rusting it. Make them agree.","ar":"قالت التسمية إنه يستطيع تخطّيه، ثم عاقبه النموذج لأنه صدّقها. اجعلهما يتّفقان."}}],"explain":{"en":"From Lesson 2: decide what the task needs, then make the label and the check say the same thing.","ar":"من الدرس 2: قرّر ما تحتاجه المهمة، ثم اجعل التسمية والتحقق يقولان الشيء نفسه."},"speaker":"sara"},{"id":"S06","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P01-U01-06","part":"check","rules":["R19"],"value":{"en":"Skill check, international sites (NN/g): separate first and last name fields are a prescription for confusion. One full-name field fits every family.","ar":"اختبار مهارة، المواقع الدولية (NN/g): الحقول المنفصلة للاسم الأول واسم العائلة وصفة للارتباك. وحقل واحد للاسم الكامل يناسب كل عائلة."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/international-sites-requirements/","quote":"Offering separate fields for first name and last name is a prescription for confusion."},"scenario":{"en":"The academy's developer wants to split the child's name so the system can sort by family name.","ar":"يريد مطوّر الأكاديمية تقسيم اسم الطفل ليتمكّن النظام من الترتيب حسب اسم العائلة."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each way of asking for Ziad's name. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل طريقة لطلب اسم زياد. أيّ طريقة تتيح لسمير أن يكتب اسم زياد كاملًا كما في شهادة الميلاد؟"},"start":"split","options":[{"id":"one","text":{"en":"One field: \"Child's full name, as on his birth certificate\"","ar":"حقل واحد: «اسم الطفل الكامل، كما في شهادة الميلاد»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"hadaf","name":{"en":"Hadaf Academy","ar":"أكاديمية هدف"},"color":"#1D4ED8","icon":"soccer-ball","domain":"hadaf.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Sign up","ar":"التسجيل"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"card","art":"people","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Summer camp 2027","ar":"المعسكر الصيفي 2027"}},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Ages 8 to 12 · July, 4 weeks","ar":"من 8 إلى 12 سنة · يوليو، 4 أسابيع"}},{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"EGP 1,500","ar":"1,500 جنيه"},"gap":"s"}]},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Child's full name, as on his birth certificate *","ar":"اسم الطفل الكامل، كما في شهادة الميلاد *"},"filled":true,"text":{"en":"Ziad Samir Abdelaziz Farid","ar":"زياد سمير عبد العزيز فريد"}}]}},{"id":"split","text":{"en":"Two fields: first name and last name","ar":"حقلان: الاسم الأول واسم العائلة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"hadaf","name":{"en":"Hadaf Academy","ar":"أكاديمية هدف"},"color":"#1D4ED8","icon":"soccer-ball","domain":"hadaf.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Sign up","ar":"التسجيل"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"card","art":"people","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Summer camp 2027","ar":"المعسكر الصيفي 2027"}},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Ages 8 to 12 · July, 4 weeks","ar":"من 8 إلى 12 سنة · يوليو، 4 أسابيع"}},{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"EGP 1,500","ar":"1,500 جنيه"},"gap":"s"}]},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Child's first name *","ar":"الاسم الأول للطفل *"},"text":""},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Child's last name *","ar":"اسم عائلة الطفل *"},"text":"","gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"three","text":{"en":"Three fields: name, father's name, family name","ar":"ثلاثة حقول: الاسم، اسم الأب، اسم العائلة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"hadaf","name":{"en":"Hadaf Academy","ar":"أكاديمية هدف"},"color":"#1D4ED8","icon":"soccer-ball","domain":"hadaf.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Sign up","ar":"التسجيل"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"card","art":"people","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Summer camp 2027","ar":"المعسكر الصيفي 2027"}},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Ages 8 to 12 · July, 4 weeks","ar":"من 8 إلى 12 سنة · يوليو، 4 أسابيع"}},{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"EGP 1,500","ar":"1,500 جنيه"},"gap":"s"}]},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Child's name *","ar":"اسم الطفل *"},"text":""},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Father's name *","ar":"اسم الأب *"},"text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Family name *","ar":"اسم العائلة *"},"text":"","gap":"s"}]}}],"answer":["one"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-006","when":["split"],"feedback":{"en":"Samir has to decide where \"Samir Abdelaziz\" goes, and the next family's names won't fit two boxes either. One field.","ar":"على سمير أن يقرّر أين يكتب «سمير عبد العزيز»، وأسماء العائلة التالية لن تناسب خانتين أيضًا. استخدم حقلًا واحدًا."}},{"id":"MC-P01-006","when":["three"],"feedback":{"en":"This fits some families and fails others. Names don't share one structure; let each family type theirs.","ar":"هذا يناسب بعض العائلات ويفشل مع غيرها. الأسماء ليس لها بنية واحدة؛ فدع كل عائلة تكتب اسمها."}}],"explain":{"en":"From Lesson 3: one full-name field, typed as on the official document, fits every naming pattern.","ar":"من الدرس 3: حقل واحد للاسم الكامل، يُكتب كما في الوثيقة الرسمية، يناسب كل أنماط الأسماء."},"speaker":"sara"},{"id":"S07","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P01-U01-07","part":"check","rules":["R19"],"value":{"en":"Skill check, international sites (NN/g): allow phone numbers with a country code and a varying number of digits. ⁦+20 10 1234 5678⁩ is the same number as ⁦010 1234 5678⁩.","ar":"اختبار مهارة، المواقع الدولية (NN/g): اسمح بأرقام الهواتف مع رمز الدولة وبعدد أرقام متغيّر. والرقم ‎⁦+20 10 1234 5678⁩ هو نفسه ⁦010 1234 5678⁩."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/international-sites-requirements/","quote":"For phone numbers, allow for international numbers containing a varying number of digits and a country code."},"scenario":{"en":"In testing, Samir pasted his number from his contacts, with the country code. The form rejected it.","ar":"في الاختبار، لصق سمير رقمه من جهات الاتصال، مع رمز الدولة. فرفضه النموذج."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each fix. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل إصلاح. أيّها يجب أن يُطلق؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"hadaf","name":{"en":"Hadaf Academy","ar":"أكاديمية هدف"},"color":"#1D4ED8","icon":"soccer-ball","domain":"hadaf.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Sign up","ar":"التسجيل"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"blocks":[{"kind":"card","art":"people","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Summer camp 2027","ar":"المعسكر الصيفي 2027"}},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Ages 8 to 12 · July, 4 weeks","ar":"من 8 إلى 12 سنة · يوليو، 4 أسابيع"}},{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"EGP 1,500","ar":"1,500 جنيه"},"gap":"s"}]},{"kind":"field","tone":"bad","label":{"en":"Parent's mobile number","ar":"رقم موبايل وليّ الأمر"},"filled":true,"text":"⁦+20 10 1234 5678⁩","error":{"en":"Use 11 digits starting with 0.","ar":"استخدم 11 رقمًا تبدأ بـ 0."}}]},"options":[{"id":"hint","text":{"en":"Add a hint: \"Start with 0, no country code\"","ar":"أضف تلميحًا: «ابدأ بـ 0، بدون رمز الدولة»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"hadaf","name":{"en":"Hadaf Academy","ar":"أكاديمية هدف"},"color":"#1D4ED8","icon":"soccer-ball","domain":"hadaf.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Sign up","ar":"التسجيل"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"card","art":"people","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Summer camp 2027","ar":"المعسكر الصيفي 2027"}},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Ages 8 to 12 · July, 4 weeks","ar":"من 8 إلى 12 سنة · يوليو، 4 أسابيع"}},{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"EGP 1,500","ar":"1,500 جنيه"},"gap":"s"}]},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Parent's mobile number","ar":"رقم موبايل وليّ الأمر"},"text":"","hint":{"en":"Start with 0, no country code, no spaces.","ar":"ابدأ بـ 0، بدون رمز الدولة، بدون مسافات."}}]}},{"id":"accept","text":{"en":"Accept it with or without the country code and spaces","ar":"اقبله برمز الدولة أو بدونه، ومع المسافات أو بدونها"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"hadaf","name":{"en":"Hadaf Academy","ar":"أكاديمية هدف"},"color":"#1D4ED8","icon":"soccer-ball","domain":"hadaf.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Sign up","ar":"التسجيل"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"card","art":"people","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Summer camp 2027","ar":"المعسكر الصيفي 2027"}},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Ages 8 to 12 · July, 4 weeks","ar":"من 8 إلى 12 سنة · يوليو، 4 أسابيع"}},{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"EGP 1,500","ar":"1,500 جنيه"},"gap":"s"}]},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Parent's mobile number","ar":"رقم موبايل وليّ الأمر"},"filled":true,"text":"⁦+20 10 1234 5678⁩"},{"kind":"small","color":"green","text":{"en":"✓ Saved","ar":"✓ تم الحفظ"},"gap":"xs"}]}},{"id":"picker","text":{"en":"Split it: a country box and an 11-digit box","ar":"قسّمه: خانة للدولة وخانة من 11 رقمًا"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"hadaf","name":{"en":"Hadaf Academy","ar":"أكاديمية هدف"},"color":"#1D4ED8","icon":"soccer-ball","domain":"hadaf.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Sign up","ar":"التسجيل"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"card","art":"people","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Summer camp 2027","ar":"المعسكر الصيفي 2027"}},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Ages 8 to 12 · July, 4 weeks","ar":"من 8 إلى 12 سنة · يوليو، 4 أسابيع"}},{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"EGP 1,500","ar":"1,500 جنيه"},"gap":"s"}]},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Parent's mobile number","ar":"رقم موبايل وليّ الأمر"}},{"kind":"row","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"field","text":"⁦+20⁩"},{"kind":"field","tone":"bad","filled":true,"text":"⁦10 1234 5678⁩"}]},{"kind":"small","color":"red","text":{"en":"Use 11 digits starting with 0.","ar":"استخدم 11 رقمًا تبدأ بـ 0."},"gap":"xs"}]}}],"answer":["accept"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-007","when":["hint"],"feedback":{"en":"The number was right. Now Samir has to edit a pasted number by hand on his phone. Let the system tidy it.","ar":"الرقم كان صحيحًا. والآن على سمير أن يعدّل رقمًا ملصوقًا بيده على هاتفه. دع النظام يرتّبه."}},{"id":"MC-P01-007","when":["picker"],"feedback":{"en":"Splitting it still forces one exact shape, and his pasted number breaks again. Accept the number as people write it.","ar":"التقسيم ما زال يفرض شكلًا واحدًا محدّدًا، فيفشل رقمه الملصوق مرة أخرى. اقبل الرقم كما يكتبه الناس."}}],"explain":{"en":"From Lesson 3: accept the formats people actually use, country codes included, and tidy them in the system.","ar":"من الدرس 3: اقبل الصيغ التي يستخدمها الناس فعلًا، بما فيها رموز الدول، ورتّبها في النظام."},"speaker":"sara"}]}$uxg$::jsonb),
  ($uxg$P01-U02-L01$uxg$, $uxg$9b5c696ac2a3fc15e0d1243ddf9680c8086c6dbfc369654399bf3a0e41876d76$uxg$, $uxg${"id":"P01-U02-L01","mode":"lesson","minutes":8,"title":{"en":"One, many, or a toggle","ar":"خيار واحد، أم عدة خيارات، أم Toggle؟"},"summary":{"en":"Choose between radio buttons, checkboxes and a toggle for real settings in a clinic app.","ar":"اختر بين الـ Radio buttons والـ Checkboxes والـ Toggle لإعدادات حقيقية في تطبيق عيادة."},"speaker":"nour","review_labels":{"MC-P01-015":{"en":"Don't preselect a guess for a personal answer","ar":"لا تختر مسبقًا إجابة شخصية بالتخمين"},"MC-P01-018":{"en":"A toggle acts now; a checkbox waits for submit","ar":"الـ Toggle يعمل فورًا، والـ Checkbox ينتظر الإرسال"},"MC-P01-031":{"en":"Show a few options; don't hide them in a dropdown","ar":"اعرض الخيارات القليلة؛ لا تُخفِها في قائمة منسدلة"},"MC-P01-032":{"en":"One answer: radio buttons; several: checkboxes","ar":"إجابة واحدة: Radio buttons؛ عدة إجابات: Checkboxes"},"MC-P01-033":{"en":"A safe, common default saves a step","ar":"القيمة الافتراضية الشائعة والآمنة توفّر خطوة"}},"steps":[{"id":"S01","type":"card","part":"hook","title":{"en":"Ahmed's reminders","ar":"تذكيرات أحمد"},"body":{"en":"Ahmed, one of our patients, opened his profile in our clinic app to update his phone number. On the same screen, he switched visit reminders off. Then he closed the app without pressing Save.\n\nThe reminders kept coming.","ar":"فتح أحمد، أحد مرضانا، ملفه الشخصي في تطبيق عيادتنا لتحديث رقم هاتفه. وفي الشاشة نفسها، أطفأ تذكيرات المواعيد. ثم أغلق التطبيق دون أن يضغط «حفظ».\n\nوظلّت التذكيرات تصل."},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"My profile","ar":"ملفي الشخصي"},"back":true},"tabbar":{"active":2,"items":[{"icon":"house","text":{"en":"Home","ar":"الرئيسية"}},{"icon":"calendar","text":{"en":"Bookings","ar":"الحجوزات"}},{"icon":"user","text":{"en":"Profile","ar":"حسابي"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","avatar":{"text":"Ahmed Samir","art":"man-1"},"text":{"en":"Ahmed Samir","ar":"أحمد سمير"},"sub":{"en":"Patient since 2024","ar":"مريض منذ 2024"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Mobile number","ar":"رقم الموبايل"},"filled":true,"text":"⁦010 9876 5432⁩","gap":"m"},{"kind":"toggle","text":{"en":"Visit reminders","ar":"تذكيرات المواعيد"},"gap":"m"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Save","ar":"حفظ"}}]}},{"id":"S02","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P01-U02-01","part":"try","rules":["R12"],"value":{"en":"Try first. Toggle switches (NN/g): toggles should give immediate results. A toggle inside a form with a Save button leaves people unsure whether it took effect; separate instant controls from ones that wait for a button.","ar":"جرّب أولًا. الـ Toggle switches (NN/g): يجب أن يعطي الـ Toggle نتيجة فورية. ووضعه داخل نموذج فيه زر «حفظ» يترك الناس غير متأكّدين هل نُفّذ التغيير؛ فافصل العناصر الفورية عن تلك التي تنتظر زرًا."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/toggle-switch-guidelines/","quote":"Separate controls that produce instant results from those that require clicking a command button."},"scenario":{"en":"Our profile screen needs its Save button for the phone number. My team wants to keep the reminders setting on the same screen.","ar":"شاشة الملف الشخصي عندنا تحتاج زر «حفظ» من أجل رقم الهاتف. ويريد فريقي إبقاء إعداد التذكيرات في الشاشة نفسها."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each version. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل نسخة. أيّها يجب أن تُطلق؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"My profile","ar":"ملفي الشخصي"},"back":true},"tabbar":{"active":2,"items":[{"icon":"house","text":{"en":"Home","ar":"الرئيسية"}},{"icon":"calendar","text":{"en":"Bookings","ar":"الحجوزات"}},{"icon":"user","text":{"en":"Profile","ar":"حسابي"}}]},"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","avatar":{"text":"Ahmed Samir","art":"man-1"},"text":{"en":"Ahmed Samir","ar":"أحمد سمير"},"sub":{"en":"Patient since 2024","ar":"مريض منذ 2024"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Mobile number","ar":"رقم الموبايل"},"filled":true,"text":"⁦010 9876 5432⁩","gap":"m"},{"kind":"toggle","text":{"en":"Visit reminders","ar":"تذكيرات المواعيد"},"gap":"m"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Save","ar":"حفظ"}}]},"options":[{"id":"note","text":{"en":"Keep the toggle; add \"Press Save to apply changes\"","ar":"أبقِ الـ Toggle؛ وأضف «اضغط حفظ لتطبيق التغييرات»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"My profile","ar":"ملفي الشخصي"},"back":true},"tabbar":{"active":2,"items":[{"icon":"house","text":{"en":"Home","ar":"الرئيسية"}},{"icon":"calendar","text":{"en":"Bookings","ar":"الحجوزات"}},{"icon":"user","text":{"en":"Profile","ar":"حسابي"}}]},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","avatar":{"text":"Ahmed Samir","art":"man-1"},"text":{"en":"Ahmed Samir","ar":"أحمد سمير"},"sub":{"en":"Patient since 2024","ar":"مريض منذ 2024"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Mobile number","ar":"رقم الموبايل"},"filled":true,"text":"⁦010 9876 5432⁩","gap":"m"},{"kind":"toggle","text":{"en":"Visit reminders","ar":"تذكيرات المواعيد"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Press Save to apply changes.","ar":"اضغط «حفظ» لتطبيق التغييرات."},"gap":"s"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Save","ar":"حفظ"}}]}},{"id":"check","text":{"en":"Use a checkbox that's saved with the form","ar":"استخدم Checkbox يُحفظ مع النموذج"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"My profile","ar":"ملفي الشخصي"},"back":true},"tabbar":{"active":2,"items":[{"icon":"house","text":{"en":"Home","ar":"الرئيسية"}},{"icon":"calendar","text":{"en":"Bookings","ar":"الحجوزات"}},{"icon":"user","text":{"en":"Profile","ar":"حسابي"}}]},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","avatar":{"text":"Ahmed Samir","art":"man-1"},"text":{"en":"Ahmed Samir","ar":"أحمد سمير"},"sub":{"en":"Patient since 2024","ar":"مريض منذ 2024"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Mobile number","ar":"رقم الموبايل"},"filled":true,"text":"⁦010 9876 5432⁩","gap":"m"},{"kind":"check","selected":true,"text":{"en":"Send me visit reminders","ar":"أرسل لي تذكيرات المواعيد"},"gap":"m"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Save","ar":"حفظ"}}]}},{"id":"keep","text":{"en":"Keep it as it is; people know to press Save","ar":"أبقِه كما هو؛ فالناس يعرفون أن عليهم الضغط على «حفظ»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"My profile","ar":"ملفي الشخصي"},"back":true},"tabbar":{"active":2,"items":[{"icon":"house","text":{"en":"Home","ar":"الرئيسية"}},{"icon":"calendar","text":{"en":"Bookings","ar":"الحجوزات"}},{"icon":"user","text":{"en":"Profile","ar":"حسابي"}}]},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","avatar":{"text":"Ahmed Samir","art":"man-1"},"text":{"en":"Ahmed Samir","ar":"أحمد سمير"},"sub":{"en":"Patient since 2024","ar":"مريض منذ 2024"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Mobile number","ar":"رقم الموبايل"},"filled":true,"text":"⁦010 9876 5432⁩","gap":"m"},{"kind":"toggle","text":{"en":"Visit reminders","ar":"تذكيرات المواعيد"},"gap":"m"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Save","ar":"حفظ"}}]}}],"answer":["check"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-018","when":["keep"],"feedback":{"en":"A toggle looks like a light switch, so Ahmed expected it to work the moment he flipped it. On a screen that waits for Save, it breaks that promise.","ar":"الـ Toggle يشبه مفتاح الإضاءة، فتوقّع أحمد أن يعمل لحظة تحريكه. وفي شاشة تنتظر «حفظ»، يُخلف هذا الوعد."}},{"id":"MC-P01-018","when":["note"],"feedback":{"en":"The note fights the control. The toggle still says \"done\"; few people read the line under it. Use a control that waits, like a checkbox.","ar":"الملاحظة تناقض ما يوحي به العنصر. فالـ Toggle ما زال يوحي بأن التغيير «تمّ»؛ وقليلون يقرؤون السطر تحته. استخدم عنصرًا ينتظر، مثل الـ Checkbox."}}],"hints":[{"en":"When does the reminders change happen: at once, or when Ahmed presses Save?","ar":"متى يحدث تغيير التذكيرات: فورًا، أم عندما يضغط أحمد «حفظ»؟"},{"en":"A toggle promises \"right now\". Does this screen keep that promise?","ar":"الـ Toggle يعد بالتنفيذ «الآن». هل تفي هذه الشاشة بهذا الوعد؟"}],"correct":{"en":"In a form that waits for Save, use a checkbox.","ar":"في نموذج ينتظر «حفظ»، استخدم Checkbox."},"explain":{"en":"A checkbox doesn't promise instant action, so it fits a form that applies changes on Save. Keep toggles for settings that work the moment you flip them.","ar":"الـ Checkbox لا يَعِد بتنفيذ فوري، لذلك يناسب نموذجًا يطبّق التغييرات عند «حفظ». واحتفظ بالـ Toggle للإعدادات التي تعمل لحظة تحريكها."},"speaker":"nour"},{"id":"S03","type":"card","part":"concept","icons":["form","list","clock","idea"],"title":{"en":"Each control makes a promise","ar":"كل عنصر تحكّم (Control) يَعِد بشيء"},"body":{"en":"People read a control's shape before its label. Pick the one whose promise matches what happens.\n\n- **Radio buttons:** pick exactly one. All the choices are visible.\n- **Checkboxes:** pick any number, including none. Each box works on its own.\n- **Toggle:** on or off, right now. Use it for settings that apply instantly.\n- **Dropdown:** hides the choices behind a tap. With only a few options, show them as radio buttons instead.\n- **A default choice** saves a step when one answer is common and safe. Don't preselect a guess about someone's personal life.","ar":"يقرأ الناس شكل العنصر قبل تسميته. فاختر العنصر الذي يطابق وعدُه ما يحدث فعلًا.\n\n- **الـ Radio buttons:** اختر واحدًا فقط. وكل الخيارات ظاهرة.\n- **الـ Checkboxes:** اختر أي عدد، أو لا شيء. وكل مربع يعمل وحده.\n- **الـ Toggle:** تشغيل أو إيقاف، الآن. استخدمه للإعدادات التي تُطبَّق فورًا.\n- **القائمة المنسدلة (Dropdown):** تُخفي الخيارات خلف ضغطة. ومع خيارات قليلة، اعرضها كـ Radio buttons بدلًا منها.\n- **الخيار الافتراضي (Default)** يوفّر خطوة حين تكون إجابة واحدة شائعة وآمنة. ولا تحدّد مسبقًا تخمينًا عن حياة الشخص الخاصة."}},{"id":"S04","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P01-U02-02","part":"guided","rules":["R06","R15"],"value":{"en":"Dropdown lists (NN/g): when a handful of options fits on screen, a dropdown adds more friction than value. Radio buttons show every choice and take one tap.","ar":"القوائم المنسدلة (NN/g): حين تتّسع الشاشة لعدد قليل من الخيارات، تضيف القائمة المنسدلة عناءً أكثر من فائدتها. والـ Radio buttons تعرض كل خيار وتحتاج ضغطة واحدة."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/dropdown-list/","quote":"When a handful of options can comfortably fit on screen, a dropdown adds more friction than real value."},"scenario":{"en":"Ahmed is booking a visit with us. It can be in person or a video call, never both.","ar":"يحجز أحمد موعدًا عندنا. ويمكن أن يكون حضوريًا أو مكالمة فيديو، ولا يكون الاثنين معًا."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each control for the visit type. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل عنصر لنوع الزيارة. أيّ عنصر يُظهر لأحمد النوعين ويسمح له باختيار واحد فقط؟"},"start":"dropdown","options":[{"id":"dropdown","text":{"en":"A dropdown","ar":"قائمة منسدلة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Book a visit","ar":"احجز زيارة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","avatar":{"text":"Ahmed Samir","art":"man-1"},"text":{"en":"Ahmed Samir","ar":"أحمد سمير"},"sub":{"en":"Patient since 2024","ar":"مريض منذ 2024"}},{"kind":"select","label":{"en":"Visit type","ar":"نوع الزيارة"},"text":{"en":"Select…","ar":"اختر…"}}]}},{"id":"checks","text":{"en":"Two checkboxes","ar":"مربّعا Checkbox"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Book a visit","ar":"احجز زيارة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","avatar":{"text":"Ahmed Samir","art":"man-1"},"text":{"en":"Ahmed Samir","ar":"أحمد سمير"},"sub":{"en":"Patient since 2024","ar":"مريض منذ 2024"}},{"kind":"small","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Visit type","ar":"نوع الزيارة"}},{"kind":"check","text":{"en":"In person","ar":"حضوري"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"check","text":{"en":"Video call","ar":"مكالمة فيديو"},"gap":"xs"}]}},{"id":"radios","text":{"en":"Two radio buttons","ar":"زرّا Radio"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Book a visit","ar":"احجز زيارة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","avatar":{"text":"Ahmed Samir","art":"man-1"},"text":{"en":"Ahmed Samir","ar":"أحمد سمير"},"sub":{"en":"Patient since 2024","ar":"مريض منذ 2024"}},{"kind":"small","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Visit type","ar":"نوع الزيارة"}},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"In person","ar":"حضوري"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Video call","ar":"مكالمة فيديو"},"gap":"xs"}]}}],"answer":["radios"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-031","when":["dropdown"],"feedback":{"en":"Ahmed has to open it to find out there are only two choices, then tap again. Two options fit on screen; show them.","ar":"على أحمد أن يفتحها ليكتشف أن هناك خيارين فقط، ثم يضغط مرة أخرى. والخياران يتّسعان على الشاشة؛ فاعرضهما."}},{"id":"MC-P01-032","when":["checks"],"feedback":{"en":"Checkboxes say \"pick any\", so Ahmed could tick both, or neither. A visit is one or the other: that's a radio choice.","ar":"الـ Checkboxes تقول «اختر أيًّا منها»، فقد يحدّد أحمد الاثنين، أو لا شيء. والزيارة إما هذا أو ذاك، وهذا ما تناسبه الـ Radio buttons."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Can a visit be in person and a video call at the same time?","ar":"هل يمكن أن تكون الزيارة حضورية ومكالمة فيديو في الوقت نفسه؟"},{"en":"With just two choices, should Ahmed have to tap to see them?","ar":"مع خيارين فقط، هل يجب أن يضغط أحمد لكي يراهما؟"}],"correct":{"en":"One of a few: radio buttons.","ar":"واحد من خيارات قليلة: Radio buttons."},"explain":{"en":"Radio buttons show every choice at once and allow exactly one. For two to about five options, they're the fastest and clearest.","ar":"الـ Radio buttons تعرض كل الخيارات مرة واحدة وتسمح باختيار واحد فقط. ومن خيارين إلى نحو خمسة، هي الأسرع والأوضح."},"speaker":"nour"},{"id":"S05","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P01-U02-02","part":"guided","rules":["R06","R15"],"value":{"en":"Checkboxes (NN/g): a checkbox list lets people select one, several, all, or none. Allergies are any number, so radio buttons or a single-select dropdown lose answers.","ar":"الـ Checkboxes (NN/g): قائمة الـ Checkboxes تتيح اختيار واحد أو عدة أو الكل أو لا شيء. والحساسية قد تكون أي عدد، فالـ Radio buttons أو القائمة المنسدلة ذات الاختيار الواحد تُضيّع إجابات."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/checkboxes-design-guidelines/","quote":"A checkbox list allows users the unique ability to select one, several, all, or no items from a list."},"scenario":{"en":"Ahmed is allergic to penicillin and to nuts. Our health form asks about common allergies.","ar":"لدى أحمد حساسية من البنسلين ومن المكسّرات. ونموذج الصحة عندنا يسأل عن أنواع الحساسية الشائعة."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each control. Which one lets Ahmed tell the doctor everything?","ar":"جرّب كل عنصر. أيّها يتيح لأحمد أن يخبر الطبيب بكل شيء؟"},"start":"radio","options":[{"id":"radio","text":{"en":"Radio buttons","ar":"Radio buttons"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Health form","ar":"النموذج الصحي"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","avatar":{"text":"Ahmed Samir","art":"man-1"},"text":{"en":"Ahmed Samir","ar":"أحمد سمير"},"sub":{"en":"Patient since 2024","ar":"مريض منذ 2024"}},{"kind":"small","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Allergies","ar":"الحساسية"}},{"kind":"radio","selected":true,"text":{"en":"Penicillin","ar":"البنسلين"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Nuts","ar":"المكسّرات"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Latex","ar":"اللاتكس"},"gap":"xs"}]}},{"id":"check","text":{"en":"Checkboxes","ar":"Checkboxes"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Health form","ar":"النموذج الصحي"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","avatar":{"text":"Ahmed Samir","art":"man-1"},"text":{"en":"Ahmed Samir","ar":"أحمد سمير"},"sub":{"en":"Patient since 2024","ar":"مريض منذ 2024"}},{"kind":"small","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Allergies (tick all that apply)","ar":"الحساسية (حدّد كل ما ينطبق)"}},{"kind":"check","selected":true,"text":{"en":"Penicillin","ar":"البنسلين"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"check","selected":true,"text":{"en":"Nuts","ar":"المكسّرات"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"check","text":{"en":"Latex","ar":"اللاتكس"},"gap":"xs"}]}},{"id":"select","text":{"en":"A dropdown","ar":"قائمة منسدلة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Health form","ar":"النموذج الصحي"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","avatar":{"text":"Ahmed Samir","art":"man-1"},"text":{"en":"Ahmed Samir","ar":"أحمد سمير"},"sub":{"en":"Patient since 2024","ar":"مريض منذ 2024"}},{"kind":"select","label":{"en":"Allergies","ar":"الحساسية"},"filled":true,"text":{"en":"Penicillin","ar":"البنسلين"}}]}}],"answer":["check"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-032","when":["radio","select"],"feedback":{"en":"This control allows one answer. When Ahmed picks nuts, penicillin disappears, and the doctor never learns about it.","ar":"هذا العنصر يسمح بإجابة واحدة. فحين يختار أحمد المكسّرات، يختفي البنسلين، ولا يعرف الطبيب به أبدًا."}}],"hints":[{"en":"How many allergies does Ahmed have?","ar":"كم نوعًا من الحساسية لدى أحمد؟"},{"en":"Which control lets him pick more than one answer?","ar":"أي عنصر يسمح له باختيار أكثر من إجابة؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Any number of answers: checkboxes.","ar":"أي عدد من الإجابات: Checkboxes."},"explain":{"en":"Each checkbox works on its own, so Ahmed can tick both allergies. The label \"tick all that apply\" removes any doubt.","ar":"كل Checkbox يعمل وحده، فيستطيع أحمد تحديد نوعي الحساسية. وعبارة «حدّد كل ما ينطبق» تُزيل أي شك."},"speaker":"nour"},{"id":"S06","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P01-U02-03","part":"guided","rules":["R06","R15"],"value":{"en":"Radio-button defaults (NN/g): a presumptuous or alienating choice is the most valid reason not to preselect. A guessed marital status is presumptuous, wrong for many, and easy to leave unchanged.","ar":"الخيار الافتراضي في الـ Radio buttons (NN/g): الاختيار المتسرّع في الافتراض أو المنفّر هو أقوى سبب لعدم التحديد المسبق. والحالة الاجتماعية المخمّنة افتراض متسرّع، وخاطئة لكثيرين، وسهل أن تُترك دون تغيير."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/radio-buttons-default-selection/","quote":"This is probably the most valid reason for not selecting a radio button by default."},"scenario":{"en":"Our doctor needs Ahmed's marital status for some treatments. Most of our patients are married, so the form preselects \"Married\".","ar":"يحتاج طبيبنا الحالة الاجتماعية لأحمد لبعض العلاجات. وأغلب مرضانا متزوّجون، فيحدّد النموذج «متزوّج» مسبقًا."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each version. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل نسخة. أيّها يجب أن تُطلق؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Health form","ar":"النموذج الصحي"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","avatar":{"text":"Ahmed Samir","art":"man-1"},"text":{"en":"Ahmed Samir","ar":"أحمد سمير"},"sub":{"en":"Patient since 2024","ar":"مريض منذ 2024"}},{"kind":"small","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Marital status","ar":"الحالة الاجتماعية"}},{"kind":"radio","selected":true,"text":{"en":"Married","ar":"متزوّج"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Single","ar":"أعزب"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Divorced","ar":"مطلّق"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Widowed","ar":"أرمل"},"gap":"xs"}]},"options":[{"id":"none","text":{"en":"No option selected; he chooses","ar":"لا تحدّد أي خيار مسبقًا؛ ودع أحمد يختار"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Health form","ar":"النموذج الصحي"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","avatar":{"text":"Ahmed Samir","art":"man-1"},"text":{"en":"Ahmed Samir","ar":"أحمد سمير"},"sub":{"en":"Patient since 2024","ar":"مريض منذ 2024"}},{"kind":"small","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Marital status","ar":"الحالة الاجتماعية"}},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Married","ar":"متزوّج"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Single","ar":"أعزب"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Divorced","ar":"مطلّق"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Widowed","ar":"أرمل"},"gap":"xs"}]}},{"id":"keep","text":{"en":"Keep \"Married\" preselected; it's the most common","ar":"أبقِ «متزوّج» محدّدًا مسبقًا؛ فهو الأكثر شيوعًا"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Health form","ar":"النموذج الصحي"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","avatar":{"text":"Ahmed Samir","art":"man-1"},"text":{"en":"Ahmed Samir","ar":"أحمد سمير"},"sub":{"en":"Patient since 2024","ar":"مريض منذ 2024"}},{"kind":"small","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Marital status","ar":"الحالة الاجتماعية"}},{"kind":"radio","selected":true,"text":{"en":"Married","ar":"متزوّج"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Single","ar":"أعزب"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Divorced","ar":"مطلّق"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Widowed","ar":"أرمل"},"gap":"xs"}]}},{"id":"hide","text":{"en":"Move it into a dropdown, with \"Married\" showing","ar":"انقله إلى قائمة منسدلة، تظهر فيها «متزوّج»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Health form","ar":"النموذج الصحي"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","avatar":{"text":"Ahmed Samir","art":"man-1"},"text":{"en":"Ahmed Samir","ar":"أحمد سمير"},"sub":{"en":"Patient since 2024","ar":"مريض منذ 2024"}},{"kind":"select","label":{"en":"Marital status","ar":"الحالة الاجتماعية"},"filled":true,"text":{"en":"Married","ar":"متزوّج"}}]}}],"answer":["none"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-015","when":["keep"],"feedback":{"en":"For a single patient in a hurry, \"Married\" stays and the doctor's record is wrong. A personal answer shouldn't start as a guess.","ar":"إذا كان المريض أعزب ومستعجلًا، فستبقى «متزوّج» ويصبح سجل الطبيب خاطئًا. والإجابة الشخصية لا ينبغي أن تبدأ بتخمين."}},{"id":"MC-P01-015","when":["hide"],"feedback":{"en":"Same guess, now harder to see: a filled dropdown looks already answered. People rarely open it to check.","ar":"التخمين نفسه، لكنه الآن أصعب في الملاحظة: القائمة المنسدلة الممتلئة تبدو مُجابة بالفعل. ونادرًا ما يفتحها الناس للتحقّق."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Whose answer is this: the clinic's guess, or Ahmed's?","ar":"إجابة من هذه: تخمين العيادة، أم إجابة أحمد؟"},{"en":"If he skims past a wrong preselected answer, what does the doctor see?","ar":"إذا مرّ أحمد سريعًا على إجابة محدّدة مسبقًا وخاطئة، ماذا سيرى الطبيب؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Let him choose a personal answer.","ar":"دعه يختار الإجابة الشخصية."},"explain":{"en":"A default is a suggestion, and people often keep suggestions. For something personal, no suggestion is the respectful and accurate choice.","ar":"الخيار الافتراضي اقتراح، والناس كثيرًا ما يُبقون الاقتراحات. وفي الأمور الشخصية، ترك الإجابة دون اقتراح يحترم الشخص ويضمن الدقة."},"speaker":"nour"},{"id":"S07","type":"compare","skill":"SK-P01-U02-03","part":"contrast","confidence":true,"rules":["R11","R15"],"value":{"en":"Contrast with S06: defaults aren't bad in general. Radio-button defaults (NN/g): select one by default in most cases. A common, harmless setting like reminder timing should start on the usual choice.","ar":"مقارنة مع الخطوة 6: الخيار الافتراضي ليس سيئًا بشكل عام. الخيار الافتراضي في الـ Radio buttons (NN/g): حدّد خيارًا افتراضيًا في أغلب الحالات. والإعداد الشائع غير الضار، مثل توقيت التذكير، يجب أن يبدأ بالاختيار المعتاد."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/radio-buttons-default-selection/","quote":"Select a single radio button by default in most cases."},"scenario":{"en":"Ahmed turns reminders on. Almost everyone wants theirs one day before; either choice is easy to change later.","ar":"يشغّل أحمد التذكيرات. وأغلب الناس يريدون التذكير قبل يوم؛ وأي اختيار سهل التغيير لاحقًا."},"prompt":{"en":"Which version should ship?","ar":"أي نسخة توفّر على أحمد خطوة، دون أن تخمّن عنه شيئًا شخصيًا؟"},"a":{"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Reminders","ar":"التذكيرات"},"back":true},"tabbar":{"active":2,"items":[{"icon":"house","text":{"en":"Home","ar":"الرئيسية"}},{"icon":"calendar","text":{"en":"Bookings","ar":"الحجوزات"}},{"icon":"user","text":{"en":"Profile","ar":"حسابي"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","avatar":{"text":"Ahmed Samir","art":"man-1"},"text":{"en":"Ahmed Samir","ar":"أحمد سمير"},"sub":{"en":"Patient since 2024","ar":"مريض منذ 2024"}},{"kind":"small","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Remind me","ar":"ذكّرني"}},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"1 day before","ar":"قبل الموعد بيوم"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"2 hours before","ar":"قبل الموعد بساعتين"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Both","ar":"الاثنان"},"gap":"xs"}]}},"b":{"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Reminders","ar":"التذكيرات"},"back":true},"tabbar":{"active":2,"items":[{"icon":"house","text":{"en":"Home","ar":"الرئيسية"}},{"icon":"calendar","text":{"en":"Bookings","ar":"الحجوزات"}},{"icon":"user","text":{"en":"Profile","ar":"حسابي"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","avatar":{"text":"Ahmed Samir","art":"man-1"},"text":{"en":"Ahmed Samir","ar":"أحمد سمير"},"sub":{"en":"Patient since 2024","ar":"مريض منذ 2024"}},{"kind":"small","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Remind me","ar":"ذكّرني"}},{"kind":"radio","selected":true,"text":{"en":"1 day before","ar":"قبل الموعد بيوم"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"2 hours before","ar":"قبل الموعد بساعتين"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Both","ar":"الاثنان"},"gap":"xs"}]}},"answer":"b","reason":{"prompt":{"en":"Why is a default right here, but wrong for marital status?","ar":"لماذا يصحّ الخيار الافتراضي هنا، ولا يصحّ في الحالة الاجتماعية؟"},"options":[{"id":"safe","text":{"en":"It's the usual choice, and leaving it costs nothing","ar":"إنه الاختيار المعتاد، وتركه كما هو لا يضرّ أحدًا"}},{"id":"always","text":{"en":"Radio buttons always need a default","ar":"الـ Radio buttons تحتاج دائمًا خيارًا افتراضيًا"}},{"id":"short","text":{"en":"The list is shorter","ar":"القائمة أقصر"}}],"answer":["safe"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-033","when":["always","short"],"feedback":{"en":"Length and habit aren't the reason. It's about the cost of a wrong default: here it's a slightly early reminder; there it's a wrong medical record.","ar":"الطول والعادة ليسا السبب. السبب هو كلفة الخيار الافتراضي الخاطئ: هنا تذكير أبكر قليلًا؛ وهناك سجل طبي خاطئ."}}]},"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-033","when":["a"],"feedback":{"en":"A makes everyone choose, though nearly all pick \"1 day before\". With a safe, common answer, start there.","ar":"A تجعل الجميع يختارون، مع أن أغلبهم يختار «قبل الموعد بيوم». ومع إجابة شائعة وآمنة، ابدأ بها."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Is this a personal answer, or a common and harmless setting?","ar":"هل هذه إجابة شخصية، أم إعداد شائع ولا ضرر منه؟"},{"en":"If almost everyone picks the same one and it's easy to change, does it need an empty start?","ar":"إذا اختار الجميع تقريبًا الخيار نفسه وكان تغييره سهلًا، فهل يحتاج أن يبدأ فارغًا؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Common and harmless: preselect it.","ar":"شائع وغير ضار: حدّده مسبقًا."},"explain":{"en":"Ask what happens if someone leaves the default. If the answer is \"nothing bad\", a default saves a step. If it's a wrong record, let them choose.","ar":"اسأل ماذا يحدث إذا ترك أحد الخيار الافتراضي. إذا كانت الإجابة «لا شيء سيئ»، فالخيار الافتراضي يوفّر خطوة. وإذا كانت سجلًا خاطئًا، فدعه يختار."},"speaker":"nour"},{"id":"S08","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P01-U02-01","part":"independent","speaker":"tarek","rules":["R14","R19"],"value":{"en":"New case. Toggle switches (NN/g): a toggle inside a form that waits for a button leaves people unsure whether their choice took effect. Tamer's checkout only applies choices on Place order.","ar":"حالة جديدة. الـ Toggle switches (NN/g): الـ Toggle داخل نموذج ينتظر زرًا يترك الناس غير متأكّدين هل نُفّذ اختيارهم. وصفحة الدفع عند تامر تطبّق الاختيارات فقط عند «أكّد الطلب»."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/toggle-switch-guidelines/","quote":"This scenario confuses users because they can’t be sure whether their toggle choice will take immediate effect."},"scenario":{"en":"In our lunch app, Tamer's checkout has a \"Leave it at the door\" toggle above Place order. Nothing is sent to the driver until he places the order.","ar":"في تطبيق الغداء عندنا، فوق زر «أكّد الطلب» في صفحة الدفع Toggle «اتركه عند الباب». ولا يصل شيء إلى السائق حتى يؤكّد تامر الطلب."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each control. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل عنصر. أيّها يجب أن يُطلق؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"lamma","name":{"en":"Lamma","ar":"لمّة"},"color":"#E03131","icon":"bowl-food","domain":"lamma.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Checkout","ar":"الدفع"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","avatar":{"text":"Ahmed Samir","art":"man-1"},"text":{"en":"Ahmed Samir","ar":"أحمد سمير"},"sub":{"en":"Patient since 2024","ar":"مريض منذ 2024"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Delivery address","ar":"عنوان التوصيل"},"filled":true,"text":{"en":"12 Nile St, 3rd floor","ar":"12 شارع النيل، الدور الثالث"}},{"kind":"toggle","text":{"en":"Leave it at the door","ar":"اتركه عند الباب"},"gap":"m"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Place order","ar":"أكّد الطلب"}}]},"options":[{"id":"select","text":{"en":"A dropdown: Yes / No","ar":"قائمة منسدلة: نعم / لا"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"lamma","name":{"en":"Lamma","ar":"لمّة"},"color":"#E03131","icon":"bowl-food","domain":"lamma.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Checkout","ar":"الدفع"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","avatar":{"text":"Ahmed Samir","art":"man-1"},"text":{"en":"Ahmed Samir","ar":"أحمد سمير"},"sub":{"en":"Patient since 2024","ar":"مريض منذ 2024"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Delivery address","ar":"عنوان التوصيل"},"filled":true,"text":{"en":"12 Nile St, 3rd floor","ar":"12 شارع النيل، الدور الثالث"}},{"kind":"select","label":{"en":"Leave it at the door?","ar":"هل نتركه عند الباب؟"},"text":{"en":"Select…","ar":"اختر…"},"gap":"m"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Place order","ar":"أكّد الطلب"}}]}},{"id":"keep","text":{"en":"Keep the toggle","ar":"أبقِ الـ Toggle"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"lamma","name":{"en":"Lamma","ar":"لمّة"},"color":"#E03131","icon":"bowl-food","domain":"lamma.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Checkout","ar":"الدفع"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","avatar":{"text":"Ahmed Samir","art":"man-1"},"text":{"en":"Ahmed Samir","ar":"أحمد سمير"},"sub":{"en":"Patient since 2024","ar":"مريض منذ 2024"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Delivery address","ar":"عنوان التوصيل"},"filled":true,"text":{"en":"12 Nile St, 3rd floor","ar":"12 شارع النيل، الدور الثالث"}},{"kind":"toggle","text":{"en":"Leave it at the door","ar":"اتركه عند الباب"},"gap":"m"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Place order","ar":"أكّد الطلب"}}]}},{"id":"check","text":{"en":"A checkbox, sent with the order","ar":"Checkbox يُرسل مع الطلب"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"lamma","name":{"en":"Lamma","ar":"لمّة"},"color":"#E03131","icon":"bowl-food","domain":"lamma.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Checkout","ar":"الدفع"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","avatar":{"text":"Ahmed Samir","art":"man-1"},"text":{"en":"Ahmed Samir","ar":"أحمد سمير"},"sub":{"en":"Patient since 2024","ar":"مريض منذ 2024"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Delivery address","ar":"عنوان التوصيل"},"filled":true,"text":{"en":"12 Nile St, 3rd floor","ar":"12 شارع النيل، الدور الثالث"}},{"kind":"check","text":{"en":"Leave it at the door","ar":"اتركه عند الباب"},"gap":"m"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Place order","ar":"أكّد الطلب"}}]}}],"answer":["check"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-018","when":["keep"],"feedback":{"en":"Flipping the toggle looks like it's done. Tamer might flip it, change his mind about ordering, and wonder whether the driver was told.","ar":"تحريك الـ Toggle يبدو كأن الأمر تمّ. وقد يحرّكه تامر، ثم يغيّر رأيه في الطلب، ويتساءل هل أُبلغ السائق."}},{"id":"MC-P01-031","when":["select"],"feedback":{"en":"A yes/no hidden in a dropdown takes two taps and hides the choice. One checkbox says it in one tap.","ar":"سؤال نعم/لا مخفي في قائمة منسدلة يحتاج ضغطتين ويُخفي الاختيار. أما Checkbox واحد فيكفيه ضغطة واحدة."}}],"hints":[{"en":"When does the driver get this choice: when Tamer flips it, or when he places the order?","ar":"متى يصل هذا الاختيار إلى السائق: عندما يغيّره تامر، أم عندما يرسل الطلب؟"},{"en":"Which control says \"this is saved with the form\"?","ar":"أي عنصر يوحي بأن الاختيار يُحفظ مع النموذج؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Part of the order: a checkbox.","ar":"جزء من الطلب: Checkbox."},"explain":{"en":"The choice only matters once he places the order, so it belongs with the order. A checkbox waits for the button, like the rest of the form.","ar":"الاختيار لا يهم إلا عند تأكيد الطلب، فمكانه مع الطلب. والـ Checkbox ينتظر الزر، مثل باقي النموذج."}},{"id":"S09","type":"card","part":"recap","icons":["form","list","clock","idea"],"title":{"en":"What you did","ar":"ماذا تعلّمت"},"body":{"en":"- **Toggle or checkbox:** used checkboxes in forms that wait for Save or a submit button.\n- **One of a few:** showed two choices as radio buttons, not a dropdown.\n- **Any number:** used checkboxes so every allergy reached the doctor.\n- **Personal answers:** left them unselected.\n- **Safe, common choices:** preselected them to save a step.\n\nNext lesson: typing, picking, and the controls in between.","ar":"- **Toggle أم Checkbox:** استخدمت الـ Checkboxes في النماذج التي تنتظر «حفظ» أو زر إرسال.\n- **واحد من خيارات قليلة:** عرضت خيارين كـ Radio buttons، لا كقائمة منسدلة.\n- **أي عدد:** استخدمت الـ Checkboxes لتصل كل أنواع الحساسية إلى الطبيب.\n- **الإجابات الشخصية:** تركتها دون تحديد.\n- **الاختيارات الشائعة والآمنة:** حدّدتها مسبقًا لتوفير خطوة.\n\nالدرس التالي: متى يكتب الناس، ومتى يختارون، والعناصر التي بين الاثنين."}}]}$uxg$::jsonb),
  ($uxg$P01-U02-L02$uxg$, $uxg$7f6ebe9db133d4370990f0efc4c6c492a418dd7ec0fd645c0071fbbd172b3796$uxg$, $uxg${"id":"P01-U02-L02","mode":"lesson","minutes":8,"title":{"en":"Type, pick, or step","ar":"تكتب، أم تختار، أم تزيد وتنقص؟"},"summary":{"en":"Decide when people should type, pick from a calendar, or tap a stepper.","ar":"قرّر متى يكتب الناس، ومتى يختارون من تقويم، ومتى يستخدمون الـ Stepper (عدّاد + و−)."},"speaker":"nour","review_labels":{"MC-P01-012":{"en":"Let people type what they know by heart","ar":"دع الناس يكتبون ما يحفظونه"},"MC-P01-013":{"en":"Let people pick what only the system knows","ar":"دع الناس يختارون ما لا يعرفه إلا النظام"},"MC-P01-021":{"en":"IDs and codes are text made of digits","ar":"الأرقام التعريفية والرموز نص مكوّن من أرقام"},"MC-P01-022":{"en":"Sliders are for rough values","ar":"الـ Slider للقيم التقريبية"},"MC-P01-023":{"en":"Small counts near a default: a stepper","ar":"الأعداد الصغيرة القريبة من قيمة شائعة: Stepper"}},"steps":[{"id":"S01","type":"card","part":"hook","title":{"en":"Ahmed's date of birth","ar":"تاريخ ميلاد أحمد"},"body":{"en":"We ask for Ahmed's date of birth. Tapping the field opens a calendar on today's month, October 2026.\n\nAhmed was born in March 1991.","ar":"نطلب تاريخ ميلاد أحمد. والضغط على الحقل يفتح تقويمًا على الشهر الحالي، أكتوبر 2026.\n\nوأحمد مولود في مارس 1991."},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"My details","ar":"بياناتي"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Date of birth","ar":"تاريخ الميلاد"}},{"kind":"row","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"text","text":"‹"},{"kind":"text","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"October 2026","ar":"أكتوبر 2026"}},{"kind":"text","text":"›"}]},{"kind":"row","gap":"xs","blocks":[{"kind":"chip","tone":"off","text":"1"},{"kind":"chip","tone":"off","text":"2"},{"kind":"chip","tone":"off","text":"3"},{"kind":"chip","tone":"off","text":"4"},{"kind":"chip","tone":"off","text":"5"},{"kind":"chip","tone":"off","text":"6"},{"kind":"chip","tone":"off","text":"7"}]}]}},{"id":"S02","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P01-U02-04","part":"try","rules":["R12"],"value":{"en":"Try first. Date input (NN/g): calendar pickers suit dates close to now, within a year. Split dropdowns for day, month and year take many unnecessary steps. Let people type a date they know.","ar":"جرّب أولًا. إدخال التاريخ (NN/g): التقويم يناسب التواريخ القريبة من الآن، خلال سنة. والقوائم المنسدلة المنفصلة لليوم والشهر والسنة تحتاج خطوات كثيرة غير ضرورية. دع الناس يكتبون تاريخًا يعرفونه."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/date-input/","quote":"Calendar pickers should be used for events close to the present time — within less than a year."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each way of asking for his date of birth. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل طريقة لطلب تاريخ ميلاده. أيّ طريقة يُدخل بها أحمد تاريخ ميلاده بأقل جهد؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"My details","ar":"بياناتي"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Date of birth","ar":"تاريخ الميلاد"}},{"kind":"row","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"text","text":"‹"},{"kind":"text","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"October 2026","ar":"أكتوبر 2026"}},{"kind":"text","text":"›"}]},{"kind":"row","gap":"xs","blocks":[{"kind":"chip","tone":"off","text":"1"},{"kind":"chip","tone":"off","text":"2"},{"kind":"chip","tone":"off","text":"3"},{"kind":"chip","tone":"off","text":"4"},{"kind":"chip","tone":"off","text":"5"},{"kind":"chip","tone":"off","text":"6"},{"kind":"chip","tone":"off","text":"7"}]}]},"options":[{"id":"dropdowns","text":{"en":"Three dropdowns: day, month, year","ar":"ثلاث قوائم منسدلة: اليوم، الشهر، السنة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"My details","ar":"بياناتي"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Date of birth","ar":"تاريخ الميلاد"}},{"kind":"row","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"select","label":{"en":"Day","ar":"اليوم"},"text":"1"},{"kind":"select","label":{"en":"Month","ar":"الشهر"},"text":{"en":"Jan","ar":"يناير"}},{"kind":"select","label":{"en":"Year","ar":"السنة"},"text":"2026"}]},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Year list: 2026 down to 1926","ar":"قائمة السنوات: من 2026 حتى 1926"},"gap":"xs"}]}},{"id":"typed","text":{"en":"Three short fields he types into","ar":"ثلاثة حقول قصيرة يكتب فيها"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"My details","ar":"بياناتي"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Date of birth","ar":"تاريخ الميلاد"}},{"kind":"row","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Day","ar":"اليوم"},"filled":true,"text":"14"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Month","ar":"الشهر"},"filled":true,"text":"3"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Year","ar":"السنة"},"filled":true,"text":"1991"}]}]}},{"id":"year","text":{"en":"Keep the calendar; add a year dropdown on top","ar":"أبقِ التقويم؛ وأضف قائمة منسدلة للسنة فوقه"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"My details","ar":"بياناتي"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Date of birth","ar":"تاريخ الميلاد"}},{"kind":"row","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"select","text":{"en":"October","ar":"أكتوبر"}},{"kind":"select","text":"2026"}]},{"kind":"row","gap":"xs","blocks":[{"kind":"chip","tone":"off","text":"1"},{"kind":"chip","tone":"off","text":"2"},{"kind":"chip","tone":"off","text":"3"},{"kind":"chip","tone":"off","text":"4"},{"kind":"chip","tone":"off","text":"5"},{"kind":"chip","tone":"off","text":"6"},{"kind":"chip","tone":"off","text":"7"}]}]}}],"answer":["typed"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-012","when":["dropdowns"],"feedback":{"en":"Each dropdown is a tap, a scroll and another tap, and the year list is a hundred items long. He knows the answer; let him type it.","ar":"كل قائمة منسدلة ضغطة وتمرير وضغطة أخرى، وقائمة السنوات طولها مئة عنصر. وهو يعرف الإجابة؛ فدعه يكتبها."}},{"id":"MC-P01-012","when":["year"],"feedback":{"en":"Better than going back 427 months, but he still scrolls 35 years, picks a month, then finds the day. Three typed numbers are faster.","ar":"أفضل من الرجوع 427 شهرًا، لكنه ما زال يمرّر 35 سنة، ويختار الشهر، ثم يبحث عن اليوم. وثلاثة أرقام مكتوبة أسرع."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Where does Ahmed's date of birth live: in the system, or in his head?","ar":"أين يوجد تاريخ ميلاد أحمد: في النظام، أم في ذهنه؟"},{"en":"How many taps does each version need to reach March 1991?","ar":"كم ضغطة تحتاج كل نسخة للوصول إلى مارس 1991؟"}],"correct":{"en":"He knows it by heart: let him type it.","ar":"يحفظه عن ظهر قلب: فدعه يكتبه."},"explain":{"en":"Typing 14, 3, 1991 takes seconds. Labelled Day, Month and Year fields remove any doubt about the order. Calendars are for dates people don't know yet.","ar":"كتابة 14 و3 و1991 تستغرق ثوانيَ. والحقول التي عليها «اليوم» و«الشهر» و«السنة» تُزيل أي شك في الترتيب. والتقويم للتواريخ التي لا يعرفها الناس بعد."}},{"id":"S03","type":"card","part":"concept","icons":["form","clock","list","idea"],"title":{"en":"Who knows the answer?","ar":"من يعرف الإجابة؟"},"body":{"en":"Choose the control by asking where the answer lives.\n\n- **In the person's head:** let them type. A date of birth fits three labelled fields.\n- **Only in the system:** let them pick, like free appointment days. Gray out and disable what isn't available.\n- **A small count with a usual value:** a **stepper** (− and +), starting at that value.\n- **Exact numbers:** a text field. A **slider** is for exploring a range, and pairs well with fields for exact values.\n- **IDs and codes:** a text field that opens the number pad. They're labels made of digits, not amounts.","ar":"اختر العنصر بسؤال: أين توجد الإجابة؟\n\n- **في ذهن الشخص:** دعه يكتب. وتاريخ الميلاد يناسبه ثلاثة حقول مسمّاة.\n- **في النظام فقط:** دعه يختار، مثل أيام المواعيد المتاحة. واجعل غير المتاح رماديًا ومعطّلًا.\n- **عدد صغير له قيمة معتادة:** **Stepper** (− و+)، يبدأ من تلك القيمة.\n- **الأرقام الدقيقة:** حقل نص. والـ **Slider** لاستكشاف مدى، ويعمل جيدًا مع حقول للقيم الدقيقة.\n- **الأرقام التعريفية والرموز:** حقل نص يفتح لوحة الأرقام. فهي رموز مكوّنة من أرقام، لا كميات."}},{"id":"S04","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P01-U02-05","part":"guided","rules":["R06","R15"],"value":{"en":"Date input (NN/g): make choices clear by disabling and graying out options that aren't available. Only the clinic knows which days the doctor works.","ar":"إدخال التاريخ (NN/g): وضّح الاختيارات بتعطيل الخيارات غير المتاحة وجعلها رمادية. والعيادة وحدها تعرف الأيام التي يعمل فيها الطبيب."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/date-input/","quote":"Make the choices clear by disabling and graying out options that are not available or are illogical pairs."},"scenario":{"en":"Ahmed needs a visit next week. Dr. Hany, one of our doctors, sees patients only on Sundays and Wednesdays.","ar":"يحتاج أحمد موعدًا الأسبوع القادم. ود. هاني، أحد أطبائنا، يستقبل المرضى يومي الأحد والأربعاء فقط."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each way of picking the day. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل طريقة لاختيار اليوم. أيّ طريقة تجعل أحمد يختار يومًا يعمل فيه د. هاني من أول مرة؟"},"start":"field","options":[{"id":"field","text":{"en":"A date field he types into","ar":"حقل تاريخ يكتب فيه"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Book with Dr. Hany","ar":"احجز مع د. هاني"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Visit date","ar":"تاريخ الزيارة"},"filled":true,"text":{"en":"Tue 3 November","ar":"الثلاثاء 3 نوفمبر"}},{"kind":"small","color":"red","text":{"en":"Dr. Hany isn't available on this day.","ar":"د. هاني غير متاح في هذا اليوم."},"gap":"xs"}]}},{"id":"all","text":{"en":"A calendar with every day open; check after he picks","ar":"تقويم كل أيامه مفتوحة؛ والتحقق بعد أن يختار"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Book with Dr. Hany","ar":"احجز مع د. هاني"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"November 2026","ar":"نوفمبر 2026"}},{"kind":"row","gap":"xs","blocks":[{"kind":"chip","text":{"en":"Sun 1","ar":"أحد 1"}},{"kind":"chip","text":{"en":"Mon 2","ar":"اثنين 2"}},{"kind":"chip","tone":"dark","text":{"en":"Tue 3","ar":"ثلاثاء 3"}},{"kind":"chip","text":{"en":"Wed 4","ar":"أربعاء 4"}}]},{"kind":"small","color":"red","text":{"en":"Dr. Hany isn't available on this day.","ar":"د. هاني غير متاح في هذا اليوم."},"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"blocked","text":{"en":"A calendar where only Sundays and Wednesdays can be picked","ar":"تقويم لا يمكن فيه اختيار إلا الأحد والأربعاء"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Book with Dr. Hany","ar":"احجز مع د. هاني"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"November 2026","ar":"نوفمبر 2026"}},{"kind":"row","gap":"xs","blocks":[{"kind":"chip","text":{"en":"Sun 1","ar":"أحد 1"}},{"kind":"chip","tone":"off","text":{"en":"Mon 2","ar":"اثنين 2"}},{"kind":"chip","tone":"off","text":{"en":"Tue 3","ar":"ثلاثاء 3"}},{"kind":"chip","text":{"en":"Wed 4","ar":"أربعاء 4"}}]},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Dr. Hany sees patients on Sundays and Wednesdays.","ar":"يستقبل د. هاني المرضى يومي الأحد والأربعاء."},"gap":"s"}]}}],"answer":["blocked"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-013","when":["field","all"],"feedback":{"en":"Ahmed can't know the doctor's days, so he guesses and gets an error. Show him what's possible before he picks.","ar":"لا يستطيع أحمد معرفة أيام الطبيب، فيخمّن ويحصل على خطأ. أرِه الأيام المتاحة قبل أن يختار."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Who knows which days Dr. Hany works: Ahmed or the system?","ar":"من يعرف أيام عمل د. هاني: أحمد أم النظام؟"},{"en":"Should Ahmed find out a day is closed before he picks it, or after?","ar":"هل يجب أن يعرف أحمد أن اليوم غير متاح قبل أن يختاره، أم بعده؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Only the system knows: let him pick, and block the rest.","ar":"النظام وحده يعرف: دعه يختار، واحجب الباقي."},"explain":{"en":"Grayed-out days show the doctor's pattern at a glance, and one line says why, so the calendar doesn't look broken.","ar":"الأيام الرمادية تُظهر نمط عمل الطبيب بنظرة واحدة، وسطر واحد يوضّح السبب، فلا يبدو التقويم معطّلًا."},"speaker":"nour"},{"id":"S05","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P01-U02-06","part":"guided","speaker":"sara","rules":["R06","R15"],"value":{"en":"Input steppers (NN/g): use steppers for numeric fields with a clear most-frequent value, and set that value as the default. Most bookings are for two adults.","ar":"الـ Stepper (NN/g): استخدمه للحقول الرقمية التي لها قيمة شائعة واضحة، واجعل تلك القيمة هي الافتراضية. وأغلب الحجوزات لشخصين بالغين."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/input-steppers/","quote":"Use steppers for numerical fields with a clear most frequently selected value."},"scenario":{"en":"I'm designing a booking form for holiday flats. Hossam is booking one. Adults: 1 to 8, and almost always 2.","ar":"أصمّم نموذج حجز لشقق العطلات. ويحجز حسام شقة. عدد البالغين من 1 إلى 8، وغالبًا 2."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each control for the number of adults. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل عنصر لعدد البالغين. أيّ عنصر يُدخل به حسام عدد البالغين بأقل جهد؟"},"start":"select","options":[{"id":"stepper","text":{"en":"A stepper starting at 2","ar":"Stepper (عدّاد بزرّي + و−) يبدأ من 2"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"sakan","name":{"en":"Sakan Stays","ar":"سكن"},"color":"#B7791F","icon":"house-line","domain":"sakan.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Book the flat","ar":"احجز الشقة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"stepper","label":{"en":"Adults","ar":"البالغون"},"text":"2"}]}},{"id":"select","text":{"en":"A dropdown from 1 to 8","ar":"قائمة منسدلة من 1 إلى 8"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"sakan","name":{"en":"Sakan Stays","ar":"سكن"},"color":"#B7791F","icon":"house-line","domain":"sakan.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Book the flat","ar":"احجز الشقة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"select","label":{"en":"Adults","ar":"البالغون"},"text":{"en":"Select…","ar":"اختر…"}}]}},{"id":"empty","text":{"en":"An empty number field","ar":"حقل رقم فارغ"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"sakan","name":{"en":"Sakan Stays","ar":"سكن"},"color":"#B7791F","icon":"house-line","domain":"sakan.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Book the flat","ar":"احجز الشقة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Adults","ar":"البالغون"},"text":""}]}}],"answer":["stepper"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-023","when":["select","empty"],"feedback":{"en":"Almost everyone answers 2, yet each of them has to open a list or type it. Start at 2 and let the few adjust with one tap.","ar":"أغلب الناس يجيبون 2، ومع ذلك على كلٍّ منهم أن يفتح قائمة أو يكتب. ابدأ من 2 ودع القلّة يعدّلون بضغطة واحدة."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Look at the usual answer: almost always 2.","ar":"انظر إلى الإجابة المعتادة: 2 في أغلب الأحيان."},{"en":"Which control shows that usual value already, with a quick way to change it?","ar":"أي عنصر يعرض هذه القيمة المعتادة مسبقًا، مع طريقة سريعة لتغييرها؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Usual value showing, one tap to change.","ar":"القيمة المعتادة ظاهرة، وضغطة واحدة للتغيير."},"explain":{"en":"Most people don't touch it at all, and a family of three taps + once. A default is fine here because it's visible and harmless if left.","ar":"أغلب الناس لا يلمسونه أصلًا، والعائلة من ثلاثة أشخاص تضغط + مرة واحدة. والقيمة الافتراضية مناسبة هنا لأنها ظاهرة وغير ضارة إن تُركت."}},{"id":"S06","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P01-U02-07","part":"guided","speaker":"sara","rules":["R06","R15"],"value":{"en":"Mobile input checklist (NN/g): what is the right keyboard for this field? A 14-digit national ID is a code: it needs the number pad, not a number field with arrows that treats it as an amount.","ar":"قائمة تحقّق حقول الهاتف (NN/g): ما لوحة المفاتيح المناسبة لهذا الحقل؟ والرقم القومي من 14 رقمًا رمز: يحتاج لوحة الأرقام، لا حقل رقم بأسهم يعامله ككمية."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/mobile-input-checklist/","quote":"What is the right keyboard for this field?"},"scenario":{"en":"Back on the library form I'm designing: Abdelrahman's national ID has 14 digits, and we're choosing the field type.","ar":"نعود إلى نموذج المكتبة الذي أصمّمه: الرقم القومي لعبد الرحمن من 14 رقمًا، ونحن نختار نوع الحقل."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each field. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل حقل. أيّها يجب أن يُطلق؟"},"start":"number","options":[{"id":"number","text":{"en":"A number field with ▲▼ arrows","ar":"حقل رقم بسهمي ▲▼"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"maktaba","name":{"en":"City Library","ar":"مكتبة المدينة"},"color":"#8B5E34","icon":"books","domain":"maktaba.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"maktaba.example/get-a-card","blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"National ID number","ar":"الرقم القومي"},"filled":true,"text":"29803121401234 ▲▼"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Treated as an amount: the arrows add or subtract 1.","ar":"يُعامَل ككمية: الأسهم تضيف 1 أو تطرحه."},"gap":"xs"}]}},{"id":"boxes","text":{"en":"Fourteen one-digit boxes","ar":"أربع عشرة خانة، رقم في كل خانة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"maktaba","name":{"en":"City Library","ar":"مكتبة المدينة"},"color":"#8B5E34","icon":"books","domain":"maktaba.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"maktaba.example/get-a-card","blocks":[{"kind":"small","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"National ID number","ar":"الرقم القومي"}},{"kind":"row","gap":"xs","blocks":[{"kind":"field","text":"2"},{"kind":"field","text":"9"},{"kind":"field","text":"8"},{"kind":"field","text":""},{"kind":"field","text":""},{"kind":"field","text":""},{"kind":"field","text":""}]}]}},{"id":"text","text":{"en":"A text field that opens the number pad","ar":"حقل نص يفتح لوحة الأرقام"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"maktaba","name":{"en":"City Library","ar":"مكتبة المدينة"},"color":"#8B5E34","icon":"books","domain":"maktaba.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"maktaba.example/get-a-card","blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"National ID number","ar":"الرقم القومي"},"filled":true,"text":"29803121401234"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Keyboard: 1 2 3 … 0","ar":"لوحة المفاتيح: 1 2 3 … 0"},"gap":"xs"}]}}],"answer":["text"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-021","when":["number"],"feedback":{"en":"A number field treats the ID as an amount: it may round it, drop a leading zero, or change it with a stray scroll. It's a code.","ar":"حقل الرقم يعامل الرقم القومي ككمية: قد يقرّبه، أو يحذف صفرًا في أوله، أو يغيّره بتمرير عابر. إنه رمز."}},{"id":"MC-P01-021","when":["boxes"],"feedback":{"en":"Boxes break pasting and make it easy to skip one. One text field with the number pad does the job.","ar":"الخانات تمنع اللصق وتجعل تخطّي خانة سهلًا. وحقل نص واحد مع لوحة الأرقام يؤدّي المهمة."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Is the ID an amount you could add or round, or a code?","ar":"هل الرقم القومي كمية يمكن جمعها أو تقريبها، أم رمز؟"},{"en":"Which field gives him the number pad without treating it as an amount?","ar":"أي حقل يعطيه لوحة الأرقام دون أن يعامله ككمية؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Digits, but not an amount: text with the number pad.","ar":"أرقام، لكنها ليست كمية: نص مع لوحة الأرقام."},"explain":{"en":"Use number fields only for amounts you'd count or add. IDs, codes and phone numbers are labels that happen to use digits.","ar":"استخدم حقول الأرقام فقط للكميات التي تُعدّ أو تُجمع. والأرقام التعريفية والرموز وأرقام الهواتف رموز تتكوّن من أرقام."}},{"id":"S07","type":"compare","skill":"SK-P01-U02-06","part":"contrast","speaker":"tarek","confidence":true,"rules":["R11","R15"],"value":{"en":"Contrast with S05: steppers aren't for every number. Input steppers (NN/g): they aren't suitable for large adjustments. A catering order of about 60 portions needs typing.","ar":"مقارنة مع الخطوة 5: الـ Stepper لا يناسب كل رقم. الـ Stepper (NN/g): لا يناسب التعديلات الكبيرة. وطلب ولائم من نحو 60 وجبة يحتاج إلى الكتابة."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/input-steppers/","quote":"Steppers are not suitable for a large number adjustments."},"scenario":{"en":"In our lunch app, Tamer is ordering for his whole office: 60 portions. Orders on this page range from 20 to 200.","ar":"في تطبيق الغداء عندنا، يطلب تامر لكل مكتبه: 60 وجبة. والطلبات في هذه الصفحة تتراوح بين 20 و200."},"prompt":{"en":"Which control should ship for the number of portions?","ar":"أي عنصر يتيح لتامر أن يُدخل 60 وجبة بأقل جهد؟"},"a":{"mock":{"app":{"id":"lamma","name":{"en":"Lamma","ar":"لمّة"},"color":"#E03131","icon":"bowl-food","domain":"lamma.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Catering order","ar":"طلب للمناسبات"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"stepper","label":{"en":"Portions","ar":"عدد الوجبات"},"text":"20"}]}},"b":{"mock":{"app":{"id":"lamma","name":{"en":"Lamma","ar":"لمّة"},"color":"#E03131","icon":"bowl-food","domain":"lamma.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Catering order","ar":"طلب للمناسبات"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Portions","ar":"عدد الوجبات"},"filled":true,"text":"60"}]}},"answer":"b","reason":{"prompt":{"en":"Why not a stepper this time?","ar":"لماذا لا نستخدم Stepper هذه المرة؟"},"options":[{"id":"taps","text":{"en":"There's no usual value, and reaching 60 would take 40 taps","ar":"لا توجد قيمة معتادة، والوصول إلى 60 يحتاج 40 ضغطة"}},{"id":"ugly","text":{"en":"Steppers look old-fashioned","ar":"الـ Stepper يبدو قديم الطراز"}},{"id":"big","text":{"en":"Big numbers need a dropdown","ar":"الأرقام الكبيرة تحتاج قائمة منسدلة"}}],"answer":["taps"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-023","when":["ugly","big"],"feedback":{"en":"It's about effort. A stepper shines when most people keep the default or change it by one or two. Here the value is far and varies a lot.","ar":"المسألة مسألة جهد. الـ Stepper ممتاز حين يُبقي أغلب الناس القيمة الافتراضية أو يغيّرونها بواحد أو اثنين. وهنا القيمة بعيدة وتتغيّر كثيرًا."}}]},"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-023","when":["a"],"feedback":{"en":"From 20 to 60 is forty taps on +. With no usual value and a wide range, typing is faster.","ar":"الانتقال من 20 إلى 60 يعني أربعين ضغطة على +. ومع غياب قيمة معتادة ومدى واسع، الكتابة أسرع."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Look at the range: 20 to 200, and Tamer needs 60.","ar":"انظر إلى المدى: من 20 إلى 200، وتامر يحتاج 60."},{"en":"How many taps would it take to reach 60 one at a time?","ar":"كم ضغطة يحتاج للوصول إلى 60 واحدة تلو الأخرى؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Wide range, no usual value: type it.","ar":"مدى واسع بلا قيمة معتادة: اكتبه."},"explain":{"en":"A stepper is for small adjustments around a common value. When answers spread widely, a text field with the number pad wins.","ar":"الـ Stepper للتعديلات الصغيرة حول قيمة شائعة. وحين تتباعد الإجابات كثيرًا، يكون حقل النص مع لوحة الأرقام هو الأنسب."}},{"id":"S08","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P01-U02-06","part":"independent","speaker":"tarek","rules":["R14","R19"],"value":{"en":"New case. Sliders (NN/g): a slider is good for exploring a range, but precise values are hard to hit; add a text box for fine control. Tamer has an exact budget.","ar":"حالة جديدة. الـ Sliders (NN/g): الـ Slider جيد لاستكشاف مدى، لكن الوصول إلى قيم دقيقة صعب؛ فأضف حقل نص للضبط الدقيق. ولدى تامر ميزانية محدّدة."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/sliders-knobs/","quote":"Then, a text box is added to allow for fine control — selecting a specific value."},"scenario":{"en":"Tamer's budget per person is exactly 80 to 120 pounds. Our restaurant filter uses a price slider from 0 to 500.","ar":"ميزانية تامر للفرد بالضبط من 80 إلى 120 جنيهًا. وفلتر المطاعم عندنا يستخدم Slider للسعر من 0 إلى 500."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each filter. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل فلتر. أيّ فلتر يتيح لتامر أن يضبط السعر من 80 إلى 120 جنيهًا بالضبط؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"lamma","name":{"en":"Lamma","ar":"لمّة"},"color":"#E03131","icon":"bowl-food","domain":"lamma.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Filters","ar":"الفلاتر"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"Now (try to set 80 to 120)","ar":"الآن (جرّب أن تضبطه من 80 إلى 120)"},"blocks":[{"kind":"slider","label":{"en":"Price per person","ar":"السعر للفرد"},"min":0,"max":500,"from":100,"to":325,"format":{"en":"From {a} to {b} pounds","ar":"من {a} إلى {b} جنيهًا"}}]},"options":[{"id":"wide","text":{"en":"Make the slider wider","ar":"اجعل الـ Slider أعرض"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"lamma","name":{"en":"Lamma","ar":"لمّة"},"color":"#E03131","icon":"bowl-food","domain":"lamma.example"},"frame":"small","appbar":{"title":{"en":"Filters","ar":"الفلاتر"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"slider","label":{"en":"Price per person","ar":"السعر للفرد"},"min":0,"max":500,"from":100,"to":325,"format":{"en":"From {a} to {b} pounds","ar":"من {a} إلى {b} جنيهًا"}}]}},{"id":"both","text":{"en":"Keep the slider, and add Min and Max fields","ar":"أبقِ الـ Slider، وأضف حقلين لأقل سعر وأعلى سعر"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"lamma","name":{"en":"Lamma","ar":"لمّة"},"color":"#E03131","icon":"bowl-food","domain":"lamma.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Filters","ar":"الفلاتر"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"slider","label":{"en":"Price per person","ar":"السعر للفرد"},"min":0,"max":500,"from":80,"to":120,"format":{"en":"From {a} to {b} pounds","ar":"من {a} إلى {b} جنيهًا"}},{"kind":"row","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Min","ar":"أقل سعر"},"filled":true,"text":"80"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Max","ar":"أعلى سعر"},"filled":true,"text":"120"}]}]}},{"id":"ranges","text":{"en":"Replace it with fixed ranges","ar":"استبدله بنطاقات ثابتة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"lamma","name":{"en":"Lamma","ar":"لمّة"},"color":"#E03131","icon":"bowl-food","domain":"lamma.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Filters","ar":"الفلاتر"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Price per person","ar":"السعر للفرد"}},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Under 100","ar":"أقل من 100"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"100 to 200","ar":"من 100 إلى 200"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Over 200","ar":"أكثر من 200"},"gap":"xs"}]}}],"answer":["both"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-022","when":["wide"],"feedback":{"en":"A few more pixels still means each step jumps a few pounds on a phone. He needs a place to type 80.","ar":"تكبيره ببضع نقاط لا يكفي: كل خطوة ما زالت تقفز بضعة جنيهات على الهاتف. يحتاج تامر مكانًا يكتب فيه 80."}},{"id":"MC-P01-022","when":["ranges"],"feedback":{"en":"His 80 to 120 crosses two ranges, so he can't express it at all. Let him set exact values.","ar":"نطاقه من 80 إلى 120 يقع بين نطاقين، فلا يستطيع التعبير عنه أصلًا. دعه يضبط قيمًا دقيقة."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Tamer knows his exact numbers. Can he set exactly 80 and 120 by dragging?","ar":"تامر يعرف أرقامه بالضبط. هل يستطيع ضبط 80 و120 بالضبط بالسحب؟"},{"en":"A slider is good for exploring. What's good for being exact?","ar":"الـ Slider مناسب للاستكشاف. ما المناسب للدقة؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Slider to explore, fields to be exact.","ar":"الـ Slider للاستكشاف، والحقول للدقة."},"explain":{"en":"The slider shows the whole price range at a glance; the fields let Tamer set exactly what he has. Linked together, each serves a different need.","ar":"الـ Slider يعرض مدى الأسعار كله بنظرة؛ والحقول تتيح لتامر ضبط ما لديه بالضبط. ومعًا، يخدم كلٌّ منهما حاجة مختلفة."}},{"id":"S09","type":"card","part":"recap","icons":["form","clock","list","idea"],"title":{"en":"What you did","ar":"ماذا تعلّمت"},"body":{"en":"- **Known by heart:** let Ahmed type his date of birth.\n- **Known only by the system:** showed the doctor's free days and blocked the rest.\n- **Small usual counts:** used a stepper starting at 2.\n- **Codes:** used a text field with the number pad for the ID.\n- **Large or exact numbers:** typed fields, with a slider only for exploring.\n\nNext lesson: long lists, and search that finds what people type.","ar":"- **ما يُحفظ عن ظهر قلب:** تركت أحمد يكتب تاريخ ميلاده.\n- **ما لا يعرفه إلا النظام:** عرضت أيام الطبيب المتاحة وحجبت الباقي.\n- **الأعداد الصغيرة المعتادة:** استخدمت Stepper يبدأ من 2.\n- **الرموز:** استخدمت حقل نص مع لوحة الأرقام للرقم القومي.\n- **الأرقام الكبيرة أو الدقيقة:** حقول للكتابة، والـ Slider للاستكشاف فقط.\n\nالدرس التالي: القوائم الطويلة، والبحث الذي يجد ما يكتبه الناس."}}]}$uxg$::jsonb),
  ($uxg$P01-U02-L03$uxg$, $uxg$9ffe3d8c5182207c5fe93f638549a248d651769b621a4c5ecb15c6f070e2e467$uxg$, $uxg${"id":"P01-U02-L03","mode":"lesson","minutes":8,"title":{"en":"Long lists: let people type","ar":"القوائم الطويلة: دع الناس يكتبون"},"summary":{"en":"Replace a 195-country scroll list with a control people can type into.","ar":"استبدل قائمة طويلة من 195 دولة بعنصر تحكّم يستطيع الناس الكتابة فيه."},"speaker":"sara","review_labels":{"MC-P01-012":{"en":"Let people type what they know by heart","ar":"دع الناس يكتبون ما يحفظونه"},"MC-P01-015":{"en":"Don't preselect a guess for a personal answer","ar":"لا تختر مسبقًا إجابة شخصية بالتخمين"},"MC-P01-016":{"en":"Long lists need a way to search","ar":"القوائم الطويلة تحتاج طريقة للبحث"},"MC-P01-024":{"en":"Search should accept how people really type","ar":"البحث يجب أن يقبل ما يكتبه الناس فعلًا"},"MC-P01-025":{"en":"Pin common options; keep the full list","ar":"ثبّت الخيارات الشائعة في الأعلى، واحتفظ بالقائمة كاملة"},"MC-P01-031":{"en":"Show a few options; don't hide them in a dropdown","ar":"اعرض الخيارات القليلة؛ لا تُخفِها في قائمة منسدلة"}},"steps":[{"id":"S01","type":"card","part":"hook","title":{"en":"Abdelrahman's nationality","ar":"جنسية عبد الرحمن"},"body":{"en":"The library form I'm designing asks for Abdelrahman's nationality. Tapping the field opens a list of about 195 countries, from A to Z.\n\nEgypt is about a quarter of the way down.","ar":"يسأل نموذج المكتبة الذي أصمّمه عن جنسية عبد الرحمن. والضغط على الحقل يفتح قائمة بنحو 195 دولة، مرتّبة أبجديًا.\n\nومصر تقع بعد نحو ربع القائمة."},"mock":{"app":{"id":"maktaba","name":{"en":"City Library","ar":"مكتبة المدينة"},"color":"#8B5E34","icon":"books","domain":"maktaba.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"maktaba.example/get-a-card","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Books","ar":"الكتب"},{"en":"Events","ar":"الفعاليات"},{"en":"Get a card","ar":"احصل على بطاقة"}],"active":2},"blocks":[{"kind":"select","label":{"en":"Nationality","ar":"الجنسية"},"text":{"en":"Select…","ar":"اختر…"}},{"kind":"group","tone":"plain","gap":"xs","blocks":[{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"Afghanistan","ar":"أفغانستان"}},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"Albania","ar":"ألبانيا"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"Algeria","ar":"الجزائر"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"Andorra","ar":"أندورا"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"… 191 more","ar":"… 191 دولة أخرى"},"gap":"xs"}]}]}},{"id":"S02","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P01-U02-08","part":"try","rules":["R12"],"value":{"en":"Try first. Dropdown lists (NN/g): when a list grows well beyond 15 options, consider a combobox; people type and the list narrows. It works well for long, predictable lists such as countries.","ar":"جرّب أولًا. القوائم المنسدلة (NN/g): حين تتجاوز القائمة 15 خيارًا بكثير، فكّر في Combobox؛ يكتب الناس فتضيق القائمة. وهو يعمل جيدًا مع القوائم الطويلة المتوقّعة مثل الدول."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/dropdown-list/","quote":"This pattern works well for long lists of predictable options such as countries, states, languages, and universities."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each way of choosing a country. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل طريقة لاختيار الدولة. أيّ طريقة توصل عبد الرحمن إلى «مصر» بأسرع شكل؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"maktaba","name":{"en":"City Library","ar":"مكتبة المدينة"},"color":"#8B5E34","icon":"books","domain":"maktaba.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"maktaba.example/get-a-card","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Books","ar":"الكتب"},{"en":"Events","ar":"الفعاليات"},{"en":"Get a card","ar":"احصل على بطاقة"}],"active":2},"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"blocks":[{"kind":"select","label":{"en":"Nationality","ar":"الجنسية"},"text":{"en":"Select…","ar":"اختر…"}},{"kind":"group","tone":"plain","gap":"xs","blocks":[{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"Afghanistan","ar":"أفغانستان"}},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"Albania","ar":"ألبانيا"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"Algeria","ar":"الجزائر"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"Andorra","ar":"أندورا"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"… 191 more","ar":"… 191 دولة أخرى"},"gap":"xs"}]}]},"options":[{"id":"radios","text":{"en":"Show all 195 as radio buttons","ar":"اعرض الدول الـ 195 كلها كـ Radio buttons"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"maktaba","name":{"en":"City Library","ar":"مكتبة المدينة"},"color":"#8B5E34","icon":"books","domain":"maktaba.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"maktaba.example/get-a-card","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Books","ar":"الكتب"},{"en":"Events","ar":"الفعاليات"},{"en":"Get a card","ar":"احصل على بطاقة"}],"active":2},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Nationality","ar":"الجنسية"}},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Afghanistan","ar":"أفغانستان"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Albania","ar":"ألبانيا"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Algeria","ar":"الجزائر"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Andorra","ar":"أندورا"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"… 191 more, about 12 screens","ar":"… 191 دولة أخرى، نحو 12 شاشة"},"gap":"xs"}]}},{"id":"split","text":{"en":"Pick a continent first, then the country","ar":"اختر القارة أولًا، ثم الدولة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"maktaba","name":{"en":"City Library","ar":"مكتبة المدينة"},"color":"#8B5E34","icon":"books","domain":"maktaba.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"maktaba.example/get-a-card","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Books","ar":"الكتب"},{"en":"Events","ar":"الفعاليات"},{"en":"Get a card","ar":"احصل على بطاقة"}],"active":2},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"select","label":{"en":"Continent","ar":"القارة"},"text":{"en":"Select…","ar":"اختر…"}},{"kind":"select","label":{"en":"Nationality","ar":"الجنسية"},"text":{"en":"Select…","ar":"اختر…"},"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"combo","text":{"en":"A field he types into; the list narrows as he types","ar":"حقل يكتب فيه؛ وتضيق القائمة مع الكتابة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"maktaba","name":{"en":"City Library","ar":"مكتبة المدينة"},"color":"#8B5E34","icon":"books","domain":"maktaba.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"maktaba.example/get-a-card","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Books","ar":"الكتب"},{"en":"Events","ar":"الفعاليات"},{"en":"Get a card","ar":"احصل على بطاقة"}],"active":2},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Nationality","ar":"الجنسية"},"filled":true,"text":{"en":"Eg","ar":"مص"}},{"kind":"group","tone":"plain","gap":"xs","blocks":[{"kind":"text","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Egypt","ar":"مصر"}}]}]}}],"answer":["combo"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-016","when":["radios"],"feedback":{"en":"Now every choice is visible, but he scrolls through a dozen screens to find Egypt. A long list needs typing, not more scrolling.","ar":"الآن كل الخيارات ظاهرة، لكنه يمرّر نحو 12 شاشة ليجد مصر. والقائمة الطويلة تحتاج كتابة، لا مزيدًا من التمرير."}},{"id":"MC-P01-016","when":["split"],"feedback":{"en":"Two lists instead of one, and he has to know how the form groups countries. Typing two letters is faster than both.","ar":"قائمتان بدل واحدة، وعليه أن يعرف كيف يقسّم النموذج الدول. وكتابة حرفين أسرع من الطريقتين."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Abdelrahman already knows the answer. What's the quickest way to reach Egypt?","ar":"عبد الرحمن يعرف الإجابة مسبقًا. ما أسرع طريقة للوصول إلى مصر؟"},{"en":"Scrolling 195 options or picking a continent first both take time. What lets him go straight there?","ar":"التمرير بين 195 خيارًا أو اختيار القارة أولًا كلاهما يأخذ وقتًا. ما الذي يوصله مباشرة؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Long, known list: type to filter.","ar":"قائمة طويلة معروفة: اكتب لتضييقها."},"explain":{"en":"Abdelrahman knows the answer. Two letters bring it to the top, and the list still guarantees a valid country.","ar":"عبد الرحمن يعرف الإجابة. وحرفان يُظهرانها في الأعلى، والقائمة تضمن مع ذلك اسم دولة صحيحًا."}},{"id":"S03","type":"card","part":"concept","icons":["list","eye","form","idea"],"title":{"en":"Let the list come to them","ar":"اجعل الخيار يظهر لهم بدل أن يبحثوا عنه"},"body":{"en":"Dropdowns hide their options. That's fine for a short list, and slow for a long one.\n\n- **A handful of options:** show them, as radio buttons.\n- **Well over 15 options people know, like countries:** a field that filters as they type.\n- **Values people know by heart, like a year:** a plain text field.\n- **Forgive spelling:** people rarely type perfectly. Suggest close matches as they type.\n- **Pin, don't preselect:** put the most common choices at the top, but let each person choose. People often keep whatever is already selected.","ar":"القوائم المنسدلة تُخفي خياراتها. وهذا مناسب للقائمة القصيرة، وبطيء للطويلة.\n\n- **خيارات قليلة:** اعرضها، كـ Radio buttons.\n- **أكثر من 15 خيارًا بكثير يعرفها الناس، مثل الدول:** حقل يضيّق القائمة مع الكتابة.\n- **قيم يحفظها الناس، مثل سنة:** حقل نص عادي.\n- **تقبّل الأخطاء الإملائية:** نادرًا ما يكتب الناس بدقة. فاقترح أقرب النتائج أثناء الكتابة.\n- **ثبّت ولا تحدّد مسبقًا:** ضع الخيارات الأكثر شيوعًا في الأعلى، لكن دع كل شخص يختار. فالناس كثيرًا ما يُبقون ما هو محدّد بالفعل."}},{"id":"S04","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P01-U02-08","part":"guided","rules":["R06","R15"],"value":{"en":"Site search (NN/g): users often don't formulate perfect queries; spelling suggestions are critical. A filter that needs exact spelling turns a shortcut into a test.","ar":"البحث في الموقع (NN/g): كثيرًا ما لا يصوغ المستخدمون استعلامات مثالية؛ واقتراحات الإملاء ضرورية. والفلتر الذي يطلب إملاءً دقيقًا يحوّل الاختصار إلى اختبار."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/internal-website-search/","quote":"Users often don’t formulate perfect queries."},"scenario":{"en":"In testing, Abdelrahman typed quickly with one thumb: \"Egipt\".","ar":"في الاختبار، كتب عبد الرحمن بسرعة بإبهام واحد: «مصرر»."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each way the field can respond. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل طريقة يمكن أن يستجيب بها الحقل. أيّ استجابة توصل عبد الرحمن إلى مصر رغم خطئه في الكتابة؟"},"start":"none","options":[{"id":"close","text":{"en":"Show the closest match","ar":"اعرض أقرب نتيجة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"maktaba","name":{"en":"City Library","ar":"مكتبة المدينة"},"color":"#8B5E34","icon":"books","domain":"maktaba.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"maktaba.example/get-a-card","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Books","ar":"الكتب"},{"en":"Events","ar":"الفعاليات"},{"en":"Get a card","ar":"احصل على بطاقة"}],"active":2},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Nationality","ar":"الجنسية"},"filled":true,"text":{"en":"Egipt","ar":"مصرر"}},{"kind":"group","tone":"plain","gap":"xs","blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Did you mean:","ar":"هل تقصد:"}},{"kind":"text","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Egypt","ar":"مصر"},"gap":"xs"}]}]}},{"id":"none","text":{"en":"Show \"No results\"","ar":"اعرض «لا توجد نتائج»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"maktaba","name":{"en":"City Library","ar":"مكتبة المدينة"},"color":"#8B5E34","icon":"books","domain":"maktaba.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"maktaba.example/get-a-card","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Books","ar":"الكتب"},{"en":"Events","ar":"الفعاليات"},{"en":"Get a card","ar":"احصل على بطاقة"}],"active":2},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Nationality","ar":"الجنسية"},"filled":true,"text":{"en":"Egipt","ar":"مصرر"}},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"No results.","ar":"لا توجد نتائج."},"gap":"xs"}]}},{"id":"all","text":{"en":"Show the whole list again","ar":"اعرض القائمة كلها من جديد"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"maktaba","name":{"en":"City Library","ar":"مكتبة المدينة"},"color":"#8B5E34","icon":"books","domain":"maktaba.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"maktaba.example/get-a-card","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Books","ar":"الكتب"},{"en":"Events","ar":"الفعاليات"},{"en":"Get a card","ar":"احصل على بطاقة"}],"active":2},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Nationality","ar":"الجنسية"},"filled":true,"text":{"en":"Egipt","ar":"مصرر"}},{"kind":"group","tone":"plain","gap":"xs","blocks":[{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"Afghanistan","ar":"أفغانستان"}},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"Albania","ar":"ألبانيا"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"… 193 more","ar":"… 193 دولة أخرى"},"gap":"xs"}]}]}}],"answer":["close"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-024","when":["none"],"feedback":{"en":"One wrong letter and a dead end. He has to spot the typo himself. The system can see that \"Egipt\" is almost certainly Egypt.","ar":"حرف خاطئ واحد يوصله إلى طريق مسدود. وعليه أن يكتشف الخطأ بنفسه. بينما يستطيع النظام أن يرى أن ما كتبه هو مصر على الأرجح."}},{"id":"MC-P01-024","when":["all"],"feedback":{"en":"His typing is thrown away and he's back to scrolling 195 countries. Use what he typed to guess what he meant.","ar":"ضاعت كتابته وعاد إلى تمرير 195 دولة. استخدم ما كتبه لتخمين ما يقصده."}}],"hints":[{"en":"He made one small typo. Is \"Egipt\" close to a country in the list?","ar":"أخطأ خطأً صغيرًا واحدًا. هل «مصرر» قريبة من دولة في القائمة؟"},{"en":"Which response helps him without making him start again?","ar":"أي استجابة تساعده دون أن تجعله يبدأ من جديد؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Close enough should still land.","ar":"صحيح. الكتابة القريبة يجب أن توصل إلى النتيجة أيضًا."},"explain":{"en":"Matching near misses, and saying so, rescues most typos in one tap. People don't need to type perfectly to get the right answer.","ar":"حين يطابق البحث الكتابة القريبة ويوضّح ذلك، يُصلح أغلب الأخطاء الإملائية بضغطة واحدة. ولا يحتاج الناس إلى الكتابة بدقة ليصلوا إلى الإجابة الصحيحة."},"speaker":"sara"},{"id":"S05","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P01-U02-08","part":"guided","rules":["R06","R15"],"value":{"en":"Dropdown lists (NN/g): users may not explore options beyond the default. Preselecting the common country creates silent errors for everyone else; pinning gives the speed without the risk.","ar":"القوائم المنسدلة (NN/g): قد لا يستكشف المستخدمون خيارات غير الخيار الافتراضي. وتحديد الدولة الشائعة مسبقًا يصنع أخطاء صامتة لكل الآخرين؛ أما التثبيت في الأعلى فيعطي السرعة بلا خطر."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/dropdown-list/","quote":"Users may not interact with the control to explore additional options beyond the default."},"scenario":{"en":"Another client's sign-up form asks for a phone country code. Most of their users are in Egypt or Saudi Arabia. Fadi lives in Jordan and is in a hurry.","ar":"نموذج التسجيل لدى عميل آخر يطلب رمز الدولة للهاتف. وأغلب مستخدميه في مصر أو السعودية. وفادي يعيش في الأردن ومستعجل."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each version. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل نسخة. أيّها يجب أن تُطلق؟"},"start":"preset","options":[{"id":"preset","text":{"en":"Preselect Egypt (⁦+20⁩)","ar":"حدّد مصر (‎⁦+20⁩) مسبقًا"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"hakawy","name":{"en":"Hakawy","ar":"حكاوي"},"color":"#0CA678","icon":"chat-circle","domain":"hakawy.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Sign up","ar":"التسجيل"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"row","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"select","label":{"en":"Code","ar":"الرمز"},"filled":true,"text":"⁦+20⁩"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Mobile number","ar":"رقم الموبايل"},"filled":true,"text":"⁦79 123 4567⁩"}]},{"kind":"small","color":"red","text":{"en":"Saved as ⁦+20 79 123 4567⁩: not Fadi's number","ar":"حُفظ هكذا: ‎⁦+20 79 123 4567⁩، وهو ليس رقم فادي"},"gap":"xs"}]}},{"id":"pin","text":{"en":"Pin Egypt and Saudi Arabia at the top; nothing selected","ar":"ثبّت مصر والسعودية في الأعلى؛ دون تحديد أي شيء"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"hakawy","name":{"en":"Hakawy","ar":"حكاوي"},"color":"#0CA678","icon":"chat-circle","domain":"hakawy.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Sign up","ar":"التسجيل"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"select","label":{"en":"Country code","ar":"رمز الدولة"},"text":{"en":"Choose or type a country","ar":"اختر دولة أو اكتب اسمها"}},{"kind":"group","tone":"plain","gap":"xs","blocks":[{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"Egypt ⁦+20⁩","ar":"مصر ‎⁦+20⁩"}},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"Saudi Arabia ⁦+966⁩","ar":"السعودية ‎⁦+966⁩"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"divider","gap":"xs"},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"Afghanistan ⁦+93⁩","ar":"أفغانستان ‎⁦+93⁩"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"… all countries, A to Z","ar":"… كل الدول، أبجديًا"},"gap":"xs"}]}]}},{"id":"az","text":{"en":"Plain A to Z list, nothing pinned or selected","ar":"قائمة أبجدية عادية، دون تثبيت أو تحديد"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"hakawy","name":{"en":"Hakawy","ar":"حكاوي"},"color":"#0CA678","icon":"chat-circle","domain":"hakawy.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Sign up","ar":"التسجيل"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"select","label":{"en":"Country code","ar":"رمز الدولة"},"text":{"en":"Select…","ar":"اختر…"}},{"kind":"group","tone":"plain","gap":"xs","blocks":[{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"Afghanistan ⁦+93⁩","ar":"أفغانستان ‎⁦+93⁩"}},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"Albania ⁦+355⁩","ar":"ألبانيا ‎⁦+355⁩"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"… Egypt is about 60 rows down","ar":"… مصر بعد نحو 60 سطرًا"},"gap":"xs"}]}]}}],"answer":["pin"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-015","when":["preset"],"feedback":{"en":"Fadi types his number and never notices ⁦+20⁩. The account gets a wrong number, and nobody knows until a code never arrives.","ar":"يكتب فادي رقمه ولا يلاحظ ‎⁦+20⁩ أبدًا. فيُسجَّل في الحساب رقم خاطئ، ولا يعرف أحد حتى لا يصل رمز التحقق."}},{"id":"MC-P01-025","when":["az"],"feedback":{"en":"Safe for Fadi, but most users scroll past dozens of countries every time. Pin the common ones on top of the full list.","ar":"آمن لفادي، لكن أغلب المستخدمين يمرّرون عشرات الدول في كل مرة. ثبّت الشائعة فوق القائمة الكاملة."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Fadi lives in Jordan. What happens if he doesn't notice a preselected code?","ar":"فادي يعيش في الأردن. ماذا يحدث إن لم ينتبه إلى رمز محدّد مسبقًا؟"},{"en":"How can most people save time without anyone getting a wrong answer by default?","ar":"كيف يوفّر أغلب الناس الوقت دون أن يحصل أحد على إجابة خاطئة تلقائيًا؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Pin the common ones; let each person choose.","ar":"ثبّت الشائعة؛ ودع كل شخص يختار."},"explain":{"en":"Pinning puts most people one tap away without choosing for anyone. Keep the pinned group small, two to five items, or it becomes another long list.","ar":"التثبيت يتيح لأغلب الناس الاختيار بضغطة واحدة، دون أن تختار نيابةً عن أحد. واجعل المجموعة المثبّتة صغيرة، من اثنين إلى خمسة، وإلا صارت قائمة طويلة أخرى."},"speaker":"sara"},{"id":"S06","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P01-U02-04","part":"guided","rules":["R06","R15"],"value":{"en":"Dropdown lists (NN/g): for readily known values, typing is often faster than selecting from a dropdown. A year has 4 digits and everyone knows theirs.","ar":"القوائم المنسدلة (NN/g): للقيم المعروفة، الكتابة غالبًا أسرع من الاختيار من قائمة منسدلة. والسنة 4 أرقام والكل يعرف سنته."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/dropdown-list/","quote":"For readily known values — ages, birthdates, heights — typing is often faster than selecting from a dropdown."},"scenario":{"en":"The library asks the year Abdelrahman finished school. The dropdown lists every year from 2026 back to 1950. He finished in 2009.","ar":"تسأل المكتبة عن السنة التي أنهى فيها عبد الرحمن الدراسة. والقائمة المنسدلة تعرض كل السنوات من 2026 حتى 1950. وقد أنهاها في 2009."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each version. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل نسخة. أيّها يجب أن تُطلق؟"},"start":"list","options":[{"id":"list","text":{"en":"Keep the dropdown of 77 years","ar":"أبقِ القائمة المنسدلة ذات الـ 77 سنة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"maktaba","name":{"en":"City Library","ar":"مكتبة المدينة"},"color":"#8B5E34","icon":"books","domain":"maktaba.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"maktaba.example/get-a-card","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Books","ar":"الكتب"},{"en":"Events","ar":"الفعاليات"},{"en":"Get a card","ar":"احصل على بطاقة"}],"active":2},"blocks":[{"kind":"select","label":{"en":"Year you finished school","ar":"سنة إنهاء الدراسة"},"text":{"en":"Select…","ar":"اختر…"}}]}},{"id":"combo","text":{"en":"A search field that filters the years","ar":"حقل بحث يضيّق قائمة السنوات"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"maktaba","name":{"en":"City Library","ar":"مكتبة المدينة"},"color":"#8B5E34","icon":"books","domain":"maktaba.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"maktaba.example/get-a-card","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Books","ar":"الكتب"},{"en":"Events","ar":"الفعاليات"},{"en":"Get a card","ar":"احصل على بطاقة"}],"active":2},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Year you finished school","ar":"سنة إنهاء الدراسة"},"filled":true,"text":"20"},{"kind":"group","tone":"plain","gap":"xs","blocks":[{"kind":"text","text":"2026"},{"kind":"text","text":"2025","gap":"xs"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"… 25 more","ar":"… 25 سنة أخرى"},"gap":"xs"}]}]}},{"id":"type","text":{"en":"A short text field for the year","ar":"حقل نص قصير للسنة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"maktaba","name":{"en":"City Library","ar":"مكتبة المدينة"},"color":"#8B5E34","icon":"books","domain":"maktaba.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"maktaba.example/get-a-card","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Books","ar":"الكتب"},{"en":"Events","ar":"الفعاليات"},{"en":"Get a card","ar":"احصل على بطاقة"}],"active":2},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Year you finished school","ar":"سنة إنهاء الدراسة"},"filled":true,"text":"2009"}]}}],"answer":["type"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-012","when":["list"],"feedback":{"en":"He knows the answer, yet has to scroll 17 years to reach it. Four keystrokes are faster than any list.","ar":"يعرف الإجابة، ومع ذلك عليه أن يمرّر 17 سنة ليصل إليها. وأربع ضغطات أسرع من أي قائمة."}},{"id":"MC-P01-012","when":["combo"],"feedback":{"en":"Filtering helps with names people might spell differently. A year has one spelling; just let him type it.","ar":"التضييق يساعد مع الأسماء التي قد تُكتب بأشكال مختلفة. والسنة لها كتابة واحدة؛ فدعه يكتبها فقط."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Does Abdelrahman need to search for 2009, or does he know it by heart?","ar":"هل يحتاج عبد الرحمن إلى البحث عن 2009، أم يحفظها؟"},{"en":"A year has one way to write it. What's the fewest steps to enter it?","ar":"السنة تُكتب بطريقة واحدة فقط. ما أقل عدد من الخطوات لإدخالها؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Known value, one spelling: type it.","ar":"قيمة يعرفها ولا تُكتب إلا بطريقة واحدة: دعه يكتبها."},"explain":{"en":"Not every answer needs a list. When people know the value and it can only be written one way, a text field is the fastest control there is.","ar":"ليست كل إجابة تحتاج قائمة. وحين يعرف الناس القيمة ولا تُكتب إلا بطريقة واحدة، فحقل النص هو أسرع عنصر ممكن."},"speaker":"sara"},{"id":"S07","type":"compare","skill":"SK-P01-U02-02","part":"contrast","confidence":true,"rules":["R11","R15"],"value":{"en":"Contrast with S02: search is for long lists. Dropdown lists (NN/g): for a handful of options, radio buttons are universally understood, show every choice and take one click.","ar":"مقارنة مع الخطوة 2: البحث للقوائم الطويلة. القوائم المنسدلة (NN/g): مع خيارات قليلة، الـ Radio buttons مفهومة للجميع، وتعرض كل الخيارات وتحتاج ضغطة واحدة."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/dropdown-list/","quote":"They are universally understood, expose all choices immediately, and require only a single click to select an option."},"scenario":{"en":"The library has four branches. Abdelrahman picks the one where he'll collect his card.","ar":"للمكتبة أربعة فروع. ويختار عبد الرحمن الفرع الذي سيستلم منه بطاقته."},"prompt":{"en":"Which version should ship?","ar":"أي نسخة يجب أن تُطلق؟"},"a":{"mock":{"app":{"id":"maktaba","name":{"en":"City Library","ar":"مكتبة المدينة"},"color":"#8B5E34","icon":"books","domain":"maktaba.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"maktaba.example/get-a-card","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Books","ar":"الكتب"},{"en":"Events","ar":"الفعاليات"},{"en":"Get a card","ar":"احصل على بطاقة"}],"active":2},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Branch","ar":"الفرع"},"text":{"en":"Type a branch name","ar":"اكتب اسم الفرع"}}]}},"b":{"mock":{"app":{"id":"maktaba","name":{"en":"City Library","ar":"مكتبة المدينة"},"color":"#8B5E34","icon":"books","domain":"maktaba.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"maktaba.example/get-a-card","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Books","ar":"الكتب"},{"en":"Events","ar":"الفعاليات"},{"en":"Get a card","ar":"احصل على بطاقة"}],"active":2},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Branch","ar":"الفرع"}},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Downtown","ar":"وسط البلد"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Heliopolis","ar":"مصر الجديدة"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Maadi","ar":"المعادي"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Nasr City","ar":"مدينة نصر"},"gap":"xs"}]}},"answer":"b","reason":{"prompt":{"en":"Why not a search field here, when it was right for countries?","ar":"لماذا لا نستخدم حقل بحث هنا، مع أنه كان صحيحًا للدول؟"},"options":[{"id":"few","text":{"en":"Four choices fit on screen, and he may not know their names","ar":"أربعة خيارات تتّسع على الشاشة، وقد لا يعرف أسماءها"}},{"id":"modern","text":{"en":"Radio buttons look friendlier","ar":"الـ Radio buttons تبدو ألطف"}},{"id":"type","text":{"en":"Typing is always slower","ar":"الكتابة أبطأ دائمًا"}}],"answer":["few"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-031","when":["modern","type"],"feedback":{"en":"Typing was faster for 195 countries he knows. Here there are four branches he may not know: showing them is faster and teaches him the options.","ar":"الكتابة كانت أسرع مع 195 دولة يعرفها. وهنا أربعة فروع قد لا يعرفها: وعرضها أسرع ويعرّفه بالخيارات."}}]},"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-031","when":["a"],"feedback":{"en":"He'd have to guess the branch names before he can type one. With four, just show them.","ar":"عليه أن يخمّن أسماء الفروع قبل أن يكتب أحدها. ومع أربعة فروع، اعرضها فقط."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Count the branches.","ar":"عُدّ الفروع."},{"en":"With only four choices, should he have to open anything to see them?","ar":"مع أربعة خيارات فقط، هل يجب أن يفتح شيئًا لكي يراها؟"}],"correct":{"en":"A handful: show them all.","ar":"خيارات قليلة: اعرضها كلها."},"explain":{"en":"The size of the list decides. A few options: show them. Dozens that people know: let them type. A value they know by heart: a plain field.","ar":"حجم القائمة هو ما يحدّد. خيارات قليلة: اعرضها. وعشرات يعرفها الناس: دعهم يكتبون. وقيمة يحفظونها: حقل عادي."},"speaker":"sara"},{"id":"S08","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P01-U02-08","part":"independent","speaker":"tarek","rules":["R14","R19"],"value":{"en":"New case. Site search (NN/g): query suggestions help people fix spelling errors while they are typing. Place names have many spellings across Arabic and English.","ar":"حالة جديدة. البحث في الموقع (NN/g): اقتراحات البحث تساعد الناس على تصحيح الأخطاء الإملائية أثناء الكتابة. وأسماء الأماكن لها كتابات كثيرة بين العربية والإنجليزية."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/internal-website-search/","quote":"Oftentimes query suggestions will assist users in adjusting spelling errors while they are typing the query."},"scenario":{"en":"Our lunch app delivers to about 300 areas. Tamer types his area the way he says it: \"Zamalik\".","ar":"يوصّل تطبيق الغداء عندنا إلى نحو 300 منطقة. ويكتب تامر منطقته كما ينطقها: «زملك»."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each version of the area field. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل نسخة من حقل المنطقة. أيّ نسخة توصل تامر إلى منطقته، مع أنه كتبها كما ينطقها؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"lamma","name":{"en":"Lamma","ar":"لمّة"},"color":"#E03131","icon":"bowl-food","domain":"lamma.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Delivery area","ar":"منطقة التوصيل"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Delivery area","ar":"منطقة التوصيل"},"filled":true,"text":{"en":"Zamalik","ar":"زملك"}},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"No results.","ar":"لا توجد نتائج."},"gap":"xs"}]},"options":[{"id":"suggest","text":{"en":"Suggest close matches as he types","ar":"اقترح أقرب النتائج أثناء الكتابة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"lamma","name":{"en":"Lamma","ar":"لمّة"},"color":"#E03131","icon":"bowl-food","domain":"lamma.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Delivery area","ar":"منطقة التوصيل"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Delivery area","ar":"منطقة التوصيل"},"filled":true,"text":{"en":"Zamal","ar":"زمل"}},{"kind":"group","tone":"plain","gap":"xs","blocks":[{"kind":"text","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Zamalek","ar":"الزمالك"}}]}]}},{"id":"hint","text":{"en":"Add \"Type the name exactly as on the map\"","ar":"أضف «اكتب الاسم كما هو على الخريطة تمامًا»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"lamma","name":{"en":"Lamma","ar":"لمّة"},"color":"#E03131","icon":"bowl-food","domain":"lamma.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Delivery area","ar":"منطقة التوصيل"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Delivery area","ar":"منطقة التوصيل"},"filled":true,"text":{"en":"Zamalik","ar":"زملك"},"hint":{"en":"Type the name exactly as on the map.","ar":"اكتب الاسم كما هو على الخريطة تمامًا."}},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"No results.","ar":"لا توجد نتائج."},"gap":"xs"}]}},{"id":"list","text":{"en":"Replace it with a dropdown of all 300 areas","ar":"استبدله بقائمة منسدلة لكل الـ 300 منطقة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"lamma","name":{"en":"Lamma","ar":"لمّة"},"color":"#E03131","icon":"bowl-food","domain":"lamma.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Delivery area","ar":"منطقة التوصيل"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"select","label":{"en":"Delivery area","ar":"منطقة التوصيل"},"text":{"en":"Select…","ar":"اختر…"}},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"300 areas, A to Z","ar":"300 منطقة، أبجديًا"},"gap":"xs"}]}}],"answer":["suggest"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-024","when":["hint"],"feedback":{"en":"Tamer has no way to know the map's spelling. The hint blames him for a problem the search could solve.","ar":"لا يستطيع تامر أن يعرف كيف كُتب الاسم على الخريطة. والتلميح يلومه على مشكلة يستطيع البحث حلّها."}},{"id":"MC-P01-016","when":["list"],"feedback":{"en":"He'd scroll through 300 areas to find Z. A long list needs a forgiving search, not a longer scroll.","ar":"سيمرّر 300 منطقة ليصل إلى الزاي. والقائمة الطويلة تحتاج بحثًا يتقبّل الأخطاء، لا تمريرًا أطول."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Tamer typed the name the way he says it. Is it close to a real area?","ar":"كتب تامر الاسم كما ينطقه. هل هو قريب من منطقة حقيقية؟"},{"en":"Should the field ask him to be exact, or help him get there?","ar":"هل يجب أن يطلب منه الحقل الدقة، أم يساعده على الوصول إليها؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Meet him halfway while he types.","ar":"صحيح. ساعده أثناء الكتابة."},"explain":{"en":"Suggestions appear before he finishes, so a near spelling still lands on Zamalek. Fewer dead ends, and no spelling test.","ar":"تظهر الاقتراحات قبل أن ينتهي من الكتابة، فتصل الكتابة القريبة إلى الزمالك. فتقلّ الطرق المسدودة، ولا يحتاج إلى إملاء صحيح."}},{"id":"S09","type":"card","part":"recap","icons":["list","eye","form","idea"],"title":{"en":"What you did","ar":"ماذا تعلّمت"},"body":{"en":"- **Long, known lists:** let people type to filter, like countries.\n- **Forgiving search:** suggested close matches instead of \"No results\".\n- **Pin, don't preselect:** put common choices on top and let each person choose.\n- **Known values:** used a plain field for the year.\n- **A handful of options:** showed them as radio buttons.\n\nNext: the unit skill check.","ar":"- **القوائم الطويلة المعروفة:** دع الناس يكتبون لتضييقها، مثل الدول.\n- **بحث يتقبّل الأخطاء:** اقترحت أقرب النتائج بدل «لا توجد نتائج».\n- **ثبّت ولا تحدّد مسبقًا:** ضع الخيارات الشائعة في الأعلى ودع كل شخص يختار.\n- **القيم المعروفة:** استخدمت حقلًا عاديًا للسنة.\n- **خيارات قليلة:** عرضتها كـ Radio buttons.\n\nالتالي: اختبار المهارة للوحدة."}}]}$uxg$::jsonb),
  ($uxg$P01-U02-L04$uxg$, $uxg$8604690969c85ff300f8be918853de8776d81f57cce026e22da5ec0364ea4b81$uxg$, $uxg${"id":"P01-U02-L04","mode":"check","minutes":7,"title":{"en":"Skill check: pick the right control","ar":"اختبار المهارة: اختر عنصر التحكّم المناسب"},"summary":{"en":"Pick every control on a home cleaning booking form on your own.","ar":"اختر كل عناصر التحكّم في نموذج حجز تنظيف منزلي بنفسك."},"speaker":"sara","steps":[{"id":"S01","type":"card","part":"hook","title":{"en":"Laila's home cleaning booking","ar":"حجز تنظيف منزل ليلى"},"body":{"en":"My client is a home cleaning company. Laila lives in Heliopolis. She's booking a 4-hour cleaning with ironing and windows, on a day the company has a free team. Her building's door code is 0427.\n\nYour job: choose the right control for each part of the booking form.\n\nThis is a skill check: no hints, and you'll see how you did at the end.","ar":"عميلي شركة تنظيف منزلي. تعيش ليلى في مصر الجديدة، وتحجز تنظيفًا لمدة 4 ساعات مع كيّ الملابس والنوافذ، في يوم فيه فريق متاح لدى الشركة. ورمز باب عمارتها 0427.\n\nمهمّتك: اختر عنصر التحكّم المناسب لكل جزء من نموذج الحجز.\n\nهذا اختبار مهارة: بدون تلميحات، وسترى نتيجتك في النهاية."},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nazeef","name":{"en":"Nazeef","ar":"نظيف"},"color":"#2A9DF4","icon":"sparkle","domain":"nazeef.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Book a home cleaning","ar":"احجز تنظيف منزل"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"sparkle","text":{"en":"Home cleaning · 4 hours","ar":"تنظيف المنزل · 4 ساعات"},"sub":{"en":"Heliopolis","ar":"مصر الجديدة"},"value":{"en":"EGP 600","ar":"600 جنيه"}},{"kind":"select","label":{"en":"Add-ons","ar":"خدمات إضافية"},"text":{"en":"Select one…","ar":"اختر واحدًا…"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"select","label":{"en":"Hours of cleaning","ar":"ساعات التنظيف"},"text":{"en":"Select…","ar":"اختر…"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"select","label":{"en":"Area","ar":"المنطقة"},"filled":true,"text":{"en":"Nasr City","ar":"مدينة نصر"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"toggle","text":{"en":"Text me when the team is on the way","ar":"أرسل لي رسالة حين يكون الفريق في الطريق"},"gap":"m"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Book cleaning","ar":"احجز التنظيف"}}]}},{"id":"S02","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P01-U02-02","part":"check","rules":["R19"],"value":{"en":"Skill check, checkboxes (NN/g): a checkbox list lets people select one, several, all, or none. Add-ons are any number; a single-select dropdown loses Laila's second add-on.","ar":"اختبار مهارة، الـ Checkboxes (NN/g): قائمة الـ Checkboxes تتيح اختيار واحد أو عدة أو الكل أو لا شيء. والخدمات الإضافية أي عدد؛ والقائمة المنسدلة ذات الاختيار الواحد تُضيّع الخدمة الثانية لليلى."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/checkboxes-design-guidelines/","quote":"A checkbox list allows users the unique ability to select one, several, all, or no items from a list."},"scenario":{"en":"Laila wants both ironing and windows. On the current form, the add-ons are a dropdown that takes one choice.","ar":"تريد ليلى كيّ الملابس والنوافذ معًا. وفي النموذج الحالي، الخدمات الإضافية قائمة منسدلة تقبل اختيارًا واحدًا."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each control for the add-ons. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل عنصر للخدمات الإضافية. أيّ عنصر يتيح لليلى أن تختار كيّ الملابس والنوافذ معًا؟"},"start":"select","options":[{"id":"select","text":{"en":"A dropdown, one choice","ar":"قائمة منسدلة، اختيار واحد"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nazeef","name":{"en":"Nazeef","ar":"نظيف"},"color":"#2A9DF4","icon":"sparkle","domain":"nazeef.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Book a cleaning","ar":"احجز موعد تنظيف"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"sparkle","text":{"en":"Home cleaning · 4 hours","ar":"تنظيف المنزل · 4 ساعات"},"sub":{"en":"Heliopolis","ar":"مصر الجديدة"},"value":{"en":"EGP 600","ar":"600 جنيه"}},{"kind":"select","label":{"en":"Add-ons","ar":"خدمات إضافية"},"filled":true,"text":{"en":"Ironing","ar":"كيّ الملابس"}}]}},{"id":"radio","text":{"en":"Radio buttons","ar":"Radio buttons"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nazeef","name":{"en":"Nazeef","ar":"نظيف"},"color":"#2A9DF4","icon":"sparkle","domain":"nazeef.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Book a cleaning","ar":"احجز موعد تنظيف"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"sparkle","text":{"en":"Home cleaning · 4 hours","ar":"تنظيف المنزل · 4 ساعات"},"sub":{"en":"Heliopolis","ar":"مصر الجديدة"},"value":{"en":"EGP 600","ar":"600 جنيه"}},{"kind":"small","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Add-ons","ar":"خدمات إضافية"}},{"kind":"radio","selected":true,"text":{"en":"Ironing","ar":"كيّ الملابس"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Windows","ar":"النوافذ"},"gap":"xs"}]}},{"id":"check","text":{"en":"Checkboxes","ar":"Checkboxes"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nazeef","name":{"en":"Nazeef","ar":"نظيف"},"color":"#2A9DF4","icon":"sparkle","domain":"nazeef.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Book a cleaning","ar":"احجز موعد تنظيف"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"sparkle","text":{"en":"Home cleaning · 4 hours","ar":"تنظيف المنزل · 4 ساعات"},"sub":{"en":"Heliopolis","ar":"مصر الجديدة"},"value":{"en":"EGP 600","ar":"600 جنيه"}},{"kind":"small","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Add-ons (tick any)","ar":"خدمات إضافية (حدّد ما تريد)"}},{"kind":"check","selected":true,"text":{"en":"Ironing","ar":"كيّ الملابس"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"check","selected":true,"text":{"en":"Windows","ar":"النوافذ"},"gap":"xs"}]}}],"answer":["check"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-032","when":["select","radio"],"feedback":{"en":"This control takes one answer, so Laila can't book both. Add-ons are any number, including none: checkboxes.","ar":"هذا العنصر يقبل إجابة واحدة، فلا تستطيع ليلى حجز الاثنين. ويمكن اختيار أي عدد من الخدمات الإضافية، أو لا شيء، وهذا ما تناسبه الـ Checkboxes."}}],"explain":{"en":"From Lesson 1: one answer, radio buttons; any number, checkboxes.","ar":"من الدرس 1: إجابة واحدة، Radio buttons؛ وأي عدد، Checkboxes."},"speaker":"sara"},{"id":"S03","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P01-U02-01","part":"check","rules":["R19"],"value":{"en":"Skill check, toggle switche