سائل الخطأ. أرِها الأيام المتاحة قبل أن تختار."}}],"explain":{"en":"From Lesson 2: when only the system knows the options, let people pick, and block what isn't possible, with a reason.","ar":"من الدرس 2: حين لا يعرف الخيارات إلا النظام، دع الناس يختارون، واحجب غير الممكن، مع ذكر السبب."},"speaker":"sara"},{"id":"S06","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P01-U02-08","part":"check","rules":["R19"],"value":{"en":"Skill check, dropdown lists (NN/g): people may not explore beyond the default. The area field preselects the most common area, so Laila may book in the wrong one.","ar":"اختبار مهارة، القوائم المنسدلة (NN/g): قد لا يستكشف الناس ما بعد الخيار الافتراضي. وحقل المنطقة يحدّد المنطقة الأكثر شيوعًا مسبقًا، فقد تحجز ليلى في المنطقة الخطأ."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/dropdown-list/","quote":"Users may not interact with the control to explore additional options beyond the default."},"scenario":{"en":"The company covers about 50 areas. Most bookings come from Nasr City, so the area field starts on Nasr City. Laila lives in Heliopolis.","ar":"تغطّي الشركة نحو 50 منطقة. وأغلب الحجوزات من مدينة نصر، فيبدأ حقل المنطقة بمدينة نصر. وليلى تعيش في مصر الجديدة."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each version of the area field. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل نسخة من حقل المنطقة. أيّها يجب أن تُطلق؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nazeef","name":{"en":"Nazeef","ar":"نظيف"},"color":"#2A9DF4","icon":"sparkle","domain":"nazeef.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Book a cleaning","ar":"احجز موعد تنظيف"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"sparkle","text":{"en":"Home cleaning · 4 hours","ar":"تنظيف المنزل · 4 ساعات"},"sub":{"en":"Heliopolis","ar":"مصر الجديدة"},"value":{"en":"EGP 600","ar":"600 جنيه"}},{"kind":"select","label":{"en":"Area","ar":"المنطقة"},"filled":true,"text":{"en":"Nasr City","ar":"مدينة نصر"}}]},"options":[{"id":"pin","text":{"en":"Type to search, with Nasr City pinned on top; nothing selected","ar":"اكتب للبحث، مع تثبيت مدينة نصر في الأعلى؛ دون تحديد شيء"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nazeef","name":{"en":"Nazeef","ar":"نظيف"},"color":"#2A9DF4","icon":"sparkle","domain":"nazeef.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Book a cleaning","ar":"احجز موعد تنظيف"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"sparkle","text":{"en":"Home cleaning · 4 hours","ar":"تنظيف المنزل · 4 ساعات"},"sub":{"en":"Heliopolis","ar":"مصر الجديدة"},"value":{"en":"EGP 600","ar":"600 جنيه"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Area","ar":"المنطقة"},"text":{"en":"Type your area","ar":"اكتب منطقتك"}},{"kind":"group","tone":"plain","gap":"xs","blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Most booked","ar":"الأكثر حجزًا"}},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"Nasr City","ar":"مدينة نصر"},"gap":"xs"}]}]}},{"id":"keep","text":{"en":"Keep Nasr City preselected; it saves most people a step","ar":"أبقِ مدينة نصر محدّدة مسبقًا؛ فهي توفّر خطوة لأغلب الناس"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nazeef","name":{"en":"Nazeef","ar":"نظيف"},"color":"#2A9DF4","icon":"sparkle","domain":"nazeef.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Book a cleaning","ar":"احجز موعد تنظيف"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"sparkle","text":{"en":"Home cleaning · 4 hours","ar":"تنظيف المنزل · 4 ساعات"},"sub":{"en":"Heliopolis","ar":"مصر الجديدة"},"value":{"en":"EGP 600","ar":"600 جنيه"}},{"kind":"select","label":{"en":"Area","ar":"المنطقة"},"filled":true,"text":{"en":"Nasr City","ar":"مدينة نصر"}}]}},{"id":"radios","text":{"en":"Show all 50 areas as radio buttons","ar":"اعرض المناطق الخمسين كلها كـ Radio buttons"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nazeef","name":{"en":"Nazeef","ar":"نظيف"},"color":"#2A9DF4","icon":"sparkle","domain":"nazeef.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Book a cleaning","ar":"احجز موعد تنظيف"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"sparkle","text":{"en":"Home cleaning · 4 hours","ar":"تنظيف المنزل · 4 ساعات"},"sub":{"en":"Heliopolis","ar":"مصر الجديدة"},"value":{"en":"EGP 600","ar":"600 جنيه"}},{"kind":"small","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Area","ar":"المنطقة"}},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Abbassia","ar":"العباسية"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Agouza","ar":"العجوزة"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Ain Shams","ar":"عين شمس"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"… 47 more","ar":"… 47 منطقة أخرى"},"gap":"xs"}]}}],"answer":["pin"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-015","when":["keep"],"feedback":{"en":"A filled field looks answered. If Laila doesn't notice, the team goes to Nasr City. Pin the common area; don't choose it for her.","ar":"الحقل الممتلئ يبدو مُجابًا. وإذا لم تنتبه ليلى، يذهب الفريق إلى مدينة نصر. ثبّت المنطقة الشائعة؛ ولا تخترها نيابةً عنها."}},{"id":"MC-P01-016","when":["radios"],"feedback":{"en":"Nothing is preselected now, but fifty radio buttons take several screens of scrolling. A long list needs typing.","ar":"لا شيء محدّد مسبقًا الآن، لكن خمسين Radio button تحتاج تمرير عدة شاشات. والقائمة الطويلة تحتاج كتابة."}}],"explain":{"en":"From Lesson 3: let people type to search a long list, and pin common choices without preselecting them.","ar":"من الدرس 3: دع الناس يكتبون للبحث في القائمة الطويلة، وثبّت الخيارات الشائعة دون تحديدها مسبقًا."},"speaker":"sara"},{"id":"S07","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P01-U02-08","part":"check","rules":["R19"],"value":{"en":"Skill check, site search (NN/g): users often don't formulate perfect queries. \"Heliopolice\" is one letter off; suggest the match.","ar":"اختبار مهارة، البحث في الموقع (NN/g): كثيرًا ما لا يصوغ المستخدمون استعلامات مثالية. وما كتبته ليلى قريب جدًا؛ فاقترح المطابقة."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/internal-website-search/","quote":"Users often don’t formulate perfect queries."},"scenario":{"en":"In testing, Laila typed her area quickly: \"Heliopolice\".","ar":"في الاختبار، كتبت ليلى منطقتها بسرعة: «مصر الجديده»، بالهاء بدل التاء المربوطة."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each response. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل استجابة. أيّها يجب أن تُطلق؟"},"start":"none","options":[{"id":"none","text":{"en":"\"No results\"","ar":"«لا توجد نتائج»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nazeef","name":{"en":"Nazeef","ar":"نظيف"},"color":"#2A9DF4","icon":"sparkle","domain":"nazeef.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Book a cleaning","ar":"احجز موعد تنظيف"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"sparkle","text":{"en":"Home cleaning · 4 hours","ar":"تنظيف المنزل · 4 ساعات"},"sub":{"en":"Heliopolis","ar":"مصر الجديدة"},"value":{"en":"EGP 600","ar":"600 جنيه"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Area","ar":"المنطقة"},"filled":true,"text":{"en":"Heliopolice","ar":"مصر الجديده"}},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"No results.","ar":"لا توجد نتائج."},"gap":"xs"}]}},{"id":"suggest","text":{"en":"Suggest the closest area","ar":"اقترح أقرب منطقة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nazeef","name":{"en":"Nazeef","ar":"نظيف"},"color":"#2A9DF4","icon":"sparkle","domain":"nazeef.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Book a cleaning","ar":"احجز موعد تنظيف"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"sparkle","text":{"en":"Home cleaning · 4 hours","ar":"تنظيف المنزل · 4 ساعات"},"sub":{"en":"Heliopolis","ar":"مصر الجديدة"},"value":{"en":"EGP 600","ar":"600 جنيه"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Area","ar":"المنطقة"},"filled":true,"text":{"en":"Heliopolice","ar":"مصر الجديده"}},{"kind":"group","tone":"plain","gap":"xs","blocks":[{"kind":"text","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Heliopolis","ar":"مصر الجديدة"}}]}]}},{"id":"rule","text":{"en":"Say \"Check your spelling\"","ar":"اعرض «تحقّق من الإملاء»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nazeef","name":{"en":"Nazeef","ar":"نظيف"},"color":"#2A9DF4","icon":"sparkle","domain":"nazeef.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Book a cleaning","ar":"احجز موعد تنظيف"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"sparkle","text":{"en":"Home cleaning · 4 hours","ar":"تنظيف المنزل · 4 ساعات"},"sub":{"en":"Heliopolis","ar":"مصر الجديدة"},"value":{"en":"EGP 600","ar":"600 جنيه"}},{"kind":"field","tone":"bad","label":{"en":"Area","ar":"المنطقة"},"filled":true,"text":{"en":"Heliopolice","ar":"مصر الجديده"},"error":{"en":"Check your spelling.","ar":"تحقّق من الإملاء."}}]}}],"answer":["suggest"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-024","when":["none","rule"],"feedback":{"en":"The system can tell what she meant; it's one letter away. Make her fix nothing: suggest Heliopolis.","ar":"يستطيع النظام معرفة ما تقصده؛ فالفرق حرف واحد. لا تجعلها تصلح شيئًا: اقترح مصر الجديدة."}}],"explain":{"en":"From Lesson 3: forgiving search suggests the closest match instead of a dead end.","ar":"من الدرس 3: البحث الذي يتقبّل الأخطاء يقترح أقرب نتيجة بدل الطريق المسدود."},"speaker":"sara"},{"id":"S08","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P01-U02-07","part":"check","rules":["R19"],"value":{"en":"Skill check, mobile input checklist (NN/g): what is the right keyboard for this field? A door code is a code: a number field would drop the leading zero of 0427.","ar":"اختبار مهارة، قائمة تحقّق حقول الهاتف (NN/g): ما لوحة المفاتيح المناسبة لهذا الحقل؟ ورمز الباب رمز: حقل الرقم سيحذف الصفر في أول 0427."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/mobile-input-checklist/","quote":"What is the right keyboard for this field?"},"scenario":{"en":"The cleaning team needs the building's door code: 0427.","ar":"يحتاج فريق التنظيف رمز باب العمارة: 0427."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each field. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل حقل. أيّها يجب أن يُطلق؟"},"start":"number","options":[{"id":"number","text":{"en":"A number field","ar":"حقل رقم"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nazeef","name":{"en":"Nazeef","ar":"نظيف"},"color":"#2A9DF4","icon":"sparkle","domain":"nazeef.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Book a cleaning","ar":"احجز موعد تنظيف"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"sparkle","text":{"en":"Home cleaning · 4 hours","ar":"تنظيف المنزل · 4 ساعات"},"sub":{"en":"Heliopolis","ar":"مصر الجديدة"},"value":{"en":"EGP 600","ar":"600 جنيه"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Door code","ar":"رمز الباب"},"filled":true,"text":"427"},{"kind":"small","color":"red","text":{"en":"Saved as 427: the leading 0 is gone","ar":"حُفظ هكذا: 427، واختفى الصفر في أوله"},"gap":"xs"}]}},{"id":"steps","text":{"en":"Four steppers, one per digit","ar":"أربعة Steppers، واحد لكل رقم"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nazeef","name":{"en":"Nazeef","ar":"نظيف"},"color":"#2A9DF4","icon":"sparkle","domain":"nazeef.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Book a cleaning","ar":"احجز موعد تنظيف"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"sparkle","text":{"en":"Home cleaning · 4 hours","ar":"تنظيف المنزل · 4 ساعات"},"sub":{"en":"Heliopolis","ar":"مصر الجديدة"},"value":{"en":"EGP 600","ar":"600 جنيه"}},{"kind":"small","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Door code","ar":"رمز الباب"}},{"kind":"row","gap":"xs","blocks":[{"kind":"stepper","text":"0"},{"kind":"stepper","text":"0"}]}]}},{"id":"text","text":{"en":"A text field that opens the number pad","ar":"حقل نص يفتح لوحة الأرقام"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nazeef","name":{"en":"Nazeef","ar":"نظيف"},"color":"#2A9DF4","icon":"sparkle","domain":"nazeef.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Book a cleaning","ar":"احجز موعد تنظيف"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"sparkle","text":{"en":"Home cleaning · 4 hours","ar":"تنظيف المنزل · 4 ساعات"},"sub":{"en":"Heliopolis","ar":"مصر الجديدة"},"value":{"en":"EGP 600","ar":"600 جنيه"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Door code","ar":"رمز الباب"},"filled":true,"text":"0427"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Keyboard: 1 2 3 … 0","ar":"لوحة المفاتيح: 1 2 3 … 0"},"gap":"xs"}]}}],"answer":["text"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-021","when":["number"],"feedback":{"en":"A number field treats 0427 as the amount 427, and the team stands at the door with the wrong code. It's a code: text with the number pad.","ar":"حقل الرقم يعامل 0427 ككمية 427، فيقف الفريق أمام الباب برمز خاطئ. إنه رمز، فاستخدم حقل نص مع لوحة الأرقام."}},{"id":"MC-P01-023","when":["steps"],"feedback":{"en":"Steppers are for small changes around a usual value. A code has no usual value; typing four digits is fastest.","ar":"الـ Stepper للتغييرات الصغيرة حول قيمة معتادة. والرمز ليس له قيمة معتادة؛ وكتابة أربعة أرقام هي الأسرع."}}],"explain":{"en":"From Lesson 2: IDs and codes are text made of digits. Use a text field that opens the number pad.","ar":"من الدرس 2: الأرقام التعريفية والرموز نص مكوّن من أرقام. استخدم حقل نص يفتح لوحة الأرقام."},"speaker":"sara"}]}$uxg$::jsonb),
  ($uxg$P01-U03-L01$uxg$, $uxg$707d39b1a9612ecad475978c4f29470b468c8f0f336bf8752e6f3f1802881fce$uxg$, $uxg${"id":"P01-U03-L01","mode":"lesson","minutes":8,"title":{"en":"Labels that don't vanish","ar":"عناوين لا تختفي"},"summary":{"en":"Turn an address form's vanishing grey examples into labels that stay while people type.","ar":"حوّل الأمثلة الرمادية التي تختفي في نموذج عنوان التوصيل إلى عناوين (Labels) تبقى أثناء الكتابة."},"speaker":"youssef","review_labels":{"MC-P01-034":{"en":"A placeholder is not a label","ar":"النص الداخلي (Placeholder) ليس عنوانًا (Label)"},"MC-P01-035":{"en":"Hints inside the field vanish while typing","ar":"التلميح داخل الحقل يختفي أثناء الكتابة"},"MC-P01-036":{"en":"Grey text in a field can look already filled","ar":"النص الرمادي في الحقل قد يبدو مُعبّأ مسبقًا"},"MC-P01-037":{"en":"Needed info can't hide in a tooltip","ar":"المعلومة الضرورية لا تُخفى في Tooltip"}},"steps":[{"id":"S01","type":"card","part":"hook","title":{"en":"Yasser's delivery address","ar":"عنوان توصيل ياسر"},"body":{"en":"Yasser ordered a kettle from my online shop. Our address form has no labels: each box shows a grey example inside it, like \"Street and building\", and the example disappears when he starts typing.\n\nHe typed his street, then stopped at the next box. It already showed his browser's suggestion, and he couldn't tell what it had asked for.","ar":"طلب ياسر غلّاية من متجري الإلكتروني. ونموذج عنوان التوصيل عندنا ليس فيه عناوين للحقول (Labels): كل مربع يعرض مثالًا رماديًا بداخله، مثل «الشارع ورقم العمارة»، ويختفي المثال حين يبدأ الكتابة.\n\nكتب شارعه، ثم توقّف عند المربع التالي. كان يعرض اقتراحًا من المتصفّح، ولم يعرف ماذا يطلب هذا المربع."},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Delivery address","ar":"عنوان التوصيل"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"progress","value":33,"label":{"en":"Step 1 of 3 · Address","ar":"الخطوة 1 من 3 · العنوان"}},{"kind":"listitem","art":"box","text":{"en":"Electric kettle, 1.7 L","ar":"غلاية كهربائية 1.7 لتر"},"sub":{"en":"Arrives Sunday","ar":"يصل الأحد"},"value":{"en":"EGP 850","ar":"850 جنيه"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","filled":true,"text":{"en":"14 Abbas El Akkad St","ar":"14 شارع عباس العقاد"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"field","filled":true,"text":{"en":"Nasr City","ar":"مدينة نصر"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","text":{"en":"Floor and flat number","ar":"رقم الدور والشقة"},"gap":"s"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Continue to payment","ar":"تابع إلى الدفع"}}]}},{"id":"S02","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P01-U03-01","part":"try","rules":["R12"],"value":{"en":"Try first. Placeholders (NN/g): text inside a field disappears when people type, so they can't check what a filled field asked for. The fix is a visible label outside the field.","ar":"جرّب أولًا. النص الداخلي (NN/g): النص داخل الحقل يختفي حين يكتب الناس، فلا يستطيعون التأكّد مما طلبه الحقل المعبّأ. والحل عنوان ظاهر خارج الحقل."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/form-design-placeholders/","quote":"the best solution is to have clear, visible labels that are placed outside empty form fields."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each version of my form. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل نسخة من نموذجي. أيّ نسخة تجعل ياسر يعرف ما يطلبه كل مربع، حتى بعد أن يكتب فيه؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Delivery address","ar":"عنوان التوصيل"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"blocks":[{"kind":"progress","value":33,"label":{"en":"Step 1 of 3 · Address","ar":"الخطوة 1 من 3 · العنوان"}},{"kind":"listitem","art":"box","text":{"en":"Electric kettle, 1.7 L","ar":"غلاية كهربائية 1.7 لتر"},"sub":{"en":"Arrives Sunday","ar":"يصل الأحد"},"value":{"en":"EGP 850","ar":"850 جنيه"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","filled":true,"text":{"en":"14 Abbas El Akkad St","ar":"14 شارع عباس العقاد"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"field","filled":true,"text":{"en":"Nasr City","ar":"مدينة نصر"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","text":{"en":"Floor and flat number","ar":"رقم الدور والشقة"},"gap":"s"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Continue to payment","ar":"تابع إلى الدفع"}}]},"options":[{"id":"darker","text":{"en":"Keep the examples inside, but make them darker","ar":"أبقِ الأمثلة بالداخل، لكن اجعلها أغمق"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Delivery address","ar":"عنوان التوصيل"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"progress","value":33,"label":{"en":"Step 1 of 3 · Address","ar":"الخطوة 1 من 3 · العنوان"}},{"kind":"listitem","art":"box","text":{"en":"Electric kettle, 1.7 L","ar":"غلاية كهربائية 1.7 لتر"},"sub":{"en":"Arrives Sunday","ar":"يصل الأحد"},"value":{"en":"EGP 850","ar":"850 جنيه"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","filled":true,"text":{"en":"14 Abbas El Akkad St","ar":"14 شارع عباس العقاد"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"field","filled":true,"text":{"en":"Nasr City","ar":"مدينة نصر"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","filled":true,"text":{"en":"Floor and flat number","ar":"رقم الدور والشقة"},"gap":"s"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Continue to payment","ar":"تابع إلى الدفع"}}]}},{"id":"labels","text":{"en":"Put a label above each box, and leave the boxes empty","ar":"ضع عنوانًا فوق كل مربع، واترك المربعات فارغة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Delivery address","ar":"عنوان التوصيل"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"progress","value":33,"label":{"en":"Step 1 of 3 · Address","ar":"الخطوة 1 من 3 · العنوان"}},{"kind":"listitem","art":"box","text":{"en":"Electric kettle, 1.7 L","ar":"غلاية كهربائية 1.7 لتر"},"sub":{"en":"Arrives Sunday","ar":"يصل الأحد"},"value":{"en":"EGP 850","ar":"850 جنيه"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Street and building","ar":"الشارع ورقم العمارة"},"filled":true,"text":{"en":"14 Abbas El Akkad St","ar":"14 شارع عباس العقاد"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Area","ar":"المنطقة"},"filled":true,"text":{"en":"Nasr City","ar":"مدينة نصر"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Floor and flat number","ar":"رقم الدور والشقة"},"text":"","gap":"s"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Continue to payment","ar":"تابع إلى الدفع"}}]}},{"id":"keep","text":{"en":"Keep it; the examples save space on a phone","ar":"أبقِ النموذج كما هو؛ فالأمثلة توفّر مساحة على الهاتف"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Delivery address","ar":"عنوان التوصيل"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"progress","value":33,"label":{"en":"Step 1 of 3 · Address","ar":"الخطوة 1 من 3 · العنوان"}},{"kind":"listitem","art":"box","text":{"en":"Electric kettle, 1.7 L","ar":"غلاية كهربائية 1.7 لتر"},"sub":{"en":"Arrives Sunday","ar":"يصل الأحد"},"value":{"en":"EGP 850","ar":"850 جنيه"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","filled":true,"text":{"en":"14 Abbas El Akkad St","ar":"14 شارع عباس العقاد"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"field","filled":true,"text":{"en":"Nasr City","ar":"مدينة نصر"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","text":{"en":"Floor and flat number","ar":"رقم الدور والشقة"},"gap":"s"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Continue to payment","ar":"تابع إلى الدفع"}}]}}],"answer":["labels"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-034","when":["keep"],"feedback":{"en":"Once Yasser types, the example is gone, so a filled box no longer says what it asked for. A label outside stays there the whole time.","ar":"بمجرّد أن يكتب ياسر، يختفي المثال، فلا يعود المربع الممتلئ يوضّح ما المطلوب فيه. أما العنوان الخارجي فيبقى طوال الوقت."}},{"id":"MC-P01-036","when":["darker"],"feedback":{"en":"Darker examples look like real answers, so the empty box now seems filled. And they still vanish when he types. Move the words out of the box.","ar":"الأمثلة الأغمق تبدو كإجابات حقيقية، فيبدو المربع الفارغ مُعبّأً. وما زالت تختفي حين يكتب. انقل الكلمات خارج المربع."}}],"hints":[{"en":"After Yasser types in a box, what tells him what that box asked for?","ar":"بعد أن يكتب ياسر في مربع، ما الذي يخبره بما طلبه هذا المربع؟"},{"en":"Which version keeps the meaning of every box on screen?","ar":"أي نسخة تُبقي معنى كل مربع ظاهرًا على الشاشة؟"}],"correct":{"en":"A label outside the field never disappears.","ar":"العنوان خارج الحقل لا يختفي أبدًا."},"explain":{"en":"Text inside a field is gone the moment someone types. A label above the box keeps telling them what belongs there, before, during and after typing.","ar":"النص داخل الحقل يختفي لحظة الكتابة. أما العنوان فوق المربع فيظل يخبر الشخص بما يُكتب فيه، قبل الكتابة وأثناءها وبعدها."}},{"id":"S03","type":"card","part":"concept","icons":["text","eye","warn","idea"],"title":{"en":"A label has to survive typing","ar":"العنوان يجب أن يبقى بعد الكتابة"},"body":{"en":"Grey text inside a field is called a placeholder. It looks tidy, but it causes real problems.\n\n- **Labels outside:** put what the field is above it, where it stays visible.\n- **Hints outside too:** a format or example belongs under or above the field, not inside, so it's there while people type.\n- **Grey text misleads:** people may think it's already filled in and skip the field.\n- **Tooltips aren't for must-know info:** an info icon needs a hover, and phones don't have one. Show what people need on the screen.","ar":"النص الرمادي داخل الحقل يسمّى Placeholder (نص داخلي). يبدو مرتّبًا، لكنه يسبّب مشكلات حقيقية.\n\n- **العناوين (Labels) بالخارج:** ضع اسم الحقل فوقه، حيث يبقى ظاهرًا.\n- **التلميحات بالخارج أيضًا:** الصيغة أو المثال مكانه تحت الحقل أو فوقه، لا بداخله، حتى يبقى أثناء الكتابة.\n- **النص الرمادي يضلّل:** قد يظن الناس أن الحقل مُعبّأ فيتخطّونه.\n- **الـ Tooltip ليس للمعلومة الضرورية:** أيقونة المعلومات تحتاج تمرير الماوس، والهواتف ليس فيها ذلك. اعرض ما يحتاجه الناس على الشاشة."}},{"id":"S04","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P01-U03-02","part":"guided","rules":["R06","R15"],"value":{"en":"Placeholders (NN/g): hints and instructions should be persistent and placed outside the field. An example inside the phone field is gone before Yasser reaches the digit he's unsure about.","ar":"النص الداخلي (NN/g): التلميحات والتعليمات يجب أن تبقى ظاهرة وتوضع خارج الحقل. والمثال داخل حقل الهاتف يختفي قبل أن يصل ياسر إلى الرقم الذي لا يعرفه."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/form-design-placeholders/","quote":"Hints and instructions should also be persistent and placed outside of the field."},"scenario":{"en":"Our driver calls the number in the \"Phone for the driver\" field. It must be an Egyptian mobile: 11 digits starting with 01. Yasser is halfway through typing his.","ar":"يتّصل سائقنا بالرقم المكتوب في حقل «رقم هاتف للسائق». ويجب أن يكون رقم موبايل مصريًا: 11 رقمًا يبدأ بـ 01. وياسر في منتصف كتابة رقمه."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each place for the hint. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل مكان للتلميح. أيّها يجب أن يُطلق؟"},"start":"inside","options":[{"id":"inside","text":{"en":"Inside the field: \"e.g. 010 1234 5678\"","ar":"داخل الحقل: «مثال: 010 1234 5678»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"caption":{"en":"While Yasser types","ar":"أثناء كتابة ياسر"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Delivery address","ar":"عنوان التوصيل"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"progress","value":33,"label":{"en":"Step 1 of 3 · Address","ar":"الخطوة 1 من 3 · العنوان"}},{"kind":"listitem","art":"box","text":{"en":"Electric kettle, 1.7 L","ar":"غلاية كهربائية 1.7 لتر"},"sub":{"en":"Arrives Sunday","ar":"يصل الأحد"},"value":{"en":"EGP 850","ar":"850 جنيه"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Phone for the driver","ar":"رقم هاتف للسائق"},"filled":true,"focus":true,"text":"⁦010 98⁩"}]}},{"id":"none","text":{"en":"No hint; the label is enough","ar":"بلا تلميح؛ العنوان يكفي"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"caption":{"en":"While Yasser types","ar":"أثناء كتابة ياسر"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Delivery address","ar":"عنوان التوصيل"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"progress","value":33,"label":{"en":"Step 1 of 3 · Address","ar":"الخطوة 1 من 3 · العنوان"}},{"kind":"listitem","art":"box","text":{"en":"Electric kettle, 1.7 L","ar":"غلاية كهربائية 1.7 لتر"},"sub":{"en":"Arrives Sunday","ar":"يصل الأحد"},"value":{"en":"EGP 850","ar":"850 جنيه"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Phone for the driver","ar":"رقم هاتف للسائق"},"filled":true,"focus":true,"text":"⁦010 98⁩"}]}},{"id":"below","text":{"en":"Under the field: \"11 digits, starting with 01\"","ar":"تحت الحقل: «11 رقمًا، يبدأ بـ 01»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"caption":{"en":"While Yasser types","ar":"أثناء كتابة ياسر"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Delivery address","ar":"عنوان التوصيل"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"progress","value":33,"label":{"en":"Step 1 of 3 · Address","ar":"الخطوة 1 من 3 · العنوان"}},{"kind":"listitem","art":"box","text":{"en":"Electric kettle, 1.7 L","ar":"غلاية كهربائية 1.7 لتر"},"sub":{"en":"Arrives Sunday","ar":"يصل الأحد"},"value":{"en":"EGP 850","ar":"850 جنيه"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Phone for the driver","ar":"رقم هاتف للسائق"},"filled":true,"focus":true,"text":"⁦010 98⁩","hint":{"en":"11 digits, starting with 01","ar":"11 رقمًا، يبدأ بـ 01"}}]}}],"answer":["below"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-035","when":["inside"],"feedback":{"en":"Look at the preview: Yasser has started typing, and the example is already gone. A hint has to be there while he types.","ar":"انظر إلى المعاينة: بدأ ياسر الكتابة، واختفى المثال بالفعل. والتلميح يجب أن يكون موجودًا أثناء الكتابة."}},{"id":"MC-P01-035","when":["none"],"feedback":{"en":"The label says what the number is for, not what it should look like. The driver only gets through if the format is right, so say it.","ar":"العنوان يوضّح لماذا نطلب الرقم، لا كيف يجب أن يبدو. ولن ينجح اتصال السائق إلا إذا كانت الصيغة صحيحة، فاذكرها."}}],"hints":[{"en":"In the preview, Yasser is typing. Can he still see the hint?","ar":"في المعاينة، ياسر يكتب. هل ما زال يرى التلميح؟"},{"en":"Where can a hint sit so that typing doesn't erase it?","ar":"أين يمكن أن يوضع التلميح حتى لا تمسحه الكتابة؟"}],"correct":{"en":"The hint sits outside, so it's still there mid-typing.","ar":"التلميح بالخارج، فيبقى ظاهرًا في منتصف الكتابة."},"explain":{"en":"People need a format most while they type and when they check their answer. A hint under the field is there at both moments; one inside is gone at both.","ar":"يحتاج الناس الصيغة أكثر ما يحتاجونها أثناء الكتابة وعند مراجعة إجابتهم. والتلميح تحت الحقل موجود في اللحظتين؛ أما الذي بالداخل فيختفي في الاثنتين."},"speaker":"youssef"},{"id":"S05","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P01-U03-01","part":"guided","rules":["R06","R15"],"value":{"en":"Placeholders (NN/g): some people assume placeholder text is a default value and skip the field. A gift message that seems written already gets skipped, and the gift arrives blank.","ar":"النص الداخلي (NN/g): بعض الناس يظنون أن النص الداخلي قيمة افتراضية فيتخطّون الحقل. ورسالة الهدية التي تبدو مكتوبة بالفعل تُتخطّى، فتصل الهدية بلا رسالة."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/form-design-placeholders/","quote":"Some users assume the placeholder text is a default value and skip the field completely."},"scenario":{"en":"Many orders sent as gifts reach us with an empty gift message. The message box shows \"Happy birthday! With love…\" in grey until someone types.","ar":"كثير من الطلبات المرسلة كهدايا تصلنا برسالة إهداء فارغة. ومربع الرسالة يعرض «عيد ميلاد سعيد! مع حبّي…» باللون الرمادي حتى يكتب أحد."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each version of the gift box. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل نسخة من مربع الهدية. أيّ نسخة توضّح للمشتري أن عليه أن يكتب رسالة الإهداء بنفسه؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Gift options","ar":"خيارات الهدية"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"blocks":[{"kind":"progress","value":33,"label":{"en":"Step 1 of 3 · Address","ar":"الخطوة 1 من 3 · العنوان"}},{"kind":"listitem","art":"box","text":{"en":"Electric kettle, 1.7 L","ar":"غلاية كهربائية 1.7 لتر"},"sub":{"en":"Arrives Sunday","ar":"يصل الأحد"},"value":{"en":"EGP 850","ar":"850 جنيه"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"check","selected":true,"text":{"en":"This is a gift","ar":"هذا الطلب هدية"}},{"kind":"field","text":{"en":"Happy birthday! With love…","ar":"عيد ميلاد سعيد! مع حبّي…"},"gap":"s"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Place order","ar":"أكّد الطلب"}}]},"options":[{"id":"label","text":{"en":"Add the label \"Gift message (optional)\" above an empty box","ar":"أضف العنوان «رسالة الهدية (اختياري)» فوق مربع فارغ"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Gift options","ar":"خيارات الهدية"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"progress","value":33,"label":{"en":"Step 1 of 3 · Address","ar":"الخطوة 1 من 3 · العنوان"}},{"kind":"listitem","art":"box","text":{"en":"Electric kettle, 1.7 L","ar":"غلاية كهربائية 1.7 لتر"},"sub":{"en":"Arrives Sunday","ar":"يصل الأحد"},"value":{"en":"EGP 850","ar":"850 جنيه"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"check","selected":true,"text":{"en":"This is a gift","ar":"هذا الطلب هدية"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Gift message (optional)","ar":"رسالة الهدية (اختياري)"},"text":"","gap":"s"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Place order","ar":"أكّد الطلب"}}]}},{"id":"example","text":{"en":"Keep it, and make the example longer and friendlier","ar":"أبقِ المثال بالداخل، واجعله أطول وألطف"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Gift options","ar":"خيارات الهدية"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"progress","value":33,"label":{"en":"Step 1 of 3 · Address","ar":"الخطوة 1 من 3 · العنوان"}},{"kind":"listitem","art":"box","text":{"en":"Electric kettle, 1.7 L","ar":"غلاية كهربائية 1.7 لتر"},"sub":{"en":"Arrives Sunday","ar":"يصل الأحد"},"value":{"en":"EGP 850","ar":"850 جنيه"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"check","selected":true,"text":{"en":"This is a gift","ar":"هذا الطلب هدية"}},{"kind":"field","text":{"en":"Happy birthday, dear! Wishing you a wonderful year…","ar":"عيد ميلاد سعيد يا عزيزي! أتمنّى لك سنة رائعة…"},"gap":"s"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Place order","ar":"أكّد الطلب"}}]}},{"id":"keep","text":{"en":"Keep it as it is","ar":"أبقِ المربع كما هو"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Gift options","ar":"خيارات الهدية"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"progress","value":33,"label":{"en":"Step 1 of 3 · Address","ar":"الخطوة 1 من 3 · العنوان"}},{"kind":"listitem","art":"box","text":{"en":"Electric kettle, 1.7 L","ar":"غلاية كهربائية 1.7 لتر"},"sub":{"en":"Arrives Sunday","ar":"يصل الأحد"},"value":{"en":"EGP 850","ar":"850 جنيه"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"check","selected":true,"text":{"en":"This is a gift","ar":"هذا الطلب هدية"}},{"kind":"field","text":{"en":"Happy birthday! With love…","ar":"عيد ميلاد سعيد! مع حبّي…"},"gap":"s"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Place order","ar":"أكّد الطلب"}}]}}],"answer":["label"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-036","when":["keep","example"],"feedback":{"en":"The grey sentence reads like a message someone already wrote, so people move on. A longer one looks even more finished. Name the box, and leave it empty.","ar":"الجملة الرمادية تُقرأ كرسالة كتبها أحد بالفعل، فيتخطّاها الناس. والأطول تبدو أكثر اكتمالًا. سمِّ المربع، واتركه فارغًا."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Does the box look empty or already written?","ar":"هل يبدو المربع فارغًا أم مكتوبًا بالفعل؟"},{"en":"What makes it clear that the box is waiting for the buyer's own words?","ar":"ما الذي يوضّح أن المربع ينتظر كلمات المشتري نفسه؟"}],"correct":{"en":"An empty box under a label clearly waits for an answer.","ar":"المربع الفارغ تحت عنوان ينتظر إجابة بوضوح."},"explain":{"en":"Grey text can pass for a real answer. A label outside plus an empty box removes the doubt: the box is empty, so it's the buyer's to fill.","ar":"النص الرمادي قد يبدو إجابة حقيقية. والعنوان بالخارج مع مربع فارغ يزيل الشك: المربع فارغ، إذن على المشتري أن يملأه."},"speaker":"youssef"},{"id":"S06","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P01-U03-03","part":"guided","rules":["R06","R15"],"value":{"en":"Tooltips (NN/g): tooltips need a hover, so they're not normally available on touchscreens, and people shouldn't need one to finish a task. Where to find the card code is needed to pay.","ar":"الـ Tooltip (NN/g): يحتاج الـ Tooltip تمرير الماوس، لذلك لا يتوفّر عادةً على شاشات اللمس، ويجب ألا يحتاج الناس إليه لإكمال مهمتهم. ومكان رمز البطاقة ضروري للدفع."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/tooltip-guidelines/","quote":"They are not normally available on touchscreens."},"scenario":{"en":"Most of my customers pay on their phones. Our card form asks for the security code, and many people don't know where it is. Right now, \"3 digits on the back of your card\" appears only when you hover over the ⓘ.","ar":"أغلب عملائي يدفعون من هواتفهم. ونموذج البطاقة عندنا يطلب رمز الأمان، وكثيرون لا يعرفون مكانه. والآن، تظهر عبارة «3 أرقام على ظهر بطاقتك» فقط عند تمرير الماوس فوق ⓘ."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each version. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل نسخة. أيّها يجب أن تُطلق؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Payment","ar":"الدفع"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"blocks":[{"kind":"progress","value":33,"label":{"en":"Step 1 of 3 · Address","ar":"الخطوة 1 من 3 · العنوان"}},{"kind":"listitem","art":"box","text":{"en":"Electric kettle, 1.7 L","ar":"غلاية كهربائية 1.7 لتر"},"sub":{"en":"Arrives Sunday","ar":"يصل الأحد"},"value":{"en":"EGP 850","ar":"850 جنيه"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Security code ⓘ","ar":"رمز الأمان ⓘ"},"text":""}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Pay 450 EGP","ar":"ادفع 450 جنيهًا"}}]},"options":[{"id":"placeholder","text":{"en":"Put \"3 digits on the back\" inside the field","ar":"ضع «3 أرقام على الظهر» داخل الحقل"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Payment","ar":"الدفع"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"progress","value":33,"label":{"en":"Step 1 of 3 · Address","ar":"الخطوة 1 من 3 · العنوان"}},{"kind":"listitem","art":"box","text":{"en":"Electric kettle, 1.7 L","ar":"غلاية كهربائية 1.7 لتر"},"sub":{"en":"Arrives Sunday","ar":"يصل الأحد"},"value":{"en":"EGP 850","ar":"850 جنيه"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Security code","ar":"رمز الأمان"},"text":{"en":"3 digits on the back","ar":"3 أرقام على الظهر"}}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Pay 450 EGP","ar":"ادفع 450 جنيهًا"}}]}},{"id":"hint","text":{"en":"Show \"The 3 digits on the back of your card\" under the label","ar":"اعرض «الأرقام الثلاثة على ظهر بطاقتك» تحت العنوان"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Payment","ar":"الدفع"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"progress","value":33,"label":{"en":"Step 1 of 3 · Address","ar":"الخطوة 1 من 3 · العنوان"}},{"kind":"listitem","art":"box","text":{"en":"Electric kettle, 1.7 L","ar":"غلاية كهربائية 1.7 لتر"},"sub":{"en":"Arrives Sunday","ar":"يصل الأحد"},"value":{"en":"EGP 850","ar":"850 جنيه"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Security code","ar":"رمز الأمان"},"hintFirst":true,"hint":{"en":"The 3 digits on the back of your card","ar":"الأرقام الثلاثة على ظهر بطاقتك"},"text":""}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Pay 450 EGP","ar":"ادفع 450 جنيهًا"}}]}},{"id":"keep","text":{"en":"Keep the ⓘ; it keeps the form clean","ar":"أبقِ ⓘ؛ فهي تُبقي النموذج مرتّبًا"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Payment","ar":"الدفع"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"progress","value":33,"label":{"en":"Step 1 of 3 · Address","ar":"الخطوة 1 من 3 · العنوان"}},{"kind":"listitem","art":"box","text":{"en":"Electric kettle, 1.7 L","ar":"غلاية كهربائية 1.7 لتر"},"sub":{"en":"Arrives Sunday","ar":"يصل الأحد"},"value":{"en":"EGP 850","ar":"850 جنيه"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Security code ⓘ","ar":"رمز الأمان ⓘ"},"text":""}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Pay 450 EGP","ar":"ادفع 450 جنيهًا"}}]}}],"answer":["hint"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-037","when":["keep"],"feedback":{"en":"On a phone there's no hover, so most of my customers never see the help. Something they need in order to pay must be on the screen.","ar":"على الهاتف لا يوجد تمرير للماوس، فلا يرى أغلب عملائي المساعدة أبدًا. وما يحتاجونه للدفع يجب أن يكون على الشاشة."}},{"id":"MC-P01-035","when":["placeholder"],"feedback":{"en":"Now it's visible, but it vanishes as soon as they type the first digit, while they're still turning the card over. Put it outside the field.","ar":"صار ظاهرًا، لكنه يختفي مع أول رقم يكتبونه، وهم ما زالوا يقلبون البطاقة. ضعه خارج الحقل."}}],"hints":[{"en":"How does someone on a phone open a hover tooltip?","ar":"كيف يفتح شخص على الهاتف Tooltip يعمل بتمرير الماوس؟"},{"en":"Which version shows the help without a hover and keeps it while typing?","ar":"أي نسخة تعرض المساعدة دون تمرير الماوس، وتُبقيها أثناء الكتابة؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Help people need to pay sits on the screen, outside the field.","ar":"المساعدة التي يحتاجها الناس للدفع موجودة على الشاشة، خارج الحقل."},"explain":{"en":"A tooltip hides help behind a gesture phones don't have. A short line under the label is seen by everyone, on every device, and stays while they type.","ar":"الـ Tooltip يُخفي المساعدة خلف حركة لا توجد في الهواتف. أما السطر القصير تحت العنوان فيراه الجميع، على كل جهاز، ويبقى أثناء الكتابة."},"speaker":"youssef"},{"id":"S07","type":"compare","skill":"SK-P01-U03-02","part":"contrast","confidence":true,"rules":["R11","R15"],"value":{"en":"Contrast: both versions have a label, which is a step in the right direction. Placeholders (NN/g): hints should still be persistent and outside the field, so B's example survives typing.","ar":"مقارنة: في النسختين عنوان، وهذه خطوة في الاتجاه الصحيح. النص الداخلي (NN/g): ومع ذلك يجب أن تبقى التلميحات ظاهرة وخارج الحقل، لذلك يبقى مثال النسخة B بعد الكتابة."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/form-design-placeholders/","quote":"Using placeholder text in combination with form labels is a step in the right direction."},"scenario":{"en":"Our returns form asks for the order number. It looks like ORD-48291, and Yasser has typed the first part.","ar":"نموذج الإرجاع عندنا يطلب رقم الطلب. وهو يشبه ORD-48291، وقد كتب ياسر الجزء الأول."},"prompt":{"en":"Which version should ship?","ar":"أي نسخة يجب أن تُطلق؟"},"a":{"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Return an item","ar":"إرجاع منتج"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"progress","value":33,"label":{"en":"Step 1 of 3 · Address","ar":"الخطوة 1 من 3 · العنوان"}},{"kind":"listitem","art":"box","text":{"en":"Electric kettle, 1.7 L","ar":"غلاية كهربائية 1.7 لتر"},"sub":{"en":"Arrives Sunday","ar":"يصل الأحد"},"value":{"en":"EGP 850","ar":"850 جنيه"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Order number","ar":"رقم الطلب"},"filled":true,"focus":true,"text":"ORD-"}]}},"b":{"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Return an item","ar":"إرجاع منتج"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"progress","value":33,"label":{"en":"Step 1 of 3 · Address","ar":"الخطوة 1 من 3 · العنوان"}},{"kind":"listitem","art":"box","text":{"en":"Electric kettle, 1.7 L","ar":"غلاية كهربائية 1.7 لتر"},"sub":{"en":"Arrives Sunday","ar":"يصل الأحد"},"value":{"en":"EGP 850","ar":"850 جنيه"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Order number","ar":"رقم الطلب"},"filled":true,"focus":true,"text":"ORD-","hint":{"en":"Like ORD-48291, on your receipt","ar":"مثل ORD-48291، على إيصالك"}}]}},"answer":"b","reason":{"prompt":{"en":"What makes B better, when both have a label?","ar":"ما الذي يجعل B أفضل، مع أن في الاثنتين عنوانًا؟"},"options":[{"id":"short","text":{"en":"Its label is shorter","ar":"عنوانها أقصر"}},{"id":"stays","text":{"en":"Its example is still there while he types","ar":"مثالها ما زال ظاهرًا أثناء كتابته"}},{"id":"pretty","text":{"en":"It looks more modern","ar":"تبدو أكثر حداثة"}}],"answer":["stays"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-035","when":["short","pretty"],"feedback":{"en":"Both labels are the same. The difference is the example: A had it inside the field, and typing erased it.","ar":"العنوانان متطابقان. الفرق في المثال: في A كان داخل الحقل، ومسحته الكتابة."}}]},"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-035","when":["a"],"feedback":{"en":"A's example was inside the field, and it disappeared with the first letter. Yasser now has to guess how many digits come next.","ar":"مثال A كان داخل الحقل، واختفى مع أول حرف. والآن على ياسر أن يخمّن كم رقمًا يأتي بعد ذلك."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Yasser has started typing. In which version can he still see what the number looks like?","ar":"بدأ ياسر الكتابة. في أي نسخة ما زال يرى شكل الرقم؟"},{"en":"Where did the example go in A?","ar":"أين ذهب المثال في A؟"}],"correct":{"en":"A label is good; a hint outside the field is what survives typing.","ar":"العنوان جيد؛ لكن التلميح خارج الحقل هو ما يبقى بعد الكتابة."},"explain":{"en":"A label alone fixes \"what is this field\". The format still has to be outside the box, so it's there exactly when people are typing and checking.","ar":"العنوان وحده يحلّ سؤال «ما هذا الحقل». لكن الصيغة يجب أن تكون خارج المربع أيضًا، لتكون موجودة تمامًا حين يكتب الناس ويراجعون."},"speaker":"youssef"},{"id":"S08","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P01-U03-01","part":"independent","speaker":"nour","rules":["R14","R19"],"value":{"en":"New case. Placeholders (NN/g): labels outside the fields keep the essential information visible at all times, so a patient can check each answer before submitting.","ar":"حالة جديدة. النص الداخلي (NN/g): العناوين خارج الحقول تُبقي المعلومة الأساسية ظاهرة طوال الوقت، فيستطيع المريض مراجعة كل إجابة قبل الإرسال."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/form-design-placeholders/","quote":"Labels outside the form fields make the essential information visible at all times"},"scenario":{"en":"In my clinic's app, patients sign in to see test results with two fields. Both only have grey words inside. Ahmed filled them in and now wants to check them before tapping Sign in, but both boxes just show numbers.","ar":"في تطبيق عيادتي، يدخل المرضى لرؤية نتائج التحاليل عبر حقلين. وكلاهما فيه كلمات رمادية بالداخل فقط. ملأهما أحمد ويريد الآن مراجعتهما قبل أن يضغط «دخول»، لكن المربعين يعرضان أرقامًا فقط."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each version. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل نسخة. أيّها يجب أن تُطلق؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"See your results","ar":"اطّلع على نتائجك"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"blocks":[{"kind":"progress","value":33,"label":{"en":"Step 1 of 3 · Address","ar":"الخطوة 1 من 3 · العنوان"}},{"kind":"listitem","art":"box","text":{"en":"Electric kettle, 1.7 L","ar":"غلاية كهربائية 1.7 لتر"},"sub":{"en":"Arrives Sunday","ar":"يصل الأحد"},"value":{"en":"EGP 850","ar":"850 جنيه"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","filled":true,"text":"48213","gap":"m"},{"kind":"field","filled":true,"text":"⁦0101 1985⁩","gap":"s"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Sign in","ar":"دخول"}}]},"options":[{"id":"icons","text":{"en":"Add a small icon inside each field","ar":"أضف أيقونة صغيرة داخل كل حقل"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"See your results","ar":"اطّلع على نتائجك"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"progress","value":33,"label":{"en":"Step 1 of 3 · Address","ar":"الخطوة 1 من 3 · العنوان"}},{"kind":"listitem","art":"box","text":{"en":"Electric kettle, 1.7 L","ar":"غلاية كهربائية 1.7 لتر"},"sub":{"en":"Arrives Sunday","ar":"يصل الأحد"},"value":{"en":"EGP 850","ar":"850 جنيه"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","filled":true,"text":"# 48213","gap":"m"},{"kind":"field","filled":true,"text":"▦ ⁦0101 1985⁩","gap":"s"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Sign in","ar":"دخول"}}]}},{"id":"keep","text":{"en":"Keep it; patients know what they typed","ar":"أبقِ الحقلين كما هما؛ فالمرضى يعرفون ما كتبوه"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"See your results","ar":"اطّلع على نتائجك"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"progress","value":33,"label":{"en":"Step 1 of 3 · Address","ar":"الخطوة 1 من 3 · العنوان"}},{"kind":"listitem","art":"box","text":{"en":"Electric kettle, 1.7 L","ar":"غلاية كهربائية 1.7 لتر"},"sub":{"en":"Arrives Sunday","ar":"يصل الأحد"},"value":{"en":"EGP 850","ar":"850 جنيه"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","filled":true,"text":"48213","gap":"m"},{"kind":"field","filled":true,"text":"⁦0101 1985⁩","gap":"s"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Sign in","ar":"دخول"}}]}},{"id":"labels","text":{"en":"Put \"File number\" and \"Date of birth\" above the fields","ar":"ضع «رقم الملف» و«تاريخ الميلاد» فوق الحقلين"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"See your results","ar":"اطّلع على نتائجك"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"progress","value":33,"label":{"en":"Step 1 of 3 · Address","ar":"الخطوة 1 من 3 · العنوان"}},{"kind":"listitem","art":"box","text":{"en":"Electric kettle, 1.7 L","ar":"غلاية كهربائية 1.7 لتر"},"sub":{"en":"Arrives Sunday","ar":"يصل الأحد"},"value":{"en":"EGP 850","ar":"850 جنيه"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"File number","ar":"رقم الملف"},"filled":true,"text":"48213","gap":"m"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Date of birth (DDMM YYYY)","ar":"تاريخ الميلاد (يوم شهر سنة)"},"filled":true,"text":"⁦0101 1985⁩","gap":"s"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Sign in","ar":"دخول"}}]}}],"answer":["labels"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-034","when":["keep"],"feedback":{"en":"Two filled boxes of numbers look alike. Without labels, Ahmed can't tell if he put his file number in the date box. Labels let him check.","ar":"مربّعان مليئان بالأرقام يتشابهان. ومن دون عناوين، لا يعرف أحمد هل كتب رقم ملفه في مربع التاريخ. والعناوين تتيح له المراجعة."}},{"id":"MC-P01-034","when":["icons"],"feedback":{"en":"An icon still has to be guessed, and these two could mean many things. Words outside the field say exactly what each box holds.","ar":"الأيقونة ما زالت تحتاج تخمينًا، وهاتان قد تعنيان أشياء كثيرة. والكلمات خارج الحقل توضّح بالضبط ما في كل مربع."}}],"hints":[{"en":"After filling in both boxes, how can Ahmed tell which is which?","ar":"بعد ملء المربعين، كيف يميّز أحمد بينهما؟"},{"en":"Which version still names each box once it's filled?","ar":"أي نسخة ما زالت تسمّي كل مربع بعد ملئه؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Labels outside let people check filled fields.","ar":"العناوين بالخارج تتيح مراجعة الحقول المعبّأة."},"explain":{"en":"The moment of checking comes after typing, exactly when placeholder words are gone. Labels outside are still there to confirm each answer.","ar":"لحظة المراجعة تأتي بعد الكتابة، أي تمامًا حين تختفي كلمات النص الداخلي. أما العناوين بالخارج فتبقى لتأكيد كل إجابة."}},{"id":"S09","type":"card","part":"recap","icons":["text","eye","warn","idea"],"title":{"en":"What you did","ar":"ماذا تعلّمت"},"body":{"en":"- **Labels outside:** replaced vanishing grey words with labels above each field.\n- **Hints outside:** put the phone format under the field, so it stayed while typing.\n- **No fake answers:** left the gift box empty under a label, so it didn't look already written.\n- **No hidden help:** showed where the card code is, instead of hiding it in a tooltip.\n\nNext lesson: where labels sit and how fields line up.","ar":"- **العناوين بالخارج:** استبدلت الكلمات الرمادية التي تختفي بعناوين فوق كل حقل.\n- **التلميحات بالخارج:** وضعت صيغة الهاتف تحت الحقل، فبقيت أثناء الكتابة.\n- **لا إجابات مزيّفة:** تركت مربع الهدية فارغًا تحت عنوان، حتى لا يبدو مكتوبًا.\n- **لا مساعدة مخفية:** عرضت مكان رمز البطاقة، بدل إخفائه في Tooltip.\n\nالدرس التالي: أين توضع العناوين وكيف تُرتّب الحقول."}}]}$uxg$::jsonb),
  ($uxg$P01-U03-L02$uxg$, $uxg$c2d74c9cb0819ff554c2a1e12c46ac758186be8797bec6a26eecbc4090690767$uxg$, $uxg${"id":"P01-U03-L02","mode":"lesson","minutes":8,"title":{"en":"Where labels sit, how fields line up","ar":"أين توضع العناوين، وكيف تُرتّب الحقول"},"summary":{"en":"Place labels and line up fields so nobody types into the wrong box.","ar":"ضع العناوين ورتّب الحقول حتى لا يكتب أحد في المربع الخطأ."},"speaker":"youssef","review_labels":{"MC-P01-038":{"en":"A label belongs nearest its own field","ar":"العنوان مكانه الأقرب إلى حقله"},"MC-P01-039":{"en":"On phones, labels go above fields","ar":"على الهاتف، العناوين فوق الحقول"},"MC-P01-040":{"en":"Two columns break the path down the form","ar":"العمودان يربكان ترتيب ملء النموذج"},"MC-P01-041":{"en":"Group related fields under a heading","ar":"اجمع الحقول المترابطة تحت عنوان رئيسي"}},"steps":[{"id":"S01","type":"card","part":"hook","title":{"en":"Nada's phone number","ar":"رقم هاتف ندى"},"body":{"en":"Nada created an account in my shop's app. Our sign-up form has labels, but each one sits halfway between two boxes.\n\nShe typed her email into the phone box, got an error, and gave up.","ar":"أنشأت ندى حسابًا في تطبيق متجري. ونموذج التسجيل عندنا فيه عناوين، لكن كل عنوان يقع في منتصف المسافة بين مربعين.\n\nكتبت بريدها في مربع الهاتف، فظهر خطأ، فتركت التسجيل."},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Create your account","ar":"أنشئ حسابك"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Full name","ar":"الاسم الكامل"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"field","text":"","gap":"m"},{"kind":"small","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Mobile number","ar":"رقم الموبايل"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"field","text":"","gap":"m"},{"kind":"small","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Email","ar":"البريد الإلكتروني"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"field","text":"","gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"S02","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P01-U03-04","part":"try","rules":["R12"],"value":{"en":"Try first. White space in forms (NN/g): items near each other appear related, so place each label closer to its own field than to other fields. Equal gaps leave people guessing.","ar":"جرّب أولًا. المسافات في النماذج (NN/g): العناصر المتقاربة تبدو مترابطة، لذلك ضع كل عنوان أقرب إلى حقله منه إلى الحقول الأخرى. والمسافات المتساوية تترك الناس يخمّنون."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/form-design-white-space/","quote":"Place the label closer to the associated text field than to other text fields."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each spacing. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل توزيع للمسافات. أيّها يجب أن يُطلق؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Create your account","ar":"أنشئ حسابك"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Full name","ar":"الاسم الكامل"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"field","text":"","gap":"m"},{"kind":"small","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Mobile number","ar":"رقم الموبايل"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"field","text":"","gap":"m"},{"kind":"small","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Email","ar":"البريد الإلكتروني"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"field","text":"","gap":"m"}]},"options":[{"id":"lines","text":{"en":"Keep the gaps, and add a line between fields","ar":"أبقِ المسافات، وأضف خطًّا بين الحقول"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Create your account","ar":"أنشئ حسابك"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Full name","ar":"الاسم الكامل"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"field","text":"","gap":"m"},{"kind":"divider","gap":"s"},{"kind":"small","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Mobile number","ar":"رقم الموبايل"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","text":"","gap":"m"},{"kind":"divider","gap":"s"},{"kind":"small","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Email","ar":"البريد الإلكتروني"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","text":"","gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"tight","text":{"en":"Each label right on top of its field, more space before the next","ar":"كل عنوان فوق حقله مباشرة، ومسافة أكبر قبل الحقل التالي"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Create your account","ar":"أنشئ حسابك"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Full name","ar":"الاسم الكامل"},"text":"","gap":"m"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Mobile number","ar":"رقم الموبايل"},"text":"","gap":"l"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Email","ar":"البريد الإلكتروني"},"text":"","gap":"l"}]}},{"id":"bold","text":{"en":"Keep the gaps, and make the labels bigger","ar":"أبقِ المسافات، واجعل العناوين أكبر"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Create your account","ar":"أنشئ حسابك"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"text","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Full name","ar":"الاسم الكامل"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"field","text":"","gap":"m"},{"kind":"text","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Mobile number","ar":"رقم الموبايل"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"field","text":"","gap":"m"},{"kind":"text","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Email","ar":"البريد الإلكتروني"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"field","text":"","gap":"m"}]}}],"answer":["tight"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-038","when":["lines","bold"],"feedback":{"en":"Each label is still as close to the box below it as to the box above it, so \"Mobile number\" could belong to either. Move it next to its own field.","ar":"ما زال كل عنوان قريبًا من المربع تحته بقدر قربه من المربع فوقه، فقد يخصّ «رقم الموبايل» أيًّا منهما. ضعه بجوار حقله."}}],"hints":[{"en":"In the Now screen, is \"Mobile number\" nearer the box above it or the one below?","ar":"في شاشة «الآن»، هل «رقم الموبايل» أقرب إلى المربع فوقه أم تحته؟"},{"en":"Which version makes the gap itself say which box a label belongs to?","ar":"أي نسخة تجعل المسافة نفسها توضّح لأي مربع ينتمي العنوان؟"}],"correct":{"en":"A label hugs its own field; the bigger gap separates fields.","ar":"العنوان ملاصق لحقله؛ والمسافة الأكبر تفصل بين الحقول."},"explain":{"en":"People pair things that are close together. Keep each label tight to its field and leave a clearly bigger gap before the next one, and nobody has to guess.","ar":"يربط الناس بين الأشياء المتقاربة. اجعل كل عنوان ملاصقًا لحقله، واترك مسافة أكبر بوضوح قبل الحقل التالي، فلن يضطر أحد إلى التخمين."}},{"id":"S03","type":"card","part":"concept","icons":["space","phone","list","group"],"title":{"en":"Layout tells people what goes where","ar":"التخطيط (Layout) يخبر الناس بما يُكتب وأين"},"body":{"en":"Before reading a word, people use position and spacing to understand a form.\n\n- **Close means related:** a label sits nearer its own field than any other field.\n- **Above, on phones:** put labels right above their fields on phones and short forms.\n- **One column:** fields in a single column give one clear path down the form.\n- **Groups with a heading:** related fields sit together under a short heading, like \"Delivery\" or \"Payment\".","ar":"قبل قراءة أي كلمة، يستخدم الناس المكان والمسافات لفهم النموذج.\n\n- **القريب مترابط:** العنوان أقرب إلى حقله من أي حقل آخر.\n- **فوق، على الهاتف:** ضع العناوين فوق حقولها مباشرة على الهواتف وفي النماذج القصيرة.\n- **عمود واحد:** الحقول في عمود واحد تعطي ترتيبًا واحدًا واضحًا من الأعلى إلى الأسفل.\n- **مجموعات بعنوان رئيسي:** ضع الحقول المترابطة معًا تحت عنوان رئيسي قصير، مثل «التوصيل» أو «الدفع»."}},{"id":"S04","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P01-U03-04","part":"guided","rules":["R06","R15"],"value":{"en":"Form usability (NN/g): put labels immediately above the field for mobile and shorter forms. Beside the field on a narrow phone, long labels squeeze the box or wrap awkwardly.","ar":"سهولة استخدام النماذج (NN/g): ضع العناوين فوق الحقل مباشرة على الهاتف وفي النماذج القصيرة. وبجانب الحقل على هاتف ضيّق، تضغط العناوين الطويلة المربع أو تنكسر بشكل غريب."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/web-form-design/","quote":"immediately above the field for mobile and shorter desktop forms"},"scenario":{"en":"Our checkout was copied from the laptop design: each label sits to the left of its box. On a 320 px phone, the labels and boxes share one narrow line.","ar":"صفحة الدفع عندنا منسوخة من تصميم الـ Laptop: كل عنوان بجانب مربعه. وعلى هاتف بعرض 320 px، يتقاسم العنوان والمربع سطرًا واحدًا ضيقًا."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each layout on the small phone. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل تخطيط على الهاتف الصغير. أيّ تخطيط يُظهر ما يكتبه الناس كاملًا ويُبقي العنوان ظاهرًا؟"},"start":"beside","options":[{"id":"beside","text":{"en":"Labels beside the boxes, as on the laptop","ar":"العناوين بجانب المربعات، كما على الـ Laptop"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"frame":"small","appbar":{"title":{"en":"Checkout","ar":"الدفع"},"back":true},"width":280,"caption":"320 px","blocks":[{"kind":"row","blocks":[{"kind":"small","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Building and street","ar":"العمارة والشارع"}},{"kind":"field","text":""}]},{"kind":"row","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"small","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Nearest landmark","ar":"أقرب علامة مميّزة"}},{"kind":"field","text":""}]}]}},{"id":"above","text":{"en":"Each label right above its box","ar":"كل عنوان فوق مربعه مباشرة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"frame":"small","appbar":{"title":{"en":"Checkout","ar":"الدفع"},"back":true},"width":280,"caption":"320 px","blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Building and street","ar":"العمارة والشارع"},"text":""},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Nearest landmark","ar":"أقرب علامة مميّزة"},"text":"","gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"inside","text":{"en":"Labels inside the boxes, to save room","ar":"العناوين داخل المربعات، لتوفير المساحة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"frame":"small","appbar":{"title":{"en":"Checkout","ar":"الدفع"},"back":true},"width":280,"caption":"320 px","blocks":[{"kind":"field","text":{"en":"Building and street","ar":"العمارة والشارع"}},{"kind":"field","text":{"en":"Nearest landmark","ar":"أقرب علامة مميّزة"},"gap":"s"}]}}],"answer":["above"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-039","when":["beside"],"feedback":{"en":"Half the width goes to the label, so the box is too narrow to show what people type, and long labels wrap into the next row. On phones, stack them.","ar":"نصف العرض يذهب للعنوان، فيصبح المربع أضيق من أن يعرض ما يُكتب، وتنكسر العناوين الطويلة إلى السطر التالي. على الهاتف، ضع العنوان فوق المربع."}},{"id":"MC-P01-034","when":["inside"],"feedback":{"en":"It saves room, but the label disappears the moment someone types. You saw this in the last lesson: labels belong outside.","ar":"يوفّر مساحة، لكن العنوان يختفي لحظة الكتابة. رأيت هذا في الدرس الماضي: العناوين مكانها بالخارج."}}],"hints":[{"en":"How wide is the box people type into in each version?","ar":"ما عرض المربع الذي يكتب فيه الناس في كل نسخة؟"},{"en":"Which version gives the box the full width and keeps the label visible?","ar":"أي نسخة تعطي المربع العرض الكامل وتُبقي العنوان ظاهرًا؟"}],"correct":{"en":"On a phone, the label goes right above its field.","ar":"على الهاتف، يوضع العنوان فوق حقله مباشرة."},"explain":{"en":"Above the field, a label can be as long as it needs and the box gets the full width. People read straight down: label, box, label, box.","ar":"فوق الحقل، يمكن أن يكون العنوان بالطول الذي يحتاجه، ويأخذ المربع العرض الكامل. ويقرأ الناس إلى الأسفل مباشرة: عنوان، مربع، عنوان، مربع."},"speaker":"youssef"},{"id":"S05","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P01-U03-05","part":"guided","rules":["R06","R15"],"value":{"en":"Form usability (NN/g): present fields in a single column; multiple columns interrupt the vertical momentum of moving down the form, and people skip or misorder fields.","ar":"سهولة استخدام النماذج (NN/g): اعرض الحقول في عمود واحد؛ فالأعمدة المتعدّدة تقطع الحركة المستمرة إلى أسفل النموذج، فيتخطّى الناس حقولًا أو يملؤونها بترتيب خاطئ."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/web-form-design/","quote":"Multiple columns interrupt the vertical momentum of moving down the form."},"scenario":{"en":"On tablets, my team put the sign-up fields in two columns to make the form look shorter. Several customers left the right-hand fields empty.","ar":"على الأجهزة اللوحية، وضع فريقي حقول التسجيل في عمودين ليبدو النموذج أقصر. وترك عدد من العملاء حقول العمود الثاني فارغة."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each layout. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل تخطيط. أيّها يجب أن يُطلق؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"frame":"tablet","appbar":{"title":{"en":"Create account","ar":"إنشاء حساب"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"width":340,"blocks":[{"kind":"row","blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Full name","ar":"الاسم الكامل"},"text":""},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Mobile number","ar":"رقم الموبايل"},"text":""}]},{"kind":"row","gap":"m","blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Email","ar":"البريد الإلكتروني"},"text":""},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"City","ar":"المدينة"},"text":""}]}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Create account","ar":"أنشئ الحساب"}}]},"options":[{"id":"keep","text":{"en":"Keep two columns; it looks shorter","ar":"أبقِ العمودين؛ فالنموذج يبدو أقصر"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"frame":"tablet","appbar":{"title":{"en":"Create account","ar":"إنشاء حساب"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"width":340,"blocks":[{"kind":"row","blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Full name","ar":"الاسم الكامل"},"text":""},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Mobile number","ar":"رقم الموبايل"},"text":""}]},{"kind":"row","gap":"m","blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Email","ar":"البريد الإلكتروني"},"text":""},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"City","ar":"المدينة"},"text":""}]}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Create account","ar":"أنشئ الحساب"}}]}},{"id":"number","text":{"en":"Keep two columns, and number the fields 1 to 4","ar":"أبقِ العمودين، ورقّم الحقول من 1 إلى 4"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"frame":"tablet","appbar":{"title":{"en":"Create account","ar":"إنشاء حساب"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"width":340,"blocks":[{"kind":"row","blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"1. Full name","ar":"1. الاسم الكامل"},"text":""},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"2. Mobile number","ar":"2. رقم الموبايل"},"text":""}]},{"kind":"row","gap":"m","blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"3. Email","ar":"3. البريد الإلكتروني"},"text":""},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"4. City","ar":"4. المدينة"},"text":""}]}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Create account","ar":"أنشئ الحساب"}}]}},{"id":"one","text":{"en":"One column, one field under the other","ar":"عمود واحد، حقل تحت الآخر"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"frame":"tablet","appbar":{"title":{"en":"Create account","ar":"إنشاء حساب"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"width":340,"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Full name","ar":"الاسم الكامل"},"text":""},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Mobile number","ar":"رقم الموبايل"},"text":"","gap":"m"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Email","ar":"البريد الإلكتروني"},"text":"","gap":"m"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"City","ar":"المدينة"},"text":"","gap":"m"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Create account","ar":"أنشئ الحساب"}}]}}],"answer":["one"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-040","when":["keep"],"feedback":{"en":"Looking shorter isn't the goal. With two columns, people go down the first one and miss the second, which is what happened. One column has one path.","ar":"أن يبدو أقصر ليس الهدف. مع عمودين، ينزل الناس في العمود الأول ويفوتهم الثاني، وهذا ما حدث. أما العمود الواحد فله ترتيب واحد."}},{"id":"MC-P01-040","when":["number"],"feedback":{"en":"Numbers make people zigzag on purpose: across, back, across. One column needs no numbers because the order is simply top to bottom.","ar":"الأرقام تجعل الناس يتنقّلون متعرّجين عمدًا: عبر السطر، ثم رجوعًا، ثم عبره مرة أخرى. والعمود الواحد لا يحتاج أرقامًا لأن الترتيب ببساطة من الأعلى إلى الأسفل."}}],"hints":[{"en":"In two columns, after Full name, which field comes next: the one beside it or the one below?","ar":"في العمودين، بعد «الاسم الكامل»، أي حقل يأتي: الذي بجانبه أم الذي تحته؟"},{"en":"Which layout has only one possible order?","ar":"أي تخطيط له ترتيب واحد ممكن فقط؟"}],"correct":{"en":"One column: one clear path, nothing skipped.","ar":"عمود واحد: ترتيب واحد واضح، ولا شيء يُتخطّى."},"explain":{"en":"A form is filled in order, so give it one order. In a single column, every field sits on the path down to the button.","ar":"النموذج يُملأ بالترتيب، فأعطه ترتيبًا واحدًا. في العمود الواحد، كل حقل يقع في الطريق إلى الزر."},"speaker":"youssef"},{"id":"S06","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P01-U03-05","part":"guided","rules":["R06","R15"],"value":{"en":"White space in forms (NN/g): grouping related fields together helps people make sense of what they must fill in, and a group heading can add context.","ar":"المسافات في النماذج (NN/g): جمع الحقول المترابطة معًا يساعد الناس على فهم ما عليهم ملؤه، وعنوان المجموعة يضيف سياقًا."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/form-design-white-space/","quote":"Grouping related fields together helps users make sense of the information that they must fill in."},"scenario":{"en":"Our checkout now has eight fields in one even list: three about the person receiving the order, three about the address, and two about payment.","ar":"صفحة الدفع عندنا فيها الآن ثمانية حقول في قائمة واحدة متساوية: ثلاثة عن مستلم الطلب، وثلاثة عن العنوان، واثنان عن الدفع."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each version. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل نسخة. أيّها يجب أن تُطلق؟"},"start":"list","options":[{"id":"list","text":{"en":"One even list of eight fields","ar":"قائمة واحدة متساوية من ثمانية حقول"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Checkout","ar":"الدفع"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Receiver's name","ar":"اسم المستلم"},"text":""},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Receiver's mobile","ar":"موبايل المستلم"},"text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Area","ar":"المنطقة"},"text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Street and building","ar":"الشارع والعمارة"},"text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Card number","ar":"رقم البطاقة"},"text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"+ 3 more fields","ar":"+ 3 حقول أخرى"},"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"groups","text":{"en":"Three groups, each under a short heading","ar":"ثلاث مجموعات، كل منها تحت عنوان رئيسي قصير"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Checkout","ar":"الدفع"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Who receives it","ar":"من يستلم الطلب"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Receiver's name","ar":"اسم المستلم"},"text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Receiver's mobile","ar":"موبايل المستلم"},"text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Where to deliver","ar":"عنوان التوصيل"},"gap":"l"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Area","ar":"المنطقة"},"text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Street and building","ar":"الشارع والعمارة"},"text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Payment","ar":"الدفع"},"gap":"l"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Card number","ar":"رقم البطاقة"},"text":"","gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"cards","text":{"en":"Each field in its own card with a shadow","ar":"كل حقل في بطاقة مستقلة بظل"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Checkout","ar":"الدفع"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"group","tone":"tint","blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Receiver's name","ar":"اسم المستلم"},"text":""}]},{"kind":"group","tone":"tint","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Receiver's mobile","ar":"موبايل المستلم"},"text":""}]},{"kind":"group","tone":"tint","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Area","ar":"المنطقة"},"text":""}]},{"kind":"group","tone":"tint","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Street and building","ar":"الشارع والعمارة"},"text":""}]},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"+ 4 more cards","ar":"+ 4 بطاقات أخرى"},"gap":"s"}]}}],"answer":["groups"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-041","when":["list"],"feedback":{"en":"Eight equal fields make one long wall. People can't see that the order has three parts, or how far along they are.","ar":"ثمانية حقول متساوية تبدو كتلة واحدة طويلة. ولا يرى الناس أن الطلب من ثلاثة أجزاء، ولا إلى أين وصلوا."}},{"id":"MC-P01-041","when":["cards"],"feedback":{"en":"A card around every field separates everything equally, so nothing looks related. Group the fields that belong together.","ar":"بطاقة حول كل حقل تفصل كل شيء بالتساوي، فلا يبدو أي شيء مترابطًا. اجمع الحقول التي تخصّ موضوعًا واحدًا."}}],"hints":[{"en":"The eight fields are really about three things. Which version shows that?","ar":"الحقول الثمانية في الحقيقة عن ثلاثة أشياء. أي نسخة تُظهر ذلك؟"},{"en":"Which version puts related fields close together and unrelated ones apart?","ar":"أي نسخة تقرّب الحقول المترابطة وتُبعد غير المترابطة؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Related fields together, under a short heading.","ar":"الحقول المترابطة معًا، تحت عنوان رئيسي قصير."},"explain":{"en":"Groups turn one long form into three short tasks. The headings tell people what each part is about, and the spacing shows where it ends.","ar":"المجموعات تحوّل نموذجًا طويلًا واحدًا إلى ثلاث مهام قصيرة. والعناوين الرئيسية تخبر الناس عمّا يخصّه كل جزء، والمسافات تُظهر أين ينتهي."},"speaker":"youssef"},{"id":"S07","type":"compare","skill":"SK-P01-U03-04","part":"contrast","confidence":true,"rules":["R11","R15"],"value":{"en":"Contrast with S02: here both versions use tight spacing, but B puts each label under its field, so it sits right on top of the next field. White space in forms (NN/g): items near each other appear related.","ar":"مقارنة مع الخطوة 2: هنا تستخدم النسختان مسافات ضيقة، لكن B تضع كل عنوان تحت حقله، فيقع مباشرة فوق الحقل التالي. المسافات في النماذج (NN/g): العناصر المتقاربة تبدو مترابطة."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/form-design-white-space/","quote":"items near each other appear related"},"scenario":{"en":"A designer suggested putting the label under each box, \"like a caption\". Both versions below use the same tight spacing.","ar":"اقترح أحد المصمّمين وضع العنوان تحت كل مربع، «مثل التعليق على صورة». والنسختان أدناه بالمسافات الضيقة نفسها."},"prompt":{"en":"Which version should ship?","ar":"أي نسخة يجب أن تُطلق؟"},"a":{"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Delivery address","ar":"عنوان التوصيل"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Area","ar":"المنطقة"},"text":""},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Street and building","ar":"الشارع والعمارة"},"text":"","gap":"l"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Floor and flat","ar":"الدور والشقة"},"text":"","gap":"l"}]}},"b":{"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Delivery address","ar":"عنوان التوصيل"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","text":""},{"kind":"small","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Area","ar":"المنطقة"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"field","text":"","gap":"l"},{"kind":"small","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Street and building","ar":"الشارع والعمارة"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"field","text":"","gap":"l"},{"kind":"small","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Floor and flat","ar":"الدور والشقة"},"gap":"xs"}]}},"answer":"a","reason":{"prompt":{"en":"Why does B confuse people?","ar":"لماذا تُربك B الناس؟"},"options":[{"id":"next","text":{"en":"Each label also sits right above the next box","ar":"كل عنوان يقع أيضًا فوق المربع التالي مباشرة"}},{"id":"font","text":{"en":"Its labels are in a smaller font","ar":"عناوينها بخط أصغر"}},{"id":"count","text":{"en":"It has more lines on the screen","ar":"فيها أسطر أكثر على الشاشة"}}],"answer":["next"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-038","when":["font","count"],"feedback":{"en":"Size and line count aren't the problem. People read a label, then look for the box under it, and in B that's the wrong box.","ar":"الحجم وعدد الأسطر ليسا المشكلة. يقرأ الناس العنوان، ثم يبحثون عن المربع تحته، وفي B هذا هو المربع الخطأ."}}]},"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-038","when":["b"],"feedback":{"en":"In B, \"Area\" sits under the first box and right on top of the second. People read down, so many will type the area into the second box.","ar":"في B، تقع «المنطقة» تحت المربع الأول ومباشرة فوق الثاني. والناس يقرؤون إلى الأسفل، فسيكتب كثيرون المنطقة في المربع الثاني."}}],"hints":[{"en":"In B, which box is right under the word \"Area\"?","ar":"في B، أي مربع يقع مباشرة تحت كلمة «المنطقة»؟"},{"en":"When people read a label, where do they expect its box?","ar":"حين يقرأ الناس عنوانًا، أين يتوقّعون مربعه؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Label above its box, so nothing sits between them.","ar":"العنوان فوق مربعه، فلا يفصل بينهما شيء."},"explain":{"en":"Tight spacing isn't enough on its own. The label has to be on the side people read first, above, so the box they meet next is the right one.","ar":"المسافة الضيقة وحدها لا تكفي. يجب أن يكون العنوان في الجهة التي يقرؤها الناس أولًا، أي فوق، ليكون المربع الذي يصلون إليه بعده هو الصحيح."},"speaker":"youssef"},{"id":"S08","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P01-U03-05","part":"independent","speaker":"hana","rules":["R14","R19"],"value":{"en":"New case. Form usability (NN/g): visually group related labels and fields, in a single column. The gym form mixes the member's details with the emergency contact's, side by side.","ar":"حالة جديدة. سهولة استخدام النماذج (NN/g): اجمع العناوين والحقول المترابطة بصريًا، في عمود واحد. ونموذج النادي يخلط بيانات العضو ببيانات جهة الطوارئ، جنبًا إلى جنب."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/web-form-design/","quote":"Visually group related labels and fields."},"scenario":{"en":"My gym's membership form shows the member's details in one column and an emergency contact in the column beside it. Several new members wrote their own mobile number as the emergency number.","ar":"نموذج الاشتراك في ناديّ يعرض بيانات العضو في عمود، وبيانات شخص للطوارئ في العمود المجاور. وكتب عدد من الأعضاء الجدد رقمهم هم كرقم للطوارئ."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each layout. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل تخطيط. أيّها يجب أن يُطلق؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Membership","ar":"العضوية"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"width":340,"blocks":[{"kind":"row","blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Your name","ar":"اسمك"},"text":""},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Contact name","ar":"اسم شخص للطوارئ"},"text":""}]},{"kind":"row","gap":"m","blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Your mobile","ar":"رقم موبايلك"},"text":""},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Contact mobile","ar":"رقم شخص للطوارئ"},"text":""}]}]},"options":[{"id":"stack","text":{"en":"One column: your details, then \"In an emergency, call\"","ar":"عمود واحد: بياناتك، ثم «في حالة الطوارئ، اتصل بـ»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Membership","ar":"العضوية"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"width":340,"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Your details","ar":"بياناتك"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Your name","ar":"اسمك"},"text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Your mobile","ar":"رقم موبايلك"},"text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"In an emergency, call","ar":"في حالة الطوارئ، اتصل بـ"},"gap":"l"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Their name","ar":"اسمه"},"text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Their mobile","ar":"رقم موبايله"},"text":"","gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"color","text":{"en":"Keep both columns; tint the emergency column","ar":"أبقِ العمودين؛ ولوّن عمود الطوارئ"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Membership","ar":"العضوية"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"width":340,"blocks":[{"kind":"row","blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Your name","ar":"اسمك"},"text":""},{"kind":"group","tone":"tint","blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Contact name","ar":"اسم شخص للطوارئ"},"text":""}]}]},{"kind":"row","gap":"m","blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Your mobile","ar":"رقم موبايلك"},"text":""},{"kind":"group","tone":"tint","blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Contact mobile","ar":"رقم شخص للطوارئ"},"text":""}]}]}]}},{"id":"keep","text":{"en":"Keep it; the labels say whose details they are","ar":"أبقِ النموذج كما هو؛ فالعناوين توضّح لمن كل بيانات"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Membership","ar":"العضوية"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"width":340,"blocks":[{"kind":"row","blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Your name","ar":"اسمك"},"text":""},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Contact name","ar":"اسم شخص للطوارئ"},"text":""}]},{"kind":"row","gap":"m","blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Your mobile","ar":"رقم موبايلك"},"text":""},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Contact mobile","ar":"رقم شخص للطوارئ"},"text":""}]}]}}],"answer":["stack"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-040","when":["keep","color"],"feedback":{"en":"Side by side, \"Your mobile\" and \"Contact mobile\" look like a pair, and people fill the row from left to right. One column with a heading per person keeps the two sets apart.","ar":"حين يكونان جنبًا إلى جنب، يبدو «رقم موبايلك» و«رقم شخص للطوارئ» كزوج، ويملأ الناس السطر من جهة إلى أخرى. وعمود واحد بعنوان رئيسي لكل شخص يفصل المجموعتين."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Which fields belong to the member, and which to someone else?","ar":"أي الحقول تخصّ العضو، وأيها تخصّ شخصًا آخر؟"},{"en":"Which layout puts each person's fields together, one after the other?","ar":"أي تخطيط يجمع حقول كل شخص معًا، واحدًا بعد الآخر؟"}],"correct":{"en":"One column, one group per person.","ar":"عمود واحد، ومجموعة لكل شخص."},"explain":{"en":"Two people's details are two groups. Stacking them, each under its own heading, makes the switch from \"you\" to \"them\" impossible to miss.","ar":"بيانات شخصين هي مجموعتان. ووضع إحداهما تحت الأخرى، كلٌّ تحت عنوانها الرئيسي، يجعل الانتقال من «أنت» إلى «هو» واضحًا لا يُفوَّت."}},{"id":"S09","type":"card","part":"recap","icons":["space","phone","list","group"],"title":{"en":"What you did","ar":"ماذا تعلّمت"},"body":{"en":"- **Close means related:** moved each label next to its own field, with a bigger gap before the next.\n- **Above on phones:** stacked labels over fields on a small screen.\n- **Label first:** kept labels above, never below, their boxes.\n- **One column:** replaced two columns that made people skip fields.\n- **Groups:** split a long checkout, and a gym form, into groups with headings.\n\nNext lesson: say the rules before people type.","ar":"- **القريب مترابط:** نقلت كل عنوان بجوار حقله، مع مسافة أكبر قبل الحقل التالي.\n- **فوق على الهاتف:** وضعت العناوين فوق الحقول على الشاشة الصغيرة.\n- **العنوان أولًا:** أبقيت العناوين فوق مربعاتها، لا تحتها أبدًا.\n- **عمود واحد:** استبدلت عمودين جعلا الناس يتخطّون حقولًا.\n- **المجموعات:** قسّمت صفحة دفع طويلة، ونموذج نادٍ، إلى مجموعات بعناوين رئيسية.\n\nالدرس التالي: اذكر القواعد قبل أن يكتب الناس."}}]}$uxg$::jsonb),
  ($uxg$P01-U03-L03$uxg$, $uxg$8bedcfc6378f1766d4a99b39e43d2c421d7a5265e608829c5650716651faadad$uxg$, $uxg${"id":"P01-U03-L03","mode":"lesson","minutes":8,"title":{"en":"Say the rules before people type","ar":"اذكر القواعد قبل أن يكتب الناس"},"summary":{"en":"Show password rules and hints before people type, not after they fail.","ar":"اعرض شروط كلمة المرور والتلميحات قبل أن يكتب الناس، لا بعد أن يفشلوا."},"speaker":"youssef","review_labels":{"MC-P01-042":{"en":"Rules go before typing, not in the error","ar":"القواعد تأتي قبل الكتابة، لا في رسالة الخطأ"},"MC-P01-043":{"en":"A rule must be exact, not general","ar":"القاعدة يجب أن تكون دقيقة، لا عامة"},"MC-P01-037":{"en":"Needed info can't hide in a tooltip","ar":"المعلومة الضرورية لا تُخفى في Tooltip"}},"steps":[{"id":"S01","type":"card","part":"hook","title":{"en":"Nada's password","ar":"كلمة مرور ندى"},"body":{"en":"Nada is setting a password in my shop's app. The form gives no rules. Each time she taps Create account, she gets \"Password doesn't meet the requirements\".\n\nShe tried three passwords, then left.","ar":"تضع ندى كلمة مرور في تطبيق متجري. والنموذج لا يذكر أي قواعد. وكل مرة تضغط «أنشئ الحساب»، تظهر لها «كلمة المرور لا تستوفي الشروط».\n\nجرّبت ثلاث كلمات مرور، ثم غادرت."},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Create account","ar":"إنشاء حساب"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Password","ar":"كلمة المرور"},"filled":true,"text":"••••••","tone":"bad","error":{"en":"Password doesn't meet the requirements.","ar":"كلمة المرور لا تستوفي الشروط."}}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Create account","ar":"أنشئ الحساب"}}]}},{"id":"S02","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P01-U03-06","part":"try","rules":["R12"],"value":{"en":"Try first. Form usability (NN/g): don't make people guess password requirements. Rules that appear only after a failed try turn the form into a guessing game.","ar":"جرّب أولًا. سهولة استخدام النماذج (NN/g): لا تجعل الناس يخمّنون شروط كلمة المرور. والقواعد التي تظهر فقط بعد محاولة فاشلة تحوّل النموذج إلى لعبة تخمين."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/web-form-design/","quote":"Don’t make users guess your obscure password requirements."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each version. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل نسخة. أيّها يجب أن تُطلق؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Create account","ar":"إنشاء حساب"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Password","ar":"كلمة المرور"},"filled":true,"text":"••••••","tone":"bad","error":{"en":"Password doesn't meet the requirements.","ar":"كلمة المرور لا تستوفي الشروط."}}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Create account","ar":"أنشئ الحساب"}}]},"options":[{"id":"loud","text":{"en":"Keep it, but make the error bigger and bolder","ar":"أبقِ النموذج، لكن اجعل رسالة الخطأ أكبر وأوضح"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Create account","ar":"إنشاء حساب"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Password","ar":"كلمة المرور"},"filled":true,"text":"••••••","tone":"bad"},{"kind":"banner","tone":"bad","text":{"en":"PASSWORD DOESN'T MEET THE REQUIREMENTS!","ar":"كلمة المرور لا تستوفي الشروط!"},"gap":"s"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Create account","ar":"أنشئ الحساب"}}]}},{"id":"tip","text":{"en":"Add an ⓘ next to the label that shows the rules","ar":"أضف ⓘ بجانب العنوان تعرض القواعد"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Create account","ar":"إنشاء حساب"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Password ⓘ","ar":"كلمة المرور ⓘ"},"text":""}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Create account","ar":"أنشئ الحساب"}}]}},{"id":"rules","text":{"en":"Show the rules under the label, before she types","ar":"اعرض القواعد تحت العنوان، قبل أن تكتب"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Create account","ar":"إنشاء حساب"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Password","ar":"كلمة المرور"},"hintFirst":true,"hint":{"en":"At least 8 characters, including one number","ar":"8 أحرف على الأقل، منها رقم واحد"},"text":""}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Create account","ar":"أنشئ الحساب"}}]}}],"answer":["rules"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-042","when":["loud"],"feedback":{"en":"A louder error still comes after the mistake, and it still doesn't say what the rules are. Nada needs them before she types.","ar":"رسالة الخطأ الأبرز ما زالت تأتي بعد الخطأ، وما زالت لا تذكر القواعد. وندى تحتاجها قبل أن تكتب."}},{"id":"MC-P01-037","when":["tip"],"feedback":{"en":"The rules exist now, but only for people who find and open the ⓘ, and on a phone there's no hover. Anyone who must follow a rule needs to see it.","ar":"صارت القواعد موجودة، لكن فقط لمن يجد ⓘ ويفتحها، والهاتف ليس فيه تمرير للماوس. ومن يجب أن يتبع قاعدة يحتاج أن يراها."}}],"hints":[{"en":"When does Nada find out what the rules are in each version?","ar":"متى تعرف ندى القواعد في كل نسخة؟"},{"en":"Which version lets her get it right on the first try?","ar":"أي نسخة تتيح لها أن تنجح من المحاولة الأولى؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Visible rules, before typing.","ar":"قواعد ظاهرة، قبل الكتابة."},"explain":{"en":"If a field has rules, they're part of the question. Showing them up front turns three failed tries into one right one.","ar":"إذا كان للحقل قواعد، فهي جزء من السؤال. وعرضها من البداية يحوّل ثلاث محاولات فاشلة إلى محاولة واحدة صحيحة."}},{"id":"S03","type":"card","part":"concept","icons":["list","eye","target","warn"],"title":{"en":"Rules are part of the question","ar":"القواعد جزء من السؤال"},"body":{"en":"When a field only accepts some answers, tell people which ones before they start.\n\n- **Before typing:** show the rule with the field, not only in an error afterwards.\n- **Exact:** \"At least 8 characters, including one number\", not \"Use a strong password\".\n- **Still visible while typing:** outside the field, so it stays there.\n- **Not behind an icon:** a rule people must follow belongs on the screen. A tooltip can hold nice-to-know extras.","ar":"حين يقبل الحقل إجابات معيّنة فقط، أخبر الناس بها قبل أن يبدؤوا.\n\n- **قبل الكتابة:** اعرض القاعدة مع الحقل، لا في رسالة خطأ بعدها فقط.\n- **دقيقة:** «8 أحرف على الأقل، منها رقم واحد»، لا «استخدم كلمة مرور قوية».\n- **ظاهرة أثناء الكتابة:** خارج الحقل، حتى تبقى.\n- **ليست خلف أيقونة:** القاعدة التي يجب أن يتبعها الناس مكانها على الشاشة. والـ Tooltip للمعلومات الإضافية غير الضرورية."}},{"id":"S04","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P01-U03-06","part":"guided","rules":["R06","R15"],"value":{"en":"Form usability (NN/g): if a field requires a specific format or type of input, state the exact instructions. A photo upload that rejects large files must say the limit first.","ar":"سهولة استخدام النماذج (NN/g): إذا كان الحقل يتطلّب صيغة أو نوعًا محدّدًا من الإدخال، فاذكر التعليمات بدقة. ورفع الصور الذي يرفض الملفات الكبيرة يجب أن يذكر الحدّ أولًا."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/web-form-design/","quote":"If a field requires a specific format or type of input, state the exact instructions."},"scenario":{"en":"To return a broken item, customers upload a photo. Our system takes JPG or PNG up to 5 MB. Phone photos are often bigger, and people only learn this after waiting for the upload to fail.","ar":"لإرجاع منتج مكسور، يرفع العملاء صورة. ونظامنا يقبل JPG أو PNG حتى 5 MB. وصور الهواتف غالبًا أكبر، ولا يعرف الناس ذلك إلا بعد انتظار فشل الرفع."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each version. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل نسخة. أيّها يجب أن تُطلق؟"},"start":"before","options":[{"id":"before","text":{"en":"Under the label: \"JPG or PNG, up to 5 MB\"","ar":"تحت العنوان: «JPG أو PNG، حتى 5 MB»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Return an item","ar":"إرجاع منتج"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Photo of the damage","ar":"صورة للتلف"}},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"JPG or PNG, up to 5 MB","ar":"JPG أو PNG، حتى 5 MB"},"gap":"xs"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","emphasis":"low","text":{"en":"Choose a photo","ar":"اختر صورة"}}]}},{"id":"after","text":{"en":"Keep it; the error explains the limit","ar":"أبقِ الصفحة كما هي؛ فرسالة الخطأ تشرح الحدّ"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Return an item","ar":"إرجاع منتج"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Photo of the damage","ar":"صورة للتلف"}},{"kind":"button","emphasis":"low","text":{"en":"Choose a photo","ar":"اختر صورة"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"banner","tone":"bad","text":{"en":"Upload failed: file too large (max 5 MB).","ar":"فشل الرفع: الملف كبير جدًا (الحدّ 5 MB)."},"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"vague","text":{"en":"Under the label: \"Please upload a suitable photo\"","ar":"تحت العنوان: «يُرجى رفع صورة مناسبة»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Return an item","ar":"إرجاع منتج"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Photo of the damage","ar":"صورة للتلف"}},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Please upload a suitable photo","ar":"يُرجى رفع صورة مناسبة"},"gap":"xs"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","emphasis":"low","text":{"en":"Choose a photo","ar":"اختر صورة"}}]}}],"answer":["before"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-042","when":["after"],"feedback":{"en":"The error is clear, but it arrives after a long wait for an upload that was never going to work. Say the limit before they pick a photo.","ar":"رسالة الخطأ واضحة، لكنها تصل بعد انتظار طويل لرفع لم يكن لينجح أبدًا. اذكر الحدّ قبل أن يختاروا صورة."}},{"id":"MC-P01-043","when":["vague"],"feedback":{"en":"\"Suitable\" doesn't tell anyone the type or the size. Only the exact rule lets them choose the right file.","ar":"«مناسبة» لا تخبر أحدًا بالنوع أو الحجم. والقاعدة الدقيقة وحدها تتيح لهم اختيار الملف الصحيح."}}],"hints":[{"en":"What two facts decide whether a photo will upload?","ar":"ما المعلومتان اللتان تحدّدان هل ستُرفع الصورة؟"},{"en":"Which version gives both facts before the person picks a photo?","ar":"أي نسخة تعطي المعلومتين قبل أن يختار الشخص صورة؟"}],"correct":{"en":"The exact type and size, before choosing.","ar":"النوع والحجم بدقة، قبل الاختيار."},"explain":{"en":"A rule is useful only if it comes in time and says exactly what's accepted. Then people can pick, or shrink, the right photo at once.","ar":"القاعدة مفيدة فقط إذا جاءت في وقتها وذكرت بالضبط ما يُقبل. حينها يستطيع الناس اختيار الصورة المناسبة، أو تصغيرها، من البداية."},"speaker":"youssef"},{"id":"S05","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P01-U03-03","part":"guided","rules":["R06","R15"],"value":{"en":"Tooltips (NN/g): people shouldn't need to find a tooltip to complete their task. Customers can't receive a refund without finding their IBAN, so that help must be on the screen.","ar":"الـ Tooltip (NN/g): يجب ألا يحتاج الناس إلى إيجاد Tooltip لإكمال مهمتهم. ولا يستطيع العملاء استلام المبلغ المسترد دون إيجاد رقم الـ IBAN، فالمساعدة يجب أن تكون على الشاشة."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/tooltip-guidelines/","quote":"Users shouldn’t need to find a tooltip in order to complete their task."},"scenario":{"en":"Refunds go to the customer's bank account. The field asks for an IBAN, which starts with EG and has 29 characters; most people find it in their bank app. That help only appears when you hover over the ⓘ.","ar":"يُحوَّل المبلغ المسترد إلى حساب العميل في البنك. والحقل يطلب رقم الـ IBAN، الذي يبدأ بـ EG ويتكوّن من 29 حرفًا ورقمًا؛ ويجده أغلب الناس في تطبيق البنك. وهذه المساعدة تظهر فقط عند تمرير الماوس فوق ⓘ."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each version. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل نسخة. أيّها يجب أن تُطلق؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Refund","ar":"استرداد المبلغ"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"IBAN ⓘ","ar":"رقم الـ IBAN ⓘ"},"text":""}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Send my refund","ar":"أرسل المبلغ المسترد"}}]},"options":[{"id":"keep","text":{"en":"Keep the ⓘ; most people know what an IBAN is","ar":"أبقِ ⓘ؛ فأغلب الناس يعرفون ما الـ IBAN"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Refund","ar":"استرداد المبلغ"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"IBAN ⓘ","ar":"رقم الـ IBAN ⓘ"},"text":""}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Send my refund","ar":"أرسل المبلغ المسترد"}}]}},{"id":"hint","text":{"en":"Show the help under the label","ar":"اعرض المساعدة تحت العنوان"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Refund","ar":"استرداد المبلغ"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"IBAN","ar":"رقم الـ IBAN"},"hintFirst":true,"hint":{"en":"Starts with EG, 29 characters. You'll find it in your bank app.","ar":"يبدأ بـ EG، و29 حرفًا ورقمًا. ستجده في تطبيق البنك."},"text":""}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Send my refund","ar":"أرسل المبلغ المسترد"}}]}},{"id":"link","text":{"en":"Add a link: \"What's an IBAN?\" to our help page","ar":"أضف رابطًا: «ما هو الـ IBAN؟» إلى صفحة المساعدة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Refund","ar":"استرداد المبلغ"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"IBAN","ar":"رقم الـ IBAN"},"text":""},{"kind":"link","text":{"en":"What's an IBAN?","ar":"ما هو الـ IBAN؟"},"gap":"xs"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Send my refund","ar":"أرسل المبلغ المسترد"}}]}}],"answer":["hint"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-037","when":["keep"],"feedback":{"en":"If people can't find their IBAN, they can't get their money. Help that the task depends on can't wait behind a hover that phones don't have.","ar":"إذا لم يجد الناس رقم الـ IBAN، فلن يستلموا أموالهم. والمساعدة التي تعتمد عليها المهمة لا يصح أن تختبئ خلف تمرير الماوس، وهو غير موجود في الهواتف."}},{"id":"MC-P01-037","when":["link"],"feedback":{"en":"A link sends them away from the form to read a page. The two facts they need fit in one line right here.","ar":"الرابط يُخرجهم من النموذج لقراءة صفحة. والمعلومتان اللتان يحتاجونهما تتّسعان في سطر واحد هنا."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Can someone get a refund without knowing where to find their IBAN?","ar":"هل يستطيع أحد استلام المبلغ دون أن يعرف أين يجد رقم الـ IBAN؟"},{"en":"Which version gives that help without a hover or leaving the form?","ar":"أي نسخة تعطي هذه المساعدة دون تمرير ماوس أو مغادرة النموذج؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Help the task needs is on the screen.","ar":"المساعدة التي تحتاجها المهمة على الشاشة."},"explain":{"en":"Ask: could someone finish without this? If not, show it next to the field, in a line short enough to read while typing.","ar":"اسأل: هل يستطيع أحد الإنهاء بدون هذه المعلومة؟ إذا كان الجواب لا، فاعرضها بجانب الحقل، في سطر قصير يُقرأ أثناء الكتابة."},"speaker":"youssef"},{"id":"S06","type":"words","skill":"SK-P01-U03-06","part":"guided","confidence":true,"rules":["R06","R15"],"value":{"en":"Form usability (NN/g): state the exact instructions. Only a rule with real numbers and limits lets people choose a username that works the first time.","ar":"سهولة استخدام النماذج (NN/g): اذكر التعليمات بدقة. والقاعدة التي فيها أرقام وحدود حقيقية هي وحدها التي تتيح للناس اختيار اسم مستخدم يعمل من المرة الأولى."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/web-form-design/","quote":"If a field requires a specific format or type of input, state the exact instructions."},"scenario":{"en":"Customers also pick a username for reviews. Our system accepts 4 to 15 letters or numbers, with no spaces.","ar":"يختار العملاء أيضًا اسم مستخدم للتقييمات. ونظامنا يقبل من 4 إلى 15 حرفًا أو رقمًا، بلا مسافات."},"prompt":{"en":"Which line should sit under the \"Username\" label?","ar":"أي سطر يجب أن يوضع تحت عنوان «اسم المستخدم»؟"},"options":[{"id":"valid","text":{"en":"\"Choose a valid username.\"","ar":"«اختر اسم مستخدم صالحًا.»"}},{"id":"rules","text":{"en":"\"Username must follow our rules.\"","ar":"«يجب أن يتبع اسم المستخدم قواعدنا.»"}},{"id":"exact","text":{"en":"\"4 to 15 letters or numbers, no spaces.\"","ar":"«من 4 إلى 15 حرفًا أو رقمًا، بلا مسافات.»"}}],"answer":["exact"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-043","when":["valid","rules"],"feedback":{"en":"This tells people a rule exists without saying what it is. They'd still have to guess, and fail, to find out.","ar":"هذا يخبر الناس أن هناك قاعدة دون أن يقول ما هي. وسيظلّون يخمّنون، ويفشلون، ليعرفوها."}}],"hints":[{"en":"After reading the line, could someone type a username that's sure to work?","ar":"بعد قراءة السطر، هل يستطيع أحد كتابة اسم مستخدم يعمل بالتأكيد؟"},{"en":"Which line names the length and the allowed characters?","ar":"أي سطر يذكر الطول والحروف المسموح بها؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Exact: length, characters and the one thing not allowed.","ar":"صحيح. سطر دقيق: يذكر الطول، والحروف المسموحة، والشيء الوحيد الممنوع."},"explain":{"en":"A useful rule can be checked against what you type. \"Valid\" and \"our rules\" can't; numbers and a clear limit can.","ar":"القاعدة المفيدة يمكن مقارنتها بما تكتبه. «صالح» و«قواعدنا» لا يمكن مقارنتهما؛ أما الأرقام والحدّ الواضح فيمكن."},"speaker":"youssef"},{"id":"S07","type":"compare","skill":"SK-P01-U03-03","part":"contrast","rules":["R11","R15"],"value":{"en":"Contrast with S05: tooltips aren't banned. Tooltips (NN/g): they shouldn't be essential for the task. A nice-to-know reason can sit in a tooltip; a rule people must follow can't.","ar":"مقارنة مع الخطوة 5: الـ Tooltip ليس ممنوعًا. الـ Tooltip (NN/g): يجب ألا يكون ضروريًا لإنجاز المهمة. والسبب الذي «من الجيد معرفته» يمكن أن يوضع في Tooltip؛ أما القاعدة التي يجب اتّباعها فلا."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/tooltip-guidelines/","quote":"tooltips shouldn’t be essential for the tasks users need to accomplish on your site."},"scenario":{"en":"Two screens in my app each use an ⓘ. Screen A explains why we ask for a birthday (an optional field): \"We send you a small gift.\" Screen B hides the delivery phone format: \"11 digits, starting with 01.\"","ar":"شاشتان في تطبيقي تستخدم كل منهما ⓘ. الشاشة A تشرح لماذا نسأل عن تاريخ الميلاد (حقل اختياري): «نرسل لك هدية صغيرة». والشاشة B تُخفي صيغة هاتف التوصيل: «11 رقمًا، يبدأ بـ 01»."},"prompt":{"en":"Which screen uses its ⓘ in an acceptable way?","ar":"أي شاشة تستخدم ⓘ بطريقة مقبولة؟"},"a":{"label":{"en":"Birthday, optional","ar":"تاريخ الميلاد، اختياري"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Your profile","ar":"ملفك"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Birthday (optional) ⓘ","ar":"تاريخ الميلاد (اختياري) ⓘ"},"text":""}]}},"b":{"label":{"en":"Delivery phone","ar":"هاتف التوصيل"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Your profile","ar":"ملفك"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Phone for the driver ⓘ","ar":"رقم هاتف للسائق ⓘ"},"text":""}]}},"answer":"a","reason":{"prompt":{"en":"What makes A's tooltip acceptable?","ar":"ما الذي يجعل Tooltip الشاشة A مقبولًا؟"},"options":[{"id":"short","text":{"en":"Its text is shorter","ar":"نصه أقصر"}},{"id":"extra","text":{"en":"Nobody needs it to fill in the form correctly","ar":"لا أحد يحتاجه ليملأ النموذج صحيحًا"}},{"id":"optional","text":{"en":"Optional fields can never have rules","ar":"الحقول الاختيارية لا يمكن أن تكون لها قواعد"}}],"answer":["extra"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-037","when":["short","optional"],"feedback":{"en":"Length isn't the test. Ask whether anyone could fail the task without reading it. The gift reason: no. The phone format: yes.","ar":"الطول ليس المعيار. اسأل هل يمكن أن يفشل أحد في المهمة دون قراءته. سبب الهدية: لا. وصيغة الهاتف: نعم."}}]},"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-037","when":["b"],"feedback":{"en":"B hides a rule people must follow for the driver to reach them, and on phones they can't hover to see it. That one has to be on the screen.","ar":"B تُخفي قاعدة يجب أن يتبعها الناس ليتّصل بهم السائق، وعلى الهواتف لا يمكنهم تمرير الماوس لرؤيتها. وهذه يجب أن تكون على الشاشة."}}],"hints":[{"en":"If someone never opens the ⓘ, which screen can they still fill in correctly?","ar":"إذا لم يفتح أحد ⓘ أبدًا، فأي شاشة ما زال يستطيع ملأها صحيحًا؟"},{"en":"Which tooltip holds a rule, and which holds a nice-to-know reason?","ar":"أي Tooltip يحمل قاعدة، وأيّهما يحمل سببًا إضافيًا غير ضروري؟"}],"correct":{"en":"A tooltip can hold extras, never what the task needs.","ar":"الـ Tooltip يمكن أن يحمل إضافات، ولا يحمل أبدًا ما تحتاجه المهمة."},"explain":{"en":"The test is simple: could someone fail without reading it? If yes, it belongs on the screen. If no, a tooltip is fine, for people with a mouse.","ar":"المعيار بسيط: هل يمكن أن يفشل أحد دون قراءته؟ إذا كانت الإجابة نعم، فمكانه على الشاشة. وإذا كانت لا، فالـ Tooltip مناسب، لمن لديه ماوس."},"speaker":"youssef"},{"id":"S08","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P01-U03-06","part":"independent","speaker":"karim","rules":["R14","R19"],"value":{"en":"New case. Form usability (NN/g): state the exact instructions for input a field accepts. A daily transfer limit is a rule on the amount field, so it belongs there before people type.","ar":"حالة جديدة. سهولة استخدام النماذج (NN/g): اذكر بدقة ما يقبله الحقل. وحدّ التحويل اليومي قاعدة لحقل المبلغ، فمكانها هناك قبل أن يكتب الناس."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/web-form-design/","quote":"If a field requires a specific format or type of input, state the exact instructions."},"scenario":{"en":"I'm building a bank app. People can send up to 10,000 EGP a day. Mostafa typed 15,000 to pay his rent, filled in the rest, and only then got \"Amount exceeds limit\".","ar":"أبني تطبيقًا لبنك. يستطيع الناس تحويل 10,000 جنيه يوميًا كحدّ أقصى. كتب مصطفى 15,000 ليدفع الإيجار، وملأ باقي الحقول، وعندها فقط ظهرت له «المبلغ يتجاوز الحدّ»."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each version. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل نسخة. أيّها يجب أن تُطلق؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rasid","name":{"en":"Rasid","ar":"رصيد"},"color":"#1C3D6E","icon":"bank","domain":"rasid.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Transfer","ar":"تحويل"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Amount (EGP)","ar":"المبلغ (جنيه)"},"filled":true,"text":"15,000"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"To","ar":"إلى"},"filled":true,"text":{"en":"Landlord","ar":"صاحب الشقة"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"banner","tone":"bad","text":{"en":"Amount exceeds limit.","ar":"المبلغ يتجاوز الحدّ."},"gap":"m"}]},"options":[{"id":"limit","text":{"en":"Show \"Up to 10,000 EGP a day\" under the amount label","ar":"اعرض «حتى 10,000 جنيه يوميًا» تحت عنوان المبلغ"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rasid","name":{"en":"Rasid","ar":"رصيد"},"color":"#1C3D6E","icon":"bank","domain":"rasid.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Transfer","ar":"تحويل"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Amount (EGP)","ar":"المبلغ (جنيه)"},"hintFirst":true,"hint":{"en":"Up to 10,000 EGP a day","ar":"حتى 10,000 جنيه يوميًا"},"text":""},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"To","ar":"إلى"},"text":"","gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"cap","text":{"en":"Quietly stop the field at 10,000","ar":"أوقف الحقل عند 10,000 دون أي رسالة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rasid","name":{"en":"Rasid","ar":"رصيد"},"color":"#1C3D6E","icon":"bank","domain":"rasid.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Transfer","ar":"تحويل"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Amount (EGP)","ar":"المبلغ (جنيه)"},"filled":true,"text":"10,000"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"To","ar":"إلى"},"filled":true,"text":{"en":"Landlord","ar":"صاحب الشقة"},"gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"keep","text":{"en":"Keep the message at the end","ar":"أبقِ الرسالة في النهاية"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rasid","name":{"en":"Rasid","ar":"رصيد"},"color":"#1C3D6E","icon":"bank","domain":"rasid.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Transfer","ar":"تحويل"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Amount (EGP)","ar":"المبلغ (جنيه)"},"filled":true,"text":"15,000"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"To","ar":"إلى"},"filled":true,"text":{"en":"Landlord","ar":"صاحب الشقة"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"banner","tone":"bad","text":{"en":"Amount exceeds limit.","ar":"المبلغ يتجاوز الحدّ."},"gap":"m"}]}}],"answer":["limit"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-042","when":["keep"],"feedback":{"en":"Mostafa only learns the rule after doing all the work, and \"exceeds limit\" doesn't even say what the limit is. Say it with the field.","ar":"لا يعرف مصطفى القاعدة إلا بعد إنجاز كل العمل، و«يتجاوز الحدّ» لا تذكر حتى قيمة الحدّ. اذكره مع الحقل."}},{"id":"MC-P01-042","when":["cap"],"feedback":{"en":"He typed 15,000 and the app silently sent 10,000. He may not notice, and his rent is short. A hidden rule is still a surprise; show it.","ar":"كتب 15,000 فحوّل التطبيق 10,000 دون أن يقول شيئًا. وقد لا يلاحظ، فيصبح الإيجار ناقصًا. والقاعدة المخفية تظل مفاجأة؛ فاعرضها."}}],"hints":[{"en":"When does Mostafa learn the limit in each version, if at all?","ar":"متى يعرف مصطفى الحدّ في كل نسخة، إن عرفه أصلًا؟"},{"en":"Which version lets him plan, say, two transfers, before he starts?","ar":"أي نسخة تتيح له أن يخطّط، مثلًا لتحويلين، قبل أن يبدأ؟"}],"correct":{"en":"The limit sits with the field, before he types.","ar":"الحدّ مكتوب مع الحقل، قبل أن يكتب."},"explain":{"en":"A limit is a rule about what the field accepts, so say it there, with the real number. Then people can plan around it instead of hitting it.","ar":"الحدّ قاعدة عمّا يقبله الحقل، فاذكره هناك، بالرقم الحقيقي. حينها يستطيع الناس التخطيط حوله بدل الاصطدام به."}},{"id":"S09","type":"card","part":"recap","icons":["list","eye","target","warn"],"title":{"en":"What you did","ar":"ماذا تعلّمت"},"body":{"en":"- **Rules first:** showed password rules before typing, not only in an error.\n- **Exact rules:** named the file type and size, and a username's length and characters.\n- **Help on the screen:** showed where to find an IBAN instead of hiding it.\n- **Tooltips for extras:** kept an ⓘ only for a nice-to-know reason.\n- **Limits up front:** put a bank's daily limit with the amount field.\n\nNext: the skill check for this unit.","ar":"- **القواعد أولًا:** عرضت قواعد كلمة المرور قبل الكتابة، لا في رسالة خطأ فقط.\n- **قواعد دقيقة:** ذكرت نوع الملف وحجمه، وطول اسم المستخدم وحروفه.\n- **المساعدة على الشاشة:** عرضت أين يوجد رقم الـ IBAN بدل إخفائه.\n- **الـ Tooltip للإضافات:** أبقيت ⓘ فقط لسبب إضافي غير ضروري.\n- **الحدود من البداية:** وضعت الحدّ اليومي للبنك مع حقل المبلغ.\n\nالتالي: اختبار المهارة لهذه الوحدة."}}]}$uxg$::jsonb),
  ($uxg$P01-U03-L04$uxg$, $uxg$6d7bd61807b613c5c5b7830249a22c820fa1a02ff6bb9844cc2c3b44b44d3932$uxg$, $uxg${"id":"P01-U03-L04","mode":"check","minutes":7,"title":{"en":"Skill check: keep labels and hints in sight","ar":"اختبار المهارة: أبقِ العناوين والتلميحات ظاهرة"},"summary":{"en":"Fix a clinic's old booking form so every label and hint stays in sight.","ar":"أصلح نموذج الحجز القديم في عيادة لتبقى كل العناوين والتلميحات ظاهرة."},"speaker":"nour","steps":[{"id":"S01","type":"card","part":"hook","title":{"en":"Samira's first visit","ar":"الزيارة الأولى لسميرة"},"body":{"en":"Samira is booking her first visit at my clinic on her phone. Our booking form came from an old template: grey words inside the boxes, a few ⓘ icons, and rules that only show up in errors.\n\nYour job: fix the form so she can fill it in right the first time.\n\nThis is a skill check: no hints, and you'll see how you did at the end.","ar":"تحجز سميرة زيارتها الأولى في عيادتي من هاتفها. ونموذج الحجز عندنا مأخوذ من قالب قديم: كلمات رمادية داخل المربعات، وبعض أيقونات ⓘ، وقواعد لا تظهر إلا في رسائل الخطأ.\n\nمهمّتك: أصلح النموذج لتملأه سميرة صحيحًا من المرة الأولى.\n\nهذا اختبار مهارة: بدون تلميحات، وسترى نتيجتك في النهاية."},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Book your first visit","ar":"احجز زيارتك الأولى"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","avatar":{"text":"Mona Adel","art":"doctor"},"text":{"en":"Dr. Mona Adel","ar":"د. منى عادل"},"sub":{"en":"Family doctor · Mon 9:30 am","ar":"طبيبة أسرة · الإثنين 9:30 صباحًا"}},{"kind":"field","text":{"en":"Full name","ar":"الاسم الكامل"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"field","text":{"en":"Date of birth","ar":"تاريخ الميلاد"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Insurance number ⓘ","ar":"رقم التأمين ⓘ"},"text":"","gap":"s"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Book visit ⓘ","ar":"احجز الزيارة ⓘ"}}]}},{"id":"S02","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P01-U03-01","part":"check","rules":["R19"],"value":{"en":"Skill check, placeholders (NN/g): people may mistake a placeholder for data that was filled in, and it vanishes once they type. Clear labels outside empty fields fix both.","ar":"اختبار مهارة، النص الداخلي (NN/g): قد يظن الناس أن النص الداخلي بيانات معبّأة، ثم يختفي حين يكتبون. والعناوين الواضحة خارج حقول فارغة تحلّ المشكلتين."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/form-design-placeholders/","quote":"Users may mistake a placeholder for data that was automatically filled in."},"scenario":{"en":"The first two boxes only have grey words inside: \"Full name\" and \"Date of birth\". Samira has typed her name in the first one.","ar":"أول مربعين فيهما كلمات رمادية بالداخل فقط: «الاسم الكامل» و«تاريخ الميلاد». وقد كتبت سميرة اسمها في الأول."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each version. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل نسخة. أيّها يجب أن تُطلق؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Book your first visit","ar":"احجز زيارتك الأولى"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","avatar":{"text":"Mona Adel","art":"doctor"},"text":{"en":"Dr. Mona Adel","ar":"د. منى عادل"},"sub":{"en":"Family doctor · Mon 9:30 am","ar":"طبيبة أسرة · الإثنين 9:30 صباحًا"}},{"kind":"field","filled":true,"text":{"en":"Samira Adel","ar":"سميرة عادل"}},{"kind":"field","text":{"en":"Date of birth","ar":"تاريخ الميلاد"},"gap":"s"}]},"options":[{"id":"bold","text":{"en":"Make the grey words bold so they stand out","ar":"اجعل الكلمات الرمادية بخط عريض لتبرز"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Book your first visit","ar":"احجز زيارتك الأولى"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","avatar":{"text":"Mona Adel","art":"doctor"},"text":{"en":"Dr. Mona Adel","ar":"د. منى عادل"},"sub":{"en":"Family doctor · Mon 9:30 am","ar":"طبيبة أسرة · الإثنين 9:30 صباحًا"}},{"kind":"field","filled":true,"text":{"en":"Samira Adel","ar":"سميرة عادل"}},{"kind":"field","filled":true,"text":{"en":"Date of birth","ar":"تاريخ الميلاد"},"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"keep","text":{"en":"Keep it; the form is short","ar":"أبقِ النموذج كما هو؛ فالنموذج قصير"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Book your first visit","ar":"احجز زيارتك الأولى"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","avatar":{"text":"Mona Adel","art":"doctor"},"text":{"en":"Dr. Mona Adel","ar":"د. منى عادل"},"sub":{"en":"Family doctor · Mon 9:30 am","ar":"طبيبة أسرة · الإثنين 9:30 صباحًا"}},{"kind":"field","filled":true,"text":{"en":"Samira Adel","ar":"سميرة عادل"}},{"kind":"field","text":{"en":"Date of birth","ar":"تاريخ الميلاد"},"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"labels","text":{"en":"Labels above the boxes; boxes start empty","ar":"عناوين فوق المربعات؛ والمربعات تبدأ فارغة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Book your first visit","ar":"احجز زيارتك الأولى"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","avatar":{"text":"Mona Adel","art":"doctor"},"text":{"en":"Dr. Mona Adel","ar":"د. منى عادل"},"sub":{"en":"Family doctor · Mon 9:30 am","ar":"طبيبة أسرة · الإثنين 9:30 صباحًا"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Full name","ar":"الاسم الكامل"},"filled":true,"text":{"en":"Samira Adel","ar":"سميرة عادل"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Date of birth","ar":"تاريخ الميلاد"},"text":"","gap":"s"}]}}],"answer":["labels"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-034","when":["keep"],"feedback":{"en":"Her name already replaced \"Full name\", so the first box no longer says what it is. Short forms need labels too.","ar":"حلّ اسمها محلّ «الاسم الكامل»، فلم يعد المربع الأول يوضّح ما المطلوب فيه. والنماذج القصيرة تحتاج عناوين أيضًا."}},{"id":"MC-P01-036","when":["bold"],"feedback":{"en":"Bold dark words look like an answer that's already there, so the date box now seems filled. Labels go outside, boxes stay empty.","ar":"الكلمات الداكنة العريضة تبدو كإجابة موجودة بالفعل، فيبدو مربع التاريخ مُعبّأً. العناوين بالخارج، والمربعات تبقى فارغة."}}],"explain":{"en":"From Lesson 1: a label outside the box is there before, during and after typing, and an empty box clearly waits for an answer.","ar":"من الدرس 1: العنوان خارج المربع موجود قبل الكتابة وأثناءها وبعدها، والمربع الفارغ ينتظر إجابة بوضوح."},"speaker":"nour"},{"id":"S03","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P01-U03-04","part":"check","rules":["R19"],"value":{"en":"Skill check, white space in forms (NN/g): place the label closer to its own field than to other fields. On a phone, that means right above it.","ar":"اختبار مهارة، المسافات في النماذج (NN/g): ضع العنوان أقرب إلى حقله منه إلى الحقول الأخرى. وعلى الهاتف، هذا يعني فوقه مباشرة."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/form-design-white-space/","quote":"Place the label closer to the associated text field than to other text fields."},"scenario":{"en":"Further down, the contact fields have labels, but each one floats in the middle of the gap between two boxes.","ar":"في الأسفل، لحقول التواصل عناوين، لكن كل عنوان يطفو في منتصف المسافة بين مربعين."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each version. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل نسخة. أيّها يجب أن تُطلق؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Book your first visit","ar":"احجز زيارتك الأولى"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","avatar":{"text":"Mona Adel","art":"doctor"},"text":{"en":"Dr. Mona Adel","ar":"د. منى عادل"},"sub":{"en":"Family doctor · Mon 9:30 am","ar":"طبيبة أسرة · الإثنين 9:30 صباحًا"}},{"kind":"field","text":""},{"kind":"small","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Mobile number","ar":"رقم الموبايل"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"field","text":"","gap":"m"},{"kind":"small","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Email (optional)","ar":"البريد الإلكتروني (اختياري)"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"field","text":"","gap":"m"}]},"options":[{"id":"tight","text":{"en":"Each label right above its box, more space between fields","ar":"كل عنوان فوق مربعه مباشرة، ومسافة أكبر بين الحقول"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Book your first visit","ar":"احجز زيارتك الأولى"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","avatar":{"text":"Mona Adel","art":"doctor"},"text":{"en":"Dr. Mona Adel","ar":"د. منى عادل"},"sub":{"en":"Family doctor · Mon 9:30 am","ar":"طبيبة أسرة · الإثنين 9:30 صباحًا"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Mobile number","ar":"رقم الموبايل"},"text":""},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Email (optional)","ar":"البريد الإلكتروني (اختياري)"},"text":"","gap":"l"}]}},{"id":"color","text":{"en":"Keep the gaps; color each label like its box border","ar":"أبقِ المسافات؛ ولوّن كل عنوان بلون حدود مربعه"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Book your first visit","ar":"احجز زيارتك الأولى"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","avatar":{"text":"Mona Adel","art":"doctor"},"text":{"en":"Dr. Mona Adel","ar":"د. منى عادل"},"sub":{"en":"Family doctor · Mon 9:30 am","ar":"طبيبة أسرة · الإثنين 9:30 صباحًا"}},{"kind":"field","text":""},{"kind":"small","weight":"bold","color":"brand","text":{"en":"Mobile number","ar":"رقم الموبايل"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"field","text":"","gap":"m"},{"kind":"small","weight":"bold","color":"brand","text":{"en":"Email (optional)","ar":"البريد الإلكتروني (اختياري)"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"field","text":"","gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"keep","text":{"en":"Keep it; even spacing looks neat","ar":"أبقِ المسافات كما هي؛ فالمسافات المتساوية تبدو مرتّبة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Book your first visit","ar":"احجز زيارتك الأولى"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","avatar":{"text":"Mona Adel","art":"doctor"},"text":{"en":"Dr. Mona Adel","ar":"د. منى عادل"},"sub":{"en":"Family doctor · Mon 9:30 am","ar":"طبيبة أسرة · الإثنين 9:30 صباحًا"}},{"kind":"field","text":""},{"kind":"small","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Mobile number","ar":"رقم الموبايل"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"field","text":"","gap":"m"},{"kind":"small","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Email (optional)","ar":"البريد الإلكتروني (اختياري)"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"field","text":"","gap":"m"}]}}],"answer":["tight"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-038","when":["keep","color"],"feedback":{"en":"Each label is still exactly between two boxes, so it could belong to either. Distance has to point to the right box.","ar":"ما زال كل عنوان في منتصف المسافة بين مربعين تمامًا، فقد يخصّ أيًّا منهما. والمسافة يجب أن تشير إلى المربع الصحيح."}}],"explain":{"en":"From Lesson 2: people pair what's close. A label tight above its own box, with a bigger gap before the next, can't be misread.","ar":"من الدرس 2: يربط الناس بين المتقارب. والعنوان الملاصق فوق مربعه، مع مسافة أكبر قبل المربع التالي، لا يمكن أن يُساء فهمه."},"speaker":"nour"},{"id":"S04","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P01-U03-05","part":"check","rules":["R19"],"value":{"en":"Skill check, white space in forms (NN/g): grouping related fields together helps people make sense of what they must fill in. Patient and insurance details are two different groups.","ar":"اختبار مهارة، المسافات في النماذج (NN/g): جمع الحقول المترابطة معًا يساعد الناس على فهم ما عليهم ملؤه. وبيانات المريض وبيانات التأمين مجموعتان مختلفتان."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/form-design-white-space/","quote":"Grouping related fields together helps users make sense of the information that they must fill in."},"scenario":{"en":"The form mixes Samira's details and her insurance details in one even list: name, insurance company, mobile, policy holder's name, date of birth.","ar":"النموذج يخلط بيانات سميرة وبيانات تأمينها في قائمة واحدة متساوية: الاسم، وشركة التأمين، والموبايل، واسم صاحب الوثيقة، وتاريخ الميلاد."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each version. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل نسخة. أيّها يجب أن تُطلق؟"},"start":"mixed","options":[{"id":"mixed","text":{"en":"Keep one mixed list","ar":"أبقِ قائمة واحدة مختلطة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Book your first visit","ar":"احجز زيارتك الأولى"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","avatar":{"text":"Mona Adel","art":"doctor"},"text":{"en":"Dr. Mona Adel","ar":"د. منى عادل"},"sub":{"en":"Family doctor · Mon 9:30 am","ar":"طبيبة أسرة · الإثنين 9:30 صباحًا"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Full name","ar":"الاسم الكامل"},"text":""},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Insurance company","ar":"شركة التأمين"},"text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Mobile number","ar":"رقم الموبايل"},"text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Policy holder's name","ar":"اسم صاحب الوثيقة"},"text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Date of birth","ar":"تاريخ الميلاد"},"text":"","gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"groups","text":{"en":"Two groups: \"About you\" and \"Your insurance\"","ar":"مجموعتان: «عنك» و«تأمينك»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Book your first visit","ar":"احجز زيارتك الأولى"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","avatar":{"text":"Mona Adel","art":"doctor"},"text":{"en":"Dr. Mona Adel","ar":"د. منى عادل"},"sub":{"en":"Family doctor · Mon 9:30 am","ar":"طبيبة أسرة · الإثنين 9:30 صباحًا"}},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"About you","ar":"عنك"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Full name","ar":"الاسم الكامل"},"text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Date of birth","ar":"تاريخ الميلاد"},"text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Mobile number","ar":"رقم الموبايل"},"text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Your insurance","ar":"تأمينك"},"gap":"l"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Insurance company","ar":"شركة التأمين"},"text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Policy holder's name","ar":"اسم صاحب الوثيقة"},"text":"","gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"cols","text":{"en":"Two columns: you on one side, insurance on the other","ar":"عمودان: أنت في جانب، والتأمين في الجانب الآخر"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Book your first visit","ar":"احجز زيارتك الأولى"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","avatar":{"text":"Mona Adel","art":"doctor"},"text":{"en":"Dr. Mona Adel","ar":"د. منى عادل"},"sub":{"en":"Family doctor · Mon 9:30 am","ar":"طبيبة أسرة · الإثنين 9:30 صباحًا"}},{"kind":"row","blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Full name","ar":"الاسم الكامل"},"text":""},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Insurance company","ar":"شركة التأمين"},"text":""}]},{"kind":"row","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Date of birth","ar":"تاريخ الميلاد"},"text":""},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Policy holder","ar":"صاحب الوثيقة"},"text":""}]}]}}],"answer":["groups"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-041","when":["mixed"],"feedback":{"en":"Jumping between Samira and her insurance makes \"name\" fields easy to mix up. Put each set together under its own heading.","ar":"التنقّل بين سميرة وتأمينها يجعل الخلط بين حقول «الاسم» سهلًا. اجمع كل مجموعة معًا تحت عنوانها الرئيسي."}},{"id":"MC-P01-040","when":["cols"],"feedback":{"en":"The groups are right, but side by side people fill across the row and mix them again. Stack the groups in one column.","ar":"المجموعات صحيحة، لكن حين تكون متجاورة يملأ الناس السطر من جهة لأخرى فيخلطونها من جديد. ضع المجموعات واحدة تحت الأخرى في عمود واحد."}}],"explain":{"en":"From Lesson 2: related fields together, under a heading, in one column. Each group becomes one small task.","ar":"من الدرس 2: الحقول المترابطة معًا، تحت عنوان رئيسي، في عمود واحد. فتصبح كل مجموعة مهمة صغيرة واحدة."},"speaker":"nour"},{"id":"S05","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P01-U03-02","part":"check","rules":["R19"],"value":{"en":"Skill check, placeholders (NN/g): hints and instructions should be persistent and placed outside the field. A date format inside the box is gone before Samira types the year.","ar":"اختبار مهارة، النص الداخلي (NN/g): التلميحات والتعليمات يجب أن تبقى ظاهرة وخارج الحقل. وصيغة التاريخ داخل المربع تختفي قبل أن تكتب سميرة السنة."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/form-design-placeholders/","quote":"Hints and instructions should also be persistent and placed outside of the field."},"scenario":{"en":"Our system needs the date of birth as day, month, year, like 07 03 1990. Samira has typed \"07 03\".","ar":"يحتاج نظامنا تاريخ الميلاد بترتيب اليوم ثم الشهر ثم السنة، مثل 07 03 1990. وقد كتبت سميرة «07 03»."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each place for the format. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل مكان للصيغة. أيّ مكان يُبقي ترتيب التاريخ ظاهرًا لسميرة وهي تكتب؟"},"start":"inside","options":[{"id":"inside","text":{"en":"Inside the box: \"DD MM YYYY\"","ar":"داخل المربع: «يوم شهر سنة»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"caption":{"en":"After Samira types \"07 03\"","ar":"بعد أن كتبت سميرة «07 03»"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Book your first visit","ar":"احجز زيارتك الأولى"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","avatar":{"text":"Mona Adel","art":"doctor"},"text":{"en":"Dr. Mona Adel","ar":"د. منى عادل"},"sub":{"en":"Family doctor · Mon 9:30 am","ar":"طبيبة أسرة · الإثنين 9:30 صباحًا"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Date of birth","ar":"تاريخ الميلاد"},"filled":true,"focus":true,"text":"⁦07 03⁩"}]}},{"id":"error","text":{"en":"Only in the error, if she gets it wrong","ar":"في رسالة الخطأ فقط، إذا أخطأت"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"caption":{"en":"After Samira types \"07 03\"","ar":"بعد أن كتبت سميرة «07 03»"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Book your first visit","ar":"احجز زيارتك الأولى"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","avatar":{"text":"Mona Adel","art":"doctor"},"text":{"en":"Dr. Mona Adel","ar":"د. منى عادل"},"sub":{"en":"Family doctor · Mon 9:30 am","ar":"طبيبة أسرة · الإثنين 9:30 صباحًا"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Date of birth","ar":"تاريخ الميلاد"},"filled":true,"focus":true,"text":"⁦07 03⁩"}]}},{"id":"under","text":{"en":"Under the label: \"Day, month, year. Example: 07 03 1990\"","ar":"تحت العنوان: «اليوم ثم الشهر ثم السنة. مثال: 07 03 1990»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"caption":{"en":"After Samira types \"07 03\"","ar":"بعد أن كتبت سميرة «07 03»"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Book your first visit","ar":"احجز زيارتك الأولى"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","avatar":{"text":"Mona Adel","art":"doctor"},"text":{"en":"Dr. Mona Adel","ar":"د. منى عادل"},"sub":{"en":"Family doctor · Mon 9:30 am","ar":"طبيبة أسرة · الإثنين 9:30 صباحًا"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Date of birth","ar":"تاريخ الميلاد"},"hintFirst":true,"hint":{"en":"Day, month, year. Example: 07 03 1990","ar":"اليوم ثم الشهر ثم السنة. مثال: 07 03 1990"},"filled":true,"focus":true,"text":"⁦07 03⁩"}]}}],"answer":["under"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-035","when":["inside"],"feedback":{"en":"Look at the preview: she has typed, and the format is gone. Day-or-month-first is exactly what she needs to check now.","ar":"انظر إلى المعاينة: كتبت، فاختفت الصيغة. وترتيب اليوم والشهر هو بالضبط ما تحتاج أن تتأكّد منه الآن."}},{"id":"MC-P01-042","when":["error"],"feedback":{"en":"An error can't catch 07 03 typed in the wrong order: both are valid dates. The format has to be visible before and while she types.","ar":"رسالة الخطأ لا تستطيع اكتشاف 07 03 إذا كُتب بترتيب خاطئ: فكلاهما تاريخ صحيح. والصيغة يجب أن تكون ظاهرة قبل الكتابة وأثناءها."}}],"explain":{"en":"From Lesson 1: hints go outside the field, where typing can't erase them. For dates, the order is the hint that matters most.","ar":"من الدرس 1: التلميحات مكانها خارج الحقل، حيث لا تمسحها الكتابة. وفي التواريخ، الترتيب هو أهم تلميح."},"speaker":"nour"},{"id":"S06","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P01-U03-03","part":"check","rules":["R19"],"value":{"en":"Skill check, tooltips (NN/g): tooltips shouldn't be essential for the task. What to bring to a first visit decides whether the visit can happen, so it belongs on the screen.","ar":"اختبار مهارة، الـ Tooltip (NN/g): يجب ألا يكون الـ Tooltip ضروريًا لإنجاز المهمة. وما يجب إحضاره للزيارة الأولى يحدّد هل يمكن أن تتم الزيارة، فمكانه على الشاشة."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/tooltip-guidelines/","quote":"tooltips shouldn’t be essential for the tasks users need to accomplish on your site."},"scenario":{"en":"First-time patients must bring their national ID and insurance card, or we can't see them. Right now, that note hides in the ⓘ on the Book visit button.","ar":"يجب أن يُحضر المرضى الجدد بطاقة الرقم القومي وبطاقة التأمين، وإلا لا نستطيع الكشف عليهم. والآن، هذه الملاحظة مخفية في ⓘ على زر «احجز الزيارة»."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each version. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل نسخة. أيّها يجب أن تُطلق؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Book your first visit","ar":"احجز زيارتك الأولى"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","avatar":{"text":"Mona Adel","art":"doctor"},"text":{"en":"Dr. Mona Adel","ar":"د. منى عادل"},"sub":{"en":"Family doctor · Mon 9:30 am","ar":"طبيبة أسرة · الإثنين 9:30 صباحًا"}}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Book visit ⓘ","ar":"احجز الزيارة ⓘ"}}]},"options":[{"id":"sms","text":{"en":"Keep the ⓘ, and also mention it in the confirmation SMS","ar":"أبقِ ⓘ، واذكرها أيضًا في رسالة التأكيد النصية"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Book your first visit","ar":"احجز زيارتك الأولى"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change · the SMS arrives after booking","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير · الرسالة تصل بعد الحجز"},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","avatar":{"text":"Mona Adel","art":"doctor"},"text":{"en":"Dr. Mona Adel","ar":"د. منى عادل"},"sub":{"en":"Family doctor · Mon 9:30 am","ar":"طبيبة أسرة · الإثنين 9:30 صباحًا"}}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Book visit ⓘ","ar":"احجز الزيارة ⓘ"}}]}},{"id":"show","text":{"en":"Show \"Bring your national ID and insurance card\" above the button","ar":"اعرض «أحضر بطاقة الرقم القومي وبطاقة التأمين» فوق الزر"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Book your first visit","ar":"احجز زيارتك الأولى"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","avatar":{"text":"Mona Adel","art":"doctor"},"text":{"en":"Dr. Mona Adel","ar":"د. منى عادل"},"sub":{"en":"Family doctor · Mon 9:30 am","ar":"طبيبة أسرة · الإثنين 9:30 صباحًا"}},{"kind":"banner","text":{"en":"Bring your national ID and insurance card to your visit.","ar":"أحضر بطاقة الرقم القومي وبطاقة التأمين معك في الزيارة."}}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Book visit","ar":"احجز الزيارة"}}]}},{"id":"keep","text":{"en":"Keep the ⓘ; it's always there for anyone who looks","ar":"أبقِ ⓘ؛ فهي موجودة دائمًا لمن يبحث"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Book your first visit","ar":"احجز زيارتك الأولى"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","avatar":{"text":"Mona Adel","art":"doctor"},"text":{"en":"Dr. Mona Adel","ar":"د. منى عادل"},"sub":{"en":"Family doctor · Mon 9:30 am","ar":"طبيبة أسرة · الإثنين 9:30 صباحًا"}}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Book visit ⓘ","ar":"احجز الزيارة ⓘ"}}]}}],"answer":["show"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-037","when":["keep","sms"],"feedback":{"en":"Samira books on a phone, where there's no hover, so she won't see it here. A rule that can cancel her visit belongs on the screen, not only in an icon or a later SMS.","ar":"تحجز سميرة من الهاتف، حيث لا يوجد تمرير للماوس، فلن تراها هنا. والقاعدة التي قد تُلغي زيارتها مكانها على الشاشة، لا في أيقونة أو رسالة لاحقة فقط."}}],"explain":{"en":"From Lesson 3: could someone fail without reading it? Without the documents, the visit fails, so the note goes on the screen.","ar":"من الدرس 3: هل يمكن أن يفشل أحد دون قراءتها؟ بدون الأوراق، تفشل الزيارة، فمكان الملاحظة على الشاشة."},"speaker":"nour"},{"id":"S07","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P01-U03-06","part":"check","rules":["R19"],"value":{"en":"Skill check, form usability (NN/g): if a field requires a specific format, state the exact instructions. The insurance number has a fixed length and a known place on the card.","ar":"اختبار مهارة، سهولة استخدام النماذج (NN/g): إذا كان الحقل يتطلّب صيغة محدّدة، فاذكر التعليمات بدقة. ورقم التأمين له طول ثابت ومكان معروف على البطاقة."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/web-form-design/","quote":"If a field requires a specific format or type of input, state the exact instructions."},"scenario":{"en":"The insurance number is always 10 digits, printed on the front of the card. Right now, the rule only appears in an error: \"Invalid insurance number\".","ar":"رقم التأمين دائمًا 10 أرقام، مطبوع على وجه البطاقة. والآن، تظهر القاعدة فقط في رسالة خطأ: «رقم تأمين غير صالح»."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each version. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل نسخة. أيّها يجب أن تُطلق؟"},"start":"exact","options":[{"id":"exact","text":{"en":"Under the label: \"10 digits, on the front of your card\"","ar":"تحت العنوان: «10 أرقام، على وجه بطاقتك»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Book your first visit","ar":"احجز زيارتك الأولى"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","avatar":{"text":"Mona Adel","art":"doctor"},"text":{"en":"Dr. Mona Adel","ar":"د. منى عادل"},"sub":{"en":"Family doctor · Mon 9:30 am","ar":"طبيبة أسرة · الإثنين 9:30 صباحًا"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Insurance number","ar":"رقم التأمين"},"hintFirst":true,"hint":{"en":"10 digits, on the front of your card","ar":"10 أرقام، على وجه بطاقتك"},"text":""}]}},{"id":"vague","text":{"en":"Under the label: \"Enter a valid insurance number\"","ar":"تحت العنوان: «أدخل رقم تأمين صالحًا»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Book your first visit","ar":"احجز زيارتك الأولى"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","avatar":{"text":"Mona Adel","art":"doctor"},"text":{"en":"Dr. Mona Adel","ar":"د. منى عادل"},"sub":{"en":"Family doctor · Mon 9:30 am","ar":"طبيبة أسرة · الإثنين 9:30 صباحًا"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Insurance number","ar":"رقم التأمين"},"hintFirst":true,"hint":{"en":"Enter a valid insurance number","ar":"أدخل رقم تأمين صالحًا"},"text":""}]}},{"id":"error","text":{"en":"Keep the rule in the error message","ar":"أبقِ القاعدة في رسالة الخطأ"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Book your first visit","ar":"احجز زيارتك الأولى"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","avatar":{"text":"Mona Adel","art":"doctor"},"text":{"en":"Dr. Mona Adel","ar":"د. منى عادل"},"sub":{"en":"Family doctor · Mon 9:30 am","ar":"طبيبة أسرة · الإثنين 9:30 صباحًا"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Insurance number","ar":"رقم التأمين"},"filled":true,"tone":"bad","text":"48210","error":{"en":"Invalid insurance number.","ar":"رقم تأمين غير صالح."}}]}}],"answer":["exact"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-043","when":["vague"],"feedback":{"en":"\"Valid\" doesn't say how many digits or where to find them. Samira still has to guess.","ar":"كلمة «صالح» لا تذكر عدد الأرقام ولا مكانها. وما زالت سميرة مضطرة للتخمين."}},{"id":"MC-P01-042","when":["error"],"feedback":{"en":"The error comes after her mistake and still doesn't say the rule. Give the exact rule before she types.","ar":"رسالة الخطأ تأتي بعد خطئها وما زالت لا تذكر القاعدة. أعطِ القاعدة الدقيقة قبل أن تكتب."}}],"explain":{"en":"From Lesson 3: an exact rule, shown before typing, lets people get it right the first time: the length, and where to look.","ar":"من الدرس 3: القاعدة الدقيقة، المعروضة قبل الكتابة، تتيح للناس النجاح من المرة الأولى: الطول، وأين يبحثون."},"speaker":"nour"}]}$uxg$::jsonb),
  ($uxg$P01-U04-L01$uxg$, $uxg$a314f324e119ba0e3922c479a0ffd4a8e09e1c59d5be2ecc3b276e0a30203618$uxg$, $uxg${"id":"P01-U04-L01","mode":"lesson","minutes":8,"title":{"en":"Put the error where the problem is","ar":"ضع الخطأ حيث توجد المشكلة"},"summary":{"en":"Move a gym form's vague top error next to the field that caused it.","ar":"انقل رسالة الخطأ المبهمة أعلى نموذج الصالة الرياضية بجانب الحقل الذي سبّبها."},"speaker":"hana","review_labels":{"MC-P01-044":{"en":"An error belongs next to its field","ar":"مكان الخطأ بجوار حقله"},"MC-P01-045":{"en":"Color alone doesn't signal an error","ar":"اللون وحده لا يكفي لإظهار الخطأ"},"MC-P01-046":{"en":"Long forms need a listed summary plus inline errors","ar":"النموذج الطويل يحتاج ملخّصًا يعدّد الأخطاء مع أخطاء بجوار الحقول"}},"steps":[{"id":"S01","type":"card","part":"hook","title":{"en":"Salma's membership form","ar":"نموذج اشتراك سلمى"},"body":{"en":"Salma tried to join my gym on our website. She filled in everything and tapped Join. A red line appeared at the very top: \"There's a problem with your form.\"\n\nShe looked at each field and couldn't see anything wrong. In the end, she walked to the front desk and signed up on paper.","ar":"حاولت سلمى الاشتراك في ناديّ الرياضي من موقعنا. ملأت كل شيء وضغطت «اشترك». فظهر سطر أحمر في أعلى الصفحة: «هناك مشكلة في النموذج».\n\nنظرت إلى كل حقل ولم ترَ أي خطأ. وفي النهاية، ذهبت إلى مكتب الاستقبال واشتركت على الورق."},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"nashat.example/join","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Classes","ar":"الحصص"},{"en":"Branches","ar":"الفروع"},{"en":"Join","ar":"اشترك"}],"active":2},"blocks":[{"kind":"banner","tone":"bad","text":{"en":"There's a problem with your form.","ar":"هناك مشكلة في النموذج."}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Full name","ar":"الاسم الكامل"},"filled":true,"text":{"en":"Salma Fathy","ar":"سلمى فتحي"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Mobile number","ar":"رقم الموبايل"},"filled":true,"text":"⁦0101 234 567⁩","gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Start date","ar":"تاريخ البدء"},"filled":true,"text":"01/12/2026","gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Join","ar":"اشترك"},"gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"S02","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P01-U04-01","part":"try","rules":["R12"],"value":{"en":"Try first. Error messages (NN/g): show the message close to the source of the error. Salma's mobile number has 10 digits; a message far from that field makes her search.","ar":"جرّب أولًا. رسائل الخطأ (NN/g): اعرض الرسالة قريبًا من مصدر الخطأ. ورقم موبايل سلمى 10 أرقام؛ والرسالة البعيدة عن هذا الحقل تجعلها تبحث."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/error-message-guidelines/","quote":"Display the error message close to the error's source."},"scenario":{"en":"The problem was her mobile number: she typed 10 digits, and Egyptian mobiles have 11.","ar":"كانت المشكلة في رقم الموبايل: كتبت 10 أرقام، وأرقام الموبايل المصرية 11 رقمًا."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each version of my form. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل نسخة من نموذجي. أيّها يجب أن تُطلق؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"nashat.example/join","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Classes","ar":"الحصص"},{"en":"Branches","ar":"الفروع"},{"en":"Join","ar":"اشترك"}],"active":2},"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"blocks":[{"kind":"banner","tone":"bad","text":{"en":"There's a problem with your form.","ar":"هناك مشكلة في النموذج."}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Full name","ar":"الاسم الكامل"},"filled":true,"text":{"en":"Salma Fathy","ar":"سلمى فتحي"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Mobile number","ar":"رقم الموبايل"},"filled":true,"text":"⁦0101 234 567⁩","gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Start date","ar":"تاريخ البدء"},"filled":true,"text":"01/12/2026","gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Join","ar":"اشترك"},"gap":"m"}]},"options":[{"id":"top","text":{"en":"Keep the message at the top, but name the problem","ar":"أبقِ الرسالة في الأعلى، لكن اذكر المشكلة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"nashat.example/join","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Classes","ar":"الحصص"},{"en":"Branches","ar":"الفروع"},{"en":"Join","ar":"اشترك"}],"active":2},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"banner","tone":"bad","text":{"en":"Mobile number needs 11 digits.","ar":"رقم الموبايل يحتاج 11 رقمًا."}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Full name","ar":"الاسم الكامل"},"filled":true,"text":{"en":"Salma Fathy","ar":"سلمى فتحي"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Mobile number","ar":"رقم الموبايل"},"filled":true,"text":"⁦0101 234 567⁩","gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Start date","ar":"تاريخ البدء"},"filled":true,"text":"01/12/2026","gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Join","ar":"اشترك"},"gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"inline","text":{"en":"Mark the mobile field and put the message under it","ar":"علّم حقل الموبايل وضع الرسالة تحته"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"nashat.example/join","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Classes","ar":"الحصص"},{"en":"Branches","ar":"الفروع"},{"en":"Join","ar":"اشترك"}],"active":2},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Full name","ar":"الاسم الكامل"},"filled":true,"text":{"en":"Salma Fathy","ar":"سلمى فتحي"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Mobile number","ar":"رقم الموبايل"},"filled":true,"text":"⁦0101 234 567⁩","tone":"bad","error":{"en":"⚠ Mobile number needs 11 digits. This one has 10.","ar":"⚠ رقم الموبايل يحتاج 11 رقمًا، وأدخلتِ 10."},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Start date","ar":"تاريخ البدء"},"filled":true,"text":"01/12/2026","gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Join","ar":"اشترك"},"gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"keep","text":{"en":"Keep it; people can check their own answers","ar":"أبقِ النموذج كما هو؛ يستطيع الناس مراجعة إجاباتهم بأنفسهم"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"nashat.example/join","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Classes","ar":"الحصص"},{"en":"Branches","ar":"الفروع"},{"en":"Join","ar":"اشترك"}],"active":2},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"banner","tone":"bad","text":{"en":"There's a problem with your form.","ar":"هناك مشكلة في النموذج."}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Full name","ar":"الاسم الكامل"},"filled":true,"text":{"en":"Salma Fathy","ar":"سلمى فتحي"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Mobile number","ar":"رقم الموبايل"},"filled":true,"text":"⁦0101 234 567⁩","gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Start date","ar":"تاريخ البدء"},"filled":true,"text":"01/12/2026","gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Join","ar":"اشترك"},"gap":"m"}]}}],"answer":["inline"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-044","when":["top"],"feedback":{"en":"Better, because it names the problem. But Salma reads it at the top, scrolls to the field, and has to remember it while she fixes it. Put it on the field.","ar":"أفضل، لأنها تذكر المشكلة. لكن سلمى تقرؤها في الأعلى، ثم تنزل إلى الحقل، وعليها أن تتذكّرها أثناء الإصلاح. ضعها على الحقل."}},{"id":"MC-P01-044","when":["keep"],"feedback":{"en":"Salma did check, and found nothing. Ten digits look normal at a glance. The form knows which field failed, so it should say so there.","ar":"راجعت سلمى بالفعل، ولم تجد شيئًا. فعشرة أرقام تبدو طبيعية للوهلة الأولى. والنموذج يعرف أي حقل فشل، فليوضّح ذلك عنده."}}],"hints":[{"en":"When Salma starts fixing her number, where are her eyes?","ar":"حين تبدأ سلمى في إصلاح رقمها، أين تنظر؟"},{"en":"Which version puts the message in that same spot?","ar":"أي نسخة تضع الرسالة في المكان نفسه؟"}],"correct":{"en":"The message sits on the field she has to fix.","ar":"الرسالة موجودة على الحقل الذي يجب أن تُصلحه."},"explain":{"en":"People fix errors where the field is. A message there tells them which field and what to do, without searching or remembering.","ar":"يُصلح الناس الأخطاء حيث يوجد الحقل. والرسالة هناك تخبرهم أي حقل وماذا يفعلون، دون بحث أو تذكّر."},"speaker":"hana"},{"id":"S03","type":"card","part":"concept","icons":["pin","color","list","ok"],"title":{"en":"An error has to lead to the fix","ar":"الخطأ يجب أن يقود إلى الإصلاح"},"body":{"en":"An error message only helps if people can find it and act on it.\n\n- **Next to the field:** put the message right under the field with the problem, where people look while fixing it.\n- **More than color:** a red border alone is easy to miss, and some people can't see red well. Add words and an icon.\n- **A list at the top of long forms:** when errors may be out of sight, list them at the top, and still mark each field.\n- **Keep it on screen:** a message that disappears after a few seconds is gone before people finish fixing.","ar":"رسالة الخطأ لا تفيد إلا إذا وجدها الناس واستطاعوا التصرّف بناءً عليها.\n\n- **بجوار الحقل:** ضع الرسالة تحت الحقل الذي فيه المشكلة مباشرة، حيث ينظر الناس أثناء الإصلاح.\n- **أكثر من اللون:** الإطار الأحمر وحده قد لا يُلاحَظ، وبعض الناس لا يرون الأحمر جيدًا. أضف كلمات وأيقونة.\n- **قائمة أعلى النماذج الطويلة:** حين قد تكون الأخطاء خارج الشاشة، اعرضها في قائمة بالأعلى، مع تعليم كل حقل أيضًا.\n- **أبقِها على الشاشة:** الرسالة التي تختفي بعد ثوانٍ تزول قبل أن ينتهي الناس من الإصلاح."}},{"id":"S04","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P01-U04-06","part":"guided","rules":["R06","R15"],"value":{"en":"Form usability (NN/g): errors should be signaled through several cues, not only color. A red border alone can look like a normal border, especially for people who don't see red well.","ar":"سهولة استخدام النماذج (NN/g): يجب إظهار الأخطاء بعدّة إشارات، لا باللون وحده. والإطار الأحمر وحده قد يبدو إطارًا عاديًا، خاصة لمن لا يرى الأحمر جيدًا."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/web-form-design/","quote":"Errors should be signaled through a variety of cues, not solely through color:"},"scenario":{"en":"Members book a personal trainer in our app. When the email is wrong, we only turn its border red. Khaled, who can't tell red from green, tapped Book five times.","ar":"يحجز الأعضاء مدرّبًا خاصًا من تطبيقنا. وحين يكون البريد خاطئًا، نكتفي بتحويل إطاره إلى الأحمر. وخالد، الذي لا يميّز الأحمر من الأخضر، ضغط «احجز» خمس مرات."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each version. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل نسخة. أيّها يجب أن تُطلق؟"},"start":"red","options":[{"id":"red","text":{"en":"Keep the red border only","ar":"أبقِ الإطار الأحمر فقط"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Book a trainer","ar":"احجز مدربًا"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Email","ar":"البريد الإلكتروني"},"filled":true,"text":"khaled.mail.com","tone":"bad"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Book","ar":"احجز"}}]}},{"id":"grey","text":{"en":"Keep the red border, and grey out Book until it's fixed","ar":"أبقِ الإطار الأحمر، واجعل «احجز» رماديًا حتى يُصلح خالد الخطأ"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Book a trainer","ar":"احجز مدربًا"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Email","ar":"البريد الإلكتروني"},"filled":true,"text":"khaled.mail.com","tone":"bad"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","tone":"off","text":{"en":"Book","ar":"احجز"}}]}},{"id":"words","text":{"en":"Keep the red border, and add an icon and a message","ar":"أبقِ الإطار الأحمر، وأضف أيقونة ورسالة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Book a trainer","ar":"احجز مدربًا"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Email","ar":"البريد الإلكتروني"},"filled":true,"text":"khaled.mail.com","tone":"bad","error":{"en":"⚠ This email is missing @. For example: name@mail.com","ar":"⚠ هذا البريد ينقصه @. مثال: name@mail.com"}}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Book","ar":"احجز"}}]}}],"answer":["words"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-045","when":["red"],"feedback":{"en":"To Khaled, a red border looks like any other border. Only words and an icon reach him, and they also say what to fix.","ar":"بالنسبة إلى خالد، الإطار الأحمر يبدو مثل أي إطار. والكلمات والأيقونة وحدها تصل إليه، وتوضّح أيضًا ما يجب إصلاحه."}},{"id":"MC-P01-045","when":["grey"],"feedback":{"en":"Now Khaled knows something is wrong, but not what or where. A grey button is one more signal without words. Say what to fix next to the email.","ar":"الآن يعرف خالد أن هناك خطأ، لكن لا يعرف ما هو ولا أين. والزر الرمادي إشارة أخرى بلا كلمات. اكتب بجوار البريد ما يجب إصلاحه."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Imagine the preview in black and white. Which version still shows an error?","ar":"تخيّل المعاينة بالأبيض والأسود. أي نسخة ما زالت تُظهر الخطأ؟"},{"en":"Which version also tells Khaled what's wrong with his email?","ar":"أي نسخة تخبر خالد أيضًا بما في بريده من خطأ؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Color, icon and words: anyone can see the error.","ar":"صحيح. باللون والأيقونة والكلمات، يرى الجميع الخطأ."},"explain":{"en":"Color helps, but it can't be the only signal. An icon and a short message work for everyone, and the message also explains the fix.","ar":"اللون يساعد، لكن لا يصح أن يكون الإشارة الوحيدة. والأيقونة والرسالة القصيرة تعملان مع الجميع، والرسالة تشرح الإصلاح أيضًا."},"speaker":"hana"},{"id":"S05","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P01-U04-07","part":"guided","rules":["R06","R15"],"value":{"en":"Form errors (NN/g): a summary at the top gives a global view of all the errors. On a long form, it tells people how many problems there are and where, even ones off screen.","ar":"أخطاء النماذج (NN/g): الملخّص في الأعلى يعطي صورة شاملة عن كل الأخطاء. وفي النموذج الطويل، يخبر الناس كم مشكلة هناك وأين، حتى التي خارج الشاشة."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/errors-forms-design-guidelines/","quote":"A validation summary can give the user a global understanding of all the errors in a form"},"scenario":{"en":"New members fill in a health form with 14 questions before their first session. When they tap Send with problems, the page jumps back to the top. Last week, Heba fixed one error, tapped Send, and got bounced back again twice.","ar":"يملأ الأعضاء الجدد استمارة صحية فيها 14 سؤالًا قبل أول حصة. وحين يضغطون «أرسل» وفيها مشكلات، تقفز الصفحة إلى الأعلى. والأسبوع الماضي، أصلحت هبة خطأ واحدًا، وضغطت «أرسل»، فأعادتها الصفحة مرتين أخريين."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each version of the top of the form after Send. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل نسخة من أعلى النموذج بعد «أرسل». أيّ نسخة تجعل هبة تعرف كل الأخطاء وأماكنها من أول مرة؟"},"start":"inline","options":[{"id":"inline","text":{"en":"Only mark each field with its error","ar":"علّم كل حقل بخطئه فقط"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"nashat.example/join","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Classes","ar":"الحصص"},{"en":"Branches","ar":"الفروع"},{"en":"Join","ar":"اشترك"}],"active":2},"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Health form","ar":"الاستمارة الصحية"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Weight (kg)","ar":"الوزن (كجم)"},"filled":true,"text":"68","gap":"m"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Height (cm)","ar":"الطول (سم)"},"text":"","tone":"bad","error":{"en":"⚠ Enter your height in cm, like 165.","ar":"⚠ اكتب طولك بالسنتيمتر، مثل 165."},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"12 more questions below","ar":"12 سؤالًا آخر بالأسفل"},"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"both","text":{"en":"List all 3 errors at the top, and mark each field","ar":"اعرض الأخطاء الثلاثة في قائمة بالأعلى، وعلّم كل حقل"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"nashat.example/join","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Classes","ar":"الحصص"},{"en":"Branches","ar":"الفروع"},{"en":"Join","ar":"اشترك"}],"active":2},"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Health form","ar":"الاستمارة الصحية"}},{"kind":"banner","tone":"bad","text":{"en":"3 answers need a fix: Height, Injuries, Emergency phone.","ar":"3 إجابات تحتاج إصلاحًا: الطول، الإصابات، هاتف الطوارئ."},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Weight (kg)","ar":"الوزن (كجم)"},"filled":true,"text":"68","gap":"m"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Height (cm)","ar":"الطول (سم)"},"text":"","tone":"bad","error":{"en":"⚠ Enter your height in cm, like 165.","ar":"⚠ اكتب طولك بالسنتيمتر، مثل 165."},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"12 more questions below","ar":"12 سؤالًا آخر بالأسفل"},"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"list","text":{"en":"List all 3 errors at the top, and leave the fields unmarked","ar":"اعرض الأخطاء الثلاثة في قائمة بالأعلى، واترك الحقول بلا علامات"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"nashat.example/join","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Classes","ar":"الحصص"},{"en":"Branches","ar":"الفروع"},{"en":"Join","ar":"اشترك"}],"active":2},"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Health form","ar":"الاستمارة الصحية"}},{"kind":"banner","tone":"bad","text":{"en":"3 answers need a fix: Height, Injuries, Emergency phone.","ar":"3 إجابات تحتاج إصلاحًا: الطول، الإصابات، هاتف الطوارئ."},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Weight (kg)","ar":"الوزن (كجم)"},"filled":true,"text":"68","gap":"m"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Height (cm)","ar":"الطول (سم)"},"text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"12 more questions below","ar":"12 سؤالًا آخر بالأسفل"},"gap":"s"}]}}],"answer":["both"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-046","when":["inline"],"feedback":{"en":"Heba sees one marked field at the top and thinks that's the only one. The other two are 12 questions down. A list at the top tells her there are three.","ar":"ترى هبة حقلًا واحدًا عليه علامة في الأعلى فتظن أنه الوحيد. أما الاثنان الآخران فبعد 12 سؤالًا. والقائمة في الأعلى تخبرها أنها ثلاثة."}},{"id":"MC-P01-046","when":["list"],"feedback":{"en":"Now she knows there are three, but when she scrolls to \"Injuries\", nothing marks it or says what to fix. Keep the message on each field too.","ar":"الآن تعرف أنها ثلاثة، لكن حين تنزل إلى «الإصابات» لا تجد عليه علامة ولا رسالة تقول ما يجب إصلاحه. أبقِ الرسالة على كل حقل أيضًا."}}],"hints":[{"en":"After Send, what does Heba need to know first: how many problems, or how to fix one?","ar":"بعد «أرسل»، ماذا تحتاج هبة أن تعرف أولًا: كم مشكلة، أم كيف تُصلح واحدة؟"},{"en":"And when she reaches each field, what should be waiting there?","ar":"وحين تصل إلى كل حقل، ماذا يجب أن يكون في انتظارها؟"}],"correct":{"en":"The list shows how many; each field shows how to fix it.","ar":"القائمة تُظهر كم خطأ؛ وكل حقل يُظهر كيف يُصلح."},"explain":{"en":"On a long form, some errors are always off screen. A list at the top gives the full picture, and the message on each field helps with the fix.","ar":"في النموذج الطويل، بعض الأخطاء تكون دائمًا خارج الشاشة. والقائمة في الأعلى تعطي الصورة كاملة، والرسالة على كل حقل تساعد في الإصلاح."},"speaker":"hana"},{"id":"S06","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P01-U04-01","part":"guided","rules":["R06","R15"],"value":{"en":"Form errors (NN/g): when the message stays by the field, people can see it while fixing the error instead of remembering it. A message that disappears after 3 seconds forces them to remember.","ar":"أخطاء النماذج (NN/g): حين تبقى الرسالة بجوار الحقل، يراها الناس أثناء إصلاح الخطأ بدل أن يتذكّروها. والرسالة التي تختفي بعد 3 ثوانٍ تجبرهم على التذكّر."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/errors-forms-design-guidelines/","quote":"users can see the error message while fixing the error instead of having to remember it."},"scenario":{"en":"Members pay for their plan in our app. When the card number is short, a message pops up at the bottom for 3 seconds and then disappears. Bassem looked down at his card, and when he looked up, the message was gone.","ar":"يدفع الأعضاء ثمن باقتهم من تطبيقنا. وحين يكون رقم البطاقة ناقصًا، تظهر رسالة أسفل الشاشة لمدة 3 ثوانٍ ثم تختفي. ونظر باسم إلى بطاقته، وحين رفع عينيه كانت الرسالة قد اختفت."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each version, 5 seconds after Pay. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل نسخة، بعد 5 ثوانٍ من «ادفع». أيّ نسخة ما زالت تخبر باسم بالمشكلة، في المكان الصحيح؟"},"start":"toast","options":[{"id":"toast","text":{"en":"Keep the 3-second message at the bottom","ar":"أبقِ الرسالة التي تظهر 3 ثوانٍ في الأسفل"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Payment","ar":"الدفع"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Card number","ar":"رقم البطاقة"},"filled":true,"text":"⁦4512 7731 0098 21⁩"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Expiry date","ar":"تاريخ الانتهاء"},"filled":true,"text":"08/28","gap":"s"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Pay 900 EGP","ar":"ادفع 900 جنيه"}}]}},{"id":"long","text":{"en":"Keep it at the bottom, but for 10 seconds","ar":"أبقِها في الأسفل، لكن لمدة 10 ثوانٍ"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Payment","ar":"الدفع"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Card number","ar":"رقم البطاقة"},"filled":true,"text":"⁦4512 7731 0098 21⁩"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Expiry date","ar":"تاريخ الانتهاء"},"filled":true,"text":"08/28","gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Pay 900 EGP","ar":"ادفع 900 جنيه"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"banner","tone":"bad","text":{"en":"Card number is incomplete.","ar":"رقم البطاقة غير مكتمل."},"gap":"l"}]}},{"id":"field","text":{"en":"Show it under the card number until it's fixed","ar":"اعرضها تحت رقم البطاقة حتى يُصلح الرقم"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Payment","ar":"الدفع"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Card number","ar":"رقم البطاقة"},"filled":true,"text":"⁦4512 7731 0098 21⁩","tone":"bad","error":{"en":"⚠ Card number needs 16 digits. This one has 14.","ar":"⚠ رقم البطاقة يحتاج 16 رقمًا، وأدخلت 14."}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Expiry date","ar":"تاريخ الانتهاء"},"filled":true,"text":"08/28","gap":"s"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Pay 900 EGP","ar":"ادفع 900 جنيه"}}]}}],"answer":["field"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-044","when":["toast"],"feedback":{"en":"The preview shows Bassem's screen 5 seconds later: nothing tells him what went wrong. He has to remember the message while he checks his card.","ar":"المعاينة تُظهر شاشة باسم بعد 5 ثوانٍ: لا شيء يخبره بما حدث. وعليه أن يتذكّر الرسالة وهو يراجع بطاقته."}},{"id":"MC-P01-044","when":["long"],"feedback":{"en":"It lasts longer, but it's still far from the field and will still vanish. A message that stays on the field is there for as long as he needs it.","ar":"تبقى مدة أطول، لكنها ما زالت بعيدة عن الحقل وستختفي أيضًا. والرسالة التي تبقى على الحقل موجودة طالما احتاجها."}}],"hints":[{"en":"How long does it take Bassem to read 16 digits off his card and fix them?","ar":"كم يستغرق باسم ليقرأ 16 رقمًا من بطاقته ويُصلحها؟"},{"en":"Which version is still there, in the right place, when he's done?","ar":"أي نسخة ما زالت موجودة، في المكان الصحيح، حين ينتهي؟"}],"correct":{"en":"The message stays on the field for as long as the problem does.","ar":"الرسالة تبقى على الحقل طالما بقيت المشكلة."},"explain":{"en":"Fixing takes time: people look away, check a card, type. An error that stays by its field is there whenever they look back.","ar":"الإصلاح يحتاج وقتًا: ينظر الناس بعيدًا، ويراجعون بطاقة، ويكتبون. والخطأ الذي يبقى بجوار حقله موجود كلما نظروا إليه."},"speaker":"hana"},{"id":"S07","type":"compare","skill":"SK-P01-U04-07","part":"contrast","rules":["R11","R15"],"value":{"en":"Contrast with S05: both versions have a summary at the top. Form errors (NN/g): the summary should give a global understanding of all the errors. \"There are errors\" doesn't; a list by field name does.","ar":"مقارنة مع الخطوة 5: النسختان فيهما ملخّص في الأعلى. أخطاء النماذج (NN/g): الملخّص يجب أن يعطي صورة شاملة عن كل الأخطاء. وعبارة «يوجد أخطاء» لا تفعل ذلك؛ أما القائمة بأسماء الحقول فتفعل."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/errors-forms-design-guidelines/","quote":"A validation summary can give the user a global understanding of all the errors in a form"},"scenario":{"en":"Our corporate membership form is long: company details, 5 employees, and billing. Two designers sent me different summaries for the top of the page. Both also mark each field.","ar":"نموذج اشتراك الشركات عندنا طويل: بيانات الشركة، و5 موظفين، والفاتورة. وأرسل لي مصمّمان ملخّصين مختلفين لأعلى الصفحة. وكلاهما يعلّم كل حقل أيضًا."},"prompt":{"en":"Which summary should ship?","ar":"أي ملخّص يجعل الناس يعرفون كم خطأ عليهم إصلاحه وأين؟"},"a":{"label":{"en":"General","ar":"عام"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"nashat.example/join","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Classes","ar":"الحصص"},{"en":"Branches","ar":"الفروع"},{"en":"Join","ar":"اشترك"}],"active":2},"blocks":[{"kind":"banner","tone":"bad","text":{"en":"Some fields have errors. Please check the form.","ar":"بعض الحقول فيها أخطاء. يُرجى مراجعة النموذج."}}]}},"b":{"label":{"en":"Listed","ar":"يذكر الحقول"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"nashat.example/join","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Classes","ar":"الحصص"},{"en":"Branches","ar":"الفروع"},{"en":"Join","ar":"اشترك"}],"active":2},"blocks":[{"kind":"banner","tone":"bad","text":{"en":"2 answers need a fix: Employee 3 phone, Billing email.","ar":"إجابتان تحتاجان إصلاحًا: هاتف الموظف 3، بريد الفاتورة."}}]}},"answer":"b","reason":{"prompt":{"en":"What makes the better summary work?","ar":"ما الذي يجعل الملخّص الأفضل ناجحًا؟"},"options":[{"id":"count","text":{"en":"It says how many and which fields, so people know where to go","ar":"يذكر عدد الأخطاء والحقول، فيعرف الناس إلى أين يذهبون"}},{"id":"polite","text":{"en":"It sounds more polite","ar":"يبدو أكثر أدبًا"}},{"id":"short","text":{"en":"It is shorter","ar":"أقصر"}}],"answer":["count"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-046","when":["polite","short"],"feedback":{"en":"Both are polite, and B is not shorter. The difference is that B names the fields, so people know how many to find and where.","ar":"كلاهما مؤدّب، وB ليس أقصر. الفرق أن B يذكر الحقول، فيعرف الناس كم حقلًا يبحثون عنه وأين."}}]},"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-046","when":["a"],"feedback":{"en":"A sends people hunting through 20 fields, with no idea how many problems there are. A summary has to name them.","ar":"A يجعل الناس يبحثون بين 20 حقلًا، دون أن يعرفوا كم مشكلة هناك. والملخّص يجب أن يذكرها."}}],"hints":[{"en":"After reading each one, does the person know when they're done fixing?","ar":"بعد قراءة كل ملخّص، هل يعرف الشخص متى ينتهي من الإصلاح؟"},{"en":"Which one names the fields?","ar":"أيّهما يذكر الحقول؟"}],"correct":{"en":"A summary that names the fields is a to-do list.","ar":"الملخّص الذي يذكر الحقول قائمة مهام."},"explain":{"en":"\"There are errors\" only repeats what the red marks say. A summary helps when it lists how many and which fields, so people know where to go and when they're done.","ar":"عبارة «توجد أخطاء» تكرّر فقط ما توضّحه العلامات الحمراء. والملخّص يفيد حين يذكر كم خطأ وأي حقول، فيعرف الناس إلى أين يذهبون ومتى ينتهون."},"speaker":"hana"},{"id":"S08","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P01-U04-06","part":"independent","speaker":"nour","rules":["R14","R19"],"value":{"en":"New case. Form errors (NN/g): color shouldn't be the only sign of an error. A label that turns red is easy to miss; words and an icon say it clearly.","ar":"حالة جديدة. أخطاء النماذج (NN/g): يجب ألّا يكون اللون العلامة الوحيدة للخطأ. والعنوان الذي يتحوّل إلى الأحمر يسهل أن يفوت؛ أما الكلمات والأيقونة فتقولانه بوضوح."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/errors-forms-design-guidelines/","quote":"shouldn't be used as the only form of error indication"},"scenario":{"en":"Patients book appointments on my clinic's website. If they skip the insurance number, we only turn its label red. Magdy is over 60, and he kept tapping Book without noticing anything had changed.","ar":"يحجز المرضى مواعيدهم من موقع عيادتي. وإن تركوا رقم التأمين فارغًا، نكتفي بتحويل عنوانه إلى الأحمر. ومجدي تجاوز الستين، وظلّ يضغط «احجز» دون أن يلاحظ أن شيئًا تغيّر."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each version. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل نسخة. أيّها يجب أن تُطلق؟"},"start":"label","options":[{"id":"label","text":{"en":"Keep the red label only","ar":"أبقِ العنوان الأحمر فقط"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"raha.example/book","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Doctors","ar":"الأطباء"},{"en":"Book","ar":"احجز"},{"en":"My visits","ar":"زياراتي"}],"active":1},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Appointment day","ar":"يوم الموعد"},"filled":true,"text":{"en":"Sunday 6 Dec","ar":"الأحد 6 ديسمبر"}},{"kind":"small","weight":"bold","color":"red","text":{"en":"Insurance number","ar":"رقم التأمين"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","text":"","gap":"xs"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Book","ar":"احجز"},"gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"both","text":{"en":"Red label and red border","ar":"عنوان أحمر وإطار أحمر"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"raha.example/book","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Doctors","ar":"الأطباء"},{"en":"Book","ar":"احجز"},{"en":"My visits","ar":"زياراتي"}],"active":1},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Appointment day","ar":"يوم الموعد"},"filled":true,"text":{"en":"Sunday 6 Dec","ar":"الأحد 6 ديسمبر"}},{"kind":"small","weight":"bold","color":"red","text":{"en":"Insurance number","ar":"رقم التأمين"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","text":"","tone":"bad","gap":"xs"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Book","ar":"احجز"},"gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"message","text":{"en":"Red border, an icon, and a message under the field","ar":"إطار أحمر، وأيقونة، ورسالة تحت الحقل"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"raha.example/book","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Doctors","ar":"الأطباء"},{"en":"Book","ar":"احجز"},{"en":"My visits","ar":"زياراتي"}],"active":1},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Appointment day","ar":"يوم الموعد"},"filled":true,"text":{"en":"Sunday 6 Dec","ar":"الأحد 6 ديسمبر"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Insurance number","ar":"رقم التأمين"},"text":"","tone":"bad","error":{"en":"⚠ Enter your insurance number, or choose \"I'll pay myself\" below.","ar":"⚠ اكتب رقم التأمين، أو اختر «سأدفع بنفسي» بالأسفل."},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Book","ar":"احجز"},"gap":"m"}]}}],"answer":["message"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-045","when":["label","both"],"feedback":{"en":"More red is still only red. Magdy didn't notice a color change; a message in words, with an icon, is hard to miss and tells him what to do.","ar":"إضافة المزيد من الأحمر لا تغيّر أنه لون فقط. لم يلاحظ مجدي تغيّر اللون؛ أما رسالة بالكلمات مع أيقونة فيصعب أن تفوته، وتخبره بما يفعل."}}],"correct":{"en":"Words and an icon reach Magdy, whatever he sees in red.","ar":"صحيح. الكلمات والأيقونة تصل إلى مجدي، مهما كانت قدرته على رؤية الأحمر."},"explain":{"en":"Color is a hint, not a message. Add words that say what's missing and an icon that catches the eye.","ar":"اللون إشارة، لا رسالة. أضف كلمات تذكر ما الناقص وأيقونة تلفت النظر."}},{"id":"S09","type":"card","part":"recap","icons":["pin","color","list","clock"],"title":{"en":"What you did","ar":"ماذا تعلّمت"},"body":{"en":"- **Next to the field:** moved Salma's mobile error from the top of the form to the field itself.\n- **More than color:** added an icon and words to a red border and a red label.\n- **A list on long forms:** listed every error at the top of a 14-question form, and kept each field marked.\n- **A summary that names fields:** chose a list of fields over \"Some fields have errors\".\n- **Messages that stay:** replaced a 3-second pop-up with a message on the card field.\n\nNext: the words inside the message.","ar":"- **بجوار الحقل:** نقلت خطأ موبايل سلمى من أعلى النموذج إلى الحقل نفسه.\n- **أكثر من اللون:** أضفت أيقونة وكلمات إلى إطار أحمر وعنوان أحمر.\n- **قائمة في النماذج الطويلة:** عرضت كل الأخطاء في قائمة أعلى استمارة من 14 سؤالًا، مع إبقاء العلامة على كل حقل.\n- **ملخّص يذكر الحقول:** اخترت قائمة بالحقول بدل «بعض الحقول فيها أخطاء».\n- **رسائل تبقى:** استبدلت الرسالة التي تختفي بعد 3 ثوانٍ برسالة على حقل البطاقة.\n\nالتالي: الكلمات داخل الرسالة."}}]}$uxg$::jsonb),
  ($uxg$P01-U04-L02$uxg$, $uxg$03e8355d703678c622152e41621b808a72efb613d96c1e499478ceb437d7fc67$uxg$, $uxg${"id":"P01-U04-L02","mode":"lesson","minutes":8,"title":{"en":"Words that help people fix it","ar":"كلمات تساعد الناس على الإصلاح"},"summary":{"en":"Rewrite error codes and blaming messages into words that tell people how to fix it.","ar":"أعد كتابة رموز الأخطاء والرسائل التي تلوم الناس بكلمات تخبرهم كيف يصلحون المشكلة."},"speaker":"hana","review_labels":{"MC-P01-047":{"en":"Say what's wrong and how to fix it","ar":"اذكر ما الخطأ وكيف يُصلح"},"MC-P01-048":{"en":"No codes or jargon in error messages","ar":"لا أكواد ولا مصطلحات تقنية في رسائل الخطأ"},"MC-P01-049":{"en":"Don't blame the person","ar":"لا تلُم الشخص"}},"steps":[{"id":"S01","type":"card","part":"hook","title":{"en":"Mahmoud's guest pass","ar":"دعوة محمود"},"body":{"en":"Members can invite a friend with a guest pass code. Mahmoud typed the code his friend sent him into our app and got \"Error 403: Invalid request.\"\n\nHe thought the app was broken and called the front desk. The code had simply ended a week earlier.","ar":"يستطيع الأعضاء دعوة صديق بكود دعوة. كتب محمود الكود الذي أرسله له صديقه في تطبيقنا، فظهرت له «Error 403: Invalid request».\n\nظنّ أن التطبيق معطّل واتصل بالاستقبال. والكود كان قد انتهى ببساطة قبل أسبوع."},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Guest pass","ar":"دعوة ضيف"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Guest pass code","ar":"كود الدعوة"},"filled":true,"text":"GP-7731","tone":"bad","error":{"en":"⚠ Error 403: Invalid request.","ar":"⚠ Error 403: Invalid request."}}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Use pass","ar":"استخدم الدعوة"}}]}},{"id":"S02","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P01-U04-02","part":"try","rules":["R12"],"value":{"en":"Try first. Error messages (NN/g): hide obscure error codes, or show them only for technical diagnosis. Mahmoud needs to know the pass ended and what he can do instead.","ar":"جرّب أولًا. رسائل الخطأ (NN/g): أخفِ أكواد الخطأ الغامضة، أو اعرضها فقط للتشخيص التقني. ومحمود يحتاج أن يعرف أن الدعوة انتهت وماذا يستطيع أن يفعل بدلًا منها."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/error-message-guidelines/","quote":"Hide or minimize the use of obscure error codes or abbreviations; show them for technical diagnostic purposes only."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each message. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل رسالة. أيّها يجب أن تُطلق؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Guest pass","ar":"دعوة ضيف"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Guest pass code","ar":"كود الدعوة"},"filled":true,"text":"GP-7731","tone":"bad","error":{"en":"⚠ Error 403: Invalid request.","ar":"⚠ Error 403: Invalid request."}}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Use pass","ar":"استخدم الدعوة"}}]},"options":[{"id":"keep","text":{"en":"Keep it; the code helps our developers","ar":"أبقِ الرسالة كما هي؛ فالكود يساعد المطوّرين عندنا"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Guest pass","ar":"دعوة ضيف"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Guest pass code","ar":"كود الدعوة"},"filled":true,"text":"GP-7731","tone":"bad","error":{"en":"⚠ Error 403: Invalid request.","ar":"⚠ Error 403: Invalid request."}}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Use pass","ar":"استخدم الدعوة"}}]}},{"id":"vague","text":{"en":"\"Something went wrong. Try again.\"","ar":"«حدث خطأ ما. حاول مرة أخرى.»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Guest pass","ar":"دعوة ضيف"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Guest pass code","ar":"كود الدعوة"},"filled":true,"text":"GP-7731","tone":"bad","error":{"en":"⚠ Something went wrong. Try again.","ar":"⚠ حدث خطأ ما. حاول مرة أخرى."}}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Use pass","ar":"استخدم الدعوة"}}]}},{"id":"clear","text":{"en":"Say the pass ended, and what to do instead","ar":"اذكر أن الدعوة انتهت، وماذا يفعل بدلًا منها"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Guest pass","ar":"دعوة ضيف"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Guest pass code","ar":"كود الدعوة"},"filled":true,"text":"GP-7731","tone":"bad","error":{"en":"⚠ This pass ended on 26 October. Ask your friend for a new one, or buy a day pass.","ar":"⚠ انتهت هذه الدعوة يوم 26 أكتوبر. اطلب دعوة جديدة من صديقك، أو اشترِ تذكرة يوم واحد."}}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Use pass","ar":"استخدم الدعوة"}}]}}],"answer":["clear"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-048","when":["keep"],"feedback":{"en":"\"403\" means something to our developers, not to Mahmoud. They can log the code; the screen should speak his language.","ar":"«403» تعني شيئًا للمطوّرين، لا لمحمود. يمكنهم تسجيل الكود في النظام؛ أما الشاشة فيجب أن تتكلّم بلغته."}},{"id":"MC-P01-047","when":["vague"],"feedback":{"en":"Plain words, but no help. \"Try again\" sends Mahmoud to type the same ended code again. Say what's wrong and what will work.","ar":"كلمات بسيطة، لكن بلا مساعدة. «حاول مرة أخرى» تجعل محمود يكتب الكود المنتهي نفسه مرة أخرى. قل ما الخطأ وما الذي سينجح."}}],"hints":[{"en":"After reading each message, does Mahmoud know why the code failed?","ar":"بعد قراءة كل رسالة، هل يعرف محمود لماذا فشل الكود؟"},{"en":"Which message also tells him what to do next?","ar":"أي رسالة تخبره أيضًا بما يفعل بعد ذلك؟"}],"correct":{"en":"He knows why it failed and has two ways forward.","ar":"يعرف لماذا فشل الكود، وأمامه طريقان للمتابعة."},"explain":{"en":"A useful error answers two questions in plain words: what went wrong, and what can I do now? Codes answer neither for the person on the screen.","ar":"رسالة الخطأ المفيدة تجيب عن سؤالين بكلمات بسيطة: ما الذي حدث، وماذا أستطيع أن أفعل الآن؟ والأكواد لا تجيب عن أيٍّ منهما لمن أمام الشاشة."}},{"id":"S03","type":"card","part":"concept","icons":["text","idea","person","ok"],"title":{"en":"What a good error says","ar":"ماذا تقول رسالة الخطأ الجيدة"},"body":{"en":"A good error message is short, but it does three jobs.\n\n- **What's wrong:** name the exact problem, like \"This pass ended on 26 October\", not \"Invalid input\".\n- **How to fix it:** give the next step, like \"Choose 3 November or later\".\n- **Plain words:** no error codes or technical terms. Developers can keep the code in their logs.\n- **No blame:** talk about the input (\"This date is in the past\"), not about the person (\"You entered a wrong date\").","ar":"رسالة الخطأ الجيدة قصيرة، لكنها تؤدّي ثلاث مهام.\n\n- **ما الخطأ:** اذكر المشكلة بدقة، مثل «انتهت هذه الدعوة يوم 26 أكتوبر»، لا «مُدخل غير صالح».\n- **كيف يُصلح:** أعطِ الخطوة التالية، مثل «اختر 3 نوفمبر أو بعده».\n- **كلمات بسيطة:** بلا أكواد خطأ أو مصطلحات تقنية. ويمكن للمطوّرين الاحتفاظ بالكود في سجلّاتهم.\n- **بلا لوم:** تحدّث عمّا كُتب («هذا التاريخ مضى»)، لا عن الشخص («أدخلت تاريخًا خاطئًا»)."}},{"id":"S04","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P01-U04-03","part":"guided","rules":["R06","R15"],"value":{"en":"Error messages (NN/g): don't use phrasing that blames users or implies they did something wrong. Inas didn't do anything wrong; the class filled up.","ar":"رسائل الخطأ (NN/g): لا تستخدم صياغة تلوم المستخدم أو توحي بأنه أخطأ. وإيناس لم تخطئ في شيء؛ الحصة امتلأت فقط."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/error-message-guidelines/","quote":"Don't use phrasing that blames users or implies they are doing something wrong"},"scenario":{"en":"Inas tried to book the 7 pm yoga class, which filled up while she was choosing. Our app said: \"You selected a full class. You must choose another class.\" She wrote a one-star review saying the app talks down to her.","ar":"حاولت إيناس حجز حصة اليوجا في السابعة مساءً، وقد امتلأت وهي تختار. فعرض تطبيقنا: «لقد اخترت حصة ممتلئة. يجب أن تختاري حصة أخرى.» فكتبت تقييمًا بنجمة واحدة تقول إن التطبيق يكلّمها بتعالٍ."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each message. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل رسالة. أيّها يجب أن تُطلق؟"},"start":"you","options":[{"id":"neutral","text":{"en":"\"Yoga at 7 pm just filled up. Join the waiting list, or book 8 pm.\"","ar":"«امتلأت حصة اليوجا في السابعة للتوّ. انضمّي لقائمة الانتظار، أو احجزي الثامنة.»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Book a class","ar":"احجز حصة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"radio","selected":true,"text":{"en":"Yoga, 7 pm","ar":"يوجا، 7 مساءً"}},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Yoga, 8 pm","ar":"يوجا، 8 مساءً"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"small","color":"red","text":{"en":"⚠ Yoga at 7 pm just filled up. Join the waiting list, or book 8 pm.","ar":"⚠ امتلأت حصة اليوجا في السابعة للتوّ. انضمّي لقائمة الانتظار، أو احجزي الثامنة."},"gap":"s"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Book","ar":"احجز"}}]}},{"id":"you","text":{"en":"Keep \"You selected a full class. You must choose another class.\"","ar":"أبقِ «لقد اخترت حصة ممتلئة. يجب أن تختاري حصة أخرى.»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Book a class","ar":"احجز حصة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"radio","selected":true,"text":{"en":"Yoga, 7 pm","ar":"يوجا، 7 مساءً"}},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Yoga, 8 pm","ar":"يوجا، 8 مساءً"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"small","color":"red","text":{"en":"⚠ You selected a full class. You must choose another class.","ar":"⚠ لقد اخترت حصة ممتلئة. يجب أن تختاري حصة أخرى."},"gap":"s"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Book","ar":"احجز"}}]}},{"id":"oops","text":{"en":"\"Oops! Wrong choice, this class is full.\"","ar":"«عفوًا! اختيار خاطئ، هذه الحصة ممتلئة.»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Book a class","ar":"احجز حصة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"radio","selected":true,"text":{"en":"Yoga, 7 pm","ar":"يوجا، 7 مساءً"}},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Yoga, 8 pm","ar":"يوجا، 8 مساءً"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"small","color":"red","text":{"en":"⚠ Oops! Wrong choice, this class is full.","ar":"⚠ عفوًا! اختيار خاطئ، هذه الحصة ممتلئة."},"gap":"s"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Book","ar":"احجز"}}]}}],"answer":["neutral"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-049","when":["you","oops"],"feedback":{"en":"\"You selected\" and \"Wrong choice\" make it sound like Inas made a mistake. She didn't: the class filled while she was choosing. Talk about the class, and offer what's still open.","ar":"«لقد اخترتِ» و«اختيار خاطئ» تجعلان الأمر يبدو كأن إيناس أخطأت. وهي لم تخطئ: الحصة امتلأت وهي تختار. تحدّث عن الحصة، واعرض ما زال متاحًا."}}],"hints":[{"en":"In each message, who is the subject of the sentence: Inas or the class?","ar":"في كل رسالة، من فاعل الجملة: إيناس أم الحصة؟"},{"en":"Which one also gives her a way to still work out tonight?","ar":"أي رسالة تعطيها أيضًا طريقة لتتمرّن الليلة رغم ذلك؟"}],"correct":{"en":"The message is about the class, and it offers two ways forward.","ar":"الرسالة عن الحصة، وتعرض طريقين للمتابعة."},"explain":{"en":"Errors feel like criticism when \"you\" is the subject. Make the input or the situation the subject, and end with what the person can do.","ar":"تبدو الأخطاء كأنها انتقاد حين يكون «أنت» فاعل الجملة. اجعل ما كُتب أو الموقف هو الفاعل، واختم بما يستطيع الشخص فعله."},"speaker":"hana"},{"id":"S05","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P01-U04-02","part":"guided","rules":["R06","R15"],"value":{"en":"Error messages (NN/g): just stating the problem is not enough; offer a possible remedy. \"Invalid date\" names a problem; \"Choose 3 November or later\" fixes it.","ar":"رسائل الخطأ (NN/g): ذكر المشكلة وحده لا يكفي؛ اعرض حلًا ممكنًا. و«تاريخ غير صالح» تذكر مشكلة؛ أما «اختر 3 نوفمبر أو بعده» فتحلّها."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/error-message-guidelines/","quote":"Merely stating the problem is also not enough; offer some potential remedies."},"scenario":{"en":"Members can freeze their membership while they travel. A freeze can start tomorrow at the earliest. Marwa typed today's date and got \"Invalid date\", then tried two other formats of the same date.","ar":"يستطيع الأعضاء تجميد اشتراكهم أثناء السفر. ولا يمكن أن يبدأ التجميد قبل الغد. كتبت مروة تاريخ اليوم فظهرت «تاريخ غير صالح»، فجرّبت صيغتين أخريين للتاريخ نفسه."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each message. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل رسالة. أيّها يجب أن تُطلق؟"},"start":"invalid","options":[{"id":"invalid","text":{"en":"Keep \"Invalid date.\"","ar":"أبقِ «تاريخ غير صالح.»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Freeze membership","ar":"تجميد العضوية"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Freeze starts on","ar":"يبدأ التجميد يوم"},"filled":true,"text":"02/11/2026","tone":"bad","error":{"en":"⚠ Invalid date.","ar":"⚠ تاريخ غير صالح."}}]}},{"id":"fix","text":{"en":"\"A freeze can start from tomorrow. Choose 3 November or later.\"","ar":"«يمكن أن يبدأ التجميد من الغد. اختاري 3 نوفمبر أو بعده.»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Freeze membership","ar":"تجميد العضوية"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Freeze starts on","ar":"يبدأ التجميد يوم"},"filled":true,"text":"02/11/2026","tone":"bad","error":{"en":"⚠ A freeze can start from tomorrow. Choose 3 November or later.","ar":"⚠ يمكن أن يبدأ التجميد من الغد. اختاري 3 نوفمبر أو بعده."}}]}},{"id":"problem","text":{"en":"\"This date is not accepted for a freeze.\"","ar":"«هذا التاريخ غير مقبول للتجميد.»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Freeze membership","ar":"تجميد العضوية"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Freeze starts on","ar":"يبدأ التجميد يوم"},"filled":true,"text":"02/11/2026","tone":"bad","error":{"en":"⚠ This date is not accepted for a freeze.","ar":"⚠ هذا التاريخ غير مقبول للتجميد."}}]}}],"answer":["fix"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-047","when":["invalid","problem"],"feedback":{"en":"Marwa already knows the date was refused; she doesn't know why, so she changed the format. Tell her the rule and a date that works.","ar":"تعرف مروة بالفعل أن التاريخ رُفض؛ لكنها لا تعرف لماذا، فغيّرت الصيغة. أخبرها بالقاعدة وبتاريخ ينجح."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Why did Marwa try other formats of the same date?","ar":"لماذا جرّبت مروة صيغًا أخرى للتاريخ نفسه؟"},{"en":"Which message tells her which dates will work?","ar":"أي رسالة تخبرها بالتواريخ التي ستنجح؟"}],"correct":{"en":"She learns the rule and the first date that works.","ar":"تعرف القاعدة وأول تاريخ ينجح."},"explain":{"en":"\"Invalid\" leaves people guessing what part is wrong. Name the rule, then give an answer that fits it.","ar":"كلمة «غير صالح» تترك الناس يخمّنون أي جزء خطأ. اذكر القاعدة، ثم أعطِ إجابة تناسبها."},"speaker":"hana"},{"id":"S06","type":"words","skill":"SK-P01-U04-02","part":"guided","confidence":true,"rules":["R06","R15"],"value":{"en":"Form errors (NN/g): an error message should be explicit, human-readable, polite, precise, and give constructive advice. Bank codes and \"issuer\" fail the human-readable test.","ar":"أخطاء النماذج (NN/g): رسالة الخطأ يجب أن تكون صريحة، ومفهومة للبشر، ومهذّبة، ودقيقة، وتقدّم نصيحة مفيدة. وأكواد البنك وكلمة «الجهة المُصدِرة» لا تجتاز اختبار «مفهومة للبشر»."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/errors-forms-design-guidelines/","quote":"it should be explicit, human-readable, polite, precise, and give constructive advice."},"scenario":{"en":"Gamal renewed his membership online. His bank refused the card for low balance, and our payment page sends back the code \"51\".","ar":"جدّد جمال اشتراكه من الموقع. ورفض بنكه البطاقة لعدم كفاية الرصيد، وصفحة الدفع عندنا تُرجع الكود «51»."},"prompt":{"en":"Which message should Gamal see?","ar":"أي رسالة يجب أن يراها جمال؟"},"options":[{"id":"code","text":{"en":"\"Payment failed (ERR_CARD_51).\"","ar":"«فشل الدفع (ERR_CARD_51).»"}},{"id":"plain","text":{"en":"\"Your bank declined this card because of low balance. Try another card, or pay at the front desk.\"","ar":"«رفض بنكك هذه البطاقة بسبب عدم كفاية الرصيد. جرّب بطاقة أخرى، أو ادفع في الاستقبال.»"}},{"id":"jargon","text":{"en":"\"Transaction declined by issuer.\"","ar":"«رُفضت المعاملة من الجهة المُصدِرة.»"}}],"answer":["plain"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-048","when":["code","jargon"],"feedback":{"en":"A code and the word \"issuer\" are bank language. Gamal can't tell whether the problem is his card, our site, or his internet.","ar":"الكود وكلمة «الجهة المُصدِرة» لغة بنوك. ولا يستطيع جمال أن يعرف هل المشكلة في بطاقته، أم في موقعنا، أم في الإنترنت عنده."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Which message could Gamal explain to a friend?","ar":"أي رسالة يستطيع جمال أن يشرحها لصديق؟"},{"en":"Which one says what he can do next?","ar":"أيّها يقول ما يستطيع فعله بعد ذلك؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Plain words, the real reason, and two ways to pay.","ar":"كلمات بسيطة، والسبب الحقيقي، وطريقتان للدفع."},"explain":{"en":"Translate system codes into the person's words: what happened, why, and what to try next.","ar":"ترجم أكواد النظام إلى كلمات يفهمها الشخص: ماذا حدث، ولماذا، وماذا يجرّب بعد ذلك."},"speaker":"hana"},{"id":"S07","type":"compare","skill":"SK-P01-U04-03","part":"contrast","rules":["R11","R15"],"value":{"en":"Contrast with S05: both messages here say how to fix it. Error messages (NN/g): don't use phrasing that blames users. The difference is only who the sentence is about.","ar":"مقارنة مع الخطوة 5: الرسالتان هنا تقولان كيف يُصلح الخطأ. رسائل الخطأ (NN/g): لا تستخدم صياغة تلوم المستخدم. والفرق فقط في من تتحدّث عنه الجملة."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/error-message-guidelines/","quote":"Don't use phrasing that blames users or implies they are doing something wrong"},"scenario":{"en":"Asmaa typed her birth date as 09/13/1995, month first. Our form reads day first, so it found month 13. I have two messages to choose from.","ar":"كتبت أسماء تاريخ ميلادها 09/13/1995، الشهر أولًا. ونموذجنا يقرأ اليوم أولًا، فوجد الشهر 13. وأمامي رسالتان أختار بينهما."},"prompt":{"en":"Which message should ship?","ar":"أي رسالة تساعد أسماء على تصحيح التاريخ دون أن تلومها؟"},"a":{"label":{"en":"About Asmaa","ar":"عن أسماء"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Your details","ar":"بياناتك"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Date of birth","ar":"تاريخ الميلاد"},"filled":true,"text":"09/13/1995","tone":"bad","error":{"en":"⚠ You entered the date wrong. Use day/month/year, like 13/09/1995.","ar":"⚠ أدخلتِ التاريخ بشكل خاطئ. استخدمي يوم/شهر/سنة، مثل 13/09/1995."}}]}},"b":{"label":{"en":"About the date","ar":"عن التاريخ"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Your details","ar":"بياناتك"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Date of birth","ar":"تاريخ الميلاد"},"filled":true,"text":"09/13/1995","tone":"bad","error":{"en":"⚠ There's no month 13. Enter day/month/year, like 13/09/1995.","ar":"⚠ لا يوجد شهر 13. اكتبي يوم/شهر/سنة، مثل 13/09/1995."}}]}},"answer":"b","reason":{"prompt":{"en":"What makes B better?","ar":"ما الذي يجعل B أفضل؟"},"options":[{"id":"fix","text":{"en":"Only B gives an example","ar":"B وحدها تعطي مثالًا"}},{"id":"subject","text":{"en":"B talks about the date, not about a mistake Asmaa made","ar":"B تتحدّث عن التاريخ، لا عن خطأ ارتكبته أسماء"}},{"id":"shorter","text":{"en":"B is shorter","ar":"B أقصر"}}],"answer":["subject"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-049","when":["fix","shorter"],"feedback":{"en":"Both give the same example and are about as long. The only difference is \"You entered the date wrong\" versus \"There's no month 13\".","ar":"كلتاهما تعطي المثال نفسه وطولهما متقارب. والفرق الوحيد هو «أدخلتِ التاريخ بشكل خاطئ» مقابل «لا يوجد شهر 13»."}}]},"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-049","when":["a"],"feedback":{"en":"A is helpful but opens by telling Asmaa she got it wrong. Many countries write month first; she wasn't careless. B says the same fix without the blame.","ar":"A مفيدة لكنها تبدأ بإخبار أسماء أنها أخطأت. وكثير من البلاد تكتب الشهر أولًا؛ فهي لم تكن مهملة. وB تذكر الإصلاح نفسه بلا لوم."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Both messages give the fix. What's different in the first few words?","ar":"الرسالتان تعطيان الإصلاح. ما المختلف في الكلمات الأولى؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Same fix, without the blame.","ar":"الإصلاح نفسه، بلا لوم."},"explain":{"en":"When two messages are equally helpful, choose the one about the input. \"There's no month 13\" explains; \"You entered it wrong\" judges.","ar":"حين تتساوى رسالتان في الفائدة، اختر التي تتحدّث عن التاريخ المكتوب. «لا يوجد شهر 13» تشرح؛ و«أدخلتِه بشكل خاطئ» تحكم."},"speaker":"hana"},{"id":"S08","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P01-U04-03","part":"independent","speaker":"karim","rules":["R14","R19"],"value":{"en":"New case. Error messages (NN/g): don't imply the user did something wrong. A message about the number itself, with where to check it, helps without accusing.","ar":"حالة جديدة. رسائل الخطأ (NN/g): لا توحِ بأن المستخدم أخطأ. والرسالة التي تتحدّث عن الرقم نفسه، مع مكان مراجعته، تساعد دون اتهام."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/error-message-guidelines/","quote":"Don't use phrasing that blames users or implies they are doing something wrong"},"scenario":{"en":"I'm building a bank's transfer screen. Account numbers at this bank have 16 digits. Sherif pasted 12 digits from a chat, and our current message says \"You entered an invalid account number.\"","ar":"أبني شاشة التحويل في تطبيق بنك. وأرقام الحسابات في هذا البنك 16 رقمًا. لصق شريف 12 رقمًا من محادثة، ورسالتنا الحالية تقول «أدخلت رقم حساب غير صالح.»"},"prompt":{"en":"Try each message. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل رسالة. أيّها يجب أن تُطلق؟"},"start":"you","options":[{"id":"digits","text":{"en":"\"This number has 12 digits. Our account numbers have 16; check the full number with the receiver.\"","ar":"«الرقم المكتوب 12 رقمًا، وأرقام الحسابات عندنا 16؛ راجع الرقم كاملًا مع المستلم.»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rasid","name":{"en":"Rasid","ar":"رصيد"},"color":"#1C3D6E","icon":"bank","domain":"rasid.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Transfer","ar":"تحويل"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Account number","ar":"رقم الحساب"},"filled":true,"text":"⁦1004 2231 9870⁩","tone":"bad","error":{"en":"⚠ This number has 12 digits. Our account numbers have 16; check the full number with the receiver.","ar":"⚠ الرقم المكتوب 12 رقمًا، وأرقام الحسابات عندنا 16؛ راجع الرقم كاملًا مع المستلم."}}]}},{"id":"you","text":{"en":"Keep \"You entered an invalid account number.\"","ar":"أبقِ «أدخلت رقم حساب غير صالح.»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rasid","name":{"en":"Rasid","ar":"رصيد"},"color":"#1C3D6E","icon":"bank","domain":"rasid.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Transfer","ar":"تحويل"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Account number","ar":"رقم الحساب"},"filled":true,"text":"⁦1004 2231 9870⁩","tone":"bad","error":{"en":"⚠ You entered an invalid account number.","ar":"⚠ أدخلت رقم حساب غير صالح."}}]}},{"id":"careful","text":{"en":"\"You made a mistake. Please be more careful with account numbers.\"","ar":"«لقد أخطأت. يُرجى الانتباه أكثر لأرقام الحسابات.»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rasid","name":{"en":"Rasid","ar":"رصيد"},"color":"#1C3D6E","icon":"bank","domain":"rasid.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Transfer","ar":"تحويل"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Account number","ar":"رقم الحساب"},"filled":true,"text":"⁦1004 2231 9870⁩","tone":"bad","error":{"en":"⚠ You made a mistake. Please be more careful with account numbers.","ar":"⚠ لقد أخطأت. يُرجى الانتباه أكثر لأرقام الحسابات."}}]}}],"answer":["digits"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-049","when":["you","careful"],"feedback":{"en":"Both point at Sherif, and neither says what's wrong with the number. The number was cut off in the chat; describe the number, and say where to get the full one.","ar":"الرسالتان تشيران إلى شريف، ولا توضّح أيٌّ منهما مشكلة الرقم. الرقم انقطع في المحادثة؛ صِف الرقم، واذكر أين يجد الرقم كاملًا."}}],"correct":{"en":"It describes the number, not Sherif, and says how to get the right one.","ar":"تصف الرقم، لا شريف، وتوضّح كيف يحصل على الرقم الصحيح."},"explain":{"en":"Count and compare: \"12 digits, we need 16\" is precise, neutral, and points straight to the fix.","ar":"اعدد وقارن: «12 رقمًا، ونحتاج 16» دقيقة، ومحايدة، وتشير مباشرة إلى الإصلاح."}},{"id":"S09","type":"card","part":"recap","icons":["text","idea","person","ok"],"title":{"en":"What you did","ar":"ماذا تعلّمت"},"body":{"en":"- **No codes:** replaced \"Error 403\" with the date the pass ended and two ways forward.\n- **The fix, not just the problem:** turned \"Invalid date\" into the first date that works.\n- **Plain words:** chose low balance and another card over a bank code and \"issuer\".\n- **No blame:** made the class, the date and the account number the subject, not the person.\n\nNext: when to show an error, and what to keep.","ar":"- **بلا أكواد:** استبدلت «Error 403» بتاريخ انتهاء الدعوة وطريقين للمتابعة.\n- **الإصلاح، لا المشكلة فقط:** حوّلت «تاريخ غير صالح» إلى أول تاريخ ينجح.\n- **كلمات بسيطة:** اخترت «عدم كفاية الرصيد» و«بطاقة أخرى» بدل كود البنك و«الجهة المُصدِرة».\n- **بلا لوم:** جعلت الحصة والتاريخ ورقم الحساب فاعل الجملة، لا الشخص.\n\nالتالي: متى تعرض الخطأ، وماذا تحتفظ به."}}]}$uxg$::jsonb),
  ($uxg$P01-U04-L03$uxg$, $uxg$89c03686e6e59ebc2ffbc2c24a7c66751c0b4c6fdf911e38acc80ae8babf6a5e$uxg$, $uxg${"id":"P01-U04-L03","mode":"lesson","minutes":8,"title":{"en":"The right moment, and nothing lost","ar":"اللحظة المناسبة، ولا شيء يضيع"},"summary":{"en":"Choose when errors appear and keep what people typed when something goes wrong.","ar":"اختر متى تظهر الأخطاء، واحتفظ بما كتبه الناس حين يحدث خطأ."},"speaker":"hana","review_labels":{"MC-P01-050":{"en":"Wait until the person leaves the field","ar":"انتظر حتى يغادر الشخص الحقل"},"MC-P01-051":{"en":"Keep what people typed","ar":"احتفظ بما كتبه الناس"}},"steps":[{"id":"S01","type":"card","part":"hook","title":{"en":"Tamer's sign-up","ar":"تسجيل تامر"},"body":{"en":"Tamer made an account in my gym's app. He typed one letter of his email, and \"Invalid email\" appeared in red. It stayed red the whole time he typed.\n\nThen he tapped Create account. His mobile number was already on another account, and the whole form came back empty, even the parts that were right.","ar":"أنشأ تامر حسابًا في تطبيق ناديّ. كتب حرفًا واحدًا من بريده، فظهرت «بريد غير صالح» باللون الأحمر. وظلّت حمراء طوال وقت الكتابة.\n\nثم ضغط «أنشئ الحساب». كان رقم موبايله مسجّلًا على حساب آخر، فعاد النموذج كله فارغًا، حتى الأجزاء الصحيحة."},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Create account","ar":"إنشاء حساب"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Email","ar":"البريد الإلكتروني"},"filled":true,"focus":true,"text":"t","tone":"bad","error":{"en":"⚠ Invalid email.","ar":"⚠ بريد غير صالح."}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Mobile number","ar":"رقم الموبايل"},"text":"","gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"S02","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P01-U04-04","part":"try","rules":["R12"],"value":{"en":"Try first. Hostile error messages (NN/g): premature errors appear before the person had a chance to finish. Checking an email after one letter is premature; checking when Tamer moves on is not.","ar":"جرّب أولًا. رسائل الخطأ العدائية (NN/g): الأخطاء المبكّرة تظهر قبل أن يتمكّن الشخص من الإنهاء. والتحقّق من البريد بعد حرف واحد مبكّر؛ أما التحقّق حين ينتقل تامر لما بعده فليس كذلك."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/hostile-error-messages/","quote":"Premature error messages are error messages that are presented by the system too early"},"prompt":{"en":"Try each timing. Each preview shows two moments. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل توقيت. كل معاينة تُظهر لحظتين. أيّها يجب أن يُطلق؟"},"start":"typing","options":[{"id":"typing","text":{"en":"Keep checking with every letter","ar":"أبقِ التحقّق مع كل حرف"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Create account","ar":"إنشاء حساب"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"While typing","ar":"أثناء الكتابة"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Email","ar":"البريد الإلكتروني"},"filled":true,"focus":true,"text":"tamer.h@","tone":"bad","error":{"en":"⚠ Enter an email like name@example.com.","ar":"⚠ اكتب بريدًا مثل name@example.com."},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"After moving to the next field","ar":"بعد الانتقال إلى الحقل التالي"},"gap":"l"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Email","ar":"البريد الإلكتروني"},"filled":true,"text":"tamer.h@mail","tone":"bad","error":{"en":"⚠ Enter an email like name@example.com.","ar":"⚠ اكتب بريدًا مثل name@example.com."},"gap":"xs"}]}},{"id":"submit","text":{"en":"Check only when he taps Create account","ar":"تحقّق فقط حين يضغط «أنشئ الحساب»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Create account","ar":"إنشاء حساب"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"While typing","ar":"أثناء الكتابة"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Email","ar":"البريد الإلكتروني"},"filled":true,"focus":true,"text":"tamer.h@","gap":"xs"},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"After moving to the next field","ar":"بعد الانتقال إلى الحقل التالي"},"gap":"l"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Email","ar":"البريد الإلكتروني"},"filled":true,"text":"tamer.h@mail","gap":"xs"}]}},{"id":"leave","text":{"en":"Check when he leaves the field","ar":"تحقّق حين يغادر الحقل"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Create account","ar":"إنشاء حساب"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"While typing","ar":"أثناء الكتابة"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Email","ar":"البريد الإلكتروني"},"filled":true,"focus":true,"text":"tamer.h@","gap":"xs"},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"After moving to the next field","ar":"بعد الانتقال إلى الحقل التالي"},"gap":"l"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Email","ar":"البريد الإلكتروني"},"filled":true,"text":"tamer.h@mail","tone":"bad","error":{"en":"⚠ Enter an email like name@example.com.","ar":"⚠ اكتب بريدًا مثل name@example.com."},"gap":"xs"}]}}],"answer":["leave"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-050","when":["typing"],"feedback":{"en":"Every email is \"wrong\" until the last letter. Red while Tamer types tells him nothing he doesn't know, and makes the form feel like it's scolding him.","ar":"كل بريد يكون «خاطئًا» حتى آخر حرف. والأحمر أثناء كتابة تامر لا يخبره بشيء لا يعرفه، ويجعل النموذج يبدو كأنه يوبّخه."}},{"id":"MC-P01-050","when":["submit"],"feedback":{"en":"Look at the second moment: the missing \".com\" goes unnoticed, and Tamer only finds out at the end, after moving on to other fields. Check as soon as he leaves the field.","ar":"انظر إلى اللحظة الثانية: «.com» الناقصة لا يلاحظها أحد، ولا يعرف تامر إلا في النهاية، بعد أن انتقل إلى حقول أخرى. تحقّق بمجرّد أن يغادر الحقل."}}],"hints":[{"en":"In the first moment, is Tamer done typing?","ar":"في اللحظة الأولى، هل انتهى تامر من الكتابة؟"},{"en":"In the second moment, he's done but made a typo. Which version tells him right then?","ar":"في اللحظة الثانية، انتهى لكن فيه خطأ. أي نسخة تخبره حينها؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Quiet while he types, clear once he moves on.","ar":"صحيح. لا رسائل أثناء الكتابة، ورسالة واضحة بمجرّد أن ينتقل."},"explain":{"en":"Leaving a field means \"I'm done\". That's the moment to check: early enough to fix while it's fresh, late enough not to interrupt.","ar":"مغادرة الحقل تعني «انتهيت». وهذه لحظة التحقّق: مبكّرة بما يكفي للإصلاح والأمر حاضر في الذهن، ومتأخرة بما يكفي حتى لا تقاطع."}},{"id":"S03","type":"card","part":"concept","icons":["clock","eye","ok","warn"],"title":{"en":"Check at the right time, and keep everything","ar":"تحقّق في الوقت المناسب، واحتفظ بكل شيء"},"body":{"en":"When an error appears matters as much as what it says.\n\n- **Not while typing:** an error after the first letter feels like scolding. People haven't finished yet.\n- **When they leave the field:** that's when they're done with it, so check then, and they can fix it right away.\n- **Keep every answer:** never empty the form after an error. Keep the right answers, and keep the wrong one too, marked, so people can edit it instead of starting over.","ar":"توقيت ظهور الخطأ مهم بقدر ما تقوله رسالته.\n\n- **ليس أثناء الكتابة:** الخطأ بعد أول حرف يبدو كتوبيخ. الناس لم ينتهوا بعد.\n- **حين يغادرون الحقل:** هذه لحظة انتهائهم منه، فتحقّق حينها، ويستطيعون الإصلاح فورًا.\n- **احتفظ بكل إجابة:** لا تُفرغ النموذج أبدًا بعد خطأ. احتفظ بالإجابات الصحيحة، واحتفظ بالخاطئة أيضًا مع علامة، ليعدّلها الناس بدل أن يبدؤوا من جديد."}},{"id":"S04","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P01-U04-05","part":"guided","rules":["R06","R15"],"value":{"en":"Form usability (NN/g): erroneous input should be preserved so users can correct it, with a specific explanation. Keeping the number lets Tamer see which one he typed.","ar":"سهولة استخدام النماذج (NN/g): يجب الاحتفاظ بالمُدخل الخاطئ ليُصلحه المستخدم، مع شرح محدّد للمشكلة. والاحتفاظ بالرقم يتيح لتامر أن يرى أي رقم كتب."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/web-form-design/","quote":"Erroneous input should be preserved so users can correct it, and accompanied by a specific explanation of the problem."},"scenario":{"en":"Back to Tamer tapping Create account. His mobile number is already on another account: his wife signed up with it last year.","ar":"نعود إلى تامر وهو يضغط «أنشئ الحساب». رقم موبايله مسجّل على حساب آخر: زوجته اشتركت به العام الماضي."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each version of what happens after Create account. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل نسخة لما يحدث بعد «أنشئ الحساب». أيّ نسخة تتيح لتامر أن يصلح رقم الموبايل دون أن يعيد كتابة باقي النموذج؟"},"start":"empty","options":[{"id":"keepall","text":{"en":"Keep every answer, and mark the mobile number","ar":"احتفظ بكل الإجابات، وعلّم رقم الموبايل"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Create account","ar":"إنشاء حساب"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Full name","ar":"الاسم الكامل"},"filled":true,"text":{"en":"Tamer Hassan","ar":"تامر حسن"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Email","ar":"البريد الإلكتروني"},"filled":true,"text":"tamer.h@mail.com","gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Mobile number","ar":"رقم الموبايل"},"filled":true,"text":"⁦0122 345 6789⁩","tone":"bad","error":{"en":"⚠ This number is already on another account. Use a different number, or sign in to that account.","ar":"⚠ هذا الرقم مسجّل على حساب آخر. استخدم رقمًا مختلفًا، أو سجّل الدخول إلى ذلك الحساب."},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Password","ar":"كلمة المرور"},"filled":true,"text":"••••••••","gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"empty","text":{"en":"Keep it: show the error on an empty form","ar":"أبقِ الوضع الحالي: اعرض الخطأ على نموذج فارغ"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Create account","ar":"إنشاء حساب"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"banner","tone":"bad","text":{"en":"This mobile number is already on another account.","ar":"رقم الموبايل هذا مسجّل على حساب آخر."}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Full name","ar":"الاسم الكامل"},"text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Email","ar":"البريد الإلكتروني"},"text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Mobile number","ar":"رقم الموبايل"},"text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Password","ar":"كلمة المرور"},"text":"","gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"clearone","text":{"en":"Keep the other answers, but clear the mobile field","ar":"احتفظ بالإجابات الأخرى، لكن امسح حقل الموبايل"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Create account","ar":"إنشاء حساب"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Full name","ar":"الاسم الكامل"},"filled":true,"text":{"en":"Tamer Hassan","ar":"تامر حسن"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Email","ar":"البريد الإلكتروني"},"filled":true,"text":"tamer.h@mail.com","gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Mobile number","ar":"رقم الموبايل"},"text":"","tone":"bad","error":{"en":"⚠ This number is already on another account. Use a different number, or sign in to that account.","ar":"⚠ هذا الرقم مسجّل على حساب آخر. استخدم رقمًا مختلفًا، أو سجّل الدخول إلى ذلك الحساب."},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Password","ar":"كلمة المرور"},"filled":true,"text":"••••••••","gap":"s"}]}}],"answer":["keepall"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-051","when":["empty"],"feedback":{"en":"One field had a problem, and Tamer has to type four again. Many people won't. Keep what he typed.","ar":"حقل واحد فيه مشكلة، وعلى تامر أن يكتب أربعة حقول من جديد. وكثيرون لن يفعلوا. احتفظ بما كتبه."}},{"id":"MC-P01-051","when":["clearone"],"feedback":{"en":"Better, but now the message talks about \"this number\" and the field is empty. Tamer can't see which number we mean. Keep it so he can compare and change it.","ar":"أفضل، لكن الرسالة الآن تتحدّث عن «هذا الرقم» والحقل فارغ. ولا يرى تامر أي رقم نقصد. احتفظ به ليقارن ويغيّره."}}],"hints":[{"en":"How many fields had a problem, and how many does Tamer have to retype in each version?","ar":"كم حقلًا فيه مشكلة، وكم حقلًا على تامر أن يعيد كتابته في كل نسخة؟"},{"en":"To fix a wrong answer, does it help to still see it?","ar":"لإصلاح إجابة خاطئة، هل يفيد أن تظل تراها؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Nothing is lost, and the problem number is right there to change.","ar":"لا شيء يضيع، والرقم الذي فيه المشكلة أمامه ليغيّره."},"explain":{"en":"An error should cost one fix, not a whole form. Keep every answer, including the wrong one, and say what's wrong with it.","ar":"الخطأ يجب أن يكلّف إصلاحًا واحدًا، لا نموذجًا كاملًا. احتفظ بكل إجابة، حتى الخاطئة، واذكر ما مشكلتها."},"speaker":"hana"},{"id":"S05","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P01-U04-04","part":"guided","rules":["R06","R15"],"value":{"en":"Hostile error messages (NN/g): showing errors while the person types feels like an unwarranted scolding. For a password, say the rule up front and check when the person leaves the field.","ar":"رسائل الخطأ العدائية (NN/g): عرض الأخطاء أثناء الكتابة يبدو كتوبيخ بلا سبب. وفي كلمة المرور، اذكر القاعدة مسبقًا وتحقّق حين يغادر الشخص الحقل."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/hostile-error-messages/","quote":"Displaying error messages while the user types feels like an unwarranted scolding and can be irritating."},"scenario":{"en":"Passwords in our app need at least 8 characters. Right now \"Too short\" shows in red from the very first character. Rania said it felt like the app was shouting at her.","ar":"كلمات المرور في تطبيقنا تحتاج 8 أحرف على الأقل. والآن تظهر «قصيرة جدًا» بالأحمر من أول حرف. وقالت رانيا إنها شعرت كأن التطبيق يصرخ فيها."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each version. Each preview shows two moments. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل نسخة. كل معاينة تُظهر لحظتين. أيّ نسخة تخبر رانيا بالقاعدة دون أن توبّخها أثناء الكتابة؟"},"start":"red","options":[{"id":"red","text":{"en":"Keep \"Too short\" in red from the first character","ar":"أبقِ «قصيرة جدًا» بالأحمر من أول حرف"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Create account","ar":"إنشاء حساب"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"After 3 characters","ar":"بعد 3 أحرف"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Password","ar":"كلمة المرور"},"filled":true,"focus":true,"text":"•••","tone":"bad","error":{"en":"⚠ Too short.","ar":"⚠ قصيرة جدًا."},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"After she moves on with 6 characters","ar":"بعد أن تنتقل وفيها 6 أحرف"},"gap":"l"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Password","ar":"كلمة المرور"},"filled":true,"text":"••••••","tone":"bad","error":{"en":"⚠ Too short.","ar":"⚠ قصيرة جدًا."},"gap":"xs"}]}},{"id":"rule","text":{"en":"Show the rule under the label, and check when she leaves the field","ar":"اعرض القاعدة تحت العنوان، وتحقّق حين تغادر الحقل"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Create account","ar":"إنشاء حساب"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"After 3 characters","ar":"بعد 3 أحرف"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Password","ar":"كلمة المرور"},"hintFirst":true,"hint":{"en":"At least 8 characters","ar":"8 أحرف على الأقل"},"filled":true,"focus":true,"text":"•••","gap":"xs"},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"After she moves on with 6 characters","ar":"بعد أن تنتقل وفيها 6 أحرف"},"gap":"l"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Password","ar":"كلمة المرور"},"hintFirst":true,"hint":{"en":"At least 8 characters","ar":"8 أحرف على الأقل"},"filled":true,"text":"••••••","tone":"bad","error":{"en":"⚠ This password has 6 characters. Add 2 more.","ar":"⚠ كلمة المرور هذه 6 أحرف. أضيفي حرفين."},"gap":"xs"}]}},{"id":"grey","text":{"en":"Keep checking from the first character, but in grey","ar":"أبقِ التحقّق من أول حرف، لكن بالرمادي"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Create account","ar":"إنشاء حساب"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"After 3 characters","ar":"بعد 3 أحرف"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Password","ar":"كلمة المرور"},"filled":true,"focus":true,"text":"•••","gap":"xs"},{"kind":"small","color":"pale","text":{"en":"Too short.","ar":"قصيرة جدًا."},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"After she moves on with 6 characters","ar":"بعد أن تنتقل وفيها 6 أحرف"},"gap":"l"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Password","ar":"كلمة المرور"},"filled":true,"text":"••••••","gap":"xs"},{"kind":"small","color":"pale","text":{"en":"Too short.","ar":"قصيرة جدًا."},"gap":"xs"}]}}],"answer":["rule"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-050","when":["red"],"feedback":{"en":"After 3 characters, Rania is still typing. Telling her it's too short is like correcting a sentence before she finishes it.","ar":"بعد 3 أحرف، ما زالت رانيا تكتب. وإخبارها أنها قصيرة كأنك تصحّح جملة قبل أن تُكملها."}},{"id":"MC-P01-050","when":["grey"],"feedback":{"en":"Grey is softer, but it's still an error while she types, and a grey line is easy to miss when she does move on with 6 characters.","ar":"الرمادي أهدأ، لكنه ما زال خطأ أثناء الكتابة، والسطر الرمادي يسهل أن يفوتها حين تنتقل فعلًا وفيها 6 أحرف."}}],"hints":[{"en":"In which version does Rania know the rule before she types, without being told off?","ar":"في أي نسخة تعرف رانيا القاعدة قبل الكتابة، دون أن تُوبَّخ؟"},{"en":"And which one speaks up clearly once she moves on?","ar":"وأيّها يُظهر الخطأ بوضوح حين تنتقل؟"}],"correct":{"en":"The rule comes first; the error comes only when she's done.","ar":"القاعدة تأتي أولًا؛ والخطأ يأتي فقط حين تنتهي."},"explain":{"en":"Separate the rule from the error. The rule helps before and during typing; the error is for when the person finishes and something is still wrong.","ar":"افصل القاعدة عن الخطأ. القاعدة تساعد قبل الكتابة وأثناءها؛ ورسالة الخطأ تأتي حين ينتهي الشخص ويبقى شيء غير صحيح."},"speaker":"hana"},{"id":"S06","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P01-U04-05","part":"guided","rules":["R06","R15"],"value":{"en":"Error messages (NN/g): let users correct errors by editing what they did, not by starting over. A message that is 62 characters too long should be shortened, not erased.","ar":"رسائل الخطأ (NN/g): دع المستخدم يُصلح الخطأ بتعديل ما فعله، لا بالبدء من جديد. والرسالة الأطول من المسموح بـ 62 حرفًا يجب أن تُختصر، لا أن تُمسح."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/error-message-guidelines/","quote":"Let users correct errors by editing their original action instead of starting over."},"scenario":{"en":"When members book a trainer, they can describe their goals in up to 250 characters. Tamer wrote 312 characters about his knee injury and his goals. When he tapped Send, the box came back empty with \"Text too long\".","ar":"حين يحجز الأعضاء مدرّبًا، يستطيعون وصف أهدافهم في 250 حرفًا كحدّ أقصى. كتب تامر 312 حرفًا عن إصابة ركبته وأهدافه. وحين ضغط «أرسل»، عاد المربع فارغًا مع «النص طويل جدًا»."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each version. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل نسخة. أيّها يجب أن تُطلق؟"},"start":"clear","options":[{"id":"clear","text":{"en":"Keep it: empty the box and say \"Text too long\"","ar":"أبقِ الوضع الحالي: أفرغ المربع واعرض «النص طويل جدًا»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Book a trainer","ar":"احجز مدربًا"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Your goals","ar":"أهدافك"},"text":"","tone":"bad","error":{"en":"⚠ Text too long.","ar":"⚠ النص طويل جدًا."}}]}},{"id":"cut","text":{"en":"Cut his text to 250 characters and send it","ar":"اقطع نصّه عند 250 حرفًا وأرسله"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Book a trainer","ar":"احجز مدربًا"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Your goals","ar":"أهدافك"},"filled":true,"text":{"en":"I hurt my left knee last year, so I can't run yet. I want to lose 8 kg before summer and get strong enough to…","ar":"أُصبت في ركبتي اليسرى العام الماضي، فلا أستطيع الجري بعد. أريد أن أنقص 8 كجم قبل الصيف وأن أصبح قويًا بما يكفي…"}},{"kind":"small","color":"green","text":{"en":"✓ Sent","ar":"✓ تم الإرسال"},"gap":"xs"}]}},{"id":"keep","text":{"en":"Keep his text, and say how much to shorten it","ar":"احتفظ بنصّه، ووضّح كم حرفًا عليه أن يحذف"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Book a trainer","ar":"احجز مدربًا"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Your goals","ar":"أهدافك"},"filled":true,"text":{"en":"I hurt my left knee last year, so I can't run yet. I want to lose 8 kg before summer and get strong enough to…","ar":"أُصبت في ركبتي اليسرى العام الماضي، فلا أستطيع الجري بعد. أريد أن أنقص 8 كجم قبل الصيف وأن أصبح قويًا بما يكفي…"},"tone":"bad","error":{"en":"⚠ 312 of 250 characters. Shorten it by 62 to send.","ar":"⚠ كتبت 312 حرفًا، والحدّ 250. احذف 62 حرفًا لتُرسله."}}]}}],"answer":["keep"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-051","when":["clear"],"feedback":{"en":"Tamer has to write 250 characters again from memory, just to fix 62 too many. Keep his text so he can trim it.","ar":"على تامر أن يكتب 250 حرفًا من جديد من الذاكرة، فقط ليُصلح 62 حرفًا زائدًا. احتفظ بنصّه ليختصره."}},{"id":"MC-P01-051","when":["cut"],"feedback":{"en":"The end of his text is gone, and he doesn't know which part. The trainer may never read about his goals. Let him choose what to cut.","ar":"نهاية نصّه ضاعت، وهو لا يعرف أي جزء. وقد لا يقرأ المدرّب عن أهدافه أبدًا. دعه يختار ما يحذفه."}}],"hints":[{"en":"What does Tamer need to fix 62 extra characters?","ar":"ماذا يحتاج تامر ليُصلح 62 حرفًا زائدًا؟"},{"en":"In which version does he decide what to remove?","ar":"في أي نسخة يقرّر هو ما يحذفه؟"}],"correct":{"en":"His text stays, and he knows exactly how much to trim.","ar":"نصّه يبقى، ويعرف بالضبط كم يختصر."},"explain":{"en":"Fixing should mean editing, not redoing. Keep the input, and say exactly what has to change.","ar":"الإصلاح يجب أن يعني التعديل، لا الإعادة. احتفظ بما كتبه الشخص، واذكر بالضبط ما يجب أن يتغيّر."},"speaker":"hana"},{"id":"S07","type":"compare","skill":"SK-P01-U04-04","part":"contrast","rules":["R11","R15"],"value":{"en":"Contrast with S02 and S05: there the check came too early. Form errors (NN/g): show the error once the person has finished with the field and moved on. Waiting for the final button is too late.","ar":"مقارنة مع الخطوتين 2 و5: هناك جاء التحقّق مبكّرًا جدًا. أخطاء النماذج (NN/g): اعرض الخطأ بعد أن ينتهي الشخص من الحقل وينتقل لما بعده. وانتظار الزر الأخير متأخر جدًا."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/errors-forms-design-guidelines/","quote":"In most cases, avoid showing an error until the user has finished with the field and moved to the next field."},"scenario":{"en":"Our kids' swimming sign-up has 9 fields. Version A checks everything only when parents tap Register at the end. Version B checks each field as the parent moves to the next one. Ehab, a parent, has just typed his child's age as 2; classes start at 4.","ar":"تسجيل السباحة للأطفال عندنا فيه 9 حقول. النسخة A تتحقّق من كل شيء فقط حين يضغط الوالد «سجّل» في النهاية. والنسخة B تتحقّق من كل حقل حين ينتقل الوالد إلى التالي. وإيهاب، أحد الآباء، كتب للتوّ عمر طفله 2؛ والحصص تبدأ من 4 سنوات."},"prompt":{"en":"Ehab has just moved to the next field. Which version should ship?","ar":"انتقل إيهاب للتوّ إلى الحقل التالي. أي نسخة تخبره بمشكلة العمر قبل أن يملأ باقي الحقول؟"},"a":{"label":{"en":"Check at Register","ar":"التحقّق عند «سجّل»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Kids' swimming","ar":"سباحة الأطفال"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Child's age","ar":"عمر الطفل"},"filled":true,"text":"2"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Preferred class time","ar":"وقت الحصة المفضّل"},"focus":true,"text":"","gap":"s"}]}},"b":{"label":{"en":"Check on leaving","ar":"التحقّق عند المغادرة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Kids' swimming","ar":"سباحة الأطفال"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Child's age","ar":"عمر الطفل"},"filled":true,"text":"2","tone":"bad","error":{"en":"⚠ Swimming classes start at age 4. See our playtime sessions for younger kids.","ar":"⚠ حصص السباحة تبدأ من عمر 4 سنوات. شاهد جلسات اللعب للأطفال الأصغر."}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Preferred class time","ar":"وقت الحصة المفضّل"},"focus":true,"text":"","gap":"s"}]}},"answer":"b","reason":{"prompt":{"en":"Why is B better here?","ar":"لماذا B أفضل هنا؟"},"options":[{"id":"fresh","text":{"en":"Ehab learns about the age now, before he fills in 7 more fields for nothing","ar":"يعرف إيهاب مشكلة العمر الآن، قبل أن يملأ 7 حقول أخرى بلا فائدة"}},{"id":"always","text":{"en":"Errors should always appear as early as possible","ar":"الأخطاء يجب أن تظهر دائمًا في أبكر وقت ممكن"}},{"id":"red","text":{"en":"B uses more red","ar":"B تستخدم أحمر أكثر"}}],"answer":["fresh"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-050","when":["always"],"feedback":{"en":"Not as early as possible: during typing is too early. The right moment is when the field is finished, which is exactly when B checks.","ar":"ليس في أبكر وقت ممكن: أثناء الكتابة مبكّر جدًا. اللحظة الصحيحة حين ينتهي الحقل، وهذا بالضبط وقت تحقّق B."}}]},"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-050","when":["a"],"feedback":{"en":"In A, Ehab fills 7 more fields, taps Register, and only then learns his child can't join. Checking when he left the age field would have saved all that.","ar":"في A، يملأ إيهاب 7 حقول أخرى، ويضغط «سجّل»، وعندها فقط يعرف أن طفله لا يستطيع الانضمام. والتحقّق حين غادر حقل العمر كان سيوفّر كل ذلك."}}],"hints":[{"en":"In A, when does Ehab find out about the age?","ar":"في A، متى يعرف إيهاب مشكلة العمر؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Not too early, not too late: when the field is done.","ar":"لا مبكّرًا جدًا، ولا متأخرًا جدًا: حين ينتهي الحقل."},"explain":{"en":"Too early scolds; too late wastes work. Checking on leaving a field catches the problem while it's fresh, before more effort goes in.","ar":"المبكّر جدًا يوبّخ؛ والمتأخر جدًا يُضيّع الجهد. والتحقّق عند مغادرة الحقل يلتقط المشكلة وهي حاضرة، قبل بذل مزيد من الجهد."},"speaker":"hana"},{"id":"S08","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P01-U04-05","part":"independent","speaker":"youssef","rules":["R14","R19"],"value":{"en":"New case. Form usability (NN/g): preserve the input, including the wrong part, and explain the problem. A bad coupon should never cost a customer their address.","ar":"حالة جديدة. سهولة استخدام النماذج (NN/g): احتفظ بالمُدخل، حتى الجزء الخاطئ، واشرح المشكلة. والكوبون غير الصالح يجب ألّا يكلّف العميل عنوانه أبدًا."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/web-form-design/","quote":"Erroneous input should be preserved so users can correct it, and accompanied by a specific explanation of the problem."},"scenario":{"en":"In my online shop's checkout, Sahar typed her address and the coupon \"EID25\". That coupon is for orders over 500 EGP, and hers is 380. The page reloaded with the address empty and \"Coupon not valid\" at the top.","ar":"في صفحة الدفع بمتجري الإلكتروني، كتبت سحر عنوانها والكوبون «EID25». وهذا الكوبون للطلبات فوق 500 جنيه، وطلبها 380. فأُعيد تحميل الصفحة والعنوان فارغ، و«كوبون غير صالح» في الأعلى."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each version. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل نسخة. أيّها يجب أن تُطلق؟"},"start":"reload","options":[{"id":"reload","text":{"en":"Keep it: reload the page with the message at the top","ar":"أبقِ الوضع الحالي: أعد تحميل الصفحة والرسالة في الأعلى"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"dar.example/checkout","blocks":[{"kind":"banner","tone":"bad","text":{"en":"Coupon not valid.","ar":"كوبون غير صالح."}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Delivery address","ar":"عنوان التوصيل"},"text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Coupon","ar":"الكوبون"},"text":"","gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"clearcode","text":{"en":"Keep the address, clear the coupon, and explain","ar":"احتفظ بالعنوان، وامسح الكوبون، واشرح"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"dar.example/checkout","blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Delivery address","ar":"عنوان التوصيل"},"filled":true,"text":{"en":"7 Tahrir St, Dokki, Giza","ar":"7 شارع التحرير، الدقي، الجيزة"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Coupon","ar":"الكوبون"},"text":"","tone":"bad","error":{"en":"⚠ EID25 works on orders over 500 EGP. Your order is 380 EGP.","ar":"⚠ الكوبون EID25 يعمل على الطلبات فوق 500 جنيه. وطلبك 380 جنيهًا."},"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"keepboth","text":{"en":"Keep the address and the coupon, and explain on the coupon field","ar":"احتفظ بالعنوان والكوبون، واشرح المشكلة عند حقل الكوبون"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"dar.example/checkout","blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Delivery address","ar":"عنوان التوصيل"},"filled":true,"text":{"en":"7 Tahrir St, Dokki, Giza","ar":"7 شارع التحرير، الدقي، الجيزة"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Coupon","ar":"الكوبون"},"filled":true,"text":"EID25","tone":"bad","error":{"en":"⚠ EID25 works on orders over 500 EGP. Your order is 380 EGP.","ar":"⚠ الكوبون EID25 يعمل على الطلبات فوق 500 جنيه. وطلبك 380 جنيهًا."},"gap":"s"}]}}],"answer":["keepboth"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-051","when":["reload"],"feedback":{"en":"Sahar loses her address over a coupon, and \"not valid\" doesn't say why. Many shoppers would leave right here.","ar":"تفقد سحر عنوانها بسبب كوبون، و«غير صالح» لا توضّح السبب. وكثير من المتسوّقين سيغادرون هنا تحديدًا."}},{"id":"MC-P01-051","when":["clearcode"],"feedback":{"en":"Close. But if she adds items to pass 500, she has to remember and retype the code. Keep it, so it can work as soon as her order qualifies.","ar":"قريب. لكن إن أضافت منتجات لتتجاوز 500، فعليها أن تتذكّر الكود وتكتبه من جديد. احتفظ به، ليعمل بمجرّد أن يستوفي طلبها الشرط."}}],"correct":{"en":"Everything stays, and the message says exactly why the coupon didn't apply.","ar":"كل شيء يبقى، والرسالة توضّح بالضبط لماذا لم يُطبَّق الكوبون."},"explain":{"en":"Keep every answer, right or wrong. The wrong one, kept and explained, is the fastest thing to fix.","ar":"احتفظ بكل إجابة، صحيحة أو خاطئة. والإجابة الخاطئة، حين تُحفظ وتُشرح، هي الأسرع في الإصلاح."}},{"id":"S09","type":"card","part":"recap","icons":["clock","ok","eye","list"],"title":{"en":"What you did","ar":"ماذا تعلّمت"},"body":{"en":"- **Not while typing:** stopped the email and password errors from appearing after the first letters.\n- **When the field is done:** checked on leaving the field, so the child's age was caught before 7 more fields.\n- **Rule first, error later:** showed the password rule up front and the error only when it was still short.\n- **Nothing lost:** kept every answer after an error, even the wrong mobile number, the long text and the coupon.\n\nNext: the skill check for this unit.","ar":"- **ليس أثناء الكتابة:** أوقفت ظهور أخطاء البريد وكلمة المرور بعد الأحرف الأولى.\n- **حين ينتهي الحقل:** تحقّقت عند مغادرة الحقل، فاكتُشفت مشكلة عمر الطفل قبل 7 حقول أخرى.\n- **القاعدة أولًا، والخطأ لاحقًا:** عرضت قاعدة كلمة المرور مسبقًا، والخطأ فقط حين بقيت قصيرة.\n- **لا شيء يضيع:** احتفظت بكل إجابة بعد الخطأ، حتى رقم الموبايل الخاطئ والنص الطويل والكوبون.\n\nالتالي: اختبار المهارة لهذه الوحدة."}}]}$uxg$::jsonb),
  ($uxg$P01-U04-L04$uxg$, $uxg$937b5a84c0cfaece5dfe4ddeb18d271f17777c75c342ee5bbb3749ba08b3c8e7$uxg$, $uxg${"id":"P01-U04-L04","mode":"check","minutes":7,"title":{"en":"Skill check: errors people can fix","ar":"اختبار المهارة: أخطاء يستطيع الناس إصلاحها"},"summary":{"en":"Fix a car licence renewal form's errors on your own, with no hints.","ar":"أصلح أخطاء نموذج تجديد رخصة السيارة بنفسك، دون تلميحات."},"speaker":"tarek","steps":[{"id":"S01","type":"card","part":"hook","title":{"en":"Ola renews her car licence","ar":"علا تجدّد رخصة سيارتها"},"body":{"en":"I'm the product manager for a service that renews car licences online. Ola tried it last night. Her renewal failed three times, and each time the error was harder to understand than the last. She drove to the traffic office the next morning.\n\nYour job: fix the errors on each screen so Ola can finish at home.\n\nThis is a skill check: no hints, and you'll see how you did at the end.","ar":"أنا مدير المنتج لخدمة تجديد رخص السيارات عبر الإنترنت. جرّبتها علا ليلة أمس. فشل التجديد ثلاث مرات، وكل مرة كان الخطأ أصعب في الفهم من سابقه. فذهبت بسيارتها إلى إدارة المرور صباح اليوم التالي.\n\nمهمّتك: أصلح الأخطاء في كل شاشة لتُنهي علا التجديد من البيت.\n\nهذا اختبار مهارة: بدون تلميحات، وسترى نتيجتك في النهاية."},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rokhsati","name":{"en":"Rokhsati","ar":"رخصتي"},"color":"#1E3A8A","icon":"car","domain":"rokhsati.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"rokhsati.example/renew","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Renew licence","ar":"تجديد الرخصة"},{"en":"Fines","ar":"المخالفات"},{"en":"Help","ar":"المساعدة"}],"active":0},"blocks":[{"kind":"banner","tone":"bad","text":{"en":"ERR_VAL_09: Please check the highlighted fields.","ar":"ERR_VAL_09: يُرجى مراجعة الحقول المحدّدة."}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"National ID","ar":"الرقم القومي"},"filled":true,"text":"⁦2950 3120 1044 5⁩","tone":"bad","gap":"m"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Plate number","ar":"رقم اللوحة"},"filled":true,"text":{"en":"ABC 4521","ar":"أ ب ج 4521"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Renew licence","ar":"جدّد الرخصة"},"gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"S02","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P01-U04-01","part":"check","rules":["R19"],"value":{"en":"Skill check, error messages (NN/g): display the error close to its source. The national ID problem should be explained on the national ID field.","ar":"اختبار مهارة، رسائل الخطأ (NN/g): اعرض الخطأ قريبًا من مصدره. ومشكلة الرقم القومي يجب أن تُشرح على حقل الرقم القومي."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/error-message-guidelines/","quote":"Display the error message close to the error's source."},"scenario":{"en":"Ola's national ID has 13 digits; it needs 14. Right now the only message is a line at the top of the page.","ar":"الرقم القومي الذي كتبته علا فيه 13 رقمًا؛ ويحتاج 14. والرسالة الوحيدة الآن سطر في أعلى الصفحة."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each version. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل نسخة. أيّها يجب أن تُطلق؟"},"start":"top","options":[{"id":"top","text":{"en":"Keep the message at the top, and name the field","ar":"أبقِ الرسالة في الأعلى، واذكر الحقل"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rokhsati","name":{"en":"Rokhsati","ar":"رخصتي"},"color":"#1E3A8A","icon":"car","domain":"rokhsati.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"rokhsati.example/renew","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Renew licence","ar":"تجديد الرخصة"},{"en":"Fines","ar":"المخالفات"},{"en":"Help","ar":"المساعدة"}],"active":0},"blocks":[{"kind":"banner","tone":"bad","text":{"en":"National ID needs 14 digits.","ar":"الرقم القومي يحتاج 14 رقمًا."}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"National ID","ar":"الرقم القومي"},"filled":true,"text":"⁦2950 3120 1044 5⁩","gap":"m"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Plate number","ar":"رقم اللوحة"},"filled":true,"text":{"en":"ABC 4521","ar":"أ ب ج 4521"},"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"inline","text":{"en":"Put the message under the national ID field","ar":"ضع الرسالة تحت حقل الرقم القومي"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rokhsati","name":{"en":"Rokhsati","ar":"رخصتي"},"color":"#1E3A8A","icon":"car","domain":"rokhsati.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"rokhsati.example/renew","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Renew licence","ar":"تجديد الرخصة"},{"en":"Fines","ar":"المخالفات"},{"en":"Help","ar":"المساعدة"}],"active":0},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"National ID","ar":"الرقم القومي"},"filled":true,"text":"⁦2950 3120 1044 5⁩","tone":"bad","error":{"en":"⚠ National ID needs 14 digits. This one has 13.","ar":"⚠ الرقم القومي يحتاج 14 رقمًا، وأدخلتِ 13."}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Plate number","ar":"رقم اللوحة"},"filled":true,"text":{"en":"ABC 4521","ar":"أ ب ج 4521"},"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"dialog","text":{"en":"Show the message in a pop-up she has to close","ar":"اعرض الرسالة في نافذة منبثقة يجب أن تغلقها"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rokhsati","name":{"en":"Rokhsati","ar":"رخصتي"},"color":"#1E3A8A","icon":"car","domain":"rokhsati.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"rokhsati.example/renew","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Renew licence","ar":"تجديد الرخصة"},{"en":"Fines","ar":"المخالفات"},{"en":"Help","ar":"المساعدة"}],"active":0},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"After she closes the pop-up:","ar":"بعد أن تغلق النافذة المنبثقة:"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"National ID","ar":"الرقم القومي"},"filled":true,"text":"⁦2950 3120 1044 5⁩","gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Plate number","ar":"رقم اللوحة"},"filled":true,"text":{"en":"ABC 4521","ar":"أ ب ج 4521"},"gap":"s"}]}}],"answer":["inline"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-044","when":["top","dialog"],"feedback":{"en":"Ola has to carry the message from where she read it to the field, and remember it while she counts digits. Put it on the field.","ar":"على علا أن تنقل الرسالة من حيث قرأتها إلى الحقل، وأن تتذكّرها وهي تعدّ الأرقام. ضعها على الحقل."}}],"explain":{"en":"From Lesson 1: the message belongs where the fixing happens, right under the field, and it stays there until the problem is gone.","ar":"من الدرس 1: مكان الرسالة حيث يُصلح الشخص الخطأ، تحت الحقل مباشرة، وتبقى هناك حتى تزول المشكلة."},"speaker":"tarek"},{"id":"S03","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P01-U04-06","part":"check","rules":["R19"],"value":{"en":"Skill check, form usability (NN/g): errors should be signaled through several cues, not only color. A red border by itself doesn't say there's an error, or what it is.","ar":"اختبار مهارة، سهولة استخدام النماذج (NN/g): يجب إظهار الأخطاء بعدّة إشارات، لا باللون وحده. والإطار الأحمر وحده لا يقول إن هناك خطأ، ولا ما هو."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/web-form-design/","quote":"Errors should be signaled through a variety of cues, not solely through color:"},"scenario":{"en":"On the car details screen, the insurance expiry date is in the past. We only turn the field's border red.","ar":"في شاشة بيانات السيارة، تاريخ انتهاء التأمين في الماضي. ونكتفي بتحويل إطار الحقل إلى الأحمر."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each version. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل نسخة. أيّها يجب أن تُطلق؟"},"start":"red","options":[{"id":"words","text":{"en":"Add an icon and a message under the field","ar":"أضف أيقونة ورسالة تحت الحقل"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rokhsati","name":{"en":"Rokhsati","ar":"رخصتي"},"color":"#1E3A8A","icon":"car","domain":"rokhsati.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"rokhsati.example/renew","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Renew licence","ar":"تجديد الرخصة"},{"en":"Fines","ar":"المخالفات"},{"en":"Help","ar":"المساعدة"}],"active":0},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Insurance valid until","ar":"التأمين ساري حتى"},"filled":true,"text":"15/10/2026","tone":"bad","error":{"en":"⚠ This insurance ended on 15 October. Renew it first, then come back.","ar":"⚠ انتهى هذا التأمين يوم 15 أكتوبر. جدّديه أولًا، ثم عودي."}}]}},{"id":"red","text":{"en":"Keep the red border only","ar":"أبقِ الإطار الأحمر فقط"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rokhsati","name":{"en":"Rokhsati","ar":"رخصتي"},"color":"#1E3A8A","icon":"car","domain":"rokhsati.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"rokhsati.example/renew","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Renew licence","ar":"تجديد الرخصة"},{"en":"Fines","ar":"المخالفات"},{"en":"Help","ar":"المساعدة"}],"active":0},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Insurance valid until","ar":"التأمين ساري حتى"},"filled":true,"text":"15/10/2026","tone":"bad"}]}},{"id":"label","text":{"en":"Turn the label red as well","ar":"حوّل العنوان إلى الأحمر أيضًا"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rokhsati","name":{"en":"Rokhsati","ar":"رخصتي"},"color":"#1E3A8A","icon":"car","domain":"rokhsati.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"rokhsati.example/renew","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Renew licence","ar":"تجديد الرخصة"},{"en":"Fines","ar":"المخالفات"},{"en":"Help","ar":"المساعدة"}],"active":0},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","weight":"bold","color":"red","text":{"en":"Insurance valid until","ar":"التأمين ساري حتى"}},{"kind":"field","filled":true,"text":"15/10/2026","tone":"bad","gap":"xs"}]}}],"answer":["words"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-045","when":["red","label"],"feedback":{"en":"More red is still only color. Someone who doesn't see red well sees nothing, and nobody learns that the insurance ended.","ar":"إضافة المزيد من الأحمر لا تغيّر أنه لون فقط. ومن لا يرى الأحمر جيدًا لا يرى شيئًا، ولا أحد يعرف أن التأمين انتهى."}}],"explain":{"en":"From Lesson 1: color plus an icon plus words. The words carry the meaning for everyone.","ar":"من الدرس 1: لون وأيقونة وكلمات. والكلمات تحمل المعنى للجميع."},"speaker":"tarek"},{"id":"S04","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P01-U04-07","part":"check","rules":["R19"],"value":{"en":"Skill check, form errors (NN/g): a summary gives a global understanding of all the errors in a form. On a long form, list them at the top and keep each one on its field.","ar":"اختبار مهارة، أخطاء النماذج (NN/g): الملخّص يعطي صورة شاملة عن كل أخطاء النموذج. وفي النموذج الطويل، اعرضها في قائمة بالأعلى وأبقِ كل خطأ على حقله."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/errors-forms-design-guidelines/","quote":"A validation summary can give the user a global understanding of all the errors in a form"},"scenario":{"en":"The full renewal form has 16 fields. After Ola taps Renew, two fields have problems: Engine number near the top, and Delivery address near the bottom.","ar":"نموذج التجديد الكامل فيه 16 حقلًا. وبعد أن تضغط علا «جدّد»، يكون في حقلين مشكلة: رقم المحرّك قرب الأعلى، وعنوان التوصيل قرب الأسفل."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each version of the top of the page after Renew. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل نسخة من أعلى الصفحة بعد «جدّد». أيّ نسخة تخبر علا بعدد الأخطاء وأماكنها؟"},"start":"general","options":[{"id":"general","text":{"en":"\"There are errors in the form\" at the top, fields marked","ar":"«توجد أخطاء في النموذج» بالأعلى، مع تعليم الحقول"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rokhsati","name":{"en":"Rokhsati","ar":"رخصتي"},"color":"#1E3A8A","icon":"car","domain":"rokhsati.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"rokhsati.example/renew","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Renew licence","ar":"تجديد الرخصة"},{"en":"Fines","ar":"المخالفات"},{"en":"Help","ar":"المساعدة"}],"active":0},"blocks":[{"kind":"banner","tone":"bad","text":{"en":"There are errors in the form.","ar":"توجد أخطاء في النموذج."}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Engine number","ar":"رقم المحرّك"},"filled":true,"text":"E8-1132","tone":"bad","error":{"en":"⚠ Engine numbers have 8 characters, like EA8-11320. Copy it from your licence card.","ar":"⚠ رقم المحرّك 8 خانات، مثل EA8-11320. انسخه من كارت الرخصة."},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"13 more fields below","ar":"13 حقلًا آخر بالأسفل"},"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"inline","text":{"en":"No summary; mark each field","ar":"بلا ملخّص؛ علّم كل حقل"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rokhsati","name":{"en":"Rokhsati","ar":"رخصتي"},"color":"#1E3A8A","icon":"car","domain":"rokhsati.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"rokhsati.example/renew","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Renew licence","ar":"تجديد الرخصة"},{"en":"Fines","ar":"المخالفات"},{"en":"Help","ar":"المساعدة"}],"active":0},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Engine number","ar":"رقم المحرّك"},"filled":true,"text":"E8-1132","tone":"bad","error":{"en":"⚠ Engine numbers have 8 characters, like EA8-11320. Copy it from your licence card.","ar":"⚠ رقم المحرّك 8 خانات، مثل EA8-11320. انسخه من كارت الرخصة."}},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"13 more fields below","ar":"13 حقلًا آخر بالأسفل"},"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"listed","text":{"en":"List both fields at the top, and mark each field","ar":"اذكر الحقلين في قائمة بالأعلى، وعلّم كل حقل"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rokhsati","name":{"en":"Rokhsati","ar":"رخصتي"},"color":"#1E3A8A","icon":"car","domain":"rokhsati.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"rokhsati.example/renew","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Renew licence","ar":"تجديد الرخصة"},{"en":"Fines","ar":"المخالفات"},{"en":"Help","ar":"المساعدة"}],"active":0},"blocks":[{"kind":"banner","tone":"bad","text":{"en":"2 answers need a fix: Engine number, Delivery address.","ar":"إجابتان تحتاجان إصلاحًا: رقم المحرّك، عنوان التوصيل."}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Engine number","ar":"رقم المحرّك"},"filled":true,"text":"E8-1132","tone":"bad","error":{"en":"⚠ Engine numbers have 8 characters, like EA8-11320. Copy it from your licence card.","ar":"⚠ رقم المحرّك 8 خانات، مثل EA8-11320. انسخه من كارت الرخصة."},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"13 more fields below","ar":"13 حقلًا آخر بالأسفل"},"gap":"s"}]}}],"answer":["listed"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-046","when":["general"],"feedback":{"en":"\"There are errors\" doesn't say how many or where. Ola fixes the engine number and thinks she's done, while the address waits 13 fields below.","ar":"«توجد أخطاء» لا توضّح عددها ولا أماكنها. فتُصلح علا رقم المحرّك وتظن أنها انتهت، بينما ينتظرها العنوان بعد 13 حقلًا."}},{"id":"MC-P01-046","when":["inline"],"feedback":{"en":"Ola only sees the engine number on screen. Nothing tells her a second problem is waiting further down.","ar":"لا ترى علا على الشاشة إلا رقم المحرّك. ولا شيء يخبرها أن مشكلة ثانية تنتظرها في الأسفل."}}],"explain":{"en":"From Lesson 1: on long forms, a summary that names the fields is a to-do list, and the message on each field helps with the fix.","ar":"من الدرس 1: في النماذج الطويلة، الملخّص الذي يذكر الحقول قائمة مهام، والرسالة على كل حقل تساعد في الإصلاح."},"speaker":"tarek"},{"id":"S05","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P01-U04-02","part":"check","rules":["R19"],"value":{"en":"Skill check, error messages (NN/g): hide obscure error codes from people and keep them for diagnosis. Ola needs the reason and the fix in her words.","ar":"اختبار مهارة، رسائل الخطأ (NN/g): أخفِ أكواد الخطأ الغامضة عن الناس واحتفظ بها للتشخيص. وعلا تحتاج السبب والإصلاح بكلماتها."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/error-message-guidelines/","quote":"Hide or minimize the use of obscure error codes or abbreviations; show them for technical diagnostic purposes only."},"scenario":{"en":"Our system can't find Ola's plate. She typed the letters in a different order than on her plate. Right now the field says \"ERR_PLATE_404\".","ar":"نظامنا لا يجد لوحة سيارة علا. فقد كتبت الحروف بترتيب مختلف عن اللوحة. والحقل الآن يعرض «ERR_PLATE_404»."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each message. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل رسالة. أيّها يجب أن تُطلق؟"},"start":"code","options":[{"id":"code","text":{"en":"Keep \"ERR_PLATE_404\"","ar":"أبقِ «ERR_PLATE_404»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rokhsati","name":{"en":"Rokhsati","ar":"رخصتي"},"color":"#1E3A8A","icon":"car","domain":"rokhsati.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"rokhsati.example/renew","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Renew licence","ar":"تجديد الرخصة"},{"en":"Fines","ar":"المخالفات"},{"en":"Help","ar":"المساعدة"}],"active":0},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Plate number","ar":"رقم اللوحة"},"filled":true,"text":{"en":"BAC 4521","ar":"ب أ ج 4521"},"tone":"bad","error":{"en":"⚠ ERR_PLATE_404","ar":"⚠ ERR_PLATE_404"}}]}},{"id":"notfound","text":{"en":"\"Plate not found.\"","ar":"«اللوحة غير موجودة.»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rokhsati","name":{"en":"Rokhsati","ar":"رخصتي"},"color":"#1E3A8A","icon":"car","domain":"rokhsati.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"rokhsati.example/renew","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Renew licence","ar":"تجديد الرخصة"},{"en":"Fines","ar":"المخالفات"},{"en":"Help","ar":"المساعدة"}],"active":0},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Plate number","ar":"رقم اللوحة"},"filled":true,"text":{"en":"BAC 4521","ar":"ب أ ج 4521"},"tone":"bad","error":{"en":"⚠ Plate not found.","ar":"⚠ اللوحة غير موجودة."}}]}},{"id":"fix","text":{"en":"Say no car in her name has this plate, and what to check","ar":"اذكر أنه لا توجد سيارة باسمها تحمل هذه اللوحة، وماذا تراجع"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rokhsati","name":{"en":"Rokhsati","ar":"رخصتي"},"color":"#1E3A8A","icon":"car","domain":"rokhsati.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"rokhsati.example/renew","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Renew licence","ar":"تجديد الرخصة"},{"en":"Fines","ar":"المخالفات"},{"en":"Help","ar":"المساعدة"}],"active":0},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Plate number","ar":"رقم اللوحة"},"filled":true,"text":{"en":"BAC 4521","ar":"ب أ ج 4521"},"tone":"bad","error":{"en":"⚠ No car in your name has plate BAC 4521. Check the letters and their order on your licence card.","ar":"⚠ لا توجد سيارة باسمك تحمل اللوحة ب أ ج 4521. راجعي الحروف وترتيبها في كارت الرخصة."}}]}}],"answer":["fix"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-048","when":["code"],"feedback":{"en":"A code means nothing to Ola. Our team can log it; the screen should say what happened and what to do.","ar":"الكود لا يعني شيئًا لعلا. يستطيع فريقنا تسجيله؛ أما الشاشة فيجب أن توضّح ماذا حدث وماذا تفعل."}},{"id":"MC-P01-047","when":["notfound"],"feedback":{"en":"Plain words, but no way forward. Ola knows her plate exists. Tell her what to check.","ar":"كلمات بسيطة، لكن بلا طريق للمتابعة. علا تعرف أن لوحتها موجودة. أخبرها بما تراجعه."}}],"explain":{"en":"From Lesson 2: plain words for what happened, and the next step. Codes stay in the logs.","ar":"من الدرس 2: كلمات بسيطة لما حدث، والخطوة التالية. والأكواد تبقى في السجلّات."},"speaker":"tarek"},{"id":"S06","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P01-U04-03","part":"check","rules":["R19"],"value":{"en":"Skill check, error messages (NN/g): don't use phrasing that blames users. Describe the fines, not Ola's failure to pay them.","ar":"اختبار مهارة، رسائل الخطأ (NN/g): لا تستخدم صياغة تلوم المستخدم. صِف المخالفات، لا تقصير علا في دفعها."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/error-message-guidelines/","quote":"Don't use phrasing that blames users or implies they are doing something wrong"},"scenario":{"en":"Ola's car has two unpaid traffic fines, 350 EGP in total. A licence can't be renewed until they're paid. She didn't know about them.","ar":"على سيارة علا مخالفتان مروريتان غير مدفوعتين، مجموعهما 350 جنيهًا. ولا يمكن تجديد الرخصة حتى تُدفعا. ولم تكن تعرف بهما."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each message. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل رسالة. أيّها يجب أن تُطلق؟"},"start":"failed","options":[{"id":"failed","text":{"en":"\"You failed to pay your fines. You cannot renew.\"","ar":"«لم تدفعي مخالفاتك. لا يمكنك التجديد.»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rokhsati","name":{"en":"Rokhsati","ar":"رخصتي"},"color":"#1E3A8A","icon":"car","domain":"rokhsati.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"rokhsati.example/renew","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Renew licence","ar":"تجديد الرخصة"},{"en":"Fines","ar":"المخالفات"},{"en":"Help","ar":"المساعدة"}],"active":0},"blocks":[{"kind":"banner","tone":"bad","text":{"en":"You failed to pay your fines. You cannot renew.","ar":"لم تدفعي مخالفاتك. لا يمكنك التجديد."}},{"kind":"button","tone":"off","text":{"en":"Renew licence","ar":"جدّد الرخصة"},"gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"warning","text":{"en":"\"Warning: violations on record. Renewal blocked.\"","ar":"«تحذير: مخالفات مسجّلة. التجديد موقوف.»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rokhsati","name":{"en":"Rokhsati","ar":"رخصتي"},"color":"#1E3A8A","icon":"car","domain":"rokhsati.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"rokhsati.example/renew","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Renew licence","ar":"تجديد الرخصة"},{"en":"Fines","ar":"المخالفات"},{"en":"Help","ar":"المساعدة"}],"active":0},"blocks":[{"kind":"banner","tone":"bad","text":{"en":"Warning: violations on record. Renewal blocked.","ar":"تحذير: مخالفات مسجّلة. التجديد موقوف."}},{"kind":"button","tone":"off","text":{"en":"Renew licence","ar":"جدّد الرخصة"},"gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"neutral","text":{"en":"\"This car has 2 unpaid fines (350 EGP). Pay them here, then renew.\"","ar":"«على هذه السيارة مخالفتان غير مدفوعتين (350 جنيهًا). ادفعيهما هنا، ثم جدّدي.»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rokhsati","name":{"en":"Rokhsati","ar":"رخصتي"},"color":"#1E3A8A","icon":"car","domain":"rokhsati.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"rokhsati.example/renew","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Renew licence","ar":"تجديد الرخصة"},{"en":"Fines","ar":"المخالفات"},{"en":"Help","ar":"المساعدة"}],"active":0},"blocks":[{"kind":"banner","tone":"bad","text":{"en":"This car has 2 unpaid fines (350 EGP). Pay them here, then renew.","ar":"على هذه السيارة مخالفتان غير مدفوعتين (350 جنيهًا). ادفعيهما هنا، ثم جدّدي."}},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Pay 350 EGP","ar":"ادفعي 350 جنيهًا"},"gap":"m"}]}}],"answer":["neutral"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-049","when":["failed","warning"],"feedback":{"en":"\"You failed\" accuses her, and \"Warning: violations\" sounds like a police notice. Neither says how much or how to pay. Describe the fines and offer the next step.","ar":"«لم تدفعي» تتّهمها، و«تحذير: مخالفات» تبدو كإنذار من الشرطة. ولا توضّح أيٌّ منهما المبلغ ولا طريقة الدفع. صِف المخالفات واعرض الخطوة التالية."}}],"explain":{"en":"From Lesson 2: make the thing the subject (\"This car has 2 unpaid fines\"), not the person, and end with what they can do.","ar":"من الدرس 2: اجعل الشيء فاعل الجملة («على هذه السيارة مخالفتان»)، لا الشخص، واختم بما يستطيع فعله."},"speaker":"tarek"},{"id":"S07","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P01-U04-04","part":"check","rules":["R19"],"value":{"en":"Skill check, form errors (NN/g): avoid showing an error until the person has finished with the field and moved to the next one.","ar":"اختبار مهارة، أخطاء النماذج (NN/g): تجنّب عرض الخطأ حتى ينتهي الشخص من الحقل وينتقل إلى التالي."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/errors-forms-design-guidelines/","quote":"In most cases, avoid showing an error until the user has finished with the field and moved to the next field."},"scenario":{"en":"The mobile number field shows \"Invalid number\" in red from the first digit Ola types until the eleventh.","ar":"حقل رقم الموبايل يعرض «رقم غير صالح» بالأحمر من أول رقم تكتبه علا حتى الحادي عشر."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each timing. Each preview shows two moments. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل توقيت. كل معاينة تُظهر لحظتين. أيّها يجب أن يُطلق؟"},"start":"typing","options":[{"id":"typing","text":{"en":"Keep checking with every digit","ar":"أبقِ التحقّق مع كل رقم"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rokhsati","name":{"en":"Rokhsati","ar":"رخصتي"},"color":"#1E3A8A","icon":"car","domain":"rokhsati.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"rokhsati.example/renew","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Renew licence","ar":"تجديد الرخصة"},{"en":"Fines","ar":"المخالفات"},{"en":"Help","ar":"المساعدة"}],"active":0},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"After 4 digits","ar":"بعد 4 أرقام"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Mobile number","ar":"رقم الموبايل"},"filled":true,"focus":true,"text":"⁦0100⁩","tone":"bad","error":{"en":"⚠ Mobile numbers have 11 digits, starting with 01.","ar":"⚠ أرقام الموبايل 11 رقمًا، تبدأ بـ 01."},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"After she moves on with 10 digits","ar":"بعد أن تنتقل وفيه 10 أرقام"},"gap":"l"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Mobile number","ar":"رقم الموبايل"},"filled":true,"text":"⁦0100 123 456⁩","tone":"bad","error":{"en":"⚠ Mobile numbers have 11 digits, starting with 01.","ar":"⚠ أرقام الموبايل 11 رقمًا، تبدأ بـ 01."},"gap":"xs"}]}},{"id":"leave","text":{"en":"Check when she leaves the field","ar":"تحقّق حين تغادر الحقل"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rokhsati","name":{"en":"Rokhsati","ar":"رخصتي"},"color":"#1E3A8A","icon":"car","domain":"rokhsati.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"rokhsati.example/renew","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Renew licence","ar":"تجديد الرخصة"},{"en":"Fines","ar":"المخالفات"},{"en":"Help","ar":"المساعدة"}],"active":0},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"After 4 digits","ar":"بعد 4 أرقام"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Mobile number","ar":"رقم الموبايل"},"filled":true,"focus":true,"text":"⁦0100⁩","gap":"xs"},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"After she moves on with 10 digits","ar":"بعد أن تنتقل وفيه 10 أرقام"},"gap":"l"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Mobile number","ar":"رقم الموبايل"},"filled":true,"text":"⁦0100 123 456⁩","tone":"bad","error":{"en":"⚠ Mobile numbers have 11 digits, starting with 01.","ar":"⚠ أرقام الموبايل 11 رقمًا، تبدأ بـ 01."},"gap":"xs"}]}},{"id":"end","text":{"en":"Check only when she taps Renew","ar":"تحقّق فقط حين تضغط «جدّد»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rokhsati","name":{"en":"Rokhsati","ar":"رخصتي"},"color":"#1E3A8A","icon":"car","domain":"rokhsati.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"rokhsati.example/renew","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Renew licence","ar":"تجديد الرخصة"},{"en":"Fines","ar":"المخالفات"},{"en":"Help","ar":"المساعدة"}],"active":0},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"After 4 digits","ar":"بعد 4 أرقام"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Mobile number","ar":"رقم الموبايل"},"filled":true,"focus":true,"text":"⁦0100⁩","gap":"xs"},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"After she moves on with 10 digits","ar":"بعد أن تنتقل وفيه 10 أرقام"},"gap":"l"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Mobile number","ar":"رقم الموبايل"},"filled":true,"text":"⁦0100 123 456⁩","gap":"xs"}]}}],"answer":["leave"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-050","when":["typing"],"feedback":{"en":"Four digits in, Ola is still typing. Red now only scolds her for not being finished.","ar":"بعد أربعة أرقام، ما زالت علا تكتب. والأحمر الآن يوبّخها فقط لأنها لم تنتهِ."}},{"id":"MC-P01-050","when":["end"],"feedback":{"en":"She moved on with a missing digit, and nothing says so until the very end. Check when she leaves the field.","ar":"انتقلت وينقصها رقم، ولا شيء ينبّهها إلى ذلك حتى النهاية. تحقّق حين تغادر الحقل."}}],"explain":{"en":"From Lesson 3: leaving a field means \"done\". Check then: not during typing, and not at the very end.","ar":"من الدرس 3: مغادرة الحقل تعني «انتهيت». تحقّق حينها: لا أثناء الكتابة، ولا في النهاية تمامًا."},"speaker":"tarek"},{"id":"S08","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P01-U04-05","part":"check","rules":["R19"],"value":{"en":"Skill check, error messages (NN/g): let users correct errors by editing what they did, instead of starting over. A declined card shouldn't erase the delivery details.","ar":"اختبار مهارة، رسائل الخطأ (NN/g): دع المستخدم يُصلح الخطأ بتعديل ما فعله، بدل البدء من جديد. والبطاقة المرفوضة يجب ألّا تمسح بيانات التوصيل."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/error-message-guidelines/","quote":"Let users correct errors by editing their original action instead of starting over."},"scenario":{"en":"Last step: Ola picks home delivery of the new licence, types her address, and pays. Her card is declined. Right now the page goes back to step 1, with everything empty.","ar":"الخطوة الأخيرة: تختار علا توصيل الرخصة الجديدة إلى البيت، وتكتب عنوانها، وتدفع. فتُرفض بطاقتها. والآن تعود الصفحة إلى الخطوة 1، وكل شيء فارغ."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each version of what Ola sees after the card is declined. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل نسخة لما تراه علا بعد رفض البطاقة. أيّ نسخة تتيح لعلا أن تغيّر البطاقة فقط دون أن تفقد شيئًا؟"},"start":"restart","options":[{"id":"restart","text":{"en":"Keep it: back to step 1, everything empty","ar":"أبقِ الوضع الحالي: العودة إلى الخطوة 1، وكل شيء فارغ"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rokhsati","name":{"en":"Rokhsati","ar":"رخصتي"},"color":"#1E3A8A","icon":"car","domain":"rokhsati.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"rokhsati.example/renew","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Renew licence","ar":"تجديد الرخصة"},{"en":"Fines","ar":"المخالفات"},{"en":"Help","ar":"المساعدة"}],"active":0},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Step 1 of 4","ar":"الخطوة 1 من 4"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"National ID","ar":"الرقم القومي"},"text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Plate number","ar":"رقم اللوحة"},"text":"","gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"stay","text":{"en":"Stay on payment, keep everything, and explain","ar":"أبقِها في خطوة الدفع، واحتفظ بكل شيء، واشرح المشكلة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rokhsati","name":{"en":"Rokhsati","ar":"رخصتي"},"color":"#1E3A8A","icon":"car","domain":"rokhsati.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"rokhsati.example/renew","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Renew licence","ar":"تجديد الرخصة"},{"en":"Fines","ar":"المخالفات"},{"en":"Help","ar":"المساعدة"}],"active":0},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Step 4 of 4","ar":"الخطوة 4 من 4"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Delivery address","ar":"عنوان التوصيل"},"filled":true,"text":{"en":"22 Gamal Abdel Nasser St, Alexandria","ar":"22 شارع جمال عبد الناصر، الإسكندرية"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Card number","ar":"رقم البطاقة"},"filled":true,"text":"⁦5236 •••• •••• 4410⁩","tone":"bad","error":{"en":"⚠ Your bank declined this card. Try another card, or pay in cash at any traffic office.","ar":"⚠ رفض بنكك هذه البطاقة. جرّبي بطاقة أخرى، أو ادفعي نقدًا في أي إدارة مرور."},"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"emptypay","text":{"en":"Stay on payment, but clear the address and card","ar":"أبقِها في خطوة الدفع، لكن امسح العنوان والبطاقة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rokhsati","name":{"en":"Rokhsati","ar":"رخصتي"},"color":"#1E3A8A","icon":"car","domain":"rokhsati.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"rokhsati.example/renew","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Renew licence","ar":"تجديد الرخصة"},{"en":"Fines","ar":"المخالفات"},{"en":"Help","ar":"المساعدة"}],"active":0},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Step 4 of 4","ar":"الخطوة 4 من 4"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Delivery address","ar":"عنوان التوصيل"},"text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Card number","ar":"رقم البطاقة"},"text":"","tone":"bad","error":{"en":"⚠ Your bank declined this card. Try another card, or pay in cash at any traffic office.","ar":"⚠ رفض بنكك هذه البطاقة. جرّبي بطاقة أخرى، أو ادفعي نقدًا في أي إدارة مرور."},"gap":"s"}]}}],"answer":["stay"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-051","when":["restart","emptypay"],"feedback":{"en":"Only the card failed. Making Ola retype her address, or all four steps, punishes her for her bank's answer. Keep everything and let her change the card.","ar":"البطاقة وحدها فشلت. وإجبار علا على إعادة كتابة عنوانها، أو الخطوات الأربع كلها، يعاقبها على رد بنكها. احتفظ بكل شيء ودعها تغيّر البطاقة."}}],"explain":{"en":"From Lesson 3: an error should cost one fix. Keep every answer, and let people change only what went wrong.","ar":"من الدرس 3: الخطأ يجب أن يكلّف إصلاحًا واحدًا. احتفظ بكل إجابة، ودع الناس يغيّرون فقط ما حدث فيه الخطأ."},"speaker":"tarek"}]}$uxg$::jsonb),
  ($uxg$P01-U05-L01$uxg$, $uxg$6dfbb0580b7fa1782fe3bb12d9c0cc54f5ced8604fd041926efccaea89e4a05d$uxg$, $uxg${"id":"P01-U05-L01","mode":"lesson","minutes":8,"title":{"en":"A form you can finish without a mouse","ar":"نموذج تُكمله بلا ماوس"},"summary":{"en":"Make a travel booking form work by keyboard, with visible focus and a sensible Tab order.","ar":"اجعل نموذج حجز السفر يعمل بلوحة المفاتيح، مع تركيز (Focus) ظاهر وترتيب Tab منطقي."},"speaker":"karim","review_labels":{"MC-P01-052":{"en":"Never remove the focus ring","ar":"لا تحذف إطار التركيز أبدًا"},"MC-P01-053":{"en":"Tab order follows the layout","ar":"ترتيب Tab يتبع ترتيب الصفحة"},"MC-P01-054":{"en":"Every control must be reachable by keyboard","ar":"يجب أن يصل المستخدم إلى كل عنصر بلوحة المفاتيح"}},"steps":[{"id":"S01","type":"card","part":"hook","title":{"en":"Nabil and the Tab key","ar":"نبيل وزر Tab"},"body":{"en":"I built a booking form for a travel agency. Nabil has a hand tremor, so he uses the keyboard instead of a mouse: Tab to move, Enter to press.\n\nOn our form, he pressed Tab and couldn't see where he was. Then Tab jumped from his name straight to the Pay button. He booked by phone instead.","ar":"بنيت نموذج حجز لوكالة سفر. نبيل عنده رعشة في يده، فيستخدم لوحة المفاتيح بدل الماوس: Tab للتنقّل، وEnter للضغط.\n\nفي نموذجنا، ضغط Tab ولم يعرف أين هو في الصفحة. ثم قفز Tab من اسمه مباشرة إلى زر الدفع. فحجز بالهاتف بدلًا من ذلك."},"mock":{"app":{"id":"zad","name":{"en":"Zad Travel","ar":"زاد للسفر"},"color":"#6D28D9","icon":"airplane-tilt","domain":"zad.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"zad.example/book","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Flights","ar":"الطيران"},{"en":"Hotels","ar":"الفنادق"},{"en":"My trips","ar":"رحلاتي"}],"active":0},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Full name","ar":"الاسم الكامل"},"filled":true,"text":{"en":"Nabil Saad","ar":"نبيل سعد"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Email","ar":"البريد الإلكتروني"},"text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Travel date","ar":"تاريخ السفر"},"text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Pay","ar":"ادفع"},"gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"S02","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P01-U05-01","part":"try","rules":["R12"],"value":{"en":"Try first. Keyboard accessibility (NN/g): removing the keyboard focus indicator is catastrophic for keyboard users. Without it, Nabil can't tell which field he's in.","ar":"جرّب أولًا. الإتاحة بلوحة المفاتيح (NN/g): حذف مؤشّر التركيز كارثة لمستخدمي لوحة المفاتيح. وبدونه، لا يعرف نبيل في أي حقل هو."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/keyboard-accessibility/","quote":"Removing the keyboard focus indicator is catastrophic for keyboard users."},"scenario":{"en":"Our designer removed the focus ring because \"it looked messy\". Nabil has pressed Tab twice, so he's in the Email field.","ar":"حذف مصمّمنا إطار التركيز (Focus ring) لأنه «بدا غير مرتّب». وضغط نبيل Tab مرتين، فهو الآن في حقل البريد."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each version of what Nabil sees. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل نسخة لما يراه نبيل. أيّ نسخة تُظهر لنبيل الحقل الذي وصل إليه؟"},"start":"none","options":[{"id":"none","text":{"en":"Keep it: no focus ring","ar":"اتركه كما هو: بلا إطار تركيز"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"zad","name":{"en":"Zad Travel","ar":"زاد للسفر"},"color":"#6D28D9","icon":"airplane-tilt","domain":"zad.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"zad.example/book","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Flights","ar":"الطيران"},{"en":"Hotels","ar":"الفنادق"},{"en":"My trips","ar":"رحلاتي"}],"active":0},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Full name","ar":"الاسم الكامل"},"filled":true,"text":{"en":"Nabil Saad","ar":"نبيل سعد"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Email","ar":"البريد الإلكتروني"},"text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Travel date","ar":"تاريخ السفر"},"text":"","gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"ring","text":{"en":"Bring back a clear focus ring","ar":"أعِد إطار تركيز واضحًا"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"zad","name":{"en":"Zad Travel","ar":"زاد للسفر"},"color":"#6D28D9","icon":"airplane-tilt","domain":"zad.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"zad.example/book","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Flights","ar":"الطيران"},{"en":"Hotels","ar":"الفنادق"},{"en":"My trips","ar":"رحلاتي"}],"active":0},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Full name","ar":"الاسم الكامل"},"filled":true,"text":{"en":"Nabil Saad","ar":"نبيل سعد"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Email","ar":"البريد الإلكتروني"},"text":"","focus":true,"gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Travel date","ar":"تاريخ السفر"},"text":"","gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"label","text":{"en":"No ring; make the focused field's label purple","ar":"بلا إطار؛ اجعل عنوان الحقل الذي عليه التركيز بنفسجيًا"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"zad","name":{"en":"Zad Travel","ar":"زاد للسفر"},"color":"#6D28D9","icon":"airplane-tilt","domain":"zad.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"zad.example/book","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Flights","ar":"الطيران"},{"en":"Hotels","ar":"الفنادق"},{"en":"My trips","ar":"رحلاتي"}],"active":0},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Full name","ar":"الاسم الكامل"},"filled":true,"text":{"en":"Nabil Saad","ar":"نبيل سعد"}},{"kind":"small","weight":"bold","color":"brand","text":{"en":"Email","ar":"البريد الإلكتروني"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","text":"","gap":"xs"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Travel date","ar":"تاريخ السفر"},"text":"","gap":"s"}]}}],"answer":["ring"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-052","when":["none"],"feedback":{"en":"Look at the preview: which field is Nabil in? Nothing says. He'd have to type and see where the letters land.","ar":"انظر إلى المعاينة: في أي حقل نبيل؟ لا شيء يوضّح ذلك. سيضطر أن يكتب ويرى أين تظهر الحروف."}},{"id":"MC-P01-052","when":["label"],"feedback":{"en":"A slightly different label color is hard to spot, and gone for people who don't see purple well. A ring around the field is obvious.","ar":"لون العنوان المختلف قليلًا صعب الملاحظة، ولا يراه من لا يميّز البنفسجي جيدًا. أما الإطار حول الحقل فواضح."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Cover the scenario. Can you tell from the preview where Nabil is?","ar":"تجاهل الوصف. هل تعرف من المعاينة أين نبيل؟"},{"en":"Which version marks the field itself, in a way you can't miss?","ar":"أي نسخة تميّز الحقل نفسه، بطريقة لا يمكن أن تفوتك؟"}],"correct":{"en":"The ring shows Nabil exactly where he is.","ar":"الإطار يُظهر لنبيل أين هو بالضبط."},"explain":{"en":"For keyboard users, the focus ring is the mouse pointer. Remove it and they're lost. Style it to fit the brand if you like, but keep it clear.","ar":"بالنسبة إلى مستخدمي لوحة المفاتيح، إطار التركيز بمثابة مؤشّر الماوس. احذفه فيضيعون. يمكنك تصميمه ليناسب هوية المنتج، لكن أبقِه واضحًا."},"speaker":"karim"},{"id":"S03","type":"card","part":"concept","icons":["eye","order","tap","ok"],"title":{"en":"Some people never touch a mouse","ar":"بعض الناس لا يلمسون الماوس أبدًا"},"body":{"en":"People with a tremor, people who are blind, and fast typists move through forms with the keyboard: Tab to the next thing, Shift+Tab back, Enter or Space to press.\n\n- **Focus you can see:** the thing Tab is on needs a clear ring. Never remove it.\n- **Order that matches the page:** Tab should move the way people read the form, top to bottom.\n- **Everything reachable:** every button, link and field must be on the Tab path.\n- **Pop-ups that close:** Esc and a Close button must work, or people get stuck.","ar":"أصحاب الرعشة، والمكفوفون، ومن يكتبون بسرعة يتنقّلون في النماذج بلوحة المفاتيح: Tab للعنصر التالي، وShift+Tab للرجوع، وEnter أو المسافة للضغط.\n\n- **تركيز (Focus) ظاهر:** العنصر الذي يقف عنده Tab يحتاج إطارًا واضحًا. لا تحذفه أبدًا.\n- **ترتيب يطابق الصفحة:** يجب أن يتحرّك Tab كما يقرأ الناس النموذج، من أعلى إلى أسفل.\n- **كل شيء في المتناول:** كل زر ورابط وحقل يجب أن يصل إليه Tab.\n- **نوافذ تُغلق:** يجب أن يعمل Esc وزر الإغلاق، وإلا علق الناس."}},{"id":"S04","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P01-U05-02","part":"guided","rules":["R06","R15"],"value":{"en":"Keyboard accessibility (NN/g): the tab order is normally coded to follow the page layout, top to bottom. When the Pay button comes second, Nabil skips the fields between.","ar":"الإتاحة بلوحة المفاتيح (NN/g): ترتيب Tab يُبرمَج عادةً ليتبع تخطيط الصفحة، من أعلى إلى أسفل. وحين يأتي زر الدفع ثانيًا، يتخطّى نبيل الحقول التي بينهما."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/keyboard-accessibility/","quote":"On most websites the tab order will be coded to reflect the page layout; that is top to bottom and left to right."},"scenario":{"en":"In our code, the Pay button comes right after the name field, because we added it early. On screen it's at the bottom.","ar":"في الكود عندنا، يأتي زر الدفع بعد حقل الاسم مباشرة، لأننا أضفناه مبكّرًا. أما على الشاشة فهو في الأسفل."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each tab order. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل ترتيب لـ Tab. أيّها يجب أن يُطلق؟"},"start":"code","options":[{"id":"code","text":{"en":"Keep the order of the code","ar":"أبقِ ترتيب الكود"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"zad","name":{"en":"Zad Travel","ar":"زاد للسفر"},"color":"#6D28D9","icon":"airplane-tilt","domain":"zad.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"zad.example/book","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Flights","ar":"الطيران"},{"en":"Hotels","ar":"الفنادق"},{"en":"My trips","ar":"رحلاتي"}],"active":0},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Full name","ar":"الاسم الكامل"},"filled":true,"text":{"en":"Nabil Saad","ar":"نبيل سعد"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Email","ar":"البريد الإلكتروني"},"text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Travel date","ar":"تاريخ السفر"},"text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Pay","ar":"ادفع"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"small","color":"brand","text":{"en":"Tab goes: Full name → Pay → Email → Travel date","ar":"ترتيب Tab: الاسم الكامل ← ادفع ← البريد ← تاريخ السفر"},"gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"page","text":{"en":"Match the page: top to bottom","ar":"طابِق الصفحة: من أعلى إلى أسفل"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"zad","name":{"en":"Zad Travel","ar":"زاد للسفر"},"color":"#6D28D9","icon":"airplane-tilt","domain":"zad.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"zad.example/book","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Flights","ar":"الطيران"},{"en":"Hotels","ar":"الفنادق"},{"en":"My trips","ar":"رحلاتي"}],"active":0},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Full name","ar":"الاسم الكامل"},"filled":true,"text":{"en":"Nabil Saad","ar":"نبيل سعد"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Email","ar":"البريد الإلكتروني"},"text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Travel date","ar":"تاريخ السفر"},"text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Pay","ar":"ادفع"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"small","color":"brand","text":{"en":"Tab goes: Full name → Email → Travel date → Pay","ar":"ترتيب Tab: الاسم الكامل ← البريد ← تاريخ السفر ← ادفع"},"gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"move","text":{"en":"Move Pay up under the name, to match the code","ar":"انقل «ادفع» لأعلى تحت الاسم، ليطابق الكود"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"zad","name":{"en":"Zad Travel","ar":"زاد للسفر"},"color":"#6D28D9","icon":"airplane-tilt","domain":"zad.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"zad.example/book","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Flights","ar":"الطيران"},{"en":"Hotels","ar":"الفنادق"},{"en":"My trips","ar":"رحلاتي"}],"active":0},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Full name","ar":"الاسم الكامل"},"filled":true,"text":{"en":"Nabil Saad","ar":"نبيل سعد"}},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Pay","ar":"ادفع"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Email","ar":"البريد الإلكتروني"},"text":"","gap":"m"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Travel date","ar":"تاريخ السفر"},"text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"small","color":"brand","text":{"en":"Tab goes: Full name → Pay → Email → Travel date","ar":"ترتيب Tab: الاسم الكامل ← ادفع ← البريد ← تاريخ السفر"},"gap":"m"}]}}],"answer":["page"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-053","when":["code"],"feedback":{"en":"Nabil reads the form top to bottom, but Tab takes him to Pay second. He may pay before filling in his email and date, or think the form is broken.","ar":"يقرأ نبيل النموذج من أعلى إلى أسفل، لكن Tab يأخذه إلى «ادفع» ثانيًا. قد يدفع قبل أن يكتب بريده وتاريخ سفره، أو يظن أن النموذج معطّل."}},{"id":"MC-P01-053","when":["move"],"feedback":{"en":"Now the order matches, but Pay sits above the fields it pays for, for everyone. Fix the order in the code, not the layout.","ar":"الآن الترتيب متطابق، لكن «ادفع» صار فوق الحقول التي يدفع مقابلها، للجميع. أصلح الترتيب في الكود، لا التخطيط."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Read the form with your eyes, then read the Tab line. Do they match?","ar":"اقرأ النموذج بعينيك، ثم اقرأ سطر Tab. هل يتطابقان؟"},{"en":"Which version keeps Pay last on screen and last for Tab?","ar":"أي نسخة تُبقي «ادفع» الأخير على الشاشة والأخير في Tab؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Tab moves the way the form reads.","ar":"Tab يتحرّك كما يُقرأ النموذج."},"explain":{"en":"Keyboard users expect Tab to follow what they see. When the code order and the screen order differ, change the code.","ar":"يتوقّع مستخدمو لوحة المفاتيح أن يتبع Tab ما يرونه. وحين يختلف ترتيب الكود عن ترتيب الشاشة، غيّر الكود."},"speaker":"karim"},{"id":"S05","type":"words","skill":"SK-P01-U05-01","part":"guided","confidence":true,"rules":["R06","R15"],"value":{"en":"Keyboard accessibility (NN/g): removing the focus indicator is catastrophic for keyboard users. A spec note has to protect the ring on every interactive element.","ar":"الإتاحة بلوحة المفاتيح (NN/g): حذف مؤشّر التركيز كارثة لمستخدمي لوحة المفاتيح. وملاحظة المواصفات يجب أن تحمي الإطار على كل عنصر تفاعلي."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/keyboard-accessibility/","quote":"Removing the keyboard focus indicator is catastrophic for keyboard users."},"scenario":{"en":"I'm writing the handoff notes for the next version, so no one removes the ring again.","ar":"أكتب ملاحظات التسليم (Handoff) للنسخة القادمة، حتى لا يحذف أحد الإطار مرة أخرى."},"prompt":{"en":"Which note should go in the spec?","ar":"أي ملاحظة يجب أن تُكتب في المواصفات (Spec)؟"},"options":[{"id":"hover","text":{"en":"\"Show a ring when the mouse hovers over a field.\"","ar":"«اعرض إطارًا حين يمرّ الماوس فوق الحقل.»"}},{"id":"first","text":{"en":"\"Show a focus ring on the first field, to start people off.\"","ar":"«اعرض إطار تركيز على الحقل الأول، ليبدأ الناس منه.»"}},{"id":"all","text":{"en":"\"Every field, button and link shows a clear focus ring when Tab reaches it.\"","ar":"«كل حقل وزر ورابط يعرض إطار تركيز واضحًا حين يصل إليه Tab.»"}}],"answer":["all"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-052","when":["hover","first"],"feedback":{"en":"Nabil doesn't hover, and he needs the ring on every stop, not just the first. The ring follows Tab everywhere.","ar":"نبيل لا يستخدم الماوس، ويحتاج الإطار في كل محطة، لا في الأولى فقط. الإطار يتبع Tab في كل مكان."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Which note still helps someone who never uses a mouse?","ar":"أي ملاحظة ما زالت تساعد من لا يستخدم الماوس أبدًا؟"},{"en":"Where does Nabil need to see focus: on one field, or on every stop?","ar":"أين يحتاج نبيل أن يرى التركيز: في حقل واحد، أم في كل محطة؟"}],"correct":{"en":"A ring on every stop Tab makes.","ar":"إطار في كل محطة يقف عندها Tab."},"explain":{"en":"Focus is for the keyboard, not the mouse. Every element Tab can reach needs a ring people can see.","ar":"التركيز للوحة المفاتيح، لا للماوس. وكل عنصر يصل إليه Tab يحتاج إطارًا يراه الناس."},"speaker":"karim"},{"id":"S06","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P01-U05-02","part":"guided","rules":["R06","R15"],"value":{"en":"Keyboard accessibility (NN/g): the tab order should reflect the layout. A promo code field that comes first for Tab but last on screen confuses keyboard users.","ar":"الإتاحة بلوحة المفاتيح (NN/g): ترتيب Tab يجب أن يعكس التخطيط. وحقل كود الخصم الذي يأتي أولًا في Tab وأخيرًا على الشاشة يُربك مستخدمي لوحة المفاتيح."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/keyboard-accessibility/","quote":"On most websites the tab order will be coded to reflect the page layout; that is top to bottom and left to right."},"scenario":{"en":"The agency's payment page has the card fields first and a promo code field at the bottom. Because the promo box is a separate piece of code, Tab lands on it before the card number.","ar":"صفحة الدفع في الوكالة فيها حقول البطاقة أولًا وحقل كود الخصم في الأسفل. ولأن مربع الخصم جزء منفصل من الكود، يصل إليه Tab قبل رقم البطاقة."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each tab order. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل ترتيب لـ Tab. أيّها يجب أن يُطلق؟"},"start":"promo","options":[{"id":"promo","text":{"en":"Keep it: promo code first","ar":"اتركه كما هو: كود الخصم أولًا"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"zad","name":{"en":"Zad Travel","ar":"زاد للسفر"},"color":"#6D28D9","icon":"airplane-tilt","domain":"zad.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"zad.example/book","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Flights","ar":"الطيران"},{"en":"Hotels","ar":"الفنادق"},{"en":"My trips","ar":"رحلاتي"}],"active":0},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Card number","ar":"رقم البطاقة"},"text":""},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Expiry date","ar":"تاريخ الانتهاء"},"text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Promo code (optional)","ar":"كود الخصم (اختياري)"},"text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Pay 6,400 EGP","ar":"ادفع 6,400 جنيه"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"small","color":"brand","text":{"en":"Tab goes: Promo code → Card number → Expiry date → Pay","ar":"ترتيب Tab: كود الخصم ← رقم البطاقة ← تاريخ الانتهاء ← ادفع"},"gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"skip","text":{"en":"Take the promo code out of the Tab order","ar":"أخرج كود الخصم من ترتيب Tab"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"zad","name":{"en":"Zad Travel","ar":"زاد للسفر"},"color":"#6D28D9","icon":"airplane-tilt","domain":"zad.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"zad.example/book","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Flights","ar":"الطيران"},{"en":"Hotels","ar":"الفنادق"},{"en":"My trips","ar":"رحلاتي"}],"active":0},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Card number","ar":"رقم البطاقة"},"text":""},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Expiry date","ar":"تاريخ الانتهاء"},"text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Promo code (optional)","ar":"كود الخصم (اختياري)"},"text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Pay 6,400 EGP","ar":"ادفع 6,400 جنيه"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"small","color":"brand","text":{"en":"Tab goes: Card number → Expiry date → Pay","ar":"ترتيب Tab: رقم البطاقة ← تاريخ الانتهاء ← ادفع"},"gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"page","text":{"en":"Card number, expiry, promo code, then Pay","ar":"رقم البطاقة، ثم الانتهاء، ثم كود الخصم، ثم ادفع"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"zad","name":{"en":"Zad Travel","ar":"زاد للسفر"},"color":"#6D28D9","icon":"airplane-tilt","domain":"zad.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"zad.example/book","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Flights","ar":"الطيران"},{"en":"Hotels","ar":"الفنادق"},{"en":"My trips","ar":"رحلاتي"}],"active":0},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Card number","ar":"رقم البطاقة"},"text":""},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Expiry date","ar":"تاريخ الانتهاء"},"text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Promo code (optional)","ar":"كود الخصم (اختياري)"},"text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Pay 6,400 EGP","ar":"ادفع 6,400 جنيه"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"small","color":"brand","text":{"en":"Tab goes: Card number → Expiry date → Promo code → Pay","ar":"ترتيب Tab: رقم البطاقة ← تاريخ الانتهاء ← كود الخصم ← ادفع"},"gap":"m"}]}}],"answer":["page"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-053","when":["promo"],"feedback":{"en":"Nabil starts typing his card number and it lands in the promo box. The order has to match what he sees.","ar":"يبدأ نبيل كتابة رقم بطاقته فيظهر في مربع الخصم. والترتيب يجب أن يطابق ما يراه."}},{"id":"MC-P01-054","when":["skip"],"feedback":{"en":"Now the order is right, but Nabil can never reach the promo code, so he pays full price. Keep it in the order, in its place.","ar":"الآن الترتيب صحيح، لكن نبيل لا يستطيع الوصول إلى كود الخصم أبدًا، فيدفع السعر كاملًا. أبقِه في الترتيب، في مكانه."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Does the Tab line match the form from top to bottom?","ar":"هل يطابق سطر Tab النموذج من أعلى إلى أسفل؟"},{"en":"Can Nabil still reach every field?","ar":"هل ما زال نبيل يستطيع الوصول إلى كل حقل؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Same order as the screen, and nothing left out.","ar":"الترتيب نفسه الذي على الشاشة، ولم يُستبعد أي حقل."},"explain":{"en":"Tab order is a path through the whole form. It follows the layout and includes every control, optional ones too.","ar":"ترتيب Tab يمرّ بالنموذج كله. يتبع التخطيط (Layout) ويشمل كل عنصر، حتى الاختيارية."},"speaker":"karim"},{"id":"S07","type":"compare","skill":"SK-P01-U05-01","part":"contrast","rules":["R11","R15"],"value":{"en":"Contrast with S02: both versions here mark focus somehow. Keyboard accessibility (NN/g): losing the focus indicator is catastrophic. A ring on the field works; a small color change elsewhere barely counts.","ar":"مقارنة مع الخطوة 2: النسختان هنا تعلّمان التركيز بطريقة ما. الإتاحة بلوحة المفاتيح (NN/g): فقدان مؤشّر التركيز كارثة. والإطار على الحقل ينجح؛ أما تغيير لون صغير في مكان آخر فبالكاد يُحسب."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/keyboard-accessibility/","quote":"Removing the keyboard focus indicator is catastrophic for keyboard users."},"scenario":{"en":"Two designers sent me focus styles for the agency's search form. In both, Nabil has tabbed to the \"Return date\" field.","ar":"أرسل لي مصمّمان شكلين للتركيز في نموذج البحث بالوكالة. وفي الاثنين، وصل نبيل بـ Tab إلى حقل «تاريخ العودة»."},"prompt":{"en":"Which focus style should ship?","ar":"أيّ شكل للتركيز يُظهر لنبيل فورًا أنه في «تاريخ العودة»؟"},"a":{"label":{"en":"Label tint","ar":"لون العنوان"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"zad","name":{"en":"Zad Travel","ar":"زاد للسفر"},"color":"#6D28D9","icon":"airplane-tilt","domain":"zad.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"zad.example/book","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Flights","ar":"الطيران"},{"en":"Hotels","ar":"الفنادق"},{"en":"My trips","ar":"رحلاتي"}],"active":0},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Leaving on","ar":"تاريخ الذهاب"},"filled":true,"text":"12/01/2027"},{"kind":"small","weight":"bold","color":"brand","text":{"en":"Return date","ar":"تاريخ العودة"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","text":"","gap":"xs"}]}},"b":{"label":{"en":"Ring","ar":"إطار"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"zad","name":{"en":"Zad Travel","ar":"زاد للسفر"},"color":"#6D28D9","icon":"airplane-tilt","domain":"zad.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"zad.example/book","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Flights","ar":"الطيران"},{"en":"Hotels","ar":"الفنادق"},{"en":"My trips","ar":"رحلاتي"}],"active":0},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Leaving on","ar":"تاريخ الذهاب"},"filled":true,"text":"12/01/2027"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Return date","ar":"تاريخ العودة"},"text":"","focus":true,"gap":"s"}]}},"answer":"b","reason":{"prompt":{"en":"What makes B work?","ar":"ما الذي يجعل B ناجحًا؟"},"options":[{"id":"brand","text":{"en":"It uses the brand color","ar":"يستخدم لون الهوية"}},{"id":"obvious","text":{"en":"It marks the field itself, big enough to spot at a glance","ar":"يميّز الحقل نفسه، بحجم يُلاحَظ بنظرة"}},{"id":"both","text":{"en":"Both are just as clear; it's taste","ar":"الاثنان واضحان بالقدر نفسه؛ إنها مسألة ذوق"}}],"answer":["obvious"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-052","when":["brand","both"],"feedback":{"en":"Both use the same purple. The difference is size and place: a thin color change on the label versus a ring around the field Nabil will type in.","ar":"كلاهما يستخدم البنفسجي نفسه. والفرق في الحجم والمكان: تغيير لون رفيع في العنوان، مقابل إطار حول الحقل الذي سيكتب فيه نبيل."}}]},"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-052","when":["a"],"feedback":{"en":"Squint at A: the empty box looks like every other box. A label tint is easy to miss, so in practice it works like no focus at all.","ar":"انظر إلى A سريعًا: المربع الفارغ يبدو مثل أي مربع. ولون العنوان لا يُلاحَظ بسهولة، فهو عمليًا كأنه لا تركيز."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Glance at each for one second. In which one do you know where Nabil is?","ar":"انظر إلى كل واحد ثانية واحدة. في أيّهما تعرف أين نبيل؟"}],"correct":{"en":"A ring around the field is focus you can't miss.","ar":"الإطار حول الحقل تركيز لا يفوتك."},"explain":{"en":"Focus has to be found at a glance. Mark the element itself, with enough contrast and size; small color shifts don't do that.","ar":"التركيز يجب أن يُرى بنظرة. ميّز العنصر نفسه، بتباين وحجم كافيين؛ وتغيّرات اللون الصغيرة لا تفعل ذلك."},"speaker":"karim"},{"id":"S08","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P01-U05-02","part":"independent","speaker":"nour","rules":["R14","R19"],"value":{"en":"New case. Keyboard accessibility (NN/g): tab order is coded to reflect the page layout, top to bottom. A form built in a different order than it looks sends keyboard users jumping.","ar":"حالة جديدة. الإتاحة بلوحة المفاتيح (NN/g): ترتيب Tab يُبرمَج ليعكس تخطيط الصفحة، من أعلى إلى أسفل. والنموذج المبني بترتيب مختلف عن شكله يجعل مستخدمي لوحة المفاتيح يقفزون."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/keyboard-accessibility/","quote":"On most websites the tab order will be coded to reflect the page layout; that is top to bottom and left to right."},"scenario":{"en":"Patients book appointments on my clinic's website. Our new developer built the date and time first, then moved the patient's name to the top of the screen. Hoda, who is blind, said Tab \"asks for the time before my name\".","ar":"يحجز المرضى مواعيدهم من موقع عيادتي. وبنى المطوّر الجديد التاريخ والوقت أولًا، ثم نقل اسم المريض إلى أعلى الشاشة. وقالت هدى، وهي كفيفة، إن Tab «يسألني عن الوقت قبل اسمي»."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each version. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل نسخة. أيّها يجب أن تُطلق؟"},"start":"built","options":[{"id":"built","text":{"en":"Keep it: the order it was built in","ar":"اتركه كما هو: بالترتيب الذي بُني به"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"raha.example/book","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Doctors","ar":"الأطباء"},{"en":"Book","ar":"احجز"},{"en":"My visits","ar":"زياراتي"}],"active":1},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Patient name","ar":"اسم المريض"},"text":""},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Day","ar":"اليوم"},"text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Time","ar":"الوقت"},"text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Book","ar":"احجز"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"small","color":"brand","text":{"en":"Tab goes: Day → Time → Patient name → Book","ar":"ترتيب Tab: اليوم ← الوقت ← اسم المريض ← احجز"},"gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"note","text":{"en":"Keep the order, and add a note: \"Fill in your name last\"","ar":"أبقِ الترتيب، وأضف ملاحظة: «اكتب اسمك في النهاية»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"raha.example/book","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Doctors","ar":"الأطباء"},{"en":"Book","ar":"احجز"},{"en":"My visits","ar":"زياراتي"}],"active":1},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Fill in your name last.","ar":"اكتب اسمك في النهاية."}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Patient name","ar":"اسم المريض"},"text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Day","ar":"اليوم"},"text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Time","ar":"الوقت"},"text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Book","ar":"احجز"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"small","color":"brand","text":{"en":"Tab goes: Day → Time → Patient name → Book","ar":"ترتيب Tab: اليوم ← الوقت ← اسم المريض ← احجز"},"gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"page","text":{"en":"Order Tab the way the page reads","ar":"رتّب Tab كما تُقرأ الصفحة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"raha.example/book","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Doctors","ar":"الأطباء"},{"en":"Book","ar":"احجز"},{"en":"My visits","ar":"زياراتي"}],"active":1},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Patient name","ar":"اسم المريض"},"text":""},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Day","ar":"اليوم"},"text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Time","ar":"الوقت"},"text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Book","ar":"احجز"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"small","color":"brand","text":{"en":"Tab goes: Patient name → Day → Time → Book","ar":"ترتيب Tab: اسم المريض ← اليوم ← الوقت ← احجز"},"gap":"m"}]}}],"answer":["page"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-053","when":["built","note"],"feedback":{"en":"The build order is our history, not Hoda's problem. A note asks her to work around our bug. Fix the order so Tab follows the page.","ar":"ترتيب البناء شأننا نحن، لا مشكلة هدى. والملاحظة تطلب منها أن تتحايل على خطئنا. أصلح الترتيب ليتبع Tab الصفحة."}}],"correct":{"en":"Tab and the screen now tell the same story.","ar":"الآن يتّفق Tab مع الشاشة."},"explain":{"en":"Whatever order the code was written in, Tab should move the way the form reads. Check it by tabbing through before launch.","ar":"أيًّا كان ترتيب كتابة الكود، يجب أن يتحرّك Tab كما يُقرأ النموذج. اختبره بالتنقّل بـ Tab قبل الإطلاق."}},{"id":"S09","type":"card","part":"recap","icons":["eye","order","tap","ok"],"title":{"en":"What you did","ar":"ماذا تعلّمت"},"body":{"en":"- **Focus you can see:** brought back a clear ring instead of nothing or a label tint.\n- **A spec that protects it:** asked for a ring on every field, button and link.\n- **Tab follows the page:** fixed the order in the code instead of moving Pay up or adding a note.\n- **Nothing left out:** kept the optional promo code on the Tab path, in its place.\n\nNext: controls that the keyboard can't reach, and pop-ups that trap people.","ar":"- **تركيز ظاهر:** أعدت إطارًا واضحًا بدل حذفه أو تلوين العنوان.\n- **مواصفات تحميه:** طلبت إطارًا على كل حقل وزر ورابط.\n- **Tab يتبع الصفحة:** أصلحت الترتيب في الكود بدل نقل «ادفع» لأعلى أو إضافة ملاحظة.\n- **لم يُستبعد شيء:** أبقيت كود الخصم الاختياري في ترتيب Tab، في مكانه.\n\nالتالي: عناصر لا تصل إليها لوحة المفاتيح، ونوافذ تحبس الناس."}}]}$uxg$::jsonb),
  ($uxg$P01-U05-L02$uxg$, $uxg$b2b004c6bef645eee1494fa798f75d110a441146a2b6dd0217f1a2301ebd7add$uxg$, $uxg${"id":"P01-U05-L02","mode":"lesson","minutes":8,"title":{"en":"Every control in reach, every pop-up closable","ar":"كل عنصر في المتناول، وكل نافذة تُغلق"},"summary":{"en":"Make every control reachable by keyboard and every pop-up easy to close.","ar":"اجعل كل عنصر تحكّم في متناول لوحة المفاتيح، وكل نافذة منبثقة (Pop-up) سهلة الإغلاق."},"speaker":"karim","review_labels":{"MC-P01-054":{"en":"Every control must be reachable by keyboard","ar":"يجب أن يصل المستخدم إلى كل عنصر بلوحة المفاتيح"},"MC-P01-055":{"en":"Pop-ups must close by keyboard","ar":"النوافذ المنبثقة يجب أن تُغلق بلوحة المفاتيح"}},"steps":[{"id":"S01","type":"card","part":"hook","title":{"en":"Nabil gets stuck","ar":"نبيل يعلق"},"body":{"en":"Back to the travel agency's booking form. Nabil wanted to add a bag, but Tab skipped right over the bag options. They look like buttons, but in the code they're just painted boxes.\n\nThen a \"Get our offers\" pop-up opened. The only way out was a tiny × that Tab never reached. He was stuck, and closed the whole tab.","ar":"نعود إلى نموذج الحجز في وكالة السفر. أراد نبيل إضافة حقيبة، لكن Tab تخطّى خيارات الحقائب تمامًا. فهي تبدو كأزرار، لكنها في الكود مجرّد مربعات مرسومة.\n\nثم فُتحت نافذة «احصل على عروضنا». والطريقة الوحيدة للخروج × صغيرة لا يصل إليها Tab أبدًا. فعلق، وأغلق الصفحة كلها."},"mock":{"app":{"id":"zad","name":{"en":"Zad Travel","ar":"زاد للسفر"},"color":"#6D28D9","icon":"airplane-tilt","domain":"zad.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"zad.example/book","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Flights","ar":"الطيران"},{"en":"Hotels","ar":"الفنادق"},{"en":"My trips","ar":"رحلاتي"}],"active":0},"blocks":[{"kind":"group","blocks":[{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":"×"},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Get our offers","ar":"احصل على عروضنا"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Email","ar":"البريد الإلكتروني"},"text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Subscribe","ar":"اشترك"},"gap":"s"}]}]}},{"id":"S02","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P01-U05-03","part":"try","rules":["R12"],"value":{"en":"Try first. Keyboard accessibility (NN/g): keyboard users must be able to reach all interactive elements, not only the main links. Bag options that Tab skips can't be chosen at all.","ar":"جرّب أولًا. الإتاحة بلوحة المفاتيح (NN/g): يجب أن يصل مستخدمو لوحة المفاتيح إلى كل العناصر التفاعلية، لا الروابط الرئيسية فقط. وخيارات الحقائب التي يتخطّاها Tab لا يمكن اختيارها أصلًا."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/keyboard-accessibility/","quote":"Keyboard users must be able to access all interactive elements, not just the main navigation or in-line links."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each version of the bag options. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل نسخة لخيارات الحقائب. أيّ نسخة يستطيع بها نبيل اختيار حقيبة بلوحة المفاتيح؟"},"start":"boxes","options":[{"id":"boxes","text":{"en":"Keep the painted boxes","ar":"أبقِ المربعات المرسومة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"zad","name":{"en":"Zad Travel","ar":"زاد للسفر"},"color":"#6D28D9","icon":"airplane-tilt","domain":"zad.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"zad.example/book","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Flights","ar":"الطيران"},{"en":"Hotels","ar":"الفنادق"},{"en":"My trips","ar":"رحلاتي"}],"active":0},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Checked bags","ar":"حقائب الشحن"}},{"kind":"button","emphasis":"low","text":{"en":"No bag","ar":"بلا حقيبة"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","emphasis":"low","text":{"en":"1 bag, +900 EGP","ar":"حقيبة واحدة، +900 جنيه"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Continue","ar":"تابع"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"small","color":"brand","text":{"en":"Tab goes: Continue (the bag options are skipped)","ar":"ترتيب Tab: تابع (يتخطّى خيارات الحقائب)"},"gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"note","text":{"en":"Keep them, and add \"Use a mouse to choose bags\"","ar":"أبقِها، وأضف «استخدم الماوس لاختيار الحقائب»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"zad","name":{"en":"Zad Travel","ar":"زاد للسفر"},"color":"#6D28D9","icon":"airplane-tilt","domain":"zad.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"zad.example/book","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Flights","ar":"الطيران"},{"en":"Hotels","ar":"الفنادق"},{"en":"My trips","ar":"رحلاتي"}],"active":0},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Checked bags","ar":"حقائب الشحن"}},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Use a mouse to choose bags.","ar":"استخدم الماوس لاختيار الحقائب."},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"button","emphasis":"low","text":{"en":"No bag","ar":"بلا حقيبة"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","emphasis":"low","text":{"en":"1 bag, +900 EGP","ar":"حقيبة واحدة، +900 جنيه"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Continue","ar":"تابع"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"small","color":"brand","text":{"en":"Tab goes: Continue (the bag options are skipped)","ar":"ترتيب Tab: تابع (يتخطّى خيارات الحقائب)"},"gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"radios","text":{"en":"Build them as real radio buttons","ar":"ابنِها كـ Radio buttons حقيقية"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"zad","name":{"en":"Zad Travel","ar":"زاد للسفر"},"color":"#6D28D9","icon":"airplane-tilt","domain":"zad.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"zad.example/book","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Flights","ar":"الطيران"},{"en":"Hotels","ar":"الفنادق"},{"en":"My trips","ar":"رحلاتي"}],"active":0},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Checked bags","ar":"حقائب الشحن"}},{"kind":"radio","selected":true,"text":{"en":"No bag","ar":"بلا حقيبة"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"1 bag, +900 EGP","ar":"حقيبة واحدة، +900 جنيه"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Continue","ar":"تابع"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"small","color":"brand","text":{"en":"Tab goes: Bag options (arrows to choose) → Continue","ar":"ترتيب Tab: خيارات الحقائب (الأسهم للاختيار) ← تابع"},"gap":"m"}]}}],"answer":["radios"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-054","when":["boxes"],"feedback":{"en":"Look at the Tab line: the bags are skipped. To Nabil, the choice doesn't exist.","ar":"انظر إلى سطر Tab: يتخطّى الحقائب. وبالنسبة إلى نبيل، الاختيار غير موجود."}},{"id":"MC-P01-054","when":["note"],"feedback":{"en":"Nabil can't use a mouse; that's why he's on the keyboard. The note tells him he's locked out instead of letting him in.","ar":"نبيل لا يستطيع استخدام الماوس؛ ولهذا يستخدم لوحة المفاتيح. والملاحظة تخبره أنه لا يستطيع الاختيار، بدل أن تمكّنه منه."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Read the Tab line under each preview. Where can Nabil choose a bag?","ar":"اقرأ سطر Tab تحت كل معاينة. أين يستطيع نبيل اختيار حقيبة؟"},{"en":"What kind of control does the keyboard already know how to reach?","ar":"أي نوع من العناصر تعرف لوحة المفاتيح الوصول إليه أصلًا؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Real radio buttons are on the Tab path, and arrows pick one.","ar":"الـ Radio buttons الحقيقية يصل إليها Tab، والأسهم تختار منها."},"explain":{"en":"If something can be clicked, it must be reachable by keyboard. Real controls (buttons, links, fields, checkboxes, radios) get that for free.","ar":"كل ما يمكن الضغط عليه يجب أن تصل إليه لوحة المفاتيح. والعناصر الحقيقية (الأزرار، والروابط، والحقول، والـ Checkboxes، والـ Radios) تحصل على ذلك تلقائيًا."}},{"id":"S03","type":"card","part":"concept","icons":["tap","warn","ok","cut"],"title":{"en":"Real controls, and a way out","ar":"عناصر حقيقية، ومخرج"},"body":{"en":"Two things trap keyboard users more than anything else.\n\n- **Fake controls:** a box, picture or text that only reacts to a mouse click is invisible to Tab. Use real buttons, links and fields, and Tab reaches them by itself.\n- **Looks aren't enough:** making text blue or a box look like a button doesn't put it on the Tab path.\n- **Pop-ups with no exit:** every pop-up needs a Close button that Tab reaches, and Esc should close it too.\n- **Back where they were:** when a pop-up closes, focus returns to what opened it.","ar":"شيئان يحبسان مستخدمي لوحة المفاتيح أكثر من أي شيء آخر.\n\n- **عناصر مزيّفة:** المربع أو الصورة أو النص الذي يستجيب لضغطة الماوس فقط لا يراه Tab. استخدم أزرارًا وروابط وحقولًا حقيقية، ويصل إليها Tab تلقائيًا.\n- **الشكل لا يكفي:** جعل النص أزرق أو المربع يشبه الزر لا يجعل Tab يصل إليه.\n- **نوافذ بلا مخرج:** كل نافذة منبثقة (Pop-up) تحتاج زر إغلاق يصل إليه Tab، ويجب أن يغلقها Esc أيضًا.\n- **العودة إلى المكان نفسه:** حين تُغلق النافذة، يعود التركيز إلى العنصر الذي فتحها."}},{"id":"S04","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P01-U05-04","part":"guided","rules":["R06","R15"],"value":{"en":"Keyboard accessibility (NN/g): it is extremely important that people can close pop-ups, or they're stuck inside them. A × only a mouse can press is no exit for Nabil.","ar":"الإتاحة بلوحة المفاتيح (NN/g): من المهم جدًا أن يستطيع الناس إغلاق النوافذ المنبثقة، وإلا علقوا بداخلها. والـ × التي لا يضغطها إلا الماوس ليست مخرجًا لنبيل."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/keyboard-accessibility/","quote":"It is extremely important for users to be able to close pop-ups or they will be stuck inside them."},"scenario":{"en":"The client wants to keep the \"Get our offers\" pop-up. My job is to make sure Nabil can get out of it.","ar":"العميل يريد الإبقاء على نافذة «احصل على عروضنا». ومهمّتي أن أتأكّد أن نبيل يستطيع الخروج منها."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each version of the pop-up. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل نسخة للنافذة. أيّ نسخة يستطيع نبيل أن يخرج منها متى أراد؟"},"start":"x","options":[{"id":"x","text":{"en":"Keep the small × that only a mouse can press","ar":"أبقِ الـ × الصغيرة التي لا يضغطها إلا الماوس"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"zad","name":{"en":"Zad Travel","ar":"زاد للسفر"},"color":"#6D28D9","icon":"airplane-tilt","domain":"zad.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"zad.example/book","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Flights","ar":"الطيران"},{"en":"Hotels","ar":"الفنادق"},{"en":"My trips","ar":"رحلاتي"}],"active":0},"blocks":[{"kind":"group","blocks":[{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":"×"},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Get our offers","ar":"احصل على عروضنا"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Email","ar":"البريد الإلكتروني"},"text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Subscribe","ar":"اشترك"},"gap":"s"}]},{"kind":"small","color":"brand","text":{"en":"Tab goes: Email → Subscribe → Email → … (no way out)","ar":"ترتيب Tab: البريد ← اشترك ← البريد ← … (بلا مخرج)"},"gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"timer","text":{"en":"Close it by itself after 10 seconds","ar":"أغلِقها تلقائيًا بعد 10 ثوانٍ"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"zad","name":{"en":"Zad Travel","ar":"زاد للسفر"},"color":"#6D28D9","icon":"airplane-tilt","domain":"zad.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"zad.example/book","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Flights","ar":"الطيران"},{"en":"Hotels","ar":"الفنادق"},{"en":"My trips","ar":"رحلاتي"}],"active":0},"blocks":[{"kind":"group","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Get our offers","ar":"احصل على عروضنا"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Email","ar":"البريد الإلكتروني"},"text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Subscribe","ar":"اشترك"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Closes in 10 seconds","ar":"تُغلق بعد 10 ثوانٍ"},"gap":"s"}]},{"kind":"small","color":"brand","text":{"en":"Tab goes: Email → Subscribe → … then it vanishes, even mid-typing","ar":"ترتيب Tab: البريد ← اشترك ← … ثم تختفي، حتى أثناء الكتابة"},"gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"close","text":{"en":"A real \"No thanks\" button on the Tab path, and Esc closes it","ar":"زر «لا، شكرًا» حقيقي يصل إليه Tab، وEsc يغلقها"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"zad","name":{"en":"Zad Travel","ar":"زاد للسفر"},"color":"#6D28D9","icon":"airplane-tilt","domain":"zad.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"zad.example/book","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Flights","ar":"الطيران"},{"en":"Hotels","ar":"الفنادق"},{"en":"My trips","ar":"رحلاتي"}],"active":0},"blocks":[{"kind":"group","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Get our offers","ar":"احصل على عروضنا"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Email","ar":"البريد الإلكتروني"},"text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Subscribe","ar":"اشترك"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","style":"plain","text":{"en":"No thanks","ar":"لا، شكرًا"},"gap":"xs"}]},{"kind":"small","color":"brand","text":{"en":"Tab goes: Email → Subscribe → No thanks. Esc closes it too.","ar":"ترتيب Tab: البريد ← اشترك ← لا، شكرًا. وEsc يغلقها أيضًا."},"gap":"m"}]}}],"answer":["close"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-055","when":["x"],"feedback":{"en":"Tab circles between the email and Subscribe forever. Nabil's only way out is to subscribe or leave the site.","ar":"يدور Tab بين البريد و«اشترك» إلى الأبد. ومخرج نبيل الوحيد أن يشترك أو يغادر الموقع."}},{"id":"MC-P01-055","when":["timer"],"feedback":{"en":"Nabil types slowly. A pop-up that vanishes on its own may close in the middle of his email, and he can't close it when he wants to.","ar":"نبيل يكتب ببطء. والنافذة التي تختفي وحدها قد تُغلق في منتصف بريده، ولا يستطيع إغلاقها حين يريد."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Follow the Tab line. Does it ever reach a way out?","ar":"اتبع سطر Tab. هل يصل إلى مخرج في أي وقت؟"},{"en":"Which version lets Nabil leave when he chooses?","ar":"أي نسخة تتيح لنبيل الخروج حين يختار؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Nabil can leave by Tab or by Esc, whenever he wants.","ar":"يستطيع نبيل الخروج بـ Tab أو بـ Esc، متى أراد."},"explain":{"en":"A pop-up takes over the screen, so it must hand control back. A Close button on the Tab path plus Esc covers every keyboard user.","ar":"النافذة المنبثقة تستولي على الشاشة، فيجب أن تُعيد التحكّم إلى الشخص. وزر إغلاق يصل إليه Tab مع Esc يغطّي كل مستخدمي لوحة المفاتيح."},"speaker":"karim"},{"id":"S05","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P01-U05-03","part":"guided","rules":["R06","R15"],"value":{"en":"Keyboard accessibility (NN/g): using only HTML links, buttons and form fields makes sure every element can be tabbed to. Text that only reacts to a click isn't one of them, however it looks.","ar":"الإتاحة بلوحة المفاتيح (NN/g): استخدام روابط وأزرار وحقول HTML فقط يضمن أن يصل Tab إلى كل عنصر. والنص الذي يستجيب للضغط فقط ليس منها، مهما كان شكله."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/keyboard-accessibility/","quote":"Alternatively, using only HTML links, buttons, and form fields will ensure that all elements can be tabbed to."},"scenario":{"en":"Flight results show 5 flights, then \"Show more flights\". In our code, that's plain text that runs a script when clicked. Tab skips it, so Nabil only ever sees 5 flights.","ar":"نتائج الرحلات تعرض 5 رحلات، ثم «اعرض رحلات أكثر». وفي الكود عندنا، هذا نص عادي يشغّل كودًا عند الضغط. ويتخطّاه Tab، فلا يرى نبيل إلا 5 رحلات دائمًا."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each version. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل نسخة. أيّها يجب أن تُطلق؟"},"start":"text","options":[{"id":"text","text":{"en":"Keep the clickable text","ar":"أبقِ النص القابل للضغط"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"zad","name":{"en":"Zad Travel","ar":"زاد للسفر"},"color":"#6D28D9","icon":"airplane-tilt","domain":"zad.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"zad.example/book","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Flights","ar":"الطيران"},{"en":"Hotels","ar":"الفنادق"},{"en":"My trips","ar":"رحلاتي"}],"active":0},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"5 of 14 flights","ar":"5 من 14 رحلة"}},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Show more flights","ar":"اعرض رحلات أكثر"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"small","color":"brand","text":{"en":"Tab goes: last flight → page footer (skips \"Show more\")","ar":"ترتيب Tab: آخر رحلة ← أسفل الصفحة (يتخطّى «اعرض أكثر»)"},"gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"blue","text":{"en":"Make the text blue and underlined","ar":"اجعل النص أزرق وتحته خط"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"zad","name":{"en":"Zad Travel","ar":"زاد للسفر"},"color":"#6D28D9","icon":"airplane-tilt","domain":"zad.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"zad.example/book","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Flights","ar":"الطيران"},{"en":"Hotels","ar":"الفنادق"},{"en":"My trips","ar":"رحلاتي"}],"active":0},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"5 of 14 flights","ar":"5 من 14 رحلة"}},{"kind":"link","text":{"en":"Show more flights","ar":"اعرض رحلات أكثر"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"small","color":"brand","text":{"en":"Tab goes: last flight → page footer (skips \"Show more\")","ar":"ترتيب Tab: آخر رحلة ← أسفل الصفحة (يتخطّى «اعرض أكثر»)"},"gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"button","text":{"en":"Make it a real button","ar":"اجعله زرًا حقيقيًا"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"zad","name":{"en":"Zad Travel","ar":"زاد للسفر"},"color":"#6D28D9","icon":"airplane-tilt","domain":"zad.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"zad.example/book","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Flights","ar":"الطيران"},{"en":"Hotels","ar":"الفنادق"},{"en":"My trips","ar":"رحلاتي"}],"active":0},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"5 of 14 flights","ar":"5 من 14 رحلة"}},{"kind":"button","emphasis":"low","text":{"en":"Show more flights","ar":"اعرض رحلات أكثر"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"small","color":"brand","text":{"en":"Tab goes: last flight → Show more flights → page footer","ar":"ترتيب Tab: آخر رحلة ← اعرض رحلات أكثر ← أسفل الصفحة"},"gap":"m"}]}}],"answer":["button"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-054","when":["text","blue"],"feedback":{"en":"Blue and underlined looks like a link, but it's still plain text in the code, so Tab still skips it. What it's built from decides, not how it looks.","ar":"الأزرق مع الخط يبدو رابطًا، لكنه ما زال نصًا عاديًا في الكود، فيظل Tab يتخطّاه. المهم ما بُني منه، لا شكله."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Compare the Tab lines. Which one changed?","ar":"قارن أسطر Tab. أيّها تغيّر؟"},{"en":"Does changing a color change what the code is?","ar":"هل يغيّر اللون نوع العنصر في الكود؟"}],"correct":{"en":"A real button is on the Tab path by itself.","ar":"الزر الحقيقي يصل إليه Tab تلقائيًا."},"explain":{"en":"Tab finds links, buttons and fields. Anything else that acts like a control needs to become one of those, not just look like one.","ar":"Tab يجد الروابط والأزرار والحقول. وأي شيء آخر يتصرّف كعنصر تحكّم يجب أن يصبح واحدًا منها، لا أن يشبهها فقط."},"speaker":"karim"},{"id":"S06","type":"words","skill":"SK-P01-U05-04","part":"guided","confidence":true,"rules":["R06","R15"],"value":{"en":"Keyboard accessibility (NN/g): people must be able to close pop-ups, or they're stuck. A good spec says how: a Close button, Esc, and focus going back where it was.","ar":"الإتاحة بلوحة المفاتيح (NN/g): يجب أن يستطيع الناس إغلاق النوافذ المنبثقة، وإلا علقوا. والمواصفات الجيدة تقول كيف: زر إغلاق، وEsc، وعودة التركيز إلى مكانه."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/keyboard-accessibility/","quote":"It is extremely important for users to be able to close pop-ups or they will be stuck inside them."},"scenario":{"en":"The travel date opens a calendar pop-up. I'm writing the spec note for how it closes.","ar":"تاريخ السفر يفتح نافذة تقويم منبثقة. وأكتب في المواصفات (Spec) كيف تُغلق."},"prompt":{"en":"Which note should go in the spec?","ar":"أي ملاحظة يجب أن تُكتب في المواصفات (Spec)؟"},"options":[{"id":"outside","text":{"en":"\"Clicking outside the calendar closes it.\"","ar":"«الضغط خارج التقويم يغلقه.»"}},{"id":"full","text":{"en":"\"Esc and a Close button close the calendar, and focus goes back to the date field.\"","ar":"«Esc وزر إغلاق يغلقان التقويم، ويعود التركيز إلى حقل التاريخ.»"}},{"id":"pick","text":{"en":"\"The calendar closes once a date is picked.\"","ar":"«يُغلق التقويم بمجرّد اختيار تاريخ.»"}}],"answer":["full"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-055","when":["outside","pick"],"feedback":{"en":"Clicking outside needs a mouse, and \"after picking\" traps anyone who opened it by mistake. Keyboard users need Esc and a Close button.","ar":"الضغط خارج التقويم يحتاج ماوسًا، و«بعد الاختيار» يحبس كل من فتحه بالخطأ. ومستخدمو لوحة المفاتيح يحتاجون Esc وزر إغلاق."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Which note still works for someone with only a keyboard, who opened the calendar by mistake?","ar":"أي ملاحظة تعمل لمن يستخدم لوحة المفاتيح فقط، وفتح التقويم بالخطأ؟"},{"en":"Where should Nabil be after the calendar closes?","ar":"أين يجب أن يكون نبيل بعد أن يُغلق التقويم؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Two ways out by keyboard, and Nabil lands back where he was.","ar":"مخرجان بلوحة المفاتيح، ويعود نبيل إلى حيث كان."},"explain":{"en":"A pop-up should open and close on the person's terms. Esc, a reachable Close button, and focus returning to its starting point make that true.","ar":"النافذة المنبثقة يجب أن تُفتح وتُغلق كما يريد الشخص. وEsc، وزر إغلاق يصل إليه Tab، وعودة التركيز إلى حيث بدأ، تحقّق ذلك."},"speaker":"karim"},{"id":"S07","type":"compare","skill":"SK-P01-U05-03","part":"contrast","rules":["R11","R15"],"value":{"en":"Contrast with S05: here both icons look exactly the same. Keyboard accessibility (NN/g): keyboard users must reach all interactive elements. Only what each one is built from differs.","ar":"مقارنة مع الخطوة 5: الأيقونتان هنا متطابقتان في الشكل. الإتاحة بلوحة المفاتيح (NN/g): يجب أن يصل مستخدمو لوحة المفاتيح إلى كل العناصر التفاعلية. والفرق الوحيد فيما بُنيت منه كل واحدة."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/keyboard-accessibility/","quote":"Keyboard users must be able to access all interactive elements, not just the main navigation or in-line links."},"scenario":{"en":"The sign-in form has a 👁 to show the password. Version A builds it as a picture with a click script. Version B builds it as a real button with the same picture inside.","ar":"نموذج الدخول فيه 👁 لإظهار كلمة المرور. النسخة A تبنيها كصورة مع كود للضغط. والنسخة B تبنيها كزر حقيقي بداخله الصورة نفسها."},"prompt":{"en":"Which version should ship?","ar":"أي نسخة يجب أن تُطلق؟"},"a":{"label":{"en":"Picture","ar":"صورة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"zad","name":{"en":"Zad Travel","ar":"زاد للسفر"},"color":"#6D28D9","icon":"airplane-tilt","domain":"zad.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"zad.example/sign-in","blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Password 👁","ar":"كلمة المرور 👁"},"filled":true,"text":"••••••••"},{"kind":"small","color":"brand","text":{"en":"Tab goes: Password → Sign in","ar":"ترتيب Tab: كلمة المرور ← دخول"},"gap":"s"}]}},"b":{"label":{"en":"Button","ar":"زر"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"zad","name":{"en":"Zad Travel","ar":"زاد للسفر"},"color":"#6D28D9","icon":"airplane-tilt","domain":"zad.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"zad.example/sign-in","blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Password 👁","ar":"كلمة المرور 👁"},"filled":true,"text":"••••••••"},{"kind":"small","color":"brand","text":{"en":"Tab goes: Password → Show password → Sign in","ar":"ترتيب Tab: كلمة المرور ← أظهر كلمة المرور ← دخول"},"gap":"s"}]}},"answer":"b","reason":{"prompt":{"en":"What decides it?","ar":"ما الذي يحسم الأمر؟"},"options":[{"id":"look","text":{"en":"B's icon is easier to see","ar":"أيقونة B أسهل في الرؤية"}},{"id":"built","text":{"en":"B is a real button, so Tab reaches it","ar":"B زر حقيقي، فيصل إليه Tab"}},{"id":"same","text":{"en":"Nothing; they look the same","ar":"لا شيء؛ شكلهما واحد"}}],"answer":["built"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-054","when":["look","same"],"feedback":{"en":"They look identical. Read the Tab lines: in A, the eye is never reached. Nabil can't check what he typed.","ar":"شكلهما متطابق. اقرأ سطري Tab: في A، لا يصل Tab إلى العين أبدًا. ولا يستطيع نبيل مراجعة ما كتبه."}}]},"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-054","when":["a"],"feedback":{"en":"A looks fine, but it works for mouse users only. Nabil can't show his password to check it.","ar":"A تبدو جيدة، لكنها تعمل لمستخدمي الماوس فقط. ولا يستطيع نبيل إظهار كلمة مروره ليراجعها."}}],"hints":[{"en":"The pictures match. What's different in the Tab lines?","ar":"الصورتان متطابقتان. ما المختلف في سطري Tab؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Same look; only the real button works by keyboard.","ar":"الشكل نفسه؛ والزر الحقيقي وحده يعمل بلوحة المفاتيح."},"explain":{"en":"You can't see keyboard access in a screenshot. Check by pressing Tab, and build every clickable thing as a real control.","ar":"سهولة الوصول بلوحة المفاتيح لا تظهر في لقطة الشاشة (Screenshot). اختبرها بالضغط على Tab، وابنِ كل شيء قابل للضغط كعنصر حقيقي."},"speaker":"karim"},{"id":"S08","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P01-U05-04","part":"independent","speaker":"mona","rules":["R14","R19"],"value":{"en":"New case. Keyboard accessibility (NN/g): people must be able to close pop-ups, or they're stuck inside them. A help panel that opens over a form needs its own way out.","ar":"حالة جديدة. الإتاحة بلوحة المفاتيح (NN/g): يجب أن يستطيع الناس إغلاق النوافذ المنبثقة، وإلا علقوا بداخلها. ولوحة المساعدة التي تُفتح فوق النموذج تحتاج مخرجها الخاص."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/keyboard-accessibility/","quote":"It is extremely important for users to be able to close pop-ups or they will be stuck inside them."},"scenario":{"en":"My team designs an insurance sign-up form. A help panel opens over it when you press \"Need help?\". Zeinab, who uses a screen reader with the keyboard, opened it by mistake and couldn't get back to the form.","ar":"يصمّم فريقي نموذج اشتراك في تأمين. وتُفتح لوحة مساعدة فوقه حين تضغط «تحتاج مساعدة؟». وزينب، التي تستخدم قارئ شاشة (Screen reader) مع لوحة المفاتيح، فتحتها بالخطأ ولم تستطع العودة إلى النموذج."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each version of the help panel. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل نسخة للوحة المساعدة. أيّ نسخة تتيح لزينب إغلاقها والعودة إلى النموذج بلوحة المفاتيح؟"},"start":"none","options":[{"id":"none","text":{"en":"Keep it: no close control","ar":"اتركها كما هي: بلا زر إغلاق"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"aman","name":{"en":"Aman","ar":"أمان"},"color":"#364FC7","icon":"shield-check","domain":"aman.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"aman.example/sign-up","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Car","ar":"السيارات"},{"en":"Health","ar":"الصحة"},{"en":"Claims","ar":"المطالبات"}],"active":1},"blocks":[{"kind":"group","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"How can we help?","ar":"كيف نساعدك؟"}},{"kind":"link","text":{"en":"Which plan is right for me?","ar":"أي باقة تناسبني؟"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"link","text":{"en":"Call us","ar":"اتصل بنا"},"gap":"s"}]},{"kind":"small","color":"brand","text":{"en":"Tab goes: Which plan… → Call us → Which plan… (stuck)","ar":"ترتيب Tab: أي باقة… ← اتصل بنا ← أي باقة… (عالقة)"},"gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"close","text":{"en":"A Close button first in the panel, Esc closes it, focus returns to \"Need help?\"","ar":"زر إغلاق في أول اللوحة، وEsc يغلقها، ويعود التركيز إلى «تحتاج مساعدة؟»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"aman","name":{"en":"Aman","ar":"أمان"},"color":"#364FC7","icon":"shield-check","domain":"aman.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"aman.example/sign-up","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Car","ar":"السيارات"},{"en":"Health","ar":"الصحة"},{"en":"Claims","ar":"المطالبات"}],"active":1},"blocks":[{"kind":"group","blocks":[{"kind":"button","style":"plain","text":{"en":"Close help","ar":"أغلق المساعدة"}},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"How can we help?","ar":"كيف نساعدك؟"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"link","text":{"en":"Which plan is right for me?","ar":"أي باقة تناسبني؟"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"link","text":{"en":"Call us","ar":"اتصل بنا"},"gap":"s"}]},{"kind":"small","color":"brand","text":{"en":"Tab goes: Close help → Which plan… → Call us. Esc closes it too.","ar":"ترتيب Tab: أغلق المساعدة ← أي باقة… ← اتصل بنا. وEsc يغلقها أيضًا."},"gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"reload","text":{"en":"Tell people to reload the page to close it","ar":"اطلب من الناس إعادة تحميل الصفحة لإغلاقها"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"aman","name":{"en":"Aman","ar":"أمان"},"color":"#364FC7","icon":"shield-check","domain":"aman.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"aman.example/sign-up","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Car","ar":"السيارات"},{"en":"Health","ar":"الصحة"},{"en":"Claims","ar":"المطالبات"}],"active":1},"blocks":[{"kind":"group","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"How can we help?","ar":"كيف نساعدك؟"}},{"kind":"link","text":{"en":"Which plan is right for me?","ar":"أي باقة تناسبني؟"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"link","text":{"en":"Call us","ar":"اتصل بنا"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"To close, reload the page.","ar":"للإغلاق، أعد تحميل الصفحة."},"gap":"s"}]},{"kind":"small","color":"brand","text":{"en":"Tab goes: Which plan… → Call us → (reload loses the form)","ar":"ترتيب Tab: أي باقة… ← اتصل بنا ← (إعادة التحميل تُضيّع النموذج)"},"gap":"m"}]}}],"answer":["close"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-055","when":["none","reload"],"feedback":{"en":"Zeinab is either stuck in the panel or loses everything she typed. A pop-up must close by keyboard and leave the form as it was.","ar":"زينب إما عالقة في اللوحة أو تفقد كل ما كتبته. والنافذة المنبثقة يجب أن تُغلق بلوحة المفاتيح وتترك النموذج كما كان."}}],"correct":{"en":"Zeinab can close it two ways and lands back on \"Need help?\".","ar":"تستطيع زينب إغلاقها بطريقتين وتعود إلى «تحتاج مساعدة؟»."},"explain":{"en":"Every panel or pop-up that opens over a form needs a Close button on the Tab path, Esc, and a return to where the person was.","ar":"كل لوحة أو نافذة تُفتح فوق النموذج تحتاج زر إغلاق يصل إليه Tab، وEsc، وأن تُعيد الشخص إلى حيث كان."}},{"id":"S09","type":"card","part":"recap","icons":["tap","ok","cut","eye"],"title":{"en":"What you did","ar":"ماذا تعلّمت"},"body":{"en":"- **Real controls:** rebuilt painted bag boxes as radio buttons and clickable text as a button.\n- **Looks aren't access:** saw that blue text and an identical icon can still be skipped by Tab.\n- **A way out:** gave pop-ups a Close button on the Tab path, plus Esc.\n- **Back where they were:** sent focus back to what opened the calendar or help panel.\n\nNext: forms on a touch screen, and the button that wipes everything.","ar":"- **عناصر حقيقية:** أعدت بناء مربعات الحقائب المرسومة كـ Radio buttons، والنص القابل للضغط كزر.\n- **الشكل لا يضمن الوصول:** رأيت أن النص الأزرق والأيقونة المتطابقة قد يتخطّاهما Tab.\n- **مخرج:** أعطيت النوافذ المنبثقة زر إغلاق يصل إليه Tab، مع Esc.\n- **العودة إلى المكان نفسه:** أعدت التركيز إلى العنصر الذي فتح التقويم أو لوحة المساعدة.\n\nالتالي: النماذج على شاشات اللمس، والزر الذي يمسح كل شيء."}}]}$uxg$::jsonb),
  ($uxg$P01-U05-L03$uxg$, $uxg$ce08b01f52ccf2001e7f88f6965524cee52ac63e5255ddb90ae92dd1a9288e87$uxg$, $uxg${"id":"P01-U05-L03","mode":"lesson","minutes":8,"title":{"en":"Big enough to tap, safe to send","ar":"كبير بما يكفي للضغط، وآمن عند الإرسال"},"summary":{"en":"Size and space tap targets, and stop a Clear button from wiping a long form.","ar":"حدّد حجم أهداف اللمس (Tap targets) والمسافة بينها، وامنع زر «مسح» من محو نموذج طويل."},"speaker":"karim","review_labels":{"MC-P01-056":{"en":"Tap targets need size and space","ar":"أهداف اللمس تحتاج حجمًا ومسافة"},"MC-P01-057":{"en":"No Clear or Reset next to Submit","ar":"لا «مسح» ولا «إعادة ضبط» (Reset) بجوار «أرسل»"}},"steps":[{"id":"S01","type":"card","part":"hook","title":{"en":"Aziza's lost request","ar":"طلب عزيزة الضائع"},"body":{"en":"I'm building a phone app for a home repair company. Aziza is 68. She filled in a long request for a plumber, then tapped what she thought was Send.\n\nIt was Clear, sitting right beside it. Everything she typed was gone. Earlier, she had also tapped the wrong time slot twice, because the slots are tiny and packed together.","ar":"أبني تطبيق هاتف لشركة صيانة منزلية. عزيزة عمرها 68 عامًا. ملأت طلبًا طويلًا لسبّاك، ثم ضغطت ما ظنّته «أرسل».\n\nكان «مسح»، الموجود بجواره مباشرة. فضاع كل ما كتبته. وقبل ذلك، كانت قد ضغطت موعدًا خاطئًا مرتين، لأن المواعيد صغيرة جدًا ومتلاصقة."},"mock":{"app":{"id":"usta","name":{"en":"Usta","ar":"أُسطى"},"color":"#F59E0B","icon":"wrench","domain":"usta.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Request a plumber","ar":"اطلب سبّاكًا"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"wrench","text":{"en":"Plumber visit","ar":"زيارة سبّاك"},"sub":{"en":"Usually within 24 hours","ar":"عادةً خلال 24 ساعة"},"value":{"en":"From EGP 250","ar":"من 250 جنيه"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"What's the problem?","ar":"ما المشكلة؟"},"filled":true,"text":{"en":"Kitchen sink leaks under the cabinet…","ar":"في حوض المطبخ تسريب تحت الدولاب…"}},{"kind":"row","gap":"m","blocks":[{"kind":"button","emphasis":"low","text":{"en":"Clear","ar":"مسح"}},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Send","ar":"أرسل"}}]}]}},{"id":"S02","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P01-U05-06","part":"try","rules":["R12"],"value":{"en":"Try first. Reset and Cancel buttons (NN/g): the worst problem with Reset is that people click it by mistake when they meant Submit. Nobody needs to wipe a whole form in one tap.","ar":"جرّب أولًا. أزرار Reset وCancel (NN/g): أسوأ مشكلة في زر Reset أن الناس يضغطونه بالخطأ وهم يقصدون الإرسال. ولا أحد يحتاج أن يمسح نموذجًا كاملًا بضغطة واحدة."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/reset-and-cancel-buttons/","quote":"The worst problem about Reset is that users click the button by mistake when they wanted to click Submit."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each version of the bottom of the form. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل نسخة لأسفل النموذج. أيّ نسخة تحمي طلب عزيزة من المسح بالخطأ؟"},"start":"both","options":[{"id":"both","text":{"en":"Keep Clear beside Send","ar":"أبقِ «مسح» بجوار «أرسل»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"usta","name":{"en":"Usta","ar":"أُسطى"},"color":"#F59E0B","icon":"wrench","domain":"usta.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Request a plumber","ar":"اطلب سبّاكًا"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"wrench","text":{"en":"Plumber visit","ar":"زيارة سبّاك"},"sub":{"en":"Usually within 24 hours","ar":"عادةً خلال 24 ساعة"},"value":{"en":"From EGP 250","ar":"من 250 جنيه"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"What's the problem?","ar":"ما المشكلة؟"},"filled":true,"text":{"en":"Kitchen sink leaks under the cabinet…","ar":"في حوض المطبخ تسريب تحت الدولاب…"}},{"kind":"row","gap":"m","blocks":[{"kind":"button","emphasis":"low","text":{"en":"Clear","ar":"مسح"}},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Send","ar":"أرسل"}}]}]}},{"id":"link","text":{"en":"Turn Clear into a small grey link under Send","ar":"حوّل «مسح» إلى رابط رمادي صغير تحت «أرسل»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"usta","name":{"en":"Usta","ar":"أُسطى"},"color":"#F59E0B","icon":"wrench","domain":"usta.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Request a plumber","ar":"اطلب سبّاكًا"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"wrench","text":{"en":"Plumber visit","ar":"زيارة سبّاك"},"sub":{"en":"Usually within 24 hours","ar":"عادةً خلال 24 ساعة"},"value":{"en":"From EGP 250","ar":"من 250 جنيه"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"What's the problem?","ar":"ما المشكلة؟"},"filled":true,"text":{"en":"Kitchen sink leaks under the cabinet…","ar":"في حوض المطبخ تسريب تحت الدولاب…"}},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Send","ar":"أرسل"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"button","style":"plain","text":{"en":"Clear","ar":"مسح"},"gap":"xs"}]}},{"id":"none","text":{"en":"Remove Clear; keep only Send","ar":"احذف «مسح»؛ وأبقِ «أرسل» فقط"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"usta","name":{"en":"Usta","ar":"أُسطى"},"color":"#F59E0B","icon":"wrench","domain":"usta.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Request a plumber","ar":"اطلب سبّاكًا"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"wrench","text":{"en":"Plumber visit","ar":"زيارة سبّاك"},"sub":{"en":"Usually within 24 hours","ar":"عادةً خلال 24 ساعة"},"value":{"en":"From EGP 250","ar":"من 250 جنيه"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"What's the problem?","ar":"ما المشكلة؟"},"filled":true,"text":{"en":"Kitchen sink leaks under the cabinet…","ar":"في حوض المطبخ تسريب تحت الدولاب…"}}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Send","ar":"أرسل"}}]}}],"answer":["none"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-057","when":["both"],"feedback":{"en":"One slip and Aziza loses everything, which is exactly what happened. The button's only job is the thing nobody wants.","ar":"زلّة واحدة وتفقد عزيزة كل شيء، وهذا بالضبط ما حدث. والمهمة الوحيدة لهذا الزر هي ما لا يريده أحد."}},{"id":"MC-P01-057","when":["link"],"feedback":{"en":"Smaller and greyer, but still one tap under Send. A thumb that lands a little low still wipes the form. Nobody needs it, so remove it.","ar":"أصغر وأكثر رمادية، لكنه ما زال تحت «أرسل» مباشرة. والإصبع الذي ينزل قليلًا يمسح النموذج. ولا أحد يحتاجه، فاحذفه."}}],"hints":[{"en":"When does anyone really want to erase every answer at once?","ar":"متى يريد أحد حقًا أن يمسح كل الإجابات دفعة واحدة؟"},{"en":"Which version makes losing the form impossible by mistake?","ar":"أي نسخة تجعل فقدان النموذج بالخطأ مستحيلًا؟"}],"correct":{"en":"No Clear, no accident.","ar":"بلا «مسح»، لا مسح بالخطأ."},"explain":{"en":"People change one answer by editing that field. A button that erases everything helps almost no one and hurts anyone who taps it by mistake.","ar":"يغيّر الناس إجابة واحدة بتعديل حقلها. والزر الذي يمسح كل شيء لا يفيد أحدًا تقريبًا، ويؤذي كل من يضغطه بالخطأ."}},{"id":"S03","type":"card","part":"concept","icons":["tap","space","cut","ok"],"title":{"en":"Fingers are bigger than pointers","ar":"الأصابع أكبر من مؤشّر الماوس"},"body":{"en":"On a phone, every button is pressed with a fingertip, often a thumb, often while moving.\n\n- **Big enough:** make each tap target at least 1 cm by 1 cm. The tap area can be bigger than the text or icon inside it.\n- **Spaced apart:** leave room between targets, so a tap lands on one thing, not its neighbour.\n- **Dangerous buttons far away:** Delete next to Edit, or Clear next to Send, turns a small slip into a big loss.\n- **No Clear button:** people fix a form one field at a time. Leave out buttons that wipe it all.","ar":"على الهاتف، كل زر يُضغط بطرف الإصبع، غالبًا بالإبهام، وغالبًا أثناء الحركة.\n\n- **كبير بما يكفي:** اجعل كل هدف لمس (Tap target) 1 سم × 1 سم على الأقل. ومساحة اللمس يمكن أن تكون أكبر من النص أو الأيقونة بداخلها.\n- **متباعد:** اترك مسافة بين الأهداف، لتقع الضغطة على عنصر واحد، لا على جاره.\n- **الأزرار الخطرة بعيدة:** «حذف» بجوار «تعديل»، أو «مسح» بجوار «أرسل»، يحوّلان زلّة صغيرة إلى خسارة كبيرة.\n- **بلا زر مسح:** يُصلح الناس النموذج حقلًا حقلًا. استغنِ عن الأزرار التي تمسح كل شيء."}},{"id":"S04","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P01-U05-05","part":"guided","rules":["R06","R15"],"value":{"en":"Touch targets (NN/g): the minimum size should be 1 cm × 1 cm. Time slots drawn as small tags are about half that, so Aziza's finger covers two at once.","ar":"أهداف اللمس (NN/g): الحد الأدنى للحجم 1 سم × 1 سم. والمواعيد المرسومة كعلامات صغيرة نصف ذلك تقريبًا، فيغطّي إصبع عزيزة موعدين في وقت واحد."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/touch-target-size/","quote":"its minimum size should be 1cm × 1cm (0.4in x 0.4in)"},"scenario":{"en":"People pick a visit time from small tags, about 5 mm tall. Aziza wanted 11 am and got 10 am, twice.","ar":"يختار الناس موعد الزيارة من علامات صغيرة، ارتفاعها نحو 5 مم. أرادت عزيزة الحادية عشرة فاختارت العاشرة، مرتين."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each version of the time slots. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل نسخة للمواعيد. أيّ نسخة تساعد عزيزة على ضغط الموعد الذي تريده من أول مرة؟"},"start":"tags","options":[{"id":"tags","text":{"en":"Keep the small tags","ar":"أبقِ العلامات الصغيرة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"usta","name":{"en":"Usta","ar":"أُسطى"},"color":"#F59E0B","icon":"wrench","domain":"usta.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Visit time","ar":"موعد الزيارة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"wrench","text":{"en":"Plumber visit","ar":"زيارة سبّاك"},"sub":{"en":"Usually within 24 hours","ar":"عادةً خلال 24 ساعة"},"value":{"en":"From EGP 250","ar":"من 250 جنيه"}},{"kind":"small","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Visit time, Tuesday","ar":"موعد الزيارة، الثلاثاء"}},{"kind":"row","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"chip","tone":"off","text":{"en":"9 am","ar":"9 ص"}},{"kind":"chip","tone":"off","text":{"en":"10 am","ar":"10 ص"}},{"kind":"chip","tone":"off","text":{"en":"11 am","ar":"11 ص"}},{"kind":"chip","tone":"off","text":{"en":"12 pm","ar":"12 م"}}]}]}},{"id":"bold","text":{"en":"Keep the tags, with bigger, bold text","ar":"أبقِ العلامات، بخط أكبر وعريض"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"usta","name":{"en":"Usta","ar":"أُسطى"},"color":"#F59E0B","icon":"wrench","domain":"usta.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Visit time","ar":"موعد الزيارة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"wrench","text":{"en":"Plumber visit","ar":"زيارة سبّاك"},"sub":{"en":"Usually within 24 hours","ar":"عادةً خلال 24 ساعة"},"value":{"en":"From EGP 250","ar":"من 250 جنيه"}},{"kind":"small","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Visit time, Tuesday","ar":"موعد الزيارة، الثلاثاء"}},{"kind":"row","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"chip","tone":"off","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"9 am","ar":"9 ص"}},{"kind":"chip","tone":"off","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"10 am","ar":"10 ص"}},{"kind":"chip","tone":"off","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"11 am","ar":"11 ص"}},{"kind":"chip","tone":"off","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"12 pm","ar":"12 م"}}]}]}},{"id":"buttons","text":{"en":"Make each slot a button at least 1 cm tall, two per row","ar":"اجعل كل موعد زرًا ارتفاعه 1 سم على الأقل، اثنين في كل صف"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"usta","name":{"en":"Usta","ar":"أُسطى"},"color":"#F59E0B","icon":"wrench","domain":"usta.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Visit time","ar":"موعد الزيارة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"wrench","text":{"en":"Plumber visit","ar":"زيارة سبّاك"},"sub":{"en":"Usually within 24 hours","ar":"عادةً خلال 24 ساعة"},"value":{"en":"From EGP 250","ar":"من 250 جنيه"}},{"kind":"small","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Visit time, Tuesday","ar":"موعد الزيارة، الثلاثاء"}},{"kind":"row","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"button","emphasis":"low","text":{"en":"9 am","ar":"9 ص"}},{"kind":"button","emphasis":"low","text":{"en":"10 am","ar":"10 ص"}}]},{"kind":"row","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"button","emphasis":"low","text":{"en":"11 am","ar":"11 ص"}},{"kind":"button","emphasis":"low","text":{"en":"12 pm","ar":"12 م"}}]}]}}],"answer":["buttons"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-056","when":["tags","bold"],"feedback":{"en":"Bigger text is easier to read, but the tag is still about 5 mm tall. A fingertip is wider than that, so it still lands on the wrong time.","ar":"النص الأكبر أسهل في القراءة، لكن العلامة ما زالت بارتفاع 5 مم تقريبًا. وطرف الإصبع أعرض من ذلك، فيقع على الموعد الخطأ مرة أخرى."}}],"hints":[{"en":"What did Aziza get wrong: reading the time, or hitting it?","ar":"أين أخطأت عزيزة: في قراءة الموعد، أم في الضغط عليه؟"},{"en":"Which version gives each slot room for a whole fingertip?","ar":"أي نسخة تعطي كل موعد مساحة لطرف إصبع كامل؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Each slot is now big enough for a fingertip.","ar":"كل موعد الآن كبير بما يكفي لطرف إصبع."},"explain":{"en":"Reading size and tapping size are different problems. A target needs about 1 cm in each direction, whatever the text size.","ar":"حجم القراءة وحجم الضغط مشكلتان مختلفتان. والهدف يحتاج نحو 1 سم في كل اتجاه، أيًّا كان حجم النص."},"speaker":"karim"},{"id":"S05","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P01-U05-05","part":"guided","rules":["R06","R15"],"value":{"en":"Touch targets (NN/g): to avoid accidental taps, targets must be big enough and also spaced well enough. A bigger Delete that touches Edit is still one slip away.","ar":"أهداف اللمس (NN/g): لتجنّب الضغطات العرضية، يجب أن تكون الأهداف كبيرة بما يكفي ومتباعدة بما يكفي أيضًا. و«حذف» الأكبر الملاصق لـ «تعديل» ما زال على بُعد زلّة."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/touch-target-size/","quote":"To avoid accidental taps, targets must first be big enough, and then also spaced well enough"},"scenario":{"en":"Under each saved address there are two buttons: Edit and Delete. Right now they're small and touching. Last week, three customers deleted an address they meant to edit.","ar":"تحت كل عنوان محفوظ زرّان: «تعديل» و«حذف». وهما الآن صغيران ومتلاصقان. والأسبوع الماضي، حذف ثلاثة عملاء عنوانًا كانوا يقصدون تعديله."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each version. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل نسخة. أيّها يجب أن تُطلق؟"},"start":"small","options":[{"id":"small","text":{"en":"Keep them small and touching","ar":"أبقِهما صغيرين ومتلاصقين"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"usta","name":{"en":"Usta","ar":"أُسطى"},"color":"#F59E0B","icon":"wrench","domain":"usta.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"My addresses","ar":"عناويني"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"wrench","text":{"en":"Plumber visit","ar":"زيارة سبّاك"},"sub":{"en":"Usually within 24 hours","ar":"عادةً خلال 24 ساعة"},"value":{"en":"From EGP 250","ar":"من 250 جنيه"}},{"kind":"small","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Home: 9 Mosaddak St, Dokki","ar":"المنزل: 9 شارع مصدق، الدقي"}},{"kind":"row","gap":"xs","blocks":[{"kind":"chip","tone":"off","text":{"en":"Edit","ar":"تعديل"}},{"kind":"chip","tone":"bad","text":{"en":"Delete","ar":"حذف"}}]}]}},{"id":"big","text":{"en":"Make both full-size buttons, still touching","ar":"اجعلهما زرّين بالحجم الكامل، لكن متلاصقين"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"usta","name":{"en":"Usta","ar":"أُسطى"},"color":"#F59E0B","icon":"wrench","domain":"usta.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"My addresses","ar":"عناويني"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"wrench","text":{"en":"Plumber visit","ar":"زيارة سبّاك"},"sub":{"en":"Usually within 24 hours","ar":"عادةً خلال 24 ساعة"},"value":{"en":"From EGP 250","ar":"من 250 جنيه"}},{"kind":"small","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Home: 9 Mosaddak St, Dokki","ar":"المنزل: 9 شارع مصدق، الدقي"}},{"kind":"button","emphasis":"low","text":{"en":"Edit","ar":"تعديل"},"gap":"s"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","style":"danger","text":{"en":"Delete","ar":"حذف"}}]}},{"id":"spaced","text":{"en":"Full-size buttons, with clear space between them","ar":"زرّان بالحجم الكامل، مع مسافة واضحة بينهما"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"usta","name":{"en":"Usta","ar":"أُسطى"},"color":"#F59E0B","icon":"wrench","domain":"usta.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"My addresses","ar":"عناويني"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"wrench","text":{"en":"Plumber visit","ar":"زيارة سبّاك"},"sub":{"en":"Usually within 24 hours","ar":"عادةً خلال 24 ساعة"},"value":{"en":"From EGP 250","ar":"من 250 جنيه"}},{"kind":"small","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Home: 9 Mosaddak St, Dokki","ar":"المنزل: 9 شارع مصدق، الدقي"}},{"kind":"button","emphasis":"low","text":{"en":"Edit","ar":"تعديل"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","style":"dangerlink","text":{"en":"Delete","ar":"حذف"},"gap":"xl"}]}}],"answer":["spaced"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-056","when":["small"],"feedback":{"en":"Both buttons are smaller than a fingertip and share an edge. A tap meant for Edit easily lands on Delete.","ar":"الزرّان أصغر من طرف الإصبع ويشتركان في حافة. والضغطة المقصودة لـ «تعديل» تقع بسهولة على «حذف»."}},{"id":"MC-P01-056","when":["big"],"feedback":{"en":"Bigger helps, but with no gap, a thumb that lands near the edge still hits Delete. Size and space both matter.","ar":"الحجم الأكبر يساعد، لكن بلا مسافة، يظل الإبهام الذي يقع قرب الحافة يضغط «حذف». الحجم والمسافة كلاهما مهم."}}],"hints":[{"en":"If a thumb lands a few millimetres off, what does it hit in each version?","ar":"لو وقع الإبهام بعيدًا ببضعة ملّيمترات، ماذا يضغط في كل نسخة؟"},{"en":"Which version has both size and space?","ar":"أي نسخة فيها الحجم والمسافة معًا؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Big enough to hit, far enough not to miss into Delete.","ar":"كبير بما يكفي للضغط، وبعيد بما يكفي حتى لا تضغط «حذف» بالخطأ."},"explain":{"en":"First make targets big enough, then space them out, especially when one of them destroys something.","ar":"اجعل الأهداف كبيرة بما يكفي أولًا، ثم باعِد بينها، خاصة حين يحذف أحدها شيئًا."},"speaker":"karim"},{"id":"S06","type":"words","skill":"SK-P01-U05-06","part":"guided","confidence":true,"rules":["R06","R15"],"value":{"en":"Reset and Cancel buttons (NN/g): people click Reset by mistake when they meant Submit. The safest spec has no Clear button at all.","ar":"أزرار Reset وCancel (NN/g): يضغط الناس Reset بالخطأ وهم يقصدون الإرسال. وأكثر المواصفات أمانًا لا تضم زر «مسح» أصلًا."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/reset-and-cancel-buttons/","quote":"The worst problem about Reset is that users click the button by mistake when they wanted to click Submit."},"scenario":{"en":"The client's other app, for booking an electrician, has Clear and Send side by side too. I'm writing one rule for both apps.","ar":"تطبيق العميل الآخر، لحجز كهربائي، فيه «مسح» و«أرسل» متجاوران أيضًا. وأكتب قاعدة واحدة للتطبيقين."},"prompt":{"en":"Which rule should go in the spec?","ar":"أي قاعدة يجب أن تُكتب في المواصفات (Spec)؟"},"options":[{"id":"confirm","text":{"en":"\"Clear asks 'Are you sure?' before it erases.\"","ar":"«زر المسح يسأل «هل أنت متأكد؟» قبل أن يمسح.»"}},{"id":"none","text":{"en":"\"No Clear button. To change an answer, people edit that field.\"","ar":"«بلا زر مسح. لتغيير إجابة، يعدّل الناس حقلها.»"}},{"id":"color","text":{"en":"\"Clear is grey and Send is purple, so they look different.\"","ar":"«زر المسح رمادي وزر الإرسال بنفسجي، ليبدوا مختلفين.»"}}],"answer":["none"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-057","when":["confirm","color"],"feedback":{"en":"Both keep a button nobody needs right where people tap to finish. Different colors don't stop a thumb; a dialog adds a scary extra step. Leave it out.","ar":"كلاهما يُبقي زرًا لا يحتاجه أحد في المكان الذي يضغط فيه الناس للإنهاء. الألوان المختلفة لا توقف الإبهام؛ ونافذة التأكيد تضيف خطوة مخيفة. استغنِ عنه."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Which rule makes the accident impossible, not just less likely?","ar":"أي قاعدة تجعل المسح بالخطأ مستحيلًا، لا أقل احتمالًا فقط؟"},{"en":"How do people usually change one answer?","ar":"كيف يغيّر الناس إجابة واحدة عادةً؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Nothing to tap by mistake, and editing still works.","ar":"لا شيء يُضغط بالخطأ، والتعديل ما زال ممكنًا."},"explain":{"en":"The best fix for a dangerous button nobody needs is to remove it. Editing one field covers the real need.","ar":"أفضل إصلاح لزر خطير لا يحتاجه أحد أن تحذفه. وتعديل الحقل الواحد يغطّي الحاجة الحقيقية."},"speaker":"karim"},{"id":"S07","type":"compare","skill":"SK-P01-U05-05","part":"contrast","rules":["R11","R15"],"value":{"en":"Contrast with S04: here the checkbox looks the same in both. Touch targets (NN/g): the target must be at least 1 cm × 1 cm. The tap area can be the whole row, not only the little box.","ar":"مقارنة مع الخطوة 4: هنا شكل الـ Checkbox واحد في النسختين. أهداف اللمس (NN/g): يجب أن يكون الهدف 1 سم × 1 سم على الأقل. ومساحة اللمس يمكن أن تكون الصف كله، لا المربع الصغير فقط."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/touch-target-size/","quote":"its minimum size should be 1cm × 1cm (0.4in x 0.4in)"},"scenario":{"en":"Before sending, people tick \"I'll be home during the visit\". In version A, only the 4 mm box reacts to a tap. In version B, the whole row reacts, about 1.2 cm tall (shaded here to show it).","ar":"قبل الإرسال، يضع الناس علامة على «سأكون في المنزل أثناء الزيارة». في النسخة A، المربع الذي حجمه 4 مم وحده يستجيب للمس. وفي النسخة B، الصف كله يستجيب، بارتفاع نحو 1.2 سم (مظلّل هنا لإظهاره)."},"prompt":{"en":"Which version should ship?","ar":"أي نسخة يجب أن تُطلق؟"},"a":{"label":{"en":"Box only","ar":"المربع فقط"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"usta","name":{"en":"Usta","ar":"أُسطى"},"color":"#F59E0B","icon":"wrench","domain":"usta.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Request a plumber","ar":"اطلب سبّاكًا"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"wrench","text":{"en":"Plumber visit","ar":"زيارة سبّاك"},"sub":{"en":"Usually within 24 hours","ar":"عادةً خلال 24 ساعة"},"value":{"en":"From EGP 250","ar":"من 250 جنيه"}},{"kind":"check","text":{"en":"I'll be home during the visit","ar":"سأكون في المنزل أثناء الزيارة"}}]}},"b":{"label":{"en":"Whole row","ar":"الصف كله"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"usta","name":{"en":"Usta","ar":"أُسطى"},"color":"#F59E0B","icon":"wrench","domain":"usta.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Request a plumber","ar":"اطلب سبّاكًا"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"wrench","text":{"en":"Plumber visit","ar":"زيارة سبّاك"},"sub":{"en":"Usually within 24 hours","ar":"عادةً خلال 24 ساعة"},"value":{"en":"From EGP 250","ar":"من 250 جنيه"}},{"kind":"group","tone":"tint","blocks":[{"kind":"check","text":{"en":"I'll be home during the visit","ar":"سأكون في المنزل أثناء الزيارة"}}]}]}},"answer":"b","reason":{"prompt":{"en":"What makes B better?","ar":"ما الذي يجعل B أفضل؟"},"options":[{"id":"area","text":{"en":"The part that reacts to a tap is about 1 cm or more","ar":"الجزء الذي يستجيب للمس نحو 1 سم أو أكثر"}},{"id":"shade","text":{"en":"The grey background looks nicer","ar":"الخلفية الرمادية أجمل"}},{"id":"bigbox","text":{"en":"Its box is bigger","ar":"مربعه أكبر"}}],"answer":["area"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-056","when":["shade","bigbox"],"feedback":{"en":"The box is the same size, and the shading is only here to show you the tap area. What changed is how much of the row reacts to a finger.","ar":"المربع بالحجم نفسه، والتظليل هنا فقط ليُريك مساحة اللمس. ما تغيّر هو الجزء من الصف الذي يستجيب للإصبع."}}]},"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-056","when":["a"],"feedback":{"en":"A 4 mm box is far below 1 cm. Most taps on the words do nothing, and people think the form is broken.","ar":"مربع 4 مم أقل بكثير من 1 سم. وأغلب الضغطات على الكلمات لا تفعل شيئًا، فيظن الناس أن النموذج معطّل."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Where would most people tap: the tiny box, or the words?","ar":"أين سيضغط أغلب الناس: على المربع الصغير، أم على الكلمات؟"}],"correct":{"en":"The tap area grows; the design doesn't have to.","ar":"تكبر مساحة اللمس، ويبقى الشكل كما هو."},"explain":{"en":"A target is the area that reacts to touch, not the drawing. Make the label part of the checkbox's tap area, and small controls become easy to hit.","ar":"الهدف هو المساحة التي تستجيب للمس، لا الرسم. اجعل النص جزءًا من مساحة لمس الـ Checkbox، فتصبح العناصر الصغيرة سهلة الضغط."},"speaker":"karim"},{"id":"S08","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P01-U05-06","part":"independent","speaker":"youssef","rules":["R14","R19"],"value":{"en":"New case. Reset and Cancel buttons (NN/g): people hit Reset when they meant Submit. \"Empty cart\" beside \"Checkout\" is the same trap in a shop.","ar":"حالة جديدة. أزرار Reset وCancel (NN/g): يضغط الناس Reset وهم يقصدون الإرسال. و«أفرغ السلّة» بجوار «إتمام الشراء» هو الفخ نفسه في متجر."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/reset-and-cancel-buttons/","quote":"The worst problem about Reset is that users click the button by mistake when they wanted to click Submit."},"scenario":{"en":"In my online shop, the cart ends with two buttons side by side: \"Empty cart\" and \"Checkout\". Ghada had 9 items in her cart, tapped the wrong one, and closed the app.","ar":"في متجري الإلكتروني، تنتهي السلّة بزرّين متجاورين: «أفرغ السلّة» و«إتمام الشراء». وكان في سلّة غادة 9 منتجات، فضغطت الزر الخطأ، وأغلقت التطبيق."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each version of the bottom of the cart. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل نسخة لأسفل السلّة. أيّ نسخة تحمي سلّة غادة من الإفراغ بالخطأ؟"},"start":"both","options":[{"id":"both","text":{"en":"Keep both side by side","ar":"أبقِ الزرّين متجاورين"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Cart","ar":"السلة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"wrench","text":{"en":"Plumber visit","ar":"زيارة سبّاك"},"sub":{"en":"Usually within 24 hours","ar":"عادةً خلال 24 ساعة"},"value":{"en":"From EGP 250","ar":"من 250 جنيه"}},{"kind":"small","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"9 items · 2,340 EGP","ar":"9 منتجات · 2,340 جنيه"}},{"kind":"row","gap":"m","blocks":[{"kind":"button","emphasis":"low","text":{"en":"Empty cart","ar":"أفرغ السلّة"}},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Checkout","ar":"إتمام الشراء"}}]}]}},{"id":"only","text":{"en":"Remove \"Empty cart\"; each item keeps its own Remove","ar":"احذف «أفرغ السلّة»؛ ويبقى لكل منتج زر «إزالة» خاص به"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Cart","ar":"السلة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"wrench","text":{"en":"Plumber visit","ar":"زيارة سبّاك"},"sub":{"en":"Usually within 24 hours","ar":"عادةً خلال 24 ساعة"},"value":{"en":"From EGP 250","ar":"من 250 جنيه"}},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Each item: − 1 + · Remove","ar":"كل منتج: − 1 + · إزالة"}},{"kind":"small","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"9 items · 2,340 EGP","ar":"9 منتجات · 2,340 جنيه"},"gap":"s"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Checkout","ar":"إتمام الشراء"}}]}},{"id":"red","text":{"en":"Keep both, and make \"Empty cart\" red","ar":"أبقِ الزرّين، واجعل «أفرغ السلّة» أحمر"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Cart","ar":"السلة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"wrench","text":{"en":"Plumber visit","ar":"زيارة سبّاك"},"sub":{"en":"Usually within 24 hours","ar":"عادةً خلال 24 ساعة"},"value":{"en":"From EGP 250","ar":"من 250 جنيه"}},{"kind":"small","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"9 items · 2,340 EGP","ar":"9 منتجات · 2,340 جنيه"}},{"kind":"row","gap":"m","blocks":[{"kind":"button","style":"danger","text":{"en":"Empty cart","ar":"أفرغ السلّة"}},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Checkout","ar":"إتمام الشراء"}}]}]}}],"answer":["only"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-057","when":["both","red"],"feedback":{"en":"Red warns the eye, not the thumb. With both side by side, one slip still throws away 9 items. Shoppers rarely need to empty a cart in one tap.","ar":"الأحمر ينبّه العين، لا الإبهام. ومع تجاور الزرّين، تظل زلّة واحدة ترمي 9 منتجات. ونادرًا ما يحتاج المتسوّق أن يُفرغ السلّة بضغطة."}}],"correct":{"en":"The only button at the end is the one people came for.","ar":"الزر الوحيد في النهاية هو الذي جاء الناس من أجله."},"explain":{"en":"Keep the end of a form or cart for the main action. Anything that wipes the work belongs nowhere near it, and usually nowhere at all.","ar":"اترك نهاية النموذج أو السلّة للإجراء الرئيسي. وأي شيء يمسح العمل لا مكان له بجواره، وغالبًا لا مكان له أصلًا."}},{"id":"S09","type":"card","part":"recap","icons":["tap","space","cut","ok"],"title":{"en":"What you did","ar":"ماذا تعلّمت"},"body":{"en":"- **No Clear:** removed Clear from beside Send, instead of shrinking it or asking \"Are you sure?\".\n- **Big enough:** turned 5 mm time tags into buttons at least 1 cm tall.\n- **Spaced apart:** separated Edit from Delete, not only made them bigger.\n- **Tap area, not drawing:** made the whole checkbox row react to touch.\n- **Nothing that wipes the work:** removed \"Empty cart\" from beside Checkout.\n\nNext: the skill check for this unit.","ar":"- **بلا مسح:** حذفت «مسح» من جوار «أرسل»، بدل تصغيره أو سؤال «هل أنت متأكد؟».\n- **كبير بما يكفي:** حوّلت علامات المواعيد ذات 5 مم إلى أزرار ارتفاعها 1 سم على الأقل.\n- **متباعد:** فصلت «تعديل» عن «حذف»، لا كبّرتهما فقط.\n- **مساحة اللمس، لا الرسم:** جعلت صف الـ Checkbox كله يستجيب للمس.\n- **لا شيء يمسح العمل:** حذفت «أفرغ السلّة» من جوار «إتمام الشراء».\n\nالتالي: اختبار المهارة لهذه الوحدة."}}]}$uxg$::jsonb),
  ($uxg$P01-U05-L04$uxg$, $uxg$9fa8e7404501504e5d005871ff2d0490713dab16428eb138a007462b90b613b2$uxg$, $uxg${"id":"P01-U05-L04","mode":"check","minutes":7,"title":{"en":"Skill check: forms everyone can finish","ar":"اختبار المهارة: نماذج يستطيع الجميع إكمالها"},"summary":{"en":"Review a bus ticket form for keyboard, screen reader and touch users on your own.","ar":"راجع بنفسك نموذج تذاكر حافلات لمستخدمي لوحة المفاتيح وقارئ الشاشة (Screen reader) واللمس."},"speaker":"sara","steps":[{"id":"S01","type":"card","part":"hook","title":{"en":"Ismail books a bus ticket","ar":"إسماعيل يحجز تذكرة حافلة"},"body":{"en":"I'm reviewing a bus ticket booking form before it launches. Our tester Ismail is blind and uses a keyboard with a screen reader. Our second tester, Samah, tries the same form on her phone.\n\nBoth got stuck in different places. Your job: fix each one so both of them can finish.\n\nThis is a skill check: no hints, and you'll see how you did at the end.","ar":"أراجع نموذج حجز تذاكر حافلات قبل إطلاقه. ومختبِرنا إسماعيل كفيف ويستخدم لوحة المفاتيح مع قارئ شاشة. والمختبرة الثانية، سماح، تجرّب النموذج نفسه على هاتفها.\n\nعلق كلاهما في أماكن مختلفة. مهمّتك: أصلح كل مشكلة ليُكمل الاثنان.\n\nهذا اختبار مهارة: بدون تلميحات، وسترى نتيجتك في النهاية."},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rehla","name":{"en":"Rehla","ar":"رحلة"},"color":"#7048E8","icon":"bus","domain":"rehla.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"rehla.example/search","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Buses","ar":"الحافلات"},{"en":"My tickets","ar":"تذاكري"},{"en":"Help","ar":"المساعدة"}],"active":0},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"From","ar":"من"},"filled":true,"text":{"en":"Cairo","ar":"القاهرة"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"To","ar":"إلى"},"filled":true,"text":{"en":"Luxor","ar":"الأقصر"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Date","ar":"التاريخ"},"text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Find buses","ar":"ابحث عن رحلات"},"gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"S02","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P01-U05-01","part":"check","rules":["R19"],"value":{"en":"Skill check, keyboard accessibility (NN/g): removing the focus indicator is catastrophic for keyboard users.","ar":"اختبار مهارة، الإتاحة بلوحة المفاتيح (NN/g): حذف مؤشّر التركيز كارثة لمستخدمي لوحة المفاتيح."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/keyboard-accessibility/","quote":"Removing the keyboard focus indicator is catastrophic for keyboard users."},"scenario":{"en":"Ismail works with a sighted colleague, Fathy, who follows his screen to help. Neither can tell which field Tab is on: the form has no focus ring.","ar":"يعمل إسماعيل مع زميل مبصر، فتحي، يتابع شاشته ليساعده. ولا يستطيع أيٌّ منهما معرفة الحقل الذي يقف عنده Tab: النموذج بلا إطار تركيز (Focus ring)."},"prompt":{"en":"Tab is on the Date field. Try each version. Which one should ship?","ar":"Tab الآن على حقل التاريخ. جرّب كل نسخة. أيّ نسخة تُظهر لفتحي الحقل الذي يقف عنده Tab؟"},"start":"none","options":[{"id":"ring","text":{"en":"A clear focus ring on whatever Tab is on","ar":"إطار تركيز واضح على أي عنصر يقف عنده Tab"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rehla","name":{"en":"Rehla","ar":"رحلة"},"color":"#7048E8","icon":"bus","domain":"rehla.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"rehla.example/search","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Buses","ar":"الحافلات"},{"en":"My tickets","ar":"تذاكري"},{"en":"Help","ar":"المساعدة"}],"active":0},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"From","ar":"من"},"filled":true,"text":{"en":"Cairo","ar":"القاهرة"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"To","ar":"إلى"},"filled":true,"text":{"en":"Luxor","ar":"الأقصر"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Date","ar":"التاريخ"},"text":"","focus":true,"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"none","text":{"en":"Keep it: no ring","ar":"اتركه كما هو: بلا إطار"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rehla","name":{"en":"Rehla","ar":"رحلة"},"color":"#7048E8","icon":"bus","domain":"rehla.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"rehla.example/search","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Buses","ar":"الحافلات"},{"en":"My tickets","ar":"تذاكري"},{"en":"Help","ar":"المساعدة"}],"active":0},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"From","ar":"من"},"filled":true,"text":{"en":"Cairo","ar":"القاهرة"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"To","ar":"إلى"},"filled":true,"text":{"en":"Luxor","ar":"الأقصر"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Date","ar":"التاريخ"},"text":"","gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"firstonly","text":{"en":"A ring on the first field only, to show where to start","ar":"إطار على الحقل الأول فقط، ليوضّح نقطة البداية"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rehla","name":{"en":"Rehla","ar":"رحلة"},"color":"#7048E8","icon":"bus","domain":"rehla.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"rehla.example/search","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Buses","ar":"الحافلات"},{"en":"My tickets","ar":"تذاكري"},{"en":"Help","ar":"المساعدة"}],"active":0},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"From","ar":"من"},"filled":true,"text":{"en":"Cairo","ar":"القاهرة"},"focus":true},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"To","ar":"إلى"},"filled":true,"text":{"en":"Luxor","ar":"الأقصر"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Date","ar":"التاريخ"},"text":"","gap":"s"}]}}],"answer":["ring"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-052","when":["none","firstonly"],"feedback":{"en":"Tab is on Date, but the preview either shows nothing or points at From. The ring has to follow Tab to every stop.","ar":"Tab على التاريخ، لكن المعاينة إما لا تُظهر شيئًا أو تشير إلى «من». والإطار يجب أن يتبع Tab إلى كل محطة."}}],"explain":{"en":"From Lesson 1: the focus ring is the keyboard's pointer. It must be clear and move with Tab.","ar":"من الدرس 1: إطار التركيز بمثابة مؤشّر لوحة المفاتيح. يجب أن يكون واضحًا ويتحرّك مع Tab."},"speaker":"sara"},{"id":"S03","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P01-U05-02","part":"check","rules":["R19"],"value":{"en":"Skill check, keyboard accessibility (NN/g): the tab order is normally coded to reflect the page layout, top to bottom.","ar":"اختبار مهارة، الإتاحة بلوحة المفاتيح (NN/g): ترتيب Tab يُبرمَج عادةً ليعكس تخطيط الصفحة، من أعلى إلى أسفل."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/keyboard-accessibility/","quote":"On most websites the tab order will be coded to reflect the page layout; that is top to bottom and left to right."},"scenario":{"en":"Ismail's screen reader reads \"To\" before \"From\", because the developer added the \"To\" field first.","ar":"قارئ الشاشة عند إسماعيل يقرأ «إلى» قبل «من»، لأن المطوّر أضاف حقل «إلى» أولًا."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each tab order. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل ترتيب لـ Tab. أيّها يجب أن يُطلق؟"},"start":"code","options":[{"id":"code","text":{"en":"Keep the order it was built in","ar":"أبقِ الترتيب الذي بُني به"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rehla","name":{"en":"Rehla","ar":"رحلة"},"color":"#7048E8","icon":"bus","domain":"rehla.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"rehla.example/search","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Buses","ar":"الحافلات"},{"en":"My tickets","ar":"تذاكري"},{"en":"Help","ar":"المساعدة"}],"active":0},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"From","ar":"من"},"text":""},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"To","ar":"إلى"},"text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Date","ar":"التاريخ"},"text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"small","color":"brand","text":{"en":"Tab goes: To → From → Date","ar":"ترتيب Tab: إلى ← من ← التاريخ"},"gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"swap","text":{"en":"Swap the fields on screen so To is on top","ar":"بدّل الحقلين على الشاشة ليكون «إلى» في الأعلى"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rehla","name":{"en":"Rehla","ar":"رحلة"},"color":"#7048E8","icon":"bus","domain":"rehla.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"rehla.example/search","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Buses","ar":"الحافلات"},{"en":"My tickets","ar":"تذاكري"},{"en":"Help","ar":"المساعدة"}],"active":0},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"To","ar":"إلى"},"text":""},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"From","ar":"من"},"text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Date","ar":"التاريخ"},"text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"small","color":"brand","text":{"en":"Tab goes: To → From → Date","ar":"ترتيب Tab: إلى ← من ← التاريخ"},"gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"page","text":{"en":"Fix the code so Tab goes From, To, Date","ar":"أصلح الكود ليكون Tab: من، إلى، التاريخ"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rehla","name":{"en":"Rehla","ar":"رحلة"},"color":"#7048E8","icon":"bus","domain":"rehla.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"rehla.example/search","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Buses","ar":"الحافلات"},{"en":"My tickets","ar":"تذاكري"},{"en":"Help","ar":"المساعدة"}],"active":0},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"From","ar":"من"},"text":""},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"To","ar":"إلى"},"text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Date","ar":"التاريخ"},"text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"small","color":"brand","text":{"en":"Tab goes: From → To → Date","ar":"ترتيب Tab: من ← إلى ← التاريخ"},"gap":"m"}]}}],"answer":["page"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-053","when":["code"],"feedback":{"en":"Ismail hears \"To\" first and types Cairo there. Tab order must match the page.","ar":"يسمع إسماعيل «إلى» أولًا فيكتب القاهرة فيه. وترتيب Tab يجب أن يطابق الصفحة."}},{"id":"MC-P01-053","when":["swap"],"feedback":{"en":"It matches now, but every trip form in the world starts with \"From\". Change the code, not what everyone else expects.","ar":"متطابق الآن، لكن كل نماذج الرحلات تبدأ بـ «من». غيّر الكود، لا ما يتوقّعه الجميع."}}],"explain":{"en":"From Lesson 1: when code order and screen order differ, fix the code so Tab follows the page.","ar":"من الدرس 1: حين يختلف ترتيب الكود عن ترتيب الشاشة، أصلح الكود ليتبع Tab الصفحة."},"speaker":"sara"},{"id":"S04","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P01-U05-03","part":"check","rules":["R19"],"value":{"en":"Skill check, keyboard accessibility (NN/g): keyboard users must be able to access all interactive elements. Painted + and − icons aren't on the Tab path.","ar":"اختبار مهارة، الإتاحة بلوحة المفاتيح (NN/g): يجب أن يصل مستخدمو لوحة المفاتيح إلى كل العناصر التفاعلية. وأيقونتا + و− المرسومتان ليستا في مسار Tab."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/keyboard-accessibility/","quote":"Keyboard users must be able to access all interactive elements, not just the main navigation or in-line links."},"scenario":{"en":"Ismail travels with his son. The number of passengers changes with + and − icons, built as pictures with a click script. Tab skips them, so he can only book one seat.","ar":"يسافر إسماعيل مع ابنه. وعدد الركّاب يتغيّر بأيقونتي + و−، مبنيّتين كصورتين مع كود للضغط. ويتخطّاهما Tab، فلا يستطيع حجز إلا مقعد واحد."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each version. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل نسخة. أيّها يجب أن تُطلق؟"},"start":"pics","options":[{"id":"pics","text":{"en":"Keep the picture icons","ar":"أبقِ الأيقونات المصوّرة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rehla","name":{"en":"Rehla","ar":"رحلة"},"color":"#7048E8","icon":"bus","domain":"rehla.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"rehla.example/search","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Buses","ar":"الحافلات"},{"en":"My tickets","ar":"تذاكري"},{"en":"Help","ar":"المساعدة"}],"active":0},"blocks":[{"kind":"stepper","label":{"en":"Passengers","ar":"الركّاب"},"text":"1"},{"kind":"small","color":"brand","text":{"en":"Tab goes: Date → Find buses (skips − and +)","ar":"ترتيب Tab: التاريخ ← ابحث عن رحلات (يتخطّى − و+)"},"gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"buttons","text":{"en":"Rebuild − and + as real buttons","ar":"أعد بناء − و+ كأزرار حقيقية"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rehla","name":{"en":"Rehla","ar":"رحلة"},"color":"#7048E8","icon":"bus","domain":"rehla.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"rehla.example/search","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Buses","ar":"الحافلات"},{"en":"My tickets","ar":"تذاكري"},{"en":"Help","ar":"المساعدة"}],"active":0},"blocks":[{"kind":"stepper","label":{"en":"Passengers","ar":"الركّاب"},"text":"2"},{"kind":"small","color":"brand","text":{"en":"Tab goes: Date → Fewer (−) → More (+) → Find buses","ar":"ترتيب Tab: التاريخ ← أقل (−) ← أكثر (+) ← ابحث عن رحلات"},"gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"tip","text":{"en":"Add a tip: \"Click + to add passengers\"","ar":"أضف تلميحًا: «اضغط + لإضافة ركّاب»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rehla","name":{"en":"Rehla","ar":"رحلة"},"color":"#7048E8","icon":"bus","domain":"rehla.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"rehla.example/search","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Buses","ar":"الحافلات"},{"en":"My tickets","ar":"تذاكري"},{"en":"Help","ar":"المساعدة"}],"active":0},"blocks":[{"kind":"stepper","label":{"en":"Passengers","ar":"الركّاب"},"text":"1"},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Click + to add passengers.","ar":"اضغط + لإضافة ركّاب."},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"small","color":"brand","text":{"en":"Tab goes: Date → Find buses (skips − and +)","ar":"ترتيب Tab: التاريخ ← ابحث عن رحلات (يتخطّى − و+)"},"gap":"m"}]}}],"answer":["buttons"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-054","when":["pics","tip"],"feedback":{"en":"Tab still skips + and −, so telling Ismail to click them doesn't help. Real buttons put them on his path.","ar":"ما زال Tab يتخطّى + و−، فإخبار إسماعيل بالضغط عليهما لا يفيد. والأزرار الحقيقية تجعل Tab يصل إليهما."}}],"explain":{"en":"From Lesson 2: anything clickable must be a real control, so Tab reaches it.","ar":"من الدرس 2: كل ما يمكن الضغط عليه يجب أن يكون عنصرًا حقيقيًا، ليصل إليه Tab."},"speaker":"sara"},{"id":"S05","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P01-U05-04","part":"check","rules":["R19"],"value":{"en":"Skill check, keyboard accessibility (NN/g): people must be able to close pop-ups, or they're stuck inside them.","ar":"اختبار مهارة، الإتاحة بلوحة المفاتيح (NN/g): يجب أن يستطيع الناس إغلاق النوافذ المنبثقة، وإلا علقوا بداخلها."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/keyboard-accessibility/","quote":"It is extremely important for users to be able to close pop-ups or they will be stuck inside them."},"scenario":{"en":"\"See bus photos\" opens a gallery pop-up. It closes only when you click the dark area around it. Ismail opened it by mistake.","ar":"«شاهد صور الحافلة» يفتح معرض صور منبثقًا. ولا يُغلق إلا بالضغط على المساحة الداكنة حوله. وفتحه إسماعيل بالخطأ."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each version of the gallery. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل نسخة للمعرض. أيّ نسخة يستطيع إسماعيل أن يخرج منها بلوحة المفاتيح متى أراد؟"},"start":"outside","options":[{"id":"outside","text":{"en":"Keep it: click outside to close","ar":"اتركه كما هو: اضغط خارجه للإغلاق"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rehla","name":{"en":"Rehla","ar":"رحلة"},"color":"#7048E8","icon":"bus","domain":"rehla.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"rehla.example/search","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Buses","ar":"الحافلات"},{"en":"My tickets","ar":"تذاكري"},{"en":"Help","ar":"المساعدة"}],"active":0},"blocks":[{"kind":"group","blocks":[{"kind":"image","size":"s","text":{"en":"Bus photo 1 of 6","ar":"صورة الحافلة 1 من 6"}},{"kind":"button","emphasis":"low","text":{"en":"Next photo","ar":"الصورة التالية"},"gap":"s"}]},{"kind":"small","color":"brand","text":{"en":"Tab goes: Next photo → Next photo … (no way out)","ar":"ترتيب Tab: الصورة التالية ← الصورة التالية … (بلا مخرج)"},"gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"end","text":{"en":"Close it by itself after the last photo","ar":"أغلِقه تلقائيًا بعد آخر صورة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rehla","name":{"en":"Rehla","ar":"رحلة"},"color":"#7048E8","icon":"bus","domain":"rehla.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"rehla.example/search","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Buses","ar":"الحافلات"},{"en":"My tickets","ar":"تذاكري"},{"en":"Help","ar":"المساعدة"}],"active":0},"blocks":[{"kind":"group","blocks":[{"kind":"image","size":"s","text":{"en":"Bus photo 1 of 6","ar":"صورة الحافلة 1 من 6"}},{"kind":"button","emphasis":"low","text":{"en":"Next photo","ar":"الصورة التالية"},"gap":"s"}]},{"kind":"small","color":"brand","text":{"en":"Tab goes: Next photo × 6, then it closes","ar":"ترتيب Tab: الصورة التالية 6 مرات، ثم يُغلق"},"gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"close","text":{"en":"A Close button on the Tab path, and Esc closes it","ar":"زر إغلاق يصل إليه Tab، وEsc يغلقه"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rehla","name":{"en":"Rehla","ar":"رحلة"},"color":"#7048E8","icon":"bus","domain":"rehla.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"rehla.example/search","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Buses","ar":"الحافلات"},{"en":"My tickets","ar":"تذاكري"},{"en":"Help","ar":"المساعدة"}],"active":0},"blocks":[{"kind":"group","blocks":[{"kind":"button","style":"plain","text":{"en":"Close photos","ar":"أغلق الصور"}},{"kind":"image","size":"s","text":{"en":"Bus photo 1 of 6","ar":"صورة الحافلة 1 من 6"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"button","emphasis":"low","text":{"en":"Next photo","ar":"الصورة التالية"},"gap":"s"}]},{"kind":"small","color":"brand","text":{"en":"Tab goes: Close photos → Next photo. Esc closes it too.","ar":"ترتيب Tab: أغلق الصور ← الصورة التالية. وEsc يغلقه أيضًا."},"gap":"m"}]}}],"answer":["close"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-055","when":["outside","end"],"feedback":{"en":"Ismail can't click outside, and he shouldn't have to sit through 6 photos he can't see to get out. Give him Close and Esc.","ar":"لا يستطيع إسماعيل الضغط بالخارج، ولا يصح أن يمرّ على 6 صور لا يراها ليخرج. أعطِه زر إغلاق وEsc."}}],"explain":{"en":"From Lesson 2: every pop-up needs a reachable Close button and Esc, so people leave when they choose.","ar":"من الدرس 2: كل نافذة منبثقة تحتاج زر إغلاق يصل إليه Tab، وEsc، ليخرج الناس متى اختاروا."},"speaker":"sara"},{"id":"S06","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P01-U05-05","part":"check","rules":["R19"],"value":{"en":"Skill check, touch targets (NN/g): to avoid accidental taps, targets must be big enough and spaced well enough.","ar":"اختبار مهارة، أهداف اللمس (NN/g): لتجنّب الضغطات العرضية، يجب أن تكون الأهداف كبيرة بما يكفي ومتباعدة بما يكفي."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/touch-target-size/","quote":"To avoid accidental taps, targets must first be big enough, and then also spaced well enough"},"scenario":{"en":"On her phone, Samah picks a departure time from a list of links, each about 4 mm tall with no space between them. She booked the 6 pm bus instead of the 7 pm.","ar":"على هاتفها، تختار سماح وقت الرحلة من قائمة روابط، ارتفاع كل منها نحو 4 مم بلا مسافات بينها. فحجزت رحلة السادسة بدل السابعة."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each version. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل نسخة. أيّها يجب أن تُطلق؟"},"start":"links","options":[{"id":"links","text":{"en":"Keep the small links, packed together","ar":"أبقِ الروابط الصغيرة المتلاصقة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rehla","name":{"en":"Rehla","ar":"رحلة"},"color":"#7048E8","icon":"bus","domain":"rehla.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Departure time","ar":"موعد الانطلاق"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"link","text":{"en":"6:00 pm · 210 EGP","ar":"6:00 م · 210 جنيه"}},{"kind":"link","text":{"en":"7:00 pm · 210 EGP","ar":"7:00 م · 210 جنيه"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"link","text":{"en":"9:30 pm · 180 EGP","ar":"9:30 م · 180 جنيه"},"gap":"xs"}]}},{"id":"rows","text":{"en":"Make each time a full-width button at least 1 cm tall, with space between","ar":"اجعل كل وقت زرًا بعرض الشاشة وارتفاع 1 سم على الأقل، مع مسافة بينها"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rehla","name":{"en":"Rehla","ar":"رحلة"},"color":"#7048E8","icon":"bus","domain":"rehla.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Departure time","ar":"موعد الانطلاق"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"button","emphasis":"low","text":{"en":"6:00 pm · 210 EGP","ar":"6:00 م · 210 جنيه"}},{"kind":"button","emphasis":"low","text":{"en":"7:00 pm · 210 EGP","ar":"7:00 م · 210 جنيه"},"gap":"m"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","emphasis":"low","text":{"en":"9:30 pm · 180 EGP","ar":"9:30 م · 180 جنيه"}}]}},{"id":"zoom","text":{"en":"Keep the links, and add \"Pinch to zoom\"","ar":"أبقِ الروابط، وأضف «باعد بإصبعيك للتكبير»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rehla","name":{"en":"Rehla","ar":"رحلة"},"color":"#7048E8","icon":"bus","domain":"rehla.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Departure time","ar":"موعد الانطلاق"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Pinch to zoom.","ar":"باعد بإصبعيك للتكبير."}},{"kind":"link","text":{"en":"6:00 pm · 210 EGP","ar":"6:00 م · 210 جنيه"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"link","text":{"en":"7:00 pm · 210 EGP","ar":"7:00 م · 210 جنيه"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"link","text":{"en":"9:30 pm · 180 EGP","ar":"9:30 م · 180 جنيه"},"gap":"xs"}]}}],"answer":["rows"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-056","when":["links","zoom"],"feedback":{"en":"4 mm with no gap is far below 1 cm, so Samah's thumb lands on the neighbour. Asking her to zoom passes our problem to her.","ar":"4 مم بلا مسافة أقل بكثير من 1 سم، فيقع إبهام سماح على الرابط المجاور. وطلب التكبير منها ينقل مشكلتنا إليها."}}],"explain":{"en":"From Lesson 3: at least 1 cm per target, and space between them.","ar":"من الدرس 3: 1 سم على الأقل لكل هدف، ومسافة بين الأهداف."},"speaker":"sara"},{"id":"S07","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P01-U05-06","part":"check","rules":["R19"],"value":{"en":"Skill check, Reset and Cancel buttons (NN/g): people click Reset by mistake when they meant Submit.","ar":"اختبار مهارة، أزرار Reset وCancel (NN/g): يضغط الناس Reset بالخطأ وهم يقصدون الإرسال."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/reset-and-cancel-buttons/","quote":"The worst problem about Reset is that users click the button by mistake when they wanted to click Submit."},"scenario":{"en":"The last screen has \"Start over\" beside \"Book seats\". \"Start over\" empties every step. Samah hit it once while trying to book.","ar":"الشاشة الأخيرة فيها «ابدأ من جديد» بجوار «احجز المقاعد». و«ابدأ من جديد» يُفرغ كل الخطوات. وضغطته سماح مرة وهي تحاول الحجز."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each version. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل نسخة. أيّها يجب أن تُطلق؟"},"start":"both","options":[{"id":"both","text":{"en":"Keep \"Start over\" beside \"Book seats\"","ar":"أبقِ «ابدأ من جديد» بجوار «احجز المقاعد»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rehla","name":{"en":"Rehla","ar":"رحلة"},"color":"#7048E8","icon":"bus","domain":"rehla.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Book seats","ar":"احجز المقاعد"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Cairo → Luxor · 2 seats · 420 EGP","ar":"القاهرة ← الأقصر · مقعدان · 420 جنيه"}},{"kind":"row","gap":"m","blocks":[{"kind":"button","emphasis":"low","text":{"en":"Start over","ar":"ابدأ من جديد"}},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Book seats","ar":"احجز المقاعد"}}]}]}},{"id":"confirm","text":{"en":"Keep it, but ask \"Are you sure?\" first","ar":"أبقِ الزر، لكن اسأل «هل أنت متأكد؟» أولًا"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rehla","name":{"en":"Rehla","ar":"رحلة"},"color":"#7048E8","icon":"bus","domain":"rehla.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Book seats","ar":"احجز المقاعد"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Cairo → Luxor · 2 seats · 420 EGP","ar":"القاهرة ← الأقصر · مقعدان · 420 جنيه"}},{"kind":"row","gap":"m","blocks":[{"kind":"button","emphasis":"low","text":{"en":"Start over","ar":"ابدأ من جديد"}},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Book seats","ar":"احجز المقاعد"}}]},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"\"Start over\" opens: Are you sure? Yes / No","ar":"«ابدأ من جديد» يفتح: هل أنت متأكد؟ نعم / لا"},"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"none","text":{"en":"Remove \"Start over\"; each step keeps its own Edit","ar":"احذف «ابدأ من جديد»؛ ولكل خطوة زر «تعديل» خاص بها"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rehla","name":{"en":"Rehla","ar":"رحلة"},"color":"#7048E8","icon":"bus","domain":"rehla.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Book seats","ar":"احجز المقاعد"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Cairo → Luxor · 2 seats · 420 EGP","ar":"القاهرة ← الأقصر · مقعدان · 420 جنيه"}},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Trip · Edit    Seats · Edit","ar":"الرحلة · تعديل    المقاعد · تعديل"},"gap":"xs"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Book seats","ar":"احجز المقاعد"}}]}}],"answer":["none"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-057","when":["both","confirm"],"feedback":{"en":"A button that wipes everything still sits where Samah taps to finish. A dialog only adds a scary step. Let people edit one step instead.","ar":"ما زال الزر الذي يمسح كل شيء في المكان الذي تضغط فيه سماح للإنهاء. ونافذة التأكيد تضيف خطوة مخيفة فقط. دع الناس يعدّلون خطوة واحدة بدلًا من ذلك."}}],"explain":{"en":"From Lesson 3: keep the end of a form for the main action, and let people change one part instead of wiping all of it.","ar":"من الدرس 3: اترك نهاية النموذج للإجراء الرئيسي، ودع الناس يغيّرون جزءًا واحدًا بدل مسح كل شيء."},"speaker":"sara"}]}$uxg$::jsonb),
  ($uxg$P02-U01-L01$uxg$, $uxg$7370d079abd75e64eafc6c45441bb48025548add0c5fc59815a8fe12dd6c7b83$uxg$, $uxg${"id":"P02-U01-L01","mode":"lesson","minutes":8,"title":{"en":"Show people what's happening","ar":"أظهِر للناس ما يحدث"},"speaker":"sara","review_labels":{"MC-P02-001":{"en":"An explanation somewhere else isn't feedback","ar":"الشرح في مكان آخر ليس ردًّا على الإجراء"},"MC-P02-002":{"en":"A silent fix still leaves people guessing","ar":"إذا أصلحتَ المشكلة دون أن تُخبر الناس، سيبقون في حيرة"},"MC-P02-003":{"en":"A spinner can't say how long a long wait is","ar":"الـ Spinner (المؤشر الدوّار) لا يُخبر الناس كم سيطول الانتظار"},"MC-P02-004":{"en":"Don't let things vanish without a word","ar":"لا تُخفِ شيئًا دون أن تُخبر الناس"},"MC-P02-005":{"en":"A general notice doesn't say what changed","ar":"التنبيه العام لا يقول ما الذي تغيّر"},"MC-P02-006":{"en":"A loading animation for an instant action distracts","ar":"حركة التحميل لإجراء فوري تشتّت الانتباه"}},"steps":[{"id":"S01","type":"card","part":"hook","title":{"en":"Two pickups for one parcel","ar":"مندوبان لطرد واحد"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"tard","name":{"en":"Tard","ar":"طرد"},"color":"#7C3AED","icon":"package","domain":"tard.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Book a pickup","ar":"احجز موعد استلام"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"map-pin","text":{"en":"14 Tahrir St, flat 6","ar":"14 شارع التحرير، شقة 6"},"sub":{"en":"Home · Cairo","ar":"البيت · القاهرة"},"chevron":true},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"package","text":{"en":"1 parcel · small box","ar":"طرد واحد · صندوق صغير"},"sub":{"en":"Up to 2 kg","ar":"حتى 2 كجم"},"chevron":true,"gap":"s"},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Pickup time","ar":"موعد الاستلام"},"gap":"l"},{"kind":"chips","items":[{"text":{"en":"Tomorrow 10 am–1 pm","ar":"غدًا من 10 ص إلى 1 م"},"on":true},{"text":{"en":"Tomorrow 4–7 pm","ar":"غدًا من 4 إلى 7 م"}}]},{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"EGP 45","ar":"45 جنيه"},"gap":"l"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Book pickup","ar":"احجز الاستلام"},"note":{"en":"Tapped 4 seconds ago, nothing changed","ar":"ضغطت منذ 4 ثوانٍ، ولم يتغيّر شيء"}}]},"body":{"en":"I'm designing an app for a parcel delivery company. Laila wants a courier to pick up a parcel from her home.\n\nShe taps **Book pickup**. For four seconds nothing on the screen changes, so she taps again. Two couriers come to her door the next morning.","ar":"أصمّم تطبيقًا لشركة توصيل طرود. تريد ليلى أن يأتي مندوب ليستلم طردًا من بيتها.\n\nضغطت **احجز الاستلام**. ولمدة أربع ثوانٍ لم يتغيّر شيء على الشاشة، فضغطت مرة أخرى. وفي الصباح التالي جاء إلى بابها مندوبان."}},{"id":"S02","type":"tune","part":"try","skill":"SK-P02-U01-01","rules":["R12"],"confidence":true,"value":{"en":"Try first. Visibility of system status (NN/g): whenever people act, they need to know if it worked. Feedback on the screen right away stops the second tap; a note elsewhere or a silent fix does not.","ar":"جرّب أولًا. ظهور حالة النظام (NN/g): كلما تصرّف الناس، يحتاجون أن يعرفوا إن نجح ما فعلوه. والردّ الفوري على الشاشة يمنع الضغطة الثانية؛ أما الملاحظة في مكان آخر أو الإصلاح الصامت فلا."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/visibility-system-status/","quote":"Whenever users interact with a system, they need to know whether the interaction was successful."},"prompt":{"en":"Booking takes about four seconds. What should I change?","ar":"الحجز يستغرق نحو أربع ثوانٍ. ماذا أغيّر؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"tard","name":{"en":"Tard","ar":"طرد"},"color":"#7C3AED","icon":"package","domain":"tard.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Book a pickup","ar":"احجز موعد استلام"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"map-pin","text":{"en":"14 Tahrir St, flat 6","ar":"14 شارع التحرير، شقة 6"},"sub":{"en":"Home · Cairo","ar":"البيت · القاهرة"},"chevron":true},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"clock","text":{"en":"Tomorrow, 10 am–1 pm","ar":"غدًا، من 10 ص إلى 1 م"},"chevron":true,"gap":"s"},{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"EGP 45","ar":"45 جنيه"},"gap":"l"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Book pickup","ar":"احجز الاستلام"},"note":{"en":"4 seconds after the tap","ar":"بعد الضغط بـ 4 ثوانٍ"}}]},"options":[{"id":"faq","text":{"en":"Add a line under the button: \"Booking can take a few seconds\"","ar":"أضيف سطرًا تحت الزر: «قد يستغرق الحجز بضع ثوانٍ»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"tard","name":{"en":"Tard","ar":"طرد"},"color":"#7C3AED","icon":"package","domain":"tard.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Book a pickup","ar":"احجز موعد استلام"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"map-pin","text":{"en":"14 Tahrir St, flat 6","ar":"14 شارع التحرير، شقة 6"},"sub":{"en":"Home · Cairo","ar":"البيت · القاهرة"},"chevron":true},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"clock","text":{"en":"Tomorrow, 10 am–1 pm","ar":"غدًا، من 10 ص إلى 1 م"},"chevron":true,"gap":"s"},{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"EGP 45","ar":"45 جنيه"},"gap":"l"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Book pickup","ar":"احجز الاستلام"},"note":{"en":"4 seconds after the tap","ar":"بعد الضغط بـ 4 ثوانٍ"}},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Booking can take a few seconds","ar":"قد يستغرق الحجز بضع ثوانٍ"},"color":"muted","gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"silent","text":{"en":"Quietly ignore a second tap within ten seconds","ar":"أتجاهل أي ضغطة ثانية خلال عشر ثوانٍ دون أن أُظهر شيئًا"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"tard","name":{"en":"Tard","ar":"طرد"},"color":"#7C3AED","icon":"package","domain":"tard.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Book a pickup","ar":"احجز موعد استلام"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"map-pin","text":{"en":"14 Tahrir St, flat 6","ar":"14 شارع التحرير، شقة 6"},"sub":{"en":"Home · Cairo","ar":"البيت · القاهرة"},"chevron":true},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"clock","text":{"en":"Tomorrow, 10 am–1 pm","ar":"غدًا، من 10 ص إلى 1 م"},"chevron":true,"gap":"s"},{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"EGP 45","ar":"45 جنيه"},"gap":"l"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Book pickup","ar":"احجز الاستلام"},"note":{"en":"Second tap ignored; nothing changes on screen","ar":"تُتجاهل الضغطة الثانية، ولا يتغيّر شيء على الشاشة"}}]}},{"id":"feedback","text":{"en":"Change the button to \"Booking…\" with a spinner, then show \"Pickup booked\" with the time","ar":"أحوّل الزر إلى «جارٍ الحجز…» مع مؤشر دوّار (Spinner)، ثم أعرض «حُجز الاستلام» مع الموعد"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"tard","name":{"en":"Tard","ar":"طرد"},"color":"#7C3AED","icon":"package","domain":"tard.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Book a pickup","ar":"احجز موعد استلام"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"map-pin","text":{"en":"14 Tahrir St, flat 6","ar":"14 شارع التحرير، شقة 6"},"sub":{"en":"Home · Cairo","ar":"البيت · القاهرة"},"chevron":true},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"clock","text":{"en":"Tomorrow, 10 am–1 pm","ar":"غدًا، من 10 ص إلى 1 م"},"chevron":true,"gap":"s"},{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"EGP 45","ar":"45 جنيه"},"gap":"l"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","icon":"spinner-gap","tone":"off","text":{"en":"Booking…","ar":"جارٍ الحجز…"},"note":{"en":"Then: ✓ Pickup booked, tomorrow 10 am–1 pm","ar":"ثم: ✓ حُجز الاستلام، غدًا من 10 ص إلى 1 م"}}]}}],"answer":["feedback"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P02-001","when":["faq"],"feedback":{"en":"Laila is looking at the button, not reading lines under it. And after four still seconds she still can't tell whether this booking is going through.","ar":"ليلى تنظر إلى الزر، ولا تقرأ الأسطر تحته. وبعد أربع ثوانٍ لم يتغيّر فيها شيء، ما زالت لا تعرف إن كان الحجز سينجح."}},{"id":"MC-P02-002","when":["silent"],"feedback":{"en":"This stops the double booking, but Laila still sees nothing happen. She may leave the app thinking the booking failed.","ar":"هذا يمنع الحجز المزدوج، لكن ليلى ما زالت لا ترى شيئًا يحدث. وقد تغادر التطبيق ظانّةً أن الحجز فشل."}}],"hints":[{"en":"What does Laila see in the four seconds after her tap?","ar":"ماذا ترى ليلى في الثواني الأربع بعد ضغطتها؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Show it's working, then show it worked.","ar":"أظهِر أن الحجز يجري، ثم أظهِر أنه تمّ."},"explain":{"en":"The spinner tells Laila her tap was caught and the app is working, so she has no reason to tap again. The confirmation with the time tells her the result.","ar":"المؤشر الدوّار يخبر ليلى أن ضغطتها وصلت وأن التطبيق يعمل، فلا يبقى سبب لتضغط مرة أخرى. والتأكيد مع الموعد يخبرها بالنتيجة."}},{"id":"S09","type":"video","part":"concept","title":{"en":"Visibility of system status","ar":"وضوح حالة النظام (Visibility of system status)"},"video":"b21e3a06-24cf-4eac-a1c9-764edcd496cb","duration":100,"transcript":[{"t":2.5,"en":"Let's look together at a very good example of feedback done badly: Paymob, the payment gateway.","ar":"تعالى نشوف مع بعض مثال كويس جدًا عن التطبيق السيئ للـ Feedback: Paymob، الـ Payment gateway اللي اسمها Paymob."},{"t":15.66,"en":"Let's look at it. Here I was trying to enter a new password, because I'd forgotten my old one.","ar":"تعالى نبص عليه مع بعض. هنا أنا كنت بحاول أدخل Password جديد، عشان كنت ناسي الـ Password القديم بتاعي."},{"t":25.5,"en":"As you can see, I enter the two passwords and press Submit new password, and nothing happens. A loader appears, and then nothing at all.","ar":"وزي ما إنتوا شايفين، أنا بدخّل الـ 2 Passwords وبدوس Submit new password، وما فيش أي حاجة بتتعمل. مجرد ما بيطلع لي Loader، وبعدين ما فيش أي حاجة بتحصل."},{"t":35.68,"en":"It doesn't tell me: do the two passwords not match? Did I do something else wrong? Was the account stopped? What exactly?","ar":"ما بيقولّيش: هل الـ 2 Passwords مش Matching؟ ولا أنا عامل حاجة غلط تانية؟ ولا الأكاونت اتوقف؟ ولا إيه بالظبط؟"},{"t":44.86,"en":"The first thing I did when this happened was start looking for another payment gateway to work with.","ar":"أول خطوة خدتها أول ما الموقف ده حصل معايا: بدأت أدوّر على Payment gateway تانية أحاول أتعامل معاها."},{"t":51.94,"en":"Simply, I don't know why I can't get into my account. Why? Because there was no feedback about something that really mattered to me here.","ar":"ببساطة أنا مش عارف ليه، مش عارف إيه سبب إني مش عارف أدخل على الأكاونت بتاعي. ده بسبب إيه؟ بسبب إنه ما كانش فيه Feedback لحاجة فعلًا تهمّني في السياق ده."},{"t":61.22,"en":"The system needs to answer me. It knows this information, the system knows it, but the designer didn't think of this case,","ar":"فمحتاج إن السيستم يرد عليّ. هو عارف المعلومة دي، السيستم هنا عارف المعلومة دي، لكن الديزاينر ما خدش باله من الـ Case دي،"},{"t":70.3,"en":"and didn't consider that there could be reasons that stop the user from continuing, like the account being deactivated, or...","ar":"وما راعاش إن في الحالة دي ممكن جدًا يكون فيه أسباب ما تخلّيش المستخدم يعرف يكمّل، زي إن الأكاونت يبقى Deactivated، أو..."},{"t":79.54,"en":"Even now I don't know the main reason. Maybe I entered the password wrongly; there could be many reasons,","ar":"أنا حتى الآن مش عارف إيه السبب الرئيسي. ممكن أكون دخّلت الـ Password بشكل خاطئ، ممكن يكون أسباب كتير،"},{"t":85.04,"en":"but it's only natural that I should know what's stopping me from getting in, and from getting past creating the password.","ar":"لكن طبيعي إني أعرف إيه السبب اللي مخلّيني مش عارف أدخل، ومش مخلّيني أعرف أتجاوز مرحلة إني أعمل Create للـ Password."}]},{"id":"S03","type":"card","part":"concept","icons":["tap","eye","warn"],"title":{"en":"Video summary","ar":"ملخص الفيديو"},"body":{"en":"The first heuristic: **always keep people informed about what is going on**, with the right feedback, in a reasonable time.\n\n- **Answer every action** right away: a pressed state, a spinner, a confirmation.\n- **Show where people are** and what comes next.\n- **Say when something changes** that affects them, instead of changing it silently.","ar":"مبدأ الاستخدام (Usability heuristic) الأول هو وضوح حالة النظام (Visibility of system status): **أخبِر الناس دائمًا بما يحدث**، بالـ Feedback (الردّ) المناسب، وفي وقت معقول.\n\n- **ردّ على كل إجراء** فورًا: حالة ضغط، أو مؤشر دوّار (Spinner)، أو تأكيد.\n- **أظهِر للناس أين وصلوا** وما خطوتهم التالية.\n- **أخبِرهم حين يتغيّر شيء** يؤثر فيهم، بدل أن تغيّره بصمت."}},{"id":"S04","type":"tune","part":"guided","skill":"SK-P02-U01-01","rules":["R06"],"value":{"en":"Progress indicators (NN/g): use a percent-done indicator for waits of 10 seconds or more; it shows how much is done and how much is left. A looped spinner gives no idea of the length.","ar":"مؤشرات التقدّم (NN/g): استخدم مؤشر النسبة المنجزة للانتظار الذي يبلغ 10 ثوانٍ أو أكثر؛ فهو يُظهر ما أُنجز وما بقي. أما المؤشر الدوّار فلا يعطي أي فكرة عن المدة."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/progress-indicators/","quote":"Generally, percent-done progress indicators should be used for longer processes that take 10 or more seconds."},"scenario":{"en":"In the same app, shop owners can upload a sheet of 200 parcels at once. Creating all the shipments takes about a minute.","ar":"في التطبيق نفسه، يستطيع أصحاب المتاجر رفع ملف فيه 200 طرد مرة واحدة. وإنشاء كل الشحنات يستغرق نحو دقيقة."},"prompt":{"en":"What should the screen show during that minute?","ar":"ماذا تعرض الشاشة خلال هذه الدقيقة؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"tard","name":{"en":"Tard","ar":"طرد"},"color":"#7C3AED","icon":"package","domain":"tard.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"tard.example/business/shipments/upload","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Shipments","ar":"الشحنات"},{"en":"Pickups","ar":"الاستلام"},{"en":"Billing","ar":"الفواتير"}],"active":0,"actions":[{"icon":"bell"},{"icon":"user"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Upload shipments","ar":"رفع الشحنات"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"file-xls","text":{"en":"orders-november.xlsx","ar":"orders-november.xlsx"},"sub":{"en":"200 parcels","ar":"200 طرد"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"icon","icon":"spinner-gap","size":"l","color":"brand","gap":"l","note":{"en":"Spinning for 40 seconds","ar":"يدور منذ 40 ثانية"}},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Please wait…","ar":"انتظر من فضلك…"},"gap":"s"}]},"options":[{"id":"spinner","text":{"en":"A spinner with \"Please wait…\"","ar":"مؤشر دوّار مع «انتظر من فضلك…»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"tard","name":{"en":"Tard","ar":"طرد"},"color":"#7C3AED","icon":"package","domain":"tard.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"tard.example/business/shipments/upload","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Shipments","ar":"الشحنات"},{"en":"Pickups","ar":"الاستلام"},{"en":"Billing","ar":"الفواتير"}],"active":0,"actions":[{"icon":"bell"},{"icon":"user"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Upload shipments","ar":"رفع الشحنات"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"file-xls","text":{"en":"orders-november.xlsx","ar":"orders-november.xlsx"},"sub":{"en":"200 parcels","ar":"200 طرد"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"icon","icon":"spinner-gap","size":"l","color":"brand","gap":"l","note":{"en":"Spinning for 40 seconds","ar":"يدور منذ 40 ثانية"}},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Please wait…","ar":"انتظر من فضلك…"},"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"count","text":{"en":"A bar that fills up, with \"Creating shipment 84 of 200\"","ar":"شريط يمتلئ، مع «جارٍ إنشاء الشحنة 84 من 200»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"tard","name":{"en":"Tard","ar":"طرد"},"color":"#7C3AED","icon":"package","domain":"tard.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"tard.example/business/shipments/upload","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Shipments","ar":"الشحنات"},{"en":"Pickups","ar":"الاستلام"},{"en":"Billing","ar":"الفواتير"}],"active":0,"actions":[{"icon":"bell"},{"icon":"user"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Upload shipments","ar":"رفع الشحنات"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"file-xls","text":{"en":"orders-november.xlsx","ar":"orders-november.xlsx"},"sub":{"en":"200 parcels","ar":"200 طرد"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"progress","value":42,"label":{"en":"Creating shipment 84 of 200","ar":"جارٍ إنشاء الشحنة 84 من 200"},"gap":"l"}]}},{"id":"email","text":{"en":"Nothing; send an email when all shipments are ready","ar":"لا أعرض شيئًا، وأرسل بريدًا حين تجهز كل الشحنات"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"tard","name":{"en":"Tard","ar":"طرد"},"color":"#7C3AED","icon":"package","domain":"tard.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"tard.example/business/shipments/upload","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Shipments","ar":"الشحنات"},{"en":"Pickups","ar":"الاستلام"},{"en":"Billing","ar":"الفواتير"}],"active":0,"actions":[{"icon":"bell"},{"icon":"user"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Upload shipments","ar":"رفع الشحنات"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"file-xls","text":{"en":"orders-november.xlsx","ar":"orders-november.xlsx"},"sub":{"en":"200 parcels","ar":"200 طرد"},"gap":"m","note":{"en":"Nothing else on screen; an email comes later","ar":"لا شيء آخر على الشاشة؛ ويصل بريد لاحقًا"}}]}}],"answer":["count"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P02-003","when":["spinner"],"feedback":{"en":"After 20 seconds of spinning, the shop owner can't tell if it's nearly done or stuck. A minute is too long for a wait with no sense of how much is left.","ar":"بعد 20 ثانية من الدوران، لا يعرف صاحب المتجر إن كان العمل قارب الانتهاء أم توقف. والدقيقة وقت طويل لانتظار لا يعرف كم بقي منه."}},{"id":"MC-P02-002","when":["email"],"feedback":{"en":"With nothing on the screen, the shop owner can't tell if the upload even started, and may upload the sheet again.","ar":"إن لم يظهر شيء على الشاشة، لا يعرف صاحب المتجر إن كان الرفع قد بدأ أصلًا، وقد يرفع الملف مرة أخرى."}}],"hints":[{"en":"How long is the wait, and what would the shop owner want to know during it?","ar":"كم يطول الانتظار، وماذا يريد صاحب المتجر أن يعرف خلاله؟"}],"correct":{"en":"A long wait needs a count or a percentage.","ar":"الانتظار الطويل يحتاج إلى عدد أو نسبة."},"explain":{"en":"\"84 of 200\" shows that work is moving and roughly how long is left, so the shop owner can wait calmly or come back later.","ar":"«84 من 200» تُظهر أن العمل يتقدّم وكم بقي تقريبًا، فيستطيع صاحب المتجر أن ينتظر بهدوء أو يعود لاحقًا."},"speaker":"sara"},{"id":"S05","type":"tune","part":"guided","skill":"SK-P02-U01-02","rules":["R06"],"value":{"en":"Visibility of system status (NN/g): when items in a saved list become unavailable, don't remove them silently or with a vague notice. Mark which ones changed and let people decide.","ar":"ظهور حالة النظام (NN/g): حين تصبح عناصر في قائمة محفوظة غير متاحة، لا تحذفها بصمت ولا بتنبيه مبهم. ضع علامة على ما تغيّر منها، ودَع الناس يقرّرون."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/visibility-system-status/","quote":"A better way to build trust is to explicitly communicate the current system"},"scenario":{"en":"People can save a list of their usual shipping boxes and order them again. The company stopped selling two of the box sizes.","ar":"يستطيع الناس حفظ قائمة بصناديق الشحن التي يستخدمونها عادة، وطلبها مرة أخرى. وقد توقّفت الشركة عن بيع مقاسين من الصناديق."},"prompt":{"en":"What should people see the next time they open their saved list?","ar":"ماذا يرى الناس حين يفتحون قائمتهم المحفوظة في المرة التالية؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"tard","name":{"en":"Tard","ar":"طرد"},"color":"#7C3AED","icon":"package","domain":"tard.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"My boxes","ar":"صناديقي"},"back":true},"tabbar":{"active":1,"items":[{"icon":"house","text":{"en":"Home","ar":"الرئيسية"}},{"icon":"package","text":{"en":"Boxes","ar":"الصناديق"}},{"icon":"user","text":{"en":"Account","ar":"حسابي"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","art":"box","text":{"en":"Small box","ar":"صندوق صغير"},"sub":{"en":"20 × 15 cm · EGP 12","ar":"20 × 15 سم · 12 جنيه"}},{"kind":"listitem","art":"box","text":{"en":"Flat box","ar":"صندوق مسطّح"},"sub":{"en":"35 × 25 cm · EGP 15","ar":"35 × 25 سم · 15 جنيه"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"listitem","art":"box","text":{"en":"Large box","ar":"صندوق كبير"},"sub":{"en":"50 × 40 cm · EGP 22","ar":"50 × 40 سم · 22 جنيه"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Flat box and Large box are no longer sold.","ar":"الصندوق المسطّح والكبير لم يعودا يُباعان."},"tone":"faint","gap":"m","note":{"en":"Known to the company, not shown to people","ar":"تعرفه الشركة، ولا يُعرض للناس"}}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Order again","ar":"اطلب مرة أخرى"}}]},"options":[{"id":"remove","text":{"en":"The list without the two boxes","ar":"القائمة دون الصندوقين"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"tard","name":{"en":"Tard","ar":"طرد"},"color":"#7C3AED","icon":"package","domain":"tard.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"My boxes","ar":"صناديقي"},"back":true},"tabbar":{"active":1,"items":[{"icon":"house","text":{"en":"Home","ar":"الرئيسية"}},{"icon":"package","text":{"en":"Boxes","ar":"الصناديق"}},{"icon":"user","text":{"en":"Account","ar":"حسابي"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","art":"box","text":{"en":"Small box","ar":"صندوق صغير"},"sub":{"en":"20 × 15 cm · EGP 12","ar":"20 × 15 سم · 12 جنيه"}}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Order again","ar":"اطلب مرة أخرى"}}]}},{"id":"banner","text":{"en":"The list without them, and a banner: \"Some items have changed\"","ar":"القائمة دونهما، وفوقها شريط تنبيه (Banner): «تغيّرت بعض العناصر»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"tard","name":{"en":"Tard","ar":"طرد"},"color":"#7C3AED","icon":"package","domain":"tard.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"My boxes","ar":"صناديقي"},"back":true},"tabbar":{"active":1,"items":[{"icon":"house","text":{"en":"Home","ar":"الرئيسية"}},{"icon":"package","text":{"en":"Boxes","ar":"الصناديق"}},{"icon":"user","text":{"en":"Account","ar":"حسابي"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"banner","tone":"info","icon":"info","text":{"en":"Some items have changed","ar":"تغيّرت بعض العناصر"}},{"kind":"listitem","art":"box","text":{"en":"Small box","ar":"صندوق صغير"},"sub":{"en":"20 × 15 cm · EGP 12","ar":"20 × 15 سم · 12 جنيه"}}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Order again","ar":"اطلب مرة أخرى"}}]}},{"id":"mark","text":{"en":"Both boxes still listed, marked \"No longer sold\", with Remove and a similar box","ar":"الصندوقان ما زالا في القائمة، وعليهما «لم يعد يُباع»، مع «احذف» وصندوق مشابه"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"tard","name":{"en":"Tard","ar":"طرد"},"color":"#7C3AED","icon":"package","domain":"tard.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"My boxes","ar":"صناديقي"},"back":true},"tabbar":{"active":1,"items":[{"icon":"house","text":{"en":"Home","ar":"الرئيسية"}},{"icon":"package","text":{"en":"Boxes","ar":"الصناديق"}},{"icon":"user","text":{"en":"Account","ar":"حسابي"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","art":"box","text":{"en":"Small box","ar":"صندوق صغير"},"sub":{"en":"20 × 15 cm · EGP 12","ar":"20 × 15 سم · 12 جنيه"}},{"kind":"listitem","art":"box","text":{"en":"Flat box","ar":"صندوق مسطّح"},"sub":{"en":"35 × 25 cm","ar":"35 × 25 سم"},"gap":"s","badge":{"text":{"en":"No longer sold","ar":"لم يعد يُباع"},"tone":"bad"}},{"kind":"row","blocks":[{"kind":"link","text":{"en":"Remove","ar":"احذف"}},{"kind":"link","text":{"en":"Similar: Medium flat box","ar":"مشابه: صندوق مسطّح متوسط"}}]},{"kind":"listitem","art":"box","text":{"en":"Large box","ar":"صندوق كبير"},"sub":{"en":"50 × 40 cm","ar":"50 × 40 سم"},"gap":"s","badge":{"text":{"en":"No longer sold","ar":"لم يعد يُباع"},"tone":"bad"}},{"kind":"row","blocks":[{"kind":"link","text":{"en":"Remove","ar":"احذف"}},{"kind":"link","text":{"en":"Similar: Big box","ar":"مشابه: صندوق ضخم"}}]}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Order again","ar":"اطلب مرة أخرى"}}]}}],"answer":["mark"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P02-004","when":["remove"],"feedback":{"en":"People will order again and only find out at the door that two boxes are missing. They also lose track of which sizes they used.","ar":"سيطلب الناس مرة أخرى، ولن يكتشفوا أن صندوقين ناقصان إلا عند التسليم. كما أنهم ينسون المقاسات التي كانوا يستخدمونها."}},{"id":"MC-P02-005","when":["banner"],"feedback":{"en":"The banner says something changed, but not what. People still have to work out which boxes are gone and what to use instead.","ar":"الـ Banner يقول إن شيئًا تغيّر، لكنه لا يقول ما هو. فما زال على الناس أن يعرفوا بأنفسهم أي الصناديق اختفت وبماذا يستبدلونها."}}],"hints":[{"en":"After seeing the screen, would people know exactly which boxes they can't order?","ar":"بعد رؤية الشاشة، هل يعرف الناس بالضبط أي الصناديق لا يستطيعون طلبها؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Say what changed, on the item itself.","ar":"قل ما الذي تغيّر، على العنصر نفسه."},"explain":{"en":"The mark sits on the exact boxes that changed, and people stay in control: they can remove them or pick a similar size.","ar":"العلامة على الصندوقين اللذين تغيّرا بالضبط، ويبقى القرار للناس: يحذفونهما أو يختارون مقاسًا مشابهًا."},"speaker":"sara"},{"id":"S06","type":"compare","speaker":"karim","part":"contrast","skill":"SK-P02-U01-01","rules":["R11"],"value":{"en":"Progress indicators (NN/g): feedback should fit the wait. For an action that takes under a second, a loading animation is distracting; a quick change on the button itself is enough.","ar":"مؤشرات التقدّم (NN/g): يجب أن يناسب الردُّ مدة الانتظار. فلإجراء يستغرق أقل من ثانية، تكون حركة التحميل مشتّتة؛ ويكفي تغيير سريع على الزر نفسه."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/progress-indicators/","quote":"For anything that takes less than 1 second to load, it is distracting to use a looped animation"},"scenario":{"en":"I'm building a food ordering website. Adding a dish to the cart takes a fraction of a second. We tried two ways to show it worked.","ar":"أبني موقعًا لطلب الطعام. وإضافة طبق إلى السلة تستغرق جزءًا من الثانية. جرّبنا طريقتين لإظهار أنها تمّت."},"prompt":{"en":"Which version gives the right feedback?","ar":"أيّ نسخة تُخبر الناس بوضوح أن الطبق أُضيف إلى السلة؟"},"a":{"label":{"en":"Version A: a loading screen","ar":"النسخة A: شاشة تحميل"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"lokma","name":{"en":"Lokma","ar":"لقمة"},"color":"#F08C00","icon":"hamburger","domain":"lokma.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Koshary El Nil","ar":"كشري النيل"},"back":true,"actions":[{"icon":"shopping-cart","count":1}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"food-koshary","size":"l"},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Koshary, large","ar":"كشري، كبير"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"EGP 65","ar":"65 جنيه"},"gap":"s"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Add to cart","ar":"أضف إلى السلة"}}],"overlay":{"type":"dialog","blocks":[{"kind":"icon","icon":"spinner-gap","size":"l","color":"brand","note":{"en":"Flashes for 0.3 s","ar":"يظهر 0.3 ثانية"}},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Loading…","ar":"جارٍ التحميل…"},"gap":"s"}]}}},"b":{"label":{"en":"Version B: the button changes","ar":"النسخة B: الزر يتغيّر"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"lokma","name":{"en":"Lokma","ar":"لقمة"},"color":"#F08C00","icon":"hamburger","domain":"lokma.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Koshary El Nil","ar":"كشري النيل"},"back":true,"actions":[{"icon":"shopping-cart","count":2}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"food-koshary","size":"l"},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Koshary, large","ar":"كشري، كبير"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"EGP 65","ar":"65 جنيه"},"gap":"s"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","icon":"check","text":{"en":"Added · View cart (2)","ar":"أُضيف · اعرض السلة (2)"}}]}},"answer":"b","misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P02-006","when":["a"],"feedback":{"en":"The loading screen flashes for a split second. People can't read it, the page jumps, and they're left unsure what just happened.","ar":"شاشة التحميل تظهر وتختفي في جزء من الثانية. لا يستطيع الناس قراءتها، والصفحة تقفز، فيبقون غير متأكدين مما حدث."}}],"correct":{"en":"B: a quick change right where people tapped.","ar":"B: تغيير سريع في المكان الذي ضغط فيه الناس."},"explain":{"en":"The button shows the result where the eyes already are, and the cart count confirms it. A loading animation is for waits of a few seconds, not for instant actions.","ar":"الزر يُظهر النتيجة حيث تنظر العين أصلًا، وعدد السلة يؤكدها. وحركة التحميل للانتظار الذي يطول بضع ثوانٍ، لا للإجراءات الفورية."}},{"id":"S07","type":"tune","speaker":"hana","part":"independent","skill":"SK-P02-U01-02","rules":["R14"],"confidence":true,"value":{"en":"Visibility of system status (NN/g): when an outside event changes something people rely on, explain it briefly and clearly. A booking that simply disappears breaks trust.","ar":"ظهور حالة النظام (NN/g): حين يغيّر حدث خارجي شيئًا يعتمد عليه الناس، اشرحه باختصار ووضوح. والحجز الذي يختفي فجأة يهدم الثقة."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/visibility-system-status/","quote":"When an external event or the passage of time caused a change in the state of the system, explain it in brief but understandable terms."},"scenario":{"en":"Members book classes in my gym's app. A trainer fell ill, so I cancelled Thursday's 7 pm spinning class. Right now, the class just disappears from members' \"My bookings\".","ar":"يحجز الأعضاء الحصص من تطبيق النادي الذي أملكه. مرض أحد المدرّبين، فألغيت حصة الـ Spinning يوم الخميس الساعة 7 مساءً. والآن تختفي الحصة ببساطة من «حجوزاتي» عند الأعضاء."},"prompt":{"en":"What should members see instead?","ar":"ماذا يجب أن يرى الأعضاء بدل ذلك؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"My bookings","ar":"حجوزاتي"}},"tabbar":{"active":1,"items":[{"icon":"calendar-blank","text":{"en":"Classes","ar":"الحصص"}},{"icon":"ticket","text":{"en":"Bookings","ar":"حجوزاتي"}},{"icon":"user","text":{"en":"Me","ar":"حسابي"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"tabs","options":[{"en":"Upcoming","ar":"القادمة"},{"en":"Past","ar":"السابقة"}],"value":0},{"kind":"listitem","art":"gym","text":{"en":"Yoga · Tue 6 pm","ar":"يوغا · الثلاثاء 6 م"},"sub":{"en":"Coach Mai · Studio 2","ar":"المدرّبة مي · الاستوديو 2"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"listitem","art":"gym","text":{"en":"HIIT · Sat 8 am","ar":"HIIT · السبت 8 ص"},"sub":{"en":"Coach Omar · Hall A","ar":"المدرّب عمر · القاعة A"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Thursday's 7 pm spinning class used to be here.","ar":"كانت حصة الـ Spinning يوم الخميس 7 م هنا."},"tone":"faint","gap":"m","note":{"en":"Gone, with no message","ar":"اختفت دون رسالة"}}]},"options":[{"id":"vanish","text":{"en":"Keep it as it is; the class is cancelled anyway","ar":"يبقى الوضع كما هو؛ فالحصة أُلغيت على أي حال"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"My bookings","ar":"حجوزاتي"}},"tabbar":{"active":1,"items":[{"icon":"calendar-blank","text":{"en":"Classes","ar":"الحصص"}},{"icon":"ticket","text":{"en":"Bookings","ar":"حجوزاتي"}},{"icon":"user","text":{"en":"Me","ar":"حسابي"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"tabs","options":[{"en":"Upcoming","ar":"القادمة"},{"en":"Past","ar":"السابقة"}],"value":0},{"kind":"listitem","art":"gym","text":{"en":"Yoga · Tue 6 pm","ar":"يوغا · الثلاثاء 6 م"},"sub":{"en":"Coach Mai · Studio 2","ar":"المدرّبة مي · الاستوديو 2"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"listitem","art":"gym","text":{"en":"HIIT · Sat 8 am","ar":"HIIT · السبت 8 ص"},"sub":{"en":"Coach Omar · Hall A","ar":"المدرّب عمر · القاعة A"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Thursday's 7 pm spinning class used to be here.","ar":"كانت حصة الـ Spinning يوم الخميس 7 م هنا."},"tone":"faint","gap":"m","note":{"en":"Gone, with no message","ar":"اختفت دون رسالة"}}]}},{"id":"card","text":{"en":"The class stays in My bookings, marked \"Cancelled by the gym: trainer ill\", with \"Book another class\"","ar":"تبقى الحصة في «حجوزاتي» وعليها «ألغاها النادي: المدرّب مريض»، مع «احجز حصة أخرى»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"My bookings","ar":"حجوزاتي"}},"tabbar":{"active":1,"items":[{"icon":"calendar-blank","text":{"en":"Classes","ar":"الحصص"}},{"icon":"ticket","text":{"en":"Bookings","ar":"حجوزاتي"}},{"icon":"user","text":{"en":"Me","ar":"حسابي"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"tabs","options":[{"en":"Upcoming","ar":"القادمة"},{"en":"Past","ar":"السابقة"}],"value":0},{"kind":"listitem","art":"gym","text":{"en":"Yoga · Tue 6 pm","ar":"يوغا · الثلاثاء 6 م"},"sub":{"en":"Coach Mai · Studio 2","ar":"المدرّبة مي · الاستوديو 2"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"listitem","art":"gym","text":{"en":"Spinning · Thu 7 pm","ar":"Spinning · الخميس 7 م"},"sub":{"en":"Cancelled by the gym: trainer ill","ar":"ألغاها النادي: المدرّب مريض"},"badge":{"text":{"en":"Cancelled","ar":"أُلغيت"},"tone":"bad"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"link","icon":"plus","text":{"en":"Book another class","ar":"احجز حصة أخرى"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"listitem","art":"gym","text":{"en":"HIIT · Sat 8 am","ar":"HIIT · السبت 8 ص"},"sub":{"en":"Coach Omar · Hall A","ar":"المدرّب عمر · القاعة A"},"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"general","text":{"en":"A message on the home screen: \"Some classes have changed this week\"","ar":"رسالة في الشاشة الرئيسية: «تغيّرت بعض الحصص هذا الأسبوع»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"My bookings","ar":"حجوزاتي"}},"tabbar":{"active":1,"items":[{"icon":"calendar-blank","text":{"en":"Classes","ar":"الحصص"}},{"icon":"ticket","text":{"en":"Bookings","ar":"حجوزاتي"}},{"icon":"user","text":{"en":"Me","ar":"حسابي"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"tabs","options":[{"en":"Upcoming","ar":"القادمة"},{"en":"Past","ar":"السابقة"}],"value":0},{"kind":"listitem","art":"gym","text":{"en":"Yoga · Tue 6 pm","ar":"يوغا · الثلاثاء 6 م"},"sub":{"en":"Coach Mai · Studio 2","ar":"المدرّبة مي · الاستوديو 2"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"listitem","art":"gym","text":{"en":"HIIT · Sat 8 am","ar":"HIIT · السبت 8 ص"},"sub":{"en":"Coach Omar · Hall A","ar":"المدرّب عمر · القاعة A"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Thursday's 7 pm spinning class used to be here.","ar":"كانت حصة الـ Spinning يوم الخميس 7 م هنا."},"tone":"faint","gap":"m","note":{"en":"Home only says: \"Some classes have changed this week\"","ar":"الرئيسية تقول فقط: «تغيّرت بعض الحصص هذا الأسبوع»"}}]}}],"answer":["card"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P02-004","when":["vanish"],"feedback":{"en":"Members who don't notice the gap will come on Thursday for a class that isn't there. Those who do notice will wonder if the app lost their booking.","ar":"الأعضاء الذين لا يلاحظون الفراغ سيأتون يوم الخميس لحصة غير موجودة. ومن يلاحظ سيتساءل إن كان التطبيق قد أضاع حجزه."}},{"id":"MC-P02-005","when":["general"],"feedback":{"en":"Each member has to work out if their own class is one of the changed ones, and why.","ar":"على كل عضو أن يكتشف بنفسه إن كانت حصته من الحصص التي تغيّرت، ولماذا."}}],"hints":[{"en":"What does a member need to know about Thursday, and where would they look?","ar":"ماذا يحتاج العضو إلى معرفته عن يوم الخميس، وأين سيبحث؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Keep it in place, say what happened, offer the next step.","ar":"أبقِها في مكانها، وقل ما حدث، واعرض الخطوة التالية."},"explain":{"en":"Members look for their class in My bookings, so the news belongs there. A short reason and a way to book another class turn a surprise into a choice.","ar":"يبحث الأعضاء عن حصتهم في «حجوزاتي»، فالخبر مكانه هناك. والسبب القصير وطريقة لحجز حصة أخرى يحوّلان المفاجأة إلى اختيار."}},{"id":"S08","type":"card","part":"recap","icons":["tap","clock","warn"],"title":{"en":"What you practised","ar":"ما تدرّبت عليه"},"body":{"en":"- **Answer every action at once**, where people are looking.\n- **Fit the feedback to the wait:** a quick change for instant actions, a spinner for a few seconds, a count or percentage for long waits.\n- **Never change things silently:** say what changed, on the item itself, and what people can do now.\n\nNext: speaking your users' language.","ar":"- **ردّ على كل إجراء فورًا**، حيث ينظر الناس.\n- **اجعل الردّ على قدر الانتظار:** تغيير سريع للإجراءات الفورية، ومؤشر دوّار لبضع ثوانٍ، وعدد أو نسبة للانتظار الطويل.\n- **لا تغيّر الأشياء بصمت:** قل ما الذي تغيّر، على العنصر نفسه، وما الذي يستطيع الناس فعله الآن.\n\nالتالي: أن تتكلم بلغة مستخدميك."}}]}$uxg$::jsonb),
  ($uxg$P02-U01-L02$uxg$, $uxg$8bb5743f8b3c6da40a4dd8061779fe9bfb7a61a43d533b6552b4641dc3017001$uxg$, $uxg${"id":"P02-U01-L02","mode":"lesson","minutes":8,"title":{"en":"Speak your users' language","ar":"تكلّم بلغة مستخدميك"},"speaker":"nour","review_labels":{"MC-P02-007":{"en":"Staff words aren't the users' words","ar":"كلمات الموظفين ليست كلمات المستخدمين"},"MC-P02-008":{"en":"A tooltip doesn't fix a strange word","ar":"الـ Tooltip لا يُصلح كلمة غريبة"},"MC-P02-009":{"en":"Spell out abbreviations","ar":"اكتب الاختصارات كاملة"},"MC-P02-010":{"en":"Follow the order people do the task in","ar":"اتبع الترتيب الذي يؤدي به الناس المهمة"},"MC-P02-011":{"en":"A new look for a familiar control hides it","ar":"إذا غيّرت شكل عنصر مألوف، لن يتعرّف عليه الناس"}},"steps":[{"id":"S01","type":"card","part":"hook","title":{"en":"The clinic app nobody uses","ar":"تطبيق العيادة الذي لا يستخدمه أحد"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"New encounter","ar":"Encounter جديد"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"select","label":{"en":"Service line","ar":"خط الخدمة (Service line)"},"text":"OPD-DERM","filled":true},{"kind":"select","label":{"en":"Provider","ar":"مقدّم الخدمة (Provider)"},"text":{"en":"Select provider","ar":"اختر مقدّم الخدمة"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"select","label":{"en":"Encounter type","ar":"نوع الـ Encounter"},"text":"F/U","filled":true,"gap":"m"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Submit encounter request","ar":"أرسل طلب الـ Encounter"}}]},"body":{"en":"I manage a clinic. Our new app lets patients book visits, but most of them still call the front desk.\n\nOne patient told me she opened the app, saw this screen, and closed it: she didn't know what an \"encounter\" was, or what she was meant to pick.","ar":"أدير عيادة. تطبيقنا الجديد يتيح للمرضى حجز الزيارات، لكن أغلبهم ما زالوا يتصلون بالاستقبال.\n\nأخبرتني مريضة أنها فتحت التطبيق، ورأت هذه الشاشة، فأغلقته: لم تعرف ما معنى «Encounter»، ولا ما الذي يُفترض أن تختاره."}},{"id":"S02","type":"tune","part":"try","skill":"SK-P02-U01-03","rules":["R12"],"confidence":true,"value":{"en":"Try first. Match between the system and the real world (NN/g): use words, phrases and concepts familiar to the user, not internal jargon. Explaining the jargon in a tooltip still makes people decode it.","ar":"جرّب أولًا. التوافق بين النظام والعالم الحقيقي (NN/g): استخدم كلمات وعبارات ومفاهيم مألوفة للمستخدم، لا مصطلحات داخلية. وشرح المصطلح في Tooltip ما زال يجبر الناس على فكّ رموزه."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/ten-usability-heuristics/","quote":"Use words, phrases, and concepts familiar to the user, rather than internal jargon."},"prompt":{"en":"What should the main button say?","ar":"ماذا نكتب على الزر الرئيسي ليفهمه المرضى؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"New encounter","ar":"Encounter جديد"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"select","label":{"en":"Service line","ar":"خط الخدمة (Service line)"},"text":"OPD-DERM","filled":true},{"kind":"select","label":{"en":"Provider","ar":"مقدّم الخدمة (Provider)"},"text":{"en":"Dr. Salma Adel","ar":"د. سلمى عادل"},"filled":true,"gap":"m"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Submit encounter request","ar":"أرسل طلب الـ Encounter"},"ring":true}]},"options":[{"id":"keep","text":{"en":"Keep \"Submit encounter request\": it's the correct medical term","ar":"يبقى «أرسل طلب الـ Encounter»: فهو المصطلح الطبي الصحيح"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"New encounter","ar":"Encounter جديد"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"select","label":{"en":"Service line","ar":"خط الخدمة (Service line)"},"text":"OPD-DERM","filled":true},{"kind":"select","label":{"en":"Provider","ar":"مقدّم الخدمة (Provider)"},"text":{"en":"Dr. Salma Adel","ar":"د. سلمى عادل"},"filled":true,"gap":"m"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Submit encounter request","ar":"أرسل طلب الـ Encounter"},"ring":true}]}},{"id":"tip","text":{"en":"Keep it, and add an ⓘ that explains \"encounter\"","ar":"يبقى كما هو، مع أيقونة ⓘ تشرح معنى «Encounter»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"New encounter","ar":"Encounter جديد"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"select","label":{"en":"Service line","ar":"خط الخدمة (Service line)"},"text":"OPD-DERM","filled":true},{"kind":"select","label":{"en":"Provider","ar":"مقدّم الخدمة (Provider)"},"text":{"en":"Dr. Salma Adel","ar":"د. سلمى عادل"},"filled":true,"gap":"m"}],"footer":[{"kind":"link","icon":"info","text":{"en":"What's an encounter?","ar":"ما معنى Encounter؟"}},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Submit encounter request","ar":"أرسل طلب الـ Encounter"},"ring":true,"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"plain","text":{"en":"\"Book a visit\"","ar":"«احجز زيارة»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"New encounter","ar":"Encounter جديد"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"select","label":{"en":"Service line","ar":"خط الخدمة (Service line)"},"text":"OPD-DERM","filled":true},{"kind":"select","label":{"en":"Provider","ar":"مقدّم الخدمة (Provider)"},"text":{"en":"Dr. Salma Adel","ar":"د. سلمى عادل"},"filled":true,"gap":"m"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Book a visit","ar":"احجز زيارة"},"ring":true}]}}],"answer":["plain"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P02-007","when":["keep"],"feedback":{"en":"\"Encounter\" is how our staff and systems talk. Patients say they want to book a visit or see a doctor.","ar":"«Encounter» هي طريقة كلام موظفينا وأنظمتنا. أما المرضى فيقولون إنهم يريدون حجز زيارة أو رؤية طبيب."}},{"id":"MC-P02-008","when":["tip"],"feedback":{"en":"Patients would still have to stop, open the tip and translate the word. If a plain word says the same thing, use it on the button.","ar":"سيظل على المرضى أن يتوقفوا ويفتحوا الـ Tooltip (الشرح المنبثق) ويترجموا الكلمة. وإن كانت هناك كلمة بسيطة بالمعنى نفسه، فضعها على الزر."}}],"hints":[{"en":"When patients call the front desk, what do they say they want?","ar":"حين يتصل المرضى بالاستقبال، ماذا يقولون إنهم يريدون؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Use the patient's own words.","ar":"استخدم كلمات المريض نفسه."},"explain":{"en":"\"Book a visit\" is what patients already say on the phone, so they understand the button without thinking. The correct internal term only matters to the staff.","ar":"«احجز زيارة» هي ما يقوله المرضى أصلًا على الهاتف، فيفهمون الزر دون تفكير. أما المصطلح الداخلي الصحيح فيهمّ الموظفين وحدهم."}},{"id":"S09","type":"video","part":"concept","title":{"en":"Match between the system and the real world","ar":"تطابق النظام مع العالم الحقيقي (Match between the system and the real world)"},"video":"d2b38b05-e7ef-487a-992c-a1cb2bc6a815","duration":125,"transcript":[{"t":2.5,"en":"Simply put, imagine you're building an application for a pharmacist friend who owns a chain of pharmacies,","ar":"ببساطة، تعالى نفترض إنك دلوقتي بتعمل Application لدكتور صيدلي صديقك، عنده ما شاء الله سلسلة من الصيدليات،"},{"t":12.56,"en":"and wants software to run the pharmacies, so the pharmacists working with him can find medicines quickly.","ar":"وعايز يعمل برنامج يدير من خلاله الصيدليات، والدكاترة اللي شغالين معاه يدوّروا على الدوا بشكل سريع."},{"t":22.56,"en":"And you decided not to do any research, and not to care about matching the system to the real world.","ar":"وإنت قررت إنك مش هتعمل Research، ومش هتعتني بفكرة الـ Matching between the system and real world."},{"t":28.56,"en":"Then you might ask yourself how to arrange the medicines, and assume it makes sense to keep diabetes medicines together, and liver medicines together,","ar":"ساعتها ممكن تقول: والله، أنا هرتّب الأدوية في السيستم ده إزاي؟ فتبدأ تفترض إنه Make sense إن أدوية مرضى السكر تبقى مع بعض، وأدوية مرضى الكبد مع بعض،"},{"t":42.56,"en":"so you start making categories, sorting the medicines by disease.","ar":"فتبدأ تعمل Categories للأدوية، أو تصنّفها بناءً على المرض."},{"t":48.56,"en":"Then you build the product, the developers work on it, your company works on it, and it goes out to the pharmacy,","ar":"وبعدين تطوّر المنتج، والـ Developers يشتغلوا عليه، وشركتك تشتغل عليه، وبعدين ينزل للصيدلية،"},{"t":56.56,"en":"and the pharmacist is surprised that it's arranged in a way he's not used to at all. It made sense to you as a designer,","ar":"والصيدلي يتفاجئ إنه مترتّب بطريقة هو مش متعوّد عليها أصلًا. هي كانت Make sense بالنسبة لك كـ Designer،"},{"t":62.56,"en":"but that's not how pharmacists look for medicines. What they're used to is alphabetical order.","ar":"لكن دي مش الطريقة اللي الدكاترة الصيادلة بيدوّروا بيها على الأدوية. الطريقة اللي هو متعوّد عليها هي الترتيب الأبجدي."},{"t":72.56,"en":"Here you assumed a way that made sense to you, based on your own real-world experience,","ar":"وإنت هنا افترضت طريقة شايف إنها Make sense بالنسبة لك، بناءً على تجربتك الـ Real world الشخصية،"},{"t":78.56,"en":"since you're usually a patient, not a pharmacist or a doctor, and you visit the different departments of a hospital. That's your real life,","ar":"باعتبارك غالبًا بتبقى مريض، مش دكتور صيدلي ولا دكتور، بتروح الأقسام المختلفة في المستشفى. فدي حياتك الواقعية،"},{"t":88.56,"en":"so you split them by departments or diseases. Here you missed the match between the system and the real world,","ar":"فقلت: والله، هقسّمها بناءً على الأقسام المختلفة أو الأمراض المختلفة. هنا إنت فوّت الـ Matching between system and real world،"},{"t":96.56,"en":"and the product you made certainly won't succeed. The first one who matches the software, and the way medicines are arranged, to how the pharmacist thinks,","ar":"وأكيد المنتج اللي إنت عملته مش هينجح. وأول ما حد يبدأ يماتش البرنامج في الديزاين بتاعه، وفي طريقة ترتيب الأدوية بالطريقة اللي الصيدلي بيفكّر بيها،"},{"t":110.56,"en":"will succeed far more than you, and be much easier for users, because they're already used to that way in their real lives.","ar":"هينجح أكتر منك بكتير، وهيكون أسهل بكتير بالنسبة للمستخدمين، لأنهم Already متعوّدين على الطريقة دي في حياتهم الواقعية."}]},{"id":"S03","type":"card","part":"concept","icons":["text","person","order"],"title":{"en":"Video summary","ar":"ملخص الفيديو"},"body":{"en":"The second heuristic: **the design should speak the users' language** and follow what they know from the real world.\n\n- **Use their words,** not your team's jargon, technical terms or unexplained abbreviations.\n- **Learn their mental model** (how they picture the task) before you organize anything. Your own logic may not be theirs.\n- **Keep the order and conventions they know:** the steps they follow, and controls that look like what they expect.","ar":"مبدأ الاستخدام (Usability heuristic) الثاني هو تطابق النظام مع العالم الحقيقي (Match between the system and the real world): **يجب أن يتكلم التصميم بلغة المستخدمين** ويتبع ما يعرفونه من العالم الحقيقي.\n\n- **استخدم كلماتهم،** لا مصطلحات فريقك ولا المصطلحات التقنية ولا الاختصارات غير المشروحة.\n- **افهم النموذج الذهني (Mental model)** لديهم، أي كيف يتصورون المهمة، قبل أن ترتّب أي شيء. فمنطقك أنت قد لا يكون منطقهم.\n- **حافظ على الترتيب والعادات التي يعرفونها (Conventions):** الخطوات التي يتبعونها، وعناصر تبدو كما يتوقعون."}},{"id":"S04","type":"tune","part":"guided","skill":"SK-P02-U01-03","rules":["R06"],"value":{"en":"Match between the system and the real world (NN/g): never assume users will understand an abbreviation or acronym at first read. Spell it out in the words people use.","ar":"التوافق بين النظام والعالم الحقيقي (NN/g): لا تفترض أبدًا أن المستخدمين سيفهمون الاختصار من أول قراءة. اكتبه كاملًا بالكلمات التي يستخدمها الناس."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/match-system-real-world/","quote":"Never assume that users will understand an abbreviation or acronym at first read."},"scenario":{"en":"The list of clinics in the app uses our internal codes: DERM, ENT, OB-GYN, PEDS.","ar":"قائمة العيادات في التطبيق تستخدم رموزنا الداخلية: DERM وENT وOB-GYN وPEDS."},"prompt":{"en":"How should the list name the clinics?","ar":"كيف نسمّي العيادات في القائمة ليفهمها المرضى؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Choose a clinic","ar":"اختر عيادة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"searchbar","text":{"en":"Search clinics","ar":"ابحث عن عيادة"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"first-aid-kit","text":"DERM","sub":{"en":"3 doctors · from EGP 350","ar":"3 أطباء · من 350 جنيه"},"chevron":true,"gap":"m"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"first-aid-kit","text":"ENT","sub":{"en":"2 doctors · from EGP 300","ar":"طبيبان · من 300 جنيه"},"chevron":true,"gap":"s"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"first-aid-kit","text":"OB-GYN","sub":{"en":"4 doctors · from EGP 400","ar":"4 أطباء · من 400 جنيه"},"chevron":true,"gap":"s"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"first-aid-kit","text":"PEDS","sub":{"en":"3 doctors · from EGP 300","ar":"3 أطباء · من 300 جنيه"},"chevron":true,"gap":"s"}]},"options":[{"id":"codes","text":{"en":"Keep the codes; they're short and fit on small screens","ar":"تبقى الرموز؛ فهي قصيرة وتناسب الشاشات الصغيرة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Choose a clinic","ar":"اختر عيادة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"searchbar","text":{"en":"Search clinics","ar":"ابحث عن عيادة"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"first-aid-kit","text":"DERM","sub":{"en":"3 doctors · from EGP 350","ar":"3 أطباء · من 350 جنيه"},"chevron":true,"gap":"m"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"first-aid-kit","text":"ENT","sub":{"en":"2 doctors · from EGP 300","ar":"طبيبان · من 300 جنيه"},"chevron":true,"gap":"s"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"first-aid-kit","text":"OB-GYN","sub":{"en":"4 doctors · from EGP 400","ar":"4 أطباء · من 400 جنيه"},"chevron":true,"gap":"s"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"first-aid-kit","text":"PEDS","sub":{"en":"3 doctors · from EGP 300","ar":"3 أطباء · من 300 جنيه"},"chevron":true,"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"names","text":{"en":"Skin, Ear nose and throat, Women's health and pregnancy, Children","ar":"الجلدية، والأنف والأذن والحنجرة، وصحة المرأة والحمل، والأطفال"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Choose a clinic","ar":"اختر عيادة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"searchbar","text":{"en":"Search clinics","ar":"ابحث عن عيادة"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"first-aid-kit","text":{"en":"Skin","ar":"الجلدية"},"sub":{"en":"3 doctors · from EGP 350","ar":"3 أطباء · من 350 جنيه"},"chevron":true,"gap":"m"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"first-aid-kit","text":{"en":"Ear, nose and throat","ar":"الأنف والأذن والحنجرة"},"sub":{"en":"2 doctors · from EGP 300","ar":"طبيبان · من 300 جنيه"},"chevron":true,"gap":"s"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"first-aid-kit","text":{"en":"Women's health and pregnancy","ar":"صحة المرأة والحمل"},"sub":{"en":"4 doctors · from EGP 400","ar":"4 أطباء · من 400 جنيه"},"chevron":true,"gap":"s"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"first-aid-kit","text":{"en":"Children","ar":"الأطفال"},"sub":{"en":"3 doctors · from EGP 300","ar":"3 أطباء · من 300 جنيه"},"chevron":true,"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"legend","text":{"en":"Keep the codes, with a key at the bottom of the list","ar":"تبقى الرموز، مع دليل يشرحها أسفل القائمة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Choose a clinic","ar":"اختر عيادة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"searchbar","text":{"en":"Search clinics","ar":"ابحث عن عيادة"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"first-aid-kit","text":"DERM","sub":{"en":"3 doctors · from EGP 350","ar":"3 أطباء · من 350 جنيه"},"chevron":true,"gap":"m"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"first-aid-kit","text":"ENT","sub":{"en":"2 doctors · from EGP 300","ar":"طبيبان · من 300 جنيه"},"chevron":true,"gap":"s"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"first-aid-kit","text":"OB-GYN","sub":{"en":"4 doctors · from EGP 400","ar":"4 أطباء · من 400 جنيه"},"chevron":true,"gap":"s"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"first-aid-kit","text":"PEDS","sub":{"en":"3 doctors · from EGP 300","ar":"3 أطباء · من 300 جنيه"},"chevron":true,"gap":"s"},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","gap":"l","text":{"en":"Key: DERM = Skin · ENT = Ear, nose and throat · OB-GYN = Women's health · PEDS = Children","ar":"الدليل: DERM = الجلدية · ENT = الأنف والأذن والحنجرة · OB-GYN = صحة المرأة · PEDS = الأطفال"}}]}}],"answer":["names"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P02-009","when":["codes","legend"],"feedback":{"en":"A mother looking for a children's doctor has to guess that PEDS means children, or scroll to a key and match each code. The plain name answers it at a glance.","ar":"الأم التي تبحث عن طبيب أطفال عليها أن تخمّن أن PEDS تعني الأطفال، أو تنزل إلى الدليل وتطابق كل رمز. أما الاسم الواضح فيوضّح الأمر من نظرة واحدة."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Would a patient who has never worked in a hospital know these codes?","ar":"هل يعرف هذه الرموز مريض لم يعمل في مستشفى من قبل؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Name each clinic the way patients do.","ar":"سمِّ كل عيادة كما يسمّيها المرضى."},"explain":{"en":"Short codes save space, but only staff can read them. Patients think in body parts and people: skin, ears, pregnancy, children.","ar":"الرموز القصيرة توفّر المساحة، لكن الموظفين وحدهم يستطيعون قراءتها. أما المرضى فيفكرون بأجزاء الجسم وبالناس: الجلد، والأذن، والحمل، والأطفال."},"speaker":"nour"},{"id":"S05","type":"tune","part":"guided","skill":"SK-P02-U01-04","rules":["R06"],"value":{"en":"Match between the system and the real world (NN/g): follow real-world conventions, making information appear in a natural and logical order. People pay after they've chosen, not before.","ar":"التوافق بين النظام والعالم الحقيقي (NN/g): اتبع أعراف العالم الحقيقي، واجعل المعلومات تظهر بترتيب طبيعي ومنطقي. فالناس يدفعون بعد أن يختاروا، لا قبل ذلك."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/ten-usability-heuristics/","quote":"Follow real-world conventions, making information appear in a natural and logical order."},"scenario":{"en":"Our developers built the booking in the order the database needs: payment first, then the time, then the clinic and the doctor.","ar":"بنى المطوّرون عندنا خطوات الحجز بالترتيب الذي تحتاجه قاعدة البيانات: الدفع أولًا، ثم الموعد، ثم العيادة والطبيب."},"prompt":{"en":"Which order should patients go through?","ar":"بأي ترتيب يمرّ المرضى بخطوات الحجز؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Book a visit","ar":"احجز زيارة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"progress","value":25,"label":{"en":"Step 1 of 4: Payment","ar":"الخطوة 1 من 4: الدفع"}},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Pay for your visit","ar":"ادفع ثمن زيارتك"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"listitem","art":"bank-card","text":{"en":"Visa ending 4821","ar":"Visa تنتهي بـ 4821"},"check":true,"gap":"s"},{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"EGP ?","ar":"? جنيه"},"gap":"m","note":{"en":"No clinic or doctor chosen yet","ar":"لم تُختر العيادة ولا الطبيب بعد"}}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Pay and continue","ar":"ادفع وتابع"}}]},"options":[{"id":"db","text":{"en":"Pay → time → clinic and doctor","ar":"الدفع ← الموعد ← العيادة والطبيب"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Book a visit","ar":"احجز زيارة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"progress","value":25,"label":{"en":"Step 1 of 4: Payment","ar":"الخطوة 1 من 4: الدفع"}},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Pay for your visit","ar":"ادفع ثمن زيارتك"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"listitem","art":"bank-card","text":{"en":"Visa ending 4821","ar":"Visa تنتهي بـ 4821"},"check":true,"gap":"s"},{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"EGP ?","ar":"? جنيه"},"gap":"m","note":{"en":"No clinic or doctor chosen yet","ar":"لم تُختر العيادة ولا الطبيب بعد"}}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Pay and continue","ar":"ادفع وتابع"}}]}},{"id":"natural","text":{"en":"Clinic → doctor → time → review → pay","ar":"العيادة ← الطبيب ← الموعد ← المراجعة ← الدفع"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Book a visit","ar":"احجز زيارة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"progress","value":20,"label":{"en":"Step 1 of 5: Clinic","ar":"الخطوة 1 من 5: العيادة"}},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Choose a clinic","ar":"اختر عيادة"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"first-aid-kit","text":{"en":"Skin","ar":"الجلدية"},"sub":{"en":"3 doctors · from EGP 350","ar":"3 أطباء · من 350 جنيه"},"chevron":true,"gap":"s"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"first-aid-kit","text":{"en":"Children","ar":"الأطفال"},"sub":{"en":"3 doctors · from EGP 300","ar":"3 أطباء · من 300 جنيه"},"chevron":true,"gap":"s"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Continue","ar":"تابع"}}]}},{"id":"time","text":{"en":"Time → pay → clinic → doctor","ar":"الموعد ← الدفع ← العيادة ← الطبيب"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Book a visit","ar":"احجز زيارة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"progress","value":25,"label":{"en":"Step 1 of 4: Time","ar":"الخطوة 1 من 4: الموعد"}},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Pick a time","ar":"اختر موعدًا"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"chips","items":[{"text":{"en":"Sun 10 am","ar":"الأحد 10 ص"}},{"text":{"en":"Sun 6 pm","ar":"الأحد 6 م"}},{"text":{"en":"Mon 11 am","ar":"الاثنين 11 ص"}}],"gap":"s"},{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"EGP ?","ar":"? جنيه"},"gap":"m","note":{"en":"No clinic or doctor chosen yet","ar":"لم تُختر العيادة ولا الطبيب بعد"}}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Continue to payment","ar":"تابع إلى الدفع"}}]}}],"answer":["natural"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P02-010","when":["db","time"],"feedback":{"en":"On the phone, patients first say what's wrong or which doctor they want, then agree on a time, and pay last. Asking for money before they know what they're booking feels wrong and makes them stop.","ar":"على الهاتف، يقول المرضى أولًا ما يشكون منه أو أي طبيب يريدون، ثم يتفقون على موعد، ويدفعون في النهاية. وطلب المال قبل أن يعرفوا ما الذي يحجزونه يبدو غريبًا ويجعلهم يتوقفون."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Think of how a booking goes when a patient calls the front desk.","ar":"فكّر في طريقة الحجز حين يتصل المريض بالاستقبال."}],"correct":{"en":"Follow the order of a real booking.","ar":"اتبع ترتيب الحجز الحقيقي."},"explain":{"en":"Patients choose what they need, then when, check it, and pay. The database can save the data in any order behind the scenes.","ar":"يختار المرضى ما يحتاجونه، ثم الموعد، ثم يراجعون، ثم يدفعون. أما قاعدة البيانات فتستطيع حفظ البيانات بأي ترتيب خلف الكواليس."},"speaker":"nour"},{"id":"S06","type":"compare","speaker":"rami","part":"contrast","skill":"SK-P02-U01-04","rules":["R11"],"value":{"en":"Match between the system and the real world (NN/g): people expect elements that stand for familiar things to look like them. Gallery controls restyled as corner tabs are missed; plain arrows are recognised.","ar":"التوافق بين النظام والعالم الحقيقي (NN/g): يتوقع الناس أن تشبه العناصر الأشياء المألوفة التي تمثّلها. وأزرار المعرض التي صُمّمت على شكل زوايا تُفوَّت؛ أما الأسهم العادية فيعرفها الناس."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/match-system-real-world/","quote":"Users expect that UI elements which reflect material objects be similar to those objects from the real world."},"scenario":{"en":"I'm designing a flat rental website. Each flat has a photo gallery. I wanted the controls to feel fresh, so I drew them as small half circles in the bottom corners.","ar":"أصمّم موقعًا لتأجير الشقق. لكل شقة معرض صور. أردت أن تبدو أزرار التنقل جديدة، فرسمتها أنصاف دوائر صغيرة في الزاويتين السفليتين."},"prompt":{"en":"In which version will people find the other photos?","ar":"في أيّ نسخة سيجد الناس باقي الصور؟"},"a":{"label":{"en":"Version A: corner tabs","ar":"النسخة A: أنصاف دوائر في الزاويتين"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"sakan","name":{"en":"Sakan Stays","ar":"سكن"},"color":"#B7791F","icon":"house-line","domain":"sakan.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"sakan.example/maadi/2-bedroom-flat","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Flats","ar":"شقق"},{"en":"Villas","ar":"فيلات"}],"active":0,"actions":[{"icon":"heart"},{"icon":"user"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"hotel-room","size":"l"},{"kind":"row","overlap":true,"blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":"◖"},{"kind":"small","text":"◗"}]},{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"2-bedroom flat, Maadi","ar":"شقة غرفتين، المعادي"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"EGP 1,800","ar":"1,800 جنيه"},"per":{"en":"/ night","ar":"/ لليلة"}}]}},"b":{"label":{"en":"Version B: arrows","ar":"النسخة B: أسهم"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"sakan","name":{"en":"Sakan Stays","ar":"سكن"},"color":"#B7791F","icon":"house-line","domain":"sakan.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"sakan.example/maadi/2-bedroom-flat","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Flats","ar":"شقق"},{"en":"Villas","ar":"فيلات"}],"active":0,"actions":[{"icon":"heart"},{"icon":"user"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"hotel-room","size":"l"},{"kind":"row","overlap":true,"blocks":[{"kind":"iconbtn","icon":"caret-left","aria":{"en":"Previous photo","ar":"الصورة السابقة"}},{"kind":"badge","text":"1 / 8","tone":"neutral"},{"kind":"iconbtn","icon":"caret-right","aria":{"en":"Next photo","ar":"الصورة التالية"}}]},{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"2-bedroom flat, Maadi","ar":"شقة غرفتين، المعادي"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"EGP 1,800","ar":"1,800 جنيه"},"per":{"en":"/ night","ar":"/ لليلة"}}]}},"answer":"b","misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P02-011","when":["a"],"feedback":{"en":"Half circles don't look like arrows or buttons, so many people never try them and think the flat has one photo.","ar":"أنصاف الدوائر لا تشبه الأسهم ولا الأزرار، فلا يجرّبها كثير من الناس، ويظنون أن للشقة صورة واحدة."}}],"correct":{"en":"B: arrows look like arrows.","ar":"B: الأسهم تبدو أسهمًا."},"explain":{"en":"People already know what ‹ and › do, and \"1 / 8\" tells them there are more photos. A fresh look is only worth it if people still recognise the control.","ar":"يعرف الناس أصلًا ما تفعله ‹ و›، و«1 / 8» تخبرهم أن هناك صورًا أخرى. والشكل الجديد لا يفيد إلا إذا ظل الناس يتعرّفون على العنصر."}},{"id":"S07","type":"tune","speaker":"tarek","part":"independent","skill":"SK-P02-U01-03","rules":["R14"],"value":{"en":"Match between the system and the real world (NN/g): people should understand meaning without having to look up a word. Technical security terms mean nothing to most customers; say what it does for them.","ar":"التوافق بين النظام والعالم الحقيقي (NN/g): يجب أن يفهم الناس المعنى دون أن يبحثوا عن معنى الكلمة. فمصطلحات الأمان التقنية لا تعني شيئًا لأغلب العملاء؛ قل ما الذي تفعله لهم."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/match-system-real-world/","quote":"Users should always be able to understand meaning without having to go look up a word"},"scenario":{"en":"In the banking app I manage, the settings screen has a switch called \"Enable 2FA (TOTP)\". Very few customers turn it on.","ar":"في تطبيق البنك الذي أديره، في شاشة الإعدادات Toggle (مفتاح تشغيل) اسمه «فعّل 2FA (TOTP)». وقليل جدًا من العملاء يشغّلونه."},"prompt":{"en":"Which label would help customers understand it?","ar":"أيّ اسم يساعد العملاء على فهمه؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rasid","name":{"en":"Rasid","ar":"رصيد"},"color":"#1C3D6E","icon":"bank","domain":"rasid.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Security","ar":"الأمان"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"fingerprint","text":{"en":"Sign in with fingerprint","ar":"الدخول ببصمة الإصبع"},"toggle":true},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"shield-check","text":{"en":"Enable 2FA (TOTP)","ar":"فعّل 2FA (TOTP)"},"toggle":false,"gap":"s","ring":true},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"devices","text":{"en":"Signed-in devices","ar":"الأجهزة المتصلة بحسابك"},"value":"2","chevron":true,"gap":"s"}]},"options":[{"id":"full","text":{"en":"\"Enable two-factor authentication (TOTP)\"","ar":"«فعّل المصادقة الثنائية (TOTP)»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rasid","name":{"en":"Rasid","ar":"رصيد"},"color":"#1C3D6E","icon":"bank","domain":"rasid.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Security","ar":"الأمان"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"fingerprint","text":{"en":"Sign in with fingerprint","ar":"الدخول ببصمة الإصبع"},"toggle":true},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"shield-check","text":{"en":"Enable two-factor authentication (TOTP)","ar":"فعّل المصادقة الثنائية (TOTP)"},"toggle":false,"gap":"s","ring":true},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"devices","text":{"en":"Signed-in devices","ar":"الأجهزة المتصلة بحسابك"},"value":"2","chevron":true,"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"plain","text":{"en":"\"Ask for a code from my phone when I sign in\"","ar":"«اطلب رمزًا من هاتفي حين أسجّل الدخول»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rasid","name":{"en":"Rasid","ar":"رصيد"},"color":"#1C3D6E","icon":"bank","domain":"rasid.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Security","ar":"الأمان"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"fingerprint","text":{"en":"Sign in with fingerprint","ar":"الدخول ببصمة الإصبع"},"toggle":true},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"shield-check","text":{"en":"Ask for a code from my phone when I sign in","ar":"اطلب رمزًا من هاتفي حين أسجّل الدخول"},"toggle":false,"gap":"s","ring":true},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"devices","text":{"en":"Signed-in devices","ar":"الأجهزة المتصلة بحسابك"},"value":"2","chevron":true,"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"secure","text":{"en":"\"Advanced security mode\"","ar":"«وضع الأمان المتقدّم»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rasid","name":{"en":"Rasid","ar":"رصيد"},"color":"#1C3D6E","icon":"bank","domain":"rasid.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Security","ar":"الأمان"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"fingerprint","text":{"en":"Sign in with fingerprint","ar":"الدخول ببصمة الإصبع"},"toggle":true},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"shield-check","text":{"en":"Advanced security mode","ar":"وضع الأمان المتقدّم"},"toggle":false,"gap":"s","ring":true},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"devices","text":{"en":"Signed-in devices","ar":"الأجهزة المتصلة بحسابك"},"value":"2","chevron":true,"gap":"s"}]}}],"answer":["plain"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P02-009","when":["full"],"feedback":{"en":"Spelling out the abbreviation only gives customers a longer technical term. They still don't know what will happen when they turn it on.","ar":"كتابة الاختصار كاملًا تعطي العملاء مصطلحًا تقنيًا أطول فقط. وما زالوا لا يعرفون ما الذي سيحدث حين يشغّلونه."}},{"id":"MC-P02-007","when":["secure"],"feedback":{"en":"\"Advanced\" sounds like it's for experts, and it doesn't say what changes. Customers will leave it off.","ar":"كلمة «متقدّم» توحي بأنه للخبراء، ولا تقول ما الذي سيتغيّر. فسيتركه العملاء مطفأً."}}],"hints":[{"en":"What will customers actually notice once the switch is on?","ar":"ما الذي سيلاحظه العملاء فعلًا بعد تشغيل الـ Toggle؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Describe what it does, in everyday words.","ar":"صِف ما يفعله، بكلمات يومية."},"explain":{"en":"Customers don't need the name of the method. \"A code from my phone when I sign in\" tells them exactly what to expect, in words they already use.","ar":"لا يحتاج العملاء إلى اسم الطريقة. و«رمز من هاتفي حين أسجّل الدخول» تخبرهم بالضبط بما يتوقعونه، بكلمات يستخدمونها أصلًا."}},{"id":"S08","type":"card","part":"recap","icons":["text","person","order"],"title":{"en":"What you practised","ar":"ما تدرّبت عليه"},"body":{"en":"- **Use your users' words,** not staff terms, technical names or codes.\n- **Your logic isn't theirs:** find out how they picture the task before you organize it.\n- **Follow the order and look they know:** steps in the order of the real task, and familiar controls that still look familiar.\n\nNext: the skill check for this unit.","ar":"- **استخدم كلمات مستخدميك،** لا مصطلحات الموظفين ولا الأسماء التقنية ولا الرموز.\n- **منطقك ليس منطقهم:** اعرف كيف يتصورون المهمة قبل أن ترتّبها.\n- **اتبع الترتيب والشكل اللذين يعرفونهما:** خطوات بترتيب المهمة الحقيقية، وعناصر تحافظ على شكلها المألوف.\n\nالتالي: اختبار المهارة لهذه الوحدة."}}]}$uxg$::jsonb),
  ($uxg$P02-U01-L03$uxg$, $uxg$d46f01e7e7f16c2e4e9b365298714dbbfc496d513e4cf8a02974b672f3db7b2c$uxg$, $uxg${"id":"P02-U01-L03","mode":"check","minutes":6,"title":{"en":"Skill check: keep people informed, in their words","ar":"اختبار المهارة: أخبِر الناس بما يحدث، بكلماتهم"},"speaker":"youssef","steps":[{"id":"S01","type":"card","part":"hook","title":{"en":"Youssef's online shop","ar":"متجر يوسف الإلكتروني"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"dar.example","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Tools","ar":"أدوات"},{"en":"Kitchen","ar":"المطبخ"},{"en":"Offers","ar":"العروض"}],"active":0,"search":{"en":"Search Dar","ar":"ابحث في دار"},"actions":[{"icon":"shopping-cart","count":1},{"icon":"user"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Everything for your home","ar":"كل ما يحتاجه بيتك"}},{"kind":"row","gap":"m","blocks":[{"kind":"card","art":"washing-machine","blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Washers","ar":"غسالات"}}]},{"kind":"card","art":"fridge","blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Fridges","ar":"ثلاجات"}}]},{"kind":"card","art":"box","blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Tools","ar":"أدوات"}}]}]}]},"body":{"en":"I sell home tools online, and my customers keep calling me with the same questions. Help me find what my site does wrong in four places.\n\nThis is a skill check: no hints, and you'll see how you did at the end.","ar":"أبيع أدوات منزلية عبر الإنترنت، وعملائي يتصلون بي دائمًا بالأسئلة نفسها. ساعدني على اكتشاف أخطاء موقعي في أربعة مواضع.\n\nهذا اختبار مهارة: دون تلميحات، وسترى نتيجتك في النهاية."}},{"id":"S02","type":"tune","part":"check","skill":"SK-P02-U01-01","value":{"en":"Check, visibility of system status (NN/g): present feedback as quickly as possible. During a six-second card payment, people need to see that it's in progress, or they tap again or leave.","ar":"اختبار، ظهور حالة النظام (NN/g): قدّم الردّ بأسرع ما يمكن. فخلال دفع بالبطاقة يستغرق ست ثوانٍ، يحتاج الناس أن يروا أنه جارٍ، وإلا ضغطوا مرة أخرى أو غادروا."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/ten-usability-heuristics/","quote":"Present feedback to the user as quickly as possible (ideally, immediately)."},"scenario":{"en":"When customers tap **Pay**, the bank takes about six seconds to confirm the card. Meanwhile the page doesn't change. Some customers get charged twice.","ar":"حين يضغط العملاء **ادفع**، يستغرق البنك نحو ست ثوانٍ ليؤكد البطاقة. وخلال ذلك لا تتغيّر الصفحة. وبعض العملاء يُخصم منهم المبلغ مرتين."},"prompt":{"en":"What should happen right after the tap?","ar":"ماذا يجب أن يحدث بعد الضغطة مباشرة؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"dar.example/checkout/pay","blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Payment","ar":"الدفع"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Card number","ar":"رقم البطاقة"},"text":"4921 •••• •••• 7710","filled":true,"icon":"credit-card","gap":"m"},{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"Total EGP 3,450","ar":"الإجمالي 3,450 جنيه"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Pay","ar":"ادفع"},"gap":"m","note":{"en":"6 s after the tap, nothing changed","ar":"بعد الضغط بـ 6 ثوانٍ، لم يتغيّر شيء"}}]},"options":[{"id":"confirm","text":{"en":"Ask \"Are you sure you want to pay?\" first","ar":"أسأل أولًا: «هل أنت متأكد أنك تريد الدفع؟»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"dar.example/checkout/pay","blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Payment","ar":"الدفع"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Card number","ar":"رقم البطاقة"},"text":"4921 •••• •••• 7710","filled":true,"icon":"credit-card","gap":"m"},{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"Total EGP 3,450","ar":"الإجمالي 3,450 جنيه"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Pay","ar":"ادفع"},"gap":"m"}],"overlay":{"type":"dialog","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Are you sure you want to pay?","ar":"هل أنت متأكد أنك تريد الدفع؟"}},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"EGP 3,450","ar":"3,450 جنيه"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Pay","ar":"ادفع"},"gap":"m","note":{"en":"After this tap: 6 s with no change","ar":"بعد هذه الضغطة: 6 ثوانٍ دون أي تغيير"}},{"kind":"button","style":"text","text":{"en":"Cancel","ar":"إلغاء"},"gap":"s"}]}}},{"id":"progress","text":{"en":"Disable the button and show \"Confirming with your bank…\" with a spinner","ar":"أعطّل الزر وأعرض «جارٍ التأكيد مع البنك…» مع مؤشر دوّار"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"dar.example/checkout/pay","blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Payment","ar":"الدفع"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Card number","ar":"رقم البطاقة"},"text":"4921 •••• •••• 7710","filled":true,"icon":"credit-card","gap":"m"},{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"Total EGP 3,450","ar":"الإجمالي 3,450 جنيه"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"button","icon":"spinner-gap","tone":"off","text":{"en":"Confirming with your bank…","ar":"جارٍ التأكيد مع البنك…"},"gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"wait","text":{"en":"Nothing, until the order confirmation page loads","ar":"لا شيء، حتى تظهر صفحة تأكيد الطلب"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"dar.example/checkout/pay","blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Payment","ar":"الدفع"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Card number","ar":"رقم البطاقة"},"text":"4921 •••• •••• 7710","filled":true,"icon":"credit-card","gap":"m"},{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"Total EGP 3,450","ar":"الإجمالي 3,450 جنيه"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Pay","ar":"ادفع"},"gap":"m","note":{"en":"6 s after the tap, nothing changed","ar":"بعد الضغط بـ 6 ثوانٍ، لم يتغيّر شيء"}}]}}],"answer":["progress"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P02-002","when":["wait"],"feedback":{"en":"Six still seconds is exactly what makes customers think the tap failed and tap again.","ar":"ست ثوانٍ لا يتغيّر فيها شيء هي بالضبط ما يجعل العملاء يظنون أن الضغطة فشلت فيضغطون مرة أخرى."}},{"id":"MC-P02-001","when":["confirm"],"feedback":{"en":"A question before paying adds a step, but after it the page still sits still for six seconds.","ar":"السؤال قبل الدفع يضيف خطوة، لكن الصفحة بعده تبقى ست ثوانٍ دون أي تغيير."}}],"correct":{"en":"Show at once that the payment is in progress.","ar":"أظهِر فورًا أن الدفع جارٍ."},"explain":{"en":"The spinner and the words say the tap worked and what the shop is waiting for. Disabling the button removes the reason, and the chance, to pay twice.","ar":"المؤشر الدوّار والكلمات يقولان إن الضغطة وصلت، وما الذي ينتظره المتجر. وتعطيل الزر يمنع الدفع مرتين، فلا يبقى سبب ولا فرصة لذلك."},"speaker":"youssef"},{"id":"S03","type":"tune","part":"check","skill":"SK-P02-U01-02","value":{"en":"Check, visibility of system status (NN/g): clearly tell people what the system's state is. A delay the shop knows about must show on the order, with the new time.","ar":"اختبار، ظهور حالة النظام (NN/g): أخبِر الناس بوضوح بحالة النظام. والتأخير الذي يعرفه المتجر يجب أن يظهر على الطلب، مع الموعد الجديد."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/visibility-system-status/","quote":"Sites and apps should clearly communicate to users what the system"},"scenario":{"en":"The courier company told me Ahmed's order will arrive tomorrow instead of today. His order page still says \"Arriving today\".","ar":"أخبرتني شركة الشحن أن طلب أحمد سيصل غدًا بدل اليوم. وصفحة طلبه ما زالت تقول «يصل اليوم»."},"prompt":{"en":"What should I do?","ar":"ماذا أفعل ليعرف أحمد أن طلبه تأخّر؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Order #48213","ar":"الطلب ‎#48213"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","art":"box","text":{"en":"Electric drill · Kettle","ar":"مثقاب كهربائي · غلاية"},"sub":{"en":"2 items · EGP 2,140","ar":"منتجان · 2,140 جنيه"}},{"kind":"badge","text":{"en":"Arriving today","ar":"يصل اليوم"},"tone":"good","icon":"truck","gap":"m"},{"kind":"progress","value":75,"label":{"en":"Out for delivery","ar":"خرج للتوصيل"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"The courier's update: arriving tomorrow.","ar":"تحديث شركة الشحن: يصل غدًا."},"tone":"faint","gap":"m","note":{"en":"Known to the shop, not shown","ar":"يعرفه المتجر، ولا يظهر"}}]},"options":[{"id":"keep","text":{"en":"Leave it; he'll get the order tomorrow anyway","ar":"أترك الصفحة كما هي؛ فسيستلم الطلب غدًا على أي حال"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Order #48213","ar":"الطلب ‎#48213"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","art":"box","text":{"en":"Electric drill · Kettle","ar":"مثقاب كهربائي · غلاية"},"sub":{"en":"2 items · EGP 2,140","ar":"منتجان · 2,140 جنيه"}},{"kind":"badge","text":{"en":"Arriving today","ar":"يصل اليوم"},"tone":"good","icon":"truck","gap":"m"},{"kind":"progress","value":75,"label":{"en":"Out for delivery","ar":"خرج للتوصيل"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"The courier's update: arriving tomorrow.","ar":"تحديث شركة الشحن: يصل غدًا."},"tone":"faint","gap":"m","note":{"en":"Known to the shop, not shown","ar":"يعرفه المتجر، ولا يظهر"}}]}},{"id":"email","text":{"en":"Send a newsletter saying deliveries may be slower this week","ar":"أرسل نشرة بريدية تقول إن التوصيل قد يكون أبطأ هذا الأسبوع"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Order #48213","ar":"الطلب ‎#48213"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","art":"box","text":{"en":"Electric drill · Kettle","ar":"مثقاب كهربائي · غلاية"},"sub":{"en":"2 items · EGP 2,140","ar":"منتجان · 2,140 جنيه"}},{"kind":"badge","text":{"en":"Arriving today","ar":"يصل اليوم"},"tone":"good","icon":"truck","gap":"m"},{"kind":"progress","value":75,"label":{"en":"Out for delivery","ar":"خرج للتوصيل"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"The courier's update: arriving tomorrow.","ar":"تحديث شركة الشحن: يصل غدًا."},"tone":"faint","gap":"m","note":{"en":"Only a newsletter: \"Deliveries may be slower this week\"","ar":"نشرة بريدية فقط: «قد يكون التوصيل أبطأ هذا الأسبوع»"}}]}},{"id":"update","text":{"en":"Change the order to \"Delayed: arriving tomorrow by 2 pm\", and send him a message with the reason","ar":"أغيّر الطلب إلى «تأخّر: يصل غدًا قبل 2 ظهرًا»، وأرسل له رسالة بالسبب"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Order #48213","ar":"الطلب ‎#48213"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","art":"box","text":{"en":"Electric drill · Kettle","ar":"مثقاب كهربائي · غلاية"},"sub":{"en":"2 items · EGP 2,140","ar":"منتجان · 2,140 جنيه"}},{"kind":"badge","text":{"en":"Delayed: arriving tomorrow by 2 pm","ar":"تأخّر: يصل غدًا قبل 2 ظهرًا"},"tone":"warn","icon":"clock","gap":"m"},{"kind":"progress","value":75,"label":{"en":"Out for delivery","ar":"خرج للتوصيل"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"small","icon":"chat-text","gap":"m","text":{"en":"Message sent to Ahmed: the courier moved his delivery to tomorrow.","ar":"أُرسلت رسالة إلى أحمد: نقلت شركة الشحن توصيل طلبه إلى الغد."}}]}}],"answer":["update"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P02-004","when":["keep"],"feedback":{"en":"Ahmed will stay home waiting today, then call to ask where his order is.","ar":"سيبقى أحمد في البيت ينتظر اليوم، ثم يتصل ليسأل أين طلبه."}},{"id":"MC-P02-005","when":["email"],"feedback":{"en":"A general note doesn't tell Ahmed that his own order is late, or when it will come.","ar":"الملاحظة العامة لا تخبر أحمد أن طلبه هو الذي تأخّر، ولا متى سيصل."}}],"correct":{"en":"Show the change on his order, with the new time.","ar":"أظهِر التغيير على طلبه، مع الموعد الجديد."},"explain":{"en":"The order page is where Ahmed checks, so it must say what's true now. The message reaches him even if he doesn't open the app.","ar":"صفحة الطلب هي المكان الذي يراجعه أحمد، فيجب أن تعرض الموعد الصحيح الآن. والرسالة تصل إليه حتى لو لم يفتح التطبيق."},"speaker":"youssef"},{"id":"S04","type":"tune","part":"check","skill":"SK-P02-U01-03","value":{"en":"Check, match between the system and the real world (NN/g): the design should speak the users' language. Warehouse codes mean nothing to shoppers.","ar":"اختبار، التوافق بين النظام والعالم الحقيقي (NN/g): يجب أن يتكلم التصميم بلغة المستخدمين. ورموز المخازن لا تعني شيئًا للمشترين."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/ten-usability-heuristics/","quote":"The design should speak the users' language."},"scenario":{"en":"My product pages show stock as **SKU status: WH-1 available**. My team set it up that way.","ar":"صفحات المنتجات عندي تعرض المخزون هكذا: **حالة الـ SKU: متاح في WH-1**. فريقي أعدّها بهذه الطريقة."},"prompt":{"en":"What should customers see?","ar":"ماذا يرى العملاء ليعرفوا إن كان المنتج متوفرًا؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"dar.example/tools/electric-drill-650w","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Tools","ar":"أدوات"},{"en":"Kitchen","ar":"المطبخ"}],"active":0,"actions":[{"icon":"shopping-cart"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"box","size":"m"},{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Electric drill 650 W","ar":"مثقاب كهربائي 650 وات"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"EGP 1,250","ar":"1,250 جنيه"}},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"SKU status: WH-1 available","ar":"حالة الـ SKU: متاح في WH-1"},"gap":"s","ring":true},{"kind":"button","icon":"shopping-cart","text":{"en":"Add to cart","ar":"أضف إلى السلة"},"gap":"m"}]},"options":[{"id":"plain","text":{"en":"\"In stock: delivered within 2 days\"","ar":"«متوفّر: يصل خلال يومين»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"dar.example/tools/electric-drill-650w","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Tools","ar":"أدوات"},{"en":"Kitchen","ar":"المطبخ"}],"active":0,"actions":[{"icon":"shopping-cart"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"box","size":"m"},{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Electric drill 650 W","ar":"مثقاب كهربائي 650 وات"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"EGP 1,250","ar":"1,250 جنيه"}},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"In stock: delivered within 2 days","ar":"متوفّر: يصل خلال يومين"},"gap":"s","ring":true},{"kind":"button","icon":"shopping-cart","text":{"en":"Add to cart","ar":"أضف إلى السلة"},"gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"tip","text":{"en":"The same text, with ⓘ explaining SKU and WH-1","ar":"النص نفسه، مع أيقونة ⓘ تشرح الـ SKU والـ WH-1"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"dar.example/tools/electric-drill-650w","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Tools","ar":"أدوات"},{"en":"Kitchen","ar":"المطبخ"}],"active":0,"actions":[{"icon":"shopping-cart"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"box","size":"m"},{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Electric drill 650 W","ar":"مثقاب كهربائي 650 وات"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"EGP 1,250","ar":"1,250 جنيه"}},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"SKU status: WH-1 available","ar":"حالة الـ SKU: متاح في WH-1"},"gap":"s","ring":true,"icon":"info","note":{"en":"ⓘ SKU = product code · WH-1 = warehouse 1","ar":"ⓘ الـ SKU = رمز المنتج · WH-1 = المخزن 1"}},{"kind":"button","icon":"shopping-cart","text":{"en":"Add to cart","ar":"أضف إلى السلة"},"gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"code","text":{"en":"\"Available (warehouse 1)\"","ar":"«متاح (المخزن 1)»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"dar.example/tools/electric-drill-650w","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Tools","ar":"أدوات"},{"en":"Kitchen","ar":"المطبخ"}],"active":0,"actions":[{"icon":"shopping-cart"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"box","size":"m"},{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Electric drill 650 W","ar":"مثقاب كهربائي 650 وات"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"EGP 1,250","ar":"1,250 جنيه"}},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Available (warehouse 1)","ar":"متاح (المخزن 1)"},"gap":"s","ring":true},{"kind":"button","icon":"shopping-cart","text":{"en":"Add to cart","ar":"أضف إلى السلة"},"gap":"m"}]}}],"answer":["plain"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P02-008","when":["tip"],"feedback":{"en":"Customers would have to open an explanation to learn whether they can buy the product. Say it plainly instead.","ar":"سيضطر العملاء إلى فتح شرح ليعرفوا إن كانوا يستطيعون شراء المنتج. قل ذلك بوضوح بدلًا من ذلك."}},{"id":"MC-P02-007","when":["code"],"feedback":{"en":"Which warehouse holds the item is our business. Customers want to know if they can have it, and when.","ar":"أي مخزن فيه المنتج شأننا نحن. أما العملاء فيريدون أن يعرفوا إن كانوا يستطيعون الحصول عليه، ومتى."}}],"correct":{"en":"Say what it means for the customer.","ar":"قل ما يعنيه ذلك للعميل."},"explain":{"en":"\"In stock\" and a delivery time answer the two things a shopper asks. The codes can stay in the team's own system.","ar":"«متوفّر» وموعد التوصيل يجيبان السؤالين اللذين يسألهما المشتري. ويمكن أن تبقى الرموز في نظام الفريق نفسه."},"speaker":"youssef"},{"id":"S05","type":"tune","part":"check","skill":"SK-P02-U01-04","value":{"en":"Check, match between the system and the real world (NN/g): people build mental models from their experience. Shoppers look for a tool by what it does, not by which supplier sold it to the shop.","ar":"اختبار، التوافق بين النظام والعالم الحقيقي (NN/g): يبني الناس نماذجهم الذهنية من خبرتهم. فالمشتري يبحث عن الأداة بما تفعله، لا بالمورّد الذي باعها للمتجر."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/match-system-real-world/","quote":"people build mental models or theories of how a system works based on their past experiences with real-world objects"},"scenario":{"en":"My shop's menu is grouped by the suppliers I buy from: \"Al-Nour Trading\", \"Delta Imports\", \"Cairo Tools Co.\". It's how I organize my own stock.","ar":"قائمة متجري مقسّمة حسب الموردين الذين أشتري منهم: «النور للتجارة» و«دلتا للاستيراد» و«القاهرة للأدوات». وهي الطريقة التي أنظّم بها مخزوني."},"prompt":{"en":"How should the menu be grouped?","ar":"كيف أقسّم القائمة ليجد العملاء ما يحتاجونه؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"dar.example","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Al-Nour Trading","ar":"النور للتجارة"},{"en":"Delta Imports","ar":"دلتا للاستيراد"},{"en":"Cairo Tools Co.","ar":"القاهرة للأدوات"}],"active":0,"actions":[{"icon":"shopping-cart"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Al-Nour Trading","ar":"النور للتجارة"}},{"kind":"row","gap":"m","blocks":[{"kind":"card","art":"box","blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Paint roller","ar":"رولة دهان"}},{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"EGP 120","ar":"120 جنيه"}}]},{"kind":"card","art":"box","blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Pipe wrench","ar":"مفتاح مواسير"}},{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"EGP 210","ar":"210 جنيه"}}]},{"kind":"card","art":"box","blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Garden hose","ar":"خرطوم حديقة"}},{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"EGP 340","ar":"340 جنيه"}}]}]}]},"options":[{"id":"supplier","text":{"en":"Keep the suppliers; they're my real categories","ar":"تبقى أسماء الموردين؛ فهي أقسامي الحقيقية"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"dar.example","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Al-Nour Trading","ar":"النور للتجارة"},{"en":"Delta Imports","ar":"دلتا للاستيراد"},{"en":"Cairo Tools Co.","ar":"القاهرة للأدوات"}],"active":0,"actions":[{"icon":"shopping-cart"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Al-Nour Trading","ar":"النور للتجارة"}},{"kind":"row","gap":"m","blocks":[{"kind":"card","art":"box","blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Paint roller","ar":"رولة دهان"}},{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"EGP 120","ar":"120 جنيه"}}]},{"kind":"card","art":"box","blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Pipe wrench","ar":"مفتاح مواسير"}},{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"EGP 210","ar":"210 جنيه"}}]},{"kind":"card","art":"box","blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Garden hose","ar":"خرطوم حديقة"}},{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"EGP 340","ar":"340 جنيه"}}]}]}]}},{"id":"task","text":{"en":"By job: Painting, Plumbing, Electrical, Garden","ar":"حسب العمل: الدهان، والسباكة، والكهرباء، والحديقة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"dar.example","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Painting","ar":"الدهان"},{"en":"Plumbing","ar":"السباكة"},{"en":"Electrical","ar":"الكهرباء"},{"en":"Garden","ar":"الحديقة"}],"active":0,"actions":[{"icon":"shopping-cart"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Painting","ar":"الدهان"}},{"kind":"row","gap":"m","blocks":[{"kind":"card","art":"box","blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Paint roller","ar":"رولة دهان"}},{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"EGP 120","ar":"120 جنيه"}}]},{"kind":"card","art":"box","blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Brush set","ar":"طقم فُرش"}},{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"EGP 85","ar":"85 جنيه"}}]},{"kind":"card","art":"box","blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Wall paint, 4 L","ar":"دهان حوائط، 4 لتر"}},{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"EGP 450","ar":"450 جنيه"}}]}]}]}},{"id":"abc","text":{"en":"One long list of every product, A to Z","ar":"قائمة طويلة واحدة بكل المنتجات، أبجديًا"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"dar.example","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"All products","ar":"كل المنتجات"}],"active":0,"actions":[{"icon":"shopping-cart"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"All products, A to Z","ar":"كل المنتجات، أبجديًا"}},{"kind":"row","gap":"m","blocks":[{"kind":"card","art":"box","blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Adhesive tape","ar":"أربطة أسلاك"}},{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"EGP 25","ar":"40 جنيه"}}]},{"kind":"card","art":"box","blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Bath tap","ar":"خلاط حمّام"}},{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"EGP 380","ar":"380 جنيه"}}]},{"kind":"card","art":"box","blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Cable ties","ar":"شريط لاصق"}},{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"EGP 40","ar":"25 جنيه"}}]}]},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","gap":"s","text":{"en":"…and 412 more products","ar":"…و412 منتجًا آخر"}}]}}],"answer":["task"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P02-010","when":["supplier"],"feedback":{"en":"Customers don't know who supplies my shop. Someone with a leaking tap has to open every supplier to find a wrench.","ar":"العملاء لا يعرفون من يورّد لمتجري. ومن عنده صنبور يسرّب عليه أن يفتح كل مورّد ليجد مفتاحًا."}},{"id":"MC-P02-010","when":["abc"],"feedback":{"en":"A to Z only helps if people know each product's exact name. Most people start from the job they need to do.","ar":"الترتيب الأبجدي لا يساعد إلا إذا عرف الناس الاسم الدقيق لكل منتج. وأغلب الناس يبدؤون من العمل الذي يحتاجون إنجازه."}}],"correct":{"en":"Group by how customers think about the task.","ar":"قسّم حسب طريقة تفكير العملاء في المهمة."},"explain":{"en":"Shoppers arrive with a job in mind, like fixing a tap or painting a room. Grouping by that job matches the picture already in their heads.","ar":"يأتي المشترون وفي أذهانهم عمل محدد، مثل إصلاح صنبور أو دهان غرفة. والتقسيم حسب هذا العمل يطابق الصورة الموجودة أصلًا في أذهانهم."},"speaker":"youssef"}]}$uxg$::jsonb),
  ($uxg$P02-U02-L01$uxg$, $uxg$56222f0f5178baf24df41d3347191d87dfe7e0be19fde23f8165b5d284ac758b$uxg$, $uxg${"id":"P02-U02-L01","mode":"lesson","minutes":8,"title":{"en":"Give people a way out","ar":"أعطِ الناس مخرجًا"},"speaker":"mona","review_labels":{"MC-P02-012":{"en":"Back should go back one step","ar":"يجب أن يعيد «رجوع» خطوة واحدة"},"MC-P02-013":{"en":"A hidden exit isn't an exit","ar":"المخرج المخفي ليس مخرجًا"},"MC-P02-014":{"en":"An undo people can't catch doesn't help","ar":"التراجع الذي يختفي قبل أن يلحقه الناس لا يفيد"},"MC-P02-015":{"en":"Asking every time is not the same as undo","ar":"السؤال في كل مرة لا يُغني عن التراجع (Undo)"}},"steps":[{"id":"S01","type":"card","part":"hook","title":{"en":"Thirty photos, gone","ar":"ضاعت ثلاثون صورة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"taba","name":{"en":"Tab'a","ar":"طبعة"},"color":"#D6336C","icon":"printer","domain":"tab-a.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Your prints · 30 photos","ar":"صورك للطباعة · 30 صورة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"row","blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"photo","size":"s"},{"kind":"image","art":"beach","size":"s"},{"kind":"image","art":"family","size":"s"}]},{"kind":"row","gap":"xs","blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"city-night","size":"s"},{"kind":"image","art":"desert","size":"s"},{"kind":"image","art":"people","size":"s"}]},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"10 × 15 cm · glossy · EGP 240","ar":"10 × 15 سم · لامع · 240 جنيه"},"gap":"m"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Continue to checkout","ar":"تابع إلى الدفع"}}],"overlay":{"type":"full","close":true,"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"beach","size":"xl","note":{"en":"Phone Back from here goes to Home","ar":"زر الرجوع في الهاتف من هنا يذهب إلى الرئيسية"}}]}},"body":{"en":"My team makes a photo printing app. Salma picked 30 photos to print, then opened one to look at it full screen.\n\nTo leave the photo, she pressed her phone's Back button. The app took her all the way to the home screen, and her 30 picks were gone.","ar":"يصنع فريقي تطبيقًا لطباعة الصور. اختارت سلمى 30 صورة لتطبعها، ثم فتحت واحدة لتراها بملء الشاشة.\n\nولكي تخرج من الصورة، ضغطت زر الرجوع في هاتفها. فأخذها التطبيق إلى الشاشة الرئيسية مباشرة، وضاعت اختياراتها الثلاثون."}},{"id":"S02","type":"tune","part":"try","skill":"SK-P02-U02-02","rules":["R12"],"confidence":true,"value":{"en":"Try first. User control and freedom (NN/g): people often take a full-screen overlay for a new page and press Back to leave it. Back should then do what Close does: one step back.","ar":"جرّب أولًا. تحكّم المستخدم وحريته (NN/g): كثيرًا ما يظن الناس أن النافذة التي تملأ الشاشة صفحة جديدة، فيضغطون «رجوع» ليخرجوا منها. وحينها يجب أن يفعل «رجوع» ما يفعله «إغلاق»: خطوة واحدة إلى الوراء."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/user-control-and-freedom/","quote":"ensure the Back button has the same effect as a Close link."},"prompt":{"en":"What should happen when Salma presses Back on the full-screen photo?","ar":"ماذا يجب أن يحدث حين تضغط سلمى «رجوع» وهي على الصورة بملء الشاشة؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"taba","name":{"en":"Tab'a","ar":"طبعة"},"color":"#D6336C","icon":"printer","domain":"tab-a.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Photo 7 of 30","ar":"الصورة 7 من 30"}},"theme":"dark","blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"beach","size":"xl"},{"kind":"row","gap":"m","blocks":[{"kind":"iconbtn","icon":"x","aria":{"en":"Close","ar":"إغلاق"}},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Phone Back pressed","ar":"ضغطت زر الرجوع في الهاتف"}}]}]},"options":[{"id":"warn","text":{"en":"Keep going home, but first ask \"Leave and lose your selection?\"","ar":"يذهب إلى الرئيسية كما هو، لكن بعد سؤال: «هل تغادر وتفقد اختياراتك؟»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"taba","name":{"en":"Tab'a","ar":"طبعة"},"color":"#D6336C","icon":"printer","domain":"tab-a.example"},"theme":"dark","appbar":{"title":{"en":"Photo 7 of 30","ar":"الصورة 7 من 30"}},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"beach","size":"xl"},{"kind":"row","gap":"m","blocks":[{"kind":"iconbtn","icon":"x","aria":{"en":"Close","ar":"إغلاق"}},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Phone Back pressed","ar":"ضغطت زر الرجوع في الهاتف"}}]}],"overlay":{"type":"dialog","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Leave and lose your selection?","ar":"هل تغادر وتفقد اختياراتك؟"}},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Your 30 picks will be lost.","ar":"ستضيع الصور الثلاثون التي اخترتها."},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","style":"danger","text":{"en":"Leave","ar":"غادر"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"button","style":"text","text":{"en":"Stay","ar":"ابقَ"},"gap":"s"}]}}},{"id":"close","text":{"en":"Close the photo and return to her 30 picks, as the ✕ does","ar":"يغلق الصورة ويعيدها إلى اختياراتها الثلاثين، كما يفعل ✕"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"taba","name":{"en":"Tab'a","ar":"طبعة"},"color":"#D6336C","icon":"printer","domain":"tab-a.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Your picks · 30","ar":"اختياراتك · 30"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"row","blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"beach","size":"s"},{"kind":"image","art":"photo","size":"s"},{"kind":"image","art":"cafe","size":"s"}],"note":{"en":"Phone Back closed the photo","ar":"زر الرجوع أغلق الصورة"}},{"kind":"row","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"family","size":"s"},{"kind":"image","art":"desert","size":"s"},{"kind":"image","art":"city-night","size":"s"}]}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Continue with 30 photos","ar":"تابع بـ 30 صورة"}}]}},{"id":"bigger","text":{"en":"Make the ✕ bigger so she uses it instead","ar":"يكبّر زر ✕ لتستخدمه بدلًا من «رجوع»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"taba","name":{"en":"Tab'a","ar":"طبعة"},"color":"#D6336C","icon":"printer","domain":"tab-a.example"},"theme":"dark","appbar":{"title":{"en":"Photo 7 of 30","ar":"الصورة 7 من 30"}},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"beach","size":"xl"},{"kind":"row","gap":"m","blocks":[{"kind":"icon","icon":"x-circle","size":"xl","color":"ink"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Phone Back still goes home","ar":"زر الرجوع ما زال يذهب إلى الرئيسية"}}]}]}}],"answer":["close"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P02-012","when":["warn","bigger"],"feedback":{"en":"Salma didn't want to leave the order. She only wanted to stop looking at one photo. Back should take her one step back, to where she came from.","ar":"لم تُرد سلمى أن تترك الطلب. أرادت فقط أن تتوقف عن النظر إلى صورة واحدة. ويجب أن يعيدها «رجوع» خطوة واحدة، إلى المكان الذي جاءت منه."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Where was Salma just before she opened the photo?","ar":"أين كانت سلمى قبل أن تفتح الصورة مباشرة؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Back goes back one step: to her picks.","ar":"«رجوع» يعيد خطوة واحدة: إلى اختياراتها."},"explain":{"en":"To Salma, the full-screen photo looks like a new page, so Back is the natural way out. Making Back act like Close returns her exactly where she expects, with nothing lost.","ar":"تبدو الصورة بملء الشاشة لسلمى كأنها صفحة جديدة، فيكون «رجوع» هو المخرج الطبيعي. وحين يعمل «رجوع» مثل «إغلاق»، يعيدها إلى حيث تتوقع بالضبط، دون أن تفقد شيئًا."}},{"id":"S09","type":"video","part":"concept","title":{"en":"User control and freedom","ar":"تحكّم المستخدم وحريته (User control and freedom)"},"video":"f0c82de8-03c9-46aa-af25-3cc102c55ba8","duration":116,"transcript":[{"t":2.5,"en":"Take Wayfair here: when you tap Reviews, a page opens with the review details.","ar":"مثال Wayfair هنا: لما بتضغط على الـ Reviews، بيفتح لك صفحة فيها تفاصيل الـ Reviews."},{"t":10.5,"en":"Your first step was opening the website's home page, then you went to the chair, opened the product you liked, and then opened the reviews.","ar":"طبعًا إنت هنا أول خطوة كانت إنك فاتح الـ Home page بتاع الـ Website، وبعدين دخلت على الكرسي، فتحت المنتج اللي إنت مهتم بيه، وبعد كده فتحت الـ Reviews."},{"t":22.5,"en":"This is a good example. Why? Because when he pressed Back, it took him back to the product he was on.","ar":"هنا مثال جيد، ليه؟ لأنه لما داس Back رجّعه على المنتج اللي كان فيه."},{"t":28.5,"en":"Other apps don't do this. They fall into the problem that pressing Back takes you all the way to the first page, the home page.","ar":"تطبيقات تانية مش بتعمل ده، بتقع في المشكلة إنها لما بيدوس Back بترجّعه لأول صفحة خالص، وهي الـ Home page."},{"t":36.5,"en":"And that's your job as a designer: make everything clear, so users know exactly where a tap will take them, even Back.","ar":"ودي من مسؤولياتك كديزاينر: إنك تخلّي كل حاجة واضحة، والمستخدم عارف لما هيضغط هنا هيروح فين بالظبط، حتى الـ Back."},{"t":48.5,"en":"People are always used to Back taking them just one step back, so don't make that mistake,","ar":"الـ Back، الناس أو المستخدمين دايمًا متعوّدين إنها بترجّعهم خطوة واحدة بس، فإنت ما تقعش في الغلطة دي،"},{"t":56.5,"en":"because it also hurts user control. User control isn't just giving people an exit; it's an exit to the place they expect,","ar":"لأنها برضو بتأثّر على الـ User control. الـ User control مش بس إني أدّيله مخرج، أنا أدّيله مخرج للمكان اللي هو متوقّع يخرج له،"},{"t":66.5,"en":"not a Back button that takes them three steps back.","ar":"مش أدّيله زرار Back يرجّعه تلات خطوات."},{"t":70.5,"en":"Here's an example that didn't get user control and freedom right. The user is looking for suitable flights,","ar":"ده مثلًا من ضمن الأمثلة اللي ما حقّقتش الـ User control and freedom بشكل جيد. هنا المستخدم بيشوف Flights أو رحلات طيران مناسبة له،"},{"t":80.5,"en":"searching and choosing a trip, and starts seeing the available flights. When they go further in and start booking,","ar":"بيدوّر وبيحدّد هو إيه الرحلة، وبيبدأ يشوف رحلات الطيران المتاحة. لما بيبدأ يخش في خطوات أكتر ويبدأ يحجز،"},{"t":88.5,"en":"and then decide to go back, they land on the first page, where they start searching for flights,","ar":"ولما بيقرّر المستخدم يرجع، بيرجع لأول صفحة بيبدأ يبحث فيها عن رحلات الطيران،"},{"t":94.5,"en":"not on the flights that were available based on the filters they had chosen,","ar":"مش بيرجع لرحلات الطيران اللي كانت متاحة له بناءً على عوامل التصفية اللي هو قرّرها،"},{"t":102.5,"en":"so they have to search all over again, instead of picking another option from the results they first got.","ar":"وبناءً عليه هو محتاج يدوّر من أول وجديد، مش يشوف بديل من ضمن النتائج اللي طلعت له في البداية."}]},{"id":"S03","type":"card","part":"concept","icons":["cut","layers","ok"],"title":{"en":"Video summary","ar":"ملخص الفيديو"},"body":{"en":"The third heuristic: people often do things by mistake or change their minds, so they need a **clearly marked emergency exit**, like the exit sign in a building.\n\n- **Always give a way out:** Cancel, Close or Back, easy to find and clearly labelled.\n- **Back goes back one step,** to exactly where people came from, not to the start.\n- **Support undo**, and before a risky action, explain what will happen and offer Cancel.","ar":"مبدأ الاستخدام (Usability heuristic) الثالث هو تحكّم المستخدم وحريته (User control and freedom): كثيرًا ما يفعل الناس أشياء بالخطأ أو يغيّرون رأيهم، فيحتاجون إلى **مخرج طوارئ واضح**، مثل علامة الخروج في أي مبنى.\n\n- **أعطِ دائمًا طريقًا للخروج:** «إلغاء» أو «إغلاق» أو «رجوع»، سهل الرؤية وواضح الاسم.\n- **«رجوع» يعيد خطوة واحدة،** إلى المكان الذي جاء منه الناس بالضبط، لا إلى البداية.\n- **ادعم التراجع (Undo)**، وقبل الإجراء الخطِر، اشرح ما سيحدث واعرض «إلغاء»."}},{"id":"S04","type":"tune","part":"guided","skill":"SK-P02-U02-01","rules":["R06"],"value":{"en":"User control and freedom (NN/g): people should be able to cancel a purchase or a money transfer at any point. The Cancel option should be easy to find and quick to use.","ar":"تحكّم المستخدم وحريته (NN/g): يجب أن يستطيع الناس إلغاء الشراء أو تحويل المال في أي لحظة. وخيار «إلغاء» يجب أن يكون سهل الإيجاد وسريع الاستخدام."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/user-control-and-freedom/","quote":"The Cancel option should be easy to find and quick to execute."},"scenario":{"en":"Our app also lets people send a photo book as a gift, in four steps. Each step has only a **Continue** button. People who change their minds close the whole app.","ar":"يتيح تطبيقنا أيضًا إرسال ألبوم صور هديةً، في أربع خطوات. وفي كل خطوة زر **متابعة** فقط. ومن يغيّر رأيه يغلق التطبيق كله."},"prompt":{"en":"What should each step have?","ar":"ماذا نضيف إلى كل خطوة ليخرج من يغيّر رأيه بسهولة؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"taba","name":{"en":"Tab'a","ar":"طبعة"},"color":"#D6336C","icon":"printer","domain":"tab-a.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Send a photo book","ar":"أرسل ألبوم صور"}},"blocks":[{"kind":"progress","value":50,"label":{"en":"Step 2 of 4","ar":"الخطوة 2 من 4"}},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Who is it for?","ar":"لمن الهدية؟"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Name","ar":"الاسم"},"text":{"en":"e.g. Nada","ar":"مثال: ندى"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Address","ar":"العنوان"},"text":{"en":"Street, building, flat","ar":"الشارع، العمارة، الشقة"},"gap":"m"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Continue","ar":"متابعة"},"note":{"en":"The only button on every step","ar":"الزر الوحيد في كل خطوة"}}]},"options":[{"id":"back","text":{"en":"Nothing new: the phone's Back button can undo the steps one by one","ar":"لا شيء جديد: زر الرجوع في الهاتف يستطيع التراجع عن الخطوات واحدة واحدة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"taba","name":{"en":"Tab'a","ar":"طبعة"},"color":"#D6336C","icon":"printer","domain":"tab-a.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Send a photo book","ar":"أرسل ألبوم صور"}},"blocks":[{"kind":"progress","value":50,"label":{"en":"Step 2 of 4","ar":"الخطوة 2 من 4"}},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Who is it for?","ar":"لمن الهدية؟"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Name","ar":"الاسم"},"text":{"en":"e.g. Nada","ar":"مثال: ندى"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Address","ar":"العنوان"},"text":{"en":"Street, building, flat","ar":"الشارع، العمارة، الشقة"},"gap":"m"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Continue","ar":"متابعة"},"note":{"en":"The only button on every step","ar":"الزر الوحيد في كل خطوة"}}]}},{"id":"cancel","text":{"en":"A \"Cancel\" link next to Continue, and a \"Back\" at the top","ar":"رابط «إلغاء» بجانب «متابعة»، و«رجوع» في الأعلى"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"taba","name":{"en":"Tab'a","ar":"طبعة"},"color":"#D6336C","icon":"printer","domain":"tab-a.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Send a photo book","ar":"أرسل ألبوم صور"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"progress","value":50,"label":{"en":"Step 2 of 4","ar":"الخطوة 2 من 4"}},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Who is it for?","ar":"لمن الهدية؟"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Name","ar":"الاسم"},"text":{"en":"e.g. Nada","ar":"مثال: ندى"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Address","ar":"العنوان"},"text":{"en":"Street, building, flat","ar":"الشارع، العمارة، الشقة"},"gap":"m"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Continue","ar":"متابعة"}},{"kind":"button","style":"text","text":{"en":"Cancel","ar":"إلغاء"},"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"x","text":{"en":"A small ✕ in the corner of the last step only","ar":"علامة ✕ صغيرة في زاوية الخطوة الأخيرة فقط"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"taba","name":{"en":"Tab'a","ar":"طبعة"},"color":"#D6336C","icon":"printer","domain":"tab-a.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Send a photo book","ar":"أرسل ألبوم صور"}},"blocks":[{"kind":"progress","value":50,"label":{"en":"Step 2 of 4","ar":"الخطوة 2 من 4"}},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Who is it for?","ar":"لمن الهدية؟"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Name","ar":"الاسم"},"text":{"en":"e.g. Nada","ar":"مثال: ندى"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Address","ar":"العنوان"},"text":{"en":"Street, building, flat","ar":"الشارع، العمارة، الشقة"},"gap":"m"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Continue","ar":"متابعة"},"note":{"en":"Still no way out here; a ✕ appears only on step 4","ar":"ما زال لا مخرج هنا؛ وتظهر ✕ في الخطوة 4 فقط"}}]}}],"answer":["cancel"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P02-013","when":["back","x"],"feedback":{"en":"Pressing Back three times to quit is slow, and many people don't know it works. A ✕ only at the end comes too late. The exit has to be visible on every step.","ar":"الضغط على «رجوع» ثلاث مرات للخروج بطيء، وكثير من الناس لا يعرفون أنه يعمل. وعلامة ✕ في الخطوة الأخيرة فقط تأتي متأخرة. يجب أن يكون المخرج ظاهرًا في كل خطوة."}}],"hints":[{"en":"How many taps does it take to quit from step 3 right now?","ar":"كم ضغطة يحتاجها الخروج من الخطوة 3 الآن؟"}],"correct":{"en":"A visible Cancel on every step.","ar":"زر «إلغاء» ظاهر في كل خطوة."},"explain":{"en":"Cancel lets people quit in one tap from any step, and Back lets them fix the step before. Knowing they can get out makes people more willing to start.","ar":"«إلغاء» يتيح للناس الخروج بضغطة واحدة من أي خطوة، و«رجوع» يتيح لهم تعديل الخطوة السابقة. ومعرفة أنهم يستطيعون الخروج تجعل الناس أكثر استعدادًا للبدء."},"speaker":"mona"},{"id":"S05","type":"tune","part":"guided","skill":"SK-P02-U02-02","rules":["R06"],"value":{"en":"User control and freedom (NN/g): give people a visible option to undo, where they expect it, and long enough to use. An Undo that vanishes in three seconds only helps those who are very quick.","ar":"تحكّم المستخدم وحريته (NN/g): أعطِ الناس خيار تراجع ظاهرًا، في المكان الذي يتوقعونه، ولمدة تكفي لاستخدامه. والتراجع الذي يختفي في ثلاث ثوانٍ لا يساعد إلا السريعين جدًا."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/user-control-and-freedom/","quote":"give users a visible option to undo an action on the UI"},"scenario":{"en":"People can delete photos from an album. A small \"Undo\" appears for three seconds, then the photos are gone for good. We get many sad emails.","ar":"يستطيع الناس حذف صور من الألبوم. يظهر زر «تراجع» صغير لثلاث ثوانٍ، ثم تُحذف الصور نهائيًا. وتصلنا رسائل كثيرة من أشخاص فقدوا صورهم."},"prompt":{"en":"What should we change?","ar":"ماذا نغيّر ليستعيد الناس الصور التي حذفوها بالخطأ؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"suwar","name":{"en":"Suwar","ar":"صور"},"color":"#2563EB","icon":"images","domain":"suwar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Summer 2026","ar":"صيف 2026"},"back":true,"actions":[{"icon":"dots-three-vertical"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"row","blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"beach","size":"s"},{"kind":"image","art":"photo","size":"s"},{"kind":"image","art":"cafe","size":"s"}]}],"overlay":{"type":"toast","blocks":[{"kind":"row","blocks":[{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"3 photos deleted","ar":"حُذفت 3 صور"}},{"kind":"link","text":{"en":"Undo","ar":"تراجع"}}],"note":{"en":"Disappears after 3 s","ar":"يختفي بعد 3 ثوانٍ"}}]}},"options":[{"id":"dialog","text":{"en":"Ask \"Delete these photos?\" before every delete","ar":"نسأل «هل تحذف هذه الصور؟» قبل كل حذف"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"suwar","name":{"en":"Suwar","ar":"صور"},"color":"#2563EB","icon":"images","domain":"suwar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Summer 2026","ar":"صيف 2026"},"back":true,"actions":[{"icon":"dots-three-vertical"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"row","blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"beach","size":"s"},{"kind":"image","art":"photo","size":"s"},{"kind":"image","art":"cafe","size":"s"}]}],"overlay":{"type":"dialog","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Delete these photos?","ar":"هل تحذف هذه الصور؟"}},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"3 photos","ar":"3 صور"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","style":"danger","text":{"en":"Delete","ar":"احذف"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"button","style":"text","text":{"en":"Cancel","ar":"إلغاء"},"gap":"s"}]}}},{"id":"longer","text":{"en":"Keep Undo on screen for about ten seconds, and keep deleted photos in \"Recently deleted\" for 30 days","ar":"نُبقي «تراجع» على الشاشة نحو عشر ثوانٍ، ونحتفظ بالصور المحذوفة في «المحذوفة مؤخرًا» 30 يومًا"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"suwar","name":{"en":"Suwar","ar":"صور"},"color":"#2563EB","icon":"images","domain":"suwar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Summer 2026","ar":"صيف 2026"},"back":true,"actions":[{"icon":"dots-three-vertical"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"row","blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"beach","size":"s"},{"kind":"image","art":"photo","size":"s"},{"kind":"image","art":"cafe","size":"s"}]},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"trash","text":{"en":"Recently deleted · 3","ar":"المحذوفة مؤخرًا · 3"},"sub":{"en":"Kept for 30 days","ar":"تبقى 30 يومًا"},"chevron":true,"gap":"l"}],"overlay":{"type":"toast","blocks":[{"kind":"row","blocks":[{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"3 photos deleted","ar":"حُذفت 3 صور"}},{"kind":"link","text":{"en":"Undo","ar":"تراجع"}}],"note":{"en":"Stays about 10 s","ar":"يبقى نحو 10 ثوانٍ"}}]}}},{"id":"shake","text":{"en":"Let people shake the phone to undo","ar":"نتيح للناس هزّ الهاتف للتراجع"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"suwar","name":{"en":"Suwar","ar":"صور"},"color":"#2563EB","icon":"images","domain":"suwar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Summer 2026","ar":"صيف 2026"},"back":true,"actions":[{"icon":"dots-three-vertical"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"row","blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"beach","size":"s"},{"kind":"image","art":"photo","size":"s"},{"kind":"image","art":"cafe","size":"s"}]}],"overlay":{"type":"toast","blocks":[{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"3 photos deleted","ar":"حُذفت 3 صور"},"note":{"en":"Shake the phone to undo","ar":"هزّ الهاتف للتراجع"}}]}}}],"answer":["longer"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P02-015","when":["dialog"],"feedback":{"en":"A question before every delete gets in the way of people who delete a lot, and they learn to tap Yes without reading. It also can't help someone who regrets it tomorrow.","ar":"السؤال قبل كل حذف يعطّل من يحذفون كثيرًا، فيتعلّمون ضغط «نعم» دون قراءة. ولا يساعد من يندم غدًا."}},{"id":"MC-P02-014","when":["shake"],"feedback":{"en":"Shaking is invisible: most people never find out it exists, so they still can't get their photos back.","ar":"الهزّ غير ظاهر: أغلب الناس لا يعرفون أصلًا أنه موجود، فلا يستطيعون استعادة صورهم."}}],"hints":[{"en":"When do people usually notice they deleted the wrong photo?","ar":"متى يلاحظ الناس عادة أنهم حذفوا الصورة الخطأ؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Make undo visible, and long enough to use.","ar":"اجعل التراجع ظاهرًا، ولمدة تكفي لاستخدامه."},"explain":{"en":"Ten seconds catches a wrong tap, and \"Recently deleted\" catches the regret that comes later. People stay in control without being stopped every time.","ar":"عشر ثوانٍ تكفي لإصلاح ضغطة خاطئة، و«المحذوفة مؤخرًا» تنفع من يندم لاحقًا. فيبقى الناس متحكّمين دون أن نوقفهم في كل مرة."},"speaker":"mona"},{"id":"S06","type":"compare","speaker":"rami","part":"contrast","skill":"SK-P02-U02-01","rules":["R11"],"value":{"en":"User control and freedom (NN/g): make exits easy to find and understand. Add a text label to the exit icon, or use plain words such as Back and Close.","ar":"تحكّم المستخدم وحريته (NN/g): اجعل المخارج سهلة الإيجاد والفهم. أضِف اسمًا مكتوبًا إلى أيقونة الخروج، أو استخدم كلمات واضحة مثل «رجوع» و«إغلاق»."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/user-control-and-freedom/","quote":"Accompany icons with text labels or substitute icons with plain text."},"scenario":{"en":"I'm designing the settings screen of a learning app. Many older learners say they get stuck inside it.","ar":"أصمّم شاشة الإعدادات في تطبيق تعليمي. ويقول كثير من المتعلمين الأكبر سنًا إنهم يعلقون داخلها."},"prompt":{"en":"Which version helps them get out?","ar":"أيّ نسخة تساعدهم على الخروج؟"},"a":{"label":{"en":"Version A: an icon only","ar":"النسخة A: أيقونة «‹» وحدها دون كلمة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"mozakra","name":{"en":"Mozakra","ar":"مذاكرة"},"color":"#1971C2","icon":"student","domain":"mozakra.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Settings","ar":"الإعدادات"}},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":"‹","tone":"faint"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"bell","text":{"en":"Daily reminder","ar":"تذكير يومي"},"toggle":true,"gap":"s"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"speaker-high","text":{"en":"Sound effects","ar":"المؤثرات الصوتية"},"toggle":false,"gap":"s"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"text-aa","text":{"en":"Text size","ar":"حجم الخط"},"value":{"en":"Large","ar":"كبير"},"chevron":true,"gap":"s"}]}},"b":{"label":{"en":"Version B: icon and word","ar":"النسخة B: أيقونة مع كلمة «رجوع»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"mozakra","name":{"en":"Mozakra","ar":"مذاكرة"},"color":"#1971C2","icon":"student","domain":"mozakra.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Settings","ar":"الإعدادات"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"link","icon":"caret-left","text":{"en":"Back","ar":"رجوع"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"bell","text":{"en":"Daily reminder","ar":"تذكير يومي"},"toggle":true,"gap":"s"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"speaker-high","text":{"en":"Sound effects","ar":"المؤثرات الصوتية"},"toggle":false,"gap":"s"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"text-aa","text":{"en":"Text size","ar":"حجم الخط"},"value":{"en":"Large","ar":"كبير"},"chevron":true,"gap":"s"}]}},"answer":"b","misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P02-013","when":["a"],"feedback":{"en":"A thin \"‹\" in grey is easy to miss and doesn't say what it does. For many people, that means no way out.","ar":"علامة «‹» رفيعة رمادية لا يكاد يلاحظها أحد، ولا تقول ما تفعله. فيظن كثير من الناس أنه لا مخرج."}}],"correct":{"en":"B: the exit says what it is.","ar":"B: المخرج مكتوب بوضوح."},"explain":{"en":"\"‹ Back\" is easy to spot and leaves no doubt. An exit only works if people notice it and trust what it will do.","ar":"«‹ رجوع» سهلة الرؤية ولا تترك أي شك. فالمخرج لا ينفع إلا إذا لاحظه الناس ووثقوا بما سيفعله."}},{"id":"S07","type":"tune","speaker":"youssef","part":"independent","skill":"SK-P02-U02-02","rules":["R14"],"confidence":true,"value":{"en":"User control and freedom (NN/g): whenever people open a new page or view, they should be able to go back to where they came from. Back from a product should return to the filtered results, not to the start.","ar":"تحكّم المستخدم وحريته (NN/g): كلما فتح الناس صفحة أو شاشة جديدة، يجب أن يستطيعوا العودة إلى حيث جاؤوا. والرجوع من صفحة المنتج يجب أن يعيدهم إلى النتائج المفلترة، لا إلى البداية."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/user-control-and-freedom/","quote":"Whenever users click a link to open a new page, screen or view, they should always be able to go back to where they came from."},"scenario":{"en":"In my online shop, a customer filters drills by price and brand, then opens one. When she taps Back, she lands on the shop's home page, and her filters are gone.","ar":"في متجري الإلكتروني، تستخدم عميلة الفلاتر (Filters) لتختار المثاقب حسب السعر والماركة، ثم تفتح واحدًا منها. وحين تضغط «رجوع»، تصل إلى الصفحة الرئيسية للمتجر، وتضيع فلاترها."},"prompt":{"en":"Where should Back take her?","ar":"إلى أين يجب أن يأخذها «رجوع»؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"logo":true,"actions":[{"icon":"magnifying-glass"},{"icon":"shopping-cart"}]},"tabbar":{"active":0,"items":[{"icon":"house","text":{"en":"Home","ar":"الرئيسية"}},{"icon":"squares-four","text":{"en":"Departments","ar":"الأقسام"}},{"icon":"user","text":{"en":"Account","ar":"حسابي"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"searchbar","text":{"en":"Search Dar","ar":"ابحث في دار"},"note":{"en":"After Back from the drill","ar":"بعد «رجوع» من صفحة المثقاب"}},{"kind":"card","art":"washing-machine","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Washers week","ar":"أسبوع الغسالات"}},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Up to 20% off","ar":"خصم حتى 20%"}}],"gap":"m"},{"kind":"chips","gap":"m","items":[{"text":{"en":"Tools","ar":"أدوات"}},{"text":{"en":"Kitchen","ar":"المطبخ"}},{"text":{"en":"Shoes","ar":"أحذية"}}]}]},"options":[{"id":"home","text":{"en":"The home page, so she can start a fresh search","ar":"الصفحة الرئيسية، لتبدأ بحثًا جديدًا"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"logo":true,"actions":[{"icon":"magnifying-glass"},{"icon":"shopping-cart"}]},"tabbar":{"active":0,"items":[{"icon":"house","text":{"en":"Home","ar":"الرئيسية"}},{"icon":"squares-four","text":{"en":"Departments","ar":"الأقسام"}},{"icon":"user","text":{"en":"Account","ar":"حسابي"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"searchbar","text":{"en":"Search Dar","ar":"ابحث في دار"},"note":{"en":"After Back from the drill","ar":"بعد «رجوع» من صفحة المثقاب"}},{"kind":"card","art":"washing-machine","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Washers week","ar":"أسبوع الغسالات"}},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Up to 20% off","ar":"خصم حتى 20%"}}],"gap":"m"},{"kind":"chips","gap":"m","items":[{"text":{"en":"Tools","ar":"أدوات"}},{"text":{"en":"Kitchen","ar":"المطبخ"}},{"text":{"en":"Shoes","ar":"أحذية"}}]}]}},{"id":"results","text":{"en":"The drill results, with her price and brand filters still set","ar":"نتائج المثاقب، مع بقاء فلاتر السعر والماركة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Drills","ar":"مثاقب"},"back":true,"actions":[{"icon":"funnel","count":2,"aria":{"en":"Filters","ar":"الفلاتر"}}]},"tabbar":{"active":0,"items":[{"icon":"house","text":{"en":"Home","ar":"الرئيسية"}},{"icon":"squares-four","text":{"en":"Departments","ar":"الأقسام"}},{"icon":"user","text":{"en":"Account","ar":"حسابي"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"chips","items":[{"text":{"en":"Under EGP 2,000","ar":"أقل من 2,000 جنيه"},"on":true},{"text":{"en":"Brand: Qowa","ar":"الماركة: قوة"},"on":true}],"note":{"en":"Her filters are still set","ar":"ما زالت فلاترها كما هي"}},{"kind":"listitem","art":"box","text":{"en":"Qowa drill 650 W","ar":"مثقاب قوة 650 وات"},"sub":{"en":"EGP 1,250","ar":"1,250 جنيه"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"listitem","art":"box","text":{"en":"Qowa drill 500 W","ar":"مثقاب قوة 500 وات"},"sub":{"en":"EGP 980","ar":"980 جنيه"},"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"category","text":{"en":"The Tools category page, without filters","ar":"صفحة قسم الأدوات، دون فلاتر"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Tools","ar":"أدوات"},"back":true},"tabbar":{"active":0,"items":[{"icon":"house","text":{"en":"Home","ar":"الرئيسية"}},{"icon":"squares-four","text":{"en":"Departments","ar":"الأقسام"}},{"icon":"user","text":{"en":"Account","ar":"حسابي"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"chips","items":[{"text":{"en":"Drills","ar":"مثاقب"}},{"text":{"en":"Saws","ar":"مناشير"}},{"text":{"en":"Hand tools","ar":"عدد يدوية"}}],"note":{"en":"No filters","ar":"دون فلاتر"}},{"kind":"listitem","art":"box","text":{"en":"Paint roller","ar":"رولة دهان"},"sub":{"en":"EGP 120","ar":"120 جنيه"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"listitem","art":"box","text":{"en":"Pipe wrench","ar":"مفتاح مواسير"},"sub":{"en":"EGP 210","ar":"210 جنيه"},"gap":"s"}]}}],"answer":["results"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P02-012","when":["home","category"],"feedback":{"en":"She wanted to compare this drill with the others she found. Sending her further back makes her filter everything again.","ar":"أرادت أن تقارن هذا المثقاب بالمثاقب الأخرى التي وجدتها. وإرجاعها أبعد من ذلك يجعلها تختار الفلاتر كلها من جديد."}}],"hints":[{"en":"What was on her screen just before she opened the drill?","ar":"ماذا كان على شاشتها قبل أن تفتح المثقاب مباشرة؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Back to exactly where she was.","ar":"«رجوع» يعيدها إلى المكان الذي كانت فيه بالضبط."},"explain":{"en":"People expect Back to undo their last move only. Returning her to the same results, filters and all, lets her keep comparing.","ar":"يتوقع الناس أن «رجوع» يلغي آخر خطوة فقط. وإعادتها إلى النتائج نفسها، بفلاترها كلها، تتيح لها أن تكمل المقارنة."}},{"id":"S08","type":"card","part":"recap","icons":["cut","layers","ok"],"title":{"en":"What you practised","ar":"ما تدرّبت عليه"},"body":{"en":"- **Always leave a clear exit:** Cancel, Close or Back on every step, with words, not just an icon.\n- **Back means one step back,** to exactly where people were, with their choices kept.\n- **Make undo visible and long enough,** and keep deleted things for a while.\n\nNext: keep things the same, inside your product and with others.","ar":"- **اترك دائمًا مخرجًا واضحًا:** «إلغاء» أو «إغلاق» أو «رجوع» في كل خطوة، بكلمات لا بأيقونة فقط.\n- **«رجوع» يعني خطوة واحدة،** إلى المكان الذي كان فيه الناس بالضبط، مع بقاء اختياراتهم.\n- **اجعل التراجع ظاهرًا ولمدة كافية،** واحتفظ بالأشياء المحذوفة فترة.\n\nالتالي: اجعل التصميم متّسقًا، داخل منتجك ومع المنتجات الأخرى."}}]}$uxg$::jsonb),
  ($uxg$P02-U02-L02$uxg$, $uxg$f07a748c5ec7263163a0cead348b160a117ee9f109db9bb4caede4fdcfaca31e$uxg$, $uxg${"id":"P02-U02-L02","mode":"lesson","minutes":8,"title":{"en":"Keep things the same","ar":"اجعل التصميم متّسقًا"},"speaker":"karim","review_labels":{"MC-P02-016":{"en":"One action, one look and place","ar":"إجراء واحد، شكل ومكان واحد"},"MC-P02-017":{"en":"Different words make people wonder","ar":"الكلمات المختلفة تجعل الناس يتساءلون"},"MC-P02-018":{"en":"A new pattern costs people effort","ar":"النمط الجديد يكلّف الناس جهدًا"},"MC-P02-019":{"en":"Brand style doesn't replace a known icon","ar":"أسلوب العلامة التجارية لا يحلّ محل أيقونة معروفة"}},"steps":[{"id":"S01","type":"card","part":"hook","title":{"en":"The button that moved","ar":"الزر الذي تحرّك"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nafaqat","name":{"en":"Nafaqat","ar":"نفقات"},"color":"#475569","icon":"receipt","domain":"nafaqat.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"nafaqat.example/claims/new","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Leave","ar":"الإجازات"},{"en":"Expenses","ar":"المصروفات"},{"en":"My requests","ar":"طلباتي"}],"active":1,"actions":[{"icon":"bell"},{"icon":"user"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Expense claim","ar":"طلب مصروفات"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Amount","ar":"المبلغ"},"text":{"en":"EGP 1,250","ar":"1,250 جنيه"},"filled":true,"gap":"m"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Receipt","ar":"الإيصال"},"text":"taxi-03-nov.jpg","filled":true,"icon":"paperclip","gap":"m"},{"kind":"row","gap":"l","blocks":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Send","ar":"أرسِل"},"note":{"en":"The leave form has Cancel here","ar":"في نموذج الإجازة يقع «إلغاء» هنا"}},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Cancel","ar":"إلغاء"},"style":"text"}]}]},"body":{"en":"I build the web app a company's staff use to request time off and claim expenses. Each form was built by a different developer.\n\nIn the leave form, **Submit** is green on the right. In the expense form, **Send** is blue on the left, where Cancel sits in the leave form. Staff keep cancelling claims they meant to send.","ar":"أبني تطبيق الويب الذي يستخدمه موظفو شركة لطلب الإجازات واسترداد المصروفات. وكل نموذج بناه مطوّر مختلف.\n\nفي نموذج الإجازة، زر **إرسال** أخضر على اليمين. وفي نموذج المصروفات، زر **أرسِل** أزرق على اليسار، في مكان «إلغاء» في نموذج الإجازة. والموظفون يلغون باستمرار طلبات كانوا يريدون إرسالها."}},{"id":"S02","type":"tune","part":"try","skill":"SK-P02-U02-03","rules":["R12"],"confidence":true,"value":{"en":"Try first. Consistency and standards (NN/g): a product should use the same patterns everywhere inside it. The fix is one label, one colour and one position for the main action on every form.","ar":"جرّب أولًا. الاتساق والمعايير (NN/g): يجب أن يستخدم المنتج الأنماط نفسها في كل مكان داخله. والإصلاح هو اسم واحد ولون واحد ومكان واحد للإجراء الرئيسي في كل نموذج."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/consistency-and-standards/","quote":"they should use the same patterns everywhere inside the system"},"prompt":{"en":"What's the best fix?","ar":"ما أفضل إصلاح ليتوقف الموظفون عن إلغاء طلباتهم بالخطأ؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nafaqat","name":{"en":"Nafaqat","ar":"نفقات"},"color":"#475569","icon":"receipt","domain":"nafaqat.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"nafaqat.example/leave/new","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Leave","ar":"الإجازات"},{"en":"Expenses","ar":"المصروفات"},{"en":"My requests","ar":"طلباتي"}],"active":0,"actions":[{"icon":"bell"},{"icon":"user"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Leave request","ar":"طلب إجازة"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"First day","ar":"أول يوم"},"text":{"en":"Sun 9 Nov","ar":"الأحد 9 نوفمبر"},"filled":true,"icon":"calendar-blank","gap":"m"},{"kind":"row","gap":"l","blocks":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Cancel","ar":"إلغاء"},"style":"text"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Submit","ar":"إرسال"}}]}]},"options":[{"id":"same","text":{"en":"Use one button style for every form: same word, same colour, same place","ar":"أستخدم شكل زر واحدًا لكل النماذج: الكلمة نفسها، واللون نفسه، والمكان نفسه"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nafaqat","name":{"en":"Nafaqat","ar":"نفقات"},"color":"#475569","icon":"receipt","domain":"nafaqat.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"nafaqat.example/expenses/new","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Leave","ar":"الإجازات"},{"en":"Expenses","ar":"المصروفات"},{"en":"My requests","ar":"طلباتي"}],"active":1,"actions":[{"icon":"bell"},{"icon":"user"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Expense claim","ar":"طلب مصروفات"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Amount","ar":"المبلغ"},"text":{"en":"EGP 180","ar":"180 جنيه"},"filled":true,"gap":"m"},{"kind":"row","gap":"l","blocks":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Cancel","ar":"إلغاء"},"style":"text"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Submit","ar":"إرسال"}}],"note":{"en":"Same word, colour and place as the leave form","ar":"الكلمة واللون والمكان نفسها كما في نموذج الإجازة"}}]}},{"id":"confirm","text":{"en":"Ask \"Are you sure you want to cancel?\" in the expense form","ar":"أسأل «هل أنت متأكد أنك تريد الإلغاء؟» في نموذج المصروفات"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nafaqat","name":{"en":"Nafaqat","ar":"نفقات"},"color":"#475569","icon":"receipt","domain":"nafaqat.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"nafaqat.example/expenses/new","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Leave","ar":"الإجازات"},{"en":"Expenses","ar":"المصروفات"},{"en":"My requests","ar":"طلباتي"}],"active":1,"actions":[{"icon":"bell"},{"icon":"user"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Expense claim","ar":"طلب مصروفات"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Amount","ar":"المبلغ"},"text":{"en":"EGP 180","ar":"180 جنيه"},"filled":true,"gap":"m"},{"kind":"row","gap":"l","blocks":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Send","ar":"أرسِل"}},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Cancel","ar":"إلغاء"},"style":"text"}]}],"overlay":{"type":"dialog","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Are you sure you want to cancel?","ar":"هل أنت متأكد أنك تريد الإلغاء؟"}},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Yes, cancel","ar":"نعم، ألغِ"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"button","style":"text","text":{"en":"No","ar":"لا"},"gap":"s"}]}}},{"id":"bold","text":{"en":"Make Send bigger and bolder in the expense form","ar":"أكبّر زر «أرسِل» وأجعل خطّه أعرض في نموذج المصروفات"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nafaqat","name":{"en":"Nafaqat","ar":"نفقات"},"color":"#475569","icon":"receipt","domain":"nafaqat.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"nafaqat.example/expenses/new","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Leave","ar":"الإجازات"},{"en":"Expenses","ar":"المصروفات"},{"en":"My requests","ar":"طلباتي"}],"active":1,"actions":[{"icon":"bell"},{"icon":"user"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Expense claim","ar":"طلب مصروفات"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Amount","ar":"المبلغ"},"text":{"en":"EGP 180","ar":"180 جنيه"},"filled":true,"gap":"m"},{"kind":"row","gap":"l","blocks":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Send","ar":"أرسِل"},"size":"l","weight":"bold"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Cancel","ar":"إلغاء"},"style":"text"}],"note":{"en":"Send is still where Cancel sits in the leave form","ar":"ما زال «أرسِل» في مكان «إلغاء» في نموذج الإجازة"}}]}}],"answer":["same"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P02-016","when":["confirm","bold"],"feedback":{"en":"Staff still reach for the place where the main button was in the other form. Patching one form leaves the two forms working differently.","ar":"ما زال الموظفون يضغطون حيث كان الزر الرئيسي في النموذج الآخر. وإصلاح نموذج واحد فقط يترك النموذجين يعملان بطريقتين مختلفتين."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Why do staff click Cancel? What did the other form teach them?","ar":"لماذا يضغط الموظفون «إلغاء»؟ ماذا علّمهم النموذج الآخر؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Make the same action look and sit the same everywhere.","ar":"اجعل الإجراء نفسه بالشكل والمكان نفسيهما في كل مكان."},"explain":{"en":"Staff learn where the main button is from the first form they use. When every form keeps it in the same place, with the same word and colour, that habit works for them instead of against them.","ar":"يتعلّم الموظفون مكان الزر الرئيسي من أول نموذج يستخدمونه. وحين يبقيه كل نموذج في المكان نفسه، بالكلمة واللون نفسيهما، تعمل هذه العادة لصالحهم لا ضدهم."}},{"id":"S09","type":"video","part":"concept","title":{"en":"Consistency and standards","ar":"الاتساق والمعايير (Consistency and standards)"},"video":"ebf7df23-5f3d-4df7-ab63-cb6667d0e536","duration":122,"transcript":[{"t":2.5,"en":"In short, a pattern is a group of components that together form a certain pattern or layout,","ar":"الـ Pattern باختصار: إن إنت عندك مجموعة من الـ Components مع بعض كوّنوا Pattern أو Layout معين،"},{"t":9.82,"en":"which you use to solve a certain problem or perform a certain function, in certain contexts.","ar":"إنت بتستخدم الـ Layout ده لحل مشكلة معينة، أو لأداء Function معينة، في Context أو سياقات معينة."},{"t":18.94,"en":"You also shouldn't change that pattern, that group of components.","ar":"ما ينفعش برضو إنك تغيّر الـ Pattern ده، الحاجة اللي هي عبارة عن مجموعة من الـ Components."},{"t":24.52,"en":"As you can see, he uses a form where the user fills in some details. Look with me: in this example, the Next button was the first button on the left, and Finish later was in the middle.","ar":"زي ما إنت شايف، هو هنا مستخدم Form بيملا فيها الـ User بعض التفاصيل. لو بصّيت معايا، هتلاقي إنه في المثال ده الـ Next button كان أول Button ناحية الشمال، وزرار Finish later كان في النص."},{"t":38.26,"en":"In the second step, Finish later became the last button, Back took Next's place at the start, and Next moved to the middle.","ar":"في تاني خطوة، زرار Finish later بقى آخر زرار، وزرار Back بقى هو اللي في الأول مكان الـ Next، والـ Next بقى هو اللي في النص."},{"t":47.16,"en":"That's an inconsistency in the pattern. If users got used to pressing Next in a certain place,","ar":"طبعًا ده Inconsistency في الـ Pattern. والمستخدم هنا لو اتعوّد إنه يضغط مثلًا على الـ Next في مكان معين،"},{"t":56.56,"en":"it's very likely that after the next step they press Next and find they pressed Back, because Back took Next's place. The same goes for the other buttons, and any components or pattern where we move things around.","ar":"وارد جدًا إنه لما يخلّص الخطوة اللي بعدها، ييجي يدوس Next، يلاقي نفسه داس Back، عشان زرار Back هو اللي جه مكان زرار Next. وهكذا في باقي الـ Buttons، وفي أي Components أو أي Pattern بنغيّر فيه أماكن الـ Components."},{"t":69.62,"en":"So what's the fix? Airbnb, as you can see, is perfectly consistent: Next stays in one fixed place through all the steps, and Back in another,","ar":"طيب، الحل إيه؟ برضو Airbnb، زي ما إنت شايف، منتهى التناسق والانتظام: حط الـ Next في مكان ثابت طول الـ Steps، والـ Back في مكان ثابت طول الـ Steps،"},{"t":83.22,"en":"and Exit is at the top left, with lower hierarchy but also in a fixed place. The button positions stay the same through every step, so the pattern is consistent.","ar":"والـ Exit موجود فوق على الشمال، بـ Hierarchy أقل، لكن في مكان برضو ثابت. محافظ على الأماكن الخاصة بالـ Buttons في الـ Pattern اللي استخدموه طول الخطوات، فهنا حقّق الـ Consistency في الـ Pattern."},{"t":99.24,"en":"And by the way, consistent patterns also mean that when the steps are used elsewhere, even for a different task, the pattern is kept as it is.","ar":"وبالمناسبة، تحقيق الـ Consistency في الـ Patterns كمان إنه لما ييجي يستخدم موضوع الـ Steps ده في مكان تاني، حتى لو مش بيعمل نفس الـ Function أو نفس المهمة، يحاول يحافظ برضو على الـ Pattern كما هو."}]},{"id":"S03","type":"card","part":"concept","icons":["layers","eye","ok"],"title":{"en":"Video summary","ar":"ملخص الفيديو"},"body":{"en":"The fourth heuristic: people should not have to wonder whether different words, situations or actions mean the same thing.\n\n- **Internal consistency:** inside your product, the same action uses the same word, look and place on every screen.\n- **External consistency:** people spend most of their time in other products, so follow the conventions they bring from there.\n- **Break a convention only** when it clearly helps the task, because a new pattern costs people effort to learn.","ar":"مبدأ الاستخدام (Usability heuristic) الرابع هو الاتساق والمعايير (Consistency and standards): يجب ألّا يضطر الناس إلى التساؤل إن كانت الكلمات أو المواقف أو الإجراءات المختلفة تعني الشيء نفسه.\n\n- **الاتساق الداخلي (Internal consistency):** داخل منتجك، يستخدم الإجراء نفسه الكلمة والشكل والمكان نفسها في كل شاشة.\n- **الاتساق الخارجي (External consistency):** يقضي الناس أغلب وقتهم في منتجات أخرى، فاتبع العادات المألوفة (Conventions) التي يأتون بها من هناك.\n- **لا تخالف المألوف** إلا إذا كان ذلك يساعد المهمة بوضوح، لأن النمط الجديد يكلّف الناس جهدًا ليتعلّموه."}},{"id":"S04","type":"tune","part":"guided","skill":"SK-P02-U02-03","rules":["R06"],"value":{"en":"Consistency and standards (NN/g): users should not have to wonder whether different words mean the same thing. Three names for one action make people suspect three different results.","ar":"الاتساق والمعايير (NN/g): لا يجب أن يتساءل المستخدمون إن كانت الكلمات المختلفة تعني الشيء نفسه. وثلاثة أسماء لإجراء واحد تجعل الناس يظنون أن لها ثلاث نتائج مختلفة."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/consistency-and-standards/","quote":"Users should not have to wonder whether different words, situations, or actions mean the same thing."},"scenario":{"en":"In the same app, the button that takes a draft request away is called **Remove** on one screen, **Delete** on another and **Discard** on a third. They all do the same thing.","ar":"في التطبيق نفسه، الزر الذي يحذف مسودّة الطلب اسمه **أزِل** في شاشة، و**احذف** في أخرى، و**تجاهَل** في ثالثة. وكلها تفعل الشيء نفسه."},"prompt":{"en":"What should I do?","ar":"ماذا أفعل؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nafaqat","name":{"en":"Nafaqat","ar":"نفقات"},"color":"#475569","icon":"receipt","domain":"nafaqat.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"nafaqat.example/requests/drafts","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Leave","ar":"الإجازات"},{"en":"Expenses","ar":"المصروفات"},{"en":"My requests","ar":"طلباتي"}],"active":2},"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Drafts","ar":"المسودّات"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"airplane-tilt","text":{"en":"Leave · 9–12 Nov","ar":"إجازة · من 9 إلى 12 نوفمبر"},"value":{"en":"Remove","ar":"أزِل"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"receipt","text":{"en":"Taxi · EGP 180","ar":"تاكسي · 180 جنيه"},"value":{"en":"Delete","ar":"احذف"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"laptop","text":{"en":"Laptop bag · EGP 650","ar":"حقيبة لابتوب · 650 جنيه"},"value":{"en":"Discard","ar":"تجاهَل"},"gap":"s"}]},"options":[{"id":"one","text":{"en":"Pick one word, \"Delete draft\", and use it on every screen","ar":"أختار كلمة واحدة، «احذف المسودّة»، وأستخدمها في كل شاشة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nafaqat","name":{"en":"Nafaqat","ar":"نفقات"},"color":"#475569","icon":"receipt","domain":"nafaqat.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"nafaqat.example/requests/drafts","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Leave","ar":"الإجازات"},{"en":"Expenses","ar":"المصروفات"},{"en":"My requests","ar":"طلباتي"}],"active":2},"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Drafts","ar":"المسودّات"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"airplane-tilt","text":{"en":"Leave · 9–12 Nov","ar":"إجازة · من 9 إلى 12 نوفمبر"},"value":{"en":"Delete draft","ar":"احذف المسودّة"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"receipt","text":{"en":"Taxi · EGP 180","ar":"تاكسي · 180 جنيه"},"value":{"en":"Delete draft","ar":"احذف المسودّة"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"laptop","text":{"en":"Laptop bag · EGP 650","ar":"حقيبة لابتوب · 650 جنيه"},"value":{"en":"Delete draft","ar":"احذف المسودّة"},"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"keep","text":{"en":"Keep them; each one fits its screen's tone","ar":"أبقيها؛ فكل كلمة تناسب أسلوب شاشتها"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nafaqat","name":{"en":"Nafaqat","ar":"نفقات"},"color":"#475569","icon":"receipt","domain":"nafaqat.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"nafaqat.example/requests/drafts","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Leave","ar":"الإجازات"},{"en":"Expenses","ar":"المصروفات"},{"en":"My requests","ar":"طلباتي"}],"active":2},"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Drafts","ar":"المسودّات"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"airplane-tilt","text":{"en":"Leave · 9–12 Nov","ar":"إجازة · من 9 إلى 12 نوفمبر"},"value":{"en":"Remove","ar":"أزِل"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"receipt","text":{"en":"Taxi · EGP 180","ar":"تاكسي · 180 جنيه"},"value":{"en":"Delete","ar":"احذف"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"laptop","text":{"en":"Laptop bag · EGP 650","ar":"حقيبة لابتوب · 650 جنيه"},"value":{"en":"Discard","ar":"تجاهَل"},"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"icon","text":{"en":"Replace all three with a bin icon and no word","ar":"أضع مكانها كلها أيقونة سلة مهملات دون كلمة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nafaqat","name":{"en":"Nafaqat","ar":"نفقات"},"color":"#475569","icon":"receipt","domain":"nafaqat.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"nafaqat.example/requests/drafts","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Leave","ar":"الإجازات"},{"en":"Expenses","ar":"المصروفات"},{"en":"My requests","ar":"طلباتي"}],"active":2},"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Drafts","ar":"المسودّات"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"airplane-tilt","text":{"en":"Leave · 9–12 Nov","ar":"إجازة · من 9 إلى 12 نوفمبر"},"value":"🗑","gap":"m"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"receipt","text":{"en":"Taxi · EGP 180","ar":"تاكسي · 180 جنيه"},"value":"🗑","gap":"s"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"laptop","text":{"en":"Laptop bag · EGP 650","ar":"حقيبة لابتوب · 650 جنيه"},"value":"🗑","gap":"s"}]}}],"answer":["one"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P02-017","when":["keep"],"feedback":{"en":"Staff will wonder if \"Discard\" keeps a copy that \"Delete\" doesn't. Different words for one action create doubts that aren't there.","ar":"سيتساءل الموظفون إن كانت «تجاهَل» تحتفظ بنسخة لا تحتفظ بها «احذف». والكلمات المختلفة لإجراء واحد تخلق شكوكًا لا أساس لها."}},{"id":"MC-P02-016","when":["icon"],"feedback":{"en":"An icon alone removes the doubt about words but adds a new one: what exactly does the bin delete here?","ar":"الأيقونة وحدها تزيل الشك في الكلمات لكنها تضيف شكًا جديدًا: ما الذي تحذفه السلة هنا بالضبط؟"}}],"hints":[{"en":"Seeing three different words, what might staff think?","ar":"حين يرى الموظفون ثلاث كلمات مختلفة، ماذا قد يظنون؟"}],"correct":{"en":"One action, one word.","ar":"إجراء واحد، كلمة واحدة."},"explain":{"en":"When the same action always has the same name, staff learn it once and trust it everywhere. Save different words for actions that really do different things.","ar":"حين يحمل الإجراء نفسه الاسم نفسه دائمًا، يتعلّمه الموظفون مرة ويثقون به في كل مكان. واحتفظ بالكلمات المختلفة للإجراءات التي تفعل فعلًا أشياء مختلفة."},"speaker":"karim"},{"id":"S05","type":"tune","part":"guided","skill":"SK-P02-U02-04","rules":["R06"],"value":{"en":"Consistency and standards (NN/g): when asking for data such as dates, use industry standards. Most sites use a calendar date picker; an open field makes people guess the format.","ar":"الاتساق والمعايير (NN/g): حين تطلب بيانات مثل التواريخ، استخدم معايير المجال. فأغلب المواقع تستخدم منتقي تاريخ بشكل تقويم؛ أما الحقل المفتوح فيجعل الناس يخمّنون الصيغة."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/consistency-and-standards/","quote":"most sites use a calendar date picker when asking users to input dates."},"scenario":{"en":"The leave form asks for the first day off in an empty text field. Staff type \"3/11\", \"Nov 3\", \"3-11-2026\", and half the requests come back with the wrong dates.","ar":"نموذج الإجازة يطلب أول يوم إجازة في حقل نصي فارغ. فيكتب الموظفون «3/11» و«3 نوفمبر» و«3-11-2026»، ويعود نصف الطلبات بتواريخ خاطئة."},"prompt":{"en":"How should the form ask for the date?","ar":"كيف يطلب النموذج التاريخ لتصل كل الطلبات بتاريخ صحيح؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nafaqat","name":{"en":"Nafaqat","ar":"نفقات"},"color":"#475569","icon":"receipt","domain":"nafaqat.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"nafaqat.example/leave/new","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Leave","ar":"الإجازات"},{"en":"Expenses","ar":"المصروفات"}],"active":0},"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Leave request","ar":"طلب إجازة"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"First day off","ar":"أول يوم إجازة"},"text":"3/11","filled":true,"focus":true,"gap":"m","note":{"en":"Others typed \"Nov 3\" and \"3-11-2026\"","ar":"كتب آخرون «3 نوفمبر» و«3-11-2026»"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Days","ar":"عدد الأيام"},"text":"4","filled":true,"gap":"m"}]},"options":[{"id":"hint","text":{"en":"Keep the field and add \"Use YYYY-MM-DD\" under it","ar":"يبقى الحقل مع إضافة «استخدم الصيغة YYYY-MM-DD» تحته"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nafaqat","name":{"en":"Nafaqat","ar":"نفقات"},"color":"#475569","icon":"receipt","domain":"nafaqat.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"nafaqat.example/leave/new","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Leave","ar":"الإجازات"},{"en":"Expenses","ar":"المصروفات"}],"active":0},"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Leave request","ar":"طلب إجازة"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"First day off","ar":"أول يوم إجازة"},"text":"3/11","filled":true,"focus":true,"gap":"m","note":{"en":"Others typed \"Nov 3\" and \"3-11-2026\"","ar":"كتب آخرون «3 نوفمبر» و«3-11-2026»"},"hint":{"en":"Use YYYY-MM-DD","ar":"استخدم الصيغة YYYY-MM-DD"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Days","ar":"عدد الأيام"},"text":"4","filled":true,"gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"picker","text":{"en":"A date field that opens a calendar, like other booking forms","ar":"حقل تاريخ يفتح تقويمًا، مثل نماذج الحجز الأخرى"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nafaqat","name":{"en":"Nafaqat","ar":"نفقات"},"color":"#475569","icon":"receipt","domain":"nafaqat.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"nafaqat.example/leave/new","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Leave","ar":"الإجازات"},{"en":"Expenses","ar":"المصروفات"}],"active":0},"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Leave request","ar":"طلب إجازة"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"First day off","ar":"أول يوم إجازة"},"text":{"en":"Tue 3 Nov 2026","ar":"الثلاثاء 3 نوفمبر 2026"},"filled":true,"focus":true,"icon":"calendar-blank","gap":"m"},{"kind":"calendar","months":[{"title":{"en":"November 2026","ar":"نوفمبر 2026"},"start":0,"days":30}],"pick":[0,3],"gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Days","ar":"عدد الأيام"},"text":"4","filled":true,"gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"three","text":{"en":"Three dropdowns: year, then month, then day","ar":"ثلاث قوائم منسدلة (Dropdowns): السنة، ثم الشهر، ثم اليوم"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nafaqat","name":{"en":"Nafaqat","ar":"نفقات"},"color":"#475569","icon":"receipt","domain":"nafaqat.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"nafaqat.example/leave/new","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Leave","ar":"الإجازات"},{"en":"Expenses","ar":"المصروفات"}],"active":0},"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Leave request","ar":"طلب إجازة"}},{"kind":"row","gap":"m","blocks":[{"kind":"select","label":{"en":"Year","ar":"السنة"},"text":"2026","filled":true},{"kind":"select","label":{"en":"Month","ar":"الشهر"},"text":{"en":"November","ar":"نوفمبر"},"filled":true},{"kind":"select","label":{"en":"Day","ar":"اليوم"},"text":"3","filled":true}]},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Days","ar":"عدد الأيام"},"text":"4","filled":true,"gap":"m"}]}}],"answer":["picker"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P02-018","when":["hint","three"],"feedback":{"en":"Staff must read the rule or work through three lists before they can enter a date. A calendar is what they already use on every booking site.","ar":"على الموظفين أن يقرؤوا القاعدة أو يمرّوا بثلاث قوائم قبل أن يُدخلوا التاريخ. أما التقويم فهو ما يستخدمونه أصلًا في كل موقع حجز."}}],"hints":[{"en":"How do other sites ask you to pick a date for a trip or an appointment?","ar":"كيف تطلب منك المواقع الأخرى اختيار تاريخ لرحلة أو موعد؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Use the control people already know: a calendar.","ar":"استخدم العنصر الذي يعرفه الناس أصلًا: التقويم."},"explain":{"en":"A calendar removes the question of format, shows the weekday, and works the way staff expect from other sites.","ar":"التقويم يُنهي الحيرة حول طريقة كتابة التاريخ، ويُظهر يوم الأسبوع، ويعمل كما يتوقع الموظفون من المواقع الأخرى."},"speaker":"karim"},{"id":"S06","type":"compare","speaker":"sara","part":"contrast","skill":"SK-P02-U02-04","rules":["R11"],"value":{"en":"Consistency and standards (NN/g): choose icons that match how other sites show the same idea. Stick to the standard magnifying glass for search, so people recognise it.","ar":"الاتساق والمعايير (NN/g): اختر أيقونات تطابق طريقة المواقع الأخرى في عرض الفكرة نفسها. والتزم بالعدسة المكبّرة المعروفة للبحث، حتى يعرفها الناس."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/consistency-and-standards/","quote":"stick to the standard magnifying glass for search, so that users will easily recognize it."},"scenario":{"en":"I'm designing a travel app with a nature theme. The brand team suggested binoculars for the search button.","ar":"أصمّم تطبيقًا للسفر بطابع الطبيعة. واقترح فريق العلامة التجارية منظارًا لزر البحث."},"prompt":{"en":"Which version will people find search in?","ar":"في أيّ نسخة يجد الناس زر البحث بسرعة؟"},"a":{"label":{"en":"Version A: binoculars","ar":"النسخة A: أيقونة منظار للبحث"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"zad","name":{"en":"Zad Travel","ar":"زاد للسفر"},"color":"#6D28D9","icon":"airplane-tilt","domain":"zad.example"},"appbar":{"logo":true,"actions":[{"icon":"binoculars","aria":{"en":"Search","ar":"بحث"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"desert","size":"l"},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Weekend in Siwa","ar":"عطلة في سيوة"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"from EGP 4,900","ar":"من 4,900 جنيه"}}]}},"b":{"label":{"en":"Version B: magnifying glass","ar":"النسخة B: أيقونة عدسة مكبّرة للبحث"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"zad","name":{"en":"Zad Travel","ar":"زاد للسفر"},"color":"#6D28D9","icon":"airplane-tilt","domain":"zad.example"},"appbar":{"logo":true,"actions":[{"icon":"magnifying-glass","aria":{"en":"Search","ar":"بحث"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"desert","size":"l"},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Weekend in Siwa","ar":"عطلة في سيوة"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"from EGP 4,900","ar":"من 4,900 جنيه"}}]}},"answer":"b","misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P02-019","when":["a"],"feedback":{"en":"Binoculars fit the theme, but people scan for a magnifying glass when they want to search. Many will read the binoculars as \"explore\" or \"view\", or miss them.","ar":"المنظار يناسب الطابع، لكن الناس يبحثون بأعينهم عن العدسة المكبّرة حين يريدون البحث. وكثيرون سيفهمون المنظار على أنه «استكشف» أو «شاهد»، أو لن يلاحظوه."}}],"correct":{"en":"B: the icon people already look for.","ar":"B: الأيقونة التي يبحث عنها الناس أصلًا."},"explain":{"en":"The magnifying glass means search in almost every app people use. The nature theme can live in colours and photos, not in the icons people need to recognise.","ar":"العدسة المكبّرة تعني البحث في كل التطبيقات التي يستخدمها الناس تقريبًا. ويمكن أن يظهر طابع الطبيعة في الألوان والصور، لا في الأيقونات التي يحتاج الناس إلى معرفتها."}},{"id":"S07","type":"tune","speaker":"sara","part":"independent","skill":"SK-P02-U02-04","rules":["R14"],"value":{"en":"Consistency and standards (NN/g): conventions such as the shopping-cart icon tell people where the items they plan to buy are. A brand-themed icon breaks that link.","ar":"الاتساق والمعايير (NN/g): الأعراف مثل أيقونة عربة التسوق تخبر الناس أين المنتجات التي ينوون شراءها. والأيقونة المصمّمة على طابع العلامة التجارية تقطع هذا الربط."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/consistency-and-standards/","quote":"the shopping-cart icon shows the items you plan to purchase"},"scenario":{"en":"For a fashion shop's website, the marketing team wants the cart icon at the top to be a clothes hanger, \"to feel more like us\". There is no word next to it.","ar":"في موقع متجر ملابس، يريد فريق التسويق أن تكون أيقونة السلة في الأعلى شمّاعة ملابس، «لتشبهنا أكثر». ولا توجد كلمة بجانبها."},"prompt":{"en":"What should I recommend?","ar":"بماذا أنصح فريق التسويق ليجد الزوار السلة بسهولة؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"lamha","name":{"en":"Lamha","ar":"لمحة"},"color":"#7C3AED","icon":"t-shirt","domain":"lamha.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"lamha.example/women/dresses","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Women","ar":"نساء"},{"en":"Men","ar":"رجال"},{"en":"Kids","ar":"أطفال"}],"active":0,"actions":[{"icon":"coat-hanger","count":2,"aria":{"en":"Cart","ar":"السلة"}},{"icon":"user"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"row","blocks":[{"kind":"card","art":"shirt","blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Linen dress","ar":"فستان كتان"}},{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"EGP 890","ar":"890 جنيه"}}]},{"kind":"card","art":"shirt","blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Cotton abaya","ar":"عباية قطن"}},{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"EGP 1,150","ar":"1,150 جنيه"}}]}]}]},"options":[{"id":"hanger","text":{"en":"Use the hanger; it's memorable and fits the brand","ar":"نستخدم الشمّاعة؛ فهي مميزة وتناسب العلامة التجارية"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"lamha","name":{"en":"Lamha","ar":"لمحة"},"color":"#7C3AED","icon":"t-shirt","domain":"lamha.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"lamha.example/women/dresses","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Women","ar":"نساء"},{"en":"Men","ar":"رجال"},{"en":"Kids","ar":"أطفال"}],"active":0,"actions":[{"icon":"coat-hanger","count":2,"aria":{"en":"Cart","ar":"السلة"}},{"icon":"user"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"row","blocks":[{"kind":"card","art":"shirt","blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Linen dress","ar":"فستان كتان"}},{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"EGP 890","ar":"890 جنيه"}}]},{"kind":"card","art":"shirt","blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Cotton abaya","ar":"عباية قطن"}},{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"EGP 1,150","ar":"1,150 جنيه"}}]}]}]}},{"id":"tour","text":{"en":"Use the hanger, with a tour on the first visit that explains it","ar":"نستخدم الشمّاعة، مع جولة تعريفية في الزيارة الأولى تشرحها"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"lamha","name":{"en":"Lamha","ar":"لمحة"},"color":"#7C3AED","icon":"t-shirt","domain":"lamha.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"lamha.example/women/dresses","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Women","ar":"نساء"},{"en":"Men","ar":"رجال"},{"en":"Kids","ar":"أطفال"}],"active":0,"actions":[{"icon":"coat-hanger","count":2,"aria":{"en":"Cart","ar":"السلة"}},{"icon":"user"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"row","blocks":[{"kind":"card","art":"shirt","blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Linen dress","ar":"فستان كتان"}},{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"EGP 890","ar":"890 جنيه"}}]},{"kind":"card","art":"shirt","blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Cotton abaya","ar":"عباية قطن"}},{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"EGP 1,150","ar":"1,150 جنيه"}}]}]}],"overlay":{"type":"banner","blocks":[{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"New here? The hanger at the top is your cart.","ar":"جديد هنا؟ الشمّاعة في الأعلى هي سلّتك."}},{"kind":"link","text":{"en":"Got it","ar":"فهمت"},"gap":"xs"}]}}},{"id":"cart","text":{"en":"Keep a standard bag or cart icon with the item count, and use the brand style elsewhere","ar":"نُبقي أيقونة حقيبة أو عربة معروفة مع عدد المنتجات، ونستخدم أسلوب العلامة التجارية في مكان آخر"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"lamha","name":{"en":"Lamha","ar":"لمحة"},"color":"#7C3AED","icon":"t-shirt","domain":"lamha.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"lamha.example/women/dresses","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Women","ar":"نساء"},{"en":"Men","ar":"رجال"},{"en":"Kids","ar":"أطفال"}],"active":0,"actions":[{"icon":"shopping-bag","count":2,"aria":{"en":"Cart","ar":"السلة"}},{"icon":"user"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"row","blocks":[{"kind":"card","art":"shirt","blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Linen dress","ar":"فستان كتان"}},{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"EGP 890","ar":"890 جنيه"}}]},{"kind":"card","art":"shirt","blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Cotton abaya","ar":"عباية قطن"}},{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"EGP 1,150","ar":"1,150 جنيه"}}]}]}]}}],"answer":["cart"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P02-019","when":["hanger"],"feedback":{"en":"A hanger usually means clothes or a wardrobe. Shoppers who look for their cart won't think to tap it.","ar":"الشمّاعة تعني عادة الملابس أو خزانة الملابس. والمتسوّقون الذين يبحثون عن سلّتهم لن يفكروا في الضغط عليها."}},{"id":"MC-P02-018","when":["tour"],"feedback":{"en":"A tour teaches a new meaning that people would not need to learn with a standard icon, and most skip tours anyway.","ar":"الجولة تعلّم معنى جديدًا لا يحتاج الناس إلى تعلّمه مع أيقونة معروفة، وأغلبهم يتخطّون الجولات على أي حال."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Where do shoppers look for their cart on other shops, and what do they expect to see?","ar":"أين يبحث المتسوّقون عن سلّتهم في المتاجر الأخرى، وماذا يتوقعون أن يروا؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Keep the convention where people rely on it.","ar":"حافظ على المألوف (Convention) حين يعتمد عليه الناس."},"explain":{"en":"Shoppers bring the cart or bag icon with them from every other shop. Keeping it means they find their items at once; the brand can shine in the photos and colours.","ar":"اعتاد المتسوّقون أيقونة العربة أو الحقيبة في كل متجر آخر. والحفاظ عليها يعني أنهم يجدون منتجاتهم فورًا؛ ويمكن أن تبرز العلامة التجارية في الصور والألوان."}},{"id":"S08","type":"card","part":"recap","icons":["layers","eye","ok"],"title":{"en":"What you practised","ar":"ما تدرّبت عليه"},"body":{"en":"- **Inside your product,** one action keeps one word, one look and one place.\n- **With other products,** use the icons and controls people already know: a calendar for dates, a magnifying glass for search, a cart for the cart.\n- **Put brand style** in colours and images, not in the controls people need to recognise.\n\nNext: the skill check for this unit.","ar":"- **داخل منتجك،** يحتفظ الإجراء الواحد بكلمة واحدة وشكل واحد ومكان واحد.\n- **مع المنتجات الأخرى،** استخدم الأيقونات والعناصر التي يعرفها الناس أصلًا: تقويم للتواريخ، وعدسة مكبّرة للبحث، وعربة للسلة.\n- **ضع أسلوب العلامة التجارية** في الألوان والصور، لا في العناصر التي يحتاج الناس إلى معرفتها.\n\nالتالي: اختبار المهارة لهذه الوحدة."}}]}$uxg$::jsonb),
  ($uxg$P02-U02-L03$uxg$, $uxg$3646dcaccf098f1d792045f4d7651f80c8ad8074ff340ec7e53ba9ff14a80f0e$uxg$, $uxg${"id":"P02-U02-L03","mode":"check","minutes":6,"title":{"en":"Skill check: let people back out, and keep things the same","ar":"اختبار المهارة: دَع الناس يتراجعون، واجعل التصميم متّسقًا"},"speaker":"hana","steps":[{"id":"S01","type":"card","part":"hook","title":{"en":"Hana's gym, online","ar":"نادي هناء على الإنترنت"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"logo":true,"actions":[{"icon":"bell"}]},"tabbar":{"active":0,"items":[{"icon":"calendar-blank","text":{"en":"Classes","ar":"الحصص"}},{"icon":"ticket","text":{"en":"Bookings","ar":"حجوزاتي"}},{"icon":"user","text":{"en":"Me","ar":"حسابي"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"card","art":"gym","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"New: evening Pilates","ar":"جديد: Pilates مسائي"}},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Sun and Wed, 8 pm","ar":"الأحد والأربعاء، 8 م"}}]}]},"body":{"en":"My gym has a new website and app. Before we tell all our members, help me check four things that confused people in our first test.\n\nThis is a skill check: no hints, and you'll see how you did at the end.","ar":"للنادي الذي أملكه موقع وتطبيق جديدان. وقبل أن نخبر كل الأعضاء، ساعدني في مراجعة أربعة أشياء أربكت الناس في أول تجربة لنا.\n\nهذا اختبار مهارة: دون تلميحات، وسترى نتيجتك في النهاية."}},{"id":"S02","type":"tune","part":"check","skill":"SK-P02-U02-01","value":{"en":"Check, user control and freedom (NN/g): people need a clearly marked emergency exit. A sign-up window with only \"Start free trial\" traps people who just want to look around.","ar":"اختبار، تحكّم المستخدم وحريته (NN/g): يحتاج الناس إلى مخرج طوارئ واضح. ونافذة التسجيل التي ليس فيها إلا «ابدأ التجربة المجانية» تحبس من يريدون التصفّح فقط."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/ten-usability-heuristics/","quote":"They need a clearly marked \"emergency exit\" to leave the unwanted action without having to go through an extended process."},"scenario":{"en":"When visitors open our class timetable, a window covers it: \"Start your free week!\" Its only button is **Start free trial**. Many visitors leave the site.","ar":"حين يفتح الزوار جدول الحصص، تغطّيه نافذة: «ابدأ أسبوعك المجاني!». وزرّها الوحيد **ابدأ التجربة المجانية**. ويغادر كثير من الزوار الموقع."},"prompt":{"en":"What should the window have?","ar":"ماذا نضيف إلى النافذة ليصل الزوار إلى الجدول إن لم يريدوا العرض؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"nashat.example/timetable","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Timetable","ar":"الجدول"},{"en":"Prices","ar":"الأسعار"},{"en":"Branches","ar":"الفروع"}],"active":0},"blocks":[{"kind":"table","head":[{"en":"Time","ar":"الوقت"},{"en":"Class","ar":"الحصة"}],"rows":[["6:00 pm",{"en":"Yoga","ar":"يوغا"}],["7:00 pm","Spinning"]]}],"overlay":{"type":"dialog","blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"gym","size":"s"},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Start your free week!","ar":"ابدأ أسبوعك المجاني!"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Start free trial","ar":"ابدأ التجربة المجانية"},"gap":"m"}]}},"options":[{"id":"close","text":{"en":"A clear ✕ and a \"Just browsing\" link that opens the timetable","ar":"علامة ✕ واضحة ورابط «أتصفّح فقط» يفتح الجدول"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"nashat.example/timetable","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Timetable","ar":"الجدول"},{"en":"Prices","ar":"الأسعار"},{"en":"Branches","ar":"الفروع"}],"active":0},"blocks":[{"kind":"table","head":[{"en":"Time","ar":"الوقت"},{"en":"Class","ar":"الحصة"}],"rows":[["6:00 pm",{"en":"Yoga","ar":"يوغا"}],["7:00 pm","Spinning"]]}],"overlay":{"type":"dialog","close":true,"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"gym","size":"s"},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Start your free week!","ar":"ابدأ أسبوعك المجاني!"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Start free trial","ar":"ابدأ التجربة المجانية"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"button","style":"text","text":{"en":"Just browsing","ar":"أتصفّح فقط"},"gap":"s"}]}}},{"id":"timer","text":{"en":"Close by itself after 15 seconds","ar":"أن تُغلق وحدها بعد 15 ثانية"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"nashat.example/timetable","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Timetable","ar":"الجدول"},{"en":"Prices","ar":"الأسعار"},{"en":"Branches","ar":"الفروع"}],"active":0},"blocks":[{"kind":"table","head":[{"en":"Time","ar":"الوقت"},{"en":"Class","ar":"الحصة"}],"rows":[["6:00 pm",{"en":"Yoga","ar":"يوغا"}],["7:00 pm","Spinning"]]}],"overlay":{"type":"dialog","blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"gym","size":"s"},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Start your free week!","ar":"ابدأ أسبوعك المجاني!"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Start free trial","ar":"ابدأ التجربة المجانية"},"gap":"m","note":{"en":"Closes by itself after 15 s","ar":"تُغلق وحدها بعد 15 ثانية"}}]}}},{"id":"escape","text":{"en":"Close when people press the Esc key","ar":"أن تُغلق حين يضغط الناس مفتاح Esc"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"nashat.example/timetable","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Timetable","ar":"الجدول"},{"en":"Prices","ar":"الأسعار"},{"en":"Branches","ar":"الفروع"}],"active":0},"blocks":[{"kind":"table","head":[{"en":"Time","ar":"الوقت"},{"en":"Class","ar":"الحصة"}],"rows":[["6:00 pm",{"en":"Yoga","ar":"يوغا"}],["7:00 pm","Spinning"]]}],"overlay":{"type":"dialog","blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"gym","size":"s"},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Start your free week!","ar":"ابدأ أسبوعك المجاني!"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Start free trial","ar":"ابدأ التجربة المجانية"},"gap":"m","note":{"en":"Closes only with the Esc key","ar":"تُغلق فقط بمفتاح Esc"}}]}}}],"answer":["close"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P02-013","when":["timer","escape"],"feedback":{"en":"Visitors can't see either way out. Most won't wait 15 seconds or guess a key; they'll just leave.","ar":"لا يرى الزوار أيًّا من الطريقتين للخروج. وأغلبهم لن ينتظروا 15 ثانية ولن يخمّنوا مفتاحًا؛ بل سيغادرون ببساطة."}}],"correct":{"en":"A visible exit, in words people understand.","ar":"مخرج ظاهر، بكلمات يفهمها الناس."},"explain":{"en":"The ✕ is where people look to close a window, and \"Just browsing\" says plainly that they can skip the offer and still see the classes.","ar":"علامة ✕ هي ما يبحث عنه الناس لإغلاق النافذة، و«أتصفّح فقط» تقول بوضوح إنهم يستطيعون تخطّي العرض ورؤية الحصص."},"speaker":"hana"},{"id":"S03","type":"tune","part":"check","skill":"SK-P02-U02-02","value":{"en":"Check, user control and freedom (NN/g): support undo. A booking cancelled by a mis-tap, with its spot given away at once, can't be taken back.","ar":"اختبار، تحكّم المستخدم وحريته (NN/g): ادعم التراجع. والحجز الذي يُلغى بضغطة خاطئة، ويُعطى مكانه لغيره فورًا، لا يمكن استرجاعه."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/user-control-and-freedom/","quote":"Support undo and redo."},"scenario":{"en":"In the app, **Cancel booking** sits right under the class name. Members sometimes tap it by mistake, and their spot goes at once to the first person on the waiting list.","ar":"في التطبيق، زر **ألغِ الحجز** تحت اسم الحصة مباشرة. ويضغطه الأعضاء أحيانًا بالخطأ، فيذهب مكانهم فورًا إلى أول شخص في قائمة الانتظار."},"prompt":{"en":"What should happen after the tap?","ar":"ماذا يحدث بعد الضغطة حتى لا يخسر العضو مكانه بالخطأ؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"My bookings","ar":"حجوزاتي"}},"blocks":[{"kind":"card","blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","art":"gym","text":{"en":"Spinning · Thu 7 pm","ar":"Spinning · الخميس 7 م"},"sub":{"en":"Coach Omar · 18 of 20 spots taken","ar":"المدرّب عمر · حُجز 18 من 20 مكانًا"}},{"kind":"link","text":{"en":"Cancel booking","ar":"ألغِ الحجز"},"style":"dangerlink","gap":"xs","note":{"en":"One tap cancels and gives the spot away","ar":"ضغطة واحدة تلغي وتعطي المكان لغيرك"}}]}]},"options":[{"id":"nothing","text":{"en":"Nothing new; members should be more careful","ar":"لا شيء جديد؛ على الأعضاء أن ينتبهوا أكثر"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"My bookings","ar":"حجوزاتي"}},"blocks":[{"kind":"card","blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","art":"gym","text":{"en":"Spinning · Thu 7 pm","ar":"Spinning · الخميس 7 م"},"sub":{"en":"Coach Omar · 18 of 20 spots taken","ar":"المدرّب عمر · حُجز 18 من 20 مكانًا"}},{"kind":"link","text":{"en":"Cancel booking","ar":"ألغِ الحجز"},"style":"dangerlink","gap":"xs","note":{"en":"One tap cancels and gives the spot away","ar":"ضغطة واحدة تلغي وتعطي المكان لغيرك"}}]}]}},{"id":"undo","text":{"en":"Show \"Booking cancelled · Undo\", and hold the spot for a few seconds before passing it on","ar":"يظهر «أُلغي الحجز · تراجع»، ويبقى المكان محجوزًا بضع ثوانٍ قبل أن ينتقل لغيره"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"My bookings","ar":"حجوزاتي"}},"blocks":[{"kind":"card","blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","art":"gym","text":{"en":"Spinning · Thu 7 pm","ar":"Spinning · الخميس 7 م"},"sub":{"en":"Cancelled · your spot is held for 10 s","ar":"أُلغي · مكانك محجوز لمدة 10 ثوانٍ"}}]}],"overlay":{"type":"toast","blocks":[{"kind":"row","blocks":[{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"Booking cancelled","ar":"أُلغي الحجز"}},{"kind":"link","text":{"en":"Undo","ar":"تراجع"}}]}]}}},{"id":"rebook","text":{"en":"Let them join the waiting list again","ar":"يُتاح لهم الانضمام إلى قائمة الانتظار مرة أخرى"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"My bookings","ar":"حجوزاتي"}},"blocks":[{"kind":"card","blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","art":"gym","text":{"en":"Spinning · Thu 7 pm","ar":"Spinning · الخميس 7 م"},"sub":{"en":"Cancelled · your spot went to the waiting list","ar":"أُلغي · ذهب مكانك إلى قائمة الانتظار"}},{"kind":"button","style":"outline","text":{"en":"Join the waiting list","ar":"انضم إلى قائمة الانتظار"},"gap":"s"}]}]}}],"answer":["undo"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P02-014","when":["nothing","rebook"],"feedback":{"en":"A mis-tap shouldn't cost a member their spot. Going to the back of the waiting list doesn't give it back.","ar":"يجب ألّا تكلّف الضغطة الخاطئة العضوَ مكانه. والعودة إلى آخر قائمة الانتظار لا تعيده إليه."}}],"correct":{"en":"Give a visible undo before the change becomes final.","ar":"أعطِ تراجعًا ظاهرًا قبل أن يصبح التغيير نهائيًا."},"explain":{"en":"Holding the spot for a few seconds makes a real undo possible, and the message offers it right where the member is looking.","ar":"إبقاء المكان محجوزًا بضع ثوانٍ يجعل التراجع الحقيقي ممكنًا، والرسالة تعرضه حيث ينظر العضو."},"speaker":"hana"},{"id":"S04","type":"tune","part":"check","skill":"SK-P02-U02-03","value":{"en":"Check, consistency and standards (NN/g): internal consistency is consistency within a product. One thing with three names in three tabs makes members think they are three things.","ar":"اختبار، الاتساق والمعايير (NN/g): الاتساق الداخلي هو الاتساق داخل المنتج. والشيء الواحد بثلاثة أسماء في ثلاثة أقسام يجعل الأعضاء يظنون أنه ثلاثة أشياء."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/consistency-and-standards/","quote":"Internal consistency relates to consistency within a product or a family of products"},"scenario":{"en":"The same group workouts are called **Classes** in the timetable, **Sessions** in My bookings, and **Workouts** in the receipts.","ar":"الحصص الجماعية نفسها اسمها **حصص** في الجدول، و**جلسات** في «حجوزاتي»، و**تمارين** في الإيصالات."},"prompt":{"en":"What should I do?","ar":"ماذا أفعل؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Spinning · Thu 7 pm","ar":"Spinning · الخميس 7 م"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"tabs","options":[{"en":"Classes","ar":"حصص"},{"en":"Sessions","ar":"جلسات"},{"en":"Workouts","ar":"تمارين"}],"value":1,"note":{"en":"One thing, three names","ar":"شيء واحد بثلاثة أسماء"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"receipt","text":{"en":"Receipt: 1 workout · EGP 120","ar":"الإيصال: تمرين واحد · 120 جنيه"},"gap":"m"}]},"options":[{"id":"one","text":{"en":"Call them \"Classes\" everywhere","ar":"أسمّيها «حصصًا» في كل مكان"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Spinning · Thu 7 pm","ar":"Spinning · الخميس 7 م"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"list","style":"check","items":[{"en":"Timetable: Classes","ar":"الجدول: حصص"},{"en":"My bookings: Classes","ar":"حجوزاتي: حصص"},{"en":"Receipts: Classes","ar":"الإيصالات: حصص"}],"note":{"en":"One thing, one name","ar":"شيء واحد باسم واحد"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"receipt","text":{"en":"Receipt: 1 class · EGP 120","ar":"الإيصال: حصة واحدة · 120 جنيه"},"gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"variety","text":{"en":"Keep the variety; it makes the app sound less repetitive","ar":"أُبقي التنوّع؛ فهو يجعل التطبيق أقل تكرارًا"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Spinning · Thu 7 pm","ar":"Spinning · الخميس 7 م"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"tabs","options":[{"en":"Classes","ar":"حصص"},{"en":"Sessions","ar":"جلسات"},{"en":"Workouts","ar":"تمارين"}],"value":1,"note":{"en":"One thing, three names","ar":"شيء واحد بثلاثة أسماء"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"receipt","text":{"en":"Receipt: 1 workout · EGP 120","ar":"الإيصال: تمرين واحد · 120 جنيه"},"gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"glossary","text":{"en":"Add a help page explaining that the three words mean the same","ar":"أضيف صفحة مساعدة تشرح أن الكلمات الثلاث تعني الشيء نفسه"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Spinning · Thu 7 pm","ar":"Spinning · الخميس 7 م"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"tabs","options":[{"en":"Classes","ar":"حصص"},{"en":"Sessions","ar":"جلسات"},{"en":"Workouts","ar":"تمارين"}],"value":1,"note":{"en":"One thing, three names","ar":"شيء واحد بثلاثة أسماء"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"receipt","text":{"en":"Receipt: 1 workout · EGP 120","ar":"الإيصال: تمرين واحد · 120 جنيه"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"link","icon":"question","gap":"m","text":{"en":"Help: classes, sessions and workouts are the same thing","ar":"مساعدة: الحصص والجلسات والتمارين شيء واحد"}}]}}],"answer":["one"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P02-017","when":["variety","glossary"],"feedback":{"en":"Members will wonder if a \"session\" is a personal training slot and a \"class\" is a group one. Few will read a help page to find out.","ar":"سيتساءل الأعضاء إن كانت «الجلسة» تدريبًا شخصيًا و«الحصة» تدريبًا جماعيًا. وقليلون سيقرؤون صفحة مساعدة ليعرفوا."}}],"correct":{"en":"One name for one thing.","ar":"اسم واحد لشيء واحد."},"explain":{"en":"\"Classes\" everywhere lets members match what they booked with what they see on the timetable and the receipt, with no doubt.","ar":"«الحصص» في كل مكان تجعل الأعضاء يربطون ما حجزوه بما يرونه في الجدول والإيصال، دون أي شك."},"speaker":"hana"},{"id":"S05","type":"tune","part":"check","skill":"SK-P02-U02-04","value":{"en":"Check, consistency and standards (NN/g): the homepage link is a standard of navigation design; people expect it in the same place on every site.","ar":"اختبار، الاتساق والمعايير (NN/g): رابط الصفحة الرئيسية من معايير تصميم التنقل؛ ويتوقعه الناس في المكان نفسه في كل موقع."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/consistency-and-standards/","quote":"a standard in navigation design is the homepage link."},"scenario":{"en":"On our website, the gym's logo sits at the top of every page, but clicking it does nothing. The only Home link is in the footer.","ar":"في موقعنا، شعار النادي في أعلى كل صفحة، لكن الضغط عليه لا يفعل شيئًا. ورابط «الرئيسية» الوحيد في أسفل الصفحة."},"prompt":{"en":"What should I change?","ar":"ماذا أغيّر؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"nashat.example/prices","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Timetable","ar":"الجدول"},{"en":"Prices","ar":"الأسعار"},{"en":"Branches","ar":"الفروع"}],"active":1},"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Membership prices","ar":"أسعار الاشتراك"},"note":{"en":"Clicking the Nashat logo does nothing","ar":"الضغط على شعار نشاط لا يفعل شيئًا"}},{"kind":"row","gap":"m","blocks":[{"kind":"card","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":"Silver"},{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"EGP 600","ar":"600 جنيه"},"per":{"en":"/ month","ar":"/ شهريًا"}}]},{"kind":"card","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":"Gold"},{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"EGP 900","ar":"900 جنيه"},"per":{"en":"/ month","ar":"/ شهريًا"}}]}]},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Home · About · Contact","ar":"الرئيسية · من نحن · تواصل معنا"},"tone":"faint","gap":"l"}]},"options":[{"id":"footer","text":{"en":"Nothing; the footer link works","ar":"لا شيء؛ فرابط أسفل الصفحة يعمل"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"nashat.example/prices","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Timetable","ar":"الجدول"},{"en":"Prices","ar":"الأسعار"},{"en":"Branches","ar":"الفروع"}],"active":1},"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Membership prices","ar":"أسعار الاشتراك"},"note":{"en":"Clicking the Nashat logo does nothing","ar":"الضغط على شعار نشاط لا يفعل شيئًا"}},{"kind":"row","gap":"m","blocks":[{"kind":"card","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":"Silver"},{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"EGP 600","ar":"600 جنيه"},"per":{"en":"/ month","ar":"/ شهريًا"}}]},{"kind":"card","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":"Gold"},{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"EGP 900","ar":"900 جنيه"},"per":{"en":"/ month","ar":"/ شهريًا"}}]}]},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Home · About · Contact","ar":"الرئيسية · من نحن · تواصل معنا"},"tone":"faint","gap":"l"}]}},{"id":"logo","text":{"en":"Make the logo go to the home page, as on other sites","ar":"أجعل الضغط على الشعار يفتح الصفحة الرئيسية، كما في المواقع الأخرى"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"nashat.example/prices","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Timetable","ar":"الجدول"},{"en":"Prices","ar":"الأسعار"},{"en":"Branches","ar":"الفروع"}],"active":1},"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Membership prices","ar":"أسعار الاشتراك"},"note":{"en":"Clicking the Nashat logo now opens Home","ar":"الضغط على شعار نشاط يفتح الآن الصفحة الرئيسية"}},{"kind":"row","gap":"m","blocks":[{"kind":"card","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":"Silver"},{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"EGP 600","ar":"600 جنيه"},"per":{"en":"/ month","ar":"/ شهريًا"}}]},{"kind":"card","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":"Gold"},{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"EGP 900","ar":"900 جنيه"},"per":{"en":"/ month","ar":"/ شهريًا"}}]}]},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Home · About · Contact","ar":"الرئيسية · من نحن · تواصل معنا"},"tone":"faint","gap":"l"}]}},{"id":"button","text":{"en":"Add a big \"Home\" button in the middle of every page","ar":"أضيف زر «الرئيسية» كبيرًا في وسط كل صفحة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"nashat.example/prices","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Timetable","ar":"الجدول"},{"en":"Prices","ar":"الأسعار"},{"en":"Branches","ar":"الفروع"}],"active":1},"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Membership prices","ar":"أسعار الاشتراك"},"note":{"en":"Clicking the Nashat logo does nothing","ar":"الضغط على شعار نشاط لا يفعل شيئًا"}},{"kind":"button","icon":"house","text":{"en":"Home","ar":"الرئيسية"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"row","gap":"m","blocks":[{"kind":"card","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":"Silver"},{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"EGP 600","ar":"600 جنيه"},"per":{"en":"/ month","ar":"/ شهريًا"}}]},{"kind":"card","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":"Gold"},{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"EGP 900","ar":"900 جنيه"},"per":{"en":"/ month","ar":"/ شهريًا"}}]}]},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Home · About · Contact","ar":"الرئيسية · من نحن · تواصل معنا"},"tone":"faint","gap":"l"}]}}],"answer":["logo"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P02-018","when":["footer","button"],"feedback":{"en":"People bring the habit of clicking the logo from other sites. A link at the very bottom, or a big new button, makes them learn something new instead.","ar":"اعتاد الناس في المواقع الأخرى أن يضغطوا الشعار. والرابط في أسفل الصفحة، أو زر جديد كبير، يجعلهم يتعلّمون شيئًا جديدًا بدلًا من ذلك."}}],"correct":{"en":"Follow the habit people already have.","ar":"اتبع العادة الموجودة أصلًا لدى الناس."},"explain":{"en":"On most sites, the logo at the top is the way home. Making ours work the same means members get home without thinking.","ar":"في أغلب المواقع، الشعار في الأعلى هو طريق العودة إلى الرئيسية. وجعل شعارنا يعمل بالطريقة نفسها يعني أن الأعضاء يعودون دون تفكير."},"speaker":"hana"}]}$uxg$::jsonb),
  ($uxg$P02-U03-L01$uxg$, $uxg$c23831f24c4f5a522aa5383c95a5726956a717c56d3ecb47903803a00162a176$uxg$, $uxg${"id":"P02-U03-L01","mode":"lesson","minutes":8,"title":{"en":"Stop errors before they happen","ar":"امنع الأخطاء قبل أن تقع"},"speaker":"tarek","review_labels":{"MC-P02-020":{"en":"A warning after the mistake is too late","ar":"التحذير بعد الخطأ يأتي متأخرًا"},"MC-P02-021":{"en":"Strict formats cause the errors they reject","ar":"الصيغ الصارمة تسبّب الأخطاء التي ترفضها"},"MC-P02-022":{"en":"A vague confirmation gets a blind Yes","ar":"حين يكون سؤال التأكيد مبهمًا، يضغط الناس «نعم» دون تفكير"},"MC-P02-023":{"en":"Confirming routine actions wears people out","ar":"تأكيد الإجراءات الروتينية يُرهق الناس"}},"steps":[{"id":"S01","type":"card","part":"hook","title":{"en":"Back before she left","ar":"عادت قبل أن تسافر"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rehla","name":{"en":"Rehla","ar":"رحلة"},"color":"#7048E8","icon":"bus","domain":"rehla.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Round trip","ar":"ذهاب وعودة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"bus","text":{"en":"Cairo → Aswan","ar":"القاهرة ← أسوان"},"sub":{"en":"1 passenger","ar":"راكب واحد"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Leave","ar":"الذهاب"},"text":{"en":"Wed 12 Nov","ar":"الأربعاء 12 نوفمبر"},"filled":true,"icon":"calendar-blank","gap":"m"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Return","ar":"العودة"},"text":{"en":"Sun 2 Nov","ar":"الأحد 2 نوفمبر"},"filled":true,"icon":"calendar-blank","gap":"m","note":{"en":"Accepted, 10 days before the trip","ar":"قبِله التطبيق، مع أنه قبل الرحلة بعشرة أيام"}},{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"EGP 820","ar":"820 جنيه"},"gap":"m"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Book both trips","ar":"احجز الرحلتين"}}]},"body":{"en":"I manage a bus ticket app. Marwa booked a trip from Cairo to Aswan on the 12th, and a return on the 2nd. She meant the 22nd.\n\nThe app accepted it. She found out at the station on the 22nd, with no seat.","ar":"أدير تطبيقًا لتذاكر الحافلات. حجزت مروة رحلة من القاهرة إلى أسوان يوم 12، ورحلة عودة يوم 2. وكانت تقصد يوم 22.\n\nقبِل التطبيق الحجز. واكتشفت الخطأ في المحطة يوم 22، ولم يكن لها مقعد."}},{"id":"S02","type":"tune","part":"try","skill":"SK-P02-U03-01","rules":["R12"],"confidence":true,"value":{"en":"Try first. Preventing slips (NN/g): when clear rules define what's acceptable, constrain the input. A return can't come before the departure, so the calendar shouldn't let people pick it.","ar":"جرّب أولًا. منع الزلّات (NN/g): حين تحدّد قواعد واضحة ما هو مقبول، ضع حدودًا للإدخال. فالعودة لا يمكن أن تسبق الذهاب، لذلك لا يجب أن يسمح التقويم باختيارها."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/slips/","quote":"A helpful constraint here will force users to pick a date range that fits."},"prompt":{"en":"What would have stopped Marwa's mistake?","ar":"ما الذي كان سيمنع خطأ مروة؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rehla","name":{"en":"Rehla","ar":"رحلة"},"color":"#7048E8","icon":"bus","domain":"rehla.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Return date","ar":"تاريخ العودة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Leaving Wed 12 Nov","ar":"الذهاب الأربعاء 12 نوفمبر"}},{"kind":"calendar","months":[{"title":{"en":"November 2026","ar":"نوفمبر 2026"},"start":0,"days":30}],"pick":[0,2],"gap":"s","note":{"en":"Every day can be picked","ar":"كل الأيام قابلة للاختيار"}}]},"options":[{"id":"email","text":{"en":"Send the tickets by email so she can check them","ar":"إرسال التذاكر بالبريد لتراجعها"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rehla","name":{"en":"Rehla","ar":"رحلة"},"color":"#7048E8","icon":"bus","domain":"rehla.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Return date","ar":"تاريخ العودة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Leaving Wed 12 Nov","ar":"الذهاب الأربعاء 12 نوفمبر"}},{"kind":"calendar","months":[{"title":{"en":"November 2026","ar":"نوفمبر 2026"},"start":0,"days":30}],"pick":[0,2],"gap":"s","note":{"en":"Every day can be picked; tickets come by email after","ar":"كل الأيام قابلة للاختيار؛ وتصل التذاكر بالبريد بعدها"}}]}},{"id":"limit","text":{"en":"In the return calendar, grey out every day before the 12th","ar":"في تقويم العودة، تعطيل كل الأيام قبل يوم 12"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rehla","name":{"en":"Rehla","ar":"رحلة"},"color":"#7048E8","icon":"bus","domain":"rehla.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Return date","ar":"تاريخ العودة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Leaving Wed 12 Nov","ar":"الذهاب الأربعاء 12 نوفمبر"}},{"kind":"calendar","months":[{"title":{"en":"November 2026","ar":"نوفمبر 2026"},"start":0,"days":30}],"gap":"s","note":{"en":"Days before the 12th are greyed out","ar":"الأيام قبل يوم 12 معطّلة"},"today":[0,12]}]}},{"id":"error","text":{"en":"Show an error after she taps Book: \"Check your dates\"","ar":"إظهار خطأ بعد أن تضغط «احجز»: «راجع التواريخ»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rehla","name":{"en":"Rehla","ar":"رحلة"},"color":"#7048E8","icon":"bus","domain":"rehla.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Return date","ar":"تاريخ العودة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Leaving Wed 12 Nov","ar":"الذهاب الأربعاء 12 نوفمبر"}},{"kind":"calendar","months":[{"title":{"en":"November 2026","ar":"نوفمبر 2026"},"start":0,"days":30}],"pick":[0,2],"gap":"s","note":{"en":"Every day can be picked","ar":"كل الأيام قابلة للاختيار"}},{"kind":"banner","tone":"bad","icon":"warning-circle","text":{"en":"Check your dates","ar":"راجع التواريخ"},"gap":"m","note":{"en":"Shown after she taps Book","ar":"يظهر بعد أن تضغط «احجز»"}}]}}],"answer":["limit"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P02-020","when":["email","error"],"feedback":{"en":"Both come after the slip. An email is easy to skim past, and an error makes her fix what the app could have made impossible.","ar":"كلاهما يأتي بعد الزلّة. فالبريد قد تقرؤه بسرعة دون انتباه، ورسالة الخطأ تجعلها تُصلح خطأً كان التطبيق يستطيع منعه أصلًا."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Is a return on the 2nd ever a valid choice for a trip that leaves on the 12th?","ar":"هل العودة يوم 2 اختيار صحيح أصلًا لرحلة تبدأ يوم 12؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Make the wrong choice impossible.","ar":"اجعل الاختيار الخطأ مستحيلًا."},"explain":{"en":"If days before the departure can't be picked, the slip simply can't happen. The best error message is the one people never need to see.","ar":"إذا كانت الأيام التي قبل الذهاب غير قابلة للاختيار، فلن تقع الزلّة أصلًا. وأفضل رسالة خطأ هي التي لا يحتاج الناس إلى رؤيتها."}},{"id":"S09","type":"video","part":"concept","title":{"en":"Error prevention","ar":"منع الأخطاء (Error prevention)"},"video":"439876ad-b22f-436a-b886-7837e88486fb","duration":128,"transcript":[{"t":2.5,"en":"Now let's look at a few simple steps to anticipate slips first, the unconscious errors.","ar":"طيب، تعالى نعرف كده خطوات بسيطة نتوقّع بيها الـ Slips أولًا، أو الـ Unconscious errors."},{"t":7.5,"en":"The first guideline for anticipating slips, unconscious errors, is to provide helpful constraints,","ar":"أول Guideline محتاج تراعيه عشان تتوقّع الـ Slipping errors، أو الأخطاء الـ Unconscious: إنك تحاول توفّر Helpful constraints،"},{"t":16.56,"en":"limits that stop the user from picking, by mistake, something that isn't realistic in the first place.","ar":"أو محدّدات تساعد اليوزر إنه ما يختارش حاجة بالغلط هي أصلًا غير واقعية."},{"t":22.78,"en":"For example, when someone books anything, they're surely booking it for the future, not the past,","ar":"زي مثلًا لو هو بيحجز أي حاجة، غالبًا أو أكيد هو بيحجزها في المستقبل، مش هيبقى بيحجزها في الماضي،"},{"t":29.06,"en":"so naturally the date they enter is in the future. So you shouldn't offer them past options at all,","ar":"فطبيعي إن التاريخ اللي هو بيحطّه يكون في المستقبل. فما ينفعش إنك توفّر له أصلًا الـ Options اللي في الماضي،"},{"t":36,"en":"so that if they tap a past date by mistake, you've already prevented the error: you've made those dates dimmed, disabled,","ar":"عشان لو بالغلط اختار حاجة في الماضي أو ضغط على حاجة في الماضي بالغلط، خلاص، إنت عامل له Already error prevention: إنت عملتها Dimmed أو Disabled،"},{"t":45.48,"en":"as we see in this Airbnb example: the user enters the check-in date,","ar":"زي ما شايفين حاليًا في المثال الخاص بـ Airbnb: اليوزر بيدخّل الـ Date اللي عايز يعمل فيه Check in،"},{"t":53.58,"en":"and the design makes every past date dimmed or disabled, so if, say, they tap 14 by mistake instead of 21,","ar":"فالديزاين عمل كل التواريخ اللي فاتت Dimmed أو Disabled، بحيث إنه لو نفترض إنه داس على 14 بالغلط بدل 21،"},{"t":63.46,"en":"the system simply won't respond, because it's disabled, not clickable, it can't be picked at all.","ar":"فكده كده أصلًا السيستم مش هيستجيب، لأنه Disabled أصلًا، مش Clickable، مش قابل إنه يتم اختياره أصلًا."},{"t":70.68,"en":"And by the way, this also protects against conscious errors. Imagine the user thinks July is August,","ar":"كذلك ده بيخلّينا نتوقّى الـ Conscious errors، by the way. يعني لو إنت تصوّرت إن اليوزر برضه ممكن يفتكر إن يوليو ده هو أغسطس،"},{"t":80.84,"en":"say they want to book 10 August, and they didn't notice the words July or August,","ar":"يعني هو عايز يحجز مثلًا يوم 10 أغسطس، وهو ما شافش كلمة يوليو، وما شافش كلمة أغسطس دي،"},{"t":88.9,"en":"and assumed every date in front of them, all in black, could be picked. So they pick the 10th, without seeing which month, thinking it's 10 August,","ar":"وافترض إن كل التواريخ اللي قدّامه دي مكتوبة كلها باللون الأسود، كلها ينفع يختارها. فهو ممكن يروح يختار يوم عشرة، وهو مش شايف عشرة إيه، وهو فاكر إنه عشرة أغسطس،"},{"t":100.66,"en":"and here they've made a mistake, because you didn't account for the fact that picking those past days would be an error anyway,","ar":"فيبقى هنا وقع في Mistake، لأنك برضه ما كنتش مراعي إن الأيام اللي فاتت دي، كده كده لو اختارها هيبقى Error،"},{"t":112.54,"en":"so you open the door to errors: slips, which are usual in cases like this, or mistakes, as in this example.","ar":"فتفتح المساحة لوقوع الإيرورز، سواء الـ Slips، وده المعتاد في مثل هذه الحالات، أو الـ Mistakes زي ما ذكرنا في المثال ده."}]},{"id":"S03","type":"card","part":"concept","icons":["warn","target","ok"],"title":{"en":"Video summary","ar":"ملخص الفيديو"},"body":{"en":"The fifth heuristic: good error messages matter, but the **best designs prevent problems in the first place**.\n\n- **Slips** happen when people are on autopilot. Prevent them with limits, good defaults and forgiving formats.\n- **Mistakes** happen when the design doesn't match what people think. Prevent them by showing what they need and warning early.\n- **Confirm only serious actions,** and say exactly what will happen, so the question isn't answered without reading.","ar":"مبدأ الاستخدام (Usability heuristic) الخامس هو منع الأخطاء (Error prevention): رسائل الخطأ الجيدة مهمة، لكن **أفضل التصميمات تمنع المشكلات من البداية**.\n\n- **الزلّات (Slips)** تحدث حين يعمل الناس بحكم العادة دون تركيز. امنعها بالحدود، والقيم الافتراضية الجيدة (Defaults)، وقبول أكثر من طريقة للكتابة.\n- **الأخطاء الواعية (Mistakes)** تحدث حين لا يطابق التصميم ما يظنه الناس. امنعها بعرض ما يحتاجونه والتحذير مبكرًا.\n- **لا تطلب التأكيد إلا للإجراءات الخطيرة،** وقل بالضبط ما سيحدث، حتى لا يضغط الناس «نعم» دون قراءة."}},{"id":"S04","type":"tune","part":"guided","skill":"SK-P02-U03-01","rules":["R06"],"value":{"en":"Preventing slips (NN/g): use forgiving formatting. Clean up spaces and dashes behind the scenes instead of rejecting what people naturally type.","ar":"منع الزلّات (NN/g): استخدم صيغًا متسامحة. نظّف المسافات والشرطات خلف الكواليس بدل أن ترفض ما يكتبه الناس بشكل طبيعي."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/slips/","quote":"Do some behind-the-scenes data scrubbing to remove parentheses or other characters that users may type, rather than frustrating them with an inflexible format."},"scenario":{"en":"At checkout, the phone field rejects anything but 11 digits in a row. People type \"010 1234 5678\", get \"Invalid number\", and many give up.","ar":"في صفحة الدفع، يرفض حقل الهاتف أي شيء غير 11 رقمًا متتاليًا. فيكتب الناس «010 1234 5678»، فيظهر «رقم غير صالح»، ويترك كثيرون الشراء."},"prompt":{"en":"What should the field do?","ar":"ماذا يفعل الحقل حتى لا يتوقف الناس عند رقم الهاتف؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rehla","name":{"en":"Rehla","ar":"رحلة"},"color":"#7048E8","icon":"bus","domain":"rehla.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Checkout","ar":"الدفع"},"back":true},"keyboard":"number","blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Mobile number","ar":"رقم الموبايل"},"text":"010 1234 5678","filled":true,"error":{"en":"Invalid number","ar":"رقم غير صالح"},"focus":true},{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"EGP 820","ar":"820 جنيه"},"gap":"m"}]},"options":[{"id":"hint","text":{"en":"Keep the rule, and add \"No spaces\" under the field","ar":"تبقى القاعدة، مع إضافة «بدون مسافات» تحت الحقل"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rehla","name":{"en":"Rehla","ar":"رحلة"},"color":"#7048E8","icon":"bus","domain":"rehla.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Checkout","ar":"الدفع"},"back":true},"keyboard":"number","blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Mobile number","ar":"رقم الموبايل"},"text":"010 1234 5678","filled":true,"error":{"en":"Invalid number","ar":"رقم غير صالح"},"focus":true,"hint":{"en":"No spaces","ar":"بدون مسافات"}},{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"EGP 820","ar":"820 جنيه"},"gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"forgive","text":{"en":"Accept spaces and dashes, remove them behind the scenes, and show the number in groups as people type","ar":"يقبل المسافات والشرطات، ويحذفها خلف الكواليس، ويعرض الرقم مقسّمًا أثناء الكتابة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rehla","name":{"en":"Rehla","ar":"رحلة"},"color":"#7048E8","icon":"bus","domain":"rehla.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Checkout","ar":"الدفع"},"back":true},"keyboard":"number","blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Mobile number","ar":"رقم الموبايل"},"text":"010 1234 5678","filled":true,"focus":true,"trail":"check-circle","note":{"en":"Spaces are fine; grouped as you type","ar":"المسافات مقبولة؛ ويُقسَّم الرقم أثناء الكتابة"}},{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"EGP 820","ar":"820 جنيه"},"gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"three","text":{"en":"Split it into three boxes of 3, 4 and 4 digits","ar":"يقسّمه إلى ثلاثة مربعات من 3 و4 و4 أرقام"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rehla","name":{"en":"Rehla","ar":"رحلة"},"color":"#7048E8","icon":"bus","domain":"rehla.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Checkout","ar":"الدفع"},"back":true},"keyboard":"number","blocks":[{"kind":"row","blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Mobile number","ar":"رقم الموبايل"},"text":"010","filled":true},{"kind":"field","label":" ","text":"1234","filled":true},{"kind":"field","label":" ","text":"5678","filled":true,"focus":true}]},{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"EGP 820","ar":"820 جنيه"},"gap":"m"}]}}],"answer":["forgive"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P02-021","when":["hint","three"],"feedback":{"en":"People still have to type the way the database wants. Spaces help them check the number, and split boxes break pasting and jumping between parts.","ar":"ما زال على الناس أن يكتبوا بالطريقة التي تريدها قاعدة البيانات. والمسافات تساعدهم على مراجعة الرقم، والمربعات المقسّمة تفسد اللصق والتنقل بين الأجزاء."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Why do people type the spaces in the first place?","ar":"لماذا يكتب الناس المسافات أصلًا؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Accept what people type, and clean it up yourself.","ar":"اقبل ما يكتبه الناس، ونظّفه بنفسك."},"explain":{"en":"Groups of digits are easier to read and check, so people catch their own typos. The system can strip the spaces in a moment; the person shouldn't have to.","ar":"مجموعات الأرقام أسهل في القراءة والمراجعة، فيكتشف الناس أخطاءهم في الكتابة. ويستطيع النظام حذف المسافات في لحظة؛ فلا داعي لأن يفعل الشخص ذلك."},"speaker":"tarek"},{"id":"S05","type":"tune","part":"guided","skill":"SK-P02-U03-02","rules":["R06","R15"],"value":{"en":"Confirmation dialogs (NN/g): instead of Yes/No, give buttons that say what will happen. Naming the trip and the refund lets people catch a mistake before they confirm.","ar":"نوافذ التأكيد (NN/g): بدل «نعم/لا»، أعطِ أزرارًا تقول ما سيحدث. وذكر الرحلة والمبلغ المسترد يتيح للناس اكتشاف الخطأ قبل أن يؤكدوا."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/confirmation-dialog/","quote":"Instead of Yes/No answers, provide response options that summarize what will happen for each possible response."},"scenario":{"en":"Cancelling a ticket can't be undone, and only 80% is refunded. Right now the app asks: \"Are you sure? Yes / No\".","ar":"إلغاء التذكرة لا يمكن التراجع عنه، ولا يُسترد إلا 80% من ثمنها. والآن يسأل التطبيق: «هل أنت متأكد؟ نعم / لا»."},"prompt":{"en":"What should the confirmation say?","ar":"ماذا تقول نافذة التأكيد ليعرف الناس ما سيخسرونه قبل الإلغاء؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rehla","name":{"en":"Rehla","ar":"رحلة"},"color":"#7048E8","icon":"bus","domain":"rehla.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"My tickets","ar":"تذاكري"}},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"bus","text":{"en":"Cairo → Aswan · 12 Nov","ar":"القاهرة ← أسوان · 12 نوفمبر"},"sub":{"en":"9:00 pm · seat 14 · EGP 450","ar":"9:00 م · المقعد 14 · 450 جنيه"}}],"overlay":{"type":"dialog","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Are you sure?","ar":"هل أنت متأكد؟"}},{"kind":"row","gap":"m","blocks":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Yes","ar":"نعم"}},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"No","ar":"لا"},"style":"outline"}]}]}},"options":[{"id":"same","text":{"en":"Keep it short: \"Are you sure? Yes / No\"","ar":"يبقى قصيرًا: «هل أنت متأكد؟ نعم / لا»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rehla","name":{"en":"Rehla","ar":"رحلة"},"color":"#7048E8","icon":"bus","domain":"rehla.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"My tickets","ar":"تذاكري"}},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"bus","text":{"en":"Cairo → Aswan · 12 Nov","ar":"القاهرة ← أسوان · 12 نوفمبر"},"sub":{"en":"9:00 pm · seat 14 · EGP 450","ar":"9:00 م · المقعد 14 · 450 جنيه"}}],"overlay":{"type":"dialog","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Are you sure?","ar":"هل أنت متأكد؟"}},{"kind":"row","gap":"m","blocks":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Yes","ar":"نعم"}},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"No","ar":"لا"},"style":"outline"}]}]}}},{"id":"specific","text":{"en":"\"Cancel Cairo → Aswan, 12 Nov? You'll get EGP 360 of 450 back.\" Buttons: Cancel ticket / Keep ticket","ar":"«إلغاء رحلة القاهرة ← أسوان، 12 نوفمبر؟ سيُردّ لك 360 جنيهًا من 450». الأزرار: ألغِ التذكرة / أبقِ التذكرة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rehla","name":{"en":"Rehla","ar":"رحلة"},"color":"#7048E8","icon":"bus","domain":"rehla.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"My tickets","ar":"تذاكري"}},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"bus","text":{"en":"Cairo → Aswan · 12 Nov","ar":"القاهرة ← أسوان · 12 نوفمبر"},"sub":{"en":"9:00 pm · seat 14 · EGP 450","ar":"9:00 م · المقعد 14 · 450 جنيه"}}],"overlay":{"type":"dialog","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Cancel Cairo → Aswan, 12 Nov?","ar":"إلغاء رحلة القاهرة ← أسوان، 12 نوفمبر؟"}},{"kind":"small","gap":"s","text":{"en":"You'll get EGP 360 of 450 back.","ar":"سيُردّ لك 360 جنيهًا من 450."}},{"kind":"button","style":"danger","text":{"en":"Cancel ticket","ar":"ألغِ التذكرة"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"button","style":"outline","text":{"en":"Keep ticket","ar":"أبقِ التذكرة"},"gap":"s"}]}}},{"id":"twice","text":{"en":"Ask \"Are you sure?\" twice in a row","ar":"يسأل «هل أنت متأكد؟» مرتين متتاليتين"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rehla","name":{"en":"Rehla","ar":"رحلة"},"color":"#7048E8","icon":"bus","domain":"rehla.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"My tickets","ar":"تذاكري"}},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"bus","text":{"en":"Cairo → Aswan · 12 Nov","ar":"القاهرة ← أسوان · 12 نوفمبر"},"sub":{"en":"9:00 pm · seat 14 · EGP 450","ar":"9:00 م · المقعد 14 · 450 جنيه"}}],"overlay":{"type":"dialog","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Are you sure?","ar":"هل أنت متأكد؟"},"note":{"en":"Asked a second time","ar":"يُسأل للمرة الثانية"}},{"kind":"row","gap":"m","blocks":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Yes","ar":"نعم"}},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"No","ar":"لا"},"style":"outline"}]}]}}}],"answer":["specific"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P02-022","when":["same","twice"],"feedback":{"en":"\"Are you sure?\" doesn't say which ticket or how much money is lost, so people tap Yes out of habit. Asking twice just builds the habit faster.","ar":"«هل أنت متأكد؟» لا تقول أي تذكرة ولا كم من المال سيضيع، فيضغط الناس «نعم» بحكم العادة. والسؤال مرتين يرسّخ هذه العادة أسرع."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Could someone notice they picked the wrong ticket from the dialog as it is?","ar":"هل يستطيع أحد أن يلاحظ أنه اختار التذكرة الخطأ من النافذة بشكلها الحالي؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Name the trip, the loss and each button's result.","ar":"اذكر الرحلة والخسارة ونتيجة كل زر."},"explain":{"en":"The trip and date let people spot the wrong ticket, the refund shows what it costs, and \"Cancel ticket / Keep ticket\" makes each choice clear without reading the question again.","ar":"الرحلة والتاريخ يجعلان الناس يلاحظون التذكرة الخطأ، والمبلغ المسترد يُظهر التكلفة، و«ألغِ التذكرة / أبقِ التذكرة» تجعل كل اختيار واضحًا دون قراءة السؤال مرة أخرى."},"speaker":"tarek"},{"id":"S06","type":"compare","speaker":"karim","part":"contrast","skill":"SK-P02-U03-02","rules":["R11"],"value":{"en":"Confirmation dialogs (NN/g): don't use them for routine actions. If you cry wolf too often, people stop reading, and the dialog loses its power to prevent errors.","ar":"نوافذ التأكيد (NN/g): لا تستخدمها للإجراءات الروتينية. فإن أكثرتَ من التحذير، توقّف الناس عن القراءة، وفقدت النافذة قدرتها على منع الأخطاء."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/confirmation-dialog/","quote":"Do not use confirmation dialogs for routine actions."},"scenario":{"en":"I'm building a podcast app. People add episodes to playlists all day. Removing an episode from a playlist is easy to redo.","ar":"أبني تطبيقًا للبودكاست (Podcast). يضيف الناس الحلقات إلى قوائم التشغيل طوال اليوم. وإذا حذفوا حلقة من القائمة، فمن السهل إعادتها."},"prompt":{"en":"Which version handles removing an episode better?","ar":"أيّ نسخة تجعل حذف حلقة سريعًا ويمكن إصلاحه؟"},"a":{"label":{"en":"Version A: confirm every time","ar":"النسخة A: تأكيد في كل مرة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"naghma","name":{"en":"Naghma","ar":"نغمة"},"color":"#AE3EC9","icon":"music-notes","domain":"naghma.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Road trip","ar":"حلقات للسفر"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"music-note","text":{"en":"Start your morning","ar":"ابدأ صباحك"},"sub":"3:45"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"music-note","text":{"en":"Money talk","ar":"حديث المال"},"sub":"4:10","gap":"s"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"music-note","text":{"en":"Stories of the Nile","ar":"حكايات النيل"},"sub":"3:20","gap":"s"}],"overlay":{"type":"dialog","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Remove this episode?","ar":"حذف هذه الحلقة؟"}},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Remove","ar":"احذف"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Cancel","ar":"إلغاء"},"style":"text","gap":"s"}]}}},"b":{"label":{"en":"Version B: remove, with Undo","ar":"النسخة B: حذف فوري مع زر «تراجع»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"naghma","name":{"en":"Naghma","ar":"نغمة"},"color":"#AE3EC9","icon":"music-notes","domain":"naghma.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Road trip","ar":"حلقات للسفر"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"music-note","text":{"en":"Start your morning","ar":"ابدأ صباحك"},"sub":"3:45"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"music-note","text":{"en":"Stories of the Nile","ar":"حكايات النيل"},"sub":"3:20","gap":"s"}],"overlay":{"type":"toast","blocks":[{"kind":"row","blocks":[{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"\"Money talk\" removed","ar":"حُذفت «حديث المال»"}},{"kind":"link","text":{"en":"Undo","ar":"تراجع"}}]}]}}},"answer":"b","misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P02-023","when":["a"],"feedback":{"en":"Asking every time slows down something people do often, and they soon tap Remove without reading. Then the dialog protects nothing.","ar":"السؤال في كل مرة يبطئ شيئًا يفعله الناس كثيرًا، وسرعان ما يضغطون «احذف» دون قراءة. وحينها لا تحمي النافذة شيئًا."}}],"correct":{"en":"B: easy to fix, so no need to ask.","ar":"B: سهل الإصلاح، فلا حاجة إلى السؤال."},"explain":{"en":"A removed episode is easy to get back, so Undo is enough. Save confirmations for the rare actions that can't be taken back, so people still read them.","ar":"الحلقة المحذوفة سهلة الاسترجاع، فيكفي «تراجع». واحتفظ بالتأكيد للإجراءات النادرة التي لا يمكن التراجع عنها، حتى يظل الناس يقرؤونه."}},{"id":"S07","type":"tune","speaker":"nour","part":"independent","skill":"SK-P02-U03-01","rules":["R14"],"confidence":true,"value":{"en":"Preventing slips (NN/g): offer reasonable defaults that fit people's real goals, then let them adjust. Typing a time from scratch invites slips such as am instead of pm.","ar":"منع الزلّات (NN/g): قدّم قيمًا افتراضية معقولة تناسب أهداف الناس الحقيقية، ثم دَعهم يعدّلونها. وكتابة الوقت من الصفر تفتح الباب لزلّات مثل «صباحًا» بدل «مساءً»."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/slips/","quote":"start by offering reasonable defaults that are likely to fit their real-world goals"},"scenario":{"en":"Our clinic's app reminds patients to take their medicine. They type each reminder time by hand. Several patients set 8:00 am when they meant 8:00 pm.","ar":"يذكّر تطبيق عيادتنا المرضى بموعد الدواء. ويكتبون كل وقت تذكير بأيديهم. وضبط عدد من المرضى 8:00 صباحًا وهم يقصدون 8:00 مساءً."},"prompt":{"en":"What should the reminder screen offer?","ar":"ماذا تعرض شاشة التذكير لتمنع الخلط بين الصباح والمساء؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Medicine reminder","ar":"تذكير الدواء"},"back":true},"keyboard":"number","blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","art":"medicine","text":{"en":"Metformin 500 mg","ar":"ميتفورمين 500 مجم"},"sub":{"en":"Twice a day","ar":"مرتين يوميًا"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Reminder 1","ar":"التذكير 1"},"text":"8:00 am","filled":true,"gap":"m"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Reminder 2","ar":"التذكير 2"},"text":"8:00 am","filled":true,"focus":true,"gap":"m","note":{"en":"Meant 8:00 pm","ar":"كان يقصد 8:00 مساءً"}}]},"options":[{"id":"presets","text":{"en":"Presets that match the prescription, such as \"Twice a day: 9 am and 9 pm\", that patients can adjust","ar":"اختيارات جاهزة تطابق الوصفة، مثل «مرتين يوميًا: 9 صباحًا و9 مساءً»، يستطيع المرضى تعديلها"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Medicine reminder","ar":"تذكير الدواء"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","art":"medicine","text":{"en":"Metformin 500 mg","ar":"ميتفورمين 500 مجم"},"sub":{"en":"Twice a day","ar":"مرتين يوميًا"}},{"kind":"badge","icon":"sparkle","gap":"m","text":{"en":"Twice a day, from your prescription","ar":"مرتين يوميًا، حسب وصفتك"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"sun","text":{"en":"Morning","ar":"صباحًا"},"value":"9:00 am","chevron":true,"gap":"m"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"moon","text":{"en":"Evening","ar":"مساءً"},"value":"9:00 pm","chevron":true,"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"bold","text":{"en":"Make am and pm bigger and bolder in the field","ar":"تكبير «صباحًا» و«مساءً» وكتابتهما بخط أعرض في الحقل"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Medicine reminder","ar":"تذكير الدواء"},"back":true},"keyboard":"number","blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","art":"medicine","text":{"en":"Metformin 500 mg","ar":"ميتفورمين 500 مجم"},"sub":{"en":"Twice a day","ar":"مرتين يوميًا"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Reminder 1","ar":"التذكير 1"},"text":"8:00 AM","filled":true,"gap":"m","weight":"bold","px":18},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Reminder 2","ar":"التذكير 2"},"text":"8:00 AM","filled":true,"focus":true,"gap":"m","note":{"en":"Meant 8:00 pm","ar":"كان يقصد 8:00 مساءً"},"weight":"bold","px":18}]}},{"id":"check","text":{"en":"Ask \"Is this time right?\" after every reminder","ar":"سؤال «هل هذا الوقت صحيح؟» بعد كل تذكير"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Medicine reminder","ar":"تذكير الدواء"},"back":true},"keyboard":"number","blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","art":"medicine","text":{"en":"Metformin 500 mg","ar":"ميتفورمين 500 مجم"},"sub":{"en":"Twice a day","ar":"مرتين يوميًا"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Reminder 1","ar":"التذكير 1"},"text":"8:00 am","filled":true,"gap":"m"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Reminder 2","ar":"التذكير 2"},"text":"8:00 am","filled":true,"focus":true,"gap":"m","note":{"en":"Meant 8:00 pm","ar":"كان يقصد 8:00 مساءً"}}],"overlay":{"type":"dialog","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Is this time right?","ar":"هل هذا الوقت صحيح؟"}},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Reminder 2: 8:00 am","ar":"التذكير 2: 8:00 صباحًا"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Yes","ar":"نعم"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"button","style":"text","text":{"en":"Change","ar":"غيّر"},"gap":"s"}]}}}],"answer":["presets"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P02-020","when":["bold","check"],"feedback":{"en":"Patients still type every time by hand, so the same slip can happen. A question after each one is quickly answered without looking.","ar":"ما زال المرضى يكتبون كل وقت بأيديهم، فيمكن أن تقع الزلّة نفسها. والسؤال بعد كل تذكير يجيب عنه الناس بسرعة دون أن ينظروا."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Does the app already know how often the medicine should be taken?","ar":"هل يعرف التطبيق أصلًا كم مرة يجب أن يؤخذ الدواء؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Start from a good default.","ar":"ابدأ من قيمة افتراضية جيدة."},"explain":{"en":"The prescription already says how often. Starting from sensible times means most patients just confirm, and nobody has to type am or pm.","ar":"الوصفة تقول أصلًا كم مرة. والبدء من أوقات معقولة يعني أن أغلب المرضى يؤكدون فقط، ولا يحتاج أحد إلى كتابة «صباحًا» أو «مساءً»."}},{"id":"S08","type":"card","part":"recap","icons":["warn","target","ok"],"title":{"en":"What you practised","ar":"ما تدرّبت عليه"},"body":{"en":"- **Make wrong choices impossible** where a clear rule exists, such as a return before the departure.\n- **Start from good defaults, and accept what people type,** then clean it up yourself.\n- **Confirm only what's serious,** name what will happen, and use Undo for everyday actions.\n\nNext: don't make people remember what you can show.","ar":"- **اجعل الاختيار الخطأ مستحيلًا** حيث توجد قاعدة واضحة، مثل العودة قبل الذهاب.\n- **ابدأ من قيم افتراضية جيدة، واقبل ما يكتبه الناس،** ثم نظّفه بنفسك.\n- **لا تطلب التأكيد إلا للخطير،** واذكر ما سيحدث، واستخدم «تراجع» للإجراءات اليومية.\n\nالتالي: لا تُجبر الناس على تذكّر ما تستطيع أن تعرضه."}}]}$uxg$::jsonb),
  ($uxg$P02-U03-L02$uxg$, $uxg$def540861ab50c00a7e7f492e842032958fc8db9387fc29890208df1fa47d25b$uxg$, $uxg${"id":"P02-U03-L02","mode":"lesson","minutes":8,"title":{"en":"Show it, don't make them remember","ar":"اعرضه، ولا تجبرهم على تذكّره"},"speaker":"rami","review_labels":{"MC-P02-024":{"en":"Scrolling back up means remembering","ar":"إذا اضطر الناس إلى الصعود لأعلى، فأنت تجبرهم على التذكّر"},"MC-P02-025":{"en":"Don't make people carry details between steps","ar":"لا تجعل الناس يحفظون التفاصيل من خطوة إلى أخرى"},"MC-P02-026":{"en":"An icon alone has to be remembered","ar":"الأيقونة دون اسم تُجبر الناس على تذكّر معناها"},"MC-P02-027":{"en":"Hidden choices are forgotten choices","ar":"الاختيارات المخفية اختيارات منسية"}},"steps":[{"id":"S01","type":"card","part":"hook","title":{"en":"Which phone was that?","ar":"أيّ هاتف كان ذلك؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"volta","name":{"en":"Volta","ar":"فولتا"},"color":"#1864AB","icon":"lightning","domain":"volta.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Compare phones","ar":"قارن الهواتف"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"table","head":["","","",""],"rows":[[{"en":"Battery","ar":"البطارية"},"5000","4500","4800"],[{"en":"Weight","ar":"الوزن"},"190 g","172 g","201 g"],[{"en":"Charging","ar":"الشحن"},"33 W","25 W","45 W"],[{"en":"Price","ar":"السعر"},"14,999","18,500","12,300"]],"note":{"en":"Scrolled down: the phone names are off screen","ar":"بعد التمرير: أسماء الهواتف خارج الشاشة"}}]},"body":{"en":"I'm designing a page where people compare up to three phones. The table is long: screen, camera, battery, weight, price and more.\n\nIn our test, Adel scrolled down to the battery row, then scrolled all the way back up. He had forgotten which column was which phone.","ar":"أصمّم صفحة يقارن فيها الناس حتى ثلاثة هواتف. والجدول طويل: الشاشة، والكاميرا، والبطارية، والوزن، والسعر، وغيرها.\n\nفي تجربتنا، نزل عادل إلى صف البطارية، ثم صعد إلى أعلى الصفحة مرة أخرى. فقد نسي أيّ عمود لأيّ هاتف."}},{"id":"S02","type":"tune","part":"try","skill":"SK-P02-U03-03","rules":["R12"],"confidence":true,"value":{"en":"Try first. Recognition rather than recall (NN/g): people should not have to remember information from one part of the interface to another. Keeping the phone names fixed at the top removes the need.","ar":"جرّب أولًا. التعرّف بدل التذكّر (NN/g): لا يجب أن يضطر الناس إلى تذكّر معلومة من جزء في الواجهة إلى جزء آخر. وتثبيت أسماء الهواتف في الأعلى يلغي هذه الحاجة."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/ten-usability-heuristics/","quote":"The user should not have to remember information from one part of the interface to another."},"prompt":{"en":"What should I change?","ar":"ماذا أغيّر؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"volta","name":{"en":"Volta","ar":"فولتا"},"color":"#1864AB","icon":"lightning","domain":"volta.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Compare phones","ar":"قارن الهواتف"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"table","head":["","Nova 8","Zain X","Mada 5"],"rows":[[{"en":"Screen","ar":"الشاشة"},"6.5\"","6.1\"","6.7\""],[{"en":"Camera","ar":"الكاميرا"},"50 MP","48 MP","64 MP"],[{"en":"Battery","ar":"البطارية"},"5000","4500","4800"]],"note":{"en":"These names scroll away","ar":"هذه الأسماء تختفي مع التمرير"}}]},"options":[{"id":"sticky","text":{"en":"Keep the row with the phone names fixed at the top while people scroll","ar":"أثبّت صف أسماء الهواتف في الأعلى أثناء التمرير"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"volta","name":{"en":"Volta","ar":"فولتا"},"color":"#1864AB","icon":"lightning","domain":"volta.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Compare phones","ar":"قارن الهواتف"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"table","head":["","Nova 8","Zain X","Mada 5"],"rows":[[{"en":"Screen","ar":"الشاشة"},"6.5\"","6.1\"","6.7\""],[{"en":"Camera","ar":"الكاميرا"},"50 MP","48 MP","64 MP"],[{"en":"Battery","ar":"البطارية"},"5000","4500","4800"]],"note":{"en":"This row stays at the top as people scroll","ar":"يبقى هذا الصف في الأعلى أثناء التمرير"}}]}},{"id":"colors","text":{"en":"Give each phone a colour, explained once at the top","ar":"أعطي كل هاتف لونًا، يُشرح مرة واحدة في الأعلى"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"volta","name":{"en":"Volta","ar":"فولتا"},"color":"#1864AB","icon":"lightning","domain":"volta.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Compare phones","ar":"قارن الهواتف"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"chips","items":[{"icon":"🔵","text":"Nova 8"},{"icon":"🟢","text":"Zain X"},{"icon":"🟠","text":"Mada 5"}]},{"kind":"table","head":["","Nova 8","Zain X","Mada 5"],"rows":[[{"en":"Screen","ar":"الشاشة"},"6.5\"","6.1\"","6.7\""],[{"en":"Camera","ar":"الكاميرا"},"50 MP","48 MP","64 MP"],[{"en":"Battery","ar":"البطارية"},"5000","4500","4800"]],"note":{"en":"Names still scroll away; only colours are left","ar":"ما زالت الأسماء تختفي مع التمرير؛ ولا يبقى إلا اللون"}}]}},{"id":"short","text":{"en":"Show fewer rows so the table is shorter","ar":"أعرض صفوفًا أقل ليقصر الجدول"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"volta","name":{"en":"Volta","ar":"فولتا"},"color":"#1864AB","icon":"lightning","domain":"volta.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Compare phones","ar":"قارن الهواتف"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"table","head":["","Nova 8","Zain X","Mada 5"],"rows":[[{"en":"Screen","ar":"الشاشة"},"6.5\"","6.1\"","6.7\""],[{"en":"Camera","ar":"الكاميرا"},"50 MP","48 MP","64 MP"]],"note":{"en":"Fewer rows; the names still scroll away","ar":"صفوف أقل؛ وما زالت الأسماء تختفي مع التمرير"}}]}}],"answer":["sticky"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P02-024","when":["colors"],"feedback":{"en":"Now Adel has to remember which colour is which phone instead. He'll still scroll up to check.","ar":"الآن على عادل أن يتذكّر أيّ لون لأيّ هاتف بدلًا من ذلك. وسيظل يصعد ليتأكد."}},{"id":"MC-P02-027","when":["short"],"feedback":{"en":"Fewer rows hides details people came to compare, and the names still scroll away.","ar":"الصفوف الأقل تُخفي تفاصيل جاء الناس ليقارنوها، والأسماء ما زالت تختفي مع التمرير."}}],"hints":[{"en":"What does Adel need to see next to the battery numbers?","ar":"ماذا يحتاج عادل إلى رؤيته بجانب أرقام البطارية؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Keep the names in view.","ar":"أبقِ الأسماء ظاهرة."},"explain":{"en":"With the names always on screen, every row can be read on its own. Adel recognises the phone instead of remembering the column.","ar":"حين تبقى الأسماء على الشاشة دائمًا، يمكن قراءة كل صف وحده. فيتعرّف عادل على الهاتف بدل أن يتذكّر العمود."}},{"id":"S09","type":"video","part":"concept","title":{"en":"Recognition rather than recall","ar":"التعرّف بدل التذكّر (Recognition rather than recall)"},"video":"9895096c-9e8d-4d41-875c-84badaea03ad","duration":154,"transcript":[{"t":2.5,"en":"Let's look at examples of recognition rather than recall: comparing. Your users need to compare several products or items.","ar":"تعال نشوف أمثلة من أمثلة الـ Recognition rather than recall: الـ Compare. اليوزر عندك يبقى عنده Need إنه يقارن بين أكتر من Product أو أكتر من Item."},{"t":13.42,"en":"In this example, you're buying a new phone and want to compare its camera, processor and other features with other phones.","ar":"في المثال ده، إنت بتشتري Mobile phone جديد، وعايز تقارن الكاميرا بتاعته والـ Processor، وباقي الـ Features بتاعته، بموبايلات تانية."},{"t":21.42,"en":"As a designer, you have one of two ways to help. First: just let people open each phone's page and see its details,","ar":"عندك حل من اتنين كديزاينر عشان تساعد اليوزر يقوم بالمهمة دي. أولًا: إنك عادي تخلّيه يدخل على صفحة الموبايل يشوف الـ Details بتاعته،"},{"t":31.42,"en":"then leave and open another phone, and start recalling the first phone's details to compare them with the second.","ar":"وبعد كده يطلع ويدخل على موبايل تاني، ويبدأ يفتكر، يعمل Recall للمعلومات بتاعة الموبايل الأولاني، ويقارنها بالموبايل التاني."},{"t":40.42,"en":"That relies on recall, and it's not the best. The second way is to offer comparison features like this one,","ar":"وده طبعًا بيعتمد على الـ Recall، ومش أحسن حاجة. الحل التاني إنك توفّر Comparison features زي ده،"},{"t":46.42,"en":"as GSM Arena does: it lets people compare phones side by side, so they recognise the data.","ar":"زي حالة GSM Arena: بيوفّر لليوزر إنه يعمل مقارنة بين الموبايلات، ويبقى بيعمل Recognition للداتا."},{"t":56.42,"en":"Want to see the body, the weight, or which takes two SIM cards? One look at the information and they recognise it.","ar":"عايز يشوف الـ Body عامل إزاي، أو الـ Weight، أو مين فيه شريحتين ومين شريحة واحدة، ومجرد ما يبص على المعلومة خلاص بيعمل لها Recognition."},{"t":70.42,"en":"But there's a problem in this design. Look at the website with me and try to work out what it is.","ar":"طيب، فيه مشكلة في التصميم ده. عايزكم تبصّوا معايا على الـ Website وتحاولوا تفكّروا إيه هي المشكلة."},{"t":76.42,"en":"I'm looking at the phones and scrolling. What's the problem, according to recognition rather than recall?","ar":"أنا دلوقتي هبص على الموبايلات وبعمل Scrolling. تفتكر إيه المشكلة في الـ Recognition rather than recall، According للـ Heuristic ده؟"},{"t":86.42,"en":"I'm looking at the features, say the battery, and now I have to remember which was the first phone, the second and the third,","ar":"أنا بصّيت هنا على الـ Features أو على الـ Battery مثلًا، وهنا محتاج أفتكر: مين كان أول موبايل، ومين كان تاني موبايل، ومين كان تالت موبايل،"},{"t":96.42,"en":"or keep scrolling up and down, up and down. Usability will certainly suffer.","ar":"وإلا أضطر أطلع فوق وأنزل تحت، أطلع فوق وأنزل تحت. فالـ Usability بلا شك هتتأثّر."},{"t":104.42,"en":"Let me show you another example that does this better: Mailchimp's pricing plans.","ar":"تعالوا أوريكم مثال تاني قدّم المهمة دي بشكل أنجح، وهو Mailchimp في الـ Pricing plans بتاعته."},{"t":114.42,"en":"It also gives me a comparison, but when I scroll it doesn't do what GSM Arena did, where I lose track of which column is which.","ar":"بص هنا، هو برضو بيدّيني مقارنة، ولما بعمل Scroll ما عملش زي GSM Arena، إني خلاص ما بقيتش عارف أول Column ده كان إيه وتالت Column كان إيه."},{"t":128.42,"en":"No, it fixes the titles, the headers of the comparison table. So all the way down I can see: this is Premium, this is Standard, this is Essentials.","ar":"لأ، هو هنا عمل Fixation، ثبّت الـ Titles أو الـ Headers بتاعة الـ Table الخاص بالمقارنة. فطول ما أنا ماشي في المقارنة، شايف: دي الـ Premium، ودي حاجات الـ Standard، ودي حاجات الـ Essentials."},{"t":144.42,"en":"These are the kinds of ways to achieve recognition rather than recall.","ar":"وما إلى ذلك من الوسائل اللي بتحقّق الـ Recognition rather than recall."}]},{"id":"S03","type":"card","part":"concept","icons":["eye","list","idea"],"title":{"en":"Video summary","ar":"ملخص الفيديو"},"body":{"en":"The sixth heuristic: **reduce people's memory load by making things visible**. Recognising something you see is much easier than recalling it from memory.\n\n- **Keep needed information in view,** such as table headers, chosen filters and the search words.\n- **Let people pick from options** rather than type from memory: menus, suggestions, recent items.\n- **Pair icons with labels,** because only a few icons are understood by everyone.","ar":"مبدأ الاستخدام (Usability heuristic) السادس هو التعرّف بدل التذكّر (Recognition rather than recall): **خفّف العبء على ذاكرة الناس بجعل الأشياء ظاهرة**. فالتعرّف على شيء تراه أسهل بكثير من تذكّره.\n\n- **أبقِ المعلومات المطلوبة ظاهرة،** مثل عناوين الجدول، والفلاتر المختارة، وكلمات البحث.\n- **دَع الناس يختارون من خيارات** بدل أن يكتبوا من الذاكرة: القوائم، والاقتراحات، وآخر ما استخدموه.\n- **ضع اسمًا مع كل أيقونة،** لأن عددًا قليلًا فقط من الأيقونات يفهمه الجميع."}},{"id":"S04","type":"tune","part":"guided","skill":"SK-P02-U03-03","rules":["R06"],"value":{"en":"Preventing mistakes (NN/g): in multistep tasks, display the contextual information people need instead of making them keep it in memory between steps.","ar":"منع الأخطاء الواعية (NN/g): في المهام متعددة الخطوات، اعرض المعلومات التي يحتاجها الناس بدل أن تجبرهم على حفظها في الذاكرة بين الخطوات."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/user-mistakes/","quote":"strive to display the contextual information that users need to complete a task."},"scenario":{"en":"On the same shop, buying a phone has three steps. Step 1 shows the colour and storage people chose. On step 3, they choose an insurance plan whose price depends on that phone, but the phone isn't shown any more.","ar":"في المتجر نفسه، لشراء الهاتف ثلاث خطوات. الخطوة 1 تعرض اللون والسعة التي اختارها الناس. وفي الخطوة 3، يختارون خطة تأمين يعتمد سعرها على هذا الهاتف، لكن الهاتف لم يعد ظاهرًا."},"prompt":{"en":"What should step 3 show?","ar":"ماذا تعرض الخطوة 3 ليختار الناس التأمين المناسب لهاتفهم؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"volta","name":{"en":"Volta","ar":"فولتا"},"color":"#1864AB","icon":"lightning","domain":"volta.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Protect your phone","ar":"احمِ هاتفك"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"progress","value":100,"label":{"en":"Step 3 of 3","ar":"الخطوة 3 من 3"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"shield-check","text":{"en":"Screen cover","ar":"تغطية الشاشة"},"value":{"en":"EGP 690 / yr","ar":"690 جنيه / سنويًا"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"shield-check","text":{"en":"Full cover","ar":"تغطية كاملة"},"value":{"en":"EGP 1,490 / yr","ar":"1,490 جنيه / سنويًا"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Price depends on the phone you chose in step 1","ar":"السعر يعتمد على الهاتف الذي اخترته في الخطوة 1"},"tone":"faint","gap":"m"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Continue","ar":"متابعة"}}]},"options":[{"id":"summary","text":{"en":"A short summary at the top: \"Phone X · Blue · 256 GB · EGP 18,500\"","ar":"ملخص قصير في الأعلى: «هاتف X · أزرق · 256 GB · 18,500 جنيه»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"volta","name":{"en":"Volta","ar":"فولتا"},"color":"#1864AB","icon":"lightning","domain":"volta.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Protect your phone","ar":"احمِ هاتفك"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"progress","value":100,"label":{"en":"Step 3 of 3","ar":"الخطوة 3 من 3"}},{"kind":"listitem","art":"phone","text":{"en":"Phone X · Blue · 256 GB","ar":"هاتف X · أزرق · 256 GB"},"value":{"en":"EGP 18,500","ar":"18,500 جنيه"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"shield-check","text":{"en":"Screen cover","ar":"تغطية الشاشة"},"value":{"en":"EGP 690 / yr","ar":"690 جنيه / سنويًا"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"shield-check","text":{"en":"Full cover","ar":"تغطية كاملة"},"value":{"en":"EGP 1,490 / yr","ar":"1,490 جنيه / سنويًا"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Price depends on the phone you chose in step 1","ar":"السعر يعتمد على الهاتف الذي اخترته في الخطوة 1"},"tone":"faint","gap":"m"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Continue","ar":"متابعة"}}]}},{"id":"back","text":{"en":"A \"Back to step 1\" link to check the phone","ar":"رابط «عُد إلى الخطوة 1» لمراجعة الهاتف"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"volta","name":{"en":"Volta","ar":"فولتا"},"color":"#1864AB","icon":"lightning","domain":"volta.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Protect your phone","ar":"احمِ هاتفك"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"progress","value":100,"label":{"en":"Step 3 of 3","ar":"الخطوة 3 من 3"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"shield-check","text":{"en":"Screen cover","ar":"تغطية الشاشة"},"value":{"en":"EGP 690 / yr","ar":"690 جنيه / سنويًا"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"shield-check","text":{"en":"Full cover","ar":"تغطية كاملة"},"value":{"en":"EGP 1,490 / yr","ar":"1,490 جنيه / سنويًا"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Price depends on the phone you chose in step 1","ar":"السعر يعتمد على الهاتف الذي اخترته في الخطوة 1"},"tone":"faint","gap":"m"},{"kind":"link","icon":"arrow-left","gap":"s","text":{"en":"Back to step 1","ar":"عُد إلى الخطوة 1"}}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Continue","ar":"متابعة"}}]}},{"id":"nothing","text":{"en":"Nothing; people just chose it a minute ago","ar":"لا شيء؛ فقد اختاره الناس قبل دقيقة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"volta","name":{"en":"Volta","ar":"فولتا"},"color":"#1864AB","icon":"lightning","domain":"volta.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Protect your phone","ar":"احمِ هاتفك"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"progress","value":100,"label":{"en":"Step 3 of 3","ar":"الخطوة 3 من 3"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"shield-check","text":{"en":"Screen cover","ar":"تغطية الشاشة"},"value":{"en":"EGP 690 / yr","ar":"690 جنيه / سنويًا"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"shield-check","text":{"en":"Full cover","ar":"تغطية كاملة"},"value":{"en":"EGP 1,490 / yr","ar":"1,490 جنيه / سنويًا"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Price depends on the phone you chose in step 1","ar":"السعر يعتمد على الهاتف الذي اخترته في الخطوة 1"},"tone":"faint","gap":"m"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Continue","ar":"متابعة"}}]}}],"answer":["summary"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P02-025","when":["back","nothing"],"feedback":{"en":"People get interrupted, or compare two phones before buying. Going back, or trusting their memory, invites a wrong insurance choice.","ar":"يُقاطَع الناس، أو يقارنون هاتفين قبل الشراء. والعودة إلى الخلف، أو الاعتماد على الذاكرة، يفتح الباب لاختيار تأمين خاطئ."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Imagine the buyer got a phone call between step 1 and step 3.","ar":"تخيّل أن المشتري تلقّى مكالمة هاتفية بين الخطوة 1 والخطوة 3."}],"correct":{"en":"Bring the details to the step that needs them.","ar":"اعرض التفاصيل في الخطوة التي تحتاجها."},"explain":{"en":"The summary puts the phone right next to the plan that depends on it, so people decide by looking, not remembering.","ar":"الملخص يضع الهاتف بجانب الخطة التي تعتمد عليه، فيقرّر الناس بالنظر، لا بالتذكّر."},"speaker":"rami"},{"id":"S05","type":"tune","part":"guided","skill":"SK-P02-U03-04","rules":["R06"],"value":{"en":"Recognition rather than recall (NN/g): information needed to use the design, such as labels and menu items, should be visible. Icons without labels must be remembered or tapped to find out.","ar":"التعرّف بدل التذكّر (NN/g): المعلومات اللازمة لاستخدام التصميم، مثل الأسماء وعناصر القوائم، يجب أن تكون ظاهرة. والأيقونات دون أسماء يجب تذكّرها أو الضغط عليها لمعرفتها."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/ten-usability-heuristics/","quote":"Information required to use the design (e.g. field labels or menu items) should be visible or easily retrievable when needed."},"scenario":{"en":"Our shop's app has five icons in the bottom bar, with no words: a house, a grid, a heart, a box and a person. People keep opening the wrong one to find their orders.","ar":"في تطبيق متجرنا خمس أيقونات في الشريط السفلي، دون كلمات: بيت، وشبكة مربعات، وقلب، وصندوق، وشخص. والناس يفتحون الأيقونة الخطأ باستمرار ليجدوا طلباتهم."},"prompt":{"en":"What should I change?","ar":"ماذا أغيّر؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"logo":true,"actions":[{"icon":"bell"}]},"tabbar":{"active":0,"items":[{"icon":"house"},{"icon":"squares-four"},{"icon":"heart"},{"icon":"package"},{"icon":"user"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"searchbar","text":{"en":"Search Dar","ar":"ابحث في دار"}},{"kind":"card","art":"earbuds","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Earbuds week","ar":"أسبوع السماعات"}}],"gap":"m"}]},"options":[{"id":"labels","text":{"en":"Put a short word under each icon: Home, Shop, Saved, Orders, Account","ar":"أضع كلمة قصيرة تحت كل أيقونة: الرئيسية، والمتجر، والمحفوظات، والطلبات، والحساب"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"logo":true,"actions":[{"icon":"bell"}]},"tabbar":{"active":0,"items":[{"icon":"house","text":{"en":"Home","ar":"الرئيسية"}},{"icon":"squares-four","text":{"en":"Shop","ar":"المتجر"}},{"icon":"heart","text":{"en":"Saved","ar":"المحفوظات"}},{"icon":"package","text":{"en":"Orders","ar":"الطلبات"}},{"icon":"user","text":{"en":"Account","ar":"الحساب"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"searchbar","text":{"en":"Search Dar","ar":"ابحث في دار"}},{"kind":"card","art":"earbuds","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Earbuds week","ar":"أسبوع السماعات"}}],"gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"tour","text":{"en":"Show a tour that explains the icons on first launch","ar":"أعرض جولة تشرح الأيقونات عند أول تشغيل"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"logo":true,"actions":[{"icon":"bell"}]},"tabbar":{"active":0,"items":[{"icon":"house"},{"icon":"squares-four"},{"icon":"heart"},{"icon":"package"},{"icon":"user"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"searchbar","text":{"en":"Search Dar","ar":"ابحث في دار"}},{"kind":"card","art":"earbuds","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Earbuds week","ar":"أسبوع السماعات"}}],"gap":"m"}],"overlay":{"type":"dialog","blocks":[{"kind":"icon","icon":"package","size":"l","color":"brand"},{"kind":"heading","gap":"s","text":{"en":"The box is your Orders","ar":"الصندوق هو طلباتك"}},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Tour 4 of 5","ar":"الجولة 4 من 5"}},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Next","ar":"التالي"},"gap":"m"}]}}},{"id":"hold","text":{"en":"Show each icon's name when people press and hold it","ar":"أُظهر اسم كل أيقونة حين يضغط الناس عليها مطولًا"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"logo":true,"actions":[{"icon":"bell"}]},"tabbar":{"active":0,"items":[{"icon":"house"},{"icon":"squares-four"},{"icon":"heart"},{"icon":"package"},{"icon":"user"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"searchbar","text":{"en":"Search Dar","ar":"ابحث في دار"}},{"kind":"card","art":"earbuds","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Earbuds week","ar":"أسبوع السماعات"}}],"gap":"m","note":{"en":"Names show only when people press and hold an icon","ar":"تظهر الأسماء فقط حين يضغط الناس مطوّلًا على الأيقونة"}}]}}],"answer":["labels"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P02-026","when":["tour","hold"],"feedback":{"en":"Both still ask people to remember what each icon means, or to find out by testing. A word under the icon answers it every single time.","ar":"كلاهما ما زال يطلب من الناس أن يتذكّروا معنى كل أيقونة، أو يكتشفوه بالتجربة. أما الكلمة تحت الأيقونة فتجيب في كل مرة."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Which of these icons could mean more than one thing?","ar":"أيّ هذه الأيقونات قد تعني أكثر من شيء واحد؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Show the label with the icon.","ar":"اعرض الاسم مع الأيقونة."},"explain":{"en":"A box could be orders, deliveries or storage; a heart could be saved items or health. With a word under each one, people recognise the right tab at a glance.","ar":"الصندوق قد يعني الطلبات أو التوصيل أو التخزين؛ والقلب قد يعني المحفوظات أو الصحة. ومع كلمة تحت كل أيقونة، يتعرّف الناس على القسم الصحيح من نظرة."},"speaker":"rami"},{"id":"S06","type":"compare","speaker":"mona","part":"contrast","skill":"SK-P02-U03-03","rules":["R11"],"value":{"en":"Recognition rather than recall (NN/g): promote recognition by making information visible and easy to reach. Chosen filters shown at the top of the results keep people from forgetting them.","ar":"التعرّف بدل التذكّر (NN/g): ادعم التعرّف بجعل المعلومات ظاهرة وسهلة الوصول. والفلاتر المختارة المعروضة أعلى النتائج تمنع الناس من نسيانها."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/recognition-and-recall/","quote":"How do you promote recognition? By making information and interface functions visible and easily accessible."},"scenario":{"en":"My team makes a shoe shop app. Filters open in a side panel. Once it closes, the results show nothing about which filters are on.","ar":"يصنع فريقي تطبيقًا لمتجر أحذية. تُفتح الفلاتر في لوحة جانبية. وبعد أن تُغلق، لا تُظهر النتائج شيئًا عن الفلاتر المفعّلة."},"prompt":{"en":"Which results screen is better?","ar":"أيّ شاشة نتائج تُذكّر الناس بالفلاتر التي اختاروها؟"},"a":{"label":{"en":"Version A: filters hidden","ar":"النسخة A: الفلاتر مخفية"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Dar · Shoes","ar":"دار · أحذية"},"back":true,"actions":[{"icon":"faders"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"12 results","ar":"12 نتيجة"}},{"kind":"row","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"card","art":"sneakers","blocks":[{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"EGP 1,450","ar":"1,450 جنيه"}}]},{"kind":"card","art":"sneakers","blocks":[{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"EGP 1,890","ar":"1,890 جنيه"}}]}]}]}},"b":{"label":{"en":"Version B: filters shown","ar":"النسخة B: الفلاتر ظاهرة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Dar · Shoes","ar":"دار · أحذية"},"back":true,"actions":[{"icon":"faders"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"chips","items":[{"text":{"en":"Size 42","ar":"مقاس 42"},"x":true},{"text":{"en":"Running","ar":"جري"},"x":true},{"text":{"en":"Under EGP 2,000","ar":"أقل من 2,000 جنيه"},"x":true}]},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"12 results","ar":"12 نتيجة"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"row","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"card","art":"sneakers","blocks":[{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"EGP 1,450","ar":"1,450 جنيه"}}]},{"kind":"card","art":"sneakers","blocks":[{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"EGP 1,890","ar":"1,890 جنيه"}}]}]}]}},"answer":"b","misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P02-027","when":["a"],"feedback":{"en":"Coming back the next day, people see only 12 shoes and think that's all the shop has. They've forgotten the filters they set.","ar":"حين يعود الناس في اليوم التالي، يرون 12 حذاءً فقط ويظنون أن هذا كل ما في المتجر. فقد نسوا الفلاتر التي اختاروها."}}],"correct":{"en":"B: people can see what's narrowing the results.","ar":"B: يرى الناس ما الذي يضيّق النتائج."},"explain":{"en":"The chips show every active filter and remove it in one tap. Nobody has to remember what they chose or open the panel to check.","ar":"الشرائح (Chips) تُظهر كل فلتر مفعّل، وتحذفه بضغطة واحدة. فلا يحتاج أحد إلى أن يتذكّر ما اختاره أو يفتح اللوحة ليتأكد."}},{"id":"S07","type":"tune","speaker":"youssef","part":"independent","skill":"SK-P02-U03-04","rules":["R14"],"value":{"en":"Recognition rather than recall (NN/g): lists of recently viewed items help people finish a purchase they started days ago, without remembering the product's name.","ar":"التعرّف بدل التذكّر (NN/g): قوائم العناصر التي شوهدت مؤخرًا تساعد الناس على إكمال شراء بدؤوه قبل أيام، دون أن يتذكّروا اسم المنتج."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/recognition-and-recall/","quote":"These lists help users remember to finish a purchase that they may have started a few days ago."},"scenario":{"en":"Customers in my tools shop often look at a product, leave, and come back days later to buy it. Many call me because they can't find it again: they don't remember its name.","ar":"عملاء متجر الأدوات عندي كثيرًا ما ينظرون إلى منتج، ثم يغادرون، ويعودون بعد أيام ليشتروه. ويتصل بي كثيرون لأنهم لا يجدونه مرة أخرى: فهم لا يتذكّرون اسمه."},"prompt":{"en":"What would help them most?","ar":"ما الذي يساعدهم أكثر على إيجاد المنتج مرة أخرى؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"logo":true,"actions":[{"icon":"magnifying-glass"},{"icon":"shopping-cart"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"card","art":"washing-machine","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Washers week","ar":"أسبوع الغسالات"}}]},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Departments","ar":"الأقسام"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"chips","items":[{"text":{"en":"Tools","ar":"أدوات"}},{"text":{"en":"Kitchen","ar":"المطبخ"}},{"text":{"en":"Shoes","ar":"أحذية"}}]},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Nothing here shows the drill she looked at on Monday","ar":"لا شيء هنا يُظهر المثقاب الذي شاهدته يوم الإثنين"},"tone":"faint","gap":"m"}]},"options":[{"id":"recent","text":{"en":"A \"Recently viewed\" row with photos on the home page","ar":"صف «شوهدت مؤخرًا» بالصور في الصفحة الرئيسية"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"logo":true,"actions":[{"icon":"magnifying-glass"},{"icon":"shopping-cart"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"card","art":"washing-machine","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Washers week","ar":"أسبوع الغسالات"}}]},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Recently viewed","ar":"شوهدت مؤخرًا"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"row","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"card","art":"box","blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Electric drill 650 W","ar":"مثقاب كهربائي 650 وات"}},{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"EGP 1,250","ar":"1,250 جنيه"}}]},{"kind":"card","art":"box","blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Pipe wrench","ar":"مفتاح مواسير"}},{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"EGP 210","ar":"210 جنيه"}}]}]},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Departments","ar":"الأقسام"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"chips","items":[{"text":{"en":"Tools","ar":"أدوات"}},{"text":{"en":"Kitchen","ar":"المطبخ"}},{"text":{"en":"Shoes","ar":"أحذية"}}]}]}},{"id":"search","text":{"en":"A bigger search box on the home page","ar":"مربع بحث أكبر في الصفحة الرئيسية"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"logo":true,"actions":[{"icon":"magnifying-glass"},{"icon":"shopping-cart"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"searchbar","size":"l","text":{"en":"Search Dar","ar":"ابحث في دار"}},{"kind":"card","art":"washing-machine","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Washers week","ar":"أسبوع الغسالات"}}],"gap":"m"},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Departments","ar":"الأقسام"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"chips","items":[{"text":{"en":"Tools","ar":"أدوات"}},{"text":{"en":"Kitchen","ar":"المطبخ"}},{"text":{"en":"Shoes","ar":"أحذية"}}]},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Nothing here shows the drill she looked at on Monday","ar":"لا شيء هنا يُظهر المثقاب الذي شاهدته يوم الإثنين"},"tone":"faint","gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"email","text":{"en":"Tell them to note product names before leaving","ar":"أن أطلب منهم تدوين أسماء المنتجات قبل المغادرة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"logo":true,"actions":[{"icon":"magnifying-glass"},{"icon":"shopping-cart"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"card","art":"washing-machine","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Washers week","ar":"أسبوع الغسالات"}}]},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Departments","ar":"الأقسام"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"chips","items":[{"text":{"en":"Tools","ar":"أدوات"}},{"text":{"en":"Kitchen","ar":"المطبخ"}},{"text":{"en":"Shoes","ar":"أحذية"}}]},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Nothing here shows the drill she looked at on Monday","ar":"لا شيء هنا يُظهر المثقاب الذي شاهدته يوم الإثنين"},"tone":"faint","gap":"m","note":{"en":"Customers are told to write product names down","ar":"يُطلب من العملاء تدوين أسماء المنتجات"}}]}}],"answer":["recent"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P02-026","when":["search","email"],"feedback":{"en":"Search needs the name they've forgotten, and writing names down puts the memory work back on the customer.","ar":"البحث يحتاج إلى الاسم الذي نسوه، وتدوين الأسماء يعيد عبء التذكّر على العميل."}}],"hints":[{"en":"What do customers still remember about the product, even without its name?","ar":"ماذا يتذكّر العملاء عن المنتج، حتى دون اسمه؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Show them what they saw, so they can recognise it.","ar":"اعرض عليهم ما رأوه، ليتعرّفوا عليه."},"explain":{"en":"Customers may forget a name but they know the drill when they see its photo. The row turns a hard memory task into a quick glance.","ar":"قد ينسى العملاء الاسم، لكنهم يعرفون المثقاب حين يرون صورته. والصف يحوّل مهمة تذكّر صعبة إلى نظرة سريعة."}},{"id":"S08","type":"card","part":"recap","icons":["eye","list","idea"],"title":{"en":"What you practised","ar":"ما تدرّبت عليه"},"body":{"en":"- **Keep what people need in view:** fixed headers, a summary of earlier choices, visible filters.\n- **Let people pick, not recall:** recent items, suggestions and menus.\n- **Words with icons,** because most icons can mean more than one thing.\n\nNext: the skill check for this unit.","ar":"- **أبقِ ما يحتاجه الناس ظاهرًا:** عناوين ثابتة، وملخص للاختيارات السابقة، وفلاتر ظاهرة.\n- **دَع الناس يختارون بدل أن يتذكّروا:** آخر ما شاهدوه، والاقتراحات، والقوائم.\n- **كلمات مع الأيقونات،** لأن أغلب الأيقونات قد تعني أكثر من شيء.\n\nالتالي: اختبار المهارة لهذه الوحدة."}}]}$uxg$::jsonb),
  ($uxg$P02-U03-L03$uxg$, $uxg$e8c510cc4d9579f1f8ec5884cb0ca93e7ea36c1c2e8ee78f124c58fd71263b1c$uxg$, $uxg${"id":"P02-U03-L03","mode":"check","minutes":6,"title":{"en":"Skill check: stop errors early, and don't make people remember","ar":"اختبار المهارة: امنع الأخطاء مبكرًا، ولا تُجبر الناس على التذكّر"},"speaker":"sara","steps":[{"id":"S01","type":"card","part":"hook","title":{"en":"Sara's travel site","ar":"موقع سارة للسفر"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"zad","name":{"en":"Zad Travel","ar":"زاد للسفر"},"color":"#6D28D9","icon":"airplane-tilt","domain":"zad.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"zad.example","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Flights","ar":"طيران"},{"en":"Hotels","ar":"فنادق"},{"en":"My trips","ar":"رحلاتي"}],"active":0,"actions":[{"icon":"user"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"beach","size":"m"},{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Where to next?","ar":"إلى أين وجهتك القادمة؟"},"gap":"m"}]},"body":{"en":"I'm redesigning a travel booking website. Our support team listed the four problems people call about most. Help me pick a fix for each.\n\nThis is a skill check: no hints, and you'll see how you did at the end.","ar":"أعيد تصميم موقع لحجز السفر. وقد جمع فريق الدعم أكثر أربع مشكلات يتصل بسببها الناس. ساعدني في اختيار إصلاح لكل منها.\n\nهذا اختبار مهارة: دون تلميحات، وسترى نتيجتك في النهاية."}},{"id":"S02","type":"tune","part":"check","skill":"SK-P02-U03-01","value":{"en":"Check, preventing slips (NN/g): suggestions can stop slips before people make them. A destination box that suggests places as people type avoids misspellings that return nothing.","ar":"اختبار، منع الزلّات (NN/g): الاقتراحات تستطيع منع الزلّات قبل أن يقع فيها الناس. ومربع الوجهة الذي يقترح أماكن أثناء الكتابة يمنع الأخطاء الإملائية التي لا تُرجع شيئًا."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/slips/","quote":"suggestions can preempt many slips before the user has the opportunity to make them."},"scenario":{"en":"People type their destination in a plain text box. \"Sharm El Shiekh\" or \"Hurgada\" return \"No hotels found\", and many think we have no hotels there.","ar":"يكتب الناس وجهتهم في مربع نص عادي. فإذا كتبوا «شرم الشيح» أو «الغردقه»، يظهر «لا توجد فنادق»، فيظن كثيرون أنه لا فنادق لدينا هناك."},"prompt":{"en":"What should the destination box do?","ar":"ماذا يفعل مربع الوجهة ليصل الناس إلى الفنادق حتى لو أخطؤوا في الإملاء؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"zad","name":{"en":"Zad Travel","ar":"زاد للسفر"},"color":"#6D28D9","icon":"airplane-tilt","domain":"zad.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"zad.example/hotels?q=Sharm+El+Shiekh","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Flights","ar":"طيران"},{"en":"Hotels","ar":"فنادق"},{"en":"My trips","ar":"رحلاتي"}],"active":1},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Destination","ar":"الوجهة"},"text":{"en":"Sharm El Shiekh","ar":"شرم الشيح"},"filled":true,"icon":"map-pin"},{"kind":"icon","icon":"magnifying-glass-minus","size":"l","gap":"l"},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"No hotels found","ar":"لا توجد فنادق"},"gap":"s"}]},"options":[{"id":"suggest","text":{"en":"Suggest matching places after the first few letters, so people pick one","ar":"يقترح الأماكن المطابقة بعد أول بضعة أحرف، فيختار الناس واحدًا"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"zad","name":{"en":"Zad Travel","ar":"زاد للسفر"},"color":"#6D28D9","icon":"airplane-tilt","domain":"zad.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"zad.example/hotels","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Flights","ar":"طيران"},{"en":"Hotels","ar":"فنادق"},{"en":"My trips","ar":"رحلاتي"}],"active":1},"blocks":[{"kind":"searchbar","text":{"en":"Shar","ar":"شرم"},"filled":true,"focus":true,"suggest":[{"icon":"map-pin","text":{"en":"Sharm El Sheikh","ar":"شرم الشيخ"},"value":{"en":"214 hotels","ar":"214 فندقًا"}},{"icon":"map-pin","text":{"en":"Sharjah","ar":"الشارقة"},"value":{"en":"96 hotels","ar":"96 فندقًا"}}]}]}},{"id":"hint","text":{"en":"Add \"Check your spelling\" to the No hotels message","ar":"يضيف «راجع الإملاء» إلى رسالة «لا توجد فنادق»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"zad","name":{"en":"Zad Travel","ar":"زاد للسفر"},"color":"#6D28D9","icon":"airplane-tilt","domain":"zad.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"zad.example/hotels?q=Sharm+El+Shiekh","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Flights","ar":"طيران"},{"en":"Hotels","ar":"فنادق"},{"en":"My trips","ar":"رحلاتي"}],"active":1},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Destination","ar":"الوجهة"},"text":{"en":"Sharm El Shiekh","ar":"شرم الشيح"},"filled":true,"icon":"map-pin"},{"kind":"icon","icon":"magnifying-glass-minus","size":"l","gap":"l"},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"No hotels found","ar":"لا توجد فنادق"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"small","gap":"s","text":{"en":"Check your spelling.","ar":"راجع الإملاء."}}]}},{"id":"list","text":{"en":"Replace it with a dropdown of all 300 destinations","ar":"تحلّ محله قائمة منسدلة (Dropdown) بكل الوجهات الثلاثمئة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"zad","name":{"en":"Zad Travel","ar":"زاد للسفر"},"color":"#6D28D9","icon":"airplane-tilt","domain":"zad.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"zad.example/hotels","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Flights","ar":"طيران"},{"en":"Hotels","ar":"فنادق"},{"en":"My trips","ar":"رحلاتي"}],"active":1},"blocks":[{"kind":"select","label":{"en":"Destination","ar":"الوجهة"},"text":{"en":"Choose a destination","ar":"اختر وجهة"},"icon":"map-pin","focus":true,"note":{"en":"300 destinations, A to Z","ar":"300 وجهة، أبجديًا"}}]}}],"answer":["suggest"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P02-020","when":["hint"],"feedback":{"en":"The message comes after the failed search, and people may not even see what they misspelled.","ar":"الرسالة تأتي بعد فشل البحث، وقد لا يرى الناس أصلًا الكلمة التي أخطؤوا فيها."}},{"id":"MC-P02-027","when":["list"],"feedback":{"en":"Scrolling 300 names is slow and easy to get wrong, especially on a phone.","ar":"التمرير بين 300 اسم بطيء، والخطأ فيه سهل، خاصة على الهاتف."}}],"correct":{"en":"Suggest the right spelling before the search runs.","ar":"اقترح الكتابة الصحيحة قبل أن يبدأ البحث."},"explain":{"en":"After \"Shar\", people see \"Sharm El Sheikh\" and tap it. The spelling slip never reaches the search.","ar":"بعد «شر»، يرى الناس «شرم الشيخ» فيضغطونها. فلا تصل الزلّة الإملائية إلى البحث أبدًا."},"speaker":"sara"},{"id":"S03","type":"tune","part":"check","skill":"SK-P02-U03-02","value":{"en":"Check, confirmation dialogs (NN/g): use one before actions with serious consequences, and make it specific. Cancelling a whole trip with four bookings and fees deserves a clear, named confirmation.","ar":"اختبار، نوافذ التأكيد (NN/g): استخدمها قبل الإجراءات ذات العواقب الكبيرة، واجعلها محددة. وإلغاء رحلة كاملة فيها أربعة حجوزات ورسوم يستحق تأكيدًا واضحًا يذكر التفاصيل."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/confirmation-dialog/","quote":"Use a confirmation dialog before committing to actions with serious consequences"},"scenario":{"en":"In **My trips**, a small **Cancel trip** link cancels the flight, the hotel, the car and the tour in one tap. Some fees can't be refunded.","ar":"في **رحلاتي**، رابط صغير **ألغِ الرحلة** يلغي الطيران والفندق والسيارة والجولة بضغطة واحدة. وبعض الرسوم لا تُسترد."},"prompt":{"en":"What should happen when people tap it?","ar":"ماذا يحدث حين يضغطه الناس حتى لا يخسروا مالًا بالخطأ؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"zad","name":{"en":"Zad Travel","ar":"زاد للسفر"},"color":"#6D28D9","icon":"airplane-tilt","domain":"zad.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"My trips","ar":"رحلاتي"}},"blocks":[{"kind":"card","art":"city-night","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Dubai · 12–16 Nov","ar":"دبي · من 12 إلى 16 نوفمبر"}},{"kind":"list","style":"check","items":[{"en":"Flight","ar":"الطيران"},{"en":"Hotel, 4 nights","ar":"الفندق، 4 ليالٍ"},{"en":"Car","ar":"السيارة"},{"en":"Desert tour","ar":"جولة الصحراء"}]},{"kind":"link","text":{"en":"Cancel trip","ar":"ألغِ الرحلة"},"style":"dangerlink","gap":"s","note":{"en":"One tap cancels all 4","ar":"ضغطة واحدة تلغي الأربعة"}}]}]},"options":[{"id":"none","text":{"en":"Cancel at once; people know what they tapped","ar":"يُلغى فورًا؛ فالناس يعرفون ما ضغطوه"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"zad","name":{"en":"Zad Travel","ar":"زاد للسفر"},"color":"#6D28D9","icon":"airplane-tilt","domain":"zad.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"My trips","ar":"رحلاتي"}},"blocks":[{"kind":"card","art":"city-night","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Dubai · 12–16 Nov","ar":"دبي · من 12 إلى 16 نوفمبر"}},{"kind":"list","style":"check","items":[{"en":"Flight","ar":"الطيران"},{"en":"Hotel, 4 nights","ar":"الفندق، 4 ليالٍ"},{"en":"Car","ar":"السيارة"},{"en":"Desert tour","ar":"جولة الصحراء"}]},{"kind":"link","text":{"en":"Cancel trip","ar":"ألغِ الرحلة"},"style":"dangerlink","gap":"s","note":{"en":"One tap cancels all 4","ar":"ضغطة واحدة تلغي الأربعة"}}]}]}},{"id":"vague","text":{"en":"Ask \"Are you sure?\" with Yes and No","ar":"يسأل «هل أنت متأكد؟» مع «نعم» و«لا»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"zad","name":{"en":"Zad Travel","ar":"زاد للسفر"},"color":"#6D28D9","icon":"airplane-tilt","domain":"zad.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"My trips","ar":"رحلاتي"}},"blocks":[{"kind":"card","art":"city-night","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Dubai · 12–16 Nov","ar":"دبي · من 12 إلى 16 نوفمبر"}},{"kind":"list","style":"check","items":[{"en":"Flight","ar":"الطيران"},{"en":"Hotel, 4 nights","ar":"الفندق، 4 ليالٍ"},{"en":"Car","ar":"السيارة"},{"en":"Desert tour","ar":"جولة الصحراء"}]},{"kind":"link","text":{"en":"Cancel trip","ar":"ألغِ الرحلة"},"style":"dangerlink","gap":"s","note":{"en":"One tap cancels all 4","ar":"ضغطة واحدة تلغي الأربعة"}}]}],"overlay":{"type":"dialog","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Are you sure?","ar":"هل أنت متأكد؟"}},{"kind":"row","gap":"m","blocks":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Yes","ar":"نعم"}},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"No","ar":"لا"},"style":"outline"}]}]}}},{"id":"named","text":{"en":"Ask \"Cancel your Dubai trip, 12 to 16 Nov? This cancels 4 bookings; EGP 1,200 in fees can't be refunded.\" Buttons: Cancel trip / Keep trip","ar":"يسأل «إلغاء رحلتك إلى دبي، من 12 إلى 16 نوفمبر؟ ستُلغى 4 حجوزات؛ ولا تُسترد رسوم قدرها 1,200 جنيه». الأزرار: ألغِ الرحلة / أبقِ الرحلة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"zad","name":{"en":"Zad Travel","ar":"زاد للسفر"},"color":"#6D28D9","icon":"airplane-tilt","domain":"zad.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"My trips","ar":"رحلاتي"}},"blocks":[{"kind":"card","art":"city-night","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Dubai · 12–16 Nov","ar":"دبي · من 12 إلى 16 نوفمبر"}},{"kind":"list","style":"check","items":[{"en":"Flight","ar":"الطيران"},{"en":"Hotel, 4 nights","ar":"الفندق، 4 ليالٍ"},{"en":"Car","ar":"السيارة"},{"en":"Desert tour","ar":"جولة الصحراء"}]},{"kind":"link","text":{"en":"Cancel trip","ar":"ألغِ الرحلة"},"style":"dangerlink","gap":"s","note":{"en":"One tap cancels all 4","ar":"ضغطة واحدة تلغي الأربعة"}}]}],"overlay":{"type":"dialog","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Cancel your Dubai trip, 12 to 16 Nov?","ar":"إلغاء رحلتك إلى دبي، من 12 إلى 16 نوفمبر؟"}},{"kind":"small","gap":"s","text":{"en":"This cancels 4 bookings. EGP 1,200 in fees can't be refunded.","ar":"ستُلغى 4 حجوزات. ولا تُسترد رسوم قدرها 1,200 جنيه."}},{"kind":"button","style":"danger","text":{"en":"Cancel trip","ar":"ألغِ الرحلة"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"button","style":"outline","text":{"en":"Keep trip","ar":"أبقِ الرحلة"},"gap":"s"}]}}}],"answer":["named"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P02-020","when":["none"],"feedback":{"en":"One mis-tap would cancel four bookings and cost real money, and it can't be taken back.","ar":"ضغطة خاطئة واحدة ستلغي أربعة حجوزات وتكلّف مالًا حقيقيًا، ولا يمكن التراجع عنها."}},{"id":"MC-P02-022","when":["vague"],"feedback":{"en":"\"Are you sure?\" doesn't say which trip, how many bookings or what's lost, so people tap Yes without checking.","ar":"«هل أنت متأكد؟» لا تقول أي رحلة، ولا كم حجزًا، ولا ما الذي سيضيع، فيضغط الناس «نعم» دون مراجعة."}}],"correct":{"en":"Confirm, and spell out what will be lost.","ar":"اطلب التأكيد، واذكر بوضوح ما سيضيع."},"explain":{"en":"This action is serious and can't be undone, so it's worth a pause. The trip, the number of bookings and the fees let people see the cost before they decide.","ar":"هذا الإجراء خطير ولا يمكن التراجع عنه، فيستحق وقفة. والرحلة وعدد الحجوزات والرسوم تُري الناس التكلفة قبل أن يقرّروا."},"speaker":"sara"},{"id":"S04","type":"tune","part":"check","skill":"SK-P02-U03-03","value":{"en":"Check, preventing mistakes (NN/g): imagine people are interrupted after every step. The seat map should show which flight it's for, so nobody has to remember.","ar":"اختبار، منع الأخطاء الواعية (NN/g): تخيّل أن الناس يُقاطَعون بعد كل خطوة. ويجب أن تُظهر خريطة المقاعد الرحلة التي تخصّها، حتى لا يحتاج أحد إلى التذكّر."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/user-mistakes/","quote":"A good approach is to imagine that your users could be interrupted by a phone call after every step in a multistep process."},"scenario":{"en":"For a round trip, people choose seats on two maps, one after the other. The maps look the same, and nothing says which flight each one is for. Some people pick a window seat for the wrong flight.","ar":"في رحلة الذهاب والعودة، يختار الناس المقاعد على خريطتين، واحدة بعد الأخرى. والخريطتان متشابهتان، ولا يوضّح شيء لأيّ رحلة كلٌّ منهما. فيختار بعض الناس مقعدًا بجانب النافذة في الرحلة الخطأ."},"prompt":{"en":"What should each seat map show?","ar":"ماذا تعرض كل خريطة ليعرف الناس لأيّ رحلة يختارون المقعد؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"zad","name":{"en":"Zad Travel","ar":"زاد للسفر"},"color":"#6D28D9","icon":"airplane-tilt","domain":"zad.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Choose seats","ar":"اختر المقاعد"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"seatmap","rows":6,"cols":6,"aisle":3,"taken":[[0,1],[1,4],[2,2],[4,5]],"picked":[[3,0]]},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Map 1 of 2","ar":"الخريطة 1 من 2"},"gap":"s","note":{"en":"Map 2 looks the same","ar":"الخريطة 2 تبدو مثلها"}}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Next","ar":"التالي"}}]},"options":[{"id":"title","text":{"en":"A title above it: \"Cairo → Dubai · 12 Nov · 9:40 am\"","ar":"عنوان فوقها: «القاهرة ← دبي · 12 نوفمبر · 9:40 صباحًا»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"zad","name":{"en":"Zad Travel","ar":"زاد للسفر"},"color":"#6D28D9","icon":"airplane-tilt","domain":"zad.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Choose seats","ar":"اختر المقاعد"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Cairo → Dubai · 12 Nov · 9:40 am","ar":"القاهرة ← دبي · 12 نوفمبر · 9:40 صباحًا"}},{"kind":"seatmap","rows":6,"cols":6,"aisle":3,"taken":[[0,1],[1,4],[2,2],[4,5]],"picked":[[3,0]],"gap":"s"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Next","ar":"التالي"}}]}},{"id":"counter","text":{"en":"\"Map 1 of 2\" and \"Map 2 of 2\"","ar":"«الخريطة 1 من 2» و«الخريطة 2 من 2»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"zad","name":{"en":"Zad Travel","ar":"زاد للسفر"},"color":"#6D28D9","icon":"airplane-tilt","domain":"zad.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Choose seats","ar":"اختر المقاعد"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"seatmap","rows":6,"cols":6,"aisle":3,"taken":[[0,1],[1,4],[2,2],[4,5]],"picked":[[3,0]]},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Map 1 of 2","ar":"الخريطة 1 من 2"},"gap":"s","note":{"en":"Says which map, not which flight","ar":"يقول أي خريطة، لا أي رحلة"}}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Next","ar":"التالي"}}]}},{"id":"before","text":{"en":"A note before the maps: \"The first map is your outbound flight\"","ar":"ملاحظة قبل الخريطتين: «الخريطة الأولى لرحلة الذهاب»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"zad","name":{"en":"Zad Travel","ar":"زاد للسفر"},"color":"#6D28D9","icon":"airplane-tilt","domain":"zad.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Choose seats","ar":"اختر المقاعد"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"The first map is your outbound flight.","ar":"الخريطة الأولى لرحلة الذهاب."},"note":{"en":"Said once, before the maps","ar":"تُقال مرة واحدة، قبل الخريطتين"}},{"kind":"seatmap","rows":6,"cols":6,"aisle":3,"taken":[[0,1],[1,4],[2,2],[4,5]],"picked":[[3,0]],"gap":"m"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Map 1 of 2","ar":"الخريطة 1 من 2"},"gap":"s","note":{"en":"Map 2 looks the same","ar":"الخريطة 2 تبدو مثلها"}}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Next","ar":"التالي"}}]}}],"answer":["title"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P02-025","when":["counter","before"],"feedback":{"en":"People still have to remember that map 1 means the outbound flight. After a phone call or a coffee, that's easy to mix up.","ar":"ما زال على الناس أن يتذكّروا أن الخريطة 1 تعني رحلة الذهاب. وبعد مكالمة أو فنجان قهوة، يسهل الخلط."}}],"correct":{"en":"Put the flight right on the map.","ar":"ضع الرحلة على الخريطة نفسها."},"explain":{"en":"With the route, date and time on each map, people can tell the flights apart at any moment, even if they left and came back.","ar":"مع المسار والتاريخ والوقت على كل خريطة، يميّز الناس بين الرحلتين في أي لحظة، حتى لو غادروا ثم عادوا."},"speaker":"sara"},{"id":"S05","type":"tune","part":"check","skill":"SK-P02-U03-04","value":{"en":"Check, recognition rather than recall (NN/g): recent searches help people resume tasks they may struggle to recall. Travellers repeat the same routes; let them pick them.","ar":"اختبار، التعرّف بدل التذكّر (NN/g): عمليات البحث الحديثة تساعد الناس على استئناف مهام قد يصعب عليهم تذكّرها. والمسافرون يكرّرون المسارات نفسها؛ فدَعهم يختارونها."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/recognition-and-recall/","quote":"Providing access to the pages recently visited and searches performed in the near past can help users resume tasks"},"scenario":{"en":"Many customers search the same trip several times before they book: same cities, dates and number of travellers. Each time, they fill in the whole search form again.","ar":"يبحث كثير من العملاء عن الرحلة نفسها عدة مرات قبل أن يحجزوا: المدن نفسها والتواريخ نفسها وعدد المسافرين نفسه. وفي كل مرة، يملؤون نموذج البحث كله من جديد."},"prompt":{"en":"What should I add?","ar":"ماذا أضيف حتى لا يملأ العملاء النموذج كله في كل مرة؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"zad","name":{"en":"Zad Travel","ar":"زاد للسفر"},"color":"#6D28D9","icon":"airplane-tilt","domain":"zad.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"zad.example/flights","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Flights","ar":"طيران"},{"en":"Hotels","ar":"فنادق"}],"active":0},"blocks":[{"kind":"row","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"From","ar":"من"},"text":""},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"To","ar":"إلى"},"text":""},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Dates","ar":"التواريخ"},"text":"","icon":"calendar-blank"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Travellers","ar":"المسافرون"},"text":""}]},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Search flights","ar":"ابحث عن رحلات"},"gap":"m","note":{"en":"Empty every time, even on the 4th search","ar":"فارغ في كل مرة، حتى في البحث الرابع"}}]},"options":[{"id":"recent","text":{"en":"\"Recent searches\" under the search form, each one ready to run again in a tap","ar":"«عمليات البحث الأخيرة» تحت نموذج البحث، ويمكن إعادة كل منها بضغطة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"zad","name":{"en":"Zad Travel","ar":"زاد للسفر"},"color":"#6D28D9","icon":"airplane-tilt","domain":"zad.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"zad.example/flights","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Flights","ar":"طيران"},{"en":"Hotels","ar":"فنادق"}],"active":0},"blocks":[{"kind":"row","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"From","ar":"من"},"text":""},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"To","ar":"إلى"},"text":""},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Dates","ar":"التواريخ"},"text":"","icon":"calendar-blank"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Travellers","ar":"المسافرون"},"text":""}]},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Search flights","ar":"ابحث عن رحلات"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Recent searches","ar":"عمليات البحث الأخيرة"},"gap":"l"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"clock-counter-clockwise","text":{"en":"Cairo → Dubai · 12–16 Nov · 2 travellers","ar":"القاهرة ← دبي · من 12 إلى 16 نوفمبر · مسافران"},"value":{"en":"Search","ar":"ابحث"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"clock-counter-clockwise","text":{"en":"Cairo → Jeddah · 3–10 Dec · 2 travellers","ar":"القاهرة ← جدة · من 3 إلى 10 ديسمبر · مسافران"},"value":{"en":"Search","ar":"ابحث"},"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"save","text":{"en":"A \"Save this search\" button people can use if they remember to","ar":"زر «احفظ هذا البحث» يستخدمه الناس إن تذكّروا"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"zad","name":{"en":"Zad Travel","ar":"زاد للسفر"},"color":"#6D28D9","icon":"airplane-tilt","domain":"zad.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"zad.example/flights","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Flights","ar":"طيران"},{"en":"Hotels","ar":"فنادق"}],"active":0},"blocks":[{"kind":"row","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"From","ar":"من"},"text":""},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"To","ar":"إلى"},"text":""},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Dates","ar":"التواريخ"},"text":"","icon":"calendar-blank"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Travellers","ar":"المسافرون"},"text":""}]},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Search flights","ar":"ابحث عن رحلات"},"gap":"m","note":{"en":"Empty every time, even on the 4th search","ar":"فارغ في كل مرة، حتى في البحث الرابع"}},{"kind":"button","style":"outline","icon":"bookmark-simple","text":{"en":"Save this search","ar":"احفظ هذا البحث"},"gap":"s","note":{"en":"Only if people remember to tap it","ar":"فقط إن تذكّر الناس الضغط عليه"}}]}},{"id":"email","text":{"en":"Email people their search details after each search","ar":"إرسال تفاصيل البحث بالبريد بعد كل بحث"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"zad","name":{"en":"Zad Travel","ar":"زاد للسفر"},"color":"#6D28D9","icon":"airplane-tilt","domain":"zad.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"zad.example/flights","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Flights","ar":"طيران"},{"en":"Hotels","ar":"فنادق"}],"active":0},"blocks":[{"kind":"row","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"From","ar":"من"},"text":""},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"To","ar":"إلى"},"text":""},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Dates","ar":"التواريخ"},"text":"","icon":"calendar-blank"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Travellers","ar":"المسافرون"},"text":""}]},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Search flights","ar":"ابحث عن رحلات"},"gap":"m","note":{"en":"Details go by email; the form is still empty","ar":"تصل التفاصيل بالبريد؛ والنموذج ما زال فارغًا"}}]}}],"answer":["recent"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P02-027","when":["save","email"],"feedback":{"en":"Both depend on people planning ahead or digging through their inbox. Recent searches are there without any effort.","ar":"كلاهما يعتمد على أن يخطّط الناس مسبقًا أو يبحثوا في بريدهم. أما عمليات البحث الأخيرة فموجودة دون أي جهد."}}],"correct":{"en":"Show what they searched, ready to pick.","ar":"اعرض ما بحثوا عنه، جاهزًا للاختيار."},"explain":{"en":"People recognise \"Cairo → Dubai, 12 to 16 Nov, 2 adults\" at once and tap it, instead of filling in five fields again from memory.","ar":"يتعرّف الناس فورًا على «القاهرة ← دبي، من 12 إلى 16 نوفمبر، بالغان» فيضغطونها، بدل ملء خمسة حقول مرة أخرى من الذاكرة."},"speaker":"sara"}]}$uxg$::jsonb),
  ($uxg$P02-U04-L01$uxg$, $uxg$ba7666db6b0133af12aaf01fdf16ca2d62f9fc9178df589840989916ef2416d6$uxg$, $uxg${"id":"P02-U04-L01","mode":"lesson","minutes":8,"title":{"en":"Speed up the people who come back","ar":"سرّع من يعودون كثيرًا"},"speaker":"youssef","review_labels":{"MC-P02-028":{"en":"One at a time doesn't scale","ar":"التعديل واحدًا تلو الآخر لا ينفع مع الأعداد الكبيرة"},"MC-P02-029":{"en":"A shortcut nobody finds doesn't help","ar":"الاختصار الذي لا يجده أحد لا يساعد"},"MC-P02-030":{"en":"Don't make regulars repeat the beginner path","ar":"لا تجبر المعتادين على تكرار خطوات المبتدئين"},"MC-P02-031":{"en":"Use what you already know about people","ar":"استخدم ما تعرفه أصلًا عن الناس"}},"steps":[{"id":"S01","type":"card","part":"hook","title":{"en":"Fifty prices, one by one","ar":"خمسون سعرًا، واحدًا واحدًا"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"dar.example/seller/products/paint-roller-23cm","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Products","ar":"المنتجات"},{"en":"Orders","ar":"الطلبات"},{"en":"Reports","ar":"التقارير"}],"active":0,"actions":[{"icon":"user"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Edit product","ar":"تعديل منتج"}},{"kind":"listitem","art":"box","text":{"en":"Paint roller, 23 cm","ar":"رولة دهان، 23 سم"},"sub":{"en":"Product 7 of 50 to update","ar":"المنتج 7 من 50 للتحديث"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Price","ar":"السعر"},"text":{"en":"EGP 120","ar":"120 جنيه"},"filled":true,"focus":true,"gap":"m"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Save","ar":"احفظ"},"gap":"m"}]},"body":{"en":"Every month my supplier raises prices, and I update my shop. In my dashboard, that means opening each product, editing the price and saving it.\n\nLast month it was 50 products. It took me a whole evening, and I made two typos.","ar":"كل شهر يرفع المورّد الأسعار، فأحدّث متجري. وفي لوحة التحكم، يعني هذا فتح كل منتج، وتعديل سعره، وحفظه.\n\nفي الشهر الماضي كانت المنتجات 50. أخذ ذلك مني مساءً كاملًا، وأخطأت في الكتابة مرتين."}},{"id":"S02","type":"tune","part":"try","skill":"SK-P02-U04-02","rules":["R12"],"confidence":true,"value":{"en":"Try first. Flexibility and efficiency (NN/g): flexible systems let people choose the method that works best for them. Someone changing 50 prices needs a way to change them together.","ar":"جرّب أولًا. المرونة والكفاءة (NN/g): الأنظمة المرنة تتيح للناس اختيار الطريقة الأنسب لهم. ومن يغيّر 50 سعرًا يحتاج إلى طريقة لتغييرها معًا."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/flexibility-efficiency-heuristic/","quote":"Flexible systems are efficient because people can choose the method that works best for them."},"prompt":{"en":"What would help me most?","ar":"ما الذي يساعدني أكثر على تحديث الأسعار بسرعة ودون أخطاء؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"dar.example/seller/products","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Products","ar":"المنتجات"},{"en":"Orders","ar":"الطلبات"},{"en":"Reports","ar":"التقارير"}],"active":0},"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Products (50)","ar":"المنتجات (50)"}},{"kind":"listitem","art":"box","text":{"en":"Paint roller, 23 cm","ar":"رولة دهان، 23 سم"},"value":{"en":"EGP 120","ar":"120 جنيه"},"chevron":true,"gap":"m"},{"kind":"listitem","art":"box","text":{"en":"Pipe wrench","ar":"مفتاح مواسير"},"value":{"en":"EGP 210","ar":"210 جنيه"},"chevron":true,"gap":"s"},{"kind":"listitem","art":"box","text":{"en":"Garden hose 20 m","ar":"خرطوم حديقة 20 م"},"value":{"en":"EGP 340","ar":"340 جنيه"},"chevron":true,"gap":"s","note":{"en":"Each price is edited one by one","ar":"كل سعر يُعدّل وحده"}}]},"options":[{"id":"bulk","text":{"en":"Select many products and raise all their prices at once, by an amount or a %","ar":"أختار منتجات كثيرة وأرفع أسعارها كلها مرة واحدة، بمبلغ أو بنسبة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"dar.example/seller/products","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Products","ar":"المنتجات"},{"en":"Orders","ar":"الطلبات"},{"en":"Reports","ar":"التقارير"}],"active":0},"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Products (50)","ar":"المنتجات (50)"}},{"kind":"listitem","art":"box","text":{"en":"Paint roller, 23 cm","ar":"رولة دهان، 23 سم"},"value":{"en":"EGP 120","ar":"120 جنيه"},"gap":"m","check":true},{"kind":"listitem","art":"box","text":{"en":"Pipe wrench","ar":"مفتاح مواسير"},"value":{"en":"EGP 210","ar":"210 جنيه"},"gap":"s","check":true},{"kind":"listitem","art":"box","text":{"en":"Garden hose 20 m","ar":"خرطوم حديقة 20 م"},"value":{"en":"EGP 340","ar":"340 جنيه"},"gap":"s","check":true}],"overlay":{"type":"dialog","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Raise prices of 3 products","ar":"ارفع أسعار 3 منتجات"}},{"kind":"segmented","options":[{"en":"By amount","ar":"بمبلغ"},{"en":"By %","ar":"بنسبة"}],"value":1,"gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Raise by","ar":"ارفع بمقدار"},"text":"10%","filled":true,"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Apply to 3 products","ar":"طبّق على 3 منتجات"},"gap":"m"}]}}},{"id":"faster","text":{"en":"Make the product edit page load faster","ar":"أن تُفتح صفحة تعديل المنتج أسرع"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"dar.example/seller/products","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Products","ar":"المنتجات"},{"en":"Orders","ar":"الطلبات"},{"en":"Reports","ar":"التقارير"}],"active":0},"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Products (50)","ar":"المنتجات (50)"}},{"kind":"listitem","art":"box","text":{"en":"Paint roller, 23 cm","ar":"رولة دهان، 23 سم"},"value":{"en":"EGP 120","ar":"120 جنيه"},"chevron":true,"gap":"m"},{"kind":"listitem","art":"box","text":{"en":"Pipe wrench","ar":"مفتاح مواسير"},"value":{"en":"EGP 210","ar":"210 جنيه"},"chevron":true,"gap":"s"},{"kind":"listitem","art":"box","text":{"en":"Garden hose 20 m","ar":"خرطوم حديقة 20 م"},"value":{"en":"EGP 340","ar":"340 جنيه"},"chevron":true,"gap":"s","note":{"en":"Still edited one by one; the page just opens faster","ar":"ما زال كل سعر يُعدّل وحده؛ الصفحة تُفتح أسرع فقط"}}]}},{"id":"next","text":{"en":"Add a \"Save and open next product\" button","ar":"إضافة زر «احفظ وافتح المنتج التالي»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"dar.example/seller/products/112/edit","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Products","ar":"المنتجات"},{"en":"Orders","ar":"الطلبات"},{"en":"Reports","ar":"التقارير"}],"active":0},"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Paint roller, 23 cm","ar":"رولة دهان، 23 سم"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Price","ar":"السعر"},"text":{"en":"EGP 130","ar":"130 جنيه"},"filled":true,"gap":"m"},{"kind":"row","gap":"m","blocks":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Save and open next product","ar":"احفظ وافتح المنتج التالي"}},{"kind":"button","style":"outline","text":{"en":"Save","ar":"احفظ"}}],"note":{"en":"Still one product at a time: 1 of 50","ar":"ما زال منتجًا واحدًا كل مرة: 1 من 50"}}]}}],"answer":["bulk"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P02-028","when":["faster","next"],"feedback":{"en":"Both make each edit a little quicker, but I still type 50 prices by hand. The time and the typos come from doing the same thing 50 times.","ar":"كلاهما يجعل كل تعديل أسرع قليلًا، لكنني ما زلت أكتب 50 سعرًا بيدي. والوقت والأخطاء يأتيان من فعل الشيء نفسه 50 مرة."}}],"hints":[{"en":"What is the same about all 50 changes?","ar":"ما الشيء المشترك بين التعديلات الخمسين كلها؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Act on many items at once.","ar":"تعامل مع عناصر كثيرة مرة واحدة."},"explain":{"en":"A price rise is one decision applied to many products. Selecting them and raising them together turns an evening of typing into a minute, with no typos. Editing one product at a time still works for small changes.","ar":"رفع الأسعار قرار واحد يُطبَّق على منتجات كثيرة. واختيارها ورفعها معًا يحوّل مساءً من الكتابة إلى دقيقة، دون أخطاء. ويظل تعديل منتج واحد ممكنًا للتغييرات الصغيرة."}},{"id":"S09","type":"video","part":"concept","title":{"en":"Flexibility and efficiency of use","ar":"المرونة وكفاءة الاستخدام (Flexibility and efficiency of use)"},"video":"01c466c4-49a1-4f60-bc6c-5d06e9225ccc","duration":128,"transcript":[{"t":2.5,"en":"You'll see this clearly in design tools. If you use Figma or any design tool, there are always shortcuts.","ar":"هتلاقي المثال ده بيبرز جدًا في الـ Design tools بالنسبة لك كـ Designers. لو إنت بتستخدم Figma أو أي Design tool، هتلاقي إن دايمًا فيه Shortcuts."},{"t":12.12,"en":"Here's our example: in Figma, when you hover over any tool or click it, it tells you which keyboard shortcut you can use.","ar":"وده المثال اللي معانا: زي ما إنت شايف في Figma، أي Tool بتوقف عليها، بتعمل عليها Hovering أو بتضغط عليها، بيقول لك إيه الـ Keyboard shortcut اللي ممكن تستخدمه."},{"t":24.12,"en":"And remember: the keyboard is faster than the mouse. Moving the mouse to a tool and clicking it is much slower than pressing one letter to get the tool.","ar":"ودايمًا خلّي بالك: الـ Keyboard أسرع من الماوس. يعني إنك تروح بالماوس توقف على الـ Tool وتضغط عليها، أبطأ بكتير من إنك تضغط على حرف على الـ Keyboard فيجيب لك الـ Tool."},{"t":34.12,"en":"So users can press letters quickly, and that improves the experience a lot.","ar":"فاليوزر يبقى عنده الـ Capability إنه يضغط على حروف بسرعة، وده بيعمل Enhance للـ Experience جدًا."},{"t":44.12,"en":"That's why a designer who has used a tool for four or five years differs from one who has used it for a month or a few weeks,","ar":"عشان كده تلاقي إن الـ Designer اللي بقى له مثلًا أربع خمس سنين بيستخدم الـ Tool، غير الـ Designer اللي بقى له شهر أو كام أسبوع بيستخدم نفس الـ Tool،"},{"t":52.12,"en":"especially when you provide shortcuts. There's a huge difference in speed, as much as the experienced person has mastered the shortcuts.","ar":"خاصةً لما تـ Provide موضوع الـ Shortcuts. بتلاقي فرق في السرعة كبير جدًا، على قد ما الشخص القديم ده متمكّن من الـ Shortcuts وفاهمها بطريقة صحيحة."},{"t":66.12,"en":"You find that the expert really is an expert, with a higher level of efficiency and speed. Efficiency means speed.","ar":"بتلاقي فعلًا إن الـ Expert هو Expert، وعنده Level of efficiency أعلى وسرعة أعلى. فالـ Efficiency هي السرعة."},{"t":76.12,"en":"So always try to let experts finish their tasks faster. Keyboard shortcuts are one way, as we said, and not just in design tools.","ar":"فدايمًا حاول تخلّي الشخص الـ Expert يخلّص المهام بتاعته بسرعة أكبر، ومن ضمن الوسائل الـ Keyboard shortcuts زي ما ذكرنا، مش بس في الـ Design tools."},{"t":86.12,"en":"Some actions need shortcuts because they're repetitive. It doesn't matter that beginners don't see these shortcuts,","ar":"إنت عارف إن فيه بعض الـ Actions محتاجة Shortcuts لأنها Repetitive. مش مهم في الحالة دي إن الـ Shortcuts تبقى ظاهرة للمبتدئين،"},{"t":96.12,"en":"but they should be easy for anyone to reach, so whoever wants to learn and improve can get to them.","ar":"لكن تبقى سهلة الوصول بالنسبة لأي User، بحيث إنه لو عايز يتعلّمها وعايز يتطوّر تبقى Accessible بالنسبة له."},{"t":104.12,"en":"Like this Figma example: just hovering over or clicking a tool shows the shortcut that opens it directly,","ar":"زي المثال هنا الخاص بـ Figma: مجرد ما بنعمل Hovering على الـ Tool، أو بيضغط عليها، بيبدأ يظهر له الـ Shortcut اللي ممكن يـ Access بيه الـ Tool دي على طول،"},{"t":114.12,"en":"and it also gives full documentation of every shortcut in the system.","ar":"وفي نفس الوقت بيدّيه Documentation كامل لكل الـ Shortcuts اللي موجودة في السيستم."}]},{"id":"S03","type":"card","part":"concept","icons":["target","layers","person"],"title":{"en":"Video summary","ar":"ملخص الفيديو"},"body":{"en":"The seventh heuristic: the same product should suit **both beginners and experts**. Shortcuts that beginners don't notice can speed experts up.\n\n- **Accelerators** such as keyboard shortcuts: show them next to the command, so people learn them over time.\n- **Repeated work in one go:** bulk actions, and automating predictable steps.\n- **Personalize:** use what people did before to shorten what they do next.","ar":"مبدأ الاستخدام (Usability heuristic) السابع هو المرونة وكفاءة الاستخدام (Flexibility and efficiency of use): يجب أن يناسب المنتج نفسه **المبتدئين والخبراء معًا**. والاختصارات التي لا يلاحظها المبتدئون تستطيع أن تسرّع الخبراء.\n\n- **المسرّعات (Accelerators)** مثل اختصارات لوحة المفاتيح: اعرضها بجانب الأمر، ليتعلّمها الناس مع الوقت.\n- **العمل المتكرر دفعة واحدة:** الإجراءات الجماعية (Bulk actions)، وجعل الخطوات المتوقعة تلقائية.\n- **التخصيص (Personalization):** استخدم ما فعله الناس من قبل لتختصر ما سيفعلونه بعد ذلك."}},{"id":"S04","type":"tune","part":"guided","skill":"SK-P02-U04-01","rules":["R06"],"value":{"en":"Flexibility and efficiency (NN/g): make accelerators discoverable but unobtrusive. The classic way is to show keyboard shortcuts next to their commands in menus or toolbars.","ar":"المرونة والكفاءة (NN/g): اجعل المسرّعات سهلة الاكتشاف دون أن تزعج أحدًا. والطريقة الكلاسيكية هي عرض اختصارات لوحة المفاتيح بجانب أوامرها في القوائم وأشرطة الأدوات."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/flexibility-efficiency-heuristic/","quote":"The classic solution for keyboard-shortcut accelerators is to show them next to the associated commands in a menu or toolbar."},"scenario":{"en":"My dashboard does have keyboard shortcuts: N for a new product, / for search, E to edit. They're listed on a help page. I only found out last week.","ar":"في لوحة التحكم عندي اختصارات لوحة مفاتيح فعلًا: N لمنتج جديد، و/ للبحث، وE للتعديل. وهي مكتوبة في صفحة مساعدة. ولم أعرف بها إلا الأسبوع الماضي."},"prompt":{"en":"How should the dashboard make them known?","ar":"كيف تعرّف لوحة التحكم المستخدمين بالاختصارات دون أن تزعجهم؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"dar.example/seller/products","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Products","ar":"المنتجات"},{"en":"Orders","ar":"الطلبات"},{"en":"Help","ar":"المساعدة"}],"active":0},"blocks":[{"kind":"row","blocks":[{"kind":"button","icon":"plus","text":{"en":"New product","ar":"منتج جديد"}},{"kind":"searchbar","text":{"en":"Search products","ar":"ابحث في المنتجات"}},{"kind":"button","icon":"pencil-simple","text":{"en":"Edit","ar":"تعديل"},"style":"outline"}]},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Shortcuts N, / and E are listed only under Help","ar":"الاختصارات N و/ وE مكتوبة فقط في المساعدة"},"tone":"faint","gap":"m"}]},"options":[{"id":"inline","text":{"en":"Show each shortcut next to its button or menu item, and in its tooltip","ar":"عرض كل اختصار بجانب زرّه أو عنصره في القائمة، وفي الـ Tooltip الخاص به"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"dar.example/seller/products","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Products","ar":"المنتجات"},{"en":"Orders","ar":"الطلبات"},{"en":"Help","ar":"المساعدة"}],"active":0},"blocks":[{"kind":"row","blocks":[{"kind":"button","icon":"plus","text":{"en":"New product  N","ar":"منتج جديد  N"}},{"kind":"searchbar","text":{"en":"Search products  /","ar":"ابحث في المنتجات  /"}},{"kind":"button","icon":"pencil-simple","text":{"en":"Edit  E","ar":"تعديل  E"},"style":"outline"}],"note":{"en":"Each key shows on its button and tooltip","ar":"يظهر كل مفتاح على زرّه وفي الـ Tooltip"}}]}},{"id":"popup","text":{"en":"A pop-up on every login listing all shortcuts","ar":"نافذة منبثقة عند كل تسجيل دخول تعرض كل الاختصارات"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"dar.example/seller/products","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Products","ar":"المنتجات"},{"en":"Orders","ar":"الطلبات"},{"en":"Help","ar":"المساعدة"}],"active":0},"blocks":[{"kind":"row","blocks":[{"kind":"button","icon":"plus","text":{"en":"New product","ar":"منتج جديد"}},{"kind":"searchbar","text":{"en":"Search products","ar":"ابحث في المنتجات"}},{"kind":"button","icon":"pencil-simple","text":{"en":"Edit","ar":"تعديل"},"style":"outline"}]},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Shortcuts N, / and E are listed only under Help","ar":"الاختصارات N و/ وE مكتوبة فقط في المساعدة"},"tone":"faint","gap":"m"}],"overlay":{"type":"dialog","close":true,"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Keyboard shortcuts","ar":"اختصارات لوحة المفاتيح"},"note":{"en":"On every login","ar":"عند كل تسجيل دخول"}},{"kind":"list","style":"bullet","gap":"s","items":[{"en":"N: new product","ar":"N: منتج جديد"},{"en":"/: search","ar":"/: بحث"},{"en":"E: edit","ar":"E: تعديل"}]},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"OK","ar":"حسنًا"},"gap":"m"}]}}},{"id":"help","text":{"en":"Keep them on the help page; experts will find them","ar":"إبقاؤها في صفحة المساعدة؛ وسيجدها الخبراء"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"dar.example/seller/products","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Products","ar":"المنتجات"},{"en":"Orders","ar":"الطلبات"},{"en":"Help","ar":"المساعدة"}],"active":0},"blocks":[{"kind":"row","blocks":[{"kind":"button","icon":"plus","text":{"en":"New product","ar":"منتج جديد"}},{"kind":"searchbar","text":{"en":"Search products","ar":"ابحث في المنتجات"}},{"kind":"button","icon":"pencil-simple","text":{"en":"Edit","ar":"تعديل"},"style":"outline"}]},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Shortcuts N, / and E are listed only under Help","ar":"الاختصارات N و/ وE مكتوبة فقط في المساعدة"},"tone":"faint","gap":"m"}]}}],"answer":["inline"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P02-029","when":["help"],"feedback":{"en":"Few people read help pages, so even daily users like me never learn the shortcuts.","ar":"قليلون يقرؤون صفحات المساعدة، فحتى من يستخدم اللوحة يوميًا مثلي لا يتعلّم الاختصارات أبدًا."}},{"id":"MC-P02-030","when":["popup"],"feedback":{"en":"A list at every login gets in everyone's way, beginners included, and is closed without reading.","ar":"قائمة عند كل تسجيل دخول تزعج الجميع، ومنهم المبتدئون، وتُغلق دون قراءة."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Where are people looking at the moment a shortcut could save them time?","ar":"أين ينظر الناس في اللحظة التي يمكن أن يوفّر فيها الاختصار وقتهم؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Show the shortcut where the action is.","ar":"اعرض الاختصار بجانب الإجراء نفسه."},"explain":{"en":"Beginners can ignore the small \"N\" next to New product, but people who see it every day start using it. The shortcut teaches itself, without getting in anyone's way.","ar":"يستطيع المبتدئون تجاهل «N» الصغيرة بجانب «منتج جديد»، أما من يراها كل يوم فيبدأ في استخدامها. فيتعلّم الناس الاختصار وحدهم، دون أن يزعج أحدًا."},"speaker":"youssef"},{"id":"S05","type":"tune","part":"guided","skill":"SK-P02-U04-01","rules":["R06"],"value":{"en":"Flexibility and efficiency (NN/g): a step-by-step wizard helps the first time but becomes extra clicks on later repetitions. Let people who know the task skip it.","ar":"المرونة والكفاءة (NN/g): المعالج خطوة بخطوة يساعد في المرة الأولى، لكنه يصبح ضغطات زائدة في المرات التالية. فدَع من يعرف المهمة يتخطّاه."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/flexibility-efficiency-heuristic/","quote":"the extra clicks to guide users through a wizard might be necessary to lead someone through a task the first time but extraneous for future repetitions."},"scenario":{"en":"Adding a product walks me through 6 screens with tips on each: name, photos, price, stock, delivery, review. I add about 10 products a week.","ar":"لإضافة منتج أمرّ بـ 6 شاشات، في كل منها نصائح: الاسم، والصور، والسعر، والمخزون، والتوصيل، والمراجعة. وأضيف نحو 10 منتجات كل أسبوع."},"prompt":{"en":"What should change?","ar":"ماذا يجب أن يتغيّر في خطوات إضافة المنتج؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"dar.example/seller/products/new/step-1","blocks":[{"kind":"progress","value":16,"label":{"en":"Step 1 of 6: Name","ar":"الخطوة 1 من 6: الاسم"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Product name","ar":"اسم المنتج"},"text":{"en":"e.g. Electric kettle","ar":"مثال: غلاية كهربائية"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"banner","icon":"lightbulb","tone":"info","text":{"en":"Tip: use the name customers search for.","ar":"نصيحة: استخدم الاسم الذي يبحث عنه العملاء."},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Next","ar":"التالي"},"gap":"m"}]},"options":[{"id":"remove","text":{"en":"Remove the step-by-step screens for everyone","ar":"حذف الشاشات المتتالية للجميع"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"dar.example/seller/products/new","blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"New product","ar":"منتج جديد"},"note":{"en":"One page for everyone, new sellers too","ar":"صفحة واحدة للجميع، والبائعون الجدد أيضًا"}},{"kind":"row","gap":"m","blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Product name","ar":"اسم المنتج"},"text":""},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Price","ar":"السعر"},"text":""},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Stock","ar":"المخزون"},"text":""}]},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Add product","ar":"أضف المنتج"},"gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"oneform","text":{"en":"Keep the guided steps for new sellers, and offer a \"Quick add\" form on one page for those who know it","ar":"إبقاء الخطوات الموجّهة للبائعين الجدد، وعرض نموذج «إضافة سريعة» في صفحة واحدة لمن يعرف الطريقة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"dar.example/seller/products/quick-add","blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Quick add","ar":"إضافة سريعة"}},{"kind":"row","gap":"m","blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Product name","ar":"اسم المنتج"},"text":{"en":"Electric kettle","ar":"غلاية كهربائية"},"filled":true},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Price","ar":"السعر"},"text":{"en":"EGP 1,100","ar":"1,100 جنيه"},"filled":true},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Stock","ar":"المخزون"},"text":"12","filled":true}]},{"kind":"row","gap":"m","blocks":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Add product","ar":"أضف المنتج"}},{"kind":"button","style":"text","text":{"en":"Use the guided steps","ar":"استخدم الخطوات الموجّهة"}}],"note":{"en":"New sellers still get the 6 steps","ar":"البائعون الجدد ما زالت لهم الخطوات الست"}}]}},{"id":"tips","text":{"en":"Keep the 6 screens, but hide the tips","ar":"إبقاء الشاشات الست، مع إخفاء النصائح"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"dar.example/seller/products/new/step-1","blocks":[{"kind":"progress","value":16,"label":{"en":"Step 1 of 6: Name","ar":"الخطوة 1 من 6: الاسم"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Product name","ar":"اسم المنتج"},"text":{"en":"e.g. Electric kettle","ar":"مثال: غلاية كهربائية"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Next","ar":"التالي"},"gap":"m"}]}}],"answer":["oneform"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P02-030","when":["tips"],"feedback":{"en":"Without the tips, it's still six screens and six taps on Next for every product.","ar":"دون النصائح، ما زالت ست شاشات وست ضغطات على «التالي» لكل منتج."}},{"id":"MC-P02-031","when":["remove"],"feedback":{"en":"New sellers lose the guidance they need the first time. Experts and beginners need different paths.","ar":"يفقد البائعون الجدد الإرشاد الذي يحتاجونه في المرة الأولى. فالخبراء والمبتدئون يحتاجون طريقين مختلفين."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Who needs the guided steps, and who doesn't?","ar":"من يحتاج الخطوات الموجّهة، ومن لا يحتاجها؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Two paths: guided for beginners, quick for regulars.","ar":"طريقان: موجّه للمبتدئين، وسريع للمعتادين."},"explain":{"en":"The guided steps still help new sellers learn, while one page lets regulars add a product in a minute. Each person picks the way that suits them.","ar":"تظل الخطوات الموجّهة تساعد البائعين الجدد على التعلّم، بينما تتيح الصفحة الواحدة للمعتادين إضافة منتج في دقيقة. ويختار كل شخص الطريقة التي تناسبه."},"speaker":"youssef"},{"id":"S06","type":"compare","speaker":"karim","part":"contrast","skill":"SK-P02-U04-02","rules":["R11"],"value":{"en":"Flexibility and efficiency (NN/g): provide personalization by tailoring content and functionality to each person. A food app that knows your past orders can offer them again in one tap.","ar":"المرونة والكفاءة (NN/g): قدّم التخصيص بملاءمة المحتوى والوظائف لكل شخص. وتطبيق الطعام الذي يعرف طلباتك السابقة يستطيع أن يعرضها عليك مرة أخرى بضغطة واحدة."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/ten-usability-heuristics/","quote":"Provide personalization by tailoring content and functionality for individual users."},"scenario":{"en":"I'm building a food delivery app. Most orders are repeats: the same people order the same meals from the same places.","ar":"أبني تطبيقًا لتوصيل الطعام. وأغلب الطلبات مكررة: الناس أنفسهم يطلبون الوجبات نفسها من الأماكن نفسها."},"prompt":{"en":"Which home screen suits them better?","ar":"أيّ شاشة رئيسية تجعل تكرار الطلب أسرع؟"},"a":{"label":{"en":"Version A: the same for everyone","ar":"النسخة A: الشاشة نفسها للجميع"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"lokma","name":{"en":"Lokma","ar":"لقمة"},"color":"#F08C00","icon":"hamburger","domain":"lokma.example"},"appbar":{"logo":true,"actions":[{"icon":"shopping-cart"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"searchbar","text":{"en":"Search restaurants or dishes","ar":"ابحث عن مطاعم أو أطباق"}},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Popular near you","ar":"الأشهر بالقرب منك"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"listitem","art":"food-pizza","text":{"en":"Pizza Roma","ar":"بيتزا روما"},"sub":{"en":"25 min · EGP 15 delivery","ar":"25 دقيقة · توصيل 15 جنيه"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"listitem","art":"food-burger","text":{"en":"Burger Lab","ar":"برجر لاب"},"sub":{"en":"30 min · free delivery","ar":"30 دقيقة · توصيل مجاني"},"gap":"s"}]}},"b":{"label":{"en":"Version B: with Order again","ar":"النسخة B: مع «اطلب مرة أخرى»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"lokma","name":{"en":"Lokma","ar":"لقمة"},"color":"#F08C00","icon":"hamburger","domain":"lokma.example"},"appbar":{"logo":true,"actions":[{"icon":"shopping-cart"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"searchbar","text":{"en":"Search restaurants or dishes","ar":"ابحث عن مطاعم أو أطباق"}},{"kind":"card","gap":"m","blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Order again","ar":"اطلب مرة أخرى"}},{"kind":"listitem","art":"food-koshary","text":{"en":"Koshary, large + salad","ar":"كشري كبير + سلطة"},"sub":{"en":"Koshary El Nil · Tue","ar":"كشري النيل · الثلاثاء"}},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Reorder · EGP 95","ar":"أعد الطلب · 95 جنيه"}}]},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Popular near you","ar":"الأشهر بالقرب منك"},"gap":"m"}]}},"answer":"b","misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P02-031","when":["a"],"feedback":{"en":"Regulars have to search the place, find the dish, choose the size and add the salad again, every time, though the app already knows their order.","ar":"على المعتادين أن يبحثوا عن المكان، ويجدوا الطبق، ويختاروا الحجم، ويضيفوا السلطة من جديد، في كل مرة، مع أن التطبيق يعرف طلبهم أصلًا."}}],"correct":{"en":"B: use what the app already knows.","ar":"B: استخدم ما يعرفه التطبيق أصلًا."},"explain":{"en":"\"Order again\" turns five steps into one tap for people who repeat orders, while newcomers still see search and popular places.","ar":"«اطلب مرة أخرى» تحوّل خمس خطوات إلى ضغطة واحدة لمن يكرّرون طلباتهم، بينما يظل الجدد يرون البحث والأماكن الشهيرة."}},{"id":"S07","type":"tune","speaker":"nour","part":"independent","skill":"SK-P02-U04-02","rules":["R14"],"value":{"en":"Flexibility and efficiency (NN/g): let people automate repetitive tasks with predictable steps. A monthly refill of the same medicine is exactly that.","ar":"المرونة والكفاءة (NN/g): دَع الناس يجعلون المهام المتكررة ذات الخطوات المتوقعة تلقائية. وإعادة صرف الدواء نفسه كل شهر مثال على ذلك تمامًا."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/flexibility-efficiency-heuristic/","quote":"allowing expert users to automate repetitious or tedious tasks that have predictable steps."},"scenario":{"en":"Our clinic's app also has a pharmacy. Many patients take the same medicine for years, and order it every month by searching for it, choosing the dose and checking out.","ar":"في تطبيق عيادتنا صيدلية أيضًا. وكثير من المرضى يتناولون الدواء نفسه لسنوات، ويطلبونه كل شهر بالبحث عنه، واختيار الجرعة، وإتمام الشراء."},"prompt":{"en":"What should the app offer them?","ar":"ماذا يقدّم لهم التطبيق ليوفّر عليهم تكرار الطلب كل شهر؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Pharmacy","ar":"الصيدلية"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"searchbar","text":{"en":"metf","ar":"ميتف"},"filled":true,"suggest":[{"icon":"pill","text":{"en":"metf**ormin 500 mg**","ar":"ميتف**ورمين 500 مجم**"}}]},{"kind":"listitem","art":"medicine","text":{"en":"Metformin 500 mg · 30 tabs","ar":"ميتفورمين 500 مجم · 30 قرصًا"},"value":{"en":"EGP 48","ar":"48 جنيه"},"gap":"m","note":{"en":"The same order, typed in again every month","ar":"الطلب نفسه، يُكتب من جديد كل شهر"}}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Add to cart","ar":"أضف إلى السلة"}}]},"options":[{"id":"auto","text":{"en":"\"Refill every month\": the same order goes out on a set day, with a reminder two days before to change or skip it","ar":"«أعِد الصرف كل شهر»: يُرسل الطلب نفسه في يوم محدد، مع تذكير قبله بيومين لتعديله أو تخطّيه"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Pharmacy","ar":"الصيدلية"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","art":"medicine","text":{"en":"Metformin 500 mg · 30 tabs","ar":"ميتفورمين 500 مجم · 30 قرصًا"},"value":{"en":"EGP 48","ar":"48 جنيه"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"arrows-clockwise","text":{"en":"Refill every month","ar":"أعِد الصرف كل شهر"},"toggle":true,"gap":"m"},{"kind":"small","gap":"s","text":{"en":"Next order: 1 Dec. We'll remind you on 29 Nov to change or skip it.","ar":"الطلب القادم: 1 ديسمبر. وسنذكّرك يوم 29 نوفمبر لتعدّله أو تتخطّاه."}}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Save","ar":"احفظ"}}]}},{"id":"banner","text":{"en":"A banner on the home page: \"Don't forget your medicine!\"","ar":"Banner في الصفحة الرئيسية: «لا تنسَ دواءك!»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Pharmacy","ar":"الصيدلية"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"banner","tone":"info","icon":"pill","text":{"en":"Don't forget your medicine!","ar":"لا تنسَ دواءك!"},"note":{"en":"On the home page","ar":"في الصفحة الرئيسية"}},{"kind":"searchbar","text":{"en":"metf","ar":"ميتف"},"filled":true,"suggest":[{"icon":"pill","text":{"en":"metf**ormin 500 mg**","ar":"ميتف**ورمين 500 مجم**"}}]},{"kind":"listitem","art":"medicine","text":{"en":"Metformin 500 mg · 30 tabs","ar":"ميتفورمين 500 مجم · 30 قرصًا"},"value":{"en":"EGP 48","ar":"48 جنيه"},"gap":"m","note":{"en":"The same order, typed in again every month","ar":"الطلب نفسه، يُكتب من جديد كل شهر"}}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Add to cart","ar":"أضف إلى السلة"}}]}},{"id":"search","text":{"en":"Better search, so the medicine is found faster","ar":"بحث أفضل، ليجد المرضى الدواء أسرع"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Pharmacy","ar":"الصيدلية"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"searchbar","text":{"en":"metf","ar":"ميتف"},"filled":true,"suggest":[{"icon":"pill","text":{"en":"metf**ormin 500 mg**","ar":"ميتف**ورمين 500 مجم**"}}]},{"kind":"listitem","art":"medicine","text":{"en":"Metformin 500 mg · 30 tabs","ar":"ميتفورمين 500 مجم · 30 قرصًا"},"value":{"en":"EGP 48","ar":"48 جنيه"},"gap":"m","note":{"en":"Found faster, but still ordered by hand every month","ar":"يُوجد أسرع، لكنه ما زال يُطلب يدويًا كل شهر"}}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Add to cart","ar":"أضف إلى السلة"}}]}}],"answer":["auto"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P02-028","when":["banner","search"],"feedback":{"en":"Patients still repeat the whole order by hand every month. The steps are the same each time, so the app can do them.","ar":"ما زال المرضى يكرّرون الطلب كله بأيديهم كل شهر. والخطوات نفسها في كل مرة، فيستطيع التطبيق أن يقوم بها."}}],"hints":[{"en":"What changes from one month's order to the next?","ar":"ما الذي يتغيّر من طلب شهر إلى طلب الشهر التالي؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Automate what repeats, and keep people in charge.","ar":"اجعل المتكرر تلقائيًا، وأبقِ القرار للناس."},"explain":{"en":"Nothing changes month to month, so a set refill removes the whole task. The reminder keeps patients in control if their dose or plans change.","ar":"لا شيء يتغيّر من شهر إلى شهر، فالصرف التلقائي في موعد محدد يُلغي المهمة كلها. والتذكير يُبقي المرضى متحكّمين إن تغيّرت جرعتهم أو خططهم."}},{"id":"S08","type":"card","part":"recap","icons":["target","layers","person"],"title":{"en":"What you practised","ar":"ما تدرّبت عليه"},"body":{"en":"- **Add shortcuts, and show them** where the action is, so regulars discover them.\n- **Keep two paths:** guided for beginners, quick for people who know the way.\n- **Repeat in one go:** bulk actions, reorder, and automation for predictable tasks.\n\nNext: cut the clutter, but keep what the task needs.","ar":"- **أضِف اختصارات واعرضها** حيث يكون الإجراء، ليكتشفها المعتادون.\n- **أبقِ طريقين:** موجّهًا للمبتدئين، وسريعًا لمن يعرف الطريق.\n- **كرّر دفعة واحدة:** إجراءات جماعية، وإعادة الطلب، وأتمتة للمهام المتوقعة.\n\nالتالي: احذف الزوائد، لكن أبقِ ما تحتاجه المهمة."}}]}$uxg$::jsonb),
  ($uxg$P02-U04-L02$uxg$, $uxg$7f0faf38e20e9b9a0a4554c80ade626448c43c8e91ba78d86b4d947a9b7a1290$uxg$, $uxg${"id":"P02-U04-L02","mode":"lesson","minutes":8,"title":{"en":"Cut the clutter, keep the essentials","ar":"احذف الزوائد، وأبقِ الأساسيات"},"speaker":"mona","review_labels":{"MC-P02-032":{"en":"Louder doesn't fix crowded","ar":"تكبير الزر وتلوينه لا يحلّ مشكلة الشاشة المزدحمة"},"MC-P02-033":{"en":"Show details when they're needed","ar":"اعرض التفاصيل حين تُحتاج"},"MC-P02-034":{"en":"Minimal isn't missing","ar":"البساطة ليست نقصًا"},"MC-P02-035":{"en":"Decoration isn't information","ar":"الزخرفة ليست معلومة"}},"steps":[{"id":"S01","type":"card","part":"hook","title":{"en":"Where is Transfer?","ar":"أين التحويل؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rasid","name":{"en":"Rasid","ar":"رصيد"},"color":"#1C3D6E","icon":"bank","domain":"rasid.example"},"appbar":{"logo":true,"actions":[{"icon":"bell","count":4}]},"tabbar":{"active":0,"items":[{"icon":"house","text":{"en":"Home","ar":"الرئيسية"}},{"icon":"credit-card","text":{"en":"Cards","ar":"البطاقات"}},{"icon":"user","text":{"en":"Me","ar":"حسابي"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"card","blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Balance","ar":"الرصيد"}},{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"EGP 12,480","ar":"12,480 جنيه"},"size":"l"}]},{"kind":"banner","icon":"megaphone","tone":"info","text":{"en":"New! 0% installments on phones","ar":"جديد! تقسيط بدون فوائد على الهواتف"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"banner","icon":"airplane-tilt","tone":"info","text":{"en":"Cashback on travel with your card","ar":"استرداد نقدي على السفر مع بطاقتك"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"image","art":"city-night","size":"s","gap":"xs"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Tip of the day: save 10% of your salary","ar":"نصيحة اليوم: ادّخر 10% من راتبك"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"USD 48.9 · EUR 52.7 · SAR 13.0","ar":"دولار 48.9 · يورو 52.7 · ريال 13.0"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"link","text":{"en":"Quiz: how smart is your spending?","ar":"مسابقة: ما مدى ذكاء إنفاقك؟"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"button","icon":"arrows-left-right","text":{"en":"Transfer","ar":"تحويل"},"style":"text","gap":"xs","note":{"en":"Here, under the quiz","ar":"هنا، تحت المسابقة"}}]},"body":{"en":"I lead the design team of a bank's app. Our home screen has grown: the balance, three offer banners, a news slider, a tip of the day, a currency table and a quiz.\n\nIn our last test, four out of six people couldn't find **Transfer** in under a minute. It's there, under the quiz.","ar":"أقود فريق التصميم لتطبيق بنك. وقد امتلأت الشاشة الرئيسية: الرصيد، وثلاثة Banners للعروض، وشريط أخبار متحرّك، ونصيحة اليوم، وجدول عملات، ومسابقة.\n\nفي آخر تجربة، لم يجد أربعة من ستة أشخاص زر **تحويل** في أقل من دقيقة. وهو موجود، تحت المسابقة."}},{"id":"S02","type":"tune","part":"try","skill":"SK-P02-U04-03","rules":["R12"],"confidence":true,"value":{"en":"Try first. Aesthetic and minimalist design (NN/g): every extra unit of information competes with the relevant ones and makes them less visible. Making Transfer louder adds to the competition; removing the noise ends it.","ar":"جرّب أولًا. التصميم الجمالي البسيط (NN/g): كل معلومة زائدة تنافس المعلومات المهمة وتجعلها أقل ظهورًا. وجعل «تحويل» أعلى صوتًا يزيد المنافسة؛ أما إزالة الضجيج فتنهيها."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/aesthetic-minimalist-design/","quote":"Every extra unit of information in an interface competes with the relevant units of information and diminishes their relative visibility."},"prompt":{"en":"What should we do?","ar":"ماذا نفعل ليجد الناس زر «تحويل» بسرعة؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rasid","name":{"en":"Rasid","ar":"رصيد"},"color":"#1C3D6E","icon":"bank","domain":"rasid.example"},"appbar":{"logo":true,"actions":[{"icon":"bell","count":4}]},"tabbar":{"active":0,"items":[{"icon":"house","text":{"en":"Home","ar":"الرئيسية"}},{"icon":"credit-card","text":{"en":"Cards","ar":"البطاقات"}},{"icon":"user","text":{"en":"Me","ar":"حسابي"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"card","blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Balance","ar":"الرصيد"}},{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"EGP 12,480","ar":"12,480 جنيه"},"size":"l"}]},{"kind":"banner","icon":"megaphone","tone":"info","text":{"en":"New! 0% installments on phones","ar":"جديد! تقسيط بدون فوائد على الهواتف"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"banner","icon":"airplane-tilt","tone":"info","text":{"en":"Cashback on travel with your card","ar":"استرداد نقدي على السفر مع بطاقتك"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"image","art":"city-night","size":"s","gap":"xs"},{"kind":"link","text":{"en":"Quiz: how smart is your spending?","ar":"مسابقة: ما مدى ذكاء إنفاقك؟"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"button","icon":"arrows-left-right","text":{"en":"Transfer","ar":"تحويل"},"style":"text","gap":"xs"}]},"options":[{"id":"red","text":{"en":"Make Transfer a big red button","ar":"نجعل «تحويل» زرًا أحمر كبيرًا"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rasid","name":{"en":"Rasid","ar":"رصيد"},"color":"#1C3D6E","icon":"bank","domain":"rasid.example"},"appbar":{"logo":true,"actions":[{"icon":"bell","count":4}]},"tabbar":{"active":0,"items":[{"icon":"house","text":{"en":"Home","ar":"الرئيسية"}},{"icon":"credit-card","text":{"en":"Cards","ar":"البطاقات"}},{"icon":"user","text":{"en":"Me","ar":"حسابي"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"card","blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Balance","ar":"الرصيد"}},{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"EGP 12,480","ar":"12,480 جنيه"},"size":"l"}]},{"kind":"banner","icon":"megaphone","tone":"info","text":{"en":"New! 0% installments on phones","ar":"جديد! تقسيط بدون فوائد على الهواتف"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"banner","icon":"airplane-tilt","tone":"info","text":{"en":"Cashback on travel with your card","ar":"استرداد نقدي على السفر مع بطاقتك"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"image","art":"city-night","size":"s","gap":"xs"},{"kind":"link","text":{"en":"Quiz: how smart is your spending?","ar":"مسابقة: ما مدى ذكاء إنفاقك؟"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"button","style":"danger","size":"l","icon":"arrows-left-right","text":{"en":"Transfer","ar":"تحويل"},"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"cut","text":{"en":"Keep the balance and the main actions on top; move offers, news and the quiz to an \"Offers\" tab","ar":"نُبقي الرصيد والإجراءات الرئيسية في الأعلى؛ وننقل العروض والأخبار والمسابقة إلى قسم «العروض»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rasid","name":{"en":"Rasid","ar":"رصيد"},"color":"#1C3D6E","icon":"bank","domain":"rasid.example"},"appbar":{"logo":true,"actions":[{"icon":"bell","count":4}]},"tabbar":{"active":0,"items":[{"icon":"house","text":{"en":"Home","ar":"الرئيسية"}},{"icon":"credit-card","text":{"en":"Cards","ar":"البطاقات"}},{"icon":"tag","text":{"en":"Offers","ar":"العروض"},"count":3},{"icon":"user","text":{"en":"Me","ar":"حسابي"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"card","blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Balance","ar":"الرصيد"}},{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"EGP 12,480","ar":"12,480 جنيه"},"size":"l"}]},{"kind":"row","gap":"m","blocks":[{"kind":"button","icon":"arrows-left-right","text":{"en":"Transfer","ar":"تحويل"}},{"kind":"button","style":"outline","icon":"receipt","text":{"en":"Pay bills","ar":"ادفع الفواتير"}}]}]}},{"id":"menu","text":{"en":"Add Transfer to the side menu as well","ar":"نضيف «تحويل» إلى القائمة الجانبية أيضًا"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rasid","name":{"en":"Rasid","ar":"رصيد"},"color":"#1C3D6E","icon":"bank","domain":"rasid.example"},"appbar":{"logo":true,"actions":[{"icon":"bell","count":4}]},"tabbar":{"active":0,"items":[{"icon":"house","text":{"en":"Home","ar":"الرئيسية"}},{"icon":"credit-card","text":{"en":"Cards","ar":"البطاقات"}},{"icon":"user","text":{"en":"Me","ar":"حسابي"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"card","blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Balance","ar":"الرصيد"}},{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"EGP 12,480","ar":"12,480 جنيه"},"size":"l"}]},{"kind":"banner","icon":"megaphone","tone":"info","text":{"en":"New! 0% installments on phones","ar":"جديد! تقسيط بدون فوائد على الهواتف"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"banner","icon":"airplane-tilt","tone":"info","text":{"en":"Cashback on travel with your card","ar":"استرداد نقدي على السفر مع بطاقتك"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"image","art":"city-night","size":"s","gap":"xs"},{"kind":"link","text":{"en":"Quiz: how smart is your spending?","ar":"مسابقة: ما مدى ذكاء إنفاقك؟"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"button","icon":"arrows-left-right","text":{"en":"Transfer","ar":"تحويل"},"style":"text","gap":"xs","note":{"en":"Also in the side menu now","ar":"موجود الآن في القائمة الجانبية أيضًا"}}]}}],"answer":["cut"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P02-032","when":["red","menu"],"feedback":{"en":"A louder button joins the competition for attention, and a second copy in the menu adds yet another place to look. The problem is everything around it.","ar":"الزر الأكبر والأكثر لفتًا للنظر ينضم إلى المنافسة على الانتباه، والنسخة الثانية في القائمة تضيف مكانًا آخر للبحث. المشكلة في كل ما حوله."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Which items on this screen help people do what they opened the app for?","ar":"أيّ عناصر هذه الشاشة تساعد الناس على فعل ما فتحوا التطبيق من أجله؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Remove what competes with the main task.","ar":"أزِل ما ينافس المهمة الرئيسية."},"explain":{"en":"Most people open a bank app to check their balance or move money. With the noise moved away, Transfer stands out without shouting, and the offers are still there for anyone who wants them.","ar":"يفتح أغلب الناس تطبيق البنك ليعرفوا رصيدهم أو يحوّلوا مالًا. وحين يُنقل الضجيج بعيدًا، يبرز «تحويل» دون أن يكون صارخًا، وتبقى العروض موجودة لمن يريدها."}},{"id":"S09","type":"video","part":"concept","title":{"en":"Aesthetic and minimalist design","ar":"تصميم بسيط وجميل بلا زيادات (Aesthetic and minimalist design)"},"video":"7b78bc7d-20d4-40f7-a726-a3870a1859b2","duration":154,"transcript":[{"t":2.5,"en":"Let's look at this example. What do you think of it, in terms of the signal-to-noise ratio?","ar":"تعال نبص على المثال ده: إيه رأيك فيه بالنسبة لموضوع الـ Signal to noise ratio؟"},{"t":8.19,"en":"Here you're supposed to book a trip, a flight. As you can see, this is what the website looks like.","ar":"ده مثال المفروض إنك من هنا بتحجز رحلة، بتحجز طيارة. زي ما إنت شايف، ده شكل الـ Website."},{"t":18.19,"en":"Is the signal high here, or the noise? Is the signal higher than the noise? Did the designer manage the noise,","ar":"هنا الـ Signal عالية ولا الـ Noise عالية؟ هل الـ Signal أعلى من الـ Noise هنا؟ هل فعلًا المصمم هنا قدر يتعامل مع الـ Noise،"},{"t":34.19,"en":"the visual elements, options or actions that don't matter in the user's context? Clearly, here he didn't get the signal-to-noise ratio right.","ar":"الحاجات اللي ممكن تكون Visual elements أو Options أو Actions مش مهمة بالنسبة لسياق اليوزر؟ هنا بوضوح ما وُفّقش إنه يحقّق الـ Signal to noise ratio."},{"t":46.19,"en":"Why? Because, as you can see, there are lots of colours, lots of images and far too many options for someone who wants to book a flight.","ar":"ليه؟ لأن زي ما إنت شايف، فيه ألوان كتير، وصور كتير، و Options كتير جدًا، بالنسبة لواحد داخل عايز يحجز طيارة."},{"t":56.19,"en":"What matters most to them may be where they're going, entering the date, and searching. There can be some options and some information,","ar":"ممكن يكون أهم حاجة بالنسبة له: هو رايح فين، ويدخل التاريخ، ويبحث. ممكن يبقى فيه بعض الـ Options وبعض المعلومات،"},{"t":66.19,"en":"and it can give a feeling of travel and all those lovely things, but not with an image filling the background like this, full of colours and details.","ar":"وممكن يحسّسه بإحساس إنه هيسافر والحاجات الجميلة دي كلها، لكن مش بصورة مالية الخلفية بالشكل ده، مالية ألوان ومالية تفاصيل."},{"t":76.19,"en":"All of that will compete, as we agreed, with the visual elements that matter most in this context.","ar":"كل ده هينافس، زي ما اتفقنا، الـ Visuals أو العناصر البصرية الأكثر أهمية في السياق ده."},{"t":86.19,"en":"Now, you'll see almost the same goal, the same function, done much better in Google Flights.","ar":"طيب، هتشوف تقريبًا نفس الـ Goal أو نفس الـ Function محقّقة بشكل أفضل بكتير في Google Flights."},{"t":96.19,"en":"The main focus is on the box in the middle, where the user enters where they're going.","ar":"هتلاقي إن الفوكس الأساسي على المربع اللي في النص، اللي من خلاله اليوزر بيدخل هو رايح فين."},{"t":106.19,"en":"And the Explore button has elevation and a shadow, and stands out in the primary colour, used very sensibly.","ar":"وهتلاقي الزرار اللي اسمه Explore واخد Elevation، واخد Shadow، وبارز وباللون الـ Primary. استخدام اللون الـ Primary هنا بطريقة عقلانية جدًا."},{"t":120.19,"en":"It conveys the feeling of travelling, there's even some emotion in it, but calmly,","ar":"قدر يوصّل Feeling إنك مسافر، يعني فيه حتى Emotion في الموضوع، لكن بطريقة هادية،"},{"t":128.19,"en":"in a way that doesn't make the user lose focus on the main task, the main part they need to concentrate on,","ar":"بطريقة ما تخلّيش اليوزر يـ Lose الفوكس أو يفقد تركيزه عن المهمة الأساسية أو الجزء الأساسي اللي هو محتاج يركّز فيه،"},{"t":140.19,"en":"which is entering where they're going and the date, and starting to explore the available flights.","ar":"وهو إنه يبدأ يدخل هو رايح فين، وإيه التاريخ، ويبدأ يـ Explore الـ Flights المتاحة."}]},{"id":"S03","type":"card","part":"concept","icons":["cut","eye","ok"],"title":{"en":"Video summary","ar":"ملخص الفيديو"},"body":{"en":"The eighth heuristic: interfaces **should not contain information that is irrelevant or rarely needed**. Everything extra competes with what matters.\n\n- **Cut or move back** what doesn't help the task. Show rare details only when they're needed.\n- **Minimalist doesn't mean empty:** keep every label, sign and fact the task needs.\n- **Looks matter too,** but clarity wins over decoration.","ar":"مبدأ الاستخدام (Usability heuristic) الثامن هو تصميم بسيط وجميل بلا زيادات (Aesthetic and minimalist design): **يجب ألّا تحتوي الواجهات على معلومات غير مهمة أو نادرًا ما تُحتاج**. فكل شيء زائد ينافس ما يهمّ.\n\n- **احذف أو أخّر** ما لا يساعد المهمة. واعرض التفاصيل النادرة فقط حين تُحتاج.\n- **البساطة لا تعني الفراغ:** أبقِ كل اسم وعلامة ومعلومة تحتاجها المهمة.\n- **الشكل مهم أيضًا،** لكن الوضوح يغلب الزخرفة."}},{"id":"S04","type":"tune","part":"guided","skill":"SK-P02-U04-03","rules":["R06"],"value":{"en":"Aesthetic and minimalist design (NN/g): for less common tasks, disclose features or information progressively, as they're needed, instead of showing everything at once.","ar":"التصميم الجمالي البسيط (NN/g): للمهام الأقل شيوعًا، اكشف الميزات أو المعلومات تدريجيًا حين تُحتاج، بدل عرض كل شيء مرة واحدة."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/aesthetic-minimalist-design/","quote":"consider progressively disclosing features or information as it is needed, rather than showing it all at once, to limit unneeded detail."},"scenario":{"en":"The transfer screen shows every field at once: amount, account, purpose, a reference code, the SWIFT code, a schedule and fee options. Most transfers only need the account and the amount.","ar":"شاشة التحويل تعرض كل الحقول مرة واحدة: المبلغ، والحساب، والغرض، ورمز مرجعي، ورمز SWIFT، والجدولة، وخيارات الرسوم. وأغلب التحويلات تحتاج إلى الحساب والمبلغ فقط."},"prompt":{"en":"How should the screen handle the other fields?","ar":"ماذا تفعل الشاشة بالحقول التي لا تحتاجها أغلب التحويلات؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rasid","name":{"en":"Rasid","ar":"رصيد"},"color":"#1C3D6E","icon":"bank","domain":"rasid.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Transfer","ar":"تحويل"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"To account","ar":"إلى الحساب"},"text":"","icon":"user"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Amount","ar":"المبلغ"},"text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Purpose","ar":"الغرض"},"text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Reference code","ar":"الرمز المرجعي"},"text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":"SWIFT","text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"select","label":{"en":"Schedule","ar":"الجدولة"},"text":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"select","label":{"en":"Fees paid by","ar":"من يدفع الرسوم"},"text":{"en":"Me","ar":"أنا"},"gap":"s"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Continue","ar":"متابعة"}}]},"options":[{"id":"all","text":{"en":"Keep them all visible; someone might need them","ar":"تبقى كلها ظاهرة؛ فقد يحتاجها أحد"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rasid","name":{"en":"Rasid","ar":"رصيد"},"color":"#1C3D6E","icon":"bank","domain":"rasid.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Transfer","ar":"تحويل"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"To account","ar":"إلى الحساب"},"text":"","icon":"user"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Amount","ar":"المبلغ"},"text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Purpose","ar":"الغرض"},"text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Reference code","ar":"الرمز المرجعي"},"text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":"SWIFT","text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"select","label":{"en":"Schedule","ar":"الجدولة"},"text":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"select","label":{"en":"Fees paid by","ar":"من يدفع الرسوم"},"text":{"en":"Me","ar":"أنا"},"gap":"s"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Continue","ar":"متابعة"}}]}},{"id":"more","text":{"en":"Show account and amount; put the rest under \"More options\", and ask for SWIFT only for transfers abroad","ar":"تعرض الحساب والمبلغ؛ وتضع الباقي تحت «خيارات أخرى»، ولا تطلب SWIFT إلا للتحويل إلى الخارج"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rasid","name":{"en":"Rasid","ar":"رصيد"},"color":"#1C3D6E","icon":"bank","domain":"rasid.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Transfer","ar":"تحويل"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"To account","ar":"إلى الحساب"},"text":"","icon":"user"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Amount","ar":"المبلغ"},"text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"accordion","text":{"en":"More options","ar":"خيارات أخرى"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","gap":"s","text":{"en":"SWIFT is asked only for transfers abroad.","ar":"يُطلب SWIFT فقط عند التحويل إلى الخارج."}}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Continue","ar":"متابعة"}}]}},{"id":"delete","text":{"en":"Remove the extra fields from the app","ar":"تحذف الحقول الإضافية من التطبيق"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rasid","name":{"en":"Rasid","ar":"رصيد"},"color":"#1C3D6E","icon":"bank","domain":"rasid.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Transfer","ar":"تحويل"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"To account","ar":"إلى الحساب"},"text":"","icon":"user"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Amount","ar":"المبلغ"},"text":"","gap":"s"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Continue","ar":"متابعة"}}]}}],"answer":["more"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P02-033","when":["all"],"feedback":{"en":"For most people, five of the seven fields are noise they must read and skip, and some will fill them in just to be safe.","ar":"عند أغلب الناس، خمسة من الحقول السبعة ضجيج عليهم أن يقرؤوه ويتخطّوه، وبعضهم سيملؤها للاحتياط فقط."}},{"id":"MC-P02-034","when":["delete"],"feedback":{"en":"Some people do need to schedule a transfer or send money abroad. Removing those fields removes the feature.","ar":"بعض الناس يحتاجون فعلًا إلى جدولة تحويل أو إرسال مال إلى الخارج. وحذف هذه الحقول يحذف الميزة."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Who needs the extra fields, and how often?","ar":"من يحتاج الحقول الإضافية، وكم مرة؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Show the common case; reveal the rest when needed.","ar":"اعرض الحالة الشائعة؛ واكشف الباقي عند الحاجة."},"explain":{"en":"Most people see two fields and finish. Those who need scheduling or a transfer abroad still find every option, one tap away.","ar":"يرى أغلب الناس حقلين وينتهون. ومن يحتاج الجدولة أو التحويل إلى الخارج يجد كل الخيارات، على بُعد ضغطة واحدة."},"speaker":"mona"},{"id":"S05","type":"tune","part":"guided","skill":"SK-P02-U04-04","rules":["R06"],"value":{"en":"Aesthetic and minimalist design (NN/g): flat, minimal visual design doesn't satisfy this heuristic by default, and often removes necessary elements. Fields need visible borders and labels.","ar":"التصميم الجمالي البسيط (NN/g): التصميم المسطّح البسيط لا يحقق هذا المبدأ تلقائيًا، وكثيرًا ما يحذف عناصر ضرورية. فالحقول تحتاج إلى حدود وأسماء ظاهرة."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/aesthetic-minimalist-design/","quote":"minimalist visual design (sometimes referred to as flat design) does not always satisfy this heuristic by default (and is often guilty of removing necessary elements)"},"scenario":{"en":"For a cleaner look, a designer on my team removed the field borders and labels from the sign-in screen. Only grey placeholder text is left inside invisible fields.","ar":"لكي يبدو التصميم أنظف، حذف مصمم في فريقي حدود الحقول وعناوينها (Labels) من شاشة الدخول. ولم يبقَ إلا نص رمادي توضيحي (Placeholder) داخل حقول غير مرئية."},"prompt":{"en":"What should we do?","ar":"ماذا نفعل؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rasid","name":{"en":"Rasid","ar":"رصيد"},"color":"#1C3D6E","icon":"bank","domain":"rasid.example"},"blocks":[{"kind":"icon","icon":"bank","size":"l","color":"brand"},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Sign in","ar":"تسجيل الدخول"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Username","ar":"اسم المستخدم"},"tone":"faint","gap":"l"},{"kind":"line","gap":"xs"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Password","ar":"كلمة المرور"},"tone":"faint","gap":"l","note":{"en":"No borders, no labels: only grey placeholder text","ar":"بلا حدود ولا أسماء: نص رمادي فقط"}},{"kind":"line","gap":"xs"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Sign in","ar":"دخول"}}]},"options":[{"id":"keep","text":{"en":"Keep it; less is more","ar":"نُبقيها؛ فالأقل أفضل"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rasid","name":{"en":"Rasid","ar":"رصيد"},"color":"#1C3D6E","icon":"bank","domain":"rasid.example"},"blocks":[{"kind":"icon","icon":"bank","size":"l","color":"brand"},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Sign in","ar":"تسجيل الدخول"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Username","ar":"اسم المستخدم"},"tone":"faint","gap":"l"},{"kind":"line","gap":"xs"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Password","ar":"كلمة المرور"},"tone":"faint","gap":"l","note":{"en":"No borders, no labels: only grey placeholder text","ar":"بلا حدود ولا أسماء: نص رمادي فقط"}},{"kind":"line","gap":"xs"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Sign in","ar":"دخول"}}]}},{"id":"back","text":{"en":"Bring back visible field borders and labels above the fields","ar":"نعيد حدود الحقول الظاهرة والأسماء فوق الحقول"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rasid","name":{"en":"Rasid","ar":"رصيد"},"color":"#1C3D6E","icon":"bank","domain":"rasid.example"},"blocks":[{"kind":"icon","icon":"bank","size":"l","color":"brand"},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Sign in","ar":"تسجيل الدخول"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Username","ar":"اسم المستخدم"},"text":"","gap":"l"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Password","ar":"كلمة المرور"},"text":"","trail":"eye","gap":"m"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Sign in","ar":"دخول"}}]}},{"id":"dark","text":{"en":"Make the placeholder text darker","ar":"نجعل النص الرمادي داخل الحقول أغمق"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rasid","name":{"en":"Rasid","ar":"رصيد"},"color":"#1C3D6E","icon":"bank","domain":"rasid.example"},"blocks":[{"kind":"icon","icon":"bank","size":"l","color":"brand"},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Sign in","ar":"تسجيل الدخول"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Username","ar":"اسم المستخدم"},"gap":"l","color":"ink"},{"kind":"line","gap":"xs"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Password","ar":"كلمة المرور"},"gap":"l","note":{"en":"Darker, but still no borders or labels","ar":"أغمق، لكن ما زال بلا حدود ولا أسماء"},"color":"ink"},{"kind":"line","gap":"xs"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Sign in","ar":"دخول"}}]}}],"answer":["back"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P02-034","when":["keep","dark"],"feedback":{"en":"Without borders, people can't tell where to tap, and placeholder text disappears as soon as they type, so they forget which field they're in.","ar":"دون الحدود، لا يعرف الناس أين يضغطون، والنص الرمادي يختفي بمجرد الكتابة، فينسون في أيّ حقل هم."}}],"hints":[{"en":"What tells people that this is a box they can type in?","ar":"ما الذي يخبر الناس أن هذا مربع يستطيعون الكتابة فيه؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Keep what the task needs, even in a clean design.","ar":"أبقِ ما تحتاجه المهمة، حتى في تصميم نظيف."},"explain":{"en":"Borders show where to type and labels stay visible while typing. They are signal, not noise; a minimal design keeps them.","ar":"الحدود تُظهر أين يكتب الناس، والأسماء تظل ظاهرة أثناء الكتابة. فهي إشارة لا ضجيج؛ والتصميم البسيط يُبقيها."},"speaker":"mona"},{"id":"S06","type":"compare","speaker":"tarek","part":"contrast","skill":"SK-P02-U04-04","rules":["R11"],"value":{"en":"Aesthetic and minimalist design (NN/g): a minimalist design contains all the elements needed to support the task. A checkout without the total or delivery date is not minimal, it's missing what people decide with.","ar":"التصميم الجمالي البسيط (NN/g): التصميم البسيط يحتوي على كل العناصر اللازمة لدعم المهمة. والدفع دون الإجمالي أو موعد التوصيل ليس بسيطًا، بل ينقصه ما يقرّر به الناس."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/aesthetic-minimalist-design/","quote":"a minimalist design contains all necessary elements to support user tasks."},"scenario":{"en":"My team made two clean versions of an online shop's checkout. The agency prefers A: \"it's calmer\".","ar":"صنع فريقي نسختين نظيفتين لصفحة الدفع في متجر إلكتروني. وتفضّل شركة التصميم النسخة A: «فهي أهدأ»."},"prompt":{"en":"Which checkout should ship?","ar":"أيّ صفحة دفع تُظهر للناس كل ما يراجعونه قبل الدفع؟"},"a":{"label":{"en":"Version A: very calm","ar":"النسخة A: هادئة جدًا"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Checkout","ar":"الدفع"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","art":"box","text":{"en":"3 items","ar":"3 منتجات"}}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Pay","ar":"ادفع"}}]}},"b":{"label":{"en":"Version B: calm, with the facts","ar":"النسخة B: هادئة، مع الإجمالي والتوصيل والموعد"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Checkout","ar":"الدفع"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","art":"box","text":{"en":"3 items","ar":"3 منتجات"},"value":{"en":"EGP 1,340","ar":"1,340 جنيه"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"truck","text":{"en":"Delivery · arrives Thu 6 Nov","ar":"التوصيل · يصل الخميس 6 نوفمبر"},"value":{"en":"EGP 40","ar":"40 جنيه"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"Total EGP 1,380","ar":"الإجمالي 1,380 جنيه"},"gap":"m"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Pay EGP 1,380","ar":"ادفع 1,380 جنيه"}}]}},"answer":"b","misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P02-034","when":["a"],"feedback":{"en":"A is calm because it's missing the total, the delivery fee and the date, which are exactly what people check before paying.","ar":"A هادئة لأنها ينقصها الإجمالي ورسوم التوصيل والموعد، وهي بالضبط ما يراجعه الناس قبل الدفع."}}],"correct":{"en":"B: still simple, nothing needed is missing.","ar":"B: ما زالت بسيطة، ولا ينقصها شيء مطلوب."},"explain":{"en":"B adds only what people decide with: the cost, the fee and when it arrives. Minimal means no extra, not less than the task needs.","ar":"تضيف B فقط ما يقرّر به الناس: التكلفة، والرسوم، وموعد الوصول. فالبساطة تعني ألّا تزيد على ما تحتاجه المهمة، لا أن تنقص عنه."}},{"id":"S07","type":"tune","speaker":"hana","part":"independent","skill":"SK-P02-U04-03","rules":["R14"],"confidence":true,"value":{"en":"Aesthetic and minimalist design (NN/g): every piece of content should have a purpose. On a class card, a big stock photo and the trainer's long bio push down the time and the spots left.","ar":"التصميم الجمالي البسيط (NN/g): يجب أن يكون لكل جزء من المحتوى غرض. وفي بطاقة الحصة، تدفع الصورة الكبيرة ونبذة المدرّب الطويلة الوقتَ والأماكنَ المتبقية إلى الأسفل."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/aesthetic-minimalist-design/","quote":"Every piece of content should have a purpose, including negative space."},"scenario":{"en":"In my gym's app, each class in the timetable is a big card: a stock photo, the trainer's bio and a quote. The time and spots left are at the bottom, so members see two classes per screen.","ar":"في تطبيق النادي الذي أملكه، كل حصة في الجدول بطاقة كبيرة: صورة جاهزة من الإنترنت، ونبذة عن المدرّب، واقتباس. والوقت والأماكن المتبقية في الأسفل، فيرى الأعضاء حصتين فقط في كل شاشة."},"prompt":{"en":"How should the timetable show each class?","ar":"كيف يعرض الجدول كل حصة ليختار الأعضاء بسرعة؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Timetable · Thursday","ar":"الجدول · الخميس"}},"blocks":[{"kind":"card","art":"gym","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Coach Mai","ar":"المدرّبة مي"}},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"10 years of yoga teaching, certified in Bali and Cairo. Loves sunrise sessions and strong tea.","ar":"10 سنوات في تدريب اليوغا، معتمدة في بالي والقاهرة. تحب جلسات الشروق والشاي الثقيل."}},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"\"Breathe in, the day is yours.\"","ar":"«خذ نفسًا، اليوم لك.»"},"tone":"faint"},{"kind":"badge","text":{"en":"Yoga · 6 pm · 4 spots left","ar":"يوغا · 6 م · بقي 4 أماكن"},"tone":"neutral","gap":"s","note":{"en":"Time and spots come last","ar":"الوقت والأماكن في الآخر"}}]}]},"options":[{"id":"row","text":{"en":"A compact row: time, class, trainer's name, spots left and Book; the bio opens on tap","ar":"صف مختصر: الوقت، والحصة، واسم المدرّب، والأماكن المتبقية، و«احجز»؛ وتُفتح النبذة عند الضغط"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Timetable · Thursday","ar":"الجدول · الخميس"}},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"clock","text":{"en":"6:00 pm · Yoga","ar":"6:00 م · يوغا"},"sub":{"en":"Coach Mai · 4 spots left","ar":"المدرّبة مي · بقي 4 أماكن"},"value":{"en":"Book","ar":"احجز"},"note":{"en":"Tap a row for the trainer's bio","ar":"اضغط الصف لترى نبذة المدرّب"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"clock","text":{"en":"7:00 pm · Spinning","ar":"7:00 م · Spinning"},"sub":{"en":"Coach Omar · 2 spots left","ar":"المدرّب عمر · بقي مكانان"},"value":{"en":"Book","ar":"احجز"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"clock","text":{"en":"8:00 pm · HIIT","ar":"8:00 م · HIIT"},"sub":{"en":"Coach Hany · 9 spots left","ar":"المدرّب هاني · بقي 9 أماكن"},"value":{"en":"Book","ar":"احجز"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"clock","text":{"en":"9:00 pm · Pilates","ar":"9:00 م · Pilates"},"sub":{"en":"Coach Mai · Full","ar":"المدرّبة مي · مكتملة"},"value":{"en":"Waitlist","ar":"انتظار"},"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"smaller","text":{"en":"The same card with a smaller photo","ar":"البطاقة نفسها بصورة أصغر"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Timetable · Thursday","ar":"الجدول · الخميس"}},"blocks":[{"kind":"card","blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"gym","size":"s"},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Coach Mai","ar":"المدرّبة مي"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"10 years of yoga teaching, certified in Bali and Cairo. Loves sunrise sessions and strong tea.","ar":"10 سنوات في تدريب اليوغا، معتمدة في بالي والقاهرة. تحب جلسات الشروق والشاي الثقيل."}},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"\"Breathe in, the day is yours.\"","ar":"«خذ نفسًا، اليوم لك.»"},"tone":"faint"},{"kind":"badge","text":{"en":"Yoga · 6 pm · 4 spots left","ar":"يوغا · 6 م · بقي 4 أماكن"},"tone":"neutral","gap":"s","note":{"en":"Still last on the card","ar":"ما زالت في آخر البطاقة"}}]}]}},{"id":"carousel","text":{"en":"Show the cards in a sideways carousel, one at a time","ar":"عرض البطاقات في شريط يتحرّك أفقيًا (Carousel)، بطاقة في كل مرة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Timetable · Thursday","ar":"الجدول · الخميس"}},"blocks":[{"kind":"card","art":"gym","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Coach Mai","ar":"المدرّبة مي"}},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"10 years of yoga teaching, certified in Bali and Cairo. Loves sunrise sessions and strong tea.","ar":"10 سنوات في تدريب اليوغا، معتمدة في بالي والقاهرة. تحب جلسات الشروق والشاي الثقيل."}},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"\"Breathe in, the day is yours.\"","ar":"«خذ نفسًا، اليوم لك.»"},"tone":"faint"},{"kind":"badge","text":{"en":"Yoga · 6 pm · 4 spots left","ar":"يوغا · 6 م · بقي 4 أماكن"},"tone":"neutral","gap":"s","note":{"en":"Time and spots come last","ar":"الوقت والأماكن في الآخر"}}]},{"kind":"small","text":"● ○ ○ ○ ○ ○","gap":"s","note":{"en":"One card at a time; swipe for the next","ar":"بطاقة واحدة كل مرة؛ اسحب للتالية"}}]}}],"answer":["row"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P02-035","when":["smaller"],"feedback":{"en":"The photo, bio and quote still come before the time and the spots, which are what members choose a class by.","ar":"ما زالت الصورة والنبذة والاقتباس تسبق الوقت والأماكن، وهما ما يختار به الأعضاء الحصة."}},{"id":"MC-P02-033","when":["carousel"],"feedback":{"en":"One class at a time makes members swipe through the day to compare times, which is harder than before.","ar":"حصة واحدة في كل مرة تجعل الأعضاء يمرّرون اليوم كله ليقارنوا الأوقات، وهذا أصعب من قبل."}}],"hints":[{"en":"What do members look at first when picking a class?","ar":"إلى ماذا ينظر الأعضاء أولًا حين يختارون حصة؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Lead with what people choose by.","ar":"ابدأ بما يختار به الناس."},"explain":{"en":"Time and spots left decide the choice, so they lead. The bio still matters to some, so it stays one tap away instead of filling every card.","ar":"الوقت والأماكن المتبقية يحسمان الاختيار، فيأتيان أولًا. والنبذة ما زالت تهمّ البعض، فتبقى على بُعد ضغطة بدل أن تملأ كل بطاقة."}},{"id":"S08","type":"card","part":"recap","icons":["cut","eye","ok"],"title":{"en":"What you practised","ar":"ما تدرّبت عليه"},"body":{"en":"- **Remove the competition,** don't shout over it: move offers, news and decoration away from the main task.\n- **Show the common case first,** and reveal rare options when they're needed.\n- **Keep every needed element:** labels, borders, totals and dates are signal, not clutter.\n\nNext: the skill check for this unit.","ar":"- **أزِل المنافسة،** ولا تحاول أن تعلو عليها: انقل العروض والأخبار والزخرفة بعيدًا عن المهمة الرئيسية.\n- **اعرض الحالة الشائعة أولًا،** واكشف الخيارات النادرة حين تُحتاج.\n- **أبقِ كل عنصر مطلوب:** الأسماء والحدود والإجماليات والمواعيد إشارة، لا زوائد.\n\nالتالي: اختبار المهارة لهذه الوحدة."}}]}$uxg$::jsonb),
  ($uxg$P02-U04-L03$uxg$, $uxg$884b02ca64ca5f56a1cc2e19a8d1602d7d6e79d3424d2398322d2d0522b33b8f$uxg$, $uxg${"id":"P02-U04-L03","mode":"check","minutes":6,"title":{"en":"Skill check: speed up regulars, cut the clutter","ar":"اختبار المهارة: سرّع المعتادين، واحذف الزوائد"},"speaker":"karim","steps":[{"id":"S01","type":"card","part":"hook","title":{"en":"Karim's task manager","ar":"تطبيق كريم لإدارة المهام"},"mock":{"app":{"name":{"en":"Maham","ar":"مهام"},"color":"#2F6FDB","icon":"check-square-offset","domain":"maham.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"maham.example/team/launch","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"My tasks","ar":"مهامي"},{"en":"Team","ar":"الفريق"},{"en":"Dashboard","ar":"لوحة التحكم"}],"active":0,"actions":[{"icon":"bell"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"circle","text":{"en":"Write the launch post","ar":"اكتب منشور الإطلاق"},"sub":{"en":"Due Thu","ar":"موعده الخميس"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"circle","text":{"en":"Check the price page","ar":"راجع صفحة الأسعار"},"sub":{"en":"Due Fri","ar":"موعده الجمعة"},"gap":"s"}]},"body":{"en":"I'm building a task manager for small teams. People use it all day, every day. Help me review four parts of it.\n\nThis is a skill check: no hints, and you'll see how you did at the end.","ar":"أبني أداة لإدارة المهام للفِرق الصغيرة. ويستخدمها الناس طوال اليوم، كل يوم. ساعدني في مراجعة أربعة أجزاء منها.\n\nهذا اختبار مهارة: دون تلميحات، وسترى نتيجتك في النهاية."}},{"id":"S02","type":"tune","part":"check","skill":"SK-P02-U04-01","value":{"en":"Check, flexibility and efficiency (NN/g): provide accelerators like keyboard shortcuts and touch gestures, alongside the slower visible path.","ar":"اختبار، المرونة والكفاءة (NN/g): قدّم مسرّعات مثل اختصارات لوحة المفاتيح وإيماءات اللمس، بجانب الطريق الظاهر الأبطأ."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/ten-usability-heuristics/","quote":"Provide accelerators like keyboard shortcuts and touch gestures."},"scenario":{"en":"To mark a task done, people open the task, tap ⋯ and choose **Mark as done**. A typical user does this 30 times a day.","ar":"لكي يضع الناس علامة «تمّت» على مهمة، يفتحونها، ويضغطون ⋯، ويختارون **ضع علامة «تمّت»**. والمستخدم العادي يفعل ذلك 30 مرة في اليوم."},"prompt":{"en":"What should I add?","ar":"ماذا أضيف؟"},"mock":{"app":{"name":{"en":"Maham","ar":"مهام"},"color":"#2F6FDB","icon":"check-square-offset","domain":"maham.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Write the launch post","ar":"اكتب منشور الإطلاق"},"back":true,"actions":[{"icon":"dots-three-vertical"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Due Thu · Mona","ar":"موعده الخميس · منى"}},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"Short post for the app stores and social media.","ar":"منشور قصير لمتاجر التطبيقات ووسائل التواصل."},"gap":"m"}],"overlay":{"type":"menu","blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"check","text":{"en":"Mark as done","ar":"ضع علامة «تمّت»"},"note":{"en":"30 times a day: open, ⋯, Mark as done","ar":"30 مرة يوميًا: افتح، ⋯، ضع علامة"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"user-switch","text":{"en":"Reassign","ar":"أعِد الإسناد"}}]}},"options":[{"id":"fast","text":{"en":"A checkbox on each task in the list, plus a swipe and a keyboard key; keep the menu option too","ar":"Checkbox (مربع اختيار) على كل مهمة في القائمة، مع سحب ومفتاح في لوحة المفاتيح؛ مع إبقاء خيار القائمة أيضًا"},"mock":{"app":{"name":{"en":"Maham","ar":"مهام"},"color":"#2F6FDB","icon":"check-square-offset","domain":"maham.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"My tasks","ar":"مهامي"}},"blocks":[{"kind":"check","text":{"en":"Write the launch post","ar":"اكتب منشور الإطلاق"},"selected":true,"note":{"en":"Tap the box, swipe, or press D","ar":"اضغط المربع، أو اسحب، أو اضغط D"}},{"kind":"check","text":{"en":"Check the price page","ar":"راجع صفحة الأسعار"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"square","text":{"en":"Send the invoice to Dar","ar":"أرسل الفاتورة إلى دار"},"swipe":{"text":{"en":"Done","ar":"تمّت"}},"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"move","text":{"en":"Move \"Mark as done\" to the top of the ⋯ menu","ar":"نقل «ضع علامة تمّت» إلى أعلى قائمة ⋯"},"mock":{"app":{"name":{"en":"Maham","ar":"مهام"},"color":"#2F6FDB","icon":"check-square-offset","domain":"maham.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Write the launch post","ar":"اكتب منشور الإطلاق"},"back":true,"actions":[{"icon":"dots-three-vertical"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Due Thu · Mona","ar":"موعده الخميس · منى"}},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"Short post for the app stores and social media.","ar":"منشور قصير لمتاجر التطبيقات ووسائل التواصل."},"gap":"m"}],"overlay":{"type":"menu","blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"check","text":{"en":"Mark as done","ar":"ضع علامة «تمّت»"},"note":{"en":"First in ⋯, still open, ⋯, tap: 30 times a day","ar":"الأول في ⋯، لكن ما زال: افتح، ⋯، اضغط، 30 مرة يوميًا"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"user-switch","text":{"en":"Reassign","ar":"أعِد الإسناد"}}]}}},{"id":"gesture","text":{"en":"Replace the menu option with a swipe only","ar":"استبدال خيار القائمة بالسحب فقط"},"mock":{"app":{"name":{"en":"Maham","ar":"مهام"},"color":"#2F6FDB","icon":"check-square-offset","domain":"maham.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"My tasks","ar":"مهامي"}},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"circle","text":{"en":"Write the launch post","ar":"اكتب منشور الإطلاق"},"swipe":{"text":{"en":"Done","ar":"تمّت"}},"note":{"en":"Swipe is now the only way","ar":"السحب الآن هو الطريقة الوحيدة"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"circle","text":{"en":"Check the price page","ar":"راجع صفحة الأسعار"},"gap":"s"}]}}],"answer":["fast"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P02-030","when":["move"],"feedback":{"en":"It saves a moment, but people still open each task and a menu, 30 times a day.","ar":"هذا يوفّر لحظة، لكن الناس ما زالوا يفتحون كل مهمة وقائمة، 30 مرة في اليوم."}},{"id":"MC-P02-029","when":["gesture"],"feedback":{"en":"A swipe alone is hidden: new users won't find it, and they'd lose the visible way that worked.","ar":"السحب وحده مخفي: لن يجده المستخدمون الجدد، وسيفقدون الطريقة الظاهرة التي كانت تعمل."}}],"correct":{"en":"Add fast paths, keep the visible one.","ar":"أضِف طرقًا سريعة، وأبقِ الطريقة الظاهرة."},"explain":{"en":"The checkbox is visible to everyone and fast, the swipe and key speed up experts, and the menu option is still there for anyone who looks for it.","ar":"الـ Checkbox ظاهر للجميع وسريع، والسحب والمفتاح يسرّعان الخبراء، وخيار القائمة ما زال موجودًا لمن يبحث عنه."},"speaker":"karim"},{"id":"S03","type":"tune","part":"check","skill":"SK-P02-U04-02","value":{"en":"Check, flexibility and efficiency (NN/g): allow users to tailor frequent actions. Reassigning 30 tasks is one decision repeated 30 times; let people do it once.","ar":"اختبار، المرونة والكفاءة (NN/g): دَع المستخدمين يكيّفون الإجراءات المتكررة. وإعادة إسناد 30 مهمة قرار واحد يتكرّر 30 مرة؛ فدَع الناس ينفّذونه مرة واحدة."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/ten-usability-heuristics/","quote":"Allow users to tailor frequent actions."},"scenario":{"en":"When someone leaves a team, a manager must hand their 30 open tasks to a new person, opening and reassigning each one.","ar":"حين يترك أحد الفريق، يجب على المدير أن يسلّم مهامه الثلاثين المفتوحة لشخص جديد، بفتح كل مهمة وإعادة إسنادها."},"prompt":{"en":"What should the app let managers do?","ar":"ماذا يتيح التطبيق للمديرين لينقلوا المهام الثلاثين بسرعة؟"},"mock":{"app":{"name":{"en":"Maham","ar":"مهام"},"color":"#2F6FDB","icon":"check-square-offset","domain":"maham.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"maham.example/team/people/karim","blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","avatar":{"text":"Karim","art":"man-1"},"text":{"en":"Karim's open tasks (30)","ar":"مهام كريم المفتوحة (30)"},"sub":{"en":"Karim left the team","ar":"غادر كريم الفريق"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"circle","text":{"en":"Fix the sign-up email","ar":"أصلِح بريد التسجيل"},"value":{"en":"Assignee: Karim ▾","ar":"المسؤول: كريم ▾"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"circle","text":{"en":"Update the FAQ","ar":"حدّث الأسئلة الشائعة"},"value":{"en":"Assignee: Karim ▾","ar":"المسؤول: كريم ▾"},"gap":"s","note":{"en":"Reassigned one task at a time","ar":"تُسند كل مهمة وحدها"}}]},"options":[{"id":"bulk","text":{"en":"Filter by person, select all, and reassign them in one action","ar":"الفلترة حسب الشخص، واختيار الكل، وإعادة الإسناد بإجراء واحد"},"mock":{"app":{"name":{"en":"Maham","ar":"مهام"},"color":"#2F6FDB","icon":"check-square-offset","domain":"maham.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"maham.example/team/people/karim","blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","avatar":{"text":"Karim","art":"man-1"},"text":{"en":"Karim's open tasks (30)","ar":"مهام كريم المفتوحة (30)"},"sub":{"en":"Karim left the team","ar":"غادر كريم الفريق"}},{"kind":"row","gap":"m","blocks":[{"kind":"check","text":{"en":"Select all (30)","ar":"اختر الكل (30)"},"selected":true},{"kind":"select","text":{"en":"Reassign to: Mona Adel","ar":"أعِد الإسناد إلى: منى عادل"},"filled":true},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Reassign 30","ar":"أعِد إسناد 30"}}]},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"check-square","text":{"en":"Fix the sign-up email","ar":"أصلِح بريد التسجيل"},"value":{"en":"Assignee: Karim ▾","ar":"المسؤول: كريم ▾"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"check-square","text":{"en":"Update the FAQ","ar":"حدّث الأسئلة الشائعة"},"value":{"en":"Assignee: Karim ▾","ar":"المسؤول: كريم ▾"},"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"support","text":{"en":"Email our support team to move the tasks","ar":"مراسلة فريق الدعم لنقل المهام"},"mock":{"app":{"name":{"en":"Maham","ar":"مهام"},"color":"#2F6FDB","icon":"check-square-offset","domain":"maham.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"maham.example/team/people/karim","blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","avatar":{"text":"Karim","art":"man-1"},"text":{"en":"Karim's open tasks (30)","ar":"مهام كريم المفتوحة (30)"},"sub":{"en":"Karim left the team","ar":"غادر كريم الفريق"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"circle","text":{"en":"Fix the sign-up email","ar":"أصلِح بريد التسجيل"},"value":{"en":"Assignee: Karim ▾","ar":"المسؤول: كريم ▾"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"circle","text":{"en":"Update the FAQ","ar":"حدّث الأسئلة الشائعة"},"value":{"en":"Assignee: Karim ▾","ar":"المسؤول: كريم ▾"},"gap":"s","note":{"en":"Or email support and wait for them to move them","ar":"أو راسل الدعم وانتظر حتى ينقلوها"}}]}},{"id":"faster","text":{"en":"A faster assignee dropdown inside each task","ar":"قائمة منسدلة (Dropdown) أسرع لاختيار المسؤول داخل كل مهمة"},"mock":{"app":{"name":{"en":"Maham","ar":"مهام"},"color":"#2F6FDB","icon":"check-square-offset","domain":"maham.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"maham.example/team/people/karim","blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","avatar":{"text":"Karim","art":"man-1"},"text":{"en":"Karim's open tasks (30)","ar":"مهام كريم المفتوحة (30)"},"sub":{"en":"Karim left the team","ar":"غادر كريم الفريق"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"circle","text":{"en":"Fix the sign-up email","ar":"أصلِح بريد التسجيل"},"value":{"en":"Assignee: Karim ▾","ar":"المسؤول: كريم ▾"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"circle","text":{"en":"Update the FAQ","ar":"حدّث الأسئلة الشائعة"},"value":{"en":"Assignee: Karim ▾","ar":"المسؤول: كريم ▾"},"gap":"s","note":{"en":"A faster dropdown, still 30 tasks one by one","ar":"قائمة أسرع، لكن ما زالت 30 مهمة واحدة واحدة"}}]}}],"answer":["bulk"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P02-028","when":["faster","support"],"feedback":{"en":"Each task is still handled one at a time, by the manager or by someone else, with the same chance of missing one.","ar":"ما زالت كل مهمة تُعالج وحدها، من المدير أو من غيره، مع الاحتمال نفسه لنسيان واحدة."}}],"correct":{"en":"One action for many items.","ar":"إجراء واحد لعناصر كثيرة."},"explain":{"en":"Selecting all of one person's tasks and reassigning them together takes seconds and leaves none behind.","ar":"اختيار كل مهام شخص واحد وإعادة إسنادها معًا يستغرق ثواني ولا يترك أي مهمة خلفه."},"speaker":"karim"},{"id":"S04","type":"tune","part":"check","skill":"SK-P02-U04-03","value":{"en":"Check, aesthetic and minimalist design (NN/g): don't let unnecessary elements distract people from the information they really need. Fourteen charts bury the one number team leads check every morning.","ar":"اختبار، التصميم الجمالي البسيط (NN/g): لا تدَع العناصر غير الضرورية تشتّت الناس عن المعلومات التي يحتاجونها فعلًا. وأربعة عشر رسمًا بيانيًا تدفن الرقم الوحيد الذي يراجعه قادة الفرق كل صباح."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/ten-usability-heuristics/","quote":"Don't let unnecessary elements distract users from the information they really need."},"scenario":{"en":"The team dashboard shows 14 charts. In interviews, team leads said they open it each morning for one thing: which tasks are overdue, and whose.","ar":"لوحة الفريق (Dashboard) تعرض 14 رسمًا بيانيًا. وفي المقابلات، قال قادة الفرق إنهم يفتحونها كل صباح لشيء واحد: أيّ المهام متأخرة، ولمن."},"prompt":{"en":"What should the dashboard lead with?","ar":"بماذا تبدأ اللوحة ليعرف قادة الفرق المهام المتأخرة فورًا؟"},"mock":{"app":{"name":{"en":"Maham","ar":"مهام"},"color":"#2F6FDB","icon":"check-square-offset","domain":"maham.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"maham.example/team/dashboard","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"My tasks","ar":"مهامي"},{"en":"Team","ar":"الفريق"},{"en":"Dashboard","ar":"لوحة التحكم"}],"active":2},"blocks":[{"kind":"row","blocks":[{"kind":"chart","type":"bar","values":[12,18,9,22]},{"kind":"chart","type":"line","values":[3,5,4,7]},{"kind":"chart","type":"bar","values":[6,2,8,5]}]},{"kind":"row","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"chart","type":"line","values":[9,7,8,6]},{"kind":"chart","type":"bar","values":[4,9,3,7],"highlight":1},{"kind":"chart","type":"line","values":[2,4,6,5],"note":{"en":"14 charts; overdue tasks are one of them","ar":"14 رسمًا؛ ورسم المهام المتأخرة واحد منها"}}]}]},"options":[{"id":"overdue","text":{"en":"An \"Overdue\" list grouped by person at the top; the charts move to a Reports page","ar":"قائمة «متأخرة» مجمّعة حسب الشخص في الأعلى؛ وتنتقل الرسوم إلى صفحة التقارير"},"mock":{"app":{"name":{"en":"Maham","ar":"مهام"},"color":"#2F6FDB","icon":"check-square-offset","domain":"maham.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"maham.example/team/dashboard"