charts; overdue tasks are one of them","ar":"14 رسمًا؛ ورسم المهام المتأخرة واحد منها"}}]}]}},{"id":"tabs","text":{"en":"Split the 14 charts into 3 tabs","ar":"تقسيم الرسوم الأربعة عشر إلى 3 تبويبات (Tabs)"},"mock":{"app":{"name":{"en":"Maham","ar":"مهام"},"color":"#2F6FDB","icon":"check-square-offset","domain":"maham.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"maham.example/team/dashboard","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"My tasks","ar":"مهامي"},{"en":"Team","ar":"الفريق"},{"en":"Dashboard","ar":"لوحة التحكم"}],"active":2},"blocks":[{"kind":"tabs","options":[{"en":"Progress","ar":"التقدّم"},{"en":"Workload","ar":"عبء العمل"},{"en":"Deadlines","ar":"المواعيد"}],"value":0,"note":{"en":"14 charts in 3 tabs","ar":"14 رسمًا في 3 تبويبات"}},{"kind":"row","blocks":[{"kind":"chart","type":"bar","values":[12,18,9,22]},{"kind":"chart","type":"line","values":[3,5,4,7]},{"kind":"chart","type":"bar","values":[6,2,8,5]}]},{"kind":"row","gap":"m","blocks":[{"kind":"chart","type":"line","values":[9,7,8,6]},{"kind":"chart","type":"bar","values":[4,9,3,7],"highlight":1},{"kind":"chart","type":"line","values":[2,4,6,5],"note":{"en":"14 charts; overdue tasks are one of them","ar":"14 رسمًا؛ ورسم المهام المتأخرة واحد منها"}}]}]}}],"answer":["overdue"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P02-032","when":["bigger"],"feedback":{"en":"A bigger chart still sits among 13 others, and a chart is slower to read than a list of names and tasks.","ar":"الرسم الأكبر ما زال بين 13 رسمًا آخر، والرسم أبطأ في القراءة من قائمة أسماء ومهام."}},{"id":"MC-P02-033","when":["tabs"],"feedback":{"en":"Tabs just hide the charts in a different way. Team leads still have to find the one thing they came for.","ar":"التبويبات تُخفي الرسوم بطريقة أخرى فقط. وما زال على قادة الفرق أن يجدوا الشيء الوحيد الذي جاؤوا من أجله."}}],"correct":{"en":"Lead with what people came for.","ar":"ابدأ بما جاء الناس من أجله."},"explain":{"en":"The overdue list answers the morning question at a glance. The charts are still there for the rarer moments someone needs them.","ar":"قائمة المتأخرات تجيب عن سؤال الصباح من نظرة. والرسوم ما زالت موجودة حين يحتاجها أحد، وهذا أقل حدوثًا."},"speaker":"karim"},{"id":"S05","type":"tune","part":"check","skill":"SK-P02-U04-04","value":{"en":"Check, aesthetic and minimalist design (NN/g): if people cannot find or discover the necessary elements, those elements do not exist for them. Due dates hidden for a cleaner list are lost information.","ar":"اختبار، التصميم الجمالي البسيط (NN/g): إن لم يستطع الناس إيجاد العناصر الضرورية أو اكتشافها، فهي غير موجودة بالنسبة لهم. وتواريخ الاستحقاق المخفية لتبدو القائمة أنظف معلومات ضائعة."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/aesthetic-minimalist-design/","quote":"if our users cannot find or discover the necessary elements, as far as they are concerned, those elements do not exist."},"scenario":{"en":"In a redesign, we removed due dates from the task list to make it cleaner. They now appear only inside each task. Missed deadlines went up.","ar":"في إعادة التصميم، حذفنا تواريخ الاستحقاق من قائمة المهام لتبدو أنظف. وأصبحت تظهر داخل كل مهمة فقط. فزادت المواعيد الفائتة."},"prompt":{"en":"What should we do?","ar":"ماذا نفعل؟"},"mock":{"app":{"name":{"en":"Maham","ar":"مهام"},"color":"#2F6FDB","icon":"check-square-offset","domain":"maham.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"My tasks","ar":"مهامي"}},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"circle","text":{"en":"Write the launch post","ar":"اكتب منشور الإطلاق"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"circle","text":{"en":"Check the price page","ar":"راجع صفحة الأسعار"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"circle","text":{"en":"Send the invoice to Dar","ar":"أرسل الفاتورة إلى دار"},"gap":"s","note":{"en":"Due dates removed from the list","ar":"حُذفت المواعيد من القائمة"}}]},"options":[{"id":"back","text":{"en":"Bring the due date back to each row, short and quiet, and highlight it when it's close","ar":"إعادة تاريخ الاستحقاق إلى كل صف، قصيرًا وهادئًا، مع إبرازه حين يقترب"},"mock":{"app":{"name":{"en":"Maham","ar":"مهام"},"color":"#2F6FDB","icon":"check-square-offset","domain":"maham.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"My tasks","ar":"مهامي"}},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"circle","text":{"en":"Write the launch post","ar":"اكتب منشور الإطلاق"},"value":{"en":"Thu","ar":"الخميس"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"circle","text":{"en":"Check the price page","ar":"راجع صفحة الأسعار"},"gap":"s","badge":{"text":{"en":"Due today","ar":"اليوم"},"tone":"warn"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"circle","text":{"en":"Send the invoice to Dar","ar":"أرسل الفاتورة إلى دار"},"gap":"s","value":{"en":"Mon","ar":"الإثنين"}}]}},{"id":"emails","text":{"en":"Keep the clean list, and email people about due dates","ar":"إبقاء القائمة النظيفة، وإرسال بريد للناس عن المواعيد"},"mock":{"app":{"name":{"en":"Maham","ar":"مهام"},"color":"#2F6FDB","icon":"check-square-offset","domain":"maham.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"My tasks","ar":"مهامي"}},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"circle","text":{"en":"Write the launch post","ar":"اكتب منشور الإطلاق"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"circle","text":{"en":"Check the price page","ar":"راجع صفحة الأسعار"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"circle","text":{"en":"Send the invoice to Dar","ar":"أرسل الفاتورة إلى دار"},"gap":"s","note":{"en":"Due dates come only by email","ar":"المواعيد تصل بالبريد فقط"}}]}},{"id":"hover","text":{"en":"Show the date when people hover over a task","ar":"إظهار التاريخ حين يمرّ الناس على المهمة بالمؤشر"},"mock":{"app":{"name":{"en":"Maham","ar":"مهام"},"color":"#2F6FDB","icon":"check-square-offset","domain":"maham.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"My tasks","ar":"مهامي"}},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"circle","text":{"en":"Write the launch post","ar":"اكتب منشور الإطلاق"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"circle","text":{"en":"Check the price page","ar":"راجع صفحة الأسعار"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"circle","text":{"en":"Send the invoice to Dar","ar":"أرسل الفاتورة إلى دار"},"gap":"s","note":{"en":"The date shows only on hover","ar":"يظهر التاريخ فقط عند المرور بالمؤشر"}}]}}],"answer":["back"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P02-034","when":["emails","hover"],"feedback":{"en":"People plan their day from the list. A date hidden behind a hover, or in an inbox, isn't there when they decide what to do next.","ar":"يخطّط الناس يومهم من القائمة. والتاريخ المخفي خلف المرور بالمؤشر، أو في البريد، لا يكون أمامهم حين يقرّرون ما يفعلونه بعد ذلك."}}],"correct":{"en":"The due date is signal; keep it in view.","ar":"تاريخ الاستحقاق إشارة؛ أبقِه ظاهرًا."},"explain":{"en":"A short date on each row adds little clutter and tells people what's urgent. Clean shouldn't mean missing what people plan with.","ar":"التاريخ القصير على كل صف يضيف زحامًا قليلًا ويخبر الناس بما هو عاجل. والتصميم النظيف يجب ألّا يعني حذف ما يخطّط به الناس."},"speaker":"karim"}]}$uxg$::jsonb),
  ($uxg$P02-U05-L01$uxg$, $uxg$5034dc7d91f1aee27224be3bfafef57f46e7978b025deb489b6178e5e57b05df$uxg$, $uxg${"id":"P02-U05-L01","mode":"lesson","minutes":8,"title":{"en":"Error messages people can act on","ar":"رسائل خطأ تساعد الناس على الإصلاح"},"speaker":"sara","review_labels":{"MC-P02-036":{"en":"Codes and jargon don't explain","ar":"الرموز والمصطلحات لا تشرح"},"MC-P02-037":{"en":"Say what to do next","ar":"قل ما يجب فعله بعد ذلك"},"MC-P02-038":{"en":"Show the error at its source","ar":"أظهِر الخطأ عند مصدره"},"MC-P02-039":{"en":"Don't flag errors too early","ar":"لا تُظهر الخطأ مبكرًا جدًا"},"MC-P02-040":{"en":"Don't blame people","ar":"لا تلُم الناس"},"MC-P02-041":{"en":"Keep what people typed","ar":"احتفظ بما كتبه الناس"}},"steps":[{"id":"S01","type":"card","part":"hook","title":{"en":"Error 05","ar":"الخطأ 05"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"volta","name":{"en":"Volta","ar":"فولتا"},"color":"#1864AB","icon":"lightning","domain":"volta.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"volta.example/checkout/payment","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Laptops","ar":"لابتوب"},{"en":"Phones","ar":"هواتف"}],"active":0,"actions":[{"icon":"shopping-cart","count":1}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Payment","ar":"الدفع"}},{"kind":"banner","icon":"warning-circle","tone":"bad","text":{"en":"Error 05: DO_NOT_HONOR. Transaction failed.","ar":"Error 05: DO_NOT_HONOR. فشلت العملية."},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"listitem","art":"laptop","text":{"en":"Laptop 14\", 16 GB","ar":"لابتوب 14 بوصة، 16 GB"},"value":{"en":"EGP 24,500","ar":"24,500 جنيه"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Card number","ar":"رقم البطاقة"},"text":"4921 •••• •••• 7710","filled":true,"icon":"credit-card","gap":"m"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Pay EGP 24,500","ar":"ادفع 24,500 جنيه"},"gap":"m"}]},"body":{"en":"I'm redesigning the checkout of an online electronics shop. Hany tried to pay for a laptop and saw this message.\n\nHe didn't know if his card was blocked, if he'd typed something wrong, or if the shop was broken. He bought the laptop somewhere else.","ar":"أعيد تصميم صفحة الدفع في متجر إلكترونيات على الإنترنت. حاول هاني أن يدفع ثمن لابتوب فرأى هذه الرسالة.\n\nلم يعرف إن كانت بطاقته موقوفة، أم أنه كتب شيئًا خطأ، أم أن المتجر به عطل. فاشترى اللابتوب من مكان آخر."}},{"id":"S02","type":"tune","part":"try","skill":"SK-P02-U05-01","rules":["R12"],"confidence":true,"value":{"en":"Try first. Help users recover from errors (NN/g): error messages should use plain language with no codes, say precisely what the problem is, and suggest a solution.","ar":"جرّب أولًا. ساعد المستخدمين على التعافي من الأخطاء (NN/g): يجب أن تستخدم رسائل الخطأ لغة بسيطة دون رموز، وتقول المشكلة بدقة، وتقترح حلًا."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/ten-usability-heuristics/","quote":"Error messages should be expressed in plain language (no error codes), precisely indicate the problem, and constructively suggest a solution."},"prompt":{"en":"What should the message say?","ar":"ماذا يجب أن تقول الرسالة؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"volta","name":{"en":"Volta","ar":"فولتا"},"color":"#1864AB","icon":"lightning","domain":"volta.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"volta.example/checkout/payment","blocks":[{"kind":"banner","icon":"warning-circle","tone":"bad","text":{"en":"Error 05: DO_NOT_HONOR. Transaction failed.","ar":"Error 05: DO_NOT_HONOR. فشلت العملية."}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Card number","ar":"رقم البطاقة"},"text":"4921 •••• •••• 7710","filled":true,"icon":"credit-card","gap":"m"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Pay EGP 24,500","ar":"ادفع 24,500 جنيه"},"gap":"m"}]},"options":[{"id":"generic","text":{"en":"\"Something went wrong. Please try again.\"","ar":"«حدث خطأ ما. حاول مرة أخرى.»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"volta","name":{"en":"Volta","ar":"فولتا"},"color":"#1864AB","icon":"lightning","domain":"volta.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"volta.example/checkout/payment","blocks":[{"kind":"banner","icon":"warning-circle","tone":"bad","text":{"en":"Something went wrong. Please try again.","ar":"حدث خطأ ما. حاول مرة أخرى."}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Card number","ar":"رقم البطاقة"},"text":"4921 •••• •••• 7710","filled":true,"icon":"credit-card","gap":"m"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Pay EGP 24,500","ar":"ادفع 24,500 جنيه"},"gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"plain","text":{"en":"\"Your bank declined this payment. You haven't been charged. Try another card, or call your bank to allow it.\"","ar":"«رفض البنك هذه العملية. لم يُخصم منك شيء. جرّب بطاقة أخرى، أو اتصل بالبنك ليسمح بها.»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"volta","name":{"en":"Volta","ar":"فولتا"},"color":"#1864AB","icon":"lightning","domain":"volta.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"volta.example/checkout/payment","blocks":[{"kind":"banner","icon":"warning-circle","tone":"bad","text":{"en":"Your bank declined this payment. You haven't been charged. Try another card, or call your bank to allow it.","ar":"رفض البنك هذه العملية. لم يُخصم منك شيء. جرّب بطاقة أخرى، أو اتصل بالبنك ليسمح بها."}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Card number","ar":"رقم البطاقة"},"text":"4921 •••• •••• 7710","filled":true,"icon":"credit-card","gap":"m"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Pay EGP 24,500","ar":"ادفع 24,500 جنيه"},"gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"code","text":{"en":"\"Error 05 (DO_NOT_HONOR). Contact support with this code.\"","ar":"«Error 05 (DO_NOT_HONOR). تواصل مع الدعم بهذا الرمز.»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"volta","name":{"en":"Volta","ar":"فولتا"},"color":"#1864AB","icon":"lightning","domain":"volta.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"volta.example/checkout/payment","blocks":[{"kind":"banner","icon":"warning-circle","tone":"bad","text":{"en":"Error 05 (DO_NOT_HONOR). Contact support with this code.","ar":"Error 05 (DO_NOT_HONOR). تواصل مع الدعم بهذا الرمز."}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Card number","ar":"رقم البطاقة"},"text":"4921 •••• •••• 7710","filled":true,"icon":"credit-card","gap":"m"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Pay EGP 24,500","ar":"ادفع 24,500 جنيه"},"gap":"m"}]}}],"answer":["plain"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P02-037","when":["generic"],"feedback":{"en":"\"Try again\" will fail the same way, because the bank will decline again. Hany still doesn't know what happened or what would work.","ar":"«حاول مرة أخرى» ستفشل بالطريقة نفسها، لأن البنك سيرفض مرة أخرى. وما زال هاني لا يعرف ما حدث ولا ما الذي سينجح."}},{"id":"MC-P02-036","when":["code"],"feedback":{"en":"The code means something to the payment team, not to Hany. Sending him to support for a declined card wastes his time and ours.","ar":"الرمز يعني شيئًا لفريق الدفع، لا لهاني. وإرساله إلى الدعم بسبب بطاقة مرفوضة يضيّع وقته ووقتنا."}}],"hints":[{"en":"After reading it, would Hany know what happened and what to try?","ar":"بعد قراءتها، هل سيعرف هاني ما حدث وما الذي يجرّبه؟"}],"correct":{"en":"What happened, in plain words, and what to do.","ar":"ما حدث، بكلمات بسيطة، وما يجب فعله."},"explain":{"en":"The message names the cause (the bank declined), calms the worry (no charge) and gives two ways forward. Hany can fix it without leaving.","ar":"الرسالة تذكر السبب (البنك رفض)، وتطمئنه (لم يُخصم شيء)، وتعطي طريقين للمتابعة. فيستطيع هاني إصلاح الأمر دون أن يغادر."}},{"id":"S09","type":"video","part":"concept","title":{"en":"Help users recognize, diagnose and recover from errors","ar":"مساعدة الناس على ملاحظة الأخطاء وفهمها وإصلاحها (Help users recognize, diagnose, and recover from errors)"},"video":"7af55f5c-c0e4-4efa-a841-34e042b35be0","duration":124,"transcript":[{"t":2.5,"en":"For example, Airbnb: this is the usual screen when you look for a page, or open a link on Airbnb slash anything, or on any site,","ar":"مثلًا في المثال الخاص بـ Airbnb: دي الشاشة المعتادة لو بتبحثوا عن أي صفحة، أو دخلتوا لينك تابع لـ Airbnb سلاش أي حاجة، أو تابع لأي موقع،"},{"t":11.76,"en":"but that page doesn't exist on the site, so you get an error like this, a 404. And that isn't meaningful:","ar":"لكن الصفحة دي مش موجودة في الموقع أصلًا، فبيطلع لك Error كده، اللي هو 404. وده بيكونش معبّر:"},{"t":22.74,"en":"users don't understand what 404 means. It's not the language they speak.","ar":"اليوزر مش فاهم إيه 404 دي، يعني مش دي اللغة اللي هو بيتكلم بيها."},{"t":27.66,"en":"So what did Airbnb do here? They used the user's language, not 404, because that means nothing to users,","ar":"طيب، هنا Airbnb عمل إيه؟ اللي عملوه هنا إنه استخدم User language، ما استخدمش 404، لأنها حاجة مش مفهومة بالنسبة لليوزر،"},{"t":36.16,"en":"it's not the term they use when they hit a problem like this, or one they'd understand.","ar":"مش هو ده المصطلح اللي بيتعامل بيه لما بيقع في مشكلة زي دي، ولا هو ده المصطلح اللي هيفهمه."},{"t":41.34,"en":"Airbnb succeeded in using the user's language: we can't find the page you're looking for, but you can use these options,","ar":"لكن هنا Airbnb نجح إنه يستخدم User language، يقول له: إحنا مش لاقيين الـ Page اللي إنت بتدوّر عليها، لكن ممكن تستخدم الحلول الفلانية،"},{"t":50.22,"en":"and those options are part of recovery. But in general, let's say this error state is very successful,","ar":"والحلول دي طبعًا ليها علاقة بشق الـ Recovery. لكن In general، خلّينا نقول كده: الـ Error state هنا ناجحة جدًا،"},{"t":59.7,"en":"in using the user's language and giving clear recognition of the error and the error state, in a friendly, engaging way, with an illustration that keeps it light,","ar":"إنها تستخدم User language، وإنها توفّر لي Recognition واضح للخطأ وحالة الخطأ، بطريقة لطيفة و Engaging، وحاطّة Illustration، وخلّت الموضوع لطيف في نفس الوقت،"},{"t":73.34,"en":"and it gives links I can go to, and at the end a site map that shows every link or page on Airbnb, in case the suggestions above weren't enough for me.","ar":"وما استخدمت Links ممكن أروح لها، وفي الآخر Site map، من خلالها يقدر يورّيني كل الـ Links أو كل الصفحات اللي موجودة في Airbnb، لو الـ Suggestions اللي فوق دي ما كانتش كافية بالنسبة لي."},{"t":85.92,"en":"Another guideline for good error-message communication: use short, clear words,","ar":"كذلك من الـ Guidelines عشان تحقّق Communication جيد للـ Error messages: إنك تستخدم ألفاظ مختصرة وواضحة،"},{"t":91.98,"en":"unlike what Paymob uses here: the wording runs into two sentences, and they don't really say anything, they don't tell me what exactly is wrong.","ar":"بخلاف اللي مستخدَم هنا في Paymob: هتلاقي إن الألفاظ بدأت تدخل في جملتين، وجملتين أصلًا مش معبّرين، مش بيعرّفوني الخطأ في إيه بالظبط."},{"t":103.56,"en":"Another guideline: use a positive tone, meaning don't scold or blame users for a mistake they made.","ar":"كذلك من الـ Guidelines عشان تحقّق Communication جيد للـ Error messages: إنك تستخدم Positive tone، يعني ما تبقاش بتبكّت أو بتلوم اليوزر على خطأ هو عمله."},{"t":114.72,"en":"That's one of the things to avoid in UX writing.","ar":"ده من الحاجات الممنوعة في الـ UX writing."}]},{"id":"S03","type":"card","part":"concept","icons":["warn","text","ok"],"title":{"en":"Video summary","ar":"ملخص الفيديو"},"body":{"en":"The ninth heuristic: when something goes wrong, help people **notice it, understand it and fix it**.\n\n- **Make it noticeable,** right next to what caused it.\n- **Say it in plain words,** precisely, without codes or blame.\n- **Offer the way out:** a fix, a suggestion, and keep everything people already entered.","ar":"مبدأ الاستخدام (Usability heuristic) التاسع هو مساعدة الناس على ملاحظة الأخطاء وفهمها وإصلاحها (Help users recognize, diagnose, and recover from errors): حين يحدث خطأ، ساعد الناس على **ملاحظته وفهمه وإصلاحه**.\n\n- **اجعله ملحوظًا،** بجانب ما سبّبه مباشرة.\n- **قله بكلمات بسيطة،** وبدقة، دون رموز أو لوم.\n- **اعرض طريق الخروج:** إصلاحًا أو اقتراحًا، واحتفظ بكل ما أدخله الناس."}},{"id":"S04","type":"tune","part":"guided","skill":"SK-P02-U05-02","rules":["R06"],"value":{"en":"Error-message guidelines (NN/g): display the error close to its source, so people connect the message with what needs fixing.","ar":"إرشادات رسائل الخطأ (NN/g): اعرض الخطأ قريبًا من مصدره، حتى يربط الناس الرسالة بما يحتاج إلى إصلاح."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/error-message-guidelines/","quote":"Display the error message close to the error's source."},"scenario":{"en":"The delivery form has 9 fields. When something is wrong, one red line appears at the very top: \"Please fix the errors below.\" People scroll up and down looking for them.","ar":"نموذج التوصيل فيه 9 حقول. وحين يوجد خطأ، يظهر سطر أحمر واحد في أعلى الصفحة: «يرجى إصلاح الأخطاء أدناه.» فيصعد الناس وينزلون بحثًا عنها."},"prompt":{"en":"Where should the errors appear?","ar":"أين تظهر الأخطاء ليصلحها الناس دون بحث؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"volta","name":{"en":"Volta","ar":"فولتا"},"color":"#1864AB","icon":"lightning","domain":"volta.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Delivery details","ar":"بيانات التوصيل"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"banner","icon":"warning-circle","tone":"bad","text":{"en":"Please fix the errors below.","ar":"يرجى إصلاح الأخطاء أدناه."}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Full name","ar":"الاسم بالكامل"},"text":{"en":"Hany Fouad","ar":"هاني فؤاد"},"filled":true,"gap":"m"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"City","ar":"المدينة"},"text":{"en":"Giza","ar":"الجيزة"},"filled":true,"gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Street","ar":"الشارع"},"text":{"en":"Haram St","ar":"شارع الهرم"},"filled":true,"gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Building","ar":"العمارة"},"text":"","gap":"s","note":{"en":"Fields 5 to 9 are below the fold","ar":"الحقول من 5 إلى 9 خارج الشاشة، في الأسفل"}}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Continue","ar":"متابعة"}}]},"options":[{"id":"field","text":{"en":"Under each field that needs fixing, with the field outlined, and the page scrolls to the first one","ar":"تحت كل حقل يحتاج إلى إصلاح، مع إطار حول الحقل، وتنتقل الصفحة إلى أول حقل منها"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"volta","name":{"en":"Volta","ar":"فولتا"},"color":"#1864AB","icon":"lightning","domain":"volta.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Delivery details","ar":"بيانات التوصيل"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Full name","ar":"الاسم بالكامل"},"text":{"en":"Hany Fouad","ar":"هاني فؤاد"},"filled":true,"gap":"m"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"City","ar":"المدينة"},"text":{"en":"Giza","ar":"الجيزة"},"filled":true,"gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Street","ar":"الشارع"},"text":{"en":"Haram St","ar":"شارع الهرم"},"filled":true,"gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Building","ar":"العمارة"},"text":"","gap":"s","note":{"en":"The page scrolls here, to the first field to fix","ar":"تنتقل الصفحة إلى هنا، أول حقل يحتاج إلى إصلاح"},"tone":"bad","focus":true,"error":{"en":"Add your building number","ar":"أضِف رقم العمارة"}}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Continue","ar":"متابعة"}}]}},{"id":"list","text":{"en":"A list of all errors at the top","ar":"قائمة بكل الأخطاء في الأعلى"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"volta","name":{"en":"Volta","ar":"فولتا"},"color":"#1864AB","icon":"lightning","domain":"volta.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Delivery details","ar":"بيانات التوصيل"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"banner","icon":"warning-circle","tone":"bad","text":{"en":"Fix 2 fields: Building is empty · Phone number is too short","ar":"أصلِح حقلين: العمارة فارغة · رقم الهاتف قصير"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Full name","ar":"الاسم بالكامل"},"text":{"en":"Hany Fouad","ar":"هاني فؤاد"},"filled":true,"gap":"m"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"City","ar":"المدينة"},"text":{"en":"Giza","ar":"الجيزة"},"filled":true,"gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Street","ar":"الشارع"},"text":{"en":"Haram St","ar":"شارع الهرم"},"filled":true,"gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Building","ar":"العمارة"},"text":"","gap":"s","note":{"en":"Fields 5 to 9 are below the fold","ar":"الحقول من 5 إلى 9 خارج الشاشة، في الأسفل"}}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Continue","ar":"متابعة"}}]}},{"id":"popup","text":{"en":"A pop-up listing the errors, closed with OK","ar":"نافذة منبثقة تعرض الأخطاء، تُغلق بزر «حسنًا»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"volta","name":{"en":"Volta","ar":"فولتا"},"color":"#1864AB","icon":"lightning","domain":"volta.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Delivery details","ar":"بيانات التوصيل"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Full name","ar":"الاسم بالكامل"},"text":{"en":"Hany Fouad","ar":"هاني فؤاد"},"filled":true,"gap":"m"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"City","ar":"المدينة"},"text":{"en":"Giza","ar":"الجيزة"},"filled":true,"gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Street","ar":"الشارع"},"text":{"en":"Haram St","ar":"شارع الهرم"},"filled":true,"gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Building","ar":"العمارة"},"text":"","gap":"s","note":{"en":"Fields 5 to 9 are below the fold","ar":"الحقول من 5 إلى 9 خارج الشاشة، في الأسفل"}}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Continue","ar":"متابعة"}}],"overlay":{"type":"dialog","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Please fix these errors","ar":"يرجى إصلاح هذه الأخطاء"}},{"kind":"list","style":"bullet","gap":"s","items":[{"en":"Building is empty","ar":"العمارة فارغة"},{"en":"Phone number is too short","ar":"رقم الهاتف قصير"}]},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"OK","ar":"حسنًا"},"gap":"m"}]}}}],"answer":["field"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P02-038","when":["list","popup"],"feedback":{"en":"People read the list, then have to find each field and remember what was wrong with it. A pop-up disappears the moment they start fixing.","ar":"يقرأ الناس القائمة، ثم عليهم أن يجدوا كل حقل ويتذكّروا ما الخطأ فيه. والنافذة المنبثقة تختفي في اللحظة التي يبدؤون فيها الإصلاح."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Where are people looking when they fix a mistake?","ar":"أين ينظر الناس حين يصلحون خطأ؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Put each error next to its field.","ar":"ضع كل خطأ بجانب حقله."},"explain":{"en":"The message sits where the fix happens, so people read it and correct the field in one place. Scrolling to the first one saves the hunt.","ar":"الرسالة في مكان الإصلاح، فيقرؤها الناس ويصحّحون الحقل في المكان نفسه. والانتقال إلى أول خطأ يوفّر عناء البحث."},"speaker":"sara"},{"id":"S05","type":"tune","part":"guided","skill":"SK-P02-U05-02","rules":["R06"],"value":{"en":"Error-message guidelines (NN/g): presenting errors too early is a hostile pattern, like grading a test before the student has answered. Check a field once people have finished with it.","ar":"إرشادات رسائل الخطأ (NN/g): إظهار الأخطاء مبكرًا جدًا نمط عدائي، مثل تصحيح الاختبار قبل أن يجيب الطالب. تحقّق من الحقل بعد أن ينتهي الناس منه."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/error-message-guidelines/","quote":"Presenting errors too early is a hostile pattern."},"scenario":{"en":"As soon as people type the first letter of their email, the field turns red: \"Invalid email\". It stays red until they finish typing the whole address.","ar":"بمجرد أن يكتب الناس أول حرف من بريدهم الإلكتروني، يتحوّل الحقل إلى الأحمر: «بريد غير صالح». ويظل أحمر حتى ينتهوا من كتابة العنوان كله."},"prompt":{"en":"When should the email field check the address?","ar":"متى يجب أن يتحقّق حقل البريد من العنوان؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"volta","name":{"en":"Volta","ar":"فولتا"},"color":"#1864AB","icon":"lightning","domain":"volta.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Create account","ar":"أنشئ حسابًا"},"back":true},"keyboard":"text","blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Email","ar":"البريد الإلكتروني"},"text":"m","filled":true,"focus":true,"error":{"en":"Invalid email","ar":"بريد غير صالح"},"note":{"en":"Red after the first letter","ar":"أحمر بعد أول حرف"}}]},"options":[{"id":"blur","text":{"en":"When people leave the field or press Continue","ar":"حين يغادر الناس الحقل أو يضغطون «متابعة»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"volta","name":{"en":"Volta","ar":"فولتا"},"color":"#1864AB","icon":"lightning","domain":"volta.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Create account","ar":"أنشئ حسابًا"},"back":true},"keyboard":"text","blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Email","ar":"البريد الإلكتروني"},"text":"mona@ma","filled":true,"focus":true,"note":{"en":"Checked when people leave the field or press Continue","ar":"يُفحص حين يغادر الناس الحقل أو يضغطون «متابعة»"}}]}},{"id":"keys","text":{"en":"On every key, as now, but in orange instead of red","ar":"مع كل حرف، كما الآن، لكن بالبرتقالي بدل الأحمر"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"volta","name":{"en":"Volta","ar":"فولتا"},"color":"#1864AB","icon":"lightning","domain":"volta.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Create account","ar":"أنشئ حسابًا"},"back":true},"keyboard":"text","blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Email","ar":"البريد الإلكتروني"},"text":"m","filled":true,"focus":true,"error":{"en":"Invalid email","ar":"بريد غير صالح"},"note":{"en":"Orange instead of red, still after the first letter","ar":"برتقالي بدل الأحمر، وما زال بعد أول حرف"},"tone":"warn"}]}},{"id":"end","text":{"en":"Only after payment, when the receipt can't be sent","ar":"فقط بعد الدفع، حين يتعذّر إرسال الإيصال"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"volta","name":{"en":"Volta","ar":"فولتا"},"color":"#1864AB","icon":"lightning","domain":"volta.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Create account","ar":"أنشئ حسابًا"},"back":true},"keyboard":"text","blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Email","ar":"البريد الإلكتروني"},"text":"mona@mail.exmaple","filled":true,"focus":true,"note":{"en":"Not checked here; a typo shows up only after payment","ar":"لا يُفحص هنا؛ ولا يظهر الخطأ إلا بعد الدفع"}}]}}],"answer":["blur"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P02-039","when":["keys"],"feedback":{"en":"A softer colour is still a warning about an address people haven't finished typing. It tells them they're wrong while they're doing it right.","ar":"اللون الأهدأ ما زال تحذيرًا من عنوان لم ينتهِ الناس من كتابته. فهو يخبرهم أنهم مخطئون وهم يكتبون الصواب."}},{"id":"MC-P02-038","when":["end"],"feedback":{"en":"By then people have left the form and the receipt is lost. The check should come while the mistake is still easy to fix.","ar":"حينها يكون الناس قد تركوا النموذج وضاع الإيصال. يجب أن يأتي التحقّق والخطأ ما زال سهل الإصلاح."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Is \"m\" a wrong email, or an email that isn't finished yet?","ar":"هل «m» بريد خطأ، أم بريد لم يكتمل بعد؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Check when people are done with the field.","ar":"تحقّق حين ينتهي الناس من الحقل."},"explain":{"en":"Checking when people leave the field catches a real mistake early, without scolding them halfway through typing.","ar":"التحقّق حين يغادر الناس الحقل يكتشف الخطأ الحقيقي مبكرًا، دون أن يوبّخهم وهم في منتصف الكتابة."},"speaker":"sara"},{"id":"S06","type":"compare","speaker":"karim","part":"contrast","skill":"SK-P02-U05-01","rules":["R11"],"value":{"en":"Error-message guidelines (NN/g): use a positive tone and don't blame the user. Avoid words like invalid, illegal or incorrect; say what will work.","ar":"إرشادات رسائل الخطأ (NN/g): استخدم نبرة إيجابية ولا تلُم المستخدم. تجنّب كلمات مثل «غير صالح» و«غير مسموح» و«خطأ»؛ وقل ما الذي سينجح."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/error-message-guidelines/","quote":"Take a positive tone and don't blame the user."},"scenario":{"en":"I'm building a train ticket website. When people type their birth date in the wrong order, we show a message under the field.","ar":"أبني موقعًا لتذاكر القطارات. وحين يكتب الناس تاريخ ميلادهم بترتيب خاطئ، نعرض رسالة تحت الحقل."},"prompt":{"en":"Which message is better?","ar":"أيّ رسالة تساعد الراكب على تصحيح التاريخ دون أن يشعر باللوم؟"},"a":{"label":{"en":"Version A","ar":"النسخة A: رسالة تقول إن الإدخال غير صالح"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rehla","name":{"en":"Rehla","ar":"رحلة"},"color":"#7048E8","icon":"bus","domain":"rehla.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"rehla.example/intercity/passenger","blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Passenger details","ar":"بيانات الراكب"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Date of birth","ar":"تاريخ الميلاد"},"text":"1998/24/03","filled":true,"error":{"en":"Invalid input! Illegal date format.","ar":"إدخال غير صالح! صيغة تاريخ غير مسموحة."},"gap":"m"}]}},"b":{"label":{"en":"Version B","ar":"النسخة B: رسالة تشرح طريقة كتابة التاريخ"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rehla","name":{"en":"Rehla","ar":"رحلة"},"color":"#7048E8","icon":"bus","domain":"rehla.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"rehla.example/intercity/passenger","blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Passenger details","ar":"بيانات الراكب"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Date of birth","ar":"تاريخ الميلاد"},"text":"1998/24/03","filled":true,"error":{"en":"Enter the day, then the month: 24/03/1998","ar":"اكتب اليوم ثم الشهر: 24/03/1998"},"gap":"m"}]}},"answer":"b","misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P02-040","when":["a"],"feedback":{"en":"\"Invalid\" and \"illegal\" sound like an accusation and still don't say how to write the date.","ar":"«غير صالح» و«غير مسموح» تبدوان اتهامًا، وما زالتا لا تقولان كيف يُكتب التاريخ."}}],"correct":{"en":"B: calm, and it shows the right way.","ar":"B: هادئة، وتُظهر الطريقة الصحيحة."},"explain":{"en":"B uses the person's own date to show the format, so fixing it takes a second. No blame, just the next step.","ar":"تستخدم B تاريخ الشخص نفسه لتوضّح الصيغة، فيستغرق الإصلاح ثانية. لا لوم، بل الخطوة التالية فقط."}},{"id":"S07","type":"tune","speaker":"hana","part":"independent","skill":"SK-P02-U05-02","rules":["R14"],"confidence":true,"value":{"en":"Error-message guidelines (NN/g): preserve the user's input. Let people fix the error by editing what they entered, not by starting over.","ar":"إرشادات رسائل الخطأ (NN/g): احتفظ بما أدخله المستخدم. دَع الناس يصلحون الخطأ بتعديل ما أدخلوه، لا بالبدء من جديد."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/error-message-guidelines/","quote":"Let users correct errors by editing their original action instead of starting over."},"scenario":{"en":"My gym's membership form has 12 fields. If the phone number has a mistake, the page reloads with every field empty and a message at the top.","ar":"نموذج الاشتراك في النادي الذي أملكه فيه 12 حقلًا. وإن كان في رقم الهاتف خطأ، يُعاد تحميل الصفحة وكل الحقول فارغة، مع رسالة في الأعلى."},"prompt":{"en":"What should happen instead?","ar":"ماذا يجب أن يحدث بدلًا من ذلك؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"nashat.example/join","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Timetable","ar":"الجدول"},{"en":"Prices","ar":"الأسعار"},{"en":"Join","ar":"اشترك"}],"active":2},"blocks":[{"kind":"banner","icon":"warning-circle","tone":"bad","text":{"en":"There was a problem with your form.","ar":"حدثت مشكلة في النموذج."}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Full name","ar":"الاسم بالكامل"},"text":"","gap":"m"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Phone","ar":"الهاتف"},"text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Date of birth","ar":"تاريخ الميلاد"},"text":"","gap":"s","note":{"en":"All 12 answers cleared after one typo","ar":"مُسحت الإجابات الـ 12 بسبب خطأ واحد"}}]},"options":[{"id":"keep","text":{"en":"Keep all 12 answers, mark the phone field, and say what to fix there","ar":"إبقاء الإجابات الاثنتي عشرة، وتمييز حقل الهاتف، وقول ما يجب إصلاحه فيه"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"nashat.example/join","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Timetable","ar":"الجدول"},{"en":"Prices","ar":"الأسعار"},{"en":"Join","ar":"اشترك"}],"active":2},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Full name","ar":"الاسم بالكامل"},"text":{"en":"Mona Adel","ar":"منى عادل"},"filled":true,"gap":"m"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Phone","ar":"الهاتف"},"text":"0100 555 281","filled":true,"tone":"bad","error":{"en":"Mobile numbers have 11 digits; this one has 10.","ar":"رقم الموبايل 11 رقمًا؛ وهذا فيه 10."},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Date of birth","ar":"تاريخ الميلاد"},"text":"12/03/1995","filled":true,"gap":"s","note":{"en":"The other 11 answers are kept","ar":"الإجابات الـ 11 الأخرى باقية"}}]}},{"id":"clear","text":{"en":"Clear only the phone field","ar":"مسح حقل الهاتف فقط"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"nashat.example/join","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Timetable","ar":"الجدول"},{"en":"Prices","ar":"الأسعار"},{"en":"Join","ar":"اشترك"}],"active":2},"blocks":[{"kind":"banner","icon":"warning-circle","tone":"bad","text":{"en":"There was a problem with your form.","ar":"حدثت مشكلة في النموذج."}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Full name","ar":"الاسم بالكامل"},"text":{"en":"Mona Adel","ar":"منى عادل"},"filled":true,"gap":"m"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Phone","ar":"الهاتف"},"text":"","gap":"s","note":{"en":"Only the phone is cleared, with no reason given","ar":"مُسح الهاتف فقط، دون ذكر السبب"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Date of birth","ar":"تاريخ الميلاد"},"text":"12/03/1995","filled":true,"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"save","text":{"en":"Keep the empty form, but add \"Fill in again carefully\"","ar":"إبقاء النموذج فارغًا، مع إضافة «املأ مرة أخرى بعناية»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"nashat.example/join","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Timetable","ar":"الجدول"},{"en":"Prices","ar":"الأسعار"},{"en":"Join","ar":"اشترك"}],"active":2},"blocks":[{"kind":"banner","icon":"warning-circle","tone":"bad","text":{"en":"There was a problem with your form. Fill in again carefully.","ar":"حدثت مشكلة في النموذج. املأ مرة أخرى بعناية."}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Full name","ar":"الاسم بالكامل"},"text":"","gap":"m"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Phone","ar":"الهاتف"},"text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Date of birth","ar":"تاريخ الميلاد"},"text":"","gap":"s","note":{"en":"All 12 answers cleared after one typo","ar":"مُسحت الإجابات الـ 12 بسبب خطأ واحد"}}]}}],"answer":["keep"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P02-041","when":["clear","save"],"feedback":{"en":"Clearing the phone field hides the very digits people need to see to spot the mistake, and an empty form makes them redo 12 answers for one typo.","ar":"مسح حقل الهاتف يُخفي الأرقام التي يحتاج الناس إلى رؤيتها ليكتشفوا الخطأ، والنموذج الفارغ يجعلهم يعيدون 12 إجابة بسبب خطأ واحد."}}],"hints":[{"en":"What do people need on screen to fix a typo in their number?","ar":"ماذا يحتاج الناس على الشاشة ليصلحوا خطأً في رقمهم؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Keep everything; point to the one fix.","ar":"احتفظ بكل شيء؛ وأشِر إلى الإصلاح الوحيد."},"explain":{"en":"With their answers kept and the number still in the field, people see the typo, correct one digit and continue.","ar":"حين تبقى إجاباتهم ويبقى الرقم في الحقل، يرى الناس الخطأ، ويصحّحون رقمًا واحدًا، ويتابعون."}},{"id":"S08","type":"card","part":"recap","icons":["warn","text","ok"],"title":{"en":"What you practised","ar":"ما تدرّبت عليه"},"body":{"en":"- **Say what happened and what to do,** in plain words, without codes or blame.\n- **Put the error next to its cause,** and show it once people are done, not while they type.\n- **Keep what people entered,** so a fix is one small edit.\n\nNext: help people find help.","ar":"- **قل ما حدث وما يجب فعله،** بكلمات بسيطة، دون رموز أو لوم.\n- **ضع الخطأ بجانب سببه،** وأظهِره بعد أن ينتهي الناس، لا أثناء الكتابة.\n- **احتفظ بما أدخله الناس،** حتى يكون الإصلاح تعديلًا صغيرًا.\n\nالتالي: ساعد الناس على إيجاد المساعدة."}}]}$uxg$::jsonb),
  ($uxg$P02-U05-L02$uxg$, $uxg$ddb449159e7dfb65cc6e880bc62fcc294388bb6de6d2ba20a46075e40032131d$uxg$, $uxg${"id":"P02-U05-L02","mode":"lesson","minutes":8,"title":{"en":"Help that's there when it's needed","ar":"مساعدة تجدها حين تحتاجها"},"speaker":"nour","review_labels":{"MC-P02-042":{"en":"A long manual isn't findable help","ar":"الدليل الطويل ليس مساعدة يسهل إيجادها"},"MC-P02-043":{"en":"Help belongs next to the question","ar":"المساعدة مكانها بجانب السؤال"},"MC-P02-044":{"en":"Steps beat paragraphs","ar":"الخطوات أفضل من الفقرات"},"MC-P02-045":{"en":"Forced tours get skipped","ar":"الجولات المفروضة تُتخطّى"}},"steps":[{"id":"S01","type":"card","part":"hook","title":{"en":"Page 27 of the manual","ar":"الصفحة 27 من الدليل"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Help","ar":"مساعدة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"file-pdf","text":{"en":"Raha Clinic app user manual","ar":"دليل مستخدم تطبيق عيادة راحة"},"sub":{"en":"v3.2 · 40 pages · PDF","ar":"الإصدار 3.2 · 40 صفحة · PDF"}},{"kind":"image","art":"document","size":"l","gap":"m","note":{"en":"Page 27 of 40 has the answer","ar":"الإجابة في الصفحة 27 من 40"}}]},"body":{"en":"Our clinic app has a **Help** button. It opens a 40-page PDF manual.\n\nMr. Fathy wanted to move his appointment to next week. He opened Help, scrolled for a while, gave up, and called the front desk. The answer was on page 27.","ar":"في تطبيق عيادتنا زر **مساعدة**. وهو يفتح دليلًا بصيغة PDF من 40 صفحة.\n\nأراد الأستاذ فتحي أن ينقل موعده إلى الأسبوع القادم. ففتح «مساعدة»، ومرّر الصفحات فترة، ثم استسلم واتصل بالاستقبال. وكانت الإجابة في الصفحة 27."}},{"id":"S02","type":"tune","part":"try","skill":"SK-P02-U05-04","rules":["R12"],"confidence":true,"value":{"en":"Try first. Help and documentation (NN/g): help should be easy to search and focused on the user's task. A 40-page manual is neither; task-named answers with search are both.","ar":"جرّب أولًا. المساعدة والتوثيق (NN/g): يجب أن تكون المساعدة سهلة البحث ومركّزة على مهمة المستخدم. والدليل من 40 صفحة ليس كذلك؛ أما الإجابات المسمّاة بالمهام مع البحث فكذلك."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/ten-usability-heuristics/","quote":"Help and documentation content should be easy to search and focused on the user's task."},"prompt":{"en":"What should Help open instead?","ar":"ماذا يجب أن يفتح زر «مساعدة» بدلًا من ذلك؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Help","ar":"مساعدة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"document","size":"l"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"1. Introduction · 2. Installing the app · 3. Account settings …","ar":"1. مقدمة · 2. تثبيت التطبيق · 3. إعدادات الحساب …"},"gap":"m"}]},"options":[{"id":"index","text":{"en":"The same PDF, with a table of contents on the first page","ar":"ملف PDF نفسه، مع فهرس في الصفحة الأولى"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Help","ar":"مساعدة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"document","size":"l"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Contents: 1. Introduction · 2. Installing the app · 3. Account settings … 14. Appointments","ar":"الفهرس: 1. مقدمة · 2. تثبيت التطبيق · 3. إعدادات الحساب … 14. المواعيد"},"gap":"m","note":{"en":"Still the same PDF","ar":"ما زال ملف PDF نفسه"}}]}},{"id":"tasks","text":{"en":"A search box, and short answers named by task: \"Change my appointment\", \"Cancel a visit\", \"Get my results\"","ar":"مربع بحث، وإجابات قصيرة مسمّاة بالمهام: «غيّر موعدي»، «ألغِ زيارة»، «احصل على نتائجي»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Help","ar":"مساعدة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"searchbar","text":{"en":"Search help","ar":"ابحث في المساعدة"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"calendar-blank","text":{"en":"Change my appointment","ar":"غيّر موعدي"},"chevron":true,"gap":"m"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"x-circle","text":{"en":"Cancel a visit","ar":"ألغِ زيارة"},"chevron":true,"gap":"s"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"file-text","text":{"en":"Get my results","ar":"احصل على نتائجي"},"chevron":true,"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"call","text":{"en":"Just the front desk's phone number","ar":"رقم هاتف الاستقبال فقط"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Help","ar":"مساعدة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"icon","icon":"phone","size":"l","color":"brand"},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Call the front desk","ar":"اتصل بالاستقبال"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","icon":"phone","text":"02 3333 4455","gap":"m"}]}}],"answer":["tasks"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P02-042","when":["index"],"feedback":{"en":"A table of contents helps a little, but patients still have to guess which chapter covers their task and read through it on a phone.","ar":"الفهرس يساعد قليلًا، لكن ما زال على المرضى أن يخمّنوا أيّ فصل يغطي مهمتهم ويقرؤوه على الهاتف."}},{"id":"MC-P02-043","when":["call"],"feedback":{"en":"A phone number is useful as a last resort, but sending everyone to the front desk is the problem we have now.","ar":"رقم الهاتف مفيد حلًّا أخيرًا، لكن إرسال الجميع إلى الاستقبال هو المشكلة التي نعاني منها الآن."}}],"hints":[{"en":"How would Mr. Fathy describe what he wanted to do?","ar":"بأيّ كلمات يصف الأستاذ فتحي ما أراد فعله؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Searchable answers, named by what people want to do.","ar":"إجابات قابلة للبحث، مسمّاة بما يريد الناس فعله."},"explain":{"en":"Patients think in tasks like \"change my appointment\". Matching those words, with search, takes them straight to the answer.","ar":"يفكر المرضى بالمهام مثل «غيّر موعدي». ومطابقة هذه الكلمات، مع البحث، تأخذهم مباشرة إلى الإجابة."}},{"id":"S09","type":"video","part":"concept","title":{"en":"Help and documentation","ar":"المساعدة والتوثيق (Help and documentation)"},"video":"2ee9eb89-5784-424c-9089-d3f1011e80fe","duration":184,"transcript":[{"t":2.5,"en":"What matters in reactive help is that it's expressive, clear and detailed, because people who go to the manual don't want bullet headlines,","ar":"المهم في الـ Reactive help إنه يبقى مُعبّر، الكلام فيه واضح ومفهوم، ويكون مفصّل، لأنه بيروح للكتالوج مش عايز يلاقي رؤوس أقلام،"},{"t":11.7,"en":"they want detail that answers every question they actually have.","ar":"عايز يشوف كلام تفصيلي يجاوب عن كل سؤال فعلًا موجود عند اليوزر."},{"t":14.7,"en":"Another reactive-help guideline: chunk the content, grouping related information together,","ar":"من الـ Guidelines الخاصة بالـ Reactive help كمان: إنك تعمل Chunking للـ Content، تبدأ تجمع المعلومات الـ Related ببعض مع بعض،"},{"t":23.7,"en":"and build a visual hierarchy, so not everything has the same visual priority,","ar":"تعمل Visual hierarchy، تدرّج بصري، علشان ما تبقاش كل حاجة على نفس مستوى الأولوية البصرية،"},{"t":29.7,"en":"and put the important keywords, as we see here, in a different colour, and anything with a link in a different colour.","ar":"وتحط الـ Keywords المهمة، زي ما إحنا شايفين هنا، بلون مختلف، والحاجة اللي ليها Link بلون مختلف."},{"t":38.7,"en":"Divide your help into main destinations, then titles, with the content under each title,","ar":"تبدأ تقسّم الـ Help بتاعك أصلًا لـ Destinations أساسية، ثم Titles، وتحت كل Title الـ Content،"},{"t":47.7,"en":"and split each title's points into bullet points or numbered lists, like the Figma example, so moving through lots of detail is easier.","ar":"وتقسّم النقاط الخاصة بكل Title في Bullet points أو Numbered lists، زي ما بنشوف في مثال Figma، علشان التنقّل في التفاصيل الكتير يبقى أسهل."},{"t":62.7,"en":"And of course use a breadcrumb that shows where you are in the help centre or the full documentation. That's very important.","ar":"وطبعًا إنك تستخدم Breadcrumb بتعرّفك المكان اللي إنت فيه في الـ Help center أو الـ Documentation الكامل، ده شيء مهم جدًا."},{"t":71.7,"en":"Here's an example that fails at all of this: one block of text, I can't tell where I came from, no order, no titles,","ar":"مثال أخفق في تحقيق كل ده: المثال اللي قدامنا ده، تكست كله على بعضه، مش عارف أنا جيت منين أصلًا، ما فيش ترتيب، ما فيش Titles،"},{"t":80.7,"en":"so it's harder to scan, and the user takes longer to reach the useful information they're looking for.","ar":"فطبعًا الـ Scannability أصعب، واليوزر هياخد هنا وقت أكتر علشان يوصل للمعلومة المفيدة اللي بيدوّر عليها."},{"t":86.7,"en":"You can also use graphics and videos here, but don't drop the written information just because you added a video,","ar":"من الحاجات اللي ممكن تستفيد بيها هنا: إنك توظّف Graphics وتوظّف Videos، لكن ما تستغناش عن المعلومات المكتوبة عشان حطّيت Video،"},{"t":98.7,"en":"no, add text that supports the video, because some people want to read and can't play a video,","ar":"لأ، حط كتابة داعمة للـ Video، لأن الشخص ممكن يبقى عايز يقرأ، ومش مناسب له يشغّل Video،"},{"t":104.7,"en":"and even if they do, they can watch it while seeing the steps written in front of them. Recognition over recall, as we said,","ar":"وحتى لو شغّل الـ Video، يبقى بيبص على الـ Video وفي نفس الوقت شايف الـ Steps مكتوبة قدامه. Recognition over recall زي ما ذكرنا،"},{"t":113.7,"en":"it lightens the load on memory: no need to memorise every step heard in the video; they're written clearly, to go back to any time.","ar":"بيخفّف الحمل على الـ Memory: مش محتاج يحفظ كل خطوة سمعها في الـ Video، لأ، مكتوبة قدامه بشكل واضح ويقدر يرجع لها في أي وقت."},{"t":122.7,"en":"Another key point in reactive help: make search clear, because I've probably come here to search for something.","ar":"كذلك من أهم الحاجات اللي محتاج تراعيها في الـ Reactive help: إنك تخلّي الـ Search واضح، لأني داخل هنا غالبًا هحتاج أعمل Search على حاجة معينة."},{"t":131.7,"en":"Unlike this example, where search has a low contrast ratio, white on a very light colour, without enough hierarchy.","ar":"بخلاف اللي حصل في المثال ده: الـ Search هنا بـ Low contrast ratio، بلون أبيض على لون فاتح قوي، مش واخد الـ Hierarchy الكافية."},{"t":140.7,"en":"Here in Shopify, search has a border and its visual priority, and is clearer, which suits how important search is in any help centre.","ar":"هنا في Shopify الـ Search واخد Border، وواخد الأولوية البصرية بتاعته، وواضح أكتر، وده مناسب لأهمية الـ Search في أي Help center."},{"t":152.7,"en":"And when users search for something, it's great to highlight the keyword they searched, so they can scan the topics easily,","ar":"كذلك لما اليوزر يبحث عن حاجة معينة، حلو جدًا إنك تعمل Highlight للـ Keyword اللي بحث بيها، بحيث يبقى سهل عليه يعمل Scan للمواضيع،"},{"t":165.7,"en":"and take the next step, deciding which article or topic covers their problem best.","ar":"ويسهل عليه ياخد الخطوة اللي بعدها، ويقرّر هيدخل على أنهي مقال أو أنهي Topic يغطّي مشكلته بشكل أفضل."}]},{"id":"S03","type":"card","part":"concept","icons":["search","idea","list"],"title":{"en":"Video summary","ar":"ملخص الفيديو"},"body":{"en":"The tenth heuristic: it's best if the design needs no explanation, but sometimes **help is needed, and it should be easy to find and use**.\n\n- **Make it searchable** and organized around people's tasks.\n- **Offer help in context:** a short tip right where the question comes up, not a long tour first.\n- **Keep it short and concrete:** numbered steps people can follow.","ar":"مبدأ الاستخدام (Usability heuristic) العاشر هو المساعدة والتوثيق (Help and documentation): الأفضل أن يكون التصميم واضحًا دون شرح، لكن أحيانًا **تكون المساعدة ضرورية، ويجب أن تكون سهلة الإيجاد والاستخدام**.\n\n- **اجعلها قابلة للبحث** ومنظّمة حول مهام الناس.\n- **قدّم المساعدة في سياقها:** نصيحة قصيرة حيث يظهر السؤال، لا جولة طويلة في البداية.\n- **اجعلها قصيرة ومحددة:** خطوات مرقّمة يستطيع الناس اتباعها."}},{"id":"S04","type":"tune","part":"guided","skill":"SK-P02-U05-03","rules":["R06"],"value":{"en":"Help and documentation (NN/g): pull revelations show contextual tips relevant to the user's task, so they're less likely to be ignored. Help about the insurance number belongs next to that field.","ar":"المساعدة والتوثيق (NN/g): المساعدة عند الطلب تعرض نصائح في سياقها تخصّ مهمة المستخدم، فيقلّ احتمال تجاهلها. والمساعدة الخاصة برقم التأمين مكانها بجانب هذا الحقل."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/help-and-documentation/","quote":"Pull revelations show contextual tips that are relevant to the user"},"scenario":{"en":"When booking, patients must enter their insurance number. Many don't know where to find it, so they leave the booking to search the FAQ.","ar":"عند الحجز، يجب على المرضى إدخال رقم التأمين. وكثيرون لا يعرفون أين يجدونه، فيتركون الحجز ليبحثوا في الأسئلة الشائعة."},"prompt":{"en":"Where should the help be?","ar":"أين نضع المساعدة حتى لا يترك المرضى الحجز؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Book a visit","ar":"احجز زيارة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"progress","value":75,"label":{"en":"Step 3 of 4","ar":"الخطوة 3 من 4"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Insurance number","ar":"رقم التأمين"},"text":"","focus":true,"gap":"m","note":{"en":"Many don't know where to find it","ar":"كثيرون لا يعرفون أين يجدونه"}}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Continue","ar":"متابعة"}}]},"options":[{"id":"tip","text":{"en":"A \"Where do I find it?\" link under the field, showing a picture of the card with the number marked","ar":"رابط «أين أجده؟» تحت الحقل، يعرض صورة البطاقة وعليها الرقم مميّزًا"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Book a visit","ar":"احجز زيارة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"progress","value":75,"label":{"en":"Step 3 of 4","ar":"الخطوة 3 من 4"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Insurance number","ar":"رقم التأمين"},"text":"","focus":true,"gap":"m"},{"kind":"link","icon":"question","gap":"s","text":{"en":"Where do I find it?","ar":"أين أجده؟"}},{"kind":"image","art":"bank-card","size":"m","gap":"s","note":{"en":"The number is marked on the card","ar":"الرقم مميّز على البطاقة"}}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Continue","ar":"متابعة"}}]}},{"id":"faq","text":{"en":"A clearer FAQ entry about insurance numbers","ar":"سؤال أوضح عن رقم التأمين في الأسئلة الشائعة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Book a visit","ar":"احجز زيارة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"progress","value":75,"label":{"en":"Step 3 of 4","ar":"الخطوة 3 من 4"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Insurance number","ar":"رقم التأمين"},"text":"","focus":true,"gap":"m","note":{"en":"The answer is in the FAQ, outside the booking","ar":"الإجابة في الأسئلة الشائعة، خارج الحجز"}}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Continue","ar":"متابعة"}}]}},{"id":"intro","text":{"en":"Explain it in the app's welcome tour","ar":"شرحه في الجولة الترحيبية للتطبيق"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Book a visit","ar":"احجز زيارة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"progress","value":75,"label":{"en":"Step 3 of 4","ar":"الخطوة 3 من 4"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Insurance number","ar":"رقم التأمين"},"text":"","focus":true,"gap":"m","note":{"en":"Explained once, in the welcome tour","ar":"شُرح مرة واحدة، في الجولة الترحيبية"}}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Continue","ar":"متابعة"}}]}}],"answer":["tip"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P02-043","when":["faq","intro"],"feedback":{"en":"Both are away from the moment the question comes up. Patients would leave the booking to find the FAQ, or remember a tour from weeks ago.","ar":"كلاهما بعيد عن لحظة ظهور السؤال. فسيترك المرضى الحجز ليجدوا الأسئلة الشائعة، أو سيحاولون تذكّر جولة رأوها قبل أسابيع."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Where is the patient when the question comes up?","ar":"أين يكون المريض حين يظهر السؤال؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Help right where the question comes up.","ar":"المساعدة حيث يظهر السؤال."},"explain":{"en":"The link appears only where it's needed and shows exactly where to look on the card. Patients answer and keep booking.","ar":"الرابط يظهر فقط حيث يُحتاج، ويُظهر بالضبط أين ينظر المريض على البطاقة. فيجيب ويكمل الحجز."},"speaker":"nour"},{"id":"S05","type":"tune","part":"guided","skill":"SK-P02-U05-04","rules":["R06"],"value":{"en":"Help and documentation (NN/g): support scanning with the rules of writing for the web: chunks, clear hierarchy, highlighted keywords and numbered lists. People in trouble don't read paragraphs.","ar":"المساعدة والتوثيق (NN/g): ادعم التصفّح السريع بقواعد الكتابة للويب: أجزاء قصيرة، وتسلسل واضح، وكلمات مفتاحية بارزة، وقوائم مرقّمة. فمن يواجه مشكلة لا يقرأ الفقرات."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/help-and-documentation/","quote":"Support scanning by using the rules of writing for the web."},"scenario":{"en":"Our answer about changing an appointment is one long paragraph: why changes are allowed, our policy on late changes, and somewhere in the middle, how to do it.","ar":"إجابتنا عن تغيير الموعد فقرة طويلة واحدة: لماذا يُسمح بالتغيير، وسياستنا في التغيير المتأخر، وفي مكان ما في المنتصف، طريقة التغيير."},"prompt":{"en":"How should the answer be written?","ar":"كيف تُكتب الإجابة ليغيّر المريض موعده بسهولة؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Change my appointment","ar":"تغيير موعدي"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"We allow patients to change appointments because plans change, and our policy is to keep schedules flexible. Changes made less than 24 hours before the visit may have a fee. To change it, open My visits, tap the visit and choose Change time, then pick a new slot. Changes are confirmed by text message.","ar":"نسمح للمرضى بتغيير المواعيد لأن الخطط تتغيّر، وسياستنا أن تبقى المواعيد مرنة. وقد تُفرض رسوم على التغيير قبل الزيارة بأقل من 24 ساعة. ولتغييره، افتح «زياراتي» واضغط الزيارة واختر «غيّر الموعد»، ثم اختر موعدًا جديدًا. ويُؤكَّد التغيير برسالة نصية."},"note":{"en":"The steps are in the middle of the paragraph","ar":"الخطوات في منتصف الفقرة"}}]},"options":[{"id":"steps","text":{"en":"Numbered steps first (1. Open My visits 2. Tap the visit 3. Tap Change time), then the late-change rule in one line","ar":"خطوات مرقّمة أولًا (1. افتح زياراتي 2. اضغط الزيارة 3. اضغط «غيّر الموعد»)، ثم قاعدة التغيير المتأخر في سطر واحد"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Change my appointment","ar":"تغيير موعدي"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"list","style":"number","items":[{"en":"Open **My visits**","ar":"افتح **زياراتي**"},{"en":"Tap the visit","ar":"اضغط الزيارة"},{"en":"Tap **Change time** and pick a new slot","ar":"اضغط **غيّر الموعد** واختر موعدًا جديدًا"}]},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","gap":"s","text":{"en":"Less than 24 hours before the visit, a fee may apply.","ar":"قبل الزيارة بأقل من 24 ساعة، قد تُفرض رسوم."}}]}},{"id":"bold","text":{"en":"The same paragraph, with the key sentence in bold","ar":"الفقرة نفسها، مع الجملة المهمة بخط عريض"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Change my appointment","ar":"تغيير موعدي"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"We allow patients to change appointments because plans change, and our policy is to keep schedules flexible. Changes made less than 24 hours before the visit may have a fee. **To change it, open My visits, tap the visit and choose Change time, then pick a new slot.** Changes are confirmed by text message.","ar":"نسمح للمرضى بتغيير المواعيد لأن الخطط تتغيّر، وسياستنا أن تبقى المواعيد مرنة. وقد تُفرض رسوم على التغيير قبل الزيارة بأقل من 24 ساعة. **ولتغييره، افتح «زياراتي» واضغط الزيارة واختر «غيّر الموعد»، ثم اختر موعدًا جديدًا.** ويُؤكَّد التغيير برسالة نصية."},"note":{"en":"Still in the middle, now in bold","ar":"ما زالت في المنتصف، لكن بخط عريض"}}]}},{"id":"video","text":{"en":"Replace it with a 3-minute video","ar":"وضع فيديو مدته 3 دقائق مكانها"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Change my appointment","ar":"تغيير موعدي"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"clinic","size":"l","text":"▶ 3:00","note":{"en":"A 3-minute video, no text","ar":"فيديو مدته 3 دقائق، بلا نص"}}]}}],"answer":["steps"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P02-044","when":["bold"],"feedback":{"en":"Bold helps people spot one sentence, but they still have to turn a paragraph into actions in their head.","ar":"الخط العريض يساعد الناس على رؤية جملة واحدة، لكن ما زال عليهم أن يحوّلوا الفقرة إلى خطوات في أذهانهم."}},{"id":"MC-P02-042","when":["video"],"feedback":{"en":"A video can help as an extra, but many people can't play sound or don't want to watch three minutes for three taps.","ar":"الفيديو قد يساعد إضافةً، لكن كثيرين لا يستطيعون تشغيل الصوت أو لا يريدون مشاهدة ثلاث دقائق من أجل ثلاث ضغطات."}}],"hints":[{"en":"What does someone with the app open in one hand need to see?","ar":"ماذا يحتاج إلى رؤيته من يمسك التطبيق مفتوحًا بيد واحدة؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Concrete steps people can follow.","ar":"خطوات محددة يستطيع الناس اتباعها."},"explain":{"en":"Numbered steps can be followed one by one while using the app. The policy still matters, so it stays, short, after the steps.","ar":"الخطوات المرقّمة يمكن اتباعها واحدة واحدة أثناء استخدام التطبيق. والسياسة ما زالت مهمة، فتبقى قصيرة بعد الخطوات."},"speaker":"nour"},{"id":"S06","type":"compare","speaker":"rami","part":"contrast","skill":"SK-P02-U05-03","rules":["R11"],"value":{"en":"Help and documentation (NN/g): push revelations should be easy to ignore. A tour that can't be skipped stalls people from using the app, especially those who don't need it.","ar":"المساعدة والتوثيق (NN/g): المساعدة المفروضة يجب أن يسهل تجاهلها. والجولة التي لا يمكن تخطّيها تعطّل الناس عن استخدام التطبيق، خاصة من لا يحتاجونها."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/help-and-documentation/","quote":"Push revelations should be easy to ignore (e.g., by dismissing them)."},"scenario":{"en":"I'm designing a photo editing app. On first launch, we want to point out a few tools.","ar":"أصمّم تطبيقًا لتعديل الصور. وعند أول تشغيل، نريد أن نُبرز بعض الأدوات."},"prompt":{"en":"Which first launch is better?","ar":"أيّ نسخة تتيح للناس أن يبدؤوا تعديل صورهم بسرعة؟"},"a":{"label":{"en":"Version A: a 7-step tour","ar":"النسخة A: جولة من 7 خطوات"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"suwar","name":{"en":"Suwar","ar":"صور"},"color":"#2563EB","icon":"images","domain":"suwar.example"},"theme":"dark","blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"beach","size":"xl"}],"overlay":{"type":"dialog","blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Tip 1 of 7: This is the Crop tool.","ar":"النصيحة 1 من 7: هذه أداة القص."}},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Next","ar":"التالي"},"gap":"m"}]}}},"b":{"label":{"en":"Version B: one skippable tip","ar":"النسخة B: نصيحة واحدة يمكن تخطّيها"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"suwar","name":{"en":"Suwar","ar":"صور"},"color":"#2563EB","icon":"images","domain":"suwar.example"},"theme":"dark","blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"beach","size":"xl"},{"kind":"tip","text":{"en":"Tap any tool to see what it does","ar":"اضغط أي أداة لترى ما تفعله"}},{"kind":"link","text":{"en":"Got it","ar":"فهمت"},"gap":"xs"}]}},"answer":"b","misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P02-045","when":["a"],"feedback":{"en":"Seven tips with no skip stand between people and their photo. Most tap Next without reading, and remember none of it later.","ar":"سبع نصائح دون تخطٍّ تقف بين الناس وصورتهم. وأغلبهم يضغطون «التالي» دون قراءة، ولا يتذكّرون شيئًا منها لاحقًا."}}],"correct":{"en":"B: brief, and easy to dismiss.","ar":"B: قصيرة، وسهلة الإغلاق."},"explain":{"en":"B gives one useful hint, lets people start editing at once, and leaves the rest to discover when they tap a tool.","ar":"تعطي B تلميحًا مفيدًا واحدًا، وتتيح للناس بدء التعديل فورًا، وتترك الباقي ليكتشفوه حين يضغطون أداة."}},{"id":"S07","type":"tune","speaker":"tarek","part":"independent","skill":"SK-P02-U05-04","rules":["R14"],"value":{"en":"Help and documentation (NN/g): when there's a lot of help content, highlight the content that is viewed most, so people find common answers fast.","ar":"المساعدة والتوثيق (NN/g): حين يكثر محتوى المساعدة، أبرِز المحتوى الأكثر مشاهدة، حتى يجد الناس الإجابات الشائعة بسرعة."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/help-and-documentation/","quote":"Highlight top content that is frequently viewed."},"scenario":{"en":"Our bank's help centre has 300 articles in alphabetical order. Half of all visits are about three things: a blocked card, a failed transfer and a forgotten password.","ar":"مركز المساعدة في بنكنا فيه 300 مقال بترتيب أبجدي. ونصف الزيارات كلها عن ثلاثة أشياء: بطاقة موقوفة، وتحويل فاشل، وكلمة مرور منسية."},"prompt":{"en":"What should the help centre's first screen show?","ar":"ماذا تعرض الشاشة الأولى في مركز المساعدة ليجد أغلب الزوار إجابتهم بسرعة؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rasid","name":{"en":"Rasid","ar":"رصيد"},"color":"#1C3D6E","icon":"bank","domain":"rasid.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Help centre","ar":"مركز المساعدة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","text":{"en":"Account statements","ar":"كشوف الحساب"},"chevron":true},{"kind":"listitem","text":{"en":"ATM locations","ar":"أماكن ماكينات الصرف"},"chevron":true,"gap":"s"},{"kind":"listitem","text":{"en":"Beneficiaries","ar":"المستفيدون"},"chevron":true,"gap":"s"},{"kind":"listitem","text":{"en":"Blocked card","ar":"بطاقة موقوفة"},"chevron":true,"gap":"s","note":{"en":"300 articles, A to Z","ar":"300 مقال، أبجديًا"}}]},"options":[{"id":"top","text":{"en":"A search box, the three top questions as big buttons, and topics like Cards, Transfers and Sign-in","ar":"مربع بحث، والأسئلة الثلاثة الأشهر أزرارًا كبيرة، وموضوعات مثل البطاقات والتحويلات وتسجيل الدخول"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rasid","name":{"en":"Rasid","ar":"رصيد"},"color":"#1C3D6E","icon":"bank","domain":"rasid.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Help centre","ar":"مركز المساعدة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"searchbar","text":{"en":"Search help","ar":"ابحث في المساعدة"}},{"kind":"button","style":"outline","icon":"credit-card","text":{"en":"My card is blocked","ar":"بطاقتي موقوفة"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"button","style":"outline","icon":"arrows-left-right","text":{"en":"My transfer failed","ar":"فشل تحويلي"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","style":"outline","icon":"key","text":{"en":"I forgot my password","ar":"نسيت كلمة المرور"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"chips","gap":"m","items":[{"text":{"en":"Cards","ar":"البطاقات"}},{"text":{"en":"Transfers","ar":"التحويلات"}},{"text":{"en":"Sign-in","ar":"تسجيل الدخول"}}]}]}},{"id":"abc","text":{"en":"All 300 articles, A to Z, so nothing is hidden","ar":"كل المقالات الثلاثمئة أبجديًا، حتى لا يُخفى شيء"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rasid","name":{"en":"Rasid","ar":"رصيد"},"color":"#1C3D6E","icon":"bank","domain":"rasid.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Help centre","ar":"مركز المساعدة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","text":{"en":"Account statements","ar":"كشوف الحساب"},"chevron":true},{"kind":"listitem","text":{"en":"ATM locations","ar":"أماكن ماكينات الصرف"},"chevron":true,"gap":"s"},{"kind":"listitem","text":{"en":"Beneficiaries","ar":"المستفيدون"},"chevron":true,"gap":"s"},{"kind":"listitem","text":{"en":"Blocked card","ar":"بطاقة موقوفة"},"chevron":true,"gap":"s","note":{"en":"All 300, A to Z: nothing hidden, nothing first","ar":"كلها، أبجديًا: لا شيء مخفي، ولا شيء في المقدمة"}}]}},{"id":"new","text":{"en":"The newest articles first","ar":"أحدث المقالات أولًا"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rasid","name":{"en":"Rasid","ar":"رصيد"},"color":"#1C3D6E","icon":"bank","domain":"rasid.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Help centre","ar":"مركز المساعدة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","text":{"en":"New: pay bills with a QR code","ar":"جديد: ادفع الفواتير برمز QR"},"chevron":true},{"kind":"listitem","text":{"en":"Card fees for 2027","ar":"رسوم البطاقات لعام 2027"},"chevron":true,"gap":"s"},{"kind":"listitem","text":{"en":"Cashback on travel","ar":"الاسترداد النقدي على السفر"},"chevron":true,"gap":"s"},{"kind":"listitem","text":{"en":"Saving goals","ar":"أهداف الادخار"},"chevron":true,"gap":"s","note":{"en":"Newest first; blocked card is far down","ar":"الأحدث أولًا؛ و«بطاقة موقوفة» في الأسفل بعيدًا"}}]}}],"answer":["top"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P02-042","when":["abc","new"],"feedback":{"en":"Half the visitors need one of three answers. A long alphabetical or date list makes all of them dig for it.","ar":"نصف الزوار يحتاجون إلى واحدة من ثلاث إجابات. والقائمة الطويلة الأبجدية أو حسب التاريخ تجعلهم جميعًا يبحثون عنها."}}],"hints":[{"en":"What do most visitors come to the help centre for?","ar":"لماذا يأتي أغلب الزوار إلى مركز المساعدة؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Put the most needed answers first.","ar":"ضع أولًا الإجابات التي يحتاجها الناس أكثر."},"explain":{"en":"Half the visitors find their answer in one tap, search covers the rest, and topics group the other 297 articles by task.","ar":"نصف الزوار يجدون إجابتهم بضغطة واحدة، والبحث يغطي الباقي، والموضوعات تجمع المقالات الـ 297 الأخرى حسب المهمة."}},{"id":"S08","type":"card","part":"recap","icons":["search","idea","list"],"title":{"en":"What you practised","ar":"ما تدرّبت عليه"},"body":{"en":"- **Make help searchable** and named by people's tasks, with the most needed answers first.\n- **Help in context:** a short tip where the question comes up; tours brief and easy to skip.\n- **Write steps, not paragraphs,** so people can follow along.\n\nNext: the skill check for this unit, the last one in the path.","ar":"- **اجعل المساعدة قابلة للبحث** ومسمّاة بمهام الناس، مع الإجابات التي يحتاجونها أكثر أولًا.\n- **مساعدة في السياق:** نصيحة قصيرة حيث يظهر السؤال؛ والجولات قصيرة وسهلة التخطّي.\n- **اكتب خطوات لا فقرات،** حتى يستطيع الناس اتباعها.\n\nالتالي: اختبار المهارة لهذه الوحدة، وهي الأخيرة في المسار."}}]}$uxg$::jsonb),
  ($uxg$P02-U05-L03$uxg$, $uxg$05b428e920aa3a8009d380cf2dfa1db5e7bcf1ec5a4a755d7e24193d28531b7b$uxg$, $uxg${"id":"P02-U05-L03","mode":"check","minutes":6,"title":{"en":"Skill check: help people recover, and find help","ar":"اختبار المهارة: ساعد الناس على إصلاح أخطائهم، وعلى إيجاد المساعدة"},"speaker":"mona","steps":[{"id":"S01","type":"card","part":"hook","title":{"en":"Mona's car insurance site","ar":"موقع منى لتأمين السيارات"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"aman","name":{"en":"Aman","ar":"أمان"},"color":"#364FC7","icon":"shield-check","domain":"aman.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"aman.example","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Car","ar":"السيارات"},{"en":"Health","ar":"الصحة"},{"en":"Claims","ar":"المطالبات"}],"active":2,"actions":[{"icon":"user"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"car","size":"m"},{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Had an accident? We're here.","ar":"تعرّضت لحادث؟ نحن هنا."},"gap":"m"}]},"body":{"en":"My team is redesigning a car insurance website. People use it when something has already gone wrong, so errors and help matter a lot. Help me review four parts.\n\nThis is a skill check: no hints, and you'll see how you did at the end.","ar":"يعيد فريقي تصميم موقع لتأمين السيارات. ويستخدمه الناس بعد أن تقع مشكلة بالفعل، فالأخطاء والمساعدة مهمة جدًا هنا. ساعدني في مراجعة أربعة أجزاء.\n\nهذا اختبار مهارة: دون تلميحات، وسترى نتيجتك في النهاية."}},{"id":"S02","type":"tune","part":"check","skill":"SK-P02-U05-01","value":{"en":"Check, error-message guidelines (NN/g): concisely and precisely describe the issue. \"An error occurred\" gives no context; the size limit and a fix do.","ar":"اختبار، إرشادات رسائل الخطأ (NN/g): صِف المشكلة باختصار ودقة. فـ«حدث خطأ» لا تعطي أي سياق؛ أما حد الحجم والإصلاح فيعطيانه."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/error-message-guidelines/","quote":"Concisely and precisely describe the issue."},"scenario":{"en":"When people upload photos of the damage to their car, large photos fail with \"An error occurred.\" People try the same photo again and again.","ar":"حين يرفع الناس صور الضرر في سياراتهم، تفشل الصور الكبيرة برسالة «حدث خطأ.» فيجرّب الناس الصورة نفسها مرة بعد مرة."},"prompt":{"en":"What should the message say?","ar":"ماذا يجب أن تقول الرسالة؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"aman","name":{"en":"Aman","ar":"أمان"},"color":"#364FC7","icon":"shield-check","domain":"aman.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"aman.example/claims/new/photos","blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Photos of the damage","ar":"صور الضرر"}},{"kind":"listitem","art":"car","text":"IMG_2041.jpg","sub":"18 MB","gap":"m"},{"kind":"banner","icon":"warning-circle","tone":"bad","text":{"en":"An error occurred.","ar":"حدث خطأ."},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","icon":"upload-simple","text":{"en":"Upload photos","ar":"ارفع الصور"},"gap":"m"}]},"options":[{"id":"precise","text":{"en":"\"This photo is 18 MB; the limit is 10 MB. Choose a smaller photo, or let us shrink it.\" with a Shrink photo button","ar":"«حجم هذه الصورة 18 ميجابايت؛ والحد 10 ميجابايت. اختر صورة أصغر، أو دَعنا نصغّرها.» مع زر «صغّر الصورة»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"aman","name":{"en":"Aman","ar":"أمان"},"color":"#364FC7","icon":"shield-check","domain":"aman.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"aman.example/claims/new/photos","blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Photos of the damage","ar":"صور الضرر"}},{"kind":"listitem","art":"car","text":"IMG_2041.jpg","sub":"18 MB","gap":"m"},{"kind":"banner","icon":"warning-circle","tone":"bad","text":{"en":"This photo is 18 MB; the limit is 10 MB. Choose a smaller photo, or let us shrink it.","ar":"حجم هذه الصورة 18 ميجابايت؛ والحد 10 ميجابايت. اختر صورة أصغر، أو دَعنا نصغّرها."},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","style":"outline","icon":"arrows-in","text":{"en":"Shrink photo","ar":"صغّر الصورة"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","icon":"upload-simple","text":{"en":"Upload photos","ar":"ارفع الصور"},"gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"retry","text":{"en":"\"Upload failed. Please try again later.\"","ar":"«فشل الرفع. حاول مرة أخرى لاحقًا.»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"aman","name":{"en":"Aman","ar":"أمان"},"color":"#364FC7","icon":"shield-check","domain":"aman.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"aman.example/claims/new/photos","blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Photos of the damage","ar":"صور الضرر"}},{"kind":"listitem","art":"car","text":"IMG_2041.jpg","sub":"18 MB","gap":"m"},{"kind":"banner","icon":"warning-circle","tone":"bad","text":{"en":"Upload failed. Please try again later.","ar":"فشل الرفع. حاول مرة أخرى لاحقًا."},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","icon":"upload-simple","text":{"en":"Upload photos","ar":"ارفع الصور"},"gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"code","text":{"en":"\"Error 413: payload too large.\"","ar":"«Error 413: payload too large.»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"aman","name":{"en":"Aman","ar":"أمان"},"color":"#364FC7","icon":"shield-check","domain":"aman.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"aman.example/claims/new/photos","blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Photos of the damage","ar":"صور الضرر"}},{"kind":"listitem","art":"car","text":"IMG_2041.jpg","sub":"18 MB","gap":"m"},{"kind":"banner","icon":"warning-circle","tone":"bad","text":"Error 413: payload too large.","gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","icon":"upload-simple","text":{"en":"Upload photos","ar":"ارفع الصور"},"gap":"m"}]}}],"answer":["precise"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P02-037","when":["retry"],"feedback":{"en":"Trying later fails the same way, because the photo is still too big. People need to know the real cause.","ar":"المحاولة لاحقًا تفشل بالطريقة نفسها، لأن الصورة ما زالت كبيرة. يحتاج الناس إلى معرفة السبب الحقيقي."}},{"id":"MC-P02-036","when":["code"],"feedback":{"en":"The code is accurate but means nothing to someone filing a claim after an accident.","ar":"الرمز دقيق لكنه لا يعني شيئًا لشخص يقدّم مطالبة بعد حادث."}}],"correct":{"en":"Say exactly what's wrong, and offer the fix.","ar":"قل بالضبط ما الخطأ، واعرض الإصلاح."},"explain":{"en":"The sizes explain the problem, and the Shrink button fixes it in one tap, so people don't have to learn how to resize a photo.","ar":"الأحجام تشرح المشكلة، وزر «صغّر الصورة» يصلحها بضغطة واحدة، فلا يحتاج الناس إلى تعلّم تصغير الصور."},"speaker":"mona"},{"id":"S03","type":"tune","part":"check","skill":"SK-P02-U05-02","value":{"en":"Check, error-message guidelines (NN/g): use noticeable, redundant and accessible indicators. A red border alone is missed by many people, including those who can't see red.","ar":"اختبار، إرشادات رسائل الخطأ (NN/g): استخدم مؤشرات ملحوظة ومتكررة ومتاحة للجميع. فالإطار الأحمر وحده يفوت كثيرين، ومنهم من لا يميّزون اللون الأحمر."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/error-message-guidelines/","quote":"Use noticeable, redundant, and accessible indicators."},"scenario":{"en":"In the claim form, a field with a problem only gets a thin red border. No text, no icon. Some people press Submit five times, not seeing what's wrong.","ar":"في نموذج المطالبة، الحقل الذي فيه مشكلة لا يحصل إلا على إطار أحمر رفيع. لا نص ولا أيقونة. ويضغط بعض الناس «أرسل» خمس مرات دون أن يروا الخطأ."},"prompt":{"en":"How should a field with a problem look?","ar":"كيف يبدو الحقل الذي فيه مشكلة ليلاحظه الناس ويعرفوا ما يُصلحون؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"aman","name":{"en":"Aman","ar":"أمان"},"color":"#364FC7","icon":"shield-check","domain":"aman.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"aman.example/claims/new/details","blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"What happened?","ar":"ماذا حدث؟"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Date of the accident","ar":"تاريخ الحادث"},"text":"","tone":"bad","gap":"m","note":{"en":"Only a thin red border, no text","ar":"إطار أحمر رفيع فقط، بلا نص"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Place","ar":"المكان"},"text":{"en":"Ring Road, Cairo","ar":"الطريق الدائري، القاهرة"},"filled":true,"gap":"m"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Submit claim","ar":"أرسل المطالبة"},"gap":"m"}]},"options":[{"id":"full","text":{"en":"A thicker red border, a ⚠ icon and a short message under the field","ar":"إطار أحمر أعرض، وأيقونة ⚠، ورسالة قصيرة تحت الحقل"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"aman","name":{"en":"Aman","ar":"أمان"},"color":"#364FC7","icon":"shield-check","domain":"aman.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"aman.example/claims/new/details","blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"What happened?","ar":"ماذا حدث؟"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Date of the accident","ar":"تاريخ الحادث"},"text":"","tone":"bad","gap":"m","error":{"en":"Enter the date of the accident","ar":"أدخل تاريخ الحادث"},"icon":"warning"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Place","ar":"المكان"},"text":{"en":"Ring Road, Cairo","ar":"الطريق الدائري، القاهرة"},"filled":true,"gap":"m"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Submit claim","ar":"أرسل المطالبة"},"gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"shake","text":{"en":"Keep the thin border, and make the whole form shake","ar":"إبقاء الإطار الرفيع، مع اهتزاز النموذج كله"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"aman","name":{"en":"Aman","ar":"أمان"},"color":"#364FC7","icon":"shield-check","domain":"aman.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"aman.example/claims/new/details","blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"What happened?","ar":"ماذا حدث؟"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Date of the accident","ar":"تاريخ الحادث"},"text":"","tone":"bad","gap":"m","note":{"en":"Thin border; the whole form shakes","ar":"إطار رفيع؛ والنموذج كله يهتز"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Place","ar":"المكان"},"text":{"en":"Ring Road, Cairo","ar":"الطريق الدائري، القاهرة"},"filled":true,"gap":"m"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Submit claim","ar":"أرسل المطالبة"},"gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"darker","text":{"en":"Make the border a darker red","ar":"جعل الإطار أحمر أغمق"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"aman","name":{"en":"Aman","ar":"أمان"},"color":"#364FC7","icon":"shield-check","domain":"aman.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"aman.example/claims/new/details","blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"What happened?","ar":"ماذا حدث؟"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Date of the accident","ar":"تاريخ الحادث"},"text":"","tone":"bad","gap":"m","note":{"en":"Darker red, still no text","ar":"أحمر أغمق، وما زال بلا نص"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Place","ar":"المكان"},"text":{"en":"Ring Road, Cairo","ar":"الطريق الدائري، القاهرة"},"filled":true,"gap":"m"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Submit claim","ar":"أرسل المطالبة"},"gap":"m"}]}}],"answer":["full"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P02-038","when":["shake","darker"],"feedback":{"en":"People may notice something is wrong, but colour and motion alone don't say which field or what to fix, and some people can't see the red at all.","ar":"قد يلاحظ الناس أن شيئًا خطأ، لكن اللون والحركة وحدهما لا يقولان أيّ حقل ولا ما الذي يجب إصلاحه، وبعض الناس لا يرون الأحمر أصلًا."}}],"correct":{"en":"Several signals, including words.","ar":"عدة إشارات، منها الكلمات."},"explain":{"en":"Colour, an icon and text together make the problem easy to notice for everyone, and the text says how to fix it.","ar":"اللون والأيقونة والنص معًا تجعل المشكلة سهلة الملاحظة للجميع، والنص يقول كيف تُصلح."},"speaker":"mona"},{"id":"S04","type":"tune","part":"check","skill":"SK-P02-U05-03","value":{"en":"Check, help and documentation (NN/g): favour pull over push revelations. Help about the policy number should appear when people reach that field, not in a tour on the home page.","ar":"اختبار، المساعدة والتوثيق (NN/g): فضّل المساعدة عند الطلب على المساعدة المفروضة. والمساعدة عن رقم الوثيقة يجب أن تظهر حين يصل الناس إلى ذلك الحقل، لا في جولة في الصفحة الرئيسية."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/help-and-documentation/","quote":"Favor pull over push revelations."},"scenario":{"en":"Starting a claim needs the policy number. Right now, a 5-step tour on the home page explains it, along with four other things. People still get stuck at that field.","ar":"بدء المطالبة يحتاج إلى رقم الوثيقة. والآن تشرحه جولة من 5 خطوات في الصفحة الرئيسية، مع أربعة أشياء أخرى. وما زال الناس يعلقون عند ذلك الحقل."},"prompt":{"en":"What should we do?","ar":"ماذا نفعل؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"aman","name":{"en":"Aman","ar":"أمان"},"color":"#364FC7","icon":"shield-check","domain":"aman.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"aman.example/claims/new","blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Start a claim","ar":"ابدأ مطالبة"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Policy number","ar":"رقم الوثيقة"},"text":"","focus":true,"gap":"m","note":{"en":"Explained only in the home page tour","ar":"مشروح فقط في جولة الصفحة الرئيسية"}},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Continue","ar":"متابعة"},"gap":"m"}]},"options":[{"id":"pull","text":{"en":"Add \"Where's my policy number?\" under the field, showing where it is on the policy card and in the confirmation email","ar":"إضافة رابط «أين رقم وثيقتي؟» تحت الحقل، يُظهر مكانه في بطاقة الوثيقة وفي بريد التأكيد"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"aman","name":{"en":"Aman","ar":"أمان"},"color":"#364FC7","icon":"shield-check","domain":"aman.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"aman.example/claims/new","blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Start a claim","ar":"ابدأ مطالبة"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Policy number","ar":"رقم الوثيقة"},"text":"","focus":true,"gap":"m"},{"kind":"link","icon":"question","gap":"s","text":{"en":"Where's my policy number?","ar":"أين رقم وثيقتي؟"}},{"kind":"image","art":"document","size":"s","gap":"s","note":{"en":"On your policy card and in the confirmation email","ar":"في بطاقة الوثيقة وفي بريد التأكيد"}},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Continue","ar":"متابعة"},"gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"longer","text":{"en":"Make the home page tour longer and more detailed","ar":"جعل جولة الصفحة الرئيسية أطول وأكثر تفصيلًا"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"aman","name":{"en":"Aman","ar":"أمان"},"color":"#364FC7","icon":"shield-check","domain":"aman.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"aman.example/claims/new","blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Start a claim","ar":"ابدأ مطالبة"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Policy number","ar":"رقم الوثيقة"},"text":"","focus":true,"gap":"m","note":{"en":"Still explained only in the home tour, now 9 steps","ar":"ما زال مشروحًا فقط في جولة الرئيسية، وصارت 9 خطوات"}},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Continue","ar":"متابعة"},"gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"repeat","text":{"en":"Show the tour again every time people log in","ar":"عرض الجولة مرة أخرى في كل تسجيل دخول"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"aman","name":{"en":"Aman","ar":"أمان"},"color":"#364FC7","icon":"shield-check","domain":"aman.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"aman.example/claims/new","blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Start a claim","ar":"ابدأ مطالبة"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Policy number","ar":"رقم الوثيقة"},"text":"","focus":true,"gap":"m","note":{"en":"Explained in the home tour, at every login","ar":"مشروح في جولة الرئيسية، عند كل تسجيل دخول"}},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Continue","ar":"متابعة"},"gap":"m"}]}}],"answer":["pull"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P02-045","when":["longer","repeat"],"feedback":{"en":"More or repeated tour steps still come before people need the answer, so they skip them and forget them.","ar":"زيادة خطوات الجولة أو تكرارها لا يغيّر أنها تأتي قبل أن يحتاج الناس إلى الإجابة، فيتخطّونها وينسونها."}}],"correct":{"en":"Help at the field, when people need it.","ar":"المساعدة عند الحقل، حين يحتاجها الناس."},"explain":{"en":"The link appears right where people get stuck and answers exactly that question, so it's actually used.","ar":"يظهر الرابط بالضبط حيث يعلق الناس، ويجيب عن ذلك السؤال تحديدًا، فيُستخدم فعلًا."},"speaker":"mona"},{"id":"S05","type":"tune","part":"check","skill":"SK-P02-U05-04","value":{"en":"Check, help and documentation (NN/g): optimize for search. People in trouble type their own words, so search must find the right article for them.","ar":"اختبار، المساعدة والتوثيق (NN/g): اجعل البحث فعّالًا. فمن يواجه مشكلة يكتب بكلماته، ويجب أن يجد البحث له المقال الصحيح."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/help-and-documentation/","quote":"Optimize for search."},"scenario":{"en":"People who search our help for \"accident\" or \"crash\" get no results. The article they need is called \"Submitting a first notice of loss\".","ar":"من يبحث في المساعدة عن «حادث» أو «تصادم» لا يجد أي نتيجة. والمقال الذي يحتاجه اسمه «تقديم الإخطار الأول بالخسارة»."},"prompt":{"en":"What should we fix?","ar":"ماذا نصلح ليجد الناس هذا المقال؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"aman","name":{"en":"Aman","ar":"أمان"},"color":"#364FC7","icon":"shield-check","domain":"aman.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"aman.example/help?q=accident","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Car","ar":"السيارات"},{"en":"Help","ar":"المساعدة"}],"active":1},"blocks":[{"kind":"searchbar","text":{"en":"accident","ar":"حادث"},"filled":true},{"kind":"icon","icon":"magnifying-glass-minus","size":"l","gap":"l"},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"No results for \"accident\"","ar":"لا نتائج لـ «حادث»"},"gap":"s","note":{"en":"The article is called \"Submitting a first notice of loss\"","ar":"اسم المقال «تقديم الإخطار الأول بالخسارة»"}}]},"options":[{"id":"search","text":{"en":"Rename it \"I had an accident: how to make a claim\", and make search match words like accident, crash and damage","ar":"تغيير اسمه إلى «تعرّضت لحادث: كيف أقدّم مطالبة»، وجعل البحث يطابق كلمات مثل حادث وتصادم وضرر"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"aman","name":{"en":"Aman","ar":"أمان"},"color":"#364FC7","icon":"shield-check","domain":"aman.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"aman.example/help?q=accident","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Car","ar":"السيارات"},{"en":"Help","ar":"المساعدة"}],"active":1},"blocks":[{"kind":"searchbar","text":{"en":"accident","ar":"حادث"},"filled":true},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"file-text","text":{"en":"I had an accident: how to make a claim","ar":"تعرّضت لحادث: كيف أقدّم مطالبة"},"sub":{"en":"Also found by: crash, damage","ar":"يظهر أيضًا عند البحث عن: تصادم، ضرر"},"chevron":true,"gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"glossary","text":{"en":"Add a glossary page explaining \"first notice of loss\"","ar":"إضافة صفحة مصطلحات تشرح «الإخطار الأول بالخسارة»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"aman","name":{"en":"Aman","ar":"أمان"},"color":"#364FC7","icon":"shield-check","domain":"aman.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"aman.example/help?q=accident","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Car","ar":"السيارات"},{"en":"Help","ar":"المساعدة"}],"active":1},"blocks":[{"kind":"searchbar","text":{"en":"accident","ar":"حادث"},"filled":true},{"kind":"icon","icon":"magnifying-glass-minus","size":"l","gap":"l"},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"No results for \"accident\"","ar":"لا نتائج لـ «حادث»"},"gap":"s","note":{"en":"The article is called \"Submitting a first notice of loss\"","ar":"اسم المقال «تقديم الإخطار الأول بالخسارة»"}},{"kind":"link","icon":"book-open","gap":"m","text":{"en":"Glossary: what's a \"first notice of loss\"?","ar":"المصطلحات: ما «الإخطار الأول بالخسارة»؟"}}]}},{"id":"abc","text":{"en":"Replace search with an A to Z list of articles","ar":"وضع قائمة أبجدية بالمقالات مكان البحث"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"aman","name":{"en":"Aman","ar":"أمان"},"color":"#364FC7","icon":"shield-check","domain":"aman.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"aman.example/help/a-z","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Car","ar":"السيارات"},{"en":"Help","ar":"المساعدة"}],"active":1},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"All articles, A to Z","ar":"كل المقالات، أبجديًا"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"file-text","text":{"en":"Adding a driver","ar":"إضافة سائق"},"chevron":true,"gap":"m"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"file-text","text":{"en":"Changing your address","ar":"تغيير عنوانك"},"chevron":true,"gap":"s","note":{"en":"120 articles; the claim one is under S","ar":"120 مقالًا؛ ومقال المطالبة تحت حرف التاء"}}]}}],"answer":["search"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P02-042","when":["glossary","abc"],"feedback":{"en":"People still won't find the article under the words they use. A glossary and an A to Z list both expect them to know our term first.","ar":"سيبقى الناس عاجزين عن إيجاد المقال بالكلمات التي يستخدمونها. فصفحة المصطلحات والقائمة الأبجدية تتوقعان أن يعرفوا مصطلحنا أولًا."}}],"correct":{"en":"Make search find people's own words.","ar":"اجعل البحث يجد كلمات الناس أنفسهم."},"explain":{"en":"After an accident, people search the way they speak. A title in their words, and search that understands them, gets them to the steps quickly.","ar":"بعد الحادث، يبحث الناس بالطريقة التي يتكلمون بها. والعنوان بكلماتهم، والبحث الذي يفهمهم، يوصلانهم إلى الخطوات بسرعة."},"speaker":"mona"}]}$uxg$::jsonb),
  ($uxg$P05-U01-L01$uxg$, $uxg$534a493fa8efc167c771d49c6f401a0e801ba6d23c637bd3dbb0f0e73cda624a$uxg$, $uxg${"id":"P05-U01-L01","mode":"lesson","minutes":8,"title":{"en":"Passing the checklist isn't enough","ar":"النجاح في الـ Checklist لا يكفي"},"summary":{"en":"A pharmacy app passed its checklist. Judge it by whether a blind customer can order easily.","ar":"تطبيق صيدلية نجح في الـ Checklist (قائمة الفحص). احكم عليه: هل يطلب العميل الكفيف دواءه بسهولة؟"},"speaker":"tarek","review_labels":{"MC-P05-001":{"en":"A passed checklist isn't proof people can finish","ar":"النجاح في الـ Checklist لا يعني أن الناس يُنهون المهمة"},"MC-P05-002":{"en":"Possible isn't the same as easy and fast","ar":"أن يستطيع الشخص المهمة لا يعني أنها سهلة وسريعة"},"MC-P05-003":{"en":"A separate version must have the same content and features","ar":"النسخة المنفصلة يجب أن يكون فيها كل المحتوى والميزات"},"MC-P05-004":{"en":"A plugin or a promise doesn't replace testing with real users","ar":"الإضافة الجاهزة أو الوعد لا يغنيان عن الاختبار مع مستخدمين حقيقيين"},"MC-P05-005":{"en":"Test on people's own phones and settings","ar":"اختبر على هواتف الناس وبإعداداتهم"}},"steps":[{"id":"S01","type":"card","part":"hook","title":{"en":"Adel can't reorder his medicine","ar":"عادل لا يستطيع طلب دوائه"},"body":{"en":"Last month, our pharmacy app passed an accessibility check: 52 of 52 points, all green. Accessibility means people with disabilities can use the app.\n\nThis week, Adel emailed us. He is blind and uses a screen reader (an app that reads the screen out loud). He tried to order his monthly medicine again, and gave up after 20 minutes. Most customers do it in less than one minute.","ar":"الشهر الماضي، نجح تطبيق الصيدلية عندنا في فحص الـ Accessibility (أن يستطيع ذوو الإعاقة استخدام التطبيق): 52 بندًا من 52، كلها خضراء.\n\nوهذا الأسبوع، أرسل لنا عادل رسالة. عادل كفيف، ويستخدم قارئ الشاشة (Screen reader)، وهو تطبيق يقرأ ما على الشاشة بصوت عالٍ. حاول أن يطلب دواءه الشهري مرة أخرى، وتوقّف بعد 20 دقيقة. وأغلب العملاء يطلبونه في أقل من دقيقة."},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dawaa","name":{"en":"Dawaa Pharmacy","ar":"صيدلية دواء"},"color":"#059669","icon":"pill","domain":"dawaa.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"admin.dawaa.example/accessibility-report","blocks":[{"kind":"row","blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Accessibility check · October","ar":"فحص الـ Accessibility · أكتوبر"}},{"kind":"badge","tone":"good","icon":"check-circle","text":{"en":"Passed","ar":"ناجح"}}]},{"kind":"progress","value":100,"label":{"en":"52 of 52 points passed","ar":"نجح 52 بندًا من 52"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"list","style":"check","gap":"m","items":[{"en":"Images have alt text","ar":"للصور نص بديل (Alt text)"},{"en":"Buttons have names","ar":"للأزرار أسماء"},{"en":"Text contrast is 4.5:1 or more","ar":"تباين النص 4.5:1 أو أكثر"},{"en":"… 49 more, all green","ar":"… 49 بندًا آخر، كلها خضراء"}]}],"overlay":{"type":"toast","blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","avatar":{"text":"Adel Samir","art":"man-3"},"text":{"en":"New email from Adel Samir","ar":"رسالة جديدة من عادل سمير"},"sub":{"en":"\"I tried for 20 minutes and couldn't reorder my medicine.\"","ar":"«حاولت 20 دقيقة ولم أستطع أن أطلب دوائي مرة أخرى.»"}}]}}},{"id":"S02","type":"choose","skill":"SK-P05-U01-01","part":"try","rules":["R12"],"value":{"en":"Try first. Accessibility Is Not Enough (NN/g): meeting every high-priority checkpoint doesn't mean disabled users can use the site. The test is whether they can do the task.","ar":"جرّب أولًا. الإتاحة وحدها لا تكفي (NN/g): النجاح في كل البنود المهمة لا يعني أن ذوي الإعاقة يستطيعون استخدام الموقع. المقياس هو: هل يُنهون المهمة؟"},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/accessibility-is-not-enough/","quote":"even if you meet every high-priority checkpoint, users with disabilities might still be completely incapable of using your site"},"prompt":{"en":"The app passed all 52 points, but Adel couldn't order. Is the app good enough for blind customers now?","ar":"نجح التطبيق في البنود الـ 52 كلها، لكن عادل لم يستطع الطلب. هل التطبيق مناسب الآن للعملاء المكفوفين؟"},"options":[{"id":"no","text":{"en":"No. A blind customer couldn't finish a main task","ar":"لا. عميل كفيف لم يستطع إنهاء مهمة أساسية"}},{"id":"yes","text":{"en":"Yes. It passed every point, so Adel's case is rare","ar":"نعم. نجح في كل البنود، وحالة عادل نادرة"}},{"id":"phone","text":{"en":"Yes, if we add a phone number for people who get stuck","ar":"نعم، إذا أضفنا رقم هاتف لمن يواجه مشكلة"}}],"answer":["no"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-001","when":["yes"],"feedback":{"en":"Each point checks one small rule on the screen. None of them asks: can a blind customer order his medicine? Adel's 20 minutes answer that question.","ar":"كل بند يفحص قاعدة صغيرة واحدة في الشاشة. ولا يوجد بند يسأل: هل يستطيع عميل كفيف أن يطلب دواءه؟ والجواب جاء من عادل: 20 دقيقة ولم ينجح."}},{"id":"MC-P05-003","when":["phone"],"feedback":{"en":"A phone number gives Adel a different, slower way to do the same thing. The app itself still stops him.","ar":"رقم الهاتف يعطي عادل طريقة أخرى أبطأ لنفس الطلب. والتطبيق نفسه ما زال يوقفه."}}],"hints":[{"en":"What was Adel trying to do, and did he manage it?","ar":"ماذا كان عادل يحاول أن يفعل؟ وهل نجح؟"},{"en":"Which tells you more: the 52 green points, or what happened when Adel tried?","ar":"أيهما يخبرك أكثر: البنود الـ 52 الخضراء، أم ما حدث حين حاول عادل؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Right. What matters is whether people can finish the task, not the score.","ar":"صحيح. المهم أن يُنهي الناس المهمة، لا الدرجة."},"explain":{"en":"A checklist checks rules one by one. It can't tell you if people can really finish a task. Only watching them try can tell you that.","ar":"الـ Checklist يفحص القواعد واحدة بعد الأخرى. لكنه لا يخبرك هل يُنهي الناس المهمة فعلًا. وهذا لا تعرفه إلا حين تراهم يحاولون."}},{"id":"S03","type":"card","part":"concept","icons":["ok","clock","layers","person","ear"],"title":{"en":"Passing the rules isn't the same as easy to use","ar":"النجاح في القواعد لا يعني سهولة الاستخدام"},"body":{"en":"- **Passing isn't proof:** a screen can pass every rule on the checklist and still stop people from finishing.\n- **Possible isn't enough:** what counts is how easy and fast it is for a disabled person. A ramp at the back of a building lets wheelchair users in, but it's far away.\n- **Same content, same features:** a separate \"accessible version\" with fewer things in it isn't equal.\n- **Not two groups:** many people see a bit less or get tired faster. It's a range, not yes or no.\n- **Their own tools:** blind people set up the screen reader on their own phone. A website's add-on menu can't replace it. Testing with real users shows what stops them.","ar":"- **النجاح ليس دليلًا:** قد تنجح الشاشة في كل قواعد الـ Checklist، ومع ذلك تمنع الناس من إنهاء مهمتهم.\n- **الممكن لا يكفي:** المهم هو: ما مدى سهولة المهمة وسرعتها للشخص ذي الإعاقة؟ فالمنحدر الموجود خلف المبنى يُدخل مستخدم الكرسي المتحرّك، لكنه بعيد.\n- **نفس المحتوى ونفس الميزات:** إذا كانت «النسخة الخاصة بذوي الإعاقة» ميزاتها أقل، فهي لا تساويهم بغيرهم.\n- **الناس ليسوا فئتين:** كثير من الناس يرون أقل قليلًا، أو يتعبون أسرع. الأمر درجات، لا «نعم أو لا».\n- **أدواتهم الخاصة:** المكفوفون يضبطون قارئ الشاشة على هواتفهم بأنفسهم. وقائمة الأدوات التي يضيفها الموقع لا تحلّ محلّه. والاختبار مع مستخدمين حقيقيين يكشف ما يوقفهم."}},{"id":"S04","type":"compare","skill":"SK-P05-U01-01","part":"guided","rules":["R06"],"value":{"en":"Alternative Interfaces for Accessibility (NN/g): whatever the user group, every version must offer the same functionality and the same content. A 'simple' version without saved prescriptions isn't equal access.","ar":"واجهات بديلة من أجل الإتاحة (NN/g): أيًّا كانت فئة المستخدمين، يجب أن تقدّم كل نسخة نفس الوظائف ونفس المحتوى. والنسخة «المبسّطة» بلا الوصفات المحفوظة ليست عادلة."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/alternative-interfaces-for-accessibility/","quote":"Regardless of the targeted user group, all designs must offer the same functionality and provide access to the same content."},"scenario":{"en":"Adel can't order his medicine in our app. Our developers have two ideas to fix this.","ar":"عادل لا يستطيع طلب دوائه من تطبيقنا. وعند المطوّرين فكرتان لحل المشكلة."},"prompt":{"en":"Which idea gives Adel everything other customers get?","ar":"أي فكرة تعطي عادل كل ما يحصل عليه باقي العملاء؟"},"a":{"label":{"en":"A: Make a separate, simple page only for blind customers","ar":"A: ننشئ صفحة بسيطة منفصلة للعملاء المكفوفين فقط"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dawaa","name":{"en":"Dawaa Pharmacy","ar":"صيدلية دواء"},"color":"#059669","icon":"pill","domain":"dawaa.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Simple order","ar":"طلب مبسّط"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"banner","tone":"info","icon":"info","text":{"en":"Saved prescriptions and offers are not available here.","ar":"الوصفات المحفوظة والعروض غير موجودة هنا."}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Medicine name","ar":"اسم الدواء"},"text":{"en":"Type the name","ar":"اكتب الاسم"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"stepper","label":{"en":"Quantity","ar":"الكمية"},"text":"1","gap":"s"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Send order","ar":"أرسل الطلب"}}]}},"b":{"label":{"en":"B: Fix our normal order screen so it works with a screen reader","ar":"B: نُصلح شاشة الطلب العادية لتعمل مع قارئ الشاشة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dawaa","name":{"en":"Dawaa Pharmacy","ar":"صيدلية دواء"},"color":"#059669","icon":"pill","domain":"dawaa.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"My prescriptions","ar":"وصفاتي"},"back":true},"reader":{"en":"Reorder Metformin 500 mg, button","ar":"اطلب ميتفورمين 500 ملجم مرة أخرى، زر"},"blocks":[{"kind":"card","blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","art":"medicine","text":{"en":"Metformin 500 mg","ar":"ميتفورمين 500 ملجم"},"sub":{"en":"Monthly · last ordered 2 October","ar":"شهريًا · آخر طلب 2 أكتوبر"},"value":{"en":"EGP 64","ar":"64 جنيه"}},{"kind":"button","icon":"arrow-counter-clockwise","text":{"en":"Reorder Metformin","ar":"اطلب ميتفورمين مرة أخرى"},"gap":"s"}]},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"tag","text":{"en":"This week's offers","ar":"عروض هذا الأسبوع"},"chevron":true,"gap":"m"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"file-text","text":{"en":"Upload a new prescription","ar":"ارفع وصفة جديدة"},"chevron":true}]}},"answer":"b","misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-003","when":["a"],"feedback":{"en":"Page A has no saved prescriptions, so Adel must type the medicine name himself, and he may not know the exact spelling. A separate page with fewer features isn't equal.","ar":"الصفحة A ليس فيها الوصفات المحفوظة، فعلى عادل أن يكتب اسم الدواء بنفسه، وقد لا يعرف طريقة كتابته بالضبط. والصفحة المنفصلة التي ميزاتها أقل لا تساوي عادل بغيره."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Compare the two screens: which one still shows Adel's saved prescription?","ar":"قارن الشاشتين: أيهما ما زالت تعرض وصفة عادل المحفوظة؟"},{"en":"Would other customers be happy if the simple page were their only way to order?","ar":"هل يرضى باقي العملاء لو كانت الصفحة البسيطة هي طريقتهم الوحيدة للطلب؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Fix the real screen, so everyone gets the same features.","ar":"صحيح. أصلح الشاشة الأصلية، ليحصل الجميع على نفس الميزات."},"explain":{"en":"Every version must have the same content and features. When you fix the one screen everyone uses, there's no side page that gets forgotten later.","ar":"يجب أن يكون في كل نسخة نفس المحتوى ونفس الميزات. وحين تُصلح الشاشة التي يستخدمها الجميع، لا تبقى صفحة جانبية تُنسى بعد ذلك."},"speaker":"tarek"},{"id":"S05","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P05-U01-01","part":"guided","rules":["R06"],"value":{"en":"Beyond Accessibility (NN/g): usability isn't only whether a task is possible, but how easy and fast it is (the ramp at the back of the building). 'My orders' after 14 offers is reachable, but slow by screen reader.","ar":"ما بعد الإتاحة (NN/g): سهولة الاستخدام ليست فقط أن تكون المهمة ممكنة، بل مدى سهولتها وسرعتها (مثل المنحدر خلف المبنى). و«طلباتي» بعد 14 عرضًا يمكن الوصول إليها، لكنها بطيئة بقارئ الشاشة."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/beyond-accessibility-treating-users-with-disabilities-as-people/","quote":"It is also a matter of how easy and fast it is for them to do so."},"scenario":{"en":"A screen reader reads our home screen from top to bottom. Adel swipes to hear the next item. He hears 14 offers before he reaches \"My orders\" at the bottom.","ar":"قارئ الشاشة يقرأ الشاشة الرئيسية عندنا من الأعلى إلى الأسفل. ويمرّر عادل إصبعه (Swipe) ليسمع العنصر التالي، فيسمع 14 عرضًا قبل أن يصل إلى «طلباتي» في الأسفل."},"prompt":{"en":"Tap each option to see the change. Which change lets Adel start his order fastest?","ar":"اضغط على كل خيار لترى التغيير. أي تغيير يجعل عادل يبدأ طلبه بأسرع شكل؟"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"app":{"id":"dawaa","name":{"en":"Dawaa Pharmacy","ar":"صيدلية دواء"},"color":"#059669","icon":"pill","domain":"dawaa.example"},"appbar":{"logo":true,"actions":[{"icon":"magnifying-glass","aria":{"en":"Search","ar":"بحث"}},{"icon":"shopping-cart","aria":{"en":"Basket","ar":"السلة"}}]},"reader":{"en":"Offer 1 of 14: 20% off vitamins, link","ar":"العرض 1 من 14: خصم 20% على الفيتامينات، رابط"},"blocks":[{"kind":"card","art":"medicine","mark":1,"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"20% off vitamins","ar":"خصم 20% على الفيتامينات"}}]},{"kind":"card","art":"box","mark":2,"gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Free delivery this week","ar":"توصيل مجاني هذا الأسبوع"}}]},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"… 12 more offers …","ar":"… 12 عرضًا آخر …"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"receipt","mark":15,"text":{"en":"My orders","ar":"طلباتي"},"chevron":true,"gap":"s"}]},"options":[{"id":"keep","text":{"en":"Change nothing: he can reach \"My orders\" in the end","ar":"لا تغيّر شيئًا: فهو يصل إلى «طلباتي» في النهاية"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"dawaa","name":{"en":"Dawaa Pharmacy","ar":"صيدلية دواء"},"color":"#059669","icon":"pill","domain":"dawaa.example"},"appbar":{"logo":true,"actions":[{"icon":"magnifying-glass","aria":{"en":"Search","ar":"بحث"}},{"icon":"shopping-cart","aria":{"en":"Basket","ar":"السلة"}}]},"reader":{"en":"Offer 1 of 14: 20% off vitamins, link","ar":"العرض 1 من 14: خصم 20% على الفيتامينات، رابط"},"blocks":[{"kind":"card","art":"medicine","mark":1,"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"20% off vitamins","ar":"خصم 20% على الفيتامينات"}}]},{"kind":"card","art":"box","mark":2,"gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Free delivery this week","ar":"توصيل مجاني هذا الأسبوع"}}]},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"… 12 more offers …","ar":"… 12 عرضًا آخر …"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"receipt","mark":15,"text":{"en":"My orders","ar":"طلباتي"},"chevron":true,"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"top","text":{"en":"Put \"Reorder my medicine\" at the top, before the offers","ar":"ضع زر «اطلب دوائي مرة أخرى» في الأعلى، قبل العروض"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"dawaa","name":{"en":"Dawaa Pharmacy","ar":"صيدلية دواء"},"color":"#059669","icon":"pill","domain":"dawaa.example"},"appbar":{"logo":true,"actions":[{"icon":"magnifying-glass","aria":{"en":"Search","ar":"بحث"}},{"icon":"shopping-cart","aria":{"en":"Basket","ar":"السلة"}}]},"reader":{"en":"Reorder my medicine, button","ar":"اطلب دوائي مرة أخرى، زر"},"blocks":[{"kind":"button","icon":"arrow-counter-clockwise","mark":1,"text":{"en":"Reorder my medicine","ar":"اطلب دوائي مرة أخرى"}},{"kind":"card","art":"medicine","mark":2,"gap":"m","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"20% off vitamins","ar":"خصم 20% على الفيتامينات"}}]},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"… 13 more offers …","ar":"… 13 عرضًا آخر …"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"receipt","text":{"en":"My orders","ar":"طلباتي"},"chevron":true,"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"note","text":{"en":"Add a line at the top: \"Screen reader users: My orders is at the bottom\"","ar":"أضف سطرًا في الأعلى: «لمستخدمي قارئ الشاشة: طلباتي في الأسفل»"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"dawaa","name":{"en":"Dawaa Pharmacy","ar":"صيدلية دواء"},"color":"#059669","icon":"pill","domain":"dawaa.example"},"appbar":{"logo":true,"actions":[{"icon":"magnifying-glass","aria":{"en":"Search","ar":"بحث"}},{"icon":"shopping-cart","aria":{"en":"Basket","ar":"السلة"}}]},"reader":{"en":"Screen reader users: My orders is at the bottom","ar":"لمستخدمي قارئ الشاشة: «طلباتي» في الأسفل"},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","mark":1,"text":{"en":"Screen reader users: My orders is at the bottom.","ar":"لمستخدمي قارئ الشاشة: «طلباتي» في الأسفل."}},{"kind":"card","art":"medicine","mark":2,"gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"20% off vitamins","ar":"خصم 20% على الفيتامينات"}}]},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"… 13 more offers …","ar":"… 13 عرضًا آخر …"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"receipt","mark":16,"text":{"en":"My orders","ar":"طلباتي"},"chevron":true,"gap":"s"}]}}],"answer":["top"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-002","when":["keep"],"feedback":{"en":"Reaching it after 14 swipes is like the ramp at the back of the building. It works, but it costs Adel much more time than anyone else.","ar":"الوصول بعد 14 سحبة مثل المنحدر خلف المبنى. يعمل، لكنه يأخذ من عادل وقتًا أكثر بكثير من غيره."}},{"id":"MC-P05-002","when":["note"],"feedback":{"en":"The line tells Adel where \"My orders\" is, but it's still far away. He still has to pass all 14 offers to get there.","ar":"السطر يخبر عادل بمكان «طلباتي»، لكنها ما زالت بعيدة. وما زال عليه أن يمرّ على الـ 14 عرضًا كلها ليصل إليها."}}],"hints":[{"en":"In each option, count how many swipes Adel needs before he can start.","ar":"في كل خيار، عُدّ كم سحبة يحتاج عادل قبل أن يبدأ."},{"en":"Which option makes his task as quick for him as it is for others?","ar":"أي خيار يجعل المهمة سريعة له كما هي سريعة لغيره؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Put the main task first, for everyone.","ar":"صحيح. ضع المهمة الأساسية أولًا، للجميع."},"explain":{"en":"Possible isn't enough; it should be quick. With the main task at the top, it's fast with a screen reader, and faster for everyone else too.","ar":"الممكن لا يكفي؛ يجب أن تكون المهمة سريعة. وحين تكون المهمة الأساسية في الأعلى، تصبح سريعة بقارئ الشاشة، وأسرع لباقي العملاء أيضًا."},"speaker":"tarek"},{"id":"S06","type":"choose","skill":"SK-P05-U01-02","part":"guided","rules":["R06"],"value":{"en":"Challenges for Screen-Reader Users on Mobile (NN/g): no screen reader user in the study opened the accessibility menus on their own; they already have a built-in screen reader. Most issues are structural and no plugin fixes them.","ar":"تحديات مستخدمي قارئ الشاشة على الهاتف (NN/g): لم يفتح أي مستخدم لقارئ الشاشة في الدراسة قوائم الإتاحة من نفسه؛ فلديهم قارئ شاشة في الهاتف. وأغلب المشكلات في بناء الشاشة نفسها، ولا تُصلحها إضافة."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/screen-reader-users-on-mobile/","quote":"Most accessibility issues are structural and cannot be fixed by a simple plugin."},"scenario":{"en":"My manager found a ready-made accessibility menu. One line of code adds a floating button with text size, colours and its own screen reader. He wants to add it and close Adel's complaint.","ar":"وجد مديري قائمة أدوات جاهزة للـ Accessibility. سطر واحد من الكود يضيف زرًا عائمًا (Floating button) فيه حجم الخط والألوان وقارئ شاشة خاص به. ويريد أن يضيفها ويُغلق شكوى عادل."},"prompt":{"en":"What should we do before we say Adel's problem is fixed?","ar":"ماذا نفعل قبل أن نقول إن مشكلة عادل حُلّت؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dawaa","name":{"en":"Dawaa Pharmacy","ar":"صيدلية دواء"},"color":"#059669","icon":"pill","domain":"dawaa.example"},"appbar":{"logo":true,"actions":[{"icon":"magnifying-glass","aria":{"en":"Search","ar":"بحث"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"card","art":"medicine","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"20% off vitamins","ar":"خصم 20% على الفيتامينات"}}]},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"receipt","text":{"en":"My orders","ar":"طلباتي"},"chevron":true,"gap":"m"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"file-text","text":{"en":"My prescriptions","ar":"وصفاتي"},"chevron":true}],"fab":{"icon":"wheelchair","text":{"en":"Accessibility menu","ar":"قائمة الـ Accessibility"}}},"options":[{"id":"menu","text":{"en":"Add the menu; its screen reader is enough for Adel","ar":"نضيف القائمة؛ فقارئ الشاشة الذي فيها يكفي عادل"}},{"id":"menutest","text":{"en":"Add the menu, then ask Adel to try its screen reader","ar":"نضيف القائمة، ثم نطلب من عادل أن يجرّب قارئ الشاشة الذي فيها"}},{"id":"users","text":{"en":"Watch a few blind customers order with their own screen readers, and fix what stops them","ar":"نراقب بعض العملاء المكفوفين وهم يطلبون بقارئ الشاشة الخاص بهم، ونُصلح ما يوقفهم"}}],"answer":["users"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-004","when":["menu","menutest"],"feedback":{"en":"Adel already has a screen reader on his phone, set up the way he likes. To use the menu's reader, he'd have to turn his own off. And the menu doesn't change the order or names on the screen, which is what stopped him.","ar":"عند عادل قارئ شاشة في هاتفه، مضبوط كما يحب. ولكي يستخدم قارئ القائمة، عليه أن يُطفئ قارئه. والقائمة لا تغيّر ترتيب الشاشة ولا أسماء العناصر، وهذا بالضبط ما أوقفه."}}],"hints":[{"en":"What does Adel already use to hear his phone?","ar":"ماذا يستخدم عادل أصلًا ليسمع ما على هاتفه؟"},{"en":"Does a floating button change the order and names on the order screen?","ar":"هل يغيّر الزر العائم ترتيب شاشة الطلب وأسماء عناصرها؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Test with real users and fix the screen itself.","ar":"صحيح. اختبر مع مستخدمين حقيقيين، وأصلح الشاشة نفسها."},"explain":{"en":"Blind people use the screen reader that comes with their phone. What stops them is usually how the screen is built: the order, the names, where things are. Watching them use it shows you what to fix.","ar":"المكفوفون يستخدمون قارئ الشاشة الموجود في هواتفهم. وما يوقفهم غالبًا هو طريقة بناء الشاشة: الترتيب، والأسماء، ومكان كل عنصر. وحين تراقبهم وهم يستخدمونها، تعرف ما يجب إصلاحه."},"speaker":"tarek"},{"id":"S07","type":"compare","skill":"SK-P05-U01-02","part":"contrast","confidence":true,"rules":["R11"],"value":{"en":"Contrast: both plans test with screen reader users; only the device differs. Mobile accessibility research (NN/g): have participants use their own device; they know where things are and how their reader is set up, and a researcher's phone would hinder them.","ar":"مقارنة: الخطتان تختبران مع مستخدمي قارئ الشاشة؛ والفرق في الهاتف فقط. بحث الإتاحة على الهاتف (NN/g): اجعل المشاركين يستخدمون أجهزتهم؛ فهم يعرفون أماكن الأشياء وضبط القارئ عندهم، وهاتف الباحث يُربكهم."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/mobile-accessibility-research/","quote":"Have participants use their own device."},"scenario":{"en":"We'll invite 5 blind customers to try our new order screen. We wrote two plans for the test.","ar":"سندعو 5 عملاء مكفوفين ليجرّبوا شاشة الطلب الجديدة. وكتبنا خطتين للاختبار."},"prompt":{"en":"Which plan shows us the problems in our app, not problems with a phone they don't know?","ar":"أي خطة تكشف لنا مشكلات تطبيقنا، لا مشكلات هاتف لا يعرفونه؟"},"a":{"label":{"en":"A: Everyone uses our office phone","ar":"A: الكل يستخدم هاتف المكتب عندنا"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"mudawwana","name":{"en":"Mudawwana","ar":"مدوّنة"},"color":"#EAB308","icon":"note-pencil","domain":"mudawwana.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Test plan A","ar":"خطة الاختبار A"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Order screen test · 5 blind customers","ar":"اختبار شاشة الطلب · 5 عملاء مكفوفين"}},{"kind":"list","style":"number","gap":"s","items":[{"en":"Each person uses **our office test phone**","ar":"كل شخص يستخدم **هاتف الاختبار في مكتبنا**"},{"en":"The screen reader is on its default settings","ar":"قارئ الشاشة على الإعدادات الأصلية"},{"en":"Task: reorder your monthly medicine","ar":"المهمة: اطلب دواءك الشهري مرة أخرى"}]}]}},"b":{"label":{"en":"B: Each person uses their own phone","ar":"B: كل شخص يستخدم هاتفه الخاص"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"mudawwana","name":{"en":"Mudawwana","ar":"مدوّنة"},"color":"#EAB308","icon":"note-pencil","domain":"mudawwana.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Test plan B","ar":"خطة الاختبار B"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Order screen test · 5 blind customers","ar":"اختبار شاشة الطلب · 5 عملاء مكفوفين"}},{"kind":"list","style":"number","gap":"s","items":[{"en":"Each person uses **their own phone**","ar":"كل شخص يستخدم **هاتفه الخاص**"},{"en":"With the screen reader settings they use every day","ar":"بإعدادات قارئ الشاشة التي يستخدمها كل يوم"},{"en":"Task: reorder your monthly medicine","ar":"المهمة: اطلب دواءك الشهري مرة أخرى"}]}]}},"answer":"b","reason":{"prompt":{"en":"Why does Plan B give us truer results?","ar":"لماذا تعطينا الخطة B نتائج أصدق؟"},"options":[{"id":"own","text":{"en":"On a phone they don't know, people struggle with the phone instead of our app","ar":"على هاتف لا يعرفونه، يتعب الناس مع الهاتف نفسه بدل تطبيقنا"}},{"id":"same","text":{"en":"Every person will have the same setup","ar":"لأن كل الأشخاص سيكون عندهم نفس الإعدادات"}},{"id":"cheap","text":{"en":"We don't have to buy test phones","ar":"لأننا لن نحتاج إلى شراء هواتف للاختبار"}}],"answer":["own"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-005","when":["same","cheap"],"feedback":{"en":"Cost and same setup aren't the point. People know where things are on their own phone and how fast their reader talks. A phone they don't know adds problems that aren't from our app.","ar":"السعر وتشابه الإعدادات ليسا السبب. الناس يعرفون أماكن الأشياء في هواتفهم، وسرعة كلام القارئ عندهم. والهاتف الذي لا يعرفونه يضيف مشكلات ليست من تطبيقنا."}}]},"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-005","when":["a"],"feedback":{"en":"On our phone, people would fight settings and a speed they don't know. We'd be testing the phone, not our order screen.","ar":"على هاتفنا، سيتعب الناس مع إعدادات وسرعة لا يعرفونها، فنختبر الهاتف لا شاشة الطلب."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Think about how much a blind person changes on their phone over the years: speed, gestures, voice.","ar":"فكّر: كم يغيّر الشخص الكفيف في هاتفه على مرّ السنين؟ السرعة، وحركات الأصابع، والصوت."},{"en":"In which plan would any problem come only from our screen?","ar":"في أي خطة ستأتي أي مشكلة من شاشتنا فقط؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Their own phone, their own settings.","ar":"صحيح. هواتفهم، وإعداداتهم."},"explain":{"en":"Screen reader users set up their phones in detail. On their own phone, any problem they hit comes from our design, and that's what we want to find.","ar":"مستخدمو قارئ الشاشة يضبطون هواتفهم بالتفصيل. وعلى هواتفهم، أي مشكلة تقابلهم تأتي من تصميمنا، وهذا ما نريد أن نكتشفه."},"speaker":"tarek"},{"id":"S08","type":"choose","skill":"SK-P05-U01-02","part":"independent","speaker":"hana","rules":["R14"],"value":{"en":"New case. Accessibility Is Not Enough (NN/g): never trust a vendor's sales staff on user experience; check for yourself by having a few disabled people do real tasks with their own assistive technology.","ar":"حالة جديدة. الإتاحة وحدها لا تكفي (NN/g): لا تصدّق فريق المبيعات في أمور تجربة المستخدم؛ وتحقّق بنفسك بأن يجرّب بعض ذوي الإعاقة مهامّ حقيقية بأدواتهم المساعدة."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/accessibility-is-not-enough/","quote":"the only good advice here is to check for yourself"},"scenario":{"en":"I'm choosing a class-booking system for my gym. The company selling it says it's \"fully accessible\" and shows a certificate. Two of our members are blind and use screen readers. One member uses a screen magnifier (a tool that makes part of the screen bigger).","ar":"أختار نظامًا لحجز الحصص في النادي الذي أملكه. الشركة التي تبيعه تقول إنه «مناسب تمامًا لذوي الإعاقة» وتعرض شهادة. اثنان من أعضائنا مكفوفان ويستخدمان قارئ الشاشة. وعضوة تستخدم مكبّر الشاشة (Screen magnifier)، وهو أداة تكبّر جزءًا من الشاشة."},"prompt":{"en":"What should I do before I sign the contract?","ar":"ماذا أفعل قبل أن أوقّع العقد؟"},"mock":{"app":{"name":{"en":"Hajz Pro","ar":"حجز برو"},"color":"#2563EB","icon":"calendar-check","domain":"hajzpro.example"},"frame":"wide","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Features","ar":"الميزات"},{"en":"Prices","ar":"الأسعار"},{"en":"Contact","ar":"تواصل معنا"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Class booking for every gym","ar":"حجز الحصص لكل نادٍ رياضي"}},{"kind":"badge","tone":"good","icon":"seal-check","text":{"en":"Fully accessible · certified","ar":"مناسب تمامًا لذوي الإعاقة · معتمد"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Members book, cancel and pay from their phones.","ar":"الأعضاء يحجزون ويلغون ويدفعون من هواتفهم."},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"row","gap":"m","blocks":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Sign the contract","ar":"وقّع العقد"}},{"kind":"button","style":"outline","text":{"en":"Book a demo","ar":"احجز عرضًا تجريبيًا"}}]}]},"options":[{"id":"try","text":{"en":"Ask those three members to book a class with it, on their own phones","ar":"أطلب من هؤلاء الأعضاء الثلاثة أن يحجزوا حصة به، على هواتفهم"}},{"id":"cert","text":{"en":"Sign now; the certificate proves it works for them","ar":"أوقّع الآن؛ فالشهادة تُثبت أنه يناسبهم"}},{"id":"list","text":{"en":"Ask the company for the full list of points it passed","ar":"أطلب من الشركة القائمة الكاملة للبنود التي نجح فيها"}}],"answer":["try"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-004","when":["cert"],"feedback":{"en":"The company wants to sell, and a certificate only says some rules were met. It can't tell you if your members can book a class.","ar":"الشركة تريد أن تبيع، والشهادة تقول فقط إن بعض القواعد تحقّقت. ولا تخبرك هل يستطيع أعضاؤك حجز حصة."}},{"id":"MC-P05-001","when":["list"],"feedback":{"en":"A longer list is still a list of rules. A system can pass them all and still stop people from booking.","ar":"القائمة الأطول تبقى قائمة قواعد. وقد ينجح النظام فيها كلها، ويظل يمنع الناس من الحجز."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Who gains the most from saying the system works for everyone?","ar":"من المستفيد الأكبر من القول إن النظام يناسب الجميع؟"},{"en":"Which option shows you real people doing the real task?","ar":"أي خيار يُريك أشخاصًا حقيقيين يقومون بالمهمة الحقيقية؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Check it yourself with the people who will use it.","ar":"صحيح. تأكّد بنفسك مع الناس الذين سيستخدمونه."},"explain":{"en":"One hour with a few members, on their own phones and tools, tells you more than any certificate. You'll see if they can book, and where they get stuck.","ar":"ساعة واحدة مع بعض الأعضاء، على هواتفهم وبأدواتهم، تخبرك أكثر من أي شهادة. سترى هل يستطيعون الحجز، وأين يتوقّفون."}},{"id":"S09","type":"card","part":"recap","icons":["ok","clock","layers","person"],"title":{"en":"What you did","ar":"ماذا تعلّمت"},"body":{"en":"- **The task decides:** you judged the app by Adel's 20 minutes, not by 52 green points.\n- **Same features:** you fixed the real screen instead of adding a side page with less in it.\n- **Easy and fast:** you moved the main task to the top, so it's quick with a screen reader too.\n- **Real users, own tools:** you tested on people's own phones and settings, and checked a seller's claim yourself.\n\nNext lesson: why a screen reader reads one thing at a time, and how to give people shortcuts.","ar":"- **العبرة بالمهمة:** حكمت على التطبيق بالـ 20 دقيقة التي قضاها عادل، لا بالبنود الـ 52 الخضراء.\n- **نفس الميزات:** أصلحت الشاشة الأصلية بدل إضافة صفحة جانبية ميزاتها أقل.\n- **سهل وسريع:** نقلت المهمة الأساسية إلى الأعلى، لتكون سريعة بقارئ الشاشة أيضًا.\n- **مستخدمون حقيقيون بأدواتهم:** اختبرت على هواتف الناس وبإعداداتهم، وتأكّدت بنفسك من كلام الشركة.\n\nالدرس التالي: لماذا يقرأ قارئ الشاشة شيئًا واحدًا في كل مرة، وكيف تعطي الناس طرقًا مختصرة."}}]}$uxg$::jsonb),
  ($uxg$P05-U01-L02$uxg$, $uxg$e34adcdc843554dac77b5d030fe54c27055da4e6501a88959e003a0db8b36304$uxg$, $uxg${"id":"P05-U01-L02","mode":"lesson","minutes":8,"title":{"en":"One thing at a time","ar":"شيء واحد في كل مرة"},"summary":{"en":"Fix a bookshop app for a screen reader that hears one item at a time.","ar":"أصلح تطبيق مكتبة لمن يسمع الشاشة بقارئ الشاشة، عنصرًا بعد عنصر."},"speaker":"sara","review_labels":{"MC-P05-006":{"en":"One-at-a-time makes people pass everything before what they want","ar":"عرض شيء واحد في كل مرة يجبر الناس على المرور بكل ما قبل ما يريدون"},"MC-P05-007":{"en":"Search is a shortcut; don't hide it","ar":"البحث طريق مختصر؛ لا تُخفِه"},"MC-P05-008":{"en":"One-at-a-time fits content read from start to end","ar":"شيء واحد في كل مرة يناسب محتوى يُقرأ من البداية إلى النهاية"}},"steps":[{"id":"S01","type":"card","part":"hook","title":{"en":"Kamal looks for this week's offer","ar":"كمال يبحث عن عرض الأسبوع"},"body":{"en":"I'm redesigning the home screen of a bookshop app. Kamal is one of our customers. He is blind and uses a screen reader. He wanted this week's offer on Arabic novels.\n\nThe offers are in a carousel: slides that show one at a time. Kamal had to go through them one by one. The novels offer was slide 6 of 8.","ar":"أعيد تصميم الشاشة الرئيسية لتطبيق مكتبة تبيع الكتب. كمال أحد عملائنا، وهو كفيف ويستخدم قارئ الشاشة. وكان يريد عرض هذا الأسبوع على الروايات العربية.\n\nالعروض موجودة في Carousel، أي شرائح تظهر واحدة بعد الأخرى. فاضطر كمال أن يمرّ عليها واحدة واحدة. وكان عرض الروايات هو الشريحة 6 من 8."},"mock":{"app":{"id":"waraq","name":{"en":"Waraq","ar":"ورق"},"color":"#9A3412","icon":"books","domain":"waraq.example"},"appbar":{"logo":true,"actions":[{"icon":"magnifying-glass","aria":{"en":"Search","ar":"بحث"}},{"icon":"shopping-cart","aria":{"en":"Basket","ar":"السلة"}}]},"tabbar":{"active":0,"items":[{"icon":"house","text":{"en":"Home","ar":"الرئيسية"}},{"icon":"books","text":{"en":"Categories","ar":"الأقسام"}},{"icon":"receipt","text":{"en":"Orders","ar":"طلباتي"}},{"icon":"user","text":{"en":"Account","ar":"حسابي"}}]},"reader":{"en":"Children's books, 20% off. Slide 1 of 8","ar":"كتب الأطفال، خصم 20%. الشريحة 1 من 8"},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"This week's offers","ar":"عروض هذا الأسبوع"}},{"kind":"card","art":"book","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"badge","text":{"en":"20% off","ar":"خصم 20%"}},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Children's books","ar":"كتب الأطفال"},"gap":"xs"}]},{"kind":"row","gap":"xs","blocks":[{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"1 of 8","ar":"1 من 8"}},{"kind":"button","style":"text","icon":"caret-right","text":{"en":"Next","ar":"التالي"}}]},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Best sellers","ar":"الأكثر مبيعًا"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"listitem","art":"book","text":{"en":"The Nile Diaries","ar":"يوميات النيل"},"sub":{"en":"Novel · Salma Fawzy","ar":"رواية · سلمى فوزي"},"value":{"en":"EGP 180","ar":"180 جنيه"}}]}},{"id":"S02","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P05-U01-03","part":"try","rules":["R12"],"value":{"en":"Try first. Direct vs. sequential access (NN/g): carousels force people through items one by one. Give links to each item so people pick any in any order, or show several at once.","ar":"جرّب أولًا. الوصول المباشر مقابل المتسلسل (NN/g): الـ Carousel يُجبر الناس على المرور بالعناصر واحدًا واحدًا. ضع رابطًا لكل عنصر ليختار الناس ما يريدون بأي ترتيب، أو اعرض عدة عناصر معًا."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/direct-vs-sequential-access/","quote":"provide links to the stories in the carousels to let people select them in any order or, at least, present more than one item at once"},"prompt":{"en":"Tap each option to see the change. Which change lets Kamal get to the novels offer fastest?","ar":"اضغط على كل خيار لترى التغيير. أي تغيير يُوصل كمال إلى عرض الروايات بأسرع شكل؟"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"app":{"id":"waraq","name":{"en":"Waraq","ar":"ورق"},"color":"#9A3412","icon":"books","domain":"waraq.example"},"appbar":{"logo":true,"actions":[{"icon":"magnifying-glass","aria":{"en":"Search","ar":"بحث"}},{"icon":"shopping-cart","aria":{"en":"Basket","ar":"السلة"}}]},"tabbar":{"active":0,"items":[{"icon":"house","text":{"en":"Home","ar":"الرئيسية"}},{"icon":"books","text":{"en":"Categories","ar":"الأقسام"}},{"icon":"receipt","text":{"en":"Orders","ar":"طلباتي"}},{"icon":"user","text":{"en":"Account","ar":"حسابي"}}]},"reader":{"en":"Children's books, 20% off. Slide 1 of 8","ar":"كتب الأطفال، خصم 20%. الشريحة 1 من 8"},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"This week's offers","ar":"عروض هذا الأسبوع"}},{"kind":"card","art":"book","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"badge","text":{"en":"20% off","ar":"خصم 20%"}},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Children's books","ar":"كتب الأطفال"},"gap":"xs"}]},{"kind":"row","gap":"xs","blocks":[{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"1 of 8","ar":"1 من 8"}},{"kind":"button","style":"text","icon":"caret-right","text":{"en":"Next","ar":"التالي"}}]},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Best sellers","ar":"الأكثر مبيعًا"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"listitem","art":"book","text":{"en":"The Nile Diaries","ar":"يوميات النيل"},"sub":{"en":"Novel · Salma Fawzy","ar":"رواية · سلمى فوزي"},"value":{"en":"EGP 180","ar":"180 جنيه"}}]},"options":[{"id":"auto","text":{"en":"Make the slides change by themselves every 3 seconds","ar":"اجعل الشرائح تتغيّر وحدها كل 3 ثوانٍ"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"waraq","name":{"en":"Waraq","ar":"ورق"},"color":"#9A3412","icon":"books","domain":"waraq.example"},"appbar":{"logo":true,"actions":[{"icon":"magnifying-glass","aria":{"en":"Search","ar":"بحث"}},{"icon":"shopping-cart","aria":{"en":"Basket","ar":"السلة"}}]},"tabbar":{"active":0,"items":[{"icon":"house","text":{"en":"Home","ar":"الرئيسية"}},{"icon":"books","text":{"en":"Categories","ar":"الأقسام"}},{"icon":"receipt","text":{"en":"Orders","ar":"طلباتي"}},{"icon":"user","text":{"en":"Account","ar":"حسابي"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"This week's offers","ar":"عروض هذا الأسبوع"}},{"kind":"card","art":"book","gap":"s","note":{"en":"Moves to the next slide every 3 s","ar":"ينتقل إلى الشريحة التالية كل 3 ثوانٍ"},"blocks":[{"kind":"badge","text":{"en":"20% off","ar":"خصم 20%"}},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Children's books","ar":"كتب الأطفال"},"gap":"xs"}]},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"1 of 8","ar":"1 من 8"},"gap":"xs"}]}},{"id":"list","text":{"en":"Show the 8 offers as a short list of links, each with its name","ar":"اعرض العروض الثمانية كقائمة قصيرة من الروابط، كل رابط باسم عرضه"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"waraq","name":{"en":"Waraq","ar":"ورق"},"color":"#9A3412","icon":"books","domain":"waraq.example"},"appbar":{"logo":true,"actions":[{"icon":"magnifying-glass","aria":{"en":"Search","ar":"بحث"}},{"icon":"shopping-cart","aria":{"en":"Basket","ar":"السلة"}}]},"tabbar":{"active":0,"items":[{"icon":"house","text":{"en":"Home","ar":"الرئيسية"}},{"icon":"books","text":{"en":"Categories","ar":"الأقسام"}},{"icon":"receipt","text":{"en":"Orders","ar":"طلباتي"}},{"icon":"user","text":{"en":"Account","ar":"حسابي"}}]},"reader":{"en":"This week's offers, heading. Children's books: 20% off, link. 1 of 8","ar":"عروض هذا الأسبوع، عنوان. كتب الأطفال: خصم 20%، رابط. 1 من 8"},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"This week's offers","ar":"عروض هذا الأسبوع"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"tag","text":{"en":"Children's books: 20% off","ar":"كتب الأطفال: خصم 20%"},"chevron":true,"gap":"s"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"tag","text":{"en":"Cookbooks: buy 2, get 1","ar":"كتب الطبخ: اشترِ 2 واحصل على 1"},"chevron":true},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"tag","text":{"en":"Arabic novels: 30% off","ar":"الروايات العربية: خصم 30%"},"chevron":true},{"kind":"link","text":{"en":"See all 8 offers","ar":"اعرض العروض الثمانية"},"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"bigger","text":{"en":"Make the Next button bigger and easier to find","ar":"كبّر زر «التالي» واجعله أسهل في الوصول"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"waraq","name":{"en":"Waraq","ar":"ورق"},"color":"#9A3412","icon":"books","domain":"waraq.example"},"appbar":{"logo":true,"actions":[{"icon":"magnifying-glass","aria":{"en":"Search","ar":"بحث"}},{"icon":"shopping-cart","aria":{"en":"Basket","ar":"السلة"}}]},"tabbar":{"active":0,"items":[{"icon":"house","text":{"en":"Home","ar":"الرئيسية"}},{"icon":"books","text":{"en":"Categories","ar":"الأقسام"}},{"icon":"receipt","text":{"en":"Orders","ar":"طلباتي"}},{"icon":"user","text":{"en":"Account","ar":"حسابي"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"This week's offers","ar":"عروض هذا الأسبوع"}},{"kind":"card","art":"book","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"badge","text":{"en":"20% off","ar":"خصم 20%"}},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Children's books","ar":"كتب الأطفال"},"gap":"xs"}]},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"1 of 8","ar":"1 من 8"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"button","icon":"caret-right","text":{"en":"Next offer","ar":"العرض التالي"},"gap":"s"}]}}],"answer":["list"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-006","when":["bigger"],"feedback":{"en":"A bigger Next button is easier to find, but Kamal still has to press it 5 times and hear 5 offers he doesn't want.","ar":"زر «التالي» الأكبر أسهل في الوصول، لكن كمال ما زال يضغطه 5 مرات، ويسمع 5 عروض لا يريدها."}},{"id":"MC-P05-006","when":["auto"],"feedback":{"en":"The slides still show one at a time, and now they move while the screen reader is reading. Kamal can't choose the offer he wants.","ar":"الشرائح ما زالت تظهر واحدة في كل مرة، وهي الآن تتحرّك وقارئ الشاشة يقرأ. ولا يستطيع كمال أن يختار العرض الذي يريده."}}],"hints":[{"en":"In each option, what does Kamal have to go through before the novels offer?","ar":"في كل خيار، على ماذا يمرّ كمال قبل عرض الروايات؟"},{"en":"Which option lets him pick his offer without going through the others one by one?","ar":"أي خيار يسمح له باختيار عرضه دون المرور على الباقي واحدًا واحدًا؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Links let him jump straight to the offer.","ar":"صحيح. الروابط توصله إلى العرض مباشرة."},"explain":{"en":"In a carousel, slide 6 only comes after the first 5. A list of named links lets anyone go straight to the one they want.","ar":"في الـ Carousel، لا تظهر الشريحة 6 إلا بعد الخمس الأولى. أما قائمة الروابط بأسمائها، فتسمح لأي شخص أن يذهب مباشرة إلى ما يريد."}},{"id":"S03","type":"card","part":"concept","icons":["ear","order","list","text","search","order"],"title":{"en":"A screen reader reads one thing at a time","ar":"قارئ الشاشة يقرأ شيئًا واحدًا في كل مرة"},"body":{"en":"A person who can see looks at the whole screen and goes straight to what they want. A screen reader reads one item, then waits for a swipe. To reach item 10, you hear the 9 before it.\n\n- **Jumping beats one by one:** let people go straight to what they want.\n- **Carousels:** give each slide a link with its name, or show several at once.\n- **Long pages:** put a short list of the page's topics at the top, as links (jump links).\n- **Videos:** add the steps as text, or a transcript (the words of the video, written out), so people can jump to the part they need.\n- **Search:** keep it easy to find. It's the fastest shortcut.\n- **When one by one is fine:** if people read everything from start to end, like the chapters of a story, a \"Next\" button is fine.","ar":"الشخص المبصر ينظر إلى الشاشة كلها، ويذهب مباشرة إلى ما يريد. أما قارئ الشاشة فيقرأ عنصرًا واحدًا، ثم ينتظر أن تمرّر إصبعك (Swipe). ولكي تصل إلى العنصر رقم 10، تسمع التسعة التي قبله.\n\n- **الوصول المباشر أفضل من المرور واحدًا واحدًا:** دع الناس يذهبون مباشرة إلى ما يريدون.\n- **الـ Carousel:** ضع لكل شريحة رابطًا باسمها، أو اعرض عدة شرائح معًا.\n- **الصفحات الطويلة:** ضع في أعلى الصفحة قائمة قصيرة بمواضيعها كروابط (Jump links).\n- **الفيديو:** أضف الخطوات مكتوبة، أو الـ Transcript (كلام الفيديو مكتوبًا)، ليصل الناس مباشرة إلى الجزء الذي يحتاجونه.\n- **البحث:** اجعله سهل الوصول. فهو أسرع طريق مختصر.\n- **متى يكون «واحدًا بعد الآخر» مناسبًا:** إذا كان الناس يقرؤون كل شيء من أوله إلى آخره، مثل فصول قصة، فزر «التالي» مناسب."}},{"id":"S04","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P05-U01-03","part":"guided","rules":["R06"],"value":{"en":"Direct vs. sequential access (NN/g): on a long page, people can't tell what's further down. A linked table of contents at the top (a mini-IA) shows what's there and lets them jump to it. Next/Previous pages are still one-by-one.","ar":"الوصول المباشر مقابل المتسلسل (NN/g): في الصفحة الطويلة لا يعرف الناس ما في الأسفل. وفهرس من الروابط في أعلى الصفحة يُظهر ما فيها ويسمح بالقفز إليه. أما صفحات «التالي/السابق» فما زالت واحدة بعد الأخرى."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/direct-vs-sequential-access/","quote":"provide a mini-IA: a linked page table of contents at the top of the page"},"scenario":{"en":"Our help page \"Delivery and returns\" is one long page with 7 topics. Kamal needs to know how many days he has to return a book. That's topic 6.","ar":"صفحة المساعدة «التوصيل والإرجاع» عندنا صفحة واحدة طويلة فيها 7 مواضيع. ويريد كمال أن يعرف كم يومًا عنده ليُرجع الكتاب. وهذا هو الموضوع رقم 6."},"prompt":{"en":"Tap each option to see the change. Which change gets Kamal to topic 6 fastest?","ar":"اضغط على كل خيار لترى التغيير. أي تغيير يُوصل كمال إلى الموضوع 6 بأسرع شكل؟"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"app":{"id":"waraq","name":{"en":"Waraq","ar":"ورق"},"color":"#9A3412","icon":"books","domain":"waraq.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Delivery and returns","ar":"التوصيل والإرجاع"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"1. Delivery areas","ar":"1. مناطق التوصيل"}},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"We deliver to all governorates. Cairo and Giza orders arrive in…","ar":"نوصّل إلى كل المحافظات. وتصل طلبات القاهرة والجيزة خلال…"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"2. Delivery fees","ar":"2. رسوم التوصيل"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"Orders over EGP 500 ship free. Smaller orders…","ar":"التوصيل مجاني للطلبات فوق 500 جنيه. والطلبات الأصغر…"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"… 5 more topics below …","ar":"… 5 مواضيع أخرى في الأسفل …"},"gap":"m"}]},"options":[{"id":"top","text":{"en":"Add a \"Back to top\" button at the bottom","ar":"أضف زر «العودة إلى الأعلى» في آخر الصفحة"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"waraq","name":{"en":"Waraq","ar":"ورق"},"color":"#9A3412","icon":"books","domain":"waraq.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Delivery and returns","ar":"التوصيل والإرجاع"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"1. Delivery areas","ar":"1. مناطق التوصيل"}},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"We deliver to all governorates. Cairo and Giza orders arrive in…","ar":"نوصّل إلى كل المحافظات. وتصل طلبات القاهرة والجيزة خلال…"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"… 6 more topics below …","ar":"… 6 مواضيع أخرى في الأسفل …"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"button","style":"text","icon":"arrow-up","text":{"en":"Back to top","ar":"العودة إلى الأعلى"},"gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"pages","text":{"en":"Split it into 7 pages with Next and Previous buttons","ar":"قسّمها إلى 7 صفحات، بزرّي «التالي» و«السابق»"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"waraq","name":{"en":"Waraq","ar":"ورق"},"color":"#9A3412","icon":"books","domain":"waraq.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Delivery and returns","ar":"التوصيل والإرجاع"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"progress","value":14,"label":{"en":"Topic 1 of 7","ar":"الموضوع 1 من 7"}},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Delivery areas","ar":"مناطق التوصيل"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"We deliver to all governorates. Cairo and Giza orders arrive in…","ar":"نوصّل إلى كل المحافظات. وتصل طلبات القاهرة والجيزة خلال…"},"gap":"xs"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","icon":"caret-right","text":{"en":"Next topic","ar":"الموضوع التالي"}}]}},{"id":"jump","text":{"en":"Add links to the 7 topics at the top of the page","ar":"أضف روابط للمواضيع السبعة في أعلى الصفحة"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"waraq","name":{"en":"Waraq","ar":"ورق"},"color":"#9A3412","icon":"books","domain":"waraq.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Delivery and returns","ar":"التوصيل والإرجاع"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"card","blocks":[{"kind":"small","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"On this page","ar":"في هذه الصفحة"}},{"kind":"link","text":{"en":"Delivery areas","ar":"مناطق التوصيل"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"link","text":{"en":"Delivery fees","ar":"رسوم التوصيل"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"… 3 more …","ar":"… 3 روابط أخرى …"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"link","text":{"en":"Days to return a book","ar":"مدة إرجاع الكتاب"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"link","text":{"en":"Refunds","ar":"استرجاع المبلغ"},"gap":"xs"}]},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"1. Delivery areas","ar":"1. مناطق التوصيل"},"gap":"m"}]}}],"answer":["jump"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-006","when":["pages"],"feedback":{"en":"Seven pages with Next are still one by one: Kamal opens 5 pages he doesn't need before he reaches topic 6.","ar":"سبع صفحات بزر «التالي» ما زالت واحدة بعد الأخرى: يفتح كمال 5 صفحات لا يحتاجها قبل أن يصل إلى الموضوع 6."}},{"id":"MC-P05-006","when":["top"],"feedback":{"en":"Back to top helps after he has read everything. He still has to go through topics 1 to 5 to reach topic 6.","ar":"زر العودة إلى الأعلى يفيد بعد أن يقرأ كل شيء. وما زال عليه أن يمرّ على المواضيع من 1 إلى 5 ليصل إلى الموضوع 6."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Where does Kamal start, and where is topic 6?","ar":"من أين يبدأ كمال، وأين الموضوع 6؟"},{"en":"Which option tells him at the start what's on the page, and takes him straight there?","ar":"أي خيار يخبره من البداية بما في الصفحة، وينقله إليه مباشرة؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Links at the top show what's on the page and take you straight there.","ar":"صحيح. الروابط في الأعلى تُظهر ما في الصفحة، وتنقلك إليه مباشرة."},"explain":{"en":"A short list of links at the top tells everyone what the page has, and lets them skip to it. It helps people who can see, on a small phone screen, as much as it helps Kamal.","ar":"قائمة الروابط القصيرة في الأعلى تخبر الجميع بما في الصفحة، وتنقلهم إليه مباشرة. وهي تفيد المبصرين على شاشة الهاتف الصغيرة كما تفيد كمال."},"speaker":"sara"},{"id":"S05","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P05-U01-03","part":"guided","rules":["R06"],"value":{"en":"Direct vs. sequential access (NN/g): video is the most sequential medium. With a video, also give a transcript or at least a detailed text summary people can scan for the part they need.","ar":"الوصول المباشر مقابل المتسلسل (NN/g): الفيديو أكثر وسيلة تُتابَع بالترتيب. ومع الفيديو، قدّم أيضًا كلامه مكتوبًا، أو على الأقل ملخصًا مكتوبًا مفصّلًا يبحث فيه الناس عن الجزء الذي يحتاجونه."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/direct-vs-sequential-access/","quote":"at least a detailed text summary that allows people to quickly scan the information for relevant details"},"scenario":{"en":"Our help on \"How to return a book\" is only a 4-minute video. There's no text. Kamal only needs step 3: where to drop off the book.","ar":"الشرح عندنا عن «كيف ترجع كتابًا» هو فيديو مدته 4 دقائق فقط، بلا أي نص. وكمال يحتاج الخطوة 3 فقط: أين يسلّم الكتاب."},"prompt":{"en":"Tap each option to see the change. Which change lets Kamal go straight to step 3?","ar":"اضغط على كل خيار لترى التغيير. أي تغيير يجعل كمال يذهب مباشرة إلى الخطوة 3؟"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"app":{"id":"waraq","name":{"en":"Waraq","ar":"ورق"},"color":"#9A3412","icon":"books","domain":"waraq.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"How to return a book","ar":"كيف ترجع كتابًا"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"book","size":"m","text":{"en":"▶ Video · 4:00","ar":"▶ فيديو · 4:00"}},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"No text version","ar":"لا توجد نسخة مكتوبة"},"gap":"s"}]},"options":[{"id":"steps","text":{"en":"Add the steps under the video as numbered text","ar":"أضف الخطوات تحت الفيديو، مكتوبة ومرقّمة"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"waraq","name":{"en":"Waraq","ar":"ورق"},"color":"#9A3412","icon":"books","domain":"waraq.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"How to return a book","ar":"كيف ترجع كتابًا"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"book","size":"s","text":{"en":"▶ Video · 4:00","ar":"▶ فيديو · 4:00"}},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Steps","ar":"الخطوات"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"list","style":"number","gap":"xs","items":[{"en":"Open My orders and pick the book","ar":"افتح «طلباتي» واختر الكتاب"},{"en":"Tap Return and print the label","ar":"اضغط «إرجاع» واطبع الملصق"},{"en":"Drop it at any Waraq branch or post office","ar":"سلّمه في أي فرع من فروع ورق أو مكتب بريد"}]}]}},{"id":"short","text":{"en":"Cut the video down to 2 minutes","ar":"اختصر الفيديو إلى دقيقتين"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"waraq","name":{"en":"Waraq","ar":"ورق"},"color":"#9A3412","icon":"books","domain":"waraq.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"How to return a book","ar":"كيف ترجع كتابًا"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"book","size":"m","text":{"en":"▶ Video · 2:00","ar":"▶ فيديو · 2:00"}},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"No text version","ar":"لا توجد نسخة مكتوبة"},"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"speed","text":{"en":"Add a button to play the video at double speed","ar":"أضف زرًا لتشغيل الفيديو بسرعة مضاعفة"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"waraq","name":{"en":"Waraq","ar":"ورق"},"color":"#9A3412","icon":"books","domain":"waraq.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"How to return a book","ar":"كيف ترجع كتابًا"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"book","size":"m","text":{"en":"▶ Video · 4:00","ar":"▶ فيديو · 4:00"}},{"kind":"button","style":"outline","icon":"fast-forward","text":{"en":"Play at 2× speed","ar":"شغّل بسرعة 2×"},"gap":"s"}]}}],"answer":["steps"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-006","when":["short","speed"],"feedback":{"en":"A shorter or faster video still plays from the start. Kamal still has to wait through steps 1 and 2 to hear step 3.","ar":"الفيديو الأقصر أو الأسرع ما زال يبدأ من أوله. فما زال على كمال أن ينتظر الخطوتين 1 و2 ليسمع الخطوة 3."}}],"hints":[{"en":"In a video, can Kamal skip to step 3 if he doesn't know the exact minute?","ar":"في الفيديو، هل يستطيع كمال أن ينتقل مباشرة إلى الخطوة 3 وهو لا يعرف دقيقتها بالضبط؟"},{"en":"Which option gives his screen reader something it can jump through?","ar":"أي خيار يعطي قارئ الشاشة شيئًا يتنقّل فيه بين الخطوات مباشرة؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Right. You can jump through written steps; you can't do that in a video.","ar":"صحيح. بين الخطوات المكتوبة تنتقل مباشرة؛ وفي الفيديو لا."},"explain":{"en":"Numbered text lets a screen reader user, or anyone in a hurry, jump to step 3. Keep the video for people who like to watch.","ar":"الخطوات المكتوبة المرقّمة توصل مستخدم قارئ الشاشة، أو أي شخص مستعجل، إلى الخطوة 3 مباشرة. وأبقِ الفيديو لمن يحب المشاهدة."},"speaker":"sara"},{"id":"S06","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P05-U01-03","part":"guided","rules":["R06"],"value":{"en":"Challenges for Screen-Reader Users on Mobile (NN/g): screen reader users rely on in-page or site search whenever they can, because it lets them jump straight to what they want. Hiding search behind a menu removes their best shortcut.","ar":"تحديات مستخدمي قارئ الشاشة على الهاتف (NN/g): يعتمد مستخدمو قارئ الشاشة على البحث كلما أمكن، لأنه يوصلهم مباشرة إلى ما يريدون. وإخفاء البحث داخل قائمة يحرمهم من أفضل طريق مختصر."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/screen-reader-users-on-mobile/","quote":"it helps them jump straight to what they are looking for"},"scenario":{"en":"My team wants a bigger banner on the home screen. To make room, they want to move the search box into the ☰ menu.","ar":"يريد فريقي بانرًا أكبر في الشاشة الرئيسية. ولكي يوفّروا له مكانًا، يريدون نقل مربع البحث إلى داخل القائمة ☰."},"prompt":{"en":"Tap each option to see the change. Which one lets Kamal find a book fastest?","ar":"اضغط على كل خيار لترى التغيير. أي خيار يجعل كمال يجد الكتاب بأسرع شكل؟"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"app":{"id":"waraq","name":{"en":"Waraq","ar":"ورق"},"color":"#9A3412","icon":"books","domain":"waraq.example"},"appbar":{"logo":true,"actions":[{"icon":"shopping-cart","aria":{"en":"Basket","ar":"السلة"}}]},"tabbar":{"active":0,"items":[{"icon":"house","text":{"en":"Home","ar":"الرئيسية"}},{"icon":"books","text":{"en":"Categories","ar":"الأقسام"}},{"icon":"receipt","text":{"en":"Orders","ar":"طلباتي"}},{"icon":"user","text":{"en":"Account","ar":"حسابي"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"searchbar","text":{"en":"Search books or authors","ar":"ابحث عن كتاب أو كاتب"}},{"kind":"card","art":"book","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Book fair week: up to 40% off","ar":"أسبوع معرض الكتاب: خصم حتى 40%"}}]}]},"options":[{"id":"menu","text":{"en":"Move search into the ☰ menu, and make the banner bigger","ar":"انقل البحث إلى القائمة ☰، وكبّر البانر"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"waraq","name":{"en":"Waraq","ar":"ورق"},"color":"#9A3412","icon":"books","domain":"waraq.example"},"appbar":{"logo":true,"actions":[{"icon":"list","aria":{"en":"Menu (search is inside)","ar":"القائمة (البحث بداخلها)"}}]},"tabbar":{"active":0,"items":[{"icon":"house","text":{"en":"Home","ar":"الرئيسية"}},{"icon":"books","text":{"en":"Categories","ar":"الأقسام"}},{"icon":"receipt","text":{"en":"Orders","ar":"طلباتي"}},{"icon":"user","text":{"en":"Account","ar":"حسابي"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"card","art":"book","size":"l","blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Book fair week: up to 40% off","ar":"أسبوع معرض الكتاب: خصم حتى 40%"}}]},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Search is now inside the ☰ menu","ar":"البحث الآن داخل القائمة ☰"},"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"keep","text":{"en":"Keep the search box at the top of the screen","ar":"أبقِ مربع البحث في أعلى الشاشة"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"waraq","name":{"en":"Waraq","ar":"ورق"},"color":"#9A3412","icon":"books","domain":"waraq.example"},"appbar":{"logo":true,"actions":[{"icon":"shopping-cart","aria":{"en":"Basket","ar":"السلة"}}]},"tabbar":{"active":0,"items":[{"icon":"house","text":{"en":"Home","ar":"الرئيسية"}},{"icon":"books","text":{"en":"Categories","ar":"الأقسام"}},{"icon":"receipt","text":{"en":"Orders","ar":"طلباتي"}},{"icon":"user","text":{"en":"Account","ar":"حسابي"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"searchbar","text":{"en":"Search books or authors","ar":"ابحث عن كتاب أو كاتب"}},{"kind":"card","art":"book","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Book fair week: up to 40% off","ar":"أسبوع معرض الكتاب: خصم حتى 40%"}}]}]}},{"id":"bottom","text":{"en":"Move search below the banner and the offers","ar":"انقل البحث تحت البانر والعروض"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"waraq","name":{"en":"Waraq","ar":"ورق"},"color":"#9A3412","icon":"books","domain":"waraq.example"},"appbar":{"logo":true,"actions":[{"icon":"shopping-cart","aria":{"en":"Basket","ar":"السلة"}}]},"tabbar":{"active":0,"items":[{"icon":"house","text":{"en":"Home","ar":"الرئيسية"}},{"icon":"books","text":{"en":"Categories","ar":"الأقسام"}},{"icon":"receipt","text":{"en":"Orders","ar":"طلباتي"}},{"icon":"user","text":{"en":"Account","ar":"حسابي"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"card","art":"book","size":"l","blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Book fair week: up to 40% off","ar":"أسبوع معرض الكتاب: خصم حتى 40%"}}]},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"… offers …","ar":"… العروض …"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"searchbar","text":{"en":"Search books or authors","ar":"ابحث عن كتاب أو كاتب"},"gap":"s"}]}}],"answer":["keep"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-007","when":["menu"],"feedback":{"en":"For Kamal, search is the fastest way: type the name of the book, and it's there. Inside a menu, he must find the menu first, then find search inside it.","ar":"البحث عند كمال هو أسرع طريق: يكتب اسم الكتاب فيجده. وإذا كان داخل القائمة، فعليه أن يجد القائمة أولًا، ثم يجد البحث داخلها."}},{"id":"MC-P05-007","when":["bottom"],"feedback":{"en":"Under the banner and offers, Kamal must swipe past all of them to reach the one thing that would let him skip them.","ar":"تحت البانر والعروض، على كمال أن يمرّ عليها كلها ليصل إلى البحث، وهو الشيء الذي كان سيُغنيه عنها."}}],"hints":[{"en":"For someone who hears the screen one item at a time, what's the quickest way to a book?","ar":"لمن يسمع الشاشة عنصرًا بعد عنصر، ما أسرع طريق إلى كتاب؟"},{"en":"In which option does he reach search before anything else?","ar":"في أي خيار يصل إلى البحث قبل أي شيء آخر؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Keep the shortcut at the top, where he reaches it first.","ar":"صحيح. أبقِ الطريق المختصر في الأعلى، حيث يصل إليه أولًا."},"explain":{"en":"Search lets screen reader users skip everything else and go straight to what they want. Keep it visible and near the top.","ar":"البحث يسمح لمستخدمي قارئ الشاشة بتخطّي كل شيء، والذهاب مباشرة إلى ما يريدون. فأبقِه ظاهرًا وقريبًا من أعلى الشاشة."},"speaker":"sara"},{"id":"S07","type":"compare","skill":"SK-P05-U01-03","part":"contrast","confidence":true,"rules":["R11"],"value":{"en":"Contrast: one-by-one isn't always wrong. Direct vs. sequential access (NN/g): sequential access is the right choice when people are expected to go through all the content in a set order, like a novel. Offers are unrelated, so they need direct access.","ar":"مقارنة: العرض واحدًا بعد الآخر ليس خطأ دائمًا. الوصول المباشر مقابل المتسلسل (NN/g): الوصول بالترتيب هو الاختيار الصحيح حين يمرّ الناس على المحتوى كله بترتيب محدّد، مثل الرواية. أما العروض فلا علاقة بينها، فتحتاج وصولًا مباشرًا."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/direct-vs-sequential-access/","quote":"Sequential access is the method of choice if you expect users to access all the content in a prescribed order."},"scenario":{"en":"Two screens in our app have only a \"Next\" button, so Kamal moves through them one by one.","ar":"في تطبيقنا شاشتان فيهما زر «التالي» فقط، فيتنقّل كمال فيهما خطوة بخطوة."},"prompt":{"en":"On which screen is it fine to move one by one with \"Next\"?","ar":"في أي شاشة يكون التنقّل خطوة بخطوة بزر «التالي» مناسبًا؟"},"a":{"label":{"en":"A: Reading a novel, chapter by chapter","ar":"A: قراءة رواية، فصلًا بعد فصل"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"waraq","name":{"en":"Waraq","ar":"ورق"},"color":"#9A3412","icon":"books","domain":"waraq.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"The Night Train","ar":"قطار الليل"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Chapter 3 of 12","ar":"الفصل 3 من 12"}},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"The train left the station before dawn, and Mariam still hadn't…","ar":"غادر القطار المحطة قبل الفجر، ومريم لم…"},"gap":"s"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","icon":"caret-right","text":{"en":"Next chapter","ar":"الفصل التالي"}}]}},"b":{"label":{"en":"B: This week's 8 offers, one by one","ar":"B: عروض هذا الأسبوع الثمانية، عرضًا بعد عرض"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"waraq","name":{"en":"Waraq","ar":"ورق"},"color":"#9A3412","icon":"books","domain":"waraq.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"This week's offers","ar":"عروض هذا الأسبوع"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Offer 3 of 8","ar":"العرض 3 من 8"}},{"kind":"card","art":"book","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Cookbooks: buy 2, get 1","ar":"كتب الطبخ: اشترِ 2 واحصل على 1"}}]}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","icon":"caret-right","text":{"en":"Next offer","ar":"العرض التالي"}}]}},"answer":"a","reason":{"prompt":{"en":"Why is \"Next\" fine for the novel?","ar":"لماذا زر «التالي» مناسب للرواية؟"},"options":[{"id":"order","text":{"en":"Readers go through every chapter, in order","ar":"لأن القارئ يمرّ على كل الفصول، بالترتيب"}},{"id":"fewer","text":{"en":"It has fewer items than the offers","ar":"لأن عناصرها أقل من العروض"}},{"id":"text","text":{"en":"Text is easier for a screen reader than images","ar":"لأن النص أسهل على قارئ الشاشة من الصور"}}],"answer":["order"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-008","when":["fewer","text"],"feedback":{"en":"The novel has more items (12 chapters), not fewer. What matters is that readers want all of it, in order. With offers, people want only one or two.","ar":"الرواية فيها عناصر أكثر (12 فصلًا)، لا أقل. المهم أن القارئ يريد الرواية كلها، بالترتيب. أما العروض، فكل شخص يريد عرضًا أو اثنين فقط."}}]},"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-008","when":["b"],"feedback":{"en":"People don't read offers in order: each person wants one or two. Making them go one by one wastes their time. A novel is read from start to end, so \"Next\" is fine there.","ar":"الناس لا يقرؤون العروض بالترتيب: كل شخص يريد عرضًا أو اثنين. وإجبارهم على المرور عليها واحدًا واحدًا يضيّع وقتهم. أما الرواية فتُقرأ من أولها إلى آخرها، فيناسبها زر «التالي»."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Does someone reading a novel want every chapter, or just one?","ar":"هل يريد قارئ الرواية كل الفصول، أم فصلًا واحدًا فقط؟"},{"en":"Does someone looking at offers want all 8, in order?","ar":"هل يريد من ينظر إلى العروض أن يرى الثمانية كلها، بالترتيب؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Right. One at a time fits content people read in order.","ar":"صحيح. شيء واحد في كل مرة يناسب محتوى يقرؤه الناس بالترتيب."},"explain":{"en":"Ask: do people want all of it, in a set order? A story: yes, so \"Next\" is fine. Offers, news or search results: no, so let people jump.","ar":"اسأل: هل يريد الناس المحتوى كله، بترتيب محدّد؟ القصة: نعم، فزر «التالي» مناسب. والعروض أو الأخبار أو نتائج البحث: لا، فدع الناس يذهبون مباشرة إلى ما يريدون."},"speaker":"sara"},{"id":"S08","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P05-U01-03","part":"independent","speaker":"nour","rules":["R14"],"value":{"en":"New case. Direct vs. sequential access (NN/g): carousels are only for short lists, and long lists never belong in them. 24 doctors in a slider means up to 23 swipes; a list grouped by specialty with links lets people jump.","ar":"حالة جديدة. الوصول المباشر مقابل المتسلسل (NN/g): الـ Carousel للقوائم القصيرة فقط، والقوائم الطويلة لا مكان لها فيه. و24 طبيبًا في شرائح تعني حتى 23 سحبة؛ والقائمة المقسّمة حسب التخصص مع الروابط تسمح بالقفز."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/direct-vs-sequential-access/","quote":"Search results or long lists never belong in carousels"},"scenario":{"en":"Our clinic's website shows its 24 doctors in a slider, one card at a time. Patients usually look for one specialty, like skin or children.","ar":"موقع عيادتنا يعرض أطباءنا الـ 24 في Slider (شرائح تتبدّل)، بطاقة واحدة في كل مرة. والمريض يبحث عادةً عن تخصص واحد، مثل الجلدية أو الأطفال."},"prompt":{"en":"Tap each option to see the change. Which one gets a patient to a children's doctor fastest?","ar":"اضغط على كل خيار لترى التغيير. أي خيار يُوصل المريض إلى طبيب الأطفال بأسرع شكل؟"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"raha.example/doctors","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Doctors","ar":"الأطباء"},{"en":"Services","ar":"الخدمات"},{"en":"Book a visit","ar":"احجز زيارة"}],"active":0},"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Our doctors","ar":"أطباؤنا"}},{"kind":"card","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","avatar":{"text":"Hesham Ali","art":"doctor"},"text":{"en":"Dr. Hesham Ali","ar":"د. هشام علي"},"sub":{"en":"Heart","ar":"القلب"}}]},{"kind":"row","gap":"xs","blocks":[{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"1 of 24","ar":"1 من 24"}},{"kind":"button","style":"text","icon":"caret-right","text":{"en":"Next","ar":"التالي"}}]}]},"options":[{"id":"arrows","text":{"en":"Add arrows on both sides and dots under the slider","ar":"أضف أسهمًا على الجانبين ونقاطًا تحت الشرائح"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"raha.example/doctors","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Doctors","ar":"الأطباء"},{"en":"Services","ar":"الخدمات"},{"en":"Book a visit","ar":"احجز زيارة"}],"active":0},"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Our doctors","ar":"أطباؤنا"}},{"kind":"row","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"iconbtn","icon":"caret-left","aria":{"en":"Previous","ar":"السابق"}},{"kind":"card","blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","avatar":{"text":"Hesham Ali","art":"doctor"},"text":{"en":"Dr. Hesham Ali","ar":"د. هشام علي"},"sub":{"en":"Heart","ar":"القلب"}}]},{"kind":"iconbtn","icon":"caret-right","aria":{"en":"Next","ar":"التالي"}}]},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":"● ○ ○ ○ ○ ○ ○ ○ ○ ○ ○ ○","gap":"xs"}]}},{"id":"list","text":{"en":"A list grouped by specialty, with a link to each specialty at the top","ar":"قائمة مقسّمة حسب التخصص، مع رابط لكل تخصص في الأعلى"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"raha.example/doctors","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Doctors","ar":"الأطباء"},{"en":"Services","ar":"الخدمات"},{"en":"Book a visit","ar":"احجز زيارة"}],"active":0},"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Our doctors","ar":"أطباؤنا"}},{"kind":"row","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"link","text":{"en":"Heart","ar":"القلب"}},{"kind":"link","text":{"en":"Skin","ar":"الجلدية"}},{"kind":"link","text":{"en":"Children","ar":"الأطفال"}},{"kind":"link","text":{"en":"More","ar":"المزيد"}}]},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Heart","ar":"القلب"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"listitem","avatar":{"text":"Hesham Ali","art":"doctor"},"text":{"en":"Dr. Hesham Ali","ar":"د. هشام علي"},"chevron":true},{"kind":"listitem","avatar":{"text":"Laila Nabil","art":"woman-2"},"text":{"en":"Dr. Laila Nabil","ar":"د. ليلى نبيل"},"chevron":true},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Skin","ar":"الجلدية"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"listitem","avatar":{"text":"Mai Hassan","art":"woman-1"},"text":{"en":"Dr. Mai Hassan","ar":"د. مي حسن"},"chevron":true}]}},{"id":"auto","text":{"en":"Let the slider move by itself so patients see every doctor","ar":"اجعل الـ Slider يتحرّك وحده ليرى المرضى كل الأطباء"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"raha.example/doctors","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Doctors","ar":"الأطباء"},{"en":"Services","ar":"الخدمات"},{"en":"Book a visit","ar":"احجز زيارة"}],"active":0},"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Our doctors","ar":"أطباؤنا"}},{"kind":"card","gap":"s","note":{"en":"Moves to the next doctor every 3 s","ar":"ينتقل إلى الطبيب التالي كل 3 ثوانٍ"},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","avatar":{"text":"Hesham Ali","art":"doctor"},"text":{"en":"Dr. Hesham Ali","ar":"د. هشام علي"},"sub":{"en":"Heart","ar":"القلب"}}]},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"1 of 24","ar":"1 من 24"},"gap":"xs"}]}}],"answer":["list"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-006","when":["arrows","auto"],"feedback":{"en":"It's still one doctor at a time: a patient who wants a children's doctor may wait for, or swipe through, 20 cards first. 24 doctors is far too many for a slider.","ar":"ما زال يعرض طبيبًا واحدًا في كل مرة: المريض الذي يريد طبيب أطفال قد ينتظر 20 بطاقة، أو يمرّ عليها أولًا. و24 طبيبًا عدد كبير جدًا على Slider واحد."}}],"hints":[{"en":"How do patients look for a doctor: by going through all 24, or by specialty?","ar":"كيف يبحث المريض عن طبيب: يمرّ على الـ 24 كلهم، أم يبحث حسب التخصص؟"},{"en":"Which option lets a patient go straight to one specialty?","ar":"أي خيار يسمح للمريض بالذهاب مباشرة إلى تخصص واحد؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Long lists don't belong in a slider.","ar":"صحيح. القوائم الطويلة لا مكان لها في الـ Slider."},"explain":{"en":"Group things the way people look for them, and link to each group. Then every patient, blind or not, reaches the right doctor in two steps.","ar":"قسّم العناصر بالطريقة التي يبحث بها الناس، وضع رابطًا لكل قسم. وهكذا يصل كل مريض، كفيفًا كان أو مبصرًا، إلى الطبيب المناسب في خطوتين."}},{"id":"S09","type":"card","part":"recap","icons":["ear","list","text","search","order"],"title":{"en":"What you did","ar":"ماذا تعلّمت"},"body":{"en":"- **Carousels:** you turned 8 slides into named links Kamal can pick from.\n- **Long pages:** you added links to the 7 topics at the top.\n- **Videos:** you added numbered text steps people can jump to.\n- **Search:** you kept it at the top, as the fastest shortcut.\n- **When order is right:** you kept \"Next\" for a novel, which people read from start to end.\n\nNext lesson: who else gets stuck, and why.","ar":"- **الـ Carousel:** حوّلت 8 شرائح إلى روابط بأسمائها، يختار منها كمال.\n- **الصفحات الطويلة:** أضفت في الأعلى روابط إلى المواضيع السبعة.\n- **الفيديو:** أضفت خطوات مكتوبة ومرقّمة يصل إليها الناس مباشرة.\n- **البحث:** أبقيته في الأعلى، لأنه أسرع طريق مختصر.\n- **حين يكون الترتيب مناسبًا:** أبقيت زر «التالي» للرواية، لأنها تُقرأ من أولها إلى آخرها.\n\nالدرس التالي: من غيرهم يواجه مشكلات، ولماذا."}}]}$uxg$::jsonb),
  ($uxg$P05-U01-L03$uxg$, $uxg$089d328d8bd8d9327c9209aede6527d26f87d659d423979a9c0400c57514025d$uxg$, $uxg${"id":"P05-U01-L03","mode":"lesson","minutes":8,"title":{"en":"Who gets stuck, and why","ar":"من يواجه مشكلات، ولماذا"},"summary":{"en":"Find what stops an older patient on a clinic app, and remove it.","ar":"اكتشف ما يوقف مريضة كبيرة في السن في تطبيق عيادة، وأزله."},"speaker":"nour","review_labels":{"MC-P05-009":{"en":"Clean up the format yourself; don't reject it","ar":"نظّف طريقة الكتابة بنفسك؛ لا ترفضها"},"MC-P05-010":{"en":"Let people type instead of forcing a hard picker","ar":"دع الناس يكتبون بدل أداة اختيار صعبة"},"MC-P05-011":{"en":"Real names have spaces, dashes and length","ar":"الأسماء الحقيقية فيها مسافات وشرطات، وقد تكون طويلة"},"MC-P05-012":{"en":"Let text follow the person's size setting","ar":"اجعل النص يتبع حجم الخط الذي اختاره الشخص"},"MC-P05-013":{"en":"Offer dark mode; don't force it","ar":"اترك الوضع الداكن اختيارًا؛ لا تفرضه"}},"steps":[{"id":"S01","type":"card","part":"hook","title":{"en":"Mrs. Fatma books a check-up","ar":"السيدة فاطمة تحجز موعد فحص"},"body":{"en":"Mrs. Fatma is 72. She books her check-ups in our clinic app. Last week, she called reception three times for help.\n\nThe app said her phone number was wrong. She couldn't set the time on the time wheel. And the text was too small for her to read.","ar":"السيدة فاطمة عمرها 72 سنة. وتحجز مواعيد الفحص في تطبيق عيادتنا. والأسبوع الماضي، اتصلت بالاستقبال ثلاث مرات تطلب المساعدة.\n\nقال لها التطبيق إن رقم هاتفها خطأ. ولم تستطع ضبط الوقت على عجلة الوقت (Time picker). وكان الخط أصغر من أن تقرأه."},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Book a check-up","ar":"احجز موعد فحص"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","avatar":{"text":"Mai Hassan","art":"woman-1"},"text":{"en":"Dr. Mai Hassan","ar":"د. مي حسن"},"sub":{"en":"Family doctor · Sunday 16 Nov","ar":"طبيبة أسرة · الأحد 16 نوفمبر"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Mobile number","ar":"رقم الموبايل"},"filled":true,"text":"010-1234-5678","tone":"bad","error":{"en":"Numbers only","ar":"أرقام فقط"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"wheel","label":{"en":"Time","ar":"الوقت"},"columns":[["8","9","10","11","12"],["27","28","29","30","31"]],"gap":"m","note":{"en":"Moves 1 minute per small swipe","ar":"تتحرّك دقيقة مع كل سحبة صغيرة"}}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Book","ar":"احجز"}}]}},{"id":"S02","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P05-U01-04","part":"try","rules":["R12"],"value":{"en":"Try first. Usability for Older Adults (NN/g): older users were often punished for typing dashes or brackets in phone and card numbers. Accept them and strip them yourself; a clearer error still makes people redo it.","ar":"جرّب أولًا. قابلية الاستخدام لكبار السن (NN/g): كثيرًا ما رفضت التطبيقات أرقام الهاتف والبطاقات لأن كبار السن كتبوها بشرطات أو أقواس. اقبلها واحذفها بنفسك؛ فالرسالة الأوضح ما زالت تجبر الناس على الإعادة."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/usability-for-senior-citizens/","quote":"punished for entering hyphens or parentheses in telephone or credit-card numbers"},"scenario":{"en":"Mrs. Fatma typed her mobile number with dashes: 010-1234-5678. The app says \"Numbers only\".","ar":"كتبت السيدة فاطمة رقم موبايلها بشرطات: 010-1234-5678. فظهرت رسالة «أرقام فقط»."},"prompt":{"en":"Tap each option to see the change. Which one lets Mrs. Fatma book with the number exactly as she typed it?","ar":"اضغط على كل خيار لترى التغيير. أي خيار يسمح للسيدة فاطمة بالحجز بالرقم كما كتبته بالضبط؟"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Book a check-up","ar":"احجز موعد فحص"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Mobile number","ar":"رقم الموبايل"},"filled":true,"text":"010-1234-5678","tone":"bad","error":{"en":"Numbers only","ar":"أرقام فقط"}}]},"options":[{"id":"accept","text":{"en":"Accept the number, and let the app remove the dashes by itself","ar":"اقبل الرقم، واجعل التطبيق يحذف الشرطات بنفسه"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Book a check-up","ar":"احجز موعد فحص"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Mobile number","ar":"رقم الموبايل"},"filled":true,"text":"010-1234-5678"},{"kind":"small","color":"green","text":{"en":"✓ Saved","ar":"✓ تم الحفظ"},"gap":"xs"}]}},{"id":"clear","text":{"en":"Keep saying no, but with a clearer message","ar":"استمرّ في رفض الرقم، لكن برسالة أوضح"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Book a check-up","ar":"احجز موعد فحص"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Mobile number","ar":"رقم الموبايل"},"filled":true,"text":"010-1234-5678","tone":"bad","error":{"en":"Please type numbers only, with no dashes or spaces.","ar":"من فضلك اكتب الأرقام فقط، بدون شرطات أو مسافات."}}]}},{"id":"boxes","text":{"en":"Split the number into three boxes","ar":"قسّم الرقم إلى ثلاثة مربعات"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Book a check-up","ar":"احجز موعد فحص"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Mobile number","ar":"رقم الموبايل"}},{"kind":"row","gap":"xs","blocks":[{"kind":"field","text":"010"},{"kind":"field","text":"1234"},{"kind":"field","text":"5678"}]}]}}],"answer":["accept"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-009","when":["clear"],"feedback":{"en":"A clearer message still says no: Mrs. Fatma has to find the dashes and delete them one by one. The app can remove them in a second.","ar":"الرسالة الأوضح ما زالت ترفض الرقم: على السيدة فاطمة أن تجد الشرطات وتحذفها واحدة واحدة. والتطبيق يستطيع حذفها في ثانية."}},{"id":"MC-P05-009","when":["boxes"],"feedback":{"en":"Three boxes bring new problems: moving from box to box, and numbers that don't split the same way. The app can read the number the way she types it.","ar":"المربعات الثلاثة تأتي بمشكلات جديدة: الانتقال من مربع لآخر، وأرقام لا تنقسم بنفس الطريقة. والتطبيق يستطيع أن يقرأ الرقم كما تكتبه هي."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Is the number itself wrong, or only the way it's written?","ar":"هل الرقم نفسه خطأ، أم طريقة كتابته فقط؟"},{"en":"Who can remove the dashes more easily: Mrs. Fatma, or the app?","ar":"من يستطيع حذف الشرطات بسهولة أكبر: السيدة فاطمة، أم التطبيق؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Accept it as she typed it, and clean it up yourself.","ar":"صحيح. اقبله كما كتبته، ونظّفه أنت."},"explain":{"en":"Her number was right; only the dashes looked \"wrong\". Accept spaces and dashes, and remove them in the code. People shouldn't have to fix what the app can fix.","ar":"رقمها كان صحيحًا؛ والشرطات فقط بدت «خطأ». اقبل المسافات والشرطات، واحذفها في الكود. فلا ينبغي أن يُصلح الناس بأيديهم ما يستطيع التطبيق إصلاحه."},"speaker":"nour"},{"id":"S03","type":"card","part":"concept","icons":["person","type","form","size","eye"],"title":{"en":"Who gets stuck, and why","ar":"من يواجه مشكلات، ولماذا"},"body":{"en":"Our eyes, hands and memory change as we get older. By their 40s, many people already need bigger text. Older people make more typing mistakes, and find small controls hard to use.\n\n- **Accept what people type:** take dashes, spaces and real names as they are, and clean them up yourself.\n- **Let people type:** a box they can type in is better than a wheel or picker that's hard to control.\n- **Text that grows:** let text follow the phone's text size, and add a bigger-text button on reading screens.\n- **Dark mode is a choice:** some eyes read better on a dark screen, and others don't. Offer it; don't force it.","ar":"العين واليد والذاكرة تتغيّر مع العمر. ففي سن الأربعين، يحتاج كثير من الناس خطًا أكبر. وكبار السن يخطئون في الكتابة أكثر، ويصعب عليهم استخدام العناصر الصغيرة.\n\n- **اقبل ما يكتبه الناس:** خذ الشرطات والمسافات والأسماء الحقيقية كما هي، ونظّفها أنت.\n- **دع الناس يكتبون:** المربع الذي يكتبون فيه أفضل من عجلة أو أداة اختيار صعبة التحكّم.\n- **خط يكبر:** اجعل النص يتبع حجم الخط في الهاتف، وأضف زرًا لتكبير النص في شاشات القراءة.\n- **الوضع الداكن اختيار:** بعض العيون تقرأ أفضل على شاشة داكنة، وبعضها لا. اعرضه كاختيار؛ ولا تفرضه."}},{"id":"S04","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P05-U01-04","part":"guided","rules":["R06"],"value":{"en":"Usability for Older Adults (NN/g): many apps accepted input in only one form; a participant fighting a finicky time selector asked why she couldn't just type the time. A typed time field removes the fiddly control; a bigger wheel is still a wheel.","ar":"قابلية الاستخدام لكبار السن (NN/g): كثير من التطبيقات قبلت الإدخال بشكل واحد فقط؛ وسألت مشاركة تعبت مع أداة الوقت: لماذا لا أكتب الوقت ببساطة؟ مربع الوقت يُلغي الأداة الصعبة؛ والعجلة الأكبر تبقى عجلة."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/usability-for-senior-citizens/","quote":"Many sites and apps accepted user inputs in only one form"},"scenario":{"en":"Mrs. Fatma wants 10:30. The time wheel moves one minute each time she moves it a little. Her finger keeps going past 10:30.","ar":"تريد السيدة فاطمة الساعة 10:30. وعجلة الوقت تتحرّك دقيقة واحدة مع كل حركة صغيرة. وإصبعها يتجاوز 10:30 في كل مرة."},"prompt":{"en":"Tap each option to see the change. Which one lets Mrs. Fatma set 10:30 most easily?","ar":"اضغط على كل خيار لترى التغيير. أي خيار يجعل السيدة فاطمة تضبط 10:30 بأسهل شكل؟"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Book a check-up","ar":"احجز موعد فحص"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Time","ar":"الوقت"}},{"kind":"group","tone":"plain","gap":"xs","blocks":[{"kind":"small","color":"faint","text":"10:36"},{"kind":"text","weight":"bold","text":"10:37"},{"kind":"small","color":"faint","text":"10:38"}]}]},"options":[{"id":"big","text":{"en":"Keep the wheel, with bigger numbers","ar":"أبقِ العجلة، مع أرقام أكبر"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Book a check-up","ar":"احجز موعد فحص"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Time","ar":"الوقت"}},{"kind":"group","tone":"plain","gap":"xs","blocks":[{"kind":"text","color":"pale","px":20,"text":"10:36"},{"kind":"text","weight":"bold","px":26,"text":"10:37"},{"kind":"text","color":"pale","px":20,"text":"10:38"}]}]}},{"id":"type","text":{"en":"A box where she can type the time","ar":"مربع تكتب فيه الوقت"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Book a check-up","ar":"احجز موعد فحص"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Time","ar":"الوقت"},"filled":true,"text":"10:30","hint":{"en":"For example 10:30","ar":"مثلًا 10:30"}}]}},{"id":"keep","text":{"en":"Keep the wheel; it never gives a wrong time","ar":"أبقِ العجلة؛ فهي لا تسمح بوقت خطأ"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Book a check-up","ar":"احجز موعد فحص"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Time","ar":"الوقت"}},{"kind":"group","tone":"plain","gap":"xs","blocks":[{"kind":"small","color":"faint","text":"10:36"},{"kind":"text","weight":"bold","text":"10:37"},{"kind":"small","color":"faint","text":"10:38"}]}]}}],"answer":["type"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-010","when":["big","keep"],"feedback":{"en":"The wheel itself is the problem: she needs a very steady finger to stop at one exact minute out of sixty. Bigger numbers don't make her finger steadier.","ar":"العجلة نفسها هي المشكلة: تحتاج إصبعًا ثابتًا جدًا لتتوقّف عند دقيقة واحدة من ستين. والأرقام الأكبر لا تجعل الإصبع أثبت."}}],"hints":[{"en":"What does the wheel need from her hand?","ar":"ماذا تحتاج العجلة من يدها؟"},{"en":"Mrs. Fatma already knows the time she wants. Which option lets her just enter it?","ar":"السيدة فاطمة تعرف الوقت الذي تريده. أي خيار يسمح لها أن تُدخله ببساطة؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Let her type the time she already knows.","ar":"صحيح. دعها تكتب الوقت الذي تعرفه."},"explain":{"en":"A wheel or picker that needs exact moves needs a steady hand. A box she can type in only asks for the time she already knows.","ar":"العجلة أو أداة الاختيار التي تحتاج حركة دقيقة، تحتاج يدًا ثابتة. أما المربع فلا يطلب منها إلا الوقت الذي تعرفه."},"speaker":"nour"},{"id":"S05","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P05-U01-04","part":"guided","rules":["R06"],"value":{"en":"Inclusive Design (NN/g): last-name restrictions like character limits or no hyphens exclude real people. Arabic names in Latin letters often have spaces, hyphens and length.","ar":"التصميم الشامل (NN/g): قيود الاسم مثل حدّ عدد الحروف أو منع الشرطات تستبعد أشخاصًا حقيقيين. والأسماء العربية المكتوبة بحروف إنجليزية كثيرًا ما يكون فيها مسافات وشرطات وطول."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/inclusive-design/","quote":"Restrictions like character limits, no hyphens, or restrictions on names that are spelled the same as inappropriate English words can make some people feel excluded."},"scenario":{"en":"Our sign-up form asks for the name in English letters. It accepts letters only, up to 12. Mrs. Fatma's son wants to sign her up as \"Fatma Abdel-Aziz El-Sayed\", as it's written on her ID.","ar":"نموذج التسجيل عندنا يطلب الاسم بالحروف الإنجليزية. ويقبل الحروف فقط، وحتى 12 حرفًا. ويريد ابن السيدة فاطمة أن يسجّلها باسم «Fatma Abdel-Aziz El-Sayed»، كما هو مكتوب في بطاقة هويتها."},"prompt":{"en":"Tap each option to see the change. Which one lets him enter her name exactly as it is on her ID?","ar":"اضغط على كل خيار لترى التغيير. أي خيار يسمح له بكتابة اسمها كما هو في البطاقة بالضبط؟"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Book a check-up","ar":"احجز موعد فحص"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Full name","ar":"الاسم الكامل"},"filled":true,"text":"Fatma Abdel-","tone":"bad","error":{"en":"Letters only, up to 12","ar":"حروف فقط، حتى 12 حرفًا"}}]},"options":[{"id":"first","text":{"en":"Ask for the first name only","ar":"اطلب الاسم الأول فقط"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Book a check-up","ar":"احجز موعد فحص"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"First name","ar":"الاسم الأول"},"filled":true,"text":"Fatma"}]}},{"id":"rule","text":{"en":"Keep the rule, and explain it above the box","ar":"أبقِ القاعدة، واشرحها فوق المربع"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Book a check-up","ar":"احجز موعد فحص"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Full name","ar":"الاسم الكامل"},"hintFirst":true,"hint":{"en":"Letters only, no spaces or dashes, up to 12","ar":"حروف فقط، بدون مسافات أو شرطات، حتى 12 حرفًا"},"filled":true,"text":"FatmaAbdelAz"}]}},{"id":"allow","text":{"en":"Allow spaces, dashes, the ' sign and long names","ar":"اسمح بالمسافات والشرطات وعلامة ' والأسماء الطويلة"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Book a check-up","ar":"احجز موعد فحص"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Full name","ar":"الاسم الكامل"},"filled":true,"text":"Fatma Abdel-Aziz El-Sayed"}]}}],"answer":["allow"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-011","when":["rule"],"feedback":{"en":"Now the rule is clear, but he still can't enter her real name. Her clinic record won't match her ID.","ar":"صارت القاعدة واضحة، لكنه ما زال لا يستطيع كتابة اسمها الحقيقي. ولن يتطابق ملفها في العيادة مع بطاقتها."}},{"id":"MC-P05-011","when":["first"],"feedback":{"en":"The clinic needs her full name to find her file. Asking for less hides the problem; it doesn't fix the rule.","ar":"العيادة تحتاج اسمها الكامل لتجد ملفها. وطلب جزء من الاسم يُخفي المشكلة، ولا يُصلح القاعدة."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Is her name wrong, or is the rule wrong?","ar":"هل اسمها خطأ، أم القاعدة خطأ؟"},{"en":"In which option does the box show her full name?","ar":"في أي خيار يظهر اسمها الكامل في المربع؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Make the box fit real names.","ar":"صحيح. اجعل المربع يناسب الأسماء الحقيقية."},"explain":{"en":"Real names have spaces, dashes, the ' sign and many parts. A box that says no to them tells people: this app isn't for you.","ar":"الأسماء الحقيقية فيها مسافات وشرطات وعلامة ' وأجزاء كثيرة. والمربع الذي يرفضها يقول للناس: هذا التطبيق ليس لك."},"speaker":"nour"},{"id":"S06","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P05-U01-05","part":"guided","rules":["R06"],"value":{"en":"Accessible Design for Users With Disabilities (NN/g): never set text in absolute sizes; use relative sizes so text grows with the person's setting. People need bigger text long before old age.","ar":"التصميم المتاح لذوي الإعاقة (NN/g): لا تثبّت حجم الخط أبدًا؛ استخدم أحجامًا نسبية ليكبر الخط مع إعداد الشخص. والناس يحتاجون خطًا أكبر قبل الشيخوخة بكثير."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/accessible-design-for-users-with-disabilities/","quote":"never encode information with absolute font sizes but use relative sizes instead"},"scenario":{"en":"Mrs. Fatma set her phone's text size to the biggest. Our app doesn't follow that setting: its text always stays at 13 px.","ar":"ضبطت السيدة فاطمة حجم الخط في هاتفها على أكبر حجم. لكن تطبيقنا لا يتبع هذا الإعداد: الخط فيه يبقى دائمًا 13 بكسل."},"prompt":{"en":"Tap each option to see the change. Which one lets Mrs. Fatma read the text in the size she chose?","ar":"اضغط على كل خيار لترى التغيير. أي خيار يجعل السيدة فاطمة تقرأ النص بالحجم الذي اختارته؟"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"My visits","ar":"زياراتي"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","px":15,"text":{"en":"Your next visit","ar":"زيارتك القادمة"}},{"kind":"text","px":13,"text":{"en":"Sunday 10:30 with Dr. Mai. Please arrive 10 minutes early and bring your ID.","ar":"الأحد 10:30 مع د. مي. يُرجى الحضور قبل الموعد بعشر دقائق، مع بطاقة الهوية."},"gap":"xs"}]},"options":[{"id":"follow","text":{"en":"Let the text follow her phone's size, and let the screen grow with it","ar":"اجعل النص يتبع حجم الخط في هاتفها، ودع الشاشة تتّسع معه"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"My visits","ar":"زياراتي"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","px":24,"text":{"en":"Your next visit","ar":"زيارتك القادمة"}},{"kind":"text","px":21,"text":{"en":"Sunday 10:30 with Dr. Mai. Please arrive 10 minutes early and bring your ID.","ar":"الأحد 10:30 مع د. مي. يُرجى الحضور قبل الموعد بعشر دقائق، مع بطاقة الهوية."},"gap":"xs"}]}},{"id":"fixed","text":{"en":"Keep the text size fixed so the screen stays neat","ar":"أبقِ حجم الخط ثابتًا لتبقى الشاشة مرتّبة"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"My visits","ar":"زياراتي"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","px":15,"text":{"en":"Your next visit","ar":"زيارتك القادمة"}},{"kind":"text","px":13,"text":{"en":"Sunday 10:30 with Dr. Mai. Please arrive 10 minutes early and bring your ID.","ar":"الأحد 10:30 مع د. مي. يُرجى الحضور قبل الموعد بعشر دقائق، مع بطاقة الهوية."},"gap":"xs"}]}},{"id":"bold","text":{"en":"Keep 13 px, but make all the text bold","ar":"أبقِ 13 بكسل، لكن اجعل كل النص عريضًا (Bold)"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"My visits","ar":"زياراتي"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","px":15,"text":{"en":"Your next visit","ar":"زيارتك القادمة"}},{"kind":"text","px":13,"weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Sunday 10:30 with Dr. Mai. Please arrive 10 minutes early and bring your ID.","ar":"الأحد 10:30 مع د. مي. يُرجى الحضور قبل الموعد بعشر دقائق، مع بطاقة الهوية."},"gap":"xs"}]}}],"answer":["follow"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-012","when":["fixed","bold"],"feedback":{"en":"Mrs. Fatma already told her phone she needs bigger text. An app that ignores it cancels her choice. And bold text at 13 px is still small.","ar":"السيدة فاطمة أخبرت هاتفها أنها تحتاج خطًا أكبر. والتطبيق الذي يتجاهل ذلك يُلغي اختيارها. والخط العريض بحجم 13 بكسل يبقى صغيرًا."}}],"hints":[{"en":"What did Mrs. Fatma already change on her phone?","ar":"ماذا غيّرت السيدة فاطمة في هاتفها؟"},{"en":"Which option follows that setting?","ar":"أي خيار يتبع هذا الإعداد؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Her setting matters more than a neat screen.","ar":"صحيح. إعدادها أهم من شاشة مرتّبة."},"explain":{"en":"Don't fix the text size. Let it grow with the phone's setting, and design screens that can stretch. A neat screen that nobody can read helps no one.","ar":"لا تثبّت حجم الخط. دعه يكبر مع إعداد الهاتف، وصمّم شاشات تتّسع. فالشاشة المرتّبة التي لا يستطيع أحد قراءتها لا تفيد أحدًا."},"speaker":"nour"},{"id":"S07","type":"compare","skill":"SK-P05-U01-05","part":"contrast","confidence":true,"rules":["R11"],"value":{"en":"Contrast: dark mode can help some readers, but not everyone. Inclusive Design (NN/g): for older eyes with cataracts, consider (but don't enforce) a dark-mode option, and use the phone's dark-mode setting.","ar":"مقارنة: الوضع الداكن قد يساعد بعض القرّاء، لا الجميع. التصميم الشامل (NN/g): لكبار السن المصابين بالمياه البيضاء، فكّر في خيار للوضع الداكن (دون فرضه)، واستفد من إعداد الوضع الداكن في الهاتف."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/inclusive-design/","quote":"consider (but do not enforce) a dark-mode option for your UIs"},"scenario":{"en":"Some older patients say our white screens are hard to read. Others read them easily. My team has two ideas.","ar":"بعض المرضى كبار السن يقولون إن شاشاتنا البيضاء صعبة القراءة. وآخرون يقرؤونها بسهولة. وعند فريقي فكرتان."},"prompt":{"en":"Which idea works for both groups of patients?","ar":"أي فكرة تناسب المجموعتين من المرضى؟"},"a":{"label":{"en":"A: Make the whole app dark, for everyone","ar":"A: نجعل التطبيق كله داكنًا، للجميع"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"theme":"dark","appbar":{"logo":true},"tabbar":{"active":0,"items":[{"icon":"house","text":{"en":"Home","ar":"الرئيسية"}},{"icon":"calendar","text":{"en":"Visits","ar":"زياراتي"}},{"icon":"user","text":{"en":"Account","ar":"حسابي"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"banner","tone":"info","icon":"moon","text":{"en":"New look: the app is now dark for everyone.","ar":"شكل جديد: التطبيق الآن داكن للجميع."}},{"kind":"card","gap":"m","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Your next visit","ar":"زيارتك القادمة"}},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Sunday 10:30 · Dr. Mai Hassan","ar":"الأحد 10:30 · د. مي حسن"},"gap":"xs"}]}]}},"b":{"label":{"en":"B: Let each person choose light, dark, or like their phone","ar":"B: كل شخص يختار: فاتح، أو داكن، أو حسب إعداد هاتفه"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Display","ar":"العرض"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Theme","ar":"المظهر"}},{"kind":"segmented","options":[{"en":"Light","ar":"فاتح"},{"en":"Dark","ar":"داكن"},{"en":"Like my phone","ar":"حسب الهاتف"}],"value":2,"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"text-aa","text":{"en":"Text size","ar":"حجم الخط"},"value":{"en":"Like my phone","ar":"حسب الهاتف"},"chevron":true,"gap":"m"}]}},"answer":"b","reason":{"prompt":{"en":"Why is B better for older patients?","ar":"لماذا B أفضل للمرضى كبار السن؟"},"options":[{"id":"battery","text":{"en":"Dark screens use less battery","ar":"الشاشات الداكنة تستهلك بطارية أقل"}},{"id":"choice","text":{"en":"Dark helps some eyes and not others, so each person picks","ar":"الداكن يساعد بعض العيون دون غيرها، فيختار كل شخص ما يناسبه"}},{"id":"light","text":{"en":"Light screens are always easier to read","ar":"الشاشات الفاتحة أسهل في القراءة دائمًا"}}],"answer":["choice"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-013","when":["battery","light"],"feedback":{"en":"Neither is the reason. Some eyes, like eyes with cataracts, read better on dark; many others read better on light. So let each person choose, starting from their phone's setting.","ar":"لا هذا ولا ذاك هو السبب. بعض العيون، مثل المصابة بالمياه البيضاء، تقرأ أفضل على الداكن؛ وعيون كثيرة غيرها تقرأ أفضل على الفاتح. لذلك دع كل شخص يختار، والبداية من إعداد هاتفه."}}]},"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-013","when":["a"],"feedback":{"en":"Making everything dark swaps one problem for another: patients who read better on white now have trouble. Offer dark as a choice.","ar":"جعل كل شيء داكنًا يستبدل مشكلة بمشكلة: فالمرضى الذين يقرؤون أفضل على الأبيض سيتعبون الآن. اعرض الداكن كاختيار."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Do all older patients find white screens hard to read?","ar":"هل كل المرضى كبار السن يجدون الشاشات البيضاء صعبة القراءة؟"},{"en":"Which version still works for a patient who reads better on white?","ar":"أي نسخة ما زالت تناسب مريضًا يقرأ أفضل على الأبيض؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Offer dark mode; don't force it.","ar":"صحيح. اعرض الوضع الداكن كاختيار؛ ولا تفرضه."},"explain":{"en":"Different eyes need different screens. Start from the phone's own setting, and let people switch, so nobody is stuck with the wrong one.","ar":"العيون المختلفة تحتاج شاشات مختلفة. ابدأ من إعداد الهاتف نفسه، ودع الناس يغيّرون، حتى لا يُجبَر أحد على الشاشة التي لا تناسبه."},"speaker":"nour"},{"id":"S08","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P05-U01-05","part":"independent","speaker":"youssef","rules":["R14"],"value":{"en":"New case. Inclusive Design (NN/g): the most common complaint from older users was text that's hard to read; use legible fonts and offer a button to increase the font size. Lighter text makes it worse.","ar":"حالة جديدة. التصميم الشامل (NN/g): أكثر شكوى من كبار السن كانت صعوبة قراءة النص؛ استخدم خطوطًا واضحة وأضف زرًا لتكبير الخط. والنص الأفتح يزيد المشكلة."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/inclusive-design/","quote":"offer a button for users to increase the font size"},"scenario":{"en":"My spice shop's app has long recipe pages. Many of my customers are older, and some say the recipes are hard to read.","ar":"تطبيق متجر التوابل الذي أملكه فيه صفحات وصفات طويلة. وكثير من عملائي كبار في السن، وبعضهم يقول إن الوصفات صعبة القراءة."},"prompt":{"en":"Tap each option to see the change. Which one makes the recipe easier for them to read?","ar":"اضغط على كل خيار لترى التغيير. أي خيار يجعل قراءة الوصفة أسهل عليهم؟"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"app":{"name":{"en":"Bahar Spices","ar":"توابل بهار"},"color":"#B45309","icon":"pepper","domain":"bahar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Recipes","ar":"الوصفات"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Koshari spice mix","ar":"خلطة توابل الكشري"}},{"kind":"text","px":13,"text":{"en":"Toast the cumin and coriander for two minutes, then grind them with…","ar":"حمّص الكمّون والكزبرة لدقيقتين، ثم اطحنهما مع…"},"gap":"s"}]},"options":[{"id":"light","text":{"en":"Make the text a lighter grey, for a softer look","ar":"اجعل لون النص رماديًا أفتح، ليبدو أهدأ"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"name":{"en":"Bahar Spices","ar":"توابل بهار"},"color":"#B45309","icon":"pepper","domain":"bahar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Recipes","ar":"الوصفات"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Koshari spice mix","ar":"خلطة توابل الكشري"}},{"kind":"text","px":13,"color":"pale","text":{"en":"Toast the cumin and coriander for two minutes, then grind them with…","ar":"حمّص الكمّون والكزبرة لدقيقتين، ثم اطحنهما مع…"},"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"keep","text":{"en":"Change nothing; it's the same size as the rest of the app","ar":"لا تغيّر شيئًا؛ فهو بنفس حجم باقي النصوص في التطبيق"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"name":{"en":"Bahar Spices","ar":"توابل بهار"},"color":"#B45309","icon":"pepper","domain":"bahar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Recipes","ar":"الوصفات"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Koshari spice mix","ar":"خلطة توابل الكشري"}},{"kind":"text","px":13,"text":{"en":"Toast the cumin and coriander for two minutes, then grind them with…","ar":"حمّص الكمّون والكزبرة لدقيقتين، ثم اطحنهما مع…"},"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"button","text":{"en":"Add an \"A A\" button that makes the recipe text bigger","ar":"أضف زر «A A» يكبّر نص الوصفة"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"name":{"en":"Bahar Spices","ar":"توابل بهار"},"color":"#B45309","icon":"pepper","domain":"bahar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Recipes","ar":"الوصفات"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"row","blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Koshari spice mix","ar":"خلطة توابل الكشري"}},{"kind":"chip","text":"A A"}]},{"kind":"text","px":20,"text":{"en":"Toast the cumin and coriander for two minutes, then grind them with…","ar":"حمّص الكمّون والكزبرة لدقيقتين، ثم اطحنهما مع…"},"gap":"s"}]}}],"answer":["button"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-012","when":["keep"],"feedback":{"en":"Being the same as the rest of the app doesn't help: customers already say this text is hard to read. On long reading screens, give them a way to make it bigger.","ar":"كونه بنفس حجم باقي التطبيق لا يفيد: فالعملاء يقولون إن هذا النص صعب القراءة. وفي شاشات القراءة الطويلة، أعطهم طريقة لتكبيره."}},{"id":"MC-P05-012","when":["light"],"feedback":{"en":"Lighter grey is closer to the white background, so the text gets harder to read, not easier.","ar":"الرمادي الأفتح أقرب إلى لون الخلفية البيضاء، فيصبح النص أصعب في القراءة، لا أسهل."}}],"hints":[{"en":"What exactly do customers say is wrong with the recipes?","ar":"ما المشكلة التي يقولها العملاء عن الوصفات بالضبط؟"},{"en":"Which option makes the words themselves bigger?","ar":"أي خيار يكبّر الكلمات نفسها؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Give readers a button to make text bigger.","ar":"صحيح. أعطِ القرّاء زرًا لتكبير النص."},"explain":{"en":"On long reading screens, a text-size button people can see lets anyone make the words bigger with one tap, and the lines still fit the screen.","ar":"في شاشات القراءة الطويلة، زر حجم الخط الظاهر يسمح لأي شخص بتكبير الكلمات بضغطة واحدة، وتبقى الأسطر داخل الشاشة."}},{"id":"S09","type":"card","part":"recap","icons":["type","form","size","eye"],"title":{"en":"What you did","ar":"ماذا تعلّمت"},"body":{"en":"- **Phone numbers:** you accepted dashes and let the app remove them.\n- **Time:** you let Mrs. Fatma type 10:30 instead of fighting a wheel.\n- **Names:** you let the box take real names with dashes and spaces.\n- **Text size:** you made text follow the phone's setting, and gave readers a bigger-text button.\n- **Dark mode:** you offered it as a choice instead of forcing it.\n\nNext: the skill check.","ar":"- **أرقام الهاتف:** قبلت الشرطات، وجعلت التطبيق يحذفها بنفسه.\n- **الوقت:** تركت السيدة فاطمة تكتب 10:30 بدل التعب مع العجلة.\n- **الأسماء:** جعلت المربع يقبل الأسماء الحقيقية بشرطاتها ومسافاتها.\n- **حجم الخط:** جعلت النص يتبع إعداد الهاتف، وأعطيت القرّاء زرًا لتكبيره.\n- **الوضع الداكن:** عرضته كاختيار، ولم تفرضه.\n\nالتالي: اختبار المهارة."}}]}$uxg$::jsonb),
  ($uxg$P05-U01-L04$uxg$, $uxg$e22db3d9e72907c50b1abbf65a93431860cdc593af3a22a4e3dd3b819c75894b$uxg$, $uxg${"id":"P05-U01-L04","mode":"check","minutes":6,"title":{"en":"Skill check: see the barriers","ar":"اختبار المهارة: اكتشف ما يوقف المستخدمين"},"summary":{"en":"Decide what a gym's booking app must change before launch, on your own.","ar":"قرّر ما يجب تغييره في تطبيق حجز لنادٍ رياضي قبل إطلاقه، بنفسك."},"speaker":"hana","steps":[{"id":"S01","type":"card","part":"hook","title":{"en":"Hana's new gym app","ar":"تطبيق نادي هناء الجديد"},"body":{"en":"My gym has a new app where members book classes. Rasha, one of our members, is blind and uses a screen reader. Some of our members are over 60.\n\nYour job: help me decide what's ready, what to change, and how to test it.\n\nThis is a skill check: there are no hints, and you'll see your result at the end.","ar":"عندنا في النادي الذي أملكه تطبيق جديد، يحجز فيه الأعضاء الحصص. رشا إحدى عضواتنا، وهي كفيفة وتستخدم قارئ الشاشة. وبعض أعضائنا عمرهم فوق الستين.\n\nمهمّتك: ساعدني أن أقرّر ما الجاهز، وما الذي يجب تغييره، وكيف نختبره.\n\nهذا اختبار مهارة: لا توجد تلميحات، وسترى نتيجتك في النهاية."},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Book a class","ar":"احجز حصة"},"back":true},"tabbar":{"active":1,"items":[{"icon":"house","text":{"en":"Home","ar":"الرئيسية"}},{"icon":"calendar-check","text":{"en":"Classes","ar":"الحصص"}},{"icon":"user","text":{"en":"Account","ar":"حسابي"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"card","art":"gym","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Yoga · Sunday 8:00","ar":"يوغا · الأحد 8:00"}},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Coach Laila · 6 places left","ar":"المدرّبة ليلى · 6 أماكن متبقية"},"gap":"xs"}]},{"kind":"row","gap":"xs","blocks":[{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"1 of 12","ar":"1 من 12"}},{"kind":"button","style":"text","icon":"caret-right","text":{"en":"Next","ar":"التالي"}}]},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Mobile number","ar":"رقم الموبايل"},"text":{"en":"11 digits","ar":"11 رقمًا"},"icon":"phone","gap":"m"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Book","ar":"احجز"}}]}},{"id":"S02","type":"choose","skill":"SK-P05-U01-01","part":"check","rules":["R19"],"value":{"en":"Skill check. Accessibility Is Not Enough (NN/g): accessibility is necessary but not nearly sufficient; the focus is how well the design helps disabled users do typical tasks. 25 minutes against 2 means it isn't ready.","ar":"اختبار مهارة. الإتاحة وحدها لا تكفي (NN/g): الإتاحة ضرورية لكنها بعيدة عن الكفاية؛ والمهم هو مدى مساعدة التصميم لذوي الإعاقة في المهام العادية. و25 دقيقة مقابل دقيقتين تعني أنه غير جاهز."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/accessibility-is-not-enough/","quote":"Accessibility is a necessary, but not nearly sufficient, objective."},"scenario":{"en":"Our developer checked the app against an accessibility checklist, and every point is green. Then we tried it with Rasha. She needed 25 minutes to book a class with her screen reader. Other members needed about 2 minutes.","ar":"فحص مطوّرنا التطبيق بـ Checklist للـ Accessibility (مناسبة التطبيق لذوي الإعاقة)، وكل البنود خضراء. ثم جرّبناه مع رشا، فاحتاجت 25 دقيقة لتحجز حصة بقارئ الشاشة، واحتاج باقي الأعضاء نحو دقيقتين."},"prompt":{"en":"The app is ready to go live next week. What should we do?","ar":"من المقرّر نشر التطبيق الأسبوع القادم. ماذا نفعل؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"mudawwana","name":{"en":"Mudawwana","ar":"مدوّنة"},"color":"#EAB308","icon":"note-pencil","domain":"mudawwana.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Booking test · Rasha","ar":"اختبار الحجز · رشا"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"badge","tone":"good","icon":"check-circle","text":{"en":"Checklist: 40 of 40 green","ar":"الـ Checklist: 40 بندًا من 40، كلها خضراء"}},{"kind":"table","gap":"m","head":[{"en":"Member","ar":"العضو"},{"en":"Time to book a class","ar":"وقت حجز حصة"}],"rows":[[{"en":"Rasha (screen reader)","ar":"رشا (قارئ الشاشة)"},{"en":"25 min","ar":"25 دقيقة"}],[{"en":"Other members","ar":"باقي الأعضاء"},{"en":"about 2 min","ar":"حوالي دقيقتين"}]]},{"kind":"quote","text":{"en":"I swiped through every class card to find Thursday.","ar":"مررت على كل بطاقات الحصص لأصل إلى الخميس."},"name":{"en":"Rasha","ar":"رشا"},"gap":"m"}]},"options":[{"id":"phone","text":{"en":"Go live, and add a phone line so screen reader users can book by phone","ar":"ننشره، ونضيف رقم هاتف ليحجز مستخدمو قارئ الشاشة بالهاتف"}},{"id":"fix","text":{"en":"Fix what slowed Rasha down, and ask her to try again before going live","ar":"نُصلح ما أبطأ رشا، ونطلب منها أن تجرّب مرة أخرى قبل النشر"}},{"id":"launch","text":{"en":"Go live; every point on the checklist is green","ar":"ننشره؛ فكل بنود الـ Checklist خضراء"}}],"answer":["fix"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-001","when":["launch"],"feedback":{"en":"Green points don't mean Rasha can book easily: she needed more than ten times as long as others. The task decides, not the checklist.","ar":"البنود الخضراء لا تعني أن رشا تحجز بسهولة: فقد احتاجت أكثر من عشرة أضعاف وقت غيرها. العبرة بإنجاز المهمة، لا بالـ Checklist."}},{"id":"MC-P05-003","when":["phone"],"feedback":{"en":"A phone line is a separate, slower way. Rasha should be able to book in the app, like everyone else.","ar":"رقم الهاتف طريقة منفصلة وأبطأ. ويجب أن تستطيع رشا الحجز في التطبيق، مثل الجميع."}}],"explain":{"en":"From Lesson 1: an app works for disabled people when they finish the real task easily and fast, with the same features.","ar":"من الدرس 1: التطبيق يناسب ذوي الإعاقة حين يُنهون المهمة الحقيقية بسهولة وسرعة، وبنفس الميزات."},"speaker":"hana"},{"id":"S03","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P05-U01-03","part":"check","rules":["R19"],"value":{"en":"Skill check. Direct vs. sequential access (NN/g): carousels make people go through every item one by one to reach the last. Twelve classes need a list people can jump through.","ar":"اختبار مهارة. الوصول المباشر مقابل المتسلسل (NN/g): الـ Carousel يجبر الناس على المرور بكل عنصر واحدًا واحدًا ليصلوا إلى الأخير. و12 حصة تحتاج قائمة يقفز فيها الناس."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/direct-vs-sequential-access/","quote":"users must go through all the items in the carousel one by one in order to get to the last one"},"scenario":{"en":"This week's 12 classes are in a carousel, one card at a time. Rasha wants the swimming class on Thursday. It's card 10.","ar":"حصص هذا الأسبوع، وعددها 12، موجودة في Carousel، بطاقة واحدة في كل مرة. وتريد رشا حصة السباحة يوم الخميس، وهي البطاقة رقم 10."},"prompt":{"en":"Tap each option to see the change. Which one gets Rasha to the swimming class fastest?","ar":"اضغط على كل خيار لترى التغيير. أي خيار يُوصل رشا إلى حصة السباحة بأسرع شكل؟"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Book a class","ar":"احجز حصة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"gym","size":"s","text":{"en":"Yoga · Sunday 8:00","ar":"يوغا · الأحد 8:00"}},{"kind":"row","gap":"xs","blocks":[{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"1 / 12","ar":"1 من 12"}},{"kind":"button","style":"plain","text":{"en":"Next ›","ar":"التالي ‹"}}]}]},"options":[{"id":"list","text":{"en":"A list by day, where each class is a link","ar":"قائمة مقسّمة حسب اليوم، وكل حصة فيها رابط"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Book a class","ar":"احجز حصة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Sunday","ar":"الأحد"}},{"kind":"link","text":{"en":"Yoga · 8:00","ar":"يوغا · 8:00"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"link","text":{"en":"Spinning · 18:00","ar":"دراجات ثابتة · 18:00"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"… Monday to Wednesday …","ar":"… من الاثنين إلى الأربعاء …"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Thursday","ar":"الخميس"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"link","text":{"en":"Swimming · 17:00","ar":"سباحة · 17:00"},"gap":"xs"}]}},{"id":"dots","text":{"en":"Add dots under the carousel to show how many cards there are","ar":"أضف نقاطًا تحت الـ Carousel توضّح عدد البطاقات"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Book a class","ar":"احجز حصة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"gym","size":"s","text":{"en":"Yoga · Sunday 8:00","ar":"يوغا · الأحد 8:00"}},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":"● ○ ○ ○ ○ ○ ○ ○ ○ ○ ○ ○","gap":"xs"}]}},{"id":"auto","text":{"en":"Let the cards move by themselves every 4 seconds","ar":"اجعل البطاقات تتحرّك وحدها كل 4 ثوانٍ"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Book a class","ar":"احجز حصة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"gym","size":"s","text":{"en":"Yoga · Sunday 8:00","ar":"يوغا · الأحد 8:00"}},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"1 / 12 · next in 4 s","ar":"1 من 12 · التالي بعد 4 ثوانٍ"},"gap":"xs"}]}}],"answer":["list"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-006","when":["dots","auto"],"feedback":{"en":"It's still one class at a time: Rasha goes through 9 cards before swimming. Show the classes as links she can jump to.","ar":"ما زال يعرض حصة واحدة في كل مرة: تمرّ رشا على 9 بطاقات قبل السباحة. اعرض الحصص كروابط توصلها إلى حصتها مباشرة."}}],"explain":{"en":"From Lesson 2: let people jump straight to what they want. A list by day lets anyone go straight to their class.","ar":"من الدرس 2: دع الناس يصلون مباشرة إلى ما يريدون. والقائمة المقسّمة حسب اليوم تسمح لأي شخص بالذهاب مباشرة إلى حصته."},"speaker":"hana"},{"id":"S04","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P05-U01-04","part":"check","rules":["R19"],"value":{"en":"Skill check. Usability for Older Adults (NN/g): users were punished for typing dashes or brackets in phone numbers. Accept the country code and spaces, and clean the number yourself.","ar":"اختبار مهارة. قابلية الاستخدام لكبار السن (NN/g): رُفضت أرقام الهاتف لأن أصحابها كتبوها بشرطات أو أقواس. اقبل كود الدولة والمسافات، ونظّف الرقم بنفسك."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/usability-for-senior-citizens/","quote":"punished for entering hyphens or parentheses in telephone or credit-card numbers"},"scenario":{"en":"Mr. Hamdy is 66. He typed his mobile number the way he always writes it: with +20 and spaces. The app says \"Enter 11 digits\".","ar":"الأستاذ حمدي عمره 66 سنة. كتب رقم موبايله كما يكتبه دائمًا: مع ⁦+20⁩ ومسافات. فظهرت رسالة «أدخل 11 رقمًا»."},"prompt":{"en":"Tap each option to see the change. Which one lets Mr. Hamdy sign up with the number as he typed it?","ar":"اضغط على كل خيار لترى التغيير. أي خيار يسمح للأستاذ حمدي بالتسجيل بالرقم كما كتبه؟"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Your details","ar":"بياناتك"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Mobile number","ar":"رقم الموبايل"},"filled":true,"text":"+20 100 123 4567","tone":"bad","error":{"en":"Enter 11 digits","ar":"أدخل 11 رقمًا"}}]},"options":[{"id":"accept","text":{"en":"Accept +20 and spaces, and let the app turn it into the 11 digits","ar":"اقبل ⁦+20⁩ والمسافات، واجعل التطبيق يحوّله إلى الـ 11 رقمًا بنفسه"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Your details","ar":"بياناتك"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Mobile number","ar":"رقم الموبايل"},"filled":true,"text":"+20 100 123 4567"},{"kind":"small","color":"green","text":{"en":"✓ Saved","ar":"✓ تم الحفظ"},"gap":"xs"}]}},{"id":"example","text":{"en":"Keep the rule, and show an example: 01001234567","ar":"أبقِ القاعدة، واعرض مثالًا: 01001234567"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Your details","ar":"بياناتك"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Mobile number","ar":"رقم الموبايل"},"hintFirst":true,"hint":{"en":"For example 01001234567","ar":"مثلًا 01001234567"},"filled":true,"text":"+20 100 123 4567","tone":"bad","error":{"en":"Enter 11 digits","ar":"أدخل 11 رقمًا"}}]}},{"id":"block","text":{"en":"Stop the keyboard from typing + and spaces at all","ar":"امنع لوحة المفاتيح من كتابة ⁦+⁩ والمسافات نهائيًا"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Your details","ar":"بياناتك"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Mobile number","ar":"رقم الموبايل"},"filled":true,"text":"201001234567","tone":"bad","error":{"en":"Enter 11 digits","ar":"أدخل 11 رقمًا"}}]}}],"answer":["accept"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-009","when":["example","block"],"feedback":{"en":"His number is right; only the way it's written is different. The app can drop +20 and the spaces by itself, instead of making him type it again.","ar":"رقمه صحيح؛ وطريقة كتابته فقط هي المختلفة. والتطبيق يستطيع حذف ⁦+20⁩ والمسافات بنفسه، بدل أن يجعله يكتبه من جديد."}}],"explain":{"en":"From Lesson 3: accept what people type, the way they type it, and clean it up in the code.","ar":"من الدرس 3: اقبل ما يكتبه الناس كما يكتبونه، ونظّفه في الكود."},"speaker":"hana"},{"id":"S05","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P05-U01-05","part":"check","rules":["R19"],"value":{"en":"Skill check. Usability for Older Adults (NN/g): people in their 40s already need somewhat larger text than designers in their 20s. A schedule locked at a small size ignores members who set bigger text on their phones.","ar":"اختبار مهارة. قابلية الاستخدام لكبار السن (NN/g): الناس في الأربعينيات يحتاجون خطًا أكبر قليلًا مما يحتاجه المصممون في العشرينيات. والجدول المثبّت على خط صغير يتجاهل الأعضاء الذين اختاروا خطًا أكبر في هواتفهم."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/usability-for-senior-citizens/","quote":"people in their 40s already have sufficiently reduced eyesight to require somewhat larger font sizes than eagle-eyed designers in their 20s"},"scenario":{"en":"Our designers fixed the weekly schedule at 12 px, so the whole week fits on one screen. Many members have set bigger text on their phones.","ar":"ثبّت المصممون عندنا خط جدول الأسبوع على 12 بكسل، ليظهر الأسبوع كله في شاشة واحدة. وكثير من الأعضاء اختاروا خطًا أكبر في هواتفهم."},"prompt":{"en":"Tap each option to see the change. Which one lets members read the schedule in the size they chose?","ar":"اضغط على كل خيار لترى التغيير. أي خيار يجعل الأعضاء يقرؤون الجدول بحجم الخط الذي اختاروه؟"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Timetable","ar":"جدول الحصص"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","px":14,"text":{"en":"This week","ar":"هذا الأسبوع"}},{"kind":"text","px":12,"text":{"en":"Sun 8:00 Yoga · Mon 18:00 Spinning · Tue 7:00 Pilates · Wed 19:00 Boxing · Thu 17:00 Swimming","ar":"الأحد 8:00 يوغا · الاثنين 18:00 دراجات ثابتة · الثلاثاء 7:00 بيلاتس · الأربعاء 19:00 ملاكمة · الخميس 17:00 سباحة"},"gap":"xs"}]},"options":[{"id":"keep","text":{"en":"Keep it at 12 px, so the week fits on one screen","ar":"أبقِه على 12 بكسل، ليظهر الأسبوع في شاشة واحدة"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Timetable","ar":"جدول الحصص"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","px":14,"text":{"en":"This week","ar":"هذا الأسبوع"}},{"kind":"text","px":12,"text":{"en":"Sun 8:00 Yoga · Mon 18:00 Spinning · Tue 7:00 Pilates · Wed 19:00 Boxing · Thu 17:00 Swimming","ar":"الأحد 8:00 يوغا · الاثنين 18:00 دراجات ثابتة · الثلاثاء 7:00 بيلاتس · الأربعاء 19:00 ملاكمة · الخميس 17:00 سباحة"},"gap":"xs"}]}},{"id":"follow","text":{"en":"Let it follow each phone's text size, and let people scroll down","ar":"اجعله يتبع حجم الخط في كل هاتف، ودع الناس يمرّرون للأسفل"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Timetable","ar":"جدول الحصص"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","px":22,"text":{"en":"This week","ar":"هذا الأسبوع"}},{"kind":"text","px":19,"text":{"en":"Sun 8:00 Yoga","ar":"الأحد 8:00 يوغا"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"text","px":19,"text":{"en":"Mon 18:00 Spinning","ar":"الاثنين 18:00 دراجات ثابتة"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"text","px":19,"text":{"en":"Tue 7:00 Pilates","ar":"الثلاثاء 7:00 بيلاتس"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Scroll for more","ar":"مرّر لترى المزيد"},"gap":"xs"}]}},{"id":"caps","text":{"en":"Keep 12 px, and write the class names in bold capitals","ar":"أبقِ 12 بكسل، واكتب أسماء الحصص بخط عريض (Bold)"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Timetable","ar":"جدول الحصص"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","px":14,"text":{"en":"This week","ar":"هذا الأسبوع"}},{"kind":"text","px":12,"weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Sun 8:00 YOGA · Mon 18:00 SPINNING · Tue 7:00 PILATES · Wed 19:00 BOXING · Thu 17:00 SWIMMING","ar":"الأحد 8:00 يوغا · الاثنين 18:00 دراجات ثابتة · الثلاثاء 7:00 بيلاتس · الأربعاء 19:00 ملاكمة · الخميس 17:00 سباحة"},"gap":"xs"}]}}],"answer":["follow"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-012","when":["keep","caps"],"feedback":{"en":"Members already asked their phones for bigger text. A fixed size ignores that, and the text stays small. Let it grow, and let people scroll.","ar":"الأعضاء طلبوا من هواتفهم خطًا أكبر. والحجم الثابت يتجاهل ذلك، فيبقى الخط صغيرًا. دعه يكبر، ودع الناس يمرّرون."}}],"explain":{"en":"From Lesson 3: text should follow the size the person chose, even if the screen has to get longer.","ar":"من الدرس 3: يجب أن يتبع النص حجم الخط الذي اختاره الشخص، حتى لو أصبحت الشاشة أطول."},"speaker":"hana"},{"id":"S06","type":"choose","skill":"SK-P05-U01-02","part":"check","rules":["R19"],"value":{"en":"Skill check. Challenges for Screen-Reader Users on Mobile (NN/g): there's no substitute for testing with real users who have disabilities, on the tools they use every day.","ar":"اختبار مهارة. تحديات مستخدمي قارئ الشاشة على الهاتف (NN/g): لا بديل عن الاختبار مع مستخدمين حقيقيين من ذوي الإعاقة، بالأدوات التي يستخدمونها كل يوم."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/screen-reader-users-on-mobile/","quote":"there is no substitute for testing it with real users that have disabilities"},"scenario":{"en":"We fixed the problems. Before the app goes live, we want to test booking one more time.","ar":"أصلحنا المشكلات. وقبل نشر التطبيق، نريد أن نختبر الحجز مرة أخيرة."},"prompt":{"en":"Which test will show us what still stops members from booking?","ar":"أي اختبار سيكشف لنا ما لا يزال يمنع الأعضاء من الحجز؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"mudawwana","name":{"en":"Mudawwana","ar":"مدوّنة"},"color":"#EAB308","icon":"note-pencil","domain":"mudawwana.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Final booking test","ar":"اختبار الحجز الأخير"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Fixed this week","ar":"ما أصلحناه هذا الأسبوع"}},{"kind":"list","style":"check","gap":"s","items":[{"en":"Classes listed by day","ar":"الحصص مرتّبة حسب اليوم"},{"en":"Phone number accepts +20 and spaces","ar":"رقم الهاتف يقبل ⁦+20⁩ والمسافات"},{"en":"Timetable follows the phone's text size","ar":"الجدول يتبع حجم الخط في الهاتف"}]},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Next: one more test before going live","ar":"التالي: اختبار أخير قبل النشر"},"gap":"m"}]},"options":[{"id":"team","text":{"en":"Our team closes their eyes and books with the screen reader on the office phone","ar":"يغمض أعضاء فريقنا أعينهم، ويحجزون بقارئ الشاشة على هاتف المكتب"}},{"id":"tool","text":{"en":"Run a tool that checks every screen against accessibility rules automatically","ar":"نشغّل أداة تفحص كل الشاشات بقواعد الـ Accessibility تلقائيًا"}},{"id":"members","text":{"en":"Rasha and other members who use screen readers or bigger text book a class on their own phones","ar":"تحجز رشا وأعضاء آخرون، ممن يستخدمون قارئ الشاشة أو الخط الكبير، حصة على هواتفهم"}}],"answer":["members"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-005","when":["team"],"feedback":{"en":"Our team doesn't use screen readers every day, and the office phone isn't set up like members' phones. We'd mostly find out how new we are to screen readers.","ar":"فريقنا لا يستخدم قارئ الشاشة كل يوم، وهاتف المكتب ليس مضبوطًا مثل هواتف الأعضاء. وسنكتشف غالبًا قلّة خبرتنا نحن بقارئ الشاشة."}},{"id":"MC-P05-001","when":["tool"],"feedback":{"en":"An automatic tool checks rules, like the checklist that was already green. It can't tell how long Rasha needs to book.","ar":"الأداة التلقائية تفحص القواعد، مثل الـ Checklist الذي كان أخضر من قبل. ولا تستطيع أن تعرف كم دقيقة تحتاج رشا لتحجز."}}],"explain":{"en":"From Lesson 1: test with real users, on their own phones and settings.","ar":"من الدرس 1: اختبر مع مستخدمين حقيقيين، على هواتفهم وبإعداداتهم."},"speaker":"hana"}]}$uxg$::jsonb),
  ($uxg$P05-U02-L01$uxg$, $uxg$dc740a4bd0b1a25177efca20d6212529d8f12b04f6798093f5f5228a6d3982fb$uxg$, $uxg${"id":"P05-U02-L01","mode":"lesson","minutes":7,"title":{"en":"Light grey isn't calm, it's hard to read","ar":"الرمادي الفاتح ليس هادئًا، بل صعب القراءة"},"summary":{"en":"Make pale text readable on a product page, without making the page louder.","ar":"اجعل النص الباهت مقروءًا في صفحة منتج، دون أن تصبح الصفحة مزدحمة."},"speaker":"mona","review_labels":{"MC-P05-014":{"en":"Pale text is hard to read, whatever the style","ar":"النص الباهت صعب القراءة، مهما كان شكله"},"MC-P05-015":{"en":"Only large or bold text may go down to 3:1","ar":"النص الكبير أو العريض فقط يكفيه 3:1"},"MC-P05-016":{"en":"Grey makes working things look disabled","ar":"الرمادي يجعل العنصر الذي يعمل يبدو معطّلًا"},"MC-P05-017":{"en":"Make it smaller or move it, don't fade it","ar":"صغّره أو انقله، ولا تجعله باهتًا"}},"steps":[{"id":"S01","type":"card","part":"hook","title":{"en":"The calm new product page","ar":"صفحة المنتج الجديدة الهادئة"},"body":{"en":"My team redesigned the product page of a home-goods shop. To make it look calm, most of the text is now light grey.\n\nSince then, customers keep calling to ask about details that are already on the page.","ar":"أعاد فريقي تصميم صفحة المنتج في متجر أدوات منزلية. ولكي تبدو الصفحة هادئة، صار أغلب النص رماديًا فاتحًا.\n\nومنذ ذلك الوقت، يتصل العملاء ليسألوا عن تفاصيل موجودة أصلًا في الصفحة."},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nasij","name":{"en":"Nasij","ar":"نسيج"},"color":"#B45309","icon":"house-line","domain":"nasij.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Bedroom","ar":"غرفة النوم"},"back":true,"actions":[{"icon":"heart","aria":{"en":"Save","ar":"حفظ"}},{"icon":"shopping-cart","aria":{"en":"Basket","ar":"السلة"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"bed-sheet","size":"m"},{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Linen bed sheet","ar":"ملاءة سرير كتان"}},{"kind":"text","color":"pale","text":{"en":"650 EGP","ar":"650 جنيه"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"text","px":14,"color":"pale","text":{"en":"100% linen. Fits beds up to 160 cm. Wash at 30°.","ar":"كتان 100%. يناسب السرير حتى عرض 160 سم. يُغسل على 30 درجة."},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Add to cart","ar":"أضف إلى السلة"},"gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"S02","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P05-U02-01","part":"try","rules":["R12"],"value":{"en":"Try first. Low-Contrast Text (NN/g): when contrast is too low, people strain their eyes to make out the words. Bold or bigger pale text is still pale; darker text fixes it.","ar":"جرّب أولًا. النص منخفض التباين (NN/g): حين يكون التباين ضعيفًا، يُجهد الناس أعينهم ليقرؤوا الكلمات. والنص الباهت العريض أو الأكبر يبقى باهتًا؛ والحل نص أغمق."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/low-contrast/","quote":"When the contrast is too low, users experience eye strain as they try to decipher the words."},"prompt":{"en":"Tap each option to see the change. Which one makes the details easiest to read?","ar":"اضغط على كل خيار لترى التغيير. أي خيار يجعل التفاصيل أسهل في القراءة؟"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"app":{"id":"nasij","name":{"en":"Nasij","ar":"نسيج"},"color":"#B45309","icon":"house-line","domain":"nasij.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Bedroom","ar":"غرفة النوم"},"back":true,"actions":[{"icon":"heart","aria":{"en":"Save","ar":"حفظ"}},{"icon":"shopping-cart","aria":{"en":"Basket","ar":"السلة"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"bed-sheet","size":"m"},{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Linen bed sheet","ar":"ملاءة سرير كتان"}},{"kind":"text","color":"pale","text":{"en":"650 EGP","ar":"650 جنيه"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"text","px":14,"color":"pale","text":{"en":"100% linen. Fits beds up to 160 cm. Wash at 30°.","ar":"كتان 100%. يناسب السرير حتى عرض 160 سم. يُغسل على 30 درجة."},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Add to cart","ar":"أضف إلى السلة"},"gap":"m"}]},"options":[{"id":"bold","text":{"en":"Keep the light grey, but make it bold","ar":"أبقِ الرمادي الفاتح، لكن اجعله عريضًا (Bold)"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"nasij","name":{"en":"Nasij","ar":"نسيج"},"color":"#B45309","icon":"house-line","domain":"nasij.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Bedroom","ar":"غرفة النوم"},"back":true,"actions":[{"icon":"heart","aria":{"en":"Save","ar":"حفظ"}},{"icon":"shopping-cart","aria":{"en":"Basket","ar":"السلة"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"bed-sheet","size":"m"},{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Linen bed sheet","ar":"ملاءة سرير كتان"}},{"kind":"text","color":"pale","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"650 EGP","ar":"650 جنيه"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"text","px":14,"color":"pale","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"100% linen. Fits beds up to 160 cm. Wash at 30°.","ar":"كتان 100%. يناسب السرير حتى عرض 160 سم. يُغسل على 30 درجة."},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Add to cart","ar":"أضف إلى السلة"},"gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"dark","text":{"en":"Make the text dark grey","ar":"اجعل النص رماديًا غامقًا"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"nasij","name":{"en":"Nasij","ar":"نسيج"},"color":"#B45309","icon":"house-line","domain":"nasij.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Bedroom","ar":"غرفة النوم"},"back":true,"actions":[{"icon":"heart","aria":{"en":"Save","ar":"حفظ"}},{"icon":"shopping-cart","aria":{"en":"Basket","ar":"السلة"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"bed-sheet","size":"m"},{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Linen bed sheet","ar":"ملاءة سرير كتان"}},{"kind":"text","color":"ink","text":{"en":"650 EGP","ar":"650 جنيه"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"text","px":14,"color":"muted","text":{"en":"100% linen. Fits beds up to 160 cm. Wash at 30°.","ar":"كتان 100%. يناسب السرير حتى عرض 160 سم. يُغسل على 30 درجة."},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Add to cart","ar":"أضف إلى السلة"},"gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"lighter","text":{"en":"Make it even lighter, so the page looks calmer","ar":"اجعله أفتح، لتبدو الصفحة أهدأ"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"nasij","name":{"en":"Nasij","ar":"نسيج"},"color":"#B45309","icon":"house-line","domain":"nasij.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Bedroom","ar":"غرفة النوم"},"back":true,"actions":[{"icon":"heart","aria":{"en":"Save","ar":"حفظ"}},{"icon":"shopping-cart","aria":{"en":"Basket","ar":"السلة"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"bed-sheet","size":"m"},{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Linen bed sheet","ar":"ملاءة سرير كتان"}},{"kind":"text","color":"faint","text":{"en":"650 EGP","ar":"650 جنيه"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"text","px":14,"color":"faint","text":{"en":"100% linen. Fits beds up to 160 cm. Wash at 30°.","ar":"كتان 100%. يناسب السرير حتى عرض 160 سم. يُغسل على 30 درجة."},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Add to cart","ar":"أضف إلى السلة"},"gap":"m"}]}}],"answer":["dark"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-014","when":["bold","lighter"],"feedback":{"en":"The problem is the colour. Pale text is close to the white background, so eyes work hard to read it, bold or not.","ar":"المشكلة في اللون. النص الباهت قريب من لون الخلفية البيضاء، فتتعب العين لتقرأه، سواء كان عريضًا أم لا."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Look at how close each text colour is to the white background.","ar":"انظر: ما مدى قرب لون كل نص من الخلفية البيضاء؟"},{"en":"Which option makes the text colour more different from the background?","ar":"أي خيار يجعل لون النص مختلفًا أكثر عن الخلفية؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Darker text is easier for everyone to read.","ar":"صحيح. النص الأغمق أسهل في القراءة للجميع."},"explain":{"en":"The bigger the difference between text and background, the easier the words are to read. That difference is called contrast.","ar":"كلما زاد الفرق بين لون النص ولون الخلفية، صارت الكلمات أسهل في القراءة. وهذا الفرق اسمه التباين (Contrast)."}},{"id":"S03","type":"card","part":"concept","icons":["eye","size","ok","order"],"title":{"en":"Contrast: how different text is from its background","ar":"التباين: مدى اختلاف النص عن خلفيته"},"body":{"en":"Contrast is measured as a ratio, like 4.5:1. Free tools check it for you.\n\n- **The minimum:** normal text needs at least 4.5:1. Large text (about 24 px, or 19 px bold) needs at least 3:1.\n- **Pale looks broken:** people expect grey controls to be turned off. A grey search box looks like it doesn't work.\n- **To make something quieter:** make it smaller, move it lower, or hide extra details behind a \"More\" link. Don't make it paler.\n- **Bright sun:** outdoors, pale text on a phone is almost impossible to read.","ar":"التباين يُقاس بنسبة، مثل 4.5:1. وهناك أدوات مجانية تقيسه لك.\n\n- **الحد الأدنى:** النص العادي يحتاج 4.5:1 على الأقل. والنص الكبير (نحو 24 بكسل، أو 19 بكسل عريض) يحتاج 3:1 على الأقل.\n- **الباهت يبدو معطّلًا:** الناس يتوقّعون أن العنصر الرمادي لا يعمل. فمربع البحث الرمادي يبدو كأنه معطّل.\n- **لتقليل أهمية عنصر:** صغّره، أو انقله إلى الأسفل، أو أخفِ التفاصيل الإضافية خلف رابط «المزيد». ولا تجعله باهتًا.\n- **ضوء الشمس:** في الخارج، تكاد قراءة النص الباهت على الهاتف تكون مستحيلة."}},{"id":"S04","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P05-U02-02","part":"guided","rules":["R06"],"value":{"en":"Low-Contrast Text (NN/g): by convention, disabled features are dimmed or greyed out, so low contrast sends the wrong signal about whether an option is available.","ar":"النص منخفض التباين (NN/g): المتعارف عليه أن العناصر المعطّلة تكون باهتة أو رمادية، فالتباين الضعيف يعطي إشارة خطأ عن توفّر الخيار."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/low-contrast/","quote":"by convention, disabled features are dimmed or grayed out. Low contrast treatments risk sending users the wrong signal about the availability of an option."},"scenario":{"en":"On the shop's home screen, we made the search box light grey so it doesn't compete with the photos. Few people use search now.","ar":"في الشاشة الرئيسية للمتجر، جعلنا مربع البحث رماديًا فاتحًا حتى لا ينافس الصور. والآن قليلون يستخدمون البحث."},"prompt":{"en":"Tap each option to see the change. Which one makes it clear that search works?","ar":"اضغط على كل خيار لترى التغيير. أي خيار يوضّح أن البحث يعمل؟"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"app":{"id":"nasij","name":{"en":"Nasij","ar":"نسيج"},"color":"#B45309","icon":"house-line","domain":"nasij.example"},"appbar":{"logo":true,"actions":[{"icon":"shopping-cart","aria":{"en":"Basket","ar":"السلة"}}]},"tabbar":{"active":0,"items":[{"icon":"house","text":{"en":"Home","ar":"الرئيسية"}},{"icon":"squares-four","text":{"en":"Rooms","ar":"الغرف"}},{"icon":"receipt","text":{"en":"Orders","ar":"طلباتي"}},{"icon":"user","text":{"en":"Account","ar":"حسابي"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","tone":"off","text":{"en":"Search the shop","ar":"ابحث في المتجر"}},{"kind":"small","color":"faint","text":{"en":"Search","ar":"بحث"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"image","art":"bed-sheet","size":"m","text":{"en":"New arrivals","ar":"وصل حديثًا"},"gap":"s"}]},"options":[{"id":"clear","text":{"en":"Give the search box a dark border and dark text","ar":"أعطِ مربع البحث إطارًا غامقًا ونصًا غامقًا"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"nasij","name":{"en":"Nasij","ar":"نسيج"},"color":"#B45309","icon":"house-line","domain":"nasij.example"},"appbar":{"logo":true,"actions":[{"icon":"shopping-cart","aria":{"en":"Basket","ar":"السلة"}}]},"tabbar":{"active":0,"items":[{"icon":"house","text":{"en":"Home","ar":"الرئيسية"}},{"icon":"squares-four","text":{"en":"Rooms","ar":"الغرف"}},{"icon":"receipt","text":{"en":"Orders","ar":"طلباتي"}},{"icon":"user","text":{"en":"Account","ar":"حسابي"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","filled":true,"text":{"en":"Search the shop","ar":"ابحث في المتجر"}},{"kind":"image","art":"bed-sheet","size":"m","text":{"en":"New arrivals","ar":"وصل حديثًا"},"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"smaller","text":{"en":"Keep it grey, but make it smaller","ar":"أبقِه رماديًا، لكن صغّره"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"nasij","name":{"en":"Nasij","ar":"نسيج"},"color":"#B45309","icon":"house-line","domain":"nasij.example"},"appbar":{"logo":true,"actions":[{"icon":"shopping-cart","aria":{"en":"Basket","ar":"السلة"}}]},"tabbar":{"active":0,"items":[{"icon":"house","text":{"en":"Home","ar":"الرئيسية"}},{"icon":"squares-four","text":{"en":"Rooms","ar":"الغرف"}},{"icon":"receipt","text":{"en":"Orders","ar":"طلباتي"}},{"icon":"user","text":{"en":"Account","ar":"حسابي"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","color":"faint","text":{"en":"Search the shop","ar":"ابحث في المتجر"}},{"kind":"image","art":"bed-sheet","size":"m","text":{"en":"New arrivals","ar":"وصل حديثًا"},"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"keep","text":{"en":"Change nothing; people will find it","ar":"لا تغيّر شيئًا؛ سيجده الناس"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"nasij","name":{"en":"Nasij","ar":"نسيج"},"color":"#B45309","icon":"house-line","domain":"nasij.example"},"appbar":{"logo":true,"actions":[{"icon":"shopping-cart","aria":{"en":"Basket","ar":"السلة"}}]},"tabbar":{"active":0,"items":[{"icon":"house","text":{"en":"Home","ar":"الرئيسية"}},{"icon":"squares-four","text":{"en":"Rooms","ar":"الغرف"}},{"icon":"receipt","text":{"en":"Orders","ar":"طلباتي"}},{"icon":"user","text":{"en":"Account","ar":"حسابي"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","tone":"off","text":{"en":"Search the shop","ar":"ابحث في المتجر"}},{"kind":"small","color":"faint","text":{"en":"Search","ar":"بحث"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"image","art":"bed-sheet","size":"m","text":{"en":"New arrivals","ar":"وصل حديثًا"},"gap":"s"}]}}],"answer":["clear"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-016","when":["smaller","keep"],"feedback":{"en":"A grey box looks turned off, so people don't try it. Make it look like it works: dark text and a clear border.","ar":"المربع الرمادي يبدو معطّلًا، فلا يجرّبه الناس. اجعله يبدو أنه يعمل: نص غامق وإطار واضح."}}],"hints":[{"en":"What do people usually think a grey control means?","ar":"ماذا يفهم الناس عادةً من العنصر الرمادي؟"},{"en":"Which option makes the box look like the others that work?","ar":"أي خيار يجعل المربع يشبه العناصر التي تعمل؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Things that work must not look turned off.","ar":"صحيح. العنصر الذي يعمل يجب ألا يبدو معطّلًا."},"explain":{"en":"Grey is the usual sign for \"turned off\". Use it only for things that really are off.","ar":"اللون الرمادي هو العلامة المعتادة لـ «معطّل». فاستخدمه فقط للعناصر المعطّلة فعلًا."},"speaker":"mona"},{"id":"S05","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P05-U02-02","part":"guided","rules":["R06"],"value":{"en":"Low-Contrast Text (NN/g): to make something less prominent, change its size, position or padding, or use an accordion, instead of lowering contrast.","ar":"النص منخفض التباين (NN/g): لتقليل بروز عنصر، غيّر حجمه أو مكانه أو المسافة حوله، أو استخدم Accordion، بدل تقليل التباين."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/low-contrast/","quote":"Often, changing the location of an element, or adding more padding around it, is enough to change its prominence on the page."},"scenario":{"en":"Under each product we show delivery and return rules. They're useful, but less important than the price. My designer made them pale so they stand out less.","ar":"تحت كل منتج نعرض شروط التوصيل والإرجاع. هي مفيدة، لكنها أقل أهمية من السعر. فجعلها المصمم باهتة لتكون أقل بروزًا."},"prompt":{"en":"Tap each option to see the change. Which one makes the rules less loud but still easy to read?","ar":"اضغط على كل خيار لترى التغيير. أي خيار يجعل الشروط أقل بروزًا، وتبقى سهلة القراءة؟"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"app":{"id":"nasij","name":{"en":"Nasij","ar":"نسيج"},"color":"#B45309","icon":"house-line","domain":"nasij.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Bedroom","ar":"غرفة النوم"},"back":true,"actions":[{"icon":"heart","aria":{"en":"Save","ar":"حفظ"}},{"icon":"shopping-cart","aria":{"en":"Basket","ar":"السلة"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"bed-sheet","size":"m"},{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Linen bed sheet","ar":"ملاءة سرير كتان"}},{"kind":"text","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"650 EGP","ar":"650 جنيه"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Add to cart","ar":"أضف إلى السلة"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"text","color":"faint","text":{"en":"Free delivery over 500 EGP. Returns within 14 days.","ar":"توصيل مجاني فوق 500 جنيه. الإرجاع خلال 14 يومًا."},"gap":"s"}]},"options":[{"id":"small","text":{"en":"Dark grey, a bit smaller, with space above it","ar":"رمادي غامق، أصغر قليلًا، مع مسافة فوقه"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"nasij","name":{"en":"Nasij","ar":"نسيج"},"color":"#B45309","icon":"house-line","domain":"nasij.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Bedroom","ar":"غرفة النوم"},"back":true,"actions":[{"icon":"heart","aria":{"en":"Save","ar":"حفظ"}},{"icon":"shopping-cart","aria":{"en":"Basket","ar":"السلة"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"bed-sheet","size":"m"},{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Linen bed sheet","ar":"ملاءة سرير كتان"}},{"kind":"text","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"650 EGP","ar":"650 جنيه"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Add to cart","ar":"أضف إلى السلة"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Free delivery over 500 EGP. Returns within 14 days.","ar":"توصيل مجاني فوق 500 جنيه. الإرجاع خلال 14 يومًا."},"gap":"l"}]}},{"id":"paler","text":{"en":"Keep it pale, and make it smaller too","ar":"أبقِه باهتًا، وصغّره أيضًا"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"nasij","name":{"en":"Nasij","ar":"نسيج"},"color":"#B45309","icon":"house-line","domain":"nasij.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Bedroom","ar":"غرفة النوم"},"back":true,"actions":[{"icon":"heart","aria":{"en":"Save","ar":"حفظ"}},{"icon":"shopping-cart","aria":{"en":"Basket","ar":"السلة"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"bed-sheet","size":"m"},{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Linen bed sheet","ar":"ملاءة سرير كتان"}},{"kind":"text","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"650 EGP","ar":"650 جنيه"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Add to cart","ar":"أضف إلى السلة"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"small","color":"faint","text":{"en":"Free delivery over 500 EGP. Returns within 14 days.","ar":"توصيل مجاني فوق 500 جنيه. الإرجاع خلال 14 يومًا."},"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"same","text":{"en":"Make it as big and bold as the price","ar":"اجعله بحجم السعر وعريضًا مثله"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"nasij","name":{"en":"Nasij","ar":"نسيج"},"color":"#B45309","icon":"house-line","domain":"nasij.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Bedroom","ar":"غرفة النوم"},"back":true,"actions":[{"icon":"heart","aria":{"en":"Save","ar":"حفظ"}},{"icon":"shopping-cart","aria":{"en":"Basket","ar":"السلة"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"bed-sheet","size":"m"},{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Linen bed sheet","ar":"ملاءة سرير كتان"}},{"kind":"text","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"650 EGP","ar":"650 جنيه"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Add to cart","ar":"أضف إلى السلة"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"text","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Free delivery over 500 EGP. Returns within 14 days.","ar":"توصيل مجاني فوق 500 جنيه. الإرجاع خلال 14 يومًا."},"gap":"s"}]}}],"answer":["small"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-017","when":["paler"],"feedback":{"en":"Small and pale is the hardest to read. Size and space already make it quieter, so the colour can stay dark.","ar":"الصغير الباهت هو الأصعب في القراءة. والحجم والمسافة يقلّلان البروز وحدهما، فيبقى اللون غامقًا."}},{"id":"MC-P05-017","when":["same"],"feedback":{"en":"Now the rules compete with the price. Readable is good, but they should still look less important.","ar":"الآن تنافس الشروط السعر. صارت مقروءة، لكن يجب أن تبدو أقل أهمية."}}],"hints":[{"en":"You need two things: easy to read, and less loud than the price.","ar":"تحتاج أمرين: سهولة القراءة، وبروز أقل من السعر."},{"en":"Which option uses size and space, not colour, to make it quieter?","ar":"أي خيار يستخدم الحجم والمسافة، لا اللون، لتقليل البروز؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Smaller and lower, but still dark.","ar":"صحيح. أصغر وفي مكان أسفل، لكن ما زال غامقًا."},"explain":{"en":"Size, place and space control how much something stands out. Keep the colour dark enough to read.","ar":"الحجم والمكان والمسافة تتحكّم في بروز العنصر. وأبقِ اللون غامقًا بما يكفي للقراءة."},"speaker":"mona"},{"id":"S06","type":"compare","skill":"SK-P05-U02-01","part":"contrast","confidence":true,"rules":["R11"],"value":{"en":"Contrast: same 3:1 grey, different size. 5 Visual Treatments (NN/g): normal text needs 4.5:1; text of at least 18pt, or 14pt bold, needs 3:1.","ar":"مقارنة: نفس الرمادي 3:1، بحجم مختلف. 5 معالجات بصرية (NN/g): النص العادي يحتاج 4.5:1؛ والنص من 18pt، أو 14pt عريض، يحتاج 3:1."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/visual-treatments-accessibility/","quote":"For text that is at least 18pt or 14pt bold, the ratio is a bit more generous at 3:1."},"scenario":{"en":"A contrast checker says our grey has a 3:1 contrast with white. We use it in two places.","ar":"أداة فحص التباين تقول إن الرمادي عندنا تباينه مع الأبيض 3:1. ونستخدمه في مكانين."},"prompt":{"en":"Which use of this grey meets the minimum contrast?","ar":"أي استخدام لهذا الرمادي يحقّق الحد الأدنى للتباين؟"},"a":{"label":{"en":"A: A big bold heading (24 px, bold)","ar":"A: عنوان كبير عريض (24 بكسل، Bold)"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nasij","name":{"en":"Nasij","ar":"نسيج"},"color":"#B45309","icon":"house-line","domain":"nasij.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Bedroom","ar":"غرفة النوم"},"back":true,"actions":[{"icon":"heart","aria":{"en":"Save","ar":"حفظ"}},{"icon":"shopping-cart","aria":{"en":"Basket","ar":"السلة"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"text","px":24,"weight":"bold","color":"pale","text":{"en":"Summer sale","ar":"تخفيضات الصيف"}}]}},"b":{"label":{"en":"B: Small product details (13 px)","ar":"B: تفاصيل المنتج بخط صغير (13 بكسل)"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nasij","name":{"en":"Nasij","ar":"نسيج"},"color":"#B45309","icon":"house-line","domain":"nasij.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Bedroom","ar":"غرفة النوم"},"back":true,"actions":[{"icon":"heart","aria":{"en":"Save","ar":"حفظ"}},{"icon":"shopping-cart","aria":{"en":"Basket","ar":"السلة"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"text","px":13,"color":"pale","text":{"en":"100% cotton. Machine wash at 30°.","ar":"قطن 100%. يُغسل في الغسالة على 30 درجة."}}]}},"answer":"a","reason":{"prompt":{"en":"Why is A fine at 3:1 but B isn't?","ar":"لماذا يكفي 3:1 للنص A ولا يكفي للنص B؟"},"options":[{"id":"size","text":{"en":"Large or bold text is easier to see, so it needs less contrast","ar":"النص الكبير أو العريض أسهل في الرؤية، فيحتاج تباينًا أقل"}},{"id":"heading","text":{"en":"Headings don't need to meet any rule","ar":"العناوين لا تخضع لأي قاعدة"}},{"id":"sale","text":{"en":"Sale text is shown only for a short time","ar":"نص التخفيضات يظهر لفترة قصيرة فقط"}}],"answer":["size"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-015","when":["heading","sale"],"feedback":{"en":"Every text has a minimum. Large or bold text just gets a lower one (3:1), because bigger letters are easier to see.","ar":"كل نص له حد أدنى. لكن النص الكبير أو العريض حدّه أقل (3:1)، لأن الحروف الكبيرة أسهل في الرؤية."}}]},"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-015","when":["b"],"feedback":{"en":"Small text needs at least 4.5:1. Only large or bold text can go down to 3:1.","ar":"النص الصغير يحتاج 4.5:1 على الأقل. والنص الكبير أو العريض فقط يكفيه 3:1."}}],"hints":[{"en":"The two texts use the same grey. What's different about them?","ar":"النصّان بنفس الرمادي. ما الفرق بينهما؟"},{"en":"Which kind of text may go down to 3:1?","ar":"أي نوع من النص يكفيه 3:1؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Big bold text can use 3:1; small text needs 4.5:1.","ar":"صحيح. النص الكبير العريض يكفيه 3:1؛ والنص الصغير يحتاج 4.5:1."},"explain":{"en":"Check the size too, not only the colour. The same grey can be fine for a big heading and too weak for small text.","ar":"افحص الحجم أيضًا، لا اللون فقط. فنفس الرمادي قد يناسب عنوانًا كبيرًا، ويكون ضعيفًا على نص صغير."},"speaker":"mona"},{"id":"S07","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P05-U02-01","part":"independent","speaker":"hana","rules":["R14"],"value":{"en":"New case. Low-Contrast Text (NN/g): reading low-contrast text on a phone in bright sun is nearly impossible; even high-contrast text is hard with glare.","ar":"حالة جديدة. النص منخفض التباين (NN/g): قراءة النص منخفض التباين على الهاتف في الشمس تكاد تكون مستحيلة؛ وحتى النص عالي التباين صعب مع انعكاس الضوء."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/low-contrast/","quote":"Imagine trying to read low-contrast text on a mobile device while walking in bright sun."},"scenario":{"en":"Members check our class times on their phones, often outside the gym in the afternoon sun. The times are in light grey.","ar":"يفتح الأعضاء مواعيد الحصص على هواتفهم، وكثيرًا ما يكونون خارج النادي في شمس العصر. والمواعيد مكتوبة بالرمادي الفاتح."},"prompt":{"en":"Tap each option to see the change. Which one lets members read the times in the sun?","ar":"اضغط على كل خيار لترى التغيير. أي خيار يجعل الأعضاء يقرؤون المواعيد في الشمس؟"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Timetable","ar":"جدول الحصص"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Today","ar":"اليوم"}},{"kind":"text","color":"faint","text":{"en":"Yoga · 17:00","ar":"يوغا · 17:00"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"text","color":"faint","text":{"en":"Boxing · 19:00","ar":"ملاكمة · 19:00"},"gap":"xs"}]},"options":[{"id":"keep","text":{"en":"Change nothing; it looks fine on my laptop","ar":"لا تغيّر شيئًا؛ يبدو جيدًا على الـ Laptop عندي"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Timetable","ar":"جدول الحصص"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Today","ar":"اليوم"}},{"kind":"text","color":"faint","text":{"en":"Yoga · 17:00","ar":"يوغا · 17:00"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"text","color":"faint","text":{"en":"Boxing · 19:00","ar":"ملاكمة · 19:00"},"gap":"xs"}]}},{"id":"dark","text":{"en":"Make the times dark","ar":"اجعل المواعيد غامقة"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Timetable","ar":"جدول الحصص"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Today","ar":"اليوم"}},{"kind":"text","color":"ink","text":{"en":"Yoga · 17:00","ar":"يوغا · 17:00"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"text","color":"ink","text":{"en":"Boxing · 19:00","ar":"ملاكمة · 19:00"},"gap":"xs"}]}},{"id":"tip","text":{"en":"Add a tip: \"Turn up your screen brightness\"","ar":"أضف نصيحة: «ارفع إضاءة الشاشة»"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Timetable","ar":"جدول الحصص"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","color":"faint","text":{"en":"Tip: turn up your screen brightness.","ar":"نصيحة: ارفع إضاءة الشاشة."}},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Today","ar":"اليوم"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"text","color":"faint","text":{"en":"Yoga · 17:00","ar":"يوغا · 17:00"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"text","color":"faint","text":{"en":"Boxing · 19:00","ar":"ملاكمة · 19:00"},"gap":"xs"}]}}],"answer":["dark"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-014","when":["keep"],"feedback":{"en":"An office screen isn't a phone in the sun. Outside, the glare makes pale text almost disappear.","ar":"شاشة المكتب ليست مثل هاتف في الشمس. ففي الخارج، يكاد انعكاس الضوء يُخفي النص الباهت."}},{"id":"MC-P05-014","when":["tip"],"feedback":{"en":"The tip is pale too, and it asks members to fix our design. Dark text fixes it for everyone.","ar":"النصيحة باهتة هي أيضًا، وتطلب من الأعضاء إصلاح تصميمنا. والنص الغامق يحلّ المشكلة للجميع."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Where are members when they read this screen?","ar":"أين يكون الأعضاء حين يقرؤون هذه الشاشة؟"},{"en":"Which option changes the text itself?","ar":"أي خيار يغيّر النص نفسه؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Dark text still reads in the sun.","ar":"صحيح. النص الغامق يبقى مقروءًا في الشمس."},"explain":{"en":"Test screens where people use them. Strong contrast keeps text readable in bright light, for every member.","ar":"اختبر الشاشات في المكان الذي يستخدمها فيه الناس. والتباين القوي يُبقي النص مقروءًا في الضوء القوي، لكل الأعضاء."}},{"id":"S08","type":"card","part":"recap","icons":["eye","ok","size","order"],"title":{"en":"What you did","ar":"ماذا تعلّمت"},"body":{"en":"- **Dark text:** you made pale text darker, so it's easy to read.\n- **Grey means off:** you made search look like it works.\n- **Quieter, not paler:** you used size and space to make details less loud.\n- **Check the size:** 4.5:1 for normal text, 3:1 for large or bold text.\n- **Real light:** you made times readable in the sun.\n\nNext lesson: what happens when colour is the only sign.","ar":"- **نص غامق:** جعلت النص الباهت أغمق، ليسهل قراءته.\n- **الرمادي يعني معطّل:** جعلت البحث يبدو أنه يعمل.\n- **أهدأ، لا أبهت:** استخدمت الحجم والمسافة لتقليل بروز التفاصيل.\n- **افحص الحجم:** 4.5:1 للنص العادي، و3:1 للنص الكبير أو العريض.\n- **الضوء الحقيقي:** جعلت المواعيد مقروءة في الشمس.\n\nالدرس التالي: ماذا يحدث حين يكون اللون هو العلامة الوحيدة."}}]}$uxg$::jsonb),
  ($uxg$P05-U02-L02$uxg$, $uxg$8c2e1a1f755d00d9617b5cd4973bb9880e5e763a335b136a219a3a95d8482f19$uxg$, $uxg${"id":"P05-U02-L02","mode":"lesson","minutes":7,"title":{"en":"Colour can't be the only sign","ar":"لا تجعل اللون العلامة الوحيدة"},"summary":{"en":"Add a second sign to colour on order dots, links, seats and a calendar.","ar":"أضف علامة ثانية إلى اللون في نقاط الطلبات والروابط والمقاعد والتقويم."},"speaker":"karim","review_labels":{"MC-P05-018":{"en":"Colour alone can't carry meaning","ar":"اللون وحده لا يكفي لنقل المعنى"},"MC-P05-019":{"en":"A colour legend is still colour alone","ar":"مفتاح الألوان ما زال يعتمد على اللون وحده"}},"steps":[{"id":"S01","type":"card","part":"hook","title":{"en":"Which order is late?","ar":"أي طلب متأخر؟"},"body":{"en":"I'm building order tracking for a pharmacy app. Each order has a dot: green means delivered, orange means on the way, red means late.\n\nSome customers still call to ask which of their orders is late.","ar":"أصمّم صفحة متابعة الطلبات في تطبيق صيدلية. لكل طلب نقطة: الأخضر يعني تم التوصيل، والبرتقالي يعني في الطريق، والأحمر يعني متأخر.\n\nومع ذلك، يتصل بعض العملاء ليسألوا: أي طلباتهم متأخر؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nasij","name":{"en":"Nasij","ar":"نسيج"},"color":"#B45309","icon":"house-line","domain":"nasij.example"},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"My orders","ar":"طلباتي"}},{"kind":"row","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Order 1042","ar":"طلب 1042"}},{"kind":"text","color":"green","text":"●"}]},{"kind":"row","gap":"xs","blocks":[{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Order 1043","ar":"طلب 1043"}},{"kind":"text","color":"red","text":"●"}]},{"kind":"row","gap":"xs","blocks":[{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Order 1044","ar":"طلب 1044"}},{"kind":"text","color":"orange","text":"●"}]}]}},{"id":"S02","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P05-U02-03","part":"try","rules":["R12"],"value":{"en":"Try first. 5 Visual Treatments (NN/g): people with colour blindness or low vision may not tell apart things that differ by colour alone. A word next to the dot works for everyone.","ar":"جرّب أولًا. 5 معالجات بصرية (NN/g): من لا يميّزون الألوان أو نظرهم ضعيف قد لا يفرّقون بين عناصر تختلف في اللون فقط. والكلمة بجانب النقطة تناسب الجميع."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/visual-treatments-accessibility/","quote":"Individuals who have color blindness or low visual acuity may not be able to distinguish between elements differentiated by color alone."},"prompt":{"en":"Tap each option to see the change. Which one lets every customer see which order is late?","ar":"اضغط على كل خيار لترى التغيير. أي خيار يجعل كل العملاء يعرفون أي طلب متأخر؟"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"app":{"id":"nasij","name":{"en":"Nasij","ar":"نسيج"},"color":"#B45309","icon":"house-line","domain":"nasij.example"},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"My orders","ar":"طلباتي"}},{"kind":"row","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Order 1042","ar":"طلب 1042"}},{"kind":"text","color":"green","text":"●"}]},{"kind":"row","gap":"xs","blocks":[{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Order 1043","ar":"طلب 1043"}},{"kind":"text","color":"red","text":"●"}]},{"kind":"row","gap":"xs","blocks":[{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Order 1044","ar":"طلب 1044"}},{"kind":"text","color":"orange","text":"●"}]}]},"options":[{"id":"bright","text":{"en":"Use stronger, brighter colours for the dots","ar":"استخدم ألوانًا أقوى وأوضح للنقاط"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"nasij","name":{"en":"Nasij","ar":"نسيج"},"color":"#B45309","icon":"house-line","domain":"nasij.example"},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"My orders","ar":"طلباتي"}},{"kind":"row","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Order 1042","ar":"طلب 1042"}},{"kind":"text","color":"green","weight":"bold","px":22,"text":"●"}]},{"kind":"row","gap":"xs","blocks":[{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Order 1043","ar":"طلب 1043"}},{"kind":"text","color":"red","weight":"bold","px":22,"text":"●"}]},{"kind":"row","gap":"xs","blocks":[{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Order 1044","ar":"طلب 1044"}},{"kind":"text","color":"orange","weight":"bold","px":22,"text":"●"}]}]}},{"id":"legend","text":{"en":"Add a line on top: \"Green: delivered · Orange: on the way · Red: late\"","ar":"أضف سطرًا في الأعلى: «أخضر: تم التوصيل · برتقالي: في الطريق · أحمر: متأخر»"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"nasij","name":{"en":"Nasij","ar":"نسيج"},"color":"#B45309","icon":"house-line","domain":"nasij.example"},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"My orders","ar":"طلباتي"}},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Green: delivered · Orange: on the way · Red: late","ar":"أخضر: تم التوصيل · برتقالي: في الطريق · أحمر: متأخر"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"row","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Order 1042","ar":"طلب 1042"}},{"kind":"text","color":"green","text":"●"}]},{"kind":"row","gap":"xs","blocks":[{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Order 1043","ar":"طلب 1043"}},{"kind":"text","color":"red","text":"●"}]},{"kind":"row","gap":"xs","blocks":[{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Order 1044","ar":"طلب 1044"}},{"kind":"text","color":"orange","text":"●"}]}]}},{"id":"word","text":{"en":"Write the status next to each dot","ar":"اكتب الحالة بجانب كل نقطة"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"nasij","name":{"en":"Nasij","ar":"نسيج"},"color":"#B45309","icon":"house-line","domain":"nasij.example"},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"My orders","ar":"طلباتي"}},{"kind":"row","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Order 1042","ar":"طلب 1042"}},{"kind":"chip","text":{"en":"● Delivered","ar":"● تم التوصيل"}}]},{"kind":"row","gap":"xs","blocks":[{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Order 1043","ar":"طلب 1043"}},{"kind":"chip","tone":"bad","text":{"en":"● Late","ar":"● متأخر"}}]},{"kind":"row","gap":"xs","blocks":[{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Order 1044","ar":"طلب 1044"}},{"kind":"chip","tone":"warn","text":{"en":"● On the way","ar":"● في الطريق"}}]}]}}],"answer":["word"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-018","when":["bright"],"feedback":{"en":"Brighter red is still red. Someone who can't tell red from green still sees three dots that look the same.","ar":"الأحمر الأقوى ما زال أحمر. ومن لا يفرّق بين الأحمر والأخضر يرى ثلاث نقاط متشابهة."}},{"id":"MC-P05-019","when":["legend"],"feedback":{"en":"The line explains the colours, but customers still have to tell the colours apart to use it.","ar":"السطر يشرح الألوان، لكن العميل ما زال يحتاج أن يميّز الألوان ليستفيد منه."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Imagine the three dots all look the same colour to you.","ar":"تخيّل أن النقاط الثلاث تبدو لك بنفس اللون."},{"en":"Which option tells you the status without seeing any colour?","ar":"أي خيار يخبرك بالحالة دون أن ترى أي لون؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Now the word says it, and the colour just helps.","ar":"صحيح. الآن الكلمة تقول الحالة، واللون مجرد مساعدة."},"explain":{"en":"Many people can't tell some colours apart, like red and green. A second sign, such as a word, works for everyone.","ar":"كثير من الناس لا يميّزون بعض الألوان، مثل الأحمر والأخضر. والعلامة الثانية، مثل كلمة، تناسب الجميع."}},{"id":"S03","type":"card","part":"concept","icons":["color","ok","text","eye"],"title":{"en":"Colour helps, but never alone","ar":"اللون يساعد، لكن ليس وحده"},"body":{"en":"Some people can't tell certain colours apart, like red and green. Others see colours weakly.\n\n- **Add a second sign:** a word, an icon, a ✕ or ✓, or a line or pattern.\n- **Different words are enough:** \"Paid\" in green and \"Unpaid\" in red is fine. The words already differ.\n- **Links inside text:** underline them. A link shown only by its colour is easy to miss.\n- **The grayscale test:** turn the screen to black and white (grayscale). If you still understand everything, it works.","ar":"بعض الناس لا يميّزون ألوانًا معيّنة، مثل الأحمر والأخضر. وآخرون يرون الألوان ضعيفة.\n\n- **أضف علامة ثانية:** كلمة، أو أيقونة، أو ✕ أو ✓، أو خط أو نقش.\n- **الكلمات المختلفة تكفي:** «مدفوع» بالأخضر و«غير مدفوع» بالأحمر لا مشكلة فيهما. فالكلمتان مختلفتان أصلًا.\n- **الروابط داخل النص:** ضع تحتها خطًا. فالرابط الذي يظهر بلونه فقط قد لا يلاحظه القارئ.\n- **اختبار الأبيض والأسود:** حوّل الشاشة إلى الأبيض والأسود (Grayscale). إذا ظللت تفهم كل شيء، فالتصميم جيد."}},{"id":"S04","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P05-U02-03","part":"guided","rules":["R06"],"value":{"en":"Guidelines for Visualizing Links (NN/g): underlined links matter for low-vision users, and underlining is essential when links are red or green.","ar":"إرشادات لإظهار الروابط (NN/g): الخط تحت الرابط مهم لضعاف النظر، وهو ضروري إذا كان لون الروابط أحمر أو أخضر."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/guidelines-for-visualizing-links/","quote":"underlined links are important for low-vision users' accessibility"},"scenario":{"en":"In the app's help page, a sentence has a link to the return guide. The link is only purple; it has no underline. The screens below are shown in grayscale.","ar":"في صفحة المساعدة بالتطبيق، توجد جملة فيها رابط إلى دليل الإرجاع. الرابط بنفسجي فقط، وليس تحته خط. والشاشات بالأسفل معروضة بالأبيض والأسود."},"prompt":{"en":"Tap each option to see the change. Which one still shows the link in grayscale?","ar":"اضغط على كل خيار لترى التغيير. أي خيار يُبقي الرابط واضحًا بالأبيض والأسود؟"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"Now, in grayscale","ar":"الآن، بالأبيض والأسود"},"app":{"id":"nasij","name":{"en":"Nasij","ar":"نسيج"},"color":"#B45309","icon":"house-line","domain":"nasij.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Help","ar":"المساعدة"},"back":true},"gray":true,"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Returns","ar":"الإرجاع"}},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"You can return most items within 14 days. To start, read","ar":"يمكنك إرجاع أغلب المنتجات خلال 14 يومًا. لتبدأ، اقرأ"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"text","color":"brand","text":{"en":"our return guide.","ar":"دليل الإرجاع."},"gap":"xs"}]},"options":[{"id":"red","text":{"en":"Make the link red, so it stands out more","ar":"اجعل الرابط أحمر، ليبرز أكثر"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change, in grayscale","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير، بالأبيض والأسود"},"app":{"id":"nasij","name":{"en":"Nasij","ar":"نسيج"},"color":"#B45309","icon":"house-line","domain":"nasij.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Help","ar":"المساعدة"},"back":true},"gray":true,"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Returns","ar":"الإرجاع"}},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"You can return most items within 14 days. To start, read","ar":"يمكنك إرجاع أغلب المنتجات خلال 14 يومًا. لتبدأ، اقرأ"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"text","color":"red","text":{"en":"our return guide.","ar":"دليل الإرجاع."},"gap":"xs"}]}},{"id":"underline","text":{"en":"Keep it purple and underline it","ar":"أبقِه بنفسجيًا وضع تحته خطًا"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change, in grayscale","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير، بالأبيض والأسود"},"app":{"id":"nasij","name":{"en":"Nasij","ar":"نسيج"},"color":"#B45309","icon":"house-line","domain":"nasij.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Help","ar":"المساعدة"},"back":true},"gray":true,"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Returns","ar":"الإرجاع"}},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"You can return most items within 14 days. To start, read","ar":"يمكنك إرجاع أغلب المنتجات خلال 14 يومًا. لتبدأ، اقرأ"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"link","text":{"en":"our return guide.","ar":"دليل الإرجاع."},"gap":"xs"}]}},{"id":"keep","text":{"en":"Change nothing; purple is our brand's link colour","ar":"لا تغيّر شيئًا؛ البنفسجي هو لون الروابط في هويتنا"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change, in grayscale","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير، بالأبيض والأسود"},"app":{"id":"nasij","name":{"en":"Nasij","ar":"نسيج"},"color":"#B45309","icon":"house-line","domain":"nasij.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Help","ar":"المساعدة"},"back":true},"gray":true,"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Returns","ar":"الإرجاع"}},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"You can return most items within 14 days. To start, read","ar":"يمكنك إرجاع أغلب المنتجات خلال 14 يومًا. لتبدأ، اقرأ"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"text","color":"brand","text":{"en":"our return guide.","ar":"دليل الإرجاع."},"gap":"xs"}]}}],"answer":["underline"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-018","when":["red","keep"],"feedback":{"en":"In grayscale, the link looks like the rest of the sentence. A link needs a sign that isn't colour, like an underline.","ar":"بالأبيض والأسود، يبدو الرابط مثل باقي الجملة. فالرابط يحتاج علامة غير اللون، مثل خط تحته."}}],"hints":[{"en":"In the grayscale screens, can you find the link?","ar":"في الشاشات بالأبيض والأسود، هل تجد الرابط؟"},{"en":"Which option adds something that isn't a colour?","ar":"أي خيار يضيف شيئًا ليس لونًا؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Right. The underline shows the link even without colour.","ar":"صحيح. الخط يُظهر الرابط حتى بدون لون."},"explain":{"en":"An underline is the clearest sign of a link inside text. Red or green links are the worst choice, because those are the colours many people confuse.","ar":"الخط تحت الكلمة هو أوضح علامة للرابط داخل النص. والروابط الحمراء أو الخضراء أسوأ اختيار، لأن كثيرين يخلطون بين هذين اللونين."},"speaker":"karim"},{"id":"S05","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P05-U02-03","part":"guided","rules":["R06"],"value":{"en":"5 Visual Treatments (NN/g): use cues beyond colour, such as strokes or patterns, for important information. A ✕ on taken seats is such a cue.","ar":"5 معالجات بصرية (NN/g): استخدم علامات غير اللون، مثل الخطوط أو النقوش، للمعلومات المهمة. والعلامة ✕ على المقاعد المحجوزة مثال على ذلك."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/visual-treatments-accessibility/","quote":"It is thus important to use additional cues (such as strokes, patterns) to communicate important information."},"scenario":{"en":"A cinema app shows a seat map. Free seats are green and taken seats are red.","ar":"تطبيق سينما يعرض خريطة المقاعد. المقاعد الفارغة خضراء، والمحجوزة حمراء."},"prompt":{"en":"Tap each option to see the change. Which one lets every customer see which seats are taken?","ar":"اضغط على كل خيار لترى التغيير. أي خيار يجعل كل العملاء يعرفون المقاعد المحجوزة؟"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"app":{"id":"shasha","name":{"en":"Shasha","ar":"شاشة"},"color":"#BE185D","icon":"film-strip","domain":"shasha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Pick your seats","ar":"اختر مقاعدك"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Screen this way","ar":"الشاشة في هذا الاتجاه"}},{"kind":"row","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"chip","tone":"bad","text":"A1"},{"kind":"chip","text":"A2"},{"kind":"chip","text":"A3"},{"kind":"chip","tone":"bad","text":"A4"}]},{"kind":"row","gap":"xs","blocks":[{"kind":"chip","text":"B1"},{"kind":"chip","tone":"bad","text":"B2"},{"kind":"chip","tone":"bad","text":"B3"},{"kind":"chip","text":"B4"}]}]},"options":[{"id":"cross","text":{"en":"Show taken seats as grey with a ✕ instead of a number","ar":"اعرض المقاعد المحجوزة باللون الرمادي مع ✕ بدل الرقم"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"shasha","name":{"en":"Shasha","ar":"شاشة"},"color":"#BE185D","icon":"film-strip","domain":"shasha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Pick your seats","ar":"اختر مقاعدك"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Screen this way","ar":"الشاشة في هذا الاتجاه"}},{"kind":"row","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"chip","tone":"off","text":"✕"},{"kind":"chip","text":"A2"},{"kind":"chip","text":"A3"},{"kind":"chip","tone":"off","text":"✕"}]},{"kind":"row","gap":"xs","blocks":[{"kind":"chip","text":"B1"},{"kind":"chip","tone":"off","text":"✕"},{"kind":"chip","tone":"off","text":"✕"},{"kind":"chip","text":"B4"}]}]}},{"id":"darker","text":{"en":"Use a darker green and a darker red","ar":"استخدم أخضر أغمق وأحمر أغمق"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"shasha","name":{"en":"Shasha","ar":"شاشة"},"color":"#BE185D","icon":"film-strip","domain":"shasha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Pick your seats","ar":"اختر مقاعدك"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Screen this way","ar":"الشاشة في هذا الاتجاه"}},{"kind":"row","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"chip","tone":"bad","weight":"bold","text":"A1"},{"kind":"chip","tone":"dark","text":"A2"},{"kind":"chip","tone":"dark","text":"A3"},{"kind":"chip","tone":"bad","weight":"bold","text":"A4"}]},{"kind":"row","gap":"xs","blocks":[{"kind":"chip","tone":"dark","text":"B1"},{"kind":"chip","tone":"bad","weight":"bold","text":"B2"},{"kind":"chip","tone":"bad","weight":"bold","text":"B3"},{"kind":"chip","tone":"dark","text":"B4"}]}]}},{"id":"legend","text":{"en":"Add a key under the map: \"Green: free · Red: taken\"","ar":"أضف مفتاحًا للألوان تحت الخريطة: «أخضر: فارغ · أحمر: محجوز»"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"shasha","name":{"en":"Shasha","ar":"شاشة"},"color":"#BE185D","icon":"film-strip","domain":"shasha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Pick your seats","ar":"اختر مقاعدك"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Screen this way","ar":"الشاشة في هذا الاتجاه"}},{"kind":"row","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"chip","tone":"bad","text":"A1"},{"kind":"chip","text":"A2"},{"kind":"chip","text":"A3"},{"kind":"chip","tone":"bad","text":"A4"}]},{"kind":"row","gap":"xs","blocks":[{"kind":"chip","text":"B1"},{"kind":"chip","tone":"bad","text":"B2"},{"kind":"chip","tone":"bad","text":"B3"},{"kind":"chip","text":"B4"}]},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Green: free · Red: taken","ar":"أخضر: فارغ · أحمر: محجوز"},"gap":"s"}]}}],"answer":["cross"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-018","when":["darker"],"feedback":{"en":"Darker red and green are still red and green. People who confuse them still see one colour.","ar":"الأحمر والأخضر الأغمق ما زالا أحمر وأخضر. ومن يخلط بينهما ما زال يرى لونًا واحدًا."}},{"id":"MC-P05-019","when":["legend"],"feedback":{"en":"The key only explains the colours. To use it, you still have to tell red from green.","ar":"المفتاح يشرح الألوان فقط. ولتستفيد منه، ما زلت تحتاج أن تفرّق بين الأحمر والأخضر."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Picture the map with red and green looking the same.","ar":"تخيّل الخريطة والأحمر والأخضر يبدوان بنفس اللون."},{"en":"Which option changes the shape on the seat, not only its colour?","ar":"أي خيار يغيّر الشكل على المقعد، لا لونه فقط؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Right. The ✕ shows a taken seat without any colour.","ar":"صحيح. العلامة ✕ تُظهر المقعد المحجوز بدون أي لون."},"explain":{"en":"A key that explains colours doesn't help people who can't see the colours. Change the seat itself.","ar":"مفتاح الألوان لا يفيد من لا يرى الألوان. غيّر المقعد نفسه."},"speaker":"karim"},{"id":"S06","type":"compare","skill":"SK-P05-U02-03","part":"contrast","confidence":true,"rules":["R11"],"value":{"en":"Contrast: coloured words vs coloured bars. Guidelines for Visualizing Links (NN/g): green \"okay\" and red \"error\" are fine, because the different words are the extra cue.","ar":"مقارنة: كلمات ملوّنة مقابل أشرطة ملوّنة. إرشادات لإظهار الروابط (NN/g): «تم» بالأخضر و«خطأ» بالأحمر لا مشكلة فيهما، لأن اختلاف الكلمات هو العلامة الإضافية."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/guidelines-for-visualizing-links/","quote":"The fact that the word meanings are clearly different provides the required redundant cue for color-blind users."},"scenario":{"en":"Two designers made the bills screen of a phone company app. You did the grayscale test on both.","ar":"صمّم مصمّمان شاشة الفواتير في تطبيق شركة اتصالات. وأجريت اختبار الأبيض والأسود على التصميمين."},"prompt":{"en":"In grayscale, which screen still shows which bill is unpaid?","ar":"بالأبيض والأسود، أي شاشة ما زالت توضّح أي فاتورة غير مدفوعة؟"},"a":{"label":{"en":"A: Each bill has a green or red bar, with no word","ar":"A: لكل فاتورة شريط أخضر أو أحمر، بدون كلمة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"shabaka","name":{"en":"Shabaka","ar":"شبكة"},"color":"#0891B2","icon":"wifi-high","domain":"shabaka.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Bills","ar":"الفواتير"},"back":true},"gray":true,"blocks":[{"kind":"row","blocks":[{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"September · 220 EGP","ar":"سبتمبر · 220 جنيه"}},{"kind":"chip","text":"▬▬"}]},{"kind":"row","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"October · 240 EGP","ar":"أكتوبر · 240 جنيه"}},{"kind":"chip","tone":"bad","text":"▬▬"}]}]}},"b":{"label":{"en":"B: Each bill says \"Paid\" in green or \"Unpaid\" in red","ar":"B: كل فاتورة مكتوب عليها «مدفوعة» بالأخضر أو «غير مدفوعة» بالأحمر"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"shabaka","name":{"en":"Shabaka","ar":"شبكة"},"color":"#0891B2","icon":"wifi-high","domain":"shabaka.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Bills","ar":"الفواتير"},"back":true},"gray":true,"blocks":[{"kind":"row","blocks":[{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"September · 220 EGP","ar":"سبتمبر · 220 جنيه"}},{"kind":"chip","text":{"en":"Paid","ar":"مدفوعة"}}]},{"kind":"row","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"October · 240 EGP","ar":"أكتوبر · 240 جنيه"}},{"kind":"chip","tone":"bad","text":{"en":"Unpaid","ar":"غير مدفوعة"}}]}]}},"answer":"b","reason":{"prompt":{"en":"Why does B pass the test even though it uses red and green?","ar":"لماذا ينجح B في الاختبار مع أنه يستخدم الأحمر والأخضر؟"},"options":[{"id":"green","text":{"en":"Green is easy to see for everyone","ar":"الأخضر سهل الرؤية للجميع"}},{"id":"words","text":{"en":"The words are different, so colour is only extra help","ar":"الكلمات مختلفة، فاللون مجرد مساعدة إضافية"}},{"id":"chips","text":{"en":"Rounded chips are always clearer than bars","ar":"الـ Chips المستديرة أوضح دائمًا من الأشرطة"}}],"answer":["words"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-018","when":["green","chips"],"feedback":{"en":"The shape and colour are the same in A and B. What B adds is a word that means something different.","ar":"الشكل واللون نفسهما في A وB. ما يضيفه B هو كلمة لها معنى مختلف."}}]},"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-018","when":["a"],"feedback":{"en":"In grayscale, A's two bars look almost the same. B's words still say \"Paid\" and \"Unpaid\".","ar":"بالأبيض والأسود، يبدو الشريطان في A متشابهين تقريبًا. أما كلمات B فما زالت تقول «مدفوعة» و«غير مدفوعة»."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Look at both screens. Can you read the bill status in each?","ar":"انظر إلى الشاشتين. هل تستطيع قراءة حالة الفاتورة في كل منهما؟"},{"en":"Which screen gives the status in words?","ar":"أي شاشة تعطي الحالة بالكلمات؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Colour is fine when the words already tell the story.","ar":"صحيح. اللون لا مشكلة فيه حين تقول الكلمات المعنى أصلًا."},"explain":{"en":"You don't have to remove colour. Just make sure it's never the only sign.","ar":"لست مضطرًا لحذف اللون. فقط تأكّد أنه ليس العلامة الوحيدة أبدًا."},"speaker":"karim"},{"id":"S07","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P05-U02-03","part":"independent","speaker":"nour","rules":["R14"],"value":{"en":"New case. 5 Visual Treatments (NN/g): the grayscale trick. If you can't understand the design in grayscale, you need a cue besides colour.","ar":"حالة جديدة. 5 معالجات بصرية (NN/g): حيلة الأبيض والأسود. إذا لم تفهم التصميم بالأبيض والأسود، فأنت تحتاج علامة غير اللون."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/visual-treatments-accessibility/","quote":"Turn your design into grayscale and see if you can correctly understand the design."},"scenario":{"en":"Patients book a doctor at our clinic through a calendar. Days with free times are green. Full days are red.","ar":"يحجز المرضى موعدًا مع الطبيب في عيادتنا عبر تقويم. الأيام التي فيها مواعيد شاغرة خضراء، والأيام الممتلئة حمراء."},"prompt":{"en":"Tap each option to see the change. Which one lets every patient see which days are full?","ar":"اضغط على كل خيار لترى التغيير. أي خيار يجعل كل المرضى يعرفون الأيام الممتلئة؟"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Book a visit","ar":"احجز زيارة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Pick a day in November","ar":"اختر يومًا في نوفمبر"}},{"kind":"row","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"chip","text":"5"},{"kind":"chip","tone":"bad","text":"6"},{"kind":"chip","text":"7"}]},{"kind":"row","gap":"xs","blocks":[{"kind":"chip","tone":"bad","text":"8"},{"kind":"chip","text":"9"},{"kind":"chip","tone":"bad","text":"11"}]}]},"options":[{"id":"legend","text":{"en":"Add a key: \"Green: free · Red: full\"","ar":"أضف مفتاحًا للألوان: «أخضر: متاح للحجز · أحمر: ممتلئ»"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Book a visit","ar":"احجز زيارة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Pick a day in November","ar":"اختر يومًا في نوفمبر"}},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Green: free · Red: full","ar":"أخضر: متاح للحجز · أحمر: ممتلئ"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"row","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"chip","text":"5"},{"kind":"chip","tone":"bad","text":"6"},{"kind":"chip","text":"7"}]},{"kind":"row","gap":"xs","blocks":[{"kind":"chip","tone":"bad","text":"8"},{"kind":"chip","text":"9"},{"kind":"chip","tone":"bad","text":"11"}]}]}},{"id":"full","text":{"en":"Grey out full days and write \"Full\" on them","ar":"اجعل الأيام الممتلئة رمادية واكتب عليها «ممتلئ»"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Book a visit","ar":"احجز زيارة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Pick a day in November","ar":"اختر يومًا في نوفمبر"}},{"kind":"row","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"chip","text":"5"},{"kind":"chip","tone":"off","text":{"en":"6 · Full","ar":"6 · ممتلئ"}},{"kind":"chip","text":"7"}]},{"kind":"row","gap":"xs","blocks":[{"kind":"chip","tone":"off","text":{"en":"8 · Full","ar":"8 · ممتلئ"}},{"kind":"chip","text":"9"},{"kind":"chip","tone":"off","text":{"en":"11 · Full","ar":"11 · ممتلئ"}}]}]}},{"id":"tap","text":{"en":"When a patient taps a full day, show \"This day is full\"","ar":"حين يضغط المريض على يوم ممتلئ، اعرض «هذا اليوم ممتلئ»"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Book a visit","ar":"احجز زيارة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Pick a day in November","ar":"اختر يومًا في نوفمبر"}},{"kind":"row","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"chip","text":"5"},{"kind":"chip","tone":"bad","text":"6"},{"kind":"chip","text":"7"}]},{"kind":"row","gap":"xs","blocks":[{"kind":"chip","tone":"bad","text":"8"},{"kind":"chip","text":"9"},{"kind":"chip","tone":"bad","text":"11"}]},{"kind":"banner","text":{"en":"After tapping 6: \"This day is full.\"","ar":"بعد الضغط على 6: «هذا اليوم ممتلئ.»"},"gap":"s"}]}}],"answer":["full"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-019","when":["legend"],"feedback":{"en":"The key still asks patients to tell red from green. Do the grayscale test: the days still look alike.","ar":"المفتاح ما زال يطلب من المريض أن يفرّق بين الأحمر والأخضر. جرّب اختبار الأبيض والأسود: الأيام ما زالت متشابهة."}},{"id":"MC-P05-018","when":["tap"],"feedback":{"en":"Patients find out only after tapping each day. Before they tap, the calendar still shows full days by colour alone.","ar":"المريض يعرف فقط بعد أن يضغط على كل يوم. وقبل الضغط، ما زال التقويم يُظهر الأيام الممتلئة باللون وحده."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Picture each option in black and white.","ar":"تخيّل كل خيار بالأبيض والأسود."},{"en":"Which option adds a word?","ar":"أي خيار يضيف كلمة؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Right. \"Full\" works in any colour, for every patient.","ar":"صحيح. كلمة «ممتلئ» يفهمها كل المرضى، بأي لون كانت."},"explain":{"en":"Before you finish a screen, check it in grayscale. If something is lost, add a word, an icon or a mark.","ar":"قبل أن تُنهي أي شاشة، افحصها بالأبيض والأسود. وإذا ضاع شيء، أضف كلمة أو أيقونة أو علامة."}},{"id":"S08","type":"card","part":"recap","icons":["text","ok","color","eye"],"title":{"en":"What you did","ar":"ماذا تعلّمت"},"body":{"en":"- **Words with colour:** you wrote each order's status next to its dot.\n- **Shapes with colour:** you marked taken seats with a ✕.\n- **Links:** you underlined a link so it shows without colour.\n- **Grayscale test:** you checked which screen still made sense in black and white.\n\nNext lesson: text on photos and dark screens.","ar":"- **كلمات مع اللون:** كتبت حالة كل طلب بجانب نقطته.\n- **أشكال مع اللون:** علّمت المقاعد المحجوزة بـ ✕.\n- **الروابط:** وضعت خطًا تحت الرابط ليظهر بدون لون.\n- **اختبار الأبيض والأسود:** عرفت أي شاشة ما زالت مفهومة بالأبيض والأسود.\n\nالدرس التالي: النص فوق الصور وفي الشاشات الداكنة."}}]}$uxg$::jsonb),
  ($uxg$P05-U02-L03$uxg$, $uxg$0ef026923a775885789b56aeaa3629fc6a1b0ff9a7252f0c068f01d5ce7abd53$uxg$, $uxg${"id":"P05-U02-L03","mode":"lesson","minutes":7,"title":{"en":"Text on photos and dark screens","ar":"النص فوق الصور وفي الشاشات الداكنة"},"summary":{"en":"Keep white text readable on trip photos, and fix colours and cards in dark mode.","ar":"اجعل النص الأبيض مقروءًا فوق صور الرحلات، وأصلح الألوان والبطاقات في الوضع الداكن."},"speaker":"rami","review_labels":{"MC-P05-020":{"en":"White text needs a dark area behind it","ar":"النص الأبيض يحتاج منطقة غامقة خلفه"},"MC-P05-021":{"en":"Check the lightest photo that can appear","ar":"افحص أفتح صورة يمكن أن تظهر"},"MC-P05-022":{"en":"Strong colours blur on dark screens","ar":"الألوان القوية تتشوّش على الشاشات الداكنة"},"MC-P05-023":{"en":"Thin lines vanish on dark; use lighter cards","ar":"الخطوط الرفيعة تختفي على الداكن؛ استخدم بطاقات أفتح"}},"steps":[{"id":"S01","type":"card","part":"hook","title":{"en":"Beautiful trip photos","ar":"صور رحلات جميلة"},"body":{"en":"Our travel app shows each trip as a big photo with the place name in white on top. In the design file it looked great.\n\nIn the live app, people scroll past some trips without reading their names.","ar":"يعرض تطبيق الرحلات عندنا كل رحلة كصورة كبيرة، واسم المكان مكتوب فوقها بالأبيض. في ملف التصميم كان الشكل رائعًا.\n\nلكن في التطبيق الفعلي، يمرّ الناس على بعض الرحلات دون أن يقرؤوا أسماءها."},"mock":{"app":{"id":"zad","name":{"en":"Zad Travel","ar":"زاد للسفر"},"color":"#6D28D9","icon":"airplane-tilt","domain":"zad.example"},"appbar":{"logo":true,"actions":[{"icon":"magnifying-glass","aria":{"en":"Search","ar":"بحث"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","size":"m","tone":"photo-dark","text":{"en":"Cairo by night","ar":"القاهرة ليلًا"}},{"kind":"image","size":"m","tone":"photo-light","text":{"en":"Siwa · 3 nights","ar":"سيوة · 3 ليالٍ"},"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"S02","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P05-U02-04","part":"try","rules":["R12"],"value":{"en":"Try first. Text Over Images (NN/g): light or faded backgrounds don't suit white text because the colours are too similar; darken the background behind the text.","ar":"جرّب أولًا. النص فوق الصور (NN/g): الخلفيات الفاتحة أو الباهتة لا تناسب النص الأبيض لأن اللونين متقاربان جدًا؛ اجعل الخلفية خلف النص أغمق."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/text-over-images/","quote":"Light-colored or faded backgrounds are not well-suited to white text because the colors are too similar."},"prompt":{"en":"Tap each option to see the change. Which one makes the trip name easy to read?","ar":"اضغط على كل خيار لترى التغيير. أي خيار يجعل اسم الرحلة سهل القراءة؟"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"app":{"id":"zad","name":{"en":"Zad Travel","ar":"زاد للسفر"},"color":"#6D28D9","icon":"airplane-tilt","domain":"zad.example"},"appbar":{"logo":true,"actions":[{"icon":"magnifying-glass","aria":{"en":"Search","ar":"بحث"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","size":"l","tone":"photo-light","text":{"en":"Siwa · 3 nights","ar":"سيوة · 3 ليالٍ"}}]},"options":[{"id":"bigger","text":{"en":"Make the white text bigger","ar":"كبّر النص الأبيض"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"zad","name":{"en":"Zad Travel","ar":"زاد للسفر"},"color":"#6D28D9","icon":"airplane-tilt","domain":"zad.example"},"appbar":{"logo":true,"actions":[{"icon":"magnifying-glass","aria":{"en":"Search","ar":"بحث"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","size":"l","tone":"photo-light","px":28,"text":{"en":"Siwa · 3 nights","ar":"سيوة · 3 ليالٍ"}}]}},{"id":"fade","text":{"en":"Add a dark fade at the bottom of the photo, and put the name there","ar":"أضف تدرّجًا غامقًا أسفل الصورة، وضع الاسم هناك"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"zad","name":{"en":"Zad Travel","ar":"زاد للسفر"},"color":"#6D28D9","icon":"airplane-tilt","domain":"zad.example"},"appbar":{"logo":true,"actions":[{"icon":"magnifying-glass","aria":{"en":"Search","ar":"بحث"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","size":"l","tone":"photo-fade","text":{"en":"Siwa · 3 nights","ar":"سيوة · 3 ليالٍ"}}]}},{"id":"busy","text":{"en":"Use a more colourful photo, so the card looks livelier","ar":"استخدم صورة أكثر ألوانًا، لتبدو البطاقة أكثر حيوية"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"zad","name":{"en":"Zad Travel","ar":"زاد للسفر"},"color":"#6D28D9","icon":"airplane-tilt","domain":"zad.example"},"appbar":{"logo":true,"actions":[{"icon":"magnifying-glass","aria":{"en":"Search","ar":"بحث"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","size":"l","tone":"photo-busy","text":{"en":"Siwa · 3 nights","ar":"سيوة · 3 ليالٍ"}}]}}],"answer":["fade"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-020","when":["bigger","busy"],"feedback":{"en":"The text is still white on a light photo. White text needs a dark area right behind it.","ar":"النص ما زال أبيض فوق صورة فاتحة. والنص الأبيض يحتاج منطقة غامقة خلفه مباشرة."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Look at the colour of the photo right behind the words.","ar":"انظر إلى لون الصورة خلف الكلمات مباشرة."},{"en":"Which option makes the area behind the white text darker?","ar":"أي خيار يجعل المنطقة خلف النص الأبيض أغمق؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Right. The dark fade gives the white text a dark background.","ar":"صحيح. التدرّج الغامق يعطي النص الأبيض خلفية غامقة."},"explain":{"en":"Contrast is about what's right behind the text. Darken that part, and you keep the photo too.","ar":"التباين يتعلّق بما خلف النص مباشرة. اجعل هذا الجزء أغمق، وتبقى الصورة كما هي تقريبًا."}},{"id":"S03","type":"card","part":"concept","icons":["contrast","layers","color","group"],"title":{"en":"Photos and dark mode need extra care","ar":"الصور والوضع الداكن يحتاجان عناية إضافية"},"body":{"en":"- **White text needs dark behind it:** on a light or busy photo, darken the part behind the text. Use a dark fade at the bottom, a dark see-through box, or a blur.\n- **Test the worst photo:** a fix that works on one photo can fail on another. Check it on the lightest, busiest photo that can appear.\n- **Dark mode, soft colours:** strong, bright colours (like a deep blue) blur on dark backgrounds. Use softer, lighter versions.\n- **Dark mode, lighter cards:** thin grey lines disappear on dark screens. Put content on cards a bit lighter than the page. The higher the layer, the lighter it is.","ar":"- **النص الأبيض يحتاج خلفية غامقة:** على الصورة الفاتحة أو المزدحمة، اجعل الجزء خلف النص أغمق. استخدم تدرّجًا غامقًا في الأسفل، أو مربعًا غامقًا شفافًا، أو تمويهًا (Blur).\n- **اختبر أسوأ صورة:** الحل الذي ينجح مع صورة قد يفشل مع أخرى. افحصه على أفتح صورة وأكثرها ازدحامًا يمكن أن تظهر.\n- **الوضع الداكن (Dark mode)، ألوان هادئة:** الألوان القوية الزاهية (مثل الأزرق الغامق) تتشوّش على الخلفيات الداكنة. استخدم درجات أهدأ وأفتح منها.\n- **الوضع الداكن، بطاقات أفتح:** الخطوط الرمادية الرفيعة تختفي على الشاشات الداكنة. ضع المحتوى على بطاقات أفتح قليلًا من الصفحة. وكلما كانت الطبقة أعلى، كانت أفتح."}},{"id":"S04","type":"choose","skill":"SK-P05-U02-04","part":"guided","rules":["R06"],"value":{"en":"Text Over Images (NN/g): consider every image that may be used; a fix can work for one image and fail for others, so check the worst-case image.","ar":"النص فوق الصور (NN/g): فكّر في كل الصور التي قد تُستخدم؛ فالحل قد ينجح مع صورة ويفشل مع غيرها، لذلك افحص أسوأ صورة."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/text-over-images/","quote":"ensure that the chosen method will provide a high enough contrast for the worst-case background image and text placement"},"scenario":{"en":"Our designer checked the white trip names on the Cairo night photo, and the contrast passed. The app shows many different photos, like the three below.","ar":"فحصت مصمّمتنا أسماء الرحلات البيضاء على صورة القاهرة ليلًا، ونجح التباين. والتطبيق يعرض صورًا كثيرة مختلفة، مثل الثلاث بالأسفل."},"prompt":{"en":"Before approving, which photo should she check the white names on?","ar":"قبل الموافقة، على أي صورة يجب أن تفحص الأسماء البيضاء؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"zad","name":{"en":"Zad Travel","ar":"زاد للسفر"},"color":"#6D28D9","icon":"airplane-tilt","domain":"zad.example"},"appbar":{"logo":true,"actions":[{"icon":"magnifying-glass","aria":{"en":"Search","ar":"بحث"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","size":"s","tone":"photo-dark","text":{"en":"Cairo by night","ar":"القاهرة ليلًا"}},{"kind":"image","size":"s","tone":"photo-busy","text":{"en":"Khan el-Khalili","ar":"خان الخليلي"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"image","size":"s","tone":"photo-light","text":{"en":"Dahab beach","ar":"شاطئ دهب"},"gap":"s"}]},"options":[{"id":"light","text":{"en":"The beach photo, because it's the lightest","ar":"صورة الشاطئ، لأنها الأفتح"}},{"id":"night","text":{"en":"The Cairo night photo, because it's our most popular trip","ar":"صورة القاهرة ليلًا، لأنها أشهر رحلة عندنا"}},{"id":"none","text":{"en":"No more checks; one photo passed, so the style passes","ar":"لا داعي لفحص آخر؛ نجحت صورة واحدة، إذن نجح الشكل كله"}}],"answer":["light"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-021","when":["night","none"],"feedback":{"en":"White text is easy on a dark photo. The real test is the lightest photo, where white text is hardest to read.","ar":"النص الأبيض سهل على الصورة الغامقة. والاختبار الحقيقي هو أفتح صورة، حيث يكون النص الأبيض أصعب في القراءة."}}],"hints":[{"en":"On which photo is the white name hardest to read?","ar":"على أي صورة يكون الاسم الأبيض أصعب في القراءة؟"},{"en":"If the text passes on the hardest photo, it passes on the easier ones too.","ar":"إذا نجح النص على أصعب صورة، فسينجح على الأسهل أيضًا."}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Test the hardest case: the lightest photo.","ar":"صحيح. اختبر أصعب حالة: أفتح صورة."},"explain":{"en":"Photos change, but the style stays. Make sure it works on the worst photo, and it works on all of them.","ar":"الصور تتغيّر، لكن الشكل ثابت. فإذا نجح مع أسوأ صورة، سينجح مع كل الصور."},"speaker":"rami"},{"id":"S05","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P05-U02-05","part":"guided","rules":["R06"],"value":{"en":"Dark Mode issues (NN/g): highly saturated colours on dark backgrounds have poor visibility and can fail WCAG contrast. Use a lighter, less saturated tone.","ar":"أخطاء الوضع الداكن (NN/g): الألوان شديدة التشبّع على الخلفيات الداكنة ضعيفة الوضوح وقد لا تحقّق تباين WCAG. استخدم درجة أفتح وأقل تشبّعًا."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/dark-mode-users-issues/","quote":"Highly saturated colors on dark backgrounds have poor visibility and do not comply with accessibility guidelines"},"scenario":{"en":"Our app now has dark mode. The designer kept our brand blue for the prices and the \"See trip\" link.","ar":"صار في تطبيقنا وضع داكن (Dark mode). وأبقى المصمّم أزرق هويتنا للأسعار ولرابط «شاهد الرحلة»."},"prompt":{"en":"Tap each option to see the change. Which one makes the price and link easy to read?","ar":"اضغط على كل خيار لترى التغيير. أي خيار يجعل السعر والرابط سهلَي القراءة؟"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"app":{"id":"zad","name":{"en":"Zad Travel","ar":"زاد للسفر"},"color":"#6D28D9","icon":"airplane-tilt","domain":"zad.example"},"theme":"dark","appbar":{"title":{"en":"Trip","ar":"الرحلة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"group","tone":"night","blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"desert","size":"m"},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Siwa · 3 nights","ar":"سيوة · 3 ليالٍ"}},{"kind":"text","color":"neon","text":{"en":"From 4,500 EGP","ar":"من 4,500 جنيه"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"text","color":"neon","text":{"en":"See trip","ar":"شاهد الرحلة"},"gap":"s"}]}]},"options":[{"id":"bold","text":{"en":"Keep the brand blue, but make it bold","ar":"أبقِ أزرق الهوية، لكن اجعله عريضًا (Bold)"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"zad","name":{"en":"Zad Travel","ar":"زاد للسفر"},"color":"#6D28D9","icon":"airplane-tilt","domain":"zad.example"},"theme":"dark","appbar":{"title":{"en":"Trip","ar":"الرحلة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"group","tone":"night","blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"desert","size":"m"},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Siwa · 3 nights","ar":"سيوة · 3 ليالٍ"}},{"kind":"text","color":"neon","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"From 4,500 EGP","ar":"من 4,500 جنيه"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"text","color":"neon","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"See trip","ar":"شاهد الرحلة"},"gap":"s"}]}]}},{"id":"same","text":{"en":"Change nothing; the brand colour must look the same everywhere","ar":"لا تغيّر شيئًا؛ لون الهوية يجب أن يبقى نفسه في كل مكان"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"zad","name":{"en":"Zad Travel","ar":"زاد للسفر"},"color":"#6D28D9","icon":"airplane-tilt","domain":"zad.example"},"theme":"dark","appbar":{"title":{"en":"Trip","ar":"الرحلة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"group","tone":"night","blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"desert","size":"m"},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Siwa · 3 nights","ar":"سيوة · 3 ليالٍ"}},{"kind":"text","color":"neon","text":{"en":"From 4,500 EGP","ar":"من 4,500 جنيه"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"text","color":"neon","text":{"en":"See trip","ar":"شاهد الرحلة"},"gap":"s"}]}]}},{"id":"soft","text":{"en":"In dark mode, use a lighter, softer version of the blue","ar":"في الوضع الداكن، استخدم درجة أفتح وأهدأ من الأزرق"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"zad","name":{"en":"Zad Travel","ar":"زاد للسفر"},"color":"#6D28D9","icon":"airplane-tilt","domain":"zad.example"},"theme":"dark","appbar":{"title":{"en":"Trip","ar":"الرحلة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"group","tone":"night","blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"desert","size":"m"},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Siwa · 3 nights","ar":"سيوة · 3 ليالٍ"}},{"kind":"text","color":"sky","text":{"en":"From 4,500 EGP","ar":"من 4,500 جنيه"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"text","color":"sky","text":{"en":"See trip","ar":"شاهد الرحلة"},"gap":"s"}]}]}}],"answer":["soft"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-022","when":["bold","same"],"feedback":{"en":"A strong blue blurs on a dark background, bold or not. A lighter blue is still your brand, and people can read it.","ar":"الأزرق القوي يتشوّش على الخلفية الداكنة، عريضًا كان أم لا. والأزرق الأفتح ما زال لون هويتك، ويستطيع الناس قراءته."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Look at how the blue sits on the dark background.","ar":"انظر كيف يبدو الأزرق على الخلفية الداكنة."},{"en":"Which option changes the colour itself?","ar":"أي خيار يغيّر اللون نفسه؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Right. A softer blue reads well on dark.","ar":"صحيح. الأزرق الأهدأ سهل القراءة على الداكن."},"explain":{"en":"Dark mode needs its own colour versions. Keep the same colour family, but lighter and less strong.","ar":"الوضع الداكن يحتاج درجات ألوان خاصة به. أبقِ نفس اللون، لكن بدرجة أفتح وأهدأ."},"speaker":"rami"},{"id":"S06","type":"compare","skill":"SK-P05-U02-05","part":"contrast","confidence":true,"rules":["R11"],"value":{"en":"Contrast: thin dividers vs lighter cards on dark. Dark Mode issues (NN/g): thin grey dividers get swallowed on very dark backgrounds; use the lightest colours for elements on top.","ar":"مقارنة: خطوط رفيعة مقابل بطاقات أفتح على الداكن. أخطاء الوضع الداكن (NN/g): الخطوط الرمادية الرفيعة تختفي على الخلفيات الداكنة جدًا؛ استخدم الألوان الأفتح للعناصر التي في الأعلى."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/dark-mode-users-issues/","quote":"Thin, gray dividers are easily swallowed up on very dark backgrounds."},"scenario":{"en":"In dark mode, the \"My bookings\" screen lists three trips. Two designers separated them in different ways.","ar":"في الوضع الداكن، تعرض شاشة «حجوزاتي» ثلاث رحلات. وفصل مصمّمان بينها بطريقتين مختلفتين."},"prompt":{"en":"Which screen makes it clear where each booking starts and ends?","ar":"أي شاشة توضّح أين تبدأ كل رحلة وأين تنتهي؟"},"a":{"label":{"en":"A: Each booking sits on a card a bit lighter than the page","ar":"A: كل رحلة على بطاقة أفتح قليلًا من الصفحة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"zad","name":{"en":"Zad Travel","ar":"زاد للسفر"},"color":"#6D28D9","icon":"airplane-tilt","domain":"zad.example"},"theme":"dark","appbar":{"title":{"en":"My bookings","ar":"حجوزاتي"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"group","tone":"night","blocks":[{"kind":"group","tone":"raised","blocks":[{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Siwa · 12 Dec","ar":"سيوة · 12 ديسمبر"}},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"2 travellers","ar":"مسافران"}}]},{"kind":"group","tone":"raised","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Dahab · 3 Jan","ar":"دهب · 3 يناير"}},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"1 traveller","ar":"مسافر واحد"}}]},{"kind":"group","tone":"raised","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Aswan · 20 Feb","ar":"أسوان · 20 فبراير"}},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"4 travellers","ar":"4 مسافرين"}}]}]}]}},"b":{"label":{"en":"B: Bookings are separated by thin grey lines","ar":"B: الرحلات مفصولة بخطوط رمادية رفيعة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"zad","name":{"en":"Zad Travel","ar":"زاد للسفر"},"color":"#6D28D9","icon":"airplane-tilt","domain":"zad.example"},"theme":"dark","appbar":{"title":{"en":"My bookings","ar":"حجوزاتي"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"group","tone":"night","blocks":[{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Siwa · 12 Dec","ar":"سيوة · 12 ديسمبر"}},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"2 travellers","ar":"مسافران"}},{"kind":"divider","gap":"s"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Dahab · 3 Jan","ar":"دهب · 3 يناير"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"1 traveller","ar":"مسافر واحد"}},{"kind":"divider","gap":"s"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Aswan · 20 Feb","ar":"أسوان · 20 فبراير"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"4 travellers","ar":"4 مسافرين"}}]}]}},"answer":"a","reason":{"prompt":{"en":"Why does A work better in dark mode?","ar":"لماذا A أوضح في الوضع الداكن؟"},"options":[{"id":"lines","text":{"en":"Thin grey lines almost disappear on a dark page; lighter cards stay visible","ar":"الخطوط الرمادية الرفيعة تكاد تختفي على الصفحة الداكنة؛ والبطاقات الأفتح تبقى ظاهرة"}},{"id":"modern","text":{"en":"Cards look more modern than lines","ar":"البطاقات تبدو أحدث من الخطوط"}},{"id":"space","text":{"en":"Cards take less space on the screen","ar":"البطاقات تأخذ مساحة أقل من الشاشة"}}],"answer":["lines"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-023","when":["modern","space"],"feedback":{"en":"It's about seeing, not style. On a dark page, thin grey lines nearly vanish, so the groups blend together.","ar":"الأمر يتعلّق بالرؤية، لا بالشكل. على الصفحة الداكنة، تكاد الخطوط الرفيعة تختفي، فتختلط الرحلات ببعضها."}}]},"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-023","when":["b"],"feedback":{"en":"Look at B: the lines are almost invisible, so the three trips run together. Lighter cards show each one clearly.","ar":"انظر إلى B: الخطوط تكاد لا تُرى، فتختلط الرحلات الثلاث. والبطاقات الأفتح تُظهر كل رحلة بوضوح."}}],"hints":[{"en":"In B, can you see the lines between the trips?","ar":"في B، هل ترى الخطوط بين الرحلات؟"},{"en":"Which way of separating stays visible on a dark page?","ar":"أي طريقة فصل تبقى ظاهرة على صفحة داكنة؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Lighter cards show the groups; thin lines vanish.","ar":"صحيح. البطاقات الأفتح تُظهر المجموعات؛ والخطوط الرفيعة تختفي."},"explain":{"en":"In light mode, shadows show layers. In dark mode, use lighter fills: the page is darkest, and each layer on top is a bit lighter.","ar":"في الوضع الفاتح، الظلال تُظهر الطبقات. وفي الوضع الداكن، استخدم ألوانًا أفتح: الصفحة هي الأغمق، وكل طبقة فوقها أفتح قليلًا."},"speaker":"rami"},{"id":"S07","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P05-U02-04","part":"independent","speaker":"tarek","rules":["R14"],"value":{"en":"New case. Text Over Images (NN/g): use a semi-opaque overlay behind the text, a blur, a text shadow or outline. Asking for darker photos fails as soon as a light photo comes.","ar":"حالة جديدة. النص فوق الصور (NN/g): استخدم طبقة شبه شفافة خلف النص، أو تمويهًا، أو ظلًا أو إطارًا للنص. وطلب صور أغمق يفشل مع أول صورة فاتحة."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/text-over-images/","quote":"Use effects such as a semiopaque overlay (either covering the entire image or just the text portion), a blur, a text shadow or outline, or a combination of these techniques."},"scenario":{"en":"Our restaurant app's home banner shows the dish of the day. The photo changes every day, and the dish name sits on it in white.","ar":"في الشاشة الرئيسية لتطبيق مطعمنا، يعرض البانر طبق اليوم. والصورة تتغيّر كل يوم، واسم الطبق مكتوب فوقها بالأبيض."},"prompt":{"en":"Tap each option to see the change. Which one keeps the name readable on any day's photo?","ar":"اضغط على كل خيار لترى التغيير. أي خيار يُبقي الاسم مقروءًا على صورة أي يوم؟"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"Now (today's photo)","ar":"الآن (صورة اليوم)"},"app":{"id":"lamma","name":{"en":"Lamma","ar":"لمّة"},"color":"#E03131","icon":"bowl-food","domain":"lamma.example"},"appbar":{"logo":true,"actions":[{"icon":"shopping-bag","aria":{"en":"Basket","ar":"السلة"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","size":"l","tone":"photo-light","text":{"en":"Today: Koshari","ar":"طبق اليوم: كشري"}}]},"options":[{"id":"darkphoto","text":{"en":"Ask the photographer to send only dark photos","ar":"اطلب من المصوّر أن يرسل صورًا غامقة فقط"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"lamma","name":{"en":"Lamma","ar":"لمّة"},"color":"#E03131","icon":"bowl-food","domain":"lamma.example"},"appbar":{"logo":true,"actions":[{"icon":"shopping-bag","aria":{"en":"Basket","ar":"السلة"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","size":"l","tone":"photo-dark","text":{"en":"Today: Koshari","ar":"طبق اليوم: كشري"}}]}},{"id":"box","text":{"en":"Put a dark see-through box behind the name","ar":"ضع مربعًا غامقًا شفافًا خلف الاسم"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"lamma","name":{"en":"Lamma","ar":"لمّة"},"color":"#E03131","icon":"bowl-food","domain":"lamma.example"},"appbar":{"logo":true,"actions":[{"icon":"shopping-bag","aria":{"en":"Basket","ar":"السلة"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","size":"l","tone":"photo-box","text":{"en":"Today: Koshari","ar":"طبق اليوم: كشري"}}]}},{"id":"bigger","text":{"en":"Make the name bigger and bold","ar":"كبّر الاسم واجعله عريضًا"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"lamma","name":{"en":"Lamma","ar":"لمّة"},"color":"#E03131","icon":"bowl-food","domain":"lamma.example"},"appbar":{"logo":true,"actions":[{"icon":"shopping-bag","aria":{"en":"Basket","ar":"السلة"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","size":"l","tone":"photo-light","px":28,"text":{"en":"Today: Koshari","ar":"طبق اليوم: كشري"}}]}}],"answer":["box"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-021","when":["darkphoto"],"feedback":{"en":"That works only until a light photo comes. The box works on every photo, light or dark.","ar":"هذا ينجح فقط حتى تأتي صورة فاتحة. أما المربع فيعمل مع كل صورة، فاتحة أو غامقة."}},{"id":"MC-P05-020","when":["bigger"],"feedback":{"en":"Big white text on a light photo is still white on light. It needs a dark area behind it.","ar":"النص الأبيض الكبير على صورة فاتحة ما زال أبيض على فاتح. ويحتاج منطقة غامقة خلفه."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Tomorrow's photo may be light or dark. Which option works for both?","ar":"صورة الغد قد تكون فاتحة أو غامقة. أي خيار يعمل مع الحالتين؟"},{"en":"Which option darkens the area behind the name, whatever the photo?","ar":"أي خيار يجعل المنطقة خلف الاسم أغمق، مهما كانت الصورة؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Right. The box keeps the name readable on any photo.","ar":"صحيح. المربع يُبقي الاسم مقروءًا على أي صورة."},"explain":{"en":"When photos change, fix the design, not the photos. A dark box, a fade or a blur behind the text works every day.","ar":"حين تتغيّر الصور، أصلح التصميم لا الصور. فالمربع الغامق أو التدرّج أو التمويه خلف النص يعمل كل يوم."}},{"id":"S08","type":"card","part":"recap","icons":["contrast","layers","color","group"],"title":{"en":"What you did","ar":"ماذا تعلّمت"},"body":{"en":"- **Dark behind white text:** you added a fade and a box behind names on photos.\n- **Worst photo:** you tested the lightest photo, not the easiest one.\n- **Softer colours:** you used a lighter blue in dark mode.\n- **Lighter cards:** you showed groups on a dark page with cards, not thin lines.\n\nNext: the skill check, with all five ideas from this unit.","ar":"- **خلفية غامقة للنص الأبيض:** أضفت تدرّجًا ومربعًا خلف الأسماء على الصور.\n- **أسوأ صورة:** اختبرت أفتح صورة، لا الأسهل.\n- **ألوان أهدأ:** استخدمت أزرق أفتح في الوضع الداكن.\n- **بطاقات أفتح:** أظهرت المجموعات على الصفحة الداكنة ببطاقات، لا بخطوط رفيعة.\n\nالتالي: اختبار المهارة، بكل الأفكار الخمس في هذه الوحدة."}}]}$uxg$::jsonb),
  ($uxg$P05-U02-L04$uxg$, $uxg$94e331937e3c2c8f46bf99ecc92c0672817ccab61304cf3dab83077a8dd8066e$uxg$, $uxg${"id":"P05-U02-L04","mode":"check","minutes":6,"title":{"en":"Skill check: colour and contrast","ar":"اختبار المهارة: الألوان والتباين"},"summary":{"en":"Check five parts of a shop's new design for contrast and colour, on your own.","ar":"افحص خمسة أجزاء من التصميم الجديد لمتجر من ناحية التباين والألوان، بنفسك."},"speaker":"youssef","steps":[{"id":"S01","type":"card","part":"hook","title":{"en":"Youssef's shop gets a new look","ar":"متجر يوسف في شكله الجديد"},"body":{"en":"I sell phone accessories online. Our app has a new design, with a dark mode too. Before we launch, I want to be sure everyone can see and read it.\n\nYour job: check five parts of the new design.\n\nThis is a skill check: there are no hints, and you'll see your result at the end.","ar":"أبيع إكسسوارات الهواتف أونلاين. ولتطبيقنا تصميم جديد، وفيه وضع داكن أيضًا. وقبل أن نطلقه، أريد أن أتأكّد أن الجميع يستطيعون رؤيته وقراءته.\n\nمهمّتك: افحص خمسة أجزاء من التصميم الجديد.\n\nهذا اختبار مهارة: لا توجد تلميحات، وسترى نتيجتك في النهاية."},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"logo":true,"actions":[{"icon":"magnifying-glass","aria":{"en":"Search","ar":"بحث"}},{"icon":"shopping-cart","aria":{"en":"Basket","ar":"السلة"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","size":"m","tone":"photo-dark","text":{"en":"Sale: up to 30% off","ar":"تخفيضات حتى 30%"}},{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Fast charger 20W","ar":"شاحن سريع 20 واط"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"text","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"350 EGP","ar":"350 جنيه"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Add to cart","ar":"أضف إلى السلة"},"gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"S02","type":"choose","skill":"SK-P05-U02-01","part":"check","rules":["R19"],"value":{"en":"Skill check. 5 Visual Treatments (NN/g): normal text needs at least 4.5:1; large or bold text can go down to 3:1. The 28 px bold headline passes at 3:1; the 12 px footer doesn't.","ar":"اختبار مهارة. 5 معالجات بصرية (NN/g): النص العادي يحتاج 4.5:1 على الأقل؛ والنص الكبير أو العريض يكفيه 3:1. فالعنوان 28 بكسل العريض ينجح بـ 3:1؛ ونص التذييل 12 بكسل لا ينجح."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/visual-treatments-accessibility/","quote":"According to the WCAG, the color-contrast ratio between text and its background should be at least 4.5:1."},"scenario":{"en":"On our home page, the headline and the footer note use the same grey. Its contrast with white is 3:1.","ar":"في الصفحة الرئيسية، العنوان وملاحظة التذييل (Footer) بنفس الرمادي. وتباينه مع الأبيض 3:1."},"prompt":{"en":"Which text must be made darker to meet the minimum contrast?","ar":"أي نص يجب أن نجعله أغمق ليحقّق الحد الأدنى للتباين؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"logo":true,"actions":[{"icon":"magnifying-glass","aria":{"en":"Search","ar":"بحث"}},{"icon":"shopping-cart","aria":{"en":"Basket","ar":"السلة"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"text","px":28,"weight":"bold","color":"pale","text":{"en":"New cables are here","ar":"وصلت الكابلات الجديدة"}},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"28 px, bold","ar":"28 بكسل، عريض"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"divider","gap":"m"},{"kind":"text","px":12,"color":"pale","text":{"en":"Prices include VAT. Delivery in 2–4 days.","ar":"الأسعار شاملة الضريبة. التوصيل خلال 2–4 أيام."},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"12 px, regular","ar":"12 بكسل، عادي"},"gap":"xs"}]},"options":[{"id":"both","text":{"en":"Both texts","ar":"النصّان كلاهما"}},{"id":"headline","text":{"en":"Only the headline","ar":"العنوان فقط"}},{"id":"footer","text":{"en":"Only the footer note","ar":"ملاحظة التذييل فقط"}}],"answer":["footer"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-015","when":["both","headline"],"feedback":{"en":"The headline is large and bold, so 3:1 is enough for it. The small footer note needs 4.5:1.","ar":"العنوان كبير وعريض، فيكفيه 3:1. أما ملاحظة التذييل الصغيرة فتحتاج 4.5:1."}}],"explain":{"en":"From Lesson 1: check size with colour. 3:1 is fine only for large or bold text.","ar":"من الدرس 1: افحص الحجم مع اللون. فالـ 3:1 يكفي فقط للنص الكبير أو العريض."},"speaker":"youssef"},{"id":"S03","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P05-U02-02","part":"check","rules":["R19"],"value":{"en":"Skill check. Low-Contrast Text (NN/g): disabled features are dimmed or greyed out by convention, so a pale \"Cancel order\" looks unavailable. Make it smaller and lower, not paler.","ar":"اختبار مهارة. النص منخفض التباين (NN/g): المتعارف عليه أن العناصر المعطّلة باهتة أو رمادية، فيبدو «إلغاء الطلب» الباهت غير متوفّر. صغّره وانقله للأسفل، ولا تجعله باهتًا."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/low-contrast/","quote":"by convention, disabled features are dimmed or grayed out. Low contrast treatments risk sending users the wrong signal about the availability of an option."},"scenario":{"en":"On the order page, \"Track order\" is the main button. \"Cancel order\" is less important, so the designer made it light grey.","ar":"في صفحة الطلب، «تتبّع الطلب» هو الزر الأساسي. و«إلغاء الطلب» أقل أهمية، فجعله المصمّم رماديًا فاتحًا."},"prompt":{"en":"Tap each option to see the change. Which one keeps \"Cancel order\" less loud, but clearly working?","ar":"اضغط على كل خيار لترى التغيير. أي خيار يجعل «إلغاء الطلب» أقل بروزًا، مع بقائه واضحًا كزر يعمل؟"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Order 2210","ar":"الطلب 2210"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Order 2210","ar":"طلب 2210"}},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Arrives Thursday","ar":"يصل يوم الخميس"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Track order","ar":"تتبّع الطلب"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"button","style":"plain","color":"faint","text":{"en":"Cancel order","ar":"إلغاء الطلب"},"gap":"s"}]},"options":[{"id":"keep","text":{"en":"Keep it light grey; it should look less important","ar":"أبقِه رماديًا فاتحًا؛ يجب أن يبدو أقل أهمية"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Order 2210","ar":"الطلب 2210"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Order 2210","ar":"طلب 2210"}},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Arrives Thursday","ar":"يصل يوم الخميس"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Track order","ar":"تتبّع الطلب"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"button","style":"plain","color":"faint","text":{"en":"Cancel order","ar":"إلغاء الطلب"},"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"plain","text":{"en":"Make it a small text button in dark grey, with space above it","ar":"اجعله زرًا نصيًا صغيرًا بالرمادي الغامق، مع مسافة فوقه"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Order 2210","ar":"الطلب 2210"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Order 2210","ar":"طلب 2210"}},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Arrives Thursday","ar":"يصل يوم الخميس"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Track order","ar":"تتبّع الطلب"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"button","style":"plain","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Cancel order","ar":"إلغاء الطلب"},"gap":"l"}]}},{"id":"red","text":{"en":"Make it a filled red button, so nobody misses it","ar":"اجعله زرًا أحمر ممتلئًا، حتى لا يغفل عنه أحد"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Order 2210","ar":"الطلب 2210"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Order 2210","ar":"طلب 2210"}},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Arrives Thursday","ar":"يصل يوم الخميس"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Track order","ar":"تتبّع الطلب"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"button","style":"danger","text":{"en":"Cancel order","ar":"إلغاء الطلب"},"gap":"s"}]}}],"answer":["plain"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-016","when":["keep"],"feedback":{"en":"Light grey looks turned off, so customers who need to cancel may think they can't.","ar":"الرمادي الفاتح يبدو معطّلًا، فقد يظن العميل الذي يريد الإلغاء أنه لا يستطيع."}},{"id":"MC-P05-017","when":["red"],"feedback":{"en":"Now Cancel is as loud as Track. Make it quieter with size and space, while keeping it dark.","ar":"الآن صار الإلغاء بارزًا مثل التتبّع. قلّل بروزه بالحجم والمسافة، مع إبقائه غامقًا."}}],"explain":{"en":"From Lesson 1: make things quieter with size, place and space, not with pale grey.","ar":"من الدرس 1: قلّل بروز العناصر بالحجم والمكان والمسافة، لا بالرمادي الفاتح."},"speaker":"youssef"},{"id":"S04","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P05-U02-03","part":"check","rules":["R19"],"value":{"en":"Skill check. 5 Visual Treatments (NN/g): if you're not sure colour is enough, try the grayscale trick. Selected filters shown only by fill colour fail it; a ✓ passes.","ar":"اختبار مهارة. 5 معالجات بصرية (NN/g): إذا لم تكن متأكّدًا أن اللون يكفي، جرّب حيلة الأبيض والأسود. والفلاتر المختارة التي يميّزها لون الخلفية فقط تفشل فيها؛ والعلامة ✓ تنجح."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/visual-treatments-accessibility/","quote":"try the grayscale trick"},"scenario":{"en":"Customers filter cables by type. A selected filter turns green; the others stay grey. The screens below are in grayscale.","ar":"يختار العملاء نوع الكابل من الفلاتر (Filters). الفلتر المختار يصير أخضر، والباقي يبقى رماديًا. والشاشات بالأسفل بالأبيض والأسود."},"prompt":{"en":"Tap each option to see the change. Which one shows the selected filters in grayscale?","ar":"اضغط على كل خيار لترى التغيير. أي خيار يُظهر الفلاتر المختارة بالأبيض والأسود؟"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"Now, in grayscale","ar":"الآن، بالأبيض والأسود"},"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Cables","ar":"الكابلات"},"back":true},"gray":true,"blocks":[{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Cable type","ar":"نوع الكابل"}},{"kind":"row","gap":"xs","blocks":[{"kind":"chip","text":"USB-C"},{"kind":"chip","tone":"off","text":"Lightning"},{"kind":"chip","text":"Micro-USB"}]}]},"options":[{"id":"check","text":{"en":"Add a ✓ to each selected filter","ar":"أضف ✓ إلى كل فلتر مختار"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change, in grayscale","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير، بالأبيض والأسود"},"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Cables","ar":"الكابلات"},"back":true},"gray":true,"blocks":[{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Cable type","ar":"نوع الكابل"}},{"kind":"row","gap":"xs","blocks":[{"kind":"chip","text":"✓ USB-C"},{"kind":"chip","tone":"off","text":"Lightning"},{"kind":"chip","text":"✓ Micro-USB"}]}]}},{"id":"brighter","text":{"en":"Use a brighter green for selected filters","ar":"استخدم أخضر أقوى للفلاتر المختارة"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change, in grayscale","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير، بالأبيض والأسود"},"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Cables","ar":"الكابلات"},"back":true},"gray":true,"blocks":[{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Cable type","ar":"نوع الكابل"}},{"kind":"row","gap":"xs","blocks":[{"kind":"chip","tone":"dark","text":"USB-C"},{"kind":"chip","tone":"off","text":"Lightning"},{"kind":"chip","tone":"dark","text":"Micro-USB"}]}]}},{"id":"key","text":{"en":"Add a note: \"Green filters are on\"","ar":"أضف ملاحظة: «الفلاتر الخضراء مفعّلة»"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change, in grayscale","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير، بالأبيض والأسود"},"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Cables","ar":"الكابلات"},"back":true},"gray":true,"blocks":[{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Cable type · Green filters are on","ar":"نوع الكابل · الفلاتر الخضراء مفعّلة"}},{"kind":"row","gap":"xs","blocks":[{"kind":"chip","text":"USB-C"},{"kind":"chip","tone":"off","text":"Lightning"},{"kind":"chip","text":"Micro-USB"}]}]}}],"answer":["check"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-018","when":["brighter"],"feedback":{"en":"A brighter green is still only colour. In grayscale, the filters still look almost the same.","ar":"الأخضر الأقوى ما زال لونًا فقط. وبالأبيض والأسود، ما زالت الفلاتر متشابهة تقريبًا."}},{"id":"MC-P05-019","when":["key"],"feedback":{"en":"The note explains the colour, but you still need to see green to use it.","ar":"الملاحظة تشرح اللون، لكنك ما زلت تحتاج أن ترى الأخضر لتستفيد منها."}}],"explain":{"en":"From Lesson 2: give every colour a second sign, and check in grayscale.","ar":"من الدرس 2: أعطِ كل لون علامة ثانية، وافحص بالأبيض والأسود."},"speaker":"youssef"},{"id":"S05","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P05-U02-04","part":"check","rules":["R19"],"value":{"en":"Skill check. Text Over Images (NN/g): consider all possible images before choosing a technique; a fix can work for one photo and fail for others. A dark fade works for every photo.","ar":"اختبار مهارة. النص فوق الصور (NN/g): فكّر في كل الصور المحتملة قبل اختيار الحل؛ فالحل قد ينجح مع صورة ويفشل مع أخرى. والتدرّج الغامق يعمل مع كل الصور."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/text-over-images/","quote":"Consider all possible images that may be used before deciding on a technique for handling text-overlay contrast."},"scenario":{"en":"Our sale banner puts white text straight on the product photo. It looked fine this week, on black headphones. Next week's photo is white earbuds.","ar":"بانر التخفيضات يضع النص الأبيض مباشرة على صورة المنتج. وكان واضحًا هذا الأسبوع، على سماعات سوداء. وصورة الأسبوع القادم سماعات بيضاء."},"prompt":{"en":"Tap each option to see the change. Which one keeps the banner text readable every week?","ar":"اضغط على كل خيار لترى التغيير. أي خيار يُبقي نص البانر مقروءًا كل أسبوع؟"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"Now (next week's photo)","ar":"الآن (صورة الأسبوع القادم)"},"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"logo":true,"actions":[{"icon":"magnifying-glass","aria":{"en":"Search","ar":"بحث"}},{"icon":"shopping-cart","aria":{"en":"Basket","ar":"السلة"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","size":"l","tone":"photo-light","text":{"en":"Earbuds: 20% off","ar":"سماعات: خصم 20%"}}]},"options":[{"id":"nothing","text":{"en":"Change nothing; it passed this week","ar":"لا تغيّر شيئًا؛ فقد نجح هذا الأسبوع"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"logo":true,"actions":[{"icon":"magnifying-glass","aria":{"en":"Search","ar":"بحث"}},{"icon":"shopping-cart","aria":{"en":"Basket","ar":"السلة"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","size":"l","tone":"photo-light","text":{"en":"Earbuds: 20% off","ar":"سماعات: خصم 20%"}}]}},{"id":"darkphoto","text":{"en":"Shoot the earbuds on a dark table instead","ar":"صوّر السماعات على طاولة غامقة بدلًا من ذلك"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"logo":true,"actions":[{"icon":"magnifying-glass","aria":{"en":"Search","ar":"بحث"}},{"icon":"shopping-cart","aria":{"en":"Basket","ar":"السلة"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","size":"l","tone":"photo-dark","text":{"en":"Earbuds: 20% off","ar":"سماعات: خصم 20%"}}]}},{"id":"fade","text":{"en":"Add a dark fade at the bottom of the banner, and put the text there","ar":"أضف تدرّجًا غامقًا أسفل البانر، وضع النص هناك"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"logo":true,"actions":[{"icon":"magnifying-glass","aria":{"en":"Search","ar":"بحث"}},{"icon":"shopping-cart","aria":{"en":"Basket","ar":"السلة"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","size":"l","tone":"photo-fade","text":{"en":"Earbuds: 20% off","ar":"سماعات: خصم 20%"}}]}}],"answer":["fade"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-021","when":["nothing","darkphoto"],"feedback":{"en":"That fixes one week. The next light photo brings the problem back. A fade behind the text works for every photo.","ar":"هذا يُصلح أسبوعًا واحدًا. وأول صورة فاتحة بعدها تُعيد المشكلة. والتدرّج خلف النص يعمل مع كل الصور."}}],"explain":{"en":"From Lesson 3: put a dark area behind white text, and make sure it works on the lightest photo.","ar":"من الدرس 3: ضع منطقة غامقة خلف النص الأبيض، وتأكّد أنها تعمل مع أفتح صورة."},"speaker":"youssef"},{"id":"S06","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P05-U02-05","part":"check","rules":["R19"],"value":{"en":"Skill check. Dark Mode issues (NN/g): use the darkest colours for elements at the bottom and the lightest for elements on top. A filter sheet the same black as the page has no visible edge.","ar":"اختبار مهارة. أخطاء الوضع الداكن (NN/g): استخدم الألوان الأغمق للعناصر في الأسفل، والأفتح للعناصر في الأعلى. ولوحة الفلاتر بنفس سواد الصفحة ليس لها حافة ظاهرة."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/dark-mode-users-issues/","quote":"use the darkest colors for the page elements on the bottom, and the lightest colors for the elements on top"},"scenario":{"en":"In dark mode, tapping \"Filter\" opens a panel over the product list. The panel is the same black as the page.","ar":"في الوضع الداكن، الضغط على «فلترة» يفتح لوحة فوق قائمة المنتجات. واللوحة بنفس سواد الصفحة."},"prompt":{"en":"Tap each option to see the change. Which one shows clearly that the panel sits on top of the list?","ar":"اضغط على كل خيار لترى التغيير. أي خيار يوضّح أن اللوحة فوق القائمة؟"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"theme":"dark","blocks":[{"kind":"group","tone":"night","blocks":[{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Fast charger 20W · 350 EGP","ar":"شاحن سريع 20 واط · 350 جنيه"}},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"USB-C cable · 120 EGP","ar":"كابل USB-C · 120 جنيه"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"divider","gap":"s"},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Filter","ar":"فلترة"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"check","selected":true,"text":{"en":"In stock only","ar":"المتوفّر فقط"},"gap":"xs"}]}]},"options":[{"id":"line","text":{"en":"Add a thin grey line at the top of the panel","ar":"أضف خطًا رماديًا رفيعًا أعلى اللوحة"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"theme":"dark","blocks":[{"kind":"group","tone":"night","blocks":[{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Fast charger 20W · 350 EGP","ar":"شاحن سريع 20 واط · 350 جنيه"}},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"USB-C cable · 120 EGP","ar":"كابل USB-C · 120 جنيه"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"divider","gap":"s"},{"kind":"divider","gap":"xs"},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Filter","ar":"فلترة"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"check","selected":true,"text":{"en":"In stock only","ar":"المتوفّر فقط"},"gap":"xs"}]}]}},{"id":"lighter","text":{"en":"Make the panel a lighter grey than the page","ar":"اجعل اللوحة رمادية أفتح من الصفحة"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"theme":"dark","blocks":[{"kind":"group","tone":"night","blocks":[{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Fast charger 20W · 350 EGP","ar":"شاحن سريع 20 واط · 350 جنيه"}},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"USB-C cable · 120 EGP","ar":"كابل USB-C · 120 جنيه"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"group","tone":"raised","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Filter","ar":"فلترة"}},{"kind":"check","selected":true,"text":{"en":"In stock only","ar":"المتوفّر فقط"},"gap":"xs"}]}]}]}},{"id":"black","text":{"en":"Make the page and the panel pure black","ar":"اجعل الصفحة واللوحة أسود خالصًا"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"theme":"dark","blocks":[{"kind":"group","tone":"night","blocks":[{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Fast charger 20W · 350 EGP","ar":"شاحن سريع 20 واط · 350 جنيه"}},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"USB-C cable · 120 EGP","ar":"كابل USB-C · 120 جنيه"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Filter","ar":"فلترة"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"check","selected":true,"text":{"en":"In stock only","ar":"المتوفّر فقط"},"gap":"xs"}]}]}}],"answer":["lighter"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-023","when":["line","black"],"feedback":{"en":"On a dark screen, thin lines nearly vanish and black on black has no edge. A lighter panel shows it sits on top.","ar":"على الشاشة الداكنة، تكاد الخطوط الرفيعة تختفي، والأسود على الأسود ليس له حافة. أما اللوحة الأفتح فتُظهر أنها فوق القائمة."}}],"explain":{"en":"From Lesson 3: in dark mode, the page is darkest and each layer on top is a bit lighter.","ar":"من الدرس 3: في الوضع الداكن، الصفحة هي الأغمق، وكل طبقة فوقها أفتح قليلًا."},"speaker":"youssef"}]}$uxg$::jsonb),
  ($uxg$P05-U03-L01$uxg$, $uxg$a168eb26c475d8f4cc11dce9204da29de0d95167676f8986fda97b8352beb826$uxg$, $uxg${"id":"P05-U03-L01","mode":"lesson","minutes":7,"title":{"en":"Put the mouse away","ar":"أبعِد الماوس"},"summary":{"en":"Put the mouse away and test a cinema site the way keyboard users meet it.","ar":"أبعِد الماوس واختبر موقع سينما كما يستخدمه من يعتمدون على لوحة المفاتيح."},"speaker":"sara","review_labels":{"MC-P05-024":{"en":"Test by doing the task with the keyboard yourself","ar":"اختبر بأن تُنجز المهمة بلوحة المفاتيح بنفسك"},"MC-P05-025":{"en":"Tab must follow the page order","ar":"يجب أن يتبع Tab ترتيب الصفحة"},"MC-P05-026":{"en":"Hover-only controls are out of keyboard reach","ar":"العناصر التي تظهر بالـ Hover فقط لا يصل إليها مستخدم لوحة المفاتيح"}},"steps":[{"id":"S01","type":"card","part":"hook","title":{"en":"\"I couldn't choose a film\"","ar":"«لم أستطع اختيار فيلم»"},"body":{"en":"I design a cinema booking site. A customer wrote to us: \"My hands shake, so I use the keyboard. I couldn't choose a film.\"\n\nOur whole team uses a mouse, so none of us saw a problem.","ar":"أصمّم موقعًا لحجز تذاكر السينما. كتب لنا أحد العملاء: «يداي ترتجفان، لذلك أستخدم لوحة المفاتيح. ولم أستطع اختيار فيلم.»\n\nكل فريقنا يستخدم الماوس، فلم يرَ أحد منّا أي مشكلة."},"mock":{"app":{"id":"shasha","name":{"en":"Shasha","ar":"شاشة"},"color":"#BE185D","icon":"film-strip","domain":"shasha.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"shasha.example","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Films ▾","ar":"الأفلام ▾"},{"en":"Offers","ar":"العروض"},{"en":"Cinemas","ar":"السينمات"}],"actions":[{"icon":"user"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"city-night","text":{"en":"Now showing: The Lion Path","ar":"يُعرض الآن: درب الأسد"}},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":"● ○ ○ ○","gap":"xs"},{"kind":"button","icon":"ticket","text":{"en":"Book tickets","ar":"احجز التذاكر"},"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"S02","type":"choose","skill":"SK-P05-U03-01","part":"try","rules":["R12"],"value":{"en":"Try first. Keyboard-Only Navigation (NN/g): the quick test is to take your hand off the mouse and use only the keyboard. A checker or the design file can't show what a keyboard user meets.","ar":"جرّب أولًا. التنقّل بلوحة المفاتيح فقط (NN/g): الاختبار السريع أن ترفع يدك عن الماوس وتستخدم لوحة المفاتيح فقط. وأداة الفحص أو ملف التصميم لا يُظهران ما يواجهه مستخدم لوحة المفاتيح."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/keyboard-accessibility/","quote":"Take your hand off your mouse and use only your keyboard."},"prompt":{"en":"What's the fastest way for our team to find what stopped this customer?","ar":"ما أسرع طريقة ليعرف فريقنا ما الذي أوقف هذا العميل؟"},"options":[{"id":"tool","text":{"en":"Run an automatic checker on the home page","ar":"نشغّل أداة فحص تلقائية على الصفحة الرئيسية"}},{"id":"keys","text":{"en":"Put the mouse away and try to book a film with only Tab, Shift+Tab and Enter","ar":"نبعد الماوس، ونحاول حجز فيلم باستخدام Tab وShift+Tab وEnter فقط"}},{"id":"file","text":{"en":"Look through the design file for buttons that are too small","ar":"نراجع ملف التصميم بحثًا عن أزرار صغيرة جدًا"}}],"answer":["keys"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-024","when":["tool","file"],"feedback":{"en":"Neither shows what happens when you press Tab. Doing the task yourself with the keyboard shows exactly where you get stuck.","ar":"لا يُظهر أيٌّ منهما ما يحدث حين تضغط Tab. أما إنجاز المهمة بنفسك بلوحة المفاتيح فيُظهر بالضبط أين تتوقّف."}}],"hints":[{"en":"The customer got stuck while pressing keys. How can we see what they saw?","ar":"توقّف العميل وهو يضغط المفاتيح. كيف نرى ما رآه؟"},{"en":"Which option has us use the site the way the customer does?","ar":"أي خيار يجعلنا نستخدم الموقع كما يستخدمه العميل؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Five minutes without a mouse shows the problem.","ar":"صحيح. خمس دقائق بدون ماوس تكشف المشكلة."},"explain":{"en":"Tab moves forward, Shift+Tab moves back, and Enter opens. Using only these keys, you meet the same walls as keyboard users.","ar":"Tab ينقلك للأمام، وShift+Tab للخلف، وEnter يفتح. وحين تستخدم هذه المفاتيح فقط، تقابل نفس العوائق التي يقابلها مستخدمو لوحة المفاتيح."}},{"id":"S03","type":"card","part":"concept","icons":["person","order","eye","tap"],"title":{"en":"The keyboard test","ar":"اختبار لوحة المفاتيح"},"body":{"en":"- **Who uses the keyboard:** people whose hands shake or tire, blind people with screen readers, and fast \"power\" users.\n- **One by one:** the keyboard moves through links in order. Tab goes forward, Shift+Tab goes back, Enter opens.\n- **The test:** put the mouse away and do the main task from start to end. Check three things: you can always see where you are, you can reach every control, and the order follows the page (top to bottom, start to end of each line).\n- **Hover hides things:** anything that appears only when the mouse is over it, like a menu or carousel arrows, needs a keyboard way in too.","ar":"- **من يستخدم لوحة المفاتيح:** من ترتجف أيديهم أو تتعب، والمكفوفون الذين يستخدمون قارئ الشاشة، والمستخدمون المحترفون الذين يريدون السرعة (Power users).\n- **واحدًا تلو الآخر:** لوحة المفاتيح تتنقّل بين الروابط بالترتيب. Tab للأمام، وShift+Tab للخلف، وEnter للفتح.\n- **الاختبار:** أبعِد الماوس، وأنجز المهمة الأساسية من أولها لآخرها. وتأكّد من ثلاثة أشياء: ترى دائمًا أين أنت، وتصل إلى كل عنصر، والترتيب يتبع الصفحة (من أعلى لأسفل، ومن أول السطر لآخره).\n- **الـ Hover يُخفي أشياء:** أي شيء يظهر فقط حين يمرّ الماوس فوقه، مثل قائمة أو أسهم الـ Carousel، يحتاج طريقًا بلوحة المفاتيح أيضًا."}},{"id":"S04","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P05-U03-01","part":"guided","rules":["R06"],"value":{"en":"Keyboard-Only Navigation (NN/g): in a good test, tabbing follows the page layout, top to bottom. Here Tab jumps to the footer before the times; fix the order, don't move the layout or explain the jumps.","ar":"التنقّل بلوحة المفاتيح فقط (NN/g): في الاختبار الجيد، يتبع Tab ترتيب الصفحة من أعلى لأسفل. وهنا يقفز Tab إلى التذييل قبل المواعيد؛ فأصلح الترتيب، ولا تغيّر التصميم أو تشرح القفزات."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/keyboard-accessibility/","quote":"Tabbing followed the same order as the page layout: left to right and top to bottom in columns."},"scenario":{"en":"We did the test on a film page. The numbers show where Tab went, in order: the title, then \"Contact us\" in the footer, then the show times.","ar":"أجرينا الاختبار على صفحة فيلم. والأرقام تُظهر أين ذهب Tab بالترتيب: العنوان، ثم «تواصل معنا» في التذييل، ثم مواعيد العرض."},"prompt":{"en":"What should we change?","ar":"ماذا نغيّر حتى لا يُربك Tab من يتنقّل في الصفحة بلوحة المفاتيح؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"shasha","name":{"en":"Shasha","ar":"شاشة"},"color":"#BE185D","icon":"film-strip","domain":"shasha.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"shasha.example/films/the-lion-path","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Films ▾","ar":"الأفلام ▾"},{"en":"Offers","ar":"العروض"},{"en":"Cinemas","ar":"السينمات"}],"active":0},"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"① The Lion Path","ar":"① درب الأسد"}},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Family · 2 h 05 min · City Stars","ar":"عائلي · ساعتان و5 دقائق · سيتي ستارز"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"row","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"chip","text":"③ 18:00"},{"kind":"chip","text":"④ 21:00"}]},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"⑤ Book tickets","ar":"⑤ احجز التذاكر"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"divider","gap":"m"},{"kind":"row","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"② Contact us","ar":"② تواصل معنا"}},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Privacy","ar":"الخصوصية"}},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":"© Shasha"}]}],"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"}},"options":[{"id":"move","text":{"en":"Move \"Contact us\" up, under the title, to match where Tab goes","ar":"ننقل «تواصل معنا» للأعلى، تحت العنوان، ليطابق الترتيب الذي يمشي به Tab"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"shasha","name":{"en":"Shasha","ar":"شاشة"},"color":"#BE185D","icon":"film-strip","domain":"shasha.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"shasha.example/films/the-lion-path","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Films ▾","ar":"الأفلام ▾"},{"en":"Offers","ar":"العروض"},{"en":"Cinemas","ar":"السينمات"}],"active":0},"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"① The Lion Path","ar":"① درب الأسد"}},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Family · 2 h 05 min · City Stars","ar":"عائلي · ساعتان و5 دقائق · سيتي ستارز"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"② Contact us","ar":"② تواصل معنا"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"row","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"chip","text":"③ 18:00"},{"kind":"chip","text":"④ 21:00"}]},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"⑤ Book tickets","ar":"⑤ احجز التذاكر"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"divider","gap":"m"},{"kind":"row","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Privacy","ar":"الخصوصية"}},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":"© Shasha"}]}],"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}},{"id":"note","text":{"en":"Add a note: \"Keyboard users: press Tab twice to reach the times\"","ar":"نضيف ملاحظة: «مستخدمو لوحة المفاتيح: اضغطوا Tab مرتين للوصول إلى المواعيد»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"shasha","name":{"en":"Shasha","ar":"شاشة"},"color":"#BE185D","icon":"film-strip","domain":"shasha.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"shasha.example/films/the-lion-path","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Films ▾","ar":"الأفلام ▾"},{"en":"Offers","ar":"العروض"},{"en":"Cinemas","ar":"السينمات"}],"active":0},"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"① The Lion Path","ar":"① درب الأسد"}},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Family · 2 h 05 min · City Stars","ar":"عائلي · ساعتان و5 دقائق · سيتي ستارز"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Keyboard users: press Tab twice to reach the times","ar":"مستخدمو لوحة المفاتيح: اضغطوا Tab مرتين للوصول إلى المواعيد"},"color":"muted","gap":"xs"},{"kind":"row","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"chip","text":"③ 18:00"},{"kind":"chip","text":"④ 21:00"}]},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"⑤ Book tickets","ar":"⑤ احجز التذاكر"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"divider","gap":"m"},{"kind":"row","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"② Contact us","ar":"② تواصل معنا"}},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Privacy","ar":"الخصوصية"}},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":"© Shasha"}]}],"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}},{"id":"order","text":{"en":"Make Tab follow the page: title, times, Book, then the footer","ar":"نجعل Tab يتبع الصفحة: العنوان، ثم المواعيد، ثم الحجز، ثم التذييل"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"shasha","name":{"en":"Shasha","ar":"شاشة"},"color":"#BE185D","icon":"film-strip","domain":"shasha.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"shasha.example/films/the-lion-path","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Films ▾","ar":"الأفلام ▾"},{"en":"Offers","ar":"العروض"},{"en":"Cinemas","ar":"السينمات"}],"active":0},"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"① The Lion Path","ar":"① درب الأسد"}},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Family · 2 h 05 min · City Stars","ar":"عائلي · ساعتان و5 دقائق · سيتي ستارز"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"row","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"chip","text":"② 18:00"},{"kind":"chip","text":"③ 21:00"}]},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"④ Book tickets","ar":"④ احجز التذاكر"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"divider","gap":"m"},{"kind":"row","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"⑤ Contact us","ar":"⑤ تواصل معنا"}},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Privacy","ar":"الخصوصية"}},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":"© Shasha"}]}],"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}}],"answer":["order"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-025","when":["move","note"],"feedback":{"en":"The page layout is right; the Tab order is wrong. Fix the order so it matches what people see.","ar":"ترتيب الصفحة صحيح؛ الخطأ في ترتيب Tab. أصلح الترتيب ليطابق ما يراه الناس."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Follow the numbers. Where does Tab go after the title?","ar":"تابع الأرقام. إلى أين يذهب Tab بعد العنوان؟"},{"en":"Which option changes the order, not the page?","ar":"أي خيار يغيّر الترتيب، لا الصفحة؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Tab should move the way the page reads.","ar":"صحيح. يجب أن يتحرّك Tab كما تُقرأ الصفحة."},"explain":{"en":"A jump to the footer and back is confusing for anyone who can see the screen. The order should match the layout.","ar":"القفز إلى التذييل ثم العودة يُربك كل من يرى الشاشة. فيجب أن يطابق الترتيب شكل الصفحة."},"speaker":"sara"},{"id":"S05","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P05-U03-05","part":"guided","rules":["R06"],"value":{"en":"Keyboard-Only Navigation (NN/g): a common problem is that carousel controls aren't keyboard accessible. Real Previous/Next buttons that are always shown let Tab reach them.","ar":"التنقّل بلوحة المفاتيح فقط (NN/g): مشكلة شائعة أن أزرار الـ Carousel لا يصل إليها مستخدم لوحة المفاتيح. وأزرار «السابق/التالي» الحقيقية الظاهرة دائمًا يصل إليها Tab."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/keyboard-accessibility/","quote":"A common problem is that media controls, such as those in carousels, are not keyboard accessible."},"scenario":{"en":"The home page shows 4 films in a carousel. The arrows appear only when the mouse is over it. In the test, Tab skipped the carousel, so we only ever saw the first film.","ar":"تعرض الصفحة الرئيسية 4 أفلام في Carousel. والأسهم تظهر فقط حين يكون الماوس فوقه. وفي الاختبار، تخطّى Tab الـ Carousel، فلم نرَ إلا الفيلم الأول."},"prompt":{"en":"Tap each option to see the change. Which one lets keyboard users see all 4 films?","ar":"اضغط على كل خيار لترى التغيير. أي خيار يجعل مستخدمي لوحة المفاتيح يرون الأفلام الأربعة؟"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"app":{"id":"shasha","name":{"en":"Shasha","ar":"شاشة"},"color":"#BE185D","icon":"film-strip","domain":"shasha.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"shasha.example","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Films ▾","ar":"الأفلام ▾"},{"en":"Offers","ar":"العروض"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"city-night","text":{"en":"The Lion Path","ar":"درب الأسد"}},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":"● ○ ○ ○","gap":"xs"},{"kind":"button","icon":"ticket","text":{"en":"Book tickets","ar":"احجز التذاكر"},"gap":"s"}]},"options":[{"id":"auto","text":{"en":"Make the carousel move to the next film by itself every 3 seconds","ar":"اجعل الـ Carousel ينتقل وحده إلى الفيلم التالي كل 3 ثوانٍ"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"shasha","name":{"en":"Shasha","ar":"شاشة"},"color":"#BE185D","icon":"film-strip","domain":"shasha.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"shasha.example","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Films ▾","ar":"الأفلام ▾"},{"en":"Offers","ar":"العروض"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"city-night","note":{"en":"Moves every 3 s","ar":"ينتقل كل 3 ثوانٍ"},"text":{"en":"The Lion Path","ar":"درب الأسد"}},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":"● ○ ○ ○","gap":"xs"},{"kind":"button","icon":"ticket","text":{"en":"Book tickets","ar":"احجز التذاكر"},"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"buttons","text":{"en":"Always show Previous and Next as real buttons Tab can reach","ar":"أظهر «السابق» و«التالي» دائمًا كأزرار حقيقية يصل إليها Tab"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"shasha","name":{"en":"Shasha","ar":"شاشة"},"color":"#BE185D","icon":"film-strip","domain":"shasha.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"shasha.example","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Films ▾","ar":"الأفلام ▾"},{"en":"Offers","ar":"العروض"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"city-night","text":{"en":"The Lion Path","ar":"درب الأسد"}},{"kind":"row","gap":"xs","blocks":[{"kind":"button","style":"plain","ring":"brand","text":{"en":"‹ Previous","ar":"› السابق"}},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"1 of 4","ar":"1 من 4"}},{"kind":"button","style":"plain","text":{"en":"Next ›","ar":"التالي ‹"}}]},{"kind":"button","icon":"ticket","text":{"en":"Book tickets","ar":"احجز التذاكر"},"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"dots","text":{"en":"Make the dots bigger","ar":"كبّر النقاط"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"shasha","name":{"en":"Shasha","ar":"شاشة"},"color":"#BE185D","icon":"film-strip","domain":"shasha.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"shasha.example","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Films ▾","ar":"الأفلام ▾"},{"en":"Offers","ar":"العروض"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"city-night","text":{"en":"The Lion Path","ar":"درب الأسد"}},{"kind":"text","px":22,"color":"muted","text":"● ○ ○ ○","gap":"xs"},{"kind":"button","icon":"ticket","text":{"en":"Book tickets","ar":"احجز التذاكر"},"gap":"s"}]}}],"answer":["buttons"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-026","when":["auto"],"feedback":{"en":"Now films slide past before people can read them, and keyboard users still can't go back or stop it. They need buttons they can reach.","ar":"الآن تمرّ الأفلام قبل أن يقرأها الناس، وما زال مستخدم لوحة المفاتيح لا يستطيع الرجوع أو الإيقاف. يحتاج أزرارًا يصل إليها."}},{"id":"MC-P05-026","when":["dots"],"feedback":{"en":"Bigger dots are still pictures that Tab skips. Keyboard users need real buttons.","ar":"النقاط الأكبر ما زالت صورًا يتخطّاها Tab. ومستخدم لوحة المفاتيح يحتاج أزرارًا حقيقية."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Tab skips the carousel now. What could Tab land on?","ar":"الآن يتخطّى Tab الـ Carousel. على أي شيء يمكن أن يقف Tab؟"},{"en":"Which option adds something you can press with Enter?","ar":"أي خيار يضيف شيئًا يمكنك الضغط عليه بـ Enter؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Now Tab reaches the buttons, and Enter moves the films.","ar":"صحيح. الآن يصل Tab إلى الأزرار، وبـ Enter تنتقل بين الأفلام."},"explain":{"en":"Controls that appear only on hover don't exist for keyboard users. Keep them visible and make them real buttons.","ar":"العناصر التي تظهر بالـ Hover فقط غير موجودة بالنسبة لمستخدم لوحة المفاتيح. اجعلها ظاهرة، واجعلها أزرارًا حقيقية."},"speaker":"sara"},{"id":"S06","type":"compare","skill":"SK-P05-U03-05","part":"contrast","confidence":true,"rules":["R11"],"value":{"en":"Contrast: hover-only menu vs clickable top-level link. Mega Menus (NN/g): the simple accessible approach is to make each top-level choice clickable, leading to a page with all the options.","ar":"مقارنة: قائمة بالـ Hover فقط مقابل رابط رئيسي قابل للضغط. القوائم الضخمة (NN/g): الحل البسيط أن تجعل كل خيار رئيسي قابلًا للضغط، ويفتح صفحة فيها كل الخيارات."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/mega-menus-work-well/","quote":"make each top-level menu choice clickable, leading to a regular Web page where you present all dropdown options in plain, fully accessible HTML."},"scenario":{"en":"The \"Films\" menu at the top opens a list of genres when the mouse is over it. Two developers built it in different ways.","ar":"قائمة «الأفلام» في الأعلى تفتح قائمة بأنواع الأفلام حين يمرّ الماوس فوقها. وبناها مطوّران بطريقتين مختلفتين."},"prompt":{"en":"Which menu lets a keyboard user reach the genres?","ar":"أي قائمة تجعل مستخدم لوحة المفاتيح يصل إلى أنواع الأفلام؟"},"a":{"label":{"en":"A: Mouse over \"Films\" opens the list; pressing \"Films\" does nothing","ar":"A: مرور الماوس على «الأفلام» يفتح القائمة؛ والضغط على «الأفلام» لا يفعل شيئًا"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"shasha","name":{"en":"Shasha","ar":"شاشة"},"color":"#BE185D","icon":"film-strip","domain":"shasha.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"shasha.example","navbar":{"actions":[{"icon":"user"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"row","blocks":[{"kind":"meta","ring":"brand","text":{"en":"Films ▾","ar":"الأفلام ▾"}},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Offers","ar":"العروض"}},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Cinemas","ar":"السينمات"}}]},{"kind":"image","art":"city-night","gap":"s"},{"kind":"banner","tone":"bad","icon":"keyboard","text":{"en":"Enter: nothing happens","ar":"Enter: لا يحدث شيء"},"gap":"s"}]}},"b":{"label":{"en":"B: Pressing \"Films\" opens a Films page with every genre; mouse over still opens the list","ar":"B: الضغط على «الأفلام» يفتح صفحة فيها كل الأنواع؛ ومرور الماوس ما زال يفتح القائمة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"shasha","name":{"en":"Shasha","ar":"شاشة"},"color":"#BE185D","icon":"film-strip","domain":"shasha.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"shasha.example/films","navbar":{"actions":[{"icon":"user"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"row","blocks":[{"kind":"meta","ring":"brand","text":{"en":"Films ▾","ar":"الأفلام ▾"}},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Offers","ar":"العروض"}},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Cinemas","ar":"السينمات"}}]},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Enter opens the Films page:","ar":"Enter يفتح صفحة الأفلام:"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Films","ar":"الأفلام"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"row","gap":"xs","blocks":[{"kind":"link","text":{"en":"Action","ar":"أكشن"}},{"kind":"link","text":{"en":"Comedy","ar":"كوميديا"}},{"kind":"link","text":{"en":"Family","ar":"عائلي"}},{"kind":"link","text":{"en":"Drama","ar":"دراما"}}]}]}},"answer":"b","reason":{"prompt":{"en":"Why does B work for keyboard users?","ar":"لماذا يناسب B مستخدمي لوحة المفاتيح؟"},"options":[{"id":"fast","text":{"en":"Pages load faster than menus","ar":"الصفحات أسرع في التحميل من القوائم"}},{"id":"enter","text":{"en":"Tab reaches \"Films\", and Enter opens a page with every genre","ar":"Tab يصل إلى «الأفلام»، وEnter يفتح صفحة فيها كل الأنواع"}},{"id":"nohover","text":{"en":"B removed the mouse-over menu","ar":"B حذف القائمة التي تظهر بمرور الماوس"}}],"answer":["enter"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-026","when":["fast","nohover"],"feedback":{"en":"B keeps the mouse-over list. It adds a keyboard way in: Enter on \"Films\" opens a page with every genre.","ar":"B أبقى القائمة التي تظهر بمرور الماوس. لكنه أضاف طريقًا بلوحة المفاتيح: Enter على «الأفلام» يفتح صفحة فيها كل الأنواع."}}]},"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-026","when":["a"],"feedback":{"en":"In A, the list needs a mouse. With the keyboard, Enter on \"Films\" does nothing, so the genres are out of reach.","ar":"في A، لا تفتح القائمة إلا بالماوس. وبلوحة المفاتيح، لا يفعل Enter شيئًا على «الأفلام»، فلا يمكن الوصول إلى الأنواع."}}],"hints":[{"en":"In each design, what happens when a keyboard user presses Enter on \"Films\"?","ar":"في كل تصميم، ماذا يحدث حين يضغط مستخدم لوحة المفاتيح Enter على «الأفلام»؟"},{"en":"Which design gives a way in that doesn't need a mouse?","ar":"أي تصميم يعطي طريقًا لا يحتاج إلى ماوس؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Keep the hover menu, and add a page Enter can open.","ar":"صحيح. أبقِ القائمة، وأضف صفحة يفتحها Enter."},"explain":{"en":"A hover menu is fine for mouse users. Just make sure the same options are one Enter away for keyboard users.","ar":"قائمة الـ Hover مناسبة لمستخدمي الماوس. فقط تأكّد أن مستخدمي لوحة المفاتيح يصلون إلى نفس الخيارات بضغطة Enter واحدة."},"speaker":"sara"},{"id":"S07","type":"choose","skill":"SK-P05-U03-01","part":"independent","speaker":"nour","rules":["R14"],"value":{"en":"New case. Keyboard-Only Navigation (NN/g): keyboard users must reach all interactive elements, not just the main navigation. Testing only the home page misses the booking steps.","ar":"حالة جديدة. التنقّل بلوحة المفاتيح فقط (NN/g): يجب أن يصل مستخدمو لوحة المفاتيح إلى كل العناصر التفاعلية، لا القائمة الرئيسية فقط. واختبار الصفحة الرئيسية وحدها يُفوّت خطوات الحجز."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/keyboard-accessibility/","quote":"Keyboard users must be able to access all interactive elements, not just the main navigation or in-line links."},"scenario":{"en":"Our clinic's new booking site goes live next week. I tabbed through the home page: I could always see where I was, and I reached every link.","ar":"موقع الحجز الجديد لعيادتنا سيُطلق الأسبوع القادم. تنقّلت بـ Tab في الصفحة الرئيسية: كنت أرى دائمًا أين أنا، ووصلت إلى كل الروابط."},"prompt":{"en":"Is the keyboard test done?","ar":"هل انتهى اختبار لوحة المفاتيح؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"raha.example","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Doctors","ar":"الأطباء"},{"en":"Services","ar":"الخدمات"},{"en":"Contact","ar":"تواصل"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Care close to home","ar":"رعاية قريبة منك"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","ring":"brand","icon":"calendar-plus","text":{"en":"Book a visit","ar":"احجز زيارة"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Next: choose a doctor › pick a day › pick a time › confirm","ar":"بعدها: اختر طبيبًا ‹ اختر يومًا ‹ اختر وقتًا ‹ أكّد"},"gap":"s"}]},"options":[{"id":"done","text":{"en":"Yes. The home page passed every check","ar":"نعم. الصفحة الرئيسية نجحت في كل الفحوصات"}},{"id":"task","text":{"en":"Not yet. Book a full appointment by keyboard, from choosing a doctor to the confirmation","ar":"ليس بعد. احجز موعدًا كاملًا بلوحة المفاتيح، من اختيار الطبيب حتى التأكيد"}},{"id":"mouse","text":{"en":"Not yet. Do the same test again with a mouse","ar":"ليس بعد. أعِد نفس الاختبار بالماوس"}}],"answer":["task"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-024","when":["done","mouse"],"feedback":{"en":"The home page is only the start. Patients get stuck in the booking steps: the calendar, the time list, the confirm button. Test the whole task by keyboard.","ar":"الصفحة الرئيسية مجرد بداية. والمرضى يتوقّفون في خطوات الحجز: التقويم، وقائمة المواعيد، وزر التأكيد. فاختبر المهمة كلها بلوحة المفاتيح."}}],"hints":[{"en":"What do patients come to the site to do?","ar":"ماذا يأتي المرضى ليفعلوا في الموقع؟"},{"en":"The test is about the main task, from start to end.","ar":"الاختبار يخصّ المهمة الأساسية، من أولها لآخرها."}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Test the whole task, not only the first page.","ar":"صحيح. اختبر المهمة كلها، لا الصفحة الأولى فقط."},"explain":{"en":"Problems hide in the steps after the home page: date pickers, lists and pop-ups. Finish the task with keys only.","ar":"المشكلات تختبئ في الخطوات بعد الصفحة الرئيسية: اختيار التاريخ، والقوائم، والنوافذ المنبثقة. أنجز المهمة كلها بالمفاتيح فقط."}},{"id":"S08","type":"card","part":"recap","icons":["tap","order","eye","person"],"title":{"en":"What you did","ar":"ماذا تعلّمت"},"body":{"en":"- **The test:** you put the mouse away and used Tab, Shift+Tab and Enter.\n- **Page order:** you made Tab follow the page, not the code.\n- **Carousels:** you gave the films real Previous and Next buttons.\n- **Hover menus:** you chose a menu that Enter can open as a page.\n- **The whole task:** you tested booking from start to end, not just the home page.\n\nNext lesson: how to show where the keyboard is, in your own style.","ar":"- **الاختبار:** أبعدت الماوس واستخدمت Tab وShift+Tab وEnter.\n- **ترتيب الصفحة:** جعلت Tab يتبع الصفحة، لا الكود.\n- **الـ Carousel:** أعطيت الأفلام زرّي «السابق» و«التالي» حقيقيين.\n- **قوائم الـ Hover:** اخترت قائمة يفتحها Enter كصفحة.\n- **المهمة كلها:** اختبرت الحجز من أوله لآخره، لا الصفحة الرئيسية فقط.\n\nالدرس التالي: كيف تُظهر مكان لوحة المفاتيح، بأسلوبك الخاص."}}]}$uxg$::jsonb),
  ($uxg$P05-U03-L02$uxg$, $uxg$bd2e132e3b15a1cef3e3816c60bdbb74fea6b9f0e844a6b975ae007cbe23688f$uxg$, $uxg${"id":"P05-U03-L02","mode":"lesson","minutes":7,"title":{"en":"A focus style that fits the brand","ar":"شكل تركيز يناسب الهوية"},"summary":{"en":"Replace a fashion site's focus outline with your own style that shows everywhere.","ar":"استبدل إطار التركيز (Focus) في موقع أزياء بتصميمك الخاص الذي يظهر في كل مكان."},"speaker":"mona","review_labels":{"MC-P05-027":{"en":"Never remove focus; restyle it","ar":"لا تحذف التركيز أبدًا؛ غيّر شكله"},"MC-P05-028":{"en":"Focus must show on every background","ar":"يجب أن يظهر التركيز على كل خلفية"},"MC-P05-029":{"en":"A colour change alone isn't a focus sign","ar":"تغيير اللون وحده ليس علامة تركيز"}},"steps":[{"id":"S01","type":"card","part":"hook","title":{"en":"\"That blue line looks cheap\"","ar":"«هذا الخط الأزرق يبدو رخيصًا»"},"body":{"en":"I lead design for a fashion shop's new website. When you press Tab, the browser draws a thin blue line around the button you're on.\n\nOur brand team says it looks cheap and wants it gone.","ar":"أقود فريق التصميم لموقع جديد لمتجر أزياء. حين تضغط Tab، يرسم المتصفح خطًا أزرق رفيعًا حول الزر الذي تقف عليه.\n\nويقول فريق الهوية إنه يبدو رخيصًا، ويريد حذفه."},"mock":{"app":{"id":"lamha","name":{"en":"Lamha","ar":"لمحة"},"color":"#7C3AED","icon":"t-shirt","domain":"lamha.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"lamha.example/men/linen-shirt","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Women","ar":"نساء"},{"en":"Men","ar":"رجال"},{"en":"Kids","ar":"أطفال"}],"active":1,"actions":[{"icon":"shopping-bag","count":1}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"shirt","text":{"en":"Linen shirt","ar":"قميص كتان"}},{"kind":"text","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"890 EGP","ar":"890 جنيه"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","ring":"default","text":{"en":"Add to bag","ar":"أضف إلى الحقيبة"},"gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"S02","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P05-U03-02","part":"try","rules":["R12"],"value":{"en":"Try first. Keyboard-Only Navigation (NN/g): if you don't like the browser's indicator, don't remove it; replace it with a design consistent with your site's look.","ar":"جرّب أولًا. التنقّل بلوحة المفاتيح فقط (NN/g): إذا لم يعجبك مؤشر المتصفح، فلا تحذفه؛ بل استبدله بتصميم يناسب شكل موقعك."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/keyboard-accessibility/","quote":"If you don’t like the indicator provided by the browser, don’t remove it altogether; instead replace it with a design that is consistent with your site’s look-and-feel."},"prompt":{"en":"Tap each option to see the change. Which one fits the brand and still shows keyboard users where they are?","ar":"اضغط على كل خيار لترى التغيير. أي خيار يناسب الهوية، ويُظهر لمستخدمي لوحة المفاتيح أين هم؟"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"Now (after pressing Tab)","ar":"الآن (بعد الضغط على Tab)"},"app":{"id":"lamha","name":{"en":"Lamha","ar":"لمحة"},"color":"#7C3AED","icon":"t-shirt","domain":"lamha.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"lamha.example/men/linen-shirt","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Women","ar":"نساء"},{"en":"Men","ar":"رجال"},{"en":"Kids","ar":"أطفال"}],"active":1,"actions":[{"icon":"shopping-bag","count":1}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"shirt","text":{"en":"Linen shirt","ar":"قميص كتان"}},{"kind":"text","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"890 EGP","ar":"890 جنيه"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","ring":"default","text":{"en":"Add to bag","ar":"أضف إلى الحقيبة"},"gap":"m"}]},"options":[{"id":"brand","text":{"en":"Replace it with a thick outline in our purple, with a small gap","ar":"استبدله بإطار عريض بلوننا البنفسجي، مع مسافة صغيرة"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"lamha","name":{"en":"Lamha","ar":"لمحة"},"color":"#7C3AED","icon":"t-shirt","domain":"lamha.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"lamha.example/men/linen-shirt","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Women","ar":"نساء"},{"en":"Men","ar":"رجال"},{"en":"Kids","ar":"أطفال"}],"active":1,"actions":[{"icon":"shopping-bag","count":1}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"shirt","text":{"en":"Linen shirt","ar":"قميص كتان"}},{"kind":"text","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"890 EGP","ar":"890 جنيه"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","ring":"brand","text":{"en":"Add to bag","ar":"أضف إلى الحقيبة"},"gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"remove","text":{"en":"Remove it; keyboard users are only a few","ar":"احذفه؛ فمستخدمو لوحة المفاتيح قليلون"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"lamha","name":{"en":"Lamha","ar":"لمحة"},"color":"#7C3AED","icon":"t-shirt","domain":"lamha.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"lamha.example/men/linen-shirt","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Women","ar":"نساء"},{"en":"Men","ar":"رجال"},{"en":"Kids","ar":"أطفال"}],"active":1,"actions":[{"icon":"shopping-bag","count":1}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"shirt","text":{"en":"Linen shirt","ar":"قميص كتان"}},{"kind":"text","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"890 EGP","ar":"890 جنيه"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Add to bag","ar":"أضف إلى الحقيبة"},"gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"tint","text":{"en":"Show focus by making the button a slightly lighter purple","ar":"أظهر التركيز بجعل الزر بنفسجيًا أفتح قليلًا"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"lamha","name":{"en":"Lamha","ar":"لمحة"},"color":"#7C3AED","icon":"t-shirt","domain":"lamha.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"lamha.example/men/linen-shirt","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Women","ar":"نساء"},{"en":"Men","ar":"رجال"},{"en":"Kids","ar":"أطفال"}],"active":1,"actions":[{"icon":"shopping-bag","count":1}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"shirt","text":{"en":"Linen shirt","ar":"قميص كتان"}},{"kind":"text","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"890 EGP","ar":"890 جنيه"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","ring":"tint","text":{"en":"Add to bag","ar":"أضف إلى الحقيبة"},"gap":"m"}]}}],"answer":["brand"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-027","when":["remove"],"feedback":{"en":"Without focus, keyboard users are like mouse users with no cursor. They can't tell which button Enter will press.","ar":"بدون تركيز، يصبح مستخدم لوحة المفاتيح مثل مستخدم ماوس بلا مؤشر. لا يعرف أي زر سيضغطه Enter."}},{"id":"MC-P05-029","when":["tint"],"feedback":{"en":"A slightly lighter purple is easy to miss, especially for people with weak sight. An outline is clear.","ar":"البنفسجي الأفتح قليلًا قد لا تلاحظه العين، خاصة عند ضعاف النظر. أما الإطار فواضح."}}],"hints":[{"en":"In each option, can you tell which button you're on?","ar":"في كل خيار، هل تعرف على أي زر تقف؟"},{"en":"Which option changes the look without hiding where you are?","ar":"أي خيار يغيّر الشكل دون أن يُخفي مكانك؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Your own style, and still easy to see.","ar":"صحيح. شكل خاص بكم، وما زال سهل الرؤية."},"explain":{"en":"You don't have to keep the browser's line. Design your own, but never leave keyboard users without one.","ar":"لست مضطرًا لإبقاء خط المتصفح. صمّم شكلك الخاص، لكن لا تترك مستخدمي لوحة المفاتيح بدونه أبدًا."}},{"id":"S03","type":"card","part":"concept","icons":["eye","color","contrast","clock"],"title":{"en":"Focus: show where the keyboard is","ar":"التركيز (Focus): أظهر أين تقف لوحة المفاتيح"},"body":{"en":"Focus is the mark on the control the keyboard is on. Enter will press that control.\n\n- **Never remove it, restyle it:** use a thick line in your brand colour, with a small gap around the control.\n- **A line, not just a colour:** a small colour change is easy to miss for people with weak sight. Use an outline or a thick border.\n- **Every background:** check it on white, on brand colours and on dark areas. A white line with a dark edge shows almost everywhere.\n- **Fast:** show it the moment people press Tab (about a tenth of a second). If it's late, people press Tab again and pass the button they wanted.","ar":"التركيز (Focus) هو العلامة على العنصر الذي تقف عليه لوحة المفاتيح. وضغطة Enter ستعمل على هذا العنصر.\n\n- **لا تحذفه، غيّر شكله:** استخدم خطًا عريضًا بلون هويتك، مع مسافة صغيرة حول العنصر.\n- **خط، لا لون فقط:** تغيير اللون البسيط قد لا يلاحظه ضعاف النظر. استخدم إطارًا أو حدًّا عريضًا.\n- **كل الخلفيات:** افحصه على الأبيض، وعلى ألوان الهوية، وعلى المناطق الداكنة. والخط الأبيض بحافة داكنة يظهر في كل مكان تقريبًا.\n- **سريع:** أظهره لحظة الضغط على Tab (نحو عُشر ثانية). وإذا تأخّر، يضغط الناس Tab مرة أخرى ويتجاوزون الزر الذي أرادوه."}},{"id":"S04","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P05-U03-02","part":"guided","rules":["R06"],"value":{"en":"Button States (NN/g): stick to a stroke or outline for focus, not colour change alone; colour change alone may not be perceived by some people with vision impairments.","ar":"حالات الأزرار (NN/g): استخدم خطًا أو إطارًا للتركيز، لا تغيير اللون وحده؛ فقد لا يلاحظ بعض ضعاف النظر تغيير اللون وحده."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/button-states-communicate-interaction/","quote":"color change alone may not be perceived by some people with vision impairments."},"scenario":{"en":"On the product page, shoppers pick a size. When a size has focus, its grey box turns a very light purple. Here, M has focus.","ar":"في صفحة المنتج، يختار المتسوّق المقاس. وحين يكون التركيز على مقاس، يتحوّل مربعه الرمادي إلى بنفسجي فاتح جدًا. وهنا التركيز على M."},"prompt":{"en":"Tap each option to see the change. Which one makes the focused size clear to everyone?","ar":"اضغط على كل خيار لترى التغيير. أي خيار يجعل المقاس الذي عليه التركيز واضحًا للجميع؟"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"app":{"id":"lamha","name":{"en":"Lamha","ar":"لمحة"},"color":"#7C3AED","icon":"t-shirt","domain":"lamha.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"lamha.example/men/linen-shirt","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Women","ar":"نساء"},{"en":"Men","ar":"رجال"},{"en":"Kids","ar":"أطفال"}],"active":1,"actions":[{"icon":"shopping-bag","count":1}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","art":"shirt","text":{"en":"Linen shirt","ar":"قميص كتان"},"value":{"en":"890 EGP","ar":"890 جنيه"}},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Size","ar":"المقاس"}},{"kind":"row","gap":"xs","blocks":[{"kind":"chip","tone":"off","text":"S"},{"kind":"chip","tone":"off","ring":"tint","text":"M"},{"kind":"chip","tone":"off","text":"L"},{"kind":"chip","tone":"off","text":"XL"}]}]},"options":[{"id":"stronger","text":{"en":"Use a stronger purple fill for the focused size","ar":"استخدم لون تعبئة بنفسجيًا أقوى للمقاس الذي عليه التركيز"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"lamha","name":{"en":"Lamha","ar":"لمحة"},"color":"#7C3AED","icon":"t-shirt","domain":"lamha.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"lamha.example/men/linen-shirt","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Women","ar":"نساء"},{"en":"Men","ar":"رجال"},{"en":"Kids","ar":"أطفال"}],"active":1,"actions":[{"icon":"shopping-bag","count":1}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","art":"shirt","text":{"en":"Linen shirt","ar":"قميص كتان"},"value":{"en":"890 EGP","ar":"890 جنيه"}},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Size","ar":"المقاس"}},{"kind":"row","gap":"xs","blocks":[{"kind":"chip","tone":"off","text":"S"},{"kind":"chip","tone":"dark","text":"M"},{"kind":"chip","tone":"off","text":"L"},{"kind":"chip","tone":"off","text":"XL"}]}]}},{"id":"tooltip","text":{"en":"Show a \"You are here\" tip after 2 seconds on a size","ar":"اعرض تلميح «أنت هنا» بعد ثانيتين على المقاس"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change (after 2 s)","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير (بعد ثانيتين)"},"app":{"id":"lamha","name":{"en":"Lamha","ar":"لمحة"},"color":"#7C3AED","icon":"t-shirt","domain":"lamha.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"lamha.example/men/linen-shirt","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Women","ar":"نساء"},{"en":"Men","ar":"رجال"},{"en":"Kids","ar":"أطفال"}],"active":1,"actions":[{"icon":"shopping-bag","count":1}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","art":"shirt","text":{"en":"Linen shirt","ar":"قميص كتان"},"value":{"en":"890 EGP","ar":"890 جنيه"}},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Size","ar":"المقاس"}},{"kind":"row","gap":"xs","blocks":[{"kind":"chip","tone":"off","text":"S"},{"kind":"chip","tone":"off","ring":"tint","text":"M"},{"kind":"chip","tone":"off","text":"L"},{"kind":"chip","tone":"off","text":"XL"}]},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"You are here: M","ar":"أنت هنا: M"},"gap":"xs"}]}},{"id":"outline","text":{"en":"Add a thick outline around the focused size","ar":"أضف إطارًا عريضًا حول المقاس الذي عليه التركيز"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"lamha","name":{"en":"Lamha","ar":"لمحة"},"color":"#7C3AED","icon":"t-shirt","domain":"lamha.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"lamha.example/men/linen-shirt","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Women","ar":"نساء"},{"en":"Men","ar":"رجال"},{"en":"Kids","ar":"أطفال"}],"active":1,"actions":[{"icon":"shopping-bag","count":1}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","art":"shirt","text":{"en":"Linen shirt","ar":"قميص كتان"},"value":{"en":"890 EGP","ar":"890 جنيه"}},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Size","ar":"المقاس"}},{"kind":"row","gap":"xs","blocks":[{"kind":"chip","tone":"off","text":"S"},{"kind":"chip","tone":"off","ring":"brand","text":"M"},{"kind":"chip","tone":"off","text":"L"},{"kind":"chip","tone":"off","text":"XL"}]}]}}],"answer":["outline"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-029","when":["stronger"],"feedback":{"en":"A stronger fill is still only a colour change, and it can look like \"selected\". An outline means \"you are here\".","ar":"اللون الأقوى ما زال تغييرًا في اللون فقط، وقد يبدو كأنه «مختار». أما الإطار فيعني «أنت هنا»."}},{"id":"MC-P05-029","when":["tooltip"],"feedback":{"en":"Two seconds is far too late; people press Tab again before it shows. Focus must be clear at once.","ar":"ثانيتان تأخير كبير جدًا؛ فالناس يضغطون Tab مرة أخرى قبل أن يظهر. يجب أن يكون التركيز واضحًا فورًا."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Look at M in the Now screen. Is it easy to spot?","ar":"انظر إلى M في شاشة «الآن». هل من السهل ملاحظته؟"},{"en":"Which option adds a line, not a colour?","ar":"أي خيار يضيف خطًا، لا لونًا؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Right. The outline shows focus clearly, at once.","ar":"صحيح. الإطار يُظهر التركيز بوضوح، وفورًا."},"explain":{"en":"Outlines are the sign people expect for focus, and they don't depend on seeing a small colour difference.","ar":"الإطار هو العلامة التي يتوقّعها الناس للتركيز، ولا يعتمد على رؤية فرق صغير في اللون."},"speaker":"mona"},{"id":"S05","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P05-U03-02","part":"guided","rules":["R06"],"value":{"en":"Button States (NN/g): a white outline around a coloured button shows which button has keyboard focus. A purple outline on a purple button disappears.","ar":"حالات الأزرار (NN/g): الإطار الأبيض حول زر ملوّن يُظهر الزر الذي عليه تركيز لوحة المفاتيح. أما الإطار البنفسجي على زر بنفسجي فيختفي."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/button-states-communicate-interaction/","quote":"The white outline around the button lets users know which button has the keyboard focus."},"scenario":{"en":"We used our new purple outline everywhere. On the purple \"Checkout\" button, the outline sits right on the button's edge.","ar":"استخدمنا الإطار البنفسجي الجديد في كل مكان. وعلى زر «إتمام الشراء» البنفسجي، يقع الإطار على حافة الزر مباشرة."},"prompt":{"en":"Tap each option to see the change. Which one makes focus on \"Checkout\" easy to see?","ar":"اضغط على كل خيار لترى التغيير. أي خيار يجعل التركيز على «إتمام الشراء» سهل الرؤية؟"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"Now (Checkout has focus)","ar":"الآن (التركيز على إتمام الشراء)"},"app":{"id":"lamha","name":{"en":"Lamha","ar":"لمحة"},"color":"#7C3AED","icon":"t-shirt","domain":"lamha.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"lamha.example/bag","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Women","ar":"نساء"},{"en":"Men","ar":"رجال"},{"en":"Kids","ar":"أطفال"}],"actions":[{"icon":"shopping-bag","count":2}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Your bag","ar":"حقيبتك"}},{"kind":"listitem","art":"shirt","text":{"en":"Linen shirt","ar":"قميص كتان"},"sub":{"en":"Size M · Qty 2","ar":"المقاس M · الكمية 2"},"value":{"en":"1,780 EGP","ar":"1,780 جنيه"}},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Total: 1,780 EGP","ar":"الإجمالي: 1,780 جنيه"}},{"kind":"button","ring":"flush","text":{"en":"Checkout","ar":"إتمام الشراء"},"gap":"m"}]},"options":[{"id":"thicker","text":{"en":"Keep the purple outline, but make it thicker","ar":"أبقِ الإطار البنفسجي، لكن اجعله أعرض"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"lamha","name":{"en":"Lamha","ar":"لمحة"},"color":"#7C3AED","icon":"t-shirt","domain":"lamha.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"lamha.example/bag","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Women","ar":"نساء"},{"en":"Men","ar":"رجال"},{"en":"Kids","ar":"أطفال"}],"actions":[{"icon":"shopping-bag","count":2}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Your bag","ar":"حقيبتك"}},{"kind":"listitem","art":"shirt","text":{"en":"Linen shirt","ar":"قميص كتان"},"sub":{"en":"Size M · Qty 2","ar":"المقاس M · الكمية 2"},"value":{"en":"1,780 EGP","ar":"1,780 جنيه"}},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Total: 1,780 EGP","ar":"الإجمالي: 1,780 جنيه"}},{"kind":"button","ring":"flush","px":18,"text":{"en":"Checkout","ar":"إتمام الشراء"},"gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"double","text":{"en":"Use a white line with a dark edge around the button","ar":"استخدم خطًا أبيض بحافة داكنة حول الزر"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"lamha","name":{"en":"Lamha","ar":"لمحة"},"color":"#7C3AED","icon":"t-shirt","domain":"lamha.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"lamha.example/bag","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Women","ar":"نساء"},{"en":"Men","ar":"رجال"},{"en":"Kids","ar":"أطفال"}],"actions":[{"icon":"shopping-bag","count":2}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Your bag","ar":"حقيبتك"}},{"kind":"listitem","art":"shirt","text":{"en":"Linen shirt","ar":"قميص كتان"},"sub":{"en":"Size M · Qty 2","ar":"المقاس M · الكمية 2"},"value":{"en":"1,780 EGP","ar":"1,780 جنيه"}},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Total: 1,780 EGP","ar":"الإجمالي: 1,780 جنيه"}},{"kind":"button","ring":"double","text":{"en":"Checkout","ar":"إتمام الشراء"},"gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"links","text":{"en":"Show focus on links only; buttons are big enough to find","ar":"أظهر التركيز على الروابط فقط؛ فالأزرار كبيرة وسهلة الإيجاد"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"lamha","name":{"en":"Lamha","ar":"لمحة"},"color":"#7C3AED","icon":"t-shirt","domain":"lamha.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"lamha.example/bag","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Women","ar":"نساء"},{"en":"Men","ar":"رجال"},{"en":"Kids","ar":"أطفال"}],"actions":[{"icon":"shopping-bag","count":2}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Your bag","ar":"حقيبتك"}},{"kind":"listitem","art":"shirt","text":{"en":"Linen shirt","ar":"قميص كتان"},"sub":{"en":"Size M · Qty 2","ar":"المقاس M · الكمية 2"},"value":{"en":"1,780 EGP","ar":"1,780 جنيه"}},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Total: 1,780 EGP","ar":"الإجمالي: 1,780 جنيه"}},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Checkout","ar":"إتمام الشراء"},"gap":"m"}]}}],"answer":["double"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-028","when":["thicker"],"feedback":{"en":"Purple on purple blends in, however thick. The focus needs a colour that stands out from the button.","ar":"البنفسجي على البنفسجي يختفي، مهما كان عريضًا. والتركيز يحتاج لونًا يختلف عن الزر."}},{"id":"MC-P05-027","when":["links"],"feedback":{"en":"Seeing a button isn't the same as knowing the keyboard is on it. Every control needs visible focus.","ar":"أن ترى الزر لا يعني أن تعرف أن لوحة المفاتيح عليه. كل عنصر يحتاج تركيزًا ظاهرًا."}}],"hints":[{"en":"In the Now screen, can you see the outline at all?","ar":"في شاشة «الآن»، هل ترى الإطار أصلًا؟"},{"en":"Which option uses colours that differ from the purple button?","ar":"أي خيار يستخدم ألوانًا تختلف عن الزر البنفسجي؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Right. White with a dark edge shows on the button and on the page.","ar":"صحيح. الأبيض بحافة داكنة يظهر على الزر وعلى الصفحة."},"explain":{"en":"One focus colour can vanish on some backgrounds. Two colours, light and dark, show almost everywhere.","ar":"لون تركيز واحد قد يختفي على بعض الخلفيات. أما لونان، فاتح وداكن، فيظهران في كل مكان تقريبًا."},"speaker":"mona"},{"id":"S06","type":"compare","skill":"SK-P05-U03-02","part":"contrast","confidence":true,"rules":["R11"],"value":{"en":"Contrast: instant focus vs a slow fade-in. Button States (NN/g): focus should appear within about 100–150 ms; otherwise people tab again and may miss the button they wanted.","ar":"مقارنة: تركيز فوري مقابل ظهور بطيء. حالات الأزرار (NN/g): يجب أن يظهر التركيز خلال نحو 100–150 جزءًا من الثانية؛ وإلا يضغط الناس Tab مرة أخرى وقد يتجاوزون الزر الذي أرادوه."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/button-states-communicate-interaction/","quote":"The focus state should appear pretty quickly (around 100-150ms) after the user uses the keyboard."},"scenario":{"en":"Our motion designer made two versions of the new outline. Both look the same once they're fully shown.","ar":"صمّم مصمّم الحركة (Motion designer) عندنا نسختين من الإطار الجديد. والنسختان متطابقتان بعد أن تظهرا بالكامل."},"prompt":{"en":"Which version helps keyboard users press the button they want?","ar":"أي نسخة تساعد مستخدمي لوحة المفاتيح على ضغط الزر الذي يريدونه؟"},"a":{"label":{"en":"A: The outline appears the moment you press Tab","ar":"A: يظهر الإطار لحظة الضغط على Tab"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"lamha","name":{"en":"Lamha","ar":"لمحة"},"color":"#7C3AED","icon":"t-shirt","domain":"lamha.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"lamha.example/men/linen-shirt","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Women","ar":"نساء"},{"en":"Men","ar":"رجال"},{"en":"Kids","ar":"أطفال"}],"active":1,"actions":[{"icon":"shopping-bag","count":1}]},"caption":{"en":"0.1 s after Tab","ar":"بعد 0.1 ثانية من Tab"},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","art":"shirt","text":{"en":"Linen shirt","ar":"قميص كتان"},"sub":{"en":"Size M","ar":"المقاس M"},"value":{"en":"890 EGP","ar":"890 جنيه"}},{"kind":"button","ring":"brand","text":{"en":"Add to bag","ar":"أضف إلى الحقيبة"}},{"kind":"button","style":"plain","text":{"en":"Save for later","ar":"احفظ لوقت لاحق"},"gap":"s"}]}},"b":{"label":{"en":"B: The outline slowly fades in over one second","ar":"B: يظهر الإطار تدريجيًا خلال ثانية واحدة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"lamha","name":{"en":"Lamha","ar":"لمحة"},"color":"#7C3AED","icon":"t-shirt","domain":"lamha.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"lamha.example/men/linen-shirt","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Women","ar":"نساء"},{"en":"Men","ar":"رجال"},{"en":"Kids","ar":"أطفال"}],"active":1,"actions":[{"icon":"shopping-bag","count":1}]},"caption":{"en":"0.1 s after Tab","ar":"بعد 0.1 ثانية من Tab"},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","art":"shirt","text":{"en":"Linen shirt","ar":"قميص كتان"},"sub":{"en":"Size M","ar":"المقاس M"},"value":{"en":"890 EGP","ar":"890 جنيه"}},{"kind":"button","ring":"faint","text":{"en":"Add to bag","ar":"أضف إلى الحقيبة"}},{"kind":"button","style":"plain","text":{"en":"Save for later","ar":"احفظ لوقت لاحق"},"gap":"s"}]}},"answer":"a","reason":{"prompt":{"en":"What goes wrong with B?","ar":"ما المشكلة في B؟"},"options":[{"id":"again","text":{"en":"People see no focus, press Tab again, and pass the button they wanted","ar":"لا يرى الناس التركيز، فيضغطون Tab مرة أخرى، ويتجاوزون الزر الذي أرادوه"}},{"id":"battery","text":{"en":"Animations use more battery","ar":"الحركة تستهلك بطارية أكثر"}},{"id":"ugly","text":{"en":"Fades look old-fashioned","ar":"الظهور التدريجي يبدو قديمًا"}}],"answer":["again"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-027","when":["battery","ugly"],"feedback":{"en":"The problem is timing. While the outline fades in, people think nothing happened and press Tab again.","ar":"المشكلة في التوقيت. فبينما يظهر الإطار تدريجيًا، يظن الناس أن شيئًا لم يحدث، فيضغطون Tab مرة أخرى."}}]},"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-027","when":["b"],"feedback":{"en":"A slow fade leaves people without focus for a moment. They press Tab again and skip the button.","ar":"الظهور البطيء يترك الناس بلا تركيز للحظة. فيضغطون Tab مرة أخرى ويتجاوزون الزر."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Look at both screens 0.1 seconds after Tab. What does a keyboard user see?","ar":"انظر إلى الشاشتين بعد 0.1 ثانية من Tab. ماذا يرى مستخدم لوحة المفاتيح؟"},{"en":"What do people do when they press a key and see nothing change?","ar":"ماذا يفعل الناس حين يضغطون مفتاحًا ولا يرون أي تغيير؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Focus has to show at once.","ar":"صحيح. يجب أن يظهر التركيز فورًا."},"explain":{"en":"Keep motion for other things. Focus is feedback for a key press, so it must be instant.","ar":"اترك الحركة لأشياء أخرى. فالتركيز استجابة (Feedback) لضغطة المفتاح، لذلك يجب أن يكون فوريًا."},"speaker":"mona"},{"id":"S07","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P05-U03-02","part":"independent","speaker":"rami","rules":["R14"],"value":{"en":"New case. Keyboard-Only Navigation (NN/g): removing the focus indicator is catastrophic for keyboard users. On a dark footer, switch the outline to white instead of dropping it.","ar":"حالة جديدة. التنقّل بلوحة المفاتيح فقط (NN/g): حذف مؤشر التركيز كارثي لمستخدمي لوحة المفاتيح. وفي التذييل الداكن، غيّر الإطار إلى الأبيض بدل أن تحذفه."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/keyboard-accessibility/","quote":"Removing the keyboard focus indicator is catastrophic for keyboard users."},"scenario":{"en":"I'm designing the dark footer of the same site. It has links like \"Returns\" and \"Contact us\". I used our purple outline there too.","ar":"أصمّم التذييل الداكن لنفس الموقع. فيه روابط مثل «الإرجاع» و«تواصل معنا». واستخدمت فيه الإطار البنفسجي أيضًا."},"prompt":{"en":"Tap each option to see the change. Which one shows clearly which footer link has focus?","ar":"اضغط على كل خيار لترى التغيير. أي خيار يوضّح أي رابط في التذييل عليه التركيز؟"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"Now (\"Returns\" has focus)","ar":"الآن (التركيز على «الإرجاع»)"},"app":{"id":"lamha","name":{"en":"Lamha","ar":"لمحة"},"color":"#7C3AED","icon":"t-shirt","domain":"lamha.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"lamha.example/men/linen-shirt","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Women","ar":"نساء"},{"en":"Men","ar":"رجال"},{"en":"Kids","ar":"أطفال"}],"active":1,"actions":[{"icon":"shopping-bag","count":1}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"You may also like","ar":"قد يعجبك أيضًا"}},{"kind":"listitem","art":"sneakers","text":{"en":"White sneakers","ar":"حذاء رياضي أبيض"},"value":{"en":"1,200 EGP","ar":"1,200 جنيه"}},{"kind":"group","tone":"night","blocks":[{"kind":"button","style":"plain","ring":"brand","text":{"en":"Returns","ar":"الإرجاع"}},{"kind":"button","style":"plain","text":{"en":"Contact us","ar":"تواصل معنا"},"gap":"xs"}]}]},"options":[{"id":"keep","text":{"en":"Keep the purple outline; it matches the rest of the site","ar":"أبقِ الإطار البنفسجي؛ فهو يطابق باقي الموقع"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"lamha","name":{"en":"Lamha","ar":"لمحة"},"color":"#7C3AED","icon":"t-shirt","domain":"lamha.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"lamha.example/men/linen-shirt","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Women","ar":"نساء"},{"en":"Men","ar":"رجال"},{"en":"Kids","ar":"أطفال"}],"active":1,"actions":[{"icon":"shopping-bag","count":1}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"You may also like","ar":"قد يعجبك أيضًا"}},{"kind":"listitem","art":"sneakers","text":{"en":"White sneakers","ar":"حذاء رياضي أبيض"},"value":{"en":"1,200 EGP","ar":"1,200 جنيه"}},{"kind":"group","tone":"night","blocks":[{"kind":"button","style":"plain","ring":"brand","text":{"en":"Returns","ar":"الإرجاع"}},{"kind":"button","style":"plain","text":{"en":"Contact us","ar":"تواصل معنا"},"gap":"xs"}]}]}},{"id":"white","text":{"en":"Use a white outline in the dark footer","ar":"استخدم إطارًا أبيض في التذييل الداكن"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"lamha","name":{"en":"Lamha","ar":"لمحة"},"color":"#7C3AED","icon":"t-shirt","domain":"lamha.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"lamha.example/men/linen-shirt","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Women","ar":"نساء"},{"en":"Men","ar":"رجال"},{"en":"Kids","ar":"أطفال"}],"active":1,"actions":[{"icon":"shopping-bag","count":1}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"You may also like","ar":"قد يعجبك أيضًا"}},{"kind":"listitem","art":"sneakers","text":{"en":"White sneakers","ar":"حذاء رياضي أبيض"},"value":{"en":"1,200 EGP","ar":"1,200 جنيه"}},{"kind":"group","tone":"night","blocks":[{"kind":"button","style":"plain","ring":"white","text":{"en":"Returns","ar":"الإرجاع"}},{"kind":"button","style":"plain","text":{"en":"Contact us","ar":"تواصل معنا"},"gap":"xs"}]}]}},{"id":"none","text":{"en":"Turn focus off in the footer; few people go there","ar":"أوقف التركيز في التذييل؛ فقليلون يذهبون إليه"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"lamha","name":{"en":"Lamha","ar":"لمحة"},"color":"#7C3AED","icon":"t-shirt","domain":"lamha.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"lamha.example/men/linen-shirt","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Women","ar":"نساء"},{"en":"Men","ar":"رجال"},{"en":"Kids","ar":"أطفال"}],"active":1,"actions":[{"icon":"shopping-bag","count":1}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"You may also like","ar":"قد يعجبك أيضًا"}},{"kind":"listitem","art":"sneakers","text":{"en":"White sneakers","ar":"حذاء رياضي أبيض"},"value":{"en":"1,200 EGP","ar":"1,200 جنيه"}},{"kind":"group","tone":"night","blocks":[{"kind":"button","style":"plain","text":{"en":"Returns","ar":"الإرجاع"}},{"kind":"button","style":"plain","text":{"en":"Contact us","ar":"تواصل معنا"},"gap":"xs"}]}]}}],"answer":["white"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-028","when":["keep"],"feedback":{"en":"Purple almost disappears on the dark footer. Same style, different colour: use white there.","ar":"البنفسجي يكاد يختفي على التذييل الداكن. نفس الشكل، بلون مختلف: استخدم الأبيض هناك."}},{"id":"MC-P05-027","when":["none"],"feedback":{"en":"Returns and contact links are exactly what some people need. Without focus, keyboard users are lost there.","ar":"روابط الإرجاع والتواصل هي بالضبط ما يحتاجه بعض الناس. وبدون تركيز، يضيع مستخدم لوحة المفاتيح هناك."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Look at the purple outline on the dark footer. Is it clear?","ar":"انظر إلى الإطار البنفسجي على التذييل الداكن. هل هو واضح؟"},{"en":"Which option keeps focus and makes it stand out from the dark?","ar":"أي خيار يُبقي التركيز ويجعله يبرز على الداكن؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Right. White shows clearly on dark.","ar":"صحيح. الأبيض يظهر بوضوح على الداكن."},"explain":{"en":"Check focus on every background the site has. Keep the style, and switch the colour where it's needed.","ar":"افحص التركيز على كل خلفية في الموقع. أبقِ الشكل، وغيّر اللون حيث يلزم."}},{"id":"S08","type":"card","part":"recap","icons":["eye","color","contrast","clock"],"title":{"en":"What you did","ar":"ماذا تعلّمت"},"body":{"en":"- **Restyle, don't remove:** you replaced the browser's line with your brand outline.\n- **A line, not a colour:** you put an outline on the focused size.\n- **On brand colours:** you used white with a dark edge on the purple button.\n- **Instant:** you chose focus that shows at once.\n- **Dark areas:** you switched to a white outline in the footer.\n\nNext lesson: skipping long menus, and dropdowns that work with keys.","ar":"- **غيّر الشكل، لا تحذف:** استبدلت خط المتصفح بإطار بلون هويتكم.\n- **خط، لا لون:** وضعت إطارًا على المقاس الذي عليه التركيز.\n- **على ألوان الهوية:** استخدمت الأبيض بحافة داكنة على الزر البنفسجي.\n- **فوري:** اخترت تركيزًا يظهر في الحال.\n- **المناطق الداكنة:** غيّرت الإطار إلى الأبيض في التذييل.\n\nالدرس التالي: تخطّي القوائم الطويلة، وقوائم منسدلة تعمل بالمفاتيح."}}]}$uxg$::jsonb),
  ($uxg$P05-U03-L03$uxg$, $uxg$7cfec3155f469b3a1757c7ab83ca15caaebf6c527bb8812037031fa076b3736d$uxg$, $uxg${"id":"P05-U03-L03","mode":"lesson","minutes":7,"title":{"en":"Skip the long menu, browse the list","ar":"تخطَّ القائمة الطويلة، وتصفّح الخيارات"},"summary":{"en":"Let keyboard users skip a news site's long menu, and fix dropdowns that pick too early.","ar":"دع مستخدمي لوحة المفاتيح يتخطّون قائمة موقع أخبار طويلة، وأصلح قوائم منسدلة تختار قبل أن يقرّر المستخدم."},"speaker":"karim","review_labels":{"MC-P05-030":{"en":"A skip link lets keyboard users jump past the menu","ar":"رابط التخطّي يجعل مستخدم لوحة المفاتيح يتخطّى القائمة"},"MC-P05-031":{"en":"The skip link must land on the main content","ar":"رابط التخطّي يجب أن يُوصل إلى المحتوى الرئيسي"},"MC-P05-032":{"en":"Show the skip link when people press Tab","ar":"أظهر رابط التخطّي حين يضغط الناس Tab"},"MC-P05-033":{"en":"Arrow keys browse; Enter picks","ar":"الأسهم للتصفّح، وEnter للاختيار"},"MC-P05-034":{"en":"Long lists need type-to-jump","ar":"القوائم الطويلة تحتاج الانتقال بكتابة أول حرف"}},"steps":[{"id":"S01","type":"card","part":"hook","title":{"en":"40 presses to the first story","ar":"40 ضغطة حتى أول خبر"},"body":{"en":"I'm building a news site. The top menu has 40 links: sections, cities and sports teams.\n\nA reader who uses only the keyboard says he has to press Tab 40 times on every page before he reaches a story.","ar":"أبني موقعًا إخباريًا. القائمة العلوية فيها 40 رابطًا: أقسام، ومدن، وفرق رياضية.\n\nويقول قارئ يستخدم لوحة المفاتيح فقط إنه يضغط Tab أربعين مرة في كل صفحة قبل أن يصل إلى أي خبر."},"mock":{"app":{"id":"mirsad","name":{"en":"Mirsad","ar":"مرصد"},"color":"#B91C1C","icon":"newspaper","domain":"mirsad.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"mirsad.example/egypt/new-metro-line","navbar":{"actions":[{"icon":"magnifying-glass"},{"icon":"user"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Home · Egypt · World · Business · Sport · Cairo · Alexandria · Giza · Al Ahly · Zamalek · Tech · Health · … (40 links)","ar":"الرئيسية · مصر · العالم · اقتصاد · رياضة · القاهرة · الإسكندرية · الجيزة · الأهلي · الزمالك · تقنية · صحة · … (40 رابطًا)"}},{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"New metro line opens in May","ar":"افتتاح خط مترو جديد في مايو"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"The line will link the east and west of the city…","ar":"سيربط الخط شرق المدينة بغربها…"},"gap":"xs"}]}},{"id":"S02","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P05-U03-03","part":"try","rules":["R12"],"value":{"en":"Try first. Keyboard-Only Navigation (NN/g): keep the menu at the top, where people expect it, and offer a Skip Navigation link so keyboard users can jump past it like mouse users do.","ar":"جرّب أولًا. التنقّل بلوحة المفاتيح فقط (NN/g): أبقِ القائمة في الأعلى حيث يتوقّعها الناس، وقدّم رابط تخطٍّ ليقفز مستخدم لوحة المفاتيح فوقها كما يفعل مستخدم الماوس."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/keyboard-accessibility/","quote":"Offering a Skip Navigation link provides some of that benefit to keyboard-only users."},"prompt":{"en":"Tap each option to see the change. Which one gets keyboard readers to the story fastest?","ar":"اضغط على كل خيار لترى التغيير. أي خيار يُوصل القرّاء الذين يستخدمون لوحة المفاتيح إلى الخبر بأسرع شكل؟"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"app":{"id":"mirsad","name":{"en":"Mirsad","ar":"مرصد"},"color":"#B91C1C","icon":"newspaper","domain":"mirsad.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"mirsad.example/egypt/new-metro-line","navbar":{"actions":[{"icon":"magnifying-glass"},{"icon":"user"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Home · Egypt · World · Business · Sport · Cairo · Alexandria · Giza · Al Ahly · Zamalek · Tech · Health · … (40 links)","ar":"الرئيسية · مصر · العالم · اقتصاد · رياضة · القاهرة · الإسكندرية · الجيزة · الأهلي · الزمالك · تقنية · صحة · … (40 رابطًا)"}},{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"New metro line opens in May","ar":"افتتاح خط مترو جديد في مايو"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"The line will link the east and west of the city…","ar":"سيربط الخط شرق المدينة بغربها…"},"gap":"xs"}]},"options":[{"id":"bottom","text":{"en":"Move the menu to the bottom of the page","ar":"انقل القائمة إلى أسفل الصفحة"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"mirsad","name":{"en":"Mirsad","ar":"مرصد"},"color":"#B91C1C","icon":"newspaper","domain":"mirsad.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"mirsad.example/egypt/new-metro-line","navbar":{"actions":[{"icon":"magnifying-glass"},{"icon":"user"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"New metro line opens in May","ar":"افتتاح خط مترو جديد في مايو"}},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"The line will link the east and west of the city…","ar":"سيربط الخط شرق المدينة بغربها…"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Home · Egypt · World · Business · Sport · … (40 links)","ar":"الرئيسية · مصر · العالم · اقتصاد · رياضة · … (40 رابطًا)"},"gap":"l"}]}},{"id":"top","text":{"en":"Add a \"Back to top\" link at the end of each story","ar":"أضف رابط «العودة للأعلى» في نهاية كل خبر"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"mirsad","name":{"en":"Mirsad","ar":"مرصد"},"color":"#B91C1C","icon":"newspaper","domain":"mirsad.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"mirsad.example/egypt/new-metro-line","navbar":{"actions":[{"icon":"magnifying-glass"},{"icon":"user"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Home · Egypt · World · Business · Sport · … (40 links)","ar":"الرئيسية · مصر · العالم · اقتصاد · رياضة · … (40 رابطًا)"}},{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"New metro line opens in May","ar":"افتتاح خط مترو جديد في مايو"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"The line will link the east and west of the city…","ar":"سيربط الخط شرق المدينة بغربها…"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"link","text":{"en":"Back to top ↑","ar":"العودة للأعلى ↑"},"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"skip","text":{"en":"Add a \"Skip to main content\" link that appears on the first Tab","ar":"أضف رابط «انتقل إلى المحتوى الرئيسي» يظهر مع أول ضغطة Tab"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change (first Tab)","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير (أول Tab)"},"app":{"id":"mirsad","name":{"en":"Mirsad","ar":"مرصد"},"color":"#B91C1C","icon":"newspaper","domain":"mirsad.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"mirsad.example/egypt/new-metro-line","navbar":{"actions":[{"icon":"magnifying-glass"},{"icon":"user"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"link","ring":"brand","text":{"en":"Skip to main content","ar":"انتقل إلى المحتوى الرئيسي"}},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Home · Egypt · World · Business · Sport · … (40 links)","ar":"الرئيسية · مصر · العالم · اقتصاد · رياضة · … (40 رابطًا)"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"New metro line opens in May","ar":"افتتاح خط مترو جديد في مايو"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"The line will link the east and west of the city…","ar":"سيربط الخط شرق المدينة بغربها…"},"gap":"xs"}]}}],"answer":["skip"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-030","when":["bottom"],"feedback":{"en":"People expect the menu at the top, so moving it confuses everyone. A skip link keeps the menu and lets keyboard users jump past it.","ar":"الناس يتوقّعون القائمة في الأعلى، فنقلها يُربك الجميع. أما رابط التخطّي فيُبقي القائمة ويجعل مستخدم لوحة المفاتيح يتخطّاها."}},{"id":"MC-P05-030","when":["top"],"feedback":{"en":"\"Back to top\" brings readers back to the 40 links. They need a way past them, not back to them.","ar":"«العودة للأعلى» تُرجع القارئ إلى الروابط الأربعين. وهو يحتاج طريقًا يتخطّاها، لا يعود إليها."}}],"hints":[{"en":"The reader presses Tab 40 times. What would let him jump over those links?","ar":"القارئ يضغط Tab أربعين مرة. ما الذي يجعله يتخطّى هذه الروابط؟"},{"en":"Which option keeps the menu where people expect it?","ar":"أي خيار يُبقي القائمة حيث يتوقّعها الناس؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Right. One Tab, one Enter, and he's at the story.","ar":"صحيح. ضغطة Tab، وضغطة Enter، ويصل إلى الخبر."},"explain":{"en":"Mouse users ignore the menu and click the story. A skip link gives keyboard users the same shortcut.","ar":"مستخدم الماوس يتجاهل القائمة ويضغط على الخبر مباشرة. ورابط التخطّي يعطي مستخدم لوحة المفاتيح نفس الاختصار."}},{"id":"S03","type":"card","part":"concept","icons":["order","target","eye","list","type"],"title":{"en":"Shortcuts for keyboard users","ar":"اختصارات لمستخدمي لوحة المفاتيح"},"body":{"en":"- **Skip link:** the first Tab shows \"Skip to main content\". Enter jumps past the menu.\n- **Land on the content:** it must move focus to the main heading, so the next Tab goes into the content, not back to the menu.\n- **Shown on Tab:** it appears when people press Tab, so mouse users don't see it and keyboard users do.\n- **Dropdowns, browse first:** the ↓ and ↑ keys move through options without choosing. Enter chooses.\n- **Type to jump:** in a long list, typing a letter jumps to the options that start with it.","ar":"- **رابط التخطّي (Skip link):** أول ضغطة Tab تُظهر «انتقل إلى المحتوى الرئيسي». وبضغطة Enter تتخطّى القائمة.\n- **يُوصل إلى المحتوى:** يجب أن ينقل التركيز إلى العنوان الرئيسي، لتذهب ضغطة Tab التالية إلى المحتوى، لا إلى القائمة مرة أخرى.\n- **يظهر مع Tab:** يظهر حين يضغط الناس Tab، فلا يراه مستخدم الماوس، ويراه مستخدم لوحة المفاتيح.\n- **القوائم المنسدلة (Dropdowns)، تصفّح أولًا:** مفتاحا ↓ و↑ يتنقّلان بين الخيارات دون اختيار. وEnter يختار.\n- **اكتب حرفًا لتنتقل:** في القائمة الطويلة، كتابة حرف تنقلك إلى الخيارات التي تبدأ به."}},{"id":"S04","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P05-U03-03","part":"guided","rules":["R06"],"value":{"en":"Keyboard-Only Navigation (NN/g): Enter on the skip link should take users to the page heading so they can continue tabbing in the content; this last step is often overlooked, but essential.","ar":"التنقّل بلوحة المفاتيح فقط (NN/g): يجب أن يأخذ Enter على رابط التخطّي المستخدم إلى عنوان الصفحة، ليُكمل التنقّل داخل المحتوى؛ وهذه الخطوة الأخيرة كثيرًا ما تُنسى، لكنها ضرورية."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/keyboard-accessibility/","quote":"This last step is frequently overlooked, but essential."},"scenario":{"en":"We added the skip link. The page scrolls down to the story when you press it. But the next Tab goes to the menu again.","ar":"أضفنا رابط التخطّي. وحين تضغطه، تنزل الصفحة إلى الخبر. لكن ضغطة Tab التالية تذهب إلى القائمة مرة أخرى."},"prompt":{"en":"Where should the skip link move the keyboard focus?","ar":"إلى أين يجب أن ينقل رابط التخطّي تركيز لوحة المفاتيح؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"mirsad","name":{"en":"Mirsad","ar":"مرصد"},"color":"#B91C1C","icon":"newspaper","domain":"mirsad.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"mirsad.example/egypt/new-metro-line","navbar":{"actions":[{"icon":"magnifying-glass"},{"icon":"user"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"link","text":{"en":"Skip to main content","ar":"انتقل إلى المحتوى الرئيسي"}},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Home · Egypt · World · … (40 links)","ar":"الرئيسية · مصر · العالم · … (40 رابطًا)"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"New metro line opens in May","ar":"افتتاح خط مترو جديد في مايو"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"link","text":{"en":"Read the full timetable","ar":"اقرأ الجدول الكامل"},"gap":"s"}],"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"}},"options":[{"id":"heading","text":{"en":"To the story's main heading, so the next Tab goes to the story's first link","ar":"إلى العنوان الرئيسي للخبر، لتذهب ضغطة Tab التالية إلى أول رابط في الخبر"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"mirsad","name":{"en":"Mirsad","ar":"مرصد"},"color":"#B91C1C","icon":"newspaper","domain":"mirsad.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"mirsad.example/egypt/new-metro-line","navbar":{"actions":[{"icon":"magnifying-glass"},{"icon":"user"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"link","text":{"en":"Skip to main content","ar":"انتقل إلى المحتوى الرئيسي"}},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Home · Egypt · World · … (40 links)","ar":"الرئيسية · مصر · العالم · … (40 رابطًا)"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"New metro line opens in May","ar":"افتتاح خط مترو جديد في مايو"},"gap":"m","ring":"brand"},{"kind":"link","text":{"en":"Read the full timetable","ar":"اقرأ الجدول الكامل"},"gap":"s"}],"reader":{"en":"New metro line opens in May, heading level 1.","ar":"افتتاح خط مترو جديد في مايو، عنوان مستوى 1."},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}},{"id":"pagetop","text":{"en":"To the very top of the page","ar":"إلى أعلى الصفحة تمامًا"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"mirsad","name":{"en":"Mirsad","ar":"مرصد"},"color":"#B91C1C","icon":"newspaper","domain":"mirsad.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"mirsad.example/egypt/new-metro-line","navbar":{"actions":[{"icon":"magnifying-glass"},{"icon":"user"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"link","text":{"en":"Skip to main content","ar":"انتقل إلى المحتوى الرئيسي"},"ring":"brand"},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Home · Egypt · World · … (40 links)","ar":"الرئيسية · مصر · العالم · … (40 رابطًا)"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"New metro line opens in May","ar":"افتتاح خط مترو جديد في مايو"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"link","text":{"en":"Read the full timetable","ar":"اقرأ الجدول الكامل"},"gap":"s"}],"reader":{"en":"Mirsad, top of page. Skip to main content, link.","ar":"مرصد، أعلى الصفحة. انتقل إلى المحتوى الرئيسي، رابط."},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}},{"id":"search","text":{"en":"To the search box in the menu","ar":"إلى مربع البحث في القائمة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"mirsad","name":{"en":"Mirsad","ar":"مرصد"},"color":"#B91C1C","icon":"newspaper","domain":"mirsad.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"mirsad.example/egypt/new-metro-line","navbar":{"actions":[{"icon":"magnifying-glass","note":{"en":"Focus is here","ar":"التركيز هنا"}},{"icon":"user"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"link","text":{"en":"Skip to main content","ar":"انتقل إلى المحتوى الرئيسي"}},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Home · Egypt · World · … (40 links)","ar":"الرئيسية · مصر · العالم · … (40 رابطًا)"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"New metro line opens in May","ar":"افتتاح خط مترو جديد في مايو"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"link","text":{"en":"Read the full timetable","ar":"اقرأ الجدول الكامل"},"gap":"s"}],"reader":{"en":"Search, edit text.","ar":"بحث، حقل نص."},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}}],"answer":["heading"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-031","when":["pagetop","search"],"feedback":{"en":"Both leave focus at or in the menu, so Tab goes through the 40 links again. Focus must land on the story.","ar":"الاثنان يتركان التركيز عند القائمة أو داخلها، فيمرّ Tab على الروابط الأربعين مرة أخرى. يجب أن يصل التركيز إلى الخبر."}}],"hints":[{"en":"After the skip, where should the next Tab go?","ar":"بعد التخطّي، إلى أين يجب أن تذهب ضغطة Tab التالية؟"},{"en":"Which place is after the menu, not in it?","ar":"أي مكان يأتي بعد القائمة، لا داخلها؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Moving the page isn't enough; the focus has to move too.","ar":"صحيح. نزول الصفحة لا يكفي؛ يجب أن ينتقل التركيز أيضًا."},"explain":{"en":"A skip link that only scrolls the page looks fine, but the keyboard is still at the top. Move focus to the main heading.","ar":"رابط التخطّي الذي ينزل بالصفحة فقط يبدو سليمًا، لكن لوحة المفاتيح ما زالت في الأعلى. انقل التركيز إلى العنوان الرئيسي."},"speaker":"karim"},{"id":"S05","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P05-U03-04","part":"guided","rules":["R06"],"value":{"en":"Keyboard-Only Navigation (NN/g): dropdowns fail by keyboard when the down arrow selects the first item; arrows should move between options and Enter should make the selection.","ar":"التنقّل بلوحة المفاتيح فقط (NN/g): القائمة المنسدلة تفشل بلوحة المفاتيح حين يختار سهم ↓ أول خيار مباشرة؛ يجب أن تتنقّل الأسهم بين الخيارات، وأن يختار Enter."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/keyboard-accessibility/","quote":"Instead, the arrow-down key should let the user scroll between Apples, Bananas, and Oranges and use Enter to make their selection."},"scenario":{"en":"Readers sort stories with a \"Sort by\" dropdown: Newest, Oldest, Most read. Right now, one press of ↓ picks \"Oldest\" and reloads the page.","ar":"يرتّب القرّاء الأخبار بقائمة منسدلة «ترتيب حسب»: الأحدث، الأقدم، الأكثر قراءة. والآن، ضغطة واحدة على ↓ تختار «الأقدم» وتُعيد تحميل الصفحة."},"prompt":{"en":"Tap each option to see the change. Which one lets a keyboard reader reach \"Most read\" easily?","ar":"اضغط على كل خيار لترى التغيير. أي خيار يجعل القارئ الذي يستخدم لوحة المفاتيح يصل إلى «الأكثر قراءة» بسهولة؟"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"Now (after one ↓)","ar":"الآن (بعد ضغطة ↓ واحدة)"},"app":{"id":"mirsad","name":{"en":"Mirsad","ar":"مرصد"},"color":"#B91C1C","icon":"newspaper","domain":"mirsad.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"mirsad.example/egypt","navbar":{"actions":[{"icon":"magnifying-glass"},{"icon":"user"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Egypt","ar":"مصر"}},{"kind":"select","label":{"en":"Sort by","ar":"ترتيب حسب"},"filled":true,"text":{"en":"Oldest","ar":"الأقدم"}},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Page reloading…","ar":"جارٍ إعادة تحميل الصفحة…"},"gap":"xs"}]},"options":[{"id":"undo","text":{"en":"Keep picking on ↓, and add an Undo button after each reload","ar":"أبقِ الاختيار مع ↓، وأضف زر «تراجع» بعد كل إعادة تحميل"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change (after one ↓)","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير (بعد ضغطة ↓ واحدة)"},"app":{"id":"mirsad","name":{"en":"Mirsad","ar":"مرصد"},"color":"#B91C1C","icon":"newspaper","domain":"mirsad.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"mirsad.example/egypt","navbar":{"actions":[{"icon":"magnifying-glass"},{"icon":"user"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Egypt","ar":"مصر"}},{"kind":"select","label":{"en":"Sort by","ar":"ترتيب حسب"},"filled":true,"text":{"en":"Oldest","ar":"الأقدم"}},{"kind":"button","style":"plain","text":{"en":"Undo","ar":"تراجع"},"gap":"xs"}]}},{"id":"browse","text":{"en":"Let ↓ and ↑ move through the open list, and Enter choose","ar":"اجعل ↓ و↑ يتنقّلان في القائمة المفتوحة، وEnter يختار"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change (after two ↓)","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير (بعد ضغطتي ↓)"},"app":{"id":"mirsad","name":{"en":"Mirsad","ar":"مرصد"},"color":"#B91C1C","icon":"newspaper","domain":"mirsad.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"mirsad.example/egypt","navbar":{"actions":[{"icon":"magnifying-glass"},{"icon":"user"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Egypt","ar":"مصر"}},{"kind":"select","label":{"en":"Sort by","ar":"ترتيب حسب"},"filled":true,"text":{"en":"Newest","ar":"الأحدث"}},{"kind":"group","gap":"xs","blocks":[{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Newest","ar":"الأحدث"}},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Oldest","ar":"الأقدم"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"meta","ring":"brand","text":{"en":"Most read","ar":"الأكثر قراءة"},"gap":"xs"}]},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Press Enter to choose","ar":"اضغط Enter للاختيار"},"gap":"xs"}]}},{"id":"remove","text":{"en":"Remove the dropdown and always sort by Newest","ar":"احذف القائمة المنسدلة، ورتّب دائمًا حسب الأحدث"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"mirsad","name":{"en":"Mirsad","ar":"مرصد"},"color":"#B91C1C","icon":"newspaper","domain":"mirsad.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"mirsad.example/egypt","navbar":{"actions":[{"icon":"magnifying-glass"},{"icon":"user"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Egypt","ar":"مصر"}},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Sorted by newest","ar":"مرتّبة حسب الأحدث"}}]}}],"answer":["browse"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-033","when":["undo"],"feedback":{"en":"Every ↓ still reloads the page. To reach \"Most read\", the reader would reload twice and undo. Arrows should only move; Enter should pick.","ar":"كل ضغطة ↓ ما زالت تُعيد تحميل الصفحة. وللوصول إلى «الأكثر قراءة»، سيُعيد القارئ التحميل مرتين ويتراجع. يجب أن تتنقّل الأسهم فقط، وأن يختار Enter."}},{"id":"MC-P05-033","when":["remove"],"feedback":{"en":"Now nobody can sort, with a mouse or keys. Fix how the keys work instead of taking the choice away.","ar":"الآن لا يستطيع أحد الترتيب، لا بالماوس ولا بالمفاتيح. أصلح طريقة عمل المفاتيح بدل حذف الخيار."}}],"hints":[{"en":"\"Most read\" is third. What happens on the way there now?","ar":"«الأكثر قراءة» هو الثالث. ماذا يحدث الآن في الطريق إليه؟"},{"en":"Which option separates moving from choosing?","ar":"أي خيار يفصل بين التنقّل والاختيار؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Arrows browse, Enter picks.","ar":"صحيح. الأسهم للتصفّح، وEnter للاختيار."},"explain":{"en":"A mouse user sees all options before clicking one. Arrow keys should give keyboard users the same look before they choose.","ar":"مستخدم الماوس يرى كل الخيارات قبل أن يضغط على أحدها. ويجب أن تعطي الأسهم مستخدم لوحة المفاتيح نفس الفرصة قبل أن يختار."},"speaker":"karim"},{"id":"S06","type":"compare","skill":"SK-P05-U03-04","part":"contrast","confidence":true,"rules":["R11"],"value":{"en":"Contrast: arrows only vs type-to-jump in a long list. Drop-Down Menus (NN/g): in a dropdown box, users should be able to type a letter and jump to options starting with it.","ar":"مقارنة: الأسهم فقط مقابل القفز بكتابة حرف في قائمة طويلة. القوائم المنسدلة (NN/g): في القائمة المنسدلة، يجب أن يستطيع المستخدم كتابة حرف ليقفز إلى الخيارات التي تبدأ به."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/drop-down-menus/","quote":"In a dropdown box, users should be able to type a letter and quickly navigate to options starting with that letter."},"scenario":{"en":"Readers who sign up pick their country from a dropdown with 190 countries, A to Z. Our two test builds work differently.","ar":"القرّاء الذين يسجّلون يختارون بلدهم من قائمة منسدلة فيها 190 بلدًا، مرتّبة أبجديًا. ونسختا الاختبار عندنا تعملان بطريقتين مختلفتين."},"prompt":{"en":"Which build lets a keyboard user pick Egypt fastest?","ar":"أي نسخة تجعل مستخدم لوحة المفاتيح يختار مصر بأسرع شكل؟"},"a":{"label":{"en":"A: Only ↓ and ↑ move through the list","ar":"A: الأسهم ↓ و↑ فقط تتنقّل في القائمة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"mirsad","name":{"en":"Mirsad","ar":"مرصد"},"color":"#B91C1C","icon":"newspaper","domain":"mirsad.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"mirsad.example/sign-up","navbar":{"actions":[{"icon":"magnifying-glass"},{"icon":"user"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Create your account","ar":"أنشئ حسابك"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Email","ar":"البريد الإلكتروني"},"filled":true,"text":"mai@mail.example"},{"kind":"select","label":{"en":"Country","ar":"البلد"},"filled":true,"text":{"en":"Afghanistan","ar":"أفغانستان"}},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Egypt is 60 presses of ↓ away","ar":"مصر على بُعد 60 ضغطة ↓"},"gap":"xs"}]}},"b":{"label":{"en":"B: Typing a letter jumps to countries starting with it","ar":"B: كتابة حرف تنقلك إلى البلاد التي تبدأ به"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"mirsad","name":{"en":"Mirsad","ar":"مرصد"},"color":"#B91C1C","icon":"newspaper","domain":"mirsad.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"mirsad.example/sign-up","navbar":{"actions":[{"icon":"magnifying-glass"},{"icon":"user"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Create your account","ar":"أنشئ حسابك"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Email","ar":"البريد الإلكتروني"},"filled":true,"text":"mai@mail.example"},{"kind":"select","label":{"en":"Country","ar":"البلد"},"filled":true,"text":{"en":"Ecuador","ar":"مالطا"}},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"After typing E: Ecuador, then ↓ once to Egypt","ar":"بعد كتابة م: مالطا، ثم ضغطات ↓ قليلة إلى مصر"},"gap":"xs"}]}},"answer":"b","reason":{"prompt":{"en":"Why is B faster?","ar":"لماذا B أسرع؟"},"options":[{"id":"modern","text":{"en":"It looks more modern","ar":"يبدو أحدث"}},{"id":"jump","text":{"en":"One letter gets close at once, instead of dozens of arrow presses","ar":"حرف واحد يقرّبك فورًا، بدل عشرات الضغطات على الأسهم"}},{"id":"laptop","text":{"en":"Many laptops have no arrow keys","ar":"كثير من أجهزة الـ Laptop ليس فيها أسهم"}}],"answer":["jump"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-034","when":["modern","laptop"],"feedback":{"en":"It's about effort. In a list of 190, arrows alone mean dozens of presses. A letter jumps close in one.","ar":"الأمر يتعلّق بالجهد. في قائمة من 190 خيارًا، الأسهم وحدها تعني عشرات الضغطات. أما الحرف فيقرّبك بضغطة واحدة."}}]},"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-034","when":["a"],"feedback":{"en":"Arrows work, but 60 presses is slow and tiring, especially for hands that shake. Type-to-jump gets there in one or two keys.","ar":"الأسهم تعمل، لكن 60 ضغطة بطيئة ومتعبة، خاصة لمن ترتجف يداه. أما كتابة الحرف فتوصلك بضغطة أو اثنتين."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Count the key presses to Egypt in each build.","ar":"احسب عدد الضغطات حتى مصر في كل نسخة."},{"en":"Which build uses the first letter of the country?","ar":"أي نسخة تستخدم أول حرف من اسم البلد؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Type-to-jump makes long lists quick.","ar":"صحيح. الانتقال بكتابة الحرف يجعل القوائم الطويلة سريعة."},"explain":{"en":"For long lists, support typing a letter. Arrows are fine for short lists, but slow for 190 options.","ar":"في القوائم الطويلة، ادعم كتابة حرف. والأسهم مناسبة للقوائم القصيرة، لكنها بطيئة مع 190 خيارًا."},"speaker":"karim"},{"id":"S07","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P05-U03-03","part":"independent","speaker":"hana","rules":["R14"],"value":{"en":"New case. Keyboard-Only Navigation (NN/g): a good skip link appears only when users tab through the page, so it doesn't disturb the design for mouse users, and sighted keyboard users can see it.","ar":"حالة جديدة. التنقّل بلوحة المفاتيح فقط (NN/g): رابط التخطّي الجيد يظهر فقط حين يتنقّل المستخدم بـ Tab، فلا يغيّر التصميم لمستخدمي الماوس، ويراه مستخدم لوحة المفاتيح المبصر."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/keyboard-accessibility/","quote":"This link only becomes available when users tab through the page, so it doesn’t disturb the visual design for mouse users."},"scenario":{"en":"My gym's website has a long top menu. Our designer added a skip link, but made it invisible to everyone; only screen readers can hear it.","ar":"موقع النادي الذي أملكه فيه قائمة علوية طويلة. وأضاف المصمّم رابط تخطٍّ، لكنه جعله مخفيًا عن الجميع؛ لا يسمعه إلا قارئ الشاشة."},"prompt":{"en":"Tap each option to see the change. Which one helps every keyboard user, without changing the page for mouse users?","ar":"اضغط على كل خيار لترى التغيير. أي خيار يساعد كل مستخدمي لوحة المفاتيح، دون تغيير الصفحة لمستخدمي الماوس؟"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"Now (after the first Tab)","ar":"الآن (بعد أول Tab)"},"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"nashat.example","navbar":{"actions":[{"icon":"magnifying-glass"},{"icon":"user"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Classes · Trainers · Prices · Branches · Kids · Women · Pool · …","ar":"الحصص · المدرّبون · الأسعار · الفروع · الأطفال · السيدات · المسبح · …"}},{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Book your free trial","ar":"احجز حصتك التجريبية المجانية"},"gap":"m"}]},"options":[{"id":"banner","text":{"en":"Show it to everyone as a big purple bar at the top","ar":"أظهره للجميع كشريط بنفسجي كبير في الأعلى"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change (for everyone)","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير (للجميع)"},"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"nashat.example","navbar":{"actions":[{"icon":"magnifying-glass"},{"icon":"user"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"banner","text":{"en":"Skip to main content","ar":"انتقل إلى المحتوى الرئيسي"}},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Classes · Trainers · Prices · Branches · Kids · Women · Pool · …","ar":"الحصص · المدرّبون · الأسعار · الفروع · الأطفال · السيدات · المسبح · …"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Book your free trial","ar":"احجز حصتك التجريبية المجانية"},"gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"keep","text":{"en":"Keep it for screen readers only; they are the ones who need it","ar":"أبقِه لمستخدمي قارئ الشاشة فقط؛ فهم من يحتاجونه"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change (after the first Tab)","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير (بعد أول Tab)"},"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"nashat.example","navbar":{"actions":[{"icon":"magnifying-glass"},{"icon":"user"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Classes · Trainers · Prices · Branches · Kids · Women · Pool · …","ar":"الحصص · المدرّبون · الأسعار · الفروع · الأطفال · السيدات · المسبح · …"}},{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Book your free trial","ar":"احجز حصتك التجريبية المجانية"},"gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"ontab","text":{"en":"Show it when someone presses Tab, and hide it again after","ar":"أظهره حين يضغط أحد Tab، وأخفِه بعد ذلك"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change (after the first Tab)","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير (بعد أول Tab)"},"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"nashat.example","navbar":{"actions":[{"icon":"magnifying-glass"},{"icon":"user"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"link","ring":"brand","text":{"en":"Skip to main content","ar":"انتقل إلى المحتوى الرئيسي"}},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Classes · Trainers · Prices · Branches · Kids · Women · Pool · …","ar":"الحصص · المدرّبون · الأسعار · الفروع · الأطفال · السيدات · المسبح · …"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Book your free trial","ar":"احجز حصتك التجريبية المجانية"},"gap":"m"}]}}],"answer":["ontab"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-032","when":["banner"],"feedback":{"en":"It works, but mouse users now see a bar they don't need. Showing it on Tab helps keyboard users without changing their page.","ar":"يعمل، لكن مستخدمي الماوس صاروا يرون شريطًا لا يحتاجونه. أما إظهاره مع Tab فيساعد مستخدم لوحة المفاتيح دون أن تتغيّر الصفحة لمستخدمي الماوس."}},{"id":"MC-P05-032","when":["keep"],"feedback":{"en":"Many keyboard users can see the screen and don't use a screen reader. They can't use a link they can't see.","ar":"كثير من مستخدمي لوحة المفاتيح يرون الشاشة ولا يستخدمون قارئ الشاشة. ولا يستطيعون استخدام رابط لا يرونه."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Who uses the keyboard but can see the screen?","ar":"من يستخدم لوحة المفاتيح ويرى الشاشة؟"},{"en":"Which option shows the link only to people who press Tab?","ar":"أي خيار يُظهر الرابط فقط لمن يضغط Tab؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Keyboard users see it; mouse users don't need to.","ar":"صحيح. يراه مستخدم لوحة المفاتيح، ولا يحتاج إليه مستخدم الماوس."},"explain":{"en":"Remember who uses the keyboard: not only blind people. A skip link must be visible when it has focus.","ar":"تذكّر من يستخدم لوحة المفاتيح: ليسوا المكفوفين وحدهم. فرابط التخطّي يجب أن يكون ظاهرًا حين يكون عليه التركيز."}},{"id":"S08","type":"card","part":"recap","icons":["order","target","eye","list","type"],"title":{"en":"What you did","ar":"ماذا تعلّمت"},"body":{"en":"- **Skip link:** you let readers jump past 40 menu links.\n- **Focus lands on content:** you moved focus to the story's heading.\n- **Shown on Tab:** you showed the skip link to keyboard users only.\n- **Browse, then pick:** you made arrows move and Enter choose.\n- **Type to jump:** you chose the country list that jumps by letter.\n\nNext: the skill check, with all five keyboard ideas.","ar":"- **رابط التخطّي:** جعلت القرّاء يتخطّون 40 رابطًا.\n- **التركيز يصل إلى المحتوى:** نقلت التركيز إلى عنوان الخبر.\n- **يظهر مع Tab:** أظهرت رابط التخطّي لمستخدمي لوحة المفاتيح فقط.\n- **تصفّح ثم اختر:** جعلت الأسهم تتنقّل وEnter يختار.\n- **اكتب حرفًا لتنتقل:** اخترت قائمة البلاد التي تنقلك بكتابة أول حرف.\n\nالتالي: اختبار المهارة، بكل أفكار لوحة المفاتيح الخمس."}}]}$uxg$::jsonb),
  ($uxg$P05-U03-L04$uxg$, $uxg$7ef911d59bf800fcc429084f617816aba7e3409baf4c1064c190149264e9dd28$uxg$, $uxg${"id":"P05-U03-L04","mode":"check","minutes":6,"title":{"en":"Skill check: keyboard and focus","ar":"اختبار المهارة: لوحة المفاتيح والتركيز"},"summary":{"en":"Check a grocery website for keyboard users, from testing to menus, on your own.","ar":"افحص موقع بقالة لمستخدمي لوحة المفاتيح، من الاختبار إلى القوائم، بنفسك."},"speaker":"tarek","steps":[{"id":"S01","type":"card","part":"hook","title":{"en":"Tarek's grocery website","ar":"موقع البقالة الذي يديره طارق"},"body":{"en":"I manage the product for an online grocery website. We launch next month, and some of our customers shop only with the keyboard.\n\nYour job: check five parts before launch.\n\nThis is a skill check: there are no hints, and you'll see your result at the end.","ar":"أنا مدير المنتج (Product manager) لموقع بقالة أونلاين. سنطلقه الشهر القادم، وبعض عملائنا يتسوّقون بلوحة المفاتيح فقط.\n\nمهمّتك: افحص خمسة أجزاء قبل الإطلاق.\n\nهذا اختبار مهارة: لا توجد تلميحات، وسترى نتيجتك في النهاية."},"mock":{"app":{"id":"sallah","name":{"en":"Sallah","ar":"سلّة"},"color":"#2E9E5B","icon":"basket","domain":"sallah.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"sallah.example","navbar":{"search":{"en":"Search Sallah","ar":"ابحث في سلّة"},"actions":[{"icon":"basket","count":3}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Fruit · Vegetables · Dairy · Bakery · Drinks · … (30 links)","ar":"فاكهة · خضار · ألبان · مخبوزات · مشروبات · … (30 رابطًا)"}},{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Fresh today","ar":"طازج اليوم"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"row","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Tomatoes · 25 EGP/kg","ar":"طماطم · 25 جنيه/كجم"}},{"kind":"button","style":"plain","text":"+"}]}]}},{"id":"S02","type":"choose","skill":"SK-P05-U03-01","part":"check","rules":["R19"],"value":{"en":"Skill check. Keyboard-Only Navigation (NN/g): a keyboard-accessible site lets users follow the focus, reach all interactive elements and bypass long navigation. Only doing the full order by keyboard checks all of that.","ar":"اختبار مهارة. التنقّل بلوحة المفاتيح فقط (NN/g): الموقع المناسب للوحة المفاتيح يجعل المستخدم يتابع التركيز، ويصل إلى كل العناصر، ويتخطّى القوائم الطويلة. وإتمام طلب كامل بلوحة المفاتيح هو ما يفحص كل ذلك."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/keyboard-accessibility/","quote":"To make your website keyboard accessible it is important to allow users to: 1) follow along with where the keyboard focus is, 2) navigate to all interactive elements, and 3) bypass the navigation if there are many links."},"scenario":{"en":"Our team has one day left for keyboard testing.","ar":"بقي لفريقنا يوم واحد لاختبار لوحة المفاتيح."},"prompt":{"en":"Which test should we run?","ar":"أي اختبار نجريه لنعرف أين يتوقّف من يتسوّق بلوحة المفاتيح؟"},"options":[{"id":"file","text":{"en":"Check the design file: every button should have a focus style drawn","ar":"نراجع ملف التصميم: يجب أن يكون لكل زر شكل تركيز مرسوم"}},{"id":"order","text":{"en":"Without a mouse, add three items, enter an address and pay","ar":"بدون ماوس، نضيف ثلاثة منتجات، ونكتب العنوان، وندفع"}},{"id":"devs","text":{"en":"Ask the developers to confirm that all buttons are built as real buttons","ar":"نطلب من المطوّرين أن يؤكّدوا أن كل الأزرار مبنية كأزرار حقيقية"}}],"answer":["order"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-024","when":["file","devs"],"feedback":{"en":"Both are useful, but neither shows what a customer meets. Doing the whole order by keyboard does.","ar":"الاثنان مفيدان، لكن لا يُظهر أيٌّ منهما ما يقابله العميل. أما إتمام الطلب كله بلوحة المفاتيح فيُظهره."}}],"explain":{"en":"From Lesson 1: put the mouse away and do the main task from start to end.","ar":"من الدرس 1: أبعِد الماوس وأنجز المهمة الأساسية من أولها لآخرها."},"speaker":"tarek"},{"id":"S03","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P05-U03-02","part":"check","rules":["R19"],"value":{"en":"Skill check. Button States (NN/g): stick to a stroke or outline for focus instead of colour change alone. A grey that gets slightly darker is easy to miss.","ar":"اختبار مهارة. حالات الأزرار (NN/g): استخدم خطًا أو إطارًا للتركيز بدل تغيير اللون وحده. والرمادي الذي يصير أغمق قليلًا سهل أن يفوت العين."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/button-states-communicate-interaction/","quote":"I strongly recommend that you stick to the stroke or outline to indicate focus, as opposed to relying on color change alone"},"scenario":{"en":"Each product has a + button to add it to the basket. When + has focus, it turns a slightly darker grey. Here, the + next to Tomatoes has focus.","ar":"لكل منتج زر + لإضافته إلى السلة. وحين يكون التركيز على +، يصير رماديًا أغمق قليلًا. وهنا التركيز على + بجانب الطماطم."},"prompt":{"en":"Tap each option to see the change. Which one shows clearly which + has focus?","ar":"اضغط على كل خيار لترى التغيير. أي خيار يوضّح أي زر + عليه التركيز؟"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"app":{"id":"sallah","name":{"en":"Sallah","ar":"سلّة"},"color":"#2E9E5B","icon":"basket","domain":"sallah.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"sallah.example/vegetables","navbar":{"search":{"en":"Search Sallah","ar":"ابحث في سلّة"},"actions":[{"icon":"basket","count":3}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"row","blocks":[{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Tomatoes","ar":"طماطم"}},{"kind":"chip","tone":"off","ring":"tint","text":"+"}]},{"kind":"row","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Cucumbers","ar":"خيار"}},{"kind":"chip","tone":"off","text":"+"}]}]},"options":[{"id":"darker","text":{"en":"Make the focused + a much darker grey","ar":"اجعل زر + الذي عليه التركيز رماديًا أغمق بكثير"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"sallah","name":{"en":"Sallah","ar":"سلّة"},"color":"#2E9E5B","icon":"basket","domain":"sallah.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"sallah.example/vegetables","navbar":{"search":{"en":"Search Sallah","ar":"ابحث في سلّة"},"actions":[{"icon":"basket","count":3}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"row","blocks":[{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Tomatoes","ar":"طماطم"}},{"kind":"chip","tone":"dark","text":"+"}]},{"kind":"row","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Cucumbers","ar":"خيار"}},{"kind":"chip","tone":"off","text":"+"}]}]}},{"id":"sound","text":{"en":"Play a small sound each time focus moves","ar":"شغّل صوتًا صغيرًا كلما تحرّك التركيز"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"sallah","name":{"en":"Sallah","ar":"سلّة"},"color":"#2E9E5B","icon":"basket","domain":"sallah.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"sallah.example/vegetables","navbar":{"search":{"en":"Search Sallah","ar":"ابحث في سلّة"},"actions":[{"icon":"basket","count":3}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"row","blocks":[{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Tomatoes","ar":"طماطم"}},{"kind":"chip","tone":"off","ring":"tint","text":"+ 🔈"}]},{"kind":"row","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Cucumbers","ar":"خيار"}},{"kind":"chip","tone":"off","text":"+"}]}]}},{"id":"outline","text":{"en":"Draw a thick outline around the focused +","ar":"ارسم إطارًا عريضًا حول زر + الذي عليه التركيز"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"sallah","name":{"en":"Sallah","ar":"سلّة"},"color":"#2E9E5B","icon":"basket","domain":"sallah.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"sallah.example/vegetables","navbar":{"search":{"en":"Search Sallah","ar":"ابحث في سلّة"},"actions":[{"icon":"basket","count":3}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"row","blocks":[{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Tomatoes","ar":"طماطم"}},{"kind":"chip","tone":"off","ring":"brand","text":"+"}]},{"kind":"row","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Cucumbers","ar":"خيار"}},{"kind":"chip","tone":"off","text":"+"}]}]}}],"answer":["outline"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-029","when":["darker"],"feedback":{"en":"Still a colour change only, and it can look like \"added\" or \"turned off\". An outline is the sign people expect for focus.","ar":"ما زال تغييرًا في اللون فقط، وقد يبدو كأنه «مُضاف» أو «معطّل». والإطار هو العلامة التي يتوقّعها الناس للتركيز."}},{"id":"MC-P05-027","when":["sound"],"feedback":{"en":"A sound says focus moved, not where it is. People still need to see which + Enter will press.","ar":"الصوت يقول إن التركيز تحرّك، لا أين هو. وما زال الناس يحتاجون أن يروا أي زر + سيضغطه Enter."}}],"explain":{"en":"From Lesson 2: show focus with a clear outline, not a colour change alone.","ar":"من الدرس 2: أظهر التركيز بإطار واضح، لا بتغيير اللون وحده."},"speaker":"tarek"},{"id":"S04","type":"choose","skill":"SK-P05-U03-03","part":"check","rules":["R19"],"value":{"en":"Skill check. Keyboard-Only Navigation (NN/g): a good skip link appears when tabbing, has a descriptive, concise name, and takes users to the page heading so they continue in the content.","ar":"اختبار مهارة. التنقّل بلوحة المفاتيح فقط (NN/g): رابط التخطّي الجيد يظهر عند الضغط على Tab، واسمه واضح ومختصر، ويأخذ المستخدم إلى عنوان الصفحة ليُكمل داخل المحتوى."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/keyboard-accessibility/","quote":"Hitting Enter on the Skip Navigation link takes users to the page heading Immigration & citizenship, allowing them to continue tabbing through the links in the body content on the page."},"scenario":{"en":"Every page starts with our 30-link category menu. I'm writing the spec for a skip link.","ar":"كل صفحة تبدأ بقائمة الأقسام عندنا، وفيها 30 رابطًا. وأنا أكتب الآن مواصفات (Spec) رابط التخطّي."},"prompt":{"en":"Which spec should I give the developer?","ar":"أي مواصفات أعطيها للمطوّر حتى يتخطّى مستخدم لوحة المفاتيح القائمة ويصل إلى المنتجات؟"},"options":[{"id":"good","text":{"en":"Appears on the first Tab, says \"Skip to products\", and moves focus to the \"Fresh today\" heading","ar":"يظهر مع أول Tab، ومكتوب عليه «انتقل إلى المنتجات»، وينقل التركيز إلى عنوان «طازج اليوم»"}},{"id":"scroll","text":{"en":"Always visible, says \"Skip\", and scrolls the page down to the products","ar":"ظاهر دائمًا، ومكتوب عليه «تخطَّ»، وينزل بالصفحة إلى المنتجات"}},{"id":"hidden","text":{"en":"Hidden from everyone except screen readers, and moves focus to the footer","ar":"مخفي عن الجميع ما عدا قارئ الشاشة، وينقل التركيز إلى التذييل"}}],"answer":["good"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-031","when":["scroll"],"feedback":{"en":"Scrolling leaves focus in the menu, and \"Skip\" doesn't say where it goes. Name the target and move focus to its heading.","ar":"النزول بالصفحة يترك التركيز في القائمة، و«تخطَّ» لا يقول إلى أين. اكتب الوجهة، وانقل التركيز إلى عنوانها."}},{"id":"MC-P05-032","when":["hidden"],"feedback":{"en":"Sighted keyboard users can't see it, and the footer skips the products too. Show it on Tab and land on the products.","ar":"مستخدم لوحة المفاتيح المبصر لا يراه، والانتقال إلى التذييل يتخطّى المنتجات أيضًا. أظهره مع Tab، واجعله يصل إلى المنتجات."}}],"explain":{"en":"From Lesson 3: shown on Tab, a clear name, and focus that lands on the main heading.","ar":"من الدرس 3: يظهر مع Tab، واسم واضح، وتركيز يصل إلى العنوان الرئيسي."},"speaker":"tarek"},{"id":"S05","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P05-U03-04","part":"check","rules":["R19"],"value":{"en":"Skill check. Drop-Down Menus (NN/g): dropdowns should support keys as well as the mouse; in a dropdown box, typing a letter should jump to options starting with it.","ar":"اختبار مهارة. القوائم المنسدلة (NN/g): يجب أن تدعم القوائم المنسدلة المفاتيح كما تدعم الماوس؛ وفي القائمة المنسدلة، كتابة حرف يجب أن تقفز إلى الخيارات التي تبدأ به."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/drop-down-menus/","quote":"Dropdowns (both menus and boxes) should support not only mouse input, but keys as well."},"scenario":{"en":"At checkout, customers pick their area from a dropdown of 120 areas, A to Z. Shubra is 95 presses of ↓ away.","ar":"عند الدفع، يختار العميل منطقته من قائمة منسدلة فيها 120 منطقة، مرتّبة أبجديًا. وشبرا على بُعد 95 ضغطة ↓."},"prompt":{"en":"Tap each option to see the change. Which one lets a keyboard user reach Shubra quickly?","ar":"اضغط على كل خيار لترى التغيير. أي خيار يجعل مستخدم لوحة المفاتيح يصل إلى شبرا بسرعة؟"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"app":{"id":"sallah","name":{"en":"Sallah","ar":"سلّة"},"color":"#2E9E5B","icon":"basket","domain":"sallah.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"sallah.example/checkout","navbar":{"search":{"en":"Search Sallah","ar":"ابحث في سلّة"},"actions":[{"icon":"basket","count":3}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Delivery address","ar":"عنوان التوصيل"}},{"kind":"select","label":{"en":"Area","ar":"المنطقة"},"filled":true,"text":{"en":"Abbasiya","ar":"العباسية"}},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Shubra: 95 presses of ↓","ar":"شبرا: 95 ضغطة ↓"},"gap":"xs"}]},"options":[{"id":"taller","text":{"en":"Make the open list taller, so 20 areas show at once","ar":"اجعل القائمة المفتوحة أطول، لتظهر 20 منطقة مرة واحدة"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"sallah","name":{"en":"Sallah","ar":"سلّة"},"color":"#2E9E5B","icon":"basket","domain":"sallah.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"sallah.example/checkout","navbar":{"search":{"en":"Search Sallah","ar":"ابحث في سلّة"},"actions":[{"icon":"basket","count":3}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Delivery address","ar":"عنوان التوصيل"}},{"kind":"select","label":{"en":"Area","ar":"المنطقة"},"filled":true,"text":{"en":"Abbasiya","ar":"العباسية"}},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"20 areas visible · Shubra: still 95 presses of ↓","ar":"20 منطقة ظاهرة · شبرا: ما زالت 95 ضغطة ↓"},"gap":"xs"}]}},{"id":"letter","text":{"en":"Let people type letters to jump: \"S\" goes to areas starting with S","ar":"اجعل الناس يكتبون حرفًا للانتقال: «ش» تذهب إلى المناطق التي تبدأ بالشين"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"sallah","name":{"en":"Sallah","ar":"سلّة"},"color":"#2E9E5B","icon":"basket","domain":"sallah.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"sallah.example/checkout","navbar":{"search":{"en":"Search Sallah","ar":"ابحث في سلّة"},"actions":[{"icon":"basket","count":3}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Delivery address","ar":"عنوان التوصيل"}},{"kind":"select","label":{"en":"Area","ar":"المنطقة"},"filled":true,"text":{"en":"Sayeda Zeinab","ar":"شبرا"}},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"After typing S: Sayeda Zeinab, then ↓ once to Shubra","ar":"بعد كتابة ش: شبرا مباشرة"},"gap":"xs"}]}},{"id":"split","text":{"en":"Split it into two shorter dropdowns, one for each half of the alphabet","ar":"قسّمها إلى قائمتين أقصر، واحدة لكل نصف من الحروف"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"sallah","name":{"en":"Sallah","ar":"سلّة"},"color":"#2E9E5B","icon":"basket","domain":"sallah.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"sallah.example/checkout","navbar":{"search":{"en":"Search Sallah","ar":"ابحث في سلّة"},"actions":[{"icon":"basket","count":3}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Delivery address","ar":"عنوان التوصيل"}},{"kind":"select","label":{"en":"Area (first half)","ar":"المنطقة (النصف الأول)"},"text":{"en":"Choose","ar":"اختر"}},{"kind":"select","label":{"en":"Area (second half)","ar":"المنطقة (النصف الثاني)"},"text":{"en":"Choose","ar":"اختر"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Shubra: still dozens of presses of ↓","ar":"شبرا: ما زالت عشرات الضغطات على ↓"},"gap":"xs"}]}}],"answer":["letter"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-034","when":["taller","split"],"feedback":{"en":"Keyboard users still press ↓ again and again. Typing a letter jumps close in one press.","ar":"ما زال مستخدم لوحة المفاتيح يضغط ↓ مرة بعد مرة. أما كتابة حرف فتقرّبه من وجهته بضغطة واحدة."}}],"explain":{"en":"From Lesson 3: long lists need type-to-jump.","ar":"من الدرس 3: القوائم الطويلة تحتاج الانتقال بكتابة أول حرف."},"speaker":"tarek"},{"id":"S06","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P05-U03-05","part":"check","rules":["R19"],"value":{"en":"Skill check. Keyboard-Only Navigation (NN/g): even the most beautiful site is useless to someone who can't reach its controls. A + that appears only on hover doesn't exist for keyboard users.","ar":"اختبار مهارة. التنقّل بلوحة المفاتيح فقط (NN/g): حتى أجمل موقع لا فائدة منه لمن لا يصل إلى عناصره. وزر + الذي يظهر بالـ Hover فقط غير موجود لمستخدم لوحة المفاتيح."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/keyboard-accessibility/","quote":"Even the most fancy or wonderful site is completely useless to someone who cannot access its controls and interact with it."},"scenario":{"en":"On the \"Offers\" page, each product photo shows a \"Quick add\" button only when the mouse is over it.","ar":"في صفحة «العروض»، تُظهر صورة كل منتج زر «إضافة سريعة» فقط حين يكون الماوس فوقها."},"prompt":{"en":"Tap each option to see the change. Which one lets keyboard users add offers to the basket?","ar":"اضغط على كل خيار لترى التغيير. أي خيار يجعل مستخدمي لوحة المفاتيح يضيفون العروض إلى السلة؟"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"Now (no mouse over it)","ar":"الآن (بدون ماوس فوقها)"},"app":{"id":"sallah","name":{"en":"Sallah","ar":"سلّة"},"color":"#2E9E5B","icon":"basket","domain":"sallah.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"sallah.example/offers","navbar":{"search":{"en":"Search Sallah","ar":"ابحث في سلّة"},"actions":[{"icon":"basket","count":3}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"shelf","text":{"en":"Olive oil · 20% off","ar":"زيت زيتون · خصم 20%"}}]},"options":[{"id":"bigger","text":{"en":"Make the area that reacts to the mouse bigger","ar":"كبّر المساحة التي تتفاعل مع الماوس"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change (no mouse over it)","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير (بدون ماوس فوقها)"},"app":{"id":"sallah","name":{"en":"Sallah","ar":"سلّة"},"color":"#2E9E5B","icon":"basket","domain":"sallah.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"sallah.example/offers","navbar":{"search":{"en":"Search Sallah","ar":"ابحث في سلّة"},"actions":[{"icon":"basket","count":3}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"shelf","text":{"en":"Olive oil · 20% off","ar":"زيت زيتون · خصم 20%"}}]}},{"id":"tip","text":{"en":"Add a note: \"Hover over a photo to add it\"","ar":"أضف ملاحظة: «مرّر الماوس فوق الصورة لإضافتها»"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change (no mouse over it)","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير (بدون ماوس فوقها)"},"app":{"id":"sallah","name":{"en":"Sallah","ar":"سلّة"},"color":"#2E9E5B","icon":"basket","domain":"sallah.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"sallah.example/offers","navbar":{"search":{"en":"Search Sallah","ar":"ابحث في سلّة"},"actions":[{"icon":"basket","count":3}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Hover over a photo to add it","ar":"مرّر الماوس فوق الصورة لإضافتها"}},{"kind":"image","art":"shelf","text":{"en":"Olive oil · 20% off","ar":"زيت زيتون · خصم 20%"},"gap":"xs"}]}},{"id":"always","text":{"en":"Always show \"Add to basket\" under each photo, as a real button","ar":"أظهر «أضف إلى السلة» دائمًا تحت كل صورة، كزر حقيقي"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change (Tab on the button)","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير (Tab على الزر)"},"app":{"id":"sallah","name":{"en":"Sallah","ar":"سلّة"},"color":"#2E9E5B","icon":"basket","domain":"sallah.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"sallah.example/offers","navbar":{"search":{"en":"Search Sallah","ar":"ابحث في سلّة"},"actions":[{"icon":"basket","count":3}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"shelf","text":{"en":"Olive oil · 20% off","ar":"زيت زيتون · خصم 20%"}},{"kind":"button","ring":"brand","text":{"en":"Add to basket","ar":"أضف إلى السلة"},"gap":"s"}]}}],"answer":["always"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-026","when":["bigger","tip"],"feedback":{"en":"Both still need a mouse. Keyboard users need a button that is there without hovering, so Tab can reach it.","ar":"الاثنان ما زالا يحتاجان إلى الماوس. ومستخدم لوحة المفاتيح يحتاج زرًا ظاهرًا دون Hover، ليصل إليه Tab."}}],"explain":{"en":"From Lesson 1: anything that appears only on hover needs a keyboard way in.","ar":"من الدرس 1: أي شيء يظهر بالـ Hover فقط يحتاج طريقًا بلوحة المفاتيح."},"speaker":"tarek"}]}$uxg$::jsonb),
  ($uxg$P05-U04-L01$uxg$, $uxg$3dae8623b65e0bf7df1a0bb718704a6bdd0bede8042d334359f48e70d7888610$uxg$, $uxg${"id":"P05-U04-L01","mode":"lesson","minutes":7,"title":{"en":"What does this image need to say?","ar":"ماذا يجب أن تقول هذه الصورة؟"},"summary":{"en":"Decide what each image on a clinic website should say to a screen reader.","ar":"قرّر ماذا يجب أن تقول كل صورة في موقع عيادة لقارئ الشاشة."},"speaker":"nour","review_labels":{"MC-P05-035":{"en":"Decorative images get empty alt text","ar":"الصور الزخرفية نصّها البديل فارغ"},"MC-P05-036":{"en":"Clickable images say the action","ar":"الصور القابلة للضغط تقول الإجراء"},"MC-P05-037":{"en":"Informative images say the message","ar":"الصور التي تحمل معلومة تقول الرسالة"},"MC-P05-038":{"en":"Short, key words first, no \"image of\"","ar":"قصير، والكلمات المهمة أولًا، بلا «صورة لـ»"},"MC-P05-039":{"en":"Don't repeat the caption","ar":"لا تكرّر التعليق المكتوب"}},"steps":[{"id":"S01","type":"card","part":"hook","title":{"en":"\"Image, image, image…\"","ar":"«صورة، صورة، صورة…»"},"body":{"en":"Our clinic's website has many images. A blind patient told us his screen reader keeps reading long descriptions of photos, and he gives up before he finds the booking button.\n\nThe text a screen reader reads for an image is called alt text.","ar":"في موقع عيادتنا صور كثيرة. وأخبرنا مريض كفيف أن قارئ الشاشة يظل يقرأ له أوصافًا طويلة للصور، فيتوقّف قبل أن يصل إلى زر الحجز.\n\nالنص الذي يقرؤه قارئ الشاشة للصورة اسمه النص البديل (Alt text)."},"mock":{"reader":{"en":"Image of a smiling young woman with a headset sitting at a white reception desk with green plants behind her.","ar":"صورة لشابة مبتسمة تضع سماعة وتجلس على مكتب استقبال أبيض وخلفها نباتات خضراء."},"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"raha.example","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Doctors","ar":"الأطباء"},{"en":"Services","ar":"الخدمات"}],"actions":[{"icon":"phone"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"woman-1","text":{"en":"Smiling receptionist at a desk","ar":"موظفة استقبال مبتسمة على مكتب"}},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Book a visit","ar":"احجز موعدًا"},"gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"S02","type":"choose","skill":"SK-P05-U04-01","part":"try","rules":["R12"],"value":{"en":"Try first. Write Alt Text (NN/g): an image is decorative if people can do every task and understand everything without it. Its alt text should be empty so the screen reader skips it.","ar":"جرّب أولًا. اكتب النص البديل (NN/g): الصورة زخرفية إذا استطاع الناس إنجاز كل مهمة وفهم كل شيء بدونها. ونصّها البديل يجب أن يكون فارغًا ليتخطّاها قارئ الشاشة."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/write-alt-text/","quote":"An image is decorative if users can complete all tasks and understand all information on the page without it."},"scenario":{"en":"The receptionist photo is there to make the page feel friendly. It tells patients nothing they need.","ar":"صورة موظفة الاستقبال موجودة لتجعل الصفحة ودودة. ولا تخبر المرضى بأي شيء يحتاجونه."},"prompt":{"en":"What should the photo's alt text be?","ar":"ماذا يجب أن يكون النص البديل (Alt text) للصورة؟"},"options":[{"id":"more","text":{"en":"A fuller description, so blind patients don't miss anything","ar":"وصف أكمل، حتى لا يفوت المرضى المكفوفين أي شيء"}},{"id":"short","text":{"en":"\"Receptionist.\"","ar":"«موظفة استقبال.»"}},{"id":"empty","text":{"en":"Empty, so the screen reader skips the photo","ar":"فارغ، ليتخطّى قارئ الشاشة الصورة"}}],"answer":["empty"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-035","when":["more","short"],"feedback":{"en":"The photo carries no information patients need. Any alt text only adds words they must listen to before reaching the booking button.","ar":"الصورة لا تحمل معلومة يحتاجها المرضى. وأي نص بديل يضيف كلمات عليهم سماعها قبل الوصول إلى زر الحجز."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Does a patient need this photo to book a visit?","ar":"هل يحتاج المريض هذه الصورة ليحجز موعدًا؟"},{"en":"Which option saves the patient's time?","ar":"أي خيار يوفّر وقت المريض؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Decorative images should be skipped.","ar":"صحيح. الصور الزخرفية يجب أن تُتخطّى."},"explain":{"en":"Empty alt text doesn't hide anything useful. It saves screen reader users time for what matters.","ar":"النص البديل الفارغ لا يُخفي شيئًا مفيدًا. بل يوفّر وقت مستخدم قارئ الشاشة لما يهمّه."},"speaker":"nour"},{"id":"S03","type":"card","part":"concept","icons":["none","tap","idea","text","cut"],"title":{"en":"Three kinds of images","ar":"ثلاثة أنواع من الصور"},"body":{"en":"Ask: why is this image here?\n\n- **Decorative (for looks):** leave the alt text empty, so the screen reader skips it.\n- **Clickable (a link or button):** say what happens, not what it looks like. A 📞 icon: \"Call the clinic.\"\n- **Informative (it tells something):** say the message it adds. If it has important words, include them.\n- **Short:** about 150 characters or less, key words first. Don't start with \"image of\"; the screen reader already says it's an image.\n- **No repeats:** if the caption already says it, don't say it again in the alt text.","ar":"اسأل: لماذا هذه الصورة هنا؟\n\n- **زخرفية (Decorative، للشكل فقط):** اترك النص البديل فارغًا، ليتخطّاها قارئ الشاشة.\n- **قابلة للضغط (رابط أو زر):** قل ماذا يحدث، لا كيف تبدو. أيقونة 📞: «اتصل بالعيادة.»\n- **تحمل معلومة:** قل الرسالة التي تضيفها. وإذا كان فيها كلمات مهمة، اكتبها.\n- **قصير:** نحو 150 حرفًا أو أقل، والكلمات المهمة أولًا. ولا تبدأ بـ «صورة لـ»؛ فقارئ الشاشة يقول إنها صورة أصلًا.\n- **بلا تكرار:** إذا كان التعليق المكتوب تحت الصورة يقول المعنى، فلا تكرّره في النص البديل."}},{"id":"S04","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P05-U04-01","part":"guided","rules":["R06"],"value":{"en":"Write Alt Text (NN/g): alt text for functional images should not describe the image; it should describe what happens when it's clicked or tapped.","ar":"اكتب النص البديل (NN/g): النص البديل للصور الوظيفية لا يصف الصورة؛ بل يصف ما يحدث عند الضغط عليها."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/write-alt-text/","quote":"Alt text for functional images should not describe the image; instead, it should describe what will happen when the image is clicked or tapped."},"scenario":{"en":"At the top of every page, there's a 📞 icon with no words. Tapping it calls the clinic.","ar":"في أعلى كل صفحة أيقونة 📞 بدون كلمات. والضغط عليها يتصل بالعيادة."},"prompt":{"en":"What should the icon's alt text be?","ar":"ماذا يجب أن يكون النص البديل للأيقونة؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"raha.example","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Doctors","ar":"الأطباء"},{"en":"Services","ar":"الخدمات"}],"actions":[{"icon":"phone","aria":{"en":"Call the clinic","ar":"اتصل بالعيادة"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"clinic"},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Care close to home","ar":"رعاية قريبة منك"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","icon":"calendar-plus","text":{"en":"Book a visit","ar":"احجز زيارة"},"gap":"s"}],"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"}},"options":[{"id":"call","text":{"en":"\"Call the clinic.\"","ar":"«اتصل بالعيادة.»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"raha.example","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Doctors","ar":"الأطباء"},{"en":"Services","ar":"الخدمات"}],"actions":[{"icon":"phone","aria":{"en":"Call the clinic","ar":"اتصل بالعيادة"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"clinic"},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Care close to home","ar":"رعاية قريبة منك"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","icon":"calendar-plus","text":{"en":"Book a visit","ar":"احجز زيارة"},"gap":"s"}],"reader":{"en":"Call the clinic, link.","ar":"اتصل بالعيادة، رابط."},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}},{"id":"icon","text":{"en":"\"Green phone icon.\"","ar":"«أيقونة هاتف خضراء.»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"raha.example","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Doctors","ar":"الأطباء"},{"en":"Services","ar":"الخدمات"}],"actions":[{"icon":"phone","aria":{"en":"Call the clinic","ar":"اتصل بالعيادة"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"clinic"},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Care close to home","ar":"رعاية قريبة منك"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","icon":"calendar-plus","text":{"en":"Book a visit","ar":"احجز زيارة"},"gap":"s"}],"reader":{"en":"Green phone icon, link.","ar":"أيقونة هاتف خضراء، رابط."},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}},{"id":"none","text":{"en":"Empty; it's only an icon","ar":"فارغ؛ إنها مجرد أيقونة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"raha.example","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Doctors","ar":"الأطباء"},{"en":"Services","ar":"الخدمات"}],"actions":[{"icon":"phone","aria":{"en":"Call the clinic","ar":"اتصل بالعيادة"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"clinic"},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Care close to home","ar":"رعاية قريبة منك"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","icon":"calendar-plus","text":{"en":"Book a visit","ar":"احجز زيارة"},"gap":"s"}],"reader":{"en":"Link.","ar":"رابط."},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}}],"answer":["call"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-036","when":["icon"],"feedback":{"en":"Patients don't need to know it's green. They need to know what tapping it does.","ar":"المريض لا يحتاج أن يعرف أنها خضراء. يحتاج أن يعرف ماذا يحدث حين يضغطها."}},{"id":"MC-P05-036","when":["none"],"feedback":{"en":"This icon does something and has no words next to it. Empty alt text would leave a button with no name.","ar":"هذه الأيقونة تفعل شيئًا، وليس بجانبها كلمات. والنص البديل الفارغ يترك زرًا بلا اسم."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Is this image only for looks, or does it do something?","ar":"هل هذه الصورة للشكل فقط، أم تفعل شيئًا؟"},{"en":"For clickable images, say what happens.","ar":"للصور القابلة للضغط، قل ماذا يحدث."}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Say the action, not the look.","ar":"صحيح. قل الإجراء، لا الشكل."},"explain":{"en":"A clickable image is a button. Its alt text is the button's name.","ar":"الصورة القابلة للضغط زر. ونصّها البديل هو اسم الزر."},"speaker":"nour"},{"id":"S05","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P05-U04-02","part":"guided","rules":["R06"],"value":{"en":"5 Visual Treatments (NN/g): alt text should not replicate the caption, since the screen reader reads both. Here the caption already says everything.","ar":"5 معالجات بصرية (NN/g): النص البديل يجب ألا يكرّر التعليق المكتوب، لأن قارئ الشاشة يقرأ الاثنين. وهنا التعليق يقول كل شيء."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/visual-treatments-accessibility/","quote":"The ALT text should not replicate the caption of the image (since both will be read by the screen reader)."},"scenario":{"en":"On the \"Our doctors\" page, each photo has a caption under it with the doctor's name and specialty.","ar":"في صفحة «أطباؤنا»، تحت كل صورة تعليق مكتوب فيه اسم الطبيب وتخصّصه."},"prompt":{"en":"What should the alt text of Dr. Salma's photo be?","ar":"ماذا يجب أن يكون النص البديل لصورة د. سلمى؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"raha.example/doctors","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Doctors","ar":"الأطباء"},{"en":"Services","ar":"الخدمات"}],"active":0,"actions":[{"icon":"phone"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"doctor"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Dr. Salma Adel, children's doctor","ar":"د. سلمى عادل، طبيبة أطفال"},"gap":"xs"}],"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"}},"options":[{"id":"repeat","text":{"en":"\"Dr. Salma Adel, children's doctor.\"","ar":"«د. سلمى عادل، طبيبة أطفال.»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"raha.example/doctors","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Doctors","ar":"الأطباء"},{"en":"Services","ar":"الخدمات"}],"active":0,"actions":[{"icon":"phone"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"doctor"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Dr. Salma Adel, children's doctor","ar":"د. سلمى عادل، طبيبة أطفال"},"gap":"xs"}],"reader":{"en":"Dr. Salma Adel, children's doctor, image. Dr. Salma Adel, children's doctor.","ar":"د. سلمى عادل، طبيبة أطفال، صورة. د. سلمى عادل، طبيبة أطفال."},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}},{"id":"empty","text":{"en":"Empty, because the caption already says who she is","ar":"فارغ، لأن التعليق يقول من هي أصلًا"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"raha.example/doctors","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Doctors","ar":"الأطباء"},{"en":"Services","ar":"الخدمات"}],"active":0,"actions":[{"icon":"phone"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"doctor"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Dr. Salma Adel, children's doctor","ar":"د. سلمى عادل، طبيبة أطفال"},"gap":"xs"}],"reader":{"en":"Dr. Salma Adel, children's doctor.","ar":"د. سلمى عادل، طبيبة أطفال."},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}},{"id":"photo","text":{"en":"\"Photo of a doctor.\"","ar":"«صورة طبيبة.»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"raha.example/doctors","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Doctors","ar":"الأطباء"},{"en":"Services","ar":"الخدمات"}],"active":0,"actions":[{"icon":"phone"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"doctor"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Dr. Salma Adel, children's doctor","ar":"د. سلمى عادل، طبيبة أطفال"},"gap":"xs"}],"reader":{"en":"Photo of a doctor, image. Dr. Salma Adel, children's doctor.","ar":"صورة طبيبة، صورة. د. سلمى عادل، طبيبة أطفال."},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}}],"answer":["empty"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-039","when":["repeat"],"feedback":{"en":"The screen reader reads the alt text and then the caption, so patients would hear the same line twice.","ar":"قارئ الشاشة يقرأ النص البديل ثم التعليق، فيسمع المريض نفس السطر مرتين."}},{"id":"MC-P05-038","when":["photo"],"feedback":{"en":"\"Photo of\" adds nothing; the screen reader already says it's an image. And the caption already names her.","ar":"«صورة» لا تضيف شيئًا؛ فقارئ الشاشة يقول إنها صورة أصلًا. والتعليق يذكر اسمها بالفعل."}}],"hints":[{"en":"What will the screen reader read right after the photo?","ar":"ماذا سيقرأ قارئ الشاشة بعد الصورة مباشرة؟"},{"en":"Does the photo add anything the caption doesn't say?","ar":"هل تضيف الصورة شيئًا لا يقوله التعليق؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Right. The caption does the job; no need to say it twice.","ar":"صحيح. التعليق يكفي؛ لا داعي لتكرار المعنى مرتين."},"explain":{"en":"Alt text is for what the image adds. When the words next to it already say it, leave the alt text empty.","ar":"النص البديل لما تضيفه الصورة. وحين تقول الكلمات بجانبها المعنى، اترك النص البديل فارغًا."},"speaker":"nour"},{"id":"S06","type":"compare","skill":"SK-P05-U04-02","part":"contrast","confidence":true,"rules":["R11"],"value":{"en":"Contrast: a vague label vs the image's words. Write Alt Text (NN/g): if an image's text is short and important to its message, include the exact words in the alt text.","ar":"مقارنة: وصف عام مقابل كلمات الصورة. اكتب النص البديل (NN/g): إذا كان نص الصورة قصيرًا ومهمًا لرسالتها، فاكتب نفس الكلمات في النص البديل."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/write-alt-text/","quote":"If the text is short enough to fit with about 150 characters and is an important part of the image's message, include the exact words in the alt text."},"scenario":{"en":"Our opening hours are shown only as an image on the home page. Two people wrote its alt text.","ar":"مواعيد العمل عندنا معروضة كصورة فقط في الصفحة الرئيسية. وكتب شخصان النص البديل لها."},"prompt":{"en":"Which alt text lets a blind patient know when to come?","ar":"أي نص بديل يجعل المريض الكفيف يعرف متى يأتي؟"},"a":{"label":{"en":"A: \"Image showing our opening hours.\"","ar":"A: «صورة تعرض مواعيد العمل.»"},"mock":{"reader":{"en":"Image showing our opening hours.","ar":"صورة تعرض مواعيد العمل."},"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"raha.example","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Doctors","ar":"الأطباء"},{"en":"Services","ar":"الخدمات"}],"actions":[{"icon":"phone"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","size":"s","text":{"en":"Sun–Thu 9:00–21:00 · Fri–Sat closed","ar":"الأحد–الخميس 9:00–21:00 · الجمعة والسبت مغلق"}}]}},"b":{"label":{"en":"B: \"Open Sunday to Thursday, 9:00 to 21:00. Closed Friday and Saturday.\"","ar":"B: «مفتوح من الأحد إلى الخميس، من 9:00 إلى 21:00. مغلق الجمعة والسبت.»"},"mock":{"reader":{"en":"Open Sunday to Thursday, 9:00 to 21:00. Closed Friday and Saturday.","ar":"مفتوح من الأحد إلى الخميس، من 9:00 إلى 21:00. مغلق الجمعة والسبت."},"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"raha.example","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Doctors","ar":"الأطباء"},{"en":"Services","ar":"الخدمات"}],"actions":[{"icon":"phone"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","size":"s","text":{"en":"Sun–Thu 9:00–21:00 · Fri–Sat closed","ar":"الأحد–الخميس 9:00–21:00 · الجمعة والسبت مغلق"}}]}},"answer":"b","reason":{"prompt":{"en":"Why is B better?","ar":"لماذا B أفضل؟"},"options":[{"id":"words","text":{"en":"The words in the image are the message, and they fit in one short line","ar":"كلمات الصورة هي الرسالة، ويمكن كتابتها في سطر قصير واحد"}},{"id":"long","text":{"en":"Longer alt text is always better","ar":"النص البديل الأطول أفضل دائمًا"}},{"id":"image","text":{"en":"A says \"image\", which screen readers can't read","ar":"A يقول «صورة»، وقارئ الشاشة لا يستطيع قراءتها"}}],"answer":["words"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-037","when":["long","image"],"feedback":{"en":"The point is the message. The hours are the reason the image is there, and they're short enough to say in full.","ar":"المهم هو الرسالة. المواعيد هي سبب وجود الصورة، وهي قصيرة بما يكفي لتُقال كاملة."}}]},"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-037","when":["a"],"feedback":{"en":"A says there are hours, but not what they are. The patient still doesn't know when to come.","ar":"A يقول إن هناك مواعيد، لكن لا يقول ما هي. وما زال المريض لا يعرف متى يأتي."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Listen to each one. Do you know when the clinic is open?","ar":"استمع إلى كل واحد. هل تعرف متى تفتح العيادة؟"},{"en":"Which one gives the message the image carries?","ar":"أي واحد يعطي الرسالة التي تحملها الصورة؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Say the message, not \"there is an image\".","ar":"صحيح. قل الرسالة، لا «توجد صورة»."},"explain":{"en":"When an image holds important words, those words are the alt text. Better still, show them as real text on the page.","ar":"حين تحمل الصورة كلمات مهمة، فهذه الكلمات هي النص البديل. والأفضل أن تعرضها كنص حقيقي في الصفحة."},"speaker":"nour"},{"id":"S07","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P05-U04-01","part":"independent","speaker":"sara","rules":["R14"],"value":{"en":"New case. Write Alt Text (NN/g): the same logo needs different alt text by context. A logo that links to the home page should describe that function: \"[Name] home.\"","ar":"حالة جديدة. اكتب النص البديل (NN/g): نفس الشعار يحتاج نصًا بديلًا مختلفًا حسب السياق. والشعار الذي يربط بالصفحة الرئيسية يجب أن يصف هذه الوظيفة: «الصفحة الرئيسية لـ [الاسم].»"},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/write-alt-text/","quote":"The UT Austin logo in the top left corner links back to the homepage. The alt text should describe this function."},"scenario":{"en":"I'm designing an insurance company's website. The logo at the top of every page links to the home page. A developer wrote its alt text.","ar":"أصمّم موقع شركة تأمين. والشعار في أعلى كل صفحة يربط بالصفحة الرئيسية. وكتب أحد المطوّرين نصّه البديل."},"prompt":{"en":"Which alt text should the logo have?","ar":"أي نص بديل يجب أن يكون للشعار؟"},"mock":{"reader":{"en":"Logo of Aman, a blue shield with a tick inside.","ar":"شعار أمان، درع أزرق وبداخله علامة صح."},"app":{"id":"aman","name":{"en":"Aman","ar":"أمان"},"color":"#364FC7","icon":"shield-check","domain":"aman.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"aman.example/car-insurance","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Car","ar":"السيارات"},{"en":"Health","ar":"الصحة"},{"en":"Claims","ar":"المطالبات"}],"active":0},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Car insurance from 250 EGP a month","ar":"تأمين السيارات من 250 جنيهًا شهريًا"}},{"kind":"image","art":"car","gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Get a quote","ar":"اعرف السعر"},"gap":"s"}],"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"}},"options":[{"id":"keep","text":{"en":"Keep it; it describes the logo well","ar":"يبقى كما هو؛ فهو يصف الشعار جيدًا"},"mock":{"reader":{"en":"Logo of Aman, a blue shield with a tick inside.","ar":"شعار أمان، درع أزرق وبداخله علامة صح."},"app":{"id":"aman","name":{"en":"Aman","ar":"أمان"},"color":"#364FC7","icon":"shield-check","domain":"aman.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"aman.example/car-insurance","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Car","ar":"السيارات"},{"en":"Health","ar":"الصحة"},{"en":"Claims","ar":"المطالبات"}],"active":0},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Car insurance from 250 EGP a month","ar":"تأمين السيارات من 250 جنيهًا شهريًا"}},{"kind":"image","art":"car","gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Get a quote","ar":"اعرف السعر"},"gap":"s"}],"caption":{"en":"Unchanged","ar":"بدون تغيير"}}},{"id":"home","text":{"en":"\"Aman home.\"","ar":"«الصفحة الرئيسية لأمان.»"},"mock":{"reader":{"en":"Aman home, link.","ar":"الصفحة الرئيسية لأمان، رابط."},"app":{"id":"aman","name":{"en":"Aman","ar":"أمان"},"color":"#364FC7","icon":"shield-check","domain":"aman.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"aman.example/car-insurance","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Car","ar":"السيارات"},{"en":"Health","ar":"الصحة"},{"en":"Claims","ar":"المطالبات"}],"active":0},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Car insurance from 250 EGP a month","ar":"تأمين السيارات من 250 جنيهًا شهريًا"}},{"kind":"image","art":"car","gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Get a quote","ar":"اعرف السعر"},"gap":"s"}],"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}},{"id":"empty","text":{"en":"Empty; logos are decorative","ar":"فارغ؛ فالشعارات زخرفية"},"mock":{"reader":{"en":"Link.","ar":"رابط."},"app":{"id":"aman","name":{"en":"Aman","ar":"أمان"},"color":"#364FC7","icon":"shield-check","domain":"aman.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"aman.example/car-insurance","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Car","ar":"السيارات"},{"en":"Health","ar":"الصحة"},{"en":"Claims","ar":"المطالبات"}],"active":0},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Car insurance from 250 EGP a month","ar":"تأمين السيارات من 250 جنيهًا شهريًا"}},{"kind":"image","art":"car","gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Get a quote","ar":"اعرف السعر"},"gap":"s"}],"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}}],"answer":["home"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-036","when":["keep"],"feedback":{"en":"Here the logo is a link. People need to know where it goes, not what the shield looks like.","ar":"الشعار هنا رابط. والناس يحتاجون أن يعرفوا إلى أين يذهب، لا شكل الدرع."}},{"id":"MC-P05-035","when":["empty"],"feedback":{"en":"This logo does something: it goes home. Empty alt text would leave a link with no name.","ar":"هذا الشعار يفعل شيئًا: يذهب إلى الصفحة الرئيسية. والنص البديل الفارغ يترك رابطًا بلا اسم."}}],"hints":[{"en":"What happens when someone taps the logo?","ar":"ماذا يحدث حين يضغط أحد على الشعار؟"},{"en":"For clickable images, say the action.","ar":"للصور القابلة للضغط، قل الإجراء."}],"correct":{"en":"Right. A linked logo says where it goes.","ar":"صحيح. الشعار المرتبط برابط يقول إلى أين يذهب."},"explain":{"en":"Ask why the image is there. In the header, the logo is a home link, so its alt text names the destination.","ar":"اسأل لماذا الصورة هنا. في رأس الصفحة، الشعار رابط للصفحة الرئيسية، فنصّه البديل يذكر الوجهة."}},{"id":"S08","type":"card","part":"recap","icons":["none","tap","idea","cut"],"title":{"en":"What you did","ar":"ماذا تعلّمت"},"body":{"en":"- **Decorative:** you left the receptionist photo's alt text empty.\n- **Clickable:** you named the 📞 icon by its action, and the logo by where it goes.\n- **No repeats:** you left a doctor's photo empty because the caption says who she is.\n- **The message:** you put the opening hours into the alt text.\n\nNext lesson: links and buttons that make sense when heard.","ar":"- **زخرفية:** تركت النص البديل لصورة الاستقبال فارغًا.\n- **قابلة للضغط:** سمّيت أيقونة 📞 بإجرائها، والشعار بوجهته.\n- **بلا تكرار:** تركت صورة الطبيبة فارغة لأن التعليق يقول من هي.\n- **الرسالة:** وضعت مواعيد العمل في النص البديل.\n\nالدرس التالي: روابط وأزرار مفهومة حين تُسمع."}}]}$uxg$::jsonb),
  ($uxg$P05-U04-L02$uxg$, $uxg$2ad6cc65015f0a8012cbc11779c8ec90cc20f39fa36a4801dc5c4e0296319bda$uxg$, $uxg${"id":"P05-U04-L02","mode":"lesson","minutes":7,"title":{"en":"Links and buttons that make sense when heard","ar":"روابط وأزرار مفهومة حين تُسمع"},"summary":{"en":"Rewrite a shop's vague links and labels, and move focus when a panel opens.","ar":"أعد كتابة روابط وتسميات (Labels) غامضة في متجر، وانقل التركيز حين تُفتح لوحة."},"speaker":"youssef","review_labels":{"MC-P05-041":{"en":"Links must make sense alone","ar":"الروابط يجب أن تكون مفهومة وحدها"},"MC-P05-042":{"en":"Put the key word first","ar":"ضع الكلمة المهمة أولًا"},"MC-P05-043":{"en":"Move focus to what just opened","ar":"انقل التركيز إلى ما فُتح للتو"}},"steps":[{"id":"S01","type":"card","part":"hook","title":{"en":"\"Learn more, learn more, learn more\"","ar":"«اعرف المزيد، اعرف المزيد، اعرف المزيد»"},"body":{"en":"My shop's help page has three short sections, and each one ends with a \"Learn more\" link.\n\nA blind customer asked his screen reader for the list of links on the page. This is what he heard.","ar":"صفحة المساعدة في متجري فيها ثلاثة أقسام قصيرة، وكل قسم ينتهي برابط «اعرف المزيد».\n\nوطلب عميل كفيف من قارئ الشاشة قائمة الروابط في الصفحة. وهذا ما سمعه."},"mock":{"reader":{"en":"Learn more, link. Learn more, link. Learn more, link.","ar":"اعرف المزيد، رابط. اعرف المزيد، رابط. اعرف المزيد، رابط."},"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Help","ar":"المساعدة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"truck","text":{"en":"Delivery","ar":"التوصيل"}},{"kind":"link","text":{"en":"Learn more","ar":"اعرف المزيد"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"arrow-u-up-left","text":{"en":"Returns","ar":"الإرجاع"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"link","text":{"en":"Learn more","ar":"اعرف المزيد"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"shield-check","text":{"en":"Warranty","ar":"الضمان"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"link","text":{"en":"Learn more","ar":"اعرف المزيد"},"gap":"xs"}]}},{"id":"S02","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P05-U04-04","part":"try","rules":["R12"],"value":{"en":"Try first. \"Learn More\" Links (NN/g): as a standalone link, the lack of descriptive keywords is a serious accessibility problem; screen reader users often hear a list of links with no context.","ar":"جرّب أولًا. روابط «اعرف المزيد» (NN/g): الرابط الذي لا يحمل كلمات واضحة مشكلة كبيرة للإتاحة؛ فمستخدمو قارئ الشاشة كثيرًا ما يسمعون قائمة روابط بلا سياق."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/learn-more-links/","quote":"Finally, as a standalone link, the lack of descriptive keywords is a serious problem for accessibility."},"prompt":{"en":"Tap each option to see the change. Which one tells the customer where each link goes?","ar":"اضغط على كل خيار لترى التغيير. أي خيار يخبر العميل إلى أين يذهب كل رابط؟"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Help","ar":"المساعدة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"meta","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Delivery","ar":"التوصيل"}},{"kind":"link","text":{"en":"Learn more","ar":"اعرف المزيد"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"meta","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Returns","ar":"الإرجاع"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"link","text":{"en":"Learn more","ar":"اعرف المزيد"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"meta","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Warranty","ar":"الضمان"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"link","text":{"en":"Learn more","ar":"اعرف المزيد"},"gap":"xs"}]},"options":[{"id":"bold","text":{"en":"Keep \"Learn more\", but make the links bold","ar":"أبقِ «اعرف المزيد»، لكن اجعل الروابط عريضة"},"mock":{"reader":{"en":"Learn more, link. Learn more, link. Learn more, link.","ar":"اعرف المزيد، رابط. اعرف المزيد، رابط. اعرف المزيد، رابط."},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Help","ar":"المساعدة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"meta","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Delivery","ar":"التوصيل"}},{"kind":"link","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Learn more","ar":"اعرف المزيد"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"meta","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Returns","ar":"الإرجاع"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"link","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Learn more","ar":"اعرف المزيد"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"meta","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Warranty","ar":"الضمان"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"link","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Learn more","ar":"اعرف المزيد"},"gap":"xs"}]}},{"id":"words","text":{"en":"Name each link by where it goes","ar":"سمِّ كل رابط بالمكان الذي يذهب إليه"},"mock":{"reader":{"en":"Delivery times and fees, link. How to return an item, link. Warranty rules, link.","ar":"مواعيد التوصيل ورسومه، رابط. طريقة إرجاع منتج، رابط. شروط الضمان، رابط."},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Help","ar":"المساعدة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"meta","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Delivery","ar":"التوصيل"}},{"kind":"link","text":{"en":"Delivery times and fees","ar":"مواعيد التوصيل ورسومه"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"meta","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Returns","ar":"الإرجاع"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"link","text":{"en":"How to return an item","ar":"طريقة إرجاع منتج"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"meta","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Warranty","ar":"الضمان"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"link","text":{"en":"Warranty rules","ar":"شروط الضمان"},"gap":"xs"}]}},{"id":"click","text":{"en":"Change each link to \"Click here\"","ar":"غيّر كل رابط إلى «اضغط هنا»"},"mock":{"reader":{"en":"Click here, link. Click here, link. Click here, link.","ar":"اضغط هنا، رابط. اضغط هنا، رابط. اضغط هنا، رابط."},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Help","ar":"المساعدة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"meta","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Delivery","ar":"التوصيل"}},{"kind":"link","text":{"en":"Click here","ar":"اضغط هنا"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"meta","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Returns","ar":"الإرجاع"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"link","text":{"en":"Click here","ar":"اضغط هنا"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"meta","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Warranty","ar":"الضمان"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"link","text":{"en":"Click here","ar":"اضغط هنا"},"gap":"xs"}]}}],"answer":["words"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-041","when":["bold","click"],"feedback":{"en":"The customer still hears three links with the same words. Each link has to say where it goes.","ar":"ما زال العميل يسمع ثلاثة روابط بنفس الكلمات. ويجب أن يقول كل رابط إلى أين يذهب."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Listen to what the screen reader says in each option.","ar":"استمع إلى ما يقوله قارئ الشاشة في كل خيار."},{"en":"Which option gives each link its own words?","ar":"أي خيار يعطي كل رابط كلماته الخاصة؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Now every link makes sense on its own.","ar":"صحيح. الآن كل رابط مفهوم وحده."},"explain":{"en":"Sighted people read the heading above a link. Screen reader users often hear the link alone, so the link must carry the meaning.","ar":"المبصر يقرأ العنوان فوق الرابط. أما مستخدم قارئ الشاشة فكثيرًا ما يسمع الرابط وحده، فيجب أن يحمل الرابط المعنى."}},{"id":"S03","type":"card","part":"concept","icons":["ear","text","order","target"],"title":{"en":"Words that work when heard","ar":"كلمات مفهومة حين تُسمع"},"body":{"en":"- **Heard alone:** screen reader users often jump from link to link, or heading to heading. They hear each one without the text around it.\n- **Say where it goes:** \"How to return an item\", not \"Learn more\" or \"Click here\". Give each link on a page different words.\n- **Key word first:** many people swipe on after the first few words. Start with the word they're looking for: \"Search the shop\", not \"Phones, cases and more. Search\".\n- **Move focus to what opened:** when a menu or panel opens, move the screen reader's focus into it. If not, people hear nothing new and think the button didn't work.","ar":"- **تُسمع وحدها:** مستخدمو قارئ الشاشة كثيرًا ما ينتقلون مباشرة من رابط إلى رابط، أو من عنوان إلى عنوان. ويسمعون كل واحد دون النص الذي حوله.\n- **قل إلى أين يذهب:** «طريقة إرجاع منتج»، لا «اعرف المزيد» أو «اضغط هنا». وأعطِ كل رابط في الصفحة كلمات مختلفة.\n- **الكلمة المهمة أولًا:** كثيرون ينتقلون بعد أول كلمات قليلة. فابدأ بالكلمة التي يبحثون عنها: «ابحث في المتجر»، لا «هواتف وجرابات والمزيد. بحث».\n- **انقل التركيز إلى ما فُتح:** حين تُفتح قائمة أو لوحة، انقل تركيز قارئ الشاشة إليها. وإلا لن يسمع الناس شيئًا جديدًا، وسيظنون أن الزر لم يعمل."}},{"id":"S04","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P05-U04-04","part":"guided","rules":["R06"],"value":{"en":"Screen-Reader Users on Mobile (NN/g): many screen reader users swipe on without hearing the whole label; if the first words don't seem relevant, they move on. A search label must start with \"Search\".","ar":"مستخدمو قارئ الشاشة على الهاتف (NN/g): كثير منهم ينتقلون دون سماع العنوان كاملًا؛ وإذا لم تبدُ أول الكلمات مهمة، ينتقلون. فعنوان البحث يجب أن يبدأ بـ «ابحث»."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/screen-reader-users-on-mobile/","quote":"If the first few words of the label don’t seem relevant, they’ll swipe and quickly move on."},"scenario":{"en":"In our app, the search box is read like this. A customer swiped past it three times and said there's no search.","ar":"في تطبيقنا، يُقرأ مربع البحث هكذا. ومرّ عليه أحد العملاء ثلاث مرات، وقال إنه لا يوجد بحث."},"prompt":{"en":"Which label should the search box have?","ar":"أي تسمية (Label) يجب أن تكون لمربع البحث؟"},"mock":{"reader":{"en":"Phones, cases, chargers and more. Search field.","ar":"هواتف وجرابات وشواحن والمزيد. حقل بحث."},"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"logo":true,"actions":[{"icon":"shopping-cart","aria":{"en":"Cart","ar":"السلة"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","icon":"magnifying-glass","text":{"en":"Phones, cases, chargers and more","ar":"هواتف وجرابات وشواحن والمزيد"}}],"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"}},"options":[{"id":"search","text":{"en":"\"Search the shop\"","ar":"«ابحث في المتجر»"},"mock":{"reader":{"en":"Search the shop, search field.","ar":"ابحث في المتجر، حقل بحث."},"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"logo":true,"actions":[{"icon":"shopping-cart","aria":{"en":"Cart","ar":"السلة"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","icon":"magnifying-glass","text":{"en":"Phones, cases, chargers and more","ar":"هواتف وجرابات وشواحن والمزيد"}}],"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}},{"id":"long","text":{"en":"\"Find phones, cases, chargers and more in our shop\"","ar":"«اعثر على الهواتف والجرابات والشواحن والمزيد في متجرنا»"},"mock":{"reader":{"en":"Find phones, cases, chargers and more in our shop, search field.","ar":"اعثر على الهواتف والجرابات والشواحن والمزيد في متجرنا، حقل بحث."},"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"logo":true,"actions":[{"icon":"shopping-cart","aria":{"en":"Cart","ar":"السلة"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","icon":"magnifying-glass","text":{"en":"Phones, cases, chargers and more","ar":"هواتف وجرابات وشواحن والمزيد"}}],"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}},{"id":"keep","text":{"en":"Keep it; it shows what we sell","ar":"يبقى كما هو؛ فهو يوضّح ما نبيعه"},"mock":{"reader":{"en":"Phones, cases, chargers and more. Search field.","ar":"هواتف وجرابات وشواحن والمزيد. حقل بحث."},"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"logo":true,"actions":[{"icon":"shopping-cart","aria":{"en":"Cart","ar":"السلة"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","icon":"magnifying-glass","text":{"en":"Phones, cases, chargers and more","ar":"هواتف وجرابات وشواحن والمزيد"}}],"caption":{"en":"Unchanged","ar":"بدون تغيير"}}}],"answer":["search"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-042","when":["long","keep"],"feedback":{"en":"Both start with product names, so people move on before they hear that it's a search box. Start with \"Search\".","ar":"الاثنان يبدآن بأسماء منتجات، فينتقل الناس قبل أن يسمعوا أنه مربع بحث. ابدأ بـ «ابحث»."}}],"hints":[{"en":"What are the first words the customer hears now?","ar":"ما أول الكلمات التي يسمعها العميل الآن؟"},{"en":"Which label starts with the word the customer is looking for?","ar":"أي تسمية تبدأ بالكلمة التي يبحث عنها العميل؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Right. The key word comes first.","ar":"صحيح. الكلمة المهمة تأتي أولًا."},"explain":{"en":"People decide from the first few words. Put the job of the control at the start.","ar":"الناس يقرّرون من أول كلمات قليلة. فضع وظيفة العنصر في البداية."},"speaker":"youssef"},{"id":"S05","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P05-U04-05","part":"guided","rules":["R06"],"value":{"en":"Screen-Reader Users on Mobile (NN/g): in a good design, when the Filter button opens an overlay, the screen reader's focus goes straight to the top of the overlay.","ar":"مستخدمو قارئ الشاشة على الهاتف (NN/g): في التصميم الجيد، حين يفتح زر الفلترة لوحة فوق الصفحة، ينتقل تركيز قارئ الشاشة مباشرة إلى أعلى اللوحة."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/screen-reader-users-on-mobile/","quote":"When the user selects the Filter button in the Target app, a Filter overlay is displayed, and the screen-reader focus is taken directly to the top of the overlay."},"scenario":{"en":"In our app, tapping \"Filter\" opens a panel over the product list. The screen reader's focus stays on the Filter button.","ar":"في تطبيقنا، الضغط على «فلترة» يفتح لوحة فوق قائمة المنتجات. لكن تركيز قارئ الشاشة يبقى على زر الفلترة."},"prompt":{"en":"Tap each option to see the change. Which one tells a screen reader user that the panel opened?","ar":"اضغط على كل خيار لترى التغيير. أي خيار يخبر مستخدم قارئ الشاشة أن اللوحة فُتحت؟"},"mock":{"reader":{"en":"Filter, button.","ar":"فلترة، زر."},"caption":{"en":"Now (just after tapping Filter)","ar":"الآن (بعد الضغط على فلترة مباشرة)"},"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Dar · Phones","ar":"دار · هواتف"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"button","style":"plain","ring":"brand","text":{"en":"Filter","ar":"فلترة"}},{"kind":"group","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Filters","ar":"الفلاتر"}},{"kind":"check","text":{"en":"In stock only","ar":"المتوفّر فقط"},"gap":"xs"}]}]},"options":[{"id":"sound","text":{"en":"Play a short sound when the panel opens","ar":"شغّل صوتًا قصيرًا حين تُفتح اللوحة"},"mock":{"reader":{"en":"(ding) Filter, button.","ar":"(رنّة) فلترة، زر."},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Dar · Phones","ar":"دار · هواتف"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"button","style":"plain","ring":"brand","text":{"en":"Filter","ar":"فلترة"}},{"kind":"group","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Filters","ar":"الفلاتر"}},{"kind":"check","text":{"en":"In stock only","ar":"المتوفّر فقط"},"gap":"xs"}]}]}},{"id":"leave","text":{"en":"Leave it; people can swipe until they find the panel","ar":"اترك الأمر كما هو؛ يستطيع الناس التنقّل حتى يجدوا اللوحة"},"mock":{"reader":{"en":"Filter, button.","ar":"فلترة، زر."},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Dar · Phones","ar":"دار · هواتف"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"button","style":"plain","ring":"brand","text":{"en":"Filter","ar":"فلترة"}},{"kind":"group","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Filters","ar":"الفلاتر"}},{"kind":"check","text":{"en":"In stock only","ar":"المتوفّر فقط"},"gap":"xs"}]}]}},{"id":"move","text":{"en":"Move the focus to the top of the panel when it opens","ar":"انقل التركيز إلى أعلى اللوحة حين تُفتح"},"mock":{"reader":{"en":"Filters, heading.","ar":"الفلاتر، عنوان."},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Dar · Phones","ar":"دار · هواتف"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"button","style":"plain","text":{"en":"Filter","ar":"فلترة"}},{"kind":"group","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","ring":"brand","text":{"en":"Filters","ar":"الفلاتر"}},{"kind":"check","text":{"en":"In stock only","ar":"المتوفّر فقط"},"gap":"xs"}]}]}}],"answer":["move"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-043","when":["sound","leave"],"feedback":{"en":"The customer still hears \"Filter, button\", as if nothing happened, and doesn't know where the panel is. Move the focus into it.","ar":"ما زال العميل يسمع «فلترة، زر»، كأن شيئًا لم يحدث، ولا يعرف أين اللوحة. انقل التركيز إليها."}}],"hints":[{"en":"After tapping, what does the customer hear in each option?","ar":"بعد الضغط، ماذا يسمع العميل في كل خيار؟"},{"en":"Which option takes the customer to the panel?","ar":"أي خيار يأخذ العميل إلى اللوحة؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Focus moves to the panel, so the customer hears it opened.","ar":"صحيح. ينتقل التركيز إلى اللوحة، فيسمع العميل أنها فُتحت."},"explain":{"en":"Sighted people see the panel appear. Screen reader users only know if the focus goes there.","ar":"المبصر يرى اللوحة تظهر. أما مستخدم قارئ الشاشة فلا يعرف إلا إذا انتقل التركيز إليها."},"speaker":"youssef"},{"id":"S06","type":"compare","skill":"SK-P05-U04-04","part":"contrast","confidence":true,"rules":["R11"],"value":{"en":"Contrast: descriptive links vs vague, repeated ones. Writing Hyperlinks (NN/g): links understandable out of context are good; vague or duplicate links are useless for screen reader users.","ar":"مقارنة: روابط واضحة مقابل روابط غامضة ومتكرّرة. كتابة الروابط (NN/g): الروابط المفهومة خارج سياقها جيدة؛ والروابط الغامضة أو المكرّرة بلا فائدة لمستخدمي قارئ الشاشة."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/writing-links/","quote":"The links that are understandable out of context, such as how to post a Tweet, are good."},"scenario":{"en":"Two designers wrote the links on a phone's product page. This is what a screen reader user hears in the list of links.","ar":"كتب مصمّمان الروابط في صفحة منتج لهاتف. وهذا ما يسمعه مستخدم قارئ الشاشة في قائمة الروابط."},"prompt":{"en":"Which page lets the customer pick the right link from the list alone?","ar":"أي صفحة تجعل العميل يختار الرابط الصحيح من قائمة الروابط وحدها؟"},"a":{"label":{"en":"A: Each link says what it opens","ar":"A: كل رابط يقول ماذا يفتح"},"mock":{"reader":{"en":"Compare phone models, link. Delivery to your area, link. Phone warranty, link.","ar":"قارن موديلات الهواتف، رابط. التوصيل إلى منطقتك، رابط. ضمان الهاتف، رابط."},"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Dar · Phones","ar":"دار · هواتف"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"phone"},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Nova 12 · 128 GB","ar":"نوفا 12 · 128 جيجا"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"12,999 EGP","ar":"12,999 جنيه"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"link","text":{"en":"Compare phone models","ar":"قارن موديلات الهواتف"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"link","text":{"en":"Delivery to your area","ar":"التوصيل إلى منطقتك"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"link","text":{"en":"Phone warranty","ar":"ضمان الهاتف"},"gap":"xs"}]}},"b":{"label":{"en":"B: Links say \"Read more\" or \"here\"","ar":"B: الروابط تقول «اقرأ المزيد» أو «هنا»"},"mock":{"reader":{"en":"Read more, link. Read more, link. Here, link.","ar":"اقرأ المزيد، رابط. اقرأ المزيد، رابط. هنا، رابط."},"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Dar · Phones","ar":"دار · هواتف"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"phone"},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Nova 12 · 128 GB","ar":"نوفا 12 · 128 جيجا"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"12,999 EGP","ar":"12,999 جنيه"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"link","text":{"en":"Read more","ar":"اقرأ المزيد"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"link","text":{"en":"Read more","ar":"اقرأ المزيد"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"link","text":{"en":"Here","ar":"هنا"},"gap":"xs"}]}},"answer":"a","reason":{"prompt":{"en":"Why is A better for screen reader users?","ar":"لماذا A أفضل لمستخدمي قارئ الشاشة؟"},"options":[{"id":"short","text":{"en":"Shorter links are always better","ar":"الروابط الأقصر أفضل دائمًا"}},{"id":"alone","text":{"en":"They often hear links without the text around them, so each link must say where it goes","ar":"كثيرًا ما يسمعون الروابط دون النص حولها، فيجب أن يقول كل رابط إلى أين يذهب"}},{"id":"more","text":{"en":"A has more links","ar":"في A روابط أكثر"}}],"answer":["alone"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-041","when":["short","more"],"feedback":{"en":"Both have three links, and B's are shorter. What matters is that A's links make sense without the page around them.","ar":"في الاثنين ثلاثة روابط، وروابط B أقصر. المهم أن روابط A مفهومة دون الصفحة حولها."}}]},"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-041","when":["b"],"feedback":{"en":"In B, the customer can't tell the links apart. \"Read more\" about what? \"Here\" is where?","ar":"في B، لا يستطيع العميل التفريق بين الروابط. «اقرأ المزيد» عن ماذا؟ و«هنا» أين؟"}}],"hints":[{"en":"Close your eyes and listen. Which list tells you where to go?","ar":"أغمض عينيك واستمع. أي قائمة تخبرك إلى أين تذهب؟"},{"en":"In which page could you choose a link without seeing anything else?","ar":"في أي صفحة تستطيع اختيار رابط دون أن ترى شيئًا آخر؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Each link stands on its own.","ar":"صحيح. كل رابط مفهوم وحده."},"explain":{"en":"Test your links by reading them as a list. If a link only makes sense with the text around it, rewrite it.","ar":"اختبر روابطك بقراءتها كقائمة. وإذا كان الرابط مفهومًا فقط مع النص حوله، فأعد كتابته."},"speaker":"youssef"},{"id":"S07","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P05-U04-05","part":"independent","speaker":"karim","rules":["R14"],"value":{"en":"New case. Screen-Reader Users on Mobile (NN/g): it's confusing when a user taps a button and the screen reader's focus stays in the same place, as if nothing happened.","ar":"حالة جديدة. مستخدمو قارئ الشاشة على الهاتف (NN/g): من المُربك أن يضغط المستخدم زرًا ويبقى تركيز قارئ الشاشة في نفس المكان، كأن شيئًا لم يحدث."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/screen-reader-users-on-mobile/","quote":"It is equally confusing when a user takes an action (e.g., tapping a button), yet the screen reader's focus remains in the same place as if nothing has happened."},"scenario":{"en":"In a notes app I'm building, the + button opens a small menu: New note, New list, New photo. After tapping +, the screen reader still says \"Add, button.\"","ar":"في تطبيق ملاحظات أبنيه، يفتح زر + قائمة صغيرة: ملاحظة جديدة، قائمة جديدة، صورة جديدة. وبعد الضغط على +، ما زال قارئ الشاشة يقول «إضافة، زر.»"},"prompt":{"en":"What should happen when the menu opens?","ar":"ماذا يجب أن يحدث حين تُفتح القائمة، حتى يعرف مستخدم قارئ الشاشة أنها فُتحت؟"},"mock":{"reader":{"en":"Add, button.","ar":"إضافة، زر."},"app":{"id":"mudawwana","name":{"en":"Mudawwana","ar":"مدوّنة"},"color":"#EAB308","icon":"note-pencil","domain":"mudawwana.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Notes","ar":"الملاحظات"},"actions":[{"icon":"plus","aria":{"en":"Add","ar":"إضافة"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"note","text":{"en":"Shopping","ar":"المشتريات"},"sub":{"en":"Yesterday","ar":"أمس"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"note","text":{"en":"Meeting notes","ar":"ملاحظات الاجتماع"},"sub":{"en":"Monday","ar":"الاثنين"}}],"overlay":{"type":"menu","blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"note-pencil","text":{"en":"New note","ar":"ملاحظة جديدة"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"list-checks","text":{"en":"New list","ar":"قائمة جديدة"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"camera","text":{"en":"New photo","ar":"صورة جديدة"}}]},"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"}},"options":[{"id":"bigger","text":{"en":"Make the + button bigger, so it's easier to find","ar":"كبّر زر +، ليسهل إيجاده"},"mock":{"reader":{"en":"Add, button.","ar":"إضافة، زر."},"app":{"id":"mudawwana","name":{"en":"Mudawwana","ar":"مدوّنة"},"color":"#EAB308","icon":"note-pencil","domain":"mudawwana.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Notes","ar":"الملاحظات"},"actions":[{"icon":"plus","aria":{"en":"Add","ar":"إضافة"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"note","text":{"en":"Shopping","ar":"المشتريات"},"sub":{"en":"Yesterday","ar":"أمس"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"note","text":{"en":"Meeting notes","ar":"ملاحظات الاجتماع"},"sub":{"en":"Monday","ar":"الاثنين"}}],"overlay":{"type":"menu","blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"note-pencil","text":{"en":"New note","ar":"ملاحظة جديدة"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"list-checks","text":{"en":"New list","ar":"قائمة جديدة"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"camera","text":{"en":"New photo","ar":"صورة جديدة"}}]},"caption":{"en":"Unchanged","ar":"بدون تغيير"}}},{"id":"move","text":{"en":"Move focus to \"New note\", the first item in the menu","ar":"انقل التركيز إلى «ملاحظة جديدة»، أول عنصر في القائمة"},"mock":{"reader":{"en":"New note, menu item, 1 of 3.","ar":"ملاحظة جديدة، عنصر قائمة، 1 من 3."},"app":{"id":"mudawwana","name":{"en":"Mudawwana","ar":"مدوّنة"},"color":"#EAB308","icon":"note-pencil","domain":"mudawwana.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Notes","ar":"الملاحظات"},"actions":[{"icon":"plus","aria":{"en":"Add","ar":"إضافة"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"note","text":{"en":"Shopping","ar":"المشتريات"},"sub":{"en":"Yesterday","ar":"أمس"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"note","text":{"en":"Meeting notes","ar":"ملاحظات الاجتماع"},"sub":{"en":"Monday","ar":"الاثنين"}}],"overlay":{"type":"menu","blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"note-pencil","text":{"en":"New note","ar":"ملاحظة جديدة"},"ring":"brand"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"list-checks","text":{"en":"New list","ar":"قائمة جديدة"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"camera","text":{"en":"New photo","ar":"صورة جديدة"}}]},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}},{"id":"rename","text":{"en":"Rename the button to \"Add, opens a menu below\"","ar":"غيّر اسم الزر إلى «إضافة، يفتح قائمة بالأسفل»"},"mock":{"reader":{"en":"Add, opens a menu below, button.","ar":"إضافة، يفتح قائمة بالأسفل، زر."},"app":{"id":"mudawwana","name":{"en":"Mudawwana","ar":"مدوّنة"},"color":"#EAB308","icon":"note-pencil","domain":"mudawwana.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Notes","ar":"الملاحظات"},"actions":[{"icon":"plus","aria":{"en":"Add","ar":"إضافة"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"note","text":{"en":"Shopping","ar":"المشتريات"},"sub":{"en":"Yesterday","ar":"أمس"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"note","text":{"en":"Meeting notes","ar":"ملاحظات الاجتماع"},"sub":{"en":"Monday","ar":"الاثنين"}}],"overlay":{"type":"menu","blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"note-pencil","text":{"en":"New note","ar":"ملاحظة جديدة"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"list-checks","text":{"en":"New list","ar":"قائمة جديدة"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"camera","text":{"en":"New photo","ar":"صورة جديدة"}}]},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}}],"answer":["move"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-043","when":["bigger","rename"],"feedback":{"en":"The user still hears the same button after tapping, and must hunt for the menu. Move focus to its first item.","ar":"ما زال المستخدم يسمع نفس الزر بعد الضغط، ويجب أن يبحث عن القائمة. انقل التركيز إلى أول عنصر فيها."}}],"hints":[{"en":"After tapping +, what does the user hear now?","ar":"بعد الضغط على +، ماذا يسمع المستخدم الآن؟"},{"en":"Where should the user be after the menu opens?","ar":"أين يجب أن يكون المستخدم بعد أن تُفتح القائمة؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Right. The user hears \"New note\" and knows the menu opened.","ar":"صحيح. يسمع المستخدم «ملاحظة جديدة»، ويعرف أن القائمة فُتحت."},"explain":{"en":"Whenever a tap opens something, the focus should follow it.","ar":"كلما فتح الضغط شيئًا، انقل التركيز إليه."}},{"id":"S08","type":"card","part":"recap","icons":["ear","text","order","target"],"title":{"en":"What you did","ar":"ماذا تعلّمت"},"body":{"en":"- **Links that make sense alone:** you replaced \"Learn more\" with where each link goes.\n- **Key word first:** you started the search label with \"Search\".\n- **Test as a list:** you chose the product page whose links work without the page.\n- **Focus follows:** you moved focus into the filter panel and the + menu.\n\nNext lesson: charts, timetables and other big images.","ar":"- **روابط مفهومة وحدها:** استبدلت «اعرف المزيد» بوجهة كل رابط.\n- **الكلمة المهمة أولًا:** بدأت تسمية مربع البحث بـ «ابحث».\n- **اختبر كقائمة:** اخترت صفحة المنتج التي تُفهم روابطها دون باقي الصفحة.\n- **التركيز يتبع:** نقلت التركيز إلى لوحة الفلاتر وقائمة +.\n\nالدرس التالي: الرسوم البيانية والجداول والصور الكبيرة الأخرى."}}]}$uxg$::jsonb),
  ($uxg$P05-U04-L03$uxg$, $uxg$a23cae3bb32f689305ff2247d58c3bb3ba5fb1e36c2659852a72841b51792cdc$uxg$, $uxg${"id":"P05-U04-L03","mode":"lesson","minutes":7,"title":{"en":"Charts, timetables and maps","ar":"الرسوم البيانية والجداول والخرائط"},"summary":{"en":"Give a gym's timetable, chart and map a text version that a screen reader can read.","ar":"اجعل لجدول النادي ورسمه البياني وخريطته نسخة نصية يقرؤها قارئ الشاشة."},"speaker":"hana","review_labels":{"MC-P05-040":{"en":"Big images need a text version","ar":"الصور الكبيرة تحتاج نسخة نصية"},"MC-P05-038":{"en":"Short, key words first, no \"image of\"","ar":"قصير، والكلمات المهمة أولًا، بلا «صورة لـ»"},"MC-P05-037":{"en":"Informative images say the message","ar":"الصور التي تحمل معلومة تقول الرسالة"},"MC-P05-035":{"en":"Decorative images get empty alt text","ar":"الصور الزخرفية نصّها البديل فارغ"},"MC-P05-039":{"en":"Don't repeat the caption","ar":"لا تكرّر التعليق المكتوب"}},"steps":[{"id":"S01","type":"card","part":"hook","title":{"en":"\"Timetable.\" And then?","ar":"«جدول الحصص.» ثم ماذا؟"},"body":{"en":"My gym's website shows the class timetable as one big image. A blind member told me his screen reader says only \"Timetable\", so he calls us every week to ask when yoga is.","ar":"موقع النادي يعرض جدول الحصص كصورة واحدة كبيرة. وأخبرني عضو كفيف أن قارئ الشاشة يقول له «جدول الحصص» فقط، فيتصل بنا كل أسبوع ليسأل عن موعد اليوغا."},"mock":{"reader":{"en":"Timetable, image.","ar":"جدول الحصص، صورة."},"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Timetable","ar":"جدول الحصص"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","size":"m","text":{"en":"Class timetable (image)","ar":"جدول الحصص (صورة)"}}]}},{"id":"S02","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P05-U04-03","part":"try","rules":["R12"],"value":{"en":"Try first. Write Alt Text (NN/g): make complex informative images accessible by changing the page text around them, often with a simple list or table in the page.","ar":"جرّب أولًا. اكتب النص البديل (NN/g): اجعل الصور المعقّدة التي تحمل معلومات متاحة بتغيير نص الصفحة حولها، وغالبًا بقائمة أو جدول بسيط في الصفحة."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/write-alt-text/","quote":"Make complex informative images more accessible by altering the page copy surrounding the image."},"prompt":{"en":"Tap each option to see the change. Which one lets him find yoga without calling?","ar":"اضغط على كل خيار لترى التغيير. أي خيار يجعله يجد موعد اليوغا دون أن يتصل؟"},"mock":{"reader":{"en":"Timetable, image.","ar":"جدول الحصص، صورة."},"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Timetable","ar":"جدول الحصص"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","size":"m","text":{"en":"Class timetable (image)","ar":"جدول الحصص (صورة)"}}]},"options":[{"id":"page","text":{"en":"Replace the image with a real table on the page","ar":"استبدل الصورة بجدول حقيقي في الصفحة"},"mock":{"reader":{"en":"Monday, 19:00, Yoga.","ar":"الاثنين، 19:00، يوغا."},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Timetable","ar":"جدول الحصص"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"table","head":[{"en":"Day","ar":"اليوم"},{"en":"Time","ar":"الوقت"},{"en":"Class","ar":"الحصة"}],"rows":[[{"en":"Sunday","ar":"الأحد"},"18:00",{"en":"Spinning","ar":"دراجات"}],[{"en":"Monday","ar":"الاثنين"},"19:00",{"en":"Yoga","ar":"يوغا"}],[{"en":"Tuesday","ar":"الثلاثاء"},"18:00",{"en":"Boxing","ar":"ملاكمة"}],[{"en":"Wednesday","ar":"الأربعاء"},"19:00",{"en":"Yoga","ar":"يوغا"}]]},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"He moves row by row and stops where he needs.","ar":"ينتقل صفًا صفًا ويتوقّف حيث يريد."},"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"all","text":{"en":"Put the whole week in the alt text","ar":"اكتب الأسبوع كله في النص البديل"},"mock":{"reader":{"en":"Sunday 7:00 Pilates, Sunday 18:00 Spinning, Sunday 20:00 Boxing, Monday 7:00 Pilates, Monday 19:00 Yoga, Monday 21:00 Spinning, Tuesday…","ar":"الأحد 7:00 بيلاتس، الأحد 18:00 دراجات، الأحد 20:00 ملاكمة، الاثنين 7:00 بيلاتس، الاثنين 19:00 يوغا، الاثنين 21:00 دراجات، الثلاثاء…"},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Timetable","ar":"جدول الحصص"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","size":"m","text":{"en":"Class timetable (image)","ar":"جدول الحصص (صورة)"}},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"(40 more classes)","ar":"(40 حصة أخرى)"},"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"better","text":{"en":"Change the alt text to \"Weekly timetable of all our classes\"","ar":"غيّر النص البديل إلى «الجدول الأسبوعي لكل حصصنا»"},"mock":{"reader":{"en":"Weekly timetable of all our classes, image.","ar":"الجدول الأسبوعي لكل حصصنا، صورة."},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Timetable","ar":"جدول الحصص"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","size":"m","text":{"en":"Class timetable (image)","ar":"جدول الحصص (صورة)"}}]}}],"answer":["page"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-038","when":["all"],"feedback":{"en":"He can't pause in the middle of alt text. To hear Monday again, he must start from Sunday.","ar":"لا يستطيع أن يوقف النص البديل في منتصفه. ولكي يسمع حصص الاثنين مرة أخرى، عليه أن يبدأ من الأحد."}},{"id":"MC-P05-040","when":["better"],"feedback":{"en":"It's a nicer name, but he still doesn't hear a single class time.","ar":"اسم أفضل، لكنه ما زال لا يسمع موعد أي حصة."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Listen to each option. Can he find Monday's yoga quickly?","ar":"استمع إلى كل خيار. هل يجد حصة اليوغا يوم الاثنين بسرعة؟"},{"en":"Which option lets him move one row at a time?","ar":"أي خيار يجعله ينتقل صفًا صفًا؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Right. A real table works for everyone.","ar":"صحيح. الجدول الحقيقي يناسب الجميع."},"explain":{"en":"A timetable holds too much for alt text. As real text on the page, a screen reader can read it row by row, and everyone can search and zoom it.","ar":"الجدول فيه معلومات أكثر من أن يحملها نص بديل. وحين يكون نصًا حقيقيًا في الصفحة، يقرؤه قارئ الشاشة صفًا صفًا، ويستطيع الجميع البحث فيه وتكبيره."}},{"id":"S03","type":"card","part":"concept","icons":["list","idea","text"],"title":{"en":"Big images need a text version","ar":"الصور الكبيرة تحتاج نسخة نصية"},"body":{"en":"Timetables, charts and maps hold too much for one short line.\n\n- **Put it on the page:** a real list or table that everyone can read, and the screen reader too.\n- **Charts:** a chart may have many numbers, but its main point often fits in one sentence. Put that sentence in the alt text.\n- **The short rules still apply:** key words first, and no \"image of\".","ar":"الجداول والرسوم البيانية والخرائط فيها معلومات أكثر من سطر قصير واحد.\n\n- **ضعها في الصفحة:** قائمة أو جدول حقيقي يقرؤه الجميع، وقارئ الشاشة أيضًا.\n- **الرسوم البيانية (Charts):** قد يحمل الرسم أرقامًا كثيرة، لكن فكرته الأساسية غالبًا تُقال في جملة واحدة. ضع هذه الجملة في النص البديل.\n- **قواعد القِصر ما زالت تنطبق:** الكلمات المهمة أولًا، وبلا «صورة لـ»."}},{"id":"S04","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P05-U04-03","part":"guided","rules":["R06"],"value":{"en":"Write Alt Text (NN/g): a graph might contain hundreds of data points, yet its main message can often be described in one sentence.","ar":"اكتب النص البديل (NN/g): قد يحمل الرسم البياني مئات القيم، لكن رسالته الأساسية غالبًا تُوصف في جملة واحدة."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/write-alt-text/","quote":"For example, a line graph might contain hundreds of data points, yet its main message might be the simple correlation between the two variables, which can be succinctly described in one sentence."},"scenario":{"en":"Under the timetable, a bar chart shows how busy the gym is each hour. Members use it to avoid the crowd.","ar":"تحت الجدول، رسم بياني بالأعمدة يوضّح زحمة النادي في كل ساعة. والأعضاء يستخدمونه ليتجنّبوا الزحمة."},"prompt":{"en":"What should the chart's alt text be?","ar":"ماذا يجب أن يكون النص البديل للرسم البياني؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Timetable","ar":"جدول الحصص"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"How busy is the gym?","ar":"ما مدى زحمة النادي؟"}},{"kind":"chart","type":"bar","values":[10,25,30,18,12,8,6,7,9,14,22,38,45,42,30,20,12],"labels":["6","","","","10","","","","14","","","","18","","","","22"],"highlight":12,"gap":"s"},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Members per hour, 6:00 to 23:00 (image)","ar":"عدد الأعضاء كل ساعة، من 6:00 إلى 23:00 (صورة)"},"gap":"xs"}],"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"}},"options":[{"id":"look","text":{"en":"\"Bar chart with purple bars.\"","ar":"«رسم بياني بأعمدة بنفسجية.»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Timetable","ar":"جدول الحصص"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"How busy is the gym?","ar":"ما مدى زحمة النادي؟"}},{"kind":"chart","type":"bar","values":[10,25,30,18,12,8,6,7,9,14,22,38,45,42,30,20,12],"labels":["6","","","","10","","","","14","","","","18","","","","22"],"highlight":12,"gap":"s"},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Members per hour, 6:00 to 23:00 (image)","ar":"عدد الأعضاء كل ساعة، من 6:00 إلى 23:00 (صورة)"},"gap":"xs"}],"reader":{"en":"Bar chart with purple bars. Image.","ar":"رسم بياني بأعمدة بنفسجية. صورة."},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}},{"id":"every","text":{"en":"\"6:00, 10 people. 7:00, 25 people. 8:00, 30 people…\" for all 17 hours","ar":"«6:00، 10 أشخاص. 7:00، 25 شخصًا. 8:00، 30 شخصًا…» لكل الساعات الـ 17"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Timetable","ar":"جدول الحصص"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"How busy is the gym?","ar":"ما مدى زحمة النادي؟"}},{"kind":"chart","type":"bar","values":[10,25,30,18,12,8,6,7,9,14,22,38,45,42,30,20,12],"labels":["6","","","","10","","","","14","","","","18","","","","22"],"highlight":12,"gap":"s"},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Members per hour, 6:00 to 23:00 (image)","ar":"عدد الأعضاء كل ساعة، من 6:00 إلى 23:00 (صورة)"},"gap":"xs"}],"reader":{"en":"6:00, 10 people. 7:00, 25 people. 8:00, 30 people… (all 17 hours) Image.","ar":"6:00، 10 أشخاص. 7:00، 25 شخصًا. 8:00، 30 شخصًا… (كل الساعات الـ 17) صورة."},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}},{"id":"point","text":{"en":"\"Busiest 18:00 to 20:00. Quietest 13:00 to 15:00.\"","ar":"«الأكثر زحمة من 18:00 إلى 20:00. والأهدأ من 13:00 إلى 15:00.»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Timetable","ar":"جدول الحصص"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"How busy is the gym?","ar":"ما مدى زحمة النادي؟"}},{"kind":"chart","type":"bar","values":[10,25,30,18,12,8,6,7,9,14,22,38,45,42,30,20,12],"labels":["6","","","","10","","","","14","","","","18","","","","22"],"highlight":12,"gap":"s"},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Members per hour, 6:00 to 23:00 (image)","ar":"عدد الأعضاء كل ساعة، من 6:00 إلى 23:00 (صورة)"},"gap":"xs"}],"reader":{"en":"Busiest 18:00 to 20:00. Quietest 13:00 to 15:00. Image.","ar":"الأكثر زحمة من 18:00 إلى 20:00. والأهدأ من 13:00 إلى 15:00. صورة."},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}}],"answer":["point"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-037","when":["look"],"feedback":{"en":"The colour of the bars doesn't help anyone pick a time. Members need what the chart tells them.","ar":"لون الأعمدة لا يساعد أحدًا على اختيار موعد. الأعضاء يحتاجون ما يخبرهم به الرسم."}},{"id":"MC-P05-038","when":["every"],"feedback":{"en":"That's 17 numbers to hold in mind. Members want the answer: when is it busy, and when is it quiet?","ar":"هذه 17 رقمًا على العضو أن يتذكّرها، وهو يريد الإجابة فقط: متى الزحمة، ومتى الهدوء؟"}}],"hints":[{"en":"Why do members look at this chart?","ar":"لماذا ينظر الأعضاء إلى هذا الرسم؟"},{"en":"Which option gives the main point in one sentence?","ar":"أي خيار يعطي الفكرة الأساسية في جملة واحدة؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Give the main point, not every number.","ar":"صحيح. قل الفكرة الأساسية، لا كل رقم."},"explain":{"en":"A chart is there to show one thing. Say that thing. If people also need the exact numbers, put them in a table on the page.","ar":"الرسم البياني موجود ليُظهر شيئًا واحدًا. قل هذا الشيء. وإذا احتاج الناس الأرقام بالضبط، ضعها في جدول في الصفحة."},"speaker":"hana"},{"id":"S05","type":"choose","skill":"SK-P05-U04-02","part":"guided","rules":["R06"],"value":{"en":"Write Alt Text (NN/g): don't start with words like \"image\" or \"photo\"; screen readers already say it's an image. Put the important words first.","ar":"اكتب النص البديل (NN/g): لا تبدأ بكلمات مثل «صورة»؛ فقارئ الشاشة يقول إنها صورة أصلًا. وضع الكلمات المهمة أولًا."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/write-alt-text/","quote":"Do not include words like ‘image’ or ‘photo’ at the beginning."},"scenario":{"en":"Our \"Facilities\" page has a photo of our new pool. Its alt text says: \"Image of a photo showing the view of our pool area, taken from the entrance on a sunny morning.\"","ar":"صفحة «المرافق» فيها صورة لحمّام السباحة الجديد. ونصّها البديل يقول: «صورة لصورة تُظهر منظر منطقة حمّام السباحة، مأخوذة من المدخل في صباح مشمس.»"},"prompt":{"en":"Members want to know what the pool is like. Which rewrite is best?","ar":"الأعضاء يريدون معرفة ما يقدّمه حمّام السباحة. أي نص بديل جديد يخبرهم بذلك؟"},"options":[{"id":"photo","text":{"en":"\"Photo of the pool.\"","ar":"«صورة حمّام السباحة.»"}},{"id":"facts","text":{"en":"\"Heated 25-metre pool with 6 lanes.\"","ar":"«حمّام سباحة مُدفّأ، طوله 25 مترًا، وفيه 6 حارات.»"}},{"id":"view","text":{"en":"\"The view of our pool area from the entrance on a sunny morning.\"","ar":"«منظر منطقة حمّام السباحة من المدخل في صباح مشمس.»"}}],"answer":["facts"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-038","when":["photo"],"feedback":{"en":"It's short, but \"photo\" wastes the first word, and members learn nothing about the pool.","ar":"قصير، لكن «صورة» تضيّع أول كلمة، ولا يعرف الأعضاء شيئًا عن حمّام السباحة."}},{"id":"MC-P05-037","when":["view"],"feedback":{"en":"It describes the camera angle and the weather. Members want to know what the pool offers.","ar":"يصف زاوية التصوير والطقس. والأعضاء يريدون معرفة ما يقدّمه حمّام السباحة."}}],"hints":[{"en":"What would a member ask about a new pool?","ar":"ماذا سيسأل العضو عن حمّام سباحة جديد؟"},{"en":"Which option starts with useful words?","ar":"أي خيار يبدأ بكلمات مفيدة؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Short, useful, key words first.","ar":"صحيح. قصير، ومفيد، والكلمات المهمة أولًا."},"explain":{"en":"Cut \"image of\" and the details nobody needs. Keep what the image is there to tell.","ar":"احذف «صورة لـ» والتفاصيل التي لا يحتاجها أحد. وأبقِ المعلومة التي وُضعت الصورة من أجلها."},"speaker":"hana"},{"id":"S06","type":"compare","skill":"SK-P05-U04-03","part":"contrast","confidence":true,"rules":["R11"],"value":{"en":"Contrast: a long alt text vs a list on the page. Write Alt Text (NN/g): often the fix is as simple as a list or table in the page itself.","ar":"مقارنة: نص بديل طويل مقابل قائمة في الصفحة. اكتب النص البديل (NN/g): الحل غالبًا بسيط مثل قائمة أو جدول في الصفحة نفسها."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/write-alt-text/","quote":"In many cases, this could be as simple as including a list or table within the HTML of the page."},"scenario":{"en":"Our \"Branches\" page shows a map with 4 pins. We tried two ways to make it work for blind members.","ar":"صفحة «الفروع» تعرض خريطة عليها 4 علامات. وجرّبنا طريقتين لنجعلها مناسبة للأعضاء المكفوفين."},"prompt":{"en":"Which page helps a blind member find the nearest branch?","ar":"أي صفحة تساعد العضو الكفيف على إيجاد أقرب فرع؟"},"a":{"label":{"en":"A: All four branches are written in the map's alt text.","ar":"A: الفروع الأربعة مكتوبة في النص البديل للخريطة."},"mock":{"reader":{"en":"Map: Nasr City, 12 Abbas El Akkad Street, 6:00 to 23:00. Maadi, 9 Road 233, 6:00 to 23:00. Dokki, 30 Tahrir Street…","ar":"خريطة: مدينة نصر، 12 شارع عباس العقاد، من 6:00 إلى 23:00. المعادي، 9 شارع 233، من 6:00 إلى 23:00. الدقي، 30 شارع التحرير…"},"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Branches","ar":"الفروع"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"map","text":{"en":"Map with 4 pins","ar":"خريطة عليها 4 علامات"}}]}},"b":{"label":{"en":"B: The map stays, and the branches are a list under it.","ar":"B: الخريطة تبقى، والفروع قائمة تحتها."},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Branches","ar":"الفروع"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"map","text":{"en":"Map with 4 pins","ar":"خريطة عليها 4 علامات"}},{"kind":"meta","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Nasr City","ar":"مدينة نصر"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"12 Abbas El Akkad St. · 6:00–23:00","ar":"12 شارع عباس العقاد · 6:00–23:00"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"meta","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Maadi","ar":"المعادي"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"9 Road 233 · 6:00–23:00","ar":"9 شارع 233 · 6:00–23:00"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"+ Dokki, Heliopolis","ar":"+ الدقي، مصر الجديدة"},"gap":"s"}]}},"answer":"b","reason":{"prompt":{"en":"Why is B better?","ar":"لماذا B أفضل؟"},"options":[{"id":"list","text":{"en":"He can move branch by branch and stop at the one he needs","ar":"يستطيع أن ينتقل فرعًا فرعًا ويتوقّف عند الفرع الذي يحتاجه"}},{"id":"short","text":{"en":"The map is smaller in B","ar":"الخريطة أصغر في B"}},{"id":"maps","text":{"en":"Maps can't have alt text","ar":"الخرائط لا يمكن أن يكون لها نص بديل"}}],"answer":["list"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-040","when":["short","maps"],"feedback":{"en":"The point is the list. Real text can be read piece by piece; alt text plays from start to end.","ar":"المهم هو القائمة. النص الحقيقي يُقرأ جزءًا جزءًا؛ أما النص البديل فيُسمع من أوله لآخره."}}]},"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-040","when":["a"],"feedback":{"en":"A has all the facts, but he can't pause or go back. To hear Maadi's address again, he must start from Nasr City.","ar":"A فيه كل المعلومات، لكن العضو لا يستطيع أن يوقفه أو يرجع فيه. ولكي يسمع عنوان المعادي مرة أخرى، عليه أن يبدأ من مدينة نصر."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Can he jump to the second branch in each one?","ar":"هل يستطيع أن ينتقل مباشرة إلى الفرع الثاني في كل صفحة؟"},{"en":"Which one is real text on the page?","ar":"أيهما نص حقيقي في الصفحة؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Right. The list does the work; the map is extra.","ar":"صحيح. القائمة تؤدّي المهمة؛ والخريطة إضافة."},"explain":{"en":"When the page text carries the information, the image doesn't need to. Everyone can read the list, copy an address, or tap it.","ar":"حين يحمل نص الصفحة المعلومة، لا تحتاج الصورة أن تحملها. ويستطيع الجميع قراءة القائمة، ونسخ العنوان، والضغط عليه."},"speaker":"hana"},{"id":"S07","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P05-U04-01","part":"independent","speaker":"sara","rules":["R14"],"value":{"en":"New case. Write Alt Text (NN/g): decorative images create a look and feel for sighted users but carry no information for any task, so their alt text should be empty.","ar":"حالة جديدة. اكتب النص البديل (NN/g): الصور الزخرفية تصنع إحساسًا معيّنًا للمبصرين، لكنها لا تحمل معلومة لأي مهمة، فنصّها البديل يجب أن يكون فارغًا."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/write-alt-text/","quote":"Decorative images create a specific look and feel for sighted users but don’t convey information relevant for any tasks."},"scenario":{"en":"I'm designing a bakery's order page. At the top, under the heading \"Fresh bread every morning\", a wide photo of bread on a wooden table sets the mood.","ar":"أصمّم صفحة الطلب لمخبز. في الأعلى، تحت عنوان «خبز طازج كل صباح»، صورة عريضة لخبز على طاولة خشب تعطي إحساسًا جميلًا."},"prompt":{"en":"What should the photo's alt text be?","ar":"ماذا يجب أن يكون النص البديل (Alt text) للصورة؟"},"mock":{"app":{"name":{"en":"Khobza","ar":"خبزة"},"color":"#B45309","icon":"bread","domain":"khobza.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"khobza.example/order","navbar":{"actions":[{"icon":"shopping-bag"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Fresh bread every morning","ar":"خبز طازج كل صباح"}},{"kind":"image","art":"bread","gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Order now","ar":"اطلب الآن"},"gap":"m"}],"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"}},"options":[{"id":"describe","text":{"en":"\"Fresh bread on a wooden table.\"","ar":"«خبز طازج على طاولة خشب.»"},"mock":{"app":{"name":{"en":"Khobza","ar":"خبزة"},"color":"#B45309","icon":"bread","domain":"khobza.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"khobza.example/order","navbar":{"actions":[{"icon":"shopping-bag"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Fresh bread every morning","ar":"خبز طازج كل صباح"}},{"kind":"image","art":"bread","gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Order now","ar":"اطلب الآن"},"gap":"m"}],"reader":{"en":"Fresh bread every morning, heading. Fresh bread on a wooden table, image.","ar":"خبز طازج كل صباح، عنوان. خبز طازج على طاولة خشب، صورة."},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}},{"id":"heading","text":{"en":"\"Fresh bread every morning.\"","ar":"«خبز طازج كل صباح.»"},"mock":{"app":{"name":{"en":"Khobza","ar":"خبزة"},"color":"#B45309","icon":"bread","domain":"khobza.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"khobza.example/order","navbar":{"actions":[{"icon":"shopping-bag"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Fresh bread every morning","ar":"خبز طازج كل صباح"}},{"kind":"image","art":"bread","gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Order now","ar":"اطلب الآن"},"gap":"m"}],"reader":{"en":"Fresh bread every morning, heading. Fresh bread every morning, image.","ar":"خبز طازج كل صباح، عنوان. خبز طازج كل صباح، صورة."},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}},{"id":"empty","text":{"en":"Empty, so the screen reader skips it","ar":"فارغ، ليتخطّاها قارئ الشاشة"},"mock":{"app":{"name":{"en":"Khobza","ar":"خبزة"},"color":"#B45309","icon":"bread","domain":"khobza.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"khobza.example/order","navbar":{"actions":[{"icon":"shopping-bag"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Fresh bread every morning","ar":"خبز طازج كل صباح"}},{"kind":"image","art":"bread","gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Order now","ar":"اطلب الآن"},"gap":"m"}],"reader":{"en":"Fresh bread every morning, heading. Order now, button.","ar":"خبز طازج كل صباح، عنوان. اطلب الآن، زر."},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}}],"answer":["empty"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-035","when":["describe"],"feedback":{"en":"The photo is there for the mood. Nobody needs it to order, so it only delays the \"Order now\" button.","ar":"الصورة موجودة للإحساس. ولا أحد يحتاجها ليطلب، فهي تؤخّر الوصول إلى زر «اطلب الآن» فقط."}},{"id":"MC-P05-039","when":["heading"],"feedback":{"en":"The heading right above already says this. The customer would hear it twice.","ar":"العنوان فوقها مباشرة يقول هذا. فسيسمعه العميل مرتين."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Can a customer order without this photo?","ar":"هل يستطيع العميل أن يطلب بدون هذه الصورة؟"},{"en":"Does the photo add anything the heading doesn't?","ar":"هل تضيف الصورة شيئًا لا يقوله العنوان؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Photos for mood are skipped.","ar":"صحيح. الصور التي للإحساس فقط تُتخطّى."},"explain":{"en":"Ask why the image is there. This one is for looks only, so empty alt text saves the customer's time.","ar":"اسأل لماذا الصورة هنا. هذه للشكل فقط، فالنص البديل الفارغ يوفّر وقت العميل."}},{"id":"S08","type":"card","part":"recap","icons":["list","idea","cut","none"],"title":{"en":"What you did","ar":"ماذا تعلّمت"},"body":{"en":"- **Text on the page:** you turned the timetable image into a real table.\n- **The main point:** you gave the busy-hours chart one clear sentence.\n- **Short and useful:** you cut \"image of\" from the pool photo and kept the facts.\n- **List over long alt text:** you put the branches in a list under the map.\n- **For looks only:** you left the bakery photo empty.\n\nNext: the skill check.","ar":"- **نص في الصفحة:** حوّلت صورة الجدول إلى جدول حقيقي.\n- **الفكرة الأساسية:** أعطيت رسم أوقات الزحمة جملة واحدة واضحة.\n- **قصير ومفيد:** حذفت «صورة لـ» من صورة حمّام السباحة وأبقيت المعلومات.\n- **قائمة بدل نص بديل طويل:** وضعت الفروع في قائمة تحت الخريطة.\n- **للشكل فقط:** تركت صورة المخبز فارغة.\n\nالتالي: اختبار المهارة."}}]}$uxg$::jsonb),
  ($uxg$P05-U04-L04$uxg$, $uxg$3059100b608d76a6b3d4a0d4e70d65a7ef38cbaf4ff0c4e8e1593a4fb70e1425$uxg$, $uxg${"id":"P05-U04-L04","mode":"check","minutes":6,"title":{"en":"Skill check: screen readers and meaning","ar":"اختبار المهارة: قارئ الشاشة والمعنى"},"summary":{"en":"Check what a screen reader says on a travel booking app, from images to links, on your own.","ar":"افحص ما يقوله قارئ الشاشة في تطبيق حجز سفر، من الصور إلى الروابط، بنفسك."},"speaker":"rami","steps":[{"id":"S01","type":"card","part":"hook","title":{"en":"Rami's travel app","ar":"تطبيق السفر الذي يصمّمه رامي"},"body":{"en":"I'm a junior designer on a hotel booking app. Before launch, my lead asked me to listen to it with a screen reader.\n\nYour job: check five parts.\n\nThis is a skill check: there are no hints, and you'll see your result at the end.","ar":"أعمل مصمّمًا مبتدئًا في تطبيق لحجز الفنادق. وقبل الإطلاق، طلبت مني قائدة الفريق أن أستمع إليه بقارئ الشاشة.\n\nمهمّتك: افحص خمسة أجزاء.\n\nهذا اختبار مهارة: لا توجد تلميحات، وسترى نتيجتك في النهاية."},"mock":{"app":{"id":"zad","name":{"en":"Zad Travel","ar":"زاد للسفر"},"color":"#6D28D9","icon":"airplane-tilt","domain":"zad.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Hotel","ar":"الفندق"},"back":true,"actions":[{"icon":"heart","aria":{"en":"Save","ar":"حفظ"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"hotel-room"},{"kind":"meta","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Nile View Hotel","ar":"فندق نايل فيو"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":"★★★★☆","gap":"xs"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Change dates","ar":"غيّر التواريخ"},"gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"S02","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P05-U04-01","part":"check","rules":["R19"],"value":{"en":"Skill check. Write Alt Text (NN/g): images are decorative, functional or informative. Skip decorative, describe the action for functional, convey the message for informative.","ar":"اختبار مهارة. اكتب النص البديل (NN/g): الصور إما زخرفية أو وظيفية أو تحمل معلومة. تخطَّ الزخرفية، وصِف الإجراء للوظيفية، وانقل الرسالة للتي تحمل معلومة."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/write-alt-text/","quote":"Images are decorative, functional, or informative. Skip alt text for decorative. Describe the action for functional. Convey the message for informative."},"scenario":{"en":"Each hotel shows its rating as an image of stars, with no number next to it.","ar":"كل فندق يعرض تقييمه كصورة نجوم، بدون رقم بجانبها."},"prompt":{"en":"What should the stars' alt text be?","ar":"ماذا يجب أن يكون النص البديل للنجوم؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"zad","name":{"en":"Zad Travel","ar":"زاد للسفر"},"color":"#6D28D9","icon":"airplane-tilt","domain":"zad.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Hotel","ar":"الفندق"},"back":true,"actions":[{"icon":"heart","aria":{"en":"Save","ar":"حفظ"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"hotel-room"},{"kind":"meta","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Nile View Hotel","ar":"فندق نايل فيو"}},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":"★★★★☆","gap":"xs"}],"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"}},"options":[{"id":"rated","text":{"en":"\"Rated 4 out of 5.\"","ar":"«التقييم 4 من 5.»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"zad","name":{"en":"Zad Travel","ar":"زاد للسفر"},"color":"#6D28D9","icon":"airplane-tilt","domain":"zad.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Hotel","ar":"الفندق"},"back":true,"actions":[{"icon":"heart","aria":{"en":"Save","ar":"حفظ"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"hotel-room"},{"kind":"meta","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Nile View Hotel","ar":"فندق نايل فيو"}},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":"★★★★☆","gap":"xs"}],"reader":{"en":"Nile View Hotel. Rated 4 out of 5.","ar":"فندق نايل فيو. التقييم 4 من 5."},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}},{"id":"look","text":{"en":"\"Four yellow stars and one grey star.\"","ar":"«أربع نجوم صفراء ونجمة رمادية.»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"zad","name":{"en":"Zad Travel","ar":"زاد للسفر"},"color":"#6D28D9","icon":"airplane-tilt","domain":"zad.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Hotel","ar":"الفندق"},"back":true,"actions":[{"icon":"heart","aria":{"en":"Save","ar":"حفظ"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"hotel-room"},{"kind":"meta","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Nile View Hotel","ar":"فندق نايل فيو"}},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":"★★★★☆","gap":"xs"}],"reader":{"en":"Nile View Hotel. Four yellow stars and one grey star.","ar":"فندق نايل فيو. أربع نجوم صفراء ونجمة رمادية."},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}},{"id":"empty","text":{"en":"Empty; stars are decoration","ar":"فارغ؛ النجوم للزينة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"zad","name":{"en":"Zad Travel","ar":"زاد للسفر"},"color":"#6D28D9","icon":"airplane-tilt","domain":"zad.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Hotel","ar":"الفندق"},"back":true,"actions":[{"icon":"heart","aria":{"en":"Save","ar":"حفظ"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"hotel-room"},{"kind":"meta","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Nile View Hotel","ar":"فندق نايل فيو"}},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":"★★★★☆","gap":"xs"}],"reader":{"en":"Nile View Hotel.","ar":"فندق نايل فيو."},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}}],"answer":["rated"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-037","when":["look"],"feedback":{"en":"Guests don't need the colours. They need the rating the stars show.","ar":"الضيف لا يحتاج الألوان. يحتاج التقييم الذي تُظهره النجوم."}},{"id":"MC-P05-035","when":["empty"],"feedback":{"en":"The stars carry the rating, and it's written nowhere else. Empty alt text would hide it.","ar":"النجوم تحمل التقييم، وهو غير مكتوب في أي مكان آخر. والنص البديل الفارغ سيُخفيه."}}],"explain":{"en":"From Lesson 1: an image that tells something gets alt text with its message.","ar":"من الدرس 1: الصورة التي تحمل معلومة، يذكر نصّها البديل رسالتها."},"speaker":"rami"},{"id":"S03","type":"choose","skill":"SK-P05-U04-02","part":"check","rules":["R19"],"value":{"en":"Skill check. Write Alt Text (NN/g): put the most important words first, so users can decide quickly whether to keep listening.","ar":"اختبار مهارة. اكتب النص البديل (NN/g): ضع الكلمات الأهم أولًا، ليقرّر المستخدم بسرعة إن كان سيكمل الاستماع."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/write-alt-text/","quote":"Frontload alt text with the most important words, to help users make a quick and informed decision about whether it’s worth listening to the rest of the alt text before moving on."},"scenario":{"en":"The room photo's alt text says: \"A photo we took last summer of one of our rooms, the Deluxe room, which has a balcony that looks at the sea.\"","ar":"النص البديل لصورة الغرفة يقول: «صورة التقطناها الصيف الماضي لإحدى غرفنا، الغرفة الديلوكس، التي فيها شرفة تطلّ على البحر.»"},"prompt":{"en":"Which rewrite is best?","ar":"أي نص بديل جديد يُسمع الضيف المهم أولًا؟"},"options":[{"id":"keep","text":{"en":"Keep it; it has all the facts","ar":"يبقى كما هو؛ فيه كل المعلومات"}},{"id":"room","text":{"en":"\"Photo of a room.\"","ar":"«صورة غرفة.»"}},{"id":"front","text":{"en":"\"Deluxe room with a sea-view balcony.\"","ar":"«غرفة ديلوكس بشرفة تطلّ على البحر.»"}}],"answer":["front"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-038","when":["keep"],"feedback":{"en":"The useful words come at the end. Guests hear \"a photo we took last summer\" first and may skip it.","ar":"الكلمات المفيدة في النهاية. والضيف يسمع «صورة التقطناها الصيف الماضي» أولًا وقد يتخطّاها."}},{"id":"MC-P05-038","when":["room"],"feedback":{"en":"It's short, but \"photo\" wastes the first word, and the balcony and sea view are lost.","ar":"قصير، لكن «صورة» تضيّع أول كلمة، ولا يذكر الشرفة ولا منظر البحر."}}],"explain":{"en":"From Lesson 1: short, key words first, no \"photo of\".","ar":"من الدرس 1: قصير، والكلمات المهمة أولًا، بلا «صورة لـ»."},"speaker":"rami"},{"id":"S04","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P05-U04-03","part":"check","rules":["R19"],"value":{"en":"Skill check. Write Alt Text (NN/g): editing the page text to give the image's message often makes the image itself unnecessary.","ar":"اختبار مهارة. اكتب النص البديل (NN/g): تعديل نص الصفحة ليحمل رسالة الصورة غالبًا يجعل الصورة نفسها غير ضرورية."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/write-alt-text/","quote":"Editing the page copy to communicate the image’s message often makes the visual itself redundant."},"scenario":{"en":"The baggage rules are one image: 3 ticket types, each with its own bag limits.","ar":"قواعد الحقائب صورة واحدة: 3 أنواع من التذاكر، ولكل نوع حدود حقائب مختلفة."},"prompt":{"en":"How should we fix it for screen reader users?","ar":"كيف نصلحها لمستخدمي قارئ الشاشة؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"zad","name":{"en":"Zad Travel","ar":"زاد للسفر"},"color":"#6D28D9","icon":"airplane-tilt","domain":"zad.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Flight to Aswan","ar":"رحلة الطيران إلى أسوان"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","size":"m","text":{"en":"Baggage rules (image)\nBasic · Standard · Flex","ar":"قواعد الحقائب (صورة)\nأساسي · عادي · مرن"}}],"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"}},"options":[{"id":"name","text":{"en":"Alt text: \"Baggage rules for each ticket type.\"","ar":"النص البديل: «قواعد الحقائب لكل نوع تذكرة.»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"zad","name":{"en":"Zad Travel","ar":"زاد للسفر"},"color":"#6D28D9","icon":"airplane-tilt","domain":"zad.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Flight to Aswan","ar":"رحلة الطيران إلى أسوان"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","size":"m","text":{"en":"Baggage rules (image)\nBasic · Standard · Flex","ar":"قواعد الحقائب (صورة)\nأساسي · عادي · مرن"}}],"reader":{"en":"Baggage rules for each ticket type, image.","ar":"قواعد الحقائب لكل نوع تذكرة، صورة."},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}},{"id":"table","text":{"en":"Show the rules as a real table on the page","ar":"اعرض القواعد كجدول حقيقي في الصفحة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"zad","name":{"en":"Zad Travel","ar":"زاد للسفر"},"color":"#6D28D9","icon":"airplane-tilt","domain":"zad.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Flight to Aswan","ar":"رحلة الطيران إلى أسوان"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Baggage rules","ar":"قواعد الحقائب"}},{"kind":"table","gap":"s","head":[{"en":"Ticket","ar":"التذكرة"},{"en":"Bags","ar":"الحقائب"},{"en":"Weight","ar":"الوزن"}],"rows":[[{"en":"Basic","ar":"أساسي"},{"en":"1 hand bag","ar":"حقيبة يد واحدة"},{"en":"7 kg","ar":"7 كجم"}],[{"en":"Standard","ar":"عادي"},{"en":"Hand bag + 1 bag","ar":"حقيبة يد + حقيبة"},{"en":"20 kg","ar":"20 كجم"}],[{"en":"Flex","ar":"مرن"},{"en":"Hand bag + 2 bags","ar":"حقيبة يد + حقيبتان"},{"en":"23 kg each","ar":"23 كجم لكل حقيبة"}]]}],"reader":{"en":"Baggage rules, heading. Table, 3 rows, 3 columns.","ar":"قواعد الحقائب، عنوان. جدول، 3 صفوف، 3 أعمدة."},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}},{"id":"all","text":{"en":"Put all the rules for all 3 tickets in the alt text","ar":"اكتب كل القواعد للتذاكر الثلاث في النص البديل"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"zad","name":{"en":"Zad Travel","ar":"زاد للسفر"},"color":"#6D28D9","icon":"airplane-tilt","domain":"zad.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Flight to Aswan","ar":"رحلة الطيران إلى أسوان"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","size":"m","text":{"en":"Baggage rules (image)\nBasic · Standard · Flex","ar":"قواعد الحقائب (صورة)\nأساسي · عادي · مرن"}}],"reader":{"en":"Basic: 1 hand bag, 7 kg. Standard: hand bag and 1 bag, 20 kg. Flex: hand bag and 2 bags, 23 kg each. Image.","ar":"أساسي: حقيبة يد واحدة، 7 كجم. عادي: حقيبة يد وحقيبة، 20 كجم. مرن: حقيبة يد وحقيبتان، 23 كجم لكل حقيبة. صورة."},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}}],"answer":["table"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-040","when":["name"],"feedback":{"en":"Guests now know the rules exist, but not what they are.","ar":"الضيف يعرف الآن أن هناك قواعد، لكن لا يعرف ما هي."}},{"id":"MC-P05-038","when":["all"],"feedback":{"en":"That's far too long for alt text, and guests can't pause it or go back to one ticket.","ar":"هذا أطول بكثير مما يحتمله النص البديل، ولا يستطيع الضيف إيقافه أو الرجوع إلى تذكرة واحدة."}}],"explain":{"en":"From Lesson 3: big images like tables need a text version on the page.","ar":"من الدرس 3: الصور الكبيرة مثل الجداول تحتاج نسخة نصية في الصفحة."},"speaker":"rami"},{"id":"S05","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P05-U04-04","part":"check","rules":["R19"],"value":{"en":"Skill check. Writing Hyperlinks (NN/g): links should have good information scent; they must clearly explain where they will take users.","ar":"اختبار مهارة. كتابة الروابط (NN/g): الرابط يجب أن يدلّ بوضوح على وجهته؛ أي يشرح إلى أين سيأخذ المستخدم."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/writing-links/","quote":"Links should have good information scent: that is, they must clearly explain where they will take users."},"scenario":{"en":"Under the price, there's a line about refunds. Only the words \"click here\" are a link.","ar":"تحت السعر سطر عن الاسترداد. وكلمتا «اضغط هنا» فقط هما الرابط."},"prompt":{"en":"Tap each option to see the change. Which link makes sense when heard alone?","ar":"اضغط على كل خيار لترى التغيير. أي رابط مفهوم حين يُسمع وحده؟"},"mock":{"reader":{"en":"Click here, link.","ar":"اضغط هنا، رابط."},"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"app":{"id":"zad","name":{"en":"Zad Travel","ar":"زاد للسفر"},"color":"#6D28D9","icon":"airplane-tilt","domain":"zad.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Hotel","ar":"الفندق"},"back":true,"actions":[{"icon":"heart","aria":{"en":"Save","ar":"حفظ"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"2,400 EGP","ar":"2,400 جنيه"},"per":{"en":"/ night","ar":"/ الليلة"}},{"kind":"row","blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"To see our refund rules,","ar":"لترى قواعد الاسترداد،"}},{"kind":"link","text":{"en":"click here","ar":"اضغط هنا"}}]}]},"options":[{"id":"rules","text":{"en":"Make the link \"Refund rules\"","ar":"اجعل الرابط «قواعد الاسترداد»"},"mock":{"reader":{"en":"Refund rules, link.","ar":"قواعد الاسترداد، رابط."},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"zad","name":{"en":"Zad Travel","ar":"زاد للسفر"},"color":"#6D28D9","icon":"airplane-tilt","domain":"zad.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Hotel","ar":"الفندق"},"back":true,"actions":[{"icon":"heart","aria":{"en":"Save","ar":"حفظ"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"2,400 EGP","ar":"2,400 جنيه"},"per":{"en":"/ night","ar":"/ الليلة"}},{"kind":"link","text":{"en":"Refund rules","ar":"قواعد الاسترداد"}}]}},{"id":"bold","text":{"en":"Make \"click here\" bold and blue","ar":"اجعل «اضغط هنا» عريضة وزرقاء"},"mock":{"reader":{"en":"Click here, link.","ar":"اضغط هنا، رابط."},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"zad","name":{"en":"Zad Travel","ar":"زاد للسفر"},"color":"#6D28D9","icon":"airplane-tilt","domain":"zad.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Hotel","ar":"الفندق"},"back":true,"actions":[{"icon":"heart","aria":{"en":"Save","ar":"حفظ"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"2,400 EGP","ar":"2,400 جنيه"},"per":{"en":"/ night","ar":"/ الليلة"}},{"kind":"row","blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"To see our refund rules,","ar":"لترى قواعد الاسترداد،"}},{"kind":"link","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"click here","ar":"اضغط هنا"}}]}]}},{"id":"tap","text":{"en":"Change it to \"Tap here\", since it's a phone app","ar":"غيّرها إلى «المس هنا»، لأنه تطبيق هاتف"},"mock":{"reader":{"en":"Tap here, link.","ar":"المس هنا، رابط."},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"zad","name":{"en":"Zad Travel","ar":"زاد للسفر"},"color":"#6D28D9","icon":"airplane-tilt","domain":"zad.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Hotel","ar":"الفندق"},"back":true,"actions":[{"icon":"heart","aria":{"en":"Save","ar":"حفظ"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"2,400 EGP","ar":"2,400 جنيه"},"per":{"en":"/ night","ar":"/ الليلة"}},{"kind":"row","blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"To see our refund rules,","ar":"لترى قواعد الاسترداد،"}},{"kind":"link","text":{"en":"tap here","ar":"المس هنا"}}]}]}}],"answer":["rules"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-041","when":["bold","tap"],"feedback":{"en":"The guest still hears a link that doesn't say where it goes. The link's own words must name the place.","ar":"ما زال الضيف يسمع رابطًا لا يقول إلى أين يذهب. ويجب أن تذكر كلمات الرابط نفسه الوجهة."}}],"explain":{"en":"From Lesson 2: a link names where it goes, so it makes sense alone.","ar":"من الدرس 2: الرابط يذكر وجهته، فيكون مفهومًا وحده."},"speaker":"rami"},{"id":"S06","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P05-U04-05","part":"check","rules":["R19"],"value":{"en":"Skill check. Screen-Reader Users on Mobile (NN/g): users expect to interact with what just opened, so focus should jump to the start of it.","ar":"اختبار مهارة. مستخدمو قارئ الشاشة على الهاتف (NN/g): المستخدم يتوقّع أن يتعامل مع ما فُتح للتو، فيجب أن ينتقل التركيز إلى بدايته."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/screen-reader-users-on-mobile/","quote":"The user will expect to interact with the newly opened menu as a result of their action."},"scenario":{"en":"Tapping \"Change dates\" opens a calendar panel. But the screen reader stays on the button, so a blind guest thinks nothing happened.","ar":"الضغط على «غيّر التواريخ» يفتح لوحة تقويم. لكن قارئ الشاشة يبقى على الزر، فيظن الضيف الكفيف أنه لم يحدث شيء."},"prompt":{"en":"What should happen when the panel opens?","ar":"ماذا يجب أن يحدث حين تُفتح اللوحة، حتى يعرف الضيف الكفيف أنها فُتحت؟"},"mock":{"reader":{"en":"Change dates, button.","ar":"غيّر التواريخ، زر."},"app":{"id":"zad","name":{"en":"Zad Travel","ar":"زاد للسفر"},"color":"#6D28D9","icon":"airplane-tilt","domain":"zad.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Hotel","ar":"الفندق"},"back":true,"actions":[{"icon":"heart","aria":{"en":"Save","ar":"حفظ"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"button","ring":"brand","text":{"en":"Change dates","ar":"غيّر التواريخ"}},{"kind":"group","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"meta","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Choose your dates","ar":"اختر التواريخ"}},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Mon 5 · Tue 6 · Wed 7 · Thu 8","ar":"الاثنين 5 · الثلاثاء 6 · الأربعاء 7 · الخميس 8"},"gap":"xs"}]},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"(nothing more)","ar":"(ولا شيء بعدها)"},"gap":"s"}],"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"}},"options":[{"id":"sound","text":{"en":"Play a sound to say something opened","ar":"شغّل صوتًا يقول إن شيئًا فُتح"},"mock":{"reader":{"en":"Change dates, button. (A sound plays.)","ar":"غيّر التواريخ، زر. (يُسمع صوت.)"},"app":{"id":"zad","name":{"en":"Zad Travel","ar":"زاد للسفر"},"color":"#6D28D9","icon":"airplane-tilt","domain":"zad.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Hotel","ar":"الفندق"},"back":true,"actions":[{"icon":"heart","aria":{"en":"Save","ar":"حفظ"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"button","ring":"brand","text":{"en":"Change dates","ar":"غيّر التواريخ"}},{"kind":"group","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"meta","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Choose your dates","ar":"اختر التواريخ"}},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Mon 5 · Tue 6 · Wed 7 · Thu 8","ar":"الاثنين 5 · الثلاثاء 6 · الأربعاء 7 · الخميس 8"},"gap":"xs"}]},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"(nothing more)","ar":"(ولا شيء بعدها)"},"gap":"s"}],"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}},{"id":"help","text":{"en":"Add a tip: \"After tapping, swipe to find the calendar\"","ar":"أضف ملاحظة: «بعد الضغط، اسحب لتجد التقويم»"},"mock":{"reader":{"en":"Change dates, button.","ar":"غيّر التواريخ، زر."},"app":{"id":"zad","name":{"en":"Zad Travel","ar":"زاد للسفر"},"color":"#6D28D9","icon":"airplane-tilt","domain":"zad.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Hotel","ar":"الفندق"},"back":true,"actions":[{"icon":"heart","aria":{"en":"Save","ar":"حفظ"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"button","ring":"brand","text":{"en":"Change dates","ar":"غيّر التواريخ"}},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"After tapping, swipe to find the calendar","ar":"بعد الضغط، اسحب لتجد التقويم"},"color":"muted","gap":"xs"},{"kind":"group","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"meta","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Choose your dates","ar":"اختر التواريخ"}},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Mon 5 · Tue 6 · Wed 7 · Thu 8","ar":"الاثنين 5 · الثلاثاء 6 · الأربعاء 7 · الخميس 8"},"gap":"xs"}]},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"(nothing more)","ar":"(ولا شيء بعدها)"},"gap":"s"}],"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}},{"id":"move","text":{"en":"Move focus to \"Choose your dates\" at the top of the panel","ar":"انقل التركيز إلى «اختر التواريخ» في أعلى اللوحة"},"mock":{"reader":{"en":"Choose your dates, heading.","ar":"اختر التواريخ، عنوان."},"app":{"id":"zad","name":{"en":"Zad Travel","ar":"زاد للسفر"},"color":"#6D28D9","icon":"airplane-tilt","domain":"zad.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Hotel","ar":"الفندق"},"back":true,"actions":[{"icon":"heart","aria":{"en":"Save","ar":"حفظ"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Change dates","ar":"غيّر التواريخ"}},{"kind":"group","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"meta","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Choose your dates","ar":"اختر التواريخ"}},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Mon 5 · Tue 6 · Wed 7 · Thu 8","ar":"الاثنين 5 · الثلاثاء 6 · الأربعاء 7 · الخميس 8"},"gap":"xs"}],"ring":"brand"},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"(nothing more)","ar":"(ولا شيء بعدها)"},"gap":"s"}],"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}}],"answer":["move"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-043","when":["sound","help"],"feedback":{"en":"The guest still has to search for the panel. Focus should go there by itself.","ar":"ما زال على الضيف أن يبحث عن اللوحة. ويجب أن ينتقل التركيز إليها تلقائيًا."}}],"explain":{"en":"From Lesson 2: when something opens, move focus to the start of it.","ar":"من الدرس 2: حين يُفتح شيء، انقل التركيز إلى بدايته."},"speaker":"rami"}]}$uxg$::jsonb),
  ($uxg$P05-U05-L01$uxg$, $uxg$ed19b19dab9a26998af7a080ba9e4a436381972e5d40c5dfedd332fdb2ab4875$uxg$, $uxg${"id":"P05-U05-L01","mode":"lesson","minutes":7,"title":{"en":"Every gesture needs a button too","ar":"كل إيماءة تحتاج زرًا أيضًا"},"summary":{"en":"Give a shopping list app's swipe and drag actions a visible button, and make slips easy to undo.","ar":"أعطِ حركات السحب والجرّ في تطبيق قائمة مشتريات زرًا ظاهرًا، واجعل التراجع عن الخطأ سهلًا."},"speaker":"sara","review_labels":{"MC-P05-044":{"en":"Gestures are hidden; add a visible option","ar":"الإيماءات مخفية؛ أضف خيارًا ظاهرًا"},"MC-P05-045":{"en":"Dragging needs another way","ar":"الجرّ يحتاج طريقة أخرى"},"MC-P05-046":{"en":"Easy slips need a clear undo","ar":"الأخطاء التي تقع بسهولة تحتاج تراجعًا واضحًا"}},"steps":[{"id":"S01","type":"card","part":"hook","title":{"en":"\"How do I remove it?\"","ar":"«كيف أحذفه؟»"},"body":{"en":"I'm designing a shopping list app. To remove an item, you swipe it to the left. Nothing on the screen shows that.\n\nIn testing, Mrs. Samia, 70, looked for a way to remove \"Milk\" for two minutes. A blind tester never knew swiping was possible.","ar":"أصمّم تطبيقًا لقائمة المشتريات. ولحذف عنصر، تسحبه لليسار (Swipe). ولا شيء على الشاشة يوضّح ذلك.\n\nفي الاختبار، ظلّت السيدة سامية، 70 سنة، تبحث عن طريقة لحذف «حليب» دقيقتين. ومختبِر كفيف لم يعرف أبدًا أن السحب ممكن."},"mock":{"app":{"id":"qaima","name":{"en":"Qaima","ar":"قائمة"},"color":"#0D9488","icon":"list-checks","domain":"qaima.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"My list","ar":"قائمتي"},"actions":[{"icon":"share-network","aria":{"en":"Share","ar":"مشاركة"}}]},"fab":{"icon":"plus","text":{"en":"Add item","ar":"أضف عنصرًا"}},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"square","text":{"en":"Milk","ar":"حليب"},"sub":{"en":"1 litre","ar":"1 لتر"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"square","text":{"en":"Bread","ar":"خبز"},"sub":{"en":"5 loaves","ar":"5 أرغفة"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"square","text":{"en":"Eggs","ar":"بيض"},"sub":{"en":"12","ar":"12"}}]}},{"id":"S02","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P05-U05-01","part":"try","rules":["R12"],"value":{"en":"Try first. Contextual Swipe (NN/g): with no visible cues, people don't know where swipe works, and even those who know it may forget to use it.","ar":"جرّب أولًا. السحب لإظهار الإجراءات (NN/g): بدون علامات ظاهرة، لا يعرف الناس أين يعمل السحب، وحتى من يعرفه قد ينسى استخدامه."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/contextual-swipe/","quote":"And even those who have learned it may occasionally forget to perform it in the absence of any visible cues."},"prompt":{"en":"Tap each option to see the change. Which one lets everyone remove an item?","ar":"اضغط على كل خيار لترى التغيير. أي خيار يجعل الجميع يستطيعون حذف عنصر؟"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"app":{"id":"qaima","name":{"en":"Qaima","ar":"قائمة"},"color":"#0D9488","icon":"list-checks","domain":"qaima.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"My list","ar":"قائمتي"},"actions":[{"icon":"share-network","aria":{"en":"Share","ar":"مشاركة"}}]},"fab":{"icon":"plus","text":{"en":"Add item","ar":"أضف عنصرًا"}},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"square","text":{"en":"Milk","ar":"حليب"},"sub":{"en":"1 litre","ar":"1 لتر"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"square","text":{"en":"Bread","ar":"خبز"},"sub":{"en":"5 loaves","ar":"5 أرغفة"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"square","text":{"en":"Eggs","ar":"بيض"},"sub":{"en":"12","ar":"12"}}]},"options":[{"id":"tip","text":{"en":"Show a tip once: \"Swipe left to remove\"","ar":"اعرض ملاحظة مرة واحدة: «اسحب لليسار للحذف»"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"qaima","name":{"en":"Qaima","ar":"قائمة"},"color":"#0D9488","icon":"list-checks","domain":"qaima.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"My list","ar":"قائمتي"},"actions":[{"icon":"share-network","aria":{"en":"Share","ar":"مشاركة"}}]},"fab":{"icon":"plus","text":{"en":"Add item","ar":"أضف عنصرًا"}},"blocks":[{"kind":"banner","tone":"info","icon":"lightbulb","text":{"en":"Swipe left to remove an item","ar":"اسحب العنصر لليسار لحذفه"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"square","text":{"en":"Milk","ar":"حليب"},"sub":{"en":"1 litre","ar":"1 لتر"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"square","text":{"en":"Bread","ar":"خبز"},"sub":{"en":"5 loaves","ar":"5 أرغفة"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"square","text":{"en":"Eggs","ar":"بيض"},"sub":{"en":"12","ar":"12"}}]}},{"id":"button","text":{"en":"Add a 🗑 button to each item, and keep the swipe as a shortcut","ar":"أضف زر 🗑 لكل عنصر، وأبقِ السحب كطريق مختصر"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"qaima","name":{"en":"Qaima","ar":"قائمة"},"color":"#0D9488","icon":"list-checks","domain":"qaima.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"My list","ar":"قائمتي"},"actions":[{"icon":"share-network","aria":{"en":"Share","ar":"مشاركة"}}]},"fab":{"icon":"plus","text":{"en":"Add item","ar":"أضف عنصرًا"}},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"square","text":{"en":"Milk","ar":"حليب"},"sub":{"en":"1 litre","ar":"1 لتر"},"badge":{"text":{"en":"Remove","ar":"احذف"},"icon":"trash","tone":"bad"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"square","text":{"en":"Bread","ar":"خبز"},"sub":{"en":"5 loaves","ar":"5 أرغفة"},"badge":{"text":{"en":"Remove","ar":"احذف"},"icon":"trash","tone":"bad"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"square","text":{"en":"Eggs","ar":"بيض"},"sub":{"en":"12","ar":"12"},"badge":{"text":{"en":"Remove","ar":"احذف"},"icon":"trash","tone":"bad"}}]}},{"id":"short","text":{"en":"Make the swipe shorter, so it's easier to do","ar":"اجعل مسافة السحب أقصر، ليصبح أسهل"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"qaima","name":{"en":"Qaima","ar":"قائمة"},"color":"#0D9488","icon":"list-checks","domain":"qaima.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"My list","ar":"قائمتي"},"actions":[{"icon":"share-network","aria":{"en":"Share","ar":"مشاركة"}}]},"fab":{"icon":"plus","text":{"en":"Add item","ar":"أضف عنصرًا"}},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"square","text":{"en":"Milk","ar":"حليب"},"sub":{"en":"1 litre","ar":"1 لتر"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"square","text":{"en":"Bread","ar":"خبز"},"sub":{"en":"5 loaves","ar":"5 أرغفة"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"square","text":{"en":"Eggs","ar":"بيض"},"sub":{"en":"12","ar":"12"}}]}}],"answer":["button"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-044","when":["tip"],"feedback":{"en":"A tip shown once is easy to miss and forget. And a blind tester or someone with shaky hands still has to swipe.","ar":"الملاحظة التي تظهر مرة واحدة قد لا يلاحظها الناس، أو ينسونها. والمختبِر الكفيف أو من تهتزّ يداه ما زال مضطرًا للسحب."}},{"id":"MC-P05-044","when":["short"],"feedback":{"en":"Look at the screen: nothing changed. People who don't know about the swipe still can't find it.","ar":"انظر إلى الشاشة: لم يتغيّر شيء. ومن لا يعرف السحب ما زال لا يجده."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Which option puts something on the screen you can see and tap?","ar":"أي خيار يضع شيئًا على الشاشة تراه وتضغطه؟"},{"en":"Think of someone who can't swipe at all.","ar":"فكّر في شخص لا يستطيع السحب أبدًا."}],"correct":{"en":"Right. A visible button for everyone, a swipe for those who like it.","ar":"صحيح. زر ظاهر للجميع، والسحب لمن يحبّه."},"explain":{"en":"A gesture is invisible. Some people never find it, some forget it, and some can't do it. A button they can see works for all of them.","ar":"الإيماءة غير مرئية. بعض الناس لا يجدونها، وبعضهم ينساها، وبعضهم لا يقدر عليها. والزر الظاهر يناسبهم كلهم."}},{"id":"S03","type":"card","part":"concept","icons":["eye","tap","order","warn"],"title":{"en":"Gestures are shortcuts, not the only way","ar":"الإيماءات طرق مختصرة، لا الطريق الوحيد"},"body":{"en":"A swipe, a drag or a long press leaves nothing on the screen.\n\n- **Hidden:** some people never find a gesture, and others forget it.\n- **Hard:** shaky hands, one hand, or a screen reader can make gestures hard or impossible.\n- **Visible option:** add a button or a menu that does the same thing. Keep the gesture as a shortcut.\n- **Slips:** a swipe is easy to do by mistake. Ask first or show a clear Undo, and keep the item in view.","ar":"السحب (Swipe) أو الجرّ (Drag) أو الضغطة الطويلة (Long press) لا تترك شيئًا ظاهرًا على الشاشة.\n\n- **مخفية:** بعض الناس لا يجدون الإيماءة أبدًا، وبعضهم ينساها.\n- **صعبة:** اليد التي تهتزّ، أو استخدام يد واحدة، أو قارئ الشاشة، قد يجعل الإيماءات صعبة أو مستحيلة.\n- **خيار ظاهر:** أضف زرًا أو قائمة تفعل نفس الشيء. وأبقِ الإيماءة كطريق مختصر.\n- **الأخطاء:** السحب قد يحدث بالخطأ بسهولة. اسأل أولًا أو أظهر زر «تراجع» واضحًا، وأبقِ العنصر ظاهرًا."}},{"id":"S04","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P05-U05-01","part":"guided","rules":["R06"],"value":{"en":"Drag–and–Drop (NN/g): drag–and–drop is traditionally mouse or touch only, but making it accessible is both possible and necessary. On mobile, a menu to move things can be less error-prone.","ar":"السحب والإفلات (NN/g): الجرّ والإفلات عادة بالماوس أو اللمس فقط، لكن جعله متاحًا ممكن وضروري. وعلى الهاتف، القائمة لنقل الأشياء قد تكون أقل عرضة للخطأ."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/drag-drop/","quote":"Drag–and–drop is traditionally a mouse or touchscreen-only interaction, but making it accessible for people that use assistive technologies is both completely possible and necessary."},"scenario":{"en":"To change the order of the list, people drag an item by its ≡ handle. Mrs. Samia's hand shakes, and the item keeps landing in the wrong place.","ar":"لتغيير ترتيب القائمة، يجرّ الناس العنصر من مقبض ≡. ويد السيدة سامية تهتزّ، فيقع العنصر في المكان الخطأ كل مرة."},"prompt":{"en":"What should we add?","ar":"ماذا نضيف حتى تستطيع السيدة سامية ترتيب القائمة دون أن يقع العنصر في المكان الخطأ؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"qaima","name":{"en":"Qaima","ar":"قائمة"},"color":"#0D9488","icon":"list-checks","domain":"qaima.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"My list","ar":"قائمتي"},"actions":[{"icon":"share-network","aria":{"en":"Share","ar":"مشاركة"}}]},"fab":{"icon":"plus","text":{"en":"Add item","ar":"أضف عنصرًا"}},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"dots-six-vertical","text":{"en":"Milk","ar":"حليب"},"sub":{"en":"1 litre","ar":"1 لتر"},"value":"⋯"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"dots-six-vertical","text":{"en":"Bread","ar":"خبز"},"sub":{"en":"5 loaves","ar":"5 أرغفة"},"value":"⋯"}],"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"}},"options":[{"id":"menu","text":{"en":"\"Move up\" and \"Move down\" in each item's ⋯ menu","ar":"«انقل لأعلى» و«انقل لأسفل» في قائمة ⋯ لكل عنصر"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"qaima","name":{"en":"Qaima","ar":"قائمة"},"color":"#0D9488","icon":"list-checks","domain":"qaima.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"My list","ar":"قائمتي"},"actions":[{"icon":"share-network","aria":{"en":"Share","ar":"مشاركة"}}]},"fab":{"icon":"plus","text":{"en":"Add item","ar":"أضف عنصرًا"}},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"dots-six-vertical","text":{"en":"Milk","ar":"حليب"},"sub":{"en":"1 litre","ar":"1 لتر"},"value":"⋯"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"dots-six-vertical","text":{"en":"Bread","ar":"خبز"},"sub":{"en":"5 loaves","ar":"5 أرغفة"},"value":"⋯"}],"overlay":{"type":"menu","blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","text":{"en":"Move up","ar":"انقل لأعلى"},"icon":"arrow-up"},{"kind":"listitem","text":{"en":"Move down","ar":"انقل لأسفل"},"icon":"arrow-down"},{"kind":"listitem","text":{"en":"Delete","ar":"احذف"},"icon":"trash"}]},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}},{"id":"big","text":{"en":"A bigger ≡ handle that's easier to grab","ar":"مقبض ≡ أكبر يسهل الإمساك به"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"qaima","name":{"en":"Qaima","ar":"قائمة"},"color":"#0D9488","icon":"list-checks","domain":"qaima.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"My list","ar":"قائمتي"},"actions":[{"icon":"share-network","aria":{"en":"Share","ar":"مشاركة"}}]},"fab":{"icon":"plus","text":{"en":"Add item","ar":"أضف عنصرًا"}},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"list","text":{"en":"Milk","ar":"حليب"},"sub":{"en":"1 litre","ar":"1 لتر"},"value":"⋯","note":{"en":"Bigger ≡ handle","ar":"مقبض ≡ أكبر"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"list","text":{"en":"Bread","ar":"خبز"},"sub":{"en":"5 loaves","ar":"5 أرغفة"},"value":"⋯"}],"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}},{"id":"slow","text":{"en":"Slower dragging, so the item moves less","ar":"جرّ أبطأ، ليتحرّك العنصر مسافة أقل"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"qaima","name":{"en":"Qaima","ar":"قائمة"},"color":"#0D9488","icon":"list-checks","domain":"qaima.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"My list","ar":"قائمتي"},"actions":[{"icon":"share-network","aria":{"en":"Share","ar":"مشاركة"}}]},"fab":{"icon":"plus","text":{"en":"Add item","ar":"أضف عنصرًا"}},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"dots-six-vertical","text":{"en":"Milk","ar":"حليب"},"sub":{"en":"1 litre","ar":"1 لتر"},"value":"⋯","note":{"en":"Drags more slowly","ar":"يُجرّ ببطء أكثر"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"dots-six-vertical","text":{"en":"Bread","ar":"خبز"},"sub":{"en":"5 loaves","ar":"5 أرغفة"},"value":"⋯"}],"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}}],"answer":["menu"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-045","when":["big","slow"],"feedback":{"en":"Both still need her to hold and drag with a steady hand. She needs a way that works with single taps.","ar":"الاثنان ما زالا يحتاجان أن تمسك وتجرّ بيد ثابتة. وهي تحتاج طريقة تعمل بضغطات منفصلة."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Which option works without dragging at all?","ar":"أي خيار يعمل بدون جرّ أبدًا؟"},{"en":"One tap at a time is easier than holding and moving.","ar":"ضغطة واحدة كل مرة أسهل من الإمساك والتحريك."}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Taps work where dragging doesn't.","ar":"صحيح. الضغطات تنجح حيث لا ينجح الجرّ."},"explain":{"en":"Keep dragging for those who like it, and give a tap-based way for everyone else.","ar":"أبقِ الجرّ لمن يحبّه، وأعطِ الباقين طريقة تعمل بالضغط."},"speaker":"sara"},{"id":"S05","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P05-U05-02","part":"guided","rules":["R06"],"value":{"en":"Contextual Swipe (NN/g): a swipe is easy to do, and people sometimes delete things by accident. Always ask for confirmation or give an easy undo.","ar":"السحب لإظهار الإجراءات (NN/g): السحب سهل، والناس أحيانًا يحذفون أشياء بالخطأ. اسأل دائمًا للتأكيد أو أعطِ تراجعًا سهلًا."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/contextual-swipe/","quote":"To prevent such accidents, it’s important to always ask for confirmation or provide an easy way to undo the swipe."},"scenario":{"en":"A full swipe deletes an item right away. One tester was scrolling with her thumb and deleted \"Eggs\" without noticing.","ar":"السحب الكامل يحذف العنصر فورًا. وكانت إحدى المختبِرات تمرّر بإبهامها فحذفت «بيض» دون أن تنتبه."},"prompt":{"en":"What should happen after a swipe deletes an item?","ar":"ماذا يجب أن يحدث بعد أن يحذف السحب عنصرًا؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"qaima","name":{"en":"Qaima","ar":"قائمة"},"color":"#0D9488","icon":"list-checks","domain":"qaima.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"My list","ar":"قائمتي"},"actions":[{"icon":"share-network","aria":{"en":"Share","ar":"مشاركة"}}]},"fab":{"icon":"plus","text":{"en":"Add item","ar":"أضف عنصرًا"}},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"square","text":{"en":"Milk","ar":"حليب"},"sub":{"en":"1 litre","ar":"1 لتر"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"square","text":{"en":"Bread","ar":"خبز"},"sub":{"en":"5 loaves","ar":"5 أرغفة"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"square","text":{"en":"Eggs","ar":"بيض"},"sub":{"en":"12","ar":"12"},"swipe":{"text":{"en":"Delete","ar":"حذف"},"tone":"bad"}}],"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"}},"options":[{"id":"sound","text":{"en":"Play a short sound","ar":"شغّل صوتًا قصيرًا"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"qaima","name":{"en":"Qaima","ar":"قائمة"},"color":"#0D9488","icon":"list-checks","domain":"qaima.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"My list","ar":"قائمتي"},"actions":[{"icon":"share-network","aria":{"en":"Share","ar":"مشاركة"}}]},"fab":{"icon":"plus","text":{"en":"Add item","ar":"أضف عنصرًا"}},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"square","text":{"en":"Milk","ar":"حليب"},"sub":{"en":"1 litre","ar":"1 لتر"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"square","text":{"en":"Bread","ar":"خبز"},"sub":{"en":"5 loaves","ar":"5 أرغفة"}}],"overlay":{"type":"toast","blocks":[{"kind":"icon","icon":"speaker-high","size":"s"},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"(a sound plays)","ar":"(يُسمع صوت)"}}]},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}},{"id":"trash","text":{"en":"Move it to a \"Deleted items\" page in Settings","ar":"انقله إلى صفحة «العناصر المحذوفة» في الإعدادات"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"qaima","name":{"en":"Qaima","ar":"قائمة"},"color":"#0D9488","icon":"list-checks","domain":"qaima.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"My list","ar":"قائمتي"},"actions":[{"icon":"share-network","aria":{"en":"Share","ar":"مشاركة"}}]},"fab":{"icon":"plus","text":{"en":"Add item","ar":"أضف عنصرًا"}},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"square","text":{"en":"Milk","ar":"حليب"},"sub":{"en":"1 litre","ar":"1 لتر"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"square","text":{"en":"Bread","ar":"خبز"},"sub":{"en":"5 loaves","ar":"5 أرغفة"}}],"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}},{"id":"undo","text":{"en":"Show \"Eggs removed · Undo\" in a clear bar at the bottom","ar":"اعرض «تم حذف بيض · تراجع» في شريط واضح في الأسفل"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"qaima","name":{"en":"Qaima","ar":"قائمة"},"color":"#0D9488","icon":"list-checks","domain":"qaima.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"My list","ar":"قائمتي"},"actions":[{"icon":"share-network","aria":{"en":"Share","ar":"مشاركة"}}]},"fab":{"icon":"plus","text":{"en":"Add item","ar":"أضف عنصرًا"}},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"square","text":{"en":"Milk","ar":"حليب"},"sub":{"en":"1 litre","ar":"1 لتر"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"square","text":{"en":"Bread","ar":"خبز"},"sub":{"en":"5 loaves","ar":"5 أرغفة"}}],"overlay":{"type":"toast","blocks":[{"kind":"row","blocks":[{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"Eggs removed","ar":"تم حذف بيض"}},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Undo","ar":"تراجع"},"style":"plain"}]}]},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}}],"answer":["undo"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-046","when":["sound"],"feedback":{"en":"A sound says something happened, but not what, and gives no way back.","ar":"الصوت يقول إن شيئًا حدث، لكن لا يقول ماذا، ولا يعطي طريقًا للرجوع."}},{"id":"MC-P05-046","when":["trash"],"feedback":{"en":"She didn't notice she deleted it, so she won't go looking in Settings. The undo must be right in front of her.","ar":"هي لم تنتبه أنها حذفته، فلن تبحث عنه في الإعدادات. ويجب أن يكون التراجع أمامها مباشرة."}}],"hints":[{"en":"She didn't notice the delete. What would tell her, and fix it?","ar":"هي لم تنتبه للحذف. ما الذي يخبرها ويُصلحه؟"},{"en":"Which option names the item and offers a way back?","ar":"أي خيار يذكر العنصر ويعطي طريقًا للرجوع؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Say what happened, and offer Undo right there.","ar":"صحيح. قل ماذا حدث، وأعطِ «تراجع» في نفس المكان."},"explain":{"en":"Easy gestures cause easy slips. A clear Undo fixes a slip in one tap.","ar":"الإيماءة السهلة يسهل أيضًا أن تحدث بالخطأ. وزر «تراجع» الواضح يُصلح الخطأ بضغطة واحدة."},"speaker":"sara"},{"id":"S06","type":"compare","skill":"SK-P05-U05-02","part":"contrast","confidence":true,"rules":["R11"],"value":{"en":"Contrast: two swipe designs. Contextual Swipe (NN/g): keep content visible, and make sure people know which item they're deleting.","ar":"مقارنة: تصميمان للسحب. السحب لإظهار الإجراءات (NN/g): أبقِ المحتوى ظاهرًا، وتأكّد أن الناس يعرفون أي عنصر يحذفون."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/contextual-swipe/","quote":"Maximize content visibility and make sure that users know the item that they are deleting or acting upon."},"scenario":{"en":"Swiping an item a little shows a Delete button. Here are two ways it can look.","ar":"سحب العنصر قليلًا يُظهر زر حذف. وهذان شكلان ممكنان له."},"prompt":{"en":"Which design is safer?","ar":"أي تصميم يساعد الناس ألّا يحذفوا العنصر الخطأ؟"},"a":{"label":{"en":"A: The item slides far, and its name is cut off.","ar":"A: العنصر ينزلق بعيدًا، ويُقطع اسمه."},"mock":{"app":{"id":"qaima","name":{"en":"Qaima","ar":"قائمة"},"color":"#0D9488","icon":"list-checks","domain":"qaima.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"My list","ar":"قائمتي"},"actions":[{"icon":"share-network","aria":{"en":"Share","ar":"مشاركة"}}]},"fab":{"icon":"plus","text":{"en":"Add item","ar":"أضف عنصرًا"}},"blocks":[{"kind":"row","blocks":[{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"…ilk","ar":"…يب"}},{"kind":"button","style":"danger","text":{"en":"Delete","ar":"حذف"}}]},{"kind":"divider","gap":"xs"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"square","text":{"en":"Bread","ar":"خبز"},"sub":{"en":"5 loaves","ar":"5 أرغفة"}}]}},"b":{"label":{"en":"B: The item's name stays in view next to Delete.","ar":"B: اسم العنصر يبقى ظاهرًا بجانب زر الحذف."},"mock":{"app":{"id":"qaima","name":{"en":"Qaima","ar":"قائمة"},"color":"#0D9488","icon":"list-checks","domain":"qaima.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"My list","ar":"قائمتي"},"actions":[{"icon":"share-network","aria":{"en":"Share","ar":"مشاركة"}}]},"fab":{"icon":"plus","text":{"en":"Add item","ar":"أضف عنصرًا"}},"blocks":[{"kind":"row","blocks":[{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Milk","ar":"حليب"}},{"kind":"button","style":"danger","text":{"en":"Delete","ar":"حذف"}}]},{"kind":"divider","gap":"xs"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"square","text":{"en":"Bread","ar":"خبز"},"sub":{"en":"5 loaves","ar":"5 أرغفة"}}]}},"answer":"b","reason":{"prompt":{"en":"Why is B safer?","ar":"لماذا B أكثر أمانًا؟"},"options":[{"id":"check","text":{"en":"People can check it's the right item before they delete","ar":"يستطيع الناس التأكّد أنه العنصر الصحيح قبل الحذف"}},{"id":"neat","text":{"en":"B looks neater","ar":"B يبدو أكثر ترتيبًا"}},{"id":"big","text":{"en":"B's Delete button is bigger","ar":"زر الحذف في B أكبر"}}],"answer":["check"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-046","when":["neat","big"],"feedback":{"en":"The button is the same. The difference is the name: in B, people see what they're about to delete.","ar":"الزر نفسه. والفرق في الاسم: في B يرى الناس ما سيحذفونه."}}]},"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-046","when":["a"],"feedback":{"en":"In A, \"…ilk\" could be Milk or something else. People delete without being sure, and slips go unnoticed.","ar":"في A، «…يب» قد يكون «حليب» أو شيئًا آخر. فيحذف الناس دون تأكّد، ولا ينتبهون للخطأ."}}],"hints":[{"en":"In each one, can you tell which item you're deleting?","ar":"في كل واحد، هل تعرف أي عنصر تحذف؟"},{"en":"Look at the name next to the button.","ar":"انظر إلى الاسم بجانب الزر."}],"correct":{"en":"Right. People should see what they're deleting.","ar":"صحيح. يجب أن يرى الناس ما يحذفونه."},"explain":{"en":"Keep the item visible while people act on it. Fewer slips, and the ones that happen get noticed.","ar":"أبقِ العنصر ظاهرًا أثناء التعامل معه. فتقلّ الأخطاء، وما يحدث منها يُلاحَظ."},"speaker":"sara"},{"id":"S07","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P05-U05-01","part":"independent","speaker":"youssef","rules":["R14"],"value":{"en":"New case. Contextual Swipe (NN/g): burying key actions behind a gesture keeps people from discovering them. A long press is just as hidden as a swipe.","ar":"حالة جديدة. السحب لإظهار الإجراءات (NN/g): إخفاء الإجراءات المهمة خلف إيماءة يمنع الناس من اكتشافها. والضغطة الطويلة مخفية مثل السحب تمامًا."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/contextual-swipe/","quote":"Burying key actions behind a contextual swipe prevents users from discovering them."},"scenario":{"en":"In my shop app, the only way to save a product to your wishlist is to press and hold its photo. Almost nobody uses the wishlist.","ar":"في تطبيق متجري، الطريقة الوحيدة لحفظ منتج في المفضّلة هي الضغط مطوّلًا على صورته. ولا أحد تقريبًا يستخدم المفضّلة."},"prompt":{"en":"What should I change?","ar":"ماذا يجب أن أغيّر؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Dar · Phones","ar":"دار · هواتف"},"back":true,"actions":[{"icon":"shopping-cart","aria":{"en":"Cart","ar":"السلة"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"earbuds"},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Wireless earbuds","ar":"سماعات لاسلكية"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"1,450 EGP","ar":"1,450 جنيه"},"gap":"xs"}],"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"}},"options":[{"id":"keep","text":{"en":"Nothing. Long press is common; people will learn it","ar":"لا شيء. الضغط المطوّل شائع؛ وسيتعلّمه الناس"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Dar · Phones","ar":"دار · هواتف"},"back":true,"actions":[{"icon":"shopping-cart","aria":{"en":"Cart","ar":"السلة"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"earbuds"},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Wireless earbuds","ar":"سماعات لاسلكية"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"1,450 EGP","ar":"1,450 جنيه"},"gap":"xs"}],"caption":{"en":"Unchanged","ar":"بدون تغيير"}}},{"id":"heart","text":{"en":"Add a visible ♡ button on each product","ar":"أضف زر ♡ ظاهرًا على كل منتج"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Dar · Phones","ar":"دار · هواتف"},"back":true,"actions":[{"icon":"shopping-cart","aria":{"en":"Cart","ar":"السلة"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"earbuds"},{"kind":"row","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Wireless earbuds","ar":"سماعات لاسلكية"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"iconbtn","text":"♡","aria":{"en":"Save","ar":"حفظ"}}]},{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"1,450 EGP","ar":"1,450 جنيه"},"gap":"xs"}],"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}},{"id":"help","text":{"en":"Explain the long press on the Help page","ar":"اشرح الضغط المطوّل في صفحة المساعدة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Dar · Phones","ar":"دار · هواتف"},"back":true,"actions":[{"icon":"shopping-cart","aria":{"en":"Cart","ar":"السلة"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"earbuds"},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Wireless earbuds","ar":"سماعات لاسلكية"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"1,450 EGP","ar":"1,450 جنيه"},"gap":"xs"}],"caption":{"en":"Unchanged","ar":"بدون تغيير"}}}],"answer":["heart"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-044","when":["keep","help"],"feedback":{"en":"People can't use what they can't see, and few read Help pages. Some can't press and hold at all.","ar":"الناس لا يستخدمون ما لا يرونه، وقليلون يقرؤون صفحات المساعدة. وبعضهم لا يستطيع الضغط المطوّل أصلًا."}}],"hints":[{"en":"How would a new customer know the wishlist exists?","ar":"كيف سيعرف عميل جديد أن هناك مفضّلة؟"},{"en":"Which option puts it on the screen?","ar":"أي خيار يضعها على الشاشة؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Right. A visible ♡ shows the feature and works with one tap.","ar":"صحيح. زر ♡ الظاهر يُظهر الميزة ويعمل بضغطة واحدة."},"explain":{"en":"Any action people need must be visible. Hidden gestures can stay as extra shortcuts.","ar":"أي إجراء يحتاجه الناس يجب أن يكون ظاهرًا. والإيماءات المخفية يمكن أن تبقى طرقًا مختصرة إضافية."}},{"id":"S08","type":"card","part":"recap","icons":["tap","order","warn","eye"],"title":{"en":"What you did","ar":"ماذا تعلّمت"},"body":{"en":"- **Visible option:** you added a 🗑 button next to the swipe.\n- **No drag needed:** you added Move up and Move down to the menu.\n- **Easy undo:** you showed \"Eggs removed · Undo\" after a swipe.\n- **See what you delete:** you kept the item's name in view.\n- **Not hidden:** you gave the wishlist a visible ♡.\n\nNext lesson: motion that doesn't make people sick.","ar":"- **خيار ظاهر:** أضفت زر 🗑 بجانب السحب.\n- **بدون جرّ:** أضفت «انقل لأعلى» و«انقل لأسفل» إلى القائمة.\n- **تراجع سهل:** أظهرت «تم حذف بيض · تراجع» بعد السحب.\n- **ترى ما تحذفه:** أبقيت اسم العنصر ظاهرًا.\n- **غير مخفي:** أعطيت المفضّلة زر ♡ ظاهرًا.\n\nالدرس التالي: حركة لا تُصيب الناس بالدوار."}}]}$uxg$::jsonb),
  ($uxg$P05-U05-L02$uxg$, $uxg$df557816a8d81b1dcd4f042cc652ae8c24c5c8e676cce20e61e92ed82ac5ea6c$uxg$, $uxg${"id":"P05-U05-L02","mode":"lesson","minutes":7,"title":{"en":"Motion that doesn't make people sick","ar":"حركة لا تُصيب الناس بالدوار"},"summary":{"en":"Calm a travel site's moving home page, respect \"Reduce motion\", and keep animations short.","ar":"هدّئ الصفحة الرئيسية المتحرّكة لموقع سفر، واحترم «تقليل الحركة»، واجعل الحركات قصيرة."},"speaker":"mona","review_labels":{"MC-P05-047":{"en":"Remove motion when \"Reduce motion\" is on","ar":"أزِل الحركة حين يكون «تقليل الحركة» مفعّلًا"},"MC-P05-048":{"en":"Flashing can cause seizures","ar":"الوميض قد يسبّب نوبات صرع"},"MC-P05-049":{"en":"Keep animations between 100 and 500 ms","ar":"اجعل الحركات بين 100 و500 ms"},"MC-P05-050":{"en":"Don't make people wait through animation","ar":"لا تجعل الناس ينتظرون انتهاء الحركة"}},"steps":[{"id":"S01","type":"card","part":"hook","title":{"en":"\"I feel dizzy\"","ar":"«أشعر بالدوار»"},"body":{"en":"My team made a new home page for a travel company. The background moves at a different speed as you scroll, cards fly in from the sides, and the menu takes a full second to slide open.\n\nA tester with an inner-ear problem felt dizzy after one minute and stopped.","ar":"صمّم فريقي صفحة رئيسية جديدة لشركة سفر. الخلفية تتحرّك بسرعة مختلفة وأنت تمرّر الصفحة، والبطاقات تطير من الجانبين، والقائمة تأخذ ثانية كاملة لتنفتح.\n\nومختبِرة عندها مشكلة في الأذن الداخلية شعرت بالدوار بعد دقيقة وتوقّفت."},"mock":{"app":{"id":"zad","name":{"en":"Zad Travel","ar":"زاد للسفر"},"color":"#6D28D9","icon":"airplane-tilt","domain":"zad.example"},"appbar":{"logo":true,"actions":[{"icon":"user","aria":{"en":"Account","ar":"الحساب"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"beach","text":{"en":"Summer by the sea","ar":"صيف على البحر"},"note":{"en":"Background moves as you scroll","ar":"الخلفية تتحرّك وأنت تمرّر"}},{"kind":"listitem","art":"beach","text":{"en":"Dahab · 3 nights","ar":"دهب · 3 ليالٍ"},"value":{"en":"4,200 EGP","ar":"4,200 جنيه"},"note":{"en":"Flies in from the right","ar":"تطير من اليمين"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"listitem","art":"desert","text":{"en":"Luxor · 2 nights","ar":"الأقصر · ليلتان"},"value":{"en":"3,600 EGP","ar":"3,600 جنيه"},"note":{"en":"Flies in from the left","ar":"تطير من اليسار"}}]}},{"id":"S02","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P05-U05-03","part":"try","rules":["R12"],"value":{"en":"Try first. Animation Duration (NN/g): parallax, moving carousels and scroll effects can make some people dizzy or sick. Respect people who turned on \"Reduce motion\" by removing animations.","ar":"جرّب أولًا. مدة الحركة (NN/g): حركة الخلفية والعروض المتحرّكة وتأثيرات التمرير قد تُصيب بعض الناس بالدوار أو الغثيان. احترم من شغّل «تقليل الحركة» بإزالة الحركات."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/animation-duration/","quote":"Restraint is important, and you should respect those users who have set their browser or device to “reduce motion” by removing animations."},"scenario":{"en":"The tester had turned on \"Reduce motion\" in her phone's settings. Our page ignored it.","ar":"كانت المختبِرة قد شغّلت «تقليل الحركة» في إعدادات هاتفها. وصفحتنا تجاهلته."},"prompt":{"en":"What should the page do when \"Reduce motion\" is on?","ar":"ماذا يجب أن تفعل الصفحة حين يكون «تقليل الحركة» مفعّلًا؟"},"mock":{"app":{"name":{"en":"Settings","ar":"الإعدادات"},"color":"#6B7280","icon":"gear","domain":"settings.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Accessibility","ar":"تسهيلات الاستخدام"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"text-aa","text":{"en":"Bold text","ar":"نص عريض"},"toggle":false},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"sparkle","text":{"en":"Reduce motion","ar":"تقليل الحركة"},"sub":{"en":"Less movement on screen","ar":"حركة أقل على الشاشة"},"toggle":true,"ring":"brand"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"magnifying-glass-plus","text":{"en":"Zoom","ar":"التكبير"},"toggle":false}],"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"}},"options":[{"id":"keep","text":{"en":"Keep the motion; it's part of our brand","ar":"تُبقي الحركة؛ فهي جزء من هويتنا"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"zad","name":{"en":"Zad Travel","ar":"زاد للسفر"},"color":"#6D28D9","icon":"airplane-tilt","domain":"zad.example"},"appbar":{"logo":true,"actions":[{"icon":"user","aria":{"en":"Account","ar":"الحساب"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","text":{"en":"Summer by the sea","ar":"صيف على البحر"},"art":"beach","note":{"en":"Background moves as you scroll","ar":"الخلفية تتحرّك وأنت تمرّر"}},{"kind":"listitem","text":{"en":"Dahab · 3 nights","ar":"دهب · 3 ليالٍ"},"art":"beach","value":{"en":"4,200 EGP","ar":"4,200 جنيه"},"gap":"s","note":{"en":"Flies in from the right","ar":"تطير من اليمين"}},{"kind":"listitem","text":{"en":"Luxor · 2 nights","ar":"الأقصر · ليلتان"},"art":"desert","value":{"en":"3,600 EGP","ar":"3,600 جنيه"}}],"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}},{"id":"slow","text":{"en":"Slow every animation down, so it feels gentler","ar":"تُبطئ كل الحركات، لتبدو ألطف"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"zad","name":{"en":"Zad Travel","ar":"زاد للسفر"},"color":"#6D28D9","icon":"airplane-tilt","domain":"zad.example"},"appbar":{"logo":true,"actions":[{"icon":"user","aria":{"en":"Account","ar":"الحساب"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","text":{"en":"Summer by the sea","ar":"صيف على البحر"},"art":"beach","note":{"en":"Background moves slowly as you scroll","ar":"الخلفية تتحرّك ببطء وأنت تمرّر"}},{"kind":"listitem","text":{"en":"Dahab · 3 nights","ar":"دهب · 3 ليالٍ"},"art":"beach","value":{"en":"4,200 EGP","ar":"4,200 جنيه"},"gap":"s","note":{"en":"Flies in slowly","ar":"تطير ببطء"}},{"kind":"listitem","text":{"en":"Luxor · 2 nights","ar":"الأقصر · ليلتان"},"art":"desert","value":{"en":"3,600 EGP","ar":"3,600 جنيه"}}],"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}},{"id":"still","text":{"en":"Turn off the moving background and fly-ins, and show content in place","ar":"توقف الخلفية المتحرّكة وطيران البطاقات، وتعرض المحتوى في مكانه"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"zad","name":{"en":"Zad Travel","ar":"زاد للسفر"},"color":"#6D28D9","icon":"airplane-tilt","domain":"zad.example"},"appbar":{"logo":true,"actions":[{"icon":"user","aria":{"en":"Account","ar":"الحساب"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","text":{"en":"Summer by the sea","ar":"صيف على البحر"},"art":"beach","note":{"en":"Still","ar":"ثابتة"}},{"kind":"listitem","text":{"en":"Dahab · 3 nights","ar":"دهب · 3 ليالٍ"},"art":"beach","value":{"en":"4,200 EGP","ar":"4,200 جنيه"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"listitem","text":{"en":"Luxor · 2 nights","ar":"الأقصر · ليلتان"},"art":"desert","value":{"en":"3,600 EGP","ar":"3,600 جنيه"}}],"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}}],"answer":["still"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-047","when":["keep"],"feedback":{"en":"She turned the setting on because motion makes her sick. A brand isn't worth losing the customer.","ar":"شغّلت الإعداد لأن الحركة تُصيبها بالدوار. والهوية لا تستحق أن نخسر العميلة."}},{"id":"MC-P05-047","when":["slow"],"feedback":{"en":"Slower is still moving, and now it lasts longer. \"Reduce motion\" means remove it.","ar":"الأبطأ ما زال يتحرّك، وصار يستمر وقتًا أطول. و«تقليل الحركة» يعني أن تُزيلها."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Why did she turn that setting on?","ar":"لماذا شغّلت هذا الإعداد؟"},{"en":"Which option has the least movement?","ar":"أي خيار فيه أقل حركة؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Right. The setting is a request: less motion.","ar":"صحيح. الإعداد طلب واضح: حركة أقل."},"explain":{"en":"Phones and browsers let people ask for less motion. Your design should listen and drop the big moving effects.","ar":"الهواتف والمتصفّحات تتيح للناس طلب حركة أقل. ويجب أن يستجيب تصميمك ويُسقط تأثيرات الحركة الكبيرة."},"speaker":"mona"},{"id":"S03","type":"card","part":"concept","icons":["warn","eye","clock","cut"],"title":{"en":"Motion with care","ar":"الحركة بحذر"},"body":{"en":"- **Some motion hurts:** a moving background, scroll effects and sliding carousels can make people dizzy or sick. Flashing can cause seizures.\n- **\"Reduce motion\":** phones and browsers have this setting. When it's on, remove the big moving effects.\n- **Short:** most animations take 100 to 500 ms (1,000 ms is one second). Small feedback, like a switch, about 100 ms. At 500 ms they start to feel slow.\n- **No waiting:** an animation people see every time must be quick, or not there at all.","ar":"- **بعض الحركة مؤذية:** الخلفية المتحرّكة وتأثيرات التمرير والـ Carousel المنزلق قد تُصيب الناس بالدوار أو الغثيان. والوميض قد يسبّب نوبات صرع.\n- **«تقليل الحركة» (Reduce motion):** إعداد موجود في الهواتف والمتصفّحات. حين يكون مفعّلًا، أزِل تأثيرات الحركة الكبيرة.\n- **قصيرة:** أغلب الحركات تستغرق من 100 إلى 500 جزء من الثانية (ms)، والثانية الواحدة = 1,000 ms. والاستجابة الصغيرة، مثل الـ Toggle، نحو 100 ms. وعند 500 ms تبدأ في أن تبدو بطيئة.\n- **بلا انتظار:** الحركة التي يراها الناس كل مرة يجب أن تكون سريعة، أو لا تكون أصلًا."}},{"id":"S04","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P05-U05-03","part":"guided","rules":["R06"],"value":{"en":"Animation Duration (NN/g): hard cuts between colours or flashing can trigger seizures in people with epilepsy. This is a risk for everyone, not only those who set \"Reduce motion\".","ar":"مدة الحركة (NN/g): التبديل الحاد بين الألوان أو الوميض قد يسبّب نوبات لمرضى الصرع. وهذا خطر على الجميع، لا على من شغّل «تقليل الحركة» فقط."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/animation-duration/","quote":"animations with hard cuts between colors or flashing can trigger seizures in epileptic users."},"scenario":{"en":"Marketing wants a \"Last seats!\" label that flashes red and white, three times a second, to grab attention.","ar":"التسويق يريد علامة «آخر المقاعد!» تومض بالأحمر والأبيض، ثلاث مرات في الثانية، لتجذب الانتباه."},"prompt":{"en":"What should I tell them?","ar":"ماذا أقول لفريق التسويق حتى تجذب العلامة الانتباه دون خطر على أحد؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"zad","name":{"en":"Zad Travel","ar":"زاد للسفر"},"color":"#6D28D9","icon":"airplane-tilt","domain":"zad.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Trips","ar":"الرحلات"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"card","art":"beach","blocks":[{"kind":"row","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Dahab · 3 nights","ar":"دهب · 3 ليالٍ"}},{"kind":"badge","tone":"bad","text":{"en":"Last seats!","ar":"آخر المقاعد!"},"note":{"en":"Flashes 3× a second","ar":"تومض 3 مرات في الثانية"}}]},{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"4,200 EGP","ar":"4,200 جنيه"},"gap":"xs"}]}],"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"}},"options":[{"id":"steady","text":{"en":"No flashing. Use a steady red label with clear words","ar":"بدون وميض. استخدموا علامة حمراء ثابتة بكلمات واضحة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"zad","name":{"en":"Zad Travel","ar":"زاد للسفر"},"color":"#6D28D9","icon":"airplane-tilt","domain":"zad.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Trips","ar":"الرحلات"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"card","art":"beach","blocks":[{"kind":"row","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Dahab · 3 nights","ar":"دهب · 3 ليالٍ"}},{"kind":"badge","tone":"bad","text":{"en":"Only 3 seats left","ar":"بقي 3 مقاعد فقط"}}]},{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"4,200 EGP","ar":"4,200 جنيه"},"gap":"xs"}]}],"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}},{"id":"setting","text":{"en":"Flash only when \"Reduce motion\" is off","ar":"تومض فقط حين يكون «تقليل الحركة» غير مفعّل"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"zad","name":{"en":"Zad Travel","ar":"زاد للسفر"},"color":"#6D28D9","icon":"airplane-tilt","domain":"zad.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Trips","ar":"الرحلات"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"card","art":"beach","blocks":[{"kind":"row","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Dahab · 3 nights","ar":"دهب · 3 ليالٍ"}},{"kind":"badge","tone":"bad","text":{"en":"Last seats!","ar":"آخر المقاعد!"},"note":{"en":"Flashes 3× a second unless Reduce motion is on","ar":"تومض 3 مرات في الثانية إلا إذا كان «تقليل الحركة» مفعّلًا"}}]},{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"4,200 EGP","ar":"4,200 جنيه"},"gap":"xs"}]}],"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}},{"id":"home","text":{"en":"Flash only on the home page","ar":"تومض في الصفحة الرئيسية فقط"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"zad","name":{"en":"Zad Travel","ar":"زاد للسفر"},"color":"#6D28D9","icon":"airplane-tilt","domain":"zad.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Trips","ar":"الرحلات"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"card","art":"beach","blocks":[{"kind":"row","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Dahab · 3 nights","ar":"دهب · 3 ليالٍ"}},{"kind":"badge","tone":"bad","text":{"en":"Last seats!","ar":"آخر المقاعد!"},"note":{"en":"Flashes on the home page; still here","ar":"تومض في الصفحة الرئيسية؛ ثابتة هنا"}}]},{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"4,200 EGP","ar":"4,200 جنيه"},"gap":"xs"}]}],"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}}],"answer":["steady"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-048","when":["setting","home"],"feedback":{"en":"Flashing can trigger a seizure in someone who never heard of that setting. It's not safe anywhere.","ar":"الوميض قد يسبّب نوبة لشخص لم يسمع عن هذا الإعداد أبدًا. وهو غير آمن في أي مكان."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Will everyone at risk have turned on a setting first?","ar":"هل كل من قد يتعرّض للخطر شغّل هذا الإعداد مسبقًا؟"},{"en":"Which option removes the danger for everyone?","ar":"أي خيار يُزيل الخطر عن الجميع؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Right. A steady label is safe and still easy to notice.","ar":"صحيح. العلامة الثابتة آمنة وما زالت سهلة الملاحظة."},"explain":{"en":"Some motion is a comfort issue; flashing is a safety issue. Don't use it at all.","ar":"بعض الحركة مسألة راحة؛ أما الوميض فمسألة أمان. فلا تستخدمه أبدًا."},"speaker":"mona"},{"id":"S05","type":"choose","skill":"SK-P05-U05-04","part":"guided","rules":["R06"],"value":{"en":"Animation Duration (NN/g): most animations should take 100–500 ms, depending on size and distance. Too fast is hard to see; too slow feels like a delay.","ar":"مدة الحركة (NN/g): أغلب الحركات يجب أن تأخذ من 100 إلى 500 جزء من الثانية، حسب حجمها ومسافتها. والسريعة جدًا صعب رؤيتها؛ والبطيئة جدًا تبدو كتأخير."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/animation-duration/","quote":"In general, the duration of most animations should be in the range of 100–500 ms, depending on complexity and on how far the element is traveling."},"scenario":{"en":"The menu slides in from the side. Right now it takes 1,000 ms, a full second, every time.","ar":"القائمة تنزلق من الجانب. وهي الآن تستغرق 1,000 ms، أي ثانية كاملة، كل مرة."},"prompt":{"en":"How long should it take?","ar":"كم يجب أن تستغرق حركة القائمة؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"zad","name":{"en":"Zad Travel","ar":"زاد للسفر"},"color":"#6D28D9","icon":"airplane-tilt","domain":"zad.example"},"appbar":{"logo":true,"actions":[{"icon":"list","aria":{"en":"Menu","ar":"القائمة"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"beach"}],"overlay":{"type":"side","title":{"en":"Menu","ar":"القائمة"},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"airplane-tilt","text":{"en":"Flights","ar":"الطيران"},"note":{"en":"Slides in over 1,000 ms","ar":"تنزلق خلال 1,000 ms"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"bed","text":{"en":"Hotels","ar":"الفنادق"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"suitcase","text":{"en":"My trips","ar":"رحلاتي"}}]}},"options":[{"id":"blink","text":{"en":"About 30 ms, so it's almost instant","ar":"نحو 30 ms، لتكون فورية تقريبًا"}},{"id":"right","text":{"en":"About 250 ms","ar":"نحو 250 ms"}},{"id":"keep","text":{"en":"Keep 1,000 ms; it looks smooth","ar":"تبقى 1,000 ms؛ فهي تبدو ناعمة"}}],"answer":["right"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-049","when":["blink"],"feedback":{"en":"That's too fast to see. The menu seems to jump in, and people lose track of where it came from.","ar":"هذا أسرع من أن يُرى. فالقائمة تبدو كأنها قفزت، ولا يعرف الناس من أين جاءت."}},{"id":"MC-P05-049","when":["keep"],"feedback":{"en":"A second feels like waiting, every time someone opens the menu. That's twice the slow end of the range.","ar":"الثانية تبدو انتظارًا، كل مرة يفتح فيها أحد القائمة. وهي ضعف الحد الأعلى للمدى المعتاد."}}],"hints":[{"en":"The usual range is 100 to 500 ms.","ar":"المدى المعتاد من 100 إلى 500 ms."},{"en":"Which option is inside that range?","ar":"أي خيار داخل هذا المدى؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Quick enough to feel instant, slow enough to see.","ar":"صحيح. سريعة بما يكفي لتبدو فورية، وبطيئة بما يكفي لتُرى."},"explain":{"en":"Look for the shortest time that doesn't feel jumpy. Animations are far more often too long than too short.","ar":"ابحث عن أقصر وقت لا يبدو كقفزة. فالحركات تكون في الغالب أطول من اللازم، ونادرًا ما تكون أقصر."},"speaker":"mona"},{"id":"S06","type":"compare","skill":"SK-P05-U05-04","part":"contrast","confidence":true,"rules":["R11"],"value":{"en":"Contrast: two switch animations. Animation Duration (NN/g): simple feedback like a checkbox or switch should take about 100 ms, which feels immediate.","ar":"مقارنة: حركتان لمفتاح تشغيل. مدة الحركة (NN/g): الاستجابة البسيطة مثل مربع الاختيار أو المفتاح يجب أن تأخذ نحو 100 ms، فتبدو فورية."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/animation-duration/","quote":"Simple feedback animations, such as showing a checkbox or toggle switch, should be roughly 100 ms (0.10 seconds) in total duration."},"scenario":{"en":"On the trip page, people turn on \"Price alerts\" with a switch. The designers made two versions.","ar":"في صفحة الرحلة، يشغّل الناس «تنبيهات السعر» بـ Toggle (مفتاح تشغيل). وصنع المصمّمون نسختين."},"prompt":{"en":"Which switch should we ship?","ar":"أي نسخة نعتمد حتى يشعر الناس أن المفتاح استجاب فورًا لضغطتهم؟"},"a":{"label":{"en":"A: The switch moves across in 100 ms.","ar":"A: المفتاح يتحرّك في 100 ms."},"mock":{"app":{"id":"zad","name":{"en":"Zad Travel","ar":"زاد للسفر"},"color":"#6D28D9","icon":"airplane-tilt","domain":"zad.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Dahab · 3 nights","ar":"دهب · 3 ليالٍ"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"beach"},{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"4,200 EGP","ar":"4,200 جنيه"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"bell","text":{"en":"Price alerts","ar":"تنبيهات السعر"},"toggle":true,"note":{"en":"100 ms","ar":"100 ms"},"gap":"s"}]}},"b":{"label":{"en":"B: The switch moves in 700 ms, with a bounce and a glow.","ar":"B: المفتاح يتحرّك في 700 ms، مع ارتداد ووهج."},"mock":{"app":{"id":"zad","name":{"en":"Zad Travel","ar":"زاد للسفر"},"color":"#6D28D9","icon":"airplane-tilt","domain":"zad.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Dahab · 3 nights","ar":"دهب · 3 ليالٍ"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"beach"},{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"4,200 EGP","ar":"4,200 جنيه"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"bell","text":{"en":"Price alerts","ar":"تنبيهات السعر"},"toggle":true,"note":{"en":"700 ms · bounce · glow","ar":"700 ms · ارتداد · وهج"},"gap":"s"}]}},"answer":"a","reason":{"prompt":{"en":"Why is A better?","ar":"لماذا A أفضل؟"},"options":[{"id":"instant","text":{"en":"Small feedback should feel instant, like moving a real switch","ar":"الاستجابة الصغيرة يجب أن تبدو فورية، مثل تحريك مفتاح حقيقي"}},{"id":"plain","text":{"en":"Plain designs are always better","ar":"التصميم البسيط أفضل دائمًا"}},{"id":"battery","text":{"en":"A uses less battery","ar":"A يستهلك بطارية أقل"}}],"answer":["instant"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-049","when":["plain","battery"],"feedback":{"en":"The point is time. At 100 ms, the switch feels like it moves under your finger. At 700 ms, you wait.","ar":"المهم هو الوقت. عند 100 ms، يبدو المفتاح كأنه يتحرّك تحت إصبعك. وعند 700 ms، أنت تنتظر."}}]},"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-049","when":["b"],"feedback":{"en":"700 ms is far past the slow end for a small switch. It feels like a delay, and the bounce adds motion nobody needs.","ar":"700 ms أبطأ بكثير من الحد المناسب لمفتاح صغير. فتبدو كتأخير، والارتداد يضيف حركة لا يحتاجها أحد."}}],"hints":[{"en":"A switch is small feedback. How long should that take?","ar":"المفتاح استجابة صغيرة. كم يجب أن تأخذ؟"},{"en":"About 100 ms feels instant.","ar":"نحو 100 ms تبدو فورية."}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Small feedback, small time.","ar":"صحيح. استجابة صغيرة، ووقت قصير."},"explain":{"en":"The bigger the change on screen, the more time it may need. A switch is tiny, so about 100 ms.","ar":"كلما كان التغيير على الشاشة أكبر، قد يحتاج وقتًا أطول. والمفتاح صغير جدًا، فنحو 100 ms."},"speaker":"mona"},{"id":"S07","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P05-U05-04","part":"independent","speaker":"rami","rules":["R14"],"value":{"en":"New case. Animation for Attention (NN/g): forcing people to sit through an animation every time they open something they use often is worse than any first-time charm.","ar":"حالة جديدة. الحركة لجذب الانتباه (NN/g): إجبار الناس على انتظار حركة كل مرة يفتحون شيئًا يستخدمونه كثيرًا أسوأ من أي جمال في أول مرة."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/animation-usability/","quote":"forcing users to sit through an animation each time the main menu needs to be accessed is even worse."},"scenario":{"en":"In my food delivery app, every time you open the cart, a scooter drives across the screen for 2 seconds. Then the cart appears.","ar":"في تطبيق توصيل الطعام الذي أصمّمه، كل مرة تفتح فيها السلة، يمرّ سكوتر عبر الشاشة لمدة ثانيتين. ثم تظهر السلة."},"prompt":{"en":"What should I do with the scooter?","ar":"ماذا أفعل بحركة السكوتر حتى لا تُبطئ من يفتح السلة كل يوم؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"lamma","name":{"en":"Lamma","ar":"لمّة"},"color":"#E03131","icon":"bowl-food","domain":"lamma.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Your cart","ar":"سلّتك"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"icon","icon":"moped","size":"l","color":"brand","note":{"en":"Drives across for 2,000 ms before the cart shows","ar":"يعبر الشاشة لمدة 2,000 ms قبل أن تظهر السلة"}},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Your cart is coming…","ar":"سلّتك في الطريق…"},"gap":"m"}],"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"}},"options":[{"id":"keep","text":{"en":"Keep it. People love fun details","ar":"أبقِه. الناس يحبّون التفاصيل الممتعة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"lamma","name":{"en":"Lamma","ar":"لمّة"},"color":"#E03131","icon":"bowl-food","domain":"lamma.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Your cart","ar":"سلّتك"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"icon","icon":"moped","size":"l","color":"brand","note":{"en":"Drives across for 2,000 ms before the cart shows","ar":"يعبر الشاشة لمدة 2,000 ms قبل أن تظهر السلة"}},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Your cart is coming…","ar":"سلّتك في الطريق…"},"gap":"m"}],"caption":{"en":"Unchanged","ar":"بدون تغيير"}}},{"id":"cut","text":{"en":"Remove it, or make it a quick touch while the cart shows at once","ar":"أزِله، أو اجعله لمسة سريعة بينما تظهر السلة فورًا"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"lamma","name":{"en":"Lamma","ar":"لمّة"},"color":"#E03131","icon":"bowl-food","domain":"lamma.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Your cart","ar":"سلّتك"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","text":{"en":"Koshary El Tahrir","ar":"كشري التحرير"},"art":"food-koshary","value":{"en":"185 EGP","ar":"185 جنيه"}},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"The cart shows at once; the scooter is a 200 ms touch","ar":"السلة تظهر فورًا؛ والدرّاجة لمسة سريعة 200 ms"},"color":"muted","gap":"s"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Checkout","ar":"ادفع"}}],"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}},{"id":"skip","text":{"en":"Add a \"Skip\" button on the animation","ar":"أضف زر «تخطَّ» على الحركة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"lamma","name":{"en":"Lamma","ar":"لمّة"},"color":"#E03131","icon":"bowl-food","domain":"lamma.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Your cart","ar":"سلّتك"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"icon","icon":"moped","size":"l","color":"brand","note":{"en":"Drives across for 2,000 ms before the cart shows","ar":"يعبر الشاشة لمدة 2,000 ms قبل أن تظهر السلة"}},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Your cart is coming…","ar":"سلّتك في الطريق…"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Skip","ar":"تخطَّ"},"style":"plain","gap":"s"}],"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}}],"answer":["cut"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-050","when":["keep"],"feedback":{"en":"It's fun the first time. By the tenth time, it's 2 seconds of waiting before every order.","ar":"ممتع أول مرة. لكن في المرة العاشرة، يصبح انتظارًا لثانيتين قبل كل طلب."}},{"id":"MC-P05-050","when":["skip"],"feedback":{"en":"Now people must tap to stop something they never wanted. The cart should just open.","ar":"الآن على الناس أن يضغطوا ليوقفوا شيئًا لم يريدوه أصلًا. ويجب أن تنفتح السلة مباشرة."}}],"hints":[{"en":"How often do people open the cart?","ar":"كم مرة يفتح الناس السلة؟"},{"en":"Which option lets the cart show without waiting?","ar":"أي خيار يُظهر السلة بدون انتظار؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Screens people open often must open fast.","ar":"صحيح. الشاشات التي يفتحها الناس كثيرًا يجب أن تنفتح بسرعة."},"explain":{"en":"Delight wears off; waiting doesn't. Never put an animation between people and what they came for.","ar":"المتعة تزول؛ أما الانتظار فلا. لا تضع حركة بين الناس وما جاؤوا من أجله."}},{"id":"S08","type":"card","part":"recap","icons":["eye","warn","clock","cut"],"title":{"en":"What you did","ar":"ماذا تعلّمت"},"body":{"en":"- **Reduce motion:** you turned off the moving background and fly-ins for people who asked.\n- **No flashing:** you swapped a flashing label for a steady one.\n- **Short:** you cut the menu from 1,000 ms to about 250 ms, and kept the switch at 100 ms.\n- **No waiting:** you took the scooter out of the cart's way.\n\nNext lesson: give people time to read.","ar":"- **تقليل الحركة:** أوقفت الخلفية المتحرّكة وطيران البطاقات لمن طلب ذلك.\n- **بلا وميض:** استبدلت العلامة الوامضة بعلامة ثابتة.\n- **قصيرة:** قلّلت وقت حركة القائمة من 1,000 ms إلى نحو 250 ms، وأبقيت المفتاح عند 100 ms.\n- **بلا انتظار:** أبعدت السكوتر عن طريق السلة.\n\nالدرس التالي: أعطِ الناس وقتًا ليقرؤوا."}}]}$uxg$::jsonb),
  ($uxg$P05-U05-L03$uxg$, $uxg$013cf47b1a686acb7c211ad254dff5ba4eed2307ebbbe4f2e0e9e17afbea1d72$uxg$, $uxg${"id":"P05-U05-L03","mode":"lesson","minutes":7,"title":{"en":"Give people time to read","ar":"أعطِ الناس وقتًا ليقرؤوا"},"summary":{"en":"Stop a pharmacy's banner from moving on its own, and keep important messages on screen.","ar":"أوقف الحركة التلقائية لبانر (Banner) في موقع صيدلية، وأبقِ الرسائل المهمة على الشاشة."},"speaker":"tarek","review_labels":{"MC-P05-051":{"en":"Content shouldn't move on its own","ar":"لا ينبغي أن يتحرّك المحتوى وحده"},"MC-P05-052":{"en":"Important messages must stay","ar":"الرسائل المهمة يجب أن تبقى"},"MC-P05-044":{"en":"Gestures are hidden; add a visible option","ar":"الإيماءات مخفية؛ أضف خيارًا ظاهرًا"}},"steps":[{"id":"S01","type":"card","part":"hook","title":{"en":"The button that keeps running away","ar":"الزر الذي يهرب دائمًا"},"body":{"en":"I manage the product for an online pharmacy. Our home page has a big banner that changes every 4 seconds: free delivery, a vitamins offer, then \"Upload your prescription\".\n\nOlder customers keep calling to ask how to send a prescription. Some saw the button, but it slid away before they could tap it.","ar":"أنا مدير المنتج (Product manager) لصيدلية أونلاين. في صفحتنا الرئيسية بانر (Banner) كبير يتغيّر كل 4 ثوانٍ: توصيل مجاني، ثم عرض فيتامينات، ثم «ارفع الوصفة الطبية».\n\nوالعملاء الأكبر سنًا يتصلون باستمرار ليسألوا كيف يرسلون الوصفة الطبية. بعضهم رأى الزر، لكنه انزلق بعيدًا قبل أن يضغطوه."},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dawaa","name":{"en":"Dawaa Pharmacy","ar":"صيدلية دواء"},"color":"#059669","icon":"pill","domain":"dawaa.example"},"appbar":{"logo":true,"actions":[{"icon":"shopping-cart","aria":{"en":"Cart","ar":"السلة"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"medicine","text":{"en":"Upload your prescription  ›","ar":"ارفع الوصفة الطبية  ›"}},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"● ○ ○   Next slide in 4 s…","ar":"● ○ ○   الشريحة التالية بعد 4 ث…"},"gap":"xs"}]}},{"id":"S02","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P05-U05-05","part":"try","rules":["R12"],"value":{"en":"Try first. Auto-Forwarding (NN/g): carousels should show a new panel only when people ask for it. Moving elements are hard for people with motor issues to click before they're gone.","ar":"جرّب أولًا. التقدّم التلقائي (NN/g): العروض المتحرّكة يجب أن تُظهر شريحة جديدة فقط حين يطلبها الناس. والعناصر المتحرّكة صعب على من عنده مشكلة في الحركة أن يضغطها قبل أن تختفي."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/auto-forwarding/","quote":"Accordions and carousels should show a new panel only when users ask for it."},"prompt":{"en":"Tap each option to see the change. Which one lets customers read and tap at their own pace?","ar":"اضغط على كل خيار لترى التغيير. أي خيار يجعل العملاء يقرؤون ويضغطون على راحتهم؟"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"app":{"id":"dawaa","name":{"en":"Dawaa Pharmacy","ar":"صيدلية دواء"},"color":"#059669","icon":"pill","domain":"dawaa.example"},"appbar":{"logo":true,"actions":[{"icon":"shopping-cart","aria":{"en":"Cart","ar":"السلة"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"medicine","text":{"en":"Upload your prescription  ›","ar":"ارفع الوصفة الطبية  ›"}},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"● ○ ○   Next slide in 4 s…","ar":"● ○ ○   الشريحة التالية بعد 4 ث…"},"gap":"xs"}]},"options":[{"id":"still","text":{"en":"The banner moves only when people tap the arrows","ar":"الشريط يتحرّك فقط حين يضغط الناس الأسهم"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"dawaa","name":{"en":"Dawaa Pharmacy","ar":"صيدلية دواء"},"color":"#059669","icon":"pill","domain":"dawaa.example"},"appbar":{"logo":true,"actions":[{"icon":"shopping-cart","aria":{"en":"Cart","ar":"السلة"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"medicine","text":{"en":"Upload your prescription  ›","ar":"ارفع الوصفة الطبية  ›"}},{"kind":"row","gap":"xs","blocks":[{"kind":"button","style":"plain","text":"‹"},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"1 of 3 · stays until you tap","ar":"1 من 3 · تبقى حتى تضغط"}},{"kind":"button","style":"plain","text":"›"}]}]}},{"id":"slower","text":{"en":"Change slides every 8 seconds instead of 4","ar":"غيّر الشرائح كل 8 ثوانٍ بدل 4"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"dawaa","name":{"en":"Dawaa Pharmacy","ar":"صيدلية دواء"},"color":"#059669","icon":"pill","domain":"dawaa.example"},"appbar":{"logo":true,"actions":[{"icon":"shopping-cart","aria":{"en":"Cart","ar":"السلة"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"medicine","text":{"en":"Upload your prescription  ›","ar":"ارفع الوصفة الطبية  ›"}},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"● ○ ○   Next slide in 8 s…","ar":"● ○ ○   الشريحة التالية بعد 8 ث…"},"gap":"xs"}]}},{"id":"fade","text":{"en":"Fade between slides instead of sliding","ar":"اجعل الشرائح تتلاشى بدل أن تنزلق"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"dawaa","name":{"en":"Dawaa Pharmacy","ar":"صيدلية دواء"},"color":"#059669","icon":"pill","domain":"dawaa.example"},"appbar":{"logo":true,"actions":[{"icon":"shopping-cart","aria":{"en":"Cart","ar":"السلة"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"medicine","text":{"en":"Upload your prescription  ›","ar":"ارفع الوصفة الطبية  ›"}},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"● ○ ○   Fades out in 4 s…","ar":"● ○ ○   تتلاشى بعد 4 ث…"},"gap":"xs"}]}}],"answer":["still"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-051","when":["slower","fade"],"feedback":{"en":"The banner still changes on its own. A slow reader or a shaky hand can still lose the button mid-tap.","ar":"الشريط ما زال يتغيّر وحده. والقارئ البطيء أو اليد التي تهتزّ ما زالت قد تفقد الزر أثناء الضغط."}}],"hints":[{"en":"In which option does the banner wait for the customer?","ar":"في أي خيار ينتظر الشريط العميل؟"},{"en":"Who decides when the slide changes?","ar":"من يقرّر متى تتغيّر الشريحة؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Right. The customer controls the pace.","ar":"صحيح. العميل يتحكّم في السرعة."},"explain":{"en":"Slow readers, people reading in a second language, and people with shaky hands all need content that stays still until they move on.","ar":"القارئ البطيء، ومن يقرأ بلغة غير لغته، ومن تهتزّ يداه، كلهم يحتاجون محتوى يبقى ثابتًا حتى ينتقلوا بأنفسهم."}},{"id":"S03","type":"card","part":"concept","icons":["clock","warn","tap","ok"],"title":{"en":"Let people read at their own pace","ar":"دع الناس يقرؤون على راحتهم"},"body":{"en":"- **No moving on its own:** banners and carousels change only when people ask. Moving content is hard to read and hard to tap.\n- **Messages that stay:** errors and anything people must act on stay until people close them or fix the problem.\n- **Vanishing is fine for small news:** \"Saved\" or \"Added to favourites\" can fade, because nothing is lost if it's missed.\n- **Not only in a carousel:** anything important also gets a fixed place on the page.","ar":"- **لا حركة تلقائية:** البانرات والـ Carousel تتغيّر فقط حين يطلب الناس. والمحتوى المتحرّك صعب قراءته وصعب الضغط عليه.\n- **رسائل تبقى:** الأخطاء وكل ما يجب أن يتصرّف فيه الناس تبقى حتى يغلقوها أو يحلّوا المشكلة.\n- **الاختفاء مقبول للأخبار الصغيرة:** «تم الحفظ» أو «أُضيف إلى المفضّلة» يمكن أن تختفي، لأنه لا يضيع شيء إذا فاتت.\n- **ليس داخل الـ Carousel فقط:** كل شيء مهم يأخذ أيضًا مكانًا ثابتًا في الصفحة."}},{"id":"S04","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P05-U05-05","part":"guided","rules":["R06"],"value":{"en":"Indicators and Notifications (NN/g): a mobile user waited 5 minutes for content because she missed a small error message that faded away after 5 seconds.","ar":"المؤشرات والإشعارات (NN/g): مستخدمة على الهاتف انتظرت 5 دقائق لأنها لم تلاحظ رسالة خطأ صغيرة اختفت بعد 5 ثوانٍ."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/indicators-validations-notifications/","quote":"In fact, one of our mobile users spent 5 minutes waiting for some content to load only because she hadn’t notice the little error message presented at the bottom of the screen that quickly faded away after 5 seconds."},"scenario":{"en":"When a card payment fails, a small \"Payment failed\" message shows at the bottom for 3 seconds, then fades. Customers keep waiting for an order that never comes.","ar":"حين يفشل الدفع بالبطاقة، تظهر رسالة صغيرة «فشل الدفع» في الأسفل لمدة 3 ثوانٍ، ثم تختفي. والعملاء ينتظرون طلبًا لن يأتي."},"prompt":{"en":"How should we fix the message?","ar":"كيف نُصلح الرسالة حتى لا يظل العميل ينتظر طلبًا لن يأتي؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dawaa","name":{"en":"Dawaa Pharmacy","ar":"صيدلية دواء"},"color":"#059669","icon":"pill","domain":"dawaa.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Checkout","ar":"الدفع"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Processing your order…","ar":"جارٍ تنفيذ طلبك…"}},{"kind":"banner","text":{"en":"Payment failed · disappears in 3 s","ar":"فشل الدفع · تختفي بعد 3 ث"},"gap":"xl"}],"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"}},"options":[{"id":"longer","text":{"en":"Keep it on screen for 6 seconds","ar":"أبقِها على الشاشة 6 ثوانٍ"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dawaa","name":{"en":"Dawaa Pharmacy","ar":"صيدلية دواء"},"color":"#059669","icon":"pill","domain":"dawaa.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Checkout","ar":"الدفع"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Processing your order…","ar":"جارٍ تنفيذ طلبك…"}},{"kind":"banner","text":{"en":"Payment failed · disappears in 6 s","ar":"فشل الدفع · تختفي بعد 6 ث"},"gap":"xl"}],"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}},{"id":"red","text":{"en":"Make the small message red, so it gets noticed","ar":"اجعل الرسالة الصغيرة حمراء، لتُلاحَظ"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dawaa","name":{"en":"Dawaa Pharmacy","ar":"صيدلية دواء"},"color":"#059669","icon":"pill","domain":"dawaa.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Checkout","ar":"الدفع"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Processing your order…","ar":"جارٍ تنفيذ طلبك…"}},{"kind":"banner","text":{"en":"Payment failed · disappears in 3 s","ar":"فشل الدفع · تختفي بعد 3 ث"},"gap":"xl","tone":"bad","icon":"warning"}],"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}},{"id":"stay","text":{"en":"Show the error on the payment screen, with \"Try again\", until it's fixed","ar":"اعرض الخطأ في شاشة الدفع، مع «حاول مرة أخرى»، حتى يُحلّ"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dawaa","name":{"en":"Dawaa Pharmacy","ar":"صيدلية دواء"},"color":"#059669","icon":"pill","domain":"dawaa.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Checkout","ar":"الدفع"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Payment failed","ar":"فشل الدفع"}},{"kind":"banner","text":{"en":"Your card was declined. Nothing was charged.","ar":"رُفضت بطاقتك. لم يُخصم أي مبلغ."},"tone":"bad","icon":"warning","gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Try again","ar":"حاول مرة أخرى"},"gap":"m"}],"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}}],"answer":["stay"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-052","when":["longer","red"],"feedback":{"en":"It still vanishes on its own. Anyone who looks away for a moment misses it and keeps waiting.","ar":"ما زالت تختفي وحدها. ومن ينظر بعيدًا لحظة تفوته ويظل ينتظر."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Does the customer need to do something after this message?","ar":"هل يحتاج العميل أن يفعل شيئًا بعد هذه الرسالة؟"},{"en":"Which option doesn't depend on seeing it in time?","ar":"أي خيار لا يعتمد على رؤيتها في الوقت المناسب؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Right. An error stays until it's fixed.","ar":"صحيح. الخطأ يبقى حتى يُحلّ."},"explain":{"en":"If people must act on a message, it can't have a timer. Put it where they're looking, with the way to fix it.","ar":"إذا كان على الناس أن يتصرّفوا بسبب الرسالة، فلا ينبغي أن تختفي بعد وقت محدّد. ضعها حيث ينظرون، مع طريقة الحل."},"speaker":"tarek"},{"id":"S05","type":"choose","skill":"SK-P05-U05-01","part":"guided","rules":["R06"],"value":{"en":"Carousels on Mobile (NN/g): important items in a hero carousel should be reachable some other way, in case people ignore the carousel completely.","ar":"العروض المتحرّكة على الهاتف (NN/g): العناصر المهمة في العرض الرئيسي يجب أن يُوصل إليها بطريقة أخرى، لأن الناس قد يتجاهلون العرض تمامًا."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/mobile-carousels/","quote":"Important items used in hero carousels should be accessible in some other way, in case that content is ignored completely by the user."},"scenario":{"en":"On phones, the banner changes only when you swipe it. \"Upload your prescription\" is the third slide.","ar":"على الهاتف، الشريط يتغيّر فقط حين تسحبه. و«ارفع الوصفة الطبية» هي الشريحة الثالثة."},"prompt":{"en":"Where else should the upload button be?","ar":"أين يجب أن يكون زر الرفع أيضًا؟"},"options":[{"id":"first","text":{"en":"Nowhere else; move it to the first slide","ar":"لا مكان آخر؛ انقله إلى الشريحة الأولى"}},{"id":"fixed","text":{"en":"A fixed \"Upload prescription\" button under the banner","ar":"زر ثابت «ارفع الوصفة الطبية» تحت الشريط"}},{"id":"hint","text":{"en":"Add \"Swipe for more\" under the banner","ar":"أضف «اسحب لترى المزيد» تحت الشريط"}}],"answer":["fixed"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-044","when":["first"],"feedback":{"en":"Better, but it's still inside something people often skip, and the next swipe hides it.","ar":"أفضل، لكنه ما زال داخل شيء يتخطّاه الناس كثيرًا، والسحبة التالية تُخفيه."}},{"id":"MC-P05-044","when":["hint"],"feedback":{"en":"Customers still have to swipe twice and spot it. The main task needs its own visible button.","ar":"ما زال على العميل أن يسحب مرتين ويلاحظه. والمهمة الأساسية تحتاج زرها الظاهر الخاص."}}],"hints":[{"en":"What's the main reason people visit a pharmacy site?","ar":"ما السبب الأساسي لزيارة موقع صيدلية؟"},{"en":"Which option works without any swiping?","ar":"أي خيار يعمل بدون أي سحب؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Right. The main task gets a place that never moves.","ar":"صحيح. المهمة الأساسية تأخذ مكانًا لا يتحرّك أبدًا."},"explain":{"en":"A carousel is fine for extras. Anything people came for needs a fixed, visible button.","ar":"العرض المتحرّك مناسب للإضافات. أما ما جاء الناس من أجله فيحتاج زرًا ثابتًا وظاهرًا."},"speaker":"tarek"},{"id":"S06","type":"compare","skill":"SK-P05-U05-05","part":"contrast","confidence":true,"rules":["R11"],"value":{"en":"Contrast: two vanishing messages. Indicators and Notifications (NN/g): a toast that disappears after a few seconds is fine for passive news but a bad way to show an error.","ar":"مقارنة: رسالتان تختفيان. المؤشرات والإشعارات (NN/g): الرسالة الصغيرة التي تختفي بعد ثوانٍ مناسبة للأخبار العابرة، لكنها طريقة سيئة لعرض خطأ."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/indicators-validations-notifications/","quote":"Alternatively, a toast (a small nonmodal popup that disappears after a few seconds, like the New Stories one used by the Facebook app), while appropriate for passive notifications, would be a bad way to implement an error message, be it validation or otherwise."},"scenario":{"en":"Both of these messages show at the bottom for 4 seconds, then fade away.","ar":"هاتان الرسالتان تظهران في الأسفل 4 ثوانٍ، ثم تختفيان."},"prompt":{"en":"Which one is a problem if it fades?","ar":"أي رسالة يخسر العميل شيئًا إذا اختفت قبل أن يراها؟"},"a":{"label":{"en":"A: \"Added to favourites.\"","ar":"A: «أُضيف إلى المفضّلة.»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dawaa","name":{"en":"Dawaa Pharmacy","ar":"صيدلية دواء"},"color":"#059669","icon":"pill","domain":"dawaa.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Dawaa Pharmacy","ar":"صيدلية دواء"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","art":"medicine","text":{"en":"Vitamin D drops","ar":"قطرات فيتامين د"},"sub":{"en":"85 EGP","ar":"85 جنيه"},"value":"♥"},{"kind":"banner","text":{"en":"✓ Added to favourites","ar":"✓ أُضيف إلى المفضّلة"},"gap":"l"}]}},"b":{"label":{"en":"B: \"Prescription photo is blurry. Please upload it again.\"","ar":"B: «صورة الوصفة الطبية غير واضحة. ارفعها مرة أخرى من فضلك.»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dawaa","name":{"en":"Dawaa Pharmacy","ar":"صيدلية دواء"},"color":"#059669","icon":"pill","domain":"dawaa.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Dawaa Pharmacy","ar":"صيدلية دواء"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","art":"document","text":{"en":"Prescription","ar":"الوصفة الطبية"},"sub":{"en":"Uploaded","ar":"تم الرفع"}},{"kind":"banner","text":{"en":"⚠ Prescription photo is blurry. Please upload it again.","ar":"⚠ صورة الوصفة الطبية غير واضحة. ارفعها مرة أخرى من فضلك."},"gap":"l"}]}},"answer":"b","reason":{"prompt":{"en":"Why is B the problem?","ar":"لماذا B هي المشكلة؟"},"options":[{"id":"act","text":{"en":"The customer must act on it; if it's missed, the order is stuck","ar":"على العميل أن يتصرّف بسببها؛ وإذا فاتته، يتوقّف الطلب"}},{"id":"long","text":{"en":"B is longer, so it needs more seconds","ar":"B أطول، فتحتاج وقتًا أطول"}},{"id":"health","text":{"en":"B is about medicine","ar":"B عن الدواء"}}],"answer":["act"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-052","when":["long","health"],"feedback":{"en":"The key is action. A needs nothing from the customer. B needs a new upload, so it must stay.","ar":"المهم هو التصرّف. A لا تحتاج شيئًا من العميل. وB تحتاج رفعًا جديدًا، فيجب أن تبقى."}}]},"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-052","when":["a"],"feedback":{"en":"If A is missed, nothing is lost; the heart still shows it's saved. B asks the customer to do something.","ar":"إذا فاتت A، لا يضيع شيء؛ فالقلب ما زال يُظهر أنه محفوظ. أما B فتطلب من العميل أن يفعل شيئًا."}}],"hints":[{"en":"What happens if the customer misses each message?","ar":"ماذا يحدث إذا فاتت العميلَ هذه الرسالة أو تلك؟"},{"en":"Which message asks the customer to do something?","ar":"أي رسالة تطلب من العميل أن يفعل شيئًا؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Messages that need action must stay.","ar":"صحيح. الرسائل التي تحتاج تصرّفًا يجب أن تبقى."},"explain":{"en":"Ask: what if they miss it? If nothing is lost, it can fade. If something breaks, it stays.","ar":"اسأل: ماذا لو فاتتهم؟ إذا لم يضع شيء، يمكن أن تختفي. وإذا تعطّل شيء، تبقى."},"speaker":"tarek"},{"id":"S07","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P05-U05-05","part":"independent","speaker":"nour","rules":["R14"],"value":{"en":"New case. Auto-Forwarding (NN/g): slow readers often don't have enough time to read information before it's removed.","ar":"حالة جديدة. التقدّم التلقائي (NN/g): القرّاء البطيئون كثيرًا لا يجدون وقتًا كافيًا لقراءة المعلومة قبل أن تُزال."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/auto-forwarding/","quote":"Low-literacy users often don't have enough time to read the information before it's removed."},"scenario":{"en":"After a patient books on our clinic's site, the page shows \"Booked! Your number: A14\" for 5 seconds, then jumps back to the home page.","ar":"بعد أن يحجز المريض في موقع عيادتنا، تعرض الصفحة «تم الحجز! رقمك: A14» لمدة 5 ثوانٍ، ثم ترجع إلى الصفحة الرئيسية."},"prompt":{"en":"What should the confirmation do?","ar":"ماذا يجب أن تفعل صفحة التأكيد حتى يحتفظ المريض برقم حجزه؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"raha.example/booking/done","navbar":{"actions":[{"icon":"user"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"icon","icon":"check-circle","size":"l","color":"brand"},{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Booked! Your number: A14","ar":"تم الحجز! رقمك: A14"}},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Going back home in 5 s…","ar":"الرجوع للرئيسية بعد 5 ث…"},"gap":"s"}],"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"}},"options":[{"id":"stay","text":{"en":"Stay until the patient leaves, with the number and a \"Done\" button","ar":"تبقى حتى يغادر المريض، مع الرقم وزر «تم»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"raha.example/booking/done","navbar":{"actions":[{"icon":"user"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"icon","icon":"check-circle","size":"l","color":"brand"},{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Booked! Your number: A14","ar":"تم الحجز! رقمك: A14"}},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Done","ar":"تم"},"gap":"m"}],"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}},{"id":"ten","text":{"en":"Stay for 10 seconds instead of 5","ar":"تبقى 10 ثوانٍ بدل 5"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"raha.example/booking/done","navbar":{"actions":[{"icon":"user"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"icon","icon":"check-circle","size":"l","color":"brand"},{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Booked! Your number: A14","ar":"تم الحجز! رقمك: A14"}},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Going back home in 10 s…","ar":"الرجوع للرئيسية بعد 10 ث…"},"gap":"s"}],"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}},{"id":"count","text":{"en":"Show a big countdown: 5, 4, 3…","ar":"تعرض عدًّا تنازليًا كبيرًا: 5، 4، 3…"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"raha.example/booking/done","navbar":{"actions":[{"icon":"user"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"icon","icon":"check-circle","size":"l","color":"brand"},{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Booked! Your number: A14","ar":"تم الحجز! رقمك: A14"}},{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"5","ar":"5"},"gap":"m","note":{"en":"5, 4, 3…","ar":"5، 4، 3…"}},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Going back home…","ar":"الرجوع للرئيسية…"},"color":"muted","gap":"xs"}],"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}}],"answer":["stay"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-052","when":["ten","count"],"feedback":{"en":"There's still a timer. A slow reader, or someone looking for a pen to write A14, still loses it.","ar":"ما زال هناك وقت محدّد. والقارئ البطيء، أو من يبحث عن قلم ليكتب A14، ما زال يفقده."}}],"hints":[{"en":"What does the patient need to do with this page?","ar":"ماذا يحتاج المريض أن يفعل بهذه الصفحة؟"},{"en":"Which option has no timer?","ar":"أي خيار بلا وقت محدّد؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Right. The patient leaves when ready.","ar":"صحيح. المريض يغادر حين يكون مستعدًا."},"explain":{"en":"Information people need to keep, like a booking number, should never disappear on a timer.","ar":"المعلومة التي يحتاج الناس الاحتفاظ بها، مثل رقم الحجز، لا ينبغي أن تختفي بعد وقت محدّد أبدًا."}},{"id":"S08","type":"card","part":"recap","icons":["clock","tap","warn","ok"],"title":{"en":"What you did","ar":"ماذا تعلّمت"},"body":{"en":"- **Still until asked:** you made the banner wait for the customer.\n- **Errors stay:** you kept \"Payment failed\" on screen with \"Try again\".\n- **A fixed place:** you put \"Upload prescription\" outside the banner.\n- **Fade or stay:** you let \"Added to favourites\" fade, but kept the blurry-photo message.\n- **No timer:** you kept the booking number until the patient leaves.\n\nNext: the skill check.","ar":"- **ثابت حتى يُطلب:** جعلت الشريط ينتظر العميل.\n- **الأخطاء تبقى:** أبقيت «فشل الدفع» على الشاشة مع «حاول مرة أخرى».\n- **مكان ثابت:** وضعت «ارفع الوصفة الطبية» خارج الشريط.\n- **تختفي أو تبقى:** تركت «أُضيف إلى المفضّلة» تختفي، وأبقيت رسالة الصورة غير الواضحة.\n- **بلا وقت محدّد:** أبقيت رقم الحجز حتى يغادر المريض.\n\nالتالي: اختبار المهارة."}}]}$uxg$::jsonb),
  ($uxg$P05-U05-L04$uxg$, $uxg$db88c58c3349b417f0b3c3b9d5ea27dada8a27193b83d888405d4fe52726e2cc$uxg$, $uxg${"id":"P05-U05-L04","mode":"check","minutes":6,"title":{"en":"Skill check: touch, motion and time","ar":"اختبار المهارة: اللمس والحركة والوقت"},"summary":{"en":"Check a bus ticket app's gestures, animations and messages before launch, on your own.","ar":"افحص الإيماءات والحركات والرسائل في تطبيق تذاكر حافلات قبل الإطلاق، بنفسك."},"speaker":"karim","steps":[{"id":"S01","type":"card","part":"hook","title":{"en":"Karim's bus ticket app","ar":"تطبيق تذاكر الحافلات الذي يبنيه كريم"},"body":{"en":"I'm building a bus ticket app. Before launch, I want it to work for people with shaky hands, people who get dizzy, and people who read slowly.\n\nYour job: check five parts.\n\nThis is a skill check: there are no hints, and you'll see your result at the end.","ar":"أبني تطبيقًا لتذاكر الحافلات. وقبل الإطلاق، أريده أن يناسب من تهتزّ يداه، ومن يصيبه الدوار، ومن يقرأ ببطء.\n\nمهمّتك: افحص خمسة أجزاء.\n\nهذا اختبار مهارة: لا توجد تلميحات، وسترى نتيجتك في النهاية."},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rehla","name":{"en":"Rehla","ar":"رحلة"},"color":"#7048E8","icon":"bus","domain":"rehla.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Your trip","ar":"رحلتك"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"card","art":"bus","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Cairo → Alexandria","ar":"القاهرة ← الإسكندرية"}},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Today · 10:30 · Gate 3","ar":"اليوم · 10:30 · بوابة 3"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"180 EGP","ar":"180 جنيه"},"gap":"xs"}]},{"kind":"button","icon":"armchair","text":{"en":"Choose seat","ar":"اختر المقعد"},"gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"S02","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P05-U05-01","part":"check","rules":["R19"],"value":{"en":"Skill check. Drag–and–Drop (NN/g): other interactions can replace dragging completely; on mobile, a menu or tap can be less error-prone than drag-and-drop.","ar":"اختبار مهارة. السحب والإفلات (NN/g): طرق أخرى يمكن أن تحلّ محل الجرّ تمامًا؛ وعلى الهاتف، القائمة أو الضغط قد يكون أقل عرضة للخطأ من الجرّ والإفلات."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/drag-drop/","quote":"on mobile, for example, using menus to move a file to a different folder can be less error-prone than drag-and-drop."},"scenario":{"en":"On the seat map, you pick a seat by dragging a 🧍 icon onto it. Testers with shaky hands keep dropping it on the wrong seat.","ar":"في خريطة المقاعد، تختار مقعدك بجرّ أيقونة 🧍 إليه. والمختبِرون الذين تهتزّ أيديهم يُسقطونها على المقعد الخطأ كل مرة."},"prompt":{"en":"What should I change?","ar":"ماذا يجب أن أغيّر؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rehla","name":{"en":"Rehla","ar":"رحلة"},"color":"#7048E8","icon":"bus","domain":"rehla.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Choose seat","ar":"اختر المقعد"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"row","blocks":[{"kind":"icon","icon":"person","size":"l","color":"brand","note":{"en":"Drag me to a seat","ar":"اسحبني إلى مقعد"}},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Drag the person to a free seat","ar":"اسحب الشخص إلى مقعد فارغ"}}]},{"kind":"seatmap","rows":5,"cols":4,"aisle":2,"taken":[[0,0],[0,1],[1,3],[2,2],[3,0],[4,1]],"gap":"s"}],"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"}},"options":[{"id":"snap","text":{"en":"Make the icon snap to the nearest seat","ar":"اجعل الأيقونة تنتقل تلقائيًا إلى أقرب مقعد"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rehla","name":{"en":"Rehla","ar":"رحلة"},"color":"#7048E8","icon":"bus","domain":"rehla.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Choose seat","ar":"اختر المقعد"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"row","blocks":[{"kind":"icon","icon":"person","size":"l","color":"brand","note":{"en":"Snaps to the nearest seat","ar":"ينتقل تلقائيًا إلى أقرب مقعد"}},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Drag the person to a free seat","ar":"اسحب الشخص إلى مقعد فارغ"}}]},{"kind":"seatmap","rows":5,"cols":4,"aisle":2,"taken":[[0,0],[0,1],[1,3],[2,2],[3,0],[4,1]],"gap":"s"}],"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}},{"id":"tap","text":{"en":"Let people tap a seat to pick it","ar":"اجعل الناس يضغطون على المقعد لاختياره"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rehla","name":{"en":"Rehla","ar":"رحلة"},"color":"#7048E8","icon":"bus","domain":"rehla.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Choose seat","ar":"اختر المقعد"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Tap a free seat to pick it","ar":"اضغط على مقعد فارغ لاختياره"},"color":"muted"},{"kind":"seatmap","rows":5,"cols":4,"aisle":2,"taken":[[0,0],[0,1],[1,3],[2,2],[3,0],[4,1]],"gap":"s","picked":[[2,0]]}],"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}},{"id":"zoom","text":{"en":"Zoom the seat map in while dragging","ar":"كبّر خريطة المقاعد أثناء الجرّ"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rehla","name":{"en":"Rehla","ar":"رحلة"},"color":"#7048E8","icon":"bus","domain":"rehla.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Choose seat","ar":"اختر المقعد"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"row","blocks":[{"kind":"icon","icon":"person","size":"l","color":"brand","note":{"en":"The map zooms in while you drag","ar":"الخريطة تكبر أثناء الجرّ"}},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Drag the person to a free seat","ar":"اسحب الشخص إلى مقعد فارغ"}}]},{"kind":"seatmap","rows":5,"cols":4,"aisle":2,"taken":[[0,0],[0,1],[1,3],[2,2],[3,0],[4,1]],"gap":"s"}],"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}}],"answer":["tap"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-045","when":["snap","zoom"],"feedback":{"en":"Both still need a steady hold-and-drag. One tap on the seat works for everyone.","ar":"الاثنان ما زالا يحتاجان إمساكًا وجرًّا بيد ثابتة. والضغطة الواحدة على المقعد تناسب الجميع."}}],"explain":{"en":"From Lesson 1: give every drag a way that works with simple taps.","ar":"من الدرس 1: أعطِ كل جرّ بديلًا بضغطات بسيطة."},"speaker":"karim"},{"id":"S03","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P05-U05-02","part":"check","rules":["R19"],"value":{"en":"Skill check. Contextual Swipe (NN/g): if an action is repeated a lot and confirmations would be tedious, support easy undo instead.","ar":"اختبار مهارة. السحب لإظهار الإجراءات (NN/g): إذا كان الإجراء يتكرّر كثيرًا وكان التأكيد كل مرة مُملًا، فأعطِ تراجعًا سهلًا بدلًا منه."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/contextual-swipe/","quote":"Alternatively, if the action is highly repetitive and asking for confirmations would be tedious, support easy undo."},"scenario":{"en":"People clear old trips from their history by swiping, often ten in a row. Right now a swipe deletes at once, with no way back.","ar":"الناس يحذفون الرحلات القديمة من السجل بالسحب، وغالبًا عشر رحلات متتالية. والآن السحب يحذف فورًا، دون أي تراجع."},"prompt":{"en":"What should happen after each swipe?","ar":"ماذا يجب أن يحدث بعد كل سحبة، حتى يستعيد الناس رحلة حذفوها بالخطأ؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rehla","name":{"en":"Rehla","ar":"رحلة"},"color":"#7048E8","icon":"bus","domain":"rehla.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Trip history","ar":"سجلّ الرحلات"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"bus","text":{"en":"Cairo → Tanta","ar":"القاهرة ← طنطا"},"sub":{"en":"2 Oct · 95 EGP","ar":"2 أكتوبر · 95 جنيه"},"swipe":{"text":{"en":"Delete","ar":"حذف"},"tone":"bad"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"bus","text":{"en":"Cairo → Alexandria","ar":"القاهرة ← الإسكندرية"},"sub":{"en":"18 Sep · 180 EGP","ar":"18 سبتمبر · 180 جنيه"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"bus","text":{"en":"Giza → Fayoum","ar":"الجيزة ← الفيوم"},"sub":{"en":"3 Sep · 70 EGP","ar":"3 سبتمبر · 70 جنيه"}}],"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"}},"options":[{"id":"undo","text":{"en":"Show \"Trip removed · Undo\" in a clear bar","ar":"اعرض «تم حذف الرحلة · تراجع» في شريط واضح"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rehla","name":{"en":"Rehla","ar":"رحلة"},"color":"#7048E8","icon":"bus","domain":"rehla.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Trip history","ar":"سجلّ الرحلات"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"bus","text":{"en":"Cairo → Alexandria","ar":"القاهرة ← الإسكندرية"},"sub":{"en":"18 Sep · 180 EGP","ar":"18 سبتمبر · 180 جنيه"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"bus","text":{"en":"Giza → Fayoum","ar":"الجيزة ← الفيوم"},"sub":{"en":"3 Sep · 70 EGP","ar":"3 سبتمبر · 70 جنيه"}}],"overlay":{"type":"toast","blocks":[{"kind":"row","blocks":[{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"Trip removed","ar":"تم حذف الرحلة"}},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Undo","ar":"تراجع"},"style":"plain"}]}]},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}},{"id":"ask","text":{"en":"Ask \"Are you sure?\" every time","ar":"اسأل «هل أنت متأكد؟» كل مرة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rehla","name":{"en":"Rehla","ar":"رحلة"},"color":"#7048E8","icon":"bus","domain":"rehla.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Trip history","ar":"سجلّ الرحلات"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"bus","text":{"en":"Cairo → Tanta","ar":"القاهرة ← طنطا"},"sub":{"en":"2 Oct · 95 EGP","ar":"2 أكتوبر · 95 جنيه"},"swipe":{"text":{"en":"Delete","ar":"حذف"},"tone":"bad"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"bus","text":{"en":"Cairo → Alexandria","ar":"القاهرة ← الإسكندرية"},"sub":{"en":"18 Sep · 180 EGP","ar":"18 سبتمبر · 180 جنيه"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"bus","text":{"en":"Giza → Fayoum","ar":"الجيزة ← الفيوم"},"sub":{"en":"3 Sep · 70 EGP","ar":"3 سبتمبر · 70 جنيه"}}],"overlay":{"type":"dialog","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Are you sure?","ar":"هل أنت متأكد؟"}},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"Delete Cairo → Tanta?","ar":"حذف القاهرة ← طنطا؟"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"row","gap":"m","blocks":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"No","ar":"لا"},"style":"plain"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Delete","ar":"احذف"},"style":"danger"}]}]},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}},{"id":"none","text":{"en":"Nothing; old trips don't matter much","ar":"لا شيء؛ الرحلات القديمة ليست مهمة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rehla","name":{"en":"Rehla","ar":"رحلة"},"color":"#7048E8","icon":"bus","domain":"rehla.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Trip history","ar":"سجلّ الرحلات"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"bus","text":{"en":"Cairo → Alexandria","ar":"القاهرة ← الإسكندرية"},"sub":{"en":"18 Sep · 180 EGP","ar":"18 سبتمبر · 180 جنيه"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"bus","text":{"en":"Giza → Fayoum","ar":"الجيزة ← الفيوم"},"sub":{"en":"3 Sep · 70 EGP","ar":"3 سبتمبر · 70 جنيه"}}],"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}}],"answer":["undo"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-046","when":["ask"],"feedback":{"en":"Ten questions in a row is tiring, and people start tapping Yes without reading. Undo is safer here.","ar":"عشرة أسئلة متتالية متعبة، ويبدأ الناس بالضغط على «نعم» دون قراءة. والتراجع أكثر أمانًا هنا."}},{"id":"MC-P05-046","when":["none"],"feedback":{"en":"Someone may swipe away a trip they still need, like one with a receipt. A slip should be easy to fix.","ar":"قد يحذف أحدهم رحلة ما زال يحتاجها، مثل رحلة فيها إيصال. والخطأ يجب أن يكون سهل الإصلاح."}}],"explain":{"en":"From Lesson 1: after an easy gesture deletes something, offer a clear Undo.","ar":"من الدرس 1: بعد أن تحذف إيماءة سهلة شيئًا، أعطِ تراجعًا واضحًا."},"speaker":"karim"},{"id":"S04","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P05-U05-03","part":"check","rules":["R19"],"value":{"en":"Skill check. Animation Duration (NN/g): parallax, carousel animations and scroll jacking can make people with vestibular disorders dizzy or nauseated and trigger migraines.","ar":"اختبار مهارة. مدة الحركة (NN/g): حركة الخلفية والعروض المتحرّكة والتحكّم في التمرير قد تُصيب من عنده اضطراب في التوازن بالدوار أو الغثيان، وتسبّب الصداع النصفي."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/animation-duration/","quote":"Parallax, carousel-forwarding animations, and scroll jacking can make users with vestibular disorders dizzy or nauseated and trigger migraines."},"scenario":{"en":"On the trip page, a bus drives along a road in the background as you scroll. A user has \"Reduce motion\" turned on.","ar":"في صفحة الرحلة، تسير حافلة على طريق في الخلفية وأنت تمرّر. ويفتحها مستخدم فعّل «تقليل الحركة»."},"prompt":{"en":"What should this user see?","ar":"ماذا يجب أن يرى هذا المستخدم؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rehla","name":{"en":"Rehla","ar":"رحلة"},"color":"#7048E8","icon":"bus","domain":"rehla.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Cairo → Alexandria","ar":"القاهرة ← الإسكندرية"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"map-route","note":{"en":"Bus drives along as you scroll","ar":"الحافلة تتحرّك وأنت تمرّر"}},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Today · 10:30 · 2 h 45 min","ar":"اليوم · 10:30 · ساعتان و45 دقيقة"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Choose seat","ar":"اختر المقعد"},"gap":"s"}],"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"}},"options":[{"id":"slow","text":{"en":"The same bus, moving more slowly","ar":"نفس الحافلة، تتحرّك ببطء أكثر"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rehla","name":{"en":"Rehla","ar":"رحلة"},"color":"#7048E8","icon":"bus","domain":"rehla.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Cairo → Alexandria","ar":"القاهرة ← الإسكندرية"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"map-route","note":{"en":"Bus drives along slowly as you scroll","ar":"الحافلة تتحرّك ببطء وأنت تمرّر"}},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Today · 10:30 · 2 h 45 min","ar":"اليوم · 10:30 · ساعتان و45 دقيقة"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Choose seat","ar":"اختر المقعد"},"gap":"s"}],"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}},{"id":"once","text":{"en":"The moving bus, but only on the first visit","ar":"الحافلة المتحرّكة، لكن في أول زيارة فقط"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rehla","name":{"en":"Rehla","ar":"رحلة"},"color":"#7048E8","icon":"bus","domain":"rehla.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Cairo → Alexandria","ar":"القاهرة ← الإسكندرية"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"map-route","note":{"en":"Bus drives along on your first visit only","ar":"الحافلة تتحرّك في أول زيارة فقط"}},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Today · 10:30 · 2 h 45 min","ar":"اليوم · 10:30 · ساعتان و45 دقيقة"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Choose seat","ar":"اختر المقعد"},"gap":"s"}],"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}},{"id":"still","text":{"en":"A still picture of the bus","ar":"صورة ثابتة للحافلة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rehla","name":{"en":"Rehla","ar":"رحلة"},"color":"#7048E8","icon":"bus","domain":"rehla.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Cairo → Alexandria","ar":"القاهرة ← الإسكندرية"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"map-route","note":{"en":"Still picture","ar":"صورة ثابتة"}},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Today · 10:30 · 2 h 45 min","ar":"اليوم · 10:30 · ساعتان و45 دقيقة"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Choose seat","ar":"اختر المقعد"},"gap":"s"}],"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}}],"answer":["still"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-047","when":["slow","once"],"feedback":{"en":"The user asked for less motion. Even one slow scroll effect can make them dizzy.","ar":"المستخدم طلب حركة أقل. وحتى تأثير تمرير بطيء واحد قد يُصيبه بالدوار."}}],"explain":{"en":"From Lesson 2: when \"Reduce motion\" is on, remove scroll and background motion.","ar":"من الدرس 2: حين يكون «تقليل الحركة» مفعّلًا، أزِل حركة التمرير والخلفية."},"speaker":"karim"},{"id":"S05","type":"choose","skill":"SK-P05-U05-04","part":"check","rules":["R19"],"value":{"en":"Skill check. Animation Duration (NN/g): when a big panel like a modal moves into view, 200–300 ms can be right. At 500 ms, animations start to feel like a drag.","ar":"اختبار مهارة. مدة الحركة (NN/g): حين تدخل لوحة كبيرة مثل النافذة المنبثقة، فإن 200 إلى 300 ms قد تكون مناسبة. وعند 500 ms تبدأ الحركة تبدو ثقيلة."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/animation-duration/","quote":"When animation involves substantial screen changes, such as when a modal window moves into view, a duration of 200–300 ms can be appropriate."},"scenario":{"en":"Tapping \"Choose seat\" slides the seat map up from the bottom. It takes 800 ms.","ar":"الضغط على «اختر المقعد» يجعل خريطة المقاعد تنزلق من الأسفل. وتستغرق الحركة 800 ms."},"prompt":{"en":"What should the timing be?","ar":"كم يجب أن تكون المدة حتى لا ينتظر المسافر؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rehla","name":{"en":"Rehla","ar":"رحلة"},"color":"#7048E8","icon":"bus","domain":"rehla.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Your trip","ar":"رحلتك"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Cairo → Alexandria","ar":"القاهرة ← الإسكندرية"}}],"overlay":{"type":"sheet","title":{"en":"Choose seat","ar":"اختر المقعد"},"blocks":[{"kind":"seatmap","rows":4,"cols":4,"aisle":2,"taken":[[0,1],[1,3],[2,0]],"note":{"en":"Slides up in 800 ms","ar":"تصعد خلال 800 ms"}}]}},"options":[{"id":"keep","text":{"en":"Keep 800 ms; it's a big panel","ar":"تبقى 800 ms؛ فهي لوحة كبيرة"}},{"id":"right","text":{"en":"About 250 ms","ar":"نحو 250 ms"}},{"id":"bounce","text":{"en":"800 ms, plus a bounce at the end","ar":"800 ms، مع ارتداد في النهاية"}}],"answer":["right"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-049","when":["keep","bounce"],"feedback":{"en":"Even big panels need only about 200 to 300 ms. 800 ms is a wait every time someone books.","ar":"حتى اللوحات الكبيرة تحتاج نحو 200 إلى 300 ms فقط. و800 ms انتظار في كل مرة يحجز فيها أحد."}}],"explain":{"en":"From Lesson 2: most animations take 100 to 500 ms; bigger changes sit near the middle, not past the end.","ar":"من الدرس 2: أغلب الحركات من 100 إلى 500 ms؛ والتغييرات الأكبر قرب منتصف المدى، لا بعد نهايته."},"speaker":"karim"},{"id":"S06","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P05-U05-05","part":"check","rules":["R19"],"value":{"en":"Skill check. Indicators and Notifications (NN/g): action-required notifications are often urgent and should demand attention, staying until people act.","ar":"اختبار مهارة. المؤشرات والإشعارات (NN/g): الإشعارات التي تتطلّب تصرّفًا تكون عاجلة غالبًا، ويجب أن تلفت الانتباه وتبقى حتى يتصرّف الناس."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/indicators-validations-notifications/","quote":"Action-required notifications are often urgent and should be intrusive"},"scenario":{"en":"When the gate changes, a small \"Now boarding at Gate 7\" message slides in at the top for 3 seconds, then disappears.","ar":"حين تتغيّر البوابة، تنزلق رسالة صغيرة «الصعود الآن من بوابة 7» في الأعلى لمدة 3 ثوانٍ، ثم تختفي."},"prompt":{"en":"How should the gate change be shown?","ar":"كيف يُعرض تغيير البوابة حتى لا يفوت أي مسافر؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rehla","name":{"en":"Rehla","ar":"رحلة"},"color":"#7048E8","icon":"bus","domain":"rehla.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Your ticket","ar":"تذكرتك"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"qr"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"door-open","text":{"en":"Gate 3","ar":"بوابة 3"},"sub":{"en":"Cairo → Alexandria · 10:30","ar":"القاهرة ← الإسكندرية · 10:30"},"gap":"s"}],"overlay":{"type":"banner","blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Now boarding at Gate 7","ar":"الصعود الآن من بوابة 7"},"note":{"en":"Gone after 3 s","ar":"تختفي بعد 3 ث"}}]},"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"}},"options":[{"id":"big","text":{"en":"The same message, but bigger","ar":"نفس الرسالة، لكن أكبر"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rehla","name":{"en":"Rehla","ar":"رحلة"},"color":"#7048E8","icon":"bus","domain":"rehla.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Your ticket","ar":"تذكرتك"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"qr"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"door-open","text":{"en":"Gate 3","ar":"بوابة 3"},"sub":{"en":"Cairo → Alexandria · 10:30","ar":"القاهرة ← الإسكندرية · 10:30"},"gap":"s"}],"overlay":{"type":"banner","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Now boarding at Gate 7","ar":"الصعود الآن من بوابة 7"},"note":{"en":"Gone after 3 s","ar":"تختفي بعد 3 ث"}}]},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}},{"id":"sound","text":{"en":"The same message, plus a sound","ar":"نفس الرسالة، مع صوت"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rehla","name":{"en":"Rehla","ar":"رحلة"},"color":"#7048E8","icon":"bus","domain":"rehla.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Your ticket","ar":"تذكرتك"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"qr"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"door-open","text":{"en":"Gate 3","ar":"بوابة 3"},"sub":{"en":"Cairo → Alexandria · 10:30","ar":"القاهرة ← الإسكندرية · 10:30"},"gap":"s"}],"overlay":{"type":"banner","blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Now boarding at Gate 7","ar":"الصعود الآن من بوابة 7"},"note":{"en":"Gone after 3 s · plays a sound","ar":"تختفي بعد 3 ث · مع صوت"}}]},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}},{"id":"stay","text":{"en":"A message that stays until the passenger taps OK, and \"Gate 7\" on the ticket","ar":"رسالة تبقى حتى يضغط المسافر «حسنًا»، و«بوابة 7» على التذكرة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rehla","name":{"en":"Rehla","ar":"رحلة"},"color":"#7048E8","icon":"bus","domain":"rehla.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Your ticket","ar":"تذكرتك"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"qr"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"door-open","text":{"en":"Gate 7","ar":"بوابة 7"},"sub":{"en":"Cairo → Alexandria · 10:30","ar":"القاهرة ← الإسكندرية · 10:30"},"gap":"s","badge":{"text":{"en":"Changed","ar":"تغيّرت"},"tone":"warn"}}],"overlay":{"type":"dialog","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Gate changed","ar":"تغيّرت البوابة"}},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"Now boarding at Gate 7","ar":"الصعود الآن من بوابة 7"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"OK","ar":"حسنًا"},"gap":"m"}]},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}}],"answer":["stay"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-052","when":["big","sound"],"feedback":{"en":"It still vanishes after 3 seconds. A passenger who looks away goes to the wrong gate.","ar":"ما زالت تختفي بعد 3 ثوانٍ. والمسافر الذي ينظر بعيدًا يذهب إلى البوابة الخطأ."}}],"explain":{"en":"From Lesson 3: messages people must act on stay until they act.","ar":"من الدرس 3: الرسائل التي يجب أن يتصرّف فيها الناس تبقى حتى يتصرّفوا."},"speaker":"karim"}]}$uxg$::jsonb),
  ($uxg$P10-U01-L01$uxg$, $uxg$bd8f77341756595d9664b4d6a2ff98d6485a18e8b26366ff6ad5b5a0fdd491a0$uxg$, $uxg${"id":"P10-U01-L01","mode":"lesson","minutes":8,"title":{"en":"Put what decides it first","ar":"ضع ما يحسم القرار أولًا"},"summary":{"en":"Reorder a workshop page so the facts that decide a booking come first.","ar":"أعد ترتيب صفحة ورشة لتأتي المعلومات التي تحسم الحجز أولًا."},"speaker":"sara","review_labels":{"MC-P10-001":{"en":"The biggest thing isn't always the most important","ar":"الأكبر ليس دائمًا الأهم"},"MC-P10-003":{"en":"Make no more than two things big","ar":"لا تكبّر أكثر من عنصرين"},"MC-P10-004":{"en":"The first words carry the decision","ar":"الكلمات الأولى تحمل القرار"},"MC-P10-005":{"en":"The main button goes right after the facts","ar":"الزر الرئيسي يأتي بعد المعلومات مباشرة"},"MC-P10-006":{"en":"The order follows the decision","ar":"الترتيب يتبع القرار"},"MC-P10-015":{"en":"Don't block the decision with promotion","ar":"لا تعرقل القرار بالترويج"}},"steps":[{"id":"S01","type":"card","part":"hook","title":{"en":"Meet Reem","ar":"تعرّف على ريم"},"body":{"en":"I'm designing the page for a free beginner workshop. Reem wants one next week. She works until 17:00, so she can only come in the evening.\n\nShe opens this page on her phone. Can she tell, quickly, whether the time works for her?","ar":"أصمّم صفحة ورشة مجانية للمبتدئين. تبحث ريم عن ورشة كهذه في الأسبوع القادم. دوامها ينتهي الساعة 17:00، فلا تستطيع الحضور إلا مساءً.\n\nفتحت هذه الصفحة على هاتفها. هل تعرف بسرعة إن كان الموعد يناسبها؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"manara","name":{"en":"Manara Learning Hub","ar":"منارة"},"color":"#5B3FD6","icon":"chalkboard-teacher","domain":"manara.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Workshop","ar":"الورشة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"people","size":"l","text":{"en":"Photo: Learn together","ar":"صورة: نتعلّم معًا"}},{"kind":"banner","text":{"en":"Get the monthly newsletter","ar":"اشترك في النشرة الشهرية"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Sketch Your First App","ar":"ارسم تطبيقك الأول"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Tuesday 17 November, 18:00–20:00","ar":"الثلاثاء 17 نوفمبر، من 18:00 إلى 20:00"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Downtown Learning Hub, Room 2","ar":"مركز التعلّم بوسط البلد، قاعة 2"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Free","ar":"مجاني"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Reserve a place","ar":"احجز مكانك"},"gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"S02","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P10-U01-01","part":"try","rules":["R12"],"value":{"en":"NN/g eyetracking: people spend about 57% of their viewing time above the fold, so the top of the page belongs to what the visitor needs to decide, not to promotion.","ar":"تتبّع العين في NN/g: يقضي الناس نحو 57% من وقت المشاهدة فوق خط الطيّ (Fold)، فأعلى الصفحة لما يحتاجه الزائر ليقرّر، لا للترويج."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/scrolling-and-attention/","quote":"Reserve the top of the page for high-priority content"},"prompt":{"en":"What should come first on Reem's phone? Try each order.","ar":"ماذا يجب أن يأتي أولًا على هاتف ريم؟ جرّب كل ترتيب."},"mock":{"app":{"id":"manara","name":{"en":"Manara Learning Hub","ar":"منارة"},"color":"#5B3FD6","icon":"chalkboard-teacher","domain":"manara.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Workshop","ar":"الورشة"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"height":380,"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"people","size":"l","text":{"en":"Photo: Learn together","ar":"صورة: نتعلّم معًا"}},{"kind":"banner","text":{"en":"Get the monthly newsletter","ar":"اشترك في النشرة الشهرية"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Sketch Your First App","ar":"ارسم تطبيقك الأول"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Tuesday 17 November, 18:00–20:00","ar":"الثلاثاء 17 نوفمبر، من 18:00 إلى 20:00"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Downtown Learning Hub, Room 2","ar":"مركز التعلّم بوسط البلد، قاعة 2"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Free","ar":"مجاني"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Reserve a place","ar":"احجز مكانك"},"gap":"m"}]},"options":[{"id":"button","text":{"en":"The Reserve button first, then the rest","ar":"زر الحجز أولًا، ثم الباقي"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"manara","name":{"en":"Manara Learning Hub","ar":"منارة"},"color":"#5B3FD6","icon":"chalkboard-teacher","domain":"manara.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Workshop","ar":"الورشة"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Reserve a place","ar":"احجز مكانك"}},{"kind":"image","art":"people","size":"l","text":{"en":"Photo: Learn together","ar":"صورة: نتعلّم معًا"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Sketch Your First App","ar":"ارسم تطبيقك الأول"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Tuesday 17 November, 18:00–20:00","ar":"الثلاثاء 17 نوفمبر، من 18:00 إلى 20:00"},"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"facts","text":{"en":"Title, time, place and price first, then Reserve; the photo and newsletter after","ar":"العنوان والموعد والمكان والسعر أولًا، ثم زر الحجز؛ والصورة والنشرة بعدها"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"manara","name":{"en":"Manara Learning Hub","ar":"منارة"},"color":"#5B3FD6","icon":"chalkboard-teacher","domain":"manara.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Workshop","ar":"الورشة"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Sketch Your First App","ar":"ارسم تطبيقك الأول"}},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Tuesday 17 November, 18:00–20:00","ar":"الثلاثاء 17 نوفمبر، من 18:00 إلى 20:00"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Downtown Learning Hub, Room 2","ar":"مركز التعلّم بوسط البلد، قاعة 2"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Free","ar":"مجاني"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Reserve a place","ar":"احجز مكانك"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"image","art":"people","size":"m","text":{"en":"Photo: Learn together","ar":"صورة: نتعلّم معًا"},"gap":"l"},{"kind":"banner","text":{"en":"Get the monthly newsletter","ar":"اشترك في النشرة الشهرية"},"gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"bigger","text":{"en":"Keep the photo first, but make it smaller","ar":"أبقِ الصورة أولًا، لكن صغّرها"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"manara","name":{"en":"Manara Learning Hub","ar":"منارة"},"color":"#5B3FD6","icon":"chalkboard-teacher","domain":"manara.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Workshop","ar":"الورشة"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"people","size":"s","text":{"en":"Photo: Learn together","ar":"صورة: نتعلّم معًا"}},{"kind":"banner","text":{"en":"Get the monthly newsletter","ar":"اشترك في النشرة الشهرية"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Sketch Your First App","ar":"ارسم تطبيقك الأول"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Tuesday 17 November, 18:00–20:00","ar":"الثلاثاء 17 نوفمبر، من 18:00 إلى 20:00"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Downtown Learning Hub, Room 2","ar":"مركز التعلّم بوسط البلد، قاعة 2"},"gap":"s"}]}}],"answer":["facts"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P10-006","when":["button"],"feedback":{"en":"Now Reem is asked to reserve before she knows the time. Put the facts she decides with first, then the button.","ar":"الآن يُطلب من ريم أن تحجز قبل أن تعرف الموعد. ضع المعلومات التي تقرّر بها أولًا، ثم الزر."}},{"id":"MC-P10-015","when":["bigger"],"feedback":{"en":"The photo and the newsletter banner still come before the time. Smaller promotion is still promotion in the way.","ar":"الصورة وشريط النشرة ما زالا قبل الموعد. تصغير الترويج لا يكفي، فهو ما زال يسبق الموعد."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Reem has one question: does the time work for her? Where would she look first?","ar":"لدى ريم سؤال واحد: هل يناسبها الموعد؟ أين ستنظر أولًا؟"},{"en":"Can she decide to reserve before she knows the time and place?","ar":"هل تستطيع أن تقرّر الحجز قبل أن تعرف الموعد والمكان؟"}],"correct":{"en":"The facts that decide it, then the action.","ar":"المعلومات التي تحسم القرار، ثم الإجراء."},"explain":{"en":"People spend more than half of their viewing time above the fold. Spend that space on what Reem decides with: what, when, where, how much. Then the Reserve button.","ar":"يقضي الناس أكثر من نصف وقت المشاهدة فوق خط الطيّ (Above the fold)، أي ما يظهر قبل التمرير. خصّص هذه المساحة لما تقرّر به ريم: ماذا ومتى وأين وبكم. ثم زر الحجز."}},{"id":"S03","type":"card","part":"concept","icons":["fold","size","text","target"],"title":{"en":"The top of the page decides","ar":"أعلى الصفحة يحسم القرار"},"body":{"en":"- **The first screen:** people spend more than half of their viewing time above the fold. Put what the visitor decides with there.\n- **Two big things at most:** make the most important element biggest, and no more than two elements big. If everything stands out, nothing does.\n- **Key fact first:** in every piece of text, the first words should carry the decision. This is the inverted pyramid.\n- **Action after the facts:** the main button comes right after what people need to decide, high on the page.","ar":"- **الشاشة الأولى:** يقضي الناس أكثر من نصف وقت المشاهدة فوق خط الطيّ (Above the fold). ضع هناك ما يقرّر به الزائر.\n- **عنصران كبيران فقط:** اجعل الأهم هو الأكبر، ولا تكبّر أكثر من عنصرين. إن برز كل شيء، فلن يبرز شيء.\n- **المعلومة الأهم أولًا:** في كل نص، يجب أن تحمل الكلمات الأولى ما يحسم القرار. هذا هو الهرم المقلوب (Inverted pyramid).\n- **الإجراء بعد المعلومات:** الزر الرئيسي يأتي بعد ما يحتاجه الناس للقرار مباشرة، في أعلى الصفحة."}},{"id":"S04","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P10-U01-02","part":"guided","rules":["R06","R13"],"value":{"en":"NN/g: limit big elements to a maximum of 2 so they stand out. When the title, time, place, price and seats are all bold and big, nothing leads.","ar":"NN/g: لا تكبّر أكثر من عنصرين حتى يبرزا فعلًا. حين يكون العنوان والموعد والمكان والسعر والأماكن كلها عريضة وكبيرة، لا شيء يقود."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/visual-hierarchy-ux-definition/","quote":"Limit how many elements are big to a maximum of 2"},"prompt":{"en":"A teammate made every fact big and bold so \"nothing gets missed\". Try each version. Which one should ship?","ar":"جعل زميلك كل المعلومات كبيرة وعريضة حتى «لا يفوت شيء». جرّب كل نسخة. أيّ نسخة تجعل ريم ترى بسرعة إن كان الموعد يناسبها؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"manara","name":{"en":"Manara Learning Hub","ar":"منارة"},"color":"#5B3FD6","icon":"chalkboard-teacher","domain":"manara.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Workshop","ar":"الورشة"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Sketch Your First App","ar":"ارسم تطبيقك الأول"}},{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Tuesday 17 November, 18:00–20:00","ar":"الثلاثاء 17 نوفمبر، من 18:00 إلى 20:00"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Downtown Learning Hub, Room 2","ar":"مركز التعلّم بوسط البلد، قاعة 2"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Free","ar":"مجاني"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"4 places left","ar":"باقي 4 أماكن"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Reserve a place","ar":"احجز مكانك"},"gap":"m"}]},"options":[{"id":"photo","text":{"en":"Make a photo the biggest thing, with all the facts small","ar":"اجعل صورة هي الأكبر، وكل المعلومات صغيرة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"manara","name":{"en":"Manara Learning Hub","ar":"منارة"},"color":"#5B3FD6","icon":"chalkboard-teacher","domain":"manara.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Workshop","ar":"الورشة"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"people","size":"l","text":{"en":"Photo: Learn together","ar":"صورة: نتعلّم معًا"}},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Sketch Your First App","ar":"ارسم تطبيقك الأول"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Tuesday 17 November, 18:00–20:00","ar":"الثلاثاء 17 نوفمبر، من 18:00 إلى 20:00"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Downtown Learning Hub, Room 2","ar":"مركز التعلّم بوسط البلد، قاعة 2"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Free","ar":"مجاني"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Reserve a place","ar":"احجز مكانك"},"gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"all","text":{"en":"Keep everything big and bold","ar":"أبقِ كل شيء كبيرًا وعريضًا"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"manara","name":{"en":"Manara Learning Hub","ar":"منارة"},"color":"#5B3FD6","icon":"chalkboard-teacher","domain":"manara.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Workshop","ar":"الورشة"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Sketch Your First App","ar":"ارسم تطبيقك الأول"}},{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Tuesday 17 November, 18:00–20:00","ar":"الثلاثاء 17 نوفمبر، من 18:00 إلى 20:00"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Downtown Learning Hub, Room 2","ar":"مركز التعلّم بوسط البلد، قاعة 2"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Free","ar":"مجاني"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"4 places left","ar":"باقي 4 أماكن"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Reserve a place","ar":"احجز مكانك"},"gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"two","text":{"en":"Title biggest, the time second, the rest in regular text","ar":"العنوان الأكبر، ثم الموعد، والباقي بنص عادي"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"manara","name":{"en":"Manara Learning Hub","ar":"منارة"},"color":"#5B3FD6","icon":"chalkboard-teacher","domain":"manara.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Workshop","ar":"الورشة"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Sketch Your First App","ar":"ارسم تطبيقك الأول"}},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Tuesday 17 November, 18:00–20:00","ar":"الثلاثاء 17 نوفمبر، من 18:00 إلى 20:00"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Downtown Learning Hub, Room 2","ar":"مركز التعلّم بوسط البلد، قاعة 2"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Free","ar":"مجاني"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"chip","text":{"en":"4 places left","ar":"باقي 4 أماكن"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Reserve a place","ar":"احجز مكانك"},"gap":"m"}]}}],"answer":["two"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P10-003","when":["all"],"feedback":{"en":"Five big lines compete, so none of them leads and Reem reads them all at the same weight. Choose two to make big.","ar":"خمسة أسطر كبيرة تتنافس، فلا يبرز أيّ منها، وتقرؤها ريم كلها بالوزن نفسه. اختر عنصرين فقط لتكبيرهما."}},{"id":"MC-P10-001","when":["photo"],"feedback":{"en":"Now the biggest thing is the one that tells Reem nothing about the time. Size should follow what she decides with.","ar":"الآن الأكبر هو الشيء الذي لا يخبر ريم بشيء عن الموعد. الحجم يجب أن يتبع ما تقرّر به."}}],"hints":[{"en":"If everything is big, what stands out?","ar":"إذا كان كل شيء كبيرًا، فما الذي يبرز؟"},{"en":"How many things should be big at most, and which fact decides it for Reem?","ar":"كم عنصرًا يجب أن يكون كبيرًا على الأكثر، وما المعلومة التي تحسم القرار لريم؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Two levels of big, and the rest calm.","ar":"عنصران كبيران فقط، والباقي هادئ."},"explain":{"en":"Make the most important element biggest, and no more than two elements big. The title says what it is; the time says if Reem can come. Everything else can be regular text.","ar":"اجعل الأهم هو الأكبر، ولا تكبّر أكثر من عنصرين. العنوان يقول ما هي الورشة، والموعد يقول إن كانت ريم تستطيع الحضور. والباقي يمكن أن يكون نصًّا عاديًا."}},{"id":"S05","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P10-U01-01","part":"guided","confidence":true,"rules":["R06","R15"],"value":{"en":"NN/g: keep major calls to action above the fold. A Reserve button after a long description is far from the facts that justify it.","ar":"NN/g: أبقِ أزرار الإجراء الرئيسية فوق خط الطيّ. زر الحجز بعد وصف طويل بعيد عن المعلومات التي تبرّره."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/scrolling-and-attention/","quote":"Keep major CTAs above the fold."},"prompt":{"en":"The page now has a long description, and Reserve sits under it. Where should Reserve go?","ar":"أصبح في الصفحة وصف طويل، وزر الحجز تحته. أين يجب أن يكون الزر؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"manara","name":{"en":"Manara Learning Hub","ar":"منارة"},"color":"#5B3FD6","icon":"chalkboard-teacher","domain":"manara.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Workshop","ar":"الورشة"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"Now: first screen","ar":"الآن: الشاشة الأولى"},"height":420,"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Sketch Your First App","ar":"ارسم تطبيقك الأول"}},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Tuesday 17 November, 18:00–20:00","ar":"الثلاثاء 17 نوفمبر، من 18:00 إلى 20:00"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Free","ar":"مجاني"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"In two hours you'll learn how designers turn an idea into screens. We start with what makes an app easy to use, look at a few real examples, and talk about why some screens confuse people.","ar":"خلال ساعتين ستتعلّم كيف يحوّل المصمّمون الفكرة إلى شاشات. نبدأ بما يجعل التطبيق سهل الاستخدام، ونرى أمثلة حقيقية، ونتحدّث عن سبب ارتباك الناس أمام بعض الشاشات."},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"Then you'll sketch your own app on paper, get feedback from the group, and leave with a plan for your next steps.","ar":"ثم ترسم تطبيقك على الورق، وتحصل على ملاحظات المجموعة، وتخرج بخطة لخطواتك التالية."},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Reserve a place","ar":"احجز مكانك"},"gap":"l"}]},"options":[{"id":"top","text":{"en":"At the very top, above the title","ar":"في أعلى الصفحة، فوق العنوان"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"manara","name":{"en":"Manara Learning Hub","ar":"منارة"},"color":"#5B3FD6","icon":"chalkboard-teacher","domain":"manara.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Workshop","ar":"الورشة"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Reserve a place","ar":"احجز مكانك"}},{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Sketch Your First App","ar":"ارسم تطبيقك الأول"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Tuesday 17 November, 18:00–20:00","ar":"الثلاثاء 17 نوفمبر، من 18:00 إلى 20:00"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Free","ar":"مجاني"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"In two hours you'll learn how designers turn an idea into screens…","ar":"خلال ساعتين ستتعلّم كيف يحوّل المصمّمون الفكرة إلى شاشات…"},"gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"after","text":{"en":"Right after the time and price, with the description below it","ar":"بعد الموعد والسعر مباشرة، والوصف تحته"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"manara","name":{"en":"Manara Learning Hub","ar":"منارة"},"color":"#5B3FD6","icon":"chalkboard-teacher","domain":"manara.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Workshop","ar":"الورشة"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Sketch Your First App","ar":"ارسم تطبيقك الأول"}},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Tuesday 17 November, 18:00–20:00","ar":"الثلاثاء 17 نوفمبر، من 18:00 إلى 20:00"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Free","ar":"مجاني"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Reserve a place","ar":"احجز مكانك"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"In two hours you'll learn how designers turn an idea into screens…","ar":"خلال ساعتين ستتعلّم كيف يحوّل المصمّمون الفكرة إلى شاشات…"},"gap":"l"}]}},{"id":"end","text":{"en":"Keep it under the description, so people read everything first","ar":"أبقِه تحت الوصف، حتى يقرأ الناس كل شيء أولًا"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"manara","name":{"en":"Manara Learning Hub","ar":"منارة"},"color":"#5B3FD6","icon":"chalkboard-teacher","domain":"manara.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Workshop","ar":"الورشة"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change: first screen","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير: الشاشة الأولى"},"height":420,"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Sketch Your First App","ar":"ارسم تطبيقك الأول"}},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Tuesday 17 November, 18:00–20:00","ar":"الثلاثاء 17 نوفمبر، من 18:00 إلى 20:00"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Free","ar":"مجاني"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"In two hours you'll learn how designers turn an idea into screens. We start with what makes an app easy to use, look at a few real examples, and talk about why some screens confuse people.","ar":"خلال ساعتين ستتعلّم كيف يحوّل المصمّمون الفكرة إلى شاشات. نبدأ بما يجعل التطبيق سهل الاستخدام، ونرى أمثلة حقيقية، ونتحدّث عن سبب ارتباك الناس أمام بعض الشاشات."},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"Then you'll sketch your own app on paper, get feedback from the group, and leave with a plan for your next steps.","ar":"ثم ترسم تطبيقك على الورق، وتحصل على ملاحظات المجموعة، وتخرج بخطة لخطواتك التالية."},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Reserve a place","ar":"احجز مكانك"},"gap":"l"}]}}],"answer":["after"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P10-005","when":["end"],"feedback":{"en":"On a phone the button drops below the first screen, away from the time and price that made Reem want it. Most people won't read the whole description first.","ar":"على الهاتف ينزل الزر تحت الشاشة الأولى، بعيدًا عن الموعد والسعر اللذين جعلا ريم تريده. ومعظم الناس لن يقرؤوا الوصف كله أولًا."}},{"id":"MC-P10-006","when":["top"],"feedback":{"en":"Now the button asks Reem to commit before she has seen the time. Facts first, then the action.","ar":"الآن يطلب الزر من ريم أن تحجز قبل أن ترى الموعد. المعلومات أولًا، ثم الإجراء."}}],"hints":[{"en":"When has Reem got what she needs to decide?","ar":"متى يكون لدى ريم كل ما تحتاجه لتقرّر؟"},{"en":"Should she scroll past the whole description to act, or reserve before she knows the time?","ar":"هل يجب أن تمرّ على الوصف كله لتتصرّف، أم تحجز قبل أن تعرف الموعد؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Decide, then act, on the first screen.","ar":"قرّر ثم تصرّف، في الشاشة الأولى."},"explain":{"en":"Keep the main action above the fold. Put Reserve right after the facts that justify it; people who want more can keep reading below.","ar":"أبقِ الإجراء الرئيسي فوق خط الطيّ. ضع زر الحجز بعد المعلومات التي تبرّره مباشرة، ومن يريد المزيد يكمل القراءة تحته."}},{"id":"S06","type":"compare","skill":"SK-P10-U01-03","part":"contrast","rules":["R11","R15"],"value":{"en":"NN/g's inverted pyramid: the first sentence of every paragraph should be the most important, because people scan. A friendly opening that delays the time costs the decision.","ar":"الهرم المقلوب من NN/g: الجملة الأولى في كل فقرة يجب أن تكون الأهم، لأن الناس يتصفّحون بسرعة. والمقدّمة اللطيفة التي تؤخّر الموعد تضيّع القرار."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/inverted-pyramid/","quote":"The first sentence of every paragraph should be the most important."},"prompt":{"en":"Reem reads only the first line of each description. In which version does that line tell her if she can come?","ar":"تقرأ ريم السطر الأول فقط من كل وصف. في أي نسخة يخبرها هذا السطر إن كانت تستطيع الحضور؟"},"a":{"mock":{"app":{"id":"manara","name":{"en":"Manara Learning Hub","ar":"منارة"},"color":"#5B3FD6","icon":"chalkboard-teacher","domain":"manara.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Workshop","ar":"الورشة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Sketch Your First App","ar":"ارسم تطبيقك الأول"}},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"Join a relaxed, friendly evening where you'll discover how designers think and meet people who love apps as much as you do. It runs from 18:00 to 20:00 and it's free.","ar":"انضم إلى أمسية هادئة وودودة تكتشف فيها كيف يفكّر المصمّمون، وتلتقي بأشخاص يحبّون التطبيقات مثلك. تبدأ الساعة 18:00 وتنتهي الساعة 20:00، وهي مجانية."},"gap":"s"}]}},"b":{"mock":{"app":{"id":"manara","name":{"en":"Manara Learning Hub","ar":"منارة"},"color":"#5B3FD6","icon":"chalkboard-teacher","domain":"manara.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Workshop","ar":"الورشة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Sketch Your First App","ar":"ارسم تطبيقك الأول"}},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"Free, from 18:00 to 20:00 on Tuesday. You'll sketch your first app screens on paper, with no design tool needed, and meet people who love apps as much as you do.","ar":"مجانية، من 18:00 إلى 20:00 يوم الثلاثاء. سترسم أول شاشات تطبيقك على الورق، دون أي أداة تصميم، وتلتقي بأشخاص يحبّون التطبيقات مثلك."},"gap":"s"}]}},"answer":"b","reason":{"prompt":{"en":"What makes B work?","ar":"ما الذي يجعل B تنجح؟"},"options":[{"id":"short","text":{"en":"It's shorter","ar":"لأنها أقصر"}},{"id":"tone","text":{"en":"Its tone is friendlier","ar":"لأن أسلوبها أكثر ودًّا"}},{"id":"first","text":{"en":"The time and price come in its first words","ar":"لأن الموعد والسعر في كلماتها الأولى"}}],"answer":["first"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P10-004","when":["short","tone"],"feedback":{"en":"Both are about the same length and both are friendly. The difference is where the time and price sit.","ar":"النصّان بالطول نفسه تقريبًا، وكلاهما ودود. الفرق هو مكان الموعد والسعر."}}]},"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P10-004","when":["a"],"feedback":{"en":"A's first line is all welcome and no facts. The time only arrives at the end, after Reem has stopped reading.","ar":"السطر الأول في A ترحيب فقط بلا معلومات. والموعد لا يأتي إلا في النهاية، بعد أن تتوقّف ريم عن القراءة."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Read only the first line of each version.","ar":"اقرأ السطر الأول فقط من كل نسخة."},{"en":"Which first line tells her the time?","ar":"أي سطر أول يخبرها بالموعد؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Lead with the facts; the warmth can follow.","ar":"ابدأ بالمعلومات، والودّ يأتي بعدها."},"explain":{"en":"People rarely read carefully on screens, so writing should follow the inverted pyramid: the conclusion first. Same words, better order.","ar":"الناس نادرًا ما يقرؤون بتمعّن على الشاشات، لذلك يجب أن تتبع الكتابة الهرم المقلوب: الخلاصة أولًا. الكلمات نفسها، بترتيب أفضل."}},{"id":"S07","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P10-U01-01","part":"independent","confidence":true,"rules":["R14","R19"],"value":{"en":"New case: on a delivery tracking screen the decision is \"when will it arrive?\". The arrival time leads; a big map and a promo don't.","ar":"حالة جديدة: في شاشة تتبّع التوصيل، السؤال هو «متى يصل الطلب؟». وقت الوصول يتصدّر، لا الخريطة الكبيرة ولا العرض الترويجي."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/inverted-pyramid/","quote":"the most important information"},"scenario":{"en":"My next project is a food delivery app. Lina ordered dinner, and she opens the tracking screen to see when it will arrive, so she can be at the door.","ar":"مشروعي التالي تطبيق لتوصيل الطعام. طلبت لينا العشاء، وفتحت شاشة التتبّع لتعرف متى يصل، حتى تكون عند الباب."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each version. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل نسخة. أيّها يجب أن يُطلق؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"tayyar","name":{"en":"Tayyar","ar":"طيّار"},"color":"#EA580C","icon":"moped","domain":"tayyar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Your order","ar":"طلبك"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"blocks":[{"kind":"banner","text":{"en":"20% off your next order","ar":"خصم 20% على طلبك القادم"}},{"kind":"image","art":"map","size":"l","text":{"en":"Map","ar":"خريطة"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Order A-2291: 2 shawarma, 1 salad","ar":"الطلب A-2291: 2 شاورما، 1 سلطة"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Arriving 19:40","ar":"يصل الساعة 19:40"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Driver: Karim · Call","ar":"السائق: كريم · اتصال"},"gap":"s"}]},"options":[{"id":"map","text":{"en":"Make the map full-screen so she can follow the driver","ar":"اجعل الخريطة بملء الشاشة حتى تتابع السائق"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"tayyar","name":{"en":"Tayyar","ar":"طيّار"},"color":"#EA580C","icon":"moped","domain":"tayyar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Your order","ar":"طلبك"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"map","size":"xl","text":{"en":"Map","ar":"خريطة"}},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Arriving 19:40","ar":"يصل الساعة 19:40"},"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"promo","text":{"en":"Keep the order, but make the offer smaller","ar":"أبقِ الترتيب، لكن صغّر العرض"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"tayyar","name":{"en":"Tayyar","ar":"طيّار"},"color":"#EA580C","icon":"moped","domain":"tayyar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Your order","ar":"طلبك"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"20% off your next order","ar":"خصم 20% على طلبك القادم"}},{"kind":"image","art":"map","size":"l","text":{"en":"Map","ar":"خريطة"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Order A-2291: 2 shawarma, 1 salad","ar":"الطلب A-2291: 2 شاورما، 1 سلطة"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Arriving 19:40","ar":"يصل الساعة 19:40"},"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"time","text":{"en":"The arrival time first and biggest, then the driver, the order and a smaller map; the offer last","ar":"وقت الوصول أولًا وبأكبر حجم، ثم السائق والطلب وخريطة أصغر؛ والعرض في الأخير"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"tayyar","name":{"en":"Tayyar","ar":"طيّار"},"color":"#EA580C","icon":"moped","domain":"tayyar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Your order","ar":"طلبك"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Arriving 19:40","ar":"يصل الساعة 19:40"}},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Driver: Karim · Call","ar":"السائق: كريم · اتصال"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Order A-2291: 2 shawarma, 1 salad","ar":"الطلب A-2291: 2 شاورما، 1 سلطة"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"image","art":"map","size":"m","text":{"en":"Map","ar":"خريطة"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"20% off your next order","ar":"خصم 20% على طلبك القادم"},"gap":"l"}]}}],"answer":["time"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P10-001","when":["map"],"feedback":{"en":"The map is the biggest thing on screen, but Lina still has to hunt for the one line she came for: when it arrives.","ar":"الخريطة هي الأكبر على الشاشة، لكن لينا ما زالت تبحث عن السطر الوحيد الذي جاءت من أجله: متى يصل الطلب."}},{"id":"MC-P10-015","when":["promo"],"feedback":{"en":"The offer and the map still come before the arrival time. Shrinking the promo doesn't move the answer up.","ar":"العرض والخريطة ما زالا قبل وقت الوصول. تصغير العرض لا يجعل وقت الوصول يظهر أولًا."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Why did Lina open this screen?","ar":"لماذا فتحت لينا هذه الشاشة؟"},{"en":"Which version answers that question first and biggest?","ar":"أي نسخة تجيب عن هذا السؤال أولًا وبأكبر حجم؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Answer the question she opened the screen for.","ar":"أجب عن السؤال الذي فتحت الشاشة من أجله."},"explain":{"en":"Same rule, new screen: the most important information first, and biggest. For tracking, that's the arrival time. The map supports it; the offer can wait.","ar":"القاعدة نفسها في شاشة جديدة: المعلومة الأهم أولًا وبأكبر حجم. وفي التتبّع هي وقت الوصول. الخريطة تدعمها، والعرض يمكنه الانتظار."},"speaker":"sara"},{"id":"S08","type":"card","part":"recap","icons":["fold","size","text","target"],"title":{"en":"What you did","ar":"ماذا تعلّمت"},"body":{"en":"- **First screen:** the facts that decide it, then the action.\n- **Two big things:** the title and the one fact that decides it.\n- **First words:** time and price before the welcome.\n- **New screen, same rule:** a tracking screen leads with the arrival time.\n\nNext lesson: what you can hide, and what you can't.","ar":"- **الشاشة الأولى:** المعلومات التي تحسم القرار، ثم الإجراء.\n- **عنصران كبيران:** العنوان والمعلومة التي تحسم القرار.\n- **الكلمات الأولى:** الموعد والسعر قبل الترحيب.\n- **شاشة جديدة والقاعدة نفسها:** شاشة التتبّع تبدأ بوقت الوصول.\n\nالدرس التالي: ما يمكنك إخفاؤه، وما لا يمكنك."}}]}$uxg$::jsonb),
  ($uxg$P10-U01-L02$uxg$, $uxg$9d59a3470db029e98855605924dafae2c977bb80e19655c27d66609d7735be3a$uxg$, $uxg${"id":"P10-U01-L02","mode":"lesson","minutes":9,"title":{"en":"What you can hide, and what you can't","ar":"ما يمكنك إخفاؤه، وما لا يمكنك"},"summary":{"en":"Decide what a workshop page can hide behind a link, and what must stay visible.","ar":"قرّر ما يمكن إخفاؤه خلف رابط في صفحة الورشة، وما يجب أن يبقى ظاهرًا."},"speaker":"sara","review_labels":{"MC-P10-002":{"en":"What people often need stays up front","ar":"ما يحتاجه الناس غالبًا يبقى ظاهرًا"},"MC-P10-007":{"en":"A link's label says what's behind it","ar":"اسم الرابط يقول ما خلفه"},"MC-P10-008":{"en":"Don't collapse what everyone needs","ar":"لا تطوِ ما يحتاجه الجميع"},"MC-P10-010":{"en":"Two levels of hiding at most","ar":"مستويان من الإخفاء كحدّ أقصى"},"MC-P10-011":{"en":"Keep what's decided together on one screen","ar":"ما يُقرَّر معًا يبقى في شاشة واحدة"},"MC-P10-016":{"en":"Show the few things most people need first","ar":"اعرض أولًا الأشياء القليلة التي يحتاجها معظم الناس"}},"steps":[{"id":"S01","type":"card","part":"hook","title":{"en":"A cleaner page?","ar":"صفحة أكثر ترتيبًا؟"},"body":{"en":"A teammate tidied my workshop page. The time, place, price and cancellation rule now sit behind one \"More details\" link. It looks calm.\n\nCan Reem still decide without digging?","ar":"رتّب أحد زملائي صفحة الورشة التي أصمّمها. أصبح الموعد والمكان والسعر وشرط الإلغاء خلف رابط واحد «تفاصيل أكثر». تبدو الصفحة هادئة.\n\nهل ما زالت ريم تستطيع أن تقرّر دون بحث؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"manara","name":{"en":"Manara Learning Hub","ar":"منارة"},"color":"#5B3FD6","icon":"chalkboard-teacher","domain":"manara.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Workshop","ar":"الورشة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Sketch Your First App","ar":"ارسم تطبيقك الأول"}},{"kind":"link","text":{"en":"More details","ar":"تفاصيل أكثر"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Reserve a place","ar":"احجز مكانك"},"gap":"l"}]}},{"id":"S02","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P10-U01-04","part":"try","rules":["R12"],"value":{"en":"Progressive disclosure (NN/g): everything people frequently need must be up front; only specialised details go behind a link.","ar":"الإفصاح التدريجي (NN/g): كل ما يحتاجه الناس كثيرًا يجب أن يكون ظاهرًا؛ والتفاصيل المتخصّصة فقط تذهب خلف رابط."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/progressive-disclosure/","quote":"You have to disclose everything that users frequently need up front"},"prompt":{"en":"Almost every visitor checks the time, place and price before reserving. Few read the full cancellation terms. Try each version. Which one should ship?","ar":"تقريبًا كل زائر يتحقّق من الموعد والمكان والسعر قبل الحجز. وقليلون يقرؤون شروط الإلغاء كاملة. جرّب كل نسخة. أيّ نسخة تجعل ريم تقرّر دون أن تبحث عن الموعد والمكان والسعر؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"manara","name":{"en":"Manara Learning Hub","ar":"منارة"},"color":"#5B3FD6","icon":"chalkboard-teacher","domain":"manara.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Workshop","ar":"الورشة"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Sketch Your First App","ar":"ارسم تطبيقك الأول"}},{"kind":"link","text":{"en":"More details","ar":"تفاصيل أكثر"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Reserve a place","ar":"احجز مكانك"},"gap":"l"}]},"options":[{"id":"price","text":{"en":"Show the price; keep the time and place behind More details","ar":"اعرض السعر، وأبقِ الموعد والمكان خلف «تفاصيل أكثر»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"manara","name":{"en":"Manara Learning Hub","ar":"منارة"},"color":"#5B3FD6","icon":"chalkboard-teacher","domain":"manara.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Workshop","ar":"الورشة"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Sketch Your First App","ar":"ارسم تطبيقك الأول"}},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Free","ar":"مجاني"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"link","text":{"en":"More details","ar":"تفاصيل أكثر"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Reserve a place","ar":"احجز مكانك"},"gap":"l"}]}},{"id":"often","text":{"en":"Show the time, place and price; keep the full cancellation terms behind a link","ar":"اعرض الموعد والمكان والسعر، وأبقِ شروط الإلغاء الكاملة خلف رابط"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"manara","name":{"en":"Manara Learning Hub","ar":"منارة"},"color":"#5B3FD6","icon":"chalkboard-teacher","domain":"manara.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Workshop","ar":"الورشة"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Sketch Your First App","ar":"ارسم تطبيقك الأول"}},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Tuesday 17 November, 18:00–20:00","ar":"الثلاثاء 17 نوفمبر، من 18:00 إلى 20:00"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Downtown Learning Hub, Room 2","ar":"مركز التعلّم بوسط البلد، قاعة 2"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Free","ar":"مجاني"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Reserve a place","ar":"احجز مكانك"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"link","text":{"en":"Cancellation terms","ar":"شروط الإلغاء"},"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"clean","text":{"en":"Keep it as it is: one clean link","ar":"أبقِها كما هي: رابط واحد، وصفحة مرتّبة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"manara","name":{"en":"Manara Learning Hub","ar":"منارة"},"color":"#5B3FD6","icon":"chalkboard-teacher","domain":"manara.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Workshop","ar":"الورشة"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Sketch Your First App","ar":"ارسم تطبيقك الأول"}},{"kind":"link","text":{"en":"More details","ar":"تفاصيل أكثر"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Reserve a place","ar":"احجز مكانك"},"gap":"l"}]}}],"answer":["often"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P10-002","when":["price","clean"],"feedback":{"en":"Almost everyone needs the time and place to decide. Hiding them makes nearly every visitor tap and come back. Hide only what few people need.","ar":"تقريبًا الجميع يحتاج إلى الموعد والمكان ليقرّر. وإخفاؤهما يجعل كل زائر تقريبًا يضغط ثم يعود. أخفِ فقط ما يحتاجه القليلون."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Almost every visitor checks three things. Are they visible?","ar":"كل الزوار تقريبًا يتحقّقون من ثلاثة أشياء. هل هي ظاهرة؟"},{"en":"What do few people read? That's what can sit behind a link.","ar":"ما الذي يقرؤه قليلون؟ هذا ما يمكن وضعه خلف رابط."}],"correct":{"en":"Show what most people need; tuck away what few do.","ar":"اعرض ما يحتاجه معظم الناس، وأخفِ ما يحتاجه القليلون."},"explain":{"en":"A tidy page that hides the facts everyone needs isn't simpler; it just moves the work to every visitor. Decide what goes up front by how often people need it.","ar":"الصفحة المرتّبة التي تُخفي ما يحتاجه الجميع ليست أبسط؛ بل تنقل العمل إلى كل زائر. قرّر ما يظهر أولًا حسب كثرة حاجة الناس إليه."}},{"id":"S03","type":"card","part":"concept","icons":["eye","list","text","layers","warn"],"title":{"en":"Show first, the rest on request","ar":"اعرض الأهم أولًا، والباقي عند الطلب"},"body":{"en":"Showing the essentials first and the rest on request is called **progressive disclosure**.\n\n- **Up front:** everything people frequently need, and only that.\n- **On request:** specialised details, behind a link or a section.\n- **Clear labels:** the link says exactly what's behind it.\n- **Two levels at most:** deeper nesting gets people lost.\n- **Collapsed sections:** fine when people need a few of them; bad when they need most of them.","ar":"عرض الأساسيات أولًا والباقي عند الطلب يُسمّى **الإفصاح التدريجي (Progressive disclosure)**.\n\n- **الظاهر أولًا:** كل ما يحتاجه الناس كثيرًا، وهذا فقط.\n- **عند الطلب:** التفاصيل المتخصّصة، خلف رابط أو قسم.\n- **أسماء واضحة:** الرابط يقول بالضبط ما خلفه.\n- **مستويان كحدّ أقصى:** التداخل الأعمق يُضيّع الناس.\n- **الأقسام المطويّة (Accordions):** مناسبة حين يحتاج الناس بعضها فقط؛ وسيّئة حين يحتاجون معظمها."}},{"id":"S04","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P10-U01-05","part":"guided","rules":["R06","R13"],"value":{"en":"NN/g: label the link to the secondary level so it sets clear expectations. \"More\" tells Reem nothing about whether her question is answered there.","ar":"NN/g: سمِّ الرابط إلى المستوى الثاني بما يوضّح ما سيأتي. «المزيد» لا يخبر ريم إن كان سؤالها يُجاب هناك."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/progressive-disclosure/","quote":"label the button or link in a way that sets clear expectations"},"scenario":{"en":"Reem wants to know if she can cancel and whether the room has step-free access. On my page, both answers are behind the link under Reserve.","ar":"تريد ريم أن تعرف إن كانت تستطيع الإلغاء، وإن كان الدخول إلى القاعة دون سلالم. وفي صفحتي، الإجابتان خلف الرابط تحت زر الحجز."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each label for that link. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل اسم لهذا الرابط. أيّ اسم يُخبر ريم قبل أن تضغط أن إجابتيها خلفه؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"manara","name":{"en":"Manara Learning Hub","ar":"منارة"},"color":"#5B3FD6","icon":"chalkboard-teacher","domain":"manara.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Workshop","ar":"الورشة"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Sketch Your First App","ar":"ارسم تطبيقك الأول"}},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Tuesday 17 November, 18:00–20:00","ar":"الثلاثاء 17 نوفمبر، من 18:00 إلى 20:00"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Free","ar":"مجاني"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Reserve a place","ar":"احجز مكانك"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"link","text":{"en":"More","ar":"المزيد"},"gap":"s"}]},"options":[{"id":"more","text":{"en":"\"More\"","ar":"«المزيد»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"manara","name":{"en":"Manara Learning Hub","ar":"منارة"},"color":"#5B3FD6","icon":"chalkboard-teacher","domain":"manara.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Workshop","ar":"الورشة"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Sketch Your First App","ar":"ارسم تطبيقك الأول"}},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Tuesday 17 November, 18:00–20:00","ar":"الثلاثاء 17 نوفمبر، من 18:00 إلى 20:00"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Free","ar":"مجاني"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Reserve a place","ar":"احجز مكانك"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"link","text":{"en":"More","ar":"المزيد"},"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"info","text":{"en":"\"Good to know\"","ar":"«معلومات مفيدة»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"manara","name":{"en":"Manara Learning Hub","ar":"منارة"},"color":"#5B3FD6","icon":"chalkboard-teacher","domain":"manara.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Workshop","ar":"الورشة"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Sketch Your First App","ar":"ارسم تطبيقك الأول"}},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Tuesday 17 November, 18:00–20:00","ar":"الثلاثاء 17 نوفمبر، من 18:00 إلى 20:00"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Free","ar":"مجاني"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Reserve a place","ar":"احجز مكانك"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"link","text":{"en":"Good to know","ar":"معلومات مفيدة"},"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"named","text":{"en":"\"Cancellation and step-free access\"","ar":"«الإلغاء والدخول دون سلالم»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"manara","name":{"en":"Manara Learning Hub","ar":"منارة"},"color":"#5B3FD6","icon":"chalkboard-teacher","domain":"manara.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Workshop","ar":"الورشة"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Sketch Your First App","ar":"ارسم تطبيقك الأول"}},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Tuesday 17 November, 18:00–20:00","ar":"الثلاثاء 17 نوفمبر، من 18:00 إلى 20:00"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Free","ar":"مجاني"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Reserve a place","ar":"احجز مكانك"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"link","text":{"en":"Cancellation and step-free access","ar":"الإلغاء والدخول دون سلالم"},"gap":"s"}]}}],"answer":["named"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P10-007","when":["more","info"],"feedback":{"en":"Reem can't tell if her questions are answered there until she taps. Name what's behind the link.","ar":"لا تعرف ريم إن كانت أسئلتها مُجابة هناك حتى تضغط. سمِّ ما خلف الرابط."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Before tapping, can Reem tell her answers are behind this link?","ar":"قبل أن تضغط، هل تعرف ريم أن إجاباتها خلف هذا الرابط؟"},{"en":"Which label names what's behind it?","ar":"أي تسمية تذكر ما خلفها؟"}],"correct":{"en":"The label tells her what she'll find.","ar":"الاسم يخبرها بما ستجده."},"explain":{"en":"Hidden content is only as findable as its label. A specific label lets people decide whether to tap, and lets those who need it find it straight away.","ar":"لن يجد الناس المحتوى المخفي إلا إذا كان اسمه واضحًا. والاسم المحدّد يجعل الناس يقرّرون هل يضغطون، ويجعل من يحتاجه يجده فورًا."},"speaker":"sara"},{"id":"S05","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P10-U01-04","part":"guided","rules":["R06","R15"],"value":{"en":"NN/g on accordions: when people need most of the sections, collapsing them adds clicks and hidden content may be missed altogether. Show them open, with headings.","ar":"NN/g عن الـ Accordions: حين يحتاج الناس معظم الأقسام، يضيف طيّها ضغطات، وقد يفوتهم المحتوى المخفي تمامًا. اعرضها مفتوحة بعناوين."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/accordions-on-desktop/","quote":"Valuable content that is hidden under an accordion may be missed altogether."},"scenario":{"en":"The day before the workshop, every attendee gets a \"Before you come\" page that I'm designing. Everyone needs all four parts of it.","ar":"قبل الورشة بيوم، تصل إلى كل مشارك صفحة «قبل أن تأتي» التي أصمّمها. والجميع يحتاج إلى أجزائها الأربعة كلها."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each layout. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل تخطيط. أيّ تخطيط يضمن أن يقرأ كل مشارك الأجزاء الأربعة؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"manara","name":{"en":"Manara Learning Hub","ar":"منارة"},"color":"#5B3FD6","icon":"chalkboard-teacher","domain":"manara.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Before you come","ar":"قبل أن تأتي"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Before you come","ar":"قبل أن تأتي"}},{"kind":"line","text":{"en":"What to bring ▾","ar":"ماذا تُحضر ▾"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"line","text":{"en":"How to find the room ▾","ar":"كيف تصل إلى القاعة ▾"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"line","text":{"en":"When to arrive ▾","ar":"متى تصل ▾"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"line","text":{"en":"If you can't make it ▾","ar":"إن لم تستطع الحضور ▾"},"gap":"xs"}]},"options":[{"id":"open","text":{"en":"All four parts open, each under its own heading","ar":"الأجزاء الأربعة مفتوحة، كلٌّ تحت عنوانه"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"manara","name":{"en":"Manara Learning Hub","ar":"منارة"},"color":"#5B3FD6","icon":"chalkboard-teacher","domain":"manara.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Before you come","ar":"قبل أن تأتي"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Before you come","ar":"قبل أن تأتي"}},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"What to bring","ar":"ماذا تُحضر"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"Pencil and paper. No laptop needed.","ar":"قلم وورق. لا تحتاج إلى Laptop."},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"How to find the room","ar":"كيف تصل إلى القاعة"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"Main entrance, lift to floor 1, Room 2.","ar":"المدخل الرئيسي، ثم المصعد إلى الطابق 1، القاعة 2."},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"When to arrive","ar":"متى تصل"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"10 minutes early; doors close at 18:05.","ar":"احضر قبل الموعد بـ10 دقائق؛ تُغلق الأبواب الساعة 18:05."},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"If you can't make it","ar":"إن لم تستطع الحضور"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"Cancel up to 24 hours before the start","ar":"يمكنك الإلغاء قبل الموعد بـ 24 ساعة على الأقل"},"gap":"xs"}]}},{"id":"closed","text":{"en":"Keep the four collapsed sections","ar":"أبقِ الأقسام الأربعة مطويّة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"manara","name":{"en":"Manara Learning Hub","ar":"منارة"},"color":"#5B3FD6","icon":"chalkboard-teacher","domain":"manara.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Before you come","ar":"قبل أن تأتي"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Before you come","ar":"قبل أن تأتي"}},{"kind":"line","text":{"en":"What to bring ▾","ar":"ماذا تُحضر ▾"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"line","text":{"en":"How to find the room ▾","ar":"كيف تصل إلى القاعة ▾"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"line","text":{"en":"When to arrive ▾","ar":"متى تصل ▾"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"line","text":{"en":"If you can't make it ▾","ar":"إن لم تستطع الحضور ▾"},"gap":"xs"}]}},{"id":"one","text":{"en":"One \"Read before you come\" link that opens everything","ar":"رابط واحد «اقرأ قبل أن تأتي» يفتح كل شيء"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"manara","name":{"en":"Manara Learning Hub","ar":"منارة"},"color":"#5B3FD6","icon":"chalkboard-teacher","domain":"manara.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Before you come","ar":"قبل أن تأتي"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Before you come","ar":"قبل أن تأتي"}},{"kind":"link","text":{"en":"Read before you come","ar":"اقرأ قبل أن تأتي"},"gap":"m"}]}}],"answer":["open"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P10-008","when":["closed","one"],"feedback":{"en":"Everyone needs every part, so everyone has to open everything, and some will skip a part they needed. Collapse only what most people don't need.","ar":"الجميع يحتاج إلى كل جزء، فعلى الجميع أن يفتحوا كل شيء، وسيفوت بعضهم جزءًا يحتاجه. اطوِ فقط ما لا يحتاجه معظم الناس."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Who needs these parts, and how many of them?","ar":"من يحتاج هذه الأجزاء، وكم جزءًا منها؟"},{"en":"If everyone needs every part, should they open each one?","ar":"إذا كان الجميع يحتاج كل جزء، فهل يجب أن يفتحوا كل واحد منها؟"}],"correct":{"en":"What everyone needs stays open.","ar":"ما يحتاجه الجميع يبقى مفتوحًا."},"explain":{"en":"Collapsed sections save space when people pick a few, as in a help page. When everyone needs all of them, collapsing only adds taps, and a hidden part can be missed completely. Headings keep the open page easy to scan.","ar":"الأقسام المطويّة توفّر المساحة حين يختار الناس بعضها، كما في صفحة المساعدة. وحين يحتاجها الجميع كلها، فالطيّ يضيف ضغطات فقط، وقد لا يرى الناس الجزء المخفي أبدًا. والعناوين تُبقي الصفحة المفتوحة سهلة التصفّح."},"speaker":"sara"},{"id":"S06","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P10-U01-05","part":"guided","rules":["R06","R15"],"value":{"en":"NN/g: designs that go beyond 2 disclosure levels typically have low usability because users get lost. Link straight to the rule.","ar":"NN/g: التصميمات التي تتجاوز مستويين من الإفصاح تكون سهولة استخدامها منخفضة عادةً، لأن المستخدمين يضيعون. اربط مباشرة بالشرط."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/progressive-disclosure/","quote":"beyond 2 disclosure levels typically have low usability"},"prompt":{"en":"To find the cancellation rule now, Reem opens More details, then Policies, then Cancellation. Try each fix. Which one should ship?","ar":"لتجد ريم شرط الإلغاء الآن، تفتح «تفاصيل أكثر»، ثم «السياسات»، ثم «الإلغاء». جرّب كل إصلاح. أيّ إصلاح يوصل ريم إلى شرط الإلغاء بأقل عدد من المستويات؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"manara","name":{"en":"Manara Learning Hub","ar":"منارة"},"color":"#5B3FD6","icon":"chalkboard-teacher","domain":"manara.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Workshop","ar":"الورشة"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"Now: three levels deep","ar":"الآن: ثلاثة مستويات"},"blocks":[{"kind":"link","text":{"en":"More details ›","ar":"تفاصيل أكثر ›"}},{"kind":"group","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"link","text":{"en":"Policies ›","ar":"السياسات ›"}},{"kind":"group","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"link","text":{"en":"Cancellation ›","ar":"الإلغاء ›"}},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Cancel up to 24 hours before the start","ar":"يمكنك الإلغاء قبل الموعد بـ 24 ساعة على الأقل"},"gap":"s"}]}]}]},"options":[{"id":"search","text":{"en":"Keep the levels, and add a search box to Policies","ar":"أبقِ المستويات، وأضف مربّع بحث إلى «السياسات»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"manara","name":{"en":"Manara Learning Hub","ar":"منارة"},"color":"#5B3FD6","icon":"chalkboard-teacher","domain":"manara.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Workshop","ar":"الورشة"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"link","text":{"en":"More details ›","ar":"تفاصيل أكثر ›"}},{"kind":"group","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"link","text":{"en":"Policies ›","ar":"السياسات ›"}},{"kind":"field","text":{"en":"Search policies","ar":"ابحث في السياسات"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"group","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"link","text":{"en":"Cancellation ›","ar":"الإلغاء ›"}},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Cancel up to 24 hours before the start","ar":"يمكنك الإلغاء قبل الموعد بـ 24 ساعة على الأقل"},"gap":"s"}]}]}]}},{"id":"direct","text":{"en":"One link under Reserve, \"Cancellation terms\", that opens the rule","ar":"رابط واحد تحت زر الحجز، «شروط الإلغاء»، يفتح الشرط مباشرة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"manara","name":{"en":"Manara Learning Hub","ar":"منارة"},"color":"#5B3FD6","icon":"chalkboard-teacher","domain":"manara.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Workshop","ar":"الورشة"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Reserve a place","ar":"احجز مكانك"}},{"kind":"link","text":{"en":"Cancellation terms ›","ar":"شروط الإلغاء ›"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"group","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Cancel up to 24 hours before the start","ar":"يمكنك الإلغاء قبل الموعد بـ 24 ساعة على الأقل"}}]}]}},{"id":"rename","text":{"en":"Keep the levels, but rename Policies to Rules","ar":"أبقِ المستويات، لكن غيّر «السياسات» إلى «القواعد»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"manara","name":{"en":"Manara Learning Hub","ar":"منارة"},"color":"#5B3FD6","icon":"chalkboard-teacher","domain":"manara.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Workshop","ar":"الورشة"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"link","text":{"en":"More details ›","ar":"تفاصيل أكثر ›"}},{"kind":"group","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"link","text":{"en":"Rules ›","ar":"القواعد ›"}},{"kind":"group","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"link","text":{"en":"Cancellation ›","ar":"الإلغاء ›"}},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Cancel up to 24 hours before the start","ar":"يمكنك الإلغاء قبل الموعد بـ 24 ساعة على الأقل"},"gap":"s"}]}]}]}}],"answer":["direct"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P10-010","when":["search","rename"],"feedback":{"en":"The rule is still three taps deep. Each extra level is another place to get lost. Keep it to two: the page, then the rule.","ar":"ما زال الشرط على بُعد ثلاث ضغطات. كل مستوى إضافي مكان آخر للضياع. اكتفِ بمستويين: الصفحة، ثم الشرط."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Count the taps Reem needs to reach the rule.","ar":"عُدّ الضغطات التي تحتاجها ريم للوصول إلى القاعدة."},{"en":"The fix should remove levels, not make the deep ones easier to search or read.","ar":"يجب أن يزيل الحل مستويات، لا أن يجعل المستويات العميقة أسهل في البحث أو القراءة."}],"correct":{"en":"Two levels: the page, then the detail.","ar":"مستويان: الصفحة، ثم التفاصيل."},"explain":{"en":"Hiding inside hiding gets people lost. Beyond two levels, people forget where they are and give up. Link straight from the page to the detail, with a label that names it.","ar":"الإخفاء داخل الإخفاء يُضيّع الناس. فبعد مستويين ينسون أين هم ويستسلمون. ضع في الصفحة رابطًا يفتح التفاصيل مباشرة، باسم يصفها."}},{"id":"S07","type":"compare","skill":"SK-P10-U01-05","part":"contrast","confidence":true,"rules":["R11","R15"],"value":{"en":"NN/g on staged disclosure: splitting steps is problematic when they're interdependent and users must alternate between them. A room choice depends on its price, so they share a screen.","ar":"NN/g عن الإفصاح على مراحل: تقسيم الخطوات مشكلة حين تعتمد على بعضها ويضطر المستخدمون إلى التنقّل بينها. اختيار الغرفة يعتمد على سعرها، فمكانهما شاشة واحدة."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/progressive-disclosure/","quote":"It is problematic when the steps are interdependent and users must alternate between them."},"scenario":{"en":"I'm also designing a hotel booking flow. Dalia will choose the room type partly by its price.","ar":"أصمّم أيضًا خطوات الحجز لفندق. وسعر الغرفة من الأمور التي ستختار داليا نوع الغرفة على أساسها."},"prompt":{"en":"Which version should ship?","ar":"أي نسخة تساعد داليا على اختيار نوع الغرفة وهي ترى سعره؟"},"a":{"label":{"en":"Step 1 of 2","ar":"الخطوة 1 من 2"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nuzul","name":{"en":"Nuzul","ar":"نُزُل"},"color":"#B7791F","icon":"bed","domain":"nuzul.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Choose a room","ar":"اختر غرفة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Choose a room","ar":"اختر غرفة"}},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Standard room","ar":"غرفة عادية"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Sea-view room","ar":"غرفة بإطلالة على البحر"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Family suite","ar":"جناح عائلي"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Next: see the price","ar":"التالي: اعرف السعر"},"gap":"m"}]}},"b":{"label":{"en":"One screen","ar":"شاشة واحدة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nuzul","name":{"en":"Nuzul","ar":"نُزُل"},"color":"#B7791F","icon":"bed","domain":"nuzul.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Choose a room","ar":"اختر غرفة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Choose a room","ar":"اختر غرفة"}},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Standard room · EGP 1,800 a night","ar":"غرفة عادية · 1,800 جنيه لليلة"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Sea-view room · EGP 2,600 a night","ar":"غرفة بإطلالة على البحر · 2,600 جنيه لليلة"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Family suite · EGP 3,900 a night","ar":"جناح عائلي · 3,900 جنيه لليلة"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Continue","ar":"متابعة"},"gap":"m"}]}},"answer":"b","reason":{"prompt":{"en":"Why is B better here?","ar":"لماذا B أفضل هنا؟"},"options":[{"id":"fewer","text":{"en":"Fewer steps are always better","ar":"الخطوات الأقل أفضل دائمًا"}},{"id":"depends","text":{"en":"The choice depends on the price, so they belong on the same screen","ar":"الاختيار يعتمد على السعر، فمكانهما الشاشة نفسها"}},{"id":"price","text":{"en":"Prices should always come first on any page","ar":"الأسعار يجب أن تأتي أولًا في أي صفحة"}}],"answer":["depends"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P10-011","when":["fewer","price"],"feedback":{"en":"Splitting steps is fine when they don't depend on each other, like payment after choosing. Here, choosing needs the price.","ar":"تقسيم الخطوات مقبول حين لا تعتمد على بعضها، مثل الدفع بعد الاختيار. لكن هنا يحتاج الاختيار إلى السعر."}}]},"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P10-011","when":["a"],"feedback":{"en":"In A, Dalia has to pick a room, see its price, go back, pick another, and remember each price. What's decided together should be shown together.","ar":"في A، على داليا أن تختار غرفة، ثم ترى سعرها، ثم تعود، ثم تختار أخرى، وتتذكّر كل سعر. ما يُقرَّر معًا يجب أن يُعرض معًا."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Dalia picks the room partly by its price. Where is the price in each version?","ar":"السعر من الأمور التي تختار داليا الغرفة على أساسها. أين السعر في كل نسخة؟"},{"en":"Should she have to go to another step to compare room and price?","ar":"هل يجب أن تنتقل إلى خطوة أخرى لتقارن بين الغرفة والسعر؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Show together what's decided together.","ar":"اعرض معًا ما يُقرَّر معًا."},"explain":{"en":"Splitting a task into steps helps when the steps don't depend on each other: choose a room, then pay. It hurts when people must go back and forth to compare. Room and price are one decision.","ar":"تقسيم المهمة إلى خطوات يفيد حين لا تعتمد الخطوات على بعضها: اختر الغرفة، ثم ادفع. ويضرّ حين يضطر الناس إلى الذهاب والعودة للمقارنة. الغرفة والسعر قرار واحد."},"speaker":"sara"},{"id":"S08","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P10-U01-04","part":"independent","rules":["R14","R19"],"value":{"en":"New case. NN/g: initially, show only a few of the most important options, and offer the specialised ones on request. Twelve equal settings bury the two everyone uses.","ar":"حالة جديدة. NN/g: اعرض في البداية بضعة خيارات هي الأهم فقط، وقدّم المتخصّصة عند الطلب. اثنا عشر إعدادًا متساويًا تدفن الإعدادين اللذين يستخدمهما الجميع."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/progressive-disclosure/","quote":"Initially, show users only a few of the most important options."},"scenario":{"en":"A client's home internet app: most people open it to change the Wi-Fi password or see who's connected. Its settings screen lists all 12 settings in one long list.","ar":"تطبيق الإنترنت المنزلي لأحد عملائي: معظم الناس يفتحونه لتغيير كلمة مرور الـ Wi-Fi أو لمعرفة من المتصل. وشاشة الإعدادات فيه تعرض الإعدادات الـ 12 كلها في قائمة طويلة واحدة."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each layout. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل تخطيط. أيّها يجب أن يُطلق؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"shabaka","name":{"en":"Shabaka","ar":"شبكة"},"color":"#0891B2","icon":"wifi-high","domain":"shabaka.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Settings","ar":"الإعدادات"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"height":330,"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Settings","ar":"الإعدادات"}},{"kind":"line","text":{"en":"DNS servers","ar":"خوادم الـ DNS"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"line","text":{"en":"Port forwarding","ar":"توجيه المنافذ"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"line","text":{"en":"Wi-Fi channel","ar":"قناة الـ Wi-Fi"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"line","text":{"en":"Firmware update","ar":"تحديث النظام"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"line","text":{"en":"Guest network","ar":"شبكة الضيوف"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"line","text":{"en":"Wi-Fi password","ar":"كلمة مرور الـ Wi-Fi"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"line","text":{"en":"IP settings","ar":"إعدادات الـ IP"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"line","text":{"en":"Connected devices","ar":"الأجهزة المتصلة"},"gap":"xs"}]},"options":[{"id":"one","text":{"en":"Put all 12 behind a single \"Settings\" button","ar":"ضع الـ 12 كلها خلف زر واحد «الإعدادات»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"shabaka","name":{"en":"Shabaka","ar":"شبكة"},"color":"#0891B2","icon":"wifi-high","domain":"shabaka.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Settings","ar":"الإعدادات"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Home internet","ar":"الإنترنت المنزلي"}},{"kind":"button","emphasis":"low","text":{"en":"Settings","ar":"الإعدادات"},"gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"few","text":{"en":"Wi-Fi password and connected devices first; the other 10 under \"Advanced settings\"","ar":"كلمة مرور الـ Wi-Fi والأجهزة المتصلة أولًا؛ والعشرة الباقية تحت «إعدادات متقدّمة»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"shabaka","name":{"en":"Shabaka","ar":"شبكة"},"color":"#0891B2","icon":"wifi-high","domain":"shabaka.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Settings","ar":"الإعدادات"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Settings","ar":"الإعدادات"}},{"kind":"line","text":{"en":"Wi-Fi password","ar":"كلمة مرور الـ Wi-Fi"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"line","text":{"en":"Connected devices","ar":"الأجهزة المتصلة"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"link","text":{"en":"Advanced settings (10) ›","ar":"إعدادات متقدّمة (10) ›"},"gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"sort","text":{"en":"Keep all 12 in one list, sorted A to Z","ar":"أبقِ الـ 12 في قائمة واحدة، مرتّبة أبجديًا"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"shabaka","name":{"en":"Shabaka","ar":"شبكة"},"color":"#0891B2","icon":"wifi-high","domain":"shabaka.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Settings","ar":"الإعدادات"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"height":330,"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Settings","ar":"الإعدادات"}},{"kind":"line","text":{"en":"Connected devices","ar":"الأجهزة المتصلة"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"line","text":{"en":"DNS servers","ar":"خوادم الـ DNS"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"line","text":{"en":"Firmware update","ar":"تحديث النظام"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"line","text":{"en":"Guest network","ar":"شبكة الضيوف"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"line","text":{"en":"IP settings","ar":"إعدادات الـ IP"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"line","text":{"en":"Port forwarding","ar":"توجيه المنافذ"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"line","text":{"en":"Wi-Fi channel","ar":"قناة الـ Wi-Fi"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"line","text":{"en":"Wi-Fi password","ar":"كلمة مرور الـ Wi-Fi"},"gap":"xs"}]}}],"answer":["few"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P10-016","when":["sort"],"feedback":{"en":"Sorting doesn't change the problem: the two settings almost everyone needs are still buried among ten that few people touch.","ar":"الترتيب لا يغيّر المشكلة: الإعدادان اللذان يحتاجهما الجميع تقريبًا ما زالا مدفونين بين عشرة لا يلمسها إلا القليلون."}},{"id":"MC-P10-002","when":["one"],"feedback":{"en":"Now everyone, including people who only want the Wi-Fi password, has to open a button first. Keep the frequent settings visible.","ar":"الآن على الجميع، حتى من يريد كلمة مرور الـ Wi-Fi فقط، أن يفتح زرًّا أولًا. أبقِ الإعدادات الشائعة ظاهرة."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Which two settings do most people open the app for?","ar":"ما الإعدادان اللذان يفتح أغلب الناس التطبيق من أجلهما؟"},{"en":"Hide everything, and the common two get lost too. Show everything, and they're hard to find.","ar":"إذا أخفيت كل شيء ضاع الإعدادان الشائعان أيضًا. وإذا أظهرت كل شيء صعب العثور عليهما."}],"correct":{"en":"The few everyone uses, then the rest on request.","ar":"القليل الذي يستخدمه الجميع، ثم الباقي عند الطلب."},"explain":{"en":"Same rule as Reem's page, on a settings screen: show the few things most people need, and put the specialised ones one clearly named tap away.","ar":"القاعدة نفسها التي طبّقتها في صفحة ريم، لكن على شاشة إعدادات: اعرض الأشياء القليلة التي يحتاجها معظم الناس، واجعل المتخصّصة تظهر بضغطة واحدة على رابط واضح الاسم."},"speaker":"sara"},{"id":"S09","type":"card","part":"recap","icons":["eye","text","layers","list"],"title":{"en":"What you did","ar":"ماذا تعلّمت"},"body":{"en":"- **Up front:** what almost everyone needs; only rare details go behind a link.\n- **Labels:** the link names what's behind it.\n- **Open, not collapsed:** when everyone needs every part.\n- **Two levels, one screen:** no hiding inside hiding, and what's decided together stays together.\n\nNext lesson: what people skip without reading.","ar":"- **الظاهر أولًا:** ما يحتاجه الجميع تقريبًا، والتفاصيل النادرة فقط خلف رابط.\n- **الأسماء:** الرابط يسمّي ما خلفه.\n- **مفتوح لا مطويّ:** حين يحتاج الجميع كل جزء.\n- **مستويان وشاشة واحدة:** لا إخفاء داخل إخفاء، وما يُقرَّر معًا يبقى معًا.\n\nالدرس التالي: ما يتخطّاه الناس دون قراءة."}}]}$uxg$::jsonb),
  ($uxg$P10-U01-L03$uxg$, $uxg$ea332cf29fe7be21f072344cb00a4b576db78c7b5285d94a3d8a0cfbb408b053$uxg$, $uxg${"id":"P10-U01-L03","mode":"lesson","minutes":8,"title":{"en":"What people skip without reading","ar":"ما يتخطّاه الناس دون قراءة"},"summary":{"en":"Rescue key notes that look like ads and banners people skip without reading.","ar":"أنقذ الملاحظات المهمة التي تبدو كإعلانات، فيتخطّاها الناس دون قراءة."},"speaker":"sara","review_labels":{"MC-P10-012":{"en":"Generic stock photos get skipped","ar":"الصور الجاهزة العامة (Stock photos) يتخطّاها الناس"},"MC-P10-013":{"en":"Don't style real content like an ad","ar":"لا تجعل المحتوى الحقيقي يشبه الإعلان"},"MC-P10-014":{"en":"Content next to ads is taken for an ad","ar":"المحتوى بجانب الإعلانات يُعامل كإعلان"},"MC-P10-017":{"en":"Keep content and offers in separate sections","ar":"افصل المحتوى عن العروض في أقسام مختلفة"},"MC-P10-018":{"en":"A photo that shows the real thing is content","ar":"الصورة التي تُظهر الشيء الحقيقي محتوى"}},"steps":[{"id":"S01","type":"card","part":"hook","title":{"en":"\"Make it pop\"","ar":"«اجعلها لافتة»"},"body":{"en":"The marketing team wants my workshop page to feel more exciting. They added a big photo of smiling people and want the important notes in bright colourful strips.\n\nBright things get attention. But do people actually read them?","ar":"يريد فريق التسويق أن تبدو صفحة الورشة التي أصمّمها أكثر جاذبية. أضافوا صورة كبيرة لأشخاص يبتسمون، ويريدون وضع الملاحظات المهمّة في أشرطة بألوان زاهية.\n\nالألوان الزاهية تلفت الانتباه. لكن هل يقرؤها الناس فعلًا؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"manara","name":{"en":"Manara Learning Hub","ar":"منارة"},"color":"#5B3FD6","icon":"chalkboard-teacher","domain":"manara.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Workshop","ar":"الورشة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"people","size":"l","text":{"en":"Photo: smiling people at a laptop","ar":"صورة: أشخاص يبتسمون أمام Laptop"}},{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Sketch Your First App","ar":"ارسم تطبيقك الأول"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Tuesday 17 November, 18:00–20:00","ar":"الثلاثاء 17 نوفمبر، من 18:00 إلى 20:00"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Downtown Learning Hub, Room 2","ar":"مركز التعلّم بوسط البلد، قاعة 2"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Reserve a place","ar":"احجز مكانك"},"gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"S02","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P10-U01-07","part":"try","rules":["R12"],"value":{"en":"Photos as web content (NN/g): users ignore stock photos of generic people and other purely decorative images, but study images that carry information relevant to their task.","ar":"الصور كمحتوى (NN/g): يتجاهل المستخدمون صور الـ Stock لأشخاص عامّين وكل صورة للزينة فقط، لكنهم يتأمّلون الصور التي تحمل معلومة تخصّ مهمّتهم."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/photos-as-web-content/","quote":"users ignore stock photos of generic people"},"prompt":{"en":"The workshop teaches people to sketch app screens on paper. Try each photo change. Which one should ship?","ar":"تعلّم الورشة الناس رسم شاشات التطبيقات على الورق. جرّب كل تغيير في الصورة. أيّ تغيير يُري ريم ما ستفعله في الورشة؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"manara","name":{"en":"Manara Learning Hub","ar":"منارة"},"color":"#5B3FD6","icon":"chalkboard-teacher","domain":"manara.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Workshop","ar":"الورشة"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"height":380,"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"people","size":"l","text":{"en":"Photo: smiling people at a laptop","ar":"صورة: أشخاص يبتسمون أمام Laptop"}},{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Sketch Your First App","ar":"ارسم تطبيقك الأول"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Tuesday 17 November, 18:00–20:00","ar":"الثلاثاء 17 نوفمبر، من 18:00 إلى 20:00"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Downtown Learning Hub, Room 2","ar":"مركز التعلّم بوسط البلد، قاعة 2"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Reserve a place","ar":"احجز مكانك"},"gap":"m"}]},"options":[{"id":"bigger","text":{"en":"Make the smiling-people photo bigger so the page feels warmer","ar":"كبّر صورة الأشخاص المبتسمين حتى تبدو الصفحة أدفأ"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"manara","name":{"en":"Manara Learning Hub","ar":"منارة"},"color":"#5B3FD6","icon":"chalkboard-teacher","domain":"manara.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Workshop","ar":"الورشة"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"height":380,"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"people","size":"l","height":250,"text":{"en":"Photo: smiling people at a laptop","ar":"صورة: أشخاص يبتسمون أمام Laptop"}},{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Sketch Your First App","ar":"ارسم تطبيقك الأول"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Tuesday 17 November, 18:00–20:00","ar":"الثلاثاء 17 نوفمبر، من 18:00 إلى 20:00"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Downtown Learning Hub, Room 2","ar":"مركز التعلّم بوسط البلد، قاعة 2"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Reserve a place","ar":"احجز مكانك"},"gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"caption","text":{"en":"Keep the photo and add a caption on it: \"Join us!\"","ar":"أبقِ الصورة وأضف عليها عبارة: «انضم إلينا!»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"manara","name":{"en":"Manara Learning Hub","ar":"منارة"},"color":"#5B3FD6","icon":"chalkboard-teacher","domain":"manara.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Workshop","ar":"الورشة"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"height":380,"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"people","size":"l","text":{"en":"Photo: smiling people at a laptop · \"Join us!\"","ar":"صورة: أشخاص يبتسمون أمام Laptop · «انضم إلينا!»"}},{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Sketch Your First App","ar":"ارسم تطبيقك الأول"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Tuesday 17 November, 18:00–20:00","ar":"الثلاثاء 17 نوفمبر، من 18:00 إلى 20:00"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Downtown Learning Hub, Room 2","ar":"مركز التعلّم بوسط البلد، قاعة 2"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Reserve a place","ar":"احجز مكانك"},"gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"real","text":{"en":"Replace it with a smaller photo of paper sketches made in last month's class, under the facts","ar":"استبدلها بصورة أصغر لرسومات ورقية صنعها المشاركون في ورشة الشهر الماضي، تحت المعلومات"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"manara","name":{"en":"Manara Learning Hub","ar":"منارة"},"color":"#5B3FD6","icon":"chalkboard-teacher","domain":"manara.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Workshop","ar":"الورشة"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"height":380,"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Sketch Your First App","ar":"ارسم تطبيقك الأول"}},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Tuesday 17 November, 18:00–20:00","ar":"الثلاثاء 17 نوفمبر، من 18:00 إلى 20:00"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Downtown Learning Hub, Room 2","ar":"مركز التعلّم بوسط البلد، قاعة 2"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Reserve a place","ar":"احجز مكانك"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"image","art":"workshop","size":"m","text":{"en":"Photo: app sketches from last month's class","ar":"صورة: رسومات تطبيقات من ورشة الشهر الماضي"},"gap":"m"}]}}],"answer":["real"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P10-012","when":["bigger","caption"],"feedback":{"en":"A photo of generic smiling people tells Reem nothing about the workshop, so people scroll past it. A bigger photo or a slogan only pushes the facts further down.","ar":"صورة أشخاص عاديين يبتسمون لا تخبر ريم بشيء عن الورشة، لذلك يتخطّاها الناس. وتكبيرها أو إضافة شعار عليها يدفع المعلومات إلى الأسفل أكثر."}}],"hints":[{"en":"What does the workshop actually teach?","ar":"ماذا تعلّم الورشة فعلًا؟"},{"en":"Which photo shows Reem what she'll do there?","ar":"أي صورة تُري ريم ما ستفعله هناك؟"}],"correct":{"en":"A photo that shows what she'll actually do.","ar":"صورة تُظهر ما ستفعله فعلًا."},"explain":{"en":"People skip decorative photos of generic people. A photo of real sketches from the class shows what Reem will make, so it carries information, and it doesn't push the facts down.","ar":"يتخطّى الناس الصور التزيينية لأشخاص عاديين. أما صورة رسومات حقيقية من الورشة فتُظهر ما ستصنعه ريم، فهي تحمل معلومة، ولا تدفع المعلومات إلى الأسفل."}},{"id":"S03","type":"card","part":"concept","icons":["eye","warn","layers","ok"],"title":{"en":"What eyes skip","ar":"ما تتخطّاه العيون"},"body":{"en":"People have learned to skip anything that looks like an ad, without reading it. This is called **banner blindness**.\n\n- **Decorative photos:** generic smiling people get skipped; photos that show the real thing get studied.\n- **Ad-like style:** a bright box that looks different from the rest of the page reads as an ad, even if it's important.\n- **Ad places:** content placed next to ads, or in the side column where ads usually sit, gets ignored too.\n- **What works:** keep important content in the main column, in the page's own style, and separate from offers.","ar":"تعلّم الناس أن يتخطّوا كل ما يشبه الإعلان دون قراءته. وهذا يُسمّى **عمى الإعلانات (Banner blindness)**.\n\n- **الصور التزيينية:** صور الأشخاص العاديين المبتسمين يتخطّاها الناس؛ والصور التي تُظهر الشيء الحقيقي يتأمّلونها.\n- **شكل الإعلان:** الصندوق الزاهي المختلف عن باقي الصفحة يُقرأ كإعلان، حتى لو كان مهمًّا.\n- **أماكن الإعلانات:** المحتوى الموضوع بجانب الإعلانات، أو في العمود الجانبي حيث تكون الإعلانات عادةً، يُتجاهل أيضًا.\n- **ما ينجح:** أبقِ المحتوى المهم في العمود الرئيسي، بشكل الصفحة نفسه، ومنفصلًا عن العروض."}},{"id":"S04","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P10-U01-06","part":"guided","rules":["R06","R13"],"value":{"en":"Banner blindness (NN/g): do not make content look like ads. Making it look different from the rest of the site to raise its salience often has the opposite effect.","ar":"عمى الإعلانات (NN/g): لا تجعل المحتوى يشبه الإعلانات. جعله مختلفًا عن باقي الموقع لزيادة بروزه يأتي غالبًا بعكس النتيجة."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/banner-blindness-old-and-new-findings/","quote":"Do not make content look like ads."},"scenario":{"en":"Every attendee must bring pencil and paper; there are none at the venue. Marketing put this note in a bright strip at the top of my page.","ar":"يجب أن يُحضر كل مشارك قلمًا وورقًا، فلا يوجد منها شيء في المكان. وضع فريق التسويق هذه الملاحظة في شريط زاهي الألوان أعلى صفحتي."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each version of the note. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل نسخة من الملاحظة. أيّ نسخة تجعل المشاركين يقرؤون أن عليهم إحضار قلم وورق؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"manara","name":{"en":"Manara Learning Hub","ar":"منارة"},"color":"#5B3FD6","icon":"chalkboard-teacher","domain":"manara.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Workshop","ar":"الورشة"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"blocks":[{"kind":"banner","text":{"en":"★ Bring pencil and paper! ★","ar":"★ أحضر قلمًا وورقًا! ★"}},{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Sketch Your First App","ar":"ارسم تطبيقك الأول"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Tuesday 17 November, 18:00–20:00","ar":"الثلاثاء 17 نوفمبر، من 18:00 إلى 20:00"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Downtown Learning Hub, Room 2","ar":"مركز التعلّم بوسط البلد، قاعة 2"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Reserve a place","ar":"احجز مكانك"},"gap":"m"}]},"options":[{"id":"louder","text":{"en":"Make the strip brighter, with an animated star","ar":"اجعل الشريط أكثر سطوعًا، مع نجمة متحرّكة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"manara","name":{"en":"Manara Learning Hub","ar":"منارة"},"color":"#5B3FD6","icon":"chalkboard-teacher","domain":"manara.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Workshop","ar":"الورشة"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"banner","tone":"bad","text":{"en":"✨ Bring pencil and paper! ✨","ar":"✨ أحضر قلمًا وورقًا! ✨"}},{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Sketch Your First App","ar":"ارسم تطبيقك الأول"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Tuesday 17 November, 18:00–20:00","ar":"الثلاثاء 17 نوفمبر، من 18:00 إلى 20:00"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Downtown Learning Hub, Room 2","ar":"مركز التعلّم بوسط البلد، قاعة 2"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Reserve a place","ar":"احجز مكانك"},"gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"plain","text":{"en":"A plain line with the other facts: \"Bring pencil and paper; none at the venue\"","ar":"سطر عادي مع باقي المعلومات: «أحضر قلمًا وورقًا؛ لا توجد في المكان»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"manara","name":{"en":"Manara Learning Hub","ar":"منارة"},"color":"#5B3FD6","icon":"chalkboard-teacher","domain":"manara.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Workshop","ar":"الورشة"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Sketch Your First App","ar":"ارسم تطبيقك الأول"}},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Tuesday 17 November, 18:00–20:00","ar":"الثلاثاء 17 نوفمبر، من 18:00 إلى 20:00"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Downtown Learning Hub, Room 2","ar":"مركز التعلّم بوسط البلد، قاعة 2"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Bring pencil and paper; none at the venue","ar":"أحضر قلمًا وورقًا؛ لا توجد في المكان"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Reserve a place","ar":"احجز مكانك"},"gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"image","text":{"en":"Turn it into a picture of a pencil with the words on it","ar":"حوّلها إلى صورة قلم مكتوب عليها الملاحظة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"manara","name":{"en":"Manara Learning Hub","ar":"منارة"},"color":"#5B3FD6","icon":"chalkboard-teacher","domain":"manara.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Workshop","ar":"الورشة"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","size":"m","text":{"en":"✏️ Bring pencil and paper!","ar":"✏️ أحضر قلمًا وورقًا!"}},{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Sketch Your First App","ar":"ارسم تطبيقك الأول"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Tuesday 17 November, 18:00–20:00","ar":"الثلاثاء 17 نوفمبر، من 18:00 إلى 20:00"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Downtown Learning Hub, Room 2","ar":"مركز التعلّم بوسط البلد، قاعة 2"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Reserve a place","ar":"احجز مكانك"},"gap":"m"}]}}],"answer":["plain"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P10-013","when":["louder","image"],"feedback":{"en":"A bright strip or a picture at the top looks like an ad, so people skip it. Put the note with the facts, in the same style.","ar":"الشريط الزاهي أو الصورة في الأعلى يشبهان الإعلان، فيتخطّاهما الناس. ضع الملاحظة مع المعلومات، بالشكل نفسه."}}],"hints":[{"en":"What do people do with things that look like ads?","ar":"ماذا يفعل الناس بالأشياء التي تبدو كإعلانات؟"},{"en":"Which version looks like the rest of the page's facts?","ar":"أي نسخة تبدو مثل بقية المعلومات في الصفحة؟"}],"correct":{"en":"In the page's own style, with the facts.","ar":"بشكل الصفحة نفسه، مع المعلومات."},"explain":{"en":"Making something look different to get attention often backfires: people take it for an ad and skip it. A plain line among the facts is read along with them.","ar":"جعل الشيء مختلفًا ليلفت الانتباه يأتي غالبًا بعكس النتيجة: يظنّه الناس إعلانًا ويتخطّونه. أما السطر العادي بين المعلومات فيُقرأ معها."},"speaker":"sara"},{"id":"S05","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P10-U01-06","part":"guided","rules":["R06","R15"],"value":{"en":"Banner blindness (NN/g): do not mix content and ads in the same visual section; content placed with ads is often taken for an ad and ignored.","ar":"عمى الإعلانات (NN/g): لا تخلط المحتوى بالإعلانات في القسم البصري نفسه؛ فالمحتوى الموضوع مع الإعلانات يُعامل غالبًا كإعلان ويُتجاهل."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/banner-blindness-old-and-new-findings/","quote":"Do not mix content and ads in the same visual section."},"scenario":{"en":"Tuesday's workshop is now full, and the next session is a week later. My page also shows two partner offers. Right now, the next session sits in one row with the offers.","ar":"اكتملت ورشة الثلاثاء، والجلسة التالية بعد أسبوع. وتعرض صفحتي أيضًا عرضين من شركاء. الآن، الجلسة التالية في صف واحد مع العروض."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each layout. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل تخطيط. أيّها يجب أن يُطلق؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"manara","name":{"en":"Manara Learning Hub","ar":"منارة"},"color":"#5B3FD6","icon":"chalkboard-teacher","domain":"manara.example"},"appbar":{