الأسفل"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"manara","name":{"en":"Manara Learning Hub","ar":"منارة"},"color":"#5B3FD6","icon":"chalkboard-teacher","domain":"manara.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Workshop","ar":"الورشة"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Sketch Your First App","ar":"ارسم تطبيقك الأول"}},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Fully booked","ar":"اكتمل الحجز"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Next session: Tuesday 24 November, 18:00","ar":"الجلسة التالية: الثلاثاء 24 نوفمبر، 18:00"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Join the waiting list","ar":"انضم إلى قائمة الانتظار"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Partner offers","ar":"عروض الشركاء"},"gap":"l"},{"kind":"row","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"banner","text":{"en":"Partner: drawing tablets 20% off","ar":"شريك: خصم 20% على ألواح الرسم"}},{"kind":"banner","text":{"en":"Partner: online design course","ar":"شريك: كورس تصميم أونلاين"}}]}]}},{"id":"first","text":{"en":"Keep the row, but move the next-session card to the start of it","ar":"أبقِ الصف، لكن انقل بطاقة الجلسة التالية إلى أوّله"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"manara","name":{"en":"Manara Learning Hub","ar":"منارة"},"color":"#5B3FD6","icon":"chalkboard-teacher","domain":"manara.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Workshop","ar":"الورشة"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Sketch Your First App","ar":"ارسم تطبيقك الأول"}},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Fully booked","ar":"اكتمل الحجز"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"You may also like","ar":"قد يعجبك أيضًا"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"row","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"banner","text":{"en":"Next session: Tuesday 24 November, 18:00","ar":"الجلسة التالية: الثلاثاء 24 نوفمبر، 18:00"}},{"kind":"banner","text":{"en":"Partner: drawing tablets 20% off","ar":"شريك: خصم 20% على ألواح الرسم"}},{"kind":"banner","text":{"en":"Partner: online design course","ar":"شريك: كورس تصميم أونلاين"}}]}]}}],"answer":["apart"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P10-017","when":["big","first"],"feedback":{"en":"As long as the next session sits in the same row as the offers, people treat the whole row as ads and skip it. Give it its own place, with the facts.","ar":"ما دامت الجلسة التالية في صف واحد مع العروض، سيعامل الناس الصف كله كإعلانات ويتخطّونه. ضعها في مكانها الخاص، مع المعلومات."}}],"hints":[{"en":"What does Reem see next to the next session? Does it look like an offer too?","ar":"ماذا ترى ريم بجانب الجلسة التالية؟ هل تبدو هي أيضًا كعرض؟"},{"en":"Making the card bigger or moving it first keeps it in the same row. What separates it?","ar":"تكبير البطاقة أو نقلها للأول يبقيها في الصف نفسه. ما الذي يفصلها؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Content with content, offers with offers.","ar":"المحتوى مع المحتوى، والعروض مع العروض."},"explain":{"en":"When content shares a section with ads, people judge the whole section as ads. The next session is what a visitor needs after \"Fully booked\", so it goes right there, apart from the offers.","ar":"حين يشارك المحتوى الإعلانات في قسم واحد، يحكم الناس على القسم كله بأنه إعلانات. والجلسة التالية هي ما يحتاجه الزائر بعد «اكتمل الحجز»، فمكانها هناك مباشرة، بعيدًا عن العروض."},"speaker":"sara"},{"id":"S06","type":"compare","skill":"SK-P10-U01-07","part":"contrast","confidence":true,"rules":["R11","R15"],"value":{"en":"Contrast with S02 and Lesson 1: photos aren't always decoration. NN/g: users pay attention to information-carrying images relevant to the task. When the photos are what the person judges, they lead.","ar":"مقارنة مع الخطوة 2 والدرس الأول: الصور ليست دائمًا للزينة. NN/g: ينتبه المستخدمون للصور التي تحمل معلومة تخصّ مهمّتهم. وحين تكون الصور هي ما يحكم به الشخص، تأتي أولًا."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/photos-as-web-content/","quote":"users pay attention to information-carrying images"},"scenario":{"en":"On a rental app I'm designing, Reham is looking for a flat. She already filtered by area and price; now she's judging whether the rooms are bright and big enough.","ar":"في تطبيق إيجار أصمّمه، تبحث رهام عن شقة. سبق أن صفّت النتائج حسب المنطقة والسعر؛ والآن تحكم إن كانت الغرف مضيئة وواسعة بما يكفي."},"prompt":{"en":"Which version of the listing should ship?","ar":"أي نسخة من إعلان الشقة تساعد رهام على الحكم هل الغرف مضيئة وواسعة؟"},"a":{"label":{"en":"Facts first","ar":"المعلومات أولًا"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"beyouti","name":{"en":"Beyouti","ar":"بيوتي"},"color":"#E11D48","icon":"house","domain":"beyouti.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Flat details","ar":"تفاصيل الشقة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Two-bedroom flat, 3rd floor","ar":"شقة بغرفتي نوم، الطابق الثالث"}},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"EGP 9,000 a month · 95 m²","ar":"9,000 جنيه في الشهر · 95 م²"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Contact the owner","ar":"تواصل مع المالك"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"image","art":"family","size":"m","text":{"en":"Photo: a happy family on a sofa","ar":"صورة: عائلة سعيدة على أريكة"},"gap":"m"}]}},"b":{"label":{"en":"Room photos first","ar":"صور الغرف أولًا"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"beyouti","name":{"en":"Beyouti","ar":"بيوتي"},"color":"#E11D48","icon":"house","domain":"beyouti.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Flat details","ar":"تفاصيل الشقة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"row","blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"hotel-room","size":"m","text":{"en":"Photo: this flat's living room","ar":"صورة: صالة هذه الشقة"}},{"kind":"image","art":"hotel-room","size":"m","text":{"en":"Photo: this flat's bedroom","ar":"صورة: غرفة النوم في هذه الشقة"}}]},{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Two-bedroom flat, 3rd floor","ar":"شقة بغرفتي نوم، الطابق الثالث"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"EGP 9,000 a month · 95 m²","ar":"9,000 جنيه في الشهر · 95 م²"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Contact the owner","ar":"تواصل مع المالك"},"gap":"m"}]}},"answer":"b","reason":{"prompt":{"en":"Why do the photos lead here?","ar":"لماذا تأتي الصور أولًا هنا؟"},"options":[{"id":"pretty","text":{"en":"Photos make any page more attractive","ar":"الصور تجعل أي صفحة أكثر جاذبية"}},{"id":"people","text":{"en":"Photos without people always work better","ar":"الصور التي ليس فيها أشخاص تنجح دائمًا أكثر"}},{"id":"info","text":{"en":"These photos are the information Reham is deciding with","ar":"هذه الصور هي المعلومة التي تقرّر بها رهام"}}],"answer":["info"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P10-018","when":["pretty","people"],"feedback":{"en":"It's not about looks or about people in the picture. These photos show the actual rooms, which is exactly what Reham is judging.","ar":"الأمر لا يتعلّق بالجمال ولا بوجود أشخاص في الصورة. هذه الصور تُظهر الغرف الفعلية، وهذا بالضبط ما تحكم عليه رهام."}}]},"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P10-018","when":["a"],"feedback":{"en":"In A, the only photo is a generic family that tells Reham nothing about the flat. Photos of the real rooms are her main facts, so they come first.","ar":"في A، الصورة الوحيدة لعائلة عادية لا تخبر رهام بشيء عن الشقة. أما صور الغرف الحقيقية فهي أهم معلوماتها، لذلك تأتي أولًا."}}],"hints":[{"en":"What is Reham judging now that she has filtered?","ar":"ماذا تقيّم رهام الآن بعد أن استخدمت الفلاتر؟"},{"en":"Can text tell her how bright a room is?","ar":"هل يستطيع النص أن يخبرها بمدى إضاءة الغرفة؟"}],"correct":{"en":"When the photo is the fact, it leads.","ar":"حين تكون الصورة هي المعلومة، تأتي أولًا."},"explain":{"en":"On Reem's page, the photo was decoration, so the facts went first. Here, the photos of the rooms are what Reham decides with. Ask whether a photo carries information for this decision, not whether photos are good or bad.","ar":"في صفحة ريم كانت الصورة للزينة، فجاءت المعلومات أولًا. أما هنا فصور الغرف هي ما تقرّر به رهام. اسأل: هل تحمل الصورة معلومة لهذا القرار؟ لا: هل الصور جيدة أم سيئة؟"},"speaker":"sara"},{"id":"S07","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P10-U01-06","part":"independent","rules":["R14","R19"],"value":{"en":"New case. Banner blindness (NN/g): content placed in the same part of the screen as an ad is often considered an ad and ignored; the side column is a typical ad location.","ar":"حالة جديدة. عمى الإعلانات (NN/g): المحتوى الموضوع في جزء الشاشة نفسه مع الإعلان يُعامل غالبًا كإعلان ويُتجاهل؛ والعمود الجانبي مكان معتاد للإعلانات."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/banner-blindness-old-and-new-findings/","quote":"Content placed in the same part of the screen as an advertisement is often considered to be an ad and is also ignored."},"scenario":{"en":"On a hotel site I'm reviewing, Omar is booking on his laptop. He'll only book if he can cancel for free. The free-cancellation note sits in the side column, under two ads.","ar":"في موقع فندق أراجعه، يحجز عمر من الـ Laptop. ولن يحجز إلا إذا استطاع الإلغاء مجانًا. وملاحظة الإلغاء المجاني في العمود الجانبي، تحت إعلانين."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each fix. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل إصلاح. أيّ إصلاح يجعل عمر يرى ملاحظة الإلغاء المجاني قبل أن يحجز؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nuzul","name":{"en":"Nuzul","ar":"نُزُل"},"color":"#B7791F","icon":"bed","domain":"nuzul.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"nuzul.example/aswan","caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"blocks":[{"kind":"row","blocks":[{"kind":"group","tone":"plain","blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Garden Hotel · 2 nights","ar":"فندق الحديقة · ليلتان"}},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"EGP 4,200 total","ar":"4,200 جنيه إجمالًا"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Book now","ar":"احجز الآن"},"gap":"m"}]},{"kind":"group","tone":"tint","blocks":[{"kind":"image","size":"s","text":{"en":"Ad: rent a car","ar":"إعلان: استأجر سيارة"}},{"kind":"image","size":"s","text":{"en":"Ad: city tours","ar":"إعلان: جولات في المدينة"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Free cancellation until 1 March","ar":"إلغاء مجاني حتى 1 مارس"},"gap":"s"}]}]}]},"options":[{"id":"red","text":{"en":"Keep it in the side column, in a red box","ar":"أبقِها في العمود الجانبي، داخل صندوق أحمر"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nuzul","name":{"en":"Nuzul","ar":"نُزُل"},"color":"#B7791F","icon":"bed","domain":"nuzul.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"nuzul.example/aswan","caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"row","blocks":[{"kind":"group","tone":"plain","blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Garden Hotel · 2 nights","ar":"فندق الحديقة · ليلتان"}},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"EGP 4,200 total","ar":"4,200 جنيه إجمالًا"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Book now","ar":"احجز الآن"},"gap":"m"}]},{"kind":"group","tone":"tint","blocks":[{"kind":"image","size":"s","text":{"en":"Ad: rent a car","ar":"إعلان: استأجر سيارة"}},{"kind":"image","size":"s","text":{"en":"Ad: city tours","ar":"إعلان: جولات في المدينة"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"banner","tone":"bad","text":{"en":"Free cancellation until 1 March","ar":"إلغاء مجاني حتى 1 مارس"},"gap":"s"}]}]}]}},{"id":"top","text":{"en":"Move it to the top of the side column, above the ads","ar":"انقلها إلى أعلى العمود الجانبي، فوق الإعلانات"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nuzul","name":{"en":"Nuzul","ar":"نُزُل"},"color":"#B7791F","icon":"bed","domain":"nuzul.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"nuzul.example/aswan","caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"row","blocks":[{"kind":"group","tone":"plain","blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Garden Hotel · 2 nights","ar":"فندق الحديقة · ليلتان"}},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"EGP 4,200 total","ar":"4,200 جنيه إجمالًا"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Book now","ar":"احجز الآن"},"gap":"m"}]},{"kind":"group","tone":"tint","blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Free cancellation until 1 March","ar":"إلغاء مجاني حتى 1 مارس"}},{"kind":"image","size":"s","text":{"en":"Ad: rent a car","ar":"إعلان: استأجر سيارة"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"image","size":"s","text":{"en":"Ad: city tours","ar":"إعلان: جولات في المدينة"},"gap":"s"}]}]}]}},{"id":"move","text":{"en":"Move it into the main column, right under the price","ar":"انقلها إلى العمود الرئيسي، تحت السعر مباشرة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nuzul","name":{"en":"Nuzul","ar":"نُزُل"},"color":"#B7791F","icon":"bed","domain":"nuzul.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"nuzul.example/aswan","caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"row","blocks":[{"kind":"group","tone":"plain","blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Garden Hotel · 2 nights","ar":"فندق الحديقة · ليلتان"}},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"EGP 4,200 total","ar":"4,200 جنيه إجمالًا"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Free cancellation until 1 March","ar":"إلغاء مجاني حتى 1 مارس"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Book now","ar":"احجز الآن"},"gap":"m"}]},{"kind":"group","tone":"tint","blocks":[{"kind":"image","size":"s","text":{"en":"Ad: rent a car","ar":"إعلان: استأجر سيارة"}},{"kind":"image","size":"s","text":{"en":"Ad: city tours","ar":"إعلان: جولات في المدينة"},"gap":"s"}]}]}]}}],"answer":["move"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P10-014","when":["top"],"feedback":{"en":"It's still in the side column with the ads, where people expect ads and don't look. Move it next to the price Omar is checking.","ar":"ما زالت في العمود الجانبي مع الإعلانات، حيث يتوقّع الناس إعلانات فلا ينظرون. انقلها بجانب السعر الذي يتحقّق منه عمر."}},{"id":"MC-P10-013","when":["red"],"feedback":{"en":"A red box next to ads looks even more like an ad. Making it louder doesn't help; moving it out of the ad area does.","ar":"الصندوق الأحمر بجانب الإعلانات يشبه الإعلان أكثر. جعلها أكثر بروزًا لا يفيد؛ ما يفيد هو إخراجها من منطقة الإعلانات."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Where is the note now, and what sits around it?","ar":"أين الملاحظة الآن، وما الذي حولها؟"},{"en":"Will a red box or a higher place in the same column stop it looking like an ad?","ar":"هل سيمنع مربع أحمر أو مكان أعلى في العمود نفسه أن تبدو كإعلان؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Next to the price, away from the ads.","ar":"بجانب السعر، بعيدًا عن الإعلانات."},"explain":{"en":"Same idea as the next-session card, on a laptop screen: content in the ad area is taken for an ad. The cancellation rule is part of Omar's decision, so it belongs with the price, in the main column.","ar":"الفكرة نفسها التي رأيتها في بطاقة الجلسة التالية، لكن على شاشة Laptop: المحتوى في منطقة الإعلانات يُعامل كإعلان. وشرط الإلغاء جزء من قرار عمر، فمكانه مع السعر في العمود الرئيسي."},"speaker":"sara"},{"id":"S08","type":"card","part":"recap","icons":["eye","warn","layers","ok"],"title":{"en":"What you did","ar":"ماذا تعلّمت"},"body":{"en":"- **Decorative photos:** swapped a generic photo for one that shows the real thing.\n- **Ad-like style:** put an important note in the page's own style, not in a bright strip.\n- **Separate sections:** kept the next session away from the partner offers.\n- **Ad places:** moved a key rule out of the side column, next to the price.\n\nNext: a skill check on a new page.","ar":"- **الصور التزيينية:** استبدلت صورة عامّة بصورة تُظهر الشيء الحقيقي.\n- **شكل الإعلان:** وضعت ملاحظة مهمّة بشكل الصفحة نفسه، لا في شريط زاهٍ.\n- **أقسام منفصلة:** أبعدت الجلسة التالية عن عروض الشركاء.\n- **أماكن الإعلانات:** نقلت شرطًا مهمًّا من العمود الجانبي إلى جانب السعر.\n\nالتالي: اختبار مهارة على صفحة جديدة."}}]}$uxg$::jsonb),
  ($uxg$P10-U01-L04$uxg$, $uxg$b27079bce43ab9baee4edbf9048cf9af2978828ddc79144b99333ccf8a7bd840$uxg$, $uxg${"id":"P10-U01-L04","mode":"check","minutes":7,"title":{"en":"Skill check: put the decision first","ar":"اختبار المهارة: ضع القرار أولًا"},"summary":{"en":"Put the deciding facts first on a clinic booking screen, on your own.","ar":"ضع المعلومات الحاسمة أولًا في شاشة حجز بعيادة، بنفسك."},"speaker":"nour","steps":[{"id":"S01","type":"card","part":"hook","title":{"en":"Huda's appointment","ar":"موعد هدى"},"body":{"en":"Huda needs a dermatologist for her eczema on Saturday morning, and her insurance is MedCare. She's booking at my clinic from her phone during a break. You're reviewing our booking page before launch.\n\nThis is a skill check: no hints, and you'll see how you did at the end.","ar":"تحتاج هدى إلى طبيبة جلدية لعلاج الإكزيما صباح السبت، وتأمينها الصحي من MedCare. تحجز في عيادتي من هاتفها في وقت الاستراحة. وأنت تراجع صفحة الحجز عندنا قبل إطلاقها.\n\nهذا اختبار مهارة: بدون تلميحات، وسترى نتيجتك في النهاية."},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Book a doctor","ar":"احجز طبيبًا"},"back":true},"height":380,"blocks":[{"kind":"banner","text":{"en":"Read our skin-care blog","ar":"اقرأ مدوّنتنا عن العناية بالبشرة"}},{"kind":"image","art":"clinic","size":"l","text":{"en":"Clinic photo","ar":"صورة العيادة"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Dr. Mona Adel, Dermatology","ar":"د. منى عادل، الأمراض الجلدية"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Saturday 21 November, 10:30","ar":"السبت 21 نوفمبر، 10:30"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Book this slot","ar":"احجز هذا الموعد"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Visit fee: 450 EGP","ar":"رسوم الكشف: 450 جنيهًا"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Insurance accepted: MedCare, Allianz","ar":"التأمين المقبول: MedCare وAllianz"},"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"S02","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P10-U01-01","part":"check","rules":["R19"],"value":{"en":"Skill check, page order (NN/g): reserve the top of the page for high-priority content; the button comes after the facts it depends on.","ar":"اختبار مهارة، ترتيب الصفحة (NN/g): خصّص أعلى الصفحة للمحتوى الأهم؛ ويأتي الزر بعد المعلومات التي يعتمد عليها."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/scrolling-and-attention/","quote":"Reserve the top of the page for high-priority content"},"prompt":{"en":"Try each order. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل ترتيب. أيّها يجب أن يُطلق؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Book a doctor","ar":"احجز طبيبًا"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"height":380,"blocks":[{"kind":"banner","text":{"en":"Read our skin-care blog","ar":"اقرأ مدوّنتنا عن العناية بالبشرة"}},{"kind":"image","art":"clinic","size":"l","text":{"en":"Clinic photo","ar":"صورة العيادة"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Dr. Mona Adel, Dermatology","ar":"د. منى عادل، الأمراض الجلدية"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Saturday 21 November, 10:30","ar":"السبت 21 نوفمبر، 10:30"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Book this slot","ar":"احجز هذا الموعد"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Visit fee: 450 EGP","ar":"رسوم الكشف: 450 جنيهًا"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Insurance accepted: MedCare, Allianz","ar":"التأمين المقبول: MedCare وAllianz"},"gap":"s"}]},"options":[{"id":"button","text":{"en":"Book this slot at the very top, then everything else","ar":"زر «احجز هذا الموعد» في الأعلى تمامًا، ثم كل شيء آخر"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Book a doctor","ar":"احجز طبيبًا"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"height":380,"blocks":[{"kind":"button