d":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Book a doctor","ar":"احجز طبيبًا"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"height":380,"blocks":[{"kind":"banner","text":{"en":"Read our skin-care blog","ar":"اقرأ مدوّنتنا عن العناية بالبشرة"}},{"kind":"image","art":"clinic","size":"s","text":{"en":"Clinic photo","ar":"صورة العيادة"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Dr. Mona Adel, Dermatology","ar":"د. منى عادل، الأمراض الجلدية"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Saturday 21 November, 10:30","ar":"السبت 21 نوفمبر، 10:30"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Book this slot","ar":"احجز هذا الموعد"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Visit fee: 450 EGP","ar":"رسوم الكشف: 450 جنيهًا"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Insurance accepted: MedCare, Allianz","ar":"التأمين المقبول: MedCare وAllianz"},"gap":"s"}]}}],"answer":["facts"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P10-006","when":["button","small"],"feedback":{"en":"Book this slot still comes before the insurance and fee, so Huda could book without knowing if MedCare is accepted.","ar":"ما زال «احجز هذا الموعد» يأتي قبل التأمين والرسوم، فقد تحجز هدى دون أن تعرف إن كان MedCare مقبولًا."}}],"explain":{"en":"From Lesson 1: the top of the screen goes to what Huda decides with, and the button follows those facts. The blog and photo can wait.","ar":"من الدرس 1: أعلى الشاشة للمعلومات التي تقرّر بها هدى، والزر يأتي بعدها. أما المدوّنة والصورة فيمكنهما الانتظار."}},{"id":"S03","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P10-U01-04","part":"check","rules":["R19"],"value":{"en":"Skill check, progressive disclosure (NN/g): disclose everything users frequently need up front; specialised details go behind a clearly named link.","ar":"اختبار مهارة، الإفصاح التدريجي (NN/g): اعرض كل ما يحتاجه المستخدمون كثيرًا في الواجهة؛ والتفاصيل المتخصّصة خلف رابط باسم واضح."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/progressive-disclosure/","quote":"You have to disclose everything that users frequently need up front"},"scenario":{"en":"Almost every patient checks the insurance and the fee before booking. Few read our clinic's history and awards. A teammate tidied the page by putting all of it behind one link.","ar":"تقريبًا كل مريض يتحقّق من التأمين والرسوم قبل الحجز. وقليلون يقرؤون تاريخ عيادتنا وجوائزها. رتّب أحد الزملاء الصفحة بوضع كل ذلك خلف رابط واحد."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each version. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل نسخة. أيّها يجب أن يُطلق؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Book a doctor","ar":"احجز طبيبًا"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Dr. Mona Adel, Dermatology","ar":"د. منى عادل، الأمراض الجلدية"}},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Saturday 21 November, 10:30","ar":"السبت 21 نوفمبر، 10:30"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"link","text":{"en":"More info","ar":"معلومات أكثر"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Book this slot","ar":"احجز هذا الموعد"},"gap":"m"}]},"options":[{"id":"history","text":{"en":"Show the clinic's history and awards; keep insurance and fee behind \"More info\"","ar":"اعرض تاريخ العيادة وجوائزها؛ وأبقِ التأمين والرسوم خلف «معلومات أكثر»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Book a doctor","ar":"احجز طبيبًا"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Dr. Mona Adel, Dermatology","ar":"د. منى عادل، الأمراض الجلدية"}},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Saturday 21 November, 10:30","ar":"السبت 21 نوفمبر، 10:30"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Open since 2009 · Best clinic award 2023","ar":"تعمل منذ 2009 · جائزة أفضل عيادة 2023"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"link","text":{"en":"More info","ar":"معلومات أكثر"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Book this slot","ar":"احجز هذا الموعد"},"gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"keep","text":{"en":"Keep everything behind \"More info\"; the page is cleaner","ar":"أبقِ كل شيء خلف «معلومات أكثر»؛ فالصفحة أكثر ترتيبًا"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Book a doctor","ar":"احجز طبيبًا"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Dr. Mona Adel, Dermatology","ar":"د. منى عادل، الأمراض الجلدية"}},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Saturday 21 November, 10:30","ar":"السبت 21 نوفمبر، 10:30"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"link","text":{"en":"More info","ar":"معلومات أكثر"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Book this slot","ar":"احجز هذا الموعد"},"gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"show","text":{"en":"Show insurance and fee; put the history and awards behind \"About the clinic\"","ar":"اعرض التأمين والرسوم؛ وضع التاريخ والجوائز خلف «عن العيادة»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Book a doctor","ar":"احجز طبيبًا"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Dr. Mona Adel, Dermatology","ar":"د. منى عادل، الأمراض الجلدية"}},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Saturday 21 November, 10:30","ar":"السبت 21 نوفمبر، 10:30"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Insurance accepted: MedCare, Allianz","ar":"التأمين المقبول: MedCare وAllianz"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Visit fee: 450 EGP","ar":"رسوم الكشف: 450 جنيهًا"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Book this slot","ar":"احجز هذا الموعد"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"link","text":{"en":"About the clinic","ar":"عن العيادة"},"gap":"s"}]}}],"answer":["show"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P10-002","when":["history","keep"],"feedback":{"en":"Almost every patient needs the insurance and fee, so hiding them makes nearly everyone tap. Hide only what few people read.","ar":"تقريبًا كل مريض يحتاج إلى التأمين والرسوم، فإخفاؤهما يجعل الجميع تقريبًا يضغط. أخفِ فقط ما يقرؤه القليلون."}}],"explain":{"en":"From Lesson 2: what most people need stays up front, and what few need goes behind a link that names it.","ar":"من الدرس 2: ما يحتاجه معظم الناس يبقى ظاهرًا، وما يحتاجه القليلون يذهب خلف رابط يسمّيه."},"speaker":"nour"},{"id":"S04","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P10-U01-06","part":"check","rules":["R19"],"value":{"en":"Skill check, banner blindness (NN/g): do not make content look like ads; a bright, different-looking box is often skipped.","ar":"اختبار مهارة، عمى الإعلانات (NN/g): لا تجعل المحتوى يشبه الإعلانات؛ فالصندوق اللامع المختلف الشكل يُتخطّى غالبًا."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/banner-blindness-old-and-new-findings/","quote":"Do not make content look like ads."},"scenario":{"en":"Our patients must bring their insurance card, or they pay the full fee. Where should this note go?","ar":"يجب أن يُحضر مرضانا بطاقة التأمين، وإلا يدفعون الرسوم كاملة. أين يجب أن توضع هذه الملاحظة؟"},"prompt":{"en":"Try each version. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل نسخة. أيّها يجب أن يُطلق؟"},"start":"plain","options":[{"id":"plain","text":{"en":"A plain line right under the insurance line","ar":"سطر عادي تحت سطر التأمين مباشرة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Book a doctor","ar":"احجز طبيبًا"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Dr. Mona Adel, Dermatology","ar":"د. منى عادل، الأمراض الجلدية"}},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Saturday 21 November, 10:30","ar":"السبت 21 نوفمبر، 10:30"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Insurance accepted: MedCare, Allianz","ar":"التأمين المقبول: MedCare وAllianz"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Bring your insurance card, or you pay the full fee","ar":"أحضر بطاقة التأمين، وإلا تدفع الرسوم كاملة"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Visit fee: 450 EGP","ar":"رسوم الكشف: 450 جنيهًا"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Book this slot","ar":"احجز هذا الموعد"},"gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"strip","text":{"en":"A bright red strip at the top of the page","ar":"شريط أحمر زاهٍ أعلى الصفحة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Book a doctor","ar":"احجز طبيبًا"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"banner","tone":"bad","text":{"en":"⚠ Bring your insurance card! ⚠","ar":"⚠ أحضر بطاقة التأمين! ⚠"}},{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Dr. Mona Adel, Dermatology","ar":"د. منى عادل، الأمراض الجلدية"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Saturday 21 November, 10:30","ar":"السبت 21 نوفمبر، 10:30"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Insurance accepted: MedCare, Allianz","ar":"التأمين المقبول: MedCare وAllianz"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Visit fee: 450 EGP","ar":"رسوم الكشف: 450 جنيهًا"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Book this slot","ar":"احجز هذا الموعد"},"gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"picture","text":{"en":"A big picture of an insurance card above the doctor's name","ar":"صورة كبيرة لبطاقة تأمين فوق اسم الطبيبة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Book a doctor","ar":"احجز طبيبًا"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","size":"m","text":{"en":"🪪 Bring your insurance card!","ar":"🪪 أحضر بطاقة التأمين!"}},{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Dr. Mona Adel, Dermatology","ar":"د. منى عادل، الأمراض الجلدية"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Saturday 21 November, 10:30","ar":"السبت 21 نوفمبر، 10:30"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Insurance accepted: MedCare, Allianz","ar":"التأمين المقبول: MedCare وAllianz"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Visit fee: 450 EGP","ar":"رسوم الكشف: 450 جنيهًا"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Book this slot","ar":"احجز هذا الموعد"},"gap":"m"}]}}],"answer":["plain"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P10-013","when":["strip","picture"],"feedback":{"en":"A bright strip or a big picture at the top looks like an ad, so many patients will skip it. Keep the note with the insurance facts, in the same style.","ar":"الشريط الزاهي أو الصورة الكبيرة في الأعلى يشبهان الإعلان، فسيتخطّاهما كثير من المرضى. أبقِ الملاحظة مع معلومات التأمين، بالشكل نفسه."}}],"explain":{"en":"From Lesson 3: making a note look different to get attention often backfires. Right next to the insurance line, it's read as part of the decision.","ar":"من الدرس 3: جعل الملاحظة مختلفة لتلفت الانتباه يأتي غالبًا بعكس النتيجة. وبجانب سطر التأمين مباشرة، تُقرأ كجزء من القرار."},"speaker":"nour"},{"id":"S05","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P10-U01-02","part":"check","rules":["R19"],"value":{"en":"Skill check, visual hierarchy (NN/g): limit how many elements are big to a maximum of 2. When everything is big, nothing stands out.","ar":"اختبار مهارة، التسلسل البصري (NN/g): لا تكبّر أكثر من عنصرين. حين يكون كل شيء كبيرًا، لا يبرز شيء."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/visual-hierarchy-ux-definition/","quote":"Limit how many elements are big to a maximum of 2"},"scenario":{"en":"I know our patients pick an appointment mainly by its time. Right now, four things on the page are big.","ar":"أعرف أن مرضانا يختارون الموعد أساسًا حسب وقته. والآن، أربعة أشياء في الصفحة كبيرة."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each version. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل نسخة. أيّها يجب أن يُطلق؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Book a doctor","ar":"احجز طبيبًا"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Dr. Mona Adel, Dermatology","ar":"د. منى عادل، الأمراض الجلدية"}},{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Saturday 21 November, 10:30","ar":"السبت 21 نوفمبر، 10:30"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Insurance accepted: MedCare, Allianz","ar":"التأمين المقبول: MedCare وAllianz"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Visit fee: 450 EGP","ar":"رسوم الكشف: 450 جنيهًا"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Book this slot","ar":"احجز هذا الموعد"},"gap":"m"}]},"options":[{"id":"red","text":{"en":"Keep all four big, and make the fee red so it stands out","ar":"أبقِ الأربعة كبيرة، واجعل الرسوم حمراء لتبرز"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Book a doctor","ar":"احجز طبيبًا"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Dr. Mona Adel, Dermatology","ar":"د. منى عادل، الأمراض الجلدية"}},{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Saturday 21 November, 10:30","ar":"السبت 21 نوفمبر، 10:30"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Insurance accepted: MedCare, Allianz","ar":"التأمين المقبول: MedCare وAllianz"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"title","color":"red","text":{"en":"Visit fee: 450 EGP","ar":"رسوم الكشف: 450 جنيهًا"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Book this slot","ar":"احجز هذا الموعد"},"gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"flat","text":{"en":"Make everything the same normal size, the button too","ar":"اجعل كل شيء بالحجم العادي نفسه، والزر أيضًا"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Book a doctor","ar":"احجز طبيبًا"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Dr. Mona Adel, Dermatology","ar":"د. منى عادل، الأمراض الجلدية"}},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Saturday 21 November, 10:30","ar":"السبت 21 نوفمبر، 10:30"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Insurance accepted: MedCare, Allianz","ar":"التأمين المقبول: MedCare وAllianz"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Visit fee: 450 EGP","ar":"رسوم الكشف: 450 جنيهًا"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"link","text":{"en":"Book this slot","ar":"احجز هذا الموعد"},"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"two","text":{"en":"Only the time and the Book button big; the rest normal","ar":"الموعد وزر الحجز فقط كبيران؛ والباقي عادي"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Book a doctor","ar":"احجز طبيبًا"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Dr. Mona Adel, Dermatology","ar":"د. منى عادل، الأمراض الجلدية"}},{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Saturday 21 November, 10:30","ar":"السبت 21 نوفمبر، 10:30"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Insurance accepted: MedCare, Allianz","ar":"التأمين المقبول: MedCare وAllianz"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Visit fee: 450 EGP","ar":"رسوم الكشف: 450 جنيهًا"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Book this slot","ar":"احجز هذا الموعد"},"gap":"m"}]}}],"answer":["two"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P10-003","when":["red"],"feedback":{"en":"With four big things, adding red just makes a fifth thing compete. Keep two big: what patients choose by, and the button.","ar":"مع أربعة أشياء كبيرة، يضيف اللون الأحمر منافسًا خامسًا فقط. أبقِ شيئين كبيرين: ما يختار به المرضى، والزر."}},{"id":"MC-P10-001","when":["flat"],"feedback":{"en":"Now nothing leads the eye, not even the button. Make the two things that matter most bigger than the rest.","ar":"الآن لا شيء يجذب العين أولًا، ولا حتى الزر. اجعل الشيئين الأهم أكبر من الباقي."}}],"explain":{"en":"From Lesson 1: two big things at most. Here, the time patients choose by and the action they take.","ar":"من الدرس 1: شيئان كبيران كحدّ أقصى. هنا: الموعد الذي يختار به المرضى، والإجراء الذي يقومون به."},"speaker":"nour"},{"id":"S06","type":"compare","skill":"SK-P10-U01-03","part":"check","rules":["R19","R11"],"value":{"en":"Skill check, inverted pyramid (NN/g): the first sentence of every paragraph should be the most important. Huda scans for whether the doctor treats eczema.","ar":"اختبار مهارة، الهرم المقلوب (NN/g): يجب أن تكون الجملة الأولى في كل فقرة هي الأهم. وهدى تبحث بسرعة: هل تعالج الطبيبة الإكزيما؟"},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/inverted-pyramid/","quote":"The first sentence of every paragraph should be the most important."},"prompt":{"en":"Both descriptions say the same things. Which one should ship?","ar":"الوصفان يقولان الأشياء نفسها. أيّهما يُخبر هدى أولًا بما تعالجه الطبيبة؟"},"a":{"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Book a doctor","ar":"احجز طبيبًا"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Dr. Mona Adel, Dermatology","ar":"د. منى عادل، الأمراض الجلدية"}},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"Treats eczema, acne and hair loss in adults and children. Dr. Nesma has 15 years of experience and believes every patient deserves time and care.","ar":"تعالج الإكزيما وحب الشباب وتساقط الشعر للكبار والأطفال. لدى د. نسمة خبرة 15 عامًا، وتؤمن بأن كل مريض يستحق الوقت والاهتمام."},"gap":"s"}]}},"b":{"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Book a doctor","ar":"احجز طبيبًا"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Dr. Mona Adel, Dermatology","ar":"د. منى عادل، الأمراض الجلدية"}},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"Dr. Nesma has 15 years of experience and believes every patient deserves time and care. She treats eczema, acne and hair loss in adults and children.","ar":"لدى د. نسمة خبرة 15 عامًا، وتؤمن بأن كل مريض يستحق الوقت والاهتمام. وهي تعالج الإكزيما وحب الشباب وتساقط الشعر للكبار والأطفال."},"gap":"s"}]}},"answer":"a","reason":{"prompt":{"en":"What makes the difference?","ar":"ما سبب الفرق؟"},"options":[{"id":"short","text":{"en":"A is shorter","ar":"A أقصر"}},{"id":"first","text":{"en":"A starts with what she treats, which is what Huda is checking","ar":"A تبدأ بما تعالجه الطبيبة، وهذا ما تتحقّق منه هدى"}},{"id":"warm","text":{"en":"B sounds warmer, so patients trust it more","ar":"B أدفأ، لذلك يثق بها المرضى أكثر"}}],"answer":["first"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P10-004","when":["short","warm"],"feedback":{"en":"Both have the same words and length. The difference is which sentence comes first: people often read only the start.","ar":"للوصفين الكلمات والطول نفسهما. الفرق في الجملة التي تأتي أولًا: فالناس كثيرًا ما يقرؤون البداية فقط."}}]},"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P10-004","when":["b"],"feedback":{"en":"In B, what Huda needs (does she treat eczema?) is hidden in the second sentence. Put the deciding fact first.","ar":"في B، ما تحتاجه هدى (هل تعالج الإكزيما؟) مخفي في الجملة الثانية. ضع المعلومة الحاسمة أولًا."}}],"explain":{"en":"From Lesson 1: the first words carry the decision. Lead with what the reader is checking; the rest can follow.","ar":"من الدرس 1: الكلمات الأولى تحمل القرار. ابدأ بما يتحقّق منه القارئ، والباقي يأتي بعده."}},{"id":"S07","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P10-U01-07","part":"check","rules":["R19"],"value":{"en":"Skill check, photos (NN/g): users pay attention to information-carrying images relevant to their task and ignore decorative ones. The entrance photo helps patients find the clinic.","ar":"اختبار مهارة، الصور (NN/g): ينتبه المستخدمون للصور التي تحمل معلومة تخصّ مهمّتهم، ويتجاهلون صور الزينة. وصورة المدخل تساعد المرضى على الوصول إلى العيادة."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/photos-as-web-content/","quote":"users pay attention to information-carrying images"},"scenario":{"en":"Patients often can't find our entrance, which is in a side street. Below the booking details there's room for one photo.","ar":"كثيرًا ما لا يجد المرضى مدخل عيادتنا، فهو في شارع جانبي. وتحت تفاصيل الحجز مكان لصورة واحدة."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each photo. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل صورة. أيّ صورة تساعد المرضى على إيجاد مدخل العيادة؟"},"start":"smile","options":[{"id":"smile","text":{"en":"A stock photo of a smiling doctor with a clipboard","ar":"صورة جاهزة (Stock) لطبيبة تبتسم وتحمل لوح أوراق"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Book a doctor","ar":"احجز طبيبًا"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Saturday 21 November, 10:30","ar":"السبت 21 نوفمبر، 10:30"}},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Book this slot","ar":"احجز هذا الموعد"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"image","art":"doctor","size":"m","text":{"en":"Photo: smiling doctor with a clipboard","ar":"صورة: طبيبة تبتسم وتحمل لوح أوراق"},"gap":"l"}]}},{"id":"door","text":{"en":"A photo of the clinic's door from the street, with \"Ground floor, side entrance\"","ar":"صورة لباب العيادة من الشارع، مع «الطابق الأرضي، المدخل الجانبي»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Book a doctor","ar":"احجز طبيبًا"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Saturday 21 November, 10:30","ar":"السبت 21 نوفمبر، 10:30"}},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Book this slot","ar":"احجز هذا الموعد"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"image","art":"clinic","size":"m","text":{"en":"Photo: the clinic's door from the street","ar":"صورة: باب العيادة من الشارع"},"gap":"l"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Ground floor, side entrance","ar":"الطابق الأرضي، المدخل الجانبي"},"gap":"xs"}]}},{"id":"happy","text":{"en":"A stock photo of a happy patient with clear skin","ar":"صورة جاهزة (Stock) لمريضة سعيدة ببشرة صافية"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Book a doctor","ar":"احجز طبيبًا"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Saturday 21 November, 10:30","ar":"السبت 21 نوفمبر، 10:30"}},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Book this slot","ar":"احجز هذا الموعد"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"image","art":"woman-3","size":"m","text":{"en":"Photo: happy patient with clear skin","ar":"صورة: مريضة سعيدة ببشرة صافية"},"gap":"l"}]}}],"answer":["door"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P10-012","when":["smile","happy"],"feedback":{"en":"A generic stock photo tells patients nothing they need, so they'll scroll past it. A photo of the real door solves a real problem.","ar":"الصورة الجاهزة العامّة لا تخبر المرضى بشيء يحتاجونه، فسيتخطّونها. أما صورة الباب الحقيقي فتحلّ مشكلة حقيقية."}}],"explain":{"en":"From Lesson 3: a photo earns its place when it carries information for the task. Here, the task includes finding the door.","ar":"من الدرس 3: تستحق الصورة مكانها حين تحمل معلومة للمهمّة. وهنا، المهمّة تشمل الوصول إلى الباب."},"speaker":"nour"}]}$uxg$::jsonb),
  ($uxg$P10-U02-L01$uxg$, $uxg$8fe19e1c5157ca1e4b9f6f4216bd4e13a9e17689fb44656addec19497a240e64$uxg$, $uxg${"id":"P10-U02-L01","mode":"lesson","minutes":9,"title":{"en":"Space says what belongs together","ar":"المسافة تُظهر ما يترابط"},"summary":{"en":"Use spacing so each price sits with its own session and button.","ar":"استخدم المسافات ليبقى كل سعر مع جلسته وزرّه."},"speaker":"sara","review_labels":{"MC-P10-020":{"en":"Less space inside a group, more between groups","ar":"مسافة أقل داخل المجموعة، وأكثر بين المجموعات"},"MC-P10-023":{"en":"A label sits closer to its own field than to any other","ar":"التسمية أقرب إلى حقلها من أي حقل آخر"},"MC-P10-031":{"en":"Split a long form into a few meaningful groups","ar":"قسّم النموذج الطويل إلى مجموعات قليلة لها معنى"},"MC-P10-033":{"en":"Controls far from the task get overlooked","ar":"الأزرار البعيدة عن المهمة لا يراها الناس"}},"steps":[{"id":"S01","type":"card","part":"hook","title":{"en":"Two workshops, one page","ar":"ورشتان في صفحة واحدة"},"body":{"en":"My workshop page now lists two sessions. Every line has the same gap above it.\n\nReem wants the cheaper one. Can she tell, at a glance, which price and which button belong to which workshop?","ar":"أصبحت صفحة الورش التي أصمّمها تعرض جلستين. وكل سطر فوقه المسافة نفسها.\n\nتريد ريم الأرخص. هل تستطيع أن تعرف بنظرة سريعة أي سعر وأي زر يخص كل ورشة؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"manara","name":{"en":"Manara Learning Hub","ar":"منارة"},"color":"#5B3FD6","icon":"chalkboard-teacher","domain":"manara.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Sessions","ar":"الجلسات"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Sketch Your First App","ar":"ارسم تطبيقك الأول"}},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"17 November, 18:00","ar":"17 نوفمبر، الساعة 18:00"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Free","ar":"مجاني"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"button","emphasis":"low","text":{"en":"Reserve Sketch","ar":"احجز «ارسم»"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Design Your First Service","ar":"صمّم أول خدمة لك"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"18 November, 10:00","ar":"18 نوفمبر، الساعة 10:00"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"EGP 120","ar":"120 جنيهًا"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"button","emphasis":"low","text":{"en":"Reserve Service","ar":"احجز «صمّم»"},"gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"S02","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P10-U02-01","part":"try","rules":["R12"],"value":{"en":"Spacing is the first grouping cue (NN/g: proximity can overpower colour and shape). Fix which session a button belongs to by changing the gaps, not the words or the size.","ar":"المسافات أول إشارة للتجميع (NN/g: التقارب قد يتغلّب على اللون والشكل). أصلح انتماء الزر لجلسته بتغيير المسافات، لا الكلمات ولا الحجم."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/gestalt-proximity/","quote":"Proximity is one of the most important grouping principles"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"manara","name":{"en":"Manara Learning Hub","ar":"منارة"},"color":"#5B3FD6","icon":"chalkboard-teacher","domain":"manara.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Sessions","ar":"الجلسات"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Sketch Your First App","ar":"ارسم تطبيقك الأول"}},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"17 November, 18:00","ar":"17 نوفمبر، الساعة 18:00"},"gap":"l"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Free","ar":"مجاني"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"button","emphasis":"low","text":{"en":"Reserve","ar":"احجز"},"gap":"l"},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Design Your First Service","ar":"صمّم أول خدمة لك"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"18 November, 10:00","ar":"18 نوفمبر، الساعة 10:00"},"gap":"l"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"EGP 120","ar":"120 جنيهًا"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"button","emphasis":"low","text":{"en":"Reserve","ar":"احجز"},"gap":"l"}]},"prompt":{"en":"Someone changed the spacing. The first Reserve button now sits right above the second title, far from its own price. What should you change so it clearly belongs to the first session?","ar":"غيّر أحدهم المسافات. أصبح زر «احجز» الأول فوق العنوان الثاني مباشرة، وبعيدًا عن سعر جلسته. ماذا تغيّر حتى يبدو بوضوح أنه يخص الجلسة الأولى؟"},"options":[{"id":"bigger","text":{"en":"Make the button filled and bigger","ar":"اجعل الزر ممتلئًا وأكبر"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"manara","name":{"en":"Manara Learning Hub","ar":"منارة"},"color":"#5B3FD6","icon":"chalkboard-teacher","domain":"manara.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Sessions","ar":"الجلسات"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Sketch Your First App","ar":"ارسم تطبيقك الأول"}},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"17 November, 18:00","ar":"17 نوفمبر، الساعة 18:00"},"gap":"l"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Free","ar":"مجاني"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"button","emphasis":"high","text":{"en":"Reserve","ar":"احجز"},"gap":"l"},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Design Your First Service","ar":"صمّم أول خدمة لك"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"18 November, 10:00","ar":"18 نوفمبر، الساعة 10:00"},"gap":"l"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"EGP 120","ar":"120 جنيهًا"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"button","emphasis":"low","text":{"en":"Reserve","ar":"احجز"},"gap":"l"}]}},{"id":"label","text":{"en":"Rename it \"Reserve this session\"","ar":"غيّر نصّه إلى «احجز هذه الجلسة»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"manara","name":{"en":"Manara Learning Hub","ar":"منارة"},"color":"#5B3FD6","icon":"chalkboard-teacher","domain":"manara.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Sessions","ar":"الجلسات"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Sketch Your First App","ar":"ارسم تطبيقك الأول"}},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"17 November, 18:00","ar":"17 نوفمبر، الساعة 18:00"},"gap":"l"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Free","ar":"مجاني"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"button","emphasis":"low","text":{"en":"Reserve this session","ar":"احجز هذه الجلسة"},"gap":"l"},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Design Your First Service","ar":"صمّم أول خدمة لك"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"18 November, 10:00","ar":"18 نوفمبر، الساعة 10:00"},"gap":"l"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"EGP 120","ar":"120 جنيهًا"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"button","emphasis":"low","text":{"en":"Reserve","ar":"احجز"},"gap":"l"}]}},{"id":"space","text":{"en":"Less space above the button, more space below it","ar":"مسافة أقل فوق الزر، ومسافة أكبر تحته"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"manara","name":{"en":"Manara Learning Hub","ar":"منارة"},"color":"#5B3FD6","icon":"chalkboard-teacher","domain":"manara.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Sessions","ar":"الجلسات"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Sketch Your First App","ar":"ارسم تطبيقك الأول"}},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"17 November, 18:00","ar":"17 نوفمبر، الساعة 18:00"},"gap":"l"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Free","ar":"مجاني"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"button","emphasis":"low","text":{"en":"Reserve","ar":"احجز"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Design Your First Service","ar":"صمّم أول خدمة لك"},"gap":"xl"},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"18 November, 10:00","ar":"18 نوفمبر، الساعة 10:00"},"gap":"l"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"EGP 120","ar":"120 جنيهًا"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"button","emphasis":"low","text":{"en":"Reserve","ar":"احجز"},"gap":"l"}]}}],"answer":["space"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P10-020","when":["label","bigger"],"feedback":{"en":"The button would still sit tight against the second title. People pair what's close before they read a word, so fix the gaps: small to its own price, big before the next session.","ar":"سيبقى الزر ملتصقًا بالعنوان الثاني. والناس يربطون المتقارب قبل أن يقرؤوا أي كلمة، فأصلح المسافات: صغيرة مع سعر جلسته، وكبيرة قبل الجلسة التالية."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Look at the button: which price is it closest to?","ar":"انظر إلى الزر: ما السعر الأقرب إليه؟"},{"en":"People group what sits close together. What should be close to this button?","ar":"يجمع الناس ما يقع قريبًا من بعضه. ما الذي يجب أن يكون قريبًا من هذا الزر؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Small gap inside the group, big gap between groups.","ar":"مسافة صغيرة داخل المجموعة، ومسافة كبيرة بين المجموعات."},"explain":{"en":"Spacing carries meaning before anyone reads a word. Right now it pairs the button with the wrong session, so Reem could reserve the paid workshop by mistake.","ar":"المسافات تحمل معنى قبل أن يقرأ أحد أي كلمة. والآن تربط الزر بالجلسة الخطأ، فقد تحجز ريم الورشة المدفوعة بالخطأ."}},{"id":"S03","type":"card","part":"concept","icons":["space","form","eye","list"],"title":{"en":"Close means together","ar":"القريب يبدو مجموعة واحدة"},"body":{"en":"People see items that sit close together as one group, before they read a word. This is **proximity**, and it can beat colour and shape.\n\n- **Gaps:** small inside a group, bigger between groups.\n- **Form labels:** each label sits closer to its own field than to any other field.\n- **Distance hides things:** people focused on a task miss a control placed far from what it acts on.\n- **Long forms:** a few short groups of related fields feel like a few short forms.","ar":"يرى الناس العناصر المتقاربة كمجموعة واحدة، قبل أن يقرؤوا أي كلمة. يُسمّى هذا **التقارب (Proximity)**، وقد يتغلّب على اللون والشكل.\n\n- **المسافات:** صغيرة داخل المجموعة، وأكبر بين المجموعات.\n- **تسميات النموذج (Labels):** كل تسمية أقرب إلى حقلها من أي حقل آخر.\n- **البعيد لا يُرى:** من يركّز على مهمته لا يرى زرًّا بعيدًا عن الشيء الذي يعمل عليه.\n- **النماذج الطويلة:** بضع مجموعات قصيرة من الحقول المترابطة تبدو كبضعة نماذج قصيرة."}},{"id":"S04","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P10-U02-01","part":"guided","rules":["R06","R13"],"value":{"en":"NN/g found that when a label has the same gap above and below it, people can't tell which field it names. Each label must hug its own field.","ar":"وجدت NN/g أن التسمية التي فوقها وتحتها المسافة نفسها لا يعرف الناس أي حقل تسمّي. يجب أن تلتصق كل تسمية بحقلها."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/form-design-white-space/","quote":"Place the label closer to the associated text field than to other text fields"},"scenario":{"en":"On a delivery form I'm designing, Reham types her address on her phone. The form has three fields, and I'm choosing the spacing.","ar":"في نموذج توصيل أصمّمه، تكتب رهام عنوانها على هاتفها. في النموذج ثلاثة حقول، وأنا أختار المسافات."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each spacing and type in the fields. Which one makes it clear which label goes with which field?","ar":"جرّب كل توزيع للمسافات واكتب في الحقول. أيّها يوضّح أي تسمية تخص أي حقل؟"},"start":"equal","options":[{"id":"equal","text":{"en":"Each label halfway between the field above and the field below","ar":"كل تسمية في منتصف المسافة بين الحقل الذي فوقها والذي تحتها"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"tayyar","name":{"en":"Tayyar","ar":"طيّار"},"color":"#EA580C","icon":"moped","domain":"tayyar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Delivery address","ar":"عنوان التوصيل"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Street","ar":"الشارع"}},{"kind":"field","text":{"en":"Nile Street","ar":"شارع النيل"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Building","ar":"رقم المبنى"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"field","text":{"en":"14","ar":"14"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Flat","ar":"رقم الشقة"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"field","text":{"en":"6","ar":"6"},"gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"below","text":{"en":"Each label right under the field before it","ar":"كل تسمية تحت الحقل الذي قبلها مباشرة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"tayyar","name":{"en":"Tayyar","ar":"طيّار"},"color":"#EA580C","icon":"moped","domain":"tayyar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Delivery address","ar":"عنوان التوصيل"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Street","ar":"الشارع"}},{"kind":"field","text":{"en":"Nile Street","ar":"شارع النيل"},"gap":"l"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Building","ar":"رقم المبنى"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"field","text":{"en":"14","ar":"14"},"gap":"l"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Flat","ar":"رقم الشقة"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"field","text":{"en":"6","ar":"6"},"gap":"l"}]}},{"id":"tight","text":{"en":"Each label right above its own field, with a bigger gap before the next label","ar":"كل تسمية فوق حقلها مباشرة، ومسافة أكبر قبل التسمية التالية"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"tayyar","name":{"en":"Tayyar","ar":"طيّار"},"color":"#EA580C","icon":"moped","domain":"tayyar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Delivery address","ar":"عنوان التوصيل"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Street","ar":"الشارع"}},{"kind":"field","text":{"en":"Nile Street","ar":"شارع النيل"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Building","ar":"رقم المبنى"},"gap":"l"},{"kind":"field","text":{"en":"14","ar":"14"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Flat","ar":"رقم الشقة"},"gap":"l"},{"kind":"field","text":{"en":"6","ar":"6"},"gap":"xs"}]}}],"answer":["tight"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P10-023","when":["equal"],"feedback":{"en":"Look at \"Building\": it's as close to the street field as to its own, so it could name either. Pull each label tight to its own field.","ar":"انظر إلى «رقم المبنى»: قربها من حقل الشارع مثل قربها من حقلها، فقد تسمّي أيًّا منهما. ألصِق كل تسمية بحقلها."}},{"id":"MC-P10-023","when":["below"],"feedback":{"en":"Now every label hugs the wrong field, so Reham may type her flat number in the building field. A label belongs right above the field it names.","ar":"الآن كل تسمية ملتصقة بالحقل الخطأ، فقد تكتب رهام رقم الشقة في حقل المبنى. مكان التسمية فوق الحقل الذي تسمّيه مباشرة."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Type in each field. Which field is each label closest to?","ar":"اكتب في كل حقل. ما الحقل الأقرب إلى كل تسمية؟"},{"en":"A label should be closer to its own field than to any other one.","ar":"يجب أن تكون التسمية أقرب إلى حقلها من أي حقل آخر."}],"correct":{"en":"Each label hugs its own field; bigger gaps separate the pairs.","ar":"كل تسمية ملتصقة بحقلها، والمسافات الأكبر تفصل بين الأزواج."},"explain":{"en":"A label and its field are a group of two. Put labels above their fields, closer to their own field than to any other, so each pair reads as one unit.","ar":"التسمية وحقلها مجموعة من عنصرين. ضع التسميات فوق حقولها، وأقرب إلى حقلها من أي حقل آخر، حتى يُقرأ كل زوج كوحدة واحدة."},"speaker":"sara"},{"id":"S05","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P10-U02-02","part":"guided","rules":["R06","R14"],"value":{"en":"From an NN/g study of the Kayak app: a Skip link far from the sign-in buttons made people think signing in was required. An optional path must sit inside the group of choices.","ar":"من دراسة NN/g لتطبيق Kayak: رابط «تخطَّ» البعيد عن أزرار الدخول جعل الناس يظنّون أن تسجيل الدخول إلزامي. الطريق الاختياري يجب أن يكون داخل مجموعة الخيارات."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/gestalt-proximity/","quote":"tricks users into thinking they must sign in"},"scenario":{"en":"A travel app I'm working on shows this screen before booking. Signing in is optional, but in testing many people thought they had to create an account, and some gave up.","ar":"تطبيق سفر أعمل عليه يعرض هذه الشاشة قبل الحجز. تسجيل الدخول اختياري، لكن في الاختبار ظنّ كثيرون أن عليهم إنشاء حساب، وتوقّف بعضهم."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each place for the way to skip signing in. Where should it go?","ar":"جرّب كل مكان لطريقة تخطّي تسجيل الدخول. أين يجب أن تكون؟"},"start":"corner","options":[{"id":"corner","text":{"en":"A small Skip link in the top corner (as now)","ar":"رابط صغير «تخطَّ» في الزاوية العلوية (كما الآن)"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"zad","name":{"en":"Zad Travel","ar":"زاد للسفر"},"color":"#6D28D9","icon":"airplane-tilt","domain":"zad.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Before you book","ar":"قبل الحجز"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"row","blocks":[{"kind":"link","text":{"en":"Skip","ar":"تخطَّ"}},{"kind":"small","text":""},{"kind":"small","text":""}]},{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Sign in to save your trips","ar":"سجّل الدخول لحفظ رحلاتك"},"gap":"xl"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Continue with Google","ar":"المتابعة باستخدام Google"},"gap":"l"},{"kind":"button","emphasis":"low","text":{"en":"Continue with Apple","ar":"المتابعة باستخدام Apple"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","emphasis":"low","text":{"en":"Continue with email","ar":"المتابعة بالبريد الإلكتروني"},"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"under","text":{"en":"\"Continue without an account\" right under the sign-in buttons","ar":"«المتابعة بدون حساب» تحت أزرار الدخول مباشرة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"zad","name":{"en":"Zad Travel","ar":"زاد للسفر"},"color":"#6D28D9","icon":"airplane-tilt","domain":"zad.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Before you book","ar":"قبل الحجز"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Sign in to save your trips","ar":"سجّل الدخول لحفظ رحلاتك"},"gap":"xl"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Continue with Google","ar":"المتابعة باستخدام Google"},"gap":"l"},{"kind":"button","emphasis":"low","text":{"en":"Continue with Apple","ar":"المتابعة باستخدام Apple"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","emphasis":"low","text":{"en":"Continue with email","ar":"المتابعة بالبريد الإلكتروني"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"link","text":{"en":"Continue without an account","ar":"المتابعة بدون حساب"},"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"bottom","text":{"en":"A Skip link at the very bottom of the screen","ar":"رابط «تخطَّ» في أسفل الشاشة تمامًا"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"zad","name":{"en":"Zad Travel","ar":"زاد للسفر"},"color":"#6D28D9","icon":"airplane-tilt","domain":"zad.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Before you book","ar":"قبل الحجز"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Sign in to save your trips","ar":"سجّل الدخول لحفظ رحلاتك"},"gap":"xl"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Continue with Google","ar":"المتابعة باستخدام Google"},"gap":"l"},{"kind":"button","emphasis":"low","text":{"en":"Continue with Apple","ar":"المتابعة باستخدام Apple"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","emphasis":"low","text":{"en":"Continue with email","ar":"المتابعة بالبريد الإلكتروني"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"small","text":"","height":150},{"kind":"link","text":{"en":"Skip","ar":"تخطَّ"},"gap":"xl"}]}}],"answer":["under"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P10-033","when":["corner","bottom"],"feedback":{"en":"People look at the buttons, because that's where the choice is. A link far from them is outside the group of choices, so it gets missed and signing in looks required.","ar":"ينظر الناس إلى الأزرار، لأن الاختيار هناك. والرابط البعيد عنها خارج مجموعة الخيارات، فلا يراه أحد ويبدو تسجيل الدخول إلزاميًا."}}],"hints":[{"en":"In testing, people missed the way to skip. Where are their eyes when they decide?","ar":"في الاختبار، لم ينتبه الناس إلى طريقة التخطّي. أين تكون أعينهم عندما يقرّرون؟"},{"en":"Skipping is one of the choices. Should it sit far from the others?","ar":"التخطّي أحد الخيارات. هل يجب أن يكون بعيدًا عن البقية؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Skipping is one of the choices, so it sits with them.","ar":"التخطّي أحد الخيارات، فمكانه معها."},"explain":{"en":"A skip link alone in a corner, far from the main buttons, makes signing in look required. Under the buttons, it reads as one more way to continue.","ar":"رابط التخطّي وحده في الزاوية، بعيدًا عن الأزرار الرئيسية، يجعل تسجيل الدخول يبدو إلزاميًا. وتحت الأزرار يُقرأ كطريقة أخرى للمتابعة."},"speaker":"sara"},{"id":"S06","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P10-U02-03","part":"guided","rules":["R06","R13"],"value":{"en":"NN/g regrouped Walgreens' 15-field sign-up form into three titled groups; it then felt like three short forms. Chunking helps only when the groups are meaningful; lines between every field don't group anything.","ar":"أعادت NN/g ترتيب نموذج تسجيل Walgreens ذي 15 حقلًا في ثلاث مجموعات بعناوين؛ فأصبح يبدو كثلاثة نماذج قصيرة. التقسيم يفيد فقط حين يكون للمجموعات معنى؛ والخطوط بين كل حقل وآخر لا تجمع شيئًا."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/form-design-white-space/","quote":"Users now see a 3-part form"},"scenario":{"en":"A pharmacy's sign-up form I'm fixing has nine fields in one even list. Many people give up before the end. I can't remove any field.","ar":"نموذج التسجيل في صيدلية أعمل على إصلاحه فيه تسعة حقول في قائمة واحدة متساوية. كثيرون يتوقّفون قبل النهاية. ولا أستطيع حذف أي حقل."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each layout. Which one makes the form feel shorter?","ar":"جرّب كل تخطيط. أيّها يجعل النموذج يبدو أقصر؟"},"start":"list","options":[{"id":"list","text":{"en":"One even list (as now)","ar":"قائمة واحدة متساوية (كما الآن)"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dawaa","name":{"en":"Dawaa Pharmacy","ar":"صيدلية دواء"},"color":"#059669","icon":"pill","domain":"dawaa.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Sign up","ar":"التسجيل"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"First name","ar":"الاسم الأول"},"text":""},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Last name","ar":"اسم العائلة"},"text":"","gap":"m"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Date of birth","ar":"تاريخ الميلاد"},"text":"","gap":"m"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Email","ar":"البريد الإلكتروني"},"text":"","gap":"m"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Password","ar":"كلمة المرور"},"text":"","gap":"m"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Repeat password","ar":"أعد كتابة كلمة المرور"},"text":"","gap":"m"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Mobile number","ar":"رقم الجوال"},"text":"","gap":"m"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Street","ar":"الشارع"},"text":"","gap":"m"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"City","ar":"المدينة"},"text":"","gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"lines","text":{"en":"A divider line between every field","ar":"خط فاصل بين كل حقل وآخر"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dawaa","name":{"en":"Dawaa Pharmacy","ar":"صيدلية دواء"},"color":"#059669","icon":"pill","domain":"dawaa.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Sign up","ar":"التسجيل"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"First name","ar":"الاسم الأول"},"text":""},{"kind":"divider","gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Last name","ar":"اسم العائلة"},"text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"divider","gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Date of birth","ar":"تاريخ الميلاد"},"text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"divider","gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Email","ar":"البريد الإلكتروني"},"text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"divider","gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Password","ar":"كلمة المرور"},"text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"divider","gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Repeat password","ar":"أعد كتابة كلمة المرور"},"text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"divider","gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Mobile number","ar":"رقم الجوال"},"text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"divider","gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Street","ar":"الشارع"},"text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"divider","gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"City","ar":"المدينة"},"text":"","gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"groups","text":{"en":"Three titled groups: About you, Your account, How to reach you","ar":"ثلاث مجموعات بعناوين: بياناتك، حسابك، كيف نتواصل معك"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dawaa","name":{"en":"Dawaa Pharmacy","ar":"صيدلية دواء"},"color":"#059669","icon":"pill","domain":"dawaa.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Sign up","ar":"التسجيل"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"About you","ar":"بياناتك"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"First name","ar":"الاسم الأول"},"text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Last name","ar":"اسم العائلة"},"text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Date of birth","ar":"تاريخ الميلاد"},"text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Your account","ar":"حسابك"},"gap":"xl"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Email","ar":"البريد الإلكتروني"},"text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Password","ar":"كلمة المرور"},"text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Repeat password","ar":"أعد كتابة كلمة المرور"},"text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"How to reach you","ar":"كيف نتواصل معك"},"gap":"xl"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Mobile number","ar":"رقم الجوال"},"text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Street","ar":"الشارع"},"text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"City","ar":"المدينة"},"text":"","gap":"s"}]}}],"answer":["groups"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P10-031","when":["list"],"feedback":{"en":"Nine equal steps feel like one long climb. Group the fields by what they're about, with a bigger gap between groups.","ar":"تسعة حقول متساوية تبدو كمهمّة طويلة واحدة. جمّع الحقول حسب موضوعها، مع مسافة أكبر بين المجموعات."}},{"id":"MC-P10-024","when":["lines"],"feedback":{"en":"Lines between every field cut the form into nine equal pieces. It looks busier and no shorter, because nothing shows which fields belong together.","ar":"الخطوط بين كل حقل وآخر تقطع النموذج إلى تسع قطع متساوية. فيبدو أكثر ازدحامًا وليس أقصر، لأن لا شيء يُظهر أي الحقول مترابطة."}}],"hints":[{"en":"You can't remove fields. What can change how long the form feels?","ar":"لا يمكنك حذف حقول. ما الذي يمكن أن يغيّر شعور الناس بطول النموذج؟"},{"en":"Do lines between every field create groups, or just more lines?","ar":"هل الخطوط بين كل حقل وآخر تصنع مجموعات، أم مجرّد خطوط أكثر؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Three short groups read like three short forms.","ar":"ثلاث مجموعات قصيرة تُقرأ كثلاثة نماذج قصيرة."},"explain":{"en":"Grouping the same nine fields into About you, Your account and How to reach you makes them read as three short forms. The groups must make sense: random chunks of three wouldn't help.","ar":"تجميع الحقول التسعة نفسها في: بياناتك، وحسابك، وكيف نتواصل معك، يجعلها تُقرأ كثلاثة نماذج قصيرة. ويجب أن يكون للمجموعات معنى: تقسيم عشوائي كل ثلاثة حقول لن يفيد."},"speaker":"sara"},{"id":"S07","type":"compare","skill":"SK-P10-U02-03","part":"contrast","confidence":true,"rules":["R11","R15"],"value":{"en":"Teaches the squint test from NN/g: blur a screen until you can't read it; the groups and hierarchy that remain are what people see first. Lines under every item don't survive the blur as groups.","ar":"يعلّم اختبار التحديق (Squint test) من NN/g: موّه الشاشة حتى لا تستطيع القراءة؛ والمجموعات والتسلسل الباقيان هما ما يراه الناس أولًا. الخطوط تحت كل عنصر لا تظهر كمجموعات بعد التمويه."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/visual-hierarchy-ux-definition/","quote":"squint or apply a slight blur to the design"},"prompt":{"en":"Designers check grouping with the squint test: blur the screen until the words can't be read, and see what groups are left. Both versions of the sessions page are blurred. Which one still shows two sessions?","ar":"يختبر المصمّمون التجميع باختبار التحديق (Squint test): موّه الشاشة حتى لا تُقرأ الكلمات، وانظر ما المجموعات الباقية. النسختان من صفحة الجلسات مموّهتان. أيّهما ما زالت تُظهر جلستين؟"},"a":{"mock":{"app":{"id":"manara","name":{"en":"Manara Learning Hub","ar":"منارة"},"color":"#5B3FD6","icon":"chalkboard-teacher","domain":"manara.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Sessions","ar":"الجلسات"},"back":true},"blur":4,"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Sketch Your First App","ar":"ارسم تطبيقك الأول"}},{"kind":"divider","gap":"s"},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"17 November, 18:00","ar":"17 نوفمبر، الساعة 18:00"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"divider","gap":"s"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Free","ar":"مجاني"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"divider","gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","emphasis":"low","text":{"en":"Reserve Sketch","ar":"احجز «ارسم»"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"divider","gap":"s"},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Design Your First Service","ar":"صمّم أول خدمة لك"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"divider","gap":"s"},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"18 November, 10:00","ar":"18 نوفمبر، الساعة 10:00"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"divider","gap":"s"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"EGP 120","ar":"120 جنيهًا"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"divider","gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","emphasis":"low","text":{"en":"Reserve Service","ar":"احجز «صمّم»"},"gap":"s"}]}},"b":{"mock":{"app":{"id":"manara","name":{"en":"Manara Learning Hub","ar":"منارة"},"color":"#5B3FD6","icon":"chalkboard-teacher","domain":"manara.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Sessions","ar":"الجلسات"},"back":true},"blur":4,"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Sketch Your First App","ar":"ارسم تطبيقك الأول"}},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"17 November, 18:00","ar":"17 نوفمبر، الساعة 18:00"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Free","ar":"مجاني"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"button","emphasis":"low","text":{"en":"Reserve Sketch","ar":"احجز «ارسم»"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Design Your First Service","ar":"صمّم أول خدمة لك"},"gap":"xl"},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"18 November, 10:00","ar":"18 نوفمبر، الساعة 10:00"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"EGP 120","ar":"120 جنيهًا"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"button","emphasis":"low","text":{"en":"Reserve Service","ar":"احجز «صمّم»"},"gap":"s"}]}},"answer":"b","reason":{"prompt":{"en":"What does the blur test check?","ar":"ماذا يختبر التمويه؟"},"options":[{"id":"size","text":{"en":"Whether the text is big enough to read","ar":"هل النص كبير بما يكفي للقراءة"}},{"id":"groups","text":{"en":"Whether the groups and what stands out work without reading","ar":"هل المجموعات وما يبرز يعملان دون قراءة"}},{"id":"color","text":{"en":"Whether the colours have enough contrast","ar":"هل الألوان فيها تباين (Contrast) كافٍ"}}],"answer":["groups"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P10-020","when":["size","color"],"feedback":{"en":"Blurring removes the words on purpose. What's left is the shape of the page: its groups and what stands out.","ar":"التمويه يُخفي الكلمات عن قصد. وما يبقى هو شكل الصفحة: مجموعاتها وما يبرز فيها."}}]},"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P10-024","when":["a"],"feedback":{"en":"Blurred, A is eight even stripes. The lines separate every item from every other, so no two items look like they belong together.","ar":"بعد التمويه، A ثمانية خطوط متساوية. الخطوط تفصل كل عنصر عن الآخر، فلا يبدو أي عنصرين مترابطين."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Ignore the words. How many blocks do you see in each version?","ar":"تجاهل الكلمات. كم كتلة ترى في كل نسخة؟"},{"en":"Two sessions should look like two separate blocks.","ar":"يجب أن تبدو الجلستان كتلتين منفصلتين."}],"correct":{"en":"B passes: two clear blocks, even with no words.","ar":"B تنجح: كتلتان واضحتان حتى دون كلمات."},"explain":{"en":"The squint test: squint or blur the screen slightly. If the groups you meant still show, the layout works before anyone reads. Dividers under every line make many equal pieces; spacing makes two sessions.","ar":"اختبار التحديق: ضيّق عينيك أو موّه الشاشة قليلًا. إن بقيت المجموعات التي قصدتها ظاهرة، فالتخطيط يعمل قبل أن يقرأ أحد. الفواصل تحت كل سطر تصنع قطعًا متساوية كثيرة؛ والمسافات تصنع جلستين."}},{"id":"S08","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P10-U02-02","part":"independent","confidence":true,"rules":["R14","R19"],"value":{"en":"New case from NN/g (California's benefits form): an Add button placed among unrelated buttons, far from the fields it adds, is camouflaged. Move it next to what it acts on, not just make it louder.","ar":"حالة جديدة من NN/g (نموذج إعانات في كاليفورنيا): زر إضافة وُضع بين أزرار لا علاقة لها به، بعيدًا عن الحقول التي يضيفها، فاختفى بينها. انقله بجانب ما يعمل عليه، ولا تكتفِ بإبرازه."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/gestalt-proximity/","quote":"grouping together unrelated elements may camouflage them from users"},"scenario":{"en":"I'm reviewing a job-benefits claim form. People must list every employer from the last 18 months. Many send the claim with only one employer, and it gets delayed.","ar":"أراجع نموذج طلب إعانة البطالة. يجب أن يذكر الناس كل جهة عمل خلال آخر 18 شهرًا. كثيرون يرسلون الطلب بجهة عمل واحدة فقط، فيتأخّر."},"prompt":{"en":"What should you change?","ar":"ماذا تغيّر حتى يضيف الناس كل جهات عملهم؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"wazifa","name":{"en":"Wazifa","ar":"وظيفة"},"color":"#1971C2","icon":"identification-card","domain":"wazifa.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Benefits claim","ar":"طلب الإعانة"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Employer 1","ar":"جهة العمل 1"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Employer name","ar":"اسم جهة العمل"},"text":{"en":"Delta Foods","ar":"دلتا للأغذية"},"filled":true,"gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"From","ar":"من"},"text":{"en":"March 2025","ar":"مارس 2025"},"filled":true,"gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"To","ar":"إلى"},"text":{"en":"June 2026","ar":"يونيو 2026"},"filled":true,"gap":"s"},{"kind":"row","gap":"xl","blocks":[{"kind":"button","emphasis":"low","text":{"en":"Add employer","ar":"إضافة جهة عمل"}},{"kind":"button","emphasis":"low","text":{"en":"Save draft","ar":"حفظ كمسودة"}},{"kind":"button","emphasis":"low","text":{"en":"Cancel","ar":"إلغاء"}}]},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Next","ar":"التالي"},"gap":"s"}]},"options":[{"id":"primary","text":{"en":"Make Add employer a filled, bright button in the same row","ar":"اجعل «إضافة جهة عمل» زرًّا ممتلئًا بلون لافت في الصف نفسه"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"wazifa","name":{"en":"Wazifa","ar":"وظيفة"},"color":"#1971C2","icon":"identification-card","domain":"wazifa.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Benefits claim","ar":"طلب الإعانة"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Employer 1","ar":"جهة العمل 1"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Employer name","ar":"اسم جهة العمل"},"text":{"en":"Delta Foods","ar":"دلتا للأغذية"},"filled":true,"gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"From","ar":"من"},"text":{"en":"March 2025","ar":"مارس 2025"},"filled":true,"gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"To","ar":"إلى"},"text":{"en":"June 2026","ar":"يونيو 2026"},"filled":true,"gap":"s"},{"kind":"row","gap":"xl","blocks":[{"kind":"button","emphasis":"high","text":{"en":"Add employer","ar":"إضافة جهة عمل"}},{"kind":"button","emphasis":"low","text":{"en":"Save draft","ar":"حفظ كمسودة"}},{"kind":"button","emphasis":"low","text":{"en":"Cancel","ar":"إلغاء"}}]},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Next","ar":"التالي"},"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"move","text":{"en":"Move \"+ Add another employer\" right under the employer fields, away from Save, Cancel and Next","ar":"انقل «+ إضافة جهة عمل أخرى» تحت حقول جهة العمل مباشرة، بعيدًا عن الحفظ والإلغاء والتالي"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"wazifa","name":{"en":"Wazifa","ar":"وظيفة"},"color":"#1971C2","icon":"identification-card","domain":"wazifa.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Benefits claim","ar":"طلب الإعانة"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Employer 1","ar":"جهة العمل 1"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Employer name","ar":"اسم جهة العمل"},"text":{"en":"Delta Foods","ar":"دلتا للأغذية"},"filled":true,"gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"From","ar":"من"},"text":{"en":"March 2025","ar":"مارس 2025"},"filled":true,"gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"To","ar":"إلى"},"text":{"en":"June 2026","ar":"يونيو 2026"},"filled":true,"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","style":"plain","text":{"en":"+ Add another employer","ar":"+ إضافة جهة عمل أخرى"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"row","gap":"xl","blocks":[{"kind":"button","emphasis":"low","text":{"en":"Save draft","ar":"حفظ كمسودة"}},{"kind":"button","emphasis":"low","text":{"en":"Cancel","ar":"إلغاء"}}]},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Next","ar":"التالي"},"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"rename","text":{"en":"Rename it \"Add employer (if you had more than one)\"","ar":"غيّر اسمه إلى «إضافة جهة عمل (إن كان لديك أكثر من واحدة)»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"wazifa","name":{"en":"Wazifa","ar":"وظيفة"},"color":"#1971C2","icon":"identification-card","domain":"wazifa.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Benefits claim","ar":"طلب الإعانة"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Employer 1","ar":"جهة العمل 1"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Employer name","ar":"اسم جهة العمل"},"text":{"en":"Delta Foods","ar":"دلتا للأغذية"},"filled":true,"gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"From","ar":"من"},"text":{"en":"March 2025","ar":"مارس 2025"},"filled":true,"gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"To","ar":"إلى"},"text":{"en":"June 2026","ar":"يونيو 2026"},"filled":true,"gap":"s"},{"kind":"row","gap":"xl","blocks":[{"kind":"button","emphasis":"low","text":{"en":"Add employer (if you had more than one)","ar":"إضافة جهة عمل (إن كان لديك أكثر من واحدة)"}},{"kind":"button","emphasis":"low","text":{"en":"Save draft","ar":"حفظ كمسودة"}},{"kind":"button","emphasis":"low","text":{"en":"Cancel","ar":"إلغاء"}}]},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Next","ar":"التالي"},"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"first","text":{"en":"Keep the row, but move Add employer to the end of it","ar":"أبقِ الصف، لكن انقل «إضافة جهة عمل» إلى آخره"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"wazifa","name":{"en":"Wazifa","ar":"وظيفة"},"color":"#1971C2","icon":"identification-card","domain":"wazifa.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Benefits claim","ar":"طلب الإعانة"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Employer 1","ar":"جهة العمل 1"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Employer name","ar":"اسم جهة العمل"},"text":{"en":"Delta Foods","ar":"دلتا للأغذية"},"filled":true,"gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"From","ar":"من"},"text":{"en":"March 2025","ar":"مارس 2025"},"filled":true,"gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"To","ar":"إلى"},"text":{"en":"June 2026","ar":"يونيو 2026"},"filled":true,"gap":"s"},{"kind":"row","gap":"xl","blocks":[{"kind":"button","emphasis":"low","text":{"en":"Save draft","ar":"حفظ كمسودة"}},{"kind":"button","emphasis":"low","text":{"en":"Cancel","ar":"إلغاء"}},{"kind":"button","emphasis":"low","text":{"en":"Add employer","ar":"إضافة جهة عمل"}}]},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Next","ar":"التالي"},"gap":"s"}]}}],"answer":["move"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P10-033","when":["primary"],"feedback":{"en":"A bright button now competes with Next, and it still sits among buttons that leave the page. People still won't link it to the employer fields.","ar":"الزر اللافت الآن ينافس «التالي»، وما زال بين أزرار تُخرج من الصفحة. ولن يربطه الناس بحقول جهة العمل."}},{"id":"MC-P10-033","when":["rename","first"],"feedback":{"en":"It's still camouflaged among Save draft and Cancel, far from the fields it adds to. People scanning for \"another employer\" look at the employer fields.","ar":"ما زال مختفيًا بين «حفظ كمسودة» و«إلغاء»، بعيدًا عن الحقول التي يضيف إليها. ومن يبحث عن «جهة عمل أخرى» ينظر إلى حقول جهة العمل."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Where is the Add button now, and what sits next to it?","ar":"أين زر الإضافة الآن، وما الذي بجانبه؟"},{"en":"Brighter or renamed, it still sits in the same row. What does it act on?","ar":"حتى لو صار أوضح أو تغيّر اسمه، فهو ما زال في الصف نفسه. على ماذا يعمل هذا الزر؟"}],"correct":{"en":"An action belongs next to the thing it acts on.","ar":"الإجراء مكانه بجانب الشيء الذي يعمل عليه."},"explain":{"en":"Grouping an action with unrelated buttons camouflages it. Put \"Add another employer\" with the employer fields, and keep Back and Next together as their own group.","ar":"وضع الإجراء مع أزرار لا علاقة لها به يُخفيه بينها. ضع «إضافة جهة عمل أخرى» مع حقول جهة العمل، واجعل «السابق» و«التالي» مجموعة مستقلة."},"speaker":"sara"},{"id":"S09","type":"card","part":"recap","icons":["space","form","eye","list"],"title":{"en":"What you did","ar":"ماذا تعلّمت"},"body":{"en":"- **Gaps:** you fixed a button pulled to the wrong session.\n- **Labels:** each one hugs its own field.\n- **Far means missed:** an optional path or an Add button belongs inside the group it serves.\n- **Long forms and the squint test:** meaningful groups make a form feel shorter, and a blur shows if the groups work.\n\nNext lesson: containers, look-alikes and headings.","ar":"- **المسافات:** أصلحت زرًّا انجذب إلى الجلسة الخطأ.\n- **التسميات:** كل تسمية ملتصقة بحقلها.\n- **البعيد لا يُرى:** الطريق الاختياري أو زر الإضافة مكانه داخل المجموعة التي يخدمها.\n- **النماذج الطويلة واختبار التحديق:** المجموعات ذات المعنى تجعل النموذج يبدو أقصر، والتمويه يكشف إن كانت المجموعات تعمل.\n\nالدرس التالي: الحاويات (Containers) والعناصر المتشابهة والعناوين."}}]}$uxg$::jsonb),
  ($uxg$P10-U02-L02$uxg$, $uxg$711a384d519696619af31064b69b76b668acae6da77474fc6ca38fe4565637bc$uxg$, $uxg${"id":"P10-U02-L02","mode":"lesson","minutes":9,"title":{"en":"Containers, look-alikes and headings","ar":"الحاويات والعناصر المتشابهة والعناوين"},"summary":{"en":"Choose when to use borders, matching styles and headings to group a sessions page.","ar":"اختر متى تستخدم الحدود والأنماط المتشابهة والعناوين لتجميع صفحة الجلسات."},"speaker":"sara","review_labels":{"MC-P10-024":{"en":"More borders don't mean clearer groups","ar":"الحدود الأكثر لا تعني مجموعات أوضح"},"MC-P10-025":{"en":"Matching looks suggest a relationship","ar":"التشابه في الشكل يوحي بعلاقة"},"MC-P10-026":{"en":"Spacing alone is invisible to screen readers","ar":"المسافات وحدها لا يراها الـ Screen reader"},"MC-P10-034":{"en":"A container's edge beats a small gap","ar":"حافة الحاوية أقوى من مسافة صغيرة"},"MC-P10-035":{"en":"Full-width lines and bands look like the end of the page","ar":"الخطوط والأشرطة بعرض الصفحة تبدو كنهايتها"},"MC-P10-036":{"en":"Content styled like ads gets ignored","ar":"المحتوى الذي يشبه الإعلانات يتجاهله الناس"},"MC-P10-037":{"en":"Text that looks like a heading isn't one until it's coded","ar":"النص الذي يشبه العنوان ليس عنوانًا حتى يُعرَّف كعنوان في الكود"}},"steps":[{"id":"S01","type":"card","part":"hook","title":{"en":"\"Add more structure\"","ar":"«أضيفوا تنظيمًا أكثر»"},"body":{"en":"A teammate thinks my sessions page needs more structure. Their plan: a border around every item, and matching green pills for the two prices so they \"look consistent\".\n\nMore structure sounds good. Does it make the groups clearer?","ar":"يرى أحد زملائي أن صفحة الجلسات التي أصمّمها تحتاج إلى تنظيم أكثر. خطته: إطار حول كل عنصر، وشارات خضراء متطابقة للسعرين حتى «يبدوا متناسقين».\n\nالتنظيم الأكثر يبدو فكرة جيدة. لكن هل يجعل المجموعات أوضح؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"manara","name":{"en":"Manara Learning Hub","ar":"منارة"},"color":"#5B3FD6","icon":"chalkboard-teacher","domain":"manara.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Sessions","ar":"الجلسات"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"row","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Sketch Your First App","ar":"ارسم تطبيقك الأول"}},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Design Your First Service","ar":"صمّم أول خدمة لك"}}]},{"kind":"row","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"17 November, 18:00","ar":"17 نوفمبر، الساعة 18:00"}},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"18 November, 10:00","ar":"18 نوفمبر، الساعة 10:00"}}]},{"kind":"row","gap":"m","blocks":[{"kind":"pill","text":{"en":"Free","ar":"مجاني"}},{"kind":"pill","text":{"en":"EGP 120","ar":"120 جنيهًا"}}]},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Reserve","ar":"احجز"},"gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"S02","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P10-U02-04","part":"try","rules":["R12"],"value":{"en":"NN/g: things that look alike are read as related. Matching pills pair the two prices with each other, not with their sessions. Position fixes it; colour can't.","ar":"NN/g: العناصر المتشابهة تُقرأ كأنها مترابطة. الشارتان المتطابقتان تربطان السعرين ببعضهما، لا بجلستيهما. المكان يصلح ذلك؛ واللون لا يستطيع."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/gestalt-similarity/","quote":"Items which share a visual characteristic are perceived as more related"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"manara","name":{"en":"Manara Learning Hub","ar":"منارة"},"color":"#5B3FD6","icon":"chalkboard-teacher","domain":"manara.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Sessions","ar":"الجلسات"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"blocks":[{"kind":"row","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Sketch Your First App","ar":"ارسم تطبيقك الأول"}},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Design Your First Service","ar":"صمّم أول خدمة لك"}}]},{"kind":"row","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"17 November, 18:00","ar":"17 نوفمبر، الساعة 18:00"}},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"18 November, 10:00","ar":"18 نوفمبر، الساعة 10:00"}}]},{"kind":"row","gap":"m","blocks":[{"kind":"pill","text":{"en":"Free","ar":"مجاني"}},{"kind":"pill","text":{"en":"EGP 120","ar":"120 جنيهًا"}}]},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Reserve","ar":"احجز"},"gap":"m"}]},"prompt":{"en":"The teammate gave both prices matching green pills so they \"look consistent\". Reem needs to see which price goes with which session. What should you change?","ar":"أعطى زميلك السعرين شارتين خضراوين متطابقتين حتى «يبدوا متناسقين». وريم تحتاج أن ترى أي سعر يخص أي جلسة. ماذا تغيّر؟"},"options":[{"id":"big","text":{"en":"Make the pills bigger","ar":"كبّر الشارتين"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"manara","name":{"en":"Manara Learning Hub","ar":"منارة"},"color":"#5B3FD6","icon":"chalkboard-teacher","domain":"manara.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Sessions","ar":"الجلسات"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"row","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Sketch Your First App","ar":"ارسم تطبيقك الأول"}},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Design Your First Service","ar":"صمّم أول خدمة لك"}}]},{"kind":"row","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"17 November, 18:00","ar":"17 نوفمبر، الساعة 18:00"}},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"18 November, 10:00","ar":"18 نوفمبر، الساعة 10:00"}}]},{"kind":"row","gap":"m","blocks":[{"kind":"pill","text":{"en":"Free","ar":"مجاني"},"px":20},{"kind":"pill","text":{"en":"EGP 120","ar":"120 جنيهًا"},"px":20}]},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Reserve","ar":"احجز"},"gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"group","text":{"en":"Put each price in its own session's group, close to its title and date","ar":"ضع كل سعر داخل مجموعة جلسته، قريبًا من عنوانها وموعدها"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"manara","name":{"en":"Manara Learning Hub","ar":"منارة"},"color":"#5B3FD6","icon":"chalkboard-teacher","domain":"manara.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Sessions","ar":"الجلسات"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"row","blocks":[{"kind":"group","tone":"plain","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Sketch Your First App","ar":"ارسم تطبيقك الأول"}},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"17 November, 18:00","ar":"17 نوفمبر، الساعة 18:00"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"pill","text":{"en":"Free","ar":"مجاني"},"gap":"xs"}]},{"kind":"group","tone":"plain","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Design Your First Service","ar":"صمّم أول خدمة لك"}},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"18 November, 10:00","ar":"18 نوفمبر، الساعة 10:00"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"pill","text":{"en":"EGP 120","ar":"120 جنيهًا"},"gap":"xs"}]}]},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Reserve","ar":"احجز"},"gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"color","text":{"en":"Give the two pills different colours","ar":"اجعل الشارتين بلونين مختلفين"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"manara","name":{"en":"Manara Learning Hub","ar":"منارة"},"color":"#5B3FD6","icon":"chalkboard-teacher","domain":"manara.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Sessions","ar":"الجلسات"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"row","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Sketch Your First App","ar":"ارسم تطبيقك الأول"}},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Design Your First Service","ar":"صمّم أول خدمة لك"}}]},{"kind":"row","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"17 November, 18:00","ar":"17 نوفمبر، الساعة 18:00"}},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"18 November, 10:00","ar":"18 نوفمبر، الساعة 10:00"}}]},{"kind":"row","gap":"m","blocks":[{"kind":"pill","text":{"en":"Free","ar":"مجاني"}},{"kind":"chip","tone":"warn","text":{"en":"EGP 120","ar":"120 جنيهًا"}}]},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Reserve","ar":"احجز"},"gap":"m"}]}}],"answer":["group"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P10-025","when":["color"],"feedback":{"en":"Different colours only say the prices differ. They still don't say which session each belongs to. Move each price into its session first.","ar":"الألوان المختلفة تقول فقط إن السعرين مختلفان. لكنها لا تقول لأي جلسة ينتمي كل سعر. انقل كل سعر إلى جلسته أولًا."}},{"id":"MC-P10-025","when":["big"],"feedback":{"en":"Bigger pills are easier to see, but they still sit in their own row, away from the session they belong to.","ar":"الشارات الأكبر أسهل في الرؤية، لكنها ما زالت في صف وحدها، بعيدًا عن الجلسة التي تخصها."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Matching pills make the two prices look like one group. Is that true?","ar":"الشكل المتطابق يجعل السعرين يبدوان كمجموعة واحدة. هل هذا صحيح؟"},{"en":"Changing colour or size keeps them apart from their sessions. What puts each price with its session?","ar":"تغيير اللون أو الحجم يبقيهما بعيدين عن جلستيهما. ما الذي يضع كل سعر مع جلسته؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Grouping by position, not by colour.","ar":"التجميع بالمكان، لا باللون."},"explain":{"en":"Matching pills make the two prices look like a pair, apart from their sessions. Put each price with its session; use colour only to support that.","ar":"الشارتان المتطابقتان تجعلان السعرين يبدوان زوجًا، بعيدًا عن جلستيهما. ضع كل سعر مع جلسته، واستخدم اللون لدعم ذلك فقط."}},{"id":"S03","type":"card","part":"concept","icons":["group","warn","fold","promo","ear"],"title":{"en":"Boxes, look-alikes and real headings","ar":"الإطارات والمتشابهات والعناوين الحقيقية"},"body":{"en":"- **Containers:** a shared box or tinted area is a strong grouping cue. It can beat spacing.\n- **Use them with care:** if spacing already shows the groups, extra boxes only add clutter. Boxes help most when a group mixes different kinds of items.\n- **False floors:** a full-width line or band can look like the end of the page, so people stop scrolling.\n- **Look-alikes:** things that look the same seem to work the same. Content styled like an ad gets ignored like one.\n- **Real headings:** for screen-reader users, big bold text is not a heading unless the code says it is.","ar":"- **الحاويات (Containers):** الإطار المشترك أو المساحة الملوّنة إشارة تجميع قوية. وقد تتغلّب على المسافات.\n- **استخدمها بحذر:** إن كانت المسافات تُظهر المجموعات أصلًا، فالإطارات الإضافية تزيد الازدحام فقط. وتفيد أكثر حين تضم المجموعة عناصر من أنواع مختلفة.\n- **النهاية الوهمية (False floor):** الخط أو الشريط بعرض الصفحة قد يبدو كنهايتها، فيتوقّف الناس عن التمرير.\n- **المتشابهات:** العناصر المتشابهة في الشكل تبدو كأنها تعمل بالطريقة نفسها. والمحتوى الذي يشبه الإعلان يُتجاهل مثله.\n- **العناوين الحقيقية:** عند من يستخدمون الـ Screen reader، النص الكبير العريض ليس عنوانًا إلا إذا عُرّف كعنوان في الكود."}},{"id":"S04","type":"compare","skill":"SK-P10-U02-04","part":"guided","rules":["R06","R15"],"value":{"en":"NN/g: a container's boundary is a strong cue that can overpower proximity. A button just outside the card, even very close, reads as part of the page, not the session.","ar":"NN/g: حدود الحاوية إشارة قوية قد تتغلّب على التقارب. الزر الموجود خارج الـ Card مباشرة، حتى لو كان قريبًا جدًا، يُقرأ كجزء من الصفحة لا من الجلسة."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/common-region/","quote":"Creating a clear boundary is a strong visual cue"},"prompt":{"en":"Each session is now a card. In which version does each Reserve button clearly belong to its session?","ar":"أصبحت كل جلسة Card. في أي نسخة ينتمي كل زر «احجز» بوضوح إلى جلسته؟"},"a":{"mock":{"app":{"id":"manara","name":{"en":"Manara Learning Hub","ar":"منارة"},"color":"#5B3FD6","icon":"chalkboard-teacher","domain":"manara.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Sessions","ar":"الجلسات"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"group","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Sketch Your First App","ar":"ارسم تطبيقك الأول"}},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"17 November, 18:00","ar":"17 نوفمبر، الساعة 18:00"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Free","ar":"مجاني"},"gap":"xs"}]},{"kind":"button","emphasis":"low","text":{"en":"Reserve Sketch","ar":"احجز «ارسم»"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"group","gap":"l","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Design Your First Service","ar":"صمّم أول خدمة لك"}},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"18 November, 10:00","ar":"18 نوفمبر، الساعة 10:00"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"EGP 120","ar":"120 جنيهًا"},"gap":"xs"}]},{"kind":"button","emphasis":"low","text":{"en":"Reserve Service","ar":"احجز «صمّم»"},"gap":"xs"}]}},"b":{"mock":{"app":{"id":"manara","name":{"en":"Manara Learning Hub","ar":"منارة"},"color":"#5B3FD6","icon":"chalkboard-teacher","domain":"manara.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Sessions","ar":"الجلسات"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"group","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Sketch Your First App","ar":"ارسم تطبيقك الأول"}},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"17 November, 18:00","ar":"17 نوفمبر، الساعة 18:00"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Free","ar":"مجاني"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"button","emphasis":"low","text":{"en":"Reserve Sketch","ar":"احجز «ارسم»"},"gap":"s"}]},{"kind":"group","gap":"l","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Design Your First Service","ar":"صمّم أول خدمة لك"}},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"18 November, 10:00","ar":"18 نوفمبر، الساعة 10:00"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"EGP 120","ar":"120 جنيهًا"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"button","emphasis":"low","text":{"en":"Reserve Service","ar":"احجز «صمّم»"},"gap":"s"}]}]}},"answer":"b","misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P10-034","when":["a"],"feedback":{"en":"In A the button is very close to its card, but outside the border. The edge wins over the small gap, so the button looks like it belongs to the page, between two sessions.","ar":"في A الزر قريب جدًا من الـ Card، لكنه خارج الإطار. والحافة أقوى من المسافة الصغيرة، فيبدو الزر تابعًا للصفحة، بين جلستين."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Look at where each Reserve button sits: inside or outside a card?","ar":"انظر أين يقع كل زر حجز: داخل الـ Card أم خارجها؟"},{"en":"A card is a group. What should it hold?","ar":"الـ Card مجموعة. ماذا يجب أن تحتوي؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Everything a session needs sits inside its card.","ar":"كل ما تحتاجه الجلسة موجود داخل الـ Card الخاصة بها."},"explain":{"en":"Once you draw a box, the box is the group. A rating or a button just outside a card belongs to the page, not to the card. Put everything that belongs to an item inside its card.","ar":"حين ترسم إطارًا، يصبح الإطار هو المجموعة. والتقييم أو الزر الموجود خارج الـ Card مباشرة ينتمي إلى الصفحة لا إلى الـ Card. ضع كل ما يخص العنصر داخل الـ Card الخاصة به."}},{"id":"S05","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P10-U02-05","part":"guided","rules":["R06","R15"],"value":{"en":"NN/g's illusion of completeness: on Maple's site, 6 of 8 users didn't realise the page scrolled. Full-width bands and big gaps look like the end; let the next content peek above the screen edge.","ar":"وهم الاكتمال من NN/g: في موقع Maple، لم يدرك 6 من 8 مستخدمين أن الصفحة تتحرّك للأسفل. الأشرطة بعرض الصفحة والمسافات الكبيرة تبدو كنهاية؛ اجعل المحتوى التالي يظهر جزء منه فوق حافة الشاشة."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/illusion-of-completeness/","quote":"Six out of eight users did not realize they could scroll down this page"},"scenario":{"en":"This is the first screen of my sessions page on Reem's phone. In testing, most people booked the first session and never saw the second one below.","ar":"هذه أول شاشة من صفحة الجلسات التي أصمّمها على هاتف ريم. في الاختبار، حجز معظم الناس الجلسة الأولى ولم يروا الجلسة الثانية في الأسفل."},"prompt":{"en":"What should you change?","ar":"ماذا تغيّر؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"manara","name":{"en":"Manara Learning Hub","ar":"منارة"},"color":"#5B3FD6","icon":"chalkboard-teacher","domain":"manara.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Sessions","ar":"الجلسات"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"Now: first screen, before scrolling","ar":"الآن: الشاشة الأولى، قبل التمرير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"group","tone":"plain","height":400,"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Workshops this month","ar":"ورش هذا الشهر"}},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Sketch Your First App","ar":"ارسم تطبيقك الأول"},"gap":"l"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"17 November, 18:00","ar":"17 نوفمبر، الساعة 18:00"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Free","ar":"مجاني"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"button","emphasis":"low","text":{"en":"Reserve Sketch","ar":"احجز «ارسم»"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"group","tone":"tint","gap":"xl","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Get monthly updates","ar":"اشترك في التحديثات الشهرية"}},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Subscribe","ar":"اشترك"},"gap":"s"}]},{"kind":"small","text":"","height":150},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Design Your First Service","ar":"صمّم أول خدمة لك"}}]}]},"options":[{"id":"taller","text":{"en":"Make the updates band taller and brighter so it gets noticed","ar":"اجعل شريط التحديثات أطول وأكثر سطوعًا حتى يلفت النظر"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"manara","name":{"en":"Manara Learning Hub","ar":"منارة"},"color":"#5B3FD6","icon":"chalkboard-teacher","domain":"manara.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Sessions","ar":"الجلسات"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After: first screen, before scrolling","ar":"بعد التغيير: الشاشة الأولى، قبل التمرير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"group","tone":"plain","height":400,"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Workshops this month","ar":"ورش هذا الشهر"}},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Sketch Your First App","ar":"ارسم تطبيقك الأول"},"gap":"l"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"17 November, 18:00","ar":"17 نوفمبر، الساعة 18:00"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Free","ar":"مجاني"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"button","emphasis":"low","text":{"en":"Reserve Sketch","ar":"احجز «ارسم»"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"group","tone":"tint","gap":"xl","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Get monthly updates","ar":"اشترك في التحديثات الشهرية"},"px":22},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"Tips, new dates and member offers, once a month.","ar":"نصائح ومواعيد جديدة وعروض للأعضاء، مرة كل شهر."},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Subscribe","ar":"اشترك"},"gap":"s"}]},{"kind":"small","text":"","height":150},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Design Your First Service","ar":"صمّم أول خدمة لك"}}]}]}},{"id":"line","text":{"en":"Add a full-width line under the band to separate it clearly","ar":"أضف خطًا بعرض الصفحة تحت الشريط ليفصله بوضوح"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"manara","name":{"en":"Manara Learning Hub","ar":"منارة"},"color":"#5B3FD6","icon":"chalkboard-teacher","domain":"manara.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Sessions","ar":"الجلسات"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After: first screen, before scrolling","ar":"بعد التغيير: الشاشة الأولى، قبل التمرير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"group","tone":"plain","height":400,"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Workshops this month","ar":"ورش هذا الشهر"}},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Sketch Your First App","ar":"ارسم تطبيقك الأول"},"gap":"l"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"17 November, 18:00","ar":"17 نوفمبر، الساعة 18:00"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Free","ar":"مجاني"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"button","emphasis":"low","text":{"en":"Reserve Sketch","ar":"احجز «ارسم»"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"group","tone":"tint","gap":"xl","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Get monthly updates","ar":"اشترك في التحديثات الشهرية"}},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Subscribe","ar":"اشترك"},"gap":"s"}]},{"kind":"divider","gap":"l"},{"kind":"small","text":"","height":150},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Design Your First Service","ar":"صمّم أول خدمة لك"}}]}]}},{"id":"peek","text":{"en":"Move the band further down and close the gap, so the second session's title shows at the bottom of the first screen","ar":"انقل الشريط إلى الأسفل وقلّل المسافة، حتى يظهر عنوان الجلسة الثانية في أسفل الشاشة الأولى"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"manara","name":{"en":"Manara Learning Hub","ar":"منارة"},"color":"#5B3FD6","icon":"chalkboard-teacher","domain":"manara.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Sessions","ar":"الجلسات"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After: first screen, before scrolling","ar":"بعد التغيير: الشاشة الأولى، قبل التمرير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"group","tone":"plain","height":400,"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Workshops this month","ar":"ورش هذا الشهر"}},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Sketch Your First App","ar":"ارسم تطبيقك الأول"},"gap":"l"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"17 November, 18:00","ar":"17 نوفمبر، الساعة 18:00"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Free","ar":"مجاني"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"button","emphasis":"low","text":{"en":"Reserve Sketch","ar":"احجز «ارسم»"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Design Your First Service","ar":"صمّم أول خدمة لك"},"gap":"xl"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"18 November, 10:00","ar":"18 نوفمبر، الساعة 10:00"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"EGP 120","ar":"120 جنيهًا"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"group","tone":"tint","gap":"xl","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Get monthly updates","ar":"اشترك في التحديثات الشهرية"}},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Subscribe","ar":"اشترك"},"gap":"s"}]}]}]}},{"id":"tight","text":{"en":"Make the gaps inside the first session smaller","ar":"صغّر المسافات داخل الجلسة الأولى"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"manara","name":{"en":"Manara Learning Hub","ar":"منارة"},"color":"#5B3FD6","icon":"chalkboard-teacher","domain":"manara.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Sessions","ar":"الجلسات"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After: first screen, before scrolling","ar":"بعد التغيير: الشاشة الأولى، قبل التمرير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"group","tone":"plain","height":400,"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Workshops this month","ar":"ورش هذا الشهر"}},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Sketch Your First App","ar":"ارسم تطبيقك الأول"},"gap":"l"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"17 November, 18:00","ar":"17 نوفمبر، الساعة 18:00"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Free","ar":"مجاني"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"button","emphasis":"low","text":{"en":"Reserve Sketch","ar":"احجز «ارسم»"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"group","tone":"tint","gap":"xl","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Get monthly updates","ar":"اشترك في التحديثات الشهرية"}},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Subscribe","ar":"اشترك"},"gap":"s"}]},{"kind":"small","text":"","height":150},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Design Your First Service","ar":"صمّم أول خدمة لك"}}]}]}}],"answer":["peek"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P10-035","when":["taller","line"],"feedback":{"en":"A bigger band or an extra full-width line makes the screen look even more finished. Both are classic causes of a false floor.","ar":"الشريط الأكبر أو الخط الإضافي بعرض الصفحة يجعل الشاشة تبدو منتهية أكثر. وكلاهما من أشهر أسباب النهاية الوهمية."}},{"id":"MC-P10-035","when":["tight"],"feedback":{"en":"The first session is already grouped well. The problem is below it: the band and the empty space look like the bottom of the page.","ar":"الجلسة الأولى مجمّعة جيدًا أصلًا. المشكلة تحتها: الشريط والمساحة الفارغة يبدوان كأسفل الصفحة."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Look at the bottom of the first screen. What tells Reem there's more below?","ar":"انظر إلى أسفل الشاشة الأولى. ما الذي يخبر ريم أن هناك المزيد في الأسفل؟"},{"en":"A band or line across the screen can look like the end of the page.","ar":"الشريط أو الخط على عرض الشاشة قد يبدو كنهاية الصفحة."}],"correct":{"en":"Content that peeks over the edge says \"there's more\".","ar":"المحتوى الظاهر جزئيًا عند الحافة يقول «هناك المزيد»."},"explain":{"en":"This is the illusion of completeness. Full-width bands, strong lines and big empty gaps look like a page's floor. Letting the next item show at the screen edge is the clearest cue to keep scrolling.","ar":"هذا ما يُسمّى وهم الاكتمال (Illusion of completeness). الأشرطة بعرض الصفحة والخطوط القوية والمسافات الفارغة الكبيرة تبدو كنهاية الصفحة. وظهور العنصر التالي عند حافة الشاشة هو أوضح إشارة لمواصلة التمرير."},"speaker":"sara"},{"id":"S06","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P10-U02-04","part":"guided","rules":["R06","R14"],"value":{"en":"From an NN/g study (Martha Stewart site): a video the same size and style as the ads around it was taken for an ad and skipped. Useful content must not look like ads.","ar":"من دراسة NN/g (موقع Martha Stewart): فيديو بحجم وشكل الإعلانات حوله ظنّه الناس إعلانًا وتجاهلوه. المحتوى المفيد يجب ألّا يشبه الإعلانات."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/gestalt-similarity/","quote":"Users mistook the video in the right rail"},"scenario":{"en":"On a laptop, my workshop page has a short video of what you'll make. It sits in the side column between two ads, at the same size and style. Very few visitors play it.","ar":"في صفحة الورشة التي أصمّمها على الـ Laptop فيديو قصير لما ستصنعه. وهو في العمود الجانبي بين إعلانين، بالحجم والشكل نفسيهما. قليلون جدًا يشغّلونه."},"prompt":{"en":"What should you change?","ar":"ماذا تغيّر؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"manara","name":{"en":"Manara Learning Hub","ar":"منارة"},"color":"#5B3FD6","icon":"chalkboard-teacher","domain":"manara.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"manara.example","caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"blocks":[{"kind":"row","blocks":[{"kind":"group","tone":"plain","blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Sketch Your First App","ar":"ارسم تطبيقك الأول"}},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"17 November, 18:00","ar":"17 نوفمبر، الساعة 18:00"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"Learn to sketch screens on paper before you open any design tool.","ar":"تعلّم رسم الشاشات على الورق قبل أن تفتح أي أداة تصميم."},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Reserve Sketch","ar":"احجز «ارسم»"},"gap":"m"}]},{"kind":"group","tone":"tint","blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Ad","ar":"إعلان"}},{"kind":"image","art":"phone","size":"s","text":{"en":"Phone deals","ar":"عروض الهواتف"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Video","ar":"فيديو"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"image","size":"s","text":{"en":"▶ What you'll make","ar":"▶ ما ستصنعه"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Ad","ar":"إعلان"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"image","size":"s","text":{"en":"Learn English fast","ar":"تعلّم الإنجليزية بسرعة"},"gap":"xs"}]}]}]},"options":[{"id":"auto","text":{"en":"Make the video play by itself","ar":"اجعل الفيديو يعمل تلقائيًا"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"manara","name":{"en":"Manara Learning Hub","ar":"منارة"},"color":"#5B3FD6","icon":"chalkboard-teacher","domain":"manara.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"manara.example","caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"row","blocks":[{"kind":"group","tone":"plain","blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Sketch Your First App","ar":"ارسم تطبيقك الأول"}},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"17 November, 18:00","ar":"17 نوفمبر، الساعة 18:00"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"Learn to sketch screens on paper before you open any design tool.","ar":"تعلّم رسم الشاشات على الورق قبل أن تفتح أي أداة تصميم."},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Reserve Sketch","ar":"احجز «ارسم»"},"gap":"m"}]},{"kind":"group","tone":"tint","blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Ad","ar":"إعلان"}},{"kind":"image","art":"phone","size":"s","text":{"en":"Phone deals","ar":"عروض الهواتف"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Video","ar":"فيديو"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"image","size":"s","text":{"en":"▶ Playing… What you'll make","ar":"▶ يعمل الآن… ما ستصنعه"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Ad","ar":"إعلان"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"image","size":"s","text":{"en":"Learn English fast","ar":"تعلّم الإنجليزية بسرعة"},"gap":"xs"}]}]}]}},{"id":"bigger","text":{"en":"Make all three boxes in the side column bigger","ar":"كبّر المربعات الثلاثة في العمود الجانبي"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"manara","name":{"en":"Manara Learning Hub","ar":"منارة"},"color":"#5B3FD6","icon":"chalkboard-teacher","domain":"manara.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"manara.example","caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"row","blocks":[{"kind":"group","tone":"plain","blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Sketch Your First App","ar":"ارسم تطبيقك الأول"}},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"17 November, 18:00","ar":"17 نوفمبر، الساعة 18:00"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"Learn to sketch screens on paper before you open any design tool.","ar":"تعلّم رسم الشاشات على الورق قبل أن تفتح أي أداة تصميم."},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Reserve Sketch","ar":"احجز «ارسم»"},"gap":"m"}]},{"kind":"group","tone":"tint","blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Ad","ar":"إعلان"}},{"kind":"image","art":"phone","size":"m","text":{"en":"Phone deals","ar":"عروض الهواتف"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Video","ar":"فيديو"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"image","size":"m","text":{"en":"▶ What you'll make","ar":"▶ ما ستصنعه"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Ad","ar":"إعلان"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"image","size":"m","text":{"en":"Learn English fast","ar":"تعلّم الإنجليزية بسرعة"},"gap":"xs"}]}]}]}},{"id":"move","text":{"en":"Move the video into the workshop details, styled differently from the ads","ar":"انقل الفيديو إلى تفاصيل الورشة، بشكل مختلف عن الإعلانات"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"manara","name":{"en":"Manara Learning Hub","ar":"منارة"},"color":"#5B3FD6","icon":"chalkboard-teacher","domain":"manara.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"manara.example","caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"row","blocks":[{"kind":"group","tone":"plain","blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Sketch Your First App","ar":"ارسم تطبيقك الأول"}},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"17 November, 18:00","ar":"17 نوفمبر، الساعة 18:00"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"Learn to sketch screens on paper before you open any design tool.","ar":"تعلّم رسم الشاشات على الورق قبل أن تفتح أي أداة تصميم."},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"image","size":"m","text":{"en":"▶ Watch: what you will make (1 min)","ar":"▶ شاهد: ما ستصنعه (دقيقة واحدة)"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Reserve Sketch","ar":"احجز «ارسم»"},"gap":"m"}]},{"kind":"group","tone":"tint","blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Ad","ar":"إعلان"}},{"kind":"image","art":"phone","size":"s","text":{"en":"Phone deals","ar":"عروض الهواتف"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Ad","ar":"إعلان"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"image","size":"s","text":{"en":"Learn English fast","ar":"تعلّم الإنجليزية بسرعة"},"gap":"xs"}]}]}]}}],"answer":["move"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P10-036","when":["auto","bigger"],"feedback":{"en":"It would still look like the boxes around it, and people skip that column because they expect ads there. Make it look like part of the workshop.","ar":"سيبقى شبيهًا بالمربعات حوله، والناس يتخطّون ذلك العمود لأنهم يتوقّعون فيه إعلانات. اجعله يبدو جزءًا من الورشة."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Where does the video sit, and what does it look like next to it?","ar":"أين يقع الفيديو، وبماذا يشبه ما بجانبه؟"},{"en":"Things that look like ads get skipped. Will bigger or autoplay fix that?","ar":"ما يبدو كإعلان يتجاهله الناس. هل سيصلح ذلك التكبير أو التشغيل التلقائي؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Out of the ad slot, into the content it belongs to.","ar":"خارج مكان الإعلانات، وداخل المحتوى الذي ينتمي إليه."},"explain":{"en":"Similarity makes the video one of the ads. People expect ads in the side column, so anything there that looks like an ad gets skipped with them. This is banner blindness.","ar":"التشابه يجعل الفيديو واحدًا من الإعلانات. الناس يتوقّعون الإعلانات في العمود الجانبي، فكل ما يشبه الإعلان هناك يتخطّونه معها. وهذا ما يُسمّى عمى الإعلانات (Banner blindness)."},"speaker":"sara"},{"id":"S07","type":"compare","skill":"SK-P10-U02-03","part":"contrast","confidence":true,"rules":["R11","R15"],"value":{"en":"NN/g: borders added \"in an abundance of caution\" create clutter. Prefer whitespace; add a container only where spacing can't do the job.","ar":"NN/g: الإطارات المضافة «من باب الاحتياط» تصنع ازدحامًا. فضّل المسافات البيضاء، وأضف Container فقط حين لا تكفي المسافات."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/common-region/","quote":"proximity is enough to signal grouping"},"prompt":{"en":"Both versions are grouped correctly. Which one makes the two sessions easier to take in?","ar":"النسختان مجمّعتان بشكل صحيح. أيّهما تجعل الجلستين أسهل في الفهم بنظرة؟"},"a":{"mock":{"app":{"id":"manara","name":{"en":"Manara Learning Hub","ar":"منارة"},"color":"#5B3FD6","icon":"chalkboard-teacher","domain":"manara.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Sessions","ar":"الجلسات"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"group","blocks":[{"kind":"line","text":{"en":"Sketch Your First App","ar":"ارسم تطبيقك الأول"}},{"kind":"line","text":{"en":"17 November, 18:00","ar":"17 نوفمبر، الساعة 18:00"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"line","text":{"en":"Free","ar":"مجاني"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","emphasis":"low","text":{"en":"Reserve Sketch","ar":"احجز «ارسم»"},"gap":"s"}]},{"kind":"group","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"line","text":{"en":"Design Your First Service","ar":"صمّم أول خدمة لك"}},{"kind":"line","text":{"en":"18 November, 10:00","ar":"18 نوفمبر، الساعة 10:00"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"line","text":{"en":"EGP 120","ar":"120 جنيهًا"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","emphasis":"low","text":{"en":"Reserve Service","ar":"احجز «صمّم»"},"gap":"s"}]},{"kind":"line","text":{"en":"Get monthly updates","ar":"اشترك في التحديثات الشهرية"},"gap":"s"}]}},"b":{"mock":{"app":{"id":"manara","name":{"en":"Manara Learning Hub","ar":"منارة"},"color":"#5B3FD6","icon":"chalkboard-teacher","domain":"manara.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Sessions","ar":"الجلسات"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Sketch Your First App","ar":"ارسم تطبيقك الأول"}},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"17 November, 18:00","ar":"17 نوفمبر، الساعة 18:00"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Free","ar":"مجاني"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"button","emphasis":"low","text":{"en":"Reserve Sketch","ar":"احجز «ارسم»"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Design Your First Service","ar":"صمّم أول خدمة لك"},"gap":"xl"},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"18 November, 10:00","ar":"18 نوفمبر، الساعة 10:00"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"EGP 120","ar":"120 جنيهًا"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"button","emphasis":"low","text":{"en":"Reserve Service","ar":"احجز «صمّم»"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"link","text":{"en":"Get monthly updates","ar":"اشترك في التحديثات الشهرية"},"gap":"xl"}]}},"answer":"b","reason":{"prompt":{"en":"When would boxes be worth adding?","ar":"متى تستحق الإطارات الإضافة؟"},"options":[{"id":"always","text":{"en":"Always: a box makes every group clearer","ar":"دائمًا: الإطار يوضّح أي مجموعة"}},{"id":"needed","text":{"en":"When spacing can't show the groups, for example when a group mixes images, text and buttons","ar":"حين لا تكفي المسافات لإظهار المجموعات، مثلًا حين تضم المجموعة صورًا ونصوصًا وأزرارًا"}},{"id":"never","text":{"en":"Never: boxes look old-fashioned","ar":"أبدًا: الإطارات تبدو قديمة"}}],"answer":["needed"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P10-024","when":["always","never"],"feedback":{"en":"It's not about style, and boxes aren't free. Each one adds lines to process. Use one when spacing alone can't make the group clear.","ar":"الأمر لا يتعلّق بالأسلوب، والإطارات ليست بلا ثمن. كل واحد يضيف خطوطًا على العين أن تعالجها. استخدمه حين لا تكفي المسافات وحدها لتوضيح المجموعة."}}]},"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P10-024","when":["a"],"feedback":{"en":"A boxes every line inside each card: you see eleven boxes before you see two sessions. The spacing in B already does the grouping.","ar":"A تضع إطارًا لكل سطر داخل كل Card: ترى أحد عشر إطارًا قبل أن ترى جلستين. والمسافات في B تقوم بالتجميع أصلًا."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Both are grouped correctly. Count the boxes and lines in each.","ar":"كلتاهما مجمّعة بشكل صحيح. عُدّ الإطارات والخطوط في كل منهما."},{"en":"If spacing already shows the groups, what do extra boxes add?","ar":"إذا كانت المسافات توضّح المجموعات مسبقًا، فماذا تضيف الإطارات الزائدة؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Spacing and headings, no boxes needed.","ar":"مسافات وعناوين، دون حاجة إلى إطارات."},"explain":{"en":"Boxes added just in case cost attention: every border is a line to process. When spacing already shows the groups, removing the boxes cuts visual noise and frees room for content.","ar":"الإطارات المضافة «احتياطًا» لها ثمن: كل حدّ خطّ على العين أن تعالجه. وحين تُظهر المسافات المجموعات أصلًا، فإزالة الإطارات تخفّف الضجيج البصري وتفسح مكانًا للمحتوى."}},{"id":"S08","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P10-U02-06","part":"independent","confidence":true,"rules":["R14","U29"],"value":{"en":"NN/g on mobile screen readers: users jump from heading to heading, and \"it is not enough to use large, bolded fonts that look like headings\". Group names must be coded as headings.","ar":"NN/g عن الـ Screen reader على الهاتف: ينتقل المستخدمون من عنوان إلى عنوان، و«لا يكفي استخدام خط كبير عريض يشبه العناوين». يجب تعريف أسماء المجموعات كعناوين في الكود."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/screen-reader-users-on-mobile/","quote":"It is not enough to use large, bolded fonts that look like headings"},"scenario":{"en":"I'm designing a hospital's clinic list. Nesma is blind and uses a screen reader on her phone. To find the eye clinic, she jumps from heading to heading. The only heading she can reach is \"Our clinics\".","ar":"أصمّم قائمة العيادات في مستشفى. نسمة كفيفة وتستخدم قارئ الشاشة (Screen reader) على هاتفها. لتجد عيادة العيون، تنتقل من عنوان إلى عنوان. والعنوان الوحيد الذي تصل إليه هو «عياداتنا»."},"prompt":{"en":"The clinic names look like headings on screen. What should you change?","ar":"أسماء العيادات تبدو كعناوين على الشاشة. ماذا تغيّر حتى تصل نسمة إلى عيادة العيون مباشرة؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Our clinics","ar":"عياداتنا"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Our clinics","ar":"عياداتنا"}},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Dental clinic","ar":"عيادة الأسنان"},"gap":"l"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Floor 2 · Sat to Thu, 9:00 to 17:00","ar":"الطابق 2 · من السبت إلى الخميس، من 9:00 إلى 17:00"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Eye clinic","ar":"عيادة العيون"},"gap":"l"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Floor 3 · Sun to Thu, 10:00 to 16:00","ar":"الطابق 3 · من الأحد إلى الخميس، من 10:00 إلى 16:00"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"group","tone":"tint","gap":"xl","blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Headings the screen reader finds:","ar":"العناوين التي يجدها الـ Screen reader:"}},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"1. Our clinics","ar":"1. عياداتنا"},"gap":"xs"}]}]},"options":[{"id":"bigger","text":{"en":"Make the clinic names bigger and bolder","ar":"كبّر أسماء العيادات واجعلها أعرض"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha C