e group of choices.","ar":"من الدرس 1: الطريق الاختياري البعيد عن الأزرار الرئيسية يجعل الخطوة تبدو إلزامية. مكانه داخل مجموعة الخيارات."},"speaker":"hana"},{"id":"S04","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P10-U02-05","part":"check","rules":["R19"],"value":{"en":"Skill check, false floors (NN/g): a full-width band plus empty space looks like the end of the page; let the next item peek.","ar":"اختبار مهارة، النهاية الوهمية (NN/g): الشريط بعرض الصفحة مع مساحة فارغة يبدو كنهايتها؛ اجعل العنصر التالي يظهر جزئيًا."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/illusion-of-completeness/","quote":"Six out of eight users did not realize they could scroll down this page"},"scenario":{"en":"This is the first screen of our Sunday classes. Spinning is below the invite banner. Few people book it.","ar":"هذه الشاشة الأولى من حصص الأحد عندنا. حصة السبينينغ تحت شريط الدعوة. وقليلون يحجزونها."},"prompt":{"en":"What should you change?","ar":"ماذا تغيّر؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Sunday classes","ar":"حصص الأحد"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"Now: first screen, before scrolling","ar":"الآن: الشاشة الأولى، قبل التمرير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"group","tone":"plain","height":360,"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Sunday classes","ar":"حصص الأحد"}},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Morning Yoga","ar":"يوغا الصباح"},"gap":"l"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Sunday 07:00 · Coach Dina","ar":"الأحد 07:00 · المدرّبة دينا"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"chip","text":{"en":"3 spots left","ar":"باقي 3 أماكن"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"button","emphasis":"low","text":{"en":"Book Yoga","ar":"احجز اليوغا"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"divider","gap":"l"},{"kind":"group","tone":"tint","gap":"l","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Invite a friend, get a free class","ar":"ادعُ صديقًا واحصل على حصة مجانية"}}]},{"kind":"small","text":"","height":80},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Spinning","ar":"سبينينغ"}}]}]},"options":[{"id":"line","text":{"en":"Add a second full-width line under the banner","ar":"أضف خطًا ثانيًا بعرض الصفحة تحت الشريط"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Sunday classes","ar":"حصص الأحد"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After: first screen, before scrolling","ar":"بعد التغيير: الشاشة الأولى، قبل التمرير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"group","tone":"plain","height":360,"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Sunday classes","ar":"حصص الأحد"}},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Morning Yoga","ar":"يوغا الصباح"},"gap":"l"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Sunday 07:00 · Coach Dina","ar":"الأحد 07:00 · المدرّبة دينا"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"chip","text":{"en":"3 spots left","ar":"باقي 3 أماكن"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"button","emphasis":"low","text":{"en":"Book Yoga","ar":"احجز اليوغا"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"divider","gap":"l"},{"kind":"group","tone":"tint","gap":"l","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Invite a friend, get a free class","ar":"ادعُ صديقًا واحصل على حصة مجانية"}}]},{"kind":"divider","gap":"l"},{"kind":"small","text":"","height":80},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Spinning","ar":"سبينينغ"}}]}]}},{"id":"bigger","text":{"en":"Make the banner bigger so people stop at it","ar":"كبّر الشريط حتى يتوقّف الناس عنده"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Sunday classes","ar":"حصص الأحد"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After: first screen, before scrolling","ar":"بعد التغيير: الشاشة الأولى، قبل التمرير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"group","tone":"plain","height":360,"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Sunday classes","ar":"حصص الأحد"}},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Morning Yoga","ar":"يوغا الصباح"},"gap":"l"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Sunday 07:00 · Coach Dina","ar":"الأحد 07:00 · المدرّبة دينا"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"chip","text":{"en":"3 spots left","ar":"باقي 3 أماكن"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"button","emphasis":"low","text":{"en":"Book Yoga","ar":"احجز اليوغا"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"divider","gap":"l"},{"kind":"group","tone":"tint","gap":"l","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Invite a friend, get a free class","ar":"ادعُ صديقًا واحصل على حصة مجانية"},"px":22},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"Bring a friend this month and you both get a free class.","ar":"ادعُ صديقًا هذا الشهر واحصلا معًا على حصة مجانية."},"gap":"xs"}]},{"kind":"small","text":"","height":80},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Spinning","ar":"سبينينغ"}}]}]}},{"id":"peek","text":{"en":"Move the banner after Spinning and close the gap, so Spinning starts on the first screen","ar":"انقل الشريط بعد السبينينغ وقلّل المسافة، حتى تبدأ حصة السبينينغ في الشاشة الأولى"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Sunday classes","ar":"حصص الأحد"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After: first screen, before scrolling","ar":"بعد التغيير: الشاشة الأولى، قبل التمرير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"group","tone":"plain","height":360,"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Sunday classes","ar":"حصص الأحد"}},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Morning Yoga","ar":"يوغا الصباح"},"gap":"l"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Sunday 07:00 · Coach Dina","ar":"الأحد 07:00 · المدرّبة دينا"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"chip","text":{"en":"3 spots left","ar":"باقي 3 أماكن"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"button","emphasis":"low","text":{"en":"Book Yoga","ar":"احجز اليوغا"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Spinning","ar":"سبينينغ"},"gap":"xl"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Sunday 19:00 · Coach Tarek","ar":"الأحد 19:00 · المدرّب طارق"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"chip","tone":"warn","text":{"en":"Full, join waiting list","ar":"مكتمل، انضم لقائمة الانتظار"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"group","tone":"tint","gap":"xl","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Invite a friend, get a free class","ar":"ادعُ صديقًا واحصل على حصة مجانية"}}]}]}]}}],"answer":["peek"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P10-035","when":["line","bigger"],"feedback":{"en":"Lines, wide bands and empty space are exactly what make a page look finished. Let the next class show on the first screen.","ar":"الخطوط والأشرطة العريضة والمساحات الفارغة هي بالضبط ما يجعل الصفحة تبدو منتهية. اجعل الحصة التالية تظهر في الشاشة الأولى."}}],"explain":{"en":"From Lesson 2: the illusion of completeness. The line, the banner and the gap below it form a false floor. Content that starts on the first screen tells people to keep going.","ar":"من الدرس 2: وهم الاكتمال. الخط والشريط والمسافة تحته تصنع نهاية وهمية. والمحتوى الذي يبدأ في الشاشة الأولى يخبر الناس أن يكملوا."},"speaker":"hana"},{"id":"S05","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P10-U02-06","part":"check","rules":["R19","U29"],"value":{"en":"Skill check, real headings (NN/g): screen-reader users jump between coded headings; text that only looks like a heading can't be reached that way.","ar":"اختبار مهارة، العناوين الحقيقية (NN/g): مستخدمو الـ Screen reader ينتقلون بين العناوين المعرّفة في الكود؛ والنص الذي يشبه العنوان فقط لا يمكن الوصول إليه بهذه الطريقة."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/screen-reader-users-on-mobile/","quote":"It is not enough to use large, bolded fonts that look like headings"},"scenario":{"en":"Rana's friend Hala uses a screen reader. She jumps by headings, and our app reads only \"Sunday classes\". The class names are big, bold text.","ar":"هالة صديقة رنا تستخدم الـ Screen reader. تنتقل بين العناوين، فيقرأ تطبيقنا «حصص الأحد» فقط. وأسماء الحصص نص كبير عريض."},"prompt":{"en":"What should you change so Hala can jump straight to Spinning?","ar":"ماذا تغيّر حتى تنتقل هالة مباشرة إلى حصة السبينينغ؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Sunday classes","ar":"حصص الأحد"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"blocks":[{"kind":