s a laptop user: the price, the rule, and step-free access for those who need it. Cut only what's decorative.","ar":"مستخدم الهاتف يحتاج المعلومات نفسها التي يحتاجها مستخدم الـ Laptop: السعر، والشرط، والدخول دون سلالم لمن يحتاجه. احذف فقط ما هو للزينة."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Which of these does Reem need to decide or to come?","ar":"أيّ هذه تحتاجها ريم لتقرّر أو لتحضر؟"},{"en":"Every fact stays. What on the page is only decoration?","ar":"كل المعلومات تبقى. ما الشيء في الصفحة الذي هو مجرد زينة؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Shrink what's optional; keep every fact.","ar":"صغّر الاختياري؛ وأبقِ كل معلومة."},"explain":{"en":"A smaller screen changes how much fits at once, not what people need. The few people who need step-free access need it just as much on a phone.","ar":"الشاشة الأصغر تغيّر كم يتّسع في المرة الواحدة، لا ما يحتاجه الناس. والقليلون الذين يحتاجون الدخول دون سلالم يحتاجونه على الهاتف بالقدر نفسه."},"speaker":"sara"},{"id":"S06","type":"compare","skill":"SK-P10-U04-04","part":"contrast","confidence":true,"rules":["R11","R15"],"value":{"en":"Contrast: responsive works in both directions. NN/g on content dispersion: a mobile-first page scaled up to desktop becomes large and overly dispersed; keep critical, related content grouped in the same viewport.","ar":"مقارنة: التصميم المتجاوب يعمل في الاتجاهين. NN/g عن تشتّت المحتوى: صفحة «الهاتف أولًا» المكبّرة على الكمبيوتر تصبح ضخمة ومتفرّقة؛ أبقِ المحتوى المهم والمترابط مجموعًا في الشاشة نفسها."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/content-dispersion/","quote":"Keep critical, related content grouped together in the same viewport."},"scenario":{"en":"On another project, my team designed the phone page first. Now we're making the laptop version of the same page.","ar":"في مشروع آخر، صمّم فريقي صفحة الهاتف أولًا. والآن نصنع نسخة الـ Laptop من الصفحة نفسها."},"prompt":{"en":"Which laptop version should ship?","ar":"أي نسخة للـ Laptop تستفيد من العرض لتُبقي المعلومات وزر الحجز معًا؟"},"a":{"mock":{"app":{"id":"manara","name":{"en":"Manara Learning Hub","ar":"منارة"},"color":"#5B3FD6","icon":"chalkboard-teacher","domain":"manara.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"manara.example/workshops/sketching-basics","height":300,"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"people","size":"l","height":200,"text":{"en":"Photo: Learn together","ar":"صورة: نتعلّم معًا"}},{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Sketch Your First App","ar":"ارسم تطبيقك الأول"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Tuesday 17 November, 18:00–20:00","ar":"الثلاثاء 17 نوفمبر، من 18:00 إلى 20:00"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Downtown Learning Hub, Room 2","ar":"مركز التعلّم بوسط البلد، قاعة 2"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Free","ar":"مجاني"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Reserve a place","ar":"احجز مكانك"},"gap":"m"}]}},"b":{"mock":{"app":{"id":"manara","name":{"en":"Manara Learning Hub","ar":"منارة"},"color":"#5B3FD6","icon":"chalkboard-teacher","domain":"manara.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"manara.example/workshops/sketching-basics","height":300,"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Sketch Your First App","ar":"ارسم تطبيقك الأول"}},{"kind":"row","gap":"m","blocks":[{"kind":"group","tone":"plain","blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"people","size":"m","text":{"en":"Photo: Learn together","ar":"صورة: نتعلّم معًا"}},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Tuesday 17 November, 18:00–20:00","ar":"الثلاثاء 17 نوفمبر، من 18:00 إلى 20:00"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Downtown Learning Hub, Room 2","ar":"مركز التعلّم بوسط البلد، قاعة 2"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Cancel up to 24 hours before the start","ar":"يمكنك الإلغاء قبل الموعد بـ 24 ساعة على الأقل"},"gap":"s"}]},{"kind":"group","blocks":[{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Free","ar":"مجاني"}},{"kind":"chip","text":{"en":"4 places left","ar":"باقي 4 أماكن"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Reserve a place","ar":"احجز مكانك"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"link","text":{"en":"View step-free access details","ar":"تفاصيل الدخول دون سلالم"},"gap":"s"}]}]}]}},"answer":"b","reason":{"prompt":{"en":"Why is B better on a laptop?","ar":"لماذا B أفضل على الـ Laptop؟"},"options":[{"id":"wide","text":{"en":"Wide screens should always use two columns","ar":"الشاشات العريضة يجب أن تستخدم عمودين دائمًا"}},{"id":"together","text":{"en":"The facts and Reserve are seen together, without scrolling past a huge photo","ar":"المعلومات وزر الحجز يظهران معًا، دون تمرير بعد صورة ضخمة"}},{"id":"same","text":{"en":"Layouts should look different on every device","ar":"يجب أن يبدو التخطيط مختلفًا في كل جهاز"}}],"answer":["together"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P10-065","when":["wide","same"],"feedback":{"en":"The number of columns isn't the point. A stretches the phone layout, so the photo fills the screen and the facts and Reserve end up far below.","ar":"عدد الأعمدة ليس المقصود. A تمطّ تخطيط الهاتف، فتملأ الصورة الشاشة وينتهي الأمر بالمعلومات وزر الحجز بعيدًا في الأسفل."}}]},"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P10-065","when":["a"],"feedback":{"en":"A is the phone layout stretched wide: one huge photo, then everything else far below. Use the extra width to keep related things together.","ar":"A هي تخطيط الهاتف ممطوطًا: صورة ضخمة واحدة، ثم كل شيء آخر بعيدًا في الأسفل. استخدم العرض الإضافي لتُبقي الأشياء المترابطة معًا."}}],"hints":[{"en":"The laptop has much more room. What does each version do with it?","ar":"الـ Laptop فيه مساحة أكبر بكثير. ماذا تفعل كل نسخة بهذه المساحة؟"},{"en":"Does a stretched phone layout use a wide screen well?","ar":"هل تخطيط الهاتف الممدود يستخدم الشاشة العريضة جيدًا؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Rearrange for the big screen too.","ar":"أعِد الترتيب للشاشة الكبيرة أيضًا."},"explain":{"en":"Stacking was right for the phone because the screen is narrow. On a laptop the same stack spreads out, and people scroll for what used to sit side by side. Each width gets its own arrangement of the same content.","ar":"كان الرصّ صحيحًا للهاتف لأن الشاشة ضيّقة. أما على الـ Laptop فالعمود نفسه يمتدّ كثيرًا، ويمرّر الناس بحثًا عمّا كان متجاورًا. لكل عرض ترتيبه الخاص للمحتوى نفسه."},"speaker":"sara"},{"id":"S07","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P10-U04-02","part":"independent","rules":["R14","R19"],"value":{"en":"New case. Responsive design (NN/g): on a smartphone, users may have to scroll a long way to discover the content they need; prioritize it.","ar":"حالة جديدة. التصميم المتجاوب (NN/g): على الهاتف قد يضطر المستخدمون إلى تمرير طويل ليجدوا المحتوى الذي يحتاجونه؛ فرتّب الأولويات."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/responsive-web-design-definition/","quote":"On a smartphone, users may have to scroll endlessly to discover the content of interest."},"scenario":{"en":"I'm fixing a pharmacy's pickup page. Mariam is picking up medicine there. On a laptop, the page shows a big map beside the pickup details. On her phone, the map now comes first, and it's taller than the screen.","ar":"أعمل على إصلاح صفحة الاستلام في صيدلية. تستلم مريم دواءً من هناك. على الـ Laptop، تعرض الصفحة خريطة كبيرة بجانب تفاصيل الاستلام. وعلى هاتفها، تأتي الخريطة الآن أولًا، وهي أطول من الشاشة."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each phone layout. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل تخطيط للهاتف. أيّ تخطيط يُري مريم رمز الاستلام والعنوان أولًا؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dawaa","name":{"en":"Dawaa Pharmacy","ar":"صيدلية دواء"},"color":"#059669","icon":"pill","domain":"dawaa.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Pickup","ar":"الاستلام"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"width":300,"height":380,"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"map","size":"l","height":330,"text":{"en":"Map","ar":"خريطة"}},{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Ready for pickup","ar":"جاهز للاستلام"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Pickup code: 4417","ar":"رمز الاستلام: 4417"},"gap":"s"}]},"options":[{"id":"details","text":{"en":"Pickup code, address and hours first, then a \"Get directions\" button; a small map after","ar":"رمز الاستلام والعنوان والمواعيد أولًا، ثم زر «اعرف الطريق»؛ وخريطة صغيرة بعدها"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dawaa","name":{"en":"Dawaa Pharmacy","ar":"صيدلية دواء"},"color":"#059669","icon":"pill","domain":"dawaa.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Pickup","ar":"الاستلام"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"width":300,"height":380,"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Ready for pickup","ar":"جاهز للاستلام"}},{"kind":"meta","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Pickup code: 4417","ar":"رمز الاستلام: 4417"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"12 Tahrir Street, ground floor","ar":"12 شارع التحرير، الطابق الأرضي"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Open today until 22:00","ar":"مفتوح اليوم حتى الساعة 22:00"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Get directions","ar":"اعرف الطريق"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"image","art":"map","size":"m","text":{"en":"Map","ar":"خريطة"},"gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"shrink","text":{"en":"Keep the map first, but make it half as tall","ar":"أبقِ الخريطة أولًا، لكن اجعل طولها النصف"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dawaa","name":{"en":"Dawaa Pharmacy","ar":"صيدلية دواء"},"color":"#059669","icon":"pill","domain":"dawaa.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Pickup","ar":"الاستلام"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"width":300,"height":380,"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"map","size":"l","height":165,"text":{"en":"Map","ar":"خريطة"}},{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Ready for pickup","ar":"جاهز للاستلام"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Pickup code: 4417","ar":"رمز الاستلام: 4417"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"12 Tahrir Street, ground floor","ar":"12 شارع التحرير، الطابق الأرضي"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Open today until 22:00","ar":"مفتوح اليوم حتى الساعة 22:00"},"gap":"xs"}]}},{"id":"maponly","text":{"en":"Show only the map on phones, with the pharmacy as a pin","ar":"اعرض الخريطة فقط على الهاتف، والصيدلية علامة عليها"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dawaa","name":{"en":"Dawaa Pharmacy","ar":"صيدلية دواء"},"color":"#059669","icon":"pill","domain":"dawaa.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Pickup","ar":"الاستلام"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"width":300,"height":380,"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"map","size":"l","height":360,"text":{"en":"Map with a pin","ar":"خريطة عليها علامة"}}]}}],"answer":["details"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P10-062","when":["shrink"],"feedback":{"en":"A smaller map still pushes the pickup code down. Mariam needs the code and the address first; the map supports them.","ar":"الخريطة الأصغر ما زالت تدفع رمز الاستلام إلى الأسفل. مريم تحتاج الرمز والعنوان أولًا؛ والخريطة تساندهما."}},{"id":"MC-P10-061","when":["maponly"],"feedback":{"en":"Now the pickup code and opening hours are gone on phones, and Mariam needs them at the counter. Keep every fact.","ar":"الآن اختفى رمز الاستلام ومواعيد العمل على الهاتف، ومريم تحتاجهما عند الشبّاك. أبقِ كل معلومة."}}],"hints":[{"en":"What does Mariam need to collect her medicine?","ar":"ماذا تحتاج مريم لاستلام دوائها؟"},{"en":"The map helps her get there. Should it come before the facts?","ar":"الخريطة تساعدها على الوصول. هل يجب أن تأتي قبل المعلومات؟"}],"correct":{"en":"The facts first; the map supports them.","ar":"المعلومات أولًا؛ والخريطة تساندها."},"explain":{"en":"Same move as Reem's page: on a phone, choose the order. The code, address and hours are what Mariam needs; the map and directions help her get there.","ar":"الخطوة نفسها التي فعلتها في صفحة ريم: على الهاتف، اختر الترتيب. الرمز والعنوان والمواعيد هي ما تحتاجه مريم؛ والخريطة والطريق يساعدانها على الوصول."},"speaker":"sara"},{"id":"S08","type":"card","part":"recap","icons":["phone","list","eye","layers"],"title":{"en":"What you did","ar":"ماذا تعلّمت"},"body":{"en":"- **Stack, don't shrink:** one readable column on the phone.\n- **Plan the order:** the facts, then the action, then the extras.\n- **Same facts everywhere:** shrank the photo; kept every fact.\n- **Both directions:** gave the laptop its own arrangement too.\n\nNext lesson: checking a layout at every width, not just one.","ar":"- **رُصّ ولا تصغّر:** عمود واحد مقروء على الهاتف.\n- **خطّط الترتيب:** المعلومات، ثم الإجراء، ثم الإضافات.\n- **المعلومات نفسها في كل مكان:** صغّرت الصورة؛ وأبقيت كل معلومة.\n- **في الاتجاهين:** أعطيت الـ Laptop ترتيبه الخاص أيضًا.\n\nالدرس التالي: فحص التخطيط على كل عرض، لا على عرض واحد."}}]}$uxg$::jsonb),
  ($uxg$P10-U04-L02$uxg$, $uxg$0794fbb6a5f719e5be91bf98433da107621724552f6656f038e3aa84ddf49d08$uxg$, $uxg${"id":"P10-U04-L02","mode":"lesson","minutes":8,"title":{"en":"Check every width, not one screenshot","ar":"افحص كل عرض، لا لقطة شاشة واحدة"},"summary":{"en":"Check a page at many phone widths and find what one screenshot hides.","ar":"افحص صفحة على عروض هواتف كثيرة واكتشف ما تُخفيه لقطة شاشة واحدة."},"speaker":"sara","review_labels":{"MC-P10-060":{"en":"Responsive isn't scaling everything down","ar":"التصميم المتجاوب (Responsive design) ليس تصغير كل شيء"},"MC-P10-061":{"en":"Hide what's optional, never what decides","ar":"أخفِ الاختياري، لا ما يحسم القرار"},"MC-P10-063":{"en":"One screenshot doesn't prove a layout works","ar":"لقطة شاشة واحدة لا تثبت أن التخطيط يعمل"},"MC-P10-078":{"en":"Fitting isn't the same as usable","ar":"الاتّساع ليس هو سهولة الاستخدام"}},"steps":[{"id":"S01","type":"card","part":"hook","title":{"en":"\"Mobile done\"","ar":"«انتهينا من الهاتف»"},"body":{"en":"A teammate checked my workshop page on their own phone and shared a screenshot: \"Mobile done.\"\n\nThe screenshot looks great. But phones come in many widths, and so do tablets and laptop windows.","ar":"فحص أحد زملائي صفحة الورشة التي أصمّمها على هاتفه وشارك لقطة شاشة: «انتهينا من الهاتف».\n\nاللقطة تبدو رائعة. لكن الهواتف بعروض كثيرة، وكذلك الأجهزة اللوحية ونوافذ الـ Laptop."},"mock":{"app":{"id":"manara","name":{"en":"Manara Learning Hub","ar":"منارة"},"color":"#5B3FD6","icon":"chalkboard-teacher","domain":"manara.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Workshop","ar":"الورشة"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"The teammate's phone","ar":"هاتف الزميل"},"width":340,"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Sketch Your First App","ar":"ارسم تطبيقك الأول"}},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Tuesday 17 November, 18:00–20:00","ar":"الثلاثاء 17 نوفمبر، من 18:00 إلى 20:00"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"row","gap":"m","blocks":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Reserve a place","ar":"احجز مكانك"}},{"kind":"button","emphasis":"low","text":{"en":"Add to calendar","ar":"أضف إلى التقويم"}}]}]}},{"id":"S02","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P10-U04-01","part":"try","rules":["R12"],"value":{"en":"Responsive design (NN/g): page elements reshuffle as the viewport shrinks. On a narrower phone, rows that fit before must be allowed to rearrange, not shrink or overflow.","ar":"التصميم المتجاوب (NN/g): تُعاد ترتيب عناصر الصفحة كلما صغرت الشاشة. وعلى هاتف أضيق، يجب أن يُسمح للصفوف التي كانت تتّسع بأن يُعاد ترتيبها، لا أن تصغر أو تخرج عن الشاشة."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/responsive-web-design-definition/","quote":"In responsive design, page elements reshuffle as the viewport grows or shrinks."},"prompt":{"en":"Here's the same page on a narrower phone. The title is cut off and the second button runs off the screen. Try each fix. Which one should ship?","ar":"هذه الصفحة نفسها على هاتف أضيق. العنوان مقطوع، والزر الثاني يخرج عن الشاشة. جرّب كل إصلاح. أيّ إصلاح يُظهر العنوان والزرّين كاملين ومقروءين؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"manara","name":{"en":"Manara Learning Hub","ar":"منارة"},"color":"#5B3FD6","icon":"chalkboard-teacher","domain":"manara.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Workshop","ar":"الورشة"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"Now, narrow phone","ar":"الآن، هاتف ضيّق"},"width":250,"blocks":[{"kind":"title","nowrap":true,"text":{"en":"Sketch Your First App","ar":"ارسم تطبيقك الأول"}},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Tuesday 17 November, 18:00–20:00","ar":"الثلاثاء 17 نوفمبر، من 18:00 إلى 20:00"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"group","tone":"plain","scroll":true,"colw":150,"gap":"m","blocks":[{"kind":"row","blocks":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Reserve a place","ar":"احجز مكانك"}},{"kind":"button","emphasis":"low","text":{"en":"Add to calendar","ar":"أضف إلى التقويم"}}]}]}]},"options":[{"id":"small","text":{"en":"Make all the text smaller on narrow phones so it fits","ar":"صغّر كل النصوص على الهواتف الضيّقة حتى تتّسع"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"manara","name":{"en":"Manara Learning Hub","ar":"منارة"},"color":"#5B3FD6","icon":"chalkboard-teacher","domain":"manara.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Workshop","ar":"الورشة"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"width":250,"blocks":[{"kind":"text","px":13,"weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Sketch Your First App","ar":"ارسم تطبيقك الأول"}},{"kind":"text","px":9,"text":{"en":"Tuesday 17 November, 18:00–20:00","ar":"الثلاثاء 17 نوفمبر، من 18:00 إلى 20:00"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"row","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"button","px":8,"text":{"en":"Reserve a place","ar":"احجز مكانك"}},{"kind":"button","px":8,"emphasis":"low","text":{"en":"Add to calendar","ar":"أضف إلى التقويم"}}]}]}},{"id":"wrap","text":{"en":"Let the title wrap, and stack the buttons when the row doesn't fit","ar":"اسمح للعنوان بالالتفاف، وضع الزرّين فوق بعض حين لا يتّسع الصف"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"manara","name":{"en":"Manara Learning Hub","ar":"منارة"},"color":"#5B3FD6","icon":"chalkboard-teacher","domain":"manara.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Workshop","ar":"الورشة"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"width":250,"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Sketch Your First App","ar":"ارسم تطبيقك الأول"}},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Tuesday 17 November, 18:00–20:00","ar":"الثلاثاء 17 نوفمبر، من 18:00 إلى 20:00"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Reserve a place","ar":"احجز مكانك"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"button","emphasis":"low","text":{"en":"Add to calendar","ar":"أضف إلى التقويم"},"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"drop","text":{"en":"Remove Add to calendar on narrow phones","ar":"احذف «أضف إلى التقويم» على الهواتف الضيّقة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"manara","name":{"en":"Manara Learning Hub","ar":"منارة"},"color":"#5B3FD6","icon":"chalkboard-teacher","domain":"manara.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Workshop","ar":"الورشة"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"width":250,"blocks":[{"kind":"title","nowrap":true,"text":{"en":"Sketch Your First App","ar":"ارسم تطبيقك الأول"}},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Tuesday 17 November, 18:00–20:00","ar":"الثلاثاء 17 نوفمبر، من 18:00 إلى 20:00"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Reserve a place","ar":"احجز مكانك"},"gap":"m"}]}}],"answer":["wrap"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P10-060","when":["small"],"feedback":{"en":"Everything fits, but now nothing is comfortable to read. Rearrange instead: let lines wrap and rows stack.","ar":"كل شيء يتّسع، لكن لا شيء صار مريحًا في القراءة. أعِد الترتيب بدلًا من ذلك: دع الأسطر تلتفّ والصفوف تتراصّ."}},{"id":"MC-P10-061","when":["drop"],"feedback":{"en":"People with narrow phones want to add the session to their calendar too, and the title is still cut off. Keep the action; change the arrangement.","ar":"أصحاب الهواتف الضيّقة يريدون إضافة الجلسة إلى التقويم أيضًا، والعنوان ما زال مقطوعًا. أبقِ الإجراء؛ وغيّر الترتيب."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Look at what's cut off. Is anything missing on purpose?","ar":"انظر إلى ما انقطع. هل هناك شيء محذوف عمدًا؟"},{"en":"Smaller text is harder to read, and a missing button is missing. What can move instead?","ar":"النص الأصغر أصعب في القراءة، والزر المحذوف لم يعد موجودًا. ما الذي يمكن أن يتحرّك بدلًا من ذلك؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Same content, rearranged for the narrow screen.","ar":"المحتوى نفسه، بترتيب جديد للشاشة الضيّقة."},"explain":{"en":"The teammate's screenshot couldn't show this: it broke only on a narrower screen. Lines that wrap and rows that stack keep working as the screen shrinks.","ar":"لم تستطع لقطة الزميل إظهار هذا: فالمشكلة ظهرت فقط على شاشة أضيق. والأسطر التي تلتفّ والصفوف التي تتراصّ تبقى تعمل كلما ضاقت الشاشة."}},{"id":"S03","type":"card","part":"concept","icons":["phone","layers","eye","form"],"title":{"en":"A layout lives across a range","ar":"التخطيط يعيش على مدى من العروض"},"body":{"en":"A layout isn't one size; it has to work from the narrowest phone to a wide laptop window.\n\n- **Breakpoint:** a width where the design switches to a different layout, such as from one column to two. Most designs need only 2 or 3.\n- **Check the range:** the narrowest width, the widest, and just above and below each breakpoint, where things break most.\n- **Fitting isn't enough:** a layout can fit on screen and still be hard to use.\n- **Tell the developers:** for each breakpoint, say what changes. One screenshot can't.","ar":"التخطيط ليس حجمًا واحدًا؛ بل يجب أن يعمل من أضيق هاتف إلى أعرض نافذة Laptop.\n\n- **نقطة التحوّل (Breakpoint):** عرض يتحوّل عنده التصميم إلى تخطيط مختلف، مثل الانتقال من عمود إلى عمودين. ومعظم التصاميم تحتاج 2 أو 3 فقط.\n- **افحص المدى كله:** أضيق عرض، وأعرض عرض، وما فوق كل نقطة تحوّل وما تحتها مباشرة، حيث تنكسر الأشياء غالبًا.\n- **الاتّساع لا يكفي:** قد يتّسع التخطيط في الشاشة ويبقى صعب الاستخدام.\n- **أخبر المطوّرين:** لكل نقطة تحوّل، قل ما الذي يتغيّر. لقطة واحدة لا تستطيع ذلك."}},{"id":"S04","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P10-U04-01","part":"guided","rules":["R06","R13"],"value":{"en":"Breakpoints (NN/g): a breakpoint is a screen size where the design adjusts to a different layout; once designed and tested, communicate to developers how the design will change.","ar":"نقاط التحوّل (NN/g): نقطة التحوّل حجم شاشة يتغيّر عنده التصميم إلى تخطيط مختلف؛ وبعد التصميم والاختبار، أخبر المطوّرين كيف سيتغيّر التصميم."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/breakpoints-in-responsive-design/","quote":"communicate to developers how the design will change"},"scenario":{"en":"My page has one breakpoint: below it, one column; above it, two. You're handing my design to the developers.","ar":"لصفحتي نقطة تحوّل واحدة: تحتها عمود واحد، وفوقها عمودان. وأنت تسلّم تصميمي للمطوّرين."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each handoff. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل طريقة تسليم. أيّ طريقة تُخبر المطوّرين كيف تعمل الصفحة على كل عرض؟"},"start":"one","options":[{"id":"one","text":{"en":"The phone screenshot: \"Mobile done\"","ar":"لقطة الهاتف: «انتهينا من الهاتف»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"manara","name":{"en":"Manara Learning Hub","ar":"منارة"},"color":"#5B3FD6","icon":"chalkboard-teacher","domain":"manara.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Workshop","ar":"الورشة"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"Handoff","ar":"التسليم"},"blocks":[{"kind":"group","blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Phone screenshot","ar":"لقطة الهاتف"}},{"kind":"image","size":"m","text":{"en":"Phone layout","ar":"تخطيط الهاتف"},"gap":"xs"}]}]}},{"id":"notes","text":{"en":"Both layouts, plus what changes at the breakpoint and what must wrap","ar":"التخطيطان، مع ما يتغيّر عند نقطة التحوّل وما يجب أن يلتفّ"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"manara","name":{"en":"Manara Learning Hub","ar":"منارة"},"color":"#5B3FD6","icon":"chalkboard-teacher","domain":"manara.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Workshop","ar":"الورشة"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"Handoff","ar":"التسليم"},"blocks":[{"kind":"row","blocks":[{"kind":"image","size":"s","text":{"en":"Phone layout","ar":"تخطيط الهاتف"}},{"kind":"image","size":"s","text":{"en":"Laptop layout","ar":"تخطيط الـ Laptop"}}]},{"kind":"group","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Below the breakpoint: one column; booking panel after the facts; photo becomes a thumbnail.","ar":"تحت نقطة التحوّل: عمود واحد؛ لوحة الحجز بعد المعلومات؛ والصورة تصبح مصغّرة."}},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Titles wrap, never cut off. Button rows stack when they don't fit.","ar":"العناوين تلتفّ ولا تُقطع أبدًا. وصفوف الأزرار تتراصّ حين لا تتّسع."},"gap":"xs"}]}]}},{"id":"two","text":{"en":"The phone and laptop screenshots, side by side","ar":"لقطتا الهاتف والـ Laptop، جنبًا إلى جنب"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"manara","name":{"en":"Manara Learning Hub","ar":"منارة"},"color":"#5B3FD6","icon":"chalkboard-teacher","domain":"manara.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Workshop","ar":"الورشة"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"Handoff","ar":"التسليم"},"blocks":[{"kind":"row","blocks":[{"kind":"image","size":"m","text":{"en":"Phone layout","ar":"تخطيط الهاتف"}},{"kind":"image","size":"m","text":{"en":"Laptop layout","ar":"تخطيط الـ Laptop"}}]}]}}],"answer":["notes"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P10-063","when":["one","two"],"feedback":{"en":"Screenshots show two widths. They don't say what happens in between, or what should wrap on a narrower phone. Write down what changes.","ar":"اللقطات تُظهر عرضين. ولا تقول ماذا يحدث بينهما، أو ما الذي يجب أن يلتفّ على هاتف أضيق. اكتب ما الذي يتغيّر."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Phones and windows come in many widths. Does a screenshot show what happens between them?","ar":"الهواتف والنوافذ بعروض كثيرة. هل تُظهر لقطة الشاشة ما يحدث بينها؟"},{"en":"What does a developer need to know at the breakpoint?","ar":"ماذا يحتاج المطوّر أن يعرف عند نقطة التحوّل؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Say what changes, not just how two sizes look.","ar":"قل ما الذي يتغيّر، لا كيف يبدو حجمان فقط."},"explain":{"en":"Developers build the whole range, not two pictures. Short notes on what changes at each breakpoint, and what must wrap or stack, stop the gaps from being guessed.","ar":"المطوّرون يبنون المدى كله، لا صورتين. والملاحظات القصيرة عمّا يتغيّر عند كل نقطة تحوّل، وما يجب أن يلتفّ أو يتراصّ، تُغنيهم عن تخمين ما بينهما."},"speaker":"sara"},{"id":"S05","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P10-U04-01","part":"guided","rules":["R06","R15"],"value":{"en":"Breakpoints (NN/g): at a smaller breakpoint, a right column may collapse into the main content area or become available elsewhere.","ar":"نقاط التحوّل (NN/g): عند نقطة تحوّل أصغر، قد يندمج العمود الأيمن في منطقة المحتوى الرئيسي أو يصبح متاحًا في مكان آخر."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/breakpoints-in-responsive-design/","quote":"A right column, if present, may collapse into the main content area or become available elsewhere."},"scenario":{"en":"On a wide laptop, my page has a third column, \"Other sessions\", that people use when this one is full. On a tablet, three columns no longer fit.","ar":"على الـ Laptop العريض، في صفحتي عمود ثالث «جلسات أخرى» يستخدمه الناس حين تكون هذه الجلسة مكتملة. وعلى الجهاز اللوحي، لم تعد الأعمدة الثلاثة تتّسع."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each tablet layout. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل تخطيط للجهاز اللوحي. أيّ تخطيط يُبقي «جلسات أخرى» موجودة ومقروءة؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"manara","name":{"en":"Manara Learning Hub","ar":"منارة"},"color":"#5B3FD6","icon":"chalkboard-teacher","domain":"manara.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Workshop","ar":"الورشة"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"Now, tablet","ar":"الآن، جهاز لوحي"},"width":460,"blocks":[{"kind":"row","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"group","tone":"plain","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Sketch Your First App","ar":"ارسم تطبيقك الأول"}},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Tuesday 17 November, 18:00–20:00","ar":"الثلاثاء 17 نوفمبر، من 18:00 إلى 20:00"},"gap":"xs"}]},{"kind":"group","blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Free","ar":"مجاني"}},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Reserve a place","ar":"احجز مكانك"},"gap":"s"}]},{"kind":"group","tone":"tint","blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Other sessions","ar":"جلسات أخرى"}},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Next session: Tuesday 24 November, 18:00","ar":"الجلسة التالية: الثلاثاء 24 نوفمبر، 18:00"},"gap":"xs"}]}]}]},"options":[{"id":"squeeze","text":{"en":"Keep all three columns, narrower","ar":"أبقِ الأعمدة الثلاثة، لكن أضيق"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"manara","name":{"en":"Manara Learning Hub","ar":"منارة"},"color":"#5B3FD6","icon":"chalkboard-teacher","domain":"manara.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Workshop","ar":"الورشة"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"width":460,"blocks":[{"kind":"row","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"group","tone":"plain","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Sketch Your First App","ar":"ارسم تطبيقك الأول"}},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Tuesday 17 November, 18:00–20:00","ar":"الثلاثاء 17 نوفمبر، من 18:00 إلى 20:00"},"gap":"xs"}]},{"kind":"group","blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Free","ar":"مجاني"}},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Reserve a place","ar":"احجز مكانك"},"gap":"s"}]},{"kind":"group","tone":"tint","blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Other sessions","ar":"جلسات أخرى"}},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Next session: Tuesday 24 November, 18:00","ar":"الجلسة التالية: الثلاثاء 24 نوفمبر، 18:00"},"gap":"xs"}]}]}]}},{"id":"collapse","text":{"en":"Two columns; \"Other sessions\" moves under the details in the main column","ar":"عمودان؛ و«جلسات أخرى» تنتقل تحت التفاصيل في العمود الرئيسي"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"manara","name":{"en":"Manara Learning Hub","ar":"منارة"},"color":"#5B3FD6","icon":"chalkboard-teacher","domain":"manara.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Workshop","ar":"الورشة"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"width":460,"blocks":[{"kind":"row","gap":"m","blocks":[{"kind":"group","tone":"plain","blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Sketch Your First App","ar":"ارسم تطبيقك الأول"}},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Tuesday 17 November, 18:00–20:00","ar":"الثلاثاء 17 نوفمبر، من 18:00 إلى 20:00"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Other sessions","ar":"جلسات أخرى"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Next session: Tuesday 24 November, 18:00","ar":"الجلسة التالية: الثلاثاء 24 نوفمبر، 18:00"},"gap":"xs"}]},{"kind":"group","blocks":[{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Free","ar":"مجاني"}},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Reserve a place","ar":"احجز مكانك"},"gap":"s"}]}]}]}},{"id":"drop","text":{"en":"Two columns; drop \"Other sessions\" on tablets","ar":"عمودان؛ واحذف «جلسات أخرى» على الأجهزة اللوحية"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"manara","name":{"en":"Manara Learning Hub","ar":"منارة"},"color":"#5B3FD6","icon":"chalkboard-teacher","domain":"manara.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Workshop","ar":"الورشة"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"width":460,"blocks":[{"kind":"row","gap":"m","blocks":[{"kind":"group","tone":"plain","blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Sketch Your First App","ar":"ارسم تطبيقك الأول"}},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Tuesday 17 November, 18:00–20:00","ar":"الثلاثاء 17 نوفمبر، من 18:00 إلى 20:00"},"gap":"xs"}]},{"kind":"group","blocks":[{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Free","ar":"مجاني"}},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Reserve a place","ar":"احجز مكانك"},"gap":"s"}]}]}]}}],"answer":["collapse"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P10-060","when":["squeeze"],"feedback":{"en":"Three narrow columns break every line into a word or two. When columns stop fitting, change the layout.","ar":"ثلاثة أعمدة ضيّقة تكسر كل سطر إلى كلمة أو اثنتين. حين تتوقّف الأعمدة عن الاتّساع، غيّر التخطيط."}},{"id":"MC-P10-061","when":["drop"],"feedback":{"en":"People rely on \"Other sessions\" when this one is full, and they'd lose it on tablets. Move it; don't remove it.","ar":"يعتمد الناس على «جلسات أخرى» حين تكون هذه الجلسة مكتملة، وسيفقدونها على الأجهزة اللوحية. انقلها؛ لا تحذفها."}}],"hints":[{"en":"When is \"Other sessions\" used?","ar":"متى يُستخدم قسم «جلسات أخرى»؟"},{"en":"If it can't stay a column, can it go somewhere else instead of disappearing?","ar":"إذا لم يستطع أن يبقى عمودًا، هل يمكن أن ينتقل إلى مكان آخر بدلًا من أن يختفي؟"}],"correct":{"en":"The side column moves into the main one.","ar":"العمود الجانبي ينتقل إلى العمود الرئيسي."},"explain":{"en":"At each breakpoint, decide where every column goes. A side column usually folds into the main content, so nothing is lost and nothing is squeezed.","ar":"عند كل نقطة تحوّل، قرّر أين يذهب كل عمود. والعمود الجانبي عادةً يندمج في المحتوى الرئيسي، فلا يضيع شيء ولا يُعصر شيء."},"speaker":"sara"},{"id":"S06","type":"compare","skill":"SK-P10-U04-05","part":"contrast","confidence":true,"rules":["R11","R15"],"value":{"en":"Contrast with S02: here nothing overflows, yet one version is still hard to use. NN/g: ensuring that elements fit within a page is not enough.","ar":"مقارنة مع الخطوة 2: هنا لا شيء يخرج عن الشاشة، ومع ذلك تبقى نسخة صعبة الاستخدام. NN/g: التأكّد من أن العناصر تتّسع في الصفحة لا يكفي."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/responsive-web-design-definition/","quote":"However, ensuring that elements fit within a page is not enough."},"scenario":{"en":"On the narrowest phone, after reserving on my page, Reem can add the session to her calendar, share it, or get directions. Both versions fit the screen.","ar":"على أضيق هاتف، وبعد الحجز في صفحتي، تستطيع ريم إضافة الجلسة إلى التقويم، أو مشاركتها، أو معرفة الطريق. والنسختان تتّسعان في الشاشة."},"prompt":{"en":"Which version should ship?","ar":"أي نسخة يجب أن تُطلق؟"},"a":{"mock":{"app":{"id":"manara","name":{"en":"Manara Learning Hub","ar":"منارة"},"color":"#5B3FD6","icon":"chalkboard-teacher","domain":"manara.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Booked","ar":"تم الحجز"},"back":true},"width":250,"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"You're booked!","ar":"تمّ حجزك!"}},{"kind":"row","gap":"m","blocks":[{"kind":"button","px":9,"text":{"en":"Calendar","ar":"التقويم"}},{"kind":"button","px":9,"emphasis":"low","text":{"en":"Share","ar":"مشاركة"}},{"kind":"button","px":9,"emphasis":"low","text":{"en":"Directions","ar":"الطريق"}}]}]}},"b":{"mock":{"app":{"id":"manara","name":{"en":"Manara Learning Hub","ar":"منارة"},"color":"#5B3FD6","icon":"chalkboard-teacher","domain":"manara.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Booked","ar":"تم الحجز"},"back":true},"width":250,"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"You're booked!","ar":"تمّ حجزك!"}},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Add to calendar","ar":"أضف إلى التقويم"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"button","emphasis":"low","text":{"en":"Share","ar":"مشاركة"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","emphasis":"low","text":{"en":"Get directions","ar":"اعرف الطريق"},"gap":"s"}]}},"answer":"b","reason":{"prompt":{"en":"What makes A worse, if both fit?","ar":"ما الذي يجعل A أسوأ، إن كانت النسختان تتّسعان؟"},"options":[{"id":"fit","text":{"en":"Nothing; if it fits, it works","ar":"لا شيء؛ ما دام يتّسع فهو يعمل"}},{"id":"tiny","text":{"en":"The buttons fit only by becoming tiny, with shortened labels that are hard to read and tap","ar":"الأزرار تتّسع فقط لأنها صارت صغيرة جدًا، بنصوص مختصرة يصعب قراءتها والضغط عليها"}},{"id":"three","text":{"en":"Three buttons on one screen is always too many","ar":"ثلاثة أزرار في شاشة واحدة كثيرة دائمًا"}}],"answer":["tiny"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P10-078","when":["fit","three"],"feedback":{"en":"Three buttons are fine. A fits only because the text and buttons shrank. Check that it's comfortable, not just that it fits.","ar":"ثلاثة أزرار مقبولة. لكن A تتّسع فقط لأن النص والأزرار صغرت. افحص أنها مريحة، لا أنها تتّسع فقط."}}]},"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P10-078","when":["a"],"feedback":{"en":"A fits, but the labels are tiny and cut short, and the buttons are hard to hit. Fitting on screen isn't the goal; being usable is.","ar":"A تتّسع، لكن نصوص الأزرار صغيرة جدًا ومختصرة، والأزرار يصعب إصابتها. الاتّساع في الشاشة ليس الهدف؛ سهولة الاستخدام هي الهدف."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Both fit. Try tapping each button.","ar":"كلتاهما تناسب الشاشة. جرّب الضغط على كل زر."},{"en":"Are the buttons big enough, and far enough apart, to tap with a thumb?","ar":"هل الأزرار كبيرة بما يكفي ومتباعدة بما يكفي للضغط بالإبهام؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Usable, not just fitting.","ar":"سهل الاستخدام، لا متّسع فقط."},"explain":{"en":"In S02 something overflowed, so the problem was easy to see. Here everything fits, which is why it slips through review. When you check a width, ask whether people can read and tap everything comfortably.","ar":"في الخطوة 2 خرج شيء عن الشاشة، فكانت المشكلة سهلة الرؤية. أما هنا فكل شيء يتّسع، ولهذا تمرّ في المراجعة. حين تفحص عرضًا، اسأل: هل يستطيع الناس قراءة كل شيء والضغط عليه بارتياح؟"},"speaker":"sara"},{"id":"S07","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P10-U04-01","part":"independent","rules":["R14","R19"],"value":{"en":"New case. Responsive design (NN/g): elements reshuffle as the viewport shrinks. A row that fits on most phones has to wrap on the narrowest ones.","ar":"حالة جديدة. التصميم المتجاوب (NN/g): تُعاد ترتيب العناصر كلما صغرت الشاشة. والصف الذي يتّسع في معظم الهواتف يجب أن يلتفّ في أضيقها."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/responsive-web-design-definition/","quote":"page elements reshuffle as the viewport grows or shrinks"},"scenario":{"en":"I'm reviewing a delivery app. On Lina's narrow phone, the driver's name and the Call button sit in one row that's wider than the screen, so the page scrolls sideways.","ar":"أراجع تطبيق توصيل. على هاتف لينا الضيّق، اسم السائق وزر الاتصال في صف واحد أعرض من الشاشة، فتتحرّك الصفحة جانبيًا."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each fix. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل إصلاح. أيّها يجب أن يُطلق؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"tayyar","name":{"en":"Tayyar","ar":"طيّار"},"color":"#EA580C","icon":"moped","domain":"tayyar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Your order","ar":"طلبك"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"Now, narrow phone","ar":"الآن، هاتف ضيّق"},"width":250,"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Arriving 19:40","ar":"يصل الساعة 19:40"}},{"kind":"group","tone":"plain","scroll":true,"colw":150,"gap":"m","blocks":[{"kind":"row","blocks":[{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Driver: Marwan Hassan","ar":"السائق: مروان حسن"}},{"kind":"button","emphasis":"low","text":{"en":"Call driver","ar":"اتصل بالسائق"}}]}]},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Order A-2291: 2 shawarma, 1 salad","ar":"الطلب A-2291: 2 شاورما، 1 سلطة"},"gap":"s"}]},"options":[{"id":"hide","text":{"en":"Hide the Call button on narrow phones","ar":"أخفِ زر الاتصال على الهواتف الضيّقة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"tayyar","name":{"en":"Tayyar","ar":"طيّار"},"color":"#EA580C","icon":"moped","domain":"tayyar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Your order","ar":"طلبك"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"width":250,"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Arriving 19:40","ar":"يصل الساعة 19:40"}},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Driver: Marwan Hassan","ar":"السائق: مروان حسن"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Order A-2291: 2 shawarma, 1 salad","ar":"الطلب A-2291: 2 شاورما، 1 سلطة"},"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"wrap","text":{"en":"Let the row wrap: the name, then the Call button below it","ar":"اسمح للصف بالالتفاف: الاسم، ثم زر الاتصال تحته"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"tayyar","name":{"en":"Tayyar","ar":"طيّار"},"color":"#EA580C","icon":"moped","domain":"tayyar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Your order","ar":"طلبك"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"width":250,"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Arriving 19:40","ar":"يصل الساعة 19:40"}},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Driver: Marwan Hassan","ar":"السائق: مروان حسن"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"button","emphasis":"low","text":{"en":"Call driver","ar":"اتصل بالسائق"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Order A-2291: 2 shawarma, 1 salad","ar":"الطلب A-2291: 2 شاورما، 1 سلطة"},"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"shrink","text":{"en":"Keep one row, with smaller text and a smaller button","ar":"أبقِ صفًّا واحدًا، بنص أصغر وزر أصغر"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"tayyar","name":{"en":"Tayyar","ar":"طيّار"},"color":"#EA580C","icon":"moped","domain":"tayyar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Your order","ar":"طلبك"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"width":250,"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Arriving 19:40","ar":"يصل الساعة 19:40"}},{"kind":"row","gap":"m","blocks":[{"kind":"text","px":9,"text":{"en":"Driver: Marwan Hassan","ar":"السائق: مروان حسن"}},{"kind":"button","px":8,"emphasis":"low","text":{"en":"Call driver","ar":"اتصل بالسائق"}}]},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Order A-2291: 2 shawarma, 1 salad","ar":"الطلب A-2291: 2 شاورما، 1 سلطة"},"gap":"s"}]}}],"answer":["wrap"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P10-061","when":["hide"],"feedback":{"en":"Lina may need to call the driver, and her phone is no less important. Keep the button; change where it sits.","ar":"قد تحتاج لينا إلى الاتصال بالسائق، وهاتفها ليس أقل أهمية. أبقِ الزر؛ وغيّر مكانه."}},{"id":"MC-P10-078","when":["shrink"],"feedback":{"en":"It fits now, but the name is hard to read and the button hard to tap. Let it wrap instead.","ar":"صار يتّسع، لكن الاسم يصعب قراءته والزر يصعب الضغط عليه. اسمح له بالالتفاف بدلًا من ذلك."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Lina needs both the name and the Call button. Which fixes keep both usable?","ar":"تحتاج لينا الاسم وزر الاتصال معًا. أي حل يبقيهما قابلين للاستخدام؟"},{"en":"If the row doesn't fit, can it become two lines?","ar":"إذا لم يتّسع الصف، هل يمكن أن يصبح سطرين؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Let it wrap.","ar":"اسمح له بالالتفاف."},"explain":{"en":"Same fix as Reem's buttons: a row that fits on wider screens should wrap on narrow ones. Everything stays readable, tappable, and on screen.","ar":"الإصلاح نفسه الذي طبّقته على أزرار ريم: الصف الذي يتّسع على الشاشات الأعرض يجب أن يلتفّ على الضيّقة. فيبقى كل شيء مقروءًا، وسهل الضغط، وداخل الشاشة."},"speaker":"sara"},{"id":"S08","type":"card","part":"recap","icons":["phone","layers","eye","form"],"title":{"en":"What you did","ar":"ماذا تعلّمت"},"body":{"en":"- **Narrow end:** let titles wrap and rows stack instead of shrinking or overflowing.\n- **Breakpoints:** folded a side column into the main one instead of squeezing or dropping it.\n- **Handoff:** wrote down what changes at each breakpoint.\n- **Usable, not just fitting:** checked that everything is comfortable to read and tap.\n\nNext lesson: an order that makes sense without the columns.","ar":"- **العرض الأضيق:** دع العناوين تلتفّ والصفوف تتراصّ، بدل التصغير أو الخروج عن الشاشة.\n- **نقاط التحوّل:** أدمجت العمود الجانبي في الرئيسي بدل عصره أو حذفه.\n- **التسليم:** كتبت ما يتغيّر عند كل نقطة تحوّل.\n- **سهل الاستخدام، لا متّسع فقط:** تأكّدت أن كل شيء مريح في القراءة والضغط.\n\nالدرس التالي: ترتيب منطقي دون الأعمدة."}}]}$uxg$::jsonb),
  ($uxg$P10-U04-L03$uxg$, $uxg$1c4aaf3b9ee017987e34deb405cfa9207c0d7604d65dcd35b91941fe5d0bff73$uxg$, $uxg${"id":"P10-U04-L03","mode":"lesson","minutes":8,"title":{"en":"An order that makes sense without the columns","ar":"ترتيب منطقي دون الأعمدة"},"summary":{"en":"Fix the page order so a screen reader reads the workshop in a sensible sequence.","ar":"أصلح ترتيب الصفحة ليقرأ قارئ الشاشة الورشة بتسلسل منطقي."},"speaker":"sara","review_labels":{"MC-P10-061":{"en":"Hide what's optional, never what decides","ar":"أخفِ الاختياري، لا ما يحسم القرار"},"MC-P10-066":{"en":"Facts come before the action in the reading order","ar":"المعلومات قبل الإجراء في ترتيب القراءة"},"MC-P10-067":{"en":"Moving things visually doesn't change the reading order","ar":"نقل العناصر بصريًا لا يغيّر ترتيب القراءة"},"MC-P10-079":{"en":"Keep each label with its value","ar":"أبقِ كل تسمية مع قيمتها"}},"steps":[{"id":"S01","type":"card","part":"hook","title":{"en":"Nesma listens to the page","ar":"نسمة تستمع إلى الصفحة"},"body":{"en":"Nesma wants to book the workshop on my page too. She's blind and uses a screen reader, which reads the page aloud, one item at a time, in the order of the page's code.\n\nOn a laptop, my page looks fine. This is what Nesma hears:","ar":"تريد نسمة حجز الورشة في صفحتي أيضًا. نسمة كفيفة وتستخدم قارئ الشاشة (Screen reader)، الذي يقرأ الصفحة بصوت عالٍ، عنصرًا بعد عنصر، بترتيب الكود.\n\nعلى الـ Laptop تبدو صفحتي سليمة. وهذا ما تسمعه نسمة:"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"manara","name":{"en":"Manara Learning Hub","ar":"منارة"},"color":"#5B3FD6","icon":"chalkboard-teacher","domain":"manara.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Workshop","ar":"الورشة"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"Read aloud, in order","ar":"تُقرأ بصوت عالٍ، بالترتيب"},"blocks":[{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"1. Get the monthly newsletter","ar":"1. اشترك في النشرة الشهرية"}},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"2. Reserve a place, button","ar":"2. احجز مكانك، زر"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"3. Free","ar":"3. مجاني"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"4. Sketch Your First App","ar":"4. ارسم تطبيقك الأول"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"5. Tuesday 17 November, 18:00–20:00","ar":"5. الثلاثاء 17 نوفمبر، من 18:00 إلى 20:00"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"6. Downtown Learning Hub, Room 2","ar":"6. مركز التعلّم بوسط البلد، قاعة 2"},"gap":"xs"}]}},{"id":"S02","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P10-U04-06","part":"try","rules":["R12"],"value":{"en":"Screen readers on mobile (NN/g): the user can't jump around; to reach the last element in the sequence they must pass through all the ones before it. The code order is what they hear.","ar":"قارئ الشاشة على الهاتف (NN/g): لا يستطيع المستخدم القفز؛ وليصل إلى آخر عنصر في التسلسل عليه أن يمرّ بكل ما قبله. وترتيب الكود هو ما يسمعه."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/screen-reader-users-on-mobile/","quote":"To access the last element in the sequence, they must pass through all the ones preceding it."},"prompt":{"en":"Nesma can't skip ahead; she hears each item in turn. Try each change to the code order. Which one should ship?","ar":"لا تستطيع نسمة القفز إلى الأمام؛ فهي تسمع كل عنصر بدوره. جرّب كل تغيير في ترتيب الكود. أيّ تغيير يجعل نسمة تسمع المعلومات قبل زر الحجز؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"manara","name":{"en":"Manara Learning Hub","ar":"منارة"},"color":"#5B3FD6","icon":"chalkboard-teacher","domain":"manara.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Workshop","ar":"الورشة"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"Now, read aloud","ar":"الآن، بصوت عالٍ"},"blocks":[{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"1. Get the monthly newsletter","ar":"1. اشترك في النشرة الشهرية"}},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"2. Reserve a place, button","ar":"2. احجز مكانك، زر"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"3. Free","ar":"3. مجاني"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"4. Sketch Your First App","ar":"4. ارسم تطبيقك الأول"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"5. Tuesday 17 November, 18:00–20:00","ar":"5. الثلاثاء 17 نوفمبر، من 18:00 إلى 20:00"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"6. Downtown Learning Hub, Room 2","ar":"6. مركز التعلّم بوسط البلد، قاعة 2"},"gap":"xs"}]},"options":[{"id":"reorder","text":{"en":"Title, time, place, price, then Reserve; the newsletter last","ar":"العنوان، الموعد، المكان، السعر، ثم زر الحجز؛ والنشرة في النهاية"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"manara","name":{"en":"Manara Learning Hub","ar":"منارة"},"color":"#5B3FD6","icon":"chalkboard-teacher","domain":"manara.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Workshop","ar":"الورشة"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change, read aloud","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير، بصوت عالٍ"},"blocks":[{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"1. Sketch Your First App","ar":"1. ارسم تطبيقك الأول"}},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"2. Tuesday 17 November, 18:00–20:00","ar":"2. الثلاثاء 17 نوفمبر، من 18:00 إلى 20:00"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"3. Downtown Learning Hub, Room 2","ar":"3. مركز التعلّم بوسط البلد، قاعة 2"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"4. Free","ar":"4. مجاني"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"5. Reserve a place, button","ar":"5. احجز مكانك، زر"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"6. Get the monthly newsletter","ar":"6. اشترك في النشرة الشهرية"},"gap":"xs"}]}},{"id":"label","text":{"en":"Keep the order, but give the newsletter a clearer name","ar":"أبقِ الترتيب، لكن أعطِ النشرة اسمًا أوضح"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"manara","name":{"en":"Manara Learning Hub","ar":"منارة"},"color":"#5B3FD6","icon":"chalkboard-teacher","domain":"manara.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Workshop","ar":"الورشة"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change, read aloud","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير، بصوت عالٍ"},"blocks":[{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"1. Monthly newsletter about new workshops","ar":"1. نشرة شهرية عن الورش الجديدة"}},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"2. Reserve a place, button","ar":"2. احجز مكانك، زر"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"3. Free","ar":"3. مجاني"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"4. Sketch Your First App","ar":"4. ارسم تطبيقك الأول"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"5. Tuesday 17 November, 18:00–20:00","ar":"5. الثلاثاء 17 نوفمبر، من 18:00 إلى 20:00"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"6. Downtown Learning Hub, Room 2","ar":"6. مركز التعلّم بوسط البلد، قاعة 2"},"gap":"xs"}]}},{"id":"action","text":{"en":"Reserve first, so Nesma reaches the action fastest","ar":"زر الحجز أولًا، حتى تصل نسمة إلى الإجراء أسرع"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"manara","name":{"en":"Manara Learning Hub","ar":"منارة"},"color":"#5B3FD6","icon":"chalkboard-teacher","domain":"manara.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Workshop","ar":"الورشة"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change, read aloud","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير، بصوت عالٍ"},"blocks":[{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"1. Reserve a place, button","ar":"1. احجز مكانك، زر"}},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"2. Sketch Your First App","ar":"2. ارسم تطبيقك الأول"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"3. Tuesday 17 November, 18:00–20:00","ar":"3. الثلاثاء 17 نوفمبر، من 18:00 إلى 20:00"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"4. Downtown Learning Hub, Room 2","ar":"4. مركز التعلّم بوسط البلد، قاعة 2"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"5. Free","ar":"5. مجاني"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"6. Get the monthly newsletter","ar":"6. اشترك في النشرة الشهرية"},"gap":"xs"}]}}],"answer":["reorder"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P10-066","when":["label","action"],"feedback":{"en":"Nesma still hears \"Reserve\" before she knows what or when. She'd have to remember the button and come back to it. Put the facts first, then the action.","ar":"ما زالت نسمة تسمع «احجز» قبل أن تعرف ما هي الورشة ومتى. وعليها أن تتذكّر الزر وتعود إليه. ضع المعلومات أولًا، ثم الإجراء."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Listen in order: what does Nesma hear before the time?","ar":"استمع بالترتيب: ماذا تسمع نسمة قبل الموعد؟"},{"en":"Can she reserve before she has heard what she's reserving?","ar":"هل تستطيع أن تحجز قبل أن تسمع ما الذي تحجزه؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Read aloud, it makes sense in order.","ar":"بصوت عالٍ، يصبح الترتيب منطقيًا."},"explain":{"en":"A screen reader can't show two columns at once; it reads one item after another. When the code follows the decision, Nesma hears what it is, when, where and how much, and then the button that acts on it.","ar":"قارئ الشاشة لا يعرض عمودين في وقت واحد؛ بل يقرأ عنصرًا بعد عنصر. وحين يتبع الكود ترتيب القرار، تسمع نسمة ما هي الورشة، ومتى، وأين، وبكم، ثم زر الحجز."}},{"id":"S03","type":"card","part":"concept","icons":["ear","list","layers","phone"],"title":{"en":"Two orders, one meaning","ar":"ترتيبان، ومعنى واحد"},"body":{"en":"Every page has two orders, and they can disagree.\n\n- **Visual order:** where things sit on the screen.\n- **Reading order:** the order in the code. Screen readers read it one item at a time, the Tab key follows it, and narrow screens stack it.\n- **Design the reading order first:** what it is, the facts, then the action, then extras. Keep each label next to its value.\n- **Moving things only visually** (with layout code) changes what eyes see, not what screen readers read.","ar":"لكل صفحة ترتيبان، وقد يختلفان.\n\n- **الترتيب البصري:** أين تقع الأشياء على الشاشة.\n- **ترتيب القراءة:** الترتيب في الكود. يقرؤه الـ Screen reader عنصرًا بعد عنصر، ويتبعه مفتاح Tab، وتتراصّ به الشاشات الضيّقة.\n- **صمّم ترتيب القراءة أولًا:** ما هو، ثم المعلومات، ثم الإجراء، ثم الإضافات. وأبقِ كل تسمية بجانب قيمتها.\n- **النقل البصري فقط** (بكود التخطيط) يغيّر ما تراه العين، لا ما يقرؤه الـ Screen reader."}},{"id":"S04","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P10-U04-06","part":"guided","rules":["R06","R13"],"value":{"en":"Screen readers (NN/g): users move forward and backward through the sequence; they can't jump around. Visual reordering leaves that sequence unchanged.","ar":"قارئ الشاشة (NN/g): يتحرّك المستخدمون للأمام وللخلف في التسلسل؛ ولا يستطيعون القفز. والنقل البصري يترك هذا التسلسل كما هو."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/screen-reader-users-on-mobile/","quote":"The user cannot jump around; they must move forward and backward through the sequence to access what they want."},"scenario":{"en":"A developer on my team suggests a quick fix: keep the code as it is, and use layout code to move the booking panel below the details on screen.","ar":"يقترح أحد المطوّرين في فريقي إصلاحًا سريعًا: إبقاء الكود كما هو، واستخدام كود التخطيط لنقل لوحة الحجز تحت التفاصيل على الشاشة."},"prompt":{"en":"Each version shows what Reem sees and what Nesma hears. Try each fix. Which one should ship?","ar":"كل نسخة تُظهر ما تراه ريم وما تسمعه نسمة. جرّب كل إصلاح. أيّ إصلاح يجعل ريم ونسمة تحصلان على الترتيب نفسه؟"},"start":"visual","options":[{"id":"visual","text":{"en":"Move it on screen only, with layout code","ar":"انقلها على الشاشة فقط، بكود التخطيط"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"manara","name":{"en":"Manara Learning Hub","ar":"منارة"},"color":"#5B3FD6","icon":"chalkboard-teacher","domain":"manara.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Workshop","ar":"الورشة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"row","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"group","blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Reem sees","ar":"ترى ريم"}},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Title","ar":"العنوان"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Time, place","ar":"الموعد، المكان"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Price","ar":"السعر"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Reserve","ar":"زر الحجز"},"gap":"xs"}]},{"kind":"group","tone":"tint","blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Nesma hears","ar":"تسمع نسمة"}},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Reserve","ar":"زر الحجز"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Price","ar":"السعر"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Title","ar":"العنوان"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Time, place","ar":"الموعد، المكان"},"gap":"xs"}]}]}]}},{"id":"code","text":{"en":"Change the order in the code itself","ar":"غيّر الترتيب في الكود نفسه"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"manara","name":{"en":"Manara Learning Hub","ar":"منارة"},"color":"#5B3FD6","icon":"chalkboard-teacher","domain":"manara.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Workshop","ar":"الورشة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"row","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"group","blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Reem sees","ar":"ترى ريم"}},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Title","ar":"العنوان"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Time, place","ar":"الموعد، المكان"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Price","ar":"السعر"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Reserve","ar":"زر الحجز"},"gap":"xs"}]},{"kind":"group","tone":"tint","blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Nesma hears","ar":"تسمع نسمة"}},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Title","ar":"العنوان"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Time, place","ar":"الموعد، المكان"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Price","ar":"السعر"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Reserve","ar":"زر الحجز"},"gap":"xs"}]}]}]}},{"id":"skip","text":{"en":"Keep the code, and add a hidden \"Skip to details\" link for screen readers at the top","ar":"أبقِ الكود، وأضف رابطًا مخفيًا «انتقل إلى التفاصيل» للـ Screen reader في الأعلى"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"manara","name":{"en":"Manara Learning Hub","ar":"منارة"},"color":"#5B3FD6","icon":"chalkboard-teacher","domain":"manara.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Workshop","ar":"الورشة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"row","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"group","blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Reem sees","ar":"ترى ريم"}},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Reserve","ar":"زر الحجز"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Price","ar":"السعر"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Title","ar":"العنوان"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Time, place","ar":"الموعد، المكان"},"gap":"xs"}]},{"kind":"group","tone":"tint","blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Nesma hears","ar":"تسمع نسمة"}},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Skip to details, link","ar":"انتقل إلى التفاصيل، رابط"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Reserve","ar":"زر الحجز"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Price","ar":"السعر"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Title","ar":"العنوان"},"gap":"xs"}]}]}]}}],"answer":["code"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P10-067","when":["visual"],"feedback":{"en":"Reem's screen looks right, but Nesma still hears Reserve and the price before the title. Layout code moves pixels, not the reading order.","ar":"شاشة ريم تبدو صحيحة، لكن نسمة ما زالت تسمع زر الحجز والسعر قبل العنوان. كود التخطيط ينقل البكسلات، لا ترتيب القراءة."}},{"id":"MC-P10-066","when":["skip"],"feedback":{"en":"A skip link adds one more item to hear, and the phone still stacks Reserve first for Reem. Fix the order itself.","ar":"رابط القفز يضيف عنصرًا آخر لتسمعه نسمة، والهاتف ما زال يرصّ زر الحجز أولًا لريم. أصلِح الترتيب نفسه."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Compare what Reem sees with what Nesma hears in each version.","ar":"قارن بين ما تراه ريم وما تسمعه نسمة في كل نسخة."},{"en":"A screen reader follows the code. Which fix changes what it reads?","ar":"قارئ الشاشة يتبع الكود. أي حل يغيّر ما يقرؤه؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Fix the order once, in the code.","ar":"أصلِح الترتيب مرة واحدة، في الكود."},"explain":{"en":"When the code is in the right order, the phone stacks it correctly, the Tab key follows it, and the screen reader reads it. One fix, and every way of using the page agrees.","ar":"حين يكون الكود بالترتيب الصحيح، يرصّه الهاتف صحيحًا، ويتبعه مفتاح Tab، ويقرؤه الـ Screen reader. إصلاح واحد، وكل طرق استخدام الصفحة تتّفق."},"speaker":"sara"},{"id":"S05","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P10-U04-06","part":"guided","rules":["R06","R15"],"value":{"en":"Screen readers (NN/g): the user is unaware of what's ahead and must remember everything already heard. All labels first, then all values, makes them hold a list in memory.","ar":"قارئ الشاشة (NN/g): المستخدم لا يعرف ما ينتظره، وعليه أن يتذكّر كل ما سمعه. وكل التسميات أولًا ثم كل القيم يجبره على حفظ قائمة في ذاكرته."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/screen-reader-users-on-mobile/","quote":"Someone using a screen reader is unaware of everything ahead and must remember everything they have already encountered."},"scenario":{"en":"On the laptop, my session details are in two columns: the labels (Date, Place, Price) on one side and the values on the other. The code lists all the labels first, then all the values.","ar":"على الـ Laptop، تفاصيل الجلسة في تصميمي في عمودين: التسميات (التاريخ، المكان، السعر) في جانب، والقيم في الجانب الآخر. والكود يضع كل التسميات أولًا، ثم كل القيم."},"prompt":{"en":"This is what happens on a phone and read aloud. Try each fix. Which one should ship?","ar":"هذا ما يحدث على الهاتف وبصوت عالٍ. جرّب كل إصلاح. أيّ إصلاح يجعل نسمة تسمع كل تسمية مع قيمتها؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"manara","name":{"en":"Manara Learning Hub","ar":"منارة"},"color":"#5B3FD6","icon":"chalkboard-teacher","domain":"manara.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Workshop","ar":"الورشة"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"Now, phone","ar":"الآن، الهاتف"},"width":300,"blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Date","ar":"التاريخ"}},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Place","ar":"المكان"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Price","ar":"السعر"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Tuesday 17 November, 18:00–20:00","ar":"الثلاثاء 17 نوفمبر، من 18:00 إلى 20:00"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Downtown Learning Hub, Room 2","ar":"مركز التعلّم بوسط البلد، قاعة 2"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Free","ar":"مجاني"},"gap":"xs"}]},"options":[{"id":"bold","text":{"en":"Keep the order; make the values bold so they stand out","ar":"أبقِ الترتيب؛ واجعل القيم Bold لتبرز"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"manara","name":{"en":"Manara Learning Hub","ar":"منارة"},"color":"#5B3FD6","icon":"chalkboard-teacher","domain":"manara.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Workshop","ar":"الورشة"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"width":300,"blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Date","ar":"التاريخ"}},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Place","ar":"المكان"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Price","ar":"السعر"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"meta","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Tuesday 17 November, 18:00–20:00","ar":"الثلاثاء 17 نوفمبر، من 18:00 إلى 20:00"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"meta","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Downtown Learning Hub, Room 2","ar":"مركز التعلّم بوسط البلد، قاعة 2"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"meta","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Free","ar":"مجاني"},"gap":"xs"}]}},{"id":"drop","text":{"en":"Remove the labels on phones; the values are clear enough","ar":"احذف التسميات على الهاتف؛ فالقيم واضحة بما يكفي"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"manara","name":{"en":"Manara Learning Hub","ar":"منارة"},"color":"#5B3FD6","icon":"chalkboard-teacher","domain":"manara.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Workshop","ar":"الورشة"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"width":300,"blocks":[{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Tuesday 17 November, 18:00–20:00","ar":"الثلاثاء 17 نوفمبر، من 18:00 إلى 20:00"}},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Downtown Learning Hub, Room 2","ar":"مركز التعلّم بوسط البلد، قاعة 2"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Free","ar":"مجاني"},"gap":"xs"}]}},{"id":"pairs","text":{"en":"Put each label right before its value in the code","ar":"ضع كل تسمية قبل قيمتها مباشرة في الكود"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"manara","name":{"en":"Manara Learning Hub","ar":"منارة"},"color":"#5B3FD6","icon":"chalkboard-teacher","domain":"manara.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Workshop","ar":"الورشة"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"width":300,"blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Date","ar":"التاريخ"}},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Tuesday 17 November, 18:00–20:00","ar":"الثلاثاء 17 نوفمبر، من 18:00 إلى 20:00"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Place","ar":"المكان"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Downtown Learning Hub, Room 2","ar":"مركز التعلّم بوسط البلد، قاعة 2"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Price","ar":"السعر"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Free","ar":"مجاني"},"gap":"xs"}]}}],"answer":["pairs"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P10-079","when":["bold"],"feedback":{"en":"Bold doesn't change the order. Nesma still hears three labels, then three values, and has to match them in her head.","ar":"الـ Bold لا يغيّر الترتيب. ما زالت نسمة تسمع ثلاث تسميات، ثم ثلاث قيم، وعليها أن تطابقها في ذهنها."}},{"id":"MC-P10-061","when":["drop"],"feedback":{"en":"\"Free\" alone doesn't say it's the price, and a screen reader user hears it without context. Keep the labels, next to their values.","ar":"«مجاني» وحدها لا تقول إنها السعر، ومستخدم الـ Screen reader يسمعها دون سياق. أبقِ التسميات، بجانب قيمها."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Listen to the order: does Nesma hear \"Date\" next to the date?","ar":"استمع إلى الترتيب: هل تسمع نسمة كلمة «التاريخ» بجانب التاريخ؟"},{"en":"What has to sit next to each value in the code?","ar":"ما الذي يجب أن يأتي بجانب كل قيمة في الكود؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Each label travels with its value.","ar":"كل تسمية ترافق قيمتها."},"explain":{"en":"Columns of labels and values look tidy on a wide screen, but stacked or read aloud they split apart. Pair them in the code, and the laptop can still line them up in columns.","ar":"أعمدة التسميات والقيم تبدو مرتّبة على الشاشة العريضة، لكنها تنفصل حين تتراصّ أو تُقرأ بصوت عالٍ. اجعلها أزواجًا في الكود، ويبقى بإمكان الـ Laptop أن يصفّها في أعمدة."},"speaker":"sara"},{"id":"S06","type":"compare","skill":"SK-P10-U04-06","part":"contrast","confidence":true,"rules":["R11","R15"],"value":{"en":"Contrast with S02: not just actions, any extra placed first costs time. NN/g: wading through all the copy to find something informative takes too much time and energy.","ar":"مقارنة مع الخطوة 2: ليس الإجراء فقط، فأي إضافة في البداية تكلّف وقتًا. NN/g: المرور بكل النص لإيجاد شيء مفيد يتطلّب وقتًا وجهدًا كبيرين."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/screen-reader-users-on-mobile/","quote":"Wading through all the copy on the page to find something informative requires too much time and energy for users."},"scenario":{"en":"I'm also working on a bus ticket app. Hamza uses a screen reader too. He opens his ticket at the station to check the platform.","ar":"أعمل أيضًا على تطبيق لتذاكر الحافلات. يستخدم حمزة الـ Screen reader أيضًا. ويفتح تذكرته في المحطة ليتحقّق من الرصيف."},"prompt":{"en":"Here's what Hamza hears in each version. Which one should ship?","ar":"هذا ما يسمعه حمزة في كل نسخة. في أيّ نسخة يسمع حمزة تذكرته قبل الإضافات؟"},"a":{"label":{"en":"Read aloud","ar":"بصوت عالٍ"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rehla","name":{"en":"Rehla","ar":"رحلة"},"color":"#7048E8","icon":"bus","domain":"rehla.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Your ticket","ar":"تذكرتك"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"1. Download our app and save 10%","ar":"1. حمّل تطبيقنا ووفّر 10%"}},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"2. Get the app, button","ar":"2. احصل على التطبيق، زر"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"3. Rate us, link","ar":"3. قيّمنا، رابط"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"4. Cairo to Alexandria","ar":"4. من القاهرة إلى الإسكندرية"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"5. Departs 07:30, platform 4","ar":"5. المغادرة 07:30، رصيف 4"},"gap":"xs"}]}},"b":{"label":{"en":"Read aloud","ar":"بصوت عالٍ"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rehla","name":{"en":"Rehla","ar":"رحلة"},"color":"#7048E8","icon":"bus","domain":"rehla.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Your ticket","ar":"تذكرتك"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"1. Cairo to Alexandria","ar":"1. من القاهرة إلى الإسكندرية"}},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"2. Departs 07:30, platform 4","ar":"2. المغادرة 07:30، رصيف 4"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"3. Seat 12A","ar":"3. مقعد 12A"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"4. Show ticket, button","ar":"4. اعرض التذكرة، زر"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"5. Download our app and save 10%","ar":"5. حمّل تطبيقنا ووفّر 10%"},"gap":"xs"}]}},"answer":"b","reason":{"prompt":{"en":"Why is B better?","ar":"لماذا B أفضل؟"},"options":[{"id":"ads","text":{"en":"Offers should never appear on a ticket","ar":"العروض يجب ألّا تظهر في التذكرة أبدًا"}},{"id":"wade","text":{"en":"In A, Hamza must listen through three extras before his ticket","ar":"في A، على حمزة أن يستمع إلى ثلاث إضافات قبل تذكرته"}},{"id":"short","text":{"en":"B is shorter","ar":"B أقصر"}}],"answer":["wade"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P10-066","when":["ads","short"],"feedback":{"en":"Both have five items, and the offer is still in B. The difference is what comes first: Hamza hears his ticket at once in B.","ar":"في النسختين خمسة عناصر، والعرض ما زال في B. الفرق فيما يأتي أولًا: يسمع حمزة تذكرته فورًا في B."}}]},"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P10-066","when":["a"],"feedback":{"en":"In A, Hamza hears an ad, a button and a link before his route and platform. Seeing users skip an ad with a glance; he has to listen through it.","ar":"في A، يسمع حمزة إعلانًا وزرًا ورابطًا قبل خط سيره ورصيفه. من يرى يتخطّى الإعلان بنظرة؛ أما هو فعليه أن يستمع إليه."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Hamza wants the platform. How long until he hears it in each version?","ar":"حمزة يريد رقم الرصيف. كم يحتاج حتى يسمعه في كل نسخة؟"},{"en":"Which version reads the ticket before the extras?","ar":"أي نسخة تقرأ التذكرة قبل الإضافات؟"}],"correct":{"en":"The ticket first; extras after.","ar":"التذكرة أولًا؛ والإضافات بعدها."},"explain":{"en":"On Reem's page the problem was the action before the facts. Here it's extras before the content. For someone listening, everything placed first costs time, every single visit.","ar":"في صفحة ريم كانت المشكلة أن الإجراء قبل المعلومات. وهنا الإضافات قبل المحتوى. ولمن يستمع، كل ما يوضع أولًا يكلّف وقتًا، في كل زيارة."},"speaker":"sara"},{"id":"S07","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P10-U04-06","part":"independent","rules":["R14","R19"],"value":{"en":"New case. Responsive design (NN/g): on a phone, content prioritization helps users find what they need. The order summary belongs before Pay, in the code, so it stacks and reads in the right place.","ar":"حالة جديدة. التصميم المتجاوب (NN/g): على الهاتف، ترتيب أولويات المحتوى يساعد المستخدمين على إيجاد ما يحتاجونه. وملخّص الطلب مكانه قبل زر الدفع في الكود، فيتراصّ ويُقرأ في المكان الصحيح."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/responsive-web-design-definition/","quote":"Smart content prioritization helps users find what they need more efficiently."},"scenario":{"en":"Fares is buying two football match tickets on a site I'm reviewing. On a laptop, the order summary (tickets, fees, total) sits in a side column next to the payment form. In the code, the summary comes after the Pay button.","ar":"يشتري فارس تذكرتين لمباراة كرة قدم من موقع أراجعه. على الـ Laptop، ملخّص الطلب (التذاكر، والرسوم، والإجمالي) في عمود جانبي بجانب نموذج الدفع. وفي الكود، يأتي الملخّص بعد زر الدفع."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each phone order. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل ترتيب على الهاتف. أيّها يجب أن يُطلق؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"tazkara","name":{"en":"Tazkara","ar":"تذكرة"},"color":"#C026D3","icon":"ticket","domain":"tazkara.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Checkout","ar":"الدفع"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"Now, phone","ar":"الآن، الهاتف"},"width":300,"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Card number","ar":"رقم البطاقة"},"text":"•••• •••• •••• 4821","filled":true},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Pay EGP 1,300","ar":"ادفع 1,300 جنيه"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Order summary","ar":"ملخّص الطلب"},"gap":"l"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"2 tickets × EGP 600 · Fees EGP 100","ar":"تذكرتان × 600 جنيه · رسوم 100 جنيه"},"gap":"xs"}]},"options":[{"id":"hide","text":{"en":"Drop the summary on phones; the total is on the Pay button","ar":"احذف الملخّص على الهاتف؛ فالإجمالي على زر الدفع"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"tazkara","name":{"en":"Tazkara","ar":"تذكرة"},"color":"#C026D3","icon":"ticket","domain":"tazkara.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Checkout","ar":"الدفع"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"width":300,"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Card number","ar":"رقم البطاقة"},"text":"•••• •••• •••• 4821","filled":true},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Pay EGP 1,300","ar":"ادفع 1,300 جنيه"},"gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"keep","text":{"en":"Keep the code order; Fares can scroll down to check","ar":"أبقِ ترتيب الكود؛ ويمكن لفارس أن يمرّر للأسفل ليتحقّق"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"tazkara","name":{"en":"Tazkara","ar":"تذكرة"},"color":"#C026D3","icon":"ticket","domain":"tazkara.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Checkout","ar":"الدفع"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"width":300,"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Card number","ar":"رقم البطاقة"},"text":"•••• •••• •••• 4821","filled":true},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Pay EGP 1,300","ar":"ادفع 1,300 جنيه"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Order summary","ar":"ملخّص الطلب"},"gap":"l"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"2 tickets × EGP 600 · Fees EGP 100","ar":"تذكرتان × 600 جنيه · رسوم 100 جنيه"},"gap":"xs"}]}},{"id":"before","text":{"en":"Move the summary before the card field and Pay, in the code","ar":"انقل الملخّص قبل حقل البطاقة وزر الدفع، في الكود"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"tazkara","name":{"en":"Tazkara","ar":"تذكرة"},"color":"#C026D3","icon":"ticket","domain":"tazkara.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Checkout","ar":"الدفع"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"width":300,"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Order summary","ar":"ملخّص الطلب"}},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"2 tickets × EGP 600 · Fees EGP 100","ar":"تذكرتان × 600 جنيه · رسوم 100 جنيه"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Card number","ar":"رقم البطاقة"},"text":"•••• •••• •••• 4821","filled":true,"gap":"m"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Pay EGP 1,300","ar":"ادفع 1,300 جنيه"},"gap":"m"}]}}],"answer":["before"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P10-066","when":["keep"],"feedback":{"en":"Fares meets Pay before he can check what he's paying for. On a phone and read aloud, the summary has to come first.","ar":"يلتقي فارس بزر الدفع قبل أن يتحقّق ممّا يدفع مقابله. وعلى الهاتف وبصوت عالٍ، يجب أن يأتي الملخّص أولًا."}},{"id":"MC-P10-061","when":["hide"],"feedback":{"en":"The total alone doesn't show the fees or the number of tickets. Phone users need the same facts before paying.","ar":"الإجمالي وحده لا يُظهر الرسوم ولا عدد التذاكر. ومستخدمو الهاتف يحتاجون المعلومات نفسها قبل الدفع."}}],"hints":[{"en":"On the phone, where does the summary end up in each version?","ar":"على الهاتف، أين يصبح الملخّص في كل نسخة؟"},{"en":"Should Fares check what he's paying for before or after he pays?","ar":"هل يجب أن يتحقّق فارس مما يدفع ثمنه قبل الدفع أم بعده؟"}],"correct":{"en":"What he's paying for, then Pay.","ar":"ما يدفع مقابله، ثم الدفع."},"explain":{"en":"Same rule as Reem's page: facts before the action, fixed in the code. On a laptop, the summary can still sit in a side column.","ar":"القاعدة نفسها التي طبّقتها في صفحة ريم: المعلومات قبل الإجراء، والإصلاح في الكود. وعلى الـ Laptop يمكن أن يبقى الملخّص في عمود جانبي."},"speaker":"sara"},{"id":"S08","type":"card","part":"recap","icons":["ear","list","layers","phone"],"title":{"en":"What you did","ar":"ماذا تعلّمت"},"body":{"en":"- **Reading order:** put the facts before the action in the code.\n- **Not just visual:** fixed the order in the code, not only on screen.\n- **Labels with values:** paired them so they make sense stacked and read aloud.\n- **Extras last:** moved the offer after the ticket.\n\nNext: a skill check on a new page.","ar":"- **ترتيب القراءة:** وضعت المعلومات قبل الإجراء في الكود.\n- **ليس بصريًا فقط:** أصلحت الترتيب في الكود، لا على الشاشة فقط.\n- **التسميات مع القيم:** جعلتها أزواجًا حتى تُفهم متراصّة وبصوت عالٍ.\n- **الإضافات في النهاية:** نقلت العرض بعد التذكرة.\n\nالتالي: اختبار مهارة على صفحة جديدة."}}]}$uxg$::jsonb),
