:["visual","alt"],"feedback":{"en":"One of the two still gets the wrong order: Nesma hears the extras first, or Dalia's phone still stacks the gallery on top. Fix it once, in the code.","ar":"ما زالت إحداهما تحصل على الترتيب الخطأ: تسمع نسمة الإضافات أولًا، أو يرصّ هاتف داليا المعرض في الأعلى. أصلِحه مرة واحدة، في الكود."}}],"explain":{"en":"From Lesson 3: the code order is what phones stack and screen readers read. Fix it there, and both agree.","ar":"من الدرس 3: ترتيب الكود هو ما ترصّه الهواتف ويقرؤه الـ Screen reader. أصلِحه هناك، فيتّفق الاثنان."},"speaker":"tarek"},{"id":"S06","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P10-U04-04","part":"check","rules":["R19"],"value":{"en":"Skill check, content dispersion (NN/g): a phone layout scaled up to desktop becomes large and dispersed; keep critical, related content grouped in the same viewport.","ar":"اختبار مهارة، تشتّت المحتوى (NN/g): تخطيط الهاتف المكبّر على الكمبيوتر يصبح ضخمًا ومتفرّقًا؛ أبقِ المحتوى المهم والمترابط مجموعًا في الشاشة نفسها."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/content-dispersion/","quote":"Keep critical, related content grouped together in the same viewport."},"scenario":{"en":"Our phone page is done. A teammate proposes using the same single column on the laptop, stretched to full width.","ar":"انتهت صفحة الهاتف عندنا. ويقترح أحد الزملاء استخدام العمود الواحد نفسه على الـ Laptop، ممطوطًا بكامل العرض."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each laptop layout. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل تخطيط للـ Laptop. أيّها يجب أن يُطلق؟"},"start":"stretch","options":[{"id":"stretch","text":{"en":"The phone column, stretched to full width","ar":"عمود الهاتف، ممطوطًا بكامل العرض"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nuzul","name":{"en":"Nuzul","ar":"نُزُل"},"color":"#B7791F","icon":"bed","domain":"nuzul.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"nuzul.example/aswan/nile-view","blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"hotel-room","size":"l","height":200,"text":{"en":"Photo gallery","ar":"معرض الصور"}},{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Nile View Hotel","ar":"فندق إطلالة النيل"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"2 nights, 4–6 December","ar":"ليلتان، من 4 إلى 6 ديسمبر"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"meta","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"EGP 3,600 total","ar":"الإجمالي 3,600 جنيه"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Book now","ar":"احجز الآن"},"gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"cols","text":{"en":"Two columns: the gallery beside the booking panel","ar":"عمودان: المعرض بجانب لوحة الحجز"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nuzul","name":{"en":"Nuzul","ar":"نُزُل"},"color":"#B7791F","icon":"bed","domain":"nuzul.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"nuzul.example/aswan/nile-view","blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Nile View Hotel","ar":"فندق إطلالة النيل"}},{"kind":"row","gap":"m","blocks":[{"kind":"group","tone":"plain","blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"hotel-room","size":"m","text":{"en":"Photo gallery","ar":"معرض الصور"}},{"kind":"link","text":{"en":"Join our rewards club","ar":"انضم إلى نادي المكافآت"},"gap":"s"}]},{"kind":"group","blocks":[{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"2 nights, 4–6 December","ar":"ليلتان، من 4 إلى 6 ديسمبر"}},{"kind":"meta","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"EGP 3,600 total","ar":"الإجمالي 3,600 جنيه"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Free cancellation until 1 December","ar":"إلغاء مجاني حتى 1 ديسمبر"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Book now","ar":"احجز الآن"},"gap":"m"}]}]}]}},{"id":"narrow","text":{"en":"The phone column, centred at phone width, with empty space on both sides","ar":"عمود الهاتف في المنتصف بعرض الهاتف، مع مساحة فارغة على الجانبين"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nuzul","name":{"en":"Nuzul","ar":"نُزُل"},"color":"#B7791F","icon":"bed","domain":"nuzul.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"nuzul.example/aswan/nile-view","blocks":[{"kind":"row","blocks":[{"kind":"divider"},{"kind":"group","tone":"plain","blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Nile View Hotel","ar":"فندق إطلالة النيل"}},{"kind":"image","art":"hotel-room","size":"m","text":{"en":"Photo gallery","ar":"معرض الصور"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"2 nights, 4–6 December","ar":"ليلتان، من 4 إلى 6 ديسمبر"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"meta","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"EGP 3,600 total","ar":"الإجمالي 3,600 جنيه"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Free cancellation until 1 December","ar":"إلغاء مجاني حتى 1 ديسمبر"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Book now","ar":"احجز الآن"},"gap":"m"}]},{"kind":"divider"}]}]}}],"answer":["cols"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P10-065","when":["stretch","narrow"],"feedback":{"en":"Both reuse the phone layout. Stretched, the gallery fills the screen and the booking falls far below; centred, the page is long and the laptop's width is wasted. Rearrange for the wide screen.","ar":"كلاهما يعيد استخدام تخطيط الهاتف. ممطوطًا، يملأ المعرض الشاشة ويسقط الحجز بعيدًا في الأسفل؛ وفي المنتصف، تصبح الصفحة طويلة ويضيع عرض الـ Laptop. أعِد الترتيب للشاشة العريضة."}}],"explain":{"en":"From Lesson 1: responsive works both ways. On a wide screen, put related things side by side.","ar":"من الدرس 1: التصميم المتجاوب يعمل في الاتجاهين. على الشاشة العريضة، ضع الأشياء المترابطة جنبًا إلى جنب."},"speaker":"tarek"},{"id":"S07","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P10-U04-05","part":"check","rules":["R19"],"value":{"en":"Skill check, fitting isn't enough (NN/g): ensuring elements fit within a page is not enough; they must stay usable.","ar":"اختبار مهارة، الاتّساع لا يكفي (NN/g): التأكّد من أن العناصر تتّسع في الصفحة لا يكفي؛ يجب أن تبقى سهلة الاستخدام."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/responsive-web-design-definition/","quote":"However, ensuring that elements fit within a page is not enough."},"scenario":{"en":"On the narrowest phone, our dates line is cut off: Dalia can't see which nights she's booking.","ar":"على أضيق هاتف، سطر التواريخ عندنا مقطوع: لا ترى داليا أي ليالٍ تحجز."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each fix. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل إصلاح. أيّها يجب أن يُطلق؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nuzul","name":{"en":"Nuzul","ar":"نُزُل"},"color":"#B7791F","icon":"bed","domain":"nuzul.example"},"app