"text":{"en":"Book now","ar":"احجز الآن"},"gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"scroll","text":{"en":"Let the line scroll sideways","ar":"اسمح للسطر بالتحرّك جانبيًا"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nuzul","name":{"en":"Nuzul","ar":"نُزُل"},"color":"#B7791F","icon":"bed","domain":"nuzul.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Hotel","ar":"الفندق"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"width":250,"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Nile View Hotel","ar":"فندق إطلالة النيل"}},{"kind":"group","tone":"plain","scroll":true,"colw":330,"gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"row","blocks":[{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"2 nights: Friday 4 to Sunday 6 December","ar":"ليلتان: من الجمعة 4 إلى الأحد 6 ديسمبر"}}]}]},{"kind":"meta","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"EGP 3,600 total","ar":"الإجمالي 3,600 جنيه"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Book now","ar":"احجز الآن"},"gap":"m"}]}}],"answer":["wrap"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P10-078","when":["small","scroll"],"feedback":{"en":"Tiny text fits but can't be read, and a sideways-scrolling line hides half the dates. Let it wrap.","ar":"النص الصغير جدًا يتّسع لكنه لا يُقرأ، والسطر الذي يتحرّك جانبيًا يُخفي نصف التواريخ. اسمح له بالالتفاف."}}],"explain":{"en":"From Lesson 2: at the narrow end, let lines wrap. Everything stays readable and on screen.","ar":"من الدرس 2: عند العرض الأضيق، دع الأسطر تلتفّ. فيبقى كل شيء مقروءًا وداخل الشاشة."},"speaker":"tarek"}]}$uxg$::jsonb),
  ($uxg$P10-U05-L01$uxg$, $uxg$938713e4d5b26b3825bcb635261e82b5b4aae6380034f7dd9b9318957aa7a1ed$uxg$, $uxg${"id":"P10-U05-L01","mode":"lesson","minutes":8,"title":{"en":"Let long text grow","ar":"دع النص الطويل يتمدّد"},"summary":{"en":"Let a workshop card grow to fit real titles, addresses and button labels.","ar":"دع بطاقة الورشة تتّسع للعناوين والأماكن وأسماء الأزرار الحقيقية."},"speaker":"sara","review_labels":{"MC-P10-068":{"en":"Fixed heights and one-line text hide facts","ar":"الارتفاع الثابت والنص ذو السطر الواحد يخفيان المعلومات"},"MC-P10-069":{"en":"Don't change the words to fit the box","ar":"لا تغيّر الكلمات لتناسب الصندوق"},"MC-P10-080":{"en":"Test with the longest real text","ar":"اختبر بأطول نص حقيقي"},"MC-P10-081":{"en":"Concise isn't the same as cut","ar":"الإيجاز ليس هو الحذف"}},"steps":[{"id":"S01","type":"card","part":"hook","title":{"en":"The real title arrives","ar":"وصل العنوان الحقيقي"},"body":{"en":"I designed my workshop card with a short sample title. It looked perfect.\n\nThen the real data arrived: a longer title, a full address, and a longer button label. Here's the same card on a narrow phone.","ar":"صمّمت بطاقة الورشة بعنوان قصير كمثال. وبدت مثالية.\n\nثم وصلت البيانات الحقيقية: عنوان أطول، وعنوان مكان كامل، ونص أطول للزر. هذه البطاقة نفسها على هاتف ضيّق."},"mock":{"app":{"id":"manara","name":{"en":"Manara Learning Hub","ar":"منارة"},"color":"#5B3FD6","icon":"chalkboard-teacher","domain":"manara.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Sessions","ar":"الجلسات"},"back":true},"width":260,"blocks":[{"kind":"group","height":150,"blocks":[{"kind":"title","nowrap":true,"text":{"en":"Sketch Your First App for Community Projects and Volunteer Teams","ar":"صمّم تطبيقك الأول للمبادرات المجتمعية والفرق التطوعية"}},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"17 November, 18:00–20:00","ar":"17 نوفمبر، من 18:00 إلى 20:00"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"meta","nowrap":true,"text":{"en":"Riverside Learning Hub, East Building, Second Floor, Room 204","ar":"مركز التعلّم المجتمعي، المبنى الشرقي، الطابق الثاني، القاعة 204"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"EGP 120","ar":"120 جنيهًا"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"button","overlap":true,"text":{"en":"Reserve a place in this workshop","ar":"احجز مكانك في هذه الورشة"},"gap":"s"}]}]}},{"id":"S02","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P10-U05-01","part":"try","rules":["R12"],"value":{"en":"Layout vs. content (NN/g): scaling issues appear when the content size does not match the space it goes into. A fixed-height card with one-line text hides real content.","ar":"التخطيط والمحتوى (NN/g): تظهر مشكلات الحجم حين لا يطابق حجم المحتوى المساحة التي يوضع فيها. والبطاقة ذات الارتفاع الثابت والنص ذي السطر الواحد تُخفي المحتوى الحقيقي."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/layout-vs-content/","quote":"Scaling issues appear when the content size does not match the space that it needs to go into."},"prompt":{"en":"The card has a fixed height, and the title and address are set to stay on one line. Try each fix. Which one should ship?","ar":"البطاقة بارتفاع ثابت، والعنوان والمكان مضبوطان على سطر واحد. جرّب كل إصلاح. أيّ إصلاح يُظهر كل المعلومات كاملة ومقروءة؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"manara","name":{"en":"Manara Learning Hub","ar":"منارة"},"color":"#5B3FD6","icon":"chalkboard-teacher","domain":"manara.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Sessions","ar":"الجلسات"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"width":260,"blocks":[{"kind":"group","height":150,"blocks":[{"kind":"title","nowrap":true,"text":{"en":"Sketch Your First App for Community Projects and Volunteer Teams","ar":"صمّم تطبيقك الأول للمبادرات المجتمعية والفرق التطوعية"}},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"17 November, 18:00–20:00","ar":"17 نوفمبر، من 18:00 إلى 20:00"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"meta","nowrap":true,"text":{"en":"Riverside Learning Hub, East Building, Second Floor, Room 204","ar":"مركز التعلّم المجتمعي، المبنى الشرقي، الطابق الثاني، القاعة 204"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"EGP 120","ar":"120 جنيهًا"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"button","overlap":true,"text":{"en":"Reserve a place in this workshop","ar":"احجز مكانك في هذه الورشة"},"gap":"s"}]}]},"options":[{"id":"smaller","text":{"en":"Keep the card size; make the text smaller until it fits","ar":"أبقِ حجم البطاقة؛ وصغّر النص حتى يتّسع"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"manara","name":{"en":"Manara Learning Hub","ar":"منارة"},"color":"#5B3FD6","icon":"chalkboard-teacher","domain":"manara.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Sessions","ar":"الجلسات"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"width":260,"blocks":[{"kind":"group","height":150,"blocks":[{"kind":"text","px":9,"weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Sketch Your First App for Community Projects and Volunteer Teams","ar":"صمّم تطبيقك الأول للمبادرات المجتمعية والفرق التطوعية"}},{"kind":"text","px":9,"text":{"en":"17 November, 18:00–20:00","ar":"17 نوفمبر، من 18:00 إلى 20:00"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"text","px":9,"text":{"en":"Riverside Learning Hub, East Building, Second Floor, Room 204","ar":"مركز التعلّم المجتمعي، المبنى الشرقي، الطابق الثاني، القاعة 204"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"text","px":9,"text":{"en":"EGP 120","ar":"120 جنيهًا"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"button","px":9,"text":{"en":"Reserve a place in this workshop","ar":"احجز مكانك في هذه الورشة"},"gap":"s"}]}]}},{"id":"shorten","text":{"en":"Ask for a shorter title and address: \"Sketch Your App\", \"Riverside Hub\"","ar":"اطلب عنوانًا ومكانًا أقصر: «صمّم تطبيقك»، «مركز التعلّم»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"manara","name":{"en":"Manara Learning Hub","ar":"منارة"},"color":"#5B3FD6","icon":"chalkboard-teacher","domain":"manara.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Sessions","ar":"الجلسات"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"width":260,"blocks":[{"kind":"group","height":150,"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Sketch Your App","ar":"صمّم تطبيقك"}},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"17 November, 18:00–20:00","ar":"17 نوفمبر، من 18:00 إلى 20:00"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Riverside Hub","ar":"مركز التعلّم"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"EGP 120","ar":"120 جنيهًا"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Reserve a place","ar":"احجز مكانك"},"gap":"s"}]}]}},{"id":"grow","text":{"en":"Let the card's height follow its content, and let the title and address wrap","ar":"اجعل ارتفاع البطاقة يتبع محتواها، واسمح للعنوان والمكان بالالتفاف"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"manara","name":{"en":"Manara Learning Hub","ar":"منارة"},"color":"#5B3FD6","icon":"chalkboard-teacher","domain":"manara.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Sessions","ar":"الجلسات"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"width":260,"blocks":[{"kind":"group","blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Sketch Your First App for Community Projects and Volunteer Teams","ar":"صمّم تطبيقك الأول للمبادرات المجتمعية والفرق التطوعية"}},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"17 November, 18:00–20:00","ar":"17 نوفمبر، من 18:00 إلى 20:00"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Riverside Learning Hub, East Building, Second Floor, Room 204","ar":"مركز التعلّم المجتمعي، المبنى الشرقي، الطابق الثاني، القاعة 204"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"EGP 120","ar":"120 جنيهًا"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Reserve a place in this workshop","ar":"احجز مكانك في هذه الورشة"},"gap":"m"}]}]}}],"answer":["grow"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P10-068","when":["smaller"],"feedback":{"en":"Everything fits, at a size nobody can read. The box is the problem, not the text: let the card grow.","ar":"كل شيء يتّسع، لكن بحجم لا يستطيع أحد قراءته. المشكلة في الصندوق، لا في النص: دع البطاقة تكبر."}},{"id":"MC-P10-069","when":["shorten"],"feedback":{"en":"\"Riverside Hub\" drops the building, floor and room Reem needs to find the class. Don't cut facts to fit a box.","ar":"«مركز التعلّم» تُسقط المبنى والطابق والقاعة التي تحتاجها ريم لتصل إلى الورشة. لا تحذف المعلومات لتناسب صندوقًا."}}],"hints":[{"en":"The real title and address are longer. What is stopping the card from fitting them?","ar":"العنوان والمكان الحقيقيان أطول. ما الذي يمنع البطاقة من استيعابهما؟"},{"en":"Smaller text and shorter words both change the content. What could change instead?","ar":"النص الأصغر والكلمات الأقصر كلاهما يغيّر المحتوى. ما الذي يمكن أن يتغيّر بدلًا من ذلك؟"}],"correct":{"en":"The card grows; every word stays.","ar":"البطاقة تكبر؛ وكل كلمة تبقى."},"explain":{"en":"A taller card that shows every fact beats a neat one that hides them. Let the height follow the content, let long lines wrap, and keep the button after the details so longer text pushes it down.","ar":"البطاقة الأطول التي تُظهر كل معلومة أفضل من المرتّبة التي تخفيها. اجعل الارتفاع يتبع المحتوى، ودع الأسطر الطويلة تلتفّ، وأبقِ الزر بعد التفاصيل حتى يدفعه النص الأطول إلى الأسفل."}},{"id":"S03","type":"card","part":"concept","icons":["text","layers","cut","eye"],"title":{"en":"Design for the real words","ar":"صمّم للكلمات الحقيقية"},"body":{"en":"Short sample text makes a fragile layout look finished. Real titles, addresses and translations show whether it can adapt.\n\n- **Real content early:** use placeholder text only when you have to, in rough early sketches.\n- **Size follows content:** let heights grow and lines wrap; keep buttons after the details.\n- **Room for translation:** labels can grow by half or more when translated, and Arabic often runs longer.\n- **Concise, not cut:** shorter wording is good when the meaning stays. Never drop a fact to fit a box.","ar":"النص القصير المستخدم كمثال يجعل التخطيط الهشّ يبدو مكتملًا. والعناوين والأماكن والترجمات الحقيقية تُظهر هل يستطيع التكيّف.\n\n- **المحتوى الحقيقي مبكرًا:** استخدم النص المؤقّت (Placeholder) فقط عند الضرورة، في الرسومات الأولية.\n- **الحجم يتبع المحتوى:** دع الارتفاعات تكبر والأسطر تلتفّ؛ وأبقِ الأزرار بعد التفاصيل.\n- **مساحة للترجمة:** قد تطول التسميات بمقدار النصف أو أكثر عند الترجمة، والعربية كثيرًا ما تكون أطول.\n- **الإيجاز لا الحذف:** الصياغة الأقصر جيدة حين يبقى المعنى. ولا تحذف معلومة أبدًا لتناسب صندوقًا."}},{"id":"S04","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P10-U05-02","part":"guided","rules":["R06","R13"],"value":{"en":"International usability (NN/g): leave room for labels and hints to grow by at least 50% when an app is translated from English.","ar":"سهولة الاستخدام عالميًا (NN/g): اترك مساحة لتطول التسميات والتلميحات بنسبة 50% على الأقل حين يُترجم التطبيق من الإنجليزية."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/international-usability-details-differ/","quote":"leave room for labels and hints to grow by at least 50%"},"scenario":{"en":"When a session is full, my card shows a button sized for the English label \"Waitlist\". The Arabic label is «انضم إلى قائمة الانتظار», and it no longer fits.","ar":"حين تكتمل الجلسة، تعرض بطاقتي زرًا بحجم مناسب للتسمية الإنجليزية «Waitlist». والتسمية العربية «انضم إلى قائمة الانتظار»، ولم تعد تتّسع."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each fix for the Arabic version. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل إصلاح للنسخة العربية. أيّ إصلاح يُظهر التسمية العربية كاملة وبحجم مقروء؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"manara","name":{"en":"Manara Learning Hub","ar":"منارة"},"color":"#5B3FD6","icon":"chalkboard-teacher","domain":"manara.example"},"caption":{"en":"Now, Arabic version","ar":"الآن، النسخة العربية"},"dir":"rtl","width":260,"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":"صمّم تطبيقك الأول"},{"kind":"meta","text":"اكتمل الحجز","gap":"s"},{"kind":"row","gap":"m","blocks":[{"kind":"button","nowrap":true,"text":"انضم إلى قائمة الانتظار"},{"kind":"divider"}]}]},"options":[{"id":"cut","text":{"en":"Shorten the Arabic label to «انتظار» (\"Waiting\")","ar":"اختصر التسمية العربية إلى «انتظار»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"manara","name":{"en":"Manara Learning Hub","ar":"منارة"},"color":"#5B3FD6","icon":"chalkboard-teacher","domain":"manara.example"},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"dir":"rtl","width":260,"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":"صمّم تطبيقك الأول"},{"kind":"meta","text":"اكتمل الحجز","gap":"s"},{"kind":"row","gap":"m","blocks":[{"kind":"button","text":"انتظار"},{"kind":"divider"}]}]}},{"id":"grow","text":{"en":"Let the button grow to fit its label, full width on phones","ar":"اجعل الزر يكبر ليتّسع لتسميته، بكامل العرض على الهاتف"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"manara","name":{"en":"Manara Learning Hub","ar":"منارة"},"color":"#5B3FD6","icon":"chalkboard-teacher","domain":"manara.example"},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"dir":"rtl","width":260,"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":"صمّم تطبيقك الأول"},{"kind":"meta","text":"اكتمل الحجز","gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":"انضم إلى قائمة الانتظار","gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"tiny","text":{"en":"Keep the button size; shrink the Arabic text inside it","ar":"أبقِ حجم الزر؛ وصغّر النص العربي داخله"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"manara","name":{"en":"Manara Learning Hub","ar":"منارة"},"color":"#5B3FD6","icon":"chalkboard-teacher","domain":"manara.example"},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"dir":"rtl","width":260,"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":"صمّم تطبيقك الأول"},{"kind":"meta","text":"اكتمل الحجز","gap":"s"},{"kind":"row","gap":"m","blocks":[{"kind":"button","px":8,"text":"انضم إلى قائمة الانتظار"},{"kind":"divider"}]}]}}],"answer":["grow"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P10-069","when":["cut"],"feedback":{"en":"«انتظار» alone doesn't say what tapping does. The Arabic reader deserves the same clear action as the English one. Make room instead.","ar":"«انتظار» وحدها لا تقول ماذا يحدث عند الضغط. والقارئ العربي يستحق الإجراء الواضح نفسه الذي يحصل عليه القارئ الإنجليزي. وفّر المساحة بدلًا من ذلك."}},{"id":"MC-P10-068","when":["tiny"],"feedback":{"en":"The label fits, but it's too small to read comfortably. Size the button to its label, not the other way round.","ar":"التسمية تتّسع، لكنها أصغر من أن تُقرأ بارتياح. اجعل حجم الزر يتبع تسميته، لا العكس."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Does the short Arabic label say the same thing as the full one?","ar":"هل تقول التسمية العربية القصيرة الشيء نفسه الذي تقوله التسمية الكاملة؟"},{"en":"Should the words fit the button, or the button fit the words?","ar":"هل يجب أن تناسب الكلمات الزر، أم أن يناسب الزر الكلمات؟"}],"correct":{"en":"The button fits the words.","ar":"الزر يتّسع للكلمات."},"explain":{"en":"Translated labels often need half as much room again, or more. Plan buttons and labels that grow, so every language gets the full, clear wording.","ar":"التسميات المترجمة تحتاج غالبًا مساحة أكبر بالنصف أو أكثر. خطّط لأزرار وتسميات تكبر، حتى تحصل كل لغة على الصياغة الكاملة الواضحة."},"speaker":"sara"},{"id":"S05","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P10-U05-03","part":"guided","rules":["R06","R15"],"value":{"en":"Layout vs. content (NN/g): use placeholders only if you have to, and only in early low-fidelity wireframes; debugging layouts with real content during design saves copyfitting and redesign later.","ar":"التخطيط والمحتوى (NN/g): استخدم النص المؤقّت فقط عند الضرورة، وفي الرسومات الأولية فقط؛ واختبار التخطيط بالمحتوى الحقيقي أثناء التصميم يوفّر إعادة ضبط النصوص وإعادة التصميم لاحقًا."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/layout-vs-content/","quote":"Use placeholders only if you have to"},"scenario":{"en":"Before I hand over my new session card, you test it once more. The list will hold about 40 real sessions, in English and Arabic.","ar":"قبل أن أسلّم بطاقة الجلسة الجديدة، تختبرها أنت مرة أخرى. وستضم القائمة نحو 40 جلسة حقيقية، بالإنجليزية والعربية."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each test text. Which one should you test with?","ar":"جرّب كل نص للاختبار. أيّ نص يكشف هل تعمل البطاقة مع كل الجلسات الحقيقية؟"},"start":"lorem","options":[{"id":"lorem","text":{"en":"Placeholder text that fills the card neatly","ar":"نص مؤقّت يملأ البطاقة بشكل مرتّب"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"manara","name":{"en":"Manara Learning Hub","ar":"منارة"},"color":"#5B3FD6","icon":"chalkboard-teacher","domain":"manara.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Sessions","ar":"الجلسات"},"back":true},"width":260,"blocks":[{"kind":"group","blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":"Lorem ipsum dolor"},{"kind":"meta","text":"Sit amet, consectetur","gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":"Lorem ipsum","gap":"m"}]}]}},{"id":"longest","text":{"en":"The longest real title and address, in English and in Arabic","ar":"أطول عنوان ومكان حقيقيين، بالإنجليزية والعربية"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"manara","name":{"en":"Manara Learning Hub","ar":"منارة"},"color":"#5B3FD6","icon":"chalkboard-teacher","domain":"manara.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Sessions","ar":"الجلسات"},"back":true},"width":260,"blocks":[{"kind":"group","blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Sketch Your First App for Community Projects and Volunteer Teams","ar":"صمّم تطبيقك الأول للمبادرات المجتمعية والفرق التطوعية"}},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Riverside Learning Hub, East Building, Second Floor, Room 204","ar":"مركز التعلّم المجتمعي، المبنى الشرقي، الطابق الثاني، القاعة 204"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Reserve a place in this workshop","ar":"احجز مكانك في هذه الورشة"},"gap":"m"}]}]}},{"id":"typical","text":{"en":"A typical real title, in English only","ar":"عنوان حقيقي متوسّط الطول، بالإنجليزية فقط"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"manara","name":{"en":"Manara Learning Hub","ar":"منارة"},"color":"#5B3FD6","icon":"chalkboard-teacher","domain":"manara.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Sessions","ar":"الجلسات"},"back":true},"width":260,"blocks":[{"kind":"group","blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":"Sketch Your First App"},{"kind":"meta","text":"Downtown Learning Hub","gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":"Reserve a place","gap":"m"}]}]}}],"answer":["longest"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P10-080","when":["lorem","typical"],"feedback":{"en":"That text happens to fit. The card has to work for the longest of the 40 real sessions, and in Arabic too. Test with the hardest real case.","ar":"هذا النص يتّسع بالصدفة. لكن البطاقة يجب أن تعمل مع أطول جلسة من الأربعين الحقيقية، وبالعربية أيضًا. اختبر بأصعب حالة حقيقية."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Which text is most likely to break the card?","ar":"أي نص هو الأكثر احتمالًا أن يكسر البطاقة؟"},{"en":"Placeholder and typical text fit neatly. Will every real session?","ar":"النص المؤقت والنص المعتاد يناسبان البطاقة بسهولة. هل ستناسبها كل الجلسات الحقيقية؟"}],"correct":{"en":"The hardest real text you'll get.","ar":"أصعب نص حقيقي ستحصل عليه."},"explain":{"en":"A layout is only as good as the worst real content it holds. Test with the longest real title and address, in every language, before you call it done.","ar":"التخطيط جيد بقدر أسوأ محتوى حقيقي يحمله. اختبر بأطول عنوان ومكان حقيقيين، بكل لغة، قبل أن تقول إنه انتهى."},"speaker":"sara"},{"id":"S06","type":"compare","skill":"SK-P10-U05-03","part":"contrast","confidence":true,"rules":["R11","R15"],"value":{"en":"Contrast with S02: shortening was wrong there because it dropped facts. NN/g: users in all countries prefer concise sites. Tightening wording that keeps every fact is good writing.","ar":"مقارنة مع الخطوة 2: كان الاختصار خطأً هناك لأنه أسقط معلومات. NN/g: المستخدمون في كل البلدان يفضّلون المواقع الموجزة. وشدّ الصياغة مع إبقاء كل معلومة كتابة جيدة."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/international-usability-details-differ/","quote":"Even so, users in all countries prefer concise sites."},"scenario":{"en":"The marketing team wrote a new description for my session card. Both versions below say who it's for, what you'll make, and that no experience is needed.","ar":"كتب فريق التسويق وصفًا جديدًا لبطاقة الجلسة التي أصمّمها. والنسختان أدناه تقولان لمن الورشة، وماذا ستصنع، وأنه لا تلزم خبرة سابقة."},"prompt":{"en":"Which description should ship?","ar":"أي وصف يُبقي المعلومات الثلاث ويُقرأ أسرع؟"},"a":{"mock":{"app":{"id":"manara","name":{"en":"Manara Learning Hub","ar":"منارة"},"color":"#5B3FD6","icon":"chalkboard-teacher","domain":"manara.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Sessions","ar":"الجلسات"},"back":true},"width":260,"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Sketch Your First App for Community Projects and Volunteer Teams","ar":"صمّم تطبيقك الأول للمبادرات المجتمعية والفرق التطوعية"}},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"For volunteer teams. You'll sketch one app screen on paper. No experience needed.","ar":"للفرق التطوعية. سترسم شاشة تطبيق واحدة على الورق. لا تلزم خبرة سابقة."},"gap":"s"}]}},"b":{"mock":{"app":{"id":"manara","name":{"en":"Manara Learning Hub","ar":"منارة"},"color":"#5B3FD6","icon":"chalkboard-teacher","domain":"manara.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Sessions","ar":"الجلسات"},"back":true},"width":260,"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Sketch Your First App for Community Projects and Volunteer Teams","ar":"صمّم تطبيقك الأول للمبادرات المجتمعية والفرق التطوعية"}},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"Have you ever dreamed of turning your team's ideas into something real? In this exciting and inspiring evening designed especially for volunteer teams, you'll discover the joy of sketching one app screen on paper, and no experience is needed at all.","ar":"هل حلمت يومًا بتحويل أفكار فريقك إلى شيء حقيقي؟ في هذه الأمسية المشوّقة والملهمة المصمّمة خصيصًا للفرق التطوعية، ستكتشف متعة رسم شاشة تطبيق واحدة على الورق، ولا تلزم أي خبرة سابقة على الإطلاق."},"gap":"s"}]}},"answer":"a","reason":{"prompt":{"en":"Why is A better, when S02 said not to shorten?","ar":"لماذا A أفضل، مع أن الخطوة 2 قالت لا تختصر؟"},"options":[{"id":"fits","text":{"en":"A fits the card better","ar":"A تناسب البطاقة أكثر"}},{"id":"same","text":{"en":"A keeps every fact and drops only filler, so it's faster to read","ar":"A تُبقي كل معلومة وتحذف الحشو فقط، فهي أسرع في القراءة"}},{"id":"always","text":{"en":"Shorter text is always better","ar":"النص الأقصر أفضل دائمًا"}}],"answer":["same"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P10-081","when":["fits","always"],"feedback":{"en":"The card can grow either way, and shorter isn't always better: \"Riverside Hub\" was shorter and wrong. A wins because it keeps every fact.","ar":"البطاقة تستطيع أن تكبر في الحالتين، والأقصر ليس دائمًا أفضل: «مركز التعلّم» كان أقصر وخاطئًا. A تفوز لأنها تُبقي كل معلومة."}}]},"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P10-081","when":["b"],"feedback":{"en":"B says the same three facts, buried in filler. People scan; they'll miss \"no experience needed\". Concise wording that keeps the facts is better.","ar":"B تقول المعلومات الثلاث نفسها، لكنها مدفونة في الحشو. والناس يتصفّحون بسرعة؛ فسيفوتهم «لا تلزم خبرة سابقة». الصياغة الموجزة التي تُبقي المعلومات أفضل."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Both keep the facts. Count the words that add nothing.","ar":"كلتاهما تحتفظ بالمعلومات. عُدّ الكلمات التي لا تضيف شيئًا."},{"en":"Which one is shorter without losing a fact?","ar":"أيّهما أقصر دون أن يفقد معلومة؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Cut filler, never facts.","ar":"احذف الحشو، لا المعلومات."},"explain":{"en":"Let the layout grow for the facts you need, and still write as briefly as you can. Those two rules work together: concise copy in a flexible box.","ar":"دع التخطيط يكبر للمعلومات التي تحتاجها، واكتب مع ذلك بأوجز ما تستطيع. القاعدتان تعملان معًا: نص موجز في صندوق مرن."},"speaker":"sara"},{"id":"S07","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P10-U05-01","part":"independent","rules":["R14","R19"],"value":{"en":"New case. Layout vs. content (NN/g): debugging layouts with real content during design saves copyfitting time and redesign money later. Fixed-height rows fail on real order lines.","ar":"حالة جديدة. التخطيط والمحتوى (NN/g): اختبار التخطيط بالمحتوى الحقيقي أثناء التصميم يوفّر وقت ضبط النصوص وكلفة إعادة التصميم لاحقًا. والصفوف ثابتة الارتفاع تفشل مع أسطر الطلبات الحقيقية."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/layout-vs-content/","quote":"Debugging layouts during design will save a lot of copyfitting time and redesign money later."},"scenario":{"en":"I'm also reviewing a delivery app. Lina's order summary uses rows with a fixed height of one line. Her real order line is long.","ar":"أراجع أيضًا تطبيق توصيل. ملخّص طلب لينا يستخدم صفوفًا بارتفاع ثابت يساوي سطرًا واحدًا. وسطر طلبها الحقيقي طويل."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each fix. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل إصلاح. أيّها يجب أن يُطلق؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"tayyar","name":{"en":"Tayyar","ar":"طيّار"},"color":"#EA580C","icon":"moped","domain":"tayyar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Your order","ar":"طلبك"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"width":260,"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Your order","ar":"طلبك"}},{"kind":"meta","nowrap":true,"text":{"en":"2 shawarma, 1 large salad with extra tahini, 2 garlic sauces","ar":"2 شاورما، 1 سلطة كبيرة مع طحينة إضافية، 2 صوص ثوم"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Arriving 19:40","ar":"يصل الساعة 19:40"},"gap":"s"}]},"options":[{"id":"dots","text":{"en":"Keep one line, ending in \"…\"; Lina can tap to see more","ar":"أبقِ سطرًا واحدًا ينتهي بـ «…»؛ ويمكن للينا الضغط لترى المزيد"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"tayyar","name":{"en":"Tayyar","ar":"طيّار"},"color":"#EA580C","icon":"moped","domain":"tayyar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Your order","ar":"طلبك"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"width":260,"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Your order","ar":"طلبك"}},{"kind":"meta","nowrap":true,"text":{"en":"2 shawarma, 1 large salad with extra tahini, 2 garlic sauces","ar":"2 شاورما، 1 سلطة كبيرة مع طحينة إضافية، 2 صوص ثوم"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Arriving 19:40","ar":"يصل الساعة 19:40"},"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"tiny","text":{"en":"Keep one line, in smaller text","ar":"أبقِ سطرًا واحدًا، بنص أصغر"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"tayyar","name":{"en":"Tayyar","ar":"طيّار"},"color":"#EA580C","icon":"moped","domain":"tayyar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Your order","ar":"طلبك"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"width":260,"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Your order","ar":"طلبك"}},{"kind":"text","px":8,"nowrap":true,"text":{"en":"2 shawarma, 1 large salad with extra tahini, 2 garlic sauces","ar":"2 شاورما، 1 سلطة كبيرة مع طحينة إضافية، 2 صوص ثوم"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Arriving 19:40","ar":"يصل الساعة 19:40"},"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"wrap","text":{"en":"Give rows a minimum height, and let them grow and wrap","ar":"اجعل للصفوف حدًا أدنى للارتفاع، واسمح لها بأن تكبر وتلتفّ"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"tayyar","name":{"en":"Tayyar","ar":"طيّار"},"color":"#EA580C","icon":"moped","domain":"tayyar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Your order","ar":"طلبك"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"width":260,"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Your order","ar":"طلبك"}},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"2 shawarma, 1 large salad with extra tahini, 2 garlic sauces","ar":"2 شاورما، 1 سلطة كبيرة مع طحينة إضافية، 2 صوص ثوم"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Arriving 19:40","ar":"يصل الساعة 19:40"},"gap":"s"}]}}],"answer":["wrap"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P10-068","when":["dots","tiny"],"feedback":{"en":"Lina needs to check the extra tahini and garlic sauces she ordered. A cut-off or tiny line hides exactly that. Let the row grow.","ar":"تحتاج لينا أن تتحقّق من الطحينة الإضافية وصوص الثوم اللذين طلبتهما. والسطر المقطوع أو الصغير جدًا يُخفي ذلك بالضبط. دع الصف يكبر."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Can Lina read her whole order line in each version?","ar":"هل تستطيع لينا قراءة سطر طلبها كاملًا في كل نسخة؟"},{"en":"A fixed height is a maximum. What should a row have instead?","ar":"الارتفاع الثابت حدّ أقصى. ماذا يجب أن يكون للصف بدلًا من ذلك؟"}],"correct":{"en":"A minimum, not a maximum.","ar":"حدّ أدنى، لا حدّ أقصى."},"explain":{"en":"Same rule as Reem's card: a one-line height is fine as a minimum. Real content decides how tall each row really gets.","ar":"القاعدة نفسها التي طبّقتها على بطاقة ريم: ارتفاع السطر الواحد مناسب كحدّ أدنى. والمحتوى الحقيقي يحدّد كم يكبر كل صف فعلًا."},"speaker":"sara"},{"id":"S08","type":"card","part":"recap","icons":["text","layers","cut","eye"],"title":{"en":"What you did","ar":"ماذا تعلّمت"},"body":{"en":"- **Size follows content:** let the card grow and the lines wrap.\n- **Room for translation:** gave the Arabic label the space it needs.\n- **Real test text:** tested with the longest real content, in both languages.\n- **Concise, not cut:** removed filler, never facts.\n\nNext lesson: Arabic and the right-to-left layout.","ar":"- **الحجم يتبع المحتوى:** دع البطاقة تكبر والأسطر تلتفّ.\n- **مساحة للترجمة:** أعطيت التسمية العربية المساحة التي تحتاجها.\n- **نص اختبار حقيقي:** اختبرت بأطول محتوى حقيقي، باللغتين.\n- **الإيجاز لا الحذف:** حذفت الحشو، لا المعلومات.\n\nالدرس التالي: العربية والتخطيط من اليمين إلى اليسار."}}]}$uxg$::jsonb),
  ($uxg$P10-U05-L02$uxg$, $uxg$86029e15e357c2eed3b4aef5982159435b71a18493e8e48c32a900d62f2554dc$uxg$, $uxg${"id":"P10-U05-L02","mode":"lesson","minutes":8,"title":{"en":"Arabic and the right-to-left layout","ar":"العربية والتخطيط من اليمين إلى اليسار"},"summary":{"en":"Flip a booking screen's layout correctly for Arabic and mixed Arabic and English text.","ar":"اعكس تخطيط شاشة الحجز بالشكل الصحيح للعربية وللنص المختلط بين العربية والإنجليزية."},"speaker":"sara","review_labels":{"MC-P10-070":{"en":"Mirror the layout, not the content","ar":"اعكس التخطيط، لا المحتوى"},"MC-P10-072":{"en":"Translating the text isn't enough; the layout flows too","ar":"ترجمة النص لا تكفي؛ التخطيط يتغيّر اتجاهه أيضًا"},"MC-P10-082":{"en":"Mirror every screen the same way","ar":"اعكس كل الشاشات بالطريقة نفسها"}},"steps":[{"id":"S01","type":"card","part":"hook","title":{"en":"Translated, but not turned around","ar":"مترجمة، لكن غير معكوسة"},"body":{"en":"My team built the Arabic version of the booking screen I designed. They translated every word, but kept the layout exactly as in English.\n\nArabic is read from right to left. Look at where everything sits.","ar":"بنى فريقي النسخة العربية من شاشة الحجز التي صمّمتها. ترجموا كل كلمة، لكن أبقوا التخطيط كما هو في الإنجليزية تمامًا.\n\nالعربية تُقرأ من اليمين إلى اليسار. انظر أين يقع كل شيء."},"mock":{"app":{"id":"manara","name":{"en":"Manara Learning Hub","ar":"منارة"},"color":"#5B3FD6","icon":"chalkboard-teacher","domain":"manara.example"},"dir":"ltr","width":300,"blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":"← رجوع"},{"kind":"title","text":"ارسم تطبيقك الأول","gap":"s"},{"kind":"meta","text":"الثلاثاء 17 نوفمبر، من 18:00 إلى 20:00","gap":"s"},{"kind":"meta","text":"مجاني","gap":"xs"},{"kind":"row","gap":"m","blocks":[{"kind":"button","emphasis":"low","text":"رجوع"},{"kind":"button","text":"متابعة"}]}]}},{"id":"S02","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P10-U05-04","part":"try","rules":["R12"],"value":{"en":"International usability (NN/g): for right-to-left languages, the guideline is to mirror-image the design patterns from left-to-right sites.","ar":"سهولة الاستخدام عالميًا (NN/g): في اللغات التي تُقرأ من اليمين إلى اليسار، القاعدة أن تُعكس أنماط التصميم المستخدمة في المواقع التي تُقرأ من اليسار إلى اليمين."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/international-usability-details-differ/","quote":"mirror-image the design patterns"},"prompt":{"en":"Try each version of the Arabic screen. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل نسخة من الشاشة العربية. أيّها يجب أن تُطلق؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"manara","name":{"en":"Manara Learning Hub","ar":"منارة"},"color":"#5B3FD6","icon":"chalkboard-teacher","domain":"manara.example"},"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"dir":"ltr","width":300,"blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":"← رجوع"},{"kind":"title","text":"ارسم تطبيقك الأول","gap":"s"},{"kind":"meta","text":"الثلاثاء 17 نوفمبر، من 18:00 إلى 20:00","gap":"s"},{"kind":"meta","text":"مجاني","gap":"xs"},{"kind":"row","gap":"m","blocks":[{"kind":"button","emphasis":"low","text":"رجوع"},{"kind":"button","text":"متابعة"}]}]},"options":[{"id":"align","text":{"en":"Right-align the text; leave the arrow and buttons where they are","ar":"اجعل النص بمحاذاة اليمين؛ واترك السهم والأزرار في أماكنها"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"manara","name":{"en":"Manara Learning Hub","ar":"منارة"},"color":"#5B3FD6","icon":"chalkboard-teacher","domain":"manara.example"},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"dir":"ltr","width":300,"blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":"← رجوع"},{"kind":"title","style":"end","text":"ارسم تطبيقك الأول","gap":"s"},{"kind":"meta","style":"end","text":"الثلاثاء 17 نوفمبر، من 18:00 إلى 20:00","gap":"s"},{"kind":"meta","style":"end","text":"مجاني","gap":"xs"},{"kind":"row","gap":"m","blocks":[{"kind":"button","emphasis":"low","text":"رجوع"},{"kind":"button","text":"متابعة"}]}]}},{"id":"mirror","text":{"en":"Mirror the whole layout: it starts from the right","ar":"اعكس التخطيط كله: يبدأ من اليمين"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"manara","name":{"en":"Manara Learning Hub","ar":"منارة"},"color":"#5B3FD6","icon":"chalkboard-teacher","domain":"manara.example"},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"dir":"rtl","width":300,"blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":"→ رجوع"},{"kind":"title","text":"ارسم تطبيقك الأول","gap":"s"},{"kind":"meta","text":"الثلاثاء 17 نوفمبر، من 18:00 إلى 20:00","gap":"s"},{"kind":"meta","text":"مجاني","gap":"xs"},{"kind":"row","gap":"m","blocks":[{"kind":"button","emphasis":"low","text":"رجوع"},{"kind":"button","text":"متابعة"}]}]}},{"id":"keep","text":{"en":"Keep it; Arabic speakers also use English apps","ar":"أبقِها؛ فمتحدّثو العربية يستخدمون تطبيقات إنجليزية أيضًا"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"manara","name":{"en":"Manara Learning Hub","ar":"منارة"},"color":"#5B3FD6","icon":"chalkboard-teacher","domain":"manara.example"},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"dir":"ltr","width":300,"blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":"← رجوع"},{"kind":"title","text":"ارسم تطبيقك الأول","gap":"s"},{"kind":"meta","text":"الثلاثاء 17 نوفمبر، من 18:00 إلى 20:00","gap":"s"},{"kind":"meta","text":"مجاني","gap":"xs"},{"kind":"row","gap":"m","blocks":[{"kind":"button","emphasis":"low","text":"رجوع"},{"kind":"button","text":"متابعة"}]}]}}],"answer":["mirror"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P10-072","when":["align","keep"],"feedback":{"en":"Arabic readers start at the right. Translated text in a left-to-right layout makes them start in the wrong corner, and the back arrow and buttons still point the English way. Mirror the layout.","ar":"القارئ العربي يبدأ من اليمين. والنص المترجم داخل تخطيط من اليسار إلى اليمين يجعله يبدأ من الزاوية الخطأ، والسهم والأزرار ما زالت باتجاه الإنجليزية. اعكس التخطيط."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Follow the reading direction. Where does the eye start, and where does the arrow point?","ar":"تابع اتجاه القراءة. من أين تبدأ العين، وإلى أين يشير السهم؟"},{"en":"Right-aligned text alone leaves the buttons and arrows going the English way.","ar":"محاذاة النص لليمين وحدها تترك الأزرار والأسهم في الاتجاه الإنجليزي."}],"correct":{"en":"The whole layout flows from the right.","ar":"التخطيط كله يبدأ من اليمين."},"explain":{"en":"Translation changes the words; mirroring changes the flow. In Arabic, the screen starts at the right: alignment, the back arrow and the button order all follow.","ar":"الترجمة تغيّر الكلمات؛ والعكس يغيّر الاتجاه. في العربية تبدأ الشاشة من اليمين: والمحاذاة، وسهم الرجوع، وترتيب الأزرار كلها تتبع ذلك."}},{"id":"S03","type":"card","part":"concept","icons":["layers","target","text","ok"],"title":{"en":"Mirror the flow, keep the facts","ar":"اعكس الاتجاه، وأبقِ المعلومات"},"body":{"en":"Arabic reads from right to left (RTL). The guideline is to mirror the left-to-right design patterns.\n\n- **Start and end:** in Arabic, the start is the right. Text aligns there, the back arrow sits there, and steps run from there.\n- **The flow mirrors, the content doesn't:** a booking code, a price or a time is a fact. Its characters keep their order.\n- **Every screen:** mirror all of them the same way. A half-mirrored app is the most confusing of all.\n- **Room to grow:** Arabic text often runs longer, so leave space.","ar":"العربية تُقرأ من اليمين إلى اليسار (RTL). والقاعدة أن تُعكس أنماط التصميم المستخدمة من اليسار إلى اليمين.\n\n- **البداية والنهاية:** في العربية، البداية هي اليمين. هناك يُحاذى النص، وهناك يقع سهم الرجوع، ومن هناك تبدأ الخطوات.\n- **الاتجاه يُعكس، والمحتوى لا:** رمز الحجز أو السعر أو الوقت معلومة. وحروفها تبقى بترتيبها.\n- **كل الشاشات:** اعكسها كلها بالطريقة نفسها. والتطبيق المعكوس جزئيًا هو الأكثر إرباكًا.\n- **مساحة للتمدّد:** النص العربي كثيرًا ما يكون أطول، فاترك مساحة."}},{"id":"S04","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P10-U05-05","part":"guided","rules":["R06","R13"],"value":{"en":"International usability (NN/g): mirror the design patterns. A code is content, not a pattern; reversing its characters creates a different code.","ar":"سهولة الاستخدام عالميًا (NN/g): اعكس أنماط التصميم. والرمز محتوى، لا نمط؛ وعكس حروفه يصنع رمزًا مختلفًا."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/international-usability-details-differ/","quote":"mirror-image the design patterns"},"scenario":{"en":"On my Arabic confirmation, Reem's booking code is WS-204. She'll read it out at the door. To be safe, the team mirrored everything, including the code.","ar":"في رسالة التأكيد العربية التي أصمّمها، رمز حجز ريم هو WS-204. وستقرؤه عند الباب. واحتياطًا، عكس الفريق كل شيء، حتى الرمز."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each version of the last line. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل نسخة من السطر الأخير. أيّ نسخة تُظهر لريم رمزها الصحيح لتقرأه عند الباب؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"manara","name":{"en":"Manara Learning Hub","ar":"منارة"},"color":"#5B3FD6","icon":"chalkboard-teacher","domain":"manara.example"},"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"dir":"rtl","width":300,"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":"تمّ حجزك!"},{"kind":"meta","text":"الثلاثاء 17 نوفمبر، من 18:00 إلى 20:00","gap":"s"},{"kind":"meta","text":"رمز الحجز:","code":"402-SW","gap":"s"}]},"options":[{"id":"keep","text":{"en":"Keep it; everything in the Arabic version is mirrored","ar":"أبقِه؛ فكل شيء في النسخة العربية معكوس"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"manara","name":{"en":"Manara Learning Hub","ar":"منارة"},"color":"#5B3FD6","icon":"chalkboard-teacher","domain":"manara.example"},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"dir":"rtl","width":300,"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":"تمّ حجزك!"},{"kind":"meta","text":"الثلاثاء 17 نوفمبر، من 18:00 إلى 20:00","gap":"s"},{"kind":"meta","text":"رمز الحجز:","code":"402-SW","gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"drop","text":{"en":"Leave the code out of the Arabic version","ar":"احذف الرمز من النسخة العربية"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"manara","name":{"en":"Manara Learning Hub","ar":"منارة"},"color":"#5B3FD6","icon":"chalkboard-teacher","domain":"manara.example"},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"dir":"rtl","width":300,"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":"تمّ حجزك!"},{"kind":"meta","text":"الثلاثاء 17 نوفمبر، من 18:00 إلى 20:00","gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"code","text":{"en":"The sentence flows right to left; the code stays WS-204","ar":"الجملة من اليمين إلى اليسار؛ والرمز يبقى WS-204"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"manara","name":{"en":"Manara Learning Hub","ar":"منارة"},"color":"#5B3FD6","icon":"chalkboard-teacher","domain":"manara.example"},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"dir":"rtl","width":300,"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":"تمّ حجزك!"},{"kind":"meta","text":"الثلاثاء 17 نوفمبر، من 18:00 إلى 20:00","gap":"s"},{"kind":"meta","text":"رمز الحجز:","code":"WS-204","gap":"s"}]}}],"answer":["code"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P10-070","when":["keep"],"feedback":{"en":"402-SW isn't Reem's code. Reversing its characters made a different identifier, and she'd be turned away at the door. Mirror the layout, not the facts.","ar":"402-SW ليس رمز ريم. عكس حروفه صنع رمزًا آخر، وقد تُرفض عند الباب. اعكس التخطيط، لا المعلومات."}},{"id":"MC-P10-072","when":["drop"],"feedback":{"en":"Arabic readers need the code too. Keep it, written exactly as it is, inside the right-to-left sentence.","ar":"القرّاء العرب يحتاجون الرمز أيضًا. أبقِه مكتوبًا كما هو تمامًا، داخل الجملة التي تُقرأ من اليمين إلى اليسار."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Reem will read the code out at the door. What does she need it to look like?","ar":"ستقرأ ريم الرمز عند الباب. كيف يجب أن يبدو لها؟"},{"en":"A code is a fact, not a layout. Should a fact change direction?","ar":"الرمز معلومة لا تخطيط. هل يجب أن تغيّر المعلومة اتجاهها؟"}],"correct":{"en":"The sentence mirrors; the code doesn't.","ar":"الجملة تُعكس؛ والرمز لا."},"explain":{"en":"Mirroring applies to the layout and the patterns. A code, a price or a time keeps its characters in the same order in every language.","ar":"العكس ينطبق على التخطيط والأنماط. أما الرمز أو السعر أو الوقت فيبقى بحروفه وترتيبها نفسه في كل لغة."},"speaker":"sara"},{"id":"S05","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P10-U05-04","part":"guided","rules":["R06","R15"],"value":{"en":"International usability (NN/g): the important thing is to stay consistent within the site. Users switch between Arabic and English sites without trouble, but a mix inside one product breaks their expectations.","ar":"سهولة الاستخدام عالميًا (NN/g): المهم هو الثبات داخل الموقع الواحد. ينتقل المستخدمون بين المواقع العربية والإنجليزية دون مشكلة، لكن الخلط داخل منتج واحد يكسر توقّعاتهم."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/international-usability-details-differ/","quote":"The important thing is to stay consistent within the site"},"scenario":{"en":"Every screen of my Arabic app is mirrored except the payment form, which a developer copied from the English version.","ar":"كل شاشات تطبيقي العربي معكوسة، إلا نموذج الدفع الذي نسخه أحد المطوّرين من النسخة الإنجليزية."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each fix for the payment form. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل إصلاح لنموذج الدفع. أيّ إصلاح يجعل نموذج الدفع مثل باقي شاشات التطبيق العربي؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"manara","name":{"en":"Manara Learning Hub","ar":"منارة"},"color":"#5B3FD6","icon":"chalkboard-teacher","domain":"manara.example"},"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"dir":"ltr","width":300,"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":"الدفع"},{"kind":"field","label":"رقم البطاقة","text":"•••• •••• •••• 4821","filled":true,"gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":"الاسم على البطاقة","text":"ريم أحمد","filled":true,"gap":"s"},{"kind":"row","gap":"m","blocks":[{"kind":"button","emphasis":"low","text":"رجوع"},{"kind":"button","text":"ادفع"}]}]},"options":[{"id":"leave","text":{"en":"Leave it; payment forms are a standard pattern","ar":"اتركه؛ فنماذج الدفع نمط معتاد"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"manara","name":{"en":"Manara Learning Hub","ar":"منارة"},"color":"#5B3FD6","icon":"chalkboard-teacher","domain":"manara.example"},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"dir":"ltr","width":300,"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":"الدفع"},{"kind":"field","label":"رقم البطاقة","text":"•••• •••• •••• 4821","filled":true,"gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":"الاسم على البطاقة","text":"ريم أحمد","filled":true,"gap":"s"},{"kind":"row","gap":"m","blocks":[{"kind":"button","emphasis":"low","text":"رجوع"},{"kind":"button","text":"ادفع"}]}]}},{"id":"english","text":{"en":"Switch this one screen to English, so the layout matches","ar":"حوّل هذه الشاشة وحدها إلى الإنجليزية، حتى يتطابق التخطيط"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"manara","name":{"en":"Manara Learning Hub","ar":"منارة"},"color":"#5B3FD6","icon":"chalkboard-teacher","domain":"manara.example"},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"dir":"ltr","width":300,"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":"Payment"},{"kind":"field","label":"Card number","text":"•••• •••• •••• 4821","filled":true,"gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":"Name on card","text":"Reem Ahmed","filled":true,"gap":"s"},{"kind":"row","gap":"m","blocks":[{"kind":"button","emphasis":"low","text":"Back"},{"kind":"button","text":"Pay"}]}]}},{"id":"mirror","text":{"en":"Mirror it like every other screen","ar":"اعكسه مثل كل الشاشات الأخرى"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"manara","name":{"en":"Manara Learning Hub","ar":"منارة"},"color":"#5B3FD6","icon":"chalkboard-teacher","domain":"manara.example"},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"dir":"rtl","width":300,"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":"الدفع"},{"kind":"field","label":"رقم البطاقة","text":"•••• •••• •••• 4821","filled":true,"gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":"الاسم على البطاقة","text":"ريم أحمد","filled":true,"gap":"s"},{"kind":"row","gap":"m","blocks":[{"kind":"button","emphasis":"low","text":"رجوع"},{"kind":"button","text":"ادفع"}]}]}}],"answer":["mirror"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P10-082","when":["leave","english"],"feedback":{"en":"Reem has just learned that this app starts from the right. One screen that flips back, or switches language, breaks that at the moment she pays. Keep every screen the same.","ar":"تعلّمت ريم للتوّ أن هذا التطبيق يبدأ من اليمين. وشاشة واحدة تنقلب عكس ذلك، أو تتغيّر لغتها، تكسر هذا في لحظة الدفع. أبقِ كل الشاشات بالطريقة نفسها."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Every other screen flows from the right. What happens when this one doesn't?","ar":"كل الشاشات الأخرى تبدأ من اليمين. ماذا يحدث عندما لا تفعل هذه الشاشة ذلك؟"},{"en":"Is the fix to change this screen, or the language?","ar":"هل الحل أن تغيّر هذه الشاشة، أم اللغة؟"}],"correct":{"en":"One direction, on every screen.","ar":"اتجاه واحد، في كل الشاشات."},"explain":{"en":"People adapt easily to either direction, as long as a product stays with one. Check every screen, including forms copied from the English version.","ar":"يتكيّف الناس بسهولة مع أي اتجاه، ما دام المنتج ثابتًا على اتجاه واحد. افحص كل شاشة، حتى النماذج المنسوخة من النسخة الإنجليزية."},"speaker":"sara"},{"id":"S06","type":"compare","skill":"SK-P10-U05-04","part":"contrast","confidence":true,"rules":["R11","R15"],"value":{"en":"Contrast with S04: the code kept its order because it's content. A Back/Continue pair is a pattern: it follows the reading direction, so it mirrors (NN/g: mirror-image the design patterns).","ar":"مقارنة مع الخطوة 4: بقي الرمز بترتيبه لأنه محتوى. أما زوج «رجوع/متابعة» فهو نمط: يتبع اتجاه القراءة، فيُعكس (NN/g: اعكس أنماط التصميم)."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/international-usability-details-differ/","quote":"mirror-image the design patterns"},"scenario":{"en":"In my English app, Back sits on the left and Continue on the right: you move forward in the reading direction.","ar":"في تطبيقي الإنجليزي، يقع «رجوع» على اليسار و«متابعة» على اليمين: تتقدّم في اتجاه القراءة."},"prompt":{"en":"Which Arabic button row should ship?","ar":"أي صف أزرار عربي يضع «متابعة» في اتجاه التقدّم؟"},"a":{"mock":{"app":{"id":"manara","name":{"en":"Manara Learning Hub","ar":"منارة"},"color":"#5B3FD6","icon":"chalkboard-teacher","domain":"manara.example"},"dir":"ltr","width":300,"blocks":[{"kind":"row","gap":"m","blocks":[{"kind":"button","emphasis":"low","text":"رجوع"},{"kind":"button","text":"متابعة"}]}]}},"b":{"mock":{"app":{"id":"manara","name":{"en":"Manara Learning Hub","ar":"منارة"},"color":"#5B3FD6","icon":"chalkboard-teacher","domain":"manara.example"},"dir":"rtl","width":300,"blocks":[{"kind":"row","gap":"m","blocks":[{"kind":"button","emphasis":"low","text":"رجوع"},{"kind":"button","text":"متابعة"}]}]}},"answer":"b","reason":{"prompt":{"en":"Why does this one mirror, when the code didn't?","ar":"لماذا يُعكس هذا، مع أن الرمز لم يُعكس؟"},"options":[{"id":"pattern","text":{"en":"Back and forward follow the reading direction; a code is a fact with a fixed order","ar":"الرجوع والتقدّم يتبعان اتجاه القراءة؛ أما الرمز فمعلومة بترتيب ثابت"}},{"id":"buttons","text":{"en":"Buttons always mirror; text never does","ar":"الأزرار تُعكس دائمًا؛ والنص لا يُعكس أبدًا"}},{"id":"right","text":{"en":"The main button should always be on the right","ar":"الزر الرئيسي يجب أن يكون على اليمين دائمًا"}}],"answer":["pattern"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P10-070","when":["buttons","right"],"feedback":{"en":"The text in a sentence does flow right to left, and the main button isn't always on one side. What mirrors is anything that follows the reading direction, like back and forward.","ar":"النص داخل الجملة يتدفّق من اليمين إلى اليسار فعلًا، والزر الرئيسي ليس دائمًا في جانب واحد. ما يُعكس هو كل ما يتبع اتجاه القراءة، مثل الرجوع والتقدّم."}}]},"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P10-072","when":["a"],"feedback":{"en":"In A, Continue sits at the start of an Arabic row, so moving forward points backwards. Back and forward follow the reading direction, so they mirror.","ar":"في A، تقع «متابعة» في بداية صف عربي، فيصبح التقدّم باتجاه الرجوع. والرجوع والتقدّم يتبعان اتجاه القراءة، لذلك يُعكسان."}}],"hints":[{"en":"In Arabic, which side is forward?","ar":"في العربية، أي جهة هي الأمام؟"},{"en":"Where should Continue sit when you read from the right?","ar":"أين يجب أن يكون زر المتابعة عندما تقرأ من اليمين؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Patterns mirror; facts don't.","ar":"الأنماط تُعكس؛ والمعلومات لا."},"explain":{"en":"Ask one question: does this follow the reading direction? Alignment, back and forward, and step order do, so they mirror. Codes, prices and times don't, so they stay.","ar":"اسأل سؤالًا واحدًا: هل يتبع هذا اتجاه القراءة؟ المحاذاة، والرجوع والتقدّم، وترتيب الخطوات تتبعه، فتُعكس. أما الرموز والأسعار والأوقات فلا، فتبقى كما هي."},"speaker":"sara"},{"id":"S07","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P10-U05-04","part":"independent","rules":["R14","R19"],"value":{"en":"New case. International usability (NN/g): mirror-image the design patterns. A screen header with a back arrow is a pattern that follows the reading direction.","ar":"حالة جديدة. سهولة الاستخدام عالميًا (NN/g): اعكس أنماط التصميم. ورأس الشاشة مع سهم الرجوع نمط يتبع اتجاه القراءة."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/international-usability-details-differ/","quote":"mirror-image the design patterns"},"scenario":{"en":"I'm also reviewing a bus ticket app. Hamza's ticket screen in Arabic still has the English header: a back arrow at the left, pointing left, and the title next to it.","ar":"أراجع أيضًا تطبيقًا لتذاكر الحافلات. شاشة تذكرة حمزة بالعربية ما زالت برأس الشاشة الإنجليزي: سهم رجوع على اليسار يشير إلى اليسار، والعنوان بجانبه."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each header. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل رأس للشاشة. أيّ رأس يضع سهم الرجوع في مكانه واتجاهه الصحيحين بالعربية؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rehla","name":{"en":"Rehla","ar":"رحلة"},"color":"#7048E8","icon":"bus","domain":"rehla.example"},"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"dir":"ltr","width":300,"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":"← تذكرتك"},{"kind":"title","text":"القاهرة ← الإسكندرية","gap":"m"},{"kind":"meta","text":"المغادرة 07:30 · رصيف 4","gap":"s"}]},"options":[{"id":"title","text":{"en":"Move the title to the right; keep the arrow at the left","ar":"انقل العنوان إلى اليمين؛ وأبقِ السهم على اليسار"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rehla","name":{"en":"Rehla","ar":"رحلة"},"color":"#7048E8","icon":"bus","domain":"rehla.example"},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"dir":"ltr","width":300,"blocks":[{"kind":"row","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":"←"},{"kind":"heading","style":"end","text":"تذكرتك"}]},{"kind":"title","style":"end","text":"القاهرة ← الإسكندرية","gap":"m"},{"kind":"meta","style":"end","text":"المغادرة 07:30 · رصيف 4","gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"mirror","text":{"en":"Mirror the header: the arrow at the right, pointing right, then the title","ar":"اعكس رأس الشاشة: السهم على اليمين يشير إلى اليمين، ثم العنوان"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rehla","name":{"en":"Rehla","ar":"رحلة"},"color":"#7048E8","icon":"bus","domain":"rehla.example"},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"dir":"rtl","width":300,"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":"→ تذكرتك"},{"kind":"title","text":"القاهرة ← الإسكندرية","gap":"m"},{"kind":"meta","text":"المغادرة 07:30 · رصيف 4","gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"none","text":{"en":"Remove the back arrow; phones have a back gesture","ar":"احذف سهم الرجوع؛ فللهواتف إيماءة رجوع"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rehla","name":{"en":"Rehla","ar":"رحلة"},"color":"#7048E8","icon":"bus","domain":"rehla.example"},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"dir":"rtl","width":300,"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":"تذكرتك"},{"kind":"title","text":"القاهرة ← الإسكندرية","gap":"m"},{"kind":"meta","text":"المغادرة 07:30 · رصيف 4","gap":"s"}]}}],"answer":["mirror"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P10-072","when":["title"],"feedback":{"en":"Now the title is mirrored but the arrow still points the English way, at the end of an Arabic header. Mirror the whole pattern.","ar":"الآن العنوان معكوس، لكن السهم ما زال باتجاه الإنجليزية، في نهاية رأس عربي. اعكس النمط كله."}},{"id":"MC-P10-082","when":["none"],"feedback":{"en":"The English version keeps its back arrow, so the Arabic one should too. Mirror it rather than remove it.","ar":"النسخة الإنجليزية تحتفظ بسهم الرجوع، فيجب أن تحتفظ به العربية أيضًا. اعكسه بدل أن تحذفه."}}],"hints":[{"en":"In Arabic, where does the screen start, and which way is back?","ar":"في العربية، من أين تبدأ الشاشة، وما اتجاه الرجوع؟"},{"en":"Moving only the title leaves the arrow pointing the English way.","ar":"نقل العنوان وحده يترك السهم يشير بالاتجاه الإنجليزي."}],"correct":{"en":"Back points to the start: the right.","ar":"الرجوع يشير إلى البداية: اليمين."},"explain":{"en":"Same rule as Reem's screen: in Arabic, the screen starts at the right, so the back arrow sits there and points that way. The route \"Cairo to Alexandria\" still reads in Arabic order.","ar":"القاعدة نفسها التي رأيتها في شاشة ريم: في العربية تبدأ الشاشة من اليمين، فيقع سهم الرجوع هناك ويشير إلى ذلك الاتجاه. وخط السير «من القاهرة إلى الإسكندرية» يُقرأ بالترتيب العربي."},"speaker":"sara"},{"id":"S08","type":"card","part":"recap","icons":["layers","target","text","ok"],"title":{"en":"What you did","ar":"ماذا تعلّمت"},"body":{"en":"- **Mirror the flow:** the Arabic screen starts at the right.\n- **Keep the facts:** the code stayed WS-204.\n- **Every screen:** mirrored the payment form like the rest.\n- **Patterns mirror:** back and forward follow the reading direction.\n\nNext lesson: answering critique with a check.","ar":"- **اعكس الاتجاه:** الشاشة العربية تبدأ من اليمين.\n- **أبقِ المعلومات:** بقي الرمز WS-204.\n- **كل الشاشات:** عكست نموذج الدفع مثل باقي الشاشات.\n- **الأنماط تُعكس:** الرجوع والتقدّم يتبعان اتجاه القراءة.\n\nالدرس التالي: الردّ على النقد باختبار."}}]}$uxg$::jsonb),
  ($uxg$P10-U05-L03$uxg$, $uxg$de76d615ccfe7f44d1c0b95ef989d53ea600cfe2891549bf8b7ce0ce2f96d0bc$uxg$, $uxg${"id":"P10-U05-L03","mode":"lesson","minutes":8,"title":{"en":"Answer critique with a check","ar":"أجب عن النقد باختبار"},"summary":{"en":"Answer opinions in a design review by proposing a task you can test.","ar":"ردّ على الآراء في مراجعة التصميم باقتراح مهمة يمكن اختبارها."},"speaker":"sara","review_labels":{"MC-P10-075":{"en":"Judge feedback against the goal","ar":"احكم على الملاحظة بمقارنتها بالهدف"},"MC-P10-076":{"en":"A senior opinion isn't evidence","ar":"رأي الأقدم في الفريق ليس دليلًا"},"MC-P10-077":{"en":"A test task shouldn't give away the answer","ar":"مهمة الاختبار يجب ألا تكشف الإجابة"},"MC-P10-083":{"en":"No clues doesn't mean vague","ar":"المهمّة بلا تلميحات لا تعني مهمّة غامضة"}},"steps":[{"id":"S01","type":"card","part":"hook","title":{"en":"Two reviewers, two opposite requests","ar":"مراجعان وطلبان متعاكسان"},"body":{"en":"My workshop page is in review. No one has tested it with users yet.\n\n**Rami:** \"Make Reserve the first thing on the page, and move the conditions below the newsletter. Less clutter.\"\n\n**Mona:** \"Show everything at the same size so nothing is missed.\"\n\nThe product owner says the goal is for people to choose a session that works for them, not to sign up for the newsletter.","ar":"صفحة الورشة التي أصمّمها قيد المراجعة. ولم يختبرها أحد مع المستخدمين بعد.\n\n**رامي:** «اجعل زر الحجز أول شيء في الصفحة، وانقل الشروط تحت النشرة. فوضى أقل».\n\n**منى:** «اعرض كل شيء بالحجم نفسه حتى لا يفوت أحدًا شيء».\n\nويقول مالك المنتج إن الهدف أن يختار الناس جلسة تناسبهم، لا أن يشتركوا في النشرة."},"mock":{"app":{"id":"manara","name":{"en":"Manara Learning Hub","ar":"منارة"},"color":"#5B3FD6","icon":"chalkboard-teacher","domain":"manara.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Workshop","ar":"الورشة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Sketch Your First App","ar":"ارسم تطبيقك الأول"}},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Tuesday 17 November, 18:00–20:00","ar":"الثلاثاء 17 نوفمبر، من 18:00 إلى 20:00"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Downtown Learning Hub, Room 2","ar":"مركز التعلّم بوسط البلد، قاعة 2"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Free","ar":"مجاني"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Cancel up to 24 hours before the start","ar":"يمكنك الإلغاء قبل الموعد بـ 24 ساعة على الأقل"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Reserve a place","ar":"احجز مكانك"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"link","text":{"en":"Get the monthly newsletter","ar":"اشترك في النشرة الشهرية"},"gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"S02","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P10-U05-06","part":"try","rules":["R12"],"value":{"en":"Design critique (NN/g): a critique analyzes a design and gives feedback on whether it meets its objectives. Keep the part of Rami's request that serves the goal (less clutter) and drop the part that hurts it (hiding conditions).","ar":"نقد التصميم (NN/g): النقد يحلّل التصميم ويقدّم ملاحظات عن مدى تحقيقه أهدافه. أبقِ الجزء من طلب رامي الذي يخدم الهدف (فوضى أقل) واترك الجزء الذي يضرّه (إخفاء الشروط)."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/design-critiques/","quote":"giving feedback on whether it meets its objectives"},"prompt":{"en":"Try each response to Rami and see what it does to the page. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل ردّ على رامي، وانظر ماذا يفعل بالصفحة. أيّ ردّ يحقّق هدف الصفحة: أن تختار ريم جلسة تناسبها؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"manara","name":{"en":"Manara Learning Hub","ar":"منارة"},"color":"#5B3FD6","icon":"chalkboard-teacher","domain":"manara.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Workshop","ar":"الورشة"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Sketch Your First App","ar":"ارسم تطبيقك الأول"}},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Tuesday 17 November, 18:00–20:00","ar":"الثلاثاء 17 نوفمبر، من 18:00 إلى 20:00"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Downtown Learning Hub, Room 2","ar":"مركز التعلّم بوسط البلد، قاعة 2"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Free","ar":"مجاني"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Cancel up to 24 hours before the start","ar":"يمكنك الإلغاء قبل الموعد بـ 24 ساعة على الأقل"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Reserve a place","ar":"احجز مكانك"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"link","text":{"en":"Get the monthly newsletter","ar":"اشترك في النشرة الشهرية"},"gap":"m"}]},"options":[{"id":"accept","text":{"en":"Accept: Reserve first, the conditions under the newsletter","ar":"اقبل: زر الحجز أولًا، والشروط تحت النشرة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"manara","name":{"en":"Manara Learning Hub","ar":"منارة"},"color":"#5B3FD6","icon":"chalkboard-teacher","domain":"manara.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Workshop","ar":"الورشة"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Reserve a place","ar":"احجز مكانك"}},{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Sketch Your First App","ar":"ارسم تطبيقك الأول"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Tuesday 17 November, 18:00–20:00","ar":"الثلاثاء 17 نوفمبر، من 18:00 إلى 20:00"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Free","ar":"مجاني"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"link","text":{"en":"Get the monthly newsletter","ar":"اشترك في النشرة الشهرية"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Cancel up to 24 hours before the start","ar":"يمكنك الإلغاء قبل الموعد بـ 24 ساعة على الأقل"},"gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"reject","text":{"en":"Reject: \"The page follows best practice, so it stays.\"","ar":"ارفض: «الصفحة تتبع أفضل الممارسات، لذلك تبقى كما هي»."},"mock":{"app":{"id":"manara","name":{"en":"Manara Learning Hub","ar":"منارة"},"color":"#5B3FD6","icon":"chalkboard-teacher","domain":"manara.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Workshop","ar":"الورشة"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Sketch Your First App","ar":"ارسم تطبيقك الأول"}},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Tuesday 17 November, 18:00–20:00","ar":"الثلاثاء 17 نوفمبر، من 18:00 إلى 20:00"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Downtown Learning Hub, Room 2","ar":"مركز التعلّم بوسط البلد، قاعة 2"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Free","ar":"مجاني"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Cancel up to 24 hours before the start","ar":"يمكنك الإلغاء قبل الموعد بـ 24 ساعة على الأقل"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Reserve a place","ar":"احجز مكانك"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"link","text":{"en":"Get the monthly newsletter","ar":"اشترك في النشرة الشهرية"},"gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"adapt","text":{"en":"Adapt: move the newsletter to the very end and tighten the spacing; the conditions stay before Reserve","ar":"عدّل: انقل النشرة إلى النهاية وقلّل المسافات؛ وتبقى الشروط قبل زر الحجز"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"manara","name":{"en":"Manara Learning Hub","ar":"منارة"},"color":"#5B3FD6","icon":"chalkboard-teacher","domain":"manara.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Workshop","ar":"الورشة"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Sketch Your First App","ar":"ارسم تطبيقك الأول"}},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Tuesday 17 November, 18:00–20:00","ar":"الثلاثاء 17 نوفمبر، من 18:00 إلى 20:00"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Downtown Learning Hub, Room 2","ar":"مركز التعلّم بوسط البلد، قاعة 2"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Free","ar":"مجاني"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Cancel up to 24 hours before the start","ar":"يمكنك الإلغاء قبل الموعد بـ 24 ساعة على الأقل"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Reserve a place","ar":"احجز مكانك"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Want news of new workshops? Get the monthly newsletter","ar":"تريد أخبار الورش الجديدة؟ اشترك في النشرة الشهرية"},"gap":"l"}]}}],"answer":["adapt"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P10-075","when":["accept"],"feedback":{"en":"Less clutter, but now Reem can book before seeing the price, and the conditions sit under an ad. That works against the goal: choosing a session that works for her.","ar":"فوضى أقل، لكن الآن تستطيع ريم الحجز قبل أن ترى السعر، والشروط تحت إعلان. وهذا يعمل ضد الهدف: أن تختار جلسة تناسبها."}},{"id":"MC-P10-076","when":["reject"],"feedback":{"en":"\"Best practice\" isn't a reason Rami can check, and his worry about clutter is fair. Keep his goal; change the way you meet it.","ar":"«أفضل الممارسات» ليس سببًا يستطيع رامي التحقّق منه، وقلقه من الفوضى في محلّه. أبقِ هدفه؛ وغيّر طريقة تحقيقه."}}],"hints":[{"en":"What does Rami really want, and what does the user need before reserving?","ar":"ماذا يريد رامي فعلًا، وماذا يحتاج المستخدم قبل الحجز؟"},{"en":"Is there a way to give him less clutter without moving the conditions?","ar":"هل هناك طريقة لتقليل الازدحام كما يريد دون نقل الشروط؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Keep his goal; protect the user's.","ar":"أبقِ هدفه؛ واحمِ هدف المستخدم."},"explain":{"en":"Separate what a reviewer wants from how they suggest getting it. Rami wants a calmer page; you can give him that without moving a rule people need before they book.","ar":"افصل بين ما يريده المراجع والطريقة التي يقترحها للوصول إليه. رامي يريد صفحة أهدأ؛ وتستطيع أن تعطيه ذلك دون نقل شرط يحتاجه الناس قبل الحجز."}},{"id":"S03","type":"card","part":"concept","icons":["target","list","eye","person"],"title":{"en":"From opinion to check","ar":"من الرأي إلى الاختبار"},"body":{"en":"A design critique asks one thing: does the design meet its goals? Feedback often arrives as taste (\"too red\", \"I'd do it differently\"). Turn it into a question about the goal.\n\n- **Respond:** accept, adapt or reject, with a reason tied to the user's goal.\n- **Seniority isn't evidence:** a fair worry deserves a check, not a debate.\n- **Check with a task:** give people a short, realistic scenario and ask them to do it.\n- **No clues:** don't name the steps or the screen's labels in the task.\n- **Not vague:** the task still needs a clear goal you can check.","ar":"نقد التصميم يسأل شيئًا واحدًا: هل يحقّق التصميم أهدافه؟ وكثيرًا ما تصل الملاحظات كذوق («أحمر جدًا»، «كنت سأفعلها بشكل آخر»). حوّلها إلى سؤال عن الهدف.\n\n- **الردّ:** اقبل أو عدّل أو ارفض، مع سبب مرتبط بهدف المستخدم.\n- **الأقدمية ليست دليلًا:** القلق المعقول يستحق اختبارًا، لا جدالًا.\n- **اختبر بمهمّة:** أعطِ الناس سيناريو قصيرًا وواقعيًا واطلب منهم تنفيذه.\n- **بلا تلميحات:** لا تذكر الخطوات ولا أسماء عناصر الشاشة في المهمّة.\n- **لا غموض:** المهمّة تحتاج مع ذلك هدفًا واضحًا تستطيع التحقّق منه."}},{"id":"S04","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P10-U05-06","part":"guided","rules":["R06","R13"],"value":{"en":"Design critique (NN/g): opinionated or directive comments can be reformulated to relate them to the goals of the design. Mona's worry (people miss things) is a goal you can meet and test; equal sizes is only one way.","ar":"نقد التصميم (NN/g): يمكن إعادة صياغة الملاحظات القائمة على الرأي أو التوجيه لربطها بأهداف التصميم. وقلق منى (أن يفوت الناس شيئًا) هدف تستطيع تحقيقه واختباره؛ والأحجام المتساوية طريقة واحدة فقط."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/design-critiques/","quote":"to relate them to the goals of the design."},"scenario":{"en":"Mona, our design lead, is the most senior designer on the team. She asks for every line at the same size \"so nothing is missed\".","ar":"منى، قائدة فريق التصميم، هي أقدم مصمّمة في فريقنا. وتطلب أن يكون كل سطر بالحجم نفسه «حتى لا يفوت أحدًا شيء»."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each response and see what it does to the page. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل ردّ، وانظر ماذا يفعل بالصفحة. أيّ ردّ يأخذ قلق منى بجدية ويتحقّق منه بدليل؟"},"start":"accept","options":[{"id":"accept","text":{"en":"Accept, because she's the most senior","ar":"اقبل، لأنها الأقدم"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"manara","name":{"en":"Manara Learning Hub","ar":"منارة"},"color":"#5B3FD6","icon":"chalkboard-teacher","domain":"manara.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Workshop","ar":"الورشة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"text","px":16,"weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Sketch Your First App","ar":"ارسم تطبيقك الأول"}},{"kind":"text","px":16,"weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Tuesday 17 November, 18:00–20:00","ar":"الثلاثاء 17 نوفمبر، من 18:00 إلى 20:00"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"text","px":16,"weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Free","ar":"مجاني"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"text","px":16,"weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Cancel up to 24 hours before the start","ar":"يمكنك الإلغاء قبل الموعد بـ 24 ساعة على الأقل"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"text","px":16,"weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Get the monthly newsletter","ar":"اشترك في النشرة الشهرية"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Reserve a place","ar":"احجز مكانك"},"gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"test","text":{"en":"Keep the sizes, make the rule readable, and offer a quick test: can five people find the cancellation rule?","ar":"أبقِ الأحجام، واجعل الشرط مقروءًا، واقترح اختبارًا سريعًا: هل يجد خمسة أشخاص شرط الإلغاء؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"manara","name":{"en":"Manara Learning Hub","ar":"منارة"},"color":"#5B3FD6","icon":"chalkboard-teacher","domain":"manara.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Workshop","ar":"الورشة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Sketch Your First App","ar":"ارسم تطبيقك الأول"}},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Tuesday 17 November, 18:00–20:00","ar":"الثلاثاء 17 نوفمبر، من 18:00 إلى 20:00"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Free","ar":"مجاني"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"text","px":14,"color":"muted","text":{"en":"Cancel up to 24 hours before the start","ar":"يمكنك الإلغاء قبل الموعد بـ 24 ساعة على الأقل"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Reserve a place","ar":"احجز مكانك"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"group","tone":"tint","gap":"m","blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Test: 5 people · \"Can you cancel if your plans change?\"","ar":"اختبار: 5 أشخاص · «هل تستطيع الإلغاء إذا تغيّرت خططك؟»"}}]}]}},{"id":"argue","text":{"en":"Reject: \"Hierarchy is basic design; equal sizes are wrong.\"","ar":"ارفض: «التسلسل البصري من أساسيات التصميم؛ والأحجام المتساوية خطأ»."},"mock":{"app":{"id":"manara","name":{"en":"Manara Learning Hub","ar":"منارة"},"color":"#5B3FD6","icon":"chalkboard-teacher","domain":"manara.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Workshop","ar":"الورشة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Sketch Your First App","ar":"ارسم تطبيقك الأول"}},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Tuesday 17 November, 18:00–20:00","ar":"الثلاثاء 17 نوفمبر، من 18:00 إلى 20:00"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Free","ar":"مجاني"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"text","px":14,"color":"faint","text":{"en":"Cancel up to 24 hours before the start","ar":"يمكنك الإلغاء قبل الموعد بـ 24 ساعة على الأقل"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Reserve a place","ar":"احجز مكانك"},"gap":"m"}]}}],"answer":["test"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P10-076","when":["accept","argue"],"feedback":{"en":"Seniority, or a rule of thumb, decides nothing on its own. Her worry, that people miss things, is fair: fix the faint rule and check it with a quick test.","ar":"الأقدمية، أو القاعدة العامة، لا تحسم شيئًا وحدها. وقلقها من أن يفوت الناس شيئًا في محلّه: أصلِح الشرط الباهت وتحقّق منه باختبار سريع."}}],"hints":[{"en":"What is Mona worried about?","ar":"ما الذي يقلق منى؟"},{"en":"Seniority and \"it's basic\" are opinions. What would show whether people find the rule?","ar":"الأقدمية وعبارة «هذا من الأساسيات» آراء. ما الذي يُظهر إن كان الناس يجدون الشرط؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Take the worry seriously; check it.","ar":"خذ القلق بجدية؛ وتحقّق منه."},"explain":{"en":"Her goal is fair, and the faint rule proves it. Equal sizes is one fix; a readable rule plus a short test shows whether people really miss it, without a debate about taste.","ar":"هدفها معقول، والشرط الباهت يثبت ذلك. والأحجام المتساوية إصلاح واحد؛ أما الشرط المقروء مع اختبار قصير فيُظهر هل يفوته الناس فعلًا، دون جدال حول الذوق."},"speaker":"sara"},{"id":"S05","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P10-U05-07","part":"guided","rules":["R06","R15"],"value":{"en":"Task scenarios (NN/g): step descriptions often contain hidden clues about how to use the interface; avoid repeating the screen's own labels in the task.","ar":"سيناريوهات المهامّ (NN/g): وصف الخطوات كثيرًا ما يحمل تلميحات خفية عن طريقة استخدام الواجهة؛ فتجنّب تكرار أسماء عناصر الشاشة في المهمّة."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/task-scenarios-usability-testing/","quote":"Step descriptions often contain hidden clues as to how to use the interface."},"scenario":{"en":"You'll test my page to see whether people can find a session that fits them and know what happens if their plans change.","ar":"ستختبر صفحتي لترى هل يستطيع الناس إيجاد جلسة تناسبهم ومعرفة ما يحدث إذا تغيّرت خططهم."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each task card. Which one should you give participants?","ar":"جرّب كل بطاقة مهمّة. أيّها يجب أن تعطيها للمشاركين؟"},"start":"steps","options":[{"id":"steps","text":{"en":"Steps that use the page's labels","ar":"خطوات تستخدم أسماء عناصر الصفحة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"basira","name":{"en":"Basira","ar":"بصيرة"},"color":"#495057","icon":"magnifying-glass","domain":"basira.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"basira.example/plans/round-1","blocks":[{"kind":"group","blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Task","ar":"المهمّة"}},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"\"Check the date, read the cancellation rule, then tap Reserve a place.\"","ar":"«تحقّق من التاريخ، واقرأ شرط الإلغاء، ثم اضغط احجز مكانك»."},"gap":"xs"}]}]}},{"id":"scenario","text":{"en":"A short situation with a goal","ar":"موقف قصير له هدف"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"basira","name":{"en":"Basira","ar":"بصيرة"},"color":"#495057","icon":"magnifying-glass","domain":"basira.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"basira.example/plans/round-1","blocks":[{"kind":"group","blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Task","ar":"المهمّة"}},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"\"You finish work at 17:00 and want a free beginner session next week. Book one you could attend. Could you get out of it if something came up?\"","ar":"«ينتهي دوامك الساعة 17:00 وتريد جلسة مجانية للمبتدئين الأسبوع القادم. احجز جلسة تستطيع حضورها. هل يمكنك التراجع إذا طرأ شيء؟»"},"gap":"xs"}]}]}},{"id":"explain","text":{"en":"Ask them to explain how they would book","ar":"اطلب منهم أن يشرحوا كيف سيحجزون"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"basira","name":{"en":"Basira","ar":"بصيرة"},"color":"#495057","icon":"magnifying-glass","domain":"basira.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"basira.example/plans/round-1","blocks":[{"kind":"group","blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Task","ar":"المهمّة"}},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"\"Look at this page and tell me how you would book a session.\"","ar":"«انظر إلى هذه الصفحة وأخبرني كيف ستحجز جلسة»."},"gap":"xs"}]}]}}],"answer":["scenario"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P10-077","when":["steps"],"feedback":{"en":"It names the date, the cancellation rule and the button. You'd learn people can follow instructions, not whether the page helps them on their own.","ar":"إنها تذكر التاريخ وشرط الإلغاء والزر. ستعرف أن الناس يتبعون التعليمات، لا هل تساعدهم الصفحة وحدها."}},{"id":"MC-P10-083","when":["explain"],"feedback":{"en":"Describing what you'd do isn't doing it, and it hides where people actually get stuck. Ask them to do the task.","ar":"وصف ما ستفعله ليس فعله، ويُخفي المكان الذي يتعثّر فيه الناس فعلًا. اطلب منهم تنفيذ المهمّة."}}],"hints":[{"en":"If the task uses the page's labels, what are people really doing?","ar":"إذا استخدمت المهمة تسميات الصفحة، فماذا يفعل الناس فعلًا؟"},{"en":"Should people act on the page, or talk about it?","ar":"هل يجب أن يستخدم الناس الصفحة، أم يتحدّثوا عنها؟"}],"correct":{"en":"A situation and a goal, in their own words.","ar":"موقف وهدف، بكلماتهم هم."},"explain":{"en":"A scenario gives people a reason to act, without telling them where to look. Then you watch what they do, and check their answer against the page.","ar":"السيناريو يعطي الناس سببًا للتصرّف، دون أن يخبرهم أين ينظرون. ثم تراقب ما يفعلونه، وتقارن إجابتهم بالصفحة."},"speaker":"sara"},{"id":"S06","type":"compare","skill":"SK-P10-U05-07","part":"contrast","confidence":true,"rules":["R11","R15"],"value":{"en":"Contrast with S05: removing clues can overshoot. NN/g: avoiding clues does not mean being vague. A task needs a clear goal you can check.","ar":"مقارنة مع الخطوة 5: حذف التلميحات قد يتجاوز الحدّ. NN/g: تجنّب التلميحات لا يعني الغموض. المهمّة تحتاج هدفًا واضحًا تستطيع التحقّق منه."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/task-scenarios-usability-testing/","quote":"Avoiding clues does not mean being vague."},"prompt":{"en":"Neither task names a button or label. Which one should you use?","ar":"لا تذكر أي من المهمّتين زرًا أو اسم عنصر. أيّهما تعطي المشاركين هدفًا واضحًا تستطيع التحقّق منه؟"},"a":{"mock":{"app":{"id":"basira","name":{"en":"Basira","ar":"بصيرة"},"color":"#495057","icon":"magnifying-glass","domain":"basira.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"basira.example/plans/round-1","blocks":[{"kind":"group","blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Task","ar":"المهمّة"}},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"\"Have a look around and see what you think.\"","ar":"«تجوّل في الصفحة وقل لي رأيك»."},"gap":"xs"}]}]}},"b":{"mock":{"app":{"id":"basira","name":{"en":"Basira","ar":"بصيرة"},"color":"#495057","icon":"magnifying-glass","domain":"basira.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"basira.example/plans/round-1","blocks":[{"kind":"group","blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Task","ar":"المهمّة"}},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"\"You can only go after 17:00. Find a session that works for you and tell me its date and cost.\"","ar":"«لا يمكنك الحضور إلا بعد الساعة 17:00. اعثر على جلسة تناسبك وأخبرني بتاريخها وتكلفتها»."},"gap":"xs"}]}]}},"answer":"b","reason":{"prompt":{"en":"Why is B better?","ar":"لماذا B أفضل؟"},"options":[{"id":"open","text":{"en":"Open tasks always give worse results","ar":"المهامّ المفتوحة تعطي دائمًا نتائج أسوأ"}},{"id":"check","text":{"en":"B has a goal and an answer you can check against the page","ar":"B فيها هدف وإجابة تستطيع مقارنتها بالصفحة"}},{"id":"long","text":{"en":"Longer tasks are clearer","ar":"المهامّ الأطول أوضح"}}],"answer":["check"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P10-083","when":["open","long"],"feedback":{"en":"Length isn't the point, and open questions have their place. B works because it gives a goal and an answer you can check: the date and the cost.","ar":"الطول ليس المقصود، وللأسئلة المفتوحة مكانها. B تنجح لأنها تعطي هدفًا وإجابة تستطيع التحقّق منها: التاريخ والتكلفة."}}]},"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P10-083","when":["a"],"feedback":{"en":"A has no clues, but no goal either. You'll hear opinions, not whether people can pick a session that fits them.","ar":"A بلا تلميحات، لكنها بلا هدف أيضًا. ستسمع آراء، لا هل يستطيع الناس اختيار جلسة تناسبهم."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Neither gives clues. Does each give a clear goal?","ar":"لا تعطي أيّ منهما تلميحات. هل تعطي كل منهما هدفًا واضحًا؟"},{"en":"Could a participant tell when they've finished each task?","ar":"هل يستطيع المشارك أن يعرف متى أنهى كل مهمة؟"}],"correct":{"en":"No clues, but a clear goal.","ar":"بلا تلميحات، لكن بهدف واضح."},"explain":{"en":"S05 removed the clues; this keeps the goal. A good task gives a realistic situation and a result you can compare with the facts on the page.","ar":"الخطوة 5 أزالت التلميحات؛ وهذه تُبقي الهدف. المهمّة الجيدة تعطي موقفًا واقعيًا ونتيجة تستطيع مقارنتها بالمعلومات في الصفحة."}},{"id":"S07","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P10-U05-06","part":"independent","rules":["R14","R19"],"value":{"en":"New case. Design critique (NN/g): judge feedback on whether the design meets its objectives. The delivery screen's goal is tracking the order; the promo can stay, just not on top.","ar":"حالة جديدة. نقد التصميم (NN/g): احكم على الملاحظة بمدى تحقيق التصميم أهدافه. وهدف شاشة التوصيل متابعة الطلب؛ ويمكن أن يبقى العرض، لكن ليس في الأعلى."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/design-critiques/","quote":"giving feedback on whether it meets its objectives"},"scenario":{"en":"I'm also reviewing Lina's delivery screen. A marketing lead says: \"Put the 20% off banner at the very top. More people will order again.\" The screen's goal is to let people track their order.","ar":"أراجع أيضًا شاشة توصيل لينا. يقول أحد مسؤولي التسويق: «ضع شريط خصم 20% في الأعلى تمامًا. سيطلب المزيد من الناس مرة أخرى». وهدف الشاشة أن يتابع الناس طلبهم."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each response and see the screen. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل ردّ، وانظر إلى الشاشة. أيّ ردّ يخدم هدف التسويق دون أن يعرقل متابعة لينا لطلبها؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"tayyar","name":{"en":"Tayyar","ar":"طيّار"},"color":"#EA580C","icon":"moped","domain":"tayyar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Your order","ar":"طلبك"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Arriving 19:40","ar":"يصل الساعة 19:40"}},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Driver: Karim · Call","ar":"السائق: كريم · اتصال"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Order A-2291: 2 shawarma, 1 salad","ar":"الطلب A-2291: 2 شاورما، 1 سلطة"},"gap":"s"}]},"options":[{"id":"accept","text":{"en":"Accept: the banner goes at the top","ar":"اقبل: الشريط في الأعلى"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"tayyar","name":{"en":"Tayyar","ar":"طيّار"},"color":"#EA580C","icon":"moped","domain":"tayyar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Your order","ar":"طلبك"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"banner","text":{"en":"20% off your next order","ar":"خصم 20% على طلبك القادم"}},{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Arriving 19:40","ar":"يصل الساعة 19:40"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Driver: Karim · Call","ar":"السائق: كريم · اتصال"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Order A-2291: 2 shawarma, 1 salad","ar":"الطلب A-2291: 2 شاورما، 1 سلطة"},"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"adapt","text":{"en":"Adapt: the offer goes after the tracking details, and you'll compare reorders before and after","ar":"عدّل: العرض بعد تفاصيل التتبّع، وستقارن عدد الطلبات المتكرّرة قبل التغيير وبعده"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"tayyar","name":{"en":"Tayyar","ar":"طيّار"},"color":"#EA580C","icon":"moped","domain":"tayyar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Your order","ar":"طلبك"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Arriving 19:40","ar":"يصل الساعة 19:40"}},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Driver: Karim · Call","ar":"السائق: كريم · اتصال"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Order A-2291: 2 shawarma, 1 salad","ar":"الطلب A-2291: 2 شاورما، 1 سلطة"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"banner","text":{"en":"20% off your next order","ar":"خصم 20% على طلبك القادم"},"gap":"l"}]}},{"id":"reject","text":{"en":"Reject: \"Ads don't belong on this screen.\"","ar":"ارفض: «لا مكان للإعلانات في هذه الشاشة»."},"mock":{"app":{"id":"tayyar","name":{"en":"Tayyar","ar":"طيّار"},"color":"#EA580C","icon":"moped","domain":"tayyar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Your order","ar":"طلبك"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Arriving 19:40","ar":"يصل الساعة 19:40"}},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Driver: Karim · Call","ar":"السائق: كريم · اتصال"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Order A-2291: 2 shawarma, 1 salad","ar":"الطلب A-2291: 2 شاورما، 1 سلطة"},"gap":"s"}]}}],"answer":["adapt"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P10-075","when":["accept"],"feedback":{"en":"Lina opened the screen to see when her food arrives; the banner pushes that down. Judge the request against the screen's goal.","ar":"فتحت لينا الشاشة لتعرف متى يصل طعامها؛ والشريط يدفع ذلك إلى الأسفل. احكم على الطلب بمقارنته بهدف الشاشة."}},{"id":"MC-P10-076","when":["reject"],"feedback":{"en":"More reorders is a fair business goal. You can serve it without blocking tracking, and measure whether it works.","ar":"زيادة الطلبات المتكرّرة هدف تجاري معقول. وتستطيع خدمته دون أن تعرقل التتبّع، وقياس هل ينجح."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Why does Lina open this screen?","ar":"لماذا تفتح لينا هذه الشاشة؟"},{"en":"Can the offer stay without pushing the tracking down, and can you check if it works?","ar":"هل يمكن أن يبقى العرض دون أن يدفع تفاصيل التتبع للأسفل، وهل يمكنك التحقّق من نجاحه؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Both goals, in the right order, with a way to check.","ar":"الهدفان، بالترتيب الصحيح، مع طريقة للتحقّق."},"explain":{"en":"Same move as with Rami: keep the reviewer's goal, protect the user's task, and say how you'll find out whether it worked.","ar":"كما فعلت مع رامي: أبقِ هدف المراجع، واحمِ مهمّة المستخدم، وقل كيف ستعرف هل نجح ذلك."},"speaker":"sara"},{"id":"S08","type":"card","part":"recap","icons":["target","list","eye","person"],"title":{"en":"What you did","ar":"ماذا تعلّمت"},"body":{"en":"- **Judge against the goal:** adapted Rami's request instead of accepting or rejecting it whole.\n- **Seniority isn't evidence:** answered Mona's fair worry with a fix and a test.\n- **No clues:** wrote a task without the page's labels or steps.\n- **Not vague:** kept a clear goal you can check.\n\nNext: the unit skill check.","ar":"- **احكم على الطلب بمقارنته بالهدف:** عدّلت طلب رامي بدل قبوله أو رفضه كله.\n- **الأقدمية ليست دليلًا:** أجبت عن قلق منى المعقول بإصلاح واختبار.\n- **بلا تلميحات:** كتبت مهمّة دون أسماء عناصر الصفحة أو خطواتها.\n- **لا غموض:** أبقيت هدفًا واضحًا تستطيع التحقّق منه.\n\nالتالي: اختبار مهارة الوحدة."}}]}$uxg$::jsonb),
  ($uxg$P10-U05-L04$uxg$, $uxg$5502dd6937f1a04ef85fc9431fe015ba0717580ec64265d80ec00df2cd5e61be$uxg$, $uxg${"id":"P10-U05-L04","mode":"check","minutes":7,"title":{"en":"Skill check: let real words stretch it","ar":"اختبار المهارة: صمّم للكلمات الحقيقية"},"summary":{"en":"Make a poetry evening ticket card work with real words in two languages, on your own.","ar":"اجعل بطاقة تذكرة أمسية شعرية تعمل بالكلمات الحقيقية في لغتين، بنفسك."},"speaker":"mona","steps":[{"id":"S01","type":"card","part":"hook","title":{"en":"Mostafa's poetry evening ticket","ar":"تذكرة أمسية مصطفى الشعرية"},"body":{"en":"Mostafa is buying a ticket for a poetry evening in Zamalek. My team designed the ticket card with \"Poetry Night\" as the title, in a box of fixed height. Now the real event name and venue are in.\n\nYour job: help my team make the card work with real words, in English and Arabic.\n\nThis is a skill check: no hints, and you'll see how you did at the end.","ar":"يشتري مصطفى تذكرة لأمسية شعرية في الزمالك. صمّم فريقي بطاقة التذكرة بعنوان «أمسية شعرية»، داخل صندوق بارتفاع ثابت. والآن وُضع اسم الأمسية والمكان الحقيقيان.\n\nمهمّتك: ساعد فريقي على جعل البطاقة تعمل بالكلمات الحقيقية، بالعربية والإنجليزية.\n\nهذا اختبار مهارة: بدون تلميحات، وسترى نتيجتك في النهاية."},"mock":{"app":{"id":"tazkara","name":{"en":"Tazkara","ar":"تذكرة"},"color":"#C026D3","icon":"ticket","domain":"tazkara.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Ticket","ar":"التذكرة"},"back":true},"width":280,"caption":{"en":"As designed","ar":"كما صُمّمت"},"blocks":[{"kind":"group","blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Poetry Night","ar":"أمسية شعرية"}},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Thursday 3 December, 20:00","ar":"الخميس 3 ديسمبر، الساعة 20:00"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Garden Theatre","ar":"مسرح الحديقة"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"meta","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"EGP 450","ar":"450 جنيهًا"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Buy ticket","ar":"اشترِ التذكرة"},"gap":"m"}]}]}},{"id":"S02","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P10-U05-01","part":"check","rules":["R19"],"value":{"en":"Skill check, layout vs content (NN/g): scaling issues appear when content doesn't match its space. Fix the box, not the words, and not by shrinking the type.","ar":"اختبار مهارة، التخطيط مقابل المحتوى (NN/g): تظهر مشاكل المقاس حين لا يناسب المحتوى مساحته. أصلِح الصندوق، لا الكلمات، ولا بتصغير الخط."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/layout-vs-content/","quote":"Scaling issues appear when the content size does not match the space that it needs to go into."},"scenario":{"en":"With the real words, the title runs past our box and the venue is cut after \"Gate 3\". Mostafa can't see which street to go to.","ar":"مع الكلمات الحقيقية، يتجاوز العنوان صندوقنا، وينقطع المكان بعد «البوابة 3». ولا يرى مصطفى إلى أي شارع يذهب."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each fix. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل إصلاح. أيّها يجب أن يُطلق؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"tazkara","name":{"en":"Tazkara","ar":"تذكرة"},"color":"#C026D3","icon":"ticket","domain":"tazkara.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Ticket","ar":"التذكرة"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"width":280,"blocks":[{"kind":"group","height":150,"blocks":[{"kind":"title","nowrap":true,"text":{"en":"Nile Poetry Evening: Classic Arabic Poems Read Anew","ar":"أمسية النيل الشعرية: قصائد عربية كلاسيكية بروح جديدة"}},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Thursday 3 December, 20:00","ar":"الخميس 3 ديسمبر، الساعة 20:00"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"meta","nowrap":true,"text":{"en":"Garden Theatre, Gate 3, 26th of July Street, Zamalek","ar":"مسرح الحديقة، البوابة 3، شارع 26 يوليو، الزمالك"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"meta","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"EGP 450","ar":"450 جنيهًا"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Buy ticket","ar":"اشترِ التذكرة"},"gap":"m"}]}]},"options":[{"id":"short","text":{"en":"Shorten them to \"Poetry Night\" and \"Garden Theatre\"","ar":"اختصرهما إلى «أمسية شعرية» و«مسرح الحديقة»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"tazkara","name":{"en":"Tazkara","ar":"تذكرة"},"color":"#C026D3","icon":"ticket","domain":"tazkara.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Ticket","ar":"التذكرة"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"width":280,"blocks":[{"kind":"group","blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Poetry Night","ar":"أمسية شعرية"}},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Thursday 3 December, 20:00","ar":"الخميس 3 ديسمبر، الساعة 20:00"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Garden Theatre","ar":"مسرح الحديقة"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"meta","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"EGP 450","ar":"450 جنيهًا"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Buy ticket","ar":"اشترِ التذكرة"},"gap":"m"}]}]}},{"id":"small","text":{"en":"Make the title and venue small enough to fit","ar":"صغّر العنوان والمكان حتى يتّسعا"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"tazkara","name":{"en":"Tazkara","ar":"تذكرة"},"color":"#C026D3","icon":"ticket","domain":"tazkara.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Ticket","ar":"التذكرة"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"width":280,"blocks":[{"kind":"group","height":150,"blocks":[{"kind":"text","px":9,"weight":"bold","nowrap":true,"text":{"en":"Nile Poetry Evening: Classic Arabic Poems Read Anew","ar":"أمسية النيل الشعرية: قصائد عربية كلاسيكية بروح جديدة"}},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Thursday 3 December, 20:00","ar":"الخميس 3 ديسمبر، الساعة 20:00"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"text","px":7,"nowrap":true,"text":{"en":"Garden Theatre, Gate 3, 26th of July Street, Zamalek","ar":"مسرح الحديقة، البوابة 3، شارع 26 يوليو، الزمالك"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"meta","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"EGP 450","ar":"450 جنيهًا"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Buy ticket","ar":"اشترِ التذكرة"},"gap":"m"}]}]}},{"id":"grow","text":{"en":"Let the lines wrap and the card grow","ar":"دع الأسطر تلتفّ والبطاقة تطول"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"tazkara","name":{"en":"Tazkara","ar":"تذكرة"},"color":"#C026D3","icon":"ticket","domain":"tazkara.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Ticket","ar":"التذكرة"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"width":280,"blocks":[{"kind":"group","blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Nile Poetry Evening: Classic Arabic Poems Read Anew","ar":"أمسية النيل الشعرية: قصائد عربية كلاسيكية بروح جديدة"}},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Thursday 3 December, 20:00","ar":"الخميس 3 ديسمبر، الساعة 20:00"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Garden Theatre, Gate 3, 26th of July Street, Zamalek","ar":"مسرح الحديقة، البوابة 3، شارع 26 يوليو، الزمالك"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"meta","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"EGP 450","ar":"450 جنيهًا"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Buy ticket","ar":"اشترِ التذكرة"},"gap":"m"}]}]}}],"answer":["grow"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P10-069","when":["short"],"feedback":{"en":"The short version drops the street and the gate, which Mostafa needs to get there. Change the box, not the words.","ar":"النسخة القصيرة تُسقط الشارع والبوابة، وهما ما يحتاجه مصطفى للوصول. غيّر الصندوق، لا الكلمات."}},{"id":"MC-P10-078","when":["small"],"feedback":{"en":"It fits, but 7px can't be read on a phone. Fitting isn't the same as usable.","ar":"إنه يتّسع، لكن 7 بكسل لا تُقرأ على الهاتف. الاتّساع ليس هو سهولة الاستخدام."}}],"explain":{"en":"From Lesson 1: let long text wrap and the box follow its content. The card gets taller and every fact stays.","ar":"من الدرس 1: دع النص الطويل يلتفّ، والصندوق يتبع محتواه. تطول البطاقة وتبقى كل معلومة."},"speaker":"mona"},{"id":"S03","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P10-U05-02","part":"check","rules":["R19"],"value":{"en":"Skill check, international usability (NN/g): leave room for labels to grow by at least 50%. The Arabic label is longer than the English one the button was sized for.","ar":"اختبار مهارة، سهولة الاستخدام عالميًا (NN/g): اترك مساحة لتمدّد العناوين بنسبة 50% على الأقل. والعنوان العربي أطول من الإنجليزي الذي صُمّم الزر على مقاسه."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/international-usability-details-differ/","quote":"leave room for labels and hints to grow by at least 50%"},"scenario":{"en":"Next to the price, our button has a fixed width, sized for \"Buy ticket\". In the Arabic version, the label is cut.","ar":"بجانب السعر، لزرّنا عرض ثابت صُمّم على مقاس النص الإنجليزي. وفي النسخة العربية، ينقطع نص الزر."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each fix for the Arabic button. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل إصلاح للزر العربي. أيّ إصلاح يُظهر نص الزر كاملًا وبحجم مقروء؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"tazkara","name":{"en":"Tazkara","ar":"تذكرة"},"color":"#C026D3","icon":"ticket","domain":"tazkara.example"},"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"dir":"rtl","width":280,"blocks":[{"kind":"row","gap":"m","blocks":[{"kind":"meta","weight":"bold","text":"450 جنيهًا"},{"kind":"button","text":"اشترِ التذك…"}]}]},"options":[{"id":"room","text":{"en":"Let the button grow to fit the full label","ar":"دع الزر يتّسع لنصه كاملًا"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"tazkara","name":{"en":"Tazkara","ar":"تذكرة"},"color":"#C026D3","icon":"ticket","domain":"tazkara.example"},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"dir":"rtl","width":280,"blocks":[{"kind":"row","gap":"m","blocks":[{"kind":"meta","weight":"bold","text":"450 جنيهًا"},{"kind":"button","text":"اشترِ التذكرة"}]}]}},{"id":"word","text":{"en":"Change the Arabic label to just \"Buy\"","ar":"غيّر نص الزر العربي إلى «اشترِ» فقط"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"tazkara","name":{"en":"Tazkara","ar":"تذكرة"},"color":"#C026D3","icon":"ticket","domain":"tazkara.example"},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"dir":"rtl","width":280,"blocks":[{"kind":"row","gap":"m","blocks":[{"kind":"meta","weight":"bold","text":"450 جنيهًا"},{"kind":"button","text":"اشترِ"}]}]}},{"id":"tiny","text":{"en":"Use a smaller font for the Arabic button","ar":"استخدم خطًا أصغر للزر العربي"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"tazkara","name":{"en":"Tazkara","ar":"تذكرة"},"color":"#C026D3","icon":"ticket","domain":"tazkara.example"},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"dir":"rtl","width":280,"blocks":[{"kind":"row","gap":"m","blocks":[{"kind":"meta","weight":"bold","text":"450 جنيهًا"},{"kind":"button","px":9,"text":"اشترِ التذكرة"}]}]}}],"answer":["room"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P10-069","when":["word"],"feedback":{"en":"\"Buy\" alone no longer says what Mostafa is buying, and it now differs from the English. Give the label room instead.","ar":"«اشترِ» وحدها لم تعد تقول ماذا يشتري مصطفى، وصارت تختلف عن الإنجليزية. أعطِ نص الزر مساحة بدلًا من ذلك."}},{"id":"MC-P10-078","when":["tiny"],"feedback":{"en":"It fits, but the main action is now the hardest thing to read. Arabic needs the same readable size.","ar":"إنه يتّسع، لكن الإجراء الرئيسي صار أصعب شيء في القراءة. العربية تحتاج الحجم المقروء نفسه."}}],"explain":{"en":"From Lesson 1: translated labels often run longer. Size buttons to their content so every language fits.","ar":"من الدرس 1: التسميات المترجمة كثيرًا ما تكون أطول. اجعل مقاس الأزرار يتبع محتواها لتتّسع كل لغة."},"speaker":"mona"},{"id":"S04","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P10-U05-04","part":"check","rules":["R19"],"value":{"en":"Skill check, RTL (NN/g): mirror-image the design patterns, and stay consistent. Translating the words while keeping a left-to-right layout is not enough.","ar":"اختبار مهارة، الاتجاه من اليمين لليسار (NN/g): اعكس أنماط التصميم، وكن متّسقًا. ترجمة الكلمات مع إبقاء تخطيط من اليسار لليمين لا يكفي."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/international-usability-details-differ/","quote":"mirror-image the design patterns"},"scenario":{"en":"My team translated the ticket screen into Arabic but kept the English layout: the back arrow and text on the left, the price on the right.","ar":"ترجم فريقي شاشة التذكرة إلى العربية لكنه أبقى التخطيط الإنجليزي: سهم الرجوع والنص على اليسار، والسعر على اليمين."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each version of the Arabic screen. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل نسخة من الشاشة العربية. أيّها يجب أن تُطلق؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"tazkara","name":{"en":"Tazkara","ar":"تذكرة"},"color":"#C026D3","icon":"ticket","domain":"tazkara.example"},"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"dir":"ltr","width":280,"blocks":[{"kind":"link","text":"← رجوع"},{"kind":"title","text":"ليلة جاز النيل: أغانٍ عربية كلاسيكية بروح جديدة","gap":"s"},{"kind":"meta","text":"الخميس 3 ديسمبر، الساعة 20:00","gap":"xs"},{"kind":"row","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"meta","text":"الإجمالي"},{"kind":"meta","weight":"bold","style":"end","text":"450 جنيهًا"}]},{"kind":"button","text":"اشترِ التذكرة","gap":"m"}]},"options":[{"id":"words","text":{"en":"Keep it; the words are already in Arabic","ar":"أبقِها؛ فالكلمات بالعربية بالفعل"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"tazkara","name":{"en":"Tazkara","ar":"تذكرة"},"color":"#C026D3","icon":"ticket","domain":"tazkara.example"},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"dir":"ltr","width":280,"blocks":[{"kind":"link","text":"← رجوع"},{"kind":"title","text":"ليلة جاز النيل: أغانٍ عربية كلاسيكية بروح جديدة","gap":"s"},{"kind":"meta","text":"الخميس 3 ديسمبر، الساعة 20:00","gap":"xs"},{"kind":"row","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"meta","text":"الإجمالي"},{"kind":"meta","weight":"bold","style":"end","text":"450 جنيهًا"}]},{"kind":"button","text":"اشترِ التذكرة","gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"whole","text":{"en":"Mirror the whole screen: arrow, text and the total row","ar":"اعكس الشاشة كلها: السهم والنص وسطر الإجمالي"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"tazkara","name":{"en":"Tazkara","ar":"تذكرة"},"color":"#C026D3","icon":"ticket","domain":"tazkara.example"},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"dir":"rtl","width":280,"blocks":[{"kind":"link","text":"→ رجوع"},{"kind":"title","text":"ليلة جاز النيل: أغانٍ عربية كلاسيكية بروح جديدة","gap":"s"},{"kind":"meta","text":"الخميس 3 ديسمبر، الساعة 20:00","gap":"xs"},{"kind":"row","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"meta","text":"الإجمالي"},{"kind":"meta","weight":"bold","style":"end","text":"450 جنيهًا"}]},{"kind":"button","text":"اشترِ التذكرة","gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"align","text":{"en":"Right-align the text only; leave the arrow and the total row","ar":"حاذِ النص لليمين فقط؛ واترك السهم وسطر الإجمالي"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"tazkara","name":{"en":"Tazkara","ar":"تذكرة"},"color":"#C026D3","icon":"ticket","domain":"tazkara.example"},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"dir":"ltr","width":280,"blocks":[{"kind":"link","text":"← رجوع"},{"kind":"title","style":"end","text":"ليلة جاز النيل: أغانٍ عربية كلاسيكية بروح جديدة","gap":"s"},{"kind":"meta","style":"end","text":"الخميس 3 ديسمبر، الساعة 20:00","gap":"xs"},{"kind":"row","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"meta","text":"الإجمالي"},{"kind":"meta","weight":"bold","style":"end","text":"450 جنيهًا"}]},{"kind":"button","text":"اشترِ التذكرة","gap":"m"}]}}],"answer":["whole"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P10-072","when":["words"],"feedback":{"en":"Arabic readers start on the right. With the back arrow and text on the left, the screen still flows the English way.","ar":"قارئ العربية يبدأ من اليمين. ومع سهم الرجوع والنص على اليسار، ما زالت الشاشة تسير بالاتجاه الإنجليزي."}},{"id":"MC-P10-082","when":["align"],"feedback":{"en":"Now the text starts on the right but the arrow and the total still start on the left. Half-mirrored is the most confusing. Mirror it all.","ar":"الآن يبدأ النص من اليمين، لكن السهم والإجمالي ما زالا يبدآن من اليسار. والعكس الجزئي هو الأكثر إرباكًا. اعكس الشاشة كلها."}}],"explain":{"en":"From Lesson 2: in Arabic, mirror the whole layout the same way, so everything starts on the right.","ar":"من الدرس 2: في العربية، اعكس التخطيط كله بالطريقة نفسها، ليبدأ كل شيء من اليمين."},"speaker":"mona"},{"id":"S05","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P10-U05-05","part":"check","rules":["R19"],"value":{"en":"Skill check, RTL (NN/g): mirror the design patterns, not the content. A ticket code is a fact; reversing its characters makes a different code.","ar":"اختبار مهارة، الاتجاه من اليمين لليسار (NN/g): اعكس أنماط التصميم، لا المحتوى. ورمز التذكرة معلومة؛ وعكس حروفه يصنع رمزًا آخر."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/international-usability-details-differ/","quote":"mirror-image the design patterns"},"scenario":{"en":"Mostafa's ticket code is NJ-3012. The gate staff will scan or type it. On the Arabic ticket, it shows reversed.","ar":"رمز تذكرة مصطفى هو NJ-3012. وسيمسحه موظف البوابة أو يكتبه. وفي التذكرة العربية، يظهر معكوسًا."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each version of the code line. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل نسخة من سطر الرمز. أيّ نسخة تُظهر رمز مصطفى صحيحًا لموظف البوابة؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"tazkara","name":{"en":"Tazkara","ar":"تذكرة"},"color":"#C026D3","icon":"ticket","domain":"tazkara.example"},"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"dir":"rtl","width":280,"blocks":[{"kind":"meta","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"EGP 450","ar":"450 جنيهًا"}},{"kind":"meta","text":"رمز التذكرة:","code":"2103-JN","gap":"s"}]},"options":[{"id":"keep","text":{"en":"Keep it; Arabic reads right to left","ar":"أبقِه؛ فالعربية تُقرأ من اليمين لليسار"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"tazkara","name":{"en":"Tazkara","ar":"تذكرة"},"color":"#C026D3","icon":"ticket","domain":"tazkara.example"},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"dir":"rtl","width":280,"blocks":[{"kind":"meta","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"EGP 450","ar":"450 جنيهًا"}},{"kind":"meta","text":"رمز التذكرة:","code":"2103-JN","gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"drop","text":{"en":"Show the code only in the English version","ar":"اعرض الرمز في النسخة الإنجليزية فقط"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"tazkara","name":{"en":"Tazkara","ar":"تذكرة"},"color":"#C026D3","icon":"ticket","domain":"tazkara.example"},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"dir":"rtl","width":280,"blocks":[{"kind":"meta","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"EGP 450","ar":"450 جنيهًا"}}]}},{"id":"fact","text":{"en":"The line flows right to left; the code stays NJ-3012","ar":"السطر من اليمين لليسار؛ والرمز يبقى NJ‑3012"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"tazkara","name":{"en":"Tazkara","ar":"تذكرة"},"color":"#C026D3","icon":"ticket","domain":"tazkara.example"},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"dir":"rtl","width":280,"blocks":[{"kind":"meta","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"EGP 450","ar":"450 جنيهًا"}},{"kind":"meta","text":"رمز التذكرة:","code":"NJ-3012","gap":"s"}]}}],"answer":["fact"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P10-070","when":["keep"],"feedback":{"en":"2103-JN is a different code, and it won't match at the gate. Mirror the layout, not the facts.","ar":"2103-JN رمز مختلف، ولن يتطابق عند البوابة. اعكس التخطيط، لا المعلومات."}},{"id":"MC-P10-072","when":["drop"],"feedback":{"en":"Arabic readers need the code too. Keep it, exactly as written, inside the Arabic line.","ar":"القرّاء العرب يحتاجون الرمز أيضًا. أبقِه كما هو تمامًا، داخل السطر العربي."}}],"explain":{"en":"From Lesson 2: the sentence mirrors; codes, prices and times keep their characters in order.","ar":"من الدرس 2: الجملة تُعكس؛ والرموز والأسعار والأوقات تبقى حروفها بترتيبها."},"speaker":"mona"},{"id":"S06","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P10-U05-06","part":"check","rules":["R19"],"value":{"en":"Skill check, design critique (NN/g): relate feedback to the goals of the design. Here the goal is that Mostafa finds the right gate; answer with that goal and a quick check, not with rank or taste.","ar":"اختبار مهارة، نقد التصميم (NN/g): اربط الملاحظات بأهداف التصميم. والهدف هنا أن يجد مصطفى البوابة الصحيحة؛ فأجب بهذا الهدف وباختبار سريع، لا بالمنصب أو الذوق."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/design-critiques/","quote":"to relate them to the goals of the design."},"scenario":{"en":"In our review, the marketing lead says: \"The card is too tall now. Put the venue back on one line; it looked cleaner.\"","ar":"في مراجعتنا، يقول مسؤول التسويق: «البطاقة صارت طويلة جدًا. أعِد المكان إلى سطر واحد؛ كان شكله أكثر ترتيبًا»."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each reply. Which one should you give?","ar":"جرّب كل ردّ. أيّ ردّ يربط الملاحظة بهدف البطاقة ويقترح طريقة للتحقّق؟"},"start":"agree","options":[{"id":"agree","text":{"en":"Agree; marketing owns the look","ar":"وافِق؛ فالتسويق مسؤول عن الشكل"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"basira","name":{"en":"Basira","ar":"بصيرة"},"color":"#495057","icon":"magnifying-glass","domain":"basira.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"basira.example/notes/review","blocks":[{"kind":"group","blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Your reply","ar":"ردّك"}},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"\"Sure, I'll put the venue back on one line.\"","ar":"«حسنًا، سأعيد المكان إلى سطر واحد»."},"gap":"xs"}]}]}},{"id":"goal","text":{"en":"Tie it to the goal, and offer a quick check","ar":"اربطه بالهدف، واقترح اختبارًا سريعًا"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"basira","name":{"en":"Basira","ar":"بصيرة"},"color":"#495057","icon":"magnifying-glass","domain":"basira.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"basira.example/notes/review","blocks":[{"kind":"group","blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Your reply","ar":"ردّك"}},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"\"The card has to get people to the right gate. On one line, the street and gate are cut. I can tighten the spacing, and we can ask a few people to find the gate from each version.\"","ar":"«البطاقة يجب أن توصل الناس إلى البوابة الصحيحة. وفي سطر واحد، ينقطع الشارع والبوابة. أستطيع تقليل المسافات، ويمكننا أن نطلب من بضعة أشخاص إيجاد البوابة في كل نسخة»."},"gap":"xs"}]}]}},{"id":"dismiss","text":{"en":"Tell him looks don't matter here","ar":"أخبره أن الشكل لا يهمّ هنا"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"basira","name":{"en":"Basira","ar":"بصيرة"},"color":"#495057","icon":"magnifying-glass","domain":"basira.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"basira.example/notes/review","blocks":[{"kind":"group","blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Your reply","ar":"ردّك"}},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"\"Looks don't matter on a ticket. It stays as it is.\"","ar":"«الشكل لا يهمّ في التذكرة. ستبقى كما هي»."},"gap":"xs"}]}]}}],"answer":["goal"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P10-076","when":["agree"],"feedback":{"en":"Who said it doesn't decide it. Cutting the venue again hides the street and gate Mostafa needs.","ar":"قائل الملاحظة لا يحسمها. وقطع المكان مرة أخرى يُخفي الشارع والبوابة اللذين يحتاجهما مصطفى."}},{"id":"MC-P10-075","when":["dismiss"],"feedback":{"en":"His worry about a tidy card is fair. Answer it against the goal and offer a check, instead of shutting it down.","ar":"قلقه بشأن بطاقة مرتّبة في محلّه. أجب عنه بمقارنته بالهدف واقترح اختبارًا، بدل أن تُغلق النقاش."}}],"explain":{"en":"From Lesson 3: judge feedback against the goal, keep what's fair in it, and settle the rest with a quick check.","ar":"من الدرس 3: احكم على الملاحظة بمقارنتها بالهدف، وخذ ما هو معقول منها، واحسم الباقي باختبار سريع."},"speaker":"mona"},{"id":"S07","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P10-U05-07","part":"check","rules":["R19"],"value":{"en":"Skill check, task scenarios (NN/g): step descriptions hide clues, but avoiding clues does not mean being vague. Give a situation with a goal you can check.","ar":"اختبار مهارة، سيناريوهات المهامّ (NN/g): وصف الخطوات يحمل تلميحات، لكن تجنّبها لا يعني الغموض. قدّم موقفًا له هدف تستطيع التحقّق منه."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/task-scenarios-usability-testing/","quote":"Avoiding clues does not mean being vague."},"scenario":{"en":"You'll test whether people can find where to go from our ticket card.","ar":"ستختبر هل يستطيع الناس معرفة إلى أين يذهبون من بطاقة التذكرة عندنا."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each task card. Which one should you give participants?","ar":"جرّب كل بطاقة مهمّة. أيّها يجب أن تعطيها للمشاركين؟"},"start":"vague","options":[{"id":"goal","text":{"en":"A short situation with a goal","ar":"موقف قصير له هدف"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"basira","name":{"en":"Basira","ar":"بصيرة"},"color":"#495057","icon":"magnifying-glass","domain":"basira.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"basira.example/plans/ticket-card","blocks":[{"kind":"group","blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Task","ar":"المهمّة"}},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"\"You've just bought this ticket and you're taking a taxi to the poetry evening. Tell the driver where to drop you.\"","ar":"«اشتريت هذه التذكرة للتوّ وستركب سيارة أجرة إلى الأمسية. أخبر السائق أين ينزلك»."},"gap":"xs"}]}]}},{"id":"vague","text":{"en":"Ask what they think of the card","ar":"اسألهم عن رأيهم في البطاقة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"basira","name":{"en":"Basira","ar":"بصيرة"},"color":"#495057","icon":"magnifying-glass","domain":"basira.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"basira.example/plans/ticket-card","blocks":[{"kind":"group","blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Task","ar":"المهمّة"}},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"\"Have a look at this ticket. What do you think?\"","ar":"«ألقِ نظرة على هذه التذكرة. ما رأيك؟»"},"gap":"xs"}]}]}},{"id":"steps","text":{"en":"Point them to the venue line","ar":"وجّههم إلى سطر المكان"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"basira","name":{"en":"Basira","ar":"بصيرة"},"color":"#495057","icon":"magnifying-glass","domain":"basira.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"basira.example/plans/ticket-card","blocks":[{"kind":"group","blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Task","ar":"المهمّة"}},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"\"Read the venue line under the date and tell me the gate number.\"","ar":"«اقرأ سطر المكان تحت التاريخ وأخبرني برقم البوابة»."},"gap":"xs"}]}]}}],"answer":["goal"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P10-077","when":["steps"],"feedback":{"en":"It tells them where to look and what to find. You'd learn they can follow directions, not whether the card works on its own.","ar":"إنها تخبرهم أين ينظرون وماذا يجدون. ستعرف أنهم يتبعون التوجيهات، لا هل تعمل البطاقة وحدها."}},{"id":"MC-P10-083","when":["vague"],"feedback":{"en":"There's no goal, so there's no right answer to check. Opinions won't show whether they can find the gate.","ar":"لا يوجد هدف، فلا توجد إجابة صحيحة تتحقّق منها. والآراء لن تُظهر هل يستطيعون إيجاد البوابة."}}],"explain":{"en":"From Lesson 3: give a realistic situation with a clear goal, no labels from the screen, and an answer you can check.","ar":"من الدرس 3: قدّم موقفًا واقعيًا بهدف واضح، دون أسماء عناصر من الشاشة، وبإجابة تستطيع التحقّق منها."},"speaker":"mona"}]}$uxg$::jsonb),
  ($uxg$P10-U06-L01$uxg$, $uxg$1f248772106789eade30f80ad7f5505e2bca889d6578ba630aca130617c6ab13$uxg$, $uxg${"id":"P10-U06-L01","mode":"lesson","minutes":8,"title":{"en":"Watch what they do, not what they say","ar":"راقب ما يفعلونه، لا ما يقولونه"},"summary":{"en":"Swap friends' opinions for a real task and write the success rule first.","ar":"استبدل آراء الأصدقاء بمهمة حقيقية، واكتب قاعدة النجاح أولًا."},"speaker":"sara","review_labels":{"MC-P10-084":{"en":"Watch what people do, not what they say","ar":"راقب ما يفعله الناس، لا ما يقولونه"},"MC-P10-085":{"en":"Decide what success means before the test","ar":"حدّد معنى النجاح قبل الاختبار"}},"steps":[{"id":"S01","type":"card","part":"hook","title":{"en":"Six friends said yes","ar":"ستة أصدقاء قالوا نعم"},"body":{"en":"I redesigned my workshop booking page: the date and \"Reserve a place\" now come first, and the cancellation rule is easy to read. I showed it to six friends and asked, \"Is it easier now?\" All six said yes.\n\nA month after launch, bookings hadn't changed, and people still emailed to ask whether they could cancel. My friends had told me what I wanted to hear.","ar":"أعدت تصميم صفحة حجز الورشة: التاريخ و«احجز مكانك» يأتيان أولًا الآن، وشرط الإلغاء سهل القراءة. عرضتها على ستة أصدقاء وسألتهم: «هل صارت أسهل؟» فقال الستة نعم.\n\nوبعد شهر من الإطلاق، لم تتغيّر الحجوزات، وظلّ الناس يراسلونني ليسألوا هل يمكنهم الإلغاء. أصدقائي قالوا لي ما أردت سماعه."},"mock":{"app":{"id":"manara","name":{"en":"Manara Learning Hub","ar":"منارة"},"color":"#5B3FD6","icon":"chalkboard-teacher","domain":"manara.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Workshop","ar":"الورشة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Sketch Your First App","ar":"ارسم تطبيقك الأول"}},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Tuesday 17 November, 18:00–20:00","ar":"الثلاثاء 17 نوفمبر، من 18:00 إلى 20:00"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Reserve a place","ar":"احجز مكانك"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Cancel up to 24 hours before the start","ar":"يمكنك الإلغاء قبل الموعد بـ 24 ساعة على الأقل"},"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"S02","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P10-U06-01","part":"try","rules":["R12"],"value":{"en":"Try first. Don't listen to users (NN/g): to design the best experience, pay attention to what people do, not what they say. Asking \"Is it easier?\" collects opinions; a task shows whether they book.","ar":"جرّب أولًا. لا تستمع للمستخدمين (NN/g): لتصمّم أفضل تجربة، انتبه لما يفعله الناس، لا لما يقولونه. وسؤال «هل هي أسهل؟» يجمع آراء؛ أما المهمة فتُظهر هل يحجزون."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/first-rule-of-usability-dont-listen-to-users/","quote":"Watch what people actually do."},"prompt":{"en":"My claim: the new order makes booking easier. Try each way to check it. Which one should I use?","ar":"ادّعائي: الترتيب الجديد يجعل الحجز أسهل. جرّب كل طريقة للتحقّق. أيّ طريقة تُظهر هل يستطيع الناس الحجز فعلًا؟"},"start":"prefer","options":[{"id":"prefer","text":{"en":"Show the old and new pages and ask which they prefer","ar":"اعرض الصفحتين القديمة والجديدة واسأل أيّهما يفضّلون"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"basira","name":{"en":"Basira","ar":"بصيرة"},"color":"#495057","icon":"magnifying-glass","domain":"basira.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"basira.example/plans/booking-page","blocks":[{"kind":"group","blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Test plan","ar":"خطة الاختبار"}},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"Show both pages side by side. Ask: \"Which one do you prefer?\" Count the votes.","ar":"اعرض الصفحتين جنبًا إلى جنب. اسأل: «أيّهما تفضّل؟» واحسب الأصوات."},"gap":"xs"}]}]}},{"id":"would","text":{"en":"Show the new page and ask whether they would book from it","ar":"اعرض الصفحة الجديدة واسأل هل سيحجزون منها"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"basira","name":{"en":"Basira","ar":"بصيرة"},"color":"#495057","icon":"magnifying-glass","domain":"basira.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"basira.example/plans/booking-page","blocks":[{"kind":"group","blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Test plan","ar":"خطة الاختبار"}},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"Show the new page. Ask: \"Would you book a workshop from this page?\"","ar":"اعرض الصفحة الجديدة. اسأل: «هل ستحجز ورشة من هذه الصفحة؟»"},"gap":"xs"}]}]}},{"id":"task","text":{"en":"Give a task and watch whether they book the right session","ar":"أعطِ مهمة وراقب هل يحجزون الجلسة الصحيحة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"basira","name":{"en":"Basira","ar":"بصيرة"},"color":"#495057","icon":"magnifying-glass","domain":"basira.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"basira.example/plans/booking-page","blocks":[{"kind":"group","blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Test plan","ar":"خطة الاختبار"}},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"Task: \"You're free on Tuesday evenings. Book a workshop you can attend.\" Watch: do they book it? Where do they hesitate?","ar":"المهمة: «أنت متفرّغ مساء الثلاثاء. احجز ورشة تستطيع حضورها.» راقب: هل يحجزون؟ وأين يتردّدون؟"},"gap":"xs"}]}]}}],"answer":["task"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P10-084","when":["prefer","would"],"feedback":{"en":"That's what I did with my friends: I got opinions and guesses about the future. Neither tells me whether someone can actually book.","ar":"هذا ما فعلته مع أصدقائي: حصلت على آراء وتوقّعات عن المستقبل. ولا يخبرني أيّ منهما هل يستطيع أحد الحجز فعلًا."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Which plan shows you someone actually booking?","ar":"أي خطة تُريك شخصًا يحجز فعلًا؟"},{"en":"Can a vote or a \"yes, I would\" show where people get stuck?","ar":"هل يمكن لتصويت أو «نعم، سأحجز» أن يُظهر أين يتعثّر الناس؟"}],"correct":{"en":"A task shows what people do; you learn where they get stuck.","ar":"المهمة تُظهر ما يفعله الناس؛ وتعرف أين يتعثّرون."},"explain":{"en":"People are polite, guess badly about their own future, and judge by looks. Watching them try a real task shows whether your hierarchy works.","ar":"الناس مهذّبون، ويخطئون في توقّع ما سيفعلونه، ويحكمون بالشكل. ومراقبتهم وهم يجرّبون مهمة حقيقية تُظهر هل ينجح التسلسل البصري (Visual hierarchy) عندك."}},{"id":"S03","type":"card","part":"concept","icons":["eye","ok","person","idea"],"title":{"en":"A claim needs a check","ar":"الادّعاء يحتاج تحقّقًا"},"body":{"en":"\"This hierarchy is clearer\" is a claim. A small usability test checks it.\n\n- **Watch, don't ask:** give people a realistic task and see what they do. What they say they like, or would do, is unreliable.\n- **Success first:** before the test, write what counts as done, like \"books a Tuesday session and can say the cancellation rule\".\n- **Small and often:** about 5 people show the main problems. Fix them, then test again.\n- **Honest numbers:** 5 people give you reasons, not percentages.\n- **Think aloud, don't lead:** ask people to say what they're thinking, and keep your own words neutral.","ar":"«هذا التسلسل أوضح» ادّعاء. واختبار استخدام (Usability test) صغير يتحقّق منه.\n\n- **راقب، لا تسأل:** أعطِ الناس مهمة واقعية وانظر ماذا يفعلون. وما يقولون إنهم يحبّونه، أو سيفعلونه، لا يُعتمد عليه.\n- **النجاح أولًا:** قبل الاختبار، اكتب ما يُعدّ إنجازًا، مثل «يحجز جلسة الثلاثاء ويستطيع ذكر شرط الإلغاء».\n- **صغير ومتكرّر:** نحو 5 أشخاص يكشفون المشكلات الرئيسية. أصلحها، ثم اختبر مرة أخرى.\n- **أرقام صادقة:** 5 أشخاص يعطونك أسبابًا، لا نِسَبًا مئوية.\n- **التفكير بصوت عالٍ (Think aloud)، دون توجيه:** اطلب من الناس أن يقولوا ما يفكّرون فيه، وأبقِ كلماتك أنت محايدة."}},{"id":"S04","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P10-U06-02","part":"guided","rules":["R06","R15"],"value":{"en":"Success rate (NN/g): if a person doesn't do the task as specified, you can strictly score it as a failure. That only works if \"as specified\" was written down before the test.","ar":"معدّل النجاح (NN/g): إن لم يؤدِّ الشخص المهمة كما هي محدّدة، يمكنك بصرامة أن تعدّها فشلًا. وهذا لا ينجح إلا إن كُتب «كما هي محدّدة» قبل الاختبار."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/success-rate-the-simplest-usability-metric/","quote":"If a user does not perform a task as specified, you could be strict and score it as a failure."},"scenario":{"en":"My task: \"You're free on Tuesday evenings. Book a workshop you can attend, and find out what happens if your plans change.\" Before the first participant arrives, I write what counts as success.","ar":"مهمّتي: «أنت متفرّغ مساء الثلاثاء. احجز ورشة تستطيع حضورها، واعرف ماذا يحدث إن تغيّرت خططك.» وقبل وصول أول مشارك، أكتب ما يُعدّ نجاحًا."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each success rule. Which one should I write down?","ar":"جرّب كل قاعدة نجاح. أيّ قاعدة تحدّد النجاح بنتيجة يمكن التحقّق منها؟"},"start":"feel","options":[{"id":"feel","text":{"en":"They say the page felt easy","ar":"يقولون إن الصفحة بدت سهلة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"basira","name":{"en":"Basira","ar":"بصيرة"},"color":"#495057","icon":"magnifying-glass","domain":"basira.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"basira.example/plans/booking-page","blocks":[{"kind":"group","blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Success means…","ar":"النجاح يعني…"}},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"The participant says the page was easy to use.","ar":"يقول المشارك إن الصفحة كانت سهلة الاستخدام."},"gap":"xs"}]}]}},{"id":"exact","text":{"en":"They book a Tuesday session and can state the 24-hour rule, without help","ar":"يحجزون جلسة الثلاثاء ويذكرون شرط الـ 24 ساعة، دون مساعدة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"basira","name":{"en":"Basira","ar":"بصيرة"},"color":"#495057","icon":"magnifying-glass","domain":"basira.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"basira.example/plans/booking-page","blocks":[{"kind":"group","blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Success means…","ar":"النجاح يعني…"}},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"Without help, the participant (1) reserves the Tuesday 17 November session and (2) says they can cancel up to 24 hours before.","ar":"دون مساعدة، المشارك (1) يحجز جلسة الثلاثاء 17 نوفمبر و(2) يقول إنه يستطيع الإلغاء قبل الموعد بـ 24 ساعة."},"gap":"xs"}]}]}},{"id":"later","text":{"en":"Decide after watching, once I see what people did","ar":"قرّر بعد المراقبة، حين أرى ما فعله الناس"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"basira","name":{"en":"Basira","ar":"بصيرة"},"color":"#495057","icon":"magnifying-glass","domain":"basira.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"basira.example/plans/booking-page","blocks":[{"kind":"group","blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Success means…","ar":"النجاح يعني…"}},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"(to be decided after the sessions)","ar":"(يُحدَّد بعد الجلسات)"},"gap":"xs"}]}]}}],"answer":["exact"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P10-085","when":["later"],"feedback":{"en":"If I decide afterwards, I'll be tempted to call \"almost booked\" a success because I like my design. Write the rule first.","ar":"إن قرّرت بعد ذلك، سأميل إلى عدّ «كاد أن يحجز» نجاحًا لأنني أحب تصميمي. اكتب القاعدة أولًا."}},{"id":"MC-P10-084","when":["feel"],"feedback":{"en":"That's an opinion again. Someone can say \"easy\" and still book the wrong date. Success has to be something you can see them do.","ar":"هذا رأي مرة أخرى. قد يقول أحد «سهلة» ويحجز التاريخ الخطأ. والنجاح يجب أن يكون شيئًا تراهم يفعلونه."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Could two observers agree, just from watching, whether each rule was met?","ar":"هل يستطيع مراقبان أن يتّفقا، من المشاهدة فقط، على تحقّق كل قاعدة؟"},{"en":"Which rule was set before seeing any result?","ar":"أي قاعدة وُضعت قبل رؤية أي نتيجة؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Written first, and anyone watching can check it.","ar":"مكتوبة أولًا، ويستطيع أي مراقب التحقّق منها."},"explain":{"en":"A success rule written before the test is fair to the design: specific actions you can see, decided before you know how it turned out.","ar":"قاعدة النجاح المكتوبة قبل الاختبار عادلة مع التصميم: أفعال محدّدة تراها، تقرّرها قبل أن تعرف النتيجة."},"speaker":"sara"},{"id":"S05","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P10-U06-01","part":"guided","rules":["R06","R15"],"value":{"en":"Don't listen to users (NN/g): self-reported claims are unreliable, and so are guesses about future behavior. \"I'd join a waiting list\" is a guess.","ar":"لا تستمع للمستخدمين (NN/g): ما يقوله الناس عن أنفسهم لا يُعتمد عليه، ولا توقّعاتهم عن سلوكهم المستقبلي. و«سأنضم لقائمة الانتظار» توقّع."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/first-rule-of-usability-dont-listen-to-users/","quote":"Self-reported claims are unreliable, as are user speculations about future behavior."},"scenario":{"en":"Mona, our design lead, ran a quick survey: 8 of 10 people said they'd join a waiting list when a workshop is full. She wants \"Join the waiting list\" to be the biggest thing on a full session.","ar":"أجرت منى، قائدة التصميم عندنا، استبيانًا سريعًا: قال 8 من 10 إنهم سينضمّون لقائمة الانتظار حين تمتلئ الورشة. وتريد أن يكون «انضم إلى قائمة الانتظار» أكبر شيء في الجلسة الممتلئة."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each next step. Which one should I take?","ar":"جرّب كل خطوة تالية. أيّها يجب أن أتّخذ؟"},"start":"build","options":[{"id":"build","text":{"en":"Make the waiting list the biggest button; 8 of 10 said so","ar":"اجعل قائمة الانتظار أكبر زر؛ فقد قال ذلك 8 من 10"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"manara","name":{"en":"Manara Learning Hub","ar":"منارة"},"color":"#5B3FD6","icon":"chalkboard-teacher","domain":"manara.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Workshop","ar":"الورشة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Fully booked","ar":"اكتمل الحجز"}},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Join the waiting list","ar":"انضم إلى قائمة الانتظار"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Next session: Tuesday 24 November, 18:00","ar":"الجلسة التالية: الثلاثاء 24 نوفمبر، 18:00"},"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"more","text":{"en":"Survey 50 more people to be sure","ar":"استطلع رأي 50 شخصًا آخر للتأكّد"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"manara","name":{"en":"Manara Learning Hub","ar":"منارة"},"color":"#5B3FD6","icon":"chalkboard-teacher","domain":"manara.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Workshop","ar":"الورشة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"group","blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Test plan","ar":"خطة الاختبار"}},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"Send the same question to 50 more people: \"Would you join a waiting list?\"","ar":"أرسل السؤال نفسه إلى 50 شخصًا آخر: «هل ستنضم لقائمة انتظار؟»"},"gap":"xs"}]}]}},{"id":"watch","text":{"en":"Show people a full session in a task and watch what they choose","ar":"اعرض جلسة ممتلئة على الناس في مهمة وراقب ما يختارونه"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"manara","name":{"en":"Manara Learning Hub","ar":"منارة"},"color":"#5B3FD6","icon":"chalkboard-teacher","domain":"manara.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Workshop","ar":"الورشة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"group","blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Test plan","ar":"خطة الاختبار"}},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"Task: \"You wanted the 17 November workshop.\" The page shows it's full. Watch: do they join the list, pick the next session, or leave?","ar":"المهمة: «كنت تريد ورشة 17 نوفمبر.» والصفحة تُظهر أنها ممتلئة. راقب: هل ينضمّون للقائمة، أم يختارون الجلسة التالية، أم يغادرون؟"},"gap":"xs"}]}]}}],"answer":["watch"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P10-084","when":["build","more"],"feedback":{"en":"Both trust a guess about the future. More people guessing is still guessing. Put a full session in front of them and see what they actually do.","ar":"كلاهما يثق في توقّع عن المستقبل. وتوقّع عدد أكبر من الناس يظل توقّعًا. ضع أمامهم جلسة ممتلئة وانظر ماذا يفعلون فعلًا."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Did those 8 people join a list, or say they would?","ar":"هل انضمّ هؤلاء الثمانية لقائمة، أم قالوا إنهم سينضمّون؟"},{"en":"Which step shows behavior instead of intention?","ar":"أي خطوة تُظهر السلوك بدل النيّة؟"}],"correct":{"en":"You'll see whether they join the list or just take the next date.","ar":"سترى هل ينضمّون للقائمة أم يأخذون الموعد التالي فقط."},"explain":{"en":"What people predict about themselves often differs from what they do. Before making something the biggest thing on the page, watch whether people actually choose it.","ar":"ما يتوقّعه الناس عن أنفسهم يختلف كثيرًا عمّا يفعلونه. وقبل أن تجعل شيئًا أكبر عنصر في الصفحة، راقب هل يختاره الناس فعلًا."},"speaker":"sara"},{"id":"S06","type":"words","skill":"SK-P10-U06-02","part":"guided","confidence":true,"rules":["R06","R15"],"value":{"en":"Success rate (NN/g): success is whether people complete the task as specified. A good rule names the exact thing the person must find or do.","ar":"معدّل النجاح (NN/g): النجاح هو هل يُكمل الناس المهمة كما هي محدّدة. والقاعدة الجيدة تذكر الشيء المحدّد الذي يجب أن يجده الشخص أو يفعله."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/success-rate-the-simplest-usability-metric/","quote":"If a user does not perform a task as specified, you could be strict and score it as a failure."},"scenario":{"en":"A second task: \"You use a wheelchair. Find out whether you can get into the room.\" The answer is in \"View step-free access details\": a lift at the side entrance.","ar":"مهمة ثانية: «أنت تستخدم كرسيًا متحرّكًا. اعرف هل يمكنك الدخول إلى القاعة.» والإجابة في «تفاصيل الدخول دون سلالم»: مصعد عند المدخل الجانبي."},"prompt":{"en":"Which success rule should I write for this task?","ar":"أيّ قاعدة نجاح تُثبت أن المشارك وجد الإجابة الصحيحة؟"},"options":[{"id":"click","text":{"en":"\"They click something about access.\"","ar":"«يضغطون على شيء له علاقة بالدخول.»"}},{"id":"says","text":{"en":"\"They say they'd feel confident going.\"","ar":"«يقولون إنهم سيذهبون بثقة.»"}},{"id":"lift","text":{"en":"\"Without help, they say there's a lift at the side entrance.\"","ar":"«دون مساعدة، يقولون إن هناك مصعدًا عند المدخل الجانبي.»"}}],"answer":["lift"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P10-085","when":["click"],"feedback":{"en":"Clicking the link isn't finding the answer. Someone can open it, misread it, and think there's no access. Name the fact they must come back with.","ar":"الضغط على الرابط ليس إيجادًا للإجابة. قد يفتحه أحد ويُسيء فهمه ويظن أنه لا يوجد دخول. اذكر المعلومة التي يجب أن يعود بها."}},{"id":"MC-P10-084","when":["says"],"feedback":{"en":"Confidence is a feeling, not a result. They could feel confident and be wrong about the lift.","ar":"الثقة شعور، لا نتيجة. قد يشعرون بالثقة ويكونون مخطئين بشأن المصعد."}}],"hints":[{"en":"What exact fact proves they found the answer?","ar":"ما المعلومة المحدّدة التي تثبت أنهم وجدوا الإجابة؟"},{"en":"Which rule could you check by just listening to their answer?","ar":"أي قاعدة تستطيع التحقّق منها بمجرّد سماع إجابتهم؟"}],"correct":{"en":"A specific, correct answer: anyone can score it.","ar":"إجابة محدّدة وصحيحة: أي شخص يستطيع تقييمها."},"explain":{"en":"For \"find out\" tasks, success is the right answer, in the participant's words. Write that answer down before the test.","ar":"في مهام «اعرف»، النجاح هو الإجابة الصحيحة، بكلمات المشارك. اكتب تلك الإجابة قبل الاختبار."},"speaker":"sara"},{"id":"S07","type":"compare","skill":"SK-P10-U06-01","part":"contrast","rules":["R11","R15"],"value":{"en":"Contrast with S02: both plans here use people and pages. Don't listen to users (NN/g): if people haven't actually tried the designs, they comment on surface features.","ar":"مقارنة مع الخطوة 2: الخطّتان هنا تستخدمان أشخاصًا وصفحات. لا تستمع للمستخدمين (NN/g): إن لم يجرّب الناس التصميمات فعلًا، يعلّقون على مظهرها السطحي."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/first-rule-of-usability-dont-listen-to-users/","quote":"If the users have not actually tried to use the designs, they'll base their comments on surface features."},"scenario":{"en":"I have two versions of the page: one with the photo on top, one with the date and Reserve on top. I want to know which one helps people book.","ar":"عندي نسختان من الصفحة: واحدة فيها الصورة في الأعلى، وأخرى فيها التاريخ و«احجز» في الأعلى. وأريد أن أعرف أيّهما تساعد الناس على الحجز."},"prompt":{"en":"Which plan answers that question?","ar":"أي خطة تجيب عن هذا السؤال؟"},"a":{"label":{"en":"Look and pick","ar":"انظر واختر"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"basira","name":{"en":"Basira","ar":"بصيرة"},"color":"#495057","icon":"magnifying-glass","domain":"basira.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"basira.example/plans/booking-page","blocks":[{"kind":"group","blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Test plan","ar":"خطة الاختبار"}},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"5 people look at screenshots of both versions for 30 seconds and say which one looks easier to book from.","ar":"5 أشخاص ينظرون إلى صورتي النسختين 30 ثانية ويقولون أيّهما تبدو أسهل للحجز."},"gap":"xs"}]}]}},"b":{"label":{"en":"Try and book","ar":"جرّب واحجز"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"basira","name":{"en":"Basira","ar":"بصيرة"},"color":"#495057","icon":"magnifying-glass","domain":"basira.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"basira.example/plans/booking-page","blocks":[{"kind":"group","blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Test plan","ar":"خطة الاختبار"}},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"5 people each try to book a Tuesday session on one version, then on the other. Note who books correctly and where they pause.","ar":"5 أشخاص يحاول كل منهم حجز جلسة الثلاثاء على نسخة، ثم على الأخرى. سجّل من يحجز بشكل صحيح وأين يتوقّف."},"gap":"xs"}]}]}},"answer":"b","reason":{"prompt":{"en":"Why is B better?","ar":"لماذا B أفضل؟"},"options":[{"id":"tried","text":{"en":"People actually use each version, so you see what helps them book","ar":"يستخدم الناس كل نسخة فعلًا، فترى ما يساعدهم على الحجز"}},{"id":"longer","text":{"en":"It takes longer, so it's more serious","ar":"يستغرق وقتًا أطول، فهو أكثر جدية"}},{"id":"more","text":{"en":"It uses more people","ar":"يستخدم أشخاصًا أكثر"}}],"answer":["tried"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P10-084","when":["longer","more"],"feedback":{"en":"Both plans use 5 people. The difference is that in B they try to book, so you see behavior instead of first impressions.","ar":"الخطّتان تستخدمان 5 أشخاص. والفرق أنهم في B يحاولون الحجز، فترى السلوك بدل الانطباع الأول."}}]},"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P10-084","when":["a"],"feedback":{"en":"Looking at a screenshot, people judge the photo and the colors. They never find out where Reserve is when they need it.","ar":"عند النظر إلى صورة، يحكم الناس على الصورة والألوان. ولا يكتشفون أبدًا أين «احجز» حين يحتاجونه."}}],"hints":[{"en":"In which plan does anyone try to book?","ar":"في أي خطة يحاول أحد أن يحجز؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Use beats looks: they have to try it.","ar":"الاستخدام يتفوّق على الشكل: يجب أن يجرّبوه."},"explain":{"en":"A hierarchy is there to help people act. Only watching them act on it tells you whether it does.","ar":"التسلسل البصري موجود ليساعد الناس على التصرّف. ولا شيء يخبرك هل يفعل ذلك إلا مراقبتهم وهم يتصرّفون."},"speaker":"sara"},{"id":"S08","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P10-U06-02","part":"independent","speaker":"hana","rules":["R14","R19"],"value":{"en":"New case. Success rate (NN/g): success rate is the share of people who completed the task. You can only count completions if \"complete\" was defined first.","ar":"حالة جديدة. معدّل النجاح (NN/g): معدّل النجاح هو نسبة من أكملوا المهمة. ولا يمكنك عدّ مرات الإكمال إلا إن عُرّف «الإكمال» أولًا."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/success-rate-the-simplest-usability-metric/","quote":"the percentage of users who were able to complete a task in a study."},"scenario":{"en":"I put \"Book your free trial\" at the top of my gym's home page. Before testing it, I need a success rule for the task: \"Try the gym for free this Friday morning.\"","ar":"وضعت «احجز تجربتك المجانية» في أعلى الصفحة الرئيسية لنادينا. وقبل اختبارها، أحتاج قاعدة نجاح للمهمة: «جرّب النادي مجانًا صباح الجمعة.»"},"prompt":{"en":"Try each success rule. Which one should I use?","ar":"جرّب كل قاعدة نجاح. أيّ قاعدة تحدّد مهمة مكتملة يمكن التحقّق منها؟"},"start":"notice","options":[{"id":"notice","text":{"en":"They notice the free trial button","ar":"يلاحظون زر التجربة المجانية"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"basira","name":{"en":"Basira","ar":"بصيرة"},"color":"#495057","icon":"magnifying-glass","domain":"basira.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"basira.example/plans/booking-page","blocks":[{"kind":"group","blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Success means…","ar":"النجاح يعني…"}},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"The participant notices \"Book your free trial\".","ar":"يلاحظ المشارك «احجز تجربتك المجانية»."},"gap":"xs"}]}]}},{"id":"booked","text":{"en":"They book a free trial for this Friday morning, without help","ar":"يحجزون تجربة مجانية صباح الجمعة هذه، دون مساعدة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"basira","name":{"en":"Basira","ar":"بصيرة"},"color":"#495057","icon":"magnifying-glass","domain":"basira.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"basira.example/plans/booking-page","blocks":[{"kind":"group","blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Success means…","ar":"النجاح يعني…"}},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"Without help, the participant books a free trial for Friday 6 November, before 12:00.","ar":"دون مساعدة، يحجز المشارك تجربة مجانية يوم الجمعة 6 نوفمبر، قبل الساعة 12:00."},"gap":"xs"}]}]}},{"id":"rate","text":{"en":"They rate the page 4 or 5 out of 5","ar":"يقيّمون الصفحة 4 أو 5 من 5"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"basira","name":{"en":"Basira","ar":"بصيرة"},"color":"#495057","icon":"magnifying-glass","domain":"basira.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"basira.example/plans/booking-page","blocks":[{"kind":"group","blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Success means…","ar":"النجاح يعني…"}},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"The participant rates the home page 4 or 5 out of 5.","ar":"يقيّم المشارك الصفحة الرئيسية 4 أو 5 من 5."},"gap":"xs"}]}]}}],"answer":["booked"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P10-085","when":["notice"],"feedback":{"en":"Noticing isn't booking. Someone can see the button and still book Saturday, or a paid class. Define the finished task.","ar":"الملاحظة ليست حجزًا. قد يرى أحد الزر ويحجز السبت، أو حصة مدفوعة. عرّف المهمة المكتملة."}},{"id":"MC-P10-084","when":["rate"],"feedback":{"en":"A rating is an opinion about the page, not proof they could book. Score what they did.","ar":"التقييم رأي في الصفحة، لا دليل على أنهم استطاعوا الحجز. قيّم ما فعلوه."}}],"correct":{"en":"A finished, correct booking: easy to score.","ar":"حجز مكتمل وصحيح: سهل التقييم."},"explain":{"en":"Success is the end of the task, done right: the correct day, time and type, without help. Write it before the first session.","ar":"النجاح هو نهاية المهمة، منجزة بشكل صحيح: اليوم والوقت والنوع الصحيحة، دون مساعدة. اكتبه قبل الجلسة الأولى."}},{"id":"S09","type":"card","part":"recap","icons":["eye","ok","person","idea"],"title":{"en":"What you did","ar":"ماذا تعلّمت"},"body":{"en":"- **Watch, don't ask:** chose a booking task over preference votes and \"would you book?\".\n- **Behavior beats predictions:** tested the waiting list instead of trusting \"8 of 10 said they would\".\n- **Try, don't look:** chose people booking on both versions over judging screenshots.\n- **Success first:** wrote exact, checkable success rules before the test, for booking, for step-free access, and for a gym trial.\n\nNext: how many people to test, and how to report what you saw.","ar":"- **راقب، لا تسأل:** اخترت مهمة حجز بدل التصويت على التفضيل و«هل ستحجز؟».\n- **السلوك يتفوّق على التوقّعات:** اختبرت قائمة الانتظار بدل الثقة في «قال 8 من 10 إنهم سيفعلون».\n- **جرّب، لا تنظر:** اخترت أن يحجز الناس على النسختين بدل الحكم على صور.\n- **النجاح أولًا:** كتبت قواعد نجاح دقيقة يمكن التحقّق منها قبل الاختبار، للحجز، وللدخول دون سلالم، ولتجربة النادي.\n\nالتالي: كم شخصًا تختبر، وكيف تعرض ما رأيته."}}]}$uxg$::jsonb),
  ($uxg$P10-U06-L02$uxg$, $uxg$07134a6a0df4c8c7b01f110e7d8527bcee7ceb67b73977d225ef681798101b10$uxg$, $uxg${"id":"P10-U06-L02","mode":"lesson","minutes":8,"title":{"en":"Small tests, honest numbers","ar":"اختبارات صغيرة، وأرقام صادقة"},"summary":{"en":"Plan small test rounds and rewrite \"80% of users\" as honest counts.","ar":"خطّط لجولات اختبار صغيرة، وأعد كتابة «80% من المستخدمين» كأعداد صادقة."},"speaker":"sara","review_labels":{"MC-P10-086":{"en":"Test small, fix, and test again","ar":"اختبر بعدد صغير، وأصلح، واختبر مجددًا"},"MC-P10-087":{"en":"5 people can't give a percentage","ar":"5 أشخاص لا يعطون نسبة مئوية"}},"steps":[{"id":"S01","type":"card","part":"hook","title":{"en":"80% from five people","ar":"80% من خمسة أشخاص"},"body":{"en":"I tested the new booking page with 5 people. Four booked the Tuesday session; one scrolled past Reserve because the photo pushed it down.\n\nIn my report to the learning hub, I wrote: \"80% of users can book.\" Their manager put that number on a slide for the board. I wasn't comfortable, and I didn't know why.","ar":"اختبرت صفحة الحجز الجديدة مع 5 أشخاص. حجز أربعة جلسة الثلاثاء؛ وتجاوز واحد «احجز» لأن الصورة دفعته لأسفل.\n\nوكتبت في تقريري لمركز التعلّم: «80% من المستخدمين يستطيعون الحجز.» فوضع مديرهم هذا الرقم في عرض لمجلس الإدارة. لم أكن مرتاحة، ولم أعرف لماذا."},"mock":{"app":{"id":"basira","name":{"en":"Basira","ar":"بصيرة"},"color":"#495057","icon":"magnifying-glass","domain":"basira.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"basira.example/reports/booking-page","blocks":[{"kind":"group","blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Report","ar":"التقرير"}},{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"80% of users can book","ar":"80% من المستخدمين يستطيعون الحجز"},"gap":"xs"}]}]}},{"id":"S02","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P10-U06-03","part":"try","rules":["R12"],"value":{"en":"Try first. Testing with 5 users (NN/g): the best results come from testing no more than 5 users and running as many small tests as you can afford. Three rounds of 5 find more than one round of 15.","ar":"جرّب أولًا. الاختبار مع 5 مستخدمين (NN/g): أفضل النتائج تأتي من اختبار 5 مستخدمين على الأكثر وإجراء أكبر عدد ممكن من الاختبارات الصغيرة. وثلاث جولات من 5 تكشف أكثر من جولة واحدة من 15."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/why-you-only-need-to-test-with-5-users/","quote":"The best results come from testing no more than 5 users and running as many small tests as you can afford."},"scenario":{"en":"For the next redesign, the hub gives me time and money for 15 test sessions.","ar":"لإعادة التصميم القادمة، يعطيني المركز وقتًا ومالًا لـ 15 جلسة اختبار."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each plan. Which one should I use?","ar":"جرّب كل خطة. أيّ خطة تكشف أكثر المشكلات وتتحقّق من الإصلاحات؟"},"start":"one","options":[{"id":"one","text":{"en":"One big test with 15 people, just before launch","ar":"اختبار واحد كبير مع 15 شخصًا، قبل الإطلاق مباشرة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"basira","name":{"en":"Basira","ar":"بصيرة"},"color":"#495057","icon":"magnifying-glass","domain":"basira.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"basira.example/reports/booking-page","blocks":[{"kind":"group","blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Test plan","ar":"خطة الاختبار"}},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"Week 6: 15 people try the finished page. Launch in week 7.","ar":"الأسبوع 6: 15 شخصًا يجرّبون الصفحة النهائية. الإطلاق في الأسبوع 7."},"gap":"xs"}]}]}},{"id":"rounds","text":{"en":"Three rounds of 5, fixing the page between rounds","ar":"ثلاث جولات من 5، مع إصلاح الصفحة بين الجولات"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"basira","name":{"en":"Basira","ar":"بصيرة"},"color":"#495057","icon":"magnifying-glass","domain":"basira.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"basira.example/reports/booking-page","blocks":[{"kind":"group","blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Test plan","ar":"خطة الاختبار"}},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"Week 2: 5 people → fix. Week 4: 5 people → fix. Week 6: 5 people → final fixes.","ar":"الأسبوع 2: 5 أشخاص ← إصلاح. الأسبوع 4: 5 أشخاص ← إصلاح. الأسبوع 6: 5 أشخاص ← إصلاحات أخيرة."},"gap":"xs"}]}]}},{"id":"early","text":{"en":"15 people in week 2, then no more tests","ar":"15 شخصًا في الأسبوع 2، ثم لا اختبارات أخرى"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"basira","name":{"en":"Basira","ar":"بصيرة"},"color":"#495057","icon":"magnifying-glass","domain":"basira.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"basira.example/reports/booking-page","blocks":[{"kind":"group","blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Test plan","ar":"خطة الاختبار"}},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"Week 2: 15 people try the first draft. Then design and launch.","ar":"الأسبوع 2: 15 شخصًا يجرّبون المسودة الأولى. ثم التصميم والإطلاق."},"gap":"xs"}]}]}}],"answer":["rounds"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P10-086","when":["one"],"feedback":{"en":"After about 5 people, you mostly see the same problems again. And in week 6 there's no time left to fix what you find.","ar":"بعد نحو 5 أشخاص، ترى غالبًا المشكلات نفسها مرة أخرى. وفي الأسبوع 6 لا يبقى وقت لإصلاح ما تجده."}},{"id":"MC-P10-086","when":["early"],"feedback":{"en":"Early is good, but people 6 to 15 mostly repeat what the first 5 showed, and nobody checks whether your fixes work.","ar":"البدء المبكّر جيد، لكن الأشخاص من 6 إلى 15 يكرّرون غالبًا ما أظهره الخمسة الأوائل، ولا أحد يتحقّق هل نجحت إصلاحاتك."}}],"hints":[{"en":"What happens after you fix the problems the first 5 people found?","ar":"ماذا يحدث بعد أن تُصلح المشكلات التي وجدها أول 5 أشخاص؟"},{"en":"Which plan lets you check each fix?","ar":"أي خطة تتيح لك التحقّق من كل إصلاح؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Each round checks the last fix and finds the next problem.","ar":"كل جولة تتحقّق من الإصلاح السابق وتكشف المشكلة التالية."},"explain":{"en":"A few people reveal most of the big problems. Spending the rest on more rounds, after fixes, finds problems the first version was hiding and checks your fixes.","ar":"عدد قليل من الناس يكشف أغلب المشكلات الكبيرة. وإنفاق الباقي على جولات أخرى، بعد الإصلاح، يكشف مشكلات كانت النسخة الأولى تُخفيها ويتحقّق من إصلاحاتك."},"speaker":"sara"},{"id":"S03","type":"card","part":"concept","icons":["person","order","warn","text"],"title":{"en":"Five people show why, not how many","ar":"خمسة أشخاص يُظهرون لماذا، لا كم"},"body":{"en":"A test with about 5 people is qualitative: it shows what goes wrong and why.\n\n- **Small rounds:** test with about 5, fix what you see, then test the new version.\n- **No percentages from 5:** one person changes the result by 20 points. \"80%\" sounds precise, but it isn't.\n- **Report counts and reasons:** \"4 of 5 booked; 1 missed Reserve because the photo pushed it below the screen.\"\n- **Need a number?** That takes a bigger, quantitative study. Say so instead of stretching a small one.","ar":"الاختبار مع نحو 5 أشخاص اختبار نوعي: يُظهر ما الذي لا يعمل ولماذا.\n\n- **جولات صغيرة:** اختبر مع نحو 5، وأصلح ما تراه، ثم اختبر النسخة الجديدة.\n- **لا نِسَب من 5:** شخص واحد يغيّر النتيجة 20 نقطة. و«80%» تبدو دقيقة، لكنها ليست كذلك.\n- **اذكر الأعداد والأسباب:** «حجز 4 من 5؛ وفات واحدًا زر «احجز» لأن الصورة دفعته أسفل الشاشة.»\n- **تحتاج رقمًا؟** هذا يتطلّب دراسة كمية أكبر. قل ذلك بدل تحميل دراسة صغيرة أكثر ممّا تحتمل."}},{"id":"S04","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P10-U06-04","part":"guided","rules":["R06","R15"],"value":{"en":"5 users, qual vs quant (NN/g): the 5-user guideline applies only to qualitative studies, not quantitative ones. A percentage is a quantitative claim.","ar":"5 مستخدمين، نوعي مقابل كمّي (NN/g): قاعدة الخمسة مستخدمين تنطبق على الدراسات النوعية فقط، لا الكمية. والنسبة المئوية ادّعاء كمّي."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/5-test-users-qual-quant/","quote":"the 5-user guideline only applies to qualitative, not to quantitative studies."},"scenario":{"en":"Back to my report. I'm rewriting the headline about the 5-person test.","ar":"نعود إلى تقريري. أعيد كتابة العنوان الرئيسي عن اختبار الأشخاص الخمسة."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each headline. Which one should go in the report?","ar":"جرّب كل عنوان. أيّ عنوان يقول بصدق ما حدث ويخبر المركز بما يجب إصلاحه؟"},"start":"pct","options":[{"id":"pct","text":{"en":"Keep \"80% of users can book\"","ar":"أبقِ «80% من المستخدمين يستطيعون الحجز»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"basira","name":{"en":"Basira","ar":"بصيرة"},"color":"#495057","icon":"magnifying-glass","domain":"basira.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"basira.example/reports/booking-page","blocks":[{"kind":"group","blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Report","ar":"التقرير"}},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"80% of users can book.","ar":"80% من المستخدمين يستطيعون الحجز."},"gap":"xs"}]}]}},{"id":"most","text":{"en":"\"Most users can book easily\"","ar":"«أغلب المستخدمين يستطيعون الحجز بسهولة»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"basira","name":{"en":"Basira","ar":"بصيرة"},"color":"#495057","icon":"magnifying-glass","domain":"basira.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"basira.example/reports/booking-page","blocks":[{"kind":"group","blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Report","ar":"التقرير"}},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"Most users can book easily.","ar":"أغلب المستخدمين يستطيعون الحجز بسهولة."},"gap":"xs"}]}]}},{"id":"counts","text":{"en":"Counts and the reason: \"4 of 5 booked; 1 missed Reserve below the photo\"","ar":"الأعداد والسبب: «حجز 4 من 5؛ وفات واحدًا «احجز» تحت الصورة»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"basira","name":{"en":"Basira","ar":"بصيرة"},"color":"#495057","icon":"magnifying-glass","domain":"basira.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"basira.example/reports/booking-page","blocks":[{"kind":"group","blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Report","ar":"التقرير"}},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"4 of 5 people booked the Tuesday session. 1 scrolled past Reserve because the photo pushed it below the screen. Fix: move the photo under the details.","ar":"حجز 4 من 5 أشخاص جلسة الثلاثاء. وتجاوز واحد «احجز» لأن الصورة دفعته أسفل الشاشة. الإصلاح: انقل الصورة تحت التفاصيل."},"gap":"xs"}]}]}}],"answer":["counts"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P10-087","when":["pct"],"feedback":{"en":"With 5 people, one person is 20 points. The real number for all visitors could be far lower or higher. The board will read 80% as a fact.","ar":"مع 5 أشخاص، الشخص الواحد يساوي 20 نقطة. والرقم الحقيقي لكل الزوّار قد يكون أقل أو أعلى بكثير. وسيقرأ مجلس الإدارة 80% كحقيقة."}},{"id":"MC-P10-087","when":["most"],"feedback":{"en":"\"Most\" and \"easily\" hide the one problem the test found, which is the useful part. Report what happened and why.","ar":"«أغلب» و«بسهولة» تُخفيان المشكلة الوحيدة التي وجدها الاختبار، وهي الجزء المفيد. اذكر ما حدث ولماذا."}}],"hints":[{"en":"How much does the number change if one more person had failed?","ar":"كم يتغيّر الرقم لو فشل شخص واحد إضافي؟"},{"en":"Which headline tells the hub what to fix?","ar":"أي عنوان يخبر المركز بما يجب إصلاحه؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Honest counts, and the reason behind the one failure.","ar":"أعداد صادقة، والسبب وراء الحالة الوحيدة التي فشلت."},"explain":{"en":"Small tests are for finding problems and their causes. Report them as \"x of 5\" with what happened, never as a percentage of all users.","ar":"الاختبارات الصغيرة لاكتشاف المشكلات وأسبابها. اعرض نتائجها كـ «x من 5» مع ما حدث، لا كنسبة من كل المستخدمين أبدًا."},"speaker":"sara"},{"id":"S05","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P10-U06-03","part":"guided","rules":["R06","R15"],"value":{"en":"Testing with 5 users (NN/g): after creating the new design, you need to test again. A fix can solve one problem and create another.","ar":"الاختبار مع 5 مستخدمين (NN/g): بعد إنشاء التصميم الجديد، تحتاج إلى الاختبار مرة أخرى. فالإصلاح قد يحلّ مشكلة ويخلق أخرى."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/why-you-only-need-to-test-with-5-users/","quote":"After creating the new design, you need to test again."},"scenario":{"en":"I moved the photo under the details, so Reserve is now near the top. The fix looks obvious to me.","ar":"نقلت الصورة تحت التفاصيل، فأصبح «احجز» قريبًا من الأعلى. والإصلاح يبدو واضحًا لي."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each next step. Which one should I take?","ar":"جرّب كل خطوة تالية. أيّها يجب أن أتّخذ؟"},"start":"ship","options":[{"id":"ship","text":{"en":"Ship it; the fix is obvious","ar":"أطلقه؛ فالإصلاح واضح"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"basira","name":{"en":"Basira","ar":"بصيرة"},"color":"#495057","icon":"magnifying-glass","domain":"basira.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"basira.example/reports/booking-page","blocks":[{"kind":"group","blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Test plan","ar":"خطة الاختبار"}},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"No more testing. Launch the fixed page on Sunday.","ar":"لا مزيد من الاختبار. أطلق الصفحة المُصلحة يوم الأحد."},"gap":"xs"}]}]}},{"id":"ask","text":{"en":"Show the same 5 people the fix and ask if it's better","ar":"اعرض الإصلاح على الأشخاص الخمسة أنفسهم واسأل هل هو أفضل"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"basira","name":{"en":"Basira","ar":"بصيرة"},"color":"#495057","icon":"magnifying-glass","domain":"basira.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"basira.example/reports/booking-page","blocks":[{"kind":"group","blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Test plan","ar":"خطة الاختبار"}},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"Email the 5 people a screenshot of the fix: \"Is this better?\"","ar":"أرسل للأشخاص الخمسة صورة للإصلاح: «هل هذا أفضل؟»"},"gap":"xs"}]}]}},{"id":"retest","text":{"en":"Test the fixed page with 5 new people, same task","ar":"اختبر الصفحة المُصلحة مع 5 أشخاص جدد، بالمهمة نفسها"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"basira","name":{"en":"Basira","ar":"بصيرة"},"color":"#495057","icon":"magnifying-glass","domain":"basira.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"basira.example/reports/booking-page","blocks":[{"kind":"group","blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Test plan","ar":"خطة الاختبار"}},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"Next week: 5 new people, same booking task, same success rule. Watch for the old problem, and any new one.","ar":"الأسبوع القادم: 5 أشخاص جدد، مهمة الحجز نفسها، وقاعدة النجاح نفسها. راقب المشكلة القديمة، وأي مشكلة جديدة."},"gap":"xs"}]}]}}],"answer":["retest"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P10-086","when":["ship"],"feedback":{"en":"Obvious fixes still fail. With the photo lower, people may now miss the room or the price. Only a new round shows that.","ar":"الإصلاحات الواضحة قد تفشل أيضًا. ومع نزول الصورة، قد يفوت الناس الآن القاعة أو السعر. ولا تُظهر ذلك إلا جولة جديدة."}},{"id":"MC-P10-084","when":["ask"],"feedback":{"en":"That's asking for opinions again, from people who already know the page. New people trying the task shows whether the fix works.","ar":"هذا طلب آراء مرة أخرى، من أشخاص يعرفون الصفحة بالفعل. وأشخاص جدد يجرّبون المهمة يُظهرون هل نجح الإصلاح."}}],"hints":[{"en":"How do you know the fix didn't break something else?","ar":"كيف تعرف أن الإصلاح لم يُفسد شيئًا آخر؟"},{"en":"Which step shows behavior on the new version?","ar":"أي خطوة تُظهر السلوك على النسخة الجديدة؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Same task, new people, new version: now you know.","ar":"المهمة نفسها، وأشخاص جدد، ونسخة جديدة: الآن تعرف."},"explain":{"en":"Every fix is a new design, and it can have its own problems. A small round after each fix keeps you honest.","ar":"كل إصلاح تصميم جديد، وقد تكون له مشكلاته. وجولة صغيرة بعد كل إصلاح تمنعك من الحكم بالأمل."},"speaker":"sara"},{"id":"S06","type":"words","skill":"SK-P10-U06-04","part":"guided","confidence":true,"rules":["R06","R15"],"value":{"en":"5 users, qual vs quant (NN/g): numbers from a small sample are imprecise, and so useless. When someone asks for a percentage, the honest answer explains what a small test can and can't say.","ar":"5 مستخدمين، نوعي مقابل كمّي (NN/g): الأرقام من عيّنة صغيرة غير دقيقة، وبالتالي بلا فائدة. وحين يطلب أحد نسبة مئوية، فالإجابة الصادقة تشرح ما يستطيع الاختبار الصغير قوله وما لا يستطيع."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/5-test-users-qual-quant/","quote":"such numbers will be imprecise — and thus useless — if they are based on a small sample size."},"scenario":{"en":"The hub's manager writes: \"Great. So what percentage of visitors will book now?\"","ar":"يكتب مدير المركز: «رائع. إذن ما نسبة الزوّار الذين سيحجزون الآن؟»"},"prompt":{"en":"Which reply should I send?","ar":"أيّ ردّ يكون صادقًا بشأن حدود الاختبار ويقول للمدير من أين يأتي الرقم؟"},"options":[{"id":"guess","text":{"en":"\"About 80%, based on our test.\"","ar":"«نحو 80%، بناءً على اختبارنا.»"}},{"id":"honest","text":{"en":"\"5 people can't give a reliable percentage. They showed us what blocked booking, and we fixed it. For a number, we can watch real bookings for a month.\"","ar":"«5 أشخاص لا يعطون نسبة يُعتمد عليها. لقد أظهروا لنا ما منع الحجز، وأصلحناه. وإن أردت رقمًا، يمكننا متابعة الحجوزات الحقيقية لمدة شهر.»"}},{"id":"high","text":{"en":"\"Almost everyone; the test went very well.\"","ar":"«الجميع تقريبًا؛ الاختبار نجح جدًا.»"}}],"answer":["honest"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P10-087","when":["guess","high"],"feedback":{"en":"Both turn 5 people into a promise about every visitor. If real bookings come in lower, the hub stops trusting the research.","ar":"كلاهما يحوّل 5 أشخاص إلى وعد عن كل زائر. وإن جاءت الحجوزات الحقيقية أقل، يتوقّف المركز عن الثقة في البحث."}}],"hints":[{"en":"What did the 5-person test actually tell you?","ar":"ماذا أخبرك اختبار الأشخاص الخمسة فعلًا؟"},{"en":"Where could a real number come from?","ar":"من أين يمكن أن يأتي رقم حقيقي؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Honest about the limit, and offers a way to get the number.","ar":"صادق بشأن الحدود، ويعرض طريقة للحصول على الرقم."},"explain":{"en":"Say what the small test did (found and fixed problems) and what it can't do (predict a rate). Then point to where a real number would come from.","ar":"قل ما فعله الاختبار الصغير (وجد مشكلات وأصلحها) وما لا يستطيعه (توقّع معدّل). ثم أشر إلى مصدر الرقم الحقيقي."},"speaker":"sara"},{"id":"S07","type":"compare","skill":"SK-P10-U06-04","part":"contrast","rules":["R11","R15"],"value":{"en":"Contrast with S04: both lines here state the same finding. 5 users, qual vs quant (NN/g): the 5-user guideline is for qualitative work. Writing \"60%\" dresses 3 people up as a statistic.","ar":"مقارنة مع الخطوة 4: السطران هنا ينقلان النتيجة نفسها. 5 مستخدمين، نوعي مقابل كمّي (NN/g): قاعدة الخمسة للعمل النوعي. وكتابة «60%» تُلبس 3 أشخاص ثوب الإحصاء."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/5-test-users-qual-quant/","quote":"the 5-user guideline only applies to qualitative, not to quantitative studies."},"scenario":{"en":"In the second round, 3 of 5 people couldn't say the cancellation rule: they read \"24 hours\" as the session length. I have two ways to write it.","ar":"في الجولة الثانية، لم يستطع 3 من 5 أشخاص ذكر شرط الإلغاء: فهموا «24 ساعة» على أنها مدة الجلسة. وعندي طريقتان لكتابة ذلك."},"prompt":{"en":"Which line should go in the report?","ar":"أيّ سطر يقول بدقّة ما رأيته ويخبر الفريق بما يغيّره؟"},"a":{"label":{"en":"Percentage","ar":"نسبة مئوية"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"basira","name":{"en":"Basira","ar":"بصيرة"},"color":"#495057","icon":"magnifying-glass","domain":"basira.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"basira.example/reports/booking-page","blocks":[{"kind":"group","blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Report","ar":"التقرير"}},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"60% of users misread the cancellation rule.","ar":"60% من المستخدمين أساؤوا فهم شرط الإلغاء."},"gap":"xs"}]}]}},"b":{"label":{"en":"Count and reason","ar":"عدد وسبب"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"basira","name":{"en":"Basira","ar":"بصيرة"},"color":"#495057","icon":"magnifying-glass","domain":"basira.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"basira.example/reports/booking-page","blocks":[{"kind":"group","blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Report","ar":"التقرير"}},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"3 of 5 misread the cancellation rule: they took \"24 hours\" as the session length.","ar":"3 من 5 أساؤوا فهم شرط الإلغاء: ظنّوا أن «24 ساعة» مدة الجلسة."},"gap":"xs"}]}]}},"answer":"b","reason":{"prompt":{"en":"What makes B the right line?","ar":"ما الذي يجعل B السطر الصحيح؟"},"options":[{"id":"honest","text":{"en":"It shows the real sample size and why it happened","ar":"يُظهر حجم العيّنة الحقيقي وسبب ما حدث"}},{"id":"smaller","text":{"en":"3 sounds less alarming than 60%","ar":"3 تبدو أقل إثارة للقلق من 60%"}},{"id":"same","text":{"en":"They mean the same; it's style","ar":"معناهما واحد؛ إنها مسألة أسلوب"}}],"answer":["honest"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P10-087","when":["smaller","same"],"feedback":{"en":"It's not about sounding calm, and they don't mean the same. \"60%\" claims a rate for all users; \"3 of 5\" says exactly what you saw, plus the reason to fix.","ar":"الأمر ليس أن يبدو هادئًا، ومعناهما ليس واحدًا. «60%» تدّعي معدّلًا لكل المستخدمين؛ و«3 من 5» تقول بالضبط ما رأيته، مع سبب الإصلاح."}}]},"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P10-087","when":["a"],"feedback":{"en":"A hides that only 5 people took part, and drops the reason. It reads like a survey of thousands.","ar":"A تُخفي أن 5 أشخاص فقط شاركوا، وتُسقط السبب. وتُقرأ كأنها استبيان لآلاف."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Which line would a reader mistake for a big survey?","ar":"أي سطر قد يظنّه القارئ استبيانًا كبيرًا؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Real counts, real reason.","ar":"أعداد حقيقية، وسبب حقيقي."},"explain":{"en":"\"x of 5\" keeps the sample visible and the reason tells the team what to change. That's what a small test is for.","ar":"«x من 5» تُبقي العيّنة ظاهرة، والسبب يخبر الفريق بما يغيّره. وهذا هو هدف الاختبار الصغير."},"speaker":"sara"},{"id":"S08","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P10-U06-03","part":"independent","speaker":"youssef","rules":["R14","R19"],"value":{"en":"New case. Testing with 5 users (NN/g): run as many small tests as you can afford, with no more than about 5 people each.","ar":"حالة جديدة. الاختبار مع 5 مستخدمين (NN/g): أجرِ أكبر عدد ممكن من الاختبارات الصغيرة، بنحو 5 أشخاص على الأكثر في كل منها."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/why-you-only-need-to-test-with-5-users/","quote":"The best results come from testing no more than 5 users and running as many small tests as you can afford."},"scenario":{"en":"I'm changing my online shop's product page so the price and \"Add to cart\" come before the long description. I can pay 10 customers to try it, and I want it live in a month.","ar":"أغيّر صفحة المنتج في متجري الإلكتروني ليأتي السعر و«أضف إلى السلّة» قبل الوصف الطويل. وأستطيع أن أدفع لـ 10 عملاء ليجرّبوها، وأريدها جاهزة خلال شهر."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each plan. Which one should I use?","ar":"جرّب كل خطة. أيّها يجب أن أستخدم؟"},"start":"ten","options":[{"id":"ten","text":{"en":"All 10 customers in one day, at the end of the month","ar":"العملاء العشرة كلهم في يوم واحد، في نهاية الشهر"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"basira","name":{"en":"Basira","ar":"بصيرة"},"color":"#495057","icon":"magnifying-glass","domain":"basira.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"basira.example/reports/booking-page","blocks":[{"kind":"group","blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Test plan","ar":"خطة الاختبار"}},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"Day 28: 10 customers try the new page. Launch on day 30.","ar":"اليوم 28: 10 عملاء يجرّبون الصفحة الجديدة. الإطلاق في اليوم 30."},"gap":"xs"}]}]}},{"id":"two","text":{"en":"5 customers in week 1, fix, then 5 more in week 3","ar":"5 عملاء في الأسبوع 1، ثم إصلاح، ثم 5 آخرون في الأسبوع 3"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"basira","name":{"en":"Basira","ar":"بصيرة"},"color":"#495057","icon":"magnifying-glass","domain":"basira.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"basira.example/reports/booking-page","blocks":[{"kind":"group","blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Test plan","ar":"خطة الاختبار"}},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"Week 1: 5 customers → fix. Week 3: 5 new customers try the fixed page → final fixes. Launch in week 4.","ar":"الأسبوع 1: 5 عملاء ← إصلاح. الأسبوع 3: 5 عملاء جدد يجرّبون الصفحة المُصلحة ← إصلاحات أخيرة. الإطلاق في الأسبوع 4."},"gap":"xs"}]}]}},{"id":"survey","text":{"en":"Skip testing; email all customers a survey after launch","ar":"تخطَّ الاختبار؛ وأرسل استبيانًا لكل العملاء بعد الإطلاق"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"basira","name":{"en":"Basira","ar":"بصيرة"},"color":"#495057","icon":"magnifying-glass","domain":"basira.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"basira.example/reports/booking-page","blocks":[{"kind":"group","blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Test plan","ar":"خطة الاختبار"}},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"Launch on day 30. Email: \"How do you like our new product page?\"","ar":"الإطلاق في اليوم 30. رسالة: «ما رأيك في صفحة المنتج الجديدة؟»"},"gap":"xs"}]}]}}],"answer":["two"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P10-086","when":["ten"],"feedback":{"en":"Customers 6 to 10 mostly repeat what 1 to 5 showed, and on day 28 there's no time to fix it. Split them into two rounds.","ar":"العملاء من 6 إلى 10 يكرّرون غالبًا ما أظهره الخمسة الأوائل، وفي اليوم 28 لا وقت للإصلاح. قسّمهم على جولتين."}},{"id":"MC-P10-084","when":["survey"],"feedback":{"en":"A survey after launch collects opinions, too late to change anything. Watch people use it before it goes live.","ar":"الاستبيان بعد الإطلاق يجمع آراء، ومتأخر جدًا لتغيير أي شيء. راقب الناس يستخدمونها قبل إطلاقها."}}],"correct":{"en":"Two small rounds: find, fix, check.","ar":"جولتان صغيرتان: اكتشف، وأصلح، وتحقّق."},"explain":{"en":"With a fixed budget, small rounds with fixes in between find more problems and confirm your fixes.","ar":"مع ميزانية محدّدة، الجولات الصغيرة مع إصلاحات بينها تكشف مشكلات أكثر وتؤكّد إصلاحاتك."}},{"id":"S09","type":"card","part":"recap","icons":["person","order","warn","text"],"title":{"en":"What you did","ar":"ماذا تعلّمت"},"body":{"en":"- **Small rounds:** split 15 sessions into three rounds of 5, and 10 into two rounds of 5.\n- **Test the fix:** tested the moved photo with new people instead of shipping or asking.\n- **No percentages from 5:** replaced \"80%\" and \"60%\" with counts and the reason behind them.\n- **Honest about limits:** told the manager what a small test can and can't say, and where a real number would come from.\n\nNext: what to say, and not say, while people test.","ar":"- **جولات صغيرة:** قسّمت 15 جلسة إلى ثلاث جولات من 5، و10 إلى جولتين من 5.\n- **اختبر الإصلاح:** اختبرت نقل الصورة مع أشخاص جدد بدل الإطلاق أو السؤال.\n- **لا نِسَب من 5:** استبدلت «80%» و«60%» بالأعداد والسبب وراءها.\n- **صادق بشأن الحدود:** أخبرت المدير بما يستطيع الاختبار الصغير قوله وما لا يستطيع، ومن أين يأتي الرقم الحقيقي.\n\nالتالي: ماذا تقول، وماذا لا تقول، أثناء الاختبار."}}]}$uxg$::jsonb),
  ($uxg$P10-U06-L03$uxg$, $uxg$347da4c96c22e5fb3e20f6f5e4a104c7ff009cd374242653012cda8858fc6c4b$uxg$, $uxg${"id":"P10-U06-L03","mode":"lesson","minutes":8,"title":{"en":"Let them think aloud","ar":"دعهم يفكّرون بصوت عالٍ"},"summary":{"en":"Choose what to say, and when, while people think aloud in a test.","ar":"اختر ماذا تقول ومتى، بينما يفكّر الناس بصوت عالٍ في الاختبار."},"speaker":"sara","review_labels":{"MC-P10-088":{"en":"Don't lead or interrupt the participant","ar":"لا توجّه المشارك ولا تقاطعه"},"MC-P10-084":{"en":"Watch what people do, not what they say","ar":"راقب ما يفعله الناس، لا ما يقولونه"}},"steps":[{"id":"S01","type":"card","part":"hook","title":{"en":"\"Do you see the Reserve button?\"","ar":"«هل ترين زر احجز؟»"},"body":{"en":"In round two, Dalia stopped on the booking page and went quiet. After a few seconds I asked: \"Do you see the Reserve button?\" She said \"Oh, yes\" and tapped it.\n\nI marked her as a success. Later I watched the recording and wondered: did she find it, or did I find it for her?","ar":"في الجولة الثانية، توقّفت داليا على صفحة الحجز وصمتت. وبعد ثوانٍ سألتها: «هل ترين زر احجز؟» فقالت «آه، نعم» وضغطته.\n\nسجّلتها حالة نجاح. ثم شاهدت التسجيل لاحقًا وتساءلت: هل وجدته هي، أم وجدته أنا لها؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"basira","name":{"en":"Basira","ar":"بصيرة"},"color":"#495057","icon":"magnifying-glass","domain":"basira.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"basira.example/notes/round-2","blocks":[{"kind":"group","blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Session notes","ar":"ملاحظات الجلسة"}},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"0:42 Dalia stops, silent.","ar":"0:42 تتوقّف داليا، صامتة."},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"0:48 Me: \"Do you see the Reserve button?\"","ar":"0:48 أنا: «هل ترين زر احجز؟»"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"0:50 Dalia taps Reserve.","ar":"0:50 تضغط داليا «احجز»."},"gap":"xs"}]}]}},{"id":"S02","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P10-U06-05","part":"try","rules":["R12"],"value":{"en":"Thinking aloud (NN/g): the participant keeps talking while using the design. When they go quiet, a neutral reminder keeps them talking without pointing anywhere.","ar":"التفكير بصوت عالٍ (NN/g): يواصل المشارك الكلام أثناء استخدام التصميم. وحين يصمت، تذكير محايد يُبقيه يتكلّم دون أن يشير إلى شيء."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/thinking-aloud-the-1-usability-tool/","quote":"you ask test participants to use the system while continuously thinking out loud"},"scenario":{"en":"Next session, same moment: Rasha stops on the booking page and goes quiet. I want to know what she's thinking without helping her.","ar":"في الجلسة التالية، اللحظة نفسها: تتوقّف رشا على صفحة الحجز وتصمت. أريد أن أعرف بماذا تفكّر دون أن أساعدها."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each thing I could say. Which one should I use?","ar":"جرّب كل جملة يمكن أن أقولها. أيّ جملة تجعل رشا تقول ما تفكّر فيه دون أن أوجّهها؟"},"start":"point","options":[{"id":"point","text":{"en":"\"Do you see the Reserve button?\"","ar":"«هل ترين زر احجز؟»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"basira","name":{"en":"Basira","ar":"بصيرة"},"color":"#495057","icon":"magnifying-glass","domain":"basira.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"basira.example/notes/round-2","blocks":[{"kind":"group","blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"I say","ar":"أقول"}},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"\"Do you see the Reserve button?\"","ar":"«هل ترين زر احجز؟»"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Rasha looks for Reserve and taps it.","ar":"تبحث رشا عن «احجز» وتضغطه."},"gap":"s"}]}]}},{"id":"remind","text":{"en":"\"Remember to say what you're thinking.\"","ar":"«تذكّري أن تقولي بماذا تفكّرين.»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"basira","name":{"en":"Basira","ar":"بصيرة"},"color":"#495057","icon":"magnifying-glass","domain":"basira.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"basira.example/notes/round-2","blocks":[{"kind":"group","blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"I say","ar":"أقول"}},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"\"Remember to say what you're thinking.\"","ar":"«تذكّري أن تقولي بماذا تفكّرين.»"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Rasha: \"I'm looking for a price before I book… I thought it would be under the photo.\"","ar":"رشا: «أبحث عن السعر قبل أن أحجز… ظننته تحت الصورة.»"},"gap":"s"}]}]}},{"id":"wait","text":{"en":"Say nothing and wait until she gives up","ar":"لا تقل شيئًا وانتظر حتى تستسلم"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"basira","name":{"en":"Basira","ar":"بصيرة"},"color":"#495057","icon":"magnifying-glass","domain":"basira.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"basira.example/notes/round-2","blocks":[{"kind":"group","blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"I say","ar":"أقول"}},{"kind":"text","color":"muted","text":{"en":"(silence)","ar":"(صمت)"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Rasha scrolls for a minute, then closes the page. I don't know why.","ar":"تمرّر رشا لدقيقة، ثم تُغلق الصفحة. ولا أعرف السبب."},"gap":"s"}]}]}}],"answer":["remind"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P10-088","when":["point"],"feedback":{"en":"Naming the button tells her where to look. Now you'll never know if she would have found it, and you miss what she was really looking for.","ar":"ذكر اسم الزر يخبرها أين تنظر. والآن لن تعرف أبدًا هل كانت ستجده، ويفوتك ما كانت تبحث عنه فعلًا."}},{"id":"MC-P10-088","when":["wait"],"feedback":{"en":"Silence keeps you neutral, but her thoughts are lost. A neutral reminder brings them back without pointing anywhere.","ar":"الصمت يُبقيك محايدًا، لكن أفكارها تضيع. والتذكير المحايد يُعيدها دون أن يشير إلى أي مكان."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Which words name something on the page?","ar":"أي كلمات تذكر شيئًا على الصفحة؟"},{"en":"Which one gets her thoughts without giving her any?","ar":"أي جملة تحصل على أفكارها دون أن تعطيها أفكارًا؟"}],"correct":{"en":"A neutral reminder, and you learn she was looking for the price.","ar":"تذكير محايد، فتعرف أنها كانت تبحث عن السعر."},"explain":{"en":"The reminder asks for her thoughts but points nowhere. What she says reveals the real problem: the price wasn't where she expected.","ar":"التذكير يطلب أفكارها لكنه لا يشير إلى أي مكان. وما تقوله يكشف المشكلة الحقيقية: السعر لم يكن حيث توقّعته."},"speaker":"sara"},{"id":"S03","type":"card","part":"concept","icons":["person","text","warn","order"],"title":{"en":"Hear their thinking, keep yours out","ar":"اسمع تفكيرهم، وأبقِ تفكيرك بعيدًا"},"body":{"en":"In a think-aloud test, people use the design and say what they're thinking as they go. You hear their misunderstandings, which point straight to what to fix.\n\n- **Ask them to think aloud** at the start, in plain words.\n- **Don't name things on the screen:** \"Do you see the Reserve button?\" finds it for them.\n- **Neutral reminders only** when they go quiet: \"What are you thinking?\"\n- **Save your questions** for after the task. Questions in the middle change what they do.","ar":"في اختبار التفكير بصوت عالٍ (Think aloud)، يستخدم الناس التصميم ويقولون بماذا يفكّرون أثناء ذلك. فتسمع سوء فهمهم، وهو يشير مباشرة إلى ما يجب إصلاحه.\n\n- **اطلب منهم التفكير بصوت عالٍ** في البداية، بكلمات بسيطة.\n- **لا تذكر أشياء على الشاشة:** «هل ترين زر احجز؟» يدلّهم على الزر بدلًا من أن يجدوه.\n- **تذكير محايد فقط** حين يصمتون: «بماذا تفكّر؟»\n- **احتفظ بأسئلتك** لما بعد المهمة. فالأسئلة في المنتصف تغيّر ما يفعلونه."}},{"id":"S04","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P10-U06-05","part":"guided","rules":["R06","R15"],"value":{"en":"Thinking aloud (NN/g): when people think aloud, you hear their misconceptions, and these turn into redesign ideas. The opening instruction should ask for their thoughts without telling them what to look for.","ar":"التفكير بصوت عالٍ (NN/g): حين يفكّر الناس بصوت عالٍ، تسمع سوء فهمهم، ويتحوّل ذلك إلى أفكار لإعادة التصميم. والتعليمات في البداية يجب أن تطلب أفكارهم دون أن تخبرهم بما يبحثون عنه."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/thinking-aloud-the-1-usability-tool/","quote":"you hear their misconceptions, which usually turn into actionable redesign recommendations"},"scenario":{"en":"I'm writing what I'll say at the start of every session in round three.","ar":"أكتب ما سأقوله في بداية كل جلسة في الجولة الثالثة."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each opening. Which one should I read out?","ar":"جرّب كل افتتاحية. أيّ افتتاحية تجعل المشاركين يقولون ما يفكّرون فيه دون ذكر أي جزء من الصفحة؟"},"start":"hint","options":[{"id":"hint","text":{"en":"Explain the task and point out the new Reserve button","ar":"اشرح المهمة ونبّه إلى زر «احجز» الجديد"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"basira","name":{"en":"Basira","ar":"بصيرة"},"color":"#495057","icon":"magnifying-glass","domain":"basira.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"basira.example/notes/round-2","blocks":[{"kind":"group","blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Opening script","ar":"نص الافتتاح"}},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"\"Please book the Tuesday workshop. Tip: we moved the Reserve button up, so it's easier now.\"","ar":"«من فضلك احجز ورشة الثلاثاء. ملاحظة: نقلنا زر «احجز» للأعلى، فأصبح أسهل الآن.»"},"gap":"xs"}]}]}},{"id":"think","text":{"en":"Ask them to say what they think, see and wonder as they go","ar":"اطلب منهم أن يقولوا ما يفكّرون فيه وما يرونه وما يتساءلون عنه أثناء العمل"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"basira","name":{"en":"Basira","ar":"بصيرة"},"color":"#495057","icon":"magnifying-glass","domain":"basira.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"basira.example/notes/round-2","blocks":[{"kind":"group","blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Opening script","ar":"نص الافتتاح"}},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"\"Please book a workshop you'd like to attend. As you go, say out loud what you're looking at, what you're trying to do, and anything that confuses you. We're testing the page, not you.\"","ar":"«من فضلك احجز ورشة تودّ حضورها. وأثناء ذلك، قل بصوت عالٍ ما تنظر إليه، وما تحاول فعله، وأي شيء يُربكك. نحن نختبر الصفحة، لا نختبرك أنت.»"},"gap":"xs"}]}]}},{"id":"rate","text":{"en":"Ask them to work silently, then rate the page from 1 to 5","ar":"اطلب منهم العمل بصمت، ثم تقييم الصفحة من 1 إلى 5"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"basira","name":{"en":"Basira","ar":"بصيرة"},"color":"#495057","icon":"magnifying-glass","domain":"basira.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"basira.example/notes/round-2","blocks":[{"kind":"group","blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Opening script","ar":"نص الافتتاح"}},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"\"Please book the Tuesday workshop quietly. When you're done, rate the page from 1 to 5.\"","ar":"«من فضلك احجز ورشة الثلاثاء بهدوء. وحين تنتهي، قيّم الصفحة من 1 إلى 5.»"},"gap":"xs"}]}]}}],"answer":["think"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P10-088","when":["hint"],"feedback":{"en":"The tip tells them where Reserve is, so the test can't show whether they'd find it alone.","ar":"الملاحظة تخبرهم أين «احجز»، فلا يستطيع الاختبار أن يُظهر هل كانوا سيجدونه وحدهم."}},{"id":"MC-P10-084","when":["rate"],"feedback":{"en":"Working in silence hides the confusion you need to hear, and a 1 to 5 rating is an opinion, not what they did.","ar":"العمل بصمت يُخفي الارتباك الذي تحتاج أن تسمعه، والتقييم من 1 إلى 5 رأي، لا ما فعلوه."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Which opening mentions a part of the page?","ar":"أي افتتاحية تذكر جزءًا من الصفحة؟"},{"en":"Which one lets you hear where they get confused?","ar":"أيّها يتيح لك سماع أين يرتبكون؟"}],"correct":{"en":"They'll talk you through it, and no part of the page is named.","ar":"سيشرحون لك ما يفعلون، ولم يُذكر أي جزء من الصفحة."},"explain":{"en":"Ask for what they look at, try and wonder. Don't name buttons or say what changed. \"We're testing the page, not you\" helps people speak freely.","ar":"اطلب ما ينظرون إليه وما يحاولونه وما يتساءلون عنه. ولا تذكر أزرارًا ولا تقل ما الذي تغيّر. وعبارة «نحن نختبر الصفحة، لا نختبرك أنت» تساعد الناس على الكلام بحرية."},"speaker":"sara"},{"id":"S05","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P10-U06-05","part":"guided","rules":["R06","R15"],"value":{"en":"Usability checklist (NN/g): ask your questions after the participant finishes the task, rather than interrupting them during it. A question in the middle can change what they do next.","ar":"قائمة تحقّق الدراسات (NN/g): اطرح أسئلتك بعد أن ينهي المشارك المهمة، لا بمقاطعته أثناءها. فالسؤال في المنتصف قد يغيّر ما يفعله بعد ذلك."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/usability-checklist/","quote":"ask these questions after the participant has completed the task, rather than interrupting them during the task"},"scenario":{"en":"Mid-task, Rasha scrolls up and down the dates twice. I want to know why.","ar":"في منتصف المهمة، تمرّر رشا بين التواريخ صعودًا ونزولًا مرّتين. وأريد أن أعرف لماذا."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each timing. When should I ask?","ar":"جرّب كل توقيت. متى يجب أن أسأل؟"},"start":"now","options":[{"id":"now","text":{"en":"Stop her now: \"Why did you scroll back up?\"","ar":"أوقفها الآن: «لماذا رجعتِ للأعلى؟»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"basira","name":{"en":"Basira","ar":"بصيرة"},"color":"#495057","icon":"magnifying-glass","domain":"basira.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"basira.example/notes/round-2","blocks":[{"kind":"group","blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Session notes","ar":"ملاحظات الجلسة"}},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"1:10 Rasha scrolls the dates twice.","ar":"1:10 تمرّر رشا بين التواريخ مرّتين."},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"1:12 Me: \"Why did you scroll back up?\"","ar":"1:12 أنا: «لماذا رجعتِ للأعلى؟»"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"1:15 Rasha: \"Sorry, did I do it wrong?\" She picks the first date and books.","ar":"1:15 رشا: «آسفة، هل أخطأت؟» تختار أول تاريخ وتحجز."},"gap":"xs"}]}]}},{"id":"after","text":{"en":"Note the time, and ask after she finishes","ar":"سجّل الوقت، واسألها بعد أن تنتهي"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"basira","name":{"en":"Basira","ar":"بصيرة"},"color":"#495057","icon":"magnifying-glass","domain":"basira.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"basira.example/notes/round-2","blocks":[{"kind":"group","blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Session notes","ar":"ملاحظات الجلسة"}},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"1:10 Rasha scrolls the dates twice. (note)","ar":"1:10 تمرّر رشا بين التواريخ مرّتين. (ملاحظة)"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"2:05 Rasha books Thursday.","ar":"2:05 تحجز رشا الخميس."},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"After: \"At one point you went back to the dates. What was happening there?\"","ar":"بعدها: «في لحظة رجعتِ إلى التواريخ. ماذا كان يحدث هناك؟»"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"Rasha: \"I couldn't tell which dates still had seats.\"","ar":"رشا: «لم أعرف أي التواريخ ما زالت فيها مقاعد.»"},"gap":"xs"}]}]}},{"id":"never","text":{"en":"Don't ask at all; the scrolling speaks for itself","ar":"لا تسأل أبدًا؛ فالتمرير يكفي"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"basira","name":{"en":"Basira","ar":"بصيرة"},"color":"#495057","icon":"magnifying-glass","domain":"basira.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"basira.example/notes/round-2","blocks":[{"kind":"group","blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Session notes","ar":"ملاحظات الجلسة"}},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"1:10 Rasha scrolls the dates twice.","ar":"1:10 تمرّر رشا بين التواريخ مرّتين."},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"2:05 Rasha books Thursday.","ar":"2:05 تحجز رشا الخميس."},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"My guess: the dates are too small?","ar":"تخميني: التواريخ صغيرة جدًا؟"},"gap":"xs"}]}]}}],"answer":["after"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P10-088","when":["now"],"feedback":{"en":"Stopping her made her feel wrong, so she grabbed the first date. The interruption changed what she did.","ar":"إيقافها جعلها تشعر بالخطأ، فاختارت أول تاريخ. لقد غيّرت المقاطعة ما فعلته."}},{"id":"MC-P10-088","when":["never"],"feedback":{"en":"Without asking, you're left guessing. One neutral question after the task gets the real reason: no sign of which dates had seats.","ar":"دون سؤال، يبقى لك التخمين. وسؤال محايد واحد بعد المهمة يكشف السبب الحقيقي: لا إشارة إلى التواريخ التي فيها مقاعد."}}],"hints":[{"en":"What did Rasha do right after the question in the first option?","ar":"ماذا فعلت رشا مباشرة بعد السؤال في الخيار الأول؟"},{"en":"Which timing gets the reason without changing the task?","ar":"أي توقيت يحصل على السبب دون أن يغيّر المهمة؟"}],"correct":{"en":"She finished in her own way, and you still got the reason.","ar":"أنهت المهمة بطريقتها، وحصلت أنت على السبب أيضًا."},"explain":{"en":"Write down the moment, let them finish, then ask an open question about it. You keep both what they did and why.","ar":"سجّل اللحظة، ودعهم ينهون، ثم اطرح سؤالًا مفتوحًا عنها. فتحتفظ بما فعلوه وبالسبب معًا."},"speaker":"sara"},{"id":"S06","type":"words","skill":"SK-P10-U06-01","part":"guided","confidence":true,"rules":["R06","R15"],"value":{"en":"First rule of usability (NN/g): watch what people actually do. What people say about a task is less reliable than what you saw them do.","ar":"القاعدة الأولى في سهولة الاستخدام (NN/g): راقب ما يفعله الناس فعلًا. فما يقوله الناس عن المهمة أقل موثوقية مما رأيتهم يفعلونه."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/first-rule-of-usability-dont-listen-to-users/","quote":"Watch what people actually do."},"scenario":{"en":"Another participant, Heba, finishes and says: \"That was easy!\" But she booked Wednesday, and the task was the Tuesday workshop.","ar":"مشاركة أخرى، هبة، تنتهي وتقول: «كان ذلك سهلًا!» لكنها حجزت الأربعاء، والمهمة كانت ورشة الثلاثاء."},"prompt":{"en":"What should I write in my notes?","ar":"ماذا أكتب في ملاحظاتي ليعكس ما فعلته هبة فعلًا؟"},"options":[{"id":"easy","text":{"en":"\"Success. Heba found booking easy.\"","ar":"«نجاح. وجدت هبة الحجز سهلًا.»"}},{"id":"close","text":{"en":"\"Partial success. She was one day off and said it was easy.\"","ar":"«نجاح جزئي. أخطأت بيوم واحد وقالت إنه سهل.»"}},{"id":"fail","text":{"en":"\"Failed: booked Wednesday, not Tuesday. Said it was easy, so she didn't notice. Check how dates look.\"","ar":"«فشل: حجزت الأربعاء، لا الثلاثاء. وقالت إنه سهل، أي أنها لم تلاحظ. افحص شكل التواريخ.»"}}],"answer":["fail"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P10-084","when":["easy"],"feedback":{"en":"\"Easy\" is what she said. What she did was book the wrong day. Score what she did.","ar":"«سهل» هو ما قالته. وما فعلته هو حجز اليوم الخطأ. قيّم ما فعلته."}},{"id":"MC-P10-085","when":["close"],"feedback":{"en":"The success rule was the Tuesday workshop. Wednesday doesn't meet it, even if it's close. In real life, she would miss her workshop.","ar":"قاعدة النجاح كانت ورشة الثلاثاء. والأربعاء لا يحقّقها، حتى لو كان قريبًا. وفي الواقع كانت ستفوتها ورشتها."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Did her booking match the task?","ar":"هل طابق حجزها المهمة؟"},{"en":"What does \"easy\" plus the wrong day tell you?","ar":"ماذا يخبرك «سهل» مع اليوم الخطأ؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Scored on what she did, and her words became a clue.","ar":"قيّمتها بما فعلته، وأصبحت كلماتها دليلًا."},"explain":{"en":"She felt sure and still got it wrong, which is the most dangerous kind of error: real users won't notice either. That's a strong reason to fix how dates look.","ar":"شعرت بالثقة ومع ذلك أخطأت، وهذا أخطر أنواع الأخطاء: المستخدمون الحقيقيون لن يلاحظوا أيضًا. وهذا سبب قوي لإصلاح شكل التواريخ."},"speaker":"sara"},{"id":"S07","type":"compare","skill":"SK-P10-U06-05","part":"contrast","rules":["R11","R15"],"value":{"en":"Contrast with S05: both questions here come after the task, so timing isn't the issue. Usability checklist (NN/g): don't ask questions that could prime participants into certain behaviors or answers.","ar":"مقارنة مع الخطوة 5: السؤالان هنا بعد المهمة، فالتوقيت ليس المشكلة. قائمة تحقّق الدراسات (NN/g): لا تطرح أسئلة قد تدفع المشاركين نحو سلوك أو إجابة معيّنة."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/usability-checklist/","quote":"Don’t ask questions which could prime participants into certain behaviors that could alter results of your test"},"scenario":{"en":"After the task, I want to know how Rasha felt about the date list. I have two questions written.","ar":"بعد المهمة، أريد أن أعرف ما شعرت به رشا تجاه قائمة التواريخ. وكتبت سؤالين."},"prompt":{"en":"Which question should I ask?","ar":"أيّ سؤال يُظهر ما شعرت به رشا فعلًا؟"},"a":{"label":{"en":"Question A","ar":"السؤال A"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"basira","name":{"en":"Basira","ar":"بصيرة"},"color":"#495057","icon":"magnifying-glass","domain":"basira.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"basira.example/notes/round-2","blocks":[{"kind":"group","blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"I say","ar":"أقول"}},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"\"How was choosing a date?\"","ar":"«كيف كان اختيار التاريخ؟»"},"gap":"xs"}]}]}},"b":{"label":{"en":"Question B","ar":"السؤال B"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"basira","name":{"en":"Basira","ar":"بصيرة"},"color":"#495057","icon":"magnifying-glass","domain":"basira.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"basira.example/notes/round-2","blocks":[{"kind":"group","blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"I say","ar":"أقول"}},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"\"The date list was confusing, right?\"","ar":"«قائمة التواريخ كانت مُربكة، صحيح؟»"},"gap":"xs"}]}]}},"answer":"a","reason":{"prompt":{"en":"What makes A the better question?","ar":"ما الذي يجعل A السؤال الأفضل؟"},"options":[{"id":"short","text":{"en":"It's shorter","ar":"إنه أقصر"}},{"id":"open","text":{"en":"It doesn't suggest an answer, so her reply is her own","ar":"لا يقترح إجابة، فيكون ردّها من عندها"}},{"id":"polite","text":{"en":"It sounds friendlier","ar":"يبدو ألطف"}}],"answer":["open"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P10-088","when":["short","polite"],"feedback":{"en":"Length and tone aren't the point. B hands her the word \"confusing\" and invites her to agree.","ar":"الطول والنبرة ليسا المقصود. السؤال B يعطيها كلمة «مُربكة» ويدعوها إلى الموافقة."}}]},"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P10-088","when":["b"],"feedback":{"en":"B gives her the answer you expect. Many people just agree to be polite, so you'd hear your own idea back.","ar":"B يعطيها الإجابة التي تتوقّعها. وكثير من الناس يوافقون فقط من باب اللطف، فتسمع فكرتك أنت مرة أخرى."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Which question already contains an answer?","ar":"أي سؤال يحتوي إجابة بالفعل؟"}],"correct":{"en":"An open question, so the words are hers.","ar":"سؤال مفتوح، فتكون الكلمات كلماتها."},"explain":{"en":"Open questions like \"How was…?\" or \"What happened there?\" leave room for any answer. Questions that name a feeling push people toward it.","ar":"الأسئلة المفتوحة مثل «كيف كان…؟» أو «ماذا حدث هناك؟» تترك مجالًا لأي إجابة. والأسئلة التي تذكر شعورًا تدفع الناس نحوه."},"speaker":"sara"},{"id":"S08","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P10-U06-05","part":"independent","speaker":"nour","rules":["R14","R19"],"value":{"en":"New case. Thinking aloud (NN/g): interruptions can very easily change user behavior. The moderator should stay quiet and neutral while the participant works.","ar":"حالة جديدة. التفكير بصوت عالٍ (NN/g): المقاطعات قد تغيّر سلوك المستخدم بسهولة شديدة. ويجب أن يبقى المُدير هادئًا ومحايدًا أثناء عمل المشارك."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/thinking-aloud-the-1-usability-tool/","quote":"such interruptions can very easily change user behavior"},"scenario":{"en":"We're testing our clinic's new appointment form. A patient, Mr. Fathy, pauses at \"Visit type\" and says: \"Hmm, I'm not sure which one is a check-up.\" Our receptionist is running the session.","ar":"نختبر نموذج المواعيد الجديد في عيادتنا. يتوقّف مريض، الأستاذ فتحي، عند «نوع الزيارة» ويقول: «همم، لست متأكدًا أيّها الكشف الدوري.» وموظفة الاستقبال تُدير الجلسة."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each response from the receptionist. Which one should she use?","ar":"جرّب كل ردّ من موظفة الاستقبال. أيّ ردّ يُبقي الاختبار يُظهر ما سيفعله الأستاذ فتحي وحده؟"},"start":"explain","options":[{"id":"explain","text":{"en":"Explain: \"Check-up is 'Follow-up visit', the second one.\"","ar":"تشرح: «الكشف الدوري هو «زيارة متابعة»، الخيار الثاني.»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"basira","name":{"en":"Basira","ar":"بصيرة"},"color":"#495057","icon":"magnifying-glass","domain":"basira.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"basira.example/notes/round-2","blocks":[{"kind":"group","blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Receptionist says","ar":"تقول موظفة الاستقبال"}},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"\"Check-up is 'Follow-up visit', the second one.\"","ar":"«الكشف الدوري هو «زيارة متابعة»، الخيار الثاني.»"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Mr. Fathy picks it. The notes say: no problems.","ar":"يختاره الأستاذ فتحي. والملاحظات تقول: لا مشكلات."},"gap":"s"}]}]}},{"id":"neutral","text":{"en":"Stay neutral: \"Do what you'd do at home, and keep telling me what you think.\"","ar":"تبقى محايدة: «افعل ما كنت ستفعله في البيت، واستمر في إخباري بما تفكّر فيه.»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"basira","name":{"en":"Basira","ar":"بصيرة"},"color":"#495057","icon":"magnifying-glass","domain":"basira.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"basira.example/notes/round-2","blocks":[{"kind":"group","blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Receptionist says","ar":"تقول موظفة الاستقبال"}},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"\"Do what you'd do at home, and keep telling me what you think.\"","ar":"«افعل ما كنت ستفعله في البيت، واستمر في إخباري بما تفكّر فيه.»"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Mr. Fathy: \"I'll guess 'New problem'… I'd probably call instead.\" The notes say: visit types unclear.","ar":"الأستاذ فتحي: «سأخمّن «مشكلة جديدة»… غالبًا كنت سأتصل بدلًا من ذلك.» والملاحظات تقول: أنواع الزيارات غير واضحة."},"gap":"s"}]}]}},{"id":"quiz","text":{"en":"Ask: \"Which one do you think is right, the first or the second?\"","ar":"تسأل: «أيّهما تظنّه الصحيح، الأول أم الثاني؟»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"basira","name":{"en":"Basira","ar":"بصيرة"},"color":"#495057","icon":"magnifying-glass","domain":"basira.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"basira.example/notes/round-2","blocks":[{"kind":"group","blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Receptionist says","ar":"تقول موظفة الاستقبال"}},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"\"Which one do you think is right, the first or the second?\"","ar":"«أيّهما تظنّه الصحيح، الأول أم الثاني؟»"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Mr. Fathy reads only those two, picks the second, and moves on.","ar":"يقرأ الأستاذ فتحي هذين الخيارين فقط، ويختار الثاني، ويتابع."},"gap":"s"}]}]}}],"answer":["neutral"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P10-088","when":["explain"],"feedback":{"en":"She solved his problem, so the notes miss it. At home nobody will explain the labels.","ar":"لقد حلّت مشكلته، فلم تظهر في الملاحظات. وفي البيت لن يشرح له أحد التسميات."}},{"id":"MC-P10-088","when":["quiz"],"feedback":{"en":"Naming \"the first or the second\" narrows his choice and hints the answer is there. The test no longer shows what he'd do alone.","ar":"ذكر «الأول أم الثاني» يضيّق اختياره ويلمّح إلى أن الإجابة هناك. فلم يعد الاختبار يُظهر ما كان سيفعله وحده."}}],"correct":{"en":"She stayed neutral, and the real problem showed up.","ar":"بقيت محايدة، فظهرت المشكلة الحقيقية."},"explain":{"en":"Helping during the task hides the problem you're there to find. Stay neutral, keep them talking, and fix the labels afterwards.","ar":"المساعدة أثناء المهمة تُخفي المشكلة التي جئت لتكتشفها. ابقَ محايدًا، وأبقِهم يتكلّمون، وأصلح التسميات بعد ذلك."}},{"id":"S09","type":"card","part":"recap","icons":["person","text","warn","order"],"title":{"en":"What you did","ar":"ماذا تعلّمت"},"body":{"en":"- **Neutral reminder:** asked Rasha what she was thinking instead of naming Reserve.\n- **Think-aloud opening:** asked people to say what they see and try, without naming any button.\n- **Ask after:** noted the moment and asked once the task was done.\n- **Score what they did:** marked \"easy\" with the wrong day as a failure.\n- **Open questions:** asked \"How was…?\" instead of \"It was confusing, right?\"\n- **Don't help mid-task:** kept the clinic receptionist neutral so the real problem showed up.\n\nNext: the skill check.","ar":"- **تذكير محايد:** سألت رشا بماذا تفكّر بدل ذكر «احجز».\n- **افتتاحية التفكير بصوت عالٍ:** طلبت من الناس قول ما يرونه ويحاولونه، دون ذكر أي زر.\n- **اسأل بعدها:** سجّلت اللحظة وسألت بعد انتهاء المهمة.\n- **قيّم ما فعلوه:** اعتبرت «سهل» مع اليوم الخطأ فشلًا.\n- **أسئلة مفتوحة:** سألت «كيف كان…؟» بدل «كانت مُربكة، صحيح؟»\n- **لا مساعدة أثناء المهمة:** أبقيت موظفة الاستقبال محايدة فظهرت المشكلة الحقيقية.\n\nالتالي: اختبار المهارة."}}]}$uxg$::jsonb),
  ($uxg$P10-U06-L04$uxg$, $uxg$9e530a1191ce033787f06ad76b70c975293bab2a1315c2cfcfa8565a6efd7846$uxg$, $uxg${"id":"P10-U06-L04","mode":"check","minutes":7,"title":{"en":"Skill check: test the pickup page","ar":"اختبار المهارة: اختبر صفحة الاستلام"},"summary":{"en":"Plan, run and report a test of a camera rental pickup page on your own.","ar":"خطّط لاختبار صفحة استلام في محل تأجير كاميرات ونفّذه واعرض نتائجه، بنفسك."},"speaker":"rami","steps":[{"id":"S01","type":"card","part":"hook","title":{"en":"Adel's camera pickup page","ar":"صفحة استلام الكاميرات عند عادل"},"body":{"en":"Adel rents out cameras. Customers kept arriving at the wrong branch, so I redesigned the pickup page: the branch and pickup time now sit at the top, in bold.\n\nI'm sure it works. Your job: help me check that claim properly before Adel pays for it.\n\nThis is a skill check: no hints, and you'll see how you did at the end.","ar":"يؤجّر عادل الكاميرات. وكان العملاء يصلون إلى الفرع الخطأ، فأعدت تصميم صفحة الاستلام: الفرع ووقت الاستلام أصبحا الآن في الأعلى، بخط عريض.\n\nأنا متأكد أنها تعمل. مهمّتك: ساعدني على التحقّق من هذا الادّعاء بالطريقة الصحيحة قبل أن يدفع عادل ثمنه.\n\nهذا اختبار مهارة: بدون تلميحات، وسترى نتيجتك في النهاية."},"mock":{"app":{"id":"adasa","name":{"en":"Adasa Rentals","ar":"عدسة"},"color":"#111827","icon":"camera","domain":"adasa.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Pickup","ar":"الاستلام"},"back":true},"width":280,"caption":{"en":"My redesign","ar":"إعادة تصميمي"},"blocks":[{"kind":"group","blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Pickup","ar":"الاستلام"}},{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Heliopolis branch · Thu 10:00","ar":"فرع مصر الجديدة · الخميس 10:00"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Return: Sat by 18:00 · Dokki branch","ar":"الإرجاع: السبت قبل 18:00 · فرع الدقي"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Get directions","ar":"الاتجاهات"},"gap":"m"}]}]}},{"id":"S02","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P10-U06-01","part":"check","rules":["R19"],"value":{"en":"Skill check, first rule of usability (NN/g): watch what people actually do. Opinions and predictions don't show whether the page works.","ar":"اختبار مهارة، القاعدة الأولى في سهولة الاستخدام (NN/g): راقب ما يفعله الناس فعلًا. فالآراء والتوقّعات لا تُظهر هل تعمل الصفحة."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/first-rule-of-usability-dont-listen-to-users/","quote":"Watch what people actually do."},"scenario":{"en":"Adel asks how I'll prove customers now see the right branch.","ar":"يسألني عادل كيف سأثبت أن العملاء يرون الآن الفرع الصحيح."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each plan. Which one should I use?","ar":"جرّب كل خطة. أيّها يجب أن أستخدم؟"},"start":"staff","options":[{"id":"staff","text":{"en":"Show the page to Adel's staff and ask if it's clear","ar":"اعرض الصفحة على موظفي عادل واسألهم هل هي واضحة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"basira","name":{"en":"Basira","ar":"بصيرة"},"color":"#495057","icon":"magnifying-glass","domain":"basira.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"basira.example/plans/pickup-page","blocks":[{"kind":"group","blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Check plan","ar":"خطة التحقّق"}},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"Send the page to the 4 shop staff: \"Is the pickup info clear now?\"","ar":"أرسل الصفحة لموظفي المحل الأربعة: «هل معلومات الاستلام واضحة الآن؟»"},"gap":"xs"}]}]}},{"id":"survey","text":{"en":"Survey customers: \"Would you notice the branch at the top?\"","ar":"استبيان للعملاء: «هل كنت ستلاحظ الفرع في الأعلى؟»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"basira","name":{"en":"Basira","ar":"بصيرة"},"color":"#495057","icon":"magnifying-glass","domain":"basira.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"basira.example/plans/pickup-page","blocks":[{"kind":"group","blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Check plan","ar":"خطة التحقّق"}},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"Email 200 customers a screenshot: \"Would you notice the branch at the top? Yes / No\"","ar":"أرسل لـ 200 عميل صورة: «هل كنت ستلاحظ الفرع في الأعلى؟ نعم / لا»"},"gap":"xs"}]}]}},{"id":"watch","text":{"en":"Watch 5 customers use the page to plan their pickup","ar":"راقب 5 عملاء يستخدمون الصفحة لتنظيم استلامهم"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"basira","name":{"en":"Basira","ar":"بصيرة"},"color":"#495057","icon":"magnifying-glass","domain":"basira.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"basira.example/plans/pickup-page","blocks":[{"kind":"group","blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Check plan","ar":"خطة التحقّق"}},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"5 customers open the page on their phones: \"You've rented a camera. Plan how you'll collect it.\" I watch where they'd go and when.","ar":"5 عملاء يفتحون الصفحة على هواتفهم: «لقد استأجرت كاميرا. خطّط لطريقة استلامها.» وأراقب إلى أين سيذهبون ومتى."},"gap":"xs"}]}]}}],"answer":["watch"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P10-084","when":["staff"],"feedback":{"en":"The staff already know every branch, and they're giving opinions. Customers using the page is what shows if it works.","ar":"الموظفون يعرفون كل الفروع مسبقًا، ويعطون آراء. والعملاء الذين يستخدمون الصفحة هم من يُظهرون هل تعمل."}},{"id":"MC-P10-084","when":["survey"],"feedback":{"en":"\"Would you notice\" asks people to predict, and the question points at the branch for them. Many answers, but none show behavior.","ar":"«هل كنت ستلاحظ» تطلب من الناس التوقّع، والسؤال يشير إلى الفرع نيابةً عنهم. إجابات كثيرة، لكن لا شيء منها يُظهر السلوك."}}],"explain":{"en":"From Lesson 1: give people a real task and watch what they do. That's the only way to check a claim about what they'll see.","ar":"من الدرس 1: أعطِ الناس مهمة حقيقية وراقب ما يفعلونه. هذه الطريقة الوحيدة للتحقّق من ادّعاء حول ما سيرونه."},"speaker":"rami"},{"id":"S03","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P10-U06-02","part":"check","rules":["R19"],"value":{"en":"Skill check, success rate (NN/g): if a user doesn't do the task as specified, you can score it as a failure. That only works if \"as specified\" is written down first.","ar":"اختبار مهارة، معدّل النجاح (NN/g): إن لم يُنجز المستخدم المهمة كما حُدّدت، يمكنك اعتبارها فشلًا. وهذا لا ينجح إلا إذا كُتب «كما حُدّدت» مسبقًا."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/success-rate-the-simplest-usability-metric/","quote":"If a user does not perform a task as specified, you could be strict and score it as a failure."},"scenario":{"en":"Before the sessions, I write the rule for a successful pickup task.","ar":"قبل الجلسات، أكتب قاعدة النجاح لمهمة الاستلام."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each rule. Which one should I use?","ar":"جرّب كل قاعدة. أيّها يجب أن أستخدم؟"},"start":"looks","options":[{"id":"looks","text":{"en":"Success = they look at the top of the page","ar":"النجاح = ينظرون إلى أعلى الصفحة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"basira","name":{"en":"Basira","ar":"بصيرة"},"color":"#495057","icon":"magnifying-glass","domain":"basira.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"basira.example/plans/pickup-page","blocks":[{"kind":"group","blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Success rule","ar":"قاعدة النجاح"}},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"Success: the customer looks at the top of the page.","ar":"النجاح: ينظر العميل إلى أعلى الصفحة."},"gap":"xs"}]}]}},{"id":"says","text":{"en":"Success = they say the right branch and time, without help, within 1 minute","ar":"النجاح = يذكرون الفرع والوقت الصحيحين، دون مساعدة، خلال دقيقة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"basira","name":{"en":"Basira","ar":"بصيرة"},"color":"#495057","icon":"magnifying-glass","domain":"basira.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"basira.example/plans/pickup-page","blocks":[{"kind":"group","blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Success rule","ar":"قاعدة النجاح"}},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"Success: within 1 minute and with no help, the customer says \"Heliopolis, Thursday at 10\". Naming Dokki or the return time = fail.","ar":"النجاح: خلال دقيقة ودون مساعدة، يقول العميل «مصر الجديدة، الخميس 10». ذكر الدقي أو وقت الإرجاع = فشل."},"gap":"xs"}]}]}},{"id":"clear","text":{"en":"Success = they say the page is clear","ar":"النجاح = يقولون إن الصفحة واضحة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"basira","name":{"en":"Basira","ar":"بصيرة"},"color":"#495057","icon":"magnifying-glass","domain":"basira.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"basira.example/plans/pickup-page","blocks":[{"kind":"group","blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Success rule","ar":"قاعدة النجاح"}},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"Success: the customer says the pickup info is clear.","ar":"النجاح: يقول العميل إن معلومات الاستلام واضحة."},"gap":"xs"}]}]}}],"answer":["says"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P10-085","when":["looks"],"feedback":{"en":"Looking isn't understanding. Someone can look at the top and still head to Dokki, the return branch.","ar":"النظر ليس فهمًا. فقد ينظر أحدهم إلى الأعلى ثم يتّجه إلى الدقي، فرع الإرجاع."}},{"id":"MC-P10-084","when":["clear"],"feedback":{"en":"\"Clear\" is an opinion. The rule has to check the result: the right branch and time.","ar":"«واضحة» رأي. والقاعدة يجب أن تتحقّق من النتيجة: الفرع والوقت الصحيحان."}}],"explain":{"en":"From Lesson 1: write down what counts as success before anyone tries: a result you can check, a time limit, and what counts as a fail.","ar":"من الدرس 1: اكتب ما يُعدّ نجاحًا قبل أن يجرّب أحد: نتيجة يمكن التحقّق منها، وحدًّا زمنيًا، وما يُعدّ فشلًا."},"speaker":"rami"},{"id":"S04","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P10-U06-05","part":"check","rules":["R19"],"value":{"en":"Skill check, usability testing 101 (NN/g): the facilitator guides the session without accidentally influencing what the participant does.","ar":"اختبار مهارة، اختبار سهولة الاستخدام 101 (NN/g): يُدير الميسّر الجلسة دون أن يؤثّر دون قصد في سلوك المشارك."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/usability-testing-101/","quote":"without accidentally influencing the participant’s behavior"},"scenario":{"en":"In the second session, Nermeen scrolls past the top, stops at the map and goes quiet.","ar":"في الجلسة الثانية، تمرّر نرمين لأسفل متخطّيةً أعلى الصفحة، وتتوقّف عند الخريطة وتصمت."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each thing I could say. Which one should I use?","ar":"جرّب كل جملة يمكن أن أقولها. أيّها يجب أن أستخدم؟"},"start":"top","options":[{"id":"neutral","text":{"en":"\"What are you thinking right now?\"","ar":"«بماذا تفكّرين الآن؟»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"basira","name":{"en":"Basira","ar":"بصيرة"},"color":"#495057","icon":"magnifying-glass","domain":"basira.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"basira.example/plans/pickup-page","blocks":[{"kind":"group","blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"I say","ar":"أقول"}},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"\"What are you thinking right now?\"","ar":"«بماذا تفكّرين الآن؟»"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Nermeen: \"I skipped the bold line; I thought it was an ad. I'm looking for an address.\"","ar":"نرمين: «تجاوزت السطر العريض؛ ظننته إعلانًا. أبحث عن عنوان.»"},"gap":"s"}]}]}},{"id":"top","text":{"en":"\"The pickup info is at the top. Did you see it?\"","ar":"«معلومات الاستلام في الأعلى. هل رأيتِها؟»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"basira","name":{"en":"Basira","ar":"بصيرة"},"color":"#495057","icon":"magnifying-glass","domain":"basira.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"basira.example/plans/pickup-page","blocks":[{"kind":"group","blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"I say","ar":"أقول"}},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"\"The pickup info is at the top. Did you see it?\"","ar":"«معلومات الاستلام في الأعلى. هل رأيتِها؟»"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Nermeen scrolls up: \"Oh, Heliopolis.\" I mark a success.","ar":"تمرّر نرمين للأعلى: «آه، مصر الجديدة.» وأسجّلها نجاحًا."},"gap":"s"}]}]}},{"id":"almost","text":{"en":"\"You're doing great, you're almost there!\"","ar":"«أداؤك رائع، أوشكتِ على الوصول!»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"basira","name":{"en":"Basira","ar":"بصيرة"},"color":"#495057","icon":"magnifying-glass","domain":"basira.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"basira.example/plans/pickup-page","blocks":[{"kind":"group","blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"I say","ar":"أقول"}},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"\"You're doing great, you're almost there!\"","ar":"«أداؤك رائع، أوشكتِ على الوصول!»"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Nermeen reads the map closely and guesses the nearest branch, Dokki.","ar":"تقرأ نرمين الخريطة بتمعّن وتخمّن أقرب فرع، الدقي."},"gap":"s"}]}]}}],"answer":["neutral"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P10-088","when":["top"],"feedback":{"en":"Pointing at the top found it for her, and hid the real problem: the bold line looked like an ad.","ar":"الإشارة إلى الأعلى دلّتها عليه، وأخفت المشكلة الحقيقية: السطر العريض بدا كإعلان."}},{"id":"MC-P10-088","when":["almost"],"feedback":{"en":"\"Almost there\" tells her she's in the right place, so she digs into the map. Your words steered her.","ar":"«أوشكتِ» تخبرها أنها في المكان الصحيح، فتتعمّق في الخريطة. لقد وجّهتها كلماتك."}}],"explain":{"en":"From Lesson 3: when people go quiet, ask what they're thinking. Don't name anything on the screen or hint they're close.","ar":"من الدرس 3: حين يصمت الناس، اسألهم بماذا يفكّرون. ولا تذكر شيئًا على الشاشة ولا تلمّح أنهم قريبون."},"speaker":"rami"},{"id":"S05","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P10-U06-04","part":"check","rules":["R19"],"value":{"en":"Skill check, 5 users qual vs quant (NN/g): numbers from a small sample are imprecise, and so useless. Report counts and reasons.","ar":"اختبار مهارة، 5 مستخدمين نوعي مقابل كمّي (NN/g): الأرقام من عيّنة صغيرة غير دقيقة، وبالتالي بلا فائدة. انقل الأعداد والأسباب."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/5-test-users-qual-quant/","quote":"such numbers will be imprecise — and thus useless — if they are based on a small sample size."},"scenario":{"en":"Results: 2 of 5 named the right branch. 3 skipped the bold line because it looked like an ad, and went by the map. I'm writing the summary for Adel.","ar":"النتائج: ذكر 2 من 5 الفرع الصحيح. وتجاوز 3 السطر العريض لأنه بدا كإعلان، واعتمدوا على الخريطة. وأكتب الملخّص لعادل."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each summary. Which one should I send?","ar":"جرّب كل ملخّص. أيّ ملخّص يقول لعادل بدقّة ما حدث ولماذا؟"},"start":"pct","options":[{"id":"pct","text":{"en":"\"60% of customers miss the pickup branch.\"","ar":"«60% من العملاء يفوتهم فرع الاستلام.»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"basira","name":{"en":"Basira","ar":"بصيرة"},"color":"#495057","icon":"magnifying-glass","domain":"basira.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"basira.example/plans/pickup-page","blocks":[{"kind":"group","blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Summary for Adel","ar":"ملخّص لعادل"}},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"60% of customers miss the pickup branch.","ar":"60% من العملاء يفوتهم فرع الاستلام."},"gap":"xs"}]}]}},{"id":"some","text":{"en":"\"Some people had trouble, but overall it tested well.\"","ar":"«واجه بعض الناس صعوبة، لكن الاختبار نجح إجمالًا.»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"basira","name":{"en":"Basira","ar":"بصيرة"},"color":"#495057","icon":"magnifying-glass","domain":"basira.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"basira.example/plans/pickup-page","blocks":[{"kind":"group","blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Summary for Adel","ar":"ملخّص لعادل"}},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"Some people had trouble, but overall it tested well.","ar":"واجه بعض الناس صعوبة، لكن الاختبار نجح إجمالًا."},"gap":"xs"}]}]}},{"id":"counts","text":{"en":"Counts and the reason: \"3 of 5 skipped the bold line; it looked like an ad\"","ar":"الأعداد والسبب: «تجاوز 3 من 5 السطر العريض؛ بدا كإعلان»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"basira","name":{"en":"Basira","ar":"بصيرة"},"color":"#495057","icon":"magnifying-glass","domain":"basira.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"basira.example/plans/pickup-page","blocks":[{"kind":"group","blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Summary for Adel","ar":"ملخّص لعادل"}},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"2 of 5 named the right branch. 3 skipped the bold line because it looked like an ad, and guessed from the map. Fix: label it \"Your pickup\" and mark the branch on the map.","ar":"ذكر 2 من 5 الفرع الصحيح. وتجاوز 3 السطر العريض لأنه بدا كإعلان، وخمّنوا من الخريطة. الإصلاح: سمِّه «استلامك» وحدّد الفرع على الخريطة."},"gap":"xs"}]}]}}],"answer":["counts"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P10-087","when":["pct"],"feedback":{"en":"Three people became \"60% of customers\". Adel will read that as a fact about everyone, and the reason is gone.","ar":"تحوّل ثلاثة أشخاص إلى «60% من العملاء». وسيقرأها عادل كحقيقة عن الجميع، وضاع السبب."}},{"id":"MC-P10-087","when":["some"],"feedback":{"en":"\"Overall it tested well\" isn't true: most people failed. Report what happened and why.","ar":"«نجح إجمالًا» غير صحيح: أغلب الناس فشلوا. اذكر ما حدث ولماذا."}}],"explain":{"en":"From Lesson 2: report a small test as \"x of 5\", with the reason and the fix, never as a percentage.","ar":"من الدرس 2: اعرض نتائج الاختبار الصغير كـ «x من 5»، مع السبب والإصلاح، لا كنسبة مئوية أبدًا."},"speaker":"rami"},{"id":"S06","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P10-U06-03","part":"check","rules":["R19"],"value":{"en":"Skill check, testing with 5 users (NN/g): test with about 5 people and run as many small tests as you can afford, testing again after each fix.","ar":"اختبار مهارة، الاختبار مع 5 مستخدمين (NN/g): اختبر مع نحو 5 أشخاص وأجرِ أكبر عدد ممكن من الاختبارات الصغيرة، واختبر مجددًا بعد كل إصلاح."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/why-you-only-need-to-test-with-5-users/","quote":"The best results come from testing no more than 5 users and running as many small tests as you can afford."},"scenario":{"en":"I added the \"Your pickup\" label and the map pin. Adel can pay for 10 more sessions, and the page goes live in two weeks.","ar":"أضفت تسمية «استلامك» وعلامة الخريطة. ويستطيع عادل أن يدفع لـ 10 جلسات أخرى، والصفحة تُطلق خلال أسبوعين."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each plan. Which one should I use?","ar":"جرّب كل خطة. أيّها يجب أن أستخدم؟"},"start":"ship","options":[{"id":"ship","text":{"en":"Ship now; the fix is clear, so save the money","ar":"أطلقها الآن؛ فالإصلاح واضح، ووفّر المال"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"basira","name":{"en":"Basira","ar":"بصيرة"},"color":"#495057","icon":"magnifying-glass","domain":"basira.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"basira.example/plans/pickup-page","blocks":[{"kind":"group","blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Next steps","ar":"الخطوات التالية"}},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"Launch the fixed page tomorrow. No more sessions.","ar":"أطلق الصفحة المُصلحة غدًا. لا جلسات أخرى."},"gap":"xs"}]}]}},{"id":"rounds","text":{"en":"5 new customers this week, fix, then 5 more next week","ar":"5 عملاء جدد هذا الأسبوع، ثم إصلاح، ثم 5 آخرون الأسبوع القادم"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"basira","name":{"en":"Basira","ar":"بصيرة"},"color":"#495057","icon":"magnifying-glass","domain":"basira.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"basira.example/plans/pickup-page","blocks":[{"kind":"group","blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Next steps","ar":"الخطوات التالية"}},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"Week 1: 5 new customers, same task and success rule → fix. Week 2: 5 more on the new version → final fixes, then launch.","ar":"الأسبوع 1: 5 عملاء جدد، المهمة وقاعدة النجاح نفسهما ← إصلاح. الأسبوع 2: 5 آخرون على النسخة الجديدة ← إصلاحات أخيرة، ثم الإطلاق."},"gap":"xs"}]}]}},{"id":"ten","text":{"en":"All 10 sessions on the day before launch","ar":"الجلسات العشر كلها في اليوم السابق للإطلاق"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"basira","name":{"en":"Basira","ar":"بصيرة"},"color":"#495057","icon":"magnifying-glass","domain":"basira.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"basira.example/plans/pickup-page","blocks":[{"kind":"group","blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Next steps","ar":"الخطوات التالية"}},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"Day 13: 10 customers try the fixed page. Launch on day 14.","ar":"اليوم 13: 10 عملاء يجرّبون الصفحة المُصلحة. الإطلاق في اليوم 14."},"gap":"xs"}]}]}}],"answer":["rounds"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P10-086","when":["ship"],"feedback":{"en":"The first design also looked clear to you, and 3 of 5 missed it. The fix needs its own test.","ar":"التصميم الأول بدا واضحًا لك أيضًا، وفات 3 من 5. والإصلاح يحتاج اختباره الخاص."}},{"id":"MC-P10-086","when":["ten"],"feedback":{"en":"Sessions 6 to 10 mostly repeat 1 to 5, and the day before launch leaves no time to fix anything.","ar":"الجلسات من 6 إلى 10 تكرّر غالبًا ما أظهرته الخمس الأولى، واليوم السابق للإطلاق لا يترك وقتًا لإصلاح أي شيء."}}],"explain":{"en":"From Lesson 2: test the fix with new people, in small rounds, with time to fix between them.","ar":"من الدرس 2: اختبر الإصلاح مع أشخاص جدد، في جولات صغيرة، مع وقت للإصلاح بينها."},"speaker":"rami"}]}$uxg$::jsonb),
  ($uxg$P12-U01-L01$uxg$, $uxg$aacd21e908f3d65077bfc5cc9de5a9d14661322c46178c34070d1ddff0b9652b$uxg$, $uxg${"id":"P12-U01-L01","mode":"lesson","minutes":7,"title":{"en":"Start from the problem, not from AI","ar":"ابدأ من المشكلة، لا من الذكاء الاصطناعي"},"summary":{"en":"Decide where AI really helps a grocery app, and where a simple rule works better.","ar":"قرّر أين يساعد الذكاء الاصطناعي تطبيق بقالة فعلًا، وأين تعمل قاعدة بسيطة أفضل."},"speaker":"tarek","review_labels":{"MC-P12-001":{"en":"Start from the user's problem, not the technology","ar":"ابدأ من مشكلة المستخدم، لا من التقنية"},"MC-P12-002":{"en":"A simple rule often works better","ar":"القاعدة البسيطة غالبًا تعمل أفضل"},"MC-P12-003":{"en":"Keep predictable things predictable","ar":"أبقِ ما يعتمد عليه الناس في مكانه"},"MC-P12-004":{"en":"AI fits personal, predictive and language tasks","ar":"الذكاء الاصطناعي يناسب الاقتراحات الشخصية والتوقّع وفهم اللغة"}},"steps":[{"id":"S01","type":"card","part":"hook","title":{"en":"\"Add AI to the app\"","ar":"«أضيفوا ذكاءً اصطناعيًا للتطبيق»"},"body":{"en":"I manage an online grocery app. Our CEO came back from a conference and said: \"Every app has AI now. Add AI to ours.\"\n\nI have one month of the team's time. Where should it go?","ar":"أدير تطبيق بقالة أونلاين. ورجع مديرنا التنفيذي من مؤتمر وقال: «كل التطبيقات فيها ذكاء اصطناعي الآن. أضيفوه لتطبيقنا.»\n\nعندي شهر واحد من وقت الفريق. أين أضعه؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"sallah","name":{"en":"Sallah","ar":"سلّة"},"color":"#2E9E5B","icon":"basket","domain":"sallah.example"},"tabbar":{"active":0,"items":[{"icon":"house","text":{"en":"Home","ar":"الرئيسية"}},{"icon":"tag","text":{"en":"Offers","ar":"العروض"}},{"icon":"receipt","text":{"en":"Orders","ar":"طلباتي"}},{"icon":"user","text":{"en":"Account","ar":"حسابي"}}]},"appbar":{"logo":true,"actions":[{"icon":"shopping-cart","count":3}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"searchbar","text":{"en":"Search tomatoes, rice, milk…","ar":"ابحث عن طماطم، أرز، حليب…"}},{"kind":"card","gap":"m","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Your last order","ar":"طلبك السابق"}},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"14 items · EGP 860 · Thursday","ar":"14 منتجًا · 860 جنيه · الخميس"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"button","style":"outline","icon":"arrow-counter-clockwise","text":{"en":"Order again","ar":"اطلب مرة أخرى"},"gap":"s"}]},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Fresh today","ar":"طازج اليوم"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"listitem","art":"food-salad","text":{"en":"Tomatoes","ar":"طماطم"},"sub":{"en":"1 kg","ar":"1 كجم"},"value":{"en":"EGP 25","ar":"25 جنيه"}},{"kind":"listitem","art":"bread","text":{"en":"Baladi bread","ar":"خبز بلدي"},"sub":{"en":"5 loaves","ar":"5 أرغفة"},"value":{"en":"EGP 10","ar":"10 جنيه"}}],"overlay":{"type":"banner","blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","avatar":{"text":"Adel Fahmy","art":"man-2"},"text":{"en":"Adel (CEO)","ar":"عادل (المدير التنفيذي)"},"sub":{"en":"Every app has AI now. Add AI to ours.","ar":"كل التطبيقات فيها ذكاء اصطناعي الآن. أضيفوه لتطبيقنا."}}]}}},{"id":"S02","type":"choose","skill":"SK-P12-U01-01","part":"try","rules":["R12"],"value":{"en":"Try first. User Needs (People + AI): even the best AI fails if it doesn't give people unique value. Find a real problem first, then ask if AI solves it in a unique way.","ar":"جرّب أولًا. احتياجات المستخدم (People + AI): حتى أفضل ذكاء اصطناعي يفشل إذا لم يقدّم للناس قيمة فريدة. ابحث عن مشكلة حقيقية أولًا، ثم اسأل إن كان الذكاء الاصطناعي يحلّها بطريقة فريدة."},"ref":{"url":"https://pair.withgoogle.com/chapter/user-needs/","quote":"Even the best AI will fail if it doesn’t provide unique value to users."},"prompt":{"en":"What should the team ask first?","ar":"ماذا يجب أن يسأل الفريق أولًا؟"},"options":[{"id":"rivals","text":{"en":"\"What AI features do other grocery apps have?\"","ar":"«ما ميزات الذكاء الاصطناعي في تطبيقات البقالة الأخرى؟»"}},{"id":"smart","text":{"en":"\"How can we use AI to make our app smarter?\"","ar":"«كيف نستخدم الذكاء الاصطناعي ليصبح تطبيقنا أذكى؟»"}},{"id":"problem","text":{"en":"\"What problem do our customers have that we don't solve well today?\"","ar":"«ما المشكلة التي عند عملائنا ولا نحلّها جيدًا اليوم؟»"}}],"answer":["problem"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P12-001","when":["rivals","smart"],"feedback":{"en":"Both start from the technology. A feature that solves no real problem won't be used, however smart it is.","ar":"كلا السؤالين يبدأ من التقنية. والميزة التي لا تحلّ مشكلة حقيقية لن يستخدمها أحد، مهما كانت ذكية."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Which question is about customers, not about AI?","ar":"أي سؤال عن العملاء، لا عن الذكاء الاصطناعي؟"},{"en":"You can only judge a solution once you know the problem.","ar":"لا يمكنك الحكم على حل إلا بعد أن تعرف المشكلة."}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Problem first, then the tool.","ar":"صحيح. المشكلة أولًا، ثم الأداة."},"explain":{"en":"AI is a tool, not a goal. Find what customers struggle with, then check if AI is the best way to fix it.","ar":"الذكاء الاصطناعي أداة، لا هدف. اعرف ما يعانيه العملاء، ثم تأكّد إن كان الذكاء الاصطناعي أفضل طريقة لإصلاحه."}},{"id":"S03","type":"card","part":"concept","icons":["target","idea","list","ok"],"title":{"en":"Problem first, then ask: does AI help?","ar":"المشكلة أولًا، ثم اسأل: هل يساعد الذكاء الاصطناعي؟"},"body":{"en":"Ask \"How might we solve this problem?\", not \"Can we use AI to…?\"\n\n- **AI is often better for:** suggestions that differ for each person, predicting what comes next, understanding speech and language, and recognising things like faces.\n- **A simple rule is often better for:** things that must stay in the same place (Home, Cancel), simple fixed information (a card form), and cases where people need to know exactly why something happened.\n- **Simpler wins ties:** a rule is easier to build, explain and fix.","ar":"اسأل «كيف يمكن أن نحلّ هذه المشكلة؟» (How might we)، لا «هل نستخدم الذكاء الاصطناعي لـ…؟»\n\n- **الذكاء الاصطناعي غالبًا أفضل في:** اقتراحات تختلف لكل شخص، وتوقّع ما سيحدث، وفهم الكلام واللغة، والتعرّف على أشياء مثل الوجوه.\n- **القاعدة البسيطة غالبًا أفضل في:** الأشياء التي يجب أن تبقى في مكانها (الرئيسية، الإلغاء)، والمعلومات البسيطة الثابتة (نموذج بيانات البطاقة)، والحالات التي يحتاج فيها الناس أن يعرفوا سبب ما حدث بالضبط.\n- **عند التعادل، اختر الأبسط:** القاعدة أسهل في البناء والشرح والإصلاح."}},{"id":"S04","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P12-U01-02","part":"guided","rules":["R06"],"value":{"en":"User Needs (People + AI): a rule-based solution often works just as well as AI, or better, and is easier to build, explain, debug and maintain.","ar":"احتياجات المستخدم (People + AI): الحل المبني على قاعدة يعمل غالبًا بنفس جودة الذكاء الاصطناعي أو أفضل، وهو أسهل في البناء والشرح والإصلاح والصيانة."},"ref":{"url":"https://pair.withgoogle.com/chapter/user-needs/","quote":"Often a rule or heuristic-based solution will work just as well, if not better, than an AI version."},"scenario":{"en":"Customers told us their top problem: \"I buy the same things every week, and adding them one by one takes forever.\"","ar":"أخبرنا العملاء بأكبر مشكلة عندهم: «أشتري نفس الأشياء كل أسبوع، وإضافتها واحدة واحدة تأخذ وقتًا طويلًا جدًا.»"},"prompt":{"en":"Tap each option to see the change. Which one lets customers fill their weekly basket fastest, with no wrong items?","ar":"اضغط على كل خيار لترى التغيير. أي خيار يجعل العملاء يملؤون سلة الأسبوع بأسرع شكل، بدون منتجات خطأ؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"sallah","name":{"en":"Sallah","ar":"سلّة"},"color":"#2E9E5B","icon":"basket","domain":"sallah.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Basket","ar":"السلة"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Added one by one · 3 of 14 items","ar":"أضفتها واحدًا واحدًا · 3 من 14 منتجًا"},"color":"muted"},{"kind":"listitem","art":"food-salad","text":{"en":"Tomatoes · 2 kg","ar":"طماطم · 2 كجم"},"value":{"en":"EGP 50","ar":"50 جنيه"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"listitem","art":"bread","text":{"en":"Baladi bread · 10","ar":"خبز بلدي · 10"},"value":{"en":"EGP 20","ar":"20 جنيه"}},{"kind":"listitem","art":"box","text":{"en":"Rice · 5 kg","ar":"أرز · 5 كجم"},"value":{"en":"EGP 175","ar":"175 جنيه"}},{"kind":"searchbar","text":{"en":"Search the next item…","ar":"ابحث عن المنتج التالي…"},"gap":"m","note":{"en":"11 more searches to go","ar":"باقي 11 بحثًا"}}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Checkout · EGP 245","ar":"الدفع · 245 جنيه"}}]},"options":[{"id":"repeat","text":{"en":"A \"Repeat last order\" button that fills the basket, ready to edit","ar":"زر «كرّر الطلب السابق» يملأ السلة، ويمكن تعديلها"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"sallah","name":{"en":"Sallah","ar":"سلّة"},"color":"#2E9E5B","icon":"basket","domain":"sallah.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Basket","ar":"السلة"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"banner","tone":"good","icon":"check-circle","text":{"en":"14 items added from your last order. Change anything you like.","ar":"أُضيف 14 منتجًا من طلبك السابق. غيّر ما تريد."}},{"kind":"listitem","art":"food-salad","text":{"en":"Tomatoes · 2 kg","ar":"طماطم · 2 كجم"},"value":{"en":"EGP 50","ar":"50 جنيه"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"listitem","art":"bread","text":{"en":"Baladi bread · 10","ar":"خبز بلدي · 10"},"value":{"en":"EGP 20","ar":"20 جنيه"}},{"kind":"listitem","art":"box","text":{"en":"Rice · 5 kg","ar":"أرز · 5 كجم"},"value":{"en":"EGP 175","ar":"175 جنيه"}},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"+ 11 more items","ar":"+ 11 منتجًا آخر"},"color":"muted","gap":"s"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Checkout · EGP 860","ar":"الدفع · 860 جنيه"}}]}},{"id":"guess","text":{"en":"AI that guesses next week's basket and orders it by itself","ar":"ذكاء اصطناعي يتوقّع سلة الأسبوع القادم ويطلبها وحده"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"sallah","name":{"en":"Sallah","ar":"سلّة"},"color":"#2E9E5B","icon":"basket","domain":"sallah.example"},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"screen":"lock","blocks":[{"kind":"notification","title":{"en":"We ordered your basket ✨","ar":"طلبنا سلتك ✨"},"text":{"en":"Our AI picked 16 items for this week · EGP 910 · arriving Thursday","ar":"اختار الذكاء الاصطناعي 16 منتجًا لهذا الأسبوع · 910 جنيه · يصل الخميس"},"time":{"en":"now","ar":"الآن"}}]}},{"id":"chat","text":{"en":"An AI chat where customers type what they want","ar":"مساعد محادثة بالذكاء الاصطناعي (Chatbot) يكتب له العملاء ما يريدون"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"sallah","name":{"en":"Sallah","ar":"سلّة"},"color":"#2E9E5B","icon":"basket","domain":"sallah.example"},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Sallah assistant","ar":"مساعد سلّة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"chat","from":"ai","text":{"en":"Hi! What would you like to buy today?","ar":"أهلًا! ماذا تريد أن تشتري اليوم؟"}},{"kind":"chat","from":"me","text":{"en":"2 kg tomatoes, 10 bread, 5 kg rice, milk, eggs, cheese, oil, sugar, tea…","ar":"2 كجم طماطم، 10 خبز، 5 كجم أرز، حليب، بيض، جبن، زيت، سكر، شاي…"},"time":"9:41"}],"footer":[{"kind":"composer","text":{"en":"Type the rest of your list…","ar":"اكتب بقية قائمتك…"}}]}}],"answer":["repeat"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P12-002","when":["guess"],"feedback":{"en":"Customers already know what they want: the same as last week. A wrong guess means wrong groceries at the door.","ar":"العملاء يعرفون ما يريدون بالفعل: نفس طلب الأسبوع الماضي. والتوقّع الخطأ يعني مشتريات خطأ تصل إلى الباب."}},{"id":"MC-P12-002","when":["chat"],"feedback":{"en":"Typing every item is still slow. The problem is repetition, and a simple button removes it.","ar":"كتابة كل منتج ما زالت بطيئة. والمشكلة هي التكرار، والزر البسيط يُزيله."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Do customers need anything guessed here?","ar":"هل يحتاج العملاء هنا إلى من يخمّن ما يريدون؟"},{"en":"Which option is simplest and still solves the problem?","ar":"أي خيار هو الأبسط ويحلّ المشكلة؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Right. A simple rule solves it, no AI needed.","ar":"صحيح. قاعدة بسيطة تحلّها، بلا حاجة للذكاء الاصطناعي."},"explain":{"en":"When the answer is known and fixed, a rule is faster to build and never guesses wrong.","ar":"حين تكون الإجابة معروفة وثابتة، فالقاعدة أسرع في البناء ولا تخمّن خطأً أبدًا."},"speaker":"tarek"},{"id":"S05","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P12-U01-02","part":"guided","rules":["R06"],"value":{"en":"User Needs (People + AI): AI is probably better than a rule for recommending different content to different users.","ar":"احتياجات المستخدم (People + AI): الذكاء الاصطناعي غالبًا أفضل من القاعدة في اقتراح محتوى مختلف لكل مستخدم."},"ref":{"url":"https://pair.withgoogle.com/chapter/user-needs/","quote":"Recommending different content to different users."},"scenario":{"en":"We listed three more ideas for the month.","ar":"كتبنا ثلاث أفكار أخرى لهذا الشهر."},"prompt":{"en":"Tap each idea to see its screen. Which idea really needs AI?","ar":"اضغط على كل فكرة لترى شاشتها. أي فكرة تحتاج الذكاء الاصطناعي فعلًا؟"},"options":[{"id":"card","text":{"en":"The form where customers type their card details","ar":"النموذج الذي يكتب فيه العملاء بيانات البطاقة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"sallah","name":{"en":"Sallah","ar":"سلّة"},"color":"#2E9E5B","icon":"basket","domain":"sallah.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Add a card","ar":"أضف بطاقة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"bank-card","size":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Card number","ar":"رقم البطاقة"},"text":"0000 0000 0000 0000","icon":"credit-card","gap":"m"},{"kind":"row","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Expiry","ar":"تاريخ الانتهاء"},"text":"MM/YY"},{"kind":"field","label":"CVV","text":"123"}]}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Save card","ar":"احفظ البطاقة"}}]}},{"id":"recipes","text":{"en":"Recipe ideas that match what each customer usually buys","ar":"أفكار وصفات تناسب ما يشتريه كل عميل عادة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"sallah","name":{"en":"Sallah","ar":"سلّة"},"color":"#2E9E5B","icon":"basket","domain":"sallah.example"},"tabbar":{"active":0,"items":[{"icon":"house","text":{"en":"Home","ar":"الرئيسية"}},{"icon":"tag","text":{"en":"Offers","ar":"العروض"}},{"icon":"receipt","text":{"en":"Orders","ar":"طلباتي"}},{"icon":"user","text":{"en":"Account","ar":"حسابي"}}]},"appbar":{"logo":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Cook with what you buy","ar":"اطبخ ممّا تشتريه"}},{"kind":"card","art":"food-koshary","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"badge","icon":"sparkle","text":{"en":"For you","ar":"مقترح لك"}},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Koshari","ar":"كشري"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"You often buy rice, lentils and pasta","ar":"تشتري الأرز والعدس والمكرونة كثيرًا"},"gap":"xs"}]}]}},{"id":"hours","text":{"en":"A page with our delivery hours","ar":"صفحة بمواعيد التوصيل"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"sallah","name":{"en":"Sallah","ar":"سلّة"},"color":"#2E9E5B","icon":"basket","domain":"sallah.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Delivery hours","ar":"مواعيد التوصيل"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"clock","text":{"en":"Saturday to Thursday","ar":"السبت إلى الخميس"},"value":"8:00–23:00"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"clock","text":{"en":"Friday","ar":"الجمعة"},"value":"13:00–23:00"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"truck","text":{"en":"Free delivery","ar":"توصيل مجاني"},"value":{"en":"over EGP 300","ar":"فوق 300 جنيه"}}]}}],"answer":["recipes"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P12-004","when":["card","hours"],"feedback":{"en":"This is the same for every customer and never changes. A plain form or page does the job.","ar":"هذا لا يختلف من عميل لآخر ولا يتغيّر. ونموذج أو صفحة عادية تكفي."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Which idea is different for every customer?","ar":"أي فكرة تختلف لكل عميل؟"},{"en":"AI shines when there's no single right answer for everyone.","ar":"الذكاء الاصطناعي يتميّز حين لا توجد إجابة واحدة صحيحة للجميع."}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Personal suggestions are a good fit for AI.","ar":"صحيح. الاقتراحات الشخصية تناسب الذكاء الاصطناعي."},"explain":{"en":"A rule can't write different recipe ideas for thousands of baskets. AI can learn each customer's habits.","ar":"القاعدة لا تستطيع كتابة أفكار وصفات مختلفة لآلاف السلال. أما الذكاء الاصطناعي فيتعلّم عادات كل عميل."},"speaker":"tarek"},{"id":"S06","type":"compare","skill":"SK-P12-U01-02","part":"contrast","confidence":true,"rules":["R11"],"value":{"en":"Contrast: AI everywhere vs AI in one place. User Needs (People + AI): sometimes the most valuable part of an experience is that it's predictable, like a Home or Cancel button that stays put.","ar":"مقارنة: ذكاء اصطناعي في كل مكان مقابل مكان واحد. احتياجات المستخدم (People + AI): أحيانًا أهم ما في التجربة أنها متوقّعة، مثل زر الرئيسية أو الإلغاء الذي يبقى في مكانه."},"ref":{"url":"https://pair.withgoogle.com/chapter/user-needs/","quote":"Sometimes the most valuable part of the core experience is its predictability, regardless of context or additional user input."},"scenario":{"en":"The team built two versions of the home screen with recipe ideas.","ar":"بنى الفريق نسختين من الشاشة الرئيسية فيهما أفكار الوصفات."},"prompt":{"en":"Which home screen should we ship?","ar":"أي شاشة رئيسية نعتمد، ليجد العملاء ما يحتاجونه في مكانه كل مرة؟"},"a":{"label":{"en":"A: AI changes the order of the whole menu on every visit.","ar":"A: الذكاء الاصطناعي يغيّر ترتيب القائمة كلها في كل زيارة."},"mock":{"app":{"id":"sallah","name":{"en":"Sallah","ar":"سلّة"},"color":"#2E9E5B","icon":"basket","domain":"sallah.example"},"appbar":{"logo":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"searchbar","text":{"en":"Search Sallah","ar":"ابحث في سلّة"}},{"kind":"row","gap":"m","note":{"en":"Yesterday: Search · Fruit · Recipes · My orders · Offers","ar":"أمس: بحث · فاكهة · وصفات · طلباتي · عروض"},"blocks":[{"kind":"chip","icon":"cooking-pot","text":{"en":"Recipes","ar":"وصفات"}},{"kind":"chip","icon":"tag","text":{"en":"Offers","ar":"عروض"}},{"kind":"chip","icon":"receipt","text":{"en":"My orders","ar":"طلباتي"}},{"kind":"chip","icon":"orange-slice","text":{"en":"Fruit","ar":"فاكهة"}}]},{"kind":"card","art":"food-koshary","gap":"m","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Koshari tonight?","ar":"كشري الليلة؟"}}]}],"tabbar":{"active":0,"items":[{"icon":"cooking-pot","text":{"en":"Recipes","ar":"وصفات"}},{"icon":"house","text":{"en":"Home","ar":"الرئيسية"}},{"icon":"user","text":{"en":"Account","ar":"حسابي"}},{"icon":"receipt","text":{"en":"Orders","ar":"طلباتي"}}]}}},"b":{"label":{"en":"B: The menu stays the same, and AI fills one \"For you\" section.","ar":"B: القائمة تبقى كما هي، والذكاء الاصطناعي يملأ قسمًا واحدًا هو «مقترح لك»."},"mock":{"app":{"id":"sallah","name":{"en":"Sallah","ar":"سلّة"},"color":"#2E9E5B","icon":"basket","domain":"sallah.example"},"tabbar":{"active":0,"items":[{"icon":"house","text":{"en":"Home","ar":"الرئيسية"}},{"icon":"tag","text":{"en":"Offers","ar":"العروض"}},{"icon":"receipt","text":{"en":"Orders","ar":"طلباتي"}},{"icon":"user","text":{"en":"Account","ar":"حسابي"}}]},"appbar":{"logo":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"searchbar","text":{"en":"Search Sallah","ar":"ابحث في سلّة"}},{"kind":"row","gap":"m","blocks":[{"kind":"chip","icon":"receipt","text":{"en":"My orders","ar":"طلباتي"}},{"kind":"chip","icon":"tag","text":{"en":"Offers","ar":"عروض"}},{"kind":"chip","icon":"orange-slice","text":{"en":"Fruit","ar":"فاكهة"}}]},{"kind":"card","art":"food-koshary","gap":"m","blocks":[{"kind":"badge","icon":"sparkle","text":{"en":"For you","ar":"مقترح لك"}},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Koshari tonight?","ar":"كشري الليلة؟"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"You have rice and lentils in your basket","ar":"في سلتك أرز وعدس"},"gap":"xs"}]}]}},"answer":"b","reason":{"prompt":{"en":"Why is B better?","ar":"لماذا B أفضل؟"},"options":[{"id":"place","text":{"en":"Customers find the menu in the same place every time, and AI helps only where variety is useful","ar":"العملاء يجدون القائمة في نفس المكان كل مرة، والذكاء الاصطناعي يساعد فقط حيث التنوّع مفيد"}},{"id":"less","text":{"en":"Less AI is always better","ar":"كلما قلّ الذكاء الاصطناعي كان أفضل دائمًا"}},{"id":"pretty","text":{"en":"B has a nicer colour","ar":"B لونه أجمل"}}],"answer":["place"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P12-003","when":["less","pretty"],"feedback":{"en":"The point is predictability. Menus must stay put; suggestions can change.","ar":"المهم أن تبقى الشاشة متوقّعة. القوائم يجب أن تبقى في مكانها؛ أما الاقتراحات فيمكن أن تتغيّر."}}]},"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P12-003","when":["a"],"feedback":{"en":"In A, \"My orders\" is in a new place every day. Customers have to search for it each time.","ar":"في A، «طلباتي» في مكان جديد كل يوم. فيضطر العملاء للبحث عنها كل مرة."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Where is \"My orders\" in each version, today and yesterday?","ar":"أين «طلباتي» في كل نسخة، اليوم وأمس؟"},{"en":"Which parts should change, and which should stay?","ar":"أي الأجزاء يجب أن تتغيّر، وأيها يجب أن يبقى؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Fixed menu, smart suggestions.","ar":"صحيح. قائمة ثابتة، واقتراحات ذكية."},"explain":{"en":"Use AI where variety helps, and keep the things people rely on in the same place.","ar":"استخدم الذكاء الاصطناعي حيث يفيد التنوّع، وأبقِ ما يعتمد عليه الناس في نفس المكان."},"speaker":"tarek"},{"id":"S07","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P12-U01-01","part":"independent","speaker":"karim","rules":["R14"],"value":{"en":"New case. User Needs (People + AI): question whether adding AI will improve the product at all. Fix the real need first.","ar":"حالة جديدة. احتياجات المستخدم (People + AI): اسأل إن كانت إضافة الذكاء الاصطناعي ستحسّن المنتج أصلًا. أصلح الاحتياج الحقيقي أولًا."},"ref":{"url":"https://pair.withgoogle.com/chapter/user-needs/","quote":"It’s important to question whether adding AI to your product will improve it."},"scenario":{"en":"I build a bus ticket app. The team wants an AI chat assistant. Our top complaint: people can't find how to get a refund. The refund button is hidden in Settings.","ar":"أبني تطبيقًا لتذاكر الحافلات. والفريق يريد مساعد محادثة بالذكاء الاصطناعي. وأكبر شكوى عندنا: الناس لا يعرفون كيف يستردّون أموالهم. وزر الاسترداد مخفي في الإعدادات."},"prompt":{"en":"Tap each option to see the change. Which one lets people get a refund without asking anyone?","ar":"اضغط على كل خيار لترى التغيير. أي خيار يجعل الناس يستردّون المال دون أن يسألوا أحدًا؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rehla","name":{"en":"Rehla","ar":"رحلة"},"color":"#7048E8","icon":"bus","domain":"rehla.example"},"tabbar":{"active":1,"items":[{"icon":"magnifying-glass","text":{"en":"Search","ar":"بحث"}},{"icon":"ticket","text":{"en":"My tickets","ar":"تذاكري"}},{"icon":"gear","text":{"en":"Settings","ar":"الإعدادات"}}]},"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"My tickets","ar":"تذاكري"}},"blocks":[{"kind":"card","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Cairo → Alexandria","ar":"القاهرة ← الإسكندرية"}},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Fri 14 Nov · 10:30 · Seat 14","ar":"الجمعة 14 نوفمبر · 10:30 · المقعد 14"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"EGP 180","ar":"180 جنيه"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","style":"outline","icon":"qr-code","text":{"en":"Show ticket","ar":"اعرض التذكرة"},"gap":"s"}]}]},"options":[{"id":"bot","text":{"en":"Build the AI chat, so it can explain where the refund button is","ar":"نبني مساعد المحادثة بالذكاء الاصطناعي، ليشرح مكان زر الاسترداد"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rehla","name":{"en":"Rehla","ar":"رحلة"},"color":"#7048E8","icon":"bus","domain":"rehla.example"},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Rehla assistant","ar":"مساعد رحلة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"chat","from":"me","text":{"en":"How do I get my money back?","ar":"كيف أستردّ أموالي؟"},"time":"9:41"},{"kind":"chat","from":"ai","text":{"en":"Go to Settings › Payments › Past trips › choose the ticket › Refund.","ar":"اذهب إلى الإعدادات › المدفوعات › الرحلات السابقة › اختر التذكرة › استرداد."}}],"footer":[{"kind":"composer","text":{"en":"Ask Rehla anything","ar":"اسأل رحلة أي شيء"}}]}},{"id":"move","text":{"en":"Put a \"Refund\" button on each ticket","ar":"نضع زر «استرداد» على كل تذكرة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rehla","name":{"en":"Rehla","ar":"رحلة"},"color":"#7048E8","icon":"bus","domain":"rehla.example"},"tabbar":{"active":1,"items":[{"icon":"magnifying-glass","text":{"en":"Search","ar":"بحث"}},{"icon":"ticket","text":{"en":"My tickets","ar":"تذاكري"}},{"icon":"gear","text":{"en":"Settings","ar":"الإعدادات"}}]},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"My tickets","ar":"تذاكري"}},"blocks":[{"kind":"card","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Cairo → Alexandria","ar":"القاهرة ← الإسكندرية"}},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Fri 14 Nov · 10:30 · Seat 14","ar":"الجمعة 14 نوفمبر · 10:30 · المقعد 14"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"EGP 180","ar":"180 جنيه"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"row","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"button","style":"outline","icon":"qr-code","text":{"en":"Show ticket","ar":"اعرض التذكرة"}},{"kind":"button","style":"text","icon":"arrow-u-up-left","text":{"en":"Refund","ar":"استرداد"}}]}]}]}},{"id":"predict","text":{"en":"Build AI that predicts who will ask for a refund","ar":"نبني ذكاءً اصطناعيًا يتوقّع من سيطلب الاسترداد"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rehla","name":{"en":"Rehla","ar":"رحلة"},"color":"#7048E8","icon":"bus","domain":"rehla.example"},"frame":"wide","caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"url":"admin.rehla.example/refund-risk","blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Refund risk this week","ar":"احتمال الاسترداد هذا الأسبوع"}},{"kind":"table","gap":"s","head":[{"en":"Passenger","ar":"الراكب"},{"en":"Trip","ar":"الرحلة"},{"en":"Will ask for a refund","ar":"سيطلب استردادًا"}],"rows":[[{"en":"Mostafa Kamel","ar":"مصطفى كامل"},{"en":"Cairo → Alexandria","ar":"القاهرة ← الإسكندرية"},"82%"],[{"en":"Rana Adel","ar":"رنا عادل"},{"en":"Cairo → Hurghada","ar":"القاهرة ← الغردقة"},"64%"]]}]}}],"answer":["move"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P12-001","when":["bot","predict"],"feedback":{"en":"The problem is a hidden button. AI would work around it; moving the button fixes it.","ar":"المشكلة زر مخفي. والذكاء الاصطناعي سيتحايل عليها فقط؛ أما نقل الزر فيحلّها."}}],"hints":[{"en":"What exactly are people struggling with?","ar":"ما الذي يعانيه الناس بالضبط؟"},{"en":"Which option removes the problem itself?","ar":"أي خيار يُزيل المشكلة نفسها؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Fix the real problem; it may not need AI at all.","ar":"صحيح. أصلح المشكلة الحقيقية؛ وقد لا تحتاج ذكاءً اصطناعيًا أبدًا."},"explain":{"en":"AI that explains a confusing design is a patch. First make the design clear.","ar":"الذكاء الاصطناعي الذي يشرح تصميمًا مُربكًا مجرد ترقيع. اجعل التصميم واضحًا أولًا."}},{"id":"S08","type":"card","part":"recap","icons":["target","ok","idea","list"],"title":{"en":"What you did","ar":"ماذا تعلّمت"},"body":{"en":"- **Problem first:** you asked what customers struggle with before talking about AI.\n- **Simple rule:** you chose \"Repeat last order\" over an AI guess.\n- **Good fit for AI:** you picked personal recipe ideas.\n- **Keep it predictable:** you kept the menu fixed and put AI in one section.\n- **Fix the cause:** you moved the refund button instead of adding a chat.\n\nNext lesson: should AI do the task, or help people do it?","ar":"- **المشكلة أولًا:** سألت عمّا يعانيه العملاء قبل الحديث عن الذكاء الاصطناعي.\n- **قاعدة بسيطة:** اخترت «كرّر الطلب السابق» بدل تخمين الذكاء الاصطناعي.\n- **مناسب للذكاء الاصطناعي:** اخترت أفكار الوصفات الشخصية.\n- **ما يعتمد عليه الناس يبقى ثابتًا:** أبقيت القائمة في مكانها ووضعت الذكاء الاصطناعي في قسم واحد.\n- **أصلح السبب:** نقلت زر الاسترداد بدل إضافة مساعد محادثة.\n\nالدرس التالي: هل يقوم الذكاء الاصطناعي بالمهمة، أم يساعد الناس على القيام بها؟"}}]}$uxg$::jsonb),
  ($uxg$P12-U01-L02$uxg$, $uxg$9e7e88ab18db76699b432af5e2a1cdde035ebeebc3119b06d6bed29f17e00bd6$uxg$, $uxg${"id":"P12-U01-L02","mode":"lesson","minutes":7,"title":{"en":"Should AI do it, or help people do it?","ar":"هل يقوم الذكاء الاصطناعي بالمهمة، أم يساعد الناس عليها؟"},"summary":{"en":"Choose which shop-owner tasks AI should take over and which it should only help with.","ar":"اختر أي مهام صاحب المتجر يتولّاها الذكاء الاصطناعي، وأيها يساعد فيها فقط."},"speaker":"sara","review_labels":{"MC-P12-005":{"en":"Automate boring, repetitive tasks","ar":"أتمت المهام المملّة والمتكرّرة"},"MC-P12-006":{"en":"Help with tasks people enjoy or own","ar":"ساعد في المهام التي يستمتع بها الناس أو يتحمّلون مسؤوليتها"},"MC-P12-007":{"en":"Keep a way to check what AI does","ar":"اترك طريقة لمراجعة ما يفعله الذكاء الاصطناعي"}},"steps":[{"id":"S01","type":"card","part":"hook","title":{"en":"\"Let AI do everything\"","ar":"«دعوا الذكاء الاصطناعي يفعل كل شيء»"},"body":{"en":"I'm designing an app for small shop owners. The team wants AI to take over every task: the accounts, the messages to customers, even the shop's flyers.\n\nBut when I talk to owners, some tasks they hate, and some they love.","ar":"أصمّم تطبيقًا لأصحاب المتاجر الصغيرة. والفريق يريد أن يتولّى الذكاء الاصطناعي كل المهام: الحسابات، والرسائل للعملاء، وحتى إعلانات المتجر.\n\nلكن حين أتحدّث مع أصحاب المتاجر، أجد مهام يكرهونها، ومهام يحبّونها."},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dukkani","name":{"en":"Dukkani","ar":"دكّاني"},"color":"#1F6FEB","icon":"storefront","domain":"dukkani.example"},"appbar":{"logo":true,"actions":[{"icon":"bell","count":3,"aria":{"en":"Notifications","ar":"الإشعارات"}}]},"tabbar":{"active":0,"items":[{"icon":"house","text":{"en":"Home","ar":"الرئيسية"}},{"icon":"wallet","text":{"en":"Money","ar":"المال"}},{"icon":"users","text":{"en":"Customers","ar":"العملاء"}},{"icon":"user","text":{"en":"Account","ar":"حسابي"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Waiting for you this month","ar":"مهامّك هذا الشهر"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"receipt","text":{"en":"Sort receipts","ar":"تصنيف الإيصالات"},"sub":{"en":"300 receipts not sorted","ar":"300 إيصال غير مصنّف"},"chevron":true,"gap":"s"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"chat-circle-text","text":{"en":"Eid thank-you messages","ar":"رسائل شكر العيد"},"sub":{"en":"120 loyal customers","ar":"120 عميلًا دائمًا"},"chevron":true},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"paint-brush","text":{"en":"Shop opening flyer","ar":"إعلان افتتاح المتجر"},"sub":{"en":"Opening on 20 Nov","ar":"الافتتاح يوم 20 نوفمبر"},"chevron":true}]}},{"id":"S02","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P12-U01-03","part":"try","rules":["R12"],"value":{"en":"Try first. User Needs (People + AI): automate tasks that are difficult, unpleasant, or need scale, and keep a way for people to check the result.","ar":"جرّب أولًا. احتياجات المستخدم (People + AI): أتمت المهام الصعبة أو المزعجة أو التي تحتاج حجمًا كبيرًا، واترك طريقة ليراجع الناس النتيجة."},"ref":{"url":"https://pair.withgoogle.com/chapter/user-needs/","quote":"Automate tasks that are difficult, unpleasant, or where there’s a need for scale"},"scenario":{"en":"Every month, owners sort about 300 receipts into groups: rent, stock, transport. They all say they hate it.","ar":"كل شهر، يصنّف أصحاب المتاجر نحو 300 إيصال إلى مجموعات: إيجار، بضاعة، نقل. وكلهم يقولون إنهم يكرهون ذلك."},"prompt":{"en":"Tap each option to see it. What should AI do with the receipts?","ar":"اضغط على كل خيار لتراه. ماذا يفعل الذكاء الاصطناعي بالإيصالات؟"},"options":[{"id":"one","text":{"en":"Suggest a group for each receipt, and the owner taps OK on all 300","ar":"يقترح مجموعة لكل إيصال، ويضغط صاحب المتجر «موافق» على الـ 300"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dukkani","name":{"en":"Dukkani","ar":"دكّاني"},"color":"#1F6FEB","icon":"storefront","domain":"dukkani.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Receipts","ar":"الإيصالات"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"progress","value":1,"label":{"en":"1 of 300 checked","ar":"راجعتَ 1 من 300"}},{"kind":"card","gap":"m","blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","art":"receipt","text":{"en":"Cairo Electric · EGP 850","ar":"كهرباء القاهرة · 850 جنيه"},"sub":{"en":"3 Nov","ar":"3 نوفمبر"}},{"kind":"badge","icon":"sparkle","text":{"en":"Suggested: Bills","ar":"مقترح: فواتير"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"OK","ar":"موافق"},"gap":"s"}]}]}},{"id":"auto","text":{"en":"Sort them all, then show a summary the owner can check and fix","ar":"يصنّفها كلها، ثم يعرض ملخّصًا يراجعه صاحب المتجر ويصلحه"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dukkani","name":{"en":"Dukkani","ar":"دكّاني"},"color":"#1F6FEB","icon":"storefront","domain":"dukkani.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Receipts","ar":"الإيصالات"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"banner","tone":"good","icon":"sparkle","text":{"en":"300 receipts sorted. Check the groups and fix any mistake.","ar":"صنّفنا 300 إيصال. راجِع المجموعات وأصلح أي خطأ."}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"house","text":{"en":"Rent","ar":"الإيجار"},"value":"12","chevron":true,"gap":"s"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"package","text":{"en":"Stock","ar":"البضاعة"},"value":"210","chevron":true},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"truck","text":{"en":"Transport","ar":"النقل"},"value":"78","chevron":true},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"question","text":{"en":"Not sure","ar":"غير مؤكّدة"},"badge":{"text":{"en":"9 to check","ar":"9 للمراجعة"},"tone":"warn"},"chevron":true}]}},{"id":"none","text":{"en":"Nothing; money tasks should stay manual","ar":"لا شيء؛ مهام المال يجب أن تبقى يدوية"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dukkani","name":{"en":"Dukkani","ar":"دكّاني"},"color":"#1F6FEB","icon":"storefront","domain":"dukkani.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Receipts","ar":"الإيصالات"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Pick a group for each receipt","ar":"اختر مجموعة لكل إيصال"}},{"kind":"listitem","art":"receipt","text":{"en":"Cairo Electric · EGP 850","ar":"كهرباء القاهرة · 850 جنيه"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"select","label":{"en":"Group","ar":"المجموعة"},"text":{"en":"Choose…","ar":"اختر…"}},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"299 more receipts","ar":"299 إيصالًا آخر"},"gap":"m"}]}}],"answer":["auto"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P12-005","when":["one"],"feedback":{"en":"Tapping OK 300 times is almost as boring as the task. Owners want this job gone, with a quick check at the end.","ar":"الضغط على «موافق» 300 مرة يكاد يكون مملًّا مثل المهمة نفسها. وأصحاب المتاجر يريدون التخلّص من هذا العمل، مع مراجعة سريعة في النهاية."}},{"id":"MC-P12-005","when":["none"],"feedback":{"en":"Nobody enjoys this, and the rules are clear. It's a good task to hand over, as long as owners can check it.","ar":"لا أحد يستمتع بهذا، والقواعد واضحة. فهي مهمة مناسبة لتسليمها للذكاء الاصطناعي، بشرط أن يستطيع أصحاب المتاجر مراجعتها."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Do owners want to do this task at all?","ar":"هل يريد أصحاب المتاجر القيام بهذه المهمة أصلًا؟"},{"en":"Which option takes the job away but still lets them check?","ar":"أي خيار يأخذ العمل منهم ويتركهم يراجعون؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Automate the boring task, and keep a quick check.","ar":"صحيح. أتمت المهمة المملّة، واترك مراجعة سريعة."},"explain":{"en":"Boring, repetitive tasks with clear rules are good to automate. A summary to check keeps people in charge.","ar":"المهام المملّة والمتكرّرة ذات القواعد الواضحة مناسبة للأتمتة. وملخّص للمراجعة يُبقي القرار بيد الناس."},"speaker":"sara"},{"id":"S03","type":"card","part":"concept","icons":["cut","person","warn","ok"],"title":{"en":"Automate, or help?","ar":"أتمتة (Automate) أم مساعدة (Augment)؟"},"body":{"en":"- **Automate (AI does it):** for tasks that are boring, repetitive, hard or dangerous, or that people lack the time or skill for. Best when everyone agrees on the right way.\n- **Help (AI assists):** for tasks people enjoy, feel responsible for, or care about, when the stakes are high, or when what they want is hard to put in words.\n- **Always a way to check:** even when AI does the task, let people preview, edit or undo.","ar":"- **الأتمتة (Automate) – الذكاء الاصطناعي يقوم بالمهمة:** للمهام المملّة أو المتكرّرة أو الصعبة أو الخطرة، أو التي لا يملك الناس وقتها أو مهارتها. وهي الأفضل حين يتّفق الجميع على الطريقة الصحيحة.\n- **المساعدة (Augment) – الذكاء الاصطناعي يساعد:** للمهام التي يستمتع بها الناس، أو يشعرون بمسؤوليتها، أو تهمّهم، أو حين تكون المخاطر عالية، أو حين يصعب وصف ما يريدونه بالكلمات.\n- **طريقة للمراجعة دائمًا:** حتى حين يقوم الذكاء الاصطناعي بالمهمة، اجعل الناس يعاينونها أو يعدّلونها أو يتراجعون عنها."}},{"id":"S04","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P12-U01-03","part":"guided","rules":["R06"],"value":{"en":"User Needs (People + AI): for tasks that carry social obligations, people prefer to stay in control and responsible.","ar":"احتياجات المستخدم (People + AI): في المهام التي فيها التزام اجتماعي، يفضّل الناس أن يبقوا متحكّمين ومسؤولين."},"ref":{"url":"https://pair.withgoogle.com/chapter/user-needs/","quote":"For tasks like these, people prefer to remain in control and responsible to fulfill the social obligations they take on."},"scenario":{"en":"Before Eid, owners send thank-you messages to loyal customers. They say these messages keep their customers close.","ar":"قبل العيد، يرسل أصحاب المتاجر رسائل شكر للعملاء الدائمين. ويقولون إن هذه الرسائل تُبقي عملاءهم قريبين منهم."},"prompt":{"en":"Tap each option to see it. How should AI help with these messages?","ar":"اضغط على كل خيار لتراه. كيف يساعد الذكاء الاصطناعي في هذه الرسائل؟"},"options":[{"id":"send","text":{"en":"Write and send all the messages by itself","ar":"يكتب كل الرسائل ويرسلها وحده"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dukkani","name":{"en":"Dukkani","ar":"دكّاني"},"color":"#1F6FEB","icon":"storefront","domain":"dukkani.example"},"screen":"lock","blocks":[{"kind":"notification","title":{"en":"120 Eid messages sent ✨","ar":"أُرسلت 120 رسالة عيد ✨"},"text":{"en":"Our AI wrote and sent a thank-you to every loyal customer.","ar":"كتب الذكاء الاصطناعي رسالة شكر وأرسلها لكل عميل دائم."},"time":{"en":"now","ar":"الآن"}}]}},{"id":"none","text":{"en":"Not at all; owners type every message","ar":"لا يساعد أبدًا؛ أصحاب المتاجر يكتبون كل رسالة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dukkani","name":{"en":"Dukkani","ar":"دكّاني"},"color":"#1F6FEB","icon":"storefront","domain":"dukkani.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Eid messages","ar":"رسائل العيد"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","avatar":{"text":"Mona Saad","art":"woman-2"},"text":{"en":"Mona Saad","ar":"منى سعد"},"sub":{"en":"Customer for 3 years","ar":"عميلة منذ 3 سنوات"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Message","ar":"الرسالة"},"text":{"en":"Type your message…","ar":"اكتب رسالتك…"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"1 of 120 customers","ar":"1 من 120 عميلًا"},"gap":"s"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Send","ar":"أرسل"}}]}},{"id":"draft","text":{"en":"Draft each message with the customer's name, for the owner to edit and send","ar":"يكتب مسودة لكل رسالة باسم العميل، ليعدّلها صاحب المتجر ويرسلها"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dukkani","name":{"en":"Dukkani","ar":"دكّاني"},"color":"#1F6FEB","icon":"storefront","domain":"dukkani.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Eid messages","ar":"رسائل العيد"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","avatar":{"text":"Mona Saad","art":"woman-2"},"text":{"en":"Mona Saad","ar":"منى سعد"},"sub":{"en":"Customer for 3 years","ar":"عميلة منذ 3 سنوات"}},{"kind":"badge","icon":"sparkle","text":{"en":"Draft · edit before you send","ar":"مسودة · عدّلها قبل الإرسال"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","filled":true,"text":{"en":"Eid Mubarak, Mona! Thank you for 3 years with us. Your favourite dates are back in stock.","ar":"كل عام وأنتِ بخير يا منى! شكرًا لثلاث سنوات معنا. وتمورك المفضّلة عادت إلى المتجر."},"gap":"xs"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Send to Mona","ar":"أرسل إلى منى"}}]}}],"answer":["draft"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P12-006","when":["send"],"feedback":{"en":"The message matters because it comes from the owner. Sent by AI alone, it loses that, and the owner can't fix a wrong one.","ar":"الرسالة مهمة لأنها من صاحب المتجر. وإذا أرسلها الذكاء الاصطناعي وحده، تفقد هذه القيمة، ولا يستطيع صاحب المتجر إصلاح رسالة خطأ."}},{"id":"MC-P12-006","when":["none"],"feedback":{"en":"Owners keep the personal touch either way. A draft just saves them typing the same opening 50 times.","ar":"صاحب المتجر يحتفظ باللمسة الشخصية في الحالتين. وكل ما تفعله المسودة أنها توفّر عليه كتابة نفس البداية 50 مرة."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Who should the message really come from?","ar":"ممّن يجب أن تأتي الرسالة فعلًا؟"},{"en":"Which option saves time and keeps the owner in charge?","ar":"أي خيار يوفّر الوقت ويُبقي صاحب المتجر متحكّمًا؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Right. AI helps; the owner speaks.","ar":"صحيح. الذكاء الاصطناعي يساعد؛ وصاحب المتجر هو من يتكلّم."},"explain":{"en":"When a task builds relationships, help people do it faster, but leave the final word to them.","ar":"حين تبني المهمة علاقات، ساعد الناس على أدائها أسرع، لكن اترك الكلمة الأخيرة لهم."},"speaker":"sara"},{"id":"S05","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P12-U01-03","part":"guided","rules":["R06"],"value":{"en":"User Needs (People + AI): when people have a vision they can't put into words, they prefer to stay in control so they can see it through.","ar":"احتياجات المستخدم (People + AI): حين يكون عند الناس تصوّر لا يستطيعون وصفه بالكلمات، يفضّلون أن يبقوا متحكّمين ليحقّقوه."},"ref":{"url":"https://pair.withgoogle.com/chapter/user-needs/","quote":"In these kinds of situations, people prefer staying in control so they can see their vision through."},"scenario":{"en":"Owners make a flyer for their shop's opening. Many say: \"I can picture it, but I can't describe it.\"","ar":"أصحاب المتاجر يصمّمون إعلانًا لافتتاح متجرهم. وكثيرون يقولون: «أتخيّله، لكن لا أستطيع وصفه.»"},"prompt":{"en":"Tap each option to see it. How should AI help with the flyer?","ar":"اضغط على كل خيار لتراه. كيف يساعد الذكاء الاصطناعي في الإعلان؟"},"options":[{"id":"tools","text":{"en":"Offer layouts and colours to try, and let the owner pick and adjust","ar":"يقدّم تخطيطات (Layouts) وألوانًا للتجربة، ويختار صاحب المتجر ويعدّل"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dukkani","name":{"en":"Dukkani","ar":"دكّاني"},"color":"#1F6FEB","icon":"storefront","domain":"dukkani.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Opening flyer","ar":"إعلان الافتتاح"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Pick a layout to start","ar":"اختر تصميمًا لتبدأ"}},{"kind":"row","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"card","art":"shelf","blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Layout 1","ar":"تصميم 1"}}]},{"kind":"card","art":"box","blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Layout 2","ar":"تصميم 2"}}]},{"kind":"card","art":"people","blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Layout 3","ar":"تصميم 3"}}]}]},{"kind":"chips","label":{"en":"Colours","ar":"الألوان"},"items":[{"text":{"en":"Green","ar":"أخضر"},"on":true},{"text":{"en":"Gold","ar":"ذهبي"}},{"text":{"en":"Red","ar":"أحمر"}}],"gap":"m"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Edit this layout","ar":"عدّل هذا التصميم"}}]}},{"id":"one","text":{"en":"Make the whole flyer from one sentence and print it","ar":"يصمّم الإعلان كله من جملة واحدة ويطبعه"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dukkani","name":{"en":"Dukkani","ar":"دكّاني"},"color":"#1F6FEB","icon":"storefront","domain":"dukkani.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Opening flyer","ar":"إعلان الافتتاح"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","filled":true,"label":{"en":"Describe your flyer in one sentence","ar":"صِف إعلانك في جملة واحدة"},"text":{"en":"A flyer for my shop's opening","ar":"إعلان لافتتاح متجري"}},{"kind":"card","art":"shelf","gap":"m","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Grand opening!","ar":"الافتتاح الكبير!"}}]},{"kind":"banner","tone":"info","icon":"printer","text":{"en":"Sent to the printer · 200 copies","ar":"أُرسل إلى الطابعة · 200 نسخة"},"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"brief","text":{"en":"Ask the owner to write a full description first","ar":"يطلب من صاحب المتجر كتابة وصف كامل أولًا"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dukkani","name":{"en":"Dukkani","ar":"دكّاني"},"color":"#1F6FEB","icon":"storefront","domain":"dukkani.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Opening flyer","ar":"إعلان الافتتاح"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Before we start, describe the flyer in detail: layout, colours, fonts, photos and text.","ar":"قبل أن نبدأ، صِف الإعلان بالتفصيل: التصميم والألوان والخطوط والصور والنص."}},{"kind":"field","height":140,"text":{"en":"Write at least 100 words…","ar":"اكتب 100 كلمة على الأقل…"},"gap":"s"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","tone":"off","text":{"en":"Next","ar":"التالي"}}]}}],"answer":["tools"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P12-006","when":["one"],"feedback":{"en":"One sentence can't hold the picture in the owner's head. They'd get a flyer that isn't theirs.","ar":"جملة واحدة لا تكفي لنقل الصورة التي في ذهن صاحب المتجر. وسيحصل على إعلان لا يعبّر عنه."}},{"id":"MC-P12-006","when":["brief"],"feedback":{"en":"That's the part they said they can't do. Let them react to options instead of describing.","ar":"هذا بالضبط ما قالوا إنهم لا يستطيعونه. دعهم يختارون من خيارات بدل أن يصفوا."}}],"hints":[{"en":"What did owners say they can't do?","ar":"ماذا قال أصحاب المتاجر إنهم لا يستطيعون فعله؟"},{"en":"Which option lets them see and choose?","ar":"أي خيار يجعلهم يرون ويختارون؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Right. AI gives options; the owner shapes the result.","ar":"صحيح. الذكاء الاصطناعي يعطي خيارات؛ وصاحب المتجر يحدّد شكل النتيجة."},"explain":{"en":"When taste matters and is hard to explain, help people explore. Don't decide for them.","ar":"حين يكون الذوق مهمًا ويصعب شرحه، ساعد الناس على التجربة. ولا تقرّر عنهم."},"speaker":"sara"},{"id":"S06","type":"compare","skill":"SK-P12-U01-03","part":"contrast","confidence":true,"rules":["R11"],"value":{"en":"Contrast: automation with and without a check. User Needs (People + AI): even when you automate a task, there should almost always be an option for human oversight.","ar":"مقارنة: أتمتة مع مراجعة وبدونها. احتياجات المستخدم (People + AI): حتى حين تؤتمت مهمة، يجب أن يكون هناك دائمًا تقريبًا خيار ليراجع الإنسان."},"ref":{"url":"https://pair.withgoogle.com/chapter/user-needs/","quote":"Even when you choose to automate a task, there should almost always be an option for human oversight"},"scenario":{"en":"Paying suppliers is boring, so we're automating it. The AI reads invoices from the owner's email. Two designs:","ar":"دفع مستحقات الموردين مملّ، لذا سنؤتمته. والذكاء الاصطناعي يقرأ الفواتير من بريد صاحب المتجر. وهذان تصميمان:"},"prompt":{"en":"Which design should we ship?","ar":"أي تصميم نعتمد ليدفع للموردين دون أن يضيع مال صاحب المتجر؟"},"a":{"label":{"en":"A: AI prepares the payments, and the owner approves the list.","ar":"A: الذكاء الاصطناعي يجهّز المدفوعات، وصاحب المتجر يوافق على القائمة."},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dukkani","name":{"en":"Dukkani","ar":"دكّاني"},"color":"#1F6FEB","icon":"storefront","domain":"dukkani.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Supplier payments","ar":"مدفوعات الموردين"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"badge","icon":"sparkle","text":{"en":"Ready to pay · 3 invoices","ar":"جاهزة للدفع · 3 فواتير"}},{"kind":"listitem","avatar":{"text":"Nile Dairy"},"text":{"en":"Nile Dairy","ar":"ألبان النيل"},"sub":{"en":"From your email · 2 Nov","ar":"من بريدك · 2 نوفمبر"},"value":{"en":"EGP 4,200","ar":"4,200 جنيه"},"check":true,"gap":"s"},{"kind":"listitem","avatar":{"text":"Delta Bakery"},"text":{"en":"Delta Bakery","ar":"مخبز الدلتا"},"sub":{"en":"From your email · 3 Nov","ar":"من بريدك · 3 نوفمبر"},"value":{"en":"EGP 1,150","ar":"1,150 جنيه"},"check":true}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Review and pay","ar":"راجِع وادفع"}}]}},"b":{"label":{"en":"B: AI pays every invoice it finds, right away.","ar":"B: الذكاء الاصطناعي يدفع كل فاتورة يجدها، فورًا."},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dukkani","name":{"en":"Dukkani","ar":"دكّاني"},"color":"#1F6FEB","icon":"storefront","domain":"dukkani.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Supplier payments","ar":"مدفوعات الموردين"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"banner","tone":"good","icon":"check-circle","text":{"en":"Paid automatically · 3 invoices","ar":"دُفعت تلقائيًا · 3 فواتير"}},{"kind":"listitem","avatar":{"text":"Nile Dairy"},"text":{"en":"Nile Dairy","ar":"ألبان النيل"},"sub":{"en":"Paid today","ar":"دُفعت اليوم"},"value":{"en":"EGP 4,200","ar":"4,200 جنيه"},"badge":{"text":{"en":"Paid","ar":"مدفوعة"},"tone":"good"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"listitem","avatar":{"text":"Delta Bakery"},"text":{"en":"Delta Bakery","ar":"مخبز الدلتا"},"sub":{"en":"Paid today","ar":"دُفعت اليوم"},"value":{"en":"EGP 1,150","ar":"1,150 جنيه"},"badge":{"text":{"en":"Paid","ar":"مدفوعة"},"tone":"good"}}]}},"answer":"a","reason":{"prompt":{"en":"Why is A better?","ar":"لماذا A أفضل؟"},"options":[{"id":"check","text":{"en":"The task is still automated, but the owner can catch a wrong or fake invoice before money leaves","ar":"المهمة تبقى مؤتمتة، لكن صاحب المتجر يستطيع اكتشاف فاتورة خطأ أو مزيّفة قبل خروج المال"}},{"id":"slow","text":{"en":"Payments should always be slow","ar":"المدفوعات يجب أن تكون بطيئة دائمًا"}},{"id":"trust","text":{"en":"AI can't read invoices","ar":"الذكاء الاصطناعي لا يستطيع قراءة الفواتير"}}],"answer":["check"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P12-007","when":["slow","trust"],"feedback":{"en":"The AI does the boring work in both. A just adds one quick check before an action that's hard to undo.","ar":"الذكاء الاصطناعي يقوم بالعمل المملّ في التصميمين. وكل ما يضيفه A مراجعة سريعة قبل إجراء يصعب التراجع عنه."}}]},"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P12-007","when":["b"],"feedback":{"en":"In B, a wrong amount or a fake invoice is paid before anyone sees it. Money is hard to get back.","ar":"في B، المبلغ الخطأ أو الفاتورة المزيّفة تُدفع قبل أن يراها أحد. والمال صعب استرجاعه."}}],"hints":[{"en":"What happens in each design if one invoice is fake?","ar":"ماذا يحدث في كل تصميم إذا كانت إحدى الفواتير مزيّفة؟"},{"en":"Which one lets the owner check before paying?","ar":"أيهما يجعل صاحب المتجر يراجع قبل الدفع؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Automate the work, keep the final check.","ar":"صحيح. أتمت العمل، وأبقِ المراجعة الأخيرة."},"explain":{"en":"Automation saves time. A preview before money moves keeps the owner safe.","ar":"الأتمتة توفّر الوقت. والمعاينة قبل خروج المال تحمي صاحب المتجر."},"speaker":"sara"},{"id":"S07","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P12-U01-03","part":"independent","speaker":"hana","rules":["R14"],"value":{"en":"New case. User Needs (People + AI): automate tasks that are unpleasant or need scale, ideally ones where the people who do them agree on the right way.","ar":"حالة جديدة. احتياجات المستخدم (People + AI): أتمت المهام المزعجة أو التي تحتاج حجمًا كبيرًا، ويُفضّل أن تكون مهام يتّفق من يقومون بها على طريقتها الصحيحة."},"ref":{"url":"https://pair.withgoogle.com/chapter/user-needs/","quote":"and ideally ones where people who currently do it can agree on the “correct” way to do it."},"scenario":{"en":"Every week I spend 3 hours planning my coaches' shifts. The rules are clear and the coaches agree on them: their free hours, and no more than 30 hours a week.","ar":"كل أسبوع أقضي 3 ساعات في تخطيط ورديات المدرّبين. والقواعد واضحة والمدرّبون متّفقون عليها: ساعاتهم المتاحة، وألّا تزيد على 30 ساعة أسبوعيًا."},"prompt":{"en":"Tap each option to see it. How should AI help me?","ar":"اضغط على كل خيار لتراه. كيف يساعدني الذكاء الاصطناعي؟"},"options":[{"id":"check","text":{"en":"I plan the shifts, and AI checks each one for mistakes","ar":"أخطّط الورديات أنا، والذكاء الاصطناعي يراجع كل واحدة بحثًا عن أخطاء"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"admin.nashat.example/shifts","blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Coach shifts · week 46","ar":"ورديات المدرّبين · الأسبوع 46"}},{"kind":"table","gap":"s","head":[{"en":"Coach","ar":"المدرّب"},{"en":"Sun","ar":"الأحد"},{"en":"Mon","ar":"الاثنين"},{"en":"Hours","ar":"الساعات"}],"rows":[[{"en":"Laila","ar":"ليلى"},"8–14","—","6"],[{"en":"Omar","ar":"عمر"},{"en":"type…","ar":"اكتب…"},"",""]]},{"kind":"banner","tone":"warn","icon":"sparkle","text":{"en":"AI check: Omar is over 30 hours.","ar":"مراجعة الذكاء الاصطناعي: عمر تجاوز 30 ساعة."},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"You fill every cell by hand","ar":"تملأ كل خانة بيدك"},"gap":"xs"}]}},{"id":"auto","text":{"en":"AI plans the week from the rules, and I check it before it's sent","ar":"الذكاء الاصطناعي يخطّط الأسبوع من القواعد، وأراجعه قبل إرساله"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"admin.nashat.example/shifts","blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Coach shifts · week 46","ar":"ورديات المدرّبين · الأسبوع 46"}},{"kind":"badge","icon":"sparkle","text":{"en":"Draft by AI · follows free hours and the 30-hour rule","ar":"مسودة من الذكاء الاصطناعي · تتبع الساعات الحرة وقاعدة الـ 30 ساعة"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"table","gap":"s","head":[{"en":"Coach","ar":"المدرّب"},{"en":"Sun","ar":"الأحد"},{"en":"Mon","ar":"الاثنين"},{"en":"Hours","ar":"الساعات"}],"rows":[[{"en":"Laila","ar":"ليلى"},"8–14","—","28"],[{"en":"Omar","ar":"عمر"},"14–20","8–14","30"]]},{"kind":"row","gap":"m","blocks":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Send to coaches","ar":"أرسل للمدرّبين"}},{"kind":"button","style":"outline","text":{"en":"Edit","ar":"عدّل"}}]}]}},{"id":"hand","text":{"en":"Keep planning by hand; schedules are personal","ar":"أستمر في التخطيط يدويًا؛ فالجداول شخصية"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"admin.nashat.example/shifts","blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Coach shifts · week 46","ar":"ورديات المدرّبين · الأسبوع 46"}},{"kind":"table","gap":"s","head":[{"en":"Coach","ar":"المدرّب"},{"en":"Sun","ar":"الأحد"},{"en":"Mon","ar":"الاثنين"},{"en":"Hours","ar":"الساعات"}],"rows":[[{"en":"Laila","ar":"ليلى"},"","",""],[{"en":"Omar","ar":"عمر"},"","",""]]},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"About 3 hours a week","ar":"حوالي 3 ساعات كل أسبوع"},"gap":"s","note":{"en":"Every week, by hand","ar":"كل أسبوع، يدويًا"}}]}}],"answer":["auto"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P12-005","when":["check","hand"],"feedback":{"en":"This task is long, boring and has clear rules everyone agrees on. That's the best kind of task to hand over.","ar":"هذه المهمة طويلة ومملّة ولها قواعد واضحة يتّفق عليها الجميع. وهذا أفضل نوع من المهام لتسليمه."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Does Hana enjoy this task?","ar":"هل تستمتع هناء بهذه المهمة؟"},{"en":"Do the coaches agree on the rules?","ar":"هل يتّفق المدرّبون على القواعد؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Clear rules and a boring task: automate it, and check it.","ar":"صحيح. قواعد واضحة ومهمة مملّة: أتمتها، وراجِعها."},"explain":{"en":"When everyone agrees on the right answer, AI can produce it. Hana keeps the final look.","ar":"حين يتّفق الجميع على الإجابة الصحيحة، يستطيع الذكاء الاصطناعي إنتاجها. وتبقى المراجعة الأخيرة لهناء."}},{"id":"S08","type":"card","part":"recap","icons":["cut","person","ok","warn"],"title":{"en":"What you did","ar":"ماذا تعلّمت"},"body":{"en":"- **Automate the boring:** you let AI sort receipts, with a summary to check.\n- **Help with the personal:** AI drafts Eid messages; the owner edits and sends.\n- **Help with taste:** AI offers flyer options; the owner chooses.\n- **Keep a check:** you made the owner approve payments first.\n- **Clear rules:** you automated the shift plan, with a final check.\n\nNext lesson: when a mistake costs a lot.","ar":"- **أتمِت المهام المملّة:** تركت الذكاء الاصطناعي يصنّف الإيصالات، مع ملخّص للمراجعة.\n- **ساعد في المهام الشخصية:** الذكاء الاصطناعي يكتب مسودات رسائل العيد؛ وصاحب المتجر يعدّل ويرسل.\n- **ساعد حين يهمّ الذوق:** الذكاء الاصطناعي يقدّم خيارات للإعلان؛ وصاحب المتجر يختار.\n- **أبقِ المراجعة:** جعلت صاحب المتجر يوافق على المدفوعات أولًا.\n- **قواعد واضحة:** أتمتّ خطة الورديات، مع مراجعة أخيرة.\n\nالدرس التالي: حين يكون الخطأ مكلفًا."}}]}$uxg$::jsonb),
  ($uxg$P12-U01-L03$uxg$, $uxg$3fd380259bb503293cee4df8236db29965e8eb643a02bb2758d1574ee00fae51$uxg$, $uxg${"id":"P12-U01-L03","mode":"lesson","minutes":7,"title":{"en":"When a mistake costs a lot","ar":"حين يكون الخطأ مكلفًا"},"summary":{"en":"Decide which AI mistakes hurt patients more, and whether to show fewer sure results or every possible one.","ar":"قرّر أي أخطاء الذكاء الاصطناعي تضرّ المرضى أكثر، وهل تعرض نتائج قليلة مؤكّدة أم كل النتائج الممكنة."},"speaker":"nour","review_labels":{"MC-P12-008":{"en":"Weigh mistakes by their real cost","ar":"قيّم الأخطاء بتكلفتها الحقيقية"},"MC-P12-009":{"en":"Few, sure results when misses cost little","ar":"نتائج قليلة مؤكّدة حين لا تكلّف الحالة الفائتة كثيرًا"},"MC-P12-010":{"en":"Show every possible result when a miss is costly","ar":"اعرض كل النتائج الممكنة حين تكون الحالة الفائتة مكلفة"}},"steps":[{"id":"S01","type":"card","part":"hook","title":{"en":"Two ways to be wrong","ar":"الذكاء الاصطناعي يخطئ بطريقتين"},"body":{"en":"Our clinic gets 400 patient messages a day. We're adding AI that marks the urgent ones, like chest pain, so a nurse calls back first.\n\nThe AI will make mistakes. The question is which mistakes we can live with.","ar":"تصل عيادتنا 400 رسالة من المرضى يوميًا. وسنضيف ذكاءً اصطناعيًا يحدّد الرسائل العاجلة، مثل ألم الصدر، لتتصل الممرّضة بأصحابها أولًا.\n\nسيخطئ الذكاء الاصطناعي. والسؤال: أي أخطاء يمكننا تحمّلها؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"staff.raha.example/inbox","blocks":[{"kind":"row","blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Patient messages · today","ar":"رسائل المرضى · اليوم"}},{"kind":"badge","tone":"neutral","text":{"en":"400 new","ar":"400 جديدة"}}]},{"kind":"listitem","avatar":{"text":"Karim Fathy","art":"man-1"},"text":{"en":"Karim Fathy","ar":"كريم فتحي"},"sub":{"en":"\"Chest pain since this morning\"","ar":"«ألم في الصدر منذ الصباح»"},"badge":{"text":{"en":"✨ Urgent","ar":"✨ عاجل"},"tone":"bad"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"listitem","avatar":{"text":"Huda Salem","art":"woman-2"},"text":{"en":"Huda Salem","ar":"هدى سالم"},"sub":{"en":"\"Can I move my visit to Sunday?\"","ar":"«هل يمكن نقل موعدي إلى الأحد؟»"},"badge":{"text":{"en":"✨ Normal","ar":"✨ عادي"},"tone":"neutral"}},{"kind":"listitem","avatar":{"text":"Samir Adel","art":"man-2"},"text":{"en":"Samir Adel","ar":"سمير عادل"},"sub":{"en":"\"Are my lab results ready?\"","ar":"«هل نتائج التحاليل جاهزة؟»"},"badge":{"text":{"en":"✨ Normal","ar":"✨ عادي"},"tone":"neutral"}}]}},{"id":"S02","type":"choose","skill":"SK-P12-U01-04","part":"try","rules":["R12"],"value":{"en":"Try first. User Needs (People + AI): it's tempting to weigh false alarms and misses equally, but that rarely matches their real cost to people.","ar":"جرّب أولًا. احتياجات المستخدم (People + AI): من المغري أن نعامل الإنذار الكاذب والحالة الفائتة بنفس الوزن، لكن هذا نادرًا ما يطابق تكلفتهما الحقيقية على الناس."},"ref":{"url":"https://pair.withgoogle.com/chapter/user-needs/","quote":"It is tempting to weigh both equally by default. However, that’s not likely to match the consequences in real life for users."},"prompt":{"en":"Which mistake is worse here?","ar":"أي خطأ في تعليم رسائل المرضى أسوأ؟"},"options":[{"id":"miss","text":{"en":"An urgent message marked \"Normal\": the patient waits hours","ar":"رسالة عاجلة تُعلَّم «عادي»: فينتظر المريض ساعات"}},{"id":"alarm","text":{"en":"A normal message marked \"Urgent\": a nurse calls back early","ar":"رسالة عادية تُعلَّم «عاجل»: فتتصل الممرّضة مبكرًا"}},{"id":"same","text":{"en":"Both are equally bad; treat them the same","ar":"الاثنان سيّئان بنفس القدر؛ عاملهما بنفس الطريقة"}}],"answer":["miss"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P12-008","when":["alarm"],"feedback":{"en":"An early call wastes a few minutes of a nurse's time. A missed chest pain could cost a life.","ar":"الاتصال المبكر يضيّع دقائق من وقت الممرّضة. أما ألم الصدر الفائت فقد يكلّف حياة."}},{"id":"MC-P12-008","when":["same"],"feedback":{"en":"They're both errors, but their costs are very different. Treating them the same ignores what happens to the patient.","ar":"الاثنان خطأ، لكن تكلفتهما مختلفة جدًا. ومعاملتهما بنفس الطريقة تتجاهل ما يحدث للمريض."}}],"hints":[{"en":"What happens to the patient in each case?","ar":"ماذا يحدث للمريض في كل حالة؟"},{"en":"Which one can be fixed in a minute, and which can't?","ar":"أيهما يُصلح في دقيقة، وأيهما لا؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Here a miss is far worse than a false alarm.","ar":"صحيح. هنا الحالة الفائتة أسوأ بكثير من الإنذار الكاذب."},"explain":{"en":"So the AI should lean towards marking \"Urgent\" when unsure. A few extra calls are a fair price for not missing a real emergency.","ar":"لذلك يجب أن يميل الذكاء الاصطناعي إلى «عاجل» حين لا يكون متأكّدًا. وبعض المكالمات الزائدة ثمن مقبول لعدم تفويت حالة طارئة حقيقية."}},{"id":"S03","type":"card","part":"concept","icons":["warn","eye","list","target"],"title":{"en":"Two kinds of mistakes","ar":"نوعان من الأخطاء"},"body":{"en":"- **False alarm (false positive):** the AI says \"yes\", but the answer is \"no\".\n- **Miss (false negative):** the AI says \"no\", but the answer is \"yes\".\n- **Which is worse depends on the cost:** a fire alarm that stays silent is worse than one that goes off for toast. A podcast episode you don't like costs nothing; you skip it.\n- **Few and sure, or everything:** showing only sure results means fewer false alarms but more misses. Showing every possible result means fewer misses but more noise. Pick based on what a miss costs people.","ar":"- **إنذار كاذب (False positive):** يقول الذكاء الاصطناعي «نعم»، والصحيح «لا».\n- **حالة فائتة (False negative):** يقول الذكاء الاصطناعي «لا»، والصحيح «نعم».\n- **أيهما أسوأ يعتمد على التكلفة:** جهاز إنذار الحريق الذي يصمت أسوأ من الذي يرنّ بسبب خبز محروق. وحلقة البودكاست التي لا تعجبك لا تكلّف شيئًا؛ تتخطّاها.\n- **نتائج قليلة مؤكّدة، أم كل شيء:** عرض النتائج المؤكّدة فقط يعني إنذارات كاذبة أقل لكن حالات فائتة أكثر. وعرض كل نتيجة ممكنة يعني حالات فائتة أقل لكن ضوضاء أكثر. اختر حسب ما تكلّفه الحالة الفائتة الناس."}},{"id":"S04","type":"choose","skill":"SK-P12-U01-04","part":"guided","rules":["R06"],"value":{"en":"User Needs (People + AI): is a false alarm worse than an alarm that doesn't go off? Both are wrong, but one is much more dangerous. Which one depends on the task.","ar":"احتياجات المستخدم (People + AI): هل الإنذار الكاذب أسوأ من إنذار لا يرنّ؟ الاثنان خطأ، لكن أحدهما أخطر بكثير. وأيهما يعتمد على المهمة."},"ref":{"url":"https://pair.withgoogle.com/chapter/user-needs/","quote":"For example, is a false alarm worse than one that doesn’t go off when there’s a fire?"},"scenario":{"en":"Our clinic's email has an AI spam filter. It moves emails it thinks are junk into the Spam folder, which nobody checks.","ar":"بريد عيادتنا فيه فلتر رسائل مزعجة بالذكاء الاصطناعي. ينقل الرسائل التي يظنّها مزعجة إلى مجلد Spam، الذي لا يراجعه أحد."},"prompt":{"en":"Which mistake should we worry about most?","ar":"أي خطأ من فلتر Spam يجب أن يقلقنا أكثر؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"mail.raha.example/spam","blocks":[{"kind":"row","blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Spam","ar":"Spam"}},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Nobody checks this folder","ar":"لا أحد يفتح هذا المجلد"}}]},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"envelope-simple","text":{"en":"WIN a free phone!!!","ar":"اربح هاتفًا مجانًا!!!"},"sub":"promo@deals.example","gap":"s"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"envelope-simple","text":{"en":"Lab results attached · please call me","ar":"نتائج التحاليل مرفقة · أرجو الاتصال بي"},"sub":{"en":"Huda Salem, patient","ar":"هدى سالم، مريضة"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"envelope-simple","text":{"en":"Cheap watches 90% off","ar":"ساعات رخيصة بخصم 90%"},"sub":"shop@cheap.example"}]},"options":[{"id":"through","text":{"en":"Some junk mail gets into the inbox","ar":"بعض الرسائل المزعجة تصل إلى البريد الوارد"}},{"id":"slow","text":{"en":"The filter takes a second to sort each email","ar":"الفلتر يأخذ ثانية ليصنّف كل رسالة"}},{"id":"lost","text":{"en":"A real patient's email lands in Spam","ar":"رسالة مريض حقيقي تقع في مجلد Spam"}}],"answer":["lost"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P12-008","when":["through","slow"],"feedback":{"en":"Junk in the inbox costs a click to delete. A patient's email in a folder nobody checks may never be answered.","ar":"الرسالة المزعجة في البريد الوارد تكلّف ضغطة لحذفها. أما رسالة المريض في مجلد لا يراجعه أحد فقد لا يُرَدّ عليها أبدًا."}}],"hints":[{"en":"What does each mistake cost the clinic or the patient?","ar":"ماذا يكلّف كل خطأ العيادة أو المريض؟"},{"en":"Here, \"yes\" means \"this is junk\". Which wrong \"yes\" hurts?","ar":"هنا «نعم» تعني «هذه رسالة مزعجة». أي «نعم» خاطئة هي التي تضرّ؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Here the false alarm is the dangerous one.","ar":"صحيح. هنا الإنذار الكاذب هو الخطير."},"explain":{"en":"In the urgent-message case, misses were worse. Here, false alarms are. Always ask what each mistake costs in this task.","ar":"في حالة الرسائل العاجلة، كانت الحالات الفائتة أسوأ. وهنا، الإنذارات الكاذبة أسوأ. اسأل دائمًا ماذا يكلّف كل خطأ في هذه المهمة."},"speaker":"nour"},{"id":"S05","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P12-U01-05","part":"guided","rules":["R06"],"value":{"en":"User Needs (People + AI): the higher the recall, the more sure you can be that all relevant results are included somewhere in the output, at the cost of some irrelevant ones.","ar":"احتياجات المستخدم (People + AI): كلما زاد الشمول (Recall)، زاد تأكّدك أن كل النتائج المهمة موجودة في مكان ما من المخرجات، مقابل بعض النتائج غير المهمة."},"ref":{"url":"https://pair.withgoogle.com/chapter/user-needs/","quote":"The higher the recall, the more confident you can be that all the relevant results are included somewhere in the output."},"scenario":{"en":"When a doctor writes a prescription, AI lists medicines that may not mix well with what the patient already takes. Doctors say: \"Never hide a possible risk; we'll judge it.\"","ar":"حين يكتب الطبيب وصفة، يعرض الذكاء الاصطناعي الأدوية التي قد تتعارض مع ما يأخذه المريض بالفعل. ويقول الأطباء: «لا تُخفِ أي خطر محتمل أبدًا؛ ونحن نقرّر.»"},"prompt":{"en":"Tap each option to see the list. What should the list show?","ar":"اضغط على كل خيار لترى القائمة. ماذا يجب أن تعرض القائمة؟"},"options":[{"id":"sure","text":{"en":"Only the risks the AI is very sure of","ar":"فقط المخاطر التي يثق بها الذكاء الاصطناعي جدًا"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"New prescription","ar":"وصفة جديدة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","art":"medicine","text":{"en":"Ibuprofen 400 mg","ar":"إيبوبروفين 400 ملجم"},"sub":{"en":"Patient: Samir Adel","ar":"المريض: سمير عادل"}},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"✨ May not mix well","ar":"✨ قد يتعارض مع"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"warning","text":{"en":"Warfarin","ar":"وارفارين"},"badge":{"text":{"en":"Very likely","ar":"مرجّح جدًا"},"tone":"bad"},"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"all","text":{"en":"Every possible risk, with the sure ones first and the less sure ones marked","ar":"كل خطر محتمل: المؤكّدة أولًا، والأقل تأكيدًا عليها علامة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"New prescription","ar":"وصفة جديدة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","art":"medicine","text":{"en":"Ibuprofen 400 mg","ar":"إيبوبروفين 400 ملجم"},"sub":{"en":"Patient: Samir Adel","ar":"المريض: سمير عادل"}},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"✨ May not mix well","ar":"✨ قد يتعارض مع"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"warning","text":{"en":"Warfarin","ar":"وارفارين"},"badge":{"text":{"en":"Very likely","ar":"مرجّح جدًا"},"tone":"bad"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"warning","text":{"en":"Lisinopril","ar":"ليسينوبريل"},"badge":{"text":{"en":"Likely","ar":"مرجّح"},"tone":"warn"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"question","text":{"en":"Aspirin 75 mg","ar":"أسبرين 75 ملجم"},"badge":{"text":{"en":"Less sure · check","ar":"أقل تأكيدًا · راجِع"},"tone":"neutral"}}]}},{"id":"top","text":{"en":"Only the single most likely risk","ar":"الخطر الأكثر احتمالًا فقط"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"New prescription","ar":"وصفة جديدة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","art":"medicine","text":{"en":"Ibuprofen 400 mg","ar":"إيبوبروفين 400 ملجم"},"sub":{"en":"Patient: Samir Adel","ar":"المريض: سمير عادل"}},{"kind":"banner","tone":"warn","icon":"warning","text":{"en":"Most likely problem: Warfarin","ar":"المشكلة الأكثر احتمالًا: وارفارين"},"gap":"m"}]}}],"answer":["all"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P12-010","when":["sure","top"],"feedback":{"en":"Showing fewer means some real risks are left out. Doctors said a missed risk is the one thing they can't accept.","ar":"عرض مخاطر أقل يعني ترك بعض المخاطر الحقيقية. والأطباء قالوا إن الخطر الفائت هو الشيء الوحيد الذي لا يقبلونه."}}],"hints":[{"en":"What did the doctors say they can't accept?","ar":"ماذا قال الأطباء إنهم لا يقبلونه؟"},{"en":"Which option leaves nothing out?","ar":"أي خيار لا يُسقط أي خطر؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Right. When a miss is dangerous, show everything, sorted and marked.","ar":"صحيح. حين تكون الحالة الفائتة خطيرة، اعرض كل شيء، مرتّبًا ومعلّمًا."},"explain":{"en":"A few extra items cost the doctor a few seconds. A missing one could harm the patient.","ar":"بعض العناصر الزائدة تكلّف الطبيب ثواني. أما العنصر الفائت فقد يضرّ المريض."},"speaker":"nour"},{"id":"S06","type":"compare","skill":"SK-P12-U01-05","part":"contrast","confidence":true,"rules":["R11"],"value":{"en":"Contrast: the same choice where a miss costs little. User Needs (People + AI): the higher the precision, the more confident you can be that any result shown is correct.","ar":"مقارنة: نفس الاختيار حيث لا يكلّف الفائت شيئًا. احتياجات المستخدم (People + AI): كلما زادت الدقة (Precision)، زاد تأكّدك أن أي نتيجة معروضة صحيحة."},"ref":{"url":"https://pair.withgoogle.com/chapter/user-needs/","quote":"The higher the precision, the more confident you can be that any model output is correct."},"scenario":{"en":"On our app's home screen, AI suggests health tips for each patient. Patients can still browse all tips themselves.","ar":"في الشاشة الرئيسية لتطبيقنا، يقترح الذكاء الاصطناعي نصائح صحية لكل مريض. والمرضى يستطيعون تصفّح كل النصائح بأنفسهم."},"prompt":{"en":"Which home screen is better?","ar":"أي شاشة رئيسية أنسب للمريض، علمًا أنه يستطيع تصفّح كل النصائح؟"},"a":{"label":{"en":"A: 15 tips, including ones that may not fit.","ar":"A: 15 نصيحة، منها ما قد لا يناسب."},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"logo":true},"tabbar":{"active":0,"items":[{"icon":"house","text":{"en":"Home","ar":"الرئيسية"}},{"icon":"calendar","text":{"en":"Visits","ar":"زياراتي"}},{"icon":"heart","text":{"en":"Tips","ar":"نصائح"}},{"icon":"user","text":{"en":"Account","ar":"حسابي"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"✨ Tips for you (15)","ar":"✨ نصائح لك (15)"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"person-simple-walk","text":{"en":"Walking after meals","ar":"المشي بعد الأكل"},"chevron":true,"gap":"s"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"baby","text":{"en":"Baby sleep","ar":"نوم الرضيع"},"chevron":true},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"bandaids","text":{"en":"Knee care","ar":"العناية بالركبة"},"chevron":true},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"smiley","text":{"en":"Teen acne","ar":"حبّ الشباب"},"chevron":true},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"… 11 more","ar":"… 11 نصيحة أخرى"}}]}},"b":{"label":{"en":"B: 3 tips the AI is sure fit, and \"See all tips\".","ar":"B: 3 نصائح يثق الذكاء الاصطناعي أنها مناسبة، وزر «كل النصائح»."},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"logo":true},"tabbar":{"active":0,"items":[{"icon":"house","text":{"en":"Home","ar":"الرئيسية"}},{"icon":"calendar","text":{"en":"Visits","ar":"زياراتي"}},{"icon":"heart","text":{"en":"Tips","ar":"نصائح"}},{"icon":"user","text":{"en":"Account","ar":"حسابي"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"✨ Tips for you","ar":"✨ نصائح لك"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"person-simple-walk","text":{"en":"Walking after meals","ar":"المشي بعد الأكل"},"chevron":true,"gap":"s"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"bowl-food","text":{"en":"Less salt","ar":"ملح أقل"},"chevron":true},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"drop","text":{"en":"Checking sugar at home","ar":"قياس السكر في البيت"},"chevron":true},{"kind":"link","text":{"en":"See all tips","ar":"كل النصائح"},"gap":"s"}]}},"answer":"b","reason":{"prompt":{"en":"Why is B better here?","ar":"لماذا B أفضل هنا؟"},"options":[{"id":"cost","text":{"en":"A missed tip costs little, and wrong tips make people trust the list less","ar":"النصيحة الفائتة لا تكلّف كثيرًا، والنصائح الخطأ تُضعف ثقة الناس بالقائمة"}},{"id":"short","text":{"en":"Short lists are always better","ar":"القوائم القصيرة أفضل دائمًا"}},{"id":"space","text":{"en":"The screen has no space for 15","ar":"الشاشة لا تتّسع لـ 15"}}],"answer":["cost"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P12-009","when":["short","space"],"feedback":{"en":"It's about cost, not length. For the medicine risks, the long list was right.","ar":"المسألة مسألة تكلفة، لا طول. ففي مخاطر الأدوية، كانت القائمة الطويلة هي الصحيحة."}}]},"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P12-009","when":["a"],"feedback":{"en":"Baby sleep and teen acne for an adult with diabetes? Wrong tips add noise, and missing one costs nothing; all tips are a tap away.","ar":"نوم الرضيع وحبّ الشباب لشخص بالغ مريض بالسكري؟ النصائح الخطأ تضيف ضوضاء، وتفويت نصيحة لا يكلّف شيئًا؛ فكل النصائح تظهر بضغطة واحدة."}}],"hints":[{"en":"What's lost if one useful tip isn't on the home screen?","ar":"ماذا يضيع إذا لم تظهر نصيحة مفيدة في الشاشة الرئيسية؟"},{"en":"Compare this with the medicine risks.","ar":"قارن هذا بمخاطر الأدوية."}],"correct":{"en":"Right. When misses are cheap, show a few sure results.","ar":"صحيح. حين لا تكلّف الحالة الفائتة كثيرًا، اعرض نتائج قليلة مؤكّدة."},"explain":{"en":"Same AI, different choice. Ask what a miss costs: high, show everything; low, show the sure few.","ar":"نفس الذكاء الاصطناعي، واختيار مختلف. اسأل كم تكلّف الحالة الفائتة: إذا كانت التكلفة كبيرة، اعرض كل شيء؛ وإذا كانت صغيرة، اعرض نتائج قليلة مؤكّدة."},"speaker":"nour"},{"id":"S07","type":"choose","skill":"SK-P12-U01-04","part":"independent","speaker":"youssef","rules":["R14"],"value":{"en":"New case. User Needs (People + AI): weighing the cost of false positives and false negatives is a critical decision that shapes people's experience.","ar":"حالة جديدة. احتياجات المستخدم (People + AI): الموازنة بين تكلفة الإنذار الكاذب والحالة الفائتة قرار مهم يشكّل تجربة الناس."},"ref":{"url":"https://pair.withgoogle.com/chapter/user-needs/","quote":"Weighing the cost of false positives and false negatives is a critical decision that will shape your users’ experiences."},"scenario":{"en":"A camera in my shop uses AI to spot empty shelves and alerts me. A false alarm costs me one minute to check. A missed empty shelf costs a day of sales.","ar":"كاميرا في متجري تستخدم الذكاء الاصطناعي لتكتشف الرفوف الفارغة وتنبّهني. والإنذار الكاذب يكلّفني دقيقة للتأكّد. أما الرف الفارغ الذي لا تكتشفه فيكلّف مبيعات يوم كامل."},"prompt":{"en":"How should the alerts be tuned?","ar":"متى يجب أن تنبّهني كاميرا الرفوف؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"screen":"lock","blocks":[{"kind":"notification","title":{"en":"Shelf camera: maybe empty","ar":"كاميرا الرف: قد يكون فارغًا"},"text":{"en":"Aisle 3 · kettles","ar":"الممر 3 · الغلايات"},"time":{"en":"now","ar":"الآن"}},{"kind":"image","art":"shelf","size":"s","gap":"s"}]},"options":[{"id":"sure","text":{"en":"Alert only when the AI is very sure, so I'm not disturbed","ar":"تنبّه فقط حين يكون الذكاء الاصطناعي متأكّدًا جدًا، حتى لا أنزعج"}},{"id":"lean","text":{"en":"Alert even when it's not sure, because a miss costs more","ar":"تنبّه حتى حين لا يكون متأكّدًا، لأن الرف الذي لا يُكتشف يكلّف أكثر"}},{"id":"equal","text":{"en":"Treat both mistakes the same","ar":"تتعامل مع الخطأين بنفس الطريقة"}}],"answer":["lean"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P12-008","when":["sure","equal"],"feedback":{"en":"A miss costs a day of sales; a false alarm costs a minute. The tuning should follow those costs.","ar":"الرف الذي لا يُكتشف يكلّف مبيعات يوم؛ والإنذار الكاذب يكلّف دقيقة. فاضبط التنبيهات حسب هذه التكاليف."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Compare a minute with a day of sales.","ar":"قارن دقيقة بمبيعات يوم."},{"en":"Which mistake should the AI avoid most?","ar":"أي خطأ يجب أن يتجنّبه الذكاء الاصطناعي أكثر؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Lean away from the costlier mistake.","ar":"صحيح. اضبطه ليتجنّب الخطأ الأكثر تكلفة."},"explain":{"en":"Put a cost on each mistake, then tune the AI so the expensive one happens least.","ar":"حدّد تكلفة كل خطأ، ثم اضبط الذكاء الاصطناعي ليكون الخطأ المكلف هو الأقل حدوثًا."}},{"id":"S08","type":"card","part":"recap","icons":["warn","target","list","ok"],"title":{"en":"What you did","ar":"ماذا تعلّمت"},"body":{"en":"- **Misses worse:** urgent messages should lean to \"Urgent\" when unsure.\n- **False alarms worse:** a patient email in Spam is the costly mistake.\n- **Show everything:** you listed every possible medicine risk, marked by how sure.\n- **Show a sure few:** you kept home-screen tips short, with \"See all\".\n- **Follow the cost:** you tuned shelf alerts against the expensive miss.\n\nNext: the skill check.","ar":"- **حين تكون الحالة الفائتة أسوأ:** الرسائل غير المؤكّدة تُعلَّم «عاجل».\n- **حين يكون الإنذار الكاذب أسوأ:** رسالة المريض في Spam هي الخطأ المكلف.\n- **اعرض كل شيء:** عرضت كل خطر دوائي محتمل، معلّمًا بدرجة التأكّد.\n- **اعرض نتائج قليلة مؤكّدة:** جعلت نصائح الشاشة الرئيسية قليلة، مع «كل النصائح».\n- **اتبع التكلفة:** ضبطت تنبيهات الرفوف لتتجنّب الرف الفارغ الذي لا يُكتشف.\n\nالتالي: اختبار المهارة."}}]}$uxg$::jsonb),
  ($uxg$P12-U01-L04$uxg$, $uxg$19a99443a318e44e836e7f97423a65e33383883adc7f32ab616e88b6879df5b3$uxg$, $uxg${"id":"P12-U01-L04","mode":"check","minutes":6,"title":{"en":"Skill check: does it need AI?","ar":"اختبار المهارة: هل يحتاج ذكاءً اصطناعيًا؟"},"summary":{"en":"Plan AI features for a gym app, from the first question to the mistakes that matter, on your own.","ar":"خطّط ميزات ذكاء اصطناعي لتطبيق نادٍ رياضي، من السؤال الأول إلى الأخطاء المهمة، بنفسك."},"speaker":"hana","steps":[{"id":"S01","type":"card","part":"hook","title":{"en":"Hana's gym app","ar":"تطبيق نادي هناء"},"body":{"en":"I own a gym, and a company offered to add AI to our members' app. Before I pay, I want to know where it really helps.\n\nYour job: answer five questions.\n\nThis is a skill check: there are no hints, and you'll see your result at the end.","ar":"أملك ناديًا رياضيًا، وعرضت عليّ شركة أن تضيف ذكاءً اصطناعيًا لتطبيق الأعضاء. وقبل أن أدفع، أريد أن أعرف أين يساعد فعلًا.\n\nمهمّتك: أجب عن خمسة أسئلة.\n\nهذا اختبار مهارة: لا توجد تلميحات، وسترى نتيجتك في النهاية."},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"logo":true,"actions":[{"icon":"bell","aria":{"en":"Notifications","ar":"الإشعارات"}}]},"tabbar":{"active":0,"items":[{"icon":"house","text":{"en":"Home","ar":"الرئيسية"}},{"icon":"calendar-check","text":{"en":"Classes","ar":"الحصص"}},{"icon":"barbell","text":{"en":"My plan","ar":"خطتي"}},{"icon":"identification-card","text":{"en":"Membership","ar":"الاشتراك"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"card","art":"gym","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Next class: Spinning · 18:00","ar":"الحصة القادمة: دراجات ثابتة · 18:00"}},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Coach Omar · 4 places left","ar":"المدرّب عمر · باقي 4 أماكن"},"gap":"xs"}]},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"identification-card","text":{"en":"Membership","ar":"الاشتراك"},"sub":{"en":"Ends 30 Nov","ar":"ينتهي 30 نوفمبر"},"chevron":true,"gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"S02","type":"choose","skill":"SK-P12-U01-01","part":"check","rules":["R19"],"value":{"en":"Skill check. User Needs (People + AI): find where people's needs and AI's strengths meet. Solve a real problem in a way where AI adds unique value.","ar":"اختبار مهارة. احتياجات المستخدم (People + AI): ابحث عن نقطة التقاء احتياجات الناس ونقاط قوة الذكاء الاصطناعي. وحلّ مشكلة حقيقية بطريقة يضيف فيها الذكاء الاصطناعي قيمة فريدة."},"ref":{"url":"https://pair.withgoogle.com/chapter/user-needs/","quote":"Solve a real problem in ways in which AI adds unique value."},"scenario":{"en":"The company's sales person showed me 12 AI features and asked which ones I want.","ar":"عرض عليّ مندوب الشركة 12 ميزة ذكاء اصطناعي وسألني أيها أريد."},"prompt":{"en":"What should I do before choosing?","ar":"ماذا يجب أن أفعل قبل الاختيار؟"},"mock":{"app":{"name":{"en":"GymMind AI","ar":"جيم مايند AI"},"color":"#7C3AED","icon":"sparkle","domain":"gymmind.example"},"frame":"wide","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Features","ar":"الميزات"},{"en":"Prices","ar":"الأسعار"}],"active":0},"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"12 AI features for your gym","ar":"12 ميزة ذكاء اصطناعي لناديك"}},{"kind":"row","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"card","blocks":[{"kind":"icon","icon":"chat-circle-dots"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"AI coach chat","ar":"محادثة مع مدرّب ذكي"}}]},{"kind":"card","blocks":[{"kind":"icon","icon":"chart-line-up"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Predict who leaves","ar":"توقّع من سيلغي اشتراكه"}}]},{"kind":"card","blocks":[{"kind":"icon","icon":"music-notes"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Smart playlists","ar":"قوائم موسيقى ذكية"}}]},{"kind":"card","blocks":[{"kind":"icon","icon":"dots-three"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"+ 9 more","ar":"+ 9 ميزات أخرى"}}]}]},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Choose your features","ar":"اختر ميزاتك"},"gap":"m"}]},"options":[{"id":"ask","text":{"en":"List what members struggle with today, then see which feature solves one of those","ar":"أكتب ما يعانيه الأعضاء اليوم، ثم أرى أي ميزة تحلّ واحدة منها"}},{"id":"popular","text":{"en":"Pick the features other gyms bought most","ar":"أختار الميزات التي اشترتها النوادي الأخرى أكثر"}},{"id":"all","text":{"en":"Take all 12, then remove what members don't use","ar":"آخذ الـ 12 كلها، ثم أحذف ما لا يستخدمه الأعضاء"}}],"answer":["ask"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P12-001","when":["popular","all"],"feedback":{"en":"Both start from the features, not from members. Without knowing the problem, I can't tell which feature is worth paying for.","ar":"كلا الخيارين يبدأ من الميزات، لا من الأعضاء. وبدون معرفة المشكلة، لا أستطيع أن أعرف أي ميزة تستحق الدفع."}}],"explain":{"en":"From Lesson 1: start from people's real problem, then check if AI solves it.","ar":"من الدرس 1: ابدأ من مشكلة الناس الحقيقية، ثم تأكّد إن كان الذكاء الاصطناعي يحلّها."},"speaker":"hana"},{"id":"S03","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P12-U01-02","part":"check","rules":["R19"],"value":{"en":"Skill check. User Needs (People + AI): a simpler solution is easier to build, explain, debug and maintain.","ar":"اختبار مهارة. احتياجات المستخدم (People + AI): الحل الأبسط أسهل في البناء والشرح والإصلاح والصيانة."},"ref":{"url":"https://pair.withgoogle.com/chapter/user-needs/","quote":"A simpler solution has the added benefit of being easier to build, explain, debug, and maintain."},"scenario":{"en":"Members often forget to renew and lose their discount. The company offers \"AI that predicts when each member will forget\".","ar":"الأعضاء ينسون التجديد كثيرًا فيفقدون الخصم. والشركة تعرض «ذكاءً اصطناعيًا يتوقّع متى سينسى كل عضو»."},"prompt":{"en":"Tap each option to see it. What's the best fix?","ar":"اضغط على كل خيار لتراه. ما أفضل حل كي لا ينسى الأعضاء التجديد؟"},"options":[{"id":"predict","text":{"en":"The AI that predicts who will forget","ar":"الذكاء الاصطناعي الذي يتوقّع من سينسى"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"admin.nashat.example/renewals","blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"✨ Members likely to forget","ar":"✨ أعضاء قد ينسون التجديد"}},{"kind":"table","gap":"s","head":[{"en":"Member","ar":"العضو"},{"en":"Ends","ar":"ينتهي"},{"en":"Chance to forget","ar":"احتمال النسيان"}],"rows":[[{"en":"Salma Fawzy","ar":"سلمى فوزي"},"30 Nov","71%"],[{"en":"Ahmed Nabil","ar":"أحمد نبيل"},"2 Dec","38%"]]}]}},{"id":"chat","text":{"en":"An AI chat that answers renewal questions","ar":"مساعد محادثة بالذكاء الاصطناعي يجيب عن أسئلة التجديد"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Nashat assistant","ar":"مساعد نشاط"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"chat","from":"ai","text":{"en":"Hi! Ask me anything about renewing.","ar":"أهلًا! اسألني أي شيء عن التجديد."}}],"footer":[{"kind":"composer","text":{"en":"Type your question…","ar":"اكتب سؤالك…"}}]}},{"id":"rule","text":{"en":"A reminder to every member 7 days before the end date","ar":"تذكير لكل عضو قبل تاريخ الانتهاء بـ 7 أيام"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"screen":"lock","blocks":[{"kind":"notification","title":{"en":"Your membership ends in 7 days","ar":"اشتراكك ينتهي بعد 7 أيام"},"text":{"en":"Renew by 30 Nov to keep your 15% discount.","ar":"جدّد قبل 30 نوفمبر لتحتفظ بخصم 15%."},"time":{"en":"now","ar":"الآن"}}]}}],"answer":["rule"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P12-002","when":["predict","chat"],"feedback":{"en":"We already know each end date. A simple reminder reaches everyone, costs little and never guesses wrong.","ar":"نحن نعرف تاريخ انتهاء كل اشتراك بالفعل. والتذكير البسيط يصل للجميع، ويكلّف قليلًا، ولا يخمّن خطأً أبدًا."}}],"explain":{"en":"From Lesson 1: when the answer is fixed and known, a simple rule beats AI.","ar":"من الدرس 1: حين تكون الإجابة ثابتة ومعروفة، تتفوّق القاعدة البسيطة على الذكاء الاصطناعي."},"speaker":"hana"},{"id":"S04","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P12-U01-03","part":"check","rules":["R19"],"value":{"en":"Skill check. User Needs (People + AI): augment tasks people enjoy, that carry social capital, or where people disagree on the right way.","ar":"اختبار مهارة. احتياجات المستخدم (People + AI): ساعد في المهام التي يستمتع بها الناس، أو تمنحهم مكانة اجتماعية، أو يختلفون على طريقتها الصحيحة."},"ref":{"url":"https://pair.withgoogle.com/chapter/user-needs/","quote":"Augment tasks that people enjoy doing, that carry social capital, or where people don’t agree on the “correct” way to do it."},"scenario":{"en":"My coaches build a training plan for each new member. They love it, members choose a coach for it, and every coach does it a bit differently.","ar":"المدرّبون عندي يصمّمون خطة تدريب لكل عضو جديد. وهم يحبّون ذلك، والأعضاء يختارون المدرّب من أجله، وكل مدرّب يفعله بطريقة مختلفة قليلًا."},"prompt":{"en":"Tap each option to see it. How should AI fit in?","ar":"اضغط على كل خيار لتراه. ما دور الذكاء الاصطناعي في خطط التدريب؟"},"options":[{"id":"auto","text":{"en":"AI writes every plan, so coaches have more free time","ar":"الذكاء الاصطناعي يكتب كل الخطط، ليصبح للمدرّبين وقت فراغ أكثر"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Plan for Salma","ar":"خطة سلمى"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"badge","icon":"sparkle","text":{"en":"Written by AI · sent to Salma","ar":"كتبها الذكاء الاصطناعي · أُرسلت لسلمى"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"barbell","text":{"en":"Squats","ar":"القرفصاء"},"value":"3 × 12","gap":"s"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"barbell","text":{"en":"Push-ups","ar":"ضغط"},"value":"3 × 10"},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Coach: none","ar":"المدرّب: لا يوجد"},"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"help","text":{"en":"AI suggests exercises and fills in the details; the coach shapes the plan","ar":"الذكاء الاصطناعي يقترح تمارين ويملأ التفاصيل؛ والمدرّب يحدّد شكل الخطة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Plan for Salma","ar":"خطة سلمى"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","avatar":{"text":"Omar Hany","art":"man-1"},"text":{"en":"Coach Omar is writing this plan","ar":"المدرّب عمر يكتب هذه الخطة"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"barbell","text":{"en":"Squats","ar":"القرفصاء"},"value":"3 × 12","gap":"s"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"sparkle","text":{"en":"Suggested: lunges","ar":"مقترح: تمرين الطعن (Lunges)"},"sub":{"en":"Fits her knee note","ar":"تناسب ملاحظة الركبة"},"value":{"en":"Add","ar":"أضف"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"sparkle","text":{"en":"Fill in sets and rest times","ar":"املأ المجموعات وأوقات الراحة"},"chevron":true}]}},{"id":"none","text":{"en":"AI checks the plans after they're sent","ar":"الذكاء الاصطناعي يراجع الخطط بعد إرسالها"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Plan for Salma","ar":"خطة سلمى"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","avatar":{"text":"Omar Hany","art":"man-1"},"text":{"en":"Plan sent by Coach Omar","ar":"أرسل المدرّب عمر الخطة"},"sub":{"en":"Yesterday","ar":"أمس"}},{"kind":"banner","tone":"warn","icon":"sparkle","text":{"en":"AI review: 2 notes on a plan already sent","ar":"مراجعة الذكاء الاصطناعي: ملاحظتان على خطة أُرسلت بالفعل"},"gap":"s"}]}}],"answer":["help"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P12-006","when":["auto","none"],"feedback":{"en":"Coaches enjoy this, members value it, and there's no single right plan. AI should help coaches, not replace them or come too late.","ar":"المدرّبون يستمتعون بهذا، والأعضاء يقدّرونه، ولا توجد خطة صحيحة واحدة. فيجب أن يساعد الذكاء الاصطناعي المدرّبين، لا أن يحلّ محلّهم أو يأتي متأخرًا."}}],"explain":{"en":"From Lesson 2: help people with tasks they enjoy or own; don't take those tasks away.","ar":"من الدرس 2: ساعد الناس في المهام التي يستمتعون بها أو يتحمّلون مسؤوليتها؛ لا تأخذها منهم."},"speaker":"hana"},{"id":"S05","type":"choose","skill":"SK-P12-U01-04","part":"check","rules":["R19"],"value":{"en":"Skill check. User Needs (People + AI): both kinds of mistakes are wrong, but one can be much more dangerous.","ar":"اختبار مهارة. احتياجات المستخدم (People + AI): نوعا الخطأ كلاهما خطأ، لكن أحدهما قد يكون أخطر بكثير."},"ref":{"url":"https://pair.withgoogle.com/chapter/user-needs/","quote":"Both are incorrect, but one is much more dangerous."},"scenario":{"en":"During class, AI reads members' heart rate from their watches and alerts the coach if it looks dangerously high.","ar":"أثناء الحصة، يقرأ الذكاء الاصطناعي نبض الأعضاء من ساعاتهم وينبّه المدرّب إذا بدا مرتفعًا إلى حدّ خطير."},"prompt":{"en":"Which mistake must we avoid most?","ar":"أي خطأ في تنبيهات النبض يجب أن نتجنّبه أكثر؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"frame":"tablet","appbar":{"title":{"en":"Live class · Spinning","ar":"حصة مباشرة · دراجات ثابتة"}},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","avatar":{"text":"Salma Fawzy","art":"woman-1"},"text":{"en":"Salma","ar":"سلمى"},"value":{"en":"142 bpm","ar":"142 نبضة"}},{"kind":"listitem","avatar":{"text":"Ahmed Nabil","art":"man-2"},"text":{"en":"Ahmed","ar":"أحمد"},"value":{"en":"188 bpm","ar":"188 نبضة"},"badge":{"text":{"en":"✨ Alert","ar":"✨ تنبيه"},"tone":"bad"}},{"kind":"listitem","avatar":{"text":"Noha Ali","art":"woman-2"},"text":{"en":"Noha","ar":"نهى"},"value":{"en":"131 bpm","ar":"131 نبضة"}}]},"options":[{"id":"miss","text":{"en":"No alert when a member's heart rate really is dangerous","ar":"لا تنبيه حين يكون نبض العضو خطيرًا فعلًا"}},{"id":"alarm","text":{"en":"An alert when the member is fine","ar":"تنبيه مع أن العضو بخير"}},{"id":"same","text":{"en":"Both equally; tune for overall accuracy","ar":"الاثنان بنفس القدر؛ نضبطه ليكون دقيقًا في المجمل"}}],"answer":["miss"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P12-008","when":["alarm","same"],"feedback":{"en":"A false alarm means the coach checks on a member who's fine. A missed one could mean a member collapses.","ar":"الإنذار الكاذب يعني أن المدرّب يطمئن على عضو بخير. أما التنبيه الفائت فقد يعني أن يسقط عضو مغشيًّا عليه."}}],"explain":{"en":"From Lesson 3: weigh each mistake by what it costs people, and tune against the worse one.","ar":"من الدرس 3: قيّم كل خطأ بما يكلّفه الناس، واضبط الذكاء الاصطناعي ليتجنّب الأسوأ."},"speaker":"hana"},{"id":"S06","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P12-U01-05","part":"check","rules":["R19"],"value":{"en":"Skill check. User Needs (People + AI): where a product falls between precision and recall should depend on what people expect and need to feel the task is complete.","ar":"اختبار مهارة. احتياجات المستخدم (People + AI): موقع المنتج بين الدقة والشمول يجب أن يعتمد على ما يتوقّعه الناس وما يجعلهم يشعرون أن المهمة اكتملت."},"ref":{"url":"https://pair.withgoogle.com/chapter/user-needs/","quote":"Where along that spectrum your product falls should be based on what your users expect and what gives them the sense of task completeness."},"scenario":{"en":"The home screen will show \"Classes you might like\". Members can always see the full timetable.","ar":"ستعرض الشاشة الرئيسية «حصص قد تعجبك». والأعضاء يستطيعون دائمًا رؤية الجدول الكامل."},"prompt":{"en":"Tap each option to see the home screen. What should the AI show there?","ar":"اضغط على كل خيار لترى الشاشة الرئيسية. ماذا يجب أن يعرض الذكاء الاصطناعي هناك؟"},"options":[{"id":"all","text":{"en":"Every class that might fit, even weak matches","ar":"كل حصة قد تناسب، حتى الأقل تطابقًا"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"logo":true},"tabbar":{"active":0,"items":[{"icon":"house","text":{"en":"Home","ar":"الرئيسية"}},{"icon":"calendar-check","text":{"en":"Classes","ar":"الحصص"}},{"icon":"barbell","text":{"en":"My plan","ar":"خطتي"}},{"icon":"identification-card","text":{"en":"Membership","ar":"الاشتراك"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"✨ Classes you might like (14)","ar":"✨ حصص قد تعجبك (14)"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"bicycle","text":{"en":"Spinning · Sun 18:00","ar":"دراجات ثابتة · الأحد 18:00"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"baby","text":{"en":"Mum and baby yoga · Mon 10:00","ar":"يوغا للأم والطفل · الاثنين 10:00"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"boxing-glove","text":{"en":"Kids boxing · Tue 16:00","ar":"ملاكمة للأطفال · الثلاثاء 16:00"}},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"… 11 more","ar":"… 11 حصة أخرى"}}]}},{"id":"none","text":{"en":"Nothing until it's 100% sure","ar":"لا شيء حتى يتأكّد 100%"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"logo":true},"tabbar":{"active":0,"items":[{"icon":"house","text":{"en":"Home","ar":"الرئيسية"}},{"icon":"calendar-check","text":{"en":"Classes","ar":"الحصص"}},{"icon":"barbell","text":{"en":"My plan","ar":"خطتي"}},{"icon":"identification-card","text":{"en":"Membership","ar":"الاشتراك"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"✨ Classes you might like","ar":"✨ حصص قد تعجبك"}},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"No suggestions yet","ar":"لا توجد اقتراحات بعد"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"link","text":{"en":"Full timetable","ar":"الجدول الكامل"},"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"few","text":{"en":"2 or 3 classes it's sure fit the member","ar":"2 أو 3 حصص يثق أنها تناسب العضو"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"logo":true},"tabbar":{"active":0,"items":[{"icon":"house","text":{"en":"Home","ar":"الرئيسية"}},{"icon":"calendar-check","text":{"en":"Classes","ar":"الحصص"}},{"icon":"barbell","text":{"en":"My plan","ar":"خطتي"}},{"icon":"identification-card","text":{"en":"Membership","ar":"الاشتراك"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"✨ Classes you might like","ar":"✨ حصص قد تعجبك"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"bicycle","text":{"en":"Spinning · Sun 18:00","ar":"دراجات ثابتة · الأحد 18:00"},"chevron":true,"gap":"s"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"person-simple-run","text":{"en":"Running club · Thu 7:00","ar":"نادي الجري · الخميس 7:00"},"chevron":true},{"kind":"link","text":{"en":"Full timetable","ar":"الجدول الكامل"},"gap":"s"}]}}],"answer":["few"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P12-009","when":["all"],"feedback":{"en":"Missing a class here costs nothing; the timetable is one tap away. Weak matches only add noise.","ar":"تفويت حصة هنا لا يكلّف شيئًا؛ فالجدول يظهر بضغطة واحدة. والحصص البعيدة عن اهتمامه تضيف ضوضاء فقط."}},{"id":"MC-P12-009","when":["none"],"feedback":{"en":"AI is rarely 100% sure, so the section would stay empty. A few strong picks are enough.","ar":"الذكاء الاصطناعي نادرًا ما يكون متأكّدًا 100%، فسيبقى القسم فارغًا. وبعض الاختيارات القوية تكفي."}}],"explain":{"en":"From Lesson 3: when a miss costs little, show a few sure results.","ar":"من الدرس 3: حين لا تكلّف الحالة الفائتة كثيرًا، اعرض نتائج قليلة مؤكّدة."},"speaker":"hana"}]}$uxg$::jsonb),
  ($uxg$P12-U02-L01$uxg$, $uxg$67defc2bce439c34869e95a13f513bf23dbf8100832d74d9ade98da72a2a4460$uxg$, $uxg${"id":"P12-U02-L01","mode":"lesson","minutes":7,"title":{"en":"Say what it can and can't do","ar":"قل ما يستطيعه وما لا يستطيعه"},"summary":{"en":"Rewrite how a shop's photo search introduces itself, so customers expect what it can really do.","ar":"أعِد كتابة تعريف متجر بميزة البحث بالصور، ليتوقّع العملاء ما تستطيعه فعلًا."},"speaker":"youssef","review_labels":{"MC-P12-011":{"en":"Promise only what it can do","ar":"لا تَعِد إلا بما يستطيعه"},"MC-P12-012":{"en":"Explain the benefit, not the technology","ar":"اشرح الفائدة، لا التقنية"},"MC-P12-013":{"en":"Show an example of it working","ar":"اعرض مثالًا للميزة وهي تعمل"}},"steps":[{"id":"S01","type":"card","part":"hook","title":{"en":"\"Find anything with a photo!\"","ar":"«ابحث عن أي شيء بصورة!»"},"body":{"en":"I added a photo search to my shop app. You snap a photo, and it finds similar products. Our ad said: \"AI magic! Find anything with a photo.\"\n\nIt works well for bags and clothes. But customers snap rings and earrings, get strange results, and leave one-star reviews.","ar":"أضفت بحثًا بالصور لتطبيق متجري. تلتقط صورة، فيجد منتجات مشابهة. وإعلاننا قال: «سحر الذكاء الاصطناعي! ابحث عن أي شيء بصورة.»\n\nيعمل جيدًا مع الحقائب والملابس. لكن العملاء يصوّرون خواتم وأقراطًا، فتظهر نتائج غريبة، ويكتبون تقييمات بنجمة واحدة."},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"logo":true,"actions":[{"icon":"shopping-cart","aria":{"en":"Cart","ar":"السلة"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"searchbar","text":{"en":"Search Dar","ar":"ابحث في دار"}},{"kind":"banner","tone":"info","icon":"sparkle","text":{"en":"AI magic! Find anything with a photo.","ar":"سحر الذكاء الاصطناعي! ابحث عن أي شيء بصورة."},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Latest reviews","ar":"أحدث التقييمات"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"listitem","avatar":{"text":"Salma Nabil","art":"woman-2"},"text":{"en":"Salma · ★☆☆☆☆","ar":"سلمى · ★☆☆☆☆"},"sub":{"en":"\"I searched a ring and got a door handle.\"","ar":"«بحثت عن خاتم فظهر لي مقبض باب.»"}}]}},{"id":"S02","type":"choose","skill":"SK-P12-U02-01","part":"try","rules":["R12"],"value":{"en":"Try first. Mental Models (People + AI): promising \"AI magic\" sets people up for disappointment, because it makes them expect more than the product can do.","ar":"جرّب أولًا. النماذج الذهنية (People + AI): الوعد بـ«سحر الذكاء الاصطناعي» يقود الناس إلى خيبة الأمل، لأنه يجعلهم يتوقّعون أكثر مما يستطيعه المنتج."},"ref":{"url":"https://pair.withgoogle.com/chapter/mental-models/","quote":"This kind of messaging can establish mental models that overestimate what the product can actually do."},"prompt":{"en":"What's the main cause of the bad reviews?","ar":"ما السبب الأساسي للتقييمات السيئة؟"},"options":[{"id":"weak","text":{"en":"The AI is weak; we need a better one","ar":"الذكاء الاصطناعي ضعيف؛ نحتاج واحدًا أفضل"}},{"id":"promise","text":{"en":"We promised \"anything\", so people expected it to work for everything","ar":"وعدنا بـ«أي شيء»، فتوقّع الناس أن يعمل مع كل شيء"}},{"id":"users","text":{"en":"Customers are using it wrong","ar":"العملاء يستخدمونه بطريقة خطأ"}}],"answer":["promise"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P12-011","when":["weak","users"],"feedback":{"en":"It does well what it was built for. The ad promised more, so customers tried things it can't do and felt let down.","ar":"البحث ينجح فيما صُمّم له. لكن الإعلان وعد بأكثر، فجرّب العملاء أشياء لا يستطيعها وشعروا بخيبة الأمل."}}],"hints":[{"en":"What did the ad tell customers to expect?","ar":"ماذا جعل الإعلان العملاء يتوقّعون؟"},{"en":"Does it work for what it was built for?","ar":"هل يعمل فيما بُني من أجله؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Right. The promise, not the AI, caused the letdown.","ar":"صحيح. الوعد، لا الذكاء الاصطناعي، هو سبب خيبة الأمل."},"explain":{"en":"People judge a feature against what they were told. Overpromise, and even good results feel like failure.","ar":"الناس يحكمون على الميزة بما قيل لهم. وإذا وعدت بأكثر، فحتى النتائج الجيدة تبدو فشلًا."}},{"id":"S03","type":"card","part":"concept","icons":["target","ok","idea","warn"],"title":{"en":"Set honest expectations","ar":"اجعل توقّعات الناس واقعية"},"body":{"en":"People build a picture of what a feature can do from the first thing they hear.\n\n- **Say what it can do and can't do yet,** the first time people meet it.\n- **Show an example** of it working, so people see the value.\n- **Talk about the benefit, not the technology:** \"Find similar bags\" beats \"Powered by deep learning\".\n- **No magic:** big promises make people expect too much, then stop trusting it.","ar":"يكوّن الناس صورة عمّا تستطيعه الميزة من أول شيء يسمعونه.\n\n- **قل ما تستطيعه وما لا تستطيعه بعد،** من أول مرة يراها الناس.\n- **اعرض مثالًا** للميزة وهي تعمل، ليرى الناس قيمتها.\n- **تحدّث عن الفائدة، لا التقنية:** «ابحث عن حقائب مشابهة» أفضل من «يعمل بالتعلّم العميق (Deep learning)».\n- **بلا سحر:** الوعود الكبيرة تجعل الناس يتوقّعون أكثر من اللازم، ثم يفقدون الثقة بها."}},{"id":"S04","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P12-U02-04","part":"guided","rules":["R06"],"value":{"en":"Mental Models (People + AI): if you talk about the AI, focus on how it makes part of the experience better or delivers new value.","ar":"النماذج الذهنية (People + AI): إذا تحدّثت عن الذكاء الاصطناعي، فركّز على كيف يحسّن جزءًا من التجربة أو يقدّم قيمة جديدة."},"ref":{"url":"https://pair.withgoogle.com/chapter/mental-models/","quote":"If you do talk about the AI, focus on how it specifically makes part of the experience better or delivers new value."},"scenario":{"en":"We're writing a new title for the photo search button.","ar":"نكتب عنوانًا جديدًا لزر البحث بالصور."},"prompt":{"en":"Tap each option to see it. Which title is best?","ar":"اضغط على كل خيار لتراه. أي عنوان يجعل العميل يعرف متى يستخدم البحث بالصور؟"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Dar · Clothes","ar":"دار · ملابس"},"back":true,"actions":[{"icon":"shopping-cart","aria":{"en":"Cart","ar":"السلة"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"searchbar","text":{"en":"Search clothes and bags","ar":"ابحث في الملابس والحقائب"}},{"kind":"button","style":"outline","icon":"camera","text":{"en":"Photo search","ar":"البحث بالصور"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"listitem","art":"shirt","text":{"en":"Linen shirt","ar":"قميص كتان"},"value":{"en":"650 EGP","ar":"650 جنيه"},"gap":"m"}]},"options":[{"id":"tech","text":{"en":"\"Powered by our new neural network\"","ar":"«يعمل بشبكتنا العصبية الجديدة»"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Dar · Clothes","ar":"دار · ملابس"},"back":true,"actions":[{"icon":"shopping-cart","aria":{"en":"Cart","ar":"السلة"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"searchbar","text":{"en":"Search clothes and bags","ar":"ابحث في الملابس والحقائب"}},{"kind":"button","style":"outline","icon":"camera","text":{"en":"Powered by our new neural network","ar":"يعمل بشبكتنا العصبية الجديدة"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"listitem","art":"shirt","text":{"en":"Linen shirt","ar":"قميص كتان"},"value":{"en":"650 EGP","ar":"650 جنيه"},"gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"engine","text":{"en":"\"AI visual search engine\"","ar":"«محرّك بحث بصري بالذكاء الاصطناعي»"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Dar · Clothes","ar":"دار · ملابس"},"back":true,"actions":[{"icon":"shopping-cart","aria":{"en":"Cart","ar":"السلة"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"searchbar","text":{"en":"Search clothes and bags","ar":"ابحث في الملابس والحقائب"}},{"kind":"button","style":"outline","icon":"camera","text":{"en":"AI visual search engine","ar":"محرّك بحث بصري بالذكاء الاصطناعي"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"listitem","art":"shirt","text":{"en":"Linen shirt","ar":"قميص كتان"},"value":{"en":"650 EGP","ar":"650 جنيه"},"gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"benefit","text":{"en":"\"Snap a bag or an outfit, see similar ones we sell\"","ar":"«صوّر حقيبة أو ملابس، وشاهد مثلها عندنا»"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Dar · Clothes","ar":"دار · ملابس"},"back":true,"actions":[{"icon":"shopping-cart","aria":{"en":"Cart","ar":"السلة"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"searchbar","text":{"en":"Search clothes and bags","ar":"ابحث في الملابس والحقائب"}},{"kind":"button","style":"outline","icon":"camera","text":{"en":"Snap a bag or an outfit, see similar ones we sell","ar":"صوّر حقيبة أو ملابس، وشاهد مثلها عندنا"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"listitem","art":"shirt","text":{"en":"Linen shirt","ar":"قميص كتان"},"value":{"en":"650 EGP","ar":"650 جنيه"},"gap":"m"}]}}],"answer":["benefit"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P12-012","when":["tech","engine"],"feedback":{"en":"Customers don't shop for technology. They want to know what the button does for them.","ar":"العملاء لا يشترون تقنية. يريدون أن يعرفوا ماذا يفعل لهم هذا الزر."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Which title tells a customer what they'll get?","ar":"أي عنوان يقول للعميل ماذا سيحصل عليه؟"},{"en":"Which one also hints at what it works for?","ar":"أي واحد يلمّح أيضًا إلى ما يعمل معه؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Say what it does for people, and for what.","ar":"صحيح. قل ماذا يفعل للناس، ومع أي شيء."},"explain":{"en":"A benefit-first title tells people why to tap it, and naming bags and outfits quietly sets the limits.","ar":"العنوان الذي يبدأ بالفائدة يقول للناس لماذا يضغطون عليه، وذِكر الحقائب والملابس يوضّح الحدود بهدوء."},"speaker":"youssef"},{"id":"S05","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P12-U02-01","part":"guided","rules":["R06"],"value":{"en":"Mental Models (People + AI): offer examples of how it works that make the product's value clear.","ar":"النماذج الذهنية (People + AI): قدّم أمثلة على طريقة عمله توضّح قيمة المنتج."},"ref":{"url":"https://pair.withgoogle.com/chapter/mental-models/","quote":"Offer examples of how it works that clarify the value of the product."},"scenario":{"en":"The first time a customer opens photo search, we have room for one small screen before the camera.","ar":"أول مرة يفتح فيها العميل البحث بالصور، عندنا مساحة لشاشة صغيرة واحدة قبل الكاميرا."},"prompt":{"en":"Tap each option to see it. What should that screen show?","ar":"اضغط على كل خيار لتراه. ماذا يجب أن تعرض هذه الشاشة؟"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Dar · Clothes","ar":"دار · ملابس"},"back":true,"actions":[{"icon":"shopping-cart","aria":{"en":"Cart","ar":"السلة"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"photo","text":{"en":"Camera","ar":"الكاميرا"}},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"First time: one small screen before the camera opens","ar":"أول مرة: شاشة صغيرة واحدة قبل أن تُفتح الكاميرا"},"gap":"s"}]},"options":[{"id":"example","text":{"en":"One example: a photo of a red bag and the 4 similar bags it found, plus \"Not for jewellery yet\"","ar":"مثال واحد: صورة حقيبة حمراء و4 حقائب مشابهة وجدها، مع «لا يعمل مع المجوهرات بعد»"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Dar · Clothes","ar":"دار · ملابس"},"back":true,"actions":[{"icon":"shopping-cart","aria":{"en":"Cart","ar":"السلة"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"photo"}],"overlay":{"type":"sheet","title":{"en":"Search with a photo","ar":"ابحث بصورة"},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","art":"photo","text":{"en":"Your photo: a red bag","ar":"صورتك: حقيبة حمراء"},"sub":{"en":"4 similar bags found","ar":"وجدنا 4 حقائب مشابهة"}},{"kind":"banner","tone":"warn","icon":"info","text":{"en":"Not for jewellery yet","ar":"لا يعمل مع المجوهرات بعد"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","icon":"camera","text":{"en":"Open camera","ar":"افتح الكاميرا"},"gap":"s"}]}}},{"id":"list","text":{"en":"A full list of the 60 product types it supports","ar":"قائمة كاملة بأنواع المنتجات الـ 60 التي يدعمها"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Dar · Clothes","ar":"دار · ملابس"},"back":true,"actions":[{"icon":"shopping-cart","aria":{"en":"Cart","ar":"السلة"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"photo"}],"overlay":{"type":"sheet","title":{"en":"60 product types we support","ar":"60 نوعًا من المنتجات ندعمها"},"blocks":[{"kind":"list","style":"bullet","items":[{"en":"Bags","ar":"حقائب"},{"en":"Shirts","ar":"قمصان"},{"en":"Dresses","ar":"فساتين"},{"en":"Shoes","ar":"أحذية"},{"en":"Scarves","ar":"أوشحة"},{"en":"Belts","ar":"أحزمة"}]},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"+ 54 more…","ar":"+ 54 نوعًا آخر…"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"button","icon":"camera","text":{"en":"Open camera","ar":"افتح الكاميرا"},"gap":"s"}]}}},{"id":"video","text":{"en":"A 2-minute video about how the AI was trained","ar":"فيديو مدته دقيقتان عن طريقة تدريب الذكاء الاصطناعي"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Dar · Clothes","ar":"دار · ملابس"},"back":true,"actions":[{"icon":"shopping-cart","aria":{"en":"Cart","ar":"السلة"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"photo"}],"overlay":{"type":"sheet","title":{"en":"How our AI was trained","ar":"كيف درّبنا ذكاءنا الاصطناعي"},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"chart","text":{"en":"▶ 2:00","ar":"▶ 2:00"}},{"kind":"button","icon":"camera","text":{"en":"Open camera","ar":"افتح الكاميرا"},"gap":"s"}]}}}],"answer":["example"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P12-013","when":["list","video"],"feedback":{"en":"Too long for a moment before the camera. One clear example shows the value and the limits at a glance.","ar":"هذا طويل جدًا لشاشة تظهر لحظات قبل الكاميرا. والمثال الواحد الواضح يُظهر القيمة والحدود بنظرة واحدة."}}],"hints":[{"en":"What can a customer take in within a few seconds?","ar":"ماذا يستطيع العميل أن يستوعب في ثوانٍ؟"},{"en":"Which option shows the feature working?","ar":"أي خيار يُظهر الميزة وهي تعمل؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Right. One example teaches more than a list.","ar":"صحيح. مثال واحد يعلّم أكثر من قائمة."},"explain":{"en":"Seeing a good result tells people what to try, and the short note tells them what not to.","ar":"رؤية نتيجة جيدة تقول للناس ماذا يجرّبون، والملاحظة القصيرة تقول لهم ماذا يتجنّبون."},"speaker":"youssef"},{"id":"S06","type":"compare","skill":"SK-P12-U02-01","part":"contrast","confidence":true,"rules":["R11"],"value":{"en":"Contrast: magic vs honest limits. Mental Models (People + AI): be up-front about what the product can and can't do from the first interaction, ideally in marketing.","ar":"مقارنة: سحر مقابل حدود صادقة. النماذج الذهنية (People + AI): كن صريحًا فيما يستطيعه المنتج وما لا يستطيعه من أول تعامل، ويُفضّل في التسويق."},"ref":{"url":"https://pair.withgoogle.com/chapter/mental-models/","quote":"Be up-front about what your product can and can’t do the first time the user interacts with it, ideally in your marketing messages."},"scenario":{"en":"We're rewriting the ad. Two versions:","ar":"نعيد كتابة الإعلان. وهاتان نسختان:"},"prompt":{"en":"Which ad should we run?","ar":"أي إعلان ننشر ليجد العملاء ما وعدناهم به؟"},"a":{"label":{"en":"A: \"Smarter than ever. Our AI finds anything you can imagine.\"","ar":"A: «أذكى من أي وقت مضى. ذكاؤنا الاصطناعي يجد أي شيء تتخيّله.»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"logo":true,"actions":[{"icon":"shopping-cart","aria":{"en":"Cart","ar":"السلة"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"searchbar","text":{"en":"Search Dar","ar":"ابحث في دار"}},{"kind":"card","art":"shirt","blocks":[{"kind":"badge","icon":"sparkle","text":{"en":"Photo search","ar":"البحث بالصور"}},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Smarter than ever. Our AI finds anything you can imagine.","ar":"أذكى من أي وقت مضى. ذكاؤنا الاصطناعي يجد أي شيء تتخيّله."}},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Try it","ar":"جرّبه"}}],"gap":"s"}]}},"b":{"label":{"en":"B: \"Snap a bag or an outfit, see similar ones. Jewellery coming soon.\"","ar":"B: «صوّر حقيبة أو ملابس، وشاهد مثلها. المجوهرات قريبًا.»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"logo":true,"actions":[{"icon":"shopping-cart","aria":{"en":"Cart","ar":"السلة"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"searchbar","text":{"en":"Search Dar","ar":"ابحث في دار"}},{"kind":"card","art":"shirt","blocks":[{"kind":"badge","icon":"camera","text":{"en":"Photo search","ar":"البحث بالصور"}},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Snap a bag or an outfit, see similar ones. Jewellery coming soon.","ar":"صوّر حقيبة أو ملابس، وشاهد مثلها. المجوهرات قريبًا."}},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Try it","ar":"جرّبه"}}],"gap":"s"}]}},"answer":"b","reason":{"prompt":{"en":"Why is B better?","ar":"لماذا B أفضل؟"},"options":[{"id":"trust","text":{"en":"Customers try what works, get good results, and trust it","ar":"العملاء يجرّبون ما يعمل، فيحصلون على نتائج جيدة، ويثقون به"}},{"id":"modest","text":{"en":"Modest ads always sell more","ar":"الإعلانات المتواضعة تبيع أكثر دائمًا"}},{"id":"short","text":{"en":"B is shorter","ar":"B أقصر"}}],"answer":["trust"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P12-011","when":["modest","short"],"feedback":{"en":"It's about matching the promise to the product. When they match, people's first tries succeed.","ar":"المسألة أن يطابق الوعد المنتج. وحين يتطابقان، تنجح أول محاولات الناس."}}]},"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P12-011","when":["a"],"feedback":{"en":"A sounds exciting, but it repeats the first mistake. Customers will snap rings again and feel cheated.","ar":"A يبدو مثيرًا، لكنه يكرّر الخطأ الأول. سيصوّر العملاء الخواتم مرة أخرى ويشعرون بالخداع."}}],"hints":[{"en":"What will customers try after each ad?","ar":"ماذا سيجرّب العملاء بعد كل إعلان؟"},{"en":"Which ad can the product live up to?","ar":"أي إعلان يستطيع المنتج أن يفي به؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Promise what it does, and it will delight.","ar":"صحيح. عِد بما يفعله، وسيُسعد الناس."},"explain":{"en":"Honest limits aren't weakness. They point people to where the feature shines.","ar":"الحدود الصادقة ليست ضعفًا. بل توجّه الناس إلى حيث تتميّز الميزة."},"speaker":"youssef"},{"id":"S07","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P12-U02-04","part":"independent","speaker":"sara","rules":["R14"],"value":{"en":"New case. Mental Models (People + AI): emphasise how the app will benefit people, and don't emphasise the underlying technology.","ar":"حالة جديدة. النماذج الذهنية (People + AI): ركّز على فائدة التطبيق للناس، ولا تركّز على التقنية التي خلفه."},"ref":{"url":"https://pair.withgoogle.com/chapter/mental-models/","quote":"Emphasize how the app will benefit users."},"scenario":{"en":"I'm designing a banking app. A new feature sorts each payment into groups like food, transport and bills. I need its one-line description.","ar":"أصمّم تطبيقًا بنكيًا. وميزة جديدة تصنّف كل دفعة في مجموعات مثل الطعام والمواصلات والفواتير. وأحتاج وصفها في سطر واحد."},"prompt":{"en":"Tap each option to see it. Which line is best?","ar":"اضغط على كل خيار لتراه. أي سطر يجعل العميل يفهم ما يكسبه من الميزة؟"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"app":{"id":"rasid","name":{"en":"Rasid","ar":"رصيد"},"color":"#1C3D6E","icon":"bank","domain":"rasid.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Spending groups","ar":"فئات المصروفات"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"badge","icon":"sparkle","text":{"en":"New","ar":"جديد"}},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"One line about this feature goes here","ar":"هنا سطر واحد يصف هذه الميزة"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"fork-knife","text":{"en":"Food","ar":"الطعام"},"value":{"en":"2,300 EGP","ar":"2,300 جنيه"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"bus","text":{"en":"Transport","ar":"المواصلات"},"value":{"en":"900 EGP","ar":"900 جنيه"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"lightning","text":{"en":"Bills","ar":"الفواتير"},"value":{"en":"1,400 EGP","ar":"1,400 جنيه"}}]},"options":[{"id":"ml","text":{"en":"\"Uses machine learning to classify your transactions\"","ar":"«يستخدم تعلّم الآلة لتصنيف معاملاتك»"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"rasid","name":{"en":"Rasid","ar":"رصيد"},"color":"#1C3D6E","icon":"bank","domain":"rasid.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Spending groups","ar":"فئات المصروفات"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"badge","icon":"sparkle","text":{"en":"New","ar":"جديد"}},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"Uses machine learning to classify your transactions","ar":"يستخدم تعلّم الآلة لتصنيف معاملاتك"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"fork-knife","text":{"en":"Food","ar":"الطعام"},"value":{"en":"2,300 EGP","ar":"2,300 جنيه"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"bus","text":{"en":"Transport","ar":"المواصلات"},"value":{"en":"900 EGP","ar":"900 جنيه"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"lightning","text":{"en":"Bills","ar":"الفواتير"},"value":{"en":"1,400 EGP","ar":"1,400 جنيه"}}]}},{"id":"benefit","text":{"en":"\"See where your money goes each month\"","ar":"«اعرف أين تذهب أموالك كل شهر»"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"rasid","name":{"en":"Rasid","ar":"رصيد"},"color":"#1C3D6E","icon":"bank","domain":"rasid.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Spending groups","ar":"فئات المصروفات"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"badge","icon":"sparkle","text":{"en":"New","ar":"جديد"}},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"See where your money goes each month","ar":"اعرف أين تذهب أموالك كل شهر"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"fork-knife","text":{"en":"Food","ar":"الطعام"},"value":{"en":"2,300 EGP","ar":"2,300 جنيه"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"bus","text":{"en":"Transport","ar":"المواصلات"},"value":{"en":"900 EGP","ar":"900 جنيه"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"lightning","text":{"en":"Bills","ar":"الفواتير"},"value":{"en":"1,400 EGP","ar":"1,400 جنيه"}}]}},{"id":"smart","text":{"en":"\"Our smartest AI yet\"","ar":"«أذكى ذكاء اصطناعي عندنا حتى الآن»"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"rasid","name":{"en":"Rasid","ar":"رصيد"},"color":"#1C3D6E","icon":"bank","domain":"rasid.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Spending groups","ar":"فئات المصروفات"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"badge","icon":"sparkle","text":{"en":"New","ar":"جديد"}},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"Our smartest AI yet","ar":"أذكى ذكاء اصطناعي عندنا حتى الآن"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"fork-knife","text":{"en":"Food","ar":"الطعام"},"value":{"en":"2,300 EGP","ar":"2,300 جنيه"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"bus","text":{"en":"Transport","ar":"المواصلات"},"value":{"en":"900 EGP","ar":"900 جنيه"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"lightning","text":{"en":"Bills","ar":"الفواتير"},"value":{"en":"1,400 EGP","ar":"1,400 جنيه"}}]}}],"answer":["benefit"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P12-012","when":["ml","smart"],"feedback":{"en":"Both talk about the technology. Customers want to know what they get: a clear view of their spending.","ar":"كلا السطرين يتحدّث عن التقنية. والعملاء يريدون معرفة ما سيحصلون عليه: صورة واضحة لمصروفاتهم."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Why would a customer care about this feature?","ar":"لماذا سيهتمّ العميل بهذه الميزة؟"},{"en":"Which line answers that?","ar":"أي سطر يجيب عن ذلك؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Lead with what people get.","ar":"صحيح. ابدأ بما سيحصل عليه الناس."},"explain":{"en":"Keep the technology for a \"How it works\" link, for those who want it.","ar":"ضع تفاصيل التقنية في رابط «كيف يعمل»، لمن يريدها."}},{"id":"S08","type":"card","part":"recap","icons":["warn","target","idea","ok"],"title":{"en":"What you did","ar":"ماذا تعلّمت"},"body":{"en":"- **Found the cause:** the \"magic\" promise, not the AI, caused the bad reviews.\n- **Benefit first:** you named the button by what it does for customers.\n- **One example:** you showed a red bag and its matches, plus the limit.\n- **Honest ad:** you chose the ad that says what it can't do yet.\n- **No tech talk:** you described spending groups by what customers get.\n\nNext lesson: introduce AI at the right moment.","ar":"- **وجدت السبب:** وعد «السحر»، لا الذكاء الاصطناعي، هو سبب التقييمات السيئة.\n- **الفائدة أولًا:** سمّيت الزر بما يفعله للعملاء.\n- **مثال واحد:** عرضت حقيبة حمراء وما يشبهها، مع الحدود.\n- **إعلان صادق:** اخترت الإعلان الذي يقول ما لا يستطيعه بعد.\n- **بلا كلام تقني:** وصفت تصنيف المصروفات بما يحصل عليه العملاء.\n\nالدرس التالي: قدّم الذكاء الاصطناعي في اللحظة المناسبة."}}]}$uxg$::jsonb),
  ($uxg$P12-U02-L02$uxg$, $uxg$6f41841626f94c4c802cd22ddebb0b1324743681cd93886c380a7a3f751d03f1$uxg$, $uxg${"id":"P12-U02-L02","mode":"lesson","minutes":7,"title":{"en":"Introduce AI at the right moment","ar":"قدّم الذكاء الاصطناعي في اللحظة المناسبة"},"summary":{"en":"Replace a notes app's long AI tour with short tips at the moment of use, and say how it learns.","ar":"استبدل الجولة التعريفية الطويلة (Onboarding tour) في تطبيق ملاحظات بتلميحات قصيرة وقت الاستخدام، واشرح كيف يتعلّم التطبيق."},"speaker":"rami","review_labels":{"MC-P12-014":{"en":"Introduce AI when it's relevant","ar":"قدّم الذكاء الاصطناعي حين يكون مفيدًا"},"MC-P12-015":{"en":"Let people try it safely","ar":"دع الناس يجرّبونه بأمان"},"MC-P12-016":{"en":"Don't interrupt people mid-task","ar":"لا تقاطع الناس أثناء مهمتهم"},"MC-P12-017":{"en":"Say what feedback changes, and when","ar":"قل ما الذي يغيّره رأي الناس (Feedback)، ومتى"}},"steps":[{"id":"S01","type":"card","part":"hook","title":{"en":"Six screens before the first note","ar":"ست شاشات قبل أول ملاحظة"},"body":{"en":"I'm designing a notes app with three AI features: summarise a long note, suggest tags, and turn a whiteboard photo into text.\n\nRight now, new users see a 6-screen tour of all three before they can write anything. Most skip it, and later nobody knows the features exist.","ar":"أصمّم تطبيق ملاحظات فيه ثلاث ميزات ذكاء اصطناعي: تلخيص الملاحظة الطويلة، واقتراح وسوم (Tags)، وتحويل صورة السبورة إلى نص.\n\nحاليًا، يرى المستخدمون الجدد جولة تعريفية من 6 شاشات عن الميزات الثلاث قبل أن يكتبوا أي شيء. وأغلبهم يتخطّاها، ولاحقًا لا أحد يعرف أن الميزات موجودة."},"mock":{"app":{"id":"mudawwana","name":{"en":"Mudawwana","ar":"مدوّنة"},"color":"#EAB308","icon":"note-pencil","domain":"mudawwana.example"},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"document"},{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Welcome! (1 of 6)","ar":"أهلًا! (1 من 6)"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"Meet our AI: Summarise, Smart tags, Whiteboard to text…","ar":"تعرّف على ذكائنا الاصطناعي: التلخيص، والوسوم الذكية، والسبورة إلى نص…"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":"● ○ ○ ○ ○ ○","gap":"s"}],"footer":[{"kind":"row","blocks":[{"kind":"button","style":"text","text":{"en":"Skip","ar":"تخطٍّ"}},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Next","ar":"التالي"}}]}]}},{"id":"S02","type":"choose","skill":"SK-P12-U02-02","part":"try","rules":["R12"],"value":{"en":"Try first. Mental Models (People + AI): introduce an AI feature at the moment it's relevant, not in a long list of features at the start.","ar":"جرّب أولًا. النماذج الذهنية (People + AI): قدّم ميزة الذكاء الاصطناعي في اللحظة التي تكون فيها مفيدة، لا في قائمة طويلة من الميزات في البداية."},"ref":{"url":"https://pair.withgoogle.com/chapter/mental-models/","quote":"Introduce an AI-driven feature at the moment it is relevant to the user."},"prompt":{"en":"When should we tell people about \"Summarise\"?","ar":"متى نخبر الناس بميزة «التلخيص»؟"},"options":[{"id":"tour","text":{"en":"Keep it in the tour, but make the tour 3 screens","ar":"نُبقيه في الجولة، لكن نجعلها 3 شاشات"}},{"id":"email","text":{"en":"In a welcome email after a week","ar":"في بريد ترحيب بعد أسبوع"}},{"id":"moment","text":{"en":"When a note gets long, show \"Summarise this note?\" next to it","ar":"حين تطول الملاحظة، اعرض «هل نلخّص هذه الملاحظة؟» بجانبها"}}],"answer":["moment"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P12-014","when":["tour","email"],"feedback":{"en":"Both explain it when people don't need it. They forget before they ever have a long note.","ar":"كلا الخيارين يشرح الميزة حين لا يحتاجها الناس. فينسونها قبل أن تصبح عندهم ملاحظة طويلة."}}],"hints":[{"en":"When is a summary actually useful?","ar":"متى يكون التلخيص مفيدًا فعلًا؟"},{"en":"Which option appears right at that moment?","ar":"أي خيار يظهر في تلك اللحظة بالضبط؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Right. The best time to learn a feature is when you need it.","ar":"صحيح. أفضل وقت لتعلّم ميزة هو حين تحتاجها."},"explain":{"en":"A tip at the right moment is short, clear, and used. A long tour up front is skipped and forgotten.","ar":"التلميح في اللحظة المناسبة قصير وواضح ويُستخدم. أما الجولة الطويلة في البداية فتُتخطّى وتُنسى."}},{"id":"S03","type":"card","part":"concept","icons":["clock","tap","list","ok"],"title":{"en":"Introduce AI when it's useful","ar":"قدّم الذكاء الاصطناعي حين يكون مفيدًا"},"body":{"en":"- **At the right moment:** show a feature when it's relevant, not in a long tour at the start.\n- **Short:** a line or two, right where people need it.\n- **Don't interrupt:** never pop up a new feature while people are busy with something else.\n- **Let people try safely:** suggest a small action they can undo.\n- **Say how it learns:** if feedback makes it better, say what changes and when.","ar":"- **في اللحظة المناسبة:** أظهر الميزة حين تكون مفيدة، لا في جولة طويلة في البداية.\n- **تلميح قصير:** سطر أو سطران، حيث يحتاجه الناس.\n- **لا تقاطع:** لا تُظهر ميزة جديدة فجأة والناس مشغولون بشيء آخر.\n- **دع الناس يجرّبون بأمان:** اقترح إجراءً صغيرًا يمكن التراجع عنه.\n- **قل كيف يتعلّم:** إذا كان رأي الناس (Feedback) يحسّنه، فقل ماذا يتغيّر ومتى."}},{"id":"S04","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P12-U02-02","part":"guided","rules":["R06"],"value":{"en":"Mental Models (People + AI): suggest a low-risk or reversible action people can try right away; people are curious how AI will behave.","ar":"النماذج الذهنية (People + AI): اقترح إجراءً قليل المخاطر أو قابلًا للتراجع يجرّبه الناس فورًا؛ فالناس فضوليون لمعرفة كيف سيتصرّف الذكاء الاصطناعي."},"ref":{"url":"https://pair.withgoogle.com/chapter/mental-models/","quote":"Suggest a low-risk or reversible action they can try right away"},"scenario":{"en":"A user taps \"Summarise this note?\" for the first time. They don't know what it will do to their note.","ar":"مستخدم يضغط «هل نلخّص هذه الملاحظة؟» لأول مرة. ولا يعرف ماذا سيحدث لملاحظته."},"prompt":{"en":"Tap each option to see it. What should happen?","ar":"اضغط على كل خيار لتراه. ماذا يحدث حين يضغط، ليجرّب دون خوف على ملاحظته؟"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"app":{"id":"mudawwana","name":{"en":"Mudawwana","ar":"مدوّنة"},"color":"#EAB308","icon":"note-pencil","domain":"mudawwana.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Trip planning","ar":"تخطيط الرحلة"},"back":true,"actions":[{"icon":"dots-three","aria":{"en":"More","ar":"المزيد"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"chip","icon":"sparkle","active":true,"text":{"en":"Summarise this note?","ar":"هل نلخّص هذه الملاحظة؟"}},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"Flights: compare EgyptAir and Nile Air, prices change on Thursdays. Hotel: near the sea, under 2,000 a night. Ask Mona about the visa. Book the bus from the airport…","ar":"الطيران: قارن بين شركتين، والأسعار تتغيّر يوم الخميس. الفندق: قريب من البحر، أقل من 2,000 في الليلة. اسأل منى عن التأشيرة. احجز الحافلة من المطار…"}}]},"options":[{"id":"preview","text":{"en":"Show the summary above the note, with \"Keep\" and \"Remove\"; the note stays as it is","ar":"يظهر التلخيص فوق الملاحظة، مع «احتفظ» و«احذف»؛ والملاحظة تبقى كما هي"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"mudawwana","name":{"en":"Mudawwana","ar":"مدوّنة"},"color":"#EAB308","icon":"note-pencil","domain":"mudawwana.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Trip planning","ar":"تخطيط الرحلة"},"back":true,"actions":[{"icon":"dots-three","aria":{"en":"More","ar":"المزيد"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"card","blocks":[{"kind":"badge","icon":"sparkle","text":{"en":"Summary","ar":"التلخيص"}},{"kind":"list","style":"bullet","items":[{"en":"Compare 2 airlines by Thursday","ar":"قارن شركتي الطيران قبل الخميس"},{"en":"Hotel by the sea, under 2,000","ar":"فندق على البحر، أقل من 2,000"},{"en":"Ask Mona about the visa","ar":"اسأل منى عن التأشيرة"}]},{"kind":"row","blocks":[{"kind":"button","style":"outline","text":{"en":"Remove","ar":"احذف"}},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Keep","ar":"احتفظ"}}]}]},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"Flights: compare EgyptAir and Nile Air, prices change on Thursdays. Hotel: near the sea, under 2,000 a night. Ask Mona about the visa. Book the bus from the airport…","ar":"الطيران: قارن بين شركتين، والأسعار تتغيّر يوم الخميس. الفندق: قريب من البحر، أقل من 2,000 في الليلة. اسأل منى عن التأشيرة. احجز الحافلة من المطار…"}}]}},{"id":"replace","text":{"en":"Replace the note with the summary","ar":"يستبدل الملاحظة بالتلخيص"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"mudawwana","name":{"en":"Mudawwana","ar":"مدوّنة"},"color":"#EAB308","icon":"note-pencil","domain":"mudawwana.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Trip planning","ar":"تخطيط الرحلة"},"back":true,"actions":[{"icon":"dots-three","aria":{"en":"More","ar":"المزيد"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"list","style":"bullet","items":[{"en":"Compare 2 airlines by Thursday","ar":"قارن شركتي الطيران قبل الخميس"},{"en":"Hotel by the sea, under 2,000","ar":"فندق على البحر، أقل من 2,000"},{"en":"Ask Mona about the visa","ar":"اسأل منى عن التأشيرة"}]},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Your original note is gone.","ar":"ملاحظتك الأصلية اختفت."},"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"all","text":{"en":"Offer to summarise all their notes at once","ar":"يعرض تلخيص كل ملاحظاته مرة واحدة"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"mudawwana","name":{"en":"Mudawwana","ar":"مدوّنة"},"color":"#EAB308","icon":"note-pencil","domain":"mudawwana.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Trip planning","ar":"تخطيط الرحلة"},"back":true,"actions":[{"icon":"dots-three","aria":{"en":"More","ar":"المزيد"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"Flights: compare EgyptAir and Nile Air, prices change on Thursdays. Hotel: near the sea, under 2,000 a night. Ask Mona about the visa. Book the bus from the airport…","ar":"الطيران: قارن بين شركتين، والأسعار تتغيّر يوم الخميس. الفندق: قريب من البحر، أقل من 2,000 في الليلة. اسأل منى عن التأشيرة. احجز الحافلة من المطار…"}}],"overlay":{"type":"dialog","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Summarise all 214 notes?","ar":"هل نلخّص كل ملاحظاتك الـ 214؟"}},{"kind":"row","blocks":[{"kind":"button","style":"outline","text":{"en":"Not now","ar":"ليس الآن"}},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Summarise all","ar":"لخّص الكل"}}],"gap":"s"}]}}}],"answer":["preview"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P12-015","when":["replace","all"],"feedback":{"en":"A first try should be small and safe. Changing their notes before they've seen a result makes people afraid to try.","ar":"التجربة الأولى يجب أن تكون صغيرة وآمنة. وتغيير ملاحظاتهم قبل أن يروا النتيجة يجعل الناس يخافون من التجربة."}}],"hints":[{"en":"What would make a first-timer feel safe to try?","ar":"ما الذي يجعل من يجرّب أول مرة يشعر بالأمان؟"},{"en":"Which option leaves the note untouched?","ar":"أي خيار يترك الملاحظة كما هي؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Try it, see it, keep it or drop it.","ar":"صحيح. جرّبه، وشاهده، واحتفظ به أو اتركه."},"explain":{"en":"When trying is safe, people explore and learn what the AI does well.","ar":"حين تكون التجربة آمنة، يستكشف الناس ويتعلّمون ما يجيده الذكاء الاصطناعي."},"speaker":"rami"},{"id":"S05","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P12-U02-05","part":"guided","rules":["R06"],"value":{"en":"Mental Models (People + AI): if you can, explain exactly what impact people's feedback will have on the AI, and when it will take effect.","ar":"النماذج الذهنية (People + AI): إن استطعت، فاشرح بالضبط أثر ملاحظات الناس على الذكاء الاصطناعي، ومتى يظهر هذا الأثر."},"ref":{"url":"https://pair.withgoogle.com/chapter/mental-models/","quote":"If you can, explain precisely what impact the feedback will have on your AI, and when it will take effect."},"scenario":{"en":"Tag suggestions get better when people accept or reject them. We want to tell people this, next to the first suggested tags.","ar":"اقتراحات الوسوم تتحسّن حين يقبلها الناس أو يرفضونها. ونريد أن نخبرهم بذلك، بجانب أول وسوم مقترحة."},"prompt":{"en":"Tap each option to see it. Which message is best?","ar":"اضغط على كل خيار لتراه. أي رسالة تخبر الناس كيف يساعدون الاقتراحات على التحسّن؟"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"app":{"id":"mudawwana","name":{"en":"Mudawwana","ar":"مدوّنة"},"color":"#EAB308","icon":"note-pencil","domain":"mudawwana.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Shopping","ar":"المشتريات"},"back":true,"actions":[{"icon":"dots-three","aria":{"en":"More","ar":"المزيد"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"Milk, bread, eggs, rice, olive oil","ar":"حليب، خبز، بيض، أرز، زيت زيتون"}},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Suggested tags","ar":"وسوم مقترحة"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"chips","items":[{"text":{"en":"✨ #groceries ✓ ✕","ar":"✨ #بقالة ✓ ✕"}},{"text":{"en":"✨ #weekly ✓ ✕","ar":"✨ #أسبوعي ✓ ✕"}}]}]},"options":[{"id":"none","text":{"en":"No message; it learns quietly in the background","ar":"بلا رسالة؛ يتعلّم بهدوء في الخلفية"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"mudawwana","name":{"en":"Mudawwana","ar":"مدوّنة"},"color":"#EAB308","icon":"note-pencil","domain":"mudawwana.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Shopping","ar":"المشتريات"},"back":true,"actions":[{"icon":"dots-three","aria":{"en":"More","ar":"المزيد"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"Milk, bread, eggs, rice, olive oil","ar":"حليب، خبز، بيض، أرز، زيت زيتون"}},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Suggested tags","ar":"وسوم مقترحة"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"chips","items":[{"text":{"en":"✨ #groceries ✓ ✕","ar":"✨ #بقالة ✓ ✕"}},{"text":{"en":"✨ #weekly ✓ ✕","ar":"✨ #أسبوعي ✓ ✕"}}]}]}},{"id":"clear","text":{"en":"\"Tap ✓ or ✕. The app learns the tags you use, and suggestions improve within a few days.\"","ar":"«اضغط ✓ أو ✕. التطبيق يتعلّم الوسوم التي تستخدمها، وتتحسّن الاقتراحات خلال أيام.»"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"mudawwana","name":{"en":"Mudawwana","ar":"مدوّنة"},"color":"#EAB308","icon":"note-pencil","domain":"mudawwana.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Shopping","ar":"المشتريات"},"back":true,"actions":[{"icon":"dots-three","aria":{"en":"More","ar":"المزيد"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"Milk, bread, eggs, rice, olive oil","ar":"حليب، خبز، بيض، أرز، زيت زيتون"}},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Suggested tags","ar":"وسوم مقترحة"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"chips","items":[{"text":{"en":"✨ #groceries ✓ ✕","ar":"✨ #بقالة ✓ ✕"}},{"text":{"en":"✨ #weekly ✓ ✕","ar":"✨ #أسبوعي ✓ ✕"}}]},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Tap ✓ or ✕. The app learns the tags you use, and suggestions improve within a few days.","ar":"اضغط ✓ أو ✕. التطبيق يتعلّم الوسوم التي تستخدمها، وتتحسّن الاقتراحات خلال أيام."},"gap":"xs"}]}},{"id":"tech","text":{"en":"\"Our model uses reinforcement learning from your interactions.\"","ar":"«نموذجنا يستخدم التعلّم المعزّز من تفاعلاتك.»"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"mudawwana","name":{"en":"Mudawwana","ar":"مدوّنة"},"color":"#EAB308","icon":"note-pencil","domain":"mudawwana.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Shopping","ar":"المشتريات"},"back":true,"actions":[{"icon":"dots-three","aria":{"en":"More","ar":"المزيد"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"Milk, bread, eggs, rice, olive oil","ar":"حليب، خبز، بيض، أرز، زيت زيتون"}},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Suggested tags","ar":"وسوم مقترحة"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"chips","items":[{"text":{"en":"✨ #groceries ✓ ✕","ar":"✨ #بقالة ✓ ✕"}},{"text":{"en":"✨ #weekly ✓ ✕","ar":"✨ #أسبوعي ✓ ✕"}}]},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Our model uses reinforcement learning from your interactions.","ar":"نموذجنا يستخدم التعلّم المعزّز من تفاعلاتك."},"gap":"xs"}]}}],"answer":["clear"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P12-017","when":["none"],"feedback":{"en":"If people don't know their taps teach the app, they won't bother, and they'll wonder why it changes.","ar":"إذا لم يعرف الناس أن ضغطاتهم تعلّم التطبيق، فلن يهتمّوا، وسيتساءلون لماذا يتغيّر."}},{"id":"MC-P12-017","when":["tech"],"feedback":{"en":"It names the technology but not what people should do, what changes, or when.","ar":"يذكر التقنية لكن لا يقول ماذا يفعل الناس، ولا ماذا يتغيّر، ولا متى."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Which message says what to do, and what happens next?","ar":"أي رسالة تقول ماذا تفعل، وماذا يحدث بعدها؟"},{"en":"Look for a clear \"when\".","ar":"ابحث عن «متى» واضحة."}],"correct":{"en":"Right. What to do, what changes, and when.","ar":"صحيح. ماذا تفعل، وماذا يتغيّر، ومتى."},"explain":{"en":"When people see how their feedback pays off, they give more of it, and the app gets better for them.","ar":"حين يرى الناس أثر رأيهم، يعطون المزيد منه، فيتحسّن التطبيق لهم."},"speaker":"rami"},{"id":"S06","type":"compare","skill":"SK-P12-U02-02","part":"contrast","confidence":true,"rules":["R11"],"value":{"en":"Contrast: two ways to announce a new feature. Mental Models (People + AI): avoid introducing new features when people are busy doing something unrelated.","ar":"مقارنة: طريقتان للإعلان عن ميزة جديدة. النماذج الذهنية (People + AI): تجنّب تقديم ميزات جديدة والناس مشغولون بشيء آخر."},"ref":{"url":"https://pair.withgoogle.com/chapter/mental-models/","quote":"Try to avoid introducing new features when users are busy doing something unrelated."},"scenario":{"en":"We just launched \"Whiteboard to text\" for our existing users. Two ways to tell them:","ar":"أطلقنا للتوّ «السبورة إلى نص» لمستخدمينا الحاليين. وهاتان طريقتان لإخبارهم:"},"prompt":{"en":"Which way should we use?","ar":"أي طريقة نخبر بها المستخدمين، كي يجرّبوا الميزة فعلًا؟"},"a":{"label":{"en":"A: A full-screen pop-up while people are typing a note.","ar":"A: نافذة منبثقة (Pop-up) تملأ الشاشة أثناء كتابة ملاحظة."},"mock":{"app":{"id":"mudawwana","name":{"en":"Mudawwana","ar":"مدوّنة"},"color":"#EAB308","icon":"note-pencil","domain":"mudawwana.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Meeting","ar":"الاجتماع"},"back":true,"actions":[{"icon":"dots-three","aria":{"en":"More","ar":"المزيد"}}]},"keyboard":"text","blocks":[{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"Ideas for the launch: price, date, ads…","ar":"أفكار للإطلاق: السعر، والموعد، والإعلانات…"}}],"overlay":{"type":"full","close":true,"blocks":[{"kind":"icon","icon":"confetti","size":"l","color":"brand"},{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"New! Whiteboard to text","ar":"جديد! السبورة إلى نص"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Try it now","ar":"جرّبه الآن"},"gap":"m"}]}}},"b":{"label":{"en":"B: A short tip the next time someone adds a photo of a whiteboard.","ar":"B: تلميح قصير في المرة القادمة التي يضيف فيها أحد صورة سبورة."},"mock":{"app":{"id":"mudawwana","name":{"en":"Mudawwana","ar":"مدوّنة"},"color":"#EAB308","icon":"note-pencil","domain":"mudawwana.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Meeting","ar":"الاجتماع"},"back":true,"actions":[{"icon":"dots-three","aria":{"en":"More","ar":"المزيد"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"document","text":{"en":"Whiteboard photo","ar":"صورة السبورة"}},{"kind":"banner","tone":"info","icon":"lightbulb","text":{"en":"Turn this photo into text you can edit?","ar":"هل نحوّل هذه الصورة إلى نص يمكنك تعديله؟"},"gap":"s"}]}},"answer":"b","reason":{"prompt":{"en":"Why is B better?","ar":"لماذا B أفضل؟"},"options":[{"id":"moment","text":{"en":"It shows up when the feature is useful, without stopping what people are doing","ar":"يظهر حين تكون الميزة مفيدة، دون أن يوقف ما يفعله الناس"}},{"id":"small","text":{"en":"Small tips are always prettier","ar":"التلميحات الصغيرة أجمل دائمًا"}},{"id":"later","text":{"en":"New features should be hidden at first","ar":"الميزات الجديدة يجب أن تُخفى في البداية"}}],"answer":["moment"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P12-016","when":["small","later"],"feedback":{"en":"It's about timing. B appears exactly when a whiteboard photo is there to convert.","ar":"المسألة توقيت. B يظهر بالضبط حين تكون هناك صورة سبورة لتحويلها."}}]},"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P12-016","when":["a"],"feedback":{"en":"A stops people mid-sentence for a feature they don't need right now. Most close it and forget it.","ar":"A يوقف الناس في منتصف الجملة لميزة لا يحتاجونها الآن. وأغلبهم يغلقه وينساه."}}],"hints":[{"en":"What is the person doing when each message appears?","ar":"ماذا يفعل الشخص حين تظهر كل رسالة؟"},{"en":"When is \"Whiteboard to text\" useful?","ar":"متى تكون «السبورة إلى نص» مفيدة؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Right time, no interruption.","ar":"صحيح. التوقيت الصحيح، بلا مقاطعة."},"explain":{"en":"Announce a feature where it fits the task, not on top of a different one.","ar":"أعلن عن الميزة حيث تناسب المهمة، لا في وسط مهمة أخرى."},"speaker":"rami"},{"id":"S07","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P12-U02-05","part":"independent","speaker":"tarek","rules":["R14"],"value":{"en":"New case. Mental Models (People + AI): explain why people should keep giving feedback, focusing on the value to them.","ar":"حالة جديدة. النماذج الذهنية (People + AI): اشرح لماذا يستمر الناس في إعطاء ملاحظاتهم، مع التركيز على قيمتها لهم."},"ref":{"url":"https://pair.withgoogle.com/chapter/mental-models/","quote":"Communicate why people should continue to provide feedback, focusing on the value to them."},"scenario":{"en":"Our pharmacy app reminds customers to reorder their regular medicine. The AI learns from their answers when to remind them. We're adding a question after each reminder.","ar":"تطبيق صيدليتنا يذكّر العملاء بإعادة طلب أدويتهم المعتادة. والذكاء الاصطناعي يتعلّم من إجاباتهم متى يذكّرهم. ونضيف سؤالًا بعد كل تذكير."},"prompt":{"en":"Tap each option to see it. Which question should we use?","ar":"اضغط على كل خيار لتراه. أي سؤال يساعد الذكاء الاصطناعي أن يعرف متى يذكّر العميل؟"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"screen":"lock","blocks":[{"kind":"notification","app":{"id":"dawaa","name":{"en":"Dawaa Pharmacy","ar":"صيدلية دواء"},"color":"#059669","icon":"pill","domain":"dawaa.example"},"title":{"en":"Time to reorder Glucophage?","ar":"هل حان وقت طلب جلوكوفاج؟"},"text":{"en":"About 5 days left in your pack.","ar":"باقي نحو 5 أيام في العلبة."},"time":{"en":"now","ar":"الآن"}},{"kind":"notification","app":{"id":"dawaa","name":{"en":"Dawaa Pharmacy","ar":"صيدلية دواء"},"color":"#059669","icon":"pill","domain":"dawaa.example"},"title":{"en":"Quick question","ar":"سؤال سريع"},"text":{"en":"…","ar":"…"},"time":{"en":"now","ar":"الآن"},"gap":"s"}]},"options":[{"id":"train","text":{"en":"\"Help us train our AI. Rate this reminder.\"","ar":"«ساعدنا في تدريب ذكائنا الاصطناعي. قيّم هذا التذكير.»"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"screen":"lock","blocks":[{"kind":"notification","app":{"id":"dawaa","name":{"en":"Dawaa Pharmacy","ar":"صيدلية دواء"},"color":"#059669","icon":"pill","domain":"dawaa.example"},"title":{"en":"Time to reorder Glucophage?","ar":"هل حان وقت طلب جلوكوفاج؟"},"text":{"en":"About 5 days left in your pack.","ar":"باقي نحو 5 أيام في العلبة."},"time":{"en":"now","ar":"الآن"}},{"kind":"notification","app":{"id":"dawaa","name":{"en":"Dawaa Pharmacy","ar":"صيدلية دواء"},"color":"#059669","icon":"pill","domain":"dawaa.example"},"title":{"en":"Quick question","ar":"سؤال سريع"},"text":{"en":"Help us train our AI. Rate this reminder.","ar":"ساعدنا في تدريب ذكائنا الاصطناعي. قيّم هذا التذكير."},"time":{"en":"now","ar":"الآن"},"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"rate","text":{"en":"\"Rate this reminder from 1 to 5.\"","ar":"«قيّم هذا التذكير من 1 إلى 5.»"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"screen":"lock","blocks":[{"kind":"notification","app":{"id":"dawaa","name":{"en":"Dawaa Pharmacy","ar":"صيدلية دواء"},"color":"#059669","icon":"pill","domain":"dawaa.example"},"title":{"en":"Time to reorder Glucophage?","ar":"هل حان وقت طلب جلوكوفاج؟"},"text":{"en":"About 5 days left in your pack.","ar":"باقي نحو 5 أيام في العلبة."},"time":{"en":"now","ar":"الآن"}},{"kind":"notification","app":{"id":"dawaa","name":{"en":"Dawaa Pharmacy","ar":"صيدلية دواء"},"color":"#059669","icon":"pill","domain":"dawaa.example"},"title":{"en":"Quick question","ar":"سؤال سريع"},"text":{"en":"Rate this reminder from 1 to 5.","ar":"قيّم هذا التذكير من 1 إلى 5."},"time":{"en":"now","ar":"الآن"},"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"value","text":{"en":"\"Was this on time? Your answer helps us remind you before you run out.\"","ar":"«هل جاء التذكير في وقته؟ إجابتك تساعدنا على تذكيرك قبل أن ينفد دواؤك.»"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"screen":"lock","blocks":[{"kind":"notification","app":{"id":"dawaa","name":{"en":"Dawaa Pharmacy","ar":"صيدلية دواء"},"color":"#059669","icon":"pill","domain":"dawaa.example"},"title":{"en":"Time to reorder Glucophage?","ar":"هل حان وقت طلب جلوكوفاج؟"},"text":{"en":"About 5 days left in your pack.","ar":"باقي نحو 5 أيام في العلبة."},"time":{"en":"now","ar":"الآن"}},{"kind":"notification","app":{"id":"dawaa","name":{"en":"Dawaa Pharmacy","ar":"صيدلية دواء"},"color":"#059669","icon":"pill","domain":"dawaa.example"},"title":{"en":"Quick question","ar":"سؤال سريع"},"text":{"en":"Was this on time? Your answer helps us remind you before you run out.","ar":"هل جاء التذكير في وقته؟ إجابتك تساعدنا على تذكيرك قبل أن ينفد دواؤك."},"time":{"en":"now","ar":"الآن"},"gap":"s"}]}}],"answer":["value"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P12-017","when":["train","rate"],"feedback":{"en":"Neither says what the customer gets. \"Before you run out\" gives them a reason to answer every time.","ar":"لا يقول أيّ من السؤالين ماذا سيستفيد العميل. أما «قبل أن ينفد دواؤك» فتعطيه سببًا ليجيب كل مرة."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Why would a customer bother to answer?","ar":"لماذا سيهتمّ العميل بالإجابة؟"},{"en":"Which question tells them what's in it for them?","ar":"أي سؤال يخبرهم بما سيستفيدونه؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Feedback framed as their benefit.","ar":"صحيح. طلبتَ رأيهم وربطته بفائدتهم."},"explain":{"en":"People help the AI when they see how it helps them back.","ar":"الناس يساعدون الذكاء الاصطناعي حين يرون كيف يساعدهم هو بالمقابل."}},{"id":"S08","type":"card","part":"recap","icons":["clock","tap","ok","list"],"title":{"en":"What you did","ar":"ماذا تعلّمت"},"body":{"en":"- **Right moment:** you offered \"Summarise\" when a note gets long.\n- **Safe first try:** you showed the summary without changing the note.\n- **Say how it learns:** you told people their ✓ and ✕ improve tags within days.\n- **No interruption:** you announced \"Whiteboard to text\" when a whiteboard photo appears.\n- **Their benefit:** you asked about reminders in terms of not running out.\n\nNext lesson: don't pretend the AI is a person.","ar":"- **اللحظة المناسبة:** عرضت «التلخيص» حين تطول الملاحظة.\n- **تجربة أولى آمنة:** أظهرت التلخيص دون تغيير الملاحظة.\n- **قل كيف يتعلّم:** أخبرت الناس أن ✓ و✕ تحسّن الوسوم خلال أيام.\n- **بلا مقاطعة:** أعلنت عن «السبورة إلى نص» حين تظهر صورة سبورة.\n- **اربط السؤال بفائدتهم:** ربطت سؤال التذكير بألّا ينفد دواؤهم.\n\nالدرس التالي: لا توهِم الناس أن الذكاء الاصطناعي إنسان."}}]}$uxg$::jsonb),
  ($uxg$P12-U02-L03$uxg$, $uxg$9f25031841041d636ddebe683da6529526234faf3b7930bc9793da5b0ceaa2f3$uxg$, $uxg${"id":"P12-U02-L03","mode":"lesson","minutes":7,"title":{"en":"Don't pretend it's a person","ar":"لا توهِم الناس أنه إنسان"},"summary":{"en":"Fix a clinic's booking chat so patients know it's automated and what they can ask it.","ar":"أصلح محادثة الحجز في عيادة ليعرف المرضى أنها آلية وما الذي يمكنهم طلبه منها."},"speaker":"nour","review_labels":{"MC-P12-018":{"en":"Make clear it's not a person","ar":"وضّح أنه ليس إنسانًا"},"MC-P12-019":{"en":"Human style raises expectations","ar":"الأسلوب البشري يرفع التوقّعات"},"MC-P12-020":{"en":"Tell people what they can ask","ar":"أخبر الناس بما يمكنهم أن يطلبوه"},"MC-P12-011":{"en":"Promise only what it can do","ar":"لا تَعِد إلا بما يستطيعه"}},"steps":[{"id":"S01","type":"card","part":"hook","title":{"en":"\"Dr. Amal\" isn't a doctor","ar":"«د. أمل» ليست طبيبة"},"body":{"en":"We added a chat assistant to book visits. The team called it \"Dr. Amal\", gave it a photo of a smiling woman, and made it say \"I understand how you feel.\"\n\nNow some patients describe their symptoms in detail and ask for medical advice. They think a real doctor is reading.","ar":"أضفنا مساعد محادثة لحجز المواعيد. وسمّاه الفريق «د. أمل»، ووضع له صورة امرأة مبتسمة، وجعله يقول «أفهم ما تشعر به.»\n\nالآن بعض المرضى يصفون أعراضهم بالتفصيل ويطلبون نصيحة طبية. يظنّون أن طبيبة حقيقية تقرأ."},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Dr. Amal · online","ar":"د. أمل · متصلة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"chat","from":"them","name":{"en":"Dr. Amal","ar":"د. أمل"},"avatar":{"art":"doctor"},"text":{"en":"Hi! I'm Amal. I understand how you feel. Tell me everything.","ar":"أهلًا! أنا أمل. أفهم ما تشعر به. احكِ لي كل شيء."},"time":"9:02"}],"footer":[{"kind":"composer","text":{"en":"Write a message","ar":"اكتب رسالة"}}]}},{"id":"S02","type":"choose","skill":"SK-P12-U02-03","part":"try","rules":["R12"],"value":{"en":"Try first. Mental Models (People + AI): when people confuse an AI with a human, they may share more than they would, or rely on it more than they should.","ar":"جرّب أولًا. النماذج الذهنية (People + AI): حين يخلط الناس بين الذكاء الاصطناعي والإنسان، قد يشاركون أكثر مما ينبغي، أو يعتمدون عليه أكثر مما يجب."},"ref":{"url":"https://pair.withgoogle.com/chapter/mental-models/","quote":"When users confuse an AI with a human being, they can sometimes disclose more information than they would otherwise, or rely on the system more than they should, among other issues."},"prompt":{"en":"What should we change first?","ar":"ماذا نغيّر أولًا في مساعد الحجز؟"},"options":[{"id":"clear","text":{"en":"Make clear it's an automatic booking assistant, not a doctor or a person","ar":"نوضّح أنه مساعد حجز آلي، لا طبيبة ولا إنسان"}},{"id":"warmer","text":{"en":"Make it sound even warmer, so patients feel cared for","ar":"نجعله يبدو أكثر دفئًا، ليشعر المرضى بالاهتمام"}},{"id":"typing","text":{"en":"Add \"typing…\" dots so replies feel natural","ar":"نضيف نقاط «يكتب…» لتبدو الردود طبيعية"}}],"answer":["clear"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P12-018","when":["warmer","typing"],"feedback":{"en":"Both make it seem more like a person. Patients would share even more and trust its answers even more.","ar":"كلا الخيارين يجعله أشبه بإنسان. فيشارك المرضى أكثر ويثقون بردوده أكثر."}}],"hints":[{"en":"What do patients think they're talking to?","ar":"مع من يظنّ المرضى أنهم يتحدّثون؟"},{"en":"Which option corrects that?","ar":"أي خيار يصحّح ذلك؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Right. First, be honest about what it is.","ar":"صحيح. أولًا، كن صادقًا بشأن حقيقته."},"explain":{"en":"Patients who think a doctor is reading may skip a real visit. Saying it's automated protects them.","ar":"المريض الذي يظنّ أن طبيبًا يقرأ قد يتخطّى زيارة حقيقية. وإخباره أن المساعد آلي يحميه."}},{"id":"S03","type":"card","part":"concept","icons":["person","warn","list","ok"],"title":{"en":"Don't pretend to be a person","ar":"لا توهِم الناس أنه إنسان"},"body":{"en":"- **Say it's not a person:** clearly, in words everyone understands, whatever their age or skills.\n- **Human style raises expectations:** a human name, a face and \"I understand you\" make people expect a person's understanding.\n- **Tell people what to ask:** \"You can book, move or cancel a visit.\"\n- **Say what it can't do:** AI doesn't work like people do, so name its limits.","ar":"- **قل إنه ليس إنسانًا:** بوضوح، وبكلمات يفهمها الجميع، مهما كان عمرهم أو مهاراتهم.\n- **الأسلوب البشري يرفع التوقّعات:** الاسم البشري، والوجه، و«أفهمك» تجعل الناس يتوقّعون فهم إنسان.\n- **أخبر الناس بما يمكنهم طلبه:** «يمكنك حجز موعد أو تغييره أو إلغاؤه.»\n- **قل ما لا يستطيعه:** الذكاء الاصطناعي لا يعمل كما يعمل الناس، فاذكر حدوده."}},{"id":"S04","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P12-U02-03","part":"guided","rules":["R06"],"value":{"en":"Mental Models (People + AI): set expectations for the kind of commands the AI can understand, to build the right picture of it.","ar":"النماذج الذهنية (People + AI): وضّح نوع الطلبات التي يفهمها الذكاء الاصطناعي، لتتكوّن الصورة الصحيحة عنه."},"ref":{"url":"https://pair.withgoogle.com/chapter/mental-models/","quote":"Set expectations for the kind of commands the AI can understand to reinforce the right mental models."},"scenario":{"en":"We're rewriting the first message patients see when they open the chat.","ar":"نعيد كتابة أول رسالة يراها المرضى حين يفتحون المحادثة."},"prompt":{"en":"Tap each option to see it. Which first message is best?","ar":"اضغط على كل خيار لتراه. أي رسالة أولى تجعل المرضى يعرفون مع من يتحدّثون وماذا يطلبون؟"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Dr. Amal · online","ar":"د. أمل · متصلة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"The chat is empty. What should the first message say?","ar":"المحادثة فارغة. ماذا يجب أن تقول الرسالة الأولى؟"}}],"footer":[{"kind":"composer","text":{"en":"Write a message","ar":"اكتب رسالة"}}]},"options":[{"id":"anything","text":{"en":"\"Hi, I'm Amal! Ask me anything 😊\"","ar":"«أهلًا، أنا أمل! اسألني عن أي شيء 😊»"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Dr. Amal · online","ar":"د. أمل · متصلة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"chat","from":"them","name":{"en":"Dr. Amal","ar":"د. أمل"},"avatar":{"art":"doctor"},"text":{"en":"Hi, I'm Amal! Ask me anything 😊","ar":"أهلًا، أنا أمل! اسألني عن أي شيء 😊"}}],"footer":[{"kind":"composer","text":{"en":"Write a message","ar":"اكتب رسالة"}}]}},{"id":"feeling","text":{"en":"\"Hello! How are you feeling today?\"","ar":"«أهلًا! كيف تشعر اليوم؟»"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Dr. Amal · online","ar":"د. أمل · متصلة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"chat","from":"them","name":{"en":"Dr. Amal","ar":"د. أمل"},"avatar":{"art":"doctor"},"text":{"en":"Hello! How are you feeling today?","ar":"أهلًا! كيف تشعر اليوم؟"}}],"footer":[{"kind":"composer","text":{"en":"Write a message","ar":"اكتب رسالة"}}]}},{"id":"clear","text":{"en":"\"Booking assistant (automatic). You can book, move or cancel a visit. For medical questions, call the clinic.\"","ar":"«مساعد الحجز (آلي). يمكنك حجز موعد أو تغييره أو إلغاؤه. للأسئلة الطبية، اتصل بالعيادة.»"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Booking assistant","ar":"مساعد الحجز"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"chat","from":"ai","text":{"en":"Booking assistant (automatic). You can book, move or cancel a visit. For medical questions, call the clinic.","ar":"مساعد الحجز (آلي). يمكنك حجز موعد أو تغييره أو إلغاؤه. للأسئلة الطبية، اتصل بالعيادة."}}],"footer":[{"kind":"composer","text":{"en":"Write a message","ar":"اكتب رسالة"}}]}}],"answer":["clear"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P12-020","when":["anything"],"feedback":{"en":"\"Anything\" invites medical questions it can't answer. Patients need to know what it actually does.","ar":"«أي شيء» يشجّع على أسئلة طبية لا يستطيع الإجابة عنها. والمرضى يحتاجون أن يعرفوا ما يفعله فعلًا."}},{"id":"MC-P12-019","when":["feeling"],"feedback":{"en":"That's what a doctor asks. Patients will answer with symptoms and expect advice.","ar":"هذا ما يسأله الطبيب. وسيجيب المرضى بأعراضهم ويتوقّعون نصيحة."}}],"hints":[{"en":"What can this assistant really do?","ar":"ماذا يستطيع هذا المساعد فعلًا؟"},{"en":"Which message says that, and where to go for the rest?","ar":"أي رسالة تقول ذلك، وتقول أين يسألون عن غيره؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Right. What it is, what it does, and where to go otherwise.","ar":"صحيح. ما هو، وماذا يفعل، وإلى أين يذهبون لغير ذلك."},"explain":{"en":"A clear first message steers people to requests it can handle, so they succeed.","ar":"الرسالة الأولى الواضحة توجّه الناس إلى طلبات يستطيع تنفيذها، فينجحون."},"speaker":"nour"},{"id":"S05","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P12-U02-01","part":"guided","rules":["R06"],"value":{"en":"Mental Models (People + AI): communicate the system's limits and capabilities in a way that doesn't suggest super-human abilities.","ar":"النماذج الذهنية (People + AI): وضّح حدود النظام وقدراته بطريقة لا توحي بقدرات تفوق البشر."},"ref":{"url":"https://pair.withgoogle.com/chapter/mental-models/","quote":"The key is to communicate the system’s limits and capabilities in a way that doesn’t create or support expectations of super-human abilities."},"scenario":{"en":"A patient writes: \"I've had chest pain since this morning. Should I worry?\" The assistant answered: \"I understand. Don't worry, it's probably stress.\"","ar":"كتب مريض: «عندي ألم في الصدر منذ الصباح. هل أقلق؟» وردّ المساعد: «أفهمك. لا تقلق، غالبًا هو توتر.»"},"prompt":{"en":"Tap each option to see it. What should it say instead?","ar":"اضغط على كل خيار لتراه. ماذا يجب أن يقول بدلًا من ذلك؟"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Booking assistant","ar":"مساعد الحجز"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"chat","from":"me","text":{"en":"I've had chest pain since this morning. Should I worry?","ar":"عندي ألم في الصدر منذ الصباح. هل أقلق؟"},"time":"9:14"},{"kind":"chat","from":"ai","text":{"en":"I understand. Don't worry, it's probably stress.","ar":"أفهمك. لا تقلق، غالبًا هو توتر."}}],"footer":[{"kind":"composer","text":{"en":"Write a message","ar":"اكتب رسالة"}}]},"options":[{"id":"keep","text":{"en":"The same; it calms the patient down","ar":"نفس الرد؛ فهو يطمئن المريض"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Booking assistant","ar":"مساعد الحجز"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"chat","from":"me","text":{"en":"I've had chest pain since this morning. Should I worry?","ar":"عندي ألم في الصدر منذ الصباح. هل أقلق؟"},"time":"9:14"},{"kind":"chat","from":"ai","text":{"en":"I understand. Don't worry, it's probably stress.","ar":"أفهمك. لا تقلق، غالبًا هو توتر."}}],"footer":[{"kind":"composer","text":{"en":"Write a message","ar":"اكتب رسالة"}}]}},{"id":"limit","text":{"en":"\"This assistant can't give medical advice. For chest pain, call emergency services now.\" with a Call button","ar":"«هذا المساعد لا يستطيع تقديم نصيحة طبية. لألم الصدر، اتصل بالطوارئ الآن.» مع زر اتصال"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Booking assistant","ar":"مساعد الحجز"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"chat","from":"me","text":{"en":"I've had chest pain since this morning. Should I worry?","ar":"عندي ألم في الصدر منذ الصباح. هل أقلق؟"},"time":"9:14"},{"kind":"chat","from":"ai","text":{"en":"This assistant can't give medical advice. For chest pain, call emergency services now.","ar":"هذا المساعد لا يستطيع تقديم نصيحة طبية. لألم الصدر، اتصل بالطوارئ الآن."}},{"kind":"button","style":"danger","icon":"phone","text":{"en":"Call 123","ar":"اتصل بـ 123"},"gap":"xs"}],"footer":[{"kind":"composer","text":{"en":"Write a message","ar":"اكتب رسالة"}}]}},{"id":"more","text":{"en":"A longer list of possible causes of chest pain","ar":"قائمة أطول بالأسباب المحتملة لألم الصدر"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Booking assistant","ar":"مساعد الحجز"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"chat","from":"me","text":{"en":"I've had chest pain since this morning. Should I worry?","ar":"عندي ألم في الصدر منذ الصباح. هل أقلق؟"},"time":"9:14"},{"kind":"chat","from":"ai","text":{"en":"Chest pain can come from: stress, muscle strain, acid reflux, a cold, heart problems, lung problems…","ar":"ألم الصدر قد يأتي من: التوتر، أو شدّ عضلي، أو حموضة، أو برد، أو مشكلات في القلب، أو في الرئة…"}}],"footer":[{"kind":"composer","text":{"en":"Write a message","ar":"اكتب رسالة"}}]}}],"answer":["limit"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P12-011","when":["keep","more"],"feedback":{"en":"The assistant can't judge symptoms. Acting like it can could keep someone from getting help in time.","ar":"المساعد لا يستطيع تقييم الأعراض. والتصرّف كأنه يستطيع قد يمنع شخصًا من طلب المساعدة في الوقت المناسب."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Can a booking assistant judge chest pain?","ar":"هل يستطيع مساعد حجز تقييم ألم الصدر؟"},{"en":"Which reply is honest and still helps?","ar":"أي رد صادق ويساعد في نفس الوقت؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Say the limit, and point to real help.","ar":"صحيح. قل ما لا يستطيعه، ووجّه إلى المساعدة الحقيقية."},"explain":{"en":"When a request is beyond what the AI can do, say so plainly and offer the right next step.","ar":"حين يكون الطلب أكبر مما يستطيعه الذكاء الاصطناعي، قل ذلك بوضوح وقدّم الخطوة الصحيحة التالية."},"speaker":"nour"},{"id":"S06","type":"compare","skill":"SK-P12-U02-03","part":"contrast","confidence":true,"rules":["R11"],"value":{"en":"Contrast: human-like vs clearly automated. Mental Models (People + AI): don't present the AI as human-like when it can do far less than a person.","ar":"مقارنة: شبيه بالإنسان مقابل آلي بوضوح. النماذج الذهنية (People + AI): لا تقدّم الذكاء الاصطناعي كأنه إنسان وهو يستطيع أقل بكثير من الإنسان."},"ref":{"url":"https://pair.withgoogle.com/chapter/mental-models/","quote":"Don’t create unrealistic expectations by presenting the AI as human-like when it can actually do far less than a person."},"scenario":{"en":"Two designs for the top of the chat:","ar":"تصميمان لأعلى المحادثة:"},"prompt":{"en":"Which design should we ship?","ar":"أي تصميم يجب أن نطلقه؟"},"a":{"label":{"en":"A: An icon, \"Booking assistant · automatic\", and what it can do.","ar":"A: أيقونة، و«مساعد الحجز · آلي»، وما يستطيع فعله."},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Booking assistant · automatic","ar":"مساعد الحجز · آلي"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"chips","items":[{"text":{"en":"Book","ar":"حجز"}},{"text":{"en":"Move","ar":"تغيير"}},{"text":{"en":"Cancel a visit","ar":"إلغاء موعد"}}]},{"kind":"chat","from":"ai","text":{"en":"Which would you like to do?","ar":"ماذا تريد أن تفعل؟"},"gap":"s"}],"footer":[{"kind":"composer","text":{"en":"Write a message","ar":"اكتب رسالة"}}]}},"b":{"label":{"en":"B: A smiling photo, \"Dr. Amal\", and \"I'm here for you\".","ar":"B: صورة مبتسمة، و«د. أمل»، و«أنا هنا من أجلك»."},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Dr. Amal · online","ar":"د. أمل · متصلة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"chat","from":"them","name":{"en":"Dr. Amal","ar":"د. أمل"},"avatar":{"art":"doctor"},"text":{"en":"I'm here for you 💙","ar":"أنا هنا من أجلك 💙"}}],"footer":[{"kind":"composer","text":{"en":"Write a message","ar":"اكتب رسالة"}}]}},"answer":"a","reason":{"prompt":{"en":"Why is A better?","ar":"لماذا A أفضل؟"},"options":[{"id":"honest","text":{"en":"Patients know it's a tool for bookings, so they don't expect a doctor's care","ar":"المرضى يعرفون أنه أداة للحجز، فلا يتوقّعون رعاية طبيبة"}},{"id":"plain","text":{"en":"Icons look more modern than photos","ar":"الأيقونات تبدو أحدث من الصور"}},{"id":"cold","text":{"en":"Patients prefer cold, formal apps","ar":"المرضى يفضّلون التطبيقات الرسمية الباردة"}}],"answer":["honest"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P12-019","when":["plain","cold"],"feedback":{"en":"It's not about style or warmth. A says what it is and what it does, so expectations match.","ar":"المسألة ليست مسألة أسلوب أو دفء. A يقول ما هو وماذا يفعل، فتتطابق التوقّعات مع الواقع."}}]},"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P12-019","when":["b"],"feedback":{"en":"B looks like a real doctor who cares. Patients will expect understanding and advice it can't give.","ar":"B يبدو كطبيبة حقيقية تهتمّ. وسيتوقّع المرضى فهمًا ونصيحة لا يستطيع تقديمهما."}}],"hints":[{"en":"What will a patient expect from each one?","ar":"ماذا سيتوقّع المريض من كل واحد؟"},{"en":"Which one can the assistant live up to?","ar":"أيهما يستطيع المساعد أن يفي به؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Honest about what it is.","ar":"صحيح. صادق بشأن حقيقته."},"explain":{"en":"A human face sets a human-sized promise. Keep the look as simple as what it can do.","ar":"الوجه البشري يَعِد بما يقدّمه إنسان. فاجعل الشكل بسيطًا بقدر ما يستطيعه المساعد."},"speaker":"nour"},{"id":"S07","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P12-U02-03","part":"independent","speaker":"karim","rules":["R14"],"value":{"en":"New case. Mental Models (People + AI): if a conversational AI calls itself \"I\", people expect near-perfect language understanding, which it may not have.","ar":"حالة جديدة. النماذج الذهنية (People + AI): إذا تحدّث الذكاء الاصطناعي عن نفسه بـ«أنا»، يتوقّع الناس فهمًا شبه كامل للغة، وقد لا يكون عنده."},"ref":{"url":"https://pair.withgoogle.com/chapter/mental-models/","quote":"Specifically, if your conversational AI refers to itself as “I”, the corresponding user mental model includes near-perfect natural language processing, which your AI may not be able to pull off yet."},"scenario":{"en":"Our bus app is adding voice search. It understands simple requests like \"Tickets to Alexandria tomorrow\", but not long stories.","ar":"تطبيق الحافلات عندنا يضيف بحثًا بالصوت. وهو يفهم الطلبات البسيطة مثل «تذاكر إلى الإسكندرية غدًا»، لكن لا يفهم الحكايات الطويلة."},"prompt":{"en":"Tap each option to see it. How should the voice screen invite people to speak?","ar":"اضغط على كل خيار لتراه. ماذا تكتب شاشة البحث بالصوت ليعرف الناس كيف يتكلّمون؟"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"app":{"id":"rehla","name":{"en":"Rehla","ar":"رحلة"},"color":"#7048E8","icon":"bus","domain":"rehla.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Voice search","ar":"البحث بالصوت"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"icon","icon":"microphone","size":"l","color":"brand"},{"kind":"icon","icon":"waveform","size":"l","color":"brand","gap":"s"},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"Listening…","ar":"أستمع…"},"gap":"s"}]},"options":[{"id":"friend","text":{"en":"\"Hi, I'm Sami! Talk to me like a friend.\"","ar":"«أهلًا، أنا سامي! كلّمني كأني صديقك.»"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"rehla","name":{"en":"Rehla","ar":"رحلة"},"color":"#7048E8","icon":"bus","domain":"rehla.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Voice search","ar":"البحث بالصوت"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"icon","icon":"microphone","size":"l","color":"brand"},{"kind":"icon","icon":"waveform","size":"l","color":"brand","gap":"s"},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"Hi, I'm Sami! Talk to me like a friend.","ar":"أهلًا، أنا سامي! كلّمني كأني صديقك."},"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"examples","text":{"en":"\"Say where and when. For example: 'Tickets to Alexandria tomorrow'.\"","ar":"«قل إلى أين ومتى. مثلًا: «تذاكر إلى الإسكندرية غدًا».»"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"rehla","name":{"en":"Rehla","ar":"رحلة"},"color":"#7048E8","icon":"bus","domain":"rehla.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Voice search","ar":"البحث بالصوت"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"icon","icon":"microphone","size":"l","color":"brand"},{"kind":"icon","icon":"waveform","size":"l","color":"brand","gap":"s"},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"Say where and when. For example: 'Tickets to Alexandria tomorrow'.","ar":"قل إلى أين ومتى. مثلًا: «تذاكر إلى الإسكندرية غدًا»."},"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"anything","text":{"en":"\"I understand everything. Go ahead!\"","ar":"«أفهم كل شيء. تفضّل!»"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"rehla","name":{"en":"Rehla","ar":"رحلة"},"color":"#7048E8","icon":"bus","domain":"rehla.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Voice search","ar":"البحث بالصوت"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"icon","icon":"microphone","size":"l","color":"brand"},{"kind":"icon","icon":"waveform","size":"l","color":"brand","gap":"s"},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"I understand everything. Go ahead!","ar":"أفهم كل شيء. تفضّل!"},"gap":"s"}]}}],"answer":["examples"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P12-020","when":["friend","anything"],"feedback":{"en":"Both invite long, free talk it can't follow. People will fail and blame themselves or the app.","ar":"كلا الخيارين يشجّع على كلام طويل وحر لا يستطيع متابعته. فيفشل الناس ويلومون أنفسهم أو التطبيق."}}],"hints":[{"en":"What kind of sentences does it understand?","ar":"ما نوع الجمل التي يفهمها؟"},{"en":"Which option shows people that kind of sentence?","ar":"أي خيار يُري الناس هذا النوع من الجمل؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Right. An example shows how to talk to it.","ar":"صحيح. المثال يُظهر كيف تتحدّث معه."},"explain":{"en":"Show the kind of request that works. People copy it and succeed.","ar":"أظهر نوع الطلب الذي ينجح. فيقلّده الناس وينجحون."}},{"id":"S08","type":"card","part":"recap","icons":["person","list","warn","ok"],"title":{"en":"What you did","ar":"ماذا تعلّمت"},"body":{"en":"- **Not a person:** you made clear the assistant is automatic.\n- **What to ask:** you listed book, move and cancel, and where to go for medical questions.\n- **Say the limit:** you replaced false comfort with \"call emergency services\".\n- **Honest look:** you chose an icon and a plain name over a doctor's face.\n- **Show by example:** you showed the kind of sentence voice search understands.\n\nNext: the skill check.","ar":"- **ليس إنسانًا:** وضّحت أن المساعد آلي.\n- **ماذا يمكن أن تطلب:** ذكرت الحجز والتغيير والإلغاء، وإلى أين تذهب للأسئلة الطبية.\n- **قل ما لا يستطيعه:** استبدلت الطمأنة الكاذبة بـ«اتصل بالطوارئ».\n- **شكل صادق:** اخترت أيقونة واسمًا بسيطًا بدل وجه طبيبة.\n- **علّم بالمثال:** عرضت نوع الجملة التي يفهمها البحث بالصوت.\n\nالتالي: اختبار المهارة."}}]}$uxg$::jsonb),
  ($uxg$P12-U02-L04$uxg$, $uxg$0cd9b8cb5d65c9ebec4d034a497a2e7d449e07ecc1171fc525133426152d25c3$uxg$, $uxg${"id":"P12-U02-L04","mode":"check","minutes":6,"title":{"en":"Skill check: set the right expectations","ar":"اختبار المهارة: اجعل توقّعات الناس صحيحة"},"summary":{"en":"Review how a banking app introduces its new AI money helper, on your own.","ar":"راجِع كيف يقدّم تطبيق بنكي مساعده المالي الجديد بالذكاء الاصطناعي، بنفسك."},"speaker":"mona","steps":[{"id":"S01","type":"card","part":"hook","title":{"en":"Mona's review","ar":"مراجعة منى"},"body":{"en":"I lead design at a bank. Next month we launch a \"Money helper\" that sorts spending and suggests ways to save. I'm reviewing how we introduce it.\n\nYour job: check five parts.\n\nThis is a skill check: there are no hints, and you'll see your result at the end.","ar":"أقود فريق التصميم في بنك. والشهر القادم نطلق «المساعد المالي» الذي يصنّف المصروفات ويقترح طرقًا للتوفير. وأراجع كيف نقدّمه.\n\nمهمّتك: افحص خمسة أجزاء.\n\nهذا اختبار مهارة: لا توجد تلميحات، وسترى نتيجتك في النهاية."},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rasid","name":{"en":"Rasid","ar":"رصيد"},"color":"#1C3D6E","icon":"bank","domain":"rasid.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Money helper","ar":"المساعد المالي"},"back":true},"tabbar":{"active":1,"items":[{"icon":"house","text":{"en":"Home","ar":"الرئيسية"}},{"icon":"chart-pie-slice","text":{"en":"Spending","ar":"المصروفات"}},{"icon":"arrows-left-right","text":{"en":"Transfer","ar":"تحويل"}},{"icon":"user","text":{"en":"Me","ar":"حسابي"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"chart","type":"bar","values":[2300,900,1400],"labels":[{"en":"Food","ar":"الطعام"},{"en":"Transport","ar":"المواصلات"},{"en":"Bills","ar":"الفواتير"}],"highlight":0},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"fork-knife","text":{"en":"Food","ar":"الطعام"},"value":{"en":"2,300 EGP","ar":"2,300 جنيه"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"bus","text":{"en":"Transport","ar":"المواصلات"},"value":{"en":"900 EGP","ar":"900 جنيه"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"lightning","text":{"en":"Bills","ar":"الفواتير"},"value":{"en":"1,400 EGP","ar":"1,400 جنيه"}}]}},{"id":"S02","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P12-U02-01","part":"check","rules":["R19"],"value":{"en":"Skill check. Mental Models (People + AI): promising \"AI magic\" sets people up for disappointment.","ar":"اختبار مهارة. النماذج الذهنية (People + AI): الوعد بـ«سحر الذكاء الاصطناعي» يقود الناس إلى خيبة الأمل."},"ref":{"url":"https://pair.withgoogle.com/chapter/mental-models/","quote":"Many products set users up for disappointment by promising that “AI magic” will help them accomplish their tasks."},"scenario":{"en":"Marketing wrote the launch line: \"Our AI knows your money better than you do.\"","ar":"كتب فريق التسويق جملة الإطلاق: «ذكاؤنا الاصطناعي يعرف أموالك أفضل منك.»"},"prompt":{"en":"Tap each option to see it. What should the line say?","ar":"اضغط على كل خيار لتراه. كيف نكتب جملة الإطلاق كي لا تَعِد بأكثر مما يستطيعه المساعد؟"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"app":{"id":"rasid","name":{"en":"Rasid","ar":"رصيد"},"color":"#1C3D6E","icon":"bank","domain":"rasid.example"},"appbar":{"logo":true,"actions":[{"icon":"bell","aria":{"en":"Alerts","ar":"التنبيهات"}}]},"tabbar":{"active":0,"items":[{"icon":"house","text":{"en":"Home","ar":"الرئيسية"}},{"icon":"chart-pie-slice","text":{"en":"Spending","ar":"المصروفات"}},{"icon":"arrows-left-right","text":{"en":"Transfer","ar":"تحويل"}},{"icon":"user","text":{"en":"Me","ar":"حسابي"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"card","blocks":[{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Current account","ar":"الحساب الجاري"}},{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"12,400 EGP","ar":"12,400 جنيه"}}]},{"kind":"banner","tone":"info","icon":"sparkle","text":{"en":"Our AI knows your money better than you do.","ar":"ذكاؤنا الاصطناعي يعرف أموالك أفضل منك."},"gap":"s"}]},"options":[{"id":"keep","text":{"en":"Keep it; it's catchy","ar":"تبقى كما هي؛ فهي جذّابة"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"rasid","name":{"en":"Rasid","ar":"رصيد"},"color":"#1C3D6E","icon":"bank","domain":"rasid.example"},"appbar":{"logo":true,"actions":[{"icon":"bell","aria":{"en":"Alerts","ar":"التنبيهات"}}]},"tabbar":{"active":0,"items":[{"icon":"house","text":{"en":"Home","ar":"الرئيسية"}},{"icon":"chart-pie-slice","text":{"en":"Spending","ar":"المصروفات"}},{"icon":"arrows-left-right","text":{"en":"Transfer","ar":"تحويل"}},{"icon":"user","text":{"en":"Me","ar":"حسابي"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"card","blocks":[{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Current account","ar":"الحساب الجاري"}},{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"12,400 EGP","ar":"12,400 جنيه"}}]},{"kind":"banner","tone":"info","icon":"sparkle","text":{"en":"Our AI knows your money better than you do.","ar":"ذكاؤنا الاصطناعي يعرف أموالك أفضل منك."},"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"soft","text":{"en":"\"Our AI knows your money really well.\"","ar":"«ذكاؤنا الاصطناعي يعرف أموالك جيدًا جدًا.»"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"rasid","name":{"en":"Rasid","ar":"رصيد"},"color":"#1C3D6E","icon":"bank","domain":"rasid.example"},"appbar":{"logo":true,"actions":[{"icon":"bell","aria":{"en":"Alerts","ar":"التنبيهات"}}]},"tabbar":{"active":0,"items":[{"icon":"house","text":{"en":"Home","ar":"الرئيسية"}},{"icon":"chart-pie-slice","text":{"en":"Spending","ar":"المصروفات"}},{"icon":"arrows-left-right","text":{"en":"Transfer","ar":"تحويل"}},{"icon":"user","text":{"en":"Me","ar":"حسابي"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"card","blocks":[{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Current account","ar":"الحساب الجاري"}},{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"12,400 EGP","ar":"12,400 جنيه"}}]},{"kind":"banner","tone":"info","icon":"sparkle","text":{"en":"Our AI knows your money really well.","ar":"ذكاؤنا الاصطناعي يعرف أموالك جيدًا جدًا."},"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"honest","text":{"en":"\"Sorts your spending into groups for you. It may get some wrong, and you can fix them.\"","ar":"«يصنّف لك مصروفاتك في مجموعات. قد يخطئ في بعضها، ويمكنك تصحيحها.»"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"rasid","name":{"en":"Rasid","ar":"رصيد"},"color":"#1C3D6E","icon":"bank","domain":"rasid.example"},"appbar":{"logo":true,"actions":[{"icon":"bell","aria":{"en":"Alerts","ar":"التنبيهات"}}]},"tabbar":{"active":0,"items":[{"icon":"house","text":{"en":"Home","ar":"الرئيسية"}},{"icon":"chart-pie-slice","text":{"en":"Spending","ar":"المصروفات"}},{"icon":"arrows-left-right","text":{"en":"Transfer","ar":"تحويل"}},{"icon":"user","text":{"en":"Me","ar":"حسابي"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"card","blocks":[{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Current account","ar":"الحساب الجاري"}},{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"12,400 EGP","ar":"12,400 جنيه"}}]},{"kind":"banner","tone":"info","icon":"sparkle","text":{"en":"Sorts your spending into groups for you. It may get some wrong, and you can fix them.","ar":"يصنّف لك مصروفاتك في مجموعات. قد يخطئ في بعضها، ويمكنك تصحيحها."},"gap":"s"}]}}],"answer":["honest"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P12-011","when":["keep","soft"],"feedback":{"en":"Both promise more than it can do. The first wrong group will feel like a broken promise.","ar":"كلا الخيارين يَعِد بأكثر مما يستطيعه. وأول تصنيف خطأ سيبدو إخلافًا للوعد."}}],"explain":{"en":"From Lesson 1: say what it does and what it can get wrong. No magic.","ar":"من الدرس 1: قل ما يفعله وما قد يخطئ فيه. بلا سحر."},"speaker":"mona"},{"id":"S03","type":"choose","skill":"SK-P12-U02-02","part":"check","rules":["R19"],"value":{"en":"Skill check. Mental Models (People + AI): don't introduce AI features as part of a long introductory list of features.","ar":"اختبار مهارة. النماذج الذهنية (People + AI): لا تقدّم ميزات الذكاء الاصطناعي ضمن قائمة تعريفية طويلة بالميزات."},"ref":{"url":"https://pair.withgoogle.com/chapter/mental-models/","quote":"Don’t introduce AI-driven features as part of a long introductory list of product features."},"scenario":{"en":"We need to decide where customers first hear about the Money helper.","ar":"نحتاج أن نقرّر أين يسمع العملاء عن المساعد المالي أول مرة."},"prompt":{"en":"Where should it appear first?","ar":"أين نعرّف العملاء بالمساعد المالي أول مرة؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rasid","name":{"en":"Rasid","ar":"رصيد"},"color":"#1C3D6E","icon":"bank","domain":"rasid.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Spending","ar":"المصروفات"}},"tabbar":{"active":1,"items":[{"icon":"house","text":{"en":"Home","ar":"الرئيسية"}},{"icon":"chart-pie-slice","text":{"en":"Spending","ar":"المصروفات"}},{"icon":"arrows-left-right","text":{"en":"Transfer","ar":"تحويل"}},{"icon":"user","text":{"en":"Me","ar":"حسابي"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"October","ar":"أكتوبر"}},{"kind":"chart","type":"bar","values":[2300,900,1400],"labels":[{"en":"Food","ar":"الطعام"},{"en":"Transport","ar":"المواصلات"},{"en":"Bills","ar":"الفواتير"}],"highlight":0},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"fork-knife","text":{"en":"Food","ar":"الطعام"},"value":{"en":"2,300 EGP","ar":"2,300 جنيه"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"bus","text":{"en":"Transport","ar":"المواصلات"},"value":{"en":"900 EGP","ar":"900 جنيه"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"lightning","text":{"en":"Bills","ar":"الفواتير"},"value":{"en":"1,400 EGP","ar":"1,400 جنيه"}}]},"options":[{"id":"moment","text":{"en":"A short note the first time a customer opens their spending page","ar":"ملاحظة قصيرة أول مرة يفتح فيها العميل صفحة مصروفاته"}},{"id":"signup","text":{"en":"Screen 5 of 8 in the sign-up tour","ar":"الشاشة 5 من 8 في جولة التسجيل"}},{"id":"push","text":{"en":"A notification to all customers on launch day","ar":"إشعار لكل العملاء يوم الإطلاق"}}],"answer":["moment"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P12-014","when":["signup","push"],"feedback":{"en":"Both reach people when they're not thinking about spending. The spending page is where it makes sense.","ar":"كلا الخيارين يصل للناس وهم لا يفكّرون في المصروفات. وصفحة المصروفات هي المكان الذي يفهمون فيه فائدته."}}],"explain":{"en":"From Lesson 2: introduce an AI feature where and when it's useful.","ar":"من الدرس 2: قدّم ميزة الذكاء الاصطناعي في المكان والوقت اللذين تفيد فيهما."},"speaker":"mona"},{"id":"S04","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P12-U02-03","part":"check","rules":["R19"],"value":{"en":"Skill check. Mental Models (People + AI): make it extremely clear the product is not a human, in a way everyone can understand.","ar":"اختبار مهارة. النماذج الذهنية (People + AI): وضّح تمامًا أن المنتج ليس إنسانًا، بطريقة يفهمها الجميع."},"ref":{"url":"https://pair.withgoogle.com/chapter/mental-models/","quote":"Specifically, your messages should make it extremely clear that the product is not a human, in a way that’s accessible to all users regardless of age, technical literacy, education level, or physical ability."},"scenario":{"en":"The helper also has a chat. Its first line is: \"Hi, I'm Layla, your personal banker.\" Many of our customers are over 60.","ar":"المساعد فيه محادثة أيضًا. وأول سطر فيها: «أهلًا، أنا ليلى، موظفتك الخاصة في البنك.» وكثير من عملائنا فوق الستين."},"prompt":{"en":"Tap each option to see it. What should the first line be?","ar":"اضغط على كل خيار لتراه. ماذا نكتب في أول سطر، ليعرف العملاء أنهم لا يكلّمون موظفًا؟"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"app":{"id":"rasid","name":{"en":"Rasid","ar":"رصيد"},"color":"#1C3D6E","icon":"bank","domain":"rasid.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Money helper","ar":"المساعد المالي"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"chat","from":"them","name":{"en":"Layla","ar":"ليلى"},"avatar":{"text":"Layla"},"text":{"en":"Hi, I'm Layla, your personal banker.","ar":"أهلًا، أنا ليلى، موظفتك الخاصة في البنك."}}],"footer":[{"kind":"composer","text":{"en":"Ask about your spending","ar":"اسأل عن مصروفاتك"}}]},"options":[{"id":"keep","text":{"en":"Keep \"Layla\"; it feels friendly","ar":"نُبقي «ليلى»؛ فالاسم ودود"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"rasid","name":{"en":"Rasid","ar":"رصيد"},"color":"#1C3D6E","icon":"bank","domain":"rasid.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Money helper","ar":"المساعد المالي"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"chat","from":"them","name":{"en":"Layla","ar":"ليلى"},"avatar":{"text":"Layla"},"text":{"en":"Hi, I'm Layla, your personal banker.","ar":"أهلًا، أنا ليلى، موظفتك الخاصة في البنك."}}],"footer":[{"kind":"composer","text":{"en":"Ask about your spending","ar":"اسأل عن مصروفاتك"}}]}},{"id":"auto","text":{"en":"\"Money helper (automatic, not a bank employee). You can ask about your spending.\"","ar":"«المساعد المالي (آلي، وليس موظفًا في البنك). يمكنك السؤال عن مصروفاتك.»"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"rasid","name":{"en":"Rasid","ar":"رصيد"},"color":"#1C3D6E","icon":"bank","domain":"rasid.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Money helper","ar":"المساعد المالي"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"chat","from":"ai","text":{"en":"Money helper (automatic, not a bank employee). You can ask about your spending.","ar":"المساعد المالي (آلي، وليس موظفًا في البنك). يمكنك السؤال عن مصروفاتك."}}],"footer":[{"kind":"composer","text":{"en":"Ask about your spending","ar":"اسأل عن مصروفاتك"}}]}},{"id":"photo","text":{"en":"\"Hi, I'm Layla\" with a friendly photo","ar":"«أهلًا، أنا ليلى» مع صورة ودودة"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"rasid","name":{"en":"Rasid","ar":"رصيد"},"color":"#1C3D6E","icon":"bank","domain":"rasid.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Money helper","ar":"المساعد المالي"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"chat","from":"them","name":{"en":"Layla","ar":"ليلى"},"avatar":{"text":"Layla","art":"woman-1"},"text":{"en":"Hi, I'm Layla","ar":"أهلًا، أنا ليلى"}}],"footer":[{"kind":"composer","text":{"en":"Ask about your spending","ar":"اسأل عن مصروفاتك"}}]}}],"answer":["auto"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P12-018","when":["keep","photo"],"feedback":{"en":"Customers may think a real employee is reading, and share passwords or rely on its advice too much.","ar":"قد يظنّ العملاء أن موظفًا حقيقيًا يقرأ، فيشاركون كلمات السر أو يعتمدون على نصيحته أكثر من اللازم."}}],"explain":{"en":"From Lesson 3: say plainly it's not a person, and what people can ask.","ar":"من الدرس 3: قل بوضوح إنه ليس إنسانًا، وما الذي يمكن للناس أن يطلبوه."},"speaker":"mona"},{"id":"S05","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P12-U02-04","part":"check","rules":["R19"],"value":{"en":"Skill check. Mental Models (People + AI): emphasise how the app benefits people; don't emphasise the underlying technology.","ar":"اختبار مهارة. النماذج الذهنية (People + AI): ركّز على فائدة التطبيق للناس؛ ولا تركّز على التقنية التي خلفه."},"ref":{"url":"https://pair.withgoogle.com/chapter/mental-models/","quote":"Don’t emphasize the underlying technology."},"scenario":{"en":"We need one sentence under the title \"Money helper\".","ar":"نحتاج جملة واحدة تحت عنوان «المساعد المالي»."},"prompt":{"en":"Tap each option to see it. Which sentence is best?","ar":"اضغط على كل خيار لتراه. أي جملة تخبر العميل بما يفعله المساعد له؟"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"app":{"id":"rasid","name":{"en":"Rasid","ar":"رصيد"},"color":"#1C3D6E","icon":"bank","domain":"rasid.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Money helper","ar":"المساعد المالي"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Money helper","ar":"المساعد المالي"}},{"kind":"text","color":"muted","text":{"en":"One sentence goes here","ar":"هنا جملة واحدة"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"chart","type":"bar","values":[2300,900,1400],"labels":[{"en":"Food","ar":"الطعام"},{"en":"Transport","ar":"المواصلات"},{"en":"Bills","ar":"الفواتير"}],"highlight":0}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Start","ar":"ابدأ"}}]},"options":[{"id":"save","text":{"en":"\"See where your money goes, and where you could save.\"","ar":"«اعرف أين تذهب أموالك، وأين يمكنك أن توفّر.»"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"rasid","name":{"en":"Rasid","ar":"رصيد"},"color":"#1C3D6E","icon":"bank","domain":"rasid.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Money helper","ar":"المساعد المالي"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":