{"en":"Bareed","ar":"بريد"},"color":"#0284C7","icon":"envelope-simple","domain":"bareed.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Inbox","ar":"البريد الوارد"},"actions":[{"icon":"magnifying-glass","aria":{"en":"Search","ar":"بحث"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"tabs","options":[{"en":"Important (4)","ar":"مهمّ (4)"},{"en":"Other (31)","ar":"أخرى (31)"}],"value":1},{"kind":"listitem","avatar":{"text":"Nile Foods"},"text":{"en":"Nile Foods","ar":"نايل فودز"},"sub":{"en":"Contract ready to sign","ar":"العقد جاهز للتوقيع"},"value":"9:12"},{"kind":"listitem","avatar":{"text":"Deals"},"text":{"en":"Deals Weekly","ar":"عروض الأسبوع"},"sub":{"en":"50% off this weekend","ar":"خصم 50% في نهاية هذا الأسبوع"},"value":"8:40"}]}}],"answer":["move"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P12-030","when":["report","nothing"],"feedback":{"en":"A missed client email can't wait. People need to fix it in one tap, and switch sorting off if it keeps failing them.","ar":"رسالة العميل الضائعة لا تحتمل الانتظار. الناس يحتاجون إصلاحها بضغطة واحدة، وإيقاف التصنيف إذا ظلّ يخذلهم."}}],"explain":{"en":"From Lesson 1: give people a way to fix it, and to turn it off.","ar":"من الدرس 1: أعطِ الناس طريقة لإصلاحه، ولإيقافه."},"speaker":"karim"},{"id":"S03","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P12-U04-02","part":"check","rules":["R19"],"value":{"en":"Skill check. Feedback + Control (People + AI): let people adjust their past feedback and reset the system.","ar":"اختبار مهارة. الملاحظات والتحكّم (People + AI): اسمح للناس بتعديل ملاحظاتهم السابقة وإعادة ضبط النظام."},"ref":{"url":"https://pair.withgoogle.com/chapter/feedback-controls/","quote":"Allow users to adjust their prior feedback and reset the system."},"scenario":{"en":"A user changed teams. Mail from her old team still lands in \"Important\", and her new team's mail goes to \"Other\".","ar":"مستخدمة انتقلت إلى فريق آخر. وما زالت رسائل فريقها القديم تصل إلى «مهمّ»، ورسائل فريقها الجديد تذهب إلى «أخرى»."},"prompt":{"en":"Tap each option to see it. What should she be able to do?","ar":"اضغط على كل خيار لتراه. ماذا يجب أن تستطيع أن تفعل؟"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"app":{"id":"bareed","name":{"en":"Bareed","ar":"بريد"},"color":"#0284C7","icon":"envelope-simple","domain":"bareed.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Sorting","ar":"التصنيف"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"sparkle","text":{"en":"Sort my mail","ar":"صنّف بريدي"},"toggle":true}]},"options":[{"id":"wait","text":{"en":"Move emails one by one for a few weeks until it learns","ar":"تنقل الرسائل واحدة واحدة لبضعة أسابيع حتى يتعلّم"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"bareed","name":{"en":"Bareed","ar":"بريد"},"color":"#0284C7","icon":"envelope-simple","domain":"bareed.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Sorting","ar":"التصنيف"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"sparkle","text":{"en":"Sort my mail","ar":"صنّف بريدي"},"toggle":true},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Tip: keep moving emails. Sorting learns in a few weeks.","ar":"نصيحة: استمر في نقل الرسائل. التصنيف يتعلّم خلال بضعة أسابيع."},"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"new","text":{"en":"Make a new account","ar":"تنشئ حسابًا جديدًا"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"bareed","name":{"en":"Bareed","ar":"بريد"},"color":"#0284C7","icon":"envelope-simple","domain":"bareed.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Sorting","ar":"التصنيف"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"sparkle","text":{"en":"Sort my mail","ar":"صنّف بريدي"},"toggle":true},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"user-plus","text":{"en":"Add another account","ar":"أضف حسابًا آخر"},"chevron":true}]}},{"id":"reset","text":{"en":"\"Reset what sorting learned\" in Settings, and start fresh","ar":"«أعِد ضبط ما تعلّمه التصنيف» في الإعدادات، وتبدأ من جديد"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"bareed","name":{"en":"Bareed","ar":"بريد"},"color":"#0284C7","icon":"envelope-simple","domain":"bareed.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Sorting","ar":"التصنيف"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"sparkle","text":{"en":"Sort my mail","ar":"صنّف بريدي"},"toggle":true},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"arrow-counter-clockwise","text":{"en":"Reset what sorting learned","ar":"أعِد ضبط ما تعلّمه التصنيف"},"sub":{"en":"Start fresh","ar":"ابدأ من جديد"},"chevron":true}]}}],"answer":["reset"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P12-031","when":["wait","new"],"feedback":{"en":"Her work changed overnight. Weeks of fixing, or a new account, is too much. Let her clear the old learning.","ar":"عملها تغيّر بين ليلة وضحاها. وأسابيع من التصحيح، أو حساب جديد، أكثر من اللازم. اسمح لها بمسح التعلّم القديم."}}],"explain":{"en":"From Lesson 1: when needs change, let people erase what it learned.","ar":"من الدرس 1: حين تتغيّر الاحتياجات، اسمح للناس بمسح ما تعلّمه."},"speaker":"karim"},{"id":"S04","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P12-U04-03","part":"check","rules":["R19"],"value":{"en":"Skill check. Feedback + Control (People + AI): feedback questions and answers should be easy to understand.","ar":"اختبار مهارة. الملاحظات والتحكّم (People + AI): أسئلة الملاحظات وإجاباتها يجب أن تكون سهلة الفهم."},"ref":{"url":"https://pair.withgoogle.com/chapter/feedback-controls/","quote":"The question and answer choices you provide in explicit feedback should be easy for users to understand."},"scenario":{"en":"When someone moves an email to Important, we can ask one quick question.","ar":"حين ينقل شخص رسالة إلى «مهمّ»، نستطيع أن نسأل سؤالًا سريعًا واحدًا."},"prompt":{"en":"Tap each option to see it. Which question is best?","ar":"اضغط على كل خيار لتراه. أي سؤال يعرف به التطبيق ماذا قصد الشخص بنقل الرسالة؟"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"app":{"id":"bareed","name":{"en":"Bareed","ar":"بريد"},"color":"#0284C7","icon":"envelope-simple","domain":"bareed.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Inbox","ar":"البريد الوارد"},"actions":[{"icon":"magnifying-glass","aria":{"en":"Search","ar":"بحث"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind