يير"},"app":{"id":"bareed","name":{"en":"Bareed","ar":"بريد"},"color":"#0284C7","icon":"envelope-simple","domain":"bareed.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Inbox","ar":"البريد الوارد"},"actions":[{"icon":"magnifying-glass","aria":{"en":"Search","ar":"بحث"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"tabs","options":[{"en":"Important (4)","ar":"مهمّ (4)"},{"en":"Other (31)","ar":"أخرى (31)"}],"value":0},{"kind":"listitem","avatar":{"text":"Nile Foods"},"text":{"en":"Nile Foods","ar":"نايل فودز"},"sub":{"en":"Contract ready to sign","ar":"العقد جاهز للتوقيع"},"value":"9:12"},{"kind":"listitem","avatar":{"text":"Hany"},"text":{"en":"Hany","ar":"هاني"},"sub":{"en":"Budget review","ar":"مراجعة الميزانية"},"value":"8:02"}],"overlay":{"type":"toast","blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Rate our sorting from 1 to 10","ar":"قيّم التصنيف من 1 إلى 10"}}]}}},{"id":"vague","text":{"en":"\"Was this helpful? Yes / Somewhat / Kind of / No\"","ar":"«هل كان هذا مفيدًا؟ نعم / إلى حدّ ما / نوعًا ما / لا»"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"bareed","name":{"en":"Bareed","ar":"بريد"},"color":"#0284C7","icon":"envelope-simple","domain":"bareed.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Inbox","ar":"البريد الوارد"},"actions":[{"icon":"magnifying-glass","aria":{"en":"Search","ar":"بحث"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"tabs","options":[{"en":"Important (4)","ar":"مهمّ (4)"},{"en":"Other (31)","ar":"أخرى (31)"}],"value":0},{"kind":"listitem","avatar":{"text":"Nile Foods"},"text":{"en":"Nile Foods","ar":"نايل فودز"},"sub":{"en":"Contract ready to sign","ar":"العقد جاهز للتوقيع"},"value":"9:12"},{"kind":"listitem","avatar":{"text":"Hany"},"text":{"en":"Hany","ar":"هاني"},"sub":{"en":"Budget review","ar":"مراجعة الميزانية"},"value":"8:02"}],"overlay":{"type":"toast","blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Was this helpful? Yes / Somewhat / Kind of / No","ar":"هل كان هذا مفيدًا؟ نعم / إلى حدّ ما / نوعًا ما / لا"}}]}}}],"answer":["clear"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P12-032","when":["scale","vague"],"feedback":{"en":"A score says nothing about what to change, and \"Somewhat\" and \"Kind of\" overlap. Ask one clear question with two clear answers.","ar":"الدرجة لا تقول شيئًا عمّا يجب تغييره، و«إلى حدّ ما» و«نوعًا ما» متداخلتان. اسأل سؤالًا واحدًا واضحًا بإجابتين واضحتين."}}],"explain":{"en":"From Lesson 2: simple, separate choices in people's words.","ar":"من الدرس 2: خيارات بسيطة ومنفصلة بكلمات الناس."},"speaker":"karim"},{"id":"S05","type":"choose","skill":"SK-P12-U04-04","part":"check","rules":["R19"],"value":{"en":"Skill check. Feedback + Control (People + AI): people may open something to dismiss it, or out of passing curiosity.","ar":"اختبار مهارة. الملاحظات والتحكّم (People + AI): قد يفتح الناس شيئًا ليتخلّصوا منه، أو بدافع فضول عابر."},"ref":{"url":"https://pair.withgoogle.com/chapter/feedback-controls/","quote":"They could be trying to dismiss it — or giving in to a temporary curiosity."},"scenario":{"en":"Many people open every promo email, just to find the \"Unsubscribe\" link. The team wants to count each open as \"this is important\".","ar":"كثير من الناس يفتحون كل رسالة ترويجية، فقط ليجدوا رابط «إلغاء الاشتراك». والفريق يريد أن يعتبر كل رسالة تُفتح «مهمّة»."},"prompt":{"en":"What should we do?","ar":"ماذا يجب أن نفعل؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"bareed","name":{"en":"Bareed","ar":"بريد"},"color":"#0284C7","icon":"envelope-simple","domain":"bareed.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Deals Weekly","ar":"عروض الأسبوع"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"50% off this weekend","ar":"خصم 50% في نهاية هذا الأسبوع"}},{"kind":"image","art":"shelf","gap":"s"},{"kind":"link","text":{"en":"Unsubscribe","ar":"إلغاء الاشتراك"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Many people open this email only to find this link.","ar":"كثيرون يفتحون هذه الرسالة فقط ليجدوا هذا الرابط."},"gap":"xs"}]},"options":[{"id":"count","text":{"en":"Count every open as important","ar":"نعتبر كل رسالة تُفتح مهمّة"}},{"id":"clear","text":{"en":"Don't treat opens as \"important\". Learn from clear signals, like replies and moves to Important.","ar":"لا نعتبر الفتح «مهمًّا». نتعلّم من الإشارات الواضحة، مثل الردود والنقل إلى «مهمّ»."}},{"id":"double","text":{"en":"Count opens twice as much as replies","ar":"نعطي الفتح وزنًا ضعف الردود"}}],"answer":["clear"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P12-033","when":["count","double"],"feedback":{"en":"Opening a promo to unsubscribe means the opposite of \"important\". Counting it would fill Important with ads.","ar":"فتح رسالة ترويجية لإلغاء الاشتراك يعني عكس «مهمّ». واعتباره كذلك سيملأ «مهمّ» بالإعلانات."}}],"explain":{"en":"From Lesson 2: one action can mean many things. Learn from clear signals.","ar":"من الدرس 2: الفعل الواحد قد يعني أشياء كثيرة. تعلّم من الإشارات الواضحة."},"speaker":"karim"},{"id":"S06","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P12-U04-05","part":"check","rules":["R19"],"value":{"en":"Skill check. Feedback + Control (People + AI): tell people where they can see their data and change data settings, ideally in context.","ar":"اختبار مهارة. الملاحظات والتحكّم (People + AI): أخبر الناس أين يرون بياناتهم ويغيّرون إعدادات جمعها، ويُفضّل في مكان استخدامها."},"ref":{"url":"https://pair.withgoogle.com/chapter/feedback-controls/","quote":"Let the user know where they can see their data and where they can change data-collection settings."},"scenario":{"en":"Sorting learns from who you reply to and how fast. Right now, nothing in the app says so.","ar":"التصنيف يتعلّم ممّن تردّ عليهم وبأي سرعة. وحاليًا، لا شيء في التطبيق يقول ذلك."},"prompt":{"en":"Tap each option to see it. What should we add?","ar":"اضغط على كل خيار لتراه. ماذا نضيف ليعرف الناس ممّا يتعلّم التصنيف؟"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"app":{"id":"bareed","name":{"en":"Bareed","ar":"بريد"},"color":"#0284C7","icon":"envelope-simple","domain":"bareed.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Inbox","ar":"البريد الوارد"},"actions":[{"icon":"magnifying-glass","aria":{"en":"Search","ar":"بحث"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"tabs","options":[{"en":"Important (4)","ar":"مهمّ (4)"},{"en":"Other (31)","ar":"أخرى (31)"}],"value":0},{"kind":"listitem","avatar":{"text":"Nile Foods"},"text":{"en":"Nile Foods","ar":"نايل فودز"},"sub":{"en":"Contract ready to sign","ar":"العقد جاهز للتوقيع"},"value":"9:12"}]},"options":[{"id":"privacy","text":{"en":"A paragraph in the privacy policy","ar":"فقرة في سياسة الخصوصية"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"bareed","name":{"en":"Bareed","ar":"بريد"},"color":"#0284C7","icon":"envelope-simple","domain":"bareed.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Inbox","ar":"البريد الوارد"},"actions":[{"icon":"magnifying-glass","aria":{"en":"Search","ar":"بحث"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"tabs","options":[{"en":"Important (4)","ar":"مهمّ (4)"},{"en":"Other (31)","ar":"أخرى (31)"}],"value":0},{"kind":"listitem","avatar":{"text":"Nile Foods"},"text":{"en":"Nile Foods","ar":"نايل فودز"},"sub":{"en":"Contract ready to sign","ar":"العقد جاهز للتوقيع"},"value":"9:12"},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"(Explained in paragraph 14 of the privacy policy)","ar":"(مشروح في الفقرة 14 من سياسة الخصوصية)"},"gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"badge","text":{"en":"An \"AI-powered\" badge on the Important tab","ar":"شارة «يعمل بالذكاء الاصطناعي» على تبويب «مهمّ»"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"bareed","name":{"en":"Bareed","ar":"بريد"},"color":"#0284C7","icon":"envelope-simple","domain":"bareed.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Inbox","ar":"البريد الوارد"}},"blocks":[{"kind":"tabs","options":[{"en":"Important (4) ✨ AI-powered","ar":"مهمّ (4) ✨ بالذكاء الاصطناعي"},{"en":"Other (31)","ar":"أخرى (31)"}],"value":0},{"kind":"listitem","avatar":{"text":"Nile Foods"},"text":{"en":"Nile Foods","ar":"نايل فودز"},"sub":{"en":"Contract ready to sign","ar":"العقد جاهز للتوقيع"},"value":"9:12"}]}},{"id":"line","text":{"en":"A line at the top of Important: \"Sorted using who you reply to. See or change in Settings › Sorting\"","ar":"سطر أعلى «مهمّ»: «صنّفناه حسب من تردّ عليهم. اعرض ذلك أو غيّره في الإعدادات › التصنيف»"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"bareed","name":{"en":"Bareed","ar":"بريد"},"color":"#0284C7","icon":"envelope-simple","domain":"bareed.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Inbox","ar":"البريد الوارد"},"actions":[{"icon":"magnifying-glass","aria":{"en":"Search","ar":"بحث"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"tabs","options":[{"en":"Important (4)","ar":"مهمّ (4)"},{"en":"Other (31)","ar":"أخرى (31)"}],"value":0},{"kind":"banner","tone":"info","icon":"info","text":{"en":"Sorted using who you reply to. See or change in Settings › Sorting","ar":"صنّفناه حسب من تردّ عليهم. اعرض ذلك أو غيّره في الإعدادات › التصنيف"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"listitem","avatar":{"text":"Nile Foods"},"text":{"en":"Nile Foods","ar":"نايل فودز"},"sub":{"en":"Contract ready to sign","ar":"العقد جاهز للتوقيع"},"value":"9:12"}]}}],"answer":["line"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P12-034","when":["privacy","badge"],"feedback":{"en":"Nobody reads the policy, and a badge doesn't say what's collected. Say it where people see the sorting, with a link to change it.","ar":"لا أحد يقرأ السياسة، والشارة لا تقول ما الذي يُجمع. قل ذلك حيث يرى الناس التصنيف، مع رابط لتغييره."}}],"explain":{"en":"From Lesson 3: say what you collect, where people see it, and where to change it.","ar":"من الدرس 3: قل ماذا تجمع، في المكان الذي يرى فيه الناس النتيجة، وأين يغيّرون ذلك."},"speaker":"karim"}]}$uxg$::jsonb),
  ($uxg$P12-U05-L01$uxg$, $uxg$563648d104cbb5c5cb3db6f03fc8edc72dc7bd4ba95060c662ab11d3f9af4749$uxg$, $uxg${"id":"P12-U05-L01","mode":"lesson","minutes":7,"title":{"en":"Say what failed and what to try","ar":"قل ما الذي فشل وما الذي يمكن تجربته"},"summary":{"en":"Rewrite a bill-scanning app's \"Error. Try again.\" so people know what to do next.","ar":"أعد كتابة رسالة «خطأ. حاول مرة أخرى.» في تطبيق لمسح الفواتير، ليعرف الناس ماذا يفعلون بعدها."},"speaker":"sara","review_labels":{"MC-P12-038":{"en":"Say what failed and what to try","ar":"قل ما الذي فشل وما الذي يمكن تجربته"},"MC-P12-039":{"en":"Offer a safe next step","ar":"قدّم خطوة تالية آمنة"}},"steps":[{"id":"S01","type":"card","part":"hook","title":{"en":"\"Error. Try again.\"","ar":"«خطأ. حاول مرة أخرى.»"},"body":{"en":"I design a bill-paying app. You take a photo of your electricity bill, and AI reads the account number and amount.\n\nWhen it can't read the photo, it says: \"Error. Try again.\" People try again, and again, with the same blurry photo. Then they give up and pay at the counter.","ar":"أصمّم تطبيقًا لدفع الفواتير. تلتقط صورة لفاتورة الكهرباء، فيقرأ الذكاء الاصطناعي رقم الحساب والمبلغ.\n\nوحين لا يستطيع قراءة الصورة، يقول: «خطأ. حاول مرة أخرى.» فيحاول الناس مرة بعد مرة، بالصورة الضبابية نفسها. ثم يستسلمون ويدفعون عند الشبّاك."},"mock":{"app":{"id":"wasl","name":{"en":"Wasl","ar":"وصل"},"color":"#0F766E","icon":"receipt","domain":"wasl.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Scan your bill","ar":"امسح فاتورتك"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"receipt"},{"kind":"banner","tone":"bad","icon":"warning","text":{"en":"Error. Try again.","ar":"خطأ. حاول مرة أخرى."},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","icon":"camera","text":{"en":"Try again","ar":"حاول مرة أخرى"},"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"S02","type":"choose","skill":"SK-P12-U05-01","part":"try","rules":["R12"],"value":{"en":"Try first. Errors + Graceful Failure (People + AI): error messages should tell people as specifically as possible about the system's limits.","ar":"جرّب أولًا. الأخطاء والفشل اللطيف (People + AI): رسائل الخطأ يجب أن تخبر الناس بأكبر قدر من التحديد عن حدود النظام."},"ref":{"url":"https://pair.withgoogle.com/chapter/errors-failing/","quote":"Messages about user-perceived errors should inform the user as specifically as possible about the system’s limitations."},"prompt":{"en":"What's wrong with \"Error. Try again.\"?","ar":"ما المشكلة في «خطأ. حاول مرة أخرى.»؟"},"options":[{"id":"polite","text":{"en":"It isn't polite enough","ar":"ليست مهذّبة بما يكفي"}},{"id":"what","text":{"en":"It doesn't say what failed, or what to change","ar":"لا تقول ما الذي فشل، ولا ما الذي يجب تغييره"}},{"id":"colour","text":{"en":"It should be in red","ar":"يجب أن تكون باللون الأحمر"}}],"answer":["what"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P12-038","when":["polite","colour"],"feedback":{"en":"A kinder or redder message still leaves people guessing. They need to know what went wrong, and what to do differently.","ar":"الرسالة الألطف أو الحمراء تترك الناس يخمّنون رغم ذلك. يحتاجون أن يعرفوا ما الخطأ، وماذا يغيّرون."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Why do people retry with the same photo?","ar":"لماذا يعيد الناس المحاولة بالصورة نفسها؟"},{"en":"What would they need to know to succeed?","ar":"ماذا يحتاجون أن يعرفوا لينجحوا؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Say what failed and what to change.","ar":"صحيح. قل ما الذي فشل وما الذي يجب تغييره."},"explain":{"en":"\"Try again\" alone just repeats the failure.","ar":"«حاول مرة أخرى» وحدها تكرّر الفشل فقط."}},{"id":"S03","type":"card","part":"concept","icons":["warn","target","other","person"],"title":{"en":"When AI fails, show the way forward","ar":"حين يفشل الذكاء الاصطناعي، وضّح الخطوة التالية"},"body":{"en":"AI will fail in ways you didn't plan for. What matters is what people can do next.\n\n- **Say what it couldn't do,** plainly: \"We couldn't read the account number.\"\n- **Say what it needs:** a clearer photo, the top half of the bill.\n- **Offer another way:** \"Or type the number.\"\n- **Keep the next step safe,** especially with money or health.","ar":"سيفشل الذكاء الاصطناعي بطرق لم تخطّط لها. والمهم هو ما يستطيع الناس فعله بعدها.\n\n- **قل ما لم يستطع فعله،** بوضوح: «لم نستطع قراءة رقم الحساب.»\n- **قل ما يحتاجه:** صورة أوضح، النصف العلوي من الفاتورة.\n- **قدّم طريقة أخرى:** «أو اكتب الرقم.»\n- **اجعل الخطوة التالية آمنة،** خصوصًا مع المال أو الصحة."}},{"id":"S04","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P12-U05-01","part":"guided","rules":["R06"],"value":{"en":"Errors + Graceful Failure (People + AI): explain what the system is supposed to do and how it works, then what it's missing or can't do.","ar":"الأخطاء والفشل اللطيف (People + AI): اشرح ما يُفترض أن يفعله النظام وكيف يعمل، ثم ما ينقصه أو ما لا يستطيعه."},"ref":{"url":"https://pair.withgoogle.com/chapter/errors-failing/","quote":"Response: Communicate what the system is supposed to do and how it works."},"scenario":{"en":"The app reads bills from the two electricity companies only. A user scans a water bill.","ar":"التطبيق يقرأ فواتير شركتَي الكهرباء فقط. ويمسح أحد المستخدمين فاتورة مياه."},"prompt":{"en":"Tap each option to see it. What should the message say?","ar":"اضغط على كل خيار لتراه. ماذا نكتب في الرسالة لمن مسح فاتورة مياه؟"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"app":{"id":"wasl","name":{"en":"Wasl","ar":"وصل"},"color":"#0F766E","icon":"receipt","domain":"wasl.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Scan your bill","ar":"امسح فاتورتك"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"receipt"},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Your photo: water bill","ar":"صورتك: فاتورة مياه"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"The message goes here","ar":"هنا تظهر الرسالة"},"gap":"s"}]},"options":[{"id":"unknown","text":{"en":"\"Unknown document.\"","ar":"«مستند غير معروف.»"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"wasl","name":{"en":"Wasl","ar":"وصل"},"color":"#0F766E","icon":"receipt","domain":"wasl.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Scan your bill","ar":"امسح فاتورتك"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"receipt"},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Your photo: water bill","ar":"صورتك: فاتورة مياه"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"banner","tone":"bad","icon":"warning","text":{"en":"Unknown document.","ar":"مستند غير معروف."},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","icon":"camera","text":{"en":"Try again","ar":"حاول مرة أخرى"},"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"learning","text":{"en":"\"Oops! Our AI is still learning 🤖\"","ar":"«عذرًا! ذكاؤنا الاصطناعي ما زال يتعلّم 🤖»"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"wasl","name":{"en":"Wasl","ar":"وصل"},"color":"#0F766E","icon":"receipt","domain":"wasl.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Scan your bill","ar":"امسح فاتورتك"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"receipt"},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Your photo: water bill","ar":"صورتك: فاتورة مياه"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"banner","tone":"info","icon":"robot","text":{"en":"Oops! Our AI is still learning 🤖","ar":"عذرًا! ذكاؤنا الاصطناعي ما زال يتعلّم 🤖"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","icon":"camera","text":{"en":"Try again","ar":"حاول مرة أخرى"},"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"limit","text":{"en":"\"We can read electricity bills only. For water bills, type the account number.\"","ar":"«نستطيع قراءة فواتير الكهرباء فقط. لفواتير المياه، اكتب رقم الحساب.»"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"wasl","name":{"en":"Wasl","ar":"وصل"},"color":"#0F766E","icon":"receipt","domain":"wasl.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Scan your bill","ar":"امسح فاتورتك"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"receipt"},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Your photo: water bill","ar":"صورتك: فاتورة مياه"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"banner","tone":"warn","icon":"info","text":{"en":"We can read electricity bills only. For water bills, type the account number.","ar":"نستطيع قراءة فواتير الكهرباء فقط. لفواتير المياه، اكتب رقم الحساب."},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","icon":"keyboard","text":{"en":"Type the account number","ar":"اكتب رقم الحساب"},"gap":"s"}]}}],"answer":["limit"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P12-038","when":["unknown","learning"],"feedback":{"en":"Neither says what the app can read, so people will keep trying. Name the limit, and give the other way.","ar":"لا تقول أيّ من الرسالتين ما يستطيع التطبيق قراءته، فسيستمرّ الناس في المحاولة. اذكر الحدّ، وقدّم الطريقة الأخرى."}}],"hints":[{"en":"What does the app actually read?","ar":"ماذا يقرأ التطبيق فعلًا؟"},{"en":"What can someone with a water bill do?","ar":"ماذا يستطيع صاحب فاتورة المياه أن يفعل؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Name the limit and the way around it.","ar":"صحيح. اذكر الحدّ والطريق البديل."},"explain":{"en":"An error that teaches the limit stops people from trying the same thing again.","ar":"رسالة الخطأ التي توضّح الحدّ تمنع الناس من تجربة الشيء نفسه مرة أخرى."},"speaker":"sara"},{"id":"S05","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P12-U05-03","part":"guided","rules":["R06"],"value":{"en":"Errors + Graceful Failure (People + AI): when it fails, the main goal is to prevent harm and help people move forward with their task.","ar":"الأخطاء والفشل اللطيف (People + AI): حين يفشل، الهدف الأساسي هو منع الضرر ومساعدة الناس على المضيّ في مهمّتهم."},"ref":{"url":"https://pair.withgoogle.com/chapter/errors-failing/","quote":"Your primary goal in these failstates should be to prevent undue harm to the user and help them move forward with their task."},"scenario":{"en":"The app read the amount, 640, but not the account number.","ar":"قرأ التطبيق المبلغ، 640، لكنه لم يقرأ رقم الحساب."},"prompt":{"en":"Tap each option to see it. What should happen next?","ar":"اضغط على كل خيار لتراه. ماذا يفعل التطبيق بعد أن قرأ المبلغ فقط؟"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"app":{"id":"wasl","name":{"en":"Wasl","ar":"وصل"},"color":"#0F766E","icon":"receipt","domain":"wasl.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Check your bill","ar":"راجع فاتورتك"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"lightning","text":{"en":"Cairo Electricity","ar":"كهرباء القاهرة"},"sub":{"en":"From your photo","ar":"من صورتك"}},{"kind":"listitem","text":{"en":"Amount","ar":"المبلغ"},"value":{"en":"640 EGP","ar":"640 جنيهًا"},"check":true},{"kind":"listitem","text":{"en":"Account number","ar":"رقم الحساب"},"badge":{"text":{"en":"Not read","ar":"لم يُقرأ"},"tone":"bad"}}]},"options":[{"id":"fill","text":{"en":"Keep 640, and ask them to type only the account number","ar":"نُبقي 640، ونطلب منهم كتابة رقم الحساب فقط"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"wasl","name":{"en":"Wasl","ar":"وصل"},"color":"#0F766E","icon":"receipt","domain":"wasl.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Check your bill","ar":"راجع فاتورتك"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"lightning","text":{"en":"Cairo Electricity","ar":"كهرباء القاهرة"},"sub":{"en":"From your photo","ar":"من صورتك"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Amount","ar":"المبلغ"},"text":{"en":"640 EGP","ar":"640 جنيهًا"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Account number","ar":"رقم الحساب"},"text":"","ring":true,"gap":"s"},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"We couldn't read the account number. Type it from the top of the bill.","ar":"لم نستطع قراءة رقم الحساب. اكتبه من أعلى الفاتورة."},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Pay 640 EGP","ar":"ادفع 640 جنيهًا"},"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"guess","text":{"en":"Fill in the account number from last month's bill, and pay","ar":"نملأ رقم الحساب من فاتورة الشهر الماضي، وندفع"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"wasl","name":{"en":"Wasl","ar":"وصل"},"color":"#0F766E","icon":"receipt","domain":"wasl.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Check your bill","ar":"راجع فاتورتك"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"lightning","text":{"en":"Cairo Electricity","ar":"كهرباء القاهرة"},"sub":{"en":"From your photo","ar":"من صورتك"}},{"kind":"listitem","text":{"en":"Amount","ar":"المبلغ"},"value":{"en":"640 EGP","ar":"640 جنيهًا"}},{"kind":"listitem","text":{"en":"Account number","ar":"رقم الحساب"},"value":"40213377","sub":{"en":"From last month's bill","ar":"من فاتورة الشهر الماضي"}},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Pay 640 EGP","ar":"ادفع 640 جنيهًا"},"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"restart","text":{"en":"Fail the whole scan and start over","ar":"نُلغي المسح كله ونبدأ من جديد"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"wasl","name":{"en":"Wasl","ar":"وصل"},"color":"#0F766E","icon":"receipt","domain":"wasl.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Scan your bill","ar":"امسح فاتورتك"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"receipt"},{"kind":"banner","tone":"bad","icon":"warning","text":{"en":"Scan failed. Start over.","ar":"فشل المسح. ابدأ من جديد."},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","icon":"camera","text":{"en":"Scan again","ar":"امسح مرة أخرى"},"gap":"s"}]}}],"answer":["fill"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P12-039","when":["guess","restart"],"feedback":{"en":"Guessing could pay someone else's bill, and starting over throws away what worked. Keep what's right, and ask for the missing part.","ar":"التخمين قد يدفع فاتورة شخص آخر، والبدء من جديد يُضيّع ما نجح. احتفظ بالصحيح، واطلب الجزء الناقص."}}],"hints":[{"en":"What could go wrong if the app guesses with money?","ar":"ماذا قد يحدث إذا خمّن التطبيق في أمر يخصّ المال؟"},{"en":"Which option keeps what already worked?","ar":"أي خيار يحتفظ بما نجح بالفعل؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Keep what worked, ask for the rest.","ar":"صحيح. احتفظ بما نجح، واطلب الباقي."},"explain":{"en":"A partial failure doesn't need a full restart, or a risky guess.","ar":"الفشل الجزئي لا يحتاج البدء من جديد، ولا تخمينًا خطِرًا."},"speaker":"sara"},{"id":"S06","type":"compare","skill":"SK-P12-U05-03","part":"contrast","confidence":true,"rules":["R11"],"value":{"en":"Contrast: dead end vs a likely match. Errors + Graceful Failure (People + AI): check the input against expected answers, to see if people meant one of them.","ar":"مقارنة: طريق مسدود مقابل اقتراح محتمل. الأخطاء والفشل اللطيف (People + AI): قارن المدخلات بالإجابات المتوقّعة، لترى هل قصد الناس إحداها."},"ref":{"url":"https://pair.withgoogle.com/chapter/errors-failing/","quote":"Response: Check the user’s input versus a range of “expected” answers to see if they intended one of those inputs."},"scenario":{"en":"In the app's search, someone types \"electrcity\" with a typo. Two designs:","ar":"في بحث التطبيق، يكتب شخص «كهربا» بخطأ إملائي. وهذان تصميمان:"},"prompt":{"en":"Which design should we use?","ar":"أي تصميم يجب أن نستخدم؟"},"a":{"label":{"en":"A: \"No results for electrcity\"","ar":"A: «لا توجد نتائج لـ كهربا»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"wasl","name":{"en":"Wasl","ar":"وصل"},"color":"#0F766E","icon":"receipt","domain":"wasl.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Pay a bill","ar":"ادفع فاتورة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"searchbar","text":{"en":"electrcity","ar":"كهربا"}},{"kind":"icon","icon":"magnifying-glass","gap":"m"},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"No results for \"electrcity\"","ar":"لا توجد نتائج لـ «كهربا»"},"gap":"s"}]}},"b":{"label":{"en":"B: \"Showing results for electricity\", with \"Search for electrcity instead\"","ar":"B: «نعرض نتائج كهرباء»، مع «ابحث عن كهربا بدلًا من ذلك»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"wasl","name":{"en":"Wasl","ar":"وصل"},"color":"#0F766E","icon":"receipt","domain":"wasl.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Pay a bill","ar":"ادفع فاتورة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"searchbar","text":{"en":"electrcity","ar":"كهربا"}},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Showing results for electricity","ar":"نعرض نتائج «كهرباء»"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"link","text":{"en":"Search for \"electrcity\" instead","ar":"ابحث عن «كهربا» بدلًا من ذلك"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"lightning","text":{"en":"Cairo Electricity","ar":"كهرباء القاهرة"},"chevron":true,"gap":"s"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"lightning","text":{"en":"Delta Electricity","ar":"كهرباء الدلتا"},"chevron":true}]}},"answer":"b","reason":{"prompt":{"en":"Why is B better?","ar":"لماذا B أفضل؟"},"options":[{"id":"move","text":{"en":"It finds what they most likely meant, and still lets them choose","ar":"يجد ما قصدوه على الأرجح، ويتركهم يختارون أيضًا"}},{"id":"smart","text":{"en":"It makes the app look smarter","ar":"يجعل التطبيق يبدو أذكى"}},{"id":"typo","text":{"en":"It teaches people to spell","ar":"يعلّم الناس الإملاء"}}],"answer":["move"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P12-039","when":["smart","typo"],"feedback":{"en":"It's about getting them to their bill, not looks or spelling. The link back keeps them in charge.","ar":"المهم أن نوصلهم إلى فاتورتهم، لا الشكل أو الإملاء. ورابط العودة يُبقيهم أصحاب القرار."}}]},"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P12-039","when":["a"],"feedback":{"en":"A is accurate, but it's a dead end. The app can tell what they meant, so it should offer it.","ar":"A دقيق، لكنه طريق مسدود. والتطبيق يستطيع أن يعرف ما قصدوه، فيجب أن يعرضه."}}],"hints":[{"en":"What were they most likely looking for?","ar":"عمّ كانوا يبحثون على الأرجح؟"},{"en":"Which design gets them there?","ar":"أي تصميم يوصلهم إلى هناك؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Turn a dead end into a likely match.","ar":"صحيح. حوّل الطريق المسدود إلى اقتراح محتمل."},"explain":{"en":"A good guess plus a way back is better than \"no results\".","ar":"التخمين الجيد مع طريق للعودة أفضل من «لا توجد نتائج»."},"speaker":"sara"},{"id":"S07","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P12-U05-01","part":"independent","speaker":"karim","rules":["R14"],"value":{"en":"New case. Errors + Graceful Failure (People + AI): use error states to tell people what input the AI needs, or how it works.","ar":"حالة جديدة. الأخطاء والفشل اللطيف (People + AI): استخدم حالات الخطأ لتخبر الناس ما المدخلات التي يحتاجها الذكاء الاصطناعي، أو كيف يعمل."},"ref":{"url":"https://pair.withgoogle.com/chapter/errors-failing/","quote":"Use error states to tell the user what inputs the AI needs or how the AI works."},"scenario":{"en":"I'm building voice search for a grocery app. When people say a long sentence, like \"I want the big bottle of the oil I usually get\", it fails and says \"Sorry, I didn't get that.\"","ar":"أبني البحث الصوتي لتطبيق بقالة. وحين يقول الناس جملة طويلة، مثل «أريد الزجاجة الكبيرة من الزيت الذي أشتريه عادةً»، يفشل ويقول «عذرًا، لم أفهم.»"},"prompt":{"en":"Tap each option to see it. What should it say instead?","ar":"اضغط على كل خيار لتراه. ماذا يجب أن يقول بدلًا من ذلك؟"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"app":{"id":"sallah","name":{"en":"Sallah","ar":"سلّة"},"color":"#2E9E5B","icon":"basket","domain":"sallah.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Search","ar":"بحث"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"searchbar","text":{"en":"Search products","ar":"ابحث عن منتجات"}}],"overlay":{"type":"sheet","blocks":[{"kind":"icon","icon":"microphone"},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"You said:","ar":"قلت:"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"\"I want the big bottle of the oil I usually get\"","ar":"«أريد الزجاجة الكبيرة من الزيت الذي أشتريه عادةً»"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"banner","tone":"bad","text":{"en":"Sorry, I didn't get that.","ar":"عذرًا، لم أفهم."},"gap":"s"}]}},"options":[{"id":"sorry","text":{"en":"\"Sorry, I didn't get that. Please try again.\"","ar":"«عذرًا، لم أفهم. حاول مرة أخرى من فضلك.»"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"sallah","name":{"en":"Sallah","ar":"سلّة"},"color":"#2E9E5B","icon":"basket","domain":"sallah.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Search","ar":"بحث"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"searchbar","text":{"en":"Search products","ar":"ابحث عن منتجات"}}],"overlay":{"type":"sheet","blocks":[{"kind":"icon","icon":"microphone"},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"You said:","ar":"قلت:"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"\"I want the big bottle of the oil I usually get\"","ar":"«أريد الزجاجة الكبيرة من الزيت الذي أشتريه عادةً»"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"banner","tone":"bad","text":{"en":"Sorry, I didn't get that. Please try again.","ar":"عذرًا، لم أفهم. حاول مرة أخرى من فضلك."},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","icon":"microphone","text":{"en":"Try again","ar":"حاول مرة أخرى"},"gap":"s"}]}}},{"id":"needs","text":{"en":"\"Try a short phrase, like \"sunflower oil 2 litres\". Or type it.\"","ar":"«جرّب عبارة قصيرة، مثل «زيت عبّاد الشمس 2 لتر». أو اكتبها.»"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"sallah","name":{"en":"Sallah","ar":"سلّة"},"color":"#2E9E5B","icon":"basket","domain":"sallah.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Search","ar":"بحث"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"searchbar","text":{"en":"Search products","ar":"ابحث عن منتجات"}}],"overlay":{"type":"sheet","blocks":[{"kind":"icon","icon":"microphone"},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"You said:","ar":"قلت:"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"\"I want the big bottle of the oil I usually get\"","ar":"«أريد الزجاجة الكبيرة من الزيت الذي أشتريه عادةً»"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"banner","tone":"info","icon":"lightbulb","text":{"en":"Try a short phrase, like \"sunflower oil 2 litres\". Or type it.","ar":"جرّب عبارة قصيرة، مثل «زيت عبّاد الشمس 2 لتر». أو اكتبها."},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"row","blocks":[{"kind":"button","icon":"microphone","text":{"en":"Speak again","ar":"تحدّث مجددًا"}},{"kind":"button","style":"outline","icon":"keyboard","text":{"en":"Type it","ar":"اكتبها"}}],"gap":"s"}]}}},{"id":"louder","text":{"en":"\"Please speak louder.\"","ar":"«تحدّث بصوت أعلى من فضلك.»"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"sallah","name":{"en":"Sallah","ar":"سلّة"},"color":"#2E9E5B","icon":"basket","domain":"sallah.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Search","ar":"بحث"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"searchbar","text":{"en":"Search products","ar":"ابحث عن منتجات"}}],"overlay":{"type":"sheet","blocks":[{"kind":"icon","icon":"microphone"},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"You said:","ar":"قلت:"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"\"I want the big bottle of the oil I usually get\"","ar":"«أريد الزجاجة الكبيرة من الزيت الذي أشتريه عادةً»"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"banner","tone":"warn","icon":"speaker-high","text":{"en":"Please speak louder.","ar":"تحدّث بصوت أعلى من فضلك."},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","icon":"microphone","text":{"en":"Try again","ar":"حاول مرة أخرى"},"gap":"s"}]}}}],"answer":["needs"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P12-038","when":["sorry","louder"],"feedback":{"en":"Volume isn't the problem, and \"try again\" will get the same sentence. Show the kind of phrase that works.","ar":"ارتفاع الصوت ليس المشكلة، ومع «حاول مرة أخرى» سيكرّر الناس الجملة نفسها. اعرض نوع العبارة التي تنجح."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Why did the search fail?","ar":"لماذا فشل البحث؟"},{"en":"Which message teaches what works?","ar":"أي رسالة تعلّم ما الذي ينجح؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Show the input that works.","ar":"صحيح. اعرض نوع الكلام الذي ينجح."},"explain":{"en":"One example teaches people how to talk to it, and typing is there as a backup.","ar":"مثال واحد يعلّم الناس كيف يتحدّثون إليه، والكتابة موجودة كبديل."}},{"id":"S08","type":"card","part":"recap","icons":["warn","target","ok","search","phone"],"title":{"en":"What you did","ar":"ماذا تعلّمت"},"body":{"en":"- **Found the problem:** \"Error. Try again.\" says nothing useful.\n- **Named the limit:** electricity bills only; type water bills.\n- **Kept what worked:** the amount stays, only the account number is asked.\n- **Likely match:** \"Showing results for electricity\".\n- **New case:** you showed voice search users a short phrase that works.\n\nNext lesson: don't act on a guess.","ar":"- **وجدت المشكلة:** «خطأ. حاول مرة أخرى.» لا تقول شيئًا مفيدًا.\n- **ذكرت الحدّ:** فواتير الكهرباء فقط؛ ولفواتير المياه يُكتب رقم الحساب.\n- **احتفظت بما نجح:** المبلغ يبقى، ونطلب رقم الحساب فقط.\n- **اقتراح محتمل:** «نعرض نتائج كهرباء».\n- **حالة جديدة:** عرضت على مستخدمي البحث الصوتي عبارة قصيرة تنجح.\n\nالدرس التالي: لا تتصرّف بناءً على تخمين."}}]}$uxg$::jsonb),
  ($uxg$P12-U05-L02$uxg$, $uxg$259716052f1ffa245fa320b35a912f8b86ecee5a6ea2a86eb951d3cf7922f5bb$uxg$, $uxg${"id":"P12-U05-L02","mode":"lesson","minutes":7,"title":{"en":"Don't act on a guess","ar":"لا تتصرّف بناءً على تخمين"},"summary":{"en":"Stop a supermarket's auto-basket from acting on wrong guesses and moving familiar buttons.","ar":"أوقف السلّة التلقائية في سوبرماركت عن التصرّف بتخمينات خطأ وعن تحريك الأزرار المألوفة."},"speaker":"tarek","review_labels":{"MC-P12-040":{"en":"Suggest, don't act on a guess","ar":"اقترح، ولا تتصرّف بناءً على تخمين"},"MC-P12-041":{"en":"Don't move what people tap by habit","ar":"لا تحرّك ما يضغطه الناس بحكم العادة"}},"steps":[{"id":"S01","type":"card","part":"hook","title":{"en":"5 kg of sugar, every week","ar":"5 كجم سكّر، كل أسبوع"},"body":{"en":"I'm the PM of a supermarket app. Its \"Smart basket\" fills your weekly order for you, from what you bought before.\n\nOne customer baked cakes for her sister's wedding and bought 5 kg of sugar. Since then, the app adds 5 kg of sugar to her basket every week. She has paid for it twice without noticing.","ar":"أنا مدير منتج لتطبيق سوبرماركت. وفيه «السلّة الذكية» التي تملأ طلبك الأسبوعي نيابةً عنك، ممّا اشتريته من قبل.\n\nخبزت إحدى العميلات كعكًا لزفاف أختها واشترت 5 كجم سكّر. ومنذ ذلك الحين، يضيف التطبيق 5 كجم سكّر إلى سلّتها كل أسبوع. ودفعت ثمنه مرتين دون أن تلاحظ."},"mock":{"app":{"id":"sallah","name":{"en":"Sallah","ar":"سلّة"},"color":"#2E9E5B","icon":"basket","domain":"sallah.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Smart basket · this week","ar":"السلّة الذكية · هذا الأسبوع"}},"tabbar":{"active":0,"items":[{"icon":"house","text":{"en":"Home","ar":"الرئيسية"}},{"icon":"basket","text":{"en":"Basket","ar":"السلّة"}},{"icon":"receipt","text":{"en":"Orders","ar":"الطلبات"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"drop","text":{"en":"Milk 2 L","ar":"حليب 2 لتر"},"value":{"en":"70 EGP","ar":"70 جنيهًا"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"bread","text":{"en":"Bread","ar":"خبز"},"value":{"en":"20 EGP","ar":"20 جنيهًا"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"egg","text":{"en":"Eggs 10","ar":"بيض 10"},"value":{"en":"75 EGP","ar":"75 جنيهًا"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"cube","text":{"en":"Sugar 5 kg","ar":"سكّر 5 كجم"},"value":{"en":"190 EGP","ar":"190 جنيهًا"}},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Pay now · 355 EGP","ar":"ادفع الآن · 355 جنيهًا"},"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"S02","type":"choose","skill":"SK-P12-U05-02","part":"try","rules":["R12"],"value":{"en":"Try first. Errors + Graceful Failure (People + AI): don't act on assumptions; doing so can lead to errors about people's situation.","ar":"جرّب أولًا. الأخطاء والفشل اللطيف (People + AI): لا تتصرّف بناءً على افتراضات؛ فذلك قد يؤدّي إلى أخطاء في فهم موقف الناس."},"ref":{"url":"https://pair.withgoogle.com/chapter/errors-failing/","quote":"Don’t act on assumptions. Doing so can lead to context errors."},"prompt":{"en":"What went wrong?","ar":"ما الخطأ الذي وقع فيه التطبيق؟"},"options":[{"id":"assume","text":{"en":"The app acted on a one-time purchase, as if it were a habit","ar":"تصرّف التطبيق بناءً على شراء لمرة واحدة، كأنه عادة"}},{"id":"check","text":{"en":"She should have checked her basket","ar":"كان عليها أن تراجع سلّتها"}},{"id":"sugar","text":{"en":"Sugar should never be in the smart basket","ar":"السكّر يجب ألّا يكون في السلّة الذكية أبدًا"}}],"answer":["assume"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P12-040","when":["check","sugar"],"feedback":{"en":"The cause is the app's guess, not her or the sugar. One big purchase isn't a weekly need.","ar":"السبب هو تخمين التطبيق، لا هي ولا السكّر. والشراء الكبير لمرة واحدة ليس حاجة أسبوعية."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Why did she buy 5 kg that week?","ar":"لماذا اشترت 5 كجم في ذلك الأسبوع؟"},{"en":"What did the app assume?","ar":"ماذا افترض التطبيق؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Right. It acted on a wrong guess.","ar":"صحيح. تصرّف بناءً على تخمين خطأ."},"explain":{"en":"The app worked as built, but it guessed her life wrong, and then acted with her money.","ar":"التطبيق عمل كما بُني، لكنه أخطأ في تخمين حياتها، ثم تصرّف بمالها."}},{"id":"S03","type":"card","part":"concept","icons":["idea","ok","cut","pin"],"title":{"en":"Guess less, ask more","ar":"خمّن أقل، واسأل أكثر"},"body":{"en":"AI can't see why people do things: a wedding, a guest, a diet.\n\n- **Act only when it's very sure,** like items bought every week.\n- **Suggest the rest:** \"Buy again?\" lets people say yes or no.\n- **Watch for patterns with a reason** the AI can't see.\n- **Don't move what people tap by habit.** Keep AI picks in their own area.","ar":"الذكاء الاصطناعي لا يرى لماذا يفعل الناس الأشياء: زفاف، أو ضيف، أو حمية.\n\n- **تصرّف فقط حين يكون متأكّدًا جدًا،** مثل الأشياء التي تُشترى كل أسبوع.\n- **اقترح الباقي:** «تشتريه مرة أخرى؟» يسمح للناس بأن يقولوا نعم أو لا.\n- **انتبه للأنماط التي لها سبب** لا يراه الذكاء الاصطناعي.\n- **لا تحرّك ما يضغطه الناس بحكم العادة.** ضع اختيارات الذكاء الاصطناعي في مساحتها الخاصة."}},{"id":"S04","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P12-U05-02","part":"guided","rules":["R06"],"value":{"en":"Errors + Graceful Failure (People + AI): act proactively only when the AI is very sure about people's situation.","ar":"الأخطاء والفشل اللطيف (People + AI): تصرّف بمبادرة فقط حين يكون الذكاء الاصطناعي متأكّدًا جدًا من موقف الناس."},"ref":{"url":"https://pair.withgoogle.com/chapter/errors-failing/","quote":"Provide proactive recommendations when AI has high confidence about the user’s context."},"scenario":{"en":"We're changing how the smart basket handles items.","ar":"نغيّر طريقة تعامل السلّة الذكية مع المنتجات."},"prompt":{"en":"Tap each option to see it. Which rule is best?","ar":"اضغط على كل خيار لتراه. أي قاعدة تمنع تكرار خطأ السكّر دون أن تُضيّع الميزة؟"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"app":{"id":"sallah","name":{"en":"Sallah","ar":"سلّة"},"color":"#2E9E5B","icon":"basket","domain":"sallah.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Smart basket · this week","ar":"السلّة الذكية · هذا الأسبوع"}},"tabbar":{"active":0,"items":[{"icon":"house","text":{"en":"Home","ar":"الرئيسية"}},{"icon":"basket","text":{"en":"Basket","ar":"السلّة"}},{"icon":"receipt","text":{"en":"Orders","ar":"الطلبات"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"drop","text":{"en":"Milk 2 L","ar":"حليب 2 لتر"},"value":{"en":"70 EGP","ar":"70 جنيهًا"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"bread","text":{"en":"Bread","ar":"خبز"},"value":{"en":"20 EGP","ar":"20 جنيهًا"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"egg","text":{"en":"Eggs 10","ar":"بيض 10"},"value":{"en":"75 EGP","ar":"75 جنيهًا"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"cube","text":{"en":"Sugar 5 kg","ar":"سكّر 5 كجم"},"value":{"en":"190 EGP","ar":"190 جنيهًا"}},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Pay now · 355 EGP","ar":"ادفع الآن · 355 جنيهًا"},"gap":"s"}]},"options":[{"id":"all","text":{"en":"Add everything bought in the last month","ar":"نضيف كل ما اشتُري في الشهر الماضي"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"sallah","name":{"en":"Sallah","ar":"سلّة"},"color":"#2E9E5B","icon":"basket","domain":"sallah.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Smart basket · this week","ar":"السلّة الذكية · هذا الأسبوع"}},"tabbar":{"active":0,"items":[{"icon":"house","text":{"en":"Home","ar":"الرئيسية"}},{"icon":"basket","text":{"en":"Basket","ar":"السلّة"}},{"icon":"receipt","text":{"en":"Orders","ar":"الطلبات"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"drop","text":{"en":"Milk 2 L","ar":"حليب 2 لتر"},"value":{"en":"70 EGP","ar":"70 جنيهًا"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"bread","text":{"en":"Bread","ar":"خبز"},"value":{"en":"20 EGP","ar":"20 جنيهًا"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"egg","text":{"en":"Eggs 10","ar":"بيض 10"},"value":{"en":"75 EGP","ar":"75 جنيهًا"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"cube","text":{"en":"Sugar 5 kg","ar":"سكّر 5 كجم"},"value":{"en":"190 EGP","ar":"190 جنيهًا"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"cake","text":{"en":"Birthday candles","ar":"شموع عيد ميلاد"},"value":{"en":"35 EGP","ar":"35 جنيهًا"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"cookie","text":{"en":"Vanilla × 10","ar":"فانيليا × 10"},"value":{"en":"60 EGP","ar":"60 جنيهًا"}},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Pay now · 450 EGP","ar":"ادفع الآن · 450 جنيهًا"},"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"none","text":{"en":"Stop filling the basket at all","ar":"نتوقّف عن ملء السلّة تمامًا"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"sallah","name":{"en":"Sallah","ar":"سلّة"},"color":"#2E9E5B","icon":"basket","domain":"sallah.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Smart basket · this week","ar":"السلّة الذكية · هذا الأسبوع"}},"tabbar":{"active":0,"items":[{"icon":"house","text":{"en":"Home","ar":"الرئيسية"}},{"icon":"basket","text":{"en":"Basket","ar":"السلّة"}},{"icon":"receipt","text":{"en":"Orders","ar":"الطلبات"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"icon","icon":"basket","gap":"m"},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"Your basket is empty.","ar":"سلّتك فارغة."},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Add your items one by one.","ar":"أضف أغراضك واحدًا تلو الآخر."},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"button","style":"outline","text":{"en":"Start shopping","ar":"ابدأ التسوّق"},"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"sure","text":{"en":"Add only items bought almost every week. Show others under \"Buy again?\"","ar":"نضيف فقط ما يُشترى كل أسبوع تقريبًا. ونعرض الباقي تحت «تشتريه مرة أخرى؟»"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"sallah","name":{"en":"Sallah","ar":"سلّة"},"color":"#2E9E5B","icon":"basket","domain":"sallah.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Smart basket · this week","ar":"السلّة الذكية · هذا الأسبوع"}},"tabbar":{"active":0,"items":[{"icon":"house","text":{"en":"Home","ar":"الرئيسية"}},{"icon":"basket","text":{"en":"Basket","ar":"السلّة"}},{"icon":"receipt","text":{"en":"Orders","ar":"الطلبات"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"drop","text":{"en":"Milk 2 L","ar":"حليب 2 لتر"},"value":{"en":"70 EGP","ar":"70 جنيهًا"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"bread","text":{"en":"Bread","ar":"خبز"},"value":{"en":"20 EGP","ar":"20 جنيهًا"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"egg","text":{"en":"Eggs 10","ar":"بيض 10"},"value":{"en":"75 EGP","ar":"75 جنيهًا"}},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Buy again?","ar":"تشتريه مرة أخرى؟"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"cube","text":{"en":"Sugar 5 kg","ar":"سكّر 5 كجم"},"sub":{"en":"Bought once, 3 weeks ago","ar":"اشتريته مرة واحدة، قبل 3 أسابيع"},"badge":{"text":{"en":"Add","ar":"أضف"},"icon":"plus"}},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Pay now · 165 EGP","ar":"ادفع الآن · 165 جنيهًا"},"gap":"s"}]}}],"answer":["sure"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P12-040","when":["all","none"],"feedback":{"en":"Adding everything repeats the sugar mistake, and stopping loses a useful feature. Act on what's certain, suggest the rest.","ar":"إضافة كل شيء تكرّر خطأ السكّر، والتوقّف يُضيّع ميزة مفيدة. تصرّف فيما هو مؤكّد، واقترح الباقي."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Which items is the app really sure about?","ar":"ما المنتجات التي يتأكّد منها التطبيق فعلًا؟"},{"en":"What should happen with the others?","ar":"ماذا يجب أن يحدث مع الباقي؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Act when sure, suggest when not.","ar":"صحيح. تصرّف حين تكون متأكّدًا، واقترح حين لا تكون."},"explain":{"en":"Milk every week is a habit. Sugar once is a story the app doesn't know.","ar":"الحليب كل أسبوع عادة. والسكّر مرة واحدة قصة لا يعرفها التطبيق."},"speaker":"tarek"},{"id":"S05","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P12-U05-05","part":"guided","rules":["R06"],"value":{"en":"Errors + Graceful Failure (People + AI): use AI in ways that don't break people's habits, like a set area for the less predictable AI results.","ar":"الأخطاء والفشل اللطيف (People + AI): استخدم الذكاء الاصطناعي بطرق لا تكسر عادات الناس، مثل مساحة مخصّصة لنتائج الذكاء الاصطناعي الأقل ثباتًا."},"ref":{"url":"https://pair.withgoogle.com/chapter/errors-failing/","quote":"Response: Implement AI in ways that don’t break habituation, such as by designating a specific area of the interface for less-predictable AI output."},"scenario":{"en":"The team wants AI to reorder the home screen buttons every day: Basket, Offers, Orders, Help.","ar":"الفريق يريد أن يعيد الذكاء الاصطناعي ترتيب أزرار الشاشة الرئيسية كل يوم: السلّة، والعروض، والطلبات، والمساعدة."},"prompt":{"en":"Tap each option to see it. What should we do?","ar":"اضغط على كل خيار لتراه. ماذا يجب أن نفعل؟"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"app":{"id":"sallah","name":{"en":"Sallah","ar":"سلّة"},"color":"#2E9E5B","icon":"basket","domain":"sallah.example"},"appbar":{"logo":true,"actions":[{"icon":"bell","aria":{"en":"Notifications","ar":"الإشعارات"}}]},"tabbar":{"active":0,"items":[{"icon":"house","text":{"en":"Home","ar":"الرئيسية"}},{"icon":"basket","text":{"en":"Basket","ar":"السلّة"}},{"icon":"receipt","text":{"en":"Orders","ar":"الطلبات"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"searchbar","text":{"en":"Search products","ar":"ابحث عن منتجات"}},{"kind":"row","blocks":[{"kind":"button","style":"outline","icon":"basket","text":{"en":"Basket","ar":"السلّة"}},{"kind":"button","style":"outline","icon":"tag","text":{"en":"Offers","ar":"العروض"}}],"gap":"s"},{"kind":"row","blocks":[{"kind":"button","style":"outline","icon":"receipt","text":{"en":"Orders","ar":"الطلبات"}},{"kind":"button","style":"outline","icon":"question","text":{"en":"Help","ar":"المساعدة"}}],"gap":"xs"}]},"options":[{"id":"fixed","text":{"en":"Keep the 4 buttons fixed, and add one \"For you\" row that AI can change","ar":"نُبقي الأزرار الأربعة ثابتة، ونضيف صفًّا واحدًا «مقترح لك» يغيّره الذكاء الاصطناعي"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"sallah","name":{"en":"Sallah","ar":"سلّة"},"color":"#2E9E5B","icon":"basket","domain":"sallah.example"},"appbar":{"logo":true,"actions":[{"icon":"bell","aria":{"en":"Notifications","ar":"الإشعارات"}}]},"tabbar":{"active":0,"items":[{"icon":"house","text":{"en":"Home","ar":"الرئيسية"}},{"icon":"basket","text":{"en":"Basket","ar":"السلّة"}},{"icon":"receipt","text":{"en":"Orders","ar":"الطلبات"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"searchbar","text":{"en":"Search products","ar":"ابحث عن منتجات"}},{"kind":"row","blocks":[{"kind":"button","style":"outline","icon":"basket","text":{"en":"Basket","ar":"السلّة"}},{"kind":"button","style":"outline","icon":"tag","text":{"en":"Offers","ar":"العروض"}}],"gap":"s"},{"kind":"row","blocks":[{"kind":"button","style":"outline","icon":"receipt","text":{"en":"Orders","ar":"الطلبات"}},{"kind":"button","style":"outline","icon":"question","text":{"en":"Help","ar":"المساعدة"}}],"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"✨ For you","ar":"✨ مقترح لك"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"chips","items":[{"text":{"en":"Dates for Ramadan","ar":"تمر لرمضان"}},{"text":{"en":"Rice 5 kg","ar":"أرز 5 كجم"}},{"text":{"en":"Tea","ar":"شاي"}}],"gap":"xs"}]}},{"id":"daily","text":{"en":"Reorder them every day, by what each person uses most","ar":"نعيد ترتيبها كل يوم، حسب ما يستخدمه كل شخص أكثر"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"sallah","name":{"en":"Sallah","ar":"سلّة"},"color":"#2E9E5B","icon":"basket","domain":"sallah.example"},"appbar":{"logo":true,"actions":[{"icon":"bell","aria":{"en":"Notifications","ar":"الإشعارات"}}]},"tabbar":{"active":0,"items":[{"icon":"house","text":{"en":"Home","ar":"الرئيسية"}},{"icon":"basket","text":{"en":"Basket","ar":"السلّة"}},{"icon":"receipt","text":{"en":"Orders","ar":"الطلبات"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"searchbar","text":{"en":"Search products","ar":"ابحث عن منتجات"}},{"kind":"row","blocks":[{"kind":"button","style":"outline","icon":"question","text":{"en":"Help","ar":"المساعدة"}},{"kind":"button","style":"outline","icon":"receipt","text":{"en":"Orders","ar":"الطلبات"}}],"gap":"s"},{"kind":"row","blocks":[{"kind":"button","style":"outline","icon":"tag","text":{"en":"Offers","ar":"العروض"}},{"kind":"button","style":"outline","icon":"basket","text":{"en":"Basket","ar":"السلّة"}}],"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","icon":"arrows-clockwise","text":{"en":"✨ Buttons reordered today, by what you use most","ar":"✨ أُعيد ترتيب الأزرار اليوم، حسب ما تستخدمه أكثر"},"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"weekly","text":{"en":"Reorder them once a week, so it's less confusing","ar":"نعيد ترتيبها مرة في الأسبوع، ليكون أقل إرباكًا"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"sallah","name":{"en":"Sallah","ar":"سلّة"},"color":"#2E9E5B","icon":"basket","domain":"sallah.example"},"appbar":{"logo":true,"actions":[{"icon":"bell","aria":{"en":"Notifications","ar":"الإشعارات"}}]},"tabbar":{"active":0,"items":[{"icon":"house","text":{"en":"Home","ar":"الرئيسية"}},{"icon":"basket","text":{"en":"Basket","ar":"السلّة"}},{"icon":"receipt","text":{"en":"Orders","ar":"الطلبات"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"searchbar","text":{"en":"Search products","ar":"ابحث عن منتجات"}},{"kind":"row","blocks":[{"kind":"button","style":"outline","icon":"receipt","text":{"en":"Orders","ar":"الطلبات"}},{"kind":"button","style":"outline","icon":"basket","text":{"en":"Basket","ar":"السلّة"}}],"gap":"s"},{"kind":"row","blocks":[{"kind":"button","style":"outline","icon":"question","text":{"en":"Help","ar":"المساعدة"}},{"kind":"button","style":"outline","icon":"tag","text":{"en":"Offers","ar":"العروض"}}],"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"✨ Buttons reordered every Saturday","ar":"✨ يُعاد ترتيب الأزرار كل سبت"},"gap":"s"}]}}],"answer":["fixed"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P12-041","when":["daily","weekly"],"feedback":{"en":"People tap by memory. Moving buttons, daily or weekly, makes them tap the wrong one. Give AI its own row instead.","ar":"الناس يضغطون من الذاكرة. وتحريك الأزرار، يوميًا أو أسبوعيًا، يجعلهم يضغطون الزر الخطأ. أعطِ الذكاء الاصطناعي صفًّا خاصًّا به بدلًا من ذلك."}}],"hints":[{"en":"How do people find \"Orders\" after a few weeks?","ar":"كيف يجد الناس «الطلبات» بعد بضعة أسابيع؟"},{"en":"Where can AI change things safely?","ar":"أين يستطيع الذكاء الاصطناعي تغيير الأشياء بأمان؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Fixed buttons, one AI area.","ar":"صحيح. أزرار ثابتة، ومساحة واحدة للذكاء الاصطناعي."},"explain":{"en":"Habits stay safe, and AI still gets a place to help.","ar":"تبقى العادات آمنة، ويبقى للذكاء الاصطناعي مكان يساعد فيه."},"speaker":"tarek"},{"id":"S06","type":"compare","skill":"SK-P12-U05-05","part":"contrast","confidence":true,"rules":["R11"],"value":{"en":"Contrast: forced change vs a way back. Errors + Graceful Failure (People + AI): let people go back to, choose, or retrain a layout they know.","ar":"مقارنة: تغيير مفروض مقابل طريق للعودة. الأخطاء والفشل اللطيف (People + AI): اسمح للناس بالعودة إلى تصميم يعرفونه، أو اختياره، أو إعادة تعليمه."},"ref":{"url":"https://pair.withgoogle.com/chapter/errors-failing/","quote":"Or, allow users to revert to, choose, or retrain a specific interaction pattern."},"scenario":{"en":"An update already moved \"Reorder last basket\" to a new spot chosen by AI. Many customers now tap \"Offers\" by mistake. Two fixes:","ar":"تحديث سابق نقل زر «أعِد طلب السلّة الأخيرة» إلى مكان جديد اختاره الذكاء الاصطناعي. والآن يضغط كثير من العملاء «العروض» بالخطأ. وهذان حلّان:"},"prompt":{"en":"Which fix should we ship?","ar":"أي حلّ نعتمد ليجد العملاء زر إعادة الطلب كما اعتادوا؟"},"a":{"label":{"en":"A: A banner: \"Things moved! Swipe to find Reorder.\"","ar":"A: شريط: «تغيّرت الأماكن! اسحب لتجد إعادة الطلب.»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"sallah","name":{"en":"Sallah","ar":"سلّة"},"color":"#2E9E5B","icon":"basket","domain":"sallah.example"},"appbar":{"logo":true,"actions":[{"icon":"bell","aria":{"en":"Notifications","ar":"الإشعارات"}}]},"tabbar":{"active":0,"items":[{"icon":"house","text":{"en":"Home","ar":"الرئيسية"}},{"icon":"basket","text":{"en":"Basket","ar":"السلّة"}},{"icon":"receipt","text":{"en":"Orders","ar":"الطلبات"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"searchbar","text":{"en":"Search products","ar":"ابحث عن منتجات"}},{"kind":"banner","tone":"info","icon":"info","text":{"en":"Things moved! Swipe to find Reorder.","ar":"تغيّرت الأماكن! اسحب لتجد إعادة الطلب."},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"row","blocks":[{"kind":"button","style":"outline","icon":"tag","text":{"en":"Offers","ar":"العروض"}},{"kind":"button","style":"outline","icon":"arrows-clockwise","text":{"en":"Reorder","ar":"إعادة الطلب"}}],"gap":"s"},{"kind":"row","blocks":[{"kind":"button","style":"outline","icon":"basket","text":{"en":"Basket","ar":"السلّة"}},{"kind":"button","style":"outline","icon":"question","text":{"en":"Help","ar":"المساعدة"}}],"gap":"xs"}]}},"b":{"label":{"en":"B: \"New layout. Keep it · Go back to classic\"","ar":"B: «تصميم جديد. احتفظ به · عُد إلى التصميم المعتاد»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"sallah","name":{"en":"Sallah","ar":"سلّة"},"color":"#2E9E5B","icon":"basket","domain":"sallah.example"},"appbar":{"logo":true,"actions":[{"icon":"bell","aria":{"en":"Notifications","ar":"الإشعارات"}}]},"tabbar":{"active":0,"items":[{"icon":"house","text":{"en":"Home","ar":"الرئيسية"}},{"icon":"basket","text":{"en":"Basket","ar":"السلّة"}},{"icon":"receipt","text":{"en":"Orders","ar":"الطلبات"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"searchbar","text":{"en":"Search products","ar":"ابحث عن منتجات"}},{"kind":"card","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"✨ New layout","ar":"✨ تصميم جديد"}},{"kind":"row","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"button","style":"outline","text":{"en":"Keep it","ar":"احتفظ به"}},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Go back to classic","ar":"عُد إلى التصميم المعتاد"}}]}]},{"kind":"row","blocks":[{"kind":"button","style":"outline","icon":"tag","text":{"en":"Offers","ar":"العروض"}},{"kind":"button","style":"outline","icon":"arrows-clockwise","text":{"en":"Reorder","ar":"إعادة الطلب"}}],"gap":"s"},{"kind":"row","blocks":[{"kind":"button","style":"outline","icon":"basket","text":{"en":"Basket","ar":"السلّة"}},{"kind":"button","style":"outline","icon":"question","text":{"en":"Help","ar":"المساعدة"}}],"gap":"xs"}]}},"answer":"b","reason":{"prompt":{"en":"Why is B better?","ar":"لماذا B أفضل؟"},"options":[{"id":"banner","text":{"en":"Banners are annoying","ar":"الشرائط مزعجة"}},{"id":"back","text":{"en":"People can return to the layout their hands already know","ar":"يستطيع الناس العودة إلى التصميم الذي تعرفه أيديهم"}},{"id":"old","text":{"en":"Old designs are always better","ar":"التصاميم القديمة أفضل دائمًا"}}],"answer":["back"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P12-041","when":["banner","old"],"feedback":{"en":"The new layout may be fine for some. The point is a choice: those who rely on the old one can get it back.","ar":"التصميم الجديد قد يناسب البعض. المهم هو الاختيار: من يعتمد على القديم يستطيع استعادته."}}]},"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P12-041","when":["a"],"feedback":{"en":"A explains the change but still forces it. People will keep tapping the old spot by habit.","ar":"A يشرح التغيير لكنه يفرضه رغم ذلك. وسيظلّ الناس يضغطون المكان القديم بحكم العادة."}}],"hints":[{"en":"What do people's thumbs do after months of tapping one spot?","ar":"ماذا تفعل إبهامات الناس بعد أشهر من الضغط في مكان واحد؟"},{"en":"Which fix lets them choose?","ar":"أي حلّ يسمح لهم بالاختيار؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Give people a way back.","ar":"صحيح. أعطِ الناس طريقًا للعودة."},"explain":{"en":"Explaining a change helps a little. Letting people undo it helps more.","ar":"شرح التغيير يساعد قليلًا. والسماح للناس بإلغائه يساعد أكثر."},"speaker":"tarek"},{"id":"S07","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P12-U05-02","part":"independent","speaker":"hana","rules":["R14"],"value":{"en":"New case. Errors + Graceful Failure (People + AI): context errors happen when AI wrongly assumes what people want at a certain time or place.","ar":"حالة جديدة. الأخطاء والفشل اللطيف (People + AI): أخطاء السياق تحدث حين يفترض الذكاء الاصطناعي خطأً ما يريده الناس في وقت أو مكان معيّن."},"ref":{"url":"https://pair.withgoogle.com/chapter/errors-failing/","quote":"Context errors are instances in which the AI system becomes less useful through making incorrect assumptions about what the user wants to do at a certain time or place."},"scenario":{"en":"A member missed 3 weeks at my gym; she was ill. The app lowered her plan to \"Beginner\" and sent: \"Losing motivation? 😢\"","ar":"غابت عضوة عن ناديّ 3 أسابيع؛ كانت مريضة. فخفّض التطبيق خطتها إلى «مبتدئ» وأرسل: «هل فقدتِ الحماس؟ 😢»"},"prompt":{"en":"Tap each option to see it. What should the app do after a long break?","ar":"اضغط على كل خيار لتراه. ماذا يفعل التطبيق بعد غياب طويل، دون أن يخمّن سبب غيابها؟"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Welcome back, Salma","ar":"أهلًا بعودتك يا سلمى"}},"tabbar":{"active":0,"items":[{"icon":"house","text":{"en":"Home","ar":"الرئيسية"}},{"icon":"calendar-blank","text":{"en":"Classes","ar":"الحصص"}},{"icon":"user","text":{"en":"Me","ar":"حسابي"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"banner","tone":"warn","text":{"en":"Losing motivation? 😢","ar":"هل فقدتِ الحماس؟ 😢"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"card","blocks":[{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Your plan","ar":"خطتك"}},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Beginner","ar":"مبتدئ"}},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Changed by the app · was Intermediate","ar":"غيّره التطبيق · كان: متوسّط"}}]}]},"options":[{"id":"same","text":{"en":"Keep doing this; it worked for some","ar":"يستمرّ في ذلك؛ فقد نجح مع البعض"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Welcome back, Salma","ar":"أهلًا بعودتك يا سلمى"}},"tabbar":{"active":0,"items":[{"icon":"house","text":{"en":"Home","ar":"الرئيسية"}},{"icon":"calendar-blank","text":{"en":"Classes","ar":"الحصص"}},{"icon":"user","text":{"en":"Me","ar":"حسابي"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"banner","tone":"warn","text":{"en":"Losing motivation? 😢","ar":"هل فقدتِ الحماس؟ 😢"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"card","blocks":[{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Your plan","ar":"خطتك"}},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Beginner","ar":"مبتدئ"}},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Changed by the app · was Intermediate","ar":"غيّره التطبيق · كان: متوسّط"}}]}]}},{"id":"guilt","text":{"en":"Send a stronger push: \"Don't give up now!\"","ar":"يرسل رسالة أقوى: «لا تستسلمي الآن!»"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Welcome back, Salma","ar":"أهلًا بعودتك يا سلمى"}},"tabbar":{"active":0,"items":[{"icon":"house","text":{"en":"Home","ar":"الرئيسية"}},{"icon":"calendar-blank","text":{"en":"Classes","ar":"الحصص"}},{"icon":"user","text":{"en":"Me","ar":"حسابي"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"banner","tone":"bad","icon":"fire","text":{"en":"Don't give up now! 💪","ar":"لا تستسلمي الآن! 💪"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"card","blocks":[{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Your plan","ar":"خطتك"}},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Beginner","ar":"مبتدئ"}},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Changed by the app · was Intermediate","ar":"غيّره التطبيق · كان: متوسّط"}}]}]}},{"id":"ask","text":{"en":"Ask: \"Welcome back! Pick up where you left off, or ease back in?\"","ar":"يسأل: «أهلًا بعودتك! تكملين من حيث توقّفتِ، أم تبدئين بهدوء؟»"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Welcome back, Salma","ar":"أهلًا بعودتك يا سلمى"}},"tabbar":{"active":0,"items":[{"icon":"house","text":{"en":"Home","ar":"الرئيسية"}},{"icon":"calendar-blank","text":{"en":"Classes","ar":"الحصص"}},{"icon":"user","text":{"en":"Me","ar":"حسابي"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"card","blocks":[{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Your plan","ar":"خطتك"}},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Intermediate","ar":"متوسّط"}}]}],"overlay":{"type":"sheet","title":{"en":"Welcome back!","ar":"أهلًا بعودتك!"},"blocks":[{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"Pick up where you left off, or ease back in?","ar":"تكملين من حيث توقّفتِ، أم تبدئين بهدوء؟"}},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Pick up where I left off","ar":"أكمل من حيث توقّفت"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","style":"outline","text":{"en":"Ease back in","ar":"أبدأ بهدوء"},"gap":"xs"}]}}}],"answer":["ask"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P12-040","when":["same","guilt"],"feedback":{"en":"The app guessed \"lost motivation\" and acted on it. The reason could be illness, travel or exams. Ask, and let her choose.","ar":"خمّن التطبيق «فقدان الحماس» وتصرّف بناءً عليه. والسبب قد يكون مرضًا أو سفرًا أو امتحانات. اسأل، واتركها تختار."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Does the app know why she was away?","ar":"هل يعرف التطبيق لماذا غابت؟"},{"en":"Which option lets her decide?","ar":"أي خيار يسمح لها بالقرار؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Don't guess her reason; ask.","ar":"صحيح. لا تخمّن سببها؛ اسأل."},"explain":{"en":"A friendly question respects her situation, and still helps her return.","ar":"السؤال الودود يحترم موقفها، ويساعدها على العودة أيضًا."}},{"id":"S08","type":"card","part":"recap","icons":["warn","ok","pin","layers","person"],"title":{"en":"What you did","ar":"ماذا تعلّمت"},"body":{"en":"- **Found the guess:** one wedding order isn't a weekly habit.\n- **Sure vs suggest:** add weekly items, ask \"Buy again?\" for the rest.\n- **Fixed buttons:** AI gets its own \"For you\" row.\n- **A way back:** \"Go back to classic\" after a layout change.\n- **New case:** you asked a returning member instead of judging her.\n\nNext lesson: hand back control safely.","ar":"- **وجدت التخمين:** طلب زفاف واحد ليس عادة أسبوعية.\n- **متأكّد أم اقتراح:** أضف ما يُشترى أسبوعيًا، واسأل «تشتريه مرة أخرى؟» عن الباقي.\n- **أزرار ثابتة:** للذكاء الاصطناعي صفّ «مقترح لك» خاص به.\n- **طريق للعودة:** «عُد إلى المعتاد» بعد تغيير التصميم.\n- **حالة جديدة:** سألت العضوة العائدة بدل الحكم عليها.\n\nالدرس التالي: أعِد التحكّم بأمان."}}]}$uxg$::jsonb),
  ($uxg$P12-U05-L03$uxg$, $uxg$aeb00c48f71df4d458642c7edf1cea30375b431d9331388eb36984dc1ddd54c9$uxg$, $uxg${"id":"P12-U05-L03","mode":"lesson","minutes":7,"title":{"en":"Hand back control safely","ar":"أعِد التحكّم بأمان"},"summary":{"en":"Fix a clinic's phone assistant so patients reach a person, without repeating themselves.","ar":"أصلح المساعد الهاتفي في عيادة، ليصل المرضى إلى شخص، دون أن يكرّروا كلامهم."},"speaker":"nour","review_labels":{"MC-P12-042":{"en":"Hand over with what people need","ar":"سلّم المهمة مع ما يحتاجه الناس"},"MC-P12-038":{"en":"Say what failed and what to try","ar":"قل ما الذي فشل وما الذي يمكن تجربته"},"MC-P12-039":{"en":"Offer a safe next step","ar":"قدّم خطوة تالية آمنة"}},"steps":[{"id":"S01","type":"card","part":"hook","title":{"en":"\"Sorry, I didn't understand\"","ar":"«عذرًا، لم أفهم»"},"body":{"en":"I manage a clinic. Our phone line now has an AI assistant that books appointments.\n\nWhen it doesn't understand, it says \"Sorry, I didn't understand\" again and again. Older patients hang up. Those who reach the receptionist have to explain everything from the start.","ar":"أدير عيادة. وخطّ الهاتف عندنا أصبح فيه مساعد بالذكاء الاصطناعي يحجز المواعيد.\n\nوحين لا يفهم، يقول «عذرًا، لم أفهم» مرة بعد مرة. فيُغلق المرضى الكبار في السن الخط. ومن يصل إلى موظّفة الاستقبال يضطرّ أن يشرح كل شيء من البداية."},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Call log · Booking line","ar":"سجلّ المكالمات · خط الحجز"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"chat","from":"them","name":{"en":"Mrs. Samia","ar":"السيدة سامية"},"text":{"en":"I want Dr. Ali, next week… the day after the market.","ar":"أريد د. علي، الأسبوع القادم… اليوم الذي بعد السوق."},"time":"10:02"},{"kind":"chat","from":"ai","text":{"en":"Sorry, I didn't understand.","ar":"عذرًا، لم أفهم."},"time":"10:02"},{"kind":"chat","from":"them","name":{"en":"Mrs. Samia","ar":"السيدة سامية"},"text":{"en":"After the market day!","ar":"بعد يوم السوق!"},"time":"10:03"},{"kind":"chat","from":"ai","text":{"en":"Sorry, I didn't understand.","ar":"عذرًا، لم أفهم."},"time":"10:03"},{"kind":"chat","from":"ai","text":{"en":"Sorry, I didn't understand.","ar":"عذرًا، لم أفهم."},"time":"10:03"},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","icon":"phone-x","text":{"en":"Caller hung up · 1:48","ar":"أغلق المتّصل الخط · 1:48"},"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"S02","type":"choose","skill":"SK-P12-U05-04","part":"try","rules":["R12"],"value":{"en":"Try first. Errors + Graceful Failure (People + AI): when an AI system fails, often the easiest way forward is to let people take over.","ar":"جرّب أولًا. الأخطاء والفشل اللطيف (People + AI): حين يفشل نظام الذكاء الاصطناعي، غالبًا ما يكون أسهل طريق هو أن يتولّى الناس الأمر."},"ref":{"url":"https://pair.withgoogle.com/chapter/errors-failing/","quote":"When an AI system fails, often the easiest path forward is to let the user take over."},"prompt":{"en":"What should happen after 2 failed tries?","ar":"ماذا يفعل المساعد بعد محاولتين فاشلتين لفهم المريض؟"},"options":[{"id":"keep","text":{"en":"Keep trying; the patient will say it more clearly","ar":"يستمرّ في المحاولة؛ سيقولها المريض بوضوح أكثر"}},{"id":"hand","text":{"en":"Put the patient through to the receptionist, who sees what they already said","ar":"يحوّل المريض إلى موظّفة الاستقبال، التي ترى ما قاله بالفعل"}},{"id":"later","text":{"en":"Politely ask the patient to call back later","ar":"يطلب من المريض بلطف أن يتّصل لاحقًا"}}],"answer":["hand"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P12-042","when":["keep","later"],"feedback":{"en":"More tries just frustrate them, and \"call later\" drops them. After 2 fails, hand over to a person, with what's known.","ar":"المحاولات الإضافية تُحبطهم فقط، و«اتّصل لاحقًا» تتخلّى عنهم. بعد فشلين، سلّم المكالمة لشخص، مع ما هو معروف."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Will a third try likely work?","ar":"هل ستنجح المحاولة الثالثة على الأرجح؟"},{"en":"Who can finish the booking now?","ar":"من يستطيع إتمام الحجز الآن؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Know when to stop, and hand over.","ar":"صحيح. اعرف متى تتوقّف، وسلّم المهمة."},"explain":{"en":"The goal is the booking, not the AI's success. A person can finish it.","ar":"الهدف هو الحجز، لا نجاح الذكاء الاصطناعي. ويستطيع شخص إتمامه."}},{"id":"S03","type":"card","part":"concept","icons":["person","list","target","warn"],"title":{"en":"Hand over, don't drop","ar":"سلّم المهمة، ولا تتخلَّ"},"body":{"en":"- **Stop early:** after a couple of failed tries, stop repeating.\n- **Hand over** to a person, or to the manual way.\n- **Pass on what's known,** so nobody starts from zero.\n- **Say what happens next,** and why.\n- **Never just switch off** when that could leave people stuck or unsafe.","ar":"- **توقّف مبكرًا:** بعد محاولتين فاشلتين، توقّف عن التكرار.\n- **سلّم المهمة** لشخص، أو للطريقة اليدوية.\n- **انقل ما هو معروف،** حتى لا يبدأ أحد من الصفر.\n- **قل ماذا سيحدث بعد ذلك،** ولماذا.\n- **لا تتوقّف فجأة أبدًا** حين قد يترك ذلك الناس عالقين أو في خطر."}},{"id":"S04","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P12-U05-04","part":"guided","rules":["R06"],"value":{"en":"Errors + Graceful Failure (People + AI): people taking over need to know the situation, what to do next, and how.","ar":"الأخطاء والفشل اللطيف (People + AI): من يتولّى المهمة يحتاج أن يعرف الموقف، وما الخطوة التالية، وكيف يفعلها."},"ref":{"url":"https://pair.withgoogle.com/chapter/errors-failing/","quote":"That means the user must have all the information they need in order to take the reins: awareness of the situation, what they need to do next, and how to do it."},"scenario":{"en":"When a call is passed on, the receptionist's screen shows something.","ar":"حين تُحوَّل مكالمة، تعرض شاشة موظّفة الاستقبال شيئًا."},"prompt":{"en":"Tap each option to see it. What should it show?","ar":"اضغط على كل خيار لتراه. ماذا تعرض شاشة الموظّفة لتكمل الحجز دون أن يكرّر المريض كلامه؟"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"frame":"wide","app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"url":"raha.example/reception","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Today","ar":"اليوم"},{"en":"Calls","ar":"المكالمات"},{"en":"Doctors","ar":"الأطباء"}],"active":1},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Incoming call · from the AI assistant","ar":"مكالمة واردة · من مساعد الذكاء الاصطناعي"}},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"What the receptionist sees goes here","ar":"هنا ما تراه موظّفة الاستقبال"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"row","blocks":[{"kind":"button","icon":"phone","text":{"en":"Answer","ar":"ردّ"}},{"kind":"button","style":"outline","text":{"en":"Decline","ar":"رفض"}}],"gap":"s"}]},"options":[{"id":"ring","text":{"en":"Just \"Incoming call\"","ar":"فقط «مكالمة واردة»"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"frame":"wide","app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"url":"raha.example/reception","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Today","ar":"اليوم"},{"en":"Calls","ar":"المكالمات"},{"en":"Doctors","ar":"الأطباء"}],"active":1},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Incoming call · from the AI assistant","ar":"مكالمة واردة · من مساعد الذكاء الاصطناعي"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"phone-incoming","text":{"en":"Incoming call","ar":"مكالمة واردة"},"sub":"+20 100 555 0192","gap":"s"},{"kind":"row","blocks":[{"kind":"button","icon":"phone","text":{"en":"Answer","ar":"ردّ"}},{"kind":"button","style":"outline","text":{"en":"Decline","ar":"رفض"}}],"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"record","text":{"en":"A recording of the whole call so far","ar":"تسجيل للمكالمة كلها حتى الآن"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"frame":"wide","app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"url":"raha.example/reception","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Today","ar":"اليوم"},{"en":"Calls","ar":"المكالمات"},{"en":"Doctors","ar":"الأطباء"}],"active":1},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Incoming call · from the AI assistant","ar":"مكالمة واردة · من مساعد الذكاء الاصطناعي"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"play-circle","text":{"en":"Call recording","ar":"تسجيل المكالمة"},"sub":{"en":"Listen to the whole call so far","ar":"استمع للمكالمة كلها حتى الآن"},"value":"3:40","gap":"s"},{"kind":"progress","value":0,"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"row","blocks":[{"kind":"button","icon":"phone","text":{"en":"Answer","ar":"ردّ"}},{"kind":"button","style":"outline","text":{"en":"Decline","ar":"رفض"}}],"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"summary","text":{"en":"\"Mrs. Samia · wants Dr. Ali next week · couldn't catch the day\"","ar":"«السيدة سامية · تريد د. علي الأسبوع القادم · لم يُفهم اليوم»"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"frame":"wide","app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"url":"raha.example/reception","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Today","ar":"اليوم"},{"en":"Calls","ar":"المكالمات"},{"en":"Doctors","ar":"الأطباء"}],"active":1},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Incoming call · from the AI assistant","ar":"مكالمة واردة · من مساعد الذكاء الاصطناعي"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"user","text":{"en":"Patient","ar":"المريضة"},"value":{"en":"Mrs. Samia","ar":"السيدة سامية"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"calendar-blank","text":{"en":"Wants","ar":"تريد"},"value":{"en":"Dr. Ali · next week","ar":"د. علي · الأسبوع القادم"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"warning","text":{"en":"Missing","ar":"ينقص"},"value":{"en":"The day","ar":"اليوم"},"badge":{"text":{"en":"Couldn't catch","ar":"لم يُفهم"},"tone":"warn"}},{"kind":"row","blocks":[{"kind":"button","icon":"phone","text":{"en":"Answer","ar":"ردّ"}},{"kind":"button","style":"outline","text":{"en":"Decline","ar":"رفض"}}],"gap":"s"}]}}],"answer":["summary"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P12-042","when":["ring","record"],"feedback":{"en":"With nothing, the patient repeats it all; with a recording, the receptionist must listen while the patient waits. A short summary shows what's known and what's missing.","ar":"دون أي معلومات، يكرّر المريض كل شيء؛ ومع التسجيل، يجب أن تستمع الموظّفة والمريض ينتظر. والملخّص القصير يُظهر المعروف والناقص."}}],"hints":[{"en":"What does the receptionist need in the first second?","ar":"ماذا تحتاج الموظّفة في الثانية الأولى؟"},{"en":"Which option shows what's missing?","ar":"أي خيار يُظهر ما ينقص؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Right. What's known, and what's left.","ar":"صحيح. المعروف، والمتبقّي."},"explain":{"en":"The receptionist asks one question, the day, and the booking is done.","ar":"تسأل الموظّفة سؤالًا واحدًا، عن اليوم، فيكتمل الحجز."},"speaker":"nour"},{"id":"S05","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P12-U05-01","part":"guided","rules":["R06"],"value":{"en":"Errors + Graceful Failure (People + AI): explain why a result couldn't be given, and offer other ways forward.","ar":"الأخطاء والفشل اللطيف (People + AI): اشرح لماذا لم تُقدَّم النتيجة، وقدّم طرقًا أخرى للمضيّ."},"ref":{"url":"https://pair.withgoogle.com/chapter/errors-failing/","quote":"Response: Explain why a certain result couldn’t be given and provide alternative paths forward."},"scenario":{"en":"Before passing the call, the assistant says one sentence to the patient.","ar":"قبل تحويل المكالمة، يقول المساعد جملة واحدة للمريض."},"prompt":{"en":"Tap each option to see it. What should it say?","ar":"اضغط على كل خيار لتراه. ماذا يقول المساعد للمريض قبل التحويل؟"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Booking line · live call","ar":"خط الحجز · مكالمة جارية"}},"blocks":[{"kind":"chat","from":"them","name":{"en":"Mrs. Samia","ar":"السيدة سامية"},"text":{"en":"Dr. Ali next week, the day after the market.","ar":"د. علي الأسبوع القادم، اليوم الذي بعد السوق."},"time":"10:02"},{"kind":"chat","from":"ai","text":{"en":"Which day works for you?","ar":"أي يوم يناسبك؟"},"time":"10:02"},{"kind":"chat","from":"them","name":{"en":"Mrs. Samia","ar":"السيدة سامية"},"text":{"en":"After the market day!","ar":"بعد يوم السوق!"},"time":"10:03"},{"kind":"chat","from":"ai","text":{"en":"…","ar":"…"},"time":"10:03"}]},"options":[{"id":"explain","text":{"en":"\"I couldn't catch the day. I'm putting you through to our receptionist; she can see what you told me.\"","ar":"«لم أفهم اليوم. سأحوّلك إلى موظّفة الاستقبال؛ وهي ترى ما قلته لي.»"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Booking line · live call","ar":"خط الحجز · مكالمة جارية"}},"blocks":[{"kind":"chat","from":"them","name":{"en":"Mrs. Samia","ar":"السيدة سامية"},"text":{"en":"Dr. Ali next week, the day after the market.","ar":"د. علي الأسبوع القادم، اليوم الذي بعد السوق."},"time":"10:02"},{"kind":"chat","from":"ai","text":{"en":"Which day works for you?","ar":"أي يوم يناسبك؟"},"time":"10:02"},{"kind":"chat","from":"them","name":{"en":"Mrs. Samia","ar":"السيدة سامية"},"text":{"en":"After the market day!","ar":"بعد يوم السوق!"},"time":"10:03"},{"kind":"chat","from":"ai","text":{"en":"I couldn't catch the day. I'm putting you through to our receptionist; she can see what you told me.","ar":"لم أفهم اليوم. سأحوّلك إلى موظّفة الاستقبال؛ وهي ترى ما قلته لي."},"time":"10:03"},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"📞 Putting you through to reception…","ar":"📞 جارٍ التحويل إلى الاستقبال…"},"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"hold","text":{"en":"\"Please hold.\"","ar":"«انتظر من فضلك.»"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Booking line · live call","ar":"خط الحجز · مكالمة جارية"}},"blocks":[{"kind":"chat","from":"them","name":{"en":"Mrs. Samia","ar":"السيدة سامية"},"text":{"en":"Dr. Ali next week, the day after the market.","ar":"د. علي الأسبوع القادم، اليوم الذي بعد السوق."},"time":"10:02"},{"kind":"chat","from":"ai","text":{"en":"Which day works for you?","ar":"أي يوم يناسبك؟"},"time":"10:02"},{"kind":"chat","from":"them","name":{"en":"Mrs. Samia","ar":"السيدة سامية"},"text":{"en":"After the market day!","ar":"بعد يوم السوق!"},"time":"10:03"},{"kind":"chat","from":"ai","text":{"en":"Please hold.","ar":"انتظر من فضلك."},"time":"10:03"},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"♪ Hold music","ar":"♪ موسيقى الانتظار"},"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"error","text":{"en":"\"An error has occurred.\"","ar":"«حدث خطأ.»"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Booking line · live call","ar":"خط الحجز · مكالمة جارية"}},"blocks":[{"kind":"chat","from":"them","name":{"en":"Mrs. Samia","ar":"السيدة سامية"},"text":{"en":"Dr. Ali next week, the day after the market.","ar":"د. علي الأسبوع القادم، اليوم الذي بعد السوق."},"time":"10:02"},{"kind":"chat","from":"ai","text":{"en":"Which day works for you?","ar":"أي يوم يناسبك؟"},"time":"10:02"},{"kind":"chat","from":"them","name":{"en":"Mrs. Samia","ar":"السيدة سامية"},"text":{"en":"After the market day!","ar":"بعد يوم السوق!"},"time":"10:03"},{"kind":"chat","from":"ai","text":{"en":"An error has occurred.","ar":"حدث خطأ."},"time":"10:03"}]}}],"answer":["explain"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P12-038","when":["hold","error"],"feedback":{"en":"Neither says what happened or what's next. Patients may think they'll start over, or hang up.","ar":"لا تقول أيّ من الرسالتين ماذا حدث أو ماذا بعد. فقد يظنّ المرضى أنهم سيبدؤون من جديد، أو يُغلقون الخط."}}],"hints":[{"en":"What is the patient worried about?","ar":"ما الذي يُقلق المريض؟"},{"en":"Which sentence answers that?","ar":"أي جملة تجيب عن ذلك؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Right. What failed, what's next, and that nothing is lost.","ar":"صحيح. ما الذي فشل، وماذا بعد، وأن شيئًا لم يضِع."},"explain":{"en":"One clear sentence keeps the patient on the line.","ar":"جملة واحدة واضحة تُبقي المريض على الخط."},"speaker":"nour"},{"id":"S06","type":"compare","skill":"SK-P12-U05-04","part":"contrast","confidence":true,"rules":["R11"],"value":{"en":"Contrast: switch off vs safe hand-over. Errors + Graceful Failure (People + AI): in some cases, suddenly going back to manual control could be risky or dangerous.","ar":"مقارنة: إيقاف مفاجئ مقابل تسليم آمن. الأخطاء والفشل اللطيف (People + AI): في بعض الحالات، قد تكون العودة المفاجئة إلى التحكّم اليدوي خطرة."},"ref":{"url":"https://pair.withgoogle.com/chapter/errors-failing/","quote":"In some cases, reverting to manual control could be risky or dangerous."},"scenario":{"en":"The clinic pharmacy uses an AI tool that warns when two medicines shouldn't be taken together. Sometimes it goes offline. Two designs:","ar":"صيدلية العيادة تستخدم أداة بالذكاء الاصطناعي تنبّه حين يجب ألّا يُؤخذ دواءان معًا. وأحيانًا تتوقّف عن العمل. وهذان تصميمان:"},"prompt":{"en":"Which design should we use?","ar":"أي تصميم يجب أن نستخدم؟"},"a":{"label":{"en":"A: \"Checker offline. Check these 2 medicines in the printed guide (page 14), or ask the doctor before handing them over.\"","ar":"A: «أداة الفحص متوقّفة. افحص هذين الدواءين في الدليل المطبوع (صفحة 14)، أو اسأل الطبيب قبل تسليمهما.»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Pharmacy · Order 3018","ar":"الصيدلية · طلب 3018"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"pill","text":{"en":"Warfarin 5 mg","ar":"وارفارين 5 مجم"},"sub":{"en":"30 tablets","ar":"30 قرصًا"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"pill","text":{"en":"Ibuprofen 400 mg","ar":"إيبوبروفين 400 مجم"},"sub":{"en":"20 tablets","ar":"20 قرصًا"}},{"kind":"banner","tone":"bad","icon":"warning","text":{"en":"Checker offline","ar":"أداة الفحص متوقّفة"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"Check these 2 medicines in the printed guide (page 14), or ask the doctor before handing them over.","ar":"افحص هذين الدواءين في الدليل المطبوع (صفحة 14)، أو اسأل الطبيب قبل تسليمهما."},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"button","style":"outline","icon":"phone","text":{"en":"Call the doctor","ar":"اتّصل بالطبيب"},"gap":"s"}]}},"b":{"label":{"en":"B: A small grey \"Offline\" label, and no warnings","ar":"B: علامة رمادية صغيرة «متوقّفة»، دون تنبيهات"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Pharmacy · Order 3018","ar":"الصيدلية · طلب 3018"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"pill","text":{"en":"Warfarin 5 mg","ar":"وارفارين 5 مجم"},"sub":{"en":"30 tablets","ar":"30 قرصًا"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"pill","text":{"en":"Ibuprofen 400 mg","ar":"إيبوبروفين 400 مجم"},"sub":{"en":"20 tablets","ar":"20 قرصًا"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"check-circle","text":{"en":"No warnings","ar":"لا توجد تنبيهات"},"badge":{"text":{"en":"Offline","ar":"متوقّفة"},"tone":"neutral"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Hand over","ar":"سلّم الدواء"},"gap":"s"}]}},"answer":"a","reason":{"prompt":{"en":"Why is A better?","ar":"لماذا A أفضل؟"},"options":[{"id":"safe","text":{"en":"The pharmacist knows the check didn't happen, and how to do it by hand","ar":"يعرف الصيدلي أن الفحص لم يحدث، وكيف يقوم به يدويًا"}},{"id":"big","text":{"en":"Bigger messages are always better","ar":"الرسائل الأكبر أفضل دائمًا"}},{"id":"blame","text":{"en":"It moves the blame to the pharmacist","ar":"ينقل المسؤولية إلى الصيدلي"}}],"answer":["safe"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P12-042","when":["big","blame"],"feedback":{"en":"It's not about size or blame. \"No warnings\" could look like \"safe\". The pharmacist needs to know to check, and how.","ar":"ليست المسألة مسألة حجم أو مسؤولية. «لا توجد تنبيهات» قد تُفهم على أنها «آمن». والصيدلي يحتاج أن يعرف أن عليه الفحص، وكيف."}}]},"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P12-042","when":["b"],"feedback":{"en":"B is quiet, and dangerous: \"No warnings\" looks like the medicines are safe together, when nothing was checked.","ar":"B هادئ، وخطِر: «لا توجد تنبيهات» تبدو كأن الدواءين آمنان معًا، بينما لم يُفحص شيء."}}],"hints":[{"en":"What might a busy pharmacist think when they see \"No warnings\"?","ar":"ماذا قد يظنّ صيدلي مشغول حين يرى «لا توجد تنبيهات»؟"},{"en":"Which design tells them what to do instead?","ar":"أي تصميم يقول له ماذا يفعل بدلًا من ذلك؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Right. When AI stops, hand over clearly and safely.","ar":"صحيح. حين يتوقّف الذكاء الاصطناعي، سلّم المهمة بوضوح وأمان."},"explain":{"en":"A silent failure in a safety tool can look like success. Make it loud, and give the manual way.","ar":"الفشل الصامت في أداة سلامة قد يبدو نجاحًا. اجعله واضحًا، وقدّم الطريقة اليدوية."},"speaker":"nour"},{"id":"S07","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P12-U05-03","part":"independent","speaker":"karim","rules":["R14"],"value":{"en":"New case. Errors + Graceful Failure (People + AI): when stakes are higher, check that the alternative you offer is actually safe.","ar":"حالة جديدة. الأخطاء والفشل اللطيف (People + AI): حين يكون الخطر أكبر، تأكّد أن البديل الذي تقدّمه آمن فعلًا."},"ref":{"url":"https://pair.withgoogle.com/chapter/errors-failing/","quote":"In the case of higher situational stakes, there should be an additional check to make sure the alternative is indeed a safe option."},"scenario":{"en":"I'm building a restaurant's ordering app. When a dish is sold out, it suggests the closest one. A customer with a nut allergy in her profile ordered chicken shawarma, now sold out. The closest dish has a peanut sauce.","ar":"أبني تطبيق طلبات لمطعم. وحين ينفد طبق، يقترح التطبيق أقرب طبق له. وعميلة لديها حساسية من المكسّرات في ملفّها طلبت شاورما دجاج، وقد نفدت. وأقرب طبق فيه صلصة فول سوداني."},"prompt":{"en":"Tap each option to see it. What should the app suggest?","ar":"اضغط على كل خيار لتراه. ماذا يقترح التطبيق لعميلة لديها حساسية من المكسّرات؟"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"app":{"name":{"en":"Bait El Shawarma","ar":"بيت الشاورما"},"color":"#B45309","icon":"bowl-food","domain":"bait-shawarma.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Your order","ar":"طلبك"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","art":"food-grill","text":{"en":"Chicken shawarma","ar":"شاورما دجاج"},"value":{"en":"110 EGP","ar":"110 جنيهًا"},"badge":{"text":{"en":"Sold out","ar":"نفدت"},"tone":"bad"}},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"⚠ In your profile: nut allergy","ar":"⚠ في ملفّك: حساسية من المكسّرات"},"gap":"s"}],"overlay":{"type":"sheet","title":{"en":"Chicken shawarma is sold out","ar":"نفدت شاورما الدجاج"},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"The suggestion goes here","ar":"هنا يظهر الاقتراح"}}]}},"options":[{"id":"closest","text":{"en":"The closest dish anyway; she can read the ingredients","ar":"أقرب طبق على أي حال؛ فهي تستطيع قراءة المكوّنات"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"name":{"en":"Bait El Shawarma","ar":"بيت الشاورما"},"color":"#B45309","icon":"bowl-food","domain":"bait-shawarma.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Your order","ar":"طلبك"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","art":"food-grill","text":{"en":"Chicken shawarma","ar":"شاورما دجاج"},"value":{"en":"110 EGP","ar":"110 جنيهًا"},"badge":{"text":{"en":"Sold out","ar":"نفدت"},"tone":"bad"}},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"⚠ In your profile: nut allergy","ar":"⚠ في ملفّك: حساسية من المكسّرات"},"gap":"s"}],"overlay":{"type":"sheet","title":{"en":"Chicken shawarma is sold out","ar":"نفدت شاورما الدجاج"},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Try instead:","ar":"جرّب بدلًا منها:"}},{"kind":"listitem","art":"food-grill","text":{"en":"Chicken with peanut sauce","ar":"دجاج بصلصة الفول السوداني"},"value":{"en":"120 EGP","ar":"120 جنيهًا"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Add to order","ar":"أضف إلى الطلب"},"gap":"s"}]}}},{"id":"safe","text":{"en":"The closest dish without nuts: \"Shawarma is sold out. Try chicken kebab (nut-free)?\"","ar":"أقرب طبق دون مكسّرات: «نفدت الشاورما. هل تجرّبين كباب الدجاج (خالٍ من المكسّرات)؟»"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"name":{"en":"Bait El Shawarma","ar":"بيت الشاورما"},"color":"#B45309","icon":"bowl-food","domain":"bait-shawarma.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Your order","ar":"طلبك"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","art":"food-grill","text":{"en":"Chicken shawarma","ar":"شاورما دجاج"},"value":{"en":"110 EGP","ar":"110 جنيهًا"},"badge":{"text":{"en":"Sold out","ar":"نفدت"},"tone":"bad"}},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"⚠ In your profile: nut allergy","ar":"⚠ في ملفّك: حساسية من المكسّرات"},"gap":"s"}],"overlay":{"type":"sheet","title":{"en":"Chicken shawarma is sold out","ar":"نفدت شاورما الدجاج"},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Try chicken kebab? It has no nuts.","ar":"هل تجرّبين كباب الدجاج؟ ليس فيه مكسّرات."}},{"kind":"listitem","art":"food-grill","text":{"en":"Chicken kebab","ar":"كباب دجاج"},"value":{"en":"115 EGP","ar":"115 جنيهًا"},"badge":{"text":{"en":"Nut-free","ar":"خالٍ من المكسّرات"},"tone":"good"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Add to order","ar":"أضف إلى الطلب"},"gap":"s"}]}}},{"id":"none","text":{"en":"Just \"Sold out\", with no suggestion","ar":"فقط «نفدت»، دون اقتراح"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"name":{"en":"Bait El Shawarma","ar":"بيت الشاورما"},"color":"#B45309","icon":"bowl-food","domain":"bait-shawarma.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Your order","ar":"طلبك"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","art":"food-grill","text":{"en":"Chicken shawarma","ar":"شاورما دجاج"},"value":{"en":"110 EGP","ar":"110 جنيهًا"},"badge":{"text":{"en":"Sold out","ar":"نفدت"},"tone":"bad"}},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"⚠ In your profile: nut allergy","ar":"⚠ في ملفّك: حساسية من المكسّرات"},"gap":"s"}],"overlay":{"type":"sheet","title":{"en":"Sold out","ar":"نفدت"},"blocks":[{"kind":"button","style":"outline","text":{"en":"OK","ar":"حسنًا"},"gap":"s"}]}}}],"answer":["safe"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P12-039","when":["closest","none"],"feedback":{"en":"Suggesting peanuts to an allergic customer is dangerous, and \"Sold out\" alone leaves her stuck. Offer a close dish that's safe for her.","ar":"اقتراح الفول السوداني لعميلة لديها حساسية أمر خطِر، و«نفدت» وحدها تتركها عالقة. قدّم طبقًا قريبًا وآمنًا لها."}}],"hints":[{"en":"What does the app know about her?","ar":"ماذا يعرف التطبيق عنها؟"},{"en":"Which option is both helpful and safe?","ar":"أي خيار مفيد وآمن معًا؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Close, and safe.","ar":"صحيح. قريب، وآمن."},"explain":{"en":"A good alternative fits what she asked for, and what she can't have.","ar":"البديل الجيد يناسب ما طلبته، وما لا تستطيع تناوله."}},{"id":"S08","type":"card","part":"recap","icons":["person","list","phone","warn","ok"],"title":{"en":"What you did","ar":"ماذا تعلّمت"},"body":{"en":"- **Stopped early:** after 2 fails, the call goes to a person.\n- **Passed it on:** the receptionist sees what's known and missing.\n- **Said what's next:** \"She can see what you told me.\"\n- **No silent failure:** the offline checker says how to check by hand.\n- **New case:** you suggested a dish that's close, and safe for an allergy.\n\nNext: the skill check for this unit.","ar":"- **توقّفت مبكرًا:** بعد فشلين، تُحوَّل المكالمة إلى شخص.\n- **نقلت المعلومات:** ترى الموظّفة المعروف والناقص.\n- **قلت ماذا بعد:** «وهي ترى ما قلته لي.»\n- **لا فشل صامت:** أداة الفحص المتوقّفة تقول كيف تفحص يدويًا.\n- **حالة جديدة:** اقترحت طبقًا قريبًا، وآمنًا لصاحبة الحساسية.\n\nالتالي: اختبار المهارة لهذه الوحدة."}}]}$uxg$::jsonb),
  ($uxg$P12-U05-L04$uxg$, $uxg$8e24ed0fc4c0aa74c3f11bc82bab36e572886c4c4c50953961972b7645ea6bd1$uxg$, $uxg${"id":"P12-U05-L04","mode":"check","minutes":6,"title":{"en":"Skill check: fail gracefully","ar":"اختبار المهارة: تعامَل مع الفشل بلطف"},"summary":{"en":"Review how a city transport app handles its AI mistakes, on your own.","ar":"راجِع بنفسك كيف يتعامل تطبيق مواصلات في المدينة مع أخطاء ذكائه الاصطناعي."},"speaker":"mona","steps":[{"id":"S01","type":"card","part":"hook","title":{"en":"Mona's review","ar":"مراجعة منى"},"body":{"en":"I lead design for a city transport app. AI plans your trip by bus and metro, and tracks it live. I'm reviewing what happens when it gets things wrong.\n\nYour job: check five parts.\n\nThis is a skill check: there are no hints, and you'll see your result at the end.","ar":"أقود التصميم في تطبيق مواصلات للمدينة. يخطّط الذكاء الاصطناعي رحلتك بالحافلة والمترو، ويتابعها مباشرة. وأراجع ما يحدث حين يخطئ.\n\nمهمّتك: افحص خمسة أجزاء.\n\nهذا اختبار مهارة: لا توجد تلميحات، وسترى نتيجتك في النهاية."},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rehla","name":{"en":"Rehla","ar":"رحلة"},"color":"#7048E8","icon":"bus","domain":"rehla.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Home → Opera","ar":"المنزل ← الأوبرا"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"map-route"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"bus","text":{"en":"Bus 12 · Metro line 2","ar":"حافلة 12 · مترو الخط 2"},"sub":{"en":"Leave 8:10 · arrive 8:45","ar":"الانطلاق 8:10 · الوصول 8:45"},"value":{"en":"35 min","ar":"35 دقيقة"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","icon":"navigation-arrow","text":{"en":"Start trip","ar":"ابدأ الرحلة"},"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"S02","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P12-U05-01","part":"check","rules":["R19"],"value":{"en":"Skill check. Errors + Graceful Failure (People + AI): don't miss a chance to explain your AI system.","ar":"اختبار مهارة. الأخطاء والفشل اللطيف (People + AI): لا تُضيّع فرصة لشرح نظام الذكاء الاصطناعي."},"ref":{"url":"https://pair.withgoogle.com/chapter/errors-failing/","quote":"Don’t miss an opportunity to explain your AI system."},"scenario":{"en":"The app plans trips inside the city only. Someone searches for a trip to another city.","ar":"التطبيق يخطّط الرحلات داخل المدينة فقط. ويبحث شخص عن رحلة إلى مدينة أخرى."},"prompt":{"en":"Tap each option to see it. What should it show?","ar":"اضغط على كل خيار لتراه. ماذا يجب أن يعرض؟"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"app":{"id":"rehla","name":{"en":"Rehla","ar":"رحلة"},"color":"#7048E8","icon":"bus","domain":"rehla.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Plan a trip","ar":"خطّط رحلة"},"back":true},"tabbar":{"active":0,"items":[{"icon":"map-trifold","text":{"en":"Trips","ar":"الرحلات"}},{"icon":"ticket","text":{"en":"Tickets","ar":"التذاكر"}},{"icon":"user","text":{"en":"Me","ar":"حسابي"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"From","ar":"من"},"text":{"en":"Home","ar":"المنزل"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"To","ar":"إلى"},"text":{"en":"Alexandria","ar":"الإسكندرية"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"The message goes here","ar":"هنا تظهر الرسالة"},"gap":"m"}]},"options":[{"id":"none","text":{"en":"\"No route found.\"","ar":"«لم يُعثر على طريق.»"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"rehla","name":{"en":"Rehla","ar":"رحلة"},"color":"#7048E8","icon":"bus","domain":"rehla.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Plan a trip","ar":"خطّط رحلة"},"back":true},"tabbar":{"active":0,"items":[{"icon":"map-trifold","text":{"en":"Trips","ar":"الرحلات"}},{"icon":"ticket","text":{"en":"Tickets","ar":"التذاكر"}},{"icon":"user","text":{"en":"Me","ar":"حسابي"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"From","ar":"من"},"text":{"en":"Home","ar":"المنزل"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"To","ar":"إلى"},"text":{"en":"Alexandria","ar":"الإسكندرية"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"icon","icon":"map-trifold","gap":"m"},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"No route found.","ar":"لم يُعثر على طريق."},"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"retry","text":{"en":"\"Something went wrong. Try again.\"","ar"