ub":{"en":"Sugar-free","ar":"خالٍ من السكر"},"value":{"en":"EGP 48","ar":"48 جنيه"}},{"kind":"listitem","art":"medicine","text":{"en":"Syrup C · 150 ml","ar":"شراب C · 150 مل"},"sub":{"en":"Delivered tomorrow","ar":"يصل غدًا"},"value":{"en":"EGP 90","ar":"90 جنيه"}}],"overlay":{"type":"sheet","close":true,"title":{"en":"Sort by","ar":"رتّب حسب"},"blocks":[{"kind":"radio","selected":true,"text":{"en":"Best match","ar":"الأنسب"}},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Price: low to high","ar":"السعر: من الأقل للأعلى"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Price: high to low","ar":"السعر: من الأعلى للأقل"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Sugar-free first","ar":"الخالي من السكر أولًا"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Available today first","ar":"المتوفّر اليوم أولًا"},"gap":"xs"}]}}},{"id":"three","text":{"en":"Three smaller sheets, one per group of options","ar":"ثلاثة Sheets أصغر، واحد لكل مجموعة خيارات"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dawaa","name":{"en":"Dawaa Pharmacy","ar":"صيدلية دواء"},"color":"#059669","icon":"pill","domain":"dawaa.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Cough syrup","ar":"شراب كحة"},"back":true,"actions":[{"icon":"shopping-cart","aria":{"en":"Cart","ar":"السلة"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"row","blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"24 results","ar":"24 نتيجة"}},{"kind":"chip","icon":"sort-ascending","text":{"en":"Sort","ar":"ترتيب"}}]},{"kind":"listitem","art":"medicine","text":{"en":"Syrup A · 120 ml","ar":"شراب A · 120 مل"},"sub":{"en":"In stock","ar":"متوفّر"},"value":{"en":"EGP 65","ar":"65 جنيه"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"listitem","art":"medicine","text":{"en":"Syrup B · 100 ml","ar":"شراب B · 100 مل"},"sub":{"en":"Sugar-free","ar":"خالٍ من السكر"},"value":{"en":"EGP 48","ar":"48 جنيه"}},{"kind":"listitem","art":"medicine","text":{"en":"Syrup C · 150 ml","ar":"شراب C · 150 مل"},"sub":{"en":"Delivered tomorrow","ar":"يصل غدًا"},"value":{"en":"EGP 90","ar":"90 جنيه"}}],"overlay":{"type":"sheet","title":{"en":"Availability","ar":"التوفّر"},"blocks":[{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Available today first","ar":"المتوفّر اليوم أولًا"}},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Opened on top of the Price sheet, on top of the Sort sheet","ar":"فُتح فوق Sheet السعر، فوق Sheet الترتيب"},"note":{"en":"3rd sheet","ar":"Sheet ثالث"},"gap":"s"}]}}}],"answer":["one"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P14-006","when":["two","three"],"feedback":{"en":"Each sheet on top hides the one below, and one swipe can close them all. Yara loses track of where she is.","ar":"كل Sheet فوق غيره يُخفي ما تحته، وسحبة واحدة قد تغلقها كلها. فلا تعرف يارا أين هي."}}],"correct":{"en":"One short sheet holds all the sort options.","ar":"Sheet واحد قصير يجمع كل خيارات الترتيب."},"explain":{"en":"Five options fit easily in one sheet. With nothing stacked, Yara sees every choice at once, and closing the sheet can't throw away a choice she made in another one.","ar":"خمسة خيارات تتّسع بسهولة في Sheet واحد. ومن دون تكديس، ترى يارا كل الخيارات مرة واحدة، وإغلاق الـ Sheet لا يُضيّع اختيارًا اختارته في Sheet آخر."}},{"id":"S10","type":"video","part":"concept","title":{"en":"Two small helpers","ar":"أداتان مساعدتان صغيرتان"},"video":"602248bf-3e3f-4581-9e2f-b0cc9dd96605","duration":201,"transcript":[{"t":2.5,"en":"The next component under mode handlers and system messages is the bottom sheet. It exists on mobile only, not on desktop, and usually not on tablets either.","ar":"تاني Component معانا تحت عنوان الـ Mode handlers والـ System messages هو الـ Bottom sheet. الـ Bottom sheet موجودة في الموبايل بس، ومش موجودة على الـ Desktop، وعادةً مش موجودة على الـ Tablet."},{"t":13.42,"en":"It looks like this: a window too, but stuck to the bottom of the screen, anchored there. It slides up from the bottom and slides back down.","ar":"وهي بالشكل اللي قدامنا: Window برضه بتظهر، لكنها لازقة في الشاشة من تحت، Anchored في الجزء اللي تحت، بتطلع من تحت وبتنزل تاني لتحت."},{"t":23.48,"en":"Sometimes it shows details about what I'm looking at, or gives me other actions I can take. It's a common component; most of us have surely used it.","ar":"بتظهر لي أحيانًا Details عن الحاجة اللي بشوفها دلوقتي، أو تدّيني Actions تانية ممكن أعملها. وهي Component منتشرة، وأغلبنا أكيد اتعامل معاها قبل كده."},{"t":33.48,"en":"Its types, as you'd expect: the modal bottom sheet isolates the background, so as a user I can't interact with the content behind it; I use only the sheet, or close it and go back.","ar":"وأنواعها زي ما هو متوقع: الـ Modal bottom sheet اللي بتعزل الخلفية، وبتخلّيني كيوزر مش قادر أتفاعل مع المحتوى اللي ورا، أتفاعل بس معاها، أو أنزّلها وأرجع للمحتوى."},{"t":46.18,"en":"As usual, a scrim can go with it: the slightly transparent layer that separates the content in the background.","ar":"وكالعادة ممكن يُستخدم معاها الـ Scrim، الطبقة اللي ليها شفافية خفيفة وبتعزل المحتوى اللي في الخلفية."},{"t":51.78,"en":"The second type, as you'd expect, is the non-modal bottom sheet, like in map apps: I can still use the map itself, and there's a bottom sheet with actions and other data,","ar":"والنوع التاني زي ما هو متوقع الـ Non-modal bottom sheet، زي اللي في تطبيقات الخرايط: عندي الخريطة نفسها أقدر أتفاعل معاها، وعندي Bottom sheet فيها Actions وداتا تانية،"},{"t":64.56,"en":"about something I selected in the product. So I can use the bottom sheet and the rest of the page content; I'm not cut off from it.","ar":"عن حاجة معينة حددتها في المنتج. فأقدر أتفاعل مع الـ Bottom sheet نفسها ومع بقية المحتوى اللي في الصفحة، ماتعزلتش عنه."},{"t":77.2,"en":"Some bottom sheets are expandable: they start as a strip at the bottom showing the title of what I'm listening to, and tapping it expands it into a full bottom sheet with more actions","ar":"وفيه Bottom sheets تكون Expandable، بتتّسع: تظهر على شكل شريط تحت فيه عنوان الحاجة اللي بسمعها دلوقتي، ولو ضغطت عليه يعمل Expand لـ Bottom sheet كاملة فيها Actions أكتر،"},{"t":91.18,"en":"and more details about the same thing. It can even expand to full screen as a whole page, and I can go back from it to the previous state.","ar":"وتفاصيل أكتر عن نفس الحاجة. وممكن كمان تتّسع لحد ما تاخد الـ Full screen وتبقى صفحة كاملة، وأرجع منها للحالة اللي قبلها."},{"t":100.5,"en":"Now some guidelines for bottom sheets. In the example in front of us, if we look for the problem, we'll notice the bottom sheet is rather large,","ar":"طب لو جينا نشوف بعض الـ Guidelines عن الـ Bottom sheets: في المثال اللي قدامنا، لو حاولنا نلاحظ إيه المشكلة، هنلاحظ إن الـ Bottom sheet كبيرة إلى حد ما،"},{"t":110.64,"en":"reaching almost to the top of the phone. So if I want to close it and pull it down, I may pull down the phone's notification drawer or control panel instead,","ar":"تقريبًا لحد آخر الموبايل. فلو عايز أقفلها وحاولت أشدّها لتحت، ممكن أشدّ معايا الـ Notification drawer أو الـ Control panel بتاعة الموبايل نفسه،"},{"t":121.38,"en":"which comes down like this, and the bottom sheet stays open. So I get a bit confused: I wanted to close it, and the notification bar came down.","ar":"تنزل لي بالشكل ده، وماقفلتش الـ Bottom sheet. فأتشتّت شوية: أنا عايز أقفلها، فنزل الـ Notification bar."},{"t":130.66,"en":"Here I need another way to close it besides dragging the handle down. So I can add a close button with an X that lets me close it easily without dragging,","ar":"في الحالة دي محتاج Option تاني أقفل بيه الـ Bottom sheet غير إني أشدّها لتحت من الـ Handle. فهنا ممكن أضيف لها Close button، فيه X، يساعدني أقفلها بسهولة من غير السحب،"},{"t":144.1,"en":"especially when the bottom sheet is large, like this example.","ar":"بالذات لو كانت الـ Bottom sheet كبيرة زي المثال اللي قدامنا."},{"t":147.32,"en":"Another common mistake: using a bottom sheet for a whole flow, like pages one after another or a full process. It isn't made for that; the user can tap outside at any moment and close it by mistake,","ar":"ومن الأخطاء الشائعة كمان: استخدام الـ Bottom sheet في Flow كامل، كأني بعمل صفحات ورا بعض أو ماشي في Process كاملة. الـ Bottom sheet مش معمولة لكده؛ اليوزر ممكن يضغط برّه في أي وقت فيقفلها بالغلط،"},{"t":159.06,"en":"or tap the close button and close it. Moving between several steps in it isn't easy, and all the steps can be lost by one mistake. It isn't designed for that.","ar":"أو يضغط على الـ Close button فيقفلها. والتنقّل فيها بين أكتر من خطوة مش سهل، والخطوات كلها ممكن تضيع بغلطة. فهي مش مصمّمة للاستخدام ده."},{"t":171.16,"en":"A bottom sheet is usually designed for short interactions: simple things, like viewing details, taking an action, or writing a post.","ar":"الـ Bottom sheet عادةً مصمّمة للـ Short interactions: حاجات بسيطة، زي إني أشوف Details، أو أعمل Action معين، أو أكتب Post."},{"t":179.86,"en":"But it isn't designed for going through a flow inside it, like viewing a product's details and then checking out. It doesn't fit that,","ar":"لكن مش مصمّمة إني أمشي فيها جوّه Flow: أشوف تفاصيل Product وأعمل Checkout مثلًا. مش مناسب أستخدمها في ده،"},{"t":189.38,"en":"nor, say, a calendar where I pick a date and a time and go on through a process. That isn't a good use of bottom sheets.","ar":"ولا مثلًا Calendar أحدّد فيها تاريخ ووقت وأكمّل Process. ده مش استخدام مناسب للـ Bottom sheets."}]},{"id":"S03","type":"card","part":"concept","icons":["layers","ok","cut","list"],"title":{"en":"Video summary","ar":"ملخص الفيديو"},"body":{"en":"A **bottom sheet** is a panel anchored to the bottom of a phone screen. It slides up to show details or more actions, and slides back down.\n\n- **Three types:** a *modal* sheet blocks the content behind it, often with a dimmed layer; a *non-modal* sheet lets people keep using the screen, like a map; an *expandable* sheet starts as a small strip and opens to a bigger sheet or a full screen.\n- **Easy to close:** a tall sheet needs a clear Close button (✕), because dragging it down near the top can pull down the phone's notifications instead. The phone's Back button closes it too.\n- **Short interactions only:** see details, take one action, write a post. A flow of several steps, like product details then checkout, belongs on pages: one tap outside closes the sheet and loses every step. And never stack a sheet on another sheet.\n- **Tooltips are extra:** a **tooltip** is a short note that appears when people point at something. What people need to finish the task stays on the screen; a tooltip adds a short tip, and needs another way to open on a phone.","ar":"الـ **Bottom sheet** لوحة مثبّتة في أسفل شاشة الهاتف. تظهر من الأسفل لتعرض تفاصيل أو إجراءات أخرى، ثم تنزل مرة أخرى.\n\n- **ثلاثة أنواع:** الـ *Modal* sheet يحجب المحتوى خلفه، وغالبًا معه طبقة معتمة؛ والـ *Non-modal* sheet يترك الناس يستخدمون الشاشة، مثل الخريطة؛ والـ *Expandable* sheet يبدأ شريطًا صغيرًا ثم يتّسع إلى Sheet أكبر أو شاشة كاملة.\n- **سهل الإغلاق:** الـ Sheet الطويل يحتاج زر إغلاق واضحًا (✕)، لأن سحبه لأسفل قرب أعلى الشاشة قد يُنزل إشعارات الهاتف بدلًا منه. وزر الرجوع في الهاتف يغلقه أيضًا.\n- **للتفاعلات القصيرة فقط:** رؤية تفاصيل، أو إجراء واحد، أو كتابة منشور. أما الخطوات الكثيرة، مثل تفاصيل منتج ثم إتمام الشراء، فمكانه الصفحات: ضغطة واحدة خارج الـ Sheet تغلقه وتُضيّع كل الخطوات. ولا تفتح Sheet فوق Sheet آخر.\n- **الـ Tooltip إضافة:** الـ **Tooltip** ملاحظة قصيرة تظهر حين يضع الناس المؤشر على شيء. ما يحتاجه الناس لإنهاء المهمة يبقى على الشاشة؛ والـ Tooltip يضيف نصيحة قصيرة، ويحتاج طريقة أخرى ليُفتح على الهاتف."}},{"id":"S04","type":"tune","part":"guided","skill":"SK-P14-U01-03","rules":["R06","R15"],"confidence":true,"value":{"en":"Bottom sheets (NN/g): even though most sheets close with a swipe on the grab handle, provide a clear Close button at the top and support Back. A swipe can open the notification drawer, and screen-reader and keyboard users can't swipe.","ar":"الـ Bottom sheets (NN/g): حتى لو كانت أغلب الـ Sheets تُغلق بالسحب من مقبض الأعلى، ضع زر إغلاق واضحًا في الأعلى، واجعل زر الرجوع يغلقه. فالسحب قد يفتح لوحة الإشعارات، ومن يستخدمون قارئ الشاشة أو لوحة المفاتيح لا يستطيعون السحب."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/bottom-sheet/","quote":"We recommend providing a clear Close button (usually styled as an X or the word Close) at the top of bottom sheets"},"scenario":{"en":"The new Sort sheet I built can only be closed by swiping down on the small bar at its top. When Yara presses her phone's Back button, the app leaves the search page.","ar":"الـ Sheet الجديد الذي بنيته للترتيب لا يُغلق إلا بالسحب للأسفل من الشريط الصغير في أعلاه. وحين تضغط يارا زر الرجوع في هاتفها، يخرج التطبيق من صفحة البحث."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each version. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل نسخة. أيّها يجب أن تُطلق؟"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"app":{"id":"dawaa","name":{"en":"Dawaa Pharmacy","ar":"صيدلية دواء"},"color":"#059669","icon":"pill","domain":"dawaa.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Cough syrup","ar":"شراب كحة"},"back":true,"actions":[{"icon":"shopping-cart","aria":{"en":"Cart","ar":"السلة"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"row","blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"24 results","ar":"24 نتيجة"}},{"kind":"chip","icon":"sort-ascending","text":{"en":"Sort","ar":"ترتيب"}}]},{"kind":"listitem","art":"medicine","text":{"en":"Syrup A · 120 ml","ar":"شراب A · 120 مل"},"sub":{"en":"In stock","ar":"متوفّر"},"value":{"en":"EGP 65","ar":"65 جنيه"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"listitem","art":"medicine","text":{"en":"Syrup B · 100 ml","ar":"شراب B · 100 مل"},"sub":{"en":"Sugar-free","ar":"خالٍ من السكر"},"value":{"en":"EGP 48","ar":"48 جنيه"}},{"kind":"listitem","art":"medicine","text":{"en":"Syrup C · 150 ml","ar":"شراب C · 150 مل"},"sub":{"en":"Delivered tomorrow","ar":"يصل غدًا"},"value":{"en":"EGP 90","ar":"90 جنيه"}}],"overlay":{"type":"sheet","title":{"en":"Sort by","ar":"رتّب حسب"},"blocks":[{"kind":"radio","selected":true,"text":{"en":"Best match","ar":"الأنسب"}},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Price: low to high","ar":"السعر: من الأقل للأعلى"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Available today first","ar":"المتوفّر اليوم أولًا"},"gap":"xs"}]}},"options":[{"id":"text","text":{"en":"Add the line \"Swipe down to close\"","ar":"أضف سطر «اسحب للأسفل للإغلاق»"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"dawaa","name":{"en":"Dawaa Pharmacy","ar":"صيدلية دواء"},"color":"#059669","icon":"pill","domain":"dawaa.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Cough syrup","ar":"شراب كحة"},"back":true,"actions":[{"icon":"shopping-cart","aria":{"en":"Cart","ar":"السلة"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"row","blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"24 results","ar":"24 نتيجة"}},{"kind":"chip","icon":"sort-ascending","text":{"en":"Sort","ar":"ترتيب"}}]},{"kind":"listitem","art":"medicine","text":{"en":"Syrup A · 120 ml","ar":"شراب A · 120 مل"},"sub":{"en":"In stock","ar":"متوفّر"},"value":{"en":"EGP 65","ar":"65 جنيه"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"listitem","art":"medicine","text":{"en":"Syrup B · 100 ml","ar":"شراب B · 100 مل"},"sub":{"en":"Sugar-free","ar":"خالٍ من السكر"},"value":{"en":"EGP 48","ar":"48 جنيه"}},{"kind":"listitem","art":"medicine","text":{"en":"Syrup C · 150 ml","ar":"شراب C · 150 مل"},"sub":{"en":"Delivered tomorrow","ar":"يصل غدًا"},"value":{"en":"EGP 90","ar":"90 جنيه"}}],"overlay":{"type":"sheet","title":{"en":"Sort by","ar":"رتّب حسب"},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","icon":"arrow-down","text":{"en":"Swipe down to close","ar":"اسحب للأسفل للإغلاق"}},{"kind":"radio","selected":true,"text":{"en":"Best match","ar":"الأنسب"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Price: low to high","ar":"السعر: من الأقل للأعلى"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Available today first","ar":"المتوفّر اليوم أولًا"},"gap":"xs"}]}}},{"id":"close","text":{"en":"Add an ✕ Close button, and make Back close the sheet","ar":"أضف زر إغلاق ✕، واجعل زر الرجوع يغلق الـ Sheet"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"dawaa","name":{"en":"Dawaa Pharmacy","ar":"صيدلية دواء"},"color":"#059669","icon":"pill","domain":"dawaa.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Cough syrup","ar":"شراب كحة"},"back":true,"actions":[{"icon":"shopping-cart","aria":{"en":"Cart","ar":"السلة"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"row","blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"24 results","ar":"24 نتيجة"}},{"kind":"chip","icon":"sort-ascending","text":{"en":"Sort","ar":"ترتيب"}}]},{"kind":"listitem","art":"medicine","text":{"en":"Syrup A · 120 ml","ar":"شراب A · 120 مل"},"sub":{"en":"In stock","ar":"متوفّر"},"value":{"en":"EGP 65","ar":"65 جنيه"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"listitem","art":"medicine","text":{"en":"Syrup B · 100 ml","ar":"شراب B · 100 مل"},"sub":{"en":"Sugar-free","ar":"خالٍ من السكر"},"value":{"en":"EGP 48","ar":"48 جنيه"}},{"kind":"listitem","art":"medicine","text":{"en":"Syrup C · 150 ml","ar":"شراب C · 150 مل"},"sub":{"en":"Delivered tomorrow","ar":"يصل غدًا"},"value":{"en":"EGP 90","ar":"90 جنيه"}}],"overlay":{"type":"sheet","close":true,"title":{"en":"Sort by","ar":"رتّب حسب"},"blocks":[{"kind":"radio","selected":true,"text":{"en":"Best match","ar":"الأنسب"}},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Price: low to high","ar":"السعر: من الأقل للأعلى"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Available today first","ar":"المتوفّر اليوم أولًا"},"gap":"xs"}]}}},{"id":"bigger","text":{"en":"Make the bar at the top bigger, so it's easier to swipe","ar":"كبّر الشريط في الأعلى، ليصبح السحب أسهل"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"dawaa","name":{"en":"Dawaa Pharmacy","ar":"صيدلية دواء"},"color":"#059669","icon":"pill","domain":"dawaa.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Cough syrup","ar":"شراب كحة"},"back":true,"actions":[{"icon":"shopping-cart","aria":{"en":"Cart","ar":"السلة"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"row","blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"24 results","ar":"24 نتيجة"}},{"kind":"chip","icon":"sort-ascending","text":{"en":"Sort","ar":"ترتيب"}}]},{"kind":"listitem","art":"medicine","text":{"en":"Syrup A · 120 ml","ar":"شراب A · 120 مل"},"sub":{"en":"In stock","ar":"متوفّر"},"value":{"en":"EGP 65","ar":"65 جنيه"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"listitem","art":"medicine","text":{"en":"Syrup B · 100 ml","ar":"شراب B · 100 مل"},"sub":{"en":"Sugar-free","ar":"خالٍ من السكر"},"value":{"en":"EGP 48","ar":"48 جنيه"}},{"kind":"listitem","art":"medicine","text":{"en":"Syrup C · 150 ml","ar":"شراب C · 150 مل"},"sub":{"en":"Delivered tomorrow","ar":"يصل غدًا"},"value":{"en":"EGP 90","ar":"90 جنيه"}}],"overlay":{"type":"sheet","handle":false,"title":{"en":"Sort by","ar":"رتّب حسب"},"blocks":[{"kind":"divider","size":"l","note":{"en":"A bigger handle","ar":"مقبض أكبر"}},{"kind":"radio","selected":true,"text":{"en":"Best match","ar":"الأنسب"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Price: low to high","ar":"السعر: من الأقل للأعلى"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Available today first","ar":"المتوفّر اليوم أولًا"},"gap":"xs"}]}}}],"answer":["close"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P14-007","when":["text","bigger"],"feedback":{"en":"Closing still depends on a swipe, which can pull down the phone's notifications instead. People using a screen reader or a keyboard can't swipe at all, and Back still leaves the page.","ar":"ما زال الإغلاق يعتمد على السحب، وقد يُنزل لوحة إشعارات الهاتف بدلًا منه. ومن يستخدمون قارئ الشاشة أو لوحة المفاتيح لا يستطيعون السحب أصلًا، وزر الرجوع ما زال يخرج من الصفحة."}}],"hints":[{"en":"How would someone close the sheet if they can't swipe?","ar":"كيف يغلق شخص الـ Sheet إن كان لا يستطيع السحب؟"}],"correct":{"en":"A visible Close, and Back closes the sheet.","ar":"زر إغلاق ظاهر، وزر الرجوع يغلق الـ Sheet."},"explain":{"en":"An ✕ button works for everyone, including screen-reader and keyboard users. Making Back close the sheet matches what Yara expects, instead of throwing her out of her search.","ar":"زر ✕ يستطيع الجميع استخدامه، بمن فيهم مستخدمو قارئ الشاشة ولوحة المفاتيح. وجعل زر الرجوع يغلق الـ Sheet يطابق ما تتوقّعه يارا، بدل أن يُخرجها من بحثها."},"speaker":"karim"},{"id":"S05","type":"tune","part":"guided","skill":"SK-P14-U01-03","rules":["R06","R15"],"value":{"en":"Bottom sheets (NN/g): don't use a sheet to replace a typical page-to-page flow. Expanding it to full screen makes it look like a page that behaves differently, which is its own problem.","ar":"الـ Bottom sheets (NN/g): لا تستخدم الـ Sheet بدل مسار عادي من صفحة إلى صفحة. وتكبيره إلى ملء الشاشة يجعله يشبه صفحة تتصرّف بطريقة مختلفة، وهذه مشكلة أخرى."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/bottom-sheet/","quote":"We strongly recommend not using a bottom sheet to replace typical page-to-page user flows."},"scenario":{"en":"Yara found her syrup. Checkout has three steps: delivery address, delivery time, and payment. I put all three in one bottom sheet that scrolls.","ar":"وجدت يارا الشراب. وإتمام الطلب (Checkout) ثلاث خطوات: عنوان التوصيل، ووقت التوصيل، والدفع. ووضعتُ الخطوات الثلاث في Bottom sheet واحد يتمرّر."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each version of checkout. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل نسخة من إتمام الطلب. أيّ نسخة تحفظ ما كتبته يارا وتُظهر لها أين وصلت؟"},"start":"sheet","options":[{"id":"sheet","text":{"en":"Keep all three steps in the scrolling sheet","ar":"أبقِ الخطوات الثلاث في الـ Sheet المتمرّر"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dawaa","name":{"en":"Dawaa Pharmacy","ar":"صيدلية دواء"},"color":"#059669","icon":"pill","domain":"dawaa.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Cart","ar":"السلة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","art":"medicine","text":{"en":"Syrup B · 100 ml","ar":"شراب B · 100 مل"},"sub":{"en":"× 1","ar":"× 1"},"value":{"en":"EGP 48","ar":"48 جنيه"}},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Checkout · EGP 63","ar":"إتمام الطلب · 63 جنيه"},"gap":"l"}],"overlay":{"type":"sheet","close":true,"title":{"en":"Checkout","ar":"إتمام الطلب"},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"1. Delivery address","ar":"1. عنوان التوصيل"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Street and building","ar":"الشارع والعمارة"},"text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"2. Delivery time","ar":"2. وقت التوصيل"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Scroll for step 3: payment…","ar":"مرّر لترى الخطوة 3: الدفع…"},"gap":"s"}]}}},{"id":"full","text":{"en":"Keep the sheet, but open it to full screen","ar":"أبقِ الـ Sheet، لكن افتحه بملء الشاشة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dawaa","name":{"en":"Dawaa Pharmacy","ar":"صيدلية دواء"},"color":"#059669","icon":"pill","domain":"dawaa.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Cart","ar":"السلة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","art":"medicine","text":{"en":"Syrup B · 100 ml","ar":"شراب B · 100 مل"},"sub":{"en":"× 1","ar":"× 1"},"value":{"en":"EGP 48","ar":"48 جنيه"}},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Checkout · EGP 63","ar":"إتمام الطلب · 63 جنيه"},"gap":"l"}],"overlay":{"type":"full","close":true,"title":{"en":"Checkout","ar":"إتمام الطلب"},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"1. Delivery address","ar":"1. عنوان التوصيل"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Street and building","ar":"الشارع والعمارة"},"text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"2. Delivery time","ar":"2. وقت التوصيل"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Scroll for step 3: payment…","ar":"مرّر لترى الخطوة 3: الدفع…"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Back closes this and empties it","ar":"زر الرجوع يغلقه ويُفرغه"},"note":{"en":"On Back","ar":"عند الرجوع"},"gap":"l"}]}}},{"id":"pages","text":{"en":"Make checkout a flow of normal pages, one step each","ar":"اجعل إتمام الطلب صفحات عادية، خطوة في كل صفحة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dawaa","name":{"en":"Dawaa Pharmacy","ar":"صيدلية دواء"},"color":"#059669","icon":"pill","domain":"dawaa.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Delivery address","ar":"عنوان التوصيل"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"progress","value":33,"label":{"en":"Step 1 of 3","ar":"الخطوة 1 من 3"}},{"kind":"field","icon":"map-pin","label":{"en":"Street and building","ar":"الشارع والعمارة"},"text":"","gap":"m"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Floor and flat","ar":"الدور والشقة"},"text":"","gap":"s"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Next: delivery time","ar":"التالي: وقت التوصيل"}}]}}],"answer":["pages"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P14-008","when":["sheet","full"],"feedback":{"en":"Checkout is a flow of several steps, not a quick task. In a sheet, one swipe or Back can close it and lose what Yara typed. Full screen makes it look like a page that doesn't behave like one.","ar":"إتمام الطلب عدة خطوات، لا مهمة سريعة. وفي Sheet، قد تغلقه سحبة واحدة أو زر الرجوع فيضيع ما كتبته يارا. وملء الشاشة يجعله يبدو صفحة، لكنه لا يتصرّف مثلها."}}],"correct":{"en":"A flow of steps belongs on pages.","ar":"الخطوات المتتابعة مكانها الصفحات."},"explain":{"en":"Pages show where Yara is (step 1 of 3), keep what she typed when she goes back, and behave the way every other screen does. A sheet is for a quick choice, like Sort.","ar":"الصفحات تُظهر أين وصلت يارا (الخطوة 1 من 3)، وتحفظ ما كتبته حين ترجع، وتتصرّف مثل أي شاشة أخرى. أما الـ Sheet فلاختيار سريع، مثل الترتيب."},"speaker":"karim"},{"id":"S06","type":"tune","part":"guided","skill":"SK-P14-U01-04","rules":["R06","R15"],"value":{"en":"Tooltips (NN/g): users shouldn't need to find a tooltip to complete their task. A rule that decides whether the upload is accepted is needed information, so it goes on the screen.","ar":"الـ Tooltips (NN/g): لا يجب أن يحتاج الناس إلى البحث عن Tooltip لإكمال مهمتهم. والشرط الذي يحدّد هل تُقبل الصورة معلومة ضرورية، فمكانها الشاشة."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/tooltip-guidelines/","quote":"Users shouldn't need to find a tooltip in order to complete their task."},"scenario":{"en":"Yara must upload a photo of her prescription. The pharmacy rejects any photo that doesn't show the doctor's stamp. Right now, that rule only appears if she taps the small ⓘ.","ar":"يجب أن ترفع يارا صورة الوصفة الطبية (الروشتة). والصيدلية ترفض أي صورة لا يظهر فيها ختم الطبيب. والآن، لا يظهر هذا الشرط إلا إذا ضغطت على ⓘ الصغيرة."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each version. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل نسخة. أيّها يجب أن تُطلق؟"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"app":{"id":"dawaa","name":{"en":"Dawaa Pharmacy","ar":"صيدلية دواء"},"color":"#059669","icon":"pill","domain":"dawaa.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Upload prescription","ar":"ارفع الروشتة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","art":"medicine","text":{"en":"Amoxil 500 mg","ar":"أموكسيل 500 مجم"},"sub":{"en":"Needs a prescription","ar":"يحتاج روشتة"}},{"kind":"row","gap":"m","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Prescription photo","ar":"صورة الروشتة"}},{"kind":"iconbtn","icon":"info","aria":{"en":"More info","ar":"معلومات أكثر"}}]},{"kind":"image","art":"document","size":"m","gap":"s"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","icon":"camera","text":{"en":"Take a photo","ar":"التقط صورة"}}]},"options":[{"id":"bold","text":{"en":"Keep the tooltip, but make the ⓘ bigger and colored","ar":"أبقِ الـ Tooltip، لكن كبّر ⓘ ولوّنها"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"dawaa","name":{"en":"Dawaa Pharmacy","ar":"صيدلية دواء"},"color":"#059669","icon":"pill","domain":"dawaa.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Upload prescription","ar":"ارفع الروشتة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","art":"medicine","text":{"en":"Amoxil 500 mg","ar":"أموكسيل 500 مجم"},"sub":{"en":"Needs a prescription","ar":"يحتاج روشتة"}},{"kind":"row","gap":"m","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Prescription photo","ar":"صورة الروشتة"}},{"kind":"iconbtn","icon":"info-fill","size":"l","color":"brand","aria":{"en":"More info","ar":"معلومات أكثر"}}]},{"kind":"image","art":"document","size":"m","gap":"s"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","icon":"camera","text":{"en":"Take a photo","ar":"التقط صورة"}}]}},{"id":"hint","text":{"en":"Show the rule under the label, always visible","ar":"اعرض الشرط تحت العنوان، ظاهرًا دائمًا"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"dawaa","name":{"en":"Dawaa Pharmacy","ar":"صيدلية دواء"},"color":"#059669","icon":"pill","domain":"dawaa.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Upload prescription","ar":"ارفع الروشتة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","art":"medicine","text":{"en":"Amoxil 500 mg","ar":"أموكسيل 500 مجم"},"sub":{"en":"Needs a prescription","ar":"يحتاج روشتة"}},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Prescription photo","ar":"صورة الروشتة"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"small","icon":"seal-check","text":{"en":"The doctor's stamp must be clear in the photo.","ar":"يجب أن يظهر ختم الطبيب بوضوح في الصورة."},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"image","art":"document","size":"m","gap":"s"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","icon":"camera","text":{"en":"Take a photo","ar":"التقط صورة"}}]}},{"id":"auto","text":{"en":"Open the tooltip by itself for 3 seconds when the screen loads","ar":"افتح الـ Tooltip تلقائيًا لمدة 3 ثوانٍ عند فتح الشاشة"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change (first 3 seconds)","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير (أول 3 ثوانٍ)"},"app":{"id":"dawaa","name":{"en":"Dawaa Pharmacy","ar":"صيدلية دواء"},"color":"#059669","icon":"pill","domain":"dawaa.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Upload prescription","ar":"ارفع الروشتة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","art":"medicine","text":{"en":"Amoxil 500 mg","ar":"أموكسيل 500 مجم"},"sub":{"en":"Needs a prescription","ar":"يحتاج روشتة"}},{"kind":"row","gap":"m","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Prescription photo","ar":"صورة الروشتة"}},{"kind":"iconbtn","icon":"info","aria":{"en":"More info","ar":"معلومات أكثر"}}]},{"kind":"tip","text":{"en":"The doctor's stamp must be clear in the photo.","ar":"يجب أن يظهر ختم الطبيب بوضوح في الصورة."},"note":{"en":"Hides after 3 s","ar":"يختفي بعد 3 ثوانٍ"}},{"kind":"image","art":"document","size":"m","gap":"s"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","icon":"camera","text":{"en":"Take a photo","ar":"التقط صورة"}}]}}],"answer":["hint"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P14-009","when":["bold","auto"],"feedback":{"en":"The rule decides whether her photo is accepted, but Yara still has to find it, or read it in 3 seconds and remember it while she takes the photo.","ar":"الشرط يحدّد هل تُقبل صورتها، لكن ما زال على يارا أن تجده، أو تقرأه في 3 ثوانٍ وتتذكّره وهي تلتقط الصورة."}}],"correct":{"en":"Needed to finish: keep it on the screen.","ar":"تحتاجه لتُكمل، فأبقِه على الشاشة."},"explain":{"en":"Without the stamp, the photo is rejected, so the rule is part of the task. Shown under the label, Yara sees it right before she takes the photo, with nothing to find or remember.","ar":"بدون الختم تُرفض الصورة، لذلك الشرط جزء من المهمة. وحين يظهر تحت العنوان، تراه يارا قبل أن تلتقط الصورة مباشرة، دون أن تبحث عنه أو تتذكّره."},"speaker":"karim"},{"id":"S07","type":"compare","part":"contrast","skill":"SK-P14-U01-04","rules":["R11"],"value":{"en":"Tooltips (NN/g): tooltips open on hover, so they work only on devices with a mouse or keyboard, and most icons are ambiguous enough that they need text labels. An icon-only bar that depends on tooltips fails on a phone.","ar":"الـ Tooltips (NN/g): الـ Tooltip يُفتح بالـ Hover، لذلك لا يعمل إلا على أجهزة فيها فأرة أو لوحة مفاتيح، وأغلب الأيقونات غامضة بما يكفي لتحتاج تسمية نصية. والشريط الذي فيه أيقونات فقط ويعتمد على الـ Tooltips يفشل على الهاتف."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/tooltip-guidelines/","quote":"Because tooltips are initiated by a hover gesture, they can be used only on devices with a mouse or keyboard."},"scenario":{"en":"Our pharmacy app has a bar of four icons on each medicine: save, compare, set a reminder and ask a pharmacist. On the website, each icon shows a tooltip on hover. The same bar is used in the phone app.","ar":"في تطبيق الصيدلية عندنا شريط من أربع أيقونات على كل دواء: حفظ، ومقارنة، وضبط تذكير، وسؤال صيدلي. وفي الموقع، تُظهر كل أيقونة Tooltip عند الـ Hover. والشريط نفسه مستخدم في تطبيق الهاتف."},"prompt":{"en":"Which version should ship in the phone app?","ar":"أيّ نسخة تجعل الناس يعرفون ما تفعله كل أيقونة في تطبيق الهاتف؟"},"a":{"label":{"en":"Version A: icons with tooltips","ar":"النسخة A: أيقونات مع Tooltips"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dawaa","name":{"en":"Dawaa Pharmacy","ar":"صيدلية دواء"},"color":"#059669","icon":"pill","domain":"dawaa.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Syrup B","ar":"شراب B"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"medicine","size":"m"},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Syrup B · 100 ml","ar":"شراب B · 100 مل"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"EGP 48","ar":"48 جنيه"}},{"kind":"row","gap":"m","blocks":[{"kind":"iconbtn","icon":"heart","aria":{"en":"Save","ar":"حفظ"}},{"kind":"iconbtn","icon":"arrows-left-right","aria":{"en":"Compare","ar":"قارن"}},{"kind":"iconbtn","icon":"alarm","aria":{"en":"Remind me","ar":"ذكّرني"}},{"kind":"iconbtn","icon":"question","aria":{"en":"Ask a pharmacist","ar":"اسأل صيدليًا"}}]},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Labels appear on hover","ar":"التسميات تظهر عند الـ Hover"},"note":{"en":"On the website","ar":"في الموقع"},"gap":"s"}]}},"b":{"label":{"en":"Version B: icons with text labels","ar":"النسخة B: أيقونات مع تسميات"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dawaa","name":{"en":"Dawaa Pharmacy","ar":"صيدلية دواء"},"color":"#059669","icon":"pill","domain":"dawaa.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Syrup B","ar":"شراب B"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"medicine","size":"m"},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Syrup B · 100 ml","ar":"شراب B · 100 مل"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"EGP 48","ar":"48 جنيه"}},{"kind":"row","gap":"m","blocks":[{"kind":"chip","icon":"heart","text":{"en":"Save","ar":"حفظ"}},{"kind":"chip","icon":"arrows-left-right","text":{"en":"Compare","ar":"قارن"}}]},{"kind":"row","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"chip","icon":"alarm","text":{"en":"Remind me","ar":"ذكّرني"}},{"kind":"chip","icon":"question","text":{"en":"Ask a pharmacist","ar":"اسأل صيدليًا"}}]}]}},"answer":"b","misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P14-010","when":["a"],"feedback":{"en":"A phone has no hover, so these tooltips never appear. People are left guessing what the clock or the arrows do.","ar":"لا يوجد Hover في الهاتف، فهذه الـ Tooltips لا تظهر أبدًا. ويبقى الناس يخمّنون ماذا تفعل الساعة أو الأسهم."}}],"correct":{"en":"B: on a phone, an icon that can be unclear needs its label on the screen.","ar":"B: على الهاتف، الأيقونة التي قد تكون غير واضحة تحتاج تسميتها على الشاشة."},"explain":{"en":"Most icons can be read more than one way: the arrows could mean compare or share, and the clock could mean a reminder or delivery time. Text labels work without hover and remove that guessing. A tooltip can't stand in for a label on a touch screen.","ar":"أغلب الأيقونات يمكن فهمها بأكثر من طريقة: الأسهم قد تعني المقارنة أو المشاركة، والساعة قد تعني تذكيرًا أو وقت التوصيل. والتسميات النصية تعمل دون Hover وتُزيل هذا التخمين. والـ Tooltip لا يمكن أن يحلّ محلّ التسمية على شاشة لمس."},"speaker":"karim"},{"id":"S08","type":"tune","speaker":"youssef","part":"independent","skill":"SK-P14-U01-04","rules":["R14"],"value":{"en":"Tooltips (NN/g): tooltips with obvious or redundant text don't help; they're best for extra explanation of a field some people don't know. \"Enter your tax number\" repeats the label; the format and where to find it is real help.","ar":"الـ Tooltips (NN/g): الـ Tooltip الذي يكرّر الواضح لا يفيد؛ وأفضل استخدام له شرح إضافي لحقل لا يعرفه بعض الناس. «أدخل رقمك الضريبي» تكرار للعنوان؛ أما الشكل ومكان العثور عليه فمساعدة حقيقية."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/tooltip-guidelines/","quote":"Tooltips with obvious or redundant text are not beneficial to users."},"scenario":{"en":"Adel works the counter in my shop and uses our invoicing website on the laptop. Most invoices don't need a tax number, but some customers ask for it. The field has a tooltip.","ar":"يعمل عادل على الكاشير في متجري، ويستخدم موقع الفواتير عندنا على الـ Laptop. أغلب الفواتير لا تحتاج رقمًا ضريبيًا، لكن بعض العملاء يطلبونه. والحقل عليه Tooltip."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each tooltip. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل Tooltip. أيّ Tooltip يساعد عادل أكثر على ملء حقل الرقم الضريبي بسرعة؟"},"start":"repeat","options":[{"id":"repeat","text":{"en":"\"Enter your tax number\"","ar":"«أدخل رقمك الضريبي»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"fatoora","name":{"en":"Fatoora","ar":"فاتورة"},"color":"#334155","icon":"receipt","domain":"fatoora.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"fatoora.example/invoices/new","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Invoices","ar":"الفواتير"},{"en":"Customers","ar":"العملاء"},{"en":"Products","ar":"المنتجات"}],"active":0,"actions":[{"icon":"user"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"New invoice","ar":"فاتورة جديدة"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Customer","ar":"العميل"},"text":{"en":"Nile Office Supplies","ar":"النيل للأدوات المكتبية"},"filled":true,"gap":"m"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Tax number (optional)","ar":"الرقم الضريبي (اختياري)"},"trail":"info","text":"","gap":"m"},{"kind":"tip","text":{"en":"Enter your tax number.","ar":"أدخل رقمك الضريبي."}}]}},{"id":"useful","text":{"en":"\"9 digits, on your tax card. Only needed if the customer asks.\"","ar":"«9 أرقام، تجدها في البطاقة الضريبية. لا يلزم إلا إذا طلبه العميل.»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"fatoora","name":{"en":"Fatoora","ar":"فاتورة"},"color":"#334155","icon":"receipt","domain":"fatoora.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"fatoora.example/invoices/new","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Invoices","ar":"الفواتير"},{"en":"Customers","ar":"العملاء"},{"en":"Products","ar":"المنتجات"}],"active":0,"actions":[{"icon":"user"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"New invoice","ar":"فاتورة جديدة"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Customer","ar":"العميل"},"text":{"en":"Nile Office Supplies","ar":"النيل للأدوات المكتبية"},"filled":true,"gap":"m"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Tax number (optional)","ar":"الرقم الضريبي (اختياري)"},"trail":"info","text":"","gap":"m"},{"kind":"tip","text":{"en":"9 digits, on your tax card. Only needed if the customer asks.","ar":"9 أرقام، تجدها في البطاقة الضريبية. لا يلزم إلا إذا طلبه العميل."}}]}},{"id":"long","text":{"en":"A full paragraph on tax law and when invoices need a number","ar":"فقرة كاملة عن قانون الضرائب ومتى تحتاج الفواتير رقمًا"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"fatoora","name":{"en":"Fatoora","ar":"فاتورة"},"color":"#334155","icon":"receipt","domain":"fatoora.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"fatoora.example/invoices/new","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Invoices","ar":"الفواتير"},{"en":"Customers","ar":"العملاء"},{"en":"Products","ar":"المنتجات"}],"active":0,"actions":[{"icon":"user"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"New invoice","ar":"فاتورة جديدة"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Customer","ar":"العميل"},"text":{"en":"Nile Office Supplies","ar":"النيل للأدوات المكتبية"},"filled":true,"gap":"m"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Tax number (optional)","ar":"الرقم الضريبي (اختياري)"},"trail":"info","text":"","gap":"m"},{"kind":"tip","text":{"en":"Under the current tax rules, registered sellers may be asked to include their tax registration number on invoices issued to business customers, especially for amounts above certain limits, and in some cases for exports. Check with your accountant to know which of your invoices need it and how the number must be shown.","ar":"وفق قواعد الضرائب الحالية، قد يُطلب من البائعين المسجّلين ذكر رقم التسجيل الضريبي في الفواتير الصادرة لعملاء من الشركات، خاصة للمبالغ التي تتجاوز حدودًا معيّنة، وفي بعض الحالات للتصدير. راجع محاسبك لتعرف أي فواتيرك تحتاجه وكيف يجب أن يظهر الرقم."}}]}}],"answer":["useful"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P14-011","when":["repeat"],"feedback":{"en":"It only repeats the label. Adel opens it and learns nothing he didn't already know.","ar":"يكرّر اسم الحقل فقط. فيفتحه عادل ولا يعرف شيئًا جديدًا."}},{"id":"MC-P14-011","when":["long"],"feedback":{"en":"This is no longer a tip. A long paragraph covers the form and gives Adel more to read than he needs to fill one field.","ar":"لم يعد هذا نصيحة قصيرة. فالفقرة الطويلة تغطّي النموذج، وتعطي عادل أكثر مما يحتاجه لملء حقل واحد."}}],"correct":{"en":"Short, and it adds what the label can't.","ar":"قصير، ويضيف ما لا يقوله اسم الحقل."},"explain":{"en":"The field is optional, and many people don't know where to find the number. The tooltip tells Adel the format, where to find it and when it's needed, in one short line.","ar":"الحقل اختياري، وكثيرون لا يعرفون أين يجدون الرقم. والـ Tooltip يخبر عادل بعدد أرقامه، وأين يجده، ومتى يلزم، في سطر واحد قصير."}},{"id":"S09","type":"card","part":"recap","icons":["layers","cut","eye"],"title":{"en":"What you practised","ar":"ما تدرّبت عليه"},"body":{"en":"- **Bottom sheets:** one at a time, for quick tasks, with a Close button that Back respects.\n- **Long flows go on pages,** even when a full-screen sheet looks like one.\n- **Tooltips add, never hold, what's needed:** keep required rules and labels on the screen, and make each tooltip short and useful.\n\nNext: how loud should a message be? Snackbar, banner or dialog.","ar":"- **الـ Bottom sheets:** واحد في كل مرة، للمهام السريعة، مع زر إغلاق، وزر الرجوع يغلقه أيضًا.\n- **الخطوات الكثيرة مكانها الصفحات،** حتى لو بدا الـ Sheet بملء الشاشة مثل صفحة.\n- **الـ Tooltip إضافة، لا مكانًا للضروري:** أبقِ الشروط والتسميات المطلوبة على الشاشة، واجعل كل Tooltip قصيرًا ومفيدًا.\n\nالتالي: كم يجب أن تلفت الرسالة الانتباه؟ Snackbar أم Banner أم Dialog."}}]}$uxg$::jsonb),
  ($uxg$P14-U01-L03$uxg$, $uxg$43d472cc9812df30dac7fdd32b266298382388625a26712ae86f8a385065e7e9$uxg$, $uxg${"id":"P14-U01-L03","mode":"lesson","minutes":8,"title":{"en":"Snackbar, banner or dialog?","ar":"Snackbar أم Banner أم Dialog؟"},"speaker":"mona","review_labels":{"MC-P14-012":{"en":"An error people must fix isn't a passing message","ar":"الخطأ الذي يجب إصلاحه ليس رسالة عابرة"},"MC-P14-013":{"en":"Don't stop people for good news","ar":"لا توقف الناس من أجل خبر جيد"},"MC-P14-014":{"en":"Something that lasts needs a message that lasts","ar":"ما يستمر يحتاج رسالة تستمر"},"MC-P14-015":{"en":"Offer Undo instead of asking every time","ar":"قدّم «تراجع» بدل السؤال كل مرة"}},"steps":[{"id":"S01","type":"card","part":"hook","title":{"en":"Reem's ride","ar":"مشوار ريم"},"body":{"en":"My team designs a ride app. Reem books a ride home with it. Her card payment fails, and the app shows a dark strip at the bottom: \"Payment failed\". Four seconds later, it's gone.\n\nReem was looking at the map. Ten minutes later, she is still waiting, and no driver has been asked to come.","ar":"يصمّم فريقي تطبيقًا للمشاوير. تحجز به ريم مشوارًا إلى البيت. فشل الدفع بالبطاقة، فأظهر التطبيق شريطًا داكنًا في الأسفل: «فشل الدفع». وبعد أربع ثوانٍ، اختفى.\n\nكانت ريم تنظر إلى الخريطة. وبعد عشر دقائق، ما زالت تنتظر، ولم يُطلب أي سائق."},"mock":{"app":{"id":"mishwar","name":{"en":"Mishwar","ar":"مشوار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"car","domain":"mishwar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Your ride","ar":"مشوارك"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"map-route","size":"l"},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Finding your driver…","ar":"نبحث عن سائق…"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"map-pin","text":{"en":"To: Home","ar":"إلى: البيت"},"sub":{"en":"12 Abbas El Akkad St · 18 min","ar":"12 شارع عباس العقاد · 18 دقيقة"},"value":{"en":"EGP 85","ar":"85 جنيه"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"credit-card","text":{"en":"Visa •••• 4821","ar":"Visa •••• 4821"}}],"overlay":{"type":"toast","blocks":[{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"Payment failed.","ar":"فشل الدفع."},"note":{"en":"Disappears after 4 s","ar":"يختفي بعد 4 ثوانٍ"}}]}}},{"id":"S02","type":"tune","part":"try","skill":"SK-P14-U01-05","rules":["R12"],"confidence":true,"value":{"en":"Try first. Notifications (NN/g): a toast (snackbar) is fine for passive notifications but would be a bad way to show an error, and passive messages are easily missed because they need no action. This ride can't go ahead until Reem acts.","ar":"جرّب أولًا. الإشعارات (NN/g): الـ Toast (الـ Snackbar) مناسب للإشعارات التي لا تحتاج إجراءً، لكنه طريقة سيئة لعرض خطأ، والرسائل التي لا تحتاج إجراءً يسهل أن تفوت الناس. وهذا المشوار لا يتم حتى تتصرّف ريم."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/indicators-validations-notifications/","quote":"Passive notifications can easily be missed, since they require no user action."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each version of the payment message. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل نسخة من رسالة الدفع. أيّ نسخة تضمن أن تعرف ريم بالمشكلة وتدفع ليأتي السائق؟"},"start":"longer","options":[{"id":"longer","text":{"en":"Keep the snackbar, but show it for 10 seconds","ar":"أبقِ الـ Snackbar، لكن اعرضه 10 ثوانٍ"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"Disappears after 10 seconds","ar":"يختفي بعد 10 ثوانٍ"},"app":{"id":"mishwar","name":{"en":"Mishwar","ar":"مشوار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"car","domain":"mishwar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Your ride","ar":"مشوارك"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"map-route","size":"l"},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Finding your driver…","ar":"نبحث عن سائق…"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"map-pin","text":{"en":"To: Home","ar":"إلى: البيت"},"sub":{"en":"12 Abbas El Akkad St · 18 min","ar":"12 شارع عباس العقاد · 18 دقيقة"},"value":{"en":"EGP 85","ar":"85 جنيه"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"credit-card","text":{"en":"Visa •••• 4821","ar":"Visa •••• 4821"}}],"overlay":{"type":"toast","blocks":[{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"Payment failed. Try another way to pay.","ar":"فشل الدفع. جرّبي طريقة دفع أخرى."}}]}}},{"id":"dialog","text":{"en":"A dialog that asks how she wants to pay","ar":"Dialog يسألها كيف تريد أن تدفع"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"mishwar","name":{"en":"Mishwar","ar":"مشوار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"car","domain":"mishwar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Your ride","ar":"مشوارك"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"map-route","size":"l"},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Finding your driver…","ar":"نبحث عن سائق…"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"map-pin","text":{"en":"To: Home","ar":"إلى: البيت"},"sub":{"en":"12 Abbas El Akkad St · 18 min","ar":"12 شارع عباس العقاد · 18 دقيقة"},"value":{"en":"EGP 85","ar":"85 جنيه"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"credit-card","text":{"en":"Visa •••• 4821","ar":"Visa •••• 4821"}}],"overlay":{"type":"dialog","blocks":[{"kind":"icon","icon":"credit-card","size":"l","color":"brand"},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Your card was declined","ar":"رُفضت بطاقتك"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"We'll ask a driver as soon as you choose how to pay.","ar":"سنطلب سائقًا بمجرد أن تختاري طريقة الدفع."},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Pay with another card","ar":"ادفعي ببطاقة أخرى"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Pay cash to the driver","ar":"ادفعي نقدًا للسائق"},"style":"outline","gap":"s"}]}}},{"id":"color","text":{"en":"Keep the snackbar, but make it red","ar":"أبقِ الـ Snackbar، لكن اجعله أحمر"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"Disappears after 4 seconds","ar":"يختفي بعد 4 ثوانٍ"},"app":{"id":"mishwar","name":{"en":"Mishwar","ar":"مشوار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"car","domain":"mishwar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Your ride","ar":"مشوارك"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"map-route","size":"l"},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Finding your driver…","ar":"نبحث عن سائق…"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"map-pin","text":{"en":"To: Home","ar":"إلى: البيت"},"sub":{"en":"12 Abbas El Akkad St · 18 min","ar":"12 شارع عباس العقاد · 18 دقيقة"},"value":{"en":"EGP 85","ar":"85 جنيه"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"credit-card","text":{"en":"Visa •••• 4821","ar":"Visa •••• 4821"}}],"overlay":{"type":"toast","blocks":[{"kind":"text","color":"red","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Payment failed.","ar":"فشل الدفع."}}]}}}],"answer":["dialog"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P14-012","when":["longer","color"],"feedback":{"en":"It still disappears on its own, while Reem may be looking at the map. Nothing happens until she pays another way, so the message can't just pass by.","ar":"ما زال يختفي وحده، بينما قد تكون ريم تنظر إلى الخريطة. ولن يحدث شيء حتى تدفع بطريقة أخرى، فلا يصح أن تمرّ الرسالة وتختفي."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Can the ride go ahead if Reem never notices this message?","ar":"هل يمكن أن يبدأ المشوار إن لم تنتبه ريم إلى هذه الرسالة أبدًا؟"}],"correct":{"en":"She must act now: a dialog with the ways forward.","ar":"يجب أن تتصرّف الآن: Dialog فيه طرق الدفع الأخرى."},"explain":{"en":"The ride is stuck until Reem picks another way to pay. A dialog stays until she answers, says what went wrong, and gives her two ways forward.","ar":"المشوار متوقّف حتى تختار ريم طريقة دفع أخرى. والـ Dialog يبقى حتى تردّ، ويقول ما المشكلة، ويعطيها طريقتين لتكمل المشوار."}},{"id":"S09","type":"video","part":"concept","title":{"en":"Make the message as loud as it matters","ar":"اجعل صوت الرسالة على قدر أهميتها"},"video":"1ff66ea0-29ed-4690-9ff3-3bdd7b335d45","duration":87,"transcript":[{"t":0,"en":"Let's compare the components that show system messages,","ar":"تعالوا نعمل مقارنة بين الـ Components اللي بتعرض System messages،"},{"t":5,"en":"the messages users see through these components.","ar":"يعني الرسايل اللي بتظهر لليوزر من خلال الـ Components دي."},{"t":8.6,"en":"The snackbar, the banner and the dialog can all show messages.","ar":"الـ Snackbar والـ Banner والـ Dialog، التلاتة ممكن يعرضوا رسايل."},{"t":13.1,"en":"But each one has a different priority, a different level of importance.","ar":"بس كل Component فيهم ليه Priority مختلفة، يعني درجة أهمية مختلفة."},{"t":17.9,"en":"The dialog has the highest priority when it appears in front of the user, especially a modal dialog.","ar":"الـ Dialog أعلى Priority، لما بيظهر قدّام اليوزر، خصوصًا لو كان Modal dialog."},{"t":23.7,"en":"It matters a lot: the user has to focus on it and can't do anything else until they close it.","ar":"أهميته عالية جدًا: اليوزر لازم يركّز معاه، ومش هيقدر يعمل أي حاجة تانية غير لما يقفله."},{"t":29.3,"en":"So that's high priority.","ar":"فده High priority."},{"t":32,"en":"The banner is medium priority: it appears at the top and it's clear,","ar":"الـ Banner بقى Medium priority: بيظهر فوق، وواضح،"},{"t":36.7,"en":"but it doesn't block the content the user is working on, so they don't have to stop and focus on it.","ar":"بس مش بيقفل الـ Content اللي اليوزر شغّال عليه، فمش محتاج يوقف ويركّز معاه."},{"t":42.3,"en":"It matters, but not very much,","ar":"أهميته كويسة، بس مش عالية أوي،"},{"t":45.8,"en":"and not as little as the snackbar, which shows at the bottom, disappears again and needs no interaction.","ar":"ومش قليلة زي الـ Snackbar، اللي بيظهر تحت ويختفي تاني، ومش محتاج Interaction."},{"t":52,"en":"The snackbar disappears on its own, unlike the banner, where I have to tap X, Close or an action to close it, or it stays.","ar":"الـ Snackbar بيختفي لوحده، عكس الـ Banner اللي لازم أدوس على X أو Close أو Action علشان يتقفل، وإلا هيفضل موجود."},{"t":61.8,"en":"So the banner stays until I deal with it,","ar":"يعني الـ Banner بيفضل لحد ما أتعامل معاه،"},{"t":64.3,"en":"and the dialog also needs an action to close it.","ar":"وبرضه زي الـ Dialog، اللي محتاج Action علشان يتقفل."},{"t":67.8,"en":"So this is a comparison of the components that let me give users messages in my system or product,","ar":"فدي مقارنة بين الـ Components اللي بتخلّيني أدّي رسايل لليوزر في الـ System أو الـ Product بتاعي،"},{"t":75.8,"en":"so I know which component to use for each context, priority and message I want to get across,","ar":"علشان أعرف أستخدم أنهي Component، حسب الـ Context والـ Priority والرسالة اللي عايز أوصّلها،"},{"t":81.8,"en":"and use them without annoying the user or giving them a bad experience.","ar":"وأستخدمهم من غير ما أضايق اليوزر أو أدّيله تجربة وحشة."}]},{"id":"S03","type":"card","part":"concept","icons":["ok","warn","target"],"title":{"en":"Video summary","ar":"ملخص الفيديو"},"body":{"en":"Three ways to tell people something, from quietest to loudest:\n\n- **Snackbar:** a short strip that disappears by itself. For news that needs no action, like \"Saved\". It can carry one action, such as Undo. Never for an error people must fix.\n- **Banner:** stays at the top of the screen until people close it or the problem is solved. For something that matters and lasts.\n- **Dialog:** blocks the screen until people answer. Only when they must respond now.","ar":"ثلاث طرق لإخبار الناس بشيء، من الأهدأ إلى الأعلى صوتًا:\n\n- **الـ Snackbar:** شريط قصير يختفي وحده. لخبر لا يحتاج إجراءً، مثل «تم الحفظ». ويمكن أن يحمل إجراءً واحدًا، مثل «تراجع». ولا يُستخدم أبدًا لخطأ يجب أن يصلحه الناس.\n- **الـ Banner:** يبقى أعلى الشاشة حتى يغلقه الناس أو تُحلّ المشكلة. لشيء مهم ومستمر.\n- **الـ Dialog:** يحجب الشاشة حتى يردّ الناس. فقط حين يجب أن يردّوا الآن."}},{"id":"S04","type":"tune","part":"guided","skill":"SK-P14-U01-05","rules":["R06","R15"],"value":{"en":"Notifications (NN/g): passive notifications are typically not urgent and should be less intrusive. \"Place saved\" needs nothing from Reem, so blocking the screen or leaving a lasting banner is louder than it deserves.","ar":"الإشعارات (NN/g): الإشعارات التي لا تحتاج إجراءً ليست عاجلة عادةً ويجب أن تكون أقل إزعاجًا. و«حُفظ المكان» لا يحتاج شيئًا من ريم، فحجب الشاشة أو ترك Banner دائم أعلى صوتًا مما يستحق."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/indicators-validations-notifications/","quote":"Passive notifications are typically not urgent and should be less intrusive."},"scenario":{"en":"Reem saves her home address as a favorite place. The save always works, and she can rename or remove it later from Favorites.","ar":"تحفظ ريم عنوان بيتها كمكان مفضّل. والحفظ ينجح دائمًا، ويمكنها أن تغيّر اسمه أو تحذفه لاحقًا من «المفضّلة»."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each way of confirming the save. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل طريقة لتأكيد الحفظ. أيّ طريقة تخبر ريم بنجاح الحفظ دون أن توقفها؟"},"start":"dialog","options":[{"id":"dialog","text":{"en":"A dialog: \"Place saved!\" with an OK button","ar":"Dialog: «تم حفظ المكان!» مع زر «حسنًا»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"mishwar","name":{"en":"Mishwar","ar":"مشوار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"car","domain":"mishwar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Where to?","ar":"إلى أين؟"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"searchbar","text":{"en":"Search for a place","ar":"ابحثي عن مكان"}},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Favorites","ar":"المفضّلة"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"house-fill","text":{"en":"Home","ar":"البيت"},"sub":{"en":"12 Abbas El Akkad St","ar":"12 شارع عباس العقاد"},"value":{"en":"★","ar":"★"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"briefcase","text":{"en":"Office","ar":"المكتب"},"sub":{"en":"90th St, New Cairo","ar":"شارع التسعين، القاهرة الجديدة"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"clock-counter-clockwise","text":{"en":"City Stars Mall","ar":"سيتي ستارز"},"sub":{"en":"Recent","ar":"مؤخرًا"}}],"overlay":{"type":"dialog","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Place saved!","ar":"تم حفظ المكان!"}},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"OK","ar":"حسنًا"},"gap":"m"}]}}},{"id":"snack","text":{"en":"A snackbar: \"Home saved\"","ar":"Snackbar: «تم حفظ البيت»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"mishwar","name":{"en":"Mishwar","ar":"مشوار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"car","domain":"mishwar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Where to?","ar":"إلى أين؟"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"searchbar","text":{"en":"Search for a place","ar":"ابحثي عن مكان"}},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Favorites","ar":"المفضّلة"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"house-fill","text":{"en":"Home","ar":"البيت"},"sub":{"en":"12 Abbas El Akkad St","ar":"12 شارع عباس العقاد"},"value":{"en":"★","ar":"★"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"briefcase","text":{"en":"Office","ar":"المكتب"},"sub":{"en":"90th St, New Cairo","ar":"شارع التسعين، القاهرة الجديدة"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"clock-counter-clockwise","text":{"en":"City Stars Mall","ar":"سيتي ستارز"},"sub":{"en":"Recent","ar":"مؤخرًا"}}],"overlay":{"type":"toast","blocks":[{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"Home saved to Favorites.","ar":"تم حفظ «البيت» في المفضّلة."}}]}}},{"id":"banner","text":{"en":"A banner at the top that stays until she closes it","ar":"Banner في الأعلى يبقى حتى تغلقه"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"mishwar","name":{"en":"Mishwar","ar":"مشوار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"car","domain":"mishwar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Where to?","ar":"إلى أين؟"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"searchbar","text":{"en":"Search for a place","ar":"ابحثي عن مكان"}},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Favorites","ar":"المفضّلة"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"house-fill","text":{"en":"Home","ar":"البيت"},"sub":{"en":"12 Abbas El Akkad St","ar":"12 شارع عباس العقاد"},"value":{"en":"★","ar":"★"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"briefcase","text":{"en":"Office","ar":"المكتب"},"sub":{"en":"90th St, New Cairo","ar":"شارع التسعين، القاهرة الجديدة"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"clock-counter-clockwise","text":{"en":"City Stars Mall","ar":"سيتي ستارز"},"sub":{"en":"Recent","ar":"مؤخرًا"}}],"overlay":{"type":"banner","close":true,"blocks":[{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"Home saved to Favorites.","ar":"تم حفظ «البيت» في المفضّلة."}}]}}}],"answer":["snack"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P14-013","when":["dialog"],"feedback":{"en":"Reem has to stop and tap OK for news she didn't need to act on. That's the loudest message used for the quietest news.","ar":"على ريم أن تتوقّف وتضغط «حسنًا» لخبر لا تحتاج أن تفعل معه شيئًا. وهذه أقوى رسالة لأبسط خبر."}},{"id":"MC-P14-013","when":["banner"],"feedback":{"en":"Nothing is left to solve, yet the banner stays and takes space until Reem closes it. Good news can pass.","ar":"لم يبقَ شيء لحلّه، ومع ذلك يبقى الـ Banner ويأخذ مساحة حتى تغلقه ريم. والخبر الجيد يكفيه أن يظهر ويختفي."}}],"correct":{"en":"No action needed: a snackbar.","ar":"لا يحتاج إجراءً: Snackbar."},"explain":{"en":"The save worked and needs nothing from Reem. A snackbar tells her, then gets out of the way, so she can keep booking.","ar":"نجح الحفظ ولا يحتاج شيئًا من ريم. والـ Snackbar يخبرها ثم يختفي، فتكمل الحجز."},"speaker":"mona"},{"id":"S05","type":"tune","part":"guided","skill":"SK-P14-U01-05","rules":["R06","R15"],"value":{"en":"Notifications (NN/g): passive notifications are easily missed. A problem that lasts (receipts can't be sent until the email is verified) needs a message that stays visible until it's solved, without blocking every visit.","ar":"الإشعارات (NN/g): الإشعارات التي لا تحتاج إجراءً يسهل أن تفوت الناس. والمشكلة المستمرة (لا تُرسل الإيصالات حتى يُؤكَّد البريد) تحتاج رسالة تبقى ظاهرة حتى تُحلّ، دون أن تحجب كل زيارة."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/indicators-validations-notifications/","quote":"Passive notifications can easily be missed, since they require no user action."},"scenario":{"en":"Reem hasn't confirmed her email address. Until she does, the app can't email her ride receipts, which she needs for work. She can still book rides.","ar":"لم تؤكّد ريم بريدها الإلكتروني. وحتى تفعل، لا يستطيع التطبيق إرسال إيصالات المشاوير إليها، وهي تحتاجها للعمل. وما زالت تستطيع حجز المشاوير."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each version. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل نسخة. أيّها يجب أن تُطلق؟"},"start":"snack","options":[{"id":"snack","text":{"en":"A snackbar each time she opens the app","ar":"Snackbar في كل مرة تفتح فيها التطبيق"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"mishwar","name":{"en":"Mishwar","ar":"مشوار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"car","domain":"mishwar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Your trips","ar":"مشاويرك"}},"tabbar":{"active":1,"items":[{"icon":"car","text":{"en":"Ride","ar":"مشوار"}},{"icon":"clock-counter-clockwise","text":{"en":"Trips","ar":"مشاويرك"}},{"icon":"user","text":{"en":"Account","ar":"حسابي"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"car","text":{"en":"Home","ar":"البيت"},"sub":{"en":"Today, 6:40 pm","ar":"اليوم، 6:40 م"},"value":{"en":"EGP 85","ar":"85 جنيه"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"car","text":{"en":"Office","ar":"المكتب"},"sub":{"en":"Yesterday, 8:15 am","ar":"أمس، 8:15 ص"},"value":{"en":"EGP 70","ar":"70 جنيه"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"car","text":{"en":"City Stars Mall","ar":"سيتي ستارز"},"sub":{"en":"Mon, 4:05 pm","ar":"الإثنين، 4:05 م"},"value":{"en":"EGP 60","ar":"60 جنيه"}}],"overlay":{"type":"toast","blocks":[{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"Confirm your email to get receipts.","ar":"أكّدي بريدك لتصلك الإيصالات."}}]}}},{"id":"banner","text":{"en":"A banner on Your trips that stays until she confirms","ar":"Banner في «مشاويرك» يبقى حتى تؤكّد"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"mishwar","name":{"en":"Mishwar","ar":"مشوار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"car","domain":"mishwar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Your trips","ar":"مشاويرك"}},"tabbar":{"active":1,"items":[{"icon":"car","text":{"en":"Ride","ar":"مشوار"}},{"icon":"clock-counter-clockwise","text":{"en":"Trips","ar":"مشاويرك"}},{"icon":"user","text":{"en":"Account","ar":"حسابي"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"banner","icon":"envelope-simple","tone":"warn","text":{"en":"Confirm your email to get ride receipts.","ar":"أكّدي بريدك لتصلك إيصالات المشاوير."}},{"kind":"link","text":{"en":"Send confirmation email","ar":"أرسلوا لي رسالة التأكيد"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"car","text":{"en":"Home","ar":"البيت"},"sub":{"en":"Today, 6:40 pm","ar":"اليوم، 6:40 م"},"value":{"en":"EGP 85","ar":"85 جنيه"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"car","text":{"en":"Office","ar":"المكتب"},"sub":{"en":"Yesterday, 8:15 am","ar":"أمس، 8:15 ص"},"value":{"en":"EGP 70","ar":"70 جنيه"}}]}},{"id":"dialog","text":{"en":"A dialog each time she opens the app","ar":"Dialog في كل مرة تفتح فيها التطبيق"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"mishwar","name":{"en":"Mishwar","ar":"مشوار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"car","domain":"mishwar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Your trips","ar":"مشاويرك"}},"tabbar":{"active":1,"items":[{"icon":"car","text":{"en":"Ride","ar":"مشوار"}},{"icon":"clock-counter-clockwise","text":{"en":"Trips","ar":"مشاويرك"}},{"icon":"user","text":{"en":"Account","ar":"حسابي"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"car","text":{"en":"Home","ar":"البيت"},"sub":{"en":"Today, 6:40 pm","ar":"اليوم، 6:40 م"},"value":{"en":"EGP 85","ar":"85 جنيه"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"car","text":{"en":"Office","ar":"المكتب"},"sub":{"en":"Yesterday, 8:15 am","ar":"أمس، 8:15 ص"},"value":{"en":"EGP 70","ar":"70 جنيه"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"car","text":{"en":"City Stars Mall","ar":"سيتي ستارز"},"sub":{"en":"Mon, 4:05 pm","ar":"الإثنين، 4:05 م"},"value":{"en":"EGP 60","ar":"60 جنيه"}}],"overlay":{"type":"dialog","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Confirm your email","ar":"أكّدي بريدك"}},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"We can't send receipts until you do.","ar":"لا نستطيع إرسال الإيصالات حتى تفعلي."},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Send confirmation email","ar":"أرسلوا لي رسالة التأكيد"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Later","ar":"لاحقًا"},"style":"text","gap":"s"}]}}}],"answer":["banner"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P14-014","when":["snack"],"feedback":{"en":"The problem lasts, but the message keeps disappearing. Reem can miss it every time and only find out when a receipt never arrives.","ar":"المشكلة مستمرة، لكن الرسالة تختفي كل مرة. فقد لا تنتبه لها ريم أبدًا، ولا تعرف إلا حين لا يصل الإيصال."}},{"id":"MC-P14-013","when":["dialog"],"feedback":{"en":"Reem can still book rides, so nothing has to stop her. A dialog on every visit blocks her for something she can do later.","ar":"ما زالت ريم تستطيع حجز المشاوير، فلا شيء يستدعي إيقافها. والـ Dialog في كل زيارة يحجبها من أجل شيء يمكنها فعله لاحقًا."}}],"correct":{"en":"Matters and lasts: a banner until it's solved.","ar":"أمر مهم ويستمر: Banner يبقى حتى تُحلّ المشكلة."},"explain":{"en":"The banner stays where Reem looks for her trips, with the action that fixes it, and disappears once her email is confirmed. It never stops her from booking.","ar":"الـ Banner يبقى حيث تبحث ريم عن مشاويرها، ومعه الإجراء الذي يحلّ المشكلة، ويختفي بمجرد تأكيد بريدها. ولا يمنعها أبدًا من الحجز."},"speaker":"mona"},{"id":"S06","type":"compare","speaker":"rami","part":"contrast","skill":"SK-P14-U01-05","rules":["R11"],"value":{"en":"Notifications (NN/g): passive notifications are easily missed because they need no action. Being offline lasts and changes what people's actions do, so a message that disappears after a few seconds leaves them unaware.","ar":"الإشعارات (NN/g): الإشعارات التي لا تحتاج إجراءً يسهل أن تفوت الناس. وانقطاع الإنترنت يستمر ويغيّر نتيجة ما يفعله الناس، فالرسالة التي تختفي بعد ثوانٍ تتركهم غير منتبهين."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/indicators-validations-notifications/","quote":"Passive notifications can easily be missed, since they require no user action."},"scenario":{"en":"I'm designing a notes app. Khaled writes notes in it on the metro. His connection drops for 15 minutes. He can keep writing, but nothing is saved to his other devices until he is back online.","ar":"أصمّم تطبيقًا للملاحظات. يكتب فيه خالد ملاحظاته وهو في المترو. وانقطع الإنترنت 15 دقيقة. يستطيع أن يستمر في الكتابة، لكن لا شيء يُحفظ على أجهزته الأخرى حتى يعود الاتصال."},"prompt":{"en":"Which version should ship?","ar":"أيّ نسخة يجب أن تُطلق؟"},"a":{"label":{"en":"Version A: a snackbar for 4 seconds","ar":"النسخة A: Snackbar لمدة 4 ثوانٍ"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"satr","name":{"en":"Satr","ar":"سطر"},"color":"#334155","icon":"text-align-left","domain":"satr.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Shopping list","ar":"قائمة المشتريات"},"back":true,"actions":[{"icon":"dots-three-vertical","aria":{"en":"More","ar":"المزيد"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Edited just now","ar":"عُدّلت الآن"}},{"kind":"list","style":"check","items":[{"en":"Bread","ar":"عيش"},{"en":"Eggs","ar":"بيض"},{"en":"Tea","ar":"شاي"},{"en":"Tomatoes","ar":"طماطم"}],"gap":"s"}],"keyboard":"text","overlay":{"type":"toast","blocks":[{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"You're offline.","ar":"لا يوجد اتصال بالإنترنت."},"note":{"en":"Disappears after 4 s","ar":"يختفي بعد 4 ثوانٍ"}}]}}},"b":{"label":{"en":"Version B: a banner while offline","ar":"النسخة B: Banner طوال الانقطاع"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"satr","name":{"en":"Satr","ar":"سطر"},"color":"#334155","icon":"text-align-left","domain":"satr.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Shopping list","ar":"قائمة المشتريات"},"back":true,"actions":[{"icon":"dots-three-vertical","aria":{"en":"More","ar":"المزيد"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"banner","icon":"wifi-slash","tone":"warn","text":{"en":"You're offline. Notes will sync when you're back online.","ar":"لا يوجد اتصال بالإنترنت. ستُزامَن ملاحظاتك حين يعود الاتصال."}},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Saved on this phone","ar":"محفوظة على هذا الهاتف"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"list","style":"check","items":[{"en":"Bread","ar":"عيش"},{"en":"Eggs","ar":"بيض"},{"en":"Tea","ar":"شاي"},{"en":"Tomatoes","ar":"طماطم"}],"gap":"s"}],"keyboard":"text"}},"answer":"b","misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P14-014","when":["a"],"feedback":{"en":"Khaled is offline for 15 minutes, but the message lasts 4 seconds. If he looked away, he may think his notes are already on his laptop.","ar":"خالد غير متصل 15 دقيقة، لكن الرسالة تبقى 4 ثوانٍ فقط. وإن لم ينتبه لها، قد يظنّ أن ملاحظاته وصلت إلى الـ Laptop."}}],"correct":{"en":"B: the message lasts as long as the problem.","ar":"B: الرسالة تستمر ما دامت المشكلة."},"explain":{"en":"The banner stays the whole time Khaled is offline and tells him what it means for his notes. It disappears by itself once he's back online.","ar":"الـ Banner يبقى طوال انقطاع الاتصال، ويخبر خالد بما يعنيه ذلك لملاحظاته. ويختفي وحده حين يعود الاتصال."}},{"id":"S07","type":"tune","speaker":"karim","part":"independent","skill":"SK-P14-U01-05","rules":["R14"],"value":{"en":"Confirmation dialogs (NN/g): don't use confirmation dialogs for routine actions; people stop reading warnings they see too often. For an action that can be reversed, offer Undo instead, which a snackbar can carry.","ar":"نوافذ التأكيد (NN/g): لا تستخدم نوافذ التأكيد للإجراءات الروتينية؛ فالناس يتوقّفون عن قراءة التحذيرات التي يرونها كثيرًا. وللإجراء الذي يمكن عكسه، قدّم «تراجع» بدلًا من ذلك، ويمكن أن يحمله الـ Snackbar."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/confirmation-dialog/","quote":"Do not use confirmation dialogs for routine actions."},"scenario":{"en":"I'm building a study website. Dina uses it on her laptop. She archives 10 to 20 old notes a week. Archived notes are never deleted; she can bring them back at any time.","ar":"أبني موقعًا للمذاكرة. تستخدمه دينا على الـ Laptop. وتؤرشف من 10 إلى 20 ملاحظة قديمة كل أسبوع. والملاحظات المؤرشفة لا تُحذف أبدًا؛ ويمكنها استعادتها في أي وقت."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each version of what happens when she archives a note. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب ما يحدث في كل نسخة حين تؤرشف دينا ملاحظة. أيّ نسخة تحميها من الخطأ دون أن توقفها كل مرة؟"},"start":"confirm","options":[{"id":"confirm","text":{"en":"A dialog each time: \"Archive this note?\"","ar":"Dialog كل مرة: «هل تؤرشفين هذه الملاحظة؟»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"mozakra","name":{"en":"Mozakra","ar":"مذاكرة"},"color":"#1971C2","icon":"student","domain":"mozakra.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"mozakra.example/notes","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"My notes","ar":"ملاحظاتي"},{"en":"Courses","ar":"الكورسات"},{"en":"Archive","ar":"الأرشيف"}],"active":0,"search":{"en":"Search notes","ar":"ابحث في الملاحظات"},"actions":[{"icon":"user"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"My notes","ar":"ملاحظاتي"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"file-text","text":{"en":"Biology · Chapter 3","ar":"الأحياء · الفصل 3"},"sub":{"en":"Edited 2 Oct","ar":"عُدّلت 2 أكتوبر"},"value":{"en":"Archive","ar":"أرشفة"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"file-text","text":{"en":"Physics · Revision","ar":"الفيزياء · مراجعة"},"sub":{"en":"Edited 28 Sep","ar":"عُدّلت 28 سبتمبر"},"value":{"en":"Archive","ar":"أرشفة"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"file-text","text":{"en":"Chemistry · Lab 2","ar":"الكيمياء · المعمل 2"},"sub":{"en":"Edited 21 Sep","ar":"عُدّلت 21 سبتمبر"},"value":{"en":"Archive","ar":"أرشفة"}}],"overlay":{"type":"dialog","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Archive this note?","ar":"هل تؤرشفين هذه الملاحظة؟"}},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Archive","ar":"أرشفة"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Cancel","ar":"إلغاء"},"style":"text","gap":"s"}]}}},{"id":"undo","text":{"en":"Archive at once, with a snackbar: \"Note archived · Undo\"","ar":"أرشِف فورًا، مع Snackbar: «أُرشفت الملاحظة · تراجع»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"mozakra","name":{"en":"Mozakra","ar":"مذاكرة"},"color":"#1971C2","icon":"student","domain":"mozakra.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"mozakra.example/notes","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"My notes","ar":"ملاحظاتي"},{"en":"Courses","ar":"الكورسات"},{"en":"Archive","ar":"الأرشيف"}],"active":0,"search":{"en":"Search notes","ar":"ابحث في الملاحظات"},"actions":[{"icon":"user"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"My notes","ar":"ملاحظاتي"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"file-text","text":{"en":"Physics · Revision","ar":"الفيزياء · مراجعة"},"sub":{"en":"Edited 28 Sep","ar":"عُدّلت 28 سبتمبر"},"value":{"en":"Archive","ar":"أرشفة"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"file-text","text":{"en":"Chemistry · Lab 2","ar":"الكيمياء · المعمل 2"},"sub":{"en":"Edited 21 Sep","ar":"عُدّلت 21 سبتمبر"},"value":{"en":"Archive","ar":"أرشفة"}}],"overlay":{"type":"toast","blocks":[{"kind":"row","blocks":[{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"Note archived.","ar":"أُرشفت الملاحظة."}},{"kind":"link","text":{"en":"Undo","ar":"تراجع"}}]}]}}},{"id":"silent","text":{"en":"Archive at once, with no message","ar":"أرشِف فورًا، دون أي رسالة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"mozakra","name":{"en":"Mozakra","ar":"مذاكرة"},"color":"#1971C2","icon":"student","domain":"mozakra.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"mozakra.example/notes","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"My notes","ar":"ملاحظاتي"},{"en":"Courses","ar":"الكورسات"},{"en":"Archive","ar":"الأرشيف"}],"active":0,"search":{"en":"Search notes","ar":"ابحث في الملاحظات"},"actions":[{"icon":"user"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"My notes","ar":"ملاحظاتي"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"file-text","text":{"en":"Physics · Revision","ar":"الفيزياء · مراجعة"},"sub":{"en":"Edited 28 Sep","ar":"عُدّلت 28 سبتمبر"},"value":{"en":"Archive","ar":"أرشفة"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"file-text","text":{"en":"Chemistry · Lab 2","ar":"الكيمياء · المعمل 2"},"sub":{"en":"Edited 21 Sep","ar":"عُدّلت 21 سبتمبر"},"value":{"en":"Archive","ar":"أرشفة"}}]}}],"answer":["undo"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P14-015","when":["confirm"],"feedback":{"en":"Dina archives up to 20 notes a week, so she'll learn to click Archive without reading. And the action can be reversed anyway, so there's nothing to protect her from.","ar":"تؤرشف دينا حتى 20 ملاحظة في الأسبوع، فستعتاد الضغط على «أرشفة» دون قراءة. والأرشفة يمكن التراجع عنها أصلًا، فلا يوجد خطر يحتاج حمايتها منه."}},{"id":"MC-P14-015","when":["silent"],"feedback":{"en":"If Dina clicks the wrong note, the note just vanishes. She doesn't know it was archived or how to get it back quickly.","ar":"إن ضغطت دينا على الملاحظة الخطأ، تختفي الملاحظة دون أي توضيح. ولا تعرف أنها أُرشفت أو كيف تستعيدها بسرعة."}}],"correct":{"en":"Reversible and routine: act, then offer Undo.","ar":"يتكرّر كثيرًا ويمكن التراجع عنه: نفّذه، ثم قدّم «تراجع»."},"explain":{"en":"The snackbar tells Dina what happened and gives her one click to reverse a slip, without stopping her 20 times a week. Save the dialog for actions that can't be undone.","ar":"الـ Snackbar يخبر دينا بما حدث، ويعطيها ضغطة واحدة لعكس الخطأ، دون أن يوقفها 20 مرة في الأسبوع. واحتفظ بالـ Dialog للإجراءات التي لا يمكن التراجع عنها."}},{"id":"S08","type":"card","part":"recap","icons":["ok","warn","target"],"title":{"en":"What you practised","ar":"ما تدرّبت عليه"},"body":{"en":"- **Snackbar** for news that needs no action, with Undo when an action can be reversed.\n- **Banner** for something that matters and lasts, until it's solved.\n- **Dialog** only when people must answer now, like a failed payment that stops the task.\n\nNext: the skill check, on new cases.","ar":"- **الـ Snackbar** لخبر لا يحتاج إجراءً، ومعه «تراجع» حين يمكن التراجع عنه.\n- **الـ Banner** لشيء مهم ومستمر، حتى يُحلّ.\n- **الـ Dialog** فقط حين يجب أن يردّ الناس الآن، مثل فشل الدفع الذي يوقف المهمة.\n\nالتالي: اختبار المهارة، على حالات جديدة."}}]}$uxg$::jsonb),
  ($uxg$P14-U01-L04$uxg$, $uxg$aa925f79eea37c2f39d18c6e060ebf27dc8919f451fbf9b6e8bb5c16cdcec86b$uxg$, $uxg${"id":"P14-U01-L04","mode":"check","minutes":7,"title":{"en":"Skill check: interrupt only when it's worth it","ar":"اختبار المهارة: لا تقاطع إلا حين يستحق الأمر"},"speaker":"tarek","steps":[{"id":"S01","type":"card","part":"hook","title":{"en":"Tarek's grocery app","ar":"تطبيق طارق للبقالة"},"body":{"en":"My team is about to launch a grocery delivery app. Help me review five moments in it before launch.\n\nThis is a skill check: no hints, and you'll see how you did at the end.","ar":"فريقي على وشك إطلاق تطبيق لتوصيل البقالة. ساعدني في مراجعة خمس لحظات فيه قبل الإطلاق.\n\nهذا اختبار مهارة: بدون تلميحات، وسترى نتيجتك في النهاية."}},{"id":"S02","type":"tune","part":"check","skill":"SK-P14-U01-01","value":{"en":"Check, modal dialogs (NN/g): don't interrupt high-stakes flows like checkout with something unrelated. Asking later in the same window doesn't change that; asking after delivery does.","ar":"اختبار، النوافذ الـ Modal (NN/g): لا تقاطع العمليات المهمة مثل الدفع بشيء غير مرتبط بها. والسؤال لاحقًا في النافذة نفسها لا يغيّر ذلك؛ أما السؤال بعد التوصيل فيغيّره."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/modal-nonmodal-dialog/","quote":"Avoid modal dialogs that interrupt high-stake processes such as checkout flows."},"scenario":{"en":"When people tap **Place order**, a dialog asks them to rate the app before the order goes through. We want more ratings.","ar":"حين يضغط الناس **أرسل الطلب**، يظهر Dialog يطلب منهم تقييم التطبيق قبل أن يُرسل الطلب. ونحن نريد تقييمات أكثر."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each version. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل نسخة. أيّها يجب أن تُطلق؟"},"start":"keep","options":[{"id":"keep","text":{"en":"Keep the rating dialog when people place an order","ar":"أبقِ Dialog التقييم عند إرسال الطلب"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"sallah","name":{"en":"Sallah","ar":"سلّة"},"color":"#2E9E5B","icon":"basket","domain":"sallah.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Checkout","ar":"الدفع"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"basket","text":{"en":"12 items","ar":"12 منتجًا"},"sub":{"en":"Milk, bread, eggs and 9 more","ar":"لبن، عيش، بيض و9 غيرها"},"value":{"en":"EGP 1,140","ar":"1140 جنيه"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"clock","text":{"en":"Today, 7–9 pm","ar":"اليوم، من 7 إلى 9 مساءً"},"sub":{"en":"Delivery slot","ar":"موعد التوصيل"},"chevron":true},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"credit-card","text":{"en":"Visa •••• 1177","ar":"Visa •••• 1177"},"chevron":true}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Place order · EGP 1,140","ar":"أرسل الطلب · 1140 جنيه"}}],"overlay":{"type":"dialog","close":true,"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Enjoying Sallah?","ar":"هل أعجبك تطبيق سلّة؟"}},{"kind":"text","text":"★ ★ ★ ★ ★","size":"l","gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Rate us","ar":"قيّمنا"},"gap":"m"}]}}},{"id":"third","text":{"en":"Show the same dialog only from the third order","ar":"اعرض الـ Dialog نفسه بدءًا من الطلب الثالث فقط"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"Third order","ar":"الطلب الثالث"},"app":{"id":"sallah","name":{"en":"Sallah","ar":"سلّة"},"color":"#2E9E5B","icon":"basket","domain":"sallah.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Checkout","ar":"الدفع"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"basket","text":{"en":"12 items","ar":"12 منتجًا"},"sub":{"en":"Milk, bread, eggs and 9 more","ar":"لبن، عيش، بيض و9 غيرها"},"value":{"en":"EGP 1,140","ar":"1140 جنيه"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"clock","text":{"en":"Today, 7–9 pm","ar":"اليوم، من 7 إلى 9 مساءً"},"sub":{"en":"Delivery slot","ar":"موعد التوصيل"},"chevron":true},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"credit-card","text":{"en":"Visa •••• 1177","ar":"Visa •••• 1177"},"chevron":true}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Place order · EGP 1,140","ar":"أرسل الطلب · 1140 جنيه"}}],"overlay":{"type":"dialog","close":true,"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Enjoying Sallah?","ar":"هل أعجبك تطبيق سلّة؟"}},{"kind":"text","text":"★ ★ ★ ★ ★","size":"l","gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Rate us","ar":"قيّمنا"},"gap":"m"}]}}},{"id":"after","text":{"en":"Ask for a rating on the order screen once it's delivered","ar":"اطلب التقييم في شاشة الطلب بعد توصيله"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"sallah","name":{"en":"Sallah","ar":"سلّة"},"color":"#2E9E5B","icon":"basket","domain":"sallah.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Order delivered","ar":"تم التوصيل"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"icon","icon":"check-circle-fill","size":"l","color":"brand"},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Delivered","ar":"تم التوصيل"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"12 items · Today 6:40 pm","ar":"12 منتجًا · اليوم 6:40 مساءً"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"card","gap":"l","blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"How was this order?","ar":"كيف كان هذا الطلب؟"}},{"kind":"text","text":"★ ★ ★ ★ ★","size":"l","gap":"s"}]}]}}],"answer":["after"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P14-001","when":["keep"],"feedback":{"en":"The rating has nothing to do with placing the order, and it blocks the most important tap in the app.","ar":"التقييم لا علاقة له بإرسال الطلب، وهو يحجب أهم ضغطة في التطبيق."}},{"id":"MC-P14-002","when":["third"],"feedback":{"en":"Fewer people see it, but it still blocks checkout for them. Waiting doesn't make it part of the task.","ar":"يراه عدد أقل من الناس، لكنه ما زال يقطع عليهم إرسال الطلب. والانتظار لا يجعله جزءًا من المهمة."}}],"correct":{"en":"Ask after the task, not in the middle of it.","ar":"اسأل بعد المهمة، لا في منتصفها."},"explain":{"en":"Once the order has arrived, a rating interrupts nothing, and people have something real to rate.","ar":"بعد وصول الطلب، لا يقاطع التقييم شيئًا، ويكون لدى الناس شيء حقيقي يقيّمونه."},"speaker":"tarek"},{"id":"S03","type":"tune","part":"check","skill":"SK-P14-U01-02","value":{"en":"Check, modal dialogs (NN/g): avoid them for decisions that need information unavailable in the modal. Picking a slot depends on the frozen-items rule shown on the page behind it.","ar":"اختبار، النوافذ الـ Modal (NN/g): تجنّبها للقرارات التي تحتاج معلومات غير موجودة في النافذة. واختيار الموعد يعتمد على شرط المجمّدات الظاهر في الصفحة خلفها."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/modal-nonmodal-dialog/","quote":"Avoid modal dialogs for complex decision making that requires additional sources of information unavailable in the modal."},"scenario":{"en":"The cart warns: \"Frozen items must be delivered within 2 hours of packing.\" People choose a delivery time in a dialog.","ar":"السلّة تنبّه: «المنتجات المجمّدة يجب أن تُوصَّل خلال ساعتين من تجهيزها.» والناس يختارون وقت التوصيل في Dialog."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each version. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل نسخة. أيّها يجب أن تُطلق؟"},"start":"modal","options":[{"id":"modal","text":{"en":"Keep the times in the dialog","ar":"أبقِ المواعيد في الـ Dialog"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"sallah","name":{"en":"Sallah","ar":"سلّة"},"color":"#2E9E5B","icon":"basket","domain":"sallah.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Cart","ar":"السلّة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"banner","icon":"snowflake","tone":"info","text":{"en":"Frozen items must be delivered within 2 hours of packing.","ar":"المنتجات المجمّدة يجب أن تُوصَّل خلال ساعتين من تجهيزها."}},{"kind":"listitem","art":"box","text":{"en":"Frozen peas, 400 g","ar":"بسلة مجمّدة، 400 جم"},"badge":{"text":{"en":"Frozen","ar":"مجمّد"},"tone":"neutral"},"value":{"en":"EGP 45","ar":"45 جنيه"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"listitem","art":"bread","text":{"en":"Baladi bread × 10","ar":"عيش بلدي × 10"},"value":{"en":"EGP 20","ar":"20 جنيه"}}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Choose delivery time","ar":"اختر وقت التوصيل"}}],"overlay":{"type":"dialog","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Delivery time","ar":"وقت التوصيل"}},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Today, 7–9 pm","ar":"اليوم، من 7 إلى 9 مساءً"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Tomorrow, 10 am–12 pm","ar":"غدًا، من 10 صباحًا إلى 12 ظهرًا"},"gap":"xs"}]}}},{"id":"link","text":{"en":"Keep the dialog; add a \"See cart\" link that closes it","ar":"أبقِ الـ Dialog؛ وأضف رابط «اعرض السلّة» يغلقه"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"sallah","name":{"en":"Sallah","ar":"سلّة"},"color":"#2E9E5B","icon":"basket","domain":"sallah.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Cart","ar":"السلّة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"banner","icon":"snowflake","tone":"info","text":{"en":"Frozen items must be delivered within 2 hours of packing.","ar":"المنتجات المجمّدة يجب أن تُوصَّل خلال ساعتين من تجهيزها."}},{"kind":"listitem","art":"box","text":{"en":"Frozen peas, 400 g","ar":"بسلة مجمّدة، 400 جم"},"badge":{"text":{"en":"Frozen","ar":"مجمّد"},"tone":"neutral"},"value":{"en":"EGP 45","ar":"45 جنيه"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"listitem","art":"bread","text":{"en":"Baladi bread × 10","ar":"عيش بلدي × 10"},"value":{"en":"EGP 20","ar":"20 جنيه"}}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Choose delivery time","ar":"اختر وقت التوصيل"}}],"overlay":{"type":"dialog","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Delivery time","ar":"وقت التوصيل"}},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Today, 7–9 pm","ar":"اليوم، من 7 إلى 9 مساءً"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Tomorrow, 10 am–12 pm","ar":"غدًا، من 10 صباحًا إلى 12 ظهرًا"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"link","text":{"en":"See cart","ar":"اعرض السلّة"},"gap":"m"}]}}},{"id":"page","text":{"en":"Choose the time on the checkout page, under the frozen-items note","ar":"اختر الوقت في صفحة إتمام الطلب، تحت ملاحظة المجمّدات"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"sallah","name":{"en":"Sallah","ar":"سلّة"},"color":"#2E9E5B","icon":"basket","domain":"sallah.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Delivery time","ar":"وقت التوصيل"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"banner","icon":"snowflake","tone":"info","text":{"en":"You have frozen items: pick a time within 2 hours of packing.","ar":"لديك منتجات مجمّدة: اختر وقتًا خلال ساعتين من التجهيز."}},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Today, 7–9 pm","ar":"اليوم، من 7 إلى 9 مساءً"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Tomorrow, 10 am–12 pm","ar":"غدًا، من 10 صباحًا إلى 12 ظهرًا"},"gap":"xs"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Confirm time","ar":"أكّد الموعد"}}]}}],"answer":["page"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P14-005","when":["modal","link"],"feedback":{"en":"The rule that decides the time is still hidden behind the dialog while people choose.","ar":"الشرط الذي يحسم الوقت ما زال مخفيًا خلف الـ Dialog وهم يختارون."}}],"correct":{"en":"The choice sits next to the rule it depends on.","ar":"الاختيار بجانب الشرط الذي يعتمد عليه."},"explain":{"en":"On the page, the frozen-items note sits right above the times, so people pick a slot that keeps their food frozen.","ar":"في الصفحة، تكون ملاحظة المجمّدات فوق المواعيد مباشرة، فيختار الناس موعدًا يحفظ طعامهم مجمّدًا."},"speaker":"tarek"},{"id":"S04","type":"tune","part":"check","skill":"SK-P14-U01-03","value":{"en":"Check, bottom sheets (NN/g): one of the biggest problems is stacking sheets. The replacement list fits in the same sheet.","ar":"اختبار، الـ Bottom sheets (NN/g): من أكبر المشكلات تكديس الـ Sheets. وقائمة البدائل تتّسع في الـ Sheet نفسه."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/bottom-sheet/","quote":"One of the biggest issues with bottom sheets occurs when an app stacks several such sheets on top of each other."},"scenario":{"en":"When an item is out of stock, a bottom sheet says so. Tapping **Choose a replacement** opens a second sheet on top with three similar items.","ar":"حين ينفد منتج، يظهر Bottom sheet يقول ذلك. والضغط على **اختر بديلًا** يفتح Sheet ثانيًا فوقه فيه ثلاثة منتجات مشابهة."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each version. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل نسخة. أيّها يجب أن تُطلق؟"},"start":"stack","options":[{"id":"stack","text":{"en":"Keep the second sheet on top","ar":"أبقِ الـ Sheet الثاني فوق الأول"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"sallah","name":{"en":"Sallah","ar":"سلّة"},"color":"#2E9E5B","icon":"basket","domain":"sallah.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Dairy","ar":"الألبان"},"back":true,"actions":[{"icon":"shopping-cart","count":12,"aria":{"en":"Cart","ar":"السلة"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","art":"box","text":{"en":"Low-fat milk, 1 L","ar":"لبن قليل الدسم، 1 لتر"},"badge":{"text":{"en":"Out of stock","ar":"نفد"},"tone":"warn"},"value":{"en":"EGP 38","ar":"38 جنيه"}},{"kind":"listitem","art":"box","text":{"en":"Yogurt, 4 cups","ar":"زبادي، 4 علب"},"value":{"en":"EGP 18","ar":"18 جنيه"}},{"kind":"listitem","art":"box","text":{"en":"White cheese, 500 g","ar":"جبنة بيضاء، 500 جم"},"value":{"en":"EGP 75","ar":"75 جنيه"}}],"overlay":{"type":"sheet","title":{"en":"Choose a replacement","ar":"اختر بديلًا"},"blocks":[{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Full-fat milk, 1 L","ar":"لبن كامل الدسم، 1 لتر"}},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Opened on top of the \"Out of stock\" sheet","ar":"فُتح فوق Sheet «نفد المنتج»"},"note":{"en":"2nd sheet","ar":"Sheet ثانٍ"},"gap":"s"}]}}},{"id":"one","text":{"en":"One sheet: the message and the three replacements together","ar":"Sheet واحد: الرسالة والبدائل الثلاثة معًا"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"sallah","name":{"en":"Sallah","ar":"سلّة"},"color":"#2E9E5B","icon":"basket","domain":"sallah.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Dairy","ar":"الألبان"},"back":true,"actions":[{"icon":"shopping-cart","count":12,"aria":{"en":"Cart","ar":"السلة"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","art":"box","text":{"en":"Low-fat milk, 1 L","ar":"لبن قليل الدسم، 1 لتر"},"badge":{"text":{"en":"Out of stock","ar":"نفد"},"tone":"warn"},"value":{"en":"EGP 38","ar":"38 جنيه"}},{"kind":"listitem","art":"box","text":{"en":"Yogurt, 4 cups","ar":"زبادي، 4 علب"},"value":{"en":"EGP 18","ar":"18 جنيه"}},{"kind":"listitem","art":"box","text":{"en":"White cheese, 500 g","ar":"جبنة بيضاء، 500 جم"},"value":{"en":"EGP 75","ar":"75 جنيه"}}],"overlay":{"type":"sheet","close":true,"title":{"en":"Low-fat milk is out of stock","ar":"نفد اللبن قليل الدسم"},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Pick a replacement:","ar":"اختر بديلًا:"}},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Full-fat milk, 1 L · EGP 40","ar":"لبن كامل الدسم، 1 لتر · 40 جنيه"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Skimmed milk, 1 L · EGP 39","ar":"لبن منزوع الدسم، 1 لتر · 39 جنيه"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"No replacement","ar":"بدون بديل"},"gap":"xs"}]}}},{"id":"full","text":{"en":"Open the replacements in a full-screen sheet on top","ar":"افتح البدائل في Sheet بملء الشاشة فوقه"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"sallah","name":{"en":"Sallah","ar":"سلّة"},"color":"#2E9E5B","icon":"basket","domain":"sallah.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Dairy","ar":"الألبان"},"back":true,"actions":[{"icon":"shopping-cart","count":12,"aria":{"en":"Cart","ar":"السلة"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","art":"box","text":{"en":"Low-fat milk, 1 L","ar":"لبن قليل الدسم، 1 لتر"},"badge":{"text":{"en":"Out of stock","ar":"نفد"},"tone":"warn"},"value":{"en":"EGP 38","ar":"38 جنيه"}},{"kind":"listitem","art":"box","text":{"en":"Yogurt, 4 cups","ar":"زبادي، 4 علب"},"value":{"en":"EGP 18","ar":"18 جنيه"}},{"kind":"listitem","art":"box","text":{"en":"White cheese, 500 g","ar":"جبنة بيضاء، 500 جم"},"value":{"en":"EGP 75","ar":"75 جنيه"}}],"overlay":{"type":"full","title":{"en":"Choose a replacement","ar":"اختر بديلًا"},"blocks":[{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Full-fat milk, 1 L","ar":"لبن كامل الدسم، 1 لتر"}},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Skimmed milk, 1 L","ar":"لبن منزوع الدسم، 1 لتر"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Still on top of the \"Out of stock\" sheet","ar":"ما زال فوق Sheet «نفد المنتج»"},"note":{"en":"On top of a sheet","ar":"فوق Sheet"},"gap":"s"}]}}}],"answer":["one"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P14-006","when":["stack","full"],"feedback":{"en":"It's still a sheet on top of a sheet. One swipe or Back can close both, and people lose track of which one they're in.","ar":"ما زال Sheet فوق Sheet. وسحبة واحدة أو زر الرجوع قد يغلق الاثنين، ولا يعرف الناس في أيّهما هم."}}],"correct":{"en":"One sheet, nothing stacked.","ar":"Sheet واحد، دون تكديس."},"explain":{"en":"Three replacements and a short message fit in one sheet, with a Close button, so the choice stays quick.","ar":"ثلاثة بدائل ورسالة قصيرة تتّسع في Sheet واحد، مع زر إغلاق، فيبقى الاختيار سريعًا."},"speaker":"tarek"},{"id":"S05","type":"tune","part":"check","skill":"SK-P14-U01-04","value":{"en":"Check, tooltips (NN/g): users shouldn't need to find a tooltip to complete their task. Whether a code works with the delivery discount decides what people pay.","ar":"اختبار، الـ Tooltips (NN/g): لا يجب أن يحتاج الناس إلى البحث عن Tooltip لإكمال مهمتهم. وهل يعمل الكود مع خصم التوصيل يحدّد ما يدفعه الناس."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/tooltip-guidelines/","quote":"Users shouldn't need to find a tooltip in order to complete their task."},"scenario":{"en":"A promo code replaces the free-delivery offer; the two can't be used together. That rule is only in a tooltip on the ⓘ next to the code field.","ar":"كود الخصم يحلّ محلّ عرض التوصيل المجاني؛ ولا يمكن استخدامهما معًا. وهذا الشرط موجود فقط في Tooltip على ⓘ بجانب حقل الكود."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each version. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل نسخة. أيّها يجب أن تُطلق؟"},"start":"tip","options":[{"id":"tip","text":{"en":"Keep the rule in the tooltip","ar":"أبقِ الشرط في الـ Tooltip"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"sallah","name":{"en":"Sallah","ar":"سلّة"},"color":"#2E9E5B","icon":"basket","domain":"sallah.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Cart","ar":"السلّة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"truck","text":{"en":"Free delivery applied","ar":"طُبّق التوصيل المجاني"},"value":{"en":"− EGP 25","ar":"− 25 جنيه"}},{"kind":"row","gap":"m","blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Promo code","ar":"كود الخصم"},"trail":"info","text":""},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Apply","ar":"طبّق"},"style":"outline"}]}]}},{"id":"shown","text":{"en":"Show the rule under the code field","ar":"اعرض الشرط تحت حقل الكود"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"sallah","name":{"en":"Sallah","ar":"سلّة"},"color":"#2E9E5B","icon":"basket","domain":"sallah.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Cart","ar":"السلّة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"truck","text":{"en":"Free delivery applied","ar":"طُبّق التوصيل المجاني"},"value":{"en":"− EGP 25","ar":"− 25 جنيه"}},{"kind":"row","gap":"m","blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Promo code","ar":"كود الخصم"},"text":"","hint":{"en":"A code replaces free delivery. You can't use both.","ar":"الكود يحلّ محلّ التوصيل المجاني. لا يمكن استخدامهما معًا."}},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Apply","ar":"طبّق"},"style":"outline"}]}]}},{"id":"longtip","text":{"en":"Keep the tooltip, and add the full promo terms to it","ar":"أبقِ الـ Tooltip، وأضف إليه كل شروط العروض"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"sallah","name":{"en":"Sallah","ar":"سلّة"},"color":"#2E9E5B","icon":"basket","domain":"sallah.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Cart","ar":"السلّة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"truck","text":{"en":"Free delivery applied","ar":"طُبّق التوصيل المجاني"},"value":{"en":"− EGP 25","ar":"− 25 جنيه"}},{"kind":"row","gap":"m","blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Promo code","ar":"كود الخصم"},"trail":"info","text":""},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Apply","ar":"طبّق"},"style":"outline"}]},{"kind":"tip","text":{"en":"Codes are valid once per customer, for orders over EGP 300, until the end date shown, and can't be combined with other offers, including free delivery.","ar":"الأكواد صالحة مرة واحدة لكل عميل، للطلبات فوق 300 جنيه، حتى تاريخ الانتهاء الظاهر، ولا تُجمع مع عروض أخرى، ومنها التوصيل المجاني."}}]}}],"answer":["shown"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P14-009","when":["tip","longtip"],"feedback":{"en":"The rule changes what people pay, but they still have to find it behind the ⓘ, and on a phone they may never open it.","ar":"الشرط يغيّر ما يدفعه الناس، لكن ما زال عليهم أن يجدوه خلف ⓘ، وعلى الهاتف قد لا يفتحونه أبدًا."}}],"correct":{"en":"It decides the price, so it goes on the screen.","ar":"يحدّد السعر، فمكانه الشاشة."},"explain":{"en":"Shown under the field, the rule is read at the moment people decide whether to use a code.","ar":"حين يظهر تحت الحقل، يقرأ الناس الشرط في اللحظة التي يقرّرون فيها هل يستخدمون كودًا."},"speaker":"tarek"},{"id":"S06","type":"tune","part":"check","skill":"SK-P14-U01-05","value":{"en":"Check, notifications (NN/g): passive notifications are easily missed. A card that expires this month is a lasting issue with an action, so it needs a message that stays until it's fixed, without blocking the app.","ar":"اختبار، الإشعارات (NN/g): الإشعارات التي لا تحتاج إجراءً يسهل أن تفوت الناس. والبطاقة التي تنتهي هذا الشهر مشكلة مستمرة لها إجراء، فتحتاج رسالة تبقى حتى تُحلّ، دون أن تحجب التطبيق."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/indicators-validations-notifications/","quote":"Passive notifications can easily be missed, since they require no user action."},"scenario":{"en":"A customer's saved card expires at the end of this month. Orders still work until then, but after that they'll fail unless the card is updated.","ar":"بطاقة أحد العملاء المحفوظة تنتهي آخر هذا الشهر. ويستطيع أن يطلب حتى ذلك الحين، لكن طلباته ستفشل بعده إن لم يحدّث البطاقة."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each version. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل نسخة. أيّها يجب أن تُطلق؟"},"start":"snack","options":[{"id":"snack","text":{"en":"A snackbar the next time they open the app","ar":"Snackbar في المرة القادمة التي يفتحون فيها التطبيق"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"sallah","name":{"en":"Sallah","ar":"سلّة"},"color":"#2E9E5B","icon":"basket","domain":"sallah.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Good evening, Mahmoud","ar":"مساء الخير يا محمود"},"logo":true,"actions":[{"icon":"shopping-cart","aria":{"en":"Cart","ar":"السلة"}}]},"tabbar":{"active":0,"items":[{"icon":"house","text":{"en":"Home","ar":"الرئيسية"}},{"icon":"squares-four","text":{"en":"Aisles","ar":"الأقسام"}},{"icon":"receipt","text":{"en":"Orders","ar":"طلباتي"}},{"icon":"user","text":{"en":"Account","ar":"حسابي"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"searchbar","text":{"en":"Search Sallah","ar":"ابحث في سلّة"}},{"kind":"card","gap":"m","blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"arrow-counter-clockwise","text":{"en":"Reorder your usual basket","ar":"أعد طلب سلّتك المعتادة"},"sub":{"en":"14 items · EGP 1,060","ar":"14 منتجًا · 1060 جنيه"},"chevron":true}]},{"kind":"row","gap":"m","blocks":[{"kind":"chip","icon":"drop","text":{"en":"Dairy","ar":"الألبان"}},{"kind":"chip","icon":"carrot","text":{"en":"Vegetables","ar":"الخضار"}},{"kind":"chip","icon":"bread","text":{"en":"Bakery","ar":"المخبوزات"}}]}],"overlay":{"type":"toast","blocks":[{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"Your card expires soon.","ar":"بطاقتك تنتهي قريبًا."}}]}}},{"id":"banner","text":{"en":"A banner with \"Update card\" that stays until it's updated","ar":"Banner فيه «حدّث البطاقة» يبقى حتى تُحدَّث"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"sallah","name":{"en":"Sallah","ar":"سلّة"},"color":"#2E9E5B","icon":"basket","domain":"sallah.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Good evening, Mahmoud","ar":"مساء الخير يا محمود"},"logo":true,"actions":[{"icon":"shopping-cart","aria":{"en":"Cart","ar":"السلة"}}]},"tabbar":{"active":0,"items":[{"icon":"house","text":{"en":"Home","ar":"الرئيسية"}},{"icon":"squares-four","text":{"en":"Aisles","ar":"الأقسام"}},{"icon":"receipt","text":{"en":"Orders","ar":"طلباتي"}},{"icon":"user","text":{"en":"Account","ar":"حسابي"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"banner","icon":"credit-card","tone":"warn","text":{"en":"Your Visa ending 1177 expires on 31 October.","ar":"تنتهي صلاحية بطاقتك Visa المنتهية بـ 1177 في 31 أكتوبر."}},{"kind":"link","text":{"en":"Update card","ar":"حدّث البطاقة"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"searchbar","text":{"en":"Search Sallah","ar":"ابحث في سلّة"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"card","gap":"m","blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"arrow-counter-clockwise","text":{"en":"Reorder your usual basket","ar":"أعد طلب سلّتك المعتادة"},"sub":{"en":"14 items · EGP 1,060","ar":"14 منتجًا · 1060 جنيه"},"chevron":true}]}]}},{"id":"dialog","text":{"en":"A dialog that blocks the app until the card is updated","ar":"Dialog يحجب التطبيق حتى تُحدَّث البطاقة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"sallah","name":{"en":"Sallah","ar":"سلّة"},"color":"#2E9E5B","icon":"basket","domain":"sallah.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Good evening, Mahmoud","ar":"مساء الخير يا محمود"},"logo":true,"actions":[{"icon":"shopping-cart","aria":{"en":"Cart","ar":"السلة"}}]},"tabbar":{"active":0,"items":[{"icon":"house","text":{"en":"Home","ar":"الرئيسية"}},{"icon":"squares-four","text":{"en":"Aisles","ar":"الأقسام"}},{"icon":"receipt","text":{"en":"Orders","ar":"طلباتي"}},{"icon":"user","text":{"en":"Account","ar":"حسابي"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"searchbar","text":{"en":"Search Sallah","ar":"ابحث في سلّة"}},{"kind":"card","gap":"m","blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"arrow-counter-clockwise","text":{"en":"Reorder your usual basket","ar":"أعد طلب سلّتك المعتادة"},"sub":{"en":"14 items · EGP 1,060","ar":"14 منتجًا · 1060 جنيه"},"chevron":true}]},{"kind":"row","gap":"m","blocks":[{"kind":"chip","icon":"drop","text":{"en":"Dairy","ar":"الألبان"}},{"kind":"chip","icon":"carrot","text":{"en":"Vegetables","ar":"الخضار"}},{"kind":"chip","icon":"bread","text":{"en":"Bakery","ar":"المخبوزات"}}]}],"overlay":{"type":"dialog","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Update your card","ar":"حدّث بطاقتك"}},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Your card expires on 31 October.","ar":"بطاقتك تنتهي في 31 أكتوبر."},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Update card","ar":"حدّث البطاقة"},"gap":"m"}]}}}],"answer":["banner"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P14-014","when":["snack"],"feedback":{"en":"The problem lasts all month, but the message disappears in seconds and may never be seen.","ar":"المشكلة تستمر طوال الشهر، لكن الرسالة تختفي في ثوانٍ وقد لا تُرى أبدًا."}},{"id":"MC-P14-013","when":["dialog"],"feedback":{"en":"Orders still work, so nothing has to stop people now. Blocking the app keeps them from shopping today.","ar":"ما زال الناس يستطيعون الطلب، فلا شيء يستدعي إيقافهم الآن. وحجب التطبيق يمنعهم من التسوّق اليوم."}}],"correct":{"en":"Matters and lasts: a banner until it's fixed.","ar":"أمر مهم ويستمر: Banner يبقى حتى تُحلّ المشكلة."},"explain":{"en":"The banner names the card and the date, carries the action, and stays until the card is updated, while people can keep ordering.","ar":"الـ Banner يذكر البطاقة والتاريخ، وفيه زر التحديث، ويبقى حتى تُحدَّث البطاقة، بينما يستمر الناس في الطلب."},"speaker":"tarek"}]}$uxg$::jsonb),
  ($uxg$P14-U02-L01$uxg$, $uxg$9d3550b60edd5495de1d102812069814635ae42cbac9f4c0e76d0cdb4b562eee$uxg$, $uxg${"id":"P14-U02-L01","mode":"lesson","minutes":8,"title":{"en":"Accordions: collapse what people skip","ar":"الـ Accordion: اطوِ ما يتخطّاه الناس"},"speaker":"tarek","review_labels":{"MC-P14-016":{"en":"Don't collapse what people read anyway","ar":"لا تطوِ ما سيقرؤه الناس على أي حال"},"MC-P14-017":{"en":"A long open page buries the part people came for","ar":"الصفحة الطويلة المفتوحة تُخفي الجزء الذي جاء الناس من أجله"},"MC-P14-018":{"en":"What's collapsed can be missed altogether","ar":"ما يُطوى قد لا يراه الناس أبدًا"}},"steps":[{"id":"S01","type":"card","part":"hook","title":{"en":"Laila's insurance app","ar":"ليلى وتطبيق التأمين"},"body":{"en":"In the insurance app I manage, Laila wants to know one thing: does her health plan cover a dental cleaning?\n\nShe opens **Your plan**. All nine sections are open, one under the other: doctors, hospitals, medicines, eyes, dental, maternity, abroad, claims and terms. Dental is the fifth section, five screens down.","ar":"في تطبيق التأمين الذي أديره، تريد ليلى أن تعرف شيئًا واحدًا: هل يغطّي تأمينها الصحي تنظيف الأسنان؟\n\nفتحت **خطّتك**. كل الأقسام التسعة مفتوحة، واحدًا تحت الآخر: الأطباء، والمستشفيات، والأدوية، والعيون، والأسنان، والولادة، والسفر، والمطالبات، والشروط. والأسنان هي القسم الخامس، ولا تصل إليه إلا بعد التمرير خمس شاشات."},"mock":{"app":{"id":"aman","name":{"en":"Aman","ar":"أمان"},"color":"#364FC7","icon":"shield-check","domain":"aman.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Your plan","ar":"خطّتك"},"back":true,"actions":[{"icon":"phone","aria":{"en":"Call us","ar":"اتصلي بنا"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"card","blocks":[{"kind":"badge","text":{"en":"Gold · Family","ar":"ذهبية · عائلية"},"icon":"shield-check"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Card no. 8812 4409 · valid to Dec 2027","ar":"بطاقة رقم 8812 4409 · سارية حتى ديسمبر 2027"},"gap":"xs"}]},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Doctors","ar":"الأطباء"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Visits to any doctor in the network are covered at 80%. Specialists need a referral from your family doctor, except for…","ar":"زيارات أي طبيب في الشبكة مغطّاة بنسبة 80%. والمتخصّصون يحتاجون تحويلًا من طبيب الأسرة، ما عدا…"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Hospitals","ar":"المستشفيات"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Stays in a shared room are fully covered. A private room is covered up to EGP 1,500 a night, and…","ar":"الإقامة في غرفة مشتركة مغطّاة بالكامل. والغرفة الخاصة مغطّاة حتى 1,500 جنيه في الليلة، و…"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Medicines","ar":"الأدوية"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Medicines on the plan's list are covered at 70% with a prescription…","ar":"الأدوية الموجودة في قائمة الخطّة مغطّاة بنسبة 70% مع روشتة…"},"gap":"xs"}]}},{"id":"S02","type":"tune","part":"try","skill":"SK-P14-U02-01","rules":["R12"],"confidence":true,"value":{"en":"Try first. Accordions (NN/g): use them on content-heavy pages where people need only a few sections; they scan the titles and skip the rest. Bigger headings still leave Laila scrolling past everything, and \"Show more\" hides sections she can't even see the names of.","ar":"جرّب أولًا. الـ Accordion (NN/g): استخدمه في الصفحات المليئة بالمحتوى حين يحتاج الناس أقسامًا قليلة؛ فيتصفّحون العناوين ويتخطّون الباقي. والعناوين الأكبر تترك ليلى تمرّ على كل شيء، و«اعرض المزيد» يخفي أقسامًا لا ترى حتى أسماءها."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/accordions-on-desktop/","quote":"When users need only a few pieces of information on the page, they will likely skip most of the content."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each version of the plan page. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل نسخة من صفحة الخطّة. أيّ نسخة توصل ليلى إلى قسم الأسنان بسرعة؟"},"start":"bigger","options":[{"id":"bigger","text":{"en":"Keep every section open, with bigger headings","ar":"أبقِ كل الأقسام مفتوحة، مع عناوين أكبر"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"Dental is still five screens down","ar":"الأسنان ما زالت بعد خمس شاشات"},"app":{"id":"aman","name":{"en":"Aman","ar":"أمان"},"color":"#364FC7","icon":"shield-check","domain":"aman.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Your plan","ar":"خطّتك"},"back":true,"actions":[{"icon":"phone","aria":{"en":"Call us","ar":"اتصلي بنا"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Doctors","ar":"الأطباء"}},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Visits to any doctor in the network are covered at 80%. Specialists need a referral from your family doctor, except for…","ar":"زيارات أي طبيب في الشبكة مغطّاة بنسبة 80%. والمتخصّصون يحتاجون تحويلًا من طبيب الأسرة، ما عدا…"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Hospitals","ar":"المستشفيات"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Stays in a shared room are fully covered. A private room is covered up to EGP 1,500 a night, and…","ar":"الإقامة في غرفة مشتركة مغطّاة بالكامل. والغرفة الخاصة مغطّاة حتى 1,500 جنيه في الليلة، و…"},"gap":"xs"}]}},{"id":"more","text":{"en":"Show the first three sections, and the rest behind \"Show more\"","ar":"اعرض الأقسام الثلاثة الأولى، والباقي خلف «اعرض المزيد»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"aman","name":{"en":"Aman","ar":"أمان"},"color":"#364FC7","icon":"shield-check","domain":"aman.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Your plan","ar":"خطّتك"},"back":true,"actions":[{"icon":"phone","aria":{"en":"Call us","ar":"اتصلي بنا"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Doctors","ar":"الأطباء"}},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Visits to any doctor in the network are covered at 80%…","ar":"زيارات أي طبيب في الشبكة مغطّاة بنسبة 80%…"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Hospitals","ar":"المستشفيات"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Stays in a shared room are fully covered…","ar":"الإقامة في غرفة مشتركة مغطّاة بالكامل…"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Medicines","ar":"الأدوية"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Medicines on the plan's list are covered at 70%…","ar":"الأدوية الموجودة في قائمة الخطّة مغطّاة بنسبة 70%…"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"button","style":"text","icon":"caret-down","text":{"en":"Show more","ar":"اعرض المزيد"},"gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"accordion","text":{"en":"Collapse each section under its title; tap a title to open it","ar":"اطوِ كل قسم تحت عنوانه؛ واضغط العنوان لفتحه"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"aman","name":{"en":"Aman","ar":"أمان"},"color":"#364FC7","icon":"shield-check","domain":"aman.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Your plan","ar":"خطّتك"},"back":true,"actions":[{"icon":"phone","aria":{"en":"Call us","ar":"اتصلي بنا"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"card","blocks":[{"kind":"badge","text":{"en":"Gold · Family","ar":"ذهبية · عائلية"},"icon":"shield-check"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Card no. 8812 4409","ar":"بطاقة رقم 8812 4409"},"gap":"xs"}]},{"kind":"accordion","text":{"en":"Doctors","ar":"الأطباء"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"accordion","text":{"en":"Hospitals","ar":"المستشفيات"}},{"kind":"accordion","text":{"en":"Medicines","ar":"الأدوية"}},{"kind":"accordion","text":{"en":"Eyes","ar":"العيون"}},{"kind":"accordion","text":{"en":"Dental","ar":"الأسنان"}},{"kind":"accordion","text":{"en":"Maternity","ar":"الولادة"}},{"kind":"accordion","text":{"en":"Abroad","ar":"السفر"}},{"kind":"accordion","text":{"en":"Claims","ar":"المطالبات"}},{"kind":"accordion","text":{"en":"Terms","ar":"الشروط"}}]}}],"answer":["accordion"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P14-017","when":["bigger"],"feedback":{"en":"The headings are easier to see, but Laila still scrolls past four full sections she doesn't need before she reaches Dental.","ar":"صارت رؤية العناوين أسهل، لكن ليلى ما زالت تمرّ على أربعة أقسام كاملة لا تحتاجها قبل أن تصل إلى الأسنان."}},{"id":"MC-P14-018","when":["more"],"feedback":{"en":"Dental is one of the hidden sections, and nothing on the screen says it's there. Laila may decide the plan doesn't mention dental at all.","ar":"قسم الأسنان من الأقسام المخفية، ولا شيء على الشاشة يدلّ على وجوده. فقد تظنّ ليلى أن الخطّة لا تذكر الأسنان أصلًا."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Which version lets Laila see the name of every section without scrolling past the others?","ar":"أيّ نسخة تجعل ليلى ترى اسم كل قسم دون أن تمرّ على الأقسام الأخرى؟"}],"correct":{"en":"She needs one section: titles first, details on tap.","ar":"تحتاج قسمًا واحدًا: العناوين أولًا، والتفاصيل عند الضغط."},"explain":{"en":"All nine titles now fit on one screen. Laila spots Dental, opens it, and never has to read about hospitals or maternity.","ar":"صارت العناوين التسعة كلها في شاشة واحدة. فترى ليلى «الأسنان» وتفتحه، ولا تحتاج أن تقرأ عن المستشفيات أو الولادة."}},{"id":"S09","type":"video","part":"concept","title":{"en":"Collapse what most people skip","ar":"اطوِ ما يتخطّاه أغلب الناس"},"video":"496c193b-b483-47af-9502-80325365de86","duration":173,"transcript":[{"t":2.5,"en":"But just as it has advantages, it surely has drawbacks. A main drawback of the accordion is that I see the data in separate pieces,","ar":"لكن زي ما فيه ميزات، أكيد فيه عيوب. ومن أهم عيوب الـ Accordion إنه بيخلّيني أشوف الداتا بشكل مقسّم،"},{"t":8.5,"en":"so I may not see all the data at once, and if I need to see all of it, I need many interactions, because I'll open each accordion on its own.","ar":"ممكن ماقدرش أشوف الداتا كلها في نفس الوقت، ولو محتاج أشوفها كلها، هحتاج أعمل Interactions كتير، لأني هفتح كل Accordion لوحده."},{"t":19.18,"en":"That's the second drawback: it raises the interaction cost. Even if I don't need them at the same time, but want data under several titles, I have to open each accordion to see what's inside.","ar":"وده العيب التاني: إنه بيزوّد الـ Interaction cost. حتى لو مش عايز أشوفهم في نفس الوقت، لكن عايز أشوف داتا تحت أكتر من عنوان، هحتاج أفتح كل Accordion عشان أشوف اللي جوّاه."},{"t":33.9,"en":"And the last one: it hurts discoverability. Sometimes the user never finds out certain data exists, because it's inside an accordion they didn't open and didn't expect under that title, so they may never know it's there.","ar":"وآخر حاجة إنه بيأثّر على الـ Discoverability: أحيانًا اليوزر مايكتشفش أصلًا إن فيه داتا معينة موجودة، لأنها جوّه Accordion مافتحهوش، وماتوقّعش إنها تحت العنوان ده، فممكن مايعرفش إنها موجودة."},{"t":49.24,"en":"So based on this, let's think about when accordions fit best. A drawback is that the user reaches the data in pieces, not all at once, and needs many interactions to see all of it.","ar":"فخلّينا بناءً على ده نفكّر إمتى يبقى أنسب وقت أستخدم فيه الـ Accordions. من السلبيات إن اليوزر هيوصل للداتا بشكل متقطّع، مش كلها في نفس الوقت، ولو عايز يشوفها كلها هيحتاج Interactions كتير."},{"t":63.4,"en":"The first good time to use accordions: when I know users won't need all the data on the page; they usually look at some of it, and there's a lot they usually don't need,","ar":"فأول وقت مناسب أستخدم فيه الـ Accordions: لو عندي معلومات بتقول إن اليوزرز مش هيحتاجوا كل الداتا اللي في الصفحة، لكن عادةً بيشوفوا جزء منها، وفيه داتا كتير مش بيحتاجوا يشوفوها،"},{"t":75.18,"en":"but it's important to have it there. Then I use accordions, and users see only the data they care about. I didn't load them with a high interaction cost, because I didn't use it where users want all the data in detail.","ar":"لكنها مهمة تكون موجودة. في الحالة دي هستخدم الـ Accordions، واليوزرز هيشوفوا الداتا اللي مهتمين بيها بس. ماحمّلتهمش Interaction cost عالي، لأني مااستخدمتوش في مكان اليوزرز عايزين يشوفوا فيه الداتا كلها بتفاصيلها."},{"t":89.6,"en":"The second good case for accordions: when the user goes through a step-by-step process. The first step sits in an accordion, and when they finish and tap Next, they move to the second step in another accordion,","ar":"تاني حالة يكون فيها استخدام الـ Accordions مناسب: لو اليوزر ماشي في Process خطوة بخطوة. أول Step تكون جوّه Accordion، ولما يخلّصها ويدوس Next يروح للـ Step التانية في Accordion تاني،"},{"t":104.84,"en":"and so on, each accordion leading to the next. The user understands these are steps in order, and can reopen the first one to go back.","ar":"وهكذا كل Accordion يودّيه للي بعده. فاليوزر هيفهم إن دي Steps ورا بعض، ولو عايز يرجع يفتح الأول تاني يقدر."},{"t":112.48,"en":"Like the checkout process in front of us: I enter the shipping address, then move to the next part, delivery and gift options, and so on. Each accordion leads to the next, so this use fits.","ar":"زي مثلًا الـ Checkout process اللي قدامنا: محتاج أدخّل الـ Shipping address، فأدخّل معلوماته، وبعدها أروح للمعلومات اللي بعدها، Delivery and gift options وهكذا. كل Accordion يودّيني للي بعده، فهنا الاستخدام مناسب."},{"t":128.52,"en":"The third case, a very good one: when the data is independent, with no piece depending on another, like FAQs. On an FAQ page the user faces a set of questions","ar":"تالت حالة يكون فيها استخدام الـ Accordions مناسب جدًا: لو عندي داتا Independent، مش معتمدة على بعض، زي الـ FAQs أو الأسئلة الشائعة. اليوزر لما يدخل صفحة الأسئلة الشائعة بيبقى قدّامه مجموعة أسئلة،"},{"t":144.38,"en":"that aren't related; they don't need to see them all at once, or many of them at all; they need the one or two they're looking for.","ar":"مالهاش علاقة ببعض، ومش محتاج يشوفها كلها في نفس الوقت، ولا محتاج يشوف أسئلة كتير أصلًا، محتاج سؤال أو اتنين بيدوّر عليهم."},{"t":154.18,"en":"So if all the question titles are in accordions, they see every title and open the ones they care about, and skip the rest. That way we avoid the drawbacks we mentioned.","ar":"فلو عناوين الأسئلة كلها موجودة في الـ Accordions، هيشوف كل العناوين، ويفتح الأسئلة اللي مهتم بيها، واللي مش مهتم بيها مش هيشوفها. وبكده تفادينا السلبيات اللي قلناها عن الـ Accordions."}]},{"id":"S03","type":"card","part":"concept","icons":["warn","eye","list","layers","ok"],"title":{"en":"Video summary","ar":"ملخص الفيديو"},"body":{"en":"An accordion shows a list of titles; each one opens its content in place.\n\n- **The cost:** content comes in pieces, every section costs a tap, and people can miss what sits in a panel they never open.\n- **Use it when people need only some of a long page**, like a plan's details. They scan the titles and open what they came for.\n- **Use it for steps in order**, like checkout: shipping address, then delivery options. Finishing one section opens the next, and people can reopen an earlier one to go back.\n- **Use it for separate items**, like an FAQ, where people want one or two answers, not all of them.\n- **Show everything** when people need most of the content. And never collapse what people must see, like a fee, a deadline or a warning.","ar":"الـ Accordion (قائمة أقسام تُفتح وتُطوى) يعرض عناوين؛ وكل عنوان يفتح محتواه في مكانه.\n\n- **التكلفة:** المحتوى يظهر مقسّمًا، وكل قسم يكلّف ضغطة، وقد لا يرى الناس ما في قسم لم يفتحوه.\n- **استخدمه حين يحتاج الناس جزءًا فقط من صفحة طويلة**، مثل تفاصيل خطّة. فيتصفّحون العناوين ويفتحون ما جاؤوا من أجله.\n- **استخدمه لخطوات بالترتيب**، مثل الـ Checkout (إتمام الشراء): عنوان الشحن، ثم خيارات التوصيل. إنهاء قسم يفتح التالي، ويستطيع الناس فتح قسم سابق للرجوع.\n- **استخدمه لعناصر منفصلة**، مثل الأسئلة الشائعة، حين يريد الناس إجابة أو اثنتين، لا كل الإجابات.\n- **اعرض كل شيء** حين يحتاج الناس أغلب المحتوى. ولا تطوِ أبدًا ما يجب أن يراه الناس، مثل رسوم أو موعد نهائي أو تحذير."}},{"id":"S04","type":"tune","speaker":"karim","part":"guided","skill":"SK-P14-U02-01","rules":["R06","R15"],"value":{"en":"Accordions (NN/g): if people need information from several sections at once, display all the content. Setup steps are all needed, in order, so collapsing them only adds taps and hides the step Nader just did.","ar":"الـ Accordion (NN/g): إن احتاج الناس معلومات من عدة أقسام معًا، فاعرض كل المحتوى. وخطوات التركيب كلها مطلوبة وبالترتيب، فطيّها يزيد الضغطات فقط ويُخفي الخطوة التي أنهاها نادر للتوّ."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/accordions-on-desktop/","quote":"If you expect users to need information from several accordions at once, it is better to display all the content at once"},"scenario":{"en":"I'm building the help pages for an internet company. Nader is setting up a new router at home. The help page has six short steps. He has to do every step, in order, looking from the page to the router and back.","ar":"أبني صفحات المساعدة لشركة إنترنت. يركّب نادر راوترًا جديدًا في البيت. وصفحة المساعدة فيها ست خطوات قصيرة. وعليه أن ينفّذ كل خطوة بالترتيب، وهو ينظر إلى الصفحة ثم إلى الراوتر ثم يعود."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each version of the help page. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل نسخة من صفحة المساعدة. أيّ نسخة تتيح لنادر أن يتبع الخطوات الست بالترتيب دون ضغطات إضافية؟"},"start":"collapsed","options":[{"id":"list","text":{"en":"All six steps open, as one numbered list","ar":"الخطوات الست مفتوحة، في قائمة واحدة مرقّمة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"shabaka","name":{"en":"Shabaka","ar":"شبكة"},"color":"#0891B2","icon":"wifi-high","domain":"shabaka.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Set up your router","ar":"ركّب الراوتر"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"workshop","size":"s","alt":{"en":"Router on a desk","ar":"راوتر على مكتب"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"plug","text":{"en":"1. Plug in the cable","ar":"1. وصّل السلك"},"sub":{"en":"Use the yellow port marked WAN.","ar":"استخدم المنفذ الأصفر المكتوب عليه WAN."},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"power","text":{"en":"2. Turn it on","ar":"2. شغّله"},"sub":{"en":"Press the button on the back for 2 seconds.","ar":"اضغط الزر الخلفي لمدة ثانيتين."}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"lightbulb","text":{"en":"3. Wait for the green light","ar":"3. انتظر الضوء الأخضر"},"sub":{"en":"It takes about a minute.","ar":"يستغرق ذلك دقيقة تقريبًا."}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"wifi-high","text":{"en":"4. Join the network","ar":"4. اتصل بالشبكة"},"sub":{"en":"The name and password are on the sticker.","ar":"الاسم وكلمة المرور على الملصق."}}]}},{"id":"collapsed","text":{"en":"Each step collapsed under its title","ar":"كل خطوة مطويّة تحت عنوانها"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"shabaka","name":{"en":"Shabaka","ar":"شبكة"},"color":"#0891B2","icon":"wifi-high","domain":"shabaka.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Set up your router","ar":"ركّب الراوتر"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"workshop","size":"s","alt":{"en":"Router on a desk","ar":"راوتر على مكتب"}},{"kind":"accordion","text":{"en":"1. Plug in the cable","ar":"1. وصّل السلك"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"accordion","text":{"en":"2. Turn it on","ar":"2. شغّله"}},{"kind":"accordion","text":{"en":"3. Wait for the green light","ar":"3. انتظر الضوء الأخضر"}},{"kind":"accordion","text":{"en":"4. Join the network","ar":"4. اتصل بالشبكة"}}]}},{"id":"one","text":{"en":"Only one step open at a time; opening the next closes the last","ar":"خطوة واحدة مفتوحة في كل مرة؛ وفتح التالية يغلق السابقة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"shabaka","name":{"en":"Shabaka","ar":"شبكة"},"color":"#0891B2","icon":"wifi-high","domain":"shabaka.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Set up your router","ar":"ركّب الراوتر"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"workshop","size":"s","alt":{"en":"Router on a desk","ar":"راوتر على مكتب"}},{"kind":"accordion","text":{"en":"1. Plug in the cable","ar":"1. وصّل السلك"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"accordion","text":{"en":"2. Turn it on","ar":"2. شغّله"},"open":true,"blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Press the button on the back for 2 seconds.","ar":"اضغط الزر الخلفي لمدة ثانيتين."}}]},{"kind":"accordion","text":{"en":"3. Wait for the green light","ar":"3. انتظر الضوء الأخضر"}},{"kind":"accordion","text":{"en":"4. Join the network","ar":"4. اتصل بالشبكة"}}]}}],"answer":["list"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P14-016","when":["collapsed","one"],"feedback":{"en":"Nader needs every step, so he'll open every one anyway. Each open is an extra tap while he's holding a cable, and he can't glance back at the step he just did.","ar":"نادر يحتاج كل خطوة، فسيفتحها كلها على أي حال. وكل فتح ضغطة إضافية وهو يمسك السلك، ولا يستطيع أن يلقي نظرة على الخطوة التي أنهاها للتوّ."}}],"correct":{"en":"He needs it all: show it all.","ar":"يحتاج كل شيء: اعرض كل شيء."},"explain":{"en":"The steps are short and all needed, in order. One open list lets Nader read, act and look back without a single extra tap.","ar":"الخطوات قصيرة وكلها مطلوبة بالترتيب. والقائمة المفتوحة تجعل نادر يقرأ وينفّذ ويرجع إلى الخطوة السابقة بنظرة، دون أي ضغطة إضافية."}},{"id":"S05","type":"tune","part":"guided","skill":"SK-P14-U02-02","rules":["R06","R15"],"confidence":true,"value":{"en":"Accordions (NN/g): avoid hiding crucial information within collapsed panels. A 30-day claim deadline decides whether Laila gets her money back, and she has no reason to open Claims before her visit.","ar":"الـ Accordion (NN/g): تجنّب إخفاء أي معلومة مهمة داخل الأقسام المطويّة. ومهلة الثلاثين يومًا للمطالبة تحدّد هل تسترد ليلى مالها، وليس لديها سبب لفتح «المطالبات» قبل زيارتها."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/accordions-on-desktop/","quote":"Avoid hiding any crucial information within the collapsed panels."},"scenario":{"en":"Laila's plan pays for a visit only if she sends the receipt within 30 days. Right now, that rule is inside the collapsed **Claims** section, and she only plans to open Dental.","ar":"خطّة ليلى لا تدفع قيمة الزيارة إلا إن أرسلت الإيصال خلال 30 يومًا. والآن هذا الشرط داخل قسم **المطالبات** المطويّ، وهي لا تنوي أن تفتح إلا «الأسنان»."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each version. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل نسخة. أيّها يجب أن تُطلق؟"},"start":"inside","options":[{"id":"above","text":{"en":"Show the rule above the sections, always visible","ar":"اعرض الشرط فوق الأقسام، ظاهرًا دائمًا"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"aman","name":{"en":"Aman","ar":"أمان"},"color":"#364FC7","icon":"shield-check","domain":"aman.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Your plan","ar":"خطّتك"},"back":true,"actions":[{"icon":"phone","aria":{"en":"Call us","ar":"اتصلي بنا"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"banner","icon":"receipt","tone":"warn","text":{"en":"Send receipts within 30 days of a visit, or it won't be paid.","ar":"أرسلي الإيصال خلال 30 يومًا من الزيارة، وإلا فلن تُدفع قيمتها."}},{"kind":"accordion","text":{"en":"Dental","ar":"الأسنان"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"accordion","text":{"en":"Maternity","ar":"الولادة"}},{"kind":"accordion","text":{"en":"Claims","ar":"المطالبات"}},{"kind":"accordion","text":{"en":"Terms","ar":"الشروط"}}]}},{"id":"inside","text":{"en":"Keep the rule inside Claims","ar":"أبقِ الشرط داخل «المطالبات»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"aman","name":{"en":"Aman","ar":"أمان"},"color":"#364FC7","icon":"shield-check","domain":"aman.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Your plan","ar":"خطّتك"},"back":true,"actions":[{"icon":"phone","aria":{"en":"Call us","ar":"اتصلي بنا"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"card","blocks":[{"kind":"badge","text":{"en":"Gold · Family","ar":"ذهبية · عائلية"},"icon":"shield-check"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Card no. 8812 4409","ar":"بطاقة رقم 8812 4409"},"gap":"xs"}]},{"kind":"accordion","text":{"en":"Doctors","ar":"الأطباء"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"accordion","text":{"en":"Hospitals","ar":"المستشفيات"}},{"kind":"accordion","text":{"en":"Medicines","ar":"الأدوية"}},{"kind":"accordion","text":{"en":"Eyes","ar":"العيون"}},{"kind":"accordion","text":{"en":"Dental","ar":"الأسنان"}},{"kind":"accordion","text":{"en":"Maternity","ar":"الولادة"}},{"kind":"accordion","text":{"en":"Abroad","ar":"السفر"}},{"kind":"accordion","text":{"en":"Claims","ar":"المطالبات"}},{"kind":"accordion","text":{"en":"Terms","ar":"الشروط"}}]}},{"id":"label","text":{"en":"Keep it inside, but rename the title \"Claims (important)\"","ar":"أبقِه بالداخل، لكن غيّر العنوان إلى «المطالبات (مهم)»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"aman","name":{"en":"Aman","ar":"أمان"},"color":"#364FC7","icon":"shield-check","domain":"aman.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Your plan","ar":"خطّتك"},"back":true,"actions":[{"icon":"phone","aria":{"en":"Call us","ar":"اتصلي بنا"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"accordion","text":{"en":"Dental","ar":"الأسنان"}},{"kind":"accordion","text":{"en":"Maternity","ar":"الولادة"}},{"kind":"accordion","text":{"en":"Claims (important)","ar":"المطالبات (مهم)"}},{"kind":"accordion","text":{"en":"Terms","ar":"الشروط"}}]}}],"answer":["above"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P14-018","when":["inside","label"],"feedback":{"en":"Laila opens only Dental. \"Important\" doesn't tell her what the rule is, so she can still miss the deadline and lose the money.","ar":"ليلى تفتح «الأسنان» فقط. وكلمة «مهم» لا تقول لها ما الشرط، فقد تفوتها المهلة وتخسر المال."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Will Laila see the 30-day rule if she opens only Dental?","ar":"هل سترى ليلى شرط الثلاثين يومًا إن فتحت «الأسنان» فقط؟"}],"correct":{"en":"It can cost her money: keep it in sight.","ar":"قد يكلّفها مالًا: أبقِه ظاهرًا."},"explain":{"en":"Above the sections, the deadline is seen by everyone who opens the plan, whichever section they came for. The details can stay in Claims.","ar":"فوق الأقسام، يرى المهلة كل من يفتح الخطّة، أيًّا كان القسم الذي جاء من أجله. ويمكن أن تبقى التفاصيل في «المطالبات»."},"speaker":"tarek"},{"id":"S06","type":"compare","speaker":"rami","part":"contrast","skill":"SK-P14-U02-02","rules":["R11"],"value":{"en":"Accordions (NN/g): valuable content hidden under an accordion may be missed altogether. A no-refund rule changes whether Ghada buys at all, so it belongs next to the Buy button, not in a closed panel.","ar":"الـ Accordion (NN/g): المحتوى المهم المخفي تحت Accordion قد يفوت الناس تمامًا. وشرط «لا استرداد» يغيّر قرار غادة بالشراء أصلًا، فمكانه بجانب زر الشراء، لا في قسم مطويّ."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/accordions-on-desktop/","quote":"Valuable content that is hidden under an accordion may be missed altogether."},"scenario":{"en":"I'm designing a theatre ticket page. Ghada is buying a ticket for EGP 1,200. Once bought, the ticket can't be refunded. The page has collapsed sections for the venue, the seating and refunds.","ar":"أصمّم صفحة لتذاكر المسرح. تشتري غادة تذكرة بسعر 1,200 جنيه. وبعد الشراء، لا يمكن استرداد قيمة التذكرة. والصفحة فيها أقسام مطويّة للمكان والمقاعد والاسترداد."},"prompt":{"en":"Which version should ship?","ar":"أيّ نسخة يجب أن تُطلق؟"},"a":{"label":{"en":"Version A: the rule in a line above Buy","ar":"النسخة A: الشرط في سطر فوق «اشترِ»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"tazkara","name":{"en":"Tazkara","ar":"تذكرة"},"color":"#C026D3","icon":"ticket","domain":"tazkara.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Play","ar":"مسرحية"},"back":true,"actions":[{"icon":"share-network","aria":{"en":"Share","ar":"شارك"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"city-night","size":"m","alt":{"en":"Theatre stage","ar":"خشبة المسرح"}},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Play · Fri 8 pm","ar":"مسرحية · الجمعة 8 م"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"EGP 1,200","ar":"1,200 جنيه"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"small","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"This ticket can't be refunded.","ar":"لا يمكن استرداد قيمة هذه التذكرة."},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"accordion","text":{"en":"Venue","ar":"المكان"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"accordion","text":{"en":"Seating","ar":"المقاعد"}},{"kind":"accordion","text":{"en":"Refunds","ar":"الاسترداد"}}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Buy ticket","ar":"اشترِ التذكرة"}}]}},"b":{"label":{"en":"Version B: the rule inside Refunds","ar":"النسخة B: الشرط داخل «الاسترداد»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"tazkara","name":{"en":"Tazkara","ar":"تذكرة"},"color":"#C026D3","icon":"ticket","domain":"tazkara.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Play","ar":"مسرحية"},"back":true,"actions":[{"icon":"share-network","aria":{"en":"Share","ar":"شارك"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"city-night","size":"m","alt":{"en":"Theatre stage","ar":"خشبة المسرح"}},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Play · Fri 8 pm","ar":"مسرحية · الجمعة 8 م"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"EGP 1,200","ar":"1,200 جنيه"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"accordion","text":{"en":"Venue","ar":"المكان"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"accordion","text":{"en":"Seating","ar":"المقاعد"}},{"kind":"accordion","text":{"en":"Refunds","ar":"الاسترداد"}}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Buy ticket","ar":"اشترِ التذكرة"}}]}},"answer":"a","misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P14-018","when":["b"],"feedback":{"en":"Ghada has no reason to open Refunds before she buys. She'd learn the rule only when she tries to get her money back.","ar":"ليس لدى غادة سبب لفتح «الاسترداد» قبل الشراء. ولن تعرف الشرط إلا حين تحاول استرداد مالها."}}],"correct":{"en":"A: the rule that changes the decision sits next to it.","ar":"A: الشرط الذي يغيّر القرار بجانب زر الشراء."},"explain":{"en":"One short line above Buy is enough for Ghada to decide knowing the rule. The other details can stay collapsed.","ar":"سطر قصير فوق «اشترِ» يكفي لتقرّر غادة وهي تعرف الشرط. ويمكن أن تبقى التفاصيل الأخرى مطويّة."}},{"id":"S07","type":"tune","speaker":"mona","part":"independent","skill":"SK-P14-U02-01","rules":["R14"],"value":{"en":"Accordions (NN/g): FAQ pages are good candidates for accordions. Each visitor comes with one or two questions; titles let them find theirs, and removing questions means some visitors never find an answer.","ar":"الـ Accordion (NN/g): صفحات الأسئلة الشائعة مناسبة جدًا للـ Accordion. فكل زائر يأتي بسؤال أو اثنين؛ والعناوين تجعله يجد سؤاله، وحذف أسئلة يعني أن بعض الزوار لن يجدوا جوابًا أبدًا."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/accordions-on-desktop/","quote":"FAQ pages and product-detail sections are good candidates for accordions."},"scenario":{"en":"My team designs a courier company's website. It has 14 common questions, about tracking, prices, missed deliveries and more. The questions don't depend on each other, and most visitors come with just one.","ar":"يصمّم فريقي موقع شركة شحن. وفيه 14 سؤالًا شائعًا، عن التتبّع والأسعار وما يحدث إن فاتك التوصيل، وغيرها. والأسئلة لا تعتمد على بعضها، وأغلب الزوار يأتون بسؤال واحد فقط."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each version of the help page. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل نسخة من صفحة المساعدة. أيّها يجب أن تُطلق؟"},"start":"open","options":[{"id":"open","text":{"en":"All 14 questions and answers open","ar":"الأسئلة الـ 14 وأجوبتها مفتوحة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"tard","name":{"en":"Tard","ar":"طرد"},"color":"#7C3AED","icon":"package","domain":"tard.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"tard.example/help","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Send","ar":"أرسل"},{"en":"Track","ar":"تتبّع"},{"en":"Help","ar":"المساعدة"}],"active":2,"actions":[{"icon":"user"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Help","ar":"المساعدة"}},{"kind":"text","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"How do I track my parcel?","ar":"كيف أتتبّع شحنتي؟"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Enter the 10-digit code from your text message on the Track page. Updates appear every few hours…","ar":"أدخل الرمز المكوّن من 10 أرقام من رسالتك في صفحة التتبّع. وتظهر التحديثات كل بضع ساعات…"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"text","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"How much does sending a parcel cost?","ar":"كم تكلفة إرسال شحنة؟"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Prices depend on weight and distance. Within the same city, a parcel up to 2 kg costs…","ar":"الأسعار تعتمد على الوزن والمسافة. وداخل المدينة نفسها، الشحنة حتى 2 كجم تكلّف…"},"gap":"xs"}]}},{"id":"acc","text":{"en":"The 14 questions as an accordion: tap one to see its answer","ar":"الأسئلة الـ 14 في Accordion: اضغط سؤالًا لترى جوابه"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"tard","name":{"en":"Tard","ar":"طرد"},"color":"#7C3AED","icon":"package","domain":"tard.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"tard.example/help","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Send","ar":"أرسل"},{"en":"Track","ar":"تتبّع"},{"en":"Help","ar":"المساعدة"}],"active":2,"actions":[{"icon":"user"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Help","ar":"المساعدة"}},{"kind":"searchbar","text":{"en":"Search help","ar":"ابحث في المساعدة"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"accordion","text":{"en":"How do I track my parcel?","ar":"كيف أتتبّع شحنتي؟"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"accordion","text":{"en":"How much does sending a parcel cost?","ar":"كم تكلفة إرسال شحنة؟"}},{"kind":"accordion","text":{"en":"What happens if I miss a delivery?","ar":"ماذا يحدث إن فاتني التوصيل؟"}},{"kind":"accordion","text":{"en":"Can I change the delivery address?","ar":"هل يمكنني تغيير عنوان التوصيل؟"}},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"+ 10 more questions","ar":"+ 10 أسئلة أخرى"},"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"top","text":{"en":"Only the 5 most asked questions; remove the other 9","ar":"أكثر 5 أسئلة طرحًا فقط؛ واحذف الأسئلة التسعة الأخرى"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"tard","name":{"en":"Tard","ar":"طرد"},"color":"#7C3AED","icon":"package","domain":"tard.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"tard.example/help","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Send","ar":"أرسل"},{"en":"Track","ar":"تتبّع"},{"en":"Help","ar":"المساعدة"}],"active":2,"actions":[{"icon":"user"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Help","ar":"المساعدة"}},{"kind":"text","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"How do I track my parcel?","ar":"كيف أتتبّع شحنتي؟"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Enter the 10-digit code from your text message…","ar":"أدخل الرمز المكوّن من 10 أرقام من رسالتك…"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"text","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"How much does sending a parcel cost?","ar":"كم تكلفة إرسال شحنة؟"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Prices depend on weight and distance…","ar":"الأسعار تعتمد على الوزن والمسافة…"},"gap":"xs"}]}}],"answer":["acc"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P14-017","when":["open"],"feedback":{"en":"A visitor with a question about a missed delivery has to read past every other answer to find it. On a wide screen, that's still a very long page.","ar":"الزائر الذي يسأل عن توصيل فاته عليه أن يقرأ كل الأجوبة الأخرى ليجد سؤاله. وحتى على شاشة عريضة، تبقى الصفحة طويلة جدًا."}},{"id":"MC-P14-018","when":["top"],"feedback":{"en":"The page is short, but a visitor whose question was one of the 9 removed finds nothing at all. Collapsing keeps every answer; removing loses it.","ar":"صارت الصفحة قصيرة، لكن الزائر الذي كان سؤاله من الأسئلة التسعة المحذوفة لن يجد شيئًا. فالطيّ يُبقي كل جواب؛ أما الحذف فيُضيّعه."}}],"correct":{"en":"Independent questions, one needed: an accordion.","ar":"أسئلة مستقلّة، والمطلوب واحد: Accordion."},"explain":{"en":"Every visitor scans 14 short titles, opens theirs and skips the rest. No answer is lost, and the page stays short.","ar":"كل زائر يتصفّح 14 عنوانًا قصيرًا، ويفتح سؤاله ويتخطّى الباقي. ولا يضيع أي جواب، وتبقى الصفحة قصيرة."}},{"id":"S08","type":"card","part":"recap","icons":["layers","eye","warn"],"title":{"en":"What you practised","ar":"ما تدرّبت عليه"},"body":{"en":"- **Accordion** when people need a few sections: a plan's details, an FAQ.\n- **Everything open** when people need it all, like setup steps they follow in order.\n- **Never collapsed:** a deadline or a rule that changes the decision, like \"no refunds\".\n\nNext: which action gets the loudest button.","ar":"- **الـ Accordion** حين يحتاج الناس أقسامًا قليلة: تفاصيل خطّة، أو أسئلة شائعة.\n- **كل شيء مفتوح** حين يحتاج الناس المحتوى كله، مثل خطوات تركيب يتبعونها بالترتيب.\n- **لا يُطوى أبدًا:** موعد نهائي أو شرط يغيّر القرار، مثل «لا استرداد».\n\nالتالي: أيّ إجراء يأخذ أوضح زر."}}]}$uxg$::jsonb),
  ($uxg$P14-U02-L02$uxg$, $uxg$078dd4c14e064c09ba121f302e94d5393583d0287ea7720e2e1d8ffd193c5b46$uxg$, $uxg${"id":"P14-U02-L02","mode":"lesson","minutes":8,"title":{"en":"One loud button, the rest in reach","ar":"زر واحد واضح، والباقي في المتناول"},"speaker":"nour","review_labels":{"MC-P14-019":{"en":"Same style reads as same importance","ar":"الشكل نفسه يعني الأهمية نفسها"},"MC-P14-020":{"en":"The loudest button belongs to the step forward","ar":"أوضح زر للخطوة التالية"},"MC-P14-021":{"en":"Don't hide what people use often","ar":"لا تُخفِ ما يستخدمه الناس كثيرًا"},"MC-P14-022":{"en":"Rare actions don't need a button each","ar":"الإجراءات النادرة لا تحتاج زرًا لكل منها"}},"steps":[{"id":"S01","type":"card","part":"hook","title":{"en":"Ashraf's appointment","ar":"موعد أشرف"},"body":{"en":"I manage a clinic, and Ashraf is booking a check-up in our app. On the last screen, he sees four buttons, all the same size and the same blue: **Confirm booking**, **Change time**, **Add to calendar** and **Cancel**.\n\nHe stops and reads all four before he dares to tap one.","ar":"أدير عيادة، ويحجز أشرف موعد فحص في تطبيقنا. وفي الشاشة الأخيرة، يرى أربعة أزرار، كلها بالحجم نفسه واللون الأزرق نفسه: **أكّد الحجز**، و**غيّر الموعد**، و**أضف إلى التقويم**، و**إلغاء**.\n\nفيتوقّف ويقرأ الأربعة قبل أن يجرؤ على الضغط على أحدها."},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Your appointment","ar":"موعدك"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","avatar":{"text":"Samia Hassan","art":"doctor"},"text":{"en":"Dr. Samia","ar":"د. سامية"},"sub":{"en":"Family doctor · 4.8 ★","ar":"طبيبة أسرة · 4.8 ★"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"calendar-blank","text":{"en":"Sun 10:30 am","ar":"الأحد 10:30 ص"},"sub":{"en":"Raha Clinic, Dokki","ar":"عيادة راحة، الدقي"},"value":{"en":"EGP 450","ar":"450 جنيه"},"gap":"s"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Confirm booking","ar":"أكّد الحجز"}},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Change time","ar":"غيّر الموعد"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Add to calendar","ar":"أضف إلى التقويم"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Cancel","ar":"إلغاء"},"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"S02","type":"tune","part":"try","skill":"SK-P14-U02-03","rules":["R12"],"confidence":true,"value":{"en":"Try first. Similarity (NN/g): same-color buttons are seen as equally important, so a separate color is kept for the primary action. A rainbow of colors still makes every button compete, and bold text alone doesn't separate them.","ar":"جرّب أولًا. مبدأ التشابه (NN/g): الأزرار ذات اللون نفسه تبدو متساوية في الأهمية، لذلك يُخصَّص لون منفصل للإجراء الرئيسي. وتلوين كل زر بلون مختلف يجعل الأزرار كلها تتنافس، والخط العريض وحده لا يميّزها."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/gestalt-similarity/","quote":"Same-color buttons will be perceived as sharing the same level of importance."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each version of the last screen. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل نسخة من الشاشة الأخيرة. أيّ نسخة تجعل أشرف يعرف فورًا أيّ زر يؤكّد الحجز؟"},"start":"colors","options":[{"id":"colors","text":{"en":"Give each button its own color","ar":"أعطِ كل زر لونًا خاصًا به"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Your appointment","ar":"موعدك"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","avatar":{"text":"Samia Hassan","art":"doctor"},"text":{"en":"Dr. Samia","ar":"د. سامية"},"sub":{"en":"Family doctor · 4.8 ★","ar":"طبيبة أسرة · 4.8 ★"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"calendar-blank","text":{"en":"Sun 10:30 am","ar":"الأحد 10:30 ص"},"sub":{"en":"Raha Clinic, Dokki","ar":"عيادة راحة، الدقي"},"value":{"en":"EGP 450","ar":"450 جنيه"},"gap":"s"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Confirm booking","ar":"أكّد الحجز"}},{"kind":"button","tone":"warn","text":{"en":"Change time","ar":"غيّر الموعد"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","tone":"off","text":{"en":"Add to calendar","ar":"أضف إلى التقويم"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","style":"danger","text":{"en":"Cancel","ar":"إلغاء"},"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"one","text":{"en":"Keep Confirm filled; make the other three outlined or text","ar":"أبقِ «أكّد الحجز» ممتلئًا؛ واجعل الثلاثة الأخرى بإطار فقط أو نصّية فقط"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Your appointment","ar":"موعدك"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","avatar":{"text":"Samia Hassan","art":"doctor"},"text":{"en":"Dr. Samia","ar":"د. سامية"},"sub":{"en":"Family doctor · 4.8 ★","ar":"طبيبة أسرة · 4.8 ★"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"calendar-blank","text":{"en":"Sun 10:30 am","ar":"الأحد 10:30 ص"},"sub":{"en":"Raha Clinic, Dokki","ar":"عيادة راحة، الدقي"},"value":{"en":"EGP 450","ar":"450 جنيه"},"gap":"s"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Confirm booking","ar":"أكّد الحجز"}},{"kind":"button","style":"outline","icon":"clock","text":{"en":"Change time","ar":"غيّر الموعد"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","style":"outline","icon":"calendar-plus","text":{"en":"Add to calendar","ar":"أضف إلى التقويم"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","style":"text","text":{"en":"Cancel","ar":"إلغاء"},"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"bold","text":{"en":"Keep all four blue; make the Confirm label bold and bigger","ar":"أبقِ الأربعة باللون الأزرق؛ واجعل نص «أكّد الحجز» عريضًا وأكبر"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Your appointment","ar":"موعدك"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","avatar":{"text":"Samia Hassan","art":"doctor"},"text":{"en":"Dr. Samia","ar":"د. سامية"},"sub":{"en":"Family doctor · 4.8 ★","ar":"طبيبة أسرة · 4.8 ★"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"calendar-blank","text":{"en":"Sun 10:30 am","ar":"الأحد 10:30 ص"},"sub":{"en":"Raha Clinic, Dokki","ar":"عيادة راحة، الدقي"},"value":{"en":"EGP 450","ar":"450 جنيه"},"gap":"s"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","px":19,"text":{"en":"Confirm booking","ar":"أكّد الحجز"}},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Change time","ar":"غيّر الموعد"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Add to calendar","ar":"أضف إلى التقويم"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Cancel","ar":"إلغاء"},"gap":"s"}]}}],"answer":["one"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P14-019","when":["colors"],"feedback":{"en":"Now every button shouts in a different color, and red Cancel is the loudest. Ashraf still has to read all four to find the one that books.","ar":"الآن كل زر يلفت الانتباه بلون مختلف، و«إلغاء» الأحمر هو الأبرز. وما زال على أشرف أن يقرأ الأربعة ليجد الزر الذي يحجز."}},{"id":"MC-P14-019","when":["bold"],"feedback":{"en":"Four identical blue blocks still look equally important. A slightly bigger label doesn't tell Ashraf which one moves him forward.","ar":"أربع كتل زرقاء متطابقة ما زالت تبدو متساوية في الأهمية. والنص الأكبر قليلًا لا يقول لأشرف أيّها يُكمل به الحجز."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Which version gives only one button the filled blue?","ar":"أيّ نسخة تعطي زرًا واحدًا فقط اللون الأزرق الممتلئ؟"}],"correct":{"en":"One filled button: the step forward.","ar":"زر واحد ممتلئ للخطوة التالية."},"explain":{"en":"Ashraf's eye goes straight to the only filled button, Confirm booking. The other actions are still there, quieter, for when he needs them.","ar":"تذهب عين أشرف مباشرة إلى الزر الممتلئ الوحيد، «أكّد الحجز». والإجراءات الأخرى ما زالت موجودة، بشكل أهدأ، حين يحتاجها."}},{"id":"S09","type":"video","part":"concept","title":{"en":"One loud action, the rest in reach","ar":"إجراء واحد واضح، والباقي في المتناول"},"video":"b643d63e-6c5a-4129-b2d6-a64304d62889","duration":50,"transcript":[{"t":2.5,"en":"Looking at the Material Design guidelines, we learn that a button is a component that lets me take an action, so I don't need one for every single action,","ar":"لو شفنا الـ Guidelines بتاعة الـ Material Design، هنعرف إن الـ Button نوع من الـ Components اللي بتخلّيني آخد Action، وبالتالي مش محتاج أستخدمه بشكل كبير لكل Action،"},{"t":13.12,"en":"putting a button for anything I add to the page, especially when the buttons are all the same type we just covered, say, all filled.","ar":"وكل ما أحتاج أحطّ حاجة في الصفحة أحطّ لها Button، بالذات لو الـ Buttons كلها من نفس الـ Type، من الأنواع اللي قلناها من شوية، لو حطّيتهم كلهم Filled مثلًا."},{"t":22.74,"en":"Put several buttons on one screen and it gets annoying: too many actions. I may not need to show all those actions at all; I can group some of them in a menu, for example,","ar":"لو حطّيت أكتر من Button في نفس الـ Screen، الموضوع بيبقى مزعج، Actions كتير. ممكن أصلًا ماكنتش محتاج أعرض الـ Actions دي كلها، وأقدر أجمع مجموعة منها في Menu مثلًا،"},{"t":32.58,"en":"or in any other component that helps the user take an action. But using many buttons on one screen isn't the best, especially of the same type. That's our first guideline.","ar":"أو في أي Component تانية بتساعد اليوزر ياخد Action. لكن مش أفضل حاجة إني أستخدم Buttons كتير في نفس الـ Screen، بالذات لو من نفس النوع. ودي أول Guideline معانا."}]},{"id":"S03","type":"card","part":"concept","icons":["warn","tap","layers","list"],"title":{"en":"Video summary","ar":"ملخص الفيديو"},"body":{"en":"Buttons that look the same look equally important.\n\n- **Not a button for every action:** a screen full of filled buttons is noisy, and nothing stands out.\n- **One filled button** per area, in its own color, for the action that moves people forward.\n- **Quieter styles** for the rest: outlined, or text only. They stay easy to find, without competing.\n- **Frequent actions stay on the screen. Rare, low-priority ones can go into a ⋯ menu** or another component. People find and use hidden actions less, so never hide the ones they use often.","ar":"الأزرار التي تبدو متشابهة تبدو متساوية في الأهمية.\n\n- **لا تضع زرًا لكل إجراء:** الشاشة المليئة بأزرار ممتلئة مزدحمة، ولا يبرز فيها شيء.\n- **زر واحد ممتلئ** في كل منطقة، بلون خاص به، للإجراء الذي ينقل الناس إلى الخطوة التالية.\n- **أشكال أهدأ** للباقي: بإطار فقط، أو نص فقط. فتبقى سهلة الإيجاد، دون أن تتنافس.\n- **الإجراءات المتكرّرة تبقى على الشاشة. والنادرة قليلة الأهمية يمكن أن تذهب إلى قائمة ⋯** أو مكوّن آخر (Component). فالناس يجدون الإجراءات المخفية ويستخدمونها أقل، لذلك لا تُخفِ أبدًا ما يستخدمونه كثيرًا."}},{"id":"S04","type":"tune","speaker":"youssef","part":"guided","skill":"SK-P14-U02-03","rules":["R06","R15"],"value":{"en":"Similarity (NN/g): a separate color is reserved for the primary call to action so it stands out among secondary buttons. In a cart, the step forward is Checkout; giving that color to Continue shopping points people backwards.","ar":"مبدأ التشابه (NN/g): يُخصَّص لون منفصل للإجراء الرئيسي حتى يبرز بين الأزرار الثانوية. وفي السلّة، الخطوة إلى الأمام هي «إتمام الشراء»؛ وإعطاء هذا اللون لـ«متابعة التسوّق» يوجّه الناس إلى الخلف."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/gestalt-similarity/","quote":"Thus, a separate color should be reserved for primary calls-to-action to help them stand out among secondary buttons."},"scenario":{"en":"My clothing shop has an app. Salma has three items in her cart. At the bottom of the cart are two buttons: **Checkout** and **Continue shopping**.","ar":"متجر الملابس الذي أملكه له تطبيق. في سلّة سلمى ثلاث قطع. وفي أسفل السلّة زرّان: **إتمام الشراء** و**متابعة التسوّق**."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each version of the cart. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل نسخة من السلّة. أيّ نسخة توضّح لسلمى الزر الذي يُنهي طلبها؟"},"start":"both","options":[{"id":"both","text":{"en":"Both buttons filled","ar":"الزرّان ممتلئان"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Cart (3)","ar":"السلّة (3)"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","art":"sneakers","text":{"en":"Running shoes","ar":"حذاء جري"},"sub":{"en":"Size 42 · Qty 1","ar":"مقاس 42 · الكمية 1"},"value":{"en":"EGP 950","ar":"950 جنيه"}},{"kind":"listitem","art":"shirt","text":{"en":"Cotton T-shirt","ar":"تيشيرت قطن"},"sub":{"en":"M · Qty 2","ar":"M · الكمية 2"},"value":{"en":"EGP 500","ar":"500 جنيه"}},{"kind":"divider","gap":"s"},{"kind":"row","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"text","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Total","ar":"الإجمالي"}},{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"EGP 1,450","ar":"1,450 جنيه"}}]}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Continue shopping","ar":"متابعة التسوّق"}},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Checkout","ar":"إتمام الشراء"},"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"reversed","text":{"en":"Continue shopping filled; Checkout outlined","ar":"«متابعة التسوّق» ممتلئ؛ و«إتمام الشراء» بإطار فقط"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Cart (3)","ar":"السلّة (3)"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","art":"sneakers","text":{"en":"Running shoes","ar":"حذاء جري"},"sub":{"en":"Size 42 · Qty 1","ar":"مقاس 42 · الكمية 1"},"value":{"en":"EGP 950","ar":"950 جنيه"}},{"kind":"listitem","art":"shirt","text":{"en":"Cotton T-shirt","ar":"تيشيرت قطن"},"sub":{"en":"M · Qty 2","ar":"M · الكمية 2"},"value":{"en":"EGP 500","ar":"500 جنيه"}},{"kind":"divider","gap":"s"},{"kind":"row","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"text","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Total","ar":"الإجمالي"}},{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"EGP 1,450","ar":"1,450 جنيه"}}]}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Continue shopping","ar":"متابعة التسوّق"}},{"kind":"button","style":"outline","text":{"en":"Checkout","ar":"إتمام الشراء"},"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"checkout","text":{"en":"Checkout filled; Continue shopping as a text button","ar":"«إتمام الشراء» ممتلئ؛ و«متابعة التسوّق» زر نصي"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Cart (3)","ar":"السلّة (3)"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","art":"sneakers","text":{"en":"Running shoes","ar":"حذاء جري"},"sub":{"en":"Size 42 · Qty 1","ar":"مقاس 42 · الكمية 1"},"value":{"en":"EGP 950","ar":"950 جنيه"}},{"kind":"listitem","art":"shirt","text":{"en":"Cotton T-shirt","ar":"تيشيرت قطن"},"sub":{"en":"M · Qty 2","ar":"M · الكمية 2"},"value":{"en":"EGP 500","ar":"500 جنيه"}},{"kind":"divider","gap":"s"},{"kind":"row","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"text","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Total","ar":"الإجمالي"}},{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"EGP 1,450","ar":"1,450 جنيه"}}]}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Checkout","ar":"إتمام الشراء"}},{"kind":"button","style":"text","text":{"en":"Continue shopping","ar":"متابعة التسوّق"},"gap":"s"}]}}],"answer":["checkout"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P14-019","when":["both"],"feedback":{"en":"Two filled buttons look equally important, so Salma has to read both. Nothing tells her which one finishes the order.","ar":"الزرّان الممتلئان يبدوان متساويين في الأهمية، فعلى سلمى أن تقرأ الاثنين. ولا شيء يقول لها أيّهما يُنهي الطلب."}},{"id":"MC-P14-020","when":["reversed"],"feedback":{"en":"The loudest button now sends Salma away from her cart. The step that finishes her order is the one that looks less important.","ar":"أوضح زر الآن يُبعد سلمى عن سلّتها. والخطوة التي تُنهي طلبها هي التي تبدو أقل أهمية."}}],"correct":{"en":"Filled for the step forward: Checkout.","ar":"الزر الممتلئ للخطوة التالية: «إتمام الشراء»."},"explain":{"en":"Salma came to the cart to pay, so Checkout gets the filled style. Continue shopping is still one tap away, just quieter.","ar":"جاءت سلمى إلى السلّة لتدفع، لذلك يأخذ «إتمام الشراء» الشكل الممتلئ. و«متابعة التسوّق» ما زال بضغطة واحدة، لكن بشكل أهدأ."}},{"id":"S05","type":"tune","part":"guided","skill":"SK-P14-U02-04","rules":["R06","R15"],"confidence":true,"value":{"en":"Contextual menus (NN/g): they're best for secondary or low-priority options, not for actions people rely on often. Message is used often, so it stays visible; Share and Report are rare, so they can go in the ⋯ menu.","ar":"قوائم السياق (NN/g): أفضل استخدام لها للخيارات الثانوية أو قليلة الأهمية، لا للإجراءات التي يعتمد عليها الناس كثيرًا. و«راسل» يُستخدم كثيرًا، فيبقى ظاهرًا؛ أما «شارك» و«أبلِغ» فنادران، فيمكن أن يذهبا إلى قائمة ⋯."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/contextual-menus-guidelines/","quote":"Contextual menus are not appropriate for actions users rely on frequently."},"scenario":{"en":"On a doctor's page in our clinic app, most patients tap **Book**. Many also tap **Message** to ask a question first. **Share** and **Report a problem** are rarely used.","ar":"في صفحة الطبيب في تطبيق عيادتنا، أغلب المرضى يضغطون **احجز**. وكثيرون يضغطون أيضًا **راسل** ليسألوا سؤالًا أولًا. أما **شارك** و**أبلِغ عن مشكلة** فنادرًا ما يُستخدمان."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each version of the doctor's page. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل نسخة من صفحة الطبيب. أيّ نسخة تُبقي ما يستخدمه أغلب المرضى ظاهرًا دون أن تزحم الصفحة؟"},"start":"all","options":[{"id":"all","text":{"en":"All four as buttons","ar":"الأربعة أزرارًا ظاهرة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Doctor","ar":"الطبيبة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"avatar","text":"Samia Hassan","art":"doctor","size":"l"},{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Dr. Samia","ar":"د. سامية"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Family doctor · 4.8 ★ · 12 years","ar":"طبيبة أسرة · 4.8 ★ · 12 سنة خبرة"},"gap":"xs"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Book","ar":"احجز"}},{"kind":"button","style":"outline","text":{"en":"Message","ar":"راسل"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","style":"outline","text":{"en":"Share","ar":"شارك"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","style":"outline","text":{"en":"Report a problem","ar":"أبلِغ عن مشكلة"},"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"menu3","text":{"en":"Book as a button; Message, Share and Report in a ⋯ menu","ar":"«احجز» زرًا ظاهرًا؛ و«راسل» و«شارك» و«أبلِغ» في قائمة ⋯"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Doctor","ar":"الطبيبة"},"back":true,"actions":[{"icon":"dots-three-vertical","aria":{"en":"More","ar":"المزيد"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"avatar","text":"Samia Hassan","art":"doctor","size":"l"},{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Dr. Samia","ar":"د. سامية"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Family doctor · 4.8 ★ · 12 years","ar":"طبيبة أسرة · 4.8 ★ · 12 سنة خبرة"},"gap":"xs"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Book","ar":"احجز"}}]}},{"id":"menu2","text":{"en":"Book and Message as buttons; Share and Report in a ⋯ menu","ar":"«احجز» و«راسل» زرّين ظاهرين؛ و«شارك» و«أبلِغ» في قائمة ⋯"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Doctor","ar":"الطبيبة"},"back":true,"actions":[{"icon":"dots-three-vertical","aria":{"en":"More","ar":"المزيد"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"avatar","text":"Samia Hassan","art":"doctor","size":"l"},{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Dr. Samia","ar":"د. سامية"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Family doctor · 4.8 ★ · 12 years","ar":"طبيبة أسرة · 4.8 ★ · 12 سنة خبرة"},"gap":"xs"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Book","ar":"احجز"}},{"kind":"button","style":"outline","text":{"en":"Message","ar":"راسل"},"gap":"s"}]}}],"answer":["menu2"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P14-022","when":["all"],"feedback":{"en":"Share and Report are rarely used, yet they take as much room as Message. Four buttons in a stack make the page busier for everyone.","ar":"«شارك» و«أبلِغ» نادرًا ما يُستخدمان، ومع ذلك يأخذان مساحة «راسل» نفسها. وأربعة أزرار متتالية تجعل الصفحة أكثر ازدحامًا للجميع."}},{"id":"MC-P14-021","when":["menu3"],"feedback":{"en":"Many patients message before they book, and now Message is hidden behind ⋯. Some of them won't find it at all.","ar":"كثير من المرضى يراسلون قبل الحجز، والآن «راسل» مخفي خلف ⋯. وبعضهم لن يجده أصلًا."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Which actions do many patients use, and which are rare?","ar":"أيّ الإجراءات يستخدمها كثير من المرضى، وأيّها نادر؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Often used: on screen. Rare: in the menu.","ar":"المتكرّر: على الشاشة. والنادر: في القائمة."},"explain":{"en":"Book and Message, the two actions most patients use, are one tap away. Share and Report wait in ⋯ for the few who need them.","ar":"«احجز» و«راسل»، الإجراءان اللذان يستخدمهما أغلب المرضى، بضغطة واحدة. و«شارك» و«أبلِغ» ينتظران في ⋯ للقلّة التي تحتاجهما."},"speaker":"nour"},{"id":"S06","type":"compare","speaker":"sara","part":"contrast","skill":"SK-P14-U02-04","rules":["R11"],"value":{"en":"Contextual menus (NN/g): people are less likely to find or use actions hidden in a menu. Tamer edits most of his photos, so Edit hidden behind ⋯ costs him an extra tap on almost every photo, and some people never find it.","ar":"قوائم السياق (NN/g): الناس أقل قدرة على إيجاد أو استخدام الإجراءات المخفية في قائمة. وتامر يعدّل أغلب صوره، فإخفاء «عدّل» خلف ⋯ يكلّفه ضغطة إضافية في كل صورة تقريبًا، وبعض الناس لا يجدونه أبدًا."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/contextual-menus-guidelines/","quote":"Users are less likely to find or use actions hidden in contextual menus"},"scenario":{"en":"I'm designing a photo app. Tamer edits most photos in it before he posts them. He deletes a photo now and then, and almost never opens a photo's details.","ar":"أصمّم تطبيقًا للصور. يعدّل فيه تامر أغلب الصور قبل أن ينشرها. ويحذف صورة من حين لآخر، ونادرًا جدًا ما يفتح تفاصيل صورة."},"prompt":{"en":"Which version should ship?","ar":"أيّ نسخة يجب أن تُطلق؟"},"a":{"label":{"en":"Version A: Edit, Delete and Details all in ⋯","ar":"النسخة A: «عدّل» و«احذف» و«التفاصيل» كلها في ⋯"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"suwar","name":{"en":"Suwar","ar":"صور"},"color":"#2563EB","icon":"images","domain":"suwar.example"},"theme":"dark","appbar":{"title":{"en":"Beach, June","ar":"البحر، يونيو"},"back":true,"actions":[{"icon":"dots-three-vertical","aria":{"en":"More","ar":"المزيد"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"beach","size":"l","alt":{"en":"Beach photo","ar":"صورة البحر"}},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"12 June · 3.2 MB","ar":"12 يونيو · 3.2 ميجابايت"},"gap":"s"}]}},"b":{"label":{"en":"Version B: Edit on screen; Delete and Details in ⋯","ar":"النسخة B: «عدّل» على الشاشة؛ و«احذف» و«التفاصيل» في ⋯"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"suwar","name":{"en":"Suwar","ar":"صور"},"color":"#2563EB","icon":"images","domain":"suwar.example"},"theme":"dark","appbar":{"title":{"en":"Beach, June","ar":"البحر، يونيو"},"back":true,"actions":[{"icon":"dots-three-vertical","aria":{"en":"More","ar":"المزيد"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"beach","size":"l","alt":{"en":"Beach photo","ar":"صورة البحر"}},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"12 June · 3.2 MB","ar":"12 يونيو · 3.2 ميجابايت"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","style":"outline","icon":"pencil-simple","text":{"en":"Edit","ar":"عدّل"},"gap":"s"}]}},"answer":"b","misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P14-021","when":["a"],"feedback":{"en":"Tamer edits almost every photo, so he'd open ⋯ almost every time. The action he uses most is the hardest one to reach.","ar":"تامر يعدّل كل صورة تقريبًا، فسيفتح ⋯ كل مرة تقريبًا. والإجراء الذي يستخدمه أكثر صار أصعب إجراء في الوصول."}}],"correct":{"en":"B: the action he uses most stays in sight.","ar":"B: الإجراء الذي يستخدمه أكثر يبقى ظاهرًا."},"explain":{"en":"Edit is one tap on every photo. Delete and Details are rare, so the menu keeps them close without crowding the screen.","ar":"«عدّل» بضغطة واحدة في كل صورة. و«احذف» و«التفاصيل» نادران، فالقائمة تُبقيهما قريبين دون أن تزدحم الشاشة."}},{"id":"S07","type":"tune","speaker":"karim","part":"independent","skill":"SK-P14-U02-03","rules":["R14"],"value":{"en":"Similarity (NN/g): when the submit button looks like the secondary actions, people spend time working out which one submits. Three outlined buttons at the end of an application leave Heba guessing; three filled ones do too.","ar":"مبدأ التشابه (NN/g): حين يشبه زر الإرسال الإجراءات الثانوية، يضيّع الناس وقتًا ليعرفوا أيّها يرسل. وثلاثة أزرار بإطار فقط في نهاية طلب التوظيف تترك هبة تخمّن؛ وثلاثة ممتلئة كذلك."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/gestalt-similarity/","quote":"Same-color buttons will be perceived as sharing the same level of importance."},"scenario":{"en":"I'm building a company's careers website. Heba is applying for a job on it, on her laptop. At the end of the form are three buttons: **Preview**, **Save draft** and **Submit application**. Right now they're all outlined.","ar":"أبني موقع التوظيف لشركة. تتقدّم فيه هبة لوظيفة على الـ Laptop. وفي نهاية النموذج ثلاثة أزرار: **معاينة**، و**احفظ مسودة**، و**أرسل الطلب**. وكلها الآن بإطار فقط."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each version. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل نسخة. أيّها يجب أن تُطلق؟"},"start":"outlined","options":[{"id":"submit","text":{"en":"Submit filled; Preview and Save draft outlined","ar":"«أرسل الطلب» ممتلئ؛ و«معاينة» و«احفظ مسودة» بإطار فقط"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"wazifa","name":{"en":"Wazifa","ar":"وظيفة"},"color":"#1971C2","icon":"identification-card","domain":"wazifa.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"wazifa.example/apply/review","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Jobs","ar":"الوظائف"},{"en":"My applications","ar":"طلباتي"},{"en":"Profile","ar":"الملف"}],"active":1,"actions":[{"icon":"bell"},{"icon":"user"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"progress","value":100,"label":{"en":"Step 4 of 4","ar":"الخطوة 4 من 4"}},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Review and send","ar":"راجِعي وأرسلي"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"briefcase","text":{"en":"Product designer · Cairo","ar":"مصممة منتجات · القاهرة"},"sub":{"en":"CV and portfolio attached","ar":"السيرة الذاتية والأعمال مرفقة"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"row","gap":"l","blocks":[{"kind":"button","style":"outline","text":{"en":"Preview","ar":"معاينة"}},{"kind":"button","style":"outline","text":{"en":"Save draft","ar":"احفظي مسودة"}},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Submit application","ar":"أرسلي الطلب"}}]}]}},{"id":"outlined","text":{"en":"Keep all three outlined","ar":"أبقِ الثلاثة بإطار فقط"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"wazifa","name":{"en":"Wazifa","ar":"وظيفة"},"color":"#1971C2","icon":"identification-card","domain":"wazifa.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"wazifa.example/apply/review","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Jobs","ar":"الوظائف"},{"en":"My applications","ar":"طلباتي"},{"en":"Profile","ar":"الملف"}],"active":1,"actions":[{"icon":"bell"},{"icon":"user"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"progress","value":100,"label":{"en":"Step 4 of 4","ar":"الخطوة 4 من 4"}},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Review and send","ar":"راجِعي وأرسلي"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"briefcase","text":{"en":"Product designer · Cairo","ar":"مصممة منتجات · القاهرة"},"sub":{"en":"CV and portfolio attached","ar":"السيرة الذاتية والأعمال مرفقة"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"row","gap":"l","blocks":[{"kind":"button","style":"outline","text":{"en":"Preview","ar":"معاينة"}},{"kind":"button","style":"outline","text":{"en":"Save draft","ar":"احفظي مسودة"}},{"kind":"button","style":"outline","text":{"en":"Submit application","ar":"أرسلي الطلب"}}]}]}},{"id":"filled","text":{"en":"Make all three filled","ar":"اجعل الثلاثة ممتلئة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"wazifa","name":{"en":"Wazifa","ar":"وظيفة"},"color":"#1971C2","icon":"identification-card","domain":"wazifa.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"wazifa.example/apply/review","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Jobs","ar":"الوظائف"},{"en":"My applications","ar":"طلباتي"},{"en":"Profile","ar":"الملف"}],"active":1,"actions":[{"icon":"bell"},{"icon":"user"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"progress","value":100,"label":{"en":"Step 4 of 4","ar":"الخطوة 4 من 4"}},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Review and send","ar":"راجِعي وأرسلي"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"briefcase","text":{"en":"Product designer · Cairo","ar":"مصممة منتجات · القاهرة"},"sub":{"en":"CV and portfolio attached","ar":"السيرة الذاتية والأعمال مرفقة"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"row","gap":"l","blocks":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Preview","ar":"معاينة"}},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Save draft","ar":"احفظي مسودة"}},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Submit application","ar":"أرسلي الطلب"}}]}]}}],"answer":["submit"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P14-019","when":["outlined","filled"],"feedback":{"en":"All three look the same, so Heba has to read each label to find the one that sends her application. Same style, same importance.","ar":"الثلاثة تبدو متشابهة، فعلى هبة أن تقرأ كل نص لتجد الزر الذي يرسل طلبها. فالشكل نفسه يعني الأهمية نفسها."}}],"correct":{"en":"One filled button: Submit.","ar":"زر واحد ممتلئ: «أرسل الطلب»."},"explain":{"en":"Submit is the step Heba came to take, so it alone is filled. Preview and Save draft are still right there, without competing with it.","ar":"الإرسال هو الخطوة التي جاءت هبة لتنفّذها، لذلك هو وحده الممتلئ. و«معاينة» و«احفظ مسودة» ما زالا بجانبه، دون أن ينافساه."}},{"id":"S08","type":"card","part":"recap","icons":["tap","layers","list"],"title":{"en":"What you practised","ar":"ما تدرّبت عليه"},"body":{"en":"- **One filled button** per area, for the step forward: Confirm, Checkout, Submit.\n- **Quieter styles** for the other actions, so they don't compete.\n- **Frequent actions on screen**, rare ones in a ⋯ menu.\n\nNext: when an action earns a floating button.","ar":"- **زر واحد ممتلئ** في كل منطقة، للخطوة التالية: التأكيد، أو إتمام الشراء، أو الإرسال.\n- **أشكال أهدأ** للإجراءات الأخرى، حتى لا تتنافس.\n- **الإجراءات المتكرّرة على الشاشة**، والنادرة في قائمة ⋯.\n\nالتالي: متى يستحق إجراءٌ زرًا عائمًا."}}]}$uxg$::jsonb),
  ($uxg$P14-U02-L03$uxg$, $uxg$a19ecfef2dd04e4713cb886435f1c5a9f7832ecb4c212b347dc415bfb42840c8$uxg$, $uxg${"id":"P14-U02-L03","mode":"lesson","minutes":7,"title":{"en":"When an action earns a floating button","ar":"متى يستحق إجراءٌ زرًا عائمًا (Floating action button)؟"},"speaker":"sara","review_labels":{"MC-P14-023":{"en":"The floating button is for the screen's main action only","ar":"الزر العائم للإجراء الرئيسي في الشاشة فقط"},"MC-P14-024":{"en":"An unclear icon needs a visible label","ar":"الأيقونة غير الواضحة تحتاج تسمية ظاهرة"}},"steps":[{"id":"S01","type":"card","part":"hook","title":{"en":"Sara's recipe app","ar":"تطبيق سارة للوصفات"},"body":{"en":"I'm designing a recipe app. People open it mostly to post their own recipes and to browse others'.\n\nMy team added a round floating button in the corner of the home screen. It asks people to **rate the app**, because we want more ratings.","ar":"أصمّم تطبيقًا للوصفات. والناس يفتحونه غالبًا لينشروا وصفاتهم ويتصفّحوا وصفات غيرهم.\n\nوأضاف فريقي زرًا دائريًا عائمًا في زاوية الشاشة الرئيسية. وهو يطلب من الناس **تقييم التطبيق**، لأننا نريد تقييمات أكثر."},"mock":{"app":{"id":"tabkha","name":{"en":"Tabkha","ar":"طبخة"},"color":"#EA580C","icon":"cooking-pot","domain":"tabkha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Recipes","ar":"الوصفات"},"logo":true,"actions":[{"icon":"magnifying-glass","aria":{"en":"Search","ar":"بحث"}}]},"tabbar":{"active":0,"items":[{"icon":"house","text":{"en":"Home","ar":"الرئيسية"}},{"icon":"bookmark-simple","text":{"en":"Saved","ar":"المحفوظة"}},{"icon":"user","text":{"en":"Me","ar":"حسابي"}}]},"fab":{"icon":"star"},"blocks":[{"kind":"card","art":"food-salad","blocks":[{"kind":"text","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Lentil soup in 20 minutes","ar":"شوربة عدس في 20 دقيقة"}},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"by Amal · 1.2k saves · ★ 4.8","ar":"من أمل · 1.2 ألف حفظ · ★ 4.8"},"gap":"xs"}]},{"kind":"card","art":"food-grill","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"text","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Grilled kofta with tahini","ar":"كفتة مشوية بالطحينة"}},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"by Omar · 860 saves · ★ 4.6","ar":"من عمر · 860 حفظ · ★ 4.6"},"gap":"xs"}]}]}},{"id":"S02","type":"tune","part":"try","skill":"SK-P14-U02-05","rules":["R12"],"confidence":true,"value":{"en":"Try first. Floating buttons (NN/g glossary): a floating button is typically used for the most commonly used and important action on the screen. In a recipe app, that's posting a recipe, not rating the app or opening settings.","ar":"جرّب أولًا. الأزرار العائمة (مسرد NN/g): يُستخدم الزر العائم عادةً للإجراء الأكثر استخدامًا وأهمية في الشاشة. وفي تطبيق وصفات، هذا الإجراء هو نشر وصفة، لا تقييم التطبيق ولا فتح الإعدادات."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/ui-elements-glossary/","quote":"A floating button is typically used for the most commonly used and important action on the screen."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each action in the floating button. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل إجراء في الزر العائم. أيّ إجراء يخدم ما يفتح أغلب الناس التطبيق من أجله؟"},"start":"rate","options":[{"id":"rate","text":{"en":"★ Rate the app","ar":"★ قيّم التطبيق"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"tabkha","name":{"en":"Tabkha","ar":"طبخة"},"color":"#EA580C","icon":"cooking-pot","domain":"tabkha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Recipes","ar":"الوصفات"},"logo":true,"actions":[{"icon":"magnifying-glass","aria":{"en":"Search","ar":"بحث"}}]},"tabbar":{"active":0,"items":[{"icon":"house","text":{"en":"Home","ar":"الرئيسية"}},{"icon":"bookmark-simple","text":{"en":"Saved","ar":"المحفوظة"}},{"icon":"user","text":{"en":"Me","ar":"حسابي"}}]},"fab":{"icon":"star","text":{"en":"Rate us","ar":"قيّمنا"}},"blocks":[{"kind":"card","art":"food-salad","blocks":[{"kind":"text","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Lentil soup in 20 minutes","ar":"شوربة عدس في 20 دقيقة"}},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"by Amal · 1.2k saves · ★ 4.8","ar":"من أمل · 1.2 ألف حفظ · ★ 4.8"},"gap":"xs"}]},{"kind":"card","art":"food-grill","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"text","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Grilled kofta with tahini","ar":"كفتة مشوية بالطحينة"}},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"by Omar · 860 saves · ★ 4.6","ar":"من عمر · 860 حفظ · ★ 4.6"},"gap":"xs"}]}]}},{"id":"post","text":{"en":"＋ Post a recipe","ar":"＋ انشر وصفة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"tabkha","name":{"en":"Tabkha","ar":"طبخة"},"color":"#EA580C","icon":"cooking-pot","domain":"tabkha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Recipes","ar":"الوصفات"},"logo":true,"actions":[{"icon":"magnifying-glass","aria":{"en":"Search","ar":"بحث"}}]},"tabbar":{"active":0,"items":[{"icon":"house","text":{"en":"Home","ar":"الرئيسية"}},{"icon":"bookmark-simple","text":{"en":"Saved","ar":"المحفوظة"}},{"icon":"user","text":{"en":"Me","ar":"حسابي"}}]},"fab":{"icon":"plus","text":{"en":"Post a recipe","ar":"انشر وصفة"}},"blocks":[{"kind":"card","art":"food-salad","blocks":[{"kind":"text","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Lentil soup in 20 minutes","ar":"شوربة عدس في 20 دقيقة"}},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"by Amal · 1.2k saves · ★ 4.8","ar":"من أمل · 1.2 ألف حفظ · ★ 4.8"},"gap":"xs"}]},{"kind":"card","art":"food-grill","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"text","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Grilled kofta with tahini","ar":"كفتة مشوية بالطحينة"}},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"by Omar · 860 saves · ★ 4.6","ar":"من عمر · 860 حفظ · ★ 4.6"},"gap":"xs"}]}]}},{"id":"settings","text":{"en":"⚙ Settings","ar":"⚙ الإعدادات"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"tabkha","name":{"en":"Tabkha","ar":"طبخة"},"color":"#EA580C","icon":"cooking-pot","domain":"tabkha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Recipes","ar":"الوصفات"},"logo":true,"actions":[{"icon":"magnifying-glass","aria":{"en":"Search","ar":"بحث"}}]},"tabbar":{"active":0,"items":[{"icon":"house","text":{"en":"Home","ar":"الرئيسية"}},{"icon":"bookmark-simple","text":{"en":"Saved","ar":"المحفوظة"}},{"icon":"user","text":{"en":"Me","ar":"حسابي"}}]},"fab":{"icon":"gear","text":{"en":"Settings","ar":"الإعدادات"}},"blocks":[{"kind":"card","art":"food-salad","blocks":[{"kind":"text","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Lentil soup in 20 minutes","ar":"شوربة عدس في 20 دقيقة"}},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"by Amal · 1.2k saves · ★ 4.8","ar":"من أمل · 1.2 ألف حفظ · ★ 4.8"},"gap":"xs"}]},{"kind":"card","art":"food-grill","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"text","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Grilled kofta with tahini","ar":"كفتة مشوية بالطحينة"}},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"by Omar · 860 saves · ★ 4.6","ar":"من عمر · 860 حفظ · ★ 4.6"},"gap":"xs"}]}]}}],"answer":["post"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P14-023","when":["rate","settings"],"feedback":{"en":"Few people open the app to do this. The most visible button on the screen now goes to an action that matters to the team or to almost nobody, while posting a recipe has to be found elsewhere.","ar":"قليلون يفتحون التطبيق ليفعلوا هذا. وأوضح زر في الشاشة يذهب الآن إلى إجراء يهمّ الفريق أو لا يهمّ أحدًا تقريبًا، بينما يجب البحث عن «انشر وصفة» في مكان آخر."}}],"hints":[{"en":"What do most people open this app to do?","ar":"لماذا يفتح أغلب الناس هذا التطبيق؟"}],"correct":{"en":"The main, frequent action: post a recipe.","ar":"الإجراء الرئيسي المتكرّر: انشر وصفة."},"explain":{"en":"Posting is why many people open the app, so it gets the button that's always in reach. Ratings and settings can live in the menu.","ar":"النشر هو سبب فتح كثيرين للتطبيق، لذلك يأخذ الزر الذي يبقى دائمًا في المتناول. ويمكن أن يكون التقييم والإعدادات في القائمة."}},{"id":"S09","type":"video","part":"concept","title":{"en":"Float only the screen's main action","ar":"لا تعطِ الزر العائم إلا للإجراء الرئيسي"},"video":"0966674b-c37e-4ee7-84be-d0b38fc83727","duration":178,"transcript":[{"t":2.5,"en":"Another button type we mentioned when we talked about types is the FAB, the floating action button. It's the button usually at the bottom right of the screen,","ar":"من أنواع الـ Buttons اللي اتكلمنا عنها برضه، وإحنا بنتكلم عن الـ Types: الـ FAB، أو الـ Floating action button. ده الـ Button اللي بيكون على اليمين تحت في الشاشات عادةً،"},{"t":12.5,"en":"and it stands for the most important action on the screen I'm on. It's floating because it usually has a shadow, raised a little above the background, and in mobile apps it usually sits above the navbar.","ar":"وبيعبّر عن أهم Action في الـ Screen اللي أنا فيها حاليًا. Floating لأنه عادةً واخد Shadow، طافي شوية فوق الـ Background، وبيكون عادةً فوق الـ Navbar في الـ Mobile applications."},{"t":24.42,"en":"For example, in the chats tab of a messaging app, there's a floating action button for starting a new chat, which may be the most important action on that screen.","ar":"على سبيل المثال، في الـ Tab بتاع المحادثات في تطبيق الرسايل، هتلاقي Floating action button بيعبّر عن Action إني أبدأ Chat جديد، وده ممكن يكون أهم Action في الشاشة دي."},{"t":36.44,"en":"I start a new chat to talk to someone, or to look someone up. So the action is very clear to me, sitting in the floating action button like this.","ar":"أبدأ Chat جديد عشان أكلّم حد، أو أدوّر على حد. فالـ Action ده واضح جدًا عندي، موجود في الـ Floating action button بالشكل ده."},{"t":44.86,"en":"The material design guidelines for the floating action button are very simple. One is that its contrast against the background behind it is clear. Sometimes it takes the same color as a solid background,","ar":"الـ Guidelines بتاعة الـ Floating action button في الـ Material Design بسيطة جدًا، منها إن الـ Contrast بتاعه يكون واضح عن الخلفية اللي وراه. أحيانًا يكون واخد نفس لون الـ Background، والـ Background لونه Solid كده،"},{"t":58,"en":"so the floating action button barely shows, its contrast is weak, and it gets lost in the background. With a different color, it stands out from the background.","ar":"فيبقى الـ Floating action button مش باين أصلًا، والـ Contrast بتاعه ضعيف، فمايتشافش مع الخلفية. لكن لو واخد لون مختلف هيبان عن الخلفية اللي وراه."},{"t":68.32,"en":"Another key guideline, when it isn't an extended floating action button: its icon must express the action it takes, especially since there's no label next to it saying exactly what it does.","ar":"ومن أهم الـ Guidelines كمان، لو مش مستخدمه Extended floating action button: إن الـ Icon اللي فيه تعبّر عن الـ Action اللي هاخده، بالذات إنه مافيش Label جنبه يقول الـ Action ده إيه بالظبط."},{"t":82.36,"en":"In this example, the plus sign, depending on context, is expected to let me add a post, or show some actions above it to choose from. The chat icon is expected to start a new message, or open the messages page,","ar":"في المثال اللي قدّامنا، متوقّع إن علامة الـ Plus، حسب السياق، تخلّيني أضيف Post مثلًا، أو تظهر لي Actions فوقها أختار منها. وأيقونة الـ Chat متوقّع إنها تخلّيني أعمل Message جديدة، أو تدخّلني صفحة الـ Messages،"},{"t":96.2,"en":"depending on context. But the icons on the other side may not be clear at all, and I can't predict what they do until I try them first.","ar":"حسب السياق. لكن الأيقونات اللي على الناحية التانية ممكن أصلًا ماتكونش مفهومة، ومش هتوقّع هي بتعمل إيه لحد ما أجرّبها الأول."},{"t":110.64,"en":"That's another very important guideline. The extended floating action button is a regular floating action button with a label or text next to it, describing the icon or the action the user takes when tapping it,","ar":"ودي برضه من الـ Guidelines المهمة جدًا. أما الـ Extended floating action button فهو Floating action button عادي، لكن مضاف جنبه Label أو Text بيعبّر عن الأيقونة أو عن الـ Action اللي اليوزر هياخده لما يضغط عليه،"},{"t":123.88,"en":"like the example in an email app: I tap the compose floating action button to write or send a new email.","ar":"زي المثال اللي عندنا في تطبيق الإيميل: لما أضغط على الـ Floating action button بتاع الـ Compose عشان أكتب إيميل جديد أو أبعت إيميل جديد."},{"t":131.36,"en":"Often the two are combined: there's an extended floating action button, and when I scroll down it collapses into a regular floating action button, just an icon, and when I reach the end of the screen","ar":"وكتير بيتدمج الاتنين: يكون عندي Extended floating action button، ولما أعمل Scroll لتحت يعمل Collapse، ويتحوّل لـ Floating action button عادي، أيقونة بس، ولما أوصل لآخر الشاشة،"},{"t":144.66,"en":"it expands back into an extended floating action button, like this example: at the top it's extended, when I scroll it collapses, and at the end of the screen it's extended again.","ar":"يعمل Expand تاني ويرجع Extended floating action button، زي المثال اللي قدّامنا: في الحالة العادية فوق هو Extended، لما أعمل Scroll يعمل Collapse، ولما أوصل لآخر الشاشة يرجع Extended."},{"t":157.32,"en":"If I scroll back up it doesn't change, because I'm going back up, not down to new content I'm seeing for the first time. That's also the usual behaviour of the extended and regular floating action button in the material design guidelines.","ar":"ولو عملت Scroll لفوق مش بيرجع تاني، لأني برجع لفوق، مش بنزل لتحت أشوف محتوى جديد أول مرة أشوفه. وده برضه الـ Behaviour المعتاد للـ Extended floating action button والـ Floating action button في الـ Material Design Guidelines."}]},{"id":"S03","type":"card","part":"concept","icons":["target","warn","contrast","text","fold"],"title":{"en":"Video summary","ar":"ملخص الفيديو"},"body":{"en":"A floating action button hovers over the content with a shadow, usually in a bottom corner above the navigation bar (bottom left in an Arabic, right-to-left layout), so it's always in reach.\n\n- **One per screen**, for its most important action, like starting a new chat.\n- **Not for rare or secondary actions**, like settings or rating the app. Several floating buttons compete and cover the content.\n- **Strong contrast:** a button in the same color as the background behind it gets lost.\n- **An icon that says the action**, like + or a pen. When the icon could be unclear, use an **extended** floating button: the icon plus a short label.\n- **On scroll:** an extended button can shrink to its icon while people scroll down, and grow back at the end of the list. Scrolling up leaves it as it is.","ar":"الـ Floating action button يطفو فوق المحتوى مع ظل، غالبًا في زاوية سفلية فوق شريط التنقّل (أسفل اليسار في الواجهة العربية من اليمين لليسار)، فيبقى دائمًا في المتناول.\n\n- **واحد لكل شاشة**، لإجرائها الأهم، مثل بدء محادثة جديدة.\n- **ليس للإجراءات النادرة أو الثانوية**، مثل الإعدادات أو تقييم التطبيق. فعدة أزرار عائمة تتنافس وتغطّي المحتوى.\n- **Contrast (تباين) واضح:** الزر الذي بلون الخلفية نفسه يضيع فيها.\n- **أيقونة تعبّر عن الإجراء**، مثل + أو قلم. وحين قد تكون الأيقونة غير واضحة، استخدم **Extended** floating button: الأيقونة ومعها نص قصير.\n- **عند الـ Scroll:** يمكن أن يصغر الزر الممتد إلى أيقونته حين يمرّر الناس لأسفل، ثم يعود في نهاية القائمة. والـ Scroll لأعلى لا يغيّره."}},{"id":"S04","type":"tune","part":"guided","skill":"SK-P14-U02-05","rules":["R06","R15"],"value":{"en":"Floating buttons (NN/g glossary): they support quick access to essential actions, so one goes to the most common one. Three stacked floating buttons cover the notes and make folders and scanning look as important as writing.","ar":"الأزرار العائمة (مسرد NN/g): تتيح وصولًا سريعًا للإجراءات الأساسية، لذلك يذهب الزر الواحد للإجراء الأكثر استخدامًا. وثلاثة أزرار عائمة فوق بعضها تغطّي الملاحظات وتجعل المجلدات والمسح يبدوان بأهمية الكتابة."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/ui-elements-glossary/","quote":"Floating buttons are often used on mobile devices, to support quick access to essential actions."},"scenario":{"en":"In my next project, a notes app, my team stacked three floating buttons: **new note**, **new folder** and **scan a page**. People write new notes every day; they make folders and scan pages only now and then.","ar":"في مشروعي التالي، تطبيق ملاحظات، وضع فريقي ثلاثة أزرار عائمة فوق بعضها: **ملاحظة جديدة**، و**مجلد جديد**، و**مسح صفحة ضوئيًا**. والناس يكتبون ملاحظات جديدة كل يوم؛ ولا ينشئون مجلدات أو يمسحون صفحات ضوئيًا إلا من حين لآخر."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each version. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل نسخة. أيّها يجب أن تُطلق؟"},"start":"three","options":[{"id":"one","text":{"en":"One floating button for a new note; folders and scanning in the menu","ar":"زر عائم واحد لملاحظة جديدة؛ والمجلدات والمسح الضوئي في القائمة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"satr","name":{"en":"Satr","ar":"سطر"},"color":"#334155","icon":"text-align-left","domain":"satr.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Notes","ar":"الملاحظات"},"large":true,"actions":[{"icon":"magnifying-glass","aria":{"en":"Search","ar":"بحث"}}]},"fab":{"icon":"pencil-simple"},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"note","text":{"en":"Shopping list","ar":"قائمة المشتريات"},"sub":{"en":"Bread, eggs, tea, rice…","ar":"عيش، بيض، شاي، أرز…"},"value":{"en":"Today","ar":"اليوم"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"note","text":{"en":"Meeting, Sunday","ar":"اجتماع الأحد"},"sub":{"en":"Budget, launch date, hiring…","ar":"الميزانية، موعد الإطلاق، التوظيف…"},"value":{"en":"Fri","ar":"الجمعة"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"note","text":{"en":"Gift ideas","ar":"أفكار هدايا"},"sub":{"en":"A book for Mom, a scarf…","ar":"كتاب لأمي، وشال…"},"value":{"en":"2 May","ar":"2 مايو"}}]}},{"id":"three","text":{"en":"Keep the three floating buttons","ar":"أبقِ الأزرار العائمة الثلاثة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"satr","name":{"en":"Satr","ar":"سطر"},"color":"#334155","icon":"text-align-left","domain":"satr.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Notes","ar":"الملاحظات"},"large":true,"actions":[{"icon":"magnifying-glass","aria":{"en":"Search","ar":"بحث"}}]},"fab":[{"icon":"pencil-simple"},{"icon":"check-square"},{"icon":"camera"}],"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"note","text":{"en":"Shopping list","ar":"قائمة المشتريات"},"sub":{"en":"Bread, eggs, tea, rice…","ar":"عيش، بيض، شاي، أرز…"},"value":{"en":"Today","ar":"اليوم"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"note","text":{"en":"Meeting, Sunday","ar":"اجتماع الأحد"},"sub":{"en":"Budget, launch date, hiring…","ar":"الميزانية، موعد الإطلاق، التوظيف…"},"value":{"en":"Fri","ar":"الجمعة"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"note","text":{"en":"Gift ideas","ar":"أفكار هدايا"},"sub":{"en":"A book for Mom, a scarf…","ar":"كتاب لأمي، وشال…"},"value":{"en":"2 May","ar":"2 مايو"}}]}},{"id":"small","text":{"en":"Keep all three, but make them smaller","ar":"أبقِ الثلاثة، لكن صغّرها"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"satr","name":{"en":"Satr","ar":"سطر"},"color":"#334155","icon":"text-align-left","domain":"satr.example"},"caption":{"en":"Three smaller floating buttons","ar":"ثلاثة أزرار عائمة أصغر"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Notes","ar":"الملاحظات"},"large":true,"actions":[{"icon":"magnifying-glass","aria":{"en":"Search","ar":"بحث"}}]},"fab":[{"icon":"pencil-simple"},{"icon":"check-square"},{"icon":"camera"}],"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"note","text":{"en":"Shopping list","ar":"قائمة المشتريات"},"sub":{"en":"Bread, eggs, tea, rice…","ar":"عيش، بيض، شاي، أرز…"},"value":{"en":"Today","ar":"اليوم"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"note","text":{"en":"Meeting, Sunday","ar":"اجتماع الأحد"},"sub":{"en":"Budget, launch date, hiring…","ar":"الميزانية، موعد الإطلاق، التوظيف…"},"value":{"en":"Fri","ar":"الجمعة"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"note","text":{"en":"Gift ideas","ar":"أفكار هدايا"},"sub":{"en":"A book for Mom, a scarf…","ar":"كتاب لأمي، وشال…"},"value":{"en":"2 May","ar":"2 مايو"}}]}}],"answer":["one"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P14-023","when":["three","small"],"feedback":{"en":"Three floating buttons still cover the notes and look equally important. Writing a note, the thing people do every day, no longer stands out.","ar":"ثلاثة أزرار عائمة ما زالت تغطّي الملاحظات وتبدو متساوية في الأهمية. وكتابة ملاحظة، وهو ما يفعله الناس كل يوم، لم تعد بارزة."}}],"correct":{"en":"One floating button, for the daily action.","ar":"زر عائم واحد، للإجراء اليومي."},"explain":{"en":"A new note is one tap from anywhere, and the list stays clear. Folders and scanning are still there, in the menu, for the times people need them.","ar":"الملاحظة الجديدة بضغطة واحدة من أي مكان، والقائمة تبقى واضحة. والمجلدات والمسح الضوئي ما زالا موجودين في القائمة، للمرات التي يحتاجهما فيها الناس."},"speaker":"sara"},{"id":"S05","type":"tune","speaker":"tarek","part":"guided","skill":"SK-P14-U02-05","rules":["R06","R15"],"confidence":true,"value":{"en":"Icons (NN/g): few icons are universally recognized, and icon labels should be visible at all times, without any interaction. A circular arrow could mean reorder, refresh or history; a long-press tooltip is an interaction most people never try.","ar":"الأيقونات (NN/g): أيقونات قليلة يعرفها الجميع، وتسميات الأيقونات يجب أن تكون ظاهرة دائمًا، دون أي تفاعل. والسهم الدائري قد يعني «اطلب مجددًا» أو «تحديث» أو «السجل»؛ والـ Tooltip عند الضغط المطوّل تفاعل لا يجرّبه أغلب الناس."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/icon-usability/","quote":"Icon labels should be visible at all times, without any interaction from the user."},"scenario":{"en":"The food app I manage has a floating button that repeats your last order in one tap. Many people order the same meal every week. Right now, the button shows only a circular arrow: ⟲.","ar":"في تطبيق الطعام الذي أديره زر عائم يكرّر آخر طلب بضغطة واحدة. وكثير من الناس يطلبون الوجبة نفسها كل أسبوع. والآن لا يعرض الزر إلا سهمًا دائريًا: ⟲."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each version of the floating button. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل نسخة من الزر العائم. أيّ نسخة تجعل الناس يفهمون أن الزر يكرّر آخر طلب؟"},"start":"icon","options":[{"id":"icon","text":{"en":"Keep the icon only","ar":"أبقِ الأيقونة فقط"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"lamma","name":{"en":"Lamma","ar":"لمّة"},"color":"#E03131","icon":"bowl-food","domain":"lamma.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Restaurants near you","ar":"مطاعم قريبة منك"},"actions":[{"icon":"shopping-bag","aria":{"en":"Orders","ar":"الطلبات"}}]},"fab":{"icon":"arrow-counter-clockwise"},"blocks":[{"kind":"card","art":"food-grill","blocks":[{"kind":"text","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Grill House · 25 min","ar":"Grill House · 25 دقيقة"}},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Grills · EGP 150 for two · ★ 4.5","ar":"مشويات · 150 جنيه لشخصين · ★ 4.5"},"gap":"xs"}]},{"kind":"card","art":"food-pizza","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"text","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Napoli Pizza · 35 min","ar":"Napoli Pizza · 35 دقيقة"}},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Pizza · EGP 220 for two · ★ 4.3","ar":"بيتزا · 220 جنيه لشخصين · ★ 4.3"},"gap":"xs"}]}]}},{"id":"tip","text":{"en":"Icon only; a tooltip \"Reorder\" appears on a long press","ar":"أيقونة فقط؛ ويظهر Tooltip «اطلب مجددًا» عند الضغط المطوّل"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"Only after a long press","ar":"بعد ضغط مطوّل فقط"},"app":{"id":"lamma","name":{"en":"Lamma","ar":"لمّة"},"color":"#E03131","icon":"bowl-food","domain":"lamma.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Restaurants near you","ar":"مطاعم قريبة منك"},"actions":[{"icon":"shopping-bag","aria":{"en":"Orders","ar":"الطلبات"}}]},"fab":{"icon":"arrow-counter-clockwise"},"blocks":[{"kind":"card","art":"food-grill","blocks":[{"kind":"text","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Grill House · 25 min","ar":"Grill House · 25 دقيقة"}},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Grills · EGP 150 for two · ★ 4.5","ar":"مشويات · 150 جنيه لشخصين · ★ 4.5"},"gap":"xs"}]},{"kind":"tip","text":{"en":"Reorder","ar":"اطلب مجددًا"},"gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"label","text":{"en":"Extended floating button: \"⟲ Reorder\"","ar":"Extended floating button: «⟲ اطلب مجددًا»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"lamma","name":{"en":"Lamma","ar":"لمّة"},"color":"#E03131","icon":"bowl-food","domain":"lamma.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Restaurants near you","ar":"مطاعم قريبة منك"},"actions":[{"icon":"shopping-bag","aria":{"en":"Orders","ar":"الطلبات"}}]},"fab":{"icon":"arrow-counter-clockwise","text":{"en":"Reorder","ar":"اطلب مجددًا"}},"blocks":[{"kind":"card","art":"food-grill","blocks":[{"kind":"text","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Grill House · 25 min","ar":"Grill House · 25 دقيقة"}},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Grills · EGP 150 for two · ★ 4.5","ar":"مشويات · 150 جنيه لشخصين · ★ 4.5"},"gap":"xs"}]},{"kind":"card","art":"food-pizza","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"text","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Napoli Pizza · 35 min","ar":"Napoli Pizza · 35 دقيقة"}},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Pizza · EGP 220 for two · ★ 4.3","ar":"بيتزا · 220 جنيه لشخصين · ★ 4.3"},"gap":"xs"}]}]}}],"answer":["label"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P14-024","when":["icon","tip"],"feedback":{"en":"The circular arrow could mean refresh or history. Without a visible label, many people never tap it, and few think to long-press a button to ask what it does.","ar":"السهم الدائري قد يعني «تحديث» أو «السجل». وبدون تسمية ظاهرة، لن يضغطه كثيرون، وقليلون يفكّرون في الضغط المطوّل على زر ليعرفوا وظيفته."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Could someone who's never used the app tell what ⟲ does?","ar":"هل يستطيع شخص لم يستخدم التطبيق من قبل أن يعرف وظيفة ⟲؟"}],"correct":{"en":"The icon could be unclear: add the label.","ar":"قد تكون الأيقونة غير واضحة: أضف التسمية."},"explain":{"en":"\"Reorder\" next to the arrow says exactly what one tap does. People who eat the same meal every week will spot it and use it.","ar":"كلمة «اطلب مجددًا» بجانب السهم تقول بالضبط ما تفعله الضغطة. ومن يأكلون الوجبة نفسها كل أسبوع سيلاحظونه ويستخدمونه."}},{"id":"S06","type":"compare","speaker":"karim","part":"contrast","skill":"SK-P14-U02-05","rules":["R11"],"value":{"en":"Floating buttons (NN/g glossary): one goes to the most commonly used and important action. Most people open the chat list to start or continue a chat; photos are sent from inside a chat, so a second floating camera button only competes.","ar":"الأزرار العائمة (مسرد NN/g): الزر الواحد يذهب للإجراء الأكثر استخدامًا وأهمية. وأغلب الناس يفتحون قائمة المحادثات ليبدؤوا محادثة أو يكملوها؛ والصور تُرسل من داخل المحادثة، فزر الكاميرا العائم الثاني لا يفعل إلا المنافسة."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/ui-elements-glossary/","quote":"A floating button is typically used for the most commonly used and important action on the screen."},"scenario":{"en":"I'm building a messaging app. Most people come to its chat list to start a new chat or open an old one. Photos are usually sent from inside a chat.","ar":"أبني تطبيقًا للمراسلة. وأغلب الناس يأتون إلى قائمة المحادثات فيه ليبدؤوا محادثة جديدة أو يفتحوا محادثة قديمة. والصور تُرسل عادةً من داخل المحادثة."},"prompt":{"en":"Which version should ship?","ar":"أيّ نسخة يجب أن تُطلق؟"},"a":{"label":{"en":"Version A: new chat and camera, both floating","ar":"النسخة A: زرّان عائمان، لمحادثة جديدة وللكاميرا"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"hakawy","name":{"en":"Hakawy","ar":"حكاوي"},"color":"#0CA678","icon":"chat-circle","domain":"hakawy.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Chats","ar":"المحادثات"},"large":true,"actions":[{"icon":"magnifying-glass","aria":{"en":"Search","ar":"بحث"}}]},"fab":[{"icon":"pencil-simple"},{"icon":"camera"}],"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","avatar":{"text":"Mom","art":"woman-2"},"text":{"en":"Mom","ar":"ماما"},"sub":{"en":"Call me when you're home","ar":"كلّمني لما توصل"},"value":"9:41","badge":{"text":"2"}},{"kind":"listitem","avatar":{"text":"Work team","art":"people"},"text":{"en":"Work team","ar":"فريق العمل"},"sub":{"en":"Slides are ready","ar":"العرض جاهز"},"value":"8:15"},{"kind":"listitem","avatar":{"text":"Hossam","art":"man-2"},"text":{"en":"Hossam","ar":"حسام"},"sub":{"en":"See you at 7","ar":"نتقابل الساعة 7"},"value":{"en":"Yesterday","ar":"أمس"}}]}},"b":{"label":{"en":"Version B: one floating button for a new chat","ar":"النسخة B: زر عائم واحد لمحادثة جديدة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"hakawy","name":{"en":"Hakawy","ar":"حكاوي"},"color":"#0CA678","icon":"chat-circle","domain":"hakawy.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Chats","ar":"المحادثات"},"large":true,"actions":[{"icon":"magnifying-glass","aria":{"en":"Search","ar":"بحث"}}]},"fab":{"icon":"pencil-simple"},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","avatar":{"text":"Mom","art":"woman-2"},"text":{"en":"Mom","ar":"ماما"},"sub":{"en":"Call me when you're home","ar":"كلّمني لما توصل"},"value":"9:41","badge":{"text":"2"}},{"kind":"listitem","avatar":{"text":"Work team","art":"people"},"text":{"en":"Work team","ar":"فريق العمل"},"sub":{"en":"Slides are ready","ar":"العرض جاهز"},"value":"8:15"},{"kind":"listitem","avatar":{"text":"Hossam","art":"man-2"},"text":{"en":"Hossam","ar":"حسام"},"sub":{"en":"See you at 7","ar":"نتقابل الساعة 7"},"value":{"en":"Yesterday","ar":"أمس"}}]}},"answer":"b","misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P14-023","when":["a"],"feedback":{"en":"The camera button competes with the main action and covers more of the list. People send photos from inside a chat anyway.","ar":"زر الكاميرا ينافس الإجراء الرئيسي ويغطّي جزءًا أكبر من القائمة. والناس يرسلون الصور من داخل المحادثة على أي حال."}}],"correct":{"en":"B: one floating button, the screen's main action.","ar":"B: زر عائم واحد، للإجراء الرئيسي في الشاشة."},"explain":{"en":"Starting a chat is what this screen is for, so it alone floats. The camera stays where photos are really sent: inside the chat.","ar":"بدء محادثة هو الغرض من هذه الشاشة، لذلك هو وحده العائم. والكاميرا تبقى حيث تُرسل الصور فعلًا: داخل المحادثة."}},{"id":"S07","type":"tune","speaker":"rami","part":"independent","skill":"SK-P14-U02-05","rules":["R14"],"value":{"en":"Floating buttons (NN/g glossary): for the most commonly used and important action. Hoda adds several events a week, while the calendar already opens on today and settings are rarely touched.","ar":"الأزرار العائمة (مسرد NN/g): للإجراء الأكثر استخدامًا وأهمية. وهدى تضيف عدة مواعيد كل أسبوع، بينما يفتح التقويم أصلًا على اليوم، ونادرًا ما تُفتح الإعدادات."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/ui-elements-glossary/","quote":"A floating button is typically used for the most commonly used and important action on the screen."},"scenario":{"en":"I'm designing a calendar app. Hoda uses it on her phone and adds 5 to 10 events a week. The app always opens on today, and she has opened the settings twice this year.","ar":"أصمّم تطبيقًا للتقويم. تستخدمه هدى على هاتفها، وتضيف من 5 إلى 10 مواعيد كل أسبوع. والتطبيق يفتح دائمًا على اليوم، وقد فتحت الإعدادات مرتين هذا العام."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each floating button. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل زر عائم. أيّ زر يخدم ما تفعله هدى أكثر في التطبيق؟"},"start":"today","options":[{"id":"today","text":{"en":"Jump to today","ar":"انتقل إلى اليوم"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"mawid","name":{"en":"Mawid","ar":"موعد"},"color":"#7950F2","icon":"calendar","domain":"mawid.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Tuesday, 14 May","ar":"الثلاثاء، 14 مايو"},"actions":[{"icon":"calendar-blank","aria":{"en":"Month view","ar":"عرض الشهر"}}]},"fab":{"icon":"crosshair","text":{"en":"Today","ar":"اليوم"}},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"tooth","text":{"en":"Dentist","ar":"طبيب الأسنان"},"sub":"9:00 – 9:45"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"fork-knife","text":{"en":"Lunch with Samar","ar":"غداء مع سمر"},"sub":"13:00 – 14:00"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"barbell","text":{"en":"Gym","ar":"النادي"},"sub":"18:30 – 19:30"}]}},{"id":"new","text":{"en":"New event","ar":"موعد جديد"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"mawid","name":{"en":"Mawid","ar":"موعد"},"color":"#7950F2","icon":"calendar","domain":"mawid.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Tuesday, 14 May","ar":"الثلاثاء، 14 مايو"},"actions":[{"icon":"calendar-blank","aria":{"en":"Month view","ar":"عرض الشهر"}}]},"fab":{"icon":"plus","text":{"en":"New event","ar":"موعد جديد"}},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"tooth","text":{"en":"Dentist","ar":"طبيب الأسنان"},"sub":"9:00 – 9:45"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"fork-knife","text":{"en":"Lunch with Samar","ar":"غداء مع سمر"},"sub":"13:00 – 14:00"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"barbell","text":{"en":"Gym","ar":"النادي"},"sub":"18:30 – 19:30"}]}},{"id":"settings","text":{"en":"Settings","ar":"الإعدادات"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"mawid","name":{"en":"Mawid","ar":"موعد"},"color":"#7950F2","icon":"calendar","domain":"mawid.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Tuesday, 14 May","ar":"الثلاثاء، 14 مايو"},"actions":[{"icon":"calendar-blank","aria":{"en":"Month view","ar":"عرض الشهر"}}]},"fab":{"icon":"gear","text":{"en":"Settings","ar":"الإعدادات"}},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"tooth","text":{"en":"Dentist","ar":"طبيب الأسنان"},"sub":"9:00 – 9:45"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"fork-knife","text":{"en":"Lunch with Samar","ar":"غداء مع سمر"},"sub":"13:00 – 14:00"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"barbell","text":{"en":"Gym","ar":"النادي"},"sub":"18:30 – 19:30"}]}}],"answer":["new"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P14-023","when":["today","settings"],"feedback":{"en":"Hoda rarely needs this: the app already opens on today, and she's opened settings twice this year. The always-in-reach button goes to something she seldom does.","ar":"نادرًا ما تحتاج هدى هذا: فالتطبيق يفتح أصلًا على اليوم، وفتحت الإعدادات مرتين هذا العام. والزر الذي يبقى دائمًا في المتناول يذهب إلى شيء نادرًا ما تفعله."}}],"correct":{"en":"Her most common action: a new event.","ar":"إجراؤها الأكثر تكرارًا: موعد جديد."},"explain":{"en":"Adding events is what Hoda does every week, so it gets the floating button. Today and Settings stay a tap away in the top bar.","ar":"إضافة المواعيد هي ما تفعله هدى كل أسبوع، لذلك تأخذ الزر العائم. ويبقى «اليوم» و«الإعدادات» بضغطة واحدة في الشريط العلوي."}},{"id":"S08","type":"card","part":"recap","icons":["tap","target","text"],"title":{"en":"What you practised","ar":"ما تدرّبت عليه"},"body":{"en":"- **One floating button** per screen, for its most common and important action.\n- **No floating buttons** for rare actions, and no stacks of them.\n- **A visible label** when the icon could be unclear, like ⟲ Reorder.\n\nNext: the skill check, on new cases.","ar":"- **زر عائم واحد** لكل شاشة، لإجرائها الأكثر استخدامًا وأهمية.\n- **لا أزرار عائمة** للإجراءات النادرة، ولا أزرار عائمة فوق بعضها.\n- **تسمية ظاهرة** حين قد تكون الأيقونة غير واضحة، مثل «⟲ اطلب مجددًا».\n\nالتالي: اختبار المهارة، على حالات جديدة."}}]}$uxg$::jsonb),
  ($uxg$P14-U02-L04$uxg$, $uxg$d10fb558fa4ec10174e52f32526741cbe63abbced005e136a1e7dd4061d3d134$uxg$, $uxg${"id":"P14-U02-L04","mode":"lesson","minutes":8,"title":{"en":"Chips for a group of related choices","ar":"الـ Chips لمجموعة من الاختيارات المترابطة"},"speaker":"rami","review_labels":{"MC-P14-049":{"en":"Match the control to the answer: radio buttons for 2 or 3 options","ar":"اختر العنصر المناسب للإجابة: Radio buttons لاختيارين أو ثلاثة"},"MC-P14-069":{"en":"A single main action is a button, not a chip","ar":"الإجراء الرئيسي الوحيد زر، لا Chip"},"MC-P14-070":{"en":"A set of related choices reads best as chips, not equal loud buttons","ar":"مجموعة الاختيارات المترابطة أوضح في Chips، لا في أزرار بارزة متساوية"},"MC-P14-071":{"en":"What people entered as chips must be removable in one tap","ar":"ما أدخله الناس في Chips يجب أن يمكن حذفه بضغطة واحدة"},"MC-P14-072":{"en":"Suggestion chips must fit what people are doing now","ar":"الـ Suggestion chips يجب أن تناسب ما يفعله الناس الآن"}},"steps":[{"id":"S01","type":"card","part":"hook","title":{"en":"Rami's movie-ticket app","ar":"تطبيق رامي لتذاكر السينما"},"body":{"en":"I'm designing an app for buying movie tickets. After people pick a film, they choose one of four showtimes on Friday: 1:30, 4:00, 6:45 or 9:15.\n\nI drew each time as a big filled button, one under the other, above **Choose seats**.","ar":"أصمّم تطبيقًا لشراء تذاكر السينما. وبعد أن يختار الناس فيلمًا، يختارون موعدًا من أربعة مواعيد عرض يوم الجمعة: 1:30 أو 4:00 أو 6:45 أو 9:15.\n\nورسمتُ كل موعد في زر كبير ممتلئ، واحدًا تحت الآخر، فوق **اختر المقاعد**."},"mock":{"app":{"id":"tazkara","name":{"en":"Tazkara","ar":"تذكرة"},"color":"#C026D3","icon":"ticket","domain":"tazkara.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Cinema tickets","ar":"تذاكر السينما"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"city-night","size":"m","alt":{"en":"Trip to the Moon poster","ar":"ملصق فيلم رحلة إلى القمر"}},{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Trip to the Moon","ar":"رحلة إلى القمر"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Friday · 2 h 10 min · ★ 4.4","ar":"الجمعة · 2 س 10 د · ★ 4.4"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"button","style":"outline","text":{"en":"1:30 pm","ar":"1:30 م"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"button","style":"outline","text":{"en":"4:00 pm","ar":"4:00 م"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","style":"outline","text":{"en":"6:45 pm","ar":"6:45 م"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","style":"outline","text":{"en":"9:15 pm","ar":"9:15 م"},"gap":"s"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Choose seats","ar":"اختر المقاعد"}}]}},{"id":"S02","type":"tune","part":"try","skill":"SK-P14-U02-06","rules":["R12"],"confidence":true,"value":{"en":"Try first. Proximity (NN/g): items close together are seen as one group with similar functions. A row of chips shows the four times as one set to pick from, and leaves the filled style to the step forward, Choose seats.","ar":"جرّب أولًا. مبدأ التقارب (NN/g): العناصر القريبة من بعضها تُرى مجموعة واحدة لها وظيفة متشابهة. وصفّ من الـ Chips يعرض المواعيد الأربعة كمجموعة واحدة للاختيار منها، ويترك الشكل الممتلئ للخطوة إلى الأمام، «اختر المقاعد»."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/gestalt-proximity/","quote":"Items close together are likely to be perceived as part of the same group — sharing similar functionality or traits."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each way to show the times. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل طريقة لعرض المواعيد. أيّ طريقة تُظهر المواعيد كلها وتُبقي «اختر المقاعد» الزر الأوضح؟"},"start":"buttons","options":[{"id":"buttons","text":{"en":"Four filled buttons, one under the other","ar":"أربعة أزرار ممتلئة، واحد تحت الآخر"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"tazkara","name":{"en":"Tazkara","ar":"تذكرة"},"color":"#C026D3","icon":"ticket","domain":"tazkara.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Cinema tickets","ar":"تذاكر السينما"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"city-night","size":"m","alt":{"en":"Trip to the Moon poster","ar":"ملصق فيلم رحلة إلى القمر"}},{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Trip to the Moon","ar":"رحلة إلى القمر"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Friday · 2 h 10 min · ★ 4.4","ar":"الجمعة · 2 س 10 د · ★ 4.4"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"button","style":"outline","text":{"en":"1:30 pm","ar":"1:30 م"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"button","style":"outline","text":{"en":"4:00 pm","ar":"4:00 م"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","style":"outline","text":{"en":"6:45 pm","ar":"6:45 م"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","style":"outline","text":{"en":"9:15 pm","ar":"9:15 م"},"gap":"s"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Choose seats","ar":"اختر المقاعد"}}]}},{"id":"chips","text":{"en":"A row of chips; the picked time shows ✓","ar":"صفّ من الـ Chips؛ والموعد المختار عليه ✓"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"tazkara","name":{"en":"Tazkara","ar":"تذكرة"},"color":"#C026D3","icon":"ticket","domain":"tazkara.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Cinema tickets","ar":"تذاكر السينما"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"city-night","size":"m","alt":{"en":"Trip to the Moon poster","ar":"ملصق فيلم رحلة إلى القمر"}},{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Trip to the Moon","ar":"رحلة إلى القمر"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Friday · 2 h 10 min · ★ 4.4","ar":"الجمعة · 2 س 10 د · ★ 4.4"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"chips","gap":"m","items":[{"text":{"en":"1:30 pm","ar":"1:30 م"}},{"text":{"en":"4:00 pm","ar":"4:00 م"}},{"text":{"en":"6:45 pm","ar":"6:45 م"},"on":true},{"text":{"en":"9:15 pm","ar":"9:15 م"}}]}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Choose seats","ar":"اختر المقاعد"}}]}},{"id":"menu","text":{"en":"A drop-down: \"Choose a time\"","ar":"قائمة منسدلة (Drop-down): «اختر موعدًا»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"tazkara","name":{"en":"Tazkara","ar":"تذكرة"},"color":"#C026D3","icon":"ticket","domain":"tazkara.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Cinema tickets","ar":"تذاكر السينما"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"city-night","size":"m","alt":{"en":"Trip to the Moon poster","ar":"ملصق فيلم رحلة إلى القمر"}},{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Trip to the Moon","ar":"رحلة إلى القمر"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Friday · 2 h 10 min · ★ 4.4","ar":"الجمعة · 2 س 10 د · ★ 4.4"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"select","label":{"en":"Showtime","ar":"موعد العرض"},"text":{"en":"Choose a time","ar":"اختر موعدًا"},"gap":"m"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Choose seats","ar":"اختر المقاعد"}}]}}],"answer":["chips"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P14-070","when":["buttons"],"feedback":{"en":"Five filled buttons look equally important, so Choose seats no longer stands out, and the times read as five separate actions instead of one set to pick from.","ar":"خمسة أزرار ممتلئة تبدو متساوية في الأهمية، فلم يعد «اختر المقاعد» بارزًا، وتُقرأ المواعيد كخمسة إجراءات منفصلة بدل مجموعة واحدة يُختار منها."}},{"id":"MC-P14-049","when":["menu"],"feedback":{"en":"Four short times fit on the screen. A drop-down hides them behind an extra tap, so people can't compare them at a glance.","ar":"أربعة مواعيد قصيرة تتّسع لها الشاشة. والقائمة المنسدلة تُخفيها خلف ضغطة إضافية، فلا يقارن الناس بينها بنظرة واحدة."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Are the times four separate actions, or one set of choices?","ar":"هل المواعيد أربعة إجراءات منفصلة، أم مجموعة واحدة من الاختيارات؟"}],"correct":{"en":"A row of chips: one set of related choices.","ar":"صفّ من الـ Chips: مجموعة واحدة من الاختيارات المترابطة."},"explain":{"en":"The times sit together as one group, all visible, and the picked one is marked. Choose seats keeps the only filled button, so the next step is clear.","ar":"المواعيد معًا في مجموعة واحدة، وكلها ظاهرة، والمختار منها عليه علامة. ويبقى «اختر المقاعد» الزر الممتلئ الوحيد، فتكون الخطوة التالية واضحة."}},{"id":"S09","type":"video","part":"concept","title":{"en":"Chips: a group of related choices","ar":"الـ Chips: مجموعة من الاختيارات المترابطة"},"video":"3f8bbd40-24e7-4fbc-b51d-b6663efff59f","duration":329,"transcript":[{"t":2.5,"en":"The second component in actions is chips. Chips are small components, very similar to a button. They also give me the option to show the","ar":"تاني Component معانا في الـ Actions هو الـ Chips. الـ Chips هي Components صغيرة شبه الـ Button جدًا، بتديني برضه الـ Option إني أعرض"},{"t":10.38,"en":"user some data, or to let the user take actions, as we'll see now in our examples, and we'll see how they differ from buttons.","ar":"لليوزر بعض الداتا، أو إني أخلّي اليوزر ياخد Actions معانا، زي ما هنشوف دلوقتي في الأمثلة اللي معانا، وهنشوف الفرق بينها وبين الـ Buttons."},{"t":18.26,"en":"One of the most important differences and uses of chips is that I can put more than one chip in the same area, and the user can interact with them in one area. Unlike buttons: we said there should be one or two buttons, no more","ar":"من أهم الفروقات والاستخدامات للـ Chips إني أقدر أحط منها أكتر من Chip في نفس الـ Area، واليوزر يقدر يتفاعل معاهم في Area واحدة. على عكس لما اتكلمنا عن الـ Buttons، وقلنا إن يكون فيه Button واحد أو"},{"t":30.3,"en":"than three at most on the same screen, and we need them to be different types so we can prioritize, or give preference to one action: that the user needs to take this action on this page, and that it's the best one, and so on.","ar":"اتنين، وما نتعدّاش تلاتة بالكتير في نفس الـ Screen، ومحتاجين نخلّيهم من Types مختلفة عشان نعمل Prioritize، أو ندي أفضلية لأحد الـ Actions: إن اليوزر محتاج ياخد الـ Action ده في الصفحة دي، وده اللي هيكون الأفضل، وهكذا."},{"t":42.34,"en":"But with chips I can use a group, more than one chip in the same place, so the user can take a certain action through them. Like when the user enters the people they want to email: they type","ar":"لكن الـ Chips ممكن أستخدم منها مجموعة، أكتر من Chip في نفس المكان، عشان اليوزر يعمل من خلالهم Action معيّن. زي لما اليوزر بيدخّل الناس اللي عايز يبعت لهم الإيميل:"},{"t":51.81,"en":"their names or emails, and these appear as chips, and they can tap a chip to remove someone from the email, meaning they no longer want to send it to them. When they type someone else, that person is","ar":"بيكتب أساميهم أو إيميلاتهم، فبيظهروا له على شكل Chips، وبيقدر يضغط على الـ Chip عشان يحذف حد من الإيميل، يعني مش عايز يبعت له الإيميل ده خلاص. ولما بيكتب حد"},{"t":61.27,"en":"added as a chip, and so on. It can easily grow to a large group of chips in the same place. That's one of the most important differences from the button, and one of the main strengths of chips.","ar":"تاني بيتضاف على شكل Chip، وهكذا. ممكن يوصل عادي لمجموعة كبيرة من الـ Chips في نفس المكان. وده من أهم الاختلافات بينها وبين الـ Button، ومن أهم مميزات الـ Chips."},{"t":70.74,"en":"The chips we'll usually use come in four types, the ones in front of us: assist, filter, input and","ar":"الـ Chips اللي هنستخدمها عادةً أربع Types، اللي قدامنا: Assist وFilter وInput وSuggestion chips. كل"},{"t":78.33,"en":"suggestion chips. Each type, of course, has a different use, and these types are widely used in many products.","ar":"نوع فيهم طبعًا ليه استخدام مختلف عن التاني، والأنواع دي مستخدمة بشكل كبير في منتجات كتير."},{"t":85.92,"en":"The first type is assist chips: they let us move between different apps or products for certain actions. For example, if I'm looking at a restaurant's page and want to see where it","ar":"أول نوع معانا هو الـ Assist chips، وهو اللي بيخلّينا نروح بين Apps أو Products مختلفة في Actions معيّنة. على سبيل المثال، لو أنا بشوف صفحة مطعم، وعايز أشوف"},{"t":96.24,"en":"is, its location on the map, I might have a chip that takes me out of the app to the maps app, where I see the location. Or if I want to book","ar":"مكان المطعم ده أو الـ Location بتاعه على الخريطة، ممكن يكون عندي Chip بتطلّعني من الـ App وتوديني لتطبيق الخرائط، أشوف من عليه الـ Location. أو لو أنا عايز"},{"t":106.56,"en":"a certain time, so I want to check my calendar, or see certain meetings in it, I might have a chip that takes me to my calendar, shows me my appointments, and where","ar":"أحجز ميعاد معيّن، فعايز أشوف الـ Calendar عندي، أو أشوف Meetings معيّنة في الـ Calendar، فممكن يكون عندي Chip توديني للـ Calendar بتاعي، تخلّيني أشوف المواعيد اللي عندي، وأشوف"},{"t":116.88,"en":"exactly this one will fit, and so on. So the main job of assist chips is to connect apps, or let us move between apps, going from one to another in a certain scenario.","ar":"الميعاد ده هيكون فين بالظبط، وهكذا. فالـ Assist chips مهمتها الأساسية إنها تربط بين الـ Apps، أو تخلّينا ننتقل بين الـ Apps، أروح من واحد للتاني في Scenario معيّن."},{"t":127.2,"en":"Filter chips almost all of us know and use: they usually sit under the search, for example, or on any page with a set of products, or any","ar":"أما الـ Filter chips فكلنا تقريبًا عارفينها وبنستخدمها: اللي بتكون موجودة عادةً تحت الـ Search مثلًا، أو في أي صفحة فيها مجموعة من المنتجات، أو أي صفحة ممكن أكون"},{"t":137.24,"en":"page where I'm browsing. I may have a set of filters as chips; if I tap any of them, it starts applying to the content on the page, filtering","ar":"بعمل فيها Browse، بتصفّح فيها. ممكن يكون عندي مجموعة من الفلاتر على شكل Chips، لو ضغطت على أي Chip فيهم بتبدأ تتطبّق على المحتوى اللي موجود في الصفحة، وتفلتر"},{"t":147.28,"en":"it based on the chip I tapped. We also talked about filters, and chips are among the most common components used in filters, especially in mobile and tablet apps.","ar":"لي المحتوى ده بناءً على الـ Chip اللي أنا ضغطت عليها. واحنا اتكلمنا برضه عن الفلاتر، فمن أشهر الـ Components المستخدمة في الفلاتر الـ Chips، بالذات في الـ Applications"},{"t":157.32,"en":"There are also examples like an image site: on the left the filter is made of a set of chips, and any chip I tap applies that filter immediately.","ar":"اللي على الموبايل والتابلت. وبرضه فيه أمثلة زي موقع صور: على الشمال عندي الفلتر مكوّن من مجموعة من الـ Chips، أي Chip أضغط عليها بيبدأ يطبّق الفلتر ده مباشرةً."},{"t":167.36,"en":"That takes us to the next type, the input chip. When I choose something in the filter and it's now applied, it may show up as an input chip. An","ar":"وده يودّينا للنوع اللي بعد كده، وهو الـ Input chip. لما باختار حاجة معيّنة في الفلتر، وتبدأ تتطبّق كفلتر متطبّق دلوقتي، ممكن تظهر لي في شكل Input"},{"t":177.53,"en":"input chip is something I entered as a user, shown to me as an input chip, and I can tap it to remove the input I entered. Like the filter example:","ar":"chip. الـ Input chip هي عبارة عن حاجة أنا دخّلتها كيوزر، فظهرت لي في شكل Input chip، وممكن أضغط عليها عشان أشيل الـ Input اللي أنا دخّلته"},{"t":187.7,"en":"I've chosen a filter like Vectors on the image site; if I tap the Vectors chip, that filter is no longer applied. And the example of the people I entered","ar":"ده. زي المثال اللي قلناه بتاع الفلتر: أنا مختار فلتر معيّن زي Vectors في موقع الصور، لو ضغطت على الـ Chip بتاعة Vectors، هخلّي الفلتر ده مش"},{"t":197.88,"en":"in an email to send it to them: as soon as I type a name and press Enter, or move on to the next person, it turns into an input chip","ar":"متطبّق خلاص. وبرضه مثال الناس اللي دخّلتهم في الإيميل عشان أبعت لهم: بمجرد ما كتبت الاسم وضغطت Enter، أو رحت للشخص اللي بعده، بيحوّله تلقائيًا لـ Input"},{"t":208.05,"en":"automatically, an input I entered, and if I tap it later it cancels that input completely, it deletes it, and so on. So that's the third type of chips, input chips.","ar":"chip، عبارة عن Input أنا دخّلته، ولو ضغطت عليها بعد كده هيلغي الـ Input ده خالص، هيحذفه، وهكذا. فده النوع التالت من الـ Chips، وهو الـ Input chips."},{"t":218.22,"en":"The fourth and last type is suggestion chips: they appear to suggest certain actions to me, or anything in a scenario I'm in. Like when I translate a word and there are other similar words: I may","ar":"رابع نوع معانا والنوع الأخير هو الـ Suggestion chips، ودي اللي بتظهر لي عشان تقترح عليّا Actions معيّنة، أو أي حاجة في Scenario معيّن أنا موجود فيه. زي لو أنا بترجم كلمة معيّنة، وفيه كلمات تانية شبهها، ممكن"},{"t":230,"en":"see a set of chips with different words related to the word I'm translating, and I tap any of them to see its translation, and so on. So they're suggestions related to what I already did, or","ar":"ألاقي مجموعة من الـ Chips ظهرت لي فيها كلمات مختلفة ليها علاقة بالكلمة اللي أنا بترجمها، أضغط على أي كلمة فيهم فأشوف ترجمتها إيه، وهكذا. فهي اقتراحات ليها علاقة بالحاجة اللي أنا أصلًا عملتها، أو الـ Scenario اللي"},{"t":241.78,"en":"the scenario I'm in. Another example is the chips that appear in some chats: sometimes when someone sends us a message, a set of chips appears suggesting different replies to it. These are all examples of suggestion chips.","ar":"أنا موجود فيه. وبرضه الـ Chips اللي بتظهر في بعض الـ Chats: أحيانًا لما حد يبعت لنا رسالة، بيظهر لنا مجموعة من الـ Chips تقترح علينا ردود مختلفة على الرسالة دي. فدي كلها أمثلة على الـ Suggestion chips."},{"t":253.56,"en":"One of the important guidelines for chips in general is having a group in the same place. All the examples, uses and types of chips we covered are used as a group of actions in","ar":"ومن الـ Guidelines المهمة اللي قلناها في الـ Chips عمومًا فكرة إن بيكون عندي مجموعة في نفس المكان. كل الأمثلة والاستخدامات والـ Types اللي قلناها على الـ Chips بتُستخدم كمجموعة من الـ Actions"},{"t":265.08,"en":"the same place. Usually I don't put a single chip and make it do a single action; then it's like a button. That's the difference between chips and buttons: when there's a group in the same","ar":"في نفس المكان. عادةً مش بحط Chip واحدة وأخلّيها تعمل Action واحد، هنا بتبقى كأنها Button. ده الفرق بين الـ Chips والـ Buttons: لما بيكون فيه مجموعة في نفس المكان بتعمل Actions ليها علاقة"},{"t":276.6,"en":"place doing actions related to the types we talked about, I use chips. But when I have one main action, usually not closely tied to the actions we just mentioned, I'll use one component to express","ar":"بالـ Types اللي اتكلمنا عنها، هنا بستخدم الـ Chips. لكن لما بيكون عندي Action واحد رئيسي، وعادةً مش مرتبط أوي بالـ Actions اللي قلناها من شوية، هنا هستخدم Component واحد يعبّر عن الـ"},{"t":288.12,"en":"it, and that will be the button. But if I want the user to have different actions related to the ones we just mentioned, chips are the best fit. That's the difference between buttons and chips.","ar":"Action ده، وهيكون هو الـ Button. لكن لو عايز أخلّي اليوزر عنده Actions مختلفة ليها علاقة بالـ Actions اللي قلناها من شوية، هنا الـ Chips هي الأنسب. وده الفارق بين الـ Buttons والـ Chips."},{"t":299.64,"en":"Also, buttons are usually used to take me a step forward or a step back in the flow I'm in, or to let me take a main action, like posting","ar":"كمان عادةً الـ Buttons بتُستخدم عشان تخلّيني آخد خطوة لقدّام أو خطوة لورا في الـ Flow اللي أنا ماشي فيه، أو تخلّيني آخد Action رئيسي، زي إني هعمل Post"},{"t":311.37,"en":"now, for example, or publishing something, and so on. That's where we use buttons. But chips, as we said, have specific uses, especially in the scenarios and types we just covered.","ar":"دلوقتي مثلًا، أو Publish لحاجة معيّنة، وهكذا. فهنا بنستخدم الـ Buttons. لكن الـ Chips زي ما قلنا ليها استخدامات معيّنة، خاصةً في الـ Scenarios والـ Types اللي قلناها من شوية."}]},{"id":"S03","type":"card","part":"concept","icons":["tap","sort","ok","idea","target","order"],"title":{"en":"Video summary","ar":"ملخص الفيديو"},"body":{"en":"A chip is a small interactive element that shows a piece of information or does a task. Unlike buttons, which stay at one to three per screen, chips come as a group in one area.\n\n- **Assist chips** take people to another app for a task, like Directions opening the maps app, or Add to calendar.\n- **Filter chips** sit under a search or above a list, and apply as soon as people tap them.\n- **Input chips** show what people entered, like an email's recipients or an applied filter. One tap on ✕ removes them.\n- **Suggestion chips** offer next steps that fit what people are doing, like related words in a translator or quick replies in a chat.\n- **One main action is a button:** a single chip that does one thing is really a button.\n- **Steps forward or back** in a flow, like Save, Cancel, Post or Publish, are buttons.","ar":"الـ Chip عنصر صغير تفاعلي يعرض معلومة أو ينفّذ مهمة. وعلى عكس الأزرار، التي تبقى من واحد إلى ثلاثة في الشاشة، تأتي الـ Chips مجموعةً في مكان واحد.\n\n- **Assist chips** تنقل الناس إلى تطبيق آخر لمهمة، مثل «الاتجاهات» التي تفتح تطبيق الخرائط، أو «أضف إلى التقويم».\n- **Filter chips** تكون تحت البحث أو فوق قائمة، وتُطبَّق بمجرد أن يضغطها الناس.\n- **Input chips** تعرض ما أدخله الناس، مثل المرسَل إليهم في رسالة بريد، أو فلتر مطبَّق. وضغطة واحدة على ✕ تحذفها.\n- **Suggestion chips** تقترح خطوات تالية تناسب ما يفعله الناس، مثل كلمات قريبة في تطبيق ترجمة، أو ردود سريعة في محادثة.\n- **الإجراء الرئيسي الواحد زر:** الـ Chip الوحيدة التي تفعل شيئًا واحدًا هي في الحقيقة زر.\n- **أزرار التقدّم أو الرجوع** بين الخطوات، مثل «حفظ» و«إلغاء» و«انشر»، أزرار."}},{"id":"S04","type":"tune","speaker":"karim","part":"guided","skill":"SK-P14-U02-06","rules":["R06","R15"],"value":{"en":"User control and freedom (NN/g): people often act by mistake and need a clear way out without a long process. As input chips, each recipient has its own ✕, so one tap removes one person; in comma-separated text, people must place the cursor and delete letters, or clear everything.","ar":"تحكّم المستخدم وحرّيته (NN/g): كثيرًا ما يخطئ الناس، ويحتاجون إلى مخرج واضح دون خطوات طويلة. وفي الـ Input chips، لكل مستلم ✕ خاصة به، فضغطة واحدة تحذف شخصًا واحدًا؛ أما في نص تفصله فواصل، فعلى الناس وضع المؤشر ومسح الحروف، أو مسح كل شيء."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/ten-usability-heuristics/","quote":"Users often perform actions by mistake."},"scenario":{"en":"I'm building an email app. People often add the wrong colleague to **To** and need to remove just that one person before sending.","ar":"أبني تطبيقًا للبريد. كثيرًا ما يضيف الناس الزميل الخطأ إلى حقل **إلى**، ويحتاجون إلى حذف هذا الشخص وحده قبل الإرسال."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each version of the To field. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل نسخة من حقل «إلى». أيّ نسخة تتيح حذف الزميل الخطأ وحده بسهولة قبل الإرسال؟"},"start":"text","options":[{"id":"text","text":{"en":"Plain text, names separated by commas","ar":"نص عادي، والأسماء تفصلها فواصل"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"bareed","name":{"en":"Bareed","ar":"بريد"},"color":"#0284C7","icon":"envelope-simple","domain":"bareed.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"New message","ar":"رسالة جديدة"},"back":true,"actions":[{"icon":"paperclip","aria":{"en":"Attach","ar":"إرفاق"}},{"icon":"paper-plane-right","aria":{"en":"Send","ar":"أرسل"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"To","ar":"إلى"},"text":{"en":"Amal Adel, Hossam Fathy, Salma Fawzy","ar":"أمل عادل، حسام فتحي، سلمى فوزي"},"filled":true},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Subject","ar":"الموضوع"},"text":{"en":"Plan for next week","ar":"خطة الأسبوع القادم"},"filled":true,"gap":"s"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Hi all, here is what I suggest for next week…","ar":"أهلًا بالجميع، هذا ما أقترحه للأسبوع القادم…"},"gap":"m"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","icon":"paper-plane-right","text":{"en":"Send","ar":"أرسل"}}],"keyboard":"text"}},{"id":"chips","text":{"en":"Each person is a chip with ✕","ar":"كل شخص Chip عليها ✕"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"bareed","name":{"en":"Bareed","ar":"بريد"},"color":"#0284C7","icon":"envelope-simple","domain":"bareed.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"New message","ar":"رسالة جديدة"},"back":true,"actions":[{"icon":"paperclip","aria":{"en":"Attach","ar":"إرفاق"}},{"icon":"paper-plane-right","aria":{"en":"Send","ar":"أرسل"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"chips","label":{"en":"To","ar":"إلى"},"boxed":true,"items":[{"text":{"en":"Amal Adel","ar":"أمل عادل"},"x":true},{"text":{"en":"Hossam Fathy","ar":"حسام فتحي"},"x":true},{"text":{"en":"Salma Fawzy","ar":"سلمى فوزي"},"x":true}]},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Subject","ar":"الموضوع"},"text":{"en":"Plan for next week","ar":"خطة الأسبوع القادم"},"filled":true,"gap":"s"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Hi all, here is what I suggest for next week…","ar":"أهلًا بالجميع، هذا ما أقترحه للأسبوع القادم…"},"gap":"m"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","icon":"paper-plane-right","text":{"en":"Send","ar":"أرسل"}}],"keyboard":"text"}},{"id":"locked","text":{"en":"Chips without ✕; to remove one, clear the field and start again","ar":"Chips بدون ✕؛ ولحذف شخص، امسح الحقل وابدأ من جديد"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"bareed","name":{"en":"Bareed","ar":"بريد"},"color":"#0284C7","icon":"envelope-simple","domain":"bareed.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"New message","ar":"رسالة جديدة"},"back":true,"actions":[{"icon":"paperclip","aria":{"en":"Attach","ar":"إرفاق"}},{"icon":"paper-plane-right","aria":{"en":"Send","ar":"أرسل"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"chips","label":{"en":"To","ar":"إلى"},"boxed":true,"items":[{"text":{"en":"Amal Adel","ar":"أمل عادل"}},{"text":{"en":"Hossam Fathy","ar":"حسام فتحي"}},{"text":{"en":"Salma Fawzy","ar":"سلمى فوزي"}}]},{"kind":"link","text":{"en":"Clear all","ar":"امسح الكل"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Subject","ar":"الموضوع"},"text":{"en":"Plan for next week","ar":"خطة الأسبوع القادم"},"filled":true,"gap":"s"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Hi all, here is what I suggest for next week…","ar":"أهلًا بالجميع، هذا ما أقترحه للأسبوع القادم…"},"gap":"m"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","icon":"paper-plane-right","text":{"en":"Send","ar":"أرسل"}}],"keyboard":"text"}}],"answer":["chips"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P14-071","when":["text","locked"],"feedback":{"en":"Removing one wrong person takes careful editing or starting over. People in a hurry may send the email to the wrong colleague instead.","ar":"حذف شخص واحد خطأ يحتاج إلى تعديل دقيق أو البدء من جديد. ومن يستعجل قد يرسل الرسالة إلى الزميل الخطأ بدلًا من ذلك."}}],"correct":{"en":"Input chips, each with its own ✕.","ar":"Input chips، لكل منها ✕ خاصة بها."},"explain":{"en":"Each recipient is a clear unit people can check at a glance, and one tap on ✕ removes exactly the wrong one.","ar":"كل مستلم وحدة واضحة يراجعها الناس بنظرة، وضغطة واحدة على ✕ تحذف الشخص الخطأ بالضبط."}},{"id":"S05","type":"tune","speaker":"youssef","part":"guided","skill":"SK-P14-U02-06","rules":["R06","R15"],"confidence":true,"value":{"en":"Filters (NN/g): use interactive filters if people are exploring. People browsing photos try one type, look, and try another, so chips that apply as soon as they're tapped beat a separate Filters page with an Apply button.","ar":"الفلاتر (NN/g): استخدم الفلاتر التفاعلية إذا كان الناس يستكشفون. ومن يتصفّح الصور يجرّب نوعًا، وينظر، ثم يجرّب غيره، لذلك فالـ Chips التي تُطبَّق بمجرد الضغط أفضل من صفحة «فلاتر» منفصلة بزر «طبّق»."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/applying-filters/","quote":"Use interactive filters if your users are exploratory in their search."},"scenario":{"en":"My online shop sells photos, vectors and icons. People search for a word, like **coffee**, then switch between types to see what fits their design.","ar":"متجري على الإنترنت يبيع صورًا ورسومات Vectors وأيقونات. والناس يبحثون عن كلمة، مثل **قهوة**، ثم يتنقّلون بين الأنواع ليروا ما يناسب تصميمهم."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each way to pick a type. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل طريقة لاختيار النوع. أيّ طريقة تتيح للناس التنقّل بين الأنواع بسرعة ورؤية النتائج فورًا؟"},"start":"page","options":[{"id":"page","text":{"en":"A Filters button that opens a page, with Apply at the bottom","ar":"زر «فلاتر» يفتح صفحة، وفي أسفلها «طبّق»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Dar · Graphics","ar":"دار · جرافيك"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"searchbar","text":{"en":"coffee","ar":"قهوة"},"filled":true},{"kind":"button","style":"outline","icon":"sliders-horizontal","text":{"en":"Filters","ar":"فلاتر"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"row","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"coffee","size":"s","alt":{"en":"Coffee photo","ar":"صورة قهوة"}},{"kind":"image","art":"cafe","size":"s","alt":{"en":"Café photo","ar":"صورة مقهى"}},{"kind":"image","art":"coffee","size":"s","alt":{"en":"Coffee cup","ar":"فنجان قهوة"}}]}]}},{"id":"chips","text":{"en":"Filter chips under the search, applied on tap","ar":"Filter chips تحت البحث، تُطبَّق عند الضغط"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Dar · Graphics","ar":"دار · جرافيك"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"searchbar","text":{"en":"coffee","ar":"قهوة"},"filled":true},{"kind":"chips","gap":"s","items":[{"text":{"en":"Photos","ar":"صور"}},{"text":{"en":"Vectors","ar":"Vectors"},"on":true},{"text":{"en":"Icons","ar":"أيقونات"}}]},{"kind":"row","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"coffee","size":"s","text":{"en":"Vector","ar":"Vector"},"alt":{"en":"Coffee vector","ar":"رسم قهوة"}},{"kind":"image","art":"coffee","size":"s","text":{"en":"Vector","ar":"Vector"},"alt":{"en":"Coffee vector","ar":"رسم قهوة"}},{"kind":"image","art":"cafe","size":"s","text":{"en":"Vector","ar":"Vector"},"alt":{"en":"Café vector","ar":"رسم مقهى"}}]}]}},{"id":"loud","text":{"en":"Three filled buttons under the search","ar":"ثلاثة أزرار ممتلئة تحت البحث"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Dar · Graphics","ar":"دار · جرافيك"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"searchbar","text":{"en":"coffee","ar":"قهوة"},"filled":true},{"kind":"row","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Photos","ar":"صور"}},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Vectors","ar":"Vectors"}},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Icons","ar":"أيقونات"}}]},{"kind":"row","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"coffee","size":"s","alt":{"en":"Coffee photo","ar":"صورة قهوة"}},{"kind":"image","art":"cafe","size":"s","alt":{"en":"Café photo","ar":"صورة مقهى"}},{"kind":"image","art":"coffee","size":"s","alt":{"en":"Coffee cup","ar":"فنجان قهوة"}}]}]}}],"answer":["chips"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P14-070","when":["loud"],"feedback":{"en":"Three filled buttons look like three separate main actions, and none shows which type is on now.","ar":"ثلاثة أزرار ممتلئة تبدو ثلاثة إجراءات رئيسية منفصلة، ولا يوضّح أيٌّ منها النوع المختار الآن."}}],"hints":[{"en":"How many times will people switch type while they explore?","ar":"كم مرة سيغيّر الناس النوع وهم يستكشفون؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Filter chips, applied on tap.","ar":"Filter chips، تُطبَّق عند الضغط."},"explain":{"en":"People see every type, switch with one tap and watch the results change at once. The ✓ shows which type is on.","ar":"يرى الناس كل الأنواع، ويبدّلون بينها بضغطة واحدة، ويشاهدون النتائج تتغيّر فورًا. وعلامة ✓ توضّح النوع المختار."}},{"id":"S06","type":"compare","speaker":"sara","part":"contrast","skill":"SK-P14-U02-06","rules":["R11"],"value":{"en":"Similarity (NN/g): a separate color is reserved for the primary call to action. Publish is the one main step on this screen, so it's a filled button; chips are for the group of related extras, like adding photos or tagging dishes.","ar":"مبدأ التشابه (NN/g): يُخصَّص لون منفصل للإجراء الرئيسي. و«انشر» هو الخطوة الرئيسية الوحيدة في هذه الشاشة، لذلك هو زر ممتلئ؛ والـ Chips لمجموعة الإضافات المترابطة، مثل إضافة صور أو تحديد الأطباق."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/gestalt-similarity/","quote":"Thus, a separate color should be reserved for primary calls-to-action to help them stand out among secondary buttons."},"scenario":{"en":"I'm designing a food app where people review restaurants. When they finish writing, they publish the review.","ar":"أصمّم تطبيق طعام يكتب فيه الناس تقييمات للمطاعم. وحين ينتهون من الكتابة، ينشرون التقييم."},"prompt":{"en":"Which version should ship?","ar":"أيّ نسخة يجب أن تُطلق؟"},"a":{"label":{"en":"Version A: Publish is a chip","ar":"النسخة A: «انشر» Chip"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"lokma","name":{"en":"Lokma","ar":"لقمة"},"color":"#F08C00","icon":"hamburger","domain":"lokma.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Share your experience","ar":"شارك تجربتك"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","art":"food-koshary","text":{"en":"Koshary House","ar":"بيت الكشري"},"sub":{"en":"Order delivered today","ar":"وصل الطلب اليوم"}},{"kind":"text","text":"★★★★★","gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","text":{"en":"Great koshary, fast service.","ar":"كشري ممتاز وخدمة سريعة."},"filled":true,"gap":"s"},{"kind":"chips","gap":"m","items":[{"text":{"en":"Publish","ar":"انشر"}}]}]}},"b":{"label":{"en":"Version B: chips for extras, Publish as a button","ar":"النسخة B: Chips للإضافات، و«انشر» زر"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"lokma","name":{"en":"Lokma","ar":"لقمة"},"color":"#F08C00","icon":"hamburger","domain":"lokma.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Share your experience","ar":"شارك تجربتك"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","art":"food-koshary","text":{"en":"Koshary House","ar":"بيت الكشري"},"sub":{"en":"Order delivered today","ar":"وصل الطلب اليوم"}},{"kind":"text","text":"★★★★★","gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","text":{"en":"Great koshary, fast service.","ar":"كشري ممتاز وخدمة سريعة."},"filled":true,"gap":"s"},{"kind":"chips","gap":"s","items":[{"text":{"en":"Photos","ar":"صور"},"icon":"plus"},{"text":{"en":"Dishes","ar":"أطباق"},"icon":"plus"}]}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Publish","ar":"انشر"}}]}},"answer":"b","misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P14-069","when":["a"],"feedback":{"en":"A lone chip is really a small, quiet button. The one step that finishes the task now looks like an optional extra, and some people won't spot it.","ar":"الـ Chip الوحيدة هي في الحقيقة زر صغير وهادئ. والخطوة الوحيدة التي تُنهي المهمة تبدو الآن إضافة اختيارية، وبعض الناس لن يلاحظوها."}}],"correct":{"en":"B: the main step is a button; chips hold the related extras.","ar":"B: الخطوة الرئيسية زر؛ والـ Chips للإضافات المترابطة."},"explain":{"en":"Publish stands out as the step forward. Photos and dishes sit together as a small group of related, optional actions.","ar":"«انشر» بارز لأنه الخطوة التالية. والصور والأطباق معًا في مجموعة صغيرة من الإجراءات الاختيارية المترابطة."}},{"id":"S07","type":"tune","speaker":"tarek","part":"independent","skill":"SK-P14-U02-06","rules":["R14"],"value":{"en":"Suggestions (NN/g): follow-up suggestions are related to an established context, such as an ongoing conversation, and when the suggestion is right, people can skip typing. Replies that fit Marwan's question save typing; generic ones don't.","ar":"الاقتراحات (NN/g): الاقتراحات التالية مرتبطة بسياق قائم، مثل محادثة جارية، وحين يكون الاقتراح مناسبًا، يستطيع الناس الاستغناء عن الكتابة. والردود التي تناسب سؤال مروان توفّر الكتابة؛ أما الردود العامة فلا."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/prompt-suggestions/","quote":"Followup questions are prompt suggestions related to a preestablished context (such as an ongoing conversation)."},"scenario":{"en":"In the chat app I manage, Marwan asks his friend: **\"Are we still on for football at 7?\"** The app shows three suggestion chips above the keyboard.","ar":"في تطبيق المحادثة الذي أديره، يسأل مروان صديقه: **«ما زلنا على موعد الكرة الساعة 7؟»** ويعرض التطبيق ثلاث Suggestion chips فوق لوحة المفاتيح."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each set of suggestion chips. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل مجموعة من الـ Suggestion chips. أيّ مجموعة تعطي صديق مروان ردودًا جاهزة تجيب عن سؤاله؟"},"start":"generic","options":[{"id":"generic","text":{"en":"\"Hi\", \"Thanks\", \"OK\"","ar":"«أهلًا»، «شكرًا»، «تمام»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"hakawy","name":{"en":"Hakawy","ar":"حكاوي"},"color":"#0CA678","icon":"chat-circle","domain":"hakawy.example"},"appbar":{"title":"Marwan","back":true,"actions":[{"icon":"phone","aria":{"en":"Call","ar":"اتصال"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"chat","from":"them","name":"Marwan","avatar":{"art":"man-3"},"text":{"en":"Are we still on for football at 7?","ar":"ما زلنا على موعد الكرة الساعة 7؟"},"time":"5:12"},{"kind":"chips","gap":"l","items":[{"text":{"en":"Hi","ar":"أهلًا"}},{"text":{"en":"Thanks","ar":"شكرًا"}},{"text":{"en":"OK","ar":"تمام"}}]}],"footer":[{"kind":"composer","text":{"en":"Message","ar":"رسالة"}}]}},{"id":"related","text":{"en":"\"Yes, see you at 7\", \"Can we make it 8?\", \"I can't today\"","ar":"«أيوه، أشوفك 7»، «ممكن نخليها 8؟»، «مش هقدر النهارده»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"hakawy","name":{"en":"Hakawy","ar":"حكاوي"},"color":"#0CA678","icon":"chat-circle","domain":"hakawy.example"},"appbar":{"title":"Marwan","back":true,"actions":[{"icon":"phone","aria":{"en":"Call","ar":"اتصال"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"chat","from":"them","name":"Marwan","avatar":{"art":"man-3"},"text":{"en":"Are we still on for football at 7?","ar":"ما زلنا على موعد الكرة الساعة 7؟"},"time":"5:12"},{"kind":"chips","gap":"l","items":[{"text":{"en":"Yes, see you at 7","ar":"أيوه، أشوفك 7"}},{"text":{"en":"Can we make it 8?","ar":"ممكن نخليها 8؟"}},{"text":{"en":"I can't today","ar":"مش هقدر النهارده"}}]}],"footer":[{"kind":"composer","text":{"en":"Message","ar":"رسالة"}}]}},{"id":"one","text":{"en":"One chip: \"Reply\"","ar":"Chip واحدة: «ردّ»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"hakawy","name":{"en":"Hakawy","ar":"حكاوي"},"color":"#0CA678","icon":"chat-circle","domain":"hakawy.example"},"appbar":{"title":"Marwan","back":true,"actions":[{"icon":"phone","aria":{"en":"Call","ar":"اتصال"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"chat","from":"them","name":"Marwan","avatar":{"art":"man-3"},"text":{"en":"Are we still on for football at 7?","ar":"ما زلنا على موعد الكرة الساعة 7؟"},"time":"5:12"},{"kind":"chips","gap":"l","items":[{"text":{"en":"Reply","ar":"ردّ"}}]}],"footer":[{"kind":"composer","text":{"en":"Message","ar":"رسالة"}}]}}],"answer":["related"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P14-072","when":["generic"],"feedback":{"en":"None of these answers Marwan's question, so his friend still has to type the real reply. The chips take space and save nothing.","ar":"لا يجيب أيٌّ منها عن سؤال مروان، فما زال على صديقه أن يكتب الرد الحقيقي. والـ Chips تأخذ مساحة ولا توفّر شيئًا."}},{"id":"MC-P14-069","when":["one"],"feedback":{"en":"A lone Reply chip is just a button for something the message field already does. It suggests nothing.","ar":"Chip «ردّ» وحدها مجرد زر لشيء يفعله حقل الرسالة أصلًا. ولا تقترح شيئًا."}}],"correct":{"en":"Replies that fit the question.","ar":"ردود تناسب السؤال."},"explain":{"en":"Each chip is a real answer to Marwan, so one tap replies. The group covers yes, a change, and no.","ar":"كل Chip ردّ حقيقي على مروان، فضغطة واحدة تكفي للرد. والمجموعة تغطّي الموافقة، والتعديل، والرفض."}},{"id":"S08","type":"card","part":"recap","icons":["group","ok","idea","target"],"title":{"en":"What you practised","ar":"ما تدرّبت عليه"},"body":{"en":"- **Chips for a group** of related choices in one area, like showtimes or filters.\n- **Input chips with ✕**, so one tap removes one entry.\n- **Suggestion chips that fit** what people are doing now.\n- **A button for the one main step**, like Choose seats or Publish.\n\nNext: the skill check, on new cases.","ar":"- **Chips لمجموعة** من الاختيارات المترابطة في مكان واحد، مثل مواعيد العرض أو الفلاتر.\n- **Input chips عليها ✕**، فضغطة واحدة تحذف إدخالًا واحدًا.\n- **Suggestion chips تناسب** ما يفعله الناس الآن.\n- **زر للخطوة الرئيسية الواحدة**، مثل «اختر المقاعد» أو «انشر».\n\nالتالي: اختبار المهارة، على حالات جديدة."}}]}$uxg$::jsonb),
  ($uxg$P14-U02-L05$uxg$, $uxg$78a5231706337b967242e73e727fe7bfb66598e67b098a2a16c6d266a3e4d803$uxg$, $uxg${"id":"P14-U02-L05","mode":"check","minutes":7,"title":{"en":"Skill check: show what's needed, make the next step obvious","ar":"اختبار المهارة: أظهر المطلوب، ووضّح الخطوة التالية"},"speaker":"mona","steps":[{"id":"S01","type":"card","part":"hook","title":{"en":"Mona's travel app","ar":"تطبيق منى للسفر"},"body":{"en":"My team is about to launch an app for booking hotels. Help me review six screens before launch.\n\nThis is a skill check: no hints, and you'll see how you did at the end.","ar":"فريقي على وشك إطلاق تطبيق لحجز الفنادق. ساعدني في مراجعة ست شاشات فيه قبل الإطلاق.\n\nهذا اختبار مهارة: بدون تلميحات، وسترى نتيجتك في النهاية."}},{"id":"S02","type":"tune","part":"check","skill":"SK-P14-U02-03","value":{"en":"Check, similarity (NN/g): a separate color is reserved for the primary action. On the payment screen, that's Pay; giving the filled style to Apply promo code, or to all three, hides the step forward.","ar":"اختبار، مبدأ التشابه (NN/g): يُخصَّص لون منفصل للإجراء الرئيسي. وفي شاشة الدفع، هذا الإجراء هو «ادفع»؛ وإعطاء الشكل الممتلئ لـ«استخدم كود الخصم»، أو للثلاثة، يُخفي الخطوة إلى الأمام."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/gestalt-similarity/","quote":"Thus, a separate color should be reserved for primary calls-to-action to help them stand out among secondary buttons."},"scenario":{"en":"The payment screen has three buttons: **Pay EGP 4,200**, **Apply promo code** and **Back**. Right now, all three are filled.","ar":"في شاشة الدفع ثلاثة أزرار: **ادفع 4,200 جنيه**، و**استخدم كود الخصم**، و**رجوع**. وكلها الآن ممتلئة."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each version. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل نسخة. أيّها يجب أن تُطلق؟"},"start":"all","options":[{"id":"all","text":{"en":"Keep all three filled","ar":"أبقِ الثلاثة ممتلئة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nuzul","name":{"en":"Nuzul","ar":"نُزُل"},"color":"#B7791F","icon":"bed","domain":"nuzul.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Payment","ar":"الدفع"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","art":"hotel-room","text":{"en":"Nile View Hotel","ar":"فندق نايل فيو"},"sub":{"en":"3 nights · 12 to 15 March","ar":"3 ليالٍ · من 12 إلى 15 مارس"},"value":{"en":"EGP 4,200","ar":"4,200 جنيه"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"credit-card","text":{"en":"Visa •••• 4821","ar":"Visa •••• 4821"},"chevron":true,"gap":"s"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Apply promo code","ar":"استخدم كود الخصم"}},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Pay EGP 4,200","ar":"ادفع 4,200 جنيه"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Back","ar":"رجوع"},"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"pay","text":{"en":"Pay filled; promo code outlined; Back as text","ar":"«ادفع» ممتلئ؛ وكود الخصم بإطار فقط؛ و«رجوع» زر نصي"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nuzul","name":{"en":"Nuzul","ar":"نُزُل"},"color":"#B7791F","icon":"bed","domain":"nuzul.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Payment","ar":"الدفع"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","art":"hotel-room","text":{"en":"Nile View Hotel","ar":"فندق نايل فيو"},"sub":{"en":"3 nights · 12 to 15 March","ar":"3 ليالٍ · من 12 إلى 15 مارس"},"value":{"en":"EGP 4,200","ar":"4,200 جنيه"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"credit-card","text":{"en":"Visa •••• 4821","ar":"Visa •••• 4821"},"chevron":true,"gap":"s"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","style":"outline","icon":"tag","text":{"en":"Apply promo code","ar":"استخدم كود الخصم"}},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Pay EGP 4,200","ar":"ادفع 4,200 جنيه"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","style":"text","text":{"en":"Back","ar":"رجوع"},"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"promo","text":{"en":"Promo code filled; Pay and Back outlined","ar":"كود الخصم ممتلئ؛ و«ادفع» و«رجوع» بإطار فقط"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nuzul","name":{"en":"Nuzul","ar":"نُزُل"},"color":"#B7791F","icon":"bed","domain":"nuzul.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Payment","ar":"الدفع"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","art":"hotel-room","text":{"en":"Nile View Hotel","ar":"فندق نايل فيو"},"sub":{"en":"3 nights · 12 to 15 March","ar":"3 ليالٍ · من 12 إلى 15 مارس"},"value":{"en":"EGP 4,200","ar":"4,200 جنيه"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"credit-card","text":{"en":"Visa •••• 4821","ar":"Visa •••• 4821"},"chevron":true,"gap":"s"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","icon":"tag","text":{"en":"Apply promo code","ar":"استخدم كود الخصم"}},{"kind":"button","style":"outline","text":{"en":"Pay EGP 4,200","ar":"ادفع 4,200 جنيه"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","style":"outline","text":{"en":"Back","ar":"رجوع"},"gap":"s"}]}}],"answer":["pay"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P14-019","when":["all"],"feedback":{"en":"Three filled buttons look equally important, so people have to read all three to find the one that pays.","ar":"ثلاثة أزرار ممتلئة تبدو متساوية في الأهمية، فعلى الناس أن يقرؤوا الثلاثة ليجدوا الزر الذي يدفع."}},{"id":"MC-P14-020","when":["promo"],"feedback":{"en":"The loudest button now goes to a side step most people skip. Paying, the step forward, looks secondary.","ar":"أوضح زر الآن يذهب إلى خطوة جانبية يتخطّاها أغلب الناس. والدفع، وهو الخطوة التالية، يبدو ثانويًا."}}],"correct":{"en":"One filled button: Pay.","ar":"زر واحد ممتلئ: «ادفع»."},"explain":{"en":"The eye goes straight to Pay. The promo code and Back are still easy to find, without competing with it.","ar":"تذهب العين مباشرة إلى «ادفع». ويبقى كود الخصم و«رجوع» سهلَي الإيجاد، دون أن ينافساه."},"speaker":"mona"},{"id":"S03","type":"tune","part":"check","skill":"SK-P14-U02-01","value":{"en":"Check, accordions (NN/g): use them on content-heavy pages where people need only a few sections. Guests read the price and photos and then one or two of the eight sections, so titles first saves them scrolling past the rest.","ar":"اختبار، الـ Accordion (NN/g): استخدمه في الصفحات المليئة بالمحتوى حين يحتاج الناس أقسامًا قليلة. والنزلاء يقرؤون السعر والصور ثم قسمًا أو اثنين من الأقسام الثمانية، فالعناوين أولًا توفّر عليهم المرور على الباقي."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/accordions-on-desktop/","quote":"On desktop, use accordions for content-heavy pages where users will not need to access content under several accordions."},"scenario":{"en":"A hotel's page has eight sections: rooms, breakfast, parking, pool, gym, pets, accessibility and house rules. Most guests check one or two of them before booking, and which ones depends on the guest.","ar":"صفحة الفندق فيها ثمانية أقسام: الغرف، والإفطار، وموقف السيارات، والمسبح، والجيم، والحيوانات الأليفة، وتسهيلات ذوي الإعاقة (Accessibility)، وقواعد الفندق. وأغلب النزلاء يراجعون قسمًا أو اثنين قبل الحجز، ويختلف القسم حسب النزيل."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each version of the hotel page. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل نسخة من صفحة الفندق. أيّ نسخة تجعل كل نزيل يصل بسرعة إلى القسم الذي يهمّه؟"},"start":"open","options":[{"id":"open","text":{"en":"All eight sections open, one under the other","ar":"الأقسام الثمانية مفتوحة، واحدًا تحت الآخر"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nuzul","name":{"en":"Nuzul","ar":"نُزُل"},"color":"#B7791F","icon":"bed","domain":"nuzul.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Nile View Hotel","ar":"فندق نايل فيو"},"back":true,"actions":[{"icon":"heart","aria":{"en":"Save","ar":"احفظ"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"hotel-room","size":"m","alt":{"en":"Hotel room","ar":"غرفة الفندق"}},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Nile View Hotel · ★ 4.6","ar":"فندق نايل فيو · ★ 4.6"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"EGP 1,400","ar":"1,400 جنيه"},"per":{"en":"/ night","ar":"/ ليلة"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"text","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Rooms","ar":"الغرف"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"All rooms have a balcony, air conditioning and a safe. Rooms on floors 5 to 9 face the river…","ar":"كل الغرف فيها شرفة وتكييف وخزنة. والغرف في الأدوار من الخامس إلى التاسع تطلّ على النيل…"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"text","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Breakfast","ar":"الإفطار"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Served from 7 to 11 am in the garden restaurant. Children under 6 eat free…","ar":"يُقدَّم من 7 إلى 11 صباحًا في مطعم الحديقة. والأطفال تحت 6 سنوات مجانًا…"},"gap":"xs"}]}},{"id":"acc","text":{"en":"The eight sections as an accordion under the price","ar":"الأقسام الثمانية في Accordion تحت السعر"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nuzul","name":{"en":"Nuzul","ar":"نُزُل"},"color":"#B7791F","icon":"bed","domain":"nuzul.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Nile View Hotel","ar":"فندق نايل فيو"},"back":true,"actions":[{"icon":"heart","aria":{"en":"Save","ar":"احفظ"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"hotel-room","size":"m","alt":{"en":"Hotel room","ar":"غرفة الفندق"}},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Nile View Hotel · ★ 4.6","ar":"فندق نايل فيو · ★ 4.6"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"EGP 1,400","ar":"1,400 جنيه"},"per":{"en":"/ night","ar":"/ ليلة"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"accordion","text":{"en":"Rooms","ar":"الغرف"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"accordion","text":{"en":"Breakfast","ar":"الإفطار"}},{"kind":"accordion","text":{"en":"Parking","ar":"موقف السيارات"}},{"kind":"accordion","text":{"en":"Pool","ar":"المسبح"}},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"+ 4 more sections","ar":"+ 4 أقسام أخرى"},"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"two","text":{"en":"Show only Rooms and Breakfast; remove the other six","ar":"اعرض الغرف والإفطار فقط؛ واحذف الأقسام الستة الأخرى"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nuzul","name":{"en":"Nuzul","ar":"نُزُل"},"color":"#B7791F","icon":"bed","domain":"nuzul.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Nile View Hotel","ar":"فندق نايل فيو"},"back":true,"actions":[{"icon":"heart","aria":{"en":"Save","ar":"احفظ"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"hotel-room","size":"m","alt":{"en":"Hotel room","ar":"غرفة الفندق"}},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Nile View Hotel · ★ 4.6","ar":"فندق نايل فيو · ★ 4.6"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"EGP 1,400","ar":"1,400 جنيه"},"per":{"en":"/ night","ar":"/ ليلة"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"text","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Rooms","ar":"الغرف"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"All rooms have a balcony, air conditioning and a safe…","ar":"كل الغرف فيها شرفة وتكييف وخزنة…"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"text","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Breakfast","ar":"الإفطار"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Served from 7 to 11 am in the garden restaurant…","ar":"يُقدَّم من 7 إلى 11 صباحًا في مطعم الحديقة…"},"gap":"xs"}]}}],"answer":["acc"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P14-017","when":["open"],"feedback":{"en":"A guest who only cares about parking has to scroll past rooms, breakfast and more before finding it.","ar":"النزيل الذي يهمّه موقف السيارات فقط عليه أن يمرّ على الغرف والإفطار وغيرهما قبل أن يجده."}},{"id":"MC-P14-018","when":["two"],"feedback":{"en":"A guest with a dog or a wheelchair now finds nothing about it, and may not book at all.","ar":"النزيل الذي معه كلب أو كرسي متحرّك لن يجد الآن شيئًا عن ذلك، وقد لا يحجز أصلًا."}}],"correct":{"en":"A few sections each: an accordion.","ar":"كل نزيل يحتاج قسمًا أو اثنين: Accordion."},"explain":{"en":"Every guest sees all eight titles, opens the one or two they care about, and skips the rest. Nothing is removed.","ar":"كل نزيل يرى العناوين الثمانية، ويفتح القسم أو القسمين اللذين يهمّانه، ويتخطّى الباقي. ولم يُحذف شيء."},"speaker":"mona"},{"id":"S04","type":"tune","part":"check","skill":"SK-P14-U02-05","value":{"en":"Check, floating buttons and icons (NN/g): one floating button for the screen's most common and important action, with a label that's visible at all times. A plane icon alone could mean flights or trips; support isn't why people open Trips.","ar":"اختبار، الأزرار العائمة والأيقونات (NN/g): زر عائم واحد للإجراء الأكثر استخدامًا وأهمية في الشاشة، مع تسمية ظاهرة دائمًا. وأيقونة الطائرة وحدها قد تعني الرحلات الجوية أو السفريات؛ والدعم ليس سبب فتح الناس لصفحة «رحلاتي»."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/icon-usability/","quote":"Icon labels should be visible at all times, without any interaction from the user."},"scenario":{"en":"Most people open **My trips** to start planning a new trip. The app also has a support chat, which few people use.","ar":"أغلب الناس يفتحون **رحلاتي** ليبدؤوا التخطيط لرحلة جديدة. وفي التطبيق أيضًا محادثة دعم، قليلون يستخدمونها."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each floating button. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل زر عائم. أيّها يجب أن يُطلق؟"},"start":"icon","options":[{"id":"icon","text":{"en":"\"✈\" alone","ar":"«✈» وحدها"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nuzul","name":{"en":"Nuzul","ar":"نُزُل"},"color":"#B7791F","icon":"bed","domain":"nuzul.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"My trips","ar":"رحلاتي"},"large":true},"tabbar":{"active":1,"items":[{"icon":"magnifying-glass","text":{"en":"Explore","ar":"استكشف"}},{"icon":"suitcase","text":{"en":"Trips","ar":"رحلاتي"}},{"icon":"user","text":{"en":"Account","ar":"حسابي"}}]},"fab":{"icon":"airplane-tilt"},"blocks":[{"kind":"card","art":"hotel-room","blocks":[{"kind":"text","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Aswan · 12 to 15 March","ar":"أسوان · من 12 إلى 15 مارس"}},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Nile View Hotel · 3 nights","ar":"فندق نايل فيو · 3 ليالٍ"},"gap":"xs"}]},{"kind":"card","art":"beach","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"text","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Dahab · 2 to 6 May","ar":"دهب · من 2 إلى 6 مايو"}},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Blue Lagoon Camp · 4 nights","ar":"معسكر بلو لاجون · 4 ليالٍ"},"gap":"xs"}]}]}},{"id":"support","text":{"en":"\"💬 Support\"","ar":"«💬 الدعم»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nuzul","name":{"en":"Nuzul","ar":"نُزُل"},"color":"#B7791F","icon":"bed","domain":"nuzul.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"My trips","ar":"رحلاتي"},"large":true},"tabbar":{"active":1,"items":[{"icon":"magnifying-glass","text":{"en":"Explore","ar":"استكشف"}},{"icon":"suitcase","text":{"en":"Trips","ar":"رحلاتي"}},{"icon":"user","text":{"en":"Account","ar":"حسابي"}}]},"fab":{"icon":"chat-circle-dots","text":{"en":"Support","ar":"الدعم"}},"blocks":[{"kind":"card","art":"hotel-room","blocks":[{"kind":"text","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Aswan · 12 to 15 March","ar":"أسوان · من 12 إلى 15 مارس"}},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Nile View Hotel · 3 nights","ar":"فندق نايل فيو · 3 ليالٍ"},"gap":"xs"}]},{"kind":"card","art":"beach","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"text","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Dahab · 2 to 6 May","ar":"دهب · من 2 إلى 6 مايو"}},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Blue Lagoon Camp · 4 nights","ar":"معسكر بلو لاجون · 4 ليالٍ"},"gap":"xs"}]}]}},{"id":"plan","text":{"en":"\"✈ Plan a trip\"","ar":"«✈ خطّط لرحلة»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nuzul","name":{"en":"Nuzul","ar":"نُزُل"},"color":"#B7791F","icon":"bed","domain":"nuzul.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"My trips","ar":"رحلاتي"},"large":true},"tabbar":{"active":1,"items":[{"icon":"magnifying-glass","text":{"en":"Explore","ar":"استكشف"}},{"icon":"suitcase","text":{"en":"Trips","ar":"رحلاتي"}},{"icon":"user","text":{"en":"Account","ar":"حسابي"}}]},"fab":{"icon":"airplane-tilt","text":{"en":"Plan a trip","ar":"خطّط لرحلة"}},"blocks":[{"kind":"card","art":"hotel-room","blocks":[{"kind":"text","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Aswan · 12 to 15 March","ar":"أسوان · من 12 إلى 15 مارس"}},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Nile View Hotel · 3 nights","ar":"فندق نايل فيو · 3 ليالٍ"},"gap":"xs"}]},{"kind":"card","art":"beach","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"text","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Dahab · 2 to 6 May","ar":"دهب · من 2 إلى 6 مايو"}},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Blue Lagoon Camp · 4 nights","ar":"معسكر بلو لاجون · 4 ليالٍ"},"gap":"xs"}]}]}}],"answer":["plan"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P14-024","when":["icon"],"feedback":{"en":"The plane could mean flights, bookings or trips. Without a label, people have to guess what one tap will do.","ar":"الطائرة قد تعني الرحلات الجوية أو الحجوزات أو السفريات. وبدون تسمية، على الناس أن يخمّنوا ما ستفعله الضغطة."}},{"id":"MC-P14-023","when":["support"],"feedback":{"en":"Few people use support, yet it takes the button that's always in reach. Planning a trip, the main action, has to be found elsewhere.","ar":"قليلون يستخدمون الدعم، ومع ذلك يأخذ الزر الذي يبقى دائمًا في المتناول. والتخطيط لرحلة، الإجراء الرئيسي، يجب البحث عنه في مكان آخر."}}],"correct":{"en":"The main action, with a label.","ar":"الإجراء الرئيسي، مع تسمية."},"explain":{"en":"\"Plan a trip\" is why people open this screen, and the label says exactly what the button does.","ar":"«خطّط لرحلة» هو سبب فتح الناس لهذه الشاشة، والتسمية تقول بالضبط ما يفعله الزر."},"speaker":"mona"},{"id":"S05","type":"tune","part":"check","skill":"SK-P14-U02-02","value":{"en":"Check, accordions (NN/g): avoid hiding crucial information within collapsed panels. A deposit that's charged now and never refunded changes whether people book, so it belongs next to Book, not under Payment details.","ar":"اختبار، الـ Accordion (NN/g): تجنّب إخفاء أي معلومة مهمة داخل الأقسام المطويّة. ومبلغ التأمين الذي يُخصم الآن ولا يُسترد يغيّر قرار الناس بالحجز، فمكانه بجانب «احجز»، لا تحت «تفاصيل الدفع»."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/accordions-on-desktop/","quote":"Avoid hiding any crucial information within the collapsed panels."},"scenario":{"en":"This hotel charges a deposit of EGP 500 when you book, and the deposit is never refunded. That rule is inside the collapsed **Payment details** section of the booking summary.","ar":"هذا الفندق يخصم مبلغ تأمين 500 جنيه عند الحجز، ولا يُسترد هذا المبلغ أبدًا. وهذا الشرط داخل قسم **تفاصيل الدفع** المطويّ في ملخّص الحجز."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each version. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل نسخة. أيّها يجب أن تُطلق؟"},"start":"inside","options":[{"id":"inside","text":{"en":"Keep the rule inside Payment details","ar":"أبقِ الشرط داخل «تفاصيل الدفع»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nuzul","name":{"en":"Nuzul","ar":"نُزُل"},"color":"#B7791F","icon":"bed","domain":"nuzul.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Booking summary","ar":"ملخّص الحجز"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","art":"hotel-room","text":{"en":"Nile View Hotel","ar":"فندق نايل فيو"},"sub":{"en":"3 nights","ar":"3 ليالٍ"},"value":{"en":"EGP 4,200","ar":"4,200 جنيه"}},{"kind":"accordion","text":{"en":"Room","ar":"الغرفة"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"accordion","text":{"en":"Payment details","ar":"تفاصيل الدفع"}}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Book","ar":"احجز"}}]}},{"id":"line","text":{"en":"Show the rule in a line right above Book","ar":"اعرض الشرط في سطر فوق «احجز» مباشرة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nuzul","name":{"en":"Nuzul","ar":"نُزُل"},"color":"#B7791F","icon":"bed","domain":"nuzul.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Booking summary","ar":"ملخّص الحجز"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","art":"hotel-room","text":{"en":"Nile View Hotel","ar":"فندق نايل فيو"},"sub":{"en":"3 nights","ar":"3 ليالٍ"},"value":{"en":"EGP 4,200","ar":"4,200 جنيه"}},{"kind":"accordion","text":{"en":"Room","ar":"الغرفة"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"accordion","text":{"en":"Payment details","ar":"تفاصيل الدفع"}},{"kind":"small","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"EGP 500 is charged now and won't be refunded.","ar":"يُخصم 500 جنيه الآن ولا يُسترد."},"gap":"l"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Book","ar":"احجز"}}]}},{"id":"star","text":{"en":"Keep it inside, and add ★ to the Payment details title","ar":"أبقِه بالداخل، وأضف ★ إلى عنوان «تفاصيل الدفع»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nuzul","name":{"en":"Nuzul","ar":"نُزُل"},"color":"#B7791F","icon":"bed","domain":"nuzul.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Booking summary","ar":"ملخّص الحجز"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","art":"hotel-room","text":{"en":"Nile View Hotel","ar":"فندق نايل فيو"},"sub":{"en":"3 nights","ar":"3 ليالٍ"},"value":{"en":"EGP 4,200","ar":"4,200 جنيه"}},{"kind":"accordion","text":{"en":"Room","ar":"الغرفة"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"accordion","text":{"en":"Payment details ★","ar":"تفاصيل الدفع ★"}}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Book","ar":"احجز"}}]}}],"answer":["line"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P14-018","when":["inside","star"],"feedback":{"en":"Most people tap Book without opening Payment details, so they learn about the lost EGP 500 only after it's gone.","ar":"أغلب الناس يضغطون «احجز» دون أن يفتحوا «تفاصيل الدفع»، فلا يعرفون بالـ 500 جنيه إلا بعد أن تضيع."}}],"correct":{"en":"It changes the decision: keep it in sight.","ar":"يغيّر القرار: أبقِه ظاهرًا."},"explain":{"en":"One line above Book makes sure everyone sees the deposit rule before they pay. The rest of the payment details can stay collapsed.","ar":"سطر واحد فوق «احجز» يضمن أن يرى الجميع شرط التأمين قبل الدفع. ويمكن أن تبقى باقي تفاصيل الدفع مطويّة."},"speaker":"mona"},{"id":"S06","type":"tune","part":"check","skill":"SK-P14-U02-04","value":{"en":"Check, contextual menus (NN/g): show actions people use often directly; put secondary or low-priority ones in a menu. At the hotel, guests open the booking code and directions again and again; the invoice and reporting a problem are rare.","ar":"اختبار، قوائم السياق (NN/g): اعرض الإجراءات التي يستخدمها الناس كثيرًا مباشرة؛ وضع الثانوية أو قليلة الأهمية في قائمة. وفي الفندق، يفتح النزلاء رمز الحجز والاتجاهات مرة بعد مرة؛ أما الفاتورة والإبلاغ عن مشكلة فنادران."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/contextual-menus-guidelines/","quote":"Contextual menus are not appropriate for actions users rely on frequently."},"scenario":{"en":"On a trip's page, guests open **Booking code** and **Directions** many times during their stay. **Download invoice** and **Report a problem** are each used by a few guests, once.","ar":"في صفحة الرحلة، يفتح النزلاء **رمز الحجز** و**الاتجاهات** مرات كثيرة أثناء إقامتهم. أما **حمّل الفاتورة** و**أبلِغ عن مشكلة** فلا يستخدمهما إلا قليل من النزلاء، مرة واحدة."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each version of the trip's page. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل نسخة من صفحة الرحلة. أيّ نسخة تُبقي ما يفتحه النزلاء كثيرًا قريبًا منهم؟"},"start":"menu","options":[{"id":"menu","text":{"en":"All four in a ⋯ menu","ar":"الأربعة في قائمة ⋯"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nuzul","name":{"en":"Nuzul","ar":"نُزُل"},"color":"#B7791F","icon":"bed","domain":"nuzul.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Aswan trip","ar":"رحلة أسوان"},"back":true,"actions":[{"icon":"dots-three-vertical","aria":{"en":"More","ar":"المزيد"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"hotel-room","size":"m","alt":{"en":"Nile View Hotel","ar":"فندق نايل فيو"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"calendar-blank","text":{"en":"Nile View Hotel","ar":"فندق نايل فيو"},"sub":{"en":"12 to 15 March · 2 guests","ar":"من 12 إلى 15 مارس · ضيفان"},"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"two","text":{"en":"Booking code and Directions on screen; the other two in ⋯","ar":"رمز الحجز والاتجاهات على الشاشة؛ والاثنان الآخران في ⋯"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nuzul","name":{"en":"Nuzul","ar":"نُزُل"},"color":"#B7791F","icon":"bed","domain":"nuzul.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Aswan trip","ar":"رحلة أسوان"},"back":true,"actions":[{"icon":"dots-three-vertical","aria":{"en":"More","ar":"المزيد"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"hotel-room","size":"m","alt":{"en":"Nile View Hotel","ar":"فندق نايل فيو"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"calendar-blank","text":{"en":"Nile View Hotel","ar":"فندق نايل فيو"},"sub":{"en":"12 to 15 March · 2 guests","ar":"من 12 إلى 15 مارس · ضيفان"},"gap":"s"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","icon":"qr-code","text":{"en":"Show booking code","ar":"اعرض رمز الحجز"}},{"kind":"button","style":"outline","icon":"navigation-arrow","text":{"en":"Directions","ar":"الاتجاهات"},"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"all","text":{"en":"All four as buttons","ar":"الأربعة أزرارًا ظاهرة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nuzul","name":{"en":"Nuzul","ar":"نُزُل"},"color":"#B7791F","icon":"bed","domain":"nuzul.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Aswan trip","ar":"رحلة أسوان"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"hotel-room","size":"m","alt":{"en":"Nile View Hotel","ar":"فندق نايل فيو"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"calendar-blank","text":{"en":"Nile View Hotel","ar":"فندق نايل فيو"},"sub":{"en":"12 to 15 March · 2 guests","ar":"من 12 إلى 15 مارس · ضيفان"},"gap":"s"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","icon":"qr-code","text":{"en":"Show booking code","ar":"اعرض رمز الحجز"}},{"kind":"button","style":"outline","text":{"en":"Directions","ar":"الاتجاهات"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","style":"outline","text":{"en":"Download invoice","ar":"حمّل الفاتورة"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","style":"outline","text":{"en":"Report a problem","ar":"أبلِغ عن مشكلة"},"gap":"s"}]}}],"answer":["two"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P14-021","when":["menu"],"feedback":{"en":"Guests open the booking code at the front desk and directions in the street, many times. Hiding them behind ⋯ adds a tap every time, and some guests won't find them.","ar":"يفتح النزلاء رمز الحجز عند الاستقبال والاتجاهات في الشارع، مرات كثيرة. وإخفاؤهما خلف ⋯ يضيف ضغطة في كل مرة، وبعض النزلاء لن يجدوهما."}},{"id":"MC-P14-022","when":["all"],"feedback":{"en":"The invoice and reporting a problem are each used once by a few guests, but they take as much room as the actions everyone needs.","ar":"الفاتورة والإبلاغ عن مشكلة لا يستخدمهما إلا قليل من النزلاء مرة واحدة، لكنهما يأخذان المساحة نفسها التي تأخذها الإجراءات التي يحتاجها الجميع."}}],"correct":{"en":"Often used: on screen. Rare: in ⋯.","ar":"المتكرّر: على الشاشة. والنادر: في ⋯."},"explain":{"en":"The two actions guests use all stay long are one tap away. The invoice and reporting wait in ⋯ for the few who need them.","ar":"الإجراءان اللذان يستخدمهما النزلاء طوال إقامتهم بضغطة واحدة. والفاتورة والإبلاغ ينتظران في ⋯ للقلّة التي تحتاجهما."},"speaker":"mona"},{"id":"S07","type":"tune","part":"check","skill":"SK-P14-U02-06","value":{"en":"Check, proximity and similarity (NN/g): related items close together read as one group, and the filled color is reserved for the primary action. Room types are one set of choices, so they're chips; Book now is the step forward, so it's the filled button.","ar":"اختبار، مبدأ التقارب والتشابه (NN/g): العناصر المترابطة القريبة من بعضها تُقرأ مجموعة واحدة، واللون الممتلئ مخصّص للإجراء الرئيسي. وأنواع الغرف مجموعة واحدة من الاختيارات، فهي Chips؛ و«احجز الآن» هي الخطوة إلى الأمام، فهي الزر الممتلئ."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/gestalt-proximity/","quote":"Items close together are likely to be perceived as part of the same group — sharing similar functionality or traits."},"scenario":{"en":"The room screen. Guests pick one room type, **Single**, **Double** or **Family**, then book.","ar":"شاشة الغرفة. يختار النزلاء نوع غرفة واحدًا، **فردية** أو **مزدوجة** أو **عائلية**، ثم يحجزون."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each version. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل نسخة. أيّها يجب أن تُطلق؟"},"start":"allchips","options":[{"id":"allchips","text":{"en":"Room types and Book now, all as chips","ar":"أنواع الغرف و«احجز الآن»، كلها Chips"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nuzul","name":{"en":"Nuzul","ar":"نُزُل"},"color":"#B7791F","icon":"bed","domain":"nuzul.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Room type","ar":"نوع الغرفة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","art":"hotel-room","text":{"en":"Nile View Hotel","ar":"فندق نايل فيو"},"sub":{"en":"12 to 15 March · 2 guests","ar":"من 12 إلى 15 مارس · ضيفان"}},{"kind":"chips","gap":"m","items":[{"text":{"en":"Single","ar":"فردية"}},{"text":{"en":"Double","ar":"مزدوجة"},"on":true},{"text":{"en":"Family","ar":"عائلية"}},{"text":{"en":"Book now","ar":"احجز الآن"}}]}]}},{"id":"allbuttons","text":{"en":"Room types and Book now, all as filled buttons","ar":"أنواع الغرف و«احجز الآن»، كلها أزرار ممتلئة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nuzul","name":{"en":"Nuzul","ar":"نُزُل"},"color":"#B7791F","icon":"bed","domain":"nuzul.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Room type","ar":"نوع الغرفة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","art":"hotel-room","text":{"en":"Nile View Hotel","ar":"فندق نايل فيو"},"sub":{"en":"12 to 15 March · 2 guests","ar":"من 12 إلى 15 مارس · ضيفان"}},{"kind":"row","gap":"m","blocks":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Single","ar":"فردية"}},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Double","ar":"مزدوجة"}},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Family","ar":"عائلية"}}]}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Book now","ar":"احجز الآن"}}]}},{"id":"mixed","text":{"en":"Room types as chips; Book now as a filled button","ar":"أنواع الغرف Chips؛ و«احجز الآن» زر ممتلئ"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nuzul","name":{"en":"Nuzul","ar":"نُزُل"},"color":"#B7791F","icon":"bed","domain":"nuzul.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Room type","ar":"نوع الغرفة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","art":"hotel-room","text":{"en":"Nile View Hotel","ar":"فندق نايل فيو"},"sub":{"en":"12 to 15 March · 2 guests","ar":"من 12 إلى 15 مارس · ضيفان"}},{"kind":"chips","gap":"m","items":[{"text":{"en":"Single","ar":"فردية"}},{"text":{"en":"Double","ar":"مزدوجة"},"on":true},{"text":{"en":"Family","ar":"عائلية"}}]}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Book now","ar":"احجز الآن"}}]}}],"answer":["mixed"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P14-069","when":["allchips"],"feedback":{"en":"Book now looks like a fourth room type. The one step that finishes the booking is hidden among the choices.","ar":"«احجز الآن» يبدو نوعًا رابعًا من الغرف. والخطوة الوحيدة التي تُنهي الحجز مختبئة بين الاختيارات."}},{"id":"MC-P14-070","when":["allbuttons"],"feedback":{"en":"Four filled buttons look equally important, so Book now doesn't stand out, and nothing shows which room is picked.","ar":"أربعة أزرار ممتلئة تبدو متساوية في الأهمية، فلا يبرز «احجز الآن»، ولا يظهر أيّ غرفة اختيرت."}}],"correct":{"en":"Room types as chips; Book now as the button.","ar":"أنواع الغرف Chips؛ و«احجز الآن» الزر."},"explain":{"en":"Guests see the three rooms as one set and which one is picked. Book now alone is filled, so the next step is clear.","ar":"يرى النزلاء الغرف الثلاث مجموعةً واحدة، ويرون أيّها اختير. و«احجز الآن» وحده ممتلئ، فتكون الخطوة التالية واضحة."},"speaker":"mona"}]}$uxg$::jsonb),
  ($uxg$P14-U03-L01$uxg$, $uxg$0a5e9511269c0ac39731275e2cf3db2bf85bb103cf699735dea04fca7f0b0068$uxg$, $uxg${"id":"P14-U03-L01","mode":"lesson","minutes":8,"title":{"en":"Suggestions that lead somewhere","ar":"اقتراحات توصل إلى نتائج"},"speaker":"sara","review_labels":{"MC-P14-025":{"en":"A suggestion must lead to real results","ar":"الاقتراح يجب أن يوصل إلى نتائج حقيقية"},"MC-P14-026":{"en":"Style the part people need to tell apart","ar":"أبرز الجزء الذي يفرّق بين الاقتراحات"}},"steps":[{"id":"S01","type":"card","part":"hook","title":{"en":"Sara's recipe site","ar":"موقع سارة للوصفات"},"body":{"en":"I work on a recipe site. When people tap the search box, a list of suggestions drops down under it.\n\nMy team fills that list from the most popular food searches on the web. Some of them, like **lentil burger**, have no recipe on our site at all.","ar":"أعمل على موقع للوصفات. وحين يضغط الناس على مربع البحث، تظهر تحته قائمة اقتراحات.\n\nويملأ فريقي هذه القائمة من أشهر عمليات البحث عن الطعام على الإنترنت. وبعضها، مثل **شوربة البصل الفرنسية**، ليس له أي وصفة في موقعنا."},"mock":{"app":{"id":"tabkha","name":{"en":"Tabkha","ar":"طبخة"},"color":"#EA580C","icon":"cooking-pot","domain":"tabkha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Search recipes","ar":"ابحث عن وصفة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"searchbar","text":{"en":"lentil","ar":"شوربة"},"filled":true,"focus":true,"suggest":[{"icon":"cooking-pot","text":{"en":"lentil **soup**","ar":"شوربة **عدس**"},"value":{"en":"Recipe","ar":"وصفة"}},{"icon":"cooking-pot","text":{"en":"lentil **burger**","ar":"شوربة **بصل فرنسية**"},"value":{"en":"Recipe","ar":"وصفة"}},{"icon":"cooking-pot","text":{"en":"lentil **salad**","ar":"شوربة **لسان عصفور**"},"value":{"en":"Recipe","ar":"وصفة"}}]}],"keyboard":"text"}},{"id":"S02","type":"tune","part":"try","skill":"SK-P14-U03-01","rules":["R12"],"confidence":true,"value":{"en":"Try first. Search suggestions (NN/g): suggested terms that return zero results, or irrelevant results, are worse than unhelpful. A suggestion is a promise that something is there.","ar":"جرّب أولًا. اقتراحات البحث (NN/g): الاقتراحات التي تُرجع صفر نتائج، أو نتائج غير مرتبطة، أسوأ من عديمة الفائدة. فالاقتراح وعد بأن هناك شيئًا موجودًا."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/site-search-suggestions/","quote":"Suggested terms that return zero results, or irrelevant results, are worse than unhelpful"},"prompt":{"en":"Someone types \"lentil\". Try each suggestion list. Which one should ship?","ar":"كتب شخص «شوربة». جرّب كل قائمة اقتراحات. أيّ قائمة توفّر على الناس الكتابة وتوصلهم دائمًا إلى وصفات؟"},"start":"web","options":[{"id":"web","text":{"en":"Popular web searches, including dishes the site doesn't have","ar":"أشهر عمليات البحث على الإنترنت، ومعها أطباق ليست في الموقع"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"No recipe on the site for burger or pasta","ar":"لا وصفة في الموقع لشوربة البصل ولا لشوربة الكاري"},"app":{"id":"tabkha","name":{"en":"Tabkha","ar":"طبخة"},"color":"#EA580C","icon":"cooking-pot","domain":"tabkha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Search recipes","ar":"ابحث عن وصفة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"searchbar","text":{"en":"lentil","ar":"شوربة"},"filled":true,"focus":true,"suggest":[{"icon":"cooking-pot","text":{"en":"lentil **soup**","ar":"شوربة **عدس**"},"value":{"en":"Recipe","ar":"وصفة"}},{"icon":"cooking-pot","text":{"en":"lentil **burger**","ar":"شوربة **بصل فرنسية**"},"value":{"en":"Recipe","ar":"وصفة"}},{"icon":"cooking-pot","text":{"en":"lentil **pasta**","ar":"شوربة **كريمة بالكاري**"},"value":{"en":"Recipe","ar":"وصفة"}},{"icon":"cooking-pot","text":{"en":"lentil **salad**","ar":"شوربة **لسان عصفور**"},"value":{"en":"Recipe","ar":"وصفة"}}]}],"keyboard":"text"}},{"id":"site","text":{"en":"Only searches that find recipes on this site","ar":"عمليات البحث التي تجد وصفات في هذا الموقع فقط"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"tabkha","name":{"en":"Tabkha","ar":"طبخة"},"color":"#EA580C","icon":"cooking-pot","domain":"tabkha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Search recipes","ar":"ابحث عن وصفة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"searchbar","text":{"en":"lentil","ar":"شوربة"},"filled":true,"focus":true,"suggest":[{"icon":"cooking-pot","text":{"en":"lentil **soup**","ar":"شوربة **عدس**"},"value":{"en":"Recipe","ar":"وصفة"}},{"icon":"cooking-pot","text":{"en":"lentil **salad**","ar":"شوربة **لسان عصفور**"},"value":{"en":"Recipe","ar":"وصفة"}},{"icon":"cooking-pot","text":{"en":"lentil **with rice (koshari)**","ar":"شوربة **خضار**"},"value":{"en":"Recipe","ar":"وصفة"}}]}],"keyboard":"text"}},{"id":"none","text":{"en":"No suggestions; people type the whole search","ar":"بدون اقتراحات؛ يكتب الناس البحث كاملًا"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"tabkha","name":{"en":"Tabkha","ar":"طبخة"},"color":"#EA580C","icon":"cooking-pot","domain":"tabkha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Search recipes","ar":"ابحث عن وصفة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"searchbar","text":{"en":"lentil","ar":"شوربة"},"filled":true,"focus":true}],"keyboard":"text"}}],"answer":["site"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P14-025","when":["web"],"feedback":{"en":"\"Lentil burger\" and \"lentil pasta\" look like a promise, then open an empty results page. People who pick them waste a tap and often give up on searching.","ar":"«شوربة بصل فرنسية» و«شوربة كريمة بالكاري» تبدوان وعدًا، ثم تفتحان صفحة نتائج فارغة. ومن يختارهما يضيّع ضغطة، وكثيرًا ما يتوقّف عن البحث."}},{"id":"MC-P14-025","when":["none"],"feedback":{"en":"Without suggestions, people type the whole search themselves, with more effort and more typos. Good suggestions save that work.","ar":"بدون اقتراحات، يكتب الناس البحث كاملًا بأنفسهم، بجهد أكبر وأخطاء إملائية أكثر. والاقتراحات الجيدة توفّر هذا الجهد."}}],"hints":[{"en":"What happens when someone taps \"lentil burger\"?","ar":"ماذا يحدث حين يضغط شخص على «شوربة بصل فرنسية»؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Only suggestions that find recipes here.","ar":"الاقتراحات التي تجد وصفات هنا فقط."},"explain":{"en":"Every suggestion in the list opens real recipes, so picking one is always a good move. People type less and still land on something.","ar":"كل اقتراح في القائمة يفتح وصفات حقيقية، فاختيار أي واحد منها خطوة صحيحة دائمًا. ويكتب الناس أقل ويصلون إلى شيء."}},{"id":"S10","type":"video","part":"concept","title":{"en":"Suggestions that lead somewhere","ar":"اقتراحات توصل إلى نتائج"},"video":"94bc590f-d13d-43dc-8723-f72fb8531361","duration":378,"transcript":[{"t":2.5,"en":"Another of the most important things that makes search effective is the suggestions and results that can appear while the user searches, as soon as they tap the search bar.","ar":"برضه من أهم الحاجات اللي بتخلّي السيرش Effective هي الـ Suggestions والنتايج اللي ممكن تظهر لليوزر وهو بيعمل السيرش، يعني أول ما اليوزر يدوس على الـ Search bar."},{"t":13.1,"en":"Before I even start, suggestions may appear in the search bar itself, as a menu or list under it, and as I type, suggestions can appear based on what I'm typing.","ar":"عشان أبدأ السيرش ممكن تظهر لي اقتراحات في الـ Search bar نفسها، على شكل Menu أو List تحت السيرش، ولما أكتب ممكن تبدأ تظهر اقتراحات بناءً على اللي بكتبه."},{"t":24.6,"en":"This is very important in making search easier: the search suggestions themselves. So we'll go through some notes that can improve them as they appear to the user.","ar":"دي من الحاجات المهمة جدًا اللي بتسهّل عملية الـ Search، الـ Search suggestions نفسها. فهنقول فيها برضه بعض الملاحظات اللي ممكن تحسّنها وهي بتظهر لليوزر."},{"t":37.19,"en":"First, as we said, as soon as the user types the query, a dropdown with these suggestions starts to appear so they can pick from it.","ar":"أول حاجة، زي ما قلنا، اليوزر أول ما يكتب الكويري هتبدأ تظهر له زي Drop down فيها الاقتراحات دي، عشان يبدأ يختار منها."},{"t":46.34,"en":"So what's special about them? Why do I put these suggestions there at all? First, when users pick one, they've picked something appropriate: something that really brings them suitable results, because I'm the one who suggested it.","ar":"إيه المميز أصلًا؟ أنا ليه أصلًا بحط الـ Suggestions دي أو الاقتراحات دي؟ أول حاجة: اليوزر لما يختار منها، هو اختار حاجة مناسبة. يعني حاجة تطلع له فعلًا نتايج مناسبة، بما إني أنا اللي اقترحتها عليه."},{"t":57.24,"en":"They typed a few letters or words in the query and suggestions appeared, and if they pick one of them, they'll definitely get results that really exist on the website.","ar":"هو كيوزر كتب كام حرف أو كام كلمة في الكويري فظهرت له اقتراحات، ولو اختار واحد منها فأكيد هتطلع له نتايج موجودة فعلًا في الـ Website."},{"t":69.74,"en":"If they finish the search themselves they may find no results, or results that aren't what they wanted. But if they type a few characters and a suggestion appears, that suggestion most likely has good results in my website or product, so if they pick it and it fits what they're after, they'll get good results.","ar":"لو كمّل السيرش بنفسه ممكن يلاقي إن مفيش نتايج، أو النتايج اللي طلعت مش اللي عايزها. لكن لو كتب بعض الحروف وطلع له اقتراح، فالأغلب إن للاقتراح ده نتايج كويسة في الـ Website أو الـ Product بتاعي، فلو اختاره، وهو مناسب لللي بيدوّر عليه، هتطلع له نتايج كويسة."},{"t":88.14,"en":"It matters for interaction cost too: they don't spend mental or physical effort typing everything. As soon as they type a few characters suggestions appear, and if one fits, the interaction cost is very low: a few characters, then straight to choosing.","ar":"وده مهم برضه لفكرة الـ Interaction cost: هو مش هيبذل مجهود ذهني أو بدني عشان يكتب الكلام كامل. مجرد ما يكتب كام حرف هتظهر له اقتراحات، ولو واحد منها مناسب فالـ Interaction cost قليل جدًا: كتب كام حرف واختار على طول."},{"t":109.34,"en":"Also typos: I've spared the user spelling mistakes that could have shown no results, or the wrong ones, because they picked from the suggestions. These are the benefits of using suggestions.","ar":"وبرضه فكرة الـ Typos أو الأخطاء الإملائية: أنا كده منعت اليوزر من أخطاء إملائية كانت ممكن ماتظهرش له نتايج أو تظهر له نتايج مش اللي عايزها، لأنه اختار من الاقتراحات على طول. دي الفوايد اللي بتحصل لما بنستخدم الـ Suggestions."},{"t":127.74,"en":"To make suggestions as good as they can be, here are a few tips for search that will help.","ar":"ولو عايزين نخلّي الاقتراحات دي بأفضل شكل، فيه شوية Tips في السيرش هتساعدنا نخلّي الاقتراحات دي كويسة."},{"t":142.24,"en":"First: don't show a suggestion if picking it gives few results, or none related to it in the website or product. If I'm a UI/UX designer at a product company and notice this problem, I should flag it to be fixed.","ar":"أول حاجة: ماأحطّش اقتراحات لو اليوزر اختارها يلاقي نتايج قليلة، أو مفيش أصلًا نتايج في الـ Website أو الـ Product ليها علاقة بالاقتراح اللي ظهر له. لو أنا UI/UX Designer في Product company ولاحظت المشكلة دي، لازم أنبّه إنها تتصلّح."},{"t":166.34,"en":"Because the experience suffers badly if the user picks a suggestion and gets few results; their trust drops and they probably won't try again.","ar":"لأن الـ Experience هتتأثر سلبًا جدًا لو اليوزر اختار واحد من الاقتراحات ونتيجته طلعت قليلة، وغالبًا ثقته هتقل ومش هيحاول تاني."},{"t":173.54,"en":"Second important thing about suggestions: I should distinguish the style of the suggestion text, between what the user typed themselves and the completion the website suggested.","ar":"تاني حاجة مهمة في الاقتراحات اللي بتظهر في السيرش: إني أفرّق في الـ Style بين النص الظاهر للاقتراح، يعني بين الحاجة اللي اليوزر كتبها نفسه والتكملة اللي الـ Website اقترحها."},{"t":189.74,"en":"For example, if I type \"basketball\" and the suggestions are \"basketball hoop\" and others, as a designer I need to distinguish between the word the user typed and the completion the website suggests.","ar":"على سبيل المثال لو أنا كـ User كتبت كلمة basketball والاقتراحات هي basketball hoop وغيرها، محتاج أنا كـ UI/UX Designer أميّز بين الكلمة اللي هو كتبها في السيرش وبين التكملة المقترحة من الـ Website."},{"t":203.84,"en":"So how do I distinguish them? Do I highlight the suggested part, or what the user typed? Those are two options. Think about it for a minute and let's see the answer together.","ar":"طب أميّز بأنهي طريقة؟ أخلّي الحاجة المقترحة هي الـ Highlighted بشكل ما، ولا الحاجة اللي اليوزر كتبها؟ دي حالتين. فكّروا في ده دقيقة وخلّونا نشوف الإجابة مع بعض."},{"t":225.65,"en":"Do I highlight what the user typed, or the completion the website suggests?","ar":"هل أخلّي الحاجة اللي اليوزر كتبها هي الـ Highlighted، ولا أخلّي التكملة المقترحة من الـ Website هي اللي بتتميّز؟"},{"t":235.55,"en":"Now we have two different cases. In one kind of search, when the user types a word, the suggestions only continue that word: if I type \"basketball\", every suggestion continues it, like \"basketball hoop\".","ar":"عندنا دلوقتي حالتين مختلفتين. في حالة من السيرش، لما اليوزر يكتب الكلمة، الاقتراحات اللي بتظهر له بس بتكمّل على الكلمة اللي كتبها: لو كتبت basketball، الاقتراحات كلها هتكمّل عليها زي basketball hoop."},{"t":256.65,"en":"In the other kind of search, if I type any word, the suggestions contain it anywhere: at the start, middle or end. So in which case do we highlight the user's text, and in which the suggested text?","ar":"لكن في حالة تانية من السيرش، لو كتبت أي كلمة، الاقتراحات هتبقى الكلمة دي موجودة فيها في أي مكان: في أولها أو نصها أو آخرها. فإحنا في أي حالة هنميّز النص اللي اليوزر كتبه، وفي أي حالة هنميّز النص المقترح؟"},{"t":276.19,"en":"In the first case, the suggestions all continue what the user typed, those exact letters, not in the middle or at the end. Like our example: we typed \"uxd\" and suggestions appeared, all starting with \"uxd\" and completing it.","ar":"في الحالة الأولى، الاقتراحات كلها بتكمّل على اللي اليوزر كتبه، على الحروف دي، مش في النص أو الآخر. زي المثال اللي قدامنا: كتبنا uxd وبدأت الاقتراحات تظهر، كلها أولها uxd، والباقي بيكمّل الجزء ده."},{"t":300.9,"en":"Here we highlight the part the website suggests, not the user's part, because the user's part sits in the same place at the start of every option, so they don't need help spotting it. They need to spot the completion, and if it's highlighted they'll see it faster and choose faster.","ar":"في الحالة دي محتاجين نعمل Highlight للجزء المقترح من الـ Website، مش جزء اليوزر، لأن جزء اليوزر موجود في نفس المكان في الأول في كل الاختيارات، فمش محتاجين اليوزر يميّزه. محتاجينه يميّز التكملة، ولو بقت Highlighted هيشوفها بشكل أسرع ويختار أسرع."},{"t":332.8,"en":"In the second case, what I typed may be at the start, middle or end, so it isn't lined up. I need the user to see where their text is so they can read what comes before and after it. Suggestions can be long, so I highlight the text the user typed in the search query.","ar":"لكن في الحالة التانية، الكلام اللي كتبته ممكن يبقى في النص أو في الآخر أو في الأول، فمش تحت بعض، فمحتاج أخلّي اليوزر يميّز اللي هو كتبه فين، عشان يشوف التكملة اللي قبله أو بعده. الاقتراحات ممكن تبقى طويلة، فأعمل Highlight للنص اللي اليوزر كتبه في الـ Search query."},{"t":359.9,"en":"So now we know some tips and guidelines for building suggestions into the search flow, and suggestions are one of the things that make search effective.","ar":"فكده عرفنا بعض الـ Tips والـ Guidelines اللي هتساعدنا لما نعمل اقتراحات في الـ Flow بتاع السيرش، والاقتراحات دي واحدة من الحاجات اللي بتخلّي السيرش Effective."}]},{"id":"S03","type":"card","part":"concept","icons":["text","list","ok","warn","eye"],"title":{"en":"Video summary","ar":"ملخص الفيديو"},"body":{"en":"People often can't phrase a search that gets good results, and many don't try a second time. Suggestions help them get there on the first try.\n\n- **A hint in the box:** short text like \"Search recipes or ingredients\" says what people can search for.\n- **Suggestions as they type:** a list appears under the box as soon as people tap it, and updates with each letter.\n- **Less typing, fewer typos:** picking a suggestion is quicker than typing the whole search, and it's spelled right.\n- **Only real results:** every suggestion must open good, relevant results. A suggestion that leads nowhere is worse than none.\n- **Show the difference:** style the suggested words differently from what people typed, so they can scan the list fast.","ar":"كثيرًا ما لا يعرف الناس كيف يصيغون بحثًا يأتي بنتائج جيدة، وكثيرون لا يحاولون مرة ثانية. والاقتراحات تساعدهم على الوصول من أول محاولة.\n\n- **تلميح داخل المربع:** نص قصير مثل «ابحث عن وصفة أو مكوّن» يقول ما يمكن البحث عنه.\n- **اقتراحات أثناء الكتابة:** تظهر قائمة تحت المربع بمجرد الضغط عليه، وتتغيّر مع كل حرف.\n- **كتابة أقل، وأخطاء أقل:** اختيار اقتراح أسرع من كتابة البحث كاملًا، وإملاؤه صحيح.\n- **نتائج حقيقية فقط:** كل اقتراح يجب أن يفتح نتائج جيدة ومرتبطة. والاقتراح الذي لا يوصل إلى شيء أسوأ من عدم وجوده.\n- **وضّح الفرق:** اجعل شكل الكلمات المقترحة مختلفًا عمّا كتبه الناس، حتى يتصفّحوا القائمة بسرعة."}},{"id":"S04","type":"tune","part":"guided","skill":"SK-P14-U03-02","rules":["R06","R15"],"value":{"en":"Search suggestions (NN/g): when suggestions only add text to the end of the query, highlight the suggested characters. Every line starts with the same word, so the new words are what people compare.","ar":"اقتراحات البحث (NN/g): حين تضيف الاقتراحات نصًا في نهاية البحث فقط، أبرز الحروف المقترحة. فكل سطر يبدأ بالكلمة نفسها، والكلمات الجديدة هي ما يقارن بينه الناس."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/site-search-suggestions/","quote":"you should highlight the suggested characters"},"scenario":{"en":"On our site, every suggestion starts with exactly what people typed, then adds words after it. Someone has typed \"chicken\".","ar":"في موقعنا، يبدأ كل اقتراح بما كتبه الناس بالضبط، ثم يضيف كلمات بعده. وقد كتب شخص «فراخ»."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each style. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل شكل. أيّها يجب أن يُطلق؟"},"start":"plain","options":[{"id":"plain","text":{"en":"All text in the same style","ar":"كل النص بالشكل نفسه"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"tabkha","name":{"en":"Tabkha","ar":"طبخة"},"color":"#EA580C","icon":"cooking-pot","domain":"tabkha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Search recipes","ar":"ابحث عن وصفة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"searchbar","text":{"en":"chicken","ar":"فراخ"},"filled":true,"focus":true,"suggest":[{"icon":"cooking-pot","text":{"en":"chicken shawarma","ar":"فراخ بانيه"},"value":{"en":"Recipe","ar":"وصفة"}},{"icon":"cooking-pot","text":{"en":"chicken with potatoes","ar":"فراخ بالبطاطس"},"value":{"en":"Recipe","ar":"وصفة"}},{"icon":"cooking-pot","text":{"en":"chicken soup","ar":"فراخ مشوية"},"value":{"en":"Recipe","ar":"وصفة"}}]}],"keyboard":"text"}},{"id":"typed","text":{"en":"Bold the typed word","ar":"الكلمة المكتوبة بخط عريض"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"tabkha","name":{"en":"Tabkha","ar":"طبخة"},"color":"#EA580C","icon":"cooking-pot","domain":"tabkha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Search recipes","ar":"ابحث عن وصفة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"searchbar","text":{"en":"chicken","ar":"فراخ"},"filled":true,"focus":true,"suggest":[{"icon":"cooking-pot","text":{"en":"**chicken** shawarma","ar":"**فراخ** بانيه"},"value":{"en":"Recipe","ar":"وصفة"}},{"icon":"cooking-pot","text":{"en":"**chicken** with potatoes","ar":"**فراخ** بالبطاطس"},"value":{"en":"Recipe","ar":"وصفة"}},{"icon":"cooking-pot","text":{"en":"**chicken** soup","ar":"**فراخ** مشوية"},"value":{"en":"Recipe","ar":"وصفة"}}]}],"keyboard":"text"}},{"id":"added","text":{"en":"Bold the suggested words","ar":"الكلمات المقترحة بخط عريض"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"tabkha","name":{"en":"Tabkha","ar":"طبخة"},"color":"#EA580C","icon":"cooking-pot","domain":"tabkha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Search recipes","ar":"ابحث عن وصفة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"searchbar","text":{"en":"chicken","ar":"فراخ"},"filled":true,"focus":true,"suggest":[{"icon":"cooking-pot","text":{"en":"chicken **shawarma**","ar":"فراخ **بانيه**"},"value":{"en":"Recipe","ar":"وصفة"}},{"icon":"cooking-pot","text":{"en":"chicken **with potatoes**","ar":"فراخ **بالبطاطس**"},"value":{"en":"Recipe","ar":"وصفة"}},{"icon":"cooking-pot","text":{"en":"chicken **soup**","ar":"فراخ **مشوية**"},"value":{"en":"Recipe","ar":"وصفة"}}]}],"keyboard":"text"}}],"answer":["added"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P14-026","when":["plain","typed"],"feedback":{"en":"Every line starts with \"chicken\", so that part tells people nothing new. The words that differ are what they need to spot, and here they don't stand out.","ar":"كل سطر يبدأ بـ«فراخ»، فهذا الجزء لا يقول للناس شيئًا جديدًا. والكلمات المختلفة هي ما يحتاجون إلى ملاحظته، وهي هنا غير بارزة."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Which part of each line is different from the others?","ar":"أيّ جزء في كل سطر يختلف عن باقي السطور؟"}],"correct":{"en":"The suggestions only add words: bold those.","ar":"الاقتراحات تضيف كلمات فقط: أبرزها."},"explain":{"en":"People already know what they typed. Bold endings let them compare shawarma, potatoes and soup at a glance.","ar":"الناس يعرفون أصلًا ما كتبوه. والنهايات العريضة تجعلهم يقارنون بين البانيه والمشوية والبطاطس بنظرة واحدة."},"speaker":"sara"},{"id":"S05","type":"tune","part":"guided","skill":"SK-P14-U03-02","rules":["R06","R15"],"value":{"en":"Search suggestions (NN/g): when suggestions contain the query anywhere, it's best to highlight the user's query. The typed word moves around in each line, so bold shows where it sits.","ar":"اقتراحات البحث (NN/g): حين تحتوي الاقتراحات على البحث في أي مكان، الأفضل إبراز ما كتبه المستخدم. فالكلمة المكتوبة تتنقّل في كل سطر، والخط العريض يوضّح مكانها."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/site-search-suggestions/","quote":"it’s best to highlight the user’s query."},"scenario":{"en":"My team changed the search: now a suggestion can contain the typed word anywhere, at the start, in the middle or at the end. Someone types \"lemon\".","ar":"غيّر فريقي البحث: صار الاقتراح قد يحتوي على الكلمة المكتوبة في أي مكان: في أوله أو وسطه أو آخره. وكتب شخص «ليمون»."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each style. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل شكل. أيّها يجب أن يُطلق؟"},"start":"rest","options":[{"id":"rest","text":{"en":"Bold everything except the typed word","ar":"كل شيء بخط عريض ما عدا الكلمة المكتوبة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"tabkha","name":{"en":"Tabkha","ar":"طبخة"},"color":"#EA580C","icon":"cooking-pot","domain":"tabkha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Search recipes","ar":"ابحث عن وصفة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"searchbar","text":{"en":"lemon","ar":"ليمون"},"filled":true,"focus":true,"suggest":[{"icon":"cooking-pot","text":{"en":"**grilled fish with** lemon","ar":"**سمك مشوي بالـ**ليمون"},"value":{"en":"Recipe","ar":"وصفة"}},{"icon":"cooking-pot","text":{"en":"lemon **cake**","ar":"**كيكة** ليمون"},"value":{"en":"Recipe","ar":"وصفة"}},{"icon":"cooking-pot","text":{"en":"**chicken with** lemon **and garlic**","ar":"**فراخ بالـ**ليمون **والثوم**"},"value":{"en":"Recipe","ar":"وصفة"}}]}],"keyboard":"text"}},{"id":"query","text":{"en":"Bold the typed word, wherever it appears","ar":"الكلمة المكتوبة بخط عريض، أينما ظهرت"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"tabkha","name":{"en":"Tabkha","ar":"طبخة"},"color":"#EA580C","icon":"cooking-pot","domain":"tabkha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Search recipes","ar":"ابحث عن وصفة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"searchbar","text":{"en":"lemon","ar":"ليمون"},"filled":true,"focus":true,"suggest":[{"icon":"cooking-pot","text":{"en":"grilled fish with **lemon**","ar":"سمك مشوي بالـ**ليمون**"},"value":{"en":"Recipe","ar":"وصفة"}},{"icon":"cooking-pot","text":{"en":"**lemon** cake","ar":"كيكة **ليمون**"},"value":{"en":"Recipe","ar":"وصفة"}},{"icon":"cooking-pot","text":{"en":"chicken with **lemon** and garlic","ar":"فراخ بالـ**ليمون** والثوم"},"value":{"en":"Recipe","ar":"وصفة"}}]}],"keyboard":"text"}},{"id":"plain","text":{"en":"All text in the same style","ar":"كل النص بالشكل نفسه"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"tabkha","name":{"en":"Tabkha","ar":"طبخة"},"color":"#EA580C","icon":"cooking-pot","domain":"tabkha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Search recipes","ar":"ابحث عن وصفة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"searchbar","text":{"en":"lemon","ar":"ليمون"},"filled":true,"focus":true,"suggest":[{"icon":"cooking-pot","text":{"en":"grilled fish with lemon","ar":"سمك مشوي بالليمون"},"value":{"en":"Recipe","ar":"وصفة"}},{"icon":"cooking-pot","text":{"en":"lemon cake","ar":"كيكة ليمون"},"value":{"en":"Recipe","ar":"وصفة"}},{"icon":"cooking-pot","text":{"en":"chicken with lemon and garlic","ar":"فراخ بالليمون والثوم"},"value":{"en":"Recipe","ar":"وصفة"}}]}],"keyboard":"text"}}],"answer":["query"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P14-026","when":["rest","plain"],"feedback":{"en":"The typed word sits in a different place in every line, so people have to hunt for it. Here it's the part that needs to stand out.","ar":"الكلمة المكتوبة في مكان مختلف في كل سطر، فيضطر الناس إلى البحث عنها. وهنا هي الجزء الذي يجب أن يبرز."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Is the typed word in the same place in every line?","ar":"هل الكلمة المكتوبة في المكان نفسه في كل سطر؟"}],"correct":{"en":"The match moves around: bold the typed word.","ar":"مكان الكلمة يتغيّر: أبرز الكلمة المكتوبة."},"explain":{"en":"With \"lemon\" in bold, people see at once where their word sits in each dish and read the rest around it.","ar":"حين تكون «ليمون» بخط عريض، يرى الناس فورًا مكان كلمتهم في كل طبق، ويقرؤون الباقي حولها."},"speaker":"sara"},{"id":"S06","type":"compare","speaker":"karim","part":"contrast","skill":"SK-P14-U03-01","rules":["R11"],"value":{"en":"Search suggestions (NN/g): make sure every suggested query actually has good, relevant results. The discontinued model opens an empty page, so version A turns a shortcut into a dead end.","ar":"اقتراحات البحث (NN/g): تأكّد أن كل بحث مقترح له فعلًا نتائج جيدة ومرتبطة. والطراز المتوقّف يفتح صفحة فارغة، فتحوّل النسخة A الاختصار إلى طريق مسدود."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/site-search-suggestions/","quote":"Make sure every suggested query actually has good, relevant results."},"scenario":{"en":"I'm building an electronics store's website. Someone types \"earbuds\". The store stopped selling the **X2** model last year, but the suggestions still come from last year's popular searches.","ar":"أبني موقع متجر إلكترونيات. كتب شخص «سماعات». وقد توقّف المتجر عن بيع طراز **X2** العام الماضي، لكن الاقتراحات ما زالت تأتي من أشهر عمليات البحث في العام الماضي."},"prompt":{"en":"Which version should ship?","ar":"أيّ نسخة يجب أن تُطلق؟"},"a":{"label":{"en":"Version A: last year's popular searches","ar":"النسخة A: أشهر عمليات البحث في العام الماضي"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"volta","name":{"en":"Volta","ar":"فولتا"},"color":"#1864AB","icon":"lightning","domain":"volta.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Volta","ar":"فولتا"},"logo":true,"actions":[{"icon":"shopping-cart","aria":{"en":"Cart","ar":"السلّة"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"searchbar","text":{"en":"earbuds","ar":"سماعات"},"filled":true,"focus":true,"suggest":[{"icon":"headphones","text":{"en":"earbuds **X2**","ar":"سماعات **X2**"},"value":{"en":"Audio","ar":"صوتيات"}},{"icon":"headphones","text":{"en":"earbuds **with noise cancelling**","ar":"سماعات **بعزل الضوضاء**"},"value":{"en":"Audio","ar":"صوتيات"}},{"icon":"headphones","text":{"en":"earbuds **for sports**","ar":"سماعات **للرياضة**"},"value":{"en":"Audio","ar":"صوتيات"}}]}],"keyboard":"text"}},"b":{"label":{"en":"Version B: only searches with products in the store","ar":"النسخة B: عمليات البحث التي لها منتجات في المتجر فقط"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"volta","name":{"en":"Volta","ar":"فولتا"},"color":"#1864AB","icon":"lightning","domain":"volta.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Volta","ar":"فولتا"},"logo":true,"actions":[{"icon":"shopping-cart","aria":{"en":"Cart","ar":"السلّة"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"searchbar","text":{"en":"earbuds","ar":"سماعات"},"filled":true,"focus":true,"suggest":[{"icon":"headphones","text":{"en":"earbuds **with noise cancelling**","ar":"سماعات **بعزل الضوضاء**"},"value":{"en":"Audio","ar":"صوتيات"}},{"icon":"headphones","text":{"en":"earbuds **for sports**","ar":"سماعات **للرياضة**"},"value":{"en":"Audio","ar":"صوتيات"}},{"icon":"headphones","text":{"en":"earbuds **under EGP 1,000**","ar":"سماعات **أقل من 1,000 جنيه**"},"value":{"en":"Audio","ar":"صوتيات"}}]}],"keyboard":"text"}},"answer":"b","misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P14-025","when":["a"],"feedback":{"en":"\"Earbuds X2\" sits first in the list and opens an empty page: the store doesn't sell it anymore. A suggestion with no results is worse than no suggestion.","ar":"«سماعات X2» في أول القائمة وتفتح صفحة فارغة: فالمتجر لم يعد يبيعها. والاقتراح الذي ليس له نتائج أسوأ من عدم وجود اقتراح."}}],"correct":{"en":"B: every suggestion finds products.","ar":"B: كل اقتراح يجد منتجات."},"explain":{"en":"Suggestions should follow what the store has today, not what was popular. Then any line people pick shows something they can buy.","ar":"الاقتراحات يجب أن تتبع ما يوجد في المتجر اليوم، لا ما كان مشهورًا. وعندها أي سطر يختاره الناس يعرض شيئًا يمكنهم شراؤه."}},{"id":"S07","type":"tune","part":"guided","skill":"SK-P14-U03-01","rules":["R06","R15"],"confidence":true,"value":{"en":"Search suggestions (NN/g): suggested terms that return zero results are worse than unhelpful, and suggestions help people pick an appropriate term that shows good results. A suggestion for a misspelling only repeats the mistake.","ar":"اقتراحات البحث (NN/g): الاقتراحات التي تُرجع صفر نتائج أسوأ من عديمة الفائدة، والاقتراحات تساعد الناس على اختيار كلمة مناسبة تعرض نتائج جيدة. واقتراح كلمة بها خطأ إملائي لا يفعل إلا تكرار الخطأ."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/site-search-suggestions/","quote":"Pick an appropriate term, which will show them good results"},"scenario":{"en":"My team adds a shortcut: we also suggest exactly what people typed most often. Many people type \"mulukhia\" with a spelling our recipes don't use, so it finds nothing. The recipes are under \"molokhia\".","ar":"أضاف فريقي اختصارًا: صرنا نقترح أيضًا ما يكتبه الناس كثيرًا، كما يكتبونه بالضبط. وكثيرون يكتبون «ملوخيا» بإملاء لا تستخدمه وصفاتنا، فلا يجد البحث شيئًا. والوصفات مكتوبة «ملوخية»."},"prompt":{"en":"Someone types \"mulu\". Try each list. Which one should ship?","ar":"كتب شخص «ملو». جرّب كل قائمة. أيّ قائمة توصل الناس دائمًا إلى وصفات الملوخية؟"},"start":"typed","options":[{"id":"typed","text":{"en":"Suggest the common misspelling as typed","ar":"اقترح الإملاء الشائع كما كتبه الناس"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"tabkha","name":{"en":"Tabkha","ar":"طبخة"},"color":"#EA580C","icon":"cooking-pot","domain":"tabkha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Search recipes","ar":"ابحث عن وصفة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"searchbar","text":{"en":"mulu","ar":"ملو"},"filled":true,"focus":true,"suggest":[{"icon":"cooking-pot","text":{"en":"mulu**khia**","ar":"ملو**خيا**"},"value":{"en":"Recipe","ar":"وصفة"}},{"icon":"cooking-pot","text":{"en":"mulu**khia with rabbit**","ar":"ملو**خيا بالأرانب**"},"value":{"en":"Recipe","ar":"وصفة"}}]}],"keyboard":"text"}},{"id":"fixed","text":{"en":"Suggest the spelling that finds recipes","ar":"اقترح الإملاء الذي يجد وصفات"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"tabkha","name":{"en":"Tabkha","ar":"طبخة"},"color":"#EA580C","icon":"cooking-pot","domain":"tabkha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Search recipes","ar":"ابحث عن وصفة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"searchbar","text":{"en":"mulu","ar":"ملو"},"filled":true,"focus":true,"suggest":[{"icon":"cooking-pot","text":{"en":"**molokhia**","ar":"**ملوخية**"},"value":{"en":"Recipe","ar":"وصفة"}},{"icon":"cooking-pot","text":{"en":"**molokhia with rabbit**","ar":"**ملوخية بالأرانب**"},"value":{"en":"Recipe","ar":"وصفة"}}]}],"keyboard":"text"}},{"id":"both","text":{"en":"Suggest both spellings","ar":"اقترح الإملاءين"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"tabkha","name":{"en":"Tabkha","ar":"طبخة"},"color":"#EA580C","icon":"cooking-pot","domain":"tabkha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Search recipes","ar":"ابحث عن وصفة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"searchbar","text":{"en":"mulu","ar":"ملو"},"filled":true,"focus":true,"suggest":[{"icon":"cooking-pot","text":{"en":"mulu**khia**","ar":"ملو**خيا**"},"value":{"en":"Recipe","ar":"وصفة"}},{"icon":"cooking-pot","text":{"en":"**molokhia**","ar":"**ملوخية**"},"value":{"en":"Recipe","ar":"وصفة"}},{"icon":"cooking-pot","text":{"en":"**molokhia with rabbit**","ar":"**ملوخية بالأرانب**"},"value":{"en":"Recipe","ar":"وصفة"}}]}],"keyboard":"text"}}],"answer":["fixed"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P14-025","when":["typed","both"],"feedback":{"en":"\"Mulukhia\" finds nothing on this site. Suggesting it, even next to the right spelling, invites people to pick a search that ends on an empty page.","ar":"«ملوخيا» لا تجد شيئًا في هذا الموقع. واقتراحها، حتى بجانب الإملاء الصحيح، يدعو الناس إلى اختيار بحث ينتهي بصفحة فارغة."}}],"hints":[{"en":"What does each suggestion open?","ar":"ماذا يفتح كل اقتراح؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Suggest only the spelling that finds recipes.","ar":"لا تقترح إلا الإملاء الذي يجد وصفات."},"explain":{"en":"People who start typing the other spelling still land on the molokhia recipes. The suggestion fixes the spelling for them.","ar":"من يبدأ بكتابة الإملاء الآخر يصل مع ذلك إلى وصفات الملوخية. فالاقتراح يصحّح له الإملاء."},"speaker":"sara"},{"id":"S08","type":"tune","speaker":"rami","part":"independent","skill":"SK-P14-U03-02","rules":["R14"],"value":{"en":"Search suggestions (NN/g): when suggestions contain the query anywhere, it's best to highlight the user's query. In a job search, \"design\" lands in a different place in every title.","ar":"اقتراحات البحث (NN/g): حين تحتوي الاقتراحات على البحث في أي مكان، الأفضل إبراز ما كتبه المستخدم. وفي البحث عن وظيفة، تقع «تصميم» في مكان مختلف في كل مسمّى."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/site-search-suggestions/","quote":"it’s best to highlight the user’s query."},"scenario":{"en":"I'm designing a jobs app. Its suggestions show job titles that contain the typed word anywhere. Someone types \"design\".","ar":"أصمّم تطبيقًا للوظائف. وتعرض اقتراحاته مسمّيات وظائف تحتوي على الكلمة المكتوبة في أي مكان. وكتب شخص «تصميم»."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each style. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل شكل. أيّها يجب أن يُطلق؟"},"start":"plain","options":[{"id":"plain","text":{"en":"All text in the same style","ar":"كل النص بالشكل نفسه"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"wazifa","name":{"en":"Wazifa","ar":"وظيفة"},"color":"#1971C2","icon":"identification-card","domain":"wazifa.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Find a job","ar":"ابحث عن وظيفة"},"logo":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"searchbar","text":{"en":"design","ar":"تصميم"},"filled":true,"focus":true,"suggest":[{"icon":"briefcase","text":{"en":"Senior UX design lead","ar":"قائد فريق تصميم UX"},"value":{"en":"Job title","ar":"مسمّى وظيفي"}},{"icon":"briefcase","text":{"en":"Design engineer","ar":"مهندس تصميم"},"value":{"en":"Job title","ar":"مسمّى وظيفي"}},{"icon":"briefcase","text":{"en":"Interior design intern","ar":"متدرّب تصميم داخلي"},"value":{"en":"Job title","ar":"مسمّى وظيفي"}}]}],"keyboard":"text"}},{"id":"query","text":{"en":"Bold the typed word, wherever it appears","ar":"الكلمة المكتوبة بخط عريض، أينما ظهرت"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"wazifa","name":{"en":"Wazifa","ar":"وظيفة"},"color":"#1971C2","icon":"identification-card","domain":"wazifa.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Find a job","ar":"ابحث عن وظيفة"},"logo":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"searchbar","text":{"en":"design","ar":"تصميم"},"filled":true,"focus":true,"suggest":[{"icon":"briefcase","text":{"en":"Senior UX **design** lead","ar":"قائد فريق **تصميم** UX"},"value":{"en":"Job title","ar":"مسمّى وظيفي"}},{"icon":"briefcase","text":{"en":"**Design** engineer","ar":"مهندس **تصميم**"},"value":{"en":"Job title","ar":"مسمّى وظيفي"}},{"icon":"briefcase","text":{"en":"Interior **design** intern","ar":"متدرّب **تصميم** داخلي"},"value":{"en":"Job title","ar":"مسمّى وظيفي"}}]}],"keyboard":"text"}},{"id":"rest","text":{"en":"Bold everything except the typed word","ar":"كل شيء بخط عريض ما عدا الكلمة المكتوبة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"wazifa","name":{"en":"Wazifa","ar":"وظيفة"},"color":"#1971C2","icon":"identification-card","domain":"wazifa.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Find a job","ar":"ابحث عن وظيفة"},"logo":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"searchbar","text":{"en":"design","ar":"تصميم"},"filled":true,"focus":true,"suggest":[{"icon":"briefcase","text":{"en":"**Senior UX** design **lead**","ar":"**قائد فريق** تصميم **UX**"},"value":{"en":"Job title","ar":"مسمّى وظيفي"}},{"icon":"briefcase","text":{"en":"Design **engineer**","ar":"**مهندس** تصميم"},"value":{"en":"Job title","ar":"مسمّى وظيفي"}},{"icon":"briefcase","text":{"en":"**Interior** design **intern**","ar":"**متدرّب** تصميم **داخلي**"},"value":{"en":"Job title","ar":"مسمّى وظيفي"}}]}],"keyboard":"text"}}],"answer":["query"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P14-026","when":["plain","rest"],"feedback":{"en":"\"Design\" moves around in every title, so people have to search each line for their own word. Bolding it shows where it sits at a glance.","ar":"«تصميم» تتنقّل في كل مسمّى، فيضطر الناس إلى البحث عن كلمتهم في كل سطر. وإبرازها يوضّح مكانها بنظرة واحدة."}}],"correct":{"en":"Matches anywhere: bold the typed word.","ar":"حين تظهر الكلمة في أي مكان: أبرز الكلمة المكتوبة."},"explain":{"en":"My users see \"design\" in each title right away and judge the rest: senior, engineer or intern.","ar":"يرى مستخدمو تطبيقي كلمة «تصميم» في كل مسمّى فورًا، ثم يقرؤون الباقي ليختاروا: قائد فريق أو مهندس أو متدرّب."}},{"id":"S09","type":"card","part":"recap","icons":["ok","eye","list"],"title":{"en":"What you practised","ar":"ما تدرّبت عليه"},"body":{"en":"- **Suggest only searches that find something**, based on what the site has today.\n- **Suggestions only add words?** Bold the added words.\n- **The typed word can be anywhere?** Bold the typed word.\n\nNext: what to show when a search finds nothing.","ar":"- **لا تقترح إلا عمليات بحث تجد شيئًا**، بناءً على ما في الموقع اليوم.\n- **الاقتراحات تضيف كلمات فقط؟** أبرز الكلمات المضافة.\n- **الكلمة المكتوبة قد تكون في أي مكان؟** أبرز الكلمة المكتوبة.\n\nالتالي: ماذا تعرض حين لا يجد البحث شيئًا."}}]}$uxg$::jsonb),
  ($uxg$P14-U03-L02$uxg$, $uxg$d35180429f80c5e695f80275bda32155c714113d57ce67ff35ae50a8b3f142e5$uxg$, $uxg${"id":"P14-U03-L02","mode":"lesson","minutes":8,"title":{"en":"When search finds nothing","ar":"حين لا يجد البحث شيئًا"},"speaker":"karim","review_labels":{"MC-P14-027":{"en":"Say clearly that nothing matched","ar":"قل بوضوح إنه لا توجد نتائج مطابقة"},"MC-P14-028":{"en":"A no-results page needs a way forward","ar":"صفحة «لا توجد نتائج» تحتاج خطوة تالية"},"MC-P14-029":{"en":"Never joke about or blame the person","ar":"لا تمزح مع الناس ولا تلُمهم أبدًا"}},"steps":[{"id":"S01","type":"card","part":"hook","title":{"en":"Karim's no-results page","ar":"كريم وصفحة «لا توجد نتائج»"},"body":{"en":"I'm building an electronics store's website. A customer searched for **wireles charger**, with one letter missing, and nothing matched.\n\nThis is the page they got: two big offers at the top, a small grey line further down, and a joke at the bottom.","ar":"أبني موقع متجر إلكترونيات. بحث عميل عن **شاحن لاسكي**، بحرف ناقص، فلم يجد شيئًا.\n\nوهذه هي الصفحة التي ظهرت له: عرضان كبيران في الأعلى، وسطر رمادي صغير تحتهما، ونكتة في الأسفل."},"mock":{"app":{"id":"volta","name":{"en":"Volta","ar":"فولتا"},"color":"#1864AB","icon":"lightning","domain":"volta.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Search","ar":"البحث"},"back":true,"actions":[{"icon":"shopping-cart","aria":{"en":"Cart","ar":"السلّة"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"searchbar","text":{"en":"wireles charger","ar":"شاحن لاسكي"},"filled":true},{"kind":"card","art":"tv","gap":"m","blocks":[{"kind":"badge","text":{"en":"Summer sale","ar":"تخفيضات الصيف"},"icon":"tag"},{"kind":"text","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Summer sale: up to 40% off","ar":"تخفيضات الصيف: حتى 40%"},"gap":"xs"}]},{"kind":"image","art":"laptop","size":"s","alt":{"en":"Laptop offer","ar":"عرض لابتوب"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"small","color":"pale","text":{"en":"0 results for \"wireles charger\"","ar":"0 نتيجة لـ«شاحن لاسكي»"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Oops! Our search robot got lost too 🤖","ar":"عفوًا! روبوت البحث تاه هو كمان 🤖"},"gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"S02","type":"tune","part":"try","skill":"SK-P14-U03-03","rules":["R12"],"confidence":true,"value":{"en":"Try first. No-results pages (NN/g): they must clearly state that nothing matched, offer starting points for moving forward, and avoid mocking people. A spelling fix gets the customer to the chargers in one tap.","ar":"جرّب أولًا. صفحات «لا توجد نتائج» (NN/g): يجب أن تقول بوضوح إنه لا يوجد تطابق، وأن تعرض نقاط بداية للمتابعة، وأن تتجنّب السخرية من الناس. وتصحيح الإملاء يوصل العميل إلى الشواحن بضغطة واحدة."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/search-no-results-serp/","quote":"No Results pages must clearly state that no results have been found to match the user’s search terms."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each version of the page. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل نسخة من الصفحة. أيّ نسخة توضّح للعميل أن البحث لم يجد شيئًا وتساعده على إيجاد الشاحن؟"},"start":"keep","options":[{"id":"keep","text":{"en":"Keep the page as it is","ar":"أبقِ الصفحة كما هي"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"volta","name":{"en":"Volta","ar":"فولتا"},"color":"#1864AB","icon":"lightning","domain":"volta.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Search","ar":"البحث"},"back":true,"actions":[{"icon":"shopping-cart","aria":{"en":"Cart","ar":"السلّة"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"searchbar","text":{"en":"wireles charger","ar":"شاحن لاسكي"},"filled":true},{"kind":"card","art":"tv","gap":"m","blocks":[{"kind":"badge","text":{"en":"Summer sale","ar":"تخفيضات الصيف"},"icon":"tag"},{"kind":"text","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Summer sale: up to 40% off","ar":"تخفيضات الصيف: حتى 40%"},"gap":"xs"}]},{"kind":"image","art":"laptop","size":"s","alt":{"en":"Laptop offer","ar":"عرض لابتوب"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"small","color":"pale","text":{"en":"0 results for \"wireles charger\"","ar":"0 نتيجة لـ«شاحن لاسكي»"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Oops! Our search robot got lost too 🤖","ar":"عفوًا! روبوت البحث تاه هو كمان 🤖"},"gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"clear","text":{"en":"Clear message at the top, a spelling fix and similar searches","ar":"رسالة واضحة في الأعلى، وتصحيح للإملاء، وعمليات بحث مشابهة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"volta","name":{"en":"Volta","ar":"فولتا"},"color":"#1864AB","icon":"lightning","domain":"volta.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Search","ar":"البحث"},"back":true,"actions":[{"icon":"shopping-cart","aria":{"en":"Cart","ar":"السلّة"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"searchbar","text":{"en":"wireles charger","ar":"شاحن لاسكي"},"filled":true},{"kind":"icon","icon":"magnifying-glass","size":"l","color":"brand","gap":"m"},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"No results for \"wireles charger\"","ar":"لا توجد نتائج لـ«شاحن لاسكي»"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"Did you mean **wireless charger**?","ar":"هل تقصد **شاحن لاسلكي**؟"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Similar searches:","ar":"عمليات بحث مشابهة:"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"row","blocks":[{"kind":"chip","icon":"magnifying-glass","text":{"en":"phone charger","ar":"شاحن موبايل"}},{"kind":"chip","icon":"magnifying-glass","text":{"en":"power bank","ar":"باور بانك"}}]}]}},{"id":"home","text":{"en":"Send people straight back to the home page","ar":"أعد الناس مباشرة إلى الصفحة الرئيسية"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"The search silently opens the home page","ar":"البحث يفتح الصفحة الرئيسية بدون أي رسالة"},"app":{"id":"volta","name":{"en":"Volta","ar":"فولتا"},"color":"#1864AB","icon":"lightning","domain":"volta.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Volta Electronics","ar":"فولتا للإلكترونيات"},"logo":true,"actions":[{"icon":"shopping-cart","aria":{"en":"Cart","ar":"السلّة"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"searchbar","text":{"en":"Search Volta","ar":"ابحث في فولتا"}},{"kind":"card","art":"tv","gap":"m","blocks":[{"kind":"badge","text":{"en":"Summer sale","ar":"تخفيضات الصيف"},"icon":"tag"},{"kind":"text","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Summer sale: up to 40% off","ar":"تخفيضات الصيف: حتى 40%"},"gap":"xs"}]}]}}],"answer":["clear"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P14-027","when":["keep","home"],"feedback":{"en":"The customer can't tell that their search failed: the grey line is easy to miss under the offers, and the home page says nothing at all. They also get no hint that one letter is missing.","ar":"لا يستطيع العميل أن يعرف أن بحثه لم ينجح: السطر الرمادي سهل التجاهل تحت العروض، والصفحة الرئيسية لا تقول شيئًا أصلًا. ولا يحصل أيضًا على أي تلميح بأن هناك حرفًا ناقصًا."}}],"hints":[{"en":"How would the customer learn that a letter is missing?","ar":"كيف سيعرف العميل أن هناك حرفًا ناقصًا؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Say it clearly, then show the way forward.","ar":"قل بوضوح إنه لا توجد نتائج، ثم اعرض خطوة تالية."},"explain":{"en":"The heading tells the customer at once that nothing matched, and \"Did you mean wireless charger?\" fixes the typo in one tap.","ar":"العنوان يخبر العميل فورًا بأن بحثه لم يجد شيئًا، و«هل تقصد شاحن لاسلكي؟» تصحّح الخطأ بضغطة واحدة."}},{"id":"S10","type":"video","part":"concept","title":{"en":"Turn no results into a next step","ar":"حوّل «لا توجد نتائج» إلى خطوة تالية"},"video":"843f107d-c4a3-4556-a390-0fbef810de56","duration":218,"transcript":[{"t":2.5,"en":"One very important thing in search: if the user types a query, searches, and sees that there are no results related to it, there's a high risk they leave the website.","ar":"من الحاجات المهمة جدًا في السيرش إن اليوزر لو كتب الكويري بتاعه وعمل Search، وظهر له إن مفيش أي نتايج ليها علاقة بالسيرش ده، فهنا فيه Risk عالي إن اليوزر يسيب الـ Website."},{"t":18.4,"en":"So here I need to try to keep the user on my website, to help them, so they don't lose hope and leave right away just because they found nothing related to their query.","ar":"ففي الحالة دي محتاج أحاول أخلّي اليوزر يفضل في الـ Website بتاعي، وأفيده وأساعده، وماينفقدش الأمل ويمشي على طول لمجرد إنه ماقاش نتايج ليها علاقة بالكويري."},{"t":31.1,"en":"So let's think about what to do when there are no search results. The most important guideline for a no-results page is to tell the user clearly that there are no results, so they understand it right away and don't keep looking.","ar":"فنبدأ نفكّر نعمل إيه في حالة No search results. أهم Guideline في الـ No search results page إننا نبيّن لليوزر بوضوح إن مفيش نتايج، عشان يفهم ده من الأول ومايفضلش يدوّر."},{"t":51.7,"en":"In this example the screen has a lot going on and gives it a strong hierarchy, but the message that there are no results is small, up at the top, so the user doesn't notice it and doesn't realize right away that there are none.","ar":"في المثال اللي قدامنا، الـ Screen فيها حاجات كتير وبتاخد Hierarchy كبيرة، لكن الرسالة إن مفيش نتايج مكتوبة بـ Hierarchy صغيرة فوق، فاليوزر مايلاحظهاش، وده بيخلّيه مايفهمش من الأول إن مفيش نتايج أصلًا."},{"t":76.2,"en":"The user has to understand immediately that there are no results for exactly the query they wrote.","ar":"لازم اليوزر يفهم على طول من الأول إن مفيش نتايج للكويري المكتوب ده بالضبط."},{"t":81.5,"en":"Second: I don't block the user; I offer another path. I suggest edits to the query itself, or things close to what they wrote that may return results, or a different way of phrasing it they hadn't thought of.","ar":"تاني حاجة: ماأعطّلش اليوزر، أوفّر له Path تاني. أقترح عليه يعدّل الكويري نفسه، أو أقترح حاجات قريبة من اللي كتبه ممكن تطلع له نتايج، أو ممكن يكتب الكويري بشكل تاني ماجاش في باله."},{"t":101.2,"en":"So they see the suggestions, pick one, and get results. I can also give them a button to go back: cancel the search, browse the whole website, or return to the home page or the page before the search.","ar":"فيشوف الاقتراحات ويختار منها وتطلع له نتايج. وممكن أوفّر له زرار يرجع بيه: يلغي السيرش ويشوف نتايج الـ Website كله، أو يرجع للصفحة الرئيسية أو للصفحة اللي قبل السيرش."},{"t":126.5,"en":"I offer other ways so the user doesn't feel they searched, found nothing, and have nothing left to do, so they leave and get no value from the product.","ar":"فأوفّر طرق تانية، عشان اليوزر ماحسّش إنه دخل ولقاش نتايج وماعادش فيه حاجة يعملها فيمشي ومايستفيدش من الـ Product."},{"t":137.2,"en":"Third: I don't joke or make fun of the user. Humor at these moments can backfire: the user may leave the website, get annoyed by the joke and not come back, or find it silly.","ar":"تالت حاجة: ماهزّرش ولا أسخر من اليوزر. الكوميديا في الأوقات دي ممكن تنقلب عكسها: اليوزر ممكن يمشي من الـ Website أو يضايق من الهزار وماجيش تاني، أو يشوفه سخيف."},{"t":162.5,"en":"When the user is failing at a goal, we don't need to joke or sound sarcastic.","ar":"في الحالات اللي اليوزر بيفشل فيها في هدف معيّن مش محتاجين نهزّر ولا نتكلم بسخرية."},{"t":169.8,"en":"Let's look at this example, which is a great search example with all the guidelines we covered. It's clear there are no search results, the page has a good hierarchy, and there are suggestions below.","ar":"فخلّينا نشوف المثال اللي قدامنا، ده Example ممتاز للسيرش فيه كل الـ Guidelines اللي قلناها. واضح إن مفيش Search results، وفيه Hierarchy كويسة في الصفحة، وفيه اقتراحات تحت."},{"t":192.8,"en":"They can edit the query, check the spelling, try more general words or fewer words, and there are suggested queries to tap to see their results, with no sarcasm anywhere. So this is an excellent example that applies every guideline we discussed for the no-results page.","ar":"ممكن يعدّل الكويري، نتشيك السبيلنج، ممكن يجرّب كلمات أعم أو أقل، وفيه اقتراحات لكويريز تانية يضغط عليها يشوف نتايجها، ومفيش أي سخرية في الموضوع. فده من الأمثلة الممتازة اللي بتطبّق كل الـ Guidelines اللي اتكلمنا عنها في صفحة الـ No search results."}]},{"id":"S03","type":"card","part":"concept","icons":["eye","idea","list","warn"],"title":{"en":"Video summary","ar":"ملخص الفيديو"},"body":{"en":"When a search finds nothing, people are close to leaving, even when the site has something related. The page has to keep them going.\n\n- **Say it clearly:** a large heading near the top, such as \"No results for …\", so nobody misses it among offers and other content.\n- **Offer ways forward:** a spelling fix, similar searches that do find results, a tip to use fewer or more general words, or links back to the main sections.\n- **Keep the tone plain:** people who just failed at their goal are already frustrated. A joke or a hint that they typed it wrong pushes them away.","ar":"حين لا يجد البحث شيئًا، يكون الناس قريبين من المغادرة، حتى لو كان في الموقع شيء مرتبط بما يريدون. ويجب أن تساعدهم الصفحة على الاستمرار.\n\n- **قل ذلك بوضوح:** عنوان كبير قرب الأعلى، مثل «لا توجد نتائج لـ…»، حتى يراه الجميع وسط العروض والمحتوى الآخر.\n- **اعرض خطوات تالية:** تصحيح الإملاء، وعمليات بحث مشابهة تجد نتائج فعلًا، ونصيحة باستخدام كلمات أقل أو أعمّ، أو روابط للأقسام الرئيسية.\n- **أبقِ الأسلوب بسيطًا:** من فشل للتو في الوصول إلى هدفه متضايق أصلًا. والنكتة أو التلميح بأنه كتب خطأ يُبعده."}},{"id":"S04","type":"tune","part":"guided","skill":"SK-P14-U03-03","rules":["R06","R15"],"value":{"en":"No-results pages (NN/g): appropriate typography and spacing are essential; otherwise, users can easily overlook or misunderstand the message. A small grey line under two offers is exactly what gets overlooked.","ar":"صفحات «لا توجد نتائج» (NN/g): الخط والمسافات المناسبة ضرورية؛ وإلا قد يتجاهل الناس الرسالة أو يسيئون فهمها بسهولة. والسطر الرمادي الصغير تحت عرضين هو بالضبط ما يتجاهله الناس."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/search-no-results-serp/","quote":"Appropriate typography and spacing are essential; otherwise, users can easily overlook or misunderstand the message."},"scenario":{"en":"I start with the message itself. The offers have to stay on the page, because the marketing team asked for them.","ar":"أبدأ بالرسالة نفسها. والعروض يجب أن تبقى في الصفحة، لأن فريق التسويق طلبها."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each version. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل نسخة. أيّها يجب أن تُطلق؟"},"start":"line","options":[{"id":"line","text":{"en":"Small grey line under the offers","ar":"سطر رمادي صغير تحت العروض"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"volta","name":{"en":"Volta","ar":"فولتا"},"color":"#1864AB","icon":"lightning","domain":"volta.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Search","ar":"البحث"},"back":true,"actions":[{"icon":"shopping-cart","aria":{"en":"Cart","ar":"السلّة"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"searchbar","text":{"en":"wireles charger","ar":"شاحن لاسكي"},"filled":true},{"kind":"card","art":"tv","gap":"m","blocks":[{"kind":"badge","text":{"en":"Summer sale","ar":"تخفيضات الصيف"},"icon":"tag"},{"kind":"text","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Summer sale: up to 40% off","ar":"تخفيضات الصيف: حتى 40%"},"gap":"xs"}]},{"kind":"small","color":"pale","text":{"en":"0 results for \"wireles charger\"","ar":"0 نتيجة لـ«شاحن لاسكي»"},"gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"heading","text":{"en":"Heading at the top, offers below it","ar":"عنوان في الأعلى، والعروض تحته"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"volta","name":{"en":"Volta","ar":"فولتا"},"color":"#1864AB","icon":"lightning","domain":"volta.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Search","ar":"البحث"},"back":true,"actions":[{"icon":"shopping-cart","aria":{"en":"Cart","ar":"السلّة"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"searchbar","text":{"en":"wireles charger","ar":"شاحن لاسكي"},"filled":true},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"No results for \"wireles charger\"","ar":"لا توجد نتائج لـ«شاحن لاسكي»"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"Did you mean **wireless charger**?","ar":"هل تقصد **شاحن لاسلكي**؟"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"listitem","art":"tv","text":{"en":"Summer sale: up to 40% off","ar":"تخفيضات الصيف: حتى 40%"},"chevron":true,"gap":"l"}]}},{"id":"dialog","text":{"en":"A dialog people have to close first","ar":"Dialog يجب أن يغلقه الناس أولًا"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"volta","name":{"en":"Volta","ar":"فولتا"},"color":"#1864AB","icon":"lightning","domain":"volta.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Search","ar":"البحث"},"back":true,"actions":[{"icon":"shopping-cart","aria":{"en":"Cart","ar":"السلّة"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"searchbar","text":{"en":"wireles charger","ar":"شاحن لاسكي"},"filled":true},{"kind":"card","art":"tv","gap":"m","blocks":[{"kind":"badge","text":{"en":"Summer sale","ar":"تخفيضات الصيف"},"icon":"tag"},{"kind":"text","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Summer sale: up to 40% off","ar":"تخفيضات الصيف: حتى 40%"},"gap":"xs"}]}],"overlay":{"type":"dialog","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"No results","ar":"لا توجد نتائج"}},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"OK","ar":"حسنًا"},"gap":"m"}]}}}],"answer":["heading"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P14-027","when":["line"],"feedback":{"en":"The message is the smallest, palest thing on the page, below two offers. Many customers will scroll past it and think the offers are their results.","ar":"الرسالة أصغر وأبهت شيء في الصفحة، تحت عرضين. وكثير من العملاء سيمرّون عليها ويظنّون أن العروض هي نتائجهم."}},{"id":"MC-P14-028","when":["dialog"],"feedback":{"en":"The dialog says it, but once it's closed, the customer is left with offers and nothing to try next. The message belongs on the page, with the way forward next to it.","ar":"الـ Dialog يقول ذلك، لكن بعد إغلاقه يبقى العميل أمام العروض بلا شيء يجرّبه. ومكان الرسالة هو الصفحة نفسها، وبجانبها الخطوة التالية."}}],"hints":[{"en":"What does the customer see first on each version?","ar":"ما أول شيء يراه العميل في كل نسخة؟"}],"correct":{"en":"A clear heading at the top.","ar":"عنوان واضح في الأعلى."},"explain":{"en":"The heading is the first thing on the page, so nobody mistakes the offers for results. The offers still show, just lower down.","ar":"العنوان أول شيء في الصفحة، فلا يظنّ أحد أن العروض هي النتائج. والعروض ما زالت ظاهرة، لكن في الأسفل."},"speaker":"karim"},{"id":"S05","type":"tune","speaker":"youssef","part":"guided","skill":"SK-P14-U03-03","rules":["R06","R15"],"confidence":true,"value":{"en":"No-results pages (NN/g): all too often they are dead ends that don't offer any suggestions about what to do next. Advice to use fewer words, plus similar searches that do return results, gives Youssef's shopper somewhere to go.","ar":"صفحات «لا توجد نتائج» (NN/g): كثيرًا ما تكون طرقًا مسدودة لا تقدّم أي اقتراح عمّا يمكن فعله بعدها. والنصيحة باستخدام كلمات أقل، مع عمليات بحث مشابهة تأتي بنتائج فعلًا، تعطي متسوّق يوسف مكانًا يذهب إليه."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/search-no-results-serp/","quote":"No Results pages are dead ends that don’t offer any suggestions about what to do next."},"scenario":{"en":"I run a sports shop. A shopper searched for **red waterproof running shoes size 47**. The shop has red running shoes and waterproof ones, but nothing that matches all of it.","ar":"أدير متجرًا رياضيًا. وبحث متسوّق عن **حذاء جري أحمر مقاوم للماء مقاس 47**. وفي المتجر أحذية جري حمراء، وأخرى مقاومة للماء، لكن لا شيء يطابق كل هذا معًا."},"prompt":{"en":"The page already says \"No results\" clearly. Try each version of what comes under it. Which one should ship?","ar":"الصفحة تقول «لا توجد نتائج» بوضوح أصلًا. جرّب كل نسخة لما يأتي تحتها. أيّها يجب أن تُطلق؟"},"start":"again","options":[{"id":"again","text":{"en":"\"Please try again\" and the search box","ar":"«حاول مرة أخرى» ومربع البحث"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Dar · Sports","ar":"دار · رياضة"},"back":true,"actions":[{"icon":"shopping-cart","aria":{"en":"Cart","ar":"السلّة"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"icon","icon":"sneaker-move","size":"l","color":"brand"},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"No results for \"red waterproof running shoes size 47\"","ar":"لا توجد نتائج لـ«حذاء جري أحمر مقاوم للماء مقاس 47»"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Please try again.","ar":"حاول مرة أخرى."},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"searchbar","text":{"en":"Search the shop","ar":"ابحث في المتجر"},"gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"ways","text":{"en":"A tip to use fewer words, and similar searches with results","ar":"نصيحة باستخدام كلمات أقل، وعمليات بحث مشابهة لها نتائج"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Dar · Sports","ar":"دار · رياضة"},"back":true,"actions":[{"icon":"shopping-cart","aria":{"en":"Cart","ar":"السلّة"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"No results for \"red waterproof running shoes size 47\"","ar":"لا توجد نتائج لـ«حذاء جري أحمر مقاوم للماء مقاس 47»"}},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Try fewer words. These searches have results:","ar":"جرّب كلمات أقل. عمليات البحث هذه لها نتائج:"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"listitem","art":"sneakers","text":{"en":"red running shoes","ar":"حذاء جري أحمر"},"value":"14","chevron":true,"gap":"s"},{"kind":"listitem","art":"sneakers","text":{"en":"waterproof running shoes","ar":"حذاء جري مقاوم للماء"},"value":"9","chevron":true},{"kind":"listitem","art":"sneakers","text":{"en":"running shoes size 47","ar":"حذاء جري مقاس 47"},"value":"6","chevron":true}]}},{"id":"contact","text":{"en":"A form to contact customer service","ar":"نموذج للتواصل مع خدمة العملاء"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Dar · Sports","ar":"دار · رياضة"},"back":true,"actions":[{"icon":"shopping-cart","aria":{"en":"Cart","ar":"السلّة"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"No results for \"red waterproof running shoes size 47\"","ar":"لا توجد نتائج لـ«حذاء جري أحمر مقاوم للماء مقاس 47»"}},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Tell us what you were looking for.","ar":"أخبرنا بما كنت تبحث عنه."},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Your message","ar":"رسالتك"},"text":"","gap":"m"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Send","ar":"أرسل"}}]}}],"answer":["ways"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P14-028","when":["again","contact"],"feedback":{"en":"The shopper doesn't know what to change, and a form only promises an answer later. Meanwhile the shop has red running shoes they could be looking at now.","ar":"المتسوّق لا يعرف ماذا يغيّر، والنموذج لا يعد إلا بردّ لاحقًا. مع أن في المتجر أحذية جري حمراء يمكن أن يتصفّحها الآن."}}],"hints":[{"en":"What could the shopper tap right now to see shoes?","ar":"على ماذا يمكن أن يضغط المتسوّق الآن ليرى أحذية؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Show the way forward: fewer words, searches with results.","ar":"اعرض خطوة تالية: كلمات أقل، وعمليات بحث لها نتائج."},"explain":{"en":"Each link drops one part of the search and shows how many shoes it finds. The shopper picks the part that matters most to them.","ar":"كل رابط يحذف جزءًا من البحث ويعرض عدد الأحذية التي يجدها. فيختار المتسوّق الجزء الأهم بالنسبة له."}},{"id":"S06","type":"tune","part":"guided","skill":"SK-P14-U03-03","rules":["R06","R15"],"value":{"en":"No-results pages (NN/g): exercise extreme caution when trying to use humor on no-results pages; most people don't enjoy being mocked, especially when they are already frustrated. A plain message with something to try respects the person.","ar":"صفحات «لا توجد نتائج» (NN/g): كن حذرًا جدًا حين تستخدم الفكاهة في هذه الصفحات؛ فأغلب الناس لا يحبّون السخرية منهم، خاصة حين يكونون متضايقين أصلًا. والرسالة البسيطة مع شيء يمكن تجربته تحترم الشخص."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/search-no-results-serp/","quote":"But exercise extreme caution when trying to use humor on No Results pages (or other error pages)."},"scenario":{"en":"Back to the electronics store. The marketing team wants the no-results message to sound fun, like the rest of the brand.","ar":"نعود إلى متجر الإلكترونيات. يريد فريق التسويق أن تبدو رسالة «لا توجد نتائج» مرحة، مثل باقي العلامة التجارية."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each message. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل رسالة. أيّ رسالة توصل العميل إلى الشواحن دون أن تضايقه؟"},"start":"joke","options":[{"id":"joke","text":{"en":"\"Oops! Our search is as lost as you are 😅\"","ar":"«عفوًا! البحث تايه زيّك بالظبط 😅»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"volta","name":{"en":"Volta","ar":"فولتا"},"color":"#1864AB","icon":"lightning","domain":"volta.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Search","ar":"البحث"},"back":true,"actions":[{"icon":"shopping-cart","aria":{"en":"Cart","ar":"السلّة"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"searchbar","text":{"en":"wireles charger","ar":"شاحن لاسكي"},"filled":true},{"kind":"icon","icon":"robot","size":"l","color":"brand","gap":"m"},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Oops! Our search is as lost as you are 😅","ar":"عفوًا! البحث تايه زيّك بالظبط 😅"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Nothing for \"wireles charger\".","ar":"لا نتائج لـ«شاحن لاسكي»."},"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"plain","text":{"en":"\"No results for … Check the spelling or try other words.\"","ar":"«لا توجد نتائج لـ… تأكّد من الإملاء أو جرّب كلمات أخرى.»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"volta","name":{"en":"Volta","ar":"فولتا"},"color":"#1864AB","icon":"lightning","domain":"volta.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Search","ar":"البحث"},"back":true,"actions":[{"icon":"shopping-cart","aria":{"en":"Cart","ar":"السلّة"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"searchbar","text":{"en":"wireles charger","ar":"شاحن لاسكي"},"filled":true},{"kind":"icon","icon":"magnifying-glass","size":"l","color":"brand","gap":"m"},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"No results for \"wireles charger\"","ar":"لا توجد نتائج لـ«شاحن لاسكي»"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Check the spelling or try other words.","ar":"تأكّد من الإملاء أو جرّب كلمات أخرى."},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"Did you mean **wireless charger**?","ar":"هل تقصد **شاحن لاسلكي**؟"},"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"blame","text":{"en":"\"You must have typed it wrong.\"","ar":"«أكيد كتبتها غلط.»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"volta","name":{"en":"Volta","ar":"فولتا"},"color":"#1864AB","icon":"lightning","domain":"volta.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Search","ar":"البحث"},"back":true,"actions":[{"icon":"shopping-cart","aria":{"en":"Cart","ar":"السلّة"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"searchbar","text":{"en":"wireles charger","ar":"شاحن لاسكي"},"filled":true},{"kind":"icon","icon":"warning-circle","size":"l","color":"brand","gap":"m"},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"You must have typed it wrong.","ar":"أكيد كتبتها غلط."},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Nothing for \"wireles charger\".","ar":"لا نتائج لـ«شاحن لاسكي»."},"gap":"s"}]}}],"answer":["plain"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P14-029","when":["joke","blame"],"feedback":{"en":"The customer just failed to find what they came for. A joke at their expense, or being told they got it wrong, makes them more likely to leave than to try again.","ar":"فشل العميل للتو في إيجاد ما جاء من أجله. والنكتة على حسابه، أو إخباره بأنه أخطأ، تجعله أقرب إلى المغادرة من المحاولة مرة أخرى."}}],"correct":{"en":"Plain, kind and useful.","ar":"بسيطة ولطيفة ومفيدة."},"explain":{"en":"The brand can be playful elsewhere. Here, a clear message and a spelling fix get the customer to the chargers.","ar":"يمكن أن تكون العلامة التجارية مرحة في أماكن أخرى. أما هنا، فالرسالة الواضحة وتصحيح الإملاء يوصلان العميل إلى الشواحن."},"speaker":"karim"},{"id":"S07","type":"compare","part":"contrast","skill":"SK-P14-U03-03","rules":["R11"],"value":{"en":"No-results pages (NN/g): offer starting points for moving forward, such as spelling corrections and suggestions for similar queries that do return results. Version B states the problem clearly but stops there.","ar":"صفحات «لا توجد نتائج» (NN/g): اعرض نقاط بداية للمتابعة، مثل تصحيح الإملاء واقتراح عمليات بحث مشابهة تأتي بنتائج. والنسخة B تقول المشكلة بوضوح لكنها تتوقّف عندها."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/search-no-results-serp/","quote":"Suggestions for similar queries that do return results"},"scenario":{"en":"In the pharmacy app I'm building, someone searched for **fluzal day night** and nothing matched. The app sells Fluzal Day and Fluzal Night as separate products.","ar":"في تطبيق الصيدلية الذي أبنيه، بحث شخص عن **فلوزال داي نايت** فلم يجد شيئًا. والتطبيق يبيع فلوزال داي وفلوزال نايت منتجين منفصلين."},"prompt":{"en":"Which version should ship?","ar":"أيّ نسخة يجب أن تُطلق؟"},"a":{"label":{"en":"Version A: clear message and similar searches","ar":"النسخة A: رسالة واضحة وعمليات بحث مشابهة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dawaa","name":{"en":"Dawaa Pharmacy","ar":"صيدلية دواء"},"color":"#059669","icon":"pill","domain":"dawaa.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Search","ar":"البحث"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"searchbar","text":{"en":"fluzal day night","ar":"فلوزال داي نايت"},"filled":true},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"No results for \"fluzal day night\"","ar":"لا توجد نتائج لـ«فلوزال داي نايت»"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Did you mean one of these?","ar":"هل تقصد أحد هذين؟"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"listitem","art":"medicine","text":{"en":"Fluzal Day","ar":"فلوزال داي"},"sub":{"en":"20 tablets","ar":"20 قرصًا"},"value":{"en":"EGP 48","ar":"48 جنيه"},"chevron":true,"gap":"s"},{"kind":"listitem","art":"medicine","text":{"en":"Fluzal Night","ar":"فلوزال نايت"},"sub":{"en":"20 tablets","ar":"20 قرصًا"},"value":{"en":"EGP 52","ar":"52 جنيه"},"chevron":true}]}},"b":{"label":{"en":"Version B: clear message only","ar":"النسخة B: رسالة واضحة فقط"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dawaa","name":{"en":"Dawaa Pharmacy","ar":"صيدلية دواء"},"color":"#059669","icon":"pill","domain":"dawaa.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Search","ar":"البحث"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"searchbar","text":{"en":"fluzal day night","ar":"فلوزال داي نايت"},"filled":true},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"No results for \"fluzal day night\"","ar":"لا توجد نتائج لـ«فلوزال داي نايت»"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"We couldn't find any products matching your search.","ar":"لم نجد أي منتجات تطابق بحثك."},"gap":"s"}]}},"answer":"a","misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P14-028","when":["b"],"feedback":{"en":"B is honest but leaves the person stuck. They don't know the two products exist separately, so they may leave without the medicine they need.","ar":"النسخة B صادقة لكنها تترك الشخص عالقًا. فهو لا يعرف أن المنتجين موجودان منفصلين، وقد يغادر بدون الدواء الذي يحتاجه."}}],"correct":{"en":"A: clear, and it leads somewhere.","ar":"A: واضحة، وتقود إلى المنتج."},"explain":{"en":"Both pages say nothing matched. A also shows the two real products, so the person picks the right one in a tap.","ar":"الصفحتان تقولان إن البحث لم يجد شيئًا. لكن A تعرض أيضًا المنتجين الحقيقيين، فيختار الشخص المناسب بضغطة."},"speaker":"karim"},{"id":"S08","type":"tune","speaker":"rami","part":"independent","skill":"SK-P14-U03-03","rules":["R14"],"value":{"en":"No-results pages (NN/g): they must clearly state that nothing matched, and can give advice about how to modify queries, using different words or fewer words. A list of best sellers with no message hides the failure.","ar":"صفحات «لا توجد نتائج» (NN/g): يجب أن تقول بوضوح إنه لا يوجد تطابق، ويمكن أن تنصح بتعديل البحث بكلمات مختلفة أو أقل. وقائمة الأكثر مبيعًا بدون رسالة تُخفي الفشل."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/search-no-results-serp/","quote":"Advice about how to modify queries, using different words or fewer words"},"scenario":{"en":"I'm designing a book app. Someone searched for **Naguib Mahfouz audiobooks**. The app has 12 of his books, but no audiobooks.","ar":"أصمّم تطبيقًا للكتب. وبحث شخص عن **كتب صوتية لنجيب محفوظ**. وفي التطبيق 12 كتابًا له، لكن بدون كتب صوتية."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each version of the results page. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل نسخة من صفحة النتائج. أيّ نسخة تخبر القارئ بما ينقص وتوصله إلى كتب محفوظ الموجودة؟"},"start":"best","options":[{"id":"best","text":{"en":"Show the week's best sellers, with no message","ar":"اعرض الأكثر مبيعًا هذا الأسبوع، بدون رسالة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"safha","name":{"en":"Safha","ar":"صفحة"},"color":"#A0522D","icon":"book-open","domain":"safha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Search","ar":"البحث"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"searchbar","text":{"en":"Naguib Mahfouz audiobooks","ar":"كتب صوتية لنجيب محفوظ"},"filled":true},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Bestsellers","ar":"الأكثر مبيعًا"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"listitem","art":"book","text":{"en":"Ten Small Habits","ar":"عشر عادات صغيرة"},"sub":{"en":"Omar Fathy · audiobook","ar":"عمر فتحي · كتاب صوتي"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"listitem","art":"book","text":{"en":"The Quiet River","ar":"النهر الهادئ"},"sub":{"en":"Salma Adel · audiobook","ar":"سلمى عادل · كتاب صوتي"}}]}},{"id":"drop","text":{"en":"Clear message, and a link without \"audiobooks\"","ar":"رسالة واضحة، ورابط بدون كلمة «صوتية»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"safha","name":{"en":"Safha","ar":"صفحة"},"color":"#A0522D","icon":"book-open","domain":"safha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Search","ar":"البحث"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"searchbar","text":{"en":"Naguib Mahfouz audiobooks","ar":"كتب صوتية لنجيب محفوظ"},"filled":true},{"kind":"icon","icon":"headphones","size":"l","color":"brand","gap":"m"},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"No audiobooks by Naguib Mahfouz yet","ar":"لا توجد كتب صوتية لنجيب محفوظ بعد"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"row","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"book","size":"s","alt":{"en":"Book cover","ar":"غلاف كتاب"}},{"kind":"image","art":"book","size":"s","alt":{"en":"Book cover","ar":"غلاف كتاب"}},{"kind":"image","art":"book","size":"s","alt":{"en":"Book cover","ar":"غلاف كتاب"}}]},{"kind":"link","text":{"en":"See his 12 books (print and e-book)","ar":"اعرض كتبه الـ12 (ورقية وإلكترونية)"},"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"joke","text":{"en":"A sad cartoon and \"This page is empty, like our shelves\"","ar":"رسمة حزينة و«الصفحة فاضية زي رفوفنا»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"safha","name":{"en":"Safha","ar":"صفحة"},"color":"#A0522D","icon":"book-open","domain":"safha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Search","ar":"البحث"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"searchbar","text":{"en":"Naguib Mahfouz audiobooks","ar":"كتب صوتية لنجيب محفوظ"},"filled":true},{"kind":"image","art":"shelf","size":"m","alt":{"en":"An empty shelf","ar":"رف فارغ"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"This page is empty, like our shelves","ar":"الصفحة فاضية زي رفوفنا"},"gap":"s"}]}}],"answer":["drop"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P14-027","when":["best"],"feedback":{"en":"Without a message, the reader may think these are the results and wonder why the search failed. They never learn that the app has 12 Mahfouz books.","ar":"بدون رسالة، قد يظنّ القارئ أن هذه هي النتائج ويتساءل لماذا لم ينجح البحث. ولن يعرف أبدًا أن في التطبيق 12 كتابًا لمحفوظ."}},{"id":"MC-P14-029","when":["joke"],"feedback":{"en":"The joke doesn't help, and it's wrong: the shelves have 12 of his books. The reader gets a laugh at best, and no way to them.","ar":"النكتة لا تساعد، وهي خاطئة: ففي الرفوف 12 كتابًا له. وفي أحسن الأحوال يضحك القارئ، لكن لا شيء يوصله إليها."}}],"correct":{"en":"Say what's missing, and link to what exists.","ar":"قل ما غير موجود، وضع رابطًا لما هو موجود."},"explain":{"en":"The reader learns there are no audiobooks, and one tap shows the 12 books the app does have.","ar":"يعرف القارئ أنه لا توجد كتب صوتية، وضغطة واحدة تعرض الكتب الـ12 الموجودة فعلًا في التطبيق."}},{"id":"S09","type":"card","part":"recap","icons":["eye","idea","warn"],"title":{"en":"What you practised","ar":"ما تدرّبت عليه"},"body":{"en":"- **Say it clearly:** a heading at the top that nothing matched.\n- **Show the way forward:** a spelling fix, similar searches with results, fewer words.\n- **Keep it plain:** no jokes about the failure, no blame.\n\nNext: filters people can understand.","ar":"- **قل ذلك بوضوح:** عنوان في الأعلى يقول إنه لا توجد نتائج.\n- **اعرض خطوة تالية:** تصحيح الإملاء، وعمليات بحث مشابهة لها نتائج، وكلمات أقل.\n- **أبقِها بسيطة:** لا نكات عن الفشل، ولا لوم.\n\nالتالي: فلاتر يفهمها الناس."}}]}$uxg$::jsonb),
  ($uxg$P14-U03-L03$uxg$, $uxg$6c180f87535018f981582ed531bdf42dfebd5a33d81154e1c739ffa1567a9f99$uxg$, $uxg${"id":"P14-U03-L03","mode":"lesson","minutes":8,"title":{"en":"Filters people understand","ar":"فلاتر يفهمها الناس"},"speaker":"youssef","review_labels":{"MC-P14-030":{"en":"Filters must cover what people filter by","ar":"الفلاتر يجب أن تغطّي ما يفلتر به الناس"},"MC-P14-031":{"en":"A filter label must say what's inside","ar":"اسم الفلتر يجب أن يقول ما بداخله"},"MC-P14-032":{"en":"General, most-used filters come first","ar":"الفلاتر العامة والأكثر استخدامًا تأتي أولًا"}},"steps":[{"id":"S01","type":"card","part":"hook","title":{"en":"Youssef's shoe store","ar":"متجر يوسف للأحذية"},"body":{"en":"I run an online shoe store. Its filter panel has **Item type**, **Color**, **Price** and **Brand**.\n\nIn interviews, customers say they scroll through pages of shoes that turn out not to come in their size.","ar":"أدير متجر أحذية على الإنترنت. وفي لوحة الفلاتر فيه: **نوع العنصر**، و**اللون**، و**السعر**، و**الماركة**.\n\nوفي المقابلات، يقول العملاء إنهم يتصفّحون صفحات من الأحذية ثم يكتشفون أنها غير متوفّرة بمقاسهم."},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Filters","ar":"الفلاتر"},"actions":[{"icon":"x","aria":{"en":"Close","ar":"إغلاق"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Dar · Women's shoes","ar":"دار · أحذية نسائية"}},{"kind":"accordion","text":{"en":"Item type","ar":"نوع العنصر"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"accordion","text":{"en":"Color","ar":"اللون"}},{"kind":"accordion","text":{"en":"Price","ar":"السعر"}},{"kind":"accordion","text":{"en":"Brand","ar":"الماركة"}}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Show 86 results","ar":"اعرض 86 نتيجة"}}]}},{"id":"S02","type":"tune","part":"try","skill":"SK-P14-U03-05","rules":["R12"],"confidence":true,"value":{"en":"Try first. Filter categories (NN/g): they must cover the most important aspects of whatever users will be filtering. For shoes, size decides whether a pair is even an option.","ar":"جرّب أولًا. فئات الفلاتر (NN/g): يجب أن تغطّي أهم جوانب ما سيفلتره الناس. وفي الأحذية، المقاس هو ما يحدّد إن كان الحذاء خيارًا أصلًا."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/filter-categories-values/","quote":"must cover the most important aspects of whatever users will be filtering"},"prompt":{"en":"The team can add one filter this month. Try each one. Which should ship?","ar":"يستطيع الفريق إضافة فلتر واحد هذا الشهر. جرّب كل فلتر. أيّ فلتر يحلّ المشكلة التي ذكرها العملاء في المقابلات؟"},"start":"season","options":[{"id":"season","text":{"en":"Collection season","ar":"موسم المجموعة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Filters","ar":"الفلاتر"},"actions":[{"icon":"x","aria":{"en":"Close","ar":"إغلاق"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Dar · Women's shoes","ar":"دار · أحذية نسائية"}},{"kind":"accordion","text":{"en":"Collection season","ar":"موسم المجموعة"},"open":true,"gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"check","text":{"en":"Spring–Summer 2026","ar":"ربيع وصيف 2026"}},{"kind":"check","text":{"en":"Autumn–Winter 2026","ar":"خريف وشتاء 2026"},"gap":"s"}]},{"kind":"accordion","text":{"en":"Item type","ar":"نوع العنصر"}},{"kind":"accordion","text":{"en":"Color","ar":"اللون"}}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Show 86 results","ar":"اعرض 86 نتيجة"}}]}},{"id":"size","text":{"en":"Size","ar":"المقاس"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Filters","ar":"الفلاتر"},"actions":[{"icon":"x","aria":{"en":"Close","ar":"إغلاق"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Dar · Women's shoes","ar":"دار · أحذية نسائية"}},{"kind":"accordion","text":{"en":"Size","ar":"المقاس"},"open":true,"gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"row","blocks":[{"kind":"chip","text":"39"},{"kind":"chip","text":"40"},{"kind":"chip","text":"41"},{"kind":"chip","text":"42"},{"kind":"chip","text":"43"}]}]},{"kind":"accordion","text":{"en":"Item type","ar":"نوع العنصر"}},{"kind":"accordion","text":{"en":"Color","ar":"اللون"}}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Show 86 results","ar":"اعرض 86 نتيجة"}}]}},{"id":"warehouse","text":{"en":"Warehouse","ar":"المخزن"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Filters","ar":"الفلاتر"},"actions":[{"icon":"x","aria":{"en":"Close","ar":"إغلاق"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Dar · Women's shoes","ar":"دار · أحذية نسائية"}},{"kind":"accordion","text":{"en":"Warehouse","ar":"المخزن"},"open":true,"gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"check","text":{"en":"Cairo – Obour","ar":"القاهرة – العبور"}},{"kind":"check","text":{"en":"Alexandria – Borg","ar":"الإسكندرية – برج العرب"},"gap":"s"}]},{"kind":"accordion","text":{"en":"Item type","ar":"نوع العنصر"}},{"kind":"accordion","text":{"en":"Color","ar":"اللون"}}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Show 86 results","ar":"اعرض 86 نتيجة"}}]}}],"answer":["size"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P14-030","when":["season","warehouse"],"feedback":{"en":"Customers don't shop by season or by where the stock is kept. They still scroll past shoes that don't come in their size, which is what they told the team.","ar":"العملاء لا يتسوّقون حسب الموسم ولا حسب مكان المخزون. وسيظلّون يمرّون على أحذية غير متوفّرة بمقاسهم، وهذا ما قالوه للفريق."}}],"hints":[{"en":"What did customers say wastes their time?","ar":"ماذا قال العملاء إنه يضيّع وقتهم؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Size: it's what customers filter shoes by.","ar":"المقاس: هو ما يفلتر به العملاء الأحذية."},"explain":{"en":"With Size, customers only see shoes they can actually buy. That's the problem they described in the interviews.","ar":"مع فلتر المقاس، لا يرى العملاء إلا الأحذية التي يمكنهم شراؤها فعلًا. وهذه هي المشكلة التي وصفوها في المقابلات."}},{"id":"S10","type":"video","part":"concept","title":{"en":"Filters people understand","ar":"فلاتر يفهمها الناس"},"video":"065a75c7-3ac8-458f-97be-95b5441b86fc","duration":369,"transcript":[{"t":2.5,"en":"To talk about filter guidelines, we first need to understand filter categories and filter values. A filter category is the main heading with many choices under it to filter by,","ar":"لو بدأنا نتكلم عن الـ Guidelines بتاعة الـ Filters، محتاجين نفهم أول حاجة فكرة الـ Filter category والـ Filter value. الـ Filter category هي العناوين الرئيسية اللي تحتها اختيارات كتير عشان أعمل Filter منها،"},{"t":14.2,"en":"and filter values are the choices under those headings. For example a category could be price or color: under price there are different ranges, and under color there are values like red, green and yellow.","ar":"والـ Filter values هي الاختيارات الموجودة تحت العناوين دي. على سبيل المثال الـ Category ممكن يكون Price أو اللون، وتحته مجموعة Values: Price تحته Ranges مختلفة، واللون تحته Values زي أحمر وأخضر وأصفر وهكذا."},{"t":30.8,"en":"So the headings are the categories, and what's under them are the values. Why do we need this? To give guidelines, or best practices, for these headings and the values under them, which we should watch as we design filters.","ar":"فالعناوين دي هي الـ Categories، والـ Values اللي تحتها هي الـ Filter values. ليه بنعرف ده؟ عشان نقول بعض الـ Guidelines، أو الـ Best practices، على العناوين دي وعلى الـ Values اللي تحتها، اللي محتاجين ناخد بالنا منها ونحن بنصمّم Filters."},{"t":48.7,"en":"We need to keep four things in mind: categories and the values under them should be appropriate, predictable, free of jargon (hard or unclear terms), and prioritized, ordered by what users need or use most.","ar":"محتاجين ناخد في الاعتبار أربع حاجات: إن الـ Filter categories والـ Values تحتها تكون Appropriate يعني مناسبة، وPredictable يعني متوقّعة، وFree of jargon يعني خالية من المصطلحات الصعبة أو غير المفهومة، وPrioritized يعني مترتّبة بالأولوية بناءً على اللي اليوزر محتاجه أو بيستخدمه أكتر."},{"t":73.25,"en":"Let's take them one by one. The first is appropriate: the values and categories in filters should suit what users want to filter by. Sometimes I put a value under a category that users don't need and never use.","ar":"خلّونا نفصّلهم واحدة واحدة. أول نقطة إنها تكون مناسبة: مهم إن الـ Values أو الـ Categories في الفلاتر تكون مناسبة للي اليوزرز عايزين يعملوا Filter عليه. ممكن أحيانًا أحط Value تحت Category معيّنة واليوزرز مش محتاجينها ومش بيستخدموها نهائيًا."},{"t":94.36,"en":"To make sure they're appropriate we need detailed user research on the specific items in the website or product, to understand which categories and values users need: what they're looking for, what their needs are, and which factors they search by to reach the items they want. That's the first point.","ar":"وعشان نتأكد إن الـ Categories والـ Values مناسبة، محتاجين نعمل Detailed user research على الـ Items المعيّنة في الـ Website أو الـ Product، عشان نفهم اليوزرز محتاجين أنهي Categories وأنهي Values جواها، يعني بيدوّروا على إيه وإيه احتياجاتهم، وبيدوّروا على أي Factors عشان يوصلوا للـ Items اللي عايزينها. ده أول نقطة."},{"t":131.96,"en":"Second, the values under each category should be predictable to users. What does that mean? The category's label itself should tell me what values are likely to be under it.","ar":"تاني حاجة إن الـ Values اللي تحت كل Category تكون متوقّعة بالنسبة لليوزرز. يعني إيه متوقّعة؟ معناها إن الـ Label بتاع الـ Category نفسه يكون موضّح لي احتمال تكون إيه الـ Values الموجودة تحته."},{"t":150.06,"en":"To do that, category labels need to be clear, not vague, so I can predict the values under them. For example, in this example one category was called item type and another style.","ar":"وعشان نعمل ده، محتاجين الـ Labels بتاعة الـ Categories تكون واضحة، مش غامضة، تخلّيني أتوقّع الـ Values اللي ممكن تكون تحتها. على سبيل المثال، في المثال ده كان عندنا Category اسمه Item type وCategory اسمه Style."},{"t":167.06,"en":"When they ran usability testing on this, most users ignored the item type category because it wasn't clear to them, they couldn't predict the values under it, and they went straight to style. Item type is too general to tell what's under it, while style was understandable.","ar":"لما عملوا Usability testing على المثال ده، أغلب المستخدمين تجاهلوا الـ Category بتاع Item type لأنه مش مفهوم لهم، مش متوقّعين الـ Values اللي ممكن تكون تحته، وكانوا بيدخلوا على طول على Style. فـ Item type عنوان عام جدًا مش مفهوم منه إيه تحته، لكن Style كان مفهوم."},{"t":193.96,"en":"So the headings themselves must be understandable, especially if we use accordions with closed categories that open to show their values. Or we can use a pattern like Amazon's, which leaves every filter open by default, so I see all the values and understand each category from what's under it.","ar":"فمحتاجين نخلّي العناوين نفسها تكون مفهومة، وبالذات لو بنستخدم Accordions بنخلّي فيها الـ Categories مقفولة ولما أضغط عليها بتفتح وتبيّن الـ Values. أو ممكن نستخدم Pattern زي اللي في Amazon، اللي بيخلّي الفلاتر كلها مفتوحة By default، فأنا شايف كل الـ Values وأعرف معنى كل Category لأني شايف اللي تحتها."},{"t":219.56,"en":"Third, values and categories should be free of jargon. The difference from the last point is that I may read a category or value and not understand it at all, because it's an unfamiliar term, maybe a bit scientific, or one that some people read one way and some another.","ar":"تالت نقطة إن الـ Values والـ Categories تكون Free of jargon. الفرق بينها وبين اللي فاتت إني ممكن أقرا Category أو Value ومافهمش معناها أصلًا لأنها مصطلح مش مفهوم أو مش دارج بين كل الناس، ممكن يكون علمي شوية، أو ليه دلالات بعض الناس فهمها وبعضهم لأ."},{"t":242.46,"en":"Like the website in front of us: one category was behavior, but the values under it were purple, orange and green. Many users might not understand them: what do purple, orange and green mean, exactly? That's a different problem from the previous point.","ar":"زي المثال في الـ Website اللي قدامنا: واحدة من الـ Categories كانت Behavior، لكن الـ Values تحتها كانت مكتوبة Purple وOrange وGreen. فكانت مصطلحات ممكن مش مفهومة لمستخدمين كتير: إيه معنى Purple وOrange وGreen؟ بتدل على إيه بالضبط؟ ودي حالة مختلفة عن النقطة اللي فاتت."},{"t":272.56,"en":"The last guideline is that filters are prioritized, ordered by how much users use them and how important they are to the website. To know that we need research, to see what users use most or what matters most to them, so that comes first, then the next, and so on.","ar":"آخر نقطة في الـ Guidelines بتاعة الفلاتر إنها تكون Prioritized، يعني مترتّبة حسب الأولوية: حسب استخدام المستخدمين ليها أكتر، وحسب أهميتها بالنسبة للـ Website. وعشان نعرف ده محتاجين نعمل Research عشان نشوف اليوزرز بيستخدموا إيه أكتر أو إيه الأهم بالنسبة لهم، فيكون في الأول وبعده اللي بعده وهكذا."},{"t":295.66,"en":"For example, the first filter was asset type: I need to choose the kind of asset I'm looking for in the first place, and that may be the most important thing for me. After that, license: free or premium, and so on.","ar":"على سبيل المثال، أول حاجة في الفلاتر كانت Asset type: أنا محتاج أحدد نوع الأصل اللي بدوّر عليه أصلًا، وده ممكن يكون أهم حاجة بالنسبة لي. بعد كده License: هل هو Free ولا Premium وهكذا."},{"t":313.66,"en":"Ordering filters by how much users use them matters, because as a user I'll mostly use the first two or three, so they need to be clearly visible and easy to use. If I want a less common filter, I can scroll down for it.","ar":"فترتيب الفلاتر حسب أولوية استخدام اليوزرز ليها من الحاجات المهمة، لأن كـ User في الآخر في الأغلب هستخدم أول 2 أو 3 Filters، فلازم يكونوا ظاهرين بوضوح وأستخدمهم بسهولة. ولو عايز Filter أقل استخدامًا، ممكن ساعتها أنزل أدوّر عليه."},{"t":332.56,"en":"Notice also that when they added a new filter, AI generated, it sat at the top so users would notice it. It was in a closed accordion with an icon beside it that opens a tooltip explaining what the filter means. I can open and use it, but it's at the top so I know it's there.","ar":"ولاحظوا برضه في المثال لما أضافوا Filter جديد، AI generated، كان موجود في الأول عشان كـ User آخد بالي إن فيه Filter جديد. كان في Accordion ومقفول، وجنبه Icon بيطلع منها Tooltip بتشرح الفلتر ده معناه إيه. فممكن أفتحه وأستخدمه، بس هو فوق عشان أعرف إنه موجود."},{"t":358.86,"en":"These are the guidelines to keep in mind as we design filters.","ar":"وهي دي الـ Guidelines اللي محتاجين ناخد بالنا منها ونحن بنصمّم الفلاتر."}]},{"id":"S03","type":"card","part":"concept","icons":["target","eye","text","order"],"title":{"en":"Video summary","ar":"ملخص الفيديو"},"body":{"en":"Filters let people leave out what doesn't fit, like a price range, a rating or a place. Each filter has a **category** (such as Price) and **values** under it (such as Under EGP 500). Both need four things:\n\n- **Appropriate:** they cover what people really filter by. User research shows what that is.\n- **Predictable:** from the category name, people can guess the values inside. Vague names like \"Item type\" get skipped.\n- **Free of jargon:** no internal codes or terms only the team knows.\n- **Prioritized:** the most general and most used categories come first, more specific ones lower down.","ar":"الفلاتر تجعل الناس يستبعدون ما لا يناسبهم، مثل نطاق سعر أو تقييم أو مكان. ولكل فلتر **فئة** (مثل السعر) و**قيم** تحتها (مثل أقل من 500 جنيه). والاثنتان تحتاجان أربعة أشياء:\n\n- **مناسبة:** تغطّي ما يفلتر به الناس فعلًا. والـ User research (بحث المستخدمين) يوضّح ما هو.\n- **متوقَّعة:** من اسم الفئة، يخمّن الناس القيم التي بداخلها. والأسماء المبهمة مثل «نوع العنصر» يتخطّاها الناس.\n- **بدون مصطلحات صعبة:** لا رموز داخلية ولا كلمات لا يعرفها إلا الفريق.\n- **مرتّبة بالأولوية:** الفئات الأعمّ والأكثر استخدامًا أولًا، والأكثر تخصّصًا في الأسفل."}},{"id":"S04","type":"tune","part":"guided","skill":"SK-P14-U03-04","rules":["R06","R15"],"value":{"en":"Filter categories (NN/g): as much as possible, avoid filter categories with vague labels like Item Type. People can't guess that sandals sit under it, so they skip it.","ar":"فئات الفلاتر (NN/g): قدر الإمكان، تجنّب الفئات ذات الأسماء المبهمة مثل «نوع العنصر». فالناس لا يخمّنون أن الصنادل تحتها، فيتخطّونها."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/filter-categories-values/","quote":"As much as possible, avoid filter categories with vague labels like Item Type."},"scenario":{"en":"Customers looking for sandals in my store never open **Item type**. That's where sandals, boots, sneakers and heels are.","ar":"العملاء الذين يبحثون عن صنادل في متجري لا يفتحون **نوع العنصر** أبدًا. وهناك توجد الصنادل والبوتات والأحذية الرياضية والكعب العالي."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each version of that filter. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل نسخة من هذا الفلتر. أيّ نسخة تجعل من يبحث عن صنادل يعرف أين يجدها؟"},"start":"item","options":[{"id":"item","text":{"en":"Keep \"Item type\"","ar":"أبقِ «نوع العنصر»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Filters","ar":"الفلاتر"},"actions":[{"icon":"x","aria":{"en":"Close","ar":"إغلاق"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Dar · Women's shoes","ar":"دار · أحذية نسائية"}},{"kind":"accordion","text":{"en":"Item type","ar":"نوع العنصر"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"accordion","text":{"en":"Size","ar":"المقاس"}},{"kind":"accordion","text":{"en":"Color","ar":"اللون"}}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Show 86 results","ar":"اعرض 86 نتيجة"}}]}},{"id":"style","text":{"en":"\"Shoe style\", with sandals, boots, sneakers and heels shown","ar":"«شكل الحذاء»، وتظهر تحته الصنادل والبوتات والرياضية والكعب"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Filters","ar":"الفلاتر"},"actions":[{"icon":"x","aria":{"en":"Close","ar":"إغلاق"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Dar · Women's shoes","ar":"دار · أحذية نسائية"}},{"kind":"accordion","text":{"en":"Shoe style","ar":"شكل الحذاء"},"open":true,"gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"check","text":{"en":"Sandals","ar":"صنادل"}},{"kind":"check","text":{"en":"Boots","ar":"بوتات"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"check","text":{"en":"Sneakers","ar":"أحذية رياضية"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"check","text":{"en":"Heels","ar":"كعب عالٍ"},"gap":"s"}]},{"kind":"accordion","text":{"en":"Size","ar":"المقاس"}}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Show 86 results","ar":"اعرض 86 نتيجة"}}]}},{"id":"more","text":{"en":"Move these values into \"More filters\"","ar":"انقل هذه القيم إلى «فلاتر أخرى»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Filters","ar":"الفلاتر"},"actions":[{"icon":"x","aria":{"en":"Close","ar":"إغلاق"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Dar · Women's shoes","ar":"دار · أحذية نسائية"}},{"kind":"accordion","text":{"en":"Size","ar":"المقاس"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"accordion","text":{"en":"Color","ar":"اللون"}},{"kind":"accordion","text":{"en":"More filters","ar":"فلاتر أخرى"}}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Show 86 results","ar":"اعرض 86 نتيجة"}}]}}],"answer":["style"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P14-031","when":["item","more"],"feedback":{"en":"\"Item type\" and \"More filters\" don't say what's inside, so someone looking for sandals has no reason to open them. The values stay hidden behind a name nobody can predict.","ar":"«نوع العنصر» و«فلاتر أخرى» لا يقولان ما بداخلهما، فمن يبحث عن صنادل ليس لديه سبب ليفتحهما. والقيم تبقى مخفية خلف اسم لا يتوقّعه أحد."}}],"hints":[{"en":"From the name alone, would you guess that sandals are inside?","ar":"من الاسم وحده، هل ستخمّن أن الصنادل بداخله؟"}],"correct":{"en":"A name that predicts the values, with the values in view.","ar":"اسم يدلّ على القيم، والقيم ظاهرة."},"explain":{"en":"\"Shoe style\" tells people what kind of choice it is, and the visible values show sandals right away.","ar":"«شكل الحذاء» يقول للناس نوع الاختيار، والقيم الظاهرة تعرض الصنادل فورًا."},"speaker":"youssef"},{"id":"S05","type":"tune","speaker":"tarek","part":"guided","skill":"SK-P14-U03-04","rules":["R06","R15"],"confidence":true,"value":{"en":"Filter values (NN/g): unintelligible jargon has no place in filters. Class letters are how the rental company sorts its fleet, not how customers think about cars.","ar":"قيم الفلاتر (NN/g): المصطلحات غير المفهومة لا مكان لها في الفلاتر. وحروف الفئات هي طريقة شركة التأجير في ترتيب سياراتها، لا طريقة تفكير العملاء في السيارات."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/filter-categories-values/","quote":"Unintelligible jargon has no place in filters."},"scenario":{"en":"In the car rental app I manage, the filter **Class** has the values **A**, **B**, **C** and **D**: the codes our company uses inside its offices.","ar":"في تطبيق تأجير السيارات الذي أديره، في فلتر **الفئة** القيم **A** و**B** و**C** و**D**: وهي الرموز التي تستخدمها شركتنا داخل مكاتبها."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each version. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل نسخة. أيّها يجب أن تُطلق؟"},"start":"codes","options":[{"id":"codes","text":{"en":"Keep the codes A to D","ar":"أبقِ الرموز من A إلى D"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dawra","name":{"en":"Dawra Cars","ar":"دورة"},"color":"#343A40","icon":"key","domain":"dawra.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Filters","ar":"الفلاتر"},"actions":[{"icon":"x","aria":{"en":"Close","ar":"إغلاق"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"car","size":"s","alt":{"en":"Rental car","ar":"سيارة إيجار"}},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Class","ar":"الفئة"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"row","blocks":[{"kind":"chip","text":"A"},{"kind":"chip","text":"B"},{"kind":"chip","text":"C"},{"kind":"chip","text":"D"}]}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Show 24 cars","ar":"اعرض 24 سيارة"}}]}},{"id":"info","text":{"en":"Keep the codes, with an ⓘ that explains them","ar":"أبقِ الرموز، مع ⓘ يشرحها"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dawra","name":{"en":"Dawra Cars","ar":"دورة"},"color":"#343A40","icon":"key","domain":"dawra.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Filters","ar":"الفلاتر"},"actions":[{"icon":"x","aria":{"en":"Close","ar":"إغلاق"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"car","size":"s","alt":{"en":"Rental car","ar":"سيارة إيجار"}},{"kind":"row","gap":"m","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Class","ar":"الفئة"}},{"kind":"iconbtn","icon":"info","aria":{"en":"What the classes mean","ar":"معنى الفئات"}}]},{"kind":"row","blocks":[{"kind":"chip","text":"A"},{"kind":"chip","text":"B"},{"kind":"chip","text":"C"},{"kind":"chip","text":"D"}]}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Show 24 cars","ar":"اعرض 24 سيارة"}}]}},{"id":"plain","text":{"en":"\"Car size\": Small, Medium, Large, 7 seats","ar":"«حجم السيارة»: صغيرة، متوسطة، كبيرة، 7 مقاعد"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dawra","name":{"en":"Dawra Cars","ar":"دورة"},"color":"#343A40","icon":"key","domain":"dawra.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Filters","ar":"الفلاتر"},"actions":[{"icon":"x","aria":{"en":"Close","ar":"إغلاق"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"car","size":"s","alt":{"en":"Rental car","ar":"سيارة إيجار"}},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Car size","ar":"حجم السيارة"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"row","blocks":[{"kind":"chip","icon":"car-simple","text":{"en":"Small","ar":"صغيرة"}},{"kind":"chip","icon":"car-simple","text":{"en":"Medium","ar":"متوسطة"}},{"kind":"chip","icon":"car-profile","text":{"en":"Large","ar":"كبيرة"}},{"kind":"chip","icon":"van","text":{"en":"7 seats","ar":"7 مقاعد"}}]}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Show 24 cars","ar":"اعرض 24 سيارة"}}]}}],"answer":["plain"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P14-031","when":["codes","info"],"feedback":{"en":"Customers don't know what class C means. An ⓘ only helps those who think to open it, and they still have to remember the code while they choose.","ar":"العملاء لا يعرفون ماذا تعني الفئة C. والـ ⓘ لا يساعد إلا من يفكّر في فتحه، وسيظلّ عليه أن يتذكّر الرمز وهو يختار."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Would a first-time customer know which letter fits a family of six?","ar":"هل سيعرف عميل يستخدم التطبيق لأول مرة أيّ حرف يناسب عائلة من ستة أفراد؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Plain words people already use.","ar":"كلمات بسيطة يستخدمها الناس أصلًا."},"explain":{"en":"\"7 seats\" answers the question a family of six actually has. No code to learn, no extra tap.","ar":"«7 مقاعد» تجيب عن السؤال الذي لدى عائلة من ستة أفراد فعلًا. بدون رمز يحفظونه، وبدون ضغطة إضافية."}},{"id":"S06","type":"tune","speaker":"karim","part":"guided","skill":"SK-P14-U03-05","rules":["R06","R15"],"value":{"en":"Filter categories (NN/g): consider placing the most general, high-level filter categories at the top of the list. First-time buyers decide on brand and budget long before lens mounts.","ar":"فئات الفلاتر (NN/g): فكّر في وضع الفئات الأعمّ والأشمل في أعلى القائمة. ومن يشتري أول كاميرا يقرّر الماركة والميزانية قبل نوع تركيب العدسة بكثير."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/filter-categories-values/","quote":"consider placing the most general, high-level filter categories at the top of the list"},"scenario":{"en":"I'm building a camera store's website. Most visitors are buying their first camera. The filter panel lists **Lens mount**, **Max aperture** and **Sensor size** first, then **Brand** and **Price**.","ar":"أبني موقع متجر كاميرات. وأغلب الزوار يشترون أول كاميرا لهم. ولوحة الفلاتر تعرض أولًا **تركيب العدسة** و**أقصى فتحة عدسة** و**حجم الحساس**، ثم **الماركة** و**السعر**."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each order. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل ترتيب. أيّها يجب أن يُطلق؟"},"start":"tech","options":[{"id":"tech","text":{"en":"Keep the technical filters first","ar":"أبقِ الفلاتر التقنية أولًا"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"kadr","name":{"en":"Kadr","ar":"كادر"},"color":"#212529","icon":"camera","domain":"kadr.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Filters","ar":"الفلاتر"},"actions":[{"icon":"x","aria":{"en":"Close","ar":"إغلاق"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Kadr · Cameras","ar":"كادر · كاميرات"}},{"kind":"accordion","text":{"en":"Lens mount","ar":"تركيب العدسة"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"accordion","text":{"en":"Max aperture","ar":"أقصى فتحة عدسة"}},{"kind":"accordion","text":{"en":"Sensor size","ar":"حجم الحساس"}},{"kind":"accordion","text":{"en":"Brand","ar":"الماركة"}},{"kind":"accordion","text":{"en":"Price","ar":"السعر"}}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Show 42 cameras","ar":"اعرض 42 كاميرا"}}]}},{"id":"general","text":{"en":"Brand and Price first, technical ones below","ar":"الماركة والسعر أولًا، والتقنية تحتهما"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"kadr","name":{"en":"Kadr","ar":"كادر"},"color":"#212529","icon":"camera","domain":"kadr.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Filters","ar":"الفلاتر"},"actions":[{"icon":"x","aria":{"en":"Close","ar":"إغلاق"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Kadr · Cameras","ar":"كادر · كاميرات"}},{"kind":"accordion","text":{"en":"Brand","ar":"الماركة"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"accordion","text":{"en":"Price","ar":"السعر"}},{"kind":"accordion","text":{"en":"Sensor size","ar":"حجم الحساس"}},{"kind":"accordion","text":{"en":"Lens mount","ar":"تركيب العدسة"}},{"kind":"accordion","text":{"en":"Max aperture","ar":"أقصى فتحة عدسة"}}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Show 42 cameras","ar":"اعرض 42 كاميرا"}}]}},{"id":"abc","text":{"en":"Alphabetical order","ar":"ترتيب أبجدي"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"kadr","name":{"en":"Kadr","ar":"كادر"},"color":"#212529","icon":"camera","domain":"kadr.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Filters","ar":"الفلاتر"},"actions":[{"icon":"x","aria":{"en":"Close","ar":"إغلاق"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Kadr · Cameras","ar":"كادر · كاميرات"}},{"kind":"accordion","text":{"en":"Brand","ar":"أقصى فتحة عدسة"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"accordion","text":{"en":"Lens mount","ar":"تركيب العدسة"}},{"kind":"accordion","text":{"en":"Max aperture","ar":"حجم الحساس"}},{"kind":"accordion","text":{"en":"Price","ar":"السعر"}},{"kind":"accordion","text":{"en":"Sensor size","ar":"الماركة"}}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Show 42 cameras","ar":"اعرض 42 كاميرا"}}]}}],"answer":["general"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P14-032","when":["tech","abc"],"feedback":{"en":"A first-time buyer meets terms like lens mount and aperture before the two filters they actually use first. The order should follow what most visitors need, not the alphabet or the specs sheet.","ar":"من يشتري أول كاميرا يقابل مصطلحات مثل تركيب العدسة وفتحة العدسة قبل الفلترين اللذين يستخدمهما أولًا فعلًا. والترتيب يجب أن يتبع ما يحتاجه أغلب الزوار، لا الأبجدية ولا ورقة المواصفات."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Which two choices does a first-time buyer make first?","ar":"ما أول اختيارين يحدّدهما من يشتري كاميرا لأول مرة؟"}],"correct":{"en":"General and most used first.","ar":"الأعمّ والأكثر استخدامًا أولًا."},"explain":{"en":"Brand and Price come first for the beginners who are most of the visitors. Experts still find the technical filters just below.","ar":"الماركة والسعر يأتيان أولًا للمبتدئين، وهم أغلب الزوار. والخبراء يجدون الفلاتر التقنية تحتهما مباشرة."}},{"id":"S07","type":"compare","speaker":"mona","part":"contrast","skill":"SK-P14-U03-05","rules":["R11"],"value":{"en":"Filter categories (NN/g): they must cover the most important aspects of whatever users will be filtering, and research shows which aspects those are. Here the research is clear: width decides whether a sofa fits.","ar":"فئات الفلاتر (NN/g): يجب أن تغطّي أهم جوانب ما سيفلتره الناس، والبحث يوضّح ما هي هذه الجوانب. والبحث هنا واضح: العرض يحدّد إن كانت الكنبة ستناسب المكان."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/filter-categories-values/","quote":"must cover the most important aspects of whatever users will be filtering"},"scenario":{"en":"My team designs a furniture store's sofa page. Research shows most customers measure their wall before shopping, and the wrong width is the top reason sofas are returned.","ar":"يصمّم فريقي صفحة الكنب في متجر أثاث. ويُظهر البحث أن أغلب العملاء يقيسون الحائط قبل التسوّق، وأن العرض الخطأ هو أول سبب لإرجاع الكنب."},"prompt":{"en":"Which filter panel should ship?","ar":"أيّ لوحة فلاتر تساعد العملاء على إيجاد كنبة بعرض يناسب حائطهم؟"},"a":{"label":{"en":"Version A: Color, Material, Price","ar":"النسخة A: اللون، الخامة، السعر"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"beit","name":{"en":"Beit","ar":"بيت"},"color":"#8B5E34","icon":"armchair","domain":"beit.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Filters","ar":"الفلاتر"},"actions":[{"icon":"x","aria":{"en":"Close","ar":"إغلاق"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Beit · Sofas","ar":"بيت · كنب"}},{"kind":"accordion","text":{"en":"Color","ar":"اللون"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"accordion","text":{"en":"Material","ar":"الخامة"}},{"kind":"accordion","text":{"en":"Price","ar":"السعر"}}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Show 31 sofas","ar":"اعرض 31 كنبة"}}]}},"b":{"label":{"en":"Version B: Width, Price, Color","ar":"النسخة B: العرض، السعر، اللون"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"beit","name":{"en":"Beit","ar":"بيت"},"color":"#8B5E34","icon":"armchair","domain":"beit.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Filters","ar":"الفلاتر"},"actions":[{"icon":"x","aria":{"en":"Close","ar":"إغلاق"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Beit · Sofas","ar":"بيت · كنب"}},{"kind":"accordion","text":{"en":"Width","ar":"العرض"},"open":true,"gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"row","blocks":[{"kind":"chip","text":{"en":"Up to 180 cm","ar":"حتى 180 سم"}},{"kind":"chip","text":{"en":"180–220 cm","ar":"من 180 إلى 220 سم"}},{"kind":"chip","text":{"en":"Over 220 cm","ar":"أكثر من 220 سم"}}]}]},{"kind":"accordion","text":{"en":"Price","ar":"السعر"}},{"kind":"accordion","text":{"en":"Color","ar":"اللون"}}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Show 31 sofas","ar":"اعرض 31 كنبة"}}]}},"answer":"b","misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P14-030","when":["a"],"feedback":{"en":"Customers arrive with a measurement and no way to use it. They open sofa after sofa to check the width, and some still buy one that doesn't fit.","ar":"يأتي العملاء ومعهم القياس بدون طريقة لاستخدامه. فيفتحون كنبة بعد كنبة ليتأكّدوا من العرض، وبعضهم يشتري مع ذلك كنبة لا تناسب."}}],"correct":{"en":"B: it filters by what customers decide on.","ar":"B: تفلتر بما يقرّر به العملاء."},"explain":{"en":"Width comes first, in ranges customers can match to their tape measure. Price and Color follow.","ar":"العرض يأتي أولًا، بنطاقات يطابقها العملاء مع قياسهم. ثم يأتي السعر واللون."}},{"id":"S08","type":"tune","speaker":"sara","part":"independent","skill":"SK-P14-U03-04","rules":["R14"],"value":{"en":"Filter values (NN/g): unintelligible jargon has no place in filters. RO, BB, HB and FB are hotel industry codes; most travellers just want to know which meals are included.","ar":"قيم الفلاتر (NN/g): المصطلحات غير المفهومة لا مكان لها في الفلاتر. وRO وBB وHB وFB رموز يستخدمها قطاع الفنادق؛ وأغلب المسافرين يريدون فقط أن يعرفوا ما الوجبات المشمولة."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/filter-categories-values/","quote":"Unintelligible jargon has no place in filters."},"scenario":{"en":"I'm designing a hotel booking site. Its **Board** filter shows **RO**, **BB**, **HB** and **FB**, the codes hotels send with their prices.","ar":"أصمّم موقعًا لحجز الفنادق. وفلتر **Board** (نظام الوجبات) فيه يعرض **RO** و**BB** و**HB** و**FB**، وهي الرموز التي ترسلها الفنادق مع أسعارها."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each version. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل نسخة. أيّها يجب أن تُطلق؟"},"start":"codes","options":[{"id":"codes","text":{"en":"Keep the codes","ar":"أبقِ الرموز"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nuzul","name":{"en":"Nuzul","ar":"نُزُل"},"color":"#B7791F","icon":"bed","domain":"nuzul.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Filters","ar":"الفلاتر"},"actions":[{"icon":"x","aria":{"en":"Close","ar":"إغلاق"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Nuzul · Hurghada · 3 nights","ar":"نُزُل · الغردقة · 3 ليالٍ"}},{"kind":"heading","text":"Board","gap":"m"},{"kind":"check","text":"RO","gap":"s"},{"kind":"check","text":"BB","gap":"s"},{"kind":"check","text":"HB","gap":"s"},{"kind":"check","text":"FB","gap":"s"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Show 57 hotels","ar":"اعرض 57 فندقًا"}}]}},{"id":"legend","text":{"en":"Keep the codes, with a key at the bottom of the page","ar":"أبقِ الرموز، مع شرح لها في أسفل الصفحة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nuzul","name":{"en":"Nuzul","ar":"نُزُل"},"color":"#B7791F","icon":"bed","domain":"nuzul.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Filters","ar":"الفلاتر"},"actions":[{"icon":"x","aria":{"en":"Close","ar":"إغلاق"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Nuzul · Hurghada · 3 nights","ar":"نُزُل · الغردقة · 3 ليالٍ"}},{"kind":"heading","text":"Board","gap":"m"},{"kind":"check","text":"RO","gap":"s"},{"kind":"check","text":"BB","gap":"s"},{"kind":"check","text":"HB","gap":"s"},{"kind":"check","text":"FB","gap":"s"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"RO = room only, BB = bed and breakfast, HB = half board, FB = full board","ar":"RO = غرفة فقط، BB = مبيت وإفطار، HB = نصف إقامة، FB = إقامة كاملة"},"gap":"l"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Show 57 hotels","ar":"اعرض 57 فندقًا"}}]}},{"id":"meals","text":{"en":"\"Meals included\": None, Breakfast, Breakfast and dinner, All meals","ar":"«الوجبات المشمولة»: بدون، إفطار، إفطار وعشاء، كل الوجبات"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nuzul","name":{"en":"Nuzul","ar":"نُزُل"},"color":"#B7791F","icon":"bed","domain":"nuzul.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Filters","ar":"الفلاتر"},"actions":[{"icon":"x","aria":{"en":"Close","ar":"إغلاق"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Nuzul · Hurghada · 3 nights","ar":"نُزُل · الغردقة · 3 ليالٍ"}},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Meals included","ar":"الوجبات المشمولة"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"check","text":{"en":"None","ar":"بدون"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"check","text":{"en":"Breakfast","ar":"إفطار"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"check","text":{"en":"Breakfast and dinner","ar":"إفطار وعشاء"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"check","text":{"en":"All meals","ar":"كل الوجبات"},"gap":"s"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Show 57 hotels","ar":"اعرض 57 فندقًا"}}]}}],"answer":["meals"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P14-031","when":["codes","legend"],"feedback":{"en":"Many travellers don't know what HB stands for, and a key at the bottom of the page is easy to miss and has to be remembered while choosing.","ar":"كثير من المسافرين لا يعرفون ماذا يعني HB، والشرح في أسفل الصفحة قد لا يلاحظه أحد، ويجب تذكّره أثناء الاختيار."}}],"correct":{"en":"Say what's included, in plain words.","ar":"قل ما هو مشمول، بكلمات بسيطة."},"explain":{"en":"\"Breakfast and dinner\" needs no key. Travellers pick the meals they want in one look.","ar":"«إفطار وعشاء» لا تحتاج شرحًا. ويختار المسافرون الوجبات التي يريدونها بنظرة واحدة."}},{"id":"S09","type":"card","part":"recap","icons":["target","text","order"],"title":{"en":"What you practised","ar":"ما تدرّبت عليه"},"body":{"en":"- **Cover what people filter by**, like size for shoes or width for sofas.\n- **Names that predict the values**, in plain words: no vague labels, no internal codes.\n- **General and most-used first**, specialist filters lower down.\n\nNext: the skill check, on new cases.","ar":"- **غطِّ ما يفلتر به الناس**، مثل المقاس للأحذية أو العرض للكنب.\n- **أسماء تدلّ على القيم**، بكلمات بسيطة: بدون أسماء مبهمة، وبدون رموز داخلية.\n- **الأعمّ والأكثر استخدامًا أولًا**، والفلاتر المتخصّصة في الأسفل.\n\nالتالي: اختبار المهارة، على حالات جديدة."}}]}$uxg$::jsonb),
  ($uxg$P14-U03-L04$uxg$, $uxg$9f10776c148065a61afde2a0a36313c3d53be69ab1c3c2cba7ccd76b14d4ad6c$uxg$, $uxg${"id":"P14-U03-L04","mode":"check","minutes":7,"title":{"en":"Skill check: help people find it","ar":"اختبار المهارة: ساعد الناس على إيجاد ما يبحثون عنه"},"speaker":"tarek","steps":[{"id":"S01","type":"card","part":"hook","title":{"en":"Tarek's grocery app","ar":"تطبيق طارق للبقالة"},"body":{"en":"My team is about to launch our grocery delivery app. Help me review its search and filters before launch.\n\nThis is a skill check: no hints, and you'll see how you did at the end.","ar":"فريقي على وشك إطلاق تطبيقنا لتوصيل البقالة. ساعدني في مراجعة البحث والفلاتر فيه قبل الإطلاق.\n\nهذا اختبار مهارة: بدون تلميحات، وسترى نتيجتك في النهاية."}},{"id":"S02","type":"tune","part":"check","skill":"SK-P14-U03-02","value":{"en":"Check, search suggestions (NN/g): when suggestions contain the query anywhere, it's best to highlight the user's query. \"Milk\" sits at the start, middle or end of each product name.","ar":"اختبار، اقتراحات البحث (NN/g): حين تحتوي الاقتراحات على البحث في أي مكان، الأفضل إبراز ما كتبه المستخدم. و«لبن» تقع في أول اسم كل منتج أو وسطه أو آخره."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/site-search-suggestions/","quote":"it’s best to highlight the user’s query."},"scenario":{"en":"The suggestions show product names that contain the typed word anywhere. Someone types \"milk\".","ar":"تعرض الاقتراحات أسماء منتجات تحتوي على الكلمة المكتوبة في أي مكان. وكتب شخص «لبن»."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each style. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل شكل. أيّها يجب أن يُطلق؟"},"start":"rest","options":[{"id":"rest","text":{"en":"Bold everything except the typed word","ar":"كل شيء بخط عريض ما عدا الكلمة المكتوبة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"sallah","name":{"en":"Sallah","ar":"سلّة"},"color":"#2E9E5B","icon":"basket","domain":"sallah.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Sallah","ar":"سلّة"},"logo":true,"actions":[{"icon":"shopping-cart","aria":{"en":"Cart","ar":"السلّة"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"searchbar","text":{"en":"milk","ar":"لبن"},"filled":true,"focus":true,"suggest":[{"icon":"basket","text":{"en":"**Full-cream** milk **1 L**","ar":"لبن **كامل الدسم 1 لتر**"}},{"icon":"basket","text":{"en":"milk **chocolate bar**","ar":"**شوكولاتة بالـ**لبن"}},{"icon":"basket","text":{"en":"**Coconut** milk","ar":"لبن **جوز الهند**"}}]}],"keyboard":"text"}},{"id":"plain","text":{"en":"All text in the same style","ar":"كل النص بالشكل نفسه"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"sallah","name":{"en":"Sallah","ar":"سلّة"},"color":"#2E9E5B","icon":"basket","domain":"sallah.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Sallah","ar":"سلّة"},"logo":true,"actions":[{"icon":"shopping-cart","aria":{"en":"Cart","ar":"السلّة"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"searchbar","text":{"en":"milk","ar":"لبن"},"filled":true,"focus":true,"suggest":[{"icon":"basket","text":{"en":"Full-cream milk 1 L","ar":"لبن كامل الدسم 1 لتر"}},{"icon":"basket","text":{"en":"Milk chocolate bar","ar":"شوكولاتة باللبن"}},{"icon":"basket","text":{"en":"Coconut milk","ar":"لبن جوز الهند"}}]}],"keyboard":"text"}},{"id":"query","text":{"en":"Bold the typed word, wherever it appears","ar":"الكلمة المكتوبة بخط عريض، أينما ظهرت"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"sallah","name":{"en":"Sallah","ar":"سلّة"},"color":"#2E9E5B","icon":"basket","domain":"sallah.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Sallah","ar":"سلّة"},"logo":true,"actions":[{"icon":"shopping-cart","aria":{"en":"Cart","ar":"السلّة"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"searchbar","text":{"en":"milk","ar":"لبن"},"filled":true,"focus":true,"suggest":[{"icon":"basket","text":{"en":"Full-cream **milk** 1 L","ar":"**لبن** كامل الدسم 1 لتر"}},{"icon":"basket","text":{"en":"**Milk** chocolate bar","ar":"شوكولاتة بالـ**لبن**"}},{"icon":"basket","text":{"en":"Coconut **milk**","ar":"**لبن** جوز الهند"}}]}],"keyboard":"text"}}],"answer":["query"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P14-026","when":["rest","plain"],"feedback":{"en":"\"Milk\" sits in a different place in each name, so shoppers have to look for it line by line.","ar":"«لبن» في مكان مختلف في كل اسم، فيضطر المتسوّقون إلى البحث عنها سطرًا بسطر."}}],"correct":{"en":"Bold the typed word.","ar":"أبرز الكلمة المكتوبة."},"explain":{"en":"Shoppers spot \"milk\" in every line at once and compare the rest: full-cream, chocolate, coconut.","ar":"يلاحظ المتسوّقون «لبن» في كل سطر فورًا، ويقارنون الباقي: كامل الدسم، والشوكولاتة، وجوز الهند."},"speaker":"tarek"},{"id":"S03","type":"tune","part":"check","skill":"SK-P14-U03-05","value":{"en":"Check, filter categories (NN/g): relevance to users is the ultimate prioritization criterion. Shoppers filter by aisle and price; country of origin and packaging matter to few.","ar":"اختبار، فئات الفلاتر (NN/g): ما يهمّ الناس هو المعيار الأول في ترتيب الأولوية. والمتسوّقون يفلترون حسب القسم والسعر؛ وبلد المنشأ والتغليف يهمّان قلّة."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/filter-categories-values/","quote":"Relevance to users is the ultimate prioritization criterion."},"scenario":{"en":"The app's data shows most shoppers filter by **Aisle** and **Price**. Few ever use **Country of origin** or **Packaging**, which are at the top of the list right now.","ar":"تُظهر بيانات التطبيق أن أغلب المتسوّقين يفلترون حسب **القسم** و**السعر**. وقليلون يستخدمون **بلد المنشأ** أو **التغليف**، وهما في أعلى القائمة الآن."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each order. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل ترتيب. أيّها يجب أن يُطلق؟"},"start":"now","options":[{"id":"now","text":{"en":"Keep Country of origin and Packaging first","ar":"أبقِ بلد المنشأ والتغليف أولًا"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"sallah","name":{"en":"Sallah","ar":"سلّة"},"color":"#2E9E5B","icon":"basket","domain":"sallah.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Filters","ar":"الفلاتر"},"actions":[{"icon":"x","aria":{"en":"Close","ar":"إغلاق"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Sallah · results for \"rice\"","ar":"سلّة · نتائج «أرز»"}},{"kind":"accordion","text":{"en":"Country of origin","ar":"بلد المنشأ"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"accordion","text":{"en":"Packaging","ar":"التغليف"}},{"kind":"accordion","text":{"en":"Aisle","ar":"القسم"}},{"kind":"accordion","text":{"en":"Price","ar":"السعر"}}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Show 38 products","ar":"اعرض 38 منتجًا"}}]}},{"id":"used","text":{"en":"Aisle and Price first, the rest below","ar":"القسم والسعر أولًا، والباقي تحتهما"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"sallah","name":{"en":"Sallah","ar":"سلّة"},"color":"#2E9E5B","icon":"basket","domain":"sallah.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Filters","ar":"الفلاتر"},"actions":[{"icon":"x","aria":{"en":"Close","ar":"إغلاق"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Sallah · results for \"rice\"","ar":"سلّة · نتائج «أرز»"}},{"kind":"accordion","text":{"en":"Aisle","ar":"القسم"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"accordion","text":{"en":"Price","ar":"السعر"}},{"kind":"accordion","text":{"en":"Country of origin","ar":"بلد المنشأ"}},{"kind":"accordion","text":{"en":"Packaging","ar":"التغليف"}}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Show 38 products","ar":"اعرض 38 منتجًا"}}]}},{"id":"hide","text":{"en":"Aisle and Price only; remove the other two","ar":"القسم والسعر فقط؛ واحذف الآخرين"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"sallah","name":{"en":"Sallah","ar":"سلّة"},"color":"#2E9E5B","icon":"basket","domain":"sallah.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Filters","ar":"الفلاتر"},"actions":[{"icon":"x","aria":{"en":"Close","ar":"إغلاق"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Sallah · results for \"rice\"","ar":"سلّة · نتائج «أرز»"}},{"kind":"accordion","text":{"en":"Aisle","ar":"القسم"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"accordion","text":{"en":"Price","ar":"السعر"}}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Show 38 products","ar":"اعرض 38 منتجًا"}}]}}],"answer":["used"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P14-032","when":["now"],"feedback":{"en":"Most shoppers have to pass two filters they never use before reaching the ones they need.","ar":"على أغلب المتسوّقين أن يمرّوا على فلترين لا يستخدمونهما قبل الوصول إلى ما يحتاجونه."}},{"id":"MC-P14-030","when":["hide"],"feedback":{"en":"Some shoppers do filter by origin or packaging, for example for allergies or recycling. Lower in the list, the filters cost the others nothing; removed, they're gone for everyone.","ar":"بعض المتسوّقين يفلترون فعلًا حسب المنشأ أو التغليف، مثلًا بسبب الحساسية أو إعادة التدوير. وفي أسفل القائمة لا يكلّف الفلتران الآخرين شيئًا؛ أما حذفهما فيلغيهما للجميع."}}],"correct":{"en":"Most used first, the rest still there.","ar":"الأكثر استخدامًا أولًا، والباقي موجود."},"explain":{"en":"Most shoppers start with the two filters they use, and the few who care about origin or packaging still find them.","ar":"يبدأ أغلب المتسوّقين بالفلترين اللذين يستخدمونهما، والقلّة التي تهتمّ بالمنشأ أو التغليف تجدهما مع ذلك."},"speaker":"tarek"},{"id":"S04","type":"tune","part":"check","skill":"SK-P14-U03-03","value":{"en":"Check, no-results pages (NN/g): they must clearly state that nothing matched, and offer starting points like spelling corrections. A page of offers with no message hides both.","ar":"اختبار، صفحات «لا توجد نتائج» (NN/g): يجب أن تقول بوضوح إنه لا يوجد تطابق، وأن تعرض نقاط بداية مثل تصحيح الإملاء. وصفحة العروض بدون رسالة تُخفي الاثنين."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/search-no-results-serp/","quote":"Spelling corrections"},"scenario":{"en":"A shopper searched for **basmati rise**. Nothing matched. The app sells basmati rice.","ar":"بحث متسوّق عن **أرز بسمتى** فلم يجد شيئًا. والتطبيق يبيع أرز بسمتي."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each version of the page. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل نسخة من الصفحة. أيّها يجب أن تُطلق؟"},"start":"offers","options":[{"id":"offers","text":{"en":"Show today's offers, with no message","ar":"اعرض عروض اليوم، بدون رسالة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"sallah","name":{"en":"Sallah","ar":"سلّة"},"color":"#2E9E5B","icon":"basket","domain":"sallah.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Search","ar":"البحث"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"searchbar","text":{"en":"basmati rise","ar":"أرز بسمتى"},"filled":true},{"kind":"text","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Today's offers","ar":"عروض اليوم"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"drop","text":{"en":"Sunflower oil 1 L","ar":"زيت عباد الشمس 1 لتر"},"value":{"en":"EGP 85","ar":"85 جنيه"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"bowl-food","text":{"en":"Pasta 400 g","ar":"مكرونة 400 جم"},"value":{"en":"EGP 22","ar":"22 جنيه"}}]}},{"id":"fix","text":{"en":"\"No results for basmati rise\", and \"Did you mean basmati rice?\"","ar":"«لا توجد نتائج لأرز بسمتى»، و«هل تقصد أرز بسمتي؟»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"sallah","name":{"en":"Sallah","ar":"سلّة"},"color":"#2E9E5B","icon":"basket","domain":"sallah.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Search","ar":"البحث"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"searchbar","text":{"en":"basmati rise","ar":"أرز بسمتى"},"filled":true},{"kind":"icon","icon":"magnifying-glass","size":"l","color":"brand","gap":"m"},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"No results for \"basmati rise\"","ar":"لا توجد نتائج لـ«أرز بسمتى»"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"Did you mean **basmati rice**? (8 products)","ar":"هل تقصد **أرز بسمتي**؟ (8 منتجات)"},"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"oops","text":{"en":"\"Oops! Nothing here but crumbs 🍞\"","ar":"«عفوًا! مافيش هنا غير الفتافيت 🍞»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"sallah","name":{"en":"Sallah","ar":"سلّة"},"color":"#2E9E5B","icon":"basket","domain":"sallah.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Search","ar":"البحث"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"searchbar","text":{"en":"basmati rise","ar":"أرز بسمتى"},"filled":true},{"kind":"image","art":"bread","size":"s","alt":{"en":"Bread crumbs","ar":"فتافيت عيش"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Oops! Nothing here but crumbs 🍞","ar":"عفوًا! مافيش هنا غير الفتافيت 🍞"},"gap":"s"}]}}],"answer":["fix"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P14-027","when":["offers"],"feedback":{"en":"The shopper isn't told the search failed, and may think the store has no basmati rice.","ar":"لا يُخبَر المتسوّق بأن البحث لم ينجح، وقد يظنّ أن المتجر ليس فيه أرز بسمتي."}},{"id":"MC-P14-029","when":["oops"],"feedback":{"en":"The joke leaves the shopper with nothing to do next, and the rice is one letter away.","ar":"النكتة تترك المتسوّق بلا شيء يفعله بعدها، مع أن الأرز لا يفصله عنه إلا حرف واحد."}}],"correct":{"en":"Clear message, and the spelling fix.","ar":"رسالة واضحة، وتصحيح الإملاء."},"explain":{"en":"One tap on the corrected spelling shows 8 kinds of basmati rice.","ar":"ضغطة واحدة على الإملاء الصحيح تعرض 8 أنواع من أرز البسمتي."},"speaker":"tarek"},{"id":"S05","type":"tune","part":"check","skill":"SK-P14-U03-04","value":{"en":"Check, filter values (NN/g): unintelligible jargon has no place in filters. GF, LF, V and VG are shorthand from the product database, not words shoppers use.","ar":"اختبار، قيم الفلاتر (NN/g): المصطلحات غير المفهومة لا مكان لها في الفلاتر. وGF وLF وV وVG اختصارات من قاعدة بيانات المنتجات، لا كلمات يستخدمها المتسوّقون."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/filter-categories-values/","quote":"Unintelligible jargon has no place in filters."},"scenario":{"en":"The **Diet** filter shows **GF**, **LF**, **V** and **VG**, copied from the product database.","ar":"يعرض فلتر **النظام الغذائي** القيم **GF** و**LF** و**V** و**VG**، منسوخة من قاعدة بيانات المنتجات."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each version. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل نسخة. أيّها يجب أن تُطلق؟"},"start":"codes","options":[{"id":"codes","text":{"en":"Keep the short codes","ar":"أبقِ الاختصارات"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"sallah","name":{"en":"Sallah","ar":"سلّة"},"color":"#2E9E5B","icon":"basket","domain":"sallah.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Filters","ar":"الفلاتر"},"actions":[{"icon":"x","aria":{"en":"Close","ar":"إغلاق"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Sallah · Bakery","ar":"سلّة · المخبوزات"}},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Diet","ar":"النظام الغذائي"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"row","blocks":[{"kind":"chip","text":"GF"},{"kind":"chip","text":"LF"},{"kind":"chip","text":"V"},{"kind":"chip","text":"VG"}]}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Show 38 products","ar":"اعرض 38 منتجًا"}}]}},{"id":"words","text":{"en":"Gluten-free, Lactose-free, Vegetarian, Vegan","ar":"خالٍ من الجلوتين، خالٍ من اللاكتوز، نباتي، نباتي صرف"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"sallah","name":{"en":"Sallah","ar":"سلّة"},"color":"#2E9E5B","icon":"basket","domain":"sallah.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Filters","ar":"الفلاتر"},"actions":[{"icon":"x","aria":{"en":"Close","ar":"إغلاق"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Sallah · Bakery","ar":"سلّة · المخبوزات"}},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Diet","ar":"النظام الغذائي"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"check","text":{"en":"Gluten-free","ar":"خالٍ من الجلوتين"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"check","text":{"en":"Lactose-free","ar":"خالٍ من اللاكتوز"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"check","text":{"en":"Vegetarian","ar":"نباتي"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"check","text":{"en":"Vegan (no animal products)","ar":"نباتي صرف (بدون أي منتج حيواني)"},"gap":"s"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Show 38 products","ar":"اعرض 38 منتجًا"}}]}},{"id":"icons","text":{"en":"Replace the codes with small icons","ar":"استبدل الاختصارات بأيقونات صغيرة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"sallah","name":{"en":"Sallah","ar":"سلّة"},"color":"#2E9E5B","icon":"basket","domain":"sallah.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Filters","ar":"الفلاتر"},"actions":[{"icon":"x","aria":{"en":"Close","ar":"إغلاق"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Sallah · Bakery","ar":"سلّة · المخبوزات"}},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Diet","ar":"النظام الغذائي"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"row","blocks":[{"kind":"chip","text":"🌾⃠"},{"kind":"chip","text":"🥛⃠"},{"kind":"chip","text":"🥕"},{"kind":"chip","text":"🌱"}]}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Show 38 products","ar":"اعرض 38 منتجًا"}}]}}],"answer":["words"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P14-031","when":["codes","icons"],"feedback":{"en":"Shoppers have to guess what each code or icon means, and for someone with an allergy, a wrong guess matters.","ar":"على المتسوّقين أن يخمّنوا معنى كل اختصار أو أيقونة، ولمن لديه حساسية، قد يكون التخمين الخطأ خطيرًا."}}],"correct":{"en":"Plain words.","ar":"كلمات بسيطة."},"explain":{"en":"Each value says exactly what it filters, so shoppers with an allergy or a diet pick it without guessing.","ar":"كل قيمة تقول بالضبط ما تفلتره، فيختارها من لديه حساسية أو نظام غذائي دون تخمين."},"speaker":"tarek"},{"id":"S06","type":"tune","part":"check","skill":"SK-P14-U03-01","value":{"en":"Check, search suggestions (NN/g): make sure every suggested query actually has good, relevant results. The app has never sold cherry tomatoes, so that suggestion only leads to an empty page.","ar":"اختبار، اقتراحات البحث (NN/g): تأكّد أن كل بحث مقترح له فعلًا نتائج جيدة ومرتبطة. والتطبيق لم يبع طماطم شيري أبدًا، فهذا الاقتراح لا يوصل إلا إلى صفحة فارغة."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/site-search-suggestions/","quote":"Make sure every suggested query actually has good, relevant results."},"scenario":{"en":"My team copied a list of popular grocery searches from another country. It includes **cherry tomatoes**, which our app doesn't sell. Someone types \"tomato\".","ar":"نسخ فريقي قائمة بأشهر عمليات البحث عن البقالة من بلد آخر. وفيها **طماطم شيري**، وتطبيقنا لا يبيعها. وكتب شخص «طماطم»."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each list. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل قائمة. أيّها يجب أن تُطلق؟"},"start":"copied","options":[{"id":"copied","text":{"en":"The copied list, as it is","ar":"القائمة المنسوخة، كما هي"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"sallah","name":{"en":"Sallah","ar":"سلّة"},"color":"#2E9E5B","icon":"basket","domain":"sallah.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Sallah","ar":"سلّة"},"logo":true,"actions":[{"icon":"shopping-cart","aria":{"en":"Cart","ar":"السلّة"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"searchbar","text":{"en":"tomato","ar":"طماطم"},"filled":true,"focus":true,"suggest":[{"icon":"basket","text":{"en":"tomatoes **cherry**","ar":"طماطم **شيري**"}},{"icon":"basket","text":{"en":"tomatoes **peeled, canned**","ar":"طماطم **مقشّرة معلّبة**"}},{"icon":"basket","text":{"en":"tomatoes **1 kg**","ar":"طماطم **بلدي 1 كيلو**"}}]}],"keyboard":"text"}},{"id":"stock","text":{"en":"Only searches that find products in the app","ar":"عمليات البحث التي تجد منتجات في التطبيق فقط"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"sallah","name":{"en":"Sallah","ar":"سلّة"},"color":"#2E9E5B","icon":"basket","domain":"sallah.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Sallah","ar":"سلّة"},"logo":true,"actions":[{"icon":"shopping-cart","aria":{"en":"Cart","ar":"السلّة"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"searchbar","text":{"en":"tomato","ar":"طماطم"},"filled":true,"focus":true,"suggest":[{"icon":"basket","text":{"en":"tomatoes **peeled, canned**","ar":"طماطم **مقشّرة معلّبة**"}},{"icon":"basket","text":{"en":"tomatoes **1 kg**","ar":"طماطم **بلدي 1 كيلو**"}},{"icon":"basket","text":{"en":"tomatoes **sun-dried**","ar":"طماطم **مجفّفة**"}}]}],"keyboard":"text"}},{"id":"none","text":{"en":"No suggestions until the list is fixed","ar":"بدون اقتراحات حتى تُصلَح القائمة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"sallah","name":{"en":"Sallah","ar":"سلّة"},"color":"#2E9E5B","icon":"basket","domain":"sallah.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Sallah","ar":"سلّة"},"logo":true,"actions":[{"icon":"shopping-cart","aria":{"en":"Cart","ar":"السلّة"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"searchbar","text":{"en":"tomato","ar":"طماطم"},"filled":true,"focus":true}],"keyboard":"text"}}],"answer":["stock"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P14-025","when":["copied"],"feedback":{"en":"\"Cherry\" is the first suggestion and finds nothing in this app.","ar":"«شيري» هو أول اقتراح، ولا يجد شيئًا في هذا التطبيق."}},{"id":"MC-P14-025","when":["none"],"feedback":{"en":"The fix is simple: keep the suggestions that find products. Removing them all makes every shopper type more.","ar":"الحل بسيط: أبقِ الاقتراحات التي تجد منتجات. وحذفها كلها يجعل كل متسوّق يكتب أكثر."}}],"correct":{"en":"Only suggestions that find products.","ar":"الاقتراحات التي تجد منتجات فقط."},"explain":{"en":"Every line opens real products, so shoppers type less and never land on an empty page.","ar":"كل سطر يفتح منتجات حقيقية، فيكتب المتسوّقون أقل ولا يصلون أبدًا إلى صفحة فارغة."},"speaker":"tarek"}]}$uxg$::jsonb),
  ($uxg$P14-U04-L01$uxg$, $uxg$90712662a733b0e06ac512780665ec015b28859826e92c4a742010bd3e8cd4b6$uxg$, $uxg${"id":"P14-U04-L01","mode":"lesson","minutes":8,"title":{"en":"Controls people recognise","ar":"عناصر تحكّم (Controls) يعرفها الناس"},"speaker":"sara","review_labels":{"MC-P14-033":{"en":"Keep the standard shape: square for many, circle for one","ar":"حافظ على الشكل المعتاد: مربع للمتعدد، ودائرة للواحد"},"MC-P14-034":{"en":"One choice per line, so each marker has one label","ar":"اختيار واحد في كل سطر، حتى يكون لكل علامة اسم واحد"},"MC-P14-035":{"en":"Say what choosing it does, in positive words","ar":"قل ما يحدث عند الاختيار، بكلمات إيجابية"}},"steps":[{"id":"S01","type":"card","part":"hook","title":{"en":"Sara's sandwich app","ar":"تطبيق سارة للساندوتشات"},"body":{"en":"I'm designing the ordering app for a sandwich shop. After picking a sandwich, people can add extras: cheese, tomato and pickles, as many as they like.\n\nThe brand team drew all the markers in the app as small circles, to match the round dots in the logo.","ar":"أصمّم تطبيق الطلبات لمحل ساندوتشات. وبعد اختيار الساندوتش، يستطيع الناس أن يضيفوا ما يريدون: جبنة وطماطم ومخلل، بالعدد الذي يريدونه.\n\nورسم فريق الهوية كل العلامات في التطبيق على شكل دوائر صغيرة، لتشبه النقاط الدائرية في الشعار."},"mock":{"app":{"id":"lokma","name":{"en":"Lokma","ar":"لقمة"},"color":"#F08C00","icon":"hamburger","domain":"lokma.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Chicken sandwich","ar":"ساندوتش فراخ"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"food-burger","size":"m","alt":{"en":"Chicken sandwich","ar":"ساندوتش فراخ"}},{"kind":"listitem","text":{"en":"Chicken sandwich","ar":"ساندوتش فراخ"},"sub":{"en":"Sandwich Corner","ar":"ركن الساندوتش"},"value":{"en":"EGP 75","ar":"75 جنيه"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Add extras","ar":"أضف إضافات"}},{"kind":"check","marker":"round","text":{"en":"Cheese  +10","ar":"جبنة  +10"},"selected":true,"gap":"s"},{"kind":"check","marker":"round","text":{"en":"Tomato  +5","ar":"طماطم  +5"}},{"kind":"check","marker":"round","text":{"en":"Pickles  +5","ar":"مخلل  +5"}}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Add to order","ar":"أضف إلى الطلب"}}]}},{"id":"S02","type":"tune","part":"try","skill":"SK-P14-U04-01","rules":["R12"],"confidence":true,"value":{"en":"Try first. Checkboxes (NN/g): users expect checkboxes to look like checkboxes, squares, and you should never use circles as checkboxes. A circle tells people they can pick only one.","ar":"جرّب أولًا. الـ Checkboxes (NN/g): يتوقّع الناس أن يبدو الـ Checkbox مثل الـ Checkbox، أي مربعًا، ولا يجب أبدًا استخدام الدوائر كـ Checkboxes. فالدائرة تقول للناس إنهم يستطيعون اختيار واحد فقط."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/checkboxes-design-guidelines/","quote":"Never use circles as checkboxes."},"prompt":{"en":"People can add any number of extras. Try each list, and tap the extras. Which one should ship?","ar":"يمكن للناس إضافة أي عدد من الإضافات. جرّب كل قائمة، واضغط على الإضافات. أيّ قائمة توضّح للناس أنهم يستطيعون اختيار أكثر من إضافة؟"},"start":"round","options":[{"id":"round","text":{"en":"Round markers that allow many, as the brand team drew them","ar":"علامات دائرية تسمح بأكثر من اختيار، كما رسمها فريق الهوية"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"lokma","name":{"en":"Lokma","ar":"لقمة"},"color":"#F08C00","icon":"hamburger","domain":"lokma.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Chicken sandwich","ar":"ساندوتش فراخ"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"food-burger","size":"m","alt":{"en":"Chicken sandwich","ar":"ساندوتش فراخ"}},{"kind":"listitem","text":{"en":"Chicken sandwich","ar":"ساندوتش فراخ"},"sub":{"en":"Sandwich Corner","ar":"ركن الساندوتش"},"value":{"en":"EGP 75","ar":"75 جنيه"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Add extras","ar":"أضف إضافات"}},{"kind":"check","marker":"round","text":{"en":"Cheese  +10","ar":"جبنة  +10"},"selected":true,"gap":"s"},{"kind":"check","marker":"round","text":{"en":"Tomato  +5","ar":"طماطم  +5"}},{"kind":"check","marker":"round","text":{"en":"Pickles  +5","ar":"مخلل  +5"}}]}},{"id":"radio","text":{"en":"Radio buttons","ar":"Radio buttons"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"lokma","name":{"en":"Lokma","ar":"لقمة"},"color":"#F08C00","icon":"hamburger","domain":"lokma.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Chicken sandwich","ar":"ساندوتش فراخ"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"food-burger","size":"m","alt":{"en":"Chicken sandwich","ar":"ساندوتش فراخ"}},{"kind":"listitem","text":{"en":"Chicken sandwich","ar":"ساندوتش فراخ"},"sub":{"en":"Sandwich Corner","ar":"ركن الساندوتش"},"value":{"en":"EGP 75","ar":"75 جنيه"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Add extras","ar":"أضف إضافات"}},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Cheese  +10","ar":"جبنة  +10"},"selected":true,"gap":"s"},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Tomato  +5","ar":"طماطم  +5"}},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Pickles  +5","ar":"مخلل  +5"}}]}},{"id":"square","text":{"en":"Square checkboxes","ar":"Checkboxes مربعة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"lokma","name":{"en":"Lokma","ar":"لقمة"},"color":"#F08C00","icon":"hamburger","domain":"lokma.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Chicken sandwich","ar":"ساندوتش فراخ"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"food-burger","size":"m","alt":{"en":"Chicken sandwich","ar":"ساندوتش فراخ"}},{"kind":"listitem","text":{"en":"Chicken sandwich","ar":"ساندوتش فراخ"},"sub":{"en":"Sandwich Corner","ar":"ركن الساندوتش"},"value":{"en":"EGP 75","ar":"75 جنيه"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Add extras","ar":"أضف إضافات"}},{"kind":"check","text":{"en":"Cheese  +10","ar":"جبنة  +10"},"selected":true,"gap":"s"},{"kind":"check","text":{"en":"Tomato  +5","ar":"طماطم  +5"}},{"kind":"check","text":{"en":"Pickles  +5","ar":"مخلل  +5"}}]}}],"answer":["square"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P14-033","when":["round"],"feedback":{"en":"Round markers read as radio buttons: pick one. Many people will add cheese and stop, never trying a second extra.","ar":"العلامات الدائرية تُقرأ كأنها Radio buttons: اختر واحدًا. فكثيرون سيضيفون الجبنة ويتوقّفون، ولن يجرّبوا إضافة ثانية."}},{"id":"MC-P14-033","when":["radio"],"feedback":{"en":"Radio buttons allow only one: tapping tomato clears the cheese. Extras can be any number, so this list loses orders.","ar":"الـ Radio buttons تسمح باختيار واحد فقط: الضغط على الطماطم يلغي الجبنة. والإضافات يمكن أن تكون بأي عدد، فهذه القائمة تُضيّع طلبات."}}],"hints":[{"en":"What does a round marker usually let people do?","ar":"ماذا تسمح العلامة الدائرية للناس بأن يفعلوا عادةً؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Any number: square checkboxes.","ar":"أي عدد: Checkboxes مربعة."},"explain":{"en":"Squares say \"tick any\" before anyone reads a word, so people add cheese and pickles without a second thought. The brand can live in colour and type, not in the control's shape.","ar":"المربعات تقول «اختر ما تريد» قبل أن يقرأ أحد أي كلمة، فيضيف الناس الجبنة والمخلل دون تفكير. ويمكن أن تظهر الهوية في الألوان والخطوط، لا في شكل العنصر."}},{"id":"S09","type":"video","part":"concept","title":{"en":"Controls people already know","ar":"عناصر تحكّم يعرفها الناس مسبقًا"},"video":"398242cc-ff80-4014-8f00-b9af556a7546","duration":260,"transcript":[{"t":2.5,"en":"The first input controls we'll talk about today are the checkbox and the radio button. We probably all know them and use them a lot, but there are some guidelines to go through.","ar":"أول Input controls هنتكلم عنها النهارده هما الـ Checkbox والـ Radio button. الشكلين دول احنا غالبًا عارفينهم وبنستخدمهم كتير، لكن هنقول بعض الـ Guidelines فيهم."},{"t":11.9,"en":"First point: when do I use a radio button and when a checkbox? Radio buttons are for options that are mutually exclusive: I can't pick more than one at the same time, and","ar":"أول نقطة: إمتى أستخدم Radio button وإمتى أستخدم Checkbox؟ الـ Radio buttons بنستخدمها لما تكون الاختيارات متنافية، يعني Mutually exclusive: ماينفعش أختار أكتر من اختيار في نفس الوقت، ولما"},{"t":24.1,"en":"picking one means I can't pick another. In this example, if I choose a type of burger I can't choose more than one type, I need exactly one, so I use a radio button.","ar":"أختار واحد ماينفعش أختار معاه واحد تاني. زي المثال اللي قدامنا: لو عايز أختار نوع البرجر، مش هقدر أختار أكتر من نوع، محتاج نوع واحد، فهنا أستخدم Radio button."},{"t":36.3,"en":"Unlike a checkbox, which I use when the user can pick more than one option, or none at all. In the example, if I want to add","ar":"على عكس الـ Checkbox، اللي أستخدمه لو ممكن أخلّي اليوزر يختار أكتر من اختيار، أو ماينختارش أي اختيار أصلًا. زي المثال: لو عايز"},{"t":47.95,"en":"things to the burger I can add cheese and tomato, I can add all three together, or add nothing. Here a checkbox fits best. That's the first guideline.","ar":"أضيف حاجات على البرجر، ممكن أضيف جبنة وطماطم، وممكن أضيف الثلاثة مع بعض، وممكن ماأضيفش أي حاجة. فهنا الأنسب Checkbox. دي أول Guideline."},{"t":59.6,"en":"Also important, especially on desktop: when I have a single checkbox like this, I can use it to turn something on or off. Like the","ar":"برضه من الحاجات المهمة، وبالذات في الـ Desktop: لما يكون عندي Checkbox واحد بالشكل ده، ممكن أستخدمه عشان أشغّل حاجة أو أوقفها، On أو Off. زي المثال"},{"t":68.7,"en":"example we had earlier in Figma, fixing an element's position while scrolling. I turn this checkbox on to enable that feature, and it's common on desktop.","ar":"اللي كان عندنا قبل كده في Figma: فكرة تثبيت العنصر وقت الـ Scrolling. فأنا بشغّل الـ Checkbox ده عشان أشغّل الخاصية دي، وده شيء متكرر في الـ Desktop."},{"t":77.8,"en":"The second guideline we can find in this example. At first glance these are checkboxes stacked under each other. But if we tap","ar":"ثاني Guideline ممكن نكتشفها من المثال ده. لأول وهلة نقول دي Checkboxes تحت بعض. لكن لو دوسنا"},{"t":87.37,"en":"one, it starts to look like a button. So is it a checkbox or a button? We might get confused. If we tap another,","ar":"على واحد منها، شكله بقى شبه Button. فهل هو Checkbox ولا Button؟ ممكن نتحير. ولو دوسنا على"},{"t":96.93,"en":"we find it's selected along with the first, so more than one choice: it's a checkbox, but its look is a mix of both.","ar":"واحد تاني هنلاقيه بيتحدد مع الأول، يعني أكتر من اختيار، فهو Checkbox، لكن شكله مختلط بين الاتنين."},{"t":106.5,"en":"From here we get the guideline that says to use a standard visual representation. This is an important idea that keeps coming","ar":"ومن هنا نطلع بالـ Guideline اللي بتقول إننا نستخدم Standard visual representation. وده من الحاجات المهمة اللي بترجع تاني"},{"t":116.7,"en":"back with design patterns: we use them because users already know them and use them easily without learning anything new. If I","ar":"في الـ Design patterns: بنستخدمها عشان الـ Users عارفينها ويستخدموها بسهولة من غير ما يتعلموا حاجة جديدة. فلو غيّرت"},{"t":126.9,"en":"change the component's look, the user may not recognize it as one they know, and I've lost the benefit of the design pattern.","ar":"شكل الـ Component، ممكن اليوزر ماعرفش إنه واحد من الـ Components اللي يعرفها، وبكده ماستفدتش من فايدة الـ Design pattern."},{"t":137.1,"en":"So we use the standard look: a checkbox is a square with a tick inside it, or even an X,","ar":"فنستخدم الـ Standard visual representation: الـ Checkbox يكون مربع وجواه علامة صح، أو حتى"},{"t":146.85,"en":"but a circle is always a radio. And a radio button is a circle with a filled circle inside it.","ar":"X، لكن الدايرة دايمًا Radio. والـ Radio button يكون دايرة جواها دايرة تانية مليانة."},{"t":152.85,"en":"The next guideline we learn from this example. If we see radio buttons like this we may get confused: I","ar":"الـ Guideline اللي بعدها نعرفها من المثال ده. لو شوفنا الـ Radio buttons بالشكل ده،"},{"t":163.28,"en":"want to choose 4, do I tap the radio after the number or before it? I'd have to go back","ar":"ممكن نتشتت: عايز أختار 4 مثلًا، أدوس على الـ Radio اللي بعد الرقم ولا اللي قبله؟"},{"t":173.75,"en":"to the start and discover that each radio belongs to the word after it. The problem is that we put","ar":"هضطر أرجع من الأول وأكتشف إن كل Radio تبع الكلمة اللي بعده. المشكلة إننا حطّينا"},{"t":184.21,"en":"the options side by side with no space, so it isn't clear which radio belongs to which option. The guideline","ar":"الاختيارات جنب بعض من غير مسافة، فمش واضح أي Radio تبع أي اختيار. فالـ Guideline بتقول:"},{"t":194.68,"en":"says: it's always better to stack radio buttons or checkboxes under each other if there's space. If we must place","ar":"الأفضل دايمًا نرتب الـ Radio buttons أو الـ Checkboxes تحت بعض لو في مساحة. ولو"},{"t":205.15,"en":"them side by side, leave enough space so we can tell each radio belongs to the option next to it.","ar":"مضطرين نرتبهم جنب بعض، نسيب مسافات كافية تخلّينا نعرف إن كل Radio تبع الاختيار اللي جنبه."},{"t":212.02,"en":"The last guideline: in this example the options are all worded as negatives, I don't want cheese, I don't","ar":"الـ Guideline الأخيرة: لو شفنا المثال، الاختيارات كلها مكتوبة بالنفي: مش عايز جبنة، مش عايز"},{"t":222.27,"en":"want tomato. So we use positive and active wording, so the user can tell the choice apart easily. If I","ar":"طماطم. فنطلع بإننا نستخدم Positive and active wording، يعني الكلمات تكون Positive عشان اليوزر يميّز الاختيار"},{"t":232.72,"en":"tell them I won't add cheese and they tick it, they get confused: am I ticking to add cheese","ar":"بسهولة. لأنه لو قلت له مش هحط جبنة وبدأ يعلّم عليها، هيحتار: أنا بعلّم عشان أضيف"},{"t":243.17,"en":"or to not add it? So we always use the affirmative, not the negative, so the choice is always easier.","ar":"جبنة ولا عشان ما أضيفش؟ فنستخدم دايمًا صيغة الإثبات مش النفي، عشان الاختيار يبقى دايمًا أسهل."}]},{"id":"S03","type":"card","part":"concept","icons":["list","eye","text","ok"],"title":{"en":"Video summary","ar":"ملخص الفيديو"},"body":{"en":"Checkboxes and radio buttons are so familiar that people use them without thinking. A design pattern only helps while it looks like itself.\n\n- **Radio buttons** pick exactly one from a set. **Checkboxes** pick any number, or none.\n- **Standard look:** a checkbox is a small square that shows a tick; a radio button is a small circle with a dot inside. Don't swap or restyle the shapes.\n- **One choice per line:** stack the options. If they must sit side by side, leave clear space so each marker belongs to one label.\n- **Positive, active words:** say what ticking does, like \"Send me offers\", not \"Don't send me offers\".","ar":"الـ Checkboxes والـ Radio buttons مألوفة جدًا، فيستخدمها الناس دون تفكير. والـ Design pattern (النمط المعروف في التصميم) لا يفيد إلا ما دام شكله هو الشكل المعتاد.\n\n- **الـ Radio buttons** لاختيار واحد فقط من مجموعة. **والـ Checkboxes** لاختيار أي عدد، أو لا شيء.\n- **الشكل المعتاد:** الـ Checkbox مربع صغير تظهر فيه علامة صح؛ والـ Radio button دائرة صغيرة بداخلها نقطة. لا تبدّل الشكلين ولا تغيّرهما.\n- **اختيار واحد في كل سطر:** ضع الاختيارات تحت بعضها. وإن اضطررت إلى وضعها جنبًا إلى جنب، فاترك مسافة واضحة حتى تنتمي كل علامة إلى اسم واحد.\n- **كلمات إيجابية وواضحة:** قل ما يحدث عند الاختيار، مثل «أرسل لي العروض»، لا «لا ترسل لي العروض»."}},{"id":"S04","type":"tune","part":"guided","skill":"SK-P14-U04-02","rules":["R06","R15"],"value":{"en":"Checkboxes (NN/g): ensure that all your label statements are worded positively. Negatively worded statements force users to contemplate double negatives, leading to errors.","ar":"الـ Checkboxes (NN/g): تأكّد أن كل أسماء الاختيارات مكتوبة بصيغة إيجابية. فالصيغ المنفية تجبر الناس على التفكير في نفي النفي، وهذا يؤدي إلى أخطاء."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/checkboxes-design-guidelines/","quote":"Negatively worded statements force users to contemplate double negatives, leading to errors."},"scenario":{"en":"At checkout, I add one checkbox about plastic cutlery. The shop wants to send cutlery only to people who ask for it.","ar":"في صفحة إتمام الطلب، أضيف Checkbox واحدًا عن أدوات المائدة البلاستيكية. والمحل يريد إرسال الأدوات لمن يطلبها فقط."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each label. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل اسم. أيّها يجب أن يُطلق؟"},"start":"dont","options":[{"id":"dont","text":{"en":"\"Don't add plastic cutlery\"","ar":"«لا تضف أدوات مائدة بلاستيكية»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"lokma","name":{"en":"Lokma","ar":"لقمة"},"color":"#F08C00","icon":"hamburger","domain":"lokma.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Your order","ar":"طلبك"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","art":"food-burger","text":{"en":"Sandwich Corner","ar":"ركن الساندوتش"},"sub":{"en":"Delivery in 25 min","ar":"التوصيل خلال 25 دقيقة"}},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"Chicken sandwich × 2","ar":"ساندوتش فراخ × 2"}},{"kind":"check","text":{"en":"Don't add plastic cutlery","ar":"لا تضف أدوات مائدة بلاستيكية"},"gap":"m"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Place order","ar":"أرسل الطلب"}}]}},{"id":"skip","text":{"en":"\"Don't skip plastic cutlery\"","ar":"«لا تتجاهل أدوات المائدة البلاستيكية»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"lokma","name":{"en":"Lokma","ar":"لقمة"},"color":"#F08C00","icon":"hamburger","domain":"lokma.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Your order","ar":"طلبك"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","art":"food-burger","text":{"en":"Sandwich Corner","ar":"ركن الساندوتش"},"sub":{"en":"Delivery in 25 min","ar":"التوصيل خلال 25 دقيقة"}},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"Chicken sandwich × 2","ar":"ساندوتش فراخ × 2"}},{"kind":"check","text":{"en":"Don't skip plastic cutlery","ar":"لا تتجاهل أدوات المائدة البلاستيكية"},"gap":"m"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Place order","ar":"أرسل الطلب"}}]}},{"id":"add","text":{"en":"\"Add plastic cutlery\"","ar":"«أضف أدوات مائدة بلاستيكية»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"lokma","name":{"en":"Lokma","ar":"لقمة"},"color":"#F08C00","icon":"hamburger","domain":"lokma.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Your order","ar":"طلبك"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","art":"food-burger","text":{"en":"Sandwich Corner","ar":"ركن الساندوتش"},"sub":{"en":"Delivery in 25 min","ar":"التوصيل خلال 25 دقيقة"}},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"Chicken sandwich × 2","ar":"ساندوتش فراخ × 2"}},{"kind":"check","text":{"en":"Add plastic cutlery","ar":"أضف أدوات مائدة بلاستيكية"},"gap":"m"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Place order","ar":"أرسل الطلب"}}]}}],"answer":["add"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P14-035","when":["dont","skip"],"feedback":{"en":"A tick here means \"don't\", so people have to work through a negative: does ticking bring cutlery, or stop it? Some will guess wrong.","ar":"علامة الصح هنا تعني «لا»، فيضطر الناس إلى فهم صيغة منفية: هل علامة الصح تأتي بالأدوات أم تمنعها؟ وسيخمّن بعضهم خطأً."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Read the label aloud with \"yes\" in front of it. Is the meaning clear?","ar":"اقرأ الاسم بصوت عالٍ وقبله كلمة «نعم». هل المعنى واضح؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Positive: \"Add plastic cutlery\".","ar":"صيغة إيجابية: «أضف أدوات مائدة بلاستيكية»."},"explain":{"en":"A tick now means yes to cutlery, and an empty box means none. Nobody has to untangle a double negative while they're hungry.","ar":"علامة الصح الآن تعني نعم للأدوات، والمربع الفارغ يعني بدونها. ولا يحتاج أحد إلى فهم نفي مزدوج وهو جائع."},"speaker":"sara"},{"id":"S05","type":"tune","part":"guided","skill":"SK-P14-U04-02","rules":["R06","R15"],"value":{"en":"Checkboxes vs. radio buttons (NN/g): use positive and active wording for checkbox labels. A label that names only a topic doesn't say whether ticking turns it on or off.","ar":"الـ Checkboxes مقابل الـ Radio buttons (NN/g): استخدم صيغة إيجابية تصف فعلًا في أسماء الـ Checkboxes. فالاسم الذي يذكر الموضوع فقط لا يقول هل الاختيار يشغّله أم يوقفه."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/checkboxes-vs-radio-buttons/","quote":"Use positive and active wording for checkbox labels"},"scenario":{"en":"Under the delivery address there's one checkbox. When it's ticked, the shop sends a text message when the driver is close.","ar":"تحت عنوان التوصيل يوجد Checkbox واحد. وحين يكون مختارًا، يرسل المحل رسالة نصية حين يقترب المندوب."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each label. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل اسم. أيّها يجب أن يُطلق؟"},"start":"sms","options":[{"id":"sms","text":{"en":"\"SMS\"","ar":"«SMS»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"lokma","name":{"en":"Lokma","ar":"لقمة"},"color":"#F08C00","icon":"hamburger","domain":"lokma.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Checkout","ar":"إتمام الطلب"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"map","size":"s","alt":{"en":"Delivery map","ar":"خريطة التوصيل"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Address","ar":"العنوان"},"text":{"en":"12 Nile St, Floor 3","ar":"12 شارع النيل، الدور 3"},"filled":true},{"kind":"check","text":{"en":"SMS","ar":"SMS"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"money","text":{"en":"Cash on delivery","ar":"الدفع عند الاستلام"},"value":{"en":"EGP 160","ar":"160 جنيه"},"gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"text","text":{"en":"\"Text me when the driver is close\"","ar":"«أرسل لي رسالة حين يقترب المندوب»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"lokma","name":{"en":"Lokma","ar":"لقمة"},"color":"#F08C00","icon":"hamburger","domain":"lokma.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Checkout","ar":"إتمام الطلب"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"map","size":"s","alt":{"en":"Delivery map","ar":"خريطة التوصيل"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Address","ar":"العنوان"},"text":{"en":"12 Nile St, Floor 3","ar":"12 شارع النيل، الدور 3"},"filled":true},{"kind":"check","text":{"en":"Text me when the driver is close","ar":"أرسل لي رسالة حين يقترب المندوب"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"money","text":{"en":"Cash on delivery","ar":"الدفع عند الاستلام"},"value":{"en":"EGP 160","ar":"160 جنيه"},"gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"pref","text":{"en":"\"SMS notification preference\"","ar":"«تفضيل إشعارات SMS»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"lokma","name":{"en":"Lokma","ar":"لقمة"},"color":"#F08C00","icon":"hamburger","domain":"lokma.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Checkout","ar":"إتمام الطلب"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"map","size":"s","alt":{"en":"Delivery map","ar":"خريطة التوصيل"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Address","ar":"العنوان"},"text":{"en":"12 Nile St, Floor 3","ar":"12 شارع النيل، الدور 3"},"filled":true},{"kind":"check","text":{"en":"SMS notification preference","ar":"تفضيل إشعارات SMS"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"money","text":{"en":"Cash on delivery","ar":"الدفع عند الاستلام"},"value":{"en":"EGP 160","ar":"160 جنيه"},"gap":"m"}]}}],"answer":["text"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P14-035","when":["sms","pref"],"feedback":{"en":"This label names a topic, not what happens. Does a tick mean \"send me texts\", \"no texts\", or \"I prefer texts over calls\"?","ar":"هذا الاسم يذكر موضوعًا، لا ما يحدث. هل علامة الصح تعني «أرسل لي رسائل»، أم «بدون رسائل»، أم «أفضّل الرسائل على المكالمات»؟"}}],"hints":[{"en":"After reading the label, do you know what ticking it will do?","ar":"بعد قراءة الاسم، هل تعرف ماذا سيحدث حين تختاره؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Active: say what ticking does.","ar":"صيغة فعل واضحة: قل ما يحدث عند الاختيار."},"explain":{"en":"\"Text me when the driver is close\" describes the result of the tick, so people know exactly what they're agreeing to.","ar":"«أرسل لي رسالة حين يقترب المندوب» تصف نتيجة الاختيار، فيعرف الناس بالضبط على ماذا يوافقون."},"speaker":"sara"},{"id":"S06","type":"compare","part":"contrast","skill":"SK-P14-U04-01","rules":["R11"],"value":{"en":"Checkboxes vs. radio buttons (NN/g): lay out your lists vertically, with one choice per line, and space buttons and labels so it's abundantly clear which choice goes with which label. In one tight line, each circle sits as close to the word before it as to the word after it.","ar":"الـ Checkboxes مقابل الـ Radio buttons (NN/g): رتّب القوائم رأسيًا، اختيارًا واحدًا في كل سطر، واترك مسافات تجعل واضحًا تمامًا أي اختيار يتبع أي اسم. وفي سطر واحد ضيّق، تكون كل دائرة قريبة من الكلمة التي قبلها بقدر قربها من الكلمة التي بعدها."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/checkboxes-vs-radio-buttons/","quote":"Lay out your lists vertically, with one choice per line."},"scenario":{"en":"Each sandwich comes in one bread: white, brown or baladi. To save space, the first design puts the three choices in one line.","ar":"كل ساندوتش يأتي بنوع خبز واحد: أبيض أو أسمر أو بلدي. ولتوفير المساحة، يضع التصميم الأول الاختيارات الثلاثة في سطر واحد."},"prompt":{"en":"Which version should ship?","ar":"أيّ نسخة يجب أن تُطلق؟"},"a":{"label":{"en":"Version A: one line","ar":"النسخة A: سطر واحد"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"lokma","name":{"en":"Lokma","ar":"لقمة"},"color":"#F08C00","icon":"hamburger","domain":"lokma.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Chicken sandwich","ar":"ساندوتش فراخ"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"bread","size":"s","alt":{"en":"Bread","ar":"خبز"}},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Bread","ar":"الخبز"}},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"◉ White ○ Brown ○ Baladi","ar":"◉ أبيض ○ أسمر ○ بلدي"},"gap":"s"}]}},"b":{"label":{"en":"Version B: one choice per line","ar":"النسخة B: اختيار واحد في كل سطر"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"lokma","name":{"en":"Lokma","ar":"لقمة"},"color":"#F08C00","icon":"hamburger","domain":"lokma.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Chicken sandwich","ar":"ساندوتش فراخ"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"bread","size":"s","alt":{"en":"Bread","ar":"خبز"}},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Bread","ar":"الخبز"}},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"White","ar":"أبيض"},"selected":true,"gap":"s"},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Brown","ar":"أسمر"}},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Baladi","ar":"بلدي"}}]}},"answer":"b","misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P14-034","when":["a"],"feedback":{"en":"Look at the middle circle: is it Brown's, or the end of White? With equal gaps, people can't tell which bread each circle picks, and some will tap the wrong one.","ar":"انظر إلى الدائرة الوسطى: هل هي للأسمر، أم هي نهاية الأبيض؟ مع مسافات متساوية، لا يعرف الناس أي خبز تختاره كل دائرة، وسيضغط بعضهم على الخطأ."}}],"correct":{"en":"B: each circle has one label.","ar":"B: لكل دائرة اسم واحد."},"explain":{"en":"Stacked, each circle sits right next to its own word, and people scan straight down the list. Three short lines cost less space than a wrong bread.","ar":"حين تكون تحت بعضها، تقع كل دائرة بجانب كلمتها مباشرة، ويتصفّح الناس القائمة من أعلى إلى أسفل. وثلاثة أسطر قصيرة أرخص من طلب بخبز خطأ."},"speaker":"sara"},{"id":"S07","type":"tune","speaker":"karim","part":"independent","skill":"SK-P14-U04-01","rules":["R14"],"value":{"en":"Checkboxes vs. radio buttons (NN/g): a radio button should be a small circle that has a solid circle inside it when selected. The account type is exactly one, so it needs the shape that says \"pick one\".","ar":"الـ Checkboxes مقابل الـ Radio buttons (NN/g): الـ Radio button يجب أن يكون دائرة صغيرة بداخلها دائرة ممتلئة عند اختياره. ونوع الحساب واحد فقط، فيحتاج إلى الشكل الذي يقول «اختر واحدًا»."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/checkboxes-vs-radio-buttons/","quote":"A radio button should be a small circle that has a solid circle inside it when selected."},"scenario":{"en":"I'm building a bank app. When opening an account online, people choose exactly one account type: savings, current or payroll.","ar":"أبني تطبيقًا لبنك. وحين يفتح الناس حسابًا عبر التطبيق، يختارون نوع حساب واحدًا فقط: توفير أو جاري أو حساب راتب."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each list, and tap the choices. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل قائمة، واضغط على الاختيارات. أيّ قائمة توضّح أن المطلوب نوع حساب واحد فقط؟"},"start":"square","options":[{"id":"square","text":{"en":"Pick-one buttons drawn as squares","ar":"أزرار اختيار واحد مرسومة على شكل مربعات"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rasid","name":{"en":"Rasid","ar":"رصيد"},"color":"#1C3D6E","icon":"bank","domain":"rasid.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Open an account","ar":"افتح حسابًا"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"progress","value":33,"label":{"en":"Step 1 of 3","ar":"الخطوة 1 من 3"}},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Account type","ar":"نوع الحساب"}},{"kind":"radio","marker":"square","text":{"en":"Savings","ar":"توفير"},"selected":true,"gap":"s"},{"kind":"radio","marker":"square","text":{"en":"Current","ar":"جاري"}},{"kind":"radio","marker":"square","text":{"en":"Payroll","ar":"حساب راتب"}}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Continue","ar":"تابع"}}]}},{"id":"check","text":{"en":"Checkboxes","ar":"Checkboxes"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rasid","name":{"en":"Rasid","ar":"رصيد"},"color":"#1C3D6E","icon":"bank","domain":"rasid.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Open an account","ar":"افتح حسابًا"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"progress","value":33,"label":{"en":"Step 1 of 3","ar":"الخطوة 1 من 3"}},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Account type","ar":"نوع الحساب"}},{"kind":"check","text":{"en":"Savings","ar":"توفير"},"selected":true,"gap":"s"},{"kind":"check","text":{"en":"Current","ar":"جاري"}},{"kind":"check","text":{"en":"Payroll","ar":"حساب راتب"}}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Continue","ar":"تابع"}}]}},{"id":"radio","text":{"en":"Round radio buttons","ar":"Radio buttons دائرية"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rasid","name":{"en":"Rasid","ar":"رصيد"},"color":"#1C3D6E","icon":"bank","domain":"rasid.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Open an account","ar":"افتح حسابًا"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"progress","value":33,"label":{"en":"Step 1 of 3","ar":"الخطوة 1 من 3"}},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Account type","ar":"نوع الحساب"}},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Savings","ar":"توفير"},"selected":true,"gap":"s"},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Current","ar":"جاري"}},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Payroll","ar":"حساب راتب"}}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Continue","ar":"تابع"}}]}}],"answer":["radio"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P14-033","when":["square"],"feedback":{"en":"Squares say \"tick any\". People may try to tick savings and current, then wonder why the first one cleared itself.","ar":"المربعات تقول «اختر ما تريد». فقد يحاول الناس اختيار التوفير والجاري معًا، ثم يتساءلون لماذا أُلغي الأول وحده."}},{"id":"MC-P14-033","when":["check"],"feedback":{"en":"Checkboxes let people tick two types, or none, but the bank needs exactly one. The form would have to reject the answer afterwards.","ar":"الـ Checkboxes تسمح للناس باختيار نوعين، أو لا شيء، لكن البنك يحتاج إلى نوع واحد بالضبط. فسيضطر النموذج إلى رفض الإجابة بعدها."}}],"correct":{"en":"Exactly one: round radio buttons.","ar":"واحد فقط: Radio buttons دائرية."},"explain":{"en":"Circles say \"pick one\" at a glance, and the control behaves the way it looks: choosing current moves the dot from savings.","ar":"الدوائر تقول «اختر واحدًا» بنظرة واحدة، والعنصر يعمل كما يبدو: اختيار الجاري ينقل النقطة من التوفير."}},{"id":"S08","type":"card","part":"recap","icons":["eye","list","text"],"title":{"en":"What you practised","ar":"ما تدرّبت عليه"},"body":{"en":"- **Standard shapes:** squares for any number, circles for exactly one, whatever the brand style.\n- **One choice per line**, so each marker clearly belongs to its label.\n- **Positive, active labels** that say what ticking does.\n\nNext: radio buttons that cover every answer, and controls that wait for a button.","ar":"- **الأشكال المعتادة:** مربعات لأي عدد، ودوائر لاختيار واحد فقط، مهما كان شكل الهوية.\n- **اختيار واحد في كل سطر**، حتى تنتمي كل علامة إلى اسمها بوضوح.\n- **أسماء إيجابية** تقول ما يحدث عند الاختيار.\n\nالتالي: Radio buttons تغطي كل الإجابات، وعناصر تنتظر الضغط على زر."}}]}$uxg$::jsonb),
  ($uxg$P14-U04-L02$uxg$, $uxg$7c7eefe925a27275120ee9dec0c28cebedfc4e39d84afaeb8c9510dbeb6b5602$uxg$, $uxg${"id":"P14-U04-L02","mode":"lesson","minutes":8,"title":{"en":"Choices that cover everyone","ar":"اختيارات تناسب الجميع"},"speaker":"rami","review_labels":{"MC-P14-036":{"en":"Start radio buttons with one choice selected","ar":"ابدأ الـ Radio buttons باختيار محدَّد"},"MC-P14-037":{"en":"Cover every answer, with \"Other\" when needed","ar":"غطِّ كل الإجابات، وأضف «أخرى» عند الحاجة"},"MC-P14-038":{"en":"Match the control to when the change happens","ar":"اختر العنصر بحسب وقت حدوث التغيير"},"MC-P14-039":{"en":"Make the label tappable, not only the box","ar":"اجعل الاسم قابلًا للضغط، لا المربع وحده"}},"steps":[{"id":"S01","type":"card","part":"hook","title":{"en":"Rami's freelance app","ar":"تطبيق رامي للعمل الحر"},"body":{"en":"I'm designing the sign-up for a freelance jobs app. One screen asks people for their main field of work.\n\nMy team listed the three fields with the most members today.","ar":"أصمّم صفحات التسجيل في تطبيق لوظائف العمل الحر. وتسأل إحدى الشاشات الناس عن مجال عملهم الأساسي.\n\nووضع فريقي المجالات الثلاثة التي فيها أكبر عدد من الأعضاء اليوم."},"mock":{"app":{"id":"herfa","name":{"en":"Herfa","ar":"حرفة"},"color":"#087F5B","icon":"briefcase","domain":"herfa.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Sign up","ar":"التسجيل"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"progress","value":50,"label":{"en":"Step 2 of 4","ar":"الخطوة 2 من 4"}},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Your main field","ar":"مجال عملك الأساسي"}},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Design","ar":"تصميم"},"selected":true,"gap":"s"},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Programming","ar":"برمجة"}},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Marketing","ar":"تسويق"}}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Next","ar":"التالي"}}]}},{"id":"S02","type":"tune","part":"try","skill":"SK-P14-U04-03","rules":["R12"],"confidence":true,"value":{"en":"Try first. Checkboxes vs. radio buttons (NN/g): radio buttons require exactly one choice, so the options must be comprehensive. If that's impossible, offer \"Other\" with a type-in field.","ar":"جرّب أولًا. الـ Checkboxes مقابل الـ Radio buttons (NN/g): الـ Radio buttons تحتاج إلى اختيار واحد بالضبط، فيجب أن تغطي الاختيارات كل الإجابات. وإن كان هذا مستحيلًا، فأضف «أخرى» مع خانة للكتابة."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/checkboxes-vs-radio-buttons/","quote":"If it's impossible to be comprehensive, offer a button labeled \"Other,\" supplemented by a type-in field."},"prompt":{"en":"Inas, a translator, is signing up. Try each version. Which one should ship?","ar":"إيناس مترجمة، وتسجّل الآن في التطبيق. جرّب كل نسخة. أيّ نسخة تتيح لإيناس أن تختار مجالها الحقيقي؟"},"start":"three","options":[{"id":"three","text":{"en":"The three biggest fields","ar":"المجالات الثلاثة الأكبر"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"herfa","name":{"en":"Herfa","ar":"حرفة"},"color":"#087F5B","icon":"briefcase","domain":"herfa.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Sign up","ar":"التسجيل"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"progress","value":50,"label":{"en":"Step 2 of 4","ar":"الخطوة 2 من 4"}},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Your main field","ar":"مجال عملك الأساسي"}},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Design","ar":"تصميم"},"selected":true,"gap":"s"},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Programming","ar":"برمجة"}},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Marketing","ar":"تسويق"}}]}},{"id":"long","text":{"en":"A longer list of ten fields","ar":"قائمة أطول فيها عشرة مجالات"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"herfa","name":{"en":"Herfa","ar":"حرفة"},"color":"#087F5B","icon":"briefcase","domain":"herfa.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Sign up","ar":"التسجيل"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"progress","value":50,"label":{"en":"Step 2 of 4","ar":"الخطوة 2 من 4"}},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Your main field","ar":"مجال عملك الأساسي"}},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Design","ar":"تصميم"},"selected":true,"gap":"s"},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Programming","ar":"برمجة"}},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Marketing","ar":"تسويق"}},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Writing","ar":"كتابة"}},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Video editing","ar":"مونتاج فيديو"}},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Accounting","ar":"محاسبة"}},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Data entry","ar":"إدخال بيانات"}},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Voice-over","ar":"تعليق صوتي"}},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Photography","ar":"تصوير"}},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Customer support","ar":"خدمة عملاء"}}]}},{"id":"other","text":{"en":"The three fields, plus \"Other\" with a box to type in","ar":"المجالات الثلاثة، ومعها «أخرى» وخانة للكتابة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"herfa","name":{"en":"Herfa","ar":"حرفة"},"color":"#087F5B","icon":"briefcase","domain":"herfa.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Sign up","ar":"التسجيل"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"progress","value":50,"label":{"en":"Step 2 of 4","ar":"الخطوة 2 من 4"}},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Your main field","ar":"مجال عملك الأساسي"}},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Design","ar":"تصميم"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Programming","ar":"برمجة"}},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Marketing","ar":"تسويق"}},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Other","ar":"أخرى"},"selected":true},{"kind":"field","text":{"en":"Translation","ar":"ترجمة"},"filled":true,"gap":"xs"}]}}],"answer":["other"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P14-037","when":["three"],"feedback":{"en":"Inas has no true answer here. She'll pick the closest wrong field, so clients looking for translators never find her, or she'll give up.","ar":"لا توجد إجابة صحيحة لإيناس هنا. فستختار أقرب مجال خطأ، فلا يجدها العملاء الذين يبحثون عن مترجمين، أو ستتوقّف عن التسجيل."}},{"id":"MC-P14-037","when":["long"],"feedback":{"en":"Ten fields still miss translation, and everyone now reads a long list. A longer list never covers everyone; \"Other\" does.","ar":"عشرة مجالات ما زالت لا تشمل الترجمة، وأصبح الجميع يقرأ قائمة طويلة. فالقائمة الأطول لا تغطي الجميع أبدًا؛ أما «أخرى» فتغطيهم."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Can Inas give a true answer in each version?","ar":"هل تستطيع إيناس أن تعطي إجابة صحيحة في كل نسخة؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Add \"Other\" with a box to type in.","ar":"أضف «أخرى» مع خانة للكتابة."},"explain":{"en":"The common fields stay one tap away, and anyone else can say exactly what they do. The team also learns which fields to add next.","ar":"تبقى المجالات الشائعة بضغطة واحدة، ويستطيع أي شخص آخر أن يكتب ما يعمله بالضبط. ويعرف الفريق أيضًا أي مجالات يضيفها لاحقًا."}},{"id":"S09","type":"video","part":"concept","title":{"en":"Choices that work for everyone","ar":"اختيارات تناسب الجميع"},"video":"d30807d6-4b43-4d27-a3aa-2bd6af75faf8","duration":269,"transcript":[{"t":2.5,"en":"Looking at the next guideline, we have three plan options: on the left as","ar":"لو بصينا على الـ Guideline اللي بعد كده، عندنا 3 اختيارات لـ Plan: على الشمال"},{"t":10.8,"en":"radio buttons, on the right as a dropdown. Which one is better in this case?","ar":"في شكل Radio buttons، وعلى اليمين في شكل Drop down. فأنهي فيهم أفضل في الحالة دي؟"},{"t":15.58,"en":"When we have few options like this example, it's always better to use radio buttons instead of dropdowns, so all the options are visible and I","ar":"في حالة لو عندنا اختيارات قليلة زي المثال ده، الأفضل دايمًا نستخدم Radio buttons بدل الـ Drop downs، عشان الاختيارات كلها تبقى ظاهرة وأقدر"},{"t":26.69,"en":"can see them all the time without opening a dropdown menu. But if I don't have enough space for radio buttons, say I'm on mobile with no","ar":"أشوفها طول الوقت، من غير ما أفتح الـ Drop down menu. لكن لو ماعنديش مساحة كفاية أحط الـ Radio buttons، وأنا على Mobile مثلًا"},{"t":37.84,"en":"room to stack them, then I'll use a dropdown. That violates the guideline, but I have a reason. These guidelines are the best default, but sometimes","ar":"وماعنديش مساحة أحطهم تحت بعض، فهنا هستخدم Drop down، وده Violate للـ Guideline لكن عندي سبب. الـ Guidelines دي هي الأفضل، لكن ممكن أحيانًا"},{"t":48.99,"en":"a reason appears to break one. It's still always better to follow the guidelines in general, even for simple components like the checkbox and the radio button.","ar":"يظهر سبب يخليني أخالف واحدة منها. ودايمًا الأفضل نحاول نمشي بالـ Guidelines عمومًا، حتى في الـ Components البسيطة زي الـ Checkbox والـ Radio button."},{"t":60.14,"en":"The next guideline: do I leave a default selection in radio buttons or not? It's always better to have a default. Once a","ar":"الـ Guideline اللي بعد كده: هل أخلّي في اختيار Default في الـ Radio buttons ولا ماخلّيش؟ الأفضل دايمًا إن في"},{"t":70.97,"en":"radio button has a choice, I can't go back to a state with nothing chosen; that state exists only in checkboxes. With radio","ar":"اختيار Default. لأن الـ Radio button ماينفعش أرجع فيه لحالة إن مفيش ولا اختيار، الحالة دي موجودة في الـ Checkboxes بس."},{"t":81.79,"en":"buttons I always need one option selected. If I leave the user with nothing chosen, as soon as they pick one they can't","ar":"في الـ Radio buttons محتاج دايمًا يكون عندي اختيار واحد مختار. فلو سيبت اليوزر من غير اختيار، أول ما يختار"},{"t":92.62,"en":"return to that state, and if they try to continue with nothing chosen they get an error. So I need a default option.","ar":"واحد مش هيقدر يرجع للحالة دي تاني، ولو حاول يكمّل من غير اختيار هيطلع له Error. فمحتاج أخلّي في اختيار Default."},{"t":103.44,"en":"It's also very important that any set of options I show the user is comprehensive: it covers everything that could come up. In this example, which isn't a real","ar":"ومهم جدًا في أي مجموعة اختيارات بعرضها على اليوزر إن الاختيارات دي تكون شاملة، تشمل كل الاختيارات اللي ممكن تظهر. زي المثال اللي قدامنا،"},{"t":115.54,"en":"one, if the user is creating an account and needs to choose their job, and my options don't cover every job and give no way to type one, they get","ar":"وهو مثال مش حقيقي: لو اليوزر بيعمل Account ومحتاج يختار وظيفته، وأنا مديله اختيارات من غير ما فيها كل الوظائف ومن غير Option يكتب"},{"t":127.64,"en":"stuck not knowing what to pick or write. So I need to give them an Others option or a way to type. The options must be as comprehensive as possible.","ar":"فيه، فهيقف مش عارف يختار إيه أو يكتب إيه. فمحتاج أديله اختيار Others أو أديله Option يكتب فيه. فلازم الاختيارات تكون شاملة قدر المستطاع."},{"t":139.74,"en":"Another important point is nested options, options inside each other, sometimes called a parent-child relationship: a radio button with other","ar":"برضه من الحاجات المهمة فكرة الاختيارات الـ Nested، أو اللي جوه بعض، وأحيانًا بيسموها Parent-child relationship: Radio button تحته"},{"t":149.2,"en":"radio buttons beneath it. This is usually not done because it isn't understandable: if I pick the main radio, does it","ar":"Radio buttons تانية. الفكرة دي مش موجودة عادة لأن استخدامها مش مفهوم: لو اخترت الـ Radio الرئيسي، هل هيختار الاتنين"},{"t":159.61,"en":"pick the two under it too? We said a radio can't select more than one option at a time, so","ar":"اللي تحته؟ احنا قلنا إن الـ Radio ماينفعش أختار منه أكتر من اختيار في نفس الوقت، فاستخدام الـ Pattern"},{"t":171.25,"en":"this pattern makes no sense and can confuse users. Unlike a checkbox, which can have a parent-child relationship or a nested","ar":"ده مش منطقي وممكن يلخبط المستخدمين. على عكس الـ Checkbox اللي ممكن يكون فيه Parent-child relationship أو Nested menu. لكن"},{"t":182.89,"en":"menu. Radio buttons can't, since I can't choose more than one: did I pick only the parent, or all the children?","ar":"الـ Radio buttons لأ، لأني أصلًا ماقدرش أختار أكتر من حاجة: هل اخترت الـ Parent بس ولا كل الـ Children؟"},{"t":194.53,"en":"Let's pause the video and try to find the problem with using a radio or checkbox the way it's used here. The mistake","ar":"خلّونا نوقّف الفيديو ونحاول نكتشف إيه المشكلة في استخدام Radio أو Checkbox بالشكل اللي قدامنا. الخطأ إننا استخدمناه"},{"t":201.34,"en":"is that we used it to trigger an action: tapping it turns on airplane mode. But radio buttons and checkboxes don't do that.","ar":"عشان يعمل Action معيّن: لما أدوس عليه هيشغّل Airplane mode. لكن الـ Radio button والـ Checkbox مابيعملوش كده. دايمًا"},{"t":211.92,"en":"They change a setting or make choices, and afterward I need to take an action for the choice to take effect. For example,","ar":"بيغيّروا Setting أو بيعملوا اختيارات، ومحتاج بعدها أعمل Action عشان الاختيار يتنفّذ. مثلًا لو هختار وظيفتي وأضغط Next،"},{"t":222.5,"en":"if I choose my job and press Next, that's when the action runs. No action runs when I press a radio button or","ar":"ساعتها الـ Action ده هيتنفّذ. مفيش Action بيتنفّذ لما أضغط على Radio button أو Checkbox، إلا في حالة الـ"},{"t":233.08,"en":"checkbox, except for the standalone checkbox we said can be used on desktop. Next we'll look at another pattern that runs the action instantly.","ar":"Standalone checkbox اللي قلنا إنه ممكن يُستخدم في الـ Desktop. وبعد كده هناخد Pattern تانية بتنفّذ الـ Action لحظيًا."},{"t":243.66,"en":"Finally, the last guideline for checkboxes and radio buttons: make the clickable area the whole thing: the component itself and the label written next to","ar":"وأخيرًا آخر Guideline في الـ Checkboxes والـ Radio buttons: نخلّي الـ Clickable area بتاعة الـ Checkbox أو الـ Radio هي الجزء كامل: الـ Component نفسه والـ"},{"t":253.51,"en":"it should all be clickable, not just the checkbox or just the radio. Otherwise it can reduce accessibility or make the component harder to use.","ar":"Label المكتوب جنبه، كلهم يكونوا Clickable area، مش بس الـ Checkbox ولا بس الـ Radio. لأن ده أحيانًا بيقلّل الـ Accessibility أو بيصعّب استخدام الـ Component."}]},{"id":"S03","type":"card","part":"concept","icons":["radio","ok","other","warn","pick"],"title":{"en":"Video summary","ar":"ملخص الفيديو"},"body":{"en":"A radio button set asks for exactly one answer, so it has to have one for everybody.\n\n- **Few options? Show them** as radio buttons rather than a dropdown, so people can see and compare every choice.\n- **Start with one selected.** Once picked, a radio button can't be cleared. If not answering is valid, add a choice like \"None\" or \"No preference\".\n- **Cover every answer.** If you can't list them all, add \"Other\" with a box to type in. Don't nest radio buttons under other radio buttons.\n- **Settings, not actions.** Ticking a box or picking a radio button changes a setting. A button makes something happen.\n- **The whole row is the target:** people can tap the circle or box, or its label.","ar":"مجموعة الـ Radio buttons تطلب إجابة واحدة بالضبط، فيجب أن يكون فيها إجابة لكل شخص.\n\n- **الاختيارات قليلة؟ اعرضها** في Radio buttons بدلًا من Dropdown، حتى يرى الناس كل الاختيارات ويقارنوا بينها.\n- **ابدأ باختيار محدَّد.** فبعد الاختيار، لا يمكن إلغاء الـ Radio button. وإن كان عدم الإجابة مقبولًا، فأضف اختيارًا مثل «لا شيء» أو «لا يهم».\n- **غطِّ كل الإجابات.** وإن لم تستطع ذكرها كلها، فأضف «أخرى» مع خانة للكتابة. ولا تضع Radio buttons داخل Radio buttons أخرى.\n- **إعدادات، لا أفعال.** اختيار Checkbox أو Radio button يغيّر إعدادًا. أما الزر فهو الذي يجعل شيئًا يحدث.\n- **السطر كله قابل للضغط:** يستطيع الناس الضغط على الدائرة أو المربع، أو على الاسم."}},{"id":"S04","type":"tune","part":"guided","skill":"SK-P14-U04-03","rules":["R06","R15"],"value":{"en":"Radio buttons (NN/g): you cannot click or tap a selected radio button to deselect it. Checkboxes vs. radio buttons (NN/g): when people may not want to choose, provide a radio button for it, such as one labelled \"None\", and start there.","ar":"الـ Radio buttons (NN/g): لا يمكن الضغط على Radio button محدَّد لإلغاء اختياره. والـ Checkboxes مقابل الـ Radio buttons (NN/g): حين قد لا يريد الناس الاختيار، أضف Radio button لذلك، مثل «لا شيء»، وابدأ به."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/radio-buttons-default-selection/","quote":"But you cannot click or tap a selected radio button to deselect it."},"scenario":{"en":"On their profile, freelancers can say when clients may call them: in the morning or in the evening. Many freelancers don't mind when.","ar":"في الملف الشخصي، يستطيع المستقلّون أن يحددوا متى يتصل بهم العملاء: صباحًا أو مساءً. وكثير منهم لا يهمّهم الوقت."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each version, and try to clear a choice after picking it. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل نسخة، وحاول إلغاء الاختيار بعد أن تختاره. أيّها يجب أن تُطلق؟"},"start":"empty","options":[{"id":"empty","text":{"en":"Morning and Evening, nothing selected","ar":"صباحًا ومساءً، دون اختيار محدَّد"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"herfa","name":{"en":"Herfa","ar":"حرفة"},"color":"#087F5B","icon":"briefcase","domain":"herfa.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Profile","ar":"الملف"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","avatar":{"text":"Adel Ramzy","art":"man-2"},"text":{"en":"Adel Ramzy","ar":"عادل رمزي"},"sub":{"en":"Logo designer · Giza","ar":"مصمم شعارات · الجيزة"}},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Best time for calls","ar":"أفضل وقت للمكالمات"}},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Morning","ar":"صباحًا"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Evening","ar":"مساءً"}}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Save","ar":"حفظ"}}]}},{"id":"morning","text":{"en":"Morning and Evening, Morning selected","ar":"صباحًا ومساءً، و«صباحًا» محدَّد"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"herfa","name":{"en":"Herfa","ar":"حرفة"},"color":"#087F5B","icon":"briefcase","domain":"herfa.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Profile","ar":"الملف"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","avatar":{"text":"Adel Ramzy","art":"man-2"},"text":{"en":"Adel Ramzy","ar":"عادل رمزي"},"sub":{"en":"Logo designer · Giza","ar":"مصمم شعارات · الجيزة"}},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Best time for calls","ar":"أفضل وقت للمكالمات"}},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Morning","ar":"صباحًا"},"selected":true,"gap":"s"},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Evening","ar":"مساءً"}}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Save","ar":"حفظ"}}]}},{"id":"any","text":{"en":"Add \"Any time\", selected","ar":"أضف «أي وقت»، وهو محدَّد"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"herfa","name":{"en":"Herfa","ar":"حرفة"},"color":"#087F5B","icon":"briefcase","domain":"herfa.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Profile","ar":"الملف"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","avatar":{"text":"Adel Ramzy","art":"man-2"},"text":{"en":"Adel Ramzy","ar":"عادل رمزي"},"sub":{"en":"Logo designer · Giza","ar":"مصمم شعارات · الجيزة"}},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Best time for calls","ar":"أفضل وقت للمكالمات"}},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Any time","ar":"أي وقت"},"selected":true,"gap":"s"},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Morning","ar":"صباحًا"}},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Evening","ar":"مساءً"}}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Save","ar":"حفظ"}}]}}],"answer":["any"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P14-036","when":["empty"],"feedback":{"en":"Pick Morning, then try to clear it: you can't. Freelancers who don't mind are pushed into a time they didn't mean, or leave the profile half done.","ar":"اختر «صباحًا» ثم حاول إلغاءه: لا تستطيع. فالمستقلّ الذي لا يهمّه الوقت يُجبَر على وقت لم يقصده، أو يترك الملف ناقصًا."}},{"id":"MC-P14-036","when":["morning"],"feedback":{"en":"Most people keep the default. Freelancers who don't mind will look like morning-only, and evening clients will skip them.","ar":"أغلب الناس يُبقون الاختيار الافتراضي. فالمستقلّون الذين لا يهمّهم الوقت سيبدون كأنهم متاحون صباحًا فقط، وسيتجاهلهم عملاء المساء."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Where does a freelancer who doesn't mind belong in each version?","ar":"أين مكان المستقلّ الذي لا يهمّه الوقت في كل نسخة؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Give \"don't mind\" its own choice, and start there.","ar":"اجعل «لا يهم» اختيارًا مستقلًا، وابدأ به."},"explain":{"en":"\"Any time\" is a true answer for many people and a safe start for everyone. Anyone with a real preference changes it in one tap.","ar":"«أي وقت» إجابة صحيحة لكثير من الناس، وبداية آمنة للجميع. ومن عنده تفضيل حقيقي يغيّره بضغطة واحدة."},"speaker":"rami"},{"id":"S05","type":"tune","part":"guided","skill":"SK-P14-U04-04","rules":["R06","R15"],"confidence":true,"value":{"en":"Checkboxes vs. radio buttons (NN/g): use checkboxes and radio buttons only to change settings, not as action buttons that make something happen. Deleting is an action, so it needs a button.","ar":"الـ Checkboxes مقابل الـ Radio buttons (NN/g): استخدم الـ Checkboxes والـ Radio buttons لتغيير الإعدادات فقط، لا كأزرار تجعل شيئًا يحدث. والحذف فعل، فيحتاج إلى زر."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/checkboxes-vs-radio-buttons/","quote":"Use checkboxes and radio buttons only to change settings, not as action buttons that make something happen."},"scenario":{"en":"Freelancers write proposals to clients, and the app keeps unsent proposals as drafts. I need a way to delete a draft from its screen.","ar":"يكتب المستقلّون عروضًا للعملاء، ويحفظ التطبيق العروض التي لم تُرسل في المسوّدات. وأحتاج إلى طريقة لحذف المسوّدة من شاشتها."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each version. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل نسخة. أيّها يجب أن تُطلق؟"},"start":"check","options":[{"id":"check","text":{"en":"A checkbox that deletes the draft as soon as it's ticked","ar":"Checkbox يحذف المسوّدة بمجرد اختياره"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"Ticking deletes at once","ar":"الاختيار يحذف فورًا"},"app":{"id":"herfa","name":{"en":"Herfa","ar":"حرفة"},"color":"#087F5B","icon":"briefcase","domain":"herfa.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Draft: Logo for a café","ar":"مسوّدة: شعار لمقهى"},"back":true,"actions":[{"icon":"dots-three-vertical","aria":{"en":"More","ar":"المزيد"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"coffee","text":{"en":"Bean Café · logo","ar":"مقهى بين · شعار"},"sub":{"en":"Budget EGP 3,000 · 6 offers","ar":"الميزانية 3,000 جنيه · 6 عروض"}},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"Hello, I'd love to design your logo…","ar":"مرحبًا، يسعدني تصميم شعاركم…"},"tone":"faint"},{"kind":"check","text":{"en":"Delete this draft","ar":"احذف هذه المسوّدة"},"gap":"m"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Send proposal","ar":"أرسل العرض"}}]}},{"id":"button","text":{"en":"A \"Delete draft\" button","ar":"زر «احذف المسوّدة»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"herfa","name":{"en":"Herfa","ar":"حرفة"},"color":"#087F5B","icon":"briefcase","domain":"herfa.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Draft: Logo for a café","ar":"مسوّدة: شعار لمقهى"},"back":true,"actions":[{"icon":"dots-three-vertical","aria":{"en":"More","ar":"المزيد"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"coffee","text":{"en":"Bean Café · logo","ar":"مقهى بين · شعار"},"sub":{"en":"Budget EGP 3,000 · 6 offers","ar":"الميزانية 3,000 جنيه · 6 عروض"}},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"Hello, I'd love to design your logo…","ar":"مرحبًا، يسعدني تصميم شعاركم…"},"tone":"faint"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Send proposal","ar":"أرسل العرض"}},{"kind":"button","style":"dangerlink","text":{"en":"Delete draft","ar":"احذف المسوّدة"},"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"radio","text":{"en":"Radio buttons, Keep or Delete, that act as soon as one is picked","ar":"Radio buttons، «احتفظ» أو «احذف»، تعمل بمجرد اختيار أحدها"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"Picking Delete deletes at once","ar":"اختيار «احذف» يحذف فورًا"},"app":{"id":"herfa","name":{"en":"Herfa","ar":"حرفة"},"color":"#087F5B","icon":"briefcase","domain":"herfa.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Draft: Logo for a café","ar":"مسوّدة: شعار لمقهى"},"back":true,"actions":[{"icon":"dots-three-vertical","aria":{"en":"More","ar":"المزيد"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"coffee","text":{"en":"Bean Café · logo","ar":"مقهى بين · شعار"},"sub":{"en":"Budget EGP 3,000 · 6 offers","ar":"الميزانية 3,000 جنيه · 6 عروض"}},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"Hello, I'd love to design your logo…","ar":"مرحبًا، يسعدني تصميم شعاركم…"},"tone":"faint"},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Keep draft","ar":"احتفظ بالمسوّدة"},"selected":true,"gap":"m"},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Delete draft","ar":"احذف المسوّدة"}}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Send proposal","ar":"أرسل العرض"}}]}}],"answer":["button"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P14-038","when":["check","radio"],"feedback":{"en":"Checkboxes and radio buttons look like settings that wait for a button, so people tap them freely to see what they do. Here one tap destroys a proposal before anyone confirms.","ar":"الـ Checkboxes والـ Radio buttons تبدو إعدادات تنتظر زرًا، فيضغط الناس عليها بحرية ليروا ماذا تفعل. وهنا ضغطة واحدة تحذف عرضًا قبل أن يؤكّد أحد."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Is deleting a setting you choose, or something that happens?","ar":"هل الحذف إعداد تختاره، أم شيء يحدث؟"}],"correct":{"en":"An action: a button.","ar":"إجراء: زر."},"explain":{"en":"A button says \"press me and it happens\", which is exactly what deleting is. The checkboxes and radio buttons stay free for real settings.","ar":"الزر يقول «اضغطني ويحدث الأمر»، وهذا بالضبط ما يحدث في الحذف. وتبقى الـ Checkboxes والـ Radio buttons للإعدادات الحقيقية."},"speaker":"rami"},{"id":"S06","type":"compare","part":"contrast","skill":"SK-P14-U04-01","rules":["R11"],"value":{"en":"Checkboxes vs. radio buttons (NN/g): let users select an option by clicking on either the box itself or its label. Checkboxes (NN/g): don't force users to tap a too-small box.","ar":"الـ Checkboxes مقابل الـ Radio buttons (NN/g): اسمح للناس باختيار الخيار بالضغط على المربع نفسه أو على اسمه. والـ Checkboxes (NN/g): لا تجبر الناس على الضغط على مربع صغير جدًا."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/checkboxes-vs-radio-buttons/","quote":"Let users select an option by clicking on either the button/box itself or its label"},"scenario":{"en":"Freelancers pick which job types to get alerts for. My team built two versions of the list.","ar":"يختار المستقلّون أنواع الوظائف التي تصلهم تنبيهات عنها. وبنى فريقي نسختين من القائمة."},"prompt":{"en":"Tap the words in each version, not the boxes. Which version should ship?","ar":"اضغط على الكلمات في كل نسخة، لا على المربعات. أيّ نسخة تستجيب حين تضغط على الكلمات؟"},"a":{"label":{"en":"Version A","ar":"النسخة A"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"herfa","name":{"en":"Herfa","ar":"حرفة"},"color":"#087F5B","icon":"briefcase","domain":"herfa.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Notifications","ar":"الإشعارات"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Alert me about","ar":"نبّهني عن"}},{"kind":"check","hit":"box","text":{"en":"Full-time jobs","ar":"وظائف بدوام كامل"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"check","hit":"box","text":{"en":"Part-time jobs","ar":"وظائف بدوام جزئي"}},{"kind":"check","hit":"box","text":{"en":"One-off projects","ar":"مشروعات لمرة واحدة"}}]}},"b":{"label":{"en":"Version B","ar":"النسخة B"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"herfa","name":{"en":"Herfa","ar":"حرفة"},"color":"#087F5B","icon":"briefcase","domain":"herfa.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Notifications","ar":"الإشعارات"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Alert me about","ar":"نبّهني عن"}},{"kind":"check","text":{"en":"Full-time jobs","ar":"وظائف بدوام كامل"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"check","text":{"en":"Part-time jobs","ar":"وظائف بدوام جزئي"}},{"kind":"check","text":{"en":"One-off projects","ar":"مشروعات لمرة واحدة"}}]}},"answer":"b","misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P14-039","when":["a"],"feedback":{"en":"In A only the small box responds. People tap the words, nothing happens, and they tap again or think it's broken. On a phone, a 20-pixel box is a hard target.","ar":"في A يستجيب المربع الصغير وحده. فيضغط الناس على الكلمات، ولا يحدث شيء، فيضغطون مرة أخرى أو يظنون أن التطبيق معطّل. وعلى الموبايل، مربع حجمه 20 بكسل هدف صعب."}}],"correct":{"en":"B: the whole row is tappable.","ar":"B: السطر كله قابل للضغط."},"explain":{"en":"In B the box and its words make one big target, so a quick tap anywhere on the line works, also for people with shaky hands or large fingers.","ar":"في B يشكّل المربع وكلماته هدفًا واحدًا كبيرًا، فتنجح ضغطة سريعة في أي مكان على السطر، حتى لمن يده غير ثابتة أو أصابعه كبيرة."},"speaker":"rami"},{"id":"S07","type":"tune","speaker":"nour","part":"independent","skill":"SK-P14-U04-03","rules":["R14"],"value":{"en":"Checkboxes vs. radio buttons (NN/g): make sure the options are both comprehensive and clearly distinct. People book visits for many relatives and friends, so a short list of relations always misses someone.","ar":"الـ Checkboxes مقابل الـ Radio buttons (NN/g): تأكّد أن الاختيارات تغطي كل الإجابات ومختلفة بوضوح عن بعضها. والناس يحجزون زيارات لكثير من الأقارب والأصدقاء، فقائمة قصيرة من صلات القرابة تنسى أحدًا دائمًا."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/checkboxes-vs-radio-buttons/","quote":"Because radio buttons require exactly one choice, make sure that the options are both comprehensive and clearly distinct"},"scenario":{"en":"I manage a clinic, and we're designing our booking app. Before picking a time, people answer one question: who is this visit for? Nesma wants to book for her grandmother.","ar":"أدير عيادة، ونصمّم تطبيق الحجز عندنا. وقبل اختيار الوقت، يجيب الناس عن سؤال واحد: لمن هذه الزيارة؟ ونسمة تريد الحجز لجدّتها."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each version. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل نسخة. أيّها يجب أن تُطلق؟"},"start":"two","options":[{"id":"two","text":{"en":"Me, or my child","ar":"لي، أو لطفلي"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Book a visit","ar":"احجز زيارة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","avatar":{"text":"Samia Hassan","art":"doctor"},"text":{"en":"Dr. Samia","ar":"د. سامية"},"sub":{"en":"Sun 10:30 am","ar":"الأحد 10:30 ص"}},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Who is this visit for?","ar":"لمن هذه الزيارة؟"}},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Me","ar":"لي"},"selected":true,"gap":"s"},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"My child","ar":"لطفلي"}},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Continue","ar":"تابع"}}]}},{"id":"family","text":{"en":"Me, my child, my husband or wife, my parent","ar":"لي، لطفلي، لزوجي أو زوجتي، لأحد والديّ"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Book a visit","ar":"احجز زيارة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","avatar":{"text":"Samia Hassan","art":"doctor"},"text":{"en":"Dr. Samia","ar":"د. سامية"},"sub":{"en":"Sun 10:30 am","ar":"الأحد 10:30 ص"}},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Who is this visit for?","ar":"لمن هذه الزيارة؟"}},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Me","ar":"لي"},"selected":true,"gap":"s"},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"My child","ar":"لطفلي"}},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"My husband or wife","ar":"لزوجي أو زوجتي"}},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"My parent","ar":"لأحد والديّ"}},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Continue","ar":"تابع"}}]}},{"id":"else","text":{"en":"Me, my child, or someone else, with a box for their name","ar":"لي، لطفلي، أو لشخص آخر، مع خانة لاسمه"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Book a visit","ar":"احجز زيارة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","avatar":{"text":"Samia Hassan","art":"doctor"},"text":{"en":"Dr. Samia","ar":"د. سامية"},"sub":{"en":"Sun 10:30 am","ar":"الأحد 10:30 ص"}},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Who is this visit for?","ar":"لمن هذه الزيارة؟"}},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Me","ar":"لي"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"My child","ar":"لطفلي"}},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Someone else","ar":"لشخص آخر"},"selected":true},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Their full name","ar":"اسمه بالكامل"},"text":{"en":"Fatma Hassan","ar":"فاطمة حسن"},"filled":true,"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Continue","ar":"تابع"}}]}}],"answer":["else"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P14-037","when":["two","family"],"feedback":{"en":"Nesma's grandmother isn't on the list. She has to pick a wrong relation, and the clinic records the wrong patient, or she calls instead.","ar":"جدّة نسمة ليست في القائمة. فستضطر إلى اختيار صلة قرابة خطأ، فتسجّل العيادة مريضًا خطأ، أو ستتصل بالهاتف بدلًا من ذلك."}}],"correct":{"en":"\"Someone else\", with their name.","ar":"«لشخص آخر»، مع اسمه."},"explain":{"en":"Two common answers stay one tap away, and \"someone else\" covers grandmothers, friends and neighbours, with the name the clinic actually needs.","ar":"تبقى الإجابتان الشائعتان بضغطة واحدة، و«لشخص آخر» تشمل الجدّات والأصدقاء والجيران، مع الاسم الذي تحتاجه العيادة فعلًا."}},{"id":"S08","type":"card","part":"recap","icons":["other","ok","pick","eye"],"title":{"en":"What you practised","ar":"ما تدرّبت عليه"},"body":{"en":"- **Cover every answer:** add \"Other\" or \"Someone else\" with a box, instead of a longer list.\n- **Start with one selected**, and give \"don't mind\" its own choice.\n- **Settings, not actions:** deleting and sending belong on buttons.\n- **The whole row is the target**, words included.\n\nNext: toggles, the control that acts the moment you flip it.","ar":"- **غطِّ كل الإجابات:** أضف «أخرى» أو «لشخص آخر» مع خانة، بدلًا من قائمة أطول.\n- **ابدأ باختيار محدَّد**، واجعل «لا يهم» اختيارًا مستقلًا.\n- **إعدادات، لا إجراءات:** الحذف والإرسال مكانهما الأزرار.\n- **السطر كله هدف للضغط**، والكلمات أيضًا.\n\nالتالي: الـ Toggle، العنصر الذي يعمل لحظة الضغط عليه."}}]}$uxg$::jsonb),
  ($uxg$P14-U04-L03$uxg$, $uxg$9fbc171334c47a6394da9a4ef7eb60f8903ba533e47ee1863893af41b3ca6460$uxg$, $uxg${"id":"P14-U04-L03","mode":"lesson","minutes":8,"title":{"en":"Toggles that act now","ar":"Toggles تعمل في الحال"},"speaker":"tarek","review_labels":{"MC-P14-038":{"en":"Match the control to when the change happens","ar":"اختر العنصر بحسب وقت حدوث التغيير"},"MC-P14-040":{"en":"Keep toggle labels short and direct","ar":"اجعل اسم الـ Toggle قصيرًا ومباشرًا"},"MC-P14-041":{"en":"A lone state word reads as the label","ar":"كلمة الحالة الوحيدة تُقرأ كأنها الاسم"}},"steps":[{"id":"S01","type":"card","part":"hook","title":{"en":"Tarek's flight app","ar":"تطبيق طارق للطيران"},"body":{"en":"In the flight booking app I manage, there's a toggle under the \"From\" field: include nearby airports.\n\nPeople fill in the trip, then tap Search to see flights.","ar":"في تطبيق حجز الطيران الذي أديره، يوجد Toggle تحت خانة «من»: أضف المطارات القريبة.\n\nيملأ الناس بيانات الرحلة، ثم يضغطون «ابحث» ليروا الرحلات."},"mock":{"app":{"id":"zad","name":{"en":"Zad Travel","ar":"زاد للسفر"},"color":"#6D28D9","icon":"airplane-tilt","domain":"zad.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Search flights","ar":"ابحث عن رحلة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"From","ar":"من"},"text":{"en":"Cairo (CAI)","ar":"القاهرة (CAI)"},"filled":true},{"kind":"toggle","text":{"en":"Include nearby airports","ar":"أضف المطارات القريبة"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"To","ar":"إلى"},"text":{"en":"Dubai (DXB)","ar":"دبي (DXB)"},"filled":true,"gap":"m"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Dates","ar":"التواريخ"},"icon":"calendar-blank","text":{"en":"14 – 21 Nov","ar":"من 14 إلى 21 نوفمبر"},"filled":true,"gap":"s"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Search","ar":"ابحث"}}]}},{"id":"S02","type":"tune","part":"try","skill":"SK-P14-U04-04","rules":["R12"],"confidence":true,"value":{"en":"Try first. Toggle switches (NN/g): toggle switches should take immediate effect and shouldn't need Save or Submit. Here the airports only change the results after Search, so the control should be one that waits.","ar":"جرّب أولًا. الـ Toggle switches (NN/g): يجب أن يكون للـ Toggle أثر فوري، ولا يحتاج إلى «حفظ» أو «إرسال». وهنا لا تغيّر المطارات النتائج إلا بعد «ابحث»، فالعنصر المناسب هو عنصر ينتظر."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/toggle-switch-guidelines/","quote":"Toggle switches should take immediate effect"},"prompt":{"en":"Nearby airports only change the results once people tap Search. Try each control. Which one should ship?","ar":"المطارات القريبة لا تغيّر النتائج إلا حين يضغط الناس «ابحث». جرّب كل عنصر. أيّ عنصر يتصرّف كما يتوقّع الناس هنا؟"},"start":"toggle","options":[{"id":"toggle","text":{"en":"A toggle","ar":"Toggle"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"zad","name":{"en":"Zad Travel","ar":"زاد للسفر"},"color":"#6D28D9","icon":"airplane-tilt","domain":"zad.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Search flights","ar":"ابحث عن رحلة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"From","ar":"من"},"text":{"en":"Cairo (CAI)","ar":"القاهرة (CAI)"},"filled":true},{"kind":"toggle","text":{"en":"Include nearby airports","ar":"أضف المطارات القريبة"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"To","ar":"إلى"},"text":{"en":"Dubai (DXB)","ar":"دبي (DXB)"},"filled":true,"gap":"m"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Dates","ar":"التواريخ"},"icon":"calendar-blank","text":{"en":"14 – 21 Nov","ar":"من 14 إلى 21 نوفمبر"},"filled":true,"gap":"s"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Search","ar":"ابحث"}}]}},{"id":"check","text":{"en":"A checkbox","ar":"Checkbox"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"zad","name":{"en":"Zad Travel","ar":"زاد للسفر"},"color":"#6D28D9","icon":"airplane-tilt","domain":"zad.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Search flights","ar":"ابحث عن رحلة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"From","ar":"من"},"text":{"en":"Cairo (CAI)","ar":"القاهرة (CAI)"},"filled":true},{"kind":"check","text":{"en":"Include nearby airports","ar":"أضف المطارات القريبة"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"To","ar":"إلى"},"text":{"en":"Dubai (DXB)","ar":"دبي (DXB)"},"filled":true,"gap":"m"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Dates","ar":"التواريخ"},"icon":"calendar-blank","text":{"en":"14 – 21 Nov","ar":"من 14 إلى 21 نوفمبر"},"filled":true,"gap":"s"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Search","ar":"ابحث"}}]}}],"answer":["check"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P14-038","when":["toggle"],"feedback":{"en":"A toggle looks like a light switch: flip it and something happens. Here nothing changes until Search, so people flip it, see no change, and wonder whether it worked.","ar":"الـ Toggle يشبه مفتاح النور: تضغطه فيحدث شيء. وهنا لا يتغيّر شيء حتى «ابحث»، فيضغطه الناس ولا يرون تغييرًا، ويتساءلون هل نجح."}}],"hints":[{"en":"When do people see the effect of this choice?","ar":"متى يرى الناس أثر هذا الاختيار؟"}],"correct":{"en":"It waits for Search: a checkbox.","ar":"ينتظر «ابحث»: Checkbox."},"explain":{"en":"A checkbox is part of the search, like the city fields. People tick it and expect it to count when they tap Search, which is exactly what happens.","ar":"الـ Checkbox جزء من البحث، مثل خانات المدن. يختاره الناس ويتوقّعون أن يُحسب حين يضغطون «ابحث»، وهذا بالضبط ما يحدث."}},{"id":"S09","type":"video","part":"concept","title":{"en":"A toggle acts the moment it's flipped","ar":"الـ Toggle يعمل لحظة الضغط عليه"},"video":"01be5e5a-23f9-41a0-bd3e-0ede0b4f2206","duration":190,"transcript":[{"t":2.5,"en":"The second design pattern for input controls is the toggle switch. We probably all know it and have used it, and we","ar":"الـ Design pattern التاني معانا في الـ Input controls هو الـ Toggle switch. ممكن كلنا نعرفه واستخدمناه قبل كده،"},{"t":12.72,"en":"know how it behaves: it switches on and off like this. Let's go through some guidelines. A toggle switch is a digital","ar":"وعارفين الـ Behavior بتاعه: بيشتغل وبيقفل بالشكل ده. خلّونا نقول بعض الـ Guidelines عنه. الـ Toggle switch هو Digital"},{"t":22.94,"en":"on/off switch that changes something in the system directly, like a light switch when I enter a room: I press it and","ar":"on/off switch، بيغيّر حاجة في السيستم مباشرة، زي زرار النور لما أدخل أوضة: بدوس عليه فيقفل النور أو يفتحه"},{"t":33.16,"en":"the light goes off or on instantly, so I start something in the system right now. Unlike checkboxes and radio buttons, which","ar":"لحظيًا، فببدأ أعمل حاجة في السيستم دلوقتي. على عكس الـ Checkbox والـ Radio buttons اللي قلنا إنهم مش بينفّذوا"},{"t":43.38,"en":"we said don't do anything instantly. So it can sometimes replace radio buttons and checkboxes, but we know the difference: it acts instantly.","ar":"حاجة لحظيًا. فممكن نقول إنه أحيانًا يستبدل الـ Radio buttons والـ Checkboxes، لكننا عارفين الفرق في تنفيذ الحاجة لحظيًا."},{"t":53.6,"en":"Based on that, let's see the guidelines related to it. In this example I'm booking a flight and choosing the airport to","ar":"وبناءً على كده نشوف الـ Guidelines اللي ليها علاقة بيه. لو شوفنا المثال ده: بحجز رحلة طيران وباختار المطار اللي"},{"t":64.06,"en":"leave from, and the option under it is to search only the airports near me, and that option is enabled with a toggle","ar":"هتحرك منه، والـ Option اللي تحته إني أدوّر على المطارات اللي موجودة بس في الأميال القريبة مني، والاختيار ده بيتفعّل بـ"},{"t":74.52,"en":"switch: I turn it on or off. Is using a toggle here right or wrong? It isn't the best choice, because pressing it","ar":"Toggle switch: بدوس عليه أو بقفله. هل استخدام الـ Toggle هنا صح ولا غلط؟ استخدام الـ Toggle هنا مش أفضل"},{"t":81.49,"en":"doesn't do anything instantly. I'm changing a setting, like a checkbox or radio button, and only when I finish the search and reach","ar":"حاجة، لأنه مش بينفّذ حاجة لحظيًا لما أضغط عليه. أنا بغيّر Setting، زي الـ Checkbox والـ Radio button، ولما أكمّل السيرش"},{"t":91.95,"en":"the results page do I see the toggle's effect. That's not what toggle guidelines say; a toggle's effect is instant, like airplane mode.","ar":"وأروح لصفحة النتايج هبدأ أشوف تأثير الـ Toggle. وده مش من Guidelines الـ Toggle، لأن تأثيره بيكون لحظي، زي Airplane mode."},{"t":98.49,"en":"Also from this example we get another guideline for the toggle switch: write the label next to the toggle as short and clear","ar":"كمان لو شفنا المثال ده، ممكن نطلع بـ Guideline تانية للـ Toggle switch: إننا نكتب الـ Label اللي مع الـ"},{"t":109.66,"en":"as possible. Users only read what they feel they need to read. If I make the label long, and it contains a negative","ar":"Toggle مختصر وواضح قدر المستطاع. اليوزر دايمًا بيقرأ الحاجات اللي شايف إنه محتاج يقراها بس. فلو خلّيت الـ Label طويل،"},{"t":120.82,"en":"too, the user needs time to read and understand it. But if I make the label short and direct, they understand it faster.","ar":"وفيه نفي برضه، الموضوع هيحتاج وقت من اليوزر عشان يقراه ويفهمه. لكن لو خلّيت الـ Label قصير ومباشر، هيفهمه أسرع."},{"t":128.2,"en":"From this example we also get another insight: if I press this toggle, am I switching it off, or switching it to on while it's currently off? We might get confused about","ar":"كمان من المثال ده نطلع بـ Insight تانية: لو ضغطت على الـ Toggle ده، هل أنا بشغّل Off ولا بحوّله لحالة On وهو دلوقتي في حالة Off؟"},{"t":139.3,"en":"which of the two states it's in. That leads to the guideline: if I have two states, on and off, and the label or title is written above rather than beside the","ar":"ممكن نتشتت ونفكر إنها حالة من الاتنين. وده يوصلنا للـ Guideline: لو عندي حالتين On وOff، والـ Label أو العنوان مكتوب فوق، مش جنب الـ Toggle نفسه،"},{"t":150.4,"en":"toggle, I can write both states, on the right and off on the left for example, so it's clear it's now off and will go to on. Or the label is written","ar":"فممكن أكتب الحالتين: On على اليمين وOff على الشمال مثلًا، عشان يبان إنه دلوقتي في حالة Off وهيروح لحالة On. أو يكون الـ Label مكتوب جنبه، فأعرف"},{"t":161.5,"en":"beside it, so I know that when it's on the left in gray or a neutral color it's off, and when it moves right and takes the primary color it's on. But","ar":"إنه على الشمال باللون الرمادي أو النيوترال يبقى في حالة Off، ولما يروح ناحية اليمين ويبقى له لون الـ Primary يبقى في حالة On. لكن لو عندي"},{"t":172.6,"en":"if I have two states, it's always better to write both off and on, not just one of them, so no one mistakes that single off or on for the toggle's label.","ar":"حالتين، يفضّل دايمًا إني أكتب Off وOn الاتنين، ماأكتبش واحد بس منهم، عشان ما يتفهمش إن الـ Off أو الـ On ده هو الـ Label بتاع الـ Toggle."}]},{"id":"S03","type":"card","part":"concept","icons":["toggle","check","text","eye"],"title":{"en":"Video summary","ar":"ملخص الفيديو"},"body":{"en":"A toggle is a digital on/off switch, like the light switch in a room: flip it and the change happens at once.\n\n- **Instant changes only.** If nothing happens until people tap Search or Save, use a checkbox or radio buttons instead.\n- **Short, direct label.** Say it aloud with \"on\" or \"off\" after it: \"Direct flights only: on\" makes sense. Avoid long or negative labels.\n- **Unmistakable state.** Use a strong colour for On. If you show state words, show both Off and On, one on each side; one word alone reads like the toggle's name.","ar":"الـ Toggle مفتاح تشغيل وإيقاف رقمي، مثل مفتاح النور في الغرفة: تضغطه فيحدث التغيير فورًا.\n\n- **للتغييرات الفورية فقط.** إن كان لا شيء يحدث حتى يضغط الناس «ابحث» أو «حفظ»، فاستخدم Checkbox أو Radio buttons بدلًا منه.\n- **اسم قصير ومباشر.** قل الاسم بصوت عالٍ وبعده «تشغيل» أو «إيقاف»: «رحلات مباشرة فقط: تشغيل» جملة مفهومة. وتجنّب الأسماء الطويلة أو المنفية.\n- **حالة واضحة بلا لبس.** استخدم لونًا قويًا لحالة التشغيل. وإن كتبت كلمات الحالة، فاكتب «إيقاف» و«تشغيل» معًا، كل واحدة في جهة؛ فالكلمة الوحيدة تُقرأ كأنها اسم الـ Toggle."}},{"id":"S04","type":"tune","part":"guided","skill":"SK-P14-U04-02","rules":["R06","R15"],"value":{"en":"Toggle switches (NN/g): keep labels for toggle switches short and direct. A long, negative label makes people work out what On means before they can use it.","ar":"الـ Toggle switches (NN/g): اجعل أسماء الـ Toggles قصيرة ومباشرة. فالاسم الطويل المنفي يجعل الناس يفكّرون في معنى التشغيل قبل أن يستخدموه."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/toggle-switch-guidelines/","quote":"Keep labels for toggle switches short and direct."},"scenario":{"en":"On the results page, a toggle changes the list right away. When it's on, the list shows direct flights only.","ar":"في صفحة النتائج، يوجد Toggle يغيّر القائمة فورًا. وحين يكون في وضع التشغيل، تعرض القائمة الرحلات المباشرة فقط."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each label. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل اسم. أيّها يجب أن يُطلق؟"},"start":"hide","options":[{"id":"hide","text":{"en":"\"Don't show flights that aren't direct\"","ar":"«لا تعرض الرحلات غير المباشرة»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"zad","name":{"en":"Zad Travel","ar":"زاد للسفر"},"color":"#6D28D9","icon":"airplane-tilt","domain":"zad.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Cairo → Dubai","ar":"القاهرة ← دبي"},"back":true,"actions":[{"icon":"sliders-horizontal","aria":{"en":"Filters","ar":"الفلاتر"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"toggle","text":{"en":"Don't show flights that aren't direct","ar":"لا تعرض الرحلات غير المباشرة"}},{"kind":"divider","gap":"s"},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"**08:40 → 12:15**  Direct  ·  EGP 9,800","ar":"**08:40 ← 12:15**  مباشرة  ·  9,800 جنيه"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"**10:05 → 17:30**  1 stop  ·  EGP 7,200","ar":"**10:05 ← 17:30**  توقّف واحد  ·  7,200 جنيه"},"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"direct","text":{"en":"\"Direct flights only\"","ar":"«رحلات مباشرة فقط»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"zad","name":{"en":"Zad Travel","ar":"زاد للسفر"},"color":"#6D28D9","icon":"airplane-tilt","domain":"zad.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Cairo → Dubai","ar":"القاهرة ← دبي"},"back":true,"actions":[{"icon":"sliders-horizontal","aria":{"en":"Filters","ar":"الفلاتر"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"toggle","text":{"en":"Direct flights only","ar":"رحلات مباشرة فقط"}},{"kind":"divider","gap":"s"},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"**08:40 → 12:15**  Direct  ·  EGP 9,800","ar":"**08:40 ← 12:15**  مباشرة  ·  9,800 جنيه"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"**10:05 → 17:30**  1 stop  ·  EGP 7,200","ar":"**10:05 ← 17:30**  توقّف واحد  ·  7,200 جنيه"},"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"setting","text":{"en":"\"Flight stops visibility setting\"","ar":"«إعداد ظهور الرحلات ذات التوقّف»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"zad","name":{"en":"Zad Travel","ar":"زاد للسفر"},"color":"#6D28D9","icon":"airplane-tilt","domain":"zad.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Cairo → Dubai","ar":"القاهرة ← دبي"},"back":true,"actions":[{"icon":"sliders-horizontal","aria":{"en":"Filters","ar":"الفلاتر"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"toggle","text":{"en":"Flight stops visibility setting","ar":"إعداد ظهور الرحلات ذات التوقّف"}},{"kind":"divider","gap":"s"},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"**08:40 → 12:15**  Direct  ·  EGP 9,800","ar":"**08:40 ← 12:15**  مباشرة  ·  9,800 جنيه"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"**10:05 → 17:30**  1 stop  ·  EGP 7,200","ar":"**10:05 ← 17:30**  توقّف واحد  ·  7,200 جنيه"},"gap":"s"}]}}],"answer":["direct"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P14-040","when":["hide"],"feedback":{"en":"Say it with \"on\": \"Don't show flights that aren't direct: on.\" People have to untangle two negatives to know what they'll see.","ar":"اقرأ الاسم وبعده «تشغيل»: «لا تعرض الرحلات غير المباشرة: تشغيل». فيضطر الناس إلى فهم نفيين ليعرفوا ماذا سيرون."}},{"id":"MC-P14-040","when":["setting"],"feedback":{"en":"\"Flight stops visibility setting: on\" still doesn't say what appears. A long technical label slows people down and hides the meaning.","ar":"«إعداد ظهور الرحلات ذات التوقّف: تشغيل» ما زالت لا تقول ماذا سيظهر. فالاسم الطويل التقني يبطئ الناس ويخفي المعنى."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Read each label with \"on\" after it. Which sentence is clear?","ar":"اقرأ كل اسم وبعده «تشغيل». أيّ جملة واضحة؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Short and direct: \"Direct flights only\".","ar":"قصير ومباشر: «رحلات مباشرة فقط»."},"explain":{"en":"\"Direct flights only: on\" reads as a plain sentence, and the list changes to match the moment people flip it.","ar":"«رحلات مباشرة فقط: تشغيل» جملة بسيطة، وتتغيّر القائمة لتطابقها لحظة الضغط على الـ Toggle."},"speaker":"tarek"},{"id":"S05","type":"tune","part":"guided","skill":"SK-P14-U04-05","rules":["R06","R15"],"confidence":true,"value":{"en":"Toggle switches (NN/g): if only one descriptor is present beside a toggle, it can be taken for a toggle label. Show both Off and On, one on each side.","ar":"الـ Toggle switches (NN/g): إن كانت بجانب الـ Toggle كلمة وصف واحدة فقط، فقد تُفهم على أنها اسمه. اكتب «إيقاف» و«تشغيل» معًا، كل واحدة في جهة."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/toggle-switch-guidelines/","quote":"If only one descriptor is present beside a toggle, it can be taken for a toggle label."},"scenario":{"en":"In the app settings, a toggle sends a reminder to check in for each flight. Its name, \"Check-in reminders\", sits above it. Our designer wants a state word next to the switch. Right now the reminders are off.","ar":"في إعدادات التطبيق، يوجد Toggle يرسل تذكيرًا بإنهاء إجراءات السفر لكل رحلة. واسمه «تذكير بإجراءات السفر» مكتوب فوقه. ويريد مصمّمنا كلمة حالة بجانب المفتاح. والتذكير الآن متوقّف."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each version. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل نسخة. أيّها يجب أن تُطلق؟"},"start":"on","options":[{"id":"on","text":{"en":"The word \"On\" beside the switch","ar":"كلمة «تشغيل» بجانب المفتاح"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"zad","name":{"en":"Zad Travel","ar":"زاد للسفر"},"color":"#6D28D9","icon":"airplane-tilt","domain":"zad.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Notifications","ar":"الإشعارات"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Settings","ar":"الإعدادات"}},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Check-in reminders","ar":"تذكير بإجراءات السفر"}},{"kind":"toggle","text":{"en":"On","ar":"تشغيل"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"divider","gap":"s"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"tag","text":{"en":"Price alerts","ar":"تنبيهات الأسعار"},"chevron":true,"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"off","text":{"en":"The word \"Off\" beside the switch","ar":"كلمة «إيقاف» بجانب المفتاح"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"zad","name":{"en":"Zad Travel","ar":"زاد للسفر"},"color":"#6D28D9","icon":"airplane-tilt","domain":"zad.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Notifications","ar":"الإشعارات"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Settings","ar":"الإعدادات"}},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Check-in reminders","ar":"تذكير بإجراءات السفر"}},{"kind":"toggle","text":{"en":"Off","ar":"إيقاف"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"divider","gap":"s"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"tag","text":{"en":"Price alerts","ar":"تنبيهات الأسعار"},"chevron":true,"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"both","text":{"en":"\"Off\" and \"On\", one on each side","ar":"«إيقاف» و«تشغيل»، كل واحدة في جهة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"zad","name":{"en":"Zad Travel","ar":"زاد للسفر"},"color":"#6D28D9","icon":"airplane-tilt","domain":"zad.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Notifications","ar":"الإشعارات"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Settings","ar":"الإعدادات"}},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Check-in reminders","ar":"تذكير بإجراءات السفر"}},{"kind":"row","gap":"xs","blocks":[{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Off","ar":"إيقاف"}},{"kind":"toggle","text":""},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"On","ar":"تشغيل"}}]},{"kind":"divider","gap":"s"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"tag","text":{"en":"Price alerts","ar":"تنبيهات الأسعار"},"chevron":true,"gap":"s"}]}}],"answer":["both"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P14-041","when":["on"],"feedback":{"en":"The switch is off, but the only word beside it says \"On\". Is that the state, or what flipping it does? Some people will think the reminders already work.","ar":"المفتاح متوقّف، لكن الكلمة الوحيدة بجانبه تقول «تشغيل». هل هذه هي الحالة، أم ما يفعله الضغط عليه؟ وسيظن بعض الناس أن التذكير يعمل بالفعل."}},{"id":"MC-P14-041","when":["off"],"feedback":{"en":"One word beside a switch reads like its name. Does flipping it turn \"Off\" on? People can't be sure whether they're switching reminders on or off.","ar":"الكلمة الوحيدة بجانب المفتاح تُقرأ كأنها اسمه. هل الضغط عليه يشغّل «إيقاف»؟ فلا يتأكّد الناس هل يشغّلون التذكير أم يوقفونه."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Flip the switch in each version. Does the word still tell the truth?","ar":"اضغط المفتاح في كل نسخة. هل ما زالت الكلمة صحيحة؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Both words, one on each side.","ar":"الكلمتان معًا، كل واحدة في جهة."},"explain":{"en":"With Off on one side and On on the other, the knob points at the current state, and no word can be mistaken for the setting's name.","ar":"حين تكون «إيقاف» في جهة و«تشغيل» في الجهة الأخرى، يشير المفتاح إلى الحالة الحالية، ولا تُفهم أي كلمة على أنها اسم الإعداد."},"speaker":"tarek"},{"id":"S06","type":"compare","part":"contrast","skill":"SK-P14-U04-02","rules":["R11"],"value":{"en":"Toggle switches (NN/g): when in doubt, say the label aloud and append \"on/off\" to the end. \"Price display: on\" doesn't say what changes; \"Show total for all travellers: on\" does.","ar":"الـ Toggle switches (NN/g): إن لم تكن متأكدًا، فقل الاسم بصوت عالٍ وأضف بعده «تشغيل/إيقاف». «طريقة عرض السعر: تشغيل» لا تقول ما الذي يتغيّر؛ أما «اعرض الإجمالي لكل المسافرين: تشغيل» فتقول."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/toggle-switch-guidelines/","quote":"When in doubt, say the label aloud and append \"on/off\" to the end."},"scenario":{"en":"A family of four searches for flights. A toggle on the results page switches prices at once from one traveller to the total for everyone.","ar":"أسرة من أربعة أفراد تبحث عن رحلات. وفي صفحة النتائج يوجد Toggle يحوّل الأسعار فورًا من سعر المسافر الواحد إلى الإجمالي لكل الأسرة."},"prompt":{"en":"Which version should ship?","ar":"أيّ نسخة يجب أن تُطلق؟"},"a":{"label":{"en":"Version A: \"Price display\"","ar":"النسخة A: «طريقة عرض السعر»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"zad","name":{"en":"Zad Travel","ar":"زاد للسفر"},"color":"#6D28D9","icon":"airplane-tilt","domain":"zad.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Cairo → Dubai · 3 travellers","ar":"القاهرة ← دبي · 3 مسافرين"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"toggle","text":{"en":"Price display","ar":"طريقة عرض السعر"}},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"**08:40 → 12:15**  EGP 9,800","ar":"**08:40 ← 12:15**  9,800 جنيه"},"gap":"s"}]}},"b":{"label":{"en":"Version B: \"Show total for all travellers\"","ar":"النسخة B: «اعرض الإجمالي لكل المسافرين»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"zad","name":{"en":"Zad Travel","ar":"زاد للسفر"},"color":"#6D28D9","icon":"airplane-tilt","domain":"zad.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Cairo → Dubai · 3 travellers","ar":"القاهرة ← دبي · 3 مسافرين"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"toggle","text":{"en":"Show total for all travellers","ar":"اعرض الإجمالي لكل المسافرين"}},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"**08:40 → 12:15**  EGP 9,800","ar":"**08:40 ← 12:15**  9,800 جنيه"},"gap":"s"}]}},"answer":"b","misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P14-040","when":["a"],"feedback":{"en":"\"Price display: on\" means nothing. People have to flip it and compare numbers to find out what it does, and may book thinking EGP 9,800 is the family total.","ar":"«طريقة عرض السعر: تشغيل» بلا معنى. فيضطر الناس إلى الضغط عليه ومقارنة الأرقام ليعرفوا ماذا يفعل، وقد يحجزون وهم يظنون أن 9,800 جنيه هي إجمالي الأسرة."}}],"correct":{"en":"B: it says what turning it on does.","ar":"B: تقول ماذا يفعل التشغيل."},"explain":{"en":"\"Show total for all travellers: on\" is a clear sentence, so the family knows which price they're looking at before they flip anything.","ar":"«اعرض الإجمالي لكل المسافرين: تشغيل» جملة واضحة، فتعرف الأسرة أي سعر تنظر إليه قبل أن تضغط أي شيء."},"speaker":"tarek"},{"id":"S07","type":"tune","speaker":"karim","part":"independent","skill":"SK-P14-U04-04","rules":["R14"],"value":{"en":"Toggle switches (NN/g): toggle switches are digital on/off switches and should take immediate effect. Lights that change the moment people tap are exactly that, so an extra Apply step only adds doubt.","ar":"الـ Toggle switches (NN/g): الـ Toggle مفتاح تشغيل وإيقاف رقمي، ويجب أن يكون أثره فوريًا. والأنوار التي تتغيّر لحظة الضغط هي هذا بالضبط، فخطوة «تطبيق» الإضافية لا تضيف إلا الشك."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/toggle-switch-guidelines/","quote":"Toggle switches are digital on/off switches."},"scenario":{"en":"I'm building a smart-home app. The lights in each room can switch on or off straight from the phone, with no delay.","ar":"أبني تطبيقًا للبيت الذكي. ويمكن تشغيل الأنوار في كل غرفة أو إطفاؤها من الموبايل مباشرة، دون تأخير."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each version. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل نسخة. أيّها يجب أن تُطلق؟"},"start":"check","options":[{"id":"check","text":{"en":"Checkboxes, then an Apply button","ar":"Checkboxes، ثم زر «طبّق»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"mesbah","name":{"en":"Mesbah","ar":"مصباح"},"color":"#3B5BDB","icon":"lightbulb","domain":"mesbah.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Home","ar":"البيت"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"hotel-room","size":"s","alt":{"en":"Living room","ar":"غرفة المعيشة"}},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Lights","ar":"الأنوار"}},{"kind":"check","text":{"en":"Living room","ar":"غرفة المعيشة"},"selected":true,"gap":"s"},{"kind":"check","text":{"en":"Kitchen","ar":"المطبخ"}},{"kind":"check","text":{"en":"Bedroom","ar":"غرفة النوم"}}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Apply","ar":"طبّق"}}]}},{"id":"radio","text":{"en":"On and Off radio buttons for each room, then Save","ar":"Radio buttons «تشغيل» و«إطفاء» لكل غرفة، ثم «حفظ»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"mesbah","name":{"en":"Mesbah","ar":"مصباح"},"color":"#3B5BDB","icon":"lightbulb","domain":"mesbah.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Home","ar":"البيت"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"hotel-room","size":"s","alt":{"en":"Living room","ar":"غرفة المعيشة"}},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Living room","ar":"غرفة المعيشة"}},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"On","ar":"تشغيل"},"selected":true,"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Off","ar":"إطفاء"}},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Kitchen","ar":"المطبخ"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"On","ar":"تشغيل"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Off","ar":"إطفاء"},"selected":true}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Save","ar":"حفظ"}}]}},{"id":"toggle","text":{"en":"A toggle for each room that works at once","ar":"Toggle لكل غرفة يعمل فورًا"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"mesbah","name":{"en":"Mesbah","ar":"مصباح"},"color":"#3B5BDB","icon":"lightbulb","domain":"mesbah.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Home","ar":"البيت"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"hotel-room","size":"s","alt":{"en":"Living room","ar":"غرفة المعيشة"}},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Lights","ar":"الأنوار"}},{"kind":"toggle","text":{"en":"Living room","ar":"غرفة المعيشة"},"selected":true,"gap":"s"},{"kind":"toggle","text":{"en":"Kitchen","ar":"المطبخ"}},{"kind":"toggle","text":{"en":"Bedroom","ar":"غرفة النوم"}}]}}],"answer":["toggle"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P14-038","when":["check","radio"],"feedback":{"en":"The lights can change the moment people tap, but this version makes them wait for a button. People tap a room, nothing happens, and they wonder whether the house heard them.","ar":"الأنوار يمكن أن تتغيّر لحظة الضغط، لكن هذه النسخة تجعل الناس ينتظرون زرًا. فيضغطون على غرفة، ولا يحدث شيء، ويتساءلون هل استجاب البيت."}}],"correct":{"en":"An instant change: a toggle per room.","ar":"تغيير فوري: Toggle لكل غرفة."},"explain":{"en":"Each toggle works like the switch on the wall: flip it and the light changes, with nothing else to press.","ar":"كل Toggle يعمل مثل المفتاح على الحائط: تضغطه فيتغيّر النور، دون حاجة إلى ضغط أي زر آخر."}},{"id":"S08","type":"card","part":"recap","icons":["toggle","text","eye"],"title":{"en":"What you practised","ar":"ما تدرّبت عليه"},"body":{"en":"- **Toggles for instant changes only;** a choice that waits for Search or Save is a checkbox.\n- **Short, direct labels** that make sense with \"on\" after them.\n- **Both Off and On**, or no state word at all, so the state can't be misread.\n\nNext: the skill check.","ar":"- **الـ Toggle للتغييرات الفورية فقط؛** والاختيار الذي ينتظر «ابحث» أو «حفظ» يكون Checkbox.\n- **أسماء قصيرة ومباشرة** تكون مفهومة حين تأتي بعدها «تشغيل».\n- **«إيقاف» و«تشغيل» معًا**، أو بدون كلمة حالة أصلًا، حتى لا تُفهم الحالة خطأً.\n\nالتالي: اختبار المهارة."}}]}$uxg$::jsonb),
  ($uxg$P14-U04-L04$uxg$, $uxg$c2ea84c5335071e40f8612ded5630aca645fed59fb1e52a75097d54c38749577$uxg$, $uxg${"id":"P14-U04-L04","mode":"check","minutes":7,"title":{"en":"Skill check: choices people can trust","ar":"اختبار المهارة: اختيارات يثق بها الناس"},"speaker":"hana","steps":[{"id":"S01","type":"card","part":"hook","title":{"en":"Hana's gym app","ar":"هناء وتطبيق النادي الرياضي"},"body":{"en":"My chain of gyms is about to launch an app. Members book classes, pick a trainer and manage their membership. Help me review its choices before launch.\n\nThis is a skill check: no hints, and you'll see how you did at the end.","ar":"سلسلة النوادي الرياضية التي أملكها على وشك إطلاق تطبيق. يحجز فيه الأعضاء الحصص، ويختارون المدرّب، ويديرون اشتراكهم. ساعدني في مراجعة الاختيارات فيه قبل الإطلاق.\n\nهذا اختبار مهارة: بدون تلميحات، وسترى نتيجتك في النهاية."}},{"id":"S02","type":"tune","part":"check","skill":"SK-P14-U04-03","value":{"en":"Check, checkboxes vs. radio buttons (NN/g): always offer a default selection for radio button lists, and when people may not want to choose, provide a choice for that, such as \"None\".","ar":"اختبار، الـ Checkboxes مقابل الـ Radio buttons (NN/g): ابدأ قائمة الـ Radio buttons دائمًا باختيار محدَّد، وحين قد لا يريد الناس الاختيار، أضف اختيارًا لذلك، مثل «لا شيء»."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/checkboxes-vs-radio-buttons/","quote":"Always offer a default selection for radio button lists."},"scenario":{"en":"When booking a personal-training session, members can ask for a female or a male trainer. Some members prefer one, and some have no preference.","ar":"عند حجز حصة تدريب شخصي، يمكن للأعضاء أن يطلبوا مدرّبة أو مدرّبًا. بعض الأعضاء يفضّلون أحدهما، وبعضهم لا يهمّه ذلك."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each version. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل نسخة. أيّها يجب أن تُطلق؟"},"start":"empty","options":[{"id":"empty","text":{"en":"Female or male trainer, nothing selected","ar":"مدرّبة أو مدرّب، دون اختيار محدَّد"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Personal training","ar":"تدريب شخصي"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"barbell","text":{"en":"Strength session · 60 min","ar":"حصة قوة · 60 دقيقة"},"sub":{"en":"Sat 6:00 pm","ar":"السبت 6:00 م"},"value":{"en":"EGP 250","ar":"250 جنيه"}},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Trainer","ar":"المدرّب"}},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Female trainer","ar":"مدرّبة"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Male trainer","ar":"مدرّب"}}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Book session","ar":"احجز الحصة"}}]}},{"id":"nopref","text":{"en":"Add \"No preference\", selected","ar":"أضف «لا يهم»، وهو محدَّد"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Personal training","ar":"تدريب شخصي"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"barbell","text":{"en":"Strength session · 60 min","ar":"حصة قوة · 60 دقيقة"},"sub":{"en":"Sat 6:00 pm","ar":"السبت 6:00 م"},"value":{"en":"EGP 250","ar":"250 جنيه"}},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Trainer","ar":"المدرّب"}},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"No preference","ar":"لا يهم"},"selected":true,"gap":"s"},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Female trainer","ar":"مدرّبة"}},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Male trainer","ar":"مدرّب"}}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Book session","ar":"احجز الحصة"}}]}},{"id":"female","text":{"en":"Female or male trainer, Female selected","ar":"مدرّبة أو مدرّب، و«مدرّبة» محدَّد"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Personal training","ar":"تدريب شخصي"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"barbell","text":{"en":"Strength session · 60 min","ar":"حصة قوة · 60 دقيقة"},"sub":{"en":"Sat 6:00 pm","ar":"السبت 6:00 م"},"value":{"en":"EGP 250","ar":"250 جنيه"}},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Trainer","ar":"المدرّب"}},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Female trainer","ar":"مدرّبة"},"selected":true,"gap":"s"},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Male trainer","ar":"مدرّب"}}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Book session","ar":"احجز الحصة"}}]}}],"answer":["nopref"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P14-036","when":["empty"],"feedback":{"en":"Members who don't mind have no true answer, and once they tap one they can't clear it.","ar":"الأعضاء الذين لا يهمّهم ذلك ليست لهم إجابة صحيحة، وبعد أن يضغطوا على اختيار لا يستطيعون إلغاءه."}},{"id":"MC-P14-036","when":["female"],"feedback":{"en":"Most members keep the default, so the gym would book female trainers for people who never asked for one.","ar":"أغلب الأعضاء يُبقون الاختيار الافتراضي، فسيحجز النادي مدرّبات لأشخاص لم يطلبوا ذلك."}}],"correct":{"en":"\"No preference\", selected.","ar":"«لا يهم»، وهو محدَّد."},"explain":{"en":"The most common answer is the start, and anyone with a preference changes it in one tap.","ar":"الإجابة الأكثر شيوعًا هي البداية، ومن عنده تفضيل يغيّره بضغطة واحدة."},"speaker":"hana"},{"id":"S03","type":"tune","part":"check","skill":"SK-P14-U04-01","value":{"en":"Check, checkboxes (NN/g): display your list vertically. Side by side in one tight line, it's hard to align the labels with the right checkbox.","ar":"اختبار، الـ Checkboxes (NN/g): اعرض القائمة رأسيًا. فجنبًا إلى جنب في سطر واحد ضيّق، يصعب ربط كل اسم بالـ Checkbox الصحيح."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/checkboxes-design-guidelines/","quote":"Display your list vertically."},"scenario":{"en":"Members tick the days they can come to class, as many as they like.","ar":"يختار الأعضاء الأيام التي يستطيعون فيها حضور الحصص، بالعدد الذي يريدونه."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each version. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل نسخة. أيّها يجب أن تُطلق؟"},"start":"line","options":[{"id":"line","text":{"en":"All days in one line","ar":"كل الأيام في سطر واحد"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Your schedule","ar":"جدولك"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Days you can come","ar":"الأيام التي تناسبك"}},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"☑ Sat ☐ Sun ☑ Mon ☐ Tue ☐ Wed","ar":"☑ السبت ☐ الأحد ☑ الاثنين ☐ الثلاثاء ☐ الأربعاء"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Save","ar":"حفظ"}}]}},{"id":"round","text":{"en":"One day per line, with round markers","ar":"يوم واحد في كل سطر، بعلامات دائرية"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Your schedule","ar":"جدولك"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Days you can come","ar":"الأيام التي تناسبك"}},{"kind":"check","marker":"round","text":{"en":"Saturday","ar":"السبت"},"selected":true,"gap":"s"},{"kind":"check","marker":"round","text":{"en":"Sunday","ar":"الأحد"}},{"kind":"check","marker":"round","text":{"en":"Monday","ar":"الاثنين"},"selected":true},{"kind":"check","marker":"round","text":{"en":"Tuesday","ar":"الثلاثاء"}},{"kind":"check","marker":"round","text":{"en":"Wednesday","ar":"الأربعاء"}},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Save","ar":"حفظ"}}]}},{"id":"list","text":{"en":"One day per line, with square checkboxes","ar":"يوم واحد في كل سطر، بـ Checkboxes مربعة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Your schedule","ar":"جدولك"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Days you can come","ar":"الأيام التي تناسبك"}},{"kind":"check","text":{"en":"Saturday","ar":"السبت"},"selected":true,"gap":"s"},{"kind":"check","text":{"en":"Sunday","ar":"الأحد"}},{"kind":"check","text":{"en":"Monday","ar":"الاثنين"},"selected":true},{"kind":"check","text":{"en":"Tuesday","ar":"الثلاثاء"}},{"kind":"check","text":{"en":"Wednesday","ar":"الأربعاء"}},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Save","ar":"حفظ"}}]}}],"answer":["list"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P14-034","when":["line"],"feedback":{"en":"In one line each box sits between two days, so members can't tell which day they ticked.","ar":"في سطر واحد يقع كل مربع بين يومين، فلا يعرف الأعضاء أي يوم اختاروه."}},{"id":"MC-P14-033","when":["round"],"feedback":{"en":"Round markers say \"pick one\", so members may choose a single day though they can come on several.","ar":"العلامات الدائرية تقول «اختر واحدًا»، فقد يختار الأعضاء يومًا واحدًا مع أنهم يستطيعون الحضور في أكثر من يوم."}}],"correct":{"en":"One per line, square checkboxes.","ar":"يوم في كل سطر، بـ Checkboxes مربعة."},"explain":{"en":"Each box sits next to its own day, and the square says members can tick as many as they like.","ar":"كل مربع بجانب يومه، والشكل المربع يقول إن الأعضاء يستطيعون اختيار ما يريدون من الأيام."},"speaker":"hana"},{"id":"S04","type":"tune","part":"check","skill":"SK-P14-U04-04","value":{"en":"Check, checkboxes vs. radio buttons (NN/g): use checkboxes and radio buttons only to change settings, not as action buttons that make something happen. Cancelling a class is an action.","ar":"اختبار، الـ Checkboxes مقابل الـ Radio buttons (NN/g): استخدم الـ Checkboxes والـ Radio buttons لتغيير الإعدادات فقط، لا كأزرار تجعل شيئًا يحدث. وإلغاء الحصة فعل."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/checkboxes-vs-radio-buttons/","quote":"Use checkboxes and radio buttons only to change settings, not as action buttons that make something happen."},"scenario":{"en":"On a booked class, members need a way to cancel their place, so someone on the waiting list can take it.","ar":"في صفحة الحصة المحجوزة، يحتاج الأعضاء إلى طريقة لإلغاء مكانهم، حتى يأخذه شخص من قائمة الانتظار."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each version. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل نسخة. أيّها يجب أن تُطلق؟"},"start":"radio","options":[{"id":"radio","text":{"en":"Radio buttons, Keep or Cancel, that act as soon as one is picked","ar":"Radio buttons، «احتفظ» أو «ألغِ»، تعمل بمجرد اختيار أحدها"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"Picking Cancel cancels at once","ar":"اختيار «ألغِ» يلغي فورًا"},"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"My bookings","ar":"حجوزاتي"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"gym","size":"s","alt":{"en":"Spinning room","ar":"صالة Spinning"}},{"kind":"badge","tone":"good","icon":"check-circle","text":{"en":"Booked","ar":"محجوز"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Spinning · Mon 7:00 pm","ar":"Spinning · الاثنين 7:00 م"}},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Keep my place","ar":"احتفظ بمكاني"},"selected":true,"gap":"s"},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Cancel my place","ar":"ألغِ مكاني"}}]}},{"id":"check","text":{"en":"A checkbox that cancels as soon as it's ticked","ar":"Checkbox يلغي بمجرد اختياره"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"Ticking cancels at once","ar":"الاختيار يلغي فورًا"},"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"My bookings","ar":"حجوزاتي"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"gym","size":"s","alt":{"en":"Spinning room","ar":"صالة Spinning"}},{"kind":"badge","tone":"good","icon":"check-circle","text":{"en":"Booked","ar":"محجوز"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Spinning · Mon 7:00 pm","ar":"Spinning · الاثنين 7:00 م"}},{"kind":"check","text":{"en":"Cancel my place","ar":"ألغِ مكاني"},"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"button","text":{"en":"A \"Cancel my place\" button","ar":"زر «ألغِ مكاني»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"My bookings","ar":"حجوزاتي"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"gym","size":"s","alt":{"en":"Spinning room","ar":"صالة Spinning"}},{"kind":"badge","tone":"good","icon":"check-circle","text":{"en":"Booked","ar":"محجوز"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Spinning · Mon 7:00 pm","ar":"Spinning · الاثنين 7:00 م"}}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","style":"dangerlink","text":{"en":"Cancel my place","ar":"ألغِ مكاني"}}]}}],"answer":["button"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P14-038","when":["radio","check"],"feedback":{"en":"This looks like a setting, so members tap it to explore. One tap gives their place away to someone on the waiting list.","ar":"يبدو هذا إعدادًا، فيضغط عليه الأعضاء ليستكشفوا. وضغطة واحدة تعطي مكانهم لشخص في قائمة الانتظار."}}],"correct":{"en":"An action: a button.","ar":"إجراء: زر."},"explain":{"en":"A button says pressing it makes something happen, so members only cancel when they mean to.","ar":"الزر يقول إن الضغط عليه يجعل شيئًا يحدث، فلا يلغي الأعضاء إلا حين يقصدون ذلك."},"speaker":"hana"},{"id":"S05","type":"tune","part":"check","skill":"SK-P14-U04-05","value":{"en":"Check, toggle switches (NN/g): if only one descriptor is present beside a toggle, it can be taken for a toggle label. Put the setting's name right beside the switch, and let the switch show the state.","ar":"اختبار، الـ Toggle switches (NN/g): إن كانت بجانب الـ Toggle كلمة وصف واحدة فقط، فقد تُفهم على أنها اسمه. ضع اسم الإعداد بجانب المفتاح مباشرة، واترك المفتاح يوضّح الحالة."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/toggle-switch-guidelines/","quote":"If only one descriptor is present beside a toggle, it can be taken for a toggle label."},"scenario":{"en":"A toggle sends members a reminder an hour before each class. Reminders are off right now.","ar":"يوجد Toggle يرسل للأعضاء تذكيرًا قبل كل حصة بساعة. والتذكير الآن متوقّف."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each version. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل نسخة. أيّها يجب أن تُطلق؟"},"start":"enabled","options":[{"id":"enabled","text":{"en":"Name above, the word \"Enabled\" beside the switch","ar":"الاسم فوق، وكلمة «مفعّل» بجانب المفتاح"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Settings","ar":"الإعدادات"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Notifications","ar":"الإشعارات"}},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Class reminders","ar":"تذكير بالحصص"}},{"kind":"toggle","text":{"en":"Enabled","ar":"مفعّل"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"divider","gap":"s"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"tag","text":{"en":"Offers","ar":"العروض"},"chevron":true,"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"name","text":{"en":"The name beside the switch, no state word","ar":"الاسم بجانب المفتاح، بدون كلمة حالة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Settings","ar":"الإعدادات"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Notifications","ar":"الإشعارات"}},{"kind":"toggle","text":{"en":"Class reminders","ar":"تذكير بالحصص"}},{"kind":"divider","gap":"s"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"tag","text":{"en":"Offers","ar":"العروض"},"chevron":true,"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"disabled","text":{"en":"Name above, the word \"Disabled\" beside the switch","ar":"الاسم فوق، وكلمة «غير مفعّل» بجانب المفتاح"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Settings","ar":"الإعدادات"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Notifications","ar":"الإشعارات"}},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Class reminders","ar":"تذكير بالحصص"}},{"kind":"toggle","text":{"en":"Disabled","ar":"غير مفعّل"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"divider","gap":"s"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"tag","text":{"en":"Offers","ar":"العروض"},"chevron":true,"gap":"s"}]}}],"answer":["name"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P14-041","when":["enabled"],"feedback":{"en":"The switch is off, yet the only word beside it says \"Enabled\". Members may think reminders already work.","ar":"المفتاح متوقّف، لكن الكلمة الوحيدة بجانبه تقول «مفعّل». فقد يظن الأعضاء أن التذكير يعمل بالفعل."}},{"id":"MC-P14-041","when":["disabled"],"feedback":{"en":"One word beside a switch reads like its name: does flipping it turn \"Disabled\" on? Members can't be sure what they're switching.","ar":"الكلمة الوحيدة بجانب المفتاح تُقرأ كأنها اسمه: هل الضغط عليه يشغّل «غير مفعّل»؟ فلا يتأكّد الأعضاء ماذا يغيّرون."}}],"correct":{"en":"Name beside the switch; the switch shows the state.","ar":"الاسم بجانب المفتاح؛ والمفتاح يوضّح الحالة."},"explain":{"en":"\"Class reminders\" next to the switch can only be read as the setting, and the switch's position and colour say whether it's on.","ar":"«تذكير بالحصص» بجانب المفتاح لا تُفهم إلا على أنها اسم الإعداد، ووضع المفتاح ولونه يقولان هل هو يعمل."},"speaker":"hana"},{"id":"S06","type":"tune","part":"check","skill":"SK-P14-U04-02","value":{"en":"Check, checkboxes (NN/g): ensure that all your label statements are worded positively; negative statements force users to contemplate double negatives.","ar":"اختبار، الـ Checkboxes (NN/g): تأكّد أن كل الأسماء مكتوبة بصيغة إيجابية؛ فالصيغ المنفية تجبر الناس على التفكير في نفي النفي."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/checkboxes-design-guidelines/","quote":"Ensure that all your label statements are worded positively."},"scenario":{"en":"On the membership page, one checkbox decides whether the membership renews by itself at the end of the month.","ar":"في صفحة الاشتراك، يوجد Checkbox واحد يحدّد هل يتجدّد الاشتراك تلقائيًا في نهاية الشهر."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each label. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل اسم. أيّها يجب أن يُطلق؟"},"start":"dont","options":[{"id":"dont","text":{"en":"\"Don't renew my membership automatically\"","ar":"«لا تجدّد اشتراكي تلقائيًا»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Membership","ar":"العضوية"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"card","art":"gym","blocks":[{"kind":"badge","text":{"en":"Active","ar":"نشط"},"tone":"good"},{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"EGP 600","ar":"600 جنيه"},"per":{"en":"/ month","ar":"/ شهر"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Next payment: 1 Dec","ar":"الدفعة القادمة: 1 ديسمبر"},"gap":"xs"}]},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Monthly membership","ar":"الاشتراك الشهري"}},{"kind":"check","text":{"en":"Don't renew my membership automatically","ar":"لا تجدّد اشتراكي تلقائيًا"},"gap":"s"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Save","ar":"حفظ"}}]}},{"id":"auto","text":{"en":"\"Auto-renewal\"","ar":"«التجديد التلقائي»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Membership","ar":"العضوية"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"card","art":"gym","blocks":[{"kind":"badge","text":{"en":"Active","ar":"نشط"},"tone":"good"},{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"EGP 600","ar":"600 جنيه"},"per":{"en":"/ month","ar":"/ شهر"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Next payment: 1 Dec","ar":"الدفعة القادمة: 1 ديسمبر"},"gap":"xs"}]},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Monthly membership","ar":"الاشتراك الشهري"}},{"kind":"check","text":{"en":"Auto-renewal","ar":"التجديد التلقائي"},"gap":"s"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Save","ar":"حفظ"}}]}},{"id":"renew","text":{"en":"\"Renew my membership each month\"","ar":"«جدّد اشتراكي كل شهر»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Membership","ar":"العضوية"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"card","art":"gym","blocks":[{"kind":"badge","text":{"en":"Active","ar":"نشط"},"tone":"good"},{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"EGP 600","ar":"600 جنيه"},"per":{"en":"/ month","ar":"/ شهر"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Next payment: 1 Dec","ar":"الدفعة القادمة: 1 ديسمبر"},"gap":"xs"}]},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Monthly membership","ar":"الاشتراك الشهري"}},{"kind":"check","text":{"en":"Renew my membership each month","ar":"جدّد اشتراكي كل شهر"},"gap":"s"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Save","ar":"حفظ"}}]}}],"answer":["renew"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P14-035","when":["dont"],"feedback":{"en":"A tick means \"don't\", so members must work through a negative to know whether they'll be charged next month.","ar":"علامة الصح تعني «لا»، فيضطر الأعضاء إلى فهم صيغة منفية ليعرفوا هل سيُخصم منهم الشهر القادم."}},{"id":"MC-P14-035","when":["auto"],"feedback":{"en":"\"Auto-renewal\" names a topic, not what the tick does. Members may tick it to read more, or to turn it off.","ar":"«التجديد التلقائي» تذكر موضوعًا، لا ما يفعله الاختيار. فقد يختاره الأعضاء ليعرفوا أكثر، أو ليوقفوه."}}],"correct":{"en":"Positive and active: say what ticking does.","ar":"صيغة إيجابية: قل ما يفعله الاختيار."},"explain":{"en":"A tick means the membership renews, an empty box means it ends. No one is charged by surprise.","ar":"علامة الصح تعني أن الاشتراك يتجدّد، والمربع الفارغ يعني أنه ينتهي. فلا يُخصم من أحد دون أن يتوقّع."},"speaker":"hana"}]}$uxg$::jsonb),
  ($uxg$P14-U05-L01$uxg$, $uxg$ad559fb384ddb7ff0c97c24a95fc8048f9a9e6f169e74da769ffec586a5be42c$uxg$, $uxg${"id":"P14-U05-L01","mode":"lesson","minutes":8,"title":{"en":"Short forms, one path","ar":"نماذج قصيرة، واتجاه واحد"},"speaker":"youssef","review_labels":{"MC-P14-042":{"en":"Every extra field costs finished forms","ar":"كل حقل زائد يقلّل عدد من يكملون النموذج"},"MC-P14-043":{"en":"One column keeps people moving down the form","ar":"العمود الواحد يُبقي الناس يتحركون إلى أسفل النموذج"},"MC-P14-044":{"en":"Put each label right next to its own field","ar":"ضع اسم كل حقل بجانب حقله مباشرة"},"MC-P14-045":{"en":"Order fields the way people find the information","ar":"رتّب الحقول بالترتيب الذي يجد به الناس المعلومات"}},"steps":[{"id":"S01","type":"card","part":"hook","title":{"en":"Youssef's bookshop sign-up","ar":"التسجيل في مكتبة يوسف"},"body":{"en":"I run an online bookshop, and I'm planning its sign-up form. To buy, an account only needs a name, an email and a password. The delivery address is asked later, at checkout.\n\nMy marketing team wants more: phone, birthday, city, job title, and \"How did you hear about us?\".","ar":"أدير مكتبة على الإنترنت، وأخطّط لنموذج التسجيل فيها. وللشراء، يحتاج الحساب فقط إلى اسم وبريد إلكتروني وكلمة مرور. أما عنوان التوصيل فيُطلب لاحقًا، عند إتمام الطلب.\n\nويريد فريق التسويق عندي حقولًا أكثر: الهاتف، وتاريخ الميلاد، والمدينة، والوظيفة، و«كيف عرفت عنّا؟»."},"mock":{"app":{"id":"waraq","name":{"en":"Waraq","ar":"ورق"},"color":"#9A3412","icon":"books","domain":"waraq.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Create your account","ar":"أنشئ حسابك"},"back":true,"logo":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Join Waraq to track your orders","ar":"انضم إلى ورق لتتابع طلباتك"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Full name","ar":"الاسم بالكامل"},"text":""},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Email","ar":"البريد الإلكتروني"},"text":""},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Password","ar":"كلمة المرور"},"text":""}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Create account","ar":"أنشئ الحساب"}}]}},{"id":"S02","type":"tune","part":"try","skill":"SK-P14-U05-01","rules":["R12"],"confidence":true,"value":{"en":"Try first. Web forms (NN/g): every time you cut a field or question from a form, you increase its conversion rate. Fields the account doesn't need now only add work before the first purchase.","ar":"جرّب أولًا. النماذج في المواقع (NN/g): كلما حذفت حقلًا أو سؤالًا من النموذج، زاد عدد من يكملونه. والحقول التي لا يحتاجها الحساب الآن تضيف عملًا فقط قبل أول عملية شراء."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/web-form-design/","quote":"Every time you cut a field or question from a form, you increase its conversion rate"},"prompt":{"en":"Try each version of the sign-up form. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل نسخة من نموذج التسجيل. أيّ نسخة تجعل أكبر عدد من الناس يكملون التسجيل ويشترون؟"},"start":"all","options":[{"id":"all","text":{"en":"All 8 fields, all required","ar":"الحقول الـ 8 كلها، وكلها مطلوبة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"waraq","name":{"en":"Waraq","ar":"ورق"},"color":"#9A3412","icon":"books","domain":"waraq.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Create your account","ar":"أنشئ حسابك"},"back":true,"logo":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Join Waraq to track your orders","ar":"انضم إلى ورق لتتابع طلباتك"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Full name","ar":"الاسم بالكامل"},"text":""},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Email","ar":"البريد الإلكتروني"},"text":""},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Password","ar":"كلمة المرور"},"text":""},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Phone","ar":"الهاتف"},"text":""},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Birthday","ar":"تاريخ الميلاد"},"text":""},{"kind":"select","label":{"en":"City","ar":"المدينة"},"text":{"en":"Choose","ar":"اختر"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Job title","ar":"الوظيفة"},"text":""},{"kind":"select","label":{"en":"How did you hear about us?","ar":"كيف عرفت عنّا؟"},"text":{"en":"Choose","ar":"اختر"}}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Create account","ar":"أنشئ الحساب"}}]}},{"id":"optional","text":{"en":"All 8 fields, the extra 5 marked optional","ar":"الحقول الـ 8 كلها، والـ 5 الإضافية اختيارية"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"waraq","name":{"en":"Waraq","ar":"ورق"},"color":"#9A3412","icon":"books","domain":"waraq.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Create your account","ar":"أنشئ حسابك"},"back":true,"logo":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Join Waraq to track your orders","ar":"انضم إلى ورق لتتابع طلباتك"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Full name","ar":"الاسم بالكامل"},"text":""},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Email","ar":"البريد الإلكتروني"},"text":""},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Password","ar":"كلمة المرور"},"text":""},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Phone (optional)","ar":"الهاتف (اختياري)"},"text":""},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Birthday (optional)","ar":"تاريخ الميلاد (اختياري)"},"text":""},{"kind":"select","label":{"en":"City (optional)","ar":"المدينة (اختياري)"},"text":{"en":"Choose","ar":"اختر"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Job title (optional)","ar":"الوظيفة (اختياري)"},"text":""},{"kind":"select","label":{"en":"How did you hear about us? (optional)","ar":"كيف عرفت عنّا؟ (اختياري)"},"text":{"en":"Choose","ar":"اختر"}}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Create account","ar":"أنشئ الحساب"}}]}},{"id":"short","text":{"en":"Only the 3 fields the account needs","ar":"الحقول الـ 3 التي يحتاجها الحساب فقط"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"waraq","name":{"en":"Waraq","ar":"ورق"},"color":"#9A3412","icon":"books","domain":"waraq.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Create your account","ar":"أنشئ حسابك"},"back":true,"logo":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Join Waraq to track your orders","ar":"انضم إلى ورق لتتابع طلباتك"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Full name","ar":"الاسم بالكامل"},"text":""},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Email","ar":"البريد الإلكتروني"},"text":""},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Password","ar":"كلمة المرور"},"text":""}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Create account","ar":"أنشئ الحساب"}}]}}],"answer":["short"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P14-042","when":["all"],"feedback":{"en":"Eight required fields stand between people and their first book. Each one is another reason to leave, and the bookshop loses buyers to get marketing data.","ar":"ثمانية حقول مطلوبة تقف بين الناس وأول كتاب يشترونه. وكل حقل سبب جديد للمغادرة، فتخسر المكتبة مشترين لتحصل على بيانات للتسويق."}},{"id":"MC-P14-042","when":["optional"],"feedback":{"en":"\"Optional\" still makes the form look long, and people stop to wonder whether to fill each one. A field the account doesn't need belongs somewhere else.","ar":"كلمة «اختياري» لا تمنع أن يبدو النموذج طويلًا، ويتوقف الناس عند كل حقل ليقرروا هل يملؤونه. والحقل الذي لا يحتاجه الحساب مكانه في موضع آخر."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Which fields does the account actually need before someone can buy a book?","ar":"ما الحقول التي يحتاجها الحساب فعلًا قبل أن يشتري أحد كتابًا؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Only what the account needs.","ar":"ما يحتاجه الحساب فقط."},"explain":{"en":"Three fields take seconds, so more people finish and buy. Birthday or job title can be asked later, in the profile, when there's a reason to give them.","ar":"ثلاثة حقول تأخذ ثوانيَ قليلة، فيكمل التسجيلَ عددٌ أكبر ويشترون. ويمكن سؤال تاريخ الميلاد أو الوظيفة لاحقًا، في الملف الشخصي، حين يوجد سبب لذكرها."}},{"id":"S10","type":"video","part":"concept","title":{"en":"A form people get through","ar":"نموذج يكمله الناس"},"video":"0aab15ea-86fa-4b6a-853c-ccae170dd079","duration":191,"transcript":[{"t":2.5,"en":"Since we talked about text fields, it's very important to talk about forms, the place text fields are used most. We use them in many situations across all kinds of products: when we","ar":"وبما إننا اتكلمنا عن الـ Text fields، فمهم جدًا نتكلم عن الـ Forms، وهي أكتر حاجة بيُستخدم فيها الـ Text fields. بنستخدمها في حالات كتير جدًا في Products متنوعة:"},{"t":12,"en":"buy, when we log in, when we enter our details, and in many other cases. So let's look at some guidelines for forms in general, and for text fields inside forms in particular.","ar":"واحنا بنشتري، واحنا بنعمل Login، واحنا بندخل بياناتنا، وفي حالات مختلفة كتير. فخلّونا نشوف بعض الـ Guidelines اللي ليها علاقة بالـ Forms عامةً، وبالـ Text fields جوه الـ Forms بالتحديد."},{"t":21.5,"en":"The first guideline is that we always need to keep the form as short as possible. How do we keep it short? First we review what","ar":"لو شفنا أول Guideline معانا، هنلاقي إننا محتاجين نخلّي الـ Form دايمًا قصير قدر المستطاع. إزاي نخلّيه قصير؟ أول حاجة"},{"t":30.5,"en":"we put in the form: once we've written down all the data we need to collect from the user, we go back over it: is there data","ar":"نبدأ نراجع الحاجات اللي حطّيناها في الـ Form: لو كتبنا كل البيانات اللي محتاجين نجمعها من اليوزر، نبدأ نراجع بعد"},{"t":39.5,"en":"we can get later in some way? Is there data that isn't necessary to ask for? Then we start removing that data as much as we can.","ar":"كده: هل في بيانات ممكن ناخدها بعدين بشكل ما؟ هل في بيانات مش ضرورية نطلبها؟ ونبدأ نشيل البيانات دي قدر المستطاع."},{"t":48.5,"en":"Second: we try to keep the things in the form that belong together visually close, or clearly one group. In this example, look at the word Password: the Password label, which belongs to the","ar":"تاني حاجة: نحاول نخلّي الحاجات اللي ليها علاقة ببعض في الـ Form تكون قريبة من بعض Visually، أو باين إنها Group واحد. يعني في المثال اللي قدامنا، لو شفنا كلمة Password، الـ Label"},{"t":60.17,"en":"second field, sits at almost the same distance from the first field as from the second. So it isn't clear that Password is closer to the second field and belongs to it, even though it","ar":"بتاع Password اللي هو أصلًا بتاع الـ Field التاني، المسافة بينه وبين الـ Field الأول وبينه وبين الـ Field التاني تقريبًا هي نفسها. فمش باين إن الـ Password أقرب للتاني وإنه تبعه، مع إنه"},{"t":71.83,"en":"obviously does. But when the form is long, this gets worse, and it may look like supporting text for the first field. So I always try to bring the label close to its own field.","ar":"واضح إنه تبع الـ Field التاني. لكن لما يكون الـ Form طويل، هيكون الموضوع مش أظرف حاجة، وممكن يبان كأنه Supporting text للـ Field الأول. فدايمًا أحاول أقرّب الـ Label من الـ Field نفسه."},{"t":83.5,"en":"Also, if I'm collecting different kinds of data, I can split it into sections: if I ask for personal information, say, and then payment information, I split them into Personal and Payment, and so on. That makes it easier for the","ar":"وبرضه لو بجمع داتا مختلفة، ممكن أقسّمها Sections: لو بطلب Personal information مثلًا، وبعدين بطلب Payment information، فأقسّمهم Personal وPayment، وهكذا. عشان يكون أسهل على اليوزر إنه يفهم"},{"t":94.5,"en":"user to understand what each section is about and what exactly the data is for. It also makes it easier to finish one section and move on to the next, rather than one long form, which can be annoying at times.","ar":"كل Section بيتكلم عن إيه، والداتا دي بتاعة إيه بالضبط. وأسهل عليه إنه يخلّص Section ويدخل للي بعده، وما يكونش Form كامل طويل، لأن ده ممكن يكون مزعج أحيانًا."},{"t":105.5,"en":"Third: we always try to stack the fields or any inputs in a form under each other, rather than in two columns side by side, because that breaks the eye's path as I","ar":"تالت حاجة: دايمًا نحاول نخلّي الـ Fields أو أي Inputs في الـ Form تحت بعض، أفضل من إننا نخلّيها في عمودين جنب بعض، لأن ده بيقطع حركة النظر وأنا نازل"},{"t":115.17,"en":"go down vertically finishing things one under another. Unless, of course, there's a logic for putting things side by side that makes it better. Like the expiration date and the CVV: they belong together","ar":"Vertical بخلّص الحاجات تحت بعض. إلا طبعًا لو في حاجة ليها Logic معيّن إنها تكون جنب بعض، ممكن يخلّيني أحطها جنب بعض أو يكون ده أفضل. زي الـ Expiration date"},{"t":124.83,"en":"in the payment method, and the CVV is a short number anyway, so we can put them in two columns side by side. Otherwise it's always better to keep them in a single column.","ar":"والـ CVV: حاجات ليها علاقة ببعض في الـ Payment method، والـ CVV أصلًا رقم صغير، فممكن نحطهم في عمودين جنب بعض. لكن غير كده الأفضل دايمًا إننا نخلّيهم Single column."},{"t":134.5,"en":"The next point is using a logical sequence. How do I decide whether to use one? I can ask: while the user enters this data, will they be doing something specific, or","ar":"الحاجة اللي بعد كده إني أستخدم Logical sequence. إزاي أفكر إني أستخدم Logical sequence ولا لأ؟ ممكن أفكر: اليوزر وقت ما بيدخل الداتا دي، هل هيعمل حاجة معينة"},{"t":144.64,"en":"taking the data from somewhere? Like this example: if they're taking the data from a credit card, they're looking at the front of the card, reading the card number, then the expiration","ar":"أو هياخد الداتا من مكان معين؟ زي المثال اللي قدامنا: لو بياخد الداتا من الـ Credit card، فهو دلوقتي بيبص على الكارت من قدام، بيقرا رقم الكارت، بعدين"},{"t":154.77,"en":"date, then turning the card over to read the CVV on the back. That's the order they follow, and that's the logic I use to lay out the fields: card number first, then","ar":"يقرا الـ Expiration date، بعدين يلف الكارت ويقرا الـ CVV من ورا. فده الترتيب اللي بيمشي بيه، وده الـ Logic اللي أستخدمه عشان أحط له الـ Fields: رقم"},{"t":164.91,"en":"the expiration date, then the CVV, so they turn it over and read it from the back. Also, if things have a very clear logical link, like first name and last name,","ar":"الكارت الأول، بعدين الـ Expiration date، بعدين الـ CVV عشان يقلبه ويشوفه من ورا. وبرضه لو في حاجات ليها علاقة Logic واضحة جدًا ببعض، زي الـ First name"},{"t":175.04,"en":"of course first name comes first, then last name. So I start asking: is there anything that should make me put the fields in a certain order, or will the order not matter?","ar":"والـ Last name، أكيد الـ First name هيكون الأول بعدين الـ Last name. فأبدأ أفكر: هل في حاجة تخلّيني أحط ترتيب معين للـ Fields، ولا الترتيب مش هيفرق."}]},{"id":"S03","type":"card","part":"concept","icons":["list","eye","layers","ok"],"title":{"en":"Video summary","ar":"ملخص الفيديو"},"body":{"en":"Forms are where people sign up, log in, pay and book. Every field is work, so the form should feel short and read in one direction.\n\n- **Keep it short:** list every field, then cut what the task doesn't need now, or what you can get later or another way.\n- **Group what belongs together:** put each label right next to its own field, and split long forms into named sections, such as \"Personal details\" and \"Payment\".\n- **One column:** stack the fields, one per row. Side by side only when two short fields clearly belong together, such as expiry date and security code.\n- **Logical order:** follow the order people find the information in, such as first name then last name, or the card number, then the expiry date, then the code on the back.","ar":"النماذج هي المكان الذي يشترك فيه الناس، ويسجّلون الدخول، ويدفعون، ويحجزون. وكل حقل فيه مجهود، لذلك يجب أن يبدو النموذج قصيرًا ويُقرأ في اتجاه واحد.\n\n- **اجعله قصيرًا:** اكتب كل الحقول، ثم احذف ما لا تحتاجه المهمة الآن، أو ما يمكن الحصول عليه لاحقًا أو بطريقة أخرى.\n- **اجمع ما يرتبط ببعضه:** ضع اسم كل حقل بجانب حقله مباشرة، وقسّم النموذج الطويل إلى أقسام لها عناوين، مثل «البيانات الشخصية» و«الدفع».\n- **عمود واحد:** ضع الحقول تحت بعضها، حقلًا في كل صف. ولا تضعها جنبًا إلى جنب إلا لحقلين قصيرين مرتبطين بوضوح، مثل تاريخ الانتهاء ورمز الأمان.\n- **ترتيب منطقي:** اتبع الترتيب الذي يجد به الناس المعلومات، مثل الاسم الأول ثم اسم العائلة، أو رقم البطاقة ثم تاريخ الانتهاء ثم الرمز الموجود على ظهرها."}},{"id":"S04","type":"choose","part":"guided","skill":"SK-P14-U05-01","rules":["R06"],"value":{"en":"Web forms (NN/g): keep it short. Reconsider every piece of data you ask for; a value the product will receive anyway later in the flow doesn't need its own field now.","ar":"النماذج في المواقع (NN/g): اجعله قصيرًا. راجع كل معلومة تطلبها؛ فالقيمة التي سيحصل عليها المنتج على أي حال لاحقًا في الخطوات لا تحتاج إلى حقل خاص بها الآن."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/web-form-design/","quote":"Every time you cut a field or question from a form, you increase its conversion rate"},"scenario":{"en":"Marketing agrees to drop most extras, but insists on keeping \"City\" at sign-up, to plan delivery areas. Every order already asks for a full delivery address at checkout, city included.","ar":"يوافق فريق التسويق على حذف أغلب الحقول الإضافية، لكنه يصر على إبقاء «المدينة» في التسجيل، ليخطط لمناطق التوصيل. وكل طلب يسأل أصلًا عن عنوان التوصيل كاملًا عند إتمام الطلب، والمدينة منه."},"prompt":{"en":"What should I do with the City field?","ar":"ماذا أفعل بحقل المدينة؟"},"options":[{"id":"keep","text":{"en":"Keep it as a required dropdown at sign-up","ar":"أبقِه Dropdown مطلوبًا في التسجيل"}},{"id":"optional","text":{"en":"Keep it, but mark it optional","ar":"أبقِه، لكن اجعله اختياريًا"}},{"id":"cut","text":{"en":"Remove it, and give marketing the city from checkout addresses","ar":"احذفه، وأعطِ فريق التسويق المدينة من عناوين التوصيل في الطلبات"}}],"answer":["cut"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P14-042","when":["keep","optional"],"feedback":{"en":"The city will arrive anyway with the first order's address. Asking it at sign-up makes everyone answer twice, and the sign-up data is less accurate than a real delivery address.","ar":"المدينة ستصل على أي حال مع عنوان أول طلب. وسؤالها في التسجيل يجعل الجميع يجيبون مرتين، وبيانات التسجيل أقل دقة من عنوان توصيل حقيقي."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Is there another moment where the bookshop gets this same answer?","ar":"هل توجد لحظة أخرى تحصل فيها المكتبة على الإجابة نفسها؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Cut it: the data arrives later anyway.","ar":"احذفه: المعلومة ستصل لاحقًا على أي حال."},"explain":{"en":"A field earns its place only if the task needs it now and there's no other way to get it. Checkout addresses give marketing real delivery cities, without slowing anyone down.","ar":"الحقل يستحق مكانه فقط إن كانت المهمة تحتاجه الآن ولا توجد طريقة أخرى للحصول عليه. وعناوين التوصيل في الطلبات تعطي فريق التسويق مدن توصيل حقيقية، دون أن تبطئ أحدًا."},"speaker":"youssef"},{"id":"S05","type":"compare","part":"guided","skill":"SK-P14-U05-02","rules":["R06"],"value":{"en":"Web forms (NN/g): labels should be close to the fields they describe. Avoid ambiguous spacing, where labels are equidistant from multiple fields.","ar":"النماذج في المواقع (NN/g): يجب أن يكون اسم الحقل قريبًا من الحقل الذي يصفه. وتجنّب المسافات المبهمة، حين يكون الاسم على المسافة نفسها من أكثر من حقل."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/web-form-design/","quote":"Avoid ambiguous spacing, where labels are equidistant from multiple fields"},"scenario":{"en":"The log-in screen has two fields. In version A, the even spacing puts each label as far from its own field as from the field above it.","ar":"في شاشة تسجيل الدخول حقلان. وفي النسخة A، تجعل المسافات المتساوية كل اسم بعيدًا عن حقله بقدر بُعده عن الحقل الذي فوقه."},"prompt":{"en":"Which version should ship?","ar":"أيّ نسخة يجب أن تُطلق؟"},"a":{"label":{"en":"Version A: even spacing","ar":"النسخة A: مسافات متساوية"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"waraq","name":{"en":"Waraq","ar":"ورق"},"color":"#9A3412","icon":"books","domain":"waraq.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Log in","ar":"تسجيل الدخول"},"logo":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Email","ar":"البريد الإلكتروني"}},{"kind":"field","text":"","gap":"m"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Password","ar":"كلمة المرور"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"field","text":"","gap":"m"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Log in","ar":"دخول"}}]}},"b":{"label":{"en":"Version B: each label on its field","ar":"النسخة B: كل اسم فوق حقله"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"waraq","name":{"en":"Waraq","ar":"ورق"},"color":"#9A3412","icon":"books","domain":"waraq.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Log in","ar":"تسجيل الدخول"},"logo":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Email","ar":"البريد الإلكتروني"},"text":""},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Password","ar":"كلمة المرور"},"text":"","gap":"l"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Log in","ar":"دخول"}}]}},"answer":"b","misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P14-044","when":["a"],"feedback":{"en":"Look at \"Password\" in A: it sits halfway between the two fields. In a longer form, people will read it as help text under the email field and type in the wrong box.","ar":"انظر إلى «كلمة المرور» في A: إنها في منتصف المسافة بين الحقلين. وفي نموذج أطول، سيقرؤها الناس كأنها نص مساعد تحت حقل البريد، ويكتبون في الخانة الخطأ."}}],"correct":{"en":"B: each label belongs to one field.","ar":"B: كل اسم ينتمي إلى حقل واحد."},"explain":{"en":"A small gap between a label and its field, and a bigger gap before the next pair, makes each label and field read as one unit.","ar":"مسافة صغيرة بين الاسم وحقله، ومسافة أكبر قبل الزوج التالي، تجعل كل اسم مع حقله وحدة واحدة."},"speaker":"youssef"},{"id":"S06","type":"compare","part":"contrast","skill":"SK-P14-U05-02","rules":["R11"],"confidence":true,"value":{"en":"Web forms (NN/g): multiple columns interrupt the vertical momentum of moving down the form. Keep people in the flow with a single column and a separate row for each field.","ar":"النماذج في المواقع (NN/g): الأعمدة المتعددة تقطع حركة الناس إلى أسفل النموذج. فأبقهم في المسار بعمود واحد وصف مستقل لكل حقل."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/web-form-design/","quote":"Multiple columns interrupt the vertical momentum of moving down the form."},"scenario":{"en":"At checkout, the delivery address has five fields. To make the page look shorter, version A puts them in two columns.","ar":"عند إتمام الطلب، يتكوّن عنوان التوصيل من خمسة حقول. ولكي تبدو الصفحة أقصر، تضعها النسخة A في عمودين."},"prompt":{"en":"Which version should ship?","ar":"أيّ نسخة يجب أن تُطلق؟"},"a":{"label":{"en":"Version A: two columns","ar":"النسخة A: عمودان"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"waraq","name":{"en":"Waraq","ar":"ورق"},"color":"#9A3412","icon":"books","domain":"waraq.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Delivery address","ar":"عنوان التوصيل"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"progress","value":50,"label":{"en":"Step 2 of 4","ar":"الخطوة 2 من 4"}},{"kind":"row","blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Street","ar":"الشارع"},"text":""},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Building","ar":"العمارة"},"text":""}]},{"kind":"row","blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Floor","ar":"الدور"},"text":""},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Area","ar":"المنطقة"},"text":""}]},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"City","ar":"المدينة"},"text":""}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Continue to payment","ar":"تابع إلى الدفع"}}]}},"b":{"label":{"en":"Version B: one column","ar":"النسخة B: عمود واحد"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"waraq","name":{"en":"Waraq","ar":"ورق"},"color":"#9A3412","icon":"books","domain":"waraq.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Delivery address","ar":"عنوان التوصيل"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"progress","value":50,"label":{"en":"Step 2 of 4","ar":"الخطوة 2 من 4"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Street","ar":"الشارع"},"text":""},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Building","ar":"العمارة"},"text":""},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Floor","ar":"الدور"},"text":""},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Area","ar":"المنطقة"},"text":""},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"City","ar":"المدينة"},"text":""}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Continue to payment","ar":"تابع إلى الدفع"}}]}},"answer":"b","misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P14-043","when":["a"],"feedback":{"en":"In two columns, people zig-zag: across, then down, then back. Some read down the first column and skip Building and Area, and the parcel goes to the wrong door.","ar":"في عمودين، تتحرك العين في خط متعرّج: إلى الجانب، ثم إلى أسفل، ثم إلى الجانب الآخر. ويقرأ بعض الناس العمود الأول إلى أسفل ويتجاوزون العمارة والمنطقة، فيصل الطرد إلى باب خطأ."}}],"correct":{"en":"B: one column, one path.","ar":"B: عمود واحد، واتجاه واحد."},"explain":{"en":"One field per row gives one obvious direction: straight down. The form is a little taller, but nobody misses a field.","ar":"حقل واحد في كل صف يعطي اتجاهًا واحدًا واضحًا: إلى أسفل مباشرة. النموذج أطول قليلًا، لكن لا أحد يتجاوز أي حقل."},"speaker":"youssef"},{"id":"S07","type":"order","part":"guided","skill":"SK-P14-U05-02","rules":["R06"],"onscreen":true,"caption":{"en":"Card payment","ar":"الدفع بالبطاقة"},"value":{"en":"Web forms (NN/g): use logical sequencing. People copy card details as they read the card: the number and expiry date on the front, then they turn it over for the code.","ar":"النماذج في المواقع (NN/g): استخدم ترتيبًا منطقيًا. فالناس ينقلون بيانات البطاقة بالترتيب الذي يقرؤونها به: الرقم وتاريخ الانتهاء على الوجه، ثم يقلبون البطاقة ليقرؤوا الرمز."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/web-form-design/","quote":"Help keyboard users by testing the Tab-key navigation to ensure it follows the correct field sequence."},"scenario":{"en":"The payment step asks for three card details. People copy them from the card in their hand.","ar":"تطلب خطوة الدفع ثلاث بيانات من البطاقة. وينقلها الناس من البطاقة التي في أيديهم."},"prompt":{"en":"Put the fields in the order people should fill them in.","ar":"رتّب الحقول بالترتيب الذي يجب أن يملأها به الناس."},"items":[{"id":"cvv","kind":"field","text":{"en":"Security code (3 digits on the back)","ar":"رمز الأمان (3 أرقام على الظهر)"}},{"id":"expiry","kind":"field","text":{"en":"Expiry date (MM/YY)","ar":"تاريخ الانتهاء (شهر/سنة)"}},{"id":"number","kind":"field","text":{"en":"Card number","ar":"رقم البطاقة"}}],"answer":["number","expiry","cvv"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P14-045","when":{"before":["cvv","number"]},"feedback":{"en":"The code is on the back. Asking for it first makes people flip the card, then flip it back for the number, then flip it again.","ar":"الرمز موجود على الظهر. وطلبه أولًا يجعل الناس يقلبون البطاقة، ثم يعيدونها للرقم، ثم يقلبونها مرة أخرى."}},{"id":"MC-P14-045","when":{"before":["expiry","number"]},"feedback":{"en":"People read the long card number first; it's the biggest thing on the front. Start where their eyes start.","ar":"يقرأ الناس رقم البطاقة الطويل أولًا؛ فهو أكبر شيء على الوجه. ابدأ من حيث تبدأ أعينهم."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Hold a card in your hand. What do you read first, and what makes you turn it over?","ar":"تخيّل بطاقة في يدك. ماذا تقرأ أولًا، وما الذي يجعلك تقلبها؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Number, expiry, then the code on the back.","ar":"الرقم، ثم تاريخ الانتهاء، ثم الرمز الموجود على الظهر."},"explain":{"en":"The order follows the card itself: front first, top to bottom, then one flip for the code. People never have to search the card twice.","ar":"الترتيب يتبع البطاقة نفسها: الوجه أولًا من أعلى إلى أسفل، ثم قلبة واحدة للرمز. ولا يحتاج الناس إلى البحث في البطاقة مرتين."},"speaker":"youssef"},{"id":"S08","type":"tune","speaker":"nour","part":"independent","skill":"SK-P14-U05-01","rules":["R14"],"value":{"en":"Web forms (NN/g): keep it short. Signed-in patients have already given their name and phone; asking again adds fields the clinic can fill itself.","ar":"النماذج في المواقع (NN/g): اجعله قصيرًا. فالمرضى المسجّلون أعطوا اسمهم وهاتفهم من قبل؛ وسؤالهم مرة أخرى يضيف حقولًا تستطيع العيادة ملأها بنفسها."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/web-form-design/","quote":"Every time you cut a field or question from a form, you increase its conversion rate"},"scenario":{"en":"I manage a clinic, and we're designing our app. Patients are signed in, so the app already knows their name and phone. To book a visit, we need the doctor, the time and the reason for the visit.","ar":"أدير عيادة، ونصمّم تطبيقها. والمرضى مسجّلون دخولهم، فالتطبيق يعرف أسماءهم وأرقام هواتفهم. ولحجز زيارة، نحتاج إلى الطبيب، والموعد، وسبب الزيارة."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each version of the booking form. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل نسخة من نموذج الحجز. أيّ نسخة تطلب من المرضى أقل كتابة ممكنة؟"},"start":"again","options":[{"id":"again","text":{"en":"Ask for name and phone again, to be sure","ar":"يطلب الاسم والهاتف مرة أخرى، للتأكد"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Book a visit","ar":"احجز زيارة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","avatar":{"text":"Amal Fathy","art":"doctor"},"text":{"en":"Raha Clinic · Dokki","ar":"عيادة راحة · الدقي"},"sub":{"en":"Family medicine","ar":"طب الأسرة"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Full name","ar":"الاسم بالكامل"},"text":""},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Phone","ar":"الهاتف"},"text":""},{"kind":"select","label":{"en":"Doctor","ar":"الطبيب"},"text":{"en":"Dr. Amal Fathy","ar":"د. أمل فتحي"},"filled":true},{"kind":"select","label":{"en":"Time","ar":"الموعد"},"text":{"en":"Sun, 10:30 am","ar":"الأحد، 10:30 صباحًا"},"filled":true},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Reason for visit","ar":"سبب الزيارة"},"text":""}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Book","ar":"احجز"}}]}},{"id":"known","text":{"en":"Show the known name and phone, ask only for the rest","ar":"يعرض الاسم والهاتف المعروفين، ويطلب الباقي فقط"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Book a visit","ar":"احجز زيارة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","avatar":{"text":"Amal Fathy","art":"doctor"},"text":{"en":"Raha Clinic · Dokki","ar":"عيادة راحة · الدقي"},"sub":{"en":"Family medicine","ar":"طب الأسرة"}},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"For Hazem Adel · 0100 123 4567","ar":"لحازم عادل · 0100 123 4567"}},{"kind":"select","label":{"en":"Doctor","ar":"الطبيب"},"text":{"en":"Dr. Amal Fathy","ar":"د. أمل فتحي"},"filled":true,"gap":"s"},{"kind":"select","label":{"en":"Time","ar":"الموعد"},"text":{"en":"Sun, 10:30 am","ar":"الأحد، 10:30 صباحًا"},"filled":true},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Reason for visit","ar":"سبب الزيارة"},"text":""}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Book","ar":"احجز"}}]}}],"answer":["known"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P14-042","when":["again"],"feedback":{"en":"The app already has these answers. Typing them again is pure work, and a typo here could even put the booking under the wrong number.","ar":"التطبيق يعرف هذه الإجابات أصلًا. وكتابتها مرة أخرى مجهود بلا فائدة، وقد يجعل خطأ في الكتابة الحجزَ مسجّلًا برقم خطأ."}}],"correct":{"en":"Ask only for what the app doesn't know.","ar":"اطلب فقط ما لا يعرفه التطبيق."},"explain":{"en":"Showing the known name and phone lets patients check them at a glance, and the form shrinks to the three answers only they can give.","ar":"عرض الاسم والهاتف المعروفين يسمح للمرضى بمراجعتهما بنظرة واحدة، ويصبح النموذج ثلاث إجابات فقط لا يعرفها غيرهم."}},{"id":"S09","type":"card","part":"recap","icons":["list","layers","ok"],"title":{"en":"What you practised","ar":"ما تدرّبت عليه"},"body":{"en":"- **Cut fields** the task doesn't need now, or that arrive later anyway.\n- **One column**, with each label right next to its own field.\n- **Logical order**, the way people find the information.\n\nNext: labels that stay in view, and saying what each field needs.","ar":"- **احذف الحقول** التي لا تحتاجها المهمة الآن، أو التي ستصل لاحقًا على أي حال.\n- **عمود واحد**، واسم كل حقل بجانب حقله مباشرة.\n- **ترتيب منطقي**، بالترتيب الذي يجد به الناس المعلومات.\n\nالتالي: أسماء حقول تبقى ظاهرة، وتوضيح ما يحتاجه كل حقل."}}]}$uxg$::jsonb),
  ($uxg$P14-U05-L02$uxg$, $uxg$b3fbf71b03f487b29e12932e3e7ae2a6c13a78a9586b2ba809ab701642705b3f$uxg$, $uxg${"id":"P14-U05-L02","mode":"lesson","minutes":8,"title":{"en":"Labels that stay, fields that explain","ar":"أسماء حقول تبقى، وحقول توضّح ما تحتاجه"},"speaker":"karim","review_labels":{"MC-P14-046":{"en":"Placeholder text is not a label","ar":"نص الـ Placeholder ليس اسمًا للحقل"},"MC-P14-047":{"en":"Example text inside a field looks like an answer already given","ar":"المثال داخل الحقل يبدو كأنه إجابة مكتوبة بالفعل"},"MC-P14-048":{"en":"Mark every required field, and the optional ones too","ar":"ميّز كل حقل مطلوب، والحقول الاختيارية أيضًا"},"MC-P14-049":{"en":"Match the control to the answer: radio buttons for 2 or 3 options","ar":"اختر العنصر المناسب للإجابة: Radio buttons لاختيارين أو ثلاثة"},"MC-P14-055":{"en":"A lone, familiar search field doesn't need a label above it","ar":"حقل البحث الوحيد المألوف لا يحتاج إلى اسم فوقه"}},"steps":[{"id":"S01","type":"card","part":"hook","title":{"en":"Karim's pharmacy app","ar":"تطبيق كريم للصيدلية"},"body":{"en":"I'm building a pharmacy delivery app. To look clean, my first draft of \"New delivery address\" has no labels: each field shows its name in grey inside the box, and the name disappears as soon as people start typing.\n\nMost orders are placed by people in a hurry, often for a sick family member.","ar":"أبني تطبيقًا لتوصيل الأدوية من الصيدلية. ولكي يبدو بسيطًا، لا توجد أسماء للحقول في أول نسخة صمّمتها لشاشة «عنوان توصيل جديد»: كل حقل يعرض اسمه بلون رمادي داخل الخانة، ويختفي الاسم بمجرد أن يبدأ الناس الكتابة.\n\nوأغلب الطلبات يرسلها أشخاص مستعجلون، غالبًا لفرد مريض من العائلة."},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dawaa","name":{"en":"Dawaa Pharmacy","ar":"صيدلية دواء"},"color":"#059669","icon":"pill","domain":"dawaa.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"New delivery address","ar":"عنوان توصيل جديد"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","text":{"en":"Recipient's name","ar":"اسم المستلم"}},{"kind":"field","text":{"en":"Phone","ar":"الهاتف"}},{"kind":"field","text":{"en":"Street and building","ar":"الشارع والعمارة"}},{"kind":"field","text":{"en":"Floor and flat","ar":"الدور والشقة"}}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Save address","ar":"احفظ العنوان"}}]}},{"id":"S02","type":"tune","part":"try","skill":"SK-P14-U05-03","rules":["R12"],"confidence":true,"value":{"en":"Try first. Placeholders in form fields (NN/g): disappearing placeholder text strains users' short-term memory. The best solution is clear, visible labels placed outside empty form fields.","ar":"جرّب أولًا. نص الـ Placeholder داخل الحقول (NN/g): النص الذي يختفي يُتعب الذاكرة قصيرة المدى. وأفضل حل هو أسماء حقول واضحة وظاهرة، موضوعة خارج الحقول الفارغة."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/form-design-placeholders/","quote":"Disappearing placeholder text strains users’ short-term memory."},"prompt":{"en":"A customer has filled in two fields and looks back to check them. Try each version. Which one should ship?","ar":"ملأ أحد العملاء حقلين، ثم نظر إليهما ليراجعهما. جرّب كل نسخة. أيّ نسخة تسمح له بأن يعرف ما في كل حقل دون أن يمسح ما كتبه؟"},"start":"inside","options":[{"id":"inside","text":{"en":"Names inside the fields, no labels","ar":"الأسماء داخل الحقول، دون أسماء فوقها"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dawaa","name":{"en":"Dawaa Pharmacy","ar":"صيدلية دواء"},"color":"#059669","icon":"pill","domain":"dawaa.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"New delivery address","ar":"عنوان توصيل جديد"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","text":{"en":"Amira Saad","ar":"أميرة سعد"},"filled":true},{"kind":"field","text":"0100 765 4321","filled":true},{"kind":"field","text":{"en":"Street and building","ar":"الشارع والعمارة"}},{"kind":"field","text":{"en":"Floor and flat","ar":"الدور والشقة"}}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Save address","ar":"احفظ العنوان"}}]}},{"id":"examples","text":{"en":"Labels above, examples in grey inside","ar":"الأسماء فوق الحقول، وأمثلة رمادية داخلها"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dawaa","name":{"en":"Dawaa Pharmacy","ar":"صيدلية دواء"},"color":"#059669","icon":"pill","domain":"dawaa.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"New delivery address","ar":"عنوان توصيل جديد"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Recipient's name","ar":"اسم المستلم"},"text":{"en":"Amira Saad","ar":"أميرة سعد"},"filled":true},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Phone","ar":"الهاتف"},"text":"0100 765 4321","filled":true},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Street and building","ar":"الشارع والعمارة"},"text":{"en":"12 Nile St, Building 4","ar":"12 شارع النيل، عمارة 4"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Floor and flat","ar":"الدور والشقة"},"text":{"en":"3rd floor, flat 7","ar":"الدور 3، شقة 7"}}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Save address","ar":"احفظ العنوان"}}]}},{"id":"labels","text":{"en":"Labels above, empty fields","ar":"الأسماء فوق الحقول، والحقول فارغة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dawaa","name":{"en":"Dawaa Pharmacy","ar":"صيدلية دواء"},"color":"#059669","icon":"pill","domain":"dawaa.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"New delivery address","ar":"عنوان توصيل جديد"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Recipient's name","ar":"اسم المستلم"},"text":{"en":"Amira Saad","ar":"أميرة سعد"},"filled":true},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Phone","ar":"الهاتف"},"text":"0100 765 4321","filled":true},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Street and building","ar":"الشارع والعمارة"},"text":""},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Floor and flat","ar":"الدور والشقة"},"text":""}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Save address","ar":"احفظ العنوان"}}]}}],"answer":["labels"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P14-046","when":["inside"],"feedback":{"en":"Look at the two filled fields: nothing says what they are. Is 0100 765 4321 the customer's phone or the recipient's? To check, people must delete what they typed to see the name again.","ar":"انظر إلى الحقلين المملوءين: لا شيء يقول ما هما. هل 0100 765 4321 هاتف العميل أم هاتف المستلم؟ ولكي يتأكد الناس، عليهم أن يمسحوا ما كتبوه ليظهر الاسم مرة أخرى."}},{"id":"MC-P14-047","when":["examples"],"feedback":{"en":"The grey examples look like an address someone already typed. People in a hurry may think the fields are done and skip them, or stop to delete text that isn't really there.","ar":"الأمثلة الرمادية تبدو كأنها عنوان كتبه أحد بالفعل. وقد يظن المستعجلون أن الحقول مملوءة فيتجاوزونها، أو يتوقفون ليمسحوا نصًا غير موجود فعلًا."}}],"hints":[{"en":"After typing, can people still tell what each filled field is?","ar":"بعد الكتابة، هل ما زال الناس يعرفون ما هو كل حقل مملوء؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Visible labels outside empty fields.","ar":"أسماء ظاهرة خارج حقول فارغة."},"explain":{"en":"The label stays while people type and when they look back to check. An empty box clearly says \"type here\", and nothing looks done before it is.","ar":"الاسم يبقى ظاهرًا أثناء الكتابة وعند المراجعة. والخانة الفارغة تقول بوضوح «اكتب هنا»، ولا يبدو أي حقل مملوءًا قبل أن يُملأ فعلًا."}},{"id":"S09","type":"video","part":"concept","title":{"en":"Labels and what each field needs","ar":"أسماء الحقول وما يحتاجه كل حقل"},"video":"60bd0f18-9913-4c67-80b5-acff504d8dfd","duration":196,"transcript":[{"t":2.5,"en":"The next point is the placeholder, and it comes up a lot. A placeholder, as its name says, holds a place until the","ar":"النقطة اللي معانا بعد كده هي الـ Placeholder، ودي من النقط المتكررة. الـ Placeholder زي ما اسمه، هو الحاجة اللي واخدة المكان"},{"t":11.83,"en":"main thing that will take that place arrives. So a placeholder in a text field is the text written inside the field that","ar":"لغاية ما تيجي الحاجة الأساسية اللي هتاخد المكان ده. يعني لما نقول Placeholder في الـ Text field، فهو الـ Text المكتوب جوه"},{"t":21.17,"en":"tells me what I can write there, until I type the input I'll enter as a user; then the placeholder disappears as I type.","ar":"الـ Text field، اللي بيفهّمني أنا ممكن أكتب هنا إيه، لغاية ما أكتب الـ Input اللي هدخله كيوزر، فالـ Placeholder يختفي وأنا بكتب."},{"t":30.5,"en":"So for text fields, using placeholders isn't always the best choice. Why? Simply because as soon as we start typing they disappear, and I may want to see them again to remember the guideline","ar":"ففي حالة الـ Text fields، مش أفضل حاجة دايمًا إننا نستخدم الـ Placeholders. ليه؟ لأننا ببساطة أول ما نبدأ نكتب هتختفي، وممكن أكون عايز أشوفها تاني عشان أفتكر الـ Guideline"},{"t":41.5,"en":"or the supporting text that was written as a placeholder and is now gone. To get it back I may need to delete everything I typed to read it again, especially if it held important","ar":"أو الـ Supporting text اللي كان مكتوب في شكل Placeholder واختفى دلوقتي. فعشان أوصله ممكن أحتاج أمسح الـ Text اللي كتبته كله عشان أقراه تاني، بالذات لو كان فيه معلومة"},{"t":52.5,"en":"information. So it's always best to put the text we wanted as a placeholder above or below the text field like this, so it shows me what to write and doesn't disappear while I type.","ar":"مهمة. فأفضل حاجة دايمًا إننا نخلّي الكلام اللي عايزين نكتبه كـ Placeholder يكون فوق الـ Text field أو تحته بالشكل ده، عشان يوضّح لي الحاجة اللي هكتبها وما يختفيش وأنا بكتب."},{"t":63.5,"en":"In some cases there's also the floating label we talked about. That isn't a placeholder: it sits inside the text field, and when I start typing it moves","ar":"وبرضه في بعض الحالات بيكون في فكرة الـ Floating label اللي اتكلمنا عنها. ده مش Placeholder: بيكون جوه الـ Text field، ولما أبدأ أكتب بيطلع فوق،"},{"t":72.5,"en":"up, floating above the field or onto its border, and I can still see it while I type inside the field. So let's always try to avoid the placeholder.","ar":"بيـ Float ويتحرك فوق الـ Text field أو على الـ Borders بتاعته، وبكون شايفه وأنا بكتب جوه الـ Text field. فدايمًا خلّونا نحاول نتجنب الـ Placeholder."},{"t":81.5,"en":"One case that can confuse some people about placeholders is search. Search usually has its word written inside, and it isn't a regular text field: search isn't treated","ar":"ومن الحالات اللي ممكن تلخبط بعض الناس في نقطة الـ Placeholder هي الـ Search. الـ Search عادةً بيكون مكتوب جوه، وده مش Text field"},{"t":89.83,"en":"as a text field. It's sometimes better to write the word Search inside it, so it's clear it's a search, and most of the time it sits at the","ar":"عادي: الـ Search مش بيتعامل كـ Text field. ومن الأفضل أحيانًا تتكتب كلمة Search جوه، عشان يكون مفهوم إنه Search، وفي أغلب الأوقات بيكون فوق"},{"t":98.17,"en":"top of the website. If I tap it or start typing, the word Search goes away. So the same guideline that applies to text fields doesn't apply to it.","ar":"في الـ Website. ولو ضغطت عليه أو بدأت أكتب، كلمة Search تروح. فده مش بينطبق عليه نفس الـ Guideline اللي بتنطبق على الـ Text field."},{"t":106.5,"en":"The next guideline we saw before when we talked about radio buttons: choosing the right field, or the right type, for each input I ask the user for. Like the case here that we discussed before: if","ar":"الـ Guideline اللي بعد كده شفناها قبل كده لما كنا بنتكلم عن الـ Radio buttons: إني أختار الـ Field أو الـ Type المناسب لكل Input بطلبه من اليوزر. زي الحالة اللي"},{"t":117.25,"en":"I have three options, is it better to choose radio buttons or a dropdown? It's always better to choose radio buttons if there are few options and I have the space for it, because I'll see all the","ar":"قدامنا اللي اتكلمنا عنها قبل كده: لو عندي تلات اختيارات، هل الأفضل أختار Radio buttons ولا Drop down؟ الأفضل دايمًا أختار Radio buttons لو الاختيارات قليلة وعندي مساحة تساعد على ده،"},{"t":128,"en":"options right away. If there are many options or I don't have enough space, I'll use the dropdown. So I think about which type of pattern fits as I ask the user for the input. I'll also","ar":"لأني هبقى شايف الاختيارات كلها على طول. لو الاختيارات كتير أو ماعنديش مساحة كفاية، هستخدم الـ Drop down. فأبدأ أفكر إيه الـ Type المناسب من الـ Patterns اللي هستخدمه وأنا بطلب"},{"t":138.75,"en":"account for the size: if I ask the user for an email address, I won't give them a small text field; I need to give them a field big enough to type the email address, and so on.","ar":"الـ Input من اليوزر. وبرضه الـ Size أكيد هعمل حسابه: لو بطلب من المستخدم Email address، مش هديله Text field صغير، محتاج أديله Text field كافي يكتب فيه الـ Email address، وهكذا."},{"t":149.5,"en":"The next point, and it's very, very important: showing the user which fields or inputs they must fill in to be able to continue, and which fields are optional, ones they don't have","ar":"الحاجة اللي بعد كده، ودي حاجة مهمة جدًا جدًا: إني أبيّن للمستخدم إيه الـ Fields أو الـ Inputs المطلوب منه يدخلها إجباريًا، لازم يدخلها عشان يقدر يكمّل، وإيه"},{"t":159.57,"en":"to fill in and can still continue. Here we can mark only the required items with an asterisk: I show the asterisk next to them so they understand they must fill it in.","ar":"الـ Fields الـ Optional الاختيارية اللي مش لازم يدخلها ويقدر يكمّل عادي. في الحالة دي ممكن نبيّن الحاجات الإجبارية بس بالنجمة: أبيّن له النجمة جنبها عشان يفهم إن"},{"t":169.65,"en":"Or I mark the optional item: I write in brackets next to its label that it's optional and they don't have to fill it. Or I do both, which may be better: an","ar":"دي حاجة لازم يدخلها. أو أبيّن الحاجة الـ Optional: أكتب له بين قوسين جنب الـ Label بتاعها إن دي Optional ومش لازم يكتبها. أو أعمل الاتنين، وده ممكن"},{"t":179.72,"en":"asterisk next to the required items and Optional next to the optional ones, so they can tell the two apart easily, without having to think a lot or try and get an error.","ar":"يكون أفضل: أحط النجمة جنب الحاجات الإجبارية وOptional جنب الحاجات الاختيارية، عشان يقدر يميّز بين الاتنين بسهولة، من غير ما يحتاج يفكر كتير أو يجرب ويظهر له Error."}]},{"id":"S03","type":"card","part":"concept","icons":["eye","list","ok","layers"],"title":{"en":"Video summary","ar":"ملخص الفيديو"},"body":{"en":"A field should tell people what to type before, during and after they type it.\n\n- **Label outside the field:** placeholder text disappears as soon as people type. Floating labels, which shrink to the top of the box, are better than that, but a plain label above the field is clearest.\n- **The exception:** a single, familiar field such as a search box can show its hint inside, because people already know what goes there.\n- **Match the control:** two or three options read best as radio buttons; keep drop-downs for long lists. Size each field to its answer: an email needs a wide box, a postcode a short one.\n- **Required and optional:** mark every required field, usually with an asterisk (*), and write \"optional\" next to the rest. Doing both is the safest.","ar":"يجب أن يقول الحقل للناس ماذا يكتبون قبل الكتابة وأثناءها وبعدها.\n\n- **الاسم خارج الحقل:** نص الـ Placeholder يختفي بمجرد أن يكتب الناس. والـ Floating labels، أي الأسماء التي تصغر وتنتقل إلى أعلى الخانة، أفضل من ذلك، لكن الاسم العادي فوق الحقل هو الأوضح.\n- **الاستثناء:** الحقل الوحيد المألوف، مثل خانة البحث، يمكن أن يعرض التلميح داخله، لأن الناس يعرفون أصلًا ما يُكتب فيه.\n- **اختر العنصر المناسب:** الاختياران أو الثلاثة تُقرأ أفضل في Radio buttons؛ واترك الـ Dropdown للقوائم الطويلة. واجعل حجم كل حقل مناسبًا لإجابته: البريد الإلكتروني يحتاج خانة عريضة، والرمز البريدي خانة قصيرة.\n- **مطلوب واختياري:** ميّز كل حقل مطلوب، غالبًا بعلامة النجمة (*)، واكتب «اختياري» بجانب الباقي. وفعل الأمرين معًا هو الأكثر أمانًا."}},{"id":"S04","type":"compare","part":"contrast","skill":"SK-P14-U05-03","rules":["R11"],"value":{"en":"Placeholders in form fields (NN/g): on simple, frequently used forms with one or two fields, such as a search box, the strain on memory is less of an issue, because people can guess what they are supposed to enter.","ar":"نص الـ Placeholder داخل الحقول (NN/g): في النماذج البسيطة كثيرة الاستخدام ذات الحقل أو الحقلين، مثل خانة البحث، لا يمثّل الضغط على الذاكرة مشكلة كبيرة، لأن الناس يستطيعون توقّع ما يجب أن يكتبوه."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/form-design-placeholders/","quote":"the strain on memory is less of an issue than with complex or rarely used forms"},"scenario":{"en":"After the address fix, my teammate wants to apply the same rule everywhere, including the one search box at the top of the home screen.","ar":"بعد إصلاح شاشة العنوان، يريد زميلي أن يطبّق القاعدة نفسها في كل مكان، ومنها خانة البحث الوحيدة أعلى الشاشة الرئيسية."},"prompt":{"en":"Which home screen should ship?","ar":"أيّ شاشة رئيسية تكفي الناس ليعرفوا ما يكتبون في خانة البحث، بأقل عناصر؟"},"a":{"label":{"en":"Version A: hint inside the search box","ar":"النسخة A: التلميح داخل خانة البحث"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dawaa","name":{"en":"Dawaa Pharmacy","ar":"صيدلية دواء"},"color":"#059669","icon":"pill","domain":"dawaa.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Pharmacy","ar":"الصيدلية"},"actions":[{"icon":"shopping-cart","aria":{"en":"Cart","ar":"السلّة"}}],"logo":true},"tabbar":{"active":0,"items":[{"icon":"house","text":{"en":"Home","ar":"الرئيسية"}},{"icon":"prescription","text":{"en":"Prescriptions","ar":"الوصفات"}},{"icon":"user","text":{"en":"Account","ar":"حسابي"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","text":{"en":"🔍 Search medicines and products","ar":"🔍 ابحث عن الأدوية والمنتجات"}},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Popular","ar":"الأكثر طلبًا"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"row","blocks":[{"kind":"chip","text":{"en":"Vitamins","ar":"فيتامينات"}},{"kind":"chip","text":{"en":"Baby care","ar":"العناية بالطفل"}}]},{"kind":"card","art":"medicine","gap":"m","blocks":[{"kind":"text","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Free delivery over EGP 300","ar":"توصيل مجاني فوق 300 جنيه"}}]}]}},"b":{"label":{"en":"Version B: a label above the search box","ar":"النسخة B: اسم فوق خانة البحث"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dawaa","name":{"en":"Dawaa Pharmacy","ar":"صيدلية دواء"},"color":"#059669","icon":"pill","domain":"dawaa.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Pharmacy","ar":"الصيدلية"},"actions":[{"icon":"shopping-cart","aria":{"en":"Cart","ar":"السلّة"}}],"logo":true},"tabbar":{"active":0,"items":[{"icon":"house","text":{"en":"Home","ar":"الرئيسية"}},{"icon":"prescription","text":{"en":"Prescriptions","ar":"الوصفات"}},{"icon":"user","text":{"en":"Account","ar":"حسابي"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Search medicines and products","ar":"ابحث عن الأدوية والمنتجات"},"text":""},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Popular","ar":"الأكثر طلبًا"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"row","blocks":[{"kind":"chip","text":{"en":"Vitamins","ar":"فيتامينات"}},{"kind":"chip","text":{"en":"Baby care","ar":"العناية بالطفل"}}]},{"kind":"card","art":"medicine","gap":"m","blocks":[{"kind":"text","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Free delivery over EGP 300","ar":"توصيل مجاني فوق 300 جنيه"}}]}]}},"answer":"a","misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P14-055","when":["b"],"feedback":{"en":"A label helps when people might forget what a field is for. A lone search box with a magnifier is understood at a glance, and people type one short query, so there is nothing to remember.","ar":"الاسم يفيد حين قد ينسى الناس الغرض من الحقل. أما خانة البحث الوحيدة مع رمز العدسة فتُفهم بنظرة، ويكتب فيها الناس كلمة بحث قصيرة، فلا يوجد ما يحتاجون إلى تذكّره."}}],"correct":{"en":"A: a lone search box can hint inside.","ar":"A: خانة البحث الوحيدة يمكن أن تعرض التلميح داخلها."},"explain":{"en":"The deciding factor is memory. In the address form, people fill several fields and look back to check them. In search, one familiar field holds one short query, so the hint inside is enough.","ar":"ما يحسم الأمر هو حاجة الناس إلى التذكّر. في نموذج العنوان، يملأ الناس عدة حقول ويعودون لمراجعتها. أما في البحث، فحقل واحد مألوف يحمل كلمة بحث قصيرة، فيكفي التلميح داخله."},"speaker":"karim"},{"id":"S05","type":"tune","part":"guided","skill":"SK-P14-U05-04","rules":["R06"],"value":{"en":"Marking required fields (NN/g): people don't read instructions at the top of forms. For every single field that must be completed, mark it as required; web forms (NN/g) adds: clearly label the optional ones.","ar":"تمييز الحقول المطلوبة (NN/g): الناس لا يقرؤون التعليمات أعلى النماذج. فميّز كل حقل يجب ملؤه بأنه مطلوب؛ ويضيف مقال النماذج في المواقع (NN/g): اكتب بوضوح أن الحقول الاختيارية اختيارية."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/required-fields/","quote":"Be as explicit and transparent as possible: for every single field that must be completed, mark it as required."},"scenario":{"en":"To order a prescription medicine, customers upload the prescription. The patient's name, the photo of the prescription and the doctor's name are required. A note to the pharmacist is optional.","ar":"لطلب دواء بوصفة طبية، يرفع العملاء صورة الوصفة. واسم المريض، وصورة الوصفة، واسم الطبيب مطلوبة. أما ملاحظة للصيدلي فاختيارية."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each version. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل نسخة. أيّها يجب أن تُطلق؟"},"start":"top","options":[{"id":"top","text":{"en":"A note at the top: \"All fields are required except the note\"","ar":"ملاحظة في الأعلى: «كل الحقول مطلوبة ما عدا الملاحظة»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dawaa","name":{"en":"Dawaa Pharmacy","ar":"صيدلية دواء"},"color":"#059669","icon":"pill","domain":"dawaa.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Upload a prescription","ar":"ارفع وصفة طبية"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"All fields are required except the note to the pharmacist.","ar":"كل الحقول مطلوبة ما عدا الملاحظة للصيدلي."}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Patient's name","ar":"اسم المريض"},"text":"","gap":"m"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Add prescription photo","ar":"أضف صورة الوصفة"},"emphasis":"low"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Doctor's name","ar":"اسم الطبيب"},"text":""},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Note to the pharmacist","ar":"ملاحظة للصيدلي"},"text":""}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Send to pharmacy","ar":"أرسل إلى الصيدلية"}}]}},{"id":"none","text":{"en":"No marks: people will find out when they press Send","ar":"دون أي تمييز: سيعرف الناس حين يضغطون «أرسل»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dawaa","name":{"en":"Dawaa Pharmacy","ar":"صيدلية دواء"},"color":"#059669","icon":"pill","domain":"dawaa.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Upload a prescription","ar":"ارفع وصفة طبية"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Patient's name","ar":"اسم المريض"},"text":""},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Add prescription photo","ar":"أضف صورة الوصفة"},"emphasis":"low"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Doctor's name","ar":"اسم الطبيب"},"text":""},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Note to the pharmacist","ar":"ملاحظة للصيدلي"},"text":""}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Send to pharmacy","ar":"أرسل إلى الصيدلية"}}]}},{"id":"both","text":{"en":"An asterisk on each required field, \"optional\" on the note","ar":"نجمة على كل حقل مطلوب، و«اختياري» على الملاحظة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dawaa","name":{"en":"Dawaa Pharmacy","ar":"صيدلية دواء"},"color":"#059669","icon":"pill","domain":"dawaa.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Upload a prescription","ar":"ارفع وصفة طبية"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Patient's name *","ar":"اسم المريض *"},"text":""},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Add prescription photo *","ar":"أضف صورة الوصفة *"},"emphasis":"low"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Doctor's name *","ar":"اسم الطبيب *"},"text":""},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Note to the pharmacist (optional)","ar":"ملاحظة للصيدلي (اختياري)"},"text":""}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Send to pharmacy","ar":"أرسل إلى الصيدلية"}}]}}],"answer":["both"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P14-048","when":["top"],"feedback":{"en":"People skip straight to the first field, so the note at the top goes unread. When they reach each field, nothing there tells them whether they can leave it empty.","ar":"ينتقل الناس مباشرة إلى أول حقل، فلا يقرؤون الملاحظة في الأعلى. وحين يصلون إلى كل حقل، لا شيء فيه يقول هل يمكن تركه فارغًا."}},{"id":"MC-P14-048","when":["none"],"feedback":{"en":"Finding out after pressing Send means an error, a scroll back up and a second try, for someone already in a hurry. Each field should say up front what it needs.","ar":"أن يعرف الناس بعد الضغط على «أرسل» يعني رسالة خطأ، والرجوع إلى أعلى، ومحاولة ثانية، لشخص مستعجل أصلًا. ويجب أن يقول كل حقل من البداية ما يحتاجه."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Where are people looking when they decide whether to fill a field?","ar":"أين ينظر الناس حين يقررون هل يملؤون حقلًا أم لا؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Mark each field where people look: on its label.","ar":"ميّز كل حقل حيث ينظر الناس: على اسمه."},"explain":{"en":"The asterisk sits on the label people are already reading, and \"optional\" removes any doubt about the note. No one has to guess or remember an instruction.","ar":"النجمة موجودة على الاسم الذي يقرؤه الناس أصلًا، وكلمة «اختياري» تزيل أي شك حول الملاحظة. ولا يحتاج أحد إلى التخمين أو تذكّر تعليمات."},"speaker":"karim"},{"id":"S06","type":"compare","part":"guided","skill":"SK-P14-U05-04","rules":["R06"],"confidence":true,"value":{"en":"Web forms (NN/g): avoid drop-downs when there are only 2 or 3 options that could be displayed as radio buttons. Radio buttons show every option at once, with one tap to choose.","ar":"النماذج في المواقع (NN/g): تجنّب الـ Dropdown حين توجد 2 أو 3 اختيارات فقط يمكن عرضها كـ Radio buttons. فالـ Radio buttons تعرض كل الاختيارات مرة واحدة، ويكفي ضغطة واحدة للاختيار."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/web-form-design/","quote":"Avoid drop-downs when there are only 2 or 3 options that could be displayed as radio buttons"},"scenario":{"en":"At checkout, customers choose a delivery time. There are three: within 2 hours, this evening, or tomorrow morning.","ar":"عند إتمام الطلب، يختار العملاء موعد التوصيل. وهناك ثلاثة مواعيد: خلال ساعتين، أو هذا المساء، أو صباح الغد."},"prompt":{"en":"Which version should ship?","ar":"أيّ نسخة يجب أن تُطلق؟"},"a":{"label":{"en":"Version A: a drop-down","ar":"النسخة A: Dropdown"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dawaa","name":{"en":"Dawaa Pharmacy","ar":"صيدلية دواء"},"color":"#059669","icon":"pill","domain":"dawaa.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Delivery time","ar":"موعد التوصيل"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"map-pin","text":{"en":"12 Nile St, Building 4","ar":"12 شارع النيل، عمارة 4"},"sub":{"en":"3rd floor, flat 7","ar":"الدور 3، شقة 7"}},{"kind":"select","label":{"en":"When should we deliver?","ar":"متى نوصّل الطلب؟"},"text":{"en":"Choose a time","ar":"اختر موعدًا"}}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Continue to payment","ar":"تابع إلى الدفع"}}]}},"b":{"label":{"en":"Version B: radio buttons","ar":"النسخة B: Radio buttons"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dawaa","name":{"en":"Dawaa Pharmacy","ar":"صيدلية دواء"},"color":"#059669","icon":"pill","domain":"dawaa.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Delivery time","ar":"موعد التوصيل"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"map-pin","text":{"en":"12 Nile St, Building 4","ar":"12 شارع النيل، عمارة 4"},"sub":{"en":"3rd floor, flat 7","ar":"الدور 3، شقة 7"}},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"When should we deliver?","ar":"متى نوصّل الطلب؟"}},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Within 2 hours","ar":"خلال ساعتين"},"selected":true},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"This evening, 6–9 pm","ar":"هذا المساء، من 6 إلى 9"}},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Tomorrow, 9–12 am","ar":"غدًا، من 9 صباحًا إلى 12 ظهرًا"}}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Continue to payment","ar":"تابع إلى الدفع"}}]}},"answer":"b","misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P14-049","when":["a"],"feedback":{"en":"The drop-down hides the three times behind a tap, and people must open it just to learn what's possible. With so few options, there's no space to save.","ar":"الـ Dropdown يخفي المواعيد الثلاثة خلف ضغطة، فيضطر الناس إلى فتحه فقط ليعرفوا ما المتاح. ومع هذا العدد القليل من الاختيارات، لا توجد مساحة تستحق التوفير."}}],"correct":{"en":"B: three options, all in view.","ar":"B: ثلاثة اختيارات، كلها ظاهرة."},"explain":{"en":"Radio buttons let people compare the three times at a glance and choose with one tap. Drop-downs earn their place only when the list is long, such as a list of countries.","ar":"الـ Radio buttons تسمح للناس بمقارنة المواعيد الثلاثة بنظرة واحدة والاختيار بضغطة واحدة. أما الـ Dropdown فيستحق مكانه فقط حين تكون القائمة طويلة، مثل قائمة الدول."},"speaker":"karim"},{"id":"S07","type":"choose","speaker":"sara","part":"independent","skill":"SK-P14-U05-03","rules":["R14"],"value":{"en":"Placeholders in form fields (NN/g): floating labels do offer a better experience than the label as a placeholder, but the best solution is clear, visible labels placed outside empty form fields.","ar":"نص الـ Placeholder داخل الحقول (NN/g): الـ Floating labels تعطي تجربة أفضل من استخدام الـ Placeholder كاسم للحقل، لكن أفضل حل هو أسماء واضحة وظاهرة خارج الحقول الفارغة."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/form-design-placeholders/","quote":"the best solution is to have clear, visible labels that are placed outside empty form fields."},"scenario":{"en":"I'm designing the money-transfer screen of a banking app: account number, amount and a short reference. A developer suggests floating labels to save space: the field name sits inside the box, then shrinks to its top edge when people tap it. There is room on the screen for normal labels.","ar":"أصمّم شاشة تحويل الأموال في تطبيق بنك: رقم الحساب، والمبلغ، ووصف قصير. ويقترح أحد المطوّرين Floating labels لتوفير المساحة: اسم الحقل يكون داخل الخانة، ثم يصغر وينتقل إلى حافتها العليا حين يضغط عليها الناس. وفي الشاشة مساحة كافية لأسماء عادية."},"prompt":{"en":"What should I use for the field names?","ar":"ماذا أستخدم لأسماء الحقول؟"},"options":[{"id":"placeholder","text":{"en":"Names inside the boxes that disappear on typing, the most compact","ar":"أسماء داخل الخانات تختفي عند الكتابة، فهي الأصغر حجمًا"}},{"id":"floating","text":{"en":"Floating labels, as the developer suggests","ar":"Floating labels، كما يقترح المطوّر"}},{"id":"above","text":{"en":"Plain labels above each field","ar":"أسماء عادية فوق كل حقل"}}],"answer":["above"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P14-046","when":["placeholder"],"feedback":{"en":"Once people type an account number, nothing on screen says which field it's in. In a money transfer, checking before sending matters most.","ar":"بمجرد أن يكتب الناس رقم الحساب، لا شيء على الشاشة يقول في أي حقل هو. وفي تحويل الأموال، المراجعة قبل الإرسال هي الأهم."}},{"id":"MC-P14-046","when":["floating"],"feedback":{"en":"Floating labels are better than names that vanish, but the shrunken label is small and hard to read, and an empty field still looks filled before people tap it. With room on the screen, there's no reason to accept that.","ar":"الـ Floating labels أفضل من أسماء تختفي، لكن الاسم بعد أن يصغر يصبح صغيرًا وصعب القراءة، والحقل الفارغ ما زال يبدو مملوءًا قبل أن يضغط عليه الناس. ومع وجود مساحة في الشاشة، لا يوجد سبب لقبول ذلك."}}],"correct":{"en":"Plain labels above the fields.","ar":"أسماء عادية فوق الحقول."},"explain":{"en":"Labels above stay full size and readable at every moment, and the empty boxes clearly invite typing. The space they take is small next to the cost of a transfer sent to the wrong account.","ar":"الأسماء فوق الحقول تبقى بحجمها الكامل وسهلة القراءة في كل لحظة، والخانات الفارغة تدعو بوضوح إلى الكتابة. والمساحة التي تأخذها صغيرة مقارنة بخسارة تحويل يذهب إلى حساب خطأ."}},{"id":"S08","type":"card","part":"recap","icons":["eye","list","ok"],"title":{"en":"What you practised","ar":"ما تدرّبت عليه"},"body":{"en":"- **Labels outside the fields**, so they stay while people type and check.\n- **The exception:** a lone, familiar search box can hint inside.\n- **Say what each field needs:** an asterisk on required fields, \"optional\" on the rest, and radio buttons for two or three options.\n\nNext: rules people can see, errors they can fix, and exits that don't erase their work.","ar":"- **الأسماء خارج الحقول**، لكي تبقى ظاهرة أثناء الكتابة والمراجعة.\n- **الاستثناء:** خانة البحث الوحيدة المألوفة يمكن أن تعرض التلميح داخلها.\n- **وضّح ما يحتاجه كل حقل:** نجمة على الحقول المطلوبة، و«اختياري» على الباقي، والـ Radio buttons لاختيارين أو ثلاثة.\n\nالتالي: شروط يراها الناس، وأخطاء يستطيعون إصلاحها، وطرق خروج لا تمسح ما كتبوه."}}]}$uxg$::jsonb),
  ($uxg$P14-U05-L03$uxg$, $uxg$4ea0ef01a1ae5491143ab51baa00dec552bebffa24b1074d38f970aa995cf953$uxg$, $uxg${"id":"P14-U05-L03","mode":"lesson","minutes":8,"title":{"en":"Rules up front, errors people can fix","ar":"الشروط من البداية، وأخطاء يستطيع الناس إصلاحها"},"speaker":"rami","review_labels":{"MC-P14-050":{"en":"State format rules before people type","ar":"اذكر شروط الإدخال قبل أن يكتب الناس"},"MC-P14-051":{"en":"Say exactly what went wrong, next to the field","ar":"قل بالضبط ما الخطأ، بجانب الحقل"},"MC-P14-052":{"en":"Signal errors with more than colour","ar":"وضّح الخطأ بأكثر من اللون"},"MC-P14-053":{"en":"Keep what people typed when there's an error","ar":"احتفظ بما كتبه الناس عند حدوث خطأ"},"MC-P14-054":{"en":"Reset and Clear buttons wipe work by accident","ar":"زر Reset أو Clear يمسح العمل بالخطأ"}},"steps":[{"id":"S01","type":"card","part":"hook","title":{"en":"Rami's bus-ticket app","ar":"تطبيق رامي لتذاكر الحافلات"},"body":{"en":"I'm designing the sign-up form of an app for booking intercity bus tickets. In testing, many people fail the first try: the password is rejected, a red message appears at the top of the screen, and some of them press \"Clear\" by mistake while reaching for \"Create account\".\n\nMy job: make every rule visible before people type, and every error easy to fix.","ar":"أصمّم نموذج التسجيل في تطبيق لحجز تذاكر الحافلات بين المدن. وفي الاختبار، يفشل كثيرون في المحاولة الأولى: تُرفض كلمة المرور، وتظهر رسالة حمراء أعلى الشاشة، ويضغط بعضهم «امسح» بالخطأ وهم يحاولون الوصول إلى «أنشئ الحساب».\n\nمهمتي: أن أجعل كل شرط ظاهرًا قبل أن يكتب الناس، وكل خطأ سهل الإصلاح."},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rehla","name":{"en":"Rehla","ar":"رحلة"},"color":"#7048E8","icon":"bus","domain":"rehla.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Create your account","ar":"أنشئ حسابك"},"back":true,"logo":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"banner","tone":"bad","text":{"en":"There are errors in the form.","ar":"توجد أخطاء في النموذج."}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Mobile number","ar":"رقم الموبايل"},"text":"","gap":"m"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Password","ar":"كلمة المرور"},"text":"","tone":"bad"},{"kind":"row","gap":"m","blocks":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Clear","ar":"امسح"}},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Create account","ar":"أنشئ الحساب"}}]}]}},{"id":"S02","type":"tune","part":"try","skill":"SK-P14-U05-04","rules":["R12"],"value":{"en":"Try first. Web forms (NN/g): if a field requires a specific format or type of input, state the exact instructions. Don't make users guess your obscure password requirements.","ar":"جرّب أولًا. النماذج في المواقع (NN/g): إن كان الحقل يحتاج إلى شكل معيّن أو نوع معيّن من الإدخال، فاذكر التعليمات بالضبط. ولا تجعل الناس يخمّنون شروط كلمة المرور الغامضة."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/web-form-design/","quote":"If a field requires a specific format or type of input, state the exact instructions."},"prompt":{"en":"The password needs at least 8 characters, including a number. Try each version. Which one should ship?","ar":"تحتاج كلمة المرور إلى 8 أحرف على الأقل، منها رقم. جرّب كل نسخة. أيّ نسخة تجعل الناس يكتبون كلمة مرور مقبولة من أول محاولة؟"},"start":"after","options":[{"id":"after","text":{"en":"Show the rules only after a failed try","ar":"اعرض الشروط فقط بعد محاولة فاشلة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rehla","name":{"en":"Rehla","ar":"رحلة"},"color":"#7048E8","icon":"bus","domain":"rehla.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Create your account","ar":"أنشئ حسابك"},"back":true,"logo":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Mobile number","ar":"رقم الموبايل"},"text":"0122 334 5566","filled":true},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Password","ar":"كلمة المرور"},"text":""}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Create account","ar":"أنشئ الحساب"}}]}},{"id":"icon","text":{"en":"Put the rules behind an ⓘ icon next to the label","ar":"ضع الشروط خلف رمز ⓘ بجانب اسم الحقل"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rehla","name":{"en":"Rehla","ar":"رحلة"},"color":"#7048E8","icon":"bus","domain":"rehla.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Create your account","ar":"أنشئ حسابك"},"back":true,"logo":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Mobile number","ar":"رقم الموبايل"},"text":"0122 334 5566","filled":true},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Password ⓘ","ar":"كلمة المرور ⓘ"},"text":""}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Create account","ar":"أنشئ الحساب"}}]}},{"id":"shown","text":{"en":"Show the rules under the label, before typing","ar":"اعرض الشروط تحت اسم الحقل، قبل الكتابة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rehla","name":{"en":"Rehla","ar":"رحلة"},"color":"#7048E8","icon":"bus","domain":"rehla.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Create your account","ar":"أنشئ حسابك"},"back":true,"logo":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Mobile number","ar":"رقم الموبايل"},"text":"0122 334 5566","filled":true},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Password","ar":"كلمة المرور"},"hint":{"en":"At least 8 characters, including a number","ar":"8 أحرف على الأقل، منها رقم"},"hintFirst":true,"text":""}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Create account","ar":"أنشئ الحساب"}}]}}],"answer":["shown"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P14-050","when":["after"],"feedback":{"en":"People only learn the rules by failing. They type a password, get rejected, then have to invent and remember a new one. One line of text up front prevents all of that.","ar":"لا يعرف الناس الشروط إلا بعد أن يفشلوا. يكتبون كلمة مرور، فتُرفض، ثم عليهم أن يبتكروا كلمة جديدة ويتذكروها. وسطر واحد من البداية يمنع كل ذلك."}},{"id":"MC-P14-050","when":["icon"],"feedback":{"en":"Most people won't tap a small icon before typing, so they still find the rules by failing. A rule everyone must follow belongs in plain view.","ar":"أغلب الناس لن يضغطوا على رمز صغير قبل الكتابة، فما زالوا يعرفون الشروط بعد الفشل. والشرط الذي يجب أن يتبعه الجميع مكانه ظاهر أمام العين."}}],"hints":[{"en":"When do people need to know the rules: before they type, or after?","ar":"متى يحتاج الناس إلى معرفة الشروط: قبل الكتابة أم بعدها؟"}],"correct":{"en":"The rules in view, before typing.","ar":"الشروط ظاهرة، قبل الكتابة."},"explain":{"en":"The hint sits between the label and the box, so people read it on the way in and create a valid password on the first try.","ar":"التلميح موجود بين اسم الحقل والخانة، فيقرؤه الناس قبل أن يكتبوا، ويختارون كلمة مرور صحيحة من أول محاولة."}},{"id":"S09","type":"video","part":"concept","title":{"en":"Rules, errors and exits","ar":"الشروط والأخطاء وطرق الخروج"},"video":"f3de5060-8a96-4d69-9d98-c17286107304","duration":133,"transcript":[{"t":2.5,"en":"This guideline is about text fields specifically: showing the user any particular characteristics the text they type should have. For example, if I want them to write a password and there","ar":"الـ Guideline اللي معانا عن الـ Text fields تحديدًا: إني أبيّن لليوزر لو في Characteristics معينة المفروض يلتزم بيها في الـ Text اللي بيكتبه. على سبيل المثال، لو عايزه يكتب"},{"t":13.83,"en":"are specific instructions it must follow, like having at least one capital letter, a special character, and so on, I need to show that before they start typing. I shouldn't let","ar":"Password، وفي Instructions معينة لازم يلتزم بيها في الـ Password ده، زي إن يكون فيه حرف Capital على الأقل، ويكون فيه Special character، وهكذا. فمحتاج أبيّن له ده من قبل"},{"t":25.17,"en":"them type and then tell them there's an error, that they shouldn't have done that. The requirements or instructions they need to follow should always be visible while they enter the input.","ar":"ما يبدأ يكتب، ماخلّيهوش يكتب وبعدين أقول له Error، إن ده ماكانش المفروض تعمله. لازم يظهر دايمًا إيه الـ Requirements أو الـ Instructions اللي المفروض يلتزم بيها وهو بيدخل الـ Input."},{"t":36.5,"en":"Also, we often find a Clear or Reset button in some forms that lets me wipe all the data I've typed. This button is very, very rarely used, and often when it's there it gets pressed by mistake.","ar":"كمان في أوقات كتير بنلاقي في بعض الـ Forms زرار Clear أو زرار Reset، اللي بيخلّيني أمسح كل الداتا اللي كتبتها. الزرار ده نادر جدًا جدًا لما يُستخدم، وأوقات كتير لما يكون موجود بيُستخدم عن طريق الخطأ."},{"t":56.5,"en":"We don't usually use Reset or Clear buttons; they aren't used much. If in some forms we know users enter private and very important data, and they may need,","ar":"احنا مابنستخدمش Reset أو Clear buttons عادةً، استخدامهم مش كبير. لو في بعض الـ Forms احنا عارفين إن اليوزرز بيدخلوا فيها داتا خاصة وداتا مهمة جدًا،"},{"t":66.17,"en":"if they want to go back, to cancel, wipe it and make sure the data they typed has been deleted, then we can give them a Cancel button, so they're","ar":"وممكن يحتاجوا لو عايزين يرجعوا إنهم يعملوا Cancel ويمسحوا ويتأكدوا إن الداتا اللي كتبوها اتمسحت، ممكن ساعتها نحط لهم زرار Cancel، عشان يتأكد إنه لما يضغط"},{"t":75.83,"en":"sure that pressing it removes everything they typed. But we give that Cancel button a lower hierarchy than the button that lets them continue or go to the next step.","ar":"عليه الداتا اللي كتبها كلها هتروح. لكن برضه ندي زرار الـ Cancel ده Hierarchy أقل من الزرار اللي هيخلّيه يكمّل أو يروح للخطوة اللي بعد كده."},{"t":85.5,"en":"Finally, the last guideline about forms and text fields: showing the user the error that happened. If an error happens, we make it very clear and specific, like this example: we","ar":"أخيرًا، الـ Guideline الأخيرة معانا عن الـ Forms أو الـ Text fields: إننا نبيّن لليوزر الـ Error اللي حصل. لو حصل Error نخلّيه واضح جدًا، ونخلّيه Specific زي الشكل اللي قدامنا:"},{"t":95.94,"en":"can write the error itself in red text, add an icon to show the error is here, and make the border red too, to show there's an error. The message itself","ar":"ممكن نكتب له الـ Error نفسه بالخط الأحمر، ممكن نحط Icon يوضّح إن هنا الـ Error، ممكن نخلّي الـ Border برضه لونه أحمر عشان نبيّن إن الـ Error موجود. والـ Message"},{"t":106.39,"en":"needs to be clear and explain what error they made. This reminds us, if we go back to the usability heuristics, of the heuristic about helping users recognize and diagnose the","ar":"نفسها محتاجين نخلّيها واضحة، تبيّن إيه الـ Error اللي هو عمله. وده هيفكّرنا لو رجعنا للـ Usability heuristics، بالـ Heuristic اللي بتتكلم إن اليوزر يقدر يعمل Recognize وDiagnose للـ Error اللي"},{"t":116.84,"en":"error they made: here I show them where the error is in the first place, and explain through this message exactly what error they made, so they can also recover from it.","ar":"عمله: أنا هنا بفهّمه الـ Error موجود فين أصلًا، وبشرح له عن طريق الـ Message دي إيه الـ Error اللي عمله بالضبط، فيقدر يعمل Recover كمان من الـ Error اللي عمله."}]},{"id":"S03","type":"card","part":"concept","icons":["ok","eye","layers","list"],"title":{"en":"Video summary","ar":"ملخص الفيديو"},"body":{"en":"Errors will happen. A good form prevents the ones it can and makes the rest quick to fix.\n\n- **State the rules up front:** password rules, formats and limits go next to the field, before people type.\n- **No Reset or Clear:** one wrong tap wipes everything. If you need Cancel, make it much quieter than the main button.\n- **Clear errors:** put a specific message right next to the field, saying what went wrong and how to fix it. Signal it with more than colour: a red border plus an icon and words.\n- **Keep their input:** never empty the fields people already filled. This is the heuristic \"help users recognize, diagnose and recover from errors\" in practice.","ar":"الأخطاء ستحدث. والنموذج الجيد يمنع ما يستطيع منعه منها، ويجعل إصلاح الباقي سريعًا.\n\n- **اذكر الشروط من البداية:** شروط كلمة المرور، وشكل الإدخال، والحدود، توضع بجانب الحقل قبل أن يكتب الناس.\n- **لا Reset ولا Clear:** ضغطة واحدة خطأ تمسح كل شيء. وإن احتجت إلى Cancel، فاجعله أهدأ بكثير من الزر الرئيسي.\n- **أخطاء واضحة:** ضع رسالة محددة بجانب الحقل مباشرة، تقول ما الخطأ وكيف يُصلح. ووضّحه بأكثر من اللون: إطار أحمر مع رمز وكلمات.\n- **احتفظ بما كتبوه:** لا تُفرغ أبدًا الحقول التي ملأها الناس. وهذا تطبيق عملي لمبدأ الاستخدام (Usability heuristic): «ساعد الناس على ملاحظة الأخطاء وفهمها وإصلاحها»."}},{"id":"S04","type":"compare","part":"guided","skill":"SK-P14-U05-05","rules":["R06"],"value":{"en":"Error messages in forms (NN/g): keeping error messages next to the fields in error minimizes working-memory load. People see the problem and the fix in the same place.","ar":"رسائل الخطأ في النماذج (NN/g): وضع رسائل الخطأ بجانب الحقول التي بها الخطأ يقلّل الضغط على الذاكرة العاملة. فيرى الناس المشكلة وطريقة إصلاحها في المكان نفسه."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/errors-forms-design-guidelines/","quote":"Keeping error messages next to the fields in error minimizes working-memory load"},"scenario":{"en":"When booking a seat, a passenger typed a 10-digit mobile number and left the ID number empty. The form must say so.","ar":"عند حجز مقعد، كتب أحد الركاب رقم موبايل من 10 أرقام وترك رقم البطاقة فارغًا. ويجب أن يوضّح النموذج ذلك."},"prompt":{"en":"Which version should ship?","ar":"أيّ نسخة يجب أن تُطلق؟"},"a":{"label":{"en":"Version A: one message at the top","ar":"النسخة A: رسالة واحدة في الأعلى"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rehla","name":{"en":"Rehla","ar":"رحلة"},"color":"#7048E8","icon":"bus","domain":"rehla.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Passenger details","ar":"بيانات الراكب"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"bus","text":{"en":"Cairo → Alexandria","ar":"القاهرة ← الإسكندرية"},"sub":{"en":"Thu 8:00 am · Seat 14","ar":"الخميس 8:00 ص · المقعد 14"},"value":{"en":"EGP 180","ar":"180 جنيه"}},{"kind":"banner","tone":"bad","text":{"en":"2 fields need attention. Please check your details.","ar":"يوجد حقلان يحتاجان إلى انتباه. من فضلك راجع بياناتك."}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Passenger name","ar":"اسم الراكب"},"text":{"en":"Ehab Lotfy","ar":"إيهاب لطفي"},"filled":true,"gap":"m"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Mobile number","ar":"رقم الموبايل"},"text":"0122 334 556","filled":true},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"National ID number","ar":"الرقم القومي"},"text":""}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Book seat","ar":"احجز المقعد"}}]}},"b":{"label":{"en":"Version B: each message on its field","ar":"النسخة B: كل رسالة على حقلها"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rehla","name":{"en":"Rehla","ar":"رحلة"},"color":"#7048E8","icon":"bus","domain":"rehla.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Passenger details","ar":"بيانات الراكب"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"bus","text":{"en":"Cairo → Alexandria","ar":"القاهرة ← الإسكندرية"},"sub":{"en":"Thu 8:00 am · Seat 14","ar":"الخميس 8:00 ص · المقعد 14"},"value":{"en":"EGP 180","ar":"180 جنيه"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Passenger name","ar":"اسم الراكب"},"text":{"en":"Ehab Lotfy","ar":"إيهاب لطفي"},"filled":true},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Mobile number","ar":"رقم الموبايل"},"text":"0122 334 556","filled":true,"tone":"bad","error":{"en":"⚠ Enter all 11 digits, starting with 01.","ar":"⚠ اكتب الأرقام الـ 11 كلها، بدءًا بـ 01."}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"National ID number","ar":"الرقم القومي"},"text":"","tone":"bad","error":{"en":"⚠ Enter the 14-digit number on your ID card.","ar":"⚠ اكتب الرقم المكوّن من 14 رقمًا الموجود على بطاقتك."}}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Book seat","ar":"احجز المقعد"}}]}},"answer":"b","misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P14-051","when":["a"],"feedback":{"en":"The banner says something is wrong, but not what or where. The passenger must hunt through the fields, guess the problem, and remember the message while they fix it.","ar":"الرسالة في الأعلى تقول إن هناك خطأ، لكنها لا تقول ما هو ولا أين. فيضطر الراكب إلى البحث في الحقول، وتخمين المشكلة، وتذكّر الرسالة أثناء الإصلاح."}}],"correct":{"en":"B: the problem and the fix, on the field.","ar":"B: المشكلة وطريقة إصلاحها، على الحقل."},"explain":{"en":"Each message names the problem and how to fix it, right where the passenger will type. Nothing has to be found or remembered.","ar":"كل رسالة تذكر المشكلة وطريقة إصلاحها، في المكان نفسه الذي سيكتب فيه الراكب. ولا يحتاج إلى البحث عن شيء أو تذكّره."},"speaker":"rami"},{"id":"S05","type":"compare","part":"contrast","skill":"SK-P14-U05-05","rules":["R11"],"confidence":true,"value":{"en":"Web forms (NN/g): errors should be signaled through a variety of cues, not solely through color. People who can't see red, or who just glance quickly, miss a red border on its own.","ar":"النماذج في المواقع (NN/g): يجب توضيح الأخطاء بأكثر من إشارة، لا باللون وحده. فمن لا يرى اللون الأحمر، أو من ينظر بسرعة، لا يلاحظ الإطار الأحمر وحده."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/web-form-design/","quote":"Errors should be signaled through a variety of cues, not solely through color"},"scenario":{"en":"Both versions mark the same wrong email with a red border. Here is how they look to a passenger who can't see red, shown in grey.","ar":"كلتا النسختين تميّز البريد الإلكتروني الخطأ نفسه بإطار أحمر. وهذا شكلهما لراكب لا يرى اللون الأحمر، معروضتين بالرمادي."},"prompt":{"en":"Which version should ship?","ar":"أيّ نسخة يجب أن تُطلق؟"},"a":{"label":{"en":"Version A: red border only","ar":"النسخة A: إطار أحمر فقط"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rehla","name":{"en":"Rehla","ar":"رحلة"},"color":"#7048E8","icon":"bus","domain":"rehla.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Passenger details","ar":"بيانات الراكب"},"back":true},"gray":true,"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"bus","text":{"en":"Cairo → Alexandria","ar":"القاهرة ← الإسكندرية"},"sub":{"en":"Thu 8:00 am · Seat 14","ar":"الخميس 8:00 ص · المقعد 14"},"value":{"en":"EGP 180","ar":"180 جنيه"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Passenger name","ar":"اسم الراكب"},"text":{"en":"Ehab Lotfy","ar":"إيهاب لطفي"},"filled":true},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Email for the ticket","ar":"البريد الإلكتروني للتذكرة"},"text":"ehab.lotfy@gmail","filled":true,"tone":"bad"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Pay and get ticket","ar":"ادفع واحصل على التذكرة"}}]}},"b":{"label":{"en":"Version B: red border, icon and message","ar":"النسخة B: إطار أحمر ورمز ورسالة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rehla","name":{"en":"Rehla","ar":"رحلة"},"color":"#7048E8","icon":"bus","domain":"rehla.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Passenger details","ar":"بيانات الراكب"},"back":true},"gray":true,"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"bus","text":{"en":"Cairo → Alexandria","ar":"القاهرة ← الإسكندرية"},"sub":{"en":"Thu 8:00 am · Seat 14","ar":"الخميس 8:00 ص · المقعد 14"},"value":{"en":"EGP 180","ar":"180 جنيه"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Passenger name","ar":"اسم الراكب"},"text":{"en":"Ehab Lotfy","ar":"إيهاب لطفي"},"filled":true},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Email for the ticket","ar":"البريد الإلكتروني للتذكرة"},"text":"ehab.lotfy@gmail","filled":true,"tone":"bad","error":{"en":"⚠ Add the ending, such as .com","ar":"⚠ أكمل نهاية العنوان، مثل .com"}}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Pay and get ticket","ar":"ادفع واحصل على التذكرة"}}]}},"answer":"b","misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P14-052","when":["a"],"feedback":{"en":"In grey, the red border looks like any other field. This passenger presses Pay again and again with no idea why nothing happens.","ar":"بالرمادي، يبدو الإطار الأحمر مثل أي حقل آخر. فيضغط هذا الراكب «ادفع» مرة بعد مرة دون أن يعرف لماذا لا يحدث شيء."}}],"correct":{"en":"B: colour plus an icon and words.","ar":"B: اللون مع رمز وكلمات."},"explain":{"en":"The deciding factor is what's left without colour. The icon and the message still say \"this field, this problem\", so everyone can find and fix it.","ar":"ما يحسم الأمر هو ما يبقى حين يغيب اللون. فالرمز والرسالة ما زالا يقولان «هذا الحقل، وهذه المشكلة»، فيستطيع الجميع إيجاده وإصلاحه."},"speaker":"rami"},{"id":"S06","type":"tune","part":"guided","skill":"SK-P14-U05-05","rules":["R06"],"value":{"en":"Web forms (NN/g): erroneous input should be preserved so users can correct it, and accompanied by a specific explanation of the problem.","ar":"النماذج في المواقع (NN/g): يجب الاحتفاظ بالإدخال الخطأ لكي يصلحه الناس، مع شرح محدد للمشكلة."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/web-form-design/","quote":"Erroneous input should be preserved so users can correct it, and accompanied by a specific explanation of the problem."},"scenario":{"en":"A passenger filled in five fields for a group booking and typed one wrong date of birth. The form checks everything when they press Book.","ar":"ملأ أحد الركاب خمسة حقول لحجز جماعي، وكتب تاريخ ميلاد واحدًا خطأ. والنموذج يراجع كل شيء حين يضغط «احجز»."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each version of what happens after pressing Book. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل نسخة لما يحدث بعد الضغط على «احجز». أيّ نسخة تجعل الراكب يصلح الخطأ بسرعة دون أن يعيد كتابة شيء؟"},"start":"empty","options":[{"id":"empty","text":{"en":"Empty the form and explain the error at the top","ar":"يُفرغ النموذج ويشرح الخطأ في الأعلى"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rehla","name":{"en":"Rehla","ar":"رحلة"},"color":"#7048E8","icon":"bus","domain":"rehla.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Group booking · 5 passengers","ar":"حجز مجموعة · 5 ركّاب"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"progress","value":40,"label":{"en":"Passenger 2 of 5","ar":"الراكب 2 من 5"}},{"kind":"banner","tone":"bad","text":{"en":"Date of birth must be DD/MM/YYYY. Please fill in the form again.","ar":"يجب أن يكون تاريخ الميلاد بالشكل يوم/شهر/سنة. من فضلك املأ النموذج مرة أخرى."}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Passenger 2 name","ar":"اسم الراكب 2"},"text":"","gap":"m"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Date of birth","ar":"تاريخ الميلاد"},"text":""},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"National ID number","ar":"الرقم القومي"},"text":""}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Book","ar":"احجز"}}]}},{"id":"vague","text":{"en":"Keep the answers, mark the field \"Invalid input\"","ar":"يحتفظ بالإجابات، ويكتب على الحقل «إدخال غير صالح»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rehla","name":{"en":"Rehla","ar":"رحلة"},"color":"#7048E8","icon":"bus","domain":"rehla.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Group booking · 5 passengers","ar":"حجز مجموعة · 5 ركّاب"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"progress","value":40,"label":{"en":"Passenger 2 of 5","ar":"الراكب 2 من 5"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Passenger 2 name","ar":"اسم الراكب 2"},"text":{"en":"Salma Lotfy","ar":"سلمى لطفي"},"filled":true},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Date of birth","ar":"تاريخ الميلاد"},"text":"14/23/2009","filled":true,"tone":"bad","error":{"en":"⚠ Invalid input","ar":"⚠ إدخال غير صالح"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"National ID number","ar":"الرقم القومي"},"text":"30909140100456","filled":true}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Book","ar":"احجز"}}]}},{"id":"keep","text":{"en":"Keep the answers, say exactly what to fix on the field","ar":"يحتفظ بالإجابات، ويقول على الحقل بالضبط ما يجب إصلاحه"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rehla","name":{"en":"Rehla","ar":"رحلة"},"color":"#7048E8","icon":"bus","domain":"rehla.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Group booking · 5 passengers","ar":"حجز مجموعة · 5 ركّاب"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"progress","value":40,"label":{"en":"Passenger 2 of 5","ar":"الراكب 2 من 5"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Passenger 2 name","ar":"اسم الراكب 2"},"text":{"en":"Salma Lotfy","ar":"سلمى لطفي"},"filled":true},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Date of birth","ar":"تاريخ الميلاد"},"text":"14/23/2009","filled":true,"tone":"bad","error":{"en":"⚠ There's no month 23. Use day/month/year, such as 23/09/2009.","ar":"⚠ لا يوجد شهر رقم 23. اكتب يوم/شهر/سنة، مثل 23/09/2009."}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"National ID number","ar":"الرقم القومي"},"text":"30909140100456","filled":true}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Book","ar":"احجز"}}]}}],"answer":["keep"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P14-053","when":["empty"],"feedback":{"en":"One wrong date costs the passenger all five fields. Many will give up rather than type everything again, and the ones who stay may make new mistakes.","ar":"تاريخ واحد خطأ يكلّف الراكب الحقول الخمسة كلها. وكثيرون سيتركون الحجز بدل أن يكتبوا كل شيء من جديد، ومن يبقى قد يقع في أخطاء جديدة."}},{"id":"MC-P14-051","when":["vague"],"feedback":{"en":"\"Invalid input\" points to the field but not the problem. The passenger may check the year, retype the same date, and fail again.","ar":"«إدخال غير صالح» تشير إلى الحقل لكن لا تشرح المشكلة. فقد يراجع الراكب السنة، ثم يكتب التاريخ نفسه مرة أخرى، ويفشل من جديد."}}],"hints":[{"en":"What does the passenger need to fix one date quickly?","ar":"ماذا يحتاج الراكب لكي يصلح تاريخًا واحدًا بسرعة؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Keep the answers and explain the fix.","ar":"احتفظ بالإجابات واشرح طريقة الإصلاح."},"explain":{"en":"Everything typed stays, and the message names the exact problem with a correct example. The passenger changes two digits and books.","ar":"كل ما كُتب يبقى، والرسالة تذكر المشكلة بالضبط مع مثال صحيح. فيغيّر الراكب رقمين ويكمل الحجز."},"speaker":"rami"},{"id":"S07","type":"choose","speaker":"mona","part":"independent","skill":"SK-P14-U05-05","rules":["R14"],"value":{"en":"Web forms (NN/g): the risk of accidental deletion outweighs the unlikely need to start over on a web form. If you need Cancel, make sure it has significantly less visual prominence than Submit.","ar":"النماذج في المواقع (NN/g): خطر المسح بالخطأ أكبر من الحاجة النادرة إلى البدء من جديد في نموذج على الإنترنت. وإن احتجت إلى Cancel، فتأكد أنه أقل ظهورًا بكثير من زر الإرسال."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/web-form-design/","quote":"The risk of accidental deletion outweighs the unlikely need to ‘start over’ on a web form."},"scenario":{"en":"My team designs a job application form for a hotel group: twelve fields and a CV upload. At the bottom are two buttons of the same size and style: \"Reset form\" and \"Submit application\". Applicants may also want to leave without sending.","ar":"يصمّم فريقي نموذج التقديم على وظيفة لمجموعة فنادق: اثنا عشر حقلًا ورفع السيرة الذاتية. وفي الأسفل زرّان بالحجم والشكل نفسيهما: «امسح النموذج» و«أرسل الطلب». وقد يريد المتقدّمون أيضًا الخروج دون إرسال."},"prompt":{"en":"What should we put at the bottom of the form?","ar":"ماذا نضع أسفل النموذج؟"},"options":[{"id":"red","text":{"en":"Keep both, but make \"Reset form\" red so people notice it","ar":"أبقِ الزرّين، لكن اجعل «امسح النموذج» أحمر لكي يلاحظه الناس"}},{"id":"same","text":{"en":"Keep both buttons as they are; people can choose","ar":"أبقِ الزرّين كما هما؛ والناس يختارون"}},{"id":"cancel","text":{"en":"Remove Reset; keep \"Submit\" as the main button and a quiet \"Cancel\" link","ar":"احذف زر المسح؛ وأبقِ «أرسل» زرًا رئيسيًا مع رابط «إلغاء» هادئ"}}],"answer":["cancel"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P14-054","when":["red","same"],"feedback":{"en":"Almost nobody wants to erase twelve answers and a CV. A same-size or louder Reset button just waits for the tap that wipes twenty minutes of work.","ar":"لا أحد تقريبًا يريد أن يمسح اثنتي عشرة إجابة وسيرة ذاتية. وزر المسح بالحجم نفسه أو بلون أقوى ينتظر فقط الضغطة التي تمسح عشرين دقيقة من العمل."}}],"correct":{"en":"No Reset; one clear Submit, a quiet Cancel.","ar":"لا زر مسح؛ زر إرسال واضح، وإلغاء هادئ."},"explain":{"en":"Submit is the one action that matters, so it gets the strong button. Cancel covers leaving without sending, and its quiet style makes a wrong tap unlikely.","ar":"الإرسال هو الإجراء المهم الوحيد، فيأخذ الزر القوي. والإلغاء يغطي الخروج دون إرسال، وشكله الهادئ يجعل الضغط عليه بالخطأ أمرًا نادرًا."}},{"id":"S08","type":"card","part":"recap","icons":["ok","eye","layers"],"title":{"en":"What you practised","ar":"ما تدرّبت عليه"},"body":{"en":"- **Rules up front**, next to the field, before people type.\n- **Specific errors on the field**, with an icon and words, not colour alone.\n- **Keep what people typed**, and leave out Reset; Cancel stays quiet.\n\nNext: the skill check for this unit.","ar":"- **الشروط من البداية**، بجانب الحقل، قبل أن يكتب الناس.\n- **أخطاء محددة على الحقل**، مع رمز وكلمات، لا باللون وحده.\n- **احتفظ بما كتبه الناس**، ولا تضع زر Reset؛ والإلغاء يبقى هادئًا.\n\nالتالي: اختبار المهارة لهذه الوحدة."}}]}$uxg$::jsonb),
  ($uxg$P14-U05-L04$uxg$, $uxg$f76ef6c533937b9176e40b34b3094c6a01c8370c1728a53030f66386af222fc1$uxg$, $uxg${"id":"P14-U05-L04","mode":"check","minutes":7,"title":{"en":"Skill check: forms people finish","ar":"اختبار المهارة: نماذج يكملها الناس"},"speaker":"sara","steps":[{"id":"S01","type":"card","part":"hook","title":{"en":"Sara's enrolment form","ar":"نموذج سارة للتسجيل"},"body":{"en":"I'm designing the enrolment form for an evening language school. To join a class, the school needs the student's name and mobile number, their level, and a class time. Staff call every new student within a day.\n\nThis is a skill check: no hints, and you'll see how you did at the end.","ar":"أصمّم نموذج التسجيل لمدرسة لغات مسائية. ولكي ينضم الطالب إلى فصل، تحتاج المدرسة إلى اسمه ورقم موبايله، ومستواه، وموعد الفصل. ويتصل الموظفون بكل طالب جديد خلال يوم.\n\nهذا اختبار مهارة: بدون تلميحات، وسترى نتيجتك في النهاية."}},{"id":"S02","type":"choose","part":"check","skill":"SK-P14-U05-01","value":{"en":"Check, web forms (NN/g): every time you cut a field or question from a form, you increase its conversion rate. Keep only what the school needs to place a student.","ar":"اختبار، النماذج في المواقع (NN/g): كلما حذفت حقلًا أو سؤالًا من النموذج، زاد عدد من يكملونه. فأبقِ فقط ما تحتاجه المدرسة لتسجيل الطالب في فصل."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/web-form-design/","quote":"Every time you cut a field or question from a form, you increase its conversion rate"},"scenario":{"en":"My draft has six fields: full name, mobile number, home address, level, class time, and \"Why do you want to learn?\". The school never sends anything by post, and teachers ask about goals in the first class.","ar":"في مسودتي ستة حقول: الاسم بالكامل، ورقم الموبايل، وعنوان المنزل، والمستوى، وموعد الفصل، و«لماذا تريد أن تتعلّم؟». والمدرسة لا ترسل أي شيء بالبريد، والمدرّسون يسألون عن الأهداف في أول حصة."},"prompt":{"en":"Which fields should I remove?","ar":"ما الحقول التي يجب أن أحذفها؟"},"options":[{"id":"none","text":{"en":"None: more information helps the school","ar":"لا شيء: المعلومات الإضافية تفيد المدرسة"}},{"id":"goals","text":{"en":"Only \"Why do you want to learn?\"","ar":"«لماذا تريد أن تتعلّم؟» فقط"}},{"id":"both","text":{"en":"Home address and \"Why do you want to learn?\"","ar":"عنوان المنزل و«لماذا تريد أن تتعلّم؟»"}},{"id":"mobile","text":{"en":"Home address and mobile number","ar":"عنوان المنزل ورقم الموبايل"}}],"answer":["both"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P14-042","when":["none","goals"],"feedback":{"en":"The address is never used, and the goals are asked in the first class anyway. Each unused field is another reason to stop before enrolling.","ar":"العنوان لا يُستخدم أبدًا، والأهداف تُسأل في أول حصة على أي حال. وكل حقل غير مستخدم سبب جديد للتوقف قبل التسجيل."}},{"id":"MC-P14-042","when":["mobile"],"feedback":{"en":"Staff call every new student, so the mobile number is needed now. Cut the fields the school never uses or gets later.","ar":"الموظفون يتصلون بكل طالب جديد، فرقم الموبايل مطلوب الآن. احذف الحقول التي لا تستخدمها المدرسة أو تحصل عليها لاحقًا."}}],"correct":{"en":"Cut the address and the goals question.","ar":"احذف العنوان وسؤال الأهداف."},"explain":{"en":"Four fields remain, and the school uses every one of them to place and call the student.","ar":"تبقى أربعة حقول، وتستخدم المدرسة كل واحد منها لتسجيل الطالب في فصل والاتصال به."},"speaker":"sara"},{"id":"S03","type":"compare","part":"check","skill":"SK-P14-U05-02","value":{"en":"Check, web forms (NN/g): multiple columns interrupt the vertical momentum of moving down the form. One field per row keeps one clear path.","ar":"اختبار، النماذج في المواقع (NN/g): الأعمدة المتعددة تقطع حركة الناس إلى أسفل النموذج. وحقل واحد في كل صف يُبقي مسارًا واحدًا واضحًا."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/web-form-design/","quote":"Multiple columns interrupt the vertical momentum of moving down the form."},"scenario":{"en":"On a laptop, the four fields fit in two columns, so the button shows without scrolling.","ar":"على الـ Laptop، تتسع الحقول الأربعة في عمودين، فيظهر الزر دون تمرير."},"prompt":{"en":"Which version should ship?","ar":"أيّ نسخة يجب أن تُطلق؟"},"a":{"label":{"en":"Version A: two columns","ar":"النسخة A: عمودان"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"kalima","name":{"en":"Kalima","ar":"كلمة"},"color":"#6741D9","icon":"translate","domain":"kalima.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"kalima.example/school/enrol","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Courses","ar":"الدورات"},{"en":"Evening school","ar":"المدرسة المسائية"},{"en":"Prices","ar":"الأسعار"}],"active":1,"actions":[{"icon":"user"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Enrol in a class","ar":"سجّل في فصل"}},{"kind":"row","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Full name","ar":"الاسم بالكامل"},"text":""},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Mobile number","ar":"رقم الموبايل"},"text":""}]},{"kind":"row","blocks":[{"kind":"select","label":{"en":"Level","ar":"المستوى"},"text":{"en":"Choose","ar":"اختر"}},{"kind":"select","label":{"en":"Class time","ar":"موعد الفصل"},"text":{"en":"Choose","ar":"اختر"}}]},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Enrol","ar":"سجّل"},"gap":"m"}]}},"b":{"label":{"en":"Version B: one column","ar":"النسخة B: عمود واحد"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"kalima","name":{"en":"Kalima","ar":"كلمة"},"color":"#6741D9","icon":"translate","domain":"kalima.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"kalima.example/school/enrol","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Courses","ar":"الدورات"},{"en":"Evening school","ar":"المدرسة المسائية"},{"en":"Prices","ar":"الأسعار"}],"active":1,"actions":[{"icon":"user"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Enrol in a class","ar":"سجّل في فصل"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Full name","ar":"الاسم بالكامل"},"text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Mobile number","ar":"رقم الموبايل"},"text":""},{"kind":"select","label":{"en":"Level","ar":"المستوى"},"text":{"en":"Choose","ar":"اختر"}},{"kind":"select","label":{"en":"Class time","ar":"موعد الفصل"},"text":{"en":"Choose","ar":"اختر"}},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Enrol","ar":"سجّل"},"gap":"m"}]}},"answer":"b","misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P14-043","when":["a"],"feedback":{"en":"Two columns make people zig-zag, and some fill the left column and miss Mobile number or Class time. A short scroll costs less than a missed field.","ar":"العمودان يجعلان العين تتحرك في خط متعرّج، ويملأ بعض الناس العمود الأول ويتجاوزون رقم الموبايل أو موعد الفصل. والتمرير القصير أقل تكلفة من حقل يفوتهم."}}],"correct":{"en":"B: one column.","ar":"B: عمود واحد."},"explain":{"en":"Straight down, one field at a time: nobody misses a field, on a laptop or a phone.","ar":"إلى أسفل مباشرة، حقلًا بعد حقل: لا أحد يتجاوز أي حقل، على الـ Laptop أو الموبايل."},"speaker":"sara"},{"id":"S04","type":"compare","part":"check","skill":"SK-P14-U05-03","value":{"en":"Check, placeholders in form fields (NN/g): disappearing placeholder text strains users' short-term memory. Visible labels outside the fields stay while people check their answers.","ar":"اختبار، نص الـ Placeholder داخل الحقول (NN/g): النص الذي يختفي يُتعب الذاكرة قصيرة المدى. والأسماء الظاهرة خارج الحقول تبقى أثناء مراجعة الناس لإجاباتهم."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/form-design-placeholders/","quote":"Disappearing placeholder text strains users’ short-term memory."},"scenario":{"en":"Parents can enrol a child too, so the form asks for the student's mobile number and a parent's mobile number. Here is the form after a parent has filled in both.","ar":"يستطيع الآباء تسجيل أبنائهم أيضًا، لذلك يطلب النموذج رقم موبايل الطالب ورقم موبايل ولي الأمر. وهذا شكل النموذج بعد أن ملأ أحد الآباء الحقلين."},"prompt":{"en":"Which version should ship?","ar":"أيّ نسخة يجب أن تُطلق؟"},"a":{"label":{"en":"Version A: names inside the fields","ar":"النسخة A: الأسماء داخل الحقول"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"kalima","name":{"en":"Kalima","ar":"كلمة"},"color":"#6741D9","icon":"translate","domain":"kalima.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Enrol in a class","ar":"سجّل في فصل"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"translate","text":{"en":"English · Evening school","ar":"الإنجليزية · المدرسة المسائية"},"sub":{"en":"Sun and Tue, 7 pm","ar":"الأحد والثلاثاء، 7 م"}},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Contact numbers","ar":"أرقام التواصل"}},{"kind":"field","text":"0111 222 3344","filled":true,"gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","text":"0100 987 6543","filled":true}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Enrol","ar":"سجّل"}}]}},"b":{"label":{"en":"Version B: labels above the fields","ar":"النسخة B: الأسماء فوق الحقول"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"kalima","name":{"en":"Kalima","ar":"كلمة"},"color":"#6741D9","icon":"translate","domain":"kalima.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Enrol in a class","ar":"سجّل في فصل"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"translate","text":{"en":"English · Evening school","ar":"الإنجليزية · المدرسة المسائية"},"sub":{"en":"Sun and Tue, 7 pm","ar":"الأحد والثلاثاء، 7 م"}},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Contact numbers","ar":"أرقام التواصل"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Student's mobile","ar":"موبايل الطالب"},"text":"0111 222 3344","filled":true,"gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Parent's mobile","ar":"موبايل ولي الأمر"},"text":"0100 987 6543","filled":true}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Enrol","ar":"سجّل"}}]}},"answer":"b","misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P14-046","when":["a"],"feedback":{"en":"Once both numbers are typed, nothing says which is the child's and which is the parent's. If they're swapped, staff call the wrong person.","ar":"بعد كتابة الرقمين، لا شيء يقول أيّهما للطالب وأيّهما لولي الأمر. وإن وُضع كل رقم في حقل الآخر، يتصل الموظفون بالشخص الخطأ."}}],"correct":{"en":"B: labels stay after typing.","ar":"B: الأسماء تبقى بعد الكتابة."},"explain":{"en":"With labels above, the parent can check at a glance that each number is in the right field.","ar":"مع الأسماء فوق الحقول، يستطيع ولي الأمر أن يتأكد بنظرة أن كل رقم في الحقل الصحيح."},"speaker":"sara"},{"id":"S05","type":"tune","part":"check","skill":"SK-P14-U05-04","value":{"en":"Check, web forms (NN/g): avoid drop-downs when there are only 2 or 3 options that could be displayed as radio buttons.","ar":"اختبار، النماذج في المواقع (NN/g): تجنّب الـ Dropdown حين توجد 2 أو 3 اختيارات فقط يمكن عرضها كـ Radio buttons."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/web-form-design/","quote":"Avoid drop-downs when there are only 2 or 3 options that could be displayed as radio buttons"},"scenario":{"en":"The school has three levels: Beginner, Intermediate and Advanced.","ar":"في المدرسة ثلاثة مستويات: مبتدئ، ومتوسط، ومتقدّم."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each version of the Level field. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل نسخة من حقل المستوى. أيّ نسخة تجعل كل طالب يختار مستواه بسرعة، بكلمات تفهمها المدرسة؟"},"start":"select","options":[{"id":"select","text":{"en":"A drop-down","ar":"Dropdown"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"kalima","name":{"en":"Kalima","ar":"كلمة"},"color":"#6741D9","icon":"translate","domain":"kalima.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Enrol in a class","ar":"سجّل في فصل"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"translate","text":{"en":"English · Evening school","ar":"الإنجليزية · المدرسة المسائية"},"sub":{"en":"Sun and Tue, 7 pm","ar":"الأحد والثلاثاء، 7 م"}},{"kind":"select","label":{"en":"Level *","ar":"المستوى *"},"text":{"en":"Choose your level","ar":"اختر مستواك"}}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Enrol","ar":"سجّل"}}]}},{"id":"field","text":{"en":"A text field to type the level","ar":"حقل نصي لكتابة المستوى"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"kalima","name":{"en":"Kalima","ar":"كلمة"},"color":"#6741D9","icon":"translate","domain":"kalima.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Enrol in a class","ar":"سجّل في فصل"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"translate","text":{"en":"English · Evening school","ar":"الإنجليزية · المدرسة المسائية"},"sub":{"en":"Sun and Tue, 7 pm","ar":"الأحد والثلاثاء، 7 م"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Level *","ar":"المستوى *"},"text":""}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Enrol","ar":"سجّل"}}]}},{"id":"radio","text":{"en":"Three radio buttons","ar":"ثلاثة Radio buttons"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"kalima","name":{"en":"Kalima","ar":"كلمة"},"color":"#6741D9","icon":"translate","domain":"kalima.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Enrol in a class","ar":"سجّل في فصل"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"translate","text":{"en":"English · Evening school","ar":"الإنجليزية · المدرسة المسائية"},"sub":{"en":"Sun and Tue, 7 pm","ar":"الأحد والثلاثاء، 7 م"}},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Level *","ar":"المستوى *"}},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Beginner","ar":"مبتدئ"},"selected":true},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Intermediate","ar":"متوسط"}},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Advanced","ar":"متقدّم"}}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Enrol","ar":"سجّل"}}]}}],"answer":["radio"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P14-049","when":["select"],"feedback":{"en":"The three levels hide behind a tap, so people open the list just to see what's possible.","ar":"المستويات الثلاثة مخفية خلف ضغطة، فيفتح الناس القائمة فقط ليعرفوا ما المتاح."}},{"id":"MC-P14-049","when":["field"],"feedback":{"en":"People don't know the exact words the school uses, so they type \"medium\", \"B1\" or \"so-so\", and staff must sort it out by phone.","ar":"الناس لا يعرفون الكلمات التي تستخدمها المدرسة بالضبط، فيكتبون «وسط» أو «B1» أو «عادي»، ويضطر الموظفون إلى توضيح ذلك بالهاتف."}}],"correct":{"en":"Radio buttons for three options.","ar":"Radio buttons لثلاثة اختيارات."},"explain":{"en":"All three levels are visible, people pick with one tap, and every answer is one the school understands.","ar":"المستويات الثلاثة ظاهرة، ويختار الناس بضغطة واحدة، وكل إجابة تفهمها المدرسة."},"speaker":"sara"},{"id":"S06","type":"tune","part":"check","skill":"SK-P14-U05-05","value":{"en":"Check, error messages in forms (NN/g): keeping error messages next to the fields in error minimizes working-memory load. Say what went wrong and keep what people typed.","ar":"اختبار، رسائل الخطأ في النماذج (NN/g): وضع رسائل الخطأ بجانب الحقول التي بها الخطأ يقلّل الضغط على الذاكرة العاملة. فقل ما الخطأ واحتفظ بما كتبه الناس."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/errors-forms-design-guidelines/","quote":"Keeping error messages next to the fields in error minimizes working-memory load"},"scenario":{"en":"A student typed their mobile number with only 10 digits and pressed Enrol.","ar":"كتب أحد الطلاب رقم موبايله من 10 أرقام فقط، ثم ضغط «سجّل»."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each version of the error. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل نسخة من رسالة الخطأ. أيّ نسخة تساعد الطالب على أن يعرف المشكلة ويصلحها بسرعة؟"},"start":"top","options":[{"id":"top","text":{"en":"A red message at the top: \"Something went wrong\"","ar":"رسالة حمراء في الأعلى: «حدث خطأ ما»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"kalima","name":{"en":"Kalima","ar":"كلمة"},"color":"#6741D9","icon":"translate","domain":"kalima.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Enrol in a class","ar":"سجّل في فصل"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"translate","text":{"en":"English · Evening school","ar":"الإنجليزية · المدرسة المسائية"},"sub":{"en":"Sun and Tue, 7 pm","ar":"الأحد والثلاثاء، 7 م"}},{"kind":"banner","tone":"bad","text":{"en":"Something went wrong. Please try again.","ar":"حدث خطأ ما. من فضلك حاول مرة أخرى."}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Full name","ar":"الاسم بالكامل"},"text":{"en":"Ayman Nabil","ar":"أيمن نبيل"},"filled":true,"gap":"m"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Mobile number","ar":"رقم الموبايل"},"text":"0111 222 334","filled":true}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Enrol","ar":"سجّل"}}]}},{"id":"border","text":{"en":"A red border on the mobile field","ar":"إطار أحمر على حقل الموبايل"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"kalima","name":{"en":"Kalima","ar":"كلمة"},"color":"#6741D9","icon":"translate","domain":"kalima.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Enrol in a class","ar":"سجّل في فصل"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"translate","text":{"en":"English · Evening school","ar":"الإنجليزية · المدرسة المسائية"},"sub":{"en":"Sun and Tue, 7 pm","ar":"الأحد والثلاثاء، 7 م"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Full name","ar":"الاسم بالكامل"},"text":{"en":"Ayman Nabil","ar":"أيمن نبيل"},"filled":true},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Mobile number","ar":"رقم الموبايل"},"text":"0111 222 334","filled":true,"tone":"bad"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Enrol","ar":"سجّل"}}]}},{"id":"inline","text":{"en":"An icon and a message on the mobile field","ar":"رمز ورسالة على حقل الموبايل"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"kalima","name":{"en":"Kalima","ar":"كلمة"},"color":"#6741D9","icon":"translate","domain":"kalima.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Enrol in a class","ar":"سجّل في فصل"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"translate","text":{"en":"English · Evening school","ar":"الإنجليزية · المدرسة المسائية"},"sub":{"en":"Sun and Tue, 7 pm","ar":"الأحد والثلاثاء، 7 م"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Full name","ar":"الاسم بالكامل"},"text":{"en":"Ayman Nabil","ar":"أيمن نبيل"},"filled":true},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Mobile number","ar":"رقم الموبايل"},"text":"0111 222 334","filled":true,"tone":"bad","error":{"en":"⚠ This number has 10 digits. Mobile numbers have 11.","ar":"⚠ هذا الرقم من 10 أرقام. ورقم الموبايل من 11 رقمًا."}}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Enrol","ar":"سجّل"}}]}}],"answer":["inline"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P14-051","when":["top"],"feedback":{"en":"\"Something went wrong\" names no field and no problem. The student may press Enrol again and get the same message.","ar":"«حدث خطأ ما» لا تذكر حقلًا ولا مشكلة. فقد يضغط الطالب «سجّل» مرة أخرى ويرى الرسالة نفسها."}},{"id":"MC-P14-052","when":["border"],"feedback":{"en":"A red border alone is easy to miss, and it doesn't say what's wrong with the number.","ar":"الإطار الأحمر وحده يسهل ألا يُلاحظ، ولا يقول ما المشكلة في الرقم."}}],"correct":{"en":"A specific message on the field.","ar":"رسالة محددة على الحقل."},"explain":{"en":"The icon and words point to the field and name the problem. The number stays, so the student adds one digit and enrols.","ar":"الرمز والكلمات تشير إلى الحقل وتذكر المشكلة. والرقم يبقى، فيضيف الطالب رقمًا واحدًا ويكمل التسجيل."},"speaker":"sara"}]}$uxg$::jsonb),
  ($uxg$P14-U06-L01$uxg$, $uxg$4ff03070387f07e0d320313178598ac4419a6328312d149f6e486f9d0befc8d6$uxg$, $uxg${"id":"P14-U06-L01","mode":"lesson","minutes":8,"title":{"en":"Steppers for small counts","ar":"الـ Steppers للأعداد الصغيرة"},"speaker":"rami","review_labels":{"MC-P14-056":{"en":"Start a stepper on the most common value","ar":"ابدأ الـ Stepper على القيمة الأكثر شيوعًا"},"MC-P14-057":{"en":"For small counts, a stepper beats a drop-down or typing","ar":"للأعداد الصغيرة، الـ Stepper أفضل من الـ Dropdown أو الكتابة"},"MC-P14-058":{"en":"Grey out + or − at the limit","ar":"عطّل + أو − عند الحد"},"MC-P14-059":{"en":"Steppers don't fit large or wide-ranging numbers","ar":"الـ Stepper لا يناسب الأرقام الكبيرة أو الواسعة المدى"},"MC-P14-060":{"en":"Show the unit next to the number","ar":"اعرض الوحدة بجانب الرقم"},"MC-P14-061":{"en":"Let people type a big jump into the stepper","ar":"اسمح للناس بكتابة القفزة الكبيرة داخل الـ Stepper"}},"steps":[{"id":"S01","type":"card","part":"hook","title":{"en":"Rami's flight search","ar":"بحث رامي عن رحلات الطيران"},"body":{"en":"I'm designing the search form of a flight-booking website. Before searching, people say how many adults and children are travelling.\n\nThe booking data is clear: most searches are for 2 adults. Almost all the rest are for 1, 3 or 4.","ar":"أصمّم نموذج البحث في موقع لحجز تذاكر الطيران. وقبل البحث، يحدد الناس عدد البالغين والأطفال المسافرين.\n\nوبيانات الحجز واضحة: أغلب عمليات البحث لبالغَين اثنين. وكل الباقي تقريبًا لـ 1 أو 3 أو 4."},"mock":{"app":{"id":"zad","name":{"en":"Zad Travel","ar":"زاد للسفر"},"color":"#6D28D9","icon":"airplane-tilt","domain":"zad.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Cairo → Dubai","ar":"القاهرة ← دبي"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"segmented","options":[{"en":"Round trip","ar":"ذهاب وعودة"},{"en":"One way","ar":"ذهاب فقط"}],"value":0},{"kind":"select","label":{"en":"Dates","ar":"التواريخ"},"text":{"en":"12 Dec – 19 Dec","ar":"من 12 إلى 19 ديسمبر"},"filled":true},{"kind":"select","label":{"en":"Travellers","ar":"المسافرون"},"text":{"en":"?","ar":"؟"}}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Search flights","ar":"ابحث عن رحلات"}}]}},{"id":"S02","type":"tune","part":"try","skill":"SK-P14-U06-01","rules":["R12"],"confidence":true,"value":{"en":"Try first. Input steppers (NN/g): steppers make sense for numerical parameters with a clear default that most users are likely to select. Set the most frequently selected value as the default.","ar":"جرّب أولًا. الـ Input steppers (NN/g): الـ Stepper مناسب للقيم الرقمية التي لها قيمة افتراضية واضحة يختارها أغلب الناس. واجعل القيمة الأكثر اختيارًا هي القيمة الافتراضية."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/input-steppers/","quote":"Steppers make sense for numerical parameters with a clear default that most users are likely to select."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each version of the Adults field. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل نسخة من حقل البالغين. أيّ نسخة تكلّف أغلب الناس أقل عدد من الضغطات؟"},"start":"dropdown","options":[{"id":"dropdown","text":{"en":"A drop-down from 1 to 9","ar":"Dropdown من 1 إلى 9"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"zad","name":{"en":"Zad Travel","ar":"زاد للسفر"},"color":"#6D28D9","icon":"airplane-tilt","domain":"zad.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Cairo → Dubai","ar":"القاهرة ← دبي"},"back":true},"overlay":{"type":"sheet","title":{"en":"Travellers","ar":"المسافرون"},"blocks":[{"kind":"select","label":{"en":"Adults","ar":"البالغون"},"text":{"en":"Choose","ar":"اختر"}},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Done","ar":"تم"},"gap":"m"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"select","label":{"en":"Dates","ar":"التواريخ"},"text":{"en":"12 Dec – 19 Dec","ar":"من 12 إلى 19 ديسمبر"},"filled":true},{"kind":"select","label":{"en":"Travellers","ar":"المسافرون"},"text":{"en":"?","ar":"؟"},"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"zero","text":{"en":"A stepper that starts at 0","ar":"Stepper يبدأ من 0"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"zad","name":{"en":"Zad Travel","ar":"زاد للسفر"},"color":"#6D28D9","icon":"airplane-tilt","domain":"zad.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Cairo → Dubai","ar":"القاهرة ← دبي"},"back":true},"overlay":{"type":"sheet","title":{"en":"Travellers","ar":"المسافرون"},"blocks":[{"kind":"stepper","label":{"en":"Adults","ar":"البالغون"},"text":"0","min":0,"max":9},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Done","ar":"تم"},"gap":"m"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"select","label":{"en":"Dates","ar":"التواريخ"},"text":{"en":"12 Dec – 19 Dec","ar":"من 12 إلى 19 ديسمبر"},"filled":true},{"kind":"select","label":{"en":"Travellers","ar":"المسافرون"},"text":{"en":"?","ar":"؟"},"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"two","text":{"en":"A stepper that starts at 2","ar":"Stepper يبدأ من 2"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"zad","name":{"en":"Zad Travel","ar":"زاد للسفر"},"color":"#6D28D9","icon":"airplane-tilt","domain":"zad.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Cairo → Dubai","ar":"القاهرة ← دبي"},"back":true},"overlay":{"type":"sheet","title":{"en":"Travellers","ar":"المسافرون"},"blocks":[{"kind":"stepper","label":{"en":"Adults","ar":"البالغون"},"text":"2","min":1,"max":9},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Done","ar":"تم"},"gap":"m"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"select","label":{"en":"Dates","ar":"التواريخ"},"text":{"en":"12 Dec – 19 Dec","ar":"من 12 إلى 19 ديسمبر"},"filled":true},{"kind":"select","label":{"en":"Travellers","ar":"المسافرون"},"text":{"en":"?","ar":"؟"},"gap":"s"}]}}],"answer":["two"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P14-057","when":["dropdown"],"feedback":{"en":"The drop-down takes three steps for everyone: open, scroll, pick. With a stepper on the usual value, most people take zero steps.","ar":"الـ Dropdown يأخذ ثلاث خطوات من الجميع: فتح، ثم تمرير، ثم اختيار. ومع Stepper على القيمة المعتادة، لا يحتاج أغلب الناس إلى أي خطوة."}},{"id":"MC-P14-056","when":["zero"],"feedback":{"en":"Nobody flies with 0 adults. Everyone has to tap + at least once, and most twice, before they can search.","ar":"لا أحد يسافر بـ 0 بالغين. فيضطر الجميع إلى الضغط على + مرة على الأقل، وأغلبهم مرتين، قبل أن يبحثوا."}}],"hints":[{"en":"What do most people choose? How many taps does each version cost them?","ar":"ماذا يختار أغلب الناس؟ وكم ضغطة تكلّفهم كل نسخة؟"}],"correct":{"en":"A stepper on the most common value.","ar":"Stepper على القيمة الأكثر شيوعًا."},"explain":{"en":"Most people go straight on with 2. The rest tap + or − once or twice. The minimum is 1, because a flight needs at least one adult.","ar":"أغلب الناس يكملون مباشرة بـ 2. والباقون يضغطون + أو − مرة أو مرتين. والحد الأدنى 1، لأن الرحلة تحتاج إلى بالغ واحد على الأقل."}},{"id":"S09","type":"video","part":"concept","title":{"en":"Steppers","ar":"الـ Steppers"},"video":"9f9a61aa-8c8f-492b-b18a-9e94ffa4c1ae","duration":269,"transcript":[{"t":2.5,"en":"If we think together about the benefit I can get from a pattern like this: why is there a pattern called the stepper at all? If we look at examples like","ar":"لو جينا نفكر مع بعض إيه الفايدة اللي ممكن أستفيدها من Pattern زي ده، ليه في Pattern أصلًا اسمه الـ Stepper؟ لو شفنا أمثلة زي"},{"t":10,"en":"these and start thinking, we can come up with some benefits: I won't need to use the keyboard, I can just tap, increasing and decreasing until I reach the number I want.","ar":"كده وبدأنا نفكر، ممكن نطلع ببعض الفوايد: زي إني مش هحتاج أستخدم الكيبورد، أنا ممكن بس أضغط، فأزوّد وأنقّص لحد ما أوصل للرقم اللي عايزه."},{"t":17.5,"en":"If I want to make the most of this, I need to understand the default of the input the user enters. Say I'm building a website or mobile app for people to book flights:","ar":"النقطة دي لو عايز أستغلها أفضل استغلال، محتاج أكون فاهم الـ Default بتاع الـ Input اللي اليوزر بيدخله. يعني لو بعمل Website أو Mobile application عشان اليوزرز يحجزوا رحلات طيران مثلًا،"},{"t":29.25,"en":"I'll look at how many adults users enter when they book, how many people they book tickets for: one person, or 2, 3 or 4. I'll look at the most frequent number, or numbers,","ar":"هبدأ أشوف اليوزرز لما بيحجزوا بيحددوا عدد البالغين اللي هيسافروا، أو بيحجزوا تذاكر لكام شخص: لشخص أو 2 أو 3 أو 4. هبدأ أشوف أكتر رقم متكرر، أو أكتر أرقام متكررة، وآخد"},{"t":41,"en":"take the middle one, say, and make that the default in the stepper. So if that number is 2, and most users enter 2, 3 or 1, a user arriving will either continue straight","ar":"الرقم المتوسط بينهم مثلًا، ويكون ده الـ Default اللي هحطه في الـ Stepper. يعني لو الرقم ده 2 مثلًا، وأغلب اليوزرز بيحطوا 2 أو 3 أو 1، فاليوزر لما يدخل إما"},{"t":52.75,"en":"away because 2 is already the default, or tap plus once or minus once, or twice, and reach the number they want. So I reduce the interaction cost we talked about at the start.","ar":"هيكمّل مباشرة لأنه هيلاقي 2 هو الـ Default اللي موجود، وإما هيضغط Plus مرة أو Minus مرة، أو مرتين، ويوصل للرقم اللي عايزه. فهقلّل الـ Interaction cost اللي اتكلمنا عنه في الأول."},{"t":64.5,"en":"That's another benefit of the input stepper, besides being very easy to use; anyone can use it, because it has very clear signifiers like plus and minus: signifiers that tell me what","ar":"ودي برضه من فوايد الـ Input stepper، غير إنه سهل الاستخدام جدًا، أي حد ممكن يستخدمه، لأن فيه Signifiers واضحة قوي زي الـ Plus والـ Minus: Signifiers بتخلّيني"},{"t":74.5,"en":"action will happen when I tap. I know this one increases and that one decreases, and almost everyone understands that, or the up arrow and down arrow, and so on. So it's very","ar":"أفهم إيه الـ Action اللي هيحصل لما أضغط. أنا عارف إن ده هيزوّد وده هينقّص، وكل الناس تقريبًا فاهمة المعنى ده، أو لما أضغط على سهم فوق أو"},{"t":84.5,"en":"easy to use in the first place. And the interaction cost, as we said: if I set a suitable default, tapping plus or minus once gets me to the number I want, instead","ar":"سهم تحت، وهكذا. فهو أصلًا سهل جدًا في الاستخدام. وفي نفس الوقت الـ Interaction cost زي ما اتكلمنا: لو حطيت Default مناسب، أنا لو ضغطت Plus أو Minus مرة"},{"t":94.5,"en":"of tapping and typing, or opening a dropdown and choosing, and so on. So I have a much lower interaction cost. Like here: I need to choose how many people are travelling; I","ar":"واحدة هوصل للرقم اللي عايزه، بدل ما أضغط وأكتب أو أفتح Drop down وأختار، وهكذا. فعندي Interaction cost أقل بكتير. زي هنا: محتاج أختار عدد الأشخاص اللي هيسافروا،"},{"t":104.5,"en":"could open a dropdown, or open the scrolling picker and pick a number from it, or type the number myself. Using the stepper can be much faster, so it's a low interaction cost.","ar":"ممكن أفتح Drop down، أو أفتح الـ Scrolling picker وأبدأ أختار منه رقم، أو أكتب الرقم أنا. لو استخدمت الـ Stepper ممكن يكون أسرع بكتير، فيكون Low interaction cost."},{"t":114.5,"en":"If we think from the other side, what drawbacks can a stepper have? We can think about an example like this one: we find that often, especially on desktop, the stepper","ar":"لو بدأنا نفكر من الناحية التانية، إيه العيوب اللي ممكن تكون في الـ Stepper؟ ممكن نفكر في مثال زي اللي قدامنا ده: هنلاقي إن أوقات كتير، بالذات في الـ"},{"t":125.3,"en":"sits in a small spot, like this: an up arrow and a down arrow close together. According to Fitts's law, as we saw when we talked about it in the visual","ar":"Desktop، الـ Stepper بيكون موجود في مكان صغير، زي الشكل ده: سهم فوق وسهم تحت قريبين من بعض. فطبقًا لـ Fitts's law، لو شفنا كورس الـ Visual design لما"},{"t":136.1,"en":"design course, the bigger the target I'm heading for, the faster I can get to it and click, and so the faster I finish the task or flow I'm in. So","ar":"اتكلمنا عنه: Fitts's law بيفهّمني إن كل ما يكون الـ Target اللي أنا رايح عليه أكبر، كل ما أقدر أروح له وأضغط أسرع، وبالتالي أخلّص الهدف أو الـ Flow اللي"},{"t":146.9,"en":"of course the stepper on desktop is sometimes a bit small, and getting to it and clicking can be a bit hard at times. Another point: I can't adjust numbers by","ar":"ماشي فيه أسرع. فطبعًا الـ Stepper أحيانًا في الـ Desktop بيكون صغير شوية، فإني أروح أقف عليه وأضغط بيكون صعب شوية أحيانًا. برضه نقطة تانية: مش هقدر أعمل Adjust"},{"t":157.7,"en":"a large amount. If I'm at 1384, say, and want to reach 1500, and I only have the stepper, I'll have to click 116 times to reach 1500, which certainly isn't practical.","ar":"للأرقام بشكل كبير. لو أنا مثلًا عند 1384 وعايز أوصل لـ 1500، ولو عندي الـ Stepper بس، هضطر أضغط 116 مرة عشان أوصل لـ 1500، فأكيد دي مش حاجة عملية."},{"t":168.5,"en":"So we need to think about what we can adjust or add to the stepper to improve it or fix its problems or drawbacks. The first thing that may come to mind is a text field","ar":"فمحتاجين نفكر في الحاجات اللي ممكن نظبطها أو نزوّدها على الـ Stepper عشان نحسّن أو نعالج المشاكل أو الـ Drawbacks اللي فيه. أول حاجة ممكن تيجي في بالنا إننا نعمل Text"},{"t":179.5,"en":"stepper: I have both options, I use it as a stepper, tapping plus or minus to raise or lower the number, or I tap it and it becomes a text field, I delete the number and type","ar":"field stepper: يعني عندي الأوبشنين، أستخدمه كـ Stepper، أضغط Plus أو Minus أزوّد أو أنقّص الرقم، أو أضغط عليه فيكون Text field، أمسح الرقم وأكتب أي رقم عايزه، عشان الـ Large"},{"t":190.5,"en":"any number I want, for the large adjustments we mentioned. The second thing we can consider is making a long press on plus or minus raise or lower the number quickly: it might go up by","ar":"adjustments زي ما قلنا. تاني حاجة ممكن نفكر فيها: إن الضغطة الطويلة على الـ Plus أو الـ Minus تخلّي الرقم يزيد أو يقل بسرعة: ممكن يزيد واحد كل ثانية، ولما أفضل"},{"t":201.5,"en":"one every second, and as I keep pressing, by one every half second, say, and so on. So it goes up and down faster while I hold plus. One more thing we can use on desktop specifically","ar":"ضاغط أكتر يزيد واحد كل نص ثانية مثلًا، وهكذا. فيزيد وينقص مع الضغط على الـ Plus بشكل أسرع. وحاجة كمان ممكن نستغلها تحديدًا في الـ Desktop: إننا نستغل الكيبورد، لأني لو"},{"t":212.5,"en":"is the keyboard: if I press the up or down arrow while I'm on the number in the stepper, it starts to go up or down, without needing to move the mouse and click plus and minus.","ar":"ضغطت على السهم اللي فوق أو اللي تحت وأنا واقف على الرقم اللي في الـ Stepper، يبدأ يزيد أو ينقص، من غير ما أحتاج أروح بالماوس أضغط على الـ Plus والـ Minus."},{"t":223.5,"en":"Another guideline for input steppers: we always need to make clear what value the stepper stands for. If it's a currency, I need to show exactly which one: is","ar":"لو شفنا برضه Guideline كمان في الـ Input steppers: محتاجين نوضّح دايمًا الـ Value اللي الـ Stepper ده بيعبّر عنها. يعني لو هي عملة، محتاج أوضّح هي"},{"t":233.41,"en":"this stepper in dollars, pounds, or what? I also need to make its maximum and minimum limits clear: if I reach the maximum, the plus becomes disabled and I","ar":"عملة إيه بالضبط: الـ Stepper ده دولار ولا جنيه ولا إيه. ومحتاج برضه أوضّح الـ Maximum والـ Minimum limits بتوعه: يعني لو وصلت للـ Maximum، الـ Plus يبقى"},{"t":243.31,"en":"can't tap it, or if I'm already at the minimum, the minus is disabled. Like this example: adults reached the maximum, which is 14, so the plus became disabled,","ar":"Disabled ومقدرش أضغط عليه، أو لو أنا أصلًا في الـ Minimum، الـ Minus يبقى Disabled. زي المثال اللي قدامنا: البالغين وصلوا للـ Maximum اللي هو 14، فعلامة الـ"},{"t":253.22,"en":"and children are at the minimum, zero, and I can't go below that, so the minus is disabled too. That's how I've made the minimum and maximum limits clear.","ar":"Plus بقت Disabled، والأطفال في الـ Minimum، في الصفر، ومقدرش أنزل عن كده، فعلامة الـ Minus برضه Disabled. فأنا كده وضّحت الـ Minimum والـ Maximum limits بالشكل ده."}]},{"id":"S03","type":"card","part":"concept","icons":["list","ok","eye","layers"],"title":{"en":"Video summary","ar":"ملخص الفيديو"},"body":{"en":"A stepper is a number between − and + buttons. People change the number without a keyboard, and the signs are understood by almost everyone.\n\n- **Use it for small changes:** it works best when most people pick one common value. Make that value the default, so most people need no taps at all.\n- **Watch the drawbacks:** small, stacked arrows are hard to hit on desktop, and big changes, such as from 1,384 to 1,500, would take 116 clicks.\n- **Fix them:** let people type into the number, make press-and-hold change it faster, and support the keyboard's up and down arrows.\n- **Be clear:** show the unit or currency, and grey out + at the maximum and − at the minimum.","ar":"الـ Stepper رقم بين زرّين − و+. يغيّر الناس الرقم دون لوحة مفاتيح، والعلامتان مفهومتان للجميع تقريبًا.\n\n- **استخدمه للتغييرات الصغيرة:** يعمل أفضل حين يختار أغلب الناس قيمة شائعة واحدة. اجعلها القيمة الافتراضية، فلا يحتاج أغلب الناس إلى أي ضغطة.\n- **انتبه لعيوبه:** الأسهم الصغيرة المتراصة فوق بعضها يصعب الضغط عليها على الكمبيوتر، والتغييرات الكبيرة، مثل من 1,384 إلى 1,500، تحتاج إلى 116 ضغطة.\n- **عالج العيوب:** اسمح للناس بالكتابة داخل الرقم، واجعل الضغط المطوّل يغيّره أسرع، وادعم سهمَي أعلى وأسفل في لوحة المفاتيح.\n- **كن واضحًا:** اعرض الوحدة أو العملة، وعطّل + عند الحد الأقصى و− عند الحد الأدنى."}},{"id":"S04","type":"compare","part":"guided","skill":"SK-P14-U06-02","rules":["R06"],"value":{"en":"Input steppers (NN/g): if the input value has a maximum or minimum limit, be sure to indicate it. A greyed-out button says \"you can't go further\" before anyone tries.","ar":"الـ Input steppers (NN/g): إن كان للقيمة حد أقصى أو حد أدنى، فتأكد من توضيحه. والزر المعطّل يقول «لا يمكنك الزيادة أكثر» قبل أن يحاول أحد."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/input-steppers/","quote":"Also, if the input value has a maximum or minimum limit, be sure to indicate it."},"scenario":{"en":"One booking can hold up to 9 adults. Children start at 0. Here is the picker for a big family that has reached 9 adults and has no children.","ar":"الحجز الواحد يتسع لـ 9 بالغين بحد أقصى. والأطفال يبدؤون من 0. وهذه شاشة الاختيار لعائلة كبيرة وصلت إلى 9 بالغين وليس معها أطفال."},"prompt":{"en":"Which version should ship?","ar":"أيّ نسخة يجب أن تُطلق؟"},"a":{"label":{"en":"Version A: every button looks active","ar":"النسخة A: كل الأزرار تبدو مفعّلة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"zad","name":{"en":"Zad Travel","ar":"زاد للسفر"},"color":"#6D28D9","icon":"airplane-tilt","domain":"zad.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Cairo → Dubai","ar":"القاهرة ← دبي"},"back":true},"overlay":{"type":"sheet","title":{"en":"Travellers","ar":"المسافرون"},"blocks":[{"kind":"stepper","label":{"en":"Adults","ar":"البالغون"},"text":"9"},{"kind":"stepper","label":{"en":"Children","ar":"الأطفال"},"text":"0"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Done","ar":"تم"},"gap":"m"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"select","label":{"en":"Dates","ar":"التواريخ"},"text":{"en":"12 Dec – 19 Dec","ar":"من 12 إلى 19 ديسمبر"},"filled":true},{"kind":"select","label":{"en":"Travellers","ar":"المسافرون"},"text":{"en":"9 adults","ar":"9 بالغين"},"filled":true,"gap":"s"}]}},"b":{"label":{"en":"Version B: buttons at a limit are greyed out","ar":"النسخة B: الأزرار عند الحد معطّلة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"zad","name":{"en":"Zad Travel","ar":"زاد للسفر"},"color":"#6D28D9","icon":"airplane-tilt","domain":"zad.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Cairo → Dubai","ar":"القاهرة ← دبي"},"back":true},"overlay":{"type":"sheet","title":{"en":"Travellers","ar":"المسافرون"},"blocks":[{"kind":"stepper","label":{"en":"Adults","ar":"البالغون"},"text":"9","min":1,"max":9,"hint":{"en":"Up to 9 per booking","ar":"حتى 9 في الحجز الواحد"}},{"kind":"stepper","label":{"en":"Children","ar":"الأطفال"},"text":"0","min":0,"max":8},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Done","ar":"تم"},"gap":"m"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"select","label":{"en":"Dates","ar":"التواريخ"},"text":{"en":"12 Dec – 19 Dec","ar":"من 12 إلى 19 ديسمبر"},"filled":true},{"kind":"select","label":{"en":"Travellers","ar":"المسافرون"},"text":{"en":"9 adults","ar":"9 بالغين"},"filled":true,"gap":"s"}]}},"answer":"b","misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P14-058","when":["a"],"feedback":{"en":"In A, + still looks tappable at 9. The family taps it, nothing happens, and they wonder if the site is broken or if they did something wrong.","ar":"في A، ما زال + يبدو قابلًا للضغط عند 9. فتضغط العائلة عليه، ولا يحدث شيء، فيتساءلون هل الموقع معطّل أم أنهم أخطؤوا."}}],"correct":{"en":"B: the limits are visible.","ar":"B: الحدود ظاهرة."},"explain":{"en":"The grey + and the short note say the limit before anyone hits it. The grey − on Children says 0 is the lowest, without a single wasted tap.","ar":"الـ + الرمادي والملاحظة القصيرة يوضّحان الحد قبل أن يصل إليه أحد. والـ − الرمادي عند الأطفال يقول إن 0 هو الأقل، دون أي ضغطة ضائعة."},"speaker":"rami"},{"id":"S05","type":"compare","part":"contrast","skill":"SK-P14-U06-01","rules":["R11"],"confidence":true,"value":{"en":"Input steppers (NN/g): steppers are not suitable for a large number adjustments. Too much clicking and tapping can be irritating.","ar":"الـ Input steppers (NN/g): الـ Stepper لا يناسب التغييرات الكبيرة في الأرقام. فكثرة الضغط مزعجة."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/input-steppers/","quote":"Steppers are not suitable for a large number adjustments."},"scenario":{"en":"At payment, members can pay part of the ticket with their miles. Balances range from a few hundred to 40,000 miles, and people usually use a round amount, such as 5,000 or 12,000.","ar":"عند الدفع، يستطيع الأعضاء دفع جزء من التذكرة بأميالهم. والأرصدة تتراوح بين بضع مئات و40,000 ميل، وعادة يستخدم الناس رقمًا مدوّرًا، مثل 5,000 أو 12,000."},"prompt":{"en":"Which version should ship?","ar":"أيّ نسخة يجب أن تُطلق؟"},"a":{"label":{"en":"Version A: a stepper, 100 miles per tap","ar":"النسخة A: Stepper، و100 ميل في كل ضغطة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"zad","name":{"en":"Zad Travel","ar":"زاد للسفر"},"color":"#6D28D9","icon":"airplane-tilt","domain":"zad.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Pay with miles","ar":"ادفع بالأميال"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"airplane-tilt","text":{"en":"Cairo → Dubai · 2 travellers","ar":"القاهرة ← دبي · مسافران"},"value":{"en":"EGP 31,600","ar":"31,600 جنيه"}},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Your balance: 23,400 miles","ar":"رصيدك: 23,400 ميل"}},{"kind":"stepper","label":{"en":"Miles to use","ar":"الأميال المستخدمة"},"text":{"en":"0 miles","ar":"0 ميل"},"min":0,"gap":"s"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Apply","ar":"طبّق"}}]}},"b":{"label":{"en":"Version B: a field to type the amount","ar":"النسخة B: حقل لكتابة الرقم"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"zad","name":{"en":"Zad Travel","ar":"زاد للسفر"},"color":"#6D28D9","icon":"airplane-tilt","domain":"zad.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Pay with miles","ar":"ادفع بالأميال"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"airplane-tilt","text":{"en":"Cairo → Dubai · 2 travellers","ar":"القاهرة ← دبي · مسافران"},"value":{"en":"EGP 31,600","ar":"31,600 جنيه"}},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Your balance: 23,400 miles","ar":"رصيدك: 23,400 ميل"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Miles to use","ar":"الأميال المستخدمة"},"hint":{"en":"Any amount up to 23,400","ar":"أي رقم حتى 23,400"},"text":"","gap":"s"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Apply","ar":"طبّق"}}]}},"answer":"b","misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P14-059","when":["a"],"feedback":{"en":"Reaching 12,000 miles takes 120 taps. Here there's no common value to start on and the range is huge, the opposite of what steppers are good at.","ar":"الوصول إلى 12,000 ميل يحتاج إلى 120 ضغطة. ولا توجد هنا قيمة شائعة يبدأ منها، والمدى واسع جدًا، وهذا عكس ما يجيده الـ Stepper."}}],"correct":{"en":"B: typing fits a wide range.","ar":"B: الكتابة تناسب المدى الواسع."},"explain":{"en":"The deciding factor is the size of the change. Adults change by 1 or 2 from a common value, so a stepper is fastest. Miles jump by thousands with no usual value, so typing is.","ar":"ما يحسم الأمر هو حجم التغيير. عدد البالغين يتغيّر بـ 1 أو 2 من قيمة شائعة، فالـ Stepper أسرع. أما الأميال فتقفز بالآلاف دون قيمة معتادة، فالكتابة أسرع."},"speaker":"rami"},{"id":"S06","type":"tune","part":"guided","skill":"SK-P14-U06-02","rules":["R06"],"value":{"en":"Input steppers (NN/g): designers should make the step and the unit explicit. A bare number leaves people guessing what one tap adds.","ar":"الـ Input steppers (NN/g): يجب أن يوضّح المصممون مقدار الخطوة والوحدة. فالرقم وحده يترك الناس يخمّنون ماذا تضيف الضغطة الواحدة."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/input-steppers/","quote":"Designers should make the step and the unit explicit"},"scenario":{"en":"After choosing a flight, people can add checked baggage. Each tap on + adds one 23 kg bag, for EGP 1,200.","ar":"بعد اختيار الرحلة، يستطيع الناس إضافة حقائب مشحونة. وكل ضغطة على + تضيف حقيبة واحدة وزنها 23 كجم، بسعر 1,200 جنيه."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each version. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل نسخة. أيّها يجب أن تُطلق؟"},"start":"bare","options":[{"id":"bare","text":{"en":"Just the number","ar":"الرقم فقط"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"zad","name":{"en":"Zad Travel","ar":"زاد للسفر"},"color":"#6D28D9","icon":"airplane-tilt","domain":"zad.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Extra baggage","ar":"حقائب إضافية"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"suitcase-rolling","text":{"en":"Included: 1 cabin bag (7 kg)","ar":"مشمول: حقيبة يد (7 كجم)"}},{"kind":"stepper","label":{"en":"Checked baggage","ar":"الحقائب المشحونة"},"text":"0","min":0,"max":3}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Continue","ar":"تابع"}}]}},{"id":"unit","text":{"en":"The number with its unit, weight and price","ar":"الرقم مع وحدته ووزنه وسعره"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"zad","name":{"en":"Zad Travel","ar":"زاد للسفر"},"color":"#6D28D9","icon":"airplane-tilt","domain":"zad.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Extra baggage","ar":"حقائب إضافية"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"suitcase-rolling","text":{"en":"Included: 1 cabin bag (7 kg)","ar":"مشمول: حقيبة يد (7 كجم)"}},{"kind":"stepper","label":{"en":"Checked baggage","ar":"الحقائب المشحونة"},"text":{"en":"0 bags","ar":"0 حقيبة"},"min":0,"max":3,"hint":{"en":"Each bag up to 23 kg · EGP 1,200","ar":"كل حقيبة حتى 23 كجم · 1,200 جنيه"}}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Continue","ar":"تابع"}}]}}],"answer":["unit"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P14-060","when":["bare"],"feedback":{"en":"Does 1 mean one bag, or one more kilogram? And what does it cost? People tap + and hope, then find the price at checkout.","ar":"هل 1 تعني حقيبة واحدة، أم كيلوجرامًا إضافيًا؟ وكم تكلّف؟ يضغط الناس + على أمل أن يكون صحيحًا، ثم يكتشفون السعر عند الدفع."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Can people tell what one tap on + adds?","ar":"هل يعرف الناس ماذا تضيف ضغطة واحدة على +؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Show the unit and what one step adds.","ar":"اعرض الوحدة وما تضيفه الخطوة الواحدة."},"explain":{"en":"\"0 bags\" names the unit, and the line below says what each step adds in weight and price. People know exactly what they're buying before they tap.","ar":"«0 حقيبة» تذكر الوحدة، والسطر الذي تحته يقول ماذا تضيف كل خطوة في الوزن والسعر. فيعرف الناس بالضبط ماذا يشترون قبل أن يضغطوا."},"speaker":"rami"},{"id":"S07","type":"choose","speaker":"youssef","part":"independent","skill":"SK-P14-U06-02","rules":["R14"],"value":{"en":"Input steppers (NN/g): let people type the number. It's best to allow users to type such values instead of forcing them to use a fixed-increment stepper, and long press makes the buttons faster.","ar":"الـ Input steppers (NN/g): اسمح للناس بكتابة الرقم. فالأفضل أن يكتب الناس هذه القيم بدل إجبارهم على Stepper بخطوة ثابتة، والضغط المطوّل يجعل الزرّين أسرع."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/input-steppers/","quote":"It’s best to allow users to type such continuous values instead of forcing them to use a fixed-increment stepper."},"scenario":{"en":"My shop prints online. On our order page, most people print 1 to 5 copies, but schools and offices sometimes order 300 or more.","ar":"أملك مطبعة على الإنترنت. وفي صفحة الطلب، أغلب الناس يطبعون من 1 إلى 5 نسخ، لكن المدارس والشركات تطلب أحيانًا 300 نسخة أو أكثر."},"prompt":{"en":"What should I use for \"Copies\"?","ar":"ماذا أستخدم لحقل «عدد النسخ»؟"},"options":[{"id":"stepper","text":{"en":"A stepper starting at 1, + and − only","ar":"Stepper يبدأ من 1، بزرّي + و− فقط"}},{"id":"field","text":{"en":"An empty text field, so any number fits","ar":"حقل نصي فارغ، لكي يتسع لأي رقم"}},{"id":"both","text":{"en":"A stepper starting at 1 whose number can also be typed, with press-and-hold","ar":"Stepper يبدأ من 1 ويمكن كتابة رقمه أيضًا، مع الضغط المطوّل"}}],"answer":["both"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P14-061","when":["stepper"],"feedback":{"en":"Perfect for one copy, painful for 300: that's 299 taps. A stepper needs a way to jump.","ar":"مثالي لنسخة واحدة، ومرهق لـ 300: فهذه 299 ضغطة. والـ Stepper يحتاج إلى طريقة للقفز."}},{"id":"MC-P14-057","when":["field"],"feedback":{"en":"Most people want 1 to 5 copies. An empty field makes every one of them open the keyboard and type, when one or two taps would do.","ar":"أغلب الناس يريدون من 1 إلى 5 نسخ. والحقل الفارغ يجعل كل واحد منهم يفتح لوحة المفاتيح ويكتب، بينما تكفي ضغطة أو ضغطتان."}}],"correct":{"en":"A stepper people can also type into.","ar":"Stepper يمكن الكتابة داخله أيضًا."},"explain":{"en":"Small orders take a tap or two from the default. Schools tap the number and type 300. Both groups get the fastest path.","ar":"الطلبات الصغيرة تحتاج إلى ضغطة أو اثنتين من القيمة الافتراضية. والمدارس تضغط على الرقم وتكتب 300. فيصل كل طرف إلى ما يريد بأسرع طريقة."}},{"id":"S08","type":"card","part":"recap","icons":["list","ok","eye"],"title":{"en":"What you practised","ar":"ما تدرّبت عليه"},"body":{"en":"- **Steppers for small counts**, starting on the most common value.\n- **Typing for big or wide-ranging numbers**, or a stepper you can type into.\n- **Clear steppers:** the unit in view, and − or + greyed out at the limits.\n\nNext: sliders, and when close enough is good enough.","ar":"- **الـ Stepper للأعداد الصغيرة**، ويبدأ من القيمة الأكثر شيوعًا.\n- **الكتابة للأرقام الكبيرة أو الواسعة المدى**، أو Stepper يمكن الكتابة داخله.\n- **Stepper واضح:** الوحدة ظاهرة، و− أو + معطّل عند الحدود.\n\nالتالي: الـ Sliders، ومتى تكفي القيمة التقريبية."}}]}$uxg$::jsonb),
  ($uxg$P14-U06-L02$uxg$, $uxg$0f03ab03e8bd91f59188146a058eca35d08c91b97749204cd4758624f010ee5d$uxg$, $uxg${"id":"P14-U06-L02","mode":"lesson","minutes":7,"title":{"en":"Sliders, when close enough is fine","ar":"الـ Sliders، حين تكفي القيمة التقريبية"},"speaker":"karim","review_labels":{"MC-P14-062":{"en":"Sliders fit values where close enough is fine","ar":"الـ Slider يناسب القيم التي تكفي فيها القيمة التقريبية"},"MC-P14-063":{"en":"Keep the slider's value visible above the finger","ar":"اجعل قيمة الـ Slider ظاهرة فوق الإصبع"},"MC-P14-064":{"en":"Exact values need typing or a stepper, not a slider","ar":"القيم الدقيقة تحتاج إلى الكتابة أو Stepper، لا Slider"}},"steps":[{"id":"S01","type":"card","part":"hook","title":{"en":"Karim's smart-home app","ar":"تطبيق كريم للمنزل الذكي"},"body":{"en":"I'm building an app that controls smart lights and the air conditioner at home. People open it in the evening to make the living room feel right: a bit dimmer, a bit warmer, a degree cooler.\n\nI have to pick the right control for each setting.","ar":"أبني تطبيقًا يتحكم في الإضاءة الذكية والتكييف في المنزل. ويفتحه الناس في المساء ليجعلوا غرفة المعيشة مريحة: إضاءة أخفّ قليلًا، ولون أدفأ قليلًا، ودرجة حرارة أبرد بدرجة.\n\nوعليّ أن أختار العنصر المناسب لكل إعداد."},"mock":{"app":{"id":"mesbah","name":{"en":"Mesbah","ar":"مصباح"},"color":"#3B5BDB","icon":"lightbulb","domain":"mesbah.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Home","ar":"البيت"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"hotel-room","size":"m","alt":{"en":"Living room","ar":"غرفة المعيشة"}},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Living room","ar":"غرفة المعيشة"}},{"kind":"toggle","text":{"en":"Ceiling light","ar":"إضاءة السقف"},"selected":true,"gap":"s"},{"kind":"line","text":{"en":"Brightness · Warmth · Air conditioner","ar":"الإضاءة · دفء اللون · التكييف"},"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"S02","type":"tune","part":"try","skill":"SK-P14-U06-03","rules":["R12"],"confidence":true,"value":{"en":"Try first. Sliders (NN/g): sliders work best when the specific value does not matter to the user, but an approximate value is good enough. People dim a light until it looks right, not to an exact number.","ar":"جرّب أولًا. الـ Sliders (NN/g): الـ Slider يعمل أفضل حين لا تهمّ الناس القيمة بالضبط، وتكفيهم قيمة تقريبية. فالناس يخفّفون الإضاءة حتى تبدو مناسبة، لا حتى رقم محدد."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/gui-slider-controls/","quote":"Sliders work best when the specific value does not matter to the user, but an approximate value is good enough."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each version of the brightness control. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل نسخة من التحكم في الإضاءة. أيّ نسخة توصل الناس إلى الإضاءة التي يريدونها بأقل تخمين؟"},"start":"field","options":[{"id":"field","text":{"en":"A field to type a percentage","ar":"حقل لكتابة نسبة مئوية"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"mesbah","name":{"en":"Mesbah","ar":"مصباح"},"color":"#3B5BDB","icon":"lightbulb","domain":"mesbah.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Ceiling light","ar":"إضاءة السقف"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"hotel-room","size":"m","alt":{"en":"Living room with the ceiling light on","ar":"غرفة المعيشة وإضاءة السقف تعمل"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Brightness (%)","ar":"الإضاءة (%)"},"text":"70","filled":true}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Apply","ar":"طبّق"}}]}},{"id":"stepper","text":{"en":"A stepper, 1% per tap","ar":"Stepper، و1% في كل ضغطة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"mesbah","name":{"en":"Mesbah","ar":"مصباح"},"color":"#3B5BDB","icon":"lightbulb","domain":"mesbah.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Ceiling light","ar":"إضاءة السقف"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"hotel-room","size":"m","alt":{"en":"Living room with the ceiling light on","ar":"غرفة المعيشة وإضاءة السقف تعمل"}},{"kind":"stepper","label":{"en":"Brightness","ar":"الإضاءة"},"text":"70%","min":0,"max":100}]}},{"id":"slider","text":{"en":"A slider from dim to bright","ar":"Slider من خافت إلى ساطع"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"mesbah","name":{"en":"Mesbah","ar":"مصباح"},"color":"#3B5BDB","icon":"lightbulb","domain":"mesbah.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Ceiling light","ar":"إضاءة السقف"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"hotel-room","size":"m","alt":{"en":"Living room with the ceiling light on","ar":"غرفة المعيشة وإضاءة السقف تعمل"}},{"kind":"slider","label":{"en":"Brightness","ar":"الإضاءة"},"min":0,"max":100,"value":70,"format":"{a}%","ticks":[{"en":"Dim","ar":"خافت"},{"en":"Bright","ar":"ساطع"}]}]}}],"answer":["slider"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P14-062","when":["field","stepper"],"feedback":{"en":"Nobody knows whether they want 62% or 65%; they want the room to look right. Typing or tapping a number makes them guess, check the room, and try again.","ar":"لا أحد يعرف هل يريد 62% أم 65%؛ بل يريد أن تبدو الغرفة مناسبة. والكتابة أو الضغط على رقم يجعلهم يخمّنون، ثم ينظرون إلى الغرفة، ثم يحاولون مرة أخرى."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Does anyone care about the exact number here, or only how the room looks?","ar":"هل يهتم أحد هنا بالرقم بالضبط، أم بشكل الغرفة فقط؟"}],"correct":{"en":"A slider: drag until it looks right.","ar":"Slider: اسحب حتى تبدو مناسبة."},"explain":{"en":"People drag and watch the light change, and stop when it feels right. One smooth gesture replaces a guess-and-check loop.","ar":"يسحب الناس ويشاهدون الإضاءة تتغيّر، ويتوقفون حين تبدو مريحة. وحركة واحدة سلسة تحلّ محل التخمين والمراجعة المتكررين."}},{"id":"S09","type":"video","part":"concept","title":{"en":"Sliders","ar":"الـ Sliders"},"video":"2d4be757-effd-4f18-901f-4c1667bfe660","duration":243,"transcript":[{"t":2.5,"en":"If we look, we can find two types of slider: the first and the second. The difference is that I can move the first one to any value; its step can be one, so I move from","ar":"لو شفنا برضه، ممكن نلاقي عندنا نوعين من الـ Slider: الأول والتاني. الفرق بينهم إن الأول بقدر أحركه على أي Value، ممكن يكون الـ Step بتاعه واحد، فأنا"},{"t":14.2,"en":"one up to 100, say: one, two, three, four, and so on. The second slider moves, say, from one to five, to ten, to fifteen, to twenty, and so on: its steps change by a set value.","ar":"بتحرك من واحد لغاية 100 مثلًا: واحد، اتنين، تلاتة، أربعة، وهكذا. الـ Slider التاني بتحرك مثلًا من واحد، لخمسة، لعشرة، لخمستاشر، لعشرين، وهكذا: عنده Steps بتتغير بقيمة معينة."},{"t":25.9,"en":"We call the first one a continuous slider: I move in it by a very small amount. In a discrete slider I set some values that","ar":"فالـ Slider الأول بنسميه Continuous slider: بتحرك فيه بقيمة صغيرة جدًا. لكن الـ Discrete slider أنا بحدد فيه بعض الـ Values اللي هتنقّل"},{"t":34.75,"en":"I'll jump between, and I can't get values in between, like we said 1, 5, 10, 15 and so on. Those are the two types of slider.","ar":"ما بينها، ومش هقدر أجيب Values في النص، زي ما قلنا 1 و5 و10 و15 وهكذا. دول النوعين اللي موجودين في الـ Sliders."},{"t":43.6,"en":"If we start thinking about the guidelines together, we have this example: I enter my weight in an app, say, and I set it","ar":"لو بدأنا نفكر في الـ Guidelines مع بعض، هنلاقي عندنا المثال اللي قدامنا ده: بدخل وزني مثلًا على أحد الـ Applications، فبحدد"},{"t":52.23,"en":"with this slider at the bottom, which of course imitates a real scale; sometimes it moves like this. The designer tried to make it","ar":"وزني بالشكل ده على شكل Slider اللي تحت، اللي طبعًا بيحاكي شكل الميزان اللي موجود في الواقع، أحيانًا بيتحرك بالشكل ده. فالديزاينر"},{"t":60.87,"en":"look a bit like a real scale, so they made it this way, and I slide the slider at the bottom to set my weight.","ar":"حاول يخلّيه شبه شوية شكل الميزان الحقيقي، فعملوا بالشكل ده اللي أقدر أعمل Slide فيه بالـ Slider اللي تحت عشان أحدد الوزن."},{"t":70.05,"en":"If we think about what the problem or the mistake with this slider could be: we find we move by one tenth here. The amount we move by is very small, and","ar":"لو جينا نفكر إيه المشكلة أو إيه الغلط اللي ممكن يكون في الـ Slider ده: هنلاقي إننا هنا بنتحرك بواحد من عشرة. القيمة اللي بنتحرك بيها صغيرة جدًا،"},{"t":80.31,"en":"weight can vary: one person might weigh 60 and another 120. So if I set the default to, say, 80, in every case I'll spend a long time sliding a lot to","ar":"والوزن ده ممكن يتغير: ممكن حد يكون وزنه 60 وحد تاني وزنه 120. فلو حطّيت الـ Default مثلًا 80، في كل الحالات هبدأ أتحرك وقت كبير، وأعمل Slide"},{"t":90.58,"en":"reach the exact value I want, which might be 80.4, for example. The slider has a hard time reaching that value, and that isn't what a slider is for in the first place.","ar":"كتير عشان أوصل للقيمة المحددة اللي أنا عايزها، ممكن تكون 80 وأربعة من عشرة مثلًا. فالـ Slider صعب يوصل للقيمة دي، وده مش من أهداف استخدام الـ Slider أصلًا."},{"t":100.85,"en":"A slider is there to choose a value whose exact amount we don't need to know; it can be approximate: we say this value is suitable, or this value is enough. Like","ar":"الـ Slider موجود عشان أختار Value مش لازم نكون عارفين قيمتها بالضبط، ممكن تكون Approximately، تقريبية: هنقول دي Value مناسبة أو دي Value كفاية."},{"t":111.92,"en":"the example here: if we're adjusting a photo's colours, we can make it a bit warm or a bit cold, between warm and cool colours. We move like this and the exact","ar":"زي المثال اللي قدامنا: لو بنتحكم في ألوان الصورة، فممكن نخلّيها Warm شوية أو Cold شوية، بين الألوان الدافية والألوان الباردة. فاحنا بنتحرك بالشكل"},{"t":123,"en":"number doesn't matter to us, but the look does: when we see the look is right now, we stop there. Like the brightness example we talked about: when I reach a brightness","ar":"ده، ومايفرقش معانا الرقم بالضبط كام، لكن هيفرق معانا الشكل: لما نشوف إن الشكل دلوقتي مناسب هنقف هنا. زي مثال البرايتنس اللي اتكلمنا عنه:"},{"t":134.07,"en":"that looks right to me, I stop. And when I reach a volume where I can hear well enough, I stop there. It doesn't have to be a specific number I know.","ar":"لما أوصل لبرايتنس أنا شايفها مناسبة هقف. ولما أوصل لصوت شايفه كفاية إني سامع هقف عنده. مش لازم يكون رقم معين واضح أنا عارفه."},{"t":145.15,"en":"That's one of the slider's guidelines: I don't always need to reach a specific number, because a slider isn't the best tool for that. I can do it with a stepper,","ar":"ودي من الـ Guidelines بتاعة الـ Slider: إني مش دايمًا محتاج أوصل لرقم معين محدد، لأن الـ Slider مش أفضل حاجة تعمل ده. ممكن أعمل ده"},{"t":152.9,"en":"or by typing the number itself, which is usually the best option in that case. But a slider, as we said, is for a number that doesn't have to be exact.","ar":"بالـ Stepper، أو إني أكتب الرقم أصلًا، وده غالبًا أفضل حاجة في الحالة دي. لكن الـ Slider زي ما قلنا لرقم مش لازم يكون دقيق بالضبط."},{"t":160.65,"en":"We can take the second slider guideline from this example: we set a price range, say, or anything with a range in general. In this example","ar":"الـ Guideline التانية في الـ Slider ممكن ناخدها من المثال ده: بنحدد Range سعر مثلًا، أو أي حاجة فيها Range عمومًا. هنشوف في المثال إن"},{"t":169.88,"en":"the number the slider reaches in the range, whether the maximum or the minimum, sits under the slider. So as I move like this, my finger starts","ar":"الرقم اللي بيوصله الـ Slider في الـ Range، سواء الـ Maximum أو الـ Minimum، موجود تحت الـ Slider. فممكن وأنا بتحرك بالشكل ده، صباعي يبدأ"},{"t":179.12,"en":"to cover the number I reached. This guideline says we need to watch what exactly my finger may cover on the screen while I move the slider.","ar":"يغطي الرقم اللي أنا وصلت له. فالـ Guideline دي بتقول إننا محتاجين ناخد بالنا صباعي ممكن يغطي إيه بالضبط في الشاشة وأنا بتحرك بالـ Slider."},{"t":188.35,"en":"Of course, this may not apply one hundred percent. Usually, if I press the slider's handle to move it back or forward, I might press it from above on the screen, with my finger or hand","ar":"طبعًا الحالة دي ممكن تكون مش مطبّقة بالشكل ده مية في المية. لأن عادةً لو ضغطت على الـ Handle بتاع الـ Slider عشان أرجّعه أو أقدّمه، ممكن أضغط عليه من فوق في"},{"t":200.8,"en":"covering part of the screen. Or I press it and move down, so my hand isn't on the slider itself: I move right and left and it moves with me, so my hand isn't covering the screen.","ar":"الـ Screen، وصباعي أو إيدي مغطية جزء من الـ Screen. أو أضغط عليه وأنزل تحت، فإيدي مش بتكون على الـ Slider نفسه: ببدأ أتحرك يمين وشمال وبيتحرك معايا، وبالتالي إيدي مش مغطية الشاشة."},{"t":213.25,"en":"So sometimes, if we don't have enough space, we don't have to put everything related to the slider above it. We can put it below, and make it big enough to be seen.","ar":"فأحيانًا في بعض الحالات، لو المساحة اللي معانا مش كفاية، مش مضطرين نحط كل حاجة ليها علاقة بالـ Slider فوقه. ممكن نحطها تحته، ونخلّي حجمها كافي ومناسب إنه"},{"t":225.24,"en":"At the same time, users get used to pressing the handle, moving their hand down and dragging the slider from below rather than from above. You can see this in many examples today.","ar":"يتشاف. وفي نفس الوقت اليوزر بيتعود إنه لما يضغط على الـ Handle بينزل إيده تحت ويتحرك بالـ Slider من تحت، مش من فوق. وده موجود في أمثلة كتير دلوقتي."}]},{"id":"S03","type":"card","part":"concept","icons":["eye","ok","layers","list"],"title":{"en":"Video summary","ar":"ملخص الفيديو"},"body":{"en":"A slider lets people drag a handle along a track to change a value, such as brightness or volume. The value can be a number, or just \"more\" and \"less\".\n\n- **Two kinds:** a continuous slider moves to any value, a discrete one jumps in fixed steps.\n- **Close enough is fine:** use sliders when people judge by look or feel, such as brightness, volume, or a photo from warm to cold.\n- **Not for exact values:** entering a weight such as 80.4 kg on a slider takes many careful drags. Use a stepper or, usually best, typing.\n- **Keep the value in view:** a finger on the handle can hide the number. Show it above the handle, or let people drag the handle from below.","ar":"الـ Slider يسمح للناس بسحب مقبض على شريط لتغيير قيمة، مثل الإضاءة أو الصوت. وقد تكون القيمة رقمًا، أو «أكثر» و«أقل» فقط.\n\n- **نوعان:** الـ Slider المستمر يتحرك إلى أي قيمة، والمتدرّج يقفز بخطوات ثابتة.\n- **القيمة التقريبية تكفي:** استخدم الـ Slider حين يحكم الناس بالشكل أو الإحساس، مثل الإضاءة، أو الصوت، أو ألوان صورة من دافئة إلى باردة.\n- **ليس للقيم الدقيقة:** إدخال وزن مثل 80.4 كجم بـ Slider يحتاج إلى سحب حذر مرات كثيرة. استخدم Stepper، أو الكتابة، وهي غالبًا الأفضل.\n- **اجعل القيمة ظاهرة:** الإصبع على المقبض قد يغطي الرقم. اعرضه فوق المقبض، أو اسمح للناس بسحب المقبض من أسفل."}},{"id":"S04","type":"compare","part":"guided","skill":"SK-P14-U06-03","rules":["R06"],"value":{"en":"Sliders (NN/g): labels describing the slider's currently selected value must appear beside or above the thumb; below it, they may be obscured by the user's finger while they are interacting with the control.","ar":"الـ Sliders (NN/g): يجب أن تظهر القيمة المختارة بجانب المقبض أو فوقه؛ لأنها إن كانت أسفله، قد يغطيها إصبع المستخدم أثناء التحكم فيه."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/gui-slider-controls/","quote":"the labels may be obscured by the users' finger while they are interacting with the control."},"scenario":{"en":"The air-conditioner fan has a slider from 1 to 5. Here is what people see while their finger is on the handle.","ar":"لمروحة التكييف Slider من 1 إلى 5. وهذا ما يراه الناس بينما إصبعهم على المقبض."},"prompt":{"en":"Which version should ship?","ar":"أيّ نسخة يجب أن تُطلق؟"},"a":{"label":{"en":"Version A: the value on the handle","ar":"النسخة A: القيمة على المقبض"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"mesbah","name":{"en":"Mesbah","ar":"مصباح"},"color":"#3B5BDB","icon":"lightbulb","domain":"mesbah.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Air conditioner","ar":"التكييف"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"icon","icon":"fan","size":"l","color":"brand"},{"kind":"slider","label":{"en":"Fan speed","ar":"سرعة المروحة"},"min":1,"max":5,"value":3,"format":{"en":"Level {a}","ar":"مستوى {a}"},"bubble":"thumb","finger":true}]}},"b":{"label":{"en":"Version B: the value above the handle","ar":"النسخة B: القيمة فوق المقبض"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"mesbah","name":{"en":"Mesbah","ar":"مصباح"},"color":"#3B5BDB","icon":"lightbulb","domain":"mesbah.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Air conditioner","ar":"التكييف"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"icon","icon":"fan","size":"l","color":"brand"},{"kind":"slider","label":{"en":"Fan speed","ar":"سرعة المروحة"},"min":1,"max":5,"value":3,"format":{"en":"Level {a}","ar":"مستوى {a}"},"bubble":"above","finger":true}]}},"answer":"b","misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P14-063","when":["a"],"feedback":{"en":"The finger sits exactly where the number is. People drag blind, lift their finger to check, and drag again.","ar":"الإصبع موجود بالضبط فوق الرقم. فيسحب الناس دون أن يروا، ثم يرفعون إصبعهم ليتأكدوا، ثم يسحبون مرة أخرى."}}],"correct":{"en":"B: the value stays above the finger.","ar":"B: القيمة تبقى فوق الإصبع."},"explain":{"en":"The bubble rides above the handle, so people see the level change as they drag and stop at the one they want.","ar":"الفقاعة تتحرك فوق المقبض، فيرى الناس المستوى يتغيّر أثناء السحب ويتوقفون عند المستوى الذي يريدونه."},"speaker":"karim"},{"id":"S05","type":"compare","part":"contrast","skill":"SK-P14-U06-03","rules":["R11"],"confidence":true,"value":{"en":"Sliders (NN/g): whenever the exact value matters, sliders are not okay. If picking an exact value is important, choose an alternate UI element.","ar":"الـ Sliders (NN/g): كلما كانت القيمة الدقيقة مهمة، لا يصلح الـ Slider. وإن كان اختيار قيمة دقيقة مهمًا، فاختر عنصرًا آخر."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/gui-slider-controls/","quote":"But whenever the exact value matters, sliders are not okay."},"scenario":{"en":"Now the air conditioner's temperature, from 16 to 30 °C. People know their number: \"set it to 23\".","ar":"والآن درجة حرارة التكييف، من 16 إلى 30 درجة. والناس يعرفون الرقم الذي يريدونه: «اضبطه على 23»."},"prompt":{"en":"Which version should ship?","ar":"أيّ نسخة يجب أن تُطلق؟"},"a":{"label":{"en":"Version A: a slider, like the lights","ar":"النسخة A: Slider، مثل الإضاءة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"mesbah","name":{"en":"Mesbah","ar":"مصباح"},"color":"#3B5BDB","icon":"lightbulb","domain":"mesbah.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Air conditioner","ar":"التكييف"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"icon","icon":"thermometer-simple","size":"l","color":"brand"},{"kind":"slider","label":{"en":"Temperature","ar":"درجة الحرارة"},"min":16,"max":30,"value":24,"step":0.5,"format":"{a} °C","bubble":"above"}]}},"b":{"label":{"en":"Version B: a stepper, 1 °C per tap","ar":"النسخة B: Stepper، ودرجة واحدة في كل ضغطة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"mesbah","name":{"en":"Mesbah","ar":"مصباح"},"color":"#3B5BDB","icon":"lightbulb","domain":"mesbah.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Air conditioner","ar":"التكييف"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"icon","icon":"thermometer-simple","size":"l","color":"brand"},{"kind":"stepper","label":{"en":"Temperature","ar":"درجة الحرارة"},"text":"24 °C","min":16,"max":30}]}},"answer":"b","misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P14-064","when":["a"],"feedback":{"en":"Try landing exactly on 23 in A: the handle slides past to 23.5 or 22.5. When people know the exact number, the slider fights them.","ar":"جرّب أن تصل بالضبط إلى 23 في A: المقبض ينزلق إلى 23.5 أو 22.5. وحين يعرف الناس الرقم الدقيق، يصبح الـ Slider عائقًا."}}],"correct":{"en":"B: an exact number needs exact steps.","ar":"B: الرقم الدقيق يحتاج إلى خطوات دقيقة."},"explain":{"en":"The deciding factor is whether the exact value matters. Light is judged by eye, so close enough is fine. Temperature is a number people know, so one tap per degree gets them there exactly.","ar":"ما يحسم الأمر هو: هل تهمّ القيمة الدقيقة؟ الإضاءة يحكم عليها الناس بالعين، فتكفي القيمة التقريبية. أما الحرارة فرقم يعرفه الناس، وضغطة لكل درجة توصلهم إليه بالضبط."},"speaker":"karim"},{"id":"S06","type":"choose","part":"guided","skill":"SK-P14-U06-03","rules":["R06"],"multi":true,"value":{"en":"Sliders (NN/g): use a slider only when the precise value won't matter to the user, but rather only the approximate range.","ar":"الـ Sliders (NN/g): استخدم الـ Slider فقط حين لا تهمّ الناس القيمة الدقيقة، بل المدى التقريبي فقط."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/gui-slider-controls/","quote":"Use a slider only when the precise value won't matter to the user, but rather only the approximate range."},"scenario":{"en":"I'm adding four more settings to the app.","ar":"أضيف أربعة إعدادات أخرى إلى التطبيق."},"prompt":{"en":"Which settings should use a slider? Choose all that fit.","ar":"أيّ الإعدادات يجب أن تستخدم Slider؟ اختر كل ما يناسب."},"options":[{"id":"warmth","text":{"en":"Light colour, from warm yellow to cool white","ar":"لون الإضاءة، من أصفر دافئ إلى أبيض بارد"}},{"id":"alarm","text":{"en":"The time the bedroom lights turn on, such as 6:45","ar":"موعد تشغيل إضاءة غرفة النوم، مثل 6:45"}},{"id":"volume","text":{"en":"Speaker volume","ar":"صوت السمّاعة"}},{"id":"pin","text":{"en":"The 4-digit code that unlocks the front door","ar":"الرمز المكوّن من 4 أرقام لفتح الباب الأمامي"}}],"answer":["warmth","volume"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P14-064","when":["alarm","pin"],"feedback":{"en":"6:45 and a door code are exact: one step off is simply wrong. Exact values need typing or a picker made for them, not dragging.","ar":"الساعة 6:45 ورمز الباب قيمتان دقيقتان: خطوة واحدة خطأ تعني نتيجة خطأ. والقيم الدقيقة تحتاج إلى الكتابة أو عنصر مصمم لها، لا إلى السحب."}}],"hints":[{"en":"For which settings would \"a little more\" be a perfectly good answer?","ar":"في أيّ الإعدادات تكون «أكثر قليلًا» إجابة جيدة تمامًا؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Warmth and volume.","ar":"دفء اللون والصوت."},"explain":{"en":"People adjust warmth and volume by feel, so sliders fit. The wake-up time and the door code must be exact, so they need other inputs.","ar":"يضبط الناس دفء اللون والصوت بالإحساس، فيناسبهما الـ Slider. أما موعد التشغيل ورمز الباب فيجب أن يكونا دقيقين، فيحتاجان إلى عناصر أخرى."},"speaker":"karim"},{"id":"S07","type":"tune","speaker":"hana","part":"independent","skill":"SK-P14-U06-03","rules":["R14"],"value":{"en":"Sliders (NN/g): if picking an exact value is important to the goal of the interface, choose an alternate UI element; consider one that allows users to tap or even type to specify their choice.","ar":"الـ Sliders (NN/g): إن كان اختيار قيمة دقيقة مهمًا لهدف الواجهة، فاختر عنصرًا آخر؛ عنصرًا يسمح للناس بالضغط أو حتى الكتابة لتحديد اختيارهم."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/gui-slider-controls/","quote":"If picking an exact value is important to the goal of the interface, choose an alternate UI element."},"scenario":{"en":"My gym is getting a fitness app. Every morning, members log their weight from the bathroom scale, such as 80.4 kg, to follow their progress. Our first draft copies the look of a real scale: a ruler you drag.","ar":"نجهّز تطبيقًا للياقة البدنية للجيم الذي أملكه. وكل صباح، يسجّل الأعضاء وزنهم من ميزان الحمّام، مثل 80.4 كجم، لكي يتابعوا تقدّمهم. ومسودتنا الأولى تقلّد شكل الميزان الحقيقي: مسطرة تُسحب."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each version. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل نسخة. أيّها يجب أن تُطلق؟"},"start":"ruler","options":[{"id":"ruler","text":{"en":"A scale-like slider from 30 to 200 kg","ar":"Slider يشبه الميزان من 30 إلى 200 كجم"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Today's weight","ar":"وزن اليوم"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"chart","type":"line","values":[82.4,81.9,81.5,81.2,80.7],"labels":["Mon","Tue","Wed","Thu","Fri"],"highlight":4},{"kind":"slider","min":30,"max":200,"value":80,"step":0.1,"format":"{a} kg","bubble":"above","ticks":["30","100","200"]}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Save","ar":"احفظ"}}]}},{"id":"type","text":{"en":"A number field with \"kg\", yesterday's weight shown","ar":"حقل رقمي مع «كجم»، ووزن الأمس ظاهر"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Today's weight","ar":"وزن اليوم"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"chart","type":"line","values":[82.4,81.9,81.5,81.2,80.7],"labels":["Mon","Tue","Wed","Thu","Fri"],"highlight":4},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Weight (kg)","ar":"الوزن (كجم)"},"hint":{"en":"Yesterday: 80.7 kg","ar":"أمس: 80.7 كجم"},"text":""}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Save","ar":"احفظ"}}]}}],"answer":["type"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P14-064","when":["ruler"],"feedback":{"en":"Drag the ruler to 80.4: each pixel jumps by several tenths, so people nudge back and forth every single morning. Looking like a real scale doesn't make it work like one.","ar":"اسحب المسطرة إلى 80.4: كل نقطة على الشاشة تقفز عدة أعشار، فيحرّك الناس المقبض ذهابًا وإيابًا كل صباح. وأن يبدو مثل الميزان الحقيقي لا يجعله يعمل مثله."}}],"correct":{"en":"Type the exact weight.","ar":"اكتب الوزن بالضبط."},"explain":{"en":"People read 80.4 off the scale and type it in a second. Yesterday's weight below the label helps them spot a typo.","ar":"يقرأ الناس 80.4 من الميزان ويكتبونه في ثانية. ووزن الأمس تحت اسم الحقل يساعدهم على ملاحظة أي خطأ في الكتابة."}},{"id":"S08","type":"card","part":"recap","icons":["eye","ok","list"],"title":{"en":"What you practised","ar":"ما تدرّبت عليه"},"body":{"en":"- **Sliders for close-enough values**, judged by eye or ear: brightness, warmth, volume.\n- **The value above the finger**, never hidden under it.\n- **Exact values need exact inputs:** a stepper or typing.\n\nNext: picking the right way to enter a date.","ar":"- **الـ Slider للقيم التقريبية**، التي يحكم عليها الناس بالعين أو الأذن: الإضاءة، ودفء اللون، والصوت.\n- **القيمة فوق الإصبع**، لا تحته أبدًا.\n- **القيم الدقيقة تحتاج إلى عناصر دقيقة:** Stepper أو الكتابة.\n\nالتالي: اختيار الطريقة المناسبة لإدخال التاريخ."}}]}$uxg$::jsonb),
  ($uxg$P14-U06-L03$uxg$, $uxg$2ec1c5df1f74ddbb7d08c0a1dd9fd7f15e485e641b393f01ecc60548495a2bc7$uxg$, $uxg${"id":"P14-U06-L03","mode":"lesson","minutes":8,"title":{"en":"A date input for every date","ar":"طريقة إدخال مناسبة لكل تاريخ"},"speaker":"sara","review_labels":{"MC-P14-065":{"en":"Calendars fit near dates; type far, known dates","ar":"التقويم للتواريخ القريبة؛ واكتب التواريخ البعيدة المعروفة"},"MC-P14-066":{"en":"Day/month/year drop-downs add many steps","ar":"الـ Dropdowns لليوم والشهر والسنة تضيف خطوات كثيرة"},"MC-P14-067":{"en":"Scrolling pickers fit near dates and times only","ar":"الـ Scrolling picker يناسب التواريخ القريبة والأوقات فقط"},"MC-P14-068":{"en":"Show a date range on a calendar, two months side by side","ar":"اعرض الفترة على تقويم، بشهرين جنبًا إلى جنب"}},"steps":[{"id":"S01","type":"card","part":"hook","title":{"en":"Sara's hotel bookings","ar":"سارة وحجوزات الفندق"},"body":{"en":"I'm designing the booking site of a beach hotel. Guests pick their stay, often over a weekend or a holiday that crosses into the next month. To create an account, they also give their date of birth.\n\nThe site has three kinds of dates, and each may need a different input.","ar":"أصمّم موقع الحجز لفندق على البحر. يختار النزلاء فترة إقامتهم، غالبًا في عطلة نهاية أسبوع أو إجازة تمتد إلى الشهر التالي. ولإنشاء حساب، يذكرون أيضًا تاريخ ميلادهم.\n\nفي الموقع ثلاثة أنواع من التواريخ، وقد يحتاج كل نوع إلى طريقة إدخال مختلفة."},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nuzul","name":{"en":"Nuzul","ar":"نُزُل"},"color":"#B7791F","icon":"bed","domain":"nuzul.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Book your stay","ar":"احجز إقامتك"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","art":"beach","text":{"en":"Coral Bay Resort · Hurghada","ar":"منتجع كورال باي · الغردقة"},"sub":{"en":"★ 4.7 · Beach front","ar":"★ 4.7 · على البحر"}},{"kind":"select","label":{"en":"Check-in and check-out","ar":"الوصول والمغادرة"},"text":{"en":"Choose dates","ar":"اختر التواريخ"}},{"kind":"stepper","label":{"en":"Guests","ar":"النزلاء"},"text":"2","min":1,"max":6}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"See rooms","ar":"اعرض الغرف"}}]}},{"id":"S02","type":"tune","part":"try","skill":"SK-P14-U06-04","rules":["R12"],"confidence":true,"value":{"en":"Try first. Date input (NN/g): calendar pickers are especially useful for selecting a date range. In those situations, they often display two months side by side.","ar":"جرّب أولًا. إدخال التاريخ (NN/g): التقويم مفيد بشكل خاص لاختيار فترة بين تاريخين. وفي هذه الحالات، يعرض غالبًا شهرين جنبًا إلى جنب."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/date-input/","quote":"Calendar pickers are especially useful for selecting a date range."},"prompt":{"en":"A guest wants the New Year's week, from Monday 28 December to Sunday 3 January. Try each version. Which one should ship?","ar":"يريد أحد النزلاء أسبوع رأس السنة، من الإثنين 28 ديسمبر إلى الأحد 3 يناير. جرّب كل نسخة. أيّ نسخة تسمح له باختيار إقامته ورؤيتها كاملة بأقل خطوات؟"},"start":"drop","options":[{"id":"drop","text":{"en":"Day, month and year drop-downs, twice","ar":"Dropdowns لليوم والشهر والسنة، مرتين"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nuzul","name":{"en":"Nuzul","ar":"نُزُل"},"color":"#B7791F","icon":"bed","domain":"nuzul.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Book your stay","ar":"احجز إقامتك"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","art":"beach","text":{"en":"Coral Bay Resort · Hurghada","ar":"منتجع كورال باي · الغردقة"},"sub":{"en":"2 guests","ar":"نزيلان"}},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Check-in","ar":"الوصول"}},{"kind":"row","blocks":[{"kind":"select","text":{"en":"Day","ar":"اليوم"}},{"kind":"select","text":{"en":"Month","ar":"الشهر"}},{"kind":"select","text":{"en":"Year","ar":"السنة"}}]},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Check-out","ar":"المغادرة"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"row","blocks":[{"kind":"select","text":{"en":"Day","ar":"اليوم"}},{"kind":"select","text":{"en":"Month","ar":"الشهر"}},{"kind":"select","text":{"en":"Year","ar":"السنة"}}]}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"See rooms","ar":"اعرض الغرف"}}]}},{"id":"typed","text":{"en":"Two fields to type the dates","ar":"حقلان لكتابة التاريخين"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nuzul","name":{"en":"Nuzul","ar":"نُزُل"},"color":"#B7791F","icon":"bed","domain":"nuzul.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Book your stay","ar":"احجز إقامتك"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","art":"beach","text":{"en":"Coral Bay Resort · Hurghada","ar":"منتجع كورال باي · الغردقة"},"sub":{"en":"2 guests","ar":"نزيلان"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Check-in","ar":"الوصول"},"hint":{"en":"DD/MM/YYYY","ar":"يوم/شهر/سنة"},"hintFirst":true,"text":""},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Check-out","ar":"المغادرة"},"hint":{"en":"DD/MM/YYYY","ar":"يوم/شهر/سنة"},"hintFirst":true,"text":""}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"See rooms","ar":"اعرض الغرف"}}]}},{"id":"calendar","text":{"en":"A calendar showing two months, the stay as a range","ar":"تقويم يعرض شهرين، والإقامة فترة واحدة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nuzul","name":{"en":"Nuzul","ar":"نُزُل"},"color":"#B7791F","icon":"bed","domain":"nuzul.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Book your stay","ar":"احجز إقامتك"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","art":"beach","text":{"en":"Coral Bay Resort · Hurghada","ar":"منتجع كورال باي · الغردقة"},"sub":{"en":"2 guests","ar":"نزيلان"}},{"kind":"calendar","months":[{"title":{"en":"December 2026","ar":"ديسمبر 2026"},"start":2,"days":31},{"title":{"en":"January 2027","ar":"يناير 2027"},"start":5,"days":31}],"from":[0,28],"to":[1,3],"text":{"en":"Mon 28 Dec – Sun 3 Jan · 6 nights","ar":"من الإثنين 28 ديسمبر إلى الأحد 3 يناير · 6 ليالٍ"}}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"See rooms","ar":"اعرض الغرف"}}]}}],"answer":["calendar"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P14-066","when":["drop"],"feedback":{"en":"Six drop-downs: open, scroll and pick, six times. And nothing shows that the 28th is a Monday or that the stay is six nights.","ar":"ستة Dropdowns: فتح ثم تمرير ثم اختيار، ست مرات. ولا شيء يوضّح أن يوم 28 هو الإثنين، أو أن الإقامة ست ليالٍ."}},{"id":"MC-P14-068","when":["typed"],"feedback":{"en":"Typing is quick, but people plan holidays by weekdays: \"Monday to Sunday\". Here they must work out the dates elsewhere, then check the range in their head.","ar":"الكتابة سريعة، لكن الناس يخططون للإجازات بأيام الأسبوع: «من الإثنين إلى الأحد». وهنا عليهم أن يعرفوا التواريخ من مكان آخر، ثم يراجعوا الفترة في أذهانهم."}}],"hints":[{"en":"The guest thinks \"Monday to Sunday, across New Year\". Which version shows that?","ar":"النزيل يفكّر «من الإثنين إلى الأحد، مرورًا برأس السنة». أيّ نسخة توضّح ذلك؟"}],"correct":{"en":"A two-month calendar with the range.","ar":"تقويم بشهرين مع الفترة."},"explain":{"en":"Two taps choose the stay, and the guest sees the weekdays, the whole range across both months, and the number of nights at once.","ar":"ضغطتان تكفيان لاختيار الإقامة، ويرى النزيل أيام الأسبوع، والفترة كاملة عبر الشهرين، وعدد الليالي مرة واحدة."}},{"id":"S09","type":"video","part":"concept","title":{"en":"Date inputs","ar":"طرق إدخال التاريخ"},"video":"a19a0530-65b0-436c-977a-6430ae5d3592","duration":211,"transcript":[{"t":2.5,"en":"The last pattern, or topic, under input controls is the date input. Date input covers more than one pattern, and","ar":"الـ Pattern أو العنوان الأخير اللي معانا تحت الـ Input controls هو الـ Date input. الـ Date input تحته أكتر من"},{"t":10.75,"en":"we can use any of them depending on what exactly I need, to let the user enter the date they want.","ar":"Pattern، ممكن نستخدم أي واحد فيهم على حسب أنا محتاج أعمل إيه بالضبط، عشان أخلّي اليوزر يدخل التاريخ اللي هو عايزه."},{"t":19,"en":"If we look at the patterns under date input, the first is calendar pickers. We've almost all used a calendar picker: it shows me a calendar","ar":"لو بدأنا نشوف الـ Patterns اللي تحت الـ Date input، هنلاقي أول حاجة الـ Calendar pickers. الـ Calendar picker تقريبًا كلنا استخدمناه: فكرته إنه بيظهر لي"},{"t":28.68,"en":"of a given month, and I choose the day from that month. Of course it suits picking a date close to today very well. And if I","ar":"Calendar بيوضّح لي شهر معين، وأبدأ أختار اليوم من الشهر ده. وطبعًا مناسب جدًا لو باختار تاريخ قريب من التاريخ اللي أنا فيه حاليًا. وبرضه لو عامل"},{"t":38.35,"en":"add a dropdown, or any other pattern or component that lets me change the year easily, it can suit even going back years or forward years,","ar":"مثلًا Drop down، أو أي نوع من الـ Patterns أو الـ Components التانية اللي بتخلّيني أغيّر السنة بسهولة، فممكن يكون مناسب حتى لو عايز أرجع سنين"},{"t":48.02,"en":"so it's easy to pick something in the year range I need. Calendar pickers are among the most frequently used patterns, and we've probably all used them.","ar":"قديمة أو أقدّم سنين قدام، فيكون سهل إني أختار حاجة في Range السنة اللي محتاجها. فالـ Calendar pickers من الـ Patterns المستخدمة بشكل متكرر، وغالبًا كلنا استخدمناها."},{"t":57.7,"en":"They're also very well suited to choosing a date range. If I want to choose a specific range, the best thing to use is pretty much a calendar picker. I can show two months, like this example,","ar":"ومناسبة جدًا جدًا برضه لو عايز أختار Date range. لو عايز أختار Range معين، أفضل حاجة ممكن نستخدمها تقريبًا هي الـ Calendar picker. ممكن أوضّح شهرين، زي المثال اللي قدامنا،"},{"t":68.4,"en":"as on most sites that need the user to enter a range of dates: two months appear side by side like this, so if they choose a date or range from the end of the first month into","ar":"واللي موجود في أغلب المواقع اللي محتاجة إن اليوزر يدخل فيها Range من التواريخ: يظهر قدامه شهرين بالشكل ده، عشان لو بدأ يختار تاريخ أو Range من آخر الشهر الأول"},{"t":79.1,"en":"the second, say the start of the second month, both show in front of them. The range is marked on the calendar, so they see it clearly. It's one of the best patterns for this case in particular.","ar":"لغاية الشهر التاني، مثلًا بداية الشهر التاني، يظهروا قدامه. والـ Range ده متحدد على الـ Calendar، فيبقى شايفه واضح. فهو من أفضل الـ Patterns اللي تُستخدم في الحالة دي تحديدًا."},{"t":89.8,"en":"The second pattern in date inputs is scrolling date pickers: I scroll until I reach the date I want, there may be several columns side by side, and they can include a time","ar":"الـ Pattern التاني في الـ Date inputs هو الـ Scrolling date pickers: إني بعمل Scroll لغاية ما أوصل للتاريخ اللي عايزه، وممكن يكون في أكتر من"},{"t":101.56,"en":"too if I want to enter one. Of course I won't use it, especially if I want to go to a far date, long ago or far ahead. I can use it to","ar":"عمود جنب بعض، وممكن يكون معاهم كمان وقت لو عايز أدخل وقت معين. وطبعًا مش هستخدمه خصوصًا لو عايز أروح لتاريخ بعيد، تاريخ قديم أو قدام جدًا."},{"t":113.32,"en":"pick a near date, or to control the time: the time is all 24 hours, so I control the hours and minutes. But I won't go back months with a scrolling date picker;","ar":"ممكن أستخدمه عشان أختار تاريخ قريب، أو لو عايز أتحكم في الوقت، والوقت كله 24 ساعة، فهتحكم في الساعات والدقايق. لكن مش هرجع مثلًا شهور بالـ"},{"t":125.08,"en":"it won't be the most suitable, since I really move through a small range of dates. And if I'm choosing more than one date, a scrolling date picker may not be the best","ar":"Scrolling date pickers، مش هتكون أنسب حاجة: فعلًا هتحرك في Range قليل من التواريخ. وبرضه لو هختار أكتر من تاريخ، الـ Scrolling date pickers ممكن يكون مش"},{"t":136.84,"en":"choice: the space can be small, and it won't be productive or help me choose quickly. I can let users simply type the date, and typing can be faster and better in that case.","ar":"أفضل اختيار: المساحة ممكن تكون صغيرة، ومش هيكون Productive ولا هيساعدني أختار بسرعة. ممكن أخلّي اليوزرز يكتبوا التاريخ أصلًا، والكتابة ممكن تكون أسرع وأفضل في الحالة دي."},{"t":148.6,"en":"The next pattern under date inputs is using dropdowns to choose the year, day and month. This pattern has a problem: it raises the interaction cost. I open the","ar":"الـ Pattern اللي بعد كده تحت الـ Date inputs إني أستخدم Drop down أختار بيه السنة واليوم والشهر. الـ Pattern ده فيه مشكلة إني هزوّد الـ Interaction cost:"},{"t":157.9,"en":"dropdown, maybe scroll inside it and choose the month, open another dropdown, scroll and choose the day, open and choose the year, and so on. So I have a","ar":"هبدأ أفتح الـ Drop down، ممكن أعمل Scroll جوه الـ Drop down وأختار الشهر، وأفتح Drop down تاني وأعمل Scroll وأختار اليوم، وأفتح وأختار السنة، وهكذا. فهنا عندي"},{"t":167.2,"en":"bit more interaction cost to choose a single date, and it's generally never one of the preferred patterns for choosing a date. The patterns we covered before can be better.","ar":"Interaction cost أكتر شوية عشان أختار تاريخ واحد، فهو دايمًا مش من الـ Patterns المفضلة في اختيار التاريخ عمومًا. الـ Patterns اللي قلناها قبل كده ممكن تكون أفضل."},{"t":176.5,"en":"The last pattern is typing: I type the date. As long as I show the user where to type the day, where the month goes and where the year goes. I can move the user straight to the month as","ar":"والـ Pattern الأخير معانا هو الـ Typing: إني أكتب التاريخ. بمجرد ما أوضّح لليوزر هو يكتب اليوم فين والشهر فين والسنة فين. ممكن أخلّي اليوزر أول"},{"t":185.95,"en":"soon as they type the day, then to the year, or they type the month, it moves them to the day and then the year, and so on. When they type the month, for example, the slash appears and takes them","ar":"ما يكتب اليوم ينقله مباشرة للشهر، وبعدين للسنة، أو يكتب الشهر فينقله لليوم وبعدين للسنة، وهكذا. لما يكتب الشهر مثلًا، الشَّرطة تترسم وتوديه لليوم، ولما يكتب"},{"t":195.39,"en":"to the day, and when they type the day it takes them to the year, so they understand exactly where they're typing. Then typing is one of the easiest kinds of input we can use to let someone enter a date.","ar":"اليوم توديه للسنة، فيبقى فاهم هو بيكتب فين بالضبط. وساعتها يكون الـ Typing من أسهل أنواع الـ Inputs اللي ممكن نستخدمها عشان نخلّي المستخدم يدخل تاريخ معين."}]},{"id":"S03","type":"card","part":"concept","icons":["layers","eye","list","ok"],"title":{"en":"Video summary","ar":"ملخص الفيديو"},"body":{"en":"There's more than one way to enter a date. Pick the one that fits the date people need.\n\n- **Calendar pickers:** best for dates close to today, and for ranges. A year drop-down lets people jump further. For a range, show two months side by side so a stay can cross from one month into the next.\n- **Scrolling pickers:** fine for a near date or a time of day, such as hours and minutes. Not for dates far in the past or future, or for several dates.\n- **Day, month and year drop-downs:** open, scroll and pick three times. A high interaction cost, so avoid them.\n- **Typing:** often the easiest, especially for dates people know by heart, such as a birthdate. Show where the day, month and year go, and move to the next part by itself.","ar":"توجد أكثر من طريقة لإدخال التاريخ. اختر الطريقة التي تناسب التاريخ الذي يحتاجه الناس.\n\n- **التقويم (Calendar picker):** الأفضل للتواريخ القريبة من اليوم، وللفترات. ويتيح Dropdown للسنة الانتقال إلى تاريخ أبعد. وللفترة، اعرض شهرين جنبًا إلى جنب لكي تمتد الإقامة من شهر إلى الشهر التالي.\n- **الـ Scrolling picker:** مناسب لتاريخ قريب أو لوقت في اليوم، مثل الساعات والدقائق. وليس للتواريخ البعيدة في الماضي أو المستقبل، ولا لعدة تواريخ.\n- **Dropdowns لليوم والشهر والسنة:** فتح ثم تمرير ثم اختيار، ثلاث مرات. وهذا Interaction cost عالٍ، فتجنّبها.\n- **الكتابة:** غالبًا الأسهل، خاصة للتواريخ التي يحفظها الناس، مثل تاريخ الميلاد. وضّح مكان اليوم والشهر والسنة، وانتقل إلى الجزء التالي تلقائيًا."}},{"id":"S04","type":"compare","part":"guided","skill":"SK-P14-U06-04","rules":["R06"],"value":{"en":"Date input (NN/g): calendar pickers should be used for events close to the present time, within less than a year. For a birthdate, it would be faster to simply type the year.","ar":"إدخال التاريخ (NN/g): يجب استخدام التقويم للأحداث القريبة من الوقت الحالي، خلال أقل من سنة. أما تاريخ الميلاد، فكتابة السنة ببساطة أسرع."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/date-input/","quote":"Calendar pickers should be used for events close to the present time — within less than a year."},"scenario":{"en":"To create an account, guests enter their date of birth. Most were born between 1960 and 2005.","ar":"لإنشاء حساب، يُدخل النزلاء تاريخ ميلادهم. وأغلبهم وُلدوا بين 1960 و2005."},"prompt":{"en":"Which version should ship?","ar":"أيّ نسخة يجب أن تُطلق؟"},"a":{"label":{"en":"Version A: a calendar that opens on this month","ar":"النسخة A: تقويم يفتح على الشهر الحالي"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nuzul","name":{"en":"Nuzul","ar":"نُزُل"},"color":"#B7791F","icon":"bed","domain":"nuzul.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Create account","ar":"أنشئ حسابًا"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Full name","ar":"الاسم بالكامل"},"text":{"en":"Nada Samir","ar":"ندى سمير"},"filled":true},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Date of birth","ar":"تاريخ الميلاد"}},{"kind":"calendar","months":[{"title":{"en":"‹  November 2026  ›","ar":"‹  نوفمبر 2026  ›"},"start":0,"days":30}],"today":[0,2]}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Continue","ar":"تابع"}}]}},"b":{"label":{"en":"Version B: three labelled fields to type","ar":"النسخة B: ثلاثة حقول لها أسماء للكتابة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nuzul","name":{"en":"Nuzul","ar":"نُزُل"},"color":"#B7791F","icon":"bed","domain":"nuzul.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Create account","ar":"أنشئ حسابًا"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Full name","ar":"الاسم بالكامل"},"text":{"en":"Nada Samir","ar":"ندى سمير"},"filled":true},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Date of birth","ar":"تاريخ الميلاد"}},{"kind":"row","blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Day","ar":"اليوم"},"text":""},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Month","ar":"الشهر"},"text":""},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Year","ar":"السنة"},"text":""}]}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Continue","ar":"تابع"}}]}},"answer":"b","misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P14-065","when":["a"],"feedback":{"en":"Someone born in March 1985 must tap back more than 490 months, or hunt for a hidden way to change the year. A calendar shines near today, not 40 years away.","ar":"من وُلد في مارس 1985 عليه أن يرجع أكثر من 490 شهرًا، أو يبحث عن طريقة مخفية لتغيير السنة. والتقويم مفيد قرب اليوم، لا قبل 40 سنة."}}],"correct":{"en":"B: type a date people know by heart.","ar":"B: اكتب تاريخًا يحفظه الناس."},"explain":{"en":"People know their birthdate without looking. Typing takes seconds, and separate labelled fields keep the day and the month from being mixed up.","ar":"الناس يعرفون تاريخ ميلادهم دون أن ينظروا. والكتابة تأخذ ثوانيَ قليلة، والحقول المنفصلة التي لها أسماء تمنع الخلط بين اليوم والشهر."},"speaker":"sara"},{"id":"S05","type":"compare","part":"contrast","skill":"SK-P14-U06-04","rules":["R11"],"confidence":true,"value":{"en":"Date input (NN/g): calendar pickers should be used for events close to the present time. For a date this week, people think \"Thursday\", and a calendar shows them exactly that.","ar":"إدخال التاريخ (NN/g): يجب استخدام التقويم للأحداث القريبة من الوقت الحالي. ففي تاريخ خلال هذا الأسبوع، يفكّر الناس «الخميس»، والتقويم يعرض لهم ذلك بالضبط."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/date-input/","quote":"Calendar pickers should be used for events close to the present time — within less than a year."},"scenario":{"en":"Guests already at the hotel can book a spa visit for one of the next few days. Today is Monday 2 November.","ar":"يستطيع النزلاء الموجودون في الفندق حجز زيارة للسبا في أحد الأيام القليلة القادمة. واليوم هو الإثنين 2 نوفمبر."},"prompt":{"en":"Which version should ship?","ar":"أيّ نسخة يجب أن تُطلق؟"},"a":{"label":{"en":"Version A: three labelled fields to type","ar":"النسخة A: ثلاثة حقول لها أسماء للكتابة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nuzul","name":{"en":"Nuzul","ar":"نُزُل"},"color":"#B7791F","icon":"bed","domain":"nuzul.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Spa","ar":"السبا"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"flower-lotus","text":{"en":"Massage · 60 min","ar":"مساج · 60 دقيقة"},"value":{"en":"EGP 900","ar":"900 جنيه"}},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Spa visit date","ar":"تاريخ زيارة السبا"}},{"kind":"row","blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Day","ar":"اليوم"},"text":""},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Month","ar":"الشهر"},"text":""},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Year","ar":"السنة"},"text":""}]}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"See times","ar":"اعرض المواعيد"}}]}},"b":{"label":{"en":"Version B: a calendar on this month","ar":"النسخة B: تقويم على الشهر الحالي"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nuzul","name":{"en":"Nuzul","ar":"نُزُل"},"color":"#B7791F","icon":"bed","domain":"nuzul.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Spa","ar":"السبا"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"flower-lotus","text":{"en":"Massage · 60 min","ar":"مساج · 60 دقيقة"},"value":{"en":"EGP 900","ar":"900 جنيه"}},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Spa visit date","ar":"تاريخ زيارة السبا"}},{"kind":"calendar","months":[{"title":{"en":"November 2026","ar":"نوفمبر 2026"},"start":0,"days":30}],"today":[0,2],"pick":[0,5],"text":{"en":"Thursday 5 November","ar":"الخميس 5 نوفمبر"}}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"See times","ar":"اعرض المواعيد"}}]}},"answer":"b","misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P14-065","when":["a"],"feedback":{"en":"Guests think \"Thursday\", not \"the 5th\". With the fields, they must work out the date first, then type the month and a year everyone already knows, with no weekday in sight.","ar":"النزلاء يفكّرون «الخميس»، لا «يوم 5». ومع الحقول، عليهم أن يحسبوا التاريخ أولًا، ثم يكتبوا الشهر وسنة يعرفها الجميع أصلًا."}}],"correct":{"en":"B: a near date belongs on a calendar.","ar":"B: التاريخ القريب مكانه التقويم."},"explain":{"en":"The deciding factor is how far the date is. A birthdate is decades away and known by heart, so typing wins. A spa visit is days away and thought of by weekday, so one tap on the calendar wins.","ar":"ما يحسم الأمر هو بُعد التاريخ. تاريخ الميلاد بعيد بعشرات السنين ومحفوظ، فالكتابة أفضل. أما زيارة السبا فبعد أيام ويُفكَّر فيها بأيام الأسبوع، فضغطة واحدة على التقويم أفضل."},"speaker":"sara"},{"id":"S06","type":"tune","part":"guided","skill":"SK-P14-U06-04","rules":["R06"],"value":{"en":"Date input (NN/g): split fields with drop-downs require a lot of unnecessary steps; this method increases interaction cost by adding additional clicks and scrolling. A scrolling picker suits a time of day close at hand.","ar":"إدخال التاريخ (NN/g): الحقول المقسّمة بـ Dropdowns تحتاج إلى خطوات كثيرة غير ضرورية؛ فهذه الطريقة تزيد الـ Interaction cost بضغطات وتمرير إضافي. أما الـ Scrolling picker فيناسب وقتًا قريبًا في اليوم."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/date-input/","quote":"This method increases interaction cost by adding additional clicks and scrolling."},"scenario":{"en":"On the phone, guests can book a car to pick them up from the airport on their arrival day. They choose the pickup time.","ar":"على الموبايل، يستطيع النزلاء حجز سيارة تستقبلهم من المطار يوم وصولهم. ويختارون موعد الاستقبال."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each version. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل نسخة. أيّها يجب أن تُطلق؟"},"start":"drops","options":[{"id":"drops","text":{"en":"Drop-downs for hour, minutes and AM/PM","ar":"Dropdowns للساعة والدقائق وصباحًا/مساءً"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nuzul","name":{"en":"Nuzul","ar":"نُزُل"},"color":"#B7791F","icon":"bed","domain":"nuzul.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Airport pickup","ar":"الاستقبال من المطار"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"car","text":{"en":"Hurghada Airport → Coral Bay","ar":"مطار الغردقة ← كورال باي"},"value":{"en":"EGP 450","ar":"450 جنيه"}},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Pickup time, Mon 28 Dec","ar":"موعد الاستقبال، الإثنين 28 ديسمبر"}},{"kind":"row","blocks":[{"kind":"select","text":{"en":"Hour","ar":"الساعة"}},{"kind":"select","text":{"en":"Min","ar":"الدقيقة"}},{"kind":"select","text":{"en":"AM","ar":"ص"}}]}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Book car","ar":"احجز السيارة"}}]}},{"id":"wheel","text":{"en":"A scrolling picker for the time","ar":"Scrolling picker للوقت"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nuzul","name":{"en":"Nuzul","ar":"نُزُل"},"color":"#B7791F","icon":"bed","domain":"nuzul.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Airport pickup","ar":"الاستقبال من المطار"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"car","text":{"en":"Hurghada Airport → Coral Bay","ar":"مطار الغردقة ← كورال باي"},"value":{"en":"EGP 450","ar":"450 جنيه"}},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Pickup time, Mon 28 Dec","ar":"موعد الاستقبال، الإثنين 28 ديسمبر"}},{"kind":"wheel","columns":[["1","2","3","4","5"],["00","15","30","45","00"],["","AM","PM","",""]]}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Book car","ar":"احجز السيارة"}}]}}],"answer":["wheel"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P14-066","when":["drops"],"feedback":{"en":"Three drop-downs mean three rounds of open, scroll and pick, each covering the screen. A time on the same day needs only a short scroll.","ar":"ثلاثة Dropdowns تعني ثلاث مرات من الفتح والتمرير والاختيار، وكل مرة تغطي الشاشة. والوقت في اليوم نفسه لا يحتاج إلا إلى تمرير قصير."}}],"hints":[{"en":"How far does the guest need to move from the starting value?","ar":"إلى أي مدى يحتاج النزيل إلى التحرك بعيدًا عن القيمة الأولى؟"}],"correct":{"en":"A scrolling picker for a near time.","ar":"Scrolling picker لوقت قريب."},"explain":{"en":"Hours and quarter hours are a short list, so a flick or two lands on 3:30 PM, with all three parts visible together.","ar":"الساعات وأرباع الساعة قائمة قصيرة، فتكفي حركة أو اثنتان للوصول إلى 3:30 مساءً، مع ظهور الأجزاء الثلاثة معًا."},"speaker":"sara"},{"id":"S07","type":"choose","speaker":"mona","part":"independent","skill":"SK-P14-U06-04","rules":["R14"],"value":{"en":"Date input (NN/g): scrolling date pickers on mobile devices are common, yet they can be annoying if the picker contains many dates, especially when the date is further away in the past or future.","ar":"إدخال التاريخ (NN/g): الـ Scrolling date pickers شائعة على الموبايل، لكنها قد تكون مزعجة إن كان فيها تواريخ كثيرة، خاصة حين يكون التاريخ بعيدًا في الماضي أو المستقبل."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/date-input/","quote":"Scrolling date pickers on mobile devices are common, yet they can be annoying if the picker contains many dates."},"scenario":{"en":"My team designs a car-insurance app. To get a quote, drivers enter the date their car was first licensed, which can be anywhere from last month to 25 years ago. They copy it from their car licence card.","ar":"يصمّم فريقي تطبيقًا لتأمين السيارات. وللحصول على عرض سعر، يُدخل السائقون تاريخ أول ترخيص لسيارتهم، وقد يكون من الشهر الماضي حتى قبل 25 سنة. وينقلونه من رخصة السيارة."},"prompt":{"en":"How should drivers enter the first-licence date?","ar":"كيف يُدخل السائقون تاريخ أول ترخيص؟"},"options":[{"id":"wheel","text":{"en":"A scrolling picker for day, month and year, starting today","ar":"Scrolling picker لليوم والشهر والسنة، يبدأ من اليوم"}},{"id":"drops","text":{"en":"Three drop-downs: day, month and year","ar":"ثلاثة Dropdowns: اليوم والشهر والسنة"}},{"id":"typed","text":{"en":"Three labelled fields to type, with the month spelled out","ar":"ثلاثة حقول لها أسماء للكتابة، والشهر مكتوب باسمه"}}],"answer":["typed"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P14-067","when":["wheel"],"feedback":{"en":"For a car licensed in 2004, the year wheel has to spin past more than twenty years, often overshooting. Scrolling pickers fit near dates and times, not far ones.","ar":"لسيارة مرخّصة في 2004، يجب أن تدور عجلة السنة أكثر من عشرين سنة، وغالبًا تتجاوز السنة المطلوبة. والـ Scrolling picker يناسب التواريخ والأوقات القريبة، لا البعيدة."}},{"id":"MC-P14-066","when":["drops"],"feedback":{"en":"Three rounds of open, scroll and pick, and the year list is long. Drivers already have the date in front of them, so typing it is faster.","ar":"ثلاث مرات من الفتح والتمرير والاختيار، وقائمة السنوات طويلة. والسائقون أمامهم التاريخ أصلًا، فكتابته أسرع."}}],"correct":{"en":"Type a date people copy from a document.","ar":"اكتب تاريخًا ينقله الناس من مستند."},"explain":{"en":"The date is right there on the licence card, so typing it takes seconds whether it's last month or 2004. Labels and a spelled-out month keep day and month from being swapped.","ar":"التاريخ موجود أمامهم على الرخصة، فكتابته تأخذ ثوانيَ قليلة سواء كان الشهر الماضي أو 2004. والأسماء والشهر المكتوب باسمه تمنع الخلط بين اليوم والشهر."}},{"id":"S08","type":"card","part":"recap","icons":["layers","eye","ok"],"title":{"en":"What you practised","ar":"ما تدرّبت عليه"},"body":{"en":"- **Calendars** for dates close to today, and **two months** for a range.\n- **Typing** for far dates people know or copy, such as a birthdate.\n- **Scrolling pickers** only for near dates and times; avoid **day/month/year drop-downs**.\n\nNext: the skill check for this unit.","ar":"- **التقويم** للتواريخ القريبة من اليوم، و**شهران** للفترة.\n- **الكتابة** للتواريخ البعيدة التي يعرفها الناس أو ينقلونها، مثل تاريخ الميلاد.\n- **الـ Scrolling picker** فقط للتواريخ والأوقات القريبة؛ وتجنّب **Dropdowns اليوم والشهر والسنة**.\n\nالتالي: اختبار المهارة لهذه الوحدة."}}]}$uxg$::jsonb),
  ($uxg$P14-U06-L04$uxg$, $uxg$758cd975c347f43268df09a170348613de4c0100b1f83ad451ee957c2053923f$uxg$, $uxg${"id":"P14-U06-L04","mode":"check","minutes":6,"title":{"en":"Skill check: numbers and dates","ar":"اختبار المهارة: الأرقام والتواريخ"},"speaker":"tarek","steps":[{"id":"S01","type":"card","part":"hook","title":{"en":"Tarek's cinema app","ar":"تطبيق طارق للسينما"},"body":{"en":"My team is about to launch an app for a chain of cinemas. People pick a film, a day and their seats, and companies can book a whole screen for an event. Help me review its number and date inputs before launch.\n\nThis is a skill check: no hints, and you'll see how you did at the end.","ar":"فريقي على وشك إطلاق تطبيق لسلسلة سينمات. يختار فيه الناس الفيلم، واليوم، والمقاعد، وتستطيع الشركات حجز قاعة كاملة لمناسبة. ساعدني في مراجعة طرق إدخال الأرقام والتواريخ فيه قبل الإطلاق.\n\nهذا اختبار مهارة: بدون تلميحات، وسترى نتيجتك في النهاية."}},{"id":"S02","type":"compare","part":"check","skill":"SK-P14-U06-01","value":{"en":"Check, input steppers (NN/g): steppers are not suitable for a large number adjustments. A wide range with no common value needs typing.","ar":"اختبار، الـ Input steppers (NN/g): الـ Stepper لا يناسب التغييرات الكبيرة في الأرقام. والمدى الواسع بلا قيمة شائعة يحتاج إلى الكتابة."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/input-steppers/","quote":"Steppers are not suitable for a large number adjustments."},"scenario":{"en":"Companies booking a whole screen enter how many guests are coming, anywhere from 30 to 280.","ar":"الشركات التي تحجز قاعة كاملة تُدخل عدد الضيوف، وقد يكون أي رقم من 30 إلى 280."},"prompt":{"en":"Which version should ship?","ar":"أيّ نسخة يجب أن تُطلق؟"},"a":{"label":{"en":"Version A: a field to type the number","ar":"النسخة A: حقل لكتابة الرقم"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"tazkara","name":{"en":"Tazkara","ar":"تذكرة"},"color":"#C026D3","icon":"ticket","domain":"tazkara.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Private screening","ar":"عرض خاص"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"city-night","size":"s","alt":{"en":"Cinema hall","ar":"قاعة السينما"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"film-strip","text":{"en":"Hall 3 · up to 280 seats","ar":"القاعة 3 · حتى 280 مقعدًا"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Number of guests","ar":"عدد الضيوف"},"hint":{"en":"30 to 280","ar":"من 30 إلى 280"},"text":""}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Check availability","ar":"تحقق من التوفر"}}]}},"b":{"label":{"en":"Version B: a stepper starting at 30","ar":"النسخة B: Stepper يبدأ من 30"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"tazkara","name":{"en":"Tazkara","ar":"تذكرة"},"color":"#C026D3","icon":"ticket","domain":"tazkara.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Private screening","ar":"عرض خاص"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"city-night","size":"s","alt":{"en":"Cinema hall","ar":"قاعة السينما"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"film-strip","text":{"en":"Hall 3 · up to 280 seats","ar":"القاعة 3 · حتى 280 مقعدًا"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"stepper","label":{"en":"Number of guests","ar":"عدد الضيوف"},"text":{"en":"30 guests","ar":"30 ضيفًا"},"min":30,"max":280}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Check availability","ar":"تحقق من التوفر"}}]}},"answer":"a","misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P14-059","when":["b"],"feedback":{"en":"A company with 150 guests would tap + 120 times. There's no common value to start from, so the stepper's strength doesn't apply.","ar":"الشركة التي معها 150 ضيفًا ستضغط + 120 مرة. ولا توجد قيمة شائعة يبدأ منها، فميزة الـ Stepper لا تنطبق هنا."}}],"correct":{"en":"A: type a number from a wide range.","ar":"A: اكتب رقمًا من مدى واسع."},"explain":{"en":"Organisers know their guest count and type it in a second. The hint states the limits up front.","ar":"المنظمون يعرفون عدد ضيوفهم ويكتبونه في ثانية. والتلميح يوضّح الحدود من البداية."},"speaker":"tarek"},{"id":"S03","type":"tune","part":"check","skill":"SK-P14-U06-02","value":{"en":"Check, input steppers (NN/g): designers should make the step and the unit explicit, and indicate any maximum or minimum limit.","ar":"اختبار، الـ Input steppers (NN/g): يجب أن يوضّح المصممون مقدار الخطوة والوحدة، وأي حد أقصى أو أدنى."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/input-steppers/","quote":"Designers should make the step and the unit explicit"},"scenario":{"en":"People can buy a cinema gift card. The amount goes up in steps of EGP 100, from 100 to 2,000, and most cards are EGP 500.","ar":"يستطيع الناس شراء كارت هدية للسينما. والمبلغ يزيد بخطوات قيمتها 100 جنيه، من 100 إلى 2,000، وأغلب الكروت بـ 500 جنيه."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each version. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل نسخة. أيّها يجب أن تُطلق؟"},"start":"bare","options":[{"id":"bare","text":{"en":"The number alone, starting at 500","ar":"الرقم وحده، ويبدأ من 500"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"tazkara","name":{"en":"Tazkara","ar":"تذكرة"},"color":"#C026D3","icon":"ticket","domain":"tazkara.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Gift card","ar":"كارت هدية"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"bank-card","size":"s","alt":{"en":"Gift card","ar":"كارت هدية"}},{"kind":"stepper","label":{"en":"Amount","ar":"المبلغ"},"text":"500","min":100,"max":2000}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Buy gift card","ar":"اشترِ كارت الهدية"}}]}},{"id":"unit","text":{"en":"The currency, the step and the limits shown","ar":"العملة والخطوة والحدود ظاهرة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"tazkara","name":{"en":"Tazkara","ar":"تذكرة"},"color":"#C026D3","icon":"ticket","domain":"tazkara.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Gift card","ar":"كارت هدية"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"bank-card","size":"s","alt":{"en":"Gift card","ar":"كارت هدية"}},{"kind":"stepper","label":{"en":"Amount","ar":"المبلغ"},"text":{"en":"EGP 500","ar":"500 جنيه"},"min":100,"max":2000,"hint":{"en":"Steps of EGP 100 · from 100 to 2,000","ar":"بخطوات 100 جنيه · من 100 إلى 2,000"}}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Buy gift card","ar":"اشترِ كارت الهدية"}}]}}],"answer":["unit"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P14-060","when":["bare"],"feedback":{"en":"500 what? And does + add 1 or 100? People tap to find out and can't tell how far they can go.","ar":"500 ماذا؟ وهل يضيف + واحدًا أم 100؟ يضغط الناس ليعرفوا، ولا يعرفون إلى أي حد يمكنهم الوصول."}}],"correct":{"en":"Show the currency, the step and the limits.","ar":"اعرض العملة والخطوة والحدود."},"explain":{"en":"\"EGP 500\" and one short line answer every question before the first tap.","ar":"«500 جنيه» وسطر قصير واحد يجيبان عن كل سؤال قبل أول ضغطة."},"speaker":"tarek"},{"id":"S04","type":"compare","part":"check","skill":"SK-P14-U06-03","value":{"en":"Check, sliders (NN/g): whenever the exact value matters, sliders are not okay.","ar":"اختبار، الـ Sliders (NN/g): كلما كانت القيمة الدقيقة مهمة، لا يصلح الـ Slider."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/gui-slider-controls/","quote":"But whenever the exact value matters, sliders are not okay."},"scenario":{"en":"Some films are for ages 16 and up, so the app asks viewers their age once. A wrong age means a refused ticket at the door.","ar":"بعض الأفلام لمن هم في سن 16 فما فوق، لذلك يسأل التطبيق المشاهدين عن أعمارهم مرة واحدة. والعمر الخطأ يعني رفض التذكرة عند الباب."},"prompt":{"en":"Which version should ship?","ar":"أيّ نسخة يجب أن تُطلق؟"},"a":{"label":{"en":"Version A: a slider from 10 to 80","ar":"النسخة A: Slider من 10 إلى 80"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"tazkara","name":{"en":"Tazkara","ar":"تذكرة"},"color":"#C026D3","icon":"ticket","domain":"tazkara.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Create account","ar":"أنشئ حسابًا"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"We use your age to show films rated for you.","ar":"نستخدم عمرك لنعرض الأفلام المناسبة لسنّك."}},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Your age","ar":"عمرك"}},{"kind":"slider","min":10,"max":80,"value":30,"format":{"en":"{a} years","ar":"{a} سنة"},"bubble":"above","gap":"m"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Continue","ar":"تابع"}}]}},"b":{"label":{"en":"Version B: a field to type the age","ar":"النسخة B: حقل لكتابة العمر"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"tazkara","name":{"en":"Tazkara","ar":"تذكرة"},"color":"#C026D3","icon":"ticket","domain":"tazkara.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Create account","ar":"أنشئ حسابًا"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"We use your age to show films rated for you.","ar":"نستخدم عمرك لنعرض الأفلام المناسبة لسنّك."}},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Your age","ar":"عمرك"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Age (years)","ar":"العمر (بالسنوات)"},"text":"","gap":"s"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Continue","ar":"تابع"}}]}},"answer":"b","misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P14-064","when":["a"],"feedback":{"en":"Landing on exactly 16 or 17 on a 70-year track is fiddly, and one step off matters here. An exact number needs an exact input.","ar":"الوصول بالضبط إلى 16 أو 17 على شريط يمتد 70 سنة أمر صعب، وخطوة واحدة خطأ لها أثر هنا. والرقم الدقيق يحتاج إلى عنصر دقيق."}}],"correct":{"en":"B: type an exact age.","ar":"B: اكتب العمر بالضبط."},"explain":{"en":"Everyone knows their age, and typing two digits gets it exactly right.","ar":"الجميع يعرفون أعمارهم، وكتابة رقمين تجعله صحيحًا تمامًا."},"speaker":"tarek"},{"id":"S05","type":"compare","part":"check","skill":"SK-P14-U06-04","value":{"en":"Check, date input (NN/g): calendar pickers should be used for events close to the present time. Split date fields with drop-downs require a lot of unnecessary steps.","ar":"اختبار، إدخال التاريخ (NN/g): يجب استخدام التقويم للأحداث القريبة من الوقت الحالي. والحقول المقسّمة بـ Dropdowns تحتاج إلى خطوات كثيرة غير ضرورية."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/date-input/","quote":"Split date fields with drop-downs for month, day, and year require a lot of unnecessary steps."},"scenario":{"en":"Viewers pick a day to watch the film. Showtimes are published for the next 14 days. Today is Monday 2 November.","ar":"يختار المشاهدون يومًا لمشاهدة الفيلم. ومواعيد العروض منشورة لـ 14 يومًا قادمة. واليوم هو الإثنين 2 نوفمبر."},"prompt":{"en":"Which version should ship?","ar":"أيّ نسخة يجب أن تُطلق؟"},"a":{"label":{"en":"Version A: day, month and year drop-downs","ar":"النسخة A: Dropdowns لليوم والشهر والسنة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"tazkara","name":{"en":"Tazkara","ar":"تذكرة"},"color":"#C026D3","icon":"ticket","domain":"tazkara.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Trip to the Moon","ar":"رحلة إلى القمر"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"film-strip","text":{"en":"Nile City Cinema","ar":"سينما نايل سيتي"},"sub":{"en":"Showing for the next 14 days","ar":"يُعرض خلال الـ14 يومًا القادمة"}},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Day to watch","ar":"يوم المشاهدة"}},{"kind":"row","blocks":[{"kind":"select","text":{"en":"Day","ar":"اليوم"}},{"kind":"select","text":{"en":"Month","ar":"الشهر"}},{"kind":"select","text":{"en":"Year","ar":"السنة"}}]}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"See showtimes","ar":"اعرض المواعيد"}}]}},"b":{"label":{"en":"Version B: a calendar on this month","ar":"النسخة B: تقويم على الشهر الحالي"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"tazkara","name":{"en":"Tazkara","ar":"تذكرة"},"color":"#C026D3","icon":"ticket","domain":"tazkara.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Trip to the Moon","ar":"رحلة إلى القمر"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"film-strip","text":{"en":"Nile City Cinema","ar":"سينما نايل سيتي"},"sub":{"en":"Showing for the next 14 days","ar":"يُعرض خلال الـ14 يومًا القادمة"}},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Day to watch","ar":"يوم المشاهدة"}},{"kind":"calendar","months":[{"title":{"en":"November 2026","ar":"نوفمبر 2026"},"start":0,"days":30}],"today":[0,2],"pick":[0,6],"text":{"en":"Friday 6 November","ar":"الجمعة 6 نوفمبر"}}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"See showtimes","ar":"اعرض المواعيد"}}]}},"answer":"b","misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P14-066","when":["a"],"feedback":{"en":"Three drop-downs to pick a day that's at most two weeks away, and none of them shows which day is Friday.","ar":"ثلاثة Dropdowns لاختيار يوم بعد أسبوعين على الأكثر، ولا يوضّح أيّ منها أي يوم هو الجمعة."}}],"correct":{"en":"B: a calendar for a near date.","ar":"B: تقويم لتاريخ قريب."},"explain":{"en":"One tap picks the day, and viewers see the weekdays they plan around.","ar":"ضغطة واحدة تختار اليوم، ويرى المشاهدون أيام الأسبوع التي يخططون على أساسها."},"speaker":"tarek"}]}$uxg$::jsonb),
  ($uxg$P15-U01-L01$uxg$, $uxg$407ef8a0ef963f44f89c33b2f3f4a8dd50a57e2499207dda9548b37384465950$uxg$, $uxg${"id":"P15-U01-L01","mode":"lesson","minutes":7,"title":{"en":"Put the words that matter first","ar":"ضع الكلمات المهمة في البداية"},"summary":{"en":"Rewrite a shop's messages so customers get the point from the first two words.","ar":"أعد كتابة رسائل متجر حتى يفهم العملاء المقصود من أول كلمتين."},"speaker":"youssef","review_labels":{"MC-P15-001":{"en":"Filler words push the meaning out of sight","ar":"كلمات الحشو تؤخّر المعنى فلا يراه القارئ"},"MC-P15-002":{"en":"Background first hides the main point","ar":"البدء بالخلفية يُخفي الفكرة الأهم"},"MC-P15-003":{"en":"Polite openings are still filler","ar":"المقدّمات المهذّبة حشو أيضًا"}},"steps":[{"id":"S01","type":"card","part":"hook","title":{"en":"\"It's written right there!\"","ar":"«مكتوب أمامك!»"},"body":{"en":"I sell home appliances online. Every day, customers call to ask things that are already written in our app.\n\nI looked at our messages. They are long, and the useful words come at the end.","ar":"أبيع أجهزة منزلية أونلاين. وكل يوم يتصل عملاء ليسألوا عن أشياء مكتوبة بالفعل في تطبيقنا.\n\nنظرت إلى رسائلنا. إنها طويلة، والكلمات المفيدة تأتي في آخرها."},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Messages","ar":"الرسائل"}},"tabbar":{"active":3,"items":[{"icon":"house","text":{"en":"Home","ar":"الرئيسية"}},{"icon":"magnifying-glass","text":{"en":"Search","ar":"البحث"}},{"icon":"package","text":{"en":"Orders","ar":"طلباتي"}},{"icon":"chat-circle-text","text":{"en":"Messages","ar":"الرسائل"},"count":3},{"icon":"user","text":{"en":"Account","ar":"حسابي"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","avatar":{"text":"Dar"},"text":{"en":"Introducing our new delivery service for all of Cairo","ar":"نقدّم لكم خدمة التوصيل الجديدة لكل أحياء القاهرة"},"sub":{"en":"Dar · Today","ar":"دار · اليوم"},"value":"9:40","nowrap":true},{"kind":"listitem","avatar":{"text":"Dar"},"text":{"en":"Important information regarding your refund request","ar":"معلومات مهمة بخصوص طلب استرداد المبلغ"},"sub":{"en":"Dar · Yesterday","ar":"دار · أمس"},"value":{"en":"Mon","ar":"الإثنين"},"nowrap":true},{"kind":"listitem","avatar":{"text":"Dar"},"text":{"en":"Please note that the shop will be closed on Friday","ar":"يرجى العلم بأن المتجر سيكون مغلقًا يوم الجمعة"},"sub":{"en":"Dar · Last week","ar":"دار · الأسبوع الماضي"},"value":{"en":"Thu","ar":"الخميس"},"nowrap":true}]}},{"id":"S02","type":"choose","skill":"SK-P15-U01-01","part":"try","rules":["R12"],"value":{"en":"Try first. First 2 Words (NN/g): people scanning a list see about the first 2 words of each item. Those words must carry the meaning.","ar":"جرّب أولًا. أول كلمتين (NN/g): من يتصفّح قائمة يرى تقريبًا أول كلمتين من كل عنصر. لذلك يجب أن تحمل هاتان الكلمتان المعنى."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/first-2-words-a-signal-for-scanning/","quote":"Users typically see about 2 words for most list items; they'll see a little more if the lead words are short, and only the first word if they're long."},"prompt":{"en":"Customers read only the first two words of each message. Which rewrite of the refund message tells them the news fastest?","ar":"العملاء يقرؤون أول كلمتين فقط من كل رسالة. أي صياغة لرسالة الاسترداد تخبرهم بالخبر أسرع؟"},"options":[{"id":"important","text":{"en":"\"Important: information about your refund request\"","ar":"«مهم: معلومات عن طلب استرداد المبلغ»"}},{"id":"approved","text":{"en":"\"Refund approved: the money reaches your card in 3 days\"","ar":"«الاسترداد مقبول: يصل المبلغ إلى بطاقتك خلال 3 أيام»"}},{"id":"please","text":{"en":"\"Please read this update about your refund\"","ar":"«يرجى قراءة هذا التحديث عن الاسترداد»"}}],"answer":["approved"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P15-001","when":["important","please"],"feedback":{"en":"The first two words here are \"Important: information\" or \"Please read\". They say nothing about the refund, so the customer still has to open it.","ar":"أول كلمتين هنا «مهم: معلومات» أو «يرجى قراءة». ولا تقولان شيئًا عن الاسترداد، فيضطر العميل أن يفتح الرسالة."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Read only the first two words of each option.","ar":"اقرأ أول كلمتين فقط من كل خيار."},{"en":"Which first two words already answer \"What happened to my refund?\"","ar":"أي كلمتين في البداية تجيبان عن سؤال «ماذا حدث للاسترداد؟»"}],"correct":{"en":"Right. \"Refund approved\" is the news, and it comes first.","ar":"صحيح. «الاسترداد مقبول» هو الخبر، وجاء أولًا."},"explain":{"en":"People scan. If the first words carry the news, they get it without opening the message.","ar":"الناس يتصفّحون بسرعة. فإذا حملت الكلمات الأولى الخبر، فهموه دون فتح الرسالة."}},{"id":"S03","type":"card","part":"concept","icons":["eye","cut","order","text"],"title":{"en":"People read the first words, then move on","ar":"الناس يقرؤون الكلمات الأولى ثم ينتقلون لغيرها"},"body":{"en":"Most people scan a screen. They don't read it word by word.\n\n- **The first two words:** in a list, people see about 2 words of each line. Arabic readers do the same, starting from the right.\n- **Cut the warm-up:** words like \"Introducing\", \"Please note that\" or \"Click here to\" push the meaning out of sight.\n- **Main point first:** start a message with the most important fact. Details and reasons come after.\n- **Everywhere:** titles, links, buttons, list items and the first line of a message.","ar":"أغلب الناس يتصفّحون الشاشة بسرعة (Scanning). ولا يقرؤونها كلمة كلمة.\n\n- **أول كلمتين:** في القائمة، يرى الناس تقريبًا كلمتين من كل سطر. والقارئ العربي يفعل نفس الشيء، لكن من اليمين.\n- **احذف التمهيد:** كلمات مثل «نقدّم لكم» أو «يرجى العلم بأن» أو «اضغط هنا لـ» تؤخّر المعنى فلا يراه القارئ.\n- **الأهم أولًا:** ابدأ الرسالة بأهم معلومة. والتفاصيل والأسباب تأتي بعدها.\n- **في كل مكان:** العناوين والروابط والأزرار وعناصر القوائم وأول سطر في الرسالة."}},{"id":"S04","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P15-U01-01","part":"guided","rules":["R06"],"value":{"en":"First 2 Words (NN/g): bad links start \"with blah-blah and deferring the information-carrying text to the end\". \"Click here to\" is that blah-blah.","ar":"أول كلمتين (NN/g): الروابط السيئة تبدأ بكلام لا معنى له وتؤخّر الكلمات التي تحمل المعلومة للنهاية. و«اضغط هنا لـ» من هذا النوع."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/first-2-words-a-signal-for-scanning/","quote":"Starting with blah-blah and deferring the information-carrying text to the end"},"scenario":{"en":"Our help page has a list of links. One of them says: \"Click here to see where your order is\".","ar":"في صفحة المساعدة عندنا قائمة روابط. ومنها رابط يقول: «اضغط هنا لترى أين طلبك»."},"prompt":{"en":"Which link text lets a customer find order tracking fastest in the list?","ar":"أي نص للرابط يجعل العميل يجد تتبّع الطلب أسرع في القائمة؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Help","ar":"المساعدة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"searchbar","text":{"en":"Search help","ar":"ابحث في المساعدة"}},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Popular","ar":"الأكثر طلبًا"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"package","text":{"en":"Click here to see where your order is","ar":"اضغط هنا لترى أين طلبك"},"chevron":true,"gap":"s"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"map-pin","text":{"en":"Click here to change your address","ar":"اضغط هنا لتغيير عنوانك"},"chevron":true},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"arrow-u-up-left","text":{"en":"Click here to return a product","ar":"اضغط هنا لإرجاع منتج"},"chevron":true}],"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"}},"options":[{"id":"here","text":{"en":"\"Click here: where is my order?\"","ar":"«اضغط هنا: أين طلبي؟»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Help","ar":"المساعدة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"searchbar","text":{"en":"Search help","ar":"ابحث في المساعدة"}},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Popular","ar":"الأكثر طلبًا"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"package","text":{"en":"Click here: where is my order?","ar":"اضغط هنا: أين طلبي؟"},"chevron":true,"gap":"s"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"map-pin","text":{"en":"Click here to change your address","ar":"اضغط هنا لتغيير عنوانك"},"chevron":true},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"arrow-u-up-left","text":{"en":"Click here to return a product","ar":"اضغط هنا لإرجاع منتج"},"chevron":true}],"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}},{"id":"you","text":{"en":"\"You can see where your order is here\"","ar":"«يمكنك أن ترى مكان طلبك هنا»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Help","ar":"المساعدة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"searchbar","text":{"en":"Search help","ar":"ابحث في المساعدة"}},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Popular","ar":"الأكثر طلبًا"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"package","text":{"en":"You can see where your order is here","ar":"يمكنك أن ترى مكان طلبك هنا"},"chevron":true,"gap":"s"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"map-pin","text":{"en":"Click here to change your address","ar":"اضغط هنا لتغيير عنوانك"},"chevron":true},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"arrow-u-up-left","text":{"en":"Click here to return a product","ar":"اضغط هنا لإرجاع منتج"},"chevron":true}],"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}},{"id":"track","text":{"en":"\"Track your order\"","ar":"«تتبّع طلبك»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Help","ar":"المساعدة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"searchbar","text":{"en":"Search help","ar":"ابحث في المساعدة"}},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Popular","ar":"الأكثر طلبًا"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"package","text":{"en":"Track your order","ar":"تتبّع طلبك"},"chevron":true,"gap":"s"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"map-pin","text":{"en":"Click here to change your address","ar":"اضغط هنا لتغيير عنوانك"},"chevron":true},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"arrow-u-up-left","text":{"en":"Click here to return a product","ar":"اضغط هنا لإرجاع منتج"},"chevron":true}],"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}}],"answer":["track"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P15-001","when":["here","you"],"feedback":{"en":"These still start with \"Click here\" or \"You can\". In a list where every link starts that way, the first words can't tell the links apart.","ar":"ما زالت تبدأ بـ «اضغط هنا» أو «يمكنك». وفي قائمة كل روابطها تبدأ هكذا، لا تفرّق الكلمات الأولى بين الروابط."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Look at the list: how do all the links start?","ar":"انظر إلى القائمة: كيف تبدأ كل الروابط؟"},{"en":"Pick the text whose first word is the task itself.","ar":"اختر النص الذي تكون أول كلمة فيه هي المهمة نفسها."}],"correct":{"en":"Right. \"Track\" is the task, and it comes first.","ar":"صحيح. «تتبّع» هي المهمة، وجاءت أولًا."},"explain":{"en":"A link is already something you tap. Start it with the task, so each link in the list looks different from the first word.","ar":"الرابط شيء يُضغط عليه أصلًا. فابدأه بالمهمة، حتى يختلف كل رابط في القائمة من أول كلمة."},"speaker":"youssef"},{"id":"S05","type":"choose","skill":"SK-P15-U01-02","part":"guided","rules":["R06"],"value":{"en":"Inverted Pyramid (NN/g): start with the most important information, so readers get the main point however much they read.","ar":"الهرم المقلوب (NN/g): ابدأ بأهم معلومة، حتى يفهم القارئ الفكرة الأساسية مهما كان مقدار ما يقرؤه."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/inverted-pyramid/","quote":"Start content with the most important piece of information so readers can get the main point, regardless of how much they read."},"scenario":{"en":"Many orders are late because of the Eid rush. We need to tell each customer when their fridge or washer will arrive.","ar":"طلبات كثيرة تأخّرت بسبب زحمة العيد. ونحتاج أن نخبر كل عميل متى تصل ثلاجته أو غسالته."},"prompt":{"en":"Which message gives the customer the main point even if they read only the first line?","ar":"أي رسالة تعطي العميل الفكرة الأهم حتى لو قرأ السطر الأول فقط؟"},"options":[{"id":"date","text":{"en":"\"Your order now arrives on Thursday, 2 days late. The Eid rush slowed our deliveries.\"","ar":"«طلبك سيصل يوم الخميس، متأخرًا يومين. زحمة العيد أبطأت التوصيل عندنا.»"}},{"id":"story","text":{"en":"\"At Dar, we always work hard to deliver on time. Because of the Eid rush, some orders are late. Yours will now arrive on Thursday.\"","ar":"«في دار نعمل دائمًا بجدّ لنوصل في الموعد. وبسبب زحمة العيد تأخّرت بعض الطلبات. وسيصل طلبك الآن يوم الخميس.»"}},{"id":"sorry","text":{"en":"\"We are very sorry. Eid is our busiest time, and we want to explain what happened to your order.\"","ar":"«نعتذر جدًا. العيد أكثر أوقاتنا ازدحامًا، ونريد أن نشرح ما حدث لطلبك.»"}}],"answer":["date"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P15-002","when":["story"],"feedback":{"en":"The date is at the very end. A customer who stops after the first sentence learns only that you work hard.","ar":"الموعد في آخر الرسالة تمامًا. والعميل الذي يتوقّف بعد الجملة الأولى يعرف فقط أنكم تعملون بجدّ."}},{"id":"MC-P15-003","when":["sorry"],"feedback":{"en":"An apology is fine, but this message never says when the order arrives. That's the one fact the customer needs.","ar":"الاعتذار لا بأس به، لكن هذه الرسالة لا تقول أبدًا متى يصل الطلب. وهذه هي المعلومة الوحيدة التي يحتاجها العميل."}}],"hints":[{"en":"What does the customer want to know most?","ar":"ما أكثر شيء يريد العميل معرفته؟"},{"en":"Find the message where that fact is in the first sentence.","ar":"ابحث عن الرسالة التي فيها هذه المعلومة في الجملة الأولى."}],"correct":{"en":"Right. The new date comes first, the reason second.","ar":"صحيح. الموعد الجديد أولًا، والسبب بعده."},"explain":{"en":"Put the fact people need first, like the top of an upside-down pyramid. The reason can follow for those who keep reading.","ar":"ضع المعلومة التي يحتاجها الناس أولًا، كما في الهرم المقلوب (Inverted pyramid). والسبب يأتي بعدها لمن يكمل القراءة."},"speaker":"youssef"},{"id":"S06","type":"compare","skill":"SK-P15-U01-02","part":"contrast","confidence":true,"rules":["R11"],"value":{"en":"Contrast: details first vs main point first. Inverted Pyramid (NN/g): readers can stop at any point and still come away with the main point.","ar":"مقارنة: التفاصيل أولًا مقابل الفكرة الأهم أولًا. الهرم المقلوب (NN/g): يستطيع القارئ أن يتوقّف في أي مكان ويخرج بالفكرة الأساسية."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/inverted-pyramid/","quote":"Readers can stop reading at any point on the page and still come away with the main point."},"scenario":{"en":"We wrote two versions of the page for our new installation service.","ar":"كتبنا نسختين من صفحة خدمة التركيب الجديدة."},"prompt":{"en":"Which page tells a customer, in its first line, what they get?","ar":"أي صفحة تخبر العميل في سطرها الأول بما سيحصل عليه؟"},"a":{"label":{"en":"A: The page starts with how the service began.","ar":"A: الصفحة تبدأ بقصة بداية الخدمة."},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"dar.example/services/installation","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Washers","ar":"غسالات"},{"en":"Fridges","ar":"ثلاجات"},{"en":"Services","ar":"الخدمات"}],"active":2,"actions":[{"icon":"shopping-cart"},{"icon":"user"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"washing-machine","size":"m"},{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Installation","ar":"التركيب"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"Last year, many customers told us that installing a washer was hard. So our team started to think about a better way.","ar":"في العام الماضي قال لنا كثير من العملاء إن تركيب الغسالة صعب. فبدأ فريقنا يفكّر في طريقة أفضل."},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"Now we install it for free, on the day it arrives.","ar":"والآن نركّبها مجانًا في يوم وصولها."},"gap":"s"}]}},"b":{"label":{"en":"B: The page starts with the offer itself.","ar":"B: الصفحة تبدأ بالعرض نفسه."},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"dar.example/services/installation","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Washers","ar":"غسالات"},{"en":"Fridges","ar":"ثلاجات"},{"en":"Services","ar":"الخدمات"}],"active":2,"actions":[{"icon":"shopping-cart"},{"icon":"user"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"washing-machine","size":"m"},{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Installation","ar":"التركيب"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"We install your washer for free, on the day it arrives.","ar":"نركّب غسالتك مجانًا في يوم وصولها."},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"Last year, many customers told us installing it was hard, so we built this service.","ar":"في العام الماضي قال لنا كثير من العملاء إن التركيب صعب، فبنينا هذه الخدمة."},"gap":"s"}]}},"answer":"b","reason":{"prompt":{"en":"Why is B better?","ar":"لماذا B أفضل؟"},"options":[{"id":"stop","text":{"en":"A customer who reads only the first line already knows the offer","ar":"العميل الذي يقرأ السطر الأول فقط يعرف العرض بالفعل"}},{"id":"short","text":{"en":"B uses fewer words than A","ar":"B فيها كلمات أقل من A"}},{"id":"story","text":{"en":"Stories should never appear on a product page","ar":"القصص يجب ألا تظهر أبدًا في صفحة منتج"}}],"answer":["stop"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P15-002","when":["short","story"],"feedback":{"en":"Both pages have the same words and the same story. Only the order changed: B puts the offer first.","ar":"الصفحتان فيهما نفس الكلمات ونفس القصة. الذي تغيّر هو الترتيب فقط: B تضع العرض أولًا."}}]},"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P15-002","when":["a"],"feedback":{"en":"In A, the free installation is in the last sentence. Most visitors leave before they reach it.","ar":"في A، التركيب المجاني في الجملة الأخيرة. وأغلب الزوار يغادرون قبل أن يصلوا إليه."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Read only the first sentence of each page.","ar":"اقرأ الجملة الأولى فقط من كل صفحة."},{"en":"Both pages have the same facts. What changed?","ar":"الصفحتان فيهما نفس المعلومات. ما الذي تغيّر؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Same words, better order.","ar":"صحيح. نفس الكلمات، بترتيب أفضل."},"explain":{"en":"You don't always need to cut the story. Move the main point to the top and let the story follow.","ar":"لا تحتاج دائمًا أن تحذف القصة. انقل الفكرة الأهم للأعلى، واجعل القصة تأتي بعدها."},"speaker":"youssef"},{"id":"S07","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P15-U01-01","part":"guided","confidence":true,"rules":["R06"],"value":{"en":"How People Read Online (NN/g): front-load information in the structure, in subheadings and in links, so people get the message quickly while scanning. A phone cuts long notification text.","ar":"كيف يقرأ الناس على الإنترنت (NN/g): ضع المعلومة في البداية، في البنية والعناوين الفرعية والروابط، حتى يفهم الناس الرسالة بسرعة وهم يتصفّحون. والهاتف يقطع نص الإشعار الطويل."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/how-people-read-online/","quote":"Placing information up front (in other words, \"front-loading\") in the structure of our content, as well as in subheadings and links, to allow people to understand the message quickly while scanning"},"scenario":{"en":"When an order ships, we send a phone notification. The lock screen shows only one short line of it.","ar":"حين يُشحن الطلب نرسل إشعارًا على الهاتف. وشاشة القفل تُظهر سطرًا واحدًا قصيرًا منه فقط."},"prompt":{"en":"Tap each option to see the change. Which notification still tells the customer the news when the phone cuts it?","ar":"اضغط على كل خيار لترى التغيير. أي إشعار يخبر العميل بالخبر حتى بعد أن يقطعه الهاتف؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"screen":"lock","caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"blocks":[{"kind":"notification","title":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"text":{"en":"Hi Ahmed! We wanted to let you know that your order has shipped and arrives Tuesday","ar":"مرحبًا أحمد! أردنا أن نخبرك بأن طلبك قد شُحن وسيصل يوم الثلاثاء"},"time":{"en":"now","ar":"الآن"},"nowrap":true}]},"options":[{"id":"hello","text":{"en":"Keep the greeting, add an emoji: \"Hi Ahmed! 👋 Good news about your order: it has shipped…\"","ar":"أبقِ التحية وأضف Emoji: «مرحبًا أحمد! 👋 خبر سعيد عن طلبك: لقد شُحن…»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"screen":"lock","caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"notification","title":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"text":{"en":"Hi Ahmed! 👋 Good news about your order: it has shipped and arrives Tuesday","ar":"مرحبًا أحمد! 👋 خبر سعيد عن طلبك: لقد شُحن وسيصل يوم الثلاثاء"},"time":{"en":"now","ar":"الآن"},"nowrap":true}]}},{"id":"bold","text":{"en":"Keep the same text, but make it bold","ar":"أبقِ نفس النص، لكن اجعله عريضًا (Bold)"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"screen":"lock","caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"notification","title":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"text":{"en":"Hi Ahmed! We wanted to let you know that your order has shipped and arrives Tuesday","ar":"مرحبًا أحمد! أردنا أن نخبرك بأن طلبك قد شُحن وسيصل يوم الثلاثاء"},"time":{"en":"now","ar":"الآن"},"nowrap":true,"weight":"bold"}]}},{"id":"front","text":{"en":"Start with the news: \"Order shipped: arrives Tuesday\"","ar":"ابدأ بالخبر: «شُحن طلبك: يصل الثلاثاء»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"screen":"lock","caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"notification","title":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"text":{"en":"Order shipped: arrives Tuesday","ar":"شُحن طلبك: يصل الثلاثاء"},"time":{"en":"now","ar":"الآن"},"nowrap":true}]}}],"answer":["front"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P15-003","when":["hello"],"feedback":{"en":"The greeting uses the only line the phone shows. \"Shipped\" and \"Tuesday\" are cut off.","ar":"التحية تأخذ السطر الوحيد الذي يُظهره الهاتف. وكلمتا «شُحن» و«الثلاثاء» قُطعتا."}},{"id":"MC-P15-001","when":["bold"],"feedback":{"en":"Bold makes it louder, not shorter. The news is still cut off at the end.","ar":"الخط العريض يجعله أبرز، لا أقصر. والخبر ما زال مقطوعًا في النهاية."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Look at where the line is cut in each version.","ar":"انظر أين يُقطع السطر في كل نسخة."},{"en":"Which version shows \"shipped\" and the day before the cut?","ar":"أيّ نسخة تُظهر كلمة «شُحن» واليوم قبل القطع؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Right. The whole message fits, and the news comes first.","ar":"صحيح. الرسالة كلها ظاهرة، والخبر في البداية."},"explain":{"en":"Small spaces cut text from the end. Put the words that matter at the start, so they survive the cut.","ar":"المساحات الصغيرة تقطع النص من آخره. فضع الكلمات المهمة في البداية، حتى تبقى ظاهرة بعد القطع."},"speaker":"youssef"},{"id":"S08","type":"choose","skill":"SK-P15-U01-02","part":"independent","speaker":"nour","rules":["R14"],"value":{"en":"New case. Inverted Pyramid (NN/g): the first sentence of every paragraph should be the most important.","ar":"حالة جديدة. الهرم المقلوب (NN/g): يجب أن تكون الجملة الأولى في كل فقرة هي الأهم."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/inverted-pyramid/","quote":"The first sentence of every paragraph should be the most important."},"scenario":{"en":"I manage a clinic. A doctor is travelling, so we must move some appointments. Our SMS starts: \"Dear patient, as part of our commitment to the best care, and due to a change in Dr. Hazem's schedule…\"","ar":"أدير عيادة. وأحد الأطباء مسافر، فلا بد أن نغيّر بعض المواعيد. ورسالتنا النصية تبدأ هكذا: «عزيزي المريض، حرصًا منّا على تقديم أفضل رعاية، ونظرًا لتغيّر في جدول د. حازم…»"},"prompt":{"en":"Which first sentence should the SMS have, so patients know what to do right away?","ar":"بأيّ جملة تبدأ الرسالة، حتى يعرف المرضى فورًا ما عليهم فعله؟"},"options":[{"id":"moved","text":{"en":"\"Your Sunday visit with Dr. Hazem is now on Monday at 10:00. Reply 1 to confirm.\"","ar":"«موعدك مع د. حازم يوم الأحد انتقل إلى الاثنين الساعة 10:00. أرسل 1 للتأكيد.»"}},{"id":"thanks","text":{"en":"\"Thank you for trusting our clinic with your care.\"","ar":"«شكرًا لثقتكم في عيادتنا.»"}},{"id":"reason","text":{"en":"\"Dr. Hazem will be at a medical conference next week.\"","ar":"«د. حازم سيحضر مؤتمرًا طبيًا الأسبوع القادم.»"}}],"answer":["moved"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P15-003","when":["thanks"],"feedback":{"en":"A polite thank-you uses the first line, and the patient still doesn't know the new time.","ar":"الشكر المهذّب يأخذ السطر الأول، والمريض ما زال لا يعرف الموعد الجديد."}},{"id":"MC-P15-002","when":["reason"],"feedback":{"en":"This is the reason, not the news. Patients need the new day and time first; the reason can come next.","ar":"هذا هو السبب، لا الخبر. المرضى يحتاجون الموعد الجديد أولًا، يومه وساعته، والسبب يأتي بعده."}}],"hints":[{"en":"What must a patient do after reading this SMS?","ar":"ماذا يجب أن يفعل المريض بعد قراءة الرسالة؟"},{"en":"Pick the sentence that a patient could act on alone.","ar":"اختر الجملة التي يستطيع المريض أن يتصرّف بها وحدها."}],"correct":{"en":"Right. New time and the next step, in the first sentence.","ar":"صحيح. الموعد الجديد والخطوة التالية في الجملة الأولى."},"explain":{"en":"Open with what changed for this person and what they should do. Thanks and reasons can follow.","ar":"ابدأ بما تغيّر لهذا الشخص وما عليه أن يفعله. والشكر والأسباب تأتي بعد ذلك."}},{"id":"S09","type":"card","part":"recap","icons":["eye","cut","order","phone"],"title":{"en":"What you did","ar":"ماذا تعلّمت"},"body":{"en":"- **First two words:** you started the refund message with \"Refund approved\".\n- **No warm-up:** you replaced \"Click here to…\" with \"Track your order\".\n- **Main point first:** you put the new delivery date before the reason, and the offer before the story.\n- **Survive the cut:** you wrote a notification that still works when the phone cuts it.\n\nNext lesson: headings and lists people can scan.","ar":"- **أول كلمتين:** بدأت رسالة الاسترداد بـ «الاسترداد مقبول».\n- **بلا تمهيد:** استبدلت «اضغط هنا لـ…» بـ «تتبّع طلبك».\n- **الأهم أولًا:** وضعت موعد التوصيل الجديد قبل السبب، والعرض قبل القصة.\n- **الخبر يبقى بعد القطع:** كتبت إشعارًا يبقى خبره ظاهرًا حتى حين يقطعه الهاتف.\n\nالدرس التالي: عناوين وقوائم يتصفّحها الناس بسرعة."}}]}$uxg$::jsonb),
  ($uxg$P15-U01-L02$uxg$, $uxg$cf9745326a8822707685a8437d12098458429c52f93dc67f7ff2b7d59005c946$uxg$, $uxg${"id":"P15-U01-L02","mode":"lesson","minutes":7,"title":{"en":"Headings and lists people can scan","ar":"عناوين وقوائم تُفهم بنظرة واحدة"},"summary":{"en":"Fix a gym's membership page with clear headings and the right kind of list.","ar":"أصلح صفحة اشتراكات نادٍ رياضي بعناوين واضحة ونوع القائمة المناسب."},"speaker":"hana","review_labels":{"MC-P15-004":{"en":"A clever heading hides what's below","ar":"العنوان الطريف يُخفي ما تحته"},"MC-P15-005":{"en":"A paragraph hides separate items","ar":"الفقرة تُخفي العناصر المنفصلة"},"MC-P15-006":{"en":"Numbers make options look like steps","ar":"الأرقام تجعل الخيارات تبدو كخطوات"},"MC-P15-007":{"en":"List items that start differently are harder to scan","ar":"العناصر التي تختلف بداياتها أصعب في التصفّح"}},"steps":[{"id":"S01","type":"card","part":"hook","title":{"en":"A page nobody reads","ar":"صفحة لا يقرؤها أحد"},"body":{"en":"I own a gym. Our membership page has all the answers: prices, what's included, how to pay, and the rules.\n\nBut people still ask at the desk. The page is one long block of text under fun headings.","ar":"أملك ناديًا رياضيًا. وصفحة الاشتراكات عندنا فيها كل الإجابات: الأسعار، وما يشمله الاشتراك، وطرق الدفع، والقواعد.\n\nلكن الناس ما زالوا يسألون في الاستقبال. فالصفحة كتلة نص طويلة تحت عناوين مَرِحة."},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Membership","ar":"الاشتراك"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"gym","size":"m"},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Get ready to sweat!","ar":"استعدّ لتتعرّق!"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"Your membership includes the gym floor, two group classes a week, a locker and one session with a trainer. You can pay by card, in cash at the desk or by mobile wallet…","ar":"اشتراكك يشمل صالة الأجهزة، وحصتين جماعيتين في الأسبوع، وخزانة، وجلسة واحدة مع مدرّب. ويمكنك الدفع بالبطاقة، أو نقدًا في الاستقبال، أو بالمحفظة الإلكترونية…"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"The fine print","ar":"التفاصيل الصغيرة"},"gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"S02","type":"choose","skill":"SK-P15-U01-03","part":"try","rules":["R12"],"value":{"en":"Try first. Headings Are Pick-Up Lines (NN/g): useful headings are specific. Avoid broad and generic headings.","ar":"جرّب أولًا. العناوين (NN/g): العناوين المفيدة محددة. وتجنّب العناوين العامة الواسعة."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/headings-pickup-lines/","quote":"Useful headings are specific."},"prompt":{"en":"I want a heading above our prices. Which heading tells a visitor exactly what is in that section?","ar":"أريد عنوانًا فوق الأسعار. أي عنوان يخبر الزائر بالضبط بما في هذا القسم؟"},"options":[{"id":"invest","text":{"en":"\"Invest in yourself\"","ar":"«استثمر في نفسك»"}},{"id":"plans","text":{"en":"\"Our plans\"","ar":"«خططنا»"}},{"id":"prices","text":{"en":"\"Prices: monthly and yearly\"","ar":"«الأسعار: شهري وسنوي»"}}],"answer":["prices"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P15-004","when":["invest"],"feedback":{"en":"\"Invest in yourself\" sounds nice, but it could sit above anything: classes, coaching or prices.","ar":"«استثمر في نفسك» عبارة لطيفة، لكنها تصلح فوق أي شيء: الحصص أو التدريب أو الأسعار."}},{"id":"MC-P15-004","when":["plans"],"feedback":{"en":"\"Our plans\" is too broad. It could mean training plans, not prices.","ar":"«خططنا» عامة جدًا. وقد تعني خطط التمرين، لا الأسعار."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Imagine the heading with nothing under it. Could you guess the content?","ar":"تخيّل العنوان بلا شيء تحته. هل تستطيع تخمين المحتوى؟"},{"en":"Which heading names the thing itself?","ar":"أي عنوان يذكر الشيء نفسه باسمه؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Right. It names what's below, in plain words.","ar":"صحيح. يذكر ما تحته بكلمات بسيطة."},"explain":{"en":"People scan headings to decide where to look. A specific heading sends them to the right place.","ar":"الناس يتصفّحون العناوين ليقرّروا أين ينظرون. والعنوان المحدد يرسلهم للمكان الصحيح."}},{"id":"S03","type":"card","part":"concept","icons":["text","list","order","eye"],"title":{"en":"Headings that say it, lists that show it","ar":"عناوين تقول المحتوى، وقوائم تُظهر العناصر"},"body":{"en":"- **Specific headings:** say what's below in plain words. A heading must make sense alone, for example in search results or a shared link.\n- **No clever headings:** jokes and slogans hide what the section is about.\n- **Lists for 3 or more items:** put related items on separate lines, so the eye can count and compare them.\n- **Numbers only for order:** number a list when the order or the count matters, like steps. Otherwise use bullets.\n- **Start items the same way:** for example, every item starts with a verb.","ar":"- **عناوين محددة:** قل ما تحت العنوان بكلمات بسيطة. ويجب أن يُفهم العنوان وحده، مثلًا في نتائج البحث أو في رابط تشاركه.\n- **لا عناوين طريفة:** النكات والشعارات تُخفي موضوع القسم.\n- **قوائم لـ 3 عناصر أو أكثر:** ضع العناصر المترابطة في سطور منفصلة، حتى تعدّها العين وتقارن بينها.\n- **أرقام للترتيب فقط:** رقّم القائمة حين يهمّ الترتيب أو العدد، مثل الخطوات. وإلا فاستخدم النقاط (Bullets).\n- **ابدأ العناصر بنفس الطريقة:** مثلًا، كل عنصر يبدأ بفعل."}},{"id":"S04","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P15-U01-04","part":"guided","rules":["R06"],"value":{"en":"Bulleted Lists (NN/g): vertical lists are best for three or more items you want to draw attention to; the eye finds them faster than items inside a paragraph.","ar":"القوائم النقطية (NN/g): القوائم الرأسية أفضل حين يكون عندك ثلاثة عناصر أو أكثر تريد لفت النظر إليها، والعين تجدها أسرع من العناصر داخل فقرة."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/presenting-bulleted-lists/","quote":"Vertical lists are best when you have three or more items that you want to attract attention to."},"scenario":{"en":"Visitors keep asking what the membership includes. Today it's one sentence: the gym floor, two classes a week, a locker and one trainer session.","ar":"الزوار يسألون دائمًا عمّا يشمله الاشتراك. واليوم هو جملة واحدة: صالة الأجهزة، وحصتان في الأسبوع، وخزانة، وجلسة مع مدرّب."},"prompt":{"en":"Tap each option to see the change. Which version lets a visitor see the 4 things at a glance?","ar":"اضغط على كل خيار لترى التغيير. أيّ نسخة تجعل الزائر يرى الأشياء الأربعة بنظرة واحدة؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"My plan","ar":"اشتراكي"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"blocks":[{"kind":"card","blocks":[{"kind":"badge","text":{"en":"Monthly plan","ar":"اشتراك شهري"}},{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"EGP 850","ar":"850 جنيه"},"per":{"en":"/ month","ar":"/ شهر"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"What's included","ar":"ما يشمله الاشتراك"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"Your membership includes the gym floor, two group classes a week, a locker and one session with a trainer.","ar":"اشتراكك يشمل صالة الأجهزة، وحصتين جماعيتين في الأسبوع، وخزانة، وجلسة واحدة مع مدرّب."},"gap":"xs"}]}]},"options":[{"id":"list","text":{"en":"Put each item on its own line with a bullet","ar":"ضع كل عنصر في سطر خاص به مع نقطة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"My plan","ar":"اشتراكي"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"card","blocks":[{"kind":"badge","text":{"en":"Monthly plan","ar":"اشتراك شهري"}},{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"EGP 850","ar":"850 جنيه"},"per":{"en":"/ month","ar":"/ شهر"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"What's included","ar":"ما يشمله الاشتراك"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"list","style":"bullet","items":[{"en":"Gym floor, any time","ar":"صالة الأجهزة في أي وقت"},{"en":"2 group classes a week","ar":"حصتان جماعيتان في الأسبوع"},{"en":"A locker","ar":"خزانة"},{"en":"1 session with a trainer","ar":"جلسة واحدة مع مدرّب"}],"gap":"xs"}]}]}},{"id":"bold","text":{"en":"Keep the sentence, make the 4 items bold","ar":"أبقِ الجملة، واجعل العناصر الأربعة بخط عريض"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"My plan","ar":"اشتراكي"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"card","blocks":[{"kind":"badge","text":{"en":"Monthly plan","ar":"اشتراك شهري"}},{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"EGP 850","ar":"850 جنيه"},"per":{"en":"/ month","ar":"/ شهر"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"What's included","ar":"ما يشمله الاشتراك"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"Your membership includes the **gym floor**, **two group classes a week**, a **locker** and **one session with a trainer**.","ar":"اشتراكك يشمل **صالة الأجهزة**، و**حصتين جماعيتين في الأسبوع**، و**خزانة**، و**جلسة واحدة مع مدرّب**."},"gap":"xs"}]}]}},{"id":"longer","text":{"en":"Explain each item in a full paragraph","ar":"اشرح كل عنصر في فقرة كاملة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"My plan","ar":"اشتراكي"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"card","blocks":[{"kind":"badge","text":{"en":"Monthly plan","ar":"اشتراك شهري"}},{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"EGP 850","ar":"850 جنيه"},"per":{"en":"/ month","ar":"/ شهر"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"What's included","ar":"ما يشمله الاشتراك"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"First, you can use the gym floor whenever we are open, with all the machines and free weights. On top of that, you can join two group classes every week, and there are many to choose from…","ar":"أولًا، يمكنك استخدام صالة الأجهزة في أي وقت يكون النادي فيه مفتوحًا، بكل الأجهزة والأوزان الحرة. وفوق ذلك، يمكنك حضور حصتين جماعيتين كل أسبوع، وهناك حصص كثيرة للاختيار…"},"gap":"xs"}]}]}}],"answer":["list"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P15-005","when":["bold","longer"],"feedback":{"en":"The items are still hidden inside sentences. The eye has to read the whole text to count them.","ar":"العناصر ما زالت مخفية داخل الجمل. والعين مضطرة لقراءة النص كله لتعدّها."}}],"hints":[{"en":"In which version can you count the 4 items without reading?","ar":"في أي نسخة تستطيع أن تعدّ العناصر الأربعة دون قراءة؟"},{"en":"Separate lines let the eye jump from item to item.","ar":"السطور المنفصلة تجعل العين تقفز من عنصر لآخر."}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Four lines, four things.","ar":"صحيح. أربعة سطور، أربعة أشياء."},"explain":{"en":"A vertical list shows how many items there are and lets people find the one they care about.","ar":"القائمة الرأسية تُظهر عدد العناصر، وتجعل الناس يجدون العنصر الذي يهمّهم."},"speaker":"hana"},{"id":"S05","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P15-U01-04","part":"guided","confidence":true,"rules":["R06"],"value":{"en":"Bulleted Lists (NN/g): if order or count doesn't matter, don't number the list. In tests, people thought they had to complete every numbered item when they only needed one.","ar":"القوائم النقطية (NN/g): إذا لم يكن الترتيب أو العدد مهمًا فلا ترقّم القائمة. وفي الاختبارات ظنّ الناس أن عليهم تنفيذ كل عنصر مرقّم، بينما كانوا يحتاجون واحدًا فقط."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/presenting-bulleted-lists/","quote":"in our user-testing studies, people erroneously thought that they had to complete all steps in a numbered list, when they only needed to choose one option."},"scenario":{"en":"Members can pay in one of three ways: by card, in cash at the desk, or by mobile wallet. Our page shows them as a numbered list.","ar":"يستطيع الأعضاء الدفع بإحدى ثلاث طرق: بالبطاقة، أو نقدًا في الاستقبال، أو بالمحفظة الإلكترونية. وصفحتنا تعرضها كقائمة مرقّمة."},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Pay for your plan","ar":"دفع الاشتراك"},"back":true},"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Continue","ar":"متابعة"}}],"blocks":[{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"EGP 850","ar":"850 جنيه"},"per":{"en":"/ month","ar":"/ شهر"}},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"How to pay","ar":"طرق الدفع"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"list","style":"number","items":[{"en":"Card","ar":"البطاقة"},{"en":"Cash at the desk","ar":"نقدًا في الاستقبال"},{"en":"Mobile wallet","ar":"المحفظة الإلكترونية"}],"gap":"xs"}],"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"}},"prompt":{"en":"What should I change so members see they need only one way?","ar":"ماذا أغيّر حتى يرى الأعضاء أنهم يحتاجون طريقة واحدة فقط؟"},"options":[{"id":"keep","text":{"en":"Nothing. Numbers make any list easier to follow","ar":"لا شيء. الأرقام تجعل أي قائمة أسهل"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Pay for your plan","ar":"دفع الاشتراك"},"back":true},"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Continue","ar":"متابعة"}}],"blocks":[{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"EGP 850","ar":"850 جنيه"},"per":{"en":"/ month","ar":"/ شهر"}},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"How to pay","ar":"طرق الدفع"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"list","style":"number","items":[{"en":"Card","ar":"البطاقة"},{"en":"Cash at the desk","ar":"نقدًا في الاستقبال"},{"en":"Mobile wallet","ar":"المحفظة الإلكترونية"}],"gap":"xs"}],"caption":{"en":"Unchanged","ar":"بدون تغيير"}}},{"id":"bullets","text":{"en":"Use bullets instead of numbers, with the lead-in \"Pay in any one of these ways:\"","ar":"استخدم نقاطًا بدل الأرقام، مع جملة تمهيد: «ادفع بإحدى هذه الطرق:»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Pay for your plan","ar":"دفع الاشتراك"},"back":true},"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Continue","ar":"متابعة"}}],"blocks":[{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"EGP 850","ar":"850 جنيه"},"per":{"en":"/ month","ar":"/ شهر"}},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Pay in any one of these ways:","ar":"ادفع بإحدى هذه الطرق:"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"list","style":"bullet","items":[{"en":"Card","ar":"البطاقة"},{"en":"Cash at the desk","ar":"نقدًا في الاستقبال"},{"en":"Mobile wallet","ar":"المحفظة الإلكترونية"}],"gap":"xs"}],"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}},{"id":"sentence","text":{"en":"Put the three ways in one sentence","ar":"ضع الطرق الثلاث في جملة واحدة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Pay for your plan","ar":"دفع الاشتراك"},"back":true},"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Continue","ar":"متابعة"}}],"blocks":[{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"EGP 850","ar":"850 جنيه"},"per":{"en":"/ month","ar":"/ شهر"}},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"How to pay","ar":"طرق الدفع"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"Card, cash at the desk, mobile wallet.","ar":"البطاقة، نقدًا في الاستقبال، المحفظة الإلكترونية."},"gap":"xs"}],"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}}],"answer":["bullets"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P15-006","when":["keep"],"feedback":{"en":"Numbers say \"do 1, then 2, then 3\". Members may think they must pay all three ways, or in that order.","ar":"الأرقام تقول «افعل 1 ثم 2 ثم 3». فقد يظنّ الأعضاء أن عليهم الدفع بالطرق الثلاث، أو بهذا الترتيب."}},{"id":"MC-P15-005","when":["sentence"],"feedback":{"en":"Three options are easier to compare on separate lines. Just drop the numbers.","ar":"الخيارات الثلاثة أسهل في المقارنة على سطور منفصلة. يكفي أن تحذف الأرقام."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Does the order of these 3 ways matter?","ar":"هل ترتيب هذه الطرق الثلاث مهم؟"},{"en":"What do numbers usually tell a reader?","ar":"ماذا تقول الأرقام عادةً للقارئ؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Bullets for choices, numbers for steps.","ar":"صحيح. النقاط للخيارات، والأرقام للخطوات."},"explain":{"en":"Number a list only when order or count matters, like the steps to book a class. Choices get bullets and a clear lead-in.","ar":"رقّم القائمة فقط حين يهمّ الترتيب أو العدد، مثل خطوات حجز حصة. أما الخيارات فلها نقاط وجملة تمهيد واضحة."},"speaker":"hana"},{"id":"S06","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P15-U01-04","part":"guided","rules":["R06"],"value":{"en":"Bulleted Lists (NN/g): structure each item the same way; start every item with the same part of speech, such as a verb.","ar":"القوائم النقطية (NN/g): ابنِ كل عنصر بنفس الطريقة، وابدأ كل عنصر بنفس نوع الكلمة، مثل الفعل."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/presenting-bulleted-lists/","quote":"Make sure each bulleted-list item starts with the same part of speech (e.g., noun, verb) and that they are all either fragments or complete sentences."},"scenario":{"en":"Our gym rules list mixes different kinds of sentences.","ar":"قائمة قواعد النادي عندنا تخلط أنواعًا مختلفة من الجمل."},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Gym rules","ar":"قواعد النادي"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"gym","size":"s"},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Gym rules","ar":"قواعد النادي"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"list","style":"bullet","items":[{"en":"Bring a towel","ar":"أحضِر منشفة"},{"en":"Clean shoes are required on the floor","ar":"الأحذية النظيفة مطلوبة في الصالة"},{"en":"Phones? Not on the floor, please","ar":"الهاتف؟ ليس في الصالة من فضلك"},{"en":"It is important to put weights back","ar":"من المهم إعادة الأوزان لمكانها"}],"gap":"xs"}],"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"}},"prompt":{"en":"Which rewrite makes the rules easiest to scan?","ar":"أي صياغة تجعل القواعد أسهل في التصفّح؟"},"options":[{"id":"mixed","text":{"en":"Keep the items, but add \"Rule:\" before each one","ar":"أبقِ العناصر، لكن أضف «قاعدة:» قبل كل واحد"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Gym rules","ar":"قواعد النادي"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"gym","size":"s"},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Gym rules","ar":"قواعد النادي"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"list","style":"bullet","items":[{"en":"Rule: Bring a towel","ar":"قاعدة: أحضِر منشفة"},{"en":"Rule: Clean shoes are required on the floor","ar":"قاعدة: الأحذية النظيفة مطلوبة في الصالة"},{"en":"Rule: Phones? Not on the floor, please","ar":"قاعدة: الهاتف؟ ليس في الصالة من فضلك"},{"en":"Rule: It is important to put weights back","ar":"قاعدة: من المهم إعادة الأوزان لمكانها"}],"gap":"xs"}],"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}},{"id":"para","text":{"en":"Join all four rules into one friendly paragraph","ar":"اجمع القواعد الأربع في فقرة واحدة لطيفة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Gym rules","ar":"قواعد النادي"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"gym","size":"s"},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Gym rules","ar":"قواعد النادي"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"text","gap":"xs","text":{"en":"Welcome! Please bring a towel, and clean shoes are required on the floor. Phones? Not on the floor, please. And it is important to put weights back. Thanks!","ar":"أهلًا بك! من فضلك أحضِر منشفة، والأحذية النظيفة مطلوبة في الصالة. الهاتف؟ ليس في الصالة من فضلك. ومن المهم إعادة الأوزان لمكانها. شكرًا!"}}],"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}},{"id":"verbs","text":{"en":"Start every item with a verb: \"Bring a towel · Wear clean shoes · Keep your phone in the locker · Put weights back\"","ar":"ابدأ كل عنصر بفعل: «أحضِر منشفة · البس حذاءً نظيفًا · اترك هاتفك في الخزانة · أعِد الأوزان لمكانها»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Gym rules","ar":"قواعد النادي"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"gym","size":"s"},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Gym rules","ar":"قواعد النادي"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"list","style":"bullet","items":[{"en":"Bring a towel","ar":"أحضِر منشفة"},{"en":"Wear clean shoes","ar":"البس حذاءً نظيفًا"},{"en":"Keep your phone in the locker","ar":"اترك هاتفك في الخزانة"},{"en":"Put weights back","ar":"أعِد الأوزان لمكانها"}],"gap":"xs"}],"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}}],"answer":["verbs"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P15-007","when":["mixed"],"feedback":{"en":"Now every item starts with the same word, \"Rule:\". The first words can't tell the rules apart, and the mixed sentences stay.","ar":"الآن كل عنصر يبدأ بنفس الكلمة «قاعدة:». فلا تفرّق الكلمات الأولى بين القواعد، وتبقى الجمل المختلطة."}},{"id":"MC-P15-005","when":["para"],"feedback":{"en":"A paragraph hides the four rules. Keep the list and fix how each item starts.","ar":"الفقرة تُخفي القواعد الأربع. أبقِ القائمة وأصلح طريقة بداية كل عنصر."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Look at the first word of each rule in the list now.","ar":"انظر إلى أول كلمة في كل قاعدة في القائمة الآن."},{"en":"Which option makes every rule start the same kind of way, with a different word?","ar":"أيّ خيار يجعل كل القواعد تبدأ بنفس نوع الكلمة، لكن بكلمة مختلفة؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Same shape, different first words.","ar":"صحيح. نفس الشكل، وكلمات أولى مختلفة."},"explain":{"en":"When every item starts with a verb, people read the list as a set of things to do, and each first word is different.","ar":"حين يبدأ كل عنصر بفعل، يقرأ الناس القائمة كمجموعة أشياء يفعلونها، وتكون أول كلمة مختلفة في كل عنصر."},"speaker":"hana"},{"id":"S07","type":"compare","skill":"SK-P15-U01-03","part":"contrast","confidence":true,"rules":["R11"],"value":{"en":"Contrast: clever vs plain heading. Tone of Voice (NN/g): funny or clever headlines often fail at the job of a headline, which is telling people what is below it.","ar":"مقارنة: عنوان ذكي مقابل عنوان بسيط. نبرة الصوت (NN/g): العناوين المضحكة أو الذكية تفشل غالبًا في مهمة العنوان، وهي أن يخبر الناس بما تحته."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/tone-voice-users/","quote":"Funny or clever headlines often fail to serve the actual purpose of headlines"},"scenario":{"en":"We post the class times on our home page and share the link in our WhatsApp group.","ar":"ننشر مواعيد الحصص على الصفحة الرئيسية، ونرسل الرابط في مجموعة الواتساب."},"prompt":{"en":"Which heading tells members, even in the shared link, that this is the class schedule?","ar":"أيّ عنوان يخبر الأعضاء أن هذا جدول الحصص، حتى حين يظهر في الرابط على الواتساب؟"},"a":{"label":{"en":"A: A heading that names the schedule and the week.","ar":"A: عنوان يذكر الجدول والأسبوع."},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"logo":true},"tabbar":{"active":0,"items":[{"icon":"house","text":{"en":"Home","ar":"الرئيسية"}},{"icon":"calendar-blank","text":{"en":"Classes","ar":"الحصص"}},{"icon":"identification-card","text":{"en":"My plan","ar":"اشتراكي"}},{"icon":"user","text":{"en":"Account","ar":"حسابي"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"card","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Class times: 10 to 16 March","ar":"مواعيد الحصص: من 10 إلى 16 مارس"}},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Yoga · Spinning · Boxing","ar":"يوغا · دراجات · ملاكمة"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"row","blocks":[{"kind":"badge","text":{"en":"Yoga 7 PM","ar":"يوغا 7 م"},"tone":"neutral"},{"kind":"badge","text":{"en":"Spinning 8 PM","ar":"دراجات 8 م"},"tone":"neutral"}],"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"See all classes","ar":"كل الحصص"},"style":"outline","gap":"m"}]}]}},"b":{"label":{"en":"B: A fun heading with a slogan.","ar":"B: عنوان مرح فيه شعار."},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"logo":true},"tabbar":{"active":0,"items":[{"icon":"house","text":{"en":"Home","ar":"الرئيسية"}},{"icon":"calendar-blank","text":{"en":"Classes","ar":"الحصص"}},{"icon":"identification-card","text":{"en":"My plan","ar":"اشتراكي"}},{"icon":"user","text":{"en":"Account","ar":"حسابي"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"card","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Find your rhythm 🔥","ar":"اعثر على إيقاعك 🔥"}},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Yoga · Spinning · Boxing","ar":"يوغا · دراجات · ملاكمة"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"row","blocks":[{"kind":"badge","text":{"en":"Yoga 7 PM","ar":"يوغا 7 م"},"tone":"neutral"},{"kind":"badge","text":{"en":"Spinning 8 PM","ar":"دراجات 8 م"},"tone":"neutral"}],"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"See all classes","ar":"كل الحصص"},"style":"outline","gap":"m"}]}]}},"answer":"a","reason":{"prompt":{"en":"Why is A better?","ar":"لماذا A أفضل؟"},"options":[{"id":"alone","text":{"en":"It says what's below even when the heading appears alone, as in the shared link","ar":"يقول ما تحته حتى حين يظهر العنوان وحده، كما في الرابط الذي نشاركه"}},{"id":"emoji","text":{"en":"Emojis are never allowed in headings","ar":"الـ Emoji ممنوعة دائمًا في العناوين"}},{"id":"long","text":{"en":"Longer headings always work better","ar":"العناوين الأطول أفضل دائمًا"}}],"answer":["alone"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P15-004","when":["emoji","long"],"feedback":{"en":"The emoji and the length are not the problem. B fails because \"Find your rhythm\" doesn't say it's a schedule.","ar":"المشكلة ليست في الـ Emoji ولا في الطول. B لا تنجح لأن «اعثر على إيقاعك» لا تقول إنه جدول."}}]},"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P15-004","when":["b"],"feedback":{"en":"In the WhatsApp preview, members see only \"Find your rhythm\". Nothing says it's this week's class times.","ar":"في معاينة الواتساب يرى الأعضاء «اعثر على إيقاعك» فقط. ولا شيء يقول إنها مواعيد حصص هذا الأسبوع."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Cover the class names. What does each heading tell you alone?","ar":"غطِّ أسماء الحصص. ماذا يخبرك كل عنوان وحده؟"},{"en":"In a shared link, often only the heading shows.","ar":"حين نشارك الرابط، كثيرًا ما يظهر العنوان وحده."}],"correct":{"en":"Right. A plain heading works anywhere it appears.","ar":"صحيح. العنوان البسيط يُفهم في أي مكان يظهر فيه."},"explain":{"en":"Headings often travel alone: in search results, chats and notifications. Write them so they still make sense there.","ar":"كثيرًا ما تظهر العناوين وحدها: في نتائج البحث والمحادثات والإشعارات. فاكتبها بحيث تُفهم هناك أيضًا."},"speaker":"hana"},{"id":"S08","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P15-U01-03","part":"independent","speaker":"karim","rules":["R14"],"value":{"en":"New case. Headings Are Pick-Up Lines (NN/g): on the web, headlines usually appear out of context, such as in search results, so they must make sense alone.","ar":"حالة جديدة. العناوين (NN/g): على الإنترنت تظهر العناوين غالبًا خارج سياقها، مثل نتائج البحث، لذلك يجب أن تُفهم وحدها."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/headings-pickup-lines/","quote":"Make sure the headline works out of context."},"scenario":{"en":"I'm building the help centre for a banking app. When people search, they see only the article titles. One article explains how to get a new card PIN by SMS.","ar":"أبني مركز المساعدة لتطبيق بنك. وحين يبحث الناس، يرون عناوين المقالات فقط. وإحدى المقالات تشرح كيف تحصل على رقم سري (PIN) جديد للبطاقة برسالة نصية."},"prompt":{"en":"Which title helps someone who forgot their PIN pick the right article from the results?","ar":"أي عنوان يساعد من نسي رقمه السري على اختيار المقالة الصحيحة من النتائج؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rasid","name":{"en":"Rasid","ar":"رصيد"},"color":"#1C3D6E","icon":"bank","domain":"rasid.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Help","ar":"المساعدة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"searchbar","text":{"en":"forgot pin","ar":"نسيت الرقم السري"},"filled":true},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"3 results","ar":"3 نتائج"},"color":"muted","gap":"s"}],"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"}},"options":[{"id":"know","text":{"en":"\"Everything you need to know about your card\"","ar":"«كل ما تحتاج معرفته عن بطاقتك»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rasid","name":{"en":"Rasid","ar":"رصيد"},"color":"#1C3D6E","icon":"bank","domain":"rasid.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Help","ar":"المساعدة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"searchbar","text":{"en":"forgot pin","ar":"نسيت الرقم السري"},"filled":true},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"3 results","ar":"3 نتائج"},"color":"muted","gap":"s"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"article","text":{"en":"Everything you need to know about your card","ar":"كل ما تحتاج معرفته عن بطاقتك"},"sub":{"en":"Help article","ar":"مقال مساعدة"},"chevron":true,"gap":"s"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"article","text":{"en":"Change your card limit","ar":"غيّر حد بطاقتك"},"sub":{"en":"Help article","ar":"مقال مساعدة"},"chevron":true},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"article","text":{"en":"Freeze a lost card","ar":"جمّد بطاقة مفقودة"},"sub":{"en":"Help article","ar":"مقال مساعدة"},"chevron":true}],"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}},{"id":"pin","text":{"en":"\"Get a new card PIN by SMS\"","ar":"«احصل على رقم سري جديد للبطاقة برسالة نصية»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rasid","name":{"en":"Rasid","ar":"رصيد"},"color":"#1C3D6E","icon":"bank","domain":"rasid.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Help","ar":"المساعدة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"searchbar","text":{"en":"forgot pin","ar":"نسيت الرقم السري"},"filled":true},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"3 results","ar":"3 نتائج"},"color":"muted","gap":"s"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"article","text":{"en":"Get a new card PIN by SMS","ar":"احصل على رقم سري جديد للبطاقة برسالة نصية"},"sub":{"en":"Help article","ar":"مقال مساعدة"},"chevron":true,"gap":"s"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"article","text":{"en":"Change your card limit","ar":"غيّر حد بطاقتك"},"sub":{"en":"Help article","ar":"مقال مساعدة"},"chevron":true},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"article","text":{"en":"Freeze a lost card","ar":"جمّد بطاقة مفقودة"},"sub":{"en":"Help article","ar":"مقال مساعدة"},"chevron":true}],"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}},{"id":"worry","text":{"en":"\"Forgot something? Don't worry!\"","ar":"«نسيت شيئًا؟ لا تقلق!»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rasid","name":{"en":"Rasid","ar":"رصيد"},"color":"#1C3D6E","icon":"bank","domain":"rasid.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Help","ar":"المساعدة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"searchbar","text":{"en":"forgot pin","ar":"نسيت الرقم السري"},"filled":true},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"3 results","ar":"3 نتائج"},"color":"muted","gap":"s"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"article","text":{"en":"Forgot something? Don't worry!","ar":"نسيت شيئًا؟ لا تقلق!"},"sub":{"en":"Help article","ar":"مقال مساعدة"},"chevron":true,"gap":"s"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"article","text":{"en":"Change your card limit","ar":"غيّر حد بطاقتك"},"sub":{"en":"Help article","ar":"مقال مساعدة"},"chevron":true},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"article","text":{"en":"Freeze a lost card","ar":"جمّد بطاقة مفقودة"},"sub":{"en":"Help article","ar":"مقال مساعدة"},"chevron":true}],"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}}],"answer":["pin"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P15-004","when":["know","worry"],"feedback":{"en":"In a list of results, this title could be about anything. People skip titles that don't name their problem.","ar":"في قائمة النتائج، هذا العنوان يصلح لأي موضوع. والناس يتجاوزون العناوين التي لا تذكر مشكلتهم."}}],"hints":[{"en":"The person sees only the title. Which one names their exact task?","ar":"الشخص يرى العنوان فقط. أي عنوان يذكر مهمّته بالضبط؟"},{"en":"Look for the words \"PIN\" and \"new\".","ar":"ابحث عن كلمتي «الرقم السري» و«جديد»."}],"correct":{"en":"Right. It names the task, and it works on its own.","ar":"صحيح. يذكر المهمة، ويُفهم وحده."},"explain":{"en":"A title in search results has no page around it. It has to say exactly what the article helps with.","ar":"في نتائج البحث يظهر العنوان وحده دون صفحته. فيجب أن يقول بالضبط بماذا تساعد المقالة."}},{"id":"S09","type":"card","part":"recap","icons":["text","list","order","eye"],"title":{"en":"What you did","ar":"ماذا تعلّمت"},"body":{"en":"- **Specific headings:** you chose \"Prices: monthly and yearly\" and \"Get a new card PIN by SMS\".\n- **No slogans:** you kept \"Find your rhythm\" off the schedule.\n- **Vertical lists:** you split the membership sentence into 4 lines.\n- **Bullets for choices:** you removed the numbers from the ways to pay.\n- **Same start:** you began every rule with a verb.\n\nNext: the skill check.","ar":"- **عناوين محددة:** اخترت «الأسعار: شهري وسنوي» و«احصل على رقم سري جديد للبطاقة برسالة نصية».\n- **بلا شعارات:** أبعدت «اعثر على إيقاعك» عن الجدول.\n- **قوائم رأسية:** قسّمت جملة الاشتراك إلى 4 سطور.\n- **نقاط للخيارات:** حذفت الأرقام من طرق الدفع.\n- **بداية واحدة:** بدأت كل قاعدة بفعل.\n\nالتالي: اختبار المهارة."}}]}$uxg$::jsonb),
  ($uxg$P15-U01-L03$uxg$, $uxg$e7d0849d4e2fb5b14af6ff8607d1688c14a8a43babedcfe45c95bd277d9e113f$uxg$, $uxg${"id":"P15-U01-L03","mode":"check","minutes":5,"title":{"en":"Skill check: write for people who scan","ar":"اختبار المهارة: اكتب لمن يقرأ بسرعة"},"summary":{"en":"Fix the words in a food delivery app so people get them at a glance, on your own.","ar":"أصلح وحدك نصوص تطبيق توصيل طعام حتى يفهمها الناس بنظرة واحدة."},"speaker":"tarek","steps":[{"id":"S01","type":"card","part":"hook","title":{"en":"Tarek's food app","ar":"تطبيق الطعام الذي يديره طارق"},"body":{"en":"I manage a food delivery app. People order while hungry and in a hurry, so they scan everything.\n\nYour job: fix four pieces of text.\n\nThis is a skill check: there are no hints, and you'll see your result at the end.","ar":"أدير تطبيقًا لتوصيل الطعام. والناس يطلبون وهم جائعون ومستعجلون، فيتصفّحون كل شيء بسرعة.\n\nمهمّتك: أصلح أربعة نصوص.\n\nهذا اختبار مهارة: لا توجد تلميحات، وسترى نتيجتك في النهاية."},"mock":{"app":{"id":"lamma","name":{"en":"Lamma","ar":"لمّة"},"color":"#E03131","icon":"bowl-food","domain":"lamma.example"},"appbar":{"logo":true},"tabbar":{"active":0,"items":[{"icon":"house","text":{"en":"Home","ar":"الرئيسية"}},{"icon":"tag","text":{"en":"Offers","ar":"العروض"}},{"icon":"receipt","text":{"en":"My orders","ar":"طلباتي"}},{"icon":"user","text":{"en":"Account","ar":"حسابي"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"searchbar","text":{"en":"Search restaurants","ar":"ابحث عن مطعم"}},{"kind":"card","art":"food-koshary","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Koshary El Tahrir","ar":"كشري التحرير"}},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"25 min · Free delivery","ar":"25 دقيقة · توصيل مجاني"},"color":"muted"}],"gap":"m"},{"kind":"card","art":"food-burger","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Burger Corner","ar":"ركن البرجر"}},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"30 min · EGP 15 delivery","ar":"30 دقيقة · توصيل 15 جنيه"},"color":"muted"}],"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"S02","type":"words","skill":"SK-P15-U01-01","part":"check","rules":["R19"],"value":{"en":"Skill check. First 2 Words (NN/g): winning links front-load user- and action-oriented terms.","ar":"اختبار مهارة. أول كلمتين (NN/g): الروابط الناجحة تضع في بدايتها الكلمات التي تخصّ المستخدم وما يريد فعله."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/first-2-words-a-signal-for-scanning/","quote":"Front-load user- and action-oriented terms"},"scenario":{"en":"In the account menu, one item reads: \"Manage the different payment methods saved to your account\".","ar":"في قائمة الحساب، أحد العناصر يقول: «إدارة طرق الدفع المختلفة المحفوظة في حسابك»."},"prompt":{"en":"Which menu item lets people spot it fastest while scanning the menu?","ar":"أي عنصر قائمة يجده الناس أسرع وهم يتصفّحون القائمة؟"},"options":[{"id":"cards","text":{"en":"\"Payment cards\"","ar":"«بطاقات الدفع»"}},{"id":"manage","text":{"en":"\"Manage your saved payment methods\"","ar":"«إدارة طرق الدفع المحفوظة»"}},{"id":"here","text":{"en":"\"Here you can change how you pay\"","ar":"«هنا يمكنك تغيير طريقة الدفع»"}}],"answer":["cards"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P15-001","when":["manage","here"],"feedback":{"en":"\"Manage your\" and \"Here you\" carry no meaning. The word people look for, payment, comes too late.","ar":"«إدارة طرق» و«هنا يمكنك» لا تحملان معنى. والكلمة التي يبحث عنها الناس، الدفع، تأتي متأخرة."}}],"explain":{"en":"From Lesson 1: start with the words that carry the meaning. In a menu, the first word should name the thing.","ar":"من الدرس 1: ابدأ بالكلمات التي تحمل المعنى. وفي القائمة، يجب أن تذكر أول كلمة الشيء نفسه."},"speaker":"tarek"},{"id":"S03","type":"choose","skill":"SK-P15-U01-02","part":"check","rules":["R19"],"value":{"en":"Skill check. Inverted Pyramid (NN/g): the story should start with the main point.","ar":"اختبار مهارة. الهرم المقلوب (NN/g): يجب أن تبدأ القصة بالفكرة الأساسية."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/inverted-pyramid/","quote":"The story should start with the main point."},"scenario":{"en":"A restaurant ran out of the dish someone ordered. We must tell them before the driver leaves.","ar":"نفد من المطعم الطبق الذي طلبه أحد العملاء. ويجب أن نخبره قبل أن يتحرّك السائق."},"prompt":{"en":"Which message lets the customer decide what to do from the first sentence?","ar":"أي رسالة تجعل العميل يقرّر ماذا يفعل من الجملة الأولى؟"},"options":[{"id":"kitchen","text":{"en":"\"Our partner kitchens get very busy at lunch time. Sometimes a dish runs out. Today, your grilled chicken did. Tap to choose another dish or get a refund.\"","ar":"«مطابخ شركائنا تزدحم جدًا وقت الغداء. وأحيانًا ينفد طبق. واليوم نفد الدجاج المشوي الذي طلبته. اضغط لتختار طبقًا آخر أو تسترد المبلغ.»"}},{"id":"sorry","text":{"en":"\"We're so sorry! We know how annoying this can be, and we want to make it right.\"","ar":"«نحن آسفون جدًا! نعرف كم هذا مزعج، ونريد أن نصلح الأمر.»"}},{"id":"out","text":{"en":"\"Your grilled chicken is sold out. Choose another dish or get a refund. The rest of your order is ready.\"","ar":"«الدجاج المشوي الذي طلبته نفد. اختر طبقًا آخر أو استرد المبلغ. وباقي طلبك جاهز.»"}}],"answer":["out"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P15-002","when":["kitchen"],"feedback":{"en":"Two sentences of background come before the news. A hungry customer may stop reading before \"sold out\".","ar":"جملتان من الخلفية قبل الخبر. والعميل الجائع قد يتوقّف عن القراءة قبل «نفد»."}},{"id":"MC-P15-003","when":["sorry"],"feedback":{"en":"The apology fills the whole message. It never says which dish is missing or what the customer can do.","ar":"الاعتذار يملأ الرسالة كلها. ولا يقول أبدًا أي طبق نفد أو ماذا يستطيع العميل أن يفعل."}}],"explain":{"en":"From Lesson 1: lead with what happened to this person and their choices. Background comes last, if at all.","ar":"من الدرس 1: ابدأ بما حدث لهذا الشخص والخيارات المتاحة له. والخلفية تأتي في الآخر، هذا إن احتجتها."},"speaker":"tarek"},{"id":"S04","type":"choose","skill":"SK-P15-U01-03","part":"check","rules":["R19"],"value":{"en":"Skill check. Headings Are Pick-Up Lines (NN/g): avoid broad and generic headings; they don't provide value.","ar":"اختبار مهارة. العناوين (NN/g): تجنّب العناوين العامة الواسعة، فهي لا تقدّم قيمة."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/headings-pickup-lines/","quote":"Avoid broad and generic headings."},"scenario":{"en":"On the home screen we add a section of restaurants that deliver in under 20 minutes.","ar":"نضيف في الشاشة الرئيسية قسمًا للمطاعم التي توصّل في أقل من 20 دقيقة."},"prompt":{"en":"Which section heading tells people what they'll find there?","ar":"أي عنوان للقسم يخبر الناس بما سيجدونه فيه؟"},"options":[{"id":"hungry","text":{"en":"\"Hungry? We got you 😋\"","ar":"«جائع؟ نحن معك 😋»"}},{"id":"fast","text":{"en":"\"Delivered in under 20 minutes\"","ar":"«توصيل في أقل من 20 دقيقة»"}},{"id":"picks","text":{"en":"\"Picks for you\"","ar":"«اختيارات لك»"}}],"answer":["fast"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P15-004","when":["hungry","picks"],"feedback":{"en":"This heading could sit above any list of restaurants. It doesn't say that these ones are fast.","ar":"هذا العنوان يصلح فوق أي قائمة مطاعم. ولا يقول إن هذه المطاعم سريعة."}}],"explain":{"en":"From Lesson 2: a heading names what's below, plainly, so people know if the section is for them.","ar":"من الدرس 2: العنوان يذكر ما تحته ببساطة، حتى يعرف الناس إن كان القسم يناسبهم."},"speaker":"tarek"},{"id":"S05","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P15-U01-04","part":"check","rules":["R19"],"value":{"en":"Skill check. Bulleted Lists (NN/g): numbered lists are for steps in a procedure or when count matters.","ar":"اختبار مهارة. القوائم النقطية (NN/g): القوائم المرقّمة للخطوات التي لها ترتيب، أو حين يهمّ العدد."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/presenting-bulleted-lists/","quote":"Numbered lists are usually reserved for instances in which the items must occur in a specific order, such as steps in a procedure, or when keeping count is important, such as a top 10 list."},"scenario":{"en":"New restaurants must do three things, in order, to join our app: sign the contract, upload the menu, then set the opening hours. Today it's one sentence.","ar":"يجب على المطاعم الجديدة أن تفعل ثلاثة أشياء بالترتيب لتنضمّ لتطبيقنا: توقيع العقد، ثم رفع قائمة الطعام، ثم تحديد ساعات العمل. واليوم هي جملة واحدة."},"prompt":{"en":"Tap each option to see the change. Which version shows restaurants what to do and in what order?","ar":"اضغط على كل خيار لترى التغيير. أي نسخة تُظهر للمطاعم ماذا تفعل وبأي ترتيب؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"lamma","name":{"en":"Lamma","ar":"لمّة"},"color":"#E03131","icon":"bowl-food","domain":"lamma.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Lamma for restaurants","ar":"لَمّة للمطاعم"}},"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Start","ar":"ابدأ"}}],"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"food-grill","size":"s"},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Join Lamma","ar":"انضمّ إلى لَمّة"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"To join, you sign the contract, and after that you upload your menu and also set your opening hours.","ar":"لكي تنضمّ، توقّع العقد، وبعد ذلك ترفع قائمة الطعام، وأيضًا تحدّد ساعات العمل."},"gap":"xs"}]},"options":[{"id":"bullets","text":{"en":"A bulleted list","ar":"قائمة نقطية"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"lamma","name":{"en":"Lamma","ar":"لمّة"},"color":"#E03131","icon":"bowl-food","domain":"lamma.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Lamma for restaurants","ar":"لَمّة للمطاعم"}},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Start","ar":"ابدأ"}}],"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"food-grill","size":"s"},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Join Lamma","ar":"انضمّ إلى لَمّة"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"list","style":"bullet","items":[{"en":"Upload your menu","ar":"ارفع قائمة الطعام"},{"en":"Sign the contract","ar":"وقّع العقد"},{"en":"Set your opening hours","ar":"حدّد ساعات العمل"}],"gap":"xs"}]}},{"id":"numbers","text":{"en":"A numbered list, in the right order","ar":"قائمة مرقّمة بالترتيب الصحيح"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"lamma","name":{"en":"Lamma","ar":"لمّة"},"color":"#E03131","icon":"bowl-food","domain":"lamma.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Lamma for restaurants","ar":"لَمّة للمطاعم"}},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Start","ar":"ابدأ"}}],"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"food-grill","size":"s"},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Join Lamma in 3 steps","ar":"انضمّ إلى لَمّة في 3 خطوات"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"list","style":"number","items":[{"en":"Sign the contract","ar":"وقّع العقد"},{"en":"Upload your menu","ar":"ارفع قائمة الطعام"},{"en":"Set your opening hours","ar":"حدّد ساعات العمل"}],"gap":"xs"}]}},{"id":"keep","text":{"en":"Keep the sentence, add \"first\" and \"then\"","ar":"أبقِ الجملة وأضف «أولًا» و«ثم»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"lamma","name":{"en":"Lamma","ar":"لمّة"},"color":"#E03131","icon":"bowl-food","domain":"lamma.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Lamma for restaurants","ar":"لَمّة للمطاعم"}},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Start","ar":"ابدأ"}}],"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"food-grill","size":"s"},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Join Lamma","ar":"انضمّ إلى لَمّة"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"To join, first you sign the contract, then you upload your menu, and then you set your opening hours.","ar":"لكي تنضمّ، أولًا توقّع العقد، ثم ترفع قائمة الطعام، ثم تحدّد ساعات العمل."},"gap":"xs"}]}}],"answer":["numbers"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P15-005","when":["keep"],"feedback":{"en":"The order is clearer, but the three steps are still hidden in one sentence.","ar":"الترتيب أوضح، لكن الخطوات الثلاث ما زالت مخفية في جملة واحدة."}},{"id":"MC-P15-006","when":["bullets"],"feedback":{"en":"Here the order matters. Bullets hide it, and this list even starts with the wrong step.","ar":"هنا الترتيب مهم. والنقاط تُخفيه، وهذه القائمة تبدأ أيضًا بالخطوة الخطأ."}}],"explain":{"en":"From Lesson 2: numbers say \"do these in this order\". Use them for real steps, like joining the app.","ar":"من الدرس 2: الأرقام تقول «افعل هذه بهذا الترتيب». فاستخدمها للخطوات الحقيقية، مثل الانضمام للتطبيق."},"speaker":"tarek"}]}$uxg$::jsonb),
  ($uxg$P15-U02-L01$uxg$, $uxg$bd1c41d44c2a969325bc0fb8b8325c2c2a9176c844f5681394f9111f05a8dc56$uxg$, $uxg${"id":"P15-U02-L01","mode":"lesson","minutes":7,"title":{"en":"Cut what readers don't need","ar":"احذف ما لا يحتاجه القارئ"},"summary":{"en":"Edit a bill-payment app's text: cut the filler, but keep every word people need.","ar":"حرّر نصوص تطبيق لدفع الفواتير: احذف الحشو، وأبقِ كل كلمة يحتاجها الناس."},"speaker":"mona","review_labels":{"MC-P15-003":{"en":"Polite openings are still filler","ar":"المقدّمات المهذّبة حشو أيضًا"},"MC-P15-008":{"en":"\"Very\" and fancy words add length, not meaning","ar":"«جدًا» والكلمات المتكلّفة تزيد الطول لا المعنى"},"MC-P15-009":{"en":"Saying it twice doesn't make it clearer","ar":"قول الشيء مرتين لا يجعله أوضح"},"MC-P15-010":{"en":"Cutting too much loses what people need","ar":"الحذف الزائد يُضيع ما يحتاجه الناس"}},"steps":[{"id":"S01","type":"card","part":"hook","title":{"en":"Every word must earn its place","ar":"كل كلمة يجب أن تستحق مكانها"},"body":{"en":"I lead the design team of a bill-payment app. In our tests, people skipped most of our text and then called support.\n\nI want to cut our text. But I don't want to cut anything people need.","ar":"أقود فريق التصميم في تطبيق لدفع الفواتير. وفي اختباراتنا، تجاوز الناس أغلب نصوصنا، ثم اتصلوا بخدمة العملاء.\n\nأريد أن أختصر نصوصنا. لكني لا أريد أن أحذف أي شيء يحتاجه الناس."},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dafaa","name":{"en":"Dafaa","ar":"دفع"},"color":"#4263EB","icon":"receipt","domain":"dafaa.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Electricity bill","ar":"فاتورة الكهرباء"},"back":true},"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Pay EGP 640","ar":"ادفع 640 جنيهًا"}}],"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"lightning","text":{"en":"North Cairo Electricity","ar":"كهرباء شمال القاهرة"},"sub":{"en":"Due 20 March","ar":"الاستحقاق: 20 مارس"}},{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"EGP 640","ar":"640 جنيه"},"size":"l","gap":"m"},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"We understand that paying bills can be stressful. It is very important to make sure that you pay your bill before the due date in order to avoid any late fees.","ar":"نحن نتفهّم أن دفع الفواتير قد يكون مرهقًا. ومن المهم جدًا أن تتأكّد من دفع فاتورتك قبل تاريخ الاستحقاق لكي تتجنّب أي غرامات تأخير."},"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"S02","type":"choose","skill":"SK-P15-U02-01","part":"try","rules":["R12"],"value":{"en":"Try first. Rewriting for Brevity (NN/g): on average, users read about 20% of the words on a page, so every extra word lowers the chance the important ones get read.","ar":"جرّب أولًا. الاختصار (NN/g): في المتوسط يقرأ المستخدمون نحو 20% فقط من كلمات الصفحة، فكل كلمة زائدة تقلّل فرصة قراءة الكلمات المهمة."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/rewriting-content-brevity/","quote":"Our research shows that, on average, users read about 20% of the words on a web page."},"prompt":{"en":"Which rewrite of the bill text keeps everything people need, in the fewest words?","ar":"أي صياغة لنص الفاتورة تحتفظ بكل ما يحتاجه الناس، بأقل عدد من الكلمات؟"},"options":[{"id":"stress","text":{"en":"\"We know bills are stressful. Please pay on time.\"","ar":"«نعرف أن الفواتير مرهقة. من فضلك ادفع في الموعد.»"}},{"id":"important","text":{"en":"\"It is very important to pay your bill before the due date.\"","ar":"«من المهم جدًا أن تدفع فاتورتك قبل تاريخ الاستحقاق.»"}},{"id":"date","text":{"en":"\"Pay by 15 March to avoid a late fee.\"","ar":"«ادفع قبل 15 مارس لتتجنّب غرامة التأخير.»"}}],"answer":["date"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P15-003","when":["stress"],"feedback":{"en":"Half of this is a warm-up sentence. And \"on time\" is vague: when is the due date?","ar":"نصف هذا النص جملة تمهيد. و«في الموعد» غير واضحة: متى تاريخ الاستحقاق؟"}},{"id":"MC-P15-008","when":["important"],"feedback":{"en":"\"It is very important to\" adds four words and no meaning. It also drops the date and the late fee.","ar":"«من المهم جدًا أن» تضيف كلمات بلا معنى. كما أنها حذفت التاريخ وغرامة التأخير."}}],"hints":[{"en":"What do people need to know here? Find the option that has both.","ar":"ماذا يحتاج الناس أن يعرفوا هنا؟ ابحث عن الخيار الذي فيه الأمران."},{"en":"Two facts matter: the date, and what happens if they're late.","ar":"معلومتان مهمتان: التاريخ، وما يحدث إن تأخّروا."}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Eight words, and nothing important is missing.","ar":"صحيح. كلمات قليلة، ولا ينقصها شيء مهم."},"explain":{"en":"The warm-up and \"it is very important\" said nothing. The date and the fee are what people need.","ar":"التمهيد و«من المهم جدًا» لم يقولا شيئًا. أما التاريخ والغرامة فهما ما يحتاجه الناس."}},{"id":"S03","type":"card","part":"concept","icons":["cut","typo","text","ok"],"title":{"en":"Ask: does the reader need this?","ar":"اسأل: هل يحتاج القارئ هذا؟"},"body":{"en":"People read only a small part of the words on a screen. Fewer words means the right ones get read.\n\n- **Warm-ups:** cut openings like \"We understand that…\" or \"It is important to…\".\n- **Empty words:** cut \"very\", \"really\", \"absolutely\". Say \"use\", not \"utilize\".\n- **Repeats:** say each idea once.\n- **But clarity comes first:** keep or add a few words when they tell people what will happen or what they need to decide.","ar":"الناس يقرؤون جزءًا صغيرًا فقط من كلمات الشاشة. وكلما قلّت الكلمات، زادت فرصة أن يقرؤوا المهم منها.\n\n- **التمهيد:** احذف بدايات مثل «نحن نتفهّم أن…» أو «من المهم أن…».\n- **الكلمات الفارغة:** احذف «جدًا» و«حقًا» و«تمامًا». وقل «استخدم» بدل «قم بالاستفادة من».\n- **التكرار:** قل كل فكرة مرة واحدة.\n- **لكن الوضوح أولًا:** أبقِ أو أضف بعض الكلمات حين تخبر الناس بما سيحدث أو بما يحتاجونه ليقرّروا."}},{"id":"S04","type":"words","skill":"SK-P15-U02-01","part":"guided","rules":["R06"],"value":{"en":"Cringeworthy Words (NN/g): \"utilize\" is usually just a fancy way of saying \"use\", and \"enables you to\" sounds paternal, as if the product grants permission.","ar":"كلمات مزعجة (NN/g): كلمة «utilize» غالبًا مجرد طريقة متكلّفة لقول «use»، و«يمكّنك من» تبدو متعالية، كأن المنتج يمنحك إذنًا."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/cringeworthy-words/","quote":"In most instances, this term is just a fancy way of saying 'use."},"scenario":{"en":"Under the Pay button, a line says: \"This feature enables you to utilize your saved cards for faster payment.\"","ar":"تحت زر الدفع سطر يقول: «هذه الميزة تمكّنك من القيام بالاستفادة من بطاقاتك المحفوظة لدفع أسرع.»"},"prompt":{"en":"Which line says the same thing in plain, short words?","ar":"أي سطر يقول نفس الشيء بكلمات بسيطة وقصيرة؟"},"options":[{"id":"lets","text":{"en":"\"This feature lets you utilize saved cards.\"","ar":"«هذه الميزة تتيح لك الاستفادة من البطاقات المحفوظة.»"}},{"id":"plain","text":{"en":"\"Pay faster with a saved card.\"","ar":"«ادفع أسرع ببطاقة محفوظة.»"}},{"id":"easily","text":{"en":"\"Easily and quickly utilize your saved cards.\"","ar":"«استفد بسهولة وسرعة من بطاقاتك المحفوظة.»"}}],"answer":["plain"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P15-008","when":["lets","easily"],"feedback":{"en":"\"Utilize\" and \"easily and quickly\" are still there. They make the line longer without adding meaning.","ar":"كلمات مثل «الاستفادة من» و«بسهولة وسرعة» ما زالت موجودة. وهي تُطيل السطر دون أن تضيف معنى."}}],"hints":[{"en":"How would you say this to a friend?","ar":"كيف تقول هذا لصديق؟"},{"en":"Pick the line that starts with what the person does.","ar":"اختر السطر الذي يبدأ بما يفعله الشخص."}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Plain verb, plain benefit.","ar":"صحيح. فعل بسيط، وفائدة واضحة."},"explain":{"en":"Simple words are faster to read and sound more confident. Talk about what people do, not what the feature \"enables\".","ar":"الكلمات البسيطة أسرع في القراءة وتبدو أكثر ثقة. تحدّث عمّا يفعله الناس، لا عمّا «تمكّنهم» منه الميزة."},"speaker":"mona"},{"id":"S05","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P15-U02-01","part":"guided","rules":["R06"],"value":{"en":"Rewriting for Brevity (NN/g): look for redundancy, words and phrases that repeat the same idea.","ar":"الاختصار (NN/g): ابحث عن التكرار، أي الكلمات والعبارات التي تعيد نفس الفكرة."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/rewriting-content-brevity/","quote":"The next thing to look for is redundancy, or words and phrases that reiterate the same idea."},"scenario":{"en":"This is our message after a payment.","ar":"هذه رسالتنا بعد الدفع."},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dafaa","name":{"en":"Dafaa","ar":"دفع"},"color":"#4263EB","icon":"receipt","domain":"dafaa.example"},"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Done","ar":"تمّ"}}],"blocks":[{"kind":"icon","icon":"check-circle-fill","size":"xl","color":"green"},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Payment successful","ar":"تمّ الدفع بنجاح"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"Your payment was successful and has gone through with no problems. A receipt for your payment will be sent to you by email to your email address.","ar":"تمّت عملية الدفع بنجاح واكتملت دون أي مشاكل. وسيتم إرسال إيصال الدفع الخاص بك عبر البريد الإلكتروني إلى بريدك الإلكتروني."},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"lightning","text":{"en":"Electricity","ar":"الكهرباء"},"value":{"en":"EGP 640","ar":"640 جنيه"},"gap":"m"}],"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"}},"prompt":{"en":"Which change makes this message shorter without losing any fact?","ar":"أي تغيير يجعل الرسالة أقصر دون أن تضيع أي معلومة؟"},"options":[{"id":"split","text":{"en":"Split the text into two shorter paragraphs","ar":"قسّم النص إلى فقرتين أقصر"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dafaa","name":{"en":"Dafaa","ar":"دفع"},"color":"#4263EB","icon":"receipt","domain":"dafaa.example"},"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Done","ar":"تمّ"}}],"blocks":[{"kind":"icon","icon":"check-circle-fill","size":"xl","color":"green"},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Payment successful","ar":"تمّ الدفع بنجاح"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"text","gap":"s","text":{"en":"Your payment was successful and has gone through with no problems.","ar":"تمّت عملية الدفع بنجاح واكتملت دون أي مشاكل."}},{"kind":"text","gap":"s","text":{"en":"A receipt for your payment will be sent to you by email to your email address.","ar":"وسيتم إرسال إيصال الدفع الخاص بك عبر البريد الإلكتروني إلى بريدك الإلكتروني."}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"lightning","text":{"en":"Electricity","ar":"الكهرباء"},"value":{"en":"EGP 640","ar":"640 جنيه"},"gap":"m"}],"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}},{"id":"once","text":{"en":"Say each fact once: \"We emailed your receipt to you.\"","ar":"قل كل معلومة مرة واحدة: «أرسلنا الإيصال إلى بريدك الإلكتروني.»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dafaa","name":{"en":"Dafaa","ar":"دفع"},"color":"#4263EB","icon":"receipt","domain":"dafaa.example"},"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Done","ar":"تمّ"}}],"blocks":[{"kind":"icon","icon":"check-circle-fill","size":"xl","color":"green"},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Payment successful","ar":"تمّ الدفع بنجاح"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"We emailed your receipt to you.","ar":"أرسلنا الإيصال إلى بريدك الإلكتروني."},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"lightning","text":{"en":"Electricity","ar":"الكهرباء"},"value":{"en":"EGP 640","ar":"640 جنيه"},"gap":"m"}],"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}},{"id":"drop","text":{"en":"Delete the text and keep only the title","ar":"احذف النص وأبقِ العنوان فقط"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dafaa","name":{"en":"Dafaa","ar":"دفع"},"color":"#4263EB","icon":"receipt","domain":"dafaa.example"},"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Done","ar":"تمّ"}}],"blocks":[{"kind":"icon","icon":"check-circle-fill","size":"xl","color":"green"},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Payment successful","ar":"تمّ الدفع بنجاح"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"lightning","text":{"en":"Electricity","ar":"الكهرباء"},"value":{"en":"EGP 640","ar":"640 جنيه"},"gap":"m"}],"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}}],"answer":["once"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P15-009","when":["split"],"feedback":{"en":"Two paragraphs still say \"successful\" three times and \"email\" twice. Same words, more space.","ar":"الفقرتان ما زالتا تقولان إن الدفع نجح ثلاث مرات، و«البريد الإلكتروني» مرتين. نفس الكلمات، ومساحة أكبر."}},{"id":"MC-P15-010","when":["drop"],"feedback":{"en":"The title says the payment worked, but people also need to know where the receipt went.","ar":"العنوان يقول إن الدفع تمّ، لكن الناس يحتاجون أيضًا أن يعرفوا أين ذهب الإيصال."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Count how many times the text says the payment worked.","ar":"عُدّ كم مرة يقول النص إن الدفع تمّ."},{"en":"The title already says \"successful\". What's the only new fact in the text?","ar":"العنوان يقول «بنجاح» بالفعل. ما المعلومة الجديدة الوحيدة في النص؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Right. The title covers success; the text adds the receipt.","ar":"صحيح. العنوان يقول إن الدفع نجح، والنص يضيف الإيصال."},"explain":{"en":"Each line should add something new. Here, the only new fact is where the receipt went.","ar":"كل سطر يجب أن يضيف شيئًا جديدًا. وهنا المعلومة الجديدة الوحيدة هي أين ذهب الإيصال."},"speaker":"mona"},{"id":"S06","type":"compare","skill":"SK-P15-U02-02","part":"contrast","confidence":true,"rules":["R11"],"value":{"en":"Contrast: shortest vs clear. 3 C's of Microcopy (NN/g): concision comes second to clarity; a few extra words are fine if they make the meaning easier to understand.","ar":"مقارنة: الأقصر مقابل الأوضح. قواعد الـ Microcopy الثلاث (NN/g): الإيجاز يأتي بعد الوضوح؛ وبعض الكلمات الزائدة مقبولة إذا جعلت المعنى أسهل في الفهم."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/3-cs-microcopy/","quote":"Out of the 3 C's, concision should come second, meaning that a few extra words can be included if they increase the understandability of a phrase or sentence."},"scenario":{"en":"We're adding a switch that pays the bill automatically. My team made two versions.","ar":"نضيف مفتاحًا (Toggle) يدفع الفاتورة تلقائيًا. وصمّم فريقي نسختين."},"prompt":{"en":"Which version tells people what will happen when they turn it on?","ar":"أي نسخة تخبر الناس بما سيحدث حين يشغّلونه؟"},"a":{"label":{"en":"A: One word only.","ar":"A: كلمة واحدة فقط."},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dafaa","name":{"en":"Dafaa","ar":"دفع"},"color":"#4263EB","icon":"receipt","domain":"dafaa.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Bill settings","ar":"إعدادات الفاتورة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"lightning","text":{"en":"Electricity","ar":"الكهرباء"},"sub":{"en":"Account 0123 4567","ar":"حساب 0123 4567"},"value":{"en":"EGP 640","ar":"640 جنيه"}},{"kind":"toggle","text":{"en":"Autopay","ar":"دفع تلقائي"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"credit-card","text":{"en":"Visa ·· 4821","ar":"Visa ·· 4821"},"sub":{"en":"Saved card","ar":"بطاقة محفوظة"},"gap":"m"}]}},"b":{"label":{"en":"B: A short line that says when and from where.","ar":"B: سطر قصير يقول متى ومن أين."},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dafaa","name":{"en":"Dafaa","ar":"دفع"},"color":"#4263EB","icon":"receipt","domain":"dafaa.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Bill settings","ar":"إعدادات الفاتورة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"lightning","text":{"en":"Electricity","ar":"الكهرباء"},"sub":{"en":"Account 0123 4567","ar":"حساب 0123 4567"},"value":{"en":"EGP 640","ar":"640 جنيه"}},{"kind":"toggle","text":{"en":"Autopay","ar":"دفع تلقائي"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"We pay this bill from your saved card on its due date.","ar":"ندفع هذه الفاتورة من بطاقتك المحفوظة في تاريخ استحقاقها."},"color":"muted","gap":"xs"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"credit-card","text":{"en":"Visa ·· 4821","ar":"Visa ·· 4821"},"sub":{"en":"Saved card","ar":"بطاقة محفوظة"},"gap":"m"}]}},"answer":"b","reason":{"prompt":{"en":"Why are the extra words worth it in B?","ar":"لماذا تستحق الكلمات الزائدة مكانها في B؟"},"options":[{"id":"decide","text":{"en":"They answer the questions people have before turning on payments: when, and from which card","ar":"تجيب عن الأسئلة التي يسألها الناس قبل تشغيل الدفع: متى، ومن أي بطاقة"}},{"id":"longer","text":{"en":"Longer text always looks more trustworthy","ar":"النص الأطول يبدو دائمًا أجدر بالثقة"}},{"id":"space","text":{"en":"There is empty space under the switch to fill","ar":"هناك مساحة فارغة تحت المفتاح يجب ملؤها"}}],"answer":["decide"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P15-010","when":["longer","space"],"feedback":{"en":"Length isn't the goal. These words stay only because people need them to decide.","ar":"الطول ليس الهدف. هذه الكلمات تبقى فقط لأن الناس يحتاجونها ليقرّروا."}}]},"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P15-010","when":["a"],"feedback":{"en":"\"Autopay\" alone leaves people guessing: when will it pay, and from which card? Many won't turn it on.","ar":"«دفع تلقائي» وحدها تترك الناس يخمّنون: متى سيدفع، ومن أي بطاقة؟ وكثيرون لن يشغّلوه."}}],"hints":[{"en":"What would you want to know before letting an app take money from your card?","ar":"ماذا تريد أن تعرف قبل أن تسمح لتطبيق بسحب المال من بطاقتك؟"},{"en":"Short is good only when it's still clear.","ar":"القِصر جيد فقط حين يبقى واضحًا."}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Clear first, short second.","ar":"صحيح. الوضوح أولًا، ثم القِصر."},"explain":{"en":"Cut words people don't need, never words they do. Here, \"when\" and \"from where\" are needed.","ar":"احذف الكلمات التي لا يحتاجها الناس، لا الكلمات التي يحتاجونها. وهنا «متى» و«من أين» ضروريتان."},"speaker":"mona"},{"id":"S07","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P15-U02-02","part":"guided","rules":["R06"],"value":{"en":"Rewriting for Brevity (NN/g): asking \"Does the reader need this?\" also shows the edge cases where brevity must be sacrificed for clarity.","ar":"الاختصار (NN/g): سؤال «هل يحتاج القارئ هذا؟» يكشف أيضًا الحالات التي يجب فيها التضحية بالاختصار من أجل الوضوح."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/rewriting-content-brevity/","quote":"This question will also help you in the edge cases where brevity must be sacrificed for clarity."},"scenario":{"en":"Rami, our junior designer, shortened the note on the water bill to save space.","ar":"اختصر رامي، المصمم المبتدئ عندنا، الملاحظة في فاتورة المياه ليوفّر المساحة."},"prompt":{"en":"Tap each option to see the change. Which note still tells people what happens if they pay late?","ar":"اضغط على كل خيار لترى التغيير. أي ملاحظة ما زالت تخبر الناس بما يحدث إن دفعوا متأخرين؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dafaa","name":{"en":"Dafaa","ar":"دفع"},"color":"#4263EB","icon":"receipt","domain":"dafaa.example"},"appbar":{"logo":true},"tabbar":{"active":0,"items":[{"icon":"receipt","text":{"en":"Bills","ar":"الفواتير"}},{"icon":"arrows-clockwise","text":{"en":"Autopay","ar":"الدفع التلقائي"}},{"icon":"clock-counter-clockwise","text":{"en":"History","ar":"السجل"}},{"icon":"user","text":{"en":"Account","ar":"حسابي"}}]},"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Due this month","ar":"مستحقة هذا الشهر"},"color":"muted"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"drop","text":{"en":"Water bill","ar":"فاتورة المياه"},"sub":{"en":"Pay soon!","ar":"ادفع قريبًا!"},"value":{"en":"EGP 210","ar":"210 جنيه"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"wifi-high","text":{"en":"Internet","ar":"الإنترنت"},"sub":{"en":"Paid · 2 March","ar":"مدفوعة · 2 مارس"},"value":{"en":"EGP 450","ar":"450 جنيه"}}]},"options":[{"id":"date","text":{"en":"\"Pay by 20 March.\"","ar":"«ادفع قبل 20 مارس.»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dafaa","name":{"en":"Dafaa","ar":"دفع"},"color":"#4263EB","icon":"receipt","domain":"dafaa.example"},"appbar":{"logo":true},"tabbar":{"active":0,"items":[{"icon":"receipt","text":{"en":"Bills","ar":"الفواتير"}},{"icon":"arrows-clockwise","text":{"en":"Autopay","ar":"الدفع التلقائي"}},{"icon":"clock-counter-clockwise","text":{"en":"History","ar":"السجل"}},{"icon":"user","text":{"en":"Account","ar":"حسابي"}}]},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Due this month","ar":"مستحقة هذا الشهر"},"color":"muted"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"drop","text":{"en":"Water bill","ar":"فاتورة المياه"},"sub":{"en":"Pay by 20 March.","ar":"ادفع قبل 20 مارس."},"value":{"en":"EGP 210","ar":"210 جنيه"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"wifi-high","text":{"en":"Internet","ar":"الإنترنت"},"sub":{"en":"Paid · 2 March","ar":"مدفوعة · 2 مارس"},"value":{"en":"EGP 450","ar":"450 جنيه"}}]}},{"id":"both","text":{"en":"\"Pay by 20 March. After that, a EGP 25 late fee is added.\"","ar":"«ادفع قبل 20 مارس. بعد ذلك تُضاف غرامة تأخير 25 جنيهًا.»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dafaa","name":{"en":"Dafaa","ar":"دفع"},"color":"#4263EB","icon":"receipt","domain":"dafaa.example"},"appbar":{"logo":true},"tabbar":{"active":0,"items":[{"icon":"receipt","text":{"en":"Bills","ar":"الفواتير"}},{"icon":"arrows-clockwise","text":{"en":"Autopay","ar":"الدفع التلقائي"}},{"icon":"clock-counter-clockwise","text":{"en":"History","ar":"السجل"}},{"icon":"user","text":{"en":"Account","ar":"حسابي"}}]},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Due this month","ar":"مستحقة هذا الشهر"},"color":"muted"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"drop","text":{"en":"Water bill","ar":"فاتورة المياه"},"sub":{"en":"Pay by 20 March. After that, a EGP 25 late fee is added.","ar":"ادفع قبل 20 مارس. بعد ذلك تُضاف غرامة تأخير 25 جنيهًا."},"value":{"en":"EGP 210","ar":"210 جنيه"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"wifi-high","text":{"en":"Internet","ar":"الإنترنت"},"sub":{"en":"Paid · 2 March","ar":"مدفوعة · 2 مارس"},"value":{"en":"EGP 450","ar":"450 جنيه"}}]}},{"id":"warn","text":{"en":"\"Late payment = fees ⚠️\"","ar":"«التأخير = غرامات ⚠️»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dafaa","name":{"en":"Dafaa","ar":"دفع"},"color":"#4263EB","icon":"receipt","domain":"dafaa.example"},"appbar":{"logo":true},"tabbar":{"active":0,"items":[{"icon":"receipt","text":{"en":"Bills","ar":"الفواتير"}},{"icon":"arrows-clockwise","text":{"en":"Autopay","ar":"الدفع التلقائي"}},{"icon":"clock-counter-clockwise","text":{"en":"History","ar":"السجل"}},{"icon":"user","text":{"en":"Account","ar":"حسابي"}}]},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Due this month","ar":"مستحقة هذا الشهر"},"color":"muted"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"drop","text":{"en":"Water bill","ar":"فاتورة المياه"},"sub":{"en":"Late payment = fees ⚠️","ar":"التأخير = غرامات ⚠️"},"value":{"en":"EGP 210","ar":"210 جنيه"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"wifi-high","text":{"en":"Internet","ar":"الإنترنت"},"sub":{"en":"Paid · 2 March","ar":"مدفوعة · 2 مارس"},"value":{"en":"EGP 450","ar":"450 جنيه"}}]}}],"answer":["both"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P15-010","when":["date","warn"],"feedback":{"en":"This is shorter, but people can't tell both the deadline and the cost of missing it.","ar":"هذه أقصر، لكن الناس لا يعرفون منها الموعد النهائي وتكلفة التأخير معًا."}}],"hints":[{"en":"People need two facts: the date, and the fee.","ar":"الناس يحتاجون معلومتين: التاريخ، والغرامة."},{"en":"Which version has both?","ar":"أي نسخة فيها الاثنتان؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Right. A few more words, and nothing left to guess.","ar":"صحيح. كلمات أكثر قليلًا، ولا شيء يحتاج تخمينًا."},"explain":{"en":"Short text that drops a needed fact isn't better. Keep the deadline and the fee.","ar":"النص القصير الذي يحذف معلومة ضرورية ليس أفضل. أبقِ الموعد والغرامة."},"speaker":"mona"},{"id":"S08","type":"choose","skill":"SK-P15-U02-01","part":"independent","speaker":"youssef","rules":["R14"],"value":{"en":"New case. Cringeworthy Words (NN/g): intensifiers like very, really and extremely rarely add value and only make sentences longer; cut blah-blah text.","ar":"حالة جديدة. كلمات مزعجة (NN/g): كلمات التوكيد مثل «جدًا» و«حقًا» و«للغاية» نادرًا ما تضيف قيمة، وتُطيل الجمل فقط؛ فاحذف الكلام الفارغ."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/cringeworthy-words/","quote":"Intensifiers rarely add value to a sentence and merely increase sentence length."},"scenario":{"en":"My shop's page for a blender says: \"In today's fast-paced world, you really need an extremely powerful blender. This very strong blender has a 1,000-watt motor and 6 blades.\"","ar":"صفحة الخلّاط في متجري تقول: «في عالمنا السريع اليوم، أنت حقًا تحتاج خلّاطًا قويًا للغاية. هذا الخلّاط القوي جدًا فيه محرّك 1000 واط و6 شفرات.»"},"prompt":{"en":"Which rewrite keeps the facts and cuts the empty words?","ar":"أي صياغة تحتفظ بالمعلومات وتحذف الكلمات الفارغة؟"},"options":[{"id":"facts","text":{"en":"\"A 1,000-watt motor and 6 blades crush ice in seconds.\"","ar":"«محرّك 1000 واط و6 شفرات تطحن الثلج في ثوانٍ.»"}},{"id":"world","text":{"en":"\"In today's world, you need a really strong blender.\"","ar":"«في عالم اليوم، تحتاج حقًا خلّاطًا قويًا.»"}},{"id":"super","text":{"en":"\"This super, extremely powerful blender is very strong.\"","ar":"«هذا الخلّاط الخارق القوي للغاية قويّ جدًا.»"}}],"answer":["facts"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P15-003","when":["world"],"feedback":{"en":"\"In today's world\" is a warm-up, and the motor and blades, the real facts, are gone.","ar":"«في عالم اليوم» تمهيد، والمحرّك والشفرات، وهي المعلومات الحقيقية، اختفت."}},{"id":"MC-P15-008","when":["super"],"feedback":{"en":"Three intensifiers, zero facts. Numbers like 1,000 watts prove \"strong\" better than \"very\".","ar":"ثلاث كلمات توكيد، ولا معلومة واحدة. والأرقام مثل 1000 واط تُثبت القوة أفضل من «جدًا»."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Which option still has the numbers?","ar":"أي خيار ما زالت فيه الأرقام؟"},{"en":"\"Very\" and \"extremely\" can go. Facts stay.","ar":"«جدًا» و«للغاية» يمكن حذفهما. أما المعلومات فتبقى."}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Facts show the power; no \"very\" needed.","ar":"صحيح. المعلومات تُظهر القوة، دون حاجة لـ «جدًا»."},"explain":{"en":"Replace empty praise with the facts behind it. It's shorter and more convincing.","ar":"استبدل المديح الفارغ بالمعلومات التي وراءه. فيصبح أقصر وأكثر إقناعًا."}},{"id":"S09","type":"card","part":"recap","icons":["cut","typo","ok","text"],"title":{"en":"What you did","ar":"ماذا تعلّمت"},"body":{"en":"- **Cut warm-ups:** you removed \"We understand that…\" and kept the date and the fee.\n- **Plain words:** you swapped \"enables you to utilize\" for \"Pay faster with a saved card\".\n- **Once is enough:** you said \"successful\" once.\n- **Clear first:** you kept the words that explain Autopay and the late fee.\n- **Facts over praise:** you replaced \"extremely powerful\" with the motor's watts.\n\nNext lesson: say who does what, and use numbers.","ar":"- **احذف التمهيد:** حذفت «نحن نتفهّم أن…» وأبقيت التاريخ والغرامة.\n- **كلمات بسيطة:** استبدلت «تمكّنك من القيام بالاستفادة» بـ «ادفع أسرع ببطاقة محفوظة».\n- **مرة تكفي:** قلت «بنجاح» مرة واحدة.\n- **الوضوح أولًا:** أبقيت الكلمات التي تشرح الدفع التلقائي وغرامة التأخير.\n- **المعلومات بدل المديح:** استبدلت «قوي للغاية» بقوة المحرّك بالواط.\n\nالدرس التالي: قل من يفعل ماذا، واستخدم الأرقام."}}]}$uxg$::jsonb),
  ($uxg$P15-U02-L02$uxg$, $uxg$b9943eee65c4519153de1f60c0fb76eeedfafdcea2e6977aa3e0887815d314c7$uxg$, $uxg${"id":"P15-U02-L02","mode":"lesson","minutes":7,"title":{"en":"Say who does what, and show the numbers","ar":"قل من يفعل ماذا، وأظهِر الأرقام"},"summary":{"en":"Fix a clinic app's messages: name who must act, drop double negatives, and write facts as digits.","ar":"أصلح رسائل تطبيق عيادة: اذكر من عليه أن يتصرّف، وتجنّب النفي المزدوج، واكتب الحقائق بالأرقام."},"speaker":"nour","review_labels":{"MC-P15-011":{"en":"A sentence with no actor leaves people unsure who must act","ar":"الجملة بلا فاعل تترك الناس غير متأكّدين من عليه أن يتصرّف"},"MC-P15-012":{"en":"Double negatives make people work out the meaning","ar":"النفي المزدوج يجعل الناس يُتعبون أنفسهم ليفهموا المعنى"},"MC-P15-013":{"en":"Numbers written as words hide the facts","ar":"الأعداد المكتوبة بالحروف تُخفي الحقائق"},"MC-P15-014":{"en":"Unusual units need a short explanation","ar":"الوحدات غير المألوفة تحتاج شرحًا قصيرًا"},"MC-P15-015":{"en":"Not every number is an exact fact","ar":"ليس كل عدد حقيقة دقيقة"},"MC-P15-010":{"en":"Cutting too much loses what people need","ar":"الحذف الزائد يُضيع ما يحتاجه الناس"}},"steps":[{"id":"S01","type":"card","part":"hook","title":{"en":"Who has to do what?","ar":"من عليه أن يفعل ماذا؟"},"body":{"en":"I manage a clinic. Our app sends messages to patients, but many of them call us to ask what the messages mean.\n\nLast week, a patient waited at home for us to send her lab results. The message said they \"must be collected\". She didn't know that meant her.","ar":"أدير عيادة. وتطبيقنا يرسل رسائل إلى المرضى، لكن كثيرين منهم يتصلون بنا ليسألوا عن معناها.\n\nالأسبوع الماضي، انتظرت مريضة في بيتها أن نرسل لها نتائج تحاليلها. كانت الرسالة تقول إن النتائج «يجب أن تُستلم». ولم تعرف أنها هي المقصودة."},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Results","ar":"النتائج"}},"tabbar":{"active":2,"items":[{"icon":"house","text":{"en":"Home","ar":"الرئيسية"}},{"icon":"calendar-check","text":{"en":"Appointments","ar":"المواعيد"}},{"icon":"flask","text":{"en":"Results","ar":"النتائج"}},{"icon":"chat-circle-text","text":{"en":"Messages","ar":"الرسائل"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"card","blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"flask","text":{"en":"Lab results","ar":"نتائج التحاليل"},"sub":{"en":"Blood test · 3 March","ar":"تحليل دم · 3 مارس"},"badge":{"text":{"en":"Ready","ar":"جاهزة"},"tone":"good"}},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"Results must be collected within seven days.","ar":"يجب أن تُستلم النتائج خلال سبعة أيام."},"gap":"s"}]}]}},{"id":"S02","type":"choose","skill":"SK-P15-U02-03","part":"try","rules":["R12"],"value":{"en":"Try first. Passive Voice Redeemed (NN/g): passive sentences that don't state the actor are even harder to understand, and readers may get wrong who does the action.","ar":"جرّب أولًا. المبني للمجهول (NN/g): الجمل المبنية للمجهول التي لا تذكر الفاعل أصعب في الفهم، وقد يخطئ القرّاء في معرفة من يقوم بالفعل."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/passive-voice-is-redeemed-for-web/","quote":"Typically, it's even harder for readers to understand passive sentences that don't explicitly state the actor."},"prompt":{"en":"Which rewrite makes it clear that the patient has to pick up the results?","ar":"أي صياغة توضّح أن المريض هو من عليه أن يستلم النتائج؟"},"options":[{"id":"you","text":{"en":"\"Pick up your results from the clinic within 7 days.\"","ar":"«استلم نتائجك من العيادة خلال 7 أيام.»"}},{"id":"ready","text":{"en":"\"Results are ready and should be collected soon.\"","ar":"«النتائج جاهزة ويجب أن تُستلم قريبًا.»"}},{"id":"collection","text":{"en":"\"Result collection is required within one week.\"","ar":"«استلام النتائج مطلوب خلال أسبوع.»"}}],"answer":["you"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P15-011","when":["ready","collection"],"feedback":{"en":"This still doesn't say who collects them. A patient could think the clinic will send them.","ar":"هذه الصياغة ما زالت لا تقول من يستلمها. وقد يظن المريض أن العيادة سترسلها."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Look for the option that speaks to the patient directly.","ar":"ابحث عن الخيار الذي يخاطب المريض مباشرة."},{"en":"Which one starts with what the patient does?","ar":"أي خيار يبدأ بما يفعله المريض؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Right. \"Pick up your results\" leaves no doubt.","ar":"صحيح. «استلم نتائجك» لا تترك أي شك."},"explain":{"en":"When the sentence names who acts, people don't have to guess. Speaking to them as \"you\" is the clearest way.","ar":"حين تذكر الجملة من يتصرّف، لا يحتاج الناس إلى التخمين. ومخاطبتهم مباشرة هي أوضح طريقة."}},{"id":"S03","type":"card","part":"concept","icons":["person","ok","warn","sort"],"title":{"en":"Name the actor, and use digits for facts","ar":"اذكر الفاعل، واستخدم الأرقام للحقائق"},"body":{"en":"- **Say who acts:** in body text, write \"You pick up the results\", not \"Results must be collected\". Use active voice, where the sentence names who does the action.\n- **Say what to do:** write \"Change it up to 24 hours before\", not \"You can't change it unless…\". Avoid double negatives.\n- **Digits for facts:** write \"7 days\", not \"seven days\". Digits stand out when people scan.\n- **Explain unusual units:** if people may not know a unit, say what it means for them.\n- **Words for rough amounts:** \"thousands of patients\" is not an exact fact, so it stays a word.","ar":"- **قل من يتصرّف:** في نص الرسالة، اكتب «استلم نتائجك»، لا «يجب أن تُستلم النتائج». استخدم صيغة المبني للمعلوم (Active voice)، أي الجملة التي تذكر من يقوم بالفعل.\n- **قل ما يجب فعله:** اكتب «يمكنك تغيير الموعد حتى 24 ساعة قبله»، لا «لا يمكنك تغييره إلا إذا…». تجنّب النفي المزدوج.\n- **أرقام للحقائق:** اكتب «7 أيام»، لا «سبعة أيام». فالأرقام تلفت العين حين يتصفّح الناس بسرعة.\n- **اشرح الوحدات غير المألوفة:** إن كان الناس قد لا يعرفون وحدة، فقل ماذا تعني لهم.\n- **كلمات للأعداد التقريبية:** «آلاف المرضى» ليست حقيقة دقيقة، فتبقى بالحروف."}},{"id":"S04","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P15-U02-03","part":"guided","rules":["R06"],"value":{"en":"Passive Voice Redeemed (NN/g): a positive statement (\"do X\") is usually better than a negative one, and double negatives are almost always horrible.","ar":"المبني للمجهول (NN/g): الجملة المثبتة («افعل كذا») أفضل غالبًا من المنفية، والنفي المزدوج سيئ في أغلب الأحيان."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/passive-voice-is-redeemed-for-web/","quote":"it's almost always horrible to use double negatives"},"scenario":{"en":"This note is on the appointment screen. Patients keep calling to ask if they can still change their visit.","ar":"هذه الملاحظة في شاشة المواعيد. والمرضى يتصلون باستمرار ليسألوا هل ما زال بإمكانهم تغيير زيارتهم."},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Your appointment","ar":"موعدك"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","avatar":{"text":"Dr Mona Adel","art":"doctor"},"text":{"en":"Dr Mona Adel","ar":"د. منى عادل"},"sub":{"en":"Family medicine","ar":"طب الأسرة"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"calendar-blank","text":{"en":"Sunday 9 March · 10:30 AM","ar":"الأحد 9 مارس · 10:30 ص"},"sub":{"en":"Room 12","ar":"الغرفة 12"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Appointments cannot be changed unless there are no fewer than 24 hours left.","ar":"لا يمكن تغيير المواعيد إلا إذا بقي ما لا يقل عن 24 ساعة."},"color":"muted","gap":"m"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Change appointment","ar":"غيّر الموعد"},"style":"outline","gap":"s"}],"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"}},"prompt":{"en":"Which rewrite tells patients clearly when they can change their visit?","ar":"أي صياغة تخبر المرضى بوضوح متى يمكنهم تغيير زيارتهم؟"},"options":[{"id":"not","text":{"en":"\"Appointments can't be changed with fewer than 24 hours left.\"","ar":"«لا يمكن تغيير المواعيد إذا بقي أقل من 24 ساعة.»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Your appointment","ar":"موعدك"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","avatar":{"text":"Dr Mona Adel","art":"doctor"},"text":{"en":"Dr Mona Adel","ar":"د. منى عادل"},"sub":{"en":"Family medicine","ar":"طب الأسرة"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"calendar-blank","text":{"en":"Sunday 9 March · 10:30 AM","ar":"الأحد 9 مارس · 10:30 ص"},"sub":{"en":"Room 12","ar":"الغرفة 12"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Appointments can't be changed with fewer than 24 hours left.","ar":"لا يمكن تغيير المواعيد إذا بقي أقل من 24 ساعة."},"color":"muted","gap":"m"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Change appointment","ar":"غيّر الموعد"},"style":"outline","gap":"s"}],"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}},{"id":"policy","text":{"en":"\"Changes are subject to our 24-hour policy.\"","ar":"«التغييرات تخضع لسياسة الـ 24 ساعة.»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Your appointment","ar":"موعدك"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","avatar":{"text":"Dr Mona Adel","art":"doctor"},"text":{"en":"Dr Mona Adel","ar":"د. منى عادل"},"sub":{"en":"Family medicine","ar":"طب الأسرة"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"calendar-blank","text":{"en":"Sunday 9 March · 10:30 AM","ar":"الأحد 9 مارس · 10:30 ص"},"sub":{"en":"Room 12","ar":"الغرفة 12"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Changes are subject to our 24-hour policy.","ar":"التغييرات تخضع لسياسة الـ 24 ساعة."},"color":"muted","gap":"m"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Change appointment","ar":"غيّر الموعد"},"style":"outline","gap":"s"}],"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}},{"id":"until","text":{"en":"\"You can change your visit up to 24 hours before it starts.\"","ar":"«يمكنك تغيير زيارتك حتى 24 ساعة قبل موعدها.»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Your appointment","ar":"موعدك"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","avatar":{"text":"Dr Mona Adel","art":"doctor"},"text":{"en":"Dr Mona Adel","ar":"د. منى عادل"},"sub":{"en":"Family medicine","ar":"طب الأسرة"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"calendar-blank","text":{"en":"Sunday 9 March · 10:30 AM","ar":"الأحد 9 مارس · 10:30 ص"},"sub":{"en":"Room 12","ar":"الغرفة 12"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"You can change your visit up to 24 hours before it starts.","ar":"يمكنك تغيير زيارتك حتى 24 ساعة قبل موعدها."},"color":"muted","gap":"m"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Change appointment","ar":"غيّر الموعد"},"style":"outline","gap":"s"}],"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}}],"answer":["until"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P15-012","when":["not"],"feedback":{"en":"Better, but it still says what people can't do. They have to flip it in their head to learn what they can do.","ar":"أفضل، لكنها ما زالت تقول ما لا يستطيع الناس فعله. فعليهم أن يعكسوا المعنى في أذهانهم ليعرفوا ما يستطيعون فعله."}},{"id":"MC-P15-011","when":["policy"],"feedback":{"en":"Short, but it doesn't say who can do what, or when. People must guess what \"our 24-hour policy\" means.","ar":"قصيرة، لكنها لا تقول من يستطيع ماذا، ولا متى. وعلى الناس أن يخمّنوا معنى «سياسة الـ 24 ساعة»."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Find the option with no \"not\" or \"can't\" in it.","ar":"ابحث عن الخيار الذي ليس فيه «لا» ولا «لا يمكن»."},{"en":"The best line says what the patient can do, and until when.","ar":"أفضل سطر يقول ما يستطيع المريض فعله، وحتى متى."}],"correct":{"en":"Right. One positive sentence, and it names who acts.","ar":"صحيح. جملة واحدة بصيغة إيجابية، وتذكر من يتصرّف."},"explain":{"en":"Tell people what they can do. They understand \"you can, up to 24 hours before\" at first read.","ar":"أخبر الناس بما يستطيعون فعله. فهم يفهمون «يمكنك التغيير حتى 24 ساعة قبل الموعد» من القراءة الأولى."},"speaker":"nour"},{"id":"S05","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P15-U02-04","part":"guided","rules":["R06"],"value":{"en":"Show Numbers as Numerals (NN/g): write numbers with digits, not letters; digits catch the eye of people scanning for facts.","ar":"اكتب الأعداد بالأرقام (NN/g): اكتب الأعداد بالأرقام لا بالحروف؛ فالأرقام تلفت عين من يتصفّح بحثًا عن الحقائق."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/web-writing-show-numbers-as-numerals/","quote":"Write numbers with digits, not letters (23, not twenty-three)."},"scenario":{"en":"Patients get this reminder the day before their visit. Many glance at it on the way out and still arrive late.","ar":"يصل هذا التذكير إلى المرضى قبل زيارتهم بيوم. وكثيرون ينظرون إليه سريعًا وهم يخرجون، ثم يصلون متأخرين."},"prompt":{"en":"Tap each option to see the change. Which reminder lets patients spot the time and room at a glance?","ar":"اضغط على كل خيار لترى التغيير. أي تذكير يجعل المرضى يرون الوقت والغرفة بنظرة سريعة؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"screen":"lock","caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"blocks":[{"kind":"notification","title":{"en":"Tomorrow's visit","ar":"زيارة الغد"},"text":{"en":"Your visit is at half past three in the afternoon in room twelve. Arrive fifteen minutes early.","ar":"زيارتك في الثالثة والنصف عصرًا في الغرفة رقم اثني عشر. احضر قبل الموعد بخمس عشرة دقيقة."},"time":{"en":"now","ar":"الآن"}}]},"options":[{"id":"digits","text":{"en":"Write the times and room as digits","ar":"اكتب الأوقات والغرفة بالأرقام"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"screen":"lock","caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"notification","title":{"en":"Tomorrow's visit","ar":"زيارة الغد"},"text":{"en":"Your visit is at 3:30 PM in Room 12. Arrive 15 minutes early.","ar":"زيارتك الساعة 3:30 عصرًا في الغرفة 12. احضر قبل الموعد بـ 15 دقيقة."},"time":{"en":"now","ar":"الآن"}}]}},{"id":"bold","text":{"en":"Make the number words bold","ar":"اجعل الأعداد المكتوبة بالحروف بخط Bold"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"screen":"lock","caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"notification","title":{"en":"Tomorrow's visit","ar":"زيارة الغد"},"text":{"en":"Your visit is at **half past three** in the afternoon in room **twelve**. Arrive **fifteen** minutes early.","ar":"زيارتك في **الثالثة والنصف** عصرًا في الغرفة رقم **اثني عشر**. احضر قبل الموعد بـ **خمس عشرة** دقيقة."},"time":{"en":"now","ar":"الآن"}}]}},{"id":"vague","text":{"en":"Shorten it to \"See you tomorrow afternoon!\"","ar":"اختصره إلى «نراك غدًا بعد الظهر!»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"screen":"lock","caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"notification","title":{"en":"Tomorrow's visit","ar":"زيارة الغد"},"text":{"en":"See you tomorrow afternoon!","ar":"نراك غدًا بعد الظهر!"},"time":{"en":"now","ar":"الآن"}}]}}],"answer":["digits"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P15-013","when":["bold"],"feedback":{"en":"Bold helps a little, but \"half past three\" still takes longer to read than \"3:30\".","ar":"الخط Bold يساعد قليلًا، لكن «الثالثة والنصف» ما زالت تحتاج وقتًا أطول للقراءة من «3:30»."}},{"id":"MC-P15-010","when":["vague"],"feedback":{"en":"It's short, but the time and the room are gone. That's what patients need most.","ar":"قصير، لكن الوقت والغرفة اختفيا. وهما أكثر ما يحتاجه المرضى."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Which version makes \"3:30\" and \"12\" jump out?","ar":"أي نسخة تجعل «3:30» و«12» تلفت النظر؟"},{"en":"Digit shapes stand out from letters, even in a long line.","ar":"أشكال الأرقام تبرز بين الحروف، حتى في سطر طويل."}],"correct":{"en":"Right. 3:30, 12 and 15 are easy to spot.","ar":"صحيح. من السهل رؤية 3:30 و12 و15."},"explain":{"en":"People scanning for a fact look for numbers. Digits let them find it at a glance.","ar":"من يتصفّح بحثًا عن معلومة يبحث عن الأرقام. والأرقام تجعله يجدها بنظرة سريعة."},"speaker":"nour"},{"id":"S06","type":"choose","skill":"SK-P15-U02-04","part":"guided","rules":["R06"],"confidence":true,"value":{"en":"Show Numbers as Numerals (NN/g): explain unusual abbreviations and measurement units; the site example is spelling out and explaining TB for shoppers.","ar":"اكتب الأعداد بالأرقام (NN/g): اشرح الاختصارات ووحدات القياس غير المألوفة؛ والمثال هو شرح وحدة TB للمشترين."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/web-writing-show-numbers-as-numerals/","quote":"Explain unusual abbreviations and measurement units, particularly those representing very big numbers."},"scenario":{"en":"Patients can now download their X-ray images in the app. The button says \"Download (1.2 GB)\". Some start the download on mobile data and run out.","ar":"يستطيع المرضى الآن تنزيل صور الأشعة في التطبيق. والزر يقول «تنزيل (1.2 GB)». بعضهم يبدأ التنزيل على باقة الهاتف فتنفد باقته."},"prompt":{"en":"Which note under the button helps patients who don't know what \"GB\" means?","ar":"أي ملاحظة تحت الزر تساعد المرضى الذين لا يعرفون معنى «GB»؟"},"options":[{"id":"exact","text":{"en":"\"File size: 1,228 MB.\"","ar":"«حجم الملف: 1228 MB.»"}},{"id":"explain","text":{"en":"\"1.2 GB is a large file. Use Wi-Fi to save your mobile data.\"","ar":"«1.2 GB ملف كبير. استخدم Wi-Fi لتحافظ على باقة هاتفك.»"}},{"id":"hide","text":{"en":"Remove the size so the button looks simpler","ar":"احذف الحجم ليبدو الزر أبسط"}}],"answer":["explain"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P15-014","when":["exact"],"feedback":{"en":"This is more exact, but \"MB\" is just as unclear as \"GB\" for many patients.","ar":"هذا أدق، لكن «MB» غير واضحة لكثير من المرضى مثل «GB» تمامًا."}},{"id":"MC-P15-010","when":["hide"],"feedback":{"en":"Without the size, patients get no warning at all before using up their data.","ar":"بدون الحجم، لن يحصل المرضى على أي تنبيه قبل أن تنفد باقتهم."}}],"hints":[{"en":"The problem isn't the number. It's what the unit means for the patient.","ar":"المشكلة ليست في العدد، بل في معنى الوحدة بالنسبة للمريض."},{"en":"Which note tells patients what to do about the size?","ar":"أيّ ملاحظة تخبر المرضى بما عليهم فعله بسبب الحجم؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Right. You kept the number and said what it means.","ar":"صحيح. أبقيت العدد وقلت ماذا يعني."},"explain":{"en":"When a unit is unusual for your readers, add a short line on what it means for them.","ar":"حين تكون الوحدة غير مألوفة لقرّائك، أضف سطرًا قصيرًا عمّا تعنيه لهم."},"speaker":"nour"},{"id":"S07","type":"compare","skill":"SK-P15-U02-03","part":"contrast","rules":["R11"],"value":{"en":"Contrast: actor named vs no actor. Passive Voice Redeemed (NN/g): active voice more directly represents the action, so readers jump through fewer cognitive hoops.","ar":"مقارنة: فاعل مذكور مقابل بلا فاعل. المبني للمجهول (NN/g): صيغة المبني للمعلوم تعبّر عن الفعل مباشرة، فيبذل القرّاء جهدًا أقل للفهم."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/passive-voice-is-redeemed-for-web/","quote":"it more directly represents the action"},"scenario":{"en":"Parents get a message after their child's first vaccine dose. We wrote it two ways.","ar":"تصل الأهلَ رسالة بعد الجرعة الأولى من تطعيم طفلهم. وكتبناها بطريقتين."},"prompt":{"en":"Which message makes parents know that they must book the next dose?","ar":"أي رسالة تجعل الأهل يعرفون أن عليهم هم حجز الجرعة التالية؟"},"a":{"label":{"en":"A: The message tells the parent to book the next dose.","ar":"A: الرسالة تطلب من ولي الأمر حجز الجرعة التالية."},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Vaccines","ar":"التطعيمات"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","avatar":{"text":"Salma","art":"woman-3"},"text":{"en":"Salma Hassan","ar":"سلمى حسن"},"sub":{"en":"Age 2 months","ar":"العمر شهران"}},{"kind":"card","gap":"m","blocks":[{"kind":"badge","text":{"en":"Vaccine: dose 1 done","ar":"التطعيم: تمّت الجرعة 1"},"tone":"good","icon":"check"},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"Book your child's second dose for 4 weeks from today.","ar":"احجز الجرعة الثانية لطفلك بعد 4 أسابيع من اليوم."},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Book dose 2","ar":"احجز الجرعة 2"},"gap":"m"}]}]}},"b":{"label":{"en":"B: The message says when the next dose should be given.","ar":"B: الرسالة تقول متى يجب أن تُعطى الجرعة التالية."},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Vaccines","ar":"التطعيمات"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","avatar":{"text":"Salma","art":"woman-3"},"text":{"en":"Salma Hassan","ar":"سلمى حسن"},"sub":{"en":"Age 2 months","ar":"العمر شهران"}},{"kind":"card","gap":"m","blocks":[{"kind":"badge","text":{"en":"Vaccine: dose 1 done","ar":"التطعيم: تمّت الجرعة 1"},"tone":"good","icon":"check"},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"The second dose should be given after 4 weeks.","ar":"يجب أن تُعطى الجرعة الثانية بعد 4 أسابيع."},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Book dose 2","ar":"احجز الجرعة 2"},"gap":"m"}]}]}},"answer":"a","reason":{"prompt":{"en":"Why does A work better?","ar":"لماذا A أفضل؟"},"options":[{"id":"shorter","text":{"en":"A has fewer words than B","ar":"في A كلمات أقل من B"}},{"id":"actor","text":{"en":"A names who acts, so parents don't wait for the clinic to call","ar":"A تذكر من يتصرّف، فلا ينتظر الأهل أن تتصل بهم العيادة"}},{"id":"button","text":{"en":"Only A has a button to book","ar":"A وحدها فيها زر للحجز"}}],"answer":["actor"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P15-011","when":["shorter","button"],"feedback":{"en":"Both have the same button and about the same length. The difference is that A says who must act.","ar":"في الاثنتين نفس الزر، وطولهما متقارب. الفرق أن A تقول من عليه أن يتصرّف."}}]},"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P15-011","when":["b"],"feedback":{"en":"\"Should be given\" by whom? Some parents will wait for the clinic to call them, and the child misses the dose.","ar":"«يجب أن تُعطى» من قِبَل من؟ بعض الأهل سينتظرون أن تتصل بهم العيادة، فتفوت الطفل الجرعة."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Read B and ask: who is supposed to do something?","ar":"اقرأ B واسأل: من المفترض أن يفعل شيئًا؟"},{"en":"Both have the same button. Look only at the sentence.","ar":"في الاثنتين نفس الزر. انظر إلى الجملة فقط."}],"correct":{"en":"Right. \"Book your child's second dose\" tells the parent it's their job.","ar":"صحيح. «احجز الجرعة الثانية لطفلك» تخبر ولي الأمر أن هذه مهمته."},"explain":{"en":"A sentence without an actor makes people guess who acts. When a missed step has a cost, name who must do it.","ar":"الجملة بلا فاعل تجعل الناس يخمّنون من يتصرّف. وحين يكون لتفويت الخطوة ثمن، اذكر من عليه أن يقوم بها."},"speaker":"nour"},{"id":"S08","type":"choose","skill":"SK-P15-U02-04","part":"independent","speaker":"youssef","rules":["R14"],"confidence":true,"value":{"en":"New case. Show Numbers as Numerals (NN/g): spell out numbers that don't represent specific facts; \"thousands\" for scope stays a word, but an exact count should use digits.","ar":"حالة جديدة. اكتب الأعداد بالأرقام (NN/g): اكتب بالحروف الأعداد التي لا تمثّل حقائق محددة؛ «آلاف» التي تعبّر عن الحجم تبقى كلمة، أما العدد الدقيق فيُكتب بالأرقام."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/web-writing-show-numbers-as-numerals/","quote":"Spell out numbers that don't represent specific facts."},"scenario":{"en":"My shop's homepage says: \"Thousands of happy customers since 2015.\" I don't have an exact count. A friend told me to always use digits.","ar":"الصفحة الرئيسية لمتجري تقول: «آلاف العملاء السعداء منذ 2015.» وليس عندي عدد دقيق. ونصحني صديق بأن أستخدم الأرقام دائمًا."},"prompt":{"en":"What should I do with this line?","ar":"ماذا أفعل بهذا السطر؟"},"options":[{"id":"symbol","text":{"en":"Change it to \"1,000s of happy customers since 2015.\"","ar":"أغيّره إلى «+1000 من العملاء السعداء منذ 2015.»"}},{"id":"spell","text":{"en":"Write the year in words too: \"since two thousand fifteen\"","ar":"أكتب السنة بالحروف أيضًا: «منذ ألفين وخمسة عشر»"}},{"id":"keep","text":{"en":"Keep it as it is: \"thousands\" is a rough amount, and 2015 is an exact fact","ar":"أتركه كما هو: «آلاف» عدد تقريبي، و2015 حقيقة دقيقة"}}],"answer":["keep"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P15-015","when":["symbol"],"feedback":{"en":"\"Thousands\" isn't an exact number. Writing it as digits makes it look like data you don't have.","ar":"«آلاف» ليست عددًا دقيقًا. وكتابتها بالأرقام تجعلها تبدو كأنها بيانات ليست عندك."}},{"id":"MC-P15-013","when":["spell"],"feedback":{"en":"2015 is a specific fact. As digits, it's quick to spot. In words, it's slow to read.","ar":"2015 حقيقة محددة. بالأرقام يسهل رؤيتها، وبالحروف تصبح قراءتها بطيئة."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Digits for facts, words for rough amounts.","ar":"صحيح. الأرقام للحقائق، والكلمات للأعداد التقريبية."},"explain":{"en":"If you later count your customers, write the exact number as digits. An exact number also makes the line more believable.","ar":"إن عددت عملاءك لاحقًا، فاكتب العدد الدقيق بالأرقام. فالعدد الدقيق يجعل السطر أكثر مصداقية أيضًا."}},{"id":"S09","type":"card","part":"recap","icons":["person","ok","sort","warn"],"title":{"en":"What you did","ar":"ماذا تعلّمت"},"body":{"en":"- **Named the actor:** \"Pick up your results\" and \"Book your child's second dose\" tell people it's their job.\n- **Said what to do:** you swapped a double negative for \"You can change your visit up to 24 hours before\".\n- **Digits for facts:** 3:30 PM and Room 12 are easy to spot.\n- **Explained a unit:** you said what 1.2 GB means for mobile data.\n- **Words for rough amounts:** \"thousands of customers\" stayed a word.\n\nNext: a skill check on this unit.","ar":"- **ذكرت الفاعل:** «استلم نتائجك» و«احجز الجرعة الثانية لطفلك» تخبران الناس أن هذه مهمتهم.\n- **قلت ما يجب فعله:** استبدلت النفي المزدوج بـ «يمكنك تغيير زيارتك حتى 24 ساعة قبل موعدها».\n- **أرقام للحقائق:** من السهل رؤية 3:30 عصرًا والغرفة 12.\n- **شرحت وحدة:** قلت ماذا يعني 1.2 GB لباقة الهاتف.\n- **كلمات للأعداد التقريبية:** بقيت «آلاف العملاء» بالحروف.\n\nالتالي: اختبار مهارات هذه الوحدة."}}]}$uxg$::jsonb),
  ($uxg$P15-U02-L03$uxg$, $uxg$bf8191e12d97bd289a4e2e3fe3649eb5dc50f0feb3f2594e68d6b0d6f3838e58$uxg$, $uxg${"id":"P15-U02-L03","mode":"check","minutes":5,"title":{"en":"Skill check: say more with fewer words","ar":"اختبار المهارة: قل أكثر بكلمات أقل"},"summary":{"en":"Edit a bus-ticket app's text on your own: cut, keep what's needed, name who acts, and use digits.","ar":"حرّر وحدك نصوص تطبيق لتذاكر الحافلات: احذف، وأبقِ الضروري، واذكر الفاعل، واستخدم الأرقام."},"speaker":"rami","steps":[{"id":"S01","type":"card","part":"hook","title":{"en":"Rami's first app","ar":"أول تطبيق لرامي"},"body":{"en":"I'm a junior designer, and this is my first app at work: a bus-ticket app. People book on their phones, often while standing in the station.\n\nYour job: fix four pieces of my text.\n\nThis is a skill check: there are no hints, and you'll see your result at the end.","ar":"أنا مصمم مبتدئ، وهذا أول تطبيق أعمل عليه: تطبيق لتذاكر الحافلات. والناس يحجزون من هواتفهم، وغالبًا وهم واقفون في المحطة.\n\nمهمّتك: أصلح أربعة من نصوصي.\n\nهذا اختبار مهارة: لا توجد تلميحات، وسترى نتيجتك في النهاية."},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rehla","name":{"en":"Rehla","ar":"رحلة"},"color":"#7048E8","icon":"bus","domain":"rehla.example"},"appbar":{"logo":true},"tabbar":{"active":0,"items":[{"icon":"magnifying-glass","text":{"en":"Search","ar":"البحث"}},{"icon":"ticket","text":{"en":"My trips","ar":"رحلاتي"}},{"icon":"bell","text":{"en":"Alerts","ar":"التنبيهات"}},{"icon":"user","text":{"en":"Account","ar":"حسابي"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"searchbar","text":{"en":"Cairo → Alexandria · Today","ar":"القاهرة ← الإسكندرية · اليوم"},"filled":true},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"bus","text":{"en":"9:00 AM → 1:30 PM","ar":"9:00 ص ← 1:30 م"},"sub":{"en":"1 stop · 18 seats left","ar":"توقّف واحد · 18 مقعدًا متاحًا"},"value":{"en":"EGP 180","ar":"180 جنيه"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"bus","text":{"en":"11:00 AM → 3:15 PM","ar":"11:00 ص ← 3:15 م"},"sub":{"en":"Direct · 4 seats left","ar":"مباشر · 4 مقاعد متاحة"},"value":{"en":"EGP 210","ar":"210 جنيه"}}]}},{"id":"S02","type":"words","skill":"SK-P15-U02-01","part":"check","rules":["R19"],"value":{"en":"Skill check. Rewriting for Brevity (NN/g): an opening clause like \"As we all know\" offers nothing important and is better removed.","ar":"اختبار مهارة. الاختصار (NN/g): عبارة افتتاحية مثل «كما نعلم جميعًا» لا تضيف شيئًا مهمًا، ومن الأفضل حذفها."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/rewriting-content-brevity/","quote":"In the remove example, the dependent clause offers nothing important and is better off removed."},"scenario":{"en":"On the trip screen I wrote: \"As we all know, buses on this route can sometimes get full, so it is really very important to book your seat early.\"","ar":"في شاشة الرحلة كتبت: «كما نعلم جميعًا، قد تمتلئ الحافلات على هذا الخط أحيانًا، لذلك من المهم حقًا جدًا أن تحجز مقعدك مبكرًا.»"},"prompt":{"en":"Which line keeps the meaning and cuts the empty words?","ar":"أي سطر يحتفظ بالمعنى ويحذف الكلمات الفارغة؟"},"options":[{"id":"know","text":{"en":"\"As we all know, this route fills up. Book early.\"","ar":"«كما نعلم جميعًا، هذا الخط يمتلئ. احجز مبكرًا.»"}},{"id":"note","text":{"en":"\"Please note: it is very important to book early.\"","ar":"«يرجى الانتباه: من المهم جدًا أن تحجز مبكرًا.»"}},{"id":"plain","text":{"en":"\"This route often fills up. Book your seat early.\"","ar":"«هذا الخط يمتلئ كثيرًا. احجز مقعدك مبكرًا.»"}}],"answer":["plain"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P15-003","when":["know"],"feedback":{"en":"\"As we all know\" is still there. It's a warm-up that tells people nothing.","ar":"«كما نعلم جميعًا» ما زالت موجودة. وهي تمهيد لا يخبر الناس بشيء."}},{"id":"MC-P15-008","when":["note"],"feedback":{"en":"\"Please note\" and \"very important\" add words, and the reason, a full bus, is gone.","ar":"«يرجى الانتباه» و«من المهم جدًا» تضيفان كلمات، والسبب، أي امتلاء الحافلة، اختفى."}}],"explain":{"en":"From Lesson 1: cut warm-ups and words like \"very\". Keep the fact and the action.","ar":"من الدرس 1: احذف التمهيد وكلمات مثل «جدًا». وأبقِ المعلومة والفعل."},"speaker":"rami"},{"id":"S03","type":"choose","skill":"SK-P15-U02-02","part":"check","rules":["R19"],"value":{"en":"Skill check. 3 C's of Microcopy (NN/g): a sold-out button that says the problem and the solution, in a few words, reduces friction.","ar":"اختبار مهارة. قواعد الـ Microcopy الثلاث (NN/g): زر نفاد الكمية الذي يقول المشكلة والحل بكلمات قليلة يقلّل العوائق."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/3-cs-microcopy/","quote":"concisely informs users of the problem and the solution, reducing friction."},"scenario":{"en":"When a trip has no seats left, its button says \"Unavailable\". People tap it again and again, then leave the app.","ar":"حين لا يبقى في الرحلة مقاعد، يقول زرّها «غير متاح». فيضغط الناس عليه مرة بعد مرة، ثم يخرجون من التطبيق."},"prompt":{"en":"Which button label tells people why they can't book, and what they can do next?","ar":"أي نص للزر يخبر الناس لماذا لا يستطيعون الحجز، وماذا يمكنهم أن يفعلوا بعد ذلك؟"},"options":[{"id":"notify","text":{"en":"\"Sold out · Tell me if a seat opens\"","ar":"«نفدت المقاعد · أخبرني إن توفّر مقعد»"}},{"id":"soldout","text":{"en":"\"Sold out\"","ar":"«نفدت المقاعد»"}},{"id":"sorry","text":{"en":"\"Sorry!\"","ar":"«نعتذر!»"}}],"answer":["notify"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P15-010","when":["soldout","sorry"],"feedback":{"en":"This is short, but people still don't know what they can do. Many will just leave.","ar":"هذا قصير، لكن الناس ما زالوا لا يعرفون ماذا يمكنهم أن يفعلوا. وكثيرون سيغادرون التطبيق ببساطة."}}],"explain":{"en":"From Lesson 1: clear comes first. A few extra words are worth it when they give people a next step.","ar":"من الدرس 1: الوضوح أولًا. وبعض الكلمات الزائدة تستحق مكانها حين تعطي الناس خطوة تالية."},"speaker":"rami"},{"id":"S04","type":"choose","skill":"SK-P15-U02-03","part":"check","rules":["R19"],"value":{"en":"Skill check. Rewriting for Brevity (NN/g): to spot passive voice, add \"by zombies\" to the end of the sentence; if it still makes sense, it is passive.","ar":"اختبار مهارة. الاختصار (NN/g): لتكتشف المبني للمجهول، أضف «بواسطة الزومبي» إلى آخر الجملة؛ فإن بقي لها معنى فهي مبنية للمجهول."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/rewriting-content-brevity/","quote":"If the sentence still makes sense, then it is passive."},"scenario":{"en":"On the booking screen I wrote: \"The seat must be chosen before payment.\" Many people pay first, because they think the app picks a seat for them.","ar":"في شاشة الحجز كتبت: «يجب أن يُختار المقعد قبل الدفع.» وكثيرون يدفعون أولًا، لأنهم يظنون أن التطبيق يختار لهم مقعدًا."},"prompt":{"en":"Which rewrite tells people that choosing the seat is their job?","ar":"أي صياغة تخبر الناس أن اختيار المقعد مهمتهم هم؟"},"options":[{"id":"selection","text":{"en":"\"Seat selection is required before payment.\"","ar":"«اختيار المقعد مطلوب قبل الدفع.»"}},{"id":"choose","text":{"en":"\"Choose your seat, then pay.\"","ar":"«اختر مقعدك، ثم ادفع.»"}},{"id":"assigned","text":{"en":"\"Seats are chosen before payment is made.\"","ar":"«تُختار المقاعد قبل أن يتم الدفع.»"}}],"answer":["choose"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P15-011","when":["selection","assigned"],"feedback":{"en":"Who chooses? This still doesn't say, so people may keep thinking the app does it.","ar":"من يختار؟ ما زالت الجملة لا تقول، فقد يبقى الناس يظنون أن التطبيق يفعل ذلك."}}],"explain":{"en":"From Lesson 2: name who must act. Speaking to people as \"you\" makes their task clear.","ar":"من الدرس 2: اذكر من عليه أن يتصرّف. ومخاطبة الناس مباشرة توضّح لهم مهمتهم."},"speaker":"rami"},{"id":"S05","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P15-U02-04","part":"check","rules":["R19"],"value":{"en":"Skill check. Show Numbers as Numerals (NN/g): digits enhance the scannability of web content.","ar":"اختبار مهارة. اكتب الأعداد بالأرقام (NN/g): الأرقام تجعل المحتوى أسهل في التصفّح السريع."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/web-writing-show-numbers-as-numerals/","quote":"Digits enhance the scannability of web content."},"scenario":{"en":"This is the trip summary people check before they pay.","ar":"هذا ملخص الرحلة الذي يراجعه الناس قبل أن يدفعوا."},"prompt":{"en":"Tap each option to see the change. Which summary lets people check the trip length and the stop at a glance?","ar":"اضغط على كل خيار لترى التغيير. أي ملخص يجعل الناس يعرفون مدة الرحلة والتوقّف بنظرة سريعة؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rehla","name":{"en":"Rehla","ar":"رحلة"},"color":"#7048E8","icon":"bus","domain":"rehla.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Review your trip","ar":"راجع رحلتك"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Pay EGP 180","ar":"ادفع 180 جنيهًا"}}],"blocks":[{"kind":"card","blocks":[{"kind":"row","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Cairo → Alexandria","ar":"القاهرة ← الإسكندرية"}},{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"EGP 180","ar":"180 جنيه"}}]},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Today · 9:00 AM · Seat 12","ar":"اليوم · 9:00 ص · المقعد 12"},"color":"muted","gap":"xs"},{"kind":"divider","gap":"s"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Trip summary","ar":"ملخص الرحلة"},"weight":"bold","gap":"s"},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"The trip takes about four and a half hours, with one stop of twenty minutes.","ar":"تستغرق الرحلة نحو أربع ساعات ونصف، مع توقّف واحد مدته عشرون دقيقة."},"gap":"xs"}]}]},"options":[{"id":"bold","text":{"en":"Make the number words bold","ar":"اجعل الأعداد المكتوبة بالحروف بخط Bold"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rehla","name":{"en":"Rehla","ar":"رحلة"},"color":"#7048E8","icon":"bus","domain":"rehla.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Review your trip","ar":"راجع رحلتك"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Pay EGP 180","ar":"ادفع 180 جنيهًا"}}],"blocks":[{"kind":"card","blocks":[{"kind":"row","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Cairo → Alexandria","ar":"القاهرة ← الإسكندرية"}},{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"EGP 180","ar":"180 جنيه"}}]},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Today · 9:00 AM · Seat 12","ar":"اليوم · 9:00 ص · المقعد 12"},"color":"muted","gap":"xs"},{"kind":"divider","gap":"s"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Trip summary","ar":"ملخص الرحلة"},"weight":"bold","gap":"s"},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"The trip takes about **four and a half hours**, with **one** stop of **twenty minutes**.","ar":"تستغرق الرحلة نحو **أربع ساعات ونصف**، مع توقّف **واحد** مدته **عشرون دقيقة**."},"gap":"xs"}]}]}},{"id":"vague","text":{"en":"Shorten it to \"A few hours, with a short break.\"","ar":"اختصره إلى «بضع ساعات، مع استراحة قصيرة.»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rehla","name":{"en":"Rehla","ar":"رحلة"},"color":"#7048E8","icon":"bus","domain":"rehla.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Review your trip","ar":"راجع رحلتك"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Pay EGP 180","ar":"ادفع 180 جنيهًا"}}],"blocks":[{"kind":"card","blocks":[{"kind":"row","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Cairo → Alexandria","ar":"القاهرة ← الإسكندرية"}},{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"EGP 180","ar":"180 جنيه"}}]},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Today · 9:00 AM · Seat 12","ar":"اليوم · 9:00 ص · المقعد 12"},"color":"muted","gap":"xs"},{"kind":"divider","gap":"s"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Trip summary","ar":"ملخص الرحلة"},"weight":"bold","gap":"s"},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"A few hours, with a short break.","ar":"بضع ساعات، مع استراحة قصيرة."},"gap":"xs"}]}]}},{"id":"digits","text":{"en":"Write the times as digits","ar":"اكتب الأوقات بالأرقام"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rehla","name":{"en":"Rehla","ar":"رحلة"},"color":"#7048E8","icon":"bus","domain":"rehla.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Review your trip","ar":"راجع رحلتك"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Pay EGP 180","ar":"ادفع 180 جنيهًا"}}],"blocks":[{"kind":"card","blocks":[{"kind":"row","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Cairo → Alexandria","ar":"القاهرة ← الإسكندرية"}},{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"EGP 180","ar":"180 جنيه"}}]},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Today · 9:00 AM · Seat 12","ar":"اليوم · 9:00 ص · المقعد 12"},"color":"muted","gap":"xs"},{"kind":"divider","gap":"s"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Trip summary","ar":"ملخص الرحلة"},"weight":"bold","gap":"s"},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"About 4 h 30 min, with 1 stop of 20 min.","ar":"نحو 4 ساعات و30 دقيقة، مع توقّف واحد مدته 20 دقيقة."},"gap":"xs"}]}]}}],"answer":["digits"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P15-013","when":["bold"],"feedback":{"en":"Bold words still read slower than digits. \"4 h 30 min\" is faster to spot than \"four and a half hours\".","ar":"الكلمات بخط Bold ما زالت أبطأ في القراءة من الأرقام. و«4 ساعات و30 دقيقة» أسرع في الرؤية من «أربع ساعات ونصف»."}},{"id":"MC-P15-010","when":["vague"],"feedback":{"en":"\"A few hours\" hides the real length. People planning their day need the exact time.","ar":"«بضع ساعات» تُخفي المدة الحقيقية. ومن يخطّط ليومه يحتاج الوقت الدقيق."}}],"explain":{"en":"From Lesson 2: digits stand out when people scan for a fact, like how long a trip takes.","ar":"من الدرس 2: الأرقام تبرز حين يبحث الناس عن معلومة، مثل مدة الرحلة."},"speaker":"rami"}]}$uxg$::jsonb),
  ($uxg$P15-U03-L01$uxg$, $uxg$43c2a090e0d610aac7259c3913592842879ba2f4cff85dcfd9fb8ef46449c638$uxg$, $uxg${"id":"P15-U03-L01","mode":"lesson","minutes":7,"title":{"en":"Hear the tone","ar":"اسمع النبرة"},"summary":{"en":"Tune a banking app's messages on 4 tone scales, and keep them friendly without losing trust.","ar":"اضبط رسائل تطبيق بنكي على مقاييس النبرة الأربعة، واجعلها ودّية دون أن تفقد الثقة."},"speaker":"sara","review_labels":{"MC-P15-016":{"en":"Casual doesn't have to mean funny","ar":"الودّي لا يعني بالضرورة المضحك"},"MC-P15-017":{"en":"Serious doesn't have to be cold and formal","ar":"الجاد ليس بالضرورة باردًا ورسميًا"},"MC-P15-018":{"en":"A playful tone can cost trust on serious topics","ar":"النبرة المرحة قد تُفقدك الثقة في المواضيع الجادة"},"MC-P15-019":{"en":"A long list of tone words is hard to follow","ar":"قائمة طويلة من كلمات النبرة يصعب اتباعها"}},"steps":[{"id":"S01","type":"card","part":"hook","title":{"en":"Same message, different feeling","ar":"نفس الرسالة، وشعور مختلف"},"body":{"en":"I'm a product designer on a banking app. Our marketing team says our text is boring and wants it to be \"fun\".\n\nBut some people say our new error message feels rude. I need a way to talk about tone that's clearer than \"fun\" or \"boring\".","ar":"أنا مصممة منتجات في تطبيق بنكي. وفريق التسويق يقول إن نصوصنا مملّة، ويريدها «ممتعة».\n\nلكن بعض الناس يقولون إن رسالة الخطأ الجديدة تبدو غير مهذّبة. أحتاج طريقة للحديث عن النبرة أوضح من «ممتع» و«ممل»."},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rasid","name":{"en":"Rasid","ar":"رصيد"},"color":"#1C3D6E","icon":"bank","domain":"rasid.example"},"appbar":{"logo":true},"tabbar":{"active":0,"items":[{"icon":"wallet","text":{"en":"Accounts","ar":"الحسابات"}},{"icon":"arrows-left-right","text":{"en":"Transfers","ar":"التحويلات"}},{"icon":"credit-card","text":{"en":"Cards","ar":"البطاقات"}},{"icon":"user","text":{"en":"Profile","ar":"حسابي"}}]},"overlay":{"type":"dialog","blocks":[{"kind":"icon","icon":"warning-circle","size":"l","color":"red"},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"What did you do?! You broke it! 😜 (Just kidding. We're having a problem on our side.)","ar":"ماذا فعلت؟! لقد كسرته! 😜 (نمزح فقط. عندنا مشكلة من جهتنا.)"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"OK","ar":"حسنًا"},"gap":"m"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"wallet","text":{"en":"Current account","ar":"الحساب الجاري"},"value":{"en":"EGP 12,480","ar":"12,480 جنيه"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"piggy-bank","text":{"en":"Savings","ar":"حساب التوفير"},"value":{"en":"EGP 40,000","ar":"40,000 جنيه"}}]}},{"id":"S02","type":"choose","skill":"SK-P15-U03-01","part":"try","rules":["R12"],"value":{"en":"Try first. Four Dimensions of Tone (NN/g): the \"You broke it! (Just kidding)\" error message is their example of a casual, funny, irreverent and enthusiastic tone.","ar":"جرّب أولًا. أبعاد النبرة الأربعة (NN/g): رسالة الخطأ «لقد كسرته! (نمزح فقط)» هي مثالهم على نبرة ودّية ومضحكة وساخرة ومتحمّسة."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/tone-of-voice-dimensions/","quote":"This attempt at humor makes the copy much more casual, funny, irreverent, and enthusiastic."},"prompt":{"en":"Look at the error message in my app. Which words describe its tone best?","ar":"انظر إلى رسالة الخطأ في تطبيقي. أي كلمات تصف نبرتها أفضل وصف؟"},"options":[{"id":"formal","text":{"en":"Formal and serious","ar":"رسمية وجادة"}},{"id":"calm","text":{"en":"Respectful and matter-of-fact","ar":"محترمة ومحايدة"}},{"id":"playful","text":{"en":"Casual, funny and a bit irreverent","ar":"ودّية ومضحكة وساخرة قليلًا"}}],"answer":["playful"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P15-016","when":["formal","calm"],"feedback":{"en":"Look at \"You broke it!\" and the 😜. The message jokes and teases, so it is far from formal or matter-of-fact.","ar":"انظر إلى «لقد كسرته!» والوجه 😜. الرسالة تمزح وتشاكس، فهي بعيدة عن الرسمية والحياد."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Is the message trying to make people laugh?","ar":"هل تحاول الرسالة أن تُضحك الناس؟"},{"en":"\"You broke it!\" teases the reader. That's not respectful or formal.","ar":"«لقد كسرته!» تشاكس القارئ. وهذا ليس محترمًا ولا رسميًا."}],"correct":{"en":"Right. It jokes, it teases, and it's very casual.","ar":"صحيح. تمزح، وتشاكس، وودّية جدًا."},"explain":{"en":"Naming the tone is the first step. Next, you can decide if this tone fits a bank.","ar":"تسمية النبرة هي الخطوة الأولى. بعدها يمكنك أن تقرّر هل تناسب هذه النبرة بنكًا."}},{"id":"S03","type":"card","part":"concept","icons":["slider","ear","person","ok"],"title":{"en":"Tone has 4 scales","ar":"للنبرة أربعة مقاييس"},"body":{"en":"Tone is how your text feels: what it tells people about how you feel about the message. Each text sits somewhere on 4 scales:\n\n- **Formal ↔ casual**\n- **Serious ↔ funny**\n- **Respectful ↔ irreverent** (teasing or mocking)\n- **Matter-of-fact ↔ enthusiastic**\n\nYou can move one scale and keep the others. For example, \"Sorry, we're having a problem on our side\" is more casual than \"We apologize for the inconvenience\", and still serious.\n\nCasual is not the same as funny, and serious is not the same as cold.","ar":"النبرة (Tone) هي إحساس النص: ما يخبر به الناس عن شعورك تجاه الرسالة. وكل نص يقع في مكان ما على 4 مقاييس:\n\n- **رسمي ↔ ودّي**\n- **جاد ↔ مضحك**\n- **محترم ↔ ساخر** (يشاكس أو يستهزئ)\n- **محايد ↔ متحمّس**\n\nيمكنك تحريك مقياس واحد وإبقاء الباقي كما هو. مثلًا، «عذرًا، عندنا مشكلة من جهتنا» أكثر ودًّا من «نعتذر عن الإزعاج»، وما زالت جادة.\n\nالودّي ليس هو المضحك، والجاد ليس هو البارد."}},{"id":"S04","type":"choose","skill":"SK-P15-U03-01","part":"guided","rules":["R06"],"value":{"en":"Four Dimensions of Tone (NN/g): \"We're sorry, but we're experiencing a problem on our end\" is still serious, respectful and matter-of-fact, but more casual than the formal apology.","ar":"أبعاد النبرة الأربعة (NN/g): «نأسف، عندنا مشكلة من جهتنا» ما زالت جادة ومحترمة ومحايدة، لكنها أكثر ودًّا من الاعتذار الرسمي."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/tone-of-voice-dimensions/","quote":"The message is still serious, respectful, and matter-of-fact. But the message becomes more casual with a few small changes"},"scenario":{"en":"Our old error message says: \"We sincerely apologize. The service is currently unavailable.\" I want it to sound more casual, but still serious.","ar":"رسالة الخطأ القديمة تقول: «نعتذر بشدّة. الخدمة غير متاحة حاليًا.» وأريدها أكثر ودًّا، لكن جادة."},"prompt":{"en":"Which version is more casual, and still serious and respectful?","ar":"أي نسخة أكثر ودًّا، وما زالت جادة ومحترمة؟"},"options":[{"id":"casual","text":{"en":"\"Sorry, we're having a problem on our side. Try again in a few minutes.\"","ar":"«عذرًا، عندنا مشكلة من جهتنا. حاول مرة أخرى بعد دقائق.»"}},{"id":"oops","text":{"en":"\"Oopsie! 🙈 Our app needs a nap. Back soon!\"","ar":"«أوبس! 🙈 تطبيقنا يحتاج قيلولة. سنعود قريبًا!»"}},{"id":"stiff","text":{"en":"\"Please be advised that the service is temporarily unavailable.\"","ar":"«نحيطكم علمًا بأن الخدمة غير متاحة مؤقتًا.»"}}],"answer":["casual"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P15-016","when":["oops"],"feedback":{"en":"This is casual, but it also became funny. You moved two scales, not one.","ar":"هذه ودّية، لكنها أصبحت مضحكة أيضًا. حرّكت مقياسين، لا مقياسًا واحدًا."}},{"id":"MC-P15-017","when":["stiff"],"feedback":{"en":"\"Please be advised\" is even more formal than before. It moved the wrong way.","ar":"«نحيطكم علمًا» أكثر رسمية من قبل. فقد تحرّكت في الاتجاه الخطأ."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Casual means plain, everyday words. It doesn't mean jokes.","ar":"الودّي يعني كلمات بسيطة يومية. لا يعني النكات."},{"en":"Pick the version you'd say to a customer at the bank counter.","ar":"اختر النسخة التي تقولها لعميل أمامك في البنك."}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Plain words make it casual. No joke needed.","ar":"صحيح. الكلمات البسيطة تجعلها ودّية. دون حاجة لنكتة."},"explain":{"en":"Small changes, like \"sorry\" instead of \"we sincerely apologize\", move one scale and leave the rest.","ar":"تغييرات صغيرة، مثل «عذرًا» بدل «نعتذر بشدّة»، تحرّك مقياسًا واحدًا وتترك الباقي."},"speaker":"sara"},{"id":"S05","type":"compare","skill":"SK-P15-U03-03","part":"contrast","confidence":true,"rules":["R11"],"value":{"en":"Contrast: formal vs casual-but-serious. Tone of Voice and Users (NN/g): the more casual bank was rated friendlier and more trustworthy than its formal twin; serious doesn't have to be cold and formal.","ar":"مقارنة: رسمي مقابل ودّي وجاد. النبرة والمستخدمون (NN/g): البنك الأكثر ودًّا قُيّم بأنه ألطف وأجدر بالثقة من نظيره الرسمي؛ فالجاد لا يجب أن يكون باردًا ورسميًا."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/tone-voice-users/","quote":"Serious doesn't necessarily have to be cold and formal."},"scenario":{"en":"We wrote two versions of the page for our free current account.","ar":"كتبنا نسختين لصفحة الحساب الجاري المجاني."},"prompt":{"en":"Which version will most customers find both friendly and trustworthy?","ar":"أيّ نسخة ودّية وجديرة بالثقة معًا؟"},"a":{"label":{"en":"A: Formal words and long nouns.","ar":"A: كلمات رسمية وأسماء طويلة."},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rasid","name":{"en":"Rasid","ar":"رصيد"},"color":"#1C3D6E","icon":"bank","domain":"rasid.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"rasid.example/accounts/current","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Accounts","ar":"الحسابات"},{"en":"Cards","ar":"البطاقات"},{"en":"Insurance","ar":"التأمين"}],"active":0,"actions":[{"icon":"user"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"bank-card","size":"m"},{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Current account","ar":"الحساب الجاري"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"Account holders are entitled to complimentary online services and the issuance of a debit card without charge.","ar":"يحقّ لأصحاب الحسابات الحصول على خدمات إلكترونية مجانية وإصدار بطاقة خصم دون رسوم."},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"row","gap":"m","blocks":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Open an account","ar":"افتح حسابًا"}},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Compare accounts","ar":"قارن الحسابات"},"style":"outline"}]}]}},"b":{"label":{"en":"B: Plain, everyday words, with no jokes.","ar":"B: كلمات بسيطة يومية، دون نكات."},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rasid","name":{"en":"Rasid","ar":"رصيد"},"color":"#1C3D6E","icon":"bank","domain":"rasid.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"rasid.example/accounts/current","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Accounts","ar":"الحسابات"},{"en":"Cards","ar":"البطاقات"},{"en":"Insurance","ar":"التأمين"}],"active":0,"actions":[{"icon":"user"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"bank-card","size":"m"},{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Current account","ar":"الحساب الجاري"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"Everything you need from a bank: online banking, the app and a debit card. All free.","ar":"كل ما تحتاجه من البنك: خدمات الإنترنت والتطبيق وبطاقة خصم. وكلها مجانية."},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"row","gap":"m","blocks":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Open an account","ar":"افتح حسابًا"}},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Compare accounts","ar":"قارن الحسابات"},"style":"outline"}]}]}},"answer":"b","reason":{"prompt":{"en":"Why does B do better?","ar":"لماذا B أفضل؟"},"options":[{"id":"plain","text":{"en":"Plain words feel approachable, and B still talks seriously about money","ar":"الكلمات البسيطة تبدو قريبة، وB ما زالت تتحدّث عن المال بجدّية"}},{"id":"short","text":{"en":"Shorter text always earns more trust","ar":"النص الأقصر يكسب ثقة أكبر دائمًا"}},{"id":"free","text":{"en":"Only B says the services are free","ar":"B وحدها تقول إن الخدمات مجانية"}}],"answer":["plain"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P15-017","when":["short","free"],"feedback":{"en":"Both say it's free. The difference is the tone: B is casual but still serious.","ar":"الاثنتان تقولان إنها مجانية. الفرق في النبرة: B ودّية لكنها ما زالت جادة."}}]},"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P15-017","when":["a"],"feedback":{"en":"Formal words can feel cold and hard to read. Many people find this kind of bank text dull, even intimidating.","ar":"الكلمات الرسمية قد تبدو باردة وصعبة القراءة. وكثيرون يجدون هذا النوع من نصوص البنوك مملًا، بل مخيفًا."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Which one would you understand on your first read?","ar":"أي واحدة ستفهمها من القراءة الأولى؟"},{"en":"Neither one jokes. Look at how formal the words are.","ar":"لا تمزح أيّ منهما. انظر إلى مدى رسمية الكلمات."}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Casual and serious can go together.","ar":"صحيح. الودّ والجدّية يمكن أن يجتمعا."},"explain":{"en":"Even a bank can use plain, friendly words. You don't need formal words to sound trustworthy.","ar":"حتى البنك يمكنه أن يستخدم كلمات بسيطة وودّية. لا تحتاج كلمات رسمية لتبدو جديرًا بالثقة."},"speaker":"sara"},{"id":"S06","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P15-U03-03","part":"guided","rules":["R06"],"value":{"en":"Tone of Voice and Users (NN/g): the playful car-insurance page was rated friendlier but less trustworthy; the friendliness and irreverence undermined trust and professionalism.","ar":"النبرة والمستخدمون (NN/g): صفحة تأمين السيارات المرحة قُيّمت بأنها ألطف لكن أقل جدارة بالثقة؛ فالودّ الزائد والسخرية أضعفا الثقة والاحترافية."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/tone-voice-users/","quote":"the friendliness and irreverence actually undermined users' perceptions of trustworthiness and professionalism."},"scenario":{"en":"Our bank now sells car insurance too. Marketing wrote the first line of the page.","ar":"بنكنا يبيع الآن تأمين السيارات أيضًا. وكتب فريق التسويق أول سطر في الصفحة."},"prompt":{"en":"Tap each option to see the change. Which line keeps it friendly and makes people trust us with their car?","ar":"اضغط على كل خيار لترى التغيير. أيّ سطر يبقى ودّيًا ويجعل الناس يأتمنوننا على سياراتهم؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rasid","name":{"en":"Rasid","ar":"رصيد"},"color":"#1C3D6E","icon":"bank","domain":"rasid.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Insurance","ar":"التأمين"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Get a quote","ar":"اطلب عرض سعر"}}],"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"car","size":"m"},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Car insurance","ar":"تأمين السيارات"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"Our customers are a happy bunch 😎 Crashed your car? Who cares, we've got you!","ar":"عملاؤنا مجموعة سعيدة 😎 صدمت سيارتك؟ ولا يهمّك، نحن معك!"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"From EGP 350","ar":"من 350 جنيهًا"},"per":{"en":"/ month","ar":"/ شهر"},"gap":"m"}]},"options":[{"id":"more","text":{"en":"Add more jokes and emojis","ar":"أضف نكاتًا ورموزًا تعبيرية أكثر"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rasid","name":{"en":"Rasid","ar":"رصيد"},"color":"#1C3D6E","icon":"bank","domain":"rasid.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Insurance","ar":"التأمين"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Get a quote","ar":"اطلب عرض سعر"}}],"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"car","size":"m"},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Car insurance","ar":"تأمين السيارات"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"Our customers are a happy bunch 😎🚗💥 Crashed your car? LOL, who cares, we've got you! 🤣","ar":"عملاؤنا مجموعة سعيدة 😎🚗💥 صدمت سيارتك؟ هههه ولا يهمّك، نحن معك! 🤣"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"From EGP 350","ar":"من 350 جنيهًا"},"per":{"en":"/ month","ar":"/ شهر"},"gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"stiff","text":{"en":"Make it formal","ar":"اجعله رسميًا"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rasid","name":{"en":"Rasid","ar":"رصيد"},"color":"#1C3D6E","icon":"bank","domain":"rasid.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Insurance","ar":"التأمين"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Get a quote","ar":"اطلب عرض سعر"}}],"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"car","size":"m"},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Car insurance","ar":"تأمين السيارات"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"Policyholders are entitled to claim settlement in accordance with the applicable terms and conditions.","ar":"يحقّ لحاملي الوثائق تسوية المطالبات وفقًا للشروط والأحكام المعمول بها."},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"From EGP 350","ar":"من 350 جنيهًا"},"per":{"en":"/ month","ar":"/ شهر"},"gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"warm","text":{"en":"Keep it casual, drop the jokes","ar":"أبقِه ودّيًا، واحذف النكات"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rasid","name":{"en":"Rasid","ar":"رصيد"},"color":"#1C3D6E","icon":"bank","domain":"rasid.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Insurance","ar":"التأمين"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Get a quote","ar":"اطلب عرض سعر"}}],"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"car","size":"m"},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Car insurance","ar":"تأمين السيارات"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"If you have an accident, report it in the app. We'll guide you through every step of your claim.","ar":"إن تعرّضت لحادث، أبلغ عنه في التطبيق. وسنرشدك في كل خطوة من مطالبتك."},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"From EGP 350","ar":"من 350 جنيهًا"},"per":{"en":"/ month","ar":"/ شهر"},"gap":"m"}]}}],"answer":["warm"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P15-018","when":["more"],"feedback":{"en":"More jokes make it feel even less safe. People don't expect insurance to be fun. They want to know we'll help.","ar":"نكات أكثر تجعلها تبدو أقل أمانًا. الناس لا ينتظرون من التأمين أن يكون ممتعًا، بل يريدون أن يعرفوا أننا سنساعدهم."}},{"id":"MC-P15-017","when":["stiff"],"feedback":{"en":"Serious, but cold and hard to read. People still don't know what to do after an accident.","ar":"جادة، لكنها باردة وصعبة القراءة. والناس ما زالوا لا يعرفون ماذا يفعلون بعد الحادث."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Think of someone who just had an accident. What would they want to read?","ar":"فكّر في شخص تعرّض لحادث للتو. ماذا يريد أن يقرأ؟"},{"en":"Look for the version that's friendly, but doesn't joke about a crash.","ar":"ابحث عن النسخة الودّية التي لا تمزح بشأن حادث."}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Friendly and serious: people trust it.","ar":"صحيح. ودّية وجادة: والناس يثقون بها."},"explain":{"en":"Jokes about money, health or safety can make people trust you less. Keep the warmth, lose the jokes.","ar":"النكات عن المال أو الصحة أو الأمان قد تجعل الناس يثقون بك أقل. أبقِ الدفء، واحذف النكات."},"speaker":"sara"},{"id":"S07","type":"choose","skill":"SK-P15-U03-04","part":"guided","rules":["R06"],"value":{"en":"Four Dimensions of Tone (NN/g): refine the tone with a handful of tone words, not more, so guidelines stay easy to follow; add anti-tone words for tones to avoid.","ar":"أبعاد النبرة الأربعة (NN/g): حدّد النبرة بعدد قليل من الكلمات، لا أكثر، حتى تبقى الإرشادات سهلة الاتباع؛ وأضف كلمات للنبرات التي تريد تجنّبها."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/tone-of-voice-dimensions/","quote":"Avoid choosing more than a handful of tone words, to keep the desired tone guidelines easy to follow."},"scenario":{"en":"I'm writing a one-page tone guide so every writer on the app sounds like us.","ar":"أكتب دليلًا للنبرة في صفحة واحدة، حتى يكتب كل من يكتب للتطبيق بصوتنا نفسه."},"prompt":{"en":"Which guide will writers find easiest to follow?","ar":"أيّ دليل يسهل على الكتّاب تذكّره واتباعه؟"},"options":[{"id":"one","text":{"en":"One word: \"Fun\"","ar":"كلمة واحدة: «ممتع»"}},{"id":"few","text":{"en":"\"We sound: friendly, clear, calm. We never sound: silly, stiff.\"","ar":"«نبدو: ودّيين، واضحين، هادئين. ولا نبدو أبدًا: سخيفين، متكلّفين.»"}},{"id":"many","text":{"en":"A list of 20 words: fun, bold, witty, smart, cool, warm, quirky…","ar":"قائمة من 20 كلمة: ممتع، جريء، ذكي، لطيف، دافئ، غريب…"}}],"answer":["few"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P15-019","when":["many"],"feedback":{"en":"Twenty words pull writers in twenty directions, and some clash, like \"bold\" and \"calm\".","ar":"عشرون كلمة تشدّ الكتّاب في عشرين اتجاهًا، وبعضها يتعارض، مثل «جريء» و«هادئ»."}},{"id":"MC-P15-016","when":["one"],"feedback":{"en":"\"Fun\" alone tells writers to joke everywhere, even in an error about someone's money.","ar":"«ممتع» وحدها تطلب من الكتّاب المزاح في كل مكان، حتى في خطأ يخصّ أموال أحدهم."}}],"hints":[{"en":"A guide works when writers can remember it.","ar":"الدليل ينجح حين يستطيع الكتّاب تذكّره."},{"en":"It also helps to say what you don't want to sound like.","ar":"ومن المفيد أيضًا أن تقول كيف لا تريد أن تبدو."}],"correct":{"en":"Right. A few words to aim for, and a few to avoid.","ar":"صحيح. كلمات قليلة تسعى إليها، وكلمات قليلة تتجنّبها."},"explain":{"en":"A short list is easy to remember. The \"never\" words stop writers from going too far.","ar":"القائمة القصيرة سهلة التذكّر. وكلمات «لا نبدو أبدًا» تمنع الكتّاب من المبالغة."},"speaker":"sara"},{"id":"S08","type":"choose","skill":"SK-P15-U03-01","part":"independent","speaker":"youssef","rules":["R14"],"value":{"en":"New case. Four Dimensions of Tone (NN/g): you can move the enthusiasm scale on its own; adding \"Oops!\" made a message more enthusiastic, and irreverence is a separate scale.","ar":"حالة جديدة. أبعاد النبرة الأربعة (NN/g): يمكنك تحريك مقياس الحماس وحده؛ فإضافة «أوبس!» جعلت الرسالة أكثر حماسًا، أما السخرية فمقياس منفصل."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/tone-of-voice-dimensions/","quote":"The addition of \"Oops!\" makes this copy much more casual and enthusiastic."},"scenario":{"en":"In my shop's app, the message after an order ships says: \"Your order has been shipped.\" I want it to sound more excited, but still respectful.","ar":"في تطبيق متجري، الرسالة بعد شحن الطلب تقول: «تمّ شحن طلبك.» وأريدها أكثر حماسًا، لكن محترمة."},"prompt":{"en":"Which message is more enthusiastic, and still respectful?","ar":"أي رسالة أكثر حماسًا، وما زالت محترمة؟"},"options":[{"id":"finally","text":{"en":"\"Finally! We thought you'd never order 😜 It's on the way.\"","ar":"«أخيرًا! ظننّا أنك لن تطلب أبدًا 😜 طلبك في الطريق.»"}},{"id":"excited","text":{"en":"\"Good news! Your order is on its way 🎉\"","ar":"«خبر سعيد! طلبك في الطريق إليك 🎉»"}},{"id":"record","text":{"en":"\"Shipment dispatched as per your order record.\"","ar":"«تمّ إرسال الشحنة وفقًا لسجل طلبك.»"}}],"answer":["excited"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P15-016","when":["finally"],"feedback":{"en":"It's excited, but it also teases the customer. That moved the respect scale too.","ar":"متحمّسة، لكنها تشاكس العميل أيضًا. فحرّكت مقياس الاحترام كذلك."}},{"id":"MC-P15-017","when":["record"],"feedback":{"en":"This is more formal and even less excited than before.","ar":"هذه أكثر رسمية، وأقل حماسًا من قبل."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. More excitement, same respect.","ar":"صحيح. حماس أكثر، ونفس الاحترام."},"explain":{"en":"Move only the scale you want to change. Teasing is a different scale from excitement.","ar":"حرّك المقياس الذي تريد تغييره فقط. فالمشاكسة مقياس مختلف عن الحماس."}},{"id":"S09","type":"card","part":"recap","icons":["slider","ear","ok","person"],"title":{"en":"What you did","ar":"ماذا تعلّمت"},"body":{"en":"- **Named the tone:** \"You broke it! 😜\" is casual, funny and irreverent.\n- **Moved one scale:** \"Sorry, we're having a problem on our side\" is casual and still serious.\n- **Serious, not cold:** plain words won both friendliness and trust for the bank.\n- **No jokes on serious topics:** you kept the car-insurance page warm but not silly.\n- **A short tone guide:** a few words to aim for, and a few to avoid.\n\nNext lesson: change the tone to fit how people feel.","ar":"- **سمّيت النبرة:** «لقد كسرته! 😜» ودّية ومضحكة وساخرة.\n- **حرّكت مقياسًا واحدًا:** «عذرًا، عندنا مشكلة من جهتنا» ودّية وما زالت جادة.\n- **جاد لا بارد:** الكلمات البسيطة كسبت الودّ والثقة معًا للبنك.\n- **لا نكات في المواضيع الجادة:** أبقيت صفحة تأمين السيارات دافئة دون سخافة.\n- **دليل نبرة قصير:** كلمات قليلة تسعى إليها، وكلمات قليلة تتجنّبها.\n\nالدرس التالي: غيّر النبرة لتناسب شعور الناس."}}]}$uxg$::jsonb),
  ($uxg$P15-U03-L02$uxg$, $uxg$593ce5add8e48a1f298eaa69453d7cca62fe84afa4df45be2db0ab9bd56bca69$uxg$, $uxg${"id":"P15-U03-L02","mode":"lesson","minutes":7,"title":{"en":"Fit the tone to the moment","ar":"اجعل النبرة تناسب اللحظة"},"summary":{"en":"Rewrite a clinic app's messages so the tone fits how patients feel, from worry to good news.","ar":"أعد كتابة رسائل تطبيق عيادة لتناسب نبرتها شعور المرضى، من القلق إلى الأخبار السعيدة."},"speaker":"nour","review_labels":{"MC-P15-017":{"en":"Serious doesn't have to be cold and formal","ar":"الجاد ليس بالضرورة باردًا ورسميًا"},"MC-P15-020":{"en":"Jokes irritate people who are worried or frustrated","ar":"النكات تزعج من هو قلق أو منزعج"},"MC-P15-021":{"en":"One voice doesn't mean the same tone everywhere","ar":"الصوت الواحد لا يعني النبرة نفسها في كل مكان"},"MC-P15-022":{"en":"You can't predict how users hear your tone","ar":"لا يمكنك أن تتوقّع كيف يسمع المستخدمون نبرتك"}},"steps":[{"id":"S01","type":"card","part":"hook","title":{"en":"Cheerful everywhere?","ar":"مرح في كل مكان؟"},"body":{"en":"Our clinic hired a new writer. She made every message in our app cheerful, with lots of emojis.\n\nPatients liked the booking screens. But some were upset by the surgery page and the error messages. Now I need to decide where cheerful fits, and where it doesn't.","ar":"عيّنت عيادتنا كاتبة جديدة. فجعلت كل رسالة في تطبيقنا مرحة، مع رموز تعبيرية كثيرة.\n\nأحبّ المرضى شاشات الحجز. لكن بعضهم انزعج من صفحة العمليات ومن رسائل الخطأ. والآن عليّ أن أقرّر أين يناسب المرح، وأين لا يناسب."},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Your surgery","ar":"عمليتك"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"clinic","size":"s"},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Before your surgery","ar":"قبل عمليتك"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"calendar-blank","text":{"en":"Thursday 13 March · 8:00 AM","ar":"الخميس 13 مارس · 8:00 ص"},"sub":{"en":"Day surgery, floor 2","ar":"جراحة اليوم الواحد، الدور 2"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"Surgery day!! 🎉🥳 No snacks, no sneaky coffee ☕😅 for 8 hours!","ar":"يوم العملية!! 🎉🥳 لا وجبات خفيفة، ولا قهوة خِلسة ☕😅 لمدة 8 ساعات!"},"gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"S02","type":"choose","skill":"SK-P15-U03-02","part":"try","rules":["R12"],"value":{"en":"Try first. Tone of Voice and Users (NN/g): nervous patients preparing for surgery don't want a formal tone; the casual, warm hospital without humor reassured users in a stressful situation.","ar":"جرّب أولًا. النبرة والمستخدمون (NN/g): المرضى القلقون قبل العملية لا يريدون نبرة رسمية؛ والمستشفى الودّي الدافئ دون مزاح طمأن المستخدمين في موقف مقلق."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/tone-voice-users/","quote":"If your users are nervous patients preparing for surgery, do you really think they'd prefer a formal tone?"},"prompt":{"en":"Patients read this page the night before surgery, often worried. Which version fits them best?","ar":"يقرأ المرضى هذه الصفحة ليلة العملية، وكثيرًا ما يكونون قلقين. أي نسخة تناسبهم أكثر؟"},"options":[{"id":"formal","text":{"en":"\"Patients are required to abstain from food and drink for a period of 8 hours prior to the procedure.\"","ar":"«يتعيّن على المرضى الامتناع عن الطعام والشراب لمدة 8 ساعات قبل الإجراء.»"}},{"id":"warm","text":{"en":"\"Don't eat or drink for 8 hours before your surgery. We'll be with you at every step.\"","ar":"«لا تأكل ولا تشرب لمدة 8 ساعات قبل عمليتك. وسنكون معك في كل خطوة.»"}},{"id":"fun","text":{"en":"\"No snacks, no sneaky coffee ☕😅 for 8 hours! You got this! 🎉\"","ar":"«لا وجبات خفيفة، ولا قهوة خِلسة ☕😅 لمدة 8 ساعات! أنت قدّها! 🎉»"}}],"answer":["warm"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P15-017","when":["formal"],"feedback":{"en":"Clear, but cold. A worried patient reads \"abstain\" and \"the procedure\" and feels alone.","ar":"واضحة، لكنها باردة. فالمريض القلق يقرأ «الامتناع» و«الإجراء» فيشعر بأنه وحيد."}},{"id":"MC-P15-020","when":["fun"],"feedback":{"en":"Jokes and party emojis can feel like nobody takes their worry seriously.","ar":"النكات ورموز الاحتفال قد تُشعرهم بأن لا أحد يأخذ قلقهم بجدّية."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Think about how a patient feels the night before surgery.","ar":"فكّر في شعور المريض ليلة العملية."},{"en":"Look for a version that's clear, warm, and doesn't joke.","ar":"ابحث عن نسخة واضحة ودافئة ولا تمزح."}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Clear, warm, and no jokes.","ar":"صحيح. واضحة، ودافئة، ودون مزاح."},"explain":{"en":"A worried reader needs calm and kindness. Plain words with a little warmth reassure them.","ar":"القارئ القلق يحتاج الهدوء واللطف. والكلمات البسيطة مع قليل من الدفء تطمئنه."}},{"id":"S03","type":"card","part":"concept","icons":["person","ear","warn","ok"],"title":{"en":"Ask how they feel right now","ar":"اسأل: بماذا يشعرون الآن؟"},"body":{"en":"Before you choose a tone, think about the reader's feelings at that moment.\n\n- **Worried or upset** (surgery, a failed payment, an error): be calm, clear and kind. No jokes.\n- **Happy** (a booking done, good news): a little more excitement is fine.\n- **One voice, many tones:** your brand's personality, its **voice**, stays the same. The **tone** changes with the moment, like a friend who talks differently at a party and at a hospital.\n- **Check, don't guess:** people hear tone differently. Show your text to real users.","ar":"قبل أن تختار النبرة، فكّر في مشاعر القارئ في تلك اللحظة.\n\n- **قلق أو منزعج** (عملية، دفع فشل، خطأ): كن هادئًا وواضحًا ولطيفًا. دون نكات.\n- **سعيد** (حجز تمّ، خبر جيد): لا بأس بحماس أكثر قليلًا.\n- **صوت واحد ونبرات كثيرة:** شخصية علامتك، أي **الصوت (Voice)**، تبقى كما هي. أما **النبرة (Tone)** فتتغيّر مع اللحظة، مثل صديق يتحدّث بطريقة في حفلة وبطريقة أخرى في مستشفى.\n- **تحقّق ولا تخمّن:** الناس يسمعون النبرة بطرق مختلفة. فاعرض نصك على مستخدمين حقيقيين."}},{"id":"S04","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P15-U03-02","part":"guided","rules":["R06"],"value":{"en":"Four Dimensions of Tone (NN/g): if users are frustrated when they reach an error message, or see it often, a humorous tone might be irritating.","ar":"أبعاد النبرة الأربعة (NN/g): إن وصل المستخدمون إلى رسالة الخطأ وهم منزعجون، أو رأوها كثيرًا، فقد تزعجهم النبرة المضحكة."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/tone-of-voice-dimensions/","quote":"If your users are frustrated when they arrive to this error message, or they see it frequently, a humorous tone might be irritating."},"scenario":{"en":"Patients see this error when booking fails. Many see it two or three times in a row.","ar":"يرى المرضى هذا الخطأ حين يفشل الحجز. وكثيرون يرونه مرتين أو ثلاثًا متتالية."},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Book a visit","ar":"احجز زيارة"},"back":true},"overlay":{"type":"dialog","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Oopsie! 🤪","ar":"أوبسي! 🤪"}},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"Our system tripped over its own feet. Hehe, happens to the best of us!","ar":"نظامنا تعثّر بقدميه. هههه، يحدث هذا لأفضل الناس!"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Try again","ar":"حاول مرة أخرى"},"gap":"m"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","avatar":{"text":"Dr Mona Adel","art":"doctor"},"text":{"en":"Dr Mona Adel","ar":"د. منى عادل"},"sub":{"en":"Sunday · 10:30 AM","ar":"الأحد · 10:30 ص"}}],"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"}},"prompt":{"en":"Which message fits patients who have just failed to book, again?","ar":"أيّ رسالة تناسب مرضى فشل حجزهم للتو، مرة أخرى؟"},"options":[{"id":"joke","text":{"en":"Keep the joke, but add \"Try again!\" at the end","ar":"أبقِ النكتة، لكن أضف «حاول مرة أخرى!» في النهاية"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Book a visit","ar":"احجز زيارة"},"back":true},"overlay":{"type":"dialog","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Oopsie! 🤪","ar":"أوبسي! 🤪"}},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"Our system tripped over its own feet. Hehe, happens to the best of us! Try again!","ar":"نظامنا تعثّر بقدميه. هههه، يحدث هذا لأفضل الناس! حاول مرة أخرى!"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Try again","ar":"حاول مرة أخرى"},"gap":"m"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","avatar":{"text":"Dr Mona Adel","art":"doctor"},"text":{"en":"Dr Mona Adel","ar":"د. منى عادل"},"sub":{"en":"Sunday · 10:30 AM","ar":"الأحد · 10:30 ص"}}],"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}},{"id":"legal","text":{"en":"\"Error 503: The requested operation could not be completed.\"","ar":"«خطأ 503: تعذّر إكمال العملية المطلوبة.»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Book a visit","ar":"احجز زيارة"},"back":true},"overlay":{"type":"dialog","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Error 503","ar":"خطأ 503"}},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"The requested operation could not be completed.","ar":"تعذّر إكمال العملية المطلوبة."},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Try again","ar":"حاول مرة أخرى"},"gap":"m"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","avatar":{"text":"Dr Mona Adel","art":"doctor"},"text":{"en":"Dr Mona Adel","ar":"د. منى عادل"},"sub":{"en":"Sunday · 10:30 AM","ar":"الأحد · 10:30 ص"}}],"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}},{"id":"calm","text":{"en":"\"Sorry, we couldn't book your visit. Try again, or call the clinic and we'll book it for you.\"","ar":"«عذرًا، لم نتمكّن من حجز زيارتك. حاول مرة أخرى، أو اتصل بالعيادة وسنحجزها لك.»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Book a visit","ar":"احجز زيارة"},"back":true},"overlay":{"type":"dialog","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Sorry, we couldn't book your visit","ar":"عذرًا، لم نتمكّن من حجز زيارتك"}},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"Try again, or call the clinic and we'll book it for you.","ar":"حاول مرة أخرى، أو اتصل بالعيادة وسنحجزها لك."},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Try again","ar":"حاول مرة أخرى"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Call the clinic","ar":"اتصل بالعيادة"},"icon":"phone","style":"outline","gap":"s"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","avatar":{"text":"Dr Mona Adel","art":"doctor"},"text":{"en":"Dr Mona Adel","ar":"د. منى عادل"},"sub":{"en":"Sunday · 10:30 AM","ar":"الأحد · 10:30 ص"}}],"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}}],"answer":["calm"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P15-020","when":["joke"],"feedback":{"en":"The joke is still there. The third time people see it, it feels like we're laughing at their problem.","ar":"النكتة ما زالت موجودة. وفي المرة الثالثة التي يرونها فيها، يبدو أننا نضحك على مشكلتهم."}},{"id":"MC-P15-017","when":["legal"],"feedback":{"en":"No joke, but now it's cold and full of tech words. Patients still don't know what to do.","ar":"لا نكتة، لكنها الآن باردة ومليئة بكلمات تقنية. والمرضى ما زالوا لا يعرفون ماذا يفعلون."}}],"hints":[{"en":"How do you feel after an app fails you three times?","ar":"بماذا تشعر بعد أن يخذلك تطبيق ثلاث مرات؟"},{"en":"Pick the message that's calm and gives a way out.","ar":"اختر الرسالة الهادئة التي تعطي حلًا."}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Calm, sorry, and a way forward.","ar":"صحيح. هادئة، ومعتذرة، وتعطي خطوة تالية."},"explain":{"en":"In a frustrating moment, a joke irritates. Be calm, say sorry simply, and help.","ar":"في لحظة مزعجة، النكتة تُغضب. كن هادئًا، واعتذر ببساطة، وساعد."},"speaker":"nour"},{"id":"S05","type":"compare","skill":"SK-P15-U03-04","part":"contrast","confidence":true,"rules":["R11"],"value":{"en":"Contrast: same tone everywhere vs one voice with varied tone. Four Dimensions of Tone (NN/g): keep the brand personality consistent, but vary the tone to fit the user's emotional state and the topic.","ar":"مقارنة: نبرة واحدة في كل مكان مقابل صوت واحد بنبرات مختلفة. أبعاد النبرة الأربعة (NN/g): حافظ على شخصية العلامة ثابتة، لكن غيّر النبرة لتناسب حالة المستخدم العاطفية والموضوع."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/tone-of-voice-dimensions/","quote":"Keep your brand personality consistent, but vary the tone to fit the user's emotional state and the topic."},"scenario":{"en":"The writer and I made two sets of messages for the app.","ar":"صنعت أنا والكاتبة مجموعتين من الرسائل للتطبيق."},"prompt":{"en":"Which set keeps one clinic personality and fits each moment?","ar":"أي مجموعة تحافظ على شخصية واحدة للعيادة وتناسب كل لحظة؟"},"a":{"label":{"en":"A: Every message has the same excited tone.","ar":"A: كل الرسائل بنفس النبرة المتحمّسة."},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"screen":"lock","blocks":[{"kind":"notification","title":{"en":"Visit booked","ar":"تمّ الحجز"},"text":{"en":"✅ Visit booked! See you Sunday! 🎉","ar":"✅ تمّ حجز الزيارة! نراك يوم الأحد! 🎉"},"time":{"en":"now","ar":"الآن"}},{"kind":"notification","title":{"en":"Results","ar":"النتائج"},"text":{"en":"🧪 Your test results are ready!! 🥳","ar":"🧪 نتائج تحاليلك جاهزة!! 🥳"},"time":{"en":"1h","ar":"منذ ساعة"}},{"kind":"notification","title":{"en":"Payment","ar":"الدفع"},"text":{"en":"💳 Payment failed! Whoops! 😅","ar":"💳 فشل الدفع! أوبس! 😅"},"time":{"en":"2h","ar":"منذ ساعتين"}}]}},"b":{"label":{"en":"B: The same friendly style, with more excitement in some messages than others.","ar":"B: نفس الأسلوب الودّي، مع حماس أكبر في بعض الرسائل من غيرها."},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"screen":"lock","blocks":[{"kind":"notification","title":{"en":"Visit booked","ar":"تمّ الحجز"},"text":{"en":"✅ Visit booked! See you Sunday 😊","ar":"✅ تمّ حجز الزيارة! نراك يوم الأحد 😊"},"time":{"en":"now","ar":"الآن"}},{"kind":"notification","title":{"en":"Results","ar":"النتائج"},"text":{"en":"🧪 Your test results are ready. Your doctor will go through them with you.","ar":"🧪 نتائج تحاليلك جاهزة. وسيشرحها لك طبيبك."},"time":{"en":"1h","ar":"منذ ساعة"}},{"kind":"notification","title":{"en":"Payment","ar":"الدفع"},"text":{"en":"💳 Your payment didn't go through. Your booking is safe for 24 hours.","ar":"💳 لم يتمّ الدفع. وحجزك محفوظ لمدة 24 ساعة."},"time":{"en":"2h","ar":"منذ ساعتين"}}]}},"answer":"b","reason":{"prompt":{"en":"Why does B fit better?","ar":"لماذا تناسب B أكثر؟"},"options":[{"id":"same","text":{"en":"Writers should use one tone everywhere, so B is more consistent","ar":"على الكتّاب استخدام نبرة واحدة في كل مكان، لذلك B أكثر اتساقًا"}},{"id":"moment","text":{"en":"B sounds like the same clinic, but it doesn't celebrate news that could be bad","ar":"B تبدو صادرة عن العيادة نفسها، لكنها لا تحتفل بخبر قد يكون سيئًا"}},{"id":"emoji","text":{"en":"B uses fewer emojis, and emojis are always wrong","ar":"B تستخدم رموزًا تعبيرية أقل، والرموز التعبيرية خطأ دائمًا"}}],"answer":["moment"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P15-021","when":["same","emoji"],"feedback":{"en":"B still uses an emoji for good news. It keeps one personality and changes the tone for hard moments.","ar":"B ما زالت تستخدم رمزًا تعبيريًا للخبر السعيد. فهي تحافظ على شخصية واحدة وتغيّر النبرة في اللحظات الصعبة."}}]},"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P15-021","when":["a"],"feedback":{"en":"Test results may bring bad news, and a failed payment is stressful. Party emojis there feel wrong.","ar":"نتائج التحاليل قد تحمل خبرًا سيئًا، وفشل الدفع مقلق. ورموز الاحتفال هناك تبدو في غير مكانها."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Read each message as a patient. Which ones could be bad news?","ar":"اقرأ كل رسالة كأنك مريض. أيها قد يكون خبرًا سيئًا؟"},{"en":"Both sets are friendly. Look at what happens in the hard moments.","ar":"المجموعتان ودّيتان. انظر إلى ما يحدث في اللحظات الصعبة."}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Same clinic voice, with a tone that fits each moment.","ar":"صحيح. نفس صوت العيادة، مع نبرة تناسب كل لحظة."},"explain":{"en":"Consistent doesn't mean identical. Keep who you are, and adjust how excited you sound.","ar":"الاتساق (Consistency) لا يعني التطابق. حافظ على شخصيتك، وغيّر مقدار حماسك."},"speaker":"nour"},{"id":"S06","type":"choose","skill":"SK-P15-U03-02","part":"guided","rules":["R06"],"value":{"en":"Tone of Voice and Users (NN/g): casual, conversational and moderately enthusiastic tones performed best overall; a happy moment can carry more enthusiasm.","ar":"النبرة والمستخدمون (NN/g): النبرات الودّية والحوارية والمتحمّسة باعتدال حقّقت أفضل النتائج عمومًا؛ واللحظة السعيدة تحتمل حماسًا أكبر."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/tone-voice-users/","quote":"casual, conversational, and moderately enthusiastic tones performed best"},"scenario":{"en":"Parents get a message when their child's last vaccine dose is done. It's a happy moment for them.","ar":"تصل الأهلَ رسالة حين تكتمل آخر جرعة تطعيم لطفلهم. وهي لحظة سعيدة لهم."},"prompt":{"en":"Which message fits this happy moment?","ar":"أي رسالة تناسب هذه اللحظة السعيدة؟"},"options":[{"id":"happy","text":{"en":"\"All done! Your child's vaccines are up to date 🎉\"","ar":"«انتهينا! تطعيمات طفلك مكتملة 🎉»"}},{"id":"dry","text":{"en":"\"Vaccination record status: complete.\"","ar":"«حالة سجل التطعيم: مكتمل.»"}},{"id":"tease","text":{"en":"\"Phew, that's over! No more tears… until the dentist 😜\"","ar":"«أخيرًا انتهينا! لا مزيد من البكاء… حتى زيارة طبيب الأسنان 😜»"}}],"answer":["happy"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P15-017","when":["dry"],"feedback":{"en":"Correct, but it sounds like a database. Good news can sound happy.","ar":"صحيحة، لكنها تبدو كأنها من قاعدة بيانات. ورسالة الخبر السعيد يمكن أن تكون فرِحة."}},{"id":"MC-P15-020","when":["tease"],"feedback":{"en":"Excited, but it jokes about a child's tears and a future visit. That can annoy parents.","ar":"متحمّسة، لكنها تمزح بشأن بكاء الطفل وزيارة قادمة. وقد يزعج هذا الأهل."}}],"hints":[{"en":"This time, the reader feels good. How much excitement fits?","ar":"هذه المرة، القارئ يشعر بالسعادة. كم من الحماس يناسب؟"},{"en":"Look for excitement without teasing.","ar":"ابحث عن حماس دون مشاكسة."}],"correct":{"en":"Right. A happy moment can sound happy.","ar":"صحيح. في اللحظة السعيدة، يمكن أن تكون الرسالة فرِحة."},"explain":{"en":"Tone moves both ways: calmer for hard moments, warmer and more excited for good ones.","ar":"النبرة تتحرّك في الاتجاهين: أهدأ في اللحظات الصعبة، وأدفأ وأكثر حماسًا في اللحظات الجيدة."},"speaker":"nour"},{"id":"S07","type":"choose","skill":"SK-P15-U03-04","part":"guided","rules":["R06"],"value":{"en":"Four Dimensions of Tone (NN/g): use product-reaction testing to see if users choose tone words that match your target; Tone of Voice and Users: you are not your user, and don't just direct users to talk about tone, or you'll bias them.","ar":"أبعاد النبرة الأربعة (NN/g): استخدم اختبار ردّ الفعل على المنتج لترى هل يختار المستخدمون كلمات تطابق النبرة التي تريدها؛ والنبرة والمستخدمون: أنت لست المستخدم، ولا توجّه المستخدمين مباشرة للحديث عن النبرة حتى لا تؤثّر عليهم."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/tone-of-voice-dimensions/","quote":"Use product-reaction testing to see if your users choose tone words that correspond to your target tone profile."},"scenario":{"en":"We want the new text to sound \"warm\". The writer says it does. A doctor says it sounds childish. We can't agree.","ar":"نريد أن يبدو النص الجديد «دافئًا». الكاتبة تقول إنه كذلك. وطبيب يقول إنه يبدو طفوليًا. ولا نستطيع الاتفاق."},"prompt":{"en":"What's the best way to settle it?","ar":"ما أفضل طريقة لحسم الأمر؟"},"options":[{"id":"boss","text":{"en":"I decide, because I know our patients well","ar":"أقرّر أنا، لأنني أعرف مرضانا جيدًا"}},{"id":"ask","text":{"en":"Ask patients: \"Do you like the tone of this text?\"","ar":"أسأل المرضى: «هل تعجبك نبرة هذا النص؟»"}},{"id":"words","text":{"en":"Show the text to a few patients and ask them to pick, from a list, the words that describe it","ar":"أعرض النص على بعض المرضى وأطلب منهم أن يختاروا من قائمة الكلمات التي تصفه"}}],"answer":["words"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P15-022","when":["boss"],"feedback":{"en":"You're not your patient. People hear tone very differently, so a guess, even a good one, can be off.","ar":"أنت لست مثل مرضاك. والناس يسمعون النبرة بطرق مختلفة جدًا، فقد يخطئ التخمين، حتى لو كان جيدًا."}},{"id":"MC-P15-022","when":["ask"],"feedback":{"en":"This pushes people to talk about tone and invites a polite \"yes\". It doesn't show how they hear it.","ar":"هذا يدفع الناس للحديث عن النبرة، ويدعوهم إلى «نعم» مهذّبة. ولا يُظهر كيف يسمعونها فعلًا."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Who should decide how the text sounds: us, or the people reading it?","ar":"من يجب أن يقرّر كيف يبدو النص: نحن، أم من يقرؤونه؟"},{"en":"Pick the option that lets patients describe it in their own choice of words.","ar":"اختر الخيار الذي يجعل المرضى يصفونه بالكلمات التي يختارونها."}],"correct":{"en":"Right. If patients pick \"warm\", you're on target. If they pick \"childish\", you're not.","ar":"صحيح. إن اختار المرضى «دافئ» فأنت على الطريق الصحيح. وإن اختاروا «طفولي» فلست كذلك."},"explain":{"en":"Let users tell you how the text sounds, without leading them. Then compare their words with your tone guide.","ar":"دع المستخدمين يخبرونك كيف يبدو النص، دون أن توجّههم. ثم قارن كلماتهم بدليل النبرة."},"speaker":"nour"},{"id":"S08","type":"choose","skill":"SK-P15-U03-02","part":"independent","speaker":"youssef","rules":["R14"],"value":{"en":"New case. Tone of Voice and Users (NN/g): humor is extremely risky, because when it fails, you annoy and alienate your users; consider their emotional state.","ar":"حالة جديدة. النبرة والمستخدمون (NN/g): المزاح مخاطرة كبيرة، لأنه حين يفشل يزعج المستخدمين ويُبعدهم؛ فراعِ حالتهم العاطفية."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/tone-voice-users/","quote":"Humor is extremely risky, because when it fails, you annoy and alienate your users."},"scenario":{"en":"A customer's refund from my shop is 5 days late. She has written to us twice, angry. I'm writing the reply.","ar":"تأخّر استرداد مال عميلة من متجري 5 أيام. وكتبت إلينا مرتين وهي غاضبة. وأنا أكتب الرد."},"prompt":{"en":"Which reply fits how she feels?","ar":"أي رد يناسب شعورها؟"},"options":[{"id":"calm","text":{"en":"\"Sorry for the delay with your refund. It will reach your card by Thursday.\"","ar":"«نعتذر عن تأخّر استرداد مالك. سيصل إلى بطاقتك قبل يوم الخميس.»"}},{"id":"joke","text":{"en":"\"Good things come to those who wait 😉 Your refund is on its way!\"","ar":"«الأشياء الجميلة تستحق الانتظار 😉 مالك في الطريق!»"}},{"id":"legal","text":{"en":"\"Refunds are processed in accordance with our returns policy.\"","ar":"«تتمّ معالجة المبالغ المستردّة وفقًا لسياسة الإرجاع.»"}}],"answer":["calm"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P15-020","when":["joke"],"feedback":{"en":"To an angry customer, this sounds like we're laughing at her. It could make things worse.","ar":"للعميلة الغاضبة، يبدو هذا كأننا نضحك عليها. وقد يجعل الأمر أسوأ."}},{"id":"MC-P15-017","when":["legal"],"feedback":{"en":"Cold, and it doesn't say sorry or when the money will arrive.","ar":"باردة، ولا تعتذر ولا تقول متى سيصل المال."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. A simple sorry, and the date she needs.","ar":"صحيح. اعتذار بسيط، والتاريخ الذي تحتاجه."},"explain":{"en":"When people are angry, skip the charm. Say sorry, give the facts, and keep it short.","ar":"حين يكون الناس غاضبين، اترك خفّة الظل. اعتذر، وأعطِ المعلومات، واختصر."}},{"id":"S09","type":"card","part":"recap","icons":["person","ear","ok","warn"],"title":{"en":"What you did","ar":"ماذا تعلّمت"},"body":{"en":"- **Worried readers:** you made the surgery page warm and clear, not formal or silly.\n- **Frustrated readers:** you swapped a joke for a calm sorry and a way forward.\n- **One voice, many tones:** the clinic sounds the same, but calmer for test results and failed payments.\n- **Happy moments:** good news can sound happy.\n- **Check with users:** let patients pick the words that describe your tone.\n\nNext: a skill check on this unit.","ar":"- **قرّاء قلقون:** جعلت صفحة العملية دافئة وواضحة، لا رسمية ولا سخيفة.\n- **قرّاء منزعجون:** استبدلت النكتة باعتذار هادئ وخطوة تالية.\n- **صوت واحد ونبرات كثيرة:** العيادة تبدو هي نفسها، لكن أهدأ مع نتائج التحاليل وفشل الدفع.\n- **لحظات سعيدة:** رسالة الخبر السعيد يمكن أن تكون فرِحة.\n- **تحقّق مع المستخدمين:** دع المرضى يختارون الكلمات التي تصف نبرتك.\n\nالتالي: اختبار مهارات هذه الوحدة."}}]}$uxg$::jsonb),
  ($uxg$P15-U03-L03$uxg$, $uxg$4c6c9a5a28c2b96c6206172524e68e7f241d633659e19319301376351a63c2cc$uxg$, $uxg${"id":"P15-U03-L03","mode":"check","minutes":5,"title":{"en":"Skill check: pick the right tone","ar":"اختبار المهارة: اختر النبرة المناسبة"},"summary":{"en":"Choose the tone for four gym app messages on your own, from a pep talk to a failed payment.","ar":"اختر بنفسك نبرة أربع رسائل في تطبيق نادٍ رياضي، من رسالة تشجيع إلى دفع فشل."},"speaker":"hana","steps":[{"id":"S01","type":"card","part":"hook","title":{"en":"Hana's gym app","ar":"تطبيق النادي الذي تملكه هناء"},"body":{"en":"I own a gym, and our app talks to members every day: reminders, payments, and the rules for canceling.\n\nYour job: pick the right tone for four messages.\n\nThis is a skill check: there are no hints, and you'll see your result at the end.","ar":"أملك ناديًا رياضيًا، وتطبيقنا يخاطب الأعضاء كل يوم: تذكيرات، ومدفوعات، وقواعد إلغاء الاشتراك.\n\nمهمّتك: اختر النبرة المناسبة لأربع رسائل.\n\nهذا اختبار مهارة: لا توجد تلميحات، وسترى نتيجتك في النهاية."},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"logo":true},"tabbar":{"active":0,"items":[{"icon":"house","text":{"en":"Home","ar":"الرئيسية"}},{"icon":"calendar-blank","text":{"en":"Classes","ar":"الحصص"}},{"icon":"identification-card","text":{"en":"My plan","ar":"اشتراكي"}},{"icon":"user","text":{"en":"Account","ar":"حسابي"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"card","art":"gym","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Spinning · 7 AM","ar":"دراجات · 7 ص"}},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Tomorrow · Coach Omar","ar":"غدًا · المدرب عمر"},"color":"muted"}]},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"identification-card","text":{"en":"Monthly plan","ar":"الاشتراك الشهري"},"sub":{"en":"Renews 1 April","ar":"يتجدّد 1 أبريل"},"value":{"en":"EGP 850","ar":"850 جنيه"},"gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"S02","type":"choose","skill":"SK-P15-U03-01","part":"check","rules":["R19"],"value":{"en":"Skill check. Four Dimensions of Tone (NN/g): every piece of copy sits somewhere on four scales: formal-casual, serious-funny, respectful-irreverent, matter-of-fact-enthusiastic.","ar":"اختبار مهارة. أبعاد النبرة الأربعة (NN/g): كل نص يقع في مكان ما على أربعة مقاييس: رسمي-ودّي، جاد-مضحك، محترم-ساخر، محايد-متحمّس."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/tone-of-voice-dimensions/","quote":"Think of each of the four dimensions as a spectrum"},"scenario":{"en":"Our morning reminder says: \"Rise and shine, champ! 💪🔥 Your 7 AM class is waiting!\"","ar":"تذكيرنا الصباحي يقول: «انهض يا بطل! 💪🔥 حصتك في السابعة صباحًا بانتظارك!»"},"prompt":{"en":"Which words describe the tone of this reminder?","ar":"أي كلمات تصف نبرة هذا التذكير؟"},"options":[{"id":"formal","text":{"en":"Formal and matter-of-fact","ar":"رسمية ومحايدة"}},{"id":"cold","text":{"en":"Serious and irreverent","ar":"جادة وساخرة"}},{"id":"hype","text":{"en":"Casual, enthusiastic and respectful","ar":"ودّية ومتحمّسة ومحترمة"}}],"answer":["hype"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P15-016","when":["formal","cold"],"feedback":{"en":"\"Champ\", the emojis and the exclamation marks make it casual and excited. It cheers people on; it doesn't mock them.","ar":"«يا بطل» والرموز التعبيرية وعلامات التعجّب تجعلها ودّية ومتحمّسة. وهي تشجّع الناس، ولا تسخر منهم."}}],"explain":{"en":"From Lesson 1: name each scale on its own. Excited and casual can still be respectful.","ar":"من الدرس 1: سمِّ كل مقياس وحده. فالنبرة المتحمّسة الودّية يمكن أن تبقى محترمة."},"speaker":"hana"},{"id":"S03","type":"choose","skill":"SK-P15-U03-02","part":"check","rules":["R19"],"value":{"en":"Skill check. Tone of Voice and Users (NN/g): consider the concerns of your readers and their emotional state when choosing a tone.","ar":"اختبار مهارة. النبرة والمستخدمون (NN/g): راعِ مخاوف قرّائك وحالتهم العاطفية حين تختار النبرة."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/tone-voice-users/","quote":"Remember to consider the concerns of your readers and their emotional state when choosing a tone."},"scenario":{"en":"A member's monthly payment failed. Her card was declined, and she may lose her plan. She's probably worried.","ar":"فشل الدفع الشهري لإحدى العضوات. رُفضت بطاقتها، وقد تفقد اشتراكها. وهي على الأرجح قلقة."},"prompt":{"en":"Which message fits how she feels?","ar":"أي رسالة تناسب شعورها؟"},"options":[{"id":"calm","text":{"en":"\"Your payment didn't go through. Update your card by Friday to keep your plan.\"","ar":"«لم يتمّ الدفع. حدّث بطاقتك قبل يوم الجمعة لتحافظ على اشتراكك.»"}},{"id":"hype","text":{"en":"\"Uh-oh, champ! 💪😅 Your card dropped the ball!\"","ar":"«أوه يا بطل! 💪😅 بطاقتك خذلتك هذه المرة!»"}},{"id":"legal","text":{"en":"\"Payment declined. Membership subject to suspension.\"","ar":"«رُفض الدفع. العضوية عرضة للإيقاف.»"}}],"answer":["calm"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P15-021","when":["hype"],"feedback":{"en":"Same pep-talk tone as the morning reminder. For a money problem, it feels like we're not taking it seriously.","ar":"نفس نبرة التشجيع في التذكير الصباحي. ومع مشكلة مالية، يبدو أننا لا نأخذ الأمر بجدّية."}},{"id":"MC-P15-017","when":["legal"],"feedback":{"en":"Clear, but cold and a bit scary. It doesn't tell her what to do.","ar":"واضحة، لكنها باردة ومخيفة قليلًا. ولا تخبرها بما عليها فعله."}}],"explain":{"en":"From Lesson 2: in a worrying moment, be calm and clear, and give people a way to fix it.","ar":"من الدرس 2: في لحظة مقلقة، كن هادئًا وواضحًا، وأعطِ الناس طريقة للإصلاح."},"speaker":"hana"},{"id":"S04","type":"choose","skill":"SK-P15-U03-03","part":"check","rules":["R19"],"value":{"en":"Skill check. Tone of Voice and Users (NN/g): a conversational but serious tone can be successful even for a bank; an exciting, chummy or funny tone won't suit every organization.","ar":"اختبار مهارة. النبرة والمستخدمون (NN/g): النبرة الحوارية الجادة قد تنجح حتى مع بنك؛ والنبرة المثيرة أو المفرطة في الودّ أو المضحكة لا تناسب كل مؤسسة."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/tone-voice-users/","quote":"a conversational but serious tone can be successful for a bank."},"scenario":{"en":"Members read our cancellation page before they decide to stop paying. It's about their money and their contract.","ar":"يقرأ الأعضاء صفحة الإلغاء قبل أن يقرّروا التوقّف عن الدفع. وهي تخصّ أموالهم وعقدهم."},"prompt":{"en":"Which text is friendly and makes members trust what it says?","ar":"أي نص ودّي ويجعل الأعضاء يثقون بما يقوله؟"},"options":[{"id":"legal","text":{"en":"\"Termination of membership shall be effective upon expiry of the current billing period.\"","ar":"«يسري إنهاء العضوية عند انتهاء فترة الفوترة الحالية.»"}},{"id":"plain","text":{"en":"\"You can cancel any time. You can still use the gym until the end of the month you've paid for.\"","ar":"«يمكنك الإلغاء في أي وقت. وتستطيع استخدام النادي حتى نهاية الشهر الذي دفعت ثمنه.»"}},{"id":"guilt","text":{"en":"\"Leaving us already? 😢 Your muscles will miss you! 💔\"","ar":"«ستتركنا بهذه السرعة؟ 😢 عضلاتك ستشتاق إليك! 💔»"}}],"answer":["plain"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P15-017","when":["legal"],"feedback":{"en":"Serious, but cold and hard to read. Members must work out what \"termination\" means for them.","ar":"جادة، لكنها باردة وصعبة القراءة. وعلى الأعضاء أن يفهموا بأنفسهم ماذا يعني «الإنهاء» لهم."}},{"id":"MC-P15-018","when":["guilt"],"feedback":{"en":"Jokes on a money-and-contract page cost trust. It also hides the facts members came for.","ar":"النكات في صفحة عن المال والعقد تُفقد الثقة. كما أنها تُخفي المعلومات التي جاء الأعضاء من أجلها."}}],"explain":{"en":"From Lesson 1: serious topics need plain, friendly words, not legal words or jokes.","ar":"من الدرس 1: المواضيع الجادة تحتاج كلمات بسيطة وودّية، لا كلمات قانونية ولا نكاتًا."},"speaker":"hana"},{"id":"S05","type":"choose","skill":"SK-P15-U03-04","part":"check","rules":["R19"],"value":{"en":"Skill check. Four Dimensions of Tone (NN/g): you might choose a casual tone for the whole site, but vary the amount of humor across it.","ar":"اختبار مهارة. أبعاد النبرة الأربعة (NN/g): قد تختار نبرة ودّية للموقع كله، لكن تغيّر مقدار المزاح من مكان لآخر."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/tone-of-voice-dimensions/","quote":"You might decide on a casual tone for your site-wide content strategy, but vary the amount of humor in your copy across the site."},"scenario":{"en":"Members love our upbeat, casual style. I'm writing the rule for the whole app.","ar":"الأعضاء يحبّون أسلوبنا الودّي المتفائل. وأكتب القاعدة للتطبيق كله."},"prompt":{"en":"Which rule keeps the gym sounding like us and fits every moment?","ar":"أيّ قاعدة تحافظ على صوت النادي وتناسب كل لحظة؟"},"options":[{"id":"same","text":{"en":"\"Be upbeat and playful in every message, so we always sound the same.\"","ar":"«كن متفائلًا ومرحًا في كل رسالة، حتى نبدو دائمًا بنفس الطريقة.»"}},{"id":"split","text":{"en":"\"Be playful in the app, but formal in emails.\"","ar":"«كن مرحًا في التطبيق، ورسميًا في رسائل البريد.»"}},{"id":"vary","text":{"en":"\"Always casual and kind. Playful for wins and reminders; calm for payments, injuries and cancelling.\"","ar":"«ودّيون ولطفاء دائمًا. مرحون في الإنجازات والتذكيرات، وهادئون في المدفوعات والإصابات والإلغاء.»"}}],"answer":["vary"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P15-021","when":["same"],"feedback":{"en":"One voice doesn't mean one tone. Playful jokes in a message about an injury would hurt.","ar":"الصوت الواحد لا يعني نبرة واحدة. والمزاح في رسالة عن إصابة سيؤذي."}},{"id":"MC-P15-021","when":["split"],"feedback":{"en":"This splits the gym into two personalities. Tone should follow the moment, not the channel.","ar":"هذا يقسم النادي إلى شخصيتين. والنبرة يجب أن تتبع اللحظة، لا وسيلة التواصل."}}],"explain":{"en":"From Lesson 2: keep one voice everywhere, and change how playful you are with the moment.","ar":"من الدرس 2: حافظ على صوت واحد في كل مكان، وغيّر مقدار المرح حسب اللحظة."},"speaker":"hana"}]}$uxg$::jsonb),
  ($uxg$P15-U04-L01$uxg$, $uxg$a5b8c8af7dd83f27e0b98e94a648cf3c7bba281643ccae85ff952fc22806cecf$uxg$, $uxg${"id":"P15-U04-L01","mode":"lesson","minutes":7,"title":{"en":"Buttons that say what they do","ar":"أزرار تقول ما تفعله"},"summary":{"en":"Rename the buttons in a photo-printing app so people know what each tap will do.","ar":"أعد تسمية الأزرار في تطبيق لطباعة الصور حتى يعرف الناس ما ستفعله كل ضغطة."},"speaker":"karim","review_labels":{"MC-P15-001":{"en":"The first words carry no meaning","ar":"أول الكلمات لا تحمل معنى"},"MC-P15-023":{"en":"Generic labels like Next, Submit or OK hide what happens","ar":"النصوص العامة مثل «التالي» و«إرسال» و«موافق» تُخفي ما سيحدث"},"MC-P15-024":{"en":"A switching button should show the next state, not the current one","ar":"زر التبديل (Toggle button) يجب أن يُظهر الحالة التالية، لا الحالية"},"MC-P15-025":{"en":"Clever or branded names make people guess","ar":"الأسماء الطريفة أو التجارية تجعل الناس يخمّنون"},"MC-P15-026":{"en":"The same action needs the same label everywhere","ar":"الفعل نفسه يحتاج النص نفسه في كل مكان"}},"steps":[{"id":"S01","type":"card","part":"hook","title":{"en":"What does \"Submit\" do?","ar":"ماذا يفعل زر «إرسال»؟"},"body":{"en":"I'm a front-end developer on a photo-printing app. I wrote the buttons fast: \"Submit\", \"Next\", \"OK\".\n\nIn tests, people stopped before tapping. One asked: \"Will this pay now, or show me a summary first?\" The buttons didn't say.","ar":"أنا مطوّر واجهات (Front-end developer) في تطبيق لطباعة الصور. وكتبت نصوص الأزرار بسرعة: «إرسال» و«التالي» و«موافق».\n\nوفي الاختبارات، توقّف الناس قبل الضغط. وسأل أحدهم: «هل سيدفع هذا الآن، أم سيعرض لي ملخصًا أولًا؟» ولم تكن الأزرار توضّح ذلك."},"mock":{"app":{"id":"taba","name":{"en":"Tab'a","ar":"طبعة"},"color":"#D6336C","icon":"printer","domain":"tab-a.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Checkout","ar":"إتمام الطلب"},"back":true},"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Next","ar":"التالي"}}],"blocks":[{"kind":"progress","value":66,"label":{"en":"Step 2 of 3 · Delivery address","ar":"الخطوة 2 من 3 · عنوان التوصيل"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Address","ar":"العنوان"},"text":{"en":"12 Nile St, Giza","ar":"12 شارع النيل، الجيزة"},"filled":true,"icon":"map-pin","gap":"m"},{"kind":"listitem","art":"photo","text":{"en":"12 prints · 10×15 cm","ar":"12 صورة · 10×15 سم"},"value":{"en":"EGP 96","ar":"96 جنيهًا"},"gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"S02","type":"choose","skill":"SK-P15-U04-01","part":"try","rules":["R12"],"value":{"en":"Try first. UI Copy (NN/g): prefer a specific verb to generic names like Next; one site guides checkout with \"Continue to Billing\".","ar":"جرّب أولًا. نصوص الواجهة (NN/g): فضّل فعلًا محددًا على الأسماء العامة مثل «التالي»؛ فأحد المواقع يقود خطوات الشراء بـ «تابع إلى الفوترة»."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/ui-copy/","quote":"whenever possible, prefer a specific verb to one of these generic names."},"prompt":{"en":"Step 3 is payment. Which label tells people what the button on the delivery screen will do?","ar":"الخطوة 3 هي الدفع. أي نص يخبر الناس بما سيفعله الزر في شاشة التوصيل؟"},"options":[{"id":"next","text":{"en":"\"Next →\"","ar":"«التالي ←»"}},{"id":"pay","text":{"en":"\"Continue to payment\"","ar":"«تابِع إلى الدفع»"}},{"id":"click","text":{"en":"\"Click here to go on to the next step\"","ar":"«اضغط هنا للانتقال إلى الخطوة التالية»"}}],"answer":["pay"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P15-023","when":["next"],"feedback":{"en":"The arrow doesn't help. \"Next\" still doesn't say what comes next: payment, or a summary?","ar":"السهم لا يساعد. «التالي» ما زالت لا تقول ما الذي يأتي بعدها: الدفع، أم ملخص؟"}},{"id":"MC-P15-001","when":["click"],"feedback":{"en":"\"Click here to go on to\" is six words that say nothing. And it still doesn't name payment.","ar":"«اضغط هنا للانتقال إلى» كلمات لا تقول شيئًا. وما زالت لا تذكر الدفع."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Which label names what's on the next screen?","ar":"أي نص يذكر ما في الشاشة التالية؟"},{"en":"Look for a verb plus where it takes you.","ar":"ابحث عن فعل ومعه المكان الذي يأخذك إليه."}],"correct":{"en":"Right. People know payment is next, not yet charged.","ar":"صحيح. الناس يعرفون أن الدفع هو الخطوة التالية، وأن المبلغ لم يُخصم بعد."},"explain":{"en":"A specific verb tells people what will happen. \"Next\" makes them guess.","ar":"الفعل المحدد يخبر الناس بما سيحدث. أما «التالي» فتجعلهم يخمّنون."}},{"id":"S03","type":"card","part":"concept","icons":["tap","text","toggle","ok"],"title":{"en":"A button is a promise","ar":"الزر وعد"},"body":{"en":"- **Start with a verb:** \"Upload photos\", \"Continue to payment\". Add a noun when the verb alone could mean many things.\n- **Keep it to 2–4 words.** Long enough to be clear, no longer.\n- **Avoid generic and clever words:** \"Submit\", \"OK\" and \"Magic Touch ✨\" make people guess.\n- **Name the next state:** while a video plays, the button says \"Pause\". When something is shown, the button says \"Hide\".\n- **Same action, same label:** if it's \"Add to cart\" on one screen, it's \"Add to cart\" everywhere.","ar":"- **ابدأ بفعل:** «ارفع الصور»، «تابِع إلى الدفع». وأضف اسمًا حين يحتمل الفعل وحده معاني كثيرة.\n- **من 2 إلى 4 كلمات.** طويلًا بما يكفي ليكون واضحًا، لا أكثر.\n- **تجنّب الكلمات العامة والطريفة:** «إرسال» و«موافق» و«اللمسة السحرية ✨» تجعل الناس يخمّنون.\n- **سمِّ الحالة التالية:** أثناء تشغيل الفيديو، يقول الزر «إيقاف مؤقت». وحين يكون شيء ظاهرًا، يقول الزر «إخفاء».\n- **نفس الفعل، نفس النص:** إن كان «أضف إلى السلة» في شاشة، فهو «أضف إلى السلة» في كل مكان."}},{"id":"S04","type":"words","skill":"SK-P15-U04-01","part":"guided","rules":["R06"],"value":{"en":"UI Copy (NN/g): lead with verbs or verb phrases that clearly outline what will happen after the command is selected.","ar":"نصوص الواجهة (NN/g): ابدأ بأفعال أو عبارات فعلية توضّح ما سيحدث بعد اختيار الأمر."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/ui-copy/","quote":"Lead with verbs or verb phrases that clearly outline what will happen after the command is selected."},"scenario":{"en":"On the first screen, people pick photos from their phone. The button under them says \"Submit\".","ar":"في الشاشة الأولى، يختار الناس الصور من هواتفهم. والزر تحتها يقول «إرسال»."},"prompt":{"en":"Which label says what the button does?","ar":"أي نص يقول ما يفعله الزر؟"},"options":[{"id":"go","text":{"en":"\"Go\"","ar":"«انطلق»"}},{"id":"proceed","text":{"en":"\"Proceed with your selection\"","ar":"«المتابعة باختيارك»"}},{"id":"upload","text":{"en":"\"Upload 12 photos\"","ar":"«ارفع 12 صورة»"}}],"answer":["upload"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P15-023","when":["go","proceed"],"feedback":{"en":"Still generic. People can't tell if this uploads, orders, or prints.","ar":"ما زال عامًا. ولا يعرف الناس هل يرفع هذا الصور، أم يطلبها، أم يطبعها."}}],"hints":[{"en":"What actually happens when they tap?","ar":"ماذا يحدث فعلًا حين يضغطون؟"},{"en":"Pick the verb that names that action.","ar":"اختر الفعل الذي يسمّي هذه الخطوة."}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Verb, then what it acts on.","ar":"صحيح. فعل، ثم ما يقع عليه."},"explain":{"en":"\"Upload 12 photos\" says the action and confirms the count, so people can catch a mistake.","ar":"«ارفع 12 صورة» تقول الفعل وتؤكّد العدد، فيستطيع الناس ملاحظة الخطأ."},"speaker":"karim"},{"id":"S05","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P15-U04-02","part":"guided","rules":["R06"],"value":{"en":"UI Copy (NN/g): commands should reflect the state the system will move into, not the current state; a playing video shows a Pause button.","ar":"نصوص الواجهة (NN/g): الأوامر يجب أن تعكس الحالة التي سينتقل إليها النظام، لا الحالة الحالية؛ فالفيديو أثناء التشغيل يُظهر زر «إيقاف مؤقت»."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/ui-copy/","quote":"Commands should always reflect the state the system will move into, rather than the current state."},"scenario":{"en":"People can watch a slideshow of their photos before printing. While it plays, the button says \"Playing\".","ar":"يستطيع الناس مشاهدة عرض لصورهم قبل الطباعة. وأثناء التشغيل، يقول الزر «قيد التشغيل»."},"prompt":{"en":"Tap each option to see the change. Which label tells people what tapping will do?","ar":"اضغط على كل خيار لترى التغيير. أي نص يخبر الناس بما ستفعله الضغطة؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"taba","name":{"en":"Tab'a","ar":"طبعة"},"color":"#D6336C","icon":"printer","domain":"tab-a.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Your photos","ar":"صورك"},"back":true},"theme":"dark","caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Print 12 photos · EGP 96","ar":"اطبع 12 صورة · 96 جنيهًا"}}],"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"photo","size":"l","text":{"en":"Slideshow · 3 of 12","ar":"عرض الصور · 3 من 12"}},{"kind":"progress","value":25,"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Playing","ar":"قيد التشغيل"},"icon":"pause","style":"outline","gap":"m"}]},"options":[{"id":"pause","text":{"en":"\"Pause\"","ar":"«إيقاف مؤقت»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"taba","name":{"en":"Tab'a","ar":"طبعة"},"color":"#D6336C","icon":"printer","domain":"tab-a.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Your photos","ar":"صورك"},"back":true},"theme":"dark","caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Print 12 photos · EGP 96","ar":"اطبع 12 صورة · 96 جنيهًا"}}],"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"photo","size":"l","text":{"en":"Slideshow · 3 of 12","ar":"عرض الصور · 3 من 12"}},{"kind":"progress","value":25,"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Pause","ar":"إيقاف مؤقت"},"icon":"pause","style":"outline","gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"both","text":{"en":"\"Play / Pause\"","ar":"«تشغيل / إيقاف مؤقت»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"taba","name":{"en":"Tab'a","ar":"طبعة"},"color":"#D6336C","icon":"printer","domain":"tab-a.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Your photos","ar":"صورك"},"back":true},"theme":"dark","caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Print 12 photos · EGP 96","ar":"اطبع 12 صورة · 96 جنيهًا"}}],"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"photo","size":"l","text":{"en":"Slideshow · 3 of 12","ar":"عرض الصور · 3 من 12"}},{"kind":"progress","value":25,"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Play / Pause","ar":"تشغيل / إيقاف مؤقت"},"icon":"pause","style":"outline","gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"on","text":{"en":"\"Slideshow: on\"","ar":"«العرض: يعمل»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"taba","name":{"en":"Tab'a","ar":"طبعة"},"color":"#D6336C","icon":"printer","domain":"tab-a.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Your photos","ar":"صورك"},"back":true},"theme":"dark","caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Print 12 photos · EGP 96","ar":"اطبع 12 صورة · 96 جنيهًا"}}],"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"photo","size":"l","text":{"en":"Slideshow · 3 of 12","ar":"عرض الصور · 3 من 12"}},{"kind":"progress","value":25,"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Slideshow: on","ar":"العرض: يعمل"},"icon":"pause","style":"outline","gap":"m"}]}}],"answer":["pause"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P15-024","when":["on"],"feedback":{"en":"This describes what's happening now. People can already see it playing; they need to know what the tap does.","ar":"هذا يصف ما يحدث الآن. والناس يرون العرض يعمل؛ ما يحتاجونه هو معرفة ما تفعله الضغطة."}},{"id":"MC-P15-023","when":["both"],"feedback":{"en":"One button, two actions. People can't tell which one will happen this time.","ar":"زر واحد وفعلان. ولا يعرف الناس أيهما سيحدث هذه المرة."}}],"hints":[{"en":"If people tap now, what will happen to the slideshow?","ar":"إن ضغط الناس الآن، ماذا سيحدث للعرض؟"},{"en":"Name that result on the button.","ar":"اكتب هذه النتيجة على الزر."}],"correct":{"en":"Right. While it plays, the button offers \"Pause\".","ar":"صحيح. أثناء التشغيل، يعرض الزر «إيقاف مؤقت»."},"explain":{"en":"A switching button names what it will do next. When the slideshow stops, it changes to \"Play\".","ar":"زر التبديل (Toggle) يسمّي ما سيفعله بعد الضغط. وحين يتوقّف العرض، يصبح «تشغيل»."},"speaker":"karim"},{"id":"S06","type":"compare","skill":"SK-P15-U04-01","part":"contrast","confidence":true,"rules":["R11"],"value":{"en":"Contrast: plain verb vs clever name. UI Copy (NN/g): command text should be straightforward, descriptive and accurate, not cutesy or faddish; limit branded terms.","ar":"مقارنة: فعل بسيط مقابل اسم ذكي. نصوص الواجهة (NN/g): نص الأمر يجب أن يكون مباشرًا ووصفيًا ودقيقًا، لا ظريفًا ولا متّبعًا للموضة؛ وقلّل الأسماء التجارية."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/ui-copy/","quote":"Command text should be straightforward, descriptive, and accurate; not cutesy or faddish."},"scenario":{"en":"We added a tool that brightens dark photos before printing. Marketing and I each named the button.","ar":"أضفنا أداة تجعل الصور المظلمة أكثر إضاءة قبل الطباعة. وسمّيت أنا وفريق التسويق الزر، كلٌّ بطريقته."},"prompt":{"en":"Which button will people understand without trying it first?","ar":"أيّ زر يوضّح ما يفعله دون الحاجة إلى تجربته أولًا؟"},"a":{"label":{"en":"A: The button names what it does to the photo.","ar":"A: الزر يذكر ما يفعله بالصورة."},"mock":{"app":{"id":"taba","name":{"en":"Tab'a","ar":"طبعة"},"color":"#D6336C","icon":"printer","domain":"tab-a.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Edit photo","ar":"تعديل الصورة"},"back":true},"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Save","ar":"احفظ"}}],"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"photo","size":"l"},{"kind":"row","gap":"m","blocks":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Crop","ar":"قصّ"},"icon":"crop","style":"text"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Brighten photo","ar":"زِد إضاءة الصورة"},"icon":"sun","style":"text"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Rotate","ar":"تدوير"},"icon":"arrow-clockwise","style":"text"}]}]}},"b":{"label":{"en":"B: The button has a catchy feature name.","ar":"B: الزر يحمل اسمًا جذّابًا للميزة."},"mock":{"app":{"id":"taba","name":{"en":"Tab'a","ar":"طبعة"},"color":"#D6336C","icon":"printer","domain":"tab-a.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Edit photo","ar":"تعديل الصورة"},"back":true},"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Save","ar":"احفظ"}}],"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"photo","size":"l"},{"kind":"row","gap":"m","blocks":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Crop","ar":"قصّ"},"icon":"crop","style":"text"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Magic Touch ✨","ar":"اللمسة السحرية ✨"},"icon":"sun","style":"text"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Rotate","ar":"تدوير"},"icon":"arrow-clockwise","style":"text"}]}]}},"answer":"a","reason":{"prompt":{"en":"Why does A work better?","ar":"لماذا A أفضل؟"},"options":[{"id":"guess","text":{"en":"People know what A will do before they tap; with B they have to try it","ar":"الناس يعرفون ما سيفعله A قبل الضغط؛ أما B فعليهم تجربته"}},{"id":"short","text":{"en":"A has fewer words","ar":"في A كلمات أقل"}},{"id":"emoji","text":{"en":"Emojis are never allowed on buttons","ar":"الرموز التعبيرية ممنوعة دائمًا على الأزرار"}}],"answer":["guess"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P15-025","when":["short","emoji"],"feedback":{"en":"Both are 2 words. The difference is that A says what it does; B is a name people must learn.","ar":"الاثنان كلمتان تقريبًا. الفرق أن A يقول ما يفعله، أما B فاسم على الناس أن يتعلّموه."}}]},"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P15-025","when":["b"],"feedback":{"en":"\"Magic Touch\" sounds nice, but what does it do? Filters? Stickers? People have to tap to find out.","ar":"«اللمسة السحرية» تبدو لطيفة، لكن ماذا تفعل؟ فلاتر؟ ملصقات؟ على الناس أن يضغطوا ليعرفوا."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Imagine someone who has never used the app.","ar":"تخيّل شخصًا لم يستخدم التطبيق من قبل."},{"en":"Which label could only mean one thing?","ar":"أي نص لا يحتمل إلا معنى واحدًا؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Plain beats clever on buttons.","ar":"صحيح. في الأزرار، الاسم البسيط أفضل من الطريف."},"explain":{"en":"A feature can have a fun name in marketing. The button should still say what it does.","ar":"يمكن أن يكون للميزة اسم ممتع في التسويق. لكن الزر يجب أن يقول ما يفعله."},"speaker":"karim"},{"id":"S07","type":"choose","skill":"SK-P15-U04-02","part":"guided","rules":["R06"],"value":{"en":"UI Copy (NN/g): use adjectives for commands that change how an element looks, like Regular, Bold or Italic; the adjective should reflect how the element will change.","ar":"نصوص الواجهة (NN/g): استخدم الصفات للأوامر التي تغيّر شكل العنصر، مثل Regular وBold وItalic؛ والصفة يجب أن تعكس كيف سيتغيّر العنصر."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/ui-copy/","quote":"The adjective should always reflect how the element will change."},"scenario":{"en":"People can write a caption under each printed photo. I'm adding three buttons that change how the caption text looks.","ar":"يستطيع الناس كتابة تعليق تحت كل صورة مطبوعة. وأضيف ثلاثة أزرار تغيّر شكل نص التعليق."},"prompt":{"en":"Which set of labels tells people how the caption will look?","ar":"أي مجموعة نصوص تخبر الناس كيف سيبدو التعليق؟"},"options":[{"id":"styles","text":{"en":"\"Style 1\", \"Style 2\", \"Style 3\"","ar":"«نمط 1»، «نمط 2»، «نمط 3»"}},{"id":"moods","text":{"en":"\"Make it pop\", \"Keep it chill\", \"Go wild\"","ar":"«اجعله يلمع»، «خلّيه رايق»، «أطلق العنان»"}},{"id":"looks","text":{"en":"\"Regular\", \"Bold\", \"Italic\"","ar":"«Regular»، «Bold»، «Italic»"}}],"answer":["looks"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P15-025","when":["moods"],"feedback":{"en":"Fun, but people can't tell what \"Make it pop\" will look like.","ar":"ممتعة، لكن الناس لا يعرفون كيف سيبدو «اجعله يلمع»."}},{"id":"MC-P15-023","when":["styles"],"feedback":{"en":"Numbers say nothing about the look. People must try each one.","ar":"الأرقام لا تقول شيئًا عن الشكل. وعلى الناس أن يجرّبوا كل واحد."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Which words describe how text looks?","ar":"أي كلمات تصف شكل النص؟"},{"en":"For style changes, the label is the style itself.","ar":"في تغييرات الشكل، نص الزر هو اسم الشكل نفسه."}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Each label says what the text will become.","ar":"صحيح. كل زر يقول كيف سيبدو التعليق."},"explain":{"en":"When a button changes how something looks, name the look.","ar":"حين يغيّر الزر شكل شيء ما، سمِّ ذلك الشكل."},"speaker":"karim"},{"id":"S08","type":"choose","skill":"SK-P15-U04-01","part":"independent","speaker":"youssef","rules":["R14"],"value":{"en":"New case. UI Copy (NN/g): if the same command appears in more than one place, use the same label text and a similar position.","ar":"حالة جديدة. نصوص الواجهة (NN/g): إن ظهر الأمر نفسه في أكثر من مكان، فاستخدم النص نفسه وموضعًا مشابهًا."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/ui-copy/","quote":"If the same command appears in more than one menu, dialog box, or task flow, use the same label text in each instance and place it in a similar position."},"scenario":{"en":"In my shop's app, the button that puts a product in the cart says \"Add to cart\" on product pages, \"Buy\" in the product list, and \"Get it\" in search results. Some customers think \"Buy\" pays at once.","ar":"في تطبيق متجري، الزر الذي يضع المنتج في السلة يقول «أضف إلى السلة» في صفحات المنتجات، و«اشترِ» في قائمة المنتجات، و«احصل عليه» في نتائج البحث. وبعض العملاء يظنون أن «اشترِ» يدفع فورًا."},"prompt":{"en":"What should I do with these buttons?","ar":"ماذا أفعل بهذه الأزرار؟"},"options":[{"id":"keep","text":{"en":"Keep all three, so the app doesn't feel repetitive","ar":"أبقي الثلاثة، حتى لا يبدو التطبيق مكرّرًا"}},{"id":"same","text":{"en":"Use \"Add to cart\" on all three screens","ar":"أستخدم «أضف إلى السلة» في الشاشات الثلاث"}},{"id":"buy","text":{"en":"Use \"Buy now\" everywhere, because it's shorter and sells more","ar":"أستخدم «اشترِ الآن» في كل مكان، لأنها أقصر وتبيع أكثر"}}],"answer":["same"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P15-026","when":["keep"],"feedback":{"en":"Different words make people think these are different actions, like \"Buy\" paying at once.","ar":"الكلمات المختلفة تجعل الناس يظنون أنها أفعال مختلفة، مثل أن «اشترِ» تدفع فورًا."}},{"id":"MC-P15-023","when":["buy"],"feedback":{"en":"Consistent, but wrong: the button doesn't buy, it adds to the cart. The label must say what really happens.","ar":"متّسق، لكنه خطأ: الزر لا يشتري، بل يضيف إلى السلة. والنص يجب أن يقول ما يحدث فعلًا."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. One action, one label, and it's accurate.","ar":"صحيح. فعل واحد، ونص واحد، ودقيق."},"explain":{"en":"Use one accurate label for one action. Then people learn it once and trust it everywhere.","ar":"استخدم نصًا واحدًا دقيقًا لفعل واحد. فيتعلّمه الناس مرة، ويثقون به في كل مكان."}},{"id":"S09","type":"card","part":"recap","icons":["tap","toggle","text","ok"],"title":{"en":"What you did","ar":"ماذا تعلّمت"},"body":{"en":"- **Specific verbs:** \"Continue to payment\" and \"Upload 12 photos\" replaced \"Next\" and \"Submit\".\n- **Next state:** while the slideshow plays, the button says \"Pause\".\n- **Plain over clever:** \"Brighten photo\" beat \"Magic Touch ✨\".\n- **Name the look:** Regular, Bold, Italic.\n- **Same action, same label:** \"Add to cart\" on every screen.\n\nNext lesson: confirmations and links.","ar":"- **أفعال محددة:** «تابِع إلى الدفع» و«ارفع 12 صورة» بدل «التالي» و«إرسال».\n- **الحالة التالية:** أثناء تشغيل العرض، يقول الزر «إيقاف مؤقت».\n- **البسيط بدل الذكي:** «زِد إضاءة الصورة» تفوّقت على «اللمسة السحرية ✨».\n- **سمِّ الشكل:** Regular وBold وItalic.\n- **نفس الفعل، نفس النص:** «أضف إلى السلة» في كل شاشة.\n\nالدرس التالي: رسائل التأكيد والروابط."}}]}$uxg$::jsonb),
  ($uxg$P15-U04-L02$uxg$, $uxg$3ca2484e90a6acc4facb5863af9312293fef2ee9caa2b90636b9007a32fe0e2e$uxg$, $uxg${"id":"P15-U04-L02","mode":"lesson","minutes":7,"title":{"en":"Confirmations and links people trust","ar":"رسائل تأكيد وروابط يثق بها الناس"},"summary":{"en":"Rewrite a food app's confirmations and links so people know what they're agreeing to and where they're going.","ar":"أعد كتابة رسائل التأكيد والروابط في تطبيق طعام حتى يعرف الناس على ماذا يوافقون وإلى أين يذهبون."},"speaker":"tarek","review_labels":{"MC-P15-027":{"en":"\"Are you sure?\" and Yes/No get tapped without reading","ar":"«هل أنت متأكد؟» و«نعم/لا» يُضغط عليها دون قراءة"},"MC-P15-028":{"en":"\"Learn more\" alone doesn't say where it goes","ar":"«اعرف المزيد» وحدها لا تقول إلى أين تأخذك"},"MC-P15-029":{"en":"A label must lead exactly where it promises","ar":"النص يجب أن يأخذك إلى ما يعد به بالضبط"}},"steps":[{"id":"S01","type":"card","part":"hook","title":{"en":"\"Yes\" to what?","ar":"«نعم» على ماذا؟"},"body":{"en":"I manage a food delivery app. Last week a customer tapped \"Yes\" on a pop-up and lost all her saved addresses. She thought it was asking about one.\n\nOur offer cards also end with \"Learn more\" links that almost nobody taps.","ar":"أدير تطبيقًا لتوصيل الطعام. والأسبوع الماضي ضغطت عميلة على «نعم» في نافذة منبثقة (Pop-up)، فخسرت كل عناوينها المحفوظة. ظنّت أن النافذة تسأل عن عنوان واحد.\n\nوبطاقات العروض عندنا تنتهي بروابط «اعرف المزيد»، ولا يضغط عليها أحد تقريبًا."},"mock":{"app":{"id":"lamma","name":{"en":"Lamma","ar":"لمّة"},"color":"#E03131","icon":"bowl-food","domain":"lamma.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Your order","ar":"طلبك"},"back":true},"overlay":{"type":"dialog","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Are you sure?","ar":"هل أنت متأكد؟"}},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"Do you want to continue?","ar":"هل تريد المتابعة؟"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"row","gap":"m","blocks":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"No","ar":"لا"},"style":"text"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Yes","ar":"نعم"}}]}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","art":"food-koshary","text":{"en":"Koshary El Tahrir","ar":"كشري التحرير"},"sub":{"en":"Order #2041 · 2 items","ar":"الطلب #2041 · منتجان"},"value":{"en":"EGP 185","ar":"185 جنيه"}},{"kind":"progress","value":20,"label":{"en":"Waiting for the restaurant","ar":"في انتظار المطعم"},"gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"S02","type":"choose","skill":"SK-P15-U04-03","part":"try","rules":["R12"],"value":{"en":"Try first. Confirmation Dialogs (NN/g): a confirmation must restate the request and explain what the computer is about to do, with specific information; \"Are you sure?\" alone gets an automatic Yes.","ar":"جرّب أولًا. رسائل التأكيد (NN/g): رسالة التأكيد يجب أن تعيد ذكر الطلب وتشرح ما سيفعله النظام بمعلومات محددة؛ و«هل أنت متأكد؟» وحدها تحصل على «نعم» تلقائية."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/confirmation-dialog/","quote":"A confirmation dialog must restate the user's request and explain what the computer is about to do"},"prompt":{"en":"This pop-up appears when someone taps \"Delete all\" in Saved addresses. Which version helps people catch a mistake?","ar":"تظهر هذه النافذة حين يضغط أحدهم «احذف الكل» في العناوين المحفوظة. أي نسخة تساعد الناس على ملاحظة الخطأ؟"},"options":[{"id":"sure","text":{"en":"\"Are you sure you want to do this?\" with Yes and No","ar":"«هل أنت متأكد أنك تريد فعل هذا؟» مع «نعم» و«لا»"}},{"id":"warn","text":{"en":"\"Warning! This can't be undone!\" with OK and Cancel","ar":"«تحذير! لا يمكن التراجع عن هذا!» مع «موافق» و«إلغاء»"}},{"id":"clear","text":{"en":"\"Delete all 4 saved addresses? You'll need to type them again to order.\" with Delete all and Keep addresses","ar":"«حذف العناوين المحفوظة الأربعة كلها؟ ستحتاج إلى كتابتها مرة أخرى لتطلب.» مع «احذف الكل» و«أبقِ العناوين»"}}],"answer":["clear"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P15-027","when":["sure","warn"],"feedback":{"en":"This doesn't say what will be deleted. People who think it's one address will tap through it.","ar":"هذه لا تقول ما الذي سيُحذف. ومن يظن أنه عنوان واحد سيضغط ويتابع."}}],"hints":[{"en":"The customer thought she was deleting one address. Which version would have stopped her?","ar":"ظنّت العميلة أنها تحذف عنوانًا واحدًا. أي نسخة كانت ستوقفها؟"},{"en":"Look for the version that names what will be lost.","ar":"ابحث عن النسخة التي تذكر ما الذي سيضيع."}],"correct":{"en":"Right. \"All 4\" is what would have made her stop.","ar":"صحيح. «الأربعة كلها» هي ما كان سيجعلها تتوقّف."},"explain":{"en":"A confirmation only helps if it says exactly what will happen. Otherwise people tap \"Yes\" on autopilot.","ar":"رسالة التأكيد تفيد فقط إن قالت بالضبط ما سيحدث. وإلا ضغط الناس «نعم» دون تفكير."}},{"id":"S03","type":"card","part":"concept","icons":["warn","tap","target","ok"],"title":{"en":"Say what, and where","ar":"قل ماذا، وإلى أين"},"body":{"en":"**Confirmations**\n- Name the item and what will happen: \"Delete all 4 saved addresses?\"\n- Buttons say what each choice does: \"Delete all\" and \"Keep addresses\", not Yes, No or OK.\n\n**Links**\n- A link should make sense on its own. Many people read only the link, not the text around it.\n- Say where it goes: \"See today's offers\", not \"Learn more\".\n- Keep the promise: the page that opens must be what the link said.","ar":"**رسائل التأكيد**\n- اذكر العنصر وما سيحدث: «حذف العناوين المحفوظة الأربعة كلها؟»\n- الأزرار تقول ما يفعله كل خيار: «احذف الكل» و«أبقِ العناوين»، لا «نعم» ولا «لا» ولا «موافق».\n\n**الروابط**\n- الرابط يجب أن يُفهم وحده. فكثيرون يقرؤون الرابط فقط، لا النص حوله.\n- قل إلى أين يأخذك: «شاهد عروض اليوم»، لا «اعرف المزيد».\n- أوفِ بالوعد: الصفحة التي تُفتح يجب أن تكون ما قاله الرابط."}},{"id":"S04","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P15-U04-03","part":"guided","rules":["R06"],"value":{"en":"Confirmation Dialogs (NN/g): instead of Yes/No answers, give options that summarize what will happen for each response, like Delete file and Keep file.","ar":"رسائل التأكيد (NN/g): بدل إجابات «نعم/لا»، ضع خيارات تلخّص ما سيحدث مع كل إجابة، مثل «احذف الملف» و«أبقِ الملف»."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/confirmation-dialog/","quote":"Instead of Yes/No answers, provide response options that summarize what will happen for each possible response."},"scenario":{"en":"People can cancel an order before the restaurant starts cooking. The text is clear, but people keep tapping the wrong button.","ar":"يستطيع الناس إلغاء الطلب قبل أن يبدأ المطعم في الطهي. والنص واضح، لكن الناس يضغطون الزر الخطأ باستمرار."},"mock":{"app":{"id":"lamma","name":{"en":"Lamma","ar":"لمّة"},"color":"#E03131","icon":"bowl-food","domain":"lamma.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Your order","ar":"طلبك"},"back":true},"overlay":{"type":"dialog","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Cancel order #2041?","ar":"إلغاء الطلب #2041؟"}},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"The restaurant hasn't started cooking. You'll get a full refund.","ar":"لم يبدأ المطعم في الطهي. وسيُردّ لك المبلغ كاملًا."},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"row","gap":"m","blocks":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Cancel","ar":"إلغاء"},"style":"text"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"OK","ar":"موافق"}}]}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","art":"food-koshary","text":{"en":"Koshary El Tahrir","ar":"كشري التحرير"},"sub":{"en":"Order #2041 · 2 items","ar":"الطلب #2041 · منتجان"},"value":{"en":"EGP 185","ar":"185 جنيه"}},{"kind":"progress","value":20,"label":{"en":"Waiting for the restaurant","ar":"في انتظار المطعم"},"gap":"m"}],"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"}},"prompt":{"en":"Which buttons stop people from tapping the wrong one?","ar":"أي أزرار تمنع الناس من الضغط على الزر الخطأ؟"},"options":[{"id":"yesno","text":{"en":"\"No\" and \"Yes\"","ar":"«لا» و«نعم»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"lamma","name":{"en":"Lamma","ar":"لمّة"},"color":"#E03131","icon":"bowl-food","domain":"lamma.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Your order","ar":"طلبك"},"back":true},"overlay":{"type":"dialog","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Cancel order #2041?","ar":"إلغاء الطلب #2041؟"}},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"The restaurant hasn't started cooking. You'll get a full refund.","ar":"لم يبدأ المطعم في الطهي. وسيُردّ لك المبلغ كاملًا."},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"row","gap":"m","blocks":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"No","ar":"لا"},"style":"text"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Yes","ar":"نعم"}}]}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","art":"food-koshary","text":{"en":"Koshary El Tahrir","ar":"كشري التحرير"},"sub":{"en":"Order #2041 · 2 items","ar":"الطلب #2041 · منتجان"},"value":{"en":"EGP 185","ar":"185 جنيه"}},{"kind":"progress","value":20,"label":{"en":"Waiting for the restaurant","ar":"في انتظار المطعم"},"gap":"m"}],"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}},{"id":"named","text":{"en":"\"Keep order\" and \"Cancel order\"","ar":"«أبقِ الطلب» و«ألغِ الطلب»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"lamma","name":{"en":"Lamma","ar":"لمّة"},"color":"#E03131","icon":"bowl-food","domain":"lamma.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Your order","ar":"طلبك"},"back":true},"overlay":{"type":"dialog","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Cancel order #2041?","ar":"إلغاء الطلب #2041؟"}},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"The restaurant hasn't started cooking. You'll get a full refund.","ar":"لم يبدأ المطعم في الطهي. وسيُردّ لك المبلغ كاملًا."},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"row","gap":"m","blocks":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Keep order","ar":"أبقِ الطلب"},"style":"text"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Cancel order","ar":"ألغِ الطلب"}}]}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","art":"food-koshary","text":{"en":"Koshary El Tahrir","ar":"كشري التحرير"},"sub":{"en":"Order #2041 · 2 items","ar":"الطلب #2041 · منتجان"},"value":{"en":"EGP 185","ar":"185 جنيه"}},{"kind":"progress","value":20,"label":{"en":"Waiting for the restaurant","ar":"في انتظار المطعم"},"gap":"m"}],"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}},{"id":"confirm","text":{"en":"\"Back\" and \"Confirm\"","ar":"«رجوع» و«تأكيد»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"lamma","name":{"en":"Lamma","ar":"لمّة"},"color":"#E03131","icon":"bowl-food","domain":"lamma.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Your order","ar":"طلبك"},"back":true},"overlay":{"type":"dialog","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Cancel order #2041?","ar":"إلغاء الطلب #2041؟"}},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"The restaurant hasn't started cooking. You'll get a full refund.","ar":"لم يبدأ المطعم في الطهي. وسيُردّ لك المبلغ كاملًا."},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"row","gap":"m","blocks":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Back","ar":"رجوع"},"style":"text"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Confirm","ar":"تأكيد"}}]}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","art":"food-koshary","text":{"en":"Koshary El Tahrir","ar":"كشري التحرير"},"sub":{"en":"Order #2041 · 2 items","ar":"الطلب #2041 · منتجان"},"value":{"en":"EGP 185","ar":"185 جنيه"}},{"kind":"progress","value":20,"label":{"en":"Waiting for the restaurant","ar":"في انتظار المطعم"},"gap":"m"}],"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}}],"answer":["named"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P15-027","when":["yesno","confirm"],"feedback":{"en":"People still have to read the question to know which is which. Many won't.","ar":"ما زال على الناس قراءة السؤال ليعرفوا أي زر يفعل ماذا. وكثيرون لن يقرؤوه."}}],"hints":[{"en":"In the mock, \"Cancel\" could mean cancel the order, or cancel this pop-up.","ar":"في الشاشة، «إلغاء» قد تعني إلغاء الطلب، أو إلغاء هذه النافذة."},{"en":"Pick the buttons that make sense even if you skip the text.","ar":"اختر الأزرار المفهومة حتى لو تجاوزت النص."}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Each button says what it will do to the order.","ar":"صحيح. كل زر يقول ما سيفعله بالطلب."},"explain":{"en":"Buttons that name the result work even for people who skip the text.","ar":"الأزرار التي تذكر النتيجة تنجح حتى مع من يتجاوز النص."},"speaker":"tarek"},{"id":"S05","type":"compare","skill":"SK-P15-U04-04","part":"contrast","confidence":true,"rules":["R11"],"value":{"en":"Contrast: generic vs descriptive links. Better Link Labels (NN/g): one of the most common link failures is the generic and unhelpful Learn more; links must make sense on their own.","ar":"مقارنة: روابط عامة مقابل روابط واصفة. روابط أفضل (NN/g): من أشهر أخطاء الروابط «اعرف المزيد» العامة غير المفيدة؛ والرابط يجب أن يُفهم وحده."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/better-link-labels/","quote":"One of the most common link failures is the generic and unhelpful Learn more."},"scenario":{"en":"Our home screen has three cards. We tried two kinds of links on them.","ar":"في الشاشة الرئيسية ثلاث بطاقات. وجرّبنا نوعين من الروابط عليها."},"prompt":{"en":"Which version tells people where each link goes, even if they read only the links?","ar":"أي نسخة تخبر الناس إلى أين يأخذ كل رابط، حتى لو قرؤوا الروابط فقط؟"},"a":{"label":{"en":"A: Every card ends with the same link text.","ar":"A: كل بطاقة تنتهي بنفس نص الرابط."},"mock":{"app":{"id":"lamma","name":{"en":"Lamma","ar":"لمّة"},"color":"#E03131","icon":"bowl-food","domain":"lamma.example"},"appbar":{"logo":true},"tabbar":{"active":0,"items":[{"icon":"house","text":{"en":"Home","ar":"الرئيسية"}},{"icon":"tag","text":{"en":"Offers","ar":"العروض"}},{"icon":"receipt","text":{"en":"My orders","ar":"طلباتي"}},{"icon":"user","text":{"en":"Account","ar":"حسابي"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"card","art":"food-pizza","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Hungry for a deal?","ar":"تبحث عن عرض؟"}},{"kind":"link","text":{"en":"Learn more","ar":"اعرف المزيد"},"gap":"xs"}]},{"kind":"card","art":"map-route","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Where's my food?","ar":"أين طعامي؟"}},{"kind":"link","text":{"en":"Learn more","ar":"اعرف المزيد"},"gap":"xs"}]},{"kind":"card","art":"food-burger","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Free delivery, all month","ar":"توصيل مجاني طوال الشهر"}},{"kind":"link","text":{"en":"Learn more","ar":"اعرف المزيد"},"gap":"xs"}]}]}},"b":{"label":{"en":"B: Each link names what it opens.","ar":"B: كل رابط يذكر ما يفتحه."},"mock":{"app":{"id":"lamma","name":{"en":"Lamma","ar":"لمّة"},"color":"#E03131","icon":"bowl-food","domain":"lamma.example"},"appbar":{"logo":true},"tabbar":{"active":0,"items":[{"icon":"house","text":{"en":"Home","ar":"الرئيسية"}},{"icon":"tag","text":{"en":"Offers","ar":"العروض"}},{"icon":"receipt","text":{"en":"My orders","ar":"طلباتي"}},{"icon":"user","text":{"en":"Account","ar":"حسابي"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"card","art":"food-pizza","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Hungry for a deal?","ar":"تبحث عن عرض؟"}},{"kind":"link","text":{"en":"See today's offers","ar":"شاهد عروض اليوم"},"gap":"xs"}]},{"kind":"card","art":"map-route","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Where's my food?","ar":"أين طعامي؟"}},{"kind":"link","text":{"en":"Track your order","ar":"تتبّع طلبك"},"gap":"xs"}]},{"kind":"card","art":"food-burger","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Free delivery, all month","ar":"توصيل مجاني طوال الشهر"}},{"kind":"link","text":{"en":"Join Lamma Plus","ar":"اشترك في لَمّة Plus"},"gap":"xs"}]}]}},"answer":"b","reason":{"prompt":{"en":"Why does B work better?","ar":"لماذا B أفضل؟"},"options":[{"id":"alone","text":{"en":"Each link makes sense alone, so people who scan, and screen-reader users, know where it goes","ar":"كل رابط مفهوم وحده، فيعرف من يتصفّح بسرعة، ومن يستخدم قارئ الشاشة (Screen reader)، إلى أين يأخذه"}},{"id":"longer","text":{"en":"Longer links always get more taps","ar":"الروابط الأطول تحصل دائمًا على ضغطات أكثر"}},{"id":"brand","text":{"en":"B mentions the app's name","ar":"B تذكر اسم التطبيق"}}],"answer":["alone"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P15-028","when":["longer","brand"],"feedback":{"en":"Length and names aren't the point. B's links say where they go, so they work on their own.","ar":"ليس المقصود الطول ولا الأسماء. روابط B تقول إلى أين تأخذك، فتُفهم وحدها."}}]},"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P15-028","when":["a"],"feedback":{"en":"Three links say \"Learn more\". People who scan the links can't tell them apart, or know where any of them goes.","ar":"ثلاثة روابط تقول «اعرف المزيد». ومن يتصفّح الروابط لا يستطيع التمييز بينها، ولا معرفة إلى أين يأخذه أيٌّ منها."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Cover the bold lines and read only the links.","ar":"غطِّ الأسطر العريضة واقرأ الروابط فقط."},{"en":"In which version do the links still make sense?","ar":"في أي نسخة ما زالت الروابط مفهومة؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Every link tells you where it leads.","ar":"صحيح. كل رابط يخبرك إلى أين يأخذك."},"explain":{"en":"Write each link as if it's the only text people will read. Often, it is.","ar":"اكتب كل رابط كأنه النص الوحيد الذي سيقرؤه الناس. فكثيرًا ما يكون كذلك."},"speaker":"tarek"},{"id":"S06","type":"choose","skill":"SK-P15-U04-04","part":"guided","rules":["R06"],"value":{"en":"Better Link Labels (NN/g): a link is a promise; link and button labels must set expectations that are met as soon as people tap. A \"More info & book\" button that opened a contact form disappointed a participant.","ar":"روابط أفضل (NN/g): الرابط وعد؛ ونصوص الروابط والأزرار يجب أن تضع توقّعات تتحقّق فور الضغط. فزر «معلومات أكثر واحجز» فتح نموذج تواصل، فخيّب ظن أحد المشاركين."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/better-link-labels/","quote":"Link and button labels must set expectations that will be instantly met as soon the user clicks or taps on those targets."},"scenario":{"en":"Restaurants can host parties. On their page, a button says \"See menu & book\". It opens a form to send the restaurant your phone number, so they call you back.","ar":"تستطيع المطاعم استضافة الحفلات. وفي صفحتها زر يقول «شاهد القائمة واحجز». لكنه يفتح نموذجًا لترسل رقم هاتفك إلى المطعم، حتى يتصل بك."},"prompt":{"en":"Which label matches what the button really opens?","ar":"أي نص يطابق ما يفتحه الزر فعلًا؟"},"options":[{"id":"call","text":{"en":"\"Ask the restaurant to call you\"","ar":"«اطلب أن يتصل بك المطعم»"}},{"id":"book","text":{"en":"\"Book your party now\"","ar":"«احجز حفلتك الآن»"}},{"id":"more","text":{"en":"\"More info\"","ar":"«معلومات أكثر»"}}],"answer":["call"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P15-029","when":["book"],"feedback":{"en":"People will expect to pick a date and book. When a phone-number form opens, they'll feel tricked.","ar":"سيتوقّع الناس أن يختاروا موعدًا ويحجزوا. وحين يُفتح نموذج لرقم الهاتف، سيشعرون بأنهم خُدعوا."}},{"id":"MC-P15-028","when":["more"],"feedback":{"en":"Vague, and still not true: the form gives no information, it asks for yours.","ar":"غامض، وما زال غير صحيح: النموذج لا يعطي معلومات، بل يطلب معلوماتك."}}],"hints":[{"en":"What does the person get right after tapping?","ar":"على ماذا يحصل الشخص بعد الضغط مباشرة؟"},{"en":"Pick the label that would never disappoint.","ar":"اختر النص الذي لن يخيّب الظن أبدًا."}],"correct":{"en":"Right. It says exactly what happens next.","ar":"صحيح. يقول بالضبط ما سيحدث بعد ذلك."},"explain":{"en":"A label that promises more than the next screen gives costs trust. Name the real next step.","ar":"النص الذي يَعِد بأكثر مما تعطيه الشاشة التالية يُفقدك الثقة. فسمِّ الخطوة التالية الحقيقية."},"speaker":"tarek"},{"id":"S07","type":"choose","skill":"SK-P15-U04-03","part":"guided","rules":["R06"],"value":{"en":"Confirmation Dialogs (NN/g): a common problem is lack of specificity; \"these 2 items\" doesn't tell users which files will be deleted, while naming the file does.","ar":"رسائل التأكيد (NN/g): مشكلة شائعة هي عدم التحديد؛ فعبارة «هذان العنصران» لا تخبر المستخدمين أي الملفات ستُحذف، بينما ذكر اسم الملف يفعل."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/confirmation-dialog/","quote":"Saying these 2 items doesn't tell users which files will be deleted."},"scenario":{"en":"A customer's cart has items from a restaurant that just closed. We need to remove them before she can order.","ar":"في سلة إحدى العميلات أصناف من مطعم أغلق للتو. ونحتاج إلى حذفها قبل أن تتمكّن من الطلب."},"prompt":{"en":"Which pop-up text lets her check what she's losing?","ar":"أي نص للنافذة يجعلها تتحقّق مما ستخسره؟"},"options":[{"id":"named","text":{"en":"\"Remove Falafel wrap, Lentil soup and Mango juice? Abu Ali's Kitchen just closed.\"","ar":"«حذف ساندويتش الفلافل وشوربة العدس وعصير المانجو؟ مطبخ أبو علي أغلق للتو.»"}},{"id":"count","text":{"en":"\"Remove 3 items from your cart?\"","ar":"«حذف 3 أصناف من سلتك؟»"}},{"id":"these","text":{"en":"\"Remove these items?\"","ar":"«حذف هذه الأصناف؟»"}}],"answer":["named"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P15-027","when":["count","these"],"feedback":{"en":"Which items, and why? She can't tell if something she still wants is going too.","ar":"أي أصناف، ولماذا؟ لا تستطيع أن تعرف هل سيُحذف شيء ما زالت تريده."}}],"hints":[{"en":"What would she need to see to say \"wait, not that one\"?","ar":"ماذا تحتاج أن ترى لتقول «مهلًا، ليس هذا»؟"},{"en":"Look for the text that names the items.","ar":"ابحث عن النص الذي يذكر الأصناف بأسمائها."}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Names and a reason. Nothing to guess.","ar":"صحيح. أسماء وسبب. ولا شيء للتخمين."},"explain":{"en":"Name the exact things that will change. A number or \"these\" isn't enough to catch a mistake.","ar":"اذكر الأشياء التي ستتغيّر بالضبط. فالعدد أو «هذه» لا يكفيان لملاحظة الخطأ."},"speaker":"tarek"},{"id":"S08","type":"choose","skill":"SK-P15-U04-04","part":"independent","speaker":"mona","rules":["R14"],"value":{"en":"New case. Better Link Labels (NN/g): links must be able to stand alone; imagine people read only the link label and none of the surrounding text.","ar":"حالة جديدة. روابط أفضل (NN/g): الروابط يجب أن تُفهم وحدها؛ تخيّل أن الناس يقرؤون نص الرابط فقط، دون أي نص حوله."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/better-link-labels/","quote":"As a consequence, links must be able to stand alone."},"scenario":{"en":"In our bill app's help screen, a line says: \"To change the day your bill is due, click here.\" Only \"click here\" is a link.","ar":"في شاشة المساعدة بتطبيق الفواتير، سطر يقول: «لتغيير يوم استحقاق فاتورتك، اضغط هنا.» و«اضغط هنا» وحدها رابط."},"prompt":{"en":"How should I rewrite the link?","ar":"كيف أعيد كتابة الرابط؟"},"options":[{"id":"here","text":{"en":"Keep \"click here\", but make it bold","ar":"أبقي «اضغط هنا»، لكن بخط Bold"}},{"id":"more","text":{"en":"Change it to \"Learn more\"","ar":"أغيّره إلى «اعرف المزيد»"}},{"id":"task","text":{"en":"Make the link \"Change your due date\"","ar":"أجعل الرابط «غيّر تاريخ الاستحقاق»"}}],"answer":["task"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P15-028","when":["here","more"],"feedback":{"en":"Read alone, this link says nothing about due dates. People scanning for it will miss it.","ar":"حين يُقرأ وحده، لا يقول هذا الرابط شيئًا عن تاريخ الاستحقاق. ومن يبحث عنه بسرعة سيفوّته."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. The link names the task.","ar":"صحيح. الرابط يذكر المهمة."},"explain":{"en":"Put the words people look for inside the link itself.","ar":"ضع الكلمات التي يبحث عنها الناس داخل الرابط نفسه."}},{"id":"S09","type":"card","part":"recap","icons":["warn","tap","target","ok"],"title":{"en":"What you did","ar":"ماذا تعلّمت"},"body":{"en":"- **Specific confirmations:** \"Delete all 4 saved addresses?\" instead of \"Are you sure?\".\n- **Buttons that name the result:** \"Keep order\" and \"Cancel order\".\n- **Name the items:** you listed the 3 dishes being removed.\n- **Links that stand alone:** \"Track your order\", not \"Learn more\"; \"Change your due date\", not \"click here\".\n- **Keep the promise:** \"Ask the restaurant to call you\" matches the form.\n\nNext: a skill check on this unit.","ar":"- **تأكيد محدد:** «حذف العناوين المحفوظة الأربعة كلها؟» بدل «هل أنت متأكد؟».\n- **أزرار تذكر النتيجة:** «أبقِ الطلب» و«ألغِ الطلب».\n- **اذكر العناصر:** ذكرت الأطباق الثلاثة التي ستُحذف.\n- **روابط تُفهم وحدها:** «تتبّع طلبك» لا «اعرف المزيد»؛ و«غيّر تاريخ الاستحقاق» لا «اضغط هنا».\n- **أوفِ بالوعد:** «اطلب أن يتصل بك المطعم» يطابق النموذج.\n\nالتالي: اختبار مهارات هذه الوحدة."}}]}$uxg$::jsonb),
  ($uxg$P15-U04-L03$uxg$, $uxg$9c86aa2c35506b2140d7d29dc41c1db714e261e0388d978dd7a03fc88f376d28$uxg$, $uxg${"id":"P15-U04-L03","mode":"check","minutes":5,"title":{"en":"Skill check: labels that say what happens","ar":"اختبار المهارة: نصوص (Labels) تقول ماذا سيحدث"},"summary":{"en":"Fix four labels in a banking app on your own: a button, a switch, a confirmation and a link.","ar":"أصلح بنفسك أربعة نصوص في تطبيق بنكي: زرًّا، ومفتاحًا، ورسالة تأكيد، ورابطًا."},"speaker":"sara","steps":[{"id":"S01","type":"card","part":"hook","title":{"en":"Sara's banking app","ar":"التطبيق البنكي الذي تصمّمه سارة"},"body":{"en":"Back to our banking app. People move real money here, so every label must say exactly what will happen.\n\nYour job: fix four labels.\n\nThis is a skill check: there are no hints, and you'll see your result at the end.","ar":"نعود إلى تطبيقنا البنكي. والناس يحوّلون أموالًا حقيقية هنا، فكل نص يجب أن يقول بالضبط ما سيحدث.\n\nمهمّتك: أصلح أربعة نصوص.\n\nهذا اختبار مهارة: لا توجد تلميحات، وسترى نتيجتك في النهاية."},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rasid","name":{"en":"Rasid","ar":"رصيد"},"color":"#1C3D6E","icon":"bank","domain":"rasid.example"},"appbar":{"logo":true},"tabbar":{"active":0,"items":[{"icon":"wallet","text":{"en":"Accounts","ar":"الحسابات"}},{"icon":"arrows-left-right","text":{"en":"Transfers","ar":"التحويلات"}},{"icon":"credit-card","text":{"en":"Cards","ar":"البطاقات"}},{"icon":"user","text":{"en":"Profile","ar":"حسابي"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"card","blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Current account","ar":"الحساب الجاري"},"color":"muted"},{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"EGP 12,480","ar":"12,480 جنيه"},"size":"l"}]},{"kind":"row","gap":"m","blocks":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Transfer","ar":"تحويل"},"icon":"arrows-left-right","style":"outline"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Pay","ar":"ادفع"},"icon":"receipt","style":"outline"}]}]}},{"id":"S02","type":"choose","skill":"SK-P15-U04-01","part":"check","rules":["R19"],"value":{"en":"Skill check. UI Copy (NN/g): use just enough text to accurately describe the command, in no more than 2–4 words.","ar":"اختبار مهارة. نصوص الواجهة (NN/g): استخدم ما يكفي من الكلمات لوصف الأمر بدقة، في 2 إلى 4 كلمات لا أكثر."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/ui-copy/","quote":"Use just enough text to accurately describe the command and include no more than 2–4 words."},"scenario":{"en":"On the last screen of a transfer, people check the amount and the name. The button says \"Submit\". Tapping it sends the money.","ar":"في آخر شاشة من التحويل، يراجع الناس المبلغ والاسم. والزر يقول «إرسال». والضغط عليه يحوّل المال."},"prompt":{"en":"Which label says exactly what this button does?","ar":"أي نص يقول بالضبط ما يفعله هذا الزر؟"},"options":[{"id":"next","text":{"en":"\"Next\"","ar":"«التالي»"}},{"id":"long","text":{"en":"\"Click to confirm and complete your transfer request\"","ar":"«اضغط لتأكيد طلب التحويل وإكماله»"}},{"id":"send","text":{"en":"\"Send EGP 500\"","ar":"«حوّل 500 جنيه»"}}],"answer":["send"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P15-023","when":["next"],"feedback":{"en":"\"Next\" sounds like there's another step. People won't know the money goes the moment they tap.","ar":"«التالي» توحي بأن هناك خطوة أخرى. ولن يعرف الناس أن المال سيُحوَّل لحظة الضغط."}},{"id":"MC-P15-001","when":["long"],"feedback":{"en":"Too many words before the point, and it still doesn't say how much.","ar":"كلمات كثيرة قبل المقصود، وما زال لا يقول كم المبلغ."}}],"explain":{"en":"From Lesson 1: a specific verb, plus what it acts on, in a few words.","ar":"من الدرس 1: فعل محدد، ومعه ما يقع عليه، في كلمات قليلة."},"speaker":"sara"},{"id":"S03","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P15-U04-02","part":"check","rules":["R19"],"value":{"en":"Skill check. UI Copy (NN/g): a changeable label communicates the state the system will move into, while saving space.","ar":"اختبار مهارة. نصوص الواجهة (NN/g): النص المتبدّل يوضّح الحالة التي سينتقل إليها النظام، ويوفّر المساحة."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/ui-copy/","quote":"This type of changeable label helps to communicate subsequent states while preserving space in the interface."},"scenario":{"en":"People can freeze a lost card. This card is frozen right now. The button under it says \"Card frozen\".","ar":"يستطيع الناس تجميد البطاقة المفقودة. وهذه البطاقة مجمّدة الآن. والزر تحتها يقول «البطاقة مجمّدة»."},"prompt":{"en":"Tap each option to see the change. Which label tells people what tapping will do?","ar":"اضغط على كل خيار لترى التغيير. أي نص يخبر الناس بما ستفعله الضغطة؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rasid","name":{"en":"Rasid","ar":"رصيد"},"color":"#1C3D6E","icon":"bank","domain":"rasid.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Cards","ar":"البطاقات"}},"tabbar":{"active":2,"items":[{"icon":"wallet","text":{"en":"Accounts","ar":"الحسابات"}},{"icon":"arrows-left-right","text":{"en":"Transfers","ar":"التحويلات"}},{"icon":"credit-card","text":{"en":"Cards","ar":"البطاقات"}},{"icon":"user","text":{"en":"Profile","ar":"حسابي"}}]},"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"bank-card","size":"m","alt":{"en":"Debit card ending 4821","ar":"بطاقة خصم تنتهي بـ 4821"}},{"kind":"row","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Debit card ·· 4821","ar":"بطاقة الخصم ·· 4821"},"weight":"bold"},{"kind":"badge","text":{"en":"Frozen","ar":"مجمّدة"},"tone":"warn","icon":"snowflake"}]},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Card frozen","ar":"البطاقة مجمّدة"},"icon":"snowflake","style":"outline","gap":"m"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"list-bullets","text":{"en":"Card transactions","ar":"معاملات البطاقة"},"chevron":true,"gap":"m"}]},"options":[{"id":"unfreeze","text":{"en":"\"Unfreeze card\"","ar":"«ألغِ تجميد البطاقة»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rasid","name":{"en":"Rasid","ar":"رصيد"},"color":"#1C3D6E","icon":"bank","domain":"rasid.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Cards","ar":"البطاقات"}},"tabbar":{"active":2,"items":[{"icon":"wallet","text":{"en":"Accounts","ar":"الحسابات"}},{"icon":"arrows-left-right","text":{"en":"Transfers","ar":"التحويلات"}},{"icon":"credit-card","text":{"en":"Cards","ar":"البطاقات"}},{"icon":"user","text":{"en":"Profile","ar":"حسابي"}}]},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"bank-card","size":"m","alt":{"en":"Debit card ending 4821","ar":"بطاقة خصم تنتهي بـ 4821"}},{"kind":"row","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Debit card ·· 4821","ar":"بطاقة الخصم ·· 4821"},"weight":"bold"},{"kind":"badge","text":{"en":"Frozen","ar":"مجمّدة"},"tone":"warn","icon":"snowflake"}]},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Unfreeze card","ar":"ألغِ تجميد البطاقة"},"icon":"snowflake","style":"outline","gap":"m"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"list-bullets","text":{"en":"Card transactions","ar":"معاملات البطاقة"},"chevron":true,"gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"freeze","text":{"en":"\"Freeze card\"","ar":"«جمّد البطاقة»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rasid","name":{"en":"Rasid","ar":"رصيد"},"color":"#1C3D6E","icon":"bank","domain":"rasid.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Cards","ar":"البطاقات"}},"tabbar":{"active":2,"items":[{"icon":"wallet","text":{"en":"Accounts","ar":"الحسابات"}},{"icon":"arrows-left-right","text":{"en":"Transfers","ar":"التحويلات"}},{"icon":"credit-card","text":{"en":"Cards","ar":"البطاقات"}},{"icon":"user","text":{"en":"Profile","ar":"حسابي"}}]},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"bank-card","size":"m","alt":{"en":"Debit card ending 4821","ar":"بطاقة خصم تنتهي بـ 4821"}},{"kind":"row","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Debit card ·· 4821","ar":"بطاقة الخصم ·· 4821"},"weight":"bold"},{"kind":"badge","text":{"en":"Frozen","ar":"مجمّدة"},"tone":"warn","icon":"snowflake"}]},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Freeze card","ar":"جمّد البطاقة"},"icon":"snowflake","style":"outline","gap":"m"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"list-bullets","text":{"en":"Card transactions","ar":"معاملات البطاقة"},"chevron":true,"gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"status","text":{"en":"\"Status: frozen\"","ar":"«الحالة: مجمّدة»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rasid","name":{"en":"Rasid","ar":"رصيد"},"color":"#1C3D6E","icon":"bank","domain":"rasid.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Cards","ar":"البطاقات"}},"tabbar":{"active":2,"items":[{"icon":"wallet","text":{"en":"Accounts","ar":"الحسابات"}},{"icon":"arrows-left-right","text":{"en":"Transfers","ar":"التحويلات"}},{"icon":"credit-card","text":{"en":"Cards","ar":"البطاقات"}},{"icon":"user","text":{"en":"Profile","ar":"حسابي"}}]},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"bank-card","size":"m","alt":{"en":"Debit card ending 4821","ar":"بطاقة خصم تنتهي بـ 4821"}},{"kind":"row","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Debit card ·· 4821","ar":"بطاقة الخصم ·· 4821"},"weight":"bold"},{"kind":"badge","text":{"en":"Frozen","ar":"مجمّدة"},"tone":"warn","icon":"snowflake"}]},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Status: frozen","ar":"الحالة: مجمّدة"},"icon":"snowflake","style":"outline","gap":"m"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"list-bullets","text":{"en":"Card transactions","ar":"معاملات البطاقة"},"chevron":true,"gap":"m"}]}}],"answer":["unfreeze"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P15-024","when":["status","freeze"],"feedback":{"en":"This doesn't name what the tap will do. The card is already frozen, so the only action left is to unfreeze it.","ar":"هذا لا يذكر ما ستفعله الضغطة. فالبطاقة مجمّدة أصلًا، والفعل الوحيد المتبقّي هو إلغاء التجميد."}}],"explain":{"en":"From Lesson 1: the label names the next state. The chip already shows the current one.","ar":"من الدرس 1: نص الزر يذكر الحالة التالية. والشارة (Chip) تُظهر الحالة الحالية أصلًا."},"speaker":"sara"},{"id":"S04","type":"choose","skill":"SK-P15-U04-03","part":"check","rules":["R19"],"value":{"en":"Skill check. Confirmation Dialogs (NN/g): be specific and tell users the consequence of their action, instead of asking \"Are you sure?\".","ar":"اختبار مهارة. رسائل التأكيد (NN/g): كن محددًا وأخبر المستخدمين بنتيجة فعلهم، بدل أن تسأل «هل أنت متأكد؟»."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/confirmation-dialog/","quote":"Be specific and inform users about the consequence of their action."},"scenario":{"en":"People can remove a saved person they send money to. Then they must add the person's account number again to send to them.","ar":"يستطيع الناس حذف شخص محفوظ يحوّلون إليه المال. وبعدها عليهم إضافة رقم حسابه مرة أخرى ليحوّلوا إليه."},"prompt":{"en":"Which confirmation helps people avoid removing the wrong person?","ar":"أي رسالة تأكيد تساعد الناس على تجنّب حذف الشخص الخطأ؟"},"options":[{"id":"sure","text":{"en":"\"Are you sure?\" with OK and Cancel","ar":"«هل أنت متأكد؟» مع «موافق» و«إلغاء»"}},{"id":"named","text":{"en":"\"Remove Ahmed Samir (·· 7730)? To send him money again, you'll need his account number.\" with Keep Ahmed and Remove Ahmed","ar":"«حذف أحمد سمير (·· 7730)؟ لتحوّل إليه مرة أخرى، ستحتاج إلى رقم حسابه.» مع «أبقِ أحمد» و«احذف أحمد»"}},{"id":"remove","text":{"en":"\"Remove this person?\" with No and Yes","ar":"«حذف هذا الشخص؟» مع «لا» و«نعم»"}}],"answer":["named"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P15-027","when":["sure","remove"],"feedback":{"en":"No name, no result, and generic buttons. People will tap through without checking.","ar":"لا اسم، ولا نتيجة، وأزرار عامة. وسيضغط الناس ويتابعون دون تحقّق."}}],"explain":{"en":"From Lesson 2: name the item and the result, and let each button say what it does.","ar":"من الدرس 2: اذكر العنصر والنتيجة، ودع كل زر يقول ما يفعله."},"speaker":"sara"},{"id":"S05","type":"choose","skill":"SK-P15-U04-04","part":"check","rules":["R19"],"value":{"en":"Skill check. \"Learn More\" Links (NN/g): the best fix is usually to use keywords that describe the link's destination, front-loaded.","ar":"اختبار مهارة. روابط «اعرف المزيد» (NN/g): أفضل حل غالبًا هو استخدام كلمات تصف وجهة الرابط، في أوله."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/learn-more-links/","quote":"Option 1: Use keywords that describe the link's destination."},"scenario":{"en":"Under the card offer, a link says \"Learn more\". It opens a table of all the card's fees.","ar":"تحت عرض البطاقة رابط يقول «اعرف المزيد». وهو يفتح جدولًا بكل رسوم البطاقة."},"prompt":{"en":"Which link label is best?","ar":"أيّ نص للرابط يقول بصدق ما يفتحه؟"},"options":[{"id":"details","text":{"en":"\"More details\"","ar":"«تفاصيل أكثر»"}},{"id":"benefits","text":{"en":"\"Discover all the benefits\"","ar":"«اكتشف كل المزايا»"}},{"id":"fees","text":{"en":"\"See all card fees\"","ar":"«شاهد كل رسوم البطاقة»"}}],"answer":["fees"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P15-028","when":["details"],"feedback":{"en":"Still vague. Details about what: the card, the offer, or the fees?","ar":"ما زال غامضًا. تفاصيل عن ماذا: البطاقة، أم العرض، أم الرسوم؟"}},{"id":"MC-P15-029","when":["benefits"],"feedback":{"en":"The page shows fees, not benefits. People expecting good news will feel misled.","ar":"الصفحة تعرض الرسوم، لا المزايا. ومن ينتظر أخبارًا جيدة سيشعر بأنه خُدع."}}],"explain":{"en":"From Lesson 2: say what the link opens, and say it truthfully.","ar":"من الدرس 2: قل ما يفتحه الرابط، وقله بصدق."},"speaker":"sara"}]}$uxg$::jsonb),
  ($uxg$P15-U05-L01$uxg$, $uxg$2146762bcdf5ec288769e1735147b4d91ff2874ca630a3f82201e27f22b9148c$uxg$, $uxg${"id":"P15-U05-L01","mode":"lesson","minutes":7,"title":{"en":"Empty screens that help","ar":"شاشات فارغة تساعد"},"summary":{"en":"Rewrite the empty screens in a shop's app so new customers know what goes there and how to start.","ar":"أعد كتابة الشاشات الفارغة في تطبيق متجر حتى يعرف العملاء الجدد ما يوضع فيها وكيف يبدؤون."},"speaker":"youssef","review_labels":{"MC-P15-030":{"en":"A blank or \"No data\" screen leaves people wondering what goes there","ar":"الشاشة الفارغة أو «لا توجد بيانات» تترك الناس يتساءلون عمّا يوضع فيها"},"MC-P15-031":{"en":"Saying \"nothing here\" while loading is worse than saying nothing","ar":"قول «لا يوجد شيء» أثناء التحميل أسوأ من الصمت"},"MC-P15-032":{"en":"Instructions alone aren't a way to start; give a button","ar":"التعليمات وحدها ليست طريقًا للبدء؛ أعطِ زرًّا"}},"steps":[{"id":"S01","type":"card","part":"hook","title":{"en":"Is the app broken?","ar":"هل التطبيق معطّل؟"},"body":{"en":"I own a home-appliances shop, and we just launched our app. New customers open \"Saved items\" and see an empty white screen.\n\nSome of them messaged us: \"Is the app broken?\" Nothing was broken. They just hadn't saved anything yet.","ar":"أملك متجرًا للأجهزة المنزلية، وأطلقنا تطبيقنا للتو. والعملاء الجدد يفتحون «المحفوظات» فيرون شاشة بيضاء فارغة.\n\nراسلنا بعضهم: «هل التطبيق معطّل؟» لم يكن شيء معطّلًا. هم فقط لم يحفظوا شيئًا بعد."},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Saved items","ar":"المحفوظات"}},"tabbar":{"active":0,"items":[{"icon":"house","text":{"en":"Home","ar":"الرئيسية"}},{"icon":"squares-four","text":{"en":"Departments","ar":"الأقسام"}},{"icon":"package","text":{"en":"Orders","ar":"طلباتي"}},{"icon":"shopping-cart","text":{"en":"Cart","ar":"السلة"}},{"icon":"user","text":{"en":"Account","ar":"حسابي"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"box","size":"m"},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Nothing saved yet","ar":"لا شيء محفوظ بعد"},"gap":"m","tone":"faint"},{"kind":"divider","gap":"s"},{"kind":"divider","gap":"xl"}]}},{"id":"S02","type":"choose","skill":"SK-P15-U05-01","part":"try","rules":["R12"],"value":{"en":"Try first. Empty States (NN/g): when content doesn't exist yet, tell the user what could be displayed and how to fill the area; one app says \"Star your favorites to list them here\".","ar":"جرّب أولًا. الحالات الفارغة (NN/g): حين لا يوجد محتوى بعد، أخبر المستخدم بما يمكن أن يظهر وكيف تُملأ المساحة؛ فأحد التطبيقات يقول «ضع نجمة على مفضّلاتك لتظهر هنا»."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/empty-state-interface-design/","quote":"Tell the user what could be displayed, and how to populate the area with that content."},"prompt":{"en":"Which text should the empty \"Saved items\" screen show?","ar":"أي نص يجب أن تعرضه شاشة «المحفوظات» الفارغة؟"},"options":[{"id":"nodata","text":{"en":"\"No items.\"","ar":"«لا توجد عناصر.»"}},{"id":"cue","text":{"en":"\"Tap ♡ on any product to save it here.\"","ar":"«اضغط ♡ على أي منتج لتحفظه هنا.»"}},{"id":"cute","text":{"en":"\"Nothing to see here… yet 🦗\"","ar":"«لا شيء هنا… حتى الآن 🦗»"}}],"answer":["cue"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P15-030","when":["nodata","cute"],"feedback":{"en":"It says the screen is empty, which people can see. It doesn't say what goes here, or how to add it.","ar":"تقول إن الشاشة فارغة، والناس يرون ذلك. لكنها لا تقول ما الذي يوضع هنا، ولا كيف يُضاف."}}],"hints":[{"en":"What would a new customer need to know to fill this screen?","ar":"ماذا يحتاج العميل الجديد أن يعرف ليملأ هذه الشاشة؟"},{"en":"Look for the text that teaches how to save something.","ar":"ابحث عن النص الذي يعلّم كيف يُحفظ شيء."}],"correct":{"en":"Right. It says what goes here, and how.","ar":"صحيح. يقول ما الذي يوضع هنا، وكيف."},"explain":{"en":"An empty screen is a chance to teach. One line can explain the feature right when people need it.","ar":"الشاشة الفارغة فرصة للتعليم. فسطر واحد يمكنه أن يشرح الميزة في اللحظة التي يحتاجها الناس."}},{"id":"S03","type":"card","part":"concept","icons":["none","idea","tap","clock"],"title":{"en":"Empty is a message, too","ar":"الفراغ رسالة أيضًا"},"body":{"en":"When a screen has nothing to show, people wonder: is it loading? Is it broken? Did I do something wrong?\n\n- **Say what goes here, and how to add it:** \"Tap ♡ on any product to save it here.\"\n- **Give a direct way to start:** a button like \"Add address\", not just directions to another screen.\n- **Be honest about loading:** while content loads, show that it's loading. Say \"No orders yet\" only when you know there are none.","ar":"حين لا يكون في الشاشة ما تعرضه (Empty state)، يتساءل الناس: هل ما زالت تُحمَّل؟ هل هي معطّلة؟ هل أخطأت في شيء؟\n\n- **قل ما الذي يوضع هنا، وكيف يُضاف:** «اضغط ♡ على أي منتج لتحفظه هنا.»\n- **أعطِ طريقًا مباشرًا للبدء:** زرًّا مثل «أضف عنوانًا»، لا مجرد إرشادات إلى شاشة أخرى.\n- **كن صادقًا بشأن التحميل:** أثناء تحميل المحتوى، أظهِر أنه يُحمَّل. وقل «لا توجد طلبات بعد» فقط حين تعرف أنه لا توجد طلبات."}},{"id":"S04","type":"choose","skill":"SK-P15-U05-01","part":"guided","rules":["R06"],"value":{"en":"Empty States (NN/g): a common, harmful case is showing \"No records\" while content is still loading, then replacing it; inaccurate status messages for empty states are particularly harmful.","ar":"الحالات الفارغة (NN/g): حالة شائعة وضارة هي عرض «لا توجد سجلات» بينما المحتوى ما زال يُحمَّل، ثم استبدالها؛ ورسائل الحالة غير الدقيقة في الشاشات الفارغة ضارة بشكل خاص."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/empty-state-interface-design/","quote":"Inaccurate system-status messages for empty states are particularly harmful."},"scenario":{"en":"When customers open \"My orders\", it says \"You have no orders\" for 3 seconds. Then their orders appear. Some leave before that and call us, worried.","ar":"حين يفتح العملاء «طلباتي»، تظهر عبارة «ليس لديك طلبات» لمدة 3 ثوانٍ. ثم تظهر طلباتهم. وبعضهم يخرج قبل ذلك ويتصل بنا قلقًا."},"prompt":{"en":"What should this screen show?","ar":"ماذا يجب أن تعرض هذه الشاشة؟"},"options":[{"id":"faster","text":{"en":"Keep the text, and try to make loading faster","ar":"أبقي النص، وأحاول جعل التحميل أسرع"}},{"id":"blank","text":{"en":"Show a blank screen until the orders load","ar":"أعرض شاشة فارغة حتى تُحمَّل الطلبات"}},{"id":"honest","text":{"en":"\"Loading your orders…\" with a spinner, and \"No orders yet\" only if there really are none","ar":"«جارٍ تحميل طلباتك…» مع مؤشّر تحميل، و«لا توجد طلبات بعد» فقط إن لم توجد فعلًا"}}],"answer":["honest"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P15-031","when":["faster"],"feedback":{"en":"Even for one second, \"You have no orders\" is false. People who believe it may never see their orders.","ar":"حتى لثانية واحدة، عبارة «ليس لديك طلبات» غير صحيحة. ومن يصدّقها قد لا يرى طلباته أبدًا."}},{"id":"MC-P15-030","when":["blank"],"feedback":{"en":"A blank screen makes people wonder if it's broken or still working.","ar":"الشاشة الفارغة تجعل الناس يتساءلون هل هي معطّلة أم ما زالت تعمل."}}],"hints":[{"en":"During those 3 seconds, what's really happening?","ar":"خلال هذه الثواني الثلاث، ما الذي يحدث فعلًا؟"},{"en":"Pick the option where every message is true when it's shown.","ar":"اختر الخيار الذي تكون فيه كل رسالة صحيحة وقت ظهورها."}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Say it's loading while it loads.","ar":"صحيح. قل إنها تُحمَّل أثناء التحميل."},"explain":{"en":"\"Nothing here\" must mean nothing is here. Until you know, say it's loading.","ar":"«لا يوجد شيء» يجب أن تعني أنه لا يوجد شيء فعلًا. وحتى تعرف، قل إنها تُحمَّل."},"speaker":"youssef"},{"id":"S05","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P15-U05-02","part":"guided","rules":["R06"],"value":{"en":"Empty States (NN/g): instead of only describing what to do, give brief explicit instructions, or better, link directly to the steps that fill the empty state.","ar":"الحالات الفارغة (NN/g): بدل أن تصف فقط ما يجب فعله، أعطِ تعليمات قصيرة وواضحة، أو الأفضل، رابطًا مباشرًا إلى الخطوات التي تملأ الشاشة الفارغة."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/empty-state-interface-design/","quote":"A better approach is to provide brief yet explicit instructions or, better yet, link directly to the steps that need to be taken to complete tasks associated with populating the empty state."},"scenario":{"en":"New customers have no delivery addresses yet. This is what they see at checkout.","ar":"العملاء الجدد ليس لديهم عناوين توصيل بعد. وهذا ما يرونه عند الدفع."},"prompt":{"en":"Tap each option to see the change. Which version gets people to add an address fastest?","ar":"اضغط على كل خيار لترى التغيير. أي نسخة تجعل الناس يضيفون عنوانًا بأسرع طريقة؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Checkout","ar":"إتمام الطلب"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"blocks":[{"kind":"progress","value":50,"label":{"en":"Step 2 of 4","ar":"الخطوة 2 من 4"}},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Delivery address","ar":"عنوان التوصيل"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"icon","icon":"map-pin-line","size":"l","color":"muted","gap":"m"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"You have no saved addresses. To add one, go to Settings > Account > Addresses.","ar":"ليس لديك عناوين محفوظة. لتضيف عنوانًا، اذهب إلى الإعدادات > الحساب > العناوين."},"color":"muted","gap":"xs"}]},"options":[{"id":"button","text":{"en":"Add an \"Add address\" button right here","ar":"أضف زر «أضف عنوانًا» هنا مباشرة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Checkout","ar":"إتمام الطلب"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"progress","value":50,"label":{"en":"Step 2 of 4","ar":"الخطوة 2 من 4"}},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Delivery address","ar":"عنوان التوصيل"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"icon","icon":"map-pin-line","size":"l","color":"muted","gap":"m"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Add an address so we know where to deliver.","ar":"أضف عنوانًا لنعرف أين نوصّل طلبك."},"color":"muted","gap":"xs"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Add address","ar":"أضف عنوانًا"},"icon":"plus","gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"bold","text":{"en":"Make the directions bold","ar":"اجعل الإرشادات بخط Bold"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Checkout","ar":"إتمام الطلب"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"progress","value":50,"label":{"en":"Step 2 of 4","ar":"الخطوة 2 من 4"}},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Delivery address","ar":"عنوان التوصيل"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"icon","icon":"map-pin-line","size":"l","color":"muted","gap":"m"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"You have no saved addresses. To add one, go to **Settings > Account > Addresses**.","ar":"ليس لديك عناوين محفوظة. لتضيف عنوانًا، اذهب إلى **الإعدادات > الحساب > العناوين**."},"color":"muted","gap":"xs"}]}},{"id":"short","text":{"en":"Shorten it to \"No addresses\"","ar":"اختصره إلى «لا توجد عناوين»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Checkout","ar":"إتمام الطلب"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"progress","value":50,"label":{"en":"Step 2 of 4","ar":"الخطوة 2 من 4"}},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Delivery address","ar":"عنوان التوصيل"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"icon","icon":"map-pin-line","size":"l","color":"muted","gap":"m"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"No addresses","ar":"لا توجد عناوين"},"color":"muted","gap":"xs"}]}}],"answer":["button"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P15-032","when":["bold"],"feedback":{"en":"Easier to see, but people still have to leave checkout and dig through 3 screens.","ar":"أسهل في الرؤية، لكن على الناس أن يغادروا صفحة الدفع ويبحثوا في 3 شاشات."}},{"id":"MC-P15-030","when":["short"],"feedback":{"en":"Shorter, but now people don't know how to add one at all.","ar":"أقصر، لكن الناس الآن لا يعرفون كيف يضيفون عنوانًا على الإطلاق."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Where are people right now? Do they want to leave?","ar":"أين الناس الآن؟ هل يريدون المغادرة؟"},{"en":"The fastest path starts on this screen.","ar":"أسرع طريق يبدأ من هذه الشاشة."}],"correct":{"en":"Right. One tap, and they never leave checkout.","ar":"صحيح. ضغطة واحدة، ولا يغادرون صفحة الدفع أبدًا."},"explain":{"en":"Don't send people somewhere else to fill an empty screen. Bring the action to them.","ar":"لا ترسل الناس إلى مكان آخر ليملؤوا الشاشة الفارغة. بل ضع الخطوة أمامهم هنا."},"speaker":"youssef"},{"id":"S06","type":"compare","skill":"SK-P15-U05-02","part":"contrast","confidence":true,"rules":["R11"],"value":{"en":"Contrast: a status message only vs a message with a direct path. Empty States (NN/g): provide direct pathways (links) to getting started with the key tasks that fill the empty state.","ar":"مقارنة: رسالة حالة فقط مقابل رسالة مع طريق مباشر. الحالات الفارغة (NN/g): وفّر طرقًا مباشرة (روابط) للبدء في المهام الأساسية التي تملأ الشاشة الفارغة."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/empty-state-interface-design/","quote":"Provide direct pathways (i.e., links) to getting started with key tasks related to populating the empty state."},"scenario":{"en":"We added gift cards. Most customers have none yet, so the \"Gift cards\" screen is empty. We wrote two versions.","ar":"أضفنا بطاقات الهدايا. ومعظم العملاء ليس لديهم أي بطاقة بعد، فشاشة «بطاقات الهدايا» فارغة. وكتبنا نسختين."},"prompt":{"en":"Which version helps people start using gift cards?","ar":"أي نسخة تساعد الناس على البدء في استخدام بطاقات الهدايا؟"},"a":{"label":{"en":"A: The message explains, and a button starts the task.","ar":"A: الرسالة تشرح، وزر يبدأ المهمة."},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Gift cards","ar":"بطاقات الهدايا"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"box","size":"m"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Send a gift card to a friend in 2 minutes. Cards you get will show here too.","ar":"أرسل بطاقة هدية لصديق في دقيقتين. والبطاقات التي تصلك ستظهر هنا أيضًا."},"color":"muted","gap":"xs"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Send a gift card","ar":"أرسل بطاقة هدية"},"gap":"s"}]}},"b":{"label":{"en":"B: The message says there are none.","ar":"B: الرسالة تقول إنه لا توجد بطاقات."},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Gift cards","ar":"بطاقات الهدايا"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"box","size":"m"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"You have no gift cards. Gift cards can be bought in the Gifts section.","ar":"ليس لديك بطاقات هدايا. ويمكن شراء بطاقات الهدايا من قسم الهدايا."},"color":"muted","gap":"xs"}]}},"answer":"a","reason":{"prompt":{"en":"Why does A work better?","ar":"لماذا A أفضل؟"},"options":[{"id":"path","text":{"en":"It says what the screen is for, and starts the task in one tap","ar":"تقول ما الغرض من الشاشة، وتبدأ المهمة بضغطة واحدة"}},{"id":"friendly","text":{"en":"It sounds friendlier","ar":"تبدو أكثر ودًّا"}},{"id":"longer","text":{"en":"Longer text is always more helpful","ar":"النص الأطول أكثر فائدة دائمًا"}}],"answer":["path"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P15-032","when":["friendly","longer"],"feedback":{"en":"Tone and length aren't the main difference. A gives a way to start right here.","ar":"النبرة والطول ليسا الفرق الأساسي. A تعطي طريقًا للبدء هنا مباشرة."}}]},"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P15-032","when":["b"],"feedback":{"en":"B points to another section and stops there. People have to go and find it themselves.","ar":"B تشير إلى قسم آخر وتتوقّف. وعلى الناس أن يذهبوا ويبحثوا عنه بأنفسهم."}}],"hints":[{"en":"In which version can people act without leaving the screen?","ar":"في أي نسخة يستطيع الناس التصرّف دون مغادرة الشاشة؟"},{"en":"Look for a button.","ar":"ابحث عن زر."}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Explain, then let them start.","ar":"صحيح. اشرح، ثم دعهم يبدؤون."},"explain":{"en":"An empty screen should answer \"what now?\" with an action, not only with words.","ar":"الشاشة الفارغة يجب أن تجيب عن «ماذا الآن؟» بفعل، لا بالكلمات فقط."},"speaker":"youssef"},{"id":"S07","type":"choose","skill":"SK-P15-U05-01","part":"guided","rules":["R06"],"value":{"en":"Empty States (NN/g): an empty alerts panel misses a chance to educate; a brief message can say what alerts are and how to start using them.","ar":"الحالات الفارغة (NN/g): لوحة التنبيهات الفارغة تُضيع فرصة للتعليم؛ ورسالة قصيرة يمكنها أن تقول ما التنبيهات وكيف تبدأ في استخدامها."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/empty-state-interface-design/","quote":"A brief dialogue could provide information about what alerts are and how to get started using them."},"scenario":{"en":"We have a \"Price alerts\" screen. Almost nobody knows what it does, and it's empty for everyone at first.","ar":"عندنا شاشة «تنبيهات الأسعار». ولا يعرف أحد تقريبًا ما تفعله، وهي فارغة للجميع في البداية."},"prompt":{"en":"Which empty-screen text teaches people the feature?","ar":"أي نص للشاشة الفارغة يعلّم الناس الميزة؟"},"options":[{"id":"none","text":{"en":"\"No alerts.\"","ar":"«لا توجد تنبيهات.»"}},{"id":"name","text":{"en":"\"Price alerts: 0\"","ar":"«تنبيهات الأسعار: 0»"}},{"id":"teach","text":{"en":"\"Get a message when a price drops. Tap 🔔 on any product to set an alert.\"","ar":"«تصلك رسالة حين ينخفض السعر. اضغط 🔔 على أي منتج لتضبط تنبيهًا.»"}}],"answer":["teach"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P15-030","when":["none","name"],"feedback":{"en":"True, but people still don't know what an alert is or why they'd want one.","ar":"صحيح، لكن الناس ما زالوا لا يعرفون ما التنبيه ولماذا قد يريدونه."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Most people don't know what this feature does yet.","ar":"معظم الناس لا يعرفون ما تفعله هذه الميزة بعد."},{"en":"Pick the text that explains the feature and how to start.","ar":"اختر النص الذي يشرح الميزة وكيف تبدأ."}],"correct":{"en":"Right. What it is, why it helps, and how to start.","ar":"صحيح. ما هي، ولماذا تفيد، وكيف تبدأ."},"explain":{"en":"Teach a feature where people find it empty. That's when they're curious.","ar":"علّم الميزة حيث يجدها الناس فارغة. ففي تلك اللحظة يكونون فضوليين."},"speaker":"youssef"},{"id":"S08","type":"choose","skill":"SK-P15-U05-02","part":"independent","speaker":"hana","rules":["R14"],"value":{"en":"New case. Empty States (NN/g): an empty state can offer direct pathways into the workflow, so users get started with key tasks from right there.","ar":"حالة جديدة. الحالات الفارغة (NN/g): الشاشة الفارغة يمكن أن تقدّم طرقًا مباشرة إلى سير العمل، فيبدأ المستخدمون المهام الأساسية من هناك."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/empty-state-interface-design/","quote":"empty states can also be used to provide direct pathways for getting users started with key tasks"},"scenario":{"en":"New members open \"My workouts\" in my gym app before their first class. It's empty.","ar":"يفتح الأعضاء الجدد «تماريني» في تطبيق ناديّ قبل حصتهم الأولى. وهي فارغة."},"prompt":{"en":"Which empty screen gets new members moving?","ar":"أي شاشة فارغة تجعل الأعضاء الجدد يبدؤون؟"},"options":[{"id":"motto","text":{"en":"\"No pain, no gain! 💪\"","ar":"«لا نجاح بلا تعب! 💪»"}},{"id":"start","text":{"en":"\"Your workouts will show here after your first class.\" with a \"Book your first class\" button","ar":"«ستظهر تمارينك هنا بعد حصتك الأولى.» مع زر «احجز حصتك الأولى»"}},{"id":"menu","text":{"en":"\"No workouts yet. Book a class from the Classes tab.\"","ar":"«لا توجد تمارين بعد. احجز حصة من تبويب الحصص.»"}}],"answer":["start"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P15-030","when":["motto"],"feedback":{"en":"Motivating, maybe, but it doesn't say what this screen is for or what to do.","ar":"قد تكون محفّزة، لكنها لا تقول ما الغرض من الشاشة ولا ماذا عليهم أن يفعلوا."}},{"id":"MC-P15-032","when":["menu"],"feedback":{"en":"Clear, but it sends people to another tab instead of letting them book right here.","ar":"واضحة، لكنها ترسل الناس إلى تبويب آخر بدل أن تتيح لهم الحجز هنا مباشرة."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. It explains, and the first step is one tap away.","ar":"صحيح. تشرح، ثم تتيح الخطوة الأولى بضغطة واحدة."},"explain":{"en":"Explain what will appear, then put the first step in reach.","ar":"اشرح ما الذي سيظهر، ثم ضع الخطوة الأولى في المتناول."}},{"id":"S09","type":"card","part":"recap","icons":["idea","tap","clock","ok"],"title":{"en":"What you did","ar":"ماذا تعلّمت"},"body":{"en":"- **Taught the feature:** \"Tap ♡ on any product to save it here.\"\n- **Honest loading:** \"Loading your orders…\", never a false \"no orders\".\n- **A direct path:** \"Add address\" right at checkout.\n- **Action, not directions:** \"Send a gift card\" beat \"buy them in the Gifts section\".\n- **Explain new features:** what price alerts are, and how to set one.\n\nNext lesson: notifications people want.","ar":"- **علّمت الميزة:** «اضغط ♡ على أي منتج لتحفظه هنا.»\n- **تحميل صادق:** «جارٍ تحميل طلباتك…»، وليس «لا توجد طلبات» وهي غير صحيحة.\n- **طريق مباشر:** «أضف عنوانًا» في صفحة الدفع نفسها.\n- **فعل لا إرشادات:** «أرسل بطاقة هدية» تفوّقت على «اشترِها من قسم الهدايا».\n- **اشرح الميزات الجديدة:** ما تنبيهات الأسعار، وكيف تضبط واحدًا.\n\nالدرس التالي: إشعارات يريدها الناس."}}]}$uxg$::jsonb),
  ($uxg$P15-U05-L02$uxg$, $uxg$d08f878397caf8ea0bf904f4fe567a4cb83985e56eea6012bbcb57578508b77a$uxg$, $uxg${"id":"P15-U05-L02","mode":"lesson","minutes":7,"title":{"en":"Notifications people want","ar":"إشعارات يريدها الناس"},"summary":{"en":"Decide when a bus app asks for notifications, what it says, and which alerts are worth sending.","ar":"قرّر متى يطلب تطبيق حافلات الإذن بالإشعارات، وماذا يقول، وأي تنبيهات تستحق الإرسال."},"speaker":"rami","review_labels":{"MC-P15-033":{"en":"Asking for notifications before people see any value","ar":"طلب الإذن بالإشعارات قبل أن يرى الناس أي فائدة"},"MC-P15-034":{"en":"The ask must say what the notifications will be about","ar":"طلب الإذن يجب أن يقول موضوع الإشعارات"},"MC-P15-035":{"en":"Many notifications at once irritate; combine them","ar":"الإشعارات الكثيرة دفعة واحدة مزعجة؛ فاجمعها"},"MC-P15-036":{"en":"Notifications about things that don't concern this person","ar":"إشعارات عن أشياء لا تخصّ هذا الشخص"}},"steps":[{"id":"S01","type":"card","part":"hook","title":{"en":"\"Don't Allow\"","ar":"«عدم السماح»"},"body":{"en":"I'm a junior designer on our bus-ticket app. The moment people open it for the first time, it asks: \"Rehla would like to send you notifications.\"\n\nMost tap \"Don't Allow\". Then they miss delay alerts we could have sent them.","ar":"أنا مصمم مبتدئ في تطبيق تذاكر الحافلات. وفي اللحظة التي يفتح فيها الناس التطبيق لأول مرة، يسألهم: «يريد تطبيق رحلة أن يرسل لك إشعارات.»\n\nمعظمهم يضغط «عدم السماح». ثم تفوتهم تنبيهات التأخير التي كان يمكن أن نرسلها لهم."},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rehla","name":{"en":"Rehla","ar":"رحلة"},"color":"#7048E8","icon":"bus","domain":"rehla.example"},"appbar":{"logo":true},"tabbar":{"active":0,"items":[{"icon":"magnifying-glass","text":{"en":"Search","ar":"البحث"}},{"icon":"ticket","text":{"en":"My trips","ar":"رحلاتي"}},{"icon":"bell","text":{"en":"Alerts","ar":"التنبيهات"}},{"icon":"user","text":{"en":"Account","ar":"حسابي"}}]},"overlay":{"type":"dialog","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"\"Rehla\" would like to send you notifications","ar":"يريد «رحلة» أن يرسل لك إشعارات"}},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Notifications may include alerts, sounds and icon badges.","ar":"قد تشمل الإشعارات تنبيهات وأصواتًا وشارات على الأيقونة."},"color":"muted","gap":"s"},{"kind":"row","gap":"m","blocks":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Don't Allow","ar":"عدم السماح"},"style":"text"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Allow","ar":"السماح"},"style":"text"}]}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"searchbar","text":{"en":"Where to?","ar":"إلى أين؟"}},{"kind":"image","art":"bus","size":"m","gap":"m"},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Welcome to Rehla","ar":"مرحبًا بك في رحلة"},"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"S02","type":"choose","skill":"SK-P15-U05-03","part":"try","rules":["R12"],"value":{"en":"Try first. Push Notifications (NN/g): asking on first launch is so common that people barely read it and tap Don't Allow; use reciprocity and offer value first.","ar":"جرّب أولًا. الإشعارات (NN/g): الطلب عند أول فتح شائع جدًا حتى إن الناس بالكاد يقرؤونه ويضغطون «لا تسمح»؛ فاستخدم مبدأ المعاملة بالمثل وقدّم فائدة أولًا."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/push-notification/","quote":"Instead, apps should take advantage of the reciprocity principle and offer users some value first."},"prompt":{"en":"When should the app ask people to turn on notifications?","ar":"متى يجب أن يطلب التطبيق من الناس تشغيل الإشعارات؟"},"options":[{"id":"first","text":{"en":"On first launch, so nobody misses the question","ar":"عند أول فتح، حتى لا يفوت السؤال أحدًا"}},{"id":"always","text":{"en":"Every time the app opens, until they say yes","ar":"في كل مرة يُفتح فيها التطبيق، حتى يوافقوا"}},{"id":"after","text":{"en":"Right after their first booking: \"Want an alert if your bus is late or the gate changes?\"","ar":"بعد أول حجز مباشرة: «هل تريد تنبيهًا إن تأخّرت حافلتك أو تغيّرت البوابة؟»"}}],"answer":["after"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P15-033","when":["first","always"],"feedback":{"en":"At that point, people haven't seen anything useful from the app. They have no reason to say yes.","ar":"في تلك اللحظة، لم يرَ الناس أي شيء مفيد من التطبيق. وليس لديهم سبب للموافقة."}}],"hints":[{"en":"When does a bus alert start to matter to someone?","ar":"متى يصبح تنبيه الحافلة مهمًا لشخص ما؟"},{"en":"People say yes more when they've already got something from the app.","ar":"الناس يوافقون أكثر حين يكونون قد حصلوا على شيء من التطبيق بالفعل."}],"correct":{"en":"Right. After booking, a delay alert is clearly useful.","ar":"صحيح. بعد الحجز، يكون تنبيه التأخير مفيدًا بوضوح."},"explain":{"en":"Ask when the value is obvious. Right after a booking, people know why they'd want alerts.","ar":"اطلب حين تكون الفائدة واضحة. فبعد الحجز مباشرة، يعرف الناس لماذا قد يريدون التنبيهات."}},{"id":"S03","type":"card","part":"concept","icons":["clock","text","layers","target"],"title":{"en":"Earn the right to interrupt","ar":"اجعل كل مقاطعة تستحقّ"},"body":{"en":"Every notification interrupts someone. Make each one worth it.\n\n- **Ask at the right time:** after people have seen what the app does for them.\n- **Say what they'll get:** \"Alerts for delays and gate changes\", not \"We'd like to send you notifications\".\n- **Don't send bursts:** combine many updates into one message.\n- **Only what matters to them:** news about their own trip, not other people's.","ar":"كل إشعار يقاطع شخصًا ما. فاجعل كل واحد يستحق ذلك.\n\n- **اطلب في الوقت المناسب:** بعد أن يرى الناس ما يقدّمه التطبيق لهم.\n- **قل ما سيحصلون عليه:** «تنبيهات التأخير وتغيير البوابة»، لا «نودّ أن نرسل لك إشعارات».\n- **لا ترسل سيلًا من الإشعارات:** اجمع التحديثات الكثيرة في رسالة واحدة.\n- **فقط ما يهمّهم:** أخبار رحلتهم هم، لا رحلات الآخرين."}},{"id":"S04","type":"words","skill":"SK-P15-U05-03","part":"guided","rules":["R06"],"value":{"en":"Push Notifications (NN/g): the generic \"X would like to send you notifications\" focuses on what the company wants, not what the user gains; tell people what notifications will be about.","ar":"الإشعارات (NN/g): العبارة العامة «يريد X أن يرسل لك إشعارات» تركّز على ما تريده الشركة، لا على ما يكسبه المستخدم؛ فأخبر الناس عمّا ستكون الإشعارات."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/push-notification/","quote":"Tell people what notifications will be about to increase the chance that they will accept your request."},"scenario":{"en":"Before the phone's own pop-up, we show our own short message after the first booking.","ar":"بعد أول حجز، وقبل أن تظهر نافذة النظام في الهاتف، نعرض رسالة قصيرة منّا."},"prompt":{"en":"Which message gives people a reason to say yes?","ar":"أي رسالة تعطي الناس سببًا للموافقة؟"},"options":[{"id":"want","text":{"en":"\"We'd love to stay in touch! Turn on notifications.\"","ar":"«يسعدنا أن نبقى على تواصل! شغّل الإشعارات.»"}},{"id":"value","text":{"en":"\"Get an alert if your bus is late or your gate changes.\"","ar":"«احصل على تنبيه إن تأخّرت حافلتك أو تغيّرت بوابتك.»"}},{"id":"news","text":{"en":"\"Turn on notifications for news, offers and more.\"","ar":"«شغّل الإشعارات للأخبار والعروض والمزيد.»"}}],"answer":["value"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P15-034","when":["want"],"feedback":{"en":"This is about what we want. It doesn't say what people will get.","ar":"هذه عمّا نريده نحن. ولا تقول ما الذي سيحصل عليه الناس."}},{"id":"MC-P15-036","when":["news"],"feedback":{"en":"\"News, offers and more\" sounds like ads. Many people will say no to that.","ar":"«الأخبار والعروض والمزيد» تبدو كالإعلانات. وكثيرون سيرفضون ذلك."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Which message is about the traveler, not the company?","ar":"أي رسالة تخصّ المسافر، لا الشركة؟"},{"en":"Look for a specific alert people would want.","ar":"ابحث عن تنبيه محدد يريده الناس."}],"correct":{"en":"Right. People know exactly what they'll get.","ar":"صحيح. الناس يعرفون بالضبط ما سيحصلون عليه."},"explain":{"en":"Name the alerts and why they help. A clear benefit makes \"Allow\" an easy choice.","ar":"سمِّ التنبيهات ولماذا تفيد. فالفائدة الواضحة تجعل «اسمح» خيارًا سهلًا."},"speaker":"rami"},{"id":"S05","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P15-U05-04","part":"guided","rules":["R06"],"value":{"en":"Push Notifications (NN/g): bursts of notifications overwhelm and irritate users; if you have more than five to send at once, combine them into a single message.","ar":"الإشعارات (NN/g): دفعات الإشعارات ترهق المستخدمين وتزعجهم؛ وإن كان لديك أكثر من خمسة إشعارات لإرسالها معًا، فاجمعها في رسالة واحدة."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/push-notification/","quote":"If you have more than five notifications that you need to send at once, combine them into a single message."},"scenario":{"en":"Prices dropped on 6 trips that one traveler saved. The app sent 6 notifications in one minute.","ar":"انخفضت أسعار 6 رحلات حفظها أحد المسافرين. فأرسل التطبيق 6 إشعارات في دقيقة واحدة."},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rehla","name":{"en":"Rehla","ar":"رحلة"},"color":"#7048E8","icon":"bus","domain":"rehla.example"},"screen":"lock","blocks":[{"kind":"notification","title":{"en":"Price drop","ar":"انخفاض سعر"},"text":{"en":"Cairo → Alexandria","ar":"القاهرة ← الإسكندرية"},"time":{"en":"now","ar":"الآن"}},{"kind":"notification","title":{"en":"Price drop","ar":"انخفاض سعر"},"text":{"en":"Cairo → Luxor","ar":"القاهرة ← الأقصر"},"time":{"en":"now","ar":"الآن"}},{"kind":"notification","title":{"en":"Price drop","ar":"انخفاض سعر"},"text":{"en":"Cairo → Aswan","ar":"القاهرة ← أسوان"},"time":{"en":"now","ar":"الآن"}},{"kind":"notification","title":{"en":"Price drop","ar":"انخفاض سعر"},"text":{"en":"Giza → Hurghada","ar":"الجيزة ← الغردقة"},"time":{"en":"now","ar":"الآن"}},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"+ 2 more","ar":"+ 2 أخرى"},"color":"muted","gap":"xs"}],"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"}},"prompt":{"en":"What should the app send instead?","ar":"ماذا يجب أن يرسل التطبيق بدلًا من ذلك؟"},"options":[{"id":"one","text":{"en":"One notification: \"Prices dropped on 6 trips you saved. Cairo → Luxor is now EGP 380.\"","ar":"إشعارًا واحدًا: «انخفضت أسعار 6 رحلات حفظتها. القاهرة ← الأقصر الآن بـ 380 جنيهًا.»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rehla","name":{"en":"Rehla","ar":"رحلة"},"color":"#7048E8","icon":"bus","domain":"rehla.example"},"screen":"lock","blocks":[{"kind":"notification","title":{"en":"Price drop","ar":"انخفاض سعر"},"text":{"en":"Prices dropped on 6 trips you saved. Cairo → Luxor is now EGP 380.","ar":"انخفضت أسعار 6 رحلات حفظتها. القاهرة ← الأقصر الآن بـ 380 جنيهًا."},"time":{"en":"now","ar":"الآن"}}],"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}},{"id":"spread","text":{"en":"The same 6 notifications, one every hour","ar":"نفس الإشعارات الستة، واحدًا كل ساعة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rehla","name":{"en":"Rehla","ar":"رحلة"},"color":"#7048E8","icon":"bus","domain":"rehla.example"},"screen":"lock","blocks":[{"kind":"notification","title":{"en":"Price drop","ar":"انخفاض سعر"},"text":{"en":"Cairo → Alexandria","ar":"القاهرة ← الإسكندرية"},"time":{"en":"now","ar":"الآن"}},{"kind":"notification","title":{"en":"Price drop","ar":"انخفاض سعر"},"text":{"en":"Cairo → Luxor","ar":"القاهرة ← الأقصر"},"time":{"en":"1h ago","ar":"منذ ساعة"}},{"kind":"notification","title":{"en":"Price drop","ar":"انخفاض سعر"},"text":{"en":"Cairo → Aswan","ar":"القاهرة ← أسوان"},"time":{"en":"2h ago","ar":"منذ ساعتين"}},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"One more every hour, 3 to go","ar":"واحد آخر كل ساعة، بقي 3"},"color":"muted","gap":"xs"}],"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}},{"id":"vague","text":{"en":"One notification: \"Something changed! Open the app 👀\"","ar":"إشعارًا واحدًا: «شيء ما تغيّر! افتح التطبيق 👀»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rehla","name":{"en":"Rehla","ar":"رحلة"},"color":"#7048E8","icon":"bus","domain":"rehla.example"},"screen":"lock","blocks":[{"kind":"notification","title":{"en":"Rehla","ar":"رحلة"},"text":{"en":"Something changed! Open the app 👀","ar":"شيء ما تغيّر! افتح التطبيق 👀"},"time":{"en":"now","ar":"الآن"}}],"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}}],"answer":["one"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P15-035","when":["spread"],"feedback":{"en":"Now the traveler is interrupted 6 times in a day instead of 6 times in a minute. Still too many.","ar":"الآن يُقاطَع المسافر 6 مرات في اليوم بدل 6 مرات في الدقيقة. وما زال هذا كثيرًا."}},{"id":"MC-P15-036","when":["vague"],"feedback":{"en":"One message, but it says nothing. People can't tell if it matters to them.","ar":"رسالة واحدة، لكنها لا تقول شيئًا. ولا يعرف الناس هل تهمّهم."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Can one message carry all 6 updates?","ar":"هل يمكن لرسالة واحدة أن تحمل التحديثات الستة؟"},{"en":"The best message also shows the most useful detail.","ar":"أفضل رسالة تُظهر أيضًا أهمّ تفصيل مفيد."}],"correct":{"en":"Right. One message, all the news, and a useful detail.","ar":"صحيح. رسالة واحدة، وكل الأخبار، وتفصيل مفيد."},"explain":{"en":"Bundle updates that arrive together. One clear message beats six interruptions.","ar":"اجمع التحديثات التي تصل معًا. فرسالة واحدة واضحة أفضل من ست مقاطعات."},"speaker":"rami"},{"id":"S06","type":"compare","skill":"SK-P15-U05-04","part":"contrast","confidence":true,"rules":["R11"],"value":{"en":"Contrast: relevant vs irrelevant. Push Notifications (NN/g): any notification is an interruption, and when the message is irrelevant to us, the interruption is irritating.","ar":"مقارنة: مهمّ مقابل غير مهمّ. الإشعارات (NN/g): كل إشعار مقاطعة، وحين لا تخصّنا الرسالة تصبح المقاطعة مزعجة."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/push-notification/","quote":"When the message is irrelevant to us, the interruption is irritating."},"scenario":{"en":"Marketing wants to send more notifications. These are two they suggested for the same traveler, who has a 9:00 bus tomorrow.","ar":"يريد فريق التسويق إرسال إشعارات أكثر. وهذان إشعاران اقترحهما للمسافر نفسه، الذي لديه حافلة الساعة 9:00 غدًا."},"prompt":{"en":"Which notification is worth interrupting this traveler for?","ar":"أي إشعار يستحق مقاطعة هذا المسافر؟"},"a":{"label":{"en":"A: News about other people's trips.","ar":"A: أخبار عن رحلات أشخاص آخرين."},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rehla","name":{"en":"Rehla","ar":"رحلة"},"color":"#7048E8","icon":"bus","domain":"rehla.example"},"screen":"lock","blocks":[{"kind":"notification","title":{"en":"Rehla","ar":"رحلة"},"text":{"en":"🚌 Someone near you just booked a trip to Aswan!","ar":"🚌 شخص بالقرب منك حجز للتو رحلة إلى أسوان!"},"time":{"en":"now","ar":"الآن"}}]}},"b":{"label":{"en":"B: A change to this traveler's own trip.","ar":"B: تغيير في رحلة هذا المسافر نفسه."},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rehla","name":{"en":"Rehla","ar":"رحلة"},"color":"#7048E8","icon":"bus","domain":"rehla.example"},"screen":"lock","blocks":[{"kind":"notification","title":{"en":"Gate change","ar":"تغيير البوابة"},"text":{"en":"🚌 Your 9:00 bus to Alexandria now leaves from Gate 4.","ar":"🚌 حافلتك الساعة 9:00 إلى الإسكندرية تغادر الآن من البوابة 4."},"time":{"en":"now","ar":"الآن"}}]}},"answer":"b","reason":{"prompt":{"en":"Why is B worth sending?","ar":"لماذا يستحق B الإرسال؟"},"options":[{"id":"own","text":{"en":"It's about the traveler's own trip, and they need it to catch the bus","ar":"يخصّ رحلة المسافر نفسه، ويحتاجه ليلحق بالحافلة"}},{"id":"short","text":{"en":"It's shorter","ar":"لأنه أقصر"}},{"id":"emoji","text":{"en":"It has a bus emoji","ar":"لأن فيه رمز حافلة"}}],"answer":["own"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P15-036","when":["short","emoji"],"feedback":{"en":"Both have the emoji and are about the same length. B matters because it's about their trip.","ar":"في الاثنين الرمز نفسه، وطولهما متقارب. B مهمّ لأنه يخصّ رحلة المسافر."}}]},"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P15-036","when":["a"],"feedback":{"en":"Someone else's trip doesn't concern this traveler. It's an interruption with nothing in it for them.","ar":"رحلة شخص آخر لا تخصّ هذا المسافر. فهي مقاطعة لا تقدّم له شيئًا."}}],"hints":[{"en":"Which one would this traveler be upset to miss?","ar":"أيهما سينزعج المسافر إن فاته؟"},{"en":"Ask: does this concern this person?","ar":"اسأل: هل يخصّ هذا الشخص؟"}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Send what concerns them, skip the rest.","ar":"صحيح. أرسل ما يخصّهم، واترك الباقي."},"explain":{"en":"Every irrelevant notification teaches people to ignore you, or to turn notifications off.","ar":"كل إشعار لا يخصّ الشخص يعلّمه أن يتجاهلك، أو أن يوقف الإشعارات."},"speaker":"rami"},{"id":"S07","type":"choose","skill":"SK-P15-U05-04","part":"guided","rules":["R06"],"value":{"en":"Push Notifications (NN/g): don't send notifications for every little thing; provide relevant content aimed to inform and engage.","ar":"الإشعارات (NN/g): لا ترسل إشعارًا لكل شيء صغير؛ بل قدّم محتوى مهمًا يُخبر ويشجّع على التفاعل."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/push-notification/","quote":"Instead, provide relevant content aimed to inform and engage."},"scenario":{"en":"A traveler's booking for Friday is confirmed. The current notification says: \"You have an update!\"","ar":"تأكّد حجز أحد المسافرين ليوم الجمعة. والإشعار الحالي يقول: «لديك تحديث!»"},"prompt":{"en":"Which notification tells the traveler what they need without opening the app?","ar":"أي إشعار يخبر المسافر بما يحتاجه دون أن يفتح التطبيق؟"},"options":[{"id":"tap","text":{"en":"\"Tap to see your update 👉\"","ar":"«اضغط لترى تحديثك 👉»"}},{"id":"hello","text":{"en":"\"Hi! We have news for you 😊\"","ar":"«مرحبًا! لدينا أخبار لك 😊»"}},{"id":"clear","text":{"en":"\"Booked: Friday, 9:00 AM, Cairo → Alexandria, seat 14.\"","ar":"«تمّ الحجز: الجمعة، 9:00 صباحًا، القاهرة ← الإسكندرية، المقعد 14.»"}}],"answer":["clear"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P15-036","when":["tap","hello"],"feedback":{"en":"It hides the news to make people open the app. They can't tell if it matters, and it feels like a trick.","ar":"يُخفي الخبر ليجعل الناس يفتحون التطبيق. ولا يعرفون هل يهمّهم، ويبدو كحيلة."}}],"hints":[{"en":"What does the traveler want to know?","ar":"ماذا يريد المسافر أن يعرف؟"},{"en":"Pick the one you could read and put the phone away.","ar":"اختر الإشعار الذي تقرؤه ثم تضع الهاتف جانبًا."}],"correct":{"en":"Right. The facts are in the notification itself.","ar":"صحيح. المعلومات داخل الإشعار نفسه."},"explain":{"en":"Put the news in the notification. People trust alerts that give them something every time.","ar":"ضع الخبر داخل الإشعار. فالناس يثقون بالتنبيهات التي تعطيهم شيئًا في كل مرة."},"speaker":"rami"},{"id":"S08","type":"choose","skill":"SK-P15-U05-03","part":"independent","speaker":"nour","rules":["R14"],"value":{"en":"New case. Push Notifications (NN/g): let people experience the app first, and only later ask them to accept notifications.","ar":"حالة جديدة. الإشعارات (NN/g): دع الناس يجرّبون التطبيق أولًا، ثم اطلب منهم لاحقًا قبول الإشعارات."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/push-notification/","quote":"Allow them to experience the app and only in a later session ask them to accept notifications."},"scenario":{"en":"Our clinic app asks for notifications on the welcome screen. I want more patients to get visit reminders.","ar":"تطبيق العيادة يطلب الإذن بالإشعارات في شاشة الترحيب. وأريد أن يصل تذكير الزيارات إلى مرضى أكثر."},"prompt":{"en":"What's the best change?","ar":"ما أفضل تغيير؟"},"options":[{"id":"louder","text":{"en":"Keep it on the welcome screen, but make the Allow button bigger","ar":"أبقيه في شاشة الترحيب، لكن أكبّر زر «اسمح»"}},{"id":"booked","text":{"en":"After a patient books a visit, ask: \"Want a reminder the day before your visit?\"","ar":"بعد أن يحجز المريض زيارة، أسأل: «هل تريد تذكيرًا قبل زيارتك بيوم؟»"}},{"id":"generic","text":{"en":"Ask on the welcome screen with \"Allow notifications to get the best experience\"","ar":"أسأل في شاشة الترحيب بعبارة «اسمح بالإشعارات لتحصل على أفضل تجربة»"}}],"answer":["booked"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P15-033","when":["louder"],"feedback":{"en":"A bigger button doesn't fix the timing. New patients still have no reason to say yes.","ar":"الزر الأكبر لا يصلح التوقيت. فالمرضى الجدد ما زالوا بلا سبب للموافقة."}},{"id":"MC-P15-034","when":["generic"],"feedback":{"en":"\"The best experience\" says nothing. Patients can't tell what they'll get.","ar":"«أفضل تجربة» لا تقول شيئًا. ولا يعرف المرضى ما الذي سيحصلون عليه."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. The right moment, and a clear reason.","ar":"صحيح. اللحظة المناسبة، وسبب واضح."},"explain":{"en":"Ask when the notification would clearly help, and say what it will be.","ar":"اطلب حين يكون الإشعار مفيدًا بوضوح، وقل ما الذي سيصلهم."}},{"id":"S09","type":"card","part":"recap","icons":["clock","text","layers","target"],"title":{"en":"What you did","ar":"ماذا تعلّمت"},"body":{"en":"- **Right moment:** ask after the first booking, not on first launch.\n- **Say what they get:** \"Get an alert if your bus is late or your gate changes.\"\n- **No bursts:** 6 price drops became one message.\n- **Only what concerns them:** a gate change, not someone else's trip.\n- **News inside:** \"Booked: Friday, 9:00 AM…\", not \"You have an update!\".\n\nNext: a skill check on this unit.","ar":"- **اللحظة المناسبة:** اطلب بعد أول حجز، لا عند أول فتح.\n- **قل ما سيحصلون عليه:** «احصل على تنبيه إن تأخّرت حافلتك أو تغيّرت بوابتك.»\n- **لا سيل من الإشعارات:** أصبحت 6 انخفاضات في الأسعار رسالة واحدة.\n- **فقط ما يخصّهم:** تغيير البوابة، لا رحلة شخص آخر.\n- **الخبر في الداخل:** «تمّ الحجز: الجمعة، 9:00 صباحًا…»، لا «لديك تحديث!».\n\nالتالي: اختبار مهارات هذه الوحدة."}}]}$uxg$::jsonb),
  ($uxg$P15-U05-L03$uxg$, $uxg$26e2f93124d816befd76c7790f14f0e6f27b28839eabb8522cc4cbf187fa034a$uxg$, $uxg${"id":"P15-U05-L03","mode":"check","minutes":5,"title":{"en":"Skill check: empty screens and alerts","ar":"اختبار المهارة: الشاشات الفارغة والتنبيهات"},"summary":{"en":"Fix two empty screens and two notifications in a bill-payment app, on your own.","ar":"أصلح بنفسك شاشتين فارغتين وإشعارين في تطبيق لدفع الفواتير."},"speaker":"mona","steps":[{"id":"S01","type":"card","part":"hook","title":{"en":"Mona's bill app","ar":"تطبيق الفواتير الذي تقود منى تصميمه"},"body":{"en":"Back to our bill-payment app. New users see a lot of empty screens in their first week, and we're adding notifications.\n\nYour job: fix two empty screens and two notifications.\n\nThis is a skill check: there are no hints, and you'll see your result at the end.","ar":"نعود إلى تطبيق دفع الفواتير. يرى المستخدمون الجدد شاشات فارغة كثيرة في أسبوعهم الأول، ونحن نضيف الإشعارات.\n\nمهمّتك: أصلح شاشتين فارغتين وإشعارين.\n\nهذا اختبار مهارة: لا توجد تلميحات، وسترى نتيجتك في النهاية."},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dafaa","name":{"en":"Dafaa","ar":"دفع"},"color":"#4263EB","icon":"receipt","domain":"dafaa.example"},"appbar":{"logo":true},"tabbar":{"active":0,"items":[{"icon":"receipt","text":{"en":"Bills","ar":"الفواتير"}},{"icon":"arrows-clockwise","text":{"en":"Autopay","ar":"الدفع التلقائي"}},{"icon":"clock-counter-clockwise","text":{"en":"History","ar":"السجل"}},{"icon":"user","text":{"en":"Account","ar":"حسابي"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Due this month","ar":"مستحقة هذا الشهر"},"color":"muted"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"lightning","text":{"en":"Electricity","ar":"الكهرباء"},"sub":{"en":"Due 20 March","ar":"الاستحقاق: 20 مارس"},"value":{"en":"EGP 640","ar":"640 جنيه"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"drop","text":{"en":"Water","ar":"المياه"},"sub":{"en":"Due 22 March","ar":"الاستحقاق: 22 مارس"},"value":{"en":"EGP 210","ar":"210 جنيه"}}]}},{"id":"S02","type":"choose","skill":"SK-P15-U05-01","part":"check","rules":["R19"],"value":{"en":"Skill check. Empty States (NN/g): do not default to totally empty states; they leave people wondering if the system is loading or broken.","ar":"اختبار مهارة. الحالات الفارغة (NN/g): لا تترك الشاشات فارغة تمامًا؛ فهي تجعل الناس يتساءلون هل النظام يُحمِّل أم معطّل."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/empty-state-interface-design/","quote":"Totally empty states cause confusion about how and whether the system is working."},"scenario":{"en":"A new user opens \"History\". They haven't paid any bill in the app yet, so the screen is empty.","ar":"يفتح مستخدم جديد «السجل». ولم يدفع أي فاتورة في التطبيق بعد، فالشاشة فارغة."},"prompt":{"en":"Which text should the empty \"History\" screen show?","ar":"أي نص يجب أن تعرضه شاشة «السجل» الفارغة؟"},"options":[{"id":"blank","text":{"en":"Nothing, so the screen stays clean","ar":"لا شيء، حتى تبقى الشاشة نظيفة"}},{"id":"nodata","text":{"en":"\"No data available.\"","ar":"«لا توجد بيانات متاحة.»"}},{"id":"cue","text":{"en":"\"Bills you pay in the app will show here, with their receipts.\"","ar":"«الفواتير التي تدفعها في التطبيق ستظهر هنا، مع إيصالاتها.»"}}],"answer":["cue"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P15-030","when":["blank","nodata"],"feedback":{"en":"The user can't tell if history is loading, broken, or will fill up later.","ar":"لا يعرف المستخدم هل السجل يُحمَّل، أم معطّل، أم سيمتلئ لاحقًا."}}],"explain":{"en":"From Lesson 1: say what will appear here, so empty means \"not yet\", not \"broken\".","ar":"من الدرس 1: قل ما الذي سيظهر هنا، حتى يعني الفراغ «ليس بعد»، لا «معطّل»."},"speaker":"mona"},{"id":"S03","type":"choose","skill":"SK-P15-U05-02","part":"check","rules":["R19"],"value":{"en":"Skill check. Empty States (NN/g): one app's empty alerts panel has a Create button, so users start the task from right there.","ar":"اختبار مهارة. الحالات الفارغة (NN/g): لوحة التنبيهات الفارغة في أحد التطبيقات فيها زر «إنشاء»، فيبدأ المستخدمون المهمة من هناك مباشرة."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/empty-state-interface-design/","quote":"the application below provides a direct link within the empty state"},"scenario":{"en":"The \"Autopay\" screen is empty for new users. Right now it says: \"No autopay set up. You can set it up from each bill's settings.\"","ar":"شاشة «الدفع التلقائي» فارغة للمستخدمين الجدد. وهي الآن تقول: «لم يتم إعداد دفع تلقائي. يمكنك إعداده من إعدادات كل فاتورة.»"},"prompt":{"en":"Which version gets people to set up autopay?","ar":"أيّ نسخة تجعل الناس يفعّلون الدفع التلقائي؟"},"options":[{"id":"button","text":{"en":"\"Pay bills on time without thinking about it.\" with a \"Set up autopay\" button","ar":"«ادفع فواتيرك في موعدها دون أن تفكّر في ذلك.» مع زر «فعّل الدفع التلقائي»"}},{"id":"steps","text":{"en":"A numbered list of the 5 steps to find each bill's settings","ar":"قائمة مرقّمة بالخطوات الخمس للوصول إلى إعدادات كل فاتورة"}},{"id":"none","text":{"en":"\"No autopay.\"","ar":"«لا يوجد دفع تلقائي.»"}}],"answer":["button"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P15-032","when":["steps"],"feedback":{"en":"Clear, but it sends people on a trip through other screens instead of starting here.","ar":"واضحة، لكنها ترسل الناس في رحلة عبر شاشات أخرى بدل أن تبدأ هنا."}},{"id":"MC-P15-030","when":["none"],"feedback":{"en":"It says the screen is empty, but not what autopay is or how to start.","ar":"تقول إن الشاشة فارغة، لكن لا تقول ما الدفع التلقائي ولا كيف تبدأ."}}],"explain":{"en":"From Lesson 1: say why it helps, then put the first step on the empty screen.","ar":"من الدرس 1: قل لماذا يفيد، ثم ضع الخطوة الأولى في الشاشة الفارغة."},"speaker":"mona"},{"id":"S04","type":"choose","skill":"SK-P15-U05-03","part":"check","rules":["R19"],"value":{"en":"Skill check. Push Notifications (NN/g): offer value before asking, and tell people what notifications will be about.","ar":"اختبار مهارة. الإشعارات (NN/g): قدّم فائدة قبل أن تطلب، وأخبر الناس عمّا ستكون الإشعارات."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/push-notification/","quote":"This message focuses on what the company wants from users, but not on what the user will gain from the company."},"scenario":{"en":"We want to ask for notifications so we can remind people before bills are due.","ar":"نريد أن نطلب الإذن بالإشعارات حتى نذكّر الناس قبل مواعيد الفواتير."},"prompt":{"en":"When and how should we ask?","ar":"متى وكيف نطلب الإذن بالإشعارات حتى يوافق الناس على التذكيرات؟"},"options":[{"id":"launch","text":{"en":"On first launch: \"Dafaa would like to send you notifications\"","ar":"عند أول فتح: «يريد تطبيق دفعة أن يرسل لك إشعارات»"}},{"id":"added","text":{"en":"After they add their first bill: \"Want a reminder 3 days before this bill is due?\"","ar":"بعد أن يضيفوا أول فاتورة: «هل تريد تذكيرًا قبل موعد هذه الفاتورة بـ 3 أيام؟»"}},{"id":"offers","text":{"en":"After their first payment: \"Turn on notifications for offers and updates\"","ar":"بعد أول عملية دفع: «شغّل الإشعارات للعروض والتحديثات»"}}],"answer":["added"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P15-033","when":["launch"],"feedback":{"en":"Too early, and it's about what we want. New users have no reason to say yes.","ar":"مبكر جدًا، ويتحدّث عمّا نريده نحن. والمستخدمون الجدد ليس لديهم سبب للموافقة."}},{"id":"MC-P15-034","when":["offers"],"feedback":{"en":"Good timing, but \"offers and updates\" doesn't promise anything people want.","ar":"توقيت جيد، لكن «العروض والتحديثات» لا تَعِد بشيء يريده الناس."}}],"explain":{"en":"From Lesson 2: ask at the moment it's useful, and name what they'll get.","ar":"من الدرس 2: اطلب في اللحظة التي يكون فيها مفيدًا، وسمِّ ما سيحصلون عليه."},"speaker":"mona"},{"id":"S05","type":"choose","skill":"SK-P15-U05-04","part":"check","rules":["R19"],"value":{"en":"Skill check. Push Notifications (NN/g): receiving many notifications in a short interval can overwhelm and irritate users; send fewer, meaningful ones.","ar":"اختبار مهارة. الإشعارات (NN/g): وصول إشعارات كثيرة في وقت قصير قد يرهق المستخدمين ويزعجهم؛ فأرسل أقل، وبمعنى."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/push-notification/","quote":"Receiving many notifications in a short interval can overwhelm and irritate users"},"scenario":{"en":"A user has 4 bills due tomorrow: electricity, water, internet and phone. Right now, they'd get 4 notifications at 9:00 AM.","ar":"لدى أحد المستخدمين 4 فواتير مستحقّة غدًا: الكهرباء والمياه والإنترنت والهاتف. والآن سيصله 4 إشعارات الساعة 9:00 صباحًا."},"prompt":{"en":"What should the app send?","ar":"ماذا يجب أن يرسل التطبيق؟"},"options":[{"id":"four","text":{"en":"Keep the 4 notifications, since each bill matters","ar":"أُبقي الإشعارات الأربعة، لأن كل فاتورة مهمّة"}},{"id":"vague","text":{"en":"One: \"You have bills due! 📢\"","ar":"إشعارًا واحدًا: «لديك فواتير مستحقّة! 📢»"}},{"id":"one","text":{"en":"One: \"4 bills are due tomorrow, EGP 1,240 in total. Pay them all in one tap.\"","ar":"إشعارًا واحدًا: «4 فواتير مستحقّة غدًا، بإجمالي 1240 جنيهًا. ادفعها كلها بضغطة واحدة.»"}}],"answer":["one"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P15-035","when":["four"],"feedback":{"en":"Each bill matters, but four buzzes at once feels like spam. One message can hold all four.","ar":"كل فاتورة مهمّة، لكن أربعة تنبيهات معًا تبدو كالرسائل المزعجة. ورسالة واحدة تستطيع أن تحمل الأربعة."}},{"id":"MC-P15-036","when":["vague"],"feedback":{"en":"One message, but no facts. Which bills? How much? When?","ar":"رسالة واحدة، لكن بلا معلومات. أي فواتير؟ كم المبلغ؟ ومتى؟"}}],"explain":{"en":"From Lesson 2: combine updates that arrive together, and keep the useful facts.","ar":"من الدرس 2: اجمع التحديثات التي تصل معًا، وأبقِ المعلومات المفيدة."},"speaker":"mona"}]}$uxg$::jsonb),
  ($uxg$P01-U01-B01$uxg$, $uxg$e6429a868e594df07b18e8fea7c635575f49ca32746ac4657eb827f9c2a77e3a$uxg$, $uxg${"id":"P01-U01-B01","mode":"bank","title":{"en":"Re-tests: ask only what you need","ar":"إعادة اختبار: اسأل فقط عمّا تحتاجه"},"steps":[{"id":"S01","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P01-U01-01","part":"retest","speaker":"mona","value":{"en":"Re-test, EAS framework (NN/g): asking for unnecessary information adds effort and makes people question your intentions. Keep the email, because the link goes there; drop the rest.","ar":"إعادة اختبار، إطار EAS (NN/g): طلب معلومات غير ضرورية يزيد الجهد ويجعل الناس يشكّون في نواياك. أبقِ البريد الإلكتروني لأن الرابط يُرسل إليه؛ واحذف الباقي."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/eas-framework-simplify-forms/","quote":"Asking for unnecessary information increases user effort and can cause users to question your intentions."},"scenario":{"en":"My team runs the sign-up for a free online talk. Basma signs up, and the link to join is sent by email. Our form also asks for her job title, her company's size and her home address. Nobody uses those.","ar":"يدير فريقي التسجيل في ندوة مجانية أونلاين. تسجّل بسمة، فيصلها رابط الدخول بالبريد الإلكتروني. ونموذجنا يسأل أيضًا عن مسمّاها الوظيفي وحجم شركتها وعنوان منزلها. ولا أحد يستخدم هذه المعلومات."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each version of the form. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل نسخة من النموذج. أيّ نسخة تطلب من بسمة ما يلزم لحضور الندوة، لا أكثر ولا أقل؟"},"mock":{"app":{"name":{"en":"Nadwa","ar":"ندوة"},"color":"#0B7285","icon":"microphone-stage","domain":"nadwa.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Join the free talk","ar":"احضر الندوة المجانية"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Full name *","ar":"الاسم الكامل *"},"text":"","gap":"m"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Email *","ar":"البريد الإلكتروني *"},"text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Job title *","ar":"المسمّى الوظيفي *"},"text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Company size *","ar":"حجم الشركة *"},"text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Home address *","ar":"عنوان المنزل *"},"text":"","gap":"s"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Save my seat","ar":"احجز مقعدي"}}]},"options":[{"id":"optional","text":{"en":"Keep all five, and make the last three optional","ar":"أبقِ الخمسة، واجعل الثلاثة الأخيرة اختيارية"},"mock":{"app":{"name":{"en":"Nadwa","ar":"ندوة"},"color":"#0B7285","icon":"microphone-stage","domain":"nadwa.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Join the free talk","ar":"احضر الندوة المجانية"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Full name *","ar":"الاسم الكامل *"},"text":"","gap":"m"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Email *","ar":"البريد الإلكتروني *"},"text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Job title (optional)","ar":"المسمّى الوظيفي (اختياري)"},"text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Company size (optional)","ar":"حجم الشركة (اختياري)"},"text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Home address (optional)","ar":"عنوان المنزل (اختياري)"},"text":"","gap":"s"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Save my seat","ar":"احجز مقعدي"}}]}},{"id":"two","text":{"en":"Ask only for her name and email","ar":"اسأل عن اسمها وبريدها الإلكتروني فقط"},"mock":{"app":{"name":{"en":"Nadwa","ar":"ندوة"},"color":"#0B7285","icon":"microphone-stage","domain":"nadwa.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Join the free talk","ar":"احضر الندوة المجانية"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Full name *","ar":"الاسم الكامل *"},"text":"","gap":"m"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Email *","ar":"البريد الإلكتروني *"},"text":"","hint":{"en":"We'll send the link here.","ar":"سنرسل الرابط إلى هنا."},"gap":"s"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Save my seat","ar":"احجز مقعدي"}}]}},{"id":"one","text":{"en":"Ask only for her name, so it's as short as possible","ar":"اسأل عن اسمها فقط، حتى يكون أقصر ما يمكن"},"mock":{"app":{"name":{"en":"Nadwa","ar":"ندوة"},"color":"#0B7285","icon":"microphone-stage","domain":"nadwa.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Join the free talk","ar":"احضر الندوة المجانية"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Full name *","ar":"الاسم الكامل *"},"text":"","gap":"m"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Save my seat","ar":"احجز مقعدي"}}]}}],"answer":["two"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-005","when":["optional"],"feedback":{"en":"Optional fields still sit on the form, and many people fill them in anyway. If nobody uses an answer, remove the question.","ar":"الحقول الاختيارية تبقى ظاهرة في النموذج، وكثيرون يملؤونها رغم ذلك. إذا لم يستخدم أحد الإجابة، فاحذف السؤال."}},{"id":"MC-P01-026","when":["one"],"feedback":{"en":"Short, but now there's nowhere to send the link, so Basma can't join. Keep every field the task needs.","ar":"النموذج قصير، لكن لم يعد فيه بريد نرسل إليه الرابط، فلن تستطيع بسمة الحضور. أبقِ كل حقل تحتاجه المهمّة."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Only what the talk needs.","ar":"صحيح. فقط ما تحتاجه الندوة."},"explain":{"en":"Each question should earn its place. The name and email are used to send the link; the job title, company size and address aren't used, so they only add effort and doubt.","ar":"لا تسأل إلا ما ستستخدم إجابته. الاسم والبريد نحتاجهما لإرسال الرابط؛ أما المسمّى وحجم الشركة والعنوان فلا نستخدمها، فهي تزيد الجهد والشك فقط."}},{"id":"S02","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P01-U01-01","part":"retest","speaker":"youssef","value":{"en":"Re-test, EAS framework (NN/g): forms should ask only for essential information. The courier needs the phone; nobody needs the birth date or gender.","ar":"إعادة اختبار، إطار EAS (NN/g): يجب أن تطلب النماذج المعلومات الأساسية فقط. المندوب يحتاج الهاتف؛ ولا أحد يحتاج تاريخ الميلاد أو النوع."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/eas-framework-simplify-forms/","quote":"Forms should only ask for essential information"},"scenario":{"en":"Hatem orders a phone charger from my shop. Our courier calls before arriving. My checkout also asks for his date of birth and gender, which I never use.","ar":"يطلب حاتم شاحن هاتف من متجري. ومندوبنا يتّصل قبل الوصول. وصفحة الدفع عندي تسأل أيضًا عن تاريخ ميلاده ونوعه، وأنا لا أستخدمهما أبدًا."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each version of the checkout. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل نسخة من صفحة الدفع. أيّ نسخة تطلب ما يلزم لوصول الطلب إلى حاتم، لا أكثر ولا أقل؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Delivery details","ar":"بيانات التوصيل"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Address *","ar":"العنوان *"},"text":"","gap":"m"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Mobile number *","ar":"رقم الموبايل *"},"text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Date of birth *","ar":"تاريخ الميلاد *"},"text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Gender *","ar":"النوع *"},"text":"","gap":"s"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Place order","ar":"أكّد الطلب"}}]},"options":[{"id":"essential","text":{"en":"Remove the date of birth and gender; keep the address and mobile","ar":"احذف تاريخ الميلاد والنوع؛ وأبقِ العنوان والموبايل"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Delivery details","ar":"بيانات التوصيل"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Address *","ar":"العنوان *"},"text":"","gap":"m"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Mobile number *","ar":"رقم الموبايل *"},"text":"","gap":"s"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Place order","ar":"أكّد الطلب"}}]}},{"id":"short","text":{"en":"Keep only the address, so checkout is as short as possible","ar":"أبقِ العنوان فقط، حتى تكون صفحة الدفع أقصر ما يمكن"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Delivery details","ar":"بيانات التوصيل"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Address *","ar":"العنوان *"},"text":"","gap":"m"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Place order","ar":"أكّد الطلب"}}]}},{"id":"later","text":{"en":"Keep everything; marketing might use the birth date for offers one day","ar":"أبقِ كل شيء؛ فقد يستخدم التسويق تاريخ الميلاد للعروض يومًا ما"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Delivery details","ar":"بيانات التوصيل"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Address *","ar":"العنوان *"},"text":"","gap":"m"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Mobile number *","ar":"رقم الموبايل *"},"text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Date of birth *","ar":"تاريخ الميلاد *"},"text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Gender *","ar":"النوع *"},"text":"","gap":"s"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Place order","ar":"أكّد الطلب"}}]}}],"answer":["essential"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-026","when":["short"],"feedback":{"en":"The courier calls before arriving, so without a mobile number Hatem may miss his delivery. Shortest isn't the goal; essential is.","ar":"المندوب يتّصل قبل الوصول، فبدون رقم موبايل قد تفوت حاتمَ طلبيته. الهدف ليس الأقصر، بل ما لا غنى عنه."}},{"id":"MC-P01-002","when":["later"],"feedback":{"en":"\"Might be useful one day\" isn't a reason to ask today. Every extra field adds effort and makes people wonder why you want it.","ar":"«قد يفيد يومًا ما» ليس سببًا للسؤال اليوم. كل حقل إضافي يزيد الجهد ويجعل الناس يتساءلون لماذا تريده."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. What the delivery needs, nothing more.","ar":"صحيح. ما يحتاجه التوصيل، لا أكثر."},"explain":{"en":"Ask what the task needs: where to deliver and how to reach Hatem. Fields nobody uses only slow him down, and a missing essential one breaks the task.","ar":"اسأل عمّا تحتاجه المهمّة: أين يكون التوصيل وكيف نصل إلى حاتم. الحقول التي لا يستخدمها أحد تبطئه فقط، وغياب حقل أساسي يُفشل المهمّة."}},{"id":"S03","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P01-U01-02","part":"retest","speaker":"tarek","value":{"en":"Re-test, EAS framework (NN/g): not every question needs to be asked immediately; if it can wait, postpone it. Card details and the school report matter only if the family continues.","ar":"إعادة اختبار، إطار EAS (NN/g): ليس كل سؤال يجب أن يُطرح فورًا؛ إذا كان يمكن أن ينتظر فأجّله. بيانات البطاقة وشهادة المدرسة مهمّة فقط إذا استمرّت الأسرة."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/eas-framework-simplify-forms/","quote":"If it can wait, postpone it."},"scenario":{"en":"I manage a tutoring app. Rehab books a free first maths lesson for her son. Our form also asks for card details for the monthly fee and his last school report. Those are only needed if they sign up after the free lesson.","ar":"أدير تطبيقًا للدروس الخصوصية. تحجز رحاب حصة رياضيات أولى مجانية لابنها. ونموذجنا يطلب أيضًا بيانات البطاقة للاشتراك الشهري وآخر شهادة مدرسية له. ولا نحتاجهما إلا إذا اشتركوا بعد الحصة المجانية."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each version of the booking form. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل نسخة من نموذج الحجز. أيّ نسخة تطلب من رحاب الآن ما تحتاجه الحصة المجانية فقط؟"},"mock":{"app":{"name":{"en":"Ostaz","ar":"أستاذ"},"color":"#2F9E44","icon":"pencil-simple","domain":"ostaz.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Book a free lesson","ar":"احجز حصة مجانية"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Child's full name *","ar":"اسم الطفل الكامل *"},"text":"","gap":"m"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"School year *","ar":"الصف الدراسي *"},"text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Parent's mobile *","ar":"موبايل ولي الأمر *"},"text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Card number *","ar":"رقم البطاقة *"},"text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Upload last school report *","ar":"ارفع آخر شهادة مدرسية *"},"text":"","gap":"s"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Book free lesson","ar":"احجز الحصة المجانية"}}]},"options":[{"id":"optional","text":{"en":"Keep the card and report, but make them optional","ar":"أبقِ البطاقة والشهادة، لكن اجعلهما اختياريتين"},"mock":{"app":{"name":{"en":"Ostaz","ar":"أستاذ"},"color":"#2F9E44","icon":"pencil-simple","domain":"ostaz.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Book a free lesson","ar":"احجز حصة مجانية"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Child's full name *","ar":"اسم الطفل الكامل *"},"text":"","gap":"m"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"School year *","ar":"الصف الدراسي *"},"text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Parent's mobile *","ar":"موبايل ولي الأمر *"},"text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Card number (optional)","ar":"رقم البطاقة (اختياري)"},"text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Upload last school report (optional)","ar":"ارفع آخر شهادة مدرسية (اختياري)"},"text":"","gap":"s"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Book free lesson","ar":"احجز الحصة المجانية"}}]}},{"id":"keep","text":{"en":"Keep it; collecting everything now saves a step later","ar":"أبقِ النموذج كما هو؛ فجمع كل شيء الآن يوفّر خطوة لاحقًا"},"mock":{"app":{"name":{"en":"Ostaz","ar":"أستاذ"},"color":"#2F9E44","icon":"pencil-simple","domain":"ostaz.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Book a free lesson","ar":"احجز حصة مجانية"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Child's full name *","ar":"اسم الطفل الكامل *"},"text":"","gap":"m"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"School year *","ar":"الصف الدراسي *"},"text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Parent's mobile *","ar":"موبايل ولي الأمر *"},"text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Card number *","ar":"رقم البطاقة *"},"text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Upload last school report *","ar":"ارفع آخر شهادة مدرسية *"},"text":"","gap":"s"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Book free lesson","ar":"احجز الحصة المجانية"}}]}},{"id":"later","text":{"en":"Ask for the child, the year and a mobile now; the card and report only when they sign up","ar":"اسأل عن الطفل والصف والموبايل الآن؛ والبطاقة والشهادة عند الاشتراك فقط"},"mock":{"app":{"name":{"en":"Ostaz","ar":"أستاذ"},"color":"#2F9E44","icon":"pencil-simple","domain":"ostaz.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Book a free lesson","ar":"احجز حصة مجانية"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Child's full name *","ar":"اسم الطفل الكامل *"},"text":"","gap":"m"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"School year *","ar":"الصف الدراسي *"},"text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Parent's mobile *","ar":"موبايل ولي الأمر *"},"text":"","gap":"s"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Book free lesson","ar":"احجز الحصة المجانية"}}]}}],"answer":["later"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-005","when":["optional"],"feedback":{"en":"A card number on a free booking still looks like a trap, optional or not, and many parents fill in optional fields anyway. Move the question to when it's needed.","ar":"رقم البطاقة في حجز مجاني يبدو كفخّ، اختياريًا كان أو لا، وكثير من الآباء يملؤون الحقول الاختيارية على أي حال. اسأل عنه حين تحتاجه فعلًا."}},{"id":"MC-P01-001","when":["keep"],"feedback":{"en":"Most families decide after the free lesson. Asking for a card and a report now makes Rehab do work that may never be needed, and some parents will just leave.","ar":"معظم الأسر تقرّر بعد الحصة المجانية. طلب البطاقة والشهادة الآن يُحمّل رحاب عملًا قد لا تحتاجه أبدًا، وبعض الآباء سيتركون الصفحة ببساطة."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. What the free lesson needs now, the rest later.","ar":"صحيح. ما تحتاجه الحصة المجانية الآن، والباقي لاحقًا."},"explain":{"en":"Ask yourself: do we need this now? For a free lesson, the school needs the child, the year and a way to reach the parent. Payment and records belong to the sign-up step.","ar":"اسأل نفسك: هل نحتاج هذا الآن؟ للحصة المجانية، يحتاج المركز اسم الطفل وصفّه ورقمًا للتواصل مع ولي الأمر. والدفع والسجلات مكانهما خطوة الاشتراك."}},{"id":"S04","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P01-U01-02","part":"retest","speaker":"karim","value":{"en":"Re-test, EAS framework (NN/g): start with the bare minimum needed at this stage, then gradually request more. Preferences can be asked when they're first useful.","ar":"إعادة اختبار، إطار EAS (NN/g): ابدأ بأقل ما تحتاجه في هذه المرحلة، ثم اطلب المزيد تدريجيًا. يمكن السؤال عن التفضيلات عندما تصبح مفيدة لأول مرة."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/eas-framework-simplify-forms/","quote":"Start by asking for the bare minimum needed at this stage, then gradually request more, to avoid overwhelming users upfront."},"scenario":{"en":"I'm building a recipe app. Mazen creates an account so he can save recipes. Sign-up also asks about his diet, his cooking level and his kitchen tools, which the app uses later to suggest recipes.","ar":"أبني تطبيقًا للوصفات. ينشئ مازن حسابًا ليحفظ الوصفات. والتسجيل يسأل أيضًا عن نظامه الغذائي ومستواه في الطبخ وأدوات مطبخه، ويستخدمها التطبيق لاحقًا لاقتراح وصفات."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each version of sign-up. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل نسخة من التسجيل. أيّ نسخة تسأل مازن الآن عمّا يلزم ليحفظ وصفاته فقط؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"tabkha","name":{"en":"Tabkha","ar":"طبخة"},"color":"#EA580C","icon":"cooking-pot","domain":"tabkha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Create your account","ar":"أنشئ حسابك"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Email *","ar":"البريد الإلكتروني *"},"text":"","gap":"m"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Password *","ar":"كلمة المرور *"},"text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"select","label":{"en":"Your diet *","ar":"نظامك الغذائي *"},"text":{"en":"Choose","ar":"اختر"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"select","label":{"en":"Cooking level *","ar":"مستواك في الطبخ *"},"text":{"en":"Choose","ar":"اختر"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"select","label":{"en":"Kitchen tools you own *","ar":"أدوات المطبخ لديك *"},"text":{"en":"Choose","ar":"اختر"},"gap":"s"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Create account","ar":"أنشئ الحساب"}}]},"options":[{"id":"optional","text":{"en":"Keep the three questions on sign-up, but make them optional","ar":"أبقِ الأسئلة الثلاثة في التسجيل، لكن اجعلها اختيارية"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"tabkha","name":{"en":"Tabkha","ar":"طبخة"},"color":"#EA580C","icon":"cooking-pot","domain":"tabkha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Create your account","ar":"أنشئ حسابك"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Email *","ar":"البريد الإلكتروني *"},"text":"","gap":"m"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Password *","ar":"كلمة المرور *"},"text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"select","label":{"en":"Your diet (optional)","ar":"نظامك الغذائي (اختياري)"},"text":{"en":"Choose","ar":"اختر"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"select","label":{"en":"Cooking level (optional)","ar":"مستواك في الطبخ (اختياري)"},"text":{"en":"Choose","ar":"اختر"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"select","label":{"en":"Kitchen tools you own (optional)","ar":"أدوات المطبخ لديك (اختياري)"},"text":{"en":"Choose","ar":"اختر"},"gap":"s"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Create account","ar":"أنشئ الحساب"}}]}},{"id":"later","text":{"en":"Email and password now; ask about his diet the first time he looks for suggestions","ar":"البريد وكلمة المرور الآن؛ واسأله عن نظامه الغذائي أول مرة يبحث فيها عن اقتراحات"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"tabkha","name":{"en":"Tabkha","ar":"طبخة"},"color":"#EA580C","icon":"cooking-pot","domain":"tabkha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Create your account","ar":"أنشئ حسابك"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Email *","ar":"البريد الإلكتروني *"},"text":"","gap":"m"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Password *","ar":"كلمة المرور *"},"text":"","gap":"s"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Create account","ar":"أنشئ الحساب"}}]}},{"id":"keep","text":{"en":"Keep them required, so suggestions are good from day one","ar":"أبقِها إلزامية، حتى تكون الاقتراحات جيدة من اليوم الأول"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"tabkha","name":{"en":"Tabkha","ar":"طبخة"},"color":"#EA580C","icon":"cooking-pot","domain":"tabkha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Create your account","ar":"أنشئ حسابك"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Email *","ar":"البريد الإلكتروني *"},"text":"","gap":"m"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Password *","ar":"كلمة المرور *"},"text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"select","label":{"en":"Your diet *","ar":"نظامك الغذائي *"},"text":{"en":"Choose","ar":"اختر"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"select","label":{"en":"Cooking level *","ar":"مستواك في الطبخ *"},"text":{"en":"Choose","ar":"اختر"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"select","label":{"en":"Kitchen tools you own *","ar":"أدوات المطبخ لديك *"},"text":{"en":"Choose","ar":"اختر"},"gap":"s"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Create account","ar":"أنشئ الحساب"}}]}}],"answer":["later"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-005","when":["optional"],"feedback":{"en":"Optional or not, three extra questions still stand between Mazen and saving his first recipe. Ask them when they help him.","ar":"حتى لو كانت اختيارية، تبقى ثلاثة أسئلة إضافية تؤخّر مازن عن حفظ أول وصفة. اسأله عنها حين تفيده."}},{"id":"MC-P01-001","when":["keep"],"feedback":{"en":"Mazen came to save a recipe, not to describe his kitchen. Asking everything upfront makes sign-up feel like a survey, and some people give up.","ar":"جاء مازن ليحفظ وصفة، لا ليصف مطبخه. السؤال عن كل شيء من البداية يجعل التسجيل يبدو كاستبيان، فيتركه بعض الناس."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. The minimum now, more when it helps.","ar":"صحيح. الحدّ الأدنى الآن، والمزيد عندما يفيد."},"explain":{"en":"At sign-up, the app only needs a way for Mazen to log in. When he later asks for suggestions, a question about his diet has an obvious reason, and he's more likely to answer it.","ar":"عند التسجيل، يحتاج التطبيق فقط طريقة ليسجّل مازن دخوله. وعندما يطلب اقتراحات لاحقًا، يكون للسؤال عن نظامه الغذائي سبب واضح، فيزيد احتمال أن يجيب."}},{"id":"S05","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P01-U01-03","part":"retest","speaker":"rami","value":{"en":"Re-test, EAS framework (NN/g): people are more likely to complete a form when they understand how their data will be used. Say it at the field, in plain words.","ar":"إعادة اختبار، إطار EAS (NN/g): يزيد احتمال إكمال الناس للنموذج عندما يفهمون كيف ستُستخدم بياناتهم. قلها عند الحقل، بكلمات بسيطة."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/eas-framework-simplify-forms/","quote":"Users will be more likely to complete the form when they understand how their data will be used."},"scenario":{"en":"I'm designing a pharmacy app. Sanaa orders medicine, and the app asks for her date of birth, because the pharmacist must check age for some medicines. She stops at that field and wonders why a shop wants it.","ar":"أصمّم تطبيقًا لصيدلية. تطلب سناء دواءً، فيسألها التطبيق عن تاريخ ميلادها، لأن الصيدلي يجب أن يتحقّق من العمر لبعض الأدوية. فتتوقّف عند هذا الحقل وتتساءل لماذا يريده متجر."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each version of the field. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل نسخة من الحقل. أيّ نسخة تجيب عن سؤال سناء: لماذا تحتاج الصيدلية تاريخ ميلادها؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dawaa","name":{"en":"Dawaa Pharmacy","ar":"صيدلية دواء"},"color":"#059669","icon":"pill","domain":"dawaa.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Your details","ar":"بياناتك"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Full name *","ar":"الاسم الكامل *"},"filled":true,"text":{"en":"Sanaa Fathy","ar":"سناء فتحي"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Date of birth *","ar":"تاريخ الميلاد *"},"text":"","gap":"s"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Continue","ar":"متابعة"}}]},"options":[{"id":"why","text":{"en":"Add a hint at the field: who checks it, and that it isn't shared","ar":"أضف تلميحًا عند الحقل: من يتحقّق منه، وأنه لا يُشارك"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dawaa","name":{"en":"Dawaa Pharmacy","ar":"صيدلية دواء"},"color":"#059669","icon":"pill","domain":"dawaa.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Your details","ar":"بياناتك"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Full name *","ar":"الاسم الكامل *"},"filled":true,"text":{"en":"Sanaa Fathy","ar":"سناء فتحي"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Date of birth *","ar":"تاريخ الميلاد *"},"text":"","hint":{"en":"Our pharmacist checks age for some medicines. We don't share it.","ar":"يتحقّق الصيدلي من العمر لبعض الأدوية. ولا نشاركه مع أحد."},"gap":"s"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Continue","ar":"متابعة"}}]}},{"id":"policy","text":{"en":"Add a link to the privacy policy at the bottom of the page","ar":"أضف رابطًا لسياسة الخصوصية في أسفل الصفحة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dawaa","name":{"en":"Dawaa Pharmacy","ar":"صيدلية دواء"},"color":"#059669","icon":"pill","domain":"dawaa.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Your details","ar":"بياناتك"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Full name *","ar":"الاسم الكامل *"},"filled":true,"text":{"en":"Sanaa Fathy","ar":"سناء فتحي"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Date of birth *","ar":"تاريخ الميلاد *"},"text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Continue","ar":"متابعة"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"link","text":{"en":"Privacy policy","ar":"سياسة الخصوصية"},"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"lock","text":{"en":"Add a lock icon and the word \"Secure\" next to the field","ar":"أضف أيقونة قفل وكلمة «آمن» بجانب الحقل"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dawaa","name":{"en":"Dawaa Pharmacy","ar":"صيدلية دواء"},"color":"#059669","icon":"pill","domain":"dawaa.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Your details","ar":"بياناتك"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Full name *","ar":"الاسم الكامل *"},"filled":true,"text":{"en":"Sanaa Fathy","ar":"سناء فتحي"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Date of birth * 🔒 Secure","ar":"تاريخ الميلاد * 🔒 آمن"},"text":"","gap":"s"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Continue","ar":"متابعة"}}]}}],"answer":["why"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-027","when":["policy","lock"],"feedback":{"en":"Sanaa's question is why a pharmacy needs her birth date. A lock or a policy link doesn't answer it. One short line at the field does.","ar":"سؤال سناء هو لماذا تحتاج صيدلية تاريخ ميلادها. القفل أو رابط السياسة لا يجيب عنه. سطر قصير عند الحقل يجيب."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. The reason, right where she hesitates.","ar":"صحيح. وضعتَ السبب حيث تتردّد بالضبط."},"explain":{"en":"A clear reason at the field turns a strange question into a sensible one. Sanaa sees who uses her birth date, for what, and that it stays private.","ar":"السبب الواضح عند الحقل يحوّل سؤالًا غريبًا إلى سؤال منطقي. ترى سناء من يستخدم تاريخ ميلادها، ولماذا، وأنه يبقى خاصًا."}},{"id":"S06","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P01-U01-03","part":"retest","speaker":"tarek","value":{"en":"Re-test, EAS framework (NN/g): a simple, clear explanation reassures people and builds trust. A national ID is sensitive; say who sees it and why.","ar":"إعادة اختبار، إطار EAS (NN/g): الشرح البسيط الواضح يطمئن الناس ويبني الثقة. الرقم القومي معلومة حسّاسة؛ قل من يراه ولماذا."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/eas-framework-simplify-forms/","quote":"A simple, clear explanation reassures users, builds trust, and helps them understand the rationale behind each question."},"scenario":{"en":"In the car-selling app I manage, Wael is selling his used car. Before the ad goes live, we ask for his national ID to confirm the car is his. He worries buyers will see it.","ar":"في تطبيق بيع السيارات الذي أديره، يبيع وائل سيارته المستعملة. وقبل نشر الإعلان، نطلب رقمه القومي للتأكّد من أن السيارة باسمه. ويخشى أن يراه المشترون."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each version of the field. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل نسخة من الحقل. أيّها يجب أن تُطلق؟"},"mock":{"app":{"name":{"en":"Arabiyti","ar":"عربيتي"},"color":"#C92A2A","icon":"car-profile","domain":"arabiyti.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Confirm you own the car","ar":"أكّد ملكيتك للسيارة"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"National ID number *","ar":"الرقم القومي *"},"text":"","gap":"m"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Publish my ad","ar":"انشر إعلاني"}}]},"options":[{"id":"lock","text":{"en":"Add a lock icon and \"256-bit encryption\" under the field","ar":"أضف أيقونة قفل و«تشفير 256-bit» تحت الحقل"},"mock":{"app":{"name":{"en":"Arabiyti","ar":"عربيتي"},"color":"#C92A2A","icon":"car-profile","domain":"arabiyti.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Confirm you own the car","ar":"أكّد ملكيتك للسيارة"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"National ID number *","ar":"الرقم القومي *"},"text":"","hint":{"en":"🔒 256-bit encryption","ar":"🔒 تشفير 256-bit"},"gap":"m"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Publish my ad","ar":"انشر إعلاني"}}]}},{"id":"top","text":{"en":"Add \"We respect your privacy\" at the top of the page","ar":"أضف «نحترم خصوصيتك» في أعلى الصفحة"},"mock":{"app":{"name":{"en":"Arabiyti","ar":"عربيتي"},"color":"#C92A2A","icon":"car-profile","domain":"arabiyti.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Sell your car","ar":"بِع سيارتك"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"We respect your privacy.","ar":"نحترم خصوصيتك."}},{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Confirm you own the car","ar":"أكّد ملكيتك للسيارة"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"National ID number *","ar":"الرقم القومي *"},"text":"","gap":"m"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Publish my ad","ar":"انشر إعلاني"}}]}},{"id":"why","text":{"en":"Add a hint at the field: buyers never see it, and what it's checked against","ar":"أضف تلميحًا عند الحقل: المشترون لا يرونه أبدًا، وما الذي نطابقه معه"},"mock":{"app":{"name":{"en":"Arabiyti","ar":"عربيتي"},"color":"#C92A2A","icon":"car-profile","domain":"arabiyti.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Confirm you own the car","ar":"أكّد ملكيتك للسيارة"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"National ID number *","ar":"الرقم القومي *"},"text":"","hint":{"en":"Buyers never see this. We check it once against the car's licence.","ar":"المشترون لا يرونه أبدًا. نطابقه مرة واحدة مع رخصة السيارة."},"gap":"m"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Publish my ad","ar":"انشر إعلاني"}}]}}],"answer":["why"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-027","when":["lock","top"],"feedback":{"en":"Wael's worry is specific: will buyers see my ID? Encryption terms and general promises don't answer it. Say who sees it and what it's for.","ar":"قلق وائل محدّد: هل سيرى المشترون رقمي القومي؟ مصطلحات التشفير والوعود العامة لا تجيب عنه. قل من يراه وفيمَ يُستخدم."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. The answer to the exact worry, at the field.","ar":"صحيح. أجبتَ عن قلقه بالضبط، عند الحقل."},"explain":{"en":"People hesitate at personal fields because they don't know what happens next. One plain sentence about who sees it and why turns that doubt into trust.","ar":"يتردّد الناس عند الحقول الشخصية لأنهم لا يعرفون ماذا سيحدث بعدها. جملة بسيطة واحدة عمّن يراها ولماذا تحوّل هذا الشك إلى ثقة."}},{"id":"S07","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P01-U01-04","part":"retest","speaker":"sara","value":{"en":"Re-test, required fields (NN/g): the asterisk is familiar to users. Mark every required field with it, and label the optional one. Red labels are a private code.","ar":"إعادة اختبار، الحقول الإلزامية (NN/g): النجمة مألوفة للمستخدمين. ضعها على كل حقل إلزامي، واكتب «اختياري» على الحقل الاختياري. العناوين الحمراء رمز خاص."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/required-fields/","quote":"The asterisk has become very common on the web and users are familiar with its meaning."},"scenario":{"en":"I'm designing the sign-up for an evening drawing course. Nahla registers. Three fields are required and one, \"Anything we should know?\", is optional. Right now nothing is marked.","ar":"أصمّم التسجيل في دورة رسم مسائية. تسجّل نهلة. ثلاثة حقول إلزامية وحقل واحد، «هل هناك ما يجب أن نعرفه؟»، اختياري. وحاليًا لا توجد أي علامة على الحقول."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each way of marking the form. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل طريقة لتمييز النموذج. أيّ طريقة تجعل نهلة تعرف دون تخمين أيّ الحقول إلزامي وأيّها اختياري؟"},"mock":{"app":{"name":{"en":"Marsam","ar":"مرسم"},"color":"#E64980","icon":"paint-brush","domain":"marsam.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"marsam.example/evening-course","caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Register for the course","ar":"سجّل في الدورة"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Full name","ar":"الاسم الكامل"},"text":"","gap":"m"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Mobile number","ar":"رقم الموبايل"},"text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Email","ar":"البريد الإلكتروني"},"text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Anything we should know?","ar":"هل هناك ما يجب أن نعرفه؟"},"text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Register","ar":"سجّل"},"gap":"m"}]},"options":[{"id":"red","text":{"en":"Make the required labels red","ar":"اجعل عناوين الحقول الإلزامية حمراء"},"mock":{"app":{"name":{"en":"Marsam","ar":"مرسم"},"color":"#E64980","icon":"paint-brush","domain":"marsam.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"marsam.example/evening-course","caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Register for the course","ar":"سجّل في الدورة"}},{"kind":"text","color":"red","text":{"en":"Full name","ar":"الاسم الكامل"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"field","text":"","gap":"xs"},{"kind":"text","color":"red","text":{"en":"Mobile number","ar":"رقم الموبايل"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","text":"","gap":"xs"},{"kind":"text","color":"red","text":{"en":"Email","ar":"البريد الإلكتروني"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","text":"","gap":"xs"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Anything we should know?","ar":"هل هناك ما يجب أن نعرفه؟"},"text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Register","ar":"سجّل"},"gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"both","text":{"en":"A star on each required field, and \"(optional)\" on the last one","ar":"نجمة على كل حقل إلزامي، و«(اختياري)» على الأخير"},"mock":{"app":{"name":{"en":"Marsam","ar":"مرسم"},"color":"#E64980","icon":"paint-brush","domain":"marsam.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"marsam.example/evening-course","caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Register for the course","ar":"سجّل في الدورة"}},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"* Required","ar":"* إلزامي"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Full name *","ar":"الاسم الكامل *"},"text":"","gap":"m"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Mobile number *","ar":"رقم الموبايل *"},"text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Email *","ar":"البريد الإلكتروني *"},"text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Anything we should know? (optional)","ar":"هل هناك ما يجب أن نعرفه؟ (اختياري)"},"text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Register","ar":"سجّل"},"gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"note","text":{"en":"Add \"All fields are required unless stated\" at the top","ar":"أضف «كل الحقول إلزامية ما لم يُذكر غير ذلك» في الأعلى"},"mock":{"app":{"name":{"en":"Marsam","ar":"مرسم"},"color":"#E64980","icon":"paint-brush","domain":"marsam.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"marsam.example/evening-course","caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Register for the course","ar":"سجّل في الدورة"}},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"All fields are required unless stated.","ar":"كل الحقول إلزامية ما لم يُذكر غير ذلك."},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Full name","ar":"الاسم الكامل"},"text":"","gap":"m"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Mobile number","ar":"رقم الموبايل"},"text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Email","ar":"البريد الإلكتروني"},"text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Anything we should know?","ar":"هل هناك ما يجب أن نعرفه؟"},"text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Register","ar":"سجّل"},"gap":"m"}]}}],"answer":["both"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-003","when":["red"],"feedback":{"en":"Red labels are a code Nahla has to guess, and red usually means an error. The star is the mark people already know.","ar":"العناوين الحمراء رمز على نهلة أن تخمّنه، والأحمر يعني عادةً خطأ. النجمة هي العلامة التي يعرفها الناس بالفعل."}},{"id":"MC-P01-028","when":["note"],"feedback":{"en":"People don't read notes at the top of forms, and \"unless stated\" is never stated here. Mark each field where Nahla fills it in.","ar":"الناس لا يقرؤون الملاحظات في أعلى النماذج، ولا يوجد هنا أصلًا حقل مكتوب عليه أنه غير إلزامي. ميّز كل حقل حيث تملؤه نهلة."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Every field says what it is, at the field.","ar":"صحيح. كل حقل يوضّح بنفسه هل هو إلزامي أم اختياري."},"explain":{"en":"A star on each required field is the mark people already know. Labelling the one optional field too means Nahla never has to guess.","ar":"النجمة على كل حقل إلزامي هي العلامة التي يعرفها الناس بالفعل. وكتابة «اختياري» على الحقل الاختياري الوحيد تعفي نهلة من التخمين."}},{"id":"S08","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P01-U01-04","part":"retest","speaker":"rami","value":{"en":"Re-test, cognitive load in forms (NN/g): when marking isn't clear enough, many people feel obliged to answer optional questions. Stars alone leave the optional fields looking required.","ar":"إعادة اختبار، العبء الذهني في النماذج (NN/g): عندما لا يكون التمييز واضحًا بما يكفي، يشعر كثيرون بأنهم مُلزمون بالإجابة عن الأسئلة الاختيارية. النجوم وحدها تجعل الحقول الاختيارية تبدو إلزامية."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/4-principles-reduce-cognitive-load/","quote":"When marking is not clear enough, many people feel obligated to answer optional questions."},"scenario":{"en":"I designed a wedding invitation reply form. Essam's name and the number of guests have stars. Two fields have none: food needs and a message for the couple. Essam isn't sure he can skip them.","ar":"صمّمت نموذج الردّ على دعوة زفاف. اسم عصام وعدد الضيوف عليهما نجمة. وحقلان بدون نجمة: طلبات خاصة بالأكل ورسالة للعروسين. وعصام ليس متأكّدًا هل يمكنه تجاوزهما."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each version. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل نسخة. أيّ نسخة تُخبر عصام بوضوح أنه يستطيع تجاوز الحقلين؟"},"mock":{"app":{"name":{"en":"Farah","ar":"فرح"},"color":"#C2255C","icon":"heart","domain":"farah.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Will you come?","ar":"هل ستحضر؟"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Your name *","ar":"اسمك *"},"text":"","gap":"m"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Number of guests *","ar":"عدد الضيوف *"},"text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Food needs","ar":"طلبات خاصة بالأكل"},"text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"A message for the couple","ar":"رسالة للعروسين"},"text":"","gap":"s"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Send reply","ar":"أرسل الرد"}}]},"options":[{"id":"label","text":{"en":"Add \"(optional)\" to the two unmarked fields","ar":"أضف «(اختياري)» إلى الحقلين اللذين بلا نجمة"},"mock":{"app":{"name":{"en":"Farah","ar":"فرح"},"color":"#C2255C","icon":"heart","domain":"farah.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Will you come?","ar":"هل ستحضر؟"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Your name *","ar":"اسمك *"},"text":"","gap":"m"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Number of guests *","ar":"عدد الضيوف *"},"text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Food needs (optional)","ar":"طلبات خاصة بالأكل (اختياري)"},"text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"A message for the couple (optional)","ar":"رسالة للعروسين (اختياري)"},"text":"","gap":"s"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Send reply","ar":"أرسل الرد"}}]}},{"id":"keep","text":{"en":"Keep it; the stars already show what's required","ar":"أبقِ النموذج كما هو؛ فالنجوم توضّح بالفعل ما هو إلزامي"},"mock":{"app":{"name":{"en":"Farah","ar":"فرح"},"color":"#C2255C","icon":"heart","domain":"farah.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Will you come?","ar":"هل ستحضر؟"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Your name *","ar":"اسمك *"},"text":"","gap":"m"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Number of guests *","ar":"عدد الضيوف *"},"text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Food needs","ar":"طلبات خاصة بالأكل"},"text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"A message for the couple","ar":"رسالة للعروسين"},"text":"","gap":"s"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Send reply","ar":"أرسل الرد"}}]}},{"id":"grey","text":{"en":"Make the two optional fields light grey","ar":"اجعل الحقلين الاختياريين باللون الرمادي الفاتح"},"mock":{"app":{"name":{"en":"Farah","ar":"فرح"},"color":"#C2255C","icon":"heart","domain":"farah.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Will you come?","ar":"هل ستحضر؟"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Your name *","ar":"اسمك *"},"text":"","gap":"m"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Number of guests *","ar":"عدد الضيوف *"},"text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"text","color":"pale","text":{"en":"Food needs","ar":"طلبات خاصة بالأكل"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","text":"","gap":"xs"},{"kind":"text","color":"pale","text":{"en":"A message for the couple","ar":"رسالة للعروسين"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","text":"","gap":"xs"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Send reply","ar":"أرسل الرد"}}]}}],"answer":["label"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-029","when":["keep"],"feedback":{"en":"Many people don't notice that a field has no star, and fill everything in to be safe. Essam may spend time on a message he never meant to write.","ar":"كثيرون لا يلاحظون أن الحقل بلا نجمة، فيملؤون كل شيء احتياطًا. وقد يقضي عصام وقتًا في رسالة لم يكن ينوي كتابتها."}},{"id":"MC-P01-003","when":["grey"],"feedback":{"en":"Grey fields look disabled, not optional, and the labels get harder to read. Say \"optional\" in words.","ar":"الحقول الرمادية تبدو معطّلة، لا اختيارية، وتصبح عناوينها أصعب في القراءة. اكتب «اختياري» بالكلمات."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Stars for required, words for optional.","ar":"صحيح. النجوم للإلزامي، والكلمات للاختياري."},"explain":{"en":"Stars alone ask people to notice an absence. A clear \"(optional)\" tells Essam he can skip those two and send his reply.","ar":"النجوم وحدها تطلب من الناس أن يلاحظوا غياب شيء. أما كلمة «(اختياري)» فتخبر عصام بوضوح أنه يستطيع تجاوز الحقلين وإرسال ردّه."}},{"id":"S09","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P01-U01-05","part":"retest","speaker":"youssef","value":{"en":"Re-test, cognitive load in forms (NN/g): communicate requirements and set expectations upfront. The label promised optional; the check must keep that promise.","ar":"إعادة اختبار، العبء الذهني في النماذج (NN/g): وضّح المتطلّبات وحدّد التوقّعات من البداية. العنوان وعد بأنه اختياري؛ والتحقّق يجب أن يفي بهذا الوعد."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/4-principles-reduce-cognitive-load/","quote":"Communicate requirements and set expectations upfront."},"scenario":{"en":"Zeinab signs up for my bookshop's newsletter. She leaves \"Mobile (optional)\" empty and presses Subscribe. The form stops her. I only send emails; I never use the mobile.","ar":"تشترك زينب في النشرة البريدية لمكتبتي. تترك «الموبايل (اختياري)» فارغًا وتضغط «اشترك». فيوقفها النموذج. وأنا أرسل رسائل بريد فقط؛ ولا أستخدم الموبايل أبدًا."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each fix. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل حل. أيّ حل يناسب مكتبة لا تستخدم الموبايل أبدًا؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"waraq","name":{"en":"Waraq","ar":"ورق"},"color":"#9A3412","icon":"books","domain":"waraq.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"waraq.example/newsletter","caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Get our newsletter","ar":"اشترك في نشرتنا"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Email *","ar":"البريد الإلكتروني *"},"filled":true,"text":"zeinab@mail.com","gap":"m"},{"kind":"field","tone":"bad","label":{"en":"Mobile (optional)","ar":"الموبايل (اختياري)"},"text":"","error":{"en":"Mobile is required.","ar":"الموبايل إلزامي."},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Subscribe","ar":"اشترك"},"gap":"m"}]},"options":[{"id":"label","text":{"en":"Change the label to \"Mobile *\" so it matches the check","ar":"غيّر العنوان إلى «الموبايل *» ليطابق التحقّق"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"waraq","name":{"en":"Waraq","ar":"ورق"},"color":"#9A3412","icon":"books","domain":"waraq.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"waraq.example/newsletter","caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Get our newsletter","ar":"اشترك في نشرتنا"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Email *","ar":"البريد الإلكتروني *"},"filled":true,"text":"zeinab@mail.com","gap":"m"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Mobile *","ar":"الموبايل *"},"text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Subscribe","ar":"اشترك"},"gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"check","text":{"en":"Fix the check so an empty mobile is accepted","ar":"أصلح التحقّق حتى يُقبل الموبايل فارغًا"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"waraq","name":{"en":"Waraq","ar":"ورق"},"color":"#9A3412","icon":"books","domain":"waraq.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"waraq.example/newsletter","caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"You're subscribed","ar":"تم اشتراكك"}},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"Look out for our first email this Friday.","ar":"انتظري أول رسالة منّا يوم الجمعة."},"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"message","text":{"en":"Change the error to \"Please add a mobile to continue\"","ar":"غيّر رسالة الخطأ إلى «يرجى إضافة موبايل للمتابعة»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"waraq","name":{"en":"Waraq","ar":"ورق"},"color":"#9A3412","icon":"books","domain":"waraq.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"waraq.example/newsletter","caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Get our newsletter","ar":"اشترك في نشرتنا"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Email *","ar":"البريد الإلكتروني *"},"filled":true,"text":"zeinab@mail.com","gap":"m"},{"kind":"field","tone":"bad","label":{"en":"Mobile (optional)","ar":"الموبايل (اختياري)"},"text":"","error":{"en":"Please add a mobile to continue.","ar":"يرجى إضافة موبايل للمتابعة."},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Subscribe","ar":"اشترك"},"gap":"m"}]}}],"answer":["check"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-004","when":["label","message"],"feedback":{"en":"The shop never uses the mobile, so the label was right and the check is wrong. Making it required asks for data nobody needs; a nicer error still breaks the promise.","ar":"المكتبة لا تستخدم الموبايل أبدًا، فالعنوان كان صحيحًا والتحقّق هو الخطأ. جعله إلزاميًا يطلب بيانات لا يحتاجها أحد؛ ورسالة الخطأ الألطف تبقى إخلافًا لوعد «اختياري»."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Optional now really means optional.","ar":"صحيح. «اختياري» الآن تعني اختياري فعلًا."},"explain":{"en":"When the label and the check disagree, decide which one tells the truth. Here the mobile isn't used, so the check is the bug.","ar":"عندما يختلف العنوان والتحقّق، قرّر أيهما يقول الحقيقة. هنا لا يُستخدم الموبايل، فالتحقّق هو الخطأ."}},{"id":"S10","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P01-U01-05","part":"retest","speaker":"karim","value":{"en":"Re-test, cognitive load in forms (NN/g): set expectations upfront, then keep them. An optional arrival time must not block the booking, and a fake default isn't a fix.","ar":"إعادة اختبار، العبء الذهني في النماذج (NN/g): حدّد التوقّعات من البداية، ثم التزم بها. وقت الوصول الاختياري يجب ألا يوقف الحجز، والقيمة الافتراضية الوهمية ليست حلًا."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/4-principles-reduce-cognitive-load/","quote":"Communicate requirements and set expectations upfront."},"scenario":{"en":"I'm building a hotel's booking form. \"Arrival time (optional)\" just helps the front desk, which is open all night. Fouad doesn't know when his train arrives, leaves it empty, and the form says \"Choose a time\".","ar":"أبني نموذج الحجز لفندق. «وقت الوصول (اختياري)» يساعد الاستقبال فقط، وهو مفتوح طوال الليل. لا يعرف فؤاد متى يصل قطاره، فيتركه فارغًا، فيقول النموذج «اختر وقتًا»."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each fix. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل حل. أيّها يجب أن يُطلق؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nuzul","name":{"en":"Nuzul","ar":"نُزُل"},"color":"#B7791F","icon":"bed","domain":"nuzul.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"nuzul.example/book","caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Your stay · 2 nights","ar":"إقامتك · ليلتان"}},{"kind":"select","tone":"bad","label":{"en":"Arrival time (optional)","ar":"وقت الوصول (اختياري)"},"text":{"en":"Choose","ar":"اختر"},"error":{"en":"Choose a time.","ar":"اختر وقتًا."},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Book room","ar":"احجز الغرفة"},"gap":"m"}]},"options":[{"id":"default","text":{"en":"Preselect 14:00, so the check always passes","ar":"اختر 14:00 مسبقًا، حتى ينجح التحقّق دائمًا"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nuzul","name":{"en":"Nuzul","ar":"نُزُل"},"color":"#B7791F","icon":"bed","domain":"nuzul.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"nuzul.example/book","caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Your stay · 2 nights","ar":"إقامتك · ليلتان"}},{"kind":"select","label":{"en":"Arrival time (optional)","ar":"وقت الوصول (اختياري)"},"filled":true,"text":"14:00","gap":"m"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Book room","ar":"احجز الغرفة"},"gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"star","text":{"en":"Make it required, with a star","ar":"اجعله إلزاميًا وضع عليه نجمة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nuzul","name":{"en":"Nuzul","ar":"نُزُل"},"color":"#B7791F","icon":"bed","domain":"nuzul.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"nuzul.example/book","caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Your stay · 2 nights","ar":"إقامتك · ليلتان"}},{"kind":"select","label":{"en":"Arrival time *","ar":"وقت الوصول *"},"text":{"en":"Choose","ar":"اختر"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Book room","ar":"احجز الغرفة"},"gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"accept","text":{"en":"Accept it empty, as the label says","ar":"اقبله فارغًا، كما يقول العنوان"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nuzul","name":{"en":"Nuzul","ar":"نُزُل"},"color":"#B7791F","icon":"bed","domain":"nuzul.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"nuzul.example/book","caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Room booked","ar":"تم حجز الغرفة"}},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"Check-in from 14:00. The front desk is open all night.","ar":"الدخول من 14:00. الاستقبال مفتوح طوال الليل."},"gap":"s"}]}}],"answer":["accept"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-004","when":["default","star"],"feedback":{"en":"The hotel doesn't need the time, so it shouldn't be required. A preselected 14:00 is worse: the front desk gets a time Fouad never chose. Let the check match the label.","ar":"الفندق لا يحتاج الوقت، فلا ينبغي أن يكون إلزاميًا. واختيار 14:00 مسبقًا أسوأ: يحصل الاستقبال على وقت لم يختره فؤاد. اجعل التحقّق يطابق العنوان."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Empty is allowed, as promised.","ar":"صحيح. يمكن تركه فارغًا، كما وعد النموذج."},"explain":{"en":"An optional field is a promise. Keeping it means accepting it empty, not forcing an answer or filling one in for Fouad.","ar":"الحقل الاختياري وعد. والوفاء به يعني قبوله فارغًا، لا إجبار فؤاد على إجابة ولا ملؤها نيابة عنه."}},{"id":"S11","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P01-U01-06","part":"retest","speaker":"nour","value":{"en":"Re-test, international sites (NN/g): separate first-name and last-name fields are a prescription for confusion. A four-part Egyptian name doesn't fit two short boxes.","ar":"إعادة اختبار، المواقع الدولية (NN/g): حقلا الاسم الأول واسم العائلة المنفصلان وصفة للارتباك. الاسم المصري الرباعي لا يتّسع في مربعين قصيرين."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/international-sites-requirements/","quote":"Offering separate fields for first name and last name is a prescription for confusion."},"scenario":{"en":"Hayam registers her grandmother at my clinic. The ID card shows four names: Fatma Mohamed Abdel Hamid Ibrahim. Our form has First name and Last name, 15 letters each.","ar":"تسجّل هيام جدّتها في عيادتي. البطاقة فيها أربعة أسماء: فاطمة محمد عبد الحميد إبراهيم. ونموذجنا فيه «الاسم الأول» و«اسم العائلة»، 15 حرفًا لكلٍّ منهما."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each version of the name field. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل نسخة من حقل الاسم. أيّ نسخة تتيح لهيام أن تكتب اسم جدّتها كاملًا كما في البطاقة؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Patient details","ar":"بيانات المريض"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"First name *","ar":"الاسم الأول *"},"filled":true,"text":{"en":"Fatma","ar":"فاطمة"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Last name *","ar":"اسم العائلة *"},"filled":true,"text":{"en":"Mohamed Abdel H","ar":"محمد عبد الحمي"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Max. 15 letters","ar":"15 حرفًا كحدّ أقصى"},"gap":"xs"}]},"options":[{"id":"full","text":{"en":"One \"Full name, as on the ID\" field, with room for long names","ar":"حقل واحد «الاسم الكامل كما في البطاقة»، مع مساحة للأسماء الطويلة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Patient details","ar":"بيانات المريض"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Full name, as on the ID *","ar":"الاسم الكامل كما في البطاقة *"},"filled":true,"text":{"en":"Fatma Mohamed Abdel Hamid Ibrahim","ar":"فاطمة محمد عبد الحميد إبراهيم"},"gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"middle","text":{"en":"Add a Middle name field between the two","ar":"أضف حقل «الاسم الأوسط» بين الحقلين"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Patient details","ar":"بيانات المريض"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"First name *","ar":"الاسم الأول *"},"filled":true,"text":{"en":"Fatma","ar":"فاطمة"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Middle name","ar":"الاسم الأوسط"},"filled":true,"text":{"en":"Mohamed","ar":"محمد"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Last name *","ar":"اسم العائلة *"},"filled":true,"text":{"en":"Abdel Hamid Ibr","ar":"عبد الحميد إبرا"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Max. 15 letters","ar":"15 حرفًا كحدّ أقصى"},"gap":"xs"}]}},{"id":"keep","text":{"en":"Keep it; people can shorten their names to fit","ar":"أبقِ النموذج كما هو؛ يستطيع الناس اختصار أسمائهم لتناسب الحقول"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Patient details","ar":"بيانات المريض"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"First name *","ar":"الاسم الأول *"},"filled":true,"text":{"en":"Fatma","ar":"فاطمة"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Last name *","ar":"اسم العائلة *"},"filled":true,"text":{"en":"Ibrahim","ar":"إبراهيم"},"gap":"s"}]}}],"answer":["full"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-006","when":["middle","keep"],"feedback":{"en":"Her name still doesn't fit the boxes, and a shortened name may not match her ID at the clinic. Not every name splits into first and last. One full-name field fits them all.","ar":"ما زال اسمها لا يتّسع في المربعات، والاسم المختصر قد لا يطابق بطاقتها في العيادة. فليس كل اسم ينقسم إلى اسم أول واسم عائلة. حقل واحد للاسم الكامل يناسب كل الأسماء."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. One field, the whole name, as on the ID.","ar":"صحيح. حقل واحد، الاسم كاملًا، كما في البطاقة."},"explain":{"en":"Names come in many shapes: one part, two, four or more. A single full-name field lets Hayam type it exactly as it appears on the ID.","ar":"تأتي الأسماء بأشكال كثيرة: جزء واحد أو اثنان أو أربعة أو أكثر. حقل واحد للاسم الكامل يتيح لهيام كتابته تمامًا كما يظهر في البطاقة."}},{"id":"S12","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P01-U01-06","part":"retest","speaker":"tarek","value":{"en":"Re-test, international sites (NN/g): separate first- and last-name fields are a prescription for confusion. Some people have a single name; a required Last name blocks them.","ar":"إعادة اختبار، المواقع الدولية (NN/g): حقلا الاسم الأول واسم العائلة المنفصلان وصفة للارتباك. بعض الناس لهم اسم واحد فقط؛ واسم العائلة الإلزامي يوقفهم."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/international-sites-requirements/","quote":"Offering separate fields for first name and last name is a prescription for confusion."},"scenario":{"en":"In our ticket app, Ashraf books football match tickets for himself and a friend from abroad. His friend's passport shows only one name. The form requires both First name and Last name for each guest.","ar":"في تطبيق التذاكر عندنا، يحجز أشرف تذاكر مباراة كرة قدم له ولصديق من الخارج. جواز سفر صديقه فيه اسم واحد فقط. والنموذج يُلزم بكتابة «الاسم الأول» و«اسم العائلة» لكل ضيف."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each version of the guest form. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل نسخة من نموذج الضيوف. أيّ نسخة تتيح لأشرف أن يكتب اسم صديقه كما في جواز السفر؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"tazkara","name":{"en":"Tazkara","ar":"تذكرة"},"color":"#C026D3","icon":"ticket","domain":"tazkara.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Tickets","ar":"التذاكر"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Guest 2","ar":"الضيف 2"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"First name *","ar":"الاسم الأول *"},"filled":true,"text":"Arjun","gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","tone":"bad","label":{"en":"Last name *","ar":"اسم العائلة *"},"text":"","error":{"en":"Last name is required.","ar":"اسم العائلة إلزامي."},"gap":"s"}]},"options":[{"id":"optional","text":{"en":"Keep both fields, and make Last name optional","ar":"أبقِ الحقلين، واجعل اسم العائلة اختياريًا"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"tazkara","name":{"en":"Tazkara","ar":"تذكرة"},"color":"#C026D3","icon":"ticket","domain":"tazkara.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Tickets","ar":"التذاكر"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Guest 2","ar":"الضيف 2"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"First name *","ar":"الاسم الأول *"},"filled":true,"text":"Arjun","gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Last name (optional)","ar":"اسم العائلة (اختياري)"},"text":"","gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"full","text":{"en":"One field: \"Full name, as on the passport\"","ar":"حقل واحد: «الاسم الكامل كما في جواز السفر»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"tazkara","name":{"en":"Tazkara","ar":"تذكرة"},"color":"#C026D3","icon":"ticket","domain":"tazkara.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Tickets","ar":"التذاكر"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Guest 2","ar":"الضيف 2"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Full name, as on the passport *","ar":"الاسم الكامل كما في جواز السفر *"},"filled":true,"text":"Arjun","gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"repeat","text":{"en":"Add a hint: \"Only one name? Type it in both fields\"","ar":"أضف تلميحًا: «لديك اسم واحد؟ اكتبه في الحقلين»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"tazkara","name":{"en":"Tazkara","ar":"تذكرة"},"color":"#C026D3","icon":"ticket","domain":"tazkara.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Tickets","ar":"التذاكر"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Guest 2","ar":"الضيف 2"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"First name *","ar":"الاسم الأول *"},"filled":true,"text":"Arjun","gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Last name *","ar":"اسم العائلة *"},"filled":true,"text":"Arjun","hint":{"en":"Only one name? Type it in both fields.","ar":"لديك اسم واحد؟ اكتبه في الحقلين."},"gap":"s"}]}}],"answer":["full"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-006","when":["optional","repeat"],"feedback":{"en":"Both still assume a name has two parts. \"Arjun Arjun\" won't match the passport at the door, and an optional last name still asks which part goes where. One full-name field fits every name.","ar":"كلاهما ما زال يفترض أن للاسم جزأين. «Arjun Arjun» لن يطابق جواز السفر عند الباب، ومع اسم عائلة اختياري يبقى السؤال: أي جزء أكتب في أي حقل؟ حقل واحد للاسم الكامل يناسب كل الأسماء."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. One name or five, it fits.","ar":"صحيح. الحقل يتّسع للاسم، جزءًا واحدًا كان أو خمسة."},"explain":{"en":"The ticket needs the name as it appears on the passport. One full-name field takes it exactly as written, however many parts it has.","ar":"التذكرة تحتاج الاسم كما يظهر في جواز السفر. حقل واحد للاسم الكامل يأخذه تمامًا كما هو مكتوب، مهما كان عدد أجزائه."}},{"id":"S13","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P01-U01-07","part":"retest","speaker":"youssef","value":{"en":"Re-test, international sites (NN/g): allow international phone numbers with a varying number of digits and a country code. A Saudi number is real and valid.","ar":"إعادة اختبار، المواقع الدولية (NN/g): اسمح بأرقام الهواتف الدولية بعدد أرقام مختلف ومع مفتاح الدولة. الرقم السعودي رقم حقيقي وصالح."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/international-sites-requirements/","quote":"For phone numbers, allow for international numbers containing a varying number of digits and a country code."},"scenario":{"en":"Shereen lives in Riyadh and sends a gift from my shop to her mother in Cairo. She types her own mobile, ⁦+966 55 123 4567⁩, so the courier can reach her. My form only accepts 11 digits starting with 01.","ar":"تعيش شيرين في الرياض وترسل هدية من متجري لأمها في القاهرة. تكتب رقم موبايلها ⁦+966 55 123 4567⁩، حتى يستطيع المندوب الوصول إليها. ونموذجي يقبل فقط 11 رقمًا تبدأ بـ 01."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each fix. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل حل. أيّها يجب أن يُطلق؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Sender's details","ar":"بيانات المرسِل"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","tone":"bad","label":{"en":"Your mobile *","ar":"موبايلك *"},"filled":true,"text":"⁦+966 55 123 4567⁩","error":{"en":"Enter a valid number.","ar":"أدخل رقمًا صالحًا."},"gap":"m"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Send gift","ar":"أرسل الهدية"}}]},"options":[{"id":"hint","text":{"en":"Add a hint: \"Format: 01XXXXXXXXX\"","ar":"أضف تلميحًا: «الصيغة: 01XXXXXXXXX»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Sender's details","ar":"بيانات المرسِل"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Your mobile *","ar":"موبايلك *"},"text":"","hint":{"en":"Format: 01XXXXXXXXX","ar":"الصيغة: 01XXXXXXXXX"},"gap":"m"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Send gift","ar":"أرسل الهدية"}}]}},{"id":"egypt","text":{"en":"Add a country list with only Egypt in it","ar":"أضف قائمة دول فيها مصر فقط"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Sender's details","ar":"بيانات المرسِل"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"select","label":{"en":"Country","ar":"الدولة"},"filled":true,"text":{"en":"Egypt (+20)","ar":"مصر (+20)"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Your mobile *","ar":"موبايلك *"},"text":"","gap":"s"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Send gift","ar":"أرسل الهدية"}}]}},{"id":"accept","text":{"en":"Accept any country code, spaces and length, and tidy it up behind the scenes","ar":"اقبل أي رمز دولة وأي مسافات وأي طول، ونظّم الرقم في الخلفية"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Sender's details","ar":"بيانات المرسِل"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Your mobile *","ar":"موبايلك *"},"filled":true,"text":"⁦+966 55 123 4567⁩","gap":"m"},{"kind":"small","color":"green","text":{"en":"✓ Saudi Arabia number","ar":"✓ رقم من السعودية"},"gap":"xs"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Send gift","ar":"أرسل الهدية"}}]}}],"answer":["accept"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-007","when":["hint","egypt"],"feedback":{"en":"Both still reject a real number. Shereen doesn't have an Egyptian mobile, so a hint or an Egypt-only list leaves her stuck. Accept the number she has.","ar":"كلاهما ما زال يرفض رقمًا حقيقيًا. شيرين ليس لديها موبايل مصري، فالتلميح أو القائمة التي فيها مصر فقط يتركانها عالقة. اقبل الرقم الذي لديها."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Her real number works.","ar":"صحيح. النموذج يقبل رقمها الحقيقي."},"explain":{"en":"Phone numbers vary by country in length and format. Accept the country code and spaces, and let the system store the number in the form it needs.","ar":"تختلف أرقام الهواتف بين الدول في طولها وصيغتها. اقبل رمز الدولة والمسافات، ودع النظام يحفظ الرقم بالصيغة التي يحتاجها."}},{"id":"S14","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P01-U01-07","part":"retest","speaker":"karim","value":{"en":"Re-test, mobile input checklist (NN/g): do you allow users to enter the number in whatever format they like? Dashes are a common way to write numbers; the system can remove them.","ar":"إعادة اختبار، قائمة تحقّق حقول الهاتف (NN/g): هل تسمح للمستخدمين بإدخال الرقم بأي صيغة يحبّونها؟ الشَرطات طريقة شائعة لكتابة الأرقام؛ ويمكن للنظام حذفها."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/mobile-input-checklist/","quote":"Do you allow users to enter it in whatever format they like?"},"scenario":{"en":"I'm building a car service booking form. Kamal types his mobile the way he always writes it, ⁦0100-123-4567⁩. My form rejects it because of the dashes.","ar":"أبني نموذج حجز لصيانة السيارات. يكتب كمال رقم موبايله كما يكتبه دائمًا، ⁦0100-123-4567⁩. فيرفضه نموذجي بسبب الشَرطات."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each fix. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل حل. أيّها يجب أن يُطلق؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"mekaneeky","name":{"en":"Mekaneeky","ar":"ميكانيكي"},"color":"#1E40AF","icon":"wrench","domain":"mekaneeky.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Book a service","ar":"احجز صيانة"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","tone":"bad","label":{"en":"Mobile *","ar":"الموبايل *"},"filled":true,"text":"⁦0100-123-4567⁩","error":{"en":"Invalid number.","ar":"رقم غير صالح."},"gap":"m"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Book","ar":"احجز"}}]},"options":[{"id":"accept","text":{"en":"Accept dashes and spaces, and remove them behind the scenes","ar":"اقبل الشَرطات والمسافات، واحذفها في الخلفية"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"mekaneeky","name":{"en":"Mekaneeky","ar":"ميكانيكي"},"color":"#1E40AF","icon":"wrench","domain":"mekaneeky.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Book a service","ar":"احجز صيانة"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Mobile *","ar":"الموبايل *"},"filled":true,"text":"⁦0100 123 4567⁩","gap":"m"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Book","ar":"احجز"}}]}},{"id":"error","text":{"en":"Make the error clearer: \"Numbers only, no dashes or spaces\"","ar":"اجعل الخطأ أوضح: «أرقام فقط، بدون شَرطات أو مسافات»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"mekaneeky","name":{"en":"Mekaneeky","ar":"ميكانيكي"},"color":"#1E40AF","icon":"wrench","domain":"mekaneeky.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Book a service","ar":"احجز صيانة"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","tone":"bad","label":{"en":"Mobile *","ar":"الموبايل *"},"filled":true,"text":"⁦0100-123-4567⁩","error":{"en":"Numbers only, no dashes or spaces.","ar":"أرقام فقط، بدون شَرطات أو مسافات."},"gap":"m"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Book","ar":"احجز"}}]}},{"id":"boxes","text":{"en":"Split the field into three boxes of 4, 3 and 4 digits","ar":"قسّم الحقل إلى ثلاثة مربعات: 4 و3 و4 أرقام"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"mekaneeky","name":{"en":"Mekaneeky","ar":"ميكانيكي"},"color":"#1E40AF","icon":"wrench","domain":"mekaneeky.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Book a service","ar":"احجز صيانة"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Mobile *","ar":"الموبايل *"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"row","gap":"xs","blocks":[{"kind":"field","text":"0100"},{"kind":"field","text":"123"},{"kind":"field","text":"4567"}]}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Book","ar":"احجز"}}]}}],"answer":["accept"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-007","when":["error","boxes"],"feedback":{"en":"Both make Kamal do the system's work: retype his number, or split it and jump between boxes. Paste or type it any way he likes, and clean it up in the code.","ar":"كلاهما يجعل كمال يقوم بعمل النظام: يعيد كتابة رقمه، أو يقسّمه ويتنقّل بين المربعات. دعه يلصقه أو يكتبه بأي طريقة، ونظّفه في الكود."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. The system tidies the number, not Kamal.","ar":"صحيح. النظام هو من ينظّم الرقم، لا كمال."},"explain":{"en":"Dashes and spaces make numbers easier for people to read and check. Removing them is easy for the system, so there's no reason to reject them.","ar":"الشَرطات والمسافات تجعل الأرقام أسهل في القراءة والمراجعة. وحذفها سهل على النظام، فلا سبب لرفضها."}},{"id":"S15","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P01-U01-08","part":"retest","speaker":"mona","value":{"en":"Re-test, cognitive load in forms (NN/g): form labels and instructions should be immediately understandable. Technical terms need a plain question, not a tooltip.","ar":"إعادة اختبار، العبء الذهني في النماذج (NN/g): يجب أن تكون عناوين النموذج وتعليماته مفهومة فورًا. المصطلحات التقنية تحتاج سؤالًا بسيطًا، لا تلميحًا منبثقًا."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/4-principles-reduce-cognitive-load/","quote":"Form labels and instructions should be immediately understandable."},"scenario":{"en":"My team is reviewing an internet company's order form. It asks Afaf \"Line type: ADSL, VDSL or FTTH\". The company really needs to know if her building has a fibre box. Afaf has no idea what the letters mean.","ar":"يراجع فريقي نموذج الطلب لشركة إنترنت. النموذج يسأل عفاف «نوع الخط: ADSL أو VDSL أو FTTH». والشركة تحتاج فعلًا أن تعرف هل في عمارتها صندوق ألياف. وعفاف لا تعرف ماذا تعني هذه الحروف."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each version of the question. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل نسخة من السؤال. أيّ نسخة تسأل عفاف سؤالًا تفهمه، وتعطي الشركة ما تحتاجه؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"shabaka","name":{"en":"Shabaka","ar":"شبكة"},"color":"#0891B2","icon":"wifi-high","domain":"shabaka.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Order internet","ar":"اطلب الإنترنت"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Line type *","ar":"نوع الخط *"}},{"kind":"radio","text":"ADSL","gap":"s"},{"kind":"radio","text":"VDSL","gap":"xs"},{"kind":"radio","text":"FTTH","gap":"xs"}]},"options":[{"id":"tooltip","text":{"en":"Keep the choices, and add an ⓘ with technical definitions","ar":"أبقِ الخيارات، وأضف ⓘ تعرض تعريفات تقنية"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"shabaka","name":{"en":"Shabaka","ar":"شبكة"},"color":"#0891B2","icon":"wifi-high","domain":"shabaka.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Order internet","ar":"اطلب الإنترنت"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Line type * ⓘ","ar":"نوع الخط * ⓘ"}},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"FTTH: fibre-to-the-home, GPON-based…","ar":"FTTH: ألياف حتى المنزل، تعتمد على GPON…"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"radio","text":"ADSL","gap":"s"},{"kind":"radio","text":"VDSL","gap":"xs"},{"kind":"radio","text":"FTTH","gap":"xs"}]}},{"id":"acronyms","text":{"en":"Spell out the full technical names of the three line types","ar":"اكتب الأسماء التقنية الكاملة لأنواع الخطوط الثلاثة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"shabaka","name":{"en":"Shabaka","ar":"شبكة"},"color":"#0891B2","icon":"wifi-high","domain":"shabaka.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Order internet","ar":"اطلب الإنترنت"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Line type *","ar":"نوع الخط *"}},{"kind":"radio","text":"Asymmetric Digital Subscriber Line","gap":"s"},{"kind":"radio","text":"Very-high-bit-rate DSL","gap":"xs"},{"kind":"radio","text":"Fibre To The Home","gap":"xs"}]}},{"id":"plain","text":{"en":"Ask in everyday words: \"Is there a fibre box in your building?\"","ar":"اسأل بكلمات يومية: «هل يوجد صندوق ألياف في عمارتك؟»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"shabaka","name":{"en":"Shabaka","ar":"شبكة"},"color":"#0891B2","icon":"wifi-high","domain":"shabaka.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Order internet","ar":"اطلب الإنترنت"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Is there a fibre box in your building? *","ar":"هل يوجد صندوق ألياف في عمارتك؟ *"}},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"A small white box near the entrance, often with the company's name.","ar":"صندوق أبيض صغير قرب المدخل، عليه اسم الشركة غالبًا."},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Yes","ar":"نعم"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"No","ar":"لا"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"I'm not sure","ar":"لست متأكّدة"},"gap":"xs"}]}}],"answer":["plain"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-008","when":["tooltip","acronyms"],"feedback":{"en":"Longer technical words are still technical. Afaf can't tell which line she has, so she'll guess. Ask about the real need in words she uses.","ar":"الاسم التقني الكامل يبقى تقنيًا. لا تستطيع عفاف معرفة أي خط لديها، فستخمّن. اسأل عن الحاجة الحقيقية بكلمات تستخدمها."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. A question Afaf can answer by looking.","ar":"صحيح. سؤال تستطيع عفاف الإجابة عنه بالنظر."},"explain":{"en":"The company needs one fact: is fibre in the building? Asking that in plain words, with \"I'm not sure\", gets a true answer instead of a guess.","ar":"الشركة تحتاج معلومة واحدة: هل الألياف موجودة في العمارة؟ السؤال عنها بكلمات بسيطة، مع «لست متأكّدة»، يأتي بإجابة صحيحة بدل التخمين."}},{"id":"S16","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P01-U01-08","part":"retest","speaker":"sara","value":{"en":"Re-test, international sites (NN/g): for dates, always spell out the name of the month. 05/06 reads as May or June depending on where you're from.","ar":"إعادة اختبار، المواقع الدولية (NN/g): في التواريخ، اكتب اسم الشهر دائمًا. 05/06 تُقرأ مايو أو يونيو حسب البلد الذي جئت منه."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/international-sites-requirements/","quote":"For dates, the main guideline is: Always spell out the name of the month."},"scenario":{"en":"I'm redesigning a visa booking site. Raouf's confirmation shows 05/06/2027. He isn't sure if it means 5 June or 6 May, and he can't afford to miss it.","ar":"أعيد تصميم موقع لحجز مواعيد التأشيرة. تأكيد رؤوف يعرض 05/06/2027. وهو ليس متأكّدًا هل يعني 5 يونيو أم 6 مايو، ولا يتحمّل أن يفوته الموعد."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each way of showing the date. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل طريقة لعرض التاريخ. أيّ طريقة تجعل رؤوف يعرف يوم موعده دون أي شك؟"},"mock":{"app":{"name":{"en":"Tasheera","ar":"تأشيرة"},"color":"#5C940D","icon":"stamp","domain":"tasheera.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"tasheera.example/appointment","caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Appointment booked","ar":"تم حجز الموعد"}},{"kind":"meta","weight":"bold","text":"05/06/2027 · 09:30","gap":"s"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Bring your passport and two photos.","ar":"أحضر جواز سفرك وصورتين."},"gap":"s"}]},"options":[{"id":"note","text":{"en":"Keep the numbers, and add \"Format: DD/MM/YYYY\" under it","ar":"أبقِ الأرقام، وأضف «الصيغة: يوم/شهر/سنة» تحته"},"mock":{"app":{"name":{"en":"Tasheera","ar":"تأشيرة"},"color":"#5C940D","icon":"stamp","domain":"tasheera.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"tasheera.example/appointment","caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Appointment booked","ar":"تم حجز الموعد"}},{"kind":"meta","weight":"bold","text":"05/06/2027 · 09:30","gap":"s"},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Format: DD/MM/YYYY","ar":"الصيغة: يوم/شهر/سنة"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Bring your passport and two photos.","ar":"أحضر جواز سفرك وصورتين."},"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"words","text":{"en":"Write the month as a word: Saturday 5 June 2027","ar":"اكتب الشهر بالكلمات: السبت 5 يونيو 2027"},"mock":{"app":{"name":{"en":"Tasheera","ar":"تأشيرة"},"color":"#5C940D","icon":"stamp","domain":"tasheera.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"tasheera.example/appointment","caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Appointment booked","ar":"تم حجز الموعد"}},{"kind":"meta","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Saturday 5 June 2027 · 09:30","ar":"السبت 5 يونيو 2027 · 09:30"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Bring your passport and two photos.","ar":"أحضر جواز سفرك وصورتين."},"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"iso","text":{"en":"Use the international format: 2027-06-05","ar":"استخدم الصيغة الدولية: 2027-06-05"},"mock":{"app":{"name":{"en":"Tasheera","ar":"تأشيرة"},"color":"#5C940D","icon":"stamp","domain":"tasheera.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"tasheera.example/appointment","caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Appointment booked","ar":"تم حجز الموعد"}},{"kind":"meta","weight":"bold","text":"2027-06-05 · 09:30","gap":"s"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Bring your passport and two photos.","ar":"أحضر جواز سفرك وصورتين."},"gap":"s"}]}}],"answer":["words"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-030","when":["note","iso"],"feedback":{"en":"Raouf still has to decode the numbers, and many people misread both formats. A month written as a word can't be confused.","ar":"ما زال على رؤوف أن يفسّر الأرقام، وكثيرون يخطئون في قراءة الصيغتين. الشهر المكتوب بالكلمات لا يمكن الخلط فيه."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. No one can misread June.","ar":"صحيح. لا أحد يخطئ في قراءة يونيو."},"explain":{"en":"Day-month order differs between countries, so number-only dates are a guess. Writing the month, and the weekday too, makes the appointment impossible to misread.","ar":"يختلف ترتيب اليوم والشهر بين الدول، فالتاريخ المكتوب بالأرقام وحدها يترك القارئ يخمّن. كتابة اسم الشهر، واسم اليوم أيضًا، تجعل الخطأ في قراءة الموعد مستحيلًا."}}]}$uxg$::jsonb),
  ($uxg$P01-U02-B01$uxg$, $uxg$316d607fe53ba705e883671c089a50ebd2d63bb45ae4d4966a9c3d6cfb241f37$uxg$, $uxg${"id":"P01-U02-B01","mode":"bank","title":{"en":"Re-tests: pick the right control","ar":"إعادة اختبار: اختر عنصر التحكّم (Control) المناسب"},"steps":[{"id":"S01","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P01-U02-01","part":"retest","speaker":"karim","value":{"en":"Re-test, toggle switches (NN/g): a toggle inside a form with a Save button confuses people, because they can't be sure whether it took effect. Inside a form, use a checkbox.","ar":"إعادة اختبار، مفاتيح الـ Toggle (NN/g): الـ Toggle داخل نموذج فيه زر حفظ يُربك الناس، لأنهم لا يعرفون هل طُبّق اختيارهم. داخل النموذج، استخدم Checkbox."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/toggle-switch-guidelines/","quote":"This scenario confuses users because they can’t be sure whether their toggle choice will take immediate effect."},"scenario":{"en":"I'm building a marketplace app. Yehia edits his seller profile, and nothing on the page is saved until he taps Save. Above the button there's a toggle: \"Show my phone number to buyers\".","ar":"أبني تطبيقًا للبيع والشراء. يعدّل يحيى ملفه كبائع، ولا شيء في الصفحة يُحفظ حتى يضغط «حفظ». وفوق الزر يوجد Toggle (مفتاح تشغيل وإيقاف): «أظهر رقم هاتفي للمشترين»."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each version. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل نسخة. أيّها يجب أن تُطلق؟"},"mock":{"app":{"name":{"en":"Bayya'","ar":"بيّاع"},"color":"#F76707","icon":"tag","domain":"bayya.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Seller profile","ar":"ملف البائع"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Shop name","ar":"اسم المتجر"},"filled":true,"text":{"en":"Yehia's Bikes","ar":"دراجات يحيى"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"toggle","text":{"en":"Show my phone number to buyers","ar":"أظهر رقم هاتفي للمشترين"},"gap":"m"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Save","ar":"حفظ"}}]},"options":[{"id":"keep","text":{"en":"Keep the toggle; it's a clear on/off choice","ar":"أبقِ الـ Toggle؛ فهو اختيار تشغيل وإيقاف واضح"},"mock":{"app":{"name":{"en":"Bayya'","ar":"بيّاع"},"color":"#F76707","icon":"tag","domain":"bayya.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Seller profile","ar":"ملف البائع"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Shop name","ar":"اسم المتجر"},"filled":true,"text":{"en":"Yehia's Bikes","ar":"دراجات يحيى"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"toggle","text":{"en":"Show my phone number to buyers","ar":"أظهر رقم هاتفي للمشترين"},"gap":"m"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Save","ar":"حفظ"}}]}},{"id":"check","text":{"en":"Use a checkbox, saved with the rest of the form","ar":"استخدم Checkbox (مربع اختيار) يُحفظ مع بقية النموذج"},"mock":{"app":{"name":{"en":"Bayya'","ar":"بيّاع"},"color":"#F76707","icon":"tag","domain":"bayya.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Seller profile","ar":"ملف البائع"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Shop name","ar":"اسم المتجر"},"filled":true,"text":{"en":"Yehia's Bikes","ar":"دراجات يحيى"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"check","text":{"en":"Show my phone number to buyers","ar":"أظهر رقم هاتفي للمشترين"},"gap":"m"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Save","ar":"حفظ"}}]}},{"id":"note","text":{"en":"Keep the toggle, and add \"Changes apply when you save\" under it","ar":"أبقِ الـ Toggle، وأضف تحته «تُطبّق التغييرات عند الحفظ»"},"mock":{"app":{"name":{"en":"Bayya'","ar":"بيّاع"},"color":"#F76707","icon":"tag","domain":"bayya.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Seller profile","ar":"ملف البائع"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Shop name","ar":"اسم المتجر"},"filled":true,"text":{"en":"Yehia's Bikes","ar":"دراجات يحيى"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"toggle","text":{"en":"Show my phone number to buyers","ar":"أظهر رقم هاتفي للمشترين"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Changes apply when you save.","ar":"تُطبّق التغييرات عند الحفظ."},"gap":"xs"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Save","ar":"حفظ"}}]}}],"answer":["check"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-018","when":["keep","note"],"feedback":{"en":"A toggle looks like it acts the moment you flip it. Yehia may flip it, leave the page, and think his number is hidden. A note fights the control instead of fixing it.","ar":"الـ Toggle يبدو كأنه يعمل لحظة تحريكه. قد يحرّكه يحيى ويغادر الصفحة، ويظن أن رقمه مخفي. والملاحظة ترقّع عنصرًا غير مناسب بدل أن تستبدله."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. A checkbox waits for Save, like the rest of the form.","ar":"صحيح. الـ Checkbox ينتظر الحفظ، مثل بقية النموذج."},"explain":{"en":"People expect a toggle to work instantly and a checkbox to wait for a button. In a form that saves together, the checkbox tells Yehia the truth.","ar":"يتوقّع الناس أن يعمل الـ Toggle فورًا، وأن ينتظر الـ Checkbox الضغط على زر. في نموذج يُحفظ دفعة واحدة، يُظهر الـ Checkbox ليحيى ما سيحدث فعلًا."}},{"id":"S02","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P01-U02-01","part":"retest","speaker":"rami","value":{"en":"Re-test, toggle switches (NN/g): separate controls that produce instant results from those that require a button. A setting that can apply at once deserves a toggle, not a checkbox and an Apply button.","ar":"إعادة اختبار، مفاتيح الـ Toggle (NN/g): افصل العناصر التي تعطي نتيجة فورية عن التي تحتاج زرًا. الإعداد الذي يمكن تطبيقه فورًا يستحق Toggle، لا Checkbox وزر «تطبيق»."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/toggle-switch-guidelines/","quote":"Separate controls that produce instant results from those that require clicking a command button."},"scenario":{"en":"I'm designing a news app. Nashwa reads at night and wants dark mode. In our settings, every other option changes at once. Dark mode is a checkbox, with an Apply button at the bottom of the screen.","ar":"أصمّم تطبيقًا للأخبار. تقرأ نشوى ليلًا وتريد الوضع الداكن. في إعداداتنا، كل الخيارات الأخرى تتغيّر فورًا. أما الوضع الداكن فهو Checkbox، مع زر «تطبيق» في أسفل الشاشة."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each version. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل نسخة. أيّها يجب أن تُطلق؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"khabar","name":{"en":"Khabar","ar":"خبر"},"color":"#212529","icon":"newspaper","domain":"khabar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Settings","ar":"الإعدادات"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"blocks":[{"kind":"toggle","selected":true,"text":{"en":"Breaking news alerts","ar":"تنبيهات الأخبار العاجلة"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"check","text":{"en":"Dark mode","ar":"الوضع الداكن"},"gap":"s"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","emphasis":"low","text":{"en":"Apply","ar":"تطبيق"}}]},"options":[{"id":"toggle","text":{"en":"Make dark mode a toggle that switches at once, and remove Apply","ar":"اجعل الوضع الداكن Toggle يتغيّر فورًا، واحذف «تطبيق»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"khabar","name":{"en":"Khabar","ar":"خبر"},"color":"#212529","icon":"newspaper","domain":"khabar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Settings","ar":"الإعدادات"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"toggle","selected":true,"text":{"en":"Breaking news alerts","ar":"تنبيهات الأخبار العاجلة"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"toggle","text":{"en":"Dark mode","ar":"الوضع الداكن"},"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"keep","text":{"en":"Keep the checkbox and the Apply button","ar":"أبقِ الـ Checkbox وزر «تطبيق»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"khabar","name":{"en":"Khabar","ar":"خبر"},"color":"#212529","icon":"newspaper","domain":"khabar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Settings","ar":"الإعدادات"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"toggle","selected":true,"text":{"en":"Breaking news alerts","ar":"تنبيهات الأخبار العاجلة"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"check","text":{"en":"Dark mode","ar":"الوضع الداكن"},"gap":"s"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","emphasis":"low","text":{"en":"Apply","ar":"تطبيق"}}]}},{"id":"radios","text":{"en":"Use On and Off radio buttons, with the Apply button","ar":"استخدم Radio buttons (أزرار اختيار واحد) «تشغيل» و«إيقاف»، مع زر «تطبيق»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"khabar","name":{"en":"Khabar","ar":"خبر"},"color":"#212529","icon":"newspaper","domain":"khabar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Settings","ar":"الإعدادات"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"toggle","selected":true,"text":{"en":"Breaking news alerts","ar":"تنبيهات الأخبار العاجلة"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Dark mode","ar":"الوضع الداكن"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"On","ar":"تشغيل"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"radio","selected":true,"text":{"en":"Off","ar":"إيقاف"},"gap":"xs"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","emphasis":"low","text":{"en":"Apply","ar":"تطبيق"}}]}}],"answer":["toggle"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-018","when":["keep","radios"],"feedback":{"en":"Everything else on this screen works at once, so Nashwa expects dark mode to as well. A control that waits for a far-away Apply button breaks that pattern, and she may never press it.","ar":"كل شيء آخر في هذه الشاشة يعمل فورًا، فتتوقّع نشوى أن يعمل الوضع الداكن كذلك. والعنصر الذي ينتظر زر «تطبيق» في أسفل الشاشة يخالف هذا النمط، وقد لا تضغطه أبدًا."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. An instant setting gets an instant control.","ar":"صحيح. الإعداد الذي يتغيّر فورًا يناسبه عنصر يعمل فورًا."},"explain":{"en":"Dark mode can change the moment Nashwa flips it, and she sees the result right away. A toggle says exactly that, and matches the other settings on the screen.","ar":"يمكن أن يتغيّر الوضع الداكن لحظة تحريكه، وترى نشوى النتيجة فورًا. والـ Toggle يوحي بذلك تمامًا، ويتّفق مع بقية الإعدادات في الشاشة."}},{"id":"S03","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P01-U02-02","part":"retest","speaker":"youssef","value":{"en":"Re-test, dropdowns (NN/g): when a handful of options fits on screen, a dropdown adds more friction than value. Three delivery slots, one answer: radio buttons.","ar":"إعادة اختبار، القوائم المنسدلة (NN/g): عندما تتّسع الشاشة لعدد قليل من الخيارات، تضيف القائمة المنسدلة عناءً أكثر من فائدتها. ثلاث فترات توصيل وإجابة واحدة: Radio buttons."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/dropdown-list/","quote":"When a handful of options can comfortably fit on screen, a dropdown adds more friction than real value."},"scenario":{"en":"Galal orders groceries from my shop for tomorrow. He must pick one delivery slot out of three: morning, afternoon or evening. Right now they're inside a dropdown.","ar":"يطلب جلال بقالة من متجري ليوم غد. يجب أن يختار فترة توصيل واحدة من ثلاث: صباحًا أو ظهرًا أو مساءً. وحاليًا تظهر داخل قائمة منسدلة (Dropdown)."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each control. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل عنصر. أيّ عنصر يُظهر لجلال الفترات الثلاث ويتيح له اختيار واحدة بضغطة؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"sallah","name":{"en":"Sallah","ar":"سلّة"},"color":"#2E9E5B","icon":"basket","domain":"sallah.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Delivery tomorrow","ar":"التوصيل غدًا"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"blocks":[{"kind":"select","label":{"en":"Delivery slot","ar":"فترة التوصيل"},"text":{"en":"Select…","ar":"اختر…"},"gap":"m"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Continue","ar":"متابعة"}}]},"options":[{"id":"dropdown","text":{"en":"Keep the dropdown; it saves space","ar":"أبقِ القائمة المنسدلة؛ فهي توفّر المساحة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"sallah","name":{"en":"Sallah","ar":"سلّة"},"color":"#2E9E5B","icon":"basket","domain":"sallah.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Delivery tomorrow","ar":"التوصيل غدًا"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"select","label":{"en":"Delivery slot","ar":"فترة التوصيل"},"text":{"en":"Select…","ar":"اختر…"},"gap":"m"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Continue","ar":"متابعة"}}]}},{"id":"checks","text":{"en":"Three checkboxes, so every slot is visible","ar":"ثلاثة Checkboxes، حتى تظهر كل الفترات"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"sallah","name":{"en":"Sallah","ar":"سلّة"},"color":"#2E9E5B","icon":"basket","domain":"sallah.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Delivery tomorrow","ar":"التوصيل غدًا"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Delivery slot","ar":"فترة التوصيل"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"check","text":{"en":"Morning, 9:00 to 12:00","ar":"صباحًا، من 9:00 إلى 12:00"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"check","text":{"en":"Afternoon, 12:00 to 16:00","ar":"ظهرًا، من 12:00 إلى 16:00"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"check","text":{"en":"Evening, 16:00 to 20:00","ar":"مساءً، من 16:00 إلى 20:00"},"gap":"xs"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Continue","ar":"متابعة"}}]}},{"id":"radios","text":{"en":"Three radio buttons, all visible","ar":"ثلاثة Radio buttons، كلها ظاهرة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"sallah","name":{"en":"Sallah","ar":"سلّة"},"color":"#2E9E5B","icon":"basket","domain":"sallah.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Delivery tomorrow","ar":"التوصيل غدًا"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Delivery slot","ar":"فترة التوصيل"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Morning, 9:00 to 12:00","ar":"صباحًا، من 9:00 إلى 12:00"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Afternoon, 12:00 to 16:00","ar":"ظهرًا، من 12:00 إلى 16:00"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Evening, 16:00 to 20:00","ar":"مساءً، من 16:00 إلى 20:00"},"gap":"xs"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Continue","ar":"متابعة"}}]}}],"answer":["radios"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-031","when":["dropdown"],"feedback":{"en":"Three options fit easily on screen. Inside a dropdown, Galal must open it to see them, then tap again to choose. Show them.","ar":"ثلاثة خيارات تتّسع بسهولة في الشاشة. داخل القائمة المنسدلة، يجب أن يفتحها جلال ليراها، ثم يضغط مرة أخرى ليختار. اعرضها."}},{"id":"MC-P01-032","when":["checks"],"feedback":{"en":"Checkboxes say \"pick any number\", but Galal can only have one slot. He may tick two and get an error. One answer means radio buttons.","ar":"الـ Checkboxes تقول «اختر أي عدد»، لكن جلال يمكنه اختيار فترة واحدة فقط. قد يختار اثنتين ويظهر له خطأ. الإجابة الواحدة تعني Radio buttons."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. All three visible, one tap to choose.","ar":"صحيح. الثلاثة ظاهرة، وضغطة واحدة للاختيار."},"explain":{"en":"Radio buttons show every option and say \"pick one\". For a few choices, they're faster than a dropdown and clearer than checkboxes.","ar":"الـ Radio buttons تعرض كل الخيارات وتقول «اختر واحدًا». للخيارات القليلة، هي أسرع من القائمة المنسدلة وأوضح من الـ Checkboxes."}},{"id":"S04","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P01-U02-02","part":"retest","speaker":"hana","value":{"en":"Re-test, checkboxes (NN/g): a checkbox list lets people select one, several, all or none. Class interests are any number; radio buttons lose answers.","ar":"إعادة اختبار، الـ Checkboxes (NN/g): قائمة الـ Checkboxes تتيح اختيار واحد أو عدة أو الكل أو لا شيء. الاهتمامات بالحصص أي عدد؛ والـ Radio buttons تُضيع إجابات."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/checkboxes-design-guidelines/","quote":"A checkbox list allows users the unique ability to select one, several, all, or no items from a list."},"scenario":{"en":"Amal joins my gym. Our form asks which classes interest her, so we can send their timetables. She likes swimming and yoga. The question uses radio buttons.","ar":"تنضمّ آمال إلى نادينا. يسأل نموذجنا عن الحصص التي تهمّها، حتى نرسل لها مواعيدها. وهي تحب السباحة واليوغا. والسؤال يستخدم Radio buttons."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each control. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل عنصر. أيّها يجب أن يُطلق؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Join","ar":"اشترك"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Which classes interest you?","ar":"أي الحصص تهمّك؟"}},{"kind":"radio","selected":true,"text":{"en":"Swimming","ar":"السباحة"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Yoga","ar":"اليوغا"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Boxing","ar":"الملاكمة"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Spinning","ar":"الدرّاجات الثابتة"},"gap":"xs"}]},"options":[{"id":"dropdown","text":{"en":"A dropdown with the four classes","ar":"قائمة منسدلة فيها الحصص الأربع"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Join","ar":"اشترك"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"select","label":{"en":"Which classes interest you?","ar":"أي الحصص تهمّك؟"},"filled":true,"text":{"en":"Swimming","ar":"السباحة"}}]}},{"id":"checks","text":{"en":"Four checkboxes","ar":"أربعة Checkboxes"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Join","ar":"اشترك"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Which classes interest you?","ar":"أي الحصص تهمّك؟"}},{"kind":"check","selected":true,"text":{"en":"Swimming","ar":"السباحة"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"check","selected":true,"text":{"en":"Yoga","ar":"اليوغا"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"check","text":{"en":"Boxing","ar":"الملاكمة"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"check","text":{"en":"Spinning","ar":"الدرّاجات الثابتة"},"gap":"xs"}]}},{"id":"keep","text":{"en":"Keep the radio buttons; she can pick her favourite","ar":"أبقِ الـ Radio buttons؛ يمكنها اختيار المفضّلة لديها"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Join","ar":"اشترك"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Which classes interest you?","ar":"أي الحصص تهمّك؟"}},{"kind":"radio","selected":true,"text":{"en":"Swimming","ar":"السباحة"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Yoga","ar":"اليوغا"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Boxing","ar":"الملاكمة"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Spinning","ar":"الدرّاجات الثابتة"},"gap":"xs"}]}}],"answer":["checks"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-032","when":["dropdown","keep"],"feedback":{"en":"Both take only one answer, so Amal loses yoga and never gets its timetable. Interests can be several. Use checkboxes.","ar":"كلاهما يقبل إجابة واحدة فقط، فتخسر آمال اليوغا ولا تصلها مواعيدها أبدًا. وقد تهتمّ بأكثر من حصة. استخدم Checkboxes."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Any number of classes, all visible.","ar":"صحيح. أي عدد من الحصص، وكلها ظاهرة."},"explain":{"en":"Ask yourself how many answers are possible. Interests can be none, one or all four, which is exactly what a checkbox list allows.","ar":"اسأل نفسك كم إجابة ممكنة. قد لا تهتمّ بأي حصة، أو بواحدة، أو بالأربع، وهذا بالضبط ما تسمح به قائمة الـ Checkboxes."}},{"id":"S05","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P01-U02-03","part":"retest","speaker":"mona","value":{"en":"Re-test, radio defaults (NN/g): a presumptuous or alienating choice is the most valid reason not to preselect. A guessed gender is personal, wrong for many, and easy to miss.","ar":"إعادة اختبار، القيم الافتراضية (NN/g): الاختيار المتسرّع أو المُنفّر هو أقوى سبب لعدم الاختيار المسبق. تخمين النوع أمر شخصي، وخطأ بالنسبة لكثيرين، ويسهل ألا يُلاحظ."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/radio-buttons-default-selection/","quote":"This is probably the most valid reason for not selecting a radio button by default."},"scenario":{"en":"My team is reviewing Hamdy's charity form. It asks donors for their gender for a yearly report. Most past donors were men, so the form preselects \"Man\". Many women donate too.","ar":"يراجع فريقي نموذج جمعية حمدي الخيرية. يسأل المتبرّعين عن نوعهم لتقرير سنوي. معظم المتبرّعين السابقين رجال، فيختار النموذج «رجل» مسبقًا. وكثير من النساء يتبرّعن أيضًا."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each version. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل نسخة. أيّها يجب أن تُطلق؟"},"mock":{"app":{"name":{"en":"Yad Charity","ar":"جمعية يد"},"color":"#0CA678","icon":"hand-heart","domain":"yad.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Donate","ar":"تبرّع"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Gender","ar":"النوع"}},{"kind":"radio","selected":true,"text":{"en":"Man","ar":"رجل"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Woman","ar":"امرأة"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Prefer not to say","ar":"أفضّل عدم الإجابة"},"gap":"xs"}]},"options":[{"id":"none","text":{"en":"Nothing preselected; donors choose","ar":"لا شيء مختار مسبقًا؛ والمتبرّع يختار"},"mock":{"app":{"name":{"en":"Yad Charity","ar":"جمعية يد"},"color":"#0CA678","icon":"hand-heart","domain":"yad.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Donate","ar":"تبرّع"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Gender","ar":"النوع"}},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Man","ar":"رجل"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Woman","ar":"امرأة"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Prefer not to say","ar":"أفضّل عدم الإجابة"},"gap":"xs"}]}},{"id":"keep","text":{"en":"Keep \"Man\"; it's right for most donors","ar":"أبقِ «رجل»؛ فهو صحيح لمعظم المتبرّعين"},"mock":{"app":{"name":{"en":"Yad Charity","ar":"جمعية يد"},"color":"#0CA678","icon":"hand-heart","domain":"yad.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Donate","ar":"تبرّع"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Gender","ar":"النوع"}},{"kind":"radio","selected":true,"text":{"en":"Man","ar":"رجل"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Woman","ar":"امرأة"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Prefer not to say","ar":"أفضّل عدم الإجابة"},"gap":"xs"}]}},{"id":"neutral","text":{"en":"Preselect \"Prefer not to say\", to be neutral","ar":"اختر «أفضّل عدم الإجابة» مسبقًا، لتكون محايدًا"},"mock":{"app":{"name":{"en":"Yad Charity","ar":"جمعية يد"},"color":"#0CA678","icon":"hand-heart","domain":"yad.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Donate","ar":"تبرّع"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Gender","ar":"النوع"}},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Man","ar":"رجل"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Woman","ar":"امرأة"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"radio","selected":true,"text":{"en":"Prefer not to say","ar":"أفضّل عدم الإجابة"},"gap":"xs"}]}}],"answer":["none"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-015","when":["keep","neutral"],"feedback":{"en":"Both guess something personal for the donor. Women who don't notice are counted as men, and \"Prefer not to say\" fills the report with answers nobody gave. Let each donor choose.","ar":"كلاهما يخمّن شيئًا شخصيًا عن المتبرّع. النساء اللواتي لا ينتبهن يُحسبن رجالًا، و«أفضّل عدم الإجابة» يملأ التقرير بإجابات لم يعطها أحد. دع كل متبرّع يختار."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. A personal answer is the person's to give.","ar":"صحيح. الإجابة الشخصية يعطيها صاحبها."},"explain":{"en":"Defaults are great for safe, common settings. For facts about a person, a guess is presumptuous and quietly creates wrong data. Leave it empty.","ar":"القيم الافتراضية (Defaults) رائعة للإعدادات الآمنة الشائعة. أما المعلومات عن الشخص، فتخمينها تطاوُل عليه، ويصنع بيانات خاطئة دون أن ينتبه أحد. اتركه فارغًا."}},{"id":"S06","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P01-U02-03","part":"retest","speaker":"youssef","value":{"en":"Re-test, radio defaults (NN/g): select one radio button by default in most cases. Free standard shipping is safe and chosen by most; a paid default is not.","ar":"إعادة اختبار، القيم الافتراضية (NN/g): اختر Radio button افتراضيًا في معظم الحالات. الشحن العادي المجاني آمن ويختاره الأغلبية؛ أما الافتراضي المدفوع فلا."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/radio-buttons-default-selection/","quote":"Select a single radio button by default in most cases."},"scenario":{"en":"Sahar buys a phone case from my shop. Nine out of ten people choose free standard shipping; express costs 60 EGP. Right now nothing is selected, and my form stops anyone who skips it.","ar":"تشتري سحر جراب هاتف من متجري. تسعة من كل عشرة يختارون الشحن العادي المجاني؛ والسريع بـ 60 جنيهًا. وحاليًا لا شيء مختار، ونموذجي يمنع من لم يختر من المتابعة."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each version. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل نسخة. أيّها يجب أن تُطلق؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Checkout","ar":"الدفع"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Shipping","ar":"الشحن"}},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Standard, 3 to 5 days · Free","ar":"عادي، من 3 إلى 5 أيام · مجاني"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Express, next day · 60 EGP","ar":"سريع، اليوم التالي · 60 جنيهًا"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"small","color":"red","text":{"en":"Choose a shipping option.","ar":"اختر طريقة الشحن."},"gap":"s"}]},"options":[{"id":"none","text":{"en":"Keep nothing selected; people should choose for themselves","ar":"اترك الخيارين بلا اختيار مسبق؛ ليختار الناس بأنفسهم"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Checkout","ar":"الدفع"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Shipping","ar":"الشحن"}},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Standard, 3 to 5 days · Free","ar":"عادي، من 3 إلى 5 أيام · مجاني"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Express, next day · 60 EGP","ar":"سريع، اليوم التالي · 60 جنيهًا"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"small","color":"red","text":{"en":"Choose a shipping option.","ar":"اختر طريقة الشحن."},"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"express","text":{"en":"Preselect Express, so more people get it faster","ar":"اختر السريع مسبقًا، حتى يحصل عدد أكبر على توصيل أسرع"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Checkout","ar":"الدفع"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Shipping","ar":"الشحن"}},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Standard, 3 to 5 days · Free","ar":"عادي، من 3 إلى 5 أيام · مجاني"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"radio","selected":true,"text":{"en":"Express, next day · 60 EGP","ar":"سريع، اليوم التالي · 60 جنيهًا"},"gap":"xs"}]}},{"id":"standard","text":{"en":"Preselect Standard; anyone can switch to Express","ar":"اختر العادي مسبقًا؛ ويمكن لأي أحد التحويل إلى السريع"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Checkout","ar":"الدفع"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Shipping","ar":"الشحن"}},{"kind":"radio","selected":true,"text":{"en":"Standard, 3 to 5 days · Free","ar":"عادي، من 3 إلى 5 أيام · مجاني"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Express, next day · 60 EGP","ar":"سريع، اليوم التالي · 60 جنيهًا"},"gap":"xs"}]}}],"answer":["standard"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-033","when":["none"],"feedback":{"en":"Defaults aren't bad in general. Here most people want the free option, it's harmless and easy to change, so starting on it saves almost everyone a step and an error.","ar":"القيم الافتراضية ليست سيئة عمومًا. هنا معظم الناس يريدون الخيار المجاني، وهو آمن وسهل التغيير، فالبدء به يوفّر خطوة وخطأً على الجميع تقريبًا."}},{"id":"MC-P01-015","when":["express"],"feedback":{"en":"A paid default guesses that Sahar wants to spend more. Many won't notice and will pay 60 EGP they didn't choose. A default should be safe.","ar":"اختيار الشحن المدفوع مسبقًا يفترض أن سحر تريد أن تدفع أكثر. كثيرون لن ينتبهوا وسيدفعون 60 جنيهًا لم يختاروها. يجب أن يكون الافتراضي آمنًا."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. The common, free choice is ready.","ar":"صحيح. الخيار الشائع المجاني جاهز."},"explain":{"en":"A good default is what most people want and costs nothing if left alone. Free standard shipping is both, and Express is still one tap away.","ar":"الافتراضي الجيد هو ما يريده معظم الناس ولا يكلّف شيئًا إذا تُرك. الشحن العادي المجاني كذلك، والسريع متاح بضغطة واحدة."}},{"id":"S07","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P01-U02-04","part":"retest","speaker":"tarek","value":{"en":"Re-test, dropdowns (NN/g): for readily known values, typing is often faster than selecting from a dropdown. A car's model year is four digits its owner knows.","ar":"إعادة اختبار، القوائم المنسدلة (NN/g): للقيم المعروفة، الكتابة غالبًا أسرع من الاختيار من قائمة منسدلة. سنة صنع السيارة أربعة أرقام يعرفها صاحبها."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/dropdown-list/","quote":"For readily known values — ages, birthdates, heights — typing is often faster than selecting from a dropdown."},"scenario":{"en":"In the insurance app I manage, Tawfik gets a car quote. He's asked for his car's model year: 2014. The field is a dropdown that lists every year from 2027 back to 1970.","ar":"في تطبيق التأمين الذي أديره، يطلب توفيق عرض سعر لسيارته. يُسأل عن سنة صنعها: 2014. والحقل قائمة منسدلة فيها كل السنوات من 2027 حتى 1970."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each control. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل عنصر. أيّها يجب أن يُطلق؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"aman","name":{"en":"Aman","ar":"أمان"},"color":"#364FC7","icon":"shield-check","domain":"aman.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Car quote","ar":"عرض سعر السيارة"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"blocks":[{"kind":"select","label":{"en":"Model year","ar":"سنة الصنع"},"text":{"en":"Select…","ar":"اختر…"}},{"kind":"group","gap":"xs","blocks":[{"kind":"meta","text":"2027"},{"kind":"meta","text":"2026","gap":"xs"},{"kind":"meta","text":"2025","gap":"xs"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"… 55 more","ar":"… 55 سنة أخرى"},"gap":"xs"}]}]},"options":[{"id":"type","text":{"en":"A short field he types the year into, with the number pad","ar":"حقل قصير يكتب فيه السنة، بلوحة الأرقام"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"aman","name":{"en":"Aman","ar":"أمان"},"color":"#364FC7","icon":"shield-check","domain":"aman.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Car quote","ar":"عرض سعر السيارة"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Model year","ar":"سنة الصنع"},"filled":true,"text":"2014","hint":{"en":"For example 2014","ar":"مثلًا 2014"}}]}},{"id":"oldest","text":{"en":"Keep the dropdown, but start it from the oldest year","ar":"أبقِ القائمة المنسدلة، لكن ابدأها من أقدم سنة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"aman","name":{"en":"Aman","ar":"أمان"},"color":"#364FC7","icon":"shield-check","domain":"aman.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Car quote","ar":"عرض سعر السيارة"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"select","label":{"en":"Model year","ar":"سنة الصنع"},"text":{"en":"Select…","ar":"اختر…"}},{"kind":"group","gap":"xs","blocks":[{"kind":"meta","text":"1970"},{"kind":"meta","text":"1971","gap":"xs"},{"kind":"meta","text":"1972","gap":"xs"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"… 55 more","ar":"… 55 سنة أخرى"},"gap":"xs"}]}]}},{"id":"calendar","text":{"en":"A calendar picker","ar":"تقويم لاختيار التاريخ (Date picker)"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"aman","name":{"en":"Aman","ar":"أمان"},"color":"#364FC7","icon":"shield-check","domain":"aman.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Car quote","ar":"عرض سعر السيارة"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Model year","ar":"سنة الصنع"},"text":{"en":"Pick a date","ar":"اختر تاريخًا"}},{"kind":"group","gap":"xs","blocks":[{"kind":"small","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"‹ October 2026 ›","ar":"‹ أكتوبر 2026 ›"}},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Tap ‹ to go back month by month","ar":"اضغط ‹ للرجوع شهرًا بعد شهر"},"gap":"xs"}]}]}}],"answer":["type"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-012","when":["oldest","calendar"],"feedback":{"en":"Tawfik knows \"2014\" by heart. Scrolling through dozens of years, or flipping back 150 months, turns four keystrokes into a hunt.","ar":"توفيق يحفظ «2014». التمرير بين عشرات السنوات، أو الرجوع 150 شهرًا، يحوّل أربع ضغطات إلى بحث طويل."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Four digits, typed in a second.","ar":"صحيح. أربعة أرقام، تُكتب في ثانية."},"explain":{"en":"When people know the answer by heart, typing is the fastest route. Lists and calendars help people find what they don't know, not what they already do.","ar":"عندما يحفظ الناس الإجابة، تكون الكتابة أسرع طريق. القوائم والتقاويم تساعد الناس على إيجاد ما لا يعرفونه، لا ما يعرفونه بالفعل."}},{"id":"S08","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P01-U02-04","part":"retest","speaker":"sara","value":{"en":"Re-test, date input (NN/g): calendar pickers suit events within less than a year. A passport expiry years away is a known date: let people type it.","ar":"إعادة اختبار، إدخال التاريخ (NN/g): التقاويم تناسب الأحداث خلال أقل من سنة. تاريخ انتهاء جواز سفر بعد سنوات تاريخ معروف: دع الناس يكتبونه."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/date-input/","quote":"Calendar pickers should be used for events close to the present time — within less than a year."},"scenario":{"en":"I'm designing a flight booking form. Mervat must enter her passport's expiry date. It's printed on the passport: 14 August 2031. The field opens a calendar on today's month.","ar":"أصمّم نموذجًا لحجز الطيران. يجب أن تُدخل ميرفت تاريخ انتهاء جواز سفرها. وهو مطبوع على الجواز: 14 أغسطس 2031. والحقل يفتح تقويمًا على الشهر الحالي."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each control. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل عنصر. أيّها يجب أن يُطلق؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"zad","name":{"en":"Zad Travel","ar":"زاد للسفر"},"color":"#6D28D9","icon":"airplane-tilt","domain":"zad.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Passenger details","ar":"بيانات المسافر"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Passport expiry date","ar":"تاريخ انتهاء جواز السفر"},"text":{"en":"Pick a date","ar":"اختر تاريخًا"}},{"kind":"group","gap":"xs","blocks":[{"kind":"small","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"‹ October 2026 ›","ar":"‹ أكتوبر 2026 ›"}},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Tap › to go forward month by month","ar":"اضغط › للتقدّم شهرًا بعد شهر"},"gap":"xs"}]}]},"options":[{"id":"calendar","text":{"en":"Keep the calendar, and add a year jump at the top","ar":"أبقِ التقويم، وأضف في أعلاه قائمة لاختيار السنة مباشرة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"zad","name":{"en":"Zad Travel","ar":"زاد للسفر"},"color":"#6D28D9","icon":"airplane-tilt","domain":"zad.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Passenger details","ar":"بيانات المسافر"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Passport expiry date","ar":"تاريخ انتهاء جواز السفر"},"text":{"en":"Pick a date","ar":"اختر تاريخًا"}},{"kind":"group","gap":"xs","blocks":[{"kind":"small","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"‹ October 2026 › · Year ▾","ar":"‹ أكتوبر 2026 › · السنة ▾"}},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Pick the year, then the month, then the day","ar":"اختر السنة، ثم الشهر، ثم اليوم"},"gap":"xs"}]}]}},{"id":"type","text":{"en":"Three short typed fields: day, month and year","ar":"ثلاثة حقول قصيرة للكتابة: اليوم والشهر والسنة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"zad","name":{"en":"Zad Travel","ar":"زاد للسفر"},"color":"#6D28D9","icon":"airplane-tilt","domain":"zad.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Passenger details","ar":"بيانات المسافر"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Passport expiry date","ar":"تاريخ انتهاء جواز السفر"}},{"kind":"row","gap":"xs","blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Day","ar":"اليوم"},"filled":true,"text":"14"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Month","ar":"الشهر"},"filled":true,"text":"08"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Year","ar":"السنة"},"filled":true,"text":"2031"}]},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"14 August 2031","ar":"14 أغسطس 2031"},"gap":"xs"}]}},{"id":"dropdowns","text":{"en":"Three dropdowns: day, month and year","ar":"ثلاث قوائم منسدلة: اليوم والشهر والسنة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"zad","name":{"en":"Zad Travel","ar":"زاد للسفر"},"color":"#6D28D9","icon":"airplane-tilt","domain":"zad.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Passenger details","ar":"بيانات المسافر"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Passport expiry date","ar":"تاريخ انتهاء جواز السفر"}},{"kind":"row","gap":"xs","blocks":[{"kind":"select","label":{"en":"Day","ar":"اليوم"},"text":"–"},{"kind":"select","label":{"en":"Month","ar":"الشهر"},"text":"–"},{"kind":"select","label":{"en":"Year","ar":"السنة"},"text":"–"}]}]}}],"answer":["type"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-012","when":["calendar","dropdowns"],"feedback":{"en":"Mervat is copying a date she can see. A calendar or three dropdowns turn that into many taps and scrolls. Let her type it.","ar":"ميرفت تنقل تاريخًا تراه أمامها. التقويم أو القوائم الثلاث تحوّل ذلك إلى ضغطات وتمرير كثير. دعها تكتبه."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. She types what's printed in front of her.","ar":"صحيح. تكتب ما هو مطبوع أمامها."},"explain":{"en":"Calendars help when people are choosing a date near today. For a known date years away, typed fields are faster, and showing the month as a word lets Mervat check it.","ar":"التقويم يساعد عندما يختار الناس تاريخًا قريبًا من اليوم. أما التاريخ الذي يعرفه الشخص وهو بعد سنوات، فكتابته أسرع، وعرض الشهر بالكلمات يتيح لميرفت مراجعته."}},{"id":"S09","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P01-U02-05","part":"retest","speaker":"karim","value":{"en":"Re-test, date input (NN/g): make the choices clear by disabling and graying out options that aren't available. Only the shop knows which times are free.","ar":"إعادة اختبار، إدخال التاريخ (NN/g): وضّح الخيارات بتعطيل الخيارات غير المتاحة وجعلها باهتة. المحل وحده يعرف أي الأوقات متاحة."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/date-input/","quote":"Make the choices clear by disabling and graying out options that are not available or are illogical pairs."},"scenario":{"en":"I'm building a barber's booking screen. Adham wants a haircut on Saturday. Only 10:00 and 13:00 are still free. The screen shows every half hour from 9:00 to 14:00 as if all were open.","ar":"أبني شاشة حجز لصالون حلاقة. يريد أدهم موعد حلاقة يوم السبت. ولم يبقَ متاحًا إلا 10:00 و13:00. والشاشة تعرض كل نصف ساعة من 9:00 إلى 14:00 كأنها كلها متاحة."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each version. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل نسخة. أيّها يجب أن تُطلق؟"},"mock":{"app":{"name":{"en":"Halla'","ar":"حلّاق"},"color":"#495057","icon":"scissors","domain":"halla.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Book a haircut","ar":"احجز حلاقة"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Saturday","ar":"السبت"}},{"kind":"row","gap":"xs","blocks":[{"kind":"chip","text":"9:00"},{"kind":"chip","text":"10:00"},{"kind":"chip","text":"11:00"},{"kind":"chip","text":"12:00"},{"kind":"chip","text":"13:00"}]}]},"options":[{"id":"after","text":{"en":"Show every time, and say \"Taken\" after he picks one","ar":"اعرض كل الأوقات، واعرض «محجوز» بعد أن يختار"},"mock":{"app":{"name":{"en":"Halla'","ar":"حلّاق"},"color":"#495057","icon":"scissors","domain":"halla.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Book a haircut","ar":"احجز حلاقة"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Saturday","ar":"السبت"}},{"kind":"row","gap":"xs","blocks":[{"kind":"chip","tone":"dark","text":"9:00"},{"kind":"chip","text":"10:00"},{"kind":"chip","text":"11:00"},{"kind":"chip","text":"12:00"},{"kind":"chip","text":"13:00"}]},{"kind":"small","color":"red","text":{"en":"9:00 is taken. Choose another time.","ar":"9:00 محجوز. اختر وقتًا آخر."},"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"type","text":{"en":"A field where he types the time he wants","ar":"حقل يكتب فيه الوقت الذي يريده"},"mock":{"app":{"name":{"en":"Halla'","ar":"حلّاق"},"color":"#495057","icon":"scissors","domain":"halla.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Book a haircut","ar":"احجز حلاقة"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Time on Saturday","ar":"الوقت يوم السبت"},"filled":true,"text":"11:00"},{"kind":"small","color":"red","text":{"en":"This time isn't available.","ar":"هذا الوقت غير متاح."},"gap":"xs"}]}},{"id":"grey","text":{"en":"Grey out taken times; only free ones can be picked","ar":"اجعل الأوقات المحجوزة باهتة؛ ولا يمكن اختيار إلا المتاحة"},"mock":{"app":{"name":{"en":"Halla'","ar":"حلّاق"},"color":"#495057","icon":"scissors","domain":"halla.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Book a haircut","ar":"احجز حلاقة"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Saturday","ar":"السبت"}},{"kind":"row","gap":"xs","blocks":[{"kind":"chip","tone":"off","text":"9:00"},{"kind":"chip","text":"10:00"},{"kind":"chip","tone":"off","text":"11:00"},{"kind":"chip","tone":"off","text":"12:00"},{"kind":"chip","text":"13:00"}]},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"2 times left on Saturday","ar":"بقي موعدان يوم السبت"},"gap":"s"}]}}],"answer":["grey"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-013","when":["after","type"],"feedback":{"en":"Adham can't know which times are free; only the shop can. Making him guess and then rejecting him wastes his tries. Show him the free ones.","ar":"لا يستطيع أدهم معرفة الأوقات المتاحة؛ المحل وحده يعرف. فإذا جعلته يخمّن ثم رفضت اختياره، ضيّعت محاولاته. اعرض له المتاح."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. He can only pick what's really free.","ar":"صحيح. يمكنه اختيار المتاح فعلًا فقط."},"explain":{"en":"When the system knows the answer, it should show it. Greyed-out times tell Adham what's left before he taps, so his first choice works.","ar":"عندما يعرف النظام الإجابة، يجب أن يعرضها. الأوقات الباهتة تخبر أدهم بما تبقّى قبل أن يضغط، فينجح اختياره الأول."}},{"id":"S10","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P01-U02-05","part":"retest","speaker":"rami","value":{"en":"Re-test, date input (NN/g): disable and grey out options that aren't available. The ferry runs only two days a week; the calendar should say so.","ar":"إعادة اختبار، إدخال التاريخ (NN/g): عطّل الخيارات غير المتاحة واجعلها باهتة. العبّارة تعمل يومين فقط في الأسبوع؛ ويجب أن يقول التقويم ذلك."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/date-input/","quote":"Make the choices clear by disabling and graying out options that are not available or are illogical pairs."},"scenario":{"en":"I'm designing a ferry booking page. Hend wants a trip next week. The ferry sails only on Friday and Monday. The page must let her pick a day.","ar":"أصمّم صفحة حجز لعبّارة. تريد هند رحلة الأسبوع القادم. العبّارة تُبحر فقط يومي الجمعة والاثنين. والصفحة يجب أن تتيح لها اختيار يوم."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each version. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل نسخة. أيّها يجب أن تُطلق؟"},"start":"field","options":[{"id":"field","text":{"en":"A date field she types into, checked after","ar":"حقل تاريخ تكتب فيه، ويُتحقّق منه بعد ذلك"},"mock":{"app":{"name":{"en":"Markeb","ar":"مركب"},"color":"#1971C2","icon":"boat","domain":"markeb.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Book a trip","ar":"احجز رحلة"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"Booking page","ar":"صفحة الحجز"},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Travel date","ar":"تاريخ السفر"},"filled":true,"text":{"en":"Wed 4 November","ar":"الأربعاء 4 نوفمبر"}},{"kind":"small","color":"red","text":{"en":"No ferry on this day.","ar":"لا توجد عبّارة في هذا اليوم."},"gap":"xs"}]}},{"id":"grey","text":{"en":"A calendar where only Friday and Monday can be picked","ar":"تقويم لا يمكن فيه اختيار إلا الجمعة والاثنين"},"mock":{"app":{"name":{"en":"Markeb","ar":"مركب"},"color":"#1971C2","icon":"boat","domain":"markeb.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Book a trip","ar":"احجز رحلة"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"Booking page","ar":"صفحة الحجز"},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"November 2026","ar":"نوفمبر 2026"}},{"kind":"row","blocks":[{"kind":"chip","tone":"off","text":{"en":"Wed 4","ar":"أربعاء 4"}},{"kind":"chip","tone":"off","text":{"en":"Thu 5","ar":"خميس 5"}},{"kind":"chip","text":{"en":"Fri 6","ar":"جمعة 6"}},{"kind":"chip","tone":"off","text":{"en":"Sat 7","ar":"سبت 7"}}]},{"kind":"row","gap":"xs","blocks":[{"kind":"chip","tone":"off","text":{"en":"Sun 8","ar":"أحد 8"}},{"kind":"chip","text":{"en":"Mon 9","ar":"اثنين 9"}}]},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"The ferry sails on Fridays and Mondays.","ar":"العبّارة تُبحر يومي الجمعة والاثنين."},"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"all","text":{"en":"A calendar with every day open; say \"No ferry\" after she picks","ar":"تقويم كل أيامه مفتوحة؛ واعرض «لا توجد عبّارة» بعد أن تختار"},"mock":{"app":{"name":{"en":"Markeb","ar":"مركب"},"color":"#1971C2","icon":"boat","domain":"markeb.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Book a trip","ar":"احجز رحلة"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"Booking page","ar":"صفحة الحجز"},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"November 2026","ar":"نوفمبر 2026"}},{"kind":"row","blocks":[{"kind":"chip","tone":"dark","text":{"en":"Wed 4","ar":"أربعاء 4"}},{"kind":"chip","text":{"en":"Thu 5","ar":"خميس 5"}},{"kind":"chip","text":{"en":"Fri 6","ar":"جمعة 6"}},{"kind":"chip","text":{"en":"Sat 7","ar":"سبت 7"}}]},{"kind":"row","gap":"xs","blocks":[{"kind":"chip","text":{"en":"Sun 8","ar":"أحد 8"}},{"kind":"chip","text":{"en":"Mon 9","ar":"اثنين 9"}}]},{"kind":"small","color":"red","text":{"en":"No ferry on this day.","ar":"لا توجد عبّارة في هذا اليوم."},"gap":"s"}]}}],"answer":["grey"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-013","when":["field","all"],"feedback":{"en":"Hend can't know the ferry's days, so she guesses and gets an error. The system knows; show only the days she can book.","ar":"لا تستطيع هند معرفة أيام العبّارة، فتخمّن ويظهر لها خطأ. النظام يعرف؛ اعرض فقط الأيام التي يمكنها حجزها."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Only real sailing days can be picked.","ar":"صحيح. يمكن اختيار أيام الإبحار الحقيقية فقط."},"explain":{"en":"A calendar with the closed days greyed out answers Hend's question before she asks it. She sees Friday and Monday, picks one, and it works.","ar":"التقويم الذي تكون فيه الأيام المغلقة باهتة يجيب عن سؤال هند قبل أن تسأله. ترى الجمعة والاثنين، وتختار أحدهما، وينجح الحجز."}},{"id":"S11","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P01-U02-06","part":"retest","speaker":"tarek","value":{"en":"Re-test, input steppers (NN/g): use steppers for numeric fields with a clear most frequent value, and start on that value. Most people buy two tickets.","ar":"إعادة اختبار، الـ Steppers (NN/g): استخدم الـ Stepper للحقول الرقمية التي لها قيمة شائعة واضحة، وابدأ بهذه القيمة. معظم الناس يشترون تذكرتين."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/input-steppers/","quote":"Use steppers for numerical fields with a clear most frequently selected value."},"scenario":{"en":"In our cinema app, Lotfy buys tickets. People buy 1 to 10, and most buy 2. Right now the number of tickets is an empty text field.","ar":"في تطبيق السينما عندنا، يشتري لطفي تذاكر. الناس يشترون من 1 إلى 10، ومعظمهم يشترون 2. والآن عدد التذاكر حقل نصّي فارغ."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each control. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل عنصر. أيّها يجب أن يُطلق؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"shasha","name":{"en":"Shasha","ar":"شاشة"},"color":"#BE185D","icon":"film-strip","domain":"shasha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Tickets","ar":"التذاكر"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Tickets","ar":"التذاكر"},"text":""}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Choose seats","ar":"اختر المقاعد"}}]},"options":[{"id":"stepper","text":{"en":"A stepper that starts at 2","ar":"Stepper (عدّاد بزرّي + و−) يبدأ من 2"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"shasha","name":{"en":"Shasha","ar":"شاشة"},"color":"#BE185D","icon":"film-strip","domain":"shasha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Tickets","ar":"التذاكر"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"stepper","label":{"en":"Tickets","ar":"التذاكر"},"text":"2"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Choose seats","ar":"اختر المقاعد"}}]}},{"id":"slider","text":{"en":"A slider from 1 to 10","ar":"Slider (شريط سحب) من 1 إلى 10"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"shasha","name":{"en":"Shasha","ar":"شاشة"},"color":"#BE185D","icon":"film-strip","domain":"shasha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Tickets","ar":"التذاكر"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"slider","label":{"en":"Tickets","ar":"التذاكر"},"min":1,"max":10,"from":1,"to":2,"format":{"en":"{b} tickets","ar":"{b} تذاكر"}}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Choose seats","ar":"اختر المقاعد"}}]}},{"id":"dropdown","text":{"en":"A dropdown from 1 to 10, with nothing selected","ar":"قائمة منسدلة من 1 إلى 10، بلا اختيار مسبق"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"shasha","name":{"en":"Shasha","ar":"شاشة"},"color":"#BE185D","icon":"film-strip","domain":"shasha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Tickets","ar":"التذاكر"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"select","label":{"en":"Tickets","ar":"التذاكر"},"text":{"en":"Select…","ar":"اختر…"}}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Choose seats","ar":"اختر المقاعد"}}]}}],"answer":["stepper"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-022","when":["slider"],"feedback":{"en":"Sliders are for rough values on a long range. Hitting exactly 2 on a thin track is fiddly, especially on a phone.","ar":"الـ Slider للقيم التقريبية على مدى طويل. الوصول إلى 2 بالضبط على مسار رفيع أمر مزعج، خصوصًا على الهاتف."}},{"id":"MC-P01-023","when":["dropdown"],"feedback":{"en":"Most people want 2, yet everyone has to open the list and pick it. A stepper already on 2 lets most buyers move straight on.","ar":"معظم الناس يريدون 2، ومع ذلك يجب على الجميع فتح القائمة واختيارها. الـ Stepper الذي يبدأ من 2 يتيح لمعظم المشترين المتابعة مباشرة."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Most people don't touch it; the rest tap + or −.","ar":"صحيح. معظم الناس لا يلمسونه؛ والباقون يضغطون + أو −."},"explain":{"en":"A small range with a clear usual value is exactly what a stepper is for. Starting on 2 means no action for most buyers and one or two taps for everyone else.","ar":"المدى الصغير ذو القيمة المعتادة الواضحة هو بالضبط ما صُمّم له الـ Stepper. البدء من 2 يعني أن معظم المشترين لا يضغطون شيئًا، والباقين ضغطة أو اثنتين."}},{"id":"S12","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P01-U02-06","part":"retest","speaker":"sara","value":{"en":"Re-test, input steppers (NN/g): steppers aren't suitable for large adjustments. 150 cards need typing, not 100 taps.","ar":"إعادة اختبار، الـ Steppers (NN/g): الـ Stepper لا يناسب التغييرات الكبيرة. 150 بطاقة تحتاج الكتابة، لا 100 ضغطة."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/input-steppers/","quote":"Steppers are not suitable for a large number adjustments."},"scenario":{"en":"I'm designing a print shop's order form. Safaa needs exactly 150 wedding invitations. Orders range from 50 to 1,000. Quantity is a stepper that starts at 50 and moves by 1.","ar":"أصمّم نموذج الطلب لمطبعة. تحتاج صفاء 150 دعوة زفاف بالضبط. والطلبات من 50 إلى 1,000. والكمية Stepper يبدأ من 50 ويزيد واحدًا في كل ضغطة."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each control. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل عنصر. أيّها يجب أن يُطلق؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"taba","name":{"en":"Tab'a","ar":"طبعة"},"color":"#D6336C","icon":"printer","domain":"tab-a.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Wedding cards","ar":"بطاقات الزفاف"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"blocks":[{"kind":"stepper","label":{"en":"Number of cards","ar":"عدد البطاقات"},"text":"50"},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"50 to 1,000 cards","ar":"من 50 إلى 1,000 بطاقة"},"gap":"xs"}]},"options":[{"id":"keep","text":{"en":"Keep the stepper; + and − are easy to use","ar":"أبقِ الـ Stepper؛ فـ + و− سهلان"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"taba","name":{"en":"Tab'a","ar":"طبعة"},"color":"#D6336C","icon":"printer","domain":"tab-a.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Wedding cards","ar":"بطاقات الزفاف"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"stepper","label":{"en":"Number of cards","ar":"عدد البطاقات"},"text":"50"},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"100 taps on + to reach 150","ar":"100 ضغطة على + للوصول إلى 150"},"gap":"xs"}]}},{"id":"slider","text":{"en":"A slider from 50 to 1,000","ar":"Slider من 50 إلى 1,000"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"taba","name":{"en":"Tab'a","ar":"طبعة"},"color":"#D6336C","icon":"printer","domain":"tab-a.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Wedding cards","ar":"بطاقات الزفاف"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"slider","label":{"en":"Number of cards","ar":"عدد البطاقات"},"min":50,"max":1000,"from":50,"to":160,"format":{"en":"{b} cards","ar":"{b} بطاقة"}}]}},{"id":"type","text":{"en":"A number field she types into, with the number pad","ar":"حقل رقم تكتب فيه، بلوحة الأرقام"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"taba","name":{"en":"Tab'a","ar":"طبعة"},"color":"#D6336C","icon":"printer","domain":"tab-a.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Wedding cards","ar":"بطاقات الزفاف"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Number of cards","ar":"عدد البطاقات"},"filled":true,"text":"150"},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"50 to 1,000 cards","ar":"من 50 إلى 1,000 بطاقة"},"gap":"xs"}]}}],"answer":["type"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-023","when":["keep"],"feedback":{"en":"Going from 50 to 150 takes 100 taps. Steppers are for small changes around a usual value, not for large exact numbers.","ar":"الانتقال من 50 إلى 150 يحتاج 100 ضغطة. الـ Stepper للتغييرات الصغيرة حول قيمة معتادة، لا للأرقام الكبيرة الدقيقة."}},{"id":"MC-P01-022","when":["slider"],"feedback":{"en":"On a track from 50 to 1,000, each pixel jumps several cards, so landing on exactly 150 is luck. Sliders are for rough values.","ar":"على مسار من 50 إلى 1,000، كل حركة صغيرة تقفز عدة بطاقات، فالوصول إلى 150 بالضبط مسألة حظ. الـ Slider للقيم التقريبية."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. She types 150 and moves on.","ar":"صحيح. تكتب 150 وتتابع."},"explain":{"en":"Safaa knows her exact number and it's far from the start. Typing it takes three key presses; no other control comes close.","ar":"صفاء تعرف عددها بالضبط، وهو بعيد عن البداية. كتابته تحتاج ثلاث ضغطات؛ ولا يوجد عنصر آخر بهذه السرعة."}},{"id":"S13","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P01-U02-07","part":"retest","speaker":"karim","value":{"en":"Re-test, mobile input checklist (NN/g): what's the right keyboard for this field? A verification code is text made of digits: a number field drops its leading zero.","ar":"إعادة اختبار، قائمة تحقّق حقول الهاتف (NN/g): ما لوحة المفاتيح المناسبة لهذا الحقل؟ رمز التحقّق نص من أرقام: حقل الأرقام يحذف الصفر الأول."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/mobile-input-checklist/","quote":"What is the right keyboard for this field?"},"scenario":{"en":"I'm building a bank app's login. Emad gets a text message with a 6-digit code: 048213. I'm choosing the field type.","ar":"أبني تسجيل الدخول لتطبيق بنك. تصل عماد رسالة فيها رمز من 6 أرقام: 048213. وأنا أختار نوع الحقل."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each field. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل حقل. أيّ حقل يتيح لعماد أن يكتب الرمز 048213 بسرعة ويُقبل كما هو؟"},"start":"number","options":[{"id":"number","text":{"en":"A number field, with up and down arrows","ar":"حقل أرقام، بأسهم للأعلى والأسفل"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rasid","name":{"en":"Rasid","ar":"رصيد"},"color":"#1C3D6E","icon":"bank","domain":"rasid.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Sign in","ar":"تسجيل الدخول"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After Emad types 048213","ar":"بعد أن يكتب عماد 048213"},"blocks":[{"kind":"row","blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Code from the text message","ar":"الرمز من الرسالة"},"filled":true,"text":"48213"},{"kind":"small","text":"▲▼"}]},{"kind":"small","color":"red","text":{"en":"Wrong code.","ar":"الرمز غير صحيح."},"gap":"xs"}]}},{"id":"pad","text":{"en":"A text field that opens the number pad","ar":"حقل نصّي يفتح لوحة الأرقام"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rasid","name":{"en":"Rasid","ar":"رصيد"},"color":"#1C3D6E","icon":"bank","domain":"rasid.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Sign in","ar":"تسجيل الدخول"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After Emad types 048213","ar":"بعد أن يكتب عماد 048213"},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Code from the text message","ar":"الرمز من الرسالة"},"filled":true,"text":"048213"},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Keyboard: 1 2 3 number pad","ar":"لوحة المفاتيح: لوحة أرقام 1 2 3"},"gap":"xs"}]}},{"id":"full","text":{"en":"A plain text field with the full keyboard","ar":"حقل نصّي عادي بلوحة المفاتيح الكاملة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rasid","name":{"en":"Rasid","ar":"رصيد"},"color":"#1C3D6E","icon":"bank","domain":"rasid.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Sign in","ar":"تسجيل الدخول"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After Emad types 048213","ar":"بعد أن يكتب عماد 048213"},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Code from the text message","ar":"الرمز من الرسالة"},"filled":true,"text":"048213"},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Keyboard: letters first; tap 123 for digits","ar":"لوحة المفاتيح: الحروف أولًا؛ اضغط 123 للأرقام"},"gap":"xs"}]}}],"answer":["pad"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-021","when":["number","full"],"feedback":{"en":"A number field treats the code as an amount and drops the 0, so Emad's correct code is rejected. The full keyboard keeps it, but hides the digits he needs behind an extra tap. A code is text made of digits: a text field with the number pad.","ar":"حقل الأرقام يتعامل مع الرمز كمبلغ ويحذف الصفر، فيُرفض رمز عماد الصحيح. ولوحة المفاتيح الكاملة تحافظ عليه، لكنها تُخفي الأرقام خلف ضغطة إضافية. فالرمز نص مكوّن من أرقام، ويناسبه حقل نصّي بلوحة أرقام."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Every digit kept, and the right keys ready.","ar":"صحيح. كل الأرقام محفوظة، والمفاتيح المناسبة جاهزة."},"explain":{"en":"Codes, IDs and card numbers are made of digits but aren't amounts. A text field keeps leading zeros, and asking for the number pad gives Emad big, easy keys.","ar":"الرموز والأرقام التعريفية وأرقام البطاقات مكوّنة من أرقام لكنها ليست مبالغ. الحقل النصّي يحافظ على الأصفار في البداية، وطلب لوحة الأرقام يعطي عماد مفاتيح كبيرة وسهلة."}},{"id":"S14","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P01-U02-07","part":"retest","speaker":"tarek","value":{"en":"Re-test, mobile input checklist (NN/g): what's the right keyboard for this field? A card number is 16 digits of text: number pad, no arrows, grouped for reading.","ar":"إعادة اختبار، قائمة تحقّق حقول الهاتف (NN/g): ما لوحة المفاتيح المناسبة لهذا الحقل؟ رقم البطاقة 16 رقمًا من النص: لوحة أرقام، بلا أسهم، ومقسّم ليسهل قراءته."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/mobile-input-checklist/","quote":"What is the right keyboard for this field?"},"scenario":{"en":"In our course app, Bahaa pays with his card. He types the 16-digit number from the card in his hand. My team is choosing the field type.","ar":"في تطبيق الدورات عندنا، يدفع بهاء ببطاقته. يكتب الرقم المكوّن من 16 رقمًا من البطاقة التي في يده. وفريقي يختار نوع الحقل."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each field. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل حقل. أيّها يجب أن يُطلق؟"},"start":"number","options":[{"id":"pad","text":{"en":"A text field with the number pad, shown in groups of four","ar":"حقل نصّي بلوحة الأرقام، يُعرض في مجموعات من أربعة"},"mock":{"app":{"name":{"en":"Ostaz","ar":"أستاذ"},"color":"#2F9E44","icon":"pencil-simple","domain":"ostaz.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Payment","ar":"الدفع"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After Bahaa types his number","ar":"بعد أن يكتب بهاء رقمه"},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Card number","ar":"رقم البطاقة"},"filled":true,"text":"4417 1234 5678 9113"},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Keyboard: 1 2 3 number pad","ar":"لوحة المفاتيح: لوحة أرقام 1 2 3"},"gap":"xs"}]}},{"id":"number","text":{"en":"A number field, with up and down arrows","ar":"حقل أرقام، بأسهم للأعلى والأسفل"},"mock":{"app":{"name":{"en":"Ostaz","ar":"أستاذ"},"color":"#2F9E44","icon":"pencil-simple","domain":"ostaz.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Payment","ar":"الدفع"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After Bahaa types his number","ar":"بعد أن يكتب بهاء رقمه"},"blocks":[{"kind":"row","blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Card number","ar":"رقم البطاقة"},"filled":true,"text":"⁦4.417123456789e15⁩"},{"kind":"small","text":"▲▼"}]}]}},{"id":"full","text":{"en":"A plain text field with the full keyboard, no spaces","ar":"حقل نصّي عادي بلوحة المفاتيح الكاملة، بلا مسافات"},"mock":{"app":{"name":{"en":"Ostaz","ar":"أستاذ"},"color":"#2F9E44","icon":"pencil-simple","domain":"ostaz.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Payment","ar":"الدفع"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"After Bahaa types his number","ar":"بعد أن يكتب بهاء رقمه"},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Card number","ar":"رقم البطاقة"},"filled":true,"text":"4417123456789113"},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Keyboard: letters first; tap 123 for digits","ar":"لوحة المفاتيح: الحروف أولًا؛ اضغط 123 للأرقام"},"gap":"xs"}]}}],"answer":["pad"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-021","when":["number","full"],"feedback":{"en":"A number field can turn a long card number into a math value and offers arrows that make no sense. The full keyboard hides the digits and an unbroken 16-digit string is hard to check. A card number is text made of digits.","ar":"حقل الأرقام قد يحوّل رقم البطاقة الطويل إلى قيمة حسابية ويعرض أسهمًا بلا معنى. ولوحة المفاتيح الكاملة تُخفي الأرقام، وسلسلة من 16 رقمًا متّصلة يصعب مراجعتها. رقم البطاقة نص من أرقام."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Easy to type and easy to check.","ar":"صحيح. سهل الكتابة وسهل المراجعة."},"explain":{"en":"The number pad makes typing fast, and groups of four match how the number is printed on the card, so Bahaa can compare them at a glance.","ar":"لوحة الأرقام تجعل الكتابة سريعة، والمجموعات الرباعية تطابق طريقة طباعة الرقم على البطاقة، فيستطيع بهاء المقارنة بنظرة."}},{"id":"S15","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P01-U02-08","part":"retest","speaker":"mona","value":{"en":"Re-test, dropdowns (NN/g): a type-to-filter combobox works well for long lists of predictable options such as universities. Ninety names in a plain dropdown means scrolling.","ar":"إعادة اختبار، القوائم المنسدلة (NN/g): الـ Combobox الذي يُضيّق القائمة بالكتابة يعمل جيدًا مع القوائم الطويلة المتوقّعة مثل الجامعات. تسعون اسمًا في قائمة منسدلة عادية تعني تمريرًا طويلًا."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/dropdown-list/","quote":"This pattern works well for long lists of predictable options such as countries, states, languages, and universities."},"scenario":{"en":"My team is reviewing a scholarship form. Soad must pick her university from a list of about 90. Most applicants come from two big universities; Soad studies at a smaller one in Assiut.","ar":"يراجع فريقي نموذجًا لمنحة دراسية. يجب أن تختار سعاد جامعتها من قائمة فيها نحو 90 جامعة. معظم المتقدّمين من جامعتين كبيرتين؛ وسعاد تدرس في جامعة أصغر في أسيوط."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each control. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل عنصر. أيّها يجب أن يُطلق؟"},"start":"az","options":[{"id":"az","text":{"en":"A plain dropdown, sorted A to Z","ar":"قائمة منسدلة عادية، مرتّبة أبجديًا"},"mock":{"app":{"name":{"en":"Minha","ar":"منحة"},"color":"#5F3DC4","icon":"graduation-cap","domain":"minha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Scholarship","ar":"المنحة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"select","label":{"en":"University","ar":"الجامعة"},"text":{"en":"Select…","ar":"اختر…"}},{"kind":"group","gap":"xs","blocks":[{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Al-Azhar University","ar":"جامعة الأزهر"}},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Alexandria University","ar":"جامعة الإسكندرية"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"… 88 more","ar":"… 88 جامعة أخرى"},"gap":"xs"}]}]}},{"id":"preselect","text":{"en":"Preselect the most common university","ar":"اختر الجامعة الأكثر شيوعًا مسبقًا"},"mock":{"app":{"name":{"en":"Minha","ar":"منحة"},"color":"#5F3DC4","icon":"graduation-cap","domain":"minha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Scholarship","ar":"المنحة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"select","label":{"en":"University","ar":"الجامعة"},"filled":true,"text":{"en":"Cairo University","ar":"جامعة القاهرة"}}]}},{"id":"search","text":{"en":"A box she types into, and the list narrows as she types","ar":"مربع تكتب فيه، فتقصر القائمة مع كل حرف"},"mock":{"app":{"name":{"en":"Minha","ar":"منحة"},"color":"#5F3DC4","icon":"graduation-cap","domain":"minha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Scholarship","ar":"المنحة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"University","ar":"الجامعة"},"filled":true,"text":{"en":"Assi","ar":"أسيو"}},{"kind":"group","gap":"xs","blocks":[{"kind":"meta","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Assiut University","ar":"جامعة أسيوط"}},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Assiut University, New Valley branch","ar":"جامعة أسيوط، فرع الوادي الجديد"},"gap":"xs"}]}]}}],"answer":["search"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-016","when":["az"],"feedback":{"en":"With about 90 names, Soad has to scroll and scan a long list on a small screen. Let her type a few letters instead.","ar":"مع نحو 90 اسمًا، يجب أن تمرّر سعاد وتبحث في قائمة طويلة على شاشة صغيرة. دعها تكتب بضعة حروف بدلًا من ذلك."}},{"id":"MC-P01-015","when":["preselect"],"feedback":{"en":"A preselected university is a guess about Soad. If she doesn't notice, her application goes in under the wrong university. Help her find hers; don't pick it for her.","ar":"الجامعة المختارة مسبقًا تخمين عن سعاد. إذا لم تنتبه، يُقدَّم طلبها باسم الجامعة الخطأ. ساعدها على إيجاد جامعتها؛ ولا تخترها نيابة عنها."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. A few letters, and her university is on top.","ar":"صحيح. تكتب بضعة حروف، فتظهر جامعتها في الأعلى."},"explain":{"en":"For long, predictable lists, typing beats scrolling. People know the name they're looking for, so a box that narrows the list as they type gets them there fastest.","ar":"في القوائم الطويلة التي يعرف الناس ما فيها، الكتابة أسرع من التمرير. الناس يعرفون الاسم الذي يبحثون عنه، فالمربع الذي يضيّق القائمة مع الكتابة يوصلهم أسرع."}},{"id":"S16","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P01-U02-08","part":"retest","speaker":"rami","value":{"en":"Re-test, site search (NN/g): query suggestions help people fix spelling errors while typing. \"Alexandaria\" is one letter off; suggest the match.","ar":"إعادة اختبار، البحث في الموقع (NN/g): اقتراحات البحث تساعد الناس على تصحيح الأخطاء الإملائية أثناء الكتابة. «Alexandaria» تختلف بحرف واحد؛ اقترح النتيجة الصحيحة."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/internal-website-search/","quote":"Oftentimes query suggestions will assist users in adjusting spelling errors while they are typing the query."},"scenario":{"en":"I'm designing a bus ticket app. In the \"To\" field, Nabil types the city quickly with one thumb: \"Alexandaria\".","ar":"أصمّم تطبيقًا لتذاكر الحافلات. في حقل «إلى» يكتب نبيل اسم المدينة بسرعة بإبهام واحد: «اسكندريه»."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each response. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل استجابة. أيّ استجابة توصل نبيل إلى الإسكندرية رغم خطئه في الكتابة؟"},"start":"none","options":[{"id":"none","text":{"en":"Show \"No results\"","ar":"اعرض «لا توجد نتائج»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rehla","name":{"en":"Rehla","ar":"رحلة"},"color":"#7048E8","icon":"bus","domain":"rehla.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Search buses","ar":"ابحث عن حافلة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"To","ar":"إلى"},"filled":true,"text":{"en":"Alexandaria","ar":"اسكندريه"}},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"No results.","ar":"لا توجد نتائج."},"gap":"xs"}]}},{"id":"suggest","text":{"en":"Suggest the closest match","ar":"اقترح أقرب نتيجة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rehla","name":{"en":"Rehla","ar":"رحلة"},"color":"#7048E8","icon":"bus","domain":"rehla.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Search buses","ar":"ابحث عن حافلة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"To","ar":"إلى"},"filled":true,"text":{"en":"Alexandaria","ar":"اسكندريه"}},{"kind":"group","gap":"xs","blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Did you mean:","ar":"هل تقصد:"}},{"kind":"text","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Alexandria","ar":"الإسكندرية"},"gap":"xs"}]}]}},{"id":"list","text":{"en":"Show the full list of cities, A to Z","ar":"اعرض قائمة المدن كاملة أبجديًا"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rehla","name":{"en":"Rehla","ar":"رحلة"},"color":"#7048E8","icon":"bus","domain":"rehla.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Search buses","ar":"ابحث عن حافلة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"To","ar":"إلى"},"filled":true,"text":{"en":"Alexandaria","ar":"اسكندريه"}},{"kind":"group","gap":"xs","blocks":[{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"Abu Simbel","ar":"أبو سمبل"}},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"Al Arish","ar":"العريش"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"… 58 more","ar":"… 58 مدينة أخرى"},"gap":"xs"}]}]}}],"answer":["suggest"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-024","when":["none","list"],"feedback":{"en":"Nabil is one letter away from the right city. \"No results\" makes him hunt for his typo, and the full list throws away what he typed. Suggest the match.","ar":"ما كتبه نبيل يختلف بحرف واحد عن اسم المدينة. «لا توجد نتائج» تجعله يبحث عن خطئه، والقائمة الكاملة تتجاهل ما كتبه. اقترح النتيجة الصحيحة."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. One tap, and he's going to Alexandria.","ar":"صحيح. بضغطة واحدة، يختار نبيل الإسكندرية."},"explain":{"en":"People rarely type place names perfectly, especially names with several spellings. A close-match suggestion turns a typo into one tap instead of a dead end.","ar":"نادرًا ما يكتب الناس أسماء الأماكن بدقة، خصوصًا الأسماء التي لها أكثر من طريقة كتابة. اقتراح أقرب نتيجة يحوّل الخطأ الإملائي إلى ضغطة واحدة بدل طريق مسدود."}}]}$uxg$::jsonb),
  ($uxg$P01-U03-B01$uxg$, $uxg$045a017eb01458212e792806d3f6fce2e24dba143321dd0023c92381a507d266$uxg$, $uxg${"id":"P01-U03-B01","mode":"bank","title":{"en":"Re-tests: labels and hints in sight","ar":"إعادة اختبار: العناوين (Labels) والتلميحات ظاهرة"},"steps":[{"id":"S01","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P01-U03-01","part":"retest","speaker":"tarek","value":{"en":"Re-test, placeholders (NN/g): the best fix is a clear, visible label outside the field. With grey text only, Adel can't check which city went in which box once both are typed.","ar":"إعادة اختبار، النص الداخلي (NN/g): أفضل حل هو عنوان واضح وظاهر خارج الحقل. ومع النص الرمادي وحده، لا يستطيع عادل التأكّد أيّ مدينة كتبها في أيّ مربع بعد ملء الاثنين."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/form-design-placeholders/","quote":"the best solution is to have clear, visible labels that are placed outside empty form fields."},"scenario":{"en":"I manage the product for a car rental site. Adel books a car from Cairo and returns it in Hurghada. Our two city boxes have no labels, only grey text inside: \"Pick-up city\" and \"Return city\". Once he types, the grey text is gone.","ar":"أنا مدير المنتج لموقع تأجير سيارات. يحجز عادل سيارة يستلمها في القاهرة ويسلّمها في الغردقة. ومربّعا المدينتين عندنا بلا عناوين، فيهما فقط نص رمادي (Placeholder): «مدينة الاستلام» و«مدينة التسليم». وحين يكتب، يختفي النص الرمادي."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each version. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل نسخة. أيّها يجب أن تُطلق؟"},"start":"grey","options":[{"id":"grey","text":{"en":"Keep the grey text inside each box","ar":"أبقِ النص الرمادي داخل كل مربع"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dawra","name":{"en":"Dawra Cars","ar":"دورة"},"color":"#343A40","icon":"key","domain":"dawra.example"},"caption":{"en":"After Adel fills in both boxes","ar":"بعد أن ملأ عادل الخانتين"},"frame":"wide","url":"dawra.example","blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Book a car","ar":"احجز سيارة"}},{"kind":"field","filled":true,"text":{"en":"Cairo","ar":"القاهرة"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"field","filled":true,"text":{"en":"Hurghada","ar":"الغردقة"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"See cars","ar":"اعرض السيارات"},"gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"dark","text":{"en":"Make the text inside darker and bold","ar":"اجعل النص الداخلي أغمق وبخط عريض"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dawra","name":{"en":"Dawra Cars","ar":"دورة"},"color":"#343A40","icon":"key","domain":"dawra.example"},"caption":{"en":"After Adel fills in both boxes","ar":"بعد أن ملأ عادل الخانتين"},"frame":"wide","url":"dawra.example","blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Book a car","ar":"احجز سيارة"}},{"kind":"field","filled":true,"text":{"en":"Cairo","ar":"القاهرة"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"field","filled":true,"text":{"en":"Hurghada","ar":"الغردقة"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"See cars","ar":"اعرض السيارات"},"gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"label","text":{"en":"Put a label above each box","ar":"ضع عنوانًا فوق كل مربع"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dawra","name":{"en":"Dawra Cars","ar":"دورة"},"color":"#343A40","icon":"key","domain":"dawra.example"},"caption":{"en":"After Adel fills in both boxes","ar":"بعد أن ملأ عادل الخانتين"},"frame":"wide","url":"dawra.example","blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Book a car","ar":"احجز سيارة"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Pick-up city","ar":"مدينة الاستلام"},"filled":true,"text":{"en":"Cairo","ar":"القاهرة"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Return city","ar":"مدينة التسليم"},"filled":true,"text":{"en":"Hurghada","ar":"الغردقة"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"See cars","ar":"اعرض السيارات"},"gap":"m"}]}}],"answer":["label"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-034","when":["grey","dark"],"feedback":{"en":"Look at the preview: both boxes are filled, and nothing says which is pick-up and which is return. Styling the text inside doesn't help, because it's gone once Adel types.","ar":"انظر إلى المعاينة: المربعان ممتلئان، ولا شيء يوضّح أيّهما للاستلام وأيّهما للتسليم. وتغيير شكل النص الداخلي لا يفيد، لأنه يختفي حين يكتب عادل."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. The labels stay, so Adel can check his cities before he books.","ar":"صحيح. العناوين تبقى، فيستطيع عادل مراجعة المدينتين قبل الحجز."},"explain":{"en":"Text inside a field disappears exactly when people need to check their answers. A label outside the field is still there after typing.","ar":"النص داخل الحقل يختفي في اللحظة التي يحتاج فيها الناس لمراجعة إجاباتهم. أما العنوان خارج الحقل فيبقى بعد الكتابة."}},{"id":"S02","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P01-U03-01","part":"retest","speaker":"mona","value":{"en":"Re-test, placeholders (NN/g): people may mistake a placeholder for data that was filled in for them. A dose box that seems filled gets skipped, and the pharmacist has to call.","ar":"إعادة اختبار، النص الداخلي (NN/g): قد يظن الناس أن النص الداخلي بيانات مُعبّأة لهم. ومربع الجرعة الذي يبدو ممتلئًا يُتخطّى، فيضطر الصيدلي إلى الاتصال."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/form-design-placeholders/","quote":"Users may mistake a placeholder for data that was automatically filled in."},"scenario":{"en":"I'm designing a pharmacy refill form. Half the requests arrive without a dose. The dose box shows \"500 mg\" in light grey until someone types, and Laila thought we already knew her dose.","ar":"أصمّم نموذجًا لإعادة صرف الأدوية من صيدلية. نصف الطلبات تصل بلا جرعة. ومربع الجرعة يعرض «500 mg» بلون رمادي فاتح حتى يكتب أحد، وظنّت ليلى أننا نعرف جرعتها بالفعل."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each version. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل نسخة. أيّها يجب أن تُطلق؟"},"start":"inside","options":[{"id":"outside","text":{"en":"Label above, example under the box, box empty","ar":"عنوان فوق المربع، ومثال تحته، والمربع فارغ"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dawaa","name":{"en":"Dawaa Pharmacy","ar":"صيدلية دواء"},"color":"#059669","icon":"pill","domain":"dawaa.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Refill","ar":"إعادة صرف"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Medicine","ar":"الدواء"},"filled":true,"text":{"en":"Metformin","ar":"Metformin"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Dose","ar":"الجرعة"},"hint":{"en":"As written on the box, for example 500 mg","ar":"كما هي مكتوبة على العلبة، مثل 500 mg"},"text":"","gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"inside","text":{"en":"Keep \"500 mg\" in grey inside the box","ar":"أبقِ «500 mg» بالرمادي داخل المربع"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dawaa","name":{"en":"Dawaa Pharmacy","ar":"صيدلية دواء"},"color":"#059669","icon":"pill","domain":"dawaa.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Refill","ar":"إعادة صرف"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Medicine","ar":"الدواء"},"filled":true,"text":{"en":"Metformin","ar":"Metformin"}},{"kind":"field","text":"500 mg","gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"prefix","text":{"en":"Change the grey text to \"e.g. 500 mg\"","ar":"غيّر النص الرمادي إلى «مثال: 500 mg»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dawaa","name":{"en":"Dawaa Pharmacy","ar":"صيدلية دواء"},"color":"#059669","icon":"pill","domain":"dawaa.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Refill","ar":"إعادة صرف"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Medicine","ar":"الدواء"},"filled":true,"text":{"en":"Metformin","ar":"Metformin"}},{"kind":"field","text":{"en":"e.g. 500 mg","ar":"مثال: 500 mg"},"gap":"m"}]}}],"answer":["outside"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-036","when":["inside"],"feedback":{"en":"To Laila, \"500 mg\" in a box looks like an answer. That's why she skipped it.","ar":"بالنسبة إلى ليلى، «500 mg» داخل المربع تبدو إجابة. ولهذا تخطّته."}},{"id":"MC-P01-034","when":["prefix"],"feedback":{"en":"\"e.g.\" helps a little, but the box still has no label, and the example vanishes when she types. Both need to sit outside the box.","ar":"كلمة «مثال» تساعد قليلًا، لكن المربع ما زال بلا عنوان، والمثال يختفي حين تكتب. يجب أن يكون الاثنان خارج المربع."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. An empty box with a label looks like a question waiting for an answer.","ar":"صحيح. المربع الفارغ مع عنوان يبدو سؤالًا ينتظر إجابة."},"explain":{"en":"Grey text inside a box can pass for a value someone already entered. Keep the box empty, name it above, and put the example below.","ar":"النص الرمادي داخل المربع قد يبدو قيمة أدخلها أحد بالفعل. اترك المربع فارغًا، وسمّه بعنوان فوقه، وضع المثال تحته."}},{"id":"S03","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P01-U03-02","part":"retest","speaker":"sara","value":{"en":"Re-test, placeholders (NN/g): hints and instructions should stay visible and sit outside the field. A digit count is useless if it disappears at the first digit.","ar":"إعادة اختبار، النص الداخلي (NN/g): التلميحات والتعليمات يجب أن تبقى ظاهرة وتوضع خارج الحقل. وعدد الأرقام لا يفيد إن اختفى مع أول رقم."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/form-design-placeholders/","quote":"Hints and instructions should also be persistent and placed outside of the field."},"scenario":{"en":"I'm building a school sign-up form. Shady types his son's national ID, which has 14 digits. The hint \"14 digits, on the birth certificate\" sits inside the box, and he's typed 9 digits so far.","ar":"أبني نموذج تسجيل لمدرسة. يكتب شادي الرقم القومي لابنه، وهو 14 رقمًا. والتلميح «14 رقمًا، تجده في شهادة الميلاد» داخل المربع، وقد كتب 9 أرقام حتى الآن."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each place for the hint. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل مكان للتلميح. أيّ مكان يُبقي التلميح ظاهرًا لشادي وهو يكتب؟"},"start":"inside","options":[{"id":"inside","text":{"en":"Inside the box","ar":"داخل المربع"},"mock":{"app":{"name":{"en":"Fasli","ar":"فصلي"},"color":"#F59F00","icon":"backpack","domain":"fasli.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Sign up","ar":"التسجيل"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Child's national ID","ar":"الرقم القومي للطفل"},"filled":true,"focus":true,"text":"⁦318 0520 01⁩"}]}},{"id":"below","text":{"en":"Under the box","ar":"تحت المربع"},"mock":{"app":{"name":{"en":"Fasli","ar":"فصلي"},"color":"#F59F00","icon":"backpack","domain":"fasli.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Sign up","ar":"التسجيل"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Child's national ID","ar":"الرقم القومي للطفل"},"filled":true,"focus":true,"text":"⁦318 0520 01⁩","hint":{"en":"14 digits, on the birth certificate","ar":"14 رقمًا، تجده في شهادة الميلاد"}}]}},{"id":"tip","text":{"en":"Behind an ⓘ next to the label","ar":"خلف ⓘ بجوار العنوان"},"mock":{"app":{"name":{"en":"Fasli","ar":"فصلي"},"color":"#F59F00","icon":"backpack","domain":"fasli.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Sign up","ar":"التسجيل"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Child's national ID ⓘ","ar":"الرقم القومي للطفل ⓘ"},"filled":true,"focus":true,"text":"⁦318 0520 01⁩"}]}}],"answer":["below"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-035","when":["inside"],"feedback":{"en":"In the preview, Shady is mid-typing and the hint is gone. He needs \"14 digits\" now, to know how many are left.","ar":"في المعاينة، شادي في منتصف الكتابة والتلميح اختفى. وهو يحتاج «14 رقمًا» الآن، ليعرف كم تبقّى."}},{"id":"MC-P01-037","when":["tip"],"feedback":{"en":"The digit count is needed by everyone, so it can't wait behind an icon that most people never open.","ar":"عدد الأرقام يحتاجه الجميع، فلا يصح أن ينتظر خلف أيقونة لا يفتحها أغلب الناس."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Under the box, the hint is still there at digit 9.","ar":"صحيح. تحت المربع، يبقى التلميح ظاهرًا عند الرقم التاسع."},"explain":{"en":"A hint helps while people type and when they check. Outside the box, nothing they type can hide it.","ar":"التلميح يساعد أثناء الكتابة وعند المراجعة. وخارج المربع، لا يختفي مهما كتبوا."}},{"id":"S04","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P01-U03-02","part":"retest","speaker":"karim","value":{"en":"Re-test, placeholders (NN/g): a placeholder combined with a label is a step forward, but the hint inside still vanishes. The expiry format belongs outside the field.","ar":"إعادة اختبار، النص الداخلي (NN/g): الجمع بين العنوان والنص الداخلي خطوة للأمام، لكن التلميح بالداخل ما زال يختفي. وصيغة تاريخ الانتهاء مكانها خارج الحقل."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/form-design-placeholders/","quote":"Using placeholder text in combination with form labels is a step in the right direction"},"scenario":{"en":"I'm working on a card payment form. The \"Expiry date\" field has \"MM/YY\" in grey inside it. Reem typed \"2\", stopped, and wondered whether the month comes first.","ar":"أعمل على نموذج دفع بالبطاقة. حقل «تاريخ الانتهاء» بداخله «MM/YY» بالرمادي. كتبت ريم «2»، ثم توقّفت، وتساءلت: هل الشهر أولًا؟"},"prompt":{"en":"Try each version. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل نسخة. أيّها يجب أن تُطلق؟"},"start":"inside","options":[{"id":"inside","text":{"en":"Keep \"MM/YY\" inside the field","ar":"أبقِ «MM/YY» داخل الحقل"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"zad","name":{"en":"Zad Travel","ar":"زاد للسفر"},"color":"#6D28D9","icon":"airplane-tilt","domain":"zad.example"},"caption":{"en":"After Reem types \"2\"","ar":"بعد أن كتبت ريم «2»"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Payment","ar":"الدفع"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Expiry date","ar":"تاريخ الانتهاء"},"filled":true,"focus":true,"text":"2"}]}},{"id":"error","text":{"en":"Say the format only if her date is wrong","ar":"اذكر الصيغة فقط إن كان تاريخها خاطئًا"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"zad","name":{"en":"Zad Travel","ar":"زاد للسفر"},"color":"#6D28D9","icon":"airplane-tilt","domain":"zad.example"},"caption":{"en":"After Reem types \"2\"","ar":"بعد أن كتبت ريم «2»"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Payment","ar":"الدفع"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Expiry date","ar":"تاريخ الانتهاء"},"filled":true,"focus":true,"text":"2"}]}},{"id":"below","text":{"en":"Under the field: \"Month then year, like 08/27\"","ar":"تحت الحقل: «الشهر ثم السنة، مثل 08/27»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"zad","name":{"en":"Zad Travel","ar":"زاد للسفر"},"color":"#6D28D9","icon":"airplane-tilt","domain":"zad.example"},"caption":{"en":"After Reem types \"2\"","ar":"بعد أن كتبت ريم «2»"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Payment","ar":"الدفع"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Expiry date","ar":"تاريخ الانتهاء"},"filled":true,"focus":true,"text":"2","hint":{"en":"Month then year, like 08/27","ar":"الشهر ثم السنة، مثل 08/27"}}]}}],"answer":["below"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-035","when":["inside"],"feedback":{"en":"The preview shows it: one digit in, and \"MM/YY\" is gone. That's the moment Reem got stuck.","ar":"المعاينة توضّح ذلك: بعد رقم واحد، اختفت «MM/YY». وهذه هي اللحظة التي توقّفت فيها ريم."}},{"id":"MC-P01-042","when":["error"],"feedback":{"en":"Reem is unsure now, before she's wrong. An error later makes her guess first and fix after.","ar":"ريم مترددة الآن، قبل أن تخطئ. ورسالة الخطأ اللاحقة تجعلها تخمّن أولًا ثم تصلح."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. The format stays under the field while she types.","ar":"صحيح. الصيغة تبقى تحت الحقل أثناء الكتابة."},"explain":{"en":"Formats like month-then-year are what people check halfway through. Keep them in sight outside the field.","ar":"الصيغ مثل «الشهر ثم السنة» هي ما يراجعه الناس في منتصف الكتابة. أبقِها ظاهرة خارج الحقل."}},{"id":"S05","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P01-U03-03","part":"retest","speaker":"hana","value":{"en":"Re-test, tooltips (NN/g): users shouldn't have to find a tooltip to complete their task. If the gate checks the name against an ID, everyone needs that rule.","ar":"إعادة اختبار، الـ Tooltip (NN/g): يجب ألّا يحتاج المستخدم إلى العثور على Tooltip ليُكمل مهمّته. وإن كانت البوابة تطابق الاسم مع البطاقة، فالجميع يحتاج هذه القاعدة."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/tooltip-guidelines/","quote":"Users shouldn’t need to find a tooltip in order to complete their task."},"scenario":{"en":"My gym runs a charity race, and people buy tickets for friends on our site. At the gate, staff check that the name on the ticket matches the guest's ID. Basma bought tickets with nicknames, because \"Use the name on your ID\" was behind the ⓘ.","ar":"ينظّم نادينا سباقًا خيريًا، ويشتري الناس تذاكر لأصدقائهم من موقعنا. عند البوابة، يتأكّد الموظفون أن الاسم على التذكرة يطابق بطاقة الضيف. واشترت بسمة تذاكر بأسماء الدلع، لأن عبارة «اكتب الاسم كما في بطاقتك» كانت خلف ⓘ."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each version. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل نسخة. أيّها يجب أن تُطلق؟"},"start":"tip","options":[{"id":"visible","text":{"en":"Show the rule under the label","ar":"اعرض القاعدة تحت العنوان"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"nashat.example/charity-race","blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Guest name","ar":"اسم الضيف"},"hintFirst":true,"hint":{"en":"Use the name on the guest's ID. We check it at the gate.","ar":"اكتب الاسم كما في بطاقة الضيف. نتحقّق منه عند البوابة."},"text":""},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Buy ticket","ar":"اشترِ التذكرة"},"gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"tip","text":{"en":"Keep the rule in the ⓘ tooltip","ar":"أبقِ القاعدة في الـ Tooltip (النص المنبثق) خلف ⓘ"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"nashat.example/charity-race","blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Guest name ⓘ","ar":"اسم الضيف ⓘ"},"text":""},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Buy ticket","ar":"اشترِ التذكرة"},"gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"faq","text":{"en":"Put the rule in the FAQ, linked under the button","ar":"ضع القاعدة في الأسئلة الشائعة، برابط تحت الزر"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"nashat.example/charity-race","blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Guest name","ar":"اسم الضيف"},"text":""},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Buy ticket","ar":"اشترِ التذكرة"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"link","text":{"en":"Ticket FAQ","ar":"أسئلة شائعة عن التذاكر"},"gap":"s"}]}}],"answer":["visible"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-037","when":["tip","faq"],"feedback":{"en":"Every buyer needs this rule, or a guest is turned away at the gate. A rule everyone needs can't wait behind an icon or a link.","ar":"كل مشترٍ يحتاج هذه القاعدة، وإلا رُدّ ضيف عند البوابة. والقاعدة التي يحتاجها الجميع لا يصح أن تختبئ خلف أيقونة أو رابط."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Basma reads the rule before she types a single name.","ar":"صحيح. تقرأ بسمة القاعدة قبل أن تكتب أي اسم."},"explain":{"en":"Tooltips and help pages are for extra detail. If skipping the info breaks the task, show it on the page.","ar":"الـ Tooltip وصفحات المساعدة للتفاصيل الإضافية. وإن كان تخطّي المعلومة يُفسد المهمة، فاعرضها على الصفحة."}},{"id":"S06","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P01-U03-03","part":"retest","speaker":"rami","value":{"en":"Re-test, tooltips (NN/g): tooltips usually aren't available on touchscreens. A delivery rule hidden in a hover tip never reaches phone shoppers.","ar":"إعادة اختبار، الـ Tooltip (NN/g): الـ Tooltip غالبًا غير متاح على شاشات اللمس. وقاعدة التوصيل المخفية في تلميح يظهر بالمرور لا تصل أبدًا لمن يتسوّق من هاتفه."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/tooltip-guidelines/","quote":"They are not normally available on touchscreens."},"scenario":{"en":"I'm working on a furniture shop's checkout. Our trucks can't reach upper floors without a lift, so we need to know. Ziad shops on his phone. \"Tell us if the building has no lift\" shows only when you hover over the address.","ar":"أعمل على صفحة الدفع لمتجر أثاث. شاحناتنا لا تستطيع التوصيل للأدوار العليا بلا مصعد، لذا نحتاج أن نعرف. ويتسوّق زياد من هاتفه. وعبارة «أخبرنا إن لم يكن في العمارة مصعد» تظهر فقط عند تمرير الماوس (Hover) فوق حقل العنوان."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each version on Ziad's phone. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل نسخة على هاتف زياد. أيّ نسخة تسأل زياد عن المصعد وهو على هاتفه؟"},"start":"hover","options":[{"id":"hover","text":{"en":"Keep the hover tooltip","ar":"أبقِ التلميح الذي يظهر عند تمرير الماوس"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"beit","name":{"en":"Beit","ar":"بيت"},"color":"#8B5E34","icon":"armchair","domain":"beit.example"},"caption":{"en":"On Ziad's phone: there's no hover","ar":"على هاتف زياد: لا يوجد Hover"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Checkout","ar":"الدفع"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Address","ar":"العنوان"},"text":""},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Floor","ar":"الدور"},"text":"","gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"field","text":{"en":"Add a visible question: \"Is there a lift?\"","ar":"أضف سؤالًا ظاهرًا: «هل يوجد مصعد؟»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"beit","name":{"en":"Beit","ar":"بيت"},"color":"#8B5E34","icon":"armchair","domain":"beit.example"},"caption":{"en":"On Ziad's phone: there's no hover","ar":"على هاتف زياد: لا يوجد Hover"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Checkout","ar":"الدفع"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Address","ar":"العنوان"},"text":""},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Floor","ar":"الدور"},"text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"small","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Is there a lift?","ar":"هل يوجد مصعد؟"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Yes","ar":"نعم"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"No","ar":"لا"},"gap":"xs"}]}},{"id":"drop","text":{"en":"Remove the tip; the driver can call","ar":"احذف التلميح؛ يمكن للسائق أن يتصل"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"beit","name":{"en":"Beit","ar":"بيت"},"color":"#8B5E34","icon":"armchair","domain":"beit.example"},"caption":{"en":"On Ziad's phone: there's no hover","ar":"على هاتف زياد: لا يوجد Hover"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Checkout","ar":"الدفع"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Address","ar":"العنوان"},"text":""},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Floor","ar":"الدور"},"text":"","gap":"s"}]}}],"answer":["field"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-037","when":["hover","drop"],"feedback":{"en":"On a phone there's no hover, so Ziad sees the same screen either way: nothing asks about the lift, and the truck arrives unprepared.","ar":"لا يوجد مرور بالماوس على الهاتف، فيرى زياد الشاشة نفسها في الحالتين: لا شيء يسأل عن المصعد، وتصل الشاحنة غير مستعدة."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. A visible question works on every screen, and we get the answer we need.","ar":"صحيح. السؤال الظاهر يعمل على كل شاشة، ونحصل على الإجابة التي نحتاجها."},"explain":{"en":"Hover doesn't exist on touchscreens. If we need the info, ask for it on the page.","ar":"المرور بالماوس غير موجود على شاشات اللمس. وإن كنا نحتاج المعلومة، فلنسأل عنها على الصفحة."}},{"id":"S07","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P01-U03-04","part":"retest","speaker":"nour","value":{"en":"Re-test, white space in forms (NN/g): place the label closer to its own field than to other fields. With equal gaps, a label floats between two boxes.","ar":"إعادة اختبار، المساحات البيضاء في النماذج (NN/g): ضع العنوان أقرب إلى حقله من الحقول الأخرى. ومع مسافات متساوية، يطفو العنوان بين مربعين."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/form-design-white-space/","quote":"Place the label closer to the associated text field than to other text fields."},"scenario":{"en":"I'm designing a blood donation form. Hoda typed her weight into the box meant for her age. Every label sits exactly halfway between the box above it and the box below it.","ar":"أصمّم نموذجًا للتبرّع بالدم. كتبت هدى وزنها في المربع المخصّص لعمرها. وكل عنوان يقع في منتصف المسافة تمامًا بين المربع الذي فوقه والمربع الذي تحته."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each spacing. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل توزيع للمسافات. أيّ توزيع يجعل هدى تعرف فورًا أي عنوان يخصّ أي مربع؟"},"start":"even","options":[{"id":"even","text":{"en":"Keep the even gaps","ar":"أبقِ المسافات المتساوية"},"mock":{"app":{"name":{"en":"Nabda","ar":"نبضة"},"color":"#C92A2A","icon":"drop","domain":"nabda.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Donate blood","ar":"تبرّع بالدم"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Age","ar":"العمر"}},{"kind":"field","text":"","gap":"m"},{"kind":"small","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Weight (kg)","ar":"الوزن (كجم)"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"field","text":"","gap":"m"},{"kind":"small","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Last donation date","ar":"تاريخ آخر تبرّع"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"field","text":"","gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"close","text":{"en":"Each label close above its box, more space before the next label","ar":"كل عنوان قريب فوق مربعه، ومسافة أكبر قبل العنوان التالي"},"mock":{"app":{"name":{"en":"Nabda","ar":"نبضة"},"color":"#C92A2A","icon":"drop","domain":"nabda.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Donate blood","ar":"تبرّع بالدم"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Age","ar":"العمر"}},{"kind":"field","text":"","gap":"xs"},{"kind":"small","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Weight (kg)","ar":"الوزن (كجم)"},"gap":"l"},{"kind":"field","text":"","gap":"xs"},{"kind":"small","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Last donation date","ar":"تاريخ آخر تبرّع"},"gap":"l"},{"kind":"field","text":"","gap":"xs"}]}},{"id":"lines","text":{"en":"Keep the gaps, and add a line between fields","ar":"أبقِ المسافات، وأضف خطًا بين الحقول"},"mock":{"app":{"name":{"en":"Nabda","ar":"نبضة"},"color":"#C92A2A","icon":"drop","domain":"nabda.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Donate blood","ar":"تبرّع بالدم"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Age","ar":"العمر"}},{"kind":"field","text":"","gap":"m"},{"kind":"divider","gap":"s"},{"kind":"small","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Weight (kg)","ar":"الوزن (كجم)"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","text":"","gap":"m"},{"kind":"divider","gap":"s"},{"kind":"small","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Last donation date","ar":"تاريخ آخر تبرّع"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","text":"","gap":"m"}]}}],"answer":["close"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-038","when":["even","lines"],"feedback":{"en":"In the preview, \"Weight\" is as close to the age box as to its own. Lines add clutter but don't fix that; only moving the label closer to its box does.","ar":"في المعاينة، «الوزن» قريب من مربع العمر بقدر قربه من مربعه. والخطوط تزيد الزحام ولا تحلّ ذلك؛ الحل الوحيد أن يقترب العنوان من مربعه."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Each label hugs its own box, so each pair reads as one.","ar":"صحيح. كل عنوان ملتصق بمربعه، فيُقرأ كل زوج كوحدة واحدة."},"explain":{"en":"People link things that sit close together. A small gap under the label and a bigger one before the next label make the pairs obvious.","ar":"يربط الناس بين الأشياء المتقاربة. ومسافة صغيرة تحت العنوان، وأكبر قبل العنوان التالي، تجعل الأزواج واضحة."}},{"id":"S08","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P01-U03-04","part":"retest","speaker":"hana","value":{"en":"Re-test, form design (NN/g): put labels right above the field on mobile and short desktop forms. Beside the field, a 320 px screen leaves the box too narrow to read.","ar":"إعادة اختبار، تصميم النماذج (NN/g): ضع العناوين فوق الحقل مباشرة على الهاتف وفي النماذج القصيرة على الكمبيوتر. وبجوار الحقل، تترك شاشة 320 px مربعًا أضيق من أن يُقرأ."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/web-form-design/","quote":"immediately above the field for mobile and shorter desktop forms"},"scenario":{"en":"In my gym's phone app, the \"Book a class\" form shows each label beside its field. On Omar's small phone, the class name and the coach's name get cut off.","ar":"في تطبيق الهاتف الخاص بنادينا، نموذج «احجز حصة» يعرض كل عنوان بجوار حقله. وعلى هاتف عمر الصغير، يظهر اسم الحصة واسم المدرّب ناقصَين."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each layout. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل تخطيط. أيّ تخطيط يُظهر اسم الحصة واسم المدرّب كاملين على هاتف عمر؟"},"start":"beside","options":[{"id":"beside","text":{"en":"Keep labels beside the fields","ar":"أبقِ العناوين بجوار الحقول"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"frame":"small","appbar":{"title":{"en":"Book a class","ar":"احجز حصة"},"back":true},"width":240,"blocks":[{"kind":"row","blocks":[{"kind":"small","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Class","ar":"الحصة"}},{"kind":"field","filled":true,"text":{"en":"Morning sp…","ar":"سباحة صب…"}}]},{"kind":"row","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"small","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Coach","ar":"المدرّب"}},{"kind":"field","filled":true,"text":{"en":"Captain Wa…","ar":"كابتن ولي…"}}]}]}},{"id":"short","text":{"en":"Keep them beside, with shorter labels","ar":"أبقِها بجوار الحقول، بعناوين أقصر"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"frame":"small","appbar":{"title":{"en":"Book a class","ar":"احجز حصة"},"back":true},"width":240,"blocks":[{"kind":"row","blocks":[{"kind":"small","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Cls","ar":"حصة"}},{"kind":"field","filled":true,"text":{"en":"Morning sp…","ar":"سباحة صب…"}}]},{"kind":"row","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"small","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Coach","ar":"مدرّب"}},{"kind":"field","filled":true,"text":{"en":"Captain Wa…","ar":"كابتن ولي…"}}]}]}},{"id":"above","text":{"en":"Put each label above its field","ar":"ضع كل عنوان فوق حقله"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"frame":"small","appbar":{"title":{"en":"Book a class","ar":"احجز حصة"},"back":true},"width":240,"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Class","ar":"الحصة"},"filled":true,"text":{"en":"Morning swimming","ar":"سباحة صباحية"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Coach","ar":"المدرّب"},"filled":true,"text":{"en":"Captain Walid","ar":"كابتن وليد"},"gap":"s"}]}}],"answer":["above"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-039","when":["beside","short"],"feedback":{"en":"Side by side, the label eats half the width, so the answers are cut off. Shorter labels are harder to understand and the boxes are still narrow.","ar":"حين يكون العنوان بجوار الحقل، يأخذ نصف العرض، فتظهر الإجابات ناقصة. والعناوين الأقصر أصعب في الفهم، والمربعات ما زالت ضيقة."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Above the field, each box gets the full width of the phone.","ar":"صحيح. فوق الحقل، يأخذ كل مربع عرض الهاتف كله."},"explain":{"en":"On a narrow screen, a label above the field leaves the whole width for the answer, and the eye moves straight down.","ar":"على الشاشة الضيقة، العنوان فوق الحقل يترك العرض كله للإجابة، وتتحرّك العين إلى الأسفل مباشرة."}},{"id":"S09","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P01-U03-05","part":"retest","speaker":"mona","value":{"en":"Re-test, form design (NN/g): multiple columns interrupt the movement down the form. In two columns, people skip the second column or fill fields in the wrong order.","ar":"إعادة اختبار، تصميم النماذج (NN/g): الأعمدة المتعددة تقطع الحركة إلى أسفل النموذج. وفي عمودين، يتخطّى الناس العمود الثاني أو يملؤون الحقول بترتيب خاطئ."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/web-form-design/","quote":"Multiple columns interrupt the vertical momentum of moving down the form."},"scenario":{"en":"I'm designing a job application form. Many applications arrive without a graduation year. The form has two columns of fields side by side, and that field is the last one in the second column.","ar":"أصمّم نموذجًا للتقدّم لوظيفة. طلبات كثيرة تصل بلا سنة التخرّج. والنموذج فيه عمودان من الحقول متجاوران، وهذا الحقل هو الأخير في العمود الثاني."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each layout. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل تخطيط. أيّها يجب أن يُطلق؟"},"start":"two","options":[{"id":"two","text":{"en":"Keep two columns","ar":"أبقِ العمودين"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"wazifa","name":{"en":"Wazifa","ar":"وظيفة"},"color":"#1971C2","icon":"identification-card","domain":"wazifa.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"wazifa.example/apply","blocks":[{"kind":"row","blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Full name","ar":"الاسم الكامل"},"text":""},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"University","ar":"الجامعة"},"text":""}]},{"kind":"row","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Phone","ar":"الهاتف"},"text":""},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Graduation year","ar":"سنة التخرّج"},"text":""}]},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Apply","ar":"قدّم الطلب"},"gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"one","text":{"en":"Put every field in one column","ar":"ضع كل الحقول في عمود واحد"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"wazifa","name":{"en":"Wazifa","ar":"وظيفة"},"color":"#1971C2","icon":"identification-card","domain":"wazifa.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"wazifa.example/apply","blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Full name","ar":"الاسم الكامل"},"text":""},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Phone","ar":"الهاتف"},"text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"University","ar":"الجامعة"},"text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Graduation year","ar":"سنة التخرّج"},"text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Apply","ar":"قدّم الطلب"},"gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"star","text":{"en":"Keep two columns, and mark the year as required","ar":"أبقِ العمودين، وضع نجمة على حقل السنة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"wazifa","name":{"en":"Wazifa","ar":"وظيفة"},"color":"#1971C2","icon":"identification-card","domain":"wazifa.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"wazifa.example/apply","blocks":[{"kind":"row","blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Full name","ar":"الاسم الكامل"},"text":""},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"University","ar":"الجامعة"},"text":""}]},{"kind":"row","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Phone","ar":"الهاتف"},"text":""},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Graduation year *","ar":"سنة التخرّج *"},"text":""}]},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Apply","ar":"قدّم الطلب"},"gap":"m"}]}}],"answer":["one"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-040","when":["two","star"],"feedback":{"en":"The problem is the path, not the field. In two columns, people go down the first one to the button and miss the other. A star doesn't change the path.","ar":"المشكلة في ترتيب القراءة، لا في الحقل. في عمودين، ينزل الناس في العمود الأول حتى الزر ويفوتهم الآخر. والنجمة لا تغيّر هذا الترتيب."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. In one column, every field is on the way to the button.","ar":"صحيح. في عمود واحد، كل حقل يقع في الطريق إلى الزر."},"explain":{"en":"One column gives one path: top to bottom, nothing to skip. Two columns make people choose a direction, and some choose wrong.","ar":"العمود الواحد يعني طريقًا واحدًا: من أعلى إلى أسفل، بلا شيء يُتخطّى. والعمودان يجعلان الناس يختارون اتجاهًا، وبعضهم يختار خطأ."}},{"id":"S10","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P01-U03-05","part":"retest","speaker":"sara","value":{"en":"Re-test, form design (NN/g): visually group related labels and fields. A heading over each group shows where the guest details end and the stay details begin.","ar":"إعادة اختبار، تصميم النماذج (NN/g): اجمع العناوين والحقول المرتبطة بصريًا. والعنوان الرئيسي فوق كل مجموعة يوضّح أين تنتهي بيانات الضيف وتبدأ بيانات الإقامة."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/web-form-design/","quote":"Visually group related labels and fields."},"scenario":{"en":"I'm designing a hotel booking form with six fields in one long list: name, phone, email, check-in, check-out, guests. Fatma kept scrolling up to check whether she had entered her dates yet.","ar":"أصمّم نموذج حجز فندق فيه ستة حقول في قائمة واحدة طويلة: الاسم، الهاتف، البريد، تاريخ الوصول، تاريخ المغادرة، عدد الضيوف. وظلّت فاطمة تصعد لأعلى لتتأكّد هل أدخلت تواريخها أم لا."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each version. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل نسخة. أيّها يجب أن تُطلق؟"},"start":"list","options":[{"id":"list","text":{"en":"Keep one long list","ar":"أبقِ القائمة الطويلة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nuzul","name":{"en":"Nuzul","ar":"نُزُل"},"color":"#B7791F","icon":"bed","domain":"nuzul.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"nuzul.example/book","blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Full name","ar":"الاسم الكامل"},"text":""},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Phone","ar":"الهاتف"},"text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Email","ar":"البريد الإلكتروني"},"text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Check-in","ar":"تاريخ الوصول"},"text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Check-out","ar":"تاريخ المغادرة"},"text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Guests","ar":"عدد الضيوف"},"text":"","gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"steps","text":{"en":"Number every field from 1 to 6","ar":"رقّم كل حقل من 1 إلى 6"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nuzul","name":{"en":"Nuzul","ar":"نُزُل"},"color":"#B7791F","icon":"bed","domain":"nuzul.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"nuzul.example/book","blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"1. Full name","ar":"1. الاسم الكامل"},"text":""},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"2. Phone","ar":"2. الهاتف"},"text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"3. Email","ar":"3. البريد الإلكتروني"},"text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"4. Check-in","ar":"4. تاريخ الوصول"},"text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"5. Check-out","ar":"5. تاريخ المغادرة"},"text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"6. Guests","ar":"6. عدد الضيوف"},"text":"","gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"groups","text":{"en":"Two groups with headings: \"Your details\" and \"Your stay\"","ar":"مجموعتان بعنوانين رئيسيين: «بياناتك» و«إقامتك»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nuzul","name":{"en":"Nuzul","ar":"نُزُل"},"color":"#B7791F","icon":"bed","domain":"nuzul.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"nuzul.example/book","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Your details","ar":"بياناتك"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Full name","ar":"الاسم الكامل"},"text":"","gap":"xs"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Phone","ar":"الهاتف"},"text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Email","ar":"البريد الإلكتروني"},"text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Your stay","ar":"إقامتك"},"gap":"l"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Check-in","ar":"تاريخ الوصول"},"text":"","gap":"xs"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Check-out","ar":"تاريخ المغادرة"},"text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Guests","ar":"عدد الضيوف"},"text":"","gap":"s"}]}}],"answer":["groups"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-041","when":["list","steps"],"feedback":{"en":"Six fields in a row look alike, with or without numbers. Fatma wants to know where her dates are, and only a heading tells her that.","ar":"ستة حقول متتالية تبدو متشابهة، بأرقام أو بدونها. وفاطمة تريد أن تعرف أين تواريخها، ولا يخبرها بذلك إلا عنوان رئيسي."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Fatma sees two parts and finds \"Your stay\" at a glance.","ar":"صحيح. ترى فاطمة جزأين، وتجد «إقامتك» بنظرة واحدة."},"explain":{"en":"Grouping turns a long list into a few short parts, and headings name what each part is for.","ar":"التجميع يحوّل القائمة الطويلة إلى أجزاء قصيرة قليلة، والعناوين الرئيسية تسمّي غرض كل جزء."}},{"id":"S11","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P01-U03-06","part":"retest","speaker":"hana","value":{"en":"Re-test, form design (NN/g): don't make users guess obscure requirements. A PIN rule that appears only after a failed try makes Dina guess twice.","ar":"إعادة اختبار، تصميم النماذج (NN/g): لا تجعل المستخدم يخمّن الشروط الغامضة. وقاعدة الرمز السري التي تظهر فقط بعد محاولة فاشلة تجعل دينا تخمّن مرتين."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/web-form-design/","quote":"Don’t make users guess your obscure password requirements."},"scenario":{"en":"Members open our gym door with a PIN from our app. The PIN must be 6 digits and can't be all the same digit or in order, like 123456. Dina typed 111111, and only then saw the rules in red.","ar":"يفتح الأعضاء باب نادينا برمز سري من تطبيقنا. يجب أن يكون الرمز السري 6 أرقام، وألّا يكون كله رقمًا واحدًا مكرّرًا أو أرقامًا متتالية، مثل 123456. كتبت دينا 111111، وعندها فقط رأت الشروط باللون الأحمر."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each version. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل نسخة. أيّها يجب أن تُطلق؟"},"start":"after","options":[{"id":"strong","text":{"en":"Show \"Choose a strong PIN\" under the label","ar":"اعرض «اختر رمزًا قويًا» تحت العنوان"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Door PIN","ar":"رمز الباب"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"New PIN","ar":"الرمز السري الجديد"},"hintFirst":true,"hint":{"en":"Choose a strong PIN","ar":"اختر رمزًا قويًا"},"text":""}]}},{"id":"after","text":{"en":"Keep the rules in the error after a wrong PIN","ar":"أبقِ الشروط في رسالة الخطأ بعد رمز خاطئ"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Door PIN","ar":"رمز الباب"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"New PIN","ar":"الرمز السري الجديد"},"text":""}]}},{"id":"exact","text":{"en":"Show the exact rules under the label","ar":"اعرض الشروط بدقة تحت العنوان"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Door PIN","ar":"رمز الباب"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"New PIN","ar":"الرمز السري الجديد"},"hintFirst":true,"hint":{"en":"6 digits. Not all the same, and not in order like 123456.","ar":"6 أرقام. ليست كلها الرقم نفسه، وليست متتالية مثل 123456."},"text":""}]}}],"answer":["exact"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-042","when":["after"],"feedback":{"en":"Dina has to fail once to learn the rules. Shown before she types, they cost her nothing.","ar":"على دينا أن تفشل مرة لتعرف الشروط. ولو ظهرت قبل الكتابة، لما كلّفتها شيئًا."}},{"id":"MC-P01-043","when":["strong"],"feedback":{"en":"\"Strong\" means something different to everyone. Dina may think 111111 is fine. Say what the app checks.","ar":"كلمة «قوي» تعني شيئًا مختلفًا لكل شخص. وقد تظن دينا أن 111111 مقبول. اذكر ما يتحقّق منه التطبيق."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Dina knows all three rules before her first digit.","ar":"صحيح. تعرف دينا الشروط الثلاثة قبل أول رقم تكتبه."},"explain":{"en":"If the system checks a rule, say that exact rule before people type. Then the first try can be the right one.","ar":"إن كان النظام يتحقّق من قاعدة، فاذكرها بدقة قبل أن يكتب الناس. فتكون المحاولة الأولى هي الصحيحة."}},{"id":"S12","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P01-U03-06","part":"retest","speaker":"karim","value":{"en":"Re-test, form design (NN/g): if a field needs a specific format, state the exact instructions. \"A valid file\" tells Amr nothing about PDF or 2 MB.","ar":"إعادة اختبار، تصميم النماذج (NN/g): إن كان الحقل يحتاج صيغة معيّنة، فاذكر التعليمات بدقة. وعبارة «ملف صالح» لا تخبر عمرو بشيء عن PDF أو 2 MB."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/web-form-design/","quote":"If a field requires a specific format or type of input, state the exact instructions."},"scenario":{"en":"I'm building a careers page. We accept CVs only as PDF, up to 2 MB. Amr uploaded a 6 MB Word file and got rejected. Under the upload button, we say \"Upload a valid file\".","ar":"أبني صفحة الوظائف. نقبل السيرة الذاتية بصيغة PDF فقط، وحتى 2 MB. رفع عمرو ملف Word حجمه 6 MB ورُفض. وتحت زر الرفع نكتب «ارفع ملفًا صالحًا»."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each version. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل نسخة. أيّها يجب أن تُطلق؟"},"start":"valid","options":[{"id":"valid","text":{"en":"Keep \"Upload a valid file\"","ar":"أبقِ «ارفع ملفًا صالحًا»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"wazifa","name":{"en":"Wazifa","ar":"وظيفة"},"color":"#1971C2","icon":"identification-card","domain":"wazifa.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"wazifa.example/careers","blocks":[{"kind":"small","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Your CV","ar":"سيرتك الذاتية"}},{"kind":"button","emphasis":"low","text":{"en":"Choose file","ar":"اختر ملفًا"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Upload a valid file","ar":"ارفع ملفًا صالحًا"},"gap":"xs"}]}},{"id":"exact","text":{"en":"Change it to \"PDF only, up to 2 MB\"","ar":"غيّرها إلى «PDF فقط، حتى 2 MB»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"wazifa","name":{"en":"Wazifa","ar":"وظيفة"},"color":"#1971C2","icon":"identification-card","domain":"wazifa.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"wazifa.example/careers","blocks":[{"kind":"small","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Your CV","ar":"سيرتك الذاتية"}},{"kind":"button","emphasis":"low","text":{"en":"Choose file","ar":"اختر ملفًا"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"PDF only, up to 2 MB","ar":"PDF فقط، حتى 2 MB"},"gap":"xs"}]}},{"id":"none","text":{"en":"Remove the line; the error will explain","ar":"احذف السطر؛ رسالة الخطأ ستشرح"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"wazifa","name":{"en":"Wazifa","ar":"وظيفة"},"color":"#1971C2","icon":"identification-card","domain":"wazifa.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"wazifa.example/careers","blocks":[{"kind":"small","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Your CV","ar":"سيرتك الذاتية"}},{"kind":"button","emphasis":"low","text":{"en":"Choose file","ar":"اختر ملفًا"},"gap":"xs"}]}}],"answer":["exact"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-043","when":["valid"],"feedback":{"en":"Amr thought his Word file was valid. A rule only helps if it names the format and size we check.","ar":"ظنّ عمرو أن ملف Word صالح. والقاعدة لا تفيد إلا إن ذكرت الصيغة والحجم اللذين نتحقّق منهما."}},{"id":"MC-P01-042","when":["none"],"feedback":{"en":"Then Amr learns the rules only after a failed upload. Telling him first saves the extra try.","ar":"عندها يعرف عمرو الشروط فقط بعد رفع فاشل. وإخباره أولًا يوفّر عليه المحاولة الزائدة."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Amr can check his file before he picks it.","ar":"صحيح. يستطيع عمرو أن يراجع ملفّه قبل أن يختاره."},"explain":{"en":"Exact rules (type and size) let people get it right the first time. Vague words or a later error make them guess.","ar":"الشروط الدقيقة (النوع والحجم) تجعل الناس ينجحون من المرة الأولى. والكلمات المبهمة أو الخطأ اللاحق تجعلهم يخمّنون."}}]}$uxg$::jsonb),
  ($uxg$P01-U04-B01$uxg$, $uxg$522ce2b16cd6fd5ee1d526e9fe653284b69ed695469e1164adc64a70591c23b1$uxg$, $uxg${"id":"P01-U04-B01","mode":"bank","title":{"en":"Re-tests: errors people can fix","ar":"إعادة اختبار: أخطاء يستطيع الناس إصلاحها"},"steps":[{"id":"S01","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P01-U04-01","part":"retest","speaker":"sara","value":{"en":"Re-test, error messages (NN/g): display the message close to the source of the error. The passport date error belongs on the passport date field.","ar":"إعادة اختبار، رسائل الخطأ (NN/g): اعرض الرسالة قريبًا من مصدر الخطأ. وخطأ تاريخ الجواز مكانه على حقل تاريخ الجواز."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/error-message-guidelines/","quote":"Display the error message close to the error's source."},"scenario":{"en":"I'm designing a flight booking app. Yara's passport ends in 2 months, and the airline needs 6. We show \"Passport not accepted for this trip\" at the very top, above the flight summary.","ar":"أصمّم تطبيقًا لحجز الطيران. ينتهي جواز يارا بعد شهرين، وشركة الطيران تحتاج 6 أشهر. ونعرض «الجواز غير مقبول لهذه الرحلة» في أعلى الصفحة تمامًا، فوق ملخّص الرحلة."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each version. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل نسخة. أيّها يجب أن تُطلق؟"},"start":"top","options":[{"id":"top","text":{"en":"Keep the message at the top","ar":"أبقِ الرسالة في الأعلى"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"zad","name":{"en":"Zad Travel","ar":"زاد للسفر"},"color":"#6D28D9","icon":"airplane-tilt","domain":"zad.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Passenger details","ar":"بيانات المسافر"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"banner","tone":"bad","text":{"en":"Passport not accepted for this trip.","ar":"الجواز غير مقبول لهذه الرحلة."}},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Cairo → Kuala Lumpur, 20 Jan","ar":"القاهرة ← كوالالمبور، 20 يناير"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Passport number","ar":"رقم الجواز"},"filled":true,"text":"A27718830","gap":"m"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Passport expiry date","ar":"تاريخ انتهاء الجواز"},"filled":true,"text":"15/03/2027","gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"both","text":{"en":"Keep the top message, and also turn the date field red","ar":"أبقِ رسالة الأعلى، واجعل حقل التاريخ أحمر أيضًا"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"zad","name":{"en":"Zad Travel","ar":"زاد للسفر"},"color":"#6D28D9","icon":"airplane-tilt","domain":"zad.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Passenger details","ar":"بيانات المسافر"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"banner","tone":"bad","text":{"en":"Passport not accepted for this trip.","ar":"الجواز غير مقبول لهذه الرحلة."}},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Cairo → Kuala Lumpur, 20 Jan","ar":"القاهرة ← كوالالمبور، 20 يناير"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Passport number","ar":"رقم الجواز"},"filled":true,"text":"A27718830","gap":"m"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Passport expiry date","ar":"تاريخ انتهاء الجواز"},"filled":true,"text":"15/03/2027","tone":"bad","gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"inline","text":{"en":"Explain it under the expiry date field","ar":"اشرح المشكلة تحت حقل تاريخ الانتهاء"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"zad","name":{"en":"Zad Travel","ar":"زاد للسفر"},"color":"#6D28D9","icon":"airplane-tilt","domain":"zad.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Passenger details","ar":"بيانات المسافر"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Cairo → Kuala Lumpur, 20 Jan","ar":"القاهرة ← كوالالمبور، 20 يناير"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Passport number","ar":"رقم الجواز"},"filled":true,"text":"A27718830","gap":"m"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Passport expiry date","ar":"تاريخ انتهاء الجواز"},"filled":true,"text":"15/03/2027","tone":"bad","error":{"en":"⚠ For this trip, your passport must be valid until 20 July 2027. Renew it, or use another passport.","ar":"⚠ لهذه الرحلة، يجب أن يكون جوازك ساريًا حتى 20 يوليو 2027. جدّديه، أو استخدمي جوازًا آخر."},"gap":"s"}]}}],"answer":["inline"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-044","when":["top","both"],"feedback":{"en":"Yara reads the problem at the top and has to guess which part of the passport it's about. Say it on the date field, with the date it must reach.","ar":"تقرأ يارا المشكلة في الأعلى، وعليها أن تخمّن أي جزء من الجواز تقصده. اكتبها عند حقل التاريخ، مع التاريخ المطلوب."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. The message is on the date that causes it.","ar":"صحيح. الرسالة عند حقل التاريخ الذي سبّب المشكلة."},"explain":{"en":"An error on its field answers \"which one?\" by itself, and stays where the fixing happens.","ar":"رسالة الخطأ عند حقلها تجيب وحدها عن سؤال «أيّ حقل؟»، وتبقى حيث يُصلح الشخص الخطأ."}},{"id":"S02","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P01-U04-01","part":"retest","speaker":"rami","value":{"en":"Re-test, form errors (NN/g): when the message stays by the field, people see it while fixing instead of remembering it. A pop-up that vanishes asks Hesham to remember.","ar":"إعادة اختبار، أخطاء النماذج (NN/g): حين تبقى الرسالة بجوار الحقل، يراها الناس أثناء الإصلاح بدل أن يتذكّروها. والنافذة التي تختفي تطلب من هشام أن يتذكّر."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/errors-forms-design-guidelines/","quote":"users can see the error message while fixing the error instead of having to remember it."},"scenario":{"en":"I'm working on a food delivery app. When the building number is missing, a pop-up says so for 2 seconds. Hesham was looking at the street sign and missed it.","ar":"أعمل على تطبيق لتوصيل الطعام. حين يكون رقم العمارة ناقصًا، تظهر نافذة منبثقة (Pop-up) تقول ذلك لمدة ثانيتين. وكان هشام ينظر إلى لافتة الشارع ففاتته."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each version, a few seconds after he taps Order. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل نسخة، بعد ثوانٍ من ضغطه «اطلب». أيّ نسخة تُبقي هشام يعرف ما الناقص حين ينظر إلى الشاشة مرة أخرى؟"},"start":"popup","options":[{"id":"popup","text":{"en":"Keep the 2-second pop-up","ar":"أبقِ النافذة التي تظهر لثانيتين"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"lamma","name":{"en":"Lamma","ar":"لمّة"},"color":"#E03131","icon":"bowl-food","domain":"lamma.example"},"caption":{"en":"3 seconds later","ar":"بعد 3 ثوانٍ"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Delivery address","ar":"عنوان التوصيل"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Street","ar":"الشارع"},"filled":true,"text":{"en":"El Nasr Rd","ar":"طريق النصر"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Building number","ar":"رقم العمارة"},"text":"","gap":"s"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Order","ar":"اطلب"}}]}},{"id":"inline","text":{"en":"Mark the building field and keep the message under it","ar":"علّم حقل العمارة وأبقِ الرسالة تحته"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"lamma","name":{"en":"Lamma","ar":"لمّة"},"color":"#E03131","icon":"bowl-food","domain":"lamma.example"},"caption":{"en":"3 seconds later","ar":"بعد 3 ثوانٍ"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Delivery address","ar":"عنوان التوصيل"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Street","ar":"الشارع"},"filled":true,"text":{"en":"El Nasr Rd","ar":"طريق النصر"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Building number","ar":"رقم العمارة"},"text":"","tone":"bad","error":{"en":"⚠ Add your building number so the driver finds you.","ar":"⚠ أضف رقم العمارة ليجدك السائق."},"gap":"s"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Order","ar":"اطلب"}}]}},{"id":"shake","text":{"en":"Shake the Order button instead","ar":"اهزز زر «اطلب» بدلًا من ذلك"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"lamma","name":{"en":"Lamma","ar":"لمّة"},"color":"#E03131","icon":"bowl-food","domain":"lamma.example"},"caption":{"en":"3 seconds later","ar":"بعد 3 ثوانٍ"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Delivery address","ar":"عنوان التوصيل"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Street","ar":"الشارع"},"filled":true,"text":{"en":"El Nasr Rd","ar":"طريق النصر"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Building number","ar":"رقم العمارة"},"text":"","gap":"s"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Order","ar":"اطلب"}}]}}],"answer":["inline"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-044","when":["popup","shake"],"feedback":{"en":"A few seconds later, Hesham's screen looks normal again. Nothing says what's missing or where. Keep the message on the field.","ar":"بعد ثوانٍ، تبدو شاشة هشام عادية مرة أخرى. ولا شيء يوضّح ما الناقص أو أين. أبقِ الرسالة على الحقل."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Whenever Hesham looks back, the message is on the empty field.","ar":"صحيح. كلما نظر هشام، وجد الرسالة على الحقل الفارغ."},"explain":{"en":"An error should stay by its field until it's fixed. People look away while fixing, and the message must still be there.","ar":"الخطأ يجب أن يبقى بجوار حقله حتى يُصلَح. فالناس ينظرون بعيدًا أثناء الإصلاح، ويجب أن تبقى الرسالة موجودة."}},{"id":"S03","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P01-U04-02","part":"retest","speaker":"karim","value":{"en":"Re-test, error messages (NN/g): keep error codes for technical diagnosis only. A login code tells Nagwa nothing about her caps lock.","ar":"إعادة اختبار، رسائل الخطأ (NN/g): احتفظ بأكواد الخطأ للتشخيص التقني فقط. وكود تسجيل الدخول لا يخبر نجوى بشيء عن زر الأحرف الكبيرة."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/error-message-guidelines/","quote":"Hide or minimize the use of obscure error codes or abbreviations; show them for technical diagnostic purposes only."},"scenario":{"en":"I'm building a bank app's sign-in. Nagwa's caps lock was on, so her password failed. The screen says \"AUTH_ERR 401\".","ar":"أبني شاشة الدخول في تطبيق بنك. كان زر الأحرف الكبيرة (Caps Lock) مفعّلًا عند نجوى، ففشلت كلمة مرورها. والشاشة تعرض «AUTH_ERR 401»."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each message. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل رسالة. أيّ رسالة تخبر نجوى بكلمات بسيطة سبب الفشل وكيف تصلحه؟"},"start":"code","options":[{"id":"plain","text":{"en":"\"That password didn't match. Caps Lock is on; turn it off and try again.\"","ar":"«كلمة المرور غير صحيحة. زر Caps Lock مفعّل؛ أوقفيه وحاولي مرة أخرى.»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rasid","name":{"en":"Rasid","ar":"رصيد"},"color":"#1C3D6E","icon":"bank","domain":"rasid.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Sign in","ar":"تسجيل الدخول"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Password","ar":"كلمة المرور"},"filled":true,"text":"••••••••","tone":"bad","error":{"en":"⚠ That password didn't match. Caps Lock is on; turn it off and try again.","ar":"⚠ كلمة المرور غير صحيحة. زر Caps Lock مفعّل؛ أوقفيه وحاولي مرة أخرى."}}]}},{"id":"code","text":{"en":"Keep \"AUTH_ERR 401\"","ar":"أبقِ «AUTH_ERR 401»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rasid","name":{"en":"Rasid","ar":"رصيد"},"color":"#1C3D6E","icon":"bank","domain":"rasid.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Sign in","ar":"تسجيل الدخول"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Password","ar":"كلمة المرور"},"filled":true,"text":"••••••••","tone":"bad","error":{"en":"⚠ AUTH_ERR 401","ar":"⚠ AUTH_ERR 401"}}]}},{"id":"auth","text":{"en":"\"Authentication failed.\"","ar":"«فشلت المصادقة.»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rasid","name":{"en":"Rasid","ar":"رصيد"},"color":"#1C3D6E","icon":"bank","domain":"rasid.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Sign in","ar":"تسجيل الدخول"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Password","ar":"كلمة المرور"},"filled":true,"text":"••••••••","tone":"bad","error":{"en":"⚠ Authentication failed.","ar":"⚠ فشلت المصادقة."}}]}}],"answer":["plain"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-048","when":["code","auth"],"feedback":{"en":"\"AUTH_ERR\" and \"Authentication\" are system words. Nagwa needs to hear that the password didn't match, and what to check.","ar":"«AUTH_ERR» و«المصادقة» كلمات نظام. ونجوى تحتاج أن تعرف أن كلمة المرور غير صحيحة، وماذا تراجع."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Plain words, and the likely cause.","ar":"صحيح. كلمات بسيطة، والسبب المحتمل."},"explain":{"en":"Translate the system's code into what happened and what to do. The code can stay in our logs.","ar":"ترجم كود النظام إلى ما حدث وما يجب فعله. ويمكن أن يبقى الكود في سجلّاتنا."}},{"id":"S04","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P01-U04-02","part":"retest","speaker":"nour","value":{"en":"Re-test, error messages (NN/g): stating the problem is not enough; offer a remedy. \"File too large\" needs the limit and another way to send it.","ar":"إعادة اختبار، رسائل الخطأ (NN/g): ذكر المشكلة لا يكفي؛ اعرض حلًا. و«الملف كبير جدًا» تحتاج الحدّ المسموح وطريقة أخرى للإرسال."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/error-message-guidelines/","quote":"Merely stating the problem is also not enough; offer some potential remedies."},"scenario":{"en":"Patients upload lab results before a visit at my clinic. Adham's scan was 12 MB, and our limit is 5 MB. He got \"File too large\" and gave up.","ar":"يرفع المرضى نتائج التحاليل قبل الزيارة في عيادتي. وكان ملف أدهم 12 MB، والحدّ عندنا 5 MB. فظهرت له «الملف كبير جدًا» فترك الرفع."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each message. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل رسالة. أيّها يجب أن تُطلق؟"},"start":"large","options":[{"id":"large","text":{"en":"Keep \"File too large.\"","ar":"أبقِ «الملف كبير جدًا.»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Lab results","ar":"نتائج التحاليل"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Lab results","ar":"نتائج التحاليل"}},{"kind":"button","emphasis":"low","text":{"en":"Choose file","ar":"اختر ملفًا"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"small","color":"red","text":{"en":"⚠ File too large.","ar":"⚠ الملف كبير جدًا."},"gap":"xs"}]}},{"id":"size","text":{"en":"\"This file is 12 MB. The limit is 5 MB.\"","ar":"«هذا الملف 12 MB. والحدّ 5 MB.»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Lab results","ar":"نتائج التحاليل"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Lab results","ar":"نتائج التحاليل"}},{"kind":"button","emphasis":"low","text":{"en":"Choose file","ar":"اختر ملفًا"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"small","color":"red","text":{"en":"⚠ This file is 12 MB. The limit is 5 MB.","ar":"⚠ هذا الملف 12 MB. والحدّ 5 MB."},"gap":"xs"}]}},{"id":"remedy","text":{"en":"Size and limit, plus: take a photo of each page instead","ar":"اذكر الحجم والحدّ، واقترح تصوير كل صفحة بدلًا من ذلك"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Lab results","ar":"نتائج التحاليل"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Lab results","ar":"نتائج التحاليل"}},{"kind":"button","emphasis":"low","text":{"en":"Choose file","ar":"اختر ملفًا"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"small","color":"red","text":{"en":"⚠ This file is 12 MB; the limit is 5 MB. You can take a photo of each page instead.","ar":"⚠ هذا الملف 12 MB؛ والحدّ 5 MB. يمكنك تصوير كل صفحة بدلًا من ذلك."},"gap":"xs"}]}}],"answer":["remedy"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-047","when":["large","size"],"feedback":{"en":"Adham now knows the file is too big, maybe even by how much, but most people can't shrink a PDF. Offer a way that works for them.","ar":"يعرف أدهم الآن أن الملف كبير، وربما بكم، لكن أغلب الناس لا يعرفون كيف يصغّرون ملف PDF. اعرض طريقة تناسبهم."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. He knows the problem and has a way to finish.","ar":"صحيح. يعرف المشكلة، ولديه طريقة لإكمال الرفع."},"explain":{"en":"A good error ends with a step people can take. If the fix is hard, offer another way.","ar":"رسالة الخطأ الجيدة تنتهي بخطوة يستطيع الناس اتّخاذها. وإن كان الإصلاح صعبًا، فاعرض طريقة أخرى."}},{"id":"S05","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P01-U04-03","part":"retest","speaker":"youssef","value":{"en":"Re-test, error messages (NN/g): don't use phrasing that blames the person. Soha's area is simply outside our delivery zone.","ar":"إعادة اختبار، رسائل الخطأ (NN/g): لا تستخدم صياغة تلوم الشخص. ومنطقة سها ببساطة خارج نطاق توصيلنا."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/error-message-guidelines/","quote":"Don't use phrasing that blames users or implies they are doing something wrong"},"scenario":{"en":"My shop delivers only inside Cairo and Giza. Soha typed an address in 6th of October City. Our message says \"You entered an address we don't accept.\"","ar":"متجري يوصّل داخل القاهرة والجيزة فقط. وكتبت سها عنوانًا في مدينة 6 أكتوبر. ورسالتنا تقول «أدخلتِ عنوانًا لا نقبله.»"},"prompt":{"en":"Try each message. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل رسالة. أيّها يجب أن تُطلق؟"},"start":"you","options":[{"id":"you","text":{"en":"Keep \"You entered an address we don't accept.\"","ar":"أبقِ «أدخلتِ عنوانًا لا نقبله.»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Delivery address","ar":"عنوان التوصيل"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Area","ar":"المنطقة"},"filled":true,"text":{"en":"6th of October City","ar":"مدينة 6 أكتوبر"},"tone":"bad","error":{"en":"⚠ You entered an address we don't accept.","ar":"⚠ أدخلتِ عنوانًا لا نقبله."}}]}},{"id":"zone","text":{"en":"\"We don't deliver to 6th of October City yet. You can pick up from our Dokki store.\"","ar":"«لا نوصّل إلى مدينة 6 أكتوبر بعد. يمكنك الاستلام من فرعنا في الدقي.»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Delivery address","ar":"عنوان التوصيل"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Area","ar":"المنطقة"},"filled":true,"text":{"en":"6th of October City","ar":"مدينة 6 أكتوبر"},"tone":"bad","error":{"en":"⚠ We don't deliver to 6th of October City yet. You can pick up from our Dokki store.","ar":"⚠ لا نوصّل إلى مدينة 6 أكتوبر بعد. يمكنك الاستلام من فرعنا في الدقي."}}]}},{"id":"wrong","text":{"en":"\"Wrong area. Please enter a valid area.\"","ar":"«منطقة خاطئة. يُرجى إدخال منطقة صحيحة.»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Delivery address","ar":"عنوان التوصيل"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Area","ar":"المنطقة"},"filled":true,"text":{"en":"6th of October City","ar":"مدينة 6 أكتوبر"},"tone":"bad","error":{"en":"⚠ Wrong area. Please enter a valid area.","ar":"⚠ منطقة خاطئة. يُرجى إدخال منطقة صحيحة."}}]}}],"answer":["zone"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-049","when":["you","wrong"],"feedback":{"en":"Soha's area isn't wrong; it's where she lives. The limit is ours. Say what we can't do, and what we can.","ar":"منطقة سها ليست خاطئة؛ إنها المكان الذي تسكن فيه. والحدّ من عندنا نحن. اذكر ما لا نستطيع فعله، وما نستطيع."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. The limit is ours, and she still has a way to buy.","ar":"صحيح. الحدّ من عندنا، وما زال لديها طريقة للشراء."},"explain":{"en":"When the problem is our limit, say so in our name (\"We don't deliver…\"), and offer what still works.","ar":"حين تكون المشكلة في حدودنا، فانسبها إلينا («لا نوصّل…»)، واعرض ما زال ممكنًا."}},{"id":"S06","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P01-U04-03","part":"retest","speaker":"mona","value":{"en":"Re-test, form errors (NN/g): an error should be explicit, human-readable, polite, precise, and give constructive advice. \"You have exceeded\" is none of the last three.","ar":"إعادة اختبار، أخطاء النماذج (NN/g): رسالة الخطأ يجب أن تكون صريحة، ومفهومة، ومهذّبة، ودقيقة، وتقدّم نصيحة مفيدة. و«لقد تجاوزت» ليست أيًّا من الثلاثة الأخيرة."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/errors-forms-design-guidelines/","quote":"it should be explicit, human-readable, polite, precise, and give constructive advice."},"scenario":{"en":"My team designs a university's course sign-up. Students can take up to 18 hours a term. Mai picked 21 and got \"You have exceeded the allowed number of hours.\"","ar":"يصمّم فريقي نظام تسجيل المقررات لجامعة. يستطيع الطلاب أخذ 18 ساعة كحدّ أقصى في الفصل. واختارت مي 21 ساعة فظهرت لها «لقد تجاوزتِ عدد الساعات المسموح.»"},"prompt":{"en":"Try each message. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل رسالة. أيّها يجب أن تُطلق؟"},"start":"exceeded","options":[{"id":"exceeded","text":{"en":"Keep \"You have exceeded the allowed number of hours.\"","ar":"أبقِ «لقد تجاوزتِ عدد الساعات المسموح.»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"jamia","name":{"en":"Jami'a","ar":"جامعة"},"color":"#1C3D6E","icon":"graduation-cap","domain":"jamia.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"jamia.example/courses","blocks":[{"kind":"small","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Your plan: 21 hours","ar":"خطتك: 21 ساعة"}},{"kind":"banner","tone":"bad","text":{"en":"You have exceeded the allowed number of hours.","ar":"لقد تجاوزتِ عدد الساعات المسموح."},"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"too","text":{"en":"\"Too many hours! Please fix your plan.\"","ar":"«ساعات كثيرة جدًا! يُرجى إصلاح خطتك.»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"jamia","name":{"en":"Jami'a","ar":"جامعة"},"color":"#1C3D6E","icon":"graduation-cap","domain":"jamia.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"jamia.example/courses","blocks":[{"kind":"small","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Your plan: 21 hours","ar":"خطتك: 21 ساعة"}},{"kind":"banner","tone":"bad","text":{"en":"Too many hours! Please fix your plan.","ar":"ساعات كثيرة جدًا! يُرجى إصلاح خطتك."},"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"precise","text":{"en":"\"This plan has 21 hours; the limit is 18. Remove a 3-hour course to continue.\"","ar":"«هذه الخطة 21 ساعة؛ والحدّ 18. احذفي مقررًا من 3 ساعات للمتابعة.»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"jamia","name":{"en":"Jami'a","ar":"جامعة"},"color":"#1C3D6E","icon":"graduation-cap","domain":"jamia.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"jamia.example/courses","blocks":[{"kind":"small","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Your plan: 21 hours","ar":"خطتك: 21 ساعة"}},{"kind":"banner","tone":"bad","text":{"en":"This plan has 21 hours; the limit is 18. Remove a 3-hour course to continue.","ar":"هذه الخطة 21 ساعة؛ والحدّ 18. احذفي مقررًا من 3 ساعات للمتابعة."},"gap":"s"}]}}],"answer":["precise"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-049","when":["exceeded","too"],"feedback":{"en":"Both point at Mai and skip the numbers. Describe the plan (21 of 18) and the one step that fixes it.","ar":"الرسالتان تشيران إلى مي وتتجاهلان الأرقام. صِف الخطة (21 من 18) والخطوة الوحيدة التي تُصلحها."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. About the plan, not Mai, with exact numbers and a fix.","ar":"صحيح. الرسالة عن الخطة لا عن مي، وفيها أرقام دقيقة وطريقة للإصلاح."},"explain":{"en":"Polite and precise go together: describe the input with real numbers, then give the step that solves it.","ar":"الأدب والدقة يسيران معًا: صِف ما أدخله الشخص بأرقام حقيقية، ثم أعطِ الخطوة التي تحلّ المشكلة."}},{"id":"S07","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P01-U04-04","part":"retest","speaker":"tarek","value":{"en":"Re-test, form errors (NN/g): avoid showing an error until the person has finished the field and moved on. \"Emails don't match\" is always true until the last letter.","ar":"إعادة اختبار، أخطاء النماذج (NN/g): تجنّب عرض الخطأ حتى ينتهي الشخص من الحقل وينتقل. و«البريدان غير متطابقين» صحيحة دائمًا حتى آخر حرف."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/errors-forms-design-guidelines/","quote":"In most cases, avoid showing an error until the user has finished with the field and moved to the next field."},"scenario":{"en":"I manage the product for an events app. Ibrahim types his email twice to get his ticket. From the first letter of the second box, it says \"Emails don't match\" in red.","ar":"أنا مدير المنتج لتطبيق فعاليات. يكتب إبراهيم بريده مرتين ليستلم تذكرته. ومن أول حرف في المربع الثاني، تظهر «البريدان غير متطابقين» بالأحمر."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each timing. Each preview shows two moments. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل توقيت. كل معاينة تُظهر لحظتين. أيّ توقيت يُظهر الخطأ لإبراهيم في اللحظة التي تفيده؟"},"start":"typing","options":[{"id":"typing","text":{"en":"Keep checking with every letter","ar":"أبقِ التحقّق مع كل حرف"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"tazkara","name":{"en":"Tazkara","ar":"تذكرة"},"color":"#C026D3","icon":"ticket","domain":"tazkara.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Your ticket","ar":"تذكرتك"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"While typing","ar":"أثناء الكتابة"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Confirm email","ar":"أكّد البريد الإلكتروني"},"filled":true,"focus":true,"text":"ibra","tone":"bad","error":{"en":"⚠ This doesn't match the email above. Check both for a typo.","ar":"⚠ هذا لا يطابق البريد بالأعلى. راجع الاثنين بحثًا عن خطأ كتابي."},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"After moving on, with one letter swapped","ar":"بعد الانتقال، مع تبديل حرف واحد"},"gap":"l"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Confirm email","ar":"أكّد البريد الإلكتروني"},"filled":true,"text":"ibarhim@mail.com","tone":"bad","error":{"en":"⚠ This doesn't match the email above. Check both for a typo.","ar":"⚠ هذا لا يطابق البريد بالأعلى. راجع الاثنين بحثًا عن خطأ كتابي."},"gap":"xs"}]}},{"id":"leave","text":{"en":"Check when he leaves the second box","ar":"تحقّق حين يغادر المربع الثاني"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"tazkara","name":{"en":"Tazkara","ar":"تذكرة"},"color":"#C026D3","icon":"ticket","domain":"tazkara.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Your ticket","ar":"تذكرتك"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"While typing","ar":"أثناء الكتابة"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Confirm email","ar":"أكّد البريد الإلكتروني"},"filled":true,"focus":true,"text":"ibra","gap":"xs"},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"After moving on, with one letter swapped","ar":"بعد الانتقال، مع تبديل حرف واحد"},"gap":"l"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Confirm email","ar":"أكّد البريد الإلكتروني"},"filled":true,"text":"ibarhim@mail.com","tone":"bad","error":{"en":"⚠ This doesn't match the email above. Check both for a typo.","ar":"⚠ هذا لا يطابق البريد بالأعلى. راجع الاثنين بحثًا عن خطأ كتابي."},"gap":"xs"}]}},{"id":"never","text":{"en":"Don't check; send the ticket to the first email","ar":"لا تتحقّق؛ أرسل التذكرة إلى البريد الأول"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"tazkara","name":{"en":"Tazkara","ar":"تذكرة"},"color":"#C026D3","icon":"ticket","domain":"tazkara.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Your ticket","ar":"تذكرتك"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"While typing","ar":"أثناء الكتابة"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Confirm email","ar":"أكّد البريد الإلكتروني"},"filled":true,"focus":true,"text":"ibra","gap":"xs"},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"After moving on, with one letter swapped","ar":"بعد الانتقال، مع تبديل حرف واحد"},"gap":"l"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Confirm email","ar":"أكّد البريد الإلكتروني"},"filled":true,"text":"ibarhim@mail.com","gap":"xs"}]}}],"answer":["leave"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-050","when":["typing"],"feedback":{"en":"Half an email never matches a whole one. The red while typing is noise; it only means something once Ibrahim is done.","ar":"نصف بريد لا يطابق بريدًا كاملًا أبدًا. واللون الأحمر أثناء الكتابة إزعاج بلا معنى؛ لا يعني شيئًا إلا حين ينتهي إبراهيم."}},{"id":"MC-P01-050","when":["never"],"feedback":{"en":"Then the swapped letters go unnoticed, and maybe the first box is the one with the typo. Check, but at the right moment: when he leaves the box.","ar":"عندها يمرّ الحرفان المبدّلان دون ملاحظة، وربما يكون الخطأ في المربع الأول. تحقّق، لكن في اللحظة الصحيحة: حين يغادر المربع."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Silent while he types, clear once he's done.","ar":"صحيح. لا شيء أثناء الكتابة، ورسالة واضحة حين ينتهي."},"explain":{"en":"Check a field when the person leaves it. That's when the answer is complete, and fixing it is still easy.","ar":"تحقّق من الحقل حين يغادره الشخص. حينها تكون الإجابة كاملة، والإصلاح ما زال سهلًا."}},{"id":"S08","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P01-U04-04","part":"retest","speaker":"hana","value":{"en":"Re-test, hostile error messages (NN/g): showing errors while people type feels like unwarranted scolding. Check the card number once Lobna leaves the field.","ar":"إعادة اختبار، رسائل الخطأ العدائية (NN/g): عرض الأخطاء أثناء الكتابة يبدو كتوبيخ بلا سبب. تحقّق من رقم البطاقة حين تغادر لبنى الحقل."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/hostile-error-messages/","quote":"Displaying error messages while the user types feels like an unwarranted scolding and can be irritating."},"scenario":{"en":"Members pay for my gym's yearly plan on our site. The card number field says \"Invalid card\" from the first digit. Lobna asked the front desk whether her card was blocked.","ar":"يدفع الأعضاء الاشتراك السنوي لنادينا من موقعنا. وحقل رقم البطاقة يعرض «بطاقة غير صالحة» من أول رقم. فسألت لبنى الاستقبال هل بطاقتها موقوفة."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each timing. Each preview shows two moments. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل توقيت. كل معاينة تُظهر لحظتين. أيّها يجب أن يُطلق؟"},"start":"typing","options":[{"id":"leave","text":{"en":"Check when she leaves the field","ar":"تحقّق حين تغادر الحقل"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"nashat.example/pay","blocks":[{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"After 6 digits","ar":"بعد 6 أرقام"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Card number","ar":"رقم البطاقة"},"filled":true,"focus":true,"text":"⁦4012 88⁩","gap":"xs"},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"After she moves on with 15 digits","ar":"بعد أن تنتقل وفيه 15 رقمًا"},"gap":"l"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Card number","ar":"رقم البطاقة"},"filled":true,"text":"⁦4012 8888 8888 188⁩","tone":"bad","error":{"en":"⚠ Card numbers have 16 digits. This one has 15.","ar":"⚠ رقم البطاقة 16 رقمًا، وأدخلتِ 15."},"gap":"xs"}]}},{"id":"typing","text":{"en":"Keep checking from the first digit","ar":"أبقِ التحقّق من أول رقم"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"nashat.example/pay","blocks":[{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"After 6 digits","ar":"بعد 6 أرقام"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Card number","ar":"رقم البطاقة"},"filled":true,"focus":true,"text":"⁦4012 88⁩","tone":"bad","error":{"en":"⚠ Invalid card.","ar":"⚠ بطاقة غير صالحة."},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"After she moves on with 15 digits","ar":"بعد أن تنتقل وفيه 15 رقمًا"},"gap":"l"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Card number","ar":"رقم البطاقة"},"filled":true,"text":"⁦4012 8888 8888 188⁩","tone":"bad","error":{"en":"⚠ Invalid card.","ar":"⚠ بطاقة غير صالحة."},"gap":"xs"}]}},{"id":"typingsoft","text":{"en":"Check from the first digit, with the clearer message","ar":"تحقّق من أول رقم، مع الرسالة الأوضح"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"nashat.example/pay","blocks":[{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"After 6 digits","ar":"بعد 6 أرقام"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Card number","ar":"رقم البطاقة"},"filled":true,"focus":true,"text":"⁦4012 88⁩","tone":"bad","error":{"en":"⚠ Card numbers have 16 digits. This one has 6.","ar":"⚠ رقم البطاقة 16 رقمًا، وأدخلتِ 6."},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"After she moves on with 15 digits","ar":"بعد أن تنتقل وفيه 15 رقمًا"},"gap":"l"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Card number","ar":"رقم البطاقة"},"filled":true,"text":"⁦4012 8888 8888 188⁩","tone":"bad","error":{"en":"⚠ Card numbers have 16 digits. This one has 15.","ar":"⚠ رقم البطاقة 16 رقمًا، وأدخلتِ 15."},"gap":"xs"}]}}],"answer":["leave"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-050","when":["typing","typingsoft"],"feedback":{"en":"Even a clear message is wrong at digit 6: Lobna isn't done. An error mid-typing made her think her card was blocked. Wait until she leaves the field.","ar":"حتى الرسالة الواضحة خاطئة عند الرقم السادس: لبنى لم تنتهِ. والخطأ أثناء الكتابة جعلها تظن أن بطاقتها موقوفة. انتظر حتى تغادر الحقل."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Nothing while she types; a clear message when one digit is missing.","ar":"صحيح. لا شيء أثناء الكتابة؛ ورسالة واضحة حين ينقص رقم."},"explain":{"en":"Good words at the wrong moment still scold. Time the check to when the field is finished.","ar":"الكلمات الجيدة في اللحظة الخاطئة ما زالت توبّخ. اجعل التحقّق حين ينتهي الشخص من الحقل."}},{"id":"S09","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P01-U04-05","part":"retest","speaker":"sara","value":{"en":"Re-test, form usability (NN/g): preserve erroneous input so people can correct it, with a specific explanation. One bad link shouldn't empty a job application.","ar":"إعادة اختبار، سهولة استخدام النماذج (NN/g): احتفظ بالمُدخل الخاطئ ليُصلحه الناس، مع شرح محدّد. والرابط الخاطئ الواحد يجب ألّا يُفرغ طلب وظيفة."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/web-form-design/","quote":"Erroneous input should be preserved so users can correct it, and accompanied by a specific explanation of the problem."},"scenario":{"en":"I'm designing a job application page. Fady pasted his portfolio link without \"https://\". After Apply, the page reloaded with every field empty and \"Invalid URL\" at the top.","ar":"أصمّم صفحة للتقدّم إلى وظيفة. لصق فادي رابط أعماله بدون «https://». وبعد «قدّم»، أُعيد تحميل الصفحة وكل الحقول فارغة، و«Invalid URL» في الأعلى."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each version of the page after Apply. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل نسخة للصفحة بعد «قدّم». أيّ نسخة تتيح لفادي أن يصلح الرابط دون أن يعيد كتابة شيء؟"},"start":"empty","options":[{"id":"empty","text":{"en":"Keep it: empty form, \"Invalid URL\" at the top","ar":"أبقِ الصفحة كما هي: نموذج فارغ، و«Invalid URL» في الأعلى"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"wazifa","name":{"en":"Wazifa","ar":"وظيفة"},"color":"#1971C2","icon":"identification-card","domain":"wazifa.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"wazifa.example/apply","blocks":[{"kind":"banner","tone":"bad","text":{"en":"Invalid URL.","ar":"Invalid URL."}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Full name","ar":"الاسم الكامل"},"text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Why this job?","ar":"لماذا هذه الوظيفة؟"},"text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Portfolio link","ar":"رابط أعمالك"},"text":"","gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"keep","text":{"en":"Keep every answer, and explain on the link field","ar":"احتفظ بكل الإجابات، واشرح المشكلة عند حقل الرابط"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"wazifa","name":{"en":"Wazifa","ar":"وظيفة"},"color":"#1971C2","icon":"identification-card","domain":"wazifa.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"wazifa.example/apply","blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Full name","ar":"الاسم الكامل"},"filled":true,"text":{"en":"Fady Mounir","ar":"فادي منير"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Why this job?","ar":"لماذا هذه الوظيفة؟"},"filled":true,"text":{"en":"I've designed delivery apps for 3 years and…","ar":"صمّمت تطبيقات توصيل لمدة 3 سنوات و…"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Portfolio link","ar":"رابط أعمالك"},"filled":true,"text":"fadymounir.design","tone":"bad","error":{"en":"⚠ Links start with https://, like https://fadymounir.design","ar":"⚠ الروابط تبدأ بـ https://، مثل https://fadymounir.design"},"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"dropbad","text":{"en":"Keep the other answers, and clear the link","ar":"احتفظ بالإجابات الأخرى، وامسح الرابط"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"wazifa","name":{"en":"Wazifa","ar":"وظيفة"},"color":"#1971C2","icon":"identification-card","domain":"wazifa.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"wazifa.example/apply","blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Full name","ar":"الاسم الكامل"},"filled":true,"text":{"en":"Fady Mounir","ar":"فادي منير"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Why this job?","ar":"لماذا هذه الوظيفة؟"},"filled":true,"text":{"en":"I've designed delivery apps for 3 years and…","ar":"صمّمت تطبيقات توصيل لمدة 3 سنوات و…"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Portfolio link","ar":"رابط أعمالك"},"text":"","tone":"bad","error":{"en":"⚠ Links start with https://, like https://fadymounir.design","ar":"⚠ الروابط تبدأ بـ https://، مثل https://fadymounir.design"},"gap":"s"}]}}],"answer":["keep"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-051","when":["empty"],"feedback":{"en":"Fady loses his whole cover note over 8 missing characters. Keep everything he wrote.","ar":"يفقد فادي رسالة التقديم كلها بسبب 8 أحرف ناقصة. احتفظ بكل ما كتبه."}},{"id":"MC-P01-051","when":["dropbad"],"feedback":{"en":"He only needs to add \"https://\" to what he typed. Clearing it makes him find and paste the link again.","ar":"كل ما يحتاجه هو إضافة «https://» لما كتبه. ومسحه يجعله يبحث عن الرابط ويلصقه من جديد."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. One small fix, and nothing to retype.","ar":"صحيح. إصلاح صغير واحد، ولا يعيد كتابة شيء."},"explain":{"en":"Keep every answer, the wrong one included. Then the fix is an edit, not a do-over.","ar":"احتفظ بكل إجابة، حتى الخاطئة منها. فيصبح الإصلاح تعديلًا، لا بداية من جديد."}},{"id":"S10","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P01-U04-05","part":"retest","speaker":"karim","value":{"en":"Re-test, error messages (NN/g): let people correct errors by editing what they did instead of starting over. A wrong one-time code shouldn't restart the transfer.","ar":"إعادة اختبار، رسائل الخطأ (NN/g): دع الناس يُصلحون الخطأ بتعديل ما فعلوه بدل البدء من جديد. والكود المؤقت الخاطئ يجب ألّا يعيد التحويل من البداية."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/error-message-guidelines/","quote":"Let users correct errors by editing their original action instead of starting over."},"scenario":{"en":"I'm building a bank's transfer flow: account, amount, note, then a 6-digit code by SMS. When Shaimaa mistyped one digit of the code, the app went back to the first screen with everything empty.","ar":"أبني خطوات التحويل في تطبيق بنك: الحساب، والمبلغ، والملاحظة، ثم كود من 6 أرقام برسالة SMS. وحين أخطأت شيماء في رقم واحد من الكود، عاد التطبيق إلى الشاشة الأولى وكل شيء فارغ."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each version of what Shaimaa sees after a wrong code. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل نسخة لما تراه شيماء بعد كود خاطئ. أيّ نسخة تتيح لشيماء أن تُصلح الرقم الخاطئ بأقل جهد؟"},"start":"restart","options":[{"id":"newcode","text":{"en":"Stay on the code screen, but send a new code and clear the box","ar":"أبقِها في شاشة الكود، لكن أرسل كودًا جديدًا وامسح المربع"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rasid","name":{"en":"Rasid","ar":"رصيد"},"color":"#1C3D6E","icon":"bank","domain":"rasid.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Transfer","ar":"تحويل"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Sending 2,000 EGP to Wael Samir","ar":"تحويل 2,000 جنيه إلى وائل سمير"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Code from SMS","ar":"الكود من الرسالة"},"text":"","tone":"bad","error":{"en":"⚠ That code didn't match. We sent a new one.","ar":"⚠ الكود غير صحيح. أرسلنا كودًا جديدًا."},"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"restart","text":{"en":"Keep it: back to the first screen","ar":"أبقِ التصميم كما هو: العودة إلى الشاشة الأولى"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rasid","name":{"en":"Rasid","ar":"رصيد"},"color":"#1C3D6E","icon":"bank","domain":"rasid.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Transfer","ar":"تحويل"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Step 1 of 4","ar":"الخطوة 1 من 4"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"To account","ar":"إلى الحساب"},"text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Amount (EGP)","ar":"المبلغ (جنيه)"},"text":"","gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"edit","text":{"en":"Stay on the code screen, keep her digits, and explain","ar":"أبقِها في شاشة الكود، واحتفظ بأرقامها، واشرح المشكلة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rasid","name":{"en":"Rasid","ar":"رصيد"},"color":"#1C3D6E","icon":"bank","domain":"rasid.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Transfer","ar":"تحويل"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Sending 2,000 EGP to Wael Samir","ar":"تحويل 2,000 جنيه إلى وائل سمير"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Code from SMS","ar":"الكود من الرسالة"},"filled":true,"text":"⁦482 951⁩","tone":"bad","error":{"en":"⚠ That code didn't match. Check the digits in the SMS and fix them here.","ar":"⚠ الكود غير صحيح. راجعي الأرقام في الرسالة وأصلحيها هنا."},"gap":"s"}]}}],"answer":["edit"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-051","when":["restart"],"feedback":{"en":"One wrong digit costs Shaimaa four screens. Keep her where the problem is.","ar":"رقم واحد خاطئ يكلّف شيماء أربع شاشات. أبقِها حيث المشكلة."}},{"id":"MC-P01-051","when":["newcode"],"feedback":{"en":"Better, but she can't compare what she typed with the SMS, and now she has to wait for a new code. Keep her digits so she can fix the one that's off.","ar":"أفضل، لكنها لا تستطيع مقارنة ما كتبته بالرسالة، وعليها الآن انتظار كود جديد. احتفظ بأرقامها لتُصلح الرقم المختلف."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. She fixes one digit and is done.","ar":"صحيح. تُصلح رقمًا واحدًا وتنتهي."},"explain":{"en":"The smallest fix wins: keep the person on the step with the problem, with their input still there to edit.","ar":"أصغر إصلاح هو الأفضل: أبقِ الشخص في الخطوة التي فيها المشكلة، وما أدخله ما زال موجودًا ليعدّله."}},{"id":"S11","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P01-U04-06","part":"retest","speaker":"nour","value":{"en":"Re-test, form usability (NN/g): signal errors through several cues, not only color. A required checkbox that only turns red is easy to miss.","ar":"إعادة اختبار، سهولة استخدام النماذج (NN/g): أظهر الأخطاء بعدّة إشارات، لا باللون وحده. وخانة الاختيار المطلوبة التي تتحوّل إلى الأحمر فقط يسهل أن تفوت."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/web-form-design/","quote":"Errors should be signaled through a variety of cues, not solely through color:"},"scenario":{"en":"Before a first visit at my clinic, patients must agree that we can request their old records. If they skip the checkbox, we only turn its text red. Wael tapped Continue four times.","ar":"قبل الزيارة الأولى في عيادتي، يجب أن يوافق المرضى على أن نطلب سجلّاتهم القديمة. وإن تخطّوا الـ Checkbox، نكتفي بتحويل نصّه إلى الأحمر. وضغط وائل «تابع» أربع مرات."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each version. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل نسخة. أيّها يجب أن تُطلق؟"},"start":"red","options":[{"id":"red","text":{"en":"Keep the red text only","ar":"أبقِ النص الأحمر فقط"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Before your visit","ar":"قبل زيارتك"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"check","text":{"en":"I agree that the clinic can request my old records","ar":"أوافق على أن تطلب العيادة سجلّاتي القديمة"}},{"kind":"small","color":"red","text":{"en":"I agree that the clinic can request my old records","ar":"أوافق على أن تطلب العيادة سجلّاتي القديمة"},"gap":"xs"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Continue","ar":"تابع"}}]}},{"id":"words","text":{"en":"Add an icon and a message under the checkbox","ar":"أضف أيقونة ورسالة تحت الـ Checkbox"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Before your visit","ar":"قبل زيارتك"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"check","text":{"en":"I agree that the clinic can request my old records","ar":"أوافق على أن تطلب العيادة سجلّاتي القديمة"}},{"kind":"small","color":"red","text":{"en":"⚠ We need this to see your past tests. Tick the box to continue.","ar":"⚠ نحتاج هذا لنرى تحاليلك السابقة. علّم الخانة للمتابعة."},"gap":"xs"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Continue","ar":"تابع"}}]}},{"id":"pale","text":{"en":"Keep the red text, and fade the Continue button","ar":"أبقِ النص الأحمر، واجعل زر «تابع» باهتًا"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Before your visit","ar":"قبل زيارتك"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"check","text":{"en":"I agree that the clinic can request my old records","ar":"أوافق على أن تطلب العيادة سجلّاتي القديمة"}},{"kind":"small","color":"red","text":{"en":"I agree that the clinic can request my old records","ar":"أوافق على أن تطلب العيادة سجلّاتي القديمة"},"gap":"xs"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","tone":"off","text":{"en":"Continue","ar":"تابع"}}]}}],"answer":["words"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-045","when":["red","pale"],"feedback":{"en":"Red text and a faded button are both signals without words. Wael still doesn't know the checkbox is the problem. Say it.","ar":"النص الأحمر والزر الباهت إشارتان بلا كلمات. وما زال وائل لا يعرف أن الـ Checkbox هو المشكلة. اكتب ذلك بالكلمات."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Words and an icon say what's missing, for everyone.","ar":"صحيح. الكلمات والأيقونة توضّح للجميع ما الناقص."},"explain":{"en":"Color supports a message; it can't replace it. Add words that name the problem and an icon that catches the eye.","ar":"اللون يدعم الرسالة؛ ولا يحلّ محلّها. أضف كلمات تذكر المشكلة وأيقونة تلفت النظر."}},{"id":"S12","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P01-U04-06","part":"retest","speaker":"youssef","value":{"en":"Re-test, form errors (NN/g): color shouldn't be the only form of error indication. A quantity that only turns red doesn't say there's a stock limit.","ar":"إعادة اختبار، أخطاء النماذج (NN/g): يجب ألّا يكون اللون الشكل الوحيد لإظهار الخطأ. والكمية التي تتحوّل إلى الأحمر فقط لا تقول إن هناك حدًّا للمخزون."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/errors-forms-design-guidelines/","quote":"shouldn't be used as the only form of error indication"},"scenario":{"en":"In my shop's cart, I have 3 of a lamp left. Doaa typed 5, and the number turned red. She thought red meant a discount and tried to pay.","ar":"في سلّة متجري، بقي عندي 3 قطع من مصباح. كتبت دعاء 5، فتحوّل الرقم إلى الأحمر. وظنّت أن الأحمر يعني خصمًا وحاولت الدفع."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each version. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل نسخة. أيّها يجب أن تُطلق؟"},"start":"red","options":[{"id":"border","text":{"en":"Red number and a red border","ar":"رقم أحمر وإطار أحمر"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Cart","ar":"السلة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Brass desk lamp","ar":"مصباح مكتب نحاسي"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Quantity","ar":"الكمية"},"filled":true,"text":"5","tone":"bad","gap":"xs"}]}},{"id":"red","text":{"en":"Keep the red number only","ar":"أبقِ الرقم الأحمر فقط"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Cart","ar":"السلة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Brass desk lamp","ar":"مصباح مكتب نحاسي"}},{"kind":"small","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Quantity","ar":"الكمية"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"small","weight":"bold","color":"red","text":"5","gap":"xs"}]}},{"id":"words","text":{"en":"Add an icon and a message under the quantity","ar":"أضف أيقونة ورسالة تحت الكمية"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Cart","ar":"السلة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Brass desk lamp","ar":"مصباح مكتب نحاسي"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Quantity","ar":"الكمية"},"filled":true,"text":"5","tone":"bad","error":{"en":"⚠ Only 3 left. Change the quantity to 3 or fewer.","ar":"⚠ بقي 3 فقط. غيّري الكمية إلى 3 أو أقل."},"gap":"xs"}]}}],"answer":["words"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-045","when":["red","border"],"feedback":{"en":"Red can mean a sale, a warning or an error. Doaa read it as a sale. Only words say \"only 3 left\".","ar":"الأحمر قد يعني تخفيضًا أو تحذيرًا أو خطأ. وفهمته دعاء تخفيضًا. والكلمات وحدها تقول «بقي 3 فقط»."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. The words remove the guessing.","ar":"صحيح. الكلمات تُنهي التخمين."},"explain":{"en":"Color has many meanings, and some people can't see it. Words with an icon make an error clear to everyone.","ar":"اللون له معانٍ كثيرة، وبعض الناس لا يرونه. والكلمات مع أيقونة تجعل الخطأ واضحًا للجميع."}},{"id":"S13","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P01-U04-07","part":"retest","speaker":"mona","value":{"en":"Re-test, form errors (NN/g): a summary gives a global understanding of all the errors. On a 20-field application, list them at the top and keep each field marked.","ar":"إعادة اختبار، أخطاء النماذج (NN/g): الملخّص يعطي صورة شاملة عن كل الأخطاء. وفي طلب من 20 حقلًا، اعرضها في قائمة بالأعلى وأبقِ كل حقل معلّمًا."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/errors-forms-design-guidelines/","quote":"A validation summary can give the user a global understanding of all the errors in a form"},"scenario":{"en":"My team designs a university application with 20 fields. After Submit, Hany had 3 errors, but only the first was on screen. He fixed it, submitted, and was sent back twice more.","ar":"يصمّم فريقي طلب التحاق بجامعة فيه 20 حقلًا. وبعد «أرسل»، كان عند هاني 3 أخطاء، لكن الأول فقط كان ظاهرًا على الشاشة. فأصلحه، وأرسل، فأعاده النموذج مرتين أخريين."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each version of the top of the page after Submit. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل نسخة من أعلى الصفحة بعد «أرسل». أيّ نسخة تجعل هاني يعرف كل أخطائه وأماكنها من أول مرة؟"},"start":"inline","options":[{"id":"list","text":{"en":"List all 3 at the top, and mark each field","ar":"اعرض الأخطاء الثلاثة في قائمة بالأعلى، وعلّم كل حقل"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"jamia","name":{"en":"Jami'a","ar":"جامعة"},"color":"#1C3D6E","icon":"graduation-cap","domain":"jamia.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"jamia.example/apply","blocks":[{"kind":"banner","tone":"bad","text":{"en":"3 answers need a fix: Secondary school grade, Second-choice major, Guardian's phone.","ar":"3 إجابات تحتاج إصلاحًا: مجموع الثانوية، التخصّص الثاني، هاتف ولي الأمر."}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Secondary school grade (%)","ar":"مجموع الثانوية (%)"},"filled":true,"text":"948","tone":"bad","error":{"en":"⚠ Enter a percentage up to 100, like 94.8.","ar":"⚠ اكتب نسبة حتى 100، مثل 94.8."},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"18 more fields below","ar":"18 حقلًا آخر بالأسفل"},"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"inline","text":{"en":"Keep it: only mark each field","ar":"أبقِ الصفحة كما هي: علّم كل حقل فقط"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"jamia","name":{"en":"Jami'a","ar":"جامعة"},"color":"#1C3D6E","icon":"graduation-cap","domain":"jamia.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"jamia.example/apply","blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Secondary school grade (%)","ar":"مجموع الثانوية (%)"},"filled":true,"text":"948","tone":"bad","error":{"en":"⚠ Enter a percentage up to 100, like 94.8.","ar":"⚠ اكتب نسبة حتى 100، مثل 94.8."}},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"18 more fields below","ar":"18 حقلًا آخر بالأسفل"},"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"count","text":{"en":"Say \"3 errors\" at the top, and mark each field","ar":"اكتب «3 أخطاء» بالأعلى، وعلّم كل حقل"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"jamia","name":{"en":"Jami'a","ar":"جامعة"},"color":"#1C3D6E","icon":"graduation-cap","domain":"jamia.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"jamia.example/apply","blocks":[{"kind":"banner","tone":"bad","text":{"en":"The form has 3 errors.","ar":"النموذج فيه 3 أخطاء."}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Secondary school grade (%)","ar":"مجموع الثانوية (%)"},"filled":true,"text":"948","tone":"bad","error":{"en":"⚠ Enter a percentage up to 100, like 94.8.","ar":"⚠ اكتب نسبة حتى 100، مثل 94.8."},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"18 more fields below","ar":"18 حقلًا آخر بالأسفل"},"gap":"s"}]}}],"answer":["list"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-046","when":["inline"],"feedback":{"en":"Hany sees one error and thinks it's the only one. Nothing on screen says two more are waiting.","ar":"يرى هاني خطأ واحدًا ويظن أنه الوحيد. ولا شيء على الشاشة يوضّح أن خطأين آخرين ينتظرانه."}},{"id":"MC-P01-046","when":["count"],"feedback":{"en":"Now he knows there are 3, but has to hunt through 18 fields for the other two. Name them.","ar":"الآن يعرف أنها 3، لكن عليه أن يبحث بين 18 حقلًا عن الاثنين الآخرين. اذكرهما."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. He knows how many and where, and each field explains itself.","ar":"صحيح. يعرف عدد الأخطاء وأماكنها، وكل حقل يشرح مشكلته."},"explain":{"en":"On long forms: a list at the top that names each field, plus the message on the field itself.","ar":"في النماذج الطويلة: قائمة بالأعلى تذكر كل حقل، مع الرسالة على الحقل نفسه."}},{"id":"S14","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P01-U04-07","part":"retest","speaker":"tarek","value":{"en":"Re-test, form errors (NN/g): the summary gives the overview, but people still fix errors at the field. A summary alone leaves Rasha searching for what to change.","ar":"إعادة اختبار، أخطاء النماذج (NN/g): الملخّص يعطي الصورة العامة، لكن الناس ما زالوا يُصلحون الأخطاء عند الحقل. والملخّص وحده يترك رشا تبحث عمّا تغيّره."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/errors-forms-design-guidelines/","quote":"A validation summary can give the user a global understanding of all the errors in a form"},"scenario":{"en":"I manage the product for a car insurance claim form with 18 fields. After Send, we list the errors at the top, but the fields themselves look normal. Rasha scrolled past \"Accident date\" twice without seeing it.","ar":"أنا مدير المنتج لنموذج مطالبة تأمين سيارات فيه 18 حقلًا. وبعد «أرسل»، نعرض الأخطاء في قائمة بالأعلى، لكن الحقول نفسها تبدو عادية. ومرّت رشا على «تاريخ الحادث» مرتين دون أن تراه."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each version of the \"Accident date\" field, further down the page. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل نسخة لحقل «تاريخ الحادث»، في أسفل الصفحة. أيّ نسخة تجعل رشا تلاحظ الحقل وتعرف ما الخطأ فيه؟"},"start":"plain","options":[{"id":"plain","text":{"en":"Keep it: the list at the top is enough","ar":"أبقِ الحقل كما هو: القائمة في الأعلى تكفي"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"aman","name":{"en":"Aman","ar":"أمان"},"color":"#364FC7","icon":"shield-check","domain":"aman.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"aman.example/claim","blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Police report number","ar":"رقم المحضر"},"filled":true,"text":"7731/2026"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Accident date","ar":"تاريخ الحادث"},"filled":true,"text":"30/11/2026","gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"redonly","text":{"en":"Turn the date field's border red","ar":"حوّل إطار حقل التاريخ إلى الأحمر"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"aman","name":{"en":"Aman","ar":"أمان"},"color":"#364FC7","icon":"shield-check","domain":"aman.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"aman.example/claim","blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Police report number","ar":"رقم المحضر"},"filled":true,"text":"7731/2026"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Accident date","ar":"تاريخ الحادث"},"filled":true,"text":"30/11/2026","tone":"bad","gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"marked","text":{"en":"Mark the field and repeat the message under it","ar":"علّم الحقل وكرّر الرسالة تحته"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"aman","name":{"en":"Aman","ar":"أمان"},"color":"#364FC7","icon":"shield-check","domain":"aman.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"aman.example/claim","blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Police report number","ar":"رقم المحضر"},"filled":true,"text":"7731/2026"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Accident date","ar":"تاريخ الحادث"},"filled":true,"text":"30/11/2026","tone":"bad","error":{"en":"⚠ This date hasn't happened yet. Enter the day of the accident, like 30/10/2026.","ar":"⚠ هذا التاريخ لم يأتِ بعد. اكتبي يوم الحادث، مثل 30/10/2026."},"gap":"s"}]}}],"answer":["marked"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-046","when":["plain"],"feedback":{"en":"The list tells Rasha what to look for, but not where it is or what's wrong with it. She needs the message at the field.","ar":"القائمة تخبر رشا عمّا تبحث، لكن ليس أين هو ولا ما مشكلته. وهي تحتاج الرسالة عند الحقل."}},{"id":"MC-P01-045","when":["redonly"],"feedback":{"en":"A red border helps her spot it, but it's still only color, and it doesn't say the date is in the future.","ar":"الإطار الأحمر يساعدها على رؤيته، لكنه ما زال لونًا فقط، ولا يقول إن التاريخ في المستقبل."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. The list says where to go; the field says what to fix.","ar":"صحيح. القائمة تدلّها إلى أين تذهب؛ والحقل يوضّح ماذا تُصلح."},"explain":{"en":"A summary and inline messages do different jobs. Long forms need both.","ar":"الملخّص والرسائل بجوار الحقول يؤدّيان مهام مختلفة. والنماذج الطويلة تحتاج الاثنين."}}]}$uxg$::jsonb),
  ($uxg$P01-U05-B01$uxg$, $uxg$5246c123713e0ca5330645eb9b661dd51fc1c1fc0711798159781cae3c068640$uxg$, $uxg${"id":"P01-U05-B01","mode":"bank","title":{"en":"Re-tests: forms everyone can finish","ar":"إعادة اختبار: نماذج يستطيع الجميع إكمالها"},"steps":[{"id":"S01","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P01-U05-01","part":"retest","speaker":"tarek","value":{"en":"Re-test, keyboard accessibility (NN/g): removing the keyboard focus indicator is catastrophic for keyboard users.","ar":"إعادة اختبار، الإتاحة بلوحة المفاتيح (NN/g): حذف مؤشّر تركيز لوحة المفاتيح كارثة لمستخدميها."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/keyboard-accessibility/","quote":"Removing the keyboard focus indicator is catastrophic for keyboard users."},"scenario":{"en":"I manage the product for a food ordering site. To match the new brand, the team removed the focus ring from all fields. Raafat orders by keyboard and has tabbed into the delivery notes.","ar":"أنا مدير المنتج لموقع طلب طعام. ولتتناسب مع الهوية الجديدة، حذف الفريق إطار التركيز (Focus ring) من كل الحقول. ويطلب رأفت بلوحة المفاتيح، ووصل بـ Tab إلى ملاحظات التوصيل."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each version. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل نسخة. أيّها يجب أن تُطلق؟"},"start":"none","options":[{"id":"none","text":{"en":"Keep it: no focus ring","ar":"اتركه كما هو: بلا إطار تركيز"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"lamma","name":{"en":"Lamma","ar":"لمّة"},"color":"#E03131","icon":"bowl-food","domain":"lamma.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"lamma.example/checkout","blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Address","ar":"العنوان"},"filled":true,"text":{"en":"18 Merghany St","ar":"18 شارع الميرغني"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Notes for the driver","ar":"ملاحظات للسائق"},"text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Place order","ar":"أكّد الطلب"},"gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"ring","text":{"en":"Bring back a clear ring, in the brand color","ar":"أعِد إطارًا واضحًا، بلون الهوية"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"lamma","name":{"en":"Lamma","ar":"لمّة"},"color":"#E03131","icon":"bowl-food","domain":"lamma.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"lamma.example/checkout","blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Address","ar":"العنوان"},"filled":true,"text":{"en":"18 Merghany St","ar":"18 شارع الميرغني"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Notes for the driver","ar":"ملاحظات للسائق"},"text":"","focus":true,"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Place order","ar":"أكّد الطلب"},"gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"cursor","text":{"en":"No ring; the blinking cursor is enough","ar":"بلا إطار؛ المؤشّر الوامض يكفي"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"lamma","name":{"en":"Lamma","ar":"لمّة"},"color":"#E03131","icon":"bowl-food","domain":"lamma.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"lamma.example/checkout","blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Address","ar":"العنوان"},"filled":true,"text":{"en":"18 Merghany St","ar":"18 شارع الميرغني"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Notes for the driver","ar":"ملاحظات للسائق"},"text":"|","filled":true,"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Place order","ar":"أكّد الطلب"},"gap":"m"}]}}],"answer":["ring"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-052","when":["none","cursor"],"feedback":{"en":"A thin cursor is easy to miss, and buttons and links don't have one at all. When Raafat tabs to Place order, nothing would show it.","ar":"المؤشّر الرفيع قد لا يُلاحَظ، والأزرار والروابط ليس فيها مؤشّر أصلًا. وحين يصل رأفت بـ Tab إلى «أكّد الطلب»، لن يظهر أي شيء."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. The ring can match the brand and still be clear.","ar":"صحيح. الإطار يمكن أن يناسب الهوية ويظل واضحًا."},"explain":{"en":"Restyle the focus ring if you want, but never remove it. It's the only way keyboard users see where they are.","ar":"غيّر شكل إطار التركيز إن أردت، لكن لا تحذفه أبدًا. فهو الوسيلة الوحيدة التي يعرف بها مستخدمو لوحة المفاتيح موضعهم في الصفحة."}},{"id":"S02","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P01-U05-01","part":"retest","speaker":"hana","value":{"en":"Re-test, keyboard accessibility (NN/g): losing the focus indicator is catastrophic. A ring the same color as the border is, in practice, no ring.","ar":"إعادة اختبار، الإتاحة بلوحة المفاتيح (NN/g): فقدان مؤشّر التركيز كارثة. والإطار بلون الحدود نفسه هو عمليًا لا إطار."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/keyboard-accessibility/","quote":"Removing the keyboard focus indicator is catastrophic for keyboard users."},"scenario":{"en":"On my gym's site, the focused field's border turns from light grey to a slightly darker grey. Amal, who uses the keyboard, said she keeps losing her place.","ar":"في موقع نادينا، حين يكون التركيز (Focus) على حقل، يتحوّل إطاره من رمادي فاتح إلى رمادي أغمق قليلًا. وقالت آمال، التي تستخدم لوحة المفاتيح، إنها تفقد مكانها باستمرار."},"prompt":{"en":"Tab is on \"Preferred time\". Try each version. Which one should ship?","ar":"Tab الآن على «الوقت المفضّل». جرّب كل نسخة. أيّ نسخة تجعل آمال ترى بوضوح الحقل الذي هي فيه؟"},"start":"grey","options":[{"id":"ring","text":{"en":"A thick ring in a strong color, with a small gap around the field","ar":"إطار عريض بلون قوي، مع مسافة صغيرة حول الحقل"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"nashat.example/book","blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Class","ar":"الحصة"},"filled":true,"text":{"en":"Spinning","ar":"سبينينج"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Preferred time","ar":"الوقت المفضّل"},"text":"","focus":true,"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"grey","text":{"en":"Keep the slightly darker grey border","ar":"أبقِ الإطار الرمادي الأغمق قليلًا"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"nashat.example/book","blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Class","ar":"الحصة"},"filled":true,"text":{"en":"Spinning","ar":"سبينينج"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Preferred time","ar":"الوقت المفضّل"},"text":"","gap":"s","ring":"faint"}]}},{"id":"labelbold","text":{"en":"Keep the border, and make the label bold","ar":"أبقِ الإطار، واجعل اسم الحقل بخط عريض"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"nashat.example/book","blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Class","ar":"الحصة"},"filled":true,"text":{"en":"Spinning","ar":"سبينينج"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Preferred time","ar":"الوقت المفضّل"},"text":"","gap":"s"}]}}],"answer":["ring"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-052","when":["grey","labelbold"],"feedback":{"en":"Look at the preview: can you tell which field Amal is in? Labels are already bold and the grey barely changes. Focus has to stand out.","ar":"انظر إلى المعاينة: هل تعرف في أي حقل آمال؟ أسماء الحقول بخط عريض أصلًا، والرمادي بالكاد يتغيّر. والتركيز يجب أن يبرز."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. You can spot it in a second.","ar":"صحيح. تلاحظه في ثانية."},"explain":{"en":"A focus style only works if it's obvious at a glance: strong color, enough thickness, around the element itself.","ar":"شكل التركيز لا ينجح إلا إن كان واضحًا بنظرة: لون قوي، وسُمك كافٍ، حول العنصر نفسه."}},{"id":"S03","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P01-U05-02","part":"retest","speaker":"mona","value":{"en":"Re-test, keyboard accessibility (NN/g): tab order is normally coded to reflect the layout, top to bottom. A newsletter box in the middle of the order breaks the path.","ar":"إعادة اختبار، الإتاحة بلوحة المفاتيح (NN/g): ترتيب Tab يُبرمَج عادةً ليعكس التخطيط، من أعلى إلى أسفل. ومربع النشرة البريدية في منتصف الترتيب يكسر المسار."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/keyboard-accessibility/","quote":"On most websites the tab order will be coded to reflect the page layout; that is top to bottom and left to right."},"scenario":{"en":"My team designs a university's contact form. The footer's newsletter field sits at the bottom of the page, but Tab goes there right after the Name field. Osama typed his question into it.","ar":"يصمّم فريقي نموذج التواصل لجامعة. وحقل النشرة البريدية في أسفل الصفحة، لكن Tab يذهب إليه بعد حقل الاسم مباشرة. فكتب أسامة سؤاله فيه."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each tab order. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل ترتيب لـ Tab. أيّ ترتيب يمرّ بالحقول كما يراها أسامة من أعلى إلى أسفل؟"},"start":"jump","options":[{"id":"jump","text":{"en":"Keep it: Name, then the footer, then back up","ar":"اتركه كما هو: الاسم، ثم أسفل الصفحة، ثم العودة لأعلى"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"jamia","name":{"en":"Jami'a","ar":"جامعة"},"color":"#1C3D6E","icon":"graduation-cap","domain":"jamia.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"jamia.example/contact","blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Name","ar":"الاسم"},"text":""},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Your question","ar":"سؤالك"},"text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Send","ar":"أرسل"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"divider","gap":"l"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Newsletter email","ar":"بريد النشرة"},"text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"small","color":"brand","text":{"en":"Tab goes: Name → Newsletter email → Your question → Send","ar":"ترتيب Tab: الاسم ← بريد النشرة ← سؤالك ← أرسل"},"gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"page","text":{"en":"Top to bottom: the form, then the footer","ar":"من أعلى إلى أسفل: النموذج، ثم أسفل الصفحة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"jamia","name":{"en":"Jami'a","ar":"جامعة"},"color":"#1C3D6E","icon":"graduation-cap","domain":"jamia.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"jamia.example/contact","blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Name","ar":"الاسم"},"text":""},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Your question","ar":"سؤالك"},"text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Send","ar":"أرسل"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"divider","gap":"l"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Newsletter email","ar":"بريد النشرة"},"text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"small","color":"brand","text":{"en":"Tab goes: Name → Your question → Send → Newsletter email","ar":"ترتيب Tab: الاسم ← سؤالك ← أرسل ← بريد النشرة"},"gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"label","text":{"en":"Keep the order, and label the footer box more clearly","ar":"أبقِ الترتيب، وأوضح عنوان مربع الأسفل"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"jamia","name":{"en":"Jami'a","ar":"جامعة"},"color":"#1C3D6E","icon":"graduation-cap","domain":"jamia.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"jamia.example/contact","blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Name","ar":"الاسم"},"text":""},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Your question","ar":"سؤالك"},"text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Send","ar":"أرسل"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"divider","gap":"l"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Newsletter email (not for questions)","ar":"بريد النشرة (ليس للأسئلة)"},"text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"small","color":"brand","text":{"en":"Tab goes: Name → Newsletter email → Your question → Send","ar":"ترتيب Tab: الاسم ← بريد النشرة ← سؤالك ← أرسل"},"gap":"m"}]}}],"answer":["page"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-053","when":["jump","label"],"feedback":{"en":"Osama follows Tab, not the page. A clearer label doesn't stop the jump. Make Tab go down the page in order.","ar":"أسامة يتبع Tab، لا الصفحة. والعنوان الأوضح لا يمنع القفزة. اجعل Tab ينزل في الصفحة بالترتيب."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Tab now reads the page like Osama does.","ar":"صحيح. Tab الآن يمرّ بالصفحة بالترتيب الذي يقرؤها به أسامة."},"explain":{"en":"Tab should never jump to another part of the page and back. Match the order people see.","ar":"يجب ألّا يقفز Tab إلى جزء آخر من الصفحة ثم يعود. طابِق الترتيب الذي يراه الناس."}},{"id":"S04","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P01-U05-02","part":"retest","speaker":"youssef","value":{"en":"Re-test, keyboard accessibility (NN/g): tab order is normally coded to reflect the layout. City first and street last is backwards from what the form shows.","ar":"إعادة اختبار، الإتاحة بلوحة المفاتيح (NN/g): ترتيب Tab يُبرمَج عادةً ليعكس التخطيط. والمدينة أولًا والشارع أخيرًا عكس ما يعرضه النموذج."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/keyboard-accessibility/","quote":"On most websites the tab order will be coded to reflect the page layout; that is top to bottom and left to right."},"scenario":{"en":"My shop's address form shows Street, Building, then City. Tab goes City, Street, Building. Mervat typed her street name into City.","ar":"نموذج العنوان في متجري يعرض الشارع، ثم العمارة، ثم المدينة. وTab يذهب: المدينة، الشارع، العمارة. فكتبت ميرفت اسم شارعها في المدينة."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each tab order. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل ترتيب لـ Tab. أيّها يجب أن يُطلق؟"},"start":"city","options":[{"id":"move","text":{"en":"Move City to the top of the screen","ar":"انقل المدينة إلى أعلى الشاشة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"dar.example/address","blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"City","ar":"المدينة"},"text":""},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Street","ar":"الشارع"},"text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Building","ar":"العمارة"},"text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"small","color":"brand","text":{"en":"Tab goes: City → Street → Building","ar":"ترتيب Tab: المدينة ← الشارع ← العمارة"},"gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"city","text":{"en":"Keep it: City first for Tab","ar":"اتركه كما هو: المدينة أولًا في ترتيب Tab"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"dar.example/address","blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Street","ar":"الشارع"},"text":""},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Building","ar":"العمارة"},"text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"City","ar":"المدينة"},"text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"small","color":"brand","text":{"en":"Tab goes: City → Street → Building","ar":"ترتيب Tab: المدينة ← الشارع ← العمارة"},"gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"page","text":{"en":"Fix the code: Street, Building, City","ar":"أصلح الكود: الشارع، العمارة، المدينة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"dar.example/address","blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Street","ar":"الشارع"},"text":""},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Building","ar":"العمارة"},"text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"City","ar":"المدينة"},"text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"small","color":"brand","text":{"en":"Tab goes: Street → Building → City","ar":"ترتيب Tab: الشارع ← العمارة ← المدينة"},"gap":"m"}]}}],"answer":["page"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-053","when":["city"],"feedback":{"en":"Mervat reads Street first and types it, but Tab put her in City. The order has to match the screen.","ar":"تقرأ ميرفت «الشارع» أولًا فتكتبه، لكن Tab وضعها في المدينة. والترتيب يجب أن يطابق الشاشة."}},{"id":"MC-P01-053","when":["move"],"feedback":{"en":"It matches, but the layout was fine. Changing the screen for everyone to hide a code problem is backwards. Fix the code.","ar":"متطابق، لكن التخطيط كان سليمًا. وتغيير الشاشة للجميع لإخفاء مشكلة في الكود عكس المطلوب. أصلح الكود."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. The screen stays, and Tab follows it.","ar":"صحيح. الشاشة تبقى، وTab يتبعها."},"explain":{"en":"Decide the layout for people, then make the code follow it.","ar":"حدّد التخطيط من أجل الناس، ثم اجعل الكود يتبعه."}},{"id":"S05","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P01-U05-03","part":"retest","speaker":"rami","value":{"en":"Re-test, keyboard accessibility (NN/g): using only HTML links, buttons and form fields makes sure every element can be tabbed to. Star pictures aren't any of those.","ar":"إعادة اختبار، الإتاحة بلوحة المفاتيح (NN/g): استخدام روابط وأزرار وحقول HTML فقط يضمن أن يصل Tab إلى كل عنصر. وصور النجوم ليست منها."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/keyboard-accessibility/","quote":"Alternatively, using only HTML links, buttons, and form fields will ensure that all elements can be tabbed to."},"scenario":{"en":"I'm designing the review form for a delivery app. The 5 stars are pictures with a click script. Bahaa rates by keyboard, and Tab skips the stars, so his review can't be sent.","ar":"أصمّم نموذج التقييم لتطبيق توصيل. والنجوم الخمس صور مع كود للضغط. ويقيّم بهاء بلوحة المفاتيح، وTab يتخطّى النجوم، فلا يمكن إرسال تقييمه."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each version. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل نسخة. أيّها يجب أن تُطلق؟"},"start":"pics","options":[{"id":"pics","text":{"en":"Keep the star pictures","ar":"أبقِ صور النجوم"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"lamma","name":{"en":"Lamma","ar":"لمّة"},"color":"#E03131","icon":"bowl-food","domain":"lamma.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Rate your order","ar":"قيّم طلبك"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Rate your delivery","ar":"قيّم التوصيل"}},{"kind":"heading","text":"☆ ☆ ☆ ☆ ☆","gap":"xs"},{"kind":"small","color":"brand","text":{"en":"Tab goes: Comment → Send (stars skipped)","ar":"ترتيب Tab: تعليق ← أرسل (يتخطّى النجوم)"},"gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"bigger","text":{"en":"Make the stars bigger and yellow","ar":"اجعل النجوم أكبر وصفراء"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"lamma","name":{"en":"Lamma","ar":"لمّة"},"color":"#E03131","icon":"bowl-food","domain":"lamma.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Rate your order","ar":"قيّم طلبك"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Rate your delivery","ar":"قيّم التوصيل"}},{"kind":"title","color":"orange","text":"☆ ☆ ☆ ☆ ☆","gap":"xs"},{"kind":"small","color":"brand","text":{"en":"Tab goes: Comment → Send (stars skipped)","ar":"ترتيب Tab: تعليق ← أرسل (يتخطّى النجوم)"},"gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"radios","text":{"en":"Build the stars as 5 real radio buttons","ar":"ابنِ النجوم كـ 5 Radio buttons حقيقية"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"lamma","name":{"en":"Lamma","ar":"لمّة"},"color":"#E03131","icon":"bowl-food","domain":"lamma.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Rate your order","ar":"قيّم طلبك"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Rate your delivery","ar":"قيّم التوصيل"}},{"kind":"heading","text":"★ ★ ★ ★ ☆","gap":"xs"},{"kind":"small","color":"brand","text":{"en":"Tab goes: Stars (arrows to choose 1 to 5) → Comment → Send","ar":"ترتيب Tab: النجوم (الأسهم للاختيار من 1 إلى 5) ← تعليق ← أرسل"},"gap":"m"}]}}],"answer":["radios"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-054","when":["pics","bigger"],"feedback":{"en":"Bigger, brighter pictures are still pictures. Tab skips them, and Bahaa can't send a review.","ar":"الصور الأكبر والأفتح ما زالت صورًا. وTab يتخطّاها، فلا يستطيع بهاء إرسال التقييم."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Same stars on screen, now on the Tab path.","ar":"صحيح. النجوم نفسها على الشاشة، والآن يصل إليها Tab."},"explain":{"en":"Any clickable thing needs to be built from a real control. The look can stay the same.","ar":"أي شيء قابل للضغط يجب أن يُبنى من عنصر حقيقي. ويمكن أن يبقى الشكل كما هو."}},{"id":"S06","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P01-U05-03","part":"retest","speaker":"nour","value":{"en":"Re-test, keyboard accessibility (NN/g): keyboard users must be able to access all interactive elements. Doctor cards that only respond to a click lock them out of booking.","ar":"إعادة اختبار، الإتاحة بلوحة المفاتيح (NN/g): يجب أن يصل مستخدمو لوحة المفاتيح إلى كل العناصر التفاعلية. وبطاقات الأطباء التي لا تستجيب إلا للضغط تمنعهم من الحجز."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/keyboard-accessibility/","quote":"Keyboard users must be able to access all interactive elements, not just the main navigation or in-line links."},"scenario":{"en":"On my clinic's site, patients choose a doctor by clicking a card. The cards are plain boxes in the code. Medhat, who uses the keyboard, can't select any doctor.","ar":"في موقع عيادتي، يختار المرضى الطبيب بالضغط على بطاقة. والبطاقات مربعات عادية في الكود. ومدحت، الذي يستخدم لوحة المفاتيح، لا يستطيع اختيار أي طبيب."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each version. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل نسخة. أيّها يجب أن تُطلق؟"},"start":"cards","options":[{"id":"cards","text":{"en":"Keep the plain cards","ar":"أبقِ البطاقات العادية"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"raha.example/doctors","blocks":[{"kind":"group","blocks":[{"kind":"small","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Dr. Safaa Hamed · Skin","ar":"د. صفاء حامد · جلدية"}}]},{"kind":"group","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"small","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Dr. Ayman Fouad · Bones","ar":"د. أيمن فؤاد · عظام"}}]},{"kind":"small","color":"brand","text":{"en":"Tab goes: Book (cards skipped)","ar":"ترتيب Tab: احجز (يتخطّى البطاقات)"},"gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"hover","text":{"en":"Add a shadow when the mouse hovers","ar":"أضف ظلًّا حين يمرّ الماوس فوقها"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"raha.example/doctors","blocks":[{"kind":"group","tone":"tint","blocks":[{"kind":"small","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Dr. Safaa Hamed · Skin","ar":"د. صفاء حامد · جلدية"}}]},{"kind":"group","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"small","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Dr. Ayman Fouad · Bones","ar":"د. أيمن فؤاد · عظام"}}]},{"kind":"small","color":"brand","text":{"en":"Tab goes: Book (cards skipped)","ar":"ترتيب Tab: احجز (يتخطّى البطاقات)"},"gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"radio","text":{"en":"Put a real radio button in each card","ar":"ضع Radio button حقيقيًا في كل بطاقة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"raha.example/doctors","blocks":[{"kind":"group","blocks":[{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Dr. Safaa Hamed · Skin","ar":"د. صفاء حامد · جلدية"}}]},{"kind":"group","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Dr. Ayman Fouad · Bones","ar":"د. أيمن فؤاد · عظام"}}]},{"kind":"small","color":"brand","text":{"en":"Tab goes: Doctors (arrows to choose) → Book","ar":"ترتيب Tab: الأطباء (الأسهم للاختيار) ← احجز"},"gap":"m"}]}}],"answer":["radio"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-054","when":["cards","hover"],"feedback":{"en":"A hover shadow helps mouse users only. Medhat still can't reach a card, so he can't choose a doctor.","ar":"ظل المرور يساعد مستخدمي الماوس فقط. وما زال مدحت لا يصل إلى أي بطاقة، فلا يستطيع اختيار طبيب."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. The cards keep their look and join the Tab path.","ar":"صحيح. البطاقات تحتفظ بشكلها، والآن يصل إليها Tab."},"explain":{"en":"A choice people click must be a real control underneath: a radio, checkbox, button or link.","ar":"الاختيار الذي يضغطه الناس يجب أن يكون عنصرًا حقيقيًا في الأساس: Radio أو Checkbox أو زر أو رابط."}},{"id":"S07","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P01-U05-04","part":"retest","speaker":"sara","value":{"en":"Re-test, keyboard accessibility (NN/g): people must be able to close pop-ups, or they're stuck inside them.","ar":"إعادة اختبار، الإتاحة بلوحة المفاتيح (NN/g): يجب أن يستطيع الناس إغلاق النوافذ المنبثقة، وإلا علقوا بداخلها."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/keyboard-accessibility/","quote":"It is extremely important for users to be able to close pop-ups or they will be stuck inside them."},"scenario":{"en":"I'm designing a furniture shop's product page. Tapping a photo opens it full screen. On a computer, it closes only by clicking the small × image. Lamia uses the keyboard and couldn't get back to the order form.","ar":"أصمّم صفحة منتج لمتجر أثاث. الضغط على صورة يفتحها بملء الشاشة. وعلى الكمبيوتر، لا تُغلق إلا بالضغط على صورة × صغيرة. ولمياء تستخدم لوحة المفاتيح ولم تستطع العودة إلى نموذج الطلب."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each version. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل نسخة. أيّها يجب أن تُطلق؟"},"start":"ximg","options":[{"id":"ximg","text":{"en":"Keep the × image","ar":"أبقِ صورة الـ ×"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"beit","name":{"en":"Beit","ar":"بيت"},"color":"#8B5E34","icon":"armchair","domain":"beit.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"beit.example/sofas","blocks":[{"kind":"group","blocks":[{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":"×"},{"kind":"image","size":"m","text":{"en":"Sofa, side view","ar":"كنبة، منظر جانبي"},"gap":"xs"}]},{"kind":"small","color":"brand","text":{"en":"Tab: nothing to reach (stuck)","ar":"Tab: لا يوجد عنصر يصل إليه (عالقة)"},"gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"close","text":{"en":"Make × a real Close button, and let Esc close it","ar":"اجعل × زر إغلاق حقيقيًا، ودع Esc يغلقها"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"beit","name":{"en":"Beit","ar":"بيت"},"color":"#8B5E34","icon":"armchair","domain":"beit.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"beit.example/sofas","blocks":[{"kind":"group","blocks":[{"kind":"button","style":"plain","text":{"en":"× Close","ar":"× إغلاق"}},{"kind":"image","size":"m","text":{"en":"Sofa, side view","ar":"كنبة، منظر جانبي"},"gap":"xs"}]},{"kind":"small","color":"brand","text":{"en":"Tab goes: Close. Esc closes it too, and focus returns to the photo.","ar":"ترتيب Tab: إغلاق. وEsc يغلقها أيضًا، ويعود التركيز إلى الصورة."},"gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"big","text":{"en":"Make the × image bigger","ar":"كبّر صورة الـ ×"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"beit","name":{"en":"Beit","ar":"بيت"},"color":"#8B5E34","icon":"armchair","domain":"beit.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"beit.example/sofas","blocks":[{"kind":"group","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":"×"},{"kind":"image","size":"m","text":{"en":"Sofa, side view","ar":"كنبة، منظر جانبي"},"gap":"xs"}]},{"kind":"small","color":"brand","text":{"en":"Tab: nothing to reach (stuck)","ar":"Tab: لا يوجد عنصر يصل إليه (عالقة)"},"gap":"m"}]}}],"answer":["close"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-055","when":["ximg","big"],"feedback":{"en":"A bigger picture of an × is still a picture. Tab can't reach it, and Esc does nothing, so Lamia stays stuck.","ar":"صورة الـ × الأكبر ما زالت صورة. لا يصل إليها Tab، وEsc لا يفعل شيئًا، فتبقى لمياء عالقة."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Two keyboard exits, and she's back at the photo.","ar":"صحيح. مخرجان بلوحة المفاتيح، وتعود إلى الصورة."},"explain":{"en":"Every pop-up needs a real Close button and Esc, and should return focus to where it opened.","ar":"كل نافذة منبثقة (Pop-up) تحتاج زر إغلاق حقيقيًا وEsc، ويجب أن تُعيد التركيز إلى المكان الذي فُتحت منه."}},{"id":"S08","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P01-U05-04","part":"retest","speaker":"karim","value":{"en":"Re-test, keyboard accessibility (NN/g): people must be able to close pop-ups. A menu that closes only by swiping traps keyboard users.","ar":"إعادة اختبار، الإتاحة بلوحة المفاتيح (NN/g): يجب أن يستطيع الناس إغلاق النوافذ المنبثقة. والقائمة التي لا تُغلق إلا بالسحب تحبس مستخدمي لوحة المفاتيح."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/keyboard-accessibility/","quote":"It is extremely important for users to be able to close pop-ups or they will be stuck inside them."},"scenario":{"en":"I'm building a pharmacy's web app. The side menu slides over the order form and closes only by swiping it away. Emad, on a tablet with a keyboard, opened it and couldn't close it.","ar":"أبني تطبيق ويب لصيدلية. القائمة الجانبية تنزلق فوق نموذج الطلب، ولا تُغلق إلا بسحبها بعيدًا. وعماد، الذي يستخدم جهازًا لوحيًا مع لوحة مفاتيح، فتحها ولم يستطع إغلاقها."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each version of the menu. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل نسخة للقائمة. أيّ نسخة يستطيع بها عماد إغلاق القائمة بلوحة المفاتيح؟"},"start":"swipe","options":[{"id":"swipe","text":{"en":"Keep it: swipe to close","ar":"اتركها كما هي: اسحب للإغلاق"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dawaa","name":{"en":"Dawaa Pharmacy","ar":"صيدلية دواء"},"color":"#059669","icon":"pill","domain":"dawaa.example"},"frame":"tablet","appbar":{"title":{"en":"New order","ar":"طلب جديد"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"group","blocks":[{"kind":"link","text":{"en":"My orders","ar":"طلباتي"}},{"kind":"link","text":{"en":"Prescriptions","ar":"الروشتات"},"gap":"s"}]},{"kind":"small","color":"brand","text":{"en":"Tab goes: My orders → Prescriptions → My orders … (stuck)","ar":"ترتيب Tab: طلباتي ← الروشتات ← طلباتي … (عالق)"},"gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"hint","text":{"en":"Keep swipe, and add \"Swipe left to close\"","ar":"أبقِ السحب، وأضف «اسحب لليسار للإغلاق»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dawaa","name":{"en":"Dawaa Pharmacy","ar":"صيدلية دواء"},"color":"#059669","icon":"pill","domain":"dawaa.example"},"frame":"tablet","appbar":{"title":{"en":"New order","ar":"طلب جديد"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"group","blocks":[{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Swipe to close","ar":"اسحب للإغلاق"}},{"kind":"link","text":{"en":"My orders","ar":"طلباتي"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"link","text":{"en":"Prescriptions","ar":"الروشتات"},"gap":"s"}]},{"kind":"small","color":"brand","text":{"en":"Tab goes: My orders → Prescriptions → My orders … (stuck)","ar":"ترتيب Tab: طلباتي ← الروشتات ← طلباتي … (عالق)"},"gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"close","text":{"en":"Add a Close button first in the menu, and let Esc close it","ar":"أضف زر إغلاق في أول القائمة، ودع Esc يغلقها"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dawaa","name":{"en":"Dawaa Pharmacy","ar":"صيدلية دواء"},"color":"#059669","icon":"pill","domain":"dawaa.example"},"frame":"tablet","appbar":{"title":{"en":"New order","ar":"طلب جديد"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"group","blocks":[{"kind":"button","style":"plain","text":{"en":"Close menu","ar":"أغلق القائمة"}},{"kind":"link","text":{"en":"My orders","ar":"طلباتي"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"link","text":{"en":"Prescriptions","ar":"الروشتات"},"gap":"s"}]},{"kind":"small","color":"brand","text":{"en":"Tab goes: Close menu → My orders → Prescriptions. Esc closes it too.","ar":"ترتيب Tab: أغلق القائمة ← طلباتي ← الروشتات. وEsc يغلقها أيضًا."},"gap":"m"}]}}],"answer":["close"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-055","when":["swipe","hint"],"feedback":{"en":"Swiping needs a touch screen. Emad is on the keyboard, so telling him to swipe doesn't help. Swipe can stay, as long as Close and Esc work too.","ar":"السحب يحتاج شاشة لمس. وعماد يستخدم لوحة المفاتيح، فإخباره بالسحب لا يفيد. يمكن أن يبقى السحب، بشرط أن يعمل زر الإغلاق وEsc أيضًا."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Swipe for touch, Close and Esc for the keyboard.","ar":"صحيح. السحب للمس، وزر الإغلاق وEsc للوحة المفاتيح."},"explain":{"en":"Gestures are extra ways out, never the only one. A Close button and Esc work for everyone.","ar":"الإيماءات طرق إضافية للخروج، لا الطريقة الوحيدة أبدًا. وزر الإغلاق وEsc يعملان للجميع."}},{"id":"S09","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P01-U05-05","part":"retest","speaker":"tarek","value":{"en":"Re-test, touch targets (NN/g): the minimum size should be 1 cm × 1 cm. Rating numbers 5 mm wide are half that.","ar":"إعادة اختبار، أهداف اللمس (NN/g): الحد الأدنى للحجم 1 سم × 1 سم. وأرقام التقييم التي عرضها 5 مم نصف ذلك."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/touch-target-size/","quote":"its minimum size should be 1cm × 1cm (0.4in x 0.4in)"},"scenario":{"en":"I manage the product for a ride app. After each ride, people rate the driver from 1 to 5. Each number is about 5 mm wide. Hazem gave a driver 4 when he meant 5.","ar":"أنا مدير المنتج لتطبيق مشاوير. بعد كل مشوار، يقيّم الناس السائق من 1 إلى 5. وعرض كل رقم نحو 5 مم. فأعطى حازم السائق 4 وهو يقصد 5."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each version. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل نسخة. أيّها يجب أن تُطلق؟"},"start":"small","options":[{"id":"small","text":{"en":"Keep the small numbers","ar":"أبقِ الأرقام الصغيرة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"mishwar","name":{"en":"Mishwar","ar":"مشوار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"car","domain":"mishwar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Rate your ride","ar":"قيّم مشوارك"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Rate your driver","ar":"قيّم السائق"}},{"kind":"row","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"chip","tone":"off","text":"1"},{"kind":"chip","tone":"off","text":"2"},{"kind":"chip","tone":"off","text":"3"},{"kind":"chip","tone":"off","text":"4"},{"kind":"chip","tone":"off","text":"5"}]}]}},{"id":"big","text":{"en":"Make each number a button at least 1 cm wide and tall","ar":"اجعل كل رقم زرًا عرضه وارتفاعه 1 سم على الأقل"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"mishwar","name":{"en":"Mishwar","ar":"مشوار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"car","domain":"mishwar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Rate your ride","ar":"قيّم مشوارك"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Rate your driver","ar":"قيّم السائق"}},{"kind":"row","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"button","emphasis":"low","text":"1"},{"kind":"button","emphasis":"low","text":"2"},{"kind":"button","emphasis":"low","text":"3"},{"kind":"button","emphasis":"low","text":"4"},{"kind":"button","emphasis":"low","text":"5"}]}]}},{"id":"confirm","text":{"en":"Keep them small, and ask \"Did you mean 4?\" after each tap","ar":"أبقِها صغيرة، واسأل «هل تقصد 4؟» بعد كل ضغطة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"mishwar","name":{"en":"Mishwar","ar":"مشوار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"car","domain":"mishwar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Rate your ride","ar":"قيّم مشوارك"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Rate your driver","ar":"قيّم السائق"}},{"kind":"row","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"chip","tone":"off","text":"1"},{"kind":"chip","tone":"off","text":"2"},{"kind":"chip","tone":"off","text":"3"},{"kind":"chip","tone":"dark","text":"4"},{"kind":"chip","tone":"off","text":"5"}]},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Did you mean 4? Yes / No","ar":"هل تقصد 4؟ نعم / لا"},"gap":"s"}]}}],"answer":["big"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-056","when":["small","confirm"],"feedback":{"en":"The numbers are still about 5 mm, so mis-taps keep happening. A question after every tap makes everyone pay for a target that's too small.","ar":"الأرقام ما زالت نحو 5 مم، فتستمر الضغطات الخاطئة. والسؤال بعد كل ضغطة يجعل الجميع يدفع ثمن هدف صغير جدًا."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Each number now fits a fingertip.","ar":"صحيح. كل رقم الآن يناسب طرف الإصبع."},"explain":{"en":"Fix the size of the target, not the consequences of missing it.","ar":"كبّر الهدف نفسه، بدل معالجة ما يحدث حين يُخطئه الناس."}},{"id":"S10","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P01-U05-05","part":"retest","speaker":"hana","value":{"en":"Re-test, touch targets (NN/g): to avoid accidental taps, targets must be big enough and also spaced well enough.","ar":"إعادة اختبار، أهداف اللمس (NN/g): لتجنّب الضغطات العرضية، يجب أن تكون الأهداف كبيرة بما يكفي ومتباعدة بما يكفي أيضًا."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/touch-target-size/","quote":"To avoid accidental taps, targets must first be big enough, and then also spaced well enough"},"scenario":{"en":"In my gym's app, members pick their training days from 7 checkboxes in one tight row. Nevine ticked Wednesday every time she meant Thursday.","ar":"في تطبيق نادينا، يختار الأعضاء أيام التمرين من 7 خانات اختيار (Checkboxes) في صف واحد ضيق. وكانت نيفين تختار الأربعاء كل مرة تقصد فيها الخميس."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each version. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل نسخة. أيّها يجب أن تُطلق؟"},"start":"row","options":[{"id":"row","text":{"en":"Keep the 7 boxes in one tight row","ar":"أبقِ الخانات السبع في صف واحد ضيق"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Training days","ar":"أيام التمرين"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Training days","ar":"أيام التمرين"}},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"☐Sa ☐Su ☐Mo ☐Tu ☐We ☐Th ☐Fr","ar":"☐سبت ☐أحد ☐اثنين ☐ثلاثاء ☐أربعاء ☐خميس ☐جمعة"},"gap":"xs"}]}},{"id":"list","text":{"en":"One full-width row per day, each at least 1 cm tall, with space between","ar":"صف بعرض الشاشة لكل يوم، ارتفاعه 1 سم على الأقل، مع مسافات"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Training days","ar":"أيام التمرين"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Training days","ar":"أيام التمرين"}},{"kind":"check","text":{"en":"Saturday","ar":"السبت"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"check","text":{"en":"Sunday","ar":"الأحد"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"check","text":{"en":"Monday","ar":"الاثنين"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"…and 4 more days","ar":"…و4 أيام أخرى"},"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"letters","text":{"en":"Keep one row, with bigger letters","ar":"أبقِ صفًا واحدًا، بحروف أكبر"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Training days","ar":"أيام التمرين"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Training days","ar":"أيام التمرين"}},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"☐Sa ☐Su ☐Mo ☐Tu ☐We ☐Th ☐Fr","ar":"☐سبت ☐أحد ☐اثنين ☐ثلاثاء ☐أربعاء ☐خميس ☐جمعة"},"gap":"xs"}]}}],"answer":["list"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-056","when":["row","letters"],"feedback":{"en":"Seven boxes squeezed into one phone row leave each one tiny and touching its neighbours. Bigger letters don't add space.","ar":"سبع خانات محشورة في صف واحد على الهاتف تجعل كل واحدة صغيرة وملاصقة لجارتها. والحروف الأكبر لا تضيف مسافة."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Each day gets its own row, big and apart.","ar":"صحيح. كل يوم له صفّه الخاص، كبير ومنفصل."},"explain":{"en":"When targets don't fit side by side at 1 cm each, stack them. Size first, then space.","ar":"حين لا تتّسع الأهداف جنبًا إلى جنب بـ 1 سم لكل منها، رتّبها فوق بعضها. الحجم أولًا، ثم المسافة."}},{"id":"S11","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P01-U05-06","part":"retest","speaker":"mona","value":{"en":"Re-test, Reset and Cancel buttons (NN/g): people click Reset by mistake when they meant Submit.","ar":"إعادة اختبار، أزرار Reset وCancel (NN/g): يضغط الناس Reset بالخطأ وهم يقصدون الإرسال."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/reset-and-cancel-buttons/","quote":"The worst problem about Reset is that users click the button by mistake when they wanted to click Submit."},"scenario":{"en":"My team designs a university's course survey with 20 questions. At the end, \"Reset answers\" sits beside \"Submit\". Some students submit empty surveys after hitting the wrong one.","ar":"يصمّم فريقي استبيان مقررات لجامعة فيه 20 سؤالًا. وفي النهاية، «امسح الإجابات» بجوار «أرسل». وبعض الطلاب يرسلون استبيانات فارغة بعد ضغط الزر الخطأ."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each version. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل نسخة. أيّها يجب أن تُطلق؟"},"start":"both","options":[{"id":"swap","text":{"en":"Keep both, but put Submit first","ar":"أبقِ الزرّين، لكن ضع «أرسل» أولًا"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"jamia","name":{"en":"Jami'a","ar":"جامعة"},"color":"#1C3D6E","icon":"graduation-cap","domain":"jamia.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"jamia.example/survey","blocks":[{"kind":"small","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"20 of 20 answered","ar":"أجبتَ عن 20 من 20"}},{"kind":"row","gap":"m","blocks":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Submit","ar":"أرسل"}},{"kind":"button","emphasis":"low","text":{"en":"Reset answers","ar":"امسح الإجابات"}}]}]}},{"id":"none","text":{"en":"Remove \"Reset answers\"","ar":"احذف «امسح الإجابات»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"jamia","name":{"en":"Jami'a","ar":"جامعة"},"color":"#1C3D6E","icon":"graduation-cap","domain":"jamia.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"jamia.example/survey","blocks":[{"kind":"small","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"20 of 20 answered","ar":"أجبتَ عن 20 من 20"}},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Submit","ar":"أرسل"},"gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"both","text":{"en":"Keep \"Reset answers\" beside Submit","ar":"أبقِ «امسح الإجابات» بجوار «أرسل»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"jamia","name":{"en":"Jami'a","ar":"جامعة"},"color":"#1C3D6E","icon":"graduation-cap","domain":"jamia.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"jamia.example/survey","blocks":[{"kind":"small","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"20 of 20 answered","ar":"أجبتَ عن 20 من 20"}},{"kind":"row","gap":"m","blocks":[{"kind":"button","emphasis":"low","text":{"en":"Reset answers","ar":"امسح الإجابات"}},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Submit","ar":"أرسل"}}]}]}}],"answer":["none"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-057","when":["both","swap"],"feedback":{"en":"Swapping sides only changes which way the slip goes. As long as Reset sits next to Submit, 20 answers are one tap from gone.","ar":"تبديل الأماكن يغيّر فقط اتجاه الزلّة. وطالما «امسح الإجابات» بجوار «أرسل»، فضغطة خاطئة واحدة تمسح الإجابات العشرين."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Nothing next to Submit can wipe the survey.","ar":"صحيح. لم يعد بجوار «أرسل» ما يمسح الاستبيان."},"explain":{"en":"Students change answers one question at a time. A button that erases all 20 isn't worth the risk.","ar":"يغيّر الطلاب إجاباتهم سؤالًا سؤالًا. والزر الذي يمسح العشرين كلها لا يستحق المخاطرة."}},{"id":"S12","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P01-U05-06","part":"retest","speaker":"nour","value":{"en":"Re-test, Reset and Cancel buttons (NN/g): people click Reset by mistake when they meant Submit. A Clear form button next to Save is the same risk.","ar":"إعادة اختبار، أزرار Reset وCancel (NN/g): يضغط الناس Reset بالخطأ وهم يقصدون الإرسال. وزر «امسح النموذج» بجوار «احفظ» هو الخطر نفسه."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/reset-and-cancel-buttons/","quote":"The worst problem about Reset is that users click the button by mistake when they wanted to click Submit."},"scenario":{"en":"Our nurses fill in a long medical history form on a tablet for each new patient. \"Clear form\" sits right next to \"Save\". Nurse Sabah lost a 15-minute interview with Mr. Kamal.","ar":"تملأ الممرّضات عندنا استمارة تاريخ مرضي طويلة على جهاز لوحي لكل مريض جديد. و«امسح النموذج» بجوار «احفظ» مباشرة. وفقدت الممرّضة صباح مقابلة استغرقت 15 دقيقة مع السيد كمال."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each version. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل نسخة. أيّها يجب أن تُطلق؟"},"start":"both","options":[{"id":"both","text":{"en":"Keep \"Clear form\" beside Save","ar":"أبقِ «امسح النموذج» بجوار «احفظ»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"frame":"tablet","appbar":{"title":{"en":"Medical history","ar":"التاريخ المرضي"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Medical history · Kamal Ragab","ar":"التاريخ المرضي · كمال رجب"}},{"kind":"row","gap":"m","blocks":[{"kind":"button","emphasis":"low","text":{"en":"Clear form","ar":"امسح النموذج"}},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Save","ar":"احفظ"}}]}]}},{"id":"danger","text":{"en":"Keep it, and make it red","ar":"أبقِ الزر، واجعله أحمر"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"frame":"tablet","appbar":{"title":{"en":"Medical history","ar":"التاريخ المرضي"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Medical history · Kamal Ragab","ar":"التاريخ المرضي · كمال رجب"}},{"kind":"row","gap":"m","blocks":[{"kind":"button","style":"danger","text":{"en":"Clear form","ar":"امسح النموذج"}},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Save","ar":"احفظ"}}]}]}},{"id":"none","text":{"en":"Remove \"Clear form\"; keep only Save","ar":"احذف «امسح النموذج»؛ وأبقِ «احفظ» فقط"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"frame":"tablet","appbar":{"title":{"en":"Medical history","ar":"التاريخ المرضي"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Medical history · Kamal Ragab","ar":"التاريخ المرضي · كمال رجب"}}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Save","ar":"احفظ"}}]}}],"answer":["none"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P01-057","when":["both","danger"],"feedback":{"en":"Red catches the eye but not the finger. Next to Save, one slip still loses a whole interview. Remove it.","ar":"الأحمر يلفت العين لا الإصبع. وبجوار «احفظ»، تظل زلّة واحدة تُضيّع مقابلة كاملة. احذفه."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Save stands alone, and the interview is safe.","ar":"صحيح. «احفظ» وحده، والمقابلة في أمان."},"explain":{"en":"The end of a long form is for saving the work. Nothing that wipes it belongs there.","ar":"نهاية النموذج الطويل لحفظ العمل. ولا مكان هناك لأي شيء يمسحه."}}]}$uxg$::jsonb),
  ($uxg$P02-U01-B01$uxg$, $uxg$55aec73f8bf8c5c240df3f9d743269d40061447f2d8da3dd9864f7ce57b125ea$uxg$, $uxg${"id":"P02-U01-B01","mode":"bank","title":{"en":"Re-tests: keep people informed, in their words","ar":"إعادة اختبار: أخبِر الناس بما يحدث، بكلماتهم"},"steps":[{"id":"S01","type":"tune","speaker":"karim","part":"retest","skill":"SK-P02-U01-01","value":{"en":"Re-test, visibility of system status (NN/g): feedback can be as simple as a change on the button people pressed. A note app that saves with no sign leaves people pressing Save again and again.","ar":"إعادة اختبار، ظهور حالة النظام (NN/g): قد يكون الردّ بسيطًا مثل تغيير على الزر الذي ضغطه الناس. وتطبيق الملاحظات الذي يحفظ دون أي علامة يجعل الناس يضغطون «احفظ» مرة بعد مرة."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/visibility-system-status/","quote":"Such feedback can be as simple as a change of color once the user has clicked on a button"},"scenario":{"en":"I'm building a note-taking app. When people tap **Save**, the note saves in a moment, but nothing on the screen changes. People tap Save three or four times to be sure.","ar":"أبني تطبيقًا لتدوين الملاحظات. حين يضغط الناس **احفظ**، تُحفظ الملاحظة في لحظة، لكن لا يتغيّر شيء على الشاشة. فيضغط الناس «احفظ» ثلاث أو أربع مرات ليتأكدوا."},"prompt":{"en":"What's the right feedback?","ar":"ما الـ Feedback (الإشارة على الشاشة) التي تُخبر الناس أن الملاحظة حُفظت؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"satr","name":{"en":"Satr","ar":"سطر"},"color":"#334155","icon":"text-align-left","domain":"satr.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Shopping list","ar":"قائمة المشتريات"},"back":true,"actions":[{"icon":"floppy-disk","aria":{"en":"Save","ar":"احفظ"}}]},"keyboard":"text","blocks":[{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"Milk, eggs, bread\nRice 2 kg\nTomatoes","ar":"حليب، بيض، عيش\nأرز 2 كجم\nطماطم"}},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Save tapped 3 times, no change on screen","ar":"ضغطوا «احفظ» 3 مرات، ولم يتغيّر شيء على الشاشة"},"tone":"faint","gap":"m"}]},"options":[{"id":"dialog","text":{"en":"A dialog: \"Your note was saved\", with OK","ar":"نافذة منبثقة (Dialog): «حُفظت ملاحظتك»، مع زر «حسنًا»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"satr","name":{"en":"Satr","ar":"سطر"},"color":"#334155","icon":"text-align-left","domain":"satr.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Shopping list","ar":"قائمة المشتريات"},"back":true,"actions":[{"icon":"floppy-disk","aria":{"en":"Save","ar":"احفظ"}}]},"keyboard":"text","blocks":[{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"Milk, eggs, bread\nRice 2 kg\nTomatoes","ar":"حليب، بيض، عيش\nأرز 2 كجم\nطماطم"}}],"overlay":{"type":"dialog","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Your note was saved","ar":"حُفظت ملاحظتك"}},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"OK","ar":"حسنًا"},"gap":"m"}]}}},{"id":"inline","text":{"en":"The button turns into \"✓ Saved\", and \"Saved just now\" appears under the title","ar":"يتحوّل الزر إلى «✓ حُفظت»، ويظهر «حُفظت الآن» تحت العنوان"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"satr","name":{"en":"Satr","ar":"سطر"},"color":"#334155","icon":"text-align-left","domain":"satr.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Shopping list","ar":"قائمة المشتريات"},"back":true,"actions":[{"icon":"check-circle","aria":{"en":"Saved","ar":"حُفظت"}}]},"keyboard":"text","blocks":[{"kind":"small","icon":"check","text":{"en":"✓ Saved just now","ar":"✓ حُفظت الآن"},"color":"green"},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"Milk, eggs, bread\nRice 2 kg\nTomatoes","ar":"حليب، بيض، عيش\nأرز 2 كجم\nطماطم"}}]}},{"id":"none","text":{"en":"Nothing; saving is so fast that people don't need to know","ar":"لا شيء؛ فالحفظ سريع جدًا ولا يحتاج الناس إلى معرفته"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"satr","name":{"en":"Satr","ar":"سطر"},"color":"#334155","icon":"text-align-left","domain":"satr.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Shopping list","ar":"قائمة المشتريات"},"back":true,"actions":[{"icon":"floppy-disk","aria":{"en":"Save","ar":"احفظ"}}]},"keyboard":"text","blocks":[{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"Milk, eggs, bread\nRice 2 kg\nTomatoes","ar":"حليب، بيض، عيش\nأرز 2 كجم\nطماطم"}},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Save tapped 3 times, no change on screen","ar":"ضغطوا «احفظ» 3 مرات، ولم يتغيّر شيء على الشاشة"},"tone":"faint","gap":"m"}]}}],"answer":["inline"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P02-006","when":["dialog"],"feedback":{"en":"A dialog for every save stops people's writing to make them tap OK. A quick change in place says the same thing without stopping them.","ar":"نافذة مع كل حفظ توقف الكتابة لتجبر الناس على ضغط «حسنًا». أما التغيير السريع في مكان الضغط فيوصل الرسالة نفسها دون أن يوقفهم."}},{"id":"MC-P02-002","when":["none"],"feedback":{"en":"Fast or not, people can't see that it saved. That's why they keep tapping.","ar":"سريعًا كان أم لا، لا يرى الناس أن الملاحظة حُفظت. ولهذا يستمرون في الضغط."}}],"correct":{"en":"A small, quick change where people tapped.","ar":"تغيير صغير سريع حيث ضغط الناس."},"explain":{"en":"\"✓ Saved\" answers the tap at once, and \"Saved just now\" stays as a reminder, so nobody needs to tap again.","ar":"«✓ حُفظت» تردّ على الضغطة فورًا، و«حُفظت الآن» تبقى تذكيرًا، فلا يحتاج أحد إلى الضغط مرة أخرى."}},{"id":"S02","type":"tune","speaker":"mona","part":"retest","skill":"SK-P02-U01-01","value":{"en":"Re-test, progress indicators (NN/g): percent-done indicators are the most informative wait feedback. A three-minute export needs one; a spinner leaves people guessing.","ar":"إعادة اختبار، مؤشرات التقدّم (NN/g): مؤشرات النسبة المنجزة أكثر أنواع ردود الانتظار إفادة. والتصدير الذي يستغرق ثلاث دقائق يحتاج إليها؛ أما المؤشر الدوّار فيترك الناس يخمّنون."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/progress-indicators/","quote":"Percent-done progress indicators are the most informative type of wait-animation feedback."},"scenario":{"en":"My team makes a video editing website. Exporting a finished video takes about three minutes. Right now we show a spinning circle, and many people close the tab thinking it froze.","ar":"يصنع فريقي موقعًا لتحرير الفيديو. وتصدير الفيديو النهائي يستغرق نحو ثلاث دقائق. نعرض الآن دائرة تدور، ويغلق كثير من الناس الصفحة ظانّين أنها توقفت."},"prompt":{"en":"What should we show instead?","ar":"ماذا نعرض بدلًا منها؟"},"mock":{"app":{"name":{"en":"Montaj","ar":"مونتاج"},"color":"#9333EA","icon":"film-strip","domain":"montaj.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"montaj.example/projects/wedding-film/export","blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"photo","size":"l"},{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Exporting \"Wedding film\"","ar":"جارٍ تصدير «فيلم الزفاف»"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"icon","icon":"spinner-gap","size":"l","color":"brand","gap":"m","note":{"en":"Spinning for 1 minute","ar":"يدور منذ دقيقة"}}]},"options":[{"id":"bigger","text":{"en":"A bigger spinner with \"Almost there…\"","ar":"دائرة أكبر مع «اقتربنا…»"},"mock":{"app":{"name":{"en":"Montaj","ar":"مونتاج"},"color":"#9333EA","icon":"film-strip","domain":"montaj.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"montaj.example/projects/wedding-film/export","blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"photo","size":"l"},{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Exporting \"Wedding film\"","ar":"جارٍ تصدير «فيلم الزفاف»"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"icon","icon":"spinner-gap","size":"xl","color":"brand","gap":"m","note":{"en":"Spinning for 1 minute","ar":"يدور منذ دقيقة"}},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Almost there…","ar":"اقتربنا…"},"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"percent","text":{"en":"A bar with \"Exporting: 45% · about 2 minutes left\"","ar":"شريط مع «جارٍ التصدير: 45% · بقي نحو دقيقتين»"},"mock":{"app":{"name":{"en":"Montaj","ar":"مونتاج"},"color":"#9333EA","icon":"film-strip","domain":"montaj.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"montaj.example/projects/wedding-film/export","blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"photo","size":"l"},{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Exporting \"Wedding film\"","ar":"جارٍ تصدير «فيلم الزفاف»"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"progress","value":45,"label":{"en":"Exporting: 45% · about 2 minutes left","ar":"جارٍ التصدير: 45% · بقي نحو دقيقتين"},"gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"tips","text":{"en":"Video editing tips that change every few seconds","ar":"نصائح في تحرير الفيديو تتغيّر كل بضع ثوانٍ"},"mock":{"app":{"name":{"en":"Montaj","ar":"مونتاج"},"color":"#9333EA","icon":"film-strip","domain":"montaj.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"montaj.example/projects/wedding-film/export","blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"photo","size":"l"},{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Exporting \"Wedding film\"","ar":"جارٍ تصدير «فيلم الزفاف»"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"icon","icon":"spinner-gap","size":"l","color":"brand","gap":"m"},{"kind":"tip","text":{"en":"Tip: press J, K and L to move through your clips faster.","ar":"نصيحة: اضغط J وK وL لتتنقّل بين المقاطع أسرع."},"gap":"m","note":{"en":"A new tip every 5 s","ar":"نصيحة جديدة كل 5 ثوانٍ"}}]}}],"answer":["percent"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P02-003","when":["bigger","tips"],"feedback":{"en":"People still can't tell how far along the export is. After a minute of not knowing, many will still give up.","ar":"ما زال الناس لا يعرفون إلى أين وصل التصدير. وبعد دقيقة من الحيرة، سيترك كثيرون الصفحة."}}],"correct":{"en":"A long wait needs a percentage and time left.","ar":"الانتظار الطويل يحتاج إلى نسبة ووقت متبقٍّ."},"explain":{"en":"The bar shows the export moving, and \"2 minutes left\" lets people decide to wait or do something else and come back.","ar":"الشريط يُظهر أن التصدير يتقدّم، و«بقي نحو دقيقتين» تساعد الناس على أن يقرّروا: ينتظرون، أو ينشغلون بشيء آخر ثم يعودون."}},{"id":"S03","type":"tune","speaker":"sara","part":"retest","skill":"SK-P02-U01-02","value":{"en":"Re-test, visibility of system status (NN/g): no action with consequences to users should happen without telling them. A different driver and car must show on the trip screen.","ar":"إعادة اختبار، ظهور حالة النظام (NN/g): لا يجب أن يحدث أي إجراء له عواقب على المستخدمين دون إخبارهم. والسائق والسيارة المختلفان يجب أن يظهرا في شاشة الرحلة."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/visibility-system-status/","quote":"no action with consequences to users should be taken without informing them."},"scenario":{"en":"I'm designing a ride app. Sometimes a driver cancels and we quietly give the ride to another driver nearby. The trip screen keeps showing the first car: a white Toyota.","ar":"أصمّم تطبيقًا لطلب السيارات. أحيانًا يلغي السائق، فنعطي الرحلة لسائق آخر قريب دون أن نُخبر الراكب. وتظل شاشة الرحلة تعرض السيارة الأولى: تويوتا بيضاء."},"prompt":{"en":"What should the rider see when the driver changes?","ar":"ماذا يجب أن يرى الراكب حين يتغيّر السائق؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"mishwar","name":{"en":"Mishwar","ar":"مشوار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"car","domain":"mishwar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Your ride","ar":"مشوارك"}},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"map-route","size":"l"},{"kind":"listitem","avatar":{"text":"Mahmoud","art":"man-2"},"text":{"en":"Mahmoud · ★ 4.9","ar":"محمود · ★ 4.9"},"sub":{"en":"White Toyota Corolla · ق ص 4721","ar":"تويوتا كورولا بيضاء · ق ص 4721"},"value":{"en":"3 min","ar":"3 د"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Mahmoud cancelled; Karim's grey Hyundai is coming.","ar":"ألغى محمود الرحلة، وكريم في الطريق بسيارة هيونداي رمادية."},"tone":"faint","gap":"s","note":{"en":"Known to the app, not shown","ar":"يعرفه التطبيق، ولا يظهر"}}]},"options":[{"id":"same","text":{"en":"Nothing new; a car is still coming","ar":"لا شيء جديد؛ فما زالت هناك سيارة قادمة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"mishwar","name":{"en":"Mishwar","ar":"مشوار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"car","domain":"mishwar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Your ride","ar":"مشوارك"}},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"map-route","size":"l"},{"kind":"listitem","avatar":{"text":"Mahmoud","art":"man-2"},"text":{"en":"Mahmoud · ★ 4.9","ar":"محمود · ★ 4.9"},"sub":{"en":"White Toyota Corolla · ق ص 4721","ar":"تويوتا كورولا بيضاء · ق ص 4721"},"value":{"en":"3 min","ar":"3 د"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Mahmoud cancelled; Karim's grey Hyundai is coming.","ar":"ألغى محمود الرحلة، وكريم في الطريق بسيارة هيونداي رمادية."},"tone":"faint","gap":"s","note":{"en":"Known to the app, not shown","ar":"يعرفه التطبيق، ولا يظهر"}}]}},{"id":"update","text":{"en":"\"Your driver changed\", with the new driver's name, car, plate and arrival time","ar":"«تغيّر سائقك»، مع اسم السائق الجديد وسيارته ورقم اللوحة وموعد الوصول"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"mishwar","name":{"en":"Mishwar","ar":"مشوار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"car","domain":"mishwar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Your ride","ar":"مشوارك"}},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"map-route","size":"l"},{"kind":"banner","tone":"info","icon":"arrows-clockwise","text":{"en":"Your driver changed: Karim is on the way","ar":"تغيّر سائقك: كريم في الطريق إليك"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"listitem","avatar":{"text":"Karim","art":"man-1"},"text":{"en":"Karim · ★ 4.8","ar":"كريم · ★ 4.8"},"sub":{"en":"Grey Hyundai Elantra · ن ر 2954","ar":"هيونداي إلنترا رمادية · ن ر 2954"},"value":{"en":"5 min","ar":"5 د"},"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"later","text":{"en":"Tell them in the trip receipt afterwards","ar":"نخبره في إيصال الرحلة بعد انتهائها"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"mishwar","name":{"en":"Mishwar","ar":"مشوار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"car","domain":"mishwar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Your ride","ar":"مشوارك"}},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"map-route","size":"l"},{"kind":"listitem","avatar":{"text":"Mahmoud","art":"man-2"},"text":{"en":"Mahmoud · ★ 4.9","ar":"محمود · ★ 4.9"},"sub":{"en":"White Toyota Corolla · ق ص 4721","ar":"تويوتا كورولا بيضاء · ق ص 4721"},"value":{"en":"3 min","ar":"3 د"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Mahmoud cancelled; Karim's grey Hyundai is coming.","ar":"ألغى محمود الرحلة، وكريم في الطريق بسيارة هيونداي رمادية."},"tone":"faint","gap":"s","note":{"en":"Told only in the receipt, after the trip","ar":"يُذكر في الإيصال فقط، بعد الرحلة"}}]}}],"answer":["update"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P02-004","when":["same","later"],"feedback":{"en":"The rider is standing on the street looking for a white Toyota. A different car may pass right by without them knowing it's theirs.","ar":"الراكب يقف في الشارع يبحث عن تويوتا بيضاء. وقد تمرّ سيارة مختلفة بجانبه دون أن يعرف أنها سيارته."}}],"correct":{"en":"Tell them now, with what they need to find the car.","ar":"أخبِره الآن، بما يحتاجه ليجد السيارة."},"explain":{"en":"The change affects what the rider is doing right now, so it belongs on the trip screen with the details that let them spot the new car.","ar":"التغيير يؤثر في ما يفعله الراكب الآن، فمكانه شاشة الرحلة، مع التفاصيل التي تساعده على التعرّف على السيارة الجديدة."}},{"id":"S04","type":"tune","speaker":"nour","part":"retest","skill":"SK-P02-U01-02","value":{"en":"Re-test, visibility of system status (NN/g): backstage events that affect people can be shown with notifications or indicators. A doctor running late is exactly such an event.","ar":"إعادة اختبار، ظهور حالة النظام (NN/g): الأحداث التي تجري خلف الكواليس وتمسّ الناس يمكن إظهارها بالإشعارات أو المؤشرات. وتأخّر الطبيب حدث من هذا النوع تمامًا."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/visibility-system-status/","quote":"To communicate backstage events that may impact users, you can use either notifications or indicators."},"scenario":{"en":"In my clinic, Dr. Samir is running 40 minutes late today. Patients with afternoon bookings still see \"5:00 pm\" in the app, and they all arrive and wait.","ar":"في عيادتي، يتأخر د. سمير اليوم 40 دقيقة. ومرضى مواعيد العصر ما زالوا يرون «5:00 مساءً» في التطبيق، فيأتون جميعًا وينتظرون."},"prompt":{"en":"What should the app do?","ar":"ماذا يجب أن يفعل التطبيق؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"My visits","ar":"زياراتي"}},"tabbar":{"active":1,"items":[{"icon":"house","text":{"en":"Home","ar":"الرئيسية"}},{"icon":"calendar-check","text":{"en":"Visits","ar":"زياراتي"}},{"icon":"user","text":{"en":"Me","ar":"حسابي"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"card","blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","avatar":{"text":"Dr. Samir","art":"doctor"},"text":{"en":"Dr. Samir Fahmy","ar":"د. سمير فهمي"},"sub":{"en":"Internal medicine","ar":"باطنة"}},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Today · 5:00 pm","ar":"اليوم · 5:00 مساءً"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Raha Clinic, Dokki","ar":"عيادة راحة، الدقي"}}]},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Dr. Samir is running 40 minutes late.","ar":"د. سمير متأخر 40 دقيقة."},"tone":"faint","gap":"m","note":{"en":"Known to the clinic, not shown","ar":"تعرفه العيادة، ولا يظهر"}}]},"options":[{"id":"notify","text":{"en":"Show \"Dr. Samir is running about 40 minutes late: expected 5:40 pm\" on the booking, and send a notification","ar":"يعرض «د. سمير متأخر نحو 40 دقيقة: الموعد المتوقع 5:40 مساءً» على الحجز، ويرسل إشعارًا"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"My visits","ar":"زياراتي"}},"tabbar":{"active":1,"items":[{"icon":"house","text":{"en":"Home","ar":"الرئيسية"}},{"icon":"calendar-check","text":{"en":"Visits","ar":"زياراتي"}},{"icon":"user","text":{"en":"Me","ar":"حسابي"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"banner","tone":"warn","icon":"clock","text":{"en":"Dr. Samir is running about 40 minutes late: expected 5:40 pm","ar":"د. سمير متأخر نحو 40 دقيقة: الموعد المتوقع 5:40 مساءً"},"note":{"en":"Also sent as a notification","ar":"ويصل أيضًا كإشعار"}},{"kind":"card","blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","avatar":{"text":"Dr. Samir","art":"doctor"},"text":{"en":"Dr. Samir Fahmy","ar":"د. سمير فهمي"},"sub":{"en":"Internal medicine","ar":"باطنة"}},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Today · 5:00 pm","ar":"اليوم · 5:00 مساءً"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Raha Clinic, Dokki","ar":"عيادة راحة، الدقي"}}]}]}},{"id":"desk","text":{"en":"Nothing; the front desk will explain when they arrive","ar":"لا شيء؛ سيشرح الاستقبال حين يصلون"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"My visits","ar":"زياراتي"}},"tabbar":{"active":1,"items":[{"icon":"house","text":{"en":"Home","ar":"الرئيسية"}},{"icon":"calendar-check","text":{"en":"Visits","ar":"زياراتي"}},{"icon":"user","text":{"en":"Me","ar":"حسابي"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"card","blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","avatar":{"text":"Dr. Samir","art":"doctor"},"text":{"en":"Dr. Samir Fahmy","ar":"د. سمير فهمي"},"sub":{"en":"Internal medicine","ar":"باطنة"}},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Today · 5:00 pm","ar":"اليوم · 5:00 مساءً"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Raha Clinic, Dokki","ar":"عيادة راحة، الدقي"}}]},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Dr. Samir is running 40 minutes late.","ar":"د. سمير متأخر 40 دقيقة."},"tone":"faint","gap":"m","note":{"en":"Not shown; the front desk explains on arrival","ar":"لا يظهر؛ يشرح الاستقبال عند الوصول"}}]}},{"id":"hours","text":{"en":"Add \"Waiting times may vary\" to the clinic's page","ar":"يضيف «قد تختلف أوقات الانتظار» إلى صفحة العيادة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"My visits","ar":"زياراتي"}},"tabbar":{"active":1,"items":[{"icon":"house","text":{"en":"Home","ar":"الرئيسية"}},{"icon":"calendar-check","text":{"en":"Visits","ar":"زياراتي"}},{"icon":"user","text":{"en":"Me","ar":"حسابي"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"card","blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","avatar":{"text":"Dr. Samir","art":"doctor"},"text":{"en":"Dr. Samir Fahmy","ar":"د. سمير فهمي"},"sub":{"en":"Internal medicine","ar":"باطنة"}},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Today · 5:00 pm","ar":"اليوم · 5:00 مساءً"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Raha Clinic, Dokki","ar":"عيادة راحة، الدقي"}}]},{"kind":"small","icon":"info","text":{"en":"Raha Clinic: waiting times may vary.","ar":"عيادة راحة: قد تختلف أوقات الانتظار."},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Dr. Samir is running 40 minutes late.","ar":"د. سمير متأخر 40 دقيقة."},"tone":"faint","gap":"m","note":{"en":"Known to the clinic, not shown","ar":"تعرفه العيادة، ولا يظهر"}}]}}],"answer":["notify"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P02-004","when":["desk"],"feedback":{"en":"By then the patients have already left work early and sat in the waiting room. The app knew and said nothing.","ar":"حينها يكون المرضى قد غادروا عملهم مبكرًا وجلسوا في غرفة الانتظار. والتطبيق كان يعرف ولم يقل شيئًا."}},{"id":"MC-P02-005","when":["hours"],"feedback":{"en":"A general warning doesn't tell any patient that today's booking is late, or by how much.","ar":"التحذير العام لا يخبر أي مريض أن موعد اليوم متأخر، ولا بكم."}}],"correct":{"en":"Show the delay on the booking, and reach them before they leave.","ar":"أظهِر التأخير على الحجز، وأبلغهم قبل أن يخرجوا."},"explain":{"en":"Patients check their booking for the time, so the delay and new time go there. The notification reaches those who don't open the app.","ar":"يراجع المرضى حجزهم ليعرفوا الموعد، فالتأخير والموعد الجديد مكانهما هناك. والإشعار يصل إلى من لا يفتح التطبيق."}},{"id":"S05","type":"tune","speaker":"hana","part":"retest","skill":"SK-P02-U01-03","value":{"en":"Re-test, match between the system and the real world (NN/g): never assume your understanding of words matches your users'. Billing terms from the payment system aren't what members say.","ar":"إعادة اختبار، التوافق بين النظام والعالم الحقيقي (NN/g): لا تفترض أبدًا أن فهمك للكلمات يطابق فهم مستخدميك. ومصطلحات الفوترة من نظام الدفع ليست ما يقوله الأعضاء."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/ten-usability-heuristics/","quote":"Never assume your understanding of words or concepts will match"},"scenario":{"en":"Members of my gym can stop paying for a month while they travel. In the app, the option is called \"Suspend billing cycle\". Members keep asking me how to freeze their membership.","ar":"يستطيع أعضاء النادي الرياضي الذي أديره أن يتوقفوا عن الدفع شهرًا أثناء السفر. وفي التطبيق اسم هذا الخيار «تعليق دورة الفوترة». والأعضاء يسألونني دائمًا كيف يجمّدون اشتراكهم."},"prompt":{"en":"What should the option be called?","ar":"ماذا نسمّي هذا الخيار ليجده الأعضاء بسهولة؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Membership","ar":"الاشتراك"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"card","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Gold · monthly","ar":"Gold · شهري"}},{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"EGP 900","ar":"900 جنيه"},"per":{"en":"/ month","ar":"/ شهريًا"}},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Renews 1 Dec","ar":"يتجدّد 1 ديسمبر"}}]},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"pause-circle","text":{"en":"Suspend billing cycle","ar":"تعليق دورة الفوترة"},"chevron":true,"gap":"m","ring":true},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"credit-card","text":{"en":"Payment method","ar":"طريقة الدفع"},"chevron":true,"gap":"s"}]},"options":[{"id":"freeze","text":{"en":"\"Freeze my membership\"","ar":"«جمّد اشتراكي»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Membership","ar":"الاشتراك"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"card","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Gold · monthly","ar":"Gold · شهري"}},{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"EGP 900","ar":"900 جنيه"},"per":{"en":"/ month","ar":"/ شهريًا"}},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Renews 1 Dec","ar":"يتجدّد 1 ديسمبر"}}]},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"snowflake","text":{"en":"Freeze my membership","ar":"جمّد اشتراكي"},"chevron":true,"gap":"m","ring":true},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"credit-card","text":{"en":"Payment method","ar":"طريقة الدفع"},"chevron":true,"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"keep","text":{"en":"\"Suspend billing cycle\", with a help page","ar":"«تعليق دورة الفوترة»، مع صفحة مساعدة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Membership","ar":"الاشتراك"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"card","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Gold · monthly","ar":"Gold · شهري"}},{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"EGP 900","ar":"900 جنيه"},"per":{"en":"/ month","ar":"/ شهريًا"}},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Renews 1 Dec","ar":"يتجدّد 1 ديسمبر"}}]},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"pause-circle","text":{"en":"Suspend billing cycle","ar":"تعليق دورة الفوترة"},"chevron":true,"gap":"m","ring":true},{"kind":"link","icon":"question","text":{"en":"Help: what is a billing cycle suspension?","ar":"مساعدة: ما معنى تعليق دورة الفوترة؟"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"credit-card","text":{"en":"Payment method","ar":"طريقة الدفع"},"chevron":true,"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"hold","text":{"en":"\"Account hold (billing)\"","ar":"«إيقاف الحساب (الفوترة)»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Membership","ar":"الاشتراك"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"card","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Gold · monthly","ar":"Gold · شهري"}},{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"EGP 900","ar":"900 جنيه"},"per":{"en":"/ month","ar":"/ شهريًا"}},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Renews 1 Dec","ar":"يتجدّد 1 ديسمبر"}}]},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"pause-circle","text":{"en":"Account hold (billing)","ar":"إيقاف الحساب (الفوترة)"},"chevron":true,"gap":"m","ring":true},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"credit-card","text":{"en":"Payment method","ar":"طريقة الدفع"},"chevron":true,"gap":"s"}]}}],"answer":["freeze"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P02-008","when":["keep"],"feedback":{"en":"Members won't recognise \"billing cycle\" as the thing they're looking for, so they won't even open the help page.","ar":"لن يعرف الأعضاء أن «دورة الفوترة» هي ما يبحثون عنه، فلن يفتحوا صفحة المساعدة أصلًا."}},{"id":"MC-P02-007","when":["hold"],"feedback":{"en":"\"Account hold\" sounds like something the gym does to you, and it isn't the word members use.","ar":"«إيقاف الحساب» يوحي بأن النادي هو الذي يوقف حسابك، وهي ليست الكلمة التي يستخدمها الأعضاء."}}],"correct":{"en":"Use the word members already say.","ar":"استخدم الكلمة التي يقولها الأعضاء أصلًا."},"explain":{"en":"Members are already asking for \"freeze\", so that word will catch their eye in the menu. The billing system can keep its own term behind the scenes.","ar":"الأعضاء يسألون أصلًا عن «التجميد»، فهذه الكلمة ستلفت نظرهم في القائمة. ويستطيع نظام الفوترة أن يحتفظ بمصطلحه خلف الكواليس."}},{"id":"S06","type":"tune","speaker":"youssef","part":"retest","skill":"SK-P02-U01-03","value":{"en":"Re-test, match between the system and the real world (NN/g): people should understand meaning without looking up a word. A telecom term as a field label stops checkout.","ar":"إعادة اختبار، التوافق بين النظام والعالم الحقيقي (NN/g): يجب أن يفهم الناس المعنى دون أن يبحثوا عن معنى كلمة. ومصطلح من عالم الاتصالات اسمًا لحقل يوقف الدفع."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/ten-usability-heuristics/","quote":"Ensure that users can understand meaning without having to go look up a word"},"scenario":{"en":"The delivery company's form on my checkout page asks for **MSISDN**. Many customers stop there.","ar":"نموذج شركة التوصيل في صفحة الدفع عندي يطلب **MSISDN**. ويتوقف كثير من العملاء عنده."},"prompt":{"en":"What should the field's label be?","ar":"ماذا نكتب في عنوان الحقل (Label)؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"dar.example/checkout/delivery","blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Delivery details","ar":"بيانات التوصيل"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Full name","ar":"الاسم بالكامل"},"text":{"en":"Mohamed Adel","ar":"محمد عادل"},"filled":true,"gap":"m"},{"kind":"field","label":"MSISDN","text":"","gap":"m","focus":true},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Continue to payment","ar":"تابع إلى الدفع"},"gap":"m"}]},"options":[{"id":"msisdn","text":{"en":"\"MSISDN (subscriber number)\"","ar":"«MSISDN (رقم المشترك)»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"dar.example/checkout/delivery","blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Delivery details","ar":"بيانات التوصيل"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Full name","ar":"الاسم بالكامل"},"text":{"en":"Mohamed Adel","ar":"محمد عادل"},"filled":true,"gap":"m"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"MSISDN (subscriber number)","ar":"MSISDN (رقم المشترك)"},"text":"","gap":"m","focus":true},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Continue to payment","ar":"تابع إلى الدفع"},"gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"mobile","text":{"en":"\"Mobile number, so the courier can call you\"","ar":"«رقم الموبايل، ليتصل بك المندوب»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"dar.example/checkout/delivery","blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Delivery details","ar":"بيانات التوصيل"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Full name","ar":"الاسم بالكامل"},"text":{"en":"Mohamed Adel","ar":"محمد عادل"},"filled":true,"gap":"m"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Mobile number, so the courier can call you","ar":"رقم الموبايل، ليتصل بك المندوب"},"text":"","gap":"m","focus":true},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Continue to payment","ar":"تابع إلى الدفع"},"gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"contact","text":{"en":"\"Contact ID\"","ar":"«معرّف التواصل»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"dar.example/checkout/delivery","blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Delivery details","ar":"بيانات التوصيل"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Full name","ar":"الاسم بالكامل"},"text":{"en":"Mohamed Adel","ar":"محمد عادل"},"filled":true,"gap":"m"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Contact ID","ar":"معرّف التواصل"},"text":"","gap":"m","focus":true},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Continue to payment","ar":"تابع إلى الدفع"},"gap":"m"}]}}],"answer":["mobile"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P02-009","when":["msisdn"],"feedback":{"en":"\"Subscriber number\" is still telecom language. Customers would wonder if it's their phone number, an account number, or something on their SIM card.","ar":"«رقم المشترك» ما زال لغة شركات الاتصالات. وسيتساءل العملاء إن كان رقم الهاتف، أم رقم حساب، أم شيئًا على شريحة الهاتف."}},{"id":"MC-P02-007","when":["contact"],"feedback":{"en":"\"Contact ID\" could mean an email, a username or a number. Customers would have to guess.","ar":"«معرّف التواصل» قد يعني بريدًا إلكترونيًا أو اسم مستخدم أو رقمًا. وسيضطر العملاء إلى التخمين."}}],"correct":{"en":"Plain words, and why you need it.","ar":"كلمات بسيطة، وسبب طلبه."},"explain":{"en":"Everyone knows what a mobile number is, and \"so the courier can call you\" tells them why it's needed.","ar":"الكل يعرف معنى رقم الموبايل، و«ليتصل بك المندوب» تخبرهم لماذا نطلبه."}},{"id":"S07","type":"compare","speaker":"tarek","part":"retest","skill":"SK-P02-U01-04","value":{"en":"Re-test, match between the system and the real world (NN/g): we associate more with up and less with down. A fan control with \"faster\" at the bottom works against that habit.","ar":"إعادة اختبار، التوافق بين النظام والعالم الحقيقي (NN/g): نربط «الأكثر» بالأعلى و«الأقل» بالأسفل. ومفتاح المروحة الذي يضع «أسرع» في الأسفل يعمل ضد هذه العادة."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/match-system-real-world/","quote":"we associate more with up and less with down"},"scenario":{"en":"In the smart home app I manage, people change a ceiling fan's speed with two buttons, one above the other.","ar":"في تطبيق المنزل الذكي الذي أديره، يغيّر الناس سرعة مروحة السقف بزرّين، أحدهما فوق الآخر."},"prompt":{"en":"Which version will people use without mistakes?","ar":"أيّ نسخة سيستخدمها الناس دون أخطاء؟"},"a":{"label":{"en":"Version A: slower on top","ar":"النسخة A: الأبطأ في الأعلى"},"mock":{"app":{"name":{"en":"Beity","ar":"بيتي"},"color":"#0D9488","icon":"house-line","domain":"beity.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Living room","ar":"الصالة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"card","blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"fan","text":{"en":"Ceiling fan","ar":"مروحة السقف"},"toggle":true},{"kind":"button","icon":"minus","text":{"en":"Slower","ar":"أبطأ"},"style":"outline","gap":"m"},{"kind":"progress","value":40,"label":{"en":"Speed 2 of 5","ar":"السرعة 2 من 5"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","icon":"plus","text":{"en":"Faster","ar":"أسرع"},"style":"outline","gap":"s"}]}]}},"b":{"label":{"en":"Version B: faster on top","ar":"النسخة B: الأسرع في الأعلى"},"mock":{"app":{"name":{"en":"Beity","ar":"بيتي"},"color":"#0D9488","icon":"house-line","domain":"beity.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Living room","ar":"الصالة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"card","blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"fan","text":{"en":"Ceiling fan","ar":"مروحة السقف"},"toggle":true},{"kind":"button","icon":"plus","text":{"en":"Faster","ar":"أسرع"},"style":"outline","gap":"m"},{"kind":"progress","value":40,"label":{"en":"Speed 2 of 5","ar":"السرعة 2 من 5"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","icon":"minus","text":{"en":"Slower","ar":"أبطأ"},"style":"outline","gap":"s"}]}]}},"answer":"b","misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P02-011","when":["a"],"feedback":{"en":"Most people reach for the top button to turn things up. In A, that slows the fan down, the opposite of what they meant.","ar":"أغلب الناس يضغطون الزر العلوي ليرفعوا السرعة. وفي A، هذا يُبطئ المروحة، أي عكس ما قصدوه."}}],"correct":{"en":"B: up means more.","ar":"B: الأعلى يعني الأكثر."},"explain":{"en":"B follows a habit people already have from volume buttons, lifts and taps: more is up, less is down.","ar":"B تتبع عادة موجودة أصلًا لدى الناس من أزرار الصوت والمصاعد والصنابير: الأكثر في الأعلى، والأقل في الأسفل."}},{"id":"S08","type":"tune","speaker":"rami","part":"retest","skill":"SK-P02-U01-04","value":{"en":"Re-test, match between the system and the real world (NN/g): present information in a natural and logical way. In a recipe, ingredients follow the order of cooking, not the alphabet.","ar":"إعادة اختبار، التوافق بين النظام والعالم الحقيقي (NN/g): اعرض المعلومات بطريقة طبيعية ومنطقية. ففي الوصفة، تتبع المكوّنات ترتيب الطبخ، لا الترتيب الأبجدي."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/match-system-real-world/","quote":"information should be presented in a natural and logical way"},"scenario":{"en":"I'm designing a recipe app. To keep it tidy, I listed each recipe's ingredients from A to Z.","ar":"أصمّم تطبيقًا للوصفات. ولكي يبدو مرتبًا، رتّبت مكوّنات كل وصفة أبجديًا."},"prompt":{"en":"How should the ingredients be ordered?","ar":"كيف نرتّب المكوّنات ليجد الطاهي ما يحتاجه أثناء الطبخ؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"tabkha","name":{"en":"Tabkha","ar":"طبخة"},"color":"#EA580C","icon":"cooking-pot","domain":"tabkha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Chicken kabsa","ar":"كبسة دجاج"},"back":true,"actions":[{"icon":"heart"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"food-grill","size":"m"},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Ingredients","ar":"المكوّنات"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"list","style":"bullet","items":[{"en":"Black pepper","ar":"أرز بسمتي"},{"en":"Cardamom","ar":"بصل"},{"en":"Chicken, 1 kg","ar":"بهارات الكبسة"},{"en":"Onion","ar":"دجاج، 1 كجم"},{"en":"Rice, 3 cups","ar":"طماطم"},{"en":"Tomatoes","ar":"هيل"}],"note":{"en":"Sorted A to Z","ar":"مرتّبة أبجديًا"}}]},"options":[{"id":"abc","text":{"en":"Keep A to Z; it's easy to scan","ar":"يبقى الترتيب الأبجدي؛ فهو سهل التصفّح"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"tabkha","name":{"en":"Tabkha","ar":"طبخة"},"color":"#EA580C","icon":"cooking-pot","domain":"tabkha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Chicken kabsa","ar":"كبسة دجاج"},"back":true,"actions":[{"icon":"heart"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"food-grill","size":"m"},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Ingredients","ar":"المكوّنات"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"list","style":"bullet","items":[{"en":"Black pepper","ar":"أرز بسمتي"},{"en":"Cardamom","ar":"بصل"},{"en":"Chicken, 1 kg","ar":"بهارات الكبسة"},{"en":"Onion","ar":"دجاج، 1 كجم"},{"en":"Rice, 3 cups","ar":"طماطم"},{"en":"Tomatoes","ar":"هيل"}],"note":{"en":"Sorted A to Z","ar":"مرتّبة أبجديًا"}}]}},{"id":"use","text":{"en":"In the order the cook uses them in the steps","ar":"بالترتيب الذي يستخدمها به الطاهي في الخطوات"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"tabkha","name":{"en":"Tabkha","ar":"طبخة"},"color":"#EA580C","icon":"cooking-pot","domain":"tabkha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Chicken kabsa","ar":"كبسة دجاج"},"back":true,"actions":[{"icon":"heart"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"food-grill","size":"m"},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Ingredients","ar":"المكوّنات"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"list","style":"bullet","items":[{"en":"Onion","ar":"بصل"},{"en":"Chicken, 1 kg","ar":"دجاج، 1 كجم"},{"en":"Tomatoes","ar":"طماطم"},{"en":"Cardamom","ar":"بهارات الكبسة"},{"en":"Black pepper","ar":"هيل"},{"en":"Rice, 3 cups","ar":"أرز بسمتي"}],"note":{"en":"In the order of the steps","ar":"بترتيب خطوات الطبخ"}}]}},{"id":"amount","text":{"en":"From the largest amount to the smallest","ar":"من الكمية الأكبر إلى الأصغر"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"tabkha","name":{"en":"Tabkha","ar":"طبخة"},"color":"#EA580C","icon":"cooking-pot","domain":"tabkha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Chicken kabsa","ar":"كبسة دجاج"},"back":true,"actions":[{"icon":"heart"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"food-grill","size":"m"},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Ingredients","ar":"المكوّنات"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"list","style":"bullet","items":[{"en":"Chicken, 1 kg","ar":"دجاج، 1 كجم"},{"en":"Rice, 3 cups","ar":"أرز بسمتي"},{"en":"Onion","ar":"بصل"},{"en":"Tomatoes","ar":"طماطم"},{"en":"Cardamom","ar":"بهارات الكبسة"},{"en":"Black pepper","ar":"هيل"}],"note":{"en":"Largest amount first","ar":"الكمية الأكبر أولًا"}}]}}],"answer":["use"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P02-010","when":["abc","amount"],"feedback":{"en":"While cooking, people look for what comes next. A to Z, or by amount, makes them hunt through the list at every step.","ar":"أثناء الطبخ، يبحث الناس عن المكوّن التالي. والترتيب الأبجدي، أو حسب الكمية، يجعلهم يبحثون في القائمة كلها عند كل خطوة."}}],"correct":{"en":"Follow the order of the real task.","ar":"اتبع ترتيب المهمة الحقيقية."},"explain":{"en":"Printed recipes list ingredients in the order they're used, so cooks can prepare and add them one after another. The app should keep that habit.","ar":"الوصفات المطبوعة تذكر المكوّنات بترتيب استخدامها، فيجهّزها الطاهي ويضيفها واحدًا بعد الآخر. ويجب أن يحافظ التطبيق على هذه العادة."}}]}$uxg$::jsonb),
  ($uxg$P02-U02-B01$uxg$, $uxg$0e82363aaad2875e224f65c29e4e9799544169711cb0fa203a0935db136c8339$uxg$, $uxg${"id":"P02-U02-B01","mode":"bank","title":{"en":"Re-tests: let people back out, and keep things the same","ar":"إعادة اختبار: دَع الناس يتراجعون، واجعل التصميم متّسقًا"},"steps":[{"id":"S01","type":"tune","speaker":"sara","part":"retest","skill":"SK-P02-U02-01","value":{"en":"Re-test, user control and freedom (NN/g): exits should be easy to find and well signposted, like in a building. A full-screen video with a hidden exit leaves people stuck.","ar":"إعادة اختبار، تحكّم المستخدم وحريته (NN/g): يجب أن تكون المخارج سهلة الإيجاد وواضحة العلامات، كما في المباني. والفيديو بملء الشاشة بمخرج مخفي يترك الناس عالقين."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/user-control-and-freedom/","quote":"Like in a physical space, exits should be easy to find and well signposted so that they will be discovered when needed."},"scenario":{"en":"I'm designing a cooking video app. Videos open full screen, and the controls, including the way out, only appear if you tap a small spot in the corner.","ar":"أصمّم تطبيقًا لفيديوهات الطبخ. تُفتح الفيديوهات بملء الشاشة، ولا تظهر أزرار التحكم، ومنها زر الخروج، إلا إذا ضغطت نقطة صغيرة في الزاوية."},"prompt":{"en":"What should I change?","ar":"ماذا أغيّر ليجد الناس طريقة الخروج من الفيديو بسهولة؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"tabkha","name":{"en":"Tabkha","ar":"طبخة"},"color":"#EA580C","icon":"cooking-pot","domain":"tabkha.example"},"theme":"dark","blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"food-grill","size":"xl","note":{"en":"Controls appear only after a tap on this corner","ar":"تظهر الأزرار فقط بعد الضغط على هذه الزاوية"}},{"kind":"small","text":"⋯","tone":"faint"}]},"options":[{"id":"tap","text":{"en":"Show the controls, with a clear ✕ Close, whenever people tap anywhere on the video","ar":"أُظهر أزرار التحكم، ومعها «✕ إغلاق» واضح، كلما ضغط الناس على أي مكان في الفيديو"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"tabkha","name":{"en":"Tabkha","ar":"طبخة"},"color":"#EA580C","icon":"cooking-pot","domain":"tabkha.example"},"theme":"dark","blocks":[{"kind":"button","style":"text","icon":"x","text":{"en":"Close","ar":"إغلاق"}},{"kind":"image","art":"food-grill","size":"xl","note":{"en":"A tap anywhere shows the controls","ar":"ضغطة في أي مكان تُظهر الأزرار"}},{"kind":"progress","value":30,"label":"2:40 / 8:45","gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"swipe","text":{"en":"Let people swipe down with two fingers to leave","ar":"أتيح للناس السحب لأسفل بإصبعين للخروج"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"tabkha","name":{"en":"Tabkha","ar":"طبخة"},"color":"#EA580C","icon":"cooking-pot","domain":"tabkha.example"},"theme":"dark","blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"food-grill","size":"xl","note":{"en":"Swipe down with two fingers to leave","ar":"اسحب لأسفل بإصبعين للخروج"}},{"kind":"small","text":"⋯","tone":"faint"}]}},{"id":"end","text":{"en":"Close the video by itself when it ends","ar":"أُغلق الفيديو وحده حين ينتهي"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"tabkha","name":{"en":"Tabkha","ar":"طبخة"},"color":"#EA580C","icon":"cooking-pot","domain":"tabkha.example"},"theme":"dark","blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"food-grill","size":"xl","note":{"en":"Closes by itself only when the video ends","ar":"يُغلق وحده فقط حين ينتهي الفيديو"}},{"kind":"small","text":"⋯","tone":"faint"}]}}],"answer":["tap"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P02-013","when":["swipe","end"],"feedback":{"en":"Neither gives people a way out they can see. Someone who wants to leave halfway still has to guess.","ar":"لا يعطي أيٌّ من الخيارين الناسَ مخرجًا ظاهرًا. ومن يريد الخروج في منتصف الفيديو ما زال عليه أن يخمّن."}}],"correct":{"en":"Make the exit easy to find.","ar":"اجعل الخروج ظاهرًا وسهلًا."},"explain":{"en":"Tapping anywhere is what people try first, and a labelled Close then shows them exactly how to leave.","ar":"الضغط على أي مكان هو أول ما يجرّبه الناس، ثم يُريهم زر «إغلاق» الواضح كيف يخرجون بالضبط."}},{"id":"S02","type":"tune","speaker":"tarek","part":"retest","skill":"SK-P02-U02-01","value":{"en":"Re-test, user control and freedom (NN/g): an ✕ can be mistaken for Close rather than Cancel. In a money transfer, label the exit with what it does.","ar":"إعادة اختبار، تحكّم المستخدم وحريته (NN/g): قد تُفهم علامة ✕ على أنها «إغلاق» لا «إلغاء». وفي تحويل المال، اكتب على المخرج ما يفعله."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/user-control-and-freedom/","quote":"sometimes X can be mistaken for Close, rather than Cancel."},"scenario":{"en":"In our banking app, the transfer screen has a small ✕ at the top. Some customers tap it to close the screen and think the transfer still went through. Others don't dare tap it.","ar":"في تطبيق البنك عندنا، في شاشة التحويل علامة ✕ صغيرة في الأعلى. يضغطها بعض العملاء ليغلقوا الشاشة ويظنون أن التحويل تمّ. وآخرون لا يجرؤون على ضغطها."},"prompt":{"en":"What should the exit look like?","ar":"كيف يكون زر الخروج ليعرف العملاء بالضبط ما سيحدث للتحويل؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rasid","name":{"en":"Rasid","ar":"رصيد"},"color":"#1C3D6E","icon":"bank","domain":"rasid.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Transfer","ar":"تحويل"},"actions":[{"icon":"x","aria":{"en":"Close","ar":"إغلاق"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","avatar":{"text":"Omar Hany"},"text":{"en":"Omar Hany","ar":"عمر هاني"},"sub":"EG38 •••• 4417"},{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"EGP 3,500","ar":"3,500 جنيه"},"size":"l","gap":"m"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Send money","ar":"حوّل المبلغ"}}]},"options":[{"id":"x","text":{"en":"Keep the ✕; it's a known icon","ar":"تبقى ✕؛ فهي أيقونة معروفة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rasid","name":{"en":"Rasid","ar":"رصيد"},"color":"#1C3D6E","icon":"bank","domain":"rasid.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Transfer","ar":"تحويل"},"actions":[{"icon":"x","aria":{"en":"Close","ar":"إغلاق"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","avatar":{"text":"Omar Hany"},"text":{"en":"Omar Hany","ar":"عمر هاني"},"sub":"EG38 •••• 4417"},{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"EGP 3,500","ar":"3,500 جنيه"},"size":"l","gap":"m"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Send money","ar":"حوّل المبلغ"}}]}},{"id":"label","text":{"en":"A \"Cancel transfer\" button next to \"Send money\"","ar":"زر «ألغِ التحويل» بجانب «حوّل المبلغ»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rasid","name":{"en":"Rasid","ar":"رصيد"},"color":"#1C3D6E","icon":"bank","domain":"rasid.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Transfer","ar":"تحويل"}},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","avatar":{"text":"Omar Hany"},"text":{"en":"Omar Hany","ar":"عمر هاني"},"sub":"EG38 •••• 4417"},{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"EGP 3,500","ar":"3,500 جنيه"},"size":"l","gap":"m"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Send money","ar":"حوّل المبلغ"}},{"kind":"button","style":"outline","text":{"en":"Cancel transfer","ar":"ألغِ التحويل"},"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"red","text":{"en":"Make the ✕ red","ar":"أجعل ✕ حمراء"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rasid","name":{"en":"Rasid","ar":"رصيد"},"color":"#1C3D6E","icon":"bank","domain":"rasid.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Transfer","ar":"تحويل"}},"blocks":[{"kind":"row","blocks":[{"kind":"iconbtn","icon":"x","color":"red","aria":{"en":"Close","ar":"إغلاق"},"note":{"en":"Now red; still no word on what it does","ar":"صارت حمراء؛ وما زال لا شيء يقول ماذا تفعل"}}]},{"kind":"listitem","avatar":{"text":"Omar Hany"},"text":{"en":"Omar Hany","ar":"عمر هاني"},"sub":"EG38 •••• 4417"},{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"EGP 3,500","ar":"3,500 جنيه"},"size":"l","gap":"m"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Send money","ar":"حوّل المبلغ"}}]}}],"answer":["label"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P02-013","when":["x","red"],"feedback":{"en":"The ✕ still doesn't say whether it cancels the transfer or only closes the screen. With money involved, people need to be sure.","ar":"ما زالت ✕ لا تقول إن كانت تلغي التحويل أم تغلق الشاشة فقط. وحين يتعلق الأمر بالمال، يحتاج الناس إلى اليقين."}}],"correct":{"en":"Say exactly what the exit does.","ar":"قل بالضبط ما يفعله المخرج."},"explain":{"en":"\"Cancel transfer\" leaves no doubt: no money moves. Customers can leave calmly, or stay and send.","ar":"«ألغِ التحويل» لا تترك أي شك: لن يُحوَّل أي مبلغ. فيستطيع العملاء المغادرة بهدوء، أو البقاء وإتمام التحويل."}},{"id":"S03","type":"tune","speaker":"nour","part":"retest","skill":"SK-P02-U02-02","value":{"en":"Re-test, user control and freedom (NN/g): when people make many changes in a row, support multiple undo and redo. Undoing only the last change is often not enough.","ar":"إعادة اختبار، تحكّم المستخدم وحريته (NN/g): حين يُجري الناس تغييرات كثيرة متتالية، ادعم التراجع والإعادة لعدة خطوات. فالتراجع عن آخر تغيير فقط لا يكفي غالبًا."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/user-control-and-freedom/","quote":"If users are likely to make many actions in short succession, support multiple Undo and Redo."},"scenario":{"en":"Doctors in my clinic write visit notes in our system. Its Undo only takes back the very last change. One doctor deleted a paragraph, typed two lines, and couldn't get the paragraph back.","ar":"يكتب الأطباء في عيادتي ملاحظات الزيارة في نظامنا. وزر «تراجع» (Undo) فيه يلغي آخر تغيير فقط. حذف طبيب فقرة، ثم كتب سطرين، فلم يستطع استعادة الفقرة."},"prompt":{"en":"What should the notes editor support?","ar":"ماذا يحتاج محرّر الملاحظات ليستعيد الطبيب ما حذفه؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"raha.example/staff/visits/2291/notes","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Today","ar":"اليوم"},{"en":"Patients","ar":"المرضى"}],"active":1,"actions":[{"icon":"arrow-counter-clockwise","aria":{"en":"Undo","ar":"تراجع"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Visit notes · Ahmed Samy","ar":"ملاحظات الزيارة · أحمد سامي"}},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"BP 130/85. Advised less salt.\nFollow up in 2 weeks.","ar":"الضغط 130/85. نُصح بتقليل الملح.\nمتابعة بعد أسبوعين."},"gap":"m","note":{"en":"A deleted paragraph sat here. Undo only brings back the last line.","ar":"كانت هنا فقرة محذوفة. «تراجع» يعيد آخر سطر فقط."}}]},"options":[{"id":"multi","text":{"en":"Undo and Redo for many steps, in the toolbar and with Ctrl+Z","ar":"«تراجع» و«إعادة» لخطوات كثيرة، في شريط الأدوات ومع Ctrl+Z"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"raha.example/staff/visits/2291/notes","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Today","ar":"اليوم"},{"en":"Patients","ar":"المرضى"}],"active":1,"actions":[{"icon":"arrow-counter-clockwise","aria":{"en":"Undo","ar":"تراجع"}},{"icon":"arrow-clockwise","aria":{"en":"Redo","ar":"إعادة"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Visit notes · Ahmed Samy","ar":"ملاحظات الزيارة · أحمد سامي"}},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"Patient reports headaches in the morning, mostly on work days.\nBP 130/85. Advised less salt.\nFollow up in 2 weeks.","ar":"يشكو المريض من صداع في الصباح، غالبًا في أيام العمل.\nالضغط 130/85. نُصح بتقليل الملح.\nمتابعة بعد أسبوعين."},"gap":"m","note":{"en":"Undo ×3 (Ctrl+Z): the paragraph is back","ar":"«تراجع» 3 مرات (Ctrl+Z): عادت الفقرة"}}]}},{"id":"confirm","text":{"en":"A warning before deleting any text","ar":"تحذير قبل حذف أي نص"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"raha.example/staff/visits/2291/notes","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Today","ar":"اليوم"},{"en":"Patients","ar":"المرضى"}],"active":1,"actions":[{"icon":"arrow-counter-clockwise","aria":{"en":"Undo","ar":"تراجع"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Visit notes · Ahmed Samy","ar":"ملاحظات الزيارة · أحمد سامي"}},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"BP 130/85. Advised less salt.\nFollow up in 2 weeks.","ar":"الضغط 130/85. نُصح بتقليل الملح.\nمتابعة بعد أسبوعين."},"gap":"m"}],"overlay":{"type":"dialog","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Delete this text?","ar":"هل تحذف هذا النص؟"}},{"kind":"button","style":"danger","text":{"en":"Delete","ar":"احذف"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"button","style":"text","text":{"en":"Cancel","ar":"إلغاء"},"gap":"s"}]}}},{"id":"save","text":{"en":"Auto-save every minute","ar":"حفظ تلقائي كل دقيقة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"raha.example/staff/visits/2291/notes","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Today","ar":"اليوم"},{"en":"Patients","ar":"المرضى"}],"active":1,"actions":[{"icon":"arrow-counter-clockwise","aria":{"en":"Undo","ar":"تراجع"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Visit notes · Ahmed Samy","ar":"ملاحظات الزيارة · أحمد سامي"}},{"kind":"small","icon":"cloud-check","color":"muted","gap":"s","text":{"en":"Saved automatically 1 min ago","ar":"حُفظ تلقائيًا منذ دقيقة"}},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"BP 130/85. Advised less salt.\nFollow up in 2 weeks.","ar":"الضغط 130/85. نُصح بتقليل الملح.\nمتابعة بعد أسبوعين."},"gap":"m","note":{"en":"A deleted paragraph sat here. Undo only brings back the last line.","ar":"كانت هنا فقرة محذوفة. «تراجع» يعيد آخر سطر فقط."}}]}}],"answer":["multi"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P02-015","when":["confirm"],"feedback":{"en":"A warning on every delete would interrupt doctors all day, and still not help once they've typed more.","ar":"التحذير مع كل حذف سيقاطع الأطباء طوال اليوم، ولن يساعد بعد أن يكتبوا المزيد."}},{"id":"MC-P02-014","when":["save"],"feedback":{"en":"Auto-save keeps the mistake too. It protects against losing work, not against a change you want to take back.","ar":"الحفظ التلقائي يحفظ الخطأ أيضًا. فهو يحمي من ضياع العمل، لا من تغيير تريد التراجع عنه."}}],"correct":{"en":"Let people step back as far as they need.","ar":"دَع الناس يرجعون بقدر ما يحتاجون."},"explain":{"en":"With many steps of undo, the doctor can go back past the two lines to the deleted paragraph, then redo anything worth keeping.","ar":"مع تراجع لخطوات كثيرة، يستطيع الطبيب أن يرجع إلى ما قبل السطرين حتى الفقرة المحذوفة، ثم يستخدم «إعادة» (Redo) ليستعيد ما يريد الاحتفاظ به."}},{"id":"S04","type":"tune","speaker":"rami","part":"retest","skill":"SK-P02-U02-02","value":{"en":"Re-test, user control and freedom (NN/g): where possible, build forms where people can use the browser's Back button. Losing everything on Back punishes a normal habit.","ar":"إعادة اختبار، تحكّم المستخدم وحريته (NN/g): ابنِ النماذج، حيثما أمكن، بحيث يستطيع الناس استخدام زر الرجوع في المتصفح. وضياع كل شيء عند الرجوع عقاب على عادة طبيعية."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/user-control-and-freedom/","quote":"Where possible, build forms where users can use the browser's Back button."},"scenario":{"en":"I'm designing a 3-page job application website. If an applicant presses the browser's Back button on page 3 to fix page 2, they get \"Session expired\" and must start over.","ar":"أصمّم موقعًا للتقديم على الوظائف في 3 صفحات. وإن ضغط المتقدّم زر الرجوع في المتصفح وهو في الصفحة 3 ليصلح الصفحة 2، تظهر له «انتهت الجلسة» وعليه أن يبدأ من جديد."},"prompt":{"en":"What should I ask the developers for?","ar":"ماذا أطلب من المطوّرين ليرجع المتقدّم دون أن يخسر ما كتبه؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"wazifa","name":{"en":"Wazifa","ar":"وظيفة"},"color":"#1971C2","icon":"identification-card","domain":"wazifa.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"wazifa.example/apply/ux-designer/step-2","blocks":[{"kind":"icon","icon":"clock-countdown","size":"l","color":"brand"},{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Session expired","ar":"انتهت الجلسة"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Please start your application again.","ar":"يرجى بدء طلبك من جديد."}},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Start again","ar":"ابدأ من جديد"},"gap":"m","note":{"en":"After browser Back on page 3","ar":"بعد زر الرجوع في المتصفح وهو في الصفحة 3"}}]},"options":[{"id":"block","text":{"en":"Disable the browser's Back button on these pages","ar":"تعطيل زر الرجوع في المتصفح في هذه الصفحات"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"wazifa","name":{"en":"Wazifa","ar":"وظيفة"},"color":"#1971C2","icon":"identification-card","domain":"wazifa.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"wazifa.example/apply/ux-designer/step-3","blocks":[{"kind":"progress","value":100,"label":{"en":"Step 3 of 3: Review","ar":"الخطوة 3 من 3: المراجعة"},"note":{"en":"Browser Back is turned off","ar":"زر الرجوع في المتصفح معطّل"}},{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Review your application","ar":"راجع طلبك"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Hoda Khaled · UI designer · 4 years","ar":"هدى خالد · مصممة واجهات · 4 سنوات"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Send application","ar":"أرسل الطلب"},"gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"work","text":{"en":"Make browser Back open page 2 with everything still filled in","ar":"أن يفتح زر الرجوع في المتصفح الصفحة 2 وكل ما فيها ما زال مكتوبًا"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"wazifa","name":{"en":"Wazifa","ar":"وظيفة"},"color":"#1971C2","icon":"identification-card","domain":"wazifa.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"wazifa.example/apply/ux-designer/step-2","blocks":[{"kind":"progress","value":66,"label":{"en":"Step 2 of 3: Experience","ar":"الخطوة 2 من 3: الخبرة"},"note":{"en":"After browser Back on page 3","ar":"بعد زر الرجوع في المتصفح وهي في الصفحة 3"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Last job title","ar":"آخر مسمّى وظيفي"},"text":{"en":"UI designer","ar":"مصممة واجهات"},"filled":true,"gap":"m"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Years of experience","ar":"سنوات الخبرة"},"text":"4","filled":true,"gap":"m"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Continue","ar":"تابع"},"gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"note","text":{"en":"Add a note: \"Don't use your browser's Back button\"","ar":"إضافة ملاحظة: «لا تستخدم زر الرجوع في المتصفح»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"wazifa","name":{"en":"Wazifa","ar":"وظيفة"},"color":"#1971C2","icon":"identification-card","domain":"wazifa.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"wazifa.example/apply/ux-designer/step-3","blocks":[{"kind":"banner","tone":"warn","icon":"warning","text":{"en":"Don't use your browser's Back button","ar":"لا تستخدم زر الرجوع في المتصفح"}},{"kind":"progress","value":100,"label":{"en":"Step 3 of 3: Review","ar":"الخطوة 3 من 3: المراجعة"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Review your application","ar":"راجع طلبك"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Hoda Khaled · UI designer · 4 years","ar":"هدى خالد · مصممة واجهات · 4 سنوات"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Send application","ar":"أرسل الطلب"},"gap":"m"}]}}],"answer":["work"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P02-012","when":["block","note"],"feedback":{"en":"People press Back without thinking. Blocking it or warning them in text still leaves them stuck, or losing their work.","ar":"يضغط الناس «رجوع» دون تفكير. وتعطيله أو التحذير منه بنص ما زال يتركهم عالقين، أو يُضيّع عملهم."}}],"correct":{"en":"Back takes them one page back, work kept.","ar":"«رجوع» يعيدهم صفحة واحدة، مع بقاء عملهم."},"explain":{"en":"Applicants expect Back to show the previous page as they left it. Keeping their answers lets them fix page 2 and carry on.","ar":"يتوقع المتقدّمون أن يُظهر «رجوع» الصفحة السابقة كما تركوها. والاحتفاظ بإجاباتهم يتيح لهم إصلاح الصفحة 2 والمتابعة."}},{"id":"S05","type":"tune","speaker":"youssef","part":"retest","skill":"SK-P02-U02-03","value":{"en":"Re-test, consistency and standards (NN/g): internal consistency shows in colours: one primary colour for all text links and primary buttons. Different colours for the same role confuse people.","ar":"إعادة اختبار، الاتساق والمعايير (NN/g): يظهر الاتساق الداخلي في الألوان: لون أساسي واحد لكل الروابط والأزرار الرئيسية. والألوان المختلفة للدور نفسه تربك الناس."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/consistency-and-standards/","quote":"an application may use orange as its primary color, which is then applied to all text links and primary buttons."},"scenario":{"en":"On my shop's product pages, **Add to cart** is orange. On the cart page, **Checkout** is grey, and grey is also the colour of disabled buttons elsewhere on the site.","ar":"في صفحات المنتجات بمتجري، زر **أضف إلى السلة** برتقالي. وفي صفحة السلة، زر **إتمام الشراء** رمادي، والرمادي هو أيضًا لون الأزرار المعطّلة في باقي الموقع."},"prompt":{"en":"What should I do with the Checkout button?","ar":"ماذا أفعل بزر «إتمام الشراء»؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Cart","ar":"السلة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","art":"box","text":{"en":"Electric drill 650 W","ar":"مثقاب كهربائي 650 وات"},"value":{"en":"EGP 1,250","ar":"1,250 جنيه"}},{"kind":"listitem","art":"box","text":{"en":"Drill bits, 10 pcs","ar":"بنط مثقاب، 10 قطع"},"value":{"en":"EGP 180","ar":"180 جنيه"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"Total EGP 1,430","ar":"الإجمالي 1,430 جنيه"},"gap":"m"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Checkout","ar":"إتمام الشراء"},"tone":"off"}]},"options":[{"id":"orange","text":{"en":"Make it orange, like every other main button","ar":"أجعله برتقاليًا، مثل كل الأزرار الرئيسية الأخرى"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Cart","ar":"السلة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","art":"box","text":{"en":"Electric drill 650 W","ar":"مثقاب كهربائي 650 وات"},"value":{"en":"EGP 1,250","ar":"1,250 جنيه"}},{"kind":"listitem","art":"box","text":{"en":"Drill bits, 10 pcs","ar":"بنط مثقاب، 10 قطع"},"value":{"en":"EGP 180","ar":"180 جنيه"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"Total EGP 1,430","ar":"الإجمالي 1,430 جنيه"},"gap":"m"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Checkout","ar":"إتمام الشراء"}}]}},{"id":"grey","text":{"en":"Keep it grey; the cart page has a calmer style","ar":"أُبقيه رماديًا؛ فلصفحة السلة أسلوب أهدأ"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Cart","ar":"السلة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","art":"box","text":{"en":"Electric drill 650 W","ar":"مثقاب كهربائي 650 وات"},"value":{"en":"EGP 1,250","ar":"1,250 جنيه"}},{"kind":"listitem","art":"box","text":{"en":"Drill bits, 10 pcs","ar":"بنط مثقاب، 10 قطع"},"value":{"en":"EGP 180","ar":"180 جنيه"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"Total EGP 1,430","ar":"الإجمالي 1,430 جنيه"},"gap":"m"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Checkout","ar":"إتمام الشراء"},"tone":"off"}]}},{"id":"arrow","text":{"en":"Keep it grey and add an arrow →","ar":"أُبقيه رماديًا وأضيف سهمًا ←"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Cart","ar":"السلة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","art":"box","text":{"en":"Electric drill 650 W","ar":"مثقاب كهربائي 650 وات"},"value":{"en":"EGP 1,250","ar":"1,250 جنيه"}},{"kind":"listitem","art":"box","text":{"en":"Drill bits, 10 pcs","ar":"بنط مثقاب، 10 قطع"},"value":{"en":"EGP 180","ar":"180 جنيه"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"Total EGP 1,430","ar":"الإجمالي 1,430 جنيه"},"gap":"m"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Checkout","ar":"إتمام الشراء"},"tone":"off","icon":"arrow-right"}]}}],"answer":["orange"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P02-016","when":["grey","arrow"],"feedback":{"en":"Customers have learned that grey means \"can't press yet\". A grey Checkout looks like it doesn't work.","ar":"تعلّم العملاء أن الرمادي يعني «لا يمكن الضغط بعد». فيبدو «إتمام الشراء» الرمادي كأنه لا يعمل."}}],"correct":{"en":"Same role, same colour.","ar":"الدور نفسه، اللون نفسه."},"explain":{"en":"Every main action on the site is orange, so customers look for orange to move on. Checkout is the most important main action of all.","ar":"كل إجراء رئيسي في الموقع برتقالي، فيبحث العملاء عن البرتقالي ليتقدّموا. و«إتمام الشراء» أهم إجراء رئيسي على الإطلاق."}},{"id":"S06","type":"choose","speaker":"mona","part":"retest","skill":"SK-P02-U02-03","value":{"en":"Re-test, consistency and standards (NN/g): decide once how forms show things like required fields, and make sure every form is designed the same way.","ar":"إعادة اختبار، الاتساق والمعايير (NN/g): قرّر مرة واحدة كيف تُظهر النماذج أشياء مثل الحقول المطلوبة، وتأكّد أن كل النماذج مصمّمة بالطريقة نفسها."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/consistency-and-standards/","quote":"make sure that each form on the site is designed in the same way."},"scenario":{"en":"Two designers on my team made the sign-up and the checkout forms. Sign-up marks required fields with a red star. Checkout marks the optional ones with \"(optional)\" and nothing on required fields.","ar":"أعدّ مصمّمان في فريقي نموذج التسجيل ونموذج الدفع. نموذج التسجيل يضع نجمة حمراء على الحقول المطلوبة. ونموذج الدفع يكتب «(اختياري)» على الحقول الاختيارية ولا يضع شيئًا على المطلوبة."},"prompt":{"en":"What should the team do?","ar":"ماذا يفعل الفريق ليعرف العملاء الحقول المطلوبة في كل نموذج؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Delivery","ar":"التوصيل"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Address","ar":"العنوان"},"text":""},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Floor (optional)","ar":"الدور (اختياري)"},"text":"","gap":"m"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Phone","ar":"الهاتف"},"text":"","gap":"m","note":{"en":"Sign-up marks required fields with a red *","ar":"نموذج التسجيل يضع * حمراء على الحقول المطلوبة"}}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Continue to payment","ar":"تابع إلى الدفع"}}]},"options":[{"id":"both","text":{"en":"Leave both; each form is clear on its own","ar":"يُبقيان الطريقتين كما هما؛ فكل نموذج واضح وحده"}},{"id":"one","text":{"en":"Pick one way, add it to our design system, and use it on every form","ar":"يختاران طريقة واحدة، ويضيفانها إلى الـ Design system (نظام التصميم)، ويستخدمانها في كل النماذج"}},{"id":"legend","text":{"en":"Add a legend at the top of each form explaining its marks","ar":"يضيفان شرحًا أعلى كل نموذج يوضّح علاماته"}}],"answer":["one"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P02-016","when":["both","legend"],"feedback":{"en":"A customer who learned \"no star means optional\" at sign-up will skip required fields at checkout. Explaining two systems is harder than having one.","ar":"العميل الذي تعلّم في التسجيل أن «غياب النجمة يعني اختياري» سيتخطّى الحقول المطلوبة في الدفع. وشرح نظامين أصعب من وجود نظام واحد."}}],"correct":{"en":"One rule, written down, used everywhere.","ar":"قاعدة واحدة، مكتوبة، تُستخدم في كل مكان."},"explain":{"en":"Putting the choice in the design system means every new form gets it right without anyone deciding again.","ar":"وضع القرار في الـ Design system يعني أن كل نموذج جديد يلتزم به دون أن يقرّر أحد من جديد."}},{"id":"S07","type":"tune","speaker":"karim","part":"retest","skill":"SK-P02-U02-04","value":{"en":"Re-test, consistency and standards (NN/g): blue underlined text is clickable, a convention people know from the whole web. Using it for plain emphasis makes people click and get nothing.","ar":"إعادة اختبار، الاتساق والمعايير (NN/g): النص الأزرق المسطّر قابل للضغط، وهو عُرف يعرفه الناس من الويب كله. واستخدامه للتأكيد فقط يجعل الناس يضغطون فلا يحدث شيء."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/consistency-and-standards/","quote":"Blue underlined text is clickable"},"scenario":{"en":"In a news website I'm building, the editors want important phrases in articles to stand out, so they made them blue and underlined. They aren't links.","ar":"في موقع إخباري أبنيه، يريد المحرّرون أن تبرز العبارات المهمة في المقالات، فجعلوها زرقاء مسطّرة. وهي ليست روابط."},"prompt":{"en":"What should I suggest?","ar":"ماذا أقترح على المحرّرين؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"khabar","name":{"en":"Khabar","ar":"خبر"},"color":"#212529","icon":"newspaper","domain":"khabar.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"khabar.example/economy/rent-prices-2026","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"News","ar":"أخبار"},{"en":"Economy","ar":"اقتصاد"},{"en":"Sport","ar":"رياضة"}],"active":1},"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Rents rose 12% this year","ar":"ارتفاع الإيجارات 12% هذا العام"}},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"Prices rose fastest in","ar":"ارتفعت الأسعار أسرع في"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"link","text":{"en":"new cities","ar":"المدن الجديدة"},"gap":"xs","note":{"en":"Blue and underlined, but not links","ar":"زرقاء مسطّرة، لكنها ليست روابط"}},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"while older districts stayed flat. Tenants are moving to","ar":"بينما بقيت الأحياء القديمة ثابتة. ويتجه المستأجرون إلى"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"link","text":{"en":"shared flats","ar":"الشقق المشتركة"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"to save.","ar":"للتوفير."},"gap":"xs"}]},"options":[{"id":"keep","text":{"en":"Keep them; readers will get used to it","ar":"تبقى؛ وسيعتاد القرّاء عليها"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"khabar","name":{"en":"Khabar","ar":"خبر"},"color":"#212529","icon":"newspaper","domain":"khabar.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"khabar.example/economy/rent-prices-2026","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"News","ar":"أخبار"},{"en":"Economy","ar":"اقتصاد"},{"en":"Sport","ar":"رياضة"}],"active":1},"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Rents rose 12% this year","ar":"ارتفاع الإيجارات 12% هذا العام"}},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"Prices rose fastest in","ar":"ارتفعت الأسعار أسرع في"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"link","text":{"en":"new cities","ar":"المدن الجديدة"},"gap":"xs","note":{"en":"Blue and underlined, but not links","ar":"زرقاء مسطّرة، لكنها ليست روابط"}},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"while older districts stayed flat. Tenants are moving to","ar":"بينما بقيت الأحياء القديمة ثابتة. ويتجه المستأجرون إلى"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"link","text":{"en":"shared flats","ar":"الشقق المشتركة"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"to save.","ar":"للتوفير."},"gap":"xs"}]}},{"id":"bold","text":{"en":"Show important phrases in bold, and keep blue underline for links only","ar":"تُعرض العبارات المهمة بخط عريض، ويبقى الأزرق المسطّر للروابط فقط"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"khabar","name":{"en":"Khabar","ar":"خبر"},"color":"#212529","icon":"newspaper","domain":"khabar.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"khabar.example/economy/rent-prices-2026","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"News","ar":"أخبار"},{"en":"Economy","ar":"اقتصاد"},{"en":"Sport","ar":"رياضة"}],"active":1},"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Rents rose 12% this year","ar":"ارتفاع الإيجارات 12% هذا العام"}},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"Prices rose fastest in **new cities**, while older districts stayed flat. Tenants are moving to **shared flats** to save.","ar":"ارتفعت الأسعار أسرع في **المدن الجديدة**، بينما بقيت الأحياء القديمة ثابتة. ويتجه المستأجرون إلى **الشقق المشتركة** للتوفير."},"gap":"m","note":{"en":"Important phrases in bold only","ar":"العبارات المهمة بخط عريض فقط"}},{"kind":"link","text":{"en":"Read more: how rents are set","ar":"اقرأ أيضًا: كيف تُحدَّد الإيجارات"},"gap":"s","note":{"en":"Blue underline: links only","ar":"الأزرق المسطّر للروابط فقط"}}]}},{"id":"tip","text":{"en":"Keep them, and show \"Not a link\" when people hover","ar":"تبقى، مع ظهور «ليس رابطًا» حين يمرّ الناس عليها بالمؤشر"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"khabar","name":{"en":"Khabar","ar":"خبر"},"color":"#212529","icon":"newspaper","domain":"khabar.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"khabar.example/economy/rent-prices-2026","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"News","ar":"أخبار"},{"en":"Economy","ar":"اقتصاد"},{"en":"Sport","ar":"رياضة"}],"active":1},"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Rents rose 12% this year","ar":"ارتفاع الإيجارات 12% هذا العام"}},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"Prices rose fastest in","ar":"ارتفعت الأسعار أسرع في"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"link","text":{"en":"new cities","ar":"المدن الجديدة"},"gap":"xs","note":{"en":"On hover: \"Not a link\"","ar":"عند المرور بالمؤشر: «ليس رابطًا»"}},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"while older districts stayed flat. Tenants are moving to","ar":"بينما بقيت الأحياء القديمة ثابتة. ويتجه المستأجرون إلى"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"link","text":{"en":"shared flats","ar":"الشقق المشتركة"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"to save.","ar":"للتوفير."},"gap":"xs"}]}}],"answer":["bold"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P02-018","when":["keep","tip"],"feedback":{"en":"Readers will keep clicking, because every other site taught them that blue underline is a link. Then they'll stop trusting the real links too.","ar":"سيستمر القرّاء في الضغط، لأن كل المواقع الأخرى علّمتهم أن الأزرق المسطّر رابط. ثم سيتوقفون عن الثقة في الروابط الحقيقية أيضًا."}}],"correct":{"en":"Leave the link style for links.","ar":"اترك شكل الرابط للروابط."},"explain":{"en":"Bold gives emphasis without promising a click. Blue underline keeps its one meaning, so real links stay easy to spot.","ar":"الخط العريض يعطي التأكيد دون أن يعِد بالضغط. ويحتفظ الأزرق المسطّر بمعناه الوحيد، فتبقى الروابط الحقيقية سهلة الرؤية."}},{"id":"S08","type":"tune","speaker":"hana","part":"retest","skill":"SK-P02-U02-04","value":{"en":"Re-test, consistency and standards (NN/g): don't reinvent common components such as notifications, modals and pulldown menus. A custom spinning menu makes people learn a new control.","ar":"إعادة اختبار، الاتساق والمعايير (NN/g): لا تعِد اختراع العناصر الشائعة مثل الإشعارات والنوافذ والقوائم المنسدلة. والقائمة الدوّارة الخاصة تجبر الناس على تعلّم عنصر جديد."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/consistency-and-standards/","quote":"when it comes to designing common components such as notifications, modals, pulldown menus, and so on."},"scenario":{"en":"A web agency proposed a fun menu for my gym's website: a wheel that spins to show one section at a time. You drag it to reach the next one.","ar":"اقترحت شركة تصميم قائمة مرحة لموقع النادي الرياضي الذي أديره: عجلة تدور لتعرض قسمًا واحدًا في كل مرة، وتسحبها لتصل إلى القسم التالي."},"prompt":{"en":"Should I accept it?","ar":"هل أقبل هذه القائمة، والزوار يريدون أن يجدوا الجدول والأسعار بسرعة؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"nashat.example","blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"gym","size":"m"},{"kind":"icon","icon":"circle-notch","size":"l","color":"brand","gap":"m","note":{"en":"Drag to spin: one section at a time","ar":"اسحب لتدوير العجلة: قسم واحد في كل مرة"}},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Timetable","ar":"الجدول"},"gap":"s"}]},"options":[{"id":"yes","text":{"en":"Yes; it makes the site memorable","ar":"نعم؛ فهي تجعل الموقع لا يُنسى"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"nashat.example","blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"gym","size":"m"},{"kind":"icon","icon":"circle-notch","size":"l","color":"brand","gap":"m","note":{"en":"Drag to spin: one section at a time","ar":"اسحب لتدوير العجلة: قسم واحد في كل مرة"}},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Timetable","ar":"الجدول"},"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"both","text":{"en":"Yes, with a short animation showing how to drag it","ar":"نعم، مع حركة قصيرة توضّح كيف تُسحب"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"nashat.example","blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"gym","size":"m"},{"kind":"icon","icon":"circle-notch","size":"l","color":"brand","gap":"m","note":{"en":"A short animation shows how to drag it","ar":"حركة قصيرة توضّح كيف تُسحب"}},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Timetable","ar":"الجدول"},"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"no","text":{"en":"No; ask for a standard menu that shows all sections at once","ar":"لا؛ أطلب قائمة عادية تعرض كل الأقسام مرة واحدة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"nashat.example","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Timetable","ar":"الجدول"},{"en":"Prices","ar":"الأسعار"},{"en":"Branches","ar":"الفروع"},{"en":"Trainers","ar":"المدرّبون"},{"en":"Contact","ar":"تواصل معنا"}],"active":0},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"gym","size":"m"},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Timetable","ar":"الجدول"},"gap":"s"}]}}],"answer":["no"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P02-018","when":["yes","both"],"feedback":{"en":"Visitors come to find the timetable or prices, not to learn a new menu. They can't even see which sections exist until they spin through them.","ar":"يأتي الزوار ليجدوا الجدول أو الأسعار، لا ليتعلّموا قائمة جديدة. ولا يستطيعون حتى أن يروا الأقسام الموجودة قبل أن يدوّروا العجلة كلها."}}],"correct":{"en":"Use the menu people already know.","ar":"استخدم القائمة التي يعرفها الناس أصلًا."},"explain":{"en":"A standard menu shows every section at a glance and works the way visitors expect. Personality can come from photos, colours and words.","ar":"القائمة العادية تُظهر كل الأقسام من نظرة واحدة وتعمل كما يتوقع الزوار. أما الطابع المميّز للموقع فيأتي من الصور والألوان والكلمات."}}]}$uxg$::jsonb),
  ($uxg$P02-U03-B01$uxg$, $uxg$9ca1df1bfa99261493054e83c6879171e946406ddb280ab7c04ac0b263ad218d$uxg$, $uxg${"id":"P02-U03-B01","mode":"bank","title":{"en":"Re-tests: stop errors early, and don't make people remember","ar":"إعادة اختبار: امنع الأخطاء مبكرًا، ولا تُجبر الناس على التذكّر"},"steps":[{"id":"S01","type":"tune","speaker":"hana","part":"retest","skill":"SK-P02-U03-01","value":{"en":"Re-test, preventing slips (NN/g): where clear rules define what's acceptable, constrain the input. If members may bring at most two guests, the control shouldn't allow more.","ar":"إعادة اختبار، منع الزلّات (NN/g): حين تحدّد قواعد واضحة ما هو مقبول، ضع حدودًا للإدخال. فإن كان للعضو أن يُحضر ضيفين على الأكثر، فلا يجب أن يسمح العنصر بأكثر."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/slips/","quote":"in cases where there are clear rules that define acceptable options, it can be a good strategy to constrain the types of input users can make."},"scenario":{"en":"Members of my gym can bring up to two guests a month. The booking form has a text box for the number of guests. Some type 3 or 20, and only learn at the door that it's not allowed.","ar":"يستطيع أعضاء النادي الرياضي الذي أديره إحضار ضيفين على الأكثر كل شهر. وفي نموذج الحجز حقل نصي (Text field) لعدد الضيوف. يكتب بعضهم 3 أو 20، ولا يعرفون أن هذا غير مسموح إلا عند الباب."},"prompt":{"en":"What should the form use?","ar":"ماذا يستخدم النموذج ليمنع الأعضاء من كتابة عدد غير مسموح؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Bring a guest","ar":"أحضِر ضيفًا"},"back":true},"keyboard":"number","blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","art":"gym","text":{"en":"Spinning · Thu 7 pm","ar":"Spinning · الخميس 7 م"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Number of guests","ar":"عدد الضيوف"},"text":"20","filled":true,"focus":true,"gap":"m","note":{"en":"Allowed: 2 a month","ar":"المسموح: ضيفان شهريًا"}}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Book","ar":"احجز"}}]},"options":[{"id":"stepper","text":{"en":"A − / + control from 0 to 2, showing \"2 guests left this month\"","ar":"عنصر Stepper (− / +) من 0 إلى 2، مع «بقي لك ضيفان هذا الشهر»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Bring a guest","ar":"أحضِر ضيفًا"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","art":"gym","text":{"en":"Spinning · Thu 7 pm","ar":"Spinning · الخميس 7 م"}},{"kind":"stepper","label":{"en":"Number of guests","ar":"عدد الضيوف"},"text":"2","min":0,"max":2,"hint":{"en":"2 guests left this month","ar":"بقي لك ضيفان هذا الشهر"},"gap":"m"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Book","ar":"احجز"}}]}},{"id":"rule","text":{"en":"Keep the text box, and print the rule under it","ar":"يبقى مربع النص، مع كتابة القاعدة تحته"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Bring a guest","ar":"أحضِر ضيفًا"},"back":true},"keyboard":"number","blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","art":"gym","text":{"en":"Spinning · Thu 7 pm","ar":"Spinning · الخميس 7 م"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Number of guests","ar":"عدد الضيوف"},"text":"20","filled":true,"focus":true,"gap":"m","note":{"en":"Allowed: 2 a month","ar":"المسموح: ضيفان شهريًا"},"hint":{"en":"Up to 2 guests a month","ar":"حتى ضيفين في الشهر"}}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Book","ar":"احجز"}}]}},{"id":"door","text":{"en":"Keep it; staff will explain at the door","ar":"يبقى كما هو؛ وسيشرح الموظفون عند الباب"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Bring a guest","ar":"أحضِر ضيفًا"},"back":true},"keyboard":"number","blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","art":"gym","text":{"en":"Spinning · Thu 7 pm","ar":"Spinning · الخميس 7 م"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Number of guests","ar":"عدد الضيوف"},"text":"20","filled":true,"focus":true,"gap":"m","note":{"en":"Allowed: 2 a month","ar":"المسموح: ضيفان شهريًا"}}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Book","ar":"احجز"}}]}}],"answer":["stepper"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P02-020","when":["rule","door"],"feedback":{"en":"The box still accepts numbers that can't work. Members who skip the rule only find out when they're turned away.","ar":"ما زال المربع يقبل أرقامًا غير مسموحة. ومن يتجاوز القاعدة من الأعضاء لا يعرف إلا حين يُمنع ضيفه."}}],"correct":{"en":"Allow only valid choices.","ar":"اسمح بالاختيارات الصحيحة فقط."},"explain":{"en":"The control can't go above 2, so the slip can't happen, and \"2 guests left\" explains the limit without a rule to read.","ar":"العنصر لا يتجاوز 2، فلا يمكن أن تقع الزلّة (Slip)، و«بقي لك ضيفان» تشرح الحد دون أن يقرأ العضو أي قاعدة."}},{"id":"S02","type":"compare","speaker":"karim","part":"retest","skill":"SK-P02-U03-01","value":{"en":"Re-test, error prevention (NN/g): poorly differentiated options, with similar names or similar styling, cause slips. A test send and a send to everyone shouldn't look alike side by side.","ar":"إعادة اختبار، منع الأخطاء (NN/g): الخيارات غير المتمايزة، بأسماء متشابهة أو شكل متشابه، تسبّب الزلّات. فإرسال التجربة والإرسال للجميع لا يجب أن يتشابها متجاورين."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/error-prevention/","quote":"Poorly differentiated options: When an interface provides multiple choices, but it uses similar names or similar visual styling for them"},"scenario":{"en":"I'm building an email newsletter tool. Last week a customer sent a half-finished draft to 40,000 people. They meant to send a test to themselves.","ar":"أبني أداة لإرسال النشرات البريدية. في الأسبوع الماضي أرسل أحد العملاء مسودّة غير مكتملة إلى 40 ألف شخص. وكان يقصد أن يرسل تجربة إلى نفسه."},"prompt":{"en":"Which version makes that slip less likely?","ar":"أيّ نسخة تقلّل احتمال إرسال المسودّة إلى كل المشتركين بالخطأ؟"},"a":{"label":{"en":"Version A: two matching buttons","ar":"النسخة A: زرّان متشابهان متجاوران"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"bareed","name":{"en":"Bareed","ar":"بريد"},"color":"#0284C7","icon":"envelope-simple","domain":"bareed.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"bareed.example/campaigns/november-news","blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"November news","ar":"أخبار نوفمبر"}},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"To: 40,000 subscribers","ar":"إلى: 40 ألف مشترك"}},{"kind":"row","gap":"l","blocks":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Send test","ar":"إرسال تجربة"}},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Send all","ar":"إرسال للكل"}}]}]}},"b":{"label":{"en":"Version B: different and apart","ar":"النسخة B: زرّان مختلفان ومتباعدان"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"bareed","name":{"en":"Bareed","ar":"بريد"},"color":"#0284C7","icon":"envelope-simple","domain":"bareed.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"bareed.example/campaigns/november-news","blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"November news","ar":"أخبار نوفمبر"}},{"kind":"link","icon":"paper-plane-tilt","text":{"en":"Send a test to me (me@mynews.example)","ar":"أرسل تجربة إليّ (me@mynews.example)"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Send to 40,000 subscribers…","ar":"أرسل إلى 40 ألف مشترك…"},"gap":"xl"}]}},"answer":"b","misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P02-020","when":["a"],"feedback":{"en":"Two same-looking buttons side by side, with similar words, are exactly where a hurried tap lands on the wrong one.","ar":"حين يتجاور زرّان متشابهان بكلمات متقاربة، تقع الضغطة المستعجلة على الزر الخطأ بسهولة."}}],"correct":{"en":"B: different looks, clear words, some distance.","ar":"B: شكلان مختلفان، وكلمات واضحة، ومسافة بينهما."},"explain":{"en":"The test is a quiet link that names who gets it; the big send names the 40,000 people and sits apart. The two can't be mistaken for each other at a glance.","ar":"التجربة رابط بسيط يذكر من سيستلمها؛ والإرسال الكبير يذكر الأربعين ألفًا ويقع بعيدًا. فلا يمكن الخلط بينهما من نظرة."}},{"id":"S03","type":"tune","speaker":"youssef","part":"retest","skill":"SK-P02-U03-02","value":{"en":"Re-test, confirmation dialogs (NN/g): many confirmations fail through lack of specificity. \"Delete 2 items?\" doesn't say which items, so people can't catch a mistake.","ar":"إعادة اختبار، نوافذ التأكيد (NN/g): كثير من نوافذ التأكيد تفشل لأنها غير محددة. و«حذف عنصرين؟» لا تقول أيّ عنصرين، فلا يستطيع الناس اكتشاف الخطأ."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/confirmation-dialog/","quote":"The problem with the multiple-file confirmation plagues many confirmation dialogs: lack of specificity."},"scenario":{"en":"In my shop's dashboard, I select products and tap **Delete**. The dialog says \"Delete 2 items? OK / Cancel\". Last week I deleted my best-selling drill by mistake.","ar":"في لوحة التحكم بمتجري، أختار منتجات وأضغط **احذف**. فتقول النافذة «حذف عنصرين؟ موافق / إلغاء». وفي الأسبوع الماضي حذفت أكثر مثقاب مبيعًا بالخطأ."},"prompt":{"en":"What should the dialog show?","ar":"ماذا تعرض النافذة لأنتبه قبل أن أحذف منتجًا بالخطأ؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"dar.example/seller/products","blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"check-square","text":{"en":"Electric drill 650 W","ar":"مثقاب كهربائي 650 وات"},"value":{"en":"320 sold","ar":"بيع 320"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"check-square","text":{"en":"Old paint roller","ar":"رولة دهان قديمة"},"value":{"en":"2 sold","ar":"بيع 2"},"gap":"s"}],"overlay":{"type":"dialog","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Delete 2 items?","ar":"حذف عنصرين؟"}},{"kind":"row","gap":"m","blocks":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"OK","ar":"موافق"}},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Cancel","ar":"إلغاء"},"style":"outline"}]}]}},"options":[{"id":"names","text":{"en":"The product names and photos, and buttons \"Delete 2 products\" / \"Keep them\"","ar":"أسماء المنتجات وصورها، وأزرار «احذف المنتجين» / «أبقِهما»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"dar.example/seller/products","blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"check-square","text":{"en":"Electric drill 650 W","ar":"مثقاب كهربائي 650 وات"},"value":{"en":"320 sold","ar":"بيع 320"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"check-square","text":{"en":"Old paint roller","ar":"رولة دهان قديمة"},"value":{"en":"2 sold","ar":"بيع 2"},"gap":"s"}],"overlay":{"type":"dialog","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Delete 2 products?","ar":"حذف منتجين؟"}},{"kind":"listitem","art":"box","text":{"en":"Electric drill 650 W","ar":"مثقاب كهربائي 650 وات"},"sub":{"en":"320 sold","ar":"بيع 320"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"listitem","art":"box","text":{"en":"Old paint roller","ar":"رولة دهان قديمة"},"sub":{"en":"2 sold","ar":"بيع 2"}},{"kind":"row","gap":"m","blocks":[{"kind":"button","style":"danger","text":{"en":"Delete 2 products","ar":"احذف المنتجين"}},{"kind":"button","style":"outline","text":{"en":"Keep them","ar":"أبقِهما"}}]}]}}},{"id":"red","text":{"en":"The same text in red","ar":"النص نفسه باللون الأحمر"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"dar.example/seller/products","blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"check-square","text":{"en":"Electric drill 650 W","ar":"مثقاب كهربائي 650 وات"},"value":{"en":"320 sold","ar":"بيع 320"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"check-square","text":{"en":"Old paint roller","ar":"رولة دهان قديمة"},"value":{"en":"2 sold","ar":"بيع 2"},"gap":"s"}],"overlay":{"type":"dialog","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","color":"red","text":{"en":"Delete 2 items?","ar":"حذف عنصرين؟"}},{"kind":"row","gap":"m","blocks":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"OK","ar":"موافق"}},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Cancel","ar":"إلغاء"},"style":"outline"}]}]}}},{"id":"type","text":{"en":"Ask me to type DELETE to confirm","ar":"أن تطلب مني كتابة «احذف» للتأكيد"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"dar.example/seller/products","blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"check-square","text":{"en":"Electric drill 650 W","ar":"مثقاب كهربائي 650 وات"},"value":{"en":"320 sold","ar":"بيع 320"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"check-square","text":{"en":"Old paint roller","ar":"رولة دهان قديمة"},"value":{"en":"2 sold","ar":"بيع 2"},"gap":"s"}],"overlay":{"type":"dialog","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Delete 2 items?","ar":"حذف عنصرين؟"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Type DELETE to confirm","ar":"اكتب «احذف» للتأكيد"},"text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"row","gap":"m","blocks":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"OK","ar":"موافق"}},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Cancel","ar":"إلغاء"},"style":"outline"}]}]}}}],"answer":["names"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P02-022","when":["red","type"],"feedback":{"en":"Red text or typing a word makes me slow down, but I still can't see which products I'm deleting, so I can't spot the wrong one.","ar":"النص الأحمر أو كتابة كلمة يجعلانني أبطئ، لكنني ما زلت لا أرى المنتجات التي أحذفها، فلا أستطيع ملاحظة الخطأ."}}],"correct":{"en":"Show exactly what will be deleted.","ar":"اعرض بالضبط ما سيُحذف."},"explain":{"en":"Seeing the drill's name and photo is what lets me notice it's in the wrong pile. Buttons that repeat the action make the choice clear.","ar":"رؤية اسم المثقاب وصورته هي ما يجعلني ألاحظ أنه في المكان الخطأ. والأزرار التي تكرّر الإجراء تجعل الاختيار واضحًا."}},{"id":"S04","type":"tune","speaker":"tarek","part":"retest","skill":"SK-P02-U03-02","value":{"en":"Re-test, error prevention (NN/g): remove error-prone conditions, or check for them and offer a confirmation before people commit. Closing an account is serious and final; renaming it isn't.","ar":"إعادة اختبار، منع الأخطاء (NN/g): أزِل الظروف التي تسبّب الأخطاء، أو تحقّق منها واعرض تأكيدًا قبل أن يلتزم الناس. وإغلاق الحساب خطير ونهائي؛ أما تغيير اسمه فلا."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/ten-usability-heuristics/","quote":"Either eliminate error-prone conditions, or check for them and present users with a confirmation option before they commit to the action."},"scenario":{"en":"In our banking app, two actions sit in the same menu: **Rename account** and **Close account**. Today, both happen in one tap. A closed account can't be reopened.","ar":"في تطبيق البنك عندنا، إجراءان في القائمة نفسها: **غيّر اسم الحساب** و**أغلق الحساب**. وحاليًا يحدث كلاهما بضغطة واحدة. والحساب المغلق لا يمكن إعادة فتحه."},"prompt":{"en":"Which one should ask for confirmation?","ar":"أيّهما يجب أن يطلب تأكيدًا؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rasid","name":{"en":"Rasid","ar":"رصيد"},"color":"#1C3D6E","icon":"bank","domain":"rasid.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Savings account","ar":"حساب التوفير"},"back":true,"actions":[{"icon":"dots-three-vertical"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"EGP 48,200","ar":"48,200 جنيه"},"size":"l"}],"overlay":{"type":"menu","blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"pencil-simple","text":{"en":"Rename account","ar":"غيّر اسم الحساب"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"prohibit","text":{"en":"Close account","ar":"أغلق الحساب"},"note":{"en":"Closes at once, can't be reopened","ar":"يُغلق فورًا، ولا يُعاد فتحه"}}]}},"options":[{"id":"both","text":{"en":"Both, to be safe","ar":"كلاهما، للاحتياط"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rasid","name":{"en":"Rasid","ar":"رصيد"},"color":"#1C3D6E","icon":"bank","domain":"rasid.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Savings account","ar":"حساب التوفير"},"back":true,"actions":[{"icon":"dots-three-vertical"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"EGP 48,200","ar":"48,200 جنيه"},"size":"l"}],"overlay":{"type":"dialog","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Rename this account?","ar":"هل تغيّر اسم هذا الحساب؟"},"note":{"en":"Asked for Rename too","ar":"يُسأل عند تغيير الاسم أيضًا"}},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Rename","ar":"غيّر الاسم"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"button","style":"text","text":{"en":"Cancel","ar":"إلغاء"},"gap":"s"}]}}},{"id":"close","text":{"en":"Only Close account, with a dialog that names the account and what happens to its balance","ar":"«أغلق الحساب» فقط، بنافذة تذكر الحساب وما سيحدث لرصيده"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rasid","name":{"en":"Rasid","ar":"رصيد"},"color":"#1C3D6E","icon":"bank","domain":"rasid.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Savings account","ar":"حساب التوفير"},"back":true,"actions":[{"icon":"dots-three-vertical"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"EGP 48,200","ar":"48,200 جنيه"},"size":"l"}],"overlay":{"type":"dialog","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Close Savings account?","ar":"إغلاق حساب التوفير؟"}},{"kind":"small","gap":"s","text":{"en":"Your EGP 48,200 moves to Current account ending 2210. A closed account can't be reopened.","ar":"سينتقل رصيدك (48,200 جنيه) إلى الحساب الجاري المنتهي بـ 2210. ولا يمكن إعادة فتح الحساب بعد إغلاقه."}},{"kind":"button","style":"danger","text":{"en":"Close account","ar":"أغلق الحساب"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"button","style":"text","text":{"en":"Keep account","ar":"أبقِ الحساب"},"gap":"s"}]}}},{"id":"none","text":{"en":"Neither; customers can call the bank if they make a mistake","ar":"لا هذا ولا ذاك؛ ويستطيع العملاء الاتصال بالبنك إن أخطؤوا"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rasid","name":{"en":"Rasid","ar":"رصيد"},"color":"#1C3D6E","icon":"bank","domain":"rasid.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Savings account","ar":"حساب التوفير"},"back":true,"actions":[{"icon":"dots-three-vertical"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"EGP 48,200","ar":"48,200 جنيه"},"size":"l"}],"overlay":{"type":"menu","blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"pencil-simple","text":{"en":"Rename account","ar":"غيّر اسم الحساب"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"prohibit","text":{"en":"Close account","ar":"أغلق الحساب"},"note":{"en":"Closes at once, can't be reopened","ar":"يُغلق فورًا، ولا يُعاد فتحه"}}]}}}],"answer":["close"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P02-023","when":["both"],"feedback":{"en":"Renaming is easy to change back. Confirming it teaches people to tap through dialogs, including the one that matters.","ar":"يسهل التراجع عن تغيير الاسم. وتأكيده يعلّم الناس أن يضغطوا «موافق» دون قراءة، حتى في النافذة المهمة."}},{"id":"MC-P02-020","when":["none"],"feedback":{"en":"A call can't reopen a closed account. The protection has to come before the tap, not after.","ar":"المكالمة لا تعيد فتح الحساب المغلق. يجب أن تأتي الحماية قبل الضغطة، لا بعدها."}}],"correct":{"en":"Confirm only the action that can't be undone.","ar":"اطلب التأكيد للإجراء الذي لا يمكن التراجع عنه فقط."},"explain":{"en":"Closing is final and affects money, so it earns a pause with specific details. Renaming stays one tap, which keeps the dialog rare enough to be read.","ar":"الإغلاق نهائي ويتعلّق بالمال، فيستحق وقفة بتفاصيل محددة. ويبقى تغيير الاسم بضغطة واحدة، فتظل النافذة نادرة بما يكفي لتُقرأ."}},{"id":"S05","type":"tune","speaker":"nour","part":"retest","skill":"SK-P02-U03-03","value":{"en":"Re-test, recognition rather than recall (NN/g): minimise people's memory load by making elements, actions and options visible. Receptionists shouldn't copy a file number from one screen to another by memory.","ar":"إعادة اختبار، التعرّف بدل التذكّر (NN/g): خفّف العبء على ذاكرة الناس بجعل العناصر والإجراءات والخيارات ظاهرة. ولا يجب أن ينقل موظفو الاستقبال رقم ملف من شاشة إلى أخرى بالذاكرة."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/ten-usability-heuristics/","quote":"Minimize the user's memory load by making elements, actions, and options visible."},"scenario":{"en":"To book a follow-up visit, my receptionists open the patient's file to find the 8-digit file number, then switch to the booking screen and type it from memory. Some visits end up in the wrong file.","ar":"لحجز زيارة متابعة، يفتح موظفو الاستقبال عندي ملف المريض ليجدوا رقم الملف المكوّن من 8 أرقام، ثم ينتقلون إلى شاشة الحجز ويكتبونه من الذاكرة. فتُسجَّل بعض الزيارات في ملف مريض آخر."},"prompt":{"en":"What should the system do?","ar":"ماذا يفعل النظام لتُسجَّل كل زيارة في الملف الصحيح؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"raha.example/staff/bookings/new","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Today","ar":"اليوم"},{"en":"Patients","ar":"المرضى"},{"en":"Bookings","ar":"الحجوزات"}],"active":2},"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"New follow-up visit","ar":"زيارة متابعة جديدة"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Patient file number","ar":"رقم ملف المريض"},"text":"","focus":true,"gap":"m","note":{"en":"Typed from memory after switching screens","ar":"يُكتب من الذاكرة بعد الانتقال بين الشاشات"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Doctor","ar":"الطبيب"},"text":{"en":"Dr. Samir Fahmy","ar":"د. سمير فهمي"},"filled":true,"gap":"m"}]},"options":[{"id":"button","text":{"en":"Add a \"Book follow-up\" button inside the patient's file that fills in the patient","ar":"إضافة زر «احجز متابعة» داخل ملف المريض يملأ بيانات المريض تلقائيًا"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"raha.example/staff/bookings/new","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Today","ar":"اليوم"},{"en":"Patients","ar":"المرضى"},{"en":"Bookings","ar":"الحجوزات"}],"active":2},"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"New follow-up visit","ar":"زيارة متابعة جديدة"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Patient file number","ar":"رقم ملف المريض"},"text":{"en":"40217733 · Ahmed Samy","ar":"40217733 · أحمد سامي"},"gap":"m","note":{"en":"Filled in by \"Book follow-up\" in the patient's file","ar":"ملأه زر «احجز متابعة» في ملف المريض"},"filled":true},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Doctor","ar":"الطبيب"},"text":{"en":"Dr. Samir Fahmy","ar":"د. سمير فهمي"},"filled":true,"gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"check","text":{"en":"Ask receptionists to read the number twice","ar":"أن يُطلب من الموظفين قراءة الرقم مرتين"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"raha.example/staff/bookings/new","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Today","ar":"اليوم"},{"en":"Patients","ar":"المرضى"},{"en":"Bookings","ar":"الحجوزات"}],"active":2},"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"New follow-up visit","ar":"زيارة متابعة جديدة"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Patient file number","ar":"رقم ملف المريض"},"text":"","focus":true,"gap":"m","note":{"en":"Still typed from memory, then read twice","ar":"ما زال يُكتب من الذاكرة، ثم يُقرأ مرتين"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Doctor","ar":"الطبيب"},"text":{"en":"Dr. Samir Fahmy","ar":"د. سمير فهمي"},"filled":true,"gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"shorter","text":{"en":"Make file numbers shorter","ar":"تقصير أرقام الملفات"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"raha.example/staff/bookings/new","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Today","ar":"اليوم"},{"en":"Patients","ar":"المرضى"},{"en":"Bookings","ar":"الحجوزات"}],"active":2},"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"New follow-up visit","ar":"زيارة متابعة جديدة"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Patient file number","ar":"رقم ملف المريض"},"text":"4021","focus":true,"gap":"m","note":{"en":"Shorter, but still typed from memory","ar":"أقصر، لكنه ما زال يُكتب من الذاكرة"},"filled":true},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Doctor","ar":"الطبيب"},"text":{"en":"Dr. Samir Fahmy","ar":"د. سمير فهمي"},"filled":true,"gap":"m"}]}}],"answer":["button"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P02-025","when":["check","shorter"],"feedback":{"en":"Both still have people carry a number in their heads between screens. A shorter number is easier, but the slip can still happen.","ar":"كلاهما ما زال يجعل الناس يحملون رقمًا في أذهانهم بين الشاشات. والرقم الأقصر أسهل، لكن الزلّة ما زالت ممكنة."}}],"correct":{"en":"Don't make people carry it at all.","ar":"لا تجعل الناس يحفظون الرقم أصلًا."},"explain":{"en":"Booking from inside the file brings the patient along, so there's nothing to remember or retype.","ar":"الحجز من داخل الملف يأخذ بيانات المريض معه، فلا يبقى شيء لتذكّره أو إعادة كتابته."}},{"id":"S06","type":"tune","speaker":"sara","part":"retest","skill":"SK-P02-U03-03","value":{"en":"Re-test, preventing mistakes (NN/g): remove burdens on people's memory. Keeping the search words in the box lets people see and adjust what they searched.","ar":"إعادة اختبار، منع الأخطاء الواعية (NN/g): خفّف العبء على ذاكرة الناس. وإبقاء كلمات البحث في المربع يتيح للناس أن يروا ما بحثوا عنه ويعدّلوه."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/user-mistakes/","quote":"A good strategy for preventing both of these types of errors is to remove burdens on users"},"scenario":{"en":"On a recipe website I'm designing, the search box empties itself after each search. People looking at the results often can't tell what they searched, or retype it with one word changed.","ar":"في موقع للوصفات أصمّمه، يُفرغ مربع البحث نفسه بعد كل بحث. والناس الذين ينظرون إلى النتائج كثيرًا ما لا يعرفون بماذا بحثوا، أو يعيدون كتابته كله لتغيير كلمة واحدة."},"prompt":{"en":"What should the search box do after a search?","ar":"ماذا يفعل مربع البحث بعد البحث ليعرف الناس بماذا بحثوا؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"tabkha","name":{"en":"Tabkha","ar":"طبخة"},"color":"#EA580C","icon":"cooking-pot","domain":"tabkha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Search","ar":"بحث"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"searchbar","text":{"en":"Search recipes","ar":"ابحث عن وصفة"},"note":{"en":"Emptied after the search","ar":"فرغ بعد البحث"}},{"kind":"listitem","art":"food-grill","text":{"en":"Chicken and rice, stovetop","ar":"دجاج بالأرز على البوتاجاز"},"sub":{"en":"40 min","ar":"40 دقيقة"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"listitem","art":"food-salad","text":{"en":"Rice salad, no cooking","ar":"سلطة أرز بدون طهي"},"sub":{"en":"15 min","ar":"15 دقيقة"},"gap":"s"}]},"options":[{"id":"keep","text":{"en":"Keep the words in the box, ready to edit","ar":"يُبقي الكلمات في المربع، جاهزة للتعديل"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"tabkha","name":{"en":"Tabkha","ar":"طبخة"},"color":"#EA580C","icon":"cooking-pot","domain":"tabkha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Search","ar":"بحث"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"searchbar","text":{"en":"chicken rice","ar":"أرز بالدجاج"},"filled":true,"note":{"en":"Kept, ready to edit","ar":"باقية، وجاهزة للتعديل"}},{"kind":"listitem","art":"food-grill","text":{"en":"Chicken and rice, stovetop","ar":"دجاج بالأرز على البوتاجاز"},"sub":{"en":"40 min","ar":"40 دقيقة"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"listitem","art":"food-salad","text":{"en":"Rice salad, no cooking","ar":"سلطة أرز بدون طهي"},"sub":{"en":"15 min","ar":"15 دقيقة"},"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"empty","text":{"en":"Empty itself, ready for a new search","ar":"يُفرغ نفسه، جاهزًا لبحث جديد"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"tabkha","name":{"en":"Tabkha","ar":"طبخة"},"color":"#EA580C","icon":"cooking-pot","domain":"tabkha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Search","ar":"بحث"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"searchbar","text":{"en":"Search recipes","ar":"ابحث عن وصفة"},"note":{"en":"Emptied after the search","ar":"فرغ بعد البحث"}},{"kind":"listitem","art":"food-grill","text":{"en":"Chicken and rice, stovetop","ar":"دجاج بالأرز على البوتاجاز"},"sub":{"en":"40 min","ar":"40 دقيقة"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"listitem","art":"food-salad","text":{"en":"Rice salad, no cooking","ar":"سلطة أرز بدون طهي"},"sub":{"en":"15 min","ar":"15 دقيقة"},"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"title","text":{"en":"Empty itself, with the words in small grey text under the results","ar":"يُفرغ نفسه، مع الكلمات بخط رمادي صغير تحت النتائج"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"tabkha","name":{"en":"Tabkha","ar":"طبخة"},"color":"#EA580C","icon":"cooking-pot","domain":"tabkha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Search","ar":"بحث"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"searchbar","text":{"en":"Search recipes","ar":"ابحث عن وصفة"},"note":{"en":"Emptied after the search","ar":"فرغ بعد البحث"}},{"kind":"listitem","art":"food-grill","text":{"en":"Chicken and rice, stovetop","ar":"دجاج بالأرز على البوتاجاز"},"sub":{"en":"40 min","ar":"40 دقيقة"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"listitem","art":"food-salad","text":{"en":"Rice salad, no cooking","ar":"سلطة أرز بدون طهي"},"sub":{"en":"15 min","ar":"15 دقيقة"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","gap":"m","text":{"en":"You searched: chicken rice","ar":"بحثت عن: أرز بالدجاج"}}]}}],"answer":["keep"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P02-024","when":["empty","title"],"feedback":{"en":"People have to remember or hunt for what they searched before they can change it, and then type it all again.","ar":"على الناس أن يتذكّروا كلمات بحثهم أو يفتّشوا عنها قبل أن يغيّروها، ثم يكتبوها كلها من جديد."}}],"correct":{"en":"Keep the search words in view.","ar":"أبقِ كلمات البحث ظاهرة."},"explain":{"en":"\"chicken rice no oven\" stays in the box, so people see why they got these results and change one word in a second.","ar":"تبقى «دجاج أرز بدون فرن» في المربع، فيرى الناس سبب ظهور هذه النتائج، ويغيّرون كلمة واحدة في ثانية."}},{"id":"S07","type":"tune","speaker":"mona","part":"retest","skill":"SK-P02-U03-04","value":{"en":"Re-test, recognition rather than recall (NN/g): a menu is the classic recognition-based interface: people see the commands and recognise the one they want, instead of recalling its name.","ar":"إعادة اختبار، التعرّف بدل التذكّر (NN/g): القائمة هي المثال الكلاسيكي للواجهة القائمة على التعرّف: يرى الناس الأوامر ويتعرّفون على ما يريدونه، بدل تذكّر اسمه."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/recognition-and-recall/","quote":"menu system is the most classic example of a recognition-based user interface"},"scenario":{"en":"In my team's note app, people format text by typing commands such as /strike or /h2. New users don't know them, and regular users forget the rare ones.","ar":"في تطبيق الملاحظات الذي يصنعه فريقي، ينسّق الناس النص بكتابة أوامر مثل /strike أو /h2. والمستخدمون الجدد لا يعرفونها، والمعتادون ينسون النادرة منها."},"prompt":{"en":"What should we add?","ar":"ماذا نضيف ليستخدم الناس الأوامر دون أن يحفظوها؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"satr","name":{"en":"Satr","ar":"سطر"},"color":"#334155","icon":"text-align-left","domain":"satr.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Meeting notes","ar":"ملاحظات الاجتماع"},"back":true},"keyboard":"text","blocks":[{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"Launch plan\n/strike","ar":"خطة الإطلاق\n/strike"},"note":{"en":"Only works if you remember the command","ar":"يعمل فقط إن تذكّرت الأمر"}}]},"options":[{"id":"menu","text":{"en":"Typing / opens a list of all commands with names and previews; people pick one","ar":"كتابة / تفتح قائمة بكل الأوامر بأسمائها ومعاينتها؛ ويختار الناس منها"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"satr","name":{"en":"Satr","ar":"سطر"},"color":"#334155","icon":"text-align-left","domain":"satr.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Meeting notes","ar":"ملاحظات الاجتماع"},"back":true},"keyboard":"text","blocks":[{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"Launch plan\n/","ar":"خطة الإطلاق\n/"}},{"kind":"card","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"text-h-two","text":{"en":"Heading","ar":"عنوان"},"value":"/h2"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"text-strikethrough","text":{"en":"Strikethrough","ar":"خط في المنتصف"},"value":"/strike"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"list-checks","text":{"en":"Checklist","ar":"قائمة مهام"},"value":"/todo"}]}]}},{"id":"cheat","text":{"en":"A printable cheat sheet of commands","ar":"ورقة ملخّص للأوامر (Cheat sheet) قابلة للطباعة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"satr","name":{"en":"Satr","ar":"سطر"},"color":"#334155","icon":"text-align-left","domain":"satr.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Meeting notes","ar":"ملاحظات الاجتماع"},"back":true},"keyboard":"text","blocks":[{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"Launch plan\n/strike","ar":"خطة الإطلاق\n/strike"},"note":{"en":"The commands are on a printed sheet, not on screen","ar":"الأوامر في ورقة مطبوعة، لا على الشاشة"}}]}},{"id":"fewer","text":{"en":"Remove the rarely used commands","ar":"حذف الأوامر قليلة الاستخدام"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"satr","name":{"en":"Satr","ar":"سطر"},"color":"#334155","icon":"text-align-left","domain":"satr.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Meeting notes","ar":"ملاحظات الاجتماع"},"back":true},"keyboard":"text","blocks":[{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"Launch plan\n/","ar":"خطة الإطلاق\n/"},"note":{"en":"/strike was removed; 5 common commands are left to remember","ar":"حُذف /strike؛ وبقيت 5 أوامر شائعة عليك أن تتذكّرها"}}]}}],"answer":["menu"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P02-026","when":["cheat"],"feedback":{"en":"A cheat sheet still asks people to look up or memorise commands outside the app.","ar":"ورقة الأوامر ما زالت تطلب من الناس البحث عن الأوامر أو حفظها خارج التطبيق."}},{"id":"MC-P02-027","when":["fewer"],"feedback":{"en":"People who need those commands lose them, and the rest still have to recall the names.","ar":"من يحتاج تلك الأوامر يفقدها، والباقون ما زال عليهم تذكّر الأسماء."}}],"correct":{"en":"Show the options so people can pick.","ar":"اعرض الخيارات ليختار الناس."},"explain":{"en":"The list shows what's possible the moment it's needed. Beginners discover commands and regulars find the rare ones without remembering exact names.","ar":"القائمة تُظهر ما هو ممكن لحظة الحاجة إليه. فيكتشف المبتدئون الأوامر، ويجد المعتادون النادرة منها دون تذكّر الأسماء الدقيقة."}},{"id":"S08","type":"tune","speaker":"rami","part":"retest","skill":"SK-P02-U03-04","value":{"en":"Re-test, recognition rather than recall (NN/g): let people recognise information in the interface instead of forcing them to remember it. A tip shown at the moment of use beats a long tour to memorise.","ar":"إعادة اختبار، التعرّف بدل التذكّر (NN/g): دَع الناس يتعرّفون على المعلومات في الواجهة بدل أن تجبرهم على تذكّرها. والنصيحة التي تظهر لحظة الاستخدام أفضل من جولة طويلة يجب حفظها."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/ten-usability-heuristics/","quote":"Let people recognize information in the interface, rather than forcing them to remember"},"scenario":{"en":"I designed an 8-screen tour for a budgeting app that explains every feature on first launch. A week later, people still ask how to split a bill.","ar":"صمّمت جولة من 8 شاشات لتطبيق ميزانية، تشرح كل الميزات عند أول تشغيل. وبعد أسبوع، ما زال الناس يسألون كيف يقسمون فاتورة."},"prompt":{"en":"What should I do instead?","ar":"ماذا أفعل بدل الجولة ليعرف الناس كيف يقسمون فاتورة؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"masroof","name":{"en":"Masroof","ar":"مصروف"},"color":"#15803D","icon":"wallet","domain":"masroof.example"},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"chart","size":"l"},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Set monthly budgets","ar":"حدّد ميزانيات شهرية"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Tip 4 of 8","ar":"النصيحة 4 من 8"},"gap":"s"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Next","ar":"التالي"}}]},"options":[{"id":"longer","text":{"en":"Add two more tour screens about splitting bills","ar":"أضيف شاشتين أخريين للجولة عن تقسيم الفواتير"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"masroof","name":{"en":"Masroof","ar":"مصروف"},"color":"#15803D","icon":"wallet","domain":"masroof.example"},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"chart","size":"l"},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Set monthly budgets","ar":"حدّد ميزانيات شهرية"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Tip 4 of 10","ar":"النصيحة 4 من 10"},"gap":"s"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Next","ar":"التالي"}}]}},{"id":"context","text":{"en":"Show a short tip next to a new expense: \"Shared this? Split it\", the first few times","ar":"أعرض نصيحة قصيرة بجانب المصروف الجديد: «شاركت فيه؟ قسّمه»، في المرات الأولى"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"masroof","name":{"en":"Masroof","ar":"مصروف"},"color":"#15803D","icon":"wallet","domain":"masroof.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"New expense","ar":"مصروف جديد"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Amount","ar":"المبلغ"},"text":{"en":"EGP 640","ar":"640 جنيه"},"filled":true},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"What for","ar":"مقابل ماذا"},"text":{"en":"Dinner with friends","ar":"عشاء مع الأصدقاء"},"filled":true,"gap":"m"},{"kind":"tip","text":{"en":"Shared this? Split it with your friends.","ar":"شاركت فيه؟ قسّمه مع أصدقائك."},"gap":"m","note":{"en":"Shown the first few times","ar":"يظهر في المرات الأولى"}}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Save","ar":"احفظ"}}]}},{"id":"video","text":{"en":"Link a 5-minute video in Settings","ar":"أضع رابط فيديو مدته 5 دقائق في الإعدادات"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"masroof","name":{"en":"Masroof","ar":"مصروف"},"color":"#15803D","icon":"wallet","domain":"masroof.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Settings","ar":"الإعدادات"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"bell","text":{"en":"Notifications","ar":"الإشعارات"},"chevron":true},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"currency-circle-dollar","text":{"en":"Currency","ar":"العملة"},"value":{"en":"EGP","ar":"جنيه"},"chevron":true,"gap":"s"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"play-circle","text":{"en":"How to use Masroof","ar":"كيف تستخدم مصروف"},"sub":{"en":"Video · 5 min","ar":"فيديو · 5 دقائق"},"chevron":true,"gap":"s"}]}}],"answer":["context"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P02-024","when":["longer","video"],"feedback":{"en":"Both teach the feature away from the moment it's needed, so people must remember it days later.","ar":"كلاهما يعلّم الميزة بعيدًا عن لحظة الحاجة إليها، فيجب على الناس أن يتذكّروها بعد أيام."}}],"correct":{"en":"Help at the moment of use.","ar":"ساعد في لحظة الاستخدام."},"explain":{"en":"The tip appears exactly when someone adds a shared expense, so they recognise the option right there instead of recalling a tour.","ar":"تظهر النصيحة بالضبط حين يضيف أحد مصروفًا مشتركًا، فيتعرّف على الخيار في مكانه بدل تذكّر جولة."}}]}$uxg$::jsonb),
  ($uxg$P02-U04-B01$uxg$, $uxg$f5dd5be774d84e550f518c658b0c6fa03e3273b6e6c42324cb73778f24fb3531$uxg$, $uxg${"id":"P02-U04-B01","mode":"bank","title":{"en":"Re-tests: speed up regulars, cut the clutter","ar":"إعادة اختبار: سرّع المعتادين، واحذف الزوائد"},"steps":[{"id":"S01","type":"tune","speaker":"sara","part":"retest","skill":"SK-P02-U04-01","value":{"en":"Re-test, flexibility and efficiency (NN/g): a usable accelerator is discoverable but unobtrusive. A swipe as the only way to delete is neither: most people never find it.","ar":"إعادة اختبار، المرونة والكفاءة (NN/g): المسرّع الجيد سهل الاكتشاف ولا يزعج أحدًا. والسحب كطريقة وحيدة للحذف ليس كذلك: فأغلب الناس لا يجدونه أبدًا."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/flexibility-efficiency-heuristic/","quote":"The trick for designing a usable accelerator is making it discoverable (which mobile keyboard gestures lack) but unobtrusive."},"scenario":{"en":"In a shopping list app I'm designing, the only way to remove an item is to swipe it left. Many people in our test kept the items they'd bought, because they never found out how.","ar":"في تطبيق لقوائم التسوق أصمّمه، الطريقة الوحيدة لحذف عنصر هي سحبه إلى اليسار. وكثير من الناس في تجربتنا أبقوا العناصر التي اشتروها، لأنهم لم يعرفوا كيف يحذفونها."},"prompt":{"en":"What should I do?","ar":"ماذا أفعل؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"qaima","name":{"en":"Qaima","ar":"قائمة"},"color":"#0D9488","icon":"list-checks","domain":"qaima.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Groceries","ar":"البقالة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"circle","text":{"en":"Milk","ar":"حليب"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"circle","text":{"en":"Bread","ar":"عيش"},"gap":"s","swipe":{"text":{"en":"Remove","ar":"احذف"},"tone":"bad"},"note":{"en":"The only way to remove: swipe left","ar":"الطريقة الوحيدة للحذف: اسحب لليسار"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"circle","text":{"en":"Tomatoes","ar":"طماطم"},"gap":"s"}]},"options":[{"id":"both","text":{"en":"Add a visible way, such as a checkbox or ⋯ > Remove, and keep the swipe as a shortcut","ar":"إضافة طريقة ظاهرة، مثل الـ Checkbox (مربع الاختيار) أو ⋯ ← احذف، مع إبقاء السحب اختصارًا"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"qaima","name":{"en":"Qaima","ar":"قائمة"},"color":"#0D9488","icon":"list-checks","domain":"qaima.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Groceries","ar":"البقالة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"square","text":{"en":"Milk","ar":"حليب"},"value":"⋯"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"square","text":{"en":"Bread","ar":"عيش"},"gap":"s","swipe":{"text":{"en":"Remove","ar":"احذف"},"tone":"bad"},"note":{"en":"Checkbox and ⋯ > Remove; swipe still works","ar":"Checkbox و⋯ ← احذف؛ والسحب ما زال يعمل"},"value":"⋯"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"square","text":{"en":"Tomatoes","ar":"طماطم"},"gap":"s","value":"⋯"}]}},{"id":"tour","text":{"en":"Keep swipe only, and show a tour about it once","ar":"إبقاء السحب فقط، مع جولة تعريفية عنه مرة واحدة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"qaima","name":{"en":"Qaima","ar":"قائمة"},"color":"#0D9488","icon":"list-checks","domain":"qaima.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Groceries","ar":"البقالة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"circle","text":{"en":"Milk","ar":"حليب"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"circle","text":{"en":"Bread","ar":"عيش"},"gap":"s","swipe":{"text":{"en":"Remove","ar":"احذف"},"tone":"bad"},"note":{"en":"The only way to remove: swipe left","ar":"الطريقة الوحيدة للحذف: اسحب لليسار"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"circle","text":{"en":"Tomatoes","ar":"طماطم"},"gap":"s"}],"overlay":{"type":"dialog","blocks":[{"kind":"icon","icon":"hand-swipe-left","size":"l","color":"brand"},{"kind":"heading","gap":"s","text":{"en":"Swipe left to remove an item","ar":"اسحب لليسار لحذف عنصر"}},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Shown once, on the first visit","ar":"تظهر مرة واحدة، في أول زيارة"}},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Got it","ar":"فهمت"},"gap":"m"}]}}},{"id":"icon","text":{"en":"Keep swipe only, with an arrow icon on each row","ar":"إبقاء السحب فقط، مع أيقونة سهم على كل صف"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"qaima","name":{"en":"Qaima","ar":"قائمة"},"color":"#0D9488","icon":"list-checks","domain":"qaima.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Groceries","ar":"البقالة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"circle","text":{"en":"Milk","ar":"حليب"},"value":"←"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"circle","text":{"en":"Bread","ar":"عيش"},"gap":"s","swipe":{"text":{"en":"Remove","ar":"احذف"},"tone":"bad"},"note":{"en":"Still the only way: swipe","ar":"ما زالت الطريقة الوحيدة: السحب"},"value":"←"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"circle","text":{"en":"Tomatoes","ar":"طماطم"},"gap":"s","value":"←"}]}}],"answer":["both"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P02-029","when":["tour","icon"],"feedback":{"en":"The shortcut is still the only way. People who skip the tour or misread the arrow remain stuck.","ar":"ما زال الاختصار هو الطريقة الوحيدة. ومن يتخطّى الجولة أو يسيء فهم السهم يظل عالقًا."}}],"correct":{"en":"A visible way for everyone, a shortcut for regulars.","ar":"طريقة ظاهرة للجميع، واختصار للمعتادين."},"explain":{"en":"Everyone can remove items with the visible control, and people who discover the swipe get a faster way. Nobody is stuck.","ar":"يستطيع الجميع حذف العناصر بالعنصر الظاهر، ومن يكتشف السحب يحصل على طريقة أسرع. ولا يعلق أحد."}},{"id":"S02","type":"tune","speaker":"tarek","part":"retest","skill":"SK-P02-U04-01","value":{"en":"Re-test, flexibility and efficiency (NN/g): novices rely on clearly labelled menus, while experienced users learn shortcuts and gestures for the same task. Removing the menus to look fast leaves novices behind.","ar":"إعادة اختبار، المرونة والكفاءة (NN/g): يعتمد المبتدئون على القوائم الواضحة، بينما يتعلّم المعتادون الاختصارات والإيماءات للمهمة نفسها. وحذف القوائم ليبدو التطبيق سريعًا يترك المبتدئين خلفه."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/flexibility-efficiency-heuristic/","quote":"Novice users rely heavily on step-by-step wizards or clearly labeled menus, for example, while more-experienced users learn keyboard shortcuts or touchscreen gestures to complete the same task."},"scenario":{"en":"Our power users love the gestures in our banking app. The team now wants to remove the menu of actions and keep gestures only, \"to make it faster for everyone\".","ar":"يحب المستخدمون المتمرّسون الإيماءات (Gestures) في تطبيق البنك عندنا. والفريق يريد الآن حذف قائمة الإجراءات والإبقاء على الإيماءات فقط، «لنجعله أسرع للجميع»."},"prompt":{"en":"What should I decide?","ar":"ماذا أقرّر بشأن قائمة الإجراءات؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rasid","name":{"en":"Rasid","ar":"رصيد"},"color":"#1C3D6E","icon":"bank","domain":"rasid.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Cards","ar":"البطاقات"}},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","art":"bank-card","text":{"en":"Visa ending 4821","ar":"Visa تنتهي بـ 4821"},"sub":{"en":"Swipe for freeze, limits, PIN","ar":"اسحب للتجميد والحدود والرقم السري"},"swipe":{"text":{"en":"Freeze","ar":"جمّد"},"tone":"warn"},"note":{"en":"Menu of actions to be removed","ar":"قائمة الإجراءات التي سيحذفها الفريق"}}]},"options":[{"id":"keep","text":{"en":"Keep both: the labelled menu for everyone, gestures as a faster way","ar":"إبقاء الاثنين: القائمة الواضحة للجميع، والإيماءات طريقة أسرع"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rasid","name":{"en":"Rasid","ar":"رصيد"},"color":"#1C3D6E","icon":"bank","domain":"rasid.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Cards","ar":"البطاقات"}},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","art":"bank-card","text":{"en":"Visa ending 4821","ar":"Visa تنتهي بـ 4821"},"swipe":{"text":{"en":"Freeze","ar":"جمّد"},"tone":"warn"},"note":{"en":"Swipe still works as a shortcut","ar":"السحب ما زال يعمل كاختصار"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"snowflake","text":{"en":"Freeze card","ar":"جمّد البطاقة"},"chevron":true,"gap":"m"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"sliders-horizontal","text":{"en":"Card limits","ar":"حدود البطاقة"},"chevron":true,"gap":"s"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"password","text":{"en":"Change PIN","ar":"غيّر الرقم السري"},"chevron":true,"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"gestures","text":{"en":"Gestures only; new users will learn them","ar":"الإيماءات فقط؛ وسيتعلّمها المستخدمون الجدد"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rasid","name":{"en":"Rasid","ar":"رصيد"},"color":"#1C3D6E","icon":"bank","domain":"rasid.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Cards","ar":"البطاقات"}},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","art":"bank-card","text":{"en":"Visa ending 4821","ar":"Visa تنتهي بـ 4821"},"swipe":{"text":{"en":"Freeze","ar":"جمّد"},"tone":"warn"},"note":{"en":"Gestures only; nothing on screen says how","ar":"إيماءات فقط؛ ولا شيء على الشاشة يشرح كيف"}}]}},{"id":"setting","text":{"en":"Gestures only, with the menu as an option deep in Settings","ar":"الإيماءات فقط، مع القائمة خيارًا في عمق الإعدادات"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rasid","name":{"en":"Rasid","ar":"رصيد"},"color":"#1C3D6E","icon":"bank","domain":"rasid.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Cards","ar":"البطاقات"}},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","art":"bank-card","text":{"en":"Visa ending 4821","ar":"Visa تنتهي بـ 4821"},"swipe":{"text":{"en":"Freeze","ar":"جمّد"},"tone":"warn"},"note":{"en":"Gestures here; the menu is in Settings > Advanced","ar":"الإيماءات هنا؛ والقائمة في الإعدادات ← متقدّم"}}]}}],"answer":["keep"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P02-031","when":["gestures","setting"],"feedback":{"en":"New and occasional customers would have no visible way to act, and few would find a setting to bring the menu back.","ar":"لن يجد العملاء الجدد ومن يستخدمون التطبيق أحيانًا أي طريقة ظاهرة لتنفيذ ما يريدون، وقليلون سيجدون إعدادًا يعيد القائمة."}}],"correct":{"en":"Shortcuts add speed; they don't replace the clear path.","ar":"الاختصارات تضيف سرعة؛ ولا تحلّ محل الطريقة الواضحة."},"explain":{"en":"Power users keep their gestures and everyone else keeps a menu they can read. Both groups get what they need from the same app.","ar":"يحتفظ المتمرّسون بإيماءاتهم، ويحتفظ الباقون بقائمة يستطيعون قراءتها. وتحصل المجموعتان على ما تحتاجانه من التطبيق نفسه."}},{"id":"S03","type":"tune","speaker":"hana","part":"retest","skill":"SK-P02-U04-02","value":{"en":"Re-test, flexibility and efficiency (NN/g): a simple form of personalization saves settings across one user's sessions. Members who always book at the same branch shouldn't pick it every time.","ar":"إعادة اختبار، المرونة والكفاءة (NN/g): من أبسط أشكال التخصيص حفظ الإعدادات بين جلسات المستخدم الواحد. والأعضاء الذين يحجزون دائمًا في الفرع نفسه لا يجب أن يختاروه في كل مرة."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/flexibility-efficiency-heuristic/","quote":"a simplistic approach to personalization that saves settings across one user"},"scenario":{"en":"My gym has three branches. Every time members book a class, the app asks them to pick a branch first, though almost all of them always go to the same one.","ar":"للنادي الذي أملكه ثلاثة فروع. وفي كل مرة يحجز فيها الأعضاء حصة، يطلب منهم التطبيق اختيار الفرع أولًا، مع أن أغلبهم يذهبون دائمًا إلى الفرع نفسه."},"prompt":{"en":"What should the app do?","ar":"ماذا يجب أن يفعل التطبيق؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Book a class","ar":"احجز حصة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Choose a branch","ar":"اختر الفرع"}},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Nasr City","ar":"مدينة نصر"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Maadi","ar":"المعادي"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Sheikh Zayed","ar":"الشيخ زايد"},"gap":"xs","note":{"en":"Asked on every booking","ar":"يُطلب في كل حجز"}}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Next","ar":"التالي"}}]},"options":[{"id":"remember","text":{"en":"Open on the last branch they used, with an easy way to switch","ar":"يفتح على آخر فرع استخدمه العضو، مع طريقة سهلة للتغيير"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Book a class","ar":"احجز حصة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"map-pin","text":{"en":"Branch: Nasr City","ar":"الفرع: مدينة نصر"},"value":{"en":"Change","ar":"غيّر"},"chevron":true,"note":{"en":"Your last branch","ar":"آخر فرع استخدمته"}},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Today's classes","ar":"حصص اليوم"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"listitem","art":"gym","text":{"en":"Yoga · 6 pm","ar":"يوغا · 6 م"},"sub":{"en":"Coach Mai · 4 spots left","ar":"المدرّبة مي · بقي 4 أماكن"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"listitem","art":"gym","text":{"en":"Spinning · 7 pm","ar":"Spinning · 7 م"},"sub":{"en":"Coach Omar · 2 spots left","ar":"المدرّب عمر · بقي مكانان"},"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"one","text":{"en":"Show all three branches' classes in one long list","ar":"يعرض حصص الفروع الثلاثة في قائمة طويلة واحدة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Book a class","ar":"احجز حصة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Today's classes","ar":"حصص اليوم"},"note":{"en":"42 classes from all 3 branches","ar":"42 حصة من الفروع الثلاثة"}},{"kind":"listitem","art":"gym","text":{"en":"Yoga · 6 pm","ar":"يوغا · 6 م"},"sub":{"en":"Maadi","ar":"المعادي"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"listitem","art":"gym","text":{"en":"Yoga · 6 pm","ar":"يوغا · 6 م"},"sub":{"en":"Nasr City","ar":"مدينة نصر"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"listitem","art":"gym","text":{"en":"Spinning · 7 pm","ar":"Spinning · 7 م"},"sub":{"en":"Sheikh Zayed","ar":"الشيخ زايد"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"listitem","art":"gym","text":{"en":"HIIT · 7 pm","ar":"HIIT · 7 م"},"sub":{"en":"Maadi","ar":"المعادي"},"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"ask","text":{"en":"Keep asking; members might change branch","ar":"يستمر في السؤال؛ فقد يغيّر الأعضاء الفرع"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Book a class","ar":"احجز حصة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Choose a branch","ar":"اختر الفرع"}},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Nasr City","ar":"مدينة نصر"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Maadi","ar":"المعادي"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Sheikh Zayed","ar":"الشيخ زايد"},"gap":"xs","note":{"en":"Asked on every booking","ar":"يُطلب في كل حجز"}}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Next","ar":"التالي"}}]}}],"answer":["remember"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P02-031","when":["ask","one"],"feedback":{"en":"The app already knows where each member goes. Asking every time, or mixing in two branches they never visit, makes every booking longer.","ar":"التطبيق يعرف أصلًا أين يذهب كل عضو. والسؤال في كل مرة، أو عرض حصص فرعين لا يزورهما، يجعل كل حجز أطول."}}],"correct":{"en":"Remember the choice, allow a change.","ar":"تذكّر الاختيار، واسمح بالتغيير."},"explain":{"en":"Starting from their usual branch saves a step on every booking, and the switch keeps members free to go elsewhere.","ar":"البدء من الفرع المعتاد يوفّر خطوة في كل حجز، وإمكانية التغيير تسمح للأعضاء بالذهاب إلى فرع آخر متى أرادوا."}},{"id":"S04","type":"tune","speaker":"youssef","part":"retest","skill":"SK-P02-U04-02","value":{"en":"Re-test, flexibility and efficiency (NN/g): accelerators are secondary, faster ways to do the same task. Marking many orders as shipped together is a faster path next to the one-by-one way.","ar":"إعادة اختبار، المرونة والكفاءة (NN/g): المسرّعات طرق ثانوية أسرع لأداء المهمة نفسها. ووضع علامة «شُحن» على طلبات كثيرة معًا طريق أسرع بجانب طريقة الواحد تلو الآخر."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/flexibility-efficiency-heuristic/","quote":"Accelerators are secondary ways of accomplishing the same task that function as faster (but typically less obvious) methods."},"scenario":{"en":"Every afternoon the courier picks up about 30 orders from my shop. Then I open each order in my dashboard and tap **Mark as shipped**, so customers get their tracking message.","ar":"كل يوم بعد الظهر يأخذ المندوب نحو 30 طلبًا من متجري. ثم أفتح كل طلب في لوحة التحكم وأضغط **ضع علامة «شُحن»**، لتصل إلى العملاء رسالة التتبع."},"prompt":{"en":"What would save me the most time?","ar":"ما الذي يوفّر عليّ أكبر قدر من الوقت؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"dar.example/seller/orders?status=packed","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Products","ar":"المنتجات"},{"en":"Orders","ar":"الطلبات"}],"active":1},"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Packed today (30)","ar":"جُهّزت اليوم (30)"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"package","text":{"en":"#48213 · Ahmed Samy","ar":"‎#48213 · أحمد سامي"},"chevron":true,"gap":"m"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"package","text":{"en":"#48214 · Mona Adel","ar":"‎#48214 · منى عادل"},"chevron":true,"gap":"s"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"package","text":{"en":"#48215 · Hany Fouad","ar":"‎#48215 · هاني فؤاد"},"chevron":true,"gap":"s","note":{"en":"Open each, tap Mark as shipped","ar":"افتح كل طلب، واضغط «شُحن»"}}]},"options":[{"id":"bulk","text":{"en":"Select today's packed orders in the list and mark them all shipped at once","ar":"اختيار طلبات اليوم المجهّزة في القائمة ووضع علامة «شُحن» عليها كلها مرة واحدة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"dar.example/seller/orders?status=packed","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Products","ar":"المنتجات"},{"en":"Orders","ar":"الطلبات"}],"active":1},"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Packed today (30)","ar":"جُهّزت اليوم (30)"}},{"kind":"row","gap":"m","blocks":[{"kind":"check","text":{"en":"Select all (30)","ar":"اختر الكل (30)"},"selected":true},{"kind":"button","icon":"truck","text":{"en":"Mark 30 as shipped","ar":"ضع علامة «شُحن» على 30"}}]},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"check-square","text":{"en":"#48213 · Ahmed Samy","ar":"‎#48213 · أحمد سامي"},"chevron":true,"gap":"m"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"check-square","text":{"en":"#48214 · Mona Adel","ar":"‎#48214 · منى عادل"},"chevron":true,"gap":"s"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"check-square","text":{"en":"#48215 · Hany Fouad","ar":"‎#48215 · هاني فؤاد"},"chevron":true,"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"button","text":{"en":"A bigger Mark as shipped button inside each order","ar":"زر «شُحن» أكبر داخل كل طلب"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"dar.example/seller/orders?status=packed","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Products","ar":"المنتجات"},{"en":"Orders","ar":"الطلبات"}],"active":1},"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Packed today (30)","ar":"جُهّزت اليوم (30)"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"package","text":{"en":"#48213 · Ahmed Samy","ar":"‎#48213 · أحمد سامي"},"chevron":true,"gap":"m"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"package","text":{"en":"#48214 · Mona Adel","ar":"‎#48214 · منى عادل"},"chevron":true,"gap":"s"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"package","text":{"en":"#48215 · Hany Fouad","ar":"‎#48215 · هاني فؤاد"},"chevron":true,"gap":"s","note":{"en":"Still open each one; the button inside is bigger","ar":"ما زلت تفتح كل طلب؛ والزر بداخله أكبر"}}]}},{"id":"later","text":{"en":"Send the tracking messages the next morning instead","ar":"إرسال رسائل التتبع في صباح اليوم التالي بدلًا من ذلك"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"dar.example/seller/orders?status=packed","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Products","ar":"المنتجات"},{"en":"Orders","ar":"الطلبات"}],"active":1},"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Packed today (30)","ar":"جُهّزت اليوم (30)"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"package","text":{"en":"#48213 · Ahmed Samy","ar":"‎#48213 · أحمد سامي"},"chevron":true,"gap":"m"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"package","text":{"en":"#48214 · Mona Adel","ar":"‎#48214 · منى عادل"},"chevron":true,"gap":"s"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"package","text":{"en":"#48215 · Hany Fouad","ar":"‎#48215 · هاني فؤاد"},"chevron":true,"gap":"s","note":{"en":"Still open each one; messages go out next morning","ar":"ما زلت تفتح كل طلب؛ والرسائل تُرسل صباح الغد"}}]}}],"answer":["bulk"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P02-028","when":["button","later"],"feedback":{"en":"I'd still open 30 orders one by one, or customers would wait a day for news. The work is the same action repeated.","ar":"سأظل أفتح 30 طلبًا واحدًا واحدًا، أو سينتظر العملاء يومًا ليعرفوا. فالعمل هو الإجراء نفسه مكررًا."}}],"correct":{"en":"Do the repeated action once, for all.","ar":"نفّذ الإجراء المتكرر مرة واحدة، للجميع."},"explain":{"en":"A bulk action turns 30 visits into one, and customers get their messages right away. Single orders can still be marked one at a time.","ar":"الإجراء الجماعي (Bulk action) يحوّل فتح 30 طلبًا إلى خطوة واحدة، وتصل الرسائل إلى العملاء فورًا. ويظل ممكنًا وضع العلامة على طلب واحد وحده."}},{"id":"S05","type":"tune","speaker":"nour","part":"retest","skill":"SK-P02-U04-03","value":{"en":"Re-test, aesthetic and minimalist design (NN/g): keep the content and visual design focused on the essentials. A booking confirmation is for the date, the time and the place.","ar":"إعادة اختبار، التصميم الجمالي البسيط (NN/g): اجعل المحتوى والتصميم البصري مركّزين على الأساسيات. فتأكيد الحجز هو للتاريخ والوقت والمكان."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/ten-usability-heuristics/","quote":"Keep the content and visual design of UI focused on the essentials."},"scenario":{"en":"Our booking confirmation screen starts with a large banner for our new dental department, then health tips, then a rating request. The appointment details are at the bottom.","ar":"شاشة تأكيد الحجز عندنا تبدأ بـ Banner كبير لقسم الأسنان الجديد، ثم نصائح صحية، ثم طلب تقييم. وتفاصيل الموعد في الأسفل."},"prompt":{"en":"What should the screen lead with?","ar":"بماذا تبدأ الشاشة ليجد المرضى تفاصيل موعدهم فورًا؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Booked!","ar":"تمّ الحجز!"}},"blocks":[{"kind":"card","art":"clinic","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Our new dental department is open!","ar":"افتتحنا قسم الأسنان الجديد!"}}]},{"kind":"list","style":"bullet","items":[{"en":"Drink 8 glasses of water","ar":"اشرب 8 أكواب ماء"},{"en":"Walk 30 minutes a day","ar":"امشِ 30 دقيقة يوميًا"}],"gap":"m"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Rate us ★★★★★","ar":"قيّمنا ★★★★★"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Dr. Samir · Sun 9 Nov, 5 pm · Dokki","ar":"د. سمير · الأحد 9 نوفمبر، 5 م · الدقي"},"gap":"m","note":{"en":"The booking details, at the bottom","ar":"تفاصيل الحجز، في الأسفل"}}]},"options":[{"id":"details","text":{"en":"Doctor, date, time and address, with Add to calendar; the rest goes below or away","ar":"الطبيب والتاريخ والوقت والعنوان، مع «أضف إلى التقويم»؛ والباقي ينزل إلى الأسفل أو يُحذف"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Booked!","ar":"تمّ الحجز!"}},"blocks":[{"kind":"card","blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","avatar":{"text":"Dr. Samir","art":"doctor"},"text":{"en":"Dr. Samir Fahmy","ar":"د. سمير فهمي"},"sub":{"en":"Internal medicine","ar":"باطنة"}},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Sun 9 Nov · 5:00 pm","ar":"الأحد 9 نوفمبر · 5:00 م"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Raha Clinic, 12 Tahrir St, Dokki","ar":"عيادة راحة، 12 شارع التحرير، الدقي"}},{"kind":"button","style":"outline","icon":"calendar-plus","text":{"en":"Add to calendar","ar":"أضف إلى التقويم"},"gap":"m"}]},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Rate us ★★★★★","ar":"قيّمنا ★★★★★"},"gap":"l"}]}},{"id":"bold","text":{"en":"Keep the order, but make the appointment details bold","ar":"يبقى الترتيب، مع جعل تفاصيل الموعد بخط عريض"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Booked!","ar":"تمّ الحجز!"}},"blocks":[{"kind":"card","art":"clinic","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Our new dental department is open!","ar":"افتتحنا قسم الأسنان الجديد!"}}]},{"kind":"list","style":"bullet","items":[{"en":"Drink 8 glasses of water","ar":"اشرب 8 أكواب ماء"},{"en":"Walk 30 minutes a day","ar":"امشِ 30 دقيقة يوميًا"}],"gap":"m"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Rate us ★★★★★","ar":"قيّمنا ★★★★★"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Dr. Samir · Sun 9 Nov, 5 pm · Dokki","ar":"د. سمير · الأحد 9 نوفمبر، 5 م · الدقي"},"gap":"m","note":{"en":"Bold, but still at the bottom","ar":"بخط عريض، لكنها ما زالت في الأسفل"},"weight":"bold"}]}},{"id":"banner","text":{"en":"Shrink the dental banner a little","ar":"تصغير Banner قسم الأسنان قليلًا"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Booked!","ar":"تمّ الحجز!"}},"blocks":[{"kind":"card","blocks":[{"kind":"small","icon":"tooth","text":{"en":"Our new dental department is open!","ar":"افتتحنا قسم الأسنان الجديد!"}}]},{"kind":"list","style":"bullet","items":[{"en":"Drink 8 glasses of water","ar":"اشرب 8 أكواب ماء"},{"en":"Walk 30 minutes a day","ar":"امشِ 30 دقيقة يوميًا"}],"gap":"m"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Rate us ★★★★★","ar":"قيّمنا ★★★★★"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Dr. Samir · Sun 9 Nov, 5 pm · Dokki","ar":"د. سمير · الأحد 9 نوفمبر، 5 م · الدقي"},"gap":"m","note":{"en":"Smaller banner; details still at the bottom","ar":"Banner أصغر؛ والتفاصيل ما زالت في الأسفل"}}]}}],"answer":["details"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P02-032","when":["bold","banner"],"feedback":{"en":"The details still sit under a banner, tips and a rating request. Patients have to dig for the one thing this screen is for.","ar":"ما زالت التفاصيل تحت Banner ونصائح وطلب تقييم. وعلى المرضى أن يبحثوا عن الشيء الوحيد الذي وُجدت الشاشة من أجله."}}],"correct":{"en":"Lead with the essentials of the task.","ar":"ابدأ بأساسيات المهمة."},"explain":{"en":"After booking, patients want to check when and where. Leading with that, and moving the rest down, makes the screen do its job.","ar":"بعد الحجز، يريد المرضى التأكد من الموعد والمكان. والبدء بذلك، وإنزال الباقي، يجعل الشاشة تؤدي وظيفتها."}},{"id":"S06","type":"compare","speaker":"rami","part":"retest","skill":"SK-P02-U04-03","value":{"en":"Re-test, aesthetic and minimalist design (NN/g): aesthetics matter, but clarity always wins over visual flourish. Moving decoration that hides the offer works against the page's goal.","ar":"إعادة اختبار، التصميم الجمالي البسيط (NN/g): الجمال مهم، لكن الوضوح يغلب الزخرفة البصرية دائمًا. والزخرفة المتحركة التي تُخفي العرض تعمل ضد هدف الصفحة."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/aesthetic-minimalist-design/","quote":"Clarity will always win over visual flourish."},"scenario":{"en":"I designed the landing page for an online English course. Version A has floating shapes, a looping background video and the price inside a spinning badge.","ar":"صمّمت صفحة الهبوط (Landing page) لدورة إنجليزية على الإنترنت. النسخة A فيها أشكال تطفو وتتحرّك، وفيديو خلفية يتكرّر، والسعر داخل شارة تدور."},"prompt":{"en":"Which version should ship?","ar":"أيّ نسخة تجعل الزوار يفهمون الدورة وسعرها بسرعة؟"},"a":{"label":{"en":"Version A: lots of motion","ar":"النسخة A: حركة كثيرة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"kalima","name":{"en":"Kalima","ar":"كلمة"},"color":"#6741D9","icon":"translate","domain":"kalima.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"kalima.example/english-8-weeks","blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"city-night","size":"l","note":{"en":"Looping video and floating shapes","ar":"فيديو يتكرر وأشكال تطفو"}},{"kind":"badge","text":{"en":"✦ EGP 900 ✦","ar":"✦ 900 جنيه ✦"},"note":{"en":"Spinning badge","ar":"شارة تدور"}},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Speak with confidence","ar":"تحدّث بثقة"},"gap":"s"}]}},"b":{"label":{"en":"Version B: calm and clear","ar":"النسخة B: هادئة وواضحة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"kalima","name":{"en":"Kalima","ar":"كلمة"},"color":"#6741D9","icon":"translate","domain":"kalima.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"kalima.example/english-8-weeks","blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Speak English with confidence in 8 weeks","ar":"تحدّث الإنجليزية بثقة في 8 أسابيع"}},{"kind":"list","style":"check","items":[{"en":"Live classes twice a week","ar":"حصص مباشرة مرتين أسبوعيًا"},{"en":"Groups of 8","ar":"مجموعات من 8"}],"gap":"s"},{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"EGP 900","ar":"900 جنيه"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Join the course","ar":"انضم إلى الدورة"},"gap":"m"}]}},"answer":"b","misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P02-035","when":["a"],"feedback":{"en":"The motion pulls the eye away from what visitors came to learn: what the course is, how it works and what it costs.","ar":"الحركة تسحب العين بعيدًا عمّا جاء الزوار ليعرفوه: ما هي الدورة، وكيف تعمل، وكم تكلّف."}}],"correct":{"en":"B: clear first, beautiful within that.","ar":"B: الوضوح أولًا، والجمال في إطاره."},"explain":{"en":"B can still look attractive, but the promise, the format and the price are read first. Decoration that hides them costs sign-ups.","ar":"يمكن أن تبدو B جذابة أيضًا، لكن الوعد وطريقة الدراسة والسعر تُقرأ أولًا. والزخرفة التي تُخفيها تُفقدك مشتركين."}},{"id":"S07","type":"tune","speaker":"mona","part":"retest","skill":"SK-P02-U04-04","value":{"en":"Re-test, aesthetic and minimalist design (NN/g): too few elements hurt usability by leaving out necessary ones. Hiding all navigation on a desktop site to look clean leaves people without a map.","ar":"إعادة اختبار، التصميم الجمالي البسيط (NN/g): العناصر القليلة جدًا تضرّ سهولة الاستخدام لأنها تُسقط عناصر ضرورية. وإخفاء كل التنقل في موقع للكمبيوتر ليبدو نظيفًا يترك الناس دون خريطة."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/aesthetic-minimalist-design/","quote":"Having too few elements would inhibit utility and usability with the absence of necessary elements"},"scenario":{"en":"For a calmer look, my team hid the whole menu of a university website behind a ☰ icon, even on large desktop screens. Visits to the admissions pages dropped.","ar":"لكي يبدو موقع إحدى الجامعات أهدأ، أخفى فريقي القائمة كلها خلف أيقونة ☰ (Hamburger menu)، حتى على شاشات الكمبيوتر الكبيرة. فقلّت زيارات صفحات القبول."},"prompt":{"en":"What should we do on desktop?","ar":"ماذا نفعل على شاشات الكمبيوتر ليجد الزوار صفحات القبول؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"jamia","name":{"en":"Jami'a","ar":"جامعة"},"color":"#1C3D6E","icon":"graduation-cap","domain":"jamia.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"jamia.example","navbar":{"links":[],"actions":[{"icon":"list","aria":{"en":"Menu","ar":"القائمة"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"city-night","size":"l"},{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Welcome to Jami'a","ar":"مرحبًا بك في «جامعة»"},"gap":"m","note":{"en":"All sections behind ☰, even on a big screen","ar":"كل الأقسام خلف ☰، حتى على شاشة كبيرة"}}]},"options":[{"id":"show","text":{"en":"Show the main sections in a visible top menu, and keep ☰ for small screens","ar":"إظهار الأقسام الرئيسية في قائمة علوية ظاهرة، وإبقاء ☰ للشاشات الصغيرة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"jamia","name":{"en":"Jami'a","ar":"جامعة"},"color":"#1C3D6E","icon":"graduation-cap","domain":"jamia.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"jamia.example","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Admissions","ar":"القبول"},{"en":"Programs","ar":"البرامج"},{"en":"Research","ar":"البحث العلمي"},{"en":"Campus life","ar":"الحياة الجامعية"},{"en":"Contact","ar":"تواصل معنا"}],"actions":[]},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"city-night","size":"l"},{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Welcome to Jami'a","ar":"مرحبًا بك في «جامعة»"},"gap":"m","note":{"en":"On desktop, sections in a top menu; ☰ only on phones","ar":"على الشاشة الكبيرة، الأقسام في قائمة علوية؛ و☰ للهواتف فقط"}}]}},{"id":"label","text":{"en":"Keep ☰, and add the word \"Menu\" next to it","ar":"إبقاء ☰، مع إضافة كلمة «القائمة» بجانبها"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"jamia","name":{"en":"Jami'a","ar":"جامعة"},"color":"#1C3D6E","icon":"graduation-cap","domain":"jamia.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"jamia.example","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"☰ Menu","ar":"☰ القائمة"}],"actions":[]},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"city-night","size":"l"},{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Welcome to Jami'a","ar":"مرحبًا بك في «جامعة»"},"gap":"m","note":{"en":"All sections still hidden behind Menu","ar":"كل الأقسام ما زالت مخفية خلف «القائمة»"}}]}},{"id":"home","text":{"en":"Put admission links in a slider on the home page","ar":"وضع روابط القبول في شريط متحرّك في الصفحة الرئيسية"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"jamia","name":{"en":"Jami'a","ar":"جامعة"},"color":"#1C3D6E","icon":"graduation-cap","domain":"jamia.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"jamia.example","navbar":{"links":[],"actions":[{"icon":"list","aria":{"en":"Menu","ar":"القائمة"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"city-night","size":"l"},{"kind":"card","gap":"m","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Apply for 2027: admissions are open","ar":"قدّم لعام 2027: القبول مفتوح"}},{"kind":"small","text":"● ○ ○ ○"}],"note":{"en":"Slides change every 5 s","ar":"تتغيّر الشرائح كل 5 ثوانٍ"}},{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Welcome to Jami'a","ar":"مرحبًا بك في «جامعة»"},"gap":"m","note":{"en":"All sections behind ☰, even on a big screen","ar":"كل الأقسام خلف ☰، حتى على شاشة كبيرة"}}]}}],"answer":["show"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P02-034","when":["label","home"],"feedback":{"en":"The sections are still out of sight. Visitors can't see what the site offers, and a slider shows each link only for a few seconds.","ar":"ما زالت الأقسام بعيدة عن النظر. فلا يرى الزوار ما يقدّمه الموقع، والشريط المتحرّك يعرض كل رابط لثوانٍ قليلة فقط."}}],"correct":{"en":"Show what people navigate by when there's room.","ar":"اعرض أقسام التنقل حين تتّسع المساحة."},"explain":{"en":"On a wide screen there's room for the main sections, and seeing them tells visitors where admissions are. Hiding them was minimal in looks, not in effort.","ar":"على الشاشة العريضة مساحة للأقسام الرئيسية، ورؤيتها تخبر الزوار أين صفحات القبول. وإخفاؤها جعل الشكل بسيطًا، لكنه صعّب الاستخدام."}},{"id":"S08","type":"tune","speaker":"karim","part":"retest","skill":"SK-P02-U04-04","value":{"en":"Re-test, aesthetic and minimalist design (NN/g): a good design maximises usability with just enough elements. Removing the words from a toolbar makes it look lighter but makes every icon a guess.","ar":"إعادة اختبار، التصميم الجمالي البسيط (NN/g): التصميم الجيد يرفع سهولة الاستخدام بعناصر كافية فقط. وحذف الكلمات من شريط الأدوات يجعله أخف شكلًا، لكنه يجعل كل أيقونة تخمينًا."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/aesthetic-minimalist-design/","quote":"a good design should strive to maximize utility and usability with just enough elements on the page."},"scenario":{"en":"In the invoice editor I'm building, the designer replaced the toolbar's buttons \"Add line\", \"Discount\", \"Tax\" and \"Send\" with icons only, to look lighter.","ar":"في محرّر الفواتير الذي أبنيه، وضع المصمم أيقونات فقط مكان أزرار شريط الأدوات «أضف سطرًا» و«خصم» و«ضريبة» و«أرسل»، ليبدو أخف."},"prompt":{"en":"What should I suggest?","ar":"ماذا أقترح على المحرّرين؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"fatoora","name":{"en":"Fatoora","ar":"فاتورة"},"color":"#334155","icon":"receipt","domain":"fatoora.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"fatoora.example/invoices/1042","navbar":{"links":[],"actions":[{"icon":"plus"},{"icon":"percent"},{"icon":"receipt"},{"icon":"paper-plane-tilt"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Invoice #1042","ar":"فاتورة ‎#1042"},"note":{"en":"Add line, Discount, Tax, Send: icons only","ar":"أضف سطرًا، خصم، ضريبة، أرسل: أيقونات فقط"}},{"kind":"table","head":[{"en":"Item","ar":"الصنف"},{"en":"Qty","ar":"الكمية"},{"en":"Price","ar":"السعر"}],"rows":[[{"en":"Electric kettle","ar":"غلاية كهربائية"},"2","1,100"],[{"en":"Toaster","ar":"محمصة"},"1","850"]],"gap":"m"}]},"options":[{"id":"words","text":{"en":"Bring the words back next to the icons","ar":"إعادة الكلمات بجانب الأيقونات"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"fatoora","name":{"en":"Fatoora","ar":"فاتورة"},"color":"#334155","icon":"receipt","domain":"fatoora.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"fatoora.example/invoices/1042","navbar":{"links":[],"actions":[]},"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Invoice #1042","ar":"فاتورة ‎#1042"}},{"kind":"row","gap":"m","blocks":[{"kind":"button","style":"outline","icon":"plus","text":{"en":"Add line","ar":"أضف سطرًا"}},{"kind":"button","style":"outline","icon":"percent","text":{"en":"Discount","ar":"خصم"}},{"kind":"button","style":"outline","icon":"receipt","text":{"en":"Tax","ar":"ضريبة"}},{"kind":"button","icon":"paper-plane-tilt","text":{"en":"Send","ar":"أرسل"}}]},{"kind":"table","head":[{"en":"Item","ar":"الصنف"},{"en":"Qty","ar":"الكمية"},{"en":"Price","ar":"السعر"}],"rows":[[{"en":"Electric kettle","ar":"غلاية كهربائية"},"2","1,100"],[{"en":"Toaster","ar":"محمصة"},"1","850"]],"gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"tips","text":{"en":"Keep icons only, with tooltips on hover","ar":"إبقاء الأيقونات فقط، مع Tooltips عند المرور بالمؤشر"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"fatoora","name":{"en":"Fatoora","ar":"فاتورة"},"color":"#334155","icon":"receipt","domain":"fatoora.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"fatoora.example/invoices/1042","navbar":{"links":[],"actions":[{"icon":"plus"},{"icon":"percent"},{"icon":"receipt"},{"icon":"paper-plane-tilt"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Invoice #1042","ar":"فاتورة ‎#1042"},"note":{"en":"Icons only; hover one to see \"Discount\"","ar":"أيقونات فقط؛ مرّر المؤشر على واحدة لترى «خصم»"}},{"kind":"table","head":[{"en":"Item","ar":"الصنف"},{"en":"Qty","ar":"الكمية"},{"en":"Price","ar":"السعر"}],"rows":[[{"en":"Electric kettle","ar":"غلاية كهربائية"},"2","1,100"],[{"en":"Toaster","ar":"محمصة"},"1","850"]],"gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"guide","text":{"en":"Keep icons only, and add a legend in the help page","ar":"إبقاء الأيقونات فقط، مع شرح لها في صفحة المساعدة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"fatoora","name":{"en":"Fatoora","ar":"فاتورة"},"color":"#334155","icon":"receipt","domain":"fatoora.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"fatoora.example/invoices/1042","navbar":{"links":[],"actions":[{"icon":"plus"},{"icon":"percent"},{"icon":"receipt"},{"icon":"paper-plane-tilt"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Invoice #1042","ar":"فاتورة ‎#1042"},"note":{"en":"Icons only; their names are on the help page","ar":"أيقونات فقط؛ وأسماؤها في صفحة المساعدة"}},{"kind":"table","head":[{"en":"Item","ar":"الصنف"},{"en":"Qty","ar":"الكمية"},{"en":"Price","ar":"السعر"}],"rows":[[{"en":"Electric kettle","ar":"غلاية كهربائية"},"2","1,100"],[{"en":"Toaster","ar":"محمصة"},"1","850"]],"gap":"m"}]}}],"answer":["words"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P02-034","when":["tips","guide"],"feedback":{"en":"People still have to hover or look up each icon to know whether it adds tax or sends the invoice. With money involved, a wrong guess is costly.","ar":"ما زال على الناس أن يمرّوا على كل أيقونة أو يبحثوا عنها ليعرفوا إن كانت تضيف الضريبة أم ترسل الفاتورة. وحين يتعلق الأمر بالمال، يكون التخمين الخاطئ مكلفًا."}}],"correct":{"en":"Labels are just enough, not too much.","ar":"الأسماء قدر كافٍ، وليست زيادة."},"explain":{"en":"Four short words cost little space and remove all doubt. That's the \"just enough\" a minimal design aims for.","ar":"أربع كلمات قصيرة لا تكلّف إلا مساحة صغيرة وتزيل كل شك. وهذا هو «القدر الكافي» الذي يهدف إليه التصميم البسيط."}}]}$uxg$::jsonb),
  ($uxg$P02-U05-B01$uxg$, $uxg$3adb01492579037430ab82db707be76367f4c3a18f3d4001088ff87e327ed5ed$uxg$, $uxg${"id":"P02-U05-B01","mode":"bank","title":{"en":"Re-tests: help people recover, and find help","ar":"إعادة اختبار: ساعد الناس على إصلاح أخطائهم، وعلى إيجاد المساعدة"},"steps":[{"id":"S01","type":"tune","speaker":"youssef","part":"retest","skill":"SK-P02-U05-01","value":{"en":"Re-test, error-message guidelines (NN/g): offer constructive advice. An out-of-stock message should say when the product returns, or offer a restock alert.","ar":"إعادة اختبار، إرشادات رسائل الخطأ (NN/g): قدّم نصيحة بنّاءة. ورسالة نفاد المنتج يجب أن تقول متى سيعود، أو تعرض تنبيهًا بتوفّره."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/error-message-guidelines/","quote":"Offer constructive advice."},"scenario":{"en":"When a drill sells out in my shop, its page just says \"Out of stock\" in red. Customers leave, and many never come back to check.","ar":"حين ينفد مثقاب في متجري، تقول صفحته فقط «نفد من المخزون» بالأحمر. فيغادر العملاء، وكثيرون لا يعودون ليراجعوا."},"prompt":{"en":"What should the page say?","ar":"ماذا تقول الصفحة حتى لا يغادر العملاء دون خيار؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Electric drill 650 W","ar":"مثقاب كهربائي 650 وات"},"back":true,"actions":[{"icon":"heart"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"box","size":"m"},{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"EGP 1,250","ar":"1,250 جنيه"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"badge","text":{"en":"Out of stock","ar":"نفد من المخزون"},"tone":"bad","gap":"s"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Add to cart","ar":"أضف إلى السلة"},"tone":"off"}]},"options":[{"id":"advice","text":{"en":"\"Back in stock around 15 Nov. Notify me\" and a similar drill that's available now","ar":"«يعود إلى المخزون نحو 15 نوفمبر. نبّهني» مع مثقاب مشابه متوفّر الآن"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Electric drill 650 W","ar":"مثقاب كهربائي 650 وات"},"back":true,"actions":[{"icon":"heart"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"box","size":"m"},{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"EGP 1,250","ar":"1,250 جنيه"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"badge","tone":"warn","icon":"clock","text":{"en":"Back in stock around 15 Nov","ar":"يعود إلى المخزون نحو 15 نوفمبر"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Available now","ar":"متوفّر الآن"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"listitem","art":"box","text":{"en":"Qowa drill 600 W","ar":"مثقاب قوة 600 وات"},"value":{"en":"EGP 1,150","ar":"1,150 جنيه"},"chevron":true,"gap":"s"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","style":"outline","icon":"bell","text":{"en":"Notify me","ar":"نبّهني"}}]}},{"id":"sorry","text":{"en":"\"Sorry! This item is currently unavailable.\"","ar":"«نأسف! هذا المنتج غير متاح حاليًا.»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Electric drill 650 W","ar":"مثقاب كهربائي 650 وات"},"back":true,"actions":[{"icon":"heart"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"box","size":"m"},{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"EGP 1,250","ar":"1,250 جنيه"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"small","color":"red","text":{"en":"Sorry! This item is currently unavailable.","ar":"نأسف! هذا المنتج غير متاح حاليًا."},"gap":"s"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Add to cart","ar":"أضف إلى السلة"},"tone":"off"}]}},{"id":"hide","text":{"en":"Hide the product until it's back","ar":"إخفاء المنتج حتى يعود"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Drills","ar":"مثاقب"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","art":"box","text":{"en":"Qowa drill 600 W","ar":"مثقاب قوة 600 وات"},"value":{"en":"EGP 1,150","ar":"1,150 جنيه"},"chevron":true,"note":{"en":"The 650 W drill is hidden until it's back","ar":"مثقاب الـ 650 وات مخفي حتى يعود"}},{"kind":"listitem","art":"box","text":{"en":"Qowa drill 500 W","ar":"مثقاب قوة 500 وات"},"value":{"en":"EGP 980","ar":"980 جنيه"},"chevron":true,"gap":"s"}]}}],"answer":["advice"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P02-037","when":["sorry","hide"],"feedback":{"en":"An apology still leaves customers with nowhere to go, and a hidden page leaves them thinking they imagined the product.","ar":"الاعتذار ما زال يترك العملاء دون أي خطوة تالية، والصفحة المخفية تجعلهم يظنون أنهم تخيّلوا المنتج."}}],"correct":{"en":"Say what happens next, and what they can do now.","ar":"قل ما سيحدث بعد ذلك، وما يستطيعون فعله الآن."},"explain":{"en":"A date, an alert and an alternative give customers three ways forward instead of a dead end.","ar":"التاريخ والتنبيه والبديل تعطي العملاء ثلاث طرق للمتابعة بدل طريق مسدود."}},{"id":"S02","type":"tune","speaker":"tarek","part":"retest","skill":"SK-P02-U05-01","value":{"en":"Re-test, error-message guidelines (NN/g): use human-readable language and avoid technical jargon. A checksum code means nothing to someone sending money.","ar":"إعادة اختبار، إرشادات رسائل الخطأ (NN/g): استخدم لغة يفهمها الناس وتجنّب المصطلحات التقنية. فرمز التحقّق لا يعني شيئًا لمن يحوّل مالًا."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/error-message-guidelines/","quote":"Use human-readable language."},"scenario":{"en":"When customers type an account number with a missing digit, our banking app shows \"ERR_IBAN_CHECKSUM\".","ar":"حين يكتب العملاء رقم حساب ينقصه رقم، يعرض تطبيق البنك عندنا «ERR_IBAN_CHECKSUM»."},"prompt":{"en":"What should the message say?","ar":"ماذا تقول الرسالة ليصحّح العملاء رقم الحساب؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rasid","name":{"en":"Rasid","ar":"رصيد"},"color":"#1C3D6E","icon":"bank","domain":"rasid.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"New beneficiary","ar":"مستفيد جديد"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Name","ar":"الاسم"},"text":{"en":"Omar Hany","ar":"عمر هاني"},"filled":true},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Account number (IBAN)","ar":"رقم الحساب (IBAN)"},"text":"EG38 0019 0005 0000 0000 2631 801","filled":true,"error":"ERR_IBAN_CHECKSUM","gap":"m"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Save","ar":"احفظ"}}]},"options":[{"id":"plain","text":{"en":"\"This account number looks incomplete: it has 28 digits instead of 29. Check it against the one you were given.\"","ar":"«يبدو رقم الحساب هذا ناقصًا: فيه 28 رقمًا بدل 29. راجعه مع الرقم الذي أُعطي لك.»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rasid","name":{"en":"Rasid","ar":"رصيد"},"color":"#1C3D6E","icon":"bank","domain":"rasid.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"New beneficiary","ar":"مستفيد جديد"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Name","ar":"الاسم"},"text":{"en":"Omar Hany","ar":"عمر هاني"},"filled":true},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Account number (IBAN)","ar":"رقم الحساب (IBAN)"},"text":"EG38 0019 0005 0000 0000 2631 801","filled":true,"error":{"en":"This account number looks incomplete: it has 28 digits instead of 29. Check it against the one you were given.","ar":"يبدو رقم الحساب هذا ناقصًا: فيه 28 رقمًا بدل 29. راجعه مع الرقم الذي أُعطي لك."},"gap":"m"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Save","ar":"احفظ"}}]}},{"id":"iban","text":{"en":"\"IBAN checksum validation failed.\"","ar":"«فشل التحقّق من رمز الـ IBAN.»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rasid","name":{"en":"Rasid","ar":"رصيد"},"color":"#1C3D6E","icon":"bank","domain":"rasid.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"New beneficiary","ar":"مستفيد جديد"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Name","ar":"الاسم"},"text":{"en":"Omar Hany","ar":"عمر هاني"},"filled":true},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Account number (IBAN)","ar":"رقم الحساب (IBAN)"},"text":"EG38 0019 0005 0000 0000 2631 801","filled":true,"error":{"en":"IBAN checksum validation failed.","ar":"فشل التحقّق من رمز الـ IBAN."},"gap":"m"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Save","ar":"احفظ"}}]}},{"id":"invalid","text":{"en":"\"Invalid account number.\"","ar":"«رقم حساب غير صالح.»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rasid","name":{"en":"Rasid","ar":"رصيد"},"color":"#1C3D6E","icon":"bank","domain":"rasid.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"New beneficiary","ar":"مستفيد جديد"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Name","ar":"الاسم"},"text":{"en":"Omar Hany","ar":"عمر هاني"},"filled":true},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Account number (IBAN)","ar":"رقم الحساب (IBAN)"},"text":"EG38 0019 0005 0000 0000 2631 801","filled":true,"error":{"en":"Invalid account number.","ar":"رقم حساب غير صالح."},"gap":"m"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Save","ar":"احفظ"}}]}}],"answer":["plain"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P02-036","when":["iban"],"feedback":{"en":"Spelled out, it's still a technical term. Customers don't know what a checksum is or what to change.","ar":"حتى بعد كتابته كاملًا، ما زال مصطلحًا تقنيًا. فالعملاء لا يعرفون ما رمز التحقّق ولا ما الذي يغيّرونه."}},{"id":"MC-P02-040","when":["invalid"],"feedback":{"en":"\"Invalid\" points at the customer without saying what's wrong. They'll retype the same number.","ar":"«غير صالح» تشير إلى العميل دون أن تقول ما الخطأ. فسيعيد كتابة الرقم نفسه."}}],"correct":{"en":"Plain words, and what to check.","ar":"كلمات بسيطة، وما يجب مراجعته."},"explain":{"en":"\"28 digits instead of 29\" tells customers exactly what to look for, in words anyone understands.","ar":"«28 رقمًا بدل 29» تخبر العملاء بالضبط بما يبحثون عنه، بكلمات يفهمها أي شخص."}},{"id":"S03","type":"tune","speaker":"karim","part":"retest","skill":"SK-P02-U05-02","value":{"en":"Re-test, error-message guidelines (NN/g): design errors based on their impact. A \"good to know\" warning shouldn't look or act like a blocking error.","ar":"إعادة اختبار، إرشادات رسائل الخطأ (NN/g): صمّم الأخطاء حسب أثرها. فالتنبيه من نوع «من الجيد أن تعرف» لا يجب أن يبدو أو يعمل مثل خطأ يمنع المتابعة."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/error-message-guidelines/","quote":"Design errors based on their impact."},"scenario":{"en":"On the sign-up page I'm building, a password that is allowed but weak gets the same red box and error sound as a password that is too short to accept.","ar":"في صفحة التسجيل التي أبنيها، كلمة المرور المسموحة لكن الضعيفة تحصل على المربع الأحمر نفسه وصوت الخطأ نفسه مثل كلمة المرور القصيرة غير المقبولة."},"prompt":{"en":"How should the weak-but-allowed password be shown?","ar":"كيف تُعرض كلمة المرور الضعيفة المسموحة؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Create account","ar":"أنشئ حسابًا"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Email","ar":"البريد الإلكتروني"},"text":"mona@mail.example","filled":true},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Password","ar":"كلمة المرور"},"text":"••••••••","filled":true,"error":{"en":"Weak password","ar":"كلمة مرور ضعيفة"},"gap":"m","note":{"en":"Allowed, but shown like a blocking error, with an error sound","ar":"مسموحة، لكنها تُعرض على أنها خطأ يمنع المتابعة، مع صوت خطأ"}}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Create account","ar":"أنشئ الحساب"}}]},"options":[{"id":"soft","text":{"en":"A calm hint under the field: \"Fair. Add a number or symbol to make it stronger\", and let people continue","ar":"تلميح هادئ تحت الحقل: «متوسطة. أضف رقمًا أو رمزًا لتقويها»، مع السماح بالمتابعة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Create account","ar":"أنشئ حسابًا"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Email","ar":"البريد الإلكتروني"},"text":"mona@mail.example","filled":true},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Password","ar":"كلمة المرور"},"text":"••••••••","filled":true,"gap":"m","note":{"en":"No error sound; people can continue","ar":"بلا صوت خطأ؛ ويستطيع الناس المتابعة"},"hint":{"en":"Fair. Add a number or symbol to make it stronger.","ar":"متوسطة. أضف رقمًا أو رمزًا لتقويها."}}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Create account","ar":"أنشئ الحساب"}}]}},{"id":"same","text":{"en":"Keep the red error; weak passwords are risky","ar":"إبقاء الخطأ الأحمر؛ فكلمات المرور الضعيفة خطرة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Create account","ar":"أنشئ حسابًا"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Email","ar":"البريد الإلكتروني"},"text":"mona@mail.example","filled":true},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Password","ar":"كلمة المرور"},"text":"••••••••","filled":true,"error":{"en":"Weak password","ar":"كلمة مرور ضعيفة"},"gap":"m","note":{"en":"Allowed, but shown like a blocking error, with an error sound","ar":"مسموحة، لكنها تُعرض على أنها خطأ يمنع المتابعة، مع صوت خطأ"}}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Create account","ar":"أنشئ الحساب"}}]}},{"id":"none","text":{"en":"Say nothing, since it's allowed","ar":"عدم قول شيء، فهي مسموحة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Create account","ar":"أنشئ حسابًا"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Email","ar":"البريد الإلكتروني"},"text":"mona@mail.example","filled":true},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Password","ar":"كلمة المرور"},"text":"••••••••","filled":true,"gap":"m","note":{"en":"Nothing said about strength","ar":"لا شيء يُقال عن قوتها"}}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Create account","ar":"أنشئ الحساب"}}]}}],"answer":["soft"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P02-038","when":["same"],"feedback":{"en":"A red error tells people they can't continue, so they think the password is rejected and keep changing it.","ar":"الخطأ الأحمر يخبر الناس أنهم لا يستطيعون المتابعة، فيظنون أن كلمة المرور مرفوضة ويستمرون في تغييرها."}},{"id":"MC-P02-037","when":["none"],"feedback":{"en":"People lose a useful tip that would help protect their account.","ar":"يفقد الناس نصيحة مفيدة كانت ستساعد في حماية حسابهم."}}],"correct":{"en":"Match the message's weight to the problem.","ar":"اجعل قوة الرسالة على قدر المشكلة."},"explain":{"en":"A soft hint shows it's advice, not a barrier. Red errors stay for problems that really stop people, so they keep their meaning.","ar":"التلميح الهادئ يُظهر أنها نصيحة لا عائق. والأخطاء الحمراء تبقى للمشكلات التي توقف الناس فعلًا، فتحتفظ بمعناها."}},{"id":"S04","type":"tune","speaker":"hana","part":"retest","skill":"SK-P02-U05-02","value":{"en":"Re-test, error-message guidelines (NN/g): apply the error styling to the message and to the elements that need correcting. A toast that vanishes leaves people unsure which field to fix.","ar":"إعادة اختبار، إرشادات رسائل الخطأ (NN/g): طبّق شكل الخطأ على الرسالة وعلى العناصر التي تحتاج إلى تصحيح. والرسالة المؤقتة التي تختفي تترك الناس غير متأكدين من الحقل الذي يصلحونه."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/error-message-guidelines/","quote":"Use this styling for the message and for the affected elements needing correction."},"scenario":{"en":"In my gym's app, if the guest's age is missing, a toast at the bottom says \"Please check the form\" for three seconds, then disappears.","ar":"في تطبيق النادي الذي أملكه، إن كان عمر الضيف ناقصًا، تظهر في الأسفل رسالة مؤقتة (Toast) تقول «يرجى مراجعة النموذج» لثلاث ثوانٍ، ثم تختفي."},"prompt":{"en":"What should happen instead?","ar":"ماذا يحدث بدلًا من ذلك ليعرف العضو ما ينقص النموذج؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Bring a guest","ar":"أحضِر ضيفًا"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Guest's name","ar":"اسم الضيف"},"text":{"en":"Salma","ar":"سلمى"},"filled":true},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Guest's age","ar":"عمر الضيف"},"text":"","gap":"m"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Book","ar":"احجز"}}],"overlay":{"type":"toast","blocks":[{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"Please check the form","ar":"يرجى مراجعة النموذج"},"note":{"en":"Gone after 3 s","ar":"يختفي بعد 3 ثوانٍ"}}]}},"options":[{"id":"field","text":{"en":"Mark the age field and show \"Add your guest's age\" under it until it's fixed","ar":"تمييز حقل العمر، وإظهار «أضِف عمر ضيفك» تحته حتى يُصلح"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Bring a guest","ar":"أحضِر ضيفًا"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Guest's name","ar":"اسم الضيف"},"text":{"en":"Salma","ar":"سلمى"},"filled":true},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Guest's age","ar":"عمر الضيف"},"text":"","gap":"m","tone":"bad","error":{"en":"Add your guest's age","ar":"أضِف عمر ضيفك"}}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Book","ar":"احجز"}}]}},{"id":"longer","text":{"en":"Keep the toast on screen for ten seconds","ar":"إبقاء الرسالة المؤقتة على الشاشة عشر ثوانٍ"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Bring a guest","ar":"أحضِر ضيفًا"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Guest's name","ar":"اسم الضيف"},"text":{"en":"Salma","ar":"سلمى"},"filled":true},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Guest's age","ar":"عمر الضيف"},"text":"","gap":"m"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Book","ar":"احجز"}}],"overlay":{"type":"toast","blocks":[{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"Please check the form","ar":"يرجى مراجعة النموذج"},"note":{"en":"Gone after 10 s","ar":"يختفي بعد 10 ثوانٍ"}}]}}},{"id":"top","text":{"en":"Move the same message to the top of the form","ar":"نقل الرسالة نفسها إلى أعلى النموذج"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Bring a guest","ar":"أحضِر ضيفًا"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"banner","tone":"bad","icon":"warning-circle","text":{"en":"Please check the form","ar":"يرجى مراجعة النموذج"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Guest's name","ar":"اسم الضيف"},"text":{"en":"Salma","ar":"سلمى"},"filled":true,"gap":"m"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Guest's age","ar":"عمر الضيف"},"text":"","gap":"m"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Book","ar":"احجز"}}]}}],"answer":["field"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P02-038","when":["longer","top"],"feedback":{"en":"The message still doesn't say which field, and it isn't next to it. Members have to search the form themselves.","ar":"ما زالت الرسالة لا تقول أيّ حقل، وليست بجانبه. فعلى الأعضاء أن يبحثوا في النموذج بأنفسهم."}}],"correct":{"en":"Mark the field, and keep the message there.","ar":"ميّز الحقل، وأبقِ الرسالة بجانبه."},"explain":{"en":"The marked field shows where the problem is, and the message beside it says what to do. It stays until the fix is made.","ar":"الحقل المميّز يُظهر مكان المشكلة، والرسالة بجانبه تقول ما يجب فعله. وتبقى حتى يُصلح الخطأ."}},{"id":"S05","type":"tune","speaker":"sara","part":"retest","skill":"SK-P02-U05-03","value":{"en":"Re-test, help and documentation (NN/g): keep proactive help short and to the point; it distracts from the main task. A six-paragraph tip is a page, not a tip.","ar":"إعادة اختبار، المساعدة والتوثيق (NN/g): اجعل المساعدة الاستباقية قصيرة ومباشرة؛ فهي تشتّت عن المهمة الأساسية. والنصيحة من ست فقرات صفحة، لا نصيحة."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/help-and-documentation/","quote":"Keep proactive help short and to the point."},"scenario":{"en":"In a budgeting app I'm designing, the first time people add an expense, a tip opens with six paragraphs about categories, budgets and reports.","ar":"في تطبيق ميزانية أصمّمه، في أول مرة يضيف فيها الناس مصروفًا، تُفتح نصيحة من ست فقرات عن الفئات والميزانيات والتقارير."},"prompt":{"en":"What should the tip be?","ar":"كيف تكون النصيحة لتساعد من يضيف أول مصروف؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"masroof","name":{"en":"Masroof","ar":"مصروف"},"color":"#15803D","icon":"wallet","domain":"masroof.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"New expense","ar":"مصروف جديد"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Amount","ar":"المبلغ"},"text":{"en":"EGP 240","ar":"240 جنيه"},"filled":true}],"overlay":{"type":"sheet","title":{"en":"How Masroof works","ar":"كيف يعمل مصروف"},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Categories help you understand where your money goes. Each expense can have one category, and you can create your own…","ar":"الفئات تساعدك على فهم أين يذهب مالك. ولكل مصروف فئة واحدة، ويمكنك إنشاء فئاتك…"}},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Budgets let you set a limit per month for each category…","ar":"الميزانيات تتيح لك تحديد حد شهري لكل فئة…"},"gap":"s","note":{"en":"6 paragraphs in all","ar":"6 فقرات في المجمل"}}]}},"options":[{"id":"short","text":{"en":"One line next to the category field: \"Pick a category to see where your money goes\", with Got it","ar":"سطر واحد بجانب حقل الفئة: «اختر فئة لترى أين يذهب مالك»، مع «فهمت»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"masroof","name":{"en":"Masroof","ar":"مصروف"},"color":"#15803D","icon":"wallet","domain":"masroof.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"New expense","ar":"مصروف جديد"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Amount","ar":"المبلغ"},"text":{"en":"EGP 240","ar":"240 جنيه"},"filled":true},{"kind":"select","label":{"en":"Category","ar":"الفئة"},"text":{"en":"Choose a category","ar":"اختر فئة"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"tip","text":{"en":"Pick a category to see where your money goes.","ar":"اختر فئة لترى أين يذهب مالك."},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"link","text":{"en":"Got it","ar":"فهمت"},"gap":"xs"}]}},{"id":"same","text":{"en":"The same six paragraphs, with headings","ar":"الفقرات الست نفسها، مع عناوين"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"masroof","name":{"en":"Masroof","ar":"مصروف"},"color":"#15803D","icon":"wallet","domain":"masroof.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"New expense","ar":"مصروف جديد"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Amount","ar":"المبلغ"},"text":{"en":"EGP 240","ar":"240 جنيه"},"filled":true}],"overlay":{"type":"sheet","title":{"en":"How Masroof works","ar":"كيف يعمل مصروف"},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Categories","ar":"الفئات"}},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Categories help you understand where your money goes. Each expense can have one category, and you can create your own…","ar":"الفئات تساعدك على فهم أين يذهب مالك. ولكل مصروف فئة واحدة، ويمكنك إنشاء فئاتك…"}},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Budgets","ar":"الميزانيات"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Budgets let you set a limit per month for each category…","ar":"الميزانيات تتيح لك تحديد حد شهري لكل فئة…"},"note":{"en":"Still 6 paragraphs, now with headings","ar":"ما زالت 6 فقرات، لكن بعناوين"}}]}}},{"id":"later","text":{"en":"Move all six paragraphs to the settings screen","ar":"نقل الفقرات الست كلها إلى شاشة الإعدادات"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"masroof","name":{"en":"Masroof","ar":"مصروف"},"color":"#15803D","icon":"wallet","domain":"masroof.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"New expense","ar":"مصروف جديد"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Amount","ar":"المبلغ"},"text":{"en":"EGP 240","ar":"240 جنيه"},"filled":true,"note":{"en":"No tip here; the six paragraphs are in Settings","ar":"لا نصيحة هنا؛ والفقرات الست في الإعدادات"}}]}}],"answer":["short"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P02-045","when":["same"],"feedback":{"en":"Headings don't make it short. People came to add one expense and now face a page of reading.","ar":"العناوين لا تجعلها قصيرة. فقد جاء الناس ليضيفوا مصروفًا واحدًا، فوجدوا أمامهم صفحة للقراءة."}},{"id":"MC-P02-043","when":["later"],"feedback":{"en":"In Settings, the help is far from the moment it's useful, and few people go looking.","ar":"في الإعدادات، تكون المساعدة بعيدة عن لحظة الحاجة إليها، وقليلون يبحثون عنها هناك."}}],"correct":{"en":"One useful line, at the right spot.","ar":"سطر واحد مفيد، في المكان الصحيح."},"explain":{"en":"One line next to the field helps right now and is easy to dismiss. Budgets and reports can get their own tips when people reach them.","ar":"سطر واحد بجانب الحقل يساعد الآن ويسهل إغلاقه. ويمكن أن تحصل الميزانيات والتقارير على نصائحها حين يصل إليها الناس."}},{"id":"S06","type":"tune","speaker":"hana","part":"retest","skill":"SK-P02-U05-03","value":{"en":"Re-test, help and documentation (NN/g): proactive help should be accessible elsewhere. People who dismissed a tip may want it later.","ar":"إعادة اختبار، المساعدة والتوثيق (NN/g): يجب أن تكون المساعدة الاستباقية متاحة في مكان آخر أيضًا. فمن أغلق نصيحة قد يحتاجها لاحقًا."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/help-and-documentation/","quote":"Proactive help content should be accessible elsewhere."},"scenario":{"en":"When members first open my gym's app, a short tip shows how to freeze a membership. Most dismiss it. Months later, before a trip, they can't find it again.","ar":"حين يفتح الأعضاء تطبيق النادي الذي أملكه أول مرة، تظهر نصيحة قصيرة تشرح كيف يجمّدون الاشتراك. وأغلبهم يغلقونها. وبعد شهور، قبل السفر، لا يجدونها مرة أخرى."},"prompt":{"en":"What should I add?","ar":"ماذا أضيف؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Membership","ar":"الاشتراك"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"card","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Gold · monthly","ar":"Gold · شهري"}},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Renews 1 Dec","ar":"يتجدّد 1 ديسمبر"}}]},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"credit-card","text":{"en":"Payment method","ar":"طريقة الدفع"},"chevron":true,"gap":"m"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"question","text":{"en":"Help","ar":"المساعدة"},"chevron":true,"gap":"s","note":{"en":"The freeze tip isn't here any more","ar":"نصيحة التجميد لم تعد هنا"}}]},"options":[{"id":"help","text":{"en":"Keep the tip, and also put \"How to freeze my membership\" in Help and next to the membership details","ar":"إبقاء النصيحة، مع وضع «كيف أجمّد اشتراكي» أيضًا في المساعدة وبجانب تفاصيل الاشتراك"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Membership","ar":"الاشتراك"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"card","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Gold · monthly","ar":"Gold · شهري"}},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Renews 1 Dec","ar":"يتجدّد 1 ديسمبر"}}]},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"snowflake","text":{"en":"How to freeze my membership","ar":"كيف أجمّد اشتراكي"},"sub":{"en":"Before a trip, for up to a month","ar":"قبل السفر، لمدة تصل إلى شهر"},"chevron":true,"gap":"m"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"credit-card","text":{"en":"Payment method","ar":"طريقة الدفع"},"chevron":true,"gap":"m"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"question","text":{"en":"Help","ar":"المساعدة"},"chevron":true,"gap":"s","note":{"en":"Help has the same answer","ar":"وفي المساعدة الإجابة نفسها"}}]}},{"id":"force","text":{"en":"Make the tip impossible to dismiss until it's read","ar":"جعل النصيحة لا تُغلق حتى تُقرأ"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Membership","ar":"الاشتراك"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"card","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Gold · monthly","ar":"Gold · شهري"}},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Renews 1 Dec","ar":"يتجدّد 1 ديسمبر"}}]},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"credit-card","text":{"en":"Payment method","ar":"طريقة الدفع"},"chevron":true,"gap":"m"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"question","text":{"en":"Help","ar":"المساعدة"},"chevron":true,"gap":"s","note":{"en":"The freeze tip isn't here any more","ar":"نصيحة التجميد لم تعد هنا"}}],"overlay":{"type":"dialog","blocks":[{"kind":"icon","icon":"snowflake","size":"l","color":"brand"},{"kind":"heading","gap":"s","text":{"en":"Tip: freeze your membership before a trip","ar":"نصيحة: جمّد اشتراكك قبل السفر"}},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"I've read it","ar":"قرأتها"},"gap":"m","note":{"en":"Can't be closed for 10 s","ar":"لا تُغلق قبل 10 ثوانٍ"}}]}}},{"id":"monthly","text":{"en":"Show the same tip again every month","ar":"عرض النصيحة نفسها مرة أخرى كل شهر"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Membership","ar":"الاشتراك"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"card","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Gold · monthly","ar":"Gold · شهري"}},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Renews 1 Dec","ar":"يتجدّد 1 ديسمبر"}}]},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"credit-card","text":{"en":"Payment method","ar":"طريقة الدفع"},"chevron":true,"gap":"m"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"question","text":{"en":"Help","ar":"المساعدة"},"chevron":true,"gap":"s","note":{"en":"The freeze tip isn't here any more","ar":"نصيحة التجميد لم تعد هنا"}}],"overlay":{"type":"banner","blocks":[{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"Tip: you can freeze your membership before a trip.","ar":"نصيحة: تستطيع تجميد اشتراكك قبل السفر."},"note":{"en":"Shown again every month","ar":"تظهر مرة أخرى كل شهر"}}]}}}],"answer":["help"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P02-045","when":["force","monthly"],"feedback":{"en":"Forcing or repeating the tip annoys everyone who doesn't need it now, and still isn't there on the day someone does.","ar":"فرض النصيحة أو تكرارها يزعج كل من لا يحتاجها الآن، ولا تكون موجودة يوم يحتاجها أحد."}}],"correct":{"en":"Let people find the tip again when they need it.","ar":"دَع الناس يجدون النصيحة مرة أخرى حين يحتاجونها."},"explain":{"en":"The tip stays easy to dismiss, and the same answer waits in Help and beside the membership, right where a traveller will look.","ar":"تبقى النصيحة سهلة الإغلاق، والإجابة نفسها تنتظر في المساعدة وبجانب الاشتراك، حيث سيبحث المسافر بالضبط."}},{"id":"S07","type":"tune","speaker":"rami","part":"retest","skill":"SK-P02-U05-04","value":{"en":"Re-test, help and documentation (NN/g): group help topics into relevant categories, so people can find content that meets their needs.","ar":"إعادة اختبار، المساعدة والتوثيق (NN/g): اجمع موضوعات المساعدة في فئات مناسبة، حتى يجد الناس المحتوى الذي يلبّي حاجتهم."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/help-and-documentation/","quote":"Group help topics into relevant categories."},"scenario":{"en":"I'm redesigning the help page of a delivery app. It's one list of 60 questions in the order they were written.","ar":"أعيد تصميم صفحة المساعدة في تطبيق توصيل. وهي قائمة واحدة من 60 سؤالًا بالترتيب الذي كُتبت به."},"prompt":{"en":"How should I organize it?","ar":"كيف أنظّمها ليجد الناس إجابة مشكلتهم بسرعة؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"lokma","name":{"en":"Lokma","ar":"لقمة"},"color":"#F08C00","icon":"hamburger","domain":"lokma.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Help","ar":"المساعدة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","text":{"en":"How do I add a promo code?","ar":"كيف أضيف رمز خصم؟"},"chevron":true},{"kind":"listitem","text":{"en":"Can I change my phone number?","ar":"هل أستطيع تغيير رقم هاتفي؟"},"chevron":true,"gap":"s"},{"kind":"listitem","text":{"en":"My order is late","ar":"طلبي متأخر"},"chevron":true,"gap":"s"},{"kind":"listitem","text":{"en":"How do I delete my account?","ar":"كيف أحذف حسابي؟"},"chevron":true,"gap":"s","note":{"en":"60 questions, in the order they were written","ar":"60 سؤالًا، بترتيب كتابتها"}}]},"options":[{"id":"groups","text":{"en":"Group them by task: My order, Payments, Account, Delivery problems, with search on top","ar":"جمعها حسب المهمة: طلبي، والمدفوعات، والحساب، ومشكلات التوصيل، مع بحث في الأعلى"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"lokma","name":{"en":"Lokma","ar":"لقمة"},"color":"#F08C00","icon":"hamburger","domain":"lokma.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Help","ar":"المساعدة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"searchbar","text":{"en":"Search help","ar":"ابحث في المساعدة"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"bag","text":{"en":"My order","ar":"طلبي"},"sub":{"en":"My order is late, missing items…","ar":"طلبي متأخر، أصناف ناقصة…"},"chevron":true,"gap":"m"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"credit-card","text":{"en":"Payments","ar":"المدفوعات"},"sub":{"en":"Promo codes, refunds…","ar":"رموز الخصم، الاسترداد…"},"chevron":true,"gap":"s"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"user","text":{"en":"Account","ar":"الحساب"},"sub":{"en":"Phone number, delete account…","ar":"رقم الهاتف، حذف الحساب…"},"chevron":true,"gap":"s"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"moped","text":{"en":"Delivery problems","ar":"مشكلات التوصيل"},"sub":{"en":"Wrong address, rider can't find me…","ar":"عنوان خطأ، المندوب لا يجدني…"},"chevron":true,"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"date","text":{"en":"Keep one list, newest questions first","ar":"إبقاء قائمة واحدة، الأسئلة الأحدث أولًا"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"lokma","name":{"en":"Lokma","ar":"لقمة"},"color":"#F08C00","icon":"hamburger","domain":"lokma.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Help","ar":"المساعدة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","text":{"en":"Can I pay with a mobile wallet?","ar":"هل أستطيع الدفع بمحفظة الموبايل؟"},"chevron":true},{"kind":"listitem","text":{"en":"Can I change my phone number?","ar":"هل أستطيع تغيير رقم هاتفي؟"},"chevron":true,"gap":"s"},{"kind":"listitem","text":{"en":"My order is late","ar":"طلبي متأخر"},"chevron":true,"gap":"s"},{"kind":"listitem","text":{"en":"How do I delete my account?","ar":"كيف أحذف حسابي؟"},"chevron":true,"gap":"s","note":{"en":"Newest first, still one list of 60","ar":"الأحدث أولًا، وما زالت قائمة واحدة من 60"}}]}},{"id":"team","text":{"en":"Group them by the team that wrote each answer","ar":"جمعها حسب الفريق الذي كتب كل إجابة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"lokma","name":{"en":"Lokma","ar":"لقمة"},"color":"#F08C00","icon":"hamburger","domain":"lokma.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Help","ar":"المساعدة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Customer care team","ar":"فريق خدمة العملاء"}},{"kind":"listitem","text":{"en":"My order is late","ar":"طلبي متأخر"},"chevron":true,"gap":"s"},{"kind":"listitem","text":{"en":"Can I change my phone number?","ar":"هل أستطيع تغيير رقم هاتفي؟"},"chevron":true,"gap":"s"},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Finance team","ar":"الفريق المالي"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"listitem","text":{"en":"How do I add a promo code?","ar":"كيف أضيف رمز خصم؟"},"chevron":true,"gap":"s","note":{"en":"Grouped by who wrote the answer","ar":"مجمّعة حسب من كتب الإجابة"}}]}}],"answer":["groups"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P02-042","when":["date","team"],"feedback":{"en":"People don't know when a question was added or which team owns it. They know what they're trying to do.","ar":"لا يعرف الناس متى أُضيف السؤال ولا أيّ فريق مسؤول عنه. بل يعرفون ما يحاولون فعله."}}],"correct":{"en":"Group help by people's tasks.","ar":"اجمع المساعدة حسب مهام الناس."},"explain":{"en":"Someone with a late order opens Delivery problems and sees only the questions that might apply. Search catches the rest.","ar":"من تأخّر طلبه يفتح «مشكلات التوصيل» فيرى فقط الأسئلة التي قد تنطبق عليه. والبحث يساعد في باقي الحالات."}},{"id":"S08","type":"tune","speaker":"nour","part":"retest","skill":"SK-P02-U05-04","value":{"en":"Re-test, help and documentation (NN/g): keep help concise, and list the concrete steps to carry out. A paragraph of background hides the steps.","ar":"إعادة اختبار، المساعدة والتوثيق (NN/g): اجعل المساعدة موجزة، واذكر الخطوات المحددة التي يجب تنفيذها. وفقرة الخلفية تُخفي الخطوات."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/ten-usability-heuristics/","quote":"Keep it concise, and list concrete steps that need to be carried out."},"scenario":{"en":"Patients can upload lab results from other labs. Our help answer starts with two paragraphs on why we accept outside results and which file types our system supports.","ar":"يستطيع المرضى رفع نتائج تحاليل من معامل أخرى. وإجابة المساعدة عندنا تبدأ بفقرتين عن سبب قبولنا للنتائج الخارجية وأنواع الملفات التي يدعمها نظامنا."},"prompt":{"en":"How should the answer start?","ar":"بماذا تبدأ الإجابة ليعرف المريض فورًا كيف يرفع نتيجته؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Add results from another lab","ar":"أضِف نتائج من معمل آخر"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"We accept results from other labs to keep your medical record complete. Our system supports PDF, JPG and PNG files up to 10 MB, scanned or photographed…","ar":"نقبل نتائج المعامل الأخرى ليكتمل ملفك الطبي. ويدعم نظامنا ملفات PDF وJPG وPNG حتى 10 ميجابايت، ممسوحة أو مصوّرة…"},"note":{"en":"The steps come after two paragraphs","ar":"الخطوات تأتي بعد فقرتين"}}]},"options":[{"id":"steps","text":{"en":"\"1. Open My results 2. Tap Add from another lab 3. Take a photo or choose a PDF\", then one line on file types","ar":"«1. افتح نتائجي 2. اضغط أضِف من معمل آخر 3. التقط صورة أو اختر ملف PDF»، ثم سطر واحد عن أنواع الملفات"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Add results from another lab","ar":"أضِف نتائج من معمل آخر"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"list","style":"number","items":[{"en":"Open **My results**","ar":"افتح **نتائجي**"},{"en":"Tap **Add from another lab**","ar":"اضغط **أضِف من معمل آخر**"},{"en":"Take a photo or choose a PDF","ar":"التقط صورة أو اختر ملف PDF"}]},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","gap":"s","text":{"en":"PDF, JPG or PNG, up to 10 MB.","ar":"PDF أو JPG أو PNG، حتى 10 ميجابايت."}}]}},{"id":"why","text":{"en":"Keep the explanation first; people should understand before they act","ar":"إبقاء الشرح أولًا؛ فيجب أن يفهم الناس قبل أن يتصرفوا"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Add results from another lab","ar":"أضِف نتائج من معمل آخر"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"We accept results from other labs to keep your medical record complete. Our system supports PDF, JPG and PNG files up to 10 MB, scanned or photographed…","ar":"نقبل نتائج المعامل الأخرى ليكتمل ملفك الطبي. ويدعم نظامنا ملفات PDF وJPG وPNG حتى 10 ميجابايت، ممسوحة أو مصوّرة…"},"note":{"en":"The steps come after two paragraphs","ar":"الخطوات تأتي بعد فقرتين"}}]}},{"id":"link","text":{"en":"A link to the full user manual","ar":"رابط إلى دليل المستخدم الكامل"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Add results from another lab","ar":"أضِف نتائج من معمل آخر"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"We accept results from other labs to keep your medical record complete. Our system supports PDF, JPG and PNG files up to 10 MB, scanned or photographed…","ar":"نقبل نتائج المعامل الأخرى ليكتمل ملفك الطبي. ويدعم نظامنا ملفات PDF وJPG وPNG حتى 10 ميجابايت، ممسوحة أو مصوّرة…"},"note":{"en":"The steps come after two paragraphs","ar":"الخطوات تأتي بعد فقرتين"}},{"kind":"link","icon":"book-open","gap":"m","text":{"en":"Read the full user manual (PDF, 48 pages)","ar":"اقرأ دليل المستخدم الكامل (PDF، 48 صفحة)"}}]}}],"answer":["steps"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P02-044","when":["why"],"feedback":{"en":"Patients came to upload a result, not to learn our policy. Two paragraphs first hide the three steps they need.","ar":"جاء المرضى ليرفعوا نتيجة، لا ليتعلّموا سياستنا. وفقرتان في البداية تُخفيان الخطوات الثلاث التي يحتاجونها."}},{"id":"MC-P02-042","when":["link"],"feedback":{"en":"A full manual sends people away from a short answer into a long search.","ar":"الدليل الكامل يأخذ الناس من إجابة قصيرة إلى بحث طويل."}}],"correct":{"en":"Lead with the steps.","ar":"ابدأ بالخطوات."},"explain":{"en":"Three numbered steps answer the question at once, and the file types still fit in one line after them.","ar":"ثلاث خطوات مرقّمة تجيب عن السؤال فورًا، ويكفي سطر واحد بعدها لأنواع الملفات."}}]}$uxg$::jsonb),
  ($uxg$P05-U01-B01$uxg$, $uxg$071e34af39f841344c90e8aece5ebd5cf12f9ebdfc08ccdd8ad361bd521fd89f$uxg$, $uxg${"id":"P05-U01-B01","mode":"bank","title":{"en":"Re-tests: see the barriers","ar":"إعادة اختبار: اكتشف ما يوقف المستخدمين"},"steps":[{"id":"S01","type":"choose","skill":"SK-P05-U01-01","part":"retest","speaker":"karim","value":{"en":"Re-test. Alternative Interfaces for Accessibility (NN/g): every version must offer the same functionality and content. A 'Lite' version without bill payments sends screen reader users to a poorer app.","ar":"إعادة اختبار. واجهات بديلة من أجل الإتاحة (NN/g): يجب أن تقدّم كل نسخة نفس الوظائف ونفس المحتوى. ونسخة «Lite» بلا دفع الفواتير تعطي مستخدمي قارئ الشاشة تطبيقًا أقل."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/alternative-interfaces-for-accessibility/","quote":"Regardless of the targeted user group, all designs must offer the same functionality and provide access to the same content."},"scenario":{"en":"I build a banking app. We made a \"Lite\" version for people who use screen readers, and we send them there. It has transfers and balances, but no bill payments.","ar":"أبني تطبيقًا لبنك. وصنعنا نسخة «Lite» لمن يستخدمون قارئ الشاشة (Screen reader)، ونرسلهم إليها. فيها التحويلات والرصيد، لكن ليس فيها دفع الفواتير."},"prompt":{"en":"What should we do so screen reader users get every feature?","ar":"ماذا نفعل ليحصل مستخدمو قارئ الشاشة على كل الميزات؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rasid","name":{"en":"Rasid","ar":"رصيد"},"color":"#1C3D6E","icon":"bank","domain":"rasid.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Rasid Lite","ar":"رصيد Lite"}},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"The simple version for screen reader users","ar":"النسخة المبسّطة لمستخدمي قارئ الشاشة"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"wallet","text":{"en":"Balances","ar":"الرصيد"},"chevron":true,"gap":"s"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"arrows-left-right","text":{"en":"Transfers","ar":"التحويلات"},"chevron":true},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"receipt","text":{"en":"Bill payments","ar":"دفع الفواتير"},"sub":{"en":"Not here: use the main app","ar":"غير موجود هنا: استخدم التطبيق الأساسي"}}]},"options":[{"id":"note","text":{"en":"Keep Lite, with a note that bills are paid in the main app","ar":"نُبقي Lite، مع ملاحظة أن الفواتير تُدفع في التطبيق الأساسي"}},{"id":"main","text":{"en":"Make the main app work with screen readers","ar":"نجعل التطبيق الأساسي يعمل مع قارئ الشاشة"}},{"id":"rare","text":{"en":"Keep Lite as it is; few people pay bills in the app","ar":"نُبقي Lite كما هو؛ فقليلون يدفعون الفواتير في التطبيق"}}],"answer":["main"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-003","when":["note","rare"],"feedback":{"en":"Screen reader users get fewer features than everyone else, and the note sends them to the app that doesn't work for them. Equal means the same features.","ar":"مستخدمو قارئ الشاشة يحصلون على ميزات أقل من غيرهم، والملاحظة ترسلهم إلى التطبيق الذي لا يعمل معهم. والمساواة تعني نفس الميزات."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. One app, every feature, for everyone.","ar":"صحيح. تطبيق واحد، بكل الميزات، للجميع."},"explain":{"en":"A separate version usually has less in it, and falls behind over time. Make the main app work with screen readers instead.","ar":"النسخة المنفصلة غالبًا ميزاتها أقل، ولا تلحق بالتحديثات مع الوقت. فاجعل التطبيق الأساسي يعمل مع قارئ الشاشة بدلًا منها."}},{"id":"S02","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P05-U01-01","part":"retest","speaker":"mona","value":{"en":"Re-test. Beyond Accessibility (NN/g): usability is also how easy and fast a task is, not only whether it's possible. A seat map that works with a magnifier but takes 12 minutes needs a faster route.","ar":"إعادة اختبار. ما بعد الإتاحة (NN/g): سهولة الاستخدام تعني أيضًا سهولة المهمة وسرعتها، لا أنها ممكنة فقط. وخريطة المقاعد التي تعمل مع المكبّر لكنها تأخذ 12 دقيقة تحتاج طريقًا أسرع."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/beyond-accessibility-treating-users-with-disabilities-as-people/","quote":"It is also a matter of how easy and fast it is for them to do so."},"scenario":{"en":"My team designs a cinema app. Ziad sees very little, so he uses a screen magnifier: it shows a small part of the screen, very big. He can choose seats on our seat map, but it takes him 12 minutes. Others need about one minute.","ar":"يصمّم فريقي تطبيقًا للسينما. زياد نظره ضعيف جدًا، فيستخدم مكبّر الشاشة (Screen magnifier): يعرض جزءًا صغيرًا من الشاشة بحجم كبير. يستطيع زياد اختيار المقاعد من خريطة المقاعد عندنا، لكن ذلك يأخذ منه 12 دقيقة، وغيره يحتاج نحو دقيقة."},"prompt":{"en":"Tap each option to see the change. Which one makes choosing seats quick for Ziad?","ar":"اضغط على كل خيار لترى التغيير. أي خيار يجعل اختيار المقاعد سريعًا لزياد؟"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"app":{"id":"shasha","name":{"en":"Shasha","ar":"شاشة"},"color":"#BE185D","icon":"film-strip","domain":"shasha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Pick 2 seats","ar":"اختر مقعدين"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Pick 2 seats","ar":"اختر مقعدين"}},{"kind":"seatmap","rows":10,"cols":18,"aisle":9,"taken":[[0,3],[0,4],[2,8],[2,9],[4,12],[6,2],[7,15]],"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Continue","ar":"متابعة"},"gap":"m"}]},"options":[{"id":"keep","text":{"en":"Change nothing; the map works with a magnifier","ar":"لا تغيّر شيئًا؛ فالخريطة تعمل مع المكبّر"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"shasha","name":{"en":"Shasha","ar":"شاشة"},"color":"#BE185D","icon":"film-strip","domain":"shasha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Pick 2 seats","ar":"اختر مقعدين"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Pick 2 seats","ar":"اختر مقعدين"}},{"kind":"seatmap","rows":10,"cols":18,"aisle":9,"taken":[[0,3],[0,4],[2,8],[2,9],[4,12],[6,2],[7,15]],"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Continue","ar":"متابعة"},"gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"help","text":{"en":"Add a help page on using the map with a magnifier","ar":"أضف صفحة مساعدة تشرح استخدام الخريطة مع المكبّر"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"shasha","name":{"en":"Shasha","ar":"شاشة"},"color":"#BE185D","icon":"film-strip","domain":"shasha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Pick 2 seats","ar":"اختر مقعدين"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Pick 2 seats","ar":"اختر مقعدين"}},{"kind":"link","text":{"en":"How to use the seat map with a magnifier","ar":"كيف تستخدم خريطة المقاعد مع المكبّر"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"seatmap","rows":10,"cols":18,"aisle":9,"taken":[[0,3],[0,4],[2,8],[2,9],[4,12],[6,2],[7,15]],"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Continue","ar":"متابعة"},"gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"best","text":{"en":"Add a \"Best 2 seats together\" button above the map, for everyone","ar":"أضف زر «أفضل مقعدين متجاورين» فوق الخريطة، للجميع"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"shasha","name":{"en":"Shasha","ar":"شاشة"},"color":"#BE185D","icon":"film-strip","domain":"shasha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Pick 2 seats","ar":"اختر مقعدين"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Pick 2 seats","ar":"اختر مقعدين"}},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Best 2 seats together","ar":"أفضل مقعدين متجاورين"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"or choose on the map","ar":"أو اختر من الخريطة"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"seatmap","rows":10,"cols":18,"aisle":9,"taken":[[0,3],[0,4],[2,8],[2,9],[4,12],[6,2],[7,15]],"gap":"xs"}]}}],"answer":["best"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-002","when":["keep","help"],"feedback":{"en":"Possible isn't the same as easy: Ziad still spends 12 minutes searching the map piece by piece. Give him, and everyone, a quick way.","ar":"أن يستطيع زياد ذلك لا يعني أنه سهل: ما زال يقضي 12 دقيقة يبحث في الخريطة جزءًا جزءًا. أعطه، وأعطِ الجميع، طريقة سريعة."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. A one-tap choice makes it fast for everyone.","ar":"صحيح. الاختيار بضغطة واحدة يجعل الحجز سريعًا للجميع."},"explain":{"en":"Count how long disabled people take, not only whether they can do it. A quick way next to the map helps Ziad most, and saves others time too.","ar":"لا تسأل فقط: هل يستطيع ذوو الإعاقة؟ بل اسأل: كم يأخذ منهم ذلك؟ والطريقة السريعة بجوار الخريطة تفيد زياد أكثر، وتوفّر وقت غيره أيضًا."}},{"id":"S03","type":"choose","skill":"SK-P05-U01-02","part":"retest","speaker":"rami","value":{"en":"Re-test. Accessibility Is Not Enough (NN/g): ask a few disabled people to try real tasks, using their own screen readers, magnifiers or other assistive technology. A designer with eyes closed isn't a screen reader user.","ar":"إعادة اختبار. الإتاحة وحدها لا تكفي (NN/g): اطلب من بعض ذوي الإعاقة تجربة مهام حقيقية، بقارئ الشاشة أو المكبّر أو الأدوات المساعدة الخاصة بهم. والمصمم المغمض العينين ليس مستخدمًا لقارئ الشاشة."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/accessibility-is-not-enough/","quote":"It's important that these employees use their own screen readers, screen magnifiers, keyguards, or mouse replacements"},"scenario":{"en":"I want to test our food delivery app with screen readers. My plan: turn on the screen reader on my phone, close my eyes, and order a meal.","ar":"أريد أن أختبر تطبيق توصيل الطعام عندنا مع قارئ الشاشة. وخطتي: أشغّل قارئ الشاشة في هاتفي، وأغمض عينيّ، وأطلب وجبة."},"prompt":{"en":"Which test will show what really stops screen reader users?","ar":"أي اختبار سيكشف ما يوقف مستخدمي قارئ الشاشة فعلًا؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"mudawwana","name":{"en":"Mudawwana","ar":"مدوّنة"},"color":"#EAB308","icon":"note-pencil","domain":"mudawwana.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Screen reader test plan","ar":"خطة اختبار قارئ الشاشة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Food delivery app · order a meal","ar":"تطبيق توصيل الطعام · اطلب وجبة"}},{"kind":"list","style":"number","gap":"s","items":[{"en":"Turn on the screen reader on my phone","ar":"أشغّل قارئ الشاشة على هاتفي"},{"en":"Close my eyes","ar":"أغمض عينيّ"},{"en":"Order a meal and note where I get stuck","ar":"أطلب وجبة وأكتب أين أتوقّف"}]}]},"options":[{"id":"me","text":{"en":"My plan is enough to find the problems","ar":"خطتي تكفي لاكتشاف المشكلات"}},{"id":"two","text":{"en":"Try it myself, then ask a colleague to do the same","ar":"أجرّبه بنفسي، ثم أطلب من زميل أن يفعل نفس الشيء"}},{"id":"users","text":{"en":"Ask 4 or 5 people who use screen readers every day to order on their own phones","ar":"أطلب من 4 أو 5 أشخاص يستخدمون قارئ الشاشة كل يوم أن يطلبوا من هواتفهم"}}],"answer":["users"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-005","when":["me","two"],"feedback":{"en":"Someone new to screen readers gets stuck on the screen reader itself. Daily users, on their own phones, show what in our app stops them.","ar":"من يجرّب قارئ الشاشة لأول مرة يتعثّر في القارئ نفسه. أما من يستخدمونه كل يوم، على هواتفهم، فيكشفون ما يوقفهم في تطبيقنا."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Real users, their own tools.","ar":"صحيح. مستخدمون حقيقيون، بأدواتهم."},"explain":{"en":"Trying it yourself is a quick first look, not proof. People who use these tools every day, on their own phones, show the real problems.","ar":"تجربتك بنفسك نظرة أولى سريعة، لا دليل. أما من يستخدمون هذه الأدوات كل يوم، على هواتفهم، فيكشفون المشكلات الحقيقية."}},{"id":"S04","type":"choose","skill":"SK-P05-U01-02","part":"retest","speaker":"youssef","value":{"en":"Re-test. Challenges for Screen-Reader Users on Mobile (NN/g): not one screen reader user opened the accessibility menus on their own. A toolbar subscription doesn't replace testing with customers and fixing the structure.","ar":"إعادة اختبار. تحديات مستخدمي قارئ الشاشة على الهاتف (NN/g): لم يفتح أي مستخدم لقارئ الشاشة قوائم الأدوات من نفسه. والاشتراك في شريط أدوات لا يغني عن الاختبار مع العملاء وإصلاح الشاشات نفسها."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/screen-reader-users-on-mobile/","quote":"not one user opened the menus of their own accord"},"scenario":{"en":"A company offers my online shop an accessibility toolbar for 300 EGP a month. They say it \"makes your site work for people with disabilities in one click\".","ar":"عرضت عليّ شركة شريط أدوات للـ Accessibility (مناسبة الموقع لذوي الإعاقة) لمتجري الإلكتروني، مقابل 300 جنيه في الشهر. وتقول إنه «يجعل موقعك مناسبًا لذوي الإعاقة بضغطة واحدة»."},"prompt":{"en":"What should I do so blind customers can really shop in my store?","ar":"ماذا أفعل ليستطيع العملاء المكفوفون الشراء فعلًا من متجري؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"frame":"wide","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Kitchen","ar":"المطبخ"},{"en":"TVs","ar":"التلفزيونات"},{"en":"Offers","ar":"العروض"}],"actions":[{"icon":"shopping-cart"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Kitchen appliances","ar":"أجهزة المطبخ"}},{"kind":"row","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"card","art":"fridge","blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Fridge 16 ft","ar":"ثلاجة 16 قدم"}},{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"EGP 21,500","ar":"21,500 جنيه"}}]},{"kind":"card","art":"washing-machine","blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Washer 8 kg","ar":"غسالة 8 كجم"}},{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"EGP 14,900","ar":"14,900 جنيه"}}]}]}],"fab":{"icon":"wheelchair","text":{"en":"Accessibility toolbar · EGP 300/month","ar":"شريط Accessibility · 300 جنيه شهريًا"}}},"options":[{"id":"test","text":{"en":"Watch a few blind customers shop on their own phones, and fix where they get stuck","ar":"أراقب بعض العملاء المكفوفين وهم يشترون من هواتفهم، وأُصلح ما يتعثّرون فيه"}},{"id":"buy","text":{"en":"Subscribe; the toolbar fixes the shop","ar":"أشترك؛ فالشريط يُصلح المتجر"}},{"id":"both","text":{"en":"Subscribe, and add a page saying the shop works for everyone","ar":"أشترك، وأضيف صفحة تقول إن المتجر يناسب الجميع"}}],"answer":["test"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-004","when":["buy","both"],"feedback":{"en":"Blind customers already have a screen reader on their phone, and they usually don't use these toolbars. The toolbar doesn't change the order or names in the shop, so the problems stay.","ar":"العملاء المكفوفون عندهم قارئ شاشة في هواتفهم، وغالبًا لا يستخدمون هذه الأشرطة. والشريط لا يغيّر ترتيب المتجر ولا أسماء العناصر، فتبقى المشكلات."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Watch real customers, and fix the shop itself.","ar":"صحيح. راقب عملاء حقيقيين، وأصلح المتجر نفسه."},"explain":{"en":"Most problems are in how the screens are built. Real customers show you where they are. A toolbar on top doesn't remove them.","ar":"أغلب المشكلات في طريقة بناء الشاشات. والعملاء الحقيقيون يُرونك مكانها. والشريط الذي يوضع فوق الشاشة لا يُزيلها."}},{"id":"S05","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P05-U01-03","part":"retest","speaker":"hana","value":{"en":"Re-test. Direct vs. sequential access (NN/g): carousels are fine only for short lists people can finish in 3–4 steps. Ten stories, one at a time, should become several at once with titled links.","ar":"إعادة اختبار. الوصول المباشر مقابل المتسلسل (NN/g): الـ Carousel مقبول فقط للقوائم القصيرة التي يُنهيها الناس في 3 إلى 4 خطوات. وعشر قصص، واحدة في كل مرة، يجب أن تصبح عدة قصص معًا بروابط لها أسماء."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/direct-vs-sequential-access/","quote":"carousels are ok only for short lists"},"scenario":{"en":"My gym's website shows 10 member stories in a slider, one at a time. Each story is about a different goal: losing weight, back pain, running a race…","ar":"موقع النادي الرياضي الذي أملكه يعرض 10 قصص لأعضاء في Slider (شرائح تتبدّل)، قصة واحدة في كل مرة. وكل قصة عن هدف مختلف: إنقاص الوزن، آلام الظهر، الجري في سباق…"},"prompt":{"en":"Tap each option to see the change. Which one gets a visitor with back pain to the back pain story fastest?","ar":"اضغط على كل خيار لترى التغيير. أي خيار يُوصل زائرًا يعاني آلام الظهر إلى قصة آلام الظهر بأسرع شكل؟"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"nashat.example/stories","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Member stories","ar":"قصص الأعضاء"}},{"kind":"image","art":"woman-1","size":"s","text":{"en":"Salma: lost 12 kg","ar":"سلمى: خسرت 12 كيلو"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"row","gap":"xs","blocks":[{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"1 / 10","ar":"1 من 10"}},{"kind":"button","style":"plain","text":{"en":"Next ›","ar":"التالي ‹"}}]}]},"options":[{"id":"arrows","text":{"en":"Add bigger arrows on both sides","ar":"أضف أسهمًا أكبر على الجانبين"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"nashat.example/stories","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Member stories","ar":"قصص الأعضاء"}},{"kind":"row","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":"‹"},{"kind":"image","art":"woman-1","size":"s","text":{"en":"Salma: lost 12 kg","ar":"سلمى: خسرت 12 كيلو"}},{"kind":"title","text":"›"}]}]}},{"id":"several","text":{"en":"Show 3 stories at once, named by goal, with a link to all 10","ar":"اعرض 3 قصص معًا، كل قصة باسم هدفها، مع رابط للقصص العشر"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"nashat.example/stories","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Member stories","ar":"قصص الأعضاء"}},{"kind":"link","text":{"en":"Weight loss: Salma lost 12 kg","ar":"إنقاص الوزن: سلمى خسرت 12 كيلو"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"link","text":{"en":"Back pain: Magdy trains pain-free","ar":"آلام الظهر: مجدي يتمرّن دون ألم"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"link","text":{"en":"Running: Dina finished her first 10 km","ar":"الجري: دينا أنهت أول 10 كيلومترات"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"link","text":{"en":"All 10 stories by goal","ar":"القصص العشر حسب الهدف"},"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"auto","text":{"en":"Make the slider move by itself every 5 seconds","ar":"اجعل الـ Slider يتحرّك وحده كل 5 ثوانٍ"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"nashat.example/stories","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Member stories","ar":"قصص الأعضاء"}},{"kind":"image","art":"woman-1","size":"s","text":{"en":"Salma: lost 12 kg","ar":"سلمى: خسرت 12 كيلو"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"1 / 10 · next in 5 s","ar":"1 من 10 · التالي بعد 5 ثوانٍ"},"gap":"xs"}]}}],"answer":["several"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-006","when":["arrows","auto"],"feedback":{"en":"It's still one story at a time: someone with back pain may go through up to 9 stories to find theirs. Ten is too many for a slider.","ar":"ما زالت قصة واحدة في كل مرة: قد يمرّ من يعاني آلام الظهر على 9 قصص ليجد قصته. وعشر قصص كثيرة على Slider واحد."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Show several, and link to the rest.","ar":"صحيح. اعرض عدة قصص، وضع رابطًا للباقي."},"explain":{"en":"Links named by goal let people jump to the story that fits them, whether they listen with a screen reader or look with their eyes.","ar":"حين يحمل كل رابط اسم الهدف، يصل الناس مباشرة إلى القصة التي تناسبهم، سواء استمعوا بقارئ الشاشة أو قرأوا بأعينهم."}},{"id":"S06","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P05-U01-03","part":"retest","speaker":"karim","value":{"en":"Re-test. Direct vs. sequential access (NN/g): video is the most sequential medium. If you provide a video, also give a transcript or a detailed text summary people can scan.","ar":"إعادة اختبار. الوصول المباشر مقابل المتسلسل (NN/g): الفيديو أكثر وسيلة تُتابَع بالترتيب. وإذا قدّمت فيديو، فقدّم أيضًا كلامه مكتوبًا أو ملخصًا مكتوبًا مفصّلًا يبحث فيه الناس."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/direct-vs-sequential-access/","quote":"If you provide a video, make sure that you also provide, if not a transcription, at least a detailed text summary"},"scenario":{"en":"In the cooking app I'm building, each recipe is only a 6-minute video. While cooking, people often need just one thing, like how much of one ingredient to add.","ar":"في تطبيق الطبخ الذي أبنيه، كل وصفة هي فيديو مدته 6 دقائق فقط. وأثناء الطبخ، يحتاج الناس غالبًا شيئًا واحدًا، مثل كمية مكوّن واحد."},"prompt":{"en":"Which change lets people find one ingredient's amount straight away?","ar":"أي تغيير يجعل الناس يجدون كمية مكوّن واحد فورًا؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"tabkha","name":{"en":"Tabkha","ar":"طبخة"},"color":"#EA580C","icon":"cooking-pot","domain":"tabkha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Recipe","ar":"الوصفة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Molokhia with chicken","ar":"ملوخية بالفراخ"}},{"kind":"image","art":"food-grill","size":"m","text":{"en":"▶ Video · 6:00","ar":"▶ فيديو · 6:00"},"gap":"s"}],"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"}},"options":[{"id":"replay","text":{"en":"Add a \"Back 10 seconds\" button to the video","ar":"أضف زر «رجوع 10 ثوانٍ» إلى الفيديو"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"tabkha","name":{"en":"Tabkha","ar":"طبخة"},"color":"#EA580C","icon":"cooking-pot","domain":"tabkha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Recipe","ar":"الوصفة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Molokhia with chicken","ar":"ملوخية بالفراخ"}},{"kind":"image","art":"food-grill","size":"m","text":{"en":"▶ Video · 6:00","ar":"▶ فيديو · 6:00"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Back 10 seconds","ar":"رجوع 10 ثوانٍ"},"icon":"arrow-counter-clockwise","style":"outline","gap":"xs"}],"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}},{"id":"autoplay","text":{"en":"Make the video start as soon as the recipe opens","ar":"اجعل الفيديو يبدأ فور فتح الوصفة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"tabkha","name":{"en":"Tabkha","ar":"طبخة"},"color":"#EA580C","icon":"cooking-pot","domain":"tabkha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Recipe","ar":"الوصفة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Molokhia with chicken","ar":"ملوخية بالفراخ"}},{"kind":"image","art":"food-grill","size":"m","text":{"en":"❚❚ Playing · 0:03","ar":"❚❚ يعمل · 0:03"},"gap":"s","note":{"en":"Starts as soon as the recipe opens","ar":"يبدأ فور فتح الوصفة"}}],"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}},{"id":"text","text":{"en":"Add the ingredients and steps as text under the video","ar":"أضف المكوّنات والخطوات مكتوبة تحت الفيديو"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"tabkha","name":{"en":"Tabkha","ar":"طبخة"},"color":"#EA580C","icon":"cooking-pot","domain":"tabkha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Recipe","ar":"الوصفة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Molokhia with chicken","ar":"ملوخية بالفراخ"}},{"kind":"image","art":"food-grill","size":"m","text":{"en":"▶ Video · 6:00","ar":"▶ فيديو · 6:00"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Ingredients","ar":"المكوّنات"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"list","style":"bullet","gap":"xs","items":[{"en":"Molokhia: 500 g","ar":"ملوخية: 500 جم"},{"en":"Chicken: 1 whole","ar":"فرخة: واحدة كاملة"},{"en":"Garlic: 6 cloves","ar":"ثوم: 6 فصوص"},{"en":"Ground coriander: 1 tbsp","ar":"كزبرة مطحونة: ملعقة كبيرة"}]},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Steps","ar":"الخطوات"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"list","style":"number","gap":"xs","items":[{"en":"Boil the chicken for 40 minutes.","ar":"اسلق الفرخة 40 دقيقة."},{"en":"Add the molokhia to the stock and stir.","ar":"أضف الملوخية إلى المرق وقلّب."}]}],"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}}],"answer":["text"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-006","when":["replay","autoplay"],"feedback":{"en":"Both keep people inside the video, watching it in order. Text lets anyone, including screen reader users, jump straight to the ingredient.","ar":"الخياران يُبقيان الناس داخل الفيديو، يشاهدونه بالترتيب. أما النص فيوصل أي شخص، ومنهم مستخدمو قارئ الشاشة، إلى المكوّن مباشرة."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. You can jump through text; you can't do that in a video.","ar":"صحيح. في النص تصل إلى ما تريد مباشرة؛ وفي الفيديو لا."},"explain":{"en":"Keep the video, and put the recipe in text next to it, so people can jump to the line they need.","ar":"أبقِ الفيديو، وضع الوصفة مكتوبة بجواره، ليصل الناس مباشرة إلى السطر الذي يحتاجونه."}},{"id":"S07","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P05-U01-04","part":"retest","speaker":"mona","value":{"en":"Re-test. Usability for Older Adults (NN/g): users were punished for typing hyphens or parentheses in phone and credit-card numbers. Accept the spaces printed on the card and remove them in code.","ar":"إعادة اختبار. قابلية الاستخدام لكبار السن (NN/g): رُفضت أرقام الهاتف والبطاقات لأن أصحابها كتبوها بشرطات أو أقواس. اقبل المسافات المطبوعة على البطاقة واحذفها في الكود."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/usability-for-senior-citizens/","quote":"punished for entering hyphens or parentheses in telephone or credit-card numbers"},"scenario":{"en":"In the payment page my team designs, Mr. Sami typed his card number with spaces, the way it's printed on his bank card. The box says it's wrong.","ar":"في صفحة الدفع التي يصمّمها فريقي، كتب الأستاذ سامي رقم بطاقته البنكية بمسافات، كما هو مطبوع عليها. فظهرت رسالة تقول إن الرقم خطأ."},"prompt":{"en":"Tap each option to see the change. Which one lets Mr. Sami pay with the number as he typed it?","ar":"اضغط على كل خيار لترى التغيير. أي خيار يسمح للأستاذ سامي بالدفع بالرقم كما كتبه؟"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"app":{"id":"lamha","name":{"en":"Lamha","ar":"لمحة"},"color":"#7C3AED","icon":"t-shirt","domain":"lamha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Payment","ar":"الدفع"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Card number","ar":"رقم البطاقة"},"filled":true,"text":"4111 1111 1111 1111","tone":"bad","error":{"en":"Invalid card number","ar":"رقم البطاقة غير صحيح"}}]},"options":[{"id":"hint","text":{"en":"Add a hint above the box: \"No spaces\"","ar":"أضف تلميحًا فوق المربع: «بدون مسافات»"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"lamha","name":{"en":"Lamha","ar":"لمحة"},"color":"#7C3AED","icon":"t-shirt","domain":"lamha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Payment","ar":"الدفع"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Card number","ar":"رقم البطاقة"},"hintFirst":true,"hint":{"en":"No spaces","ar":"بدون مسافات"},"filled":true,"text":"4111 1111 1111 1111","tone":"bad","error":{"en":"Invalid card number","ar":"رقم البطاقة غير صحيح"}}]}},{"id":"accept","text":{"en":"Accept the spaces, and let the app remove them","ar":"اقبل المسافات، واجعل التطبيق يحذفها بنفسه"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"lamha","name":{"en":"Lamha","ar":"لمحة"},"color":"#7C3AED","icon":"t-shirt","domain":"lamha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Payment","ar":"الدفع"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Card number","ar":"رقم البطاقة"},"filled":true,"text":"4111 1111 1111 1111"},{"kind":"small","color":"green","text":{"en":"✓ Visa","ar":"✓ Visa"},"gap":"xs"}]}},{"id":"message","text":{"en":"Change the error to \"Please remove the spaces\"","ar":"غيّر رسالة الخطأ إلى «من فضلك احذف المسافات»"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"lamha","name":{"en":"Lamha","ar":"لمحة"},"color":"#7C3AED","icon":"t-shirt","domain":"lamha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Payment","ar":"الدفع"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Card number","ar":"رقم البطاقة"},"filled":true,"text":"4111 1111 1111 1111","tone":"bad","error":{"en":"Please remove the spaces","ar":"من فضلك احذف المسافات"}}]}}],"answer":["accept"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-009","when":["hint","message"],"feedback":{"en":"The card number is right; the spaces just copy how the card looks. A hint or a kinder message still makes Mr. Sami do work the code can do.","ar":"رقم البطاقة صحيح؛ والمسافات مجرد شكله على البطاقة. والتلميح أو الرسالة الألطف ما زالا يُحمّلان الأستاذ سامي عملًا يستطيع الكود فعله."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Accept it as he typed it.","ar":"صحيح. اقبله كما كتبه."},"explain":{"en":"People copy numbers the way they see them. Accept spaces and dashes, and clean them up in the code.","ar":"الناس ينقلون الأرقام كما يرونها. فاقبل المسافات والشرطات، ونظّفها في الكود."}},{"id":"S08","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P05-U01-04","part":"retest","speaker":"sara","value":{"en":"Re-test. Usability for Older Adults (NN/g): interfaces are often inflexible and unforgiving of errors; a participant asked why she couldn't just type the time. A typed time box replaces the fiddly wheel.","ar":"إعادة اختبار. قابلية الاستخدام لكبار السن (NN/g): الواجهات كثيرًا ما تكون جامدة ولا تسامح الأخطاء؛ وسألت مشاركة: لماذا لا أكتب الوقت ببساطة؟ ومربع كتابة الوقت يحلّ محلّ العجلة الصعبة."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/usability-for-senior-citizens/","quote":"Interfaces in websites and apps are often inflexible and unforgiving of errors."},"scenario":{"en":"I'm designing an app that reminds people to take their medicine. Uncle Mahmoud, 70, wants a reminder at 8:15. The wheel moves one minute with each small move. He keeps stopping at 8:13 or 8:17.","ar":"أصمّم تطبيقًا يذكّر الناس بمواعيد الدواء. عمّ محمود، 70 سنة، يريد تذكيرًا الساعة 8:15. وعجلة اختيار الوقت (Time picker) تتحرّك دقيقة مع كل حركة صغيرة، فيقف كل مرة على 8:13 أو 8:17."},"prompt":{"en":"Tap each option to see the change. Which one lets Uncle Mahmoud set 8:15 most easily?","ar":"اضغط على كل خيار لترى التغيير. أي خيار يجعل عمّ محمود يضبط 8:15 بأسهل شكل؟"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"app":{"id":"dawaa","name":{"en":"Dawaa Pharmacy","ar":"صيدلية دواء"},"color":"#059669","icon":"pill","domain":"dawaa.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"New reminder","ar":"تذكير جديد"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Remind me at","ar":"ذكّرني الساعة"}},{"kind":"group","tone":"plain","gap":"xs","blocks":[{"kind":"small","color":"faint","text":"8:12"},{"kind":"text","weight":"bold","text":"8:13"},{"kind":"small","color":"faint","text":"8:14"}]}]},"options":[{"id":"type","text":{"en":"A box where he can type 8:15","ar":"مربع يكتب فيه 8:15"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"dawaa","name":{"en":"Dawaa Pharmacy","ar":"صيدلية دواء"},"color":"#059669","icon":"pill","domain":"dawaa.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"New reminder","ar":"تذكير جديد"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Remind me at","ar":"ذكّرني الساعة"},"filled":true,"text":"8:15","hint":{"en":"For example 8:15","ar":"مثلًا 8:15"}}]}},{"id":"buzz","text":{"en":"Keep the wheel, and make the phone vibrate at each minute","ar":"أبقِ العجلة، واجعل الهاتف يهتز مع كل دقيقة"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"dawaa","name":{"en":"Dawaa Pharmacy","ar":"صيدلية دواء"},"color":"#059669","icon":"pill","domain":"dawaa.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"New reminder","ar":"تذكير جديد"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Remind me at","ar":"ذكّرني الساعة"}},{"kind":"group","tone":"plain","gap":"xs","blocks":[{"kind":"small","color":"faint","text":"8:12"},{"kind":"text","weight":"bold","text":"8:13"},{"kind":"small","color":"faint","text":"8:14"}]},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"📳 Vibrates at each minute","ar":"📳 يهتز مع كل دقيقة"},"gap":"xs"}]}},{"id":"keep","text":{"en":"Keep the wheel; it never gives a wrong time","ar":"أبقِ العجلة؛ فهي لا تسمح بوقت خطأ"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"dawaa","name":{"en":"Dawaa Pharmacy","ar":"صيدلية دواء"},"color":"#059669","icon":"pill","domain":"dawaa.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"New reminder","ar":"تذكير جديد"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Remind me at","ar":"ذكّرني الساعة"}},{"kind":"group","tone":"plain","gap":"xs","blocks":[{"kind":"small","color":"faint","text":"8:12"},{"kind":"text","weight":"bold","text":"8:13"},{"kind":"small","color":"faint","text":"8:14"}]}]}}],"answer":["type"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-010","when":["buzz","keep"],"feedback":{"en":"The wheel still needs a steady finger to stop at one exact minute. Uncle Mahmoud knows the time he wants; let him type it.","ar":"ما زالت العجلة تحتاج إصبعًا ثابتًا لتقف عند دقيقة بعينها. وعمّ محمود يعرف الوقت الذي يريده؛ فدعه يكتبه."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Let him type the time.","ar":"صحيح. دعه يكتب الوقت."},"explain":{"en":"When people know the exact value, typing it is better than a control that needs a steady hand.","ar":"حين يعرف الناس القيمة بالضبط، تكون كتابتها أفضل من عنصر يحتاج يدًا ثابتة."}},{"id":"S09","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P05-U01-05","part":"retest","speaker":"tarek","value":{"en":"Re-test. Inclusive Design (NN/g): to make reading screens more inclusive, offer a button for users to increase the font size. Removing it because few people tap it removes it from the people who need it most.","ar":"إعادة اختبار. التصميم الشامل (NN/g): لتناسب شاشات القراءة عددًا أكبر من الناس، أضف زرًا يسمح بتكبير الخط. وحذفه لأن قليلين يضغطونه يأخذه من أكثر الناس حاجة إليه."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/inclusive-design/","quote":"offer a button for users to increase the font size"},"scenario":{"en":"In our news app, only 6% of readers use the \"A A\" button that makes article text bigger. The designers want to remove it, so the top of the article looks cleaner.","ar":"في تطبيق الأخبار عندنا، 6% فقط من القرّاء يستخدمون زر «A A» الذي يكبّر نص المقال. والمصممون يريدون حذفه، ليبدو أعلى المقال أنظف."},"prompt":{"en":"What should we do with the button, so readers who need bigger text can still read?","ar":"ماذا نفعل بالزر، حتى يستطيع من يحتاج خطًا أكبر أن يقرأ؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"mirsad","name":{"en":"Mirsad","ar":"مرصد"},"color":"#B91C1C","icon":"newspaper","domain":"mirsad.example"},"appbar":{"logo":true,"actions":[{"icon":"bookmark-simple","aria":{"en":"Save","ar":"حفظ"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"row","blocks":[{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Economy · 5 min read","ar":"اقتصاد · 5 دقائق قراءة"}},{"kind":"chip","text":"A A"}]},{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Bread prices stay the same this month","ar":"أسعار الخبز ثابتة هذا الشهر"},"gap":"s"}],"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"}},"options":[{"id":"keep","text":{"en":"Keep it on article screens","ar":"نُبقيه في شاشات المقالات"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"mirsad","name":{"en":"Mirsad","ar":"مرصد"},"color":"#B91C1C","icon":"newspaper","domain":"mirsad.example"},"appbar":{"logo":true,"actions":[{"icon":"bookmark-simple","aria":{"en":"Save","ar":"حفظ"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"row","blocks":[{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Economy · 5 min read","ar":"اقتصاد · 5 دقائق قراءة"}},{"kind":"chip","text":"A A"}]},{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Bread prices stay the same this month","ar":"أسعار الخبز ثابتة هذا الشهر"},"gap":"s"}],"caption":{"en":"Unchanged","ar":"بدون تغيير"}}},{"id":"remove","text":{"en":"Remove it; 6% is too few people","ar":"نحذفه؛ فـ 6% عدد قليل"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"mirsad","name":{"en":"Mirsad","ar":"مرصد"},"color":"#B91C1C","icon":"newspaper","domain":"mirsad.example"},"appbar":{"logo":true,"actions":[{"icon":"bookmark-simple","aria":{"en":"Save","ar":"حفظ"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"row","blocks":[{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Economy · 5 min read","ar":"اقتصاد · 5 دقائق قراءة"}}]},{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Bread prices stay the same this month","ar":"أسعار الخبز ثابتة هذا الشهر"},"gap":"s"}],"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}},{"id":"bury","text":{"en":"Move it to Settings › Display › Advanced","ar":"ننقله إلى الإعدادات › العرض › متقدّم"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"mirsad","name":{"en":"Mirsad","ar":"مرصد"},"color":"#B91C1C","icon":"newspaper","domain":"mirsad.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Advanced","ar":"متقدّم"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Settings › Display › Advanced","ar":"الإعدادات › العرض › متقدّم"},"color":"muted"},{"kind":"listitem","text":{"en":"Text size","ar":"حجم النص"},"icon":"text-aa","chevron":true,"gap":"s"},{"kind":"listitem","text":{"en":"Data saver","ar":"توفير البيانات"},"icon":"cell-signal-low","toggle":false},{"kind":"listitem","text":{"en":"Clear cache","ar":"مسح الذاكرة المؤقتة"},"icon":"trash","chevron":true}],"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}}],"answer":["keep"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-012","when":["remove","bury"],"feedback":{"en":"The 6% are probably the readers who can't read the normal size. Removing or hiding the button takes away exactly what they need, right where they read.","ar":"الـ 6% غالبًا هم القرّاء الذين لا يستطيعون قراءة الحجم العادي. وحذف الزر أو إخفاؤه يأخذ منهم ما يحتاجونه بالضبط، في مكان القراءة نفسه."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Keep it where people read.","ar":"صحيح. أبقِه حيث يقرأ الناس."},"explain":{"en":"A small number of users may be the ones who can't read without it. Keep a bigger-text button on long reading screens.","ar":"قد يكون هذا العدد الصغير هم من لا يستطيعون القراءة بدونه. فأبقِ زر تكبير الخط في شاشات القراءة الطويلة."}},{"id":"S10","type":"compare","skill":"SK-P05-U01-05","part":"retest","speaker":"rami","value":{"en":"Re-test. Inclusive Design (NN/g): consider a dark-mode option without enforcing it, and use the dark-mode settings phones already offer. A dark-only redesign locks out people who read better on light screens.","ar":"إعادة اختبار. التصميم الشامل (NN/g): فكّر في خيار للوضع الداكن دون فرضه، واستفد من إعداد الوضع الداكن الموجود في الهواتف. والتصميم الداكن فقط يُتعب من يقرؤون أفضل على الشاشات الفاتحة."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/inclusive-design/","quote":"take advantage of any dark-mode APIs that various operating systems may offer"},"scenario":{"en":"We're redesigning a banking app. Some customers read better on dark screens, and others on light ones. I have two ideas for the colours.","ar":"نعيد تصميم تطبيق بنك. بعض العملاء يقرؤون أفضل على الشاشات الداكنة، وآخرون على الفاتحة. وعندي فكرتان للألوان."},"prompt":{"en":"Which idea works for both groups of customers?","ar":"أي فكرة تناسب المجموعتين من العملاء؟"},"a":{"label":{"en":"A: Follow the phone's setting, and let people change it","ar":"A: نتبع إعداد الهاتف، ونسمح للناس بتغييره"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rasid","name":{"en":"Rasid","ar":"رصيد"},"color":"#1C3D6E","icon":"bank","domain":"rasid.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Display","ar":"العرض"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Theme","ar":"المظهر"}},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Follows your phone's light or dark setting. You can change it here.","ar":"يتبع الوضع الفاتح أو الداكن المختار في هاتفك. ويمكنك تغييره من هنا."},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"segmented","options":[{"en":"Light","ar":"فاتح"},{"en":"Dark","ar":"داكن"},{"en":"Like my phone","ar":"حسب الهاتف"}],"value":2,"gap":"s"}]}},"b":{"label":{"en":"B: Make the app dark only, to match our brand","ar":"B: نجعل التطبيق داكنًا فقط، ليناسب هوية البنك"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rasid","name":{"en":"Rasid","ar":"رصيد"},"color":"#1C3D6E","icon":"bank","domain":"rasid.example"},"theme":"dark","appbar":{"logo":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"banner","tone":"info","icon":"moon","text":{"en":"Our new look is dark only, to match our brand.","ar":"شكلنا الجديد داكن فقط، ليناسب هوية البنك."}},{"kind":"card","gap":"m","blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Current account","ar":"الحساب الجاري"}},{"kind":"price","size":"l","text":{"en":"EGP 12,400","ar":"12,400 جنيه"}}]}]}},"answer":"a","misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-013","when":["b"],"feedback":{"en":"Dark helps some eyes and tires others. Dark-only shuts out customers who read better on light screens, and ignores the setting they chose on their phone.","ar":"الداكن يساعد بعض العيون ويُتعب غيرها. والداكن فقط يُتعب العملاء الذين يقرؤون أفضل على الشاشات الفاتحة، ويتجاهل الإعداد الذي اختاروه في هواتفهم."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Follow the phone, and let people choose.","ar":"صحيح. اتبع إعداد الهاتف، ودع الناس يختارون."},"explain":{"en":"Start from the person's phone setting, and let them switch. Offer dark mode; don't force it.","ar":"ابدأ من إعداد هاتف الشخص، ودعه يغيّره. اعرض الوضع الداكن (Dark mode) كاختيار، ولا تفرضه."}}]}$uxg$::jsonb),
  ($uxg$P05-U02-B01$uxg$, $uxg$f26a69af77acb780c02a4d8c6f59d0a612adadb968648e0c96c9cf6bc0294521$uxg$, $uxg${"id":"P05-U02-B01","mode":"bank","title":{"en":"Re-tests: colour and contrast","ar":"إعادة اختبار: الألوان والتباين (Contrast)"},"steps":[{"id":"S01","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P05-U02-01","part":"retest","speaker":"sara","value":{"en":"Re-test. Low-Contrast Text (NN/g): our vision gets weaker as we age, and low contrast hurts low-vision readers most. Bigger pale text is still pale; dark text fixes it.","ar":"إعادة اختبار. النص منخفض التباين (NN/g): يضعف النظر مع العمر، والتباين الضعيف يضرّ ضعاف النظر أكثر. والنص الباهت الأكبر يبقى باهتًا؛ والحل نص غامق."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/low-contrast/","quote":"As we get older our vision degrades."},"scenario":{"en":"I'm designing a reading app. Many of our readers are over 50. To feel calm, the book text is light grey.","ar":"أصمّم تطبيقًا للقراءة. وكثير من قرّائنا فوق الخمسين. ولكي يبدو التطبيق هادئًا، جعلنا نص الكتاب رماديًا فاتحًا."},"prompt":{"en":"Tap each option to see the change. Which one makes the book easiest to read?","ar":"اضغط على كل خيار لترى التغيير. أي خيار يجعل الكتاب أسهل في القراءة؟"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"app":{"id":"waraq","name":{"en":"Waraq","ar":"ورق"},"color":"#9A3412","icon":"books","domain":"waraq.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"The Night Train","ar":"قطار الليل"},"back":true,"actions":[{"icon":"text-aa","aria":{"en":"Text size","ar":"حجم الخط"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Chapter 3","ar":"الفصل 3"}},{"kind":"text","color":"faint","text":{"en":"The train left the station just after dawn. Laila watched the river until the city was gone.","ar":"غادر القطار المحطة بعد الفجر بقليل. وظلّت ليلى تنظر إلى النهر حتى اختفت المدينة."},"gap":"s"}]},"options":[{"id":"bigger","text":{"en":"Keep the light grey, but make the text bigger","ar":"أبقِ الرمادي الفاتح، لكن كبّر النص"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"waraq","name":{"en":"Waraq","ar":"ورق"},"color":"#9A3412","icon":"books","domain":"waraq.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"The Night Train","ar":"قطار الليل"},"back":true,"actions":[{"icon":"text-aa","aria":{"en":"Text size","ar":"حجم الخط"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Chapter 3","ar":"الفصل 3"}},{"kind":"text","px":19,"color":"faint","text":{"en":"The train left the station just after dawn. Laila watched the river until the city was gone.","ar":"غادر القطار المحطة بعد الفجر بقليل. وظلّت ليلى تنظر إلى النهر حتى اختفت المدينة."},"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"zoom","text":{"en":"Change nothing; readers can zoom in","ar":"لا تغيّر شيئًا؛ يستطيع القرّاء التكبير"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"waraq","name":{"en":"Waraq","ar":"ورق"},"color":"#9A3412","icon":"books","domain":"waraq.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"The Night Train","ar":"قطار الليل"},"back":true,"actions":[{"icon":"text-aa","aria":{"en":"Text size","ar":"حجم الخط"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Chapter 3","ar":"الفصل 3"}},{"kind":"text","color":"faint","text":{"en":"The train left the station just after dawn. Laila watched the river until the city was gone.","ar":"غادر القطار المحطة بعد الفجر بقليل. وظلّت ليلى تنظر إلى النهر حتى اختفت المدينة."},"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"dark","text":{"en":"Make the book text near-black","ar":"اجعل نص الكتاب قريبًا من الأسود"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"waraq","name":{"en":"Waraq","ar":"ورق"},"color":"#9A3412","icon":"books","domain":"waraq.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"The Night Train","ar":"قطار الليل"},"back":true,"actions":[{"icon":"text-aa","aria":{"en":"Text size","ar":"حجم الخط"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Chapter 3","ar":"الفصل 3"}},{"kind":"text","color":"ink","text":{"en":"The train left the station just after dawn. Laila watched the river until the city was gone.","ar":"غادر القطار المحطة بعد الفجر بقليل. وظلّت ليلى تنظر إلى النهر حتى اختفت المدينة."},"gap":"s"}]}}],"answer":["dark"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-014","when":["bigger","zoom"],"feedback":{"en":"Bigger pale text is still pale. For readers whose eyes are weaker, the colour itself has to be dark.","ar":"النص الباهت الأكبر يبقى باهتًا. ولمن نظره أضعف، يجب أن يكون اللون نفسه غامقًا."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Dark text is the calm choice for tired eyes.","ar":"صحيح. النص الغامق هو الاختيار المريح للعين المتعبة."},"explain":{"en":"A page feels calm when it's easy to read. Keep body text dark, and use space and size for calm.","ar":"الصفحة تبدو هادئة حين تكون سهلة القراءة. أبقِ النص غامقًا، واصنع الهدوء بالمسافات وحجم الخط."}},{"id":"S02","type":"choose","skill":"SK-P05-U02-01","part":"retest","speaker":"hana","value":{"en":"Re-test. Low-Contrast Text (NN/g): check colour combinations together with font size; some pass only when the font is large enough. 15 px regular text needs 4.5:1, so 3.8:1 fails.","ar":"إعادة اختبار. النص منخفض التباين (NN/g): افحص الألوان مع حجم الخط؛ فبعضها ينجح فقط حين يكون الخط كبيرًا بما يكفي. والنص العادي 15 بكسل يحتاج 4.5:1، فالـ 3.8:1 لا ينجح."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/low-contrast/","quote":"Be sure to check those combinations paired with your font size, as some combinations become compliant when the font is large enough."},"scenario":{"en":"The contrast checker says our class descriptions have 3.8:1. They're 15 px, regular weight. My designer says that's fine, because it's over 3:1.","ar":"أداة فحص التباين (Contrast checker) تقول إن وصف الحصص عندنا تباينه 3.8:1. والخط 15 بكسل، عادي (غير عريض). ويقول المصمّم إن هذا جيد، لأنه أعلى من 3:1."},"prompt":{"en":"Is the designer right?","ar":"هل المصمّم على حق؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Classes","ar":"الحصص"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Pilates · Monday 18:00","ar":"بيلاتس · الاثنين 18:00"}},{"kind":"text","px":15,"color":"pale","text":{"en":"A gentle class for strength and balance. Bring a towel.","ar":"حصة هادئة للقوة والتوازن. أحضر منشفة."},"gap":"xs"}]},"options":[{"id":"needs","text":{"en":"No. Text this size needs at least 4.5:1","ar":"لا. النص بهذا الحجم يحتاج 4.5:1 على الأقل"}},{"id":"over3","text":{"en":"Yes. Any text over 3:1 passes","ar":"نعم. أي نص أعلى من 3:1 ينجح"}},{"id":"short","text":{"en":"Yes, because the descriptions are short","ar":"نعم، لأن الوصف قصير"}}],"answer":["needs"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-015","when":["over3","short"],"feedback":{"en":"3:1 is only for large or bold text. Normal 15 px text needs 4.5:1, however short it is.","ar":"الـ 3:1 للنص الكبير أو العريض فقط. والنص العادي 15 بكسل يحتاج 4.5:1، مهما كان قصيرًا."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Normal text needs 4.5:1.","ar":"صحيح. النص العادي يحتاج 4.5:1."},"explain":{"en":"Read the contrast number together with the text size. 3:1 is only for large or bold text.","ar":"اقرأ رقم التباين مع حجم النص. فالـ 3:1 للنص الكبير أو العريض فقط."}},{"id":"S03","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P05-U02-02","part":"retest","speaker":"nour","value":{"en":"Re-test. Low-Contrast Text (NN/g): navigation is an especially risky place for low contrast, as people may think their options are limited. Keep all tabs readable and mark the current one another way.","ar":"إعادة اختبار. النص منخفض التباين (NN/g): التنقّل مكان خطير بشكل خاص للتباين الضعيف، فقد يظن الناس أن خياراتهم محدودة. أبقِ كل التبويبات مقروءة، وميّز الحالي بطريقة أخرى."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/low-contrast/","quote":"Navigation is an especially risky place to use low contrast, as users may perceive their options to be limited"},"scenario":{"en":"Our clinic app has three tabs at the top. To show which tab is open, the designer made the other two very light grey.","ar":"في تطبيق عيادتنا ثلاثة تبويبات (Tabs) في الأعلى. ولكي يُظهر المصمّم التبويب المفتوح، جعل التبويبين الآخرين رماديين فاتحين جدًا."},"prompt":{"en":"Tap each option to see the change. Which one shows the open tab, while the others still look like they work?","ar":"اضغط على كل خيار لترى التغيير. أي خيار يُظهر التبويب المفتوح، ويُبقي التبويبين الآخرين واضحين وقابلين للضغط؟"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"My clinic","ar":"عيادتي"}},"blocks":[{"kind":"row","blocks":[{"kind":"meta","weight":"bold","color":"ink","text":{"en":"Bookings","ar":"الحجوزات"}},{"kind":"meta","color":"faint","text":{"en":"Results","ar":"النتائج"}},{"kind":"meta","color":"faint","text":{"en":"Doctors","ar":"الأطباء"}}]},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"Dr. Salma · Sunday 10:30","ar":"د. سلمى · الأحد 10:30"},"gap":"m"}]},"options":[{"id":"fainter","text":{"en":"Make the other tabs even lighter, so the open one stands out more","ar":"اجعل التبويبين الآخرين أفتح، ليبرز المفتوح أكثر"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"My clinic","ar":"عيادتي"}},"blocks":[{"kind":"row","blocks":[{"kind":"meta","weight":"bold","color":"ink","text":{"en":"Bookings","ar":"الحجوزات"}},{"kind":"meta","color":"faint","px":12,"text":{"en":"Results","ar":"النتائج"}},{"kind":"meta","color":"faint","px":12,"text":{"en":"Doctors","ar":"الأطباء"}}]},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"Dr. Salma · Sunday 10:30","ar":"د. سلمى · الأحد 10:30"},"gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"segment","text":{"en":"Keep all tabs dark, and put the open one in a filled box","ar":"أبقِ كل التبويبات غامقة، وضع التبويب المفتوح في مربع ملوّن"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"My clinic","ar":"عيادتي"}},"blocks":[{"kind":"segmented","options":[{"en":"Bookings","ar":"الحجوزات"},{"en":"Results","ar":"النتائج"},{"en":"Doctors","ar":"الأطباء"}],"value":0},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"Dr. Salma · Sunday 10:30","ar":"د. سلمى · الأحد 10:30"},"gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"hide","text":{"en":"Hide the other tabs behind a \"Menu\" button","ar":"أخفِ التبويبين الآخرين خلف زر «القائمة»"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"My clinic","ar":"عيادتي"}},"blocks":[{"kind":"row","blocks":[{"kind":"meta","weight":"bold","color":"ink","text":{"en":"Bookings","ar":"الحجوزات"}},{"kind":"button","style":"plain","text":{"en":"Menu ☰","ar":"القائمة ☰"}}]},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"Dr. Salma · Sunday 10:30","ar":"د. سلمى · الأحد 10:30"},"gap":"m"}]}}],"answer":["segment"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-016","when":["fainter"],"feedback":{"en":"Faded tabs look turned off, so patients may think they can't open their results. Keep every tab readable.","ar":"التبويبات الباهتة تبدو معطّلة، فقد يظن المريض أنه لا يستطيع فتح نتائجه. أبقِ كل التبويبات مقروءة."}},{"id":"MC-P05-017","when":["hide"],"feedback":{"en":"Now patients can't see the other tabs at all. Show them in dark text, and mark the open one with a box.","ar":"الآن لا يرى المريض التبويبات الأخرى أصلًا. اعرضها بنص غامق، وميّز المفتوح بمربع."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Every tab is readable, and the box shows which one is open.","ar":"صحيح. كل التبويبات مقروءة، والمربع يُظهر المفتوح."},"explain":{"en":"Don't fade options to show which one is chosen. Faded options look like they don't work.","ar":"لا تجعل الخيارات باهتة لتُظهر المختار منها. فالخيارات الباهتة تبدو كأنها لا تعمل."}},{"id":"S04","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P05-U02-02","part":"retest","speaker":"mona","value":{"en":"Re-test. Low-Contrast Text (NN/g): expandable sections can reduce clutter by showing details only when users ask for them, instead of making text pale.","ar":"إعادة اختبار. النص منخفض التباين (NN/g): الأقسام القابلة للفتح تقلّل الزحام بعرض التفاصيل فقط حين يطلبها المستخدم، بدل جعل النص باهتًا."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/low-contrast/","quote":"In some cases, expandable sections can reduce clutter by showing details only when users express interest with a click or a tap."},"scenario":{"en":"Our towel page has long care instructions. They made the page look crowded, so the designer turned them pale grey.","ar":"صفحة المناشف عندنا فيها تعليمات عناية طويلة. كانت تجعل الصفحة مزدحمة، فجعلها المصمّم رمادية باهتة."},"prompt":{"en":"Tap each option to see the change. Which one makes the page less crowded, while the care tips stay easy to read?","ar":"اضغط على كل خيار لترى التغيير. أي خيار يجعل الصفحة أقل زحامًا، وتبقى نصائح العناية سهلة القراءة؟"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"app":{"id":"nasij","name":{"en":"Nasij","ar":"نسيج"},"color":"#B45309","icon":"house-line","domain":"nasij.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Bathroom","ar":"الحمّام"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"bed-sheet","size":"m"},{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Cotton bath towel","ar":"منشفة حمّام قطن"}},{"kind":"text","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"280 EGP","ar":"280 جنيه"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"small","color":"faint","text":{"en":"Care: wash at 40° before first use. Wash dark colours apart. Don't use softener. Dry on low heat. Don't iron the edges.","ar":"العناية: اغسلها على 40 درجة قبل أول استخدام. اغسل الألوان الغامقة وحدها. لا تستخدم المنعّم. جفّفها على حرارة منخفضة. لا تكوِ الأطراف."},"gap":"s"}]},"options":[{"id":"more","text":{"en":"Show the first tip in dark grey, with \"More care tips\" to open the rest","ar":"اعرض أول نصيحة بالرمادي الغامق، مع «نصائح عناية أخرى» لفتح الباقي"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"nasij","name":{"en":"Nasij","ar":"نسيج"},"color":"#B45309","icon":"house-line","domain":"nasij.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Bathroom","ar":"الحمّام"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"bed-sheet","size":"m"},{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Cotton bath towel","ar":"منشفة حمّام قطن"}},{"kind":"text","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"280 EGP","ar":"280 جنيه"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Care: wash at 40° before first use.","ar":"العناية: اغسلها على 40 درجة قبل أول استخدام."},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","style":"plain","text":{"en":"More care tips ▾","ar":"نصائح عناية أخرى ▾"},"gap":"xs"}]}},{"id":"smaller","text":{"en":"Keep them pale, and make them smaller","ar":"أبقِها باهتة، وصغّرها"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"nasij","name":{"en":"Nasij","ar":"نسيج"},"color":"#B45309","icon":"house-line","domain":"nasij.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Bathroom","ar":"الحمّام"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"bed-sheet","size":"m"},{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Cotton bath towel","ar":"منشفة حمّام قطن"}},{"kind":"text","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"280 EGP","ar":"280 جنيه"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"text","px":11,"color":"faint","text":{"en":"Care: wash at 40° before first use. Wash dark colours apart. Don't use softener. Dry on low heat. Don't iron the edges.","ar":"العناية: اغسلها على 40 درجة قبل أول استخدام. اغسل الألوان الغامقة وحدها. لا تستخدم المنعّم. جفّفها على حرارة منخفضة. لا تكوِ الأطراف."},"gap":"s"}]}},{"id":"dark","text":{"en":"Show all the tips in dark text, the same size as the price","ar":"اعرض كل النصائح بنص غامق، بنفس حجم السعر"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"nasij","name":{"en":"Nasij","ar":"نسيج"},"color":"#B45309","icon":"house-line","domain":"nasij.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Bathroom","ar":"الحمّام"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"bed-sheet","size":"m"},{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Cotton bath towel","ar":"منشفة حمّام قطن"}},{"kind":"text","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"280 EGP","ar":"280 جنيه"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"text","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"Care: wash at 40° before first use. Wash dark colours apart. Don't use softener. Dry on low heat. Don't iron the edges.","ar":"العناية: اغسلها على 40 درجة قبل أول استخدام. اغسل الألوان الغامقة وحدها. لا تستخدم المنعّم. جفّفها على حرارة منخفضة. لا تكوِ الأطراف."},"gap":"s"}]}}],"answer":["more"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-017","when":["smaller"],"feedback":{"en":"Small and pale is the hardest to read. Hide the extra tips behind a link instead of fading them.","ar":"الصغير الباهت هو الأصعب في القراءة. أخفِ النصائح الإضافية خلف رابط بدل أن تجعلها باهتة."}},{"id":"MC-P05-017","when":["dark"],"feedback":{"en":"Now the tips are readable, but the page is as crowded as before, and they compete with the price.","ar":"الآن صارت النصائح مقروءة، لكن الصفحة مزدحمة كما كانت، وتنافس النصائح السعر."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Less on the page, and what's there is easy to read.","ar":"صحيح. محتوى أقل في الصفحة، وما يظهر سهل القراءة."},"explain":{"en":"To cut clutter, show less, not paler. A \"More\" link keeps details one tap away.","ar":"لتقليل الزحام، اعرض نصًا أقل، لا نصًا أبهت. ورابط «المزيد» يُظهر التفاصيل بضغطة واحدة."}},{"id":"S05","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P05-U02-03","part":"retest","speaker":"karim","value":{"en":"Re-test. Guidelines for Visualizing Links (NN/g): when colour signals information, give colour-blind users a redundant cue. Line numbers on the map and in the steps work without colour.","ar":"إعادة اختبار. إرشادات لإظهار الروابط (NN/g): حين يحمل اللون معلومة، أعطِ من لا يميّزون الألوان علامة إضافية. وأرقام الخطوط على الخريطة وفي الخطوات تعمل بدون لون."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/guidelines-for-visualizing-links/","quote":"As always, when using color to signal information, you should provide redundant cues for color-blind users."},"scenario":{"en":"I'm working on a metro app. On the route screen, each metro line is shown only by its colour.","ar":"أعمل على تطبيق للمترو. في شاشة المسار، يظهر كل خط مترو بلونه فقط."},"prompt":{"en":"Tap each option to see the change. Which one lets every rider tell the lines apart?","ar":"اضغط على كل خيار لترى التغيير. أي خيار يجعل كل الركّاب يفرّقون بين الخطوط؟"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"app":{"color":"#1D4ED8","domain":"khatt.example","icon":"train-simple","name":{"ar":"خط مترو","en":"Khatt Metro"}},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Route","ar":"المسار"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"To Sadat","ar":"إلى السادات"}},{"kind":"row","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"text","color":"green","weight":"bold","text":"━━━━"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Ride 4 stops to Attaba","ar":"اركب 4 محطات إلى العتبة"}}]},{"kind":"row","gap":"xs","blocks":[{"kind":"text","color":"red","weight":"bold","text":"━━━━"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Change, ride 2 stops to Sadat","ar":"بدّل، واركب محطتين إلى السادات"}}]}]},"options":[{"id":"thicker","text":{"en":"Make the coloured lines thicker","ar":"اجعل الخطوط الملوّنة أعرض"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"color":"#1D4ED8","domain":"khatt.example","icon":"train-simple","name":{"ar":"خط مترو","en":"Khatt Metro"}},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Route","ar":"المسار"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"To Sadat","ar":"إلى السادات"}},{"kind":"row","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"text","color":"green","weight":"bold","px":26,"text":"━━━"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Ride 4 stops to Attaba","ar":"اركب 4 محطات إلى العتبة"}}]},{"kind":"row","gap":"xs","blocks":[{"kind":"text","color":"red","weight":"bold","px":26,"text":"━━━"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Change, ride 2 stops to Sadat","ar":"بدّل، واركب محطتين إلى السادات"}}]}]}},{"id":"key","text":{"en":"Add a key: \"Green: Line 2 · Red: Line 1\"","ar":"أضف مفتاحًا للألوان: «أخضر: الخط 2 · أحمر: الخط 1»"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"color":"#1D4ED8","domain":"khatt.example","icon":"train-simple","name":{"ar":"خط مترو","en":"Khatt Metro"}},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Route","ar":"المسار"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"To Sadat","ar":"إلى السادات"}},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Green: Line 2 · Red: Line 1","ar":"أخضر: الخط 2 · أحمر: الخط 1"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"row","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"text","color":"green","weight":"bold","text":"━━━━"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Ride 4 stops to Attaba","ar":"اركب 4 محطات إلى العتبة"}}]},{"kind":"row","gap":"xs","blocks":[{"kind":"text","color":"red","weight":"bold","text":"━━━━"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Change, ride 2 stops to Sadat","ar":"بدّل، واركب محطتين إلى السادات"}}]}]}},{"id":"number","text":{"en":"Write each line's number on it and in the step","ar":"اكتب رقم كل خط عليه وفي الخطوة"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"color":"#1D4ED8","domain":"khatt.example","icon":"train-simple","name":{"ar":"خط مترو","en":"Khatt Metro"}},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Route","ar":"المسار"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"To Sadat","ar":"إلى السادات"}},{"kind":"row","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"text","color":"green","weight":"bold","text":"━ 2 ━"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Line 2: ride 4 stops to Attaba","ar":"الخط 2: اركب 4 محطات إلى العتبة"}}]},{"kind":"row","gap":"xs","blocks":[{"kind":"text","color":"red","weight":"bold","text":"━ 1 ━"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Line 1: ride 2 stops to Sadat","ar":"الخط 1: اركب محطتين إلى السادات"}}]}]}}],"answer":["number"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-018","when":["thicker"],"feedback":{"en":"Thicker red and green are still red and green. Riders who confuse them still can't tell the lines apart.","ar":"الأحمر والأخضر الأعرض ما زالا أحمر وأخضر. ومن يخلط بينهما ما زال لا يفرّق بين الخطين."}},{"id":"MC-P05-019","when":["key"],"feedback":{"en":"The key still asks riders to match colours. A number on the line works without seeing colour.","ar":"مفتاح الألوان ما زال يطلب من الراكب أن يطابق الألوان. أما الرقم على الخط فيُفهم دون رؤية اللون."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. The numbers work for every rider.","ar":"صحيح. الأرقام يفهمها كل الركّاب."},"explain":{"en":"Keep the colours, and add a sign that isn't colour: here, the line number.","ar":"أبقِ الألوان، وأضف علامة ليست لونًا: هنا، رقم الخط."}},{"id":"S06","type":"compare","skill":"SK-P05-U02-03","part":"retest","speaker":"tarek","value":{"en":"Re-test. 5 Visual Treatments (NN/g): people with colour blindness or low vision may not tell apart elements that differ by colour alone. A \"🌶 Spicy\" label passes the grayscale test; red names don't.","ar":"إعادة اختبار. 5 معالجات بصرية (NN/g): من لا يميّزون الألوان أو نظرهم ضعيف قد لا يفرّقون بين عناصر تختلف في اللون فقط. وعلامة «🌶 حار» تنجح في اختبار الأبيض والأسود؛ والأسماء الحمراء لا تنجح."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/visual-treatments-accessibility/","quote":"Individuals who have color blindness or low visual acuity may not be able to distinguish between elements differentiated by color alone."},"scenario":{"en":"Our menu marks spicy dishes. We tried two designs and did the grayscale test on both.","ar":"قائمة طعامنا تميّز الأطباق الحارة. جرّبنا تصميمين، وأجرينا على الاثنين اختبار الأبيض والأسود (Grayscale test)."},"prompt":{"en":"In grayscale, which menu still shows which dish is spicy?","ar":"بالأبيض والأسود، أي قائمة ما زالت توضّح الطبق الحار؟"},"a":{"label":{"en":"A: Spicy dish names are written in red","ar":"A: أسماء الأطباق الحارة مكتوبة بالأحمر"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"lamma","name":{"en":"Lamma","ar":"لمّة"},"color":"#E03131","icon":"bowl-food","domain":"lamma.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Menu","ar":"القائمة"},"back":true},"gray":true,"blocks":[{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Grilled chicken · 180 EGP","ar":"فراخ مشوية · 180 جنيه"}},{"kind":"meta","color":"red","text":{"en":"Chicken shawarma · 150 EGP","ar":"شاورما فراخ · 150 جنيه"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Lentil soup · 60 EGP","ar":"شوربة عدس · 60 جنيه"},"gap":"s"}]}},"b":{"label":{"en":"B: Spicy dishes have a \"🌶 Spicy\" label","ar":"B: الأطباق الحارة عليها علامة «🌶 حار»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"lamma","name":{"en":"Lamma","ar":"لمّة"},"color":"#E03131","icon":"bowl-food","domain":"lamma.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Menu","ar":"القائمة"},"back":true},"gray":true,"blocks":[{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Grilled chicken · 180 EGP","ar":"فراخ مشوية · 180 جنيه"}},{"kind":"row","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Chicken shawarma · 150 EGP","ar":"شاورما فراخ · 150 جنيه"}},{"kind":"chip","tone":"bad","text":{"en":"🌶 Spicy","ar":"🌶 حار"}}]},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Lentil soup · 60 EGP","ar":"شوربة عدس · 60 جنيه"},"gap":"s"}]}},"answer":"b","misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-018","when":["a"],"feedback":{"en":"In grayscale, the red name looks like the others. B's label still says \"Spicy\".","ar":"بالأبيض والأسود، يبدو الاسم الأحمر مثل باقي الأسماء. أما علامة B فما زالت تقول «حار»."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. The word and the icon work without colour.","ar":"صحيح. الكلمة والأيقونة تُفهمان بدون لون."},"explain":{"en":"If grayscale hides the meaning, colour is doing the job alone. Add a word or an icon.","ar":"إذا اختفى المعنى بالأبيض والأسود، فاللون وحده يحمل المعنى. أضف كلمة أو أيقونة."}},{"id":"S07","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P05-U02-04","part":"retest","speaker":"rami","value":{"en":"Re-test. Text Over Images (NN/g): on light or faded backgrounds, the background needs to be darkened to give white text enough contrast.","ar":"إعادة اختبار. النص فوق الصور (NN/g): على الخلفيات الفاتحة أو الباهتة، يجب جعل الخلفية أغمق ليحصل النص الأبيض على تباين كافٍ."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/text-over-images/","quote":"In these situations, the background will need to be darkened to provide enough contrast."},"scenario":{"en":"Our app sells tickets for desert camping trips. The main card has a photo of the sand, with the date in white on top.","ar":"تطبيقنا يبيع تذاكر رحلات تخييم في الصحراء. والبطاقة الرئيسية فيها صورة للرمال، والتاريخ مكتوب فوقها بالأبيض."},"prompt":{"en":"Tap each option to see the change. Which one makes the date easy to read?","ar":"اضغط على كل خيار لترى التغيير. أي خيار يجعل التاريخ سهل القراءة؟"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"app":{"id":"tazkara","name":{"en":"Tazkara","ar":"تذكرة"},"color":"#C026D3","icon":"ticket","domain":"tazkara.example"},"appbar":{"logo":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","size":"l","tone":"photo-light","text":{"en":"Desert Nights · 14 March","ar":"ليالي الصحراء · 14 مارس"}}]},"options":[{"id":"bigger","text":{"en":"Make the date bigger","ar":"كبّر التاريخ"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"tazkara","name":{"en":"Tazkara","ar":"تذكرة"},"color":"#C026D3","icon":"ticket","domain":"tazkara.example"},"appbar":{"logo":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","size":"l","tone":"photo-light","px":28,"text":{"en":"Desert Nights · 14 March","ar":"ليالي الصحراء · 14 مارس"}}]}},{"id":"box","text":{"en":"Darken the photo behind the text","ar":"اجعل الصورة أغمق خلف النص"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"tazkara","name":{"en":"Tazkara","ar":"تذكرة"},"color":"#C026D3","icon":"ticket","domain":"tazkara.example"},"appbar":{"logo":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","size":"l","tone":"photo-box","text":{"en":"Desert Nights · 14 March","ar":"ليالي الصحراء · 14 مارس"}}]}},{"id":"busy","text":{"en":"Use a more detailed sand photo, so the card looks richer","ar":"استخدم صورة رمال بتفاصيل أكثر، لتبدو البطاقة أغنى"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"tazkara","name":{"en":"Tazkara","ar":"تذكرة"},"color":"#C026D3","icon":"ticket","domain":"tazkara.example"},"appbar":{"logo":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","size":"l","tone":"photo-busy","text":{"en":"Desert Nights · 14 March","ar":"ليالي الصحراء · 14 مارس"}}]}}],"answer":["box"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-020","when":["bigger","busy"],"feedback":{"en":"The date is still white on light sand. Darken the area behind it.","ar":"التاريخ ما زال أبيض على رمال فاتحة. اجعل المنطقة خلفه أغمق."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Dark behind white text makes it readable.","ar":"صحيح. الخلفية الغامقة خلف النص الأبيض تجعله مقروءًا."},"explain":{"en":"White text needs a dark area right behind it. Darken that part, and the photo still shows.","ar":"النص الأبيض يحتاج منطقة غامقة خلفه مباشرة. اجعل هذا الجزء أغمق، وتبقى الصورة ظاهرة."}},{"id":"S08","type":"choose","skill":"SK-P05-U02-04","part":"retest","speaker":"sara","value":{"en":"Re-test. Text Over Images (NN/g): a solution may work for one image but not for others. With user-uploaded covers, test the lightest and busiest ones.","ar":"إعادة اختبار. النص فوق الصور (NN/g): الحل قد ينجح مع صورة ولا ينجح مع غيرها. ومع صور الغلاف التي يرفعها المستخدمون، اختبر أفتحها وأكثرها ازدحامًا."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/text-over-images/","quote":"Often, a solution may work for one image but not for others."},"scenario":{"en":"In our community app, members upload their own cover photo. Their name appears on it in white, with a dark box behind it.","ar":"في تطبيقنا لمجتمع الأعضاء، يرفع كل عضو صورة الغلاف بنفسه. ويظهر اسمه فوقها بالأبيض، وخلفه مربع غامق."},"prompt":{"en":"Which test shows if the name is readable on every member's cover?","ar":"أي اختبار يكشف هل الاسم مقروء على غلاف كل عضو؟"},"mock":{"app":{"color":"#0891B2","domain":"halaqa.example","icon":"users-three","name":{"ar":"حلقة","en":"Halaqa"}},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Profile","ar":"الملف الشخصي"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","size":"m","tone":"photo-box","text":{"en":"Layla Hassan","ar":"ليلى حسن"}}]},"options":[{"id":"worst","text":{"en":"Try the box on the lightest and busiest covers members have uploaded","ar":"جرّب المربع على أفتح صور الغلاف وأكثرها ازدحامًا مما رفعه الأعضاء"}},{"id":"sample","text":{"en":"Try it on our own sample cover, a dark night sky","ar":"جرّبه على صورة الغلاف التجريبية عندنا، سماء ليلية غامقة"}},{"id":"popular","text":{"en":"Try it on the cover photo members choose most often","ar":"جرّبه على صورة الغلاف التي يختارها الأعضاء أكثر"}}],"answer":["worst"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-021","when":["sample","popular"],"feedback":{"en":"One photo can pass while another fails. Test the hardest covers: the lightest and busiest ones.","ar":"قد تنجح صورة وتفشل أخرى. اختبر أصعب صور الغلاف: أفتحها وأكثرها ازدحامًا."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. If it works on the hardest covers, it works on all of them.","ar":"صحيح. إذا نجح مع أصعب صور الغلاف، فسينجح معها كلها."},"explain":{"en":"When you can't control the photos, test the worst ones you can find.","ar":"حين لا تتحكّم في الصور، اختبر أسوأ صور تجدها."}},{"id":"S09","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P05-U02-05","part":"retest","speaker":"youssef","value":{"en":"Re-test. Dark Mode issues (NN/g): a saturated blue seems to blur slightly on a dark background. Use a lighter, softer blue for the selected tab.","ar":"إعادة اختبار. أخطاء الوضع الداكن (NN/g): الأزرق المشبّع يبدو مشوّشًا قليلًا على الخلفية الداكنة. استخدم أزرق أفتح وأهدأ للتبويب المختار."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/dark-mode-users-issues/","quote":"Notice how the saturated blue seems to blur slightly with the dark background."},"scenario":{"en":"In dark mode, the bottom bar of our shop app shows the selected tab in our strong brand blue.","ar":"في الوضع الداكن، يُظهر الشريط السفلي في تطبيق متجرنا التبويب المختار بأزرق هويتنا القوي."},"prompt":{"en":"Tap each option to see the change. Which one makes the selected tab easy to read?","ar":"اضغط على كل خيار لترى التغيير. أي خيار يجعل التبويب المختار سهل القراءة؟"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"theme":"dark","blocks":[{"kind":"group","tone":"night","blocks":[{"kind":"row","blocks":[{"kind":"meta","color":"neon","text":{"en":"● Home","ar":"● الرئيسية"}},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Orders","ar":"الطلبات"}},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Account","ar":"حسابي"}}]}]}]},"options":[{"id":"bold","text":{"en":"Keep the brand blue, and make the tab bold","ar":"أبقِ أزرق الهوية، واجعل التبويب عريضًا"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"theme":"dark","blocks":[{"kind":"group","tone":"night","blocks":[{"kind":"row","blocks":[{"kind":"meta","color":"neon","weight":"bold","text":{"en":"● Home","ar":"● الرئيسية"}},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Orders","ar":"الطلبات"}},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Account","ar":"حسابي"}}]}]}]}},{"id":"same","text":{"en":"Change nothing; the brand blue must match light mode","ar":"لا تغيّر شيئًا؛ أزرق الهوية يجب أن يطابق الوضع الفاتح"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"theme":"dark","blocks":[{"kind":"group","tone":"night","blocks":[{"kind":"row","blocks":[{"kind":"meta","color":"neon","text":{"en":"● Home","ar":"● الرئيسية"}},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Orders","ar":"الطلبات"}},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Account","ar":"حسابي"}}]}]}]}},{"id":"soft","text":{"en":"In dark mode, use a lighter, softer blue","ar":"في الوضع الداكن، استخدم أزرق أفتح وأهدأ"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"theme":"dark","blocks":[{"kind":"group","tone":"night","blocks":[{"kind":"row","blocks":[{"kind":"meta","color":"sky","text":{"en":"● Home","ar":"● الرئيسية"}},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Orders","ar":"الطلبات"}},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Account","ar":"حسابي"}}]}]}]}}],"answer":["soft"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-022","when":["bold","same"],"feedback":{"en":"A strong blue blurs on dark, bold or not. A lighter blue keeps the brand and reads clearly.","ar":"الأزرق القوي يتشوّش على الداكن، عريضًا كان أم لا. والأزرق الأفتح يحافظ على الهوية ويُقرأ بوضوح."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Softer colours read better on dark screens.","ar":"صحيح. الألوان الأهدأ تُقرأ أفضل على الشاشات الداكنة."},"explain":{"en":"Each brand colour needs a dark-mode version: same family, lighter and less strong.","ar":"كل لون في الهوية يحتاج نسخة للوضع الداكن: من نفس اللون، لكن أفتح وأهدأ."}},{"id":"S10","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P05-U02-05","part":"retest","speaker":"hana","value":{"en":"Re-test. Dark Mode issues (NN/g): a black element on a black background is a problem, because a shadow doesn't create the same layered effect. Make the dialog a lighter grey than the page.","ar":"إعادة اختبار. أخطاء الوضع الداكن (NN/g): العنصر الأسود على خلفية سوداء مشكلة، لأن الظل لا يصنع نفس الإحساس بالطبقات. اجعل النافذة رمادية أفتح من الصفحة."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/dark-mode-users-issues/","quote":"placing a black element on a black background can be problematic"},"scenario":{"en":"In dark mode, a pop-up asks members to rate their class. The pop-up and the page behind it are the same black.","ar":"في الوضع الداكن، تظهر نافذة منبثقة (Pop-up) تطلب من الأعضاء تقييم الحصة. والنافذة والصفحة خلفها بنفس السواد."},"prompt":{"en":"What makes the pop-up clearly sit on top of the page?","ar":"ما الذي يجعل النافذة تبدو بوضوح فوق الصفحة؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"theme":"dark","blocks":[{"kind":"group","tone":"night","blocks":[{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Yoga · Sunday 8:00","ar":"يوغا · الأحد 8:00"}},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Boxing · Monday 19:00","ar":"ملاكمة · الاثنين 19:00"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"How was Yoga?","ar":"كيف كانت حصة اليوغا؟"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"text","text":"★ ★ ★ ★ ☆","gap":"xs"}]}],"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"}},"options":[{"id":"shadow","text":{"en":"Add a black shadow under the pop-up","ar":"أضف ظلًا أسود تحت النافذة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"theme":"dark","blocks":[{"kind":"group","tone":"night","blocks":[{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Yoga · Sunday 8:00","ar":"يوغا · الأحد 8:00"}},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Boxing · Monday 19:00","ar":"ملاكمة · الاثنين 19:00"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"group","gap":"m","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"How was Yoga?","ar":"كيف كانت حصة اليوغا؟"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"text","text":"★ ★ ★ ★ ☆","gap":"xs"}],"tone":"night","note":{"en":"Black shadow underneath","ar":"ظل أسود تحتها"}}]}],"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}},{"id":"lighter","text":{"en":"Make the pop-up a lighter grey than the page","ar":"اجعل النافذة رمادية أفتح من الصفحة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"theme":"dark","blocks":[{"kind":"group","tone":"night","blocks":[{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Yoga · Sunday 8:00","ar":"يوغا · الأحد 8:00"}},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Boxing · Monday 19:00","ar":"ملاكمة · الاثنين 19:00"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"group","gap":"m","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"How was Yoga?","ar":"كيف كانت حصة اليوغا؟"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"text","text":"★ ★ ★ ★ ☆","gap":"xs"}],"tone":"raised"}]}],"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}},{"id":"line","text":{"en":"Add a thin grey line around the pop-up","ar":"أضف خطًا رماديًا رفيعًا حول النافذة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"theme":"dark","blocks":[{"kind":"group","tone":"night","blocks":[{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Yoga · Sunday 8:00","ar":"يوغا · الأحد 8:00"}},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Boxing · Monday 19:00","ar":"ملاكمة · الاثنين 19:00"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"group","gap":"m","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"How was Yoga?","ar":"كيف كانت حصة اليوغا؟"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"text","text":"★ ★ ★ ★ ☆","gap":"xs"}],"tone":"night","note":{"en":"Thin grey line around it","ar":"خط رمادي رفيع حولها"}}]}],"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}}],"answer":["lighter"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-023","when":["shadow","line"],"feedback":{"en":"A black shadow doesn't show on black, and thin lines nearly vanish. A lighter fill shows the pop-up is on top.","ar":"الظل الأسود لا يظهر على الأسود، والخطوط الرفيعة تكاد تختفي. أما اللون الأفتح فيُظهر أن النافذة فوق الصفحة."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. In dark mode, higher layers are lighter.","ar":"صحيح. في الوضع الداكن، الطبقات الأعلى أفتح."},"explain":{"en":"Shadows show layers on light screens. On dark screens, use lighter fills for things on top.","ar":"الظلال تُظهر الطبقات على الشاشات الفاتحة. وعلى الشاشات الداكنة، استخدم ألوانًا أفتح للعناصر التي في الأعلى."}}]}$uxg$::jsonb),
  ($uxg$P05-U03-B01$uxg$, $uxg$4badd810573f06620965fae9e0901a1b73dbb98d10d38cfd60f80e058928854e$uxg$, $uxg${"id":"P05-U03-B01","mode":"bank","title":{"en":"Re-tests: keyboard and focus","ar":"إعادة اختبار: لوحة المفاتيح والتركيز (Focus)"},"steps":[{"id":"S01","type":"choose","skill":"SK-P05-U03-01","part":"retest","speaker":"youssef","value":{"en":"Re-test. Keyboard-Only Navigation (NN/g): the Tab order should follow the same visual flow as the page layout. Reaching everything isn't enough if the order jumps around.","ar":"إعادة اختبار. التنقّل بلوحة المفاتيح فقط (NN/g): يجب أن يتبع ترتيب Tab نفس تسلسل الصفحة. والوصول إلى كل شيء لا يكفي إذا كان الترتيب يقفز."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/keyboard-accessibility/","quote":"The Tab order on the City of London website follows the same visual flow as the page layout."},"scenario":{"en":"My nephew tested my shop by keyboard. He saw the focus and reached every link. But Tab went from the product photo to the footer, then back up to the price.","ar":"اختبر ابن أخي متجري بلوحة المفاتيح. رأى مؤشّر التركيز (Focus) ووصل إلى كل الروابط. لكن زر Tab نقله من صورة المنتج إلى التذييل، ثم رجع به إلى السعر."},"prompt":{"en":"Did the product page pass the keyboard test?","ar":"هل نجحت صفحة المنتج في اختبار لوحة المفاتيح؟"},"options":[{"id":"pass","text":{"en":"Yes. Everything was visible and reachable","ar":"نعم. كل شيء كان ظاهرًا ويمكن الوصول إليه"}},{"id":"order","text":{"en":"No. Tab must follow the page, top to bottom","ar":"لا. يجب أن ينتقل Tab بترتيب الصفحة، من أعلى لأسفل"}},{"id":"focus","text":{"en":"No. The focus must be blue","ar":"لا. يجب أن يكون التركيز أزرق"}}],"answer":["order"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-025","when":["pass","focus"],"feedback":{"en":"The test has three checks. The order failed: jumping to the footer and back confuses anyone who can see the page.","ar":"للاختبار ثلاثة فحوصات. والترتيب فشل: القفز إلى التذييل ثم الرجوع يُربك كل من يرى الصفحة."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Two checks passed, but the order failed.","ar":"صحيح. نجح فحصان، لكن الترتيب فشل."},"explain":{"en":"See where you are, reach everything, move in page order. A page passes only when all three work.","ar":"أن ترى أين أنت، وأن تصل إلى كل شيء، وأن تتحرّك بترتيب الصفحة. ولا تنجح الصفحة إلا إذا تحقّقت الثلاثة."}},{"id":"S02","type":"choose","skill":"SK-P05-U03-01","part":"retest","speaker":"nour","value":{"en":"Re-test. Keyboard-Only Navigation (NN/g): having no visible focus is like using a mouse without seeing the cursor. That's the 'see where you are' check failing.","ar":"إعادة اختبار. التنقّل بلوحة المفاتيح فقط (NN/g): غياب التركيز الظاهر مثل استخدام الماوس دون رؤية المؤشر. وهذا فشل في فحص «ترى أين أنت»."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/keyboard-accessibility/","quote":"Imagine someone using their mouse to browse the internet without seeing the cursor on the screen."},"scenario":{"en":"I tested our new appointment calendar with only the keyboard. Tab reached every date, in order. But I couldn't tell which date I was on, so I pressed Enter and booked the wrong day.","ar":"اختبرت تقويم المواعيد الجديد بلوحة المفاتيح فقط. وصل Tab إلى كل التواريخ، بالترتيب. لكني لم أعرف على أي تاريخ أقف، فضغطت Enter وحجزت اليوم الخطأ."},"prompt":{"en":"What should we fix?","ar":"ماذا نُصلح حتى لا يحجز مستخدم لوحة المفاتيح اليوم الخطأ؟"},"options":[{"id":"confirm","text":{"en":"Add a \"Are you sure?\" message after every booking","ar":"نضيف رسالة «هل أنت متأكد؟» بعد كل حجز"}},{"id":"order","text":{"en":"Change the order in which Tab moves through the dates","ar":"نغيّر الترتيب الذي يتنقّل به Tab بين التواريخ"}},{"id":"focus","text":{"en":"Show a clear focus outline on the date the keyboard is on","ar":"نُظهر إطار تركيز واضحًا على التاريخ الذي تقف عليه لوحة المفاتيح"}}],"answer":["focus"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-024","when":["confirm","order"],"feedback":{"en":"The order was fine. What failed was seeing where you are. Without focus, every Enter is a guess.","ar":"الترتيب كان سليمًا. ما فشل هو أن ترى أين أنت. وبدون تركيز ظاهر، كل ضغطة Enter تخمين."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. People must see where they are before they press Enter.","ar":"صحيح. يجب أن يرى الناس أين هم قبل أن يضغطوا Enter."},"explain":{"en":"Match the fix to the check that failed. Here, it was \"see where you are\".","ar":"اختر الحل حسب الفحص الذي فشل. وهنا كان «ترى أين أنت»."}},{"id":"S03","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P05-U03-02","part":"retest","speaker":"mona","value":{"en":"Re-test. 5 Visual Treatments (NN/g): use a visually obvious stroke, such as a thick line around the element in focus. A thin, light dotted line is easy to miss.","ar":"إعادة اختبار. 5 معالجات بصرية (NN/g): استخدم خطًا واضحًا، مثل خط عريض حول العنصر الذي عليه التركيز. والخط المنقّط الرفيع الفاتح سهل أن يفوت العين."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/visual-treatments-accessibility/","quote":"I recommend using a visually obvious stroke (e.g., a thick-weight line around the in-focus element) to clearly identify a focus state"},"scenario":{"en":"Our design system's focus style is a thin, light grey dotted line. Here, \"Track order\" has focus.","ar":"شكل التركيز (Focus style) في نظام التصميم (Design system) عندنا خط منقّط رمادي فاتح ورفيع. وهنا التركيز على «تتبّع الطلب»."},"prompt":{"en":"Tap each option to see the change. Which one makes focus easy to spot?","ar":"اضغط على كل خيار لترى التغيير. أي خيار يجعل التركيز سهل الملاحظة؟"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"dar.example/orders/4821","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Phones","ar":"هواتف"},{"en":"Shoes","ar":"أحذية"},{"en":"Offers","ar":"العروض"}],"actions":[{"icon":"shopping-cart"},{"icon":"user"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Order #4821 · On the way","ar":"الطلب 4821 · في الطريق"}},{"kind":"listitem","art":"earbuds","text":{"en":"Wireless earbuds","ar":"سماعات لاسلكية"},"value":{"en":"1,450 EGP","ar":"1,450 جنيه"}},{"kind":"button","ring":"faint","style":"plain","text":{"en":"Track order","ar":"تتبّع الطلب"}},{"kind":"button","style":"plain","text":{"en":"Contact the shop","ar":"تواصل مع المتجر"},"gap":"xs"}]},"options":[{"id":"thick","text":{"en":"A thick outline in a strong colour","ar":"إطار عريض بلون قوي"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"dar.example/orders/4821","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Phones","ar":"هواتف"},{"en":"Shoes","ar":"أحذية"},{"en":"Offers","ar":"العروض"}],"actions":[{"icon":"shopping-cart"},{"icon":"user"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Order #4821 · On the way","ar":"الطلب 4821 · في الطريق"}},{"kind":"listitem","art":"earbuds","text":{"en":"Wireless earbuds","ar":"سماعات لاسلكية"},"value":{"en":"1,450 EGP","ar":"1,450 جنيه"}},{"kind":"button","ring":"brand","style":"plain","text":{"en":"Track order","ar":"تتبّع الطلب"}},{"kind":"button","style":"plain","text":{"en":"Contact the shop","ar":"تواصل مع المتجر"},"gap":"xs"}]}},{"id":"keep","text":{"en":"Keep the dotted line; it's subtle and elegant","ar":"أبقِ الخط المنقّط؛ فهو هادئ وأنيق"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"dar.example/orders/4821","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Phones","ar":"هواتف"},{"en":"Shoes","ar":"أحذية"},{"en":"Offers","ar":"العروض"}],"actions":[{"icon":"shopping-cart"},{"icon":"user"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Order #4821 · On the way","ar":"الطلب 4821 · في الطريق"}},{"kind":"listitem","art":"earbuds","text":{"en":"Wireless earbuds","ar":"سماعات لاسلكية"},"value":{"en":"1,450 EGP","ar":"1,450 جنيه"}},{"kind":"button","ring":"faint","style":"plain","text":{"en":"Track order","ar":"تتبّع الطلب"}},{"kind":"button","style":"plain","text":{"en":"Contact the shop","ar":"تواصل مع المتجر"},"gap":"xs"}]}},{"id":"tint","text":{"en":"Replace it with a light purple background","ar":"استبدله بخلفية بنفسجية فاتحة"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"dar.example/orders/4821","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Phones","ar":"هواتف"},{"en":"Shoes","ar":"أحذية"},{"en":"Offers","ar":"العروض"}],"actions":[{"icon":"shopping-cart"},{"icon":"user"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Order #4821 · On the way","ar":"الطلب 4821 · في الطريق"}},{"kind":"listitem","art":"earbuds","text":{"en":"Wireless earbuds","ar":"سماعات لاسلكية"},"value":{"en":"1,450 EGP","ar":"1,450 جنيه"}},{"kind":"button","ring":"tint","style":"plain","text":{"en":"Track order","ar":"تتبّع الطلب"}},{"kind":"button","style":"plain","text":{"en":"Contact the shop","ar":"تواصل مع المتجر"},"gap":"xs"}]}}],"answer":["thick"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-027","when":["keep"],"feedback":{"en":"A focus nobody can spot is almost the same as no focus. Make it thick and strong.","ar":"التركيز الذي لا يلاحظه أحد يكاد يساوي عدم وجود تركيز. اجعله عريضًا وقويًا."}},{"id":"MC-P05-029","when":["tint"],"feedback":{"en":"A light background is only a colour change, and easy to miss. Use a thick outline.","ar":"الخلفية الفاتحة مجرد تغيير في اللون، وقد لا تلاحظها العين. استخدم إطارًا عريضًا."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. A thick outline is easy to find.","ar":"صحيح. الإطار العريض سهل الإيجاد."},"explain":{"en":"Focus is how keyboard users find themselves on the page. It should be one of the easiest things to see.","ar":"بالتركيز يعرف مستخدم لوحة المفاتيح مكانه في الصفحة. لذلك يجب أن يكون من أسهل الأشياء رؤيةً."}},{"id":"S04","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P05-U03-02","part":"retest","speaker":"karim","value":{"en":"Re-test. 5 Visual Treatments (NN/g): focus states can be customised to fit your brand. In dark mode, customise the colour too: a white outline instead of dark purple.","ar":"إعادة اختبار. 5 معالجات بصرية (NN/g): يمكن تغيير شكل التركيز ليناسب هويتك. وفي الوضع الداكن، غيّر اللون أيضًا: إطار أبيض بدل البنفسجي الغامق."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/visual-treatments-accessibility/","quote":"Focus states are easily customizable to fit your visual-design needs or brand standards."},"scenario":{"en":"Our banking app now has dark mode. The focus outline is still our purple. Here, \"Transfer\" has focus.","ar":"صار في تطبيق البنك عندنا وضع داكن. وما زال إطار التركيز بنفسجيًا كما هو. وهنا التركيز على «تحويل»."},"prompt":{"en":"Tap each option to see the change. Which one makes focus clear in dark mode?","ar":"اضغط على كل خيار لترى التغيير. أي خيار يجعل التركيز واضحًا في الوضع الداكن؟"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"app":{"id":"rasid","name":{"en":"Rasid","ar":"رصيد"},"color":"#1C3D6E","icon":"bank","domain":"rasid.example"},"theme":"dark","appbar":{"title":{"en":"My accounts","ar":"حساباتي"},"actions":[{"icon":"bell","aria":{"en":"Alerts","ar":"التنبيهات"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"group","tone":"night","blocks":[{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Balance: 12,400 EGP","ar":"الرصيد: 12,400 جنيه"}},{"kind":"row","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"button","style":"plain","ring":"brand","text":{"en":"Transfer","ar":"تحويل"}},{"kind":"button","style":"plain","text":{"en":"Pay bills","ar":"دفع الفواتير"}}]}]}]},"options":[{"id":"thicker","text":{"en":"Keep the purple, but make the outline thicker","ar":"أبقِ البنفسجي، لكن اجعل الإطار أعرض"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"rasid","name":{"en":"Rasid","ar":"رصيد"},"color":"#1C3D6E","icon":"bank","domain":"rasid.example"},"theme":"dark","appbar":{"title":{"en":"My accounts","ar":"حساباتي"},"actions":[{"icon":"bell","aria":{"en":"Alerts","ar":"التنبيهات"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"group","tone":"night","blocks":[{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Balance: 12,400 EGP","ar":"الرصيد: 12,400 جنيه"}},{"kind":"row","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"button","style":"plain","ring":"flush","text":{"en":"Transfer","ar":"تحويل"}},{"kind":"button","style":"plain","text":{"en":"Pay bills","ar":"دفع الفواتير"}}]}]}]}},{"id":"same","text":{"en":"Keep it; the focus should look the same in both modes","ar":"أبقِه؛ يجب أن يبدو التركيز متطابقًا في الوضعين"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"rasid","name":{"en":"Rasid","ar":"رصيد"},"color":"#1C3D6E","icon":"bank","domain":"rasid.example"},"theme":"dark","appbar":{"title":{"en":"My accounts","ar":"حساباتي"},"actions":[{"icon":"bell","aria":{"en":"Alerts","ar":"التنبيهات"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"group","tone":"night","blocks":[{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Balance: 12,400 EGP","ar":"الرصيد: 12,400 جنيه"}},{"kind":"row","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"button","style":"plain","ring":"brand","text":{"en":"Transfer","ar":"تحويل"}},{"kind":"button","style":"plain","text":{"en":"Pay bills","ar":"دفع الفواتير"}}]}]}]}},{"id":"white","text":{"en":"Use a white outline in dark mode","ar":"استخدم إطارًا أبيض في الوضع الداكن"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"rasid","name":{"en":"Rasid","ar":"رصيد"},"color":"#1C3D6E","icon":"bank","domain":"rasid.example"},"theme":"dark","appbar":{"title":{"en":"My accounts","ar":"حساباتي"},"actions":[{"icon":"bell","aria":{"en":"Alerts","ar":"التنبيهات"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"group","tone":"night","blocks":[{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Balance: 12,400 EGP","ar":"الرصيد: 12,400 جنيه"}},{"kind":"row","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"button","style":"plain","ring":"white","text":{"en":"Transfer","ar":"تحويل"}},{"kind":"button","style":"plain","text":{"en":"Pay bills","ar":"دفع الفواتير"}}]}]}]}}],"answer":["white"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-028","when":["thicker","same"],"feedback":{"en":"Purple is hard to see on a dark screen, thick or not. Keep the shape, and switch the colour to white.","ar":"البنفسجي صعب الرؤية على الشاشة الداكنة، عريضًا كان أم لا. أبقِ الشكل، وغيّر اللون إلى الأبيض."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. White stands out on dark.","ar":"صحيح. الأبيض يبرز على الداكن."},"explain":{"en":"A focus style is part of the theme. Each theme needs a focus colour that shows on its backgrounds.","ar":"شكل التركيز جزء من المظهر (Theme). وكل مظهر يحتاج لون تركيز يظهر على خلفياته."}},{"id":"S05","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P05-U03-03","part":"retest","speaker":"sara","value":{"en":"Re-test. Keyboard-Only Navigation (NN/g): a good skip link name is descriptive and concise, and the link appears only when people tab.","ar":"إعادة اختبار. التنقّل بلوحة المفاتيح فقط (NN/g): اسم رابط التخطّي الجيد واضح ومختصر، والرابط يظهر فقط حين يضغط الناس Tab."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/keyboard-accessibility/","quote":"The link name is descriptive and concise."},"scenario":{"en":"I'm adding a skip link to a university website with a long menu. The developer asked me what it should say.","ar":"أضيف رابط تخطٍّ (Skip link) لموقع جامعة فيه قائمة طويلة. وسألني المطوّر: ماذا نكتب عليه؟"},"prompt":{"en":"Which text should the skip link have?","ar":"أي نص يجب أن يكون على رابط التخطّي؟"},"mock":{"app":{"name":{"en":"Wadi University","ar":"جامعة الوادي"},"color":"#1D4ED8","icon":"graduation-cap","domain":"wadi-uni.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"wadi-uni.example/admissions","navbar":{"actions":[{"icon":"magnifying-glass"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"link","ring":"brand","text":{"en":"?","ar":"؟"}},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"About · Faculties · Admissions · Fees · Library · News · … (60 links)","ar":"عن الجامعة · الكليات · القبول · المصروفات · المكتبة · الأخبار · … (60 رابطًا)"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Admissions 2027","ar":"القبول 2027"},"gap":"m"}],"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"}},"options":[{"id":"click","text":{"en":"\"Click here\"","ar":"«اضغط هنا»"},"mock":{"app":{"name":{"en":"Wadi University","ar":"جامعة الوادي"},"color":"#1D4ED8","icon":"graduation-cap","domain":"wadi-uni.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"wadi-uni.example/admissions","navbar":{"actions":[{"icon":"magnifying-glass"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"link","ring":"brand","text":{"en":"Click here","ar":"اضغط هنا"}},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"About · Faculties · Admissions · Fees · Library · News · … (60 links)","ar":"عن الجامعة · الكليات · القبول · المصروفات · المكتبة · الأخبار · … (60 رابطًا)"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Admissions 2027","ar":"القبول 2027"},"gap":"m"}],"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}},{"id":"skip","text":{"en":"\"Skip\"","ar":"«تخطَّ»"},"mock":{"app":{"name":{"en":"Wadi University","ar":"جامعة الوادي"},"color":"#1D4ED8","icon":"graduation-cap","domain":"wadi-uni.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"wadi-uni.example/admissions","navbar":{"actions":[{"icon":"magnifying-glass"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"link","ring":"brand","text":{"en":"Skip","ar":"تخطَّ"}},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"About · Faculties · Admissions · Fees · Library · News · … (60 links)","ar":"عن الجامعة · الكليات · القبول · المصروفات · المكتبة · الأخبار · … (60 رابطًا)"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Admissions 2027","ar":"القبول 2027"},"gap":"m"}],"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}},{"id":"main","text":{"en":"\"Skip to main content\"","ar":"«انتقل إلى المحتوى الرئيسي»"},"mock":{"app":{"name":{"en":"Wadi University","ar":"جامعة الوادي"},"color":"#1D4ED8","icon":"graduation-cap","domain":"wadi-uni.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"wadi-uni.example/admissions","navbar":{"actions":[{"icon":"magnifying-glass"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"link","ring":"brand","text":{"en":"Skip to main content","ar":"انتقل إلى المحتوى الرئيسي"}},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"About · Faculties · Admissions · Fees · Library · News · … (60 links)","ar":"عن الجامعة · الكليات · القبول · المصروفات · المكتبة · الأخبار · … (60 رابطًا)"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Admissions 2027","ar":"القبول 2027"},"gap":"m"}],"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}}],"answer":["main"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-030","when":["click","skip"],"feedback":{"en":"People need to know where the link goes. \"Skip to main content\" says it in four words.","ar":"يحتاج الناس أن يعرفوا إلى أين يذهب الرابط. و«انتقل إلى المحتوى الرئيسي» تقولها في كلمات قليلة."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Short, and it says where it goes.","ar":"صحيح. قصير، ويقول إلى أين يذهب."},"explain":{"en":"A skip link is a link like any other: its words must say where it takes you.","ar":"رابط التخطّي رابط مثل أي رابط: كلماته يجب أن تقول إلى أين يأخذك."}},{"id":"S06","type":"choose","skill":"SK-P05-U03-03","part":"retest","speaker":"tarek","value":{"en":"Re-test. Keyboard-Only Navigation (NN/g): Enter on the skip link should take users to the page heading so they continue tabbing in the content; this step is often overlooked.","ar":"إعادة اختبار. التنقّل بلوحة المفاتيح فقط (NN/g): يجب أن يأخذ Enter على رابط التخطّي المستخدم إلى عنوان الصفحة ليُكمل داخل المحتوى؛ وهذه الخطوة كثيرًا ما تُنسى."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/keyboard-accessibility/","quote":"allowing them to continue tabbing through the links in the body content on the page"},"scenario":{"en":"On our recipe site, \"Skip to recipe\" scrolls down to the recipe. But the next Tab goes to the logo at the top.","ar":"في موقع الوصفات عندنا، رابط «انتقل إلى الوصفة» ينزل بالصفحة إلى الوصفة. لكن ضغطة Tab التالية تذهب إلى الشعار في الأعلى."},"prompt":{"en":"What should the developer change?","ar":"ماذا يغيّر المطوّر حتى تذهب ضغطة Tab التالية إلى الوصفة؟"},"options":[{"id":"focus","text":{"en":"Move the keyboard focus to the recipe's title, not just the page","ar":"ينقل تركيز لوحة المفاتيح إلى عنوان الوصفة، لا الصفحة فقط"}},{"id":"logo","text":{"en":"Remove the link from the logo","ar":"يحذف الرابط من الشعار"}},{"id":"rename","text":{"en":"Rename the link to \"Scroll to recipe\"","ar":"يغيّر اسم الرابط إلى «انزل إلى الوصفة»"}}],"answer":["focus"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-031","when":["logo","rename"],"feedback":{"en":"The page moved, but the keyboard stayed at the top. Focus has to land on the recipe's title.","ar":"الصفحة نزلت، لكن لوحة المفاتيح بقيت في الأعلى. يجب أن يصل التركيز إلى عنوان الوصفة."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Move the focus, not just the view.","ar":"صحيح. انقل التركيز، لا الشاشة فقط."},"explain":{"en":"Test a skip link with one more Tab after it. If that Tab goes into the content, it works.","ar":"اختبر رابط التخطّي بضغطة Tab إضافية بعده. إذا ذهبت إلى المحتوى، فهو يعمل."}},{"id":"S07","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P05-U03-04","part":"retest","speaker":"rami","value":{"en":"Re-test. Keyboard-Only Navigation (NN/g): if the down arrow selects the first item, keyboard users can't browse; arrows should move between options and Enter should select.","ar":"إعادة اختبار. التنقّل بلوحة المفاتيح فقط (NN/g): إذا اختار سهم ↓ أول خيار مباشرة، لا يستطيع مستخدم لوحة المفاتيح التصفّح؛ يجب أن تتنقّل الأسهم بين الخيارات، وأن يختار Enter."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/keyboard-accessibility/","quote":"This happens if the arrow-down button selects the first item from the list, instead of moving down through the list options."},"scenario":{"en":"On a shoe shop's site, the \"Size\" filter is a dropdown. Each press of ↓ picks the next size and reloads the results.","ar":"في موقع متجر أحذية، فلتر «المقاس» قائمة منسدلة (Dropdown). وكل ضغطة على ↓ تختار المقاس التالي وتُعيد تحميل النتائج."},"prompt":{"en":"Tap each option to see the change. Which one lets a keyboard user reach size 43 without five reloads?","ar":"اضغط على كل خيار لترى التغيير. أي خيار يجعل مستخدم لوحة المفاتيح يصل إلى مقاس 43 دون خمس إعادات تحميل؟"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"Now (after one ↓)","ar":"الآن (بعد ضغطة ↓ واحدة)"},"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"dar.example/shoes","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Phones","ar":"هواتف"},{"en":"Shoes","ar":"أحذية"},{"en":"Offers","ar":"العروض"}],"active":1,"actions":[{"icon":"shopping-cart"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","art":"sneakers","text":{"en":"Running shoes","ar":"حذاء جري"},"sub":{"en":"24 results","ar":"24 نتيجة"}},{"kind":"select","label":{"en":"Size","ar":"المقاس"},"filled":true,"text":"39"},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Loading results for size 39…","ar":"جارٍ تحميل نتائج مقاس 39…"},"gap":"xs"}]},"options":[{"id":"faster","text":{"en":"Make the results load faster","ar":"اجعل النتائج تُحمَّل أسرع"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change (after one ↓)","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير (بعد ضغطة ↓ واحدة)"},"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"dar.example/shoes","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Phones","ar":"هواتف"},{"en":"Shoes","ar":"أحذية"},{"en":"Offers","ar":"العروض"}],"active":1,"actions":[{"icon":"shopping-cart"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","art":"sneakers","text":{"en":"Running shoes","ar":"حذاء جري"},"sub":{"en":"24 results","ar":"24 نتيجة"}},{"kind":"select","label":{"en":"Size","ar":"المقاس"},"filled":true,"text":"39"},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Showing size 39","ar":"يعرض مقاس 39"},"gap":"xs"}]}},{"id":"browse","text":{"en":"Let ↓ move through the open list, and load results only on Enter","ar":"اجعل ↓ يتنقّل في القائمة المفتوحة، وحمّل النتائج فقط مع Enter"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change (after five ↓)","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير (بعد خمس ضغطات ↓)"},"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"dar.example/shoes","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Phones","ar":"هواتف"},{"en":"Shoes","ar":"أحذية"},{"en":"Offers","ar":"العروض"}],"active":1,"actions":[{"icon":"shopping-cart"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","art":"sneakers","text":{"en":"Running shoes","ar":"حذاء جري"},"sub":{"en":"24 results","ar":"24 نتيجة"}},{"kind":"select","label":{"en":"Size","ar":"المقاس"},"filled":true,"text":{"en":"Any","ar":"أي مقاس"}},{"kind":"row","gap":"xs","blocks":[{"kind":"meta","text":"39"},{"kind":"meta","text":"40"},{"kind":"meta","text":"41"},{"kind":"meta","text":"42"},{"kind":"meta","ring":"brand","text":"43"}]},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Press Enter to show size 43","ar":"اضغط Enter لعرض مقاس 43"},"gap":"xs"}]}},{"id":"buttons","text":{"en":"Replace the dropdown with a \"Next size\" button","ar":"استبدل القائمة بزر «المقاس التالي»"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"},"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"dar.example/shoes","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Phones","ar":"هواتف"},{"en":"Shoes","ar":"أحذية"},{"en":"Offers","ar":"العروض"}],"active":1,"actions":[{"icon":"shopping-cart"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","art":"sneakers","text":{"en":"Running shoes","ar":"حذاء جري"},"sub":{"en":"24 results","ar":"24 نتيجة"}},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"Size: 39","ar":"المقاس: 39"}},{"kind":"button","style":"plain","text":{"en":"Next size ›","ar":"المقاس التالي ‹"},"gap":"xs"}]}}],"answer":["browse"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-033","when":["faster","buttons"],"feedback":{"en":"Each step still picks a size and reloads. Moving through the list and choosing must be separate.","ar":"كل خطوة ما زالت تختار مقاسًا وتُعيد التحميل. يجب أن يكون التنقّل في القائمة منفصلًا عن الاختيار."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Browse with arrows, choose with Enter.","ar":"صحيح. تصفّح بالأسهم، واختر بـ Enter."},"explain":{"en":"Moving is not choosing. Keys should let people look before they pick, like a mouse does.","ar":"التنقّل ليس اختيارًا. ويجب أن تسمح المفاتيح للناس بالنظر قبل الاختيار، كما يفعل الماوس."}},{"id":"S08","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P05-U03-04","part":"retest","speaker":"hana","value":{"en":"Re-test. Drop-Down Menus (NN/g): in a dropdown box, users should be able to type a letter and jump to options starting with it. With 40 branches, that saves dozens of presses.","ar":"إعادة اختبار. القوائم المنسدلة (NN/g): في القائمة المنسدلة، يجب أن يستطيع المستخدم كتابة حرف ليقفز إلى الخيارات التي تبدأ به. ومع 40 فرعًا، هذا يوفّر عشرات الضغطات."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/drop-down-menus/","quote":"users should be able to type a letter and quickly navigate to options starting with that letter"},"scenario":{"en":"Members pick their gym branch from a dropdown of 40 branches, A to Z. Some members use only the keyboard.","ar":"يختار الأعضاء فرع النادي من قائمة منسدلة فيها 40 فرعًا، مرتّبة أبجديًا. وبعض الأعضاء يستخدمون لوحة المفاتيح فقط."},"prompt":{"en":"What should the dropdown do when a member types \"S\"?","ar":"ماذا يجب أن تفعل القائمة حين يكتب العضو «ش»؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"nashat.example/join","navbar":{"actions":[{"icon":"user"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Join Nashat","ar":"انضم إلى نشاط"}},{"kind":"select","label":{"en":"Branch","ar":"الفرع"},"filled":true,"text":{"en":"Choose a branch","ar":"اختر فرعًا"}}],"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"}},"options":[{"id":"nothing","text":{"en":"Nothing; members use the arrows","ar":"لا شيء؛ الأعضاء يستخدمون الأسهم"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"nashat.example/join","navbar":{"actions":[{"icon":"user"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Join Nashat","ar":"انضم إلى نشاط"}},{"kind":"select","label":{"en":"Branch","ar":"الفرع"},"filled":true,"text":{"en":"Choose a branch","ar":"اختر فرعًا"},"focus":true,"note":{"en":"Typed \"S\": nothing happens","ar":"كتب «ش»: لا يحدث شيء"}}],"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}},{"id":"jump","text":{"en":"Jump to the first branch starting with S","ar":"تنتقل مباشرة إلى أول فرع يبدأ بالشين"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"nashat.example/join","navbar":{"actions":[{"icon":"user"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Join Nashat","ar":"انضم إلى نشاط"}},{"kind":"select","label":{"en":"Branch","ar":"الفرع"},"filled":true,"text":{"en":"Sheikh Zayed","ar":"الشيخ زايد"},"focus":true,"note":{"en":"Typed \"S\": jumped to Sheikh Zayed","ar":"كتب «ش»: انتقلت إلى الشيخ زايد"}}],"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}},{"id":"close","text":{"en":"Close the list, so the member can start again","ar":"تُغلق القائمة، ليبدأ العضو من جديد"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"nashat.example/join","navbar":{"actions":[{"icon":"user"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Join Nashat","ar":"انضم إلى نشاط"}},{"kind":"select","label":{"en":"Branch","ar":"الفرع"},"filled":true,"text":{"en":"Choose a branch","ar":"اختر فرعًا"},"focus":true,"note":{"en":"Typed \"S\": the list closed","ar":"كتب «ش»: أُغلقت القائمة"}}],"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}}],"answer":["jump"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-034","when":["nothing","close"],"feedback":{"en":"With 40 branches, arrows alone mean many presses. Typing a letter should jump straight to that part of the list.","ar":"مع 40 فرعًا، الأسهم وحدها تعني ضغطات كثيرة. ويجب أن تنقلك كتابة الحرف مباشرة إلى ذلك الجزء من القائمة."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. One letter, and they're close.","ar":"صحيح. بحرف واحد، يصلون قريبًا من فرعهم."},"explain":{"en":"Long lists should respond to typing. It's faster for everyone, and much easier for hands that tire.","ar":"القوائم الطويلة يجب أن تستجيب للكتابة. هذا أسرع للجميع، وأسهل بكثير لمن تتعب يداه."}},{"id":"S09","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P05-U03-05","part":"retest","speaker":"youssef","value":{"en":"Re-test. Keyboard-Only Navigation (NN/g): all interactive elements, including buttons and widgets, must be reachable by tabbing. A heart that appears only on hover isn't.","ar":"إعادة اختبار. التنقّل بلوحة المفاتيح فقط (NN/g): يجب أن يصل Tab إلى كل العناصر التفاعلية، ومنها الأزرار والأدوات. والقلب الذي يظهر بالـ Hover فقط لا يصل إليه."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/keyboard-accessibility/","quote":"This means that form elements, drop-down menus, buttons, dialog boxes, and other widgets all have to be accessible by tabbing through the interface."},"scenario":{"en":"In my shop, a ♡ \"Save\" icon appears on a product only when the mouse is over it.","ar":"في متجري، تظهر أيقونة ♡ «حفظ» على المنتج فقط حين يكون الماوس فوقه."},"prompt":{"en":"Tap each option to see the change. Which one lets keyboard users save products?","ar":"اضغط على كل خيار لترى التغيير. أي خيار يجعل مستخدمي لوحة المفاتيح يحفظون المنتجات؟"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"Now (no mouse over it)","ar":"الآن (بدون ماوس فوقه)"},"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"dar.example/phones/cases","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Phones","ar":"هواتف"},{"en":"Shoes","ar":"أحذية"},{"en":"Offers","ar":"العروض"}],"active":0,"actions":[{"icon":"shopping-cart"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"phone","text":{"en":"Phone case · 150 EGP","ar":"جراب هاتف · 150 جنيه"}}]},"options":[{"id":"show","text":{"en":"Show the ♡ button all the time, and let Tab reach it","ar":"أظهر زر ♡ طوال الوقت، واجعل Tab يصل إليه"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change (Tab on ♡)","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير (Tab على ♡)"},"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"dar.example/phones/cases","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Phones","ar":"هواتف"},{"en":"Shoes","ar":"أحذية"},{"en":"Offers","ar":"العروض"}],"active":0,"actions":[{"icon":"shopping-cart"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"phone","text":{"en":"Phone case · 150 EGP","ar":"جراب هاتف · 150 جنيه"}},{"kind":"button","style":"plain","ring":"brand","text":{"en":"♡ Save","ar":"♡ حفظ"},"gap":"xs"}]}},{"id":"big","text":{"en":"Make the ♡ bigger when it appears","ar":"كبّر ♡ حين يظهر"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change (no mouse over it)","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير (بدون ماوس فوقه)"},"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"dar.example/phones/cases","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Phones","ar":"هواتف"},{"en":"Shoes","ar":"أحذية"},{"en":"Offers","ar":"العروض"}],"active":0,"actions":[{"icon":"shopping-cart"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"phone","text":{"en":"Phone case · 150 EGP","ar":"جراب هاتف · 150 جنيه"}}]}},{"id":"rightclick","text":{"en":"Let people right-click a product to save it","ar":"اجعل الناس يضغطون بالزر الأيمن على المنتج لحفظه"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After this change (no mouse over it)","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير (بدون ماوس فوقه)"},"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"dar.example/phones/cases","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Phones","ar":"هواتف"},{"en":"Shoes","ar":"أحذية"},{"en":"Offers","ar":"العروض"}],"active":0,"actions":[{"icon":"shopping-cart"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"phone","text":{"en":"Phone case · 150 EGP","ar":"جراب هاتف · 150 جنيه"}},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Right-click to save","ar":"اضغط بالزر الأيمن للحفظ"},"gap":"xs"}]}}],"answer":["show"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-026","when":["big","rightclick"],"feedback":{"en":"Both still need a mouse. The ♡ must be a button that's there without hovering.","ar":"الاثنان ما زالا يحتاجان إلى الماوس. ويجب أن يكون ♡ زرًا ظاهرًا دون Hover (مرور الماوس فوقه)."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Now Tab and Enter can save a product.","ar":"صحيح. الآن يمكن حفظ المنتج بـ Tab وEnter."},"explain":{"en":"If a mouse is the only way to make something appear, keyboard users never see it.","ar":"إذا كان الماوس هو الطريقة الوحيدة لإظهار شيء، فلن يراه مستخدم لوحة المفاتيح أبدًا."}},{"id":"S10","type":"compare","skill":"SK-P05-U03-05","part":"retest","speaker":"nour","value":{"en":"Re-test. Mega Menus (NN/g): make each top-level menu choice clickable, leading to a page that shows all the options in plain HTML. Then the hover menu has a keyboard way in.","ar":"إعادة اختبار. القوائم الضخمة (NN/g): اجعل كل خيار رئيسي في القائمة قابلًا للضغط، ويفتح صفحة تعرض كل الخيارات. فيصبح لقائمة الـ Hover طريق بلوحة المفاتيح."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/mega-menus-work-well/","quote":"Simple: Don't bother making the dropdown itself accessible. Instead, make each top-level menu choice clickable"},"scenario":{"en":"Our clinic site's \"Services\" menu lists 12 specialties when the mouse is over it. We have two versions.","ar":"قائمة «الخدمات» في موقع عيادتنا تعرض 12 تخصصًا حين يمرّ الماوس فوقها. وعندنا نسختان."},"prompt":{"en":"Which version lets a keyboard user find the eye clinic?","ar":"أي نسخة تجعل مستخدم لوحة المفاتيح يجد عيادة العيون؟"},"a":{"label":{"en":"A: \"Services\" also opens a page listing all 12 specialties","ar":"A: «الخدمات» تفتح أيضًا صفحة فيها التخصصات الـ 12 كلها"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"raha.example","navbar":{"actions":[{"icon":"user"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"meta","ring":"brand","text":{"en":"Services ▾","ar":"الخدمات ▾"}},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Enter opens:","ar":"Enter يفتح:"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"link","text":{"en":"Eyes · Teeth · Skin · Children · …","ar":"العيون · الأسنان · الجلدية · الأطفال · …"},"gap":"xs"}]}},"b":{"label":{"en":"B: \"Services\" only opens its list on mouse over","ar":"B: «الخدمات» تفتح قائمتها بمرور الماوس فقط"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"raha.example","navbar":{"actions":[{"icon":"user"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"meta","ring":"brand","text":{"en":"Services ▾","ar":"الخدمات ▾"}},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Enter: nothing happens","ar":"Enter: لا يحدث شيء"},"gap":"s"}]}},"answer":"a","misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-026","when":["b"],"feedback":{"en":"In B, the 12 specialties need a mouse. A gives the keyboard a way in: Enter opens a page with all of them.","ar":"في B، لا تظهر التخصصات الـ 12 إلا بالماوس. أما A فيعطي لوحة المفاتيح طريقًا: Enter يفتح صفحة فيها كلها."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Enter on \"Services\" reaches every specialty.","ar":"صحيح. الضغط على Enter عند «الخدمات» يوصلك إلى كل التخصصات."},"explain":{"en":"Keep the hover menu for mouse users, and make the top item a real link to a full page.","ar":"أبقِ قائمة الـ Hover لمستخدمي الماوس، واجعل العنصر الرئيسي رابطًا حقيقيًا إلى صفحة كاملة."}}]}$uxg$::jsonb),
  ($uxg$P05-U04-B01$uxg$, $uxg$66eddd9b5fbafd7b6f0f487ac447b1773df34c9786f0da590f5948dbb895de93$uxg$, $uxg${"id":"P05-U04-B01","mode":"bank","title":{"en":"Re-tests: screen readers and meaning","ar":"إعادة اختبار: قارئ الشاشة (Screen reader) والمعنى"},"steps":[{"id":"S01","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P05-U04-01","part":"retest","speaker":"youssef","value":{"en":"Re-test. Write Alt Text (NN/g): when a product photo shows words that appear nowhere else on the page, the alt text should include those words.","ar":"إعادة اختبار. اكتب النص البديل (NN/g): حين تُظهر صورة المنتج كلمات غير موجودة في أي مكان آخر في الصفحة، يجب أن يذكرها النص البديل."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/write-alt-text/","quote":"The alt text describing this image should include the words on the t-shirt."},"scenario":{"en":"I sell printed T-shirts. One shirt has \"Cairo Runners 2026\" printed on it, but the product name is only \"White T-shirt\".","ar":"أبيع تيشيرتات مطبوعة. وأحد التيشيرتات مطبوع عليه «Cairo Runners 2026»، لكن اسم المنتج «تيشيرت أبيض» فقط."},"prompt":{"en":"What should the photo's alt text be?","ar":"ماذا يجب أن يكون النص البديل (Alt text) للصورة؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"lamha","name":{"en":"Lamha","ar":"لمحة"},"color":"#7C3AED","icon":"t-shirt","domain":"lamha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Lamha · Men","ar":"لمحة · رجال"},"back":true,"actions":[{"icon":"shopping-bag","aria":{"en":"Bag","ar":"الحقيبة"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"shirt","text":"CAIRO RUNNERS 2026"},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"White T-shirt","ar":"تيشيرت أبيض"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"350 EGP","ar":"350 جنيه"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Add to bag","ar":"أضف إلى الحقيبة"},"gap":"s"}],"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"}},"options":[{"id":"empty","text":{"en":"Empty; the name already says it's a T-shirt","ar":"فارغ؛ الاسم يقول إنه تيشيرت أصلًا"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"lamha","name":{"en":"Lamha","ar":"لمحة"},"color":"#7C3AED","icon":"t-shirt","domain":"lamha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Lamha · Men","ar":"لمحة · رجال"},"back":true,"actions":[{"icon":"shopping-bag","aria":{"en":"Bag","ar":"الحقيبة"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"shirt","text":"CAIRO RUNNERS 2026"},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"White T-shirt","ar":"تيشيرت أبيض"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"350 EGP","ar":"350 جنيه"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Add to bag","ar":"أضف إلى الحقيبة"},"gap":"s"}],"reader":{"en":"White T-shirt, heading. 350 EGP.","ar":"تيشيرت أبيض، عنوان. 350 جنيه."},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}},{"id":"plain","text":{"en":"\"White cotton T-shirt.\"","ar":"«تيشيرت قطن أبيض.»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"lamha","name":{"en":"Lamha","ar":"لمحة"},"color":"#7C3AED","icon":"t-shirt","domain":"lamha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Lamha · Men","ar":"لمحة · رجال"},"back":true,"actions":[{"icon":"shopping-bag","aria":{"en":"Bag","ar":"الحقيبة"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"shirt","text":"CAIRO RUNNERS 2026"},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"White T-shirt","ar":"تيشيرت أبيض"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"350 EGP","ar":"350 جنيه"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Add to bag","ar":"أضف إلى الحقيبة"},"gap":"s"}],"reader":{"en":"White cotton T-shirt, image. White T-shirt, heading.","ar":"تيشيرت قطن أبيض، صورة. تيشيرت أبيض، عنوان."},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}},{"id":"words","text":{"en":"\"White T-shirt printed with 'Cairo Runners 2026'.\"","ar":"«تيشيرت أبيض مطبوع عليه \"Cairo Runners 2026\".»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"lamha","name":{"en":"Lamha","ar":"لمحة"},"color":"#7C3AED","icon":"t-shirt","domain":"lamha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Lamha · Men","ar":"لمحة · رجال"},"back":true,"actions":[{"icon":"shopping-bag","aria":{"en":"Bag","ar":"الحقيبة"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"shirt","text":"CAIRO RUNNERS 2026"},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"White T-shirt","ar":"تيشيرت أبيض"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"350 EGP","ar":"350 جنيه"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Add to bag","ar":"أضف إلى الحقيبة"},"gap":"s"}],"reader":{"en":"White T-shirt printed with 'Cairo Runners 2026', image. White T-shirt, heading.","ar":"تيشيرت أبيض مطبوع عليه \"Cairo Runners 2026\"، صورة. تيشيرت أبيض، عنوان."},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}}],"answer":["words"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-037","when":["empty","plain"],"feedback":{"en":"The print is the reason people buy this shirt, and it's written nowhere else. The alt text must say it.","ar":"الطباعة هي سبب شراء هذا التيشيرت، وهي غير مكتوبة في أي مكان آخر. فيجب أن يذكرها النص البديل."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Say what only the image shows.","ar":"صحيح. قل ما تُظهره الصورة وحدها."},"explain":{"en":"Alt text gives the message the image adds. Here, that's the words on the shirt.","ar":"النص البديل يعطي الرسالة التي تضيفها الصورة. وهنا هي الكلمات المطبوعة على التيشيرت."}},{"id":"S02","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P05-U04-01","part":"retest","speaker":"tarek","value":{"en":"Re-test. Write Alt Text (NN/g): alt text for functional images describes what happens when they're tapped, not how they look.","ar":"إعادة اختبار. اكتب النص البديل (NN/g): النص البديل للصور الوظيفية يصف ما يحدث عند الضغط عليها، لا شكلها."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/write-alt-text/","quote":"Alt text for functional images should not describe the image; instead, it should describe what will happen when the image is clicked or tapped."},"scenario":{"en":"Our app shows an offer pop-up. The only way to close it is a small ✕ icon in the corner, with no words.","ar":"تطبيقنا يعرض نافذة عرض منبثقة. والطريقة الوحيدة لإغلاقها أيقونة ✕ صغيرة في الركن، بدون كلمات."},"prompt":{"en":"What should the ✕ icon's alt text be?","ar":"ماذا يجب أن يكون النص البديل لأيقونة ✕؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"sallah","name":{"en":"Sallah","ar":"سلّة"},"color":"#2E9E5B","icon":"basket","domain":"sallah.example"},"appbar":{"logo":true,"actions":[{"icon":"basket","aria":{"en":"Basket","ar":"السلة"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"searchbar","text":{"en":"Search Sallah","ar":"ابحث في سلّة"}},{"kind":"listitem","art":"bread","text":{"en":"Baladi bread","ar":"عيش بلدي"},"value":{"en":"10 EGP","ar":"10 جنيه"}}],"overlay":{"type":"dialog","close":true,"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"20% off your first order","ar":"خصم 20% على أول طلب"}},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"Use code HELLO20 at checkout.","ar":"استخدم الكود HELLO20 عند الدفع."},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Shop now","ar":"تسوّق الآن"},"gap":"s"}]},"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"}},"options":[{"id":"close","text":{"en":"\"Close offer.\"","ar":"«أغلق العرض.»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"sallah","name":{"en":"Sallah","ar":"سلّة"},"color":"#2E9E5B","icon":"basket","domain":"sallah.example"},"appbar":{"logo":true,"actions":[{"icon":"basket","aria":{"en":"Basket","ar":"السلة"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"searchbar","text":{"en":"Search Sallah","ar":"ابحث في سلّة"}},{"kind":"listitem","art":"bread","text":{"en":"Baladi bread","ar":"عيش بلدي"},"value":{"en":"10 EGP","ar":"10 جنيه"}}],"overlay":{"type":"dialog","close":true,"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"20% off your first order","ar":"خصم 20% على أول طلب"}},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"Use code HELLO20 at checkout.","ar":"استخدم الكود HELLO20 عند الدفع."},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Shop now","ar":"تسوّق الآن"},"gap":"s"}]},"reader":{"en":"Close offer, button.","ar":"أغلق العرض، زر."},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}},{"id":"cross","text":{"en":"\"Grey cross icon.\"","ar":"«أيقونة علامة × رمادية.»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"sallah","name":{"en":"Sallah","ar":"سلّة"},"color":"#2E9E5B","icon":"basket","domain":"sallah.example"},"appbar":{"logo":true,"actions":[{"icon":"basket","aria":{"en":"Basket","ar":"السلة"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"searchbar","text":{"en":"Search Sallah","ar":"ابحث في سلّة"}},{"kind":"listitem","art":"bread","text":{"en":"Baladi bread","ar":"عيش بلدي"},"value":{"en":"10 EGP","ar":"10 جنيه"}}],"overlay":{"type":"dialog","close":true,"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"20% off your first order","ar":"خصم 20% على أول طلب"}},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"Use code HELLO20 at checkout.","ar":"استخدم الكود HELLO20 عند الدفع."},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Shop now","ar":"تسوّق الآن"},"gap":"s"}]},"reader":{"en":"Grey cross icon, button.","ar":"أيقونة علامة × رمادية، زر."},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}},{"id":"empty","text":{"en":"Empty; it's a tiny icon","ar":"فارغ؛ إنها أيقونة صغيرة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"sallah","name":{"en":"Sallah","ar":"سلّة"},"color":"#2E9E5B","icon":"basket","domain":"sallah.example"},"appbar":{"logo":true,"actions":[{"icon":"basket","aria":{"en":"Basket","ar":"السلة"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"searchbar","text":{"en":"Search Sallah","ar":"ابحث في سلّة"}},{"kind":"listitem","art":"bread","text":{"en":"Baladi bread","ar":"عيش بلدي"},"value":{"en":"10 EGP","ar":"10 جنيه"}}],"overlay":{"type":"dialog","close":true,"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"20% off your first order","ar":"خصم 20% على أول طلب"}},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"Use code HELLO20 at checkout.","ar":"استخدم الكود HELLO20 عند الدفع."},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Shop now","ar":"تسوّق الآن"},"gap":"s"}]},"reader":{"en":"Button.","ar":"زر."},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}}],"answer":["close"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-036","when":["cross"],"feedback":{"en":"The customer doesn't need its colour or shape. They need to know tapping it closes the offer.","ar":"العميل لا يحتاج لونها أو شكلها. يحتاج أن يعرف أن الضغط عليها يغلق العرض."}},{"id":"MC-P05-035","when":["empty"],"feedback":{"en":"This icon is the only way out. With empty alt text, the button has no name, and a blind customer may get stuck.","ar":"هذه الأيقونة هي الطريق الوحيد للخروج. وبنص بديل فارغ يصبح الزر بلا اسم، وقد يعلق العميل الكفيف."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Say what the button does.","ar":"صحيح. قل ماذا يفعل الزر."},"explain":{"en":"A clickable image is a button, and its alt text is the button's name.","ar":"الصورة القابلة للضغط زر، ونصّها البديل هو اسم الزر."}},{"id":"S03","type":"choose","skill":"SK-P05-U04-02","part":"retest","speaker":"mona","value":{"en":"Re-test. Write Alt Text (NN/g): avoid jargon and abbreviations unless users are sure to understand them.","ar":"إعادة اختبار. اكتب النص البديل (NN/g): تجنّب المصطلحات التقنية والاختصارات إلا إذا كان المستخدم سيفهمها بالتأكيد."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/write-alt-text/","quote":"Avoid technical jargon and abbreviations unless users are certain to understand them."},"scenario":{"en":"Our team is posting a project story on the company website for clients. A designer wrote this alt text for a screen: \"New PDP with sticky CTA above the fold.\"","ar":"فريقنا ينشر قصة مشروع على موقع الشركة للعملاء. وكتب أحد المصمّمين هذا النص البديل لإحدى الشاشات: «New PDP with sticky CTA above the fold.»"},"prompt":{"en":"How should the alt text read?","ar":"كيف نكتب النص البديل ليفهمه عملاء الشركة؟"},"options":[{"id":"keep","text":{"en":"Keep it; it's short and exact","ar":"يبقى كما هو؛ فهو قصير ودقيق"}},{"id":"plain","text":{"en":"\"New product page: the Buy button stays on screen as you scroll.\"","ar":"«صفحة المنتج الجديدة: زر الشراء يبقى ظاهرًا وأنت تمرّر الصفحة.»"}},{"id":"image","text":{"en":"\"Image of the new product page design.\"","ar":"«صورة لتصميم صفحة المنتج الجديدة.»"}}],"answer":["plain"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-038","when":["keep"],"feedback":{"en":"Clients may not know \"PDP\" or \"CTA\". Short only helps if people understand it.","ar":"العملاء قد لا يعرفون «PDP» أو «CTA». والقِصر يفيد فقط إذا فهمه الناس."}},{"id":"MC-P05-038","when":["image"],"feedback":{"en":"It starts with \"image of\" and drops the point: what changed on the page.","ar":"يبدأ بـ «صورة لـ» ويُسقط الفكرة: ما الذي تغيّر في الصفحة."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Plain words, key point first.","ar":"صحيح. كلمات بسيطة، والفكرة المهمة أولًا."},"explain":{"en":"Write alt text in the words your readers use, not the team's shortcuts.","ar":"اكتب النص البديل بالكلمات التي يستخدمها قرّاؤك، لا باختصارات الفريق."}},{"id":"S04","type":"choose","skill":"SK-P05-U04-02","part":"retest","speaker":"nour","value":{"en":"Re-test. Write Alt Text (NN/g): users can't pause and resume alt text in the middle; they must go back to the beginning. Keep it short.","ar":"إعادة اختبار. اكتب النص البديل (NN/g): المستخدم لا يستطيع إيقاف النص البديل في منتصفه ثم إكماله؛ عليه أن يرجع إلى أوله. فاجعله قصيرًا."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/write-alt-text/","quote":"Users can’t pause and resume the screen reader in the middle of alt text without going back to the beginning."},"scenario":{"en":"We bought a new X-ray machine. Its photo has 4 lines of alt text about the brand, the room, the colour and how fast it is.","ar":"اشترينا جهاز أشعة جديدًا. ولصورته نص بديل من 4 أسطر عن الماركة والغرفة واللون وسرعته."},"prompt":{"en":"Patients care most about speed. Which alt text is best?","ar":"المرضى تهمّهم السرعة أكثر من أي شيء. أي نص بديل يعطيهم ما يهمّهم؟"},"options":[{"id":"image","text":{"en":"\"Image of X-ray machine.\"","ar":"«صورة جهاز أشعة.»"}},{"id":"keep","text":{"en":"Keep all 4 lines; patients can skip what they don't need","ar":"أبقِ الأسطر الأربعة؛ يستطيع المرضى تخطّي ما لا يحتاجونه"}},{"id":"fast","text":{"en":"\"New X-ray machine: results in 10 minutes.\"","ar":"«جهاز أشعة جديد: النتيجة في 10 دقائق.»"}}],"answer":["fast"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-038","when":["keep"],"feedback":{"en":"They can't skip inside alt text. To hear the speed again, they must listen to all 4 lines from the start.","ar":"لا يستطيعون التخطّي داخل النص البديل. ولكي يسمعوا السرعة مرة أخرى، عليهم سماع الأسطر الأربعة من البداية."}},{"id":"MC-P05-038","when":["image"],"feedback":{"en":"Short, but it starts with \"image of\" and leaves out the one fact patients want.","ar":"قصير، لكنه يبدأ بـ «صورة» ويترك المعلومة الوحيدة التي يريدها المرضى."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. One short line with what matters.","ar":"صحيح. سطر قصير فيه ما يهم."},"explain":{"en":"Keep alt text to about one sentence, and lead with what people came for.","ar":"اجعل النص البديل في حدود جملة واحدة، وابدأ بما جاء الناس من أجله."}},{"id":"S05","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P05-U04-03","part":"retest","speaker":"karim","value":{"en":"Re-test. Write Alt Text (NN/g): an informative image is simple when its main message fits in one sentence of about 150 characters. A chart's alt text gives that message.","ar":"إعادة اختبار. اكتب النص البديل (NN/g): الصورة التي تحمل معلومة تكون بسيطة حين تُلخَّص رسالتها في جملة واحدة من نحو 150 حرفًا. والنص البديل للرسم البياني يعطي هذه الرسالة."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/write-alt-text/","quote":"An informative image is considered simple when its main message can be summarized in one sentence that fits within about 150 characters."},"scenario":{"en":"I'm adding a chart to our app's news page. It shows monthly downloads from January to June, and the line goes up every month.","ar":"أضيف رسمًا بيانيًا لصفحة أخبار تطبيقنا. يُظهر عدد التحميلات كل شهر من يناير إلى يونيو، والخط يصعد كل شهر."},"prompt":{"en":"What should the chart's alt text be?","ar":"ماذا يجب أن يكون النص البديل للرسم البياني؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"waraq","name":{"en":"Waraq","ar":"ورق"},"color":"#9A3412","icon":"books","domain":"waraq.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"News","ar":"الأخبار"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Half a year of growth","ar":"نصف عام من النمو"}},{"kind":"chart","type":"line","values":[12,14,17,19,22,25],"labels":[{"en":"Jan","ar":"يناير"},{"en":"Feb","ar":"فبراير"},{"en":"Mar","ar":"مارس"},{"en":"Apr","ar":"أبريل"},{"en":"May","ar":"مايو"},{"en":"Jun","ar":"يونيو"}],"gap":"s"},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Monthly downloads, in thousands","ar":"التحميلات الشهرية، بالآلاف"},"gap":"xs"}],"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"}},"options":[{"id":"point","text":{"en":"\"Downloads doubled from January to June, rising every month.\"","ar":"«تضاعفت التحميلات من يناير إلى يونيو، وزادت كل شهر.»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"waraq","name":{"en":"Waraq","ar":"ورق"},"color":"#9A3412","icon":"books","domain":"waraq.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"News","ar":"الأخبار"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Half a year of growth","ar":"نصف عام من النمو"}},{"kind":"chart","type":"line","values":[12,14,17,19,22,25],"labels":[{"en":"Jan","ar":"يناير"},{"en":"Feb","ar":"فبراير"},{"en":"Mar","ar":"مارس"},{"en":"Apr","ar":"أبريل"},{"en":"May","ar":"مايو"},{"en":"Jun","ar":"يونيو"}],"gap":"s"},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Monthly downloads, in thousands","ar":"التحميلات الشهرية، بالآلاف"},"gap":"xs"}],"reader":{"en":"Downloads doubled from January to June, rising every month. Image.","ar":"تضاعفت التحميلات من يناير إلى يونيو، وزادت كل شهر. صورة."},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}},{"id":"numbers","text":{"en":"\"January 12,400. February 14,100. March 16,800. April…\"","ar":"«يناير 12,400. فبراير 14,100. مارس 16,800. أبريل…»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"waraq","name":{"en":"Waraq","ar":"ورق"},"color":"#9A3412","icon":"books","domain":"waraq.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"News","ar":"الأخبار"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Half a year of growth","ar":"نصف عام من النمو"}},{"kind":"chart","type":"line","values":[12,14,17,19,22,25],"labels":[{"en":"Jan","ar":"يناير"},{"en":"Feb","ar":"فبراير"},{"en":"Mar","ar":"مارس"},{"en":"Apr","ar":"أبريل"},{"en":"May","ar":"مايو"},{"en":"Jun","ar":"يونيو"}],"gap":"s"},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Monthly downloads, in thousands","ar":"التحميلات الشهرية، بالآلاف"},"gap":"xs"}],"reader":{"en":"January 12,400. February 14,100. March 16,800. April… Image.","ar":"يناير 12,400. فبراير 14,100. مارس 16,800. أبريل… صورة."},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}},{"id":"type","text":{"en":"\"Line chart of downloads.\"","ar":"«رسم بياني بخط للتحميلات.»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"waraq","name":{"en":"Waraq","ar":"ورق"},"color":"#9A3412","icon":"books","domain":"waraq.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"News","ar":"الأخبار"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Half a year of growth","ar":"نصف عام من النمو"}},{"kind":"chart","type":"line","values":[12,14,17,19,22,25],"labels":[{"en":"Jan","ar":"يناير"},{"en":"Feb","ar":"فبراير"},{"en":"Mar","ar":"مارس"},{"en":"Apr","ar":"أبريل"},{"en":"May","ar":"مايو"},{"en":"Jun","ar":"يونيو"}],"gap":"s"},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Monthly downloads, in thousands","ar":"التحميلات الشهرية، بالآلاف"},"gap":"xs"}],"reader":{"en":"Line chart of downloads. Image.","ar":"رسم بياني بخط للتحميلات. صورة."},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}}],"answer":["point"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-040","when":["numbers"],"feedback":{"en":"Six big numbers are hard to hold in mind. The reader wants the point: downloads keep growing.","ar":"ستة أرقام كبيرة يصعب تذكّرها. والقارئ يريد الفكرة: التحميلات تزيد باستمرار."}},{"id":"MC-P05-037","when":["type"],"feedback":{"en":"This says what kind of chart it is, but not what it shows.","ar":"هذا يقول نوع الرسم، لكن لا يقول ماذا يُظهر."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. The main point, in one sentence.","ar":"صحيح. الفكرة الأساسية في جملة واحدة."},"explain":{"en":"Say what the chart is there to show. If readers need the exact numbers, add a table on the page.","ar":"قل الفكرة التي يُظهرها الرسم. وإذا احتاج القرّاء الأرقام بالضبط، أضف جدولًا في الصفحة."}},{"id":"S06","type":"choose","skill":"SK-P05-U04-03","part":"retest","speaker":"sara","value":{"en":"Re-test. Write Alt Text (NN/g): make complex images accessible by changing the page text around them, often with a list or table in the page.","ar":"إعادة اختبار. اكتب النص البديل (NN/g): اجعل الصور المعقّدة متاحة بتغيير نص الصفحة حولها، وغالبًا بقائمة أو جدول في الصفحة."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/write-alt-text/","quote":"In many cases, this could be as simple as including a list or table within the HTML of the page."},"scenario":{"en":"I'm designing a phone company's plans page. The marketing team made one image that compares 3 plans: price, data, minutes.","ar":"أصمّم صفحة الباقات لشركة اتصالات. وصنع فريق التسويق صورة واحدة تقارن 3 باقات: السعر، والإنترنت، والدقائق."},"prompt":{"en":"What's the best way to show the comparison?","ar":"ما أفضل طريقة لعرض المقارنة لكل العملاء، ومنهم مستخدمو قارئ الشاشة؟"},"options":[{"id":"alt","text":{"en":"Keep the image and write all 9 values in its alt text","ar":"أبقِ الصورة واكتب القيم التسع كلها في نصّها البديل"}},{"id":"table","text":{"en":"Build the comparison as a real table on the page","ar":"اعرض المقارنة كجدول حقيقي في الصفحة"}},{"id":"name","text":{"en":"Keep the image with alt text \"Plan comparison.\"","ar":"أبقِ الصورة بنص بديل «مقارنة الباقات.»"}}],"answer":["table"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-040","when":["alt"],"feedback":{"en":"Customers can't pause alt text or jump to one plan. A table lets them move cell by cell.","ar":"العميل لا يستطيع إيقاف النص البديل أو الانتقال مباشرة إلى باقة واحدة. أما الجدول فيجعله ينتقل خانة خانة."}},{"id":"MC-P05-040","when":["name"],"feedback":{"en":"The customer learns there's a comparison, but not a single price.","ar":"يعرف العميل أن هناك مقارنة، لكن لا يعرف أي سعر."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. A real table works for everyone.","ar":"صحيح. الجدول الحقيقي يناسب الجميع."},"explain":{"en":"When an image holds a lot of information, put that information on the page as text.","ar":"حين تحمل الصورة معلومات كثيرة، ضع هذه المعلومات في الصفحة كنص."}},{"id":"S07","type":"choose","skill":"SK-P05-U04-04","part":"retest","speaker":"rami","value":{"en":"Re-test. \"Learn More\" Links (NN/g): front-load link text by putting the most relevant keywords at the beginning.","ar":"إعادة اختبار. روابط «اعرف المزيد» (NN/g): ضع الكلمات الأهم في بداية نص الرابط."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/learn-more-links/","quote":"When rewriting the labels, remember to try to front-load the link text by putting the most relevant keywords at the beginning of the text."},"scenario":{"en":"I'm fixing a university website. One link says: \"Click to learn more about how you can apply for a scholarship\".","ar":"أصلح موقع جامعة. وأحد الروابط يقول: «اضغط لتعرف المزيد عن طريقة التقديم على منحة دراسية»."},"prompt":{"en":"Which link text is best?","ar":"أي نص للرابط يقول للطالب وجهته من أول كلماته؟"},"options":[{"id":"more","text":{"en":"\"Learn more\"","ar":"«اعرف المزيد»"}},{"id":"keep","text":{"en":"Keep it; it says where it goes","ar":"يبقى كما هو؛ فهو يقول إلى أين يذهب"}},{"id":"front","text":{"en":"\"Apply for a scholarship\"","ar":"«التقديم على منحة دراسية»"}}],"answer":["front"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-042","when":["keep"],"feedback":{"en":"It does say it, but only after 7 words. Students who hear only the start may move on.","ar":"نعم يقول وجهته، لكن بعد 7 كلمات. والطالب الذي يسمع البداية فقط قد ينتقل إلى رابط آخر."}},{"id":"MC-P05-041","when":["more"],"feedback":{"en":"Shorter, but now it doesn't say where it goes at all.","ar":"أقصر، لكنه الآن لا يقول إلى أين يذهب أبدًا."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. The key words come first.","ar":"صحيح. الكلمات المهمة أولًا."},"explain":{"en":"A link should say where it goes in its first few words.","ar":"الرابط يجب أن يقول وجهته في أول كلماته."}},{"id":"S08","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P05-U04-04","part":"retest","speaker":"hana","value":{"en":"Re-test. \"Learn More\" Links (NN/g): most screen reader users hear a list of links with no visual context, so the same generic link text repeated means nothing.","ar":"إعادة اختبار. روابط «اعرف المزيد» (NN/g): أغلب مستخدمي قارئ الشاشة يسمعون قائمة روابط بلا سياق بصري، فتكرار نفس النص العام لا يعني شيئًا."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/learn-more-links/","quote":"Most screen-reader users will hear a list of links read to them, with no visual context to help them make sense of different generic Learn More or Read More links."},"scenario":{"en":"My gym's page has three files to download: the timetable, the price list and the gym rules. Each has a \"Download\" button.","ar":"صفحة النادي فيها ثلاثة ملفات للتحميل: جدول الحصص، وقائمة الأسعار، وقواعد النادي. ولكل ملف زر «تحميل»."},"prompt":{"en":"What should the buttons say?","ar":"ماذا نكتب على الأزرار حتى يعرف العضو أي ملف سيحمّل؟"},"mock":{"reader":{"en":"Download, button. Download, button. Download, button.","ar":"تحميل، زر. تحميل، زر. تحميل، زر."},"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"nashat.example/members","navbar":{"actions":[{"icon":"user"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Member files","ar":"ملفات الأعضاء"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"calendar","text":{"en":"Class timetable","ar":"جدول الحصص"},"sub":"PDF · 1 MB"},{"kind":"button","style":"outline","icon":"download-simple","text":{"en":"Download","ar":"تحميل"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"receipt","text":{"en":"Price list","ar":"قائمة الأسعار"},"sub":"PDF · 0.5 MB","gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","style":"outline","icon":"download-simple","text":{"en":"Download","ar":"تحميل"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"list-checks","text":{"en":"Gym rules","ar":"قواعد النادي"},"sub":"PDF · 0.3 MB","gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","style":"outline","icon":"download-simple","text":{"en":"Download","ar":"تحميل"},"gap":"xs"}],"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"}},"options":[{"id":"one","text":{"en":"\"Download 1\", \"Download 2\", \"Download 3\"","ar":"«تحميل 1»، «تحميل 2»، «تحميل 3»"},"mock":{"reader":{"en":"Download 1, button. Download 2, button. Download 3, button.","ar":"تحميل 1، زر. تحميل 2، زر. تحميل 3، زر."},"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"nashat.example/members","navbar":{"actions":[{"icon":"user"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Member files","ar":"ملفات الأعضاء"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"calendar","text":{"en":"Class timetable","ar":"جدول الحصص"},"sub":"PDF · 1 MB"},{"kind":"button","style":"outline","icon":"download-simple","text":{"en":"Download 1","ar":"تحميل 1"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"receipt","text":{"en":"Price list","ar":"قائمة الأسعار"},"sub":"PDF · 0.5 MB","gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","style":"outline","icon":"download-simple","text":{"en":"Download 2","ar":"تحميل 2"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"list-checks","text":{"en":"Gym rules","ar":"قواعد النادي"},"sub":"PDF · 0.3 MB","gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","style":"outline","icon":"download-simple","text":{"en":"Download 3","ar":"تحميل 3"},"gap":"xs"}],"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}},{"id":"names","text":{"en":"\"Download timetable\", \"Download prices\", \"Download rules\"","ar":"«تحميل جدول الحصص»، «تحميل الأسعار»، «تحميل القواعد»"},"mock":{"reader":{"en":"Download timetable, button. Download prices, button. Download rules, button.","ar":"تحميل جدول الحصص، زر. تحميل الأسعار، زر. تحميل القواعد، زر."},"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"nashat.example/members","navbar":{"actions":[{"icon":"user"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Member files","ar":"ملفات الأعضاء"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"calendar","text":{"en":"Class timetable","ar":"جدول الحصص"},"sub":"PDF · 1 MB"},{"kind":"button","style":"outline","icon":"download-simple","text":{"en":"Download timetable","ar":"تحميل جدول الحصص"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"receipt","text":{"en":"Price list","ar":"قائمة الأسعار"},"sub":"PDF · 0.5 MB","gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","style":"outline","icon":"download-simple","text":{"en":"Download prices","ar":"تحميل الأسعار"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"list-checks","text":{"en":"Gym rules","ar":"قواعد النادي"},"sub":"PDF · 0.3 MB","gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","style":"outline","icon":"download-simple","text":{"en":"Download rules","ar":"تحميل القواعد"},"gap":"xs"}],"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}},{"id":"icon","text":{"en":"Keep \"Download\" and add a ⬇ icon","ar":"أبقِ «تحميل» وأضف أيقونة ⬇"},"mock":{"reader":{"en":"Download, button. Download, button. Download, button.","ar":"تحميل، زر. تحميل، زر. تحميل، زر."},"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"nashat.example/members","navbar":{"actions":[{"icon":"user"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Member files","ar":"ملفات الأعضاء"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"calendar","text":{"en":"Class timetable","ar":"جدول الحصص"},"sub":"PDF · 1 MB"},{"kind":"button","style":"outline","icon":"download-simple","text":{"en":"Download","ar":"تحميل"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"receipt","text":{"en":"Price list","ar":"قائمة الأسعار"},"sub":"PDF · 0.5 MB","gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","style":"outline","icon":"download-simple","text":{"en":"Download","ar":"تحميل"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"list-checks","text":{"en":"Gym rules","ar":"قواعد النادي"},"sub":"PDF · 0.3 MB","gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","style":"outline","icon":"download-simple","text":{"en":"Download","ar":"تحميل"},"gap":"xs"}],"caption":{"en":"Unchanged","ar":"بدون تغيير"}}}],"answer":["names"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-041","when":["one","icon"],"feedback":{"en":"A member who hears the buttons alone still can't tell which file is which.","ar":"العضو الذي يسمع الأزرار وحدها ما زال لا يعرف أي زر لأي ملف."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Each button says its own file.","ar":"صحيح. كل زر يذكر ملفه."},"explain":{"en":"Buttons and links are often heard as a list. Each needs words that make sense alone.","ar":"الأزرار والروابط كثيرًا ما تُسمع كقائمة. وكل واحد يحتاج كلمات مفهومة وحدها."}},{"id":"S09","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P05-U04-05","part":"retest","speaker":"tarek","value":{"en":"Re-test. Screen-Reader Users on Mobile (NN/g): when a menu opens, the screen reader's focus should jump to its beginning.","ar":"إعادة اختبار. مستخدمو قارئ الشاشة على الهاتف (NN/g): حين تُفتح قائمة، يجب أن ينتقل تركيز قارئ الشاشة إلى بدايتها."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/screen-reader-users-on-mobile/","quote":"It would be better if the screen reader's focus immediately jumped to the beginning of the newly opened menu."},"scenario":{"en":"In our delivery app, \"Add address\" opens a form over the page. But the screen reader keeps reading the page behind it.","ar":"في تطبيق التوصيل عندنا، «أضف عنوانًا» يفتح نموذجًا فوق الصفحة. لكن قارئ الشاشة يظل يقرأ الصفحة التي خلفه."},"prompt":{"en":"Where should focus go when the form opens?","ar":"إلى أين يجب أن يذهب التركيز حين يُفتح النموذج؟"},"mock":{"reader":{"en":"Fresh today, heading. Tomatoes, 25 pounds.","ar":"طازج اليوم، عنوان. طماطم، 25 جنيهًا."},"app":{"id":"sallah","name":{"en":"Sallah","ar":"سلّة"},"color":"#2E9E5B","icon":"basket","domain":"sallah.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Checkout","ar":"الدفع"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Fresh today","ar":"طازج اليوم"}},{"kind":"listitem","art":"food-salad","text":{"en":"Tomatoes","ar":"طماطم"},"value":{"en":"25 EGP","ar":"25 جنيه"}}],"overlay":{"type":"sheet","title":{"en":"New address","ar":"عنوان جديد"},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Street","ar":"الشارع"},"text":{"en":"e.g. 12 Tahrir St.","ar":"مثال: 12 شارع التحرير"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Building and flat","ar":"العمارة والشقة"},"text":{"en":"e.g. Building 4, flat 7","ar":"مثال: عمارة 4، شقة 7"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Save","ar":"احفظ"},"gap":"s"}]},"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"}},"options":[{"id":"stay","text":{"en":"Stay on \"Add address\", so the customer knows where they are","ar":"يبقى على «أضف عنوانًا»، ليعرف العميل أين هو"},"mock":{"reader":{"en":"Add address, button.","ar":"أضف عنوانًا، زر."},"app":{"id":"sallah","name":{"en":"Sallah","ar":"سلّة"},"color":"#2E9E5B","icon":"basket","domain":"sallah.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Checkout","ar":"الدفع"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Fresh today","ar":"طازج اليوم"}},{"kind":"listitem","art":"food-salad","text":{"en":"Tomatoes","ar":"طماطم"},"value":{"en":"25 EGP","ar":"25 جنيه"}}],"overlay":{"type":"sheet","title":{"en":"New address","ar":"عنوان جديد"},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Street","ar":"الشارع"},"text":{"en":"e.g. 12 Tahrir St.","ar":"مثال: 12 شارع التحرير"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Building and flat","ar":"العمارة والشقة"},"text":{"en":"e.g. Building 4, flat 7","ar":"مثال: عمارة 4، شقة 7"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Save","ar":"احفظ"},"gap":"s"}]},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}},{"id":"save","text":{"en":"Go to the \"Save\" button at the bottom of the form","ar":"يذهب إلى زر «احفظ» في أسفل النموذج"},"mock":{"reader":{"en":"Save, button.","ar":"احفظ، زر."},"app":{"id":"sallah","name":{"en":"Sallah","ar":"سلّة"},"color":"#2E9E5B","icon":"basket","domain":"sallah.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Checkout","ar":"الدفع"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Fresh today","ar":"طازج اليوم"}},{"kind":"listitem","art":"food-salad","text":{"en":"Tomatoes","ar":"طماطم"},"value":{"en":"25 EGP","ar":"25 جنيه"}}],"overlay":{"type":"sheet","title":{"en":"New address","ar":"عنوان جديد"},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Street","ar":"الشارع"},"text":{"en":"e.g. 12 Tahrir St.","ar":"مثال: 12 شارع التحرير"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Building and flat","ar":"العمارة والشقة"},"text":{"en":"e.g. Building 4, flat 7","ar":"مثال: عمارة 4، شقة 7"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Save","ar":"احفظ"},"gap":"s","ring":"brand"}]},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}},{"id":"top","text":{"en":"Go to the form's title, \"New address\", at the top","ar":"يذهب إلى عنوان النموذج «عنوان جديد» في الأعلى"},"mock":{"reader":{"en":"New address, heading.","ar":"عنوان جديد، عنوان."},"app":{"id":"sallah","name":{"en":"Sallah","ar":"سلّة"},"color":"#2E9E5B","icon":"basket","domain":"sallah.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Checkout","ar":"الدفع"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Fresh today","ar":"طازج اليوم"}},{"kind":"listitem","art":"food-salad","text":{"en":"Tomatoes","ar":"طماطم"},"value":{"en":"25 EGP","ar":"25 جنيه"}}],"overlay":{"type":"sheet","title":{"en":"New address","ar":"عنوان جديد"},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Street","ar":"الشارع"},"text":{"en":"e.g. 12 Tahrir St.","ar":"مثال: 12 شارع التحرير"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Building and flat","ar":"العمارة والشقة"},"text":{"en":"e.g. Building 4, flat 7","ar":"مثال: عمارة 4، شقة 7"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Save","ar":"احفظ"},"gap":"s"}]},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}}],"answer":["top"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-043","when":["stay"],"feedback":{"en":"Then the customer keeps swiping through the page behind and never finds the form.","ar":"عندها يظل العميل يمرّر في الصفحة التي خلفه ولا يجد النموذج أبدًا."}},{"id":"MC-P05-043","when":["save"],"feedback":{"en":"Focus should go into the form, but at its start. From \"Save\", the customer would skip every field.","ar":"يجب أن يذهب التركيز إلى النموذج، لكن إلى بدايته. فمن «احفظ» سيتخطّى العميل كل الحقول."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Focus goes to the start of what opened.","ar":"صحيح. التركيز يذهب إلى بداية ما فُتح."},"explain":{"en":"Customers expect to use what they just opened. Start them at its top.","ar":"العميل يتوقّع أن يستخدم ما فتحه للتو. فضع التركيز في أعلاه."}},{"id":"S10","type":"choose","skill":"SK-P05-U04-05","part":"retest","speaker":"mona","value":{"en":"Re-test. Screen-Reader Users on Mobile (NN/g): when focus didn't jump to what opened, a user assumed nothing had happened.","ar":"إعادة اختبار. مستخدمو قارئ الشاشة على الهاتف (NN/g): حين لم ينتقل التركيز إلى ما فُتح، ظن المستخدم أنه لم يحدث شيء."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/screen-reader-users-on-mobile/","quote":"After tapping on the contact with whom he wanted to chat, the screen reader's focus did not immediately jump to the overlay, and he assumed that nothing had happened."},"scenario":{"en":"I'm reviewing my team's chat app. A blind tester tapped a contact's name to start a chat, then tapped it again and again.","ar":"أراجع تطبيق المحادثة الذي يصمّمه فريقي. ضغط مختبِر كفيف على اسم في قائمة محادثاته ليبدأ محادثة، ثم ضغطه مرة بعد مرة."},"prompt":{"en":"What's the most likely cause?","ar":"ما السبب الأرجح لضغطه على الاسم مرة بعد مرة؟"},"mock":{"reader":{"en":"Mona Adel, button.","ar":"منى عادل، زر."},"app":{"id":"hakawy","name":{"en":"Hakawy","ar":"حكاوي"},"color":"#0CA678","icon":"chat-circle","domain":"hakawy.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Chats","ar":"المحادثات"},"actions":[{"icon":"magnifying-glass","aria":{"en":"Search","ar":"بحث"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","avatar":{"text":"Mona Adel","art":"woman-1"},"text":{"en":"Mona Adel","ar":"منى عادل"},"sub":{"en":"See you tomorrow","ar":"أراك غدًا"},"value":"10:42","ring":"brand"},{"kind":"listitem","avatar":{"text":"Omar Samy","art":"man-2"},"text":{"en":"Omar Samy","ar":"عمر سامي"},"sub":{"en":"Thanks!","ar":"شكرًا!"},"value":"09:15"},{"kind":"listitem","avatar":{"text":"Laila Hassan","art":"woman-3"},"text":{"en":"Laila Hassan","ar":"ليلى حسن"},"sub":{"en":"Photo","ar":"صورة"},"value":{"en":"Yesterday","ar":"أمس"}}]},"options":[{"id":"focus","text":{"en":"The chat opened, but focus stayed on the name, so he thought nothing happened","ar":"المحادثة فُتحت، لكن التركيز بقي على الاسم، فظن أنه لم يحدث شيء"}},{"id":"slow","text":{"en":"The app is slow, so it needs a loading spinner","ar":"التطبيق بطيء، فيحتاج مؤشّر تحميل (Spinner)"}},{"id":"small","text":{"en":"The name is too small to tap","ar":"الاسم أصغر من أن يُضغط"}}],"answer":["focus"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-043","when":["slow","small"],"feedback":{"en":"The tap worked and the chat opened. He just heard nothing new, because focus didn't move into the chat.","ar":"الضغط نجح والمحادثة فُتحت. لكنه لم يسمع شيئًا جديدًا، لأن التركيز لم ينتقل إلى المحادثة."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. No new words means \"nothing happened\" to him.","ar":"صحيح. حين لا يسمع كلامًا جديدًا، يظن أنه لم يحدث شيء."},"explain":{"en":"A screen reader user knows something opened only when focus moves there. Move focus into the chat.","ar":"مستخدم قارئ الشاشة يعرف أن شيئًا فُتح فقط حين ينتقل التركيز إليه. فانقل التركيز إلى المحادثة."}}]}$uxg$::jsonb),
  ($uxg$P05-U05-B01$uxg$, $uxg$56ed899ea678a5ce220005e3f6dad6a4921902f63d9e0c73d16c217b7c03aa2c$uxg$, $uxg${"id":"P05-U05-B01","mode":"bank","title":{"en":"Re-tests: touch, motion and time","ar":"إعادة اختبار: اللمس والحركة والوقت"},"steps":[{"id":"S01","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P05-U05-01","part":"retest","speaker":"hana","value":{"en":"Re-test. Contextual Swipe (NN/g): with no signifiers, people can't tell where a swipe can be used.","ar":"إعادة اختبار. السحب لإظهار الإجراءات (NN/g): بدون علامات ظاهرة، لا يعرف الناس أين يمكن استخدام السحب."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/contextual-swipe/","quote":"Lack of signifiers makes it unclear where the contextual swipe can be used."},"scenario":{"en":"In my gym's app, you book a class by swiping its card to the right. There's no Book button. Many members think booking is only at the front desk.","ar":"في تطبيق النادي، تحجز الحصة بسحب بطاقتها لليمين (Swipe). ولا يوجد زر حجز. وأعضاء كثيرون يظنّون أن الحجز في الاستقبال فقط."},"prompt":{"en":"What should I change?","ar":"ماذا أغيّر حتى يعرف الأعضاء أنهم يستطيعون الحجز من التطبيق؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Classes","ar":"الحصص"}},"tabbar":{"active":1,"items":[{"icon":"house","text":{"en":"Home","ar":"الرئيسية"}},{"icon":"calendar","text":{"en":"Classes","ar":"الحصص"}},{"icon":"user","text":{"en":"Me","ar":"حسابي"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"card","art":"gym","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Yoga · Mon 19:00","ar":"يوغا · الاثنين 19:00"}},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"6 places left","ar":"6 أماكن متبقية"},"gap":"xs"}]},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"barbell","text":{"en":"Boxing · Tue 18:00","ar":"ملاكمة · الثلاثاء 18:00"},"sub":{"en":"2 places left","ar":"مكانان متبقيان"},"gap":"s"}],"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"}},"options":[{"id":"poster","text":{"en":"Put a poster in the gym: \"Swipe right to book\"","ar":"علّق لافتة في النادي: «اسحب لليمين للحجز»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Classes","ar":"الحصص"}},"tabbar":{"active":1,"items":[{"icon":"house","text":{"en":"Home","ar":"الرئيسية"}},{"icon":"calendar","text":{"en":"Classes","ar":"الحصص"}},{"icon":"user","text":{"en":"Me","ar":"حسابي"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"card","art":"gym","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Yoga · Mon 19:00","ar":"يوغا · الاثنين 19:00"}},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"6 places left","ar":"6 أماكن متبقية"},"gap":"xs"}]},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"barbell","text":{"en":"Boxing · Tue 18:00","ar":"ملاكمة · الثلاثاء 18:00"},"sub":{"en":"2 places left","ar":"مكانان متبقيان"},"gap":"s"}],"caption":{"en":"Unchanged","ar":"بدون تغيير"}}},{"id":"arrow","text":{"en":"Add a small → arrow on each card","ar":"أضف سهمًا صغيرًا → على كل بطاقة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Classes","ar":"الحصص"}},"tabbar":{"active":1,"items":[{"icon":"house","text":{"en":"Home","ar":"الرئيسية"}},{"icon":"calendar","text":{"en":"Classes","ar":"الحصص"}},{"icon":"user","text":{"en":"Me","ar":"حسابي"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"card","art":"gym","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Yoga · Mon 19:00  →","ar":"يوغا · الاثنين 19:00  ←"}},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"6 places left","ar":"6 أماكن متبقية"},"gap":"xs"}]},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"barbell","text":{"en":"Boxing · Tue 18:00","ar":"ملاكمة · الثلاثاء 18:00"},"sub":{"en":"2 places left","ar":"مكانان متبقيان"},"gap":"s","chevron":true}],"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}},{"id":"book","text":{"en":"Add a \"Book\" button on each card, and keep the swipe as a shortcut","ar":"أضف زر «احجز» على كل بطاقة، وأبقِ السحب كطريق مختصر"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Classes","ar":"الحصص"}},"tabbar":{"active":1,"items":[{"icon":"house","text":{"en":"Home","ar":"الرئيسية"}},{"icon":"calendar","text":{"en":"Classes","ar":"الحصص"}},{"icon":"user","text":{"en":"Me","ar":"حسابي"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"card","art":"gym","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Yoga · Mon 19:00","ar":"يوغا · الاثنين 19:00"}},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"6 places left","ar":"6 أماكن متبقية"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Book","ar":"احجز"},"gap":"s"}]},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"barbell","text":{"en":"Boxing · Tue 18:00","ar":"ملاكمة · الثلاثاء 18:00"},"sub":{"en":"2 places left","ar":"مكانان متبقيان"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Book","ar":"احجز"},"style":"outline","gap":"xs"}],"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}}],"answer":["book"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-044","when":["poster","arrow"],"feedback":{"en":"Members still have to swipe, and some can't. A button shows the action and works with one tap.","ar":"ما زال على الأعضاء أن يسحبوا، وبعضهم لا يستطيع. أما الزر فيُظهر الإجراء ويعمل بضغطة واحدة."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. The main action is a button people can see.","ar":"صحيح. الإجراء الأساسي زر يراه الناس."},"explain":{"en":"A gesture can be a shortcut. The way everyone uses must be visible.","ar":"الإيماءة (Gesture) يمكن أن تكون طريقًا مختصرًا. أما الطريقة التي يستخدمها الجميع فيجب أن تكون ظاهرة."}},{"id":"S02","type":"choose","skill":"SK-P05-U05-01","part":"retest","speaker":"rami","value":{"en":"Re-test. Drag–and–Drop (NN/g): drag–and–drop is usually mouse or touch only, but making it accessible is possible and necessary.","ar":"إعادة اختبار. السحب والإفلات (NN/g): الجرّ والإفلات عادة بالماوس أو اللمس فقط، لكن جعله متاحًا ممكن وضروري."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/drag-drop/","quote":"Drag–and–drop is traditionally a mouse or touchscreen-only interaction, but making it accessible for people that use assistive technologies is both completely possible and necessary."},"scenario":{"en":"I'm designing a task board with three columns: To do, Doing, Done. The only way to move a task is to drag it to another column.","ar":"أصمّم لوحة مهام فيها ثلاثة أعمدة: للتنفيذ، قيد التنفيذ، تم. والطريقة الوحيدة لنقل مهمة هي جرّها (Drag) إلى عمود آخر."},"prompt":{"en":"What should I add?","ar":"ماذا أضيف حتى يستطيع مستخدمو لوحة المفاتيح وقارئ الشاشة نقل المهام؟"},"options":[{"id":"move","text":{"en":"A \"Move to…\" option in each task's menu","ar":"خيار «انقل إلى…» في قائمة كل مهمة"}},{"id":"shadow","text":{"en":"A shadow on tasks, so they look draggable","ar":"ظل على المهام، لتبدو قابلة للجرّ"}},{"id":"wide","text":{"en":"Wider columns, so tasks are easier to drop","ar":"أعمدة أعرض، ليسهل إسقاط المهام فيها"}}],"answer":["move"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-045","when":["shadow","wide"],"feedback":{"en":"Both help people who can drag. Someone using a keyboard or a screen reader still can't move a task.","ar":"الاثنان يساعدان من يستطيع الجرّ. أما من يستخدم لوحة المفاتيح أو قارئ الشاشة فما زال لا يستطيع نقل مهمة."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. A menu works without dragging.","ar":"صحيح. القائمة تعمل بدون جرّ."},"explain":{"en":"Keep dragging, and add a way that works with taps, keys and screen readers.","ar":"أبقِ الجرّ، وأضف طريقة تعمل بالضغط ولوحة المفاتيح وقارئ الشاشة."}},{"id":"S03","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P05-U05-02","part":"retest","speaker":"youssef","value":{"en":"Re-test. Contextual Swipe (NN/g): make the undo option highly visible, so people don't have to look for it.","ar":"إعادة اختبار. السحب لإظهار الإجراءات (NN/g): اجعل خيار التراجع ظاهرًا جدًا، حتى لا يضطر الناس للبحث عنه."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/contextual-swipe/","quote":"Make sure that the undo option is highly salient on the screen, so people won’t have to look for it."},"scenario":{"en":"In my shop app, swiping a cart item removes it. To bring it back, you open ⋯ › History › Removed items.","ar":"في تطبيق متجري، سحب منتج في السلة يحذفه. ولإرجاعه، تفتح ⋯ ‹ السجل ‹ المنتجات المحذوفة."},"prompt":{"en":"How should undo work?","ar":"كيف يجب أن يعمل التراجع (Undo) حتى يُرجع العميل المنتج بسهولة؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Cart","ar":"السلة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"wallet","text":{"en":"Leather wallet","ar":"محفظة جلد"},"sub":{"en":"450 EGP","ar":"450 جنيه"},"swipe":{"text":{"en":"Remove","ar":"احذف"},"tone":"bad"}},{"kind":"listitem","art":"earbuds","text":{"en":"Wireless earbuds","ar":"سماعات لاسلكية"},"sub":{"en":"1,450 EGP","ar":"1,450 جنيه"}}],"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"}},"options":[{"id":"keep","text":{"en":"Keep it in History; it's there if people need it","ar":"يبقى التراجع في السجل؛ فهو موجود إن احتاجه الناس"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Cart","ar":"السلة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"wallet","text":{"en":"Leather wallet","ar":"محفظة جلد"},"sub":{"en":"450 EGP","ar":"450 جنيه"},"swipe":{"text":{"en":"Remove","ar":"احذف"},"tone":"bad"}},{"kind":"listitem","art":"earbuds","text":{"en":"Wireless earbuds","ar":"سماعات لاسلكية"},"sub":{"en":"1,450 EGP","ar":"1,450 جنيه"}}],"caption":{"en":"Unchanged","ar":"بدون تغيير"}}},{"id":"bar","text":{"en":"Show \"Wallet removed · Undo\" right after the swipe","ar":"اعرض «تم حذف المحفظة · تراجع» بعد السحب مباشرة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Cart","ar":"السلة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","art":"earbuds","text":{"en":"Wireless earbuds","ar":"سماعات لاسلكية"},"sub":{"en":"1,450 EGP","ar":"1,450 جنيه"}}],"overlay":{"type":"toast","blocks":[{"kind":"row","blocks":[{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"Wallet removed","ar":"تم حذف المحفظة"}},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Undo","ar":"تراجع"},"style":"plain"}]}]},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}},{"id":"email","text":{"en":"Email the customer a list of removed items","ar":"أرسل للعميل بريدًا بقائمة المنتجات المحذوفة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Cart","ar":"السلة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","art":"earbuds","text":{"en":"Wireless earbuds","ar":"سماعات لاسلكية"},"sub":{"en":"1,450 EGP","ar":"1,450 جنيه"}}],"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}}],"answer":["bar"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-046","when":["keep","email"],"feedback":{"en":"Undo only helps if people see it at the moment of the slip. Few will dig through menus or emails.","ar":"التراجع يفيد فقط إذا رآه الناس لحظة الخطأ. وقليلون سيبحثون في القوائم أو البريد."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Undo where the slip happened.","ar":"صحيح. التراجع في مكان الخطأ."},"explain":{"en":"A good undo is right in front of people, with the item's name, the moment they need it.","ar":"التراجع الجيد أمام الناس مباشرة، مع اسم المنتج، في اللحظة التي يحتاجونه فيها."}},{"id":"S04","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P05-U05-02","part":"retest","speaker":"nour","value":{"en":"Re-test. Contextual Swipe (NN/g): ask for confirmation before completing a destructive action, and keep the item visible.","ar":"إعادة اختبار. السحب لإظهار الإجراءات (NN/g): اطلب التأكيد قبل إتمام إجراء يحذف شيئًا، وأبقِ العنصر ظاهرًا."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/contextual-swipe/","quote":"Ask for confirmation before completing a destructive action."},"scenario":{"en":"In our clinic app, a full swipe on an appointment cancels it at once. A cancelled slot goes to another patient within minutes.","ar":"في تطبيق عيادتنا، السحب الكامل على موعد يلغيه فورًا. والموعد الملغي يذهب لمريض آخر خلال دقائق."},"prompt":{"en":"What should the swipe do?","ar":"ماذا يجب أن يفعل السحب حتى لا يخسر المريض موعده بالخطأ؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"My appointments","ar":"مواعيدي"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","avatar":{"text":"Salma Adel","art":"doctor"},"text":{"en":"Tue 10:30 · Dr. Salma","ar":"الثلاثاء 10:30 · د. سلمى"},"sub":{"en":"Children's doctor","ar":"طبيبة أطفال"},"swipe":{"text":{"en":"Cancel","ar":"إلغاء"},"tone":"bad"}},{"kind":"listitem","avatar":{"text":"Karim Nabil","art":"man-1"},"text":{"en":"Thu 17:00 · Dr. Karim","ar":"الخميس 17:00 · د. كريم"},"sub":{"en":"Dentist","ar":"طبيب أسنان"}}],"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"}},"options":[{"id":"sound","text":{"en":"Cancel at once and play a sound","ar":"يلغي فورًا ويشغّل صوتًا"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"My appointments","ar":"مواعيدي"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","avatar":{"text":"Karim Nabil","art":"man-1"},"text":{"en":"Thu 17:00 · Dr. Karim","ar":"الخميس 17:00 · د. كريم"},"sub":{"en":"Dentist","ar":"طبيب أسنان"}}],"overlay":{"type":"toast","blocks":[{"kind":"icon","icon":"speaker-high","size":"s"},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"(a sound plays)","ar":"(يُسمع صوت)"}}]},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}},{"id":"hide","text":{"en":"Cancel at once and hide the appointment","ar":"يلغي فورًا ويُخفي الموعد"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"My appointments","ar":"مواعيدي"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","avatar":{"text":"Karim Nabil","art":"man-1"},"text":{"en":"Thu 17:00 · Dr. Karim","ar":"الخميس 17:00 · د. كريم"},"sub":{"en":"Dentist","ar":"طبيب أسنان"}}],"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}},{"id":"confirm","text":{"en":"Show \"Cancel Tue 10:30 with Dr. Salma?\" with Yes and No","ar":"يعرض «إلغاء موعد الثلاثاء 10:30 مع د. سلمى؟» مع «نعم» و«لا»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"My appointments","ar":"مواعيدي"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","avatar":{"text":"Salma Adel","art":"doctor"},"text":{"en":"Tue 10:30 · Dr. Salma","ar":"الثلاثاء 10:30 · د. سلمى"},"sub":{"en":"Children's doctor","ar":"طبيبة أطفال"},"swipe":{"text":{"en":"Cancel","ar":"إلغاء"},"tone":"bad"}},{"kind":"listitem","avatar":{"text":"Karim Nabil","art":"man-1"},"text":{"en":"Thu 17:00 · Dr. Karim","ar":"الخميس 17:00 · د. كريم"},"sub":{"en":"Dentist","ar":"طبيب أسنان"}}],"overlay":{"type":"dialog","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Cancel Tue 10:30 with Dr. Salma?","ar":"إلغاء موعد الثلاثاء 10:30 مع د. سلمى؟"}},{"kind":"row","gap":"m","blocks":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"No","ar":"لا"},"style":"plain"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Yes","ar":"نعم"},"style":"danger"}]}]},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}}],"answer":["confirm"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-046","when":["sound","hide"],"feedback":{"en":"Here a slip can't be undone: the slot goes to someone else. So ask first, and name the appointment.","ar":"هنا لا يمكن التراجع عن الخطأ: الموعد يذهب لغيره. فاسأل أولًا، واذكر الموعد."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. When undo isn't possible, ask first.","ar":"صحيح. حين لا يمكن التراجع، اسأل أولًا."},"explain":{"en":"Use undo for small, repeated deletes. For a loss that can't be reversed, confirm, and show exactly what will be lost.","ar":"استخدم التراجع للحذف الصغير المتكرّر. أما الخسارة التي لا يمكن التراجع عنها، فاطلب تأكيدًا، وأظهر بالضبط ما سيضيع."}},{"id":"S05","type":"choose","skill":"SK-P05-U05-03","part":"retest","speaker":"sara","value":{"en":"Re-test. Animation Duration (NN/g): be cautious with parallax or scroll-jacking animations; they are often frustrating, dizzying and annoying.","ar":"إعادة اختبار. مدة الحركة (NN/g): احذر من حركة الخلفية والتحكّم في التمرير؛ فهي كثيرًا مُحبطة ومُسبّبة للدوار ومزعجة."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/animation-duration/","quote":"Be cautious with parallax or scroll-jacking animations, as these are frequently frustrating, dizzying, and annoying."},"scenario":{"en":"I'm designing a bank's landing page. As you scroll, the page zooms into a coin that spins and grows. A customer with \"Reduce motion\" on opens it.","ar":"أصمّم صفحة الهبوط (Landing page) لبنك. وأنت تمرّر، تقترب الصورة من عملة تدور وتكبر. ويفتحها عميل فعّل «تقليل الحركة» في هاتفه."},"prompt":{"en":"What should this customer get?","ar":"ماذا يجب أن يرى هذا العميل؟"},"options":[{"id":"still","text":{"en":"A normal page that scrolls, with a still picture of the coin","ar":"صفحة عادية تتمرّر، مع صورة ثابتة للعملة"}},{"id":"half","text":{"en":"The same zoom, but the coin doesn't spin","ar":"نفس الاقتراب، لكن العملة لا تدور"}},{"id":"warn","text":{"en":"A warning first: \"This page has motion\"","ar":"تحذير أولًا: «هذه الصفحة فيها حركة»"}}],"answer":["still"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-047","when":["half","warn"],"feedback":{"en":"The scroll effect is still there. The customer already said no motion; give a calm page.","ar":"تأثير التمرير ما زال موجودًا. والعميل قال بالفعل لا للحركة؛ فأعطه صفحة هادئة."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Scrolling just scrolls.","ar":"صحيح. التمرير يحرّك الصفحة فقط."},"explain":{"en":"With \"Reduce motion\" on, scroll should move the page and nothing else.","ar":"حين يكون «تقليل الحركة» مفعّلًا، يجب أن يحرّك التمرير الصفحة ولا شيء غيرها."}},{"id":"S06","type":"choose","skill":"SK-P05-U05-03","part":"retest","speaker":"tarek","value":{"en":"Re-test. Animation Duration (NN/g): hard cuts between colours or flashing can trigger seizures in people with epilepsy.","ar":"إعادة اختبار. مدة الحركة (NN/g): التبديل الحاد بين الألوان أو الوميض قد يسبّب نوبات لمرضى الصرع."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/animation-duration/","quote":"animations with hard cuts between colors or flashing can trigger seizures in epileptic users."},"scenario":{"en":"While an order is processing, our pharmacy app's screen flashes between white and green to show it's working.","ar":"أثناء تنفيذ الطلب، تومض شاشة تطبيق الصيدلية بين الأبيض والأخضر لتُظهر أنها تعمل."},"prompt":{"en":"What should we use instead?","ar":"ماذا نستخدم بدل الوميض لنُظهر أن الطلب قيد التنفيذ؟"},"options":[{"id":"slower","text":{"en":"The same flash, but twice as slow","ar":"نفس الوميض، لكن أبطأ مرتين"}},{"id":"bar","text":{"en":"A steady progress bar with \"Sending your order…\"","ar":"شريط تقدّم ثابت مع «جارٍ إرسال طلبك…»"}},{"id":"soft","text":{"en":"Flash between two softer greens","ar":"وميض بين لونين أخضرين أهدأ"}}],"answer":["bar"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-048","when":["slower","soft"],"feedback":{"en":"It still flashes over the whole screen. That's a seizure risk; remove it.","ar":"ما زالت الشاشة كلها تومض. وهذا قد يسبّب نوبات صرع؛ فأزِله."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Show progress without flashing.","ar":"صحيح. أظهر التقدّم بدون وميض."},"explain":{"en":"Flashing is a safety risk for everyone, not a style choice.","ar":"الوميض خطر على سلامة الناس، وليس مجرد اختيار في الشكل."}},{"id":"S07","type":"choose","skill":"SK-P05-U05-04","part":"retest","speaker":"karim","value":{"en":"Re-test. Animation Duration (NN/g): it is far more common for animations to be too long than too short. Small feedback should take about 100 ms.","ar":"إعادة اختبار. مدة الحركة (NN/g): الحركات تكون طويلة أكثر بكثير من أن تكون قصيرة. والاستجابة الصغيرة يجب أن تأخذ نحو 100 ms."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/animation-duration/","quote":"It is far more common for animations to be too long than too short."},"scenario":{"en":"In a to-do app I'm building, ticking a checkbox draws the ✓ slowly, in 600 ms. People tick many items in a row.","ar":"في تطبيق مهام أبنيه، الضغط على الـ Checkbox يرسم ✓ ببطء، في 600 ms. والناس يضعون علامات على عناصر كثيرة متتالية."},"prompt":{"en":"How long should the tick take?","ar":"كم يجب أن تستغرق حركة العلامة حتى لا تُبطئ الناس؟"},"options":[{"id":"keep","text":{"en":"Keep 600 ms; it feels satisfying","ar":"تبقى 600 ms؛ فهي ممتعة"}},{"id":"mid","text":{"en":"About 400 ms, a little faster","ar":"نحو 400 ms، أسرع قليلًا"}},{"id":"fast","text":{"en":"About 100 ms","ar":"نحو 100 ms"}}],"answer":["fast"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-049","when":["keep","mid"],"feedback":{"en":"A tick is tiny feedback. At about 100 ms it feels instant; anything longer slows down every tick.","ar":"العلامة استجابة صغيرة جدًا. عند نحو 100 ms تبدو فورية؛ وأي مدة أطول تُبطئ كل علامة."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Tiny feedback, about 100 ms.","ar":"صحيح. استجابة صغيرة، نحو 100 ms."},"explain":{"en":"When in doubt, go shorter. Small feedback should feel like it happens under your finger.","ar":"حين تتردّد، اختر الأقصر. والاستجابة الصغيرة يجب أن تبدو كأنها تحدث تحت إصبعك."}},{"id":"S08","type":"choose","skill":"SK-P05-U05-04","part":"retest","speaker":"mona","value":{"en":"Re-test. Animation Duration (NN/g): at 500 ms, animations start to feel like a real drag; they become cumbersome and annoying.","ar":"إعادة اختبار. مدة الحركة (NN/g): عند 500 ms تبدأ الحركات تبدو ثقيلة فعلًا؛ وتصبح مُرهقة ومزعجة."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/animation-duration/","quote":"At 500ms, animations start to feel like a real drag for users — they become cumbersome and annoying."},"scenario":{"en":"I'm writing our design system's motion rules. A designer suggests: \"Every screen change takes 600 ms, so it all feels calm.\"","ar":"أكتب قواعد الحركة في نظام التصميم عندنا. واقترح مصمّم: «كل تغيير شاشة يأخذ 600 ms، ليبدو كل شيء هادئًا.»"},"prompt":{"en":"What rule should we write?","ar":"أي قاعدة نكتب حتى تبدو الحركة سريعة وتُظهر ما تغيّر؟"},"options":[{"id":"six","text":{"en":"Accept 600 ms for everything","ar":"نقبل 600 ms لكل شيء"}},{"id":"none","text":{"en":"No animation at all, anywhere","ar":"بلا أي حركة، في أي مكان"}},{"id":"range","text":{"en":"Small feedback about 100 ms; big panels about 200 to 300 ms","ar":"الاستجابة الصغيرة نحو 100 ms؛ واللوحات الكبيرة نحو 200 إلى 300 ms"}}],"answer":["range"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-049","when":["six"],"feedback":{"en":"600 ms is past the point where animations feel slow, and the whole product would feel sluggish.","ar":"600 ms أطول من الحد الذي تبدو بعده الحركة بطيئة، وسيبدو المنتج كله ثقيلًا."}},{"id":"MC-P05-049","when":["none"],"feedback":{"en":"Short animations help people notice what changed. The fix is shorter, not none.","ar":"الحركات القصيرة تساعد الناس على ملاحظة ما تغيّر. والحل أن تكون أقصر، لا أن تختفي."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Short, and sized to the change.","ar":"صحيح. قصيرة، وعلى قدر التغيير."},"explain":{"en":"Match the time to the size of the change, and stay under 500 ms.","ar":"اجعل الوقت على قدر حجم التغيير، وابقَ تحت 500 ms."}},{"id":"S09","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P05-U05-05","part":"retest","speaker":"hana","value":{"en":"Re-test. Auto-Forwarding (NN/g): moving UI elements reduce accessibility, especially for people with motor issues who can't click something before it's taken away.","ar":"إعادة اختبار. التقدّم التلقائي (NN/g): العناصر المتحرّكة تقلّل الإتاحة، خاصة لمن عنده مشكلة في الحركة ولا يستطيع الضغط على شيء قبل أن يختفي."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/auto-forwarding/","quote":"Moving UI elements usually reduce accessibility, particularly for users with motor skill issues who have difficulty clicking something before it's taken away."},"scenario":{"en":"Our website has a news line that scrolls across the top: \"Yoga moves to 20:00 · See new times · Pool closed Friday…\"","ar":"في موقعنا سطر أخبار يتحرّك أعلى الصفحة: «اليوغا تنتقل إلى 20:00 · شاهد المواعيد الجديدة · المسبح مغلق الجمعة…»"},"prompt":{"en":"How should we show this news?","ar":"كيف نعرض هذه الأخبار حتى يقرأها الأعضاء ويضغطوا رابطها بسهولة؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"nashat.example","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Classes","ar":"الحصص"},{"en":"Prices","ar":"الأسعار"}],"actions":[{"icon":"user"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"banner","tone":"info","icon":"megaphone","text":{"en":"Yoga moves to 20:00 · See new times · Pool closed Friday…","ar":"اليوغا تنتقل إلى 20:00 · شاهد المواعيد الجديدة · المسبح مغلق الجمعة…"},"note":{"en":"Scrolls across all the time","ar":"يتحرّك عبر الشاشة طوال الوقت"}},{"kind":"image","art":"gym","gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Book your free trial","ar":"احجز حصتك التجريبية المجانية"},"gap":"s"}],"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"}},"options":[{"id":"slow","text":{"en":"Keep the moving line, but slower","ar":"أبقِ السطر المتحرّك، لكن أبطأ"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"nashat.example","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Classes","ar":"الحصص"},{"en":"Prices","ar":"الأسعار"}],"actions":[{"icon":"user"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"banner","tone":"info","icon":"megaphone","text":{"en":"Yoga moves to 20:00 · See new times · Pool closed Friday…","ar":"اليوغا تنتقل إلى 20:00 · شاهد المواعيد الجديدة · المسبح مغلق الجمعة…"},"note":{"en":"Scrolls across, more slowly","ar":"يتحرّك عبر الشاشة، أبطأ"}},{"kind":"image","art":"gym","gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Book your free trial","ar":"احجز حصتك التجريبية المجانية"},"gap":"s"}],"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}},{"id":"still","text":{"en":"A still notice box with each item and a \"See new times\" link","ar":"صندوق تنبيه ثابت فيه كل خبر ورابط «شاهد المواعيد الجديدة»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"nashat.example","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Classes","ar":"الحصص"},{"en":"Prices","ar":"الأسعار"}],"actions":[{"icon":"user"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"card","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"News","ar":"أخبار"}},{"kind":"list","style":"bullet","gap":"xs","items":[{"en":"Yoga moves to 20:00","ar":"اليوغا تنتقل إلى 20:00"},{"en":"Pool closed Friday","ar":"المسبح مغلق الجمعة"}]},{"kind":"link","text":{"en":"See new times","ar":"شاهد المواعيد الجديدة"},"gap":"xs"}]},{"kind":"image","art":"gym","gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Book your free trial","ar":"احجز حصتك التجريبية المجانية"},"gap":"s"}],"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}},{"id":"hover","text":{"en":"Keep it moving, and stop it when the mouse is over it","ar":"أبقِه متحرّكًا، وأوقفه حين يكون الماوس فوقه"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"nashat.example","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Classes","ar":"الحصص"},{"en":"Prices","ar":"الأسعار"}],"actions":[{"icon":"user"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"banner","tone":"info","icon":"megaphone","text":{"en":"Yoga moves to 20:00 · See new times · Pool closed Friday…","ar":"اليوغا تنتقل إلى 20:00 · شاهد المواعيد الجديدة · المسبح مغلق الجمعة…"},"note":{"en":"Scrolls across; stops under the mouse","ar":"يتحرّك عبر الشاشة؛ ويتوقّف تحت الماوس"}},{"kind":"image","art":"gym","gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Book your free trial","ar":"احجز حصتك التجريبية المجانية"},"gap":"s"}],"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}}],"answer":["still"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-051","when":["slow","hover"],"feedback":{"en":"The link still moves. Members with shaky hands, or on a phone with no mouse, may never catch it.","ar":"الرابط ما زال يتحرّك. والأعضاء الذين تهتزّ أيديهم، أو من يستخدمون الهاتف بلا ماوس، قد لا يلحقونه أبدًا."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Still text is easy to read and tap.","ar":"صحيح. النص الثابت سهل القراءة والضغط."},"explain":{"en":"Anything people need to read or tap should stay still.","ar":"كل ما يحتاج الناس قراءته أو الضغط عليه يجب أن يبقى ثابتًا."}},{"id":"S10","type":"choose","skill":"SK-P05-U05-05","part":"retest","speaker":"rami","value":{"en":"Re-test. Auto-Forwarding (NN/g): people reading in a second language read more slowly, so they can't understand a panel shown only briefly.","ar":"إعادة اختبار. التقدّم التلقائي (NN/g): من يقرأ بلغة غير لغته الأم يقرأ ببطء أكثر، فلا يفهم شريحة تظهر لوقت قصير."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/auto-forwarding/","quote":"International users also read more slowly if your site is not in their native language, and thus they won't be able to understand a panel if it's displayed only briefly."},"scenario":{"en":"Our travel app's offers move to the next one every 3 seconds. Many of our users are tourists reading in English as a second language.","ar":"عروض تطبيق السفر عندنا تنتقل إلى العرض التالي كل 3 ثوانٍ. وكثير من مستخدمينا سيّاح يقرؤون بالإنجليزية كلغة ثانية."},"prompt":{"en":"What should I change?","ar":"ماذا يجب أن أغيّر؟"},"options":[{"id":"short","text":{"en":"Shorten the text on each offer","ar":"اختصر النص في كل عرض"}},{"id":"five","text":{"en":"Move every 5 seconds instead","ar":"اجعل العروض تنتقل كل 5 ثوانٍ بدلًا من ذلك"}},{"id":"user","text":{"en":"Move only when people tap or swipe, and show where they are: 1 of 4","ar":"اجعل العروض تنتقل فقط حين يضغط الناس أو يسحبوا، وأظهر أين هم: 1 من 4"}}],"answer":["user"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P05-051","when":["short","five"],"feedback":{"en":"Any timer is too fast for someone. Let each reader decide when to move on.","ar":"أي وقت محدّد سيكون سريعًا على أحدهم. دع كل قارئ يقرّر متى ينتقل."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. The reader sets the pace.","ar":"صحيح. القارئ يحدّد السرعة."},"explain":{"en":"People read at different speeds. Content that waits works for all of them.","ar":"الناس يقرؤون بسرعات مختلفة. والمحتوى الذي ينتظر القارئ يناسبهم كلهم."}}]}$uxg$::jsonb),
  ($uxg$P10-U01-B01$uxg$, $uxg$3765ff39afe15a79209241642d33ff8bf217364bf45abdd65c5c4524f2b02d83$uxg$, $uxg${"id":"P10-U01-B01","mode":"bank","title":{"en":"Re-tests: put the decision first","ar":"إعادة اختبار: ضع القرار أولًا"},"steps":[{"id":"S01","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P10-U01-01","part":"retest","speaker":"tarek","value":{"en":"Re-test, page order (NN/g): reserve the top of the page for high-priority content. Yara decides by the showtimes, so they come before Buy and before the club banner.","ar":"إعادة اختبار، ترتيب الصفحة (NN/g): خصّص أعلى الصفحة للمحتوى الأهم. تقرّر يارا حسب مواعيد العرض، فتأتي قبل زر الشراء وقبل إعلان النادي."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/scrolling-and-attention/","quote":"Reserve the top of the page for high-priority content"},"scenario":{"en":"In the cinema app I manage, Yara wants to see the film The Last Lighthouse tonight, but only in a showing that starts after 20:00. She opens the film page on her phone.","ar":"في تطبيق السينما الذي أديره، تريد يارا مشاهدة فيلم «المنارة الأخيرة» الليلة، لكن فقط في عرض يبدأ بعد الساعة 20:00. وتفتح صفحة الفيلم من هاتفها."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each order. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل ترتيب. أيّ ترتيب يجعل يارا تعرف أولًا هل يوجد عرض بعد الساعة 20:00؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"shasha","name":{"en":"Shasha","ar":"شاشة"},"color":"#BE185D","icon":"film-strip","domain":"shasha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Showtimes","ar":"مواعيد العرض"},"back":true},"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"},"height":400,"blocks":[{"kind":"banner","text":{"en":"Join the Film Club: 2 tickets for 1 on Mondays","ar":"انضم إلى نادي الأفلام: تذكرتان بسعر واحدة أيام الاثنين"}},{"kind":"image","art":"city-night","size":"l","text":{"en":"Trailer: The Last Lighthouse","ar":"الإعلان التشويقي: المنارة الأخيرة"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"The Last Lighthouse","ar":"المنارة الأخيرة"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Buy tickets","ar":"اشترِ التذاكر"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"T