، دون الساعات"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Today","ar":"اليوم"}},"blocks":[{"kind":"card","blocks":[{"kind":"badge","icon":"sparkle","text":{"en":"Tip","ar":"نصيحة"}},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Take an easy day.","ar":"خذ يومًا خفيفًا."}}]},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"person-simple-walk","text":{"en":"Light walk · 30 min","ar":"مشي خفيف · 30 دقيقة"},"gap":"s"}],"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}}],"answer":["source"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P12-022","when":["remove","vague"],"feedback":{"en":"The tip is useful. Members only need to know where the data came from, and how to turn it off.","ar":"النصيحة مفيدة. والأعضاء يحتاجون فقط أن يعرفوا من أين جاءت البيانات، وكيف يوقفون استخدامها."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Name the source, keep the tip.","ar":"صحيح. اذكر المصدر، واحتفظ بالنصيحة."},"explain":{"en":"A short source line turns \"how do you know?\" into \"oh, my watch\".","ar":"سطر قصير عن المصدر يحوّل «كيف عرفت؟» إلى «آه، من ساعتي»."}},{"id":"S04","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P12-U03-02","part":"retest","speaker":"tarek","value":{"en":"Re-test. Explainability + Trust (People + AI): explain whether results are personal to one person, or based on data from all users.","ar":"إعادة اختبار. قابلية الشرح والثقة (People + AI): وضّح هل النتائج شخصية لفرد واحد، أم مبنية على بيانات كل المستخدمين."},"ref":{"url":"https://pair.withgoogle.com/chapter/explainability-trust/","quote":"Reach. Explain whether the system is personalized to one user or device, or if it is using aggregated data across all users."},"scenario":{"en":"Our grocery app has a row called \"For you\". It actually shows what people in your area buy most. A single man saw baby food there and asked why.","ar":"تطبيق البقالة عندنا فيه صفّ اسمه «مقترح لك». وهو في الحقيقة يعرض أكثر ما يشتريه الناس في منطقتك. ورأى رجل أعزب طعام أطفال فيه وسأل لماذا."},"prompt":{"en":