aemoglobin","ar":"الهيموجلوبين"},"13.1","12–16"]]}],"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}},{"id":"all","text":{"en":"A table of all 24 values, with their medical names","ar":"جدول بكل القيم الـ 24، بأسمائها الطبية"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Lab results","ar":"نتائج التحاليل"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"table","gap":"s","head":[{"en":"Test","ar":"التحليل"},{"en":"Result","ar":"النتيجة"},{"en":"Normal","ar":"الطبيعي"}],"rows":[[{"en":"Fasting plasma glucose (FPG)","ar":"جلوكوز البلازما الصائم (FPG)"},"108","70–100"],[{"en":"Haemoglobin (Hb)","ar":"الهيموجلوبين (Hb)"},"13.1","12–16"],[{"en":"Mean corpuscular volume (MCV)","ar":"متوسط حجم الكريّة (MCV)"},"88","80–100"],[{"en":"Alanine aminotransferase (ALT)","ar":"ناقلة أمين الألانين (ALT)"},"22","7–56"],[{"en":"Thyroid-stimulating hormone (TSH)","ar":"الهرمون المنبّه للغدة الدرقية (TSH)"},"2.1","0.4–4.0"]]},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"+ 19 more values","ar":"+ 19 قيمة أخرى"},"color":"muted","gap":"xs"}],"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}}],"answer":["why"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P12-024","when":["fine"],"feedback":{"en":"\"Fine\" hides the one value she should know about. With health, say what's off and who will check it.","ar":"«جيدة» تُخفي القيمة الوحيدة التي يجب أن تعرفها. وفي الصحة، قل ما الذي خرج عن الطبيعي ومن سيراجعه."}},{"id":"MC-P12-021","when":["all"],"feedback":{"en":"24 medical names bury the one thing that matters. Lead with it in plain words.","ar":"24 اسمًا طبيًا تُخفي الشيء الوحيد المهم. ابدأ به بكلمات بسيطة."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Name what matters, and who checks it.","ar":"صحيح. اذكر المهم، ومن يراجعه."},"explain":{"en":"High stakes need the detail that matters, plus a person to check.","ar":"حين يكون الخطر كبيرًا، اذكر التفصيل المهم، ومن سيراجعه."}},{"id":"S07","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P12-U03-04","part":"retest","speaker":"rami","value":{"en":"Re-test. Explainability + Trust (People + AI): confidence displays risk being distracting, or worse, misunderstood.","ar":"إعادة اختبار. قابلية الشرح والثقة (People + AI): عرض درجة الثقة قد يشتّت الانتباه، أو الأسوأ، يُفهم خطأ."},"ref":{"url":"https://pair.withgoogle.com/chapter/explainability-trust/","quote":"There’s always a risk that confidence displays will be distracting, or worse, misinterpreted."},"scenario":{"en":"I'm designing a menu translation app. It shows a score next to every line: \"Grilled fish · 91.4%\". People skip the scores, and the menu is hard to read.","ar":"أصمّم تطبيقًا لترجمة قوائم الطعام. يعرض درجة بجانب كل سطر: «سمك مشوي · 91.4%». والناس يتجاهلون الدرجات، والقائمة صعبة القراءة."},"prompt":{"en":"What should we change?","ar":"ماذا يجب أن نغيّر؟"},"mock":{"app":{"name":{"en":"Tarjim Lens","ar":"عدسة ترجم"},"color":"#0F766E","icon":"translate","domain":"tarjim.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Menu · translated","ar":"القائمة · مترجمة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","text":{"en":"Grilled fish · 91.4%","ar":"سمك مشوي · 91.4%"}},{"kind":"listitem","text":{"en":"Stuffed vine leaves · 67.2%","ar":"ورق عنب محشي · 67.2%"}},{"kind":"listitem","text":{"en":"Lamb with freekeh · 88.9%","ar":"لحم ضأن بالفريك · 88.9%"}}],"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"}},"options":[{"id":"keep","text":{"en":"Keep the scores; more information is always better","ar":"نُبقي الدرجات؛ فالمعلومات الأكثر أفضل دائمًا"},"mock":{"app":{"name":{"en":"Tarjim Lens","ar":"عدسة ترجم"},"color":"#0F766E","icon":"translate","domain":"tarjim.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Menu · translated","ar":"القائمة · مترجمة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","text":{"en":"Grilled fish · 91.4%","ar":"سمك مشوي · 91.4%"}},{"kind":"listitem","text":{"en":"Stuffed vine leaves · 67.2%","ar":"ورق عنب محشي · 67.2%"}},{"kind":"listitem","text":{"en":"Lamb with freekeh · 88.9%","ar":"لحم ضأن بالفريك · 88.9%"}}],"caption":{"en":"Unchanged","ar":"بدون تغيير"}}},{"id":"bigger","text":{"en":"Make the scores bigger, so people notice them","ar":"نكبّر الدرجات، ليلاحظها الناس"},"mock":{"app":{"name":{"en":"Tarjim Lens","ar":"عدسة ترجم"},"color":"#0F766E","icon":"translate","domain":"tarjim.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Menu · translated","ar":"القائمة · مترجمة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","text":{"en":"Grilled fish","ar":"سمك مشوي"},"value":{"en":"**91.4%**","ar":"**91.4%**"}},{"kind":"listitem","text":{"en":"Stuffed vine leaves","ar":"ورق عنب محشي"},"value":{"en":"**67.2%**","ar":"**67.2%**"}},{"kind":"listitem","text":{"en":"Lamb with freekeh","ar":"لحم ضأن بالفريك"},"value":{"en":"**88.9%**","ar":"**88.9%**"}}],"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}},{"id":"flag","text":{"en":"Remove the scores, and mark only the lines it's unsure about: \"Check with staff\"","ar":"نحذف الدرجات، ونضع علامة فقط على السطور التي لم يتأكّد من ترجمتها: «اسأل الموظّف»"},"mock":{"app":{"name":{"en":"Tarjim Lens","ar":"عدسة ترجم"},"color":"#0F766E","icon":"translate","domain":"tarjim.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Menu · translated","ar":"القائمة · مترجمة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","text":{"en":"Grilled fish","ar":"سمك مشوي"}},{"kind":"listitem","text":{"en":"Stuffed vine leaves","ar":"ورق عنب محشي"},"badge":{"text":{"en":"Check with staff","ar":"اسأل الموظّف"},"tone":"warn","icon":"warning"}},{"kind":"listitem","text":{"en":"Lamb with freekeh","ar":"لحم ضأن بالفريك"}}],"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}}],"answer":["flag"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P12-026","when":["keep","bigger"],"feedback":{"en":"A score on every line changes nothing people do. Only the unsure lines need their attention.","ar":"الدرجة على كل سطر لا تغيّر شيئًا مما يفعله الناس. والسطور غير المؤكّدة فقط تحتاج انتباههم."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Show doubt only where it changes something.","ar":"صحيح. أظهِر عدم التأكّد فقط حيث يغيّر ما يفعله الناس."},"explain":{"en":"A clean menu, plus a clear flag where a wrong dish is likely.","ar":"قائمة سهلة القراءة، مع علامة واضحة حيث قد تكون الترجمة خطأ."}},{"id":"S08","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P12-U03-04","part":"retest","speaker":"sara","value":{"en":"Re-test. Explainability + Trust (People + AI): if confidence could mislead people, rethink how it's shown, or whether to show it.","ar":"إعادة اختبار. قابلية الشرح والثقة (People + AI): إذا كانت درجة الثقة قد تضلّل الناس، فأعد التفكير في طريقة عرضها، أو في عرضها أصلًا."},"ref":{"url":"https://pair.withgoogle.com/chapter/explainability-trust/","quote":"If the confidence level could be misleading for less-savvy users, reconsider how it’s displayed, or whether to display it at all."},"scenario":{"en":"I'm designing a hiring tool. It shows a bold \"Match: 96%\" for each applicant, even when their profile is almost empty. Managers have stopped reading CVs.","ar":"أصمّم أداة توظيف. تعرض «تطابق: 96%» بخط عريض لكل متقدّم، حتى حين يكون ملفّه شبه فارغ. وتوقّف المديرون عن قراءة السِّيَر الذاتية."},"prompt":{"en":"What should we change?","ar":"ماذا يجب أن نغيّر؟"},"mock":{"app":{"name":{"en":"Shaghla","ar":"شغلة"},"color":"#0E7490","icon":"briefcase","domain":"shaghla.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"shaghla.example/hiring","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Applicants · UX Designer","ar":"المتقدّمون · مصمّم تجربة مستخدم"}},{"kind":"listitem","avatar":{"text":"Ali Hassan","art":"man-2"},"text":{"en":"Ali Hassan","ar":"علي حسن"},"sub":{"en":"Profile: 2 lines","ar":"الملف: سطران"},"value":{"en":"Match: 96%","ar":"تطابق: 96%"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"listitem","avatar":{"text":"Nada Samir","art":"woman-3"},"text":{"en":"Nada Samir","ar":"ندى سمير"},"sub":{"en":"Profile: complete","ar":"الملف: مكتمل"},"value":{"en":"Match: 81%","ar":"تطابق: 81%"}}],"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"}},"options":[{"id":"green","text":{"en":"Colour scores above 90% green","ar":"نلوّن الدرجات فوق 90% بالأخضر"},"mock":{"app":{"name":{"en":"Shaghla","ar":"شغلة"},"color":"#0E7490","icon":"briefcase","domain":"shaghla.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"shaghla.example/hiring","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Applicants · UX Designer","ar":"المتقدّمون · مصمّم تجربة مستخدم"}},{"kind":"listitem","avatar":{"text":"Ali Hassan","art":"man-2"},"text":{"en":"Ali Hassan","ar":"علي حسن"},"sub":{"en":"Profile: 2 lines","ar":"الملف: سطران"},"gap":"s","badge":{"text":{"en":"Match: 96%","ar":"تطابق: 96%"},"tone":"good"}},{"kind":"listitem","avatar":{"text":"Nada Samir","art":"woman-3"},"text":{"en":"Nada Samir","ar":"ندى سمير"},"sub":{"en":"Profile: complete","ar":"الملف: مكتمل"},"value":{"en":"Match: 81%","ar":"تطابق: 81%"}}],"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}},{"id":"thin","text":{"en":"For thin profiles, replace the score with \"Not enough info to match. Read the CV.\"","ar":"للملفّات الناقصة، نستبدل الدرجة بـ «لا توجد معلومات كافية للمطابقة. اقرأ السيرة الذاتية.»"},"mock":{"app":{"name":{"en":"Shaghla","ar":"شغلة"},"color":"#0E7490","icon":"briefcase","domain":"shaghla.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"shaghla.example/hiring","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Applicants · UX Designer","ar":"المتقدّمون · مصمّم تجربة مستخدم"}},{"kind":"listitem","avatar":{"text":"Ali Hassan","art":"man-2"},"text":{"en":"Ali Hassan","ar":"علي حسن"},"sub":{"en":"Profile: 2 lines","ar":"الملف: سطران"},"gap":"s","badge":{"text":{"en":"Not enough info to match. Read the CV.","ar":"لا توجد معلومات كافية للمطابقة. اقرأ السيرة الذاتية."},"tone":"neutral"}},{"kind":"listitem","avatar":{"text":"Nada Samir","art":"woman-3"},"text":{"en":"Nada Samir","ar":"ندى سمير"},"sub":{"en":"Profile: complete","ar":"الملف: مكتمل"},"value":{"en":"Match: 81%","ar":"تطابق: 81%"}}],"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}},{"id":"keep","text":{"en":"Keep it; managers are busy","ar":"تبقى كما هي؛ فالمديرون مشغولون"},"mock":{"app":{"name":{"en":"Shaghla","ar":"شغلة"},"color":"#0E7490","icon":"briefcase","domain":"shaghla.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"shaghla.example/hiring","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Applicants · UX Designer","ar":"المتقدّمون · مصمّم تجربة مستخدم"}},{"kind":"listitem","avatar":{"text":"Ali Hassan","art":"man-2"},"text":{"en":"Ali Hassan","ar":"علي حسن"},"sub":{"en":"Profile: 2 lines","ar":"الملف: سطران"},"value":{"en":"Match: 96%","ar":"تطابق: 96%"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"listitem","avatar":{"text":"Nada Samir","art":"woman-3"},"text":{"en":"Nada Samir","ar":"ندى سمير"},"sub":{"en":"Profile: complete","ar":"الملف: مكتمل"},"value":{"en":"Match: 81%","ar":"تطابق: 81%"}}],"caption":{"en":"Unchanged","ar":"بدون تغيير"}}}],"answer":["thin"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P12-027","when":["green","keep"],"feedback":{"en":"A high score on almost no data makes managers skip good and bad applicants alike. Say when it can't judge.","ar":"الدرجة المرتفعة مع بيانات شبه معدومة تجعل المديرين يتجاوزون المتقدّمين الجيدين والسيئين معًا. قل متى لا يستطيع الحكم."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. No data, no big number.","ar":"صحيح. لا بيانات، إذن لا رقم كبير."},"explain":{"en":"An honest \"not enough info\" sends managers back to the CV when it matters.","ar":"حين تقول الأداة بصدق «لا توجد معلومات كافية»، يعود المديرون إلى السيرة الذاتية حين يهمّ ذلك."}},{"id":"S09","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P12-U03-05","part":"retest","speaker":"hana","value":{"en":"Re-test. Explainability + Trust (People + AI): numbers like percentages are risky, because they assume people understand probability.","ar":"إعادة اختبار. قابلية الشرح والثقة (People + AI): الأرقام مثل النسب المئوية فيها خطر، لأنها تفترض أن الناس يفهمون الاحتمالات."},"ref":{"url":"https://pair.withgoogle.com/chapter/explainability-trust/","quote":"Numeric confidence indicators are risky because they presume your users have a good baseline understanding of probability."},"scenario":{"en":"Our gym app predicts how crowded the gym will be. It says: \"6 p.m.: 72% chance of busy.\"","ar":"تطبيق النادي يتوقّع مدى ازدحام النادي. ويقول: «6 مساءً: احتمال الازدحام 72%.»"},"prompt":{"en":"What should it say?","ar":"ماذا يكتب التطبيق ليعرف الأعضاء متى يأتون؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Busy times","ar":"أوقات الازدحام"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"chart","type":"bar","values":[20,35,50,72,60,30],"labels":["13","15","17","18","19","21"],"highlight":3},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"6 p.m.: 72% chance of busy","ar":"6 مساءً: احتمال الازدحام 72%"},"gap":"s"}],"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"}},"options":[{"id":"act","text":{"en":"\"6 p.m. is usually busy. Come before 5 for free machines.\"","ar":"«الساعة 6 مساءً مزدحمة عادةً. تعالَ قبل 5 لتجد أجهزة متاحة.»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Busy times","ar":"أوقات الازدحام"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"chart","type":"bar","values":[20,35,50,72,60,30],"labels":["13","15","17","18","19","21"],"highlight":3},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"6 p.m. is usually busy. Come before 5 for free machines.","ar":"الساعة 6 مساءً مزدحمة عادةً. تعالَ قبل 5 لتجد أجهزة متاحة."},"gap":"s"}],"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}},{"id":"num","text":{"en":"Keep \"72% chance of busy\"","ar":"يبقى «احتمال الازدحام 72%»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Busy times","ar":"أوقات الازدحام"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"chart","type":"bar","values":[20,35,50,72,60,30],"labels":["13","15","17","18","19","21"],"highlight":3},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"6 p.m.: 72% chance of busy","ar":"6 مساءً: احتمال الازدحام 72%"},"gap":"s"}],"caption":{"en":"Unchanged","ar":"بدون تغيير"}}},{"id":"more","text":{"en":"\"72.4% chance of busy\", to be more exact","ar":"«احتمال الازدحام 72.4%»، ليكون أدقّ"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Busy times","ar":"أوقات الازدحام"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"chart","type":"bar","values":[20,35,50,72,60,30],"labels":["13","15","17","18","19","21"],"highlight":3},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"6 p.m.: 72.4% chance of busy","ar":"6 مساءً: احتمال الازدحام 72.4%"},"gap":"s"}],"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}}],"answer":["act"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P12-028","when":["num","more"],"feedback":{"en":"Members don't plan with percentages. Tell them what it means and when to come instead.","ar":"الأعضاء لا يخطّطون بالنسب المئوية. قل لهم ماذا تعني، ومتى يأتون بدلًا من ذلك."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Plain words and a next step.","ar":"صحيح. كلمات بسيطة وخطوة تالية."},"explain":{"en":"\"Usually busy, come before 5\" is something members can act on today.","ar":"«مزدحمة عادةً، تعالَ قبل 5» شيء يستطيع الأعضاء أن يتصرّفوا بناءً عليه اليوم."}},{"id":"S10","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P12-U03-05","part":"retest","speaker":"mona","value":{"en":"Re-test. Explainability + Trust (People + AI): to choose how to show confidence, think about what action it should inform.","ar":"إعادة اختبار. قابلية الشرح والثقة (People + AI): لتختار طريقة عرض الثقة، فكّر في الفعل الذي يجب أن تساعد عليه."},"ref":{"url":"https://pair.withgoogle.com/chapter/explainability-trust/","quote":"To come up with the best way to display model confidence, think about what user action this information should inform."},"scenario":{"en":"Our bank app reads cheque photos. Sometimes it can't tell if the amount is 1,500 or 7,500.","ar":"تطبيق بنكنا يقرأ صور الشيكات. وأحيانًا لا يستطيع أن يعرف هل المبلغ 1,500 أم 7,500."},"prompt":{"en":"What should it show?","ar":"ماذا يعرض التطبيق حين لا يعرف المبلغ بالضبط؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rasid","name":{"en":"Rasid","ar":"رصيد"},"color":"#1C3D6E","icon":"bank","domain":"rasid.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Dep