ht one.","ar":"هل المبلغ 1,500 أم 7,500؟ اضغط على الصحيح."},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"chips","gap":"xs","items":[{"text":{"en":"1,500","ar":"1,500"}},{"text":{"en":"7,500","ar":"7,500"}}]}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Deposit","ar":"أودِع"}}],"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}}],"answer":["ask"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P12-029","when":["guess","pct"],"feedback":{"en":"A wrong amount costs real money. The customer is holding the cheque; let them pick in one tap.","ar":"المبلغ الخطأ يكلّف مالًا حقيقيًا. والعميل يحمل الشيك بيده؛ دعه يختار بضغطة واحدة."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. When unsure, ask with the options.","ar":"صحيح. حين لا يكون متأكّدًا، اسأل واعرض الخيارات."},"explain":{"en":"The action here is confirming the amount, so the display should ask for exactly that.","ar":"المطلوب هنا تأكيد المبلغ، لذلك يجب أن تطلب الشاشة ذلك بالضبط."}}]}$uxg$::jsonb),
  ($uxg$P12-U04-B01$uxg$, $uxg$3c0d0bde895bd2857000012efcd5df7e1fa78b0b7ccbfcdfb7dc1d6b17b0655f$uxg$, $uxg${"id":"P12-U04-B01","mode":"bank","title":{"en":"Re-tests: keep people in control","ar":"إعادة اختبار: اترك التحكّم للناس"},"steps":[{"id":"S01","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P12-U04-01","part":"retest","speaker":"hana","value":{"en":"Re-test. Feedback + Control (People + AI): the manual method is a safe and useful fallback.","ar":"إعادة اختبار. الملاحظات والتحكّم (People + AI): الطريقة اليدوية بديل آمن ومفيد."},"ref":{"url":"https://pair.withgoogle.com/chapter/feedback-controls/","quote":"As we mentioned in the Mental Models chapter, the manual method is a safe and useful fallback."},"scenario":{"en":"Our gym app now books each member's weekly classes automatically. Some members still want to pick their own.","ar":"تطبيق النادي أصبح يحجز حصص كل عضو الأسبوعية تلقائيًا. وما زال بعض الأعضاء يريدون اختيار حصصهم بأنفسهم."},"prompt":{"en":"What should we do with the \"Book a class\" button?","ar":"ماذا نفعل بزر «احجز حصة»؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"My week","ar":"أسبوعي"}},"blocks":[{"kind":"badge","icon":"sparkle","text":{"en":"Booked for you","ar":"حجزنا لك"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"calendar-check","text":{"en":"Sun · Yoga 19:00","ar":"الأحد · يوجا 19:00"},"check":true,"gap":"s"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"calendar-check","text":{"en":"Tue · Spinning 7:00","ar":"الثلاثاء · دراجات 7:00"},"check":true},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"calendar-check","text":{"en":"Thu · Boxing 20:00","ar":"الخميس · ملاكمة 20:00"},"check":true}],"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"}},"options":[{"id":"remove","text":{"en":"Remove it; auto-booking does the job","ar":"نحذفه؛ فالحجز التلقائي يقوم بالمهمة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"My week","ar":"أ