blished","ar":"منشور"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"✨ Like-new laptop, 16 GB RAM, perfect battery, no scratches…","ar":"✨ لابتوب شبه جديد، ذاكرة 16 جيجا، بطارية ممتازة، بلا خدوش…"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Written by AI from your photos","ar":"كتبه الذكاء الاصطناعي من صورك"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"link","text":{"en":"Report wrong description","ar":"أبلغ عن وصف خطأ"},"gap":"s"}],"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}},{"id":"better","text":{"en":"Nothing; improve the AI instead","ar":"لا شيء؛ نحسّن الذكاء الاصطناعي بدلًا من ذلك"},"mock":{"app":{"name":{"en":"Souq Sahl","ar":"سوق سهل"},"color":"#9333EA","icon":"storefront","domain":"souqsahl.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Your listing","ar":"إعلانك"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"laptop"},{"kind":"badge","tone":"good","icon":"check-circle","text":{"en":"Published","ar":"منشور"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"✨ Like-new laptop, 16 GB RAM, perfect battery, no scratches…","ar":"✨ لابتوب شبه جديد، ذاكرة 16 جيجا، بطارية ممتازة، بلا خدوش…"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Written by AI from your photos","ar":"كتبه الذكاء الاصطناعي من صورك"},"gap":"xs"}],"caption":{"en":"Unchanged","ar":"بدون تغيير"}}}],"answer":["draft"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P12-030","when":["report","better"],"feedback":{"en":"A wrong size or material goes live under the seller's name. Let them check and edit before anyone sees it.","ar":"مقاس أو خامة خطأ تُنشر باسم البائع. اسمح له بالمراجعة والتعديل قبل أن يراها أحد."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. AI drafts, people decide.","ar":"صحيح. الذكاء الاصطناعي يكتب المسوّدة، والناس يقرّرون."},"explain":{"en":"The seller knows the product. A draft saves them time and keeps them in charge.","ar":"البائع يعرف المنتج. والمسوّدة توفّر وقته وتبقيه صاحب القرار."}},{"id":"S03","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P12-U04-02","part":"retest","speaker":"nour","value":{"en":"Re-test. Feedback + Control (People + A