t? Amazing / Great / Good / Fine / OK\". I can't tell what to fix.","ar":"بعد كل توصيل، يسأل تطبيق متجري: «كيف كان؟ رائع / ممتاز / جيد / مقبول / لا بأس». ولا أعرف ما الذي يجب إصلاحه."},"prompt":{"en":"What should it ask?","ar":"ماذا يسأل التطبيق لأعرف ما الذي يجب إصلاحه؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Order delivered","ar":"وصل طلبك"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","art":"earbuds","text":{"en":"Wireless earbuds","ar":"سماعات لاسلكية"},"sub":{"en":"Delivered today","ar":"وصلت اليوم"}}],"overlay":{"type":"sheet","title":{"en":"How was it?","ar":"كيف كان؟"},"blocks":[{"kind":"chips","items":[{"text":{"en":"Amazing","ar":"رائع"}},{"text":{"en":"Great","ar":"ممتاز"}},{"text":{"en":"Good","ar":"جيد"}},{"text":{"en":"Fine","ar":"مقبول"}},{"text":{"en":"OK","ar":"لا بأس"}}]}]},"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"}},"options":[{"id":"more","text":{"en":"Add \"Excellent\" and \"Bad\" to the list","ar":"نضيف «ممتاز جدًا» و«سيئ» إلى القائمة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Order delivered","ar":"وصل طلبك"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","art":"earbuds","text":{"en":"Wireless earbuds","ar":"سماعات لاسلكية"},"sub":{"en":"Delivered today","ar":"وصلت اليوم"}}],"overlay":{"type":"sheet","title":{"en":"How was it?","ar":"كيف كان؟"},"blocks":[{"kind":"chips","items":[{"text":{"en":"Excellent","ar":"ممتاز جدًا"}},{"text":{"en":"Amazing","ar":"رائع"}},{"text":{"en":"Great","ar":"ممتاز"}},{"text":{"en":"Good","ar":"جيد"}},{"text":{"en":"Fine","ar":"مقبول"}},{"text":{"en":"OK","ar":"لا بأس"}},{"text":{"en":"Bad","ar":"سيئ"}}]}]},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}},{"id":"stars","text":{"en":"Use 10 stars instead","ar":"نستخدم 10 نجوم بدلًا منها"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Order delivered","ar":"وصل طلبك"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","art":"earbuds","text":{"en":"Wireless earbuds","ar":"سماعات لاسلكية"},"sub":{"en":"Delivered today","ar":"وصلت اليوم"}}],"overlay":{"type":"sheet","title":{"en":"How was it?","ar":"كيف كان؟"},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"☆☆☆☆☆☆☆☆☆☆","ar":"☆☆☆☆☆☆☆☆☆☆"}},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Tap 1 to 10 stars","ar":"اضغط من 1 إلى 10 نجوم"},"color":"muted","gap":"xs"}]},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}},{"id":"clear","text":{"en":"\"Did it arrive OK? 👍 Yes / 👎 There was a problem\"","ar":"«هل وصل الطلب بخير؟ 👍 نعم / 👎 كانت هناك مشكلة»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Order delivered","ar":"وصل طلبك"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","art":"earbuds","text":{"en":"Wireless earbuds","ar":"سماعات لاسلكية"},"sub":{"en":"Delivered today","ar":"وصلت اليوم"}}],"overlay":{"type":"sheet","title":{"en":"Did it arrive OK?","ar":"هل وصل الطلب بخير؟"},"blocks":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"👍 Yes","ar":"👍 نعم"},"style":"outline"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"👎 There was a problem","ar":"👎 كانت هناك مشكلة"},"style":"outline","gap":"s"}]},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}}],"answer":["clear"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P12-032","when":["more","stars"],"feedback":{"en":"More levels only add overlap. Two clear answers tell me at once which orders need a look.","ar":"المستويات الإضافية تزيد التداخل فقط. والإجابتان الواضحتان تقولان لي فورًا أي الطلبات تحتاج مراجعة."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Two clear, separate answers.","ar":"صحيح. إجابتان واضحتان ومنفصلتان."},"explain":{"en":"\"There was a problem\" is something I can act on; \"Fine\" vs \"OK\" isn't.","ar":"«كانت هناك مشكلة» شيء أستطيع أن أتصرّف بناءً عليه؛ أما الفرق بين «مقبول» و«لا بأس» فلا."}},{"id":"S06","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P12-U04-03","part":"retest","speaker":"mona","value":{"en":"Re-test. Feedback + Control (People + AI): use the right voice and tone for the kind of feedback you're asking for.","ar":"إعادة اختبار. الملاحظات والتحكّم (People + AI): استخدم الصوت والأسلوب المناسبين لنوع الملاحظات التي تطلبها."},"ref":{"url":"https://pair.withgoogle.com/chapter/feedback-controls/","quote":"It’s also important that your wording choices hit the appropriate voice and tone for the type of feedback you’re requesting, and avoid words or references that can be interpreted as offensive."},"scenario":{"en":"Our bank app blocked a card payment as possible fraud. Now we ask the customer if we were right.","ar":"تطبيق بنكنا أوقف دفعة بالبطاقة لاحتمال احتيال. والآن نسأل العميل إن كنّا على حق."},"prompt":{"en":"Which question should we use?","ar":"أي سؤال نطرحه على عميل ربما سُرق ماله؟"},"mock":{"screen":"lock","blocks":[{"kind":"notification","app":{"id":"rasid","name":{"en":"Rasid","ar":"رصيد"},"color":"#1C3D6E","icon":"bank","domain":"rasid.example"},"title":{"en":"Payment blocked","ar":"أوقفنا الدفعة"},"text":{"en":"3,200 EGP at an online store looked unusual.","ar":"3,200 جنيه في متجر إلكتروني بدت غير معتادة."},"time":{"en":"now","ar":"الآن"}}],"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"}},"options":[{"id":"plain","text":{"en":"\"Was this payment yours? Yes, it was me / No, I didn't make it\"","ar":"«هل كانت هذه الدفعة منك؟ نعم، مني / لا، ليست مني»"},"mock":{"screen":"lock","blocks":[{"kind":"notification","app":{"id":"rasid","name":{"en":"Rasid","ar":"رصيد"},"color":"#1C3D6E","icon":"bank","domain":"rasid.example"},"title":{"en":"Was this payment yours?","ar":"هل كانت هذه الدفعة منك؟"},"text":{"en":"3,200 EGP at an online store. Yes, it was me / No, I didn't make it","ar":"3,200 جنيه في متجر إلكتروني. نعم، مني / لا، ليست مني"},"time":{"en":"now","ar":"الآن"}}],"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}},{"id":"joke","text":{"en":"\"Oops! 🙈 Did we goof? Yep 😅 / Nope\"","ar":"«أوبس! 🙈 هل أخطأنا؟ نعم 😅 / لا»"},"mock":{"screen":"lock","blocks":[{"kind":"notification","app":{"id":"rasid","name":{"en":"Rasid","ar":"رصيد"},"color":"#1C3D6E","icon":"bank","domain":"rasid.example"},"title":{"en":"Oops! 🙈 Did we goof?","ar":"أوبس! 🙈 هل أخطأنا؟"},"text":{"en":"3,200 EGP at an online store. Yep 😅 / Nope","ar":"3,200 جنيه في متجر إلكتروني. نعم 😅 / لا"},"time":{"en":"now","ar":"الآن"}}],"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}},{"id":"blame","text":{"en":"\"Did you make a suspicious payment?\"","ar":"«هل قمت بدفعة مشبوهة؟»"},"mock":{"screen":"lock","blocks":[{"kind":"notification","app":{"id":"rasid","name":{"en":"Rasid","ar":"رصيد"},"color":"#1C3D6E","icon":"bank","domain":"rasid.example"},"title":{"en":"Did you make a suspicious payment?","ar":"هل قمت بدفعة مشبوهة؟"},"text":{"en":"3,200 EGP at an online store.","ar":"3,200 جنيه في متجر إلكتروني."},"time":{"en":"now","ar":"الآن"}}],"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}}],"answer":["plain"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P12-037","when":["joke","blame"],"feedback":{"en":"Someone may have stolen their money: a joke feels careless, and \"suspicious\" sounds like an accusation. Ask plainly.","ar":"ربما سُرق مال العميل: النكتة تبدو استهتارًا، و«مشبوهة» تبدو اتهامًا. اسأل ببساطة."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Plain, calm and neutral.","ar":"صحيح. بسيط وهادئ ومحايد."},"explain":{"en":"The right tone makes people feel safe giving an honest answer.","ar":"الأسلوب المناسب يجعل الناس يشعرون بالأمان ليجيبوا بصدق."}},{"id":"S07","type":"choose","skill":"SK-P12-U04-04","part":"retest","speaker":"tarek","value":{"en":"Re-test. Feedback + Control (People + AI): there isn't always a clear link between what people do and what they want from the AI.","ar":"إعادة اختبار. الملاحظات والتحكّم (People + AI): لا توجد دائمًا علاقة واضحة بين ما يفعله الناس وما يريدونه من الذكاء الاصطناعي."},"ref":{"url":"https://pair.withgoogle.com/chapter/feedback-controls/","quote":"Feedback like this can be confusing because there isn’t always a clear link between what a user does and what a user wants from the AI model."},"scenario":{"en":"In our grocery app, a man with no children bought diapers once, as a gift. Now his home screen is full of baby products.","ar":"في تطبيق البقالة عندنا، اشترى رجل ليس لديه أطفال حفاضات مرة واحدة، كهدية. والآن شاشته الرئيسية مليئة بمنتجات الأطفال."},"prompt":{"en":"What should the app do?","ar":"ماذا يفعل التطبيق بعد عملية شراء واحدة كانت هدية؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"sallah","name":{"en":"Sallah","ar":"سلّة"},"color":"#2E9E5B","icon":"basket","domain":"sallah.example"},"appbar":{"logo":true,"actions":[{"icon":"basket","aria":{"en":"Basket","ar":"السلة"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Picked for you","ar":"اخترناه لك"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"baby","text":{"en":"Diapers, size 3","ar":"حفاضات، مقاس 3"},"value":{"en":"320 EGP","ar":"320 جنيه"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"baby","text":{"en":"Baby wipes","ar":"مناديل أطفال"},"value":{"en":"60 EGP","ar":"60 جنيه"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"baby","text":{"en":"Baby formula","ar":"حليب أطفال"},"value":{"en":"410 EGP","ar":"410 جنيه"}}]},"options":[{"id":"more","text":{"en":"Keep showing baby products; he bought them","ar":"يستمرّ في عرض منتجات الأطفال؛ فقد اشتراها"}},{"id":"ask","text":{"en":"Wait for more than one purchase, and offer \"Bought this as a gift? Don't use it for suggestions\"","ar":"ينتظر أكثر من عملية شراء، ويعرض «اشتريتها كهدية؟ لا تستخدمها في الاقتراحات»"}},{"id":"never","text":{"en":"Never use purchases for suggestions","ar":"لا يستخدم المشتريات في الاقتراحات أبدًا"}}],"answer":["ask"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P12-033","when":["more","never"],"feedback":{"en":"One purchase isn't a pattern, but purchases are still useful. Don't jump on one, and let him say it was a gift.","ar":"عملية شراء واحدة ليست نمطًا، لكن المشتريات تبقى مفيدة. لا تتسرّع بسبب عملية واحدة، واسمح له أن يقول إنها هدية."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Don't build a picture on one action.","ar":"صحيح. لا تبنِ صورة كاملة على فعل واحد."},"explain":{"en":"A gift, a one-off or a mistake all look like interest. Wait, or ask.","ar":"الهدية، والشراء لمرة واحدة، والخطأ، كلها تبدو اهتمامًا. انتظر، أو اسأل."}},{"id":"S08","type":"choose","skill":"SK-P12-U04-04","part":"retest","speaker":"karim","value":{"en":"Re-test. Feedback + Control (People + AI): consider carefully how you'll use what people do to tune the AI.","ar":"إعادة اختبار. الملاحظات والتحكّم (People + AI): فكّر جيدًا في طريقة استخدام ما يفعله الناس لضبط الذكاء الاصطناعي."},"ref":{"url":"https://pair.withgoogle.com/chapter/feedback-controls/","quote":"In these cases, it’s important to consider how you’ll use the implicit signal for model tuning."},"scenario":{"en":"I'm building a health articles app. A user reads many articles about diabetes, because her father has it. The app starts treating her as diabetic, with diet warnings on every recipe.","ar":"أبني تطبيقًا لمقالات الصحة. وتقرأ إحدى المستخدمات مقالات كثيرة عن السكّري، لأن والدها مصاب به. فيبدأ التطبيق بمعاملتها كمريضة سكّري، مع تحذيرات غذائية على كل وصفة."},"prompt":{"en":"What should the app do?","ar":"ماذا يجب أن يفعل التطبيق؟"},"mock":{"app":{"name":{"en":"Sehha","ar":"صحّة"},"color":"#0891B2","icon":"heartbeat","domain":"sehha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Recipes","ar":"الوصفات"}},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","art":"food-salad","text":{"en":"Fattoush salad","ar":"سلطة فتّوش"}},{"kind":"banner","tone":"warn","icon":"warning","text":{"en":"For your diabetes: watch the bread.","ar":"لأنك مصابة بالسكري: انتبهي للخبز."},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"She reads about diabetes for her father. She is not diabetic.","ar":"هي تقرأ عن السكري من أجل والدها. وهي ليست مريضة سكري."},"gap":"s"}]},"options":[{"id":"assume","text":{"en":"Keep the warnings; reading means it's about her","ar":"يُبقي التحذيرات؛ فالقراءة تعني أن الأمر يخصّها"}},{"id":"ask","text":{"en":"Suggest more diabetes articles, but ask before changing anything about her: \"Reading for yourself or someone else?\"","ar":"يقترح مقالات أكثر عن السكّري، لكن يسأل قبل تغيير أي شيء يخصّها: «تقرئين لنفسك أم لشخص آخر؟»"}},{"id":"stop","text":{"en":"Stop suggesting diabetes articles","ar":"يتوقّف عن اقتراح مقالات السكّري"}}],"answer":["ask"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P12-033","when":["assume","stop"],"feedback":{"en":"Reading shows interest in the topic, not that she has it. Keep the articles, and ask before acting on her health.","ar":"القراءة تدلّ على الاهتمام بالموضوع، لا على أنها مصابة. احتفظ بالمقالات، واسأل قبل أي تصرّف يخصّ صحّتها."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Interest isn't the same as identity.","ar":"صحيح. الاهتمام بموضوع لا يعني أنه يخصّها."},"explain":{"en":"Use the signal for what it shows, and ask about the rest.","ar":"استخدم الإشارة فيما تدلّ عليه، واسأل عن الباقي."}},{"id":"S09","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P12-U04-05","part":"retest","speaker":"mona","value":{"en":"Re-test. Feedback + Control (People + AI): let people know what information is collected, what it's for, and how it benefits them.","ar":"إعادة اختبار. الملاحظات والتحكّم (People + AI): أخبر الناس ما المعلومات التي تُجمع، ولماذا، وكيف تفيدهم."},"ref":{"url":"https://pair.withgoogle.com/chapter/feedback-controls/","quote":"For either type of feedback, it’s important to let users know what information is being collected, what it’s for, and how its use benefits them."},"scenario":{"en":"Our bank app wants to record which screens each customer opens, to put their most-used actions first.","ar":"تطبيق بنكنا يريد تسجيل الشاشات التي يفتحها كل عميل، ليضع الإجراءات التي يستخدمها أكثر في المقدّمة."},"prompt":{"en":"What should we tell customers?","ar":"بماذا نخبر العملاء قبل تسجيل الشاشات التي يفتحونها؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rasid","name":{"en":"Rasid","ar":"رصيد"},"color":"#1C3D6E","icon":"bank","domain":"rasid.example"},"appbar":{"logo":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"card","blocks":[{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Current account","ar":"الحساب الجاري"}},{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"12,400 EGP","ar":"12,400 جنيه"}}]},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"New: record which screens you open, to put your most-used actions first. What should customers see?","ar":"جديد: تسجيل الشاشات التي تفتحها، لنضع أكثر ما تستخدمه أولًا. ماذا يجب أن يرى العملاء؟"},"gap":"s"}],"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"}},"options":[{"id":"tell","text":{"en":"\"We can note which screens you use, to put your favourite actions first. Allow / No thanks\"","ar":"«نستطيع تسجيل الشاشات التي تستخدمها، لنضع إجراءاتك المفضّلة أولًا. اسمح / لا، شكرًا»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rasid","name":{"en":"Rasid","ar":"رصيد"},"color":"#1C3D6E","icon":"bank","domain":"rasid.example"},"appbar":{"logo":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"card","blocks":[{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Current account","ar":"الحساب الجاري"}},{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"12,400 EGP","ar":"12,400 جنيه"}}]}],"overlay":{"type":"sheet","title":{"en":"Put your favourite actions first?","ar":"نضع إجراءاتك المفضّلة أولًا؟"},"blocks":[{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"We can note which screens you use, to put your favourite actions first.","ar":"نستطيع تسجيل الشاشات التي تستخدمها، لنضع إجراءاتك المفضّلة أولًا."}},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Allow","ar":"اسمح"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"No thanks","ar":"لا، شكرًا"},"style":"text","gap":"xs"}]},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}},{"id":"nothing","text":{"en":"Nothing; it's harmless","ar":"لا شيء؛ فهو غير مؤذٍ"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rasid","name":{"en":"Rasid","ar":"رصيد"},"color":"#1C3D6E","icon":"bank","domain":"rasid.example"},"appbar":{"logo":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"card","blocks":[{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Current account","ar":"الحساب الجاري"}},{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"12,400 EGP","ar":"12,400 جنيه"}}]}],"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}},{"id":"vague","text":{"en":"\"We use data to improve your experience.\"","ar":"«نستخدم البيانات لتحسين تجربتك.»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rasid","name":{"en":"Rasid","ar":"رصيد"},"color":"#1C3D6E","icon":"bank","domain":"rasid.example"},"appbar":{"logo":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"card","blocks":[{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Current account","ar":"الحساب الجاري"}},{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"12,400 EGP","ar":"12,400 جنيه"}}]},{"kind":"banner","text":{"en":"We use data to improve your experience.","ar":"نستخدم البيانات لتحسين تجربتك."},"tone":"neutral","icon":"info","gap":"s"}],"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}}],"answer":["tell"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P12-034","when":["nothing","vague"],"feedback":{"en":"Money apps need trust most. Say exactly what you record, why, and what customers get, and let them choose.","ar":"تطبيقات المال تحتاج الثقة أكثر من غيرها. قل بالضبط ماذا تسجّل، ولماذا، وماذا يستفيد العملاء، واتركهم يختارون."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. What, why, and what's in it for them.","ar":"صحيح. ماذا، ولماذا، وما الفائدة لهم."},"explain":{"en":"\"Improve your experience\" says nothing. A specific benefit earns a real yes.","ar":"«تحسين تجربتك» لا تقول شيئًا. والفائدة المحدّدة تكسب موافقة حقيقية."}},{"id":"S10","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P12-U04-05","part":"retest","speaker":"youssef","value":{"en":"Re-test. Feedback + Control (People + AI): always give a way to see, and ideally edit, the data collected.","ar":"إعادة اختبار. الملاحظات والتحكّم (People + AI): أعطِ دائمًا طريقة لرؤية البيانات التي جُمعت، ويُفضّل تعديلها."},"ref":{"url":"https://pair.withgoogle.com/chapter/feedback-controls/","quote":"Always provide a way to see, and ideally edit, data collected."},"scenario":{"en":"My shop app records the products each customer looks at, to suggest others. Customers agreed at sign-up.","ar":"تطبيق متجري يسجّل المنتجات التي ينظر إليها كل عميل، ليقترح غيرها. وقد وافق العملاء عند التسجيل."},"prompt":{"en":"What else should the app offer?","ar":"ماذا يقدّم التطبيق أيضًا ليبقى العميل متحكّمًا في بياناته؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Privacy","ar":"الخصوصية"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"eye","text":{"en":"Products you looked at","ar":"المنتجات التي شاهدتها"},"sub":{"en":"Used for suggestions · agreed at sign-up","ar":"تُستخدم للاقتراحات · وافقت عند التسجيل"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"bell","text":{"en":"Offers by email","ar":"العروض بالبريد"},"toggle":true}],"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"}},"options":[{"id":"none","text":{"en":"Nothing; they already agreed","ar":"لا شيء؛ فقد وافقوا بالفعل"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Privacy","ar":"الخصوصية"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"eye","text":{"en":"Products you looked at","ar":"المنتجات التي شاهدتها"},"sub":{"en":"Used for suggestions · agreed at sign-up","ar":"تُستخدم للاقتراحات · وافقت عند التسجيل"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"bell","text":{"en":"Offers by email","ar":"العروض بالبريد"},"toggle":true}],"caption":{"en":"Unchanged","ar":"بدون تغيير"}}},{"id":"email","text":{"en":"A copy of their data, by email request","ar":"نسخة من بياناتهم، بطلب عبر البريد"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Privacy","ar":"الخصوصية"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"eye","text":{"en":"Products you looked at","ar":"المنتجات التي شاهدتها"},"sub":{"en":"Used for suggestions · agreed at sign-up","ar":"تُستخدم للاقتراحات · وافقت عند التسجيل"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"bell","text":{"en":"Offers by email","ar":"العروض بالبريد"},"toggle":true},{"kind":"listitem","text":{"en":"Get a copy of your data","ar":"احصل على نسخة من بياناتك"},"icon":"envelope-simple","sub":{"en":"Request by email · we reply within 30 days","ar":"اطلبها بالبريد · نردّ خلال 30 يومًا"},"chevron":true}],"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}},{"id":"see","text":{"en":"\"Recently viewed\" in their account, where they can remove items or pause it","ar":"«شوهد مؤخرًا» في حسابهم، حيث يحذفون منتجات أو يوقفونه مؤقتًا"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Privacy","ar":"الخصوصية"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"eye","text":{"en":"Products you looked at","ar":"المنتجات التي شاهدتها"},"sub":{"en":"Used for suggestions · agreed at sign-up","ar":"تُستخدم للاقتراحات · وافقت عند التسجيل"}},{"kind":"listitem","text":{"en":"Recently viewed","ar":"شوهد مؤخرًا"},"icon":"clock-counter-clockwise","sub":{"en":"See, remove or pause","ar":"اعرض، أو احذف، أو أوقف مؤقتًا"},"chevron":true},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"bell","text":{"en":"Offers by email","ar":"العروض بالبريد"},"toggle":true}],"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}}],"answer":["see"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P12-035","when":["none","email"],"feedback":{"en":"Agreeing once isn't the end. People should be able to see what's recorded and change it, in the app.","ar":"الموافقة مرة واحدة ليست النهاية. يجب أن يستطيع الناس رؤية ما يُسجَّل وتغييره، داخل التطبيق."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. See it, change it, pause it.","ar":"صحيح. يرونه، ويغيّرونه، ويوقفونه."},"explain":{"en":"A visible list keeps the data honest and the customer in charge.","ar":"القائمة الظاهرة تُبقي البيانات واضحة والعميلَ صاحب القرار."}}]}$uxg$::jsonb),
  ($uxg$P12-U05-B01$uxg$, $uxg$ea78227b475be2c798d1508c40423a2ca9b6fbf838da4c31468306c83c298f66$uxg$, $uxg${"id":"P12-U05-B01","mode":"bank","title":{"en":"Re-tests: fail gracefully","ar":"إعادة اختبار: تعامَل مع الفشل بلطف"},"steps":[{"id":"S01","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P12-U05-01","part":"retest","speaker":"rami","value":{"en":"Re-test. Errors + Graceful Failure (People + AI): explain what the system is supposed to do and how it works.","ar":"إعادة اختبار. الأخطاء والفشل اللطيف (People + AI): اشرح ما يُفترض أن يفعله النظام وكيف يعمل."},"ref":{"url":"https://pair.withgoogle.com/chapter/errors-failing/","quote":"Response: Communicate what the system is supposed to do and how it works."},"scenario":{"en":"I'm designing an expenses app. It reads receipts from photos, but only printed ones. When someone scans a handwritten receipt, it says \"Scan failed.\"","ar":"أصمّم تطبيقًا للمصروفات. يقرأ الإيصالات من الصور، لكن المطبوعة فقط. وحين يمسح شخص إيصالًا مكتوبًا بخط اليد، يقول «فشل المسح.»"},"prompt":{"en":"What should it say?","ar":"ماذا يجب أن يقول؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nafaqat","name":{"en":"Nafaqat","ar":"نفقات"},"color":"#475569","icon":"receipt","domain":"nafaqat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Add expense","ar":"أضف مصروفًا"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"receipt"},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Your photo: a handwritten taxi receipt","ar":"صورتك: إيصال تاكسي مكتوب بخط اليد"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"banner","tone":"bad","icon":"warning","text":{"en":"Scan failed.","ar":"فشل المسح."},"gap":"s"}],"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"}},"options":[{"id":"failed","text":{"en":"Keep \"Scan failed.\"","ar":"يبقى «فشل المسح.»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nafaqat","name":{"en":"Nafaqat","ar":"نفقات"},"color":"#475569","icon":"receipt","domain":"nafaqat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Add expense","ar":"أضف مصروفًا"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"receipt"},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Your photo: a handwritten taxi receipt","ar":"صورتك: إيصال تاكسي مكتوب بخط اليد"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"banner","tone":"bad","icon":"warning","text":{"en":"Scan failed.","ar":"فشل المسح."},"gap":"s"}],"caption":{"en":"Unchanged","ar":"بدون تغيير"}}},{"id":"blurry","text":{"en":"\"Photo too blurry. Try again.\"","ar":"«الصورة ضبابية جدًا. حاول مرة أخرى.»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nafaqat","name":{"en":"Nafaqat","ar":"نفقات"},"color":"#475569","icon":"receipt","domain":"nafaqat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Add expense","ar":"أضف مصروفًا"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"receipt"},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Your photo: a handwritten taxi receipt","ar":"صورتك: إيصال تاكسي مكتوب بخط اليد"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"banner","tone":"bad","icon":"warning","text":{"en":"Photo too blurry. Try again.","ar":"الصورة ضبابية جدًا. حاول مرة أخرى."},"gap":"s"}],"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}},{"id":"limit","text":{"en":"\"We can read printed receipts only. For handwritten ones, type the amount.\"","ar":"«نستطيع قراءة الإيصالات المطبوعة فقط. للمكتوبة بخط اليد، اكتب المبلغ.»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nafaqat","name":{"en":"Nafaqat","ar":"نفقات"},"color":"#475569","icon":"receipt","domain":"nafaqat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Add expense","ar":"أضف مصروفًا"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"receipt"},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Your photo: a handwritten taxi receipt","ar":"صورتك: إيصال تاكسي مكتوب بخط اليد"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"banner","tone":"bad","icon":"warning","text":{"en":"We can read printed receipts only. For handwritten ones, type the amount.","ar":"نستطيع قراءة الإيصالات المطبوعة فقط. للمكتوبة بخط اليد، اكتب المبلغ."},"gap":"s"}],"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}}],"answer":["limit"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P12-038","when":["failed","blurry"],"feedback":{"en":"The photo isn't the problem; handwriting is. A wrong reason sends people back to retry. Name the real limit.","ar":"المشكلة ليست في الصورة؛ بل في خط اليد. والسبب الخطأ يعيد الناس إلى المحاولة. اذكر الحدّ الحقيقي."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. The real limit, and the way around it.","ar":"صحيح. الحدّ الحقيقي، والطريق البديل."},"explain":{"en":"People stop retrying when they know why it failed.","ar":"يتوقّف الناس عن إعادة المحاولة حين يعرفون لماذا فشل."}},{"id":"S02","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P12-U05-01","part":"retest","speaker":"hana","value":{"en":"Re-test. Errors + Graceful Failure (People + AI): don't miss a chance to explain your AI system.","ar":"إعادة اختبار. الأخطاء والفشل اللطيف (People + AI): لا تُضيّع فرصة لشرح نظام الذكاء الاصطناعي."},"ref":{"url":"https://pair.withgoogle.com/chapter/errors-failing/","quote":"Don’t miss an opportunity to explain your AI system."},"scenario":{"en":"Our gym app checks a member's form through the phone camera. When it can't see their feet, it shows: \"Unable to analyse.\"","ar":"تطبيق النادي يفحص أداء العضو للتمرين عبر كاميرا الهاتف. وحين لا يرى قدميه، يعرض: «تعذّر التحليل.»"},"prompt":{"en":"What should it show?","ar":"ماذا يجب أن يعرض؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"theme":"dark","appbar":{"title":{"en":"Form check · Squats","ar":"فحص الأداء · القرفصاء"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"gym"},{"kind":"banner","tone":"bad","icon":"warning","text":{"en":"Unable to analyse.","ar":"تعذّر التحليل."},"gap":"s"}],"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"}},"options":[{"id":"frame","text":{"en":"\"Step back so your whole body, head to feet, is in the frame.\"","ar":"«ارجع للخلف ليظهر جسمك كله، من الرأس إلى القدمين، في الصورة.»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"theme":"dark","appbar":{"title":{"en":"Form check · Squats","ar":"فحص الأداء · القرفصاء"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"gym"},{"kind":"banner","tone":"bad","icon":"warning","text":{"en":"Step back so your whole body, head to feet, is in the frame.","ar":"ارجع للخلف ليظهر جسمك كله، من الرأس إلى القدمين، في الصورة."},"gap":"s"}],"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}},{"id":"keep","text":{"en":"Keep \"Unable to analyse.\"","ar":"يبقى «تعذّر التحليل.»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"theme":"dark","appbar":{"title":{"en":"Form check · Squats","ar":"فحص الأداء · القرفصاء"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"gym"},{"kind":"banner","tone":"bad","icon":"warning","text":{"en":"Unable to analyse.","ar":"تعذّر التحليل."},"gap":"s"}],"caption":{"en":"Unchanged","ar":"بدون تغيير"}}},{"id":"later","text":{"en":"\"Try again later.\"","ar":"«حاول لاحقًا.»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"theme":"dark","appbar":{"title":{"en":"Form check · Squats","ar":"فحص الأداء · القرفصاء"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"gym"},{"kind":"banner","tone":"bad","icon":"warning","text":{"en":"Try again later.","ar":"حاول لاحقًا."},"gap":"s"}],"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}}],"answer":["frame"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P12-038","when":["keep","later"],"feedback":{"en":"Waiting won't help. The app needs to see the full body. Tell members exactly that.","ar":"الانتظار لن يساعد. التطبيق يحتاج أن يرى الجسم كله. قل للأعضاء ذلك بالضبط."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Tell them what the AI needs to see.","ar":"صحيح. قل لهم ما يحتاج الذكاء الاصطناعي أن يراه."},"explain":{"en":"The error teaches how the feature works, so the next try succeeds.","ar":"رسالة الخطأ تعلّم الناس كيف تعمل الميزة، فتنجح المحاولة التالية."}},{"id":"S03","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P12-U05-02","part":"retest","speaker":"karim","value":{"en":"Re-test. Errors + Graceful Failure (People + AI): a system can work as intended, yet seem wrong because it acted on poor assumptions.","ar":"إعادة اختبار. الأخطاء والفشل اللطيف (People + AI): قد يعمل النظام كما صُمّم، ومع ذلك يبدو خطأً لأنه تصرّف بناءً على افتراضات ضعيفة."},"ref":{"url":"https://pair.withgoogle.com/chapter/errors-failing/","quote":"Context errors. These are often true positives: the system is “working as intended,” but the user perceives an error because the actions of the system aren’t well-explained, break the user’s mental model, or were based on poor assumptions."},"scenario":{"en":"I'm building an email app. It adds calendar events from any email with a date. Now people's calendars fill with \"Sale ends Friday\" from shop newsletters.","ar":"أبني تطبيق بريد. يضيف أحداثًا إلى التقويم من أي رسالة فيها تاريخ. والآن تمتلئ تقاويم الناس بـ«التخفيضات تنتهي الجمعة» من نشرات المتاجر."},"prompt":{"en":"What should the app do?","ar":"ماذا يجب أن يفعل التطبيق؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"bareed","name":{"en":"Bareed","ar":"بريد"},"color":"#0284C7","icon":"envelope-simple","domain":"bareed.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Calendar · this week","ar":"التقويم · هذا الأسبوع"}},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"tag","text":{"en":"Sale ends Friday","ar":"التخفيضات تنتهي الجمعة"},"sub":{"en":"Fri · all day · Lamha","ar":"الجمعة · طوال اليوم · لمحة"},"badge":{"text":{"en":"From email","ar":"من البريد"},"icon":"envelope-simple"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"tag","text":{"en":"50% off ends tonight","ar":"خصم 50% ينتهي الليلة"},"sub":{"en":"Wed · 23:59 · Volta","ar":"الأربعاء · 23:59 · فولتا"},"badge":{"text":{"en":"From email","ar":"من البريد"},"icon":"envelope-simple"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"cake","text":{"en":"Mum's birthday","ar":"عيد ميلاد أمي"},"sub":{"en":"Thu · 19:00","ar":"الخميس · 19:00"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"tag","text":{"en":"Last chance: free delivery","ar":"الفرصة الأخيرة: توصيل مجاني"},"sub":{"en":"Sat · all day · Lokma","ar":"السبت · طوال اليوم · لقمة"},"badge":{"text":{"en":"From email","ar":"من البريد"},"icon":"envelope-simple"}}],"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"}},"options":[{"id":"keep","text":{"en":"Keep adding them; the dates are correct","ar":"يستمرّ في إضافتها؛ فالتواريخ صحيحة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"bareed","name":{"en":"Bareed","ar":"بريد"},"color":"#0284C7","icon":"envelope-simple","domain":"bareed.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Calendar · this week","ar":"التقويم · هذا الأسبوع"}},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"tag","text":{"en":"Sale ends Friday","ar":"التخفيضات تنتهي الجمعة"},"sub":{"en":"Fri · all day · Lamha","ar":"الجمعة · طوال اليوم · لمحة"},"badge":{"text":{"en":"From email","ar":"من البريد"},"icon":"envelope-simple"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"tag","text":{"en":"50% off ends tonight","ar":"خصم 50% ينتهي الليلة"},"sub":{"en":"Wed · 23:59 · Volta","ar":"الأربعاء · 23:59 · فولتا"},"badge":{"text":{"en":"From email","ar":"من البريد"},"icon":"envelope-simple"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"cake","text":{"en":"Mum's birthday","ar":"عيد ميلاد أمي"},"sub":{"en":"Thu · 19:00","ar":"الخميس · 19:00"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"tag","text":{"en":"Last chance: free delivery","ar":"الفرصة الأخيرة: توصيل مجاني"},"sub":{"en":"Sat · all day · Lokma","ar":"السبت · طوال اليوم · لقمة"},"badge":{"text":{"en":"From email","ar":"من البريد"},"icon":"envelope-simple"}}],"caption":{"en":"Unchanged","ar":"بدون تغيير"}}},{"id":"suggest","text":{"en":"Show \"Add to calendar?\" on the email, and add only when people tap it","ar":"يعرض «إضافة إلى التقويم؟» على الرسالة، ويضيف فقط حين يضغط عليه الناس"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"bareed","name":{"en":"Bareed","ar":"بريد"},"color":"#0284C7","icon":"envelope-simple","domain":"bareed.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Calendar · this week","ar":"التقويم · هذا الأسبوع"}},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"cake","text":{"en":"Mum's birthday","ar":"عيد ميلاد أمي"},"sub":{"en":"Thu · 19:00","ar":"الخميس · 19:00"}},{"kind":"card","gap":"m","blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"In your email · Lamha","ar":"في بريدك · لمحة"},"color":"muted"},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"Sale ends Friday","ar":"التخفيضات تنتهي الجمعة"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Add to calendar?","ar":"إضافة إلى التقويم؟"},"style":"outline","icon":"calendar-plus","gap":"s"}]}],"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}},{"id":"delete","text":{"en":"Delete newsletter events every night","ar":"يحذف أحداث النشرات كل ليلة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"bareed","name":{"en":"Bareed","ar":"بريد"},"color":"#0284C7","icon":"envelope-simple","domain":"bareed.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Calendar · this week","ar":"التقويم · هذا الأسبوع"}},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"cake","text":{"en":"Mum's birthday","ar":"عيد ميلاد أمي"},"sub":{"en":"Thu · 19:00","ar":"الخميس · 19:00"}},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Newsletter events were deleted last night.","ar":"حُذفت أحداث النشرات ليلة أمس."},"color":"muted","gap":"m"}],"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}}],"answer":["suggest"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P12-040","when":["keep","delete"],"feedback":{"en":"The dates are right, but the app guessed people wanted them. Suggest, and let them choose.","ar":"التواريخ صحيحة، لكن التطبيق خمّن أن الناس يريدونها. اقترح، واتركهم يختارون."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Suggest instead of acting.","ar":"صحيح. اقترح بدل أن تتصرّف."},"explain":{"en":"\"Working as intended\" isn't enough if it guesses what people want.","ar":"«يعمل كما صُمّم» لا يكفي إذا كان يخمّن ما يريده الناس."}},{"id":"S04","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P12-U05-02","part":"retest","speaker":"sara","value":{"en":"Re-test. Errors + Graceful Failure (People + AI): when a whole group rejects suggestions at a certain time of year, it may be a cultural reason your team missed.","ar":"إعادة اختبار. الأخطاء والفشل اللطيف (People + AI): حين ترفض مجموعة كاملة الاقتراحات في وقت معيّن من السنة، فقد يكون السبب ثقافيًا لم ينتبه له فريقك."},"ref":{"url":"https://pair.withgoogle.com/chapter/errors-failing/","quote":"Whereas if all of the users in a certain group consistently rejected meat-based suggestions during a certain time of year, that might be linked to a cultural value or preference that your team hasn’t accounted for."},"scenario":{"en":"I design a recipe app. Every year, for one month, many users skip all lunch suggestions. The team thinks the lunch recipes got worse. It's Ramadan; they're fasting.","ar":"أصمّم تطبيق وصفات. وكل سنة، لمدة شهر، يتجاوز كثير من المستخدمين كل اقتراحات الغداء. والفريق يظنّ أن وصفات الغداء ساءت. إنه رمضان؛ وهم صائمون."},"prompt":{"en":"What should we do?","ar":"ماذا يجب أن نفعل؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"tabkha","name":{"en":"Tabkha","ar":"طبخة"},"color":"#EA580C","icon":"cooking-pot","domain":"tabkha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Lunch for you","ar":"غداء لك"}},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","art":"food-koshary","text":{"en":"Koshary","ar":"كشري"},"sub":{"en":"40 min","ar":"40 دقيقة"},"badge":{"text":{"en":"Skipped","ar":"تخطّاه الناس"},"tone":"neutral"}},{"kind":"listitem","art":"food-grill","text":{"en":"Grilled chicken with rice","ar":"دجاج مشوي بالأرز"},"sub":{"en":"45 min","ar":"45 دقيقة"},"badge":{"text":{"en":"Skipped","ar":"تخطّاه الناس"},"tone":"neutral"}},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Lunch taps this month: down 70%","ar":"الضغطات على وصفات الغداء هذا الشهر: أقل بنسبة 70%"},"gap":"s"}],"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"}},"options":[{"id":"new","text":{"en":"Replace the lunch recipes with new ones","ar":"نستبدل وصفات الغداء بوصفات جديدة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"tabkha","name":{"en":"Tabkha","ar":"طبخة"},"color":"#EA580C","icon":"cooking-pot","domain":"tabkha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Lunch for you","ar":"غداء لك"}},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","text":{"en":"Molokhia with rice","ar":"ملوخية بالأرز"},"art":"food-salad","sub":{"en":"50 min","ar":"50 دقيقة"}},{"kind":"listitem","text":{"en":"Pasta béchamel","ar":"مكرونة بالبشاميل"},"art":"food-pizza","sub":{"en":"60 min","ar":"60 دقيقة"}},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Lunch taps this month: down 70%","ar":"الضغطات على وصفات الغداء هذا الشهر: أقل بنسبة 70%"},"gap":"s"}],"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}},{"id":"all","text":{"en":"Switch everyone to iftar recipes during Ramadan","ar":"نحوّل الجميع إلى وصفات الإفطار في رمضان"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"tabkha","name":{"en":"Tabkha","ar":"طبخة"},"color":"#EA580C","icon":"cooking-pot","domain":"tabkha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Iftar for you","ar":"إفطار لك"}},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","text":{"en":"Lentil soup","ar":"شوربة عدس"},"art":"food-salad","sub":{"en":"30 min","ar":"30 دقيقة"}},{"kind":"listitem","text":{"en":"Stuffed vine leaves","ar":"ورق عنب محشي"},"art":"food-grill","sub":{"en":"90 min","ar":"90 دقيقة"}},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"For everyone, fasting or not","ar":"للجميع، صائمين أو لا"},"color":"muted","gap":"s"}],"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}},{"id":"offer","text":{"en":"Offer \"Fasting this month? Show iftar and suhoor recipes\"","ar":"نعرض «صائم هذا الشهر؟ اعرض وصفات الإفطار والسحور»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"tabkha","name":{"en":"Tabkha","ar":"طبخة"},"color":"#EA580C","icon":"cooking-pot","domain":"tabkha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Lunch for you","ar":"غداء لك"}},"blocks":[{"kind":"card","blocks":[{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"Fasting this month?","ar":"صائم هذا الشهر؟"}},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Show iftar and suhoor recipes","ar":"اعرض وصفات الإفطار والسحور"},"style":"outline","icon":"moon","gap":"s"}]},{"kind":"listitem","art":"food-koshary","text":{"en":"Koshary","ar":"كشري"},"sub":{"en":"40 min","ar":"40 دقيقة"},"badge":{"text":{"en":"Skipped","ar":"تخطّاه الناس"},"tone":"neutral"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"listitem","art":"food-grill","text":{"en":"Grilled chicken with rice","ar":"دجاج مشوي بالأرز"},"sub":{"en":"45 min","ar":"45 دقيقة"},"badge":{"text":{"en":"Skipped","ar":"تخطّاه الناس"},"tone":"neutral"}},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Lunch taps this month: down 70%","ar":"الضغطات على وصفات الغداء هذا الشهر: أقل بنسبة 70%"},"gap":"s"}],"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}}],"answer":["offer"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P12-040","when":["new","all"],"feedback":{"en":"One misreads the reason; the other guesses everyone fasts. See the real reason, and let each person choose.","ar":"الأول يُسيء فهم السبب؛ والثاني يخمّن أن الجميع صائمون. افهم السبب الحقيقي، واترك كل شخص يختار."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Spot the reason, then ask.","ar":"صحيح. اكتشف السبب، ثم اسأل."},"explain":{"en":"The pattern had a reason the AI couldn't see. A simple offer fits those who fast, and leaves others alone.","ar":"النمط كان له سبب لم يره الذكاء الاصطناعي. والعرض البسيط يناسب الصائمين، ويترك الآخرين كما هم."}},{"id":"S05","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P12-U05-03","part":"retest","speaker":"tarek","value":{"en":"Re-test. Errors + Graceful Failure (People + AI): focusing on what people can do after a failure keeps them in charge and the product useful.","ar":"إعادة اختبار. الأخطاء والفشل اللطيف (People + AI): التركيز على ما يستطيع الناس فعله بعد الفشل يُبقيهم أصحاب القرار ويُبقي المنتج مفيدًا."},"ref":{"url":"https://pair.withgoogle.com/chapter/errors-failing/","quote":"Focusing on what your users can do after the system fails empowers them while maintaining the usefulness of your product."},"scenario":{"en":"Our pharmacy app's smart search found the medicine, but it's out of stock at the customer's branch.","ar":"البحث الذكي في تطبيق صيدليتنا وجد الدواء، لكنه نفد في فرع العميل."},"prompt":{"en":"What should it show?","ar":"ماذا يجب أن يعرض؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dawaa","name":{"en":"Dawaa Pharmacy","ar":"صيدلية دواء"},"color":"#059669","icon":"pill","domain":"dawaa.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Search","ar":"بحث"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"searchbar","text":{"en":"concor 5","ar":"كونكور 5"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"pill","text":{"en":"Concor 5 mg · 30 tablets","ar":"كونكور 5 مجم · 30 قرصًا"},"sub":{"en":"Nasr City branch","ar":"فرع مدينة نصر"},"badge":{"text":{"en":"Out of stock","ar":"نفد من المخزون"},"tone":"bad"},"gap":"s"}],"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"}},"options":[{"id":"out","text":{"en":"Just \"Out of stock\"","ar":"فقط «نفد من المخزون»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dawaa","name":{"en":"Dawaa Pharmacy","ar":"صيدلية دواء"},"color":"#059669","icon":"pill","domain":"dawaa.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Search","ar":"بحث"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"searchbar","text":{"en":"concor 5","ar":"كونكور 5"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"pill","text":{"en":"Concor 5 mg · 30 tablets","ar":"كونكور 5 مجم · 30 قرصًا"},"sub":{"en":"Nasr City branch","ar":"فرع مدينة نصر"},"badge":{"text":{"en":"Out of stock","ar":"نفد من المخزون"},"tone":"bad"},"gap":"s"}],"caption":{"en":"Unchanged","ar":"بدون تغيير"}}},{"id":"next","text":{"en":"\"Out of stock here. Available at our Heliopolis branch (2 km), or get a message when it's back.\"","ar":"«نفد هنا. متوفّر في فرع مصر الجديدة (2 كم)، أو نرسل لك رسالة حين يتوفّر.»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dawaa","name":{"en":"Dawaa Pharmacy","ar":"صيدلية دواء"},"color":"#059669","icon":"pill","domain":"dawaa.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Search","ar":"بحث"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"searchbar","text":{"en":"concor 5","ar":"كونكور 5"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"pill","text":{"en":"Concor 5 mg · 30 tablets","ar":"كونكور 5 مجم · 30 قرصًا"},"sub":{"en":"Nasr City branch","ar":"فرع مدينة نصر"},"badge":{"text":{"en":"Out of stock","ar":"نفد من المخزون"},"tone":"bad"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"Out of stock here. Available at our Heliopolis branch (2 km), or get a message when it's back.","ar":"نفد هنا. متوفّر في فرع مصر الجديدة (2 كم)، أو نرسل لك رسالة حين يتوفّر."},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"listitem","text":{"en":"Heliopolis branch","ar":"فرع مصر الجديدة"},"icon":"map-pin","sub":{"en":"2 km","ar":"2 كم"},"badge":{"text":{"en":"In stock","ar":"متوفّر"},"tone":"good"},"chevron":true,"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Message me when it's back","ar":"أرسلوا لي رسالة حين يتوفّر"},"style":"outline","icon":"bell","gap":"s"}],"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}},{"id":"swap","text":{"en":"Add a different brand to the basket automatically","ar":"يضيف ماركة أخرى إلى السلّة تلقائيًا"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dawaa","name":{"en":"Dawaa Pharmacy","ar":"صيدلية دواء"},"color":"#059669","icon":"pill","domain":"dawaa.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Search","ar":"بحث"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"searchbar","text":{"en":"concor 5","ar":"كونكور 5"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"pill","text":{"en":"Concor 5 mg · 30 tablets","ar":"كونكور 5 مجم · 30 قرصًا"},"sub":{"en":"Nasr City branch","ar":"فرع مدينة نصر"},"badge":{"text":{"en":"Out of stock","ar":"نفد من المخزون"},"tone":"bad"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"banner","text":{"en":"We added another brand to your basket.","ar":"أضفنا ماركة أخرى إلى سلّتك."},"tone":"neutral","icon":"basket","gap":"s"},{"kind":"listitem","text":{"en":"Bisocard 5 mg · 30 tablets","ar":"بيسوكارد 5 مجم · 30 قرصًا"},"icon":"pill","badge":{"text":{"en":"In basket","ar":"في السلّة"},"tone":"brand"},"gap":"xs"}],"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}}],"answer":["next"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P12-039","when":["out","swap"],"feedback":{"en":"\"Out of stock\" is a dead end, and swapping a medicine without asking is risky. Offer safe ways to still get it.","ar":"«نفد» طريق مسدود، واستبدال الدواء دون سؤال أمر خطِر. قدّم طرقًا آمنة للحصول عليه رغم ذلك."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Safe ways to still get it.","ar":"صحيح. طرق آمنة للحصول عليه رغم ذلك."},"explain":{"en":"Another branch or a back-in-stock message keeps the customer moving, and lets them decide.","ar":"فرع آخر أو رسالة عند التوفّر تساعد العميل على إكمال طلبه، وتترك القرار له."}},{"id":"S06","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P12-U05-03","part":"retest","speaker":"nour","value":{"en":"Re-test. Errors + Graceful Failure (People + AI): setting expectations helps, but how people move forward after a failure matters just as much.","ar":"إعادة اختبار. الأخطاء والفشل اللطيف (People + AI): وضع التوقّعات يساعد، لكن طريقة مضيّ الناس بعد الفشل مهمة بالقدر نفسه."},"ref":{"url":"https://pair.withgoogle.com/chapter/errors-failing/","quote":"Setting reasonable expectations about the limitations of your technology helps set up good experiences with errors, but how users move forward is equally important."},"scenario":{"en":"A patient types to our booking assistant: \"Book Dr. Ali on Friday.\" Dr. Ali doesn't work on Fridays.","ar":"يكتب مريض لمساعد الحجز عندنا: «احجز مع د. علي يوم الجمعة.» ود. علي لا يعمل أيام الجمعة."},"prompt":{"en":"What should it reply?","ar":"بماذا يردّ مساعد الحجز، ود. علي لا يعمل يوم الجمعة؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Booking assistant","ar":"مساعد الحجز"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"chat","from":"me","text":{"en":"Book Dr. Ali on Friday.","ar":"احجز مع د. علي يوم الجمعة."},"time":"21:14"},{"kind":"chat","from":"ai","text":"…","time":"21:14"},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Dr. Ali works Saturday to Thursday.","ar":"د. علي يعمل من السبت إلى الخميس."},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"composer","text":{"en":"Type a message","ar":"اكتب رسالة"}}],"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"}},"options":[{"id":"no","text":{"en":"\"No appointments available.\"","ar":"«لا توجد مواعيد متاحة.»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Booking assistant","ar":"مساعد الحجز"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"chat","from":"me","text":{"en":"Book Dr. Ali on Friday.","ar":"احجز مع د. علي يوم الجمعة."},"time":"21:14"},{"kind":"chat","from":"ai","text":{"en":"No appointments available.","ar":"لا توجد مواعيد متاحة."},"time":"21:14"},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Dr. Ali works Saturday to Thursday.","ar":"د. علي يعمل من السبت إلى الخميس."},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"composer","text":{"en":"Type a message","ar":"اكتب رسالة"}}],"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}},{"id":"other","text":{"en":"Book Friday with another doctor, without asking","ar":"يحجز يوم الجمعة مع طبيب آخر، دون سؤال"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Booking assistant","ar":"مساعد الحجز"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"chat","from":"me","text":{"en":"Book Dr. Ali on Friday.","ar":"احجز مع د. علي يوم الجمعة."},"time":"21:14"},{"kind":"chat","from":"ai","text":{"en":"Done! Booked Friday 10 a.m. with Dr. Hany.","ar":"تمّ! حجزت الجمعة 10 صباحًا مع د. هاني."},"time":"21:14"},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Dr. Ali works Saturday to Thursday.","ar":"د. علي يعمل من السبت إلى الخميس."},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"composer","text":{"en":"Type a message","ar":"اكتب رسالة"}}],"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}},{"id":"closest","text":{"en":"\"Dr. Ali isn't in on Fridays. Closest times: Thursday 6 p.m. or Saturday 10 a.m.\"","ar":"«د. علي لا يعمل أيام الجمعة. أقرب المواعيد: الخميس 6 مساءً أو السبت 10 صباحًا.»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"raha","name":{"en":"Raha Clinic","ar":"عيادة راحة"},"color":"#0E9384","icon":"first-aid-kit","domain":"raha.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Booking assistant","ar":"مساعد الحجز"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"chat","from":"me","text":{"en":"Book Dr. Ali on Friday.","ar":"احجز مع د. علي يوم الجمعة."},"time":"21:14"},{"kind":"chat","from":"ai","text":{"en":"Dr. Ali isn't in on Fridays. Closest times: Thursday 6 p.m. or Saturday 10 a.m.","ar":"د. علي لا يعمل أيام الجمعة. أقرب المواعيد: الخميس 6 مساءً أو السبت 10 صباحًا."},"time":"21:14"},{"kind":"chips","gap":"xs","items":[{"text":{"en":"Thursday 6 p.m.","ar":"الخميس 6 مساءً"}},{"text":{"en":"Saturday 10 a.m.","ar":"السبت 10 صباحًا"}}]},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Dr. Ali works Saturday to Thursday.","ar":"د. علي يعمل من السبت إلى الخميس."},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"composer","text":{"en":"Type a message","ar":"اكتب رسالة"}}],"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}}],"answer":["closest"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P12-039","when":["no","other"],"feedback":{"en":"One leaves the patient stuck; the other changes their doctor without asking. Explain, and offer the nearest choices.","ar":"الأول يترك المريض عالقًا؛ والثاني يغيّر طبيبه دون سؤال. اشرح، وقدّم أقرب الخيارات."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Why it can't, and the closest options.","ar":"صحيح. لماذا لا يستطيع، وأقرب الخيارات."},"explain":{"en":"The patient gets what they wanted, Dr. Ali, just on another day.","ar":"يحصل المريض على ما أراده، د. علي، لكن في يوم آخر."}},{"id":"S07","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P12-U05-04","part":"retest","speaker":"youssef","value":{"en":"Re-test. Errors + Graceful Failure (People + AI): when control passes from AI to people, make it easy to pick up where the system stopped.","ar":"إعادة اختبار. الأخطاء والفشل اللطيف (People + AI): حين ينتقل التحكّم من الذكاء الاصطناعي إلى الناس، اجعل إكمال ما توقّف عنده النظام سهلًا."},"ref":{"url":"https://pair.withgoogle.com/chapter/errors-failing/","quote":"When this AI-to-manual control transition happens, it’s your responsibility to make it easy and intuitive for users to quickly pick up where the system leaves off."},"scenario":{"en":"My shop's chat bot answers customers. It can't handle refund disputes, so it passes them to me.","ar":"روبوت المحادثة في متجري يردّ على العملاء. ولا يستطيع التعامل مع خلافات الاسترداد، فيحوّلها إليّ."},"prompt":{"en":"What should I get when it hands one over?","ar":"ماذا يصلني حين يحوّل الروبوت خلافًا إليّ، لأتصرّف فورًا؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Dar · Chat","ar":"دار · المحادثة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"chat","from":"me","text":{"en":"My dress arrived torn. I want my money back, not an exchange.","ar":"وصل فستاني ممزّقًا. أريد استرداد المبلغ، لا الاستبدال."},"time":"16:20"},{"kind":"image","art":"shirt","gap":"xs"},{"kind":"chat","from":"ai","text":{"en":"I'm passing you to Youssef from our team.","ar":"سأحوّلك إلى يوسف من فريقنا."},"time":"16:21"},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Youssef joins the chat","ar":"انضمّ يوسف إلى المحادثة"},"gap":"s"}],"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"}},"options":[{"id":"ping","text":{"en":"A notification: \"New chat waiting\"","ar":"إشعار: «محادثة جديدة تنتظر»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"screen":"lock","blocks":[{"kind":"notification","title":{"en":"Dar · Support","ar":"دار · الدعم"},"text":{"en":"New chat waiting","ar":"محادثة جديدة تنتظر"},"time":{"en":"now","ar":"الآن"}}],"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}},{"id":"summary","text":{"en":"\"Order 4821 · dress arrived torn · wants a refund, not an exchange · photo attached\"","ar":"«الطلب 4821 · الفستان وصل ممزّقًا · تريد استرداد المبلغ، لا الاستبدال · الصورة مرفقة»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Dar · Chat","ar":"دار · المحادثة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"chat","from":"me","text":{"en":"My dress arrived torn. I want my money back, not an exchange.","ar":"وصل فستاني ممزّقًا. أريد استرداد المبلغ، لا الاستبدال."},"time":"16:20"},{"kind":"image","art":"shirt","gap":"xs"},{"kind":"chat","from":"ai","text":{"en":"I'm passing you to Youssef from our team.","ar":"سأحوّلك إلى يوسف من فريقنا."},"time":"16:21"},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Youssef joins the chat","ar":"انضمّ يوسف إلى المحادثة"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"card","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"badge","text":{"en":"Handover for Youssef","ar":"تسليم إلى يوسف"},"icon":"user-switch"},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"Order 4821 · dress arrived torn · wants a refund, not an exchange · photo attached","ar":"الطلب 4821 · الفستان وصل ممزّقًا · تريد استرداد المبلغ، لا الاستبدال · الصورة مرفقة"},"gap":"xs"}]}],"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}},{"id":"full","text":{"en":"The full chat log, 40 messages","ar":"سجلّ المحادثة كاملًا، 40 رسالة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Dar · Chat","ar":"دار · المحادثة"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"chat","from":"me","text":{"en":"My dress arrived torn. I want my money back, not an exchange.","ar":"وصل فستاني ممزّقًا. أريد استرداد المبلغ، لا الاستبدال."},"time":"16:20"},{"kind":"image","art":"shirt","gap":"xs"},{"kind":"chat","from":"ai","text":{"en":"I'm passing you to Youssef from our team.","ar":"سأحوّلك إلى يوسف من فريقنا."},"time":"16:21"},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Youssef joins the chat","ar":"انضمّ يوسف إلى المحادثة"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"card","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"badge","text":{"en":"Handover for Youssef","ar":"تسليم إلى يوسف"},"icon":"user-switch"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Full chat log · 40 messages","ar":"سجلّ المحادثة كاملًا · 40 رسالة"},"color":"muted","gap":"xs"},{"kind":"chat","text":{"en":"Hi","ar":"مرحبًا"},"from":"them","gap":"xs"},{"kind":"chat","text":{"en":"Hello! How can I help?","ar":"أهلًا! كيف أساعدك؟"},"from":"ai"},{"kind":"chat","text":{"en":"I ordered a dress last week","ar":"طلبت فستانًا الأسبوع الماضي"},"from":"them"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"+ 37 more messages","ar":"+ 37 رسالة أخرى"},"color":"muted","gap":"xs"}]}],"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}}],"answer":["summary"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P12-042","when":["ping","full"],"feedback":{"en":"With a bare alert I ask her everything again; with 40 messages, I read while she waits. A short summary lets me act now.","ar":"مع إشعار فارغ أسألها كل شيء من جديد؛ ومع 40 رسالة، أقرأ وهي تنتظر. والملخّص القصير يتيح لي التصرّف فورًا."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Pick up exactly where the bot stopped.","ar":"صحيح. أكمِل من حيث توقّف الروبوت بالضبط."},"explain":{"en":"A good hand-over means the customer never repeats herself.","ar":"التسليم الجيد يعني أن العميلة لا تكرّر كلامها أبدًا."}},{"id":"S08","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P12-U05-04","part":"retest","speaker":"mona","value":{"en":"Re-test. Errors + Graceful Failure (People + AI): when an AI system fails, often the easiest way forward is to let people take over.","ar":"إعادة اختبار. الأخطاء والفشل اللطيف (People + AI): حين يفشل نظام الذكاء الاصطناعي، غالبًا ما يكون أسهل طريق هو أن يتولّى الناس الأمر."},"ref":{"url":"https://pair.withgoogle.com/chapter/errors-failing/","quote":"When an AI system fails, often the easiest path forward is to let the user take over."},"scenario":{"en":"Our bank app has \"Smart save\", which moves small amounts to savings each week. It stopped, because the customer's card expired.","ar":"تطبيق بنكنا فيه «الادّخار الذكي»، الذي ينقل مبالغ صغيرة إلى الادّخار كل أسبوع. وقد توقّف، لأن بطاقة العميل انتهت صلاحيتها."},"prompt":{"en":"What should the customer see?","ar":"ماذا يرى العميل ليعرف أن الادّخار توقّف وكيف يكمله؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rasid","name":{"en":"Rasid","ar":"رصيد"},"color":"#1C3D6E","icon":"bank","domain":"rasid.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Smart save","ar":"الادّخار الذكي"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"card","blocks":[{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Saved so far","ar":"ادّخرت حتى الآن"}},{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"1,850 EGP","ar":"1,850 جنيهًا"}},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Last move: 24 April","ar":"آخر تحويل: 24 أبريل"}}]},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"credit-card","text":"Visa •••• 4417","sub":{"en":"Expired 1 May","ar":"انتهت في 1 مايو"},"gap":"s"}],"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"}},"options":[{"id":"silent","text":{"en":"Nothing; it restarts when they add a new card","ar":"لا شيء؛ سيعود للعمل حين يضيف بطاقة جديدة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rasid","name":{"en":"Rasid","ar":"رصيد"},"color":"#1C3D6E","icon":"bank","domain":"rasid.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Smart save","ar":"الادّخار الذكي"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"card","blocks":[{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Saved so far","ar":"ادّخرت حتى الآن"}},{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"1,850 EGP","ar":"1,850 جنيهًا"}},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Last move: 24 April","ar":"آخر تحويل: 24 أبريل"}}]},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"credit-card","text":"Visa •••• 4417","sub":{"en":"Expired 1 May","ar":"انتهت في 1 مايو"},"gap":"s"}],"caption":{"en":"Unchanged","ar":"بدون تغيير"}}},{"id":"paused","text":{"en":"\"Smart save paused: your card expired on 1 May. Add your new card, or save by hand this week.\"","ar":"«الادّخار الذكي متوقّف: انتهت صلاحية بطاقتك في 1 مايو. أضِف بطاقتك الجديدة، أو ادّخر يدويًا هذا الأسبوع.»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rasid","name":{"en":"Rasid","ar":"رصيد"},"color":"#1C3D6E","icon":"bank","domain":"rasid.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Smart save","ar":"الادّخار الذكي"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"card","blocks":[{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Saved so far","ar":"ادّخرت حتى الآن"}},{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"1,850 EGP","ar":"1,850 جنيهًا"}},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Last move: 24 April","ar":"آخر تحويل: 24 أبريل"}}]},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"credit-card","text":"Visa •••• 4417","sub":{"en":"Expired 1 May","ar":"انتهت في 1 مايو"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"banner","text":{"en":"Smart save paused: your card expired on 1 May. Add your new card, or save by hand this week.","ar":"الادّخار الذكي متوقّف: انتهت صلاحية بطاقتك في 1 مايو. أضِف بطاقتك الجديدة، أو ادّخر يدويًا هذا الأسبوع."},"tone":"warn","icon":"pause-circle","gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Add new card","ar":"أضِف بطاقة جديدة"},"icon":"plus","gap":"s"}],"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}},{"id":"error","text":{"en":"\"Smart save error (code 402).\"","ar":"«خطأ في الادّخار الذكي (رمز 402).»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rasid","name":{"en":"Rasid","ar":"رصيد"},"color":"#1C3D6E","icon":"bank","domain":"rasid.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Smart save","ar":"الادّخار الذكي"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"card","blocks":[{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Saved so far","ar":"ادّخرت حتى الآن"}},{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"1,850 EGP","ar":"1,850 جنيهًا"}},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Last move: 24 April","ar":"آخر تحويل: 24 أبريل"}}]},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"credit-card","text":"Visa •••• 4417","sub":{"en":"Expired 1 May","ar":"انتهت في 1 مايو"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"banner","text":{"en":"Smart save error (code 402).","ar":"خطأ في الادّخار الذكي (رمز 402)."},"tone":"bad","icon":"warning","gap":"s"}],"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}}],"answer":["paused"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P12-042","when":["silent","error"],"feedback":{"en":"Silence means weeks of missed saving, and a code means nothing to customers. Say what stopped, why, and how to take over.","ar":"الصمت يعني أسابيع من الادّخار الضائع، والرمز لا يعني شيئًا للعملاء. قل ما الذي توقّف، ولماذا، وكيف يتولّون الأمر."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. What stopped, why, and what to do.","ar":"صحيح. ما الذي توقّف، ولماذا، وماذا يفعلون."},"explain":{"en":"Two clear paths, fix the card or save by hand, keep the customer's goal on track.","ar":"طريقان واضحان، إصلاح البطاقة أو الادّخار يدويًا، يحافظان على هدف العميل في الادّخار."}},{"id":"S09","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P12-U05-05","part":"retest","speaker":"hana","value":{"en":"Re-test. Errors + Graceful Failure (People + AI): changes can break habits, so people's usual actions lead to the wrong result.","ar":"إعادة اختبار. الأخطاء والفشل اللطيف (People + AI): التغييرات قد تكسر العادات، فتؤدّي أفعال الناس المعتادة إلى نتيجة خطأ."},"ref":{"url":"https://pair.withgoogle.com/chapter/errors-failing/","quote":"When a user has built up habitual interactions with the system’s UI, but a change causes their actions to lead to a different, undesired, result."},"scenario":{"en":"In our gym app, members tap \"Check in\" at the door, at the bottom right. A new AI layout moved it, and many now tap \"Cancel class\" by mistake.","ar":"في تطبيق النادي، يضغط الأعضاء «تسجيل الحضور» عند الباب، أسفل يمين الشاشة. ونقله تصميم جديد بالذكاء الاصطناعي، فأصبح كثيرون يضغطون «إلغاء الحصة» بالخطأ."},"prompt":{"en":"What should we do?","ar":"ماذا يجب أن نفعل؟"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Spinning · 7:00","ar":"دراجات · 7:00"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"gym"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"user","text":{"en":"Coach Omar","ar":"المدرّب عمر"},"sub":{"en":"Studio 2","ar":"الاستوديو 2"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"✨ New AI layout","ar":"✨ تصميم جديد بالذكاء الاصطناعي"},"gap":"s"}],"footer":[{"kind":"row","blocks":[{"kind":"button","style":"outline","text":{"en":"Check in","ar":"تسجيل الحضور"}},{"kind":"button","style":"danger","text":{"en":"Cancel class","ar":"إلغاء الحصة"}}]}],"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"}},"options":[{"id":"back","text":{"en":"Put \"Check in\" back in its old spot, and keep it fixed","ar":"نُعيد «تسجيل الحضور» إلى مكانه القديم، ونُبقيه ثابتًا"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Spinning · 7:00","ar":"دراجات · 7:00"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"gym"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"user","text":{"en":"Coach Omar","ar":"المدرّب عمر"},"sub":{"en":"Studio 2","ar":"الاستوديو 2"},"gap":"s"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Check in","ar":"تسجيل الحضور"},"icon":"check"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Cancel class","ar":"إلغاء الحصة"},"style":"text","gap":"xs"}],"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}},{"id":"confirm","text":{"en":"Add \"Are you sure?\" to \"Cancel class\"","ar":"نضيف «هل أنت متأكّد؟» إلى «إلغاء الحصة»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Spinning · 7:00","ar":"دراجات · 7:00"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"gym"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"user","text":{"en":"Coach Omar","ar":"المدرّب عمر"},"sub":{"en":"Studio 2","ar":"الاستوديو 2"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"✨ New AI layout","ar":"✨ تصميم جديد بالذكاء الاصطناعي"},"gap":"s"}],"footer":[{"kind":"row","blocks":[{"kind":"button","style":"outline","text":{"en":"Check in","ar":"تسجيل الحضور"}},{"kind":"button","style":"danger","text":{"en":"Cancel class","ar":"إلغاء الحصة"}}]}],"overlay":{"type":"dialog","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Are you sure?","ar":"هل أنت متأكّد؟"}},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"Cancel Spinning at 7:00?","ar":"إلغاء حصة الدراجات 7:00؟"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"row","gap":"m","blocks":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Back","ar":"رجوع"},"style":"text"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Cancel class","ar":"إلغاء الحصة"},"style":"danger"}]}]},"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}},{"id":"tip","text":{"en":"Show a tip: \"Check in has moved!\"","ar":"نعرض تلميحًا: «تسجيل الحضور انتقل!»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Spinning · 7:00","ar":"دراجات · 7:00"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"gym"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"user","text":{"en":"Coach Omar","ar":"المدرّب عمر"},"sub":{"en":"Studio 2","ar":"الاستوديو 2"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"banner","text":{"en":"Check in has moved!","ar":"تسجيل الحضور انتقل!"},"tone":"brand","icon":"info","gap":"s"}],"footer":[{"kind":"row","blocks":[{"kind":"button","style":"outline","text":{"en":"Check in","ar":"تسجيل الحضور"}},{"kind":"button","style":"danger","text":{"en":"Cancel class","ar":"إلغاء الحصة"}}]}],"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}}],"answer":["back"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P12-041","when":["confirm","tip"],"feedback":{"en":"Both patch the symptom. Hands still go to the old spot. Put the button people rely on back where they expect it.","ar":"كلا الخيارين يعالج العَرَض فقط. فالأيدي تذهب إلى المكان القديم بحكم العادة. أعِد الزر الذي يعتمد عليه الناس إلى حيث يتوقّعونه."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Habits win; keep the button where hands expect it.","ar":"صحيح. العادة تنتصر؛ أبقِ الزر حيث تتوقّعه الأيدي."},"explain":{"en":"A button used every day, at the door, must never move.","ar":"الزر الذي يُستخدم كل يوم، عند الباب، يجب ألّا يتحرّك أبدًا."}},{"id":"S10","type":"tune","skill":"SK-P12-U05-05","part":"retest","speaker":"rami","value":{"en":"Re-test. Errors + Graceful Failure (People + AI): when AI keeps moving things, muscle memory opens the wrong thing.","ar":"إعادة اختبار. الأخطاء والفشل اللطيف (People + AI): حين يستمرّ الذكاء الاصطناعي في تحريك الأشياء، تفتح ذاكرة اليد الشيء الخطأ."},"ref":{"url":"https://pair.withgoogle.com/chapter/errors-failing/","quote":"Clicking in that area due to muscle memory now opens the wrong folder."},"scenario":{"en":"I'm designing a files app. The team wants \"All files\" sorted by AI, most likely first, instead of A to Z.","ar":"أصمّم تطبيقًا للملفّات. والفريق يريد ترتيب «كل الملفّات» بالذكاء الاصطناعي، ليظهر الملف الذي يُرجَّح أن تحتاجه أولًا، بدلًا من الترتيب الأبجدي."},"prompt":{"en":"What should we do?","ar":"ماذا يجب أن نفعل؟"},"mock":{"app":{"name":{"en":"Malaffat","ar":"ملفّات"},"color":"#475569","icon":"folder","domain":"malaffat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"All files","ar":"كل الملفّات"}},"blocks":[{"kind":"badge","icon":"sparkle","text":{"en":"Planned: sorted by AI","ar":"المخطّط: ترتيب بالذكاء الاصطناعي"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"file-xls","text":"Budget-2026.xlsx","gap":"s"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"file-pdf","text":"Invoice-May.pdf"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"file-doc","text":"Contract.docx"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"file-pdf","text":"Brochure.pdf"},{"kind":"small","color":"muted","text":{"en":"Today: A to Z","ar":"اليوم: أبجديًا"},"gap":"s"}],"caption":{"en":"Now","ar":"الآن"}},"options":[{"id":"ai","text":{"en":"Sort \"All files\" by AI, as planned","ar":"نرتّب «كل الملفّات» بالذكاء الاصطناعي، كما خُطّط"},"mock":{"app":{"name":{"en":"Malaffat","ar":"ملفّات"},"color":"#475569","icon":"folder","domain":"malaffat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"All files","ar":"كل الملفّات"}},"blocks":[{"kind":"badge","icon":"sparkle","text":{"en":"Planned: sorted by AI","ar":"المخطّط: ترتيب بالذكاء الاصطناعي"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"file-pdf","text":"Invoice-May.pdf","gap":"s"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"file-doc","text":"Contract.docx"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"file-xls","text":"Budget-2026.xlsx"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"file-pdf","text":"Brochure.pdf"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Sorted by AI: the order changes each day","ar":"ترتيب بالذكاء الاصطناعي: يتغيّر الترتيب كل يوم"},"color":"muted","gap":"s"}],"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}},{"id":"both","text":{"en":"Keep \"All files\" A to Z, and add a separate \"Suggested\" row above it","ar":"نُبقي «كل الملفّات» أبجديًا، ونضيف صفّ «مقترحة» منفصلًا فوقه"},"mock":{"app":{"name":{"en":"Malaffat","ar":"ملفّات"},"color":"#475569","icon":"folder","domain":"malaffat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"All files","ar":"كل الملفّات"}},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Suggested","ar":"مقترحة"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"file-pdf","text":"Invoice-May.pdf","badge":{"text":{"en":"Suggested","ar":"مقترح"},"icon":"sparkle"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"file-doc","text":"Contract.docx","badge":{"text":{"en":"Suggested","ar":"مقترح"},"icon":"sparkle"}},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"All files · A to Z","ar":"كل الملفّات · أبجديًا"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"file-pdf","text":"Brochure.pdf"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"file-xls","text":"Budget-2026.xlsx"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"file-doc","text":"Contract.docx"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"file-pdf","text":"Invoice-May.pdf"}],"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}},{"id":"random","text":{"en":"Mix the two lists into one","ar":"ندمج القائمتين في قائمة واحدة"},"mock":{"app":{"name":{"en":"Malaffat","ar":"ملفّات"},"color":"#475569","icon":"folder","domain":"malaffat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"All files","ar":"كل الملفّات"}},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"file-doc","text":"Contract.docx","badge":{"text":{"en":"Suggested","ar":"مقترح"},"icon":"sparkle"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"file-pdf","text":"Brochure.pdf"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"file-pdf","text":"Invoice-May.pdf","badge":{"text":{"en":"Suggested","ar":"مقترح"},"icon":"sparkle"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"file-xls","text":"Budget-2026.xlsx"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Suggested and all files in one list","ar":"المقترحة وكل الملفّات في قائمة واحدة"},"color":"muted","gap":"s"}],"caption":{"en":"After this change","ar":"بعد هذا التغيير"}}}],"answer":["both"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P12-041","when":["ai","random"],"feedback":{"en":"People find files by position. If the order keeps changing, they open the wrong one. Keep the list stable, and give AI its own row.","ar":"الناس يجدون الملفّات بمكانها. وإذا ظلّ الترتيب يتغيّر، يفتحون الملفّ الخطأ. أبقِ القائمة ثابتة، وأعطِ الذكاء الاصطناعي صفًّا خاصًّا به."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Stable list, separate AI row.","ar":"صحيح. قائمة ثابتة، وصفّ منفصل للذكاء الاصطناعي."},"explain":{"en":"AI can help without moving what people already know.","ar":"الذكاء الاصطناعي يستطيع أن يساعد دون أن يحرّك ما يعرفه الناس بالفعل."}}]}$uxg$::jsonb),
  ($uxg$P13-U01-B01$uxg$, $uxg$334b8903a0597e221de3f4fc48b9be18ceb55fceeaecfa418b1cc52dab308fa7$uxg$, $uxg${"id":"P13-U01-B01","mode":"bank","title":{"en":"Re-tests: let AI draft, you decide","ar":"إعادة اختبار: دع الذكاء الاصطناعي يكتب المسوّدة، وقرّر أنت"},"steps":[{"id":"S01","type":"choose","skill":"SK-P13-U01-01","part":"retest","speaker":"hana","value":{"en":"Re-test. AI for UX (NN/g): when AI gives you facts, ask for its sources and double-check the information.","ar":"إعادة اختبار. الذكاء الاصطناعي لتجربة المستخدم (NN/g): حين يعطيك الذكاء الاصطناعي معلومات، اطلب مصادرها وتحقّق منها مرة أخرى."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/ai-ux-getting-started/","quote":"Ask for links to those sources as well, and doublecheck the information provided."},"scenario":{"en":"In our gym app, I asked AI to write the help page for booking classes. It says classes open for booking 7 days ahead. Our real rule is 3 days.","ar":"في تطبيق النادي الرياضي، طلبت من الذكاء الاصطناعي أن يكتب صفحة المساعدة لحجز الحصص. وهو يقول إن الحجز يُفتح قبل 7 أيام. وقاعدتنا الحقيقية 3 أيام."},"prompt":{"en":"What does this tell you about the rest of the page?","ar":"ماذا يعني هذا الخطأ لبقية الصفحة؟"},"options":[{"id":"one","text":{"en":"Fix the 7 days. One mistake means the rest is fine","ar":"أصلح الـ7 أيام. فخطأ واحد يعني أن الباقي سليم"}},{"id":"all","text":{"en":"Check every rule on the page against our real rules","ar":"أطابق كل قاعدة في الصفحة مع قواعدنا الحقيقية"}},{"id":"stop","text":{"en":"Stop using AI for help pages","ar":"أتوقّف عن استخدام الذكاء الاصطناعي لصفحات المساعدة"}}],"answer":["all"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P13-001","when":["one"],"feedback":{"en":"If it got one rule wrong, others may be wrong too. Check them all.","ar":"إذا أخطأ في قاعدة واحدة، فقد تكون غيرها خاطئة أيضًا. تحقّق منها كلها."}},{"id":"MC-P13-002","when":["stop"],"feedback":{"en":"The draft still saved time. Checking it is your part of the work.","ar":"المسوّدة وفّرت عليك الوقت رغم ذلك. والتحقّق منها هو دورك في العمل."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. A draft with one wrong fact needs a full check.","ar":"صحيح. المسوّدة التي فيها معلومة خاطئة تحتاج تحقّقًا كاملًا."},"explain":{"en":"AI can state wrong facts with full confidence. Check each one before you publish.","ar":"الذكاء الاصطناعي قد يذكر معلومات خاطئة بثقة كاملة. تحقّق من كل واحدة قبل النشر."}},{"id":"S02","type":"choose","skill":"SK-P13-U01-01","part":"retest","speaker":"karim","value":{"en":"Re-test. AI for UX (NN/g): treat AI's work as a first draft that you review before it goes to anyone.","ar":"إعادة اختبار. الذكاء الاصطناعي لتجربة المستخدم (NN/g): تعامل مع عمل الذكاء الاصطناعي كمسوّدة أولى تراجعها قبل أن تصل إلى أي أحد."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/ai-ux-getting-started/","quote":"Don't deliver this first draft to your client or stakeholders."},"scenario":{"en":"AI wrote 40 error messages for our photo app. My lead wants them in the app by tomorrow.","ar":"كتب الذكاء الاصطناعي 40 رسالة خطأ لتطبيق الصور. ويريدها قائد الفريق في التطبيق بحلول الغد."},"prompt":{"en":"What's the best plan?","ar":"ما أفضل خطة؟"},"options":[{"id":"review","text":{"en":"Read all 40 in the real screens, and fix any that are wrong or unclear","ar":"أقرأ الـ40 في الشاشات الحقيقية، وأصلح أي رسالة خاطئة أو غير واضحة"}},{"id":"sample","text":{"en":"Read 3 of them. If those are fine, ship all 40","ar":"أقرأ 3 منها. وإذا كانت سليمة، أضع الـ40 كلها في التطبيق"}},{"id":"ship","text":{"en":"Ship them now. AI writes clearly","ar":"أضعها في التطبيق الآن. فالذكاء الاصطناعي يكتب بوضوح"}}],"answer":["review"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P13-001","when":["sample"],"feedback":{"en":"Three good ones don't prove the other 37 are right.","ar":"ثلاث رسائل جيدة لا تُثبت أن الـ37 الأخرى صحيحة."}},{"id":"MC-P13-007","when":["ship"],"feedback":{"en":"Clear writing can still give the wrong reason or the wrong fix.","ar":"الكتابة الواضحة قد تذكر سببًا خاطئًا أو حلًا خاطئًا."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Each message is a draft until you've checked it.","ar":"صحيح. كل رسالة مسوّدة حتى تتحقّق منها."},"explain":{"en":"AI made the 40 drafts fast. Your review is what makes them ready.","ar":"كتب الذكاء الاصطناعي الـ40 مسوّدة بسرعة. ومراجعتك هي ما يجعلها جاهزة."}},{"id":"S03","type":"choose","skill":"SK-P13-U01-02","part":"retest","speaker":"nour","value":{"en":"Re-test. AI for UX (NN/g): ideation is free with AI, so you can use it for many more steps than a team brainstorm allows.","ar":"إعادة اختبار. الذكاء الاصطناعي لتجربة المستخدم (NN/g): توليد الأفكار مجاني مع الذكاء الاصطناعي، فتستطيع استخدامه في خطوات أكثر بكثير مما يسمح به اجتماع عصف ذهني للفريق."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/ai-ux-getting-started/","quote":"Ideation is free with AI, so you can employ it for many more steps in the UX workflow than would be economical if you had to get a group of UX colleagues into a room for a brainstorming session."},"scenario":{"en":"Our clinic app needs new text for 12 small screens. The team can only meet for one brainstorm, enough for 2 screens.","ar":"يحتاج تطبيق العيادة نصوصًا جديدة لـ12 شاشة صغيرة. والفريق يستطيع أن يجتمع لعصف ذهني (brainstorm) واحد فقط، يكفي لشاشتين."},"prompt":{"en":"How should I use AI here?","ar":"كيف أستخدم الذكاء الاصطناعي هنا؟"},"options":[{"id":"big","text":{"en":"Only for the 2 most important screens, and leave the rest as they are","ar":"للشاشتين الأهم فقط، وأترك الباقي كما هو"}},{"id":"one","text":{"en":"Ask for one version per screen and use it","ar":"أطلب نسخة واحدة لكل شاشة وأستخدمها"}},{"id":"many","text":{"en":"Ask for several versions for every screen, then pick the best ones","ar":"أطلب عدة نسخ لكل شاشة، ثم أختار أفضلها"}}],"answer":["many"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P13-002","when":["big"],"feedback":{"en":"AI ideas cost almost nothing. The 10 small screens can get ideas too.","ar":"أفكار الذكاء الاصطناعي لا تكلّف شيئًا تقريبًا. والشاشات العشر الصغيرة تستحق أفكارًا أيضًا."}},{"id":"MC-P13-003","when":["one"],"feedback":{"en":"One version per screen leaves you nothing to choose from.","ar":"نسخة واحدة لكل شاشة لا تترك لك شيئًا لتختار منه."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. AI gives every screen its own small brainstorm.","ar":"صحيح. الذكاء الاصطناعي يعطي كل شاشة عصفًا ذهنيًا صغيرًا خاصًا بها."},"explain":{"en":"Use AI ideas on small steps too, where a team meeting would cost too much.","ar":"استخدم أفكار الذكاء الاصطناعي في الخطوات الصغيرة أيضًا، التي لا تستحق اجتماعًا للفريق."}},{"id":"S04","type":"choose","skill":"SK-P13-U01-02","part":"retest","speaker":"rami","value":{"en":"Re-test. AI for UX (NN/g): AI gives many ideas; humans need to narrow them down to the few worth exploring.","ar":"إعادة اختبار. الذكاء الاصطناعي لتجربة المستخدم (NN/g): الذكاء الاصطناعي يعطي أفكارًا كثيرة؛ والبشر يجب أن يختصروها إلى القليل الذي يستحق الاستكشاف."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/ai-ux-getting-started/","quote":"Humans need to winnow down the many of these to the few that bear further exploration and implementation."},"scenario":{"en":"AI gave me 30 names for a new \"live bus location\" feature in our bus app. Next week we test names with riders.","ar":"أعطاني الذكاء الاصطناعي 30 اسمًا لميزة جديدة لـ«موقع الحافلة المباشر» في تطبيق الحافلات. والأسبوع القادم نختبر الأسماء مع الركّاب."},"prompt":{"en":"What should I take to the test?","ar":"ماذا أعرض على الركّاب في الاختبار؟"},"options":[{"id":"aibest","text":{"en":"The one name the AI says is best","ar":"الاسم الواحد الذي يقول الذكاء الاصطناعي إنه الأفضل"}},{"id":"few","text":{"en":"3 or 4 names the team picks, based on what riders need","ar":"3 أو 4 أسماء يختارها الفريق، بناءً على ما يحتاجه الركّاب"}},{"id":"all30","text":{"en":"All 30 names, and let riders choose","ar":"الأسماء الـ30 كلها، وأترك الركّاب يختارون"}}],"answer":["few"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P13-004","when":["aibest"],"feedback":{"en":"The AI doesn't know your riders. The team should choose.","ar":"الذكاء الاصطناعي لا يعرف ركّابك. والفريق هو من يجب أن يختار."}},{"id":"MC-P13-003","when":["all30"],"feedback":{"en":"30 names would tire riders out. Picking a few is your job before the test.","ar":"30 اسمًا ستُتعب الركّاب. واختيار القليل منها مهمّتك قبل الاختبار."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. AI makes the long list; you make the short list.","ar":"صحيح. الذكاء الاصطناعي يكتب القائمة الطويلة، وأنت تختار منها القائمة القصيرة."},"explain":{"en":"More ideas mean more choosing. Use your judgment to keep only the strongest.","ar":"كلما زادت الأفكار، زاد ما عليك أن تختار منه. استخدم حكمك، واترك الأقوى فقط."}},{"id":"S05","type":"choose","skill":"SK-P13-U01-03","part":"retest","speaker":"youssef","value":{"en":"Re-test. AI for UX (NN/g): AI design critiques are dangerous because many of their points are wrong, even when they sound expert.","ar":"إعادة اختبار. الذكاء الاصطناعي لتجربة المستخدم (NN/g): نقد التصميم من الذكاء الاصطناعي خطير لأن كثيرًا من ملاحظاته خاطئة، حتى حين تبدو كلام خبير."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/ai-ux-getting-started/","quote":"AI-derived design critiques are dangerous because many of its insights are wrong"},"scenario":{"en":"I gave AI screenshots of our shop's new checkout. It replied: \"This design follows usability rules and users will find it easy.\" My business partner says we can skip the user test.","ar":"أعطيت الذكاء الاصطناعي صورًا لصفحة الدفع (checkout) الجديدة في متجرنا. فردّ: «هذا التصميم يتّبع قواعد قابلية الاستخدام (usability)، وسيجده المستخدمون سهلًا». وشريكي في المتجر يقول إننا نستطيع تخطّي اختبار المستخدمين."},"prompt":{"en":"What should I tell my partner?","ar":"ماذا أقول لشريكي؟"},"options":[{"id":"test","text":{"en":"Use the AI's notes as ideas, but still test with a few real shoppers","ar":"نستخدم ملاحظات الذكاء الاصطناعي كأفكار، لكن نختبر مع بعض المتسوّقين الحقيقيين"}},{"id":"skip","text":{"en":"Agree. The AI checked it against usability rules","ar":"أوافق. فالذكاء الاصطناعي راجعه وفق قواعد قابلية الاستخدام"}},{"id":"aiusers","text":{"en":"Skip the test, but ask AI users to try the checkout","ar":"نتخطّى الاختبار، لكن نطلب من مستخدمين اصطناعيين (AI users) أن يجرّبوا صفحة الدفع"}}],"answer":["test"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P13-006","when":["skip"],"feedback":{"en":"AI reviews often sound expert and are still wrong. Only real shoppers show you where they get stuck.","ar":"مراجعات الذكاء الاصطناعي تبدو غالبًا كأنها من خبير، ومع ذلك تكون خاطئة. والمتسوّقون الحقيقيون فقط يكشفون لك أين يتعثّرون."}},{"id":"MC-P13-010","when":["aiusers"],"feedback":{"en":"AI users tend to like what they see. They don't get stuck the way people do.","ar":"المستخدمون الاصطناعيون يُعجبهم غالبًا ما يرونه. ولا يتعثّرون كما يتعثّر الناس الحقيقيون."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. AI notes can guide the test, not replace it.","ar":"صحيح. ملاحظات الذكاء الاصطناعي توجّه الاختبار، ولا تحلّ محلّه."},"explain":{"en":"A confident AI review is not proof. Test with real people before you ship.","ar":"ثقة الذكاء الاصطناعي في مراجعته ليست دليلًا. اختبر مع أناس حقيقيين قبل النشر."}},{"id":"S06","type":"choose","skill":"SK-P13-U01-03","part":"retest","speaker":"sara","value":{"en":"Re-test. Synthetic Users vs. Human Respondents (NN/g): AI-made answers repeat the most common response and drop the less common ones real people give.","ar":"إعادة اختبار. المستخدمون الاصطناعيون مقابل المشاركين الحقيقيين (NN/g): إجابات الذكاء الاصطناعي تكرّر الرد الأكثر شيوعًا، وتُسقط الردود الأقل شيوعًا التي يعطيها الناس الحقيقيون."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/synthetic-users-vs-human-respondents/","quote":"In synthetic-users research, mode collapse refers to synthetic data that reproduces the most common data point but drops the long tail of less-common responses in the target human population."},"scenario":{"en":"Our bank wants to know why older customers avoid the app. A teammate suggests asking 200 AI users instead of calling 8 real older customers.","ar":"يريد بنكنا أن يعرف لماذا يتجنّب العملاء الأكبر سنًا التطبيق. ويقترح زميل أن نسأل 200 مستخدم اصطناعي بدلًا من الاتصال بـ8 عملاء حقيقيين أكبر سنًا."},"prompt":{"en":"Why are the 8 real customers the better choice?","ar":"لماذا الاتصال بـ8 عملاء حقيقيين هو الخيار الأفضل؟"},"options":[{"id":"same","text":{"en":"They aren't. 200 AI answers cover more people","ar":"ليسوا كذلك. فـ200 إجابة اصطناعية تغطّي ناسًا أكثر"}},{"id":"cheap","text":{"en":"Because calling people is cheaper than an AI tool","ar":"لأن الاتصال بالناس أرخص من أداة الذكاء الاصطناعي"}},{"id":"rare","text":{"en":"Real people give the unusual reasons that AI answers tend to miss","ar":"الناس الحقيقيون يذكرون الأسباب غير المعتادة التي تُفوّتها إجابات الذكاء الاصطناعي غالبًا"}}],"answer":["rare"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P13-008","when":["same"],"feedback":{"en":"200 AI answers often say the same few things. The reasons you most need may be the less common ones.","ar":"الـ200 إجابة اصطناعية تقول غالبًا الأشياء القليلة نفسها. والأسباب التي تحتاجها أكثر قد تكون الأقل شيوعًا."}},{"id":"MC-P13-006","when":["cheap"],"feedback":{"en":"Cost isn't the reason. AI answers simply can't stand in for what real people do.","ar":"التكلفة ليست السبب. فإجابات الذكاء الاصطناعي ببساطة لا تحلّ محلّ ما يفعله الناس الحقيقيون."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. The rare answers are often the ones that matter.","ar":"صحيح. الإجابات النادرة هي غالبًا الأهم."},"explain":{"en":"AI answers cluster around the common view. Real people show you the full range.","ar":"إجابات الذكاء الاصطناعي تتجمّع حول الرأي الشائع. أما الناس الحقيقيون فيكشفون لك كل الأسباب المختلفة."}},{"id":"S07","type":"choose","skill":"SK-P13-U01-04","part":"retest","speaker":"mona","value":{"en":"Re-test. AI for UX (NN/g): AI reflects its training data, which came mostly from the internet, and much of it reflects Western countries.","ar":"إعادة اختبار. الذكاء الاصطناعي لتجربة المستخدم (NN/g): الذكاء الاصطناعي يعكس البيانات التي تدرّب عليها، وأغلبها من الإنترنت، وكثير منها يعكس الدول الغربية."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/ai-ux-getting-started/","quote":"Current AI also exhibits some bias because it reflects its training data, which came mostly from the internet."},"scenario":{"en":"I asked AI to design a sign-up form for our app in Egypt. It made fields for \"First name\", \"Last name\", \"ZIP code\" and \"State\".","ar":"طلبت من الذكاء الاصطناعي أن يصمّم نموذج تسجيل لتطبيقنا في مصر. فصنع حقولًا لـ«الاسم الأول»، و«اسم العائلة»، و«الرمز البريدي (ZIP code)»، و«الولاية»."},"prompt":{"en":"What's the most likely problem?","ar":"ما المشكلة الأرجح؟"},"options":[{"id":"west","text":{"en":"The form follows US habits, so some fields may not fit users in Egypt","ar":"النموذج يتّبع العادات الأمريكية، فقد لا تناسب بعض الحقول المستخدمين في مصر"}},{"id":"none","text":{"en":"Nothing. Forms are the same everywhere","ar":"لا شيء. فالنماذج متشابهة في كل مكان"}},{"id":"short","text":{"en":"The form is too short","ar":"النموذج قصير جدًا"}}],"answer":["west"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P13-005","when":["none","short"],"feedback":{"en":"\"State\" and \"ZIP code\" are US habits. Egypt has governorates, and many people don't know their postal code.","ar":"«الولاية» و«الرمز البريدي» عادات أمريكية. ومصر فيها محافظات، وكثير من الناس لا يعرفون رمزهم البريدي."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Check AI's defaults against how your users live.","ar":"صحيح. قارن ما يضعه الذكاء الاصطناعي تلقائيًا بطريقة حياة مستخدميك."},"explain":{"en":"AI often fills in Western defaults. Look for them and change them for your users.","ar":"الذكاء الاصطناعي يضع غالبًا خيارات غربية تلقائيًا (defaults). ابحث عنها وغيّرها لتناسب مستخدميك."}},{"id":"S08","type":"choose","skill":"SK-P13-U01-04","part":"retest","speaker":"tarek","value":{"en":"Re-test. AI for UX (NN/g): the internet that AI learned from has plenty of good information, but also inaccurate and false information.","ar":"إعادة اختبار. الذكاء الاصطناعي لتجربة المستخدم (NN/g): الإنترنت الذي تعلّم منه الذكاء الاصطناعي فيه معلومات جيدة كثيرة، لكن فيه أيضًا معلومات غير دقيقة وخاطئة."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/ai-ux-getting-started/","quote":"While the internet contains plenty of good information, it also has unpleasant, inaccurate, and downright false information."},"scenario":{"en":"I asked AI how to lay out our food app's menu page. It said: \"Users never scroll, so put everything above the fold.\"","ar":"سألت الذكاء الاصطناعي كيف أرتّب صفحة القائمة في تطبيق الطعام. فقال: «المستخدمون لا يمرّرون الشاشة (scroll) أبدًا، فضع كل شيء في الجزء الظاهر قبل التمرير (above the fold)»."},"prompt":{"en":"What should I do with this advice?","ar":"ماذا أفعل بهذه النصيحة؟"},"options":[{"id":"follow","text":{"en":"Follow it. AI learned from millions of pages","ar":"أتّبعها. فالذكاء الاصطناعي تعلّم من ملايين الصفحات"}},{"id":"verify","text":{"en":"Check it against trusted UX research before I use it","ar":"أتحقّق منها في أبحاث موثوقة لتجربة المستخدم قبل أن أستخدمها"}},{"id":"ask","text":{"en":"Ask the AI \"Are you sure?\" and follow its second answer","ar":"أسأل الذكاء الاصطناعي «هل أنت متأكد؟» وأتّبع إجابته الثانية"}}],"answer":["verify"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P13-007","when":["follow","ask"],"feedback":{"en":"AI also learned from wrong pages. It can repeat a popular myth in a confident voice.","ar":"الذكاء الاصطناعي تعلّم أيضًا من صفحات خاطئة. وقد يكرّر خرافة منتشرة بثقة كاملة."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Popular online advice isn't always true.","ar":"صحيح. النصيحة المنتشرة على الإنترنت ليست صحيحة دائمًا."},"explain":{"en":"AI learned from good and bad pages alike. Check its advice against trusted sources.","ar":"تعلّم الذكاء الاصطناعي من صفحات جيدة وسيئة معًا. تحقّق من نصيحته في مصادر موثوقة."}}]}$uxg$::jsonb),
  ($uxg$P13-U02-B01$uxg$, $uxg$2d78aa2cf0de89e48ccb097e7ce092f523a90acbd288a573a13fa1fef86648bd$uxg$, $uxg${"id":"P13-U02-B01","mode":"bank","title":{"en":"Re-tests: write prompts that work","ar":"إعادة اختبار: اكتب طلبات (Prompts) تعطيك ما تحتاجه"},"steps":[{"id":"S01","type":"choose","skill":"SK-P13-U02-01","part":"retest","speaker":"rami","value":{"en":"Re-test. AI as an intern (NN/g): AI doesn't know your organization; to get good results, share the relevant details.","ar":"إعادة اختبار. الذكاء الاصطناعي كمتدرّب (NN/g): الذكاء الاصطناعي لا يعرف مؤسستك؛ ولتحصل على نتائج جيدة، شارك التفاصيل المهمّة."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/ai-intern/","quote":"To get good results, you need to share relevant details about the organization, business goals, and research needs."},"scenario":{"en":"I asked AI for a bus-delay message and got: \"Your service is delayed.\" Our riders are Cairo commuters, most delays come from traffic, and the message shows on the trip screen.","ar":"طلبت من الذكاء الاصطناعي رسالة لتأخّر الحافلة فحصلت على: «خدمتك متأخرة.» وركّابنا يتنقّلون يوميًا في القاهرة، وأغلب التأخير بسبب الزحام، والرسالة تظهر في شاشة الرحلة."},"prompt":{"en":"How do I get a better message?","ar":"كيف أحصل على رسالة أفضل؟"},"options":[{"id":"again","text":{"en":"Ask the same prompt again","ar":"أرسل الطلب (Prompt) نفسه مرة أخرى"}},{"id":"add","text":{"en":"Add who the riders are, the usual cause and where the message shows","ar":"أضيف من هم الركّاب، والسبب المعتاد، وأين تظهر الرسالة"}},{"id":"other","text":{"en":"Switch to a different AI tool","ar":"أنتقل إلى أداة ذكاء اصطناعي أخرى"}}],"answer":["add"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P13-011","when":["again","other"],"feedback":{"en":"Any AI will guess without your details. Give it what you just told me.","ar":"أي أداة ذكاء اصطناعي ستخمّن دون تفاصيلك. أعطِها ما أخبرتني به للتو."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. The details you know are what the AI is missing.","ar":"صحيح. التفاصيل التي تعرفها هي ما ينقص الذكاء الاصطناعي."},"explain":{"en":"The AI doesn't know your riders or your app. Tell it.","ar":"الذكاء الاصطناعي لا يعرف ركّابك ولا تطبيقك. فأخبره."}},{"id":"S02","type":"choose","skill":"SK-P13-U02-01","part":"retest","speaker":"mona","value":{"en":"Re-test. CARE (NN/g): focus the context on what's relevant for the task.","ar":"إعادة اختبار. CARE (NN/g): اجعل السياق مركّزًا على ما يهمّ المهمة."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/careful-prompts/","quote":"Focus on what’s relevant for the task."},"scenario":{"en":"I want AI to suggest names for the \"Autopay\" screen in our bill app. A teammate pasted our 30-page company profile as context.","ar":"أريد أن يقترح الذكاء الاصطناعي أسماء لشاشة «الدفع التلقائي» في تطبيق الفواتير. ولصق زميل ملف تعريف شركتنا المكوّن من 30 صفحة سياقًا (Context)."},"prompt":{"en":"What should the context be?","ar":"ماذا يجب أن يكون السياق؟"},"options":[{"id":"all","text":{"en":"Keep all 30 pages. More is better","ar":"أُبقي الصفحات الثلاثين. فالأكثر أفضل"}},{"id":"none","text":{"en":"Remove it all and send only the ask","ar":"أحذفه كله وأرسل المطلوب فقط"}},{"id":"focus","text":{"en":"A few lines: what Autopay does, who uses it, and where the name appears","ar":"بضعة أسطر: ماذا يفعل الدفع التلقائي، ومن يستخدمه، وأين يظهر الاسم"}}],"answer":["focus"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P13-017","when":["all"],"feedback":{"en":"Most of those pages have nothing to do with this screen. They can pull the AI off track.","ar":"أغلب هذه الصفحات لا علاقة لها بهذه الشاشة. وقد تُبعد الذكاء الاصطناعي عن المطلوب."}},{"id":"MC-P13-011","when":["none"],"feedback":{"en":"Too far the other way. With no context, the AI only guesses.","ar":"وهذه مبالغة في الاتجاه المعاكس. فدون سياق، الذكاء الاصطناعي يخمّن فقط."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Short and on topic.","ar":"صحيح. قصير ومتعلّق بالموضوع."},"explain":{"en":"Give the context this task needs, not everything you have.","ar":"أعطِ السياق الذي تحتاجه هذه المهمة، لا كل ما لديك."}},{"id":"S03","type":"choose","skill":"SK-P13-U02-02","part":"retest","speaker":"tarek","value":{"en":"Re-test. CARE (NN/g): part of a specific ask is the format: how do you want to receive the results?","ar":"إعادة اختبار. CARE (NN/g): جزء من الطلب المحدّد هو الشكل: كيف تريد أن تستلم النتائج؟"},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/careful-prompts/","quote":"The format: How do you want to receive the results?"},"scenario":{"en":"AI gave me 10 ideas for our food app's \"Order again\" button, mixed into one long paragraph with its reasons. I need to share them with my team.","ar":"أعطاني الذكاء الاصطناعي 10 أفكار لزر «اطلب مرة أخرى» في تطبيق الطعام، مخلوطة في فقرة طويلة واحدة مع أسبابها. وأحتاج أن أشاركها مع فريقي."},"prompt":{"en":"What should I add to the ask?","ar":"ماذا أضيف إلى الطلب؟"},"options":[{"id":"table","text":{"en":"\"Show the 10 ideas in a table: the idea in column 1, the reason in column 2.\"","ar":"«اعرض الأفكار العشر في جدول: الفكرة في العمود الأول، والسبب في العمود الثاني.»"}},{"id":"short","text":{"en":"\"Be shorter.\"","ar":"«كن أقصر.»"}},{"id":"more","text":{"en":"\"Give me 20 ideas instead.\"","ar":"«أعطني 20 فكرة بدلًا من ذلك.»"}}],"answer":["table"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P13-012","when":["short","more"],"feedback":{"en":"The problem is the format. Say exactly how you want the ideas laid out.","ar":"المشكلة في الشكل. قل بالضبط كيف تريد ترتيب الأفكار."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. A clear format, ready to share.","ar":"صحيح. شكل واضح، جاهز للمشاركة."},"explain":{"en":"Say how you want the answer: a list, a table, a set number of words.","ar":"قل كيف تريد الإجابة: قائمة، أو جدول، أو عدد محدّد من الكلمات."}},{"id":"S04","type":"choose","skill":"SK-P13-U02-02","part":"retest","speaker":"karim","value":{"en":"Re-test. CARE (NN/g): smaller, more focused tasks tend to give better results.","ar":"إعادة اختبار. CARE (NN/g): المهام الأصغر والأكثر تركيزًا تعطي غالبًا نتائج أفضل."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/careful-prompts/","quote":"Smaller, more focused tasks tend to yield better results."},"scenario":{"en":"Our team needs a research plan for our photo app, and I offered to draft it with AI. My first idea is one prompt: \"Make a full research plan for our app.\"","ar":"يحتاج فريقنا خطة بحث لتطبيق الصور، وعرضت أن أكتب مسوّدتها بالذكاء الاصطناعي. وفكرتي الأولى طلب واحد: «اصنع خطة بحث كاملة لتطبيقنا.»"},"prompt":{"en":"What's a better way to ask?","ar":"كيف أكتب الطلب بطريقة أفضل؟"},"options":[{"id":"long","text":{"en":"The same one-line ask, but with \"very detailed\" added","ar":"الطلب نفسه في سطر واحد، مع إضافة «مفصّلة جدًا»"}},{"id":"steps","text":{"en":"One part at a time: first research questions, then methods, then the recruiting questions","ar":"جزء في كل مرة: أولًا أسئلة البحث، ثم الطرق، ثم أسئلة اختيار المشاركين"}},{"id":"copy","text":{"en":"Ask for a plan another company used","ar":"أطلب خطة استخدمتها شركة أخرى"}}],"answer":["steps"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P13-012","when":["long"],"feedback":{"en":"\"Very detailed\" is still one big, open job. Break it into focused steps.","ar":"«مفصّلة جدًا» تبقى مهمة كبيرة مفتوحة. قسّمها إلى خطوات مركّزة."}},{"id":"MC-P13-017","when":["copy"],"feedback":{"en":"Another company's plan doesn't fit your app or your questions.","ar":"خطة شركة أخرى لا تناسب تطبيقك ولا أسئلتك."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Small steps you can check one by one.","ar":"صحيح. خطوات صغيرة تستطيع مراجعتها واحدة واحدة."},"explain":{"en":"Walk the AI through a big task in small parts. Each part is easier to check.","ar":"قسّم المهمة الكبيرة على الذكاء الاصطناعي إلى أجزاء صغيرة. فكل جزء أسهل في المراجعة."}},{"id":"S05","type":"choose","skill":"SK-P13-U02-03","part":"retest","speaker":"hana","value":{"en":"Re-test. CARE (NN/g): to improve an existing message, include it in the prompt and describe what you don't like about it.","ar":"إعادة اختبار. CARE (NN/g): لتحسين رسالة موجودة، ضعها في الطلب وصِف ما لا يعجبك فيها."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/careful-prompts/","quote":"For example, if you’re trying to improve an existing error message, include it in your prompt and describe what you don’t like about it or what needs improvement."},"scenario":{"en":"When two members book the last spot at once, our gym app shows: \"Error 409: Booking conflict.\" I want AI to help rewrite it.","ar":"حين يحجز عضوان آخر مكان في الوقت نفسه، يعرض تطبيق النادي: «Error 409: Booking conflict.» وأريد أن يساعدني الذكاء الاصطناعي في إعادة كتابة هذه الرسالة."},"prompt":{"en":"What should the prompt include?","ar":"ماذا يجب أن يتضمّن الطلب؟"},"options":[{"id":"hide","text":{"en":"Leave the old message out, so the AI isn't influenced by it","ar":"أترك الرسالة القديمة خارج الطلب، حتى لا يتأثّر بها الذكاء الاصطناعي"}},{"id":"friendly","text":{"en":"Just \"Make our error messages friendlier.\"","ar":"فقط «اجعل رسائل الخطأ عندنا ألطف.»"}},{"id":"show","text":{"en":"The old message, with: \"Too technical. Members don't know the spot is gone or what to do.\"","ar":"الرسالة القديمة، مع: «تقنية جدًا. الأعضاء لا يعرفون أن المكان حُجز ولا ماذا يفعلون.»"}}],"answer":["show"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P13-014","when":["hide","friendly"],"feedback":{"en":"Showing the bad message and why it fails tells the AI exactly what to fix.","ar":"عرض الرسالة السيئة وسبب فشلها يخبر الذكاء الاصطناعي بالضبط بما يجب إصلاحه."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. A bad example plus the reason.","ar":"صحيح. مثال سيئ مع السبب."},"explain":{"en":"Paste what you have and say what's wrong. It's one of the clearest examples you can give.","ar":"الصق ما لديك وقل ما الخطأ فيه. فهذا من أوضح الأمثلة التي تستطيع تقديمها."}},{"id":"S06","type":"choose","skill":"SK-P13-U02-03","part":"retest","speaker":"youssef","value":{"en":"Re-test. CARE (NN/g): rules can include design limits, such as the space the copy must fit or a maximum character count.","ar":"إعادة اختبار. CARE (NN/g): القواعد قد تشمل حدود التصميم، مثل المساحة التي يجب أن يناسبها النص أو أقصى عدد للحروف."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/careful-prompts/","quote":"We can also include product or brand-specific rules, such as tone-of-voice guidelines, and design constraints to consider, such as the amount of space in which the copy should fit or a maximum character count."},"scenario":{"en":"I asked AI for sale notifications for our shop. The lock screen shows about 40 characters, but every message is around 120, so the offer gets cut off.","ar":"طلبت من الذكاء الاصطناعي إشعارات للتخفيضات في متجرنا. وشاشة القفل تُظهر نحو 40 حرفًا، لكن كل رسالة نحو 120 حرفًا، فيُقطع العرض."},"prompt":{"en":"What should I add to the prompt?","ar":"ماذا أضيف إلى الطلب؟"},"options":[{"id":"limit","text":{"en":"\"Max 40 characters. Put the discount first.\"","ar":"«40 حرفًا كحدّ أقصى. ضع الخصم أولًا.»"}},{"id":"short","text":{"en":"\"Make them short.\"","ar":"«اجعلها قصيرة.»"}},{"id":"cut","text":{"en":"Nothing. I'll cut each one myself afterwards","ar":"لا شيء. سأختصر كل واحدة بنفسي بعد ذلك"}}],"answer":["limit"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P13-013","when":["short","cut"],"feedback":{"en":"\"Short\" means different things. Give the exact limit, and the AI can write for it.","ar":"كلمة «قصيرة» تعني أشياء مختلفة. أعطِ الحدّ بالضبط، فيكتب الذكاء الاصطناعي على أساسه."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. An exact limit and what goes first.","ar":"صحيح. حدّ دقيق، وما يأتي أولًا."},"explain":{"en":"Turn your screen's space into a number the AI can follow.","ar":"حوّل مساحة شاشتك إلى رقم يستطيع الذكاء الاصطناعي اتّباعه."}},{"id":"S07","type":"choose","skill":"SK-P13-U02-04","part":"retest","speaker":"sara","value":{"en":"Re-test. CARE (NN/g): combine multiple options: pick the parts you want and mix them with your own.","ar":"إعادة اختبار. CARE (NN/g): اجمع عدة خيارات: اختر الأجزاء التي تريدها وامزجها مع عملك."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/careful-prompts/","quote":"Combine multiple options."},"scenario":{"en":"AI gave me 5 versions of our \"card blocked\" message. None is right. Version 2 explains the reason well, and version 4 has a clear next step.","ar":"أعطاني الذكاء الاصطناعي 5 نسخ لرسالة «تم إيقاف البطاقة». ولا واحدة مناسبة. النسخة 2 تشرح السبب جيدًا، والنسخة 4 فيها خطوة تالية واضحة."},"prompt":{"en":"What should I do?","ar":"ماذا أفعل؟"},"options":[{"id":"pick","text":{"en":"Use version 2. The reason matters most","ar":"أستخدم النسخة 2. فالسبب هو الأهم"}},{"id":"mix","text":{"en":"Join the reason from 2 with the next step from 4, then edit the words","ar":"أجمع السبب من 2 مع الخطوة التالية من 4، ثم أحرّر الكلمات"}},{"id":"drop","text":{"en":"None is right, so stop using AI for this","ar":"لا واحدة مناسبة، فأتوقّف عن استخدام الذكاء الاصطناعي لهذا"}}],"answer":["mix"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P13-001","when":["pick"],"feedback":{"en":"Version 2 leaves people stuck. You can take the best of both.","ar":"النسخة 2 تترك الناس عالقين. وتستطيع أن تأخذ أفضل ما في النسختين."}},{"id":"MC-P13-002","when":["drop"],"feedback":{"en":"Two versions have exactly the parts you need. Use them.","ar":"نسختان فيهما بالضبط الأجزاء التي تحتاجها. فاستخدمهما."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Mix the best parts, then polish.","ar":"صحيح. اجمع أفضل الأجزاء، ثم حسّنها."},"explain":{"en":"AI answers are raw material. Combine and edit them into your final text.","ar":"إجابات الذكاء الاصطناعي مادة خام. اجمعها وحرّرها لتصنع نصك النهائي."}},{"id":"S08","type":"choose","skill":"SK-P13-U02-04","part":"retest","speaker":"nour","value":{"en":"Re-test. CARE (NN/g): the more detailed your instructions, the more likely the AI will forget or overlook some of them.","ar":"إعادة اختبار. CARE (NN/g): كلما زادت تفاصيل تعليماتك، زاد احتمال أن ينسى الذكاء الاصطناعي بعضها أو يتجاهله."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/careful-prompts/","quote":"The more detailed your instructions are, the more likely the generative AI chatbot will forget or overlook one or more details."},"scenario":{"en":"My prompt for lab-result messages had 9 rules. The answer looks great at first glance.","ar":"كان في طلبي لرسائل نتائج التحاليل 9 قواعد. والإجابة تبدو رائعة من أول نظرة."},"prompt":{"en":"What should I do before using it?","ar":"ماذا أفعل قبل استخدامها؟"},"options":[{"id":"trust","text":{"en":"Use it. With 9 clear rules, it must have followed them","ar":"أستخدمها. فمع 9 قواعد واضحة، لا بد أنه اتّبعها"}},{"id":"one","text":{"en":"Check the most important rule only","ar":"أراجع القاعدة الأهم فقط"}},{"id":"each","text":{"en":"Go through all 9 rules, and ask it to redo anything it missed","ar":"أراجع القواعد التسع كلها، وأطلب منه إعادة أي شيء فاته"}}],"answer":["each"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P13-015","when":["trust","one"],"feedback":{"en":"More rules means more chances to skip one. Check them all.","ar":"كلما زادت القواعد، زادت فرصة أن يتخطّى واحدة منها. راجعها كلها."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. A long prompt needs a full check.","ar":"صحيح. الطلب الطويل يحتاج مراجعة كاملة."},"explain":{"en":"Looking great isn't the same as following every rule. Check each one.","ar":"الشكل الرائع لا يعني أنها اتّبعت كل قاعدة. راجع كل واحدة."}}]}$uxg$::jsonb),
  ($uxg$P13-U03-B01$uxg$, $uxg$584694d7d8a1305866cd571fe03afeb498ff51ad2e9bd5d6fbd1c42ea97db213$uxg$, $uxg${"id":"P13-U03-B01","mode":"bank","title":{"en":"Re-tests: check what AI tells you","ar":"إعادة اختبار: تحقّق ممّا يخبرك به الذكاء الاصطناعي"},"steps":[{"id":"S01","type":"choose","skill":"SK-P13-U03-01","part":"retest","speaker":"hana","value":{"en":"Re-test. AI Hallucinations (NN/g): AI doesn't know when it has gotten something right; it isn't a fact database.","ar":"إعادة اختبار. هلوسة الذكاء الاصطناعي (NN/g): الذكاء الاصطناعي لا يعرف متى أصاب؛ فهو ليس قاعدة بيانات للحقائق."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/ai-hallucinations/","quote":"Fundamentally, the problem is that LLMs don't know when they've gotten something correct"},"scenario":{"en":"I asked AI if our gym should offer shorter classes. It said: \"Research shows 74% of gym members prefer 20-minute classes.\" No source was given.","ar":"سألت الذكاء الاصطناعي هل يجب أن يقدّم نادينا حصصًا أقصر. فقال: «تُظهر الأبحاث أن 74% من أعضاء النوادي يفضّلون حصص الـ20 دقيقة.» ولم يذكر أي مصدر."},"prompt":{"en":"How should I treat that number?","ar":"كيف أتعامل مع هذا الرقم؟"},"options":[{"id":"precise","text":{"en":"Trust it. A number that exact must come from somewhere","ar":"أثق به. فرقم بهذه الدقة لا بد أن يكون له مصدر"}},{"id":"guess","text":{"en":"As a guess until I find the real research, or ask our own members","ar":"كتخمين حتى أجد البحث الحقيقي، أو أسأل أعضاءنا أنفسهم"}},{"id":"round","text":{"en":"Round it to \"about 70%\" to be safe","ar":"أقرّبه إلى «نحو 70%» لأكون في أمان"}}],"answer":["guess"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P13-018","when":["precise","round"],"feedback":{"en":"Exact numbers can be made up too. Rounding a made-up number doesn't make it real.","ar":"الأرقام الدقيقة قد تكون مُختلَقة أيضًا. وتقريب رقم مُختلَق لا يجعله حقيقيًا."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. No source, no fact.","ar":"صحيح. بلا مصدر، لا معلومة."},"explain":{"en":"AI can't tell its true facts from its false ones. Find the source, or get your own data.","ar":"الذكاء الاصطناعي لا يميّز معلوماته الصحيحة من الخاطئة. ابحث عن المصدر، أو اجمع بياناتك."}},{"id":"S02","type":"choose","skill":"SK-P13-U03-01","part":"retest","speaker":"tarek","value":{"en":"Re-test. Sycophancy (NN/g): catching false AI information is harder if you don't already know the topic.","ar":"إعادة اختبار. التملّق (NN/g): اكتشاف المعلومات الخاطئة من الذكاء الاصطناعي أصعب إذا لم تكن تعرف الموضوع أصلًا."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/sycophancy-generative-ai-chatbots/","quote":"Catching false information is harder if you don't already have some expertise in the topic."},"scenario":{"en":"Our food app is launching in Saudi Arabia. I know nothing about its e-invoice rules, so I asked AI. Its answer sounds detailed and sure.","ar":"سنطلق تطبيق الطعام في السعودية. ولا أعرف شيئًا عن قواعد الفواتير الإلكترونية هناك، فسألت الذكاء الاصطناعي. وإجابته تبدو مفصّلة وواثقة."},"prompt":{"en":"How much can I rely on it?","ar":"إلى أي حدّ أستطيع الاعتماد عليها؟"},"options":[{"id":"start","text":{"en":"Use it as a start, then check with official sources or a local expert","ar":"أستخدمها كبداية، ثم أتحقّق من المصادر الرسمية أو من خبير محلّي"}},{"id":"full","text":{"en":"Fully. It's detailed, so it's probably right","ar":"تمامًا. فهي مفصّلة، إذن صحيحة على الأرجح"}},{"id":"spot","text":{"en":"I'll read it carefully and spot any errors myself","ar":"سأقرؤها بعناية وأكتشف أي أخطاء بنفسي"}}],"answer":["start"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P13-018","when":["full"],"feedback":{"en":"Detail isn't proof. AI can be detailed and wrong at the same time.","ar":"التفصيل ليس دليلًا. فالذكاء الاصطناعي قد يكون مفصّلًا ومخطئًا في الوقت نفسه."}},{"id":"MC-P13-007","when":["spot"],"feedback":{"en":"When you don't know a topic, wrong answers look just like right ones. You need an expert source.","ar":"حين لا تعرف موضوعًا، تبدو الإجابات الخاطئة مثل الصحيحة تمامًا. فتحتاج مصدرًا خبيرًا."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. The less you know, the more you check.","ar":"صحيح. كلما قلّت معرفتك، زاد تحقّقك."},"explain":{"en":"In a topic you don't know, you can't catch AI's mistakes. Check with experts.","ar":"في موضوع لا تعرفه، لا تستطيع اكتشاف أخطاء الذكاء الاصطناعي. فتحقّق مع الخبراء."}},{"id":"S03","type":"choose","skill":"SK-P13-U03-02","part":"retest","speaker":"mona","value":{"en":"Re-test. Sycophancy (NN/g): AI adapts its answers to agree with the user's view, even when that view isn't true.","ar":"إعادة اختبار. التملّق (NN/g): الذكاء الاصطناعي يكيّف إجاباته ليوافق رأي المستخدم، حتى حين لا يكون هذا الرأي صحيحًا."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/sycophancy-generative-ai-chatbots/","quote":"Sycophancy refers to instances in which an AI model adapts responses to align with the user's view, even if the view is not objectively true."},"scenario":{"en":"I'm about to ask AI: \"Our users hate long forms, so a one-field sign-up is always best, right?\"","ar":"أنا على وشك أن أسأل الذكاء الاصطناعي: «مستخدمونا يكرهون النماذج الطويلة، إذن التسجيل بحقل واحد هو الأفضل دائمًا، صح؟»"},"prompt":{"en":"What's the better question?","ar":"ما السؤال الأفضل؟"},"options":[{"id":"same","text":{"en":"The same one. It's what I want to know","ar":"السؤال نفسه. فهذا ما أريد معرفته"}},{"id":"strong","text":{"en":"\"Confirm that one-field sign-up is always best.\"","ar":"«أكّد أن التسجيل بحقل واحد هو الأفضل دائمًا.»"}},{"id":"open","text":{"en":"\"For a bill-payment app, what are the trade-offs of short and longer sign-up forms?\"","ar":"«في تطبيق لدفع الفواتير، ما المكاسب والخسائر لنماذج التسجيل القصيرة والأطول؟»"}}],"answer":["open"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P13-020","when":["same","strong"],"feedback":{"en":"Both tell the AI what you think. It will likely just agree.","ar":"كلاهما يخبر الذكاء الاصطناعي برأيك. وعلى الأرجح سيوافقك فقط."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. An open question gets a real answer.","ar":"صحيح. السؤال المفتوح يأتيك بإجابة حقيقية."},"explain":{"en":"Ask about trade-offs, not for agreement.","ar":"اسأل عن المكاسب والخسائر، ولا تطلب منه أن يوافقك."}},{"id":"S04","type":"choose","skill":"SK-P13-U03-02","part":"retest","speaker":"youssef","value":{"en":"Re-test. Sycophancy (NN/g): just saying \"I dislike this argument\" can make a model change its answer completely.","ar":"إعادة اختبار. التملّق (NN/g): مجرد قول «لا يعجبني هذا الرأي» قد يجعل النموذج يغيّر إجابته تمامًا."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/sycophancy-generative-ai-chatbots/","quote":"For example, stating I dislike this argument is enough for a language model to fundamentally change a response to a given prompt."},"scenario":{"en":"AI said our shop should show delivery costs before checkout. I replied, \"I don't like that idea.\" Now it says delivery costs are better left for the last step.","ar":"قال الذكاء الاصطناعي إن متجرنا يجب أن يُظهر تكلفة التوصيل قبل صفحة الدفع. فرددت: «لا تعجبني هذه الفكرة.» والآن يقول إن الأفضل أن تُترك تكلفة التوصيل للخطوة الأخيرة."},"prompt":{"en":"What should I take from this?","ar":"ماذا أستنتج من هذا؟"},"options":[{"id":"agree","text":{"en":"It agrees with me now, so I was right","ar":"إنه يوافقني الآن، إذن كنت محقًا"}},{"id":"pressure","text":{"en":"It changed because of my reaction, not new facts. I should decide with research and user data","ar":"غيّر رأيه بسبب ردّ فعلي، لا بسبب معلومات جديدة. ويجب أن أقرّر بالبحث وبيانات المستخدمين"}},{"id":"first","text":{"en":"Its first answer is always the true one","ar":"إجابته الأولى هي الصحيحة دائمًا"}}],"answer":["pressure"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P13-020","when":["agree"],"feedback":{"en":"It agreed because you pushed. That isn't evidence.","ar":"لقد وافق لأنك ضغطت. وهذا ليس دليلًا."}},{"id":"MC-P13-021","when":["first"],"feedback":{"en":"Neither answer is proof. A flip only shows the AI bends to your view.","ar":"ولا إجابة من الاثنتين دليل. فالتراجع يُظهر فقط أن الذكاء الاصطناعي يميل إلى رأيك."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Feelings changed its answer; facts should decide yours.","ar":"صحيح. المشاعر غيّرت إجابته، والحقائق يجب أن تحدّد قرارك."},"explain":{"en":"When the AI flips to match you, go back to real evidence.","ar":"حين يتراجع الذكاء الاصطناعي ليوافقك، ارجع إلى الأدلة الحقيقية."}},{"id":"S05","type":"choose","skill":"SK-P13-U03-03","part":"retest","speaker":"nour","value":{"en":"Re-test. Demand Accuracy from AI (NN/g): following an AI recommendation without question can lower conversion, and the team may not know why.","ar":"إعادة اختبار. اطلب الدقة من الذكاء الاصطناعي (NN/g): اتّباع اقتراح الذكاء الاصطناعي دون تفكير قد يُخفض نسبة التحويل، وقد لا يعرف الفريق السبب."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/baymard-ai-tool-accuracy/","quote":"If the team followed that recommendation unquestioningly, it may inadvertently decrease the conversion rate and not even realize why it happened."},"scenario":{"en":"An AI review of our clinic app says: \"Remove doctor photos from the booking list to make it cleaner.\" Patients often pick a doctor they've seen before.","ar":"تقول مراجعة بالذكاء الاصطناعي لتطبيق العيادة: «احذف صور الأطباء من قائمة الحجز لتصبح أنظف.» والمرضى كثيرًا ما يختارون طبيبًا رأوه من قبل."},"prompt":{"en":"What should I do with this suggestion?","ar":"ماذا أفعل بهذا الاقتراح؟"},"options":[{"id":"do","text":{"en":"Remove the photos. Cleaner is better","ar":"أحذف الصور. فالأنظف أفضل"}},{"id":"drop","text":{"en":"Stop using AI reviews","ar":"أتوقّف عن استخدام مراجعات الذكاء الاصطناعي"}},{"id":"test","text":{"en":"Check it against how patients choose, and test before removing anything","ar":"أقارنه بطريقة اختيار المرضى، وأختبر قبل أن أحذف أي شيء"}}],"answer":["test"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P13-022","when":["do"],"feedback":{"en":"Patients use the photos to find their doctor. Removing them could cut bookings.","ar":"المرضى يستخدمون الصور ليجدوا طبيبهم. وحذفها قد يقلّل الحجوزات."}},{"id":"MC-P13-002","when":["drop"],"feedback":{"en":"Some AI suggestions are useful. Check them instead of dropping them all.","ar":"بعض اقتراحات الذكاء الاصطناعي مفيدة. تحقّق منها بدلًا من التخلّي عنها كلها."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Check it against your users first.","ar":"صحيح. قارنه بمستخدميك أولًا."},"explain":{"en":"A neat-sounding AI fix can hurt. Check it against how your users really behave.","ar":"اقتراح الذكاء الاصطناعي قد يبدو مرتّبًا ويضرّ مع ذلك. قارنه بسلوك مستخدميك الحقيقي."}},{"id":"S06","type":"choose","skill":"SK-P13-U03-03","part":"retest","speaker":"rami","value":{"en":"Re-test. Demand Accuracy from AI (NN/g): AI tools that scan pages usually find only some types of issues, like contrast or white space, not all UX problems.","ar":"إعادة اختبار. اطلب الدقة من الذكاء الاصطناعي (NN/g): أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي التي تفحص الصفحات تكتشف عادةً بعض أنواع المشكلات فقط، مثل التباين أو المسافات، لا كل مشكلات تجربة المستخدم."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/baymard-ai-tool-accuracy/","quote":"An AI-powered tool designed to scan pages for identifiable UX problems is typically capable of detecting only some types of issues (e.g. poor visual contrast, inconsistent copy, or insufficient white space), rather than addressing all types of UX issues."},"scenario":{"en":"An AI tool scanned our bus app and found no problems: good contrast, consistent words, enough space. My manager says our UX is done.","ar":"فحصت أداة ذكاء اصطناعي تطبيق الحافلات ولم تجد أي مشكلة: تباين جيد، وكلمات موحّدة، ومسافات كافية. ومديري يقول إن تجربة المستخدم عندنا اكتملت."},"prompt":{"en":"What do I tell him?","ar":"ماذا أقول له؟"},"options":[{"id":"done","text":{"en":"He's right. The tool checked everything","ar":"إنه محق. فالأداة فحصت كل شيء"}},{"id":"surface","text":{"en":"The tool checks only some surface issues. We still need to see if riders can plan trips easily","ar":"الأداة تفحص بعض المشكلات السطحية فقط. وما زلنا نحتاج أن نرى هل يخطّط الركّاب لرحلاتهم بسهولة"}},{"id":"rerun","text":{"en":"Run the scan again to be sure","ar":"نشغّل الفحص مرة أخرى لنتأكّد"}}],"answer":["surface"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P13-023","when":["done","rerun"],"feedback":{"en":"A clean scan only means no surface issues. Whether riders can do their tasks needs real users.","ar":"حين لا يجد الفحص مشكلات، فهذا يعني فقط عدم وجود مشكلات سطحية. أما هل يُنجز الركّاب مهامّهم فيحتاج مستخدمين حقيقيين."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. No surface issues isn't the same as good UX.","ar":"صحيح. غياب المشكلات السطحية لا يعني أن تجربة المستخدم جيدة."},"explain":{"en":"Know what an AI tool can't see. Test the rest with people.","ar":"اعرف ما لا تستطيع أداة الذكاء الاصطناعي رؤيته. واختبر الباقي مع الناس."}},{"id":"S07","type":"choose","skill":"SK-P13-U03-04","part":"retest","speaker":"sara","value":{"en":"Re-test. One AI Output Is an Example (NN/g): one good output shows the system can do a task, not how often or how reliably it will.","ar":"إعادة اختبار. ناتج واحد مثال (NN/g): الناتج الجيد الواحد يُظهر أن النظام يستطيع أداء المهمة، لا كم مرة ولا بأي ثقة سيؤدّيها."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/eval-ai-output/","quote":"One good output demonstrates that a system can perform a task. It does not show how often or how reliably the system will do so."},"scenario":{"en":"A company showed us an AI tool that sorts customer complaints into topics. In their demo, it sorted one complaint perfectly.","ar":"عرضت علينا شركة أداة ذكاء اصطناعي تفرز شكاوى العملاء حسب الموضوع. وفي عرضهم التجريبي، فرزت شكوى واحدة فرزًا ممتازًا."},"prompt":{"en":"What should we ask for before we decide?","ar":"ماذا نطلب من الشركة قبل أن نقرّر؟"},"options":[{"id":"another","text":{"en":"A second demo with a different complaint","ar":"عرض تجريبي ثانٍ بشكوى مختلفة"}},{"id":"trial","text":{"en":"A trial on a few hundred of our real complaints, run more than once, to see how often it's right","ar":"تجربة على بضع مئات من شكاوانا الحقيقية، تُشغَّل أكثر من مرة، لنرى كم مرة تصيب"}},{"id":"reviews","text":{"en":"Reviews from other customers of the tool","ar":"آراء عملاء آخرين استخدموا الأداة"}}],"answer":["trial"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P13-024","when":["another","reviews"],"feedback":{"en":"One or two examples, or other people's opinions, don't show how it handles your complaints.","ar":"مثال أو اثنان، أو آراء الآخرين، لا تُظهر كيف تتعامل الأداة مع شكاواك."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Your data, many times.","ar":"صحيح. بياناتك، مرات كثيرة."},"explain":{"en":"Test AI tools on many of your own real inputs before you trust them.","ar":"اختبر أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي على كثير من مدخلاتك الحقيقية قبل أن تثق بها."}},{"id":"S08","type":"choose","skill":"SK-P13-U03-04","part":"retest","speaker":"karim","value":{"en":"Re-test. One AI Output Is an Example (NN/g): AI evaluations should use representative inputs, enough observations, and report average performance and its variation.","ar":"إعادة اختبار. ناتج واحد مثال (NN/g): تقييمات الذكاء الاصطناعي يجب أن تستخدم مدخلات ممثِّلة، وملاحظات كافية، وأن تذكر متوسّط الأداء ومدى تفاوته."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/eval-ai-output/","quote":"AI evaluations should do the same: use representative inputs, collect enough observations, and report average performance, together with variability and uncertainty."},"scenario":{"en":"Our photo app writes image descriptions for blind users with AI. I tried two prompts on one photo each. Prompt B's description looked better.","ar":"تطبيق الصور يكتب بالذكاء الاصطناعي أوصافًا للصور للمستخدمين المكفوفين. وجرّبت طلبين (Prompts) على صورة واحدة لكل منهما. فبدا وصف الطلب B أفضل."},"prompt":{"en":"Can I switch to Prompt B?","ar":"هل أعتمد الطلب B بدلًا من A؟"},"options":[{"id":"test","text":{"en":"Not yet. Try both on many different photos, several times each, then compare","ar":"ليس بعد. أجرّب الاثنين على صور مختلفة كثيرة، عدة مرات لكل منها، ثم أقارن"}},{"id":"yes","text":{"en":"Yes. B clearly won","ar":"نعم. B فاز بوضوح"}},{"id":"same","text":{"en":"Try both again on the same photo","ar":"أجرّب الاثنين مرة أخرى على الصورة نفسها"}}],"answer":["test"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P13-024","when":["yes","same"],"feedback":{"en":"One photo can't show which prompt works better on the thousands of photos users upload.","ar":"صورة واحدة لا تُظهر أي طلب يعمل أفضل على آلاف الصور التي يرفعها المستخدمون."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Many photos, many runs, then decide.","ar":"صحيح. صور كثيرة، ومرات كثيرة، ثم قرّر."},"explain":{"en":"Compare AI prompts like a study: many real inputs, repeated runs, average results.","ar":"قارن طلبات الذكاء الاصطناعي كما في دراسة: مدخلات حقيقية كثيرة، وتشغيل متكرّر، ثم متوسّط النتائج."}}]}$uxg$::jsonb),
  ($uxg$P13-U04-B01$uxg$, $uxg$3c756b5878dd6f85b70d8faecc2f1877c365ba30a28a56058c8908f0192a5b99$uxg$, $uxg${"id":"P13-U04-B01","mode":"bank","title":{"en":"Re-tests: research faster with AI","ar":"إعادة اختبار: ابحث أسرع بالذكاء الاصطناعي"},"steps":[{"id":"S01","type":"choose","skill":"SK-P13-U04-01","part":"retest","speaker":"nour","value":{"en":"Re-test. Accelerating Research with AI (NN/g): ideally, have an experienced researcher review the final list of AI-drafted questions.","ar":"إعادة اختبار. تسريع البحث بالذكاء الاصطناعي (NN/g): الأفضل أن يراجع باحث متمرّس القائمة النهائية للأسئلة التي كتبها الذكاء الاصطناعي."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/research-with-ai/","quote":"Ideally, have a human research expert review your final list of ideas."},"scenario":{"en":"AI wrote 10 survey questions for our patients. One is: \"How much do you love our new booking app?\" I'm new to research.","ar":"كتب الذكاء الاصطناعي 10 أسئلة استبيان لمرضانا. وأحدها: «ما مدى حبّك لتطبيق الحجز الجديد؟» وأنا جديدة في البحث."},"prompt":{"en":"What should I do before sending the survey?","ar":"ماذا أفعل قبل إرسال الاستبيان؟"},"options":[{"id":"send","text":{"en":"Send it. The AI knows how to write surveys","ar":"أرسله. فالذكاء الاصطناعي يعرف كيف يكتب الاستبيانات"}},{"id":"one","text":{"en":"Fix that one question and send the rest","ar":"أصلح ذلك السؤال وحده وأرسل الباقي"}},{"id":"review","text":{"en":"Rewrite it neutrally, then ask an experienced researcher to review all 10","ar":"أعيد صياغته بحياد، ثم أطلب من باحث متمرّس أن يراجع الأسئلة العشرة كلها"}}],"answer":["review"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P13-025","when":["send","one"],"feedback":{"en":"\"How much do you love\" pushes patients to say nice things. Others may lead them too, and they're harder to spot when you're new.","ar":"«ما مدى حبّك» تدفع المرضى إلى قول كلام لطيف. وقد توجّههم أسئلة أخرى أيضًا، ويصعب اكتشافها حين تكون جديدًا."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Fix it, then get a second pair of expert eyes.","ar":"صحيح. أصلحه، ثم اطلب من خبير أن يراجع الأسئلة."},"explain":{"en":"AI questions often lead people. A research expert can catch what you might miss.","ar":"أسئلة الذكاء الاصطناعي كثيرًا ما توجّه الناس. والخبير في البحث يلتقط ما قد يفوتك."}},{"id":"S02","type":"choose","skill":"SK-P13-U04-01","part":"retest","speaker":"sara","value":{"en":"Re-test. Accelerating Research with AI (NN/g): watch out for mistakes in how AI fills in research documents.","ar":"إعادة اختبار. تسريع البحث بالذكاء الاصطناعي (NN/g): انتبه للأخطاء في طريقة ملء الذكاء الاصطناعي لمستندات البحث."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/research-with-ai/","quote":"Watch out for mistakes in how the system completes the documentation."},"scenario":{"en":"AI filled in our invite email template for bank customers. We offer a 200 EGP voucher for a 30-minute online call on Monday.","ar":"ملأ الذكاء الاصطناعي قالب رسالة الدعوة لعملاء البنك. ونحن نقدّم قسيمة بقيمة 200 جنيه مقابل مكالمة عبر الإنترنت مدّتها 30 دقيقة يوم الاثنين."},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rasid","name":{"en":"Rasid","ar":"رصيد"},"color":"#1C3D6E","icon":"bank","domain":"rasid.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Inbox","ar":"البريد الوارد"},"back":true},"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Pick a time","ar":"اختر موعدًا"}}],"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","avatar":{"text":"Rasid"},"text":{"en":"Rasid Research","ar":"فريق أبحاث رصيد"},"sub":{"en":"To: you · 9:12 AM","ar":"إليك · 9:12 ص"}},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Help us improve the app","ar":"ساعدنا في تحسين التطبيق"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"Join a 60-minute session at our Cairo office on Tuesday. As a thank-you, you'll get a 500 EGP voucher.","ar":"انضمّ إلى جلسة مدّتها 60 دقيقة في مكتبنا بالقاهرة يوم الثلاثاء. وشكرًا لمشاركتك، ستحصل على قسيمة بقيمة 500 جنيه."},"gap":"s"}]},"prompt":{"en":"What should I check?","ar":"ماذا أراجع؟"},"options":[{"id":"facts","text":{"en":"Every detail: length, place, day and voucher are all wrong","ar":"كل تفصيلة: المدة، والمكان، واليوم، والقسيمة كلها خاطئة"}},{"id":"tone","text":{"en":"Only the tone. The details came from our template","ar":"النبرة فقط. فالتفاصيل جاءت من قالبنا"}},{"id":"money","text":{"en":"Only the voucher amount","ar":"قيمة القسيمة فقط"}}],"answer":["facts"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P13-001","when":["tone","money"],"feedback":{"en":"A template doesn't stop wrong details. Four facts here don't match the study.","ar":"القالب لا يمنع التفاصيل الخاطئة. فأربع معلومات هنا لا تطابق الدراسة."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Customers would come to the wrong place, expecting the wrong gift.","ar":"صحيح. كان العملاء سيأتون إلى المكان الخطأ، ويتوقّعون الهدية الخطأ."},"explain":{"en":"Check every detail AI fills in against your real study plan.","ar":"قارن كل تفصيلة يملؤها الذكاء الاصطناعي بخطّة دراستك الحقيقية."}},{"id":"S03","type":"choose","skill":"SK-P13-U04-02","part":"retest","speaker":"youssef","value":{"en":"Re-test. Accelerating Research with AI (NN/g): usability testing is a behavioral method, so what people do matters more than what they say.","ar":"إعادة اختبار. تسريع البحث بالذكاء الاصطناعي (NN/g): اختبار قابلية الاستخدام طريقة سلوكية، لذلك ما يفعله الناس أهم ممّا يقولونه."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/research-with-ai/","quote":"Since usability testing is a behavioral method, what people do is more important to us than what they say."},"scenario":{"en":"In a test of our shop's search, a customer said: \"I'd just search for it.\" The AI summary says: \"Search works well.\"","ar":"في اختبار للبحث في متجرنا، قال عميل: «سأبحث عنه فقط.» وملخّص الذكاء الاصطناعي يقول: «البحث يعمل جيدًا.»"},"prompt":{"en":"What should I check?","ar":"ماذا أراجع؟"},"options":[{"id":"summary","text":{"en":"Nothing. The summary matches what he said","ar":"لا شيء. فالملخّص يطابق ما قاله"}},{"id":"video","text":{"en":"The recording: did his search actually find the product, and how fast?","ar":"التسجيل: هل وجد بحثه المنتج فعلًا، وبأي سرعة؟"}},{"id":"ask","text":{"en":"Call him and ask if search worked","ar":"أتّصل به وأسأله هل نجح البحث"}}],"answer":["video"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P13-027","when":["summary","ask"],"feedback":{"en":"Saying he'd search isn't the same as finding it. Only his actions show if search works.","ar":"قوله إنه سيبحث لا يعني أنه وجد المنتج. وأفعاله فقط تُظهر هل البحث يعمل."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. His actions answer the question.","ar":"صحيح. أفعاله تجيب عن السؤال."},"explain":{"en":"In usability tests, check what people did, not only what they said.","ar":"في اختبارات قابلية الاستخدام (Usability tests)، تحقّق ممّا فعله الناس، لا ممّا قالوه فقط."}},{"id":"S04","type":"choose","skill":"SK-P13-U04-02","part":"retest","speaker":"mona","value":{"en":"Re-test. Accelerating Research with AI (NN/g): AI tools are superb at processing text, but they can't understand users' actions or nonverbal interactions with an interface.","ar":"إعادة اختبار. تسريع البحث بالذكاء الاصطناعي (NN/g): أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي ممتازة في معالجة النصوص، لكنها لا تفهم أفعال المستخدمين ولا تفاعلهم غير اللفظي مع الواجهة."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/research-with-ai/","quote":"While current AI tools are superb at processing text, they cannot understand and interpret users' actions or nonverbal interactions with an interface."},"scenario":{"en":"To save time, a teammate suggests 20 remote tests of our bill app, where an AI tool listens to what users say aloud and writes all the findings. No one watches.","ar":"لتوفير الوقت، يقترح زميل 20 اختبارًا عن بُعد لتطبيق الفواتير، تستمع فيها أداة ذكاء اصطناعي لما يقوله المستخدمون بصوت عالٍ وتكتب كل النتائج. ولا أحد يشاهد."},"prompt":{"en":"What's the problem with this plan?","ar":"ما المشكلة في هذه الخطة؟"},"options":[{"id":"problem","text":{"en":"The tool only hears words. It will miss where users hesitate, tap wrong or give up quietly","ar":"الأداة تسمع الكلمات فقط. وسيفوتها أين يتردّد المستخدمون، أو يضغطون خطأ، أو يستسلمون بصمت"}},{"id":"number","text":{"en":"20 tests are too many","ar":"20 اختبارًا عدد كبير جدًا"}},{"id":"none","text":{"en":"Nothing. Users say what they're doing","ar":"لا شيء. فالمستخدمون يقولون ما يفعلونه"}}],"answer":["problem"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P13-026","when":["none","number"],"feedback":{"en":"Users don't narrate every tap. Silent struggles are often the biggest findings.","ar":"المستخدمون لا يصفون بصوت عالٍ كل ضغطة. والتعثّر الصامت كثيرًا ما يكون أهم النتائج."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Someone has to see what users do.","ar":"صحيح. يجب أن يرى أحدٌ ما يفعله المستخدمون."},"explain":{"en":"AI tools handle words well and actions badly. Usability tests need someone watching.","ar":"أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي تفهم الكلمات جيدًا، لكنها ضعيفة في فهم الأفعال. واختبارات قابلية الاستخدام تحتاج شخصًا يشاهد."}},{"id":"S05","type":"choose","skill":"SK-P13-U04-03","part":"retest","speaker":"hana","value":{"en":"Re-test. Accelerating Research with AI (NN/g): review any suggested groupings, because AI can misunderstand meaning and tag data incorrectly.","ar":"إعادة اختبار. تسريع البحث بالذكاء الاصطناعي (NN/g): راجع أي مجموعات مقترحة، لأن الذكاء الاصطناعي قد يُسيء فهم المعنى ويصنّف البيانات خطأ."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/research-with-ai/","quote":"Review any suggested codes or groupings because AI can sometimes misunderstand the meaning and can organize or tag data incorrectly."},"scenario":{"en":"AI sorted 200 member comments. Under \"Positive: popular classes\" it put: \"The 7 PM class is so packed I can't move.\"","ar":"فرز الذكاء الاصطناعي 200 تعليق من الأعضاء. وتحت «إيجابي: حصص مشهورة» وضع: «حصة الساعة 7 مساءً مزدحمة لدرجة أنني لا أستطيع الحركة.»"},"prompt":{"en":"What does this tell me about the AI's groups?","ar":"ماذا يعني هذا لمجموعات الذكاء الاصطناعي؟"},"options":[{"id":"one","text":{"en":"Just move this one comment. The rest are fine","ar":"أنقل هذا التعليق وحده. والباقي سليم"}},{"id":"fine","text":{"en":"Nothing. Packed classes are popular, so it's positive","ar":"لا شيء. فالحصص المزدحمة مشهورة، إذن هو إيجابي"}},{"id":"review","text":{"en":"It misread a complaint as praise, so I review every group before using it","ar":"لقد فهم شكوى على أنها مديح، فأراجع كل مجموعة قبل أن أستخدمها"}}],"answer":["review"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P13-028","when":["one","fine"],"feedback":{"en":"This member is complaining about crowding. If the AI misread this one, it may have misread others.","ar":"هذا العضو يشتكي من الزحام. وإذا أساء الذكاء الاصطناعي فهم هذا التعليق، فقد يكون أساء فهم غيره."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. One wrong tag means checking them all.","ar":"صحيح. تصنيف خاطئ واحد يعني أن تراجعها كلها."},"explain":{"en":"AI can miss what people mean. Review the groups against the comments.","ar":"الذكاء الاصطناعي قد يفوته ما يقصده الناس. فراجع المجموعات على التعليقات نفسها."}},{"id":"S06","type":"choose","skill":"SK-P13-U04-03","part":"retest","speaker":"tarek","value":{"en":"Re-test. Accelerating Research with AI (NN/g): AI groupings are often surface-level, since clustering is often around keywords.","ar":"إعادة اختبار. تسريع البحث بالذكاء الاصطناعي (NN/g): تجميعات الذكاء الاصطناعي كثيرًا ما تكون سطحية، لأن التجميع يعتمد غالبًا على الكلمات المفتاحية."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/research-with-ai/","quote":"Surface-level groupings, since clustering is often around keywords"},"scenario":{"en":"AI made a theme called \"Driver\" from our food app's reviews. It has \"the driver was rude\", \"driver tracking is wrong\" and \"I can't tip the driver in the app\".","ar":"صنع الذكاء الاصطناعي مجموعة (Theme) اسمها «السائق» من تقييمات تطبيق الطعام. وفيها «السائق كان وقحًا»، و«تتبّع السائق خاطئ»، و«لا أستطيع إعطاء السائق بقشيشًا من التطبيق»."},"prompt":{"en":"What's wrong with this theme?","ar":"ما المشكلة في هذه المجموعة؟"},"options":[{"id":"word","text":{"en":"It groups by the word \"driver\". These are three different problems for three different teams","ar":"تجمّع حسب كلمة «السائق». وهذه ثلاث مشكلات مختلفة لثلاثة فرق مختلفة"}},{"id":"none","text":{"en":"Nothing. They're all about drivers","ar":"لا شيء. فكلها عن السائقين"}},{"id":"small","text":{"en":"It needs more reviews in it","ar":"تحتاج تقييمات أكثر فيها"}}],"answer":["word"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P13-028","when":["none","small"],"feedback":{"en":"Service, a tracking bug and a missing feature don't share a fix. Split them.","ar":"سوء معاملة السائق، وخلل في التتبّع، وميزة ناقصة لا يجمعها حل واحد. افصل بينها."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Same word, different problems.","ar":"صحيح. الكلمة نفسها، والمشكلات مختلفة."},"explain":{"en":"AI often groups by shared words. Regroup by the real problem behind them.","ar":"الذكاء الاصطناعي كثيرًا ما يجمّع حسب الكلمات المشتركة. أعد التجميع حسب المشكلة الحقيقية وراءها."}},{"id":"S07","type":"choose","skill":"SK-P13-U04-04","part":"retest","speaker":"rami","value":{"en":"Re-test. Accelerating Research with AI (NN/g): double-check transcriptions; AI makes mistakes, especially with several speakers and poor audio.","ar":"إعادة اختبار. تسريع البحث بالذكاء الاصطناعي (NN/g): تحقّق من النصوص المكتوبة مرة أخرى؛ فالذكاء الاصطناعي يخطئ، خاصة مع تعدّد المتحدّثين وضعف جودة الصوت."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/research-with-ai/","quote":"Double-check transcriptions: AI-powered transcription can make mistakes, especially when there are multiple speakers and poor-quality audio."},"scenario":{"en":"I interviewed riders in pairs at a noisy bus station. In the AI transcripts, some lines seem to come from the wrong person.","ar":"أجريت مقابلات مع ركّاب، كل اثنين معًا، في محطة حافلات صاخبة. وفي نصوص الذكاء الاصطناعي، تبدو بعض الجمل منسوبة إلى الشخص الخطأ."},"prompt":{"en":"What should I do?","ar":"ماذا أفعل؟"},"options":[{"id":"asis","text":{"en":"Use them. Who said it doesn't matter much","ar":"أستخدمها. فمن قالها لا يهمّ كثيرًا"}},{"id":"check","text":{"en":"Check the key parts against the recording, fixing who said what","ar":"أقارن الأجزاء المهمّة بالتسجيل، وأصلح من قال ماذا"}},{"id":"redo","text":{"en":"Throw them away and redo the interviews","ar":"أتخلّص منها وأعيد المقابلات"}}],"answer":["check"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P13-030","when":["asis"],"feedback":{"en":"A daily rider and a first-time rider can mean very different things. Who said it matters.","ar":"الراكب اليومي والراكب لأول مرة قد يقصدان أشياء مختلفة جدًا. فمن قالها يهمّ."}},{"id":"MC-P13-002","when":["redo"],"feedback":{"en":"The recordings are fine. Fixing the transcript is much faster.","ar":"التسجيلات سليمة. وإصلاح النص أسرع بكثير."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Noise and two voices mean extra checking.","ar":"صحيح. الضوضاء وصوتان يعنيان تحقّقًا إضافيًا."},"explain":{"en":"With noise or several speakers, check AI transcripts against the recording.","ar":"مع الضوضاء أو تعدّد المتحدّثين، قارن نصوص الذكاء الاصطناعي بالتسجيل."}},{"id":"S08","type":"choose","skill":"SK-P13-U04-04","part":"retest","speaker":"karim","value":{"en":"Re-test. Accelerating Research with AI (NN/g): thoroughly spot-check any analysis or data processing you ask AI to do.","ar":"إعادة اختبار. تسريع البحث بالذكاء الاصطناعي (NN/g): افحص بعناية عيّنات من أي تحليل أو معالجة بيانات تطلبها من الذكاء الاصطناعي."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/research-with-ai/","quote":"Be sure to thoroughly spot-check any analysis or data processing you ask the AI to perform."},"scenario":{"en":"I set up an AI tool to remove names and phone numbers from 5,000 support chats before our design team reads them.","ar":"أعددت أداة ذكاء اصطناعي لتحذف الأسماء وأرقام الهواتف من 5,000 محادثة دعم قبل أن يقرأها فريق التصميم."},"prompt":{"en":"What should I do before sharing them?","ar":"ماذا أفعل قبل مشاركتها؟"},"options":[{"id":"share","text":{"en":"Share them. The tool is built for this","ar":"أشاركها. فالأداة مصمّمة لهذا"}},{"id":"one","text":{"en":"Open one chat to see if it worked","ar":"أفتح محادثة واحدة لأرى هل نجحت"}},{"id":"sample","text":{"en":"Check a good sample for missed phone numbers and for useful details it removed","ar":"أفحص عيّنة جيدة بحثًا عن أرقام هواتف فاتتها وعن تفاصيل مفيدة حذفتها"}}],"answer":["sample"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P13-031","when":["share","one"],"feedback":{"en":"Cleaning tools make mistakes both ways. One missed phone number is a privacy leak.","ar":"أدوات التنظيف تخطئ في الاتجاهين. ورقم هاتف واحد فاتها يعني تسريبًا للخصوصية."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Check for what leaked and what was lost.","ar":"صحيح. تحقّق ممّا تسرّب وممّا ضاع."},"explain":{"en":"Spot-check AI data cleaning before anyone sees the data.","ar":"افحص عيّنات من تنظيف الذكاء الاصطناعي للبيانات قبل أن يراها أحد."}}]}$uxg$::jsonb),
  ($uxg$P13-U05-B01$uxg$, $uxg$26341ca95721016f8a9d381bb37fc14fadb7a62a102311fe8c0832ab401467c2$uxg$, $uxg${"id":"P13-U05-B01","mode":"bank","title":{"en":"Re-tests: design with AI, keep the judgment","ar":"إعادة اختبار: صمّم بالذكاء الاصطناعي، والقرار لك"},"steps":[{"id":"S01","type":"choose","skill":"SK-P13-U05-01","part":"retest","speaker":"hana","value":{"en":"Re-test. AI Design Tools Are Marginally Better (NN/g): unlike broad AI that takes any input, narrow-scope AI specializes in one or a few specific tasks.","ar":"إعادة اختبار. أدوات التصميم بالذكاء الاصطناعي أفضل قليلًا (NN/g): على عكس الذكاء الاصطناعي الواسع الذي يقبل أي مُدخل، يتخصّص الذكاء الاصطناعي المحدود في مهمة واحدة أو مهام قليلة محدّدة."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/ai-design-tools-update-2/","quote":"Unlike broad AIs (like ChatGPT), which accept a wide range of inputs and produce an equally wide array of outputs, narrow-scope AIs specialize in one or few specific tasks."},"scenario":{"en":"I'm updating our gym app on my own. I have 30 classes that need short descriptions, and I want a new app design.","ar":"أحدّث تطبيق النادي بنفسي. ولديّ 30 حصة تحتاج أوصافًا قصيرة، وأريد تصميمًا جديدًا للتطبيق."},"prompt":{"en":"Where will AI help me most?","ar":"أين سيساعدني الذكاء الاصطناعي أكثر؟"},"options":[{"id":"app","text":{"en":"Generate the whole new app design from one sentence","ar":"توليد تصميم التطبيق الجديد كاملًا من جملة واحدة"}},{"id":"desc","text":{"en":"Draft the 30 class descriptions from my notes, then I edit them","ar":"كتابة مسوّدات أوصاف الحصص الثلاثين من ملاحظاتي، ثم أحرّرها"}},{"id":"prices","text":{"en":"Decide the new membership prices","ar":"تحديد أسعار الاشتراك الجديدة"}}],"answer":["desc"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P13-032","when":["app","prices"],"feedback":{"en":"Big, open jobs are where AI falls short. Thirty similar descriptions are exactly its kind of job.","ar":"الذكاء الاصطناعي يقصّر في المهام الكبيرة المفتوحة. أما ثلاثون وصفًا متشابهًا فهي المهمة التي يُتقنها."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Many similar small pieces: a perfect AI job.","ar":"صحيح. قطع صغيرة متشابهة كثيرة: مهمة مثالية للذكاء الاصطناعي."},"explain":{"en":"Give AI the narrow, repeated work, and keep the big decisions.","ar":"أعطِ الذكاء الاصطناعي العمل المحدود المتكرّر، واحتفظ بالقرارات الكبيرة."}},{"id":"S02","type":"choose","skill":"SK-P13-U05-01","part":"retest","speaker":"youssef","value":{"en":"Re-test. AI Design Tools Are Marginally Better (NN/g): AI images work well as placeholders; using them in final designs isn't recommended, since trust can drop if users notice.","ar":"إعادة اختبار. أدوات التصميم بالذكاء الاصطناعي أفضل قليلًا (NN/g): صور الذكاء الاصطناعي تصلح كصور مؤقتة؛ واستخدامها في التصاميم النهائية غير مُستحسن، لأن الثقة قد تنهار إذا لاحظ المستخدمون."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/ai-design-tools-update-2/","quote":"While we do not recommend you do so, since user trust can plummet if they notice AI use, it does work in a pinch when resources are scarce."},"scenario":{"en":"I need product photos for 50 items. Some are for next week's prototype test, and the rest are for the live shop.","ar":"أحتاج صورًا لـ50 منتجًا. بعضها لاختبار النموذج الأولي الأسبوع القادم، والباقي للمتجر الفعلي."},"prompt":{"en":"How should I use AI images?","ar":"كيف أستخدم صور الذكاء الاصطناعي؟"},"options":[{"id":"all","text":{"en":"Use AI images everywhere. They look great and cost nothing","ar":"أستخدم صور الذكاء الاصطناعي في كل مكان. فهي تبدو رائعة ولا تكلّف شيئًا"}},{"id":"none","text":{"en":"Never use them, not even in the prototype","ar":"لا أستخدمها أبدًا، ولا حتى في النموذج الأولي"}},{"id":"proto","text":{"en":"Use them in the prototype, and use real photos of the real products in the live shop","ar":"أستخدمها في النموذج الأولي، وأستخدم صورًا حقيقية للمنتجات الحقيقية في المتجر الفعلي"}}],"answer":["proto"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P13-032","when":["all"],"feedback":{"en":"Shoppers need to see the real product. If they spot AI photos, they may stop trusting the shop.","ar":"المتسوّقون يحتاجون أن يروا المنتج الحقيقي. وإذا لاحظوا صور الذكاء الاصطناعي، قد يتوقّفون عن الثقة بالمتجر."}},{"id":"MC-P13-002","when":["none"],"feedback":{"en":"For a quick test, AI placeholders save time and money. Just keep them out of the live shop.","ar":"في اختبار سريع، الصور المؤقتة (Placeholders) من الذكاء الاصطناعي توفّر الوقت والمال. فقط أبقِها خارج المتجر الفعلي."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Placeholders for tests, real photos for buyers.","ar":"صحيح. صور مؤقتة للاختبار، وصور حقيقية للمشترين."},"explain":{"en":"AI placeholders are a good small job. Real products need real photos.","ar":"الصور المؤقتة من الذكاء الاصطناعي مهمة صغيرة جيدة. والمنتجات الحقيقية تحتاج صورًا حقيقية."}},{"id":"S03","type":"choose","skill":"SK-P13-U05-02","part":"retest","speaker":"tarek","value":{"en":"Re-test. AI Design Tools Are Marginally Better (NN/g): no AI tool supports design systems well yet, and a prototype of random design elements isn't helpful.","ar":"إعادة اختبار. أدوات التصميم بالذكاء الاصطناعي أفضل قليلًا (NN/g): لا توجد بعد أداة ذكاء اصطناعي تدعم أنظمة التصميم جيدًا، والنموذج الأولي المكوّن من عناصر عشوائية غير مفيد."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/ai-design-tools-update-2/","quote":"Currently, no genAI tool effectively supports design systems; this limitation lowers their utility within design teams."},"scenario":{"en":"AI generated a new restaurant page for our food app. The buttons, fonts and cards look nothing like the rest of our app. A teammate wants to ship it as is.","ar":"ولّد الذكاء الاصطناعي صفحة مطعم جديدة لتطبيق الطعام. والأزرار والخطوط والبطاقات لا تشبه بقية تطبيقنا أبدًا. ويريد زميل أن يطلقها كما هي."},"prompt":{"en":"What do I tell my teammate?","ar":"ماذا أقول لزميلي؟"},"options":[{"id":"idea","text":{"en":"Let's keep its good ideas and rebuild the page with our design system","ar":"لنحتفظ بأفكارها الجيدة ونُعيد بناء الصفحة بنظام التصميم (Design system) عندنا"}},{"id":"ship","text":{"en":"Ship it. A fresh look is good","ar":"لنطلقها. فالشكل الجديد جيد"}},{"id":"colors","text":{"en":"Just change its colors to ours and ship it","ar":"لنغيّر ألوانها إلى ألواننا فقط ونطلقها"}}],"answer":["idea"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P13-033","when":["ship","colors"],"feedback":{"en":"A page that doesn't match the app confuses users and is harder for developers to keep. Colors alone won't fix that.","ar":"الصفحة التي لا تشبه بقية التطبيق تُربك المستخدمين ويصعب على المطوّرين صيانتها. والألوان وحدها لن تُصلح ذلك."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Its ideas, our system.","ar":"صحيح. أفكارها، ونظامنا."},"explain":{"en":"AI screens ignore your design system. Use their ideas, then build with your own parts.","ar":"شاشات الذكاء الاصطناعي تتجاهل نظام التصميم عندك. استخدم أفكارها، ثم ابنِ بمكوّناتك (Components)."}},{"id":"S04","type":"choose","skill":"SK-P13-U05-02","part":"retest","speaker":"karim","value":{"en":"Re-test. Prompt to Design Interfaces (NN/g): repetition without purpose only adds noise and distracts users from the key content.","ar":"إعادة اختبار. من الطلب إلى تصميم الواجهات (NN/g): التكرار بلا هدف يضيف ضوضاء فقط ويشتّت المستخدمين عن المحتوى الأساسي."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/vague-prototyping/","quote":"Repetition without purpose only adds noise to the interface and distracts users from the key content."},"scenario":{"en":"I'm coding an order screen the AI tool generated. It shows the order status twice: as a progress bar and as a step list right under it.","ar":"أبرمج شاشة طلب ولّدتها أداة الذكاء الاصطناعي. وهي تُظهر حالة الطلب مرتين: كشريط تقدّم (Progress bar)، وكقائمة خطوات تحته مباشرة."},"prompt":{"en":"What should I do?","ar":"ماذا أفعل؟"},"options":[{"id":"both","text":{"en":"Code both. The AI must have had a reason","ar":"أبرمج الاثنين. فلا بد أن للذكاء الاصطناعي سببًا"}},{"id":"ask","text":{"en":"Ask the designer to keep one, since the repeat adds noise","ar":"أطلب من المصمم أن يُبقي واحدًا، لأن التكرار يزحم الشاشة"}},{"id":"third","text":{"en":"Add a status text too, to be extra clear","ar":"أضيف نص حالة أيضًا، ليكون أوضح"}}],"answer":["ask"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P13-034","when":["both","third"],"feedback":{"en":"AI often repeats things for no reason. Showing the same status twice only crowds the screen.","ar":"الذكاء الاصطناعي كثيرًا ما يكرّر الأشياء بلا سبب. وإظهار الحالة نفسها مرتين يزحم الشاشة فقط."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. One clear status is enough.","ar":"صحيح. حالة واحدة واضحة تكفي."},"explain":{"en":"Watch for repeats in AI screens. Each one costs space and attention.","ar":"انتبه للتكرار في شاشات الذكاء الاصطناعي. فكل تكرار يأخذ مساحة وانتباهًا."}},{"id":"S05","type":"choose","skill":"SK-P13-U05-03","part":"retest","speaker":"sara","value":{"en":"Re-test. Prompt to Design Interfaces (NN/g): when crafting prompts, clarity and specificity matter more than length.","ar":"إعادة اختبار. من الطلب إلى تصميم الواجهات (NN/g): حين تكتب الطلبات، الوضوح والتحديد أهم من الطول."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/vague-prototyping/","quote":"When crafting prompts, clarity and specificity matter more than sheer length."},"scenario":{"en":"I want AI ideas for a card-settings screen in our banking app. My first prompt: \"Design a trendy card settings page.\"","ar":"أريد أفكارًا من الذكاء الاصطناعي لشاشة إعدادات البطاقة في تطبيقنا البنكي. وطلبي الأول: «صمّم صفحة إعدادات بطاقة عصرية.»"},"prompt":{"en":"Which rewrite is best?","ar":"أي صياغة للطلب تعطيني أفكارًا مفيدة لهذه الشاشة؟"},"options":[{"id":"longer","text":{"en":"\"Design a very trendy, very modern, very clean, very beautiful card settings page.\"","ar":"«صمّم صفحة إعدادات بطاقة عصرية جدًا، وحديثة جدًا، وبسيطة جدًا، وجميلة جدًا.»"}},{"id":"brand","text":{"en":"\"Make it like a famous global bank's app.\"","ar":"«اجعلها مثل تطبيق بنك عالمي مشهور.»"}},{"id":"clear","text":{"en":"\"Flat design in our attached design system. Toggles for freeze card, online payments and limits, with the freeze toggle first.\"","ar":"«تصميم مسطّح (Flat design) بنظام التصميم المرفق. مفاتيح (Toggles) لإيقاف البطاقة، والدفع الإلكتروني، والحدود، ومفتاح الإيقاف أولًا.»"}}],"answer":["clear"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P13-035","when":["longer"],"feedback":{"en":"More vague words are still vague. Say the style and what the screen must show.","ar":"الكلمات الغامضة الإضافية تبقى غامضة. قل الأسلوب وما يجب أن تُظهره الشاشة."}},{"id":"MC-P13-036","when":["brand"],"feedback":{"en":"Another bank's look fits its own users. Describe what yours need.","ar":"شكل بنك آخر يناسب مستخدميه. صِف ما يحتاجه مستخدموك."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Short, precise and specific.","ar":"صحيح. قصير، ودقيق، ومحدّد."},"explain":{"en":"A precise prompt beats a long vague one. Name the style, the parts and the order.","ar":"الطلب الدقيق أفضل من الطويل الغامض. سمِّ الأسلوب، والأجزاء، والترتيب."}},{"id":"S06","type":"choose","skill":"SK-P13-U05-03","part":"retest","speaker":"mona","value":{"en":"Re-test. Prompt to Design Interfaces (NN/g): early in the process, use lightweight visual references, like moodboards, inspiration images or screenshots of your design system.","ar":"إعادة اختبار. من الطلب إلى تصميم الواجهات (NN/g): في بداية العمل، استخدم مراجع بصرية بسيطة، مثل لوحات الإلهام، أو صور ملهمة، أو صور لنظام التصميم عندك."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/vague-prototyping/","quote":"When you’re still early in the design process or lack the resources to produce polished assets, use lightweight visual references instead, such moodboards, inspiration images, or screenshots of your design system."},"scenario":{"en":"My team is exploring early ideas for a rewards screen. AI keeps giving us styles that don't feel like our app. Nobody has time for polished mockups.","ar":"يستكشف فريقي أفكارًا أولى لشاشة مكافآت. والذكاء الاصطناعي يعطينا أساليب لا تشبه تطبيقنا. ولا أحد لديه وقت لنماذج تصميم مصقولة (Mockups)."},"prompt":{"en":"What should we add to the prompt?","ar":"ماذا نضيف إلى الطلب؟"},"options":[{"id":"ref","text":{"en":"A screenshot of our design system and two screens from our app","ar":"صورة لنظام التصميم عندنا وشاشتين من تطبيقنا"}},{"id":"mock","text":{"en":"Nothing until someone makes a full high-fidelity mockup","ar":"لا شيء حتى يصنع أحدٌ نموذجًا كاملًا عالي الدقة (High-fidelity mockup)"}},{"id":"words","text":{"en":"\"Make it feel like our app.\"","ar":"«اجعلها تشبه تطبيقنا.»"}}],"answer":["ref"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P13-035","when":["words"],"feedback":{"en":"The AI doesn't know what your app looks like. Show it.","ar":"الذكاء الاصطناعي لا يعرف شكل تطبيقك. فأرِه إياه."}},{"id":"MC-P13-016","when":["mock"],"feedback":{"en":"You don't need polish to guide the AI. A quick screenshot is enough for early ideas.","ar":"لست بحاجة إلى تصميم مصقول لتوجيه الذكاء الاصطناعي. فصورة سريعة تكفي للأفكار الأولى."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. A quick reference beats a description.","ar":"صحيح. المرجع السريع أفضل من الوصف."},"explain":{"en":"Show the AI your look with a simple reference. Words alone can't describe it.","ar":"أرِ الذكاء الاصطناعي شكل تطبيقك بمرجع بسيط. فالكلمات وحدها لا تصفه."}},{"id":"S07","type":"choose","skill":"SK-P13-U05-04","part":"retest","speaker":"nour","value":{"en":"Re-test. Mock Tables and Charts (NN/g): set plausible ranges for the values in your mock data.","ar":"إعادة اختبار. الجداول والرسوم التجريبية (NN/g): حدّد نطاقات معقولة للقيم في بياناتك التجريبية."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/ai-data-prototype-testing/","quote":"Plausible ranges: Determine a realistic range to bound values in the table."},"scenario":{"en":"We'll test a new results screen with our doctors. The AI's mock data shows a patient's blood pressure as 300/20.","ar":"سنختبر شاشة نتائج جديدة مع أطبائنا. والبيانات التجريبية من الذكاء الاصطناعي تُظهر ضغط دم أحد المرضى 300/20."},"prompt":{"en":"What should I do?","ar":"ماذا أفعل؟"},"options":[{"id":"keep","text":{"en":"Keep it. Doctors know it's a prototype","ar":"أُبقيها. فالأطباء يعرفون أنه نموذج أولي"}},{"id":"ranges","text":{"en":"Ask AI again with realistic ranges, like 90 to 140 for the top number, and check the results","ar":"أطلب من الذكاء الاصطناعي مرة أخرى مع نطاقات واقعية، مثل من 90 إلى 140 للرقم الأعلى، وأراجع النتائج"}},{"id":"remove","text":{"en":"Remove all numbers from the prototype","ar":"أحذف كل الأرقام من النموذج الأولي"}}],"answer":["ranges"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P13-037","when":["keep","remove"],"feedback":{"en":"Doctors will spot impossible numbers at once, and talk about them instead of the design. And without numbers, there's nothing to test.","ar":"الأطباء سيلاحظون الأرقام المستحيلة فورًا، ويتحدّثون عنها بدلًا من التصميم. ودون أرقام، لا يوجد ما يُختبر."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Believable numbers keep the test on the design.","ar":"صحيح. الأرقام القابلة للتصديق تُبقي تركيز الاختبار على التصميم."},"explain":{"en":"Give AI realistic ranges, then check its numbers before the test.","ar":"أعطِ الذكاء الاصطناعي نطاقات واقعية، ثم راجع أرقامه قبل الاختبار."}},{"id":"S08","type":"choose","skill":"SK-P13-U05-04","part":"retest","speaker":"rami","value":{"en":"Re-test. Mock Tables and Charts (NN/g): never share sensitive or identifying data with AI tools unless your company has approved them.","ar":"إعادة اختبار. الجداول والرسوم التجريبية (NN/g): لا تشارك أبدًا بيانات حسّاسة أو تكشف هوية أصحابها مع أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي إلا إذا وافقت عليها شركتك."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/ai-data-prototype-testing/","quote":"We recommend that you never share sensitive or identifying data with genAI tools unless your company has verified and approved their use."},"scenario":{"en":"I need a realistic rider profile screen for a test. A teammate sends me a file with 2,000 real riders' names, phones and home stations, and says: \"Paste it into the AI, it's quicker.\"","ar":"أحتاج شاشة ملف شخصي واقعية لراكب من أجل اختبار. ويرسل لي زميل ملفًا فيه أسماء 2,000 راكب حقيقي وهواتفهم ومحطاتهم القريبة من بيوتهم، ويقول: «الصقه في الذكاء الاصطناعي، أسرع.»"},"prompt":{"en":"What should I do?","ar":"ماذا أفعل؟"},"options":[{"id":"paste","text":{"en":"Paste it. It's only for a prototype","ar":"ألصقه. فهو لنموذج أولي فقط"}},{"id":"few","text":{"en":"Paste only 20 of the riders","ar":"ألصق 20 راكبًا فقط"}},{"id":"mock","text":{"en":"Don't paste it. Ask AI to make up realistic riders instead","ar":"لا ألصقه. وأطلب من الذكاء الاصطناعي أن يخترع ركّابًا واقعيين بدلًا من ذلك"}}],"answer":["mock"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P13-038","when":["paste","few"],"feedback":{"en":"Even 20 real riders is private data shared with an outside tool. Made-up riders work just as well.","ar":"حتى بيانات 20 راكبًا حقيقيًا بيانات خاصة، وستُشارَك مع أداة خارجية. والركّاب المُخترَعون يؤدّون الغرض نفسه."}}],"correct":{"en":"Right. Realistic, not real.","ar":"صحيح. واقعي، لا حقيقي."},"explain":{"en":"Keep real personal data out of AI tools. Ask for realistic made-up data.","ar":"أبقِ البيانات الشخصية الحقيقية بعيدًا عن أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي. واطلب بيانات مُخترَعة واقعية."}}]}$uxg$::jsonb),
  ($uxg$P14-U01-B01$uxg$, $uxg$bd4c9ac2442f166bd99533038c86e33ac1a889fd6b9f5987c9dfa85e9fbfc85d$uxg$, $uxg${"id":"P14-U01-B01","mode":"bank","title":{"en":"Re-tests: interrupt only when it's worth it","ar":"إعادة اختبار: لا تقاطع إلا حين يستحق الأمر"},"steps":[{"id":"S01","type":"tune","speaker":"karim","skill":"SK-P14-U01-01","part":"retest","value":{"en":"Re-test, modal dialogs (NN/g): use them for important warnings that prevent critical errors. Closing a file with unsaved edits loses work, so it's worth a dialog with clear choices.","ar":"إعادة اختبار، النوافذ الـ Modal (NN/g): استخدمها للتحذيرات المهمة التي تمنع أخطاء كبيرة. وإغلاق ملف فيه تعديلات غير محفوظة يُضيّع العمل، فيستحق Dialog بخيارات واضحة."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/modal-nonmodal-dialog/","quote":"Use modal dialogs for important warnings, as a way to prevent or correct critical errors."},"scenario":{"en":"I'm building a photo editing website. Hany has spent 20 minutes on one photo and hasn't saved. He clicks the ✕ to close it.","ar":"أبني موقعًا لتعديل الصور. قضى هاني 20 دقيقة على صورة واحدة ولم يحفظ. ثم ضغط ✕ ليغلقها."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each version of what happens. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل نسخة. أيّ نسخة تحمي عمل هاني من الضياع؟"},"start":"close","options":[{"id":"close","text":{"en":"Close the photo at once","ar":"أغلق الصورة فورًا"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"suwar","name":{"en":"Suwar","ar":"صور"},"color":"#2563EB","icon":"images","domain":"suwar.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"suwar.example/photos","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Photos","ar":"الصور"},{"en":"Albums","ar":"الألبومات"},{"en":"Shared","ar":"مشاركة"}],"active":0,"search":true,"actions":[{"icon":"upload-simple"},{"icon":"user"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"My photos","ar":"صوري"}},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"beach.jpg · last saved 20 minutes ago","ar":"beach.jpg · آخر حفظ قبل 20 دقيقة"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"row","gap":"m","blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"beach","size":"s","alt":{"en":"Beach","ar":"شاطئ"}},{"kind":"image","art":"family","size":"s","alt":{"en":"Family","ar":"العائلة"}},{"kind":"image","art":"city-night","size":"s","alt":{"en":"City at night","ar":"المدينة ليلًا"}},{"kind":"image","art":"desert","size":"s","alt":{"en":"Desert","ar":"صحراء"}}]}]}},{"id":"ask","text":{"en":"A dialog: \"Save changes to beach.jpg?\" with Save, Don't save and Cancel","ar":"Dialog يسأل: «هل تحفظ التغييرات في beach.jpg؟» وفيه «احفظ» و«لا تحفظ» و«إلغاء»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"suwar","name":{"en":"Suwar","ar":"صور"},"color":"#2563EB","icon":"images","domain":"suwar.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"suwar.example/edit/beach.jpg","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Photos","ar":"الصور"},{"en":"Albums","ar":"الألبومات"},{"en":"Shared","ar":"مشاركة"}],"active":0,"search":true,"actions":[{"icon":"upload-simple"},{"icon":"user"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"row","blocks":[{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"beach.jpg","ar":"beach.jpg"}},{"kind":"iconbtn","icon":"x","aria":{"en":"Close editor","ar":"أغلق المحرر"}}]},{"kind":"image","art":"beach","size":"l","alt":{"en":"Beach photo being edited","ar":"صورة الشاطئ قيد التعديل"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"row","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"chip","icon":"crop","text":{"en":"Crop","ar":"قص"}},{"kind":"chip","icon":"sun","text":{"en":"Light","ar":"الإضاءة"},"active":true},{"kind":"chip","icon":"drop","text":{"en":"Color","ar":"الألوان"}},{"kind":"chip","icon":"magic-wand","text":{"en":"Filters","ar":"الفلاتر"}}]}],"overlay":{"type":"dialog","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Save changes to beach.jpg?","ar":"هل تحفظ التغييرات في beach.jpg؟"}},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"20 minutes of edits will be lost if you don't save.","ar":"ستضيع تعديلات 20 دقيقة إن لم تحفظ."},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"row","gap":"m","blocks":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Save","ar":"احفظ"}},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Don't save","ar":"لا تحفظ"},"style":"outline"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Cancel","ar":"إلغاء"},"style":"text"}]}]}}},{"id":"snack","text":{"en":"Close it, with a snackbar: \"Unsaved changes were discarded\"","ar":"أغلقها، مع Snackbar: «حُذفت التغييرات غير المحفوظة»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"suwar","name":{"en":"Suwar","ar":"صور"},"color":"#2563EB","icon":"images","domain":"suwar.example"},"frame":"wide","url":"suwar.example/photos","navbar":{"links":[{"en":"Photos","ar":"الصور"},{"en":"Albums","ar":"الألبومات"},{"en":"Shared","ar":"مشاركة"}],"active":0,"search":true,"actions":[{"icon":"upload-simple"},{"icon":"user"}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"My photos","ar":"صوري"}},{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"beach.jpg · last saved 20 minutes ago","ar":"beach.jpg · آخر حفظ قبل 20 دقيقة"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"row","gap":"m","blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"beach","size":"s","alt":{"en":"Beach","ar":"شاطئ"}},{"kind":"image","art":"family","size":"s","alt":{"en":"Family","ar":"العائلة"}},{"kind":"image","art":"city-night","size":"s","alt":{"en":"City at night","ar":"المدينة ليلًا"}},{"kind":"image","art":"desert","size":"s","alt":{"en":"Desert","ar":"صحراء"}}]}],"overlay":{"type":"toast","blocks":[{"kind":"text","text":{"en":"Unsaved changes were discarded.","ar":"حُذفت التغييرات غير المحفوظة."}}]}}}],"answer":["ask"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P14-003","when":["close","snack"],"feedback":{"en":"If Hany clicked ✕ by habit, 20 minutes of work are gone. A message afterwards can't bring them back.","ar":"إن ضغط هاني ✕ بحكم العادة، ضاع عمل 20 دقيقة. والرسالة بعد ذلك لا تعيده."}}],"correct":{"en":"Work would be lost: warn first, in a dialog.","ar":"سيضيع العمل، فحذّر أولًا في Dialog."},"explain":{"en":"Losing unsaved work is a critical mistake. The dialog stops it and labels each button with what it does.","ar":"ضياع العمل غير المحفوظ خطأ خطير. والـ Dialog يمنعه، ويكتب على كل زر ما يفعله."}},{"id":"S02","type":"tune","speaker":"tarek","skill":"SK-P14-U01-01","part":"retest","value":{"en":"Re-test, modal dialogs (NN/g): don't use them for nonessential information unrelated to the current flow. A newsletter offer while typing passenger details is unrelated; an unticked checkbox on the confirmation page is not in the way.","ar":"إعادة اختبار، النوافذ الـ Modal (NN/g): لا تستخدمها لمعلومات غير ضرورية ولا علاقة لها بالمهمة الحالية. وعرض النشرة البريدية أثناء كتابة بيانات المسافر لا علاقة له بالمهمة؛ أما Checkbox غير محدّد في صفحة التأكيد فلا يعترض الطريق."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/modal-nonmodal-dialog/","quote":"Do not use modal dialogs for nonessential information that is not related to the current user flow."},"scenario":{"en":"In the airline app I manage, Lobna is typing passenger details for a flight. Halfway through, a dialog asks her to sign up for our newsletter.","ar":"في تطبيق شركة الطيران الذي أديره، تكتب لبنى بيانات المسافرين لرحلة. وفي منتصف ذلك، يظهر Dialog يطلب منها الاشتراك في نشرتنا البريدية."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each version. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل نسخة. أيّ نسخة تترك لبنى تُكمل بيانات المسافرين دون مقاطعة؟"},"start":"keep","options":[{"id":"keep","text":{"en":"Keep the newsletter dialog","ar":"أبقِ Dialog النشرة البريدية"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"zad","name":{"en":"Zad Travel","ar":"زاد للسفر"},"color":"#6D28D9","icon":"airplane-tilt","domain":"zad.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Passenger details","ar":"بيانات المسافرين"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"progress","value":50,"label":{"en":"Passenger 1 of 2","ar":"المسافر 1 من 2"}},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Full name as on passport","ar":"الاسم كاملًا كما في جواز السفر"},"icon":"user","filled":true,"text":"Lobna Adel","gap":"m"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Passport number","ar":"رقم جواز السفر"},"icon":"identification-card","text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Date of birth","ar":"تاريخ الميلاد"},"icon":"calendar-blank","text":"","gap":"s"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Next passenger","ar":"المسافر التالي"}}],"keyboard":"text","overlay":{"type":"dialog","close":true,"blocks":[{"kind":"icon","icon":"tag","size":"l","color":"brand"},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Never miss a deal!","ar":"لا تفوّتي أي عرض!"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Get our best fares to your inbox.","ar":"تصلك أفضل أسعارنا على بريدك."},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Email","ar":"البريد الإلكتروني"},"icon":"envelope-simple","text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Subscribe","ar":"اشتركي"},"gap":"m"}]}}},{"id":"box","text":{"en":"Remove the dialog; add an unticked newsletter checkbox on the booking-confirmed page","ar":"احذف الـ Dialog؛ وأضف Checkbox غير محدّد للنشرة في صفحة تأكيد الحجز"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"zad","name":{"en":"Zad Travel","ar":"زاد للسفر"},"color":"#6D28D9","icon":"airplane-tilt","domain":"zad.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Booking confirmed","ar":"تم تأكيد الحجز"}},"blocks":[{"kind":"icon","icon":"check-circle-fill","size":"l","color":"good"},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"You're going to Jeddah!","ar":"أنتِ مسافرة إلى جدة!"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"card","gap":"m","blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"airplane-tilt","text":{"en":"Cairo → Jeddah","ar":"القاهرة ← جدة"},"sub":{"en":"14 Nov · 09:40 · 2 passengers","ar":"14 نوفمبر · 09:40 · مسافران"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"ticket","text":{"en":"Booking code","ar":"رمز الحجز"},"value":"ZD7K4Q"}]},{"kind":"check","text":{"en":"Email me deals on this route","ar":"أرسلوا لي عروض هذا الخط بالبريد"},"gap":"m"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"View my trip","ar":"اعرضي رحلتي"}}]}},{"id":"end","text":{"en":"Keep the dialog, but show it after passenger 2","ar":"أبقِ الـ Dialog، لكن اعرضه بعد المسافر الثاني"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After passenger 2, before payment","ar":"بعد المسافر الثاني، قبل الدفع"},"app":{"id":"zad","name":{"en":"Zad Travel","ar":"زاد للسفر"},"color":"#6D28D9","icon":"airplane-tilt","domain":"zad.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Payment","ar":"الدفع"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"airplane-tilt","text":{"en":"Cairo → Jeddah · 14 Nov","ar":"القاهرة ← جدة · 14 نوفمبر"},"sub":{"en":"2 passengers","ar":"مسافران"}},{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"EGP 18,400","ar":"18400 جنيه"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Card number","ar":"رقم البطاقة"},"icon":"credit-card","text":"","gap":"m"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Pay EGP 18,400","ar":"ادفعي 18400 جنيه"}}],"overlay":{"type":"dialog","close":true,"blocks":[{"kind":"icon","icon":"tag","size":"l","color":"brand"},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Never miss a deal!","ar":"لا تفوّتي أي عرض!"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Email","ar":"البريد الإلكتروني"},"icon":"envelope-simple","text":"","gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Subscribe","ar":"اشتركي"},"gap":"m"}]}}}],"answer":["box"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P14-001","when":["keep"],"feedback":{"en":"The newsletter has nothing to do with the passenger details, and it stops Lobna halfway through typing them.","ar":"النشرة البريدية لا علاقة لها ببيانات المسافرين، وهي توقف لبنى في منتصف كتابتها."}},{"id":"MC-P14-002","when":["end"],"feedback":{"en":"Now it blocks the payment step instead. It's still unrelated and still in the middle of booking.","ar":"الآن يحجب خطوة الدفع بدلًا من ذلك. وما زال غير مرتبط بالمهمة، وما زال في منتصف الحجز."}}],"correct":{"en":"Unrelated: take it out of the flow.","ar":"لا علاقة له بالحجز: أخرِجه من خطوات الحجز."},"explain":{"en":"After the booking, an unticked checkbox offers the newsletter without stopping anything, and only people who want it tick it.","ar":"بعد الحجز، يعرض Checkbox غير محدّد النشرة دون أن يوقف شيئًا، ولا يحدّده إلا من يريدها."}},{"id":"S03","type":"compare","speaker":"sara","skill":"SK-P14-U01-02","part":"retest","value":{"en":"Re-test, modal dialogs (NN/g): avoid them for decisions that need information the modal doesn't show. Choosing coverage depends on the car's value and age.","ar":"إعادة اختبار، النوافذ الـ Modal (NN/g): تجنّبها للقرارات التي تحتاج معلومات لا تعرضها النافذة. واختيار التغطية يعتمد على قيمة السيارة وعمرها."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/modal-nonmodal-dialog/","quote":"Avoid modal dialogs for complex decision making that requires additional sources of information unavailable in the modal."},"scenario":{"en":"I'm designing a car insurance app. Aya is choosing a plan for her car. Which plan makes sense depends on her car's value (EGP 650,000) and age (9 years), shown on the car's page.","ar":"أصمّم تطبيقًا لتأمين السيارات. تختار آية خطة لسيارتها. والخطة المناسبة تعتمد على قيمة السيارة (650 ألف جنيه) وعمرها (9 سنوات)، الظاهرين في صفحة السيارة."},"prompt":{"en":"Which version should ship?","ar":"أيّ نسخة تساعد آية على اختيار الخطة المناسبة لسيارتها؟"},"a":{"label":{"en":"Version A: the plans on a page with her car's details","ar":"النسخة A: الخطط في صفحة فيها بيانات سيارتها"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"aman","name":{"en":"Aman","ar":"أمان"},"color":"#364FC7","icon":"shield-check","domain":"aman.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Insure your car","ar":"أمّن سيارتك"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"banner","icon":"car","tone":"info","text":{"en":"Your car: 9 years old · value EGP 650,000","ar":"سيارتك: عمرها 9 سنوات · قيمتها 650 ألف جنيه"}},{"kind":"card","gap":"m","blocks":[{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Full cover","ar":"تغطية شاملة"}},{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"EGP 21,000","ar":"21000 جنيه"},"per":{"en":"/ year","ar":"/ سنة"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Theft, fire, and damage to your car and others'","ar":"السرقة والحريق وأضرار سيارتك وسيارات الغير"},"gap":"xs"}]},{"kind":"card","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Third party","ar":"ضد الغير"}},{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"EGP 4,500","ar":"4500 جنيه"},"per":{"en":"/ year","ar":"/ سنة"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Only damage you cause to others","ar":"الأضرار التي تسببها للغير فقط"},"gap":"xs"}]}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Continue","ar":"تابع"}}]}},"b":{"label":{"en":"Version B: the plans in a dialog over the car's page","ar":"النسخة B: الخطط في Dialog فوق صفحة السيارة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"aman","name":{"en":"Aman","ar":"أمان"},"color":"#364FC7","icon":"shield-check","domain":"aman.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"My car","ar":"سيارتي"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"car","size":"m","alt":{"en":"Your car","ar":"سيارتك"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"car","text":{"en":"Hyundai Elantra 2017","ar":"هيونداي إلنترا 2017"},"sub":{"en":"9 years old · value EGP 650,000","ar":"عمرها 9 سنوات · قيمتها 650 ألف جنيه"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Choose a plan","ar":"اختاري خطة"},"gap":"m"}],"overlay":{"type":"dialog","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Choose a plan","ar":"اختاري خطة"}},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Full cover · EGP 21,000/year","ar":"تغطية شاملة · 21000 جنيه/سنة"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Third party · EGP 4,500/year","ar":"ضد الغير · 4500 جنيه/سنة"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Continue","ar":"تابع"},"gap":"m"}]}}},"answer":"a","misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P14-005","when":["b"],"feedback":{"en":"The dialog hides the car's value and age, the two facts Aya needs to weigh the price.","ar":"الـ Dialog يُخفي قيمة السيارة وعمرها، وهما المعلومتان اللتان تحتاجهما آية لتقدير السعر."}}],"correct":{"en":"A: the facts sit next to the choice.","ar":"A: المعلومات بجانب الاختيار."},"explain":{"en":"On the page, Aya sees her car's value and age right above the plans, so she can judge whether full cover is worth it.","ar":"في الصفحة، ترى آية قيمة سيارتها وعمرها فوق الخطط مباشرة، فتقدّر هل تستحق التغطية الشاملة سعرها."}},{"id":"S04","type":"tune","speaker":"youssef","skill":"SK-P14-U01-02","part":"retest","value":{"en":"Re-test, modal dialogs (NN/g): a decision that needs the map can't happen in a list that covers the map.","ar":"إعادة اختبار، النوافذ الـ Modal (NN/g): القرار الذي يحتاج الخريطة لا يمكن أن يتم في قائمة تغطّي الخريطة."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/modal-nonmodal-dialog/","quote":"Avoid modal dialogs for complex decision making that requires additional sources of information unavailable in the modal."},"scenario":{"en":"My shop ships through collection points. Sherif picks up a parcel from one. He wants the one closest to his office, so he needs to see where each point is on the map. The points are listed in a dialog.","ar":"يشحن متجري عبر نقاط استلام. يستلم شريف طردًا من إحداها. ويريد أقربها إلى مكتبه، لذلك يحتاج أن يرى مكان كل نقطة على الخريطة. والنقاط معروضة في Dialog."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each version. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل نسخة. أيّها يجب أن تُطلق؟"},"start":"dialog","options":[{"id":"dialog","text":{"en":"Keep the list in the dialog","ar":"أبقِ القائمة في الـ Dialog"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Collection points","ar":"نقاط الاستلام"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"searchbar","text":{"en":"Search an area","ar":"ابحثي عن منطقة"}},{"kind":"image","art":"map","size":"l","alt":{"en":"Map with three collection points","ar":"خريطة عليها ثلاث نقاط استلام"},"gap":"s"}],"overlay":{"type":"dialog","title":{"en":"Pick a point","ar":"اختاري نقطة"},"blocks":[{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Point A · Tahrir St","ar":"النقطة A · شارع التحرير"}},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Point B · Nile Corniche","ar":"النقطة B · كورنيش النيل"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Point C · Ramses Sq","ar":"النقطة C · ميدان رمسيس"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Confirm","ar":"تأكيد"},"gap":"m"}]}}},{"id":"page","text":{"en":"Show the map with the points marked, and the list under it","ar":"اعرض الخريطة وعليها النقاط، والقائمة تحتها"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Collection points","ar":"نقاط الاستلام"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"map","size":"m","alt":{"en":"Map with three collection points","ar":"خريطة عليها ثلاث نقاط استلام"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"map-pin-fill","text":{"en":"A · Tahrir St","ar":"A · شارع التحرير"},"sub":{"en":"Open until 10 pm","ar":"مفتوح حتى 10 م"},"value":{"en":"0.4 km from your office","ar":"0.4 كم من مكتبك"},"check":true,"gap":"s"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"map-pin","text":{"en":"B · Nile Corniche","ar":"B · كورنيش النيل"},"sub":{"en":"Open until 9 pm","ar":"مفتوح حتى 9 م"},"value":{"en":"1.8 km","ar":"1.8 كم"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"map-pin","text":{"en":"C · Ramses Sq","ar":"C · ميدان رمسيس"},"sub":{"en":"Open 24 hours","ar":"مفتوح 24 ساعة"},"value":{"en":"3.1 km","ar":"3.1 كم"}}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Collect from Point A","ar":"استلمي من النقطة A"}}]}},{"id":"half","text":{"en":"Keep the dialog, but make it see-through","ar":"أبقِ الـ Dialog، لكن اجعله شفافًا"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"dar","name":{"en":"Dar","ar":"دار"},"color":"#E8590C","icon":"washing-machine","domain":"dar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Collection points","ar":"نقاط الاستلام"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"searchbar","text":{"en":"Search an area","ar":"ابحثي عن منطقة"}},{"kind":"image","art":"map","size":"l","alt":{"en":"Map with three collection points","ar":"خريطة عليها ثلاث نقاط استلام"},"gap":"s"}],"overlay":{"type":"dialog","scrim":false,"blocks":[{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Point A · Tahrir St","ar":"النقطة A · شارع التحرير"}},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Point B · Nile Corniche","ar":"النقطة B · كورنيش النيل"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Point C · Ramses Sq","ar":"النقطة C · ميدان رمسيس"},"gap":"xs"}]}}}],"answer":["page"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P14-005","when":["dialog","half"],"feedback":{"en":"The list still sits on top of the map Sherif needs, so he can't match each point to a place.","ar":"ما زالت القائمة فوق الخريطة التي يحتاجها شريف، فلا يستطيع ربط كل نقطة بمكانها."}}],"correct":{"en":"The map and the list, side by side on a page.","ar":"الخريطة والقائمة معًا في صفحة."},"explain":{"en":"With the map visible and the distances in the list, Sherif can see at once that point A is closest to his office.","ar":"حين تظهر الخريطة والمسافات في القائمة، يرى شريف فورًا أن النقطة A الأقرب إلى مكتبه."}},{"id":"S05","type":"tune","speaker":"rami","skill":"SK-P14-U01-03","part":"retest","value":{"en":"Re-test, bottom sheets (NN/g): provide a clear Close button at the top and support Back for dismissing the sheet; a swipe alone isn't enough.","ar":"إعادة اختبار، الـ Bottom sheets (NN/g): ضع زر إغلاق واضحًا في الأعلى، واجعل زر الرجوع يغلق الـ Sheet؛ فالسحب وحده لا يكفي."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/bottom-sheet/","quote":"You can prevent this issue by supporting the use of Back for dismissing the bottom sheet"},"scenario":{"en":"I'm designing a food app. Mai adds a note for the restaurant. The note opens in a bottom sheet that closes only with a swipe. Pressing Back leaves the restaurant's menu and empties her cart.","ar":"أصمّم تطبيقًا للطعام. تضيف مي ملاحظة للمطعم. تُفتح الملاحظة في Bottom sheet (لوحة تظهر من أسفل الشاشة) لا يُغلق إلا بالسحب. وزر الرجوع يُخرجها من قائمة طعام المطعم ويُفرغ سلّتها."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each version. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل نسخة. أيّها يجب أن تُطلق؟"},"start":"swipe","options":[{"id":"swipe","text":{"en":"Keep it as it is","ar":"أبقِه كما هو"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"lokma","name":{"en":"Lokma","ar":"لقمة"},"color":"#F08C00","icon":"hamburger","domain":"lokma.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Koshary House","ar":"بيت الكشري"},"back":true,"actions":[{"icon":"shopping-cart","aria":{"en":"Cart","ar":"السلّة"},"count":2}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"food-koshary","size":"m","alt":{"en":"Koshary","ar":"كشري"}},{"kind":"listitem","art":"food-koshary","text":{"en":"Large koshary","ar":"كشري كبير"},"sub":{"en":"In your cart","ar":"في سلّتك"},"value":{"en":"EGP 75","ar":"75 جنيه"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"listitem","art":"food-dessert","text":{"en":"Rice pudding","ar":"أرز باللبن"},"sub":{"en":"In your cart","ar":"في سلّتك"},"value":{"en":"EGP 30","ar":"30 جنيه"}}],"overlay":{"type":"sheet","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Note for the restaurant","ar":"ملاحظة للمطعم"}},{"kind":"field","label":"","text":{"en":"e.g. extra crispy onions","ar":"مثال: بصل مقرمش زيادة"},"gap":"s"}]}}},{"id":"fixed","text":{"en":"Add an ✕ Close and Done, and make Back close the sheet","ar":"أضف زر ✕ للإغلاق وزر «تم»، واجعل زر الرجوع يغلق الـ Sheet"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"lokma","name":{"en":"Lokma","ar":"لقمة"},"color":"#F08C00","icon":"hamburger","domain":"lokma.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Koshary House","ar":"بيت الكشري"},"back":true,"actions":[{"icon":"shopping-cart","aria":{"en":"Cart","ar":"السلّة"},"count":2}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"food-koshary","size":"m","alt":{"en":"Koshary","ar":"كشري"}},{"kind":"listitem","art":"food-koshary","text":{"en":"Large koshary","ar":"كشري كبير"},"sub":{"en":"In your cart","ar":"في سلّتك"},"value":{"en":"EGP 75","ar":"75 جنيه"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"listitem","art":"food-dessert","text":{"en":"Rice pudding","ar":"أرز باللبن"},"sub":{"en":"In your cart","ar":"في سلّتك"},"value":{"en":"EGP 30","ar":"30 جنيه"}}],"overlay":{"type":"sheet","close":true,"blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Note for the restaurant","ar":"ملاحظة للمطعم"}},{"kind":"field","label":"","text":{"en":"e.g. extra crispy onions","ar":"مثال: بصل مقرمش زيادة"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Done","ar":"تم"},"gap":"m"}]}}},{"id":"warn","text":{"en":"Keep the swipe; warn \"Back will empty your cart\"","ar":"أبقِ السحب؛ ونبّه «زر الرجوع سيُفرغ سلّتك»"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"lokma","name":{"en":"Lokma","ar":"لقمة"},"color":"#F08C00","icon":"hamburger","domain":"lokma.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Koshary House","ar":"بيت الكشري"},"back":true,"actions":[{"icon":"shopping-cart","aria":{"en":"Cart","ar":"السلّة"},"count":2}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"food-koshary","size":"m","alt":{"en":"Koshary","ar":"كشري"}},{"kind":"listitem","art":"food-koshary","text":{"en":"Large koshary","ar":"كشري كبير"},"sub":{"en":"In your cart","ar":"في سلّتك"},"value":{"en":"EGP 75","ar":"75 جنيه"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"listitem","art":"food-dessert","text":{"en":"Rice pudding","ar":"أرز باللبن"},"sub":{"en":"In your cart","ar":"في سلّتك"},"value":{"en":"EGP 30","ar":"30 جنيه"}}],"overlay":{"type":"sheet","blocks":[{"kind":"banner","icon":"warning","tone":"warn","text":{"en":"Back will empty your cart.","ar":"زر الرجوع سيُفرغ سلّتك."}},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Note for the restaurant","ar":"ملاحظة للمطعم"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"field","label":"","text":{"en":"e.g. extra crispy onions","ar":"مثال: بصل مقرمش زيادة"},"gap":"s"}]}}}],"answer":["fixed"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P14-007","when":["swipe","warn"],"feedback":{"en":"Closing still depends on a swipe, and Back still throws Mai's cart away. A warning doesn't fix a button that does the wrong thing.","ar":"ما زال الإغلاق يعتمد على السحب، وما زال زر الرجوع يُضيّع سلّة مي. والتنبيه لا يُصلح زرًا يفعل الشيء الخطأ."}}],"correct":{"en":"Visible ways out, and Back closes only the sheet.","ar":"طرق خروج ظاهرة، وزر الرجوع يغلق الـ Sheet فقط."},"explain":{"en":"✕ and Done work for everyone, and Back now does what Mai expects: it closes the note and keeps her cart.","ar":"زرّا ✕ و«تم» يفهمهما الجميع، وزر الرجوع يفعل الآن ما تتوقّعه مي: يغلق الملاحظة ويحفظ سلّتها."}},{"id":"S06","type":"tune","speaker":"mona","skill":"SK-P14-U01-03","part":"retest","value":{"en":"Re-test, bottom sheets (NN/g): a sheet is a transient element for quick interactions; don't use it for a typical page-to-page flow. Opening an account takes six steps.","ar":"إعادة اختبار، الـ Bottom sheets (NN/g): الـ Sheet عنصر مؤقت للتفاعلات السريعة؛ فلا تستخدمه لمسار عادي من صفحة إلى صفحة. وفتح الحساب يأخذ ست خطوات."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/bottom-sheet/","quote":"We strongly recommend not using a bottom sheet to replace typical page-to-page user flows."},"scenario":{"en":"My team built a bank app. Bassem opens a savings account in it. It takes six steps: amount, period, returns payout, account to link, terms and a code. We built all six inside a bottom sheet.","ar":"بنى فريقي تطبيقًا لبنك. يفتح فيه باسم حساب توفير. ويأخذ ذلك ست خطوات: المبلغ، والمدة، وصرف العائد، والحساب المرتبط، والشروط، ورمز التأكيد. وبنينا الخطوات الست داخل Bottom sheet."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each version. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل نسخة. أيّها يجب أن تُطلق؟"},"start":"sheet","options":[{"id":"sheet","text":{"en":"Keep the six steps in the sheet","ar":"أبقِ الخطوات الست في الـ Sheet"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rasid","name":{"en":"Rasid","ar":"رصيد"},"color":"#1C3D6E","icon":"bank","domain":"rasid.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Accounts","ar":"الحسابات"},"large":true},"tabbar":{"active":0,"items":[{"icon":"house","text":{"en":"Home","ar":"الرئيسية"}},{"icon":"arrows-left-right","text":{"en":"Transfer","ar":"تحويل"}},{"icon":"receipt","text":{"en":"Bills","ar":"فواتير"}},{"icon":"list","text":{"en":"More","ar":"المزيد"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"wallet","text":{"en":"Current account","ar":"الحساب الجاري"},"sub":"•••• 3307","value":{"en":"EGP 42,300","ar":"42300 جنيه"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"piggy-bank","text":{"en":"Open a savings certificate","ar":"افتح شهادة ادخار"},"chevron":true,"gap":"s"}],"overlay":{"type":"sheet","close":true,"blocks":[{"kind":"progress","value":50,"label":{"en":"Step 3 of 6","ar":"الخطوة 3 من 6"}},{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Returns payout","ar":"صرف العائد"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Monthly","ar":"شهريًا"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"At the end","ar":"في النهاية"},"gap":"xs"}]}}},{"id":"pages","text":{"en":"Make it a flow of pages, one step each","ar":"اجعلها سلسلة صفحات، خطوة في كل صفحة"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rasid","name":{"en":"Rasid","ar":"رصيد"},"color":"#1C3D6E","icon":"bank","domain":"rasid.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Savings certificate","ar":"شهادة ادخار"},"back":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"progress","value":50,"label":{"en":"Step 3 of 6","ar":"الخطوة 3 من 6"}},{"kind":"title","text":{"en":"Returns payout","ar":"صرف العائد"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Monthly","ar":"شهريًا"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"At the end","ar":"في النهاية"},"gap":"xs"}],"footer":[{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Next","ar":"التالي"}}]}},{"id":"sheets","text":{"en":"Give each step its own sheet, one after another","ar":"اجعل لكل خطوة Sheet خاصًا، واحدًا بعد الآخر"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rasid","name":{"en":"Rasid","ar":"رصيد"},"color":"#1C3D6E","icon":"bank","domain":"rasid.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Accounts","ar":"الحسابات"},"large":true},"tabbar":{"active":0,"items":[{"icon":"house","text":{"en":"Home","ar":"الرئيسية"}},{"icon":"arrows-left-right","text":{"en":"Transfer","ar":"تحويل"}},{"icon":"receipt","text":{"en":"Bills","ar":"فواتير"}},{"icon":"list","text":{"en":"More","ar":"المزيد"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"listitem","icon":"wallet","text":{"en":"Current account","ar":"الحساب الجاري"},"sub":"•••• 3307","value":{"en":"EGP 42,300","ar":"42300 جنيه"}},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"piggy-bank","text":{"en":"Open a savings certificate","ar":"افتح شهادة ادخار"},"chevron":true,"gap":"s"}],"overlay":{"type":"sheet","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":{"en":"Returns payout","ar":"صرف العائد"}},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"Monthly","ar":"شهريًا"},"gap":"s"},{"kind":"radio","text":{"en":"At the end","ar":"في النهاية"},"gap":"xs"},{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Sheet 3, on top of sheets 1 and 2","ar":"الـ Sheet الثالث، فوق الأول والثاني"},"note":{"en":"Two more sheets are stacked underneath","ar":"وتحته اثنان آخران من الـ Sheets"},"gap":"s"}]}}}],"answer":["pages"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P14-008","when":["sheet"],"feedback":{"en":"Six steps is a flow, not a quick task. One swipe can close the sheet and lose everything Bassem entered.","ar":"ست خطوات تعني سلسلة صفحات، لا مهمة سريعة. وسحبة واحدة قد تغلق الـ Sheet وتُضيّع كل ما أدخله باسم."}},{"id":"MC-P14-006","when":["sheets"],"feedback":{"en":"Now the sheets stack up, one on another, and closing one can close them all.","ar":"الآن تتكدّس الـ Sheets فوق بعضها، وإغلاق واحد قد يغلقها كلها."}}],"correct":{"en":"A flow of steps belongs on pages.","ar":"الخطوات المتتابعة مكانها الصفحات."},"explain":{"en":"Pages show the progress, keep each answer when Bassem goes back, and can't be swiped away by accident.","ar":"الصفحات تُظهر التقدّم، وتحفظ كل إجابة حين يرجع باسم، ولا تُغلق بسحبة خاطئة."}},{"id":"S07","type":"tune","speaker":"hana","skill":"SK-P14-U01-04","part":"retest","value":{"en":"Re-test, tooltips (NN/g): users shouldn't need to find a tooltip to complete their task, or hold its content in working memory. Password rules decide whether sign-up works.","ar":"إعادة اختبار، الـ Tooltips (NN/g): لا يجب أن يحتاج الناس إلى البحث عن Tooltip لإكمال مهمتهم، أو حفظ محتواه في الذاكرة. وشروط كلمة المرور تحدّد هل ينجح التسجيل."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/tooltip-guidelines/","quote":"Users shouldn't need to find a tooltip in order to complete their task."},"scenario":{"en":"My gym has an app. Noura signs up in it. Her password must have at least 8 characters and one number. Those rules are in a tooltip on the ⓘ next to the field.","ar":"للنادي الرياضي الذي أديره تطبيق، وتسجّل فيه نورا. ويجب أن تكون كلمة المرور 8 أحرف على الأقل وفيها رقم واحد. وهذه الشروط في Tooltip على ⓘ بجانب الحقل."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each version. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل نسخة. أيّها يجب أن تُطلق؟"},"start":"tip","options":[{"id":"tip","text":{"en":"Keep the rules in the tooltip","ar":"أبقِ الشروط في الـ Tooltip"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Create account","ar":"أنشئي حسابًا"},"back":true,"logo":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Email","ar":"البريد الإلكتروني"},"icon":"envelope-simple","filled":true,"text":"salma@mail.com"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Password","ar":"كلمة المرور"},"icon":"lock","trail":"info","text":"","gap":"m"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Sign up","ar":"سجّلي"},"gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"hint","text":{"en":"Show the rules under the field","ar":"اعرض الشروط تحت الحقل"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Create account","ar":"أنشئي حسابًا"},"back":true,"logo":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Email","ar":"البريد الإلكتروني"},"icon":"envelope-simple","filled":true,"text":"salma@mail.com"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Password","ar":"كلمة المرور"},"icon":"lock","text":"","hint":{"en":"At least 8 characters, including a number.","ar":"8 أحرف على الأقل، منها رقم."},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Sign up","ar":"سجّلي"},"gap":"m"}]}},{"id":"error","text":{"en":"Remove the tooltip; show the rules only after a wrong password","ar":"احذف الـ Tooltip؛ واعرض الشروط فقط بعد كلمة مرور خاطئة"},"mock":{"caption":{"en":"After she taps Sign up","ar":"بعد أن تضغط «سجّلي»"},"app":{"id":"nashat","name":{"en":"Nashat","ar":"نشاط"},"color":"#F97316","icon":"barbell","domain":"nashat.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Create account","ar":"أنشئي حسابًا"},"back":true,"logo":true},"blocks":[{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Email","ar":"البريد الإلكتروني"},"icon":"envelope-simple","filled":true,"text":"salma@mail.com"},{"kind":"field","label":{"en":"Password","ar":"كلمة المرور"},"icon":"lock","filled":true,"text":"••••••","error":{"en":"Use at least 8 characters, including a number.","ar":"استخدمي 8 أحرف على الأقل، منها رقم."},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"button","text":{"en":"Sign up","ar":"سجّلي"},"gap":"m"}]}}],"answer":["hint"],"misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P14-009","when":["tip","error"],"feedback":{"en":"Noura needs the rules before she types. Hidden behind ⓘ, or shown only after she fails, they make her guess first.","ar":"تحتاج نورا الشروط قبل أن تكتب. وإخفاؤها خلف ⓘ، أو عرضها فقط بعد الفشل، يجعلها تخمّن أولًا."}}],"correct":{"en":"Needed to finish: on the screen, before she types.","ar":"تحتاجها لتُكمل، فاعرضها على الشاشة قبل أن تكتب."},"explain":{"en":"Under the field, the rules are in view while Noura makes up her password, so she gets it right the first time.","ar":"حين تكون الشروط تحت الحقل، تراها نورا وهي تختار كلمة المرور، فتكتبها صحيحة من أول مرة."}},{"id":"S08","type":"compare","speaker":"karim","skill":"SK-P14-U01-04","part":"retest","value":{"en":"Re-test, tooltips (NN/g): tooltips need a mouse or keyboard hover, and most icons are ambiguous enough that they need text labels. A phone tab bar of bare icons fails both.","ar":"إعادة اختبار، الـ Tooltips (NN/g): الـ Tooltip يحتاج Hover بالفأرة أو لوحة المفاتيح، وأغلب الأيقونات غامضة بما يكفي لتحتاج تسمية نصية. وشريط تبويب على الهاتف بأيقونات فقط يفشل في الأمرين."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/tooltip-guidelines/","quote":"Most icons have some level of ambiguity, which is why we recommend text labels for all icons."},"scenario":{"en":"I'm building the banking app Hisham uses. It has five tabs at the bottom of the screen. On our website they show tooltips on hover; the app uses the same icons.","ar":"أبني تطبيق البنك الذي يستخدمه هشام. فيه خمسة Tabs (تبويبات) أسفل الشاشة. وفي موقعنا تظهر Tooltips حين يمرّ المؤشر فوق الأيقونة (Hover)؛ والتطبيق يستخدم الأيقونات نفسها."},"prompt":{"en":"Which version should ship in the app?","ar":"أيّ نسخة تجعل هشام يعرف إلى أين يأخذه كل تبويب في التطبيق؟"},"a":{"label":{"en":"Version A: icons with labels","ar":"النسخة A: أيقونات مع تسميات"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rasid","name":{"en":"Rasid","ar":"رصيد"},"color":"#1C3D6E","icon":"bank","domain":"rasid.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Home","ar":"الرئيسية"},"large":true,"actions":[{"icon":"bell","aria":{"en":"Notifications","ar":"الإشعارات"},"count":1}]},"tabbar":{"active":0,"items":[{"icon":"house","text":{"en":"Home","ar":"الرئيسية"}},{"icon":"arrows-left-right","text":{"en":"Transfer","ar":"تحويل"}},{"icon":"receipt","text":{"en":"Bills","ar":"فواتير"}},{"icon":"list","text":{"en":"More","ar":"المزيد"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"card","blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Current account","ar":"الحساب الجاري"}},{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"EGP 42,300","ar":"42300 جنيه"},"gap":"xs"}]},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"arrow-down-left","text":{"en":"Salary","ar":"الراتب"},"sub":{"en":"1 Nov","ar":"1 نوفمبر"},"value":{"en":"+EGP 18,000","ar":"+18000 جنيه"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"lightning","text":{"en":"Electricity bill","ar":"فاتورة الكهرباء"},"sub":{"en":"30 Oct","ar":"30 أكتوبر"},"value":{"en":"−EGP 640","ar":"−640 جنيه"}}]}},"b":{"label":{"en":"Version B: icons only","ar":"النسخة B: أيقونات فقط"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"rasid","name":{"en":"Rasid","ar":"رصيد"},"color":"#1C3D6E","icon":"bank","domain":"rasid.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Home","ar":"الرئيسية"},"large":true,"actions":[{"icon":"bell","aria":{"en":"Notifications","ar":"الإشعارات"},"count":1}]},"tabbar":{"active":0,"items":[{"icon":"house","aria":{"en":"Home","ar":"الرئيسية"}},{"icon":"arrows-left-right","aria":{"en":"Transfer","ar":"تحويل"}},{"icon":"receipt","aria":{"en":"Bills","ar":"فواتير"}},{"icon":"list","aria":{"en":"More","ar":"المزيد"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"card","blocks":[{"kind":"small","text":{"en":"Current account","ar":"الحساب الجاري"}},{"kind":"price","text":{"en":"EGP 42,300","ar":"42300 جنيه"},"gap":"xs"}]},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"arrow-down-left","text":{"en":"Salary","ar":"الراتب"},"sub":{"en":"1 Nov","ar":"1 نوفمبر"},"value":{"en":"+EGP 18,000","ar":"+18000 جنيه"},"gap":"m"},{"kind":"listitem","icon":"lightning","text":{"en":"Electricity bill","ar":"فاتورة الكهرباء"},"sub":{"en":"30 Oct","ar":"30 أكتوبر"},"value":{"en":"−EGP 640","ar":"−640 جنيه"}}]}},"answer":"a","misconceptions":[{"id":"MC-P14-010","when":["b"],"feedback":{"en":"On a phone there's no hover, so the tooltips never show, and ⇄ or ▤ can mean several things.","ar":"لا يوجد Hover على الهاتف، فلا تظهر الـ Tooltips أبدًا، و⇄ أو ▤ قد تعني أشياء كثيرة."}}],"correct":{"en":"A: on a touch screen, labels have to be visible.","ar":"A: على شاشة اللمس، يجب أن تظهر التسميات."},"explain":{"en":"Labels under the icons work without hover and tell Hisham exactly where each tab goes.","ar":"التسميات تحت الأيقونات تعمل دون Hover، وتخبر هشام بالضبط إلى أين يأخذه كل تبويب."}},{"id":"S09","type":"tune","speaker":"sara","skill":"SK-P14-U01-05","part":"retest","value":{"en":"Re-test, notifications (NN/g): passive notifications aren't urgent and should be less intrusive. A finished upload needs nothing from Rasha.","ar":"إعادة اختبار، الإشعارات (NN/g): الإشعارات التي لا تحتاج إجراءً ليست عاجلة ويجب أن تكون أقل إزعاجًا. والرفع الذي اكتمل لا يحتاج شيئًا من رشا."},"ref":{"url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/indicators-validations-notifications/","quote":"Passive notifications are typically not urgent and should be less intrusive."},"scenario":{"en":"I'm designing a shared family album. Rasha adds 12 photos to it. When the upload finishes, a dialog says \"Upload complete\" with an OK button.","ar":"أصمّم ألبومًا عائليًا مشتركًا. تضيف رشا إليه 12 صورة. وحين ينتهي الرفع، يظهر Dialog يقول «اكتمل الرفع» مع زر «حسنًا»."},"prompt":{"en":"Try each version. Which one should ship?","ar":"جرّب كل نسخة. أيّها يجب أن تُطلق؟"},"start":"dialog","options":[{"id":"dialog","text":{"en":"Keep the dialog","ar":"أبقِ الـ Dialog"},"mock":{"app":{"id":"suwar","name":{"en":"Suwar","ar":"صور"},"color":"#2563EB","icon":"images","domain":"suwar.example"},"appbar":{"title":{"en":"Family · Summer","ar":"العائلة · الصيف"},"back":true,"actions":[{"icon":"upload-simple","aria":{"en":"Upload","ar":"ارفعي"}},{"icon":"share-network","aria":{"en":"Share","ar":"شاركي"}}]},"blocks":[{"kind":"meta","text":{"en":"48 photos · shared with 5 people","ar":"48 صورة · مشترك مع 5 أشخاص"}},{"kind":"row","gap":"s","blocks":[{"kind":"image","art":"family","size":"s","alt":{"en":"Family","ar":"العائلة"}},{"kind":"image","art":"beach","size":"s","alt":{"en":"Beach","ar":"شاطئ"}},{"kind":"image","